#: src/butchery.cpp:197
msgid ""
"Really desecrate the mortal remains of this being by butchering them for "
"meat?  You feel others may take issue with your action."
msgstr "真的要褻瀆這具屍骸，將其屠宰取肉嗎？你感覺其他人也許會對你的行為有所非議。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:202
msgid "Really desecrate the mortal remains of this being by butchering them for meat?"
msgstr "真的要褻瀆這具屍體，將其肢解取肉嗎？"

#: src/butchery.cpp:207
msgid ""
"Really take this thing apart?  You feel others may take issue with your "
"action."
msgstr "真的要拆解這個東西嗎？你覺得其他人可能會對你的行爲有所非議。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:215
msgid "<swear!>?  Are you butchering them?  That's not okay, <name_b>."
msgstr "<咒罵!>？你在屠宰它們嗎？這不太好了啊，<name_b>。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:241
msgid "None of your cutting tools are suitable for butchering."
msgstr "你的切割工具都不適合用來屠宰。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:246
msgid "You don't trust the quality of your tools, but carry on anyway."
msgstr "你不相信你的工具的品質, 但無論如何只能繼續。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:253
msgid "None of your tools are sharp and precise enough to do that."
msgstr "你並沒有足夠銳利和精細到能勝任此事的工具。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:257
msgid "You could use a better tool, but this will do."
msgstr "你可以使用更好的工具, 不過用這個也行。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:260
msgid "This tool is great, but you still would like a scalpel."
msgstr "這個工具很棒, 但你仍然想要一把手術刀。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:263
msgid "You dissect the corpse with a trusty scalpel."
msgstr "你用一把可靠的手術刀解剖屍體。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:267
msgid "You dissect the corpse with a sophisticated system of surgical grade scalpels."
msgstr "你用精密的外科等級手術刀系統解剖屍體。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:277
msgid "You can't butcher this; you are missing some tools.\n"
msgstr "你無法屠宰這個；你缺乏一些工具。\n"

#: src/butchery.cpp:295
msgid "This corpse has already been bled."
msgstr "這具屍體已經被放血了。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:302
msgid "It would be futile to dissect this badly damaged corpse."
msgstr "解剖這嚴重受損的屍體是徒勞的。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:308
msgid "This corpse is already field dressed."
msgstr "這具屍體已經去除臟器了。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:313
msgid "This corpse is already skinned."
msgstr "這具屍體已經被剝皮了。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:319
msgid "This corpse is too small to quarter without damaging."
msgstr "這個屍體太小了, 無法切成四塊。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:324
msgid "This is already quartered."
msgstr "這已是四等份了。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:330
msgid "You need to perform field dressing before quartering."
msgstr "你須在四等分前先進行去除臟器。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:354 src/butchery.cpp:373
msgid "It needs a coffin, not a knife."
msgstr "它需要一副棺材, 而不是一把刀。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:369
msgid "You were trained for autopsies, not butchery."
msgstr "你所受的解剖訓練不該用在屠宰上。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:652
msgid "You salvage what you can from the corpse, but it is badly damaged."
msgstr "你盡可能的回收了屍體，但他遭受了嚴重的破壞。"

#: src/butchery.cpp:660
msgid "The corpse looks a little underweight�"
msgstr "这具尸体看起来有点体重不足�"

