"\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1313
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: fabrication\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Restores farm plots created in previous expansion upgrades.\n"
"> Does not damage existing crops.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Moderate\n"
"Time: 5 Min / Plot\n"
"Positions: 0/1\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"技能：制造\n"
"难度：无\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 仅恢复上次扩展区升级之后创建的农田。\n"
"> 不会损害已有的作物。\n"
"\n"
"风险：无\n"
"活动程度：适中\n"
"耗时：5 分钟/地块\n"
"位置：0/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1329
msgid " (Finish) Plow fields"
msgstr "（完成）犁田"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1337
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Plant designated seeds in the spaces that have already been tilled.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"註記：\n"
"在已經犁好的田地中播種植物種子。\n"
"\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1341
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Choose which seed type or all of your seeds.\n"
"> Stops when out of seeds or planting locations.\n"
"> Will plant in ALL dirt mounds in the expansion.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Moderate\n"
"Time: 1 Min / Plot\n"
"Positions: 0/1\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"技能：生存\n"
"需求等级：无\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 选择播种的种子种类或者全部播种。\n"
"> 当无可用种子或无空余田地时自动停止。\n"
"> 将在所选扩展区内的所有土堆上播种。\n"
"\n"
"风险：无\n"
"活动程度：适中\n"
"耗时：1 分钟/地块\n"
"位置：0/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1359
msgid " (Finish) Plant Fields"
msgstr "（完成）播種"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1367
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Harvest any plants that are ripe and bring the produce back.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"註記：\n"
"收割所有成熟的作物並帶回來。\n"
"\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1370
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Will dump all harvesting products onto your location.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Moderate\n"
"Time: 3 Min / Plot\n"
"Positions: 0/1\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"技能：生存\n"
"需求等级：无\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 将会把所有收获的作物丢在你的当前位置上。\n"
"\n"
"风险：无\n"
"活动程度：适中\n"
"耗时：3 分钟/地块\n"
"位置：0/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1386
msgid " (Finish) Harvest Fields"
msgstr "（完成）收成"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1427
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Nearby terrain can be turned into fields if it is completely cleared of "
"terrain that isn't grass or dirt.  Doing so makes that terrain eligible for "
"usage for standard base camp expansion.  Note that log cutting does this "
"conversion automatically when the trees are depleted, but not all terrain can "
"be logged.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> If the expansion direction selected is eligible for conversion into a field "
"this mission will perform that conversion.  If it is not eligible you are "
"told as much, and would have to make it suitable for conversion by removing "
"everything that isn't grass or soil.  Mining zones are useful to remove "
"pavement, for instance.  Note that removal of buildings is dangerous, "
"laborious, and may still fail to get rid of everything if e.g. a basement or "
"an opening to underground areas (such as a manhole) remains.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Moderate\n"
"Time: 0 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"将附近已经完全移除非草地或泥土的区块类型转换为旷野。这样做使得该地可用于建设扩展区。请注意，伐木任务会自动进行相同的地形转换，但并非所有区块都能执行伐木任务"
"。\n"
"\n"
"技能：无\n"
"效果：\n"
"> "
"如果所选区块符合转换条件，则此任务将进行转换。若不符合条件，则会告知原因，并且必须通过去除所有非草地或泥土的地形来使其适合转换。例如，挖掘区可用于拆除人行道"
"。请注意，拆除建筑物是危险、费力的，并且可能仍然无法拆除所有地形，例如地下室或通往地下区域的开口（下水井等）仍然存在。\n"
"\n"
"风险：无\n"
"活动程度：适中\n"
"耗时：无\n"
"位置：%d/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1451
msgid "Recover Field Surveyor"
msgstr "召回同伴（勘测选址）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1458
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Expansions open up new opportunities but can be expensive and time-consuming. "
" Pick them carefully, at most 8 can be built at each camp.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Choose any one of the available expansions.  Starting with a farm is always "
"a solid choice since food is used to support companion missions and minimal "
"investment is needed to get it going.  A forge is also a great idea, allowing "
"you to refine resources for subsequent expansions, craft better gear and make "
"charcoal.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: Actions available through expansions are located in separate tabs of "
"the Camp Manager window.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Moderate\n"
"Time: 3 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"扩展区可以解锁许多新任务，但建造它也会花费更多资源而且十分耗时。谨慎选择你的扩展区，每个营地最多支持建设8块扩展区。\n"
"\n"
"技能：制造\n"
"需求等级：无\n"
"效果：\n"
"> "
"选择一块可用的扩展区区块。从农场开始始终都是一个可靠的选择，食物被用来支付同伴的任务花费而建设它不需要很多资源。选择铁匠铺也是个不错的主意，它可以让你制作更"
"好的装备，或是生产木炭，又或是精炼资源为后续的扩展做准备。\n"
"\n"
"注意：扩展区新增功能位于营地主管页面扩展区所对应的标签页内。\n"
"\n"
"风险：无\n"
"活动程度：适中\n"
"耗时：3 小时\n"
"位置：%d/1\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1480
msgid "Recover Surveyor"
msgstr "召回勘查者"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1489
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Distribute food to your follower and fill your larders.  Place the food you "
"wish to distribute in the camp food zone.  You must have a camp food zone, "
"and a camp storage zone, or you will be prompted to create them using the "
"zone manager.\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Increases your faction's food supply value which in turn is used to pay "
"laborers for their time\n"
"\n"
"Must have enjoyability >= -6\n"
"Total faction food stock: %d kcal\n"
"or %d / %d / %d days' rations\n"
"where the days is measured for Extra / Moderate / No exercise levels"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"向你营地里的同伴分发食物并装进储藏室。营地中必须已经设置有一个营地食物区及一个营地储物区，否则系统将提示使用区域管理器创建这些区域。\n"
"效果：\n"
"> 增加你派系的食物储备，食物储备会作为报酬支付给工人\n"
"\n"
"食物的享受度必须 >= -6\n"
"当前派系食物储备：%d 千卡\n"
"或 %d/%d/%d 天口粮\n"
"以上天数依照极限/适中/无活动强度计算"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1507
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Choose a new leader for your faction.\n"
"<color_yellow>You will switch to playing as the new leader.</color>\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Risk: None\n"
msgstr ""
"注：\n"
"为你的派系选择一个新的领导者。\n"
"<color_yellow>你的游戏角色会切换成新的领导者。</color>\n"
"难度：无\n"
"风险：无\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1517
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Eat some food from the larder.\n"
"Nutritional value depends on food stored in the larder.\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Risk: None\n"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"你可以从储藏室中取出食物食用。\n"
"营养依据储藏室中食物计算。\n"
"需求：无\n"
"风险：无\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1528
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Assign repeating job duties to NPCs stationed here.\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Time: Ongoing"
msgstr ""
"註記：\n"
"將重複的工作指派給駐紮在這裡的 NPC。\n"
"難度：N/A \n"
"效果：\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"風險：無\n"
"時間：持續進行"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1538
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Assign followers to work at this camp."
msgstr ""
"註記：\n"
"指派追隨者在這個營地工作。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1544
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Abandon this camp"
msgstr ""
"註記：\n"
"遺棄這個營地"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1558
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Cancel a current mission and force the immediate return of a companion.  No "
"work will be done on the mission and all resources used on the mission will "
"be lost.\n"
"\n"
"WARNING: All resources used on the mission will be lost and no work will be "
"done.  Only use this mission to recover a companion who cannot otherwise be "
"recovered.\n"
"\n"
"Companions must be on missions for at least 24 hours before emergency recall "
"becomes available."
msgstr ""
"註記：\n"
"取消當前任務並強迫同伴立即返回。該任務的所有作業皆取消，將失去所有該任務使用的資源。\n"
"\n"
"警告：任務中使用的所有資源都將丟失，並且無法完成任何工作。此任務只適用於召回原本就無法回覆工作的同伴。\n"
"\n"
"同伴必須執行任務至少24小時，才能使用緊急召回。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1568
msgid "Emergency Recall"
msgstr "緊急召回"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1598
#, c-format
msgid "It's too early for that.  A new leader can be chosen in %s."
msgstr "现在还为时过早。新领导者可以在%s后被选举。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1605
msgid "autocratic"
msgstr "专制"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1606
msgid "sortition"
msgstr "抽签"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1607
msgid "democratic"
msgstr "民主"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1609
msgid "Choose how the new leader will be determined."
msgstr "选择确定新领导者的方式。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1619
msgid ""
"As an experienced leader, only you know what will be required of future "
"leaders.  You will choose.\n"
"\n"
"Is this acceptable?"
msgstr ""
"作为一个经验丰富的领导者，只有你才知道未来的领导者需要什么品质，选择权在你的手上。\n"
"\n"
"你接受吗？"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1646
msgid ""
"You will allow fate to choose the next leader.  Whether it's by dice, drawing "
"straws, or picking names out of a hat, it will be purely random.\n"
"\n"
"Is this acceptable?"
msgstr ""
"你选择让命运来选择下一任领导人。无论是掷骰子、抽签还是抓阄，都是纯粹的随机。\n"
"\n"
"你接受吗？"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1652
msgid "Fate calls for you to remain in your role as leader… for now."
msgstr "命运要求你暂时保持你作为领导者的角色。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1657
#, c-format
msgid "Fate chooses %s to lead your faction."
msgstr "命运选择了%s领导你的派系。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1665
msgid ""
"A leader can only lead those willing to follow.  Everyone must get a say in "
"choosing the new leader.\n"
"\n"
"Is this acceptable?"
msgstr ""
"领导者只能领导那些愿意追随的人。在选择新领导人时，每个人都有发言权。\n"
"\n"
"你接受吗？"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1674
msgid "You win the election!"
msgstr "你赢得了选举！"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1678
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s wins the election with a popularity of %2$s!  The runner-up had a "
"popularity of %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s以%2$s的支持率赢得了选举！第二名则获得了%3$s的支持率。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1687
