msgstr "出發去獵捕大型動物..."

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1921
msgid "departs to search for recruits…"
msgstr "出發去找尋新成員..."

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1977 src/faction_camp.cpp:2480
msgid "You don't have enough food stored to feed your companion."
msgstr "你沒有足夠的儲糧來餵飽你的同伴。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:2043
msgid "You don't have enough food stored to feed your companion for this task."
msgstr "你沒有足夠的儲糧來餵飽你的同伴執行這項任務。"

