msgid "There is a sheer drop halfway down.  Climb your rope down?"
msgstr "這是一個陡坡，要使用繩索垂降嗎？"

#: src/game.cpp:12961
msgid "There is a sheer drop halfway down.  Jump?"
msgstr "這是一個陡坡, 要往下跳嗎?"

#: src/game.cpp:13024
msgid "AUTO: goes down"
msgstr "自動: 往下"

#: src/game.cpp:13028
msgid "AUTO: goes up"
msgstr "自動: 往上"

#: src/game.cpp:13355
msgid "Set scent map sensitivity to?"
msgstr "将气味图灵敏度设置为？"

#: src/game.cpp:13492 src/game.cpp:13495
msgid "Saving game, this may take a while."
msgstr "正在儲存遊戲, 可能會花一些時間。"

#: src/game.cpp:13531
msgid "No saves for current character yet."
msgstr "目前角色尚無存檔。"

#: src/game.cpp:13746
msgid "Your skill in parkour makes up for your bad knees while climbing."
msgstr "你的跑酷技能和你的膝蓋毛病互相抵消。"

#: src/game.cpp:13751
msgid "Your skill in parkour makes it easier to climb."
msgstr "你的跑酷技能使你更容易爬上爬下。"

#: src/game.cpp:13756
msgid "Your bad knees make it difficult to climb."
msgstr "你的膝蓋讓你很難攀爬。"

#: src/game.cpp:13788
msgid "Your wet hands and feet make it harder to climb."
msgstr "你濕透的手腳讓你更難攀爬。"

#: src/game.cpp:13790
msgid "Your wet feet make it harder to climb."
msgstr "你濕透的腳使你更難攀爬"

#: src/game.cpp:13792
msgid "Your wet hands make it harder to climb."
msgstr "你濕透的手使你更難攀爬"

