#: src/mission_companion.cpp:642
msgid ""
"Profit: 20-75 merch\n"
"Danger: Low\n"
"Time: 10 hour missions\n"
"\n"
"Assigning one of your allies to patrol the surrounding wilderness and "
"isolated buildings presents the opportunity to build survival skills while "
"engaging in relatively safe combat against isolated creatures."
msgstr ""
"報酬：20-75 商票\n"
"危險：低\n"
"需時：10小時任務\n"
"\n"
"派遣其中一位同伴在附近的荒野和孤立建築中巡邏。能在相對安全的環境中對付落單的生物並鍛煉自己的生存能力。"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:648
msgid "Assign Scavenging Patrol"
msgstr "指派拾荒巡邏"

