"Profit: 5 merch/hour\n"
"Danger: Minimal\n"
"Time: 1 hour minimum\n"
"\n"
"Carpentry work requires more skill than menial labor while offering modestly "
"improved pay.  It is unlikely that your companions will face combat, but "
"there are hazards working on makeshift buildings."
msgstr ""
"報酬: 5 商票/小時\n"
"危險: 最低\n"
"需時: 最少1小時\n"
"\n"
"木工工作需要比雜務更高的技術，同時也提供更多的報酬。你的同伴不太可能要面對戰鬥，但在簡易搭建的建築裡工作總有危險。"

