msgstr "你感覺到一股強烈的能量在 %1$s 和 %2$s 之間的空氣中爆發。"

#: src/monattack.cpp:3226
#, c-format
msgid "You feel a sudden, intense burst of energy from the %s."
msgstr "你感覺到一股強烈的能量從 %s 爆發。"

#: src/monattack.cpp:3232
#. ~ %1$s is the pre-upgrade monster, %2$s is the post-upgrade monster.
#, c-format
