msgstr "只會自動撿取體積小於或是等於 [設定值] * 50 毫升的物品。設定為 [0] 會停用這個功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1506
msgid "Auto pickup safe mode"
msgstr "自動撿取安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1507
msgid ""
"If true, auto pickup is disabled as long as you can see monsters nearby.  "
"This is affected by 'Safe mode proximity distance'."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 當遇到怪物時自動撿取會自動停用。這個功能受到 \"安全模式偵測距離\" 影響。"

#: src/options.cpp:1514
msgid "List items within no auto pickup zones"
msgstr "表列關閉自動撿取區域內的物品"

#: src/options.cpp:1515
msgid ""
"If true, you will see messages about items you step on, within no auto pickup "
"zones."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，當你在關閉自動撿取的區域內時將可看見腳下的物品訊息。"

#: src/options.cpp:1524
msgid "Auto features options"
msgstr "自动功能"

#: src/options.cpp:1525
msgid "Options regarding auto features."
msgstr "關於自動屠宰、拖地、打爛等相關功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1527
msgid "Additional auto features"
msgstr "其他自動功能"

#: src/options.cpp:1528
msgid ""
"If true, enables configured auto features below.  Disabled as long as any "
"enemy monster is seen."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 啟用下列的自動功能選項。當視野內有任何敵對怪物時會自動停用。"

#: src/options.cpp:1532
msgid "Auto pulp or butcher"
msgstr "自動打爛或屠宰"

#: src/options.cpp:1533
msgid ""
"Action to perform when 'Auto pulp or butcher' is enabled.  Pulp: Pulp corpses "
"you stand on.  - Pulp Adjacent: Also pulp corpses adjacent from you.  - "
"Butcher: Butcher corpses you stand on."
msgstr "設定 \"自動打爛或屠宰\" 啟用時的動作。 [打爛] 打爛在你腳下的屍體。 [打爛鄰接] 把鄰接的屍體也一起打爛。 [屠宰] 屠宰在你腳下的屍體。"

#: src/options.cpp:1536
msgid "Pulp"
msgstr "打爛"

#: src/options.cpp:1537
msgid "Pulp Zombies Only"
msgstr "只打爛殭屍"

#: src/options.cpp:1538
msgid "Pulp Adjacent"
msgstr "打爛鄰接"

#: src/options.cpp:1539
msgid "Pulp Adjacent Zombie Only"
msgstr "只打爛鄰接殭屍"

#: src/options.cpp:1540
msgid "Pulp or Dismember"
msgstr "Pulp or Dismember"

#: src/options.cpp:1541
msgid "Pulp or Dismember Adjacent"
msgstr "Pulp or Dismember Adjacent"

#: src/options.cpp:1542
msgid "Pulp or Dismember Zombie Only"
msgstr "Pulp or Dismember Zombie Only"

#: src/options.cpp:1543
msgid "Pulp or Dismember Adjacent Zombie Only"
msgstr "Pulp or Dismember Adjacent Zombie Only"

#: src/options.cpp:1544 data/raw/keybindings.json
#. ~ Key binding name
msgid "Butcher"
msgstr "屠宰"

#: src/options.cpp:1551
msgid "Auto mining"
msgstr "自動採礦"

#: src/options.cpp:1552
msgid ""
"If true, enables automatic use of wielded pickaxes and jackhammers whenever "
"trying to move into mineable terrain."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 會在試圖進入可挖掘的地形時自動使用十字鎬和手提鑿岩機。"

#: src/options.cpp:1558
msgid "Auto mopping"
msgstr "自動拖地"

#: src/options.cpp:1559
msgid "If true, enables automatic use of wielded mops to clean surrounding terrain."
msgstr "設定為「是」，自動使用手持的拖把把周圍的地形拖乾淨。"

#: src/options.cpp:1565
msgid "Auto foraging"
msgstr "自動採集"

#: src/options.cpp:1566
msgid ""
"Action to perform when 'Auto foraging' is enabled.  Bushes: Only forage "
"bushes.  - Trees: Only forage trees.  - Crops: Only forage crops.  - "
"Everything: Forage bushes, trees, crops, and everything else including "
"flowers, cattails etc."
msgstr "自動採集功能啟用候會執行的動作。[灌木]：只採集灌木。[樹木]：只採集樹木。[作物]：只採集作物。[所有東西]：採集灌木、樹木、以及所有像花、香蒲等東西。"

#: src/options.cpp:1567
msgid "Bushes"
msgstr "灌木"

#: src/options.cpp:1567
msgid "Crops"
msgstr "作物"

#: src/options.cpp:1567
msgid "Everything"
msgstr "所有東西"

#: src/options.cpp:1567
msgid "Trees"
msgstr "樹木"

#: src/options.cpp:1575
msgid "Player safety options"
msgstr "玩家安全"

#: src/options.cpp:1576
msgid "Options regarding player safety."
msgstr "阻止踏入危險地形、強制撿取等功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1578
msgid "Dangerous pickups"
msgstr "強制撿取"

#: src/options.cpp:1579
msgid ""
"If true, will allow player to pick new items, even if it causes them to "
"exceed the weight limit."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，玩家會在超重時仍然可以檢取新物品。"

#: src/options.cpp:1584
msgid "Dangerous terrain warning prompt"
msgstr "危險地形警告提示"

#: src/options.cpp:1585
msgid ""
"Always: You will be prompted to move onto dangerous tiles.  Running: You will "
"only be able to move onto dangerous tiles while running and will be prompted. "
" Crouching: You will only be able to move onto a dangerous tile while "
"crouching and will be prompted.  Never:  You will not be able to move onto a "
"dangerous tile unless running and will not be warned or prompted."
msgstr ""
"總是: 你會在移動至危險地形時被提醒。 奔跑中: 你只會在奔跑狀態下移動至危險地形時被提醒。 蹲下: 你只會在蹲下狀態下移動至危險地形時被提醒。 永不: "
"你將無法在非奔跑狀態下移動至危險地形，且不會被警告或提醒。"

#: src/options.cpp:1586 src/options.cpp:1719 src/options.cpp:2127
#: data/raw/keybindings.json
#. ~ Key binding name
msgid "Always"
msgstr "總是"

#: src/options.cpp:1586 src/options.cpp:1719 src/options.cpp:2126
#: data/raw/keybindings.json
#. ~ Key binding name
msgid "Never"
msgstr "從不"

#: src/options.cpp:1591
msgid "Force smart engine controller off"
msgstr "強制關閉智慧引擎控制器"

#: src/options.cpp:1592
msgid ""
"If enabled, turn off the smart engine controller when you turn off the engine "
"of the car without an electric motor."
msgstr "如果啟用，當你關閉不含電動馬達的汽車引擎時，也會關閉智慧引擎控制器。"

#: src/options.cpp:1596 src/options.cpp:1719 data/json/item_actions.json
#. ~ Item action name of "MAGIC_8_BALL"
msgid "Ask"
msgstr "詢問"

#: src/options.cpp:1603
msgid "Safe mode options"
msgstr "安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1604
msgid "Options regarding safe mode."
msgstr "安全模式相關功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1606
msgid "Safe mode"
msgstr "安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1607
msgid ""
"If true, will hold the game and display a warning if a hostile monster/NPC is "
"approaching."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，當有敵對的怪物或 NPC 接近時, 將暫停遊戲並顯示警告。"

#: src/options.cpp:1611
msgid "Safe mode proximity distance"
msgstr "安全模式偵測距離"

#: src/options.cpp:1612
msgid ""
"If safe mode is enabled, distance to hostiles at which safe mode should show "
"a warning.  0 = Max player view distance.  This option only has effect when "
"no safe mode rule is specified.  Otherwise, edit the default rule in Safe "
"mode manager instead of this value."
msgstr ""
"假如啟用安全模式， 敵人在指定距離內出現時會顯示警告。設定為 [0] "
"會使用玩家的最大可視距離。這項選項只有在安全模式規則沒有設定時會生效。否則，去編輯安全模式管理器的預設規則而非這項數值。"

#: src/options.cpp:1616
msgid "Safe mode when driving"
msgstr "駕駛時的安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1617
msgid "If true, safe mode will alert you of hostiles while you are driving a vehicle."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，安全模式將會在你駕駛車輛並遭遇敵人時警告你。"

#: src/options.cpp:1621
msgid "Auto reactivate safe mode"
msgstr "自動重啟安全模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1622
msgid ""
"If true, safe mode will automatically reactivate after a certain number of "
"turns.  See option 'Turns to auto reactivate safe mode.'"
msgstr "設定為 [是], 安全模式會在關閉一定的回合後自動重啟。參照 \"重啟安全模式回合數\" 選項。"

#: src/options.cpp:1626
msgid "Turns to auto reactivate safe mode"
msgstr "重啟安全模式回合數"

#: src/options.cpp:1627
msgid ""
"Number of turns after which safe mode is reactivated.  Will only reactivate "
"if no hostiles are in 'Safe mode proximity distance.'"
msgstr "重啟安全模式所需的回合數。只會在 \"安全模式偵測距離\" 內沒有敵人時發揮作用。"

#: src/options.cpp:1631
msgid "Turns to remember ignored monsters"
msgstr "記住'忽略的怪物'的回合數"

#: src/options.cpp:1632
msgid ""
"Number of turns an ignored monster stays ignored after it is no longer seen.  "
"0 disables this option and monsters are permanently ignored."
msgstr "設定在'忽略的怪物'離開視野後繼續忽略的回合數。設定為 0 表示停用這功能，忽略的怪物會永遠被忽略。"

#: src/options.cpp:1639
msgid "Realtime turn progression"
msgstr "實時回合制"

#: src/options.cpp:1640
msgid ""
"If higher than 0, monsters will take periodic gameplay turns.  This value is "
"the delay between each turn, in seconds.  Works best with Safe Mode disabled. "
" 0 = disabled."
msgstr "如果設定超過0，每經過 [設定值] * 秒, 遊戲會自動經過 1 回合, 並且怪物會依回合行動。啟用時建議停用安全模式。設定為 [0] 會停用這個功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1646
msgid "Autosave options"
msgstr "自动保存"

#: src/options.cpp:1647
msgid "Options regarding autosave."
msgstr "自動存檔相關功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1649
msgid "Autosave"
msgstr "自動存檔"

#: src/options.cpp:1650
msgid ""
"If true, game will periodically save the map.  Autosaves occur based on "
"in-game turns or realtime minutes, whichever is larger."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，遊戲將會定期儲存地圖。自動存檔的情況取決於遊戲回合數或真實分鐘, 以較大者為準。"

#: src/options.cpp:1654
msgid "Game turns between autosaves"
msgstr "自動存檔間隔 (遊戲回合數)"

#: src/options.cpp:1655
msgid "Number of game turns between autosaves."
msgstr "每當遊戲中經過幾回就會自動存檔。"

#: src/options.cpp:1661
msgid "Real minutes between autosaves"
msgstr "自動存檔間隔 (真實分鐘)"

#: src/options.cpp:1662
msgid "Number of realtime minutes between autosaves."
msgstr "每當真實世界經過幾分鐘就會自動存檔。"

#: src/options.cpp:1671
msgid "Auto notes options"
msgstr "自动备注"

#: src/options.cpp:1672
msgid "Options regarding auto notes."
msgstr "大地圖自動註記相關功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:1674
msgid "Auto notes"
msgstr "自動註記"

#: src/options.cpp:1675
msgid "If true, automatically sets notes."
msgstr "如果設定成 [是] ，將會開啟大地圖自動註記。"

#: src/options.cpp:1679
msgid "Auto notes (stairs)"
msgstr "自動註記（上下樓梯）"

#: src/options.cpp:1680
msgid ""
"If true, automatically sets notes on places that have stairs that go up or "
"down."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，會自動將上下樓梯的位置註記於地圖上。"

#: src/options.cpp:1686
msgid "Auto notes (map extras)"
msgstr "自動註記（特殊地點）"

#: src/options.cpp:1687
msgid "If true, automatically sets notes on places that contain various map extras."
msgstr "如果設定成 [是]，將會在大地圖上自動註記各種特殊的地點"

#: src/options.cpp:1693
msgid "Auto notes (dropped favorites)"
msgstr "自動註記（丟下的最愛物品）"

#: src/options.cpp:1694
msgid "If true, automatically sets notes when player drops favorited items."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，將會在自動註記玩家丟下的最愛物品。"

#: src/options.cpp:1703
msgid "Misc Options"
msgstr "其他選項"

#: src/options.cpp:1704 src/options.cpp:2804
msgid "Miscellaneous options."
msgstr "其他"

#: src/options.cpp:1706
msgid "Circular distances"
msgstr "圓形視距"

#: src/options.cpp:1707
msgid ""
"If true, the game will calculate range in a realistic way: light sources will "
"be circles, diagonal movement will cover more ground and take longer.  If "
"false, everything is square: moving to the northwest corner of a building "
"takes as long as moving to the north wall."
msgstr ""
"設定為 [是]，遊戲將會以更真實的方式計算距離: 光源會變成圓形、斜線移動距離會更遠也更費時。設定為 [否], "
"所有東西都是方形的：移動到建築物的西北角跟移動到正北方的牆壁花費同樣的時間。"

#: src/options.cpp:1711
msgid "Drop empty containers"
msgstr "自動丟棄空容器"

#: src/options.cpp:1712
msgid ""
"Set to drop empty containers after use.  No: Don't drop any.  - Watertight: "
"All except watertight containers.  - All: Drop all containers."
msgstr "設定是否自動丟棄使用後被清空的容器。 [否] 都不丟棄。 [水密] 除了能密封的容器都丟棄。 [全部] 全部丟棄。"

#: src/options.cpp:1713
msgid "Watertight"
msgstr "水密"

#: src/options.cpp:1717
msgid "DeathCam"
msgstr "死亡鏡頭"

#: src/options.cpp:1718
msgid ""
"Always: Always start deathcam.  Ask: Query upon death.  Never: Never show "
"deathcam."
msgstr " [總是] 總是啟動死亡鏡頭。 [詢問] 死後詢問。 [從不] 不使用死亡鏡頭。"

#: src/options.cpp:1723
msgid "Special event spawns"
msgstr "特殊節日生成"

#: src/options.cpp:1724
msgid ""
"If not disabled, unique items and/or monsters can spawn during special events "
"(Christmas, Halloween, etc.)"
msgstr "如果未關閉，特殊節日（聖誕節、萬聖節等）期間會生成特殊物品和怪物。"

#: src/options.cpp:1725 src/options.cpp:2195 src/safemode_ui.cpp:261
msgid "Both"
msgstr "兩者"

#: src/options.cpp:1731
msgid "Soundpack options"
msgstr "音效包"

#: src/options.cpp:1732
msgid "Options regarding soundpack."
msgstr "关于音效包选择与音量调整的设置。"

#: src/options.cpp:1734
msgid "Sound enabled"
msgstr "啟用音效"

#: src/options.cpp:1735
msgid "If true, music and sound are enabled."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 音樂與音效將被啟用。"

#: src/options.cpp:1741
msgid "Choose soundpack"
msgstr "選擇音效包"

#: src/options.cpp:1742
msgid "Choose the soundpack you want to use.  Requires restart."
msgstr "選擇你想要使用的音效包。需要重啟遊戲。"

#: src/options.cpp:1752
msgid "Music volume"
msgstr "音樂音量"

#: src/options.cpp:1753
msgid "Adjust the volume of the music being played in the background."
msgstr "調整背景音樂的音量。"

#: src/options.cpp:1759
msgid "Sound effect volume"
msgstr "音效音量"

#: src/options.cpp:1760
msgid "Adjust the volume of sound effects being played by the game."
msgstr "調整遊戲音效的音量。"

#: src/options.cpp:1766
msgid "Ambient sound volume"
msgstr "環境音量"

#: src/options.cpp:1767
msgid "Adjust the volume of ambient sounds being played by the game."
msgstr "調整遊戲播放環境聲音的音量。"

#: src/options.cpp:1783
msgid "Language"
msgstr "語言"

#: src/options.cpp:1784
msgid ""
"Switch language.  Each percentage is the fraction of strings translated for "
"that language."
msgstr "切換語言。百分比代表翻譯比例。"

#: src/options.cpp:1790
msgid "Measurement units"
msgstr "计量单位"

#: src/options.cpp:1791
msgid "Options regarding measurement units."
msgstr "計量單位相關設定。"

#: src/options.cpp:1793
msgid "Temperature units"
msgstr "溫度單位"

#: src/options.cpp:1794
msgid "Switch between Fahrenheit, Celsius, and Kelvin."
msgstr "於[華氏溫標] (Fahrenheit)、 [攝氏溫標] (Celsius) 與 [絕對溫標] (Kelvin) 之間切換。"

#: src/options.cpp:1795
msgid "Celsius"
msgstr "攝氏溫標"

#: src/options.cpp:1795
msgid "Fahrenheit"
msgstr "華氏溫標"

#: src/options.cpp:1795
msgid "Kelvin"
msgstr "絕對溫標"

#: src/options.cpp:1799
msgid "Speed units"
msgstr "速度單位"

#: src/options.cpp:1800
msgid "Switch between mph, km/h, and tiles/turn."
msgstr "於 [mph] (英里每小時)、[km/h] (公里每小時) 與 [t/t] (方格每回合) 之間切換。"

#: src/options.cpp:1801
msgid "tiles/turn"
msgstr "t/t"

#: src/options.cpp:1805
msgid "Mass units"
msgstr "重量單位"

#: src/options.cpp:1806
msgid "Switch between lbs and kg."
msgstr "於  [磅] (lbs) 與 [公斤] (kg) 之間切換。"

#: src/options.cpp:1807 src/units_utility.cpp:93
msgid "kg"
msgstr "公斤"

#: src/options.cpp:1807 src/units_utility.cpp:93
msgid "lbs"
msgstr "磅"

#: src/options.cpp:1811
msgid "Volume units"
msgstr "體積單位"

#: src/options.cpp:1812
msgid "Switch between the cups (c), liters (L), and quarts (qt)."
msgstr "於 杯(c) 、公升(L) 或 夸脫(qt) 之間切換。"

#: src/options.cpp:1813
msgid "Cup"
msgstr "杯"

#: src/options.cpp:1813
msgid "Liter"
msgstr "公升"

#: src/options.cpp:1813
msgid "Quart"
msgstr "夸脫"

#: src/options.cpp:1816
msgid "Distance units"
msgstr "長度單位"

#: src/options.cpp:1817
msgid "Switch between metric and imperial distance units."
msgstr "於英制和公制距離單位之間切換。"

#: src/options.cpp:1818
msgid "Imperial"
msgstr "英制"

#: src/options.cpp:1818
msgid "Metric"
msgstr "公制"

#: src/options.cpp:1821
msgid "Time format"
msgstr "時間格式"

#: src/options.cpp:1822
msgid ""
"12h: AM/PM, e.g. 7:31 AM - Military: 24h Military, e.g. 0731 - 24h: Normal "
"24h, e.g. 7:31"
msgstr ""
" [12h] 上午/下午, 例如: 7:31:23 下午。 [軍用] 24 小時制軍用時間, 例如: 1931.23。 [24h] 一般的 24 小時制, "
"例如: 19:31:23。"

#: src/options.cpp:1824
#. ~ 12h time, e.g.  11:59pm
msgid "12h"
msgstr "12h"

#: src/options.cpp:1826
#. ~ Military time, e.g.  2359
msgid "Military"
msgstr "軍用"

#: src/options.cpp:1828
#. ~ 24h time, e.g.  23:59
msgid "24h"
msgstr "24h"

#: src/options.cpp:1831
msgid "Show vitamin masses"
msgstr "顯示維他命重量"

#: src/options.cpp:1832
msgid ""
"Display the masses of vitamins in addition to units/RDA values in item "
"descriptions."
msgstr "除了顯示每日建議攝取量百分比以外，顯示維他命的重量。"

#: src/options.cpp:1839
msgid "Additional messages in the log"
msgstr "日誌顯示額外訊息"

#: src/options.cpp:1840
msgid "If true, some additional messages will be shown in the sidebar message log."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，額外訊息會在側邊欄的日誌中顯示。"

#: src/options.cpp:1843
msgid "Items on the ground"
msgstr "地面物品"

#: src/options.cpp:1844
msgid ""
"Show messages about items lying on the ground when character steps on tile "
"with them."
msgstr "經過時顯示角色腳下的物品。"

#: src/options.cpp:1848
msgid "Special monster movement"
msgstr "怪物特殊行動"

#: src/options.cpp:1849
msgid ""
"Show messages about special monster movement: flying over the fence, diving "
"into the water etc."
msgstr "顯示怪物特殊行動：飛過柵欄、潛入水中等等。"

#: src/options.cpp:1853
msgid "Monster attempts to free itself"
msgstr "怪物試圖掙脫"

#: src/options.cpp:1854
msgid ""
"Show messages about monster trying to free itself from effects preventing it "
"from moving: downed, tied etc."
msgstr "顯示怪物試圖掙脫束縛：被擊倒、被綁住等。"

#: src/options.cpp:1858
msgid "Monster/NPC attacking monster/NPC"
msgstr "怪物/NPC之間的攻擊"

#: src/options.cpp:1859
msgid ""
"Show messages about non-playable creatures attacking other non-playable "
"creatures."
msgstr "顯示非玩家角色攻擊其他非玩家角色的訊息。"

#: src/options.cpp:1866
msgid "Naming options"
msgstr "名称显示"

#: src/options.cpp:1867
msgid "Options regarding the naming of items."
msgstr "關於物品名稱的設定。"

#: src/options.cpp:1869
msgid "Show drug brand names"
msgstr "顯示藥物品牌名"

#: src/options.cpp:1870
msgid ""
"If true, show brand names for drugs, instead of generic functional names - "
"'Adderall', instead of 'prescription stimulant'."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，顯示藥物的品牌名，而不是通用的功能性名稱——「阿得拉爾」，而不是「處方興奮劑」。"

#: src/options.cpp:1872
msgid "Show gun brand names"
msgstr "顯示槍械型號"

#: src/options.cpp:1873
msgid ""
"If true, show brand names for guns, instead of generic functional names - "
"'m4a1' or 'h&k416a5' instead of 'NATO assault rifle'."
msgstr "設定為[是]，顯示槍械的型號，而不是通用的功能名稱——「m4a1」或「h&k416a5」而不是「NATO突擊步槍」。"

#: src/options.cpp:1875
msgid "Add ammo to weapon/magazine names"
msgstr "彈藥加到武器 / 彈匣名稱中"

#: src/options.cpp:1876
msgid ""
"If true, the default ammo is added to weapon and magazine names.  For example "
"\"Mosin-Nagant M44 (4/5)\" becomes \"Mosin-Nagant M44 (4/5 7.62x54mm)\"."
msgstr "如果是，預設彈藥會加到武器和彈匣名稱中。舉例來說「莫辛-納甘M44（4/5）」會變成「莫辛-納甘M44（4/5 7.62x54mm）」"

#: src/options.cpp:1879
msgid "Detailed containers"
msgstr "詳細容器"

#: src/options.cpp:1880
msgid ""
"All: every container has detailed remaining volume info.  - Worn: only worn "
"containers have detailed remaining volume info.  - None: no additional info "
"is provided."
msgstr "所有：每個容器都顯示詳細的剩餘容量資訊。穿著：只有穿在身上的容器才顯示剩餘容量資訊。無：不顯示額外資訊。"

#: src/options.cpp:1891
msgid "Accessibility options"
msgstr "快捷操作"

#: src/options.cpp:1892
msgid "Options regarding the accessibility."
msgstr "可用性設定。"

#: src/options.cpp:1894
msgid "Use key code input mode"
msgstr "使用按鍵編碼（Key code）輸入模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1895
msgid ""
"Use key code or symbol input on SDL.  Symbol is recommended for non-qwerty "
"layouts since currently the default keybindings for key code mode only "
"supports qwerty.  Key code is currently WIP and bypasses IMEs, caps lock, and "
"num lock."
msgstr ""
"在SDL上使用按鍵編碼（key code）或符號（symbol）輸入模式。符號模式適合非 qwerty 的鍵盤因為目前預設的按鍵設定只支援 "
"qwerty。按鍵編碼模式還在開發中而且會繞過輸入法編輯器（IME）、大寫鎖定鍵（caps lock）與小鍵盤鎖定鍵（num lock）。"

#: src/options.cpp:1899
msgid "Key code"
msgstr "按鍵編碼（Key code）"

#: src/options.cpp:1902
msgid "Use pinyin in search"
msgstr "使用漢語拼音搜尋"

#: src/options.cpp:1903
msgid ""
"If true, pinyin (pronunciation of Chinese characters) can be used in "
"searching/filtering (may cause major slowdown when searching through too many "
"entries.)"
msgstr "設定為 [是]，可以使用漢語來搜尋/篩選。(如果搜尋太多條目，可能會導致搜尋速度大幅降低)"

#: src/options.cpp:1909
msgid "Force capital/modified letters in prompts"
msgstr "輸入確認限制大寫"

#: src/options.cpp:1910
msgid ""
"If true, prompts such as Y/N queries only accepts capital or modified "
"letters, while lower case and unmodified letters only snap the cursor to the "
"corresponding option."
msgstr "設定為「是」，輸入確認 Y/N 只會接受大寫或帶修飾鍵的輸入，當輸入小寫或不帶修飾鍵時把指標移到對應的選項上。"

#: src/options.cpp:1915
msgid "Snap to target"
msgstr "自動瞄準目標"

#: src/options.cpp:1916
msgid "If true, automatically follow the crosshair when firing/throwing."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 會自動把游標移動到可攻擊或投擲的目標上。"

#: src/options.cpp:1920
msgid "Reaim after firing"
msgstr "開火後再次瞄準"

#: src/options.cpp:1921
msgid "If true, after firing automatically aim again if targets are available."
msgstr "設定為「是」，如果目標還在，會在開火後再次進入瞄準狀態。"

#: src/options.cpp:1925
msgid "Unload your bow etc after canceling shooting"
msgstr "取消射擊後退下弓箭箭矢。"

#: src/options.cpp:1926
msgid "If true, weapons like bow and slingshot will be unloaded when quitting aim UI."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，離開瞄準介面時類似弓和但弓的武器會卸下彈藥。"

#: src/options.cpp:1930
msgid "Query on item disassembly"
msgstr "拆解物品前詢問"

#: src/options.cpp:1931
msgid "If true, will query before disassembling items."
msgstr "設定為 [是]， 會在每次拆解物品前進行確認。"

#: src/options.cpp:1935
msgid "Query on terrain/furniture deconstruction"
msgstr "拆除地形/家具前詢問"

#: src/options.cpp:1936
msgid "If true, will query before deconstructing terrain/furniture."
msgstr "設定為 [是]， 會在每次拆除地形/家具前進行確認。"

#: src/options.cpp:1940
msgid "Query on keybinding removal"
msgstr "移除熱鍵前詢問"

#: src/options.cpp:1941
msgid "If true, will query before removing a keybinding from a hotkey."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 會在移除熱鍵綁定前進行確認。"

#: src/options.cpp:1945
msgid "Close advanced inventory on move all"
msgstr "移動所有物品後關閉進階物品欄"

#: src/options.cpp:1946
msgid ""
"If true, will close the advanced inventory when the move all items command is "
"used."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 當使用移動所有物品的命令後會關閉進階物品欄。"

#: src/options.cpp:1951
msgid "Open default advanced inventory layout"
msgstr "總是打開預設的進階物品欄佈局"

#: src/options.cpp:1952
msgid "If true, open default advanced inventory layout instead of last opened layout"
msgstr "設定為 [是]，會打開預設的進階物品欄佈局而不是上次使用的佈局。"

#: src/options.cpp:1956
msgid "Display actions in \"Use item\" menu"
msgstr "在 \"使用物品\" 選單中顯示相關行動"

#: src/options.cpp:1958
msgid ""
"If true, actions (like \"Read\", \"Smoke\", \"Wrap tighter\") will be "
"displayed next to the corresponding items."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，可用的行動 (如閱讀，吸煙，包緊) 會顯示在相應的物品旁邊。"

#: src/options.cpp:1963
msgid "Autoselect if exactly one valid target"
msgstr "自動選取單一有效目標"

#: src/options.cpp:1964
msgid ""
"If true, directional actions ( like \"Examine\", \"Open\", \"Pickup\" ) will "
"autoselect an adjacent tile if there is exactly one valid target."
msgstr "若設定為是，指向性行動 (像\"調查\"、\"開啟\"、\"拿取\") 會在只有單一個有效目標的情況下自動選取鄰近地形。"

#: src/options.cpp:1970
msgid "Inventory highlight mode"
msgstr "物品欄反白模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1971
msgid ""
"Highlight selected item's contents and parent container in inventory screen.  "
"\"Symbol\" shows a highlighted caret and \"Highlight\" uses font highlighting."
msgstr "在物品欄標示選取物品的內容物或容器。「符號」會顯示反白的插入符號 (<^>)，「反白」會將字體反白。"

#: src/options.cpp:1974
msgid "Highlight"
msgstr "反白"

#: src/options.cpp:1981
msgid "Highlight unread recipes"
msgstr "標示未讀配方"

#: src/options.cpp:1982
msgid "If true, highlight unread recipes to allow tracking of newly learned recipes."
msgstr "設定為[是]，標示未讀配方來讓你找到新學到的配方。"

#: src/options.cpp:1987
msgid "Highlight unread items"
msgstr "標記新發現物品"

#: src/options.cpp:1988
msgid "If true, highlight unread items to allow tracking of newly discovered items."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，標記出沒見過的物品來讓你追蹤新發現的物品。"

#: src/options.cpp:1992
msgid "Screen reader mode"
msgstr "螢幕閱讀器模式"

#: src/options.cpp:1993
msgid ""
"On supported UI screens, tweaks display of text to optimize for screen "
"readers.  Targeted towards using the open-source screen reader 'orca' using "
"curses for display."
msgstr "在支持的介面中，調整顯示文字以便螢幕閱讀器的使用。目前支援使用開源螢幕閱讀器「orca」在字元模式下顯示。"

#: src/options.cpp:2002
msgid "Diagonal movement with cursor keys and modifiers"
msgstr "使用修飾鍵與方向鍵進行斜線移動"

#: src/options.cpp:2047
msgid ""
"Allows diagonal movement with cursor keys using CTRL and SHIFT modifiers.  "
"Diagonal movement action keys are taken from keybindings, so you need these "
"to be configured."
msgstr "允許使用 Ctrl 或 Shift 配合方向鍵來進行斜線移動。斜線移動的按鍵取決於熱鍵設定，所以需要先進行設定。"

#: src/options.cpp:2047
msgid "Mode 1: Numpad Emulation"
msgstr "模式 1:數字鍵盤模擬"

#: src/options.cpp:2047
msgid "Mode 2: CW/CCW"
msgstr "模式 2： 順時針 / 逆時針"

#: src/options.cpp:2047
msgid "Mode 3: L/R Tilt"
msgstr "模式 3 ： 左 / 右傾斜"

#: src/options.cpp:2047
msgid "Mode 4: Diagonal Lock"
msgstr "模式 4：斜線鎖定"

#: src/options.cpp:2053
msgid "Vehicle interface options"
msgstr "载具驾驶"

#: src/options.cpp:2054
msgid "Options regarding vehicle interface."
msgstr "載具相關選項。"

#: src/options.cpp:2056
msgid "Vehicle plating changes part color"
msgstr "車輛裝甲板改變零件顏色"

#: src/options.cpp:2057
msgid "If true, vehicle parts will change color if they are armor plated."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，車輛零件會在安裝裝甲板後改變顏色。"

#: src/options.cpp:2061
msgid "Auto-shift the view while driving"
msgstr "駕駛時自動前移視角"

#: src/options.cpp:2062
msgid "If true, view will automatically shift towards the driving direction."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，駕駛時會自動把視角往駕駛方向前移。"

#: src/options.cpp:2066
msgid "Draw vehicle facing indicator"
msgstr "駕駛時顯示車輛朝向指標"

#: src/options.cpp:2067
msgid ""
"If true, when controlling a vehicle, a white 'X' (in curses version) or a "
"crosshair (in tiles version) at distance 10 from the center will display its "
"current facing."
msgstr "設定為 [是]，駕駛時會把車輛的朝向以白色的 X 符號 (字符版本) 或十字線 (圖像版本) 顯示在距離車輛中心點前方 10 格的位置。"

#: src/options.cpp:2071
msgid "Reverse steering direction in reverse"
msgstr "倒車時將方向鍵左右顛倒。"

#: src/options.cpp:2072
msgid ""
"If true, when driving a vehicle in reverse, steering should also reverse like "
"real life."
msgstr "如果設定成 [是]，當駕駛車輛倒車時，方向盤轉向也應該像現實世界一樣是跟前進相反的。"

#: src/options.cpp:2079
msgid "Sidebar interface options"
msgstr "侧边栏"

#: src/options.cpp:2080
msgid "Options regarding sidebar interface."
msgstr "側邊欄相關選項。"

#: src/options.cpp:2082
msgid "Sidebar position"
msgstr "側邊欄位置"

#: src/options.cpp:2083
msgid "Switch between sidebar on the left or on the right side.  Requires restart."
msgstr "切換側邊欄設在左側或右側。需要重新啟動遊戲。"

#: src/options.cpp:2085 src/options.cpp:2134 src/options.cpp:3136
#. ~ sidebar position
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左側"

#: src/options.cpp:2085 src/options.cpp:2134 src/options.cpp:3136
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右側"

#: src/options.cpp:2088
msgid "Draw sidebar spacers"
msgstr "繪製側邊欄間隔"

#: src/options.cpp:2089
msgid "If true, adds an extra space between sidebar panels."
msgstr "如果設定為[是]，會在側邊欄面板之間添加額外的間隔。"

#: src/options.cpp:2093
msgid "Message log flow"
msgstr "日誌訊息呈現方向"

#: src/options.cpp:2094
msgid "Where new log messages should show."
msgstr "設定新訊息從哪邊出現。"

#: src/options.cpp:2096
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

#: src/options.cpp:2096
#. ~ sidebar/message log flow direction
msgid "Top"
msgstr "頂部"

#: src/options.cpp:2100
msgid "Sidebar log message display duration"
msgstr "側邊欄日誌訊息顯示時長"

#: src/options.cpp:2101
msgid ""
"Number of turns after which a message will be removed from the sidebar log.  "
"0 = disabled."
msgstr "設定經過多少回合後日誌訊息會從側邊欄移除。設定為 [0] 會停用這個功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:2105
msgid "Message cooldown"
msgstr "隱藏相似訊息"

#: src/options.cpp:2106
msgid "Number of turns during which similar messages are hidden.  0 = disabled."
msgstr "隱藏相似訊息的回合數。設定為 0 會停用這功能。"

#: src/options.cpp:2110
msgid "Limit message history"
msgstr "限制歷史訊息"

#: src/options.cpp:2111
msgid "Number of messages to preserve in the history, and when saving."
msgstr "當存檔時最大保留的歷史訊息數量。"

#: src/options.cpp:2116
msgid "Suppress \"Unknown command\" messages"
msgstr "停用 \"未知的指令\" 訊息"

#: src/options.cpp:2117
msgid ""
"If true, pressing a key with no set function will not display a notice in the "
"chat log."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 按下未設定功能的按鍵時將不會在日誌訊息中顯示通知。"

#: src/options.cpp:2122
msgid "Popup window when achievement completed"
msgstr "完成成就時跳出視窗"

#: src/options.cpp:2123
msgid ""
"Whether to trigger a popup window when completing an achievement.  First: "
"when completing an achievement that has not been completed in a previous game."
msgstr "完成成就時是否要有個視窗跳出來。「首次」：當之前的遊戲從未完成這項成就時。"

#: src/options.cpp:2128
msgid "First"
msgstr "首次"

#: src/options.cpp:2132
msgid "Look around position"
msgstr "窺視時的預設方向"

#: src/options.cpp:2133
msgid "Switch between look around panel being left or right."
msgstr "切換你窺視的預設方向（左或右）。"

#: src/options.cpp:2138
msgid "Aim window display style"
msgstr "瞄準畫面顯示樣式"

#: src/options.cpp:2139
msgid "How should confidence and steadiness be communicated to the player."
msgstr "設定顯示命中率與穩定性的方式。"

#: src/options.cpp:2141 src/options.cpp:2193
msgid "Bars"
msgstr "條狀"

#: src/options.cpp:2141
#. ~ aim bar style - bars or numbers
msgid "Numbers"
msgstr "數字"

#: src/options.cpp:2144
msgid "Morale style"
msgstr "士氣顯示樣式"

#: src/options.cpp:2145
msgid "Morale display style in sidebar."
msgstr "設定士氣在側邊欄的顯示樣式。"

#: src/options.cpp:2146
msgid "Horizontal"
msgstr "水平"

#: src/options.cpp:2146
msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "垂直"

#: src/options.cpp:2150
msgid "Full screen Advanced Inventory Manager"
msgstr "全螢幕進階物品管理"

#: src/options.cpp:2151
msgid ""
"If true, Advanced Inventory Manager menu will fit full screen, otherwise it "
"will leave sidebar visible."
msgstr "如果是，進階物品管理選單會填滿螢幕，否則它會顯示側邊欄。"

#: src/options.cpp:2157
msgid "QOL options"
msgstr "游戏体验"

#: src/options.cpp:2158
msgid "Options regarding QOL."
msgstr "提升遊戲體驗的選項。"

#: src/options.cpp:2160
msgid "Move view offset"
msgstr "視角移動距離"

#: src/options.cpp:2161
msgid "Move view by how many squares per keypress."
msgstr "設定每次按鍵會將視角移動幾個方格。"

#: src/options.cpp:2165
msgid "Overmap fast scroll offset"
msgstr "世界地圖快速捲動的格數"

#: src/options.cpp:2166
msgid ""
"With Fast Scroll option enabled, shift view on the overmap and while looking "
"around by this many squares per keypress."
msgstr "當世界地圖快速捲動啟用時，每次按下方向鍵會將游標移動多少格。"

#: src/options.cpp:2170
msgid "Centered menu scrolling"
msgstr "選單游標置中捲動"

#: src/options.cpp:2171
msgid ""
"If true, menus will start scrolling in the center of the list, and keep the "
"list centered."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 選單的游標在捲動時會保持在中央。"

#: src/options.cpp:2175
msgid "Shift list item view"
msgstr "列出物品時畫面視角"

#: src/options.cpp:2176
msgid ""
"Centered or to edge, shift the view toward the selected item if it is outside "
"of your current viewport."
msgstr "設定列出角色附近所有物品時, 若是選中的物品不在畫面中, 要移動畫面把該物品置中還是置於畫面邊緣。"

#: src/options.cpp:2177
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "置中"

#: src/options.cpp:2177
msgid "To edge"
msgstr "邊緣"

#: src/options.cpp:2181
msgid "Auto inventory letters"
msgstr "自動指定物品代碼"

#: src/options.cpp:2182
msgid ""
"Enabled: automatically assign letters to any carried items that lack them.  "
"Disabled: do not auto-assign letters.  Favorites: only auto-assign letters to "
"favorited items."
msgstr "[啟用]：自動將字母分配給所有缺少字母代碼的物品。[停用]：不自動分配物品代碼。[最愛]：僅自動將字母分配給設為最愛的物品。"

#: src/options.cpp:2190
msgid "Show item health"
msgstr "顯示物品耐久"

#: src/options.cpp:2192
msgid "Show item health bars, descriptions like reinforced, scratched etc. or both."
msgstr "顯示物品的耐久條、或是顯示如「強化」、「刮傷的」等描述。也可以選擇兩種都顯示。"

#: src/options.cpp:2194
msgid "Descriptions"
msgstr "描述"

#: src/options.cpp:2199
msgid "Show item symbols"
msgstr "顯示物品符號"

#: src/options.cpp:2200
msgid "If true, show item symbols in inventory and pick up menu."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 會在物品欄和撿取選單中顯示物品的符號。"

#: src/options.cpp:2204
msgid "Show armor coverage map"
msgstr "顯示護甲覆蓋示意圖"

#: src/options.cpp:2205
msgid ""
"If true, show a visual representation of armor coverage in the item info "
"window."
msgstr "設定為[是]，在物品說明視窗顯示護甲覆蓋示意圖。"

#: src/options.cpp:2209
msgid "Favorited item's mark position"
msgstr "最愛物品的標記位置"

#: src/options.cpp:2210
msgid ""
"Where to place mark of the favorited item (asterisk): before item's name "
"(prefix) or after item's name (suffix)."
msgstr "收藏物品的標記（星號）位於物品名稱的前面（前綴）還是後面（後綴）。"

#: src/options.cpp:2211
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "前綴"

#: src/options.cpp:2211
msgid "Suffix"
msgstr "後綴"

#: src/options.cpp:2217
msgid "Mouse control options"
msgstr "手柄鼠标"

#: src/options.cpp:2218
msgid "Options regarding mouse control."
msgstr "關於滑鼠控制的選項。"

#: src/options.cpp:2220
msgid "Enable mouse"
msgstr "启动鼠标"

#: src/options.cpp:2221
msgid "Enable input from mouse."
msgstr "启用鼠标输入"

#: src/options.cpp:2224
msgid "Enable joystick"
msgstr "啟用搖桿"

#: src/options.cpp:2225
msgid "If true, enable input from joystick."
msgstr "如果為[是]，啟用搖桿輸入。"

#: src/options.cpp:2229
msgid "Hide mouse cursor"
msgstr "隱藏滑鼠游標"

#: src/options.cpp:2230
msgid ""
"Show: cursor is always shown.  Hide: cursor is hidden.  HideKB: cursor is "
"hidden on keyboard input and unhidden on mouse movement."
msgstr " [顯示] 游標總是顯示。 [隱藏] 游標隱藏。 [自動] 游標會在鍵盤輸入時隱藏, 在滑鼠移動時取消隱藏。"

#: src/options.cpp:2232
#. ~ show mouse cursor
msgid "Show"
msgstr "顯示"

#: src/options.cpp:2234 data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
#. ~ hide mouse cursor
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_invisibility"
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隱藏"

#: src/options.cpp:2236
#. ~ hide mouse cursor when keyboard is used
msgid "HideKB"
msgstr "自動"

#: src/options.cpp:2241
msgid "Edge scrolling"
msgstr "邊緣滾動"

#: src/options.cpp:2242
msgid "Edge scrolling with the mouse."
msgstr "使用滑鼠游標滾動邊緣。"

#: src/options.cpp:2244 data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eoc_riddles.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_slow"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_XE_RIDDLE_15"
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "慢"

#: src/options.cpp:2246
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快"

#: src/options.cpp:2260
msgid "Animation options"
msgstr "动画"

#: src/options.cpp:2261
msgid "Options regarding animations."
msgstr "動畫相關設定。"

#: src/options.cpp:2263
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "動畫"

#: src/options.cpp:2264
msgid "If true, will display enabled animations."
msgstr "設定為 [是], 將會顯示下列啟用的動畫。"

#: src/options.cpp:2268
msgid "Rain animation"
