msgstr ""

#: data/core/mod_migrations.json
#. ~ Explaination for removal of mod "sees_player_retro"
#. ~ Explaination for removal of mod "sees_player_hitbutton"
msgid ""
"Superseded by \"Show overlay icons over creatures\" option under Graphics -> "
"Tileset Options."
msgstr ""
"Superseded by \"Show overlay icons over creatures\" option under Graphics -> "
"Tileset Options."

#: data/core/mod_migrations.json
#. ~ Explaination for removal of mod "No_Rail_Stations"
msgid ""
"Railway stations removed from vanilla and moved to \"Railroads\" mod making "
"this mod redundant."
msgstr ""
"Railway stations removed from vanilla and moved to \"Railroads\" mod making "
"this mod redundant."

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Fires can spread easily, especially with abundance of fuel."
msgstr "火勢可以很容易擴散, 特別是有大量燃料的時候。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Even without electricity, ovens can be useful fire containers."
msgstr "就算沒有電力，烤箱仍是個很有用的點燃容器。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's sight, noise, or smell."
msgstr "亮光並不吸引殭屍，吸引它們注意的是被看見、噪音或氣味。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Moose may not be your friend."
msgstr "駝鹿或許不會成為你的朋友。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."
msgstr "消防戰鬥服能在火焰中保謢你，但不能在過熱中保護你。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Peek around corners, when crouching, or up/down stairs to check for enemies."
msgstr "在障礙物後蹲下或者正準備上下樓梯時，可以窺視轉角觀察是否有敵人。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."
msgstr "冷凍食物可以保存更長時間。找一個涼快的地下室或者做一個地下儲藏室。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."
msgstr "死亡是體驗的一部分。用你學到的東西再接再厲。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Frozen food?  Put it by a fire or heat it up in a pan."
msgstr "冷凍食品? 把它放在火旁或者用平底鍋加熱它。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr "地底空間像地下室或者洞穴是整年都會保持涼爽。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes "
"instead."
msgstr "害怕野生動物？一直大喊可以嚇走牠們。但要注意另外一種被你聲音吸引來的東西。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."
msgstr "動物跟殭屍並非朋友，你可以利用這一點。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "A door is not the only way in or out of most places."
msgstr "門口在大部分地方並不是唯一的入口或者出口。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."
msgstr "別跟困難對抗，為生存而逃跑並不可恥。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "You don't have to sit right next to fire to use it."
msgstr "用火並不需要緊貼在火源旁邊。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."
msgstr "很多物品有特殊動作，嘗試找出它們能做甚麼吧。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."
msgstr "只是因為一個地方很危險不代表它值得去掠奪。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."
msgstr "如果你正在入侵某地方的話，請確定你也知道要怎樣離開。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."
msgstr "方法通常不會只有一種，發揮你的創造性思考能力吧。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Survival order: shelter, water, food, then everything else."
msgstr "生存要件：住所、水、食物，再來才是其他林林總總的事物。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Balance armor versus encumbrance.  Even dropping a backpack can help in melee."
msgstr "在護甲值與累贅值之間取得最好的平衡。即使只脫掉一個背包，也能對近戰有所助益。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like "
"spears."
msgstr "害怕打近身戰? 對敵人投擲物品或者使用例如矛的伸延武器。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made "
"again."
msgstr "粗製武器很容易損壞，但它們依然是武器，而且可以再製作出來。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Not much survives a car at 120mph.  Can you?"
msgstr "沒太多東西能在一輛時速120英里的車輛下生存，你可以嗎?"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Drugs are great for quick morale boosts and more, but be aware of addiction "
"and overdose."
msgstr "毒品能很好且迅速的提高士氣，但要小心上癮或者過量。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you "
"need."
msgstr "明智地使用你的地圖。 會找到你正需要的物品的掠奪地點應優先處理。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speeds that up."
msgstr "隨著時間的推移，傷口會慢慢癒合。繃帶和消毒劑能提升癒合速度。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Don't get grabbed by zombies.  Their bites can be infectious."
msgstr "不要被殭屍抓住。被它們咬到可能會被感染。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Feeling odd after waking up?  Try eating healthier and your health may "
"improve."
msgstr "睡醒後覺得怪怪的? 試試吃健康一點, 你的健康狀況能夠改善的。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."
msgstr "吃得健康點，不然會損害你的健康，快餐只適合在危急的時候。"

#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Nature can provide.  You can live off the land if you learn how."
msgstr "大自然是很慷慨大方的。如果你學會如何在這片土地上生活的話。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Raw food and water from unsafe sources can't be healthy.  Right?"
msgstr "來自不明源頭的生食和水總不會是健康的，對吧？"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"
msgstr "你明明可以開車，或者騎腳踏車，又或者用溜冰鞋，為何要用雙腳走路？"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr "大災變前的食物不會永遠保持新鮮。牢記在心。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if "
"needed."
msgstr "你可以用平凡的物品去製作不平凡的東西。 如果有需要的話, 實行完全的馬蓋先風格吧。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know the "
"difference."
msgstr "那裡有你想吃的，以及你想燒掉的菌類。你看到就會知道它們的分別。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Having a backup weapon is wise.  So is having a backup plan."
msgstr "擁有一件後備武器是明智決定，那等於你有一個後備計劃。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."
msgstr "濕透又生氣? 一條乾的毛巾會把你的笑容帶回來。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"
msgstr "喜歡賭博？使用誘變劑！高雄發大財！"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Smoking and napping is asking for more than a hole in your shirt."
msgstr "在抽菸時打瞌睡的危險可不僅僅是在衣服上燒個洞那麼簡單。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out."
msgstr "你著火了嗎？停止行動並等待來撲滅火勢。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."
msgstr "日常殺戮。 保持警覺！ 千萬別鬆懈。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of "
"pills."
msgstr "大部份藥物都不是即效性的，所以別一口氣吞下一整瓶藥丸。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal stick."
msgstr "出名的遺言: 用金屬棒去戳這頭電擊殭屍吧。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat "
"regularly."
msgstr "飽腹不會解決你的營養不良問題。給它點時間, 並且定期進食。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Be mindful of the environmental protection of your gear.  It can take you "
"places."
msgstr "注意有環境防護屬性的裝備。使你可以到更多地方。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Don't overlook protective gear, like gas masks or turnout gear.  You never "
"know."
msgstr "不要忽略護具, 例如防毒面具或者消防戰鬥服。 因為很難說會發生甚麼事。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting "
"components."
msgstr "耗盡資源? 破壞或者拆解物品會出現有趣的材料。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Temperature affects the shelf life of foods.  The colder, the better."
msgstr "溫度會影響食物的有效存放期，越冷越好。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Frozen food doesn't rot, but may be inedible if not defrosted."
msgstr "冷凍物品不會腐爛，但沒解凍之前可能不適合食用。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Some dry foods can be eaten frozen.  Some foods become mushy after defrosting."
msgstr "有些乾燥的食物可以在冰凍狀態食用。有些食物在解凍後會變成糊狀。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Thirsty on a long winter journey?  Take a thermos with you."
msgstr "在漫長的冬季裡覺得口渴? 帶一個熱水瓶吧。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."
msgstr "\"這只是一道刮痕? \" 無論如何, 消毒並包紮可以加速癒合。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Broken limb?  Improvised splints are ok, but hospitals might have better tech "
"for it."
msgstr "摔斷腿了？自製的夾板也許夠用，但醫院裡有更好的醫療手段。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Don't be afraid to make the game easier on yourself.  Worlds can be made to "
"spawn with more resources."
msgstr "不要害怕讓你自己的遊戲變得更容易。世界可以在建立時產生更多的物資。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."
msgstr "會使你速度減慢的地型也會減慢敵人的速度。"

#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your best "
"friend."
msgstr "當整個城鎮都變成了一座大型超市時, 一台購物車就是你最好的朋友。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Different characters, professions, hobbies, and scenarios can spice up your "
"game.  Roleplay!"
msgstr "不同的角色，職業，興趣和場景可以添增遊戲樂趣。角色扮演！"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"
msgstr "救了一個倖存者等於賺到一個朋友，多數情況下..."

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."
msgstr "想學怎麼玩？看看熱鍵設定選單，學會所有基本的操作方式吧。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Expect the unexpected, even if it's the Spanish Inquisition."
msgstr "防患於未然，即使老大跟你保證五十年不變。（原文為西班牙宗教裁判所）"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"You can throw things while peeking around corners.  Perfect for taking down "
"gun turrets."
msgstr "你可以在窺視轉角時投擲物品，非常適合用來破壞砲塔。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash cards!"
msgstr "可沒人告訴那些自動販賣機說世界末日到了。蒐集那些現金卡！"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, right?"
msgstr "那些最高機密的地下實驗室一定有一些很酷的東西，應該吧？"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."
msgstr "將漏斗放在壺或桶上，隨著時間流動能收集雨水。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) "
"kill them all."
msgstr "在城市裡的殭屍非常多但有限，你 (最終) 可以把牠們殺清光。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"
msgstr "你是不是只拿沒被釘子釘住的東西？回去拿那些釘子！"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "You can make your own safe mode rules in the pause menu."
msgstr "你可以在暫停選單中自定你的安全模式規則。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."
msgstr "沒有子彈，連世上最好的槍都會毫無用處。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running "
"away."
msgstr "絕大部份殭屍會直接穿過車輛，而不是繞過。在逃走時要記著這點。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."
msgstr "如果你腿斷了困在室內，何不在等待痊癒的時間內閱覽群書。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."
msgstr "別太貪心，你死了的話戰利品就不再重要了。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "The floor is too hard to sleep on?  Try gathering a pile of leaves."
msgstr "地板太硬睡不著？試試看收集一堆樹葉。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Too cold to sleep well at night?  A pile of clothes will make it better."
msgstr "晚上太冷睡不著？放一些衣物保暖是個好辦法。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Major blood loss?  Drink plenty, supplement iron, and rest to regenerate your "
"red blood cells."
msgstr "大量失血？多喝水，補充鐵質然後多休息讓紅血球再生。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Arterial bleeding from a gunshot?  A tourniquet can save you from death."
msgstr "槍擊導致動脈大出血？及時使用止血帶可以使你免於死亡。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"No bandages nearby?  Empty your hands and let the time pass to apply pressure "
"to the wound."
msgstr "找不到繃帶？空出雙手讓時間流逝，就能對傷口施壓以止血。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Tis but a scratch?  Minor bleeding does not require any dressing.  A Bandaid "
"is sufficient enough."
msgstr "只是些擦傷？輕微流血不需要包紮，OK繃就夠用了。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Zone activity manager can make your life easier.  Do more in one go."
msgstr "區域活動管理讓你玩得更輕鬆。一次大量處理同類事情。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Want less micro-management?  Zone manager can change your game."
msgstr "希望少點細節微操？區域管理可以改變你的遊戲體驗。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Every sensei was once a student.  NPCs can teach you and vice versa."
msgstr "每個大神都曾經是個菜鳥。同伴NPC可以教導你技能，反之亦然。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Length matters… at least when it comes to shoving a shovel in your backpack."
msgstr "長度是有差別的...特別是當你想將鏟子放入背包時。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific "
"items in them."
msgstr "我的打火機哪去了？使用容器管理來指定儲存特定物品。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Keep essentials in your clothing pockets in case you have to ditch your "
"backpack."
msgstr "把關鍵物品放在衣服口袋裡，免得有時候你需要拋棄背包。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Exercising and being active increases your cardio and therefore your stamina "
"pool."
msgstr "運動鍛鍊可以增加你的心肺功能，從而增加你的耐力。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."
msgstr "準備長途旅行？自動旅行和自動駕駛引領你前往目的地。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"You can automate repetitive tasks such as foraging, mining, or mopping for "
"your convenience."
msgstr "為了減少不必要的操作，你可以設置自動執行重複性工作，如採集、挖掘或者拖地。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"You can crouch or go prone to hide behind objects and reduce the sound you "
"make when you move."
msgstr "你可以蹲下或者俯臥來躲在家具後面，並減少移動時發出的聲音。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "When you are prone, you use the bipod of your rifle for better accuracy."
msgstr "當你趴下時，你可以使用槍械的腳架來提高射擊準確度。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Dissecting bodies will help in gaining knowledge about the weaknesses of the "
"opponents."
msgstr "解剖屍體可以幫助你了解敵人的弱點。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"An armored enemy?  Don't give up, maybe it has some weaknesses that can be "
"exploited."
msgstr "覆甲的敵人？別放棄，也許它有些弱點可以被利用。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Need experience with crafting and such?  Use the training recipes to master "
"the ins and outs."
msgstr "需要些製作方面的經驗嗎？使用訓練配方來掌握各項細節。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Remember that the sidebar is customizable and widgets can be added and "
"removed from it."
msgstr "記住，側邊資訊欄是可自定義的，你可以在其中添加或者刪除項目。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."
msgstr "傀儡控制。你可以直接控制你的NPC追隨者來進行遊戲。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Your skills can rust, but you'll learn them faster when you pick them up "
"again."
msgstr "長期不使用的技能會被慢慢遺忘，但當你重拾它們時，能學得更快。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Save time.  Instead of using a recipe, place water in a container on a fire "
"to boil it."
msgstr "比起使用製造配方來煮水，直接把裝水容器放在火上燒開更節約時間。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Knowledge can't replace practical skill and experience, but it will help you "
"get them faster."
msgstr "理論知識不能代替實踐技能和經驗，但了解理論能使你更快獲得實踐經驗。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Books carry knowledge and often recipes.  You need practical skills to "
"utilize them.  Practice."
msgstr "書本記載著知識，而且常有許多配方。但你需要實踐來應用它們。多練習。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Being skilled does not mean being proficient.  Gain proficiency to become a "
"master in specific areas."
msgstr "熟練並不意味著精通。 獲得熟練專精，成為特定領域的大師。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Prolonged physical exhaustion results in weariness.  Overworking causes loss "
"of productivity."
msgstr "長時間的體力消耗會累積疲憊。過度操勞會導製工作效率下降。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Mark the items you carry as favorites so you can easily identify new items "
"and drop them in bulk."
msgstr "將隨身物品標記為最愛，以便輕鬆辨識新物品並批量丟下。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Verticality is a thing.  If you can get to a roof somehow, it may save your "
"life."
msgstr "充分利用垂直空間，如果你找到方法可以攀爬上屋頂，有時候也許能救你一命。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Your enemy is often slower than you.  Walk to conserve stamina and run only "
"when you must."
msgstr "許多敵人往往比你慢，步行以保持體力，只在需要的時候才跑步。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Fight on your conditions whenever you can.  Use terrain, traps, and fire to "
"your advantage."
msgstr "盡量選擇有利情況進行戰鬥。像是地形、陷阱和火焰來為你帶來優勢。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "Pick your fights and don't let them pick you.  Don't bite what you can't chew."
msgstr "由你來選擇作戰，而非反過來。別嘗試去挑戰你吃不下的目標。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Learn to use zone sorting to sort your loot in one go.  Y to set up zones, O "
"to sort items."
msgstr "使用區域管理來進一步分類你的戰利品。按Y進行區域設置，按O來整理物品。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Want to loot everything not nailed down in one go?  Use zone manager to fill "
"your hoard."
msgstr "想一鍵掃蕩物資？使用區域管理來填滿你的倉鼠窩。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"You can view local keybindings in most sub-menus by pressing the question "
"mark (?) key."
msgstr "你可以按下［？］來查看大部分子介面的本地熱鍵。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"There are some unbound keybindings that might prove useful for your needs.  "
"Check them out."
msgstr "有些未被設定的熱鍵也許更符合你的需求。去檢查看看。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Check what you can craft from time to time, even if you don't have components "
"right now."
msgstr "多查看一下你所能製作的物品，即使你還沒找齊材料。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better "
"quality of life."
msgstr "適當使用黑白名單和過濾器，提升你的遊戲體驗。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Many items have contextual uses.  Use the item action menu to find out what "
"you can do with them."
msgstr "許多物品都有他們對應的使用功能。使用物品動作選單可以查看它們的用途。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"The action menu can help you determine what you can do.  There are also some "
"rare actions there."
msgstr "動作選單能幫你了解你有哪些行為可以進行。其中可能還有些你平常不了解的行為。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Auto-pickup settings can save you time when you need it.  It's fully "
"customizable too."
msgstr "自動撿取設置可以在你需要的時候大量節省時間。當然這可以完全自定義條件。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Feeling unwell?  Allow yourself to rest, even for a few days as needed.  Heal "
"now, explore later."
msgstr "感覺不舒服？最好讓自己休息一下，即便可能需要幾天時間。及時治療，探索稍後。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Overconfidence is a treacherous killer.  Leave yourself some leeway for "
"unforeseen circumstances."
msgstr "過度自信是個狡詐的殺手。總是為意外情況保留點餘地吧。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Be mindful of what, when, and how much you eat.  A balanced diet is crucial "
"in the long run."
msgstr "留意你吃了什麼，何時吃，吃多少。均衡飲食是幫助你走更遠的關鍵。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Skillful management of your stamina is crucial for your survival.  Conserve "
"it when you can."
msgstr "有效管理你的體力是生存的關鍵。盡可能的維持它。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a "
"practice target."
msgstr "有些東西在建築選單是不需材料的：標記製作現場，柴薪源，練習靶。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."
msgstr "當你使用觀察時，按T可以自動移動到目的地或者物品處。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "You can use your mouse to move to a destination by double-clicking it."
msgstr "你可以雙擊滑鼠左鍵來移動到目標位置。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "You can use your mouse in your inventory and few other menus."
msgstr "你可以在物品欄的部分選項中使用滑鼠操作。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Crafting is faster if you have an actual place for it, preferably a workshop "
"bench."
msgstr "有個好的製作地點可以使製作物品更為快速，其中最好的是工作台。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Hope for the best but prepare for the worst.  A backup stash of necessities "
"can save the day."
msgstr "抱持最好的希望，但做最壞的準備。備用的必需品可以拯救你。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Pain can drastically slow you down and reduces your stats.  Check your speed "
"in the character menu."
msgstr "疼痛會大幅度降低你的速度和減少你的屬性值。你可以在角色介面確認當前的速度。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more "
"bullets."
msgstr "贏家從不吸毒。它們太昂貴了。贏家會用毒品換更多子彈。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"If you don't have a certain proficiency, having a related book is a good "
"idea.  More books make you less likely to fail, but not as good as knowing "
"the subject for yourself."
msgstr "假如你沒有一定程度的熟練度，找些相關的書籍是個好主意。 更多的書籍讓你沒那麼容易失敗，但不會比你自己瞭解這個專業來的有用。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"You can set priority levels for pockets in your inventory, letting you decide "
"where your loot goes."
msgstr "你可以在你物品欄中的容器管理設定口袋的優先權，讓你設定你的戰利品要去哪。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Face masks can help protect from smoke and disease, but make it harder to "
"breathe, affecting stamina."
msgstr "口罩可以保護你免受煙霧和疾病的威脅，但是讓你更難呼吸並影響耐力。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "The burglar alarm for a store won't go off if you break through the wall."
msgstr "如果你破牆而入的話商店的警報鈴就不會響起來囉。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"You can keep a diary if you set the keybinding.  Use it to roleplay, take "
"notes, and keep score."
msgstr "你可以設置「按鍵設置」來開啟日記功能。使用它來角色扮演、作筆記和計分。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Some weapons have techniques that let you do things like hit faster, block "
"attacks, or stun opponents."
msgstr "有些武器會有揮舞時可使用的技巧，像是快速攻擊，格擋或擊暈敵人。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "If brute force isn't working, you're not using enough of it."
msgstr "如果暴力法沒有用，那一定是你還不夠使勁。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Sweat is simulated in Cataclysm.  Excessive sweating will dehydrate you "
"quickly but keep you cool."
msgstr "CDDA模擬了流汗。大量流汗會使你快速缺水但能讓你保持涼爽。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Feral humans are smarter than zombies.  They throw rocks and can even open "
"doors.  Watch out!"
msgstr "野人比殭屍聰明，他們會丟石頭和開門。小心點！"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"If you want something to stop existing, setting it on fire is a tried and "
"true method."
msgstr "如果你要某些東西不再存在，把它燒毀是個經實證有效的方法。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid "The higher up you are, the farther you can see on the overmap."
msgstr "站的越高，在大地圖上就看得越遠。"

#: data/core/tips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
msgid ""
"Nobody wants to buy filthy underwear.  Wash your clothes to get a better "
"price for them."
msgstr "沒人想買你的原味內褲。把它洗乾淨才能賣個好價錢。"

