msgid "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
msgstr "吃了抗痙攣藥物"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
msgid ""
"You took anticonvulsant drugs some time ago and you might still be under its "
"influence.\n"
"Prescription note says its effect duration may vary, so your estimate may be "
"inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"不久前你吃了抗痙攣藥物, 目前仍然處於藥效中。\n"
"處方說明它的藥效持續時間可能會有所不同, 因此你的預估可能不準確。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
msgid "Anticonvulsants"
msgstr "抗癲癇藥物"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "relax_gas"
