#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
msgid "You begin feeling increasingly tired and listless."
msgstr "你開始感到越來越疲倦和無精打采。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
msgid "You are no longer in risk of becoming anemic."
msgstr "你不再需要擔心缺鐵性貧血了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
msgid "Your iron deficiency is nearly resolved."
msgstr "你的鐵質缺乏已經快要解決了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
msgid "Your feel stronger as your iron deficiency starts to improve."
msgstr "你感覺你的缺鐵情況逐漸改善。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron
#. Deficiency, Acute Iron Deficiency"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute
#. Anemia"
msgid "Anemia"
msgstr "貧血症"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
