msgstr "早期貧血"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
msgid "Acute Anemia"
msgstr "急性貧血"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
msgid "Loss of red blood cells results in progressively worsening anemia."
msgstr "大量紅血球損失導致貧血逐漸嚴重。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
msgid "You no longer feel anemic."
msgstr "你不再感到貧血。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
msgid "Your anemia is nearly resolved."
msgstr "你的貧血症狀已經快要解決了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
msgid "Your feel stronger as your anemia starts to improve."
msgstr "隨著你的缺鐵情況改善, 你的貧血逐漸恢復中。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
msgid "Early Scurvy"
msgstr "早期壞血病"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad
#. Scurvy"
msgid "Scurvy"
msgstr "壞血病"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
msgid "Bad Scurvy"
msgstr "嚴重壞血病"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
msgid ""
"A lack of vitamin C in your diet will result in progressively worse symptoms "
"of scurvy."
msgstr "你的飲食中缺乏維他命 C, 導致你的壞血病症狀逐漸惡化。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
msgid "You start to develop symptoms of scurvy."
msgstr "你的壞血病症狀開始加重。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
msgid "Your scurvy has resolved."
msgstr "你的壞血病已經痊癒。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
msgid "Your vitamin C deficiency is starting to resolve."
msgstr "你的維他命 C 缺乏症已經開始改善了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
msgid "Your scurvy lessens as your Vitamin C deficiency improves."
msgstr "隨著你的維他命 C 缺乏情況改善, 你的壞血病逐漸減輕中。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "betablock"
msgid "Beta blocker"
msgstr "乙種腎上腺阻斷劑"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Beta blocker"
msgid ""
"You are under the influence of a beta blocker.  This controls your heart "
"rate, decreasing the influence of stressful events such as pain on it.  "
"However, it also lowers blood pressure and induces sleepiness."
msgstr "你受到了乙種腎上腺阻斷劑的影響，它可以控制你的心率，減少疼痛等壓力事件對心率的影響。然而，它也會降低血壓並且讓人犯困。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Beta blocker"
msgid "Beta Blocker"
msgstr "乙種腎上腺阻斷劑"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypervitaminosis"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
msgid "Hypervitaminosis"
msgstr "維他命過多症"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
msgid "An excess of vitamins has badly affected your metabolism."
msgstr "維他命過量已經嚴重影響你的新陳代謝。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
msgid "Your metabolism becomes unstable."
msgstr "你的新陳代謝變得不穩定。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
msgid "Your metabolism becomes more stable."
msgstr "你的新陳代謝變得更加穩定。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxin_buildup"
msgid "Concerning symptoms"
msgstr "令人擔憂的症狀"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxin_buildup"
msgid "Unnerving symptoms"
msgstr "令人不安的症狀"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Concerning symptoms"
msgid "Your muscles keep twitching strangely."
msgstr "你的肌肉不斷地抽搐。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Unnerving symptoms"
msgid ""
"Your nervous system is malfunctioning, almost like it's being torn apart from "
"the inside."
msgstr "你的神經系統出現了問題，你感覺像身體從內部被撕開般。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "opiate_eff"
msgid "Mild Opiate Euphoria"
msgstr "轻度阿片类药物兴奋"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "opiate_eff"
msgid "Moderate Opiate Euphoria"
msgstr "中度阿片类药物兴奋"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "opiate_eff"
msgid "Significant Opiate Euphoria"
msgstr "强效阿片类药物兴奋"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "opiate_eff"
msgid "Opiate Intoxication"
msgstr "阿片类药物中毒"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "opiate_eff"
msgid "Opiate Debilitation"
msgstr "阿片类药物衰弱"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "opiate_eff"
msgid "Death"
msgstr "死亡"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Opiate Euphoria"
msgid "Mild euphoric feelings from the Opiates you've taken."
msgstr "因服用阿片类药物产生的轻微欣快感。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderate Opiate Euphoria"
msgid "Moderate euphoria, likely sedative effects."
msgstr "中等程度欣快感，可能伴随镇静效果。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Significant Opiate Euphoria"
msgid "Significant euphoria, heavy sedative effects."
msgstr "显著欣快感，伴随强烈镇静作用。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Opiate Intoxication"
msgid "Some incapacitation, sedation, nausea, numbness."
msgstr "一些失能、镇静、恶心、麻木感。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Opiate Debilitation"
msgid "Significant chance of death, incapable of many tasks, narcolepsy."
msgstr "死亡的可能性很大，无法完成许多任务，产生嗜睡感。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Death"
msgid "Terminal Dosage achieved."
msgstr "达到最大剂量。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Mild Opiate Euphoria, Moderate
#. Opiate Euphoria, Significant Opiate Euphoria, Opiate Intoxication, Opiate
#. Debilitation, Death"
msgid "Sample contains opiate based painkillers."
msgstr "样品含有阿片类止痛药。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
msgid "Gross Food"
msgstr "不好吃的食物"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
msgid "Demoralizing Food"
msgstr "令人沮喪的食物"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
msgid "Depressing Food"
msgstr "绝望食物"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Gross Food"
msgid "The food you eat is disgusting."
msgstr "你吃的食物令人作噁。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Demoralizing Food"
msgid "Eating nothing but disgusting rations is starting to get you down."
msgstr "只吃那些噁心的口糧讓你開始感覺到不舒服。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Depressing Food"
msgid ""
"Sure, you survived, but what kind of survival is this, eating these "
"disgusting rations day in and day out?"
msgstr "好吧，一切都是為了生存，但這算哪門子生存，吃這些噁心的東西值得嗎？"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
msgid "Mild Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "輕度貧血休克"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
msgid "Moderate Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "中度貧血休克"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
msgid "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "重度貧血休克"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
msgid "Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "致死貧血休克"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid "You've lost some blood and look somewhat pale."
msgstr "你失血不少且看起來蒼白。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderate Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid "You've lost a large amount of blood, and you're not feeling well."
msgstr "你損失了大量的血，而且感覺很不好。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid ""
"You've lost an awful lot of blood, and your condition is severe.  Seek "
"medical attention."
msgstr "你損失了非常大量的血，你的情況非常嚴重，盡快醫療處理。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid ""
"You've lost tremendous amount of blood, and you're standing on death's door.  "
"Saline infusion might save you."
msgstr "你因失血过多，一只脚踏已经进了鬼门关。立即输生理盐水也许能救你一命，快！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid "You have lost a lot of blood, and your condition worsens."
msgstr "你流失很多血液，你的情況正在惡化。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid "You are no longer in shock."
msgstr "你不再休克。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid "Your blood volume increases, and you feel better; but still, you look pale."
msgstr "你的身體血液量回升，你感覺好多了；但你仍然看起來蒼白。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid "You feel stronger as your blood volume starts to improve."
msgstr "當你的血液量開始恢復，你感覺較為有力了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgid "You're not dying from lack of blood, but you're not out of the woods yet."
msgstr "你沒有因缺血而死，但你狀況仍然不好。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "haslight"
msgid "Lit Up"
msgstr "發亮"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Lit Up"
msgid "You are carrying a light and can't hide well."
msgstr "你身上帶著燈, 難以隱藏。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
msgid "Started Recovery"
msgstr "開始復原"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
msgid "Recovering"
msgstr "正在復原"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
msgid "Mostly Recovered"
msgstr "幾乎康複"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Started Recovery, Recovering, Mostly
#. Recovered"
msgid "This damaged limb is slowly regaining its functions."
msgstr "這個受傷的肢體正在慢慢恢復其功能。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Disabled"
msgid "This limb is damaged beyond use and may require a splint to recover."
msgstr "這個肢體受傷太嚴重, 可能需要裝上夾板才能恢復。"

#: data/json/effects.json data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disabled"
#. ~ Snippet in category "broken_limb"
msgid "Your limb breaks!"
msgstr "你的肢體被打斷了!"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disabled"
msgid "The broken limb has mended."
msgstr "斷裂的肢體已被修補。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pkill"
msgid "Painkillers"
msgstr "鎮痛劑"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Painkillers"
msgid ""
"You are under the influence of analgesic substances to relieve pain, but they "
"may numb you a bit."
msgstr "你正在受到鎮痛劑的影響來緩解疼痛，不過這會使你麻木。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Painkillers"
msgid "Painkiller"
msgstr "止痛藥"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
msgid "Happy"
msgstr "快樂"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
msgid "Joyful"
msgstr "喜悅"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
msgid "Elated"
msgstr "高昂"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Happy, Joyful, Elated"
msgid "Life is good."
msgstr "生命真美好。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Happy, Joyful, Elated"
msgid "Oh what a day!  What a lovely day!"
msgstr "令人高興的一天！真是美好的一天！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Happy, Joyful, Elated"
msgid "I'm on top of the world, baby!"
msgstr "寶貝～我在世界之巔！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
msgid "Unhappy"
msgstr "不快樂"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
msgid "Sad"
msgstr "難過"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
msgid "Depressed"
msgstr "沮喪"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
msgid "You are not content with your life."
msgstr "你並不滿足現在的生活。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
msgid "This is not what you planned for your life."
msgstr "這不是你想過的生活。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
msgid "You wonder what's the point of fighting?"
msgstr "你开始怀疑为何而战？"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
msgid "When will all your suffering end?"
msgstr "這所有的痛苦什麼時候才會結束？"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Unhappy, Sad, Depressed"
msgid "You dejectedly consider the pointlessness of it all."
msgstr "你沮丧地觉得一切都毫无意义。"

#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "irradiated"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_weakening"
msgid "Weakness"
msgstr "虛弱"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Weakness"
msgid "Irradiated"
msgstr "受輻射汙染"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Stimulants"
msgid "You're very jittery and pumped up, probably from some stimulants."
msgstr "你感到非常興奮且無法放鬆，也許是因為興奮劑的效果。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "depressants"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Depressants"
msgid "Depressants"
msgstr "鎮靜劑"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Depressants"
msgid "You are under the influence of depressants, and in a bit of a daze."
msgstr "你正受到鎮靜劑的影響，並且感到有點恍神。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "stim_overdose"
msgid "Stimulant Overdose"
msgstr "興奮劑過量"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Stimulant Overdose"
msgid ""
"You can't sit still as you feel your heart pounding out of your chest.  You "
"probably overdosed on those stims."
msgstr "你感覺你的心臟快要跳出你的胸膛了，你根本無法放鬆。你可能服用了過量的興奮劑。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Stimulant Overdose"
msgid "You shake with the excess stimulation."
msgstr "過量的興奮劑使你不自主的發抖。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weak_antibiotic_visible"
msgid "Took Weak Antibiotic"
msgstr "服用弱效抗生素"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Weak Antibiotic"
msgid ""
"You consumed mild antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr "不久前你服用了溫和的抗生素以對抗感染。如果你沒有康復, 你可能需要服用另外一技, 但是要小心服藥過量。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "antibiotic_visible"
msgid "Took Antibiotic"
msgstr "服用抗生素"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Antibiotic"
msgid ""
"You consumed antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr "不久前你服用了抗生素以對抗感染。如果你沒有康復, 你可能需要服用另外一技, 但是要小心服藥過量。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "strong_antibiotic_visible"
msgid "Took Strong Antibiotic"
msgstr "服用强效抗生素"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Strong Antibiotic"
msgid ""
"You consumed prescription-grade antibiotic some time ago to fight off "
"infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr "不久前你服用了處方級的抗生素以對抗感染。如果你沒有康復, 你可能需要服用另外一技, 但是要小心服藥過量。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "weak_antibiotic"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "antibiotic"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "strong_antibiotic"
msgid "Antibiotics"
msgstr "抗生素"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "panacea"
msgid "Panacea"
msgstr "萬能藥"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Panacea"
msgid "You feel incredible!  You could take on the world!"
msgstr "你覺得不可思議！ 你可以掌握這個世界！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "tummy_tablet"
msgid "Soothed Stomach"
msgstr "服用了胃藥"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Soothed Stomach"
msgid "You are under the effects of a stomach soother."
msgstr "你正受到胃舒緩的影響。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "antifungal"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Antifungals"
msgid "Antifungals"
msgstr "服用了抗真菌藥"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Antifungals"
msgid "You are under the effects of an antifungal medicine or chemicals."
msgstr "你正受到抗真菌藥或者化學藥劑的影響。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "emp"
msgid "Discharge"
msgstr "能量流失"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Discharge"
msgid "You've been recently affected by an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr "你最近受到電磁脈衝的影響。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "supercharged"
msgid "Supercharged"
msgstr "超級充能"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Supercharged"
msgid "You've been struck by lightning, and feel… different."
msgstr "你被閃電擊中，而且感覺...不一樣了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_str_bad"
msgid "Muscle Vanishment"
msgstr "肌肉消失"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_str_bad"
msgid "Muscle Disappearance"
msgstr "肌肉萎縮"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Vanishment"
msgid "You feel as if your muscles are not quite there."
msgstr "你覺得肌肉好像根本不存在。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Disappearance"
msgid "You feel as if your muscles are not in your body."
msgstr "你覺得你的身體好像沒有肌肉了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Muscle Vanishment, Muscle Disappearance"
msgid "Your lack of strength stops you!"
msgstr "你缺乏力量而停了下來！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_dex_bad"
msgid "Weak Grasp"
msgstr "較弱抓握"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_dex_bad"
msgid "Inexistent Grasp"
msgstr "無法抓握"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Weak Grasp"
msgid "You seem to have problems touching things."
msgstr "你似乎無法碰觸到物體。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Inexistent Grasp"
msgid "You feel as if your hands just pass through matter."
msgstr "你感覺你的手似乎穿過了物體。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Weak Grasp, Inexistent Grasp"
msgid "Your attacks don't seem to touch your enemies!"
msgstr "你的攻擊似乎無法碰觸到你的敵人！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_per_bad"
msgid "Distorted Vision"
msgstr "扭曲視野"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_per_bad"
msgid "Otherworldly Vision"
msgstr "超現實視覺"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Distorted Vision"
msgid "You have problems distinguishing shapes and colors."
msgstr "你無法區分形狀和顏色。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Otherworldly Vision"
msgid "You seem to see slightly different realities every time you blink."
msgstr "你似乎在每次眨眼時看到的現實都略顯不同。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Distorted Vision, Otherworldly Vision"
msgid "You can't distinguish up from down!"
msgstr "你無法區分上下！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_int_bad"
msgid "Wandering Mind"
msgstr "遊蕩思維"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_int_bad"
msgid "Foreign Mind"
msgstr "陌生思維"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Wandering Mind"
msgid "Your thoughts seem to wander around on their own."
msgstr "你的思維似乎自己在周圍徘徊。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Foreign Mind"
msgid "Foreign thoughts seem to invade your mind."
msgstr "陌生的想法似乎入侵了你的腦內。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Wandering Mind, Foreign Mind"
msgid "You suddenly think you shouldn't do that!"
msgstr "你突然發覺你不應該這樣做！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_rejection"
msgid "World Rejection"
msgstr "世界排斥"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_rejection"
msgid "Dimensional Rejection"
msgstr "位面排斥"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "World Rejection"
msgid ""
"Faint sparks surround your every move, your body aches more with every "
"passing second."
msgstr "你的一舉一動都帶著微弱的火花，你的身體每過一秒都會更加疼痛。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Rejection"
msgid ""
"Sparks swarm around you, your body hurts and even the air seems to reject "
"your existence."
msgstr "火花在你周圍湧動，你的身體疼痛，甚至連空氣都似乎排斥著你的存在。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "World Rejection, Dimensional Rejection"
msgid ""
"The world is no longer trying to eject you from this plane of existence, for "
"now."
msgstr "世界不再試圖排斥你，至少暫時是如此。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World Rejection, Dimensional Rejection"
msgid "The rejection you feel from all around you has become a little easier to bear."
msgstr "你感覺到周圍的世界對你的排斥減弱了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_strengthened_reality"
msgid "World's Acceptance"
msgstr "維度接納"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_strengthened_reality"
msgid "World's Embracement"
msgstr "維度擁抱"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_strengthened_reality"
msgid "Dimensional Foothold"
msgstr "維度立足"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_strengthened_reality"
msgid "Dimensional Assimilation"
msgstr "維度同化"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "World's Acceptance"
msgid "The world around you seems calmer with your presence and actions."
msgstr "你周圍的世界似乎因為你的存在和行為而變得更加平靜。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "World's Embracement"
msgid ""
"The world around you seems to regard you as one of their own, your body is a "
"little easier to move now."
msgstr "周圍的世界開始將你視為它的一部分，你的身體活動感覺變得更自在了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Foothold"
msgid ""
"You can more easily exert your will around you, this dimension is, if not "
"welcoming you, obeying you a little.  You have managed to secure a foothold "
"in this reality."
msgstr "你意志的運用在周圍變得更容易了，即使這個維度不歡迎你，也多少向你表現出了服從。 你已成功在這個維度中初步立足。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid ""
"The very fabric of reality is blending in with your body, your will is "
"greatly easier to exert around you and your body is trying to permanently "
"assimilate with this world, it just needs a little push…"
msgstr "現實的結構正與你的身體融為一體，你的意志更容易操縱，你的身體正試圖永久地同化到這個世界，現在只需要一點助力…"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "Your eyes open to a whole new world!"
msgstr "眼前看到一片完全嶄新的世界！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "You start to feel rejected by the world again."
msgstr "你又開始感到在被這個世界排擠。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "Did the world just oppose you?"
msgstr "世界剛剛在排擠你嗎？"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "For a moment you felt a great hostility all around you."
msgstr "一瞬間，你感覺到周圍充滿了巨大的敵意。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "Did your enemy just vanish for a moment?"
msgstr "你的敵人是不是一下子就消失了？"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "You felt weird for a moment."
msgstr "你察覺到一陣異樣感。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "Was that a spark?"
msgstr "那是火花嗎？"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "Your grip suddenly failed you."
msgstr "你突然抓不住了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "Something just flashed in front of your eyes."
msgstr "有什麼東西剛從你眼前閃過。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "Why did the hit go that way?"
msgstr "為什麼這一下打到那裡去了？"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid "You could swear that you hit it!"
msgstr "你可以發誓你擊中它了！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid ""
"The world no longer embraces you as its child.  At least it still tolerates "
"your presence."
msgstr "世界不再像對待他的孩子般擁抱你。 但它至少還容忍你的存在。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid ""
"You have lost your foothold and can no longer command the world around you, "
"the world sees you now as only an unruly child."
msgstr "你失去了立足點，再也無法掌控周圍的世界，此世界如今只將你視為一個不守規矩的孩子。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
msgid ""
"You can no longer bend the world to your will.  You have failed in blending "
"in with this reality and have now only a foothold left."
msgstr "你再也無法讓世界屈服於你的意志。 你未能融入這個現實，如今僅餘一個立足之地。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
msgid "Stinking Air"
msgstr "惡臭空氣"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
msgid "Disorienting Air"
msgstr "迷惑空氣"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
msgid "Smothering Air"
msgstr "窒息氣體"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Stinking Air"
msgid "The air in here smells like vinegar and mold."
msgstr "這裡的空氣聞起來酸臭發霉。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Disorienting Air"
msgid ""
"The air in here smells like vinegar and mold.  It makes you feel soft-headed "
"and confused."
msgstr "這裡的空氣聞起來酸臭發霉。讓你感到暈眩和迷惑。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Smothering Air"
msgid ""
"The air in here smells like vinegar and mold.  It is closing in and "
"smothering you, making it impossible to think clearly."
msgstr "這裡的空氣聞起來酸臭發霉。它不斷靠近使你窒息，讓你無法清晰的思考。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Stinking Air, Disorienting Air, Smothering
#. Air"
msgid "The air in here smells like vinegar and mold, and hurts your lungs a bit."
msgstr "這裡的空氣聞起來酸臭發霉，讓你的肺部有點痛。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Stinking Air, Disorienting Air, Smothering
#. Air"
msgid "You feel groggy in this sweltering, foul air."
msgstr "在這悶熱惡臭的空氣中，你感到頭昏眼花。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "fetid_goop"
msgid "Covered in Fetid Goop"
msgstr "沾滿惡臭黏液"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Covered in Fetid Goop"
msgid ""
"The feeling of the goop slowly sliding on your skin revulses you and the "
"smell makes you gag."
msgstr "你感覺黏液在你皮膚上緩慢滑動，使你非常不適且想吐。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Covered in Fetid Goop"
msgid "You're disgusted by the goop."
msgstr "你被惡臭粘液噁心到了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "incorporeal"
msgid "Incorporeal"
msgstr "非實體"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Incorporeal"
msgid "You lack substance, as if you aren't quite fully here."
msgstr "你缺乏實體，就像你根本並不在此。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_1"
msgid "Lightly Weary"
msgstr "輕度疲憊"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Lightly Weary"
msgid ""
"You've been pretty active for a while; operating at the highest levels of "
"activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.25x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了一段時間；高度專注工作操作能力受損。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：1.25x"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_2"
msgid "Moderately Weary"
msgstr "中度疲憊"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderately Weary"
msgid ""
"You've been quite active for a while; operating at higher levels of activity "
"will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.67x, Active: 1.33x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了相當一段時間；較高度活動需求操作能力受損。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：1.67x，積極：1.33x"

#: data/json/effects.json data/json/ui/sidebar-legacy-labels-narrow.json
#: data/json/ui/zenfs/health.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_3"
#. ~ Label of UI widget "ln_weariness_desc"
#. ~ Label of UI widget "zenfs_weariness_num"
msgid "Weary"
msgstr "疲憊"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Weary"
msgid ""
"You've been very active for a while, and need to slow down for a bit.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 2.5x, Active: 2x, Brisk: 1.5x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了非常長一段時間，且需要慢下來休息。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：2.5x，積極：2x，活躍： 1.5x"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_4"
msgid "Very Weary"
msgstr "非常疲憊"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Very Weary"
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and need to slow down.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 5x, Active: 4x, Brisk: 3x, Moderate: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，最好慢下來。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：5x，積極：4x，活躍： 3x，中度：2x"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_5"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_6"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_7"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_8"
msgid "Extremely Weary"
msgstr "極度疲累"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can't take much more activity.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，已經不太能繼續工作。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：10x，積極：8x，活躍： 6x，中度：4x，輕度：2x"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and really need to get some rest.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，且真的需要一些休息。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：10x，積極：8x，活躍： 6x，中度：4x，輕度：2x"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while; it's time to stop.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，該是時候停下來了。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：10x，積極：8x，活躍： 6x，中度：4x，輕度：2x"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can no longer keep pushing.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"你已經工作了極長的一段時間，完全筋疲力竭不能做事了。\n"
"以下程度的活動將會有疲勞懲罰：\n"
"極度：10x，積極：8x，活躍： 6x，中度：4x，輕度：2x"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Full"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Full"
msgid "You feel quite full, and a bit sluggish."
msgstr "你覺得很飽，並有點呆滯。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Engorged"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Engorged"
msgid "Your stomach is full to bursting.  This was a mistake."
msgstr "你的胃已經滿到快要爆炸。這真是個錯誤。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weakened_inertia"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "strengthened_inertia"
msgid "Weakened Inertia"
msgstr "弱慣性"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
msgid "Your body moves strangely easily, as if it weighted less."
msgstr "你的身體移動起來異常容易，彷彿重量減輕了一般。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
msgid "Your inertia itself is damaged, but the outcome seems suspiciously beneficial."
msgstr "你自身的慣性平衡被破壞了，但結果似乎是有益的。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your inertia returns to normal."
msgstr "現實重新出現，而你的慣性也恢復正常了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
msgid "Your body is strangely difficult to move, as if it weighted more."
msgstr "你的身體出奇的難以移動，好像它的重量更大了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
msgid "Your inertia itself is damaged, but hopefully it's not permanent yet."
msgstr "你自身的慣性已經受損，但希望它還不是永久性的。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warped_viewpoint"
msgid "Warped Viewpoint"
msgstr "扭曲視點"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
msgid ""
"Space is warped around you such that you can see a wider arc and as if "
"everything was closer."
msgstr "空間在你的周圍扭曲，以至於你可以看到更寬的弧度，好像一切都離你更近了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
msgid ""
"Space around you is damaged but in the process your can see more and more "
"easily than before."
msgstr "你周圍的空間被破壞了，但在這個過程中，你可以比以前看的更多，更容易。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your perspective returns to normal."
msgstr "現實重現，你的視角恢復正常。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "narrow_viewpoint"
msgid "Narrowed Viewpoint"
msgstr "狹窄視點"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
msgid ""
"Space is warped around you such that you can see less and as if everything "
"was farther away."
msgstr "你周圍的空間被扭曲了，以至於你能看到的更少，而且好像一切都變遠了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
msgid "Space around you is damaged narrowing your perspective."
msgstr "你周圍的空間像鏡子一樣破碎，縮小了你的視野。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weakened_gravity"
msgid "Weakened Gravity"
msgstr "弱重力"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything near you seems to "
"weigh less."
msgstr "本地的時空出現了問題，你附近的一切都變輕了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
msgid "Space around you is damaged and everything near you seems to weigh less."
msgstr "周圍的空間碎成萬片，你附近的一切似乎不再那麼重了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your gravity returns to normal."
msgstr "現實重新顯現，你的重力恢復正常。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "strengthened_gravity"
msgid "Strengthened Gravity"
msgstr "強重力"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything near you seems to "
"weigh more."
msgstr "本地的時空出現了問題，你周圍的一切像是灌了鉛水一樣沉重。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
msgid "Space around you is damaged and everything near you seems to weigh more."
msgstr "周圍的空間碎成千萬，你附近的一切都更重了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "slowed_time"
msgid "Slowed Time"
msgstr "時間減緩"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Slowed Time"
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything around seems to move "
"faster than you."
msgstr "本地的時空出現了問題，你周圍的一切似乎都變得更快了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Slowed Time"
msgid "Time around you is damaged and everything near you seems to move faster."
msgstr "周圍的時間遭到了破壞，你附近的一切似乎都變得更快了。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Slowed Time"
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your time returns to normal."
msgstr "現實重新確定，你的時間恢復正常。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "nvg_green"
msgid "Night Vision Goggles (Green)"
msgstr "夜視鏡（綠色）"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Night Vision Goggles (Green)"
msgid "Your night vision goggles give a green tint to the world."
msgstr "你的夜視鏡給世界塗上了一層綠色的色調。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Glowing Gas"
msgid ""
"You've inhaled a lungful of glowing nether parasite spores.  Thankfully, they "
"don't seem adapted to the human physiology."
msgstr "你吸入了一肺發光的異界寄生孢子。 值得慶幸的是，它們似乎並不適應人類的生理學。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Glowing Gas"
msgid ""
"You inhale a lungful of the glowing gas, and you have an urge to violently "
"cough."
msgstr "你吸入了一肺發光的氣體，你有劇烈咳嗽的衝動。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Glowing Gas"
msgid "Your lungs burn from the glowing gas."
msgstr "你的肺被發光氣體嗆得很難受。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Glowing"
msgid "You are covered in glowing nether spores!"
msgstr "你全身沾滿了發光的異界孢子！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Glowing"
msgid "The glowing spores settle on you!"
msgstr "發光孢子掉落在你身上！"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "molting"
msgid "Molting"
msgstr "蛻殼"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Molting"
msgid "You feel a strong urge to hide somewhere safe."
msgstr "你有一種想躲在安全之處的強烈衝動。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Molting"
msgid "Your chitin plating itches against your body."
msgstr "你的幾丁質外殼開始摩擦著你的身體，讓你發癢。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "molting_imminent"
msgid "Imminent Molting"
msgstr "蛻殼在即"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Imminent Molting"
msgid "Seek shelter, you will be helpless when it begins."
msgstr "立刻尋找安全的地方，否則當它開始時，你將變得十分無助。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Imminent Molting"
msgid ""
"You can hardly move in your tightening exoskeleton, and you feel a strong "
"impulse to hunker down somewhere safe."
msgstr "你在緊縮的外骨骼幾乎無法移動，而且有一種想要鑽進安全角落的衝動。"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "VITRIFYING"
msgid "Among Glass"
msgstr "玻璃之中"

#: data/json/effects.json
