#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "social"
msgstr "社交"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "social"
msgid ""
"Your skill in speaking to other people.  Covers ability in boasting, "
"flattery, threats, persuasion, lies, bartering, and other facets of "
"interpersonal communication.  Works best in conjunction with a high level of "
"intelligence."
msgstr "你與其他人溝通的能力。包含了吹牛、奉承、威脅、說服、說謊、以物易物之類的溝通技巧。與智力一同配合能發揮更好效果。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You probably don't care about talking to other people much."
msgstr "你可能不太在意和其他人交谈"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You know how to communicate."
msgstr "你懂得如何沟通交流"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You're a good communicator."
msgstr "你是个善于沟通的人"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You know effective communication methods and sales tactics."
msgstr "你掌握了有效的沟通方法和销售技巧"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You're possibly a psychologist."
msgstr "你可能是个心理学家"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You're not used to talking to people."
msgstr "你不习惯与人交谈"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You rarely offend people by accident."
msgstr "你很少会无意中冒犯他人"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You can communicate your ideas well."
msgstr "你能够很好地传达自己的想法"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You can make friends easily and drive a hard bargain."
msgstr "你善于结交朋友且精于讨价还价"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You could sell ocean water to a hermit crab."
msgstr "你能把海水卖给寄居蟹"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "computers"
msgstr "電腦"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "computers"
msgid ""
"Your skill in accessing and manipulating computers.  Higher levels can allow "
"a user to navigate complex software systems and even bypass their security."
msgstr "你折騰電腦的技能。較高的等級能夠讓你掌握複雜的電腦系統甚至繞過它的安全防護。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You barely know the minimum of how to use a computer."
msgstr "你对电脑的使用仅停留在最基础的水平"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You knew how to surf the web back when that was possible."
msgstr "你曾掌握过在互联网还能使用时上网冲浪的技巧"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You're aware what a \"command prompt\" is."
msgstr "你知道什么是“命令提示符"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You know how to write code in a few scripting languages."
msgstr "你会用几种脚本语言编写代码"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You have an in–depth knowledge of code and how computers function."
msgstr "你对代码和计算机运作原理有着深入的理解"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You have probably read the entire SICP."
msgstr "你大概已经啃完了《计算机程序的构造和解释》全书"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid ""
"You can navigate to the \"phone\" app on your smartphone and likely \"hunt "
"and peck\" to type."
msgstr "你可以打开智能手机上的“电话”应用，大概能“一指禅”式地打字"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You can probably touch-type."
msgstr "你完全可以盲打"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You can debug a mod conflict for a video game."
msgstr "你可以调试一个视频游戏的模组冲突。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You can make your own mods for a video game."
msgstr "你可以为电子游戏制作自己的模组。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You can code your own video game."
msgstr "你可以自己编写电子游戏。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid ""
"You could get paid to bounty-hunt vulnerabilities in government databases, if "
"any government was still around."
msgstr "如果有人还在管理政府数据库，你或许能靠悬赏搜寻漏洞来赚钱。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "health care"
msgid ""
"Your skill in effecting medical treatment.  Higher levels allow better use of "
"medicines and items like bandages and first aid kits, and reduce the failure "
"and complication rates of medical procedures."
msgstr "這是影響醫療效率的技能。提高等級能夠把藥物和醫藥用品如繃帶、急救包發揮的更好， 並且減少手術的失敗和後遺症機率。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You barely have any idea how your own body works."
msgstr "你对自身躯体的运作几乎一无所知。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You're at least aware the blood should stay inside you."
msgstr "你至少知道血应该留在体内。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You have a decent idea of first aid."
msgstr "你对急救有不错的了解。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You're well-trained in first aid."
msgstr "你受过良好的急救训练。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You know a lot about how the body works and how to deal with many injuries."
msgstr "你对人体运作机制及多种伤势处理颇有心得。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You may know how to do simple surgeries."
msgstr "你可能掌握了一些简单的手术技巧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You might be able to put a bandaid on a minor cut without passing out."
msgstr "你或许能贴个创可贴处理小伤口而不至于晕过去。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You can do basic first-aid techniques without panicking too much."
msgstr "你可以冷静地实施基本的急救措施"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You're used to using a first-aid kit."
msgstr "你已经习惯使用急救箱了"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "Dealing with injuries is becoming routine for you."
msgstr "处理伤势对你来说已是家常便饭。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You could probably work in the ER."
msgstr "你完全可以胜任急诊室的工作"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You almost certainly can perform a simple surgery."
msgstr "你肯定可以进行简单的手术"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "mechanics"
msgstr "機械"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "mechanics"
msgid ""
"Your skill in engineering, maintaining and repairing vehicles and other "
"mechanical systems.  This skill covers the craft of items with complex parts, "
"and plays a role in the installation of bionic equipment."
msgstr "你在工程、維護、修理車輛與其他機械系統的技能。這個技能包含了能使用複雜零件製作物品, 並且在安裝生化插件時扮演重要的角色。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know that cars are supposed to be able to go forward."
msgstr "你知道汽车应该能往前开"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know how to check your oil."
msgstr "你知道怎么检查机油"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know the basic ideas of how a car works."
msgstr "你大概知道汽车的基本工作原理"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know how to fix most issues a car could have."
msgstr "你懂得如何修理汽车可能出现的大部分问题"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know how to build a car from scratch."
msgstr "你知道如何从零开始造一辆车"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You can change a wheel.  Potentially."
msgstr "你能换个轮胎。大概吧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You can do the basics of car maintenance."
msgstr "你可以进行基础的车辆维护。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You can fix most common issues your car could have."
msgstr "你可以解决你的车辆可能出现的大部分常见问题。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You can install an engine."
msgstr "你可以安装一个引擎。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You're a skilled enough mechanic you can install a second engine."
msgstr "你的机械技术足够精湛，可以安装第二台引擎。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "devices"
msgid ""
"Your skill in manipulating fine devices like security systems, traps, locks "
"and other precision tasks.  This skill does not affect the evasion of traps "
"that are triggered."
msgstr "你能夠擺弄像是保全系統、陷阱、鎖以及其他這類精密器械的技能。這項技能不能協助你避免觸發陷阱。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You know keys go in locks and traps go off if you step on them."
msgstr "你知道钥匙能开锁，踩到陷阱就会触发。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You know how to set basic traps."
msgstr "你懂得如何布置基础陷阱。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You know how to set most traps and how most locks function."
msgstr "你懂得如何布置大多数陷阱以及大多数锁具的工作原理。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You're a knowledgeable trapper and locksmith."
msgstr "你是个经验丰富的陷阱专家兼锁匠。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You have an intricate understanding of traps and locks."
msgstr "你对陷阱和锁具有着深刻的理解。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You shouldn't try disarming anything, you'll only hurt yourself."
msgstr "你不该尝试拆除任何东西，只会伤到自己。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You might be able to pick the simplest locks and can disarm basic traps."
msgstr "你或许能撬开最简单的锁，也能拆除基础的陷阱。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You can easily disarm most traps and pick some locks."
msgstr "你能轻松解除大多数陷阱并撬开一些锁。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "Lockpicking shouldn't be a problem for you."
msgstr "开锁对你来说应该不成问题。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid ""
"You can disarm a landmine.  It's still extremely unsafe.  But you can.  "
"Probably."
msgstr "你可以拆除地雷。这仍然极度危险。但你能做到。大概吧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "vehicles"
msgstr "載具"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "vehicles"
msgid ""
"Your skill in operating and steering a vehicle in motion, from cars and boats "
"to helicopters and hot air balloons.  A higher level allows greater control "
"over vehicles at higher speeds, and reduces the penalty of shooting while "
"driving."
msgstr "你控制載具的技巧，從車子到船、直升機和熱氣球。較高的等級能在高速時對車輛控制得更好， 並且減少開車射擊的懲罰。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know what a car looks like."
msgstr "你知道汽车长什么样。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know the basics of driving a car."
msgstr "你掌握了驾驶汽车的基本技巧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know how to drive a car."
msgstr "你会开车。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You probably know how to drive larger vehicles like a truck or bus."
msgstr "你可能已经掌握了驾驶卡车或公交车等大型车辆的技巧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know how to drive even in difficult conditions."
msgstr "你懂得如何在恶劣条件下驾驶车辆。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know tricks even racecar drivers use."
msgstr "你掌握着连赛车手都用的技巧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You don't even have a driver's license."
msgstr "你连驾照都没有。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You were good enough to get a driver's license."
msgstr "你考驾照的水平还是够格的。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You've driven a car enough for it to become routine."
msgstr "你已经把开车练到驾轻就熟的地步了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You're better than most drivers on the road.  Well, not that any are left."
msgstr "你比路上大多数司机都强。好吧，虽然现在也没剩几个了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You can keep control of most vehicles even in awkward conditions."
msgstr "即使在恶劣条件下，你也能掌控大多数载具的驾驶。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You could compete on a race track."
msgstr "你可以在赛道上竞速。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "athletics"
msgstr "體育"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "athletics"
msgid ""
"Your athletic ability, including swimming endurance and ability to swim with "
"weight.  Athletic skill also improves your overall cardio fitness and stamina."
msgstr "你的體育能力，包含游泳耐力和負重游泳能力。體育技能還能提高你的心肺功能和體力。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You don't even let people tell you that you should be more active."
msgstr "你甚至不让别人告诉你应该更活跃些。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're at least aware exercise is good and that you should do it more."
msgstr "你至少知道锻炼有益，而且应该多运动。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You know how to exercise."
msgstr "你知道如何锻炼身体。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You know proper form and stretches."
msgstr "你懂得正确的姿势和拉伸动作。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You could be a personal trainer."
msgstr "你可以成为一名私人教练。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're a couch potato."
msgstr "你是个沙发土豆。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You might be able to doggy paddle."
msgstr "你大概能狗刨几下。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're reasonably active and a decent swimmer."
msgstr "你相当活跃，游泳水平也不错。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're active and a good swimmer."
msgstr "你身手敏捷，擅长游泳。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're very active and a great swimmer."
msgstr "你非常活跃，是个游泳好手。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You could swim across the English Channel."
msgstr "你可以横渡英吉利海峡。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "fabrication"
msgstr "製作"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"Your skill in working with raw materials and shaping them into useful "
"objects.  This skill plays an important role in the crafting of many objects."
msgstr "你把一系列物質塑造成有用物品的技能。這個技能在製作物品上是一個非常重要的角色。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You barely know which side of the hammer you should hold."
msgstr "你连锤子该握哪头都搞不清楚。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You know how to hold a hammer."
msgstr "你知道怎么握锤子。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"You're a decent DIYer and know how to craft a variety of wooden items or very "
"basic metalworking."
msgstr "你是个不错的 DIY 爱好者，懂得制作各种木制品或进行最基础的金属加工。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You're a fairly skilled DIYer and know how to craft a variety of metal items."
msgstr "你是个相当熟练的 DIY 达人，懂得如何打造各种金属制品。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"You're an exceptionally skilled DIYer and know how to smith basic tools and "
"weapons."
msgstr "你是一位技艺超群的 DIY 达人，精通锻造基础工具与武器的技艺。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You know the ins and outs of making almost anything you can think of."
msgstr "你精通制造几乎所有能想到的物品。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You can only craft the most basic things."
msgstr "你只能制作最基础的物品。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You can craft a few basic things."
msgstr "你可以制作一些基础物品。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You can craft a variety of useful stuff without much issue."
msgstr "你可以轻松制作出各种实用的物品。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"You can easily craft useful, if junky weapons and armor, but nothing too "
"complex."
msgstr "你可以轻松制作出实用但粗糙的武器和护甲，不过复杂的东西就别想了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You can craft even complex objects without fail."
msgstr "你能毫无差错地制作出复杂的物品。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"You have created many things with your hands and you should have little issue "
"crafting anything."
msgstr "你已亲手创造了许多物品，制作任何东西对你来说都不在话下。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "food handling"
msgid ""
"Your skill in combining food ingredients to make other, tastier food items.  "
"Also includes food preservation and safety, brewing, butchery, and more."
msgstr "你結合食材成為美味食物的技能。也包括食品保存、飲食安全、釀造、屠宰以及其他。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You probably lived on takeout."
msgstr "你大概靠外卖过活。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You know the basics of how not to burn your house down."
msgstr "你知道如何避免烧毁房子的基本常识。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You know how to cook reasonably."
msgstr "你懂得如何像模像样地烹饪。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You know how to cook a wide variety of food."
msgstr "你精通烹饪各式各样的食物。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You know how to cook the most advanced and complex dishes."
msgstr "你精通烹饪最尖端复杂的菜肴。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You'd burn a PB&J, somehow."
msgstr "你连花生酱果酱三明治都能烤糊，真是绝了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You can boil an egg."
msgstr "你可以煮个鸡蛋。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You can cook a variety of recipes."
msgstr "你可以烹饪多种多样的食谱。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You can cook most recipes with ease."
msgstr "你可以轻松烹饪大多数食谱"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You'd win a neighborhood bake-off."
msgstr "你在社区烘焙大赛中能拔得头筹"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You'd be an excellent chef, too bad all the zombies want to eat is you."
msgstr "你会是个很棒的厨师，可惜丧尸们只想品尝你。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "tailoring"
msgid ""
"Your skill in the craft and repair of clothing, bags, blankets and other "
"textiles.  Affects knitting, sewing, stitching, weaving, and nearly anything "
"else involving a needle and thread."
msgstr "你製作及修理衣物、包包、毯子以及其他編織物的能力。影響了編織, 縫紉、和涉及針和線的任何工作。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know nothing about tailoring."
msgstr "你对缝纫一窍不通。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know the very basics of how to sew a patch over a small hole."
msgstr "你知道如何在小破洞上缝补丁的基础知识。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know how to sew."
msgstr "你知道怎么缝纫。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know how to sew well."
msgstr "你很会缝纫。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know how to sew with non-standard materials."
msgstr "你擅长用特殊材料缝纫。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You're a very knowledgeable tailor."
msgstr "你是个知识渊博的裁缝。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You can put a shirt on without ripping it, at least."
msgstr "你至少能把衬衫穿上不扯破。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You've held a sewing needle once or twice."
msgstr "你曾经拿过一两次缝纫针"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You can repair or sew simple clothing."
msgstr "你可以缝制或修补一些简单的衣物。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You can repair or sew more complex clothing."
msgstr "你能够缝制或修补更为复杂的衣物。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You're skilled at working with non-standard materials like Kevlar."
msgstr "你擅长使用像凯夫拉这样的特殊材料进行缝纫。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You can sew anything you could dream of."
msgstr "你可以缝制任何你能想象到的东西。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "survival"
msgstr "生存"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "survival"
msgid ""
"Your skill in surviving the wilderness, and in crafting various basic "
"survival items.  This also covers your ability to skin and butcher animals "
"for meat and hides."
msgstr "你在野外生存的技巧, 並且能製作許多基本生存物品。這個技能同時包含了屠宰動物以取得肉與皮的能力。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You're aware the outdoors is gross."
msgstr "你知道户外环境是令人不快的。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You know the very basics of camping."
msgstr "你了解露营的基本知识。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You know how to craft a fire drill to start fires without lighters."
msgstr "你具备使用钻木取火装置替代打火机进行生火的能力。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You probably memorized most of the Scouting handbook."
msgstr "你可能已熟记童子军手册中的大部分内容。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You're exceptionally knowledgeable in all things outdoorsy."
msgstr "你在户外相关领域具备异常丰富的知识储备。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You need to touch grass."
msgstr "你需要接触自然环境以调整身心状态。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You've touched grass."
msgstr "你与自然有了一定的接触。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You might've been a cub scout as a kid."
msgstr "你小时候可能是个童子军。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You're a skilled scout and can pitch a tent with ease."
msgstr "你是个熟练的侦察员，可以很容易地搭起帐篷。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You could likely be dropped into a forest with nothing and thrive."
msgstr "你可能可以空手进入一片森林里顽强求生。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "electronics"
msgstr "電子"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "electronics"
msgid ""
"Your skill in dealing with electrical systems, used in the craft and repair "
"of objects with electrical components.  This skill is an important part of "
"installing and managing bionic implants."
msgstr "你處理電子系統的技能。可用於製作物品以及修理電子元件。這個技能在安裝及管理生化插件時很重要。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid ""
"You don't know the first thing about how electricity works.  It might as well "
"be magic to you."
msgstr "你根本不知道电是如何工作的。这对你来说可能是魔法。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You have a very rudimentary knowledge on how electricity works."
msgstr "你对电是如何工作的有一个非常基础的了解。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You have some idea of how electricity works."
msgstr "你知道电是怎么工作的。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid ""
"You have a good understanding of how electricity works and were possibly an "
"electrician."
msgstr "你对电的运作原理有很好的了解，而且很可能曾经从事过电工的工作。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You have an intricate understanding of electronics and how they function."
msgstr "你对电子学及其运作原理有着深入透彻的理解。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You can turn a light switch on or off."
msgstr "你能够操作电灯开关进行开启或关闭。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You can craft extremely basic electronics like flashlights."
msgstr "你能够制作如手电筒等非常基础的电子设备。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid ""
"You can craft some electrical gadgets and set up an at-home power grid "
"without major fire hazards."
msgstr "你具备组装简易电子装置并搭建家用电力系统的技术能力，且能有效规避重大火灾风险。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You can craft a variety of useful electronics."
msgstr "你具备制作多种实用电子设备的技术能力。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You can craft any electrical device you can think of."
msgstr "你能够制作任何你能想象到的电子设备。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "archery"
msgid ""
"Your skill in using bow weapons, from hand-carved self bows to complex "
"compound bows.  Quiet and effective, they require strength of body and sight "
"to wield, and are not terribly accurate over a long distance."
msgstr "使用弓類武器的技巧, 包含手工雕琢的弓到結構複雜的複合弓。它們安靜而有效, 但需要足夠的力量與視力來使用, 並且在長距離上不是非常的準確。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You know what a bow looks like."
msgstr "你知道弓是什么样子。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You know how to nock an arrow."
msgstr "你知道怎么射箭"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You know the basics of archery."
msgstr "你知道射箭的基础知识。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You're knowledgeable about archery."
msgstr "你对射箭的知识很丰富。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You have a wealth of knowledge about archery."
msgstr "你有大量关于射箭的知识"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You're lucky if the arrow doesn't spin sideways."
msgstr "你应该幸运你的箭没有射偏。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You can usually get the arrow to fly straight-ish."
msgstr "你通常可以让箭笔直射出。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You can usually hit an archery target."
msgstr "你通常可以射中箭靶。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You're a fairly skilled archer."
msgstr "你相当于一个经验老道的射手了"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You're a skilled archer and might've done well in some competitions."
msgstr "你是一个经验丰富的射手，并可能在某些赛事中得到好成绩。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You'd've been a terror at the Battle of Agincourt."
msgstr "你在阿金库尔战役中是个可怕的存在。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid ""
"Your overall skill in using bows and firearms.  With higher levels, this "
"general experience increases accuracy with any bows or firearms, but is "
"secondary to practice with the type of ranged weapon in question."
msgstr "你使用槍械與弓箭的整體技能。提高此技能等級能夠提昇任何槍械與弓箭的命中率, 但是相比起操作特定遠程武器的技巧影響較為次要。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You don't even know how to aim a gun."
msgstr "你甚至不知道如何用枪瞄准。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You know where the iron sights on a gun are."
msgstr "你知道了枪上的准星在哪。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You know the basics of aiming."
msgstr "你知道了瞄准的基础知识。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You know how to aim most ranged weapons fairly well."
msgstr "你知道如何很好地用大多数远程武器瞄准。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid ""
"You know how to aim even at long distances taking into account bullet drop "
"and wind speed."
msgstr "考虑到子弹下落和风速，你知道如何瞄准远距离目标。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid ""
"Your hands shake, your aim is shit, and you close your eyes before each shot. "
" You could aim at the ground and somehow miss."
msgstr "你的手在颤抖，你的目标很糟糕，每次射击前你都闭上眼睛。你可以瞄准目标区域，却不知怎么地错过了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "Holding a gun steady is difficult for you."
msgstr "你很难稳定的持枪。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You've been to the range a few times and can usually hit the target."
msgstr "你去过靶场几次，通常能击中目标。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "Your aim is pretty good even at medium ranges."
msgstr "即使在中射程下你的瞄准也相当不错。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You have good aim even at fairly long ranges."
msgstr "你在相当远的距离下能够保持好的准头。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You're a veritable sniper."
msgstr "你是个名副其实的狙击手。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "launchers"
msgid ""
"Your skill in using heavy weapons like rocket, grenade or missile launchers.  "
"These weapons have a variety of applications and may carry immense "
"destructive power, but they are cumbersome and hard to manage."
msgstr "你使用各式重型武器的技巧, 例如火箭, 榴彈, 飛彈發射器。這些武器能有各式各樣的運用, 並且有著毀滅性的力量, 但是很笨重並且難以操作。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You know nothing about launchers, cannons, or anything similar."
msgstr "你对发射器、大炮或类似的东西一无所知。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You've at least read about cannons or flamethrowers."
msgstr "你至少读过关于大炮或火焰喷射器的书。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You probably built a spud launcher at some point."
msgstr "你可能在某个时候建造过一个土豆发射器。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You're skilled with various types of launchers."
msgstr "你对多种类型的发射器有经验。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You're a rare expert in knowledge about various types of launchers."
msgstr "你对多种类型的发射器知识几乎是专家。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "Rather understandably, you have never fired any kind of launcher before."
msgstr "可以理解的是，你以前从未发射过任何类型的发射器。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You may have fired a spud cannon at some point."
msgstr "你可能在某个时候发射过一个土豆大炮。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You have experience firing launchers or flamethrowers, somehow."
msgstr "不管怎么讲，你有操纵发射器或火焰喷射器的经验。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid ""
"Your growing level of experience with rocket launchers, flamethrowers, or "
"cannons is worrying."
msgstr "你对火箭发射器、火焰喷射器或大炮的经验越来越丰富，这令人担忧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid ""
"You just want to watch the world burn, and you're really damn good at making "
"sure it will."
msgstr "你只想看着世界燃烧，你真的很擅长让它燃烧这件事。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "handguns"
msgstr "手槍"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "handguns"
msgid ""
"Handguns have poor accuracy compared to rifles, but are usually quick to fire "
"and reload faster than other guns.  They are very effective at close "
"quarters, though unsuited for long range engagement."
msgstr "手槍相比步槍來說命中率極低, 但是有著比其他槍械射擊快與裝填快的優點。很適合近距離戰鬥, 不適合遠距交戰。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You can't tell a revolver from a semiautomatic."
msgstr "你分不清左轮手枪和半自动手枪。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You can tell a revolver from a semiautomatic."
msgstr "你可以分清左轮手枪和半自动手枪。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You know the basics of handguns and their usage."
msgstr "你知道基础的手枪和他们的使用方式。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You're knowledgeable about handguns and their uses."
msgstr "你对手枪和他们的使用方式有很多经验。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid ""
"You know every trick and technique for firing handguns accurately and "
"effectively."
msgstr "你知道准确有效地发射手枪的每一个技巧和技术。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "Hopefully it won't fly out of your hands when you fire one."
msgstr "希望在你击发时这玩意不会从你手中飞走。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "Handguns feel awkward to use for you."
msgstr "手枪对你来说使用起来很困难。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You're comfortable with the usage of handguns."
msgstr "你用起手枪来很顺手。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You're quite skilled and accurate with handguns."
msgstr "你对于精准使用手枪经验丰富。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You could win a duel at high noon."
msgstr "你可以在正午十分赢得决斗。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid ""
"You're a deadeye with pistols and can likely hit someone at 20 yards from the "
"hip with ease."
msgstr "你是一个拿着手枪的神枪手，很可能会轻松地击中距离你的髋部20码的人。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "rifles"
msgid ""
"Classic rifles have terrific range and accuracy compared to other firearms, "
"but may be slow to fire and reload, and can prove difficult to use in close "
"combat.  Short-barreled rifles and carbines are more like SMGs and perform "
"well in close combat."
msgstr "与其他枪械相比，传统步枪射程远、精度高，但射击和装填速度慢，在近距离作战中难以使用。 短管步枪和卡宾枪更像 一种冲锋枪，在近距离作战中表现出色。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "Rifles are complicated weaponry and you don't know anything about them."
msgstr "步枪是种复杂的武器，而你对此一窍不通。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You at least have rudimentary knowledge of rifles."
msgstr "你至少掌握了步枪的基础知识。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You can maintain your average standard-issue rifle."
msgstr "你能进行普通制式步枪的日常维护。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You have an intricate knowledge of all the parts of a rifle and their use."
msgstr "你对步枪的各个组成部分及其功能有深入了解。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid ""
"You can probably disassemble and reassemble your rifle in the dark with your "
"hands tied together."
msgstr "即使在黑暗或双手受限的情况下，你也能完成步枪的拆解与组装。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You've never fired a rifle before."
msgstr "你以前从未开过枪。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You can at least shoulder a rifle."
msgstr "你至少能做到正确抵肩持枪。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You're at least as competent as the average soldier straight out of boot camp."
msgstr "你至少具备刚结束新兵训练的普通士兵的合格水准。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "Rifles feel familiar in your hands."
msgstr "步枪在你手中显得得心应手。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You're a genuinely good shot."
msgstr "你的枪法确实了得。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You could be a career sniper."
msgstr "你完全有资格成为一名职业狙击手。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "shotguns"
msgid ""
"Shotguns are easy to shoot and can inflict massive damage, but their "
"effectiveness and accuracy decline rapidly with range.  Slugs can be loaded "
"into shotguns to provide greater range, though they are somewhat inaccurate."
msgstr "霰彈槍是操作簡單又能造成大量傷害的槍械, 但是其有效性與準確度隨著距離大大下降。可裝填單顆金屬彈頭來增加有效距離, 但準確度不是太好。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "\"Shot-guns?\"  But all guns are shot?"
msgstr "“霰弹枪？”但所有枪不都是用来“射击”的吗?"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You know what a shotgun is."
msgstr "你了解霰弹枪的基本构造与功能。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid ""
"You know enough about shotguns to get mad about unrealistic pellet spread in "
"video games."
msgstr "你对霰弹枪的了解已经多到会为游戏里失真的弹丸散布较真了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You're knowledgeable about the handling and maintenance of shotguns."
msgstr "你很了解对于霰弹枪的操作和维护。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You couldn't hit the broad side of a barn."
msgstr "你连谷仓的宽边都打不到。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You can usually hit a clay pigeon if it's just sitting there."
msgstr "你通常可以打中一只泥鸽，如果它只是不动的站在那。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You probably have experience skeet shooting."
msgstr "你大概有着飞靶射击的经验。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You're a very skilled skeet shooter."
msgstr "你是一个熟练的飞靶射击手。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You could snipe with most shotguns if you weren't limited by the spread."
msgstr "你可以用大多数霰弹枪狙击，如果你不受范围限制的话。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "submachine guns"
msgstr "衝鋒槍"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid ""
"Comprised of an automatic rifle carbine designed to fire a pistol cartridge, "
"submachine guns can reload and fire quickly, sometimes in bursts, but they "
"are relatively inaccurate and may be prone to mechanical failures."
msgstr "泛指設計成發射手槍彈藥的自動步槍卡賓槍。應對突發狀況時，衝鋒槍可以快速重新裝填和射擊，但是相對的命中率就不高，而且可能容易遇到機械故障。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You don't know the first thing about submachine guns."
msgstr "你对冲锋枪一无所知。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You know very little about SMGs."
msgstr "你对冲锋枪知之甚少。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You know a decent bit about firing SMGs accurately."
msgstr "你知道如何准确的用冲锋枪射击。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You're knowledgeable about the tactics used with SMGs."
msgstr "你对冲锋枪的战术很了解。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You've never held an SMG before."
msgstr "你从来没拿起过冲锋枪。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You have minimal experience with SMGs."
msgstr "你对使用冲锋枪没什么经验。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You have some experience with SMGs."
msgstr "你有使用冲锋枪的经验。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You're fairly experienced with SMGs."
msgstr "你对冲锋枪的操作相当经验。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You're very experienced with SMGs."
msgstr "你对使用冲锋枪很有经验。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You're a CQB expert with SMGs."
msgstr "你是使用冲锋枪的CQB专家。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"Your skill in throwing objects over a distance.  Skill increases accuracy, "
"and at higher levels, the range of a throw."
msgstr "你投擲物品的技巧。增加技能會提升命中率, 較高的等級還能提昇距離。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You've managed to avoid gym class your whole life and barely know how to "
"throw a rock.  Impressive."
msgstr "你这辈子都没上过体育课还不知道怎么扔石头。让人印象深刻。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You know how to throw things.  Which is good, since that's an inherent skill "
"of being human."
msgstr "你知道怎么扔东西。这很好，因为这是人类与生俱来的技能。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You know how to throw stuff with reasonable accuracy."
msgstr "你知道怎么把东西扔得很准。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You know proper form and methods for throwing accurately."
msgstr "你知道正确的投掷方式和方法。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You could teach sports.  The ones that involve throwing stuff anyway."
msgstr "你可以教体育。反正就是要扔东西的那种。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You're lucky if you don't drop the thing you're throwing at your feet.  Be "
"extra careful with grenades."
msgstr "如果你扔到脚上的东西没有掉到地上，你就很幸运了。要特别小心手榴弹。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You can usually throw a rock at a person if they're not too far away, or "
"moving."
msgstr "如果一个人离你不远，或者正在移动，你通常可以准确的向他扔石头。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You can accurately throw a dodgeball at someone."
msgstr "你可以准确地向某人投掷躲避球。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You can pitch a baseball across home plate into the strike zone reliably."
msgstr "你可以可靠地把棒球投过本垒板进入好球区。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You've got a good fastball."
msgstr "你的快球投得不错。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You could've become a professional pitcher.  At least beaning zombies doesn't "
"give them a free walk to first base."
msgstr "你本可以成为职业棒球投手的，不过至少爆僵尸头时不用白送它们上一垒。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"Your skill and finesse in personal combat, both with and without a weapon.  "
"Higher levels can significantly increase the accuracy and effectiveness of "
"your physical attacks."
msgstr "你在個人戰鬥上的技巧, 不論是徒手或是拿著武器。提高等級能夠大幅增加命中率以及你物理攻擊的有效程度。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"You have no idea how to do anything other than vaguely swing in their "
"direction."
msgstr "除了略显迟疑地把手里的武器朝它们挥砍过去，你根本不知道该怎么做。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "You can theoretically fight."
msgstr "理论上你可以战斗。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"You've learned enough to avoid overswinging and falling off balance if you "
"miss."
msgstr "你已经学得足够多了，如果你失手了，可以避免过度摇摆和失去平衡。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "Whether self-taught or trained, you've learned quite a lot about fighting."
msgstr "无论是自学还是训练，你都学到了很多关于打斗的知识。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "You could teach a platoon of medieval soldiers how to fight in a war."
msgstr "你可以教一排中世纪的士兵如何在战争中作战。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "Any fighting you do is mostly just panicked flailing."
msgstr "你做的任何打斗都只是惊慌失措的乱打。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "Your panicked flailing has become somewhat more determined flailing."
msgstr "你惊慌失措的乱挥变成了更坚定的乱挥。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "Your fighting now actually resembles proper form and is far less clumsy."
msgstr "你现在的打斗方式很正常，也不那么笨拙了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "You're a proper fighter and can use most techniques."
msgstr "你已是一名合格的战士了，并且掌握了大多数的战斗技巧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"You're a skilled man-at-arms that wouldn't look out of place fighting on a "
"medieval battlefield."
msgstr "你是一位技艺娴熟的武士，就算把你放在中世纪的战场中，你也能临危不惧，迅速融入。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"In a world with guns you've dedicated yourself to mastering melee combat, and "
"you're damn good at it too."
msgstr "在一个枪械盛行的世界里，你却专注于成为一名近战大师，并且你现在确实技艺非凡。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "bashing weapons"
msgstr "鈍擊武器"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with blunt weaponry, from rocks and sticks to baseball "
"bats and the butts of rifles.  Skill increases damage, and higher levels will "
"improve the accuracy of an attack."
msgstr "你使用鈍器戰鬥的技巧, 從石頭到棒球棒或是槍托都是。提高技能可以增加傷害, 而更高的等級能夠增加命中率。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You don't even know how to swing a baseball bat properly."
msgstr "你甚至都不知道如何正确地挥动棒球棍。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You at least know how to swing a baseball bat."
msgstr "你至少知道怎么挥舞棒球棒。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You have a decent idea how to maneuver blunt weapons without falling off "
"balance."
msgstr "你大致知道如何在保持自身平衡的情况下，挥舞钝器进行战斗，"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You've learned how to leverage blunt weapons best to get powerful, accurate "
"hits."
msgstr "你已经学会了如何最高效的使用钝器，能在战斗中发出强力且精准的攻击。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You could teach a class on fighting with maces and hammers."
msgstr "你的钝击技巧娴熟到甚至可以开设一门关于使用战锤和钉头锤的战斗课程。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You've somehow gone through life without even swinging a stick for fun.  How "
"awful."
msgstr "你活到现在，居然在玩耍时连根木棍都没挥过，真是糟透了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You can swing a baseball bat."
msgstr "你知道如何正确的挥舞棒球棍。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You can reliably hit a pitch while at bat."
msgstr "你能稳定的用球棒击中投来的球。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You're a decently skilled batter and good at using all sorts of bludgeons, "
"improvised or otherwise."
msgstr "你是个训练有素的击球手，擅长使用各种钝器，无论是自制的棍棒还是专业的武器。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You can hit zombies over the head even with random junk and still make it "
"look good."
msgstr "就算用随手捡到的垃圾，你也能轻松地给丧尸开瓢，甚至还能打得优雅而不失风采。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You can swing a heavy, poorly-weighted sledgehammer with pinpoint accuracy "
"even against a moving target."
msgstr "你能挥舞一把沉重且平衡差的长柄大锤精确命中目标，即使是面对移动的目标也不成问题。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "cutting weapons"
msgstr "砍劈武器"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with weaponry designed to cut, hack and slash an "
"opponent.  Lower levels of skill increase accuracy and damage, while higher "
"levels will help to bypass heavy armor and thick hides."
msgstr "使用設計來切割、劈砍、斬擊的武器與對手戰鬥的技巧。技能等級較低時增加命中率與傷害, 技能等級較高時則有助於繞過厚重的裝甲與厚實的表皮。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You don't even know how to play-swordfight."
msgstr "你甚至不知道如何进行剑术对决。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You at least know which part of the sword you're supposed to hold."
msgstr "至少，你知道应该握住剑的哪一部分。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You've learned how to cut properly with draw cuts and similar techniques."
msgstr "你已经学会了如何正确地进行拔刀斩以及类似的斩击技巧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You've learned how to fight with swords effectively."
msgstr "你已经学会了如何有效地使用剑进行战斗。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You've studied the blade."
msgstr "你已经研习过剑术了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You'd probably hit with the flat of the blade more than the edge."
msgstr "如果在条件允许的情况下，你更多地会用剑身而不是剑刃进行攻击。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You can usually get a decent cut when chopping."
msgstr "通常来说你能在劈砍时造成不错的斩击伤害。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You can reliably keep good edge alignment when slicing."
msgstr "你在进行劈砍时，总能造成平整的，良好的切口。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You're a fairly skilled swordsman."
msgstr "你已经是一名技艺娴熟的剑士了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "With your skill, in another life you could duel a samurai."
msgstr "凭借你的高超技艺，另一世的你甚至可以与武士进行决斗。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"Your ability to dodge an oncoming threat, be it an enemy's attack, a "
"triggered trap, or a falling rock.  This skill is also used in attempts to "
"fall gracefully, and for other acrobatic feats.  The first number shown "
"includes modifiers, and the second does not."
msgstr ""
"你躲避迎面而來的威脅的能力，無論是敵人的攻擊、觸發的陷阱、還是落石。此技能也用於嘗試優雅地跌倒，以及其他雜技專長。顯示的第一個數字是已經計算過所有修正加權後"
"的，第二個數字則未經計算。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"For most people, jumping out of the way of danger is instinct, and you barely "
"have that."
msgstr "对于大多数人来说，躲避危险是本能，而你的闪避本能基本没有。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You might know how to dodge."
msgstr "你可能知道如何闪避"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"You've learned how to minimize your movement with dodging to avoid "
"overexerting yourself."
msgstr "你已经学会了通过细微的动作来进行闪避，以免在闪避中过度消耗你的体力。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"You have a good grasp on various dodging techniques and ways to avoid being "
"grabbed."
msgstr "你很好的掌握了各种闪避技巧，也知道那些避免被人抓住的方法。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"You know how to do a dodge, duck, dip, dive, and how to win every game of "
"dodgeball."
msgstr "你知道如何闪避、低头、侧身、俯身，并且知道如何用你的闪避技巧赢得每一场躲避球比赛。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "Your reflexes are dull and you have two left feet.  Hope you don't trip."
msgstr "你的反应迟钝，行动笨拙。希望你不会摔倒。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You can at least dodge without tripping over your own feet."
msgstr "至少你在躲避攻击时不会绊倒自己。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You have decent reflexes and can dodge a dodgeball."
msgstr "你的反应能力还不错，能够躲避飞来的躲避球。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You're fairly squirrely, most enemies will have some difficulty hitting you."
msgstr "你相当灵活，大多数敌人很难击中你。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You have exceptional reflexes and are very slippery and hard to pin down."
msgstr "你非常灵活，反应能力也很出色，因此你难以被抓住。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "piercing weapons"
msgstr "穿刺武器"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with knives, spears and other such stabbing "
"implements.  Skill increases attack accuracy as well as the chance of "
"inflicting a deadly and critical blow."
msgstr "你使用刀, 矛之類刺擊武器的技巧。提高等級能夠增加命中率以及致命爆擊的機會。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You might not even be aware you're supposed to stab with a spear."
msgstr "你可能甚至不知道怎么用长矛进行刺击。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You understand the gist of thrusting weapons."
msgstr "你了解刺击武器的基本使用方法。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You know some of the techniques involved with thrusting weapons."
msgstr "你知道一些使用刺击武器的技巧。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You're well-learned in fencing or spearmanship."
msgstr "你在击剑或是枪术方面有很高的造诣。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You could open a fencing school or start your own spear lessons."
msgstr "你完全有能力开设一所击剑学校，或是进行枪术课程的教学。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You have a hard time spearing steak with a fork."
msgstr "就算用叉子叉牛排，你也常常感到非常困难。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "Stabbing is an awkward motion for you."
msgstr "对你来说，刺击是一种笨拙的动作。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You're a decent fencer or spearman."
msgstr "你是一位像样的击剑家或长矛手。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You're a skilled fencer or spearman."
msgstr "你是一位技艺娴熟的击剑家或长矛手"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid ""
"You're a commando with a knife, a fencing expert, and an accomplished "
"spearman."
msgstr "你就像个手持军匕的突击队员、一位剑术家，也是一名技艺高超的长矛手。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "unarmed combat"
msgstr "徒手戰鬥"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid ""
"Your skill in hand-to-hand fighting.  For the unskilled, it's a good way to "
"get hurt, but those with enough practice can perform special blows and "
"techniques to quickly dispatch enemies."
msgstr "你使用徒手戰鬥的技巧。若是此技能不足很容易受傷, 若是提昇後能夠使出特殊攻擊快速的癱瘓敵人。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You've never had any interest in learning to fight."
msgstr "你对空手搏斗从来没有一丁点儿兴趣。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You can theoretically throw a punch."
msgstr "理论上，你知道该怎么出拳。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You know how to throw down."
msgstr "你知道该怎么徒手打架。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You really know how to throw down."
msgstr "你完全知道怎么动手打人，理论上来说，你是一位街头斗殴大师。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You could probably teach your own martial art."
msgstr "你大概都能自创一套武术流派了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "Punching someone is more likely to hurt you than them."
msgstr "你的拳脚功夫惊为天人，甚至能做到杀敌八百，自损一千。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You can throw a punch.  Not well, but you can throw one."
msgstr "尽管不太娴熟，但你还是略懂一些拳脚的，放倒一个人应该问题不大。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You're enough of a scrapper to fight with your fists if you have to."
msgstr "如果必须动手才能解决问题的话，你也能用双拳打一架。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You could win most bar fights."
msgstr "你能赢下大多数的酒吧斗殴。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You'd have your black belt if any dojos were still open."
msgstr "要是还有道馆开着，恐怕你现在早就拿到黑带了。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You could have multiple black belts or box in the major leagues."
msgstr "你的肉搏水平完全可以拿下好几条黑带，甚至去职业拳击赛场上搏一搏。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "applied science"
msgstr "應用科學"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "applied science"
msgid ""
"Your skill in general 'bench science', applying any of a wide range of "
"precision techniques based on your overall understanding of scientific "
"principles.  This is not a research skill, but about using the results of "
"others' research."
msgstr "你在「實驗室科學」的技能，基於你總體對於科學原理的了解去應用在各式各樣地方的精確技術。這不是研究技能，而是如何使用其他人研究的成果。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You're not even theoretically a physicist."
msgstr "理论上来说，你肯定不是物理学家。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You have the basic understanding of science on par with a high schooler."
msgstr "你对科学有着基本的理解，相当于高中生的水平。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You have a decent understanding of science on par with a college graduate."
msgstr "你对科学有着进一步的理解，相当于大学生的水平。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid ""
"You have a deep understanding of the scientific method and possibly have a "
"degree in a scientific field."
msgstr "你对科学方法有着深刻的理解，可能在某个科学领域拥有学位。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You likely have a PhD in a scientific field."
msgstr "你很可能在某个科学领域拥有博士学位。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You skipped all your science classes."
msgstr "你非常肯定自己一节科学课都没上过。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You've at least done high school chemistry classes."
msgstr "至少你还是做过了高中的化学实验课。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You've worked with a few chemicals and can follow simple procedures."
msgstr "你处理过一些化学品，并能遵循简单的操作过程制备药品。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid ""
"You can follow some more complicated procedures and likely took advanced "
"chemistry courses."
msgstr "你能遵循一些更复杂的制备流程制作化工产物，你可能还修过高级化学课程。"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You can do some advanced chemistry, or just make drugs."
msgstr "你可以进行一些高级化学实验，或是制备药品。"

