msgstr "NRE记录器发出三声尖锐的哔哔声！"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "medium_printout_portal_storm_data_ping"
#. in nested EOCs in false effect in EoC
#. "large_printout_portal_storm_data_ping" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "record_portal_storm_data"
