#: data/json/effects_on_condition/npc_eocs/isherwood_barry_rescue_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "isherwood_mission_barry_return_home"
msgid ""
"Barry raises a hand to signal you to stop.  \"This is it.  Thank you so much. "
" I can't believe I'm here, alive.  It almost feels like I'm dreaming, like it "
"can't be real.\"  He stares at you, his eyes glistening.  \"Whoever you are, "
"thank you.  I'm going to head the rest of the way now and catch up to my "
"family.  Come by and talk to me later when I've had a moment to rest.\""
msgstr ""
"巴里举手示意你停下。“就是这了。非常感谢你。我简直不敢相信我能活着来到这里。感觉就像是做了一场虚幻的梦。”他盯着你，眼中闪烁着泪光。“无论你是谁，我都要谢谢"
"你。接下来的路请让我独自前行，我要去找我的家人。等我缓一会儿再来和我聊聊吧。”"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/npc_eocs/isherwood_barry_rescue_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "isherwood_mission_player_leaves_map"
msgid ""
"Chris sees you leaving the tower, and gives you a harsh look.  \"Where are "
"you going?  Dammit, we're backing out?  Fine.  I'll make sure everyone knows.\""
msgstr "克里斯看到你离开塔楼，给了你一个严厉的眼神。“你要去哪儿？该死的，我们要撤了吗？行。我会确保所有人都清楚这件事的。”"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/npc_eocs/isherwood_barry_rescue_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "isherwood_mission_damage_flee_message"
msgid ""
"You hear a horn honk, and one of the Isherwoods calling out from their truck. "
" \"We're swarmed out here!  We're going to have to head back and regroup!\"  "
"The horn bleats again, and there's a sound of an engine revving, followed by "
"the fleshy 'smack' of something large hitting a windshield."
msgstr ""
"你听到一声喇叭声，然后某个伊舍伍德家族成员正从卡车上朝你喊道：“我们快被包围了！我们必须后撤重新集结！”喇叭声再次响起，接着是发动机的怒吼，接着是某个大家伙"
"撞击挡风玻璃的肉肉的“啪叽”声。"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/npc_eocs/ref_center_beggar_npc_eocs.json
