#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "kitchen station"
msgstr "车载厨房"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "workshop station"
msgstr "工作站"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "oven"
msgstr "烤箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "oven"
msgid ""
"A standard electric convection-based oven, commonly used for heating and "
"cooking food.  It's plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "一台標準規格的電力旋風烤箱，通常用於加熱和烹飪食物。已接通電源並準備就緒。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "stationary water purifier"
msgstr "淨水器"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "stationary water purifier"
msgid ""
"This device effectively sterilizes water.  Activate it to clean all water in "
"a connected tank, at the cost of some electricity."
msgstr "該裝置可以有效地對水進行消毒。啟動它可以濾清在連接水箱中的所有水，但需要消耗一些電力。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-recreation.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "arcade machine"
msgstr "電玩機台"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "arcade machine"
msgid ""
"A bulky upright arcade cabinet, brightly painted and slightly worn with age.  "
"Ready to be played."
msgstr "一台笨重的直立式街機，色彩鮮豔，隨著時間的推移略有磨損。準備好可以玩了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "arc furnace"
msgid_plural "arc furnaces"
msgstr[0] "電弧爐"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "arc furnace"
msgid ""
"An arc furnace designed to burn a powdery mix of coke and limestone to create "
"calcium carbide.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "一種電弧爐，設計用於燃燒焦炭和石灰石的粉狀混合物以產生電石。已接通電源並準備就緒。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electric forge"
msgid_plural "electric forges"
msgstr[0] "電力鍛造爐"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "electric forge"
msgid ""
"An electric forge, plugged in and ready to be used for metalworking.  If you "
"attempt to craft an item that needs a forge, you will be given the option of "
"selecting it as a tool."
msgstr "一台電力鍛造爐，已接通電源並準備用於金屬加工。如果你嘗試製作需要鍛造的物品，可以選擇它作為工具。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_kiln"
msgid ""
"An electric kiln for baking brick or clay.  When plugged in and powered you "
"could use this to harden bricks or clay.  If you attempt to craft an item "
"that needs a kiln, you will be given the option of selecting it as a tool."
msgstr "用於燒磚或陶的電力窯爐。接通電源並通電後，你可以用它來燒磚或陶。如果你嘗試製作需要窯爐的物品，可以選擇它作為工具。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "drill press"
msgid_plural "drill presses"
msgstr[0] "鑽床"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "drill press"
msgid ""
"A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  Useful "
"in all kinds of projects, from industrial fabrication to home woodworking.  "
"Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "一具安裝在滑軌上的強力鑽頭，可以精確控制它落下的狀況。適用於從工業製造到家庭木工的各種項目。已接通電源並準備就緒。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "table saw"
msgid_plural "table saws"
msgstr[0] "桌鋸"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "table saw"
msgid ""
"A rotating sawblade set into a large, flat table.  Used for making straight, "
"measured cuts, it's a key tool in any carpenter's arsenal.  Plugged in and "
"ready to go."
msgstr "一具旋轉鋸片，安裝在一張平坦的大桌子上。用於進行直線、精準測量的切割，是任何木匠工具庫中的關鍵利器。已接通電源並準備就緒。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mitre saw"
msgid_plural "mitre saws"
msgstr[0] "斜切鋸"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "mitre saw"
msgid ""
"A circular sawblade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several "
"directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry.  Plugged in and "
"ready to go."
msgstr "安裝在機械臂上的圓鋸片，可以在多個方向上滑動和旋轉，這是幾乎適用於任何木工的基本工具。已接通電源並準備就緒。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "band saw"
msgid_plural "band saws"
msgstr[0] "彎鋸"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "band saw"
msgid ""
"A ribbonlike sawblade runs in a single direction in this tool, allowing "
"precise cuts at almost any angle.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "該工具中的帶狀鋸刃沿著單一方向運行，幾乎可以在任何角度進行精確切割。已接通電源並準備就緒。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "router table"
msgstr "路達桌"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "router table"
msgid ""
"This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade "
"head for cutting specific profiles and grooves.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "這張工作台配有嵌入式刳鉋機、具有可更換刀頭的旋轉電機，用於切割特定的型材和凹槽。已接通電源並準備就緒。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "planer"
msgid_plural "planers"
msgstr[0] "手壓鉋台"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "planer"
msgid ""
"A hefty tool that will take in a board and cut it smooth and flat to a "
"specific width, particularly great if working with raw lumber stock, but also "
"good just for shaving wood down to size.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "一台笨重机器，能把木板切割成特定厚度并抛光。特别适合用来处理原木，但也能用来把木块切削加工成合适的尺寸。已接通电源，可以使用了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jointer"
msgid_plural "jointers"
msgstr[0] "自動鉋台"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "jointer"
msgid ""
"A table-shaped tool with a rotating blade that will cut down, smooth out, and "
"square off a board to make it nice and smooth.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "一张安装有旋转刀刃工具的桌子，它可以把一块木板切割成形、磨平，使之变得非常光滑、美观。已接通电源，可以使用了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "catalytic cracking reactor"
msgid_plural "catalytic cracking reactors"
msgstr[0] "催化裂解反应器"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "catalytic cracking reactor"
msgid ""
"A makeshift extraction system, or as makeshift as you can consider something "
"that was purpose-built in a laboratory by a group of experts."
msgstr "一套临时的催化裂解系统，或者说是那种实验室的研究人员建造的临时制取装置。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hydraulic press"
msgid_plural "hydraulic presses"
msgstr[0] "液壓機"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hydraulic press"
msgid ""
"If you really want to squash something a lot, this is exactly the right "
"industrial tool for you.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "如果你真的很想挤压一些东西，这对你来说就是一个很好的工业工具。你懂的，它的力量非常大。已接通电源，可以使用了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "air compressor"
msgid_plural "air compressors"
msgstr[0] "空氣壓縮機"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "air compressor"
msgid ""
"This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the "
"tank as possible.  Plugged in and ready to go."
msgstr "这个坚固的气罐顶部安装着一台压缩机，能将尽可能多的空气抽进罐中。已接通电源，可以使用了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "large heater"
msgstr "大型暖氣機"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "small heater"
msgstr "小型暖氣機"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift water electrolyzer"
msgid_plural "makeshift water electrolyzers"
msgstr[0] "粗製電解水機"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift water electrolyzer"
msgid ""
"A makeshift appliance which decomposes water into oxygen and hydrogen via "
"electrolysis of sodium hydroxide solution, with a power cord to connect it to "
"an electric grid."
msgstr "一台自制的通过碱性溶液电解将水分解成氧气和氢气的设备，带有连接到电网的电源线。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift ammonia machine reactor"
msgid_plural "makeshift ammonia machine reactors"
msgstr[0] "粗製氨水反應機"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift ammonia machine reactor"
msgid ""
"A huge appliance built from salvaged industrial equipment, which produces "
"ammonia via the Haber-Bosch process from hydrogen and nitrogen.  It has a "
"power cord to connect it to an electric grid."
msgstr "一台巨大的设备，由回收来的工业设备制成，通过哈伯-博施法将氢气和氮气反应合成氨，带有连接到电网的电源线。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift ammonia machine pipework"
msgid_plural "makeshift ammonia machine pipeworks"
msgstr[0] "粗製氨水管道"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift ammonia machine pipework"
msgid ""
"A rather complicated system of thick-walled pipes, powerful compressors, and "
"wiring, meant to interface with a reactor producing ammonia from nitrogen and "
"hydrogen via the Haber-Bosch process, with a power cord to connect it to an "
"electric grid."
msgstr "一个相当复杂的系统，由厚壁管道、强大的压缩机和电线组成，用于连接氨反应器，通过哈伯-博施法将氢气和氮气合成氨，带有连接到电网的电源线。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift nitrogen generator"
msgid_plural "makeshift nitrogen generators"
msgstr[0] "粗製製氮設備"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift nitrogen generator"
msgid ""
"A large makeshift appliance which captures nitrogen from the air for use in "
"chemistry projects, with a power cord to connect it to an electric grid."
msgstr "一台自制的从空气中收集氮气用于化学反应的大型设备，带有连接到电网的电源线。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/tool/cables.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "power cord"
msgid_plural "power cords"
msgstr[0] "電源線"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "power cord"
msgid ""
"A power cord sticking out of an appliance.  You need to plug it into a "
"powered grid for the appliance to work properly."
msgstr "一条从电器中伸出的电源线。你需要将其插入电网，电器才能正常工作。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wall light"
msgstr "壁挂灯"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wall light"
msgid "A wall-mounted lamp that provides illumination when turned on."
msgstr "壁挂式灯，打开时提供照明。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "standing lamp"
msgstr "立燈"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "standing lamp"
msgid "A tall floor lamp that provides illumination when turned on."
msgstr "高大的落地灯，打开时提供照明。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "standing floodlight"
msgstr "泛光燈"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "standing floodlight"
msgid "A large, heavy light that illuminates a wide area around it when switched on."
msgstr "一种大而重的灯，打开后能照亮周围的大片区域。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "standing directed floodlight"
msgstr "立式定向泛光灯"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "standing directed floodlight"
msgid ""
"A large, heavy light that illuminates a wide semicircle around it when "
"switched on."
msgstr "一种大而重的灯，打开后能照亮周围的半圆形区域。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wall wirings"
msgstr "牆壁電線"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wall wirings"
msgid "Electric wires embedded in the wall."
msgstr "安装在墙上用来供电的电线。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "deployed folding solar panel"
msgid_plural "deployed folding solar panels"
msgstr[0] "展開的摺疊太陽能板"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "deployed folding solar panel"
msgid ""
"This folding solar panel has been unfolded, and it is ready to charge "
"connected devices, if the sun is out."
msgstr "展開的摺疊式太陽能板，只要太陽出來，它就能為連接的裝置充電。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/vehicle/solar.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "deployed solar suitcase"
msgid_plural "deployed solar suitcases"
msgstr[0] "展開的太陽能摺疊包"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "deployed solar suitcase"
msgid "This solar suitcase has been unpacked and is ready to supply power."
msgstr "太陽能摺疊包已經設置好可以供電了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "small solar panel"
msgstr "小型太陽能板"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small solar panel"
msgid "A small solar panel, mounted on a frame and ready to power other appliances."
msgstr "小型太陽能板，安裝在框架上，能為其他電器供電。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_ground_solar_panel"
msgid "A solar panel, mounted on a frame and ready to power other appliances."
msgstr "太陽能板，安裝在框架上，能為其他電器供電。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_reinforced_solar_panel"
msgid ""
"A reinforced solar panel, mounted on a frame and ready to power other "
"appliances."
msgstr "安裝在框架上的強化太陽能板，能為其他電器供電。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "small advanced solar panel"
msgstr "小型進階太陽能板"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small advanced solar panel"
msgid ""
"A  small, high-performance solar panel, mounted on a frame and ready to power "
"other appliances."
msgstr "安裝在框架上的小型高效率太陽能板，能為其他電器供電。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_reinforced_solar_panel_v2"
msgid ""
"A high-performance reinforced solar panel, mounted on a frame and ready to "
"power other appliances."
msgstr "一塊高性能，並且加固過的太陽能板被安裝在框架上，準備好為其他設施提供電力。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_wind_turbine"
msgid "A mounted wind turbine, ready to power other appliances."
msgstr "設置好的風力發電機，準備好給其他家電供電了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_xl_wind_turbine"
msgid "A large mounted wind turbine, ready to power other appliances."
msgstr "設置好的大型風力發電機，準備好給其他家電供電了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_water_wheel"
msgid "A mounted water wheel, ready to power other appliances."
msgstr "一个安装好的水轮机，准备好给其他家电供电了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_xl_water_wheel"
msgid "A mounted large water wheel, ready to power other appliances."
msgstr "一个安装好的大型水轮机，准备好给其他家电供电了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "small grid battery"
msgstr "小型電網電池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/appliances.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small grid battery"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "portable survival battery"
msgid "A small battery to store electrical power in a static power grid."
msgstr "用來給固定電網儲存電力的小型蓄電池。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "medium grid battery"
msgstr "中型電網電池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "medium grid battery"
msgid "A medium battery to store electrical power in a static power grid."
msgstr "用來給固定電網儲存電力的中型蓄電池。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "large grid battery"
msgstr "大型電網電池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "large grid battery"
msgid "A large battery to store electrical power in a static power grid."
msgstr "用來給固定電網儲存電力的大型蓄電池。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "very large grid battery"
msgstr "超大型電網電池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "very large grid battery"
msgid "A very large battery to store electrical power in a static power grid."
msgstr "用來給固定電網儲存電力的超大型蓄電池。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "car grid battery"
msgstr "車輛電網電池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "car grid battery"
msgid "A car battery wired into a static power grid."
msgstr "用電線連接到固定電網的車輛電池。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "motorbike grid battery"
msgstr "摩托车电池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "motorbike grid battery"
msgid "A motorbike battery wired into a static power grid."
msgstr "一块连接到电网的摩托车电池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "small motorbike grid battery"
msgstr "小型摩托车电池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small motorbike grid battery"
msgid "A small motorbike battery wired into a static power grid."
msgstr "一块连接到电网的小型摩托车电池"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ap_washing_machine"
msgid ""
"An appliance used to clean laundry, plugged into a power supply and using "
"internal water tanks."
msgstr "一台用来洗衣服的家电，已经插入电源并使用内部水箱。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "dishwasher"
msgstr "洗碗機"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "dishwasher"
msgid ""
"An appliance used to clean dishes, plugged into a power supply and using "
"internal tanks."
msgstr "一台用来洗碗的家电，已经插入电源并使用内部水箱。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "small autoclave"
msgstr "小型高壓滅菌器"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small autoclave"
msgid ""
"An autoclave that can steam its contents at high enough temperatures to "
"completely sterilize them, killing any possible contaminants.  This one is "
"plugged into a power grid and running off internal water tanks."
msgstr "一个车载高压灭菌釜，能以高温蒸汽彻底消毒内容物，清除可能的污染。已经接入到电网并使用内部水箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "foot locker recharging station"
msgstr "櫃式充電站"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foot locker recharging station"
msgid ""
"A universal recharging station integrated into a steel storage compartment.  "
"When turned on, it will steadily charge all rechargeable batteries (battery "
"cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) placed directly within its storage space."
msgstr "整合在鋼製儲物箱中的通用充電站。開啟後，它將持續地為直接放置在其儲存空間內的所有可充電電池（蓄電池、鉛酸電池等）充電。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "box battery charger"
msgstr "電池充電盒"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "box battery charger"
msgid ""
"A small device for recharging batteries integrated into a small wooden "
"storage compartment.  When turned on, it will slowly charge all rechargeable "
"batteries (battery cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) placed directly within "
"its storage space."
msgstr "整合在小型木製儲物箱中的用來充電電池的小型裝置。開啟後，它將緩慢地為直接放置在其儲存空間內的所有可充電電池（蓄電池、鉛酸電池等）充電。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "advanced Stirling radioisotope generator"
msgstr "先进斯特林放射性同位素发电机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "advanced Stirling radioisotope generator"
#. ~ Description of "disconnected advanced Stirling radioisotope generator"
msgid ""
"A rather heavy brick of metal housing an ASRG, formerly designed by NASA and "
"repurposed for terrestrial use.  Will provide about 130 W, basically forever "
"as far as you're concerned.  Even though the alpha radiation these run off of "
"isn't very dangerous in case of a breach, this unit appears to be armored to "
"take a beating and is a good deal heavier owing to its composite plating."
msgstr ""
"一个非常重的大金属块，里面装有一个ASRG（先进斯特林放射性同位素发电机），由以前的NASA设计，后来被迁移至地面使用。它能提供130"
"W的供电，直到永远（至少对你所需要关心的时间来说）。尽管同位素放出的α射线在发生泄漏时也不是很危险，但这个装置似乎有着能够承受打击的防护装甲，也由于其复合装"
"甲板而变重了许多。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "grid microwave"
msgstr "微波炉"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "grid microwave"
msgid "A microwave connected to a power grid, ready to cook some food."
msgstr "连接到电网的微波炉，准备好用于处理食物了。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "oxygen concentrator"
msgid_plural "oxygen concentrators"
msgstr[0] "制氧机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "oxygen concentrator"
msgid ""
"A machine capable of generating pure oxygen from the air.  It has been "
"plugged into a power grid."
msgstr "一种能吸入空气产生纯氧的机器。它已经接入了电网。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high pressure compressor unit"
msgid_plural "high pressure compressor units"
msgstr[0] "高压压缩机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "high pressure compressor unit"
msgid ""
"A machine designed to compress an input gas to a very high pressure.  It has "
"been plugged into a power grid."
msgstr "一种能把输入气体压缩至超高压的机器。它已经接入了电网。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glassblower's crucible"
msgid_plural "glassblower's crucibles"
msgstr[0] "玻璃吹制坩埚"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "glassblower's crucible"
#. ~ Description of "disconnected glassblower's crucible"
msgid ""
"An electric crucible, powered by your electric grid.  Designed for melting "
"large quantities of glass for batch crafting and production of large items, "
"it needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr "电坩埚，由你的电网供电。 专为熔化大量玻璃而设计，用于批量制作和生产大型物品。需要放置并插入电源。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "portable gasoline generator"
msgid_plural "portable gasoline generators"
msgstr[0] "便携式汽油发电机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "portable gasoline generator"
msgid ""
"A small, portable generator, one that people buy for a camp.  It just needs "
"to be fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "一种小型便携式发电机，通常用于露营。只需添加燃料，然后启动即可。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "diesel generator"
msgid_plural "diesel generators"
msgstr[0] "柴油发电机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "diesel generator"
msgid ""
"Big and powerful generator, used for street works.  It just needs to be "
"plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "一种功率强大的大型发电机，主要用于街道施工。只需接入电网，加入燃料，然后启动即可。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military diesel generator"
msgid_plural "military diesel generators"
msgstr[0] "军用柴油发电机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "military diesel generator"
#. ~ Description of "military diesel generator"
msgid ""
"Big and powerful generator, painted in camo.  It just needs to be plugged in, "
"fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "一种功率强大的大型发电机，外壳涂有迷彩。只需接入电网，加入燃料，然后启动即可。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "powerful gasoline generator"
msgid_plural "powerful gasoline generators"
msgstr[0] "大功率汽油发电机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "powerful gasoline generator"
#. ~ Description of "powerful gasoline generator"
msgid ""
"Still reasonably portable, this 12000 W gasoline generator can power up an "
"entire house.  It just needs to be plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "一台12000瓦的汽油发电机，依然保持了相对的便携性，能够为整栋房屋提供电力。只需接入电网，加入燃料，然后启动即可。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "fridge"
msgstr "冰箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "fridge"
msgid ""
"A standard household refrigerator.  When turned on, it will cool the food "
"inside, extending the time until the food spoils."
msgstr "一台普通的家用冰箱。开启时，它可以冷藏食物，延缓腐烂。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "minifridge"
msgid_plural "minifridges"
msgstr[0] "小型冰箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "minifridge"
msgid ""
"A small fridge.  When turned on, it will cool the food inside, extending the "
"time until the food spoils."
msgstr "一個小型冰箱。當它啟動時， 裡面的食物將被冷藏， 延長食物腐敗所需要的時間。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "food truck fridge"
msgid_plural "food truck fridges"
msgstr[0] "美食貨車冰箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "food truck fridge"
msgid ""
"A heavy, portable fridge.  When turned on, it will cool the food inside, "
"extending the time until the food spoils."
msgstr "一台沉重的车载冰箱。开启时，它可以冷藏食物，延缓腐烂。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "single glass door fridge"
msgid_plural "single glass door fridges"
msgstr[0] "单玻璃门冰箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "single glass door fridge"
msgid ""
"A commercial refrigerator with a glass door.  When turned on, it will cool "
"the food inside, extending the time until the food spoils."
msgstr "一台带玻璃门的商用冰箱。开启时，它可以冷藏食物，延缓腐烂。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "double glass door fridge"
msgid_plural "double glass door fridges"
msgstr[0] "双玻璃门冰箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "double glass door fridge"
msgid ""
"A commercial refrigerator with two glass doors.  When turned on, it will cool "
"the food inside, extending the time until the food spoils."
msgstr "一台带双玻璃门的商用冰箱。开启时，它可以冷藏食物，延缓腐烂。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy-duty fridge"
msgid_plural "heavy-duty fridges"
msgstr[0] "重型冰箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty fridge"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty refrigerator.  When turned on, it will cool the food inside, "
"extending the time until the food spoils."
msgstr "一台结实耐用的重型冰箱。开启时，它可以冷藏食物，延缓腐烂。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "display fridge"
msgid_plural "display fridges"
msgstr[0] "展示冰箱"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "display fridge"
msgid ""
"A display fridge.  When turned on, it will cool the food inside, extending "
"the time until the food spoils."
msgstr "一台展柜形状的冰箱。开启时，它可以冷藏食物，延缓腐烂。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/appliances.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "freezer"
msgid_plural "freezers"
msgstr[0] "冰櫃"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "freezer"
msgid ""
"A common upright freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "常见的立式冰柜。打开后，它会冷冻里面的食物，防止任何物品进一步的过期。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "minifreezer"
msgid_plural "minifreezers"
msgstr[0] "小型冰櫃"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "minifreezer"
msgid ""
"A small freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, preventing "
"any further expiration."
msgstr "一台小型冰柜。通电后，它能将内部的食物冷冻起来，防止食物进一步变质。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chest minifreezer"
msgid_plural "chest minifreezers"
msgstr[0] "迷你卧式冰柜"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "chest minifreezer"
msgid ""
"A small chest freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "这是一台小型立式冰柜。一旦接通电源，它便能将里面的食物冷冻保存，从而有效阻止食物继续变质。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "food truck freezer"
msgid_plural "food truck freezers"
msgstr[0] "美食貨車冷凍櫃"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "food truck freezer"
msgid ""
"A heavy, portable freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "一款沉重但可移动的冰柜。一旦开启，它能迅速将内部存放的食物冻结，有效阻止食品继续腐坏变质。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chest freezer"
msgid_plural "chest freezers"
msgstr[0] "卧式冰柜"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "chest freezer"
msgid ""
"A big chest freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration.  Don't fall in!"
msgstr "一个大型的卧式冰柜。一旦通电运行，它就能使内部的食物保持冷冻状态，有效阻止食品过期变质。千万小心，别掉进去了！"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy-duty freezer"
msgid_plural "heavy-duty freezers"
msgstr[0] "重型冰柜"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty freezer"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "一款重型冰柜。一旦开启，它就能迅速冷冻内部食物，有效阻止食物继续变质。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glass door freezer"
msgid_plural "glass door freezers"
msgstr[0] "玻璃门冰柜"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "glass door freezer"
msgid ""
"A glass door freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "一款带玻璃门的冰柜。接通电源后，它能够冷冻存储在内的食物，从而避免食品继续变质。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "display freezer"
msgid_plural "display freezers"
msgstr[0] "展示冰柜"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "display freezer"
msgid ""
"A display freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "这是一款展示冰柜。一旦开启电源，它就能冷冻保存内部的食物，有效阻止食品过期变质。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "glowing tendril"
msgstr "發光觸鬚"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing tendril"
msgid ""
"A willowy tendril growing from the floor, gently waving back and forth.  A "
"faint light spills from it."
msgstr "一根柔韧的卷须从地板上长出来，轻轻地前后摆动着。微弱的亮光从里面射了出来。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "splorch!"
msgstr "咔！"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "wafting anemone"
msgstr "飘动海葵"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "wafting anemone"
msgid ""
"A fleshy white protuberance growing from the floor, with a cluster of "
"tendrils protruding from it.  It looks almost exactly like a sea anemone, "
"even waving gently as though underwater."
msgstr "一个肉质的白色生物从地面突起，一串卷须从肉质中伸出。它看起来几乎和海葵一模一样，甚至像在水里一样轻轻地摆动。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gasping tube"
msgstr "肉质钟乳石"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gasping tube"
msgid ""
"A meaty green stalactite with a thickened hide like that of a starfish, "
"extending from the floor to the ceiling.  In the center is a series of ports "
"somewhat like mouths, from which pour bursts of a vile-smelling gas."
msgstr "一块肉质的绿色钟乳石，有像海星一样的厚皮，从地板一直延伸到天花板。中心是一系列像嘴一样的开口，从中喷出阵阵难闻的气体。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "twitching frond"
msgstr "摇摆蕨叶"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "twitching frond"
msgid ""
"A spine resembling moth antennae juts from the ground, swaying gently in the "
"air.  Every so often, a cascade of energy arcs along it and discharges into "
"the ceiling."
msgstr "一根像飞蛾触须一样的带毛尖刺从地面伸出来，在空中轻轻摇摆。每隔一段时间，它就会向天花板射出几道电弧。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scarred lump"
msgstr "疤痕肉瘤"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scarred lump"
msgid ""
"A pile of nondescript alien flesh, twitching and belching strange gases out "
"of injured orifices."
msgstr "一堆无法分辨清楚的异界血肉，它受伤的孔洞正抽搐着向往外喷出奇怪的气体。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "splat!"
msgstr "啪啦!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "slimy pod"
msgstr "黏滑荚囊"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "slimy pod"
msgid ""
"A slick, translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  It is covered in a thick "
"mucus, obscuring whatever is floating in the gel-like substance inside."
msgstr "一个悬挂在细茎上的光滑、半透明荚囊。遍覆其上的厚重黏液，掩盖了凝胶状物质中悬浮的任何东西。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "organ pod"
msgstr "器官莢囊"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "organ pod"
msgid ""
"A translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside you can see the dimly "
"outlined shape of human organs, floating in some kind of preservative goo."
msgstr "一个悬挂在细茎上的半透明荚囊。其中你可以看到人体器官的模糊轮廓，漂浮在某种防护性黏液中。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "resin pod"
msgstr "樹脂莢"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "resin pod"
msgid ""
"A translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside is a clean, clear, "
"resinous-looking fluid.  You could fairly easily tear it from the stalk and "
"take it with you."
msgstr "一个悬挂在细茎上的半透明荚囊。里面是干净，清澈的树脂状液体。你可以很容易地把它从茎上扯下来并随身携带。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "fleshy altar"
msgstr "血肉祭壇"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "fleshy altar"
msgid ""
"This pulsing protuberance juts from the floor, its sides covered in scaled, "
"oozing skin.  The surface is flat, but undulates softly.  A handful of "
"unidentifiable appendages reach from the sides, suggesting a sort of "
"nightmarish living Autodoc."
msgstr "这个脉动的突起物从地板上凸出，侧面覆盖着鳞片状、湿黏的皮肤。表面平坦，但微微蠕动着。一簇无法识别的附肢从两侧伸出，暗示其为某种噩梦般的活体全自动医疗仪。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scrap antenna"
msgstr "廢金屬天線"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scrap antenna"
msgid ""
"This contraption looks like some sort of cobbled-together transmitter or "
"receiver antenna.  It consists of a number of mismatched blinking lights, "
"spinning servos, and dangling wires connected to a hefty metal box."
msgstr "这个装置看起来像是某种用金属废料拼凑起来的发射器或接收器天线。它由许多互不匹配的闪烁指示灯、旋转的马达和连接到一个沉重金属盒上的垂直天线组成。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "pictographic signpost"
msgstr "象形路标"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "pictographic signpost"
msgid ""
"This simple scrap metal sign has a series of pictographs on it depicting what "
"seems to be a trade interaction.  There is a crude but understandable map "
"beneath it.  You should take a closer look."
msgstr "这个简单的废金属路标上画着一系列象形文字，描绘了某种贸易交互行为。它的下方画着一张粗糙但可以理解的地图。你应该更仔细地看一看。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXODII_SIGNPOST_FALSE" in furniture
#. "pictographic signpost"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You study the signpost.  It shows a similar set of directions to the ones you "
"already have.  You cross-reference them and don't learn anything new."
msgstr "你仔细勘察了路标。上面标识着一组与你已知方向相似的方向。你相互参照着研究了一下，没有发现任何新东西。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXODII_SIGNPOST" in furniture
#. "pictographic signpost"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You study the signpost.  It shows simply-drawn pictograms of a pair of hands "
"holding out an object, and another pair taking the object and offering a "
"pouch in return.  Beneath the pictures there's a crude but understandable map "
"with arrows pointing to what looks like some kind of castle.  You do your "
"best to relate those to landmarks you know about, and mark the likely "
"location on your map."
msgstr ""
"你仔细勘察了路标。上面有个简单绘制的一双手给出一个物体的象形图案，另一双手拿着这个物体并给一个袋子作为回报。图片下方是一张粗糙但易懂的地图，箭头指向看起来像"
"是城堡的地方。你尽最大努力将这些与你知道的地标联系起来，并在地图上标出了可能的位置。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "rack of robots"
msgstr "機器人展架"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "rack of robots"
msgid ""
"A wire cage containing a number of robot parts, from chassis to limbs, firmly "
"clamped onto sturdy hanging rods.  It looks like it would be exceptionally "
"difficult to open it and get at them without damaging them, probably by "
"design."
msgstr "一个钢丝笼，里面有许多机器人零件，从底盘到四肢，牢牢地固定在坚固的吊杆上。很可能是故意如此设计的，想要在不损坏部件的情况下打开展架并取下它们是几乎不可能的。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "spinning dish"
msgstr "不断旋转的碟形天线"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "spinning dish"
msgid ""
"A slowly-spinning parabolic dish engraved with an unrecognizable pattern of "
"symbols that might, at a guess, be some sort of circuitry pattern - or maybe "
"a religious incantation.  It is mounted on a completely mismatched electric "
"motor that looks fairly mundane."
msgstr ""
"一个正在缓缓旋转的抛物形碟形天线，上面雕刻着一大块无法辨认的符号图案，可能是某种电路图案，或者是某种宗教咒语。它安装在一个相当普通的电动机上，看上去完全不匹"
"配。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scavenged utility light"
msgstr "废物利用的工作灯"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scavenged utility light"
msgid ""
"The bulbs emit an eerie greenish glow, and some parts of it have a curved "
"appearance as though the metal were grown in a lab, but by and large this "
"isn't a particularly unusual looking area light."
msgstr "它的灯泡发出一股怪诞的绿色光芒，它的一部分有种弯曲的外观，就好像金属是在实验室里生长出来的一般，但总的来说，它并不是一个特别不寻常的工作灯。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "clanking fluid pump"
msgstr "咣当作响的液泵"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "clanking fluid pump"
msgid ""
"The huge, sweating pipes and large tank reveal this clanking and tortuous "
"piece of equipment to be some sort of fluid pump.  It is cobbled together "
"from several apparently ill-fitting parts that have been fitted with some "
"very strange-looking but surprisingly clever adapters."
msgstr ""
"外表凝结了许多水珠的巨大管道和大型油罐表明了这台正在咣当作响的弯弯曲曲的设备是某种液泵。它看上去是由几个明显不匹配的部件拼凑而成，这些部件之间由一些看起来非"
"常奇怪但构思却出奇巧妙的转接器组装在一起。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "metalloid printer"
msgstr "类金属打印机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "metalloid printer"
msgid ""
"This huge device fairly closely resembles a 3D printer, aside from its "
"industrial size.  Huge spools of various thin metallic wires atop it feed "
"into what seems to be some sort of nozzle, and massive electrical cables "
"disappear into the wall behind it."
msgstr ""
"这台巨大的设备实际看起来和3"
"D打印机非常相似，除了它的工业级巨大尺寸。巨大的线轴上缠绕着各种各样的细金属线，送进一个看起来像是某种喷嘴的装置，巨大的电缆延伸消失在它背后的墙中。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "circuit printer"
msgstr "电路打印机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "circuit printer"
msgid ""
"A tall device with a lattice of pipes and nozzles.  Based on the pile of "
"products sitting in the output hopper, it looks like it's used as a printer "
"for complex electronic components."
msgstr "一台很高的装置，有个由各种管道和喷嘴组成的网格。根据放在输出料斗中的那堆产品来看，它看起来像是一台用来打印复杂电子元件的3D打印机。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Mavrik 10-101 power core"
msgstr "Mavrik 10-101 能源核心"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Mavrik 10-101 power core"
msgid ""
"There is a faded metallic plaque on the side of this cylindrical device.  The "
"lettering is a strange combination of English and Cyrillic script.  It reads:\n"
"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Stabиlиtи\n"
"Saфetи\n"
"A нyuclиar фyutuр ви bilив iн"
msgstr ""
"这个圆柱形装置的侧面有一块褪色的金属板。上面的字母是英语和西里尔字母的奇怪组合。写着：\n"
"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Stabиlиtи（稳定）\n"
"Saфetи（安全）\n"
"A нyuclиar фyutuр ви bilив iн（一个我们所信任的核能未来）"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "spherical generator"
msgstr "球形发电机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "spherical generator"
msgid ""
"This huge steel-plated sphere gives off a soft hum as it, presumably, "
"generates power.  A heavy lead plate bolted to the front might describe what "
"it is, but it is written in something that looks vaguely like cuneiform."
msgstr "这个巨大的钢壳球体发出柔和的嗡嗡声，大概是在发电。一块用螺栓固定在前面的厚重铅板也许描述了它的功能，但是用一种看起来像楔形文字的符号写的。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "fluidic generator"
msgstr "射流发电机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "fluidic generator"
msgid ""
"Twisting reams of copper and steel pipes wrap around a central core that "
"thrums softly.  Although there are no labels in any language you recognize, "
"the cables connected to the base suggest that this is some sort of power "
"generator."
msgstr "许多扭曲的铜管和钢管缠绕在一个正在轻声轰鸣的核心之上。虽然没有任何你能读懂的文字标签，但是连接到底座的电缆表明这是某种发电机。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "rusty generator"
msgstr "锈迹斑斑的发电机"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "rusty generator"
msgid ""
"A tall, unremarkable cylinder capped by a wide, flat saucer.  There is heavy "
"rusting at the base.  A series of connected cables suggest that it's some "
"sort of power generator."
msgstr "一个高而普通的圆筒，顶部有一个宽而扁平的碟形盖子。底座已经锈蚀严重。一系列相连的电缆表明这是某种发电机。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "personal charging station"
msgstr "单人充电站"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "personal charging station"
msgid ""
"The cyborg equivalent of a bed, this is a custom-shaped near-vertical booth "
"designed to mount a heavy metal frame and connect it to a central power "
"supply and nutrient source."
msgstr "相当于一张机器人所用的床，这是一个经过特殊定制的接近垂直的金属展示架，设计用来安装一个重型金属框架，并将其连接到中央供电和供养系统之中。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "simple charging station"
msgstr "简易充电站"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "simple charging station"
msgid ""
"A simple, unadorned, corroded metal charging and feeding station, with "
"hookups for two units somewhat larger than a human to stand side by side and "
"be recharged and refueled."
msgstr "一个简单、朴素、锈蚀金属构成的充电加油站，配有两个比成人体型稍大的连接装置，可让两个机器人并排站立并进行充电和加油。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "shimmering superstructure"
msgstr "闪闪发光的上层结构"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "shimmering superstructure"
msgid ""
"A simple metal superstructure like you might see holding up a radio tower, "
"this one seems to give off just the faintest hint of shimmer, like heat "
"waves.  The metal has a burnt, iridescent pattern.  There is a boxy, "
"unimpressive-looking device at the top of the tower."
msgstr ""
"一个简单的金属上层结构，就像支撑无线电塔的那种架子一样，但这个结构似乎能发出十分微弱的微光，像热浪一般往四周扩散。金属表面有一大块烧焦的、闪光的图案。塔顶上"
"有一个长方形的、看起来很普通的装置。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "portal enclosure"
msgstr "传送门围护装置"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "portal enclosure"
msgid ""
"A heavy metal ring attached to dozens of wires, charred by residue that gives "
"off an acrid, unfamiliar smell."
msgstr "一个沉重的金属环，上面连接了几十根电线，上面被烧焦的残留物散发出一股刺鼻的陌生气味。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "locator antenna"
msgstr "定位天线"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "locator antenna"
msgid ""
"A tall metal pole solidly fixed to the roof.  It does not look activated but "
"there's a small set of holes near its base, maybe something could be plugged "
"in one to reboot the locator."
msgstr "牢固地固定在屋顶上的高金属杆，看起来并没有被激活。不过它的底座附近有几个孔，也许你可以插入一些东西来重新启动它。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR_ACTIVE" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid "The locator is already active"
msgstr "定位天线已激活"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR_FALSE" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid "You don't have anything that could reactivate this device"
msgstr "你没有任何东西可以重新激活此设备"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You plug the rebooter in the locator.\n"
"<color_light_green>The locator reactivates.</color>"
msgstr ""
"你将重新启动装置插入定位天线。\n"
"<color_light_green>定位天线已重新激活。</color>"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "crystalline flower"
msgstr "水晶花"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "crystalline flower"
msgid "A crystalline structure that resembles a plant."
msgstr "类似植物的晶体结构。"

