#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "broken console"
msgid ""
"A standalone computer terminal.  It doesn't seem to be working.  It's the "
"broken screen and shattered circuit boards telling you that."
msgstr "一台獨立的電腦終端機。破碎的螢幕和損毀的電路板，讓你知道它已無法運作。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "computer console"
msgstr "電腦控制台"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "computer console"
msgid ""
"A standalone computer terminal, the screen glowing with dim artificial light. "
" If examined closely, you can read what's on the screen and perform any "
"allowed functions.  It might even be possible to hack it, given the skills."
msgstr "一台獨立的電腦終端機，螢幕上閃爍著昏暗的人造光源。如果仔細查看，你可以閱讀螢幕上的內容並執行任何允許的功能。如果你有足夠的技能，甚至有可能破解它。"

