#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "porthole"
#. ~ Description of terrain "view port"
msgid ""
"A thick, round window surrounded with a strong metal frame.  It's sealed "
"closed."
msgstr "一扇厚厚的圆形窗户，四周用坚固的金属框完全封死。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "wooden stairs"
msgstr "木板樓梯"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden stairs"
msgid "A wooden staircase leading down."
msgstr "往下走的木板樓梯。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "half-built wooden stairs"
msgstr "半建成木板樓梯"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built wooden stairs"
msgid ""
"Half of a wooden staircase.  Some work still needs to be done before this "
"staircase is complete."
msgstr "半截木楼梯。在段木楼梯完成之前，还需要做一些工作。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "broken wooden stairs"
msgstr "損壞的木板樓梯"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "broken wooden stairs"
msgid ""
"A number of planks are missing and the structure is beginning to sag and fall "
"apart.  It's going to need quite a bit of work to repair this staircase."
msgstr "这段木楼梯上的一些木板不见了，整体结构开始倾倒崩裂。修复这段楼梯颇需要一番功夫。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden stairs"
msgid "A wooden staircase leading up."
msgstr "一段向上的木楼梯。"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "stairs"
msgstr "樓梯"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "stairs"
