#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected oven"
msgid_plural "disconnected ovens"
msgstr[0] "烤箱（未連接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected oven"
msgid ""
"A disconnected electric convection-based oven, commonly used for heating and "
"cooking food.  Plug it into a vehicle or power grid to get cooking."
msgstr "一台未通电的对流式电烤箱，通常用于加热及烹饪食物。把它接入汽车电源或连接电网就可以做饭了。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected large water purifier"
msgid_plural "disconnected large water purifiers"
msgstr[0] "大型净水器（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected large water purifier"
msgid ""
"A device that effectively sterilizes water, but it doesn't take batteries.  "
"You'll need to connect it to a power source."
msgstr "一种有效消毒水的设备，但它不使用电池。 你需要将其连接到电网。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected arcade machine"
msgid_plural "disconnected arcade machines"
msgstr[0] "電玩機台（未連接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected arcade machine"
msgid ""
"A bulky upright arcade cabinet, brightly painted and slightly worn with age.  "
"Ready to be plugged in and played."
msgstr "一台笨重的立式街机游戏机，色彩鲜艳，因长年使用而略微磨损。可以接入电源后用它玩一会游戏。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected arc furnace"
msgid_plural "disconnected arc furnaces"
msgstr[0] "电弧炉（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected arc furnace"
msgid ""
"An arc furnace designed to burn a powdery mix of coke and limestone to create "
"calcium carbide.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr "一个用于煅烧粉末状焦炭石灰混合物来制取电石的电弧炉。已插上电源，需要被放置并接入电源来使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected drill press"
msgid_plural "disconnected drill presses"
msgstr[0] "鑽床（未連接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected drill press"
msgid ""
"A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  Useful "
"in all kinds of projects, from industrial fabrication to home woodworking.  "
"Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr "一台安装在滑轨上的大功率钻机，可以用它精确钻孔。可用于从工业制造到家庭木工的各种工作。需要放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected table saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected table saws"
msgstr[0] "台锯（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected table saw"
msgid ""
"A rotating sawblade set into a large, flat table.  Used for making straight, "
"measured cuts, it's a key tool in any carpenter's arsenal.  Needs to be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr "一台旋转锯片，嵌装在宽敞又平整的工作台上。它能够笔直地切割出精准的直线，是各类木工设备中的关键工具之一。需要放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected mitre saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected mitre saws"
msgstr[0] "横切锯（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected mitre saw"
msgid ""
"A circular sawblade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several "
"directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry.  Needs to be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr "一台安装在机械臂上的圆锯，可以在多个维度上滑动旋转，近乎是木匠的标配工具。需要放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected band saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected band saws"
msgstr[0] "带锯机（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected band saw"
msgid ""
"A ribbonlike sawblade runs in a single direction in this tool, allowing "
"precise cuts at almost any angle.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a "
"power source."
msgstr "一台装在一条线性导轨上运行的带型链锯。可按任意角度进行精确切割。需要放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected router table"
msgid_plural "disconnected router tables"
msgstr[0] "雕刻机（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected router table"
msgid ""
"This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade "
"head for cutting specific profiles and grooves.  Needs to be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr "这张桌子上安装着一台嵌入式刳刨机、一台旋转电机和一套可更换的刀头，能够将材料切割出特殊轮廓、凹槽和其他形状。需要放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected planer"
msgid_plural "disconnected planers"
msgstr[0] "刨床（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected planer"
msgid ""
"A hefty tool that will take in a board and cut it smooth and flat to a "
"specific width, particularly great if working with raw lumber stock, but also "
"good just for shaving wood down to size.  Needs to be placed and plugged into "
"a power source."
msgstr "一台笨重机器，能丝滑地把木板平整切割成特定厚度。特别适合用来处理原木，但也能很好地用来把木块切削加工成合适的尺寸。需要放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected jointer"
msgid_plural "disconnected jointers"
msgstr[0] "木工车床（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected jointer"
msgid ""
"A table-shaped tool with a rotating blade that will cut down, smooth out, and "
"square off a board to make it nice and smooth.  Needs to be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr "一张安装有旋转刀刃工具的工作台，能把木板切割成形、抛光，使之变得非常光滑、美观。需要放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected hydraulic press"
msgid_plural "disconnected hydraulic presses"
msgstr[0] "液压机（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected hydraulic press"
msgid ""
"If you really want to squash something a lot, this is exactly the right "
"industrial tool for you.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr "如果你真的很想冲压一些东西，那你就确实选对了工业工具。需要放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected air compressor"
msgid_plural "disconnected air compressors"
msgstr[0] "空气压缩机（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected air compressor"
msgid ""
"This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the "
"tank as possible.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr "这个坚固的气罐顶部安装着一台压缩机，能将尽可能多的空气抽进罐中。需要放置后接入电源才能使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected autoclave"
msgid_plural "disconnected autoclaves"
msgstr[0] "高壓滅菌器（未插電）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected autoclave"
msgid ""
"An autoclave, used to sterilize equipment with pressurized steam.  It "
"requires a massive amount of power, so it will need to be plugged into a "
"power grid."
msgstr "一台高压灭菌釜，用于对 CBM 之类的装置进行加压灭菌。启动它需要巨多电力，因此需要接入电网使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected wall light"
msgid_plural "disconnected wall lights"
msgstr[0] "壁挂灯（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected wall light"
msgid "A wall light that provides illumination when plugged into a grid."
msgstr "一个可以挂起来的落地灯，在接入电网后可以提供照明。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected standing lamp"
msgid_plural "disconnected standing lamps"
msgstr[0] "立灯（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected standing lamp"
msgid ""
"A tall standing lamp that provides illumination when plugged into a power "
"outlet."
msgstr "一盏高高的立灯，插到电源插座上时提供照明。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected standing floodlight"
msgid_plural "disconnected standing floodlights"
msgstr[0] "泛光灯（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected standing floodlight"
msgid ""
"A large, heavy light designed to illuminate wide areas when plugged into a "
"power outlet."
msgstr "一盏又大又重的灯，插到电源插座上时可用来照亮大片半圆形区域。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected standing directed floodlight"
msgid_plural "disconnected standing directed floodlights"
msgstr[0] "立式定向泛光灯（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected standing directed floodlight"
msgid ""
"A large, heavy light designed to illuminate a wide semicircle in a chosen "
"direction when plugged into a power outlet."
msgstr "一盏又大又重的灯，插到电源插座上时可用来照亮选择的大片半圆形区域。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wall wiring"
msgid_plural "wall wirings"
msgstr[0] "牆壁電線插座"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "wall wiring"
msgid "Electric wires used to run power through walls."
msgstr "安裝在牆上用來供電。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected foot locker recharging station"
msgid_plural "disconnected foot locker recharging stations"
msgstr[0] "鞋柜充电站（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected foot locker recharging station"
msgid ""
"A universal recharging station integrated into a steel storage compartment.  "
"When plugged in and powered, it will steadily charge all rechargeable "
"batteries (battery cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) placed directly within "
"its storage space."
msgstr "整合在鋼製儲物箱中的通用充電站。當插入電源並通電時，它將持續地為直接放置在其儲存空間內的所有可充電電池（蓄電池、鉛酸電池等）充電。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected box battery charger"
msgid_plural "disconnected box battery chargers"
msgstr[0] "電池充電盒（未插電）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected box battery charger"
msgid ""
"A small device for recharging batteries integrated into a small wooden "
"storage compartment.  When plugged in and powered, it will slowly charge all "
"rechargeable batteries (battery cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) placed "
"directly within its storage space."
msgstr "整合在小型木製儲物箱中的用來充電電池的小型裝置。 插入電源並通電後，它將緩慢地為直接放置在其儲存空間內的所有可充電電池（蓄電池、鉛酸電池等）充電。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected advanced Stirling radioisotope generator"
msgid_plural "disconnected advanced Stirling radioisotope generators"
msgstr[0] "先进斯特林放射性同位素发电机（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "oxygen concentrator"
msgid ""
"A machine capable of generating pure oxygen from the air.  Can be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr "一种能吸入空气产生纯氧的机器。可以放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "high pressure compressor unit"
msgid ""
"A machine designed to compress an input gas to a very high pressure.  Can be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr "一种能吸入空气产生纯氧的机器。可以放置后接入电源使用。"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected glassblower's crucible"
msgid_plural "disconnected glassblower's crucibles"
msgstr[0] "玻璃吹制坩埚（未连接）"

#: data/json/items/basecamp.json
