msgstr[0] "營寨跑酷區"

#: data/json/items/basecamp.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small anaerobic digester tank"
msgid_plural "small anaerobic digester tanks"
msgstr[0] "小型厌氧发酵罐"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "ultra-light battery (rechargeable)"
msgid_plural "ultra-light batteries (rechargeable)"
msgstr[0] "超輕型電池（可充電）"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "ultra-light battery (rechargeable)"
#. ~ Description of "ultra-light battery (rechargeable)"
msgid ""
"A light, coin-like battery cell designed for small size over everything else. "
" Used for watches, calculators, toys or similar low-power electronics."
msgstr "一種輕巧的硬幣狀電池，專為小尺寸而設計。用於手錶、計算器、玩具或類似的低功耗電子產品。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "ultra-light battery"
msgid_plural "ultra-light batteries"
msgstr[0] "超輕型電池"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "ultra-light battery"
#. ~ Description of "ultra-light battery"
msgid ""
"A light, coin-like battery cell designed for small size over everything else. "
" Used for watches, calculators, toys or similar low-power electronics.  This "
"one can't be recharged."
msgstr "一種輕巧的硬幣狀電池，專為小尺寸而設計。用於手錶、計算器、玩具或類似的低功耗電子產品。這個不能充電。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "light battery"
msgid_plural "light batteries"
msgstr[0] "輕型電池"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "light battery"
#. ~ Description of "light battery"
msgid ""
"A light battery cell, popular for any consumer-grade electronic: from remotes "
"to mouses, from clocks to thermometers.  This one can't be recharged."
msgstr "一個輕型電池，適用於任何消費性電子產品：從遙控器到滑鼠，從時鐘到溫度計。這個不能充電。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "light battery (rechargeable)"
msgid_plural "light batteries (rechargeable)"
msgstr[0] "輕型電池（可充電）"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "light battery (rechargeable)"
#. ~ Description of "light battery (rechargeable)"
msgid ""
"A light battery cell, popular for any consumer-grade electronic: from remotes "
"to mouses, from clocks to thermometers."
msgstr "一個輕型電池，適用於任何消費性電子產品：從遙控器到滑鼠，從時鐘到溫度計。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "medium battery (rechargeable)"
msgid_plural "medium batteries (rechargeable)"
msgstr[0] "中型電池（可充電）"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "medium battery (rechargeable)"
#. ~ Description of "medium battery (rechargeable)"
msgid ""
"A medium battery cell, wildly used in modern tools: heavy flashlights, "
"two-way radios, security cameras, multiple of them make a tool battery, and "
"some older generation of EV use thousands of this as the power storage."
msgstr "一個中型電池，廣泛用於現代工具：耐用手電筒、雙向無線電、保安監視器等，多個這種電池可用來作成工具電池，一些老一代電動汽車使用數千個這樣的電池作為電力存儲。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "small tool battery"
msgid_plural "small tool batteries"
msgstr[0] "小型電動工具電池"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "small tool battery"
#. ~ Description of "small tool battery"
msgid ""
"A light battery cell, universally compatible with all kinds of "
"industrial-grade equipment and portable tools - drills, angle grinders, "
"chainsaws."
msgstr "一個輕型電池，普遍兼容各種工業級設備與便攜式工具－鑽頭、角磨機、鏈鋸等。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "big tool battery"
msgid_plural "big tool batteries"
msgstr[0] "大型電動工具電池"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "big tool battery"
#. ~ Description of "big tool battery"
msgid ""
"A heavy battery cell, universally compatible with all kinds of "
"industrial-grade equipment and portable tools - drills, angle grinders, "
"chainsaws."
msgstr "一個大型電池，普遍兼容各種工業級設備與便攜式工具－鑽頭、角磨機、鏈鋸等。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "heavy plutonium fuel battery"
msgid_plural "heavy plutonium fuel batteries"
msgstr[0] "重型鈽燃料電池"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "heavy plutonium fuel battery"
#. ~ Description of "heavy plutonium fuel battery"
msgid ""
"A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilize an exotic "
"nanocompound.  It is universally compatible with all kinds of "
"industrial-grade equipment and large tools.  Although it stores a huge amount "
"of power, it cannot be recharged."
msgstr "这种电池使用一根钚-244棒来稳定一种奇特的纳米复合材料，兼容各种工业级设备和大型电动工具。虽然它储存了大量的能量，但它不能被再次充电。"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "military plutonium fuel cell"
msgid_plural "military plutonium fuel cells"
msgstr[0] "軍用鈽燃料電池"

#: data/json/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "military plutonium fuel cell"
#. ~ Description of "military plutonium fuel cell"
msgid ""
"A battery that uses a huge plutonium-244 rod to stabilize an exotic "
"nanocompound.  It was used in military mech-suits, was highly experimental, "
"and had no civilian applications.  Although it stores a stupendous amount of "
"power, it cannot be recharged."
msgstr "这种电池使用一根巨大的钚-244棒来稳定一种奇特的纳米复合材料。供军用机甲使用，实验性质较高，尚未进入民用领域。虽然它储存了大量的能量，但它不能被再次充电。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "abstract faulty bionic module"
msgid "A CBM that is broken beyond repair; you can't do anything with it."
msgstr "一个彻底损坏的CBM，你不能用它做任何事。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Adrenaline Pump CBM"
msgid_plural "Adrenaline Pump CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 腎上腺素幫浦"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Adrenaline Pump CBM"
msgid ""
"A stimulator system that is implanted alongside the adrenal glands, allowing "
"the user to trigger their body's adrenaline response at the cost of some "
"bionic power."
msgstr "在使用者的腎上腺旁植入一個刺激的系統裝置，以消耗一些生化能量來啟動這裝置，讓身體進入充滿腎上腺素的狀態。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Active Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Active Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 主動防禦系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Active Defense System CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic that projects a thin forcefield around the user's body.  Everything "
"loses velocity when penetrating this field, which results in a reduced amount "
"of dealt damage at the cost of user's bionic energy.  Bullets and stabbing "
"attacks will lose more velocity than cutting attacks, and those in turn more "
"than bashing attacks."
msgstr ""
"一个能在受体周围投射出一层薄薄的力场屏障的生化插件。任何穿透这个力场的东西都会失去速度，降低造成的伤害，但同时也会造成额外的能量消耗。子弹和刺击会比斩击失去"
"更多的速度，而这些攻击又会比钝击失去更多的速度。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Alarm System CBM"
msgid_plural "Alarm System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 警報系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Alarm System CBM"
msgid ""
"A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a "
"fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert the user.  This is very useful "
"during sleep, or if the user suspects a cloaked pursuer."
msgstr "一個動態偵測警報系統能夠偵測 5 呎遠的範圍並通知使用者。在睡覺時, 或是懷疑被隱形的生物追蹤時非常有用。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Integrated AR System CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated AR System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "集成AR系统CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated AR System CBM"
msgid "This bionic module integrates augmented reality interface into user's eyes."
msgstr "这个生化插件将增强显示界面整合到使用者的视野当中。\"这下可以安心以高达形态出击了\""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Arms CBM"
msgid_plural "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Arms CBMs"
msgstr[0] "皮下保护网 - 手臂CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Arms CBM"
#. ~ Description of "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Legs CBM"
msgid ""
"An advanced protective mesh that weaves into the user's flesh.  Provides "
"passive protection at the cost of mild encumbrance, and can be used in "
"conjunction with bionic martial arts."
msgstr "先进的网状防护合金，被织入使用者的肌肤。以少许累赘为代价提供被动保护，可结合生化格斗术使用。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Protective Lenses CBM"
msgid_plural "Protective Lenses CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 防護鏡片"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Protective Lenses CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic package that seals the user's eye sockets with highly-protective "
"mirrored lenses and re-routes their tear ducts to their mouth.  When the user "
"cries, they must spit out or swallow their tears."
msgstr "这个生化插件将用高防护性的镜状晶体封闭受体的眼眶，并将泪管重新导向口腔。当使用者哭泣的时候，如果不选择把眼泪吐出来，就只能选择自食其泪了。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Head CBM"
msgid_plural "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Head CBMs"
msgstr[0] "皮下保护网 - 头部CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Head CBM"
msgid ""
"An advanced protective mesh that weaves into the user's flesh, protecting "
"both their head and jaw regions at the cost of mild encumbrance."
msgstr "先进的防护网状合金，被织入使用者的肌肤。以少许累赘为代价，保护了头部和嘴部区域。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Legs CBM"
msgid_plural "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Legs CBMs"
msgstr[0] "皮下保护网 - 腿部CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Torso CBM"
msgid_plural "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Torso CBMs"
msgstr[0] "皮下保护网 - 躯干CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Subcutaneous Protective Mesh - Torso CBM"
msgid ""
"An advanced protective mesh that weaves into the user's flesh, protecting it "
"from physical trauma at the cost of mild encumbrance."
msgstr "先进的防护网状合金，被织入使用者的肌肤。以少许累赘为代价，保护躯干不受创伤。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Battery System CBM"
msgid_plural "Battery System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 電池系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Battery System CBM"
msgid ""
"A battery draining attachment to make use of the energy contained in normal, "
"everyday batteries."
msgstr "一個電池電力抽取插件，能夠從一般的日常電池中提取能量。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
msgid_plural "Monomolecular Blade CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 單分子刀"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
msgid ""
"A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material that is installed inside "
"the forearm, capable of being extended through the back of the user's wrist "
"at the cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will "
"prevent the user from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr "由先進材料製成一英尺長的致命刀刃，安裝在你的前臂裡，耗用少許能量就能夠從手腕背面伸出。雖然它異常鋒利，但是在它伸出時你無法握持任何東西。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Shotgun Arm CBM"
msgid_plural "Shotgun Arm CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM：手臂霰彈槍"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Shotgun Arm CBM"
msgid ""
"A concealed, single shot 12 gauge shotgun that is implanted inside the left "
"forearm.  Perfect in a pinch."
msgstr "一種隱藏式的單發 12 鉛徑的霰彈槍被植入於左前臂中。緊要關頭特別有用。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Blood Analysis CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Analysis CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 血液分析"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Blood Analysis CBM"
msgid ""
"Small sensors that are implanted in the user's heart, allowing them to "
"analyze their blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other "
"conditions."
msgstr "植入使用者心臟的小型傳感器，使他們能夠分析自己的血液。能夠檢測多種疾病、藥物和其他的狀況。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Blood Filter CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Filter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 血液過濾"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Blood Filter CBM"
msgid ""
"A filtration system that is installed in the heart and can actively filter "
"out chemical impurities, primarily drugs, with limited impact on viruses.  "
"Note that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in the system will be "
"affected."
msgstr "安裝在心臟的過濾系統，能夠主動過濾化學雜質，主要是藥物。但是對病毒只有有限的作用。注意這不是針對性的過濾器；藥物會被過濾掉。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cable Charger System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cable Charger System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 電纜充電系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Cable Charger System CBM"
msgid ""
"A complex port that is mounted above the hip.  While active, it will recharge "
"bionic power when connected to a battery via jumper cable."
msgstr "一個安裝在臀部上方的複雜連接埠。啟動後，它會以跨接電纜所連接的電池來補充生化能量。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
msgid_plural "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 碳纖維皮下組織"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
msgid ""
"Thin armor made of carbon nanotubes, implanted just beneath the skin.  It "
"reduces cutting, stabbing and ballistic damage."
msgstr "被植入到皮肤下方的薄层碳纳米管装甲。削弱收到的斩击，刺击和子弹伤害。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Chain Lightning CBM"
msgid_plural "Chain Lightning CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 連鎖電擊"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Chain Lightning CBM"
msgid ""
"A chain lightning generator that emits a blast of lightning at a target, "
"leaving a trail of lightning in its wake and jumping to additional targets "
"within 4 tiles of the previous target."
msgstr "一款鏈狀閃電產生器，朝目標發射一陣閃電，會在尾跡中留下一道閃電痕跡，並且會傳導傷害到目標 4 格內的其他目標。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Bionic Claws CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Claws CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 生化爪"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Bionic Claws CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of vicious, retractable claws that are implanted inside the user's "
"fingers.  They do considerable cutting damage, but prevent the user from "
"holding anything else while extended."
msgstr "受体的手指中植入了可伸缩利爪，伸出时能够造成可观的斩击伤害，但使用者将无法手持任何物品。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Internal Climate Control CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Climate Control CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 恆溫控制系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Internal Climate Control CBM"
msgid ""
"A network of thermal piping which eases the effects of high and low ambient "
"temperatures once activated."
msgstr "一套由熱導管所組成的網路，啟動時能夠減輕高溫或低溫環境帶來的影響。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cloaking System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cloaking System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 偽裝系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Cloaking System CBM"
msgid ""
"A high-power system that uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make the user "
"blend into their surroundings, rendering them fully invisible to eyes and "
"optical sensors.  However, this doesn't prevent detection from other means "
"such as infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr "一套高耗能的隐身系统，由无数的迷你摄像机和LED灯组成，让使用者能与周围环境融为一体，进入可见光隐身状态。但是，隐形系统也无法屏蔽红外视觉或声呐之类的探测。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
msgid_plural "Close Quarters Battle CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 近身格鬥"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of bionic processors and databanks, loaded with martial arts combat "
"programs.  While active, the CQB module will improve the user's hand-to-hand "
"combat skills, but prevents them from improving them through combat "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"一套生化處理器與資料庫，裝載著武術格鬥程式。當啟動時，限制空間戰鬥（Close-Quarters "
"Battle，CQB）模組將提高你的徒手戰鬥技能，但會使你無法透過戰鬥經驗來提高技能。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wired Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Wired Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 神經反射增強"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Wired Reflexes CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of bionic nerve stimulators that greatly enhance reaction times, "
"granting a +2 bonus to dexterity."
msgstr "这套生化神经电极能够极大地缩短反应时间。敏捷+2。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
msgid_plural "Expanded Digestive System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 擴充消化系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
msgid ""
"This module contains three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade intestines "
"which replace the user's corresponding organs.  Not only will these extract "
"much more nutrition from food, but also increase the user's resistance to "
"foodborne illness, and occasionally allow the digestion of rotten food.  "
"Installing this CBM will correct any abnormalities in the user's digestive "
"system."
msgstr ""
"这个生化插件包含三个人造胃囊和工业级人造肠道，用来替换使用者所对应的器官。这套系统不仅可以从食物中吸收更多营养，还能提高使用者对食源性疾病的抵抗力，偶尔也能"
"消化腐败食物。安装此CBM将纠正患者消化系统的任何异常。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Hearing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 聽覺強化"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
msgid ""
"While this bionic is active, the user's hearing will be drastically improved, "
"allowing them to hear ten times better than the average person.  "
"Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before "
"they can damage the user's hearing."
msgstr "当这个生化插件启用时，使用者的听力将极大提高，使其能够达到相当于普通人10倍的听力。此外，高分贝的声音将在使用者听力受到损伤前自动减弱。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "AudioVox CBM"
msgid_plural "AudioVox CBMs"
msgstr[0] "语音合成CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "AudioVox CBM"
msgid ""
"An implanted set of vocal cords and speakers allowing the user to remodulate "
"and project their voice at will."
msgstr "一套植入式声带和扬声器，允许使用者随意调整和投射自己的声音。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "WearMan CBM"
msgid_plural "WearMan CBMs"
msgstr[0] "髓身听CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "WearMan CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of speakers implanted into the skull, able to pick up local radiowaves "
"and play downloaded music."
msgstr "一组植入到你头骨中的扬声器，能够接收本地无线电波，并播放下载的音乐。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Subaquatic Navigation System CBM"
msgid_plural "Subaquatic Navigation System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "水下导航系统CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Subaquatic Navigation System CBM"
msgid ""
"A tiny device implanted in the inner ear.  When active, it will periodically "
"generate ultrasonic pulses which aid in navigation, provided the user is "
"underwater and able to hear."
msgstr "一个植入内耳的小型装置。开启时，它会周期性地发出超声波脉冲，协助你导航，前提是你得在水下并且能听到声音。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Directional EMP CBM"
msgid_plural "Directional EMP CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 指向性EMP"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Directional EMP CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of small parabolic EMP field generators that are mounted in the palm of "
"the user's right hand.  They can be used to instantly fire a wide, but "
"short-ranged blast which will disable electronics and robots."
msgstr "一套小型电磁脉冲抛射器，被植入受体的右手掌心，可以用于瞬时发射一道大范围近程EMP冲击来瘫痪掉电子器械和机器人。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "EMP Projector CBM"
msgid_plural "EMP Projector CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: EMP發射器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "EMP Projector CBM"
msgid ""
"A ranged EMP generator system that is implanted in the user's right arm and "
"hand.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that require time to "
"aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets, but mostly useless "
"otherwise."
msgstr "一套远程电磁脉冲发射器系统，被植入在受体右臂和右手下。这套系统能发射精准的单目标脉冲，需要时间瞄准。对电子目标特别有效，但对其它目标没什么作用。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ethanol Burner CBM"
msgid_plural "Ethanol Burner CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 酒精發電器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Ethanol Burner CBM"
msgid ""
"A reactor that burns alcohol as fuel in an extremely efficient reaction.  It "
"can store up to 500 mL and accepts ethanol, methanol and denatured alcohol as "
"fuel."
msgstr "一个生化酒精反应炉，燃烧效率极高。可以储存 500 毫升乙醇、甲醇或者改性酒精作为燃料。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
msgid_plural "Aero-Evaporator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 濕氣凝水裝置"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
msgid ""
"This unit draws moisture from the surrounding air, which slowly trickles "
"directly into the user's blood stream.  It may fail in very dry environments."
msgstr "这个插件可以从周围的空气中吸收水蒸气，并将其直接低速注入血液之中。在非常干燥的地区，此仪器可能效果不佳。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Diamond Cornea CBM"
msgid_plural "Diamond Cornea CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 鑽石角膜"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Diamond Cornea CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of diamond corneas which greatly enhance the user's vision, granting a "
"+2 bonus to perception."
msgstr "一組可以提升使用者視力的鑽石角膜，額外 +2 點感知。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Telescopic Eyes CBM"
msgid_plural "Telescopic Eyes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 自動對焦眼球"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Telescopic Eyes CBM"
msgid ""
"An array of high-powered, auto-focusing lenses that replaces much of the "
"material in the user's inner eye.  This fixes any vision problems and allows "
"for an increased vision range akin to binoculars."
msgstr "一组高功耗自动对焦镜头，用于替代眼内的大部分组织。可以消除受体的任何视力缺陷，并且能够达到如同望远镜一般的视力范围。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Facial Distortion CBM"
msgid_plural "Facial Distortion CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 易容裝置"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Facial Distortion CBM"
msgid ""
"Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, this bionic "
"module lets the user alter their facial structure so as to subtly affect the "
"reactions of others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr "透過控制施加的電子脈衝，這個生化插件能讓使用者調整臉部結構，從而巧妙地影響他人的反應。在所有社交互動上提供優勢。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
msgid_plural "Dielectric Capacitance System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 絕緣電容系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
msgid ""
"A network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors, implanted throughout the "
"user's body to protect from external electrical discharge."
msgstr "一套微型压电电容网络，植入到全身用于防御外部电击的伤害。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Fingerhack CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerhack CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 手指駭客"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Fingerhack CBM"
msgid ""
"A miniature electrohack, surgically embedded in a finger of the user's right "
"hand.  This is an all-purpose hacking unit used to override control panels "
"and the like, but not computers.  Computer proficiency is important, and a "
"failed use may cause damage."
msgstr ""
"一台微型电子黑客仪，通过手术植入到右手的一根手指中。这种通用黑客单元可以用于覆写控制面板及类似的系统，但是不能用于电脑。使用者的计算机专长对成功至关重要，每"
"次失败的尝试都有可能造成身体损伤。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Calorie Tracker CBM"
msgid_plural "Calorie Tracker CBMs"
msgstr[0] "卡路里追踪器 CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Calorie Tracker CBM"
msgid ""
"A small medical implant that passively tracks your calorie expenditure and "
"consumption."
msgstr "一种小型医疗植入物，可以被动跟踪你的卡路里消耗。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Flashbang Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Flashbang Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 閃光產生器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Flashbang Generator CBM"
msgid ""
"A combination of LEDs and speakers that create a flash and sound comparable "
"to a flashbang grenade, deafening and blinding nearby enemies."
msgstr "由LED和喇叭組成，能產生媲美閃光彈的閃光與聲響，弄聾弄瞎周圍的敵人。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
msgid_plural "Cranial Flashlight CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 頭顱燈"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
msgid "A small, but powerful LED flashlight that is mounted between the user's eyes."
msgstr "一颗小型高功率LED灯，植入于两眼之间。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "LED Tattoo CBM"
msgid_plural "LED Tattoo CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: LED 紋身"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "LED Tattoo CBM"
msgid ""
"An LED display implanted beneath the epidermis that can display patterns or "
"pictures through the skin.  When active it glows dimly, providing a very "
"small amount of light."
msgstr "植入皮膚表皮層下方的LED燈組，可通過皮膚顯示圖案或圖片。當啟用時，它會發出昏暗的光線，提供非常少量的光源。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Integrated Dosimeter CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Dosimeter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 輻射量測表"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated Dosimeter CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of small radiation sensors that are implanted throughout the body, "
"allowing the user to analyze their level of absorbed radiation.  They will "
"also alert the user whenever exposed to environmental radiation."
msgstr "一套小型辐射传感器已经植入使用者的身体，可以让使用者分析其辐射吸收量级。该装置也会提醒使用者是否暴露于辐射环境。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Respirator CBM"
msgid_plural "Respirator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM：呼吸器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Respirator CBM"
msgid ""
"A complex respiration augmentation system that increases the user's maximal "
"oxygen uptake and allows for underwater breathing akin to gills.  Will "
"automatically activate if the user is drowning."
msgstr "一整套複雜的呼吸增強系統。可以強化使用者對氧氣的利用，並允許使用者在水中呼吸，當溺水時會自動開啟。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Terranian Sonar CBM"
msgid_plural "Terranian Sonar CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 地形聲納"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Terranian Sonar CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of precision sonar equipment, implanted in the user's feet to allow the "
"detection of below-ground movement, buried traps, and unstable terrain."
msgstr "一套植入在脚掌上的精密声纳设备，可以探测地下生物的移动、掩埋的陷阱和不稳定的地形。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Heat Drain CBM"
msgid_plural "Heat Drain CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 熱能吸收"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Heat Drain CBM"
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of "
"extra damage and recharging the user's bionic power reserves slightly."
msgstr "当使用者成功徒手攻击恒温生物一次，你有一定几率吸取目标体内的热能，造成少量的额外伤害并增加少量的生化能量。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
msgid_plural "Thermal Dissipation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 散熱裝置"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of powerful heatsinks and supermaterials woven into the user's flesh.  "
"While powered, this system will prevent external heat damage up to 2000 "
"degrees Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect the internal body "
"temperature."
msgstr "一套强力散热片和超织物被植入了受体体内，供电时可以防护低于2000华氏度（约1093摄氏度）的外部高温伤害。注意，这不会影响受体的内部体温。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
msgid_plural "Hydraulic Muscles CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 液壓肌肉"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
msgid ""
"A hydraulic muscle support system that when active, increases the user's "
"strength by 20."
msgstr "一套液压肌肉支持系统，启用时力量+20。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Infrared Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Infrared Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 紅外線視覺"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Infrared Vision CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic module that extends the user's range of vision into the infrared, "
"allowing them to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark and through smoke."
msgstr "这个生化插件将受体的视觉扩展到红外波段，使其能够在黑暗中或透过烟雾看见恒温动物。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cerebral Booster CBM"
msgid_plural "Cerebral Booster CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 腦波增強"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Cerebral Booster CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of bionic coprocessors that are implanted in the user's brain, granting "
"a +2 bonus to intelligence.  It takes over and replaces numerous cognitive "
"functions once installed and cannot be removed."
msgstr "一套生物处理芯片，植入使用者的脑中，提供 +2 智力。它一经安装就接管替代了许多的认知功能，并且不能够移除。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger-Mounted Laser CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 指尖雷射"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
msgid ""
"A small, high-powered laser that is embedded in the user's fingertip.  This "
"long-range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very accurate, and has "
"the potential to start fires."
msgstr "一个小型大功率激光发射器嵌在指尖上。这种远程武器伤害不高，但是异常精准，还有可能点燃目标。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
msgid_plural "Leukocyte Breeder System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 白血球培養系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of bionic stimulators which augment the user's haematopoiesis system, "
"allowing them to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic power.  "
"It is designed for continuous use and may cause unpleasant side effects when "
"turned off."
msgstr "这个生化激励系统增强了受体的造血系统，使其能够消耗生化能量加速白细胞的生成。它应当保持持续运行，开启后再关闭可能造成不良影响。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Finger Lighter CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger Lighter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM：指尖打火機"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Finger Lighter CBM"
msgid ""
"A pair of powerful fire starters which extend from the tip of both hands' "
"index fingers."
msgstr "一对强大的喷火器，植入到了受体双手的食指中。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Fingerpick CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerpick CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 手指開鎖器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Fingerpick CBM"
msgid ""
"An electronic lockpick that is embedded in a fingertip.  This automatic "
"system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key locks without any "
"skill required on the part of the user."
msgstr "植入指尖的电子开锁器。这个全自动开锁器可以迅速打开除了最先进以外的所有钥匙锁，不需要使用者掌握任何开锁技能。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electromagnetic Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 電磁元件"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
msgid ""
"A powerful electromagnet that is implanted into the user's right hand, "
"allowing them to indiscriminately pull all nearby magnetic objects towards "
"them.  Unlucky bystanders might be injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr "一個強力的電磁鐵將植入使用者的右手，使他們能夠隨意的將附近的磁性物體拉向自己。運氣不好的傢伙可能會被飛來的物體傷害甚至殺死。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Nictitating Membrane CBM"
msgid_plural "Nictitating Membrane CBMs"
msgstr[0] "人工瞬膜CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Nictitating Membrane CBM"
msgid ""
"Thin membranes that cover the user's eyes while underwater, negating any "
"vision penalties."
msgstr "在水下会自动覆盖受体眼球的人造瞬膜，能消除所有水下视觉惩罚。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Memory Banks CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 記憶庫強化"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of highly-advanced quantum storage drives used to enhance memory.  "
"While active, they increase the rate that the user learns skills.  Once it is "
"installed, it will partially replace the functionality of the hippocampus, "
"and thus cannot be removed without risk of severe permanent amnesia and "
"difficulty forming new memories."
msgstr ""
"一组用于增强内存的高度先进的量子存储驱动器。激活时，加快使用者学习技能的速度。一旦安装完毕，它将取代部分海马体的功能，将其移除会造成严重的永久性失忆并且难以"
"形成新的记忆。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
msgid_plural "Metabolic Interchange CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 代謝交換器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
msgid ""
"This module interconnects the user's digestive system and power supply, "
"letting them replenish bionic energy by burning calories."
msgstr "這模組連結了使用者的消化系統與能源供應，讓你能夠消耗卡路里來補充生化能量。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Weather Reader CBM"
msgid_plural "Weather Reader CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 天氣預報"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Weather Reader CBM"
msgid ""
"A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collects environmental "
"data.  The data are compiled and presented as a simple readout of the current "
"weather.  It also passively tells the user their external temperature."
msgstr "一堆科学装置和感应器的整合系统。用来收集周围环境的数据，这些数据随后将会被分析并汇总成为易于读取的目前天气的情况报告。它还可被动显示使用者的外部温度。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Repair Nanobots CBM"
msgid_plural "Repair Nanobots CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 奈米機器人修復器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Repair Nanobots CBM"
msgid ""
"A fleet of tiny, dormant robots.  While activated, they will flit about the "
"user's body, repairing damage and stopping bleeding at the cost of power."
msgstr "一群微型纳米机器人。开启时会不断消耗能量，绕行使用者的周身，修复伤害以及止血。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Artificial Night Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 黑夜產生器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 2 tile radius of the "
"user through destructive interference."
msgstr "开启时，这个生化插件会通过干扰光线来消除附近2格内所有的光源。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Implanted Night Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 植入式夜視鏡"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
msgid ""
"This bionic module modifies the user's eyes to amplify existing light, "
"allowing them to see in the dark."
msgstr "这个生化插件通过放大微弱光线的方式改造使用者的眼球，增强夜视能力。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Offensive Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Offensive Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 攻擊性防禦系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Offensive Defense System CBM"
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield gets projected around the user's body, continually draining "
"power.  This field does not deflect attacks, but rather delivers a strong "
"shock, damaging unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr "当该系统激活时，一层护盾会投影在使用者身体周围，并持续消耗能量。这层护盾不会格挡或偏移任何攻击，但是会电击徒手或使用导电武器攻击使用者的敌人。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sensory Dulling CBM"
msgid_plural "Sensory Dulling CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 知覺阻隔"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Sensory Dulling CBM"
msgid ""
"This module lets the user's nervous system inhibit pain signals, allowing "
"them to dull their senses at will.  However, the use of this system may cause "
"delayed reaction times and drowsiness."
msgstr "這個模組能讓使用者抑制神經底下的疼痛訊號，使你可以麻痺自己的感官。然而，使用這個系統可能導製遲鈍和嗜睡等症狀。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Power Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 能量儲存室"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Power Storage CBM"
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module that upgrades the user's power capacity by 100 "
"units.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered "
"bionics.  The user will also need a power supply, found in various CBMs."
msgstr "這個整合生化插件模組能夠提升你的能量儲存 100 個單位。至少要有一個這種插件才能驅動其他生化插件。你也需要一個能夠供給能量的 CBM。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Power Storage Mk. II CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Storage Mk. II CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 能量儲存室 Mk. II"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Power Storage Mk. II CBM"
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module developed at DoubleTech Industries as a replacement "
"for the highly successful Power Storage CBM.  Increases the user's power "
"capacity by 250 units."
msgstr "DoubleTech 工業開發的整合式生化插件模組，這個型號是能量儲存室 CBM 的新一代。能夠增加你的能量儲存量 250 單位。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Probability Travel CBM"
msgid_plural "Probability Travel CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 分解傳輸"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Probability Travel CBM"
msgid ""
"Increases the body's wavelength, allowing the user to quantum tunnel through "
"walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, but "
"each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr "增加身體的波長, 讓使用者能夠以量子穿隧的方式穿過牆壁出現在另一邊。待命時的能量消耗少, 但是每穿梭一格時會耗用 250 點生化能量。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Air Filtration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Air Filtration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 空氣濾淨系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Air Filtration System CBM"
msgid ""
"An advanced filtration system that is implanted in the user's trachea.  If "
"toxins or airborne diseases find their way into the windpipe, the filter will "
"attempt to remove them."
msgstr "一套先进的空气过滤系统，被植入进受体气管中。不管进入气管的是有毒气体还是通过空气传播的病菌，这个过滤器都会试图去过滤它们。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Infolink CBM"
msgid_plural "Infolink CBMs"
msgstr[0] "脑内无线电CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Infolink CBM"
msgid ""
"A wireless communications device that integrates with the ear canal to enable "
"hands-free communication over radio waves."
msgstr "一个无线通信装置，整合到使用者的耳道，使其拥有无线电交流的能力。\"在发号施令时解放你的双手\""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
msgid_plural "Radiation Scrubber System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 輻射淨化系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
msgid ""
"A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters that are implanted "
"throughout the body, allowing the user to purge themself of absorbed "
"radiation at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr "一种先进的压电式血液透析装置，植入了受体的体内，使之可以通过消耗生化能量来清除体内的辐射。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Fingertip Razors CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingertip Razors CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 指尖刀刃"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Fingertip Razors CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of ten double-edged, four centimeter long razor-sharp claws that are "
"implanted underneath the fingernails.  They deal a small amount of unarmed "
"slashing damage whenever the user's fingertips are uncovered."
msgstr "一套由十个四厘米长的利刃组成的，剃刀般锋利的爪子，植入进受体的指甲之下。当受体的指尖没有被盖住时，徒手攻击时可以用它们造成少量额外的斩击伤害。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM"
msgid_plural "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM：汽油燃料電池"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM"
msgid ""
"A small gasoline fuel cell able to convert gasoline to bionic power.  It's "
"connected to a diffuse network of bio-plastic bladders able to hold up to 500 "
"mL of gasoline."
msgstr "这是一个小型汽油燃料电池，可以将汽油转化为生化能量。一套生物塑胶制成的液囊扩散网络与其连接，能够存放最多 500 毫升的汽油。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Recycler Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Recycler Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 回收消化器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Recycler Unit CBM"
msgid ""
"A series of filters and processors that is implanted in the user's digestive "
"system, allowing them to reclaim waste liquid and, to a lesser degree, "
"nutrients.  The net effect is a greatly reduced need to eat and drink."
msgstr "一系列的过滤器和处理器被植入到受体的消化系统中，使其能够重新吸收废弃液体和少量营养物质，最终大幅度降低受体的饮食需求。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Remote Controller CBM"
msgid_plural "Remote Controller CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 遠端遙控"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Remote Controller CBM"
msgid ""
"A small module that connects to the user's brain and allows them to interface "
"with nearby devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr "一个连接至受体大脑的小模块，可以与附近有无线功能的设备联动。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sonic Resonator CBM"
msgid_plural "Sonic Resonator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 聲波共振器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Sonic Resonator CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic module that allows the user's entire body to resonate at very high "
"power, creating a short-range shockwave.  While it will not do much damage to "
"creatures, solid objects such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr "这个生化插件能使使用者的全身在极高的能量下产生共振，产生一道短距冲击波。虽然这道冲击波无法对生物造成多少伤害，但其能够损坏坚硬的物体，比如说墙壁或者门。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Olfactory Mask CBM"
msgid_plural "Olfactory Mask CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 氣味遮罩"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Olfactory Mask CBM"
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, the user's body will produce very little odor, "
"making it nearly impossible for creatures to track them by scent."
msgstr "当该系统激活时，使用者的身体只会产生很少的气味，使得其他生物几乎不可能通过气味来跟踪他们。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Electroshock Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electroshock Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 電擊元件"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Electroshock Unit CBM"
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is "
"a chance that a successful hit will shock the user's opponent, inflicting "
"extra damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr "当使用者徒手搏斗或者使用可导电的武器时，有一定几率消耗部分能量电击对手，造成额外伤害并暂时使目标失去行动能力。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Shockwave Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Shockwave Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 震波產生器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Shockwave Generator CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic module that generates a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby "
"creatures.  Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun upon "
"impact with impassable terrain, and knock back any creatures they collide "
"with."
msgstr ""
"生化插件可以产生一道强力的冲击波，击退所有附近的生物并造成短暂的眩晕，如果撞击在无法通行的地形上将造成额外的伤害和眩晕，被击退生物碰撞到的其他生物也会被一同"
"击退。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Accelerator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 突觸加速器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A set of bionic stimulators that enhance the user's nervous system, granting "
"a 10% boost to speed."
msgstr "这套生化神经电极能增强神经系统，为行动速度带来10%的提升。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
msgid_plural "Muscle Augmentation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 肌肉增強"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of myomer fibers that enhance the user's muscular system, granting a +2 "
"bonus to strength."
msgstr "一套能够增强使用者肌肉系统的生化纤维，力量+2。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
msgid_plural "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 自動外科手術刀"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
msgid ""
"A system of surgical-grade scalpels that is implanted in the user's fingers.  "
"They allow for automated precise cuts and can be used as a high-quality "
"butchering tool."
msgstr "一套外科级别的手术刀植入在用户的手指上。能够自动进行精确切割。也可以用作高级屠宰工具。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgid_plural "Anti-Glare Compensators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 眩光防護裝置"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of quick-reacting transition lenses that are installed over the user's "
"eyes.  They negate glare penalties, partially protect from bright flashes, "
"and protect the eyes when welding."
msgstr "一副安裝在使用者眼中的快速反應變色鏡片，能夠防止任何閃光炫光對與視覺的傷害，且在焊接時保護雙眼。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Synthetic Lungs CBM"
msgid_plural "Synthetic Lungs CBMs"
msgstr[0] "合成肺脏CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Synthetic Lungs CBM"
msgid ""
"Highly efficient synthetic lungs which replace the user's own.  After "
"installation the user's cardio fitness will be greatly increased and will not "
"need regular exercise to maintain but the user will need continuous power to "
"remain breathing.  Further, they will weaken the user's immune system "
"somewhat."
msgstr ""
"我们先进的合成肺已经全面超越了用户老式的肺，安装后，用户的有氧健身能力将大大提高，而且不需要定期锻炼来维持，但用户需要持续的动力来保持呼吸。此外，它们会在一"
"定程度上削弱用户的免疫系统。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Targeting System CBM"
msgid_plural "Targeting System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 瞄準系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Targeting System CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic module that contains rangefinders and synchronizes the movement of "
"the user's eyes with their arms, to a degree.  Shots they fire will be much "
"more accurate, particularly at long ranges."
msgstr "这个生化插件内含测距仪，并且能在一定程度上使使用者的眼睛与手臂保持同步。使用者的枪击将会更精准，特别是在长距离上。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Super Stun Gun CBM"
msgid_plural "Super Stun Gun CBMs"
msgstr[0] "超级电击枪CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Super Stun Gun CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic stun gun which implants into the hand.  It is highly powerful, able "
"to easily cause electrical burns and cardiac arrest in targets.  The "
"electricity it generates arcs through the air over short distances, making it "
"nearly impossible to miss, but it still requires the user to be nearly "
"adjacent to their target."
msgstr "一种植入手部的仿生电击枪。它非常强大，很容易就能对目标造成电烧伤，并令其心脏骤停。虽然它在短距离的空气中产生的电弧百发百中，但用户依然得靠近目标使用。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Teleportation Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 空間傳送"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgid ""
"A highly experimental unit that folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting the user's body up to 25 feet in a random direction at the cost "
"of much power.  Note that prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"这个高度实验性质的生化插件可将空间折叠，进行短距离传送。通过消耗大量能量，使用者可以传送至25英尺（约7.6"
"米）外随机方向的一个地方。需要注意的是长期或者频繁使用可能有危险的副作用。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Time Dilation CBM"
msgid_plural "Time Dilation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 時間膨脹"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Time Dilation CBM"
msgid ""
"At the cost of all stored bionic power, the user may increase their body "
"speed and reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  Violent or "
"rapid movements may cause damage due to friction."
msgstr "通过消耗体内所有储存的生化插件能量，使用者可以极大的提升自己的速度和反应能力，就好像把时间冻结了一样。但是，剧烈或高速下运动产生的空气摩擦可能会导致受伤。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Integrated Multitool CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Multitool CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 多功能整合工具手"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multitool CBM"
msgid ""
"A surgically-implanted set of compact tools and a welder which runs off the "
"user's power banks.  Includes screwdriving heads, a multi-purpose knife, a "
"low-power impact wrench and a nail prying tool."
msgstr "一套小型工具和一台焊机通过外科手术植入了你的体内，并使用体内的生化能量供能。这套工具包括螺丝刀、多功能刀、低功耗冲击扳手和撬钉工具。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Integrated Multimeter CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Multimeter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 內置三用電表"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multimeter CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of electrical leads to be embedded in the user's fingers, connected to "
"a multimeter unit in their hand.  Allows the user to measure voltage, "
"resistance, and current using their fingertips, and provides slight "
"protection against electric shocks."
msgstr "一組電線被植入了使用者的手指中，並連接到手臂裏的萬用表上。可以讓使用者用指尖測量電壓、電阻和電流，並提供少許電擊防護。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Integrated Circuitry Toolset CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Circuitry Toolset CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 整合電子工具手"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated Circuitry Toolset CBM"
msgid ""
"A soldering iron, multimeter, and set of fine screwdrivers implanted in the "
"user's hands.  Contains all the tools required for manipulating bench-scale "
"electrical circuits, and provides slight protection against electric shocks."
msgstr "烙鐵、三用電表和一套精細的螺絲刀被植入了使用者的手中。包含制造小型電子電路所需的全套工具，並提供少許電擊防護。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 關節發電機"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of torsion ratchets that replace the user's joints to slowly generate "
"power when they move.  These can be toggled to generate more power, but "
"movement will require more effort."
msgstr "一套会替换使用者的关节的动力齿轮，能在其移动时缓慢恢复生化能量。启动即可开始产生能量，但是移动会更加费力。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Joint Servo CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Servo CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM：關節伺服馬達"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Joint Servo CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of servomotors installed on the leg joints to provide power-assisted "
"movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also requires less "
"effort while this bionic is active.  However, when it's offline it will "
"hamper the user's movement."
msgstr ""
"一套安装在腿部关节上的伺服电机，能为运动提供辅助动力。它们能提高跑步速度，同时当该生化插件开启时，步行也会更加轻松。然而，当它关闭时，未工作的移动部件会阻碍"
"行动。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid_plural "Uncanny Dodge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 閃避直覺"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of bionic processors that augment the user's nervous system, allowing "
"them to dodge attacks beyond normal human capability."
msgstr "一套生化处理器，能够增强使用者的神经系统，使其能够以远超常人的水平回避攻击。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Unified Power System CBM"
msgid_plural "Unified Power System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: UPS系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Unified Power System CBM"
msgid ""
"A Unified Power System that is wired into the user's bionic power banks.  "
"Objects that run on a UPS can now directly draw power from the bionic power "
"supply."
msgstr "一套統一規格供電系統（UPS）裝到使用者體內的生化能量庫，使用 UPS 供電的物品現在可以直接使用生化能量了。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Internal Chronometer CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Chronometer CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 內部計時器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Internal Chronometer CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic module containing an atomic clock, complete with a silent alarm "
"clock function."
msgstr "一个包含了一个原子钟的生化插件，具有无声闹钟功能。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Water Extraction Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 水分萃取元件"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
msgid ""
"A module containing nanotubes that are embedded in the palm of the user's "
"hand to pump any available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of "
"impurities, and convert it into potable water.  Water container not included."
msgstr "这个模块包含了一套纳米管，能够植入到掌心，用于从尸体中提取可用的液体，净化并转换为可饮用的净水。不过，你必须有个装水的容器。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Intravenous Needletip CBM"
msgid_plural "Intravenous Needletip CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 靜脈注射針"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Intravenous Needletip CBM"
msgid ""
"A small tube with a retractable needle that terminates in a net of tiny hoses "
"instead of a plunger.  When installed, it allows the user to draw substances "
"directly into their bloodstream akin to a regular syringe."
msgstr "一个带有可伸缩针头的小型注射管，但针管末端是网状细管而非柱状活塞。安装后，使用者可以通过注射管将针剂直接引入血液之中，达成类似注射针筒的功能。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM"
msgid_plural "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 鈦製骨架支撐"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of hinges, springs, and other synthetic augments for the skeletal "
"structure.  These artificial enhancers strengthen the knees and elbows, "
"allowing the user to carry more weight.  The reinforcement also provides 2 "
"bashing armor to the torso, legs and arms."
msgstr ""
"一副由各种铰链，弹簧，和其他合成材料增强过的骨架被植入了使用者的体内。这些生化强化装置加强了膝盖和肘部关节，让使用者能够携带更多的重量。它同时也为躯干、手部"
"、及腿部提供2点钝击防护。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Taste Modifier CBM"
msgid_plural "Taste Modifier CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM：味覺置換"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Taste Modifier CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of highly-sensitive sensors implanted in the user's mouth, combined "
"with a sophisticated analyzer.  While active, it will block all unpleasant "
"taste and texture at the cost of bionic energy."
msgstr "一套极其敏感的传感器被植入到了使用者的口腔，附有一个复杂的分析装置。开启时，它可以通过消耗生化能量来屏蔽不佳的味道和质感。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Soporific Induction CBM"
msgid_plural "Soporific Induction CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM：助眠誘導"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Soporific Induction CBM"
msgid ""
"A microscopic electrode designed to gently stimulate a particular cluster of "
"neurons in the hypothalamus, helping the user to fall asleep."
msgstr "一种微小的电极，设计用来轻轻地刺激使用者下丘脑的一组神经元，帮助其入睡。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Squeaky Ankles CBM"
msgid_plural "Squeaky Ankles CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 嘎嘎踝關節"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Squeaky Ankles CBM"
msgid "A pair of defective bionics that make squeaking noises."
msgstr "一对发出吱吱噪音的故障生化插件。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Bionic-Induced Deformity CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic-Induced Deformity CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 生化畸形誘發"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Bionic-Induced Deformity CBM"
msgid ""
"A jumble of broken metal pieces that were removed during reconstructive "
"surgery."
msgstr "一坨金屬廢料，在重建手術中取出。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Acidic Discharge CBM"
msgid_plural "Acidic Discharge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 酸液洩漏"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Acidic Discharge CBM"
msgid "A CBM that has been breached in several places.  Some acid is leaking from it."
msgstr "一个有几处已经破损的生化插件。一些酸液正从中泄漏出来。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Electrical Discharge CBM"
msgid_plural "Electrical Discharge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 電力洩漏"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Electrical Discharge CBM"
msgid ""
"A formerly-functional CBM that is now a mess of naked wires and burnt "
"resistors."
msgstr "一个已经变成了一堆乱七八糟的裸露电线和烧毁电阻的生化插件。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Electrical Drain CBM"
msgid_plural "Electrical Drain CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 電力流失"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Electrical Drain CBM"
msgid ""
"This CBM was wired incorrectly and would drain power from any system "
"connected to it."
msgstr "此生化插件接線錯誤，會消耗任何連接的能源。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Itchy Metal Thing CBM"
msgid_plural "Itchy Metal Thing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 很癢的金屬東西"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Itchy Metal Thing CBM"
msgid ""
"You can't recognize what this is supposed to be, but you imagine it'd be a "
"very awkward thing to have in one's body."
msgstr "你不知道这是什么，但是你可以想象到它在你的身体里时会令你非常不舒服。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Glowy Thing CBM"
msgid_plural "Glowy Thing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 發出微光的玩意兒"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Glowy Thing CBM"
msgid "It's a… thing?  And it glows, at least it did when it was installed."
msgstr "这是……某种东西，至少安装在身上后会发光的东西。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Leaky Bionic CBM"
msgid_plural "Leaky Bionic CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 生化洩漏"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Leaky Bionic CBM"
msgid ""
"A mess of pierced pipes and broken seals, something unpleasant is leaking "
"from it."
msgstr "一堆破損的管子和失效的封條，不停漏出令人不快的東西。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Noisemaker CBM"
msgid_plural "Noisemaker CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 噪音產生器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Noisemaker CBM"
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  When installed, it occasionally emits a loud burst "
"of noise."
msgstr "一个出现故障的生化插件。当安装在身上时，它偶尔会发出一阵巨大的噪声。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Bionic Nostril CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Nostril CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 生化鼻孔"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Bionic Nostril CBM"
msgid "This thing was up someone's nose, they're probably glad to be rid of it."
msgstr "這玩意兒曾經裝在某人的鼻子上，他八成很高興已經擺脫它了。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Bionic Visual Impairment CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Visual Impairment CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 視覺障礙"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Bionic Visual Impairment CBM"
msgid "A defective bionic that impairs vision."
msgstr "这个故障的生化插件减弱了受体的视力。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Power Overload CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Overload CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 能量超載"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Power Overload CBM"
msgid "A bunch of defective power circuits that are prone to short-circuiting."
msgstr "一堆故障的功率电路，随时会短路。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Bionic Short Circuit CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Short Circuit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 插件短路"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Bionic Short Circuit CBM"
msgid "This bionic is poorly wired and occasionally short-circuits."
msgstr "这个生化插件的接线很乱，偶尔会短路。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Endocrine Enervator CBM"
msgid_plural "Endocrine Enervator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 內分泌削弱"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Endocrine Enervator CBM"
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic that causes sleepiness by altering the unfortunate "
"user's brain chemistry."
msgstr "这个故障的生化插件改变了它倒霉受体的脑部化学过程，使得受体容易犯困。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Synaptic Regeneration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Regeneration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 神經突觸再生系統"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Synaptic Regeneration System CBM"
msgid ""
"An electromagnetic stimulator surgically implanted on the back of the head "
"and along the spine, continually draining power.  As long as it's active, the "
"user will not suffer from sleep deprivation, although they may still feel "
"sleepy; if activated by a user that is already sleep-deprived, it will "
"gradually reduce the symptoms of lacking sleep."
msgstr ""
"一套电磁刺激装置被植入到你的后脑和脊柱上，不断地消耗着生化能量。当被激活时，你就不会受到睡眠不足的惩罚，尽管你仍会困倦；如果开启时你已经睡眠不足了，它将逐渐"
"减轻睡眠不足的症状。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Motor Control Overstimulator CBM"
msgid_plural "Motor Control Overstimulator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 機電過載"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Motor Control Overstimulator CBM"
msgid ""
"The result of poor configuration, this bionic module frequently causes "
"debilitating muscle spasms."
msgstr "作为胡乱安装的后果，这个生化插件经常造成肌肉痉挛，使人虚弱。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBM"
msgid_plural "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 僵化線材"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBM"
msgid "A length of poorly installed wiring that would cause stiffness."
msgstr "一根错误安装的电线，会造成身体的僵直。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Self-Locking Thumbs CBM"
msgid_plural "Self-Locking Thumbs CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 自鎖大拇指"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Self-Locking Thumbs CBM"
msgid "A pair of faulty, self-locking thumb bionics."
msgstr "一对故障的自锁大拇指生化插件。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Visual Disruptor CBM"
msgid_plural "Visual Disruptor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 視覺干擾"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Visual Disruptor CBM"
msgid ""
"A pair of defective ocular bionics that cause visual distortion and "
"pixelation."
msgstr "一对故障的眼部生化插件，会造成视觉失真和像素化。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Voice Remodulator CBM"
msgid_plural "Voice Remodulator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 機械變聲器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Voice Remodulator CBM"
msgid ""
"Part of the Autodoc's 'Cyborg Identity Package', this bionic gives the user a "
"creepy robot voice."
msgstr "这个生化插件是全自动医疗仪的\"改造人身份套餐\"的一部分，使受体的声音变成令人毛骨悚然的机械音。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Electromagnetic Leak CBM"
msgid_plural "Electromagnetic Leak CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 電磁洩漏"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Electromagnetic Leak CBM"
msgid ""
"A broken implant that sends electromagnetic impulses that reduce other "
"implants' capacity to store charge."
msgstr "一个会不断发出电磁脉冲，降低其他储能生化插件容量的损坏生化插件。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Oil Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Oil Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 燃油發電機"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Oil Generator CBM"
msgid ""
"A CBM that generates power out of kerosene or motor oil.  It is fairly "
"efficient and can store up to 750 mL of fuel, but works somewhat slowly."
msgstr "燃烧煤油或机油的供能 CBM。它的转换率相当高，可以储存最多 750 毫升的燃油，但能量恢复速度较慢。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Taste Fouler CBM"
msgid_plural "Taste Fouler CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 味覺失靈"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Taste Fouler CBM"
msgid ""
"A broken and mis-wired module that would cause food and drink to taste "
"terrible if installed."
msgstr "一个坏掉的、接线错误的生化插件，会让食物和饮料的味道变得糟糕。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Radioactive Leak CBM"
msgid_plural "Radioactive Leak CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 輻射洩漏"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Radioactive Leak CBM"
msgid ""
"A broken CBM that has been leaking radiation into its user.  The danger seems "
"to have been sealed off during the removal process, but you definitely "
"shouldn't put it back."
msgstr "一个持续泄漏辐射的破损的CBM。大部分辐射泄漏似乎在移除时已被封存，但把它装回体内绝对是个坏主意。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Recoil Compensators CBM"
msgid_plural "Recoil Compensators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 後座力補償器"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Recoil Compensators CBM"
msgid ""
"A CBM that contains shock absorbers and kinetic braces which greatly reduce "
"the recoil of guns."
msgstr "一个包含减震器和动力支架的CBM，可大大减少枪械后坐力。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sleep Mode Shutdown CBM"
msgid_plural "Sleep Mode Shutdown CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 睡眠關機"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Sleep Mode Shutdown CBM"
msgid ""
"A CBM that completely shuts down all communication between the user's brain "
"and the rest of their body when they fall asleep, preventing them from waking "
"up under any circumstance until their natural sleep cycle completes.  An "
"inability to trigger its effects manually makes it useless as an anesthesia "
"substitute."
msgstr ""
"这个CBM完全关闭使用者入睡时大脑与身体其他部位之间的所有通信，防止他们在任何情况下醒来，直到他们的自然睡眠周期结束。由于无法手动触发其效果，因此无法作为麻"
"醉替代品使用。"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Throwing Assist CBM"
msgid_plural "Throwing Assist CBMs"
msgstr[0] "投掷辅助CBM"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Throwing Assist CBM"
msgid ""
"The culmination of decades of research into hominid palaeoanthropology and "
"biomechanical modeling, the throwing assist CBM was brought to market to "
"revolutionize Beqball tournaments, soon becoming exhibitions of cybernetic "
"human effort and engineering.  A network of neurostimulators and sensors, "
"mostly in the arms and hands, work in tandem with the eyes for a significant "
"increase in throwing accuracy and precision.  When the Exodii came upon this "
"cybernetic enhancement suite, they found it to be an economical way to ensure "
"precise grenade placement in partial cyborgs."
msgstr ""
"几十年来，对古人类学和生物力学建模的研究达到了顶峰，投掷辅助CBM也被推向市场，比克球锦标赛被彻底改变，很快成为改造人们的努力和工程的展览。位于手臂和手掌的"
"神经刺激器和传感器网络与眼睛协同工作，显著提高了投掷的精准度。当流亡族发现这种CBM时，他们发现这是一种廉价的方案，可以让改造人们精准投出手榴弹。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bird litter"
msgid_plural "bird litter"
msgstr[0] "禽類排泄物"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "bird litter"
msgid "Bird droppings, feathers, and soiled bits of rubbish."
msgstr "鳥糞、羽毛和髒污的垃圾。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cow pie"
msgid_plural "cow pies"
msgstr[0] "牛糞"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "cow pie"
msgid "A fresh cow pie; this could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr "一坨新鮮的牛糞；不只可用來插鮮花，還可用來製作一些很好的肥料。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dog dung"
msgid_plural "dog dungs"
msgstr[0] "狗屎"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "dog dung"
msgid "Droppings from a canine."
msgstr "來自犬類的糞便。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "manure"
msgid_plural "manure"
msgstr[0] "糞"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "manure"
msgid "Common manure, could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr "一般糞便，可用來製作一些肥料。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "roach dirt"
msgid_plural "roach dirt"
msgstr[0] "蟑螂屎"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "roach dirt"
msgid "Large black pellets of rotting material."
msgstr "大塊黑色顆粒的腐爛物質。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fetid goop"
msgid_plural "fetid goops"
msgstr[0] "惡臭黏液"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "fetid goop"
msgid ""
"A foul-smelling goop.  It has a disgusting texture and a powerful smell that "
"overwhelms every other smell around it."
msgstr "一團聞起來很臭的黏液。它具有令人噁心的質感和強烈到會蓋過附近所有氣味的強烈氣味。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chitin dust"
msgid_plural "chitin dust"
msgstr[0] "甲殼粉塵"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "chitin dust"
msgid ""
"The dust left over by winged insects such as butterflies or moths.  It's "
"mostly chitin but may also contain dirt and other gross materials."
msgstr "蝴蝶或飞蛾等有翅膀的昆虫留下的粉尘。其主要成分为甲壳素，但也可能含有泥土和其他恶心的材料。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shed snakeskin"
msgid_plural "shed snakeskins"
msgstr[0] "蛇蜕"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "shed snakeskin"
msgid ""
"A small length of shed snakeskin.  It's thin and translucent but still bears "
"the distinct pattern of scales."
msgstr "一小块脱落的蛇皮。它薄而半透明，但仍然带有明显的蛇鳞图案。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "shed snakeskin"
msgid ""
"The molted dermis of an adult snake.  This one is in one piece.  You can even "
"see the individual eyes."
msgstr "成年蛇蜕下来的蛇皮。这个是一体的。你甚至可以看到每只眼睛。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "big shed snakeskin"
msgid_plural "big shed snakeskins"
msgstr[0] "大型蛇蜕"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "big shed snakeskin"
msgid ""
"A very large shed snakeskin.  This didn't come from anything native, or "
"natural, to New England."
msgstr "一大块蜕下的蛇皮。看起来不像是来自新英格兰本地，或是说自然里会产生的东西。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gigantic shed snakeskin"
msgid_plural "gigantic shed snakeskins"
msgstr[0] "巨型蛇蜕"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "gigantic shed snakeskin"
msgid ""
"A complete shed snakeskin of tremendous size.  Whatever left it must be "
"getting even bigger.  You should not be, or return to, wherever you found "
"this."
msgstr "一块巨大的完整的蛇皮。不管来自何处，它一定越来越大了。你不应该去找，或是回到你发现它的地方。"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gigantic snake scales"
msgid_plural "gigantic snake scales"
msgstr[0] "巨型蛇鳞"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "gigantic snake scales"
msgid ""
"A handful of greatly oversized scales from a snake.  This is a troubling find "
"for a few reasons.  There's the size, obviously, but also the unusual "
"hardness in spite of the obvious decay, and the fact that snakes don't shed "
"individual scales like this."
msgstr ""
"一把超大的蛇鳞片。这是一个令人不安的发现，原因有几个。首先显而易见，当然是蛇的大小，其次尽管有明显的腐烂迹象，但仍然表现出不同寻常的硬度，最后蛇不会像这样脱"
"落单个鳞片。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "anesthetic"
msgid ""
"A variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's "
"intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be administered "
"manually.  You can reload an anesthesia kit with it."
msgstr "各種強效的催眠藥，止痛藥和興奮劑。 它只能用於專業醫療設備，不能手動使用。 您可以使用它重新裝填麻醉包。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fertility supplement"
msgid_plural "fertility supplement"
msgstr[0] "生育保健品"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "fertility supplement"
msgid "A pill for those looking to have children.  It is of no use to you."
msgstr "为那些希望有孩子的人准备的药丸。它对你没有任何用处。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sulfur"
msgid_plural "sulfur"
msgstr[0] "硫磺"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "sulfur"
msgid ""
"A handful of pure sulfur.  Primarily used to make battery acid, sulfur is "
"sometimes used as fuel for explosives.  Can be burned to produce acidic smoke "
"that is deadly to bacteria and humans alike, or oxidized to make "
"paper-bleaching agents.  It also serves as a basis for many kinds of "
"fungicide."
msgstr ""
"一把純硫磺。硫主要用於製造電池酸液，有時也用作炸藥的燃料。燃燒後會產生對細菌和人類都致命的酸性煙霧，或是氧化後會產生紙張漂白劑。它也可作為多種抗真菌劑的基底"
"原料。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of sulfur"
msgid_plural "chunks of sulfur"
msgstr[0] "硫磺塊"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of sulfur"
msgid "A chunk of pure sulfur.  Break it up to use it."
msgstr "一塊的純硫磺。打碎分解之後才有用。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cement powder"
msgid_plural "cement powder"
msgstr[0] "水泥粉"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "cement powder"
msgid ""
"Portland is most likely long gone, but its memory persists in cement.  This "
"ubiquitous binder can be used for all kinds of advanced masonry.  Just add "
"water."
msgstr "波特蘭很可能早已不復存在，但它的回憶仍存於水泥之中。這種普遍存在的粘合劑可用於各種先進砌築，只需要加水。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "gravel"
msgid "A handful of gravel, smaller than pebbles but larger than sand."
msgstr "一把碎石，比石子略小，但又比沙子略大。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shredded rubber"
msgid_plural "shredded rubber"
msgstr[0] "碎橡膠"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "shredded rubber"
msgid "A handful of shredded rubber, usable as a mulch now."
msgstr "一堆破碎的橡膠，可以用來建造橡膠地板。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "limestone"
msgid_plural "limestone"
msgstr[0] "石灰石"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "limestone"
msgid ""
"A handful of small chunks of limestone.  Useful for experiments at science "
"fairs, but pretty useless as ammo.  Maybe something could be crafted from "
"this stuff…"
msgstr "一小把石灰石碎塊。適合在科展上做實驗給大家看，但用來當彈藥就沒什麼用了。也許能用來做成別的什麼…"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quicklime"
msgid_plural "quicklime"
msgstr[0] "生石灰"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "quicklime"
msgid ""
"The product of burning limestone, this white powder is a crucial ingredient "
"in making cement.  That said, it is also extremely caustic and will cause "
"severe burns to any tissue it comes in contact with.  This property could "
"probably be exploited."
msgstr "石灰石經燃燒後的成品, 這些白色粉末是製作水泥的主要材料。請注意, 生石灰具有很強的腐蝕性, 直接接觸很可能會導致灼傷。這個特性或許有別的用途"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "slaked lime"
msgid_plural "slaked lime"
msgstr[0] "熟石灰"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "slaked lime"
msgid ""
" A handful of slaked lime, a white odorless powder with many uses.  Also "
"known as calcium hydroxide."
msgstr "一份熟石灰，特征为白色无气味粉末，有许多用途。也被称为氢氧化钙。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "sand"
msgid ""
"A handful of New England sand.  If you had a stoked furnace, you could turn "
"it into glass.  Otherwise, it's only good for making cement."
msgstr "一大把新英格蘭沙。如果你有台熊熊燃燒的火爐，你就可以把它變成玻璃。或者你也可以拿它來做水泥。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soil"
msgid_plural "soil"
msgstr[0] "土壤"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "soil"
msgid ""
"A pile of loosely-packed, slightly damp loamy soil.  This mixture of sand, "
"silt and clay is ideal for growing plants."
msgstr "一堆鬆散的，略帶潮濕的肥沃土壤。這種沙子、淤泥和粘土的混合物是種植植物的理想選擇。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "limestone shard"
msgid_plural "limestone shards"
msgstr[0] "石灰岩碎片"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "limestone shard"
msgid ""
"A small shard of limestone.  Pretty flimsy and not much of a weapon, but its "
"alkaline properties may yet find some use."
msgstr "小石灰石碎片。相當脆弱， 不太可能當作武器， 但它是鹼性的， 可能有些別的用途。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rock salt"
msgid_plural "rock salt"
msgstr[0] "岩鹽"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "rock salt"
msgid "A handful of rock salt crystals.  Could be refined into table salt."
msgstr "一把岩鹽結晶。可以提煉成食鹽。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rhodonite"
msgid_plural "rhodonite"
msgstr[0] "薔薇輝石"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "rhodonite"
msgid ""
"A chunk of rhodonite.  It has manganese dioxide covering and going through it "
"in veins, which can be obtained using a chisel."
msgstr "一大塊的薔薇輝石，被二氧化錳覆蓋並穿透紋理，可以使用鑿子來採取。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zincite"
msgid_plural "zincite"
msgstr[0] "紅鋅礦"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "zincite"
msgid ""
"A chunk of zincite.  Could be refined into zinc oxide, then into zinc by "
"reduction with a source of carbon."
msgstr "一大塊鋅礦。可以提煉成氧化鋅，然後透過用炭來還原成鋅。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bleach"
msgid_plural "bleach"
msgstr[0] "漂白水"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "bleach"
msgid "Sodium hypochlorite, a common household cleaning agent."
msgstr "次氯酸鈉，一種常見的家用清潔劑。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "bleach" when FLAG matches DIRTY
msgid "bleach spill"
msgid_plural "bleach spills"
msgstr[0] "灑出去的漂白水"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "liquid ammonia"
msgid_plural "liquid ammonia"
msgstr[0] "液氨"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "liquid ammonia"
msgid ""
"Anhydrous ammonia, a useful chemical compound.  It must be stored under "
"pressure or refrigerated.  Don't even think about drinking it."
msgstr "無水氨，一種有用的化合物。它必須在壓力下儲存或冷藏。想都別想，它不能喝。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ammonia solution"
msgid_plural "ammonia solution"
msgstr[0] "氨水"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "ammonia solution"
msgid "Ammonium hydroxide, a common household cleaning agent."
msgstr "氫氧化銨，一種常見的家用清潔劑。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "liquid fertilizer"
msgid_plural "liquid fertilizer"
msgstr[0] "液態肥料"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "liquid fertilizer"
msgid "A nutrient-rich elixir for plants."
msgstr "一種植物用的營養藥劑。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fermentable liquid mixture"
msgid_plural "fermentable liquid mixture"
msgstr[0] "可发酵混合液体"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "fermentable liquid mixture"
msgid ""
"A mixture of various organic wastes and water.  Wait about two months for "
"them to be fermented in a tank.  Also, biogas production will start after one "
"month."
msgstr "各种有机废物和水的混合物。液体在罐中发酵需要大约两个月时间。此外，装罐一个月后，罐内开始产生沼气。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fermentable fish mixture"
msgid_plural "fermentable fish mixture"
msgstr[0] "可发酵混合鱼类"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "fermentable fish mixture"
msgid ""
"A mixture of fish, sugars, and water.  Wait about two months for them to be "
"fermented in an open tank."
msgstr "鱼，糖和水的混合液体。装进开放的发酵容器中并等待两个月可以将其发酵。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "fermentable fish mixture"
msgid ""
"The overpowering smell of the fermenting fish liquid makes it clear that it "
"is not ready for use."
msgstr "发酵的鱼类混合液散发出的强烈气味表明它还不能被使用。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fermented fertilizer liquid"
msgid_plural "fermented fertilizer liquid"
msgstr[0] "发酵肥料液体"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "fermented fertilizer liquid"
msgid ""
"A mixture of fermented biomass, will become liquid fertilizer after simple "
"treatment."
msgstr "各种发酵生物质的混合物，经过简单处理即可变为液体肥料。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "commercial fertilizer"
msgid_plural "commercial fertilizer"
msgstr[0] "商用肥料"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "commercial fertilizer"
msgid "Nutrient-rich granules for plants."
msgstr "植物用的營養顆粒劑。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fungicide"
msgid_plural "fungicide"
msgstr[0] "殺菌劑"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "fungicide"
msgid ""
"Agricultural-grade chemical anti-fungal powder designed to destroy infections "
"in plants."
msgstr "農業用的化學抗真菌粉末，能夠消滅植物中的真菌感染。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "insecticide"
msgid_plural "insecticide"
msgstr[0] "殺蟲劑"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "insecticide"
msgid ""
"Agricultural-grade chemical insecticide powder designed to eradicate insect "
"pests."
msgstr "農業等級的化學殺蟲劑粉末，用於根除害蟲。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salt water"
msgid_plural "salt water"
msgstr[0] "鹽水"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "salt water"
msgid "Water with salt added.  Not good for drinking."
msgstr "加了鹽的水。不適合飲用。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soapy water"
msgid_plural "soapy water"
msgstr[0] "肥皂水"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "soapy water"
msgid "Water with soap added.  Not good for drinking."
msgstr "加了肥皂的水。不適合飲用。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sewage sample"
msgid_plural "sewage sample"
msgstr[0] "污水樣本"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "sewage sample"
msgid "A sample of sewage from a treatment plant.  Gross."
msgstr "污水處理廠的標準樣本。好噁心。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aluminum powder"
msgid_plural "aluminum powder"
msgstr[0] "鋁粉"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "aluminum powder"
msgid ""
"A handful of finely-ground aluminum powder.  This strong reducing agent was "
"used in combination with various oxidants for chemical welding and explosives "
"alike.  Just before the Cataclysm, however, it was the basis of virtually all "
"commercial metallic-hued paints and anti-corrosive coatings."
msgstr "一把鋁粉。這種強效還原劑混合於各式化學焊料跟爆裂物中作為氧化劑。在大災變前，基本上用在所有有關金屬色的顏料跟防腐蝕的塗層。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nickel powder"
msgid_plural "nickel powder"
msgstr[0] "鎳粉"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "nickel powder"
msgid ""
"A handful of silvery-white metallic powder composed of nickel.  Common "
"industrial uses include production of stainless steel as well as other alloys."
msgstr "一把由鎳組成的銀白色金屬粉。常見的工業用途包括生產不銹鋼以及其他合金。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zinc powder"
msgid_plural "zinc powder"
msgstr[0] "鋅粉"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "zinc powder"
msgid ""
"A handful of zinc powder.  While commercially used mostly in cosmetics and "
"for paints, hobbyists used to mix it with sulfur to make basic rocket fuel or "
"a smokescreen.  When treated with a strong acid, it will produce hydrogen."
msgstr "一把鋅粉。常用於化妝品與顏料中，某些業餘愛好者則用它混合硫磺來做基本的火箭燃料。和強酸混合後會產生氫氣。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zinc oxide"
msgid_plural "zinc oxide"
msgstr[0] "氧化鋅"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "zinc oxide"
msgid ""
"A handful of zinc oxide.  It can be reduced into zinc, or used for some other "
"reactions of its own."
msgstr "少量氧化鋅。它可以還原成鋅，或用於其自身特性的一些其他化學反應。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "manganese dioxide"
msgid_plural "manganese dioxide"
msgstr[0] "二氧化錳"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "manganese dioxide"
msgid ""
"A handful of manganese dioxide powder.  Occurring naturally in the mineral "
"pyrolusite, it is used commercially in the production of alkaline and "
"zinc-carbon batteries."
msgstr "少量二氧化錳粉末。在礦物軟錳礦中天然存在，在商業上用於生產鹼性電池和鋅碳電池。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acidic electrolyte paste"
msgid_plural "acidic electrolyte paste"
msgstr[0] "酸性電解質糊"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "acidic electrolyte paste"
msgid ""
"A moisturized mixture of zinc chloride and manganese dioxide, slightly "
"acidic.  It can be used in the production of zinc-carbon batteries."
msgstr "氯化鋅和二氧化錳的濕潤混合物，呈弱酸性。可用於生產鋅碳電池。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ferric chloride"
msgid_plural "ferric chloride"
msgstr[0] "氯化鐵"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "ferric chloride"
msgid ""
"A handful of dark green crystalline powder, with a weak pungent smell similar "
"to that of hydrochloric acid.  Commonly used as a Lewis acid for catalyzing "
"various chemical reactions."
msgstr "一把深綠色結晶粉末，有微弱的類似鹽酸的刺激性氣味。常用作路易斯酸來催化各種化學反應。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antimony trichloride"
msgid_plural "antimony trichloride"
msgstr[0] "三氯化銻"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "antimony trichloride"
msgid ""
"A handful of soft, colorless powder with a sharp pungent odor, also known as "
"butter of antimony.  It's a catalyst for polymerization, hydrocracking, and "
"chlorination reactions, and has some other niche uses."
msgstr "一把柔軟的無色粉末，具有強烈的刺激性氣味，也稱為銻黃油。它是聚合、加氫裂解和氯化反應的催化劑，還有一些其他的特殊用途。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potassium chloride"
msgid_plural "potassium chloride"
msgstr[0] "氯化鉀"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "potassium chloride"
msgid ""
"A handful of potassium chloride.  Although it occurs naturally in the mineral "
"sylvite, it can be produced as a byproduct of the reaction of saltpeter and "
"hydrochloric acid.  It can be used for making fertilizer, or potassium "
"hydroxide by way of electrolysis."
msgstr "少量氯化鉀。雖然它天然存在於礦物鉀鹽中，但它可以從硝石和鹽酸的反應中以副產物型態產生。它可以通過電解用於製造肥料或氫氧化鉀。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potassium hydroxide"
msgid_plural "potassium hydroxide"
msgstr[0] "氫氧化鉀"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "potassium hydroxide"
msgid ""
"A handful of potassium hydroxide.  Commonly called caustic potash, it was "
"mainly used industrially for its caustic nature.  It can be used as an "
"electrolyte in alkaline batteries, among other applications."
msgstr "少量氫氧化鉀。俗稱苛性鉀，工業上的運用主要利用其腐蝕的特性。它可以用作鹼性電池中的電解質，以及其他應用。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sulfuric acid"
msgid_plural "sulfuric acid"
msgstr[0] "硫酸"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "sulfuric acid"
msgid ""
"Sulfuric acid: viscous, foul-smelling and extremely corrosive, particularly "
"to organic matter and evil clowns.  Although used to prepare a number of "
"chemicals, it is mostly known as battery acid, due to its widest commercial "
"application."
msgstr ""
"硫磺酸：黏黏的，臭死你不要錢，且具高度腐蝕性的酸性物質，用來溶解有機生物以及邪惡小丑效果特好。雖然曾被用來提煉數種化學物質，由於其廣泛的商業用途，最普遍的應"
"用仍為電池內的酸液。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hydrochloric acid"
msgid_plural "hydrochloric acid"
msgstr[0] "氫氯酸"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "hydrochloric acid"
msgid ""
"Hydrochloric acid, also known as muriatic acid.  It is a strong acid that has "
"a distinctive smell, important and frequently used ever since its discovery.  "
"It still has a vast multitude of uses."
msgstr "氫氯酸，俗稱鹽酸。它是一種強酸，具有獨特的氣味，自發現以來一直很重要且經常被使用。它仍然有很多用途。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acetone"
msgid_plural "acetone"
msgstr[0] "丙酮"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "acetone"
msgid ""
"Acetone, best known as the primary constituent of most nail polish removers.  "
"Flammable, and can be easily used for potent homemade explosives, as "
"demonstrated by the terrorist attacks of 2016."
msgstr "丙酮，眾所周知是大多數指甲油去除劑的主要成分。易燃，可用來簡單容易地製作強效自製炸藥，2016 年的恐怖攻擊證明了這一點。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nitric acid"
msgid_plural "nitric acid"
msgstr[0] "硝酸"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "nitric acid"
msgid ""
"Nitric acid, a strong oxidant and an extremely corrosive material.  Mainly "
"used in the production of synthetic fertilizers, for the etching of circuit "
"boards, and in woodworking.  Remains quite useful both for making a vast "
"array of pyrotechnic and explosive agents and as a direct weapon: not many "
"beings enjoy being doused in nitric acid."
msgstr ""
"硝酸，一種強氧化劑和腐蝕性極強的物質。主要用於生產合成肥料、電路板蝕刻和木工。對於製造大量煙火藥和炸藥以及直接作為武器仍然非常有用：沒有多少生物喜歡被浸泡在"
"硝酸中。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chromium oxide"
msgid_plural "chromium oxide"
msgstr[0] "氧化鉻"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "chromium oxide"
msgid ""
"A handful of chromium oxide.  This substance, typically known as the only "
"stable green pigment for paints, is also a mild oxidizer, which can be mixed "
"with aluminum powder to make thermite for welding.  If one had access to a "
"CVD machine and a laboratory worth of reagents, they might be able to produce "
"very durable ceramic layers."
msgstr ""
"少量氧化鉻。這種物質是通常情況下唯一穩定的綠色顏料，也是一種溫和的氧化劑。可以和鋁粉混合來進行鋁熱焊。如果能夠找到化學氣相沉積器和具有對應試劑的實驗室，它們"
"可以用來生產非常耐用的陶瓷層。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "calcium carbide premix"
msgid_plural "calcium carbide premix"
msgstr[0] "碳化鈣預混料"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "calcium carbide premix"
msgid ""
"A powdered mixture of coke and lime ready to be smelted into usable calcium "
"carbide in an arc furnace."
msgstr "焦炭和石灰的粉末混合物，可以在電弧爐中熔煉成可用的碳化鈣。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "calcium carbide"
msgid_plural "calcium carbide"
msgstr[0] "碳化鈣"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "calcium carbide"
msgid ""
"A handful of calcium carbide, giving off a faint, garlic-like smell.  "
"Commercially, calcium carbide was used for on-the-spot manufacture of "
"acetylene and historically to power acetylene lamps.  If mixed with water and "
"sealed, it will explode with little strength, but with a relatively loud "
"noise that might be useful as a distraction."
msgstr ""
"一把碳化鈣（電石），散發著淡淡的大蒜味。在商業上，電石用於現場製造乙炔，並且歷史上用於為乙炔燈提供動力。如果與水混合並密封，它會以很小的力量爆炸，但會發出相"
"對較大的噪音，可以用來作為誘餌。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "calcium carbonate"
msgid_plural "calcium carbonate"
msgstr[0] "碳酸鈣"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "calcium carbonate"
msgid ""
"A handful of calcium carbonate powder, typically derived from lime or shells. "
" Useful for a number of roles, such as sugar production, fracking, "
"construction, paint additives and antacid medicine."
msgstr "一把碳酸鈣粉末，通常來自石灰或貝殼。可用於多種用途，例如製糖、水力壓裂、建築、油漆添加劑和抗酸藥。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "hexamine"
msgid ""
"A handful of waxy hexamine tablets which could be broken up into smaller "
"crumbs if needed.  This ubiquitous fuel was used to start up almost every "
"garden grill, and no 'real' camping trip could do its cooking without it, "
"until the Cataclysm.  Nowadays, it is even more valuable than before, being "
"the key component in the preparation of several military-grade explosives."
msgstr ""
"一些優洛托品（六亞甲四胺）片，如果需要的話可以分解成更小的碎片。這種普遍存在的燃料被用於幾乎每一個花園烤架，直到大災變為止，那種「真正的」露營之旅也離不開用"
"它來烹飪食物。現在，作為軍用級炸藥的關鍵製作成分，它甚至比以前還要來的更有價值了。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)"
msgid_plural "hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)"
msgstr[0] "過氧化氫 (未稀釋)"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)"
msgid ""
"Concentrated hydrogen peroxide is a powerful oxidant, violently decomposing "
"in contact with most reducing agents.  Can be used as rocket fuel or to make "
"high explosives.  Causes severe burns to any organic matter and may ignite it "
"on contact."
msgstr "濃過氧化氫溶液是一種強大的氧化劑，與大部分還原劑接觸都會劇烈分解。可以用作火箭燃料或強烈炸藥。與任何有機物接觸都有可能點燃它們並造成嚴重燒傷。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "plutonium"
msgid ""
"A chunk of unshielded plutonium.  You should probably get very far away from "
"this, if you enjoy not being irradiated."
msgstr "一塊未屏蔽的鈽。如果你不喜歡被輻射的話，你也許該遠離它。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "uranium"
msgid ""
"Some uranium.  You should probably get very far away from this, if you enjoy "
"not being irradiated."
msgstr "一些鈾。如果你不喜歡被輻射的話，你也許該遠離它。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ammonium nitrate"
msgid_plural "ammonium nitrate"
msgstr[0] "硝酸氨"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "ammonium nitrate"
msgid ""
"A handful of ammonium nitrate.  This white, crystalline powder is commonly "
"used as a component of fertilizers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved "
"in water to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this "
"quality in this new world?"
msgstr "一把硝酸銨。這種白色結晶粉末通常用作肥料和炸藥的成分。也可以溶於水中以大幅降低溫度，但這種特質在這個新世界有什麼用嗎？"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ammonium nitrate pellets"
msgid_plural "ammonium nitrate pellets"
msgstr[0] "硝酸氨顆粒"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "ammonium nitrate pellets"
msgid ""
"A handful of ammonium nitrate pellets.  These pellets are commonly used as a "
"component of fertilizers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water to "
"sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in this "
"new world?"
msgstr "一把硝酸銨顆粒。這些顆粒通常用作肥料和炸藥的成分。也可以溶於水中以大幅降低溫度，但這種特質在這個新世界有什麼用嗎？"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "saltpeter"
msgid_plural "saltpeter"
msgstr[0] "硝酸鉀"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "saltpeter"
msgid ""
"A handful of saltpeter.  Sometimes used as a fertilizer, this ubiquitous "
"nitrate is the principal constituent of black gunpowder and simple rocket "
"propellants, such as rocket candy."
msgstr "一小撮硝石，有時用來作肥料。這種普遍存在的硝酸鹽是黑色火藥和簡單的火箭推進劑，如「火箭糖」的主要成分。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/furniture_and_terrain/veins.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "niter"
msgid_plural "niter"
msgstr[0] "硝石"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "niter"
msgid ""
"A large crystal of niter, the mineral form of potassium nitrate.  It can be "
"processed into saltpeter."
msgstr "一塊大的硝酸鹽晶體，硝酸鉀的礦物形態。它可以加工成硝酸鉀。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aluminum sulfate"
msgid_plural "aluminum sulfate"
msgstr[0] "硫酸鋁"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "aluminum sulfate"
msgid ""
"Several crystals of aluminum sulfate.  Historically, an agent for purifying "
"water and as molluscicide, due to the fact that it degenerates their slime.  "
"Just before the Cataclysm, its main uses were for adjusting the acidity of "
"soil and as an additive to baking powder.  If mixed with a strong acid, it "
"could be used to saturate soil with aluminum, causing all but the most "
"resistant of plants to wither and die."
msgstr ""
"幾塊硫酸鋁晶體。歷史上，它是一種淨化水和殺軟體動物的藥劑，因為它可以使軟體動物的黏液變質。就在大災變之前，它的主要用途是調節土壤的酸度和作為發酵粉的添加劑。"
"如果與強酸混合，它可以使土壤充滿鋁，導致除了最具抵抗力的植物之外的所有植物枯萎和死亡。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acetic acid"
msgid_plural "acetic acid"
msgstr[0] "乙酸"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "acetic acid"
msgid ""
"Concentrated acetic acid, typically used as a chemical reagent and antifungal "
"agent.  Despite its horrid smell, it was used to prepare several types of "
"perfumes, but would making perfume not be too fancy for post-apocalyptic New "
"England?"
msgstr "濃縮醋酸，通常用作化學試劑和抗真菌劑。儘管氣味難聞，但它仍被用來配製多種香水，但對於末日世界的新英格蘭地區來說，製作香水不是太花哨了嗎？"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "formaldehyde"
msgid_plural "formaldehyde"
msgstr[0] "甲醛"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "formaldehyde"
msgid ""
"Formaldehyde, here dissolved in water, was widely used before the Cataclysm "
"as a precursor to production of many chemicals and materials and as an "
"embalming agent.  Easily identifiable by its pungent odor.  Terribly toxic, "
"carcinogenic, and volatile."
msgstr "甲醛，已溶解進水中，在大災變之前被廣泛用作生產許多化學品和材料，及用作防腐劑。可以通過其刺激性氣味輕鬆識別。極其有毒、致癌和易揮發。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thermite"
msgid_plural "thermite"
msgstr[0] "鋁熱劑"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "thermite"
msgid ""
"A handful of silvery-greenish powder, produced by mixing aluminum and "
"chromium oxide.  This mixture, burning at a constant pace and at extremely "
"high temperature, was once used for on-the-spot welding.  Can be used as an "
"incendiary material in a pinch."
msgstr "一小撮銀綠色的粉末，由鋁粉和氧化鉻混合而成。這種混合物能以一定的加溫率燃燒至產生極高的溫度，一度曾被用於即時焊接。在緊急的時刻，可以作為燃燒彈的材料。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ANFO"
msgid_plural "ANFO"
msgstr[0] "銨油炸藥"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "ANFO"
msgid ""
"A handful of brownish pellets, made by allowing ammonium nitrate to absorb an "
"organic fuel.  This ammonium nitrate/fuel oil mixture, or ANFO, is a common "
"industrial explosive due to its stability and low price.  Burns fast, but "
"needs an explosive primer to detonate."
msgstr ""
"一份用硝酸铵吸收有机燃料制成的褐色小球。这种硝酸铵与燃料油的混合物，即ANFO（铵油炸药）因其稳定性好、价格低廉，是一种常见的工业炸药。它燃烧很快，但需要一"
"个爆炸引信来引爆。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black gunpowder"
msgid_plural "black gunpowder"
msgstr[0] "黑火藥"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "black gunpowder"
msgid ""
"A handful of black gunpowder, a mix of saltpeter, charcoal, and sulfur.  "
"Pretty useless for making modern cartridges, as the soot produced when it "
"burns will quickly clog any firearm, but it could be used to make some "
"vicious bombs."
msgstr "一把黑色火藥，是硝石、木炭和硫磺的混合物。對於製造現代彈藥幾乎沒用，因為燃燒時產生的煙灰會很快堵塞任何槍支，但它可以用來製造一些烈性炸彈。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "RDX"
msgid ""
"Several off-white crystals of RDX, or hexogen: a military-grade, shelf-stable "
"high explosive.  Can be cast into shaped charges, or mixed with scrap to "
"pepper the blast area with high-velocity shrapnel."
msgstr ""
"這些灰白色的晶體就是黑索金炸藥（hexogen），或稱作旋風炸藥（RDX）。它是一種軍用等級且穩定性高的爆裂物。可被製作成錐形裝藥，或者與廢金屬混合，以大量"
"超高速彈片痛擊所有爆炸區域內的生物。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "composition B"
msgid_plural "composition B"
msgstr[0] "B炸藥"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "composition B"
msgid ""
"Composition B is an explosive consisting of castable mixtures of RDX and TNT. "
" It is used as the main explosive filling in artillery projectiles, rockets, "
"land mines, hand grenades, and various other munitions."
msgstr "B型炸药是由RDX和TNT按比例浇筑混合而成的炸药。它被广泛用作装填炮弹、火箭、地雷、手榴弹和其他各种弹药的主要炸药。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "HMTD"
msgid_plural "HMTD"
msgstr[0] "六甲氧胺"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "HMTD"
msgid ""
"Hexamine peroxide: this fine, yellowish powder is a powerful primary "
"explosive, used to initiate detonation of more stable explosives, such as "
"RDX.  Relatively stable, but best not store it for too long."
msgstr "過氧化六亞甲四胺：這些淡黃色的粉末是一種強力的主流爆裂物原料。主要用來做為更穩定爆裂物的起爆藥，例如旋風炸藥。雖然本身性質相對穩定，但最好不要儲存太久."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "APEX"
msgid_plural "APEX"
msgstr[0] "APEX"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "APEX"
msgid ""
"Acetone peroxide: this fine, white crystalline powder is a powerful primary "
"explosive, used to initiate detonation of more stable explosives, such as "
"RDX.  Relatively stable, with a fruit-like smell when pure."
msgstr "三过氧化三丙酮：这种细小的白色结晶粉末是一种强大的起爆药，用于引爆更稳定的炸药，如RDX。纯净的三过氧化三丙酮相对稳定，闻起来有水果味。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "improvised rocket fuel"
msgid_plural "improvised rocket fuel"
msgstr[0] "粗製火箭燃料"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "improvised rocket fuel"
msgid ""
"A chunk of a zinc powder-and-sulfur mixture, bound together by superglue, "
"that can be used as an impromptu rocket fuel."
msgstr "一堆锌粉和硫磺的混合物，由强力胶粘合胶结，可以用作临时爆炸箭燃料。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "water purification tablet"
msgid_plural "water purification tablets"
msgstr[0] "淨水錠"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "water purification tablet"
msgid ""
"Intended for the clarification and disinfection of unsafe drinking water "
"while camping or traveling, this sodium dichloroisocyanurate-based "
"purification tablet removes dangerous contaminants using powerful chemicals.  "
"The label says to use one tablet per liter (4 units of water)."
msgstr "这种基于二氯异氰尿酸钠的净水片剂可在露营或旅行时对不安全的饮用水进行澄清和消毒，利用强力化学物质去除危险的污染物。 标签上标明每公升（4 单位水）使用一片。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hickory root"
msgid_plural "hickory roots"
msgstr[0] "山核桃根"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "hickory root"
msgid "A root from a hickory tree.  It has an earthy smell."
msgstr "山核桃的根， 帶有泥土的氣味。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hickory nuts"
msgid_plural "hickory nuts"
msgstr[0] "山核桃堅果"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "hickory nuts"
msgid "A handful of hard nuts from a hickory tree, still in their shells."
msgstr "一把來自山核挑樹的堅果，仍未去殼。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pecans"
msgid_plural "pecans"
msgstr[0] "長山核桃"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "pecans"
msgid "A handful of hard nuts from a pecan tree, still in their shells."
msgstr "一把來自長山核桃樹的堅果， 仍未去殼。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pistachios"
msgid_plural "pistachios"
msgstr[0] "開心果"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "pistachios"
msgid "A handful of hard nuts from a pistachio tree, still in their shells."
msgstr "一把來自阿月渾子樹的堅果，仍未去殼。"

