msgid_plural "peanuts"
msgstr[0] "花生"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "peanuts"
msgid "A handful of hard nuts from a peanut bush, still in their shells."
msgstr "一把來自花生灌木的堅果，仍未去殼。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hazelnuts"
msgid_plural "hazelnuts"
msgstr[0] "榛果"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "hazelnuts"
msgid "A handful of hard nuts from a hazelnut tree, still in their shells."
msgstr "一把來自榛樹的堅果，仍未去殼。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chestnuts"
msgid_plural "chestnuts"
msgstr[0] "栗子"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "chestnuts"
msgid "A handful of hard nuts from a chestnut tree, still in their shells."
msgstr "一把來自栗樹的堅果，仍未去殼。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "walnuts"
msgid_plural "walnuts"
msgstr[0] "核桃"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "walnuts"
msgid "A handful of hard nuts from a walnut tree, still in their shells."
msgstr "一把來自胡桃樹的堅果，仍未去殼。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "butternuts"
msgid_plural "butternuts"
msgstr[0] "白胡桃"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "butternuts"
msgid "A handful of nuts from a butternut tree, still in their shell."
msgstr "一把來自白胡桃樹的堅果，仍未去殼。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "butternut husks"
msgid_plural "butternut husks"
msgstr[0] "灰胡桃壳"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "butternut husks"
msgid "A handful of husks from a butternuts, emptied of their meat."
msgstr "一把掏空了果肉的灰胡桃壳。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sewage water"
msgid_plural "sewage water"
msgstr[0] "污水"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "sewage water"
msgid "Turbid liquid from the sewers with an awful stench."
msgstr "來自下水道的混濁液體，帶有可怕的惡臭。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "detergent"
msgid_plural "detergent"
msgstr[0] "洗衣粉"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "detergent"
msgid "A popular pre-Cataclysm washing powder."
msgstr "一款於災變前隨處可見的洗衣粉。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soap flakes"
msgid_plural "soap flakes"
msgstr[0] "肥皂片"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "soap flakes"
msgid ""
"A handful of flakes shaved off a bar of soap, suitable for use in a washing "
"machine."
msgstr "從一塊肥皂上刮下來的一小撮薄片，適合在洗衣機中使用。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lye"
msgid_plural "lye"
msgstr[0] "鹼液"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "lye"
msgid "A liquid form of sodium hydroxide.  It is highly corrosive; handle with care."
msgstr "液體形式的氫氧化鈉。具有強腐蝕性；小心處理。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potassium lye"
msgid_plural "potassium lye"
msgstr[0] "液態氫氧化鉀"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "potassium lye"
msgid ""
"A liquid form of potassium hydroxide.  It is highly corrosive; handle with "
"care."
msgstr "液體形式的氫氧化鉀。具有強腐蝕性；小心處理。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nanomaterial canister"
msgid_plural "nanomaterial canisters"
msgstr[0] "奈米材料罐"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "nanomaterial canister"
msgid ""
"A steel canister containing carbon, iron, titanium, copper, and other "
"elements in specifically engineered atomic-scale configurations.  A "
"nanofabricator can assemble them into usable items."
msgstr "裝有採用特殊設計的原子級結構的碳、鐵、鈦、銅和其他元素的鋼罐。一台奈米材料塑型機可以將它們組合成可使用的物品。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wood ashes"
msgid_plural "wood ashes"
msgstr[0] "木灰"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "wood ashes"
msgid ""
"A handful of almost-weightless residue left after the burning of some "
"substance."
msgstr "這是一些物質燃燒後剩下的殘留物，幾乎沒有重量。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "corpse ashes"
msgid_plural "corpse ashes"
msgstr[0] "屍體骨灰"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse ashes"
msgid "The burnt remains of a person or animal."
msgstr "人或動物被燒焦的遺骸。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ether"
msgid_plural "ether"
msgstr[0] "醚"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "ether"
msgid ""
"A useful industrial solvent, and the first inhalative anesthetic in "
"widespread use.  Its uncomfortable side effects and tendency to explode "
"caused it to fall out of favor decades ago in the developed world.  If you "
"can't get the good stuff, however, it might make a passable substitute."
msgstr "實用的工業溶劑，而且是第一個廣泛使用的吸入性麻醉劑。不適的副作用與易爆性使它在幾十年前被先進國家所捨棄。如果你找不到更好的東西，就將就著用吧。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dimethyl sulfoxide"
msgid_plural "dimethyl sulfoxide"
msgstr[0] "二甲基亞碸"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "dimethyl sulfoxide"
msgid ""
"Dimethyl sulfoxide, or DMSO, is a common and important aprotic solvent, "
"capable of dissolving a huge range of things.  It has the unusual property of "
"being absorbed very quickly through the skin, causing a garlic flavor in the "
"mouth, even if it touched your arm."
msgstr ""
"二甲亞砜（DMSO）是一種常見且重要的非質子性溶劑，能夠溶解多種物質。它具有一種不尋常的特性，可以透過皮膚快速吸收，即使接觸到你的手臂，也會在口腔中產生大蒜"
"味。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chloroform"
msgid_plural "chloroform"
msgstr[0] "氯仿"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "chloroform"
msgid ""
"Famous for its properties as an illicit sedative, this substance is also a "
"very good solvent.  In particular, it's used a lot in nuclear magnetic "
"resonance spectroscopy."
msgstr "以其作為黑影人所使用的非法鎮靜劑而聞名，這種物質也是一種非常好的溶劑。特別是在核磁共振光譜法測定分子結構中大量使用。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "phenol"
msgid_plural "phenol"
msgstr[0] "苯酚"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "phenol"
msgid ""
"A useful and potent solvent with a wide range of reactive applications.  It "
"can be used to make a huge number of plastics and polymers, it can be an "
"antiseptic, it can strip paint and break down epoxy, and it can burn your "
"skin away like tissue paper under a heat gun.  Wear gloves."
msgstr ""
"一種有用且有效的溶劑，具有廣泛的反應應用。它可以用來製造大量的塑膠和聚合物，它可以是一種防腐劑，它可以剝去油漆並分解環氧樹脂，它可以像熱風槍下的薄紙一樣燒掉"
"你的皮膚。戴上手套。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "benzene"
msgid_plural "benzene"
msgstr[0] "苯"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "benzene"
msgid ""
"A colorless, highly flammable liquid with a sweet odor, one of the elementary "
"petrochemicals.  Being used primarily as a precursor to the manufacture of "
"chemicals with more complex structure, it's a major industrial chemical, but "
"finds limited use in consumer items because of its toxicity."
msgstr "一種無色、高度易燃的液體，具有甜味，是基本石化產品之一。它主要用作製造結構更複雜的化學品的前體，是一種主要的工業化學品，但由於其毒性，在消費品中的用途有限。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toluene"
msgid_plural "toluene"
msgstr[0] "甲苯"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "toluene"
msgid ""
"A colorless, toxic, and highly flammable liquid which smells like paint "
"thinner.  It's predominantly used as an industrial feedstock and a solvent, "
"and is also used as an intoxicative inhalant in a manner unintended by "
"manufacturers."
msgstr "一種無色、有毒、高度易燃的液體，聞起來像油漆稀釋劑。它主要用作工業原料和溶劑，也以製造商意想不到的方式當作引起中毒的吸入劑。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glycerol"
msgid_plural "glycerol"
msgstr[0] "甘油"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "glycerol"
msgid ""
"Also called glycerin, this clear, odorless liquid is both a handy skin "
"moisturizer and an ingredient necessary to make dynamite."
msgstr "這種透明、無氣味的液體也稱為甘油，既是一種方便的皮膚保濕劑，也是製造炸藥的必要成分。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peptone water powder"
msgid_plural "peptone water powder"
msgstr[0] "肽胨水粉"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "peptone water powder"
msgid "A pre-mixed salty solution of protein and sugar meant for bacteria to eat."
msgstr "一种预先混合好的蛋白质和糖的盐溶液，供细菌繁殖。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "agar"
msgid_plural "agar"
msgstr[0] "洋菜"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "agar"
msgid ""
"Clear flakes of processed seaweed that can be dissolved in boiling water to "
"create a very sturdy, temperature-resistant gel.  Not only is it good for "
"making gels to separate molecules by size, but it's a great cheat ingredient "
"to make sure your jellies set properly."
msgstr "这些清澈的海藻薄片可以溶解在沸水中，形成一种非常坚固、耐高温的凝胶。这种凝胶既可以用来当作电泳分离设备的溶剂基质，也还是保证你的果冻制造成功的秘密配方。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acrylamide"
msgid_plural "acrylamide"
msgstr[0] "丙烯醯胺"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "acrylamide"
msgid ""
"A handful of highly carcinogenic white powder that can be readily polymerized "
"into a whole bunch of useful water-soluble gels."
msgstr "一份高度致癌的白色粉末，很容易聚合成一块有用的水溶性凝胶。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steel grille"
msgid_plural "steel grilles"
msgstr[0] "鋼格柵"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "steel grille"
msgid "A metal grille.  It can be used as a framework for making a chemical catalyst."
msgstr "一个金属格栅。它可以用作制造化学催化剂的支撑框架。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cobalt-60 pellet"
msgid_plural "cobalt-60 pellets"
msgstr[0] "鈷-60 顆粒"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "cobalt-60 pellet"
msgid ""
"A piece of unshielded radioactive material that used to be a part of some "
"nuclear industry equipment.  You have yet to find some use for it, and you "
"probably shouldn't stand near it."
msgstr "一份开封的放射性物质，曾经是核工业设备的一部分。不过你还没有找到这玩意儿的用途，并且最好别站在它附近。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden bead"
msgid_plural "wooden beads"
msgstr[0] "木珠"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden bead"
msgid ""
"A wooden bead.  It can be used to craft inscribable jewelry or create a "
"beaded curtain door."
msgstr "一颗木珠。可以用来制造可刻字的珠宝或制造珠帘门。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rosin"
msgid_plural "rosin"
msgstr[0] "松香"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "rosin"
msgid "A chunk of yellowish rosin, usable as a flux for soldering."
msgstr "一块淡黄色的松香，可作为助焊剂用于焊接。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acetylene"
msgid_plural "acetylene"
msgstr[0] "乙炔"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "acetylene"
msgid ""
"A flammable gas that explodes under pressure.  Combined with oxygen, "
"acetylene makes a great welding gas."
msgstr "易燃氣體，在壓力下會爆炸。乙炔與氧氣結合使用，是一種很好的焊接氣體。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "formic acid"
msgid_plural "formic acid"
msgstr[0] "甲酸"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "formic acid"
msgid ""
"Common in nature as an insect venom, this substance has a number of "
"industrial uses such as preservation and manufacturing."
msgstr "自然界中常見的昆蟲毒液，這種物質有數種工業用途像是保存與製造。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "latex"
msgid_plural "latex"
msgstr[0] "乳膠"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "latex"
msgid "A liquid precursor to rubber found in some plants."
msgstr "橡膠的液體前驅物，能在植物中找到。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "citric acid"
msgid_plural "citric acid"
msgstr[0] "檸檬酸"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "citric acid"
msgid ""
"A manufactured form of citric acid that is commonly used as an additive in "
"food, cleaning agents, and nutritional supplements."
msgstr "一種人工合成的檸檬酸，通常用作食品、清潔劑和營養補充劑中的添加劑。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wasp venom gland"
msgid_plural "wasp venom glands"
msgstr[0] "黃蜂毒腺"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "wasp venom gland"
msgid ""
"A fragile, slightly quivering organ for the production and storage of wasp "
"venom.  You could extract some very useful chemicals from it with the right "
"know-how, but only if you hurry."
msgstr "一個纖細，微微顫抖著的，用於生產和儲存黃蜂毒液的器官。你能從它提煉出非常有用的化學物質，前提是你要知道怎麼做，而且要快。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bee venom gland"
msgid_plural "bee venom glands"
msgstr[0] "蜜蜂毒腺"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "bee venom gland"
msgid ""
"A fragile, slightly quivering organ for the production and storage of "
"honeybee venom.  You could extract some very useful chemicals from it with "
"the right know-how, but only if you hurry."
msgstr "一個纖細，微微顫抖著的，用於生產和儲存蜜蜂毒液的器官。你能從它提煉出非常有用的化學物質，前提是你要知道怎麼做，而且要快。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sac of paralytic venom"
msgid_plural "sacs of paralytic venom"
msgstr[0] "麻痺性毒囊"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "sac of paralytic venom"
msgid ""
"A grayish, flexible vesicle filled to the brim with the potent paralytic "
"agent the triffids use to subdue still-moving fertilizer such as yourself.  "
"If you know your way around poisons you might be able to find a use for it."
msgstr "一颗灰色的，有弹性的小球，充满了强效麻痹毒素。三尖树用它来对付像你这样还在移动的肥料。如果你知道提取毒素的方法，你也许能找到它的用途。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sac of triffid fungicide"
msgid_plural "sacs of triffid fungicide"
msgstr[0] "食人樹抗真菌液囊"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "sac of triffid fungicide"
msgid ""
"A triffid sac filled with what appears to be a triffid-produced antifungal "
"agent.  It will likely already work as an antifungal compound for more "
"offensive applications, but requires further refining before it can be used "
"as a medical drug."
msgstr "一个三尖树液囊，里面装的似乎是三尖树生产的抗真菌剂。它可能已经能够被直接当作抗真菌物质用于攻击作战之中，但需要进一步提炼才能当作药物使用。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "concentrated venom"
msgid_plural "concentrated venom"
msgstr[0] "濃縮毒液"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "concentrated venom"
msgid ""
"A transparent, lightly greenish liquid, refined from the venom of bees and "
"wasps.  Active ingredients include (nor-)adrenaline, dopamine, histamine, and "
"protein toxins.  It is now relatively stable, but will require further "
"separation to be useful for anything other than killing you."
msgstr ""
"一份透明的浅绿色液体，由蜜蜂和黄蜂的毒液提炼而来。活性成分包括去甲肾上腺素、多巴胺、组织胺和蛋白质毒素。它现在化合态较为稳定，但需要进行分离才能用在除自杀以"
"外的事情上。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "concentrated paralytic"
msgid_plural "concentrated paralytic"
msgstr[0] "濃縮麻痺毒"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "concentrated paralytic"
msgid ""
"A concentrated paralytic agent, originally from a triffid.  Given your "
"experience with its effects (chiefly gathered while sourcing this batch) and "
"their striking similarity to earthly flora, you figure it's related to "
"curarines.  Might come in handy in crafting more useful things."
msgstr ""
"一份来源于三尖树的浓缩麻痹剂。考虑到你对其效果的（主要是在采集原料时）初步观察总结以及它们与地球某类植物惊人的相似之处，你认为它的作用机理可能与箭毒碱类似。"
"可能会在制作其它东西上派上用场。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rocuronium"
msgid_plural "rocuronium"
msgstr[0] "羅庫諾林（rocuronium）"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "rocuronium"
msgid ""
"Rocuronium bromide, a fast-acting muscle relaxant.  Used primarily in "
"emergency medicine because of its relative stability, it can serve as a "
"component of a balanced anesthesia in a pinch."
msgstr "羅庫諾林溴化物，一種快速生效的肌肉鬆弛劑。主要用在急救因為它相對穩定，只要一點就能作為協和麻醉法的用藥。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "red phosphorous"
msgid_plural "red phosphorous"
msgstr[0] "紅磷"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "red phosphorous"
msgid ""
"An allotrope of the element phosphorous.  It's what you use to light matches, "
"but can also be used in the synthesis of methamphetamine.  You could use it "
"to make bombs, and if you were truly desperate you might even be able to use "
"it in small portions as a propellant for bullets."
msgstr "磷元素的同素异形体。它可以用来点燃火柴，但也可以用于合成甲基苯丙胺（冰毒）。你可以用它制造炸弹，不过如果你真的走投无路，也可以把它小剂量的用作子弹的推进药。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small portion of red phosphorous"
msgid_plural "small portion of red phosphorous"
msgstr[0] "红磷"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "small portion of red phosphorous"
msgid ""
"An allotrope of the element phosphorous.  It's what you use to light matches, "
"but can also be used in the synthesis of methamphetamine.  You could use it "
"to make bombs, and if you were truly desperate you might even be able to use "
"it as a propellant for bullets."
msgstr "磷元素的同素异形体。它可以用来点燃火柴，但也可以用于合成甲基苯丙胺（冰毒）。你可以用它制造炸弹，不过如果你真的无路可走了，也可以把它用作子弹的推进药。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "white phosphorous"
msgid_plural "white phosphorous"
msgstr[0] "白磷"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "white phosphorous"
msgid ""
"An allotrope of the element phosphorous.  Extremely flammable, produces toxic "
"smoke, you can use it to make smoke bombs."
msgstr "磷元素的同素异形体。极度易燃，燃烧时会产生有毒烟雾，可以用来制造烟雾弹。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acetic anhydride"
msgid_plural "acetic anhydride"
msgstr[0] "乙酸酐"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "acetic anhydride"
msgid ""
"A colorless liquid that smells strongly of vinegar.  If you have enough "
"chemical knowledge, you could use it to easily convert morphine into heroin."
msgstr "一种带有强烈醋味的无色液体。如果你有足够的化学知识，你可以利用它轻易地将吗啡转化为海洛因。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "iodine crystals"
msgid_plural "iodine crystals"
msgstr[0] "碘晶体"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "iodine crystals"
msgid ""
"A handful of resublimed crystals of the element iodine, they can be used as "
"an antiseptic, but are also used in the making of methamphetamine."
msgstr "一份碘元素的非晶态晶体，可用于抗败血症，但也可用于制造冰毒。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "liquid soap"
msgid_plural "liquid soap"
msgstr[0] "肥皂液"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "liquid soap"
msgid ""
"Standard skin-safe liquid soap, the type you might see on a kitchen sink, "
"shower shelf, or bathroom soap dispenser, but it should work reasonably well "
"for cleaning anything that's filthy."
msgstr "符合标准的不伤手液体肥皂，在厨房水池、淋浴置物架或是卫生间都能找到它的身影。虽然常见，但它应该能相当好地清除任何污渍。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pine resin"
msgid_plural "pine resin"
msgstr[0] "松脂"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "pine resin"
msgid "A sticky, sludgy mass of sap harvested from a pine tree."
msgstr "一些从松树上采集的粘稠、淤泥状的松树树液。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "silicone caulk"
msgid_plural "silicone caulk"
msgstr[0] "矽利康"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "silicone caulk"
msgid "A thick gray paste used as a sealant in many construction projects."
msgstr "一种厚灰色的糊状物，在许多建筑项目中用作密封剂。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toxic acidic blood"
msgid_plural "toxic acidic blood"
msgstr[0] "有毒酸性血液"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "toxic acidic blood"
#. ~ Description of "virulent acidic blood"
msgid ""
"Blood mixed with acidic compounds, extremely corrosive, a means of refining "
"this could net some useful chemicals."
msgstr "混合着酸性化合物的血液，腐蚀性极强，能用来通过某种方法提取出一些有用的化学物质。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "virulent acidic blood"
msgid_plural "virulent acidic blood"
msgstr[0] "强酸性血液"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "putrid acidic blood"
msgid_plural "putrid acidic blood"
msgstr[0] "腐臭酸性血液"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "putrid acidic blood"
msgid ""
"Blood mixed with acidic compounds, smells putrid, a means of refining this "
"could net some useful chemicals."
msgstr "混合着酸性化合物的血液，带有腐臭气味，能用来通过某种方法提取出一些有用的化学物质。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "foul acidic blood"
msgid_plural "foul acidic blood"
msgstr[0] "腐臭强酸性血液"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "foul acidic blood"
msgid ""
"Blood mixed with acidic compounds, foul-smelling and extremely corrosive, a "
"means of refining this could net some useful chemicals."
msgstr "混合着酸性化合物的血液，臭气熏天且腐蚀性极强，能用来通过某种方法提取出一些有用的化学物质。"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exodii ceramic patch"
msgid_plural "exodii ceramic patch"
msgstr[0] "流亡族陶瓷修补套件"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "exodii ceramic patch"
msgid ""
"A patch kit produced by the Exodii for repairing their nanotube-infused "
"ceramics.  Requires a kiln."
msgstr "由流亡族生产的用于修复其纳米管陶瓷的修补套件。使用它需要一个窑炉。"

#: data/json/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "breadboard"
msgid_plural "breadboards"
msgstr[0] "麵包板"

#: data/json/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "breadboard"
msgid ""
"Commonly used in electronics prototyping, this solderless breadboard is a "
"small brick of plastic filled with hundreds of holes connected by internal "
"electrical busses.  With a few components and scraps of wire, you could "
"quickly build a circuit on this, if you know what you're doing."
msgstr ""
"这个不带焊锡的试验板通常用于电子产品的原型制作，它是一块有数百个小孔的塑料砖块，这些小孔通过内部铜线连接。如果你知道自己在做什么的话，用一些元件和电线，你就"
"可以很快在上面搭出一个电路。"

#: data/json/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magnetron"
msgid_plural "magnetrons"
msgstr[0] "磁控管"

#: data/json/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "magnetron"
msgid ""
"An electrical component designed to produce microwaves, for use in a "
"microwave oven."
msgstr "一个能够产生微波的电子元件，主要用于微波炉中。"

#: data/json/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "explosively pumped flux compression generator"
msgid_plural "explosively pumped flux compression generators"
msgstr[0] "爆磁壓縮發生器"

#: data/json/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "explosively pumped flux compression generator"
msgid ""
"A large device consisting mainly of a tube of copper wire surrounding a large "
"copper tube filled with high explosives.  When detonated properly, the "
"explosives allow the device to produce large amounts of electrical energy in "
"a very short time."
msgstr "一个大型爆炸装置，其中主要部分是一根内部装满高能炸药且外部缠满电线的大型铜管。当正确引爆时，爆炸装置能在极短的时间内产生巨大的电磁脉冲。"

#: data/json/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "supercomputer platter"
msgid_plural "supercomputer platters"
msgstr[0] "超算碟状装置"

#: data/json/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "supercomputer platter"
msgid ""
"A hefty and expensive-looking golden dish engraved with concentric circuitry. "
" You felt the urge to rip it from a supercomputer."
msgstr "一个看起来又重又贵的金制碟状物，上面刻着一圈圈的电路。 你感到有种冲动，想把它从超算上扯下来。"

#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "teeth and claws"
msgid_plural "teeth and claws"
msgstr[0] "牙齒和爪子"

#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "WearMan Music"
msgid_plural "WearMan Musics"
msgstr[0] "髓身听（音乐）"

#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Description of "WearMan Music"
msgid ""
"A set of speakers implanted into your skull, that can receive local "
"radiowaves and play downloaded music at a concert hall quality.  It is "
"currently playing \"Rubik's Mickse\"."
msgstr "一组植入到你头骨中的扬声器，能够接收本地无线电波，并以音乐厅级音质播放下载的音乐。它正在播放“鲁比克的混音”。"

#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "WearMan Radio"
msgid_plural "WearMan Radios"
msgstr[0] "随身听（广播）"

#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Description of "WearMan Radio"
msgid ""
"A set of speakers implanted into your skull, that can receive local "
"radiowaves and play downloaded music at a concert hall quality.  It is "
"currently listening to the radio."
msgstr "一组植入到你头骨中的扬声器，能够接收本地无线电波，并以音乐厅级音质播放下载的音乐。它现在正在收听广播。"

#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated AR System"
msgid ""
"Extremely thin lenses provides user with augmented reality overlay allowing "
"the user to zoom, and it displays handy information about local topology."
msgstr "为用户提供叠加增强显示的超薄镜头，可以缩放视野，展示一些有用的信息。"

#: data/json/items/fake.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bionic goggles"
