msgstr[0] "混凝土攪拌機"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magic 8-Ball"
msgid_plural "Magic 8-Balls"
msgstr[0] "魔術八號球"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of "Magic 8-Ball"
msgid ""
"A fortune-telling device from the 1950s.  The kind of moral support you "
"didn't know you needed."
msgstr "20世紀50年代的算命裝置。為你提供了那些你從未意識到過但此時又十分需要的精神支撐。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "deck of cards"
msgid "deck of cards"
msgid_plural "decks of cards"
msgstr[0] "一副撲克牌"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of "deck of cards"
msgid "A deck of 52 playing cards."
msgstr "一副含有52张扑克牌的扑克。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "deck of cards" of item "deck of cards"
msgid "A fairly new, glossy deck of 52 playing cards."
msgstr "一副光滑的扑克牌，共52张，相当新。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "deck of cards"
msgid "worn deck of cards"
msgid_plural "worn decks of cards"
msgstr[0] "一副旧了的扑克牌"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "worn deck of cards" of item "deck of cards"
msgid ""
"A deck of 52 playing cards.  Judging by the bent, frayed edges and faded "
"prints, it saw its share of games."
msgstr "一副老旧的扑克牌，共计52张。从它弯曲的，磨损的边缘和褪色的印花来看，想必它见识过无数次刺激游戏。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "deck of cards"
msgid "deck of Uno cards"
msgid_plural "decks of Uno cards"
msgstr[0] "一副UNO牌"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "deck of Uno cards" of item "deck of cards"
msgid ""
"A set of Uno cards meant to play a game of Uno with your companions.  Just "
"don't yell Uno too loud to avoid attracting the undead."
msgstr "一套UNO牌，用来和你的同伴玩UNO。不过现在喊UNO也可能会受到来自某些不死生物的“惩罚”。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "deck of cards"
msgid "deck of Shadowcaser cards"
msgid_plural "decks of Shadowcaser cards"
msgstr[0] "Shadowcaser 桌游牌"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "deck of Shadowcaser cards" of item "deck of
#. cards"
msgid ""
"A set of cards used in the solo or two-player cooperative card game called "
"Shadowcaser.  The deck consists of 76 unique cards.  Shadowcaser is a "
"immersive card game set in a dream world where players find themselves "
"trapped in a mysterious labyrinthine dream.  The objective of the game is for "
"players to escape this dream world by unlocking eight doors before they run "
"out of time or succumb to the nightmares haunting them."
msgstr ""
"一个用于单人或两人合作的卡牌游戏Shadowcaser中使用的卡牌套装。这副牌包含76"
"张独特的卡牌。Shadowcaser是一个沉浸式的卡牌游戏，设定在一个梦境世界中，玩家们发现自己被困在一个神秘的迷宫梦境中。游戏的目标是让玩家在时间耗尽或被"
"困扰的噩梦击倒之前，通过解锁八扇门来逃离这个梦境世界。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "deck of cards"
msgid "deck of Sorcery cards"
msgid_plural "decks of Sorcery cards"
msgstr[0] "一套巫術卡"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "deck of Sorcery cards" of item "deck of cards"
msgid ""
"A set of cards meant to play the game \"Sorcery.\"  Each card has a fun "
"picture of a different monster."
msgstr "一套用於玩 \"巫術\" 遊戲的卡片。每張卡片都有不同怪物的有趣圖畫。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "deck of cards"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deck of tarot cards"
msgid_plural "decks of tarot cards"
msgstr[0] "塔罗牌"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "deck of tarot cards" of item "deck of cards"
msgid ""
"A deck of tarot cards.  Commonly used for the practice of divination.  Each "
"card has a unique and highly symbolic picture."
msgstr "一盒塔罗牌，常用来进行塔罗占卜。每张牌上都印有独特的具有隐喻含义的图像。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "deck of cards"
msgid "makeshift deck of cards"
msgid_plural "makeshift decks of cards"
msgstr[0] "粗製撲克牌"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "makeshift deck of cards" of item "deck of cards"
msgid ""
"A deck of 52 makeshift cards, made out of cardboard rectangles with simple "
"designs drawn on them."
msgstr "一副52张自制的简易扑克，由长方形的卡纸制成，上面画着简单的图案。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "family photo"
msgid_plural "family photos"
msgstr[0] "全家福照片"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of "family photo"
msgid ""
"A photo of a smiling family on a camping trip.  One of the parents looks like "
"a cleaner, happier version of a zombie you've seen."
msgstr "一张微笑的家庭野营旅行的照片。其中的父母看起来比你所曾见过的一只丧尸更干净、更快乐。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of pom poms"
msgid_plural "pairs of pom poms"
msgstr[0] "啦啦隊彩球"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of pom poms"
msgid ""
"A pair of red and silver pom poms with plastic handles.  Using them will make "
"you start a cheerleading routine."
msgstr "一对红色银色相间的带塑料手柄的啦啦队花球。使用它会让你开始啦啦队训练。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "polaroid photo"
msgid_plural "polaroid photos"
msgstr[0] "拍立得照片"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of "polaroid photo"
msgid ""
"A poorly-taken polaroid photo of a young man wearing bell-bottoms and a "
"fedora.  It's pretty blurry."
msgstr "一张拍得很差的拍立得照片，上面有个穿着喇叭裤、戴着软呢帽的年轻人。这张照片拍的很模糊。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Jigsaw puzzle"
msgid_plural "Jigsaw puzzles"
msgstr[0] "拼图"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of "Jigsaw puzzle"
msgid ""
"A jigsaw puzzle cardboard box containing 1000 cardboard pieces that when "
"connected together properly forms a image of something, somewhere."
msgstr "一个装有1000块拼图的纸箱，当它们都被摆放正确时，会形成某种东西的图像。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jigsaw puzzle"
msgid "White House jigsaw puzzle"
msgid_plural "White House jigsaw puzzles"
msgstr[0] "白宫拼图"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "White House jigsaw puzzle" of item "Jigsaw
#. puzzle"
msgid ""
"A jigsaw puzzle cardboard box containing 1000 cardboard pieces that when "
"connected together properly forms the main view of the White House in "
"Washington, DC."
msgstr "一个装有1000块拼图的纸箱，当它们都被摆放正确时，会形成白宫的主视图。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jigsaw puzzle"
msgid "St. Basil's jigsaw puzzle"
msgid_plural "St. Basil's jigsaw puzzles"
msgstr[0] "圣巴西尔大教堂拼图"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "St. Basil's jigsaw puzzle" of item "Jigsaw
#. puzzle"
msgid ""
"A jigsaw puzzle cardboard box containing 1000 cardboard pieces that when "
"connected together properly forms the main view of the St. Basil's Cathedral "
"at the Red Square in Moscow, Russia."
msgstr "一个装有1000块拼图的纸箱，当它们都被摆放正确时，会形成圣巴西尔大教堂的主视图。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jigsaw puzzle"
msgid "Big Ben jigsaw puzzle"
msgid_plural "Big Ben jigsaw puzzles"
msgstr[0] "大本钟拼图"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Big Ben jigsaw puzzle" of item "Jigsaw puzzle"
msgid ""
"A jigsaw puzzle cardboard box containing 1000 cardboard pieces that when "
"connected together properly forms the front view of the Big Ben in London, "
"United Kingdom."
msgstr "一个装有1000块拼图的纸箱，当它们都被摆放正确时，会形成大本钟的前视图。"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jigsaw puzzle"
msgid "Curitiba's Botanical Garden jigsaw puzzle"
msgid_plural "Curitiba's Botanical Garden jigsaw puzzles"
msgstr[0] "库里奇巴植物园拼图"

#: data/json/items/fluff.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Curitiba's Botanical Garden jigsaw puzzle" of
#. item "Jigsaw puzzle"
msgid ""
"A jigsaw puzzle cardboard box containing 1000 cardboard pieces that when "
