msgstr "一个结构复杂的机械引信。它似乎可以在触发后经过一小段特定时间后引爆稳定炸药。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "impact fuze"
msgid_plural "impact fuzes"
msgstr[0] "撞擊引信"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "impact fuze"
msgid ""
"A complex mechanical fuze.  It seems it can be used to detonate stable "
"explosives upon a solid impact."
msgstr "一个结构复杂的机械引信。它似乎可以在受到强烈撞击后引爆稳定炸药。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Kord AK rifle (Demilled)"
msgid_plural "Kord AK rifles (Demilled)"
msgstr[0] "AEK-971突击步枪（展示用）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "Kord AK rifle (Demilled)"
#. ~ Description of variant "Kord 6P67 rifle (Demilled)" of item "Kord AK
#. rifle (Demilled)"
msgid ""
"A special forces Russian rifle chambered in 5.45 that someone has taken a "
"plasma cutter to, cutting it in three places to comply with import "
"restrictions.  This thing would have been hard to source, and thankfully its "
"unique complex recoil balance system remains intact, unlike the receiver and "
"barrel.  The telltale rainbow patterns of torch cuts mar the otherwise "
"beautiful receiver.  A well-equipped gunsmith with time and materials could "
"probably build a new one out of this…"
msgstr ""
"一支 5.45 "
"口徑的俄羅斯特種部隊步槍，有人用等離子切割機將其切割成三個位置，以符合進口限制。這個東西很難找到，值得慶幸的是，與機匣和槍管不同，它獨特且複雜的後座力平衡系"
"統保持完好。火炬切割的彩虹圖案破壞了原本美麗的機匣。一個裝備精良、有時間和材料的槍匠可能可以用這個造一支新的…"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Kord AK rifle (Demilled)"
msgid "Kord 6P67 rifle (Demilled)"
msgid_plural "Kord 6P67 rifles (Demilled)"
msgstr[0] "Kord 6P67步枪（去膛）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken camspy"
msgid_plural "broken camspies"
msgstr[0] "損壞的無人機"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "broken camspy"
msgid ""
"A broken camspy.  It probably won't spy on anything ever again.  Could be "
"gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的侦察无人机。它可能再也无法监视任何东西了。可以拆解以获取零件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
