"A broken lab defense bot, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be "
"gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台損毀的警衛機器人, 基本上已經沒有威脅了, 現在它很安靜, 死氣沉沉。可以分解出零件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
