"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set to "
"replicate itself."
msgstr "最先進的光學儲存系統，包含自我複製的指令集。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nanofabricator template (silicon photonics)"
msgid_plural "nanofabricator templates (silicon photonics)"
msgstr[0] "奈米材料塑型機模板（矽光子電路）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template (silicon photonics)"
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set "
"required for the fabrication of complex silicon photonic circuitry.  The data "
"within was once clearly worth millions, but now, you are not sure if it's "
"anything more than a fancy, high-tech paperweight."
msgstr "最先進的光學儲存系統，包含製造複雜矽光子電路所需的指令集。裡面的資料曾經價值數百萬美元，但現在，你不確定它是否只是一個精美的高科技鎮紙。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nanofabricator template (UHMWPE)"
msgid_plural "nanofabricator templates (UHMWPE)"
msgstr[0] "奈米材料塑型機模板（UHMWPE）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template (UHMWPE)"
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set "
"required for the fabrication of advanced armor materials.  This seems to just "
"be routines for working with the materials, not actual armor schematics."
msgstr "最先進的光學儲存系統，包含製造先進裝甲材料所需的指令集。這似乎只是處理材料的例行程式，而不是實際的裝甲製造原理圖。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antenna"
msgid_plural "antennas"
msgstr[0] "天線"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "antenna"
msgid "A simple thin copper shaft.  Useful in lots of electronics recipes."
msgstr "一個簡單的細銅軸。在許多電子製作配方中會用到。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "micro electric motor"
msgid_plural "micro electric motors"
msgstr[0] "超微型電動馬達"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "micro electric motor"
msgid ""
"A very small electric motor like those used in RC cars or electric hair "
"trimmers."
msgstr "一個非常小的電動馬達，就像是遙控汽車或電動毛髮修剪器使用的電動馬達。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "circuit board"
msgid_plural "circuit boards"
msgstr[0] "電路板"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "circuit board"
msgid ""
"A printed card that supports and electrically connects electronic components "
"on a non-conductive substrate."
msgstr "一片上面有許多電路的印刷版， 用來連結各種電子元件。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electronic scrap"
msgid_plural "electronic scraps"
msgstr[0] "電子廢料"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "electronic scrap"
msgid ""
"A random collection of resistors, capacitors, and diodes which have been "
"stripped from printed circuits."
msgstr "從電路板上拔下來的各種電阻， 電容和二極管。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "radio repeater mod"
msgid_plural "radio repeater mods"
msgstr[0] "無線電中繼器模組"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "radio repeater mod"
msgid "A system designed to convert a radio station into an autonomous repeater."
msgstr "一個能把廣播電台轉換成自主中繼器的系統。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "desk fan"
msgid_plural "desk fans"
msgstr[0] "桌扇"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "desk fan"
msgid "A small fan, used to propel air around a room."
msgstr "一個小電扇， 能夠推動房間中的氣流。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ceramic armor plate"
msgid_plural "ceramic armor plates"
msgstr[0] "陶瓷裝甲板"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "ceramic armor plate"
msgid ""
"A ceramic armor plate, specifically engineered for use as armor.  Not "
"suitable for human use."
msgstr "一块陶瓷装甲板，专门设计用于护甲。不适合直接穿戴。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fishbowl"
msgid_plural "fishbowls"
msgstr[0] "魚缸"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "fishbowl"
msgid ""
"A filled fishbowl, the tag says 'to Ed' and the fish's name, 'Hoss'.  The "
"fish appears to have tiny antlers."
msgstr "一個裝有魚的魚缸， 貼在上面的便利貼寫著: '給Ed'， 牠的名字叫 'Hoss'。這隻魚有著小小的鹿角。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pipe cleaner"
msgid_plural "pipe cleaners"
msgstr[0] "管道清潔器"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "pipe cleaner"
msgid ""
"A tool designed to clean the interior surface of pipes, bottles, and similar "
"objects.  This one is thin enough to be used for cleaning firearm barrels "
"from dirt and fouling."
msgstr "一个用于清洁管道、瓶子和类似物体内部表面的工具。这个足够细，可以用来清洗枪管内的灰尘和污垢。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clock"
msgid_plural "clocks"
msgstr[0] "時鐘"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "clock"
msgid "A small mechanical clock, it's stopped at 10:10."
msgstr "一個小型的機械鐘， 上面的指針停在 10:10。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clockworks"
msgid_plural "clockworks"
msgstr[0] "發條裝置"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "clockworks"
msgid "A small assortment of gears and other clockwork gubbins."
msgstr "一組小齒輪和小的發條。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hand mirror"
msgid_plural "hand mirrors"
msgstr[0] "小鏡子"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "hand mirror"
msgid "A small hand mirror."
msgstr "一面帶手柄的小鏡子。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "manhole cover"
msgid ""
"A heavy iron disc that typically covers a ladder into the sewers.  Lifting it "
"from the manhole is impossible without a crowbar."
msgstr "一大塊圓餅似的鐵蓋， 封閉了下水道與階梯。要抬起它必須使用撬棍。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pine bough"
msgid_plural "pine boughs"
msgstr[0] "松樹樹枝"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "pine bough"
msgid ""
"A branch from a pine tree, oozing sticky sap and bristling with prickly "
"needles."
msgstr "松樹的樹枝， 滲著黏黏的汁液而且還長滿小刺。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pinecone"
msgid_plural "pinecones"
msgstr[0] "松果"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "pinecone"
msgid "A spiny pod from a pine tree."
msgstr "一颗松树所结出多刺松果。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "unfinished koji rice"
msgid_plural "unfinished koji rice"
msgstr[0] "米麴（未完成）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "unfinished koji rice"
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice mixed with yeast and koji mold fragments, set aside to let "
"koji mold grow on it so that it can make a passable sake base."
msgstr "将一些煮熟的米饭与酵母和曲霉菌混合，静置使得曲霉菌在上面生长，这样就可以做成一个合格的清酒酒曲。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "unfinished koji rice"
msgid "The koji mold seems to have overtaken all the rice; this batch is usable now."
msgstr "曲霉菌似乎已经完全覆盖了大米；这批酒曲现在可以用了。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "unfinished koji rice"
msgid "The koji mold is still growing."
msgstr "曲霉菌仍然在生长。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "koji rice"
msgid_plural "koji rice"
msgstr[0] "米麴"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "koji rice"
msgid ""
"Some rice covered in koji mold, mixed in with yeast.  Useful for making sake, "
"but not really tasty on its own.  Smells vaguely of chestnuts."
msgstr "将一些煮熟的米饭与酵母和曲霉菌混合制成的酒曲。可以用来酿制清酒，但本身并不美味。隐约有栗子的味道。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "growing wild koji mold"
msgid_plural "growing wild koji mold"
msgstr[0] "野生米麴菌（成長中）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "growing wild koji mold"
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  If left "
"alone for a while, it will most likely grow koji mold."
msgstr "将一些煮熟的米饭撒上炉灰，并裹在玉米壳之中。静置一段时间，它很可能会长出曲霉菌。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "growing wild koji mold"
msgid "Patches of koji mold have grown on the rice; you can now extract it."
msgstr "米饭上长出了曲霉菌；你现在可以取出它了。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "growing wild koji mold"
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "soy and wheat dough"
msgid "The koji mold hasn't grown yet."
msgstr "曲霉菌仍然在生长。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grown wild koji mold"
msgid_plural "grown wild koji mold"
msgstr[0] "野生米麴菌（可收穫）"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "grown wild koji mold"
msgid ""
"Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  It has "
"grown patches of koji mold inside; disassemble this item to extract it."
msgstr "将一些煮熟的米饭撒上炉灰，并裹在玉米壳之中。它外表长出了一片片的曲霉菌；拆解这个物品将其取出。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soy and wheat dough"
msgid_plural "soy and wheat dough"
msgstr[0] "黃豆麥麵糰"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough"
msgid ""
"Dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, wrapped in wet "
"paper.  If left to dry for some time, it'll grow koji mold, as necessary for "
"making soy sauce."
msgstr "煮熟并捣碎的大豆混合小麦粉制成的面团，用湿纸包裹。风干一段时间后会长出曲霉菌，这是制作酱油所必需的。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "soy and wheat dough"
msgid "The koji mold seems to have overtaken all the dough; this batch is usable now."
msgstr "曲霉菌似乎已经完全覆盖了面团；这批酱醅现在可以用了。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soy and wheat dough with koji"
msgid_plural "soy and wheat dough with koji"
msgstr[0] "黃豆麥麵糰加麴"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough with koji"
msgid ""
"A block of dried dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, "
"covered with koji mold.  Usable for making soy sauce."
msgstr "一块煮熟并捣碎的大豆和小麦粉制成的干面团，上面覆盖着曲霉菌。可用于制作酱油。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "poppy bud"
msgid_plural "poppy buds"
msgstr[0] "罌粟芽"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "poppy bud"
msgid ""
"A poppy bud.  Contains some substances commonly produced by a mutated poppy "
"flower."
msgstr "罌粟芽， 含有一些突變罌粟花常產生的物質。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "sunflower"
msgid ""
"The top of a sunflower, with yellow petals and some seeds that have yet to be "
"eaten by animals."
msgstr "向日葵的花蕾，有黄色的花瓣和一些尚未被动物吃掉的种子。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chamomile flowers"
msgid_plural "chamomile flowers"
msgstr[0] "洋甘菊花"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "chamomile flowers"
msgid ""
"A handful of white chamomile flowers, used as an herbal remedy since ancient "
"times."
msgstr "一把白洋甘菊，自古以来用作草药。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lotus flower"
msgid_plural "lotus flowers"
msgstr[0] "蓮花"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "lotus flower"
msgid ""
"A lovely flower that grows on the surface of bodies of fresh water.  "
"Traditionally connected with many Eastern cultures."
msgstr ""
"一种生长在淡水表面的可爱的花。传统上与许多东方文化相联系。\n"
"\"接天莲叶无穷碧\""

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spurge flowers"
msgid_plural "spurge flowers"
msgstr[0] "大戟花"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "spurge flowers"
msgid ""
"A handful of yellow-green flowers.  Can be brewed into a tea that prevents "
"asthma attacks."
msgstr "一种黄绿色的花。花朵可以制成预防哮喘发作的茶。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "withered bouquet"
msgid_plural "withered bouquet"
msgstr[0] "枯萎花束"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "withered bouquet"
msgid ""
"A mixed collection of flowers.  Unfortunately, they have all withered with "
"time."
msgstr "各種品種的花。不幸的是，它們都隨著時間的推移而枯萎了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "dog tag"
msgid "dog tag"
msgid_plural "dog tags"
msgstr[0] "狗牌"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "dog tag"
msgid ""
"An identification tag for a pet, engraved with their name and their owner's "
"address and phone number.  It says \"<dog_name>\"."
msgstr "一块宠物识别标签，上面刻有宠物的姓名、主人的地址和电话号码。上面写着：“<dog_name>”。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lump of clay"
msgid_plural "lumps of clay"
msgstr[0] "黏土塊"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "lump of clay"
msgid "A fresh piece of clay.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "一坨新鮮的黏土。能用於一些物品製作配方。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "brick"
msgid_plural "bricks"
msgstr[0] "磚塊"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "brick"
msgid "A fire-hardened building block used in masonry construction."
msgstr "一块经过火烤硬化后的建筑材料，用在各种砖石结构中。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mortar"
msgid_plural "mortar"
msgstr[0] "沙漿"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "mortar"
msgid "Some mortar, ready to be used in building projects."
msgstr "一袋沙漿， 已經準備於用在建築工程中了。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lime mortar"
msgid_plural "lime mortar"
msgstr[0] "石灰砂漿"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "lime mortar"
msgid "Some lime mortar, made from quicklime and aggregate and ready for building."
msgstr "ㄧ些石灰沙漿，用生石灰和骨料製成，準備好用於建設。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soft adobe brick"
msgid_plural "soft adobe bricks"
msgstr[0] "軟土坯磚"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "soft adobe brick"
msgid ""
"A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, still too wet to build with.  "
"Load it onto a pallet and leave it to dry."
msgstr "一块压实的土壤和天然纤维，仍然太湿，无法用它建造。把它装到托盘上，让它晾干。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "soft adobe brick"
msgid "You test the brick, and it seems solid enough to use."
msgstr "你试了试，这块砖似乎已足够结实可以使用。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "soft adobe brick"
msgid "The brick is still too damp to bear weight."
msgstr "这块砖还太湿，承受不了重量。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "adobe brick"
msgid_plural "adobe bricks"
msgstr[0] "土坯磚"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "adobe brick"
msgid ""
"A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, baked dry enough to harden into "
"a brick."
msgstr "一块压实的土壤和天然纤维，烘焙得足够干燥，可以硬化成砖块。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "adobe mortar"
msgid_plural "adobe mortar"
msgstr[0] "土坯砂漿"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "adobe mortar"
msgid ""
"A thick, pasty mud, low in sand content to reduce crumbling once dry.  Used "
"to glue larger, heavier pieces of mud and clay together."
msgstr "一团厚厚的泥巴糊，含沙量低，一旦干了就能减少碎裂。用来粘合更大更重的泥块和黏土。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "piece of tanbark"
msgid_plural "pieces of tanbark"
msgstr[0] "鞣料树皮"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "piece of tanbark"
msgid "A sheet of tannin-rich bark from a tree, useful for tanning leather."
msgstr "一大块富含单宁的树皮，用于鞣制皮革。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "piece of birchbark"
msgid_plural "pieces of birchbark"
msgstr[0] "桦树皮"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "piece of birchbark"
msgid "A sheet of tough, water-resistant bark taken from a birch tree."
msgstr "一片既堅硬又防水的樹皮， 從樺樹上取得。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "piece of willowbark"
msgid_plural "pieces of willowbark"
msgstr[0] "柳树皮"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "piece of willowbark"
msgid "A sheet of bark taken from a willow tree.  Used in the production of aspirin."
msgstr "一片從柳樹上取得的樹皮， 可用於製作阿斯匹靈。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sassafras root"
msgid_plural "sassafras root"
msgstr[0] "黄樟根"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "sassafras root"
msgid ""
"A root taken from a sassafras tree.  Used in the production of certain sweet "
"beverages."
msgstr "从黄樟树上取下的根。 用于生产某些甜味饮料。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Snippet in category "<geometric_patterns>"
#. ~ Geometric patterns originally made for blankets, to represent their
#. stitching patterns.
msgid "diamond"
msgid_plural "diamonds"
msgstr[0] "鑽石"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "diamond"
msgid "A sparkling diamond."
msgstr "一顆閃閃發光的鑽石。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "garnet"
msgid_plural "garnets"
msgstr[0] "石榴石"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "garnet"
msgid "A sparkling garnet."
msgstr "一顆閃閃發光的石榴石。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "amethyst"
msgid_plural "amethysts"
msgstr[0] "紫水晶"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "amethyst"
msgid "A sparkling amethyst."
msgstr "一顆閃閃發光的紫水晶。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aquamarine"
msgid_plural "aquamarines"
msgstr[0] "海藍寶石"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "aquamarine"
msgid "A sparkling aquamarine."
msgstr "一顆閃閃發光的海藍寶石。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "emerald"
msgid_plural "emeralds"
msgstr[0] "祖母綠"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "emerald"
msgid "A sparkling emerald."
msgstr "一顆閃閃發光的祖母綠。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alexandrite"
msgid_plural "alexandrites"
msgstr[0] "亞歷山大變石"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "alexandrite"
msgid "A sparkling alexandrite."
msgstr "一顆閃閃發光的亞歷山大變石。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "malachite"
msgid_plural "malachites"
msgstr[0] "孔雀石"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "malachite"
msgid "A sparkling malachite."
msgstr "一颗闪闪发光的孔雀石。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pearl"
msgid_plural "pearls"
msgstr[0] "珍珠"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "pearl"
msgid "A lustrous pearl."
msgstr "一顆光彩熠熠的珍珠。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ruby"
msgid_plural "rubies"
msgstr[0] "紅寶石"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "ruby"
msgid "A sparkling ruby."
msgstr "一顆閃閃發光的紅寶石。"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
