#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "military flight helmet"
msgid ""
"A military flight helmet.  Equipped with a visor, microphone, and noise "
"dampening system.  The helmet is also fitted with plastic rail for a "
"night-vision attachment."
msgstr "一顶军用飞行头盔。配有面罩、麦克风和消音系统。头盔还装有塑料导轨来安装夜视附件。"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military flight helmet"
msgid "You turn the flight helmet on."
msgstr "你启动了飞行头盔。"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "military flight helmet"
