#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".223 Remington"
msgid_plural ".223 Remington"
msgstr[0] ".223 雷明頓"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Description of ".223 Remington"
msgid ""
".223 Remington ammunition with a 55gr FMJ-BT bullet, patterned after the M193 "
"loading.  The .223 round has been very popular with civilian shooters for "
"almost a century, finding use in a wide variety of weapons.  The combination "
"of high velocity with a thinly-jacketed, cannelured projectile led to "
"unexpected yaw and fragmentation in soft tissue, increasing this round's "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"55格令的.223 "
"雷明顿全金属被甲艇尾弹，样式与M193弹相同。在过去近一个世纪以来，.223"
"口径在民用射击领域极受欢迎，能找到有许多使用这个口径弹药的枪械。高速与薄被甲的带弹壳槽线的弹头的结合，导致了其击中软组织后无法预测的翻滚及碎裂，提高了子弹的"
"停止力。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.56 NATO Mk 262"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO Mk 262"
msgstr[0] "5.56 NATO Mk 262 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO Mk 262"
msgid ""
"5.56x45mm ammunition, loaded for precision from the Mk 12 SPR rifles, and "
"later used by other SF units looking for more effective loadings for their "
"M4A1 and Mk 18 carbines.  The Mk 262 Mod 1 is loaded with a 77 grain Open Tip "
"Match bullet, enhancing lethality even at longer ranges when compared to "
"older M855 loadings."
msgstr ""
"一款5.56x45mm口径弹药，起初作为供Mk 12 SPR步枪使用的精确射击型号，后来被其他特种部队使用，作为其所使用的M4A1步枪和Mk "
"18卡宾枪更为有效的弹药类型。Mk 262 Mod 1型弹药含有一颗77格令重的开尖弹头，与旧的M855型号相比，在提升射程的基础上上也带来了杀伤力的提升。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.56 NATO Mk318"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO Mk318"
msgstr[0] "5.56 NATO Mk318 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO Mk318"
msgid ""
"5.56x45mm ammunition, developed due to SOF dissatisfaction with the M855 "
"cartridge.  The Mk318 Mod 1 is loaded with a 62 grain Open Tip Match Rear "
"Penetrator bullet, a copper slug enclosed inside an open-tipped brass "
"projectile, providing for consistent loading, enhanced lethality and "
"increased penetration.  When compared to M855, the Mk318 fragments "
"consistently, even out of short-barreled carbines."
msgstr ""
"一款5.56x45mm口径弹药，由于特种部队对M855型弹药不满意而研发。Mk318 Mod "
"1型弹药含有一颗62格令的开尖穿甲弹头，铜制弹芯被密封在开口尖端黄铜壳体内，提供装填一致性、提升杀伤力并增加穿透力。与M855型号相比，Mk318"
"弹的破片一致性更好，即使是使用短卡宾枪发射也是如此。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.56 NATO M855"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO M855"
msgstr[0] "5.56 NATO M855 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO M855"
msgid ""
"5.56x45mm ammunition with a 62gr FMJ bullet containing a steel penetrator.  "
"Originally designed for the M249 FN Minimi, M855 was designed to penetrate "
"steel helmets and light cover at range, sacrificing terminal performance and "
"accuracy in the process.  The limited yaw and fragmentation is worsened with "
"shorter-barreled carbines shooting this round, and optimization of barrel "
"twist for stabilization of the tracer variant of M855 has resulted in "
"lackluster accuracy overall."
msgstr ""
"62格令的5.56x45mm全金属被甲钢芯弹。M855弹最初是为M249 FN "
"\"米尼米\""
"轻机枪设计的，用于在其射程内穿透钢盔和轻度防护目标，牺牲了弹道性能及精度。在使用较短的卡宾枪发射时，该型号有限的翻转及碎片不足的缺点更加严重，为了稳定M85"
"5曳光弹而对枪管扭力进行优化导致总体精度不高。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.56 NATO M855A1"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO M855A1"
msgstr[0] "5.56 NATO M855A1 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO M855A1"
msgid ""
"An updated loading of M855 5.56x45mm ammunition, featuring a 62 grain "
"projectile containing an exposed steel penetrator and copper slug.  Designed "
"as a mostly lead-free projectile, the opportunity was further taken to "
"improve upon M855's penetration and lethality characteristics through "
"penetrator design and increased pressure.  Its improved accuracy, penetration "
"and lethality over M855 are appreciated by users of shorter-barreled AR "
"variants."
msgstr ""
"一款M855 "
"5.56x45mm弹药的改进型号，使用62格令弹头，包含裸露的钢穿甲弹和铜芯弹头。设计为无铅弹药，通过穿甲弹设计和增加膛压，进一步提高了M855"
"弹的穿透力和杀伤力特征。相比旧M855型号具有更高的精度、穿透力和杀伤力，受到枪管较短的AR枪族用户的赞赏。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.56 NATO tracer"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO tracer"
msgstr[0] "5.56 NATO 曳光彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO tracer"
msgid ""
"An M856 tracer round.  Traditional practice is to load one tracer per every "
"four normal rounds to help keep the weapon they are fired from on target.  "
"They have the potential to ignite flammable surfaces at their point of impact."
msgstr "M856 曳光弹。传统做法是每隔四发普通子弹加入一发曳光弹，以帮助射手保持瞄准射击目标。这类弹药在撞击目标时能点燃易燃表面。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.56 NATO M995"
msgid_plural "5.56 NATO M995"
msgstr[0] "5.56 NATO M995 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
#. ~ Description of "5.56 NATO M995"
msgid ""
"An armor piercing 5.56x45mm M995 round using a 52gr projectile, featuring a "
"black-tipped, tungsten carbide penetrator over an aluminum slug.  Increased "
"penetration over standard ball rounds at the cost of worse wounding potential "
"in soft tissue."
msgstr "5.56x45mm M995 穿甲弹，使用52格令碳化钨穿甲弹头、铝制弹壳，特征是弹头尖呈黑色。比起标准弹药拥有更强的穿透力，代价是对软组织伤害力不足。"

