#: data/json/items/ammo/300.json
#. ~ Description of ".300 Winchester Magnum"
msgid ""
".300 Winchester Magnum ammunition with a 220gr JHP bullet.  The 300WM round "
"is an extremely powerful and accurate rifle round introduced in 1963.  It has "
"proven popular with hunters and snipers, although it is not as common as .308 "
"or .30-06."
msgstr ""
".300 溫徹斯特麥格農彈藥使用 220 格令被甲空尖彈頭。這款步槍子彈在 1963 年面世，準確之外還有著極強的破壞力。雖然普及程度比不上 .308 和 "
".30-06 彈種，但仍受獵人和狙擊手歡迎。"

