msgid_plural ".380 ACP FMJ"
msgstr[0] ".380 ACP 全金屬被甲彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/380.json
#. ~ Description of ".380 ACP FMJ"
msgid ""
".380 ACP ammunition with a brass jacketed 95gr bullet.  Popular in pocket "
"pistols for over a century, it is often considered the weakest caliber to "
"consider for self-defense.  One should be careful not to chamber it in 9x18mm "
"Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ""
".380 柯特自動手槍（.380 ACP）彈藥使用 95 "
"格令黃銅包覆彈頭。在小型手槍中受歡迎達一世紀之久，常被認為是自衛武器中最弱的口徑。應該注意不要將其放入 9x18mm 馬卡洛夫手槍或 9x19mm 槍械中。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/380.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".380 ACP JHP"
msgid_plural ".380 ACP JHP"
msgstr[0] ".380 ACP 被甲空尖彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/380.json
#. ~ Description of ".380 ACP JHP"
msgid ""
".380 ACP ammunition with a 95gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  It is a "
"popular round for small concealable backup pistols, and often the weakest "
"recommended defensive caliber.  One should be careful not to chamber it in "
"9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ""
".380 柯特自動手槍（.380 ACP）彈藥使用 95 格令被甲空尖彈頭。這是款流行的小型隱藏式備用手槍，是最不被推薦的防禦性口徑。應該注意不要將其放入 "
"9x18mm 馬卡洛夫手槍或 9x19mm 槍械中。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/380.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".380 ACP +P"
msgid_plural ".380 ACP +P"
msgstr[0] ".380 ACP 增壓彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/380.json
#. ~ Description of ".380 ACP +P"
msgid ""
"Overpressure .380 ACP ammunition with a 90gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  "
"This defensive loading is designed to maximize performance and tends to be "
"more accurate than practice ammo.  One should be careful not to chamber it in "
"9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ""
"90格令的 .380 ACP 被甲空尖弹，超压型号。这些子弹是为了最大限度地提高性能而设计的，而且比训练弹更精确。注意不要将其装入使用 9x18mm "
"马卡洛夫弹或 9x19mm 弹的枪械中。"

