#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "40x46mm M1006 sponge"
msgid_plural "40x46mm M1006 sponge"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm M1006 海綿彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M1006 sponge"
msgid ""
"A low velocity less-lethal 40x46mm round with a foam and plastic projectile "
"intended to cause pain and disorientation to the target.  May still injure or "
"kill."
msgstr "一款低速的低致命性 40x46 毫米的子彈，有著泡棉和塑膠彈丸以對目標造成疼痛和喪失方向感。仍可能會造成致命傷。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "40x46mm M433 HEDP"
msgid_plural "40x46mm M433 HEDP"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm M433 高爆雙用途彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M433 HEDP"
msgid ""
"A low velocity 40x46mm high explosive dual-purpose grenade.  It can penetrate "
"2 inches of steel armor, and the fragmentation of the projectile body also "
"makes it suitable for use against infantry."
msgstr "一款低初速的40x46mm HEDP 高爆两用榴弹。它能够击穿2英寸(约5厘米)厚的钢板，而击中目标时产生的大量破片使它也能作为反步兵弹药使用。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "40x46mm M576 buckshot"
msgid_plural "40x46mm M576 buckshot"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm M576 獵鹿彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M576 buckshot"
msgid ""
"A 40x46mm buckshot load, designed for use in thick vegetation or room "
"clearing.  Due to the limitations of weapons built to fire 40x46mm grenades, "
"it's much less powerful than you'd expect."
msgstr "一款40x66mm 猎鹿榴弹，用于丛林茂密地形或者是室内作战。由于受限于能发射40x46mm榴弹武器的局限性，它的威力比你想象的要小得多。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "40x46mm M651 tear gas"
msgid_plural "40x46mm M651 tear gas"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm M651 催淚彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M651 tear gas"
msgid ""
"A low velocity 40x46mm tear gas canister.  It is effective for riot control "
"and driving infantry from entrenched positions, and is able to penetrate thin "
"wood."
msgstr "一款低初速的40x46mm催泪瓦斯榴弹。在防暴行动及将敌方步兵驱离防御阵地时十分有效，而且能穿透薄木板。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "40x46mm .22 LR beehive"
msgid_plural "40x46mm .22 LR beehive"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm 蜂窝弹（.22 LR）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of "40x46mm .22 LR beehive"
msgid ""
"A set of ten .22 LR bullets compressed into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all ten "
"rounds simultaneously."
msgstr "十发 .22 LR 弹被装入了一个 40mm 榴弹适配器中。能够将十发子弹同时击发。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "40x46mm .410 hornet's nest"
msgid_plural "40x46mm .410 hornet's nest"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm .410 蜂窩榴彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of "40x46mm .410 hornet's nest"
msgid ""
"A set of four .410 000 shotshells and a large pistol primer loaded into a "
"40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing "
"assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "四发 .410 000 霰弹和一个大型手枪底火被装入了一个 40mm 榴弹适配器中。内部的击发装置通过引发底火，能够将四发子弹同时击发。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "40x46mm .410 slug's nest"
msgid_plural "40x46mm .410 slug's nest"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm 蜂窝弹（.410独头弹）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of "40x46mm .410 slug's nest"
msgid ""
"A set of four .410 slug shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm "
"adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, "
"which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "四发 .410 独头弹和一个大型手枪底火被装入了一个 40mm 榴弹适配器中。内部的击发装置通过引发底火，能够将四发子弹同时击发。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
