#: data/json/items/ammo/458wm.json
#. ~ Description of ".458 WM JSP"
msgid ""
"Jacketed .458 Winchester Magnum loaded with a 350gr soft point bullet.  "
"Compared to other cartridges of this size, the straight walls of the case and "
"the 'belt' near the base of the case give the cartridge a strange appearance. "
" .458 Winchester Magnum is a modern Big Five game rifle cartridge, intended "
"for taking any of Africa's large and dangerous game, which quickly supplanted "
"other cartridges in use by hunters, guides and wardens."
msgstr ""
".458 溫徹斯特麥格農彈藥使用 350 格令的被甲軟尖彈頭。與類似尺寸的其他彈藥相比，筆直的外殼壁和靠近外殼底部的“帶”，使它具有獨特的外觀。.458 "
"溫徹斯特麥格農子彈是一款現代狩獵非洲五霸的步槍彈，專用於非洲任何危險的大型獵物，它很快取代了獵人、嚮導和看守員所使用的其他彈藥。（譯註：非洲五霸(Big "
"Five)，指非洲獅、非洲象、非洲水牛、非洲豹和黑犀牛）"

