msgstr[0] ".45 柯特 LFN 子彈（紅磷火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".45 Colt +P JHP"
msgid_plural ".45 Colt +P JHP"
msgstr[0] ".45 柯特增壓被甲空尖彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt +P JHP"
msgid ""
"Jacketed .45 Colt ammunition with a 225gr hollow point bullet, loaded much "
"hotter than regular loads for this cartridge.  Hollowpoints in this venerable "
"caliber were issued by the occasional police department looking for extra "
"lethality before the '97 North Hollywood shootout.  Since then they were "
"mostly used for home defense, and now by the post-apocalyptic cowboy."
msgstr ""
".45 柯特彈藥使用 225 格令被甲空尖彈頭，其裝藥比普通子彈高得多。在 1997 "
"年北好萊塢搶劫槍戰之前，警察部門偶爾會配備這種令人敬畏的口徑的空尖彈，以尋求額外的殺傷力。從那時起，它們主要用於家用自衛，現在則被末世後的牛仔使用。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".45 Colt +P JHP, reloaded"
msgid_plural ".45 Colt +P JHP, reloaded"
msgstr[0] ".45 柯特增壓被甲空尖彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".45 Colt JHP, black powder"
msgid_plural ".45 Colt JHP, black powder"
msgstr[0] ".45 柯特被甲空尖彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt JHP, black powder"
msgid ""
"Jacketed .45 Colt ammunition with a 225gr hollow point bullet, loaded much "
"hotter than regular loads for this cartridge.  The resource scarcity of the "
"Cataclysm inspired someone to hand-reload this one with black powder, "
"bringing the round closer to its original incarnation.  It's kind of poetic, "
"when you think about it."
msgstr ""
".45 柯特彈藥使用 225 "
"格令被甲空尖彈頭，其裝藥比普通子彈高得多。大災變的資源缺乏激發了有人用黑火藥手動重新裝填這枚子彈，使得這子彈更接近其原始形態。當你想到這情境，竟還有點詩意。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".45 Colt JHP, matchhead powder"
msgid_plural ".45 Colt JHP, matchhead powder"
msgstr[0] ".45 柯特被甲空尖彈（紅磷火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".45 Colt +P FMJ, reloaded"
msgid_plural ".45 Colt +P FMJ, reloaded"
msgstr[0] ".45 柯特增壓全金屬被甲彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt +P FMJ, reloaded"
msgid ""
"Jacketed .45 Long Colt ammunition with a 225gr bullet.  Originally designed "
"for the Colt Single Action Army, and still used for modern reproduction "
"revolvers."
msgstr " 225 格令的. .45 长柯尔特子弹。最初为柯尔特单动式陆军左轮手枪（M1873）设计，时至今日，这种弹药仍应用于其现代复刻版左轮手枪。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
