msgid_plural ".45 Colt FMJ, black powder"
msgstr[0] ".45 柯特全金屬被甲彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Description of ".45 Colt FMJ, black powder"
msgid ""
"Jacketed .45 Long Colt ammunition with a 225gr bullet.  Originally designed "
"for the Colt Single Action Army, and still used for modern reproduction "
"revolvers.  The resource scarcity of the Cataclysm inspired someone to "
"hand-reload this one with black powder, bringing the round closer to its "
"original incarnation.  It's kind of poetic, when you think about it."
msgstr ""
".45 長柯特彈藥使用 225 "
"格令全金屬被甲彈頭，其裝藥比普通子彈高得多。原型設計主要參考柯特單動式陸軍轉輪手槍，而且現在仍廣泛應用於現代左輪手槍的生產流程。大災變的資源缺乏激發了有人用"
"黑火藥手動重新裝填這枚子彈，使得這子彈更接近其原始形態。當你想到這情境，竟還有點詩意。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/45colt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".45 Colt FMJ, matchhead powder"
msgid_plural ".45 Colt FMJ, matchhead powder"
msgstr[0] ".45 柯特全金屬被甲彈（紅磷火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/46.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "4.6x30mm"
msgid_plural "4.6x30mm"
msgstr[0] "4.6x30mm 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/46.json
#. ~ Description of "4.6x30mm"
msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated steel bullet.  The 4.6x30mm "
"round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  "
"It has low recoil and excellent armor penetration."
msgstr ""
"31格令的4.6x30mm口径镀铜钢芯弹，4.6x30mm口径子弹是由H&K公司研制，用来与 FN "
"赫斯塔尔公司的5.7x28mm口径弹药竞争的弹种。该弹有着较低后坐力，和优秀的穿甲性能。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/46.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "4.6x30mm, black powder"
msgid_plural "4.6x30mm, black powder"
msgstr[0] "4.6x30mm 子彈 （黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/46.json
#. ~ Description of "4.6x30mm, black powder"
#. ~ Description of "4.6x30mm, reloaded"
msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated lead bullets.  The 4.6x30mm "
"round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  "
"It has low recoil, but lacks its usual armor penetration due to using a "
"simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made penetrator projectile."
msgstr ""
"31格令的4.6x30mm口径镀铜铅芯弹，4.6x30mm口径子弹是由H&K公司研制，用来与 FN "
"赫斯塔尔公司的5.7x28"
"mm口径弹药竞争的弹种。该弹有着较低后坐力，但由于使用的是简单的铅芯而不是正规的工厂制造的穿甲弹芯，因此没有常规枪弹的对于装甲的穿透力。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/46.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "4.6x30mm, reloaded"
msgid_plural "4.6x30mm, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "4.6x30mm 子彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/460sw.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".460 S&W Magnum FTX"
msgid_plural ".460 S&W Magnum FTX"
msgstr[0] ".460 S&W 马格南 FTX弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/460sw.json
#. ~ Description of ".460 S&W Magnum FTX"
msgid ""
".460 S&W Magnum ammo, with a 200 grain FTX projectile.  Its purpose serves "
"mainly as a hunting handgun, or to deter wildlife in dangerous areas, though "
"you have no doubt about its effectiveness against the undead."
msgstr ".460 S&W 马格南弹药，配有200格令FTX弹丸。它的用途主要是作为狩猎手枪，或在危险地区威慑野生动物，尽管你毫不怀疑它对丧尸的有效性。"

