msgid_plural "5.45x39mm FMJ"
msgstr[0] "5.45x39mm 全金屬被甲彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/545x39.json
#. ~ Description of "5.45x39mm FMJ"
msgid ""
"Domestically produced 5.45x39mm ammunition with a 56gr FMJ bullet.  The "
"5.45x39mm round was introduced along with the AK-74 in 1974.  It has superior "
"wounding potential to the older 7.62x39mm round and quickly replaced it in "
"Soviet military use."
msgstr ""
"56格令的5.45x39mm 7N10 "
"全金属被甲弹。5.45x39mm口径弹药在1974年随着AK-74的流行而广泛流行开来，因其较7.62x39"
"mm口径的老式型号有着更优异的破坏力，因此该种弹药在发布后就迅速地取代了老式子弹。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/545x39.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.45x39mm 7N6"
msgid_plural "5.45x39mm 7N6"
msgstr[0] "5.45x39mm 7N6 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/545x39.json
#. ~ Description of "5.45x39mm 7N6"
msgid ""
"5.45x39mm ammunition with a 57gr bullet containing a mild steel penetrator, "
"which penetrates armor marginally better than lead core projectiles.  "
"Developed in 1974 by the Russian military, and banned from import into the US "
"in 2014."
msgstr "57格令碳钢穿甲弹头的5.45x39mm口径子弹，比起铅芯弹头穿甲性能更好。1974年由俄罗斯陆军研发，在2014年被禁止进口到美国。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/545x39.json
#. ~ Item name
