#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.7x28mm SS190"
msgid_plural "5.7x28mm SS190"
msgstr[0] "5.7x28mm SS190 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Description of "5.7x28mm SS190"
msgid ""
"5.7x28mm ammunition with a 31gr AP FMJ bullet.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was "
"designed by FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although the "
"project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled, the 5.7x28mm "
"round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be reliable.  It "
"has very low recoil and its armor penetration is a defining feature."
msgstr ""
"5.7x28mm 彈藥使用 31 格令全金屬被甲彈穿甲彈頭。5.7x28mm 子彈由赫爾斯塔爾國營工廠（FN "
"Herstal）設計，用以取代北大西洋公約組織（NATO）使用的 9x19mm 帕拉貝倫彈，雖然計畫最後取消了，但 5.7x28mm "
"子彈已經在許多衝突中發揮作用，並被證明是可靠的。它有著出眾的穿甲能力，同時只有非常低的後座力。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.7x28mm SB193"
msgid_plural "5.7x28mm SB193"
msgstr[0] "5.7x28mm SB193 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Description of "5.7x28mm SB193"
msgid ""
"A subsonic cartridge derived from the 5.7x28mm, designed for silenced "
"firearms.  It offers good armor penetration at the cost of slightly less "
"damage."
msgstr "5.7x28mm 手枪弹的亚音速衍生版本，供微声武器使用。这种子弹通过稍稍降低威力的改进来获得良好的装甲穿彻性能。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.7x28mm SS195LF"
msgid_plural "5.7x28mm SS195LF"
msgstr[0] "5.7x28mm SS195LF弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Description of "5.7x28mm SS195LF"
msgid ""
"A commercially available cartridge derived from the 5.7x28mm round.  It "
"features a copper-jacketed bullet with an aluminum core, which significantly "
"reduces its armor-piercing capabilities compared to its lead-core "
"counterpart.  However, the hollow-point design enhances terminal performance "
"against unarmored targets.  In all other respects, it remains largely "
"identical to the military version."
msgstr ""
"一种由5.7x28"
"mm弹药改进而来的商业弹种。该弹头采用铜被甲包裹铝芯结构，与铅芯弹相比其穿甲性能大幅削弱，但空尖弹设计显著提升了其对无防护目标的杀伤效果。其余性能参数则与军"
"用版本基本保持一致。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.7x28mm, black powder"
msgid_plural "5.7x28mm, black powder"
msgstr[0] "5.7x28mm 子彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Description of "5.7x28mm, black powder"
#. ~ Description of "5.7x28mm, reloaded"
msgid ""
"5.7x28mm ammunition with a 31gr AP FMJ bullet.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was "
"designed by FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although the "
"project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled, the 5.7x28mm "
"round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be reliable.  It "
"has very low recoil but lacks its usual armor penetration due to using a "
"simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made penetrator projectile."
msgstr ""
"5.7x28mm 彈藥使用 31 格令穿甲全金屬被甲彈頭。5.7x28mm 子彈由赫爾斯塔爾國營工廠（FN "
"Herstal）設計，用以取代北大西洋公約組織（NATO）使用的 9x19mm 帕拉貝倫彈，雖然計畫最後取消了，但 5.7x28mm "
"子彈已經在許多衝突中發揮作用，並被證明是可靠的。它的後座力非常低，但由於使用簡單的鉛彈而不是正規工廠製造的穿甲彈，因此沒有一般穿甲彈的裝甲穿透力。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/57.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.7x28mm, reloaded"
msgid_plural "5.7x28mm, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "5.7x28mm 子彈（重填彈）"

