#. explosive mortar shell"
msgid ""
"High-explosive mortar cartridge, designed to be used against troops, light "
"vehicles, light bunkers or similar targets."
msgstr "高爆迫击炮弹，被设计用于对付士兵、轻型车辆、轻型掩体或类似目标。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/60mm.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "high-explosive mortar shell"
msgid "M720A1 60 mm mortar shell (HE)"
msgid_plural "M720A1 60 mm mortar shells (HE)"
msgstr[0] "M720A1 60mm 迫击炮弹（HE）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/60mm.json
#. ~ Description of "high-explosive mortar shell"
msgid ""
"High-explosive mortar cartridge, designed to be used against troops, light "
"vehicles, light bunkers or similar targets.  This one is more modern version, "
"both more safe and more powerful."
msgstr "高爆迫击炮弹，设计用于对付士兵、轻型车辆、轻型掩体或类似目标。这个版本更现代，更安全，更强大。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/60mm.json
