msgstr[0] "7.62x25mm 被甲空尖彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/762x25.json
#. ~ Description of "7.62x25mm JHP"
msgid ""
"A commercial version of the 7.62x25mm cartridge created for the armed forces "
"of Soviet Russia.  It was derived from the 7.63x25mm cartridge used by the "
"C96 pistol."
msgstr "蘇俄軍隊製作的 7.62x25mm 子彈的商業版本，它是從 C96 手槍的 7.63x25mm 子彈衍生而來。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/762x25.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.62x25mm FMJ hot load"
msgid_plural "7.62x25mm FMJ hot load"
msgstr[0] "7.62x25mm 高劑量全金屬被甲彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/762x25.json
#. ~ Description of "7.62x25mm FMJ hot load"
msgid ""
"A high-pressure commercial version of the 7.62x25mm cartridge, loaded with an "
"85 gr. FMJ bullet.  It is more powerful than the original."
msgstr "市售版提升膛壓的 7.62x25mm 彈藥，裝有 85 格令全金屬被甲彈頭，比原版的子彈更具威力。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/762x25.json
#. ~ Item name
