#: data/json/items/ammo/77mm_arisaka.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.7x58mm Japanese JSP"
msgid_plural "7.7x58mm Japanese JSP"
msgstr[0] "7.7x58mm 日本半被甲軟尖彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/77mm_arisaka.json
#. ~ Description of "7.7x58mm Japanese JSP"
msgid ""
"This is a 7.7x58mm Arisaka cartridge loaded with a 174 gr soft point bullet, "
"excellent against larger game and, now, zombies.  Adopted as the Japanese "
"empire's standard service cartridge in 1939 (though chambered in machine guns "
"before then) to replace the less potent 6.5x50mm Arisaka round, the 7.7mm "
"bullet was, while more deadly, never quite able to supplant the older "
"munitions.  Having acquired a following as a hunting cartridge before the "
"Cataclysm, mainly due to the prevalence of captured or surrendered Japanese "
"rifles, the round was more common than its older 6.5x50mm counterpart."
msgstr ""
"174格令软尖弹头的7.7x58mm口径Arisaka子弹，非常适合对付大型猎物和僵尸。1939"
"年被用作日本帝国的标准子弹（之前曾用作机枪弹药），以取代威力较小的6.5x50mm "
"Arisaka子弹。尽管更致命，但并未完全取代旧弹药。在大在变前，这种子弹大量用作狩猎弹药，因为受降或缴获了大量日军武器，它比旧的6.5x50"
"mm口径更常见。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/77mm_arisaka.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.7x58mm Japanese JSP, black powder"
msgid_plural "7.7x58mm Japanese JSP, black powder"
msgstr[0] "7.7x58mm 日本半被甲軟尖彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/77mm_arisaka.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.7x58mm Japanese JSP, reloaded"
msgid_plural "7.7x58mm Japanese JSP, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "7.7x58mm 日本半被甲軟尖彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "84x245mm HE"
msgid_plural "84x245mm HE"
msgstr[0] "84x245mm 高爆弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
#. ~ Description of "84x245mm HE"
msgid ""
"An 84x245mm High Explosive anti-personnel cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 "
"and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Designed to be highly effective against "
"personnel."
msgstr "一发84x246mm口径的高爆弹，用于卡尔古斯塔夫 M3 无后坐力炮或其他84mm口径武器。高爆设计能有效杀伤人员。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "84x245mm HEDP"
msgid_plural "84x245mm HEDP"
msgstr[0] "84x245mm 高爆两用弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
#. ~ Description of "84x245mm HEDP"
msgid ""
"An 84x245mm High Explosive Dual Purpose anti-materiel cartridge for the Carl "
"Gustaf M3 and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Designed to be highly effective "
"against vehicles and structures."
msgstr "一枚 84x245mm 高爆两用反器材炮弹，用于卡尔古斯塔夫 M3 无后坐力炮和其他84mm口径炮，能有效打击车辆和建筑。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "84x245mm smoke"
msgid_plural "84x245mm smoke"
msgstr[0] "84x245mm 烟雾弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/84x246mm.json
#. ~ Description of "84x245mm smoke"
msgid ""
"An 84x245mm smoke marker cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 and other 84mm "
"recoilless rifles.  Commonly used for signaling, target designation, and for "
"screening troop movements."
msgstr "一枚 84x245mm 烟雾弹，用于卡尔古斯塔夫 M3 无后坐力炮和其他84mm口径炮，常用于发信号、指示目标和掩护部队。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "8x40mm FMJ"
msgid_plural "8x40mm FMJ"
msgstr[0] "8x40mm 全金屬被甲彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
#. ~ Description of "8x40mm FMJ"
msgid ""
"An 8x40mm caseless cartridge with a rectangular shape, consisting of a "
"jacketed 127gr bullet housed inside of an advanced propellant body.  Upon "
"firing, the body will be consumed, leaving nothing behind in the chamber.  "
"Proprietary ammunition for Rivtech 8x40 caseless guns."
msgstr ""
"一枚 8x40mm 无壳方形弹药，由127格令的弹头和提供推力的弹体组成。在发射后弹体被消耗，枪膛内不会留下弹壳，专为Rivtech 8x40口径 "
"无壳枪械设计。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "8x40mm SCX"
msgid_plural "8x40mm SCX"
msgstr[0] "8x40mm 空尖无壳弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/8x40mm.json
#. ~ Description of "8x40mm SCX"
msgid ""
"An 8x40mm caseless cartridge with a rectangular shape, consisting of a "
"licensed 127gr solid copper expanding bullet housed inside of an advanced "
"propellant body.  Upon firing, the body will be consumed, leaving nothing "
"behind in the chamber.  The monometal construction of the bullet lends itself "
"to greater manufacturing precision, while also offering excellent expansion "
"and penetration.  Proprietary ammunition for Rivtech 8x40 caseless guns."
msgstr ""
"一枚 8x40mm "
"无壳方形弹药，由127"
"格令的弹头和提供推力的弹体组成。弹体在发射后消耗，枪膛内不会留下弹壳。子弹的单金属结构使其能达到更高的制造精度，也保证了良好的扩张和穿透性能。专为Rivte"
"ch 8x40口径 无壳枪械设计。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm JHP"
msgid_plural "9x19mm JHP"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 被甲空尖彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Description of "9x19mm JHP"
msgid ""
"9x19mm ammunition with a 116gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  JHP rounds have "
"inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, but their expansion slightly increases "
"stopping power against unarmored targets and reduces overpenetration."
msgstr ""
"9x19mm 彈藥使用 116 格令被甲空尖彈頭。被甲空尖彈（JHP - Jacketed Hollow Points）的穿甲能力比全金屬被甲彈（FMJ "
"- Full Metal Jacket）差，但其彈頭會在擊中目標時變型擴張，而非直接穿透目標，因此對無裝甲的目標具有更強的制止力。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm FMJ"
msgid_plural "9x19mm FMJ"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 全金屬被甲彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Description of "9x19mm FMJ"
msgid ""
"9x19mm ammunition with a brass jacketed 115gr bullet.  It has been a popular "
"round for military, law enforcement, and civilian use for over a century."
msgstr "115格令的 9x19mm 黄铜全金属被甲弹。即便已经生产了将近一个世纪，时至今日依然广泛使用在军队、执法部门和民用领域。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm +P"
msgid_plural "9x19mm +P"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 增壓彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Description of "9x19mm +P"
msgid ""
"Overpressure 9x19mm ammunition.  The round's increased velocity results in "
"superior accuracy and stopping power at the cost of higher recoil."
msgstr "提升膛壓的 9x19mm 彈藥，較高的槍口初速使得它具有更高的準確度及制止力，代價就是後座力變高了。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm +P+"
msgid_plural "9x19mm +P+"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 高增壓彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Description of "9x19mm +P+"
msgid ""
"A step beyond the high-pressure 9x19mm +P round, the +P+ has even higher "
"internal pressure offering superior damage, accuracy, and penetration."
msgstr "比 9x19mm 增壓彈更進一步，這款高增壓彈具有更強的破壞力、命中率，以及穿透力。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm JHP, black powder"
msgid_plural "9x19mm JHP, black powder"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 被甲空尖彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm FMJ, black powder"
msgid_plural "9x19mm FMJ, black powder"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 全金屬被甲彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm JHP, reloaded"
msgid_plural "9x19mm JHP, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 被甲空尖彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm FMJ, reloaded"
msgid_plural "9x19mm FMJ, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 全金屬被甲彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm +P, reloaded"
msgid_plural "9x19mm +P, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 增壓彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm +P+, reloaded"
msgid_plural "9x19mm +P+, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 高增壓彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm FMJ, matchhead powder"
msgid_plural "9x19mm FMJ, matchhead powder"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 全金屬被甲彈（紅磷火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x19mm JHP, matchhead powder"
msgid_plural "9x19mm JHP, matchhead powder"
msgstr[0] "9x19mm 被甲空尖彈（紅磷火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm 57-N-181S"
msgid_plural "9x18mm 57-N-181S"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 57-N-181S 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Description of "9x18mm 57-N-181S"
msgid ""
"9x18mm Makarov ammunition with a 93gr steel core FMJ bullet.  The 9x18mm "
"round was very common in the Eastern Bloc during the 20th century and "
"remained in Russian military service into the 21st."
msgstr ""
"93格令的 9x18mm 马卡洛夫全金属被甲钢芯弹。类似欧洲的 9x19mm 弹，9x18mm "
"弹在20世纪被东欧社会主义国家广泛使用，在21世纪依然服务于俄罗斯军队。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm SP-7"
msgid_plural "9x18mm SP-7"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm SP-7 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Description of "9x18mm SP-7"
msgid ""
"9x18mm Makarov SP-7 ammunition.  The 9x18mm round was very common in the "
"Eastern Bloc during the 20th century and remained in Russian military service "
"into the 21st."
msgstr "9x18mm 马卡洛夫 SP-7弹，类似欧洲的9x19mm弹，9x18mm弹在20世纪被东欧社会主义国家广泛使用，在21世纪依然服务于俄罗斯军队。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm RG028"
msgid_plural "9x18mm RG028"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm RG028 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Description of "9x18mm RG028"
msgid ""
"9x18mm Makarov RG028 ammunition.  The RG028 round uses a bullet with a "
"hardened steel core to improve armor penetration."
msgstr "9x18mm 马卡洛夫 RG028 弹。RG028 弹头中含有硬化钢芯，具有更好的护甲穿透能力。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm, black powder"
msgid_plural "9x18mm, black powder"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 子彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm FMJ, black powder"
msgid_plural "9x18mm FMJ, black powder"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 全金屬被甲彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm, reloaded"
msgid_plural "9x18mm, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 子彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm +P+, reloaded"
msgid_plural "9x18mm +P+, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 高增壓彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Description of "9x18mm +P+, reloaded"
msgid ""
"9x18 millimeter Makarov, an old Soviet pistol cartridge used mainly by the "
"Makarov PM.  This one has been hand-reloaded to generate higher internal "
"pressure, boosting flight stability and damage."
msgstr "9x18mm 馬卡洛夫子彈，蘇聯舊日的手槍彈種，主要供馬卡洛夫手槍使用。這顆手工重填彈由於壓力較高，具有更強的破壞力，飛行時也較穩定。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm FMJ, reloaded"
msgid_plural "9x18mm FMJ, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 全金屬被甲彈（重填彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm FMJ, matchhead powder"
msgid_plural "9x18mm FMJ, matchhead powder"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 全金屬被甲彈（紅磷火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x18mm, matchhead powder"
msgid_plural "9x18mm, matchhead powder"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 弹（红磷火药）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/atgm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "152mm ATGM HEAT"
msgid_plural "152mm ATGM HEAT"
msgstr[0] "152mm 反坦克導彈（高爆彈）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/atgm.json
#. ~ Description of "152mm ATGM HEAT"
msgid ""
"A tube-launched, optically tracked, wire-guided missile contained in a steel "
"tube.  Designed to be highly effective against vehicles and structures."
msgstr "一支以炮管發射，鋼管內裝著具有光學追蹤能力的線控導引飛彈。設計針對車輛和建築物，非常有效。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/barb.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "paralyzing barb"
msgid_plural "paralyzing barbs"
msgstr[0] "麻痺倒鉤"

#: data/json/items/ammo/barb.json
#. ~ Description of "paralyzing barb"
msgid ""
"Tiny droplets of venom trickle out of the sponge-like tissue of this sharp "
"barb."
msgstr "微小的毒液滴從這個鋒利的倒鉤的海綿狀組織中滴出。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/barb.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gene sting barb"
msgid_plural "gene sting barbs"
msgstr[0] "基因刺痛毒刺"

#: data/json/items/ammo/barb.json
#. ~ Description of "gene sting barb"
msgid ""
"Tiny droplets of cyan venom trickle out of the sponge-like tissue of this "
"sharp barb."
msgstr "这根毒刺的海绵状组织中渗出小滴的青色毒液。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/blank.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".22 blank"
msgid_plural ".22 blank"
msgstr[0] ".22 空包彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/blank.json
#. ~ Description of ".22 blank"
msgid "A powder load .22 blank used for powder-actuated tools."
msgstr "一个装满火药粉末的 .22 空包弹，用于火药发射工具。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/cannon.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cannon round shot"
msgid_plural "cannon round shot"
msgstr[0] "實心加農砲彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/cannon.json
#. ~ Description of "cannon round shot"
msgid ""
"A bundle of wadding, black gunpowder, and a cannonball, ready to be loaded "
"into a cannon."
msgstr "一捆棉絮、黑色火药和球形炮弹，准备装进大炮里。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sprayable toxic gas"
msgid_plural "sprayable toxic gas"
msgstr[0] "噴灑式毒氣"

#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
#. ~ Description of "sprayable toxic gas"
msgid ""
"A hazardous mixture made from household cleaning chemicals, improvised for "
"use in a chemical thrower.  Best used with some kind of mask or mouth "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"一些由家用清洁剂制成的致命喷雾，须填充于药剂喷罐喷洒。\n"
"\"最好戴上面罩或嘴部防护使用。\""

#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sprayable fungicide"
msgid_plural "sprayable fungicide"
msgstr[0] "噴灑式抗真菌劑"

#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
#. ~ Description of "sprayable fungicide"
msgid ""
"Fungicide enhanced with sulfur to create sprayable anti-fungal ammo for the "
"chemical thrower.  Best used with some kind of mask or mouth protection."
msgstr ""
"一些抗真菌剂加硫磺制成的强化式抗真菌喷雾，须填充于药剂喷罐喷洒。\n"
"\"最好戴上面罩或嘴部防护使用。\""

#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sprayable insecticide"
msgid_plural "sprayable insecticide"
msgstr[0] "噴灑式殺蟲劑"

#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
#. ~ Description of "sprayable insecticide"
msgid ""
"Strong sprayable insecticide ammo for the chemical thrower.  Best used with "
"some kind of mask or mouth protection."
msgstr ""
"一些强化式杀虫剂，需填充于药剂喷罐喷洒。\n"
"\"最好戴上面罩或嘴部防护使用。\""

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12.3ln round"
msgid_plural "12.3ln rounds"
msgstr[0] "12.3ln 子彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "12.3ln round"
msgid ""
"In some alternate universe, the 12.3ln cartridge was introduced in Romania in "
"the wake of the second Carpathian conflict.  The PA md. 71 rifle, using this "
"ammunition, rapidly gained popularity in the Eastern Union, and from there, "
"the world.  Due to this, the 12.3ln rapidly became the standard combat round "
"in the Eurasian sphere, making it easy for the Exodii to stockpile it in "
"large quantities when they visited that version of Earth.  It looks vaguely "
"like a rimless, .303 British cartridge loaded with a larger, non-spitzer "
"bullet."
msgstr ""
"一枚12.3ln口径弹药，类似于.303口径英制弹药，只是弹头更大更圆。\n"
"在某个平行世界中，罗马尼亚在第二次喀尔巴阡山冲突后引进了 12.3ln 弹。使用这种弹药的 PA md.71 "
"步枪迅速在东欧联盟以及世界各地流行起来。正因为如此，12.3ln 弹迅速成为欧亚大陆的标准弹药口径。因此流亡族在到达这个世界的地球时轻易储存了大量弹药。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12.3ln, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12.3ln, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "12.3ln 弹（复装）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12.3ln, black powder"
msgid_plural "12.3ln, black powder"
msgstr[0] "12.3ln彈（黑火藥）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua light slug"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua light slugs"
msgstr[0] "27.3x110 蒂约轻型独头弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua light slug"
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua light slug loads were employed by colonists on some alternate "
"Earth to take dangerous game, and later, fend off commonwealth forces from "
"atop palisade walls."
msgstr "27.3x110 蒂约轻型独头弹，某个平行世界中殖民者为狩猎危险猎物研发。后来用于从防御工事击退联邦军队。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua medium slug"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua medium slugs"
msgstr[0] "27.3x110 蒂约中型独头弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua medium slug"
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua medium slug loads were employed by colonists on some alternate "
"Earth to take extremely dangerous game, and later, fend off commonwealth "
"forces from atop palisade walls.  Most users of the Brogyaga guns considered "
"these shells too punishing to withstand."
msgstr ""
"27.3x110 "
"蒂约中型独头弹，某个平行世界中殖民者为狩猎高危猎物研发。后来用于从防御工事击退联邦军队。大多数使用博雅格枪械的人常抱怨子弹威力太大，难以应对。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slug"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slugs"
msgstr[0] "27.3x110 蒂约重型独头弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slug"
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua slug loads similar to these were employed by colonists on some "
"alternate Earth to take extremely dangerous game.  This heavy slug load, "
"however, was used almost entirely by recoil enthusiasts and braggarts, until "
"the Exodii came upon them."
msgstr ""
"27.3x110 "
"蒂约独头弹，某个平行世界中殖民者为狩猎高危猎物研发的加重版本。在流亡族出现前，这种重型独头弹几乎只有对后坐力有特殊嗜好或是喜欢吹牛的人才用。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
msgstr[0] "27.3x110 蒂约猎“鸟”弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
msgid ""
"On some alien Earth, scores of flocks were decimated by loads such as this "
"27.3x110 Diyua shell, loaded with a ludicrous number of tiny pellets.  Though "
"it would still be devastating against more humanoid targets, flockshot like "
"this is more typically employed by the Exodii by the occasional hunting party."
msgstr "在某个异界，27.3x110 蒂约猎鸟弹消灭了大量鸟群。尽管对于类人的目标来说，这种弹药仍能造成严重破坏，但像这种子弹通常仅由流亡族的临时狩猎队使用。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua canister"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua canisters"
msgstr[0] "27.3x110 蒂约开花弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua canister"
msgid ""
"On some alien Earth, these mini-canister loads mimicked much larger artillery "
"shot, and were employed for anti-personnel usage against advancing waves from "
"atop a palisade.  The Exodii would load these in their Brogyeki sidearms for "
"backup usage."
msgstr "在某个异界，这种27.3x110 口径霰弹模仿大型的霰弹式炮弹，用于对从防御工事顶部对人群造成大规模杀伤。流亡族会在他们的副武器博杰奇中填装这种子弹备用。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua star"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua star"
msgstr[0] "27.3x44 蒂约照明弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua star"
msgid ""
"These flare cartridges are for use in 27.3x44 Diyua guns, or perhaps in "
"27.3x110 Diyua guns.  They are employed by the Exodii for emergency signaling "
"when their usual communications systems are suffering interference, "
"breakdown, or are being jammed."
msgstr "用于27.3x44 口径，或是27.3x110口径蒂约枪械的照明弹。流亡族的常规通信受到干扰、阻塞、破坏时，用以传递紧急信号。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
msgstr[0] "27.3x44 蒂约训练弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge loaded with a large hollow aluminum projectile, "
"painted blue at the tip, for practicing shooting.  If interdimensional total "
"replacement cyborgs have to practice, maybe you should too."
msgstr "一枚装有大号空心铝制弹头的 27.3x44口径 蒂约弹药，尖端涂成了蓝色，用于射击训练。嗯，如果说全身都是义肢的改造人都需要训练的话，你或许也该练练了。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
msgstr[0] "27.3x44 蒂约温压弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge with a minute amount of liquid fuel encasing a fuel "
"dispersing explosive charge, and a secondary ignition charge.  On impact the "
"fuel is dispersed, creating a fuel air mixture which is ignited a few "
"milliseconds later.  In a cartridge like 27.3x44 Diyua, the pressure wave "
"produced is rather diminutive, yet it makes the most of what little payload "
"is available."
msgstr ""
"一枚封装有液态燃料和爆破性弹头的27.3x44口径蒂约弹药，弹头有二级点火设计。击中时燃料扩散至空气中，几毫秒后随之点火，造成温压爆炸。27.3x44"
"口径能产生的压力波不大，但这种设计已经尽可能地利用载荷产生更大的杀伤力了。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
msgstr[0] "27.3x44 蒂约高爆弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge loaded with a high explosive charge and a "
"point-detonating fuze.  Primarily useful for assaulting soft targets, and, in "
"their universe of origin, dispersing crowds."
msgstr "一枚装有高爆弹头及起爆引信的 27.3x44口径蒂约弹药。主要用于对付软体目标，或是在他们原来的世界中驱散人群。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
msgid_plural "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
msgstr[0] "66/27.3x278 蒂约多用弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
msgid ""
"A long 27.3 Diyua cartridge loaded with a propelling charge, attached to a "
"large high explosive shaped charge grenade several times larger in diameter.  "
"It was designed to be muzzle loaded into 27.3x44 Diyua guns.  Though the "
"grenade's penetration and fragmentation were ultimately deemed insufficient, "
"this was of no matter to the Exodii who saw value in the explosive potential "
"the grenade added to the Brogyeki '23."
msgstr ""
"一枚带有推进弹头的27.3口径加长蒂约子弹，连接着一枚直径几倍的的高爆穿甲榴弹。它设计从27.3x44 "
"蒂约枪的枪口填装。尽管最终发现这枚榴弹的穿透力和碎片效果不足，但对于流亡族来说，这并不重要，因为他们看到了这枚榴弹为Brogyeki "
"'23增添的爆炸潜力的价值。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Caotel cell"
msgid ""
"This is a small metallic cube of inscrutable construction.  A single groove "
"etched into one side of the object presumably allows it to be mounted into "
"other things, and a small red arrow has been helpfully painted besides it."
msgstr "这是一个构造难以理解的小型金属立方体。物体一侧刻有一条凹槽，大概是为了将其安装到其他物体上，旁边还贴心地画了一个红色箭头。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Khuunäöfaai firework payload"
msgid ""
"Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Highly reactive to oxygen, "
"removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr "锟厄焚军械炮的加压化学有效载荷。对氧气有强烈反应，从罐中将其取出是个坏主意。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Khuunäöfaai incendiary payload"
msgid ""
"Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Highly flammable and "
"reactive to oxygen, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr "锟厄焚军械炮的加压化学有效载荷。高度易燃且对氧气有反应，将其从罐中取出将是一个坏主意。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Khuunäöfaai corrosive payload"
msgid ""
"Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Essentially a juiced up "
"version of pirahna solution, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr "锟厄焚军械炮的加压化学有效载荷。本质上是食人鱼溶液（浓硫酸和过氧化氢溶液）的浓缩版本，将其从罐中取出是一个坏主意。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Khuunäöfaai foaming payload"
msgid_plural "Khuunäöfaai foaming payloads"
msgstr[0] "锟厄焚军械炮发泡胶载荷"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Khuunäöfaai foaming payload"
msgid ""
"Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  An incredibly powerful "
"binding agent and sealant, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr "锟厄焚军械炮的加压化学有效载荷。一种非常强大的粘合剂和密封剂，将其从罐中取出是一个坏主意。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "3.3 naval, FMJ"
msgid_plural "3.3 naval, FMJ"
msgstr[0] "3.3 海军型全金属被甲弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "3.3 naval, FMJ"
msgid ""
"Initially made for marine combat, this hefty projectile is a go-to round for "
"late-stage Exodii fights."
msgstr "最初为流亡族的海军陆战队战斗而设计，这种沉重的弹药是流亡族后期战斗中的首选弹药。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#. ~ Description of "paper cartridge"
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and a metallic projectile.  "
"Historically used to reload muzzleloaders in a more reasonable time."
msgstr "一個內含黑火藥和金屬彈丸的紙卷彈藥。能夠加快老式燧發槍緩慢的裝彈速度。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/black_powder.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "paper shot cartridge"
msgid_plural "paper shot cartridges"
msgstr[0] "紙卷霰彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/black_powder.json
#. ~ Description of "paper shot cartridge"
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and metallic shot.  Historically "
"used to reload muzzleloaders in a more reasonable time."
msgstr "一個內含黑火藥和金屬彈丸的紙卷彈藥。能夠加快老式燧發槍緩慢的裝彈速度。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flechette"
msgid_plural "flechettes"
msgstr[0] "鋼鏢"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Description of "flechette"
msgid ""
"A tiny steel dart.  Can be fired from a nail gun or similar weapon, or used "
"for crafting ammunition."
msgstr "微型钢镖，可以被射钉枪或者其他类似武器发射，或用来制造弹药。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze nail"
msgid_plural "bronze nails"
msgstr[0] "青铜钉"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze nail"
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of bronze.  It can be used to construct various things "
"with a hammer."
msgstr "一颗钉子形状的青铜，配合锤子可以打造各种各样的东西。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nail"
msgid_plural "nails"
msgstr[0] "鐵釘"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Description of "nail"
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of steel.  It can be used to construct various things with "
"a hammer."
msgstr "一颗钉子形状的钢铁，配合锤子可以打造各种各样的东西。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nut and bolt"
msgid_plural "nuts and bolts"
msgstr[0] "螺母和螺栓"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Description of "nut and bolt"
msgid "A matching nut and bolt.  Useful for securing objects together."
msgstr "一对匹配的螺母和螺栓。用于将物品固定在一起。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/paintball.json
#. ~ Description of "paintball"
msgid ""
"A small paintball for recreational shooting.  Getting shot with one stings a "
"little, but you'd be hard-pressed to kill anything with it."
msgstr "娱乐休闲射击时所使用的小彩弹。被打中时有点刺痛，但你很难用它杀死任何东西。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge birdshot, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge birdshot, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "猎鸟弹(复装)"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge dragon's breath, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge dragon's breath, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "龙息霰弹(复装)"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge dragon's breath, reloaded"
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge dragon's breath, black powder"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, "
"high-temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel.  While looking "
"very impressive, they present more of a fire hazard than an effective tool "
"for lighting up hostiles.  This one was made in somebody's garage.  Are you "
"sure you want to shoot this?"
msgstr ""
"一种填充镁颗粒或碎片的霰弹枪弹，主要用作紧急求救信号弹或者起火工具。当该弹药发射时，枪管会射出高温火花和火焰。但它们更像是一种火灾隐患而不是一种点燃敌人的有"
"效工具。这个某个人手工复装弹型号。你确定要用这个吗？"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge buckshot, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge buckshot, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹(复装)"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge flechette, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge flechettes, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "箭形弹（复装）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge slug, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge slugs, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "独头弹（复装）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge birdshot, black powder"
msgid_plural "12 gauge birdshot, black powder"
msgstr[0] "猎鸟弹（黑火药）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge dragon's breath, black powder"
msgid_plural "12 gauge dragon's breath, black powder"
msgstr[0] "龙息霰弹（黑火药）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge buckshot, black powder"
msgid_plural "12 gauge buckshot, black powder"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹（黑火药）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge flechette, black powder"
msgid_plural "12 gauge flechettes, black powder"
msgstr[0] "箭形弹（黑火药）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge slug, black powder"
msgid_plural "12 gauge slugs, black powder"
msgstr[0] "独头弹（黑火药）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge buckshot"
msgid_plural "12 gauge buckshot"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge buckshot"
msgid ""
"A 12 gauge shotgun shell, filled with 9 pellets of 00 buck.  A very common "
"and versatile round, they're useful for both self defense and for hunting.  "
"The spread of the shot doesn't just increase your chances to have a "
"projectile hit, it also causes a much larger wound, greatly increasing "
"lethality.  It does struggle with range, and against body armor."
msgstr ""
"12号口径霰弹枪弹，内装9枚00"
"号鹿弹。这种弹药极为常见且用途广泛，既可用于自卫也能狩猎。弹丸散布不仅能提高命中几率，还会造成更大面积的创伤，显著增强杀伤效果。但其射程有限，对防弹衣效果欠"
"佳。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge beanbag"
msgid_plural "12 gauge beanbags"
msgstr[0] "沙包弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge beanbag"
msgid ""
"A beanbag round for shotguns.  Designated 'less-lethal' and intended to "
"disable, but remember that 'less-lethal' does not mean 'non-lethal'."
msgstr "一枚霰弹枪使用的防暴霰弹。宣称\"低致命性\"并旨在使目标瘫痪，但请记住，\"低致命性\"并不意味着\"非致命性\"。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge birdshot"
msgid_plural "12 gauge birdshot"
msgstr[0] "猎鸟弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge birdshot"
msgid ""
"Weak shotgun ammunition, filled with tiny pellets and a low powder charge.  "
"Used often for shooting clays or birds, they're a very common commercial "
"round.  Their effectiveness against human targets are quite limited outside "
"of very close ranges, serving more to hurt than kill."
msgstr ""
"12号口径猎鸟霰弹，弹丸细小且装药量较低。这种商用弹药常用于飞靶射击或猎鸟，极为常见。但除非在极近距离，否则对人类目标的杀伤效果相当有限，更多是造成伤害而非"
"致命。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge dragon's breath"
msgid_plural "12 gauge dragon's breath"
msgstr[0] "龙息霰弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge dragon's breath"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, "
"high-temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel.  While looking "
"very impressive, they present more of a fire hazard than an effective tool "
"for lighting up hostiles."
msgstr ""
"一种填充镁粒或镁片的霰弹枪弹，主要用于求救信号弹或起火工具。击发时，枪管会喷出高温火花与烈焰。虽然视觉效果惊人，但这玩意儿点燃敌人的效率远不如引发火灾的效率"
"高。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge flechette"
msgid_plural "12 gauge flechettes"
msgstr[0] "镖型霰弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge flechette"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  While looking quite dangerous, "
"their actual effectiveness is questionable.  Despite being finned, they have "
"a tendency to tumble mid-air, leading to greater spread and reduced damage."
msgstr "装填细小钢镖的霰弹枪弹。虽然看起来相当致命，但实际杀伤效果存疑。尽管钢镖带有尾翼，仍容易在空中翻滚，导致弹道扩散加剧，杀伤力下降。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge explosive slug"
msgid_plural "12 gauge explosive slugs"
msgstr[0] "高爆霰弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge explosive slug"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell shooting a small explosive.  Banned in several states.  While "
"an explosive from a shotgun sounds impressive, its practical applications are "
"limited at best.  The loss in mass in order to accommodate an explosive give "
"it much less impact force compared to traditional ammunition.  The relatively "
"small size of the slug can only accommodate a limited amount of explosives, "
"resulting in a fairly underwhelming explosion.  These traits make it a "
"utility tool for damaging barriers and disrupting other explosive devices, "
"rather than something for anti-personnel use."
msgstr ""
"一种发射小型爆炸弹头的霰弹。在数个州被禁用。虽然能爆炸的霰弹听起来很强，但其实际应用场景十分有限。与传统霰弹相比，为了容纳炸药而损失的弹头质量使其产生的冲击"
"力要小得多，而弹头相对较小的尺寸只能容纳十分有限的炸药，导致爆炸强度相当低。这些特点使其成为破障和干扰其他爆炸装置的实用工具，而非用于杀伤人员。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge buckshot, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge buckshot, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹（废料）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge buckshot, scrap loaded"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with whatever scrap metal was lying around.  More "
"damaging than birdshot, but fairly inaccurate."
msgstr "一种塞进了各种金属废料的霰弹，弹丸材料完全因地制宜。威力比猎鸟弹稍微强点，就是不太准。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹（废料黑火药）"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with black gunpowder and whatever scrap metal was "
"lying around.  The logical conclusion of ammunition bootlegging.  It'll kill "
"zombies just fine, but your gun will suffer for it."
msgstr "一种塞进了各种金属废料的霰弹，弹丸材料完全因地制宜。自然是某人自制的弹药。它可以很好地杀死丧尸，但你的枪肯定也不好受。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge slug"
msgid_plural "12 gauge slugs"
msgstr[0] "独头弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge slug"
msgid ""
"A 12 gauge slug.  Unlike birdshot or buckshot, slugs are a single large "
"projectile fired from a shotgun.  They're mostly used for hunting bigger "
"game, or for longer range shots where typical buck may spread out more.  Not "
"as lethal as buckshot in certain ranges, but much more accurate and with a "
"longer range, and is more effective against armor."
msgstr ""
"12号口径独头弹。与鸟弹或鹿弹不同，独头弹是从霰弹枪发射的单一大型弹头。主要用于狩猎大型猎物，或在较远距离射击时使用——普通鹿弹在这种距离下弹道会过于分散。"
"虽然某些射程内杀伤力不及鹿弹，但精准度更高、有效射程更远，对护甲的穿透效果也更好。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wax slug"
msgid_plural "wax slugs"
msgstr[0] "蜡封独头猎鸟弹"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "wax slug"
msgid ""
"A round of 12 gauge birdshot that has had the crimp opened, and wax poured "
"into the shot to mimic the performance of a proper slug."
msgstr "一种经过加工的12号口径鸟弹。通过割开霰弹壳顶部的收口，再将融化的蜡灌入霰弹中，使其凝固成一个整体，从而达到类似常规独头弹的效果。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/signal_flare.json
#. ~ Description of "signal flare"
msgid ""
"A heavy plastic cartridge made for use in flare guns.  It appears to be a "
"modified 12 gauge shotgun shell."
msgstr "一種用於信號槍的重型塑膠彈藥。它似乎是經過改造的 12 鉛徑霰彈槍彈藥。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "sling-ready Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "投射用汽油彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a long fuse inserted, ready to be used in a "
"staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, use "
"it light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your "
"inventory to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"一瓶塞着一块长长引线的易燃液体，随时可以使用带有改进托架的弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用该物品将点燃它，当然你需要口袋里有打火机或火柴来点燃它。点燃后投掷会引发"
"大火。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
msgid "Light rag"
msgstr "點燃布條"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
msgid "You light the Molotov cocktail!"
msgstr "你燃點了汽油彈！"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sling-ready grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready grenades"
msgstr[0] "投射用手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready grenade"
msgid ""
"A military-grade fragmentary hand grenade, modified with a retaining fuse for "
"use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a "
"sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have "
"five seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一个军用破片手雷，随时可以使用带有改进托架的弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用此物品以拔掉插销，之后你有五秒钟的时间将它投掷出去。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
msgid "Activate grenade"
msgstr "啟動手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
msgid "You snap the retaining fuse on the grenade."
msgstr "你拔掉了手雷的插销。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投射用自製小型手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from spare parts and modified "
"with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item without a "
"sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have "
"5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一个用各种零件拼凑成的自制手雷，用延时引信改装，随时可以使用弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用此物品以点燃引信，之后你有五秒钟的时间将它投掷出去。"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready military explosive small
#. homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready military explosive
