#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chest ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "chest ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "胸部彈藥袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "chest ammo pouch"
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your chest and hold a single "
"magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在胸口上的弹匣包。可装一个弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "chest rig"
msgid "chest rig"
msgid_plural "chest rigs"
msgstr[0] "胸掛背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "chest rig"
#. ~ Description of variant "chest rig" of item "chest rig"
msgid ""
"Popularized during the Vietnam War, chest rigs like these are typically "
"plain, barebones affairs consisting of three or more pouches in a row, with "
"straps to secure them on your chest.  This one can hold four magazines in its "
"pouches."
msgstr "在越戰時很興盛，像這樣的胸掛背心一般來說很簡略，有一排三個以上的彈藥袋，用綁帶固定在你的胸部。這個背心的彈藥袋可以存放四個彈匣。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chest rig"
msgid "patriot's chest rig"
msgid_plural "patriot's chest rigs"
msgstr[0] "爱国者军用携行具"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of variant "patriot's chest rig" of item "chest rig"
msgid ""
"An American flag is proudly embroidered across the front of each pouch, with "
"a tiny, eagle-winged .50-caliber bullet crowning each banner."
msgstr "这件弹挂的每个口袋前都自豪地绣有美国国旗，每面旗帜上都有一颗小巧的鹰翼.50口径子弹。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "javelin bag"
msgid_plural "javelin bags"
msgstr[0] "標槍袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "javelin bag"
msgid "An open medieval-looking bag, designed to store javelins within easy reach."
msgstr "一款開口的中世紀風格袋子，設計來便於存取標槍。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "javelin bag"
msgid "Stash javelins"
msgstr "存放標槍"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ankle ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "ankle ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "腳踝式彈藥袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "ankle ammo pouch"
msgid ""
"A small fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your ankle and hold a "
"single small magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在脚踝上的弹匣包。可装一个小型弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leg ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "leg ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "腿掛式彈藥袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "leg ammo pouch"
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your leg and hold two magazines "
"close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在腿上的弹匣包，能够装下两个弹匣，保证弹药随手取用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quiver"
msgid_plural "quivers"
msgstr[0] "箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "quiver"
msgid ""
"A leather quiver worn at the waist that can hold 20 arrows or bolts.  Use "
"insert to store arrows or bolts."
msgstr "一個以皮革製成的箭袋，穿戴在腰間，能夠裝入 20 支箭矢或弩箭。使用放入來裝入箭矢或弩箭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nylon quiver"
msgid_plural "nylon quivers"
msgstr[0] "尼龍箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon quiver"
msgid ""
"A lighter and more durable quiver made of nylon, with straps to attach to a "
"MOLLE system."
msgstr "由尼龍製成的更輕、更耐用的箭袋，附有可連接到模組化輕型承載設備（MOLLE）的帶子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "birchbark quiver"
msgid_plural "birchbark quivers"
msgstr[0] "樺皮箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "birchbark quiver"
msgid ""
"A quiver woven from strips of birch bark, worn at the waist, that can hold 20 "
"arrows or bolts.  Use insert to store arrows or bolts."
msgstr "一個以樺樹皮製成的箭袋，穿戴在腰間，能夠裝入 20 支箭矢或弩箭。使用放入來裝入箭矢或弩箭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pipe quiver"
msgid_plural "pipe quivers"
msgstr[0] "鋼管箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "pipe quiver"
msgid ""
"A makeshift quiver fashioned from a pipe, worn at the waist.  Heavier and "
"thinner than a typical quiver, it can only hold 10 arrows or bolts.  Use "
"insert to store arrows or bolts."
msgstr "用鋼管製作的粗製箭袋，戴在腰間。它比典型的箭袋更重、更薄，只能容納 10 支箭矢或弩箭。使用插入動作來存放箭矢或弩箭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large quiver"
msgid_plural "large quivers"
msgstr[0] "大型箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "large quiver"
msgid ""
"A large leather quiver trimmed with metal, worn on the back, that can hold 60 "
"arrows or bolts.  Historically used by horse archers, rather than foot "
"archers, but neither of THEM had to fight zombies.  Use insert to store "
"arrows or bolts."
msgstr ""
"一個鑲嵌了金屬的大型皮革箭袋， 穿戴在背後，能夠裝入 60 支箭矢或弩箭。歷史上是供馬弓兵使用，而非步行的弓兵， "
"但這兩者都不用對抗殭屍。使用\"放入\"來裝入箭矢或弩箭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large birchbark quiver"
msgid_plural "large birchbark quivers"
msgstr[0] "大型樺皮箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "large birchbark quiver"
msgid ""
"A large quiver woven from strips of birchbark, worn on the back, that can "
"hold 60 arrows or bolts.  Use insert to store arrows or bolts."
msgstr "一個以樺樹皮製成的大型箭袋，穿戴在背上，能夠裝入 60 支箭矢或弩箭。使用放入來裝入箭矢或弩箭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large pipe quiver"
msgid_plural "large pipe quivers"
msgstr[0] "大型鋼管箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "large pipe quiver"
msgid ""
"A large makeshift quiver fashioned from 3 pipes, worn on the back.  Heavier "
"and thinner than a typical large quiver, it can only hold 30 arrows or bolts. "
" Use insert to store arrows or bolts."
msgstr "用 3 根鋼管製作的粗製大型箭袋，戴在背上。它比典型的大型箭袋更重更薄，只能容納 30 支箭矢或弩箭。 使用插入動作來存放箭矢或弩箭。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "simple cloth quiver"
msgid_plural "simple cloth quivers"
msgstr[0] "简易布制箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "simple cloth quiver"
msgid ""
"A simple quiver made out of cloth that can be adjusted to hold various types "
"of arrows, bolts, and spears of different lengths.  Takes slightly longer to "
"pull ammunition from than a regular quiver.  Use insert to store arrows, "
"bolts, fishing spears, or atlatl spears."
msgstr "由布料制成的简易箭袋，可以调节大小以容纳不同长度的箭矢、弩箭和矛。取箭速度比普通箭袋稍慢。使用以存储箭矢、弩箭、捕鱼矛或投矛。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "multi-function quiver"
msgid_plural "multi-function quivers"
msgstr[0] "多功能箭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "multi-function quiver"
msgid ""
"A large cotton quiver capable of easily storing 16 arrows.  It includes a bag "
"and straps to store a takedown bow, as well as a small pouch for archery "
"accessories.  Use insert to store arrows or bolts and activate to "
"holster/draw your bow."
msgstr ""
"大型棉布箭袋，可輕易存放 16 "
"支箭矢。它有一個袋子和用於存放可拆卸弓的繫帶，以及一個用於存放弓箭配件的小袋。使用插入動作來存放箭矢或弩箭，啟動它來存放/拔出弓。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tac vest"
msgid_plural "tac vests"
msgstr[0] "戰術背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "tac vest"
msgid ""
"This light vest is meant to carry your magazines, shells and pistols.  They "
"are popular among law enforcement, but less so than combination tactical "
"vests incorporating Kevlar."
msgstr "这款轻便的背心可以让你携带弹匣，霰弹及手枪。它们很受执法部门的欢迎，但不如加入了凯夫拉纤维的战术背心。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "tac vest"
msgid "Stash item"
msgstr "存入物品"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "light load bearing vest"
msgid_plural "light load bearing vests"
msgstr[0] "輕型模組化戰術背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "light load bearing vest"
msgid ""
"This lightweight harness covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a few "
"pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some "
"soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can "
"then be easily separated."
msgstr ""
"一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的轻型背带，设计用来安装些小口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离"
"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "load bearing vest"
msgid_plural "load bearing vests"
msgstr[0] "模組化戰術背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "load bearing vest"
msgid ""
"This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters "
"and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over "
"directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be easily "
"separated."
msgstr "一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的背带，设计用来安装些口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "load bearing vest with sling"
msgid_plural "load bearing vests with slings"
msgstr[0] "模組化戰術背心（含背帶）"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "load bearing vest with sling"
msgid ""
"This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters "
"and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over "
"directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be easily "
"separated.  This one has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders "
"using a system to keep your weapon extra secure."
msgstr ""
"一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的背带，设计用来安装些口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离。这个"
"型号有个穿在肩上的单点背带，附带系统能够保证挂在上面的武器更加稳固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/utility.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "load bearing vest with sling"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "heavy load bearing vest with sling"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survivor harness"
msgid "Rifle sling."
msgstr "步枪背带"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy load bearing vest"
msgid_plural "heavy load bearing vests"
msgstr[0] "重型模組化戰術背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy load bearing vest"
msgid ""
"This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large "
"number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred "
"by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as "
"they can then be easily separated."
msgstr ""
"一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的重型背带，设计用来安装大量口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离"
"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy load bearing vest with sling"
msgid_plural "heavy load bearing vests with slings"
msgstr[0] "重型模組化戰術背心（含背帶）"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy load bearing vest with sling"
msgid ""
"This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large "
"number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred "
"by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as "
"they can then be easily separated.  This one has a single point sling wrapped "
"around the shoulders using a system to keep your weapon extra secure."
msgstr ""
"一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的重型背带，设计用来安装大量口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。一些士兵更喜欢将附件直接安装在防弹背心上，因为它们很容易分离"
"。这个型号有个穿在肩上的单点背带，附带系统能够保证挂在上面的武器更加稳固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "breacher load bearing vest"
msgid_plural "breacher load bearing vests"
msgstr[0] "破門手模組化戰術背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "breacher load bearing vest"
msgid ""
"This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large "
"number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  This one "
"has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders using a system to keep "
"your weapon extra secure, as well as a set of strong magnets attached to the "
"torso and waist to hold a breaching shotgun."
msgstr ""
"一个表面覆盖了MOLLE连接织带的重型背带，设计用来安装大量口袋、枪套和其他兼容PALS的附件。这个型号有个穿在肩上的单点背带，附带系统能够保证挂在上面的武"
"器更加稳固，以及一套安装在躯干和腰部的强力磁铁，可以吸住一把破门霰弹枪。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
msgid "Breaching shotgun magnets."
msgstr "破门霰弹枪磁铁"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical radio pouch"
msgid_plural "tactical radio pouches"
msgstr[0] "戰術無線電袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical radio pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep your radio accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps "
"for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为无线电的可及性和安全性而设计的口袋。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gadget pouch"
msgid_plural "gadget pouches"
msgstr[0] "雜物袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "gadget pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep gadgets and small items accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为小型物品的可及性和安全性而设计的口袋。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "H2O pouch"
msgid_plural "H2O pouches"
msgstr[0] "水袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "H2O pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold a water bottle with an additional front tactical "
"pocket.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个设计用来装水瓶的口袋，前面还有个战术口袋。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canteen pouch"
msgid_plural "canteen pouches"
msgstr[0] "水壺袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "canteen pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep your canteen accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE "
"straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为水壶的可及性和安全性而设计的口袋。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical tool pouch"
msgid_plural "tactical tool pouches"
msgstr[0] "戰術工具袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical tool pouch"
msgid ""
"A low profile pouch designed to keep your tools accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your "
"chest."
msgstr "一个专为工具而设计的小口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flashlight pouch"
msgid_plural "flashlight pouches"
msgstr[0] "手電筒袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "flashlight pouch"
msgid ""
"A tiny pouch designed to keep your flashlight accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为手电筒而设计的小口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical holster"
msgid_plural "tactical holsters"
msgstr[0] "戰術槍套"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical holster"
msgid ""
"A sturdy holster designed to be worn vertically, to keep a small profile on a "
"tactical vest.  This makes it a little more awkward to draw from than a "
"normal holster."
msgstr "一个结实的枪套，设计成垂直佩戴以便在战术背心上占据较小空间。这使得它比普通枪套更难拔出。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gas mask pouch"
msgid_plural "gas mask pouches"
msgstr[0] "防毒面具袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "gas mask pouch"
msgid ""
"A large pouch capable of holding a gas mask and an additional filter, keeping "
"both accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为防毒面具和额外的过滤器而设计的大口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "gas mask pouch"
msgid "The main compartment for a respirator."
msgstr "防毒面具的主要部分。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "gas mask pouch"
msgid "A side pocket for a single spare filter."
msgstr "侧面的小口袋，用于放置一个备用滤芯。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "gas mask pouch"
msgid "An internal divider pocket for some small accessories."
msgstr "一个内部隔层小口袋，用于收纳一些小配件。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical grenade pouch"
msgid_plural "tactical grenade pouches"
msgstr[0] "戰術榴彈袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical grenade pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold one military grenade, keeping it both accessible and "
"secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为军用手榴弹而设计的口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "triple stacker ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "triple stacker ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "三層堆疊彈藥袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "triple stacker ammo pouch"
msgid ""
"A collection of 6 pockets, 3 wide and 2 deep, designed to hold rifle "
"magazines and keep them accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for "
"attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your chest."
msgstr "一个六联弹药袋，宽三列深两排，用来保证步枪弹匣的可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical shotshell pouch"
msgid_plural "tactical shotshell pouches"
msgstr[0] "戰術霰彈袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical shotshell pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold shotgun shells or .308 rounds, keeping them "
"accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr "一个专为霰弹和.308弹而设计的口袋，保证其可及性和安全性。有可以用来安在背带或背心上的MOLLE连接织带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Kevlar vest"
msgid_plural "Kevlar vests"
msgstr[0] "克維拉背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "Kevlar vest"
msgid ""
"A massive handmade imitation of a proper ballistic vest for abnormally large "
"folks.  Large and heavy, but will still fit under an abnormally large coat."
msgstr "一件巨大的自制凯夫拉防弹背心，根据正品仿制，供体型异常大的人使用。又大又重，但仍然适合放在异常大的外套下面。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather ammo satchel"
msgid_plural "leather ammo satchels"
msgstr[0] "皮革彈藥垮包"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "leather ammo satchel"
msgid ""
"A sturdy leather ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a "
"single large magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在腰上的皮革弹匣包。可装一个大型弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather chest ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "leather chest ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "皮革胸部彈藥袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "leather chest ammo pouch"
msgid ""
"A leather ammo pouch that can be strapped to your chest and hold a single "
"magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在胸口上的皮革弹匣包。可装一个弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
