msgid_plural "medium belt loops"
msgstr[0] "中号腰带环"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "medium belt loop"
msgid ""
"A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching tools and some weapons to a "
"load-bearing vest."
msgstr "一个 MOLLE 兼容的环，用于将工具和一些武器连接到承重背心上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large belt loop"
msgid_plural "large belt loops"
msgstr[0] "大号腰带环"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "large belt loop"
msgid ""
"A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching large tools and weapons to a "
"load-bearing vest."
msgstr "一个 MOLLE 兼容的环，用于将大型工具和武器连接到承重背心上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sustainment pouch"
msgid_plural "sustainment pouches"
msgstr[0] "补给品袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "sustainment pouch"
msgid ""
"A large, drawstring & buckle pouch originally designed to hold 3 MREs, and "
"part of the official MOLLE II rucksack system.  Has MOLLE straps for "
"attaching to a belt, vest, or rucksack."
msgstr "一个大型抽绳扣带包，原设计用于装三份军用即食口粮，属于MOLLE II标准背包系统的组成部分。配有MOLLE织带，可固定在腰带、战术背心或背包上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of 2-by-arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of 2-by-arm guards"
msgstr[0] "木材護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of 2-by-arm guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of improvised arm guards made from broken pieces of a plank that are "
"tied to your arms with rags and string.  They offer good protection, but are "
"really uncomfortable to wear."
msgstr ""
"一对用布条绑上了木板的强化双臂护手，能够提供良好的防护，但穿起来很累赘。\n"
"\"看起来和骨折用的夹板没什么区别，但是请遵医嘱。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of carpet arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of carpet arm guards"
msgstr[0] "地毯护臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of carpet arm guards"
msgid ""
"Small squares of carpet rolled around your upper and lower arms.  Armor of "
"the truly desperate or crafty."
msgstr "裹住上臂和手肘的小张地毯。身处绝望时灵光乍现制作的防具。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of carpet bracers"
msgid_plural "pairs of carpet bracers"
msgstr[0] "地毯护腕"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of carpet bracers"
msgid ""
"Small squares of carpet rolled around your lower arms.  The bare minimum to "
"hopefully stop a bite or two."
msgstr "可以包裹住你下臂的小块地毯。希望它至少能抗上丧尸们的一两口咬伤吧。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of chitin arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of chitin arm guards"
msgstr[0] "甲殼護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of chitin arm guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards made from the exoskeletons of insects.  Light and "
"durable."
msgstr "一雙由昆蟲外骨骼製成的護臂。輕又可靠。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of biosilicified chitin arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of biosilicified chitin arm guards"
msgstr[0] "生物矽化甲殼護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of biosilicified chitin arm guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned "
"biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr "將酸液螞蟻的生物矽化外骨骼，仔細清洗並剪裁製成的護臂。耐酸但易碎。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of cloth-padded sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of cloth-padded sleeves"
msgstr[0] "墊布袖套"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of cloth-padded sleeves"
msgid ""
"The sleeves of a thick cotton shirt, with a bunch of cloth sewn in to act as "
"extra padding.  They're quite lonely, no longer being attached to each other "
"by the rest of the shirt."
msgstr "一对厚棉衬衫袖子，缝上了一束布料提供额外保护。只有袖套，没有和衬衫连在一起。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hard arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of hard arm guards"
msgstr[0] "硬質護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hard arm guards"
msgid "A pair of neoprene arm sleeves covered with molded plastic sheaths."
msgstr "一對硬質的塑膠護臂，內裡有緩衝泡綿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of leather arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of leather arm guards"
msgstr[0] "皮革護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of leather arm guards"
msgid "A pair of tough leather arm guards.  Light and comfortable."
msgstr "一雙強韌的皮革護臂。輕巧且舒適。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of steel arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of steel arm guards"
msgstr[0] "鋼鐵護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of steel arm guards"
msgid ""
"A full assembly of medieval arm protection.  Rerebraces, couters, and "
"vambraces, with leather straps to secure each piece and connect it as part of "
"a set."
msgstr "一副完整組裝的中世紀護臂。以皮革綁帶固定並連結著上臂護甲、護肘以及前臂護甲。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of sheet metal arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of sheet metal arm guards"
msgstr[0] "鐵板護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of sheet metal arm guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards hammered out from metal, avoiding joints.  Perfect for "
"the Post-Apocalyptic Warrior look."
msgstr "一对用钢板锤打而成的护臂，避开了关节部位。完美搭配末日战士造型。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened steel sheet metal arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened steel sheet metal arm guards"
msgstr[0] "钢板护臂（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened steel sheet metal arm guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards hammered out from sheet metal, hardened for extra "
"protection.  Still manages that Post-Apocalyptic Warrior look."
msgstr "一对用钢板捶打而成的护臂，经过了表面硬化以提供额外防护。依然引领着末日战士造型的潮流。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of mild steel sheet metal bracers"
msgid_plural "pairs of mild steel sheet metal bracers"
msgstr[0] "钢板护腕（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of mild steel sheet metal bracers"
msgid "A pair of arm guards hammered out from metal, only covering your forearms."
msgstr "一对由金属捶打而成的护臂，只覆盖你的前臂。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened steel sheet metal bracers"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened steel sheet metal bracers"
msgstr[0] "钢板护腕（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened steel sheet metal bracers"
msgid ""
"A pair of forearm guards hammered out from sheet metal, hardened for extra "
"protection."
msgstr "一对用钢板捶打而成的护臂，只覆盖前臂，经过了表面硬化以提供额外防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of mild steel sheet metal pauldrons"
msgid_plural "pairs of mild steel sheet metal pauldrons"
msgstr[0] "钢板护肩（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of mild steel sheet metal pauldrons"
msgid ""
"Two half-cylinders of sheet metal jutting out over your shoulders and two "
"more underneath.  They make it impossible to raise your arms fully, but "
"they'll keep your arms attached to you."
msgstr "从你肩膀上伸出来的两片半圆柱形金属板，下面还有两个。穿上这东西让你无法完全举起手臂，但起码可以保证你的手臂还连接在你身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened sheet metal pauldrons"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened sheet metal pauldrons"
msgstr[0] "钢板护肩（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened sheet metal pauldrons"
msgid ""
"A pair of crude pauldrons made out of sheet metal and hardened for "
"reinforcement."
msgstr "一对由金属板粗制而成的肩甲，经过表面硬化处理加固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of mild steel sheet metal elbow guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of mild steel sheet metal elbow guards"
msgstr[0] "钢板护肘（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of mild steel sheet metal elbow guards"
msgid ""
"Two small half-cylinders of sheet metal cut down and hammered to fit over "
"your elbows.  Very brutal, just needs spikes."
msgstr "两个小的半圆柱体金属板被切割下来，经过捶打以适应你的肘部，十分狂野，再来点钉子就更好了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened sheet metal elbow guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened sheet metal elbow guards"
msgstr[0] "钢板护肘（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened sheet metal elbow guards"
msgid ""
"Elbow guards of sheet metal, hardened to make sure you never bang your funny "
"bone on the table again."
msgstr "一对由金属板制成的护肘，经过表面硬化处理加固，你再也不用担心撞到麻筋了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of paper arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of paper arm guards"
msgstr[0] "紙質護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
