msgid "Arm guards made of stacked paper sheets held together with duct tape."
msgstr "將幾疊紙用膠帶纏繞成的紙護臂。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of improvised tire arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of improvised tire arm guards"
msgstr[0] "粗製輪胎護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of improvised tire arm guards"
msgid "Arm guards made of thick chunks of tire held together with duct tape."
msgstr "一对将许多块轮胎片叠在一起，然后用胶带粘牢的护臂。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of scrap arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of scrap arm guards"
msgstr[0] "廢金屬護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of scrap arm guards"
msgid "A pair of arm guards made from scraps of metal secured by simple strings."
msgstr "一对用金属碎片做成的护臂，碎片之间用小绳子固定。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of tire arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of tire arm guards"
msgstr[0] "輪胎護臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of tire arm guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards made from thick chunks of tire secured by simple "
"strings; the loose collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the "
"most convenient protection."
msgstr "一套用轮胎片做成的护臂，碎片之间用小绳子固定。这些松垮的橡胶小片片能提供不错的防护，但是还不够完美。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of neoprene arm sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of neoprene arm sleeves"
msgstr[0] "橡膠袖套"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of neoprene arm sleeves"
msgid "A pair of soft neoprene arm sleeves.  Often used in contact sports."
msgstr "一雙柔軟的合成橡膠手臂袖套。常用於接觸性的運動上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of gambeson sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of gambeson sleeves"
msgstr[0] "軟甲袖套"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of gambeson sleeves"
