msgid_plural "FBI ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "FBI 防彈背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "FBI ballistic vest"
msgid ""
"A ranger green soft ballistic vest with MOLLE rigging used by federal law "
"enforcement agencies.  Soft armor plates inside the vest provide solid "
"defense against shrapnel and small-caliber rounds.  \"FBI\" is emblazoned "
"across the front and back in large, yellow lettering, and it includes a "
"pocket for storing evidence.  Use it to attach or detach pouches."
msgstr ""
"一件游骑兵绿的软质防弹背心，带有MOLLE织带，由联邦执法机构使用。背心内部的软质装甲板可有效防御弹片和小口径枪弹。“FBI”字样以醒目的大号黄色字体印在正"
"面和背面。背心上还带有一个用于存放证物的口袋。使用MOLLE织带可以附加或拆卸各种口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hard armor vest"
msgid_plural "hard armor vests"
msgstr[0] "硬甲背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hard armor vest"
msgid ""
"Armored panels give this vest solid defense against small caliber firearms, "
"and front and back pockets for hard armor panels give protection from higher "
"calibers."
msgstr "装甲板让这件防弹背心能够抵挡对小口径枪械射击，可以装入硬质装甲板的前后口袋能防护更大口径武器的射击。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "humanitarian ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "humanitarian ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "人道救援防彈背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "humanitarian ballistic vest" of item "hard armor
#. vest"
msgid ""
"Bright blue in color, this slim armor vest was used by volunteers and "
"officials from humanitarian groups during the first days of the Cataclysm "
"before order broke down completely.  \"FEMA\" is written on the front lapel "
"and across the back."
msgstr "一件轻薄的亮蓝色防弹背心，在秩序完全失控的大灾变发生前，曾被志愿者和人道救援组织的官员使用。前翻领和后翻领上都印着\"FEMA\"字样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "police ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "police ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "警用防彈背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "police ballistic vest" of item "hard armor vest"
msgid ""
"This charcoal-colored body armor was once a common sight on police officers, "
"and it provides adequate protection against small-caliber firearms in "
"addition to featuring pouches to hold armor inserts.  \"POLICE\" is written "
"on the front lapel and across the back."
msgstr ""
"一件炭黑色的防弹衣，样式就是警官们曾经常穿的那种，它除了自身能提供足够的保护，防止小口径枪支的袭击之外，还有可以插入装甲插板的口袋。前翻领和后翻领上都印着\""
"警察\"字样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "National Guard ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "National Guard ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "國民警衛隊防彈背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "National Guard ballistic vest" of item "hard
#. armor vest"
msgid ""
"Styled in urban camo, this ballistic vest was issued to soldiers, and as "
"things got worse, to volunteers as well.  It was designed to stand out after "
"the chaos of the riots; \"US ARMY\" is emblazoned on the front lapel next to "
"a patch of the United States flag, and \"NATIONAL GUARD\" is written across "
"the back."
msgstr ""
"一件城市迷彩样式的防弹背心，配发给士兵的款式，随着局势不断恶化，也配发给志愿者。它的作用在骚乱混乱之中脱颖而出；前翻领上印着一块美国国旗，旁边印着\""
"美国陆军\"的字样，背面印着\"国民警卫队\"的字样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "防彈背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with of lots of salvaged ballistic "
"Kevlar panels.  It's bulkier than a factory made US Army vest, but it is "
"customized for the benefit of an abnormally large mutant who couldn't wear "
"such armors otherwise.  Coated in MOLLE webbing to support modular loadouts "
"for the tacticool mutant.  It could be outfitted with steel plates for "
"further protection."
msgstr ""
"一件巨大的自制防弹背心，由大量回收的防弹凯夫拉板制成。它比工厂制造的美国陆军防弹背心更笨重，但这件防弹背心专为大号变种人定制，让他们可以穿上它。背心上有 "
"MOLLE 织带，可以支持战术工具的模块化装载。它还可以安装钢板，以提供进一步保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest (mild steel plates)"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests (mild steel plates)"
msgstr[0] "防彈背心（低碳鋼板）"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest (mild steel plates)"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with lots of salvaged ballistic "
"Kevlar panels and homemade \"ballistic inserts\" made of mild steel.  The "
"thin metal isn't the most protective, but it's probably better than just "
"plain Kevlar."
msgstr "一件巨大的自制防弹背心，由大量回收的防弹凯夫拉板和自制低碳钢“防弹插板”制成。这些薄金属片的防护效果未必是最好的，但总比凯夫拉纤维好。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest (tempered steel plates)"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests (tempered steel plates)"
msgstr[0] "防彈背心（回火鋼板）"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest (tempered steel plates)"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest made of lots of salvaged ballistic Kevlar "
"panels and ten NIJ IIIA plates inserted into custom-made pockets - four each "
"for your front and back and one each for your sides.  Monstrously heavy but "
"extremely protective."
msgstr "一件巨大的自制防弹背心，由大量回收的防弹凯夫拉板和前后各四个、两侧各一个共十块插入定制口袋的NIJ IIIA防护级别钢板制成。重量惊人，但防护性能极强。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgid_plural "pairs of ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgstr[0] "防彈護肩"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgid ""
"Nylon armor with soft armor inserts protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  "
"Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "插入軟裝甲片的尼龍護甲，保護三角肌和上臂。設計用於安裝在重型軍用防彈衣上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic groin protector"
msgid_plural "ballistic groin protectors"
msgstr[0] "防彈褲檔"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic groin protector"
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon armor with soft armor inserts for groin and butt "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "插入軟裝甲片的正面與後背的尼龍裝甲，可保護腹股溝和臀部。設計用於安裝在重型軍用防彈衣上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic collar"
msgid_plural "ballistic collars"
msgstr[0] "防彈護頸"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic collar"
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon collar assemblies with soft armor inserts for neck "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "前後各一片尼龍護脖組件，內部襯有軟甲保護頸部。設計用來安裝在重型軍用防彈衣上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pistol bandolier"
msgid_plural "pistol bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "手槍斜背子彈帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "pistol bandolier"
msgid ""
"An embroidered leather bandolier for keeping pistol cartridges close to hand. "
" If this doesn't make you feel like a cowboy, nothing will."
msgstr "一條繡有花紋的皮革子彈帶，讓手槍彈藥離手更近。它一定能讓你覺得自己像個牛仔。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rifle bandolier"
msgid_plural "rifle bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "步槍斜背子彈帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "rifle bandolier"
msgid "A leather bandolier for keeping rifle cartridges close to hand."
msgstr "一條皮革子彈帶， 讓步槍彈藥離手更近。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "waist shotgun bandolier"
msgid_plural "waist shotgun bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "霰彈槍子彈腰帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "waist shotgun bandolier"
msgid ""
"A leather bandolier worn around the waist for keeping shotgun shells close to "
"hand."
msgstr "皮革製的子彈腰帶，讓霰彈槍彈藥離手更近。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "torso grenade bandolier"
msgid_plural "torso grenade bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "胸部榴彈繫肩帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "torso grenade bandolier"
msgid ""
"A leather bandolier strapped around the torso for keeping 40mm grenades close "
"to hand.  For some reason, wearing this makes you feel Austrian."
msgstr "皮革製的40mm榴彈帶可以繫在軀幹上，讓你便於拿取。因為某些原因，穿著這個讓你感覺你是個奧地利人。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "torso shotgun bandolier"
msgid_plural "torso shotgun bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "胸部霰彈槍斜背子彈帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "torso shotgun bandolier"
msgid ""
"A leather bandolier strapped around the torso for keeping shotgun shells "
"close to hand."
msgstr "皮革製的胸部子彈帶，讓霰彈槍彈藥離手更近。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "paper cartridge pouch"
msgid_plural "paper cartridge pouches"
msgstr[0] "紙卷彈藥袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "paper cartridge pouch"
msgid ""
"A covered leather pouch, worn at the waist to store and protect prepared "
"blackpowder cartridges."
msgstr "一個皮革袋子， 穿戴於腰間以儲存並保護製作完畢的黑火藥彈夾。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wrist bandolier"
msgid_plural "wrist bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "手腕子彈帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "wrist bandolier"
msgid ""
"A small fabric bandolier for rifle cartridges, designed to be worn around the "
"wrist."
msgstr "一个小型子弹带，保证步枪子弹随手可得。设计穿在手腕上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grenade pouch"
msgid_plural "grenade pouches"
msgstr[0] "榴彈袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "grenade pouch"
msgid ""
"A small pouch for storing cartridge grenades, with straps for attaching it to "
"your belt or other webbing."
msgstr "一个小口袋，用来存储榴弹弹药。自带一条带子，可以附加到腰带或者其他带子上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone pouch"
msgid_plural "stone pouches"
msgstr[0] "石頭彈藥袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "stone pouch"
msgid ""
"A medium-sized pouch for storing rocks, with straps for attaching it to your "
"belt or other webbing."
msgstr "一個儲存石頭的中型袋子, 袋子上的皮帶可以繫到你的腰帶或其他網帶上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather stone pouch"
msgid_plural "leather stone pouches"
msgstr[0] "皮革石頭袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "leather stone pouch"
msgid ""
"A medium-sized pouch for storing rocks, made of heavy leather, with straps "
"for attaching it to your belt or other webbing."
msgstr "一个用厚皮革制成的小口袋，用来存储石子。自带一条带子，可以附加到腰带或者其他带子上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large grenade pouch"
msgid_plural "large grenade pouches"
msgstr[0] "大型榴彈袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "large grenade pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch for holding up to four full-sized grenades of various types, with "
"straps for attaching it to your belt or other webbing."
msgstr "一个小袋子，最多能装四枚各种型号的全尺寸手雷。它有带子，可以固定在你的皮带或其它网格上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "large grenade pouch"
msgid "Stash grenades"
msgstr "存放榴彈"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military 5.56 bandolier"
msgid_plural "military 5.56 bandoliers"
msgstr[0] "军用 5.56 入门弹挂"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "military 5.56 bandolier"
msgid ""
"A simple bag on a strap, partitioned into pouches for four STANAG 30-round "
"magazines or twelve 10-round 5.56x45mm stripper clips.  When full, this "
"bandolier is more encumbering than proper kit and slower to reload from, but "
"it at least offers a quick and cheap means of resupplying ammunition."
msgstr ""
"入门级的弹挂，分为4个口袋，总共可以装下4个30发STANAG弹匣或是12个10发5.56x45"
"mm弹夹。装满时比专用装备更累赘且不易取用。但它至少能为你提供便捷廉价的弹药供应。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5.56x45 belt pouch"
msgid_plural "5.56x45 belt pouches"
msgstr[0] "5.56x45 彈鏈腰袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "5.56x45 belt pouch"
msgid "A large cotton pouch, designed to store a spare ammo belt for the M249 SAW."
msgstr "一个大型棉布袋，用于存放M249 SAW机枪的备用弹药带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.62x51 belt pouch"
msgid_plural "7.62x51 belt pouches"
msgstr[0] "7.62x51 彈鏈腰袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/bandolier.json
#. ~ Description of "7.62x51 belt pouch"
msgid ""
"A large cotton pouch, designed to store a spare ammo belt for the M240 or M60 "
"machine guns."
msgstr "一个大型棉布袋，用于存放 M240 机枪或 M60 机枪的备用弹药带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "firefighter belt"
msgid_plural "firefighter belts"
msgstr[0] "消防腰帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "firefighter belt"
msgid ""
"A stout firefighter's belt.  Useful for keeping your bunker gear up, it also "
"doubles as an equipment belt with a reinforced loop for holding a large tool."
msgstr "一條紮實的消防腰帶， 用來固定身上的工具很好用。它還有一個強化的腰帶圈， 讓大型工具也可以掛在上面。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "firefighter belt"
#, c-format
msgid "You clip your %s to your %s"
msgstr "你把 %s 夾上了你的 %s。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "firefighter belt"
msgid "Attach what to belt loop?"
msgstr "要把甚麼牽到腰帶圈上?"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "firefighter belt"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "leather belt"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "longsword scabbard"
msgid "Clipped directly to side of the belt."
msgstr "夹在腰带侧面。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black belt"
msgid_plural "black belts"
msgstr[0] "黑帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "black belt"
msgid "A belt worn by martial arts practitioners, advertising a master."
msgstr "練武者的腰帶， 屬於大師級。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blue belt"
msgid_plural "blue belts"
msgstr[0] "藍帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "blue belt"
msgid "A belt worn by martial arts practitioners, advertising a strong intermediate."
msgstr "練武者的腰帶， 屬於中高級。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "brown belt"
msgid_plural "brown belts"
msgstr[0] "棕带"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "brown belt"
msgid "A belt worn by martial arts practitioners, advertising a near-master."
msgstr "練武者的腰帶， 級別接近大師級。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "green belt"
msgid_plural "green belts"
msgstr[0] "綠帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "green belt"
msgid "A belt worn by martial arts practitioners, advertising an intermediate."
msgstr "練武者的腰帶， 屬於中級。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orange belt"
msgid_plural "orange belts"
msgstr[0] "橙帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "orange belt"
msgid "A belt worn by martial arts practitioners, advertising a fresh intermediate."
msgstr "練武者的腰帶， 屬於初級。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "white belt"
msgid_plural "white belts"
msgstr[0] "白帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "white belt"
msgid "A belt worn by martial arts practitioners, advertising a novice."
msgstr "練武者的腰帶， 屬於初級。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "yellow belt"
msgid_plural "yellow belts"
msgstr[0] "黃帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "yellow belt"
msgid "A belt worn by martial arts practitioners, advertising a moderate novice."
msgstr "練武者的腰帶， 屬於初中級。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather belt"
msgid_plural "leather belts"
msgstr[0] "皮帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "leather belt"
msgid ""
"A leather belt.  Designed to look good and hold up a pair of pants, but you "
"should be able to attach a small tool or weapon to one of the belt loops."
msgstr "一条皮革腰带。款式好看，可以兜起一条裤子，但你应该能将一个小型工具或武器安装在腰带环上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_rings.json
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "leather belt"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "broad belt"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "magic leather belt"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "Belt of Weaponry"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "lesser storage ring"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "greater storage ring"
#, c-format
msgid "You tuck your %s into your %s"
msgstr "你把 %s 塞進你的 %s"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "leather belt"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "broad belt"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "magic leather belt"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "Belt of Weaponry"
msgid "Stick what into your belt"
msgstr "把東西夾在腰帶上"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "leather belt"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "longsword scabbard"
msgid "Clipped directly to back of the belt."
msgstr "夹在腰带背面。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "obi"
msgid_plural "obis"
msgstr[0] "腰帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "obi"
msgid "A broad, black obi gi."
msgstr "一條黑色的空手道服寬腰帶。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "police duty belt"
msgid_plural "police duty belts"
msgstr[0] "警用勤務腰帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "police duty belt"
msgid ""
"A black leather belt used by police officers.  It has several pouches and a "
"holder for a baton."
msgstr "一条警察佩戴的黑色皮带。它上面有几个袋子和一个警棍的插销。"

