#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broad belt"
msgid_plural "broad belts"
msgstr[0] "寬腰帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "broad belt"
msgid ""
"A broad, buckled leather belt, commonly used by bearded men on Christmas.  "
"Usually worn over a red jacket."
msgstr "一根带扣的宽皮带，常被那个在圣诞节出现的长胡子男人使用。通常穿在一件红色夹克外面。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tool belt"
msgid_plural "tool belts"
msgstr[0] "工具腰帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "tool belt"
msgid ""
"A common belt with pockets, loops and sheaths to store up to seven tools or "
"blades.  Widely used by handymen and electricians."
msgstr "一条常见的工具腰带，带有口袋，腰带环和刀套，最多能够收纳七件工具或者刀具。手工业者和电工们经常穿着。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
