msgstr "装在护套里。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "MOLLE webbing belt"
msgid_plural "MOLLE webbing belts"
msgstr[0] "MOLLE 織布腰帶"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "MOLLE webbing belt"
msgid ""
"A 2-inch nylon webbing belt commonly used by military forces.  "
"MOLLE-compatible pouches can be attached to the webbing for extra storage."
msgstr ""
"軍隊常用的 2 吋尼龍織帶。MOLLE 相容的小袋可以安裝到織帶上以提供額外的儲存空間。（譯著：Modular lightweight "
"load-carrying equipment，簡稱 MOLLE，模組化輕量承載設備）"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "MOLLE webbing belt"
