msgstr "夹在腰带上"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "MOLLE webbing belt"
msgid "Clipped directly to the back of the belt."
msgstr "夹在腰带背面。"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "suspenders"
msgid_plural "pairs of suspenders"
msgstr[0] "吊裤带"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "suspenders"
msgid ""
"A pair of black suspenders, which reach over the wearer's shoulders and hook "
"to their waist.  Gives a wonderful western feel!"
msgstr "一条黑色吊带，可以绕过穿戴者的肩膀，扣在腰上。给人一种美妙的西部片感觉！"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather suspenders"
msgid_plural "pairs of leather suspenders"
msgstr[0] "皮制吊裤带"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "leather suspenders"
msgid ""
"A pair of leather suspenders, which reach over the wearer's shoulders and "
"hook to their waist.  Gives a wonderful western feel!"
msgstr "一条皮革吊带，可以绕过穿戴者的肩膀，扣在腰上。给人一种美妙的西部片感觉！"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "holster suspenders"
msgid_plural "pairs of holster suspenders"
msgstr[0] "枪套吊裤带"

#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
#. ~ Description of "holster suspenders"
msgid "A pair of leather suspenders with a holster placed near the stomach."
msgstr "一条皮革吊带，在腹部附近有个皮枪套。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of cord sandals"
msgid_plural "pairs of cord sandals"
msgstr[0] "涼鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of cord sandals"
msgid ""
"Lightweight sandals made from wound cord.  They offer little in the way of "
"protection, but keep you cool during warmer months."
msgstr "輕量的涼鞋， 由捲繞的縫線製成。只能提供很少的防護能力， 但可以讓你在溫暖的月份裡保持涼爽。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of boots"
msgstr[0] "皮革靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of boots"
msgid "Tough leather boots, for tough everyday work."
msgstr "強韌的皮革靴，設計來進行粗重的日常工作。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of occult boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of occult boots"
msgstr[0] "神秘靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of occult boots"
msgid ""
"Leather boots covered with tiny, finely-carved bones.  With each step, the "
"bones collide with each other and produce a melodic clicking."
msgstr "一双布满了细小且雕刻精美的骨头的皮靴。每走一步，骨头就会互相碰撞，咔嗒声听起来像是有旋律一般。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of turnout boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of turnout boots"
msgstr[0] "消防靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of turnout boots"
msgid "A pair of steel-toed rubber boots, the sort worn by firefighters."
msgstr "一双钢头橡胶靴，消防员穿的那种。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of chitinous boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of chitinous boots"
msgstr[0] "甲殼靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of chitinous boots"
msgid "Boots made from the exoskeletons of insects."
msgstr "一雙由昆蟲的外骨骼製成的靴子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of biosilicified chitin boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of biosilicified chitin boots"
msgstr[0] "生物矽化甲殼靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of biosilicified chitin boots"
msgid ""
"Boots crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned biosilicified "
"exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr "將酸液螞蟻的生物矽化外骨骼，仔細清洗並剪裁製成的靴子。耐酸但易碎。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of combat boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of combat boots"
msgstr[0] "戰鬥靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of combat boots"
msgid "Modern reinforced tactical combat boots.  Very durable."
msgstr "強化的現代戰術靴。非常耐用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of denim boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of denim boots"
msgstr[0] "牛仔布靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of denim boots"
msgid ""
"A pair of boots extending towards your lower leg, completely lined with "
"denim.  Looks cool and has above average protection."
msgstr "一雙高至小腿的靴子，內襯全由牛仔布製成。看起來很酷並且具有較高的防護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of EOD foot protectors"
msgid_plural "pairs of EOD foot protectors"
msgstr[0] "拆彈防護鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of EOD foot protectors"
msgid ""
"Armored foot protectors constructed from steel and Nomex for use by explosive "
"ordnance disposal technicians."
msgstr "一双用钢材和芳纶纤维制成的装甲防护靴，供排爆技术员使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of toecaps"
msgid_plural "pairs of toecaps"
msgstr[0] "鋼頭膠鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of toecaps"
msgid "Rubbery overshoes that cover your toes with sturdy, OSHA compliant steel toes."
msgstr "一双橡胶套鞋，前端有个坚固且符合OSHA标准的钢制靴头包裹着你的脚趾。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of fur boots"
msgstr[0] "毛皮靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of fur boots"
#. ~ Description of "pair of faux fur boots"
msgid "Boots lined with fur for warmth."
msgstr "內襯毛皮的靴子， 很保暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of faux fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of faux fur boots"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hiking boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of hiking boots"
msgstr[0] "登山靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hiking boots"
msgid "Tough yet light leather boots, intended for outdoor activity."
msgstr "硬而輕的皮革靴，適合戶外活動。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of leather armor boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of leather armor boots"
msgstr[0] "皮革護甲靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of leather armor boots"
msgid "Thick leather boots made specifically to protect the feet.  Light yet tough."
msgstr "一双专门为保护脚部而设计的厚皮靴。轻巧而坚韧。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of armored boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of armored boots"
msgstr[0] "裝甲靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of armored boots"
msgid "An extremely heavy set of armor plated boots."
msgstr "一雙極度厚重的裝甲靴子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of rubber boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of rubber boots"
msgstr[0] "橡膠靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of rubber boots"
msgid "A pair of rubber boots, often used while cleaning with caustic materials."
msgstr "一雙橡膠的靴子， 通常在清潔腐蝕性物質時會用到。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of scrap boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of scrap boots"
msgstr[0] "廢金屬靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of scrap boots"
msgid ""
"Boots made of random metal scraps attached to simple cloth wraps.  They're "
"uncomfortable, but provide decent protection."
msgstr "一双把各类废旧金属固定在简单的衬布制成的靴子。穿起来很不舒服，但防护还可以。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of sheet metal sabatons"
msgid_plural "pairs of sheet metal sabatons"
msgstr[0] "鐵板鎧靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of sheet metal sabatons"
msgid ""
"Some sheets of metal hammered to fit over the top of your foot and around "
"your ankles, meant to be worn over boots.  They make walking a fair bit more "
"awkward, but they'll keep your toes from being stomped on."
msgstr "一些被捶打成能够贴合脚板和脚踝的金属板，用来穿在靴子外面。这东西让你走路更加别扭，但是可以防止你的脚趾被踩扁。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened steel sheet metal sabatons"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened steel sheet metal sabatons"
msgstr[0] "钢板战靴（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened steel sheet metal sabatons"
msgid ""
"Sabatons made of sheet metal, hardened to protect your feet if you drop "
"something heavy on them.  No relation to the band, aside from being very "
"metal."
msgstr "由金属板制成的靴子，经过表面硬化处理，可以保护你的脚不被砸伤之类的。除了真的非常\"金属\"以外，与乐队没有任何关系。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of steeltoed boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of steeltoed boots"
msgstr[0] "鋼頭鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of steeltoed boots"
msgid "Leather boots with a steel toe, intended for use by workers."
msgstr "一双钢头皮靴，供工人使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of steeltoed sneakers"
msgid_plural "pairs of steeltoed sneakers"
msgstr[0] "鋼頭運動鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of steeltoed sneakers"
msgid ""
"A descendant of the classic steeltoed boot, this modern footwear has become "
"popular among working class people over the last couple of decades."
msgstr "作为经典钢头靴的后代产物，过去几十年中，这种现代运动鞋在工人大众中广受欢迎。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of western boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of western boots"
msgstr[0] "西部靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of western boots"
msgid ""
"Stiff leather boots with intricate embroidery and one-inch heels.  They look "
"good, but these boots are made for walking, not running for your life.  Each "
"boot is large enough to conceal a small holdout pistol."
msgstr ""
"一对带着精巧刺绣的硬邦邦皮靴，有着较宽的高鞋跟。虽然样式时髦，但跑步时容易崴脚。每只靴子都足够大，能够装下一把小型自卫手枪。\n"
"\"如果有踢马刺就可以对付背后的丧尸了，或者是自己的屁股。\""

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of winter boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of winter boots"
msgstr[0] "雪靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of winter boots"
msgid "Wool-lined boots designed for warmth."
msgstr "一双为保暖而设计的羊毛内衬靴子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of cleats"
msgid_plural "pairs of cleats"
msgstr[0] "釘鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of cleats"
msgid ""
"Sport shoes with hard undersides and studs on the bottom designed to dig into "
"grass."
msgstr "一双硬底的运动鞋，底部设计有鞋钉，可以让你稳稳地走在草地上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of golf shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of golf shoes"
msgstr[0] "高爾夫球鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of golf shoes"
msgid "Snug sport shoes with hard ridges on the bottom."
msgstr "一双舒适的运动鞋，鞋底有些坚硬的鞋钉增加抓地力。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of wooden clogs"
msgid_plural "pairs of wooden clogs"
msgstr[0] "木鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of wooden clogs"
msgid ""
"Known as klompen in the Netherlands and sabots in France, these wooden shoes "
"have endured through the ages due to their simple design and durability."
msgstr "知名的荷蘭木鞋， 這種木鞋有著簡單又耐用的設計。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of clown shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of clown shoes"
msgstr[0] "小丑鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of clown shoes"
msgid "Gigantic shoes fit for a clown.  Incredibly difficult to walk in."
msgstr "小丑穿的一雙大鞋子。走起路來相當困難。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of dance shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of dance shoes"
msgstr[0] "舞鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of dance shoes"
msgid "Expensive black dance shoes with large heels."
msgstr "昂貴的黑色高跟舞鞋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of dress shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of dress shoes"
msgstr[0] "西裝皮鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of dress shoes"
msgid "Fancy patent leather shoes.  Not designed for running."
msgstr "一双样式时髦的皮鞋。但它并不是为跑步而设计的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of flip-flops"
msgid_plural "pairs of flip-flops"
msgstr[0] "人字拖"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of flip-flops"
msgid "Simple sandals.  Somewhat difficult to run in."
msgstr "一双样式简单的拖鞋。穿着它很难跑步。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of expensive flip-flops"
msgid_plural "pairs of expensive flip-flops"
msgstr[0] "豪華拖鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of expensive flip-flops"
msgid "These are upmarket \"luxury\" flip-flops.  Very difficult to run in."
msgstr "一双高档的\"豪华版\"拖鞋。穿着它很难跑步。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of foot rags"
msgid_plural "pairs of foot rags"
msgstr[0] "裹腳布"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of foot rags"
msgid ""
"Rags tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being barefoot, "
"but still better than nothing."
msgstr "裹在脚上的布条，比光脚好不了多少，但也总比光着要好。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of fur foot wraps"
msgid_plural "pairs of fur foot wraps"
msgstr[0] "毛皮裹腳布"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of fur foot wraps"
msgid ""
"Fur pelts tied around your feet.  Not much of an improvement over being "
"barefoot, but still better than nothing."
msgstr "裹在脚上的毛皮，比光脚好不了多少，但也总比光着要好。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of faux fur foot wraps"
msgid_plural "pairs of faux fur foot wraps"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮裹腳布"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of faux fur foot wraps"
