"A simple pair of geta.  Traditional wooden Japanese sandals with a fabric "
"thong similar to flip flops."
msgstr "一雙簡單的木屐。傳統的日本木製涼鞋，配上類似人字拖的織帶。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of heels"
msgid_plural "pairs of heels"
msgstr[0] "高跟鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of heels"
msgid "A pair of high heels.  Difficult to even walk in."
msgstr "一雙高跟鞋。穿這個連走路都不好走。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of heels"
msgid "pair of stiletto heels"
msgid_plural "pairs of stiletto heels"
msgstr[0] "細高跟鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of stiletto heels" of item "pair of heels"
msgid ""
"A traditional pair of tall, high-heeled shoes with a tapered, slender heel, "
"which makes strutting fashionable, walking a challenge, and running an "
"impossibility.  These days, they'd probably be more useful to stab a zombie's "
"eyes out than as footwear."
msgstr "一双普通高跟鞋,鞋跟又细又尖,使走路成为一种时尚,跑步则是不可能的。如今,它们可能更适合戳瞎丧尸的眼睛,而不是作为鞋子穿着。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of heels"
msgid "pair of block heels"
msgid_plural "pairs of block heels"
msgstr[0] "粗高跟鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of block heels" of item "pair of heels"
msgid ""
"These are a pair of chunky, broad-based shoes with a sturdy block-like heel, "
"and while they don't do you any favors in the mobility department, they're at "
"least more comfortable to trudge about in than their peers and won't likely "
"cause irreversible damage to your feet."
msgstr "这是一双厚实、宽底的鞋子，带有一个坚固的方块状鞋跟，虽然在移动方面对你没有任何好处，但至少比同类鞋子穿着起来更舒适，而且不太可能对你的脚造成不可逆转的伤害。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of heels"
msgid "pair of wedges"
msgid_plural "pairs of wedges"
msgstr[0] "楔形鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of wedges" of item "pair of heels"
msgid ""
"A pair of tall, high-heeled, open-toed shoes with thick wedges running the "
"length of the shoe, serving as its heels."
msgstr "一双露趾高跟鞋，鞋底是一块厚厚的楔形，垫起作为厚高跟。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of heels"
msgid "pair of platform heels"
msgid_plural "pairs of platform heels"
msgstr[0] "厚底高跟鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of platform heels" of item "pair of heels"
msgid ""
"A pair of heavy, thick-soled high-heeled shoes with a ridiculously tall heel "
"supported by an ankle strap and chunky soles.  A great choice for when you've "
"given up on basic biomechanical function and decided that you're more than "
"willing to risk long-term damage to your feet for the sake of a ridiculous "
"fashion statement in the ruins of America."
msgstr ""
"一双沉重的厚底高跟鞋，鞋跟高得离谱，由脚踝带和厚底固定。 "
"如果你想放弃基本的生物力学运动，冒着足部长期损伤的风险，只为在废墟上发表可笑的时尚声明的话，这无疑是一个很棒的选择。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of heels"
msgid "pair of liberty's heels"
msgid_plural "pairs of liberty's heels"
msgstr[0] "爱国高跟鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of liberty's heels" of item "pair of heels"
msgid ""
"The shoes of patriotic ladies around the nation, these open-toed heels "
"glitter with small golden stars embroidered along their sides, with a pair of "
"decorative flaps styled with the image of a miniature American flag unfurling "
"from each ankle, like wings.  The footwear's heels consist of an adorably "
"tiny reproduction of the Statue of Liberty situated beneath each sole, with "
"their arms razed and supporting the shoe's heels.  Each of the statues' "
"dresses is inscribed with the legend, \"America Gives You Wings!\""
msgstr ""
"作为全国各地爱国女士的鞋子，这些露趾高跟鞋的两侧闪耀着金色的小星星，一对装饰性的挡板上有一个微型美国国旗的形象，像翅膀一样从每个脚踝处展开。 "
"鞋跟由缩小的自由女神像组成，十分漂亮，其手臂抬起，支撑着鞋跟。 每个女神像的衣服上都刻着这样的字样：\"美国给你翅膀！\""

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of knee-high boots"
msgid "pair of knee-high boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of knee-high boots"
msgstr[0] "及膝高筒靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of knee-high boots"
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of knee-high boots" of item "pair of knee-
#. high boots"
msgid ""
"Very long leather boots that cover the lower legs, they are cumbersome to "
"wear."
msgstr "一双长度及膝的长皮靴。穿起来很费力。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of knee-high boots"
msgid "pair of jackboots"
msgid_plural "pairs of jackboots"
msgstr[0] "長筒靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of jackboots" of item "pair of knee-high
#. boots"
msgid ""
"A pair of sturdy, over-the-knee, laceless boots fitted with a rubberized "
"sole: these imposing combat boots provide good traction despite their "
"encumbering nature.  Most commonly associated with totalitarian regimes due "
"to their use by Nazi soldiers, this style of boot is warm, protective, and "
"produces a deeply satisfying sound while marching."
msgstr ""
"一双用料扎实的橡胶鞋底过膝长筒靴，没有鞋带。这种大号战斗靴虽然比较累赘，但抓地力好不易打滑。因为纳粹士兵曾有这样的穿着，它通常让人联想到中央集权的政体。这种"
"靴子很暖和，防护也不错，还能在列队行进时发出迷人的踏地声。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of knee-high boots"
msgid "pair of Chelsea boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of Chelsea boots"
msgstr[0] "切尔西靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of Chelsea boots" of item "pair of knee-high
#. boots"
msgid ""
"A pair of knee-length, laceless boots formed from calfskin with an elastic "
"side panel that's designed to stretch away to facilitate simple donning and "
"doffing, these stylish stompers are a time-old gift from Victorian-age "
"England.  Intended for you to fashionably saunter down roadways rather than "
"sprint for your life, this style of boot became a style staple within London "
"during the 1960s, where they were synonymous with the mod crowd."
msgstr ""
"这是一双由小牛皮制成长及膝盖的靴子，没有鞋带，侧面有一个可伸展的弹性板，以方便简单的穿脱。这双时尚的散步靴是维多利亚时代英国的古老礼物。 "
"这种靴子是为了让你时尚地在公路上漫步，而不是为生活而冲刺，这种风格的靴子在20世纪60年代成为伦敦的时尚主力，是时尚人群的代名词。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of motorcycle police boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of motorcycle police boots"
msgstr[0] "騎警靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of motorcycle police boots"
msgid ""
"Custom-made knee-high leather boots issued to motor officers.  Warm, durable "
"and quite tough."
msgstr "为摩托警官定制的及膝皮靴。温暖、耐用、相当坚韧。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of leather sandals"
msgid_plural "pairs of leather sandals"
msgstr[0] "皮革涼鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of leather sandals"
msgid ""
"Sturdy leather hiking sandals with a heel strap.  Offers little in the way of "
"protection, but keeps you cool during warmer months."
msgstr "堅固的皮革登山涼鞋， 帶有腳後跟綁帶。只能提供很少的防護能力， 但可以讓你在溫暖的月份裡保持涼爽。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of lowtop tennis shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of lowtop tennis shoes"
msgstr[0] "短筒網球鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of lowtop tennis shoes"
msgid "Lightweight shoes made of cloth and rubber."
msgstr "以布料與橡膠製成的輕量鞋子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of moccasins"
msgid_plural "pairs of moccasins"
msgstr[0] "莫卡辛鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of moccasins"
msgid ""
"A type of traditional Native American footwear sewn out of prepared leather "
"or pelts."
msgstr "一种美洲特色的皮鞋，后跟很矮，通常由皮革或毛皮制成。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of motorcycle boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of motorcycle boots"
msgstr[0] "機車靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of motorcycle boots"
msgid "A pair of durable boots used by dirt bikers and motorcyclists."
msgstr "一套为摩托车手和越野自行车手所使用的靴子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of rollerblades"
msgid_plural "pairs of rollerblades"
msgstr[0] "直排輪"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of rollerblades"
msgid ""
"A pair of inline skates.  Very fast on flat floors, but they make it hard to "
"move on rough terrain, take hits, or dodge effectively."
msgstr "一双直排轮滑鞋。在平地上移动速度很快，但是在崎岖地形上会让你举步维艰，难以攻击并且更难躲闪。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of rollerskates"
msgid_plural "pairs of rollerskates"
msgstr[0] "輪式溜冰鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of rollerskates"
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned pair of leather rollerskates with steel frames.  While quite "
"fast on flat floors, they make it difficult to take hits or to move on rough "
"terrain."
msgstr "一對過時、鋼底結構的皮製輪式溜冰鞋。在平地時相當快, 但在崎嶇的地形中很難命中或移動。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of birchbark shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of birchbark shoes"
msgstr[0] "樺皮鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of birchbark shoes"
msgid ""
"Simple shoes woven from strips of birch bark.  Not very comfortable, but "
"better than going barefoot."
msgstr "由樺樹皮條編織而成的簡單鞋子。不太舒服， 但總比赤腳來得好。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of bowling shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of bowling shoes"
msgstr[0] "保齡球鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of bowling shoes"
msgid "A pair of flat-soled shoes designed to give you a grip on slippery surfaces."
msgstr "一雙設計來讓你在光滑表面上站穩的平底鞋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of denim sneakers"
msgid_plural "pairs of denim sneakers"
msgstr[0] "牛仔運動鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of denim sneakers"
msgid "A pair of denim shoes.  They are cool and that's about it."
msgstr "一雙牛仔布鞋。 他們很酷，僅此而已。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of slippers"
msgid_plural "pairs of slippers"
msgstr[0] "拖鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of slippers"
msgid "Soft shoes that keep your feet warm.  Not suitable for running."
msgstr "能保持雙腳溫暖的軟拖鞋， 但穿著它難以奔跑。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of sneakers"
msgid_plural "pairs of sneakers"
msgstr[0] "運動鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of sneakers"
msgid "Guaranteed to make you run faster and jump higher!"
msgstr "保證能讓你跑更快， 跳更高！"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of straw sandals"
msgid_plural "pairs of straw sandals"
msgstr[0] "草鞋"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of straw sandals"
msgid ""
"Sandals made from straw rope.  Not very comfortable, but can keep your feet "
"safe."
msgstr "用稻草繩製成的涼鞋， 不是很舒服， 但可以保護你的腳。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of thigh-high boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of thigh-high boots"
msgstr[0] "過膝高筒靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of thigh-high boots"
msgid ""
"Very long leather boots that reach past the knees, they are cumbersome to "
"wear."
msgstr "一双长度过膝的长皮靴。穿起来很费力。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of heelys (off)"
msgid_plural "pairs of heelys (off)"
msgstr[0] "暴走鞋（未啟動）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of heelys (off)"
msgid ""
"A pair of sneakers with integrated wheels.  Currently the wheels are "
"retracted, making these essentially normal lace-up athletic shoes."
msgstr "一双自带滑轮的运动鞋。目前滑轮被收起来，使它和普通的系带运动鞋一样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pair of heelys (off)"
msgid "Extend wheels"
msgstr "放下滑轮"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pair of heelys (off)"
msgid "You pop the wheels out."
msgstr "你把鞋底下的滑輪彈出來。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of heelys (on)"
msgid_plural "pairs of heelys (on)"
msgstr[0] "暴走鞋（啟動）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of heelys (on)"
msgid ""
"A pair of sneakers with integrated wheels, currently the wheels are out, "
"allowing you to swiftly roll around on flat terrain.  You should probably pop "
"them back in before you try fighting or going off-road."
msgstr "一双自带滑轮的运动鞋。目前滑轮在外面，让你在平坦的地形上快速滑行。在你准备打架或越野前，你可能应该把滑轮收回去。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pair of heelys (on)"
msgid "Retract wheels"
msgstr "收起滑轮"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pair of heelys (on)"
msgid "You pop the wheels back in."
msgstr "你把鞋底下的滑輪收進去。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲靴"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of chainmail chausses"
msgid ""
"Customized chainmail chausses that cover the feet, like booties made of "
"chainmail.  The metal shows signs of rust and corrosion."
msgstr "经过特别定制的锁环镫靴，覆盖了整个腿部，如同锁环制成的长筒女靴一样。金属有生锈和腐蚀的迹象。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of mild steel chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of mild steel chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲靴（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of mild steel chainmail chausses"
#. ~ Description of "pair of medium steel chainmail chausses"
#. ~ Description of "pair of high steel chainmail chausses"
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened steel chainmail chausses"
#. ~ Description of "pair of tempered steel chainmail chausses"
msgid ""
"Customized chainmail chausses that cover the feet, like booties made of "
"chainmail."
msgstr "覆蓋腳的訂製鏈甲靴，就像用鏈甲做成的靴子。（譯著: chainmail chausses 是鏈甲腿鎧，包覆腿部，可能包覆到腳部，不過遊戲內只有包覆腳）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of medium steel chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of medium steel chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲靴（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of high steel chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of high steel chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲靴（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened steel chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened steel chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲靴（表面硬化鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of tempered steel chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of tempered steel chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲靴（回火鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of flame-resistant socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of flame-resistant socks"
msgstr[0] "抗火襪"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of flame-resistant socks"
msgid "A snug-fitting pair of stockings made from thin and lightweight Nomex fabric."
msgstr "一双由轻薄的芳纶织物制成的防火袜子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of socks"
msgstr[0] "襪子"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of socks"
msgid "Socks.  Put 'em on your feet."
msgstr "襪子。穿在腳上的玩意。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of ankle socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of ankle socks"
msgstr[0] "船型襪"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of ankle socks"
msgid ""
"Short socks, commonly used for sports.  These are designed to protect your "
"feet from friction, not temperature."
msgstr "短襪，通常運動時穿。它設計來避免你的腳擦傷而不是保暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of bag socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of bag socks"
msgstr[0] "塑膠袋襪"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of bag socks"
msgid "A pair of disposable plastic bags, adapted to be used as socks."
msgstr "一對免洗塑膠袋， 被改成襪子的樣子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of disposable bowling socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of disposable bowling socks"
msgstr[0] "免洗的保齡球襪"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of disposable bowling socks"
msgid ""
"Cheap socks designed to be worn once and then thrown away.  They keep your "
"feet clean, but are too thin to give any protection."
msgstr "設計為一次性使用的便宜襪子。它能保持雙腳乾淨，但是很薄所以無法提供任何保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of wool socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of wool socks"
msgstr[0] "羊毛襪"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of wool socks"
msgid "Warm socks made of wool."
msgstr "羊毛製的保暖襪。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of stockings"
msgid_plural "pairs of stockings"
msgstr[0] "長襪"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of stockings"
msgid "Long cotton socks that reach above the knees to help protect from the cold."
msgstr "及膝的長型棉布襪子， 保護你免於寒冷。"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of stockings"
msgid "pair of black stockings"
msgid_plural "pairs of black stockings"
msgstr[0] "黑長襪"

