msgstr[0] "粉紅色廚師外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pink chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
msgid "It's colored pink, commonly used by women chefs or men who like pink."
msgstr "它是粉红色的，通常由女性或喜欢粉红色的男性使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
msgid "yellow chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "yellow chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "黃色廚師外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "yellow chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
#. ~ Description of variant "yellow toque" of item "toque"
msgid "It's colored yellow."
msgstr "它是黄色的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
msgid "camo chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "camo chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "迷彩色廚師外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "camo chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
msgid "It has a camouflage pattern, perfect for chefs that want to hide in the wild."
msgstr "它印有迷彩图案，非常适合那些想躲在野外的厨师。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chef's jacket"
msgid "skull chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "skull chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "骷髏廚師外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "skull chef's jacket" of item "chef's jacket"
msgid ""
"It's colored white, and the front and back are printed with a giant skull "
"between crossed kitchen knives.  Perfect for the apocalyptic chef."
msgstr "它是白色的，在正面和背面画着巨大的骷髅头和一对交叉的厨刀。完美匹配末日厨师。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "emergency jacket"
msgid_plural "emergency jackets"
msgstr[0] "救生衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "emergency jacket"
msgid ""
"A bright, cheaply made FEMA-issue windbreaker jacket with a hood.  One size, "
"fits none.  Helps keep you unfrozen & visible for rescuers."
msgstr ""
"一件联邦紧急事务管理署分发的，有着鲜艳的红色反光条的廉价应急防风夹克，带了一顶兜帽。政府统一定制了一个谁穿都不会合身的尺寸，但能够帮助你保持体温并让搜救人员"
"及时发现你。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flannel jacket"
msgid_plural "flannel jackets"
msgstr[0] "法蘭絨外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "flannel jacket"
msgid "A jacket made from flannel, favored by outdoorsy types."
msgstr "一件深受户外爱好者喜爱的法兰绒材质夹克。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jean jacket"
msgid_plural "jean jackets"
msgstr[0] "牛仔外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "jean jacket"
msgid "A jacket made from denim."
msgstr "由牛仔布製成的夾克。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jean jacket"
msgid ""
"A jacket made from denim.  This one is haphazardly covered with patches "
"featuring metal band logos."
msgstr "由牛仔布製成的夾克。這件隨意地逢著有金屬樂團標誌的補丁。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jean jacket"
msgid "A jacket made from denim, dyed black."
msgstr "由牛仔布製成並染成黑色的夾克。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jean jacket"
msgid "A denim jacket ornamented with yellow filament patterns."
msgstr "飾有黃色細絲圖案的牛仔布夾克。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jean jacket"
msgid ""
"An old denim jacket.  It has wears in several places and has lost its blue "
"color, but its overall integrity is preserved."
msgstr "一件舊牛仔夾克。它有多處磨損，原本的藍色已經褪色，但還是保有整體的完整性。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jean vest"
msgid_plural "jean vests"
msgstr[0] "牛仔背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "jean vest"
msgid "A vest made from denim."
msgstr "由牛仔布製成的背心。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jean vest"
msgid ""
"A vest made from denim.  This one is haphazardly covered with patches "
"featuring metal band logos."
msgstr "由牛仔布製成的背心。這件隨意地逢著有金屬樂團標誌的補丁。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jean vest"
msgid "A vest made from denim, dyed black."
msgstr "由牛仔布製成並染成黑色的背心。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jean vest"
msgid "A stone washed blue vest made from denim."
msgstr "經過石洗處理，由牛仔布製成的藍色背心。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jean vest"
msgid ""
"A vest made from denim.  Its armholes have filament and torn fabric sticking "
"out, as if someone just ripped the sleeves off."
msgstr "由牛仔布製成的背心。它的袖孔上有細絲和撕裂的布料，就像有人剛剛把袖子撕下來一樣。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ninja jacket"
msgid_plural "ninja jackets"
msgstr[0] "忍者外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "ninja jacket"
msgid ""
"This is a wrap over black jacket.  Commonly used by stealthy individuals "
"hiding in the dark of the night.  It includes a pair of cotton gauntlets and "
"a sash."
msgstr "一件黑色外套夹克。通常由隐藏在夜之黑暗中的潜行人物使用。它包含了一副配套的棉护手和一条腰带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather jacket"
msgid_plural "leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "皮革外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "leather jacket"
msgid ""
"A jacket made from leather, offering more protection than your average cotton "
"or denim jacket."
msgstr "一件由皮革制成的夹克。相比普通的棉质或牛仔夹克，它提供了更多的防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "leather jacket"
msgid "black leather jacket"
msgid_plural "black leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "黑色皮革夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "black leather jacket" of item "leather jacket"
msgid "This one is a dark black."
msgstr "这件是暗黑色的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "leather jacket"
msgid "brown leather jacket"
msgid_plural "brown leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "棕色皮革夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "brown leather jacket" of item "leather jacket"
msgid "This one is a dark shade of brown."
msgstr "这件是暗棕色的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "leather jacket"
msgid "biker leather jacket"
msgid_plural "biker leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "飞车党皮夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "biker leather jacket" of item "leather jacket"
msgid "This one has the symbol of a local biker gang on it."
msgstr "这件皮夹克上印着当地飞车党的标志。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "leather jacket"
msgid "red leather jacket"
msgid_plural "red leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "紅色皮革外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "red leather jacket" of item "leather jacket"
msgid "This one is bright red."
msgstr "这件是亮红色"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "light jacket"
msgid_plural "light jackets"
msgstr[0] "薄外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "light jacket"
msgid "A thin cotton jacket with a hood.  Good for brisk weather."
msgstr "一件棉製的連帽薄外套。很適合在稍涼的天氣穿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "windbreaker"
msgid_plural "windbreakers"
msgstr[0] "風褸"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "windbreaker"
msgid ""
"A light synthetic jacket with a hood.  Not very warm, but will keep out the "
"rain."
msgstr "附有兜帽的光滑合成纖維夾克。不是很保暖， 但可阻隔雨水。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "windbreaker"
msgid "FBI raid jacket"
msgid_plural "FBI raid jackets"
msgstr[0] "FBI突击夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "FBI raid jacket" of item "windbreaker"
msgid ""
"A distinctive deep blue windbreaker with \"FBI\" emblazoned on the left "
"breast, on the sides of the sleeves, and across the back in large, yellow "
"lettering.  It is only issued to FBI field agents, preventing "
"misidentification."
msgstr "一件独特的深蓝色防风夹克，左胸、袖子两侧和背部都用醒目的大号黄色字体印上了“FBI”字样。这款夹克仅配发给联邦调查局的外勤特工，以防止身份混淆。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "校队夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "varsity jacket"
msgid ""
"A cotton varsity jacket, the type that the jocks in a highschool or a college "
"would wear."
msgstr "一件棉质校队夹克，就是高中或大学里运动员们会穿的那种。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "black and white varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "black and white varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "棒球夹克（黑白相间）"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "black and white varsity jacket" of item "varsity
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This one is black except the white arms, and has no discerning emblem or "
"writing."
msgstr "除了袖子是白色之外，其余全是黑色的，并且没有任何显眼的标志或字样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "Clover High School varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "Clover High School varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "“四叶草高中”校队夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Clover High School varsity jacket" of item
#. "varsity jacket"
msgid ""
"This one has a dark green torso and white arms.  There is an emblem of a "
"four-leaf clover with the writing \"Clover High School\" on the left arm and "
"front right."
msgstr "这件夹克的整体为深绿色，袖子为白色。左袖和右前身带有四叶草徽章和“四叶草高中”的字样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "Wizards varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "Wizards varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "“法师”棒球夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Wizards varsity jacket" of item "varsity jacket"
msgid ""
"This one has a purple torso with white arms.  It has an angry looking old "
"wizard on its back, holding its staff menacingly; below it writes \"WIZARDS\"."
msgstr "这件有着紫的躯干和白色的袖子。在它的背面印有一个看起来很生气的老魔法师，阴险的抓着他的手杖；在其下面写有“WIZARD（法师）”字样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "red and beige varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "red and beige varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "红米色棒球夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "red and beige varsity jacket" of item "varsity
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This one has a red torso and beige looking arms.  \"'93\" is embedded on both "
"its arms, and there is a crest you can't recognize on its front right."
msgstr "这件夹克躯干部分是红色的，手臂部分看起来像是米色的。两侧的袖子上都印着“93”字样，并且在正面右上方有个你无法辨认的纹章。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "black varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "black varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "黑色棒球夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "black varsity jacket" of item "varsity jacket"
msgid ""
"This one is completely black.  At least a dozen different patches are sewn on "
"it."
msgstr "这件是纯黑色的。其上至少缝了数十个不同的补丁。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "NEURT varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "NEURT varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "纽尔特棒球夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "NEURT varsity jacket" of item "varsity jacket"
msgid ""
"This one has a yellow torso and black arms.  \"New England University "
"Robotics Team\" in small letters is written on front left."
msgstr "这件有着黄色的躯干和黑色的袖子。左前侧写着一行小字母“新英格兰大学机器人团队”。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "Crimson Bulls varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "Crimson Bulls varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "深红公牛校队夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Crimson Bulls varsity jacket" of item "varsity
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This one's torso is black and its arms are red.  It has an angry looking red "
"bull ready to charge on its back.  Across the front writes \"BULLS\"."
msgstr "这件夹克躯干部分是纯黑色的，手臂部分则是红色的。背面上画着一只怒目圆瞪的红牛，像是要冲出来一样。正面写着“BULLS”几个大字。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "navy varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "navy varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "海军风格棒球夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "navy varsity jacket" of item "varsity jacket"
msgid ""
"This one's torso is navy colored and has white arms.  You can see the logo of "
"a well known brand in it."
msgstr "这件的躯干部分是水手蓝，手臂部分则是白色。上面还印着知名品牌的logo。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "Zombies varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "Zombies varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "“僵尸”棒球夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Zombies varsity jacket" of item "varsity jacket"
msgid ""
"This one is completely green save for the white stripes around the wrists and "
"the hip.  It has a sprinting zombie clad in football gear on the back, above "
"it writes \"ZOMBIES\"."
msgstr "这件衣服是纯绿色，但手腕和臀部的位置有白色条纹图案。背上画着一只穿着橄榄球护具正在冲锋的僵尸，在图案上方写着“丧尸”。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
msgid "pink and white varsity jacket"
msgid_plural "pink and white varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "校队夹克（粉白相间）"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pink and white varsity jacket" of item "varsity
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This one has a pink torso and white arms.  Someone has sewn an equally pink "
"heart on its front right."
msgstr "这件夹克躯干部分是粉色的，手臂部分则是白色的。有人曾在其正面缝了一个同样是粉红色的爱心。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "judo gi"
msgid_plural "judo gi"
msgstr[0] "柔道道服"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "judo gi"
msgid "Plain white judo gi."
msgstr "一件纯白色的柔道服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "karate gi"
msgid_plural "karate gi"
msgstr[0] "空手道道服"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "karate gi"
msgid "Plain white karate gi.  Made from loose and flowing cotton."
msgstr "一件纯白色的空手道服。由松散而流动的棉布制成。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kariginu"
msgid_plural "kariginu"
msgstr[0] "狩衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "kariginu"
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Shinto robe with several layers and very wide "
"sleeves."
msgstr "一件神道教的傳統長袍， 長度及踝， 有好幾層內裡與非常寬大的袖子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kasaya"
msgid_plural "kasayas"
msgstr[0] "袈裟"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "kasaya"
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Buddhist robe, stitched together from three "
"pieces of traditional saffron dyed cloth."
msgstr "袈裟是一种传统的长及脚踝的佛教僧袍，由三块藏红花染色的传统布料缝合而成。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "keikogi"
msgid_plural "keikogi"
msgstr[0] "劍道服"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "keikogi"
msgid "Plain white keikogi for use in martial arts."
msgstr "純白色的劍道服， 常用在武術上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kimono"
msgid_plural "kimonos"
msgstr[0] "和服"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "kimono"
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Japanese robe, wrapped around the body with a "
"sash."
msgstr "一件日本的傳統長袍， 長度及踝， 有一條可以纏繞身體好幾圈的腰帶。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "yukata"
msgid_plural "yukata"
msgstr[0] "浴衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "yukata"
msgid ""
"An easy-to-wear, breezy robe secured with a sash.  Essentially Japanese "
"pajamas.  Great for summer nights."
msgstr "一件好穿、輕盈、用腰帶綁著的袍子。基本上就是日本的睡衣。很適合夏夜。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "haori"
msgid_plural "haori"
msgstr[0] "羽織"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "haori"
msgid ""
"A loose coat with wide sleeves that is worn unfastened over a kimono.  It is "
"jet black with sparse, tasteful golden embroidery."
msgstr "穿在和服外的寬鬆寬袖外套。它是黑色的，飾有雅緻的金色刺繡。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kittel"
msgid_plural "kittels"
msgstr[0] "猶太傳統服飾"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "kittel"
msgid ""
"A white, knee-length cotton robe, traditionally worn by Jews on special "
"occasions."
msgstr "一件白色的棉質長袍， 長度及膝， 是猶太人在特殊場合穿的傳統服裝。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "motorcycle jacket"
msgid "motorcycle jacket"
msgid_plural "motorcycle jackets"
msgstr[0] "機車夾克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "motorcycle jacket"
msgid ""
"A thick and heavy leather jacket used most commonly by motorcyclists, "
"equestrians and Australian vigilantes."
msgstr "一件厚重的皮衣，是機車騎士、馬術騎手和澳洲義警通常會穿的那種。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "motorcycle jacket"
msgid "motorcycle police jacket"
msgid_plural "motorcycle police jackets"
msgstr[0] "騎警夾克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "motorcycle police jacket" of item "motorcycle
#. jacket"
msgid "It is emblazoned with the insignia of the local police force."
msgstr "這件皮衣上面裝飾著一個當地警察局的徽章標志。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "motorcycle jacket"
msgid "biker gang jacket"
msgid_plural "biker gang jackets"
msgstr[0] "单车恶徒夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "biker gang jacket" of item "motorcycle jacket"
msgid "It is emblazoned with the bad-to-the-bone symbol of a biker gang."
msgstr "这件夹克上有单车飙车党彰显自己坏到骨子里的符号纹章。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "motorcycle jacket" of item "motorcycle jacket"
msgid "This one is plain, lacking any particular decals."
msgstr "这件夹克很普通，没有上面特别的图案装饰。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peacoat"
msgid_plural "peacoats"
msgstr[0] "海軍大衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "peacoat"
msgid "A heavy wool coat, warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "一件厚重的羊绒大衣，带着几个很深的口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "robe"
msgid_plural "robes"
msgstr[0] "長袍"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "robe"
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting outer garment with sleeves and a mysterious amount of "
"well-hidden pockets."
msgstr "一个宽松的长袖外袍，内侧隐藏着几个小口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ghost's robe"
msgid_plural "ghost's robes"
msgstr[0] "鬼袍"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "ghost's robe"
msgid ""
"A white hooded ghost's robe characteristic of souls that haunt the living "
"world."
msgstr "一条带白色头巾的鬼袍，看上去像是出没于活者世界的鬼魂。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cheap ghost's robe"
msgid_plural "cheap ghost's robes"
msgstr[0] "連假鬼袍"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "cheap ghost's robe"
msgid ""
"A cheap ghost costume comprised of a white sheet with two eye holes cut out.  "
"A simple hat is worn underneath to keep the sheet in place."
msgstr "一条廉价鬼袍，由一条白色床单上开两个孔制成。上面有顶简单的帽子，用来固定床单。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grim reaper's robe"
msgid_plural "grim reaper's robes"
msgstr[0] "死神袍"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "grim reaper's robe"
msgid ""
"A black hooded grim reaper's robe with a face cover to hide the user's lack "
"of facial skin.  It pairs nicely with a scythe.  Use it to remove the face "
"cover and show yourself before your victims."
msgstr "一条带黑色头巾的死神长袍，带有面罩，以掩盖使用者所缺少的面部皮肤。它和镰刀特别搭配。使用它来取下面罩，向你的受害者展示自己。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "grim reaper's robe"
msgid "Remove face cover"
msgstr "取下面罩"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "grim reaper's robe"
msgid "The darkness surrounding your face lightens."
msgstr "你的脸周围的黑暗变亮了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grim reaper's robe (faceless)"
msgid_plural "grim reaper's robes (faceless)"
msgstr[0] "死神袍（無面罩）"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "grim reaper's robe (faceless)"
msgid ""
"A black hooded grim reaper's robe with the face cover removed to show the "
"user's lack of facial skin.  It pairs nicely with a scythe.  Use it to hide "
"your lack of facial features."
msgstr "一条带黑色头巾的死神长袍，所带有的面罩被取下，来展示使用者所缺少的面部皮肤。它和镰刀特别搭配。使用它来戴上面罩，掩盖你所缺少的面部五官。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "grim reaper's robe (faceless)"
msgid "Adjust face cover"
msgstr "戴上面罩"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "grim reaper's robe (faceless)"
msgid "You shroud your face in darkness."
msgstr "你的脸被黑暗所掩盖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wizard robe"
msgid_plural "wizard robes"
msgstr[0] "巫師袍"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "wizard robe"
msgid ""
"A mysterious and arcane-looking robe, signifying status in the wizarding "
"world.  It has a hood and some pockets for your magical artifacts."
msgstr "一件神秘的魔法长袍，象征着穿戴者在法师界中的地位。它带有一顶兜帽和一些口袋，用来装你的魔法物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "samghati"
msgid_plural "samghatis"
msgstr[0] "僧伽黎"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "samghati"
msgid ""
"A traditional, double-layered Buddhist coat.  Used as an outer cloak for "
"various occasions."
msgstr "一件传统的佛教双层大衣，在各种场合作为外衣穿戴。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Santa jacket"
msgid_plural "Santa jackets"
msgstr[0] "圣诞夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "Santa jacket"
msgid ""
"A red jacket, trimmed with white faux fur, commonly used by bearded men on "
"Christmas.  Warm and has a couple of small pockets."
msgstr "一件装饰着白色人造毛皮的红色夹克，常被那个在圣诞节出现的长胡子男人使用。保暖而且还有两个小口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "short Santa jacket"
msgid_plural "short Santa jackets"
msgstr[0] "圣诞短夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "short Santa jacket"
msgid ""
"A short red jacket with white faux fur as trim, similar to a Santa jacket but "
"sleeveless, for a more revealing look on Christmas."
msgstr "一件装饰着白色人造毛皮的红色短夹克，与圣诞老人夹克相似但没有袖子，在圣诞节更显露骨。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ski jacket"
msgid_plural "ski jackets"
msgstr[0] "滑雪外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "ski jacket"
msgid ""
"An insulated, breathable hoodie made for alpine skiing.  Very warm, and with "
"sizable pockets."
msgstr "這款絕緣透氣連帽衫專為高山滑雪而設計。很溫暖，有很大的口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless dusters"
msgstr[0] "無袖防塵大衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless duster"
msgid ""
"A rugged full-length duster that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty "
"of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件耐用的、等身長的無袖防塵大衣， 讓你的手臂不受束縛。它有很多口袋， 提供了相當充足的儲物空間。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless fur duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "無袖毛皮大衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless fur duster"
msgid ""
"A thick fur full-length duster without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚實的、等身長的無袖毛皮防塵大衣， 讓你的手臂不受束縛。它有很多口袋， 提供了相當充足的儲物空間。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "無袖人造毛皮防塵大衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless faux fur duster"
msgid ""
"A thick, sleeveless faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many "
"pockets for storing things."
msgstr "一件厚實的無袖人造毛皮防塵大衣， 衣長過膝， 有很多可以儲存物品的口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless leather duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "無袖皮革防塵大衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless leather duster"
msgid ""
"A thick leather full-length duster without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚實的、等身長的無袖皮革防塵大衣， 讓你的手臂不受束縛。它有很多口袋， 提供了相當充足的儲物空間。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "無袖風衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless trenchcoat"
msgid ""
"A thick canvas trenchcoat that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty of "
"storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚实的无袖帆布风衣，有许多口袋，提供了不少存储空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "無袖毛皮風衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless fur trenchcoat"
msgid ""
"A thick fur trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered.  Has "
"plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚實的無袖毛皮風衣， 讓你的手臂不受束縛。它有很多口袋， 提供了相當充足的儲物空間。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "無袖人造毛皮風衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur trenchcoat without sleeves.  Has plenty of storage space, "
"and looks pretty good."
msgstr "一件厚實的無袖人造毛皮風衣。有足夠的存儲空間， 穿上去很好看。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless leather trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless leather trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "無袖皮革風衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless leather trenchcoat"
msgid ""
"A thick leather trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered.  "
"Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚實的無袖皮革風衣， 讓你的手臂不受束縛。它有很多口袋， 提供了相當充足的儲物空間。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless tunic"
msgid_plural "sleeveless tunics"
msgstr[0] "無袖束腰外衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless tunic"
msgid "A sleeveless cloth garment that covers the torso and legs."
msgstr "無袖布質連身服， 覆蓋了軀幹與腿部。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thawb"
msgid_plural "thawbs"
msgstr[0] "阿拉伯長袍"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "thawb"
msgid "A long, loose-fitting robe with wide sleeves.  A traditional Arab garment."
msgstr "一件有着长而宽松的大袖管的阿拉伯传统服饰。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "風衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "trenchcoat"
msgid "A thick canvas trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "一件厚帆布风衣，缝着不少口袋，提供非常大的存储空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "毛皮風衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "fur trenchcoat"
msgid "A thick fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "一件厚實的毛皮風衣， 有許多口袋， 很適合儲物。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "faux fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮風衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage, and "
"makes you the talk of the town."
msgstr "一件厚實的人造毛皮風衣， 內襯許多口袋。非常適合存儲物品， 穿上它讓你成為城市的話題。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "leather trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "皮革風衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "leather trenchcoat"
msgid "A thick leather trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "一件厚實的皮革風衣， 有許多口袋， 很適合儲物。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tunic"
msgid_plural "tunics"
msgstr[0] "束腰外衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "tunic"
msgid "A simple garment long enough to cover down to the knees."
msgstr "一件簡單的衣服， 長度足以覆蓋膝蓋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rag tunic"
msgid_plural "rag tunics"
msgstr[0] "布條束腰外衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "rag tunic"
msgid ""
"A poorly-made long tunic with a string tied around the waist to keep it all "
"in place."
msgstr "一件粗制滥造的束腰外衣，用一根束腰带固定在位置上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tuxedo"
msgid_plural "tuxedos"
msgstr[0] "燕尾服"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "tuxedo"
msgid "A full-body tuxedo.  Makes the apocalypse feel a little more classy."
msgstr "一套燕尾服。為末日時增添一些優雅氣息。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "waistcoat"
msgid_plural "waistcoats"
msgstr[0] "西裝背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "waistcoat"
msgid ""
"An elegant waistcoat.  Ideal for those occasions when wearing only a shirt "
"would be too casual and a suit would be overdoing it."
msgstr "一件优雅的背心。当穿衬衫太随意，穿正装又太过的时候，就选择它吧。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "army winter jacket"
msgid_plural "army winter jackets"
msgstr[0] "陸軍冬季外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "army winter jacket"
msgid ""
"A hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  Favored by "
"the military."
msgstr "一件上面缝着不少口袋的外套，有防寒衬里。军队指定用品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steampunk trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "steampunk trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "风衣（蒸汽朋克）"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "steampunk trenchcoat"
msgid ""
"A thick black leather steampunk themed trenchcoat.  Unlike a regular "
"trenchcoat, this one has no pockets."
msgstr "厚厚的黑色皮革蒸汽朋克主题风衣。与普通风衣不同，这件风衣没有口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plague robe"
msgid_plural "plague robes"
msgstr[0] "瘟疫长袍"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "plague robe"
msgid "A dark robbed cassock worn by plague doctors."
msgstr "瘟疫医生穿的破旧深色袍服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nun habit"
msgid_plural "nun habits"
msgstr[0] "修女常服"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "nun habit"
msgid "A dark piece of clerical clothing.  Typically worn by Christian nuns."
msgstr "深色的神职人员服装。 通常由基督教修女穿着。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical jacket"
msgid ""
"A hefty camouflage jacket rattling with a spade of zippers, press-studs, and "
"attachment points, featuring a high mandarin collar, Velcro cuffs, plates for "
"ID tags, and enough pockets to make your internal Militiaman weep for joy."
msgstr "一件厚重的迷彩夹克，满载拉链、按扣和附件点，配有高立领、魔术贴袖口、身份识别牌插槽，以及足以令你内心的民兵战士喜极而泣的众多口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "forest-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "forest-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "森林迷彩战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "forest-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Paying homage to the field-proven camouflage pattern of old US military "
"uniforms, this huntsman's jacket is printed with a green, brown, and black "
"woodland camouflage pattern."
msgstr "这款猎人夹克致敬了美国旧式军服久经战场考验的迷彩图案，采用绿色、棕色和黑色的林地迷彩印花。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "jungle-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "jungle-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "丛林迷彩战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "jungle-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Bright and dark green shades meet within the patterning of this tactical "
"jacket, embellished by tones of earthen brown and other natural hues.  The "
"trees of the Amazon will speak your native tongue as you stalk around, waging "
"guerrilla warfare against the undead, with this jacket on.  It's just a shame "
"that the rainforest is quite a walk away."
msgstr ""
"这件战术夹克交织着亮绿色和深绿色的迷彩图案，并以土棕色和其他自然色调加以点缀。穿上这件夹克，你在潜伏游击对抗丧尸时仿佛与亚马逊的树林融为一体，只可惜热带雨林"
"离这里相当远。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "savanna tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "savanna tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "草原战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "savanna tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This adventurous-looking jacket would be at home on a safari to the Horn of "
"Africa, dyed, as it is, in light greens, browns, and beige tones.  Then "
"again, you suppose that every day's a safari now.  You're just not sure who's "
"meant to be the hunter: you or the dead."
msgstr ""
"这款颇具冒险气质的夹克仿佛属于前往非洲之角的狩猎之旅，采用浅绿色、棕色和米色调染制而成。话又说回来，你认为如今每一天都如同一场狩猎。只是不确定谁才是猎人：是"
"你，还是那些丧尸。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "marshland-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "marshland-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "沼泽迷彩战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "marshland-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"A staple companion of gamesmen whose trade lies within the watery recesses of "
"wetlands, this water-resistant jacket is festooned with profile-disrupting "
"lines and patterns printed in tan, gray, green, and black hues."
msgstr "这款防水夹克是湿地猎人们的必备伙伴，其上缀满采用棕、灰、绿、黑等色调印制的轮廓扰乱线条与图案。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "arid tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "arid tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "旱地战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "arid tactical jacket" of item "tactical jacket"
msgid ""
"If you were traipsing off to the Sonoran desert, this pocket-laden jacket, "
"with its sand-tan hues, streaks of beige and black, and ventilated interior, "
"would have been your friend.  Now, all it is, is a reminder of a part of the "
"world that may as well be the crust of Mars, for how remote and unreachable "
"it is."
msgstr ""
"如果你打算踏足索诺兰沙漠，这款满是口袋、沙土色基调、掺杂了米白与黑色条纹、且内部透气的夹克将能够成为你的良伴。但如今，它只能提醒你想起那片遥远得如同火星表面"
"般遥不可及的世界。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "alpine-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "alpine-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "山地迷彩战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "alpine-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"A comfortable overcoat for the summer-time mountaineer, hiker, or alpine "
"hunter, this predominantly gray jacket is coated in jagged lines and "
"geometric shapes of brown and white dye."
msgstr "这款以灰色为主调的夹克专为夏季登山者、徒步者或高山猎人设计，其上覆盖着棕色与白色染料勾勒出的锯齿状线条与几何图形，穿着极为舒适。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "urban-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "urban-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "城市迷彩战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "urban-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This particular pattern of jacket proved a relatively common sight among "
"preppers during the end of days, printed in industrial colors — blacks, "
"grays, and dirty whites — to offer better concealment within New England's "
"man-made battle grounds.  Needless to say, a simple camo pattern proved of "
"little help when push came to actual shove."
msgstr ""
"这款夹克的迷彩图案在末日准备者们之中很流行，特别是在大灾变来临时，采用工业色调——黑色、灰色和脏白色——以便在新英格兰地区的战场中获得更好的隐蔽效果。无需多"
"说，在真正的生死关头，这种简单的迷彩图案几乎起不到任何作用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "maritime tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "maritime tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "海事战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "maritime tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Resplendent in a wide assortment of blue and light gray tones, this versatile "
"outerwear is the garment of choice for ocean-side activities, namely ocean "
"activities with less fun sea-side paddling and more marine security and "
"over-the-beach gunfights."
msgstr "这件多彩的外套以各种蓝色和浅灰色调为主，这种多功能的外衣是海边活动的首选服装，特别是那些不那么有趣的海边划船活动，当然更多的是海上安保以及海滩上的枪战。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "river-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "river-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "河流迷彩战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "river-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"The fabric of this particular jacket is festooned with a camouflage pattern — "
"a muddle of greens, light blues, browns, and gray — that would make it at "
"home with any river-based huntsman or angler.  Its water-repellent "
"construction ensures that one's possessions are protected from river spray."
msgstr ""
"这款夹克的面料饰有迷彩图案——由绿色、浅蓝、棕色和灰色交织而成的混杂图案——使其与任何以河流为活动范围的猎人或垂钓者完美契合。其防水构造确保了使用者的物品免"
"受河水飞溅的影响。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "poler-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "poler-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "极地迷彩战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "poler-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Fit for utility in light snowfall and in the colder months, this jacket, "
"while not as insulating as thicker winter overcoats, is resplendent with a "
"mixed camo palette of snowy white, gray, and a hint of light brown."
msgstr "这件夹克适合在下小雪或是寒冷的月份穿着。尽管它的保暖性不如厚实的冬季外套，但它以雪白、灰色和淡棕色点缀的混合迷彩图案非常时髦。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "wolf tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "wolf tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "灰狼战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "wolf tactical jacket" of item "tactical jacket"
msgid ""
"Subtle and unassuming, save for the purely ludicrous number of pockets it's "
"coated in, this hardy overgarment's outer shell is dyed a muted tone of gray "
"verging into beige."
msgstr "如果不去看上面多到荒唐的巨量口袋，这件夹克朴素且不显眼，外表染成了一种接近米色的柔和灰色。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "coyote-brown tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "coyote-brown tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "狼棕战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "coyote-brown tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Modest and relatively plain, as far as tactical equipment goes, this "
"particular jacket is dyed a solid shade of earthen brown."
msgstr "就战术装备而言，这件特殊的夹克被染成土棕色，看上去相对朴素。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "olive-drab tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "olive-drab tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "橄榄色战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "olive-drab tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"The venerable shade of old military equipment, modern reproductions, and "
"prepper camo-closets, this particular jacket is completely dyed a traditional "
"shade of olive green."
msgstr "这件夹克完全采用了传统的老式军用装备、现代复制品以及预备者迷彩衣柜中的经典色调——橄榄绿色。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "urban-black tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "urban-black tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "城市黑色战术夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "urban-black tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Pitch-black, from its mandarin collar to its hems, this jacket is a coat for "
"the aspiring nocturnal operator, tacticool edge lord, and those in the "
"business to be afoot during the small hours of the night."
msgstr "这件夹克大衣从领口到下摆都是漆黑的，是那些夜间行动者、战术潮流领袖以及那些需要在深夜活动的人的理想选择。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "tactical jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "synleather jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "diode bomber"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "mercenary bolero"
msgid "Zip-up chest pocket."
msgstr "胸部拉链口袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "tactical jacket"
msgid "Upper arm pocket."
msgstr "上臂口袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "tactical jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "synleather jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "diode bomber"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "mercenary bolero"
msgid "Zip-up left sleeve pocket."
msgstr "左臂拉链口袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "tactical jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "synleather jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "diode bomber"
msgid "rear channel pocket."
msgstr "后侧口袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "abaya"
msgid_plural "abayas"
msgstr[0] "穆斯林长袍"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "abaya"
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting, full-length outer garment generally worn over clothing by "
"Muslim women."
msgstr "穆斯林妇女通常穿在衣服外面的一种宽松的长外衣。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "abstract combat exoskeleton"
msgid "Compartment for a tool battery."
msgstr "工具电池储存箱。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "abstract combat exoskeleton"
msgid "Attachment points for exoskeleton head armor."
msgstr "戰鬥外骨骼頭部裝甲的安裝處。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "abstract combat exoskeleton"
msgid "Attachment points for exoskeleton torso armor."
msgstr "戰鬥外骨骼軀幹裝甲的安裝處。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "abstract combat exoskeleton"
msgid "Attachment points for exoskeleton arm armor."
msgstr "戰鬥外骨骼手臂裝甲的安裝處。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "abstract combat exoskeleton"
msgid "Attachment points for exoskeleton leg armor."
msgstr "戰鬥外骨骼腿部裝甲的安裝處。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat exoskeleton mk1"
msgid_plural "combat exoskeletons mk1"
msgstr[0] "戰鬥外骨骼裝甲 mk1"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Description of "combat exoskeleton mk1"
msgid ""
"Colloquially known as a 'tank suit' in the media, these first-generation "
"exoskeletons were tested in military service a few years back and determined "
"to be too expensive for regular use.  The exoskeleton itself is strapped on "
"an environmental suit with an integrated life-support system.  A variety of "
"webbing, magnets, and clips allows the attachment of special armor plating "
"onto the frame."
msgstr ""
"這些第一代外骨骼在媒體中俗稱“坦克服”，幾年前在軍隊中進行了測試，但被認為價格太昂貴，不適合常規使用。外骨骼本身綁在整合了生命維持系統的環境防護服上。各種繫"
"帶、磁鐵和夾子可以將特殊的裝甲板固定在外骨骼框架上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk1"
msgid ""
"You turn the exoskeleton on.\n"
">>Initiating boot sequence…\n"
"//Loading DoubleOS v1.38…\n"
"//Loading calibration profile…\n"
"//Activating atmospheric filtration…\n"
"//Activating liquid cooling…\n"
"//Activating sound dampeners…\n"
">>Boot successful."
msgstr ""
"你啟動外骨骼裝甲系統。\n"
">> 開始啟動程序...\n"
" // 正在載入 DoubleOS v1.38…\n"
" // 載入校準設定檔...\n"
" // 啟動氣體過濾系統...\n"
" // 啟動液體冷卻系統...\n"
" // 啟動降噪系統...\n"
">> 啟動成功。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk1"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk2"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk3"
msgid "The exoskeleton batteries are empty."
msgstr "外骨骼裝甲電力耗盡。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat exoskeleton mk1 (on)"
msgid_plural "combat exoskeletons mk1 (on)"
msgstr[0] "戰鬥外骨骼裝甲 mk1（啟動）"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk1 (on)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk2 (on)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk3 (on)"
msgid ""
"You turn the exoskeleton off.\n"
">>Initiating shutdown sequence…\n"
">>Shutting down."
msgstr ""
"你關閉外骨骼裝甲系統。\n"
">> 開始執行關閉程式...\n"
">> 系統正在關閉。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat exoskeleton mk2"
msgid_plural "combat exoskeletons mk2"
msgstr[0] "戰鬥外骨骼裝甲 mk2"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Description of "combat exoskeleton mk2"
msgid ""
"These were the second wave of military combat exoskeleton, and got a lot of "
"media attention, with popular Navy commercials featuring them heavily.  The "
"exoskeleton itself is strapped on an environmental suit with an integrated "
"life-support system.  A variety of webbing, magnets, and clips allows the "
"attachment of special armor plating onto the frame."
msgstr ""
"第二代的軍用戰鬥外骨骼裝甲，除了引起媒體的廣泛關注，廣泛散播的海軍廣告中也大量展示了它們。外骨骼本身綁在整合了生命維持系統的環境防護服上。各種繫帶、磁鐵和夾"
"子可以將特殊的裝甲板固定在外骨骼框架上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk2"
msgid ""
"You turn the exoskeleton on.\n"
">>Initiating boot sequence…\n"
"//Loading DoubleOS v2.86…\n"
"//Loading calibration profile…\n"
"//Activating atmospheric filtration…\n"
"//Activating liquid cooling…\n"
"//Activating sound dampeners…\n"
">>Boot successful."
msgstr ""
"你啟動外骨骼裝甲系統。\n"
">> 開始啟動程序...\n"
" // 正在載入 DoubleOS v2.86…\n"
" // 載入校準設定檔...\n"
" // 啟動氣體過濾系統...\n"
" // 啟動液體冷卻系統...\n"
" // 啟動降噪系統...\n"
">> 啟動成功。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat exoskeleton mk2 (on)"
msgid_plural "combat exoskeletons m2 (on)"
msgstr[0] "戰鬥外骨骼裝甲 mk2（啟動）"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat exoskeleton mk3"
msgid_plural "combat exoskeletons mk3"
msgstr[0] "戰鬥外骨骼裝甲 mk3"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ Description of "combat exoskeleton mk3"
msgid ""
"The final iteration of military power armor before the fall of civilization, "
"this version was designed for actual widespread combat use and was seen on "
"the front lines during the last days of the Cataclysm, unfortunately, the "
"world ended before it could roll out in significant numbers.  The exoskeleton "
"itself is strapped on an environmental suit with an integrated life-support "
"system.  A variety of webbing, magnets, and clips allows the attachment of "
"special armor plating onto the frame."
msgstr ""
"在文明衰落之前，軍用動力裝甲的最後一次迭代，該版本是為實際廣泛的戰鬥使用而設計的，並在大災變的最後幾天出現在前線，不幸的是，在它大量推出之前世界末日就來臨了"
"。外骨骼本身綁在整合了生命維持系統的環境防護服上。各種繫帶、磁鐵和夾子可以將特殊的裝甲板固定在外骨骼框架上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/combat_exoskeleton.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "combat exoskeleton mk3"
msgid ""
"You turn the exoskeleton on.\n"
">>Initiating boot sequence…\n"
"//Loading DoubleOS v3.51…\n"
"//Loading calibration profile…\n"
"//Activating atmospheric filtration…\n"
"//Activating liquid cooling…\n"
"//Activating sound dampeners…\n"
">>Boot successful."
msgstr ""
"你啟動外骨骼裝甲系統。\n"
">> 開始啟動程序...\n"
" // 正在載入 DoubleOS v3.51…\n"
" // 載入校準設定檔...\n"
" // 啟動氣體過濾系統...\n"
" // 啟動液體冷卻系統...\n"
" // 啟動降噪系統...\n"
">> 啟動成功。"

