msgid_plural "overgrown iridescent carapace plates"
msgstr[0] "彩虹甲殼板（生長過度）"

#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
#. ~ Description of "overgrown iridescent carapace plate"
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that looks like it was at one point shaped "
"like armor, but is now bulky and overgrown with sharp pieces jutting out "
"haphazardly.  Scarred into the outer surface you can barely make out the "
"label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could force it into a ballistic "
"vest."
msgstr ""
"一块来自异界的甲壳，看起来曾被整形成装甲板的模样，但现在十分笨重，长满了随意伸出的尖锐碎片。外表面嵌着一道深深的疤痕，你勉强能够分辨出那是\"打击面\""
"的字样。看起来你可以把它强行塞进防弹背心中。"

#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "iridescent carapace plate"
msgid_plural "iridescent carapace plates"
msgstr[0] "彩虹甲殼板"

#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
#. ~ Description of "iridescent carapace plate"
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the "
"shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into the "
"outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could force it "
"into a ballistic vest."
msgstr "一块来自异界的甲壳，看起来被整形成防弹装甲板的模样，稍稍有些弧度。外表面的划痕标记出\"打击面\"的字样。看起来你可以把它塞进防弹背心中。"

#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "undergrown iridescent carapace plate"
msgid_plural "undergrown iridescent carapace plates"
msgstr[0] "彩虹甲殼板（生長不全）"

#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
#. ~ Description of "undergrown iridescent carapace plate"
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the "
"shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into the "
"outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  The armor coverage is spotty and "
"it appears to be oozing and pulsing like it is in pain."
msgstr ""
"一块来自异界的甲壳，看起来被整形成防弹装甲板的模样，稍稍有些弧度。外表面的划痕标记出\"打击面\""
"的字样。装甲板上布满了斑痕，它似乎在疼痛中不停跳动着渗出黏液。"

#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plate of scarred flesh"
msgid_plural "plates of scarred flesh"
msgstr[0] "彩虹甲殼板（幾乎毀掉）"

#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
#. ~ Description of "plate of scarred flesh"
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly flesh that seems to have been forced into the shape "
"of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  There is no armor left "
"on this plate, just a mass of writhing alien flesh oozing in pain.  However, "
"it looks like it is slowly growing back."
msgstr ""
"一块来自异界的血肉，看起来被整形成防弹装甲板的模样，稍稍有些弧度。装甲板上以及完全没有甲壳了，只剩下一大团不断抽搐着渗出黏液的异界血肉。然而它看起来正在慢慢"
"恢复。"

#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
