#. ~ Description of variant "pair of reading aviators" of item "pair of
#. reading sunglasses"
msgid "This pair has aviator-styled lenses."
msgstr "这副眼镜采用飞行员式镜框。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of eyeglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of eyeglasses"
msgstr[0] "近視眼鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of eyeglasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of glasses for the near-sighted.  The concave lenses diffuse the "
"sunlight, rendering them useless for starting fires."
msgstr "一副近視眼鏡。凹透鏡讓陽光發散， 所以無法用來生火。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of eyeglasses"
msgid "pair of round eyeglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of round eyeglasses"
msgstr[0] "圆框眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of eyeglasses"
msgid "pair of square eyeglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of square eyeglasses"
msgstr[0] "方框眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of eyeglasses"
msgid "pair of aviator eyeglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of aviator eyeglasses"
msgstr[0] "飞行员眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "monocle"
msgid_plural "monocles"
msgstr[0] "單眼鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "monocle"
msgid ""
"An essential article of the gentleman's apparel.  Also corrects "
"near-sightedness.  The concave lens diffuses the sunlight, rendering it "
"useless for starting fires."
msgstr "這是紳士服飾的必備品。還能矯正近視。凹透鏡讓陽光發散，所以無法用來生火。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of reading glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of reading glasses"
msgstr[0] "老花眼鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of reading glasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else.  You can use "
"them to focus sunlight."
msgstr "一副遠視眼鏡。對正常人沒有用處。你可以用它來聚焦陽光。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of safety glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of safety glasses"
msgstr[0] "護目鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of safety glasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of plastic glasses, used in workshops, sports, chemistry labs, and "
"many other places.  Provides great protection from damage."
msgstr "一副塑膠眼鏡， 常用在工作室， 運動， 化學實驗室， 以及許多地方。提供了絕佳的傷害保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of glass goggles"
msgid_plural "pairs of glass goggles"
msgstr[0] "玻璃護目鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of glass goggles"
msgid ""
"A pair of old-fashioned goggles with thick glass lenses, somewhat similar to "
"those worn by the pilots of open-cockpit aircraft, but more crude looking.  "
"Won't protect your eyes from physical harm, but can keep hazardous chemicals "
"out."
msgstr "一副有厚重玻璃鏡片的老式護目鏡，類似開放式駕駛艙飛機駕駛員所戴的護目鏡，但看起來更粗糙。不會保護您的眼睛免受物理傷害，但可以阻隔有害化學物質。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of ski goggles"
msgid_plural "pairs of ski goggles"
msgstr[0] "滑雪護目鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of ski goggles"
msgid ""
"A large pair of goggles that completely seal off your eyes.  Provides "
"excellent protection from environmental dangers."
msgstr "一副大型護目鏡， 能完全密封你的眼睛， 提供絕佳的環境危害防護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of welding goggles"
msgid_plural "pairs of welding goggles"
msgstr[0] "焊接護目鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of welding goggles"
msgid ""
"A dark pair of goggles.  They make seeing very difficult, but protect you "
"from bright flashes."
msgstr "一副深色的護目鏡。它讓視線變得非常困難， 但是能保護你免於眩光。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of snow goggles"
msgid_plural "pairs of snow goggles"
msgstr[0] "滑雪護目鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of snow goggles"
msgid ""
"Eyewear carved from wood or bone, with only a thin slit to see out of.  Helps "
"reduce glare, traditionally used by the Inuit to protect against snow "
"blindness."
msgstr "由木頭或骨頭雕刻而成的眼鏡， 在眼睛的位置只有一條薄薄的縫隙。有助於減少眩光， 傳統上供因紐特人使用以防止雪盲。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "太陽眼鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of sunglasses"
msgid "A pair of sunglasses, good for keeping the glare out of your eyes."
msgstr "一副太陽眼鏡， 能夠防止強光亮瞎你的眼。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of sunglasses"
msgid "pair of round sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of round sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "圆框太阳镜"

