#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of bifocal sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "雙焦點墨鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of bifocal sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those "
"who are both near-sighted and far-sighted."
msgstr "一副能夠看遠看近的墨鏡。能讓有遠視老花眼也有近視的悲劇人物免受炫光之苦。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid "pair of round bifocal sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of round bifocal sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "圆框双光太阳镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid "pair of square bifocal sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of square bifocal sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "方框双光太阳镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid "pair of bifocal aviators"
msgid_plural "pairs of bifocal aviators"
msgstr[0] "飞行员双光眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid "pair of round bifocal transition glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of round bifocal transition glasses"
msgstr[0] "变色圆框双光眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of round bifocal transition glasses" of item
#. "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of transition bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and "
"far-sighted.  Contains photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when "
"exposed to ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the "
"lenses fade back.  This pair has rounded lenses."
msgstr ""
"一副可调焦点的变色眼镜，针对同时近视及远视的人群。含有感光变色染料，当暴露于太阳光的紫外线下时，会使镜片中的染料激活变暗。当紫外线减弱时，镜片会褪色。这副眼"
"镜采用圆式镜框。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid "pair of square bifocal transition glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of square bifocal transition glasses"
msgstr[0] "变色方框双光眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of square bifocal transition glasses" of
#. item "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of transition bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and "
"far-sighted.  Contains photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when "
"exposed to ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the "
"lenses fade back.  This pair has square lenses."
msgstr ""
"一副可调焦点的变色眼镜，针对同时近视及远视的人群。含有感光变色染料，当暴露于太阳光的紫外线下时，会使镜片中的染料激活变暗。当紫外线减弱时，镜片会褪色。这副眼"
"镜采用方式镜框。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid "pair of bifocal transition aviators"
msgid_plural "pairs of bifocal transition aviators"
msgstr[0] "变色飞行员双光眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of bifocal transition aviators" of item
#. "pair of bifocal sunglasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of transition bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and "
"far-sighted.  Contains photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when "
"exposed to ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the "
"lenses fade back.  This pair has aviator-styled lenses."
msgstr ""
"一副可调焦点的变色眼镜，针对同时近视及远视的人群。含有感光变色染料，当暴露于太阳光的紫外线下时，会使镜片中的染料激活变暗。当紫外线减弱时，镜片会褪色。这副眼"
"镜采用飞行员式镜框。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of corrective sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of corrective sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "矯正墨鏡"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of corrective sunglasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes of those who are "
"near-sighted."
msgstr "一副的墨鏡，能讓有近視的人免受炫光之苦。"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of corrective sunglasses"
msgid "pair of round corrective sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of round corrective sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "圆框近视太阳镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of corrective sunglasses"
msgid "pair of square corrective sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of square corrective sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "方框近视太阳镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of corrective sunglasses"
msgid "pair of corrective aviators"
msgid_plural "pairs of corrective aviators"
msgstr[0] "飞行员近视眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of corrective sunglasses"
msgid "pair of round corrective transition glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of round corrective transition glasses"
msgstr[0] "变色圆框近视眼镜"

#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of round corrective transition glasses" of
#. item "pair of corrective sunglasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of transition glasses for the near-sighted.  Contains photochromic "
"dyes that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to ultraviolet rays from "
"sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the lenses fade back.  This pair has "
