#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "padded gambeson"
msgid_plural "padded gambesons"
msgstr[0] "加厚軟甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "padded gambeson"
msgid ""
"A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting readily available fabric and "
"stuffing the layers with waste fabric or horse hair that was intended as "
"standalone armor, being too thick to comfortably fit a cuirass over.  Likely "
"either a historical artifact or a low-quality reproduction.  Though inferior "
"to a proper layered aketon or gambeson it still offers decent protection."
msgstr ""
"用現成的布料縫製而成的加墊大衣，並在各層中塞入廢布料或馬毛，用來當作獨立的盔甲，因為太厚而無法舒適地套上胸甲。可能是歷史文物或低品質的複製品。雖然比不上正規"
"的多層軟甲或實物，但仍能提供不錯的保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "padded gambeson vest"
msgid_plural "padded gambeson vests"
msgstr[0] "加厚衬垫软铠"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "padded gambeson vest"
msgid ""
"A thick padded surcoat assembled by quilting readily available fabric and "
"stuffing the layers with waste fabric or horse hair that was intended as "
"standalone armor, being too thick to comfortably fit a cuirass over.  Likely "
"either a historical artifact or a low-quality reproduction.  Though inferior "
"to a proper layered gambeson its sheer thickness is still quite protective."
msgstr ""
"一件加厚的衬垫软铠，通过层叠绗缝现有的布料，并用边角料或马鬃毛填充各层，制作出的独立盔甲，太厚而无法舒适地穿上外套胸甲。 像是个历史文物或低质量的仿品。 "
"虽然不如真正制作良好的欧洲层叠软铠，但由于它的厚度仍能提供不错的保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "padded arming pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of padded arming pants"
msgstr[0] "绗缝衬裤"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "padded arming pants"
msgid ""
"Thick pants made of quilted fabric, meant to be worn alongside a gambeson "
"under or without armor."
msgstr ""
"一件绗缝厚裤子，用来穿在链甲或其他护甲底下。\n"
"译者注：绗缝是一种在双层布中填充棉花等材料的工艺。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "padded coif"
msgid_plural "padded coifs"
msgstr[0] "衬布罩盔"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "padded coif"
msgid ""
"A cloth coif with neck and forehead protection.  Resting on your shoulders, "
"it serves as padding for a helmet.  Though it's pretty warm, it is "
"constructed of stuffed cloth layers and provides moderate protection."
msgstr "保护颈部和前额的布头巾，有点像修女穿的那种。它下部垂在肩上，作为头盔的衬垫。它很暖和。它由好几层薄布料堆叠制成，提供适当的防御。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canvas aketon"
msgid_plural "canvas aketons"
msgstr[0] "帆布軟甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas aketon"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth jack, intended to be worn below metal armor.  This one is made "
"of over a dozen layers of tough canvas, and it provides fairly decent "
"protection on its own."
msgstr "一件厚外套，专门穿在金属盔甲下面。由许多层坚韧的帆布制成，本身就能提供可观的防御。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canvas aketon vest"
msgid_plural "canvas aketon vests"
msgstr[0] "帆布軟甲背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas aketon vest"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth vest, intended to be worn below metal armor.  This one is made "
"of over a dozen layers of tough canvas, and it provides fairly decent "
"protection on its own."
msgstr "一件厚背心，专门穿在金属盔甲下面。由许多层坚韧的帆布制成，本身就能提供可观的防御。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "canvas arming pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of canvas arming pants"
msgstr[0] "帆布绗缝衬裤"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas arming pants"
msgid ""
"Tough cloth pants worn alongside an aketon underneath metal armor.  These are "
"made of many layers of canvas offering solid protection."
msgstr "穿在金屬護甲下的堅韌的軟甲布褲。由多層帆布製成，提供堅實的保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canvas coif"
msgid_plural "canvas coifs"
msgstr[0] "帆布頭巾"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas coif"
msgid ""
"A cloth coif with neck and forehead protection.  Resting on your shoulders, "
"it serves as padding for a helmet.  Though it's pretty warm, it is "
"constructed of tough canvas and provides substantial protection even on its "
"own."
msgstr "保护颈部和前额的布头巾，有点像修女穿的那种。它下部垂在肩上，作为头盔的衬垫。它很暖和。它由坚韧的帆布组成，本身就提供不错的防御。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "canvas arming gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of canvas arming gloves"
msgstr[0] "帆布绗缝手套"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas arming gloves"
msgid ""
"Tough gloves made of canvas cloth, thin enough to wear under metal gauntlets. "
" They help to keep your hands safe during a fight."
msgstr "帆布布料制成的坚韧的手套，薄到可以戴在金属护手下。它们有助于在格斗中保护你的手。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canvas gambeson"
msgid_plural "canvas gambesons"
msgstr[0] "帆布軟護甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas gambeson"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth greatcoat intended to be worn as standalone armor, as it's a "
"little too thick to comfortably add chainmail or a cuirass on top.  Made of "
"thirty layers of tough canvas, this will protect you from almost everything, "
"but it's very heavy and warm.  The sleeves are a bit thinner for flexibility "
"and it drapes below your legs, providing additional protection there."
msgstr ""
"一件使用较厚布料制作的大外套，本身作为独立的布甲穿着，因为再往上面穿链甲或胸甲就太厚了。使用三十层坚韧的帆布制成，防御性能很好，但是穿着又重又热。略薄的袖子"
"方便运动，腿部有提供防御的额外垂帘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thin-sleeved canvas gambeson"
msgid_plural "thin-sleeved canvas gambesons"
msgstr[0] "薄袖帆布軟護甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "thin-sleeved canvas gambeson"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth greatcoat intended to be worn as standalone armor, as it's a "
"little too thick to comfortably add chainmail or a cuirass on top.  Made of "
"thirty layers of tough canvas, this will protect you from almost everything, "
"but it's very heavy and warm.  The sleeves are a lot thinner for flexibility "
"and it drapes below your legs, providing additional protection there."
msgstr ""
"一件使用较厚布料制作的大外套，本身作为独立的布甲穿着，因为再往上面穿链甲或胸甲就太厚了。使用三十层坚韧的帆布制成，防御性能很好，但是穿着又重又热。更薄的袖子"
"更方便运动，腿部有提供防御的额外垂帘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless canvas gambeson"
msgid_plural "sleeveless canvas gambesons"
msgstr[0] "無袖帆布軟護甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless canvas gambeson"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth surcoat intended to be worn as standalone armor, as it's a "
"little too thick to comfortably add chainmail or a cuirass on top.  Made of "
"thirty layers of tough canvas, this will protect you from almost everything, "
"but it's very heavy and warm.  It drapes below your legs, providing "
"additional protection there, and it lacks sleeves entirely."
msgstr ""
"一件使用较厚布料制作的大外套，本身作为独立的布甲穿着，因为再往上面穿链甲或胸甲就太厚了。使用三十层坚韧的帆布制成，防御性能很好，但是穿着又重又热。腿部有提供"
"防御的额外垂帘，完全没有袖子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canvas heavy arming pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of canvas heavy arming pants"
msgstr[0] "帆布重型绗缝衬裤"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas heavy arming pants"
msgid ""
"Tough, extremely thick cloth pants worn on their own alongside a gambeson.  "
"These are made of a huge number of canvas layers offering very solid "
"protection, though they're too thick to easily add metal armor on top and are "
"both stuffy and restrictive."
msgstr "一条极厚且坚韧的与软铠穿在一起的裤子。它由大量帆布层叠制成，提供非常可观的防御，但金属盔甲也不再能套在它外面，光穿它就已经又闷又沉。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canvas arming mittens"
msgid_plural "pairs of canvas arming mittens"
msgstr[0] "帆布武裝連指手套"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas arming mittens"
msgid ""
"Very thick canvas gauntlets worn in lieu of metal or leather armor.  Though "
"they make it hard to do anything other than swing a weapon, and they're very "
"warm, they offer excellent protection."
msgstr "非常厚实的帆布手套，是金属或皮革材质的替代品。也是因为太过厚实，除了挥动武器，做其他任何事情都不方便。它很暖和，提供不俗的防御"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nylon aketon"
msgid_plural "nylon aketons"
msgstr[0] "尼龍軟甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon aketon"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth jack, intended to be worn below metal armor.  This one is made "
"of over a dozen layers of tough nylon, and it provides fairly decent "
"protection on its own."
msgstr "一件布質厚夾克，設計穿在金屬盔甲裡面。由十幾層堅韌的尼龍製成，本身就提供了相當不錯的保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nylon aketon vest"
msgid_plural "nylon aketon vests"
msgstr[0] "尼龍軟甲背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon aketon vest"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth vest, intended to be worn below metal armor.  This one is made "
"of over a dozen layers of tough nylon, and it provides fairly decent "
"protection on its own in addition to being quite light."
msgstr "一件布質厚背心，設計穿在金屬盔甲裡面。由十幾層堅韌的尼龍製成，除了相當輕盈之外，本身還提供相當不錯的保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "nylon arming pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of nylon arming pants"
msgstr[0] "尼龙绗缝衬裤"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon arming pants"
msgid ""
"Tough cloth pants worn alongside an aketon underneath metal armor.  These are "
"made of many layers of nylon offering solid protection and the modern "
"material is much lighter than organic fabrics."
msgstr "一件布質厚褲子，設計成與軟甲一起穿在金屬盔甲裡面。由多層尼龍製成，提供堅實的保護。這種現代材料比天然有機織物要輕得多。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nylon coif"
msgid_plural "nylon coifs"
msgstr[0] "尼龍頭巾"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon coif"
msgid ""
"A cloth coif with neck and forehead protection.  Resting on your shoulders, "
"it serves as padding for a helmet.  It is constructed of tough nylon and "
"provides decent protection even on its own in addition to being fairly light."
msgstr "保護頸部和前額的布質頭巾。兩端垂放在你的肩膀上，可充當頭盔的襯墊。它由堅韌的尼龍製成，除了相當輕之外，甚至單獨穿戴就能提供良好的保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "nylon arming gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of nylon arming gloves"
msgstr[0] "尼龙绗缝手套"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon arming gloves"
msgid ""
"Tough gloves made of nylon cloth, thin enough to wear under metal gauntlets.  "
"They help to keep your hands safe during a fight."
msgstr "由尼龍布製成的堅韌手套，薄到可以穿戴在金屬重型長手套裡面。有助於在戰鬥中保護你的雙手。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nylon gambeson"
msgid_plural "nylon gambesons"
msgstr[0] "尼龍厚軟甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon gambeson"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth greatcoat intended to be worn as standalone armor, as it's a "
"little too thick to comfortably add chainmail or a cuirass on top.  Made of "
"thirty layers of tough nylon, this will protect you from almost everything, "
"but it's very heavy and warm.  The sleeves are a bit thinner for flexibility "
"and it drapes below your legs, providing additional protection there."
msgstr ""
"一件厚的布質大衣，設計成單獨穿戴的護甲，因為它有點太厚，無法舒適地在外面穿戴鏈甲或胸甲。由三十層堅韌的尼龍布製成，幾乎可以保護你承受任何傷害，但是又重又熱。"
"袖子稍薄，具有靈活性，下擺垂落在你的腿部，為腿部提供額外的保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thin-sleeved nylon gambeson"
msgid_plural "thin-sleeved nylon gambesons"
msgstr[0] "薄袖尼龍厚軟甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
#. ~ Description of "thin-sleeved nylon gambeson"
msgid ""
"A thick cloth greatcoat intended to be worn as standalone armor, as it's a "
"little too thick to comfortably add chainmail or a cuirass on top.  Made of "
"thirty layers of tough nylon, this will protect you from almost everything, "
"but it's very heavy and warm.  The sleeves are a lot thinner for flexibility "
"and it drapes below your legs, providing additional protection there."
msgstr ""
"一件厚的布質大衣，設計成單獨穿戴的護甲，因為它有點太厚，無法舒適地在外面穿戴鏈甲或胸甲。由三十層堅韌的尼龍布製成，幾乎可以保護你承受任何傷害，但是又重又熱。"
"袖子稍薄，具有靈活性，下擺垂落在你的腿部，為腿部提供額外的保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
