#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "blood donor cap" of item "baseball cap"
msgid ""
"A snapback baseball cap displaying the image of bloodpack connected to a drop "
"of blood in the front, and under that image, a text that reads: 'Donating "
"Blood', in white, and 'Save Lives' in red.  It shields your eyes from the sun "
"and provides a little bit of warmth."
msgstr "一顶按扣式棒球帽，正面画着一个血袋连接到一滴血的图案，图案下方写着：白色的“献血”和红色的“拯救生命”字样。它能保护你的眼睛不受阳光直射，而且也能稍微保暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
