msgid_plural "Planet Earth caps"
msgstr[0] "地球棒球帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Planet Earth cap" of item "baseball cap"
msgid ""
"A snapback baseball cap displaying the detailed image of a round Planet Earth "
"right at the front.  The whole cap is black, with some white dots around, "
"making the background looks like outer space.  It shields your eyes from the "
"sun and provides a little bit of warmth."
msgstr "一顶按扣式棒球帽，前面印有一个细致的地球图像。整个帽子是黑色的，周围有一些白色点，使背景看起来像外太空。它能保护你的眼睛避免阳光直射，同时提供一点点保暖效果"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
