msgid_plural "Flat Earth caps"
msgstr[0] "地平棒球帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Flat Earth cap" of item "baseball cap"
msgid ""
"A snapback baseball cap displaying the image of a flat, disk-like Earth, with "
"the dome right above it, showing the sun illuminating one half of Flat Earth, "
"and the moon, illuminating the night with moonlight (which is reflected light "
"from the sun) on the other half, and besides it, a text that reads: 'Earth is "
"Flat!'.  It shields your eyes from the sun and provides a little bit of "
"warmth."
msgstr ""
"一顶反扣式棒球帽，展示了一个扁平、圆盘状的地球图像，正上方是穹顶，太阳照亮了扁平地球的一半，另一半是月亮，月光（就是来自太阳的反射光）照亮了夜晚，除此之外，"
"还有一段文字：“地球是平的！”。它为你的眼睛遮挡阳光，并提供一丝温暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
