#. ~ Description of "knit hat"
msgid "A snug-fitting wool hat.  Very warm."
msgstr "一頂緊密貼身的羊毛帽。非常保暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "newsboy cap"
msgid_plural "newsboy caps"
msgstr[0] "送報生帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "newsboy cap"
msgid ""
"A slouching wool cap with a short front brim, traditionally associated with "
"newspaper delivery boys.  Quite warm."
msgstr "一頂軟塌的羊毛帽， 前方有短帽沿， 通常會讓人聯想到送報男孩。相當保暖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "noise canceling headgear"
msgid_plural "noise canceling headgears"
msgstr[0] "消音耳罩"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "noise canceling headgear"
msgid "Padding over your ears, kept in place by some string.  Blocks incoming sounds."
msgstr "一个用来隔绝外界噪音的头戴式耳罩。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sombrero"
msgid_plural "sombreros"
msgstr[0] "墨西哥闊邊帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "sombrero"
msgid ""
"An orange felt sombrero with traditional white and yellow hand stitching.  "
"The wide brim keeps the sun out of your eyes, and a thin strap hooks around "
"your chin."
msgstr "一顶橙色的墨西哥毛毡宽边帽，装饰着传统白黄相间的手工刺绣图案。宽大的帽檐能够保护你的眼睛不受阳光直射，同时还有一条细细的绑带钩住你的下巴。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kippah"
msgid_plural "kippahs"
msgstr[0] "猶太帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "kippah"
msgid "A thin, rounded skullcap.  A traditional headdress in Judaism."
msgstr "一頂薄型無邊圓帽。是猶太教的傳統頭飾。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zucchetto"
msgid_plural "zucchettos"
msgstr[0] "主教无檐帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "zucchetto"
msgid "A small, crimson skullcap.  Traditionally worn by Catholic priests."
msgstr "一顶较小的深红色无檐帽。一般是天主教神父常戴着它。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kufi cap"
msgid_plural "kufi caps"
msgstr[0] "庫法體帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "kufi cap"
msgid "A brimless, short and rounded cap."
msgstr "一頂無帽簷的短圓帽。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "French maid hat"
msgid_plural "French maid hats"
msgstr[0] "法式女僕頭飾"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "French maid hat"
msgid "A frilly white headpiece."
msgstr "一個白色的褶邊頭飾。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "porkpie hat"
msgid_plural "porkpie hats"
msgstr[0] "卷邊平頂帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "porkpie hat"
msgid ""
"A flat-topped hat with circular indent and a narrow brim.  Most popular in "
"the 40s and 50s, still common among those in the mod scene, hipsters, and "
"people named Heisenberg."
msgstr "一頂平頂的帽子， 有著圓形凹槽和一個狹窄的帽緣。在 40 及 50 年代很受歡迎， 常見於國防場景， 嬉皮士， 還有叫 \"海森堡\" 的人頭上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mail carrier hat"
msgid_plural "mail carrier hats"
msgstr[0] "郵差帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "mail carrier hat"
msgid ""
"A traditional mail carrier's cap, with the US postal service logo embroidered "
"on the front above the plastic brim.  A symbol of a bygone world."
msgstr "一顶塑料帽檐上方印着美国邮政服务标志、传统样式的邮差帽。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Santa hat"
msgid_plural "Santa hats"
msgstr[0] "圣诞帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "Santa hat"
msgid "A red hat with white faux fur trim, commonly used by bearded men on Christmas."
msgstr "一顶装饰着白色人造毛皮的红色帽子，常被那个在圣诞节出现的长胡子男人使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "straw hat"
msgid_plural "straw hats"
msgstr[0] "草帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "straw hat"
msgid "A hat woven out of straw.  Its brim helps keep the sun out of your eyes."
msgstr "一顶由麦秸或其他坚韧植物编织而成的帽子，宽大的帽檐能够保护你的眼睛不受太阳直射。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tinfoil hat"
msgid_plural "tinfoil hats"
msgstr[0] "錫箔帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "tinfoil hat"
msgid ""
"A sheet of aluminum foil that has been molded into a form-fitting hat.  "
"Perfect for protecting yourself from the government, Illuminati, aliens, and "
"THEM."
msgstr "用一塊鋁箔， 已經摺疊成一頂合身的帽子。完美的保護你免於老大哥、光明會、外星人、以及 \"他們\" 的控制。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "top hat"
msgid_plural "top hats"
msgstr[0] "高帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "top hat"
msgid ""
"The only hat for a gentleman.  Look exquisite while laughing in the face of "
"danger!"
msgstr "紳士專用的唯一選擇。危險當前時更要保持優雅的笑容！"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tricorne"
msgid_plural "tricornes"
msgstr[0] "船形帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "tricorne"
msgid ""
"A classic design, the \"tricorne\", or three-cornered hat, simply pins a "
"large and floppy brim out of the way, though this example adds "
"well-embroidered designs and is oiled against water.  Whether you're the "
"\"guvnah\" of a settlement, or the captain of a post-apocalyptic crew, this "
"is the hat for you."
msgstr ""
"一頂經典的 \"船形帽\"， 或稱三角帽， 純粹將大而軟的帽沿向上折起固定， 這頂還帶有精緻的刺繡與防水設計。不論你是一個定居點的 \"總督\"， "
"或是一名末日的後船長， 這頂帽子是為你而準備的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "turban"
msgid_plural "turbans"
msgstr[0] "頭巾"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "turban"
msgid ""
"Cloth wound around the head, worn by people of many cultures worldwide.  Some "
"historical examples could be huge and ostentatious, but this one is a very "
"simple design."
msgstr "一条缠在头上的布，世界各地各种文化的人都会穿着。历史上某些范例能弄得十分巨大或华丽，但这条款式非常简单。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "golf cap"
msgid_plural "golf caps"
msgstr[0] "高爾夫球帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "golf cap"
msgid ""
"You're not actually sure if this is called a golf cap, but it's the "
"stereotypical cap golfers wear."
msgstr "你真的不確定這是否叫做高爾夫球帽， 而是印象中高爾夫球手們都戴這種帽子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wizard hat"
msgid_plural "wizard hats"
msgstr[0] "巫師帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
#. ~ Description of "wizard hat"
