msgstr[0] "步枪弹壳吊坠"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of "rifle-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"Rather crude and clearly put together on a budget, this is a piece of "
"post-Cataclysmic—so-called—jewelry—little more than an unpolished, solitary "
"rifle casing threaded on a length of cord, string, or twine to form a pendent "
"necklace."
msgstr ""
"这款首饰相当粗陋，显然在预算有限的情况下拼凑而成，是所谓的后灾变时代的“珠宝”——实际上不过是一枚未经打磨的步枪弹壳，被穿在一条绳索、细线或麻线上，形成了一"
"条吊坠项链。"

