#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "ordnance-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"An expedient means of flaunting one's gunnery prowess, or a crude attempt at "
"overcompensating for matters best left undescribed, this article of "
"craft-produced jewelry is, essentially, one part cordage and three parts "
"mammoth bullet casing: the giant cartridge, either from a grenade round or "
"some other form of heavy munitions, strung to hang upon the chest as a "
"pendent.  The shell's neck has been carefully tapped, leaving a hole on "
"either side of the casing's throat through which the makeshift neck chain has "
"been fed and tied off."
msgstr ""
"这种手工艺品首饰是一种权宜之计，用来炫耀某人的射击技能，或者是一种粗俗的尝试，用来过度补偿那些最好不提的事情。本质上，这件首饰是由一部分绳索和三部分巨大的子"
"弹壳组成的：这个巨大的弹壳，要么来自一种榴弹，要么是其他某种重型弹药，被串起来挂在胸前作为吊坠。弹壳的颈部两侧被小心地凿开，留下了孔，绳子穿过这些孔并打结固"
"定，形成了这件自制的项链。"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "ordnance-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"An expedient means of flaunting one's gunnery prowess, or a crude attempt at "
"overcompensating for matters best left undescribed, this article of "
"craft-produced jewelry is, essentially, one part cordage and three parts "
"mammoth bullet casing: the giant cartridge, either from a grenade round or "
"some other form of heavy munitions, strung to hang upon the chest as a "
"pendent.  The center of the shell's struck primer has been punched out, and a "
"second hole has been drilled shy of the rim, with a section of tied-off "
"cordage stringing through both entry points to form a makeshift neck chain."
msgstr ""
"这件工艺饰品既是一种炫耀射击技术的高明手段，又是一种笨拙地试图弥补那些最好避而不谈的事情的尝试。其本质上，是由一部分绳索和三部分巨型子弹壳组成：巨大的弹壳，"
"可能是来自榴弹或其他形式的重型弹药，被串起来挂在胸前作为吊坠。弹壳中央的撞击底火已被冲出，同时在边缘附近钻了一个孔，通过这两个入口点穿入一段打结的绳索，形成"
"这件自制的项链。"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "ordnance-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"An expedient means of flaunting one's gunnery prowess, or a crude attempt at "
"overcompensating for matters best left undescribed, this article of "
"craft-produced jewelry is, essentially, one part cordage and three parts "
"mammoth bullet casing: the giant cartridge, either from a grenade round or "
"some other form of heavy munitions, strung to hang upon the chest as a "
"pendent.  The jaws of a set of pliers have been laid to work, with the "
"shell's neck twisted closed in a tapered spiral, while a hole has been bored "
"through opposite sides of the cartridge's base, through which a loop of cord "
"has been tugged.  The string's loose ends have been wrapped around the casing "
"in a serpentine pattern before being tied off, creating a manner of bullet "
"cocoon."
msgstr ""
"这件手工制作的饰品，本质上既是一种炫耀射击技术的高明手段，又是一种笨拙地试图弥补那些最好避而不谈的事情的尝试。它主要由一部分绳索和三部分巨型子弹壳组成：这个"
"巨大的弹壳，可能来自榴弹或其他形式的重型弹药，被串起来挂在胸前作为吊坠。用钳子的钳口将弹壳的颈部以锥形螺旋状扭曲闭合，同时在弹壳底座的对面两侧钻出一个孔，穿"
"过一根绳索的环。绳索的松散末端以蛇形图案缠绕在弹壳上，然后系紧，形成了一个子弹茧的样式。"

