#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of "refined ordnance-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"An article of hand-produced apparel that George Washington himself could look "
"down upon with an approving smile, the daintiness of this necklace's precious "
"metal chain looks rather comical when compared against the gargantuan pendant "
"that hangs from it: an expended casing from a grenade round, shotgun "
"cartridge, or some other form of sizable munition."
msgstr ""
"这款手工制作的饰品，乔治·华盛顿本人若是看到，想必也会带着赞许的微笑低头审视。与这条项链的精致金属链条相比，挂在其上的巨型吊坠显得颇为滑稽：它是一个来自榴弹"
"、霰弹枪弹药筒或其他大型弹药形式的弹壳。"

