#. ~ Description of "base chainmail half-leggings"
msgid ""
"Customized partial chainmail leggings only covering the front and sides of "
"the legs.  The zigzagging lace at the back keeps everything in place, and the "
"lack of toes and heels allows them to work perfectly well with footwear."
msgstr "一套自制的链甲腿甲部件，仅覆盖腿的前侧及两侧。背部的锯齿形系带起到固定作用。脚趾与后跟处留空，方便你穿上各种鞋具。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chainmail leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of chainmail leggings"
msgstr[0] "链甲护腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "chainmail leggings"
msgid ""
"Customized chainmail leggings.  Their straps keep everything in place, and "
"the lack of toes and heels allows them to work perfectly well with footwear.  "
"The metal shows signs of rust and corrosion, and some chain links have fallen "
"away."
msgstr "一套自制的锁链腿甲，各个部件之间采用带子连接固定在一起，脚趾和脚跟处的空缺使它们能够与鞋类很好地兼容。金属有生锈和腐蚀的迹象。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel chainmail leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of mild steel chainmail leggings"
msgstr[0] "低碳钢链甲护腿"

