msgid_plural "pairs of mild steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgstr[0] "低碳钢链甲半护腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of medium steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgstr[0] "中碳钢链甲半护腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of high steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgstr[0] "高碳钢链甲半护腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgstr[0] "硬化碳钢链甲半护腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of tempered steel chainmail half-leggings"
msgstr[0] "回火碳钢链甲半护腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cataphract leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of cataphract leggings"
msgstr[0] "重骑兵护腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "cataphract leggings"
msgid ""
"This leg armor, made of interlocking plates of burnished bronze, appears to "
"be either a high-quality recreation or a genuine artifact.  Despite having an "
"ancient design, it is in mint condition aside from some battle damage.  It "
"covers from the upper thigh to the lower shin, and is of extremely high "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"这件青铜甲胄由相互连接的抛光青铜板制成，看起来要么是高质量的现代重制品，要么是真正的古代遗物。尽管样式十分古老，除了表面的一些战斗损伤，它仍旧完好无缺。它覆"
"盖的部位从头部到腰部，品质极高。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather chaps"
msgid_plural "leather chaps"
msgstr[0] "皮革護腿套褲"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leather chaps"
msgid ""
"A pair of black leather chaps.  Very tough and light, but doesn't offer any "
"storage."
msgstr "一對黑色皮革護腿套褲。非常堅韌且輕巧， 但沒有任何儲物空間。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chainsaw chaps"
msgid_plural "chainsaw chaps"
msgstr[0] "防鋸護腿套褲"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "chainsaw chaps"
msgid ""
"A pair of tough chaps made of Kevlar.  Chainsaw kickbacks are potentially "
"fatal; personal protective equipment like these chaps help protect your "
"femoral arteries.  The layered Kevlar is designed to fray on contact with the "
"chain and bind up the tool."
msgstr "一条由凯夫拉纤维制成的坚固耐用的裹腿。链锯失控能够致命；诸如此类的个人防护设备能保护你的股动脉。分层的凯夫拉纤维在与链条接触时会磨损，并缠住链条。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fencing pants"
msgid_plural "fencing pants"
msgstr[0] "擊劍長褲"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "fencing pants"
msgid ""
"A pair of reinforced pants used by fencers to prevent injuries.  They don't "
"cover the lower leg."
msgstr "一条用于避免击剑时发生意外的防护裤，没有覆盖到小腿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of knee pads"
msgid_plural "pairs of knee pads"
msgstr[0] "護膝"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of knee pads"
msgid "A pair of knee pads made of stout plastic and cloth."
msgstr "一對由堅固的布料與塑膠製成的護膝。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of bronze greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of bronze greaves"
msgstr[0] "青銅護脛"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of bronze greaves"
msgid "A pair of bronze leg guards with a simple leather lining."
msgstr "一對有著簡易皮革內襯的青銅護腿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hard leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of hard leg guards"
msgstr[0] "硬式護腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hard leg guards"
msgid "A pair of polyurethane leg guards with neoprene backing."
msgstr "一個硬塑膠製的護腿， 有泡綿緩衝內襯。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of steel leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of steel leg guards"
msgstr[0] "鋼製護腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of steel leg guards"
msgid ""
"A full assembly of medieval leg protection.  Cuisses, poleyns, and greaves, "
"with leather straps to secure each piece and connect it as part of a set."
msgstr "一副完整組裝的中世紀護腿。以皮革綁帶固定並連結著護腿、護膝以及護脛。 "

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of iron greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of iron greaves"
msgstr[0] "鐵製護脛"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of iron greaves"
msgid "A pair of iron leg guards with a simple leather lining."
msgstr "一對有著簡易皮革內襯的鐵製護腿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of sheet metal leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of sheet metal leg guards"
msgstr[0] "鐵板護腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of sheet metal leg guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of leg guards hammered out of metal and shaped to tie on to the upper "
"and lower leg, avoiding joints.  Perfect for the Post-Apocalyptic Warrior "
"look."
msgstr "一对用金属锤打而成的护腿，能绑在大腿和小腿上，避开了关节部位。完美搭配末日战士造型。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened sheet metal leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened sheet metal leg guards"
msgstr[0] "钢板护腿（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened sheet metal leg guards"
msgid ""
"These crude leg guards have been hardened to further protect your legs from "
"the mighty coffee table, destroyer of shins."
msgstr "这副粗制的护腿经过硬化处理，可进一步保护你的腿免受\"强大的小腿破坏者——咖啡桌\"的伤害。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of sheet metal greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of sheet metal greaves"
msgstr[0] "钢板护胫"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of sheet metal greaves"
msgid ""
"A pair of shin guards hammered out of metal and shaped to tie on to the lower "
"leg."
msgstr "一对用金属锤打成型的护胫，可以系在小腿上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened sheet metal greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened sheet metal greaves"
msgstr[0] "钢板护胫（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened sheet metal greaves"
msgid "These crude greaves have been hardened to further protect your shins."
msgstr "这对简陋的护胫经过硬化处理，可以进一步保护小腿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sheet metal skirt"
msgid_plural "sheet metal skirts"
msgstr[0] "鐵板裙"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "sheet metal skirt"
msgid ""
"Four cut-down sheets of metal hanging off your waist to keep your hip and "
"groin safe.  They're held in place rather loosely, but still get in the way a "
"lot when running."
msgstr "四块切割好的金属板，挂在你的腰上，以保护你的臀部和腹股沟。虽然这些金属板比较松散，但在跑步时仍会有不少不便。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened sheet metal skirt"
msgid_plural "hardened sheet metal skirts"
msgstr[0] "钢板裙（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened sheet metal skirt"
msgid ""
"This loose skirt made from several cut-down sheets of metal has been hardened "
"to provide maximum protection for your most vulnerable area."
msgstr "这条宽松的裙子由几块金属片切割制成，经过硬化处理，为你最脆弱的区域提供最大程度的保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of sheet metal knee guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of sheet metal knee guards"
msgstr[0] "鐵板護膝"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of sheet metal knee guards"
msgid ""
"Two small half-cylinders of sheet metal cut down and hammered to fit over the "
"front of your knees.  They make kneeling painful, but don't impede running "
"much."
msgstr "两块被切割并捶打成半圆柱形，以贴合膝盖前部的小金属板。这东西让你跪在地上时非常痛苦，但不太会妨碍跑步。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of hardened sheet metal knee guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened sheet metal knee guards"
msgstr[0] "钢板护膝（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of hardened sheet metal knee guards"
msgid ""
"Knee guards of sheet metal, hardened to protect your kneecaps from any feral "
"with a bat."
msgstr "薄钢板制成的护膝，经过硬化处理，可以保护你的膝盖免受那些拿着棒球棍的疯子所伤。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of paper leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of paper leg guards"
msgstr[0] "紙質護腿套"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of paper leg guards"
msgid "Leg guards made of stacked paper sheets held together with duct tape."
msgstr "將幾疊紙用膠帶纏繞成的紙護腿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of improvised tire leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of improvised tire leg guards"
msgstr[0] "粗製輪胎護腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of improvised tire leg guards"
msgid "Leg guards made of thick chunks of tire held together with duct tape."
msgstr "一对将许多块轮胎片叠在一起，然后用胶带粘牢的护腿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of scrap leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of scrap leg guards"
msgstr[0] "廢金屬護腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of scrap leg guards"
msgid "A pair of leg guards made from scraps of metal secured by simple strings."
msgstr "一对用金属碎片做成的护腿，碎片之间用小绳子固定。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of tire leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of tire leg guards"
msgstr[0] "輪胎護腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of tire leg guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of leg guards made from thick chunks of tire secured by simple "
"strings; the loose collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the "
"most convenient protection."
msgstr "一套用厚橡胶块做成的护腿，碎片之间用小绳子固定。这些松垮的小片片能提供不错的防护，但是还不够完美。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "motorcycle jeans"
msgid_plural "pairs of motorcycle jeans"
msgstr[0] "摩托车牛仔裤"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "motorcycle jeans"
msgid ""
"A pair of thick jeans interwoven with Kevlar for added durability and "
"sporting integrated kneepads and flank protection, typically worn by "
"motorcyclists to protect from road rash."
msgstr "一条嵌入了凯夫拉纤维以增加耐久度，并提供了一体化的护膝和侧腹保护的厚牛仔裤，摩托车手通常会穿这条牛仔裤，以防出车祸时受伤。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armored jeans"
msgid_plural "pairs of armored jeans"
msgstr[0] "装甲牛仔裤"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "armored jeans"
msgid ""
"A pair of jeans reinforced with hard plastic knee pads and metal sheets.  The "
"end product is not very sturdy and somewhat cumbersome, but protective."
msgstr "一条用硬塑料护膝和金属片加固的牛仔裤。 虽然不是很坚固还有点笨重，但至少能保护你。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened armored jeans"
msgid_plural "pairs of hardened armored jeans"
msgstr[0] "硬化装甲牛仔裤"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened armored jeans"
msgid ""
"A pair of jeans reinforced with hard plastic knee pads and hardened steel "
"sheets.  Although its high protection outweighs its encumbrance, it's not "
"really sturdy."
msgstr "一条用硬塑料护膝和硬化碳钢加固的牛仔裤。 虽然较高的防护能力超过了累赘程度，但它并不是很耐用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "EOD trousers"
msgid_plural "EOD trousers"
msgstr[0] "拆彈防護長褲"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "EOD trousers"
msgid ""
"This is a heavy pair of trousers armored in Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, "
"for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians.  While it offers near "
"complete coverage in fragmentation resistant materials, it still offers "
"insufficient protection from ballistic threats."
msgstr "这是一条由凯夫拉纤维、芳纶和泡沫衬垫制成的厚重长裤，供排爆技术员使用。 虽然它几乎完全被防破片材料覆盖了，但仍不足以抵御子弹的威胁。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical EOD trousers"
msgid_plural "tactical EOD trousers"
msgstr[0] "战术拆弹防护裤"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical EOD trousers"
msgid ""
"This is a heavy pair of trousers armored in Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, "
"for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians in 'non-permissive "
"environments'.  While it offers near complete coverage in fragmentation "
"resistant materials, it still offers insufficient protection from ballistic "
"threats.  These trousers are lighter than normal EOD armor to provide more "
"maneuverability."
msgstr ""
"这是一条由凯夫拉、芳纶和泡沫衬垫制成的厚重长裤，供排爆技术员在“非许可环境”中使用。 "
"虽然它几乎完全覆盖了抗碎裂材料，但它仍然无法提供足够的防弹威胁保护。为了提供更强大的机动性，这条裤子比普通的拆弹护甲更轻。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel light leg guard"
msgid_plural "mild steel light leg guards"
msgstr[0] "輕型鋼護腿（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel light leg guard"
msgid ""
"A light leg guard, 1.25 mm at the thickest.  This one has been made with mild "
"steel."
msgstr "一件厚1.25毫米的轻型护腿。这件是用低碳钢做的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel light leg guard"
msgid_plural "medium steel light leg guards"
msgstr[0] "輕型鋼護腿（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel light leg guard"
msgid ""
"A light leg guard, 1.25 mm at the thickest.  Made with tougher medium steel, "
"this offers solid protection."
msgstr "一件厚1.25毫米的轻型护腿。这件是用更坚硬的中碳钢制成，提供坚固的保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel light leg guard"
msgid_plural "high steel light leg guards"
msgstr[0] "輕型鋼護腿（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel light leg guard"
msgid ""
"A light leg guard, 1.25 mm at the thickest.  Made with high steel offering "
"excellent protection."
msgstr "一件厚1.25毫米的轻型护腿。这件是用更坚硬的高碳钢制成，提供出色的保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened light leg guard"
msgid_plural "hardened light leg guards"
msgstr[0] "轻型钢护腿（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened light leg guard"
msgid ""
"A light leg guard, 1.25 mm at the thickest.  The mild steel has been "
"hardened, offering superior protection."
msgstr "一件厚1.25毫米的轻型护腿。低碳钢经过硬化处理，提供更好的保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered light leg guard"
msgid_plural "tempered light leg guards"
msgstr[0] "輕型鋼護腿（回火鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered light leg guard"
msgid ""
"A light leg guard, 1.25 mm at the thickest.  The medium steel has been "
"quenched and tempered, offering top of the line protection."
msgstr "一件厚1.25毫米的轻型护腿。中碳钢经过淬火和回火处理，提供顶级保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel leg guard"
msgid_plural "mild steel leg guards"
msgstr[0] "中型鋼護腿（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel leg guard"
msgid "A leg guard, 1.75 mm at the thickest.  This one has been made with mild steel."
msgstr "一件厚1.75毫米的护腿。这件是用低碳钢做的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel leg guard"
msgid_plural "medium steel leg guards"
msgstr[0] "中型鋼護腿（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel leg guard"
msgid ""
"A leg guard, 1.75 mm at the thickest.  Made with tougher medium steel, this "
"offers solid protection."
msgstr "一件厚1.75毫米的护腿。这件是用更坚硬的中碳钢制成，提供坚固的保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel leg guard"
msgid_plural "high steel leg guards"
