msgstr "一件時尚的漂白牛仔褲。"

#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "jeans"
msgid "A pair of old baggy jeans.  The heels are all ripped up."
msgstr "一条破旧的布袋牛仔裤。裤脚都被撕裂了。"

