#. ~ Description of "chitin cow armor"
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from chitin "
"fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一套使用甲壳块自制的动物铠甲，包含鸡颈，当胸和搭后，贴合在一层细网外。你可以把这套牛铠套在一头友好的牛身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chainmail cow armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail cow armors"
msgstr[0] "乳牛用鏈甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "chainmail cow armor"
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of chainmail, suitably made for cows as protection.  You "
"could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一套厚厚的铁环链甲，专门为保护牛打造。你可以将这套牛铠穿在一头友好的牛身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled leather cow barding with caparison"
msgid_plural "boiled leather cow bardings with caparison"
msgstr[0] "华丽皮革牛铠"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled leather cow barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for cows consisting of boiled leather and cloth undercovering. "
" This caparison depicts a battle between a monstrous dragon and regal "
"griffin.  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一套全身牛铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰描述了一只恶龙与一匹皇家狮鹫之间的战斗。你可以将这套牛铠套在一头友好的牛身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled leather cow barding with bones"
msgid_plural "boiled leather cow bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "鑲骨硬化皮革乳牛護甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled leather cow barding with bones"
msgid ""
"Decorative bones affixed to leather cow barding to invoke fear in bandits and "
"raiders and traders all!  You could put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一套鞣制皮革制成的牛铠，上面附加了许多装饰性的骨钉，足以使强盗、掠夺者和商人们感到恐惧！你可以将这套牛铠套在一头友好的牛身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cow rain sheet"
msgid_plural "cow rain sheets"
msgstr[0] "乳牛雨衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "cow rain sheet"
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering designed to keep a cow dry in the rain.  You could "
"put this on a friendly cow."
msgstr "一层薄薄的能覆盖一头牛全身的塑料布，使牛在雨中保持干燥。你可以将这套雨衣套一头友好的牛身上。"

