#: data/json/items/armor/pets_dog_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "chainmail dog coat"
#. ~ Description is reference to Churl scenario text - 'protect your dog from
#. foul undead'.
msgid "Protecteth yon hund fram ful daemons!  You could put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr "保護你的獵犬遠離惡魔！你能將它穿戴到友善的犬類身上。"

