"undercovering.  This caparison depicts a battle between a monstrous dragon "
"and regal griffin.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套全身马铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰描述了一只恶龙与一匹皇家狮鹫之间的战斗。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather horse barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison depicts a red dragon breathing fire on cities. "
" You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套全身马铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰描述了一只红龙向城市喷吐烈火。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather horse barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison depicts a bear standing on its hind legs, "
"forelegs outstretched in a menacing manner.  You could put this on a friendly "
"horse."
msgstr "一套全身马铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰描述了一只熊用后腿直立起来，并威胁性地伸展它的前腿，准备扑击。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather horse barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison depicts an assortment of fruits and vegetables "
"with a very large orange featured in the foreground.  You could put this on a "
"friendly horse."
msgstr "一套全身马铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰描绘了一个巨大的橘子，背景中还有各种水果蔬菜。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather horse barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison depicts a massive vulture perched on a "
"mountain.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套全身马铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰描绘了一只栖息在高山上的秃鹫。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather horse barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison depicts the mythical Erymanthian boar in "
"various artistic forms.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套全身马铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰以多种艺术形式描绘了希腊神话中凶恶的厄律曼托斯野猪。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather horse barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison seems to be sponsored by Rycon Construction, "
"with a tag line of \"From down under to your home, we play all the roles from "
"start to finish!\".  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"一套全身马铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰看起来由瑞康建筑公司赞助，包含公司的广告词：\"从澳大利亚到你的家中，从动土到封顶，我们什么活都接！\""
"。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather horse barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison seems to be sponsored by Core Generator Tech, "
"with a tag line of \"Providing power solutions from culinary to graphic "
"design, we have the magic touch for your problems!\".  You could put this on "
"a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"一套全身马铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马铠上的装饰看起来由核心发电科技公司赞助，包含公司的广告词：\"提供从烹饪到平面设计的电源解决方案，有难题找我们！\""
"。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled leather horse barding with bones"
msgid_plural "boiled leather horse bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "骨钉皮革马铠"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled leather horse barding with bones"
msgid ""
"Decorative bones affixed to leather horse barding to invoke fear in bandits "
"and raiders and traders all!  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套鞣制皮革制成的马铠，上面附加了许多装饰性的骨钉，足以使强盗、掠夺者和商人们感到恐惧！你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horse rain sheet"
msgid_plural "horse rain sheets"
msgstr[0] "馬用雨衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "horse rain sheet"
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering designed to keep a horse dry in the rain.  You could "
"put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一层薄薄的能覆盖马匹全身的塑料布，能使马在雨中保持干燥。你可以将这套犬具穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "iron horse armor"
msgid_plural "iron horse armors"
msgstr[0] "铁马铠"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "iron horse armor"
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically-placed iron plates and leather, suitably "
"made for horses as protection.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的铁甲，专门为保护马匹打造。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steel horse armor"
msgid_plural "steel horse armors"
msgstr[0] "钢马铠"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "steel horse armor"
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of steel plate and leather, suitably made for horses as "
"protection.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的钢板，专门为保护马匹打造。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze horse armor"
msgid_plural "bronze horse armors"
msgstr[0] "青铜马铠"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze horse armor"
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically-placed bronze plates and leather, suitably "
"made for horses as protection.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的青铜甲，专门为保护马匹打造。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of saddle bags"
msgid_plural "pairs of saddle bags"
msgstr[0] "鞍座袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/pets_horse_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of saddle bags"
msgid "A pair of covered pouches laid across the back of a horse behind the saddle."
msgstr "一對有蓋子的小袋鋪設在鞍座後面的馬背上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense system"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense systems"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 模組化防禦系統"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense system"
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  Striped in brown and blue, the white seal "
"of Hub 01 is emblazoned proudly on the front.  It features several quick "
"access pouches attached to a waist drawstring, and two waterproof dry bags "
"for carrying liquids.  It also features several tight clamps and velcro "
"strips around the waist and shoulders; perhaps something attaches to them."
msgstr ""
"一条为真正的边疆探险家定制设计的披风，由凯夫拉纤维和极厚的防裂布制成。上面使用棕蓝相间的条纹，Hub "
"01的标志被自豪地印在了披风的正面。自带了挂在腰部拉绳上的几个快速存取口袋和两个防水干袋，用于盛装液体。此外在腰部和肩部也有几个夹具和尼龙搭扣；也许能在上面"
"安装些其他挂件。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid "Watertight internal reservoir."
msgstr "防水内置储液箱"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "remediator defense anchor"
msgid "Quick access pouches."
msgstr "快取口袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "remediator defense anchor"
msgid "Hooks for an armored mantle."
msgstr "护甲外套挂钩"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid "Hooks for an armored skirt."
msgstr "护甲裙板挂钩"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense system"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid "Strap for a gun barrel."
msgstr "枪管背带"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense anchors"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 模組化防禦空間錨"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  This one features a hardened skeleton of "
"ceramic plates running up and over the shoulders, and a portion of the front "
"has been raised upwards from the rest.  Lifting the fabric reveals a large "
"disc-shaped device installed into the garment, featureless except for a "
"prominent switch and Hub 01's logo in LED.  In addition to the poncho's usual "
"complement of storage, a battery compartment has been added that wires into "
"this device, featuring very specialized connectors and, perhaps a little "
"disconcertingly, radiation shielding."
msgstr ""
"一条为真正的边疆探险家定制设计的披风，由凯夫拉纤维和极厚的防裂布制成。这款型号上装满了一直向上覆盖到肩部的陶瓷护甲板，在正面的一部分向前凸出。提起织物，可以"
"看到下方一个巨大的圆盘状装置安装在装甲上，除了一个突出的开关和Hub "
"01的LED标志外，没有其他特征。除了原版披风所带的储物空间外，还额外增加了一个电池箱，可以连接到设备上，具有非常独特的连接器，可能还有一个令人不安的辐射屏"
"蔽层。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid "Turn on anchor"
msgstr "开启空间锚"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid ""
"You activate the anchor, and the Hub 01 logo on your front begins to glow "
"white."
msgstr "你开启了空间锚，正面的Hub 01标志开始发光。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense anchors (on)"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 模組化防禦空間錨（開）"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  The logo of Hub 01 emblazoned on the chest "
"is glowing white."
msgstr ""
"一条为真正的边疆探险家定制设计的披风，由凯夫拉纤维和极厚的防裂布制成。这款型号上装满了一直向上覆盖到肩部的陶瓷护甲板，在正面的一部分向前凸出。胸前印着Hub"
" 01的标志，正在发出白光。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid "Turn off anchor"
msgstr "关闭空间锚"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid "The Hub logo on your front stops glowing."
msgstr "正面的Hub 01标志不再发光。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 模块化侦察头盔"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer, made with robust "
"Nylon sheeting reinforced with Kevlar fibers.  The top consists of a series "
"of plastic plates with hooks and velcro strips, perhaps for attaching "
"additional parts.  On the forehead of the assembly is a bulky box visor on a "
"mechanism to quickly pull it down over your eyes, with a cover on the side to "
"insert standard batteries.  Activate to lower the visor and use the light "
"amplification functions."
msgstr ""
"为真正的先驱探险家设计的带兜帽重型头盔，由坚固的化纤织物与凯夫拉纤维加固而成。头盔顶部装有一系列塑料板，上面附有挂钩和尼龙搭扣带，推测是用来安装附加模块的。"
"头盔前额处装有一个厚重的盒状护目镜，通过目镜支架可以迅速将其拉下覆盖眼部，侧边有一个电池仓盖，可用于放入标准电池供电。激活以降下护目镜并启用微光增强功能。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid "You lower the visor and flick the control dial to light amplification mode."
msgstr "你放下护目镜，拨动控制盘，进入微光增强模式。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/headsets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/headsets.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "tactical infovisor"
msgid "The visor's batteries are dead."
msgstr "护目镜的电池没电了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid "Hooks for an armored helm plate."
msgstr "头盔板挂钩"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV+IR)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV+IR)"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 模块化侦察头盔（夜视+红外）"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV+IR)"
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer.  The visor has "
"been lowered over the eyes, and is drawing low power to provide light "
"amplification by way of an infrared illuminator and detector.  Lets you see "
"in the dark, and detects heat signatures emitted by (un)living organisms.  "
"Activate again to turn off and stow the visor."
msgstr ""
"为真正的先驱探险家设计的带兜帽重型头盔，护目镜已降下，正在缓慢消耗电量，通过红外照明器和探测装置实现微光增强效果。能让你在黑暗中视物，并侦测活体或非活体生物"
"发出的热信号。激活以关闭功能并将护目镜抬起。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/headsets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/headsets.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV+IR)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tactical infovisor"
msgid "You flick the visor off, and push it off your face."
msgstr "你关闭了护目镜，并把它从脸上抬起。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "drone-tech harness"
msgid_plural "drone-tech harness"
msgstr[0] "无人机背带"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "drone-tech harness"
msgid ""
"A modified army harness, repurposed to carry several small and a single "
"medium sized drone alongside the tools to maintain them."
msgstr "改进的军用背带，用于携带几架小型和一架中型无人机以及维护它们的工具。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "A series of connectors meant to hold a medium sized drone on your back."
msgstr "一条用于将中型无人机固定在背上的背带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "Medium drone strap"
msgstr "中型无人机背带"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "A series of connectors meant to store a small drone."
msgstr "一条用于将小型无人机固定在背上的背带。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "Small drone holder"
msgstr "小型无人机背带"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "Gadget pouch"
msgstr "小工具袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "Tool clip"
msgstr "工具夹"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 prototype mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype mantles"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 原型外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Several buckles and straps allow it to be "
"adjusted to fit you comfortably.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear that a "
"lot of thought has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to clip to "
"the chest and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE "
"SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3"
"D打印的上半身盔甲，由一层厚而柔韧的含有加固金属纤维的塑料制成。几条扣环和背带可以调整适合你的体型，穿着合身舒适。尽管表面粗糙，但很明显设计者在人体工程学和"
"装备重量方面考虑了很多。设计了胸部和肩部的夹具，内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic mantles"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 動能外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic mantle"
#. ~ Description of "remediator kinetic mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  This model incorporates a rubber coating "
"that diffuses impacts and provides excellent protection from blunt trauma, "
"even if it does feel a bit like a rain coat.  Designed to clip to the chest "
"and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3"
"D打印的上半身盔甲，由一层厚而柔韧的含有加固金属纤维的塑料制成。这款型号采用了橡胶涂层，可以扩散冲击，并提供极好的保护，免受钝击创伤，即使这使它看起来有点像"
"雨衣。设计了胸部和肩部的夹具，内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 turnout mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout mantles"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防火外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  This model features heat-resistant "
"materials in the construction, providing protection from extreme heat without "
"sacrificing its overall performance.  Designed to clip to the chest and "
"shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3"
"D打印的上半身盔甲，由一层厚而柔韧的含有加固金属纤维的塑料制成。这款型号采用了耐热材料，在不牺牲其整体性能的情况下能够防护极端高温。设计了胸部和肩部的夹具，"
"内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic mantles"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防彈外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Thanks to a slim under-layer of synthetic "
"fibers, it provides fantastic defense from small-arms fire, and could take "
"the edge off of a rifle bullet, too.  Designed to clip to the chest and "
"shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3"
"D打印的上半身盔甲，由一层厚而柔韧的含有加固金属纤维的塑料制成。多亏内含的一层合成纤维薄层，它能轻松挡下小口径武器的射击，还可以降低步枪子弹所造成的伤害。设"
"计了胸部和肩部的夹具，内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 soldier mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier mantles"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 士兵外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, sporting a professional finish and "
"stellar ergonomics.  Made of extremely tough UHMW polyethylene combined with "
"treated aramid fabric, it provides military-grade defense against zombies, "
"bullets, zombies with bullets, and plenty of other things that the Cataclysm "
"can throw at you.  Designed to clip to the chest and shoulders, its interior "
"reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3"
"D打印的上半身盔甲，由一层厚而柔韧的含有加固金属纤维的塑料制成。它由极为坚硬的超高分子量聚乙烯和经过处理的凯夫拉纤维制成，可提供军用级的防御，抵御丧尸、子弹"
"、带子弹的丧尸，以及大灾变所能丢到你头上的其他大部分东西。设计了胸部和肩部的夹具，内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 prototype skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype skirts"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 原型褲裙"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  It features a simple integrated belt to let it fit "
"any waist size.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear that a lot of thought "
"has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3"
"D打印的下半身盔甲，由多块分段装甲组成裙板。它内置一条简单的腰带，适合所有的腰围。尽管表面粗糙，但很明显设计者在人体工程学和装备重量方面考虑了很多。设计了腰"
"部的夹具，内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic skirts"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 動能褲裙"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  This model resembles scale armor, and provides "
"excellent protection from blunt trauma.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3D打印的下半身盔甲，由多块分段装甲组成裙板。这个型号类似于鳞甲，并提供了极好的保护，免受钝击创伤。设计了腰部的夹具，内侧印着\""
"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 turnout skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout skirts"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防火褲裙"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  This version incorporates tight-fitting leggings "
"that provide some protection from extreme heat.  Designed to clip to the "
"waist, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr "一套3D打印的下半身盔甲，由多块分段装甲组成裙板。这个型号采用紧身护腿，可以防护极端高温。设计了腰部的夹具，内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic skirts"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防彈褲裙"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  It includes a reinforcing layer of aramid fabric in "
"addition to leg sleeves made of high-strength material, protecting your "
"sensitive bits from small-arms fire.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3"
"D打印的下半身盔甲，由多块分段装甲组成裙板。除了高强度材料制成的腿套，它还包括一层凯夫拉纤维加固层，保护你的敏感部位免受小口径武器的攻击。设计了腰部的夹具，"
"内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 soldier skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier skirts"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 士兵褲裙"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, sporting a professional finish and "
"stellar ergonomics.  Composed of segmented polyethylene armor plates "
"featuring a dense metal core sandwiched between layers of composite-grade "
"aramid fabric, it provides excellent protection for the upper legs to ensure "
"that you'll stay on your feet when it really matters.  Designed to clip to "
"the waist, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"一套3"
"D打印的下半身盔甲，拥有专业的外观和一流的人体工程学。它由分段聚乙烯装甲板组成，沉重的金属核心被夹在复合凯夫拉纤维层之间，为腿部提供极好的保护，确保你在真正"
"重要的时候依然能够稳如泰山。设计了腰部的夹具，内侧印着\"此面安装于模块化防御系统\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 原型臂甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  The end of each sheet features a clip and drawstring, to "
"fit the armor to any size.  Despite the rough finish, it fits securely, and "
"feels quite comfortable."
msgstr ""
"一对3"
"D打印的护臂，由包裹在前臂上的大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成。每块装甲板末端都有一个夹具和一根拉绳，以适合任何尺寸的盔甲。尽管表面粗糙，但它牢固贴合，感觉非常舒适"
"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 動能臂甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  These ones are built in an overlapping pattern that "
"diffuses impacts and provides excellent protection from blunt trauma."
msgstr "一对3D打印的护臂，由包裹在前臂上的大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成。每块装甲板都排成相互重叠的样式，可以传递冲击，并提供良好的保护，免受钝击创伤。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防火臂甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  These ones include Nomex sleeves to protect your arms "
"from extreme heat."
msgstr "一对3D打印的护臂，由包裹在前臂上的大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成。这个型号采用芳纶制成袖子，可以为手臂提供极端高温防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 ballistic vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 ballistic vambraces"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防彈臂甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 ballistic vambraces"
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  These ones include aramid arm sleeves that do a great "
"job of slowing down bullets and preventing them from shredding your arms."
msgstr "一对3D打印的护臂，由包裹在前臂上的大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成。这个型号采用凯夫拉纤维制成袖子，可以很好地减缓子弹的速度，防止它们撕碎你的手臂。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 soldier vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 soldier vambraces"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 士兵臂甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 soldier vambraces"
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, sporting a professional finish and stellar ergonomics. "
" With thick bullet-resistant arm sleeves, flexible but extremely tough "
"thermoplastic plates, and special attention given to areas reflexively used "
"to protect the face from attacks, it provides first-rate protection against "
"all the horrors that the apocalypse has brought to bear."
msgstr ""
"一对3"
"D打印的护臂，由包裹在前臂上的大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成。这个型号有着厚厚的防弹袖子，柔韧但极为结实的热塑性塑料装甲板，并特别注意利用人的本能来保护面部免受攻"
"击，它提供了一流的保护，以抵御大灾变所带来的各种恐怖。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 prototype greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 prototype greaves"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 原型脛甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 prototype greaves"
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, consisting of thick knee pads and a pair of large, "
"flexible polymer plates for securing around the calves to protect the tibias "
"of each leg.  Two straps on each plate can be tightened or loosened to fit "
"different leg sizes.  Despite the rough finish, it doesn't impede your "
"movement, and fits comfortably against your body."
msgstr ""
"一对3"
"D打印的护腿，由一个厚护膝和一对大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成，用来固定在小腿周围，以保护双腿的胫骨部位。每块装甲板上的两条带子可以拉紧或松开，以适应不同的腿部尺"
"寸。尽管表面粗糙，但它不会妨碍你的运动，并且舒适地贴合你的身体。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 kinetic greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 kinetic greaves"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 動能脛甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 kinetic greaves"
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, consisting of thick knee pads and a pair of large, "
"flexible polymer plates for securing around the calves to protect the tibias "
"of each leg.  Thick padding and rubber lining provide excellent protection "
"from blunt trauma."
msgstr "一对3D打印的护腿，由一个厚护膝和一对大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成，用来固定在小腿周围，以保护双腿的胫骨部位。厚厚的衬垫和橡胶衬里提供极好的保护，免受钝击创伤。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 turnout greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 turnout greaves"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防火脛甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 turnout greaves"
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, consisting of thick knee pads and a pair of large, "
"flexible polymer plates for securing around the calves to protect the tibias "
"of each leg.  Heat-resistant leg sleeves and a breathable design provide "
"adequate protection from extreme heat without sacrificing your mobility or "
"core protection."
msgstr ""
"一对3"
"D打印的护腿，由一个厚护膝和一对大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成，用来固定在小腿周围，以保护双腿的胫骨部位。耐热裤管和透气设计在不牺牲灵活性或核心保护的前提下，为你"
"的腿部提供充分的极端高温防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 ballistic greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 ballistic greaves"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防彈脛甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 ballistic greaves"
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, consisting of thick knee pads and a pair of large, "
"flexible polymer plates for securing around the calves to protect the tibias "
"of each leg.  This model features leggings made of durable aramid and a "
"reinforced plate design; combined, they do a good job of mitigating damage "
"from small-arms fire."
msgstr ""
"一对3"
"D打印的护腿，由一个厚护膝和一对大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成，用来固定在小腿周围，以保护双腿的胫骨部位。这个型号采用结实耐用的凯夫拉纤维制成，并采用强化装甲板设"
"计；综合起来，它能够有效抵御小口径武器射击所造成的伤害。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 soldier greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 soldier greaves"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 士兵脛甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 soldier greaves"
msgid ""
"3D printed leg guards, sporting a professional finish and stellar ergonomics. "
" Layered UHMW thermoplastic plates and bullet-resistant aramid padding "
"combine to keep your lower leg bones protected and unbroken, even when "
"knee-deep in the dead."
msgstr ""
"一对3"
"D打印的护腿，由一个厚护膝和一对大块柔性聚合物装甲板组成，用来固定在小腿周围，以保护双腿的胫骨部位。多层超高分子量热塑性塑料板和防弹凯夫拉衬垫相结合，让你的"
"小腿骨不受损伤，即使身陷死人堆之中。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 prototype helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype helmets"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 实验头盔"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype helmet"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, made of thick polymer plates woven with "
"metallic fibers.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear that a lot of thought "
"has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to clip to some kind of "
"attachment point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3D打印的头部装甲，由厚厚的聚合材料板与金属纤维编织而成。尽管它看起来很粗糙，但很明显在人体工程学和重量上花了很多心思。它被设计成可以扣在某种连接点上，内侧"
"写着\"此面安装到模块化头盔\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic helmets"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 动能头盔"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic helmet"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, made of thick polymer plates woven with "
"metallic fibers.  This model is covered in countless rubber hexagons, and "
"offers superior protection against blunt trauma.  Designed to clip to some "
"kind of attachment point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3D打印的头部装甲，由厚厚的聚合材料板与金属纤维编织而成。这种型号覆盖有无数的橡胶六边形，对钝击提供了卓越防护。它被设计成可以扣在某种连接点上，内侧写着\""
"此面安装到模块化头盔\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 turnout helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout helmets"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防火头盔"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout helmet"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, made of thick polymer plates woven with "
"metallic fibers.  This version incorporates a tight fitting Nomex layer for "
"some protection against heat.  Designed to clip to some kind of attachment "
"point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3D打印的头部装甲，由厚厚的聚合材料板与金属纤维编织而成。这种型号在内测加入了一层紧贴的芳纶，以提供一些防热效果。它被设计成可以扣在某种连接点上，内侧写着\""
"此面安装到模块化头盔\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic helmets"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防弹头盔"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic helmet"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, made of thick polymer plates woven with "
"metallic fibers.  This one has extra Kevlar and steel layering, to provide "
"superior protection against small arms.  Designed to clip to some kind of "
"attachment point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3D打印的头部装甲，由厚厚的聚合材料板与金属纤维编织而成。这种型号有额外的凯夫拉和钢板层，以提供对小型枪械的卓越保护。它被设计成可以扣在某种连接点上，内侧写"
"着\"此面安装到模块化头盔\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 soldier helmet"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier helmets"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 士兵头盔"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier helmet"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, sporting a professional finish and stellar "
"ergonomics.  Composed of a dense metal shell sandwiched between layers of "
"composite-grade aramid fabric, it provides excellent protection, ensuring "
"you'll keep your head against whatever the Cataclysm throws at you.  Designed "
"to clip to some kind of attachment point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO "
"MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""
"3D打印的头部盔甲，拥有专业的外观和一流的人体工程学。它由一个致密金属外壳和多层复合凯夫拉纤维组成，提供了出色的保护，能让你的头部在大灾变中保持完好。它被设"
"计成可以扣在某种连接点上，内侧写着\"此面安装到模块化头盔\"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "knit cowl"
msgid_plural "knit cowls"
msgstr[0] "針織風帽"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "knit cowl"
msgid ""
"A snuggly woolen cowl.  It's one of those stylish and bulky cowls you see in "
"fashion magazines."
msgstr "一頂貼身的羊毛風帽。這是你在時尚雜誌上看到的那些時尚而笨重的風帽之一。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "headscarf"
msgid_plural "headscarfs"
msgstr[0] "頭巾"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "headscarf"
msgid "A loose cloth worn over the head and around the neck."
msgstr "一塊鬆散的布料戴在頭上或圍在脖子上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "keffiyeh"
msgid_plural "keffiyehs"
msgstr[0] "阿拉伯頭巾"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "keffiyeh"
msgid ""
"A type of headdress traditionally used in the Middle East.  It can be used in "
"different ways to protect the head and mouth from the elements."
msgstr "一種中東的傳統頭巾。它能以各種方式保護頭部與嘴巴免於環境危害。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "simple patchwork scarf"
