#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wimple"
msgid_plural "wimples"
msgstr[0] "修女頭巾"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "wimple"
msgid "A loose cloth headwrap and veil.  Typically worn by Christian nuns."
msgstr "松散的棉布頭巾和面紗。通常由基督教修女佩戴。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tallit gadol"
msgid_plural "tallit gadol"
msgstr[0] "塔利特大披肩"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "tallit gadol"
msgid ""
"A large prayer shawl worn by observant Jews during morning prayers and "
"certain other occasions."
msgstr "一种大型的祈祷披肩，是虔诚的犹太教徒在晨祷或其他某些场合穿戴的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nylon throat guard"
msgid_plural "nylon throat guards"
msgstr[0] "尼龙护颈"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon throat guard"
msgid ""
"A common nylon throat guard commonly used for neck protection when playing "
"sports."
msgstr "一种常见的尼龙护颈，通常用于在体育运动中保护颈部。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canvas throat guard"
msgid_plural "canvas throat guards"
msgstr[0] "帆布护颈"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "canvas throat guard"
msgid ""
"A common canvas throat guard commonly used for neck protection when playing "
"sports like hockey."
msgstr "一种常见的帆布护颈，通常用于在冰球（或曲棍球）这类体育运动中保护颈部。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic throat guard"
msgid_plural "plastic throat guards"
msgstr[0] "塑料护颈"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic throat guard"
msgid ""
"A rare variety of throat guard originally known as a gorget and used for neck "
"protection in HEMA.  It's made from thick rubber covered by nylon.  It offers "
"good protection for the throat, but it only covers a small portion of the "
"nape."
msgstr ""
"一种罕见的护喉护具，最初被称为“颈甲”，用于在欧洲历史武术 (HEMA) "
"中保护颈部。它由厚实的橡胶制成，覆盖尼龙外层。这款护具能为喉部提供良好保护，，不过脖子后面只能盖住一小块地方。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut-resistant throat guard"
msgid_plural "cut-resistant throat guards"
msgstr[0] "防割护颈"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant throat guard"
msgid ""
"A cut-resistant Kevlar throat guard, commonly used by welders, security "
"forces and in some sports."
msgstr "一种凯夫拉纤维制成的防割喉部护具，普遍为焊工、安防部队及一些体育运动所采用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mercenary throat guard"
msgid_plural "mercenary throat guards"
msgstr[0] "佣兵护颈"

#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
#. ~ Description of "mercenary throat guard"
msgid ""
"A ballistic collar modified to wear it as a standalone armor, carefully "
"combined with a regular nylon throat guard for extra protection."
msgstr "为颈部独立装备的防弹护颈，被细致的和常规尼龙面料紧密结合，以提供额外防护"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "axe ring holster"
msgid_plural "axe ring holsters"
msgstr[0] "斧頭套"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "axe ring holster"
msgid "A combination of leather and a metal ring to hold an axe on your waist."
msgstr "用皮革和一個金屬環把斧頭固定在你的腰上。"

