#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "axe ring holster"
msgid "Sheath axe"
msgstr "斧頭收鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "longsword scabbard"
msgid_plural "longsword scabbards"
msgstr[0] "長劍劍鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "longsword scabbard"
msgid ""
"A leather scabbard, big enough for anything up to a longsword, or even a bit "
"larger than that.  Designed to be worn at the waist, secured to the sturdy "
"leather belt.  Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr "一個皮革劍鞘，大小足夠容納一把長劍，或是比它稍大的武器。劍鞘穿在腰間，加以結實的皮帶繫穩。使用它來收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "longsword scabbard"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "back scabbard"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "scabbard"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "nylon scabbard"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "hollow cane"
msgid "Sheath sword"
msgstr "刀劍收鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "throwing knives leg sheath"
msgid_plural "throwing knives leg sheaths"
msgstr[0] "腿部飛刀鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "throwing knives leg sheath"
msgid ""
"A nylon strap knife sheath worn on the thigh, made to hold 6 very thin "
"knives, such as throwing knives, close at hand.  Activate to sheathe/draw a "
"weapon."
msgstr "一个能绑在大腿上的尼龙刀鞘，能装下6把小刀随手取用。通常用来存放飞刀。使用来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "throwing knives leg sheath"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "garter sheath"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "garter double sheath"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "ankle sheath"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "birchbark ankle sheath"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "sheath"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "birchbark sheath"
msgid "Sheath knife"
msgstr "刀子收鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "garter sheath"
msgid_plural "garter sheaths"
msgstr[0] "吊襪刀鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "garter sheath"
msgid ""
"A small concealed garter knife sheath worn on the thigh.  Commonly used by "
"assassins under a skirt or dress.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个隐蔽的小型吊袜刀鞘。通常被刺客穿在裙子或连衣裙下面。使用来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "garter double sheath"
msgid_plural "garter double sheaths"
msgstr[0] "雙開吊襪刀鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "garter double sheath"
msgid ""
"A small concealed garter double knife sheath worn on the thigh.  Commonly "
"used by overly cautious assassins under a skirt or dress.  Activate to "
"sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个隐蔽的小型双开吊袜刀鞘。通常被特别小心的刺客穿在裙子或连衣裙下面。使用来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ankle sheath"
msgid_plural "ankle sheaths"
msgstr[0] "腳踝式小刀鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "ankle sheath"
msgid ""
"A small concealed knife sheath worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use "
"without practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一個穿戴在腳踝上的隱蔽小刀鞘。沒有練習過就使用會略顯笨拙。使用以收 (或拔) 武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "birchbark ankle sheath"
msgid_plural "birchbark ankle sheathes"
msgstr[0] "桦皮刀鞘（脚）"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "birchbark ankle sheath"
msgid ""
"A handcrafted small concealed knife sheath worn on the ankle, made from birch "
"bark.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a "
"weapon."
msgstr "一个用桦树皮制成的穿在脚踝上的自制小型刀鞘。不经过练习用起来很笨拙。使用来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "back scabbard"
msgid_plural "back scabbards"
msgstr[0] "刀鞘 (掛背)"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "back scabbard"
msgid ""
"A leather scabbard, big enough for almost any sword.  Designed to be strapped "
"to the back, it's very difficult to draw from without considerable practice.  "
"Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr "一個皮革製刀鞘， 大小足夠收納多數的劍。設計用於綁在背部， 如果沒有反覆地練習， 很難拔劍出鞘。使用刀鞘來收納/拔出劍。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scabbard"
msgid_plural "scabbards"
msgstr[0] "刀鞘 (掛腰)"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "scabbard"
msgid ""
"A large, adjustable sheath for holding swords and other large blades.  "
"Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一個可調整的大型刀鞘， 可以放置刀劍或者其他大型武器。使用以收 (或拔) 武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nylon scabbard"
msgid_plural "nylon scabbards"
msgstr[0] "尼龍刀鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "nylon scabbard"
msgid ""
"A large, adjustable sheath for holding swords and other large blades, made "
"with nylon.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "可調整的大型刀鞘， 可以放置刀劍或者其他大型武器，由尼龍製成。啟動它來收起/拔出武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sheath"
msgid_plural "sheathes"
msgstr[0] "小刀鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "sheath"
msgid ""
"A leather sheath for holding knives and other small blades.  It is easy to "
"use without much practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一個可以用來放置小刀或者其他小型武器的皮革刀鞘。容易使用， 不需要太多練習。使用以收 (或拔) 武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "birchbark sheath"
msgid_plural "birchbark sheathes"
msgstr[0] "桦树皮刀鞘"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "birchbark sheath"
msgid ""
"A handcrafted sheath made from birch bark, for holding knives and other small "
"blades, with a strap attached.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一个用桦树皮制成的自制刀鞘，大小足够容纳匕首，或是类似的小型刀具，自带一条背带。使用来收拔武器。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spear strap"
msgid_plural "spear straps"
msgstr[0] "肩帶 (標槍)"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ Description of "spear strap"
msgid ""
"A leather strap tied around the torso for toting spears while keeping your "
"hands free.  You have to duck to get through doors while one's in it, though. "
" Activate to holster/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一條皮革帶系在軀幹上， 用於攜帶長矛， 同時讓你空出雙手。不過， 你必須避免進入門框。對它用使用指令來收納/抽出武器。 "

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "spear strap"
#, c-format
msgid "You holster your %s."
msgstr "你把你的 %s 收到槍套。"

#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "spear strap"
msgid "Holster spear"
msgstr "收納長矛"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "backpack"
msgid_plural "backpacks"
msgstr[0] "背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "backpack"
msgid "A small backpack.  Good storage for a little encumbrance."
msgstr "一個小背包， 有許多的儲物空間卻只會增加一點點累贅。"

