#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survivor dry bag"
msgid "Secured under compression straps or with a tool loop."
msgstr "捆在压缩带/工具扣环下"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hunting backpack"
msgid_plural "hunting backpacks"
msgstr[0] "狩猎背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "hunting backpack"
msgid ""
"A large hunting backpack with plenty of storage space and additional external "
"space possible for large camping items or game bags."
msgstr "一个大型狩猎背包，具有充足的存储空间和额外的外部空间，可以装大型露营物品或作为游戏包。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "hunting backpack"
msgid "The pack has been slid away from the frame leaving room to store large items."
msgstr "从背包主体额外展开的口袋，可以存很多东西，但很麻烦。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "giant novelty backpack"
msgid_plural "giant novelty backpacks"
msgstr[0] "巨大的新奇背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "giant novelty backpack"
msgid ""
"A huge fabric backpack made mostly as a joke before the Cataclysm.  Now, it's "
"still rather silly, but it can store a lot of stuff."
msgstr "在大災變之前，一個巨大的布料背包多被視為是個笑話。現在，它仍然相當愚蠢， 但它可以存儲很多東西。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather backpack"
msgid_plural "leather backpacks"
msgstr[0] "皮革背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "leather backpack"
msgid "A small leather backpack.  Good storage for a little encumbrance."
msgstr "一個小型皮革背包。不太累贅而且適合儲物。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "denim backpack"
msgid_plural "denim backpacks"
msgstr[0] "牛仔布背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "denim backpack"
msgid "A denim backpack.  Solid storage for few encumbrance.  The texture feels nice."
msgstr "牛仔布背包。以少量的累贅換得堅實的儲存空間。質感感覺不錯。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large tactical backpack"
msgid_plural "large tactical backpacks"
msgstr[0] "大型戰術背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "large tactical backpack"
msgid "A large tactical multi-compartment backpack that has great lower back support."
msgstr "這是一款軍事戰術用多隔層的大型背包，背部支撐力極佳。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high-volume rucksack"
msgid_plural "high-volume rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "高容量帆布背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "high-volume rucksack"
msgid ""
"Also known as a \"bigpack\", this rucksack is prized by pack rats but may "
"lead to a bad back."
msgstr "也被稱為“bigpack”，這個帆布背包很受垃圾收藏家所青睞，但它可能會傷害你的背椎。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bindle"
msgid_plural "bindles"
msgstr[0] "布袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "bindle"
msgid "You're ready for a trip down some train tracks.  Also known as a hobo stick."
msgstr "你準備好沿著鐵軌旅行了。這東西也被稱作流浪漢的鋪蓋卷。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "box backpack"
msgid_plural "box backpacks"
msgstr[0] "木箱背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "box backpack"
msgid "A makeshift backpack comprised of a wooden box and a pair of ropes."
msgstr "一個由木箱和繩子組成的粗製背包。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "briefcase"
msgid_plural "briefcases"
msgstr[0] "公事包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "briefcase"
msgid "Useful for carrying money, documents, or smuggled goods."
msgstr "用途是裝錢， 放文件， 或是走私物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "violin case"
msgid_plural "violin cases"
msgstr[0] "小提琴盒"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "violin case"
msgid ""
"Useful to carry your precious musical instrument around protected from any "
"harm."
msgstr "用於攜帶珍貴的樂器， 保護它免於傷害。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "daypack"
msgid_plural "daypacks"
msgstr[0] "單日健行背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "daypack"
msgid ""
"An ultralight nylon backpack intended for one-day hiking trips.  Waterproof, "
"slim, and spacious."
msgstr "這款超輕尼龍背包適合一日徒步旅行。防水，輕薄，容量大。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deployment bag"
msgid_plural "deployment bags"
msgstr[0] "整備袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "deployment bag"
msgid ""
"A durable nylon bag marketed towards military personnel.  It has clips on the "
"top and back, making it easy to attach a strap and wear it comfortably as a "
"fanny pack.  MOLLE webbing on the back lets you affix it to body armor or a "
"backpack."
msgstr "一个耐用尼龙小包，受众主要是军人。顶部和背面都有夹子，便于固定在带子上，可当作一个舒适的腰包穿戴。背面的MOLLE织带可以让你将其固定在防弹衣或背包上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
msgid "Center pocket."
msgstr "主口袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "deployment bag"
msgid "Side pocket."
msgstr "侧口袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dive bag"
msgid_plural "dive bags"
msgstr[0] "潛水袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "dive bag"
msgid "A lightweight mesh backpack, commonly worn by swimmers and divers."
msgstr "一個輕量的網狀背包， 常用於游泳者和潛水者。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dry bag"
msgid_plural "dry bags"
msgstr[0] "防水袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "dry bag"
msgid "A lightweight watertight backpack, commonly worn by swimmers and divers."
msgstr "一个轻便的防水背包，常常用于游泳或潜水运动。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "duffel bag"
msgid_plural "duffel bags"
msgstr[0] "行李袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "duffel bag"
msgid "A huge duffel bag.  Provides plenty of storage, but is severely encumbering."
msgstr "一個巨大的行李袋， 提供充足的儲物空間， 但造成嚴重的累贅。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_storage.json
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "duffel bag"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "dry duffel bag"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survivor duffel bag"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survivor dry duffel bag"
msgid "Tucked under the carry handles."
msgstr "夹在提把下"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dry duffel bag"
msgid_plural "dry duffel bags"
msgstr[0] "防水筒状行李袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "dry duffel bag"
msgid ""
"A huge watertight duffel bag.  Capable of floating.  Provides plenty of "
"storage, but is severely encumbering."
msgstr "一个很大的防水行李袋，放在水里都不会沉下去。提供大量的存储空间，但特别的累赘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical dump pouch"
msgid_plural "tactical dump pouches"
msgstr[0] "戰術儲存袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical dump pouch"
msgid ""
"An expandable pouch secured with straps.  Provides a bit of extra storage "
"with minimal encumbrance."
msgstr "加上背帶的可摺疊袋子。能夠多提供一點儲物空間， 只造成極小的累贅。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fanny pack"
msgid_plural "fanny packs"
msgstr[0] "腰包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "fanny pack"
msgid ""
"A small fabric bag worn on the waist, with the pouch in front for easy "
"access.  Once used as a visual shorthand for unstylish geeks and silly "
"tourists, it was making a decent comeback before the apocalypse."
msgstr "一个穿在腰上的小布袋，正前方有个便于取用的小口袋。它曾被当作没品位极客和愚蠢游客的视觉标志，但在世界末日到来之前，就已经某种程度上重新流行起来。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "golf bag"
msgid_plural "golf bags"
msgstr[0] "高爾夫球袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "golf bag"
msgid ""
"A tall canvas and plastic bag with fold-out legs used for golfing.  It even "
"has straps to be worn on the back and a slot for an umbrella."
msgstr "一个细长的带有可折叠支架的高尔夫球背包，采用帆布和塑料制成。它甚至还配有一条背带和雨伞挂钩。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "golf bag"
#, c-format
msgid "You awkwardly sheath your %s"
msgstr "你笨拙地將你的 %s 收鞘。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "golf bag"
msgid "Sheath golf club"
msgstr "收納高爾夫球桿"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hide bag"
msgid_plural "hide bags"
msgstr[0] "皮革袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "hide bag"
msgid ""
"The raw skin of an animal, quickly turned into a makeshift bag for storage.  "
"It will still rot, and needs to be cured and tanned."
msgstr "用動物的生皮革快速製作成的臨時儲物袋。它仍會腐敗， 需要進一步加工和鞣製。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted hide bag"
msgid_plural "tainted hide bags"
msgstr[0] "汙染皮革袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted hide bag"
msgid ""
"The raw skin of a monster, quickly turned into a makeshift bag for storage.  "
"It will still rot, and needs to be cured and tanned."
msgstr "用怪物的生皮革快速製作成的臨時儲物袋。它仍會腐敗， 需要進一步加工和鞣製。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "H&K operational briefcase (empty)"
msgid_plural "H&K operational briefcases (empty)"
msgstr[0] "H&K 特務公事包（空的）"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "H&K operational briefcase (empty)"
msgid ""
"This is a plain, hard-sided black briefcase with a trigger in the handle and "
"a concealed hole in the side.  Squeezing the trigger would currently do "
"nothing, as it is empty.  Don't forget to put a suitable MP5 back inside "
"before you try to pay any ransom fees with lead."
msgstr "這是個平白無奇的硬邊黑色公事包，在手把裡有個機關而且側邊有個隱藏的孔。按下機關目前不會有任何反應，因為它是空的。別忘了在你想餵人吃慶記前放把 MP5。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jerrypack"
msgid_plural "jerrypacks"
msgstr[0] "油桶背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "jerrypack"
msgid "A jerrycan modified to be worn in a similar manner to a backpack."
msgstr "一個改裝過的油桶， 可以像背包一樣穿在身上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather pouch"
msgid_plural "leather pouches"
msgstr[0] "皮革袋子"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "leather pouch"
msgid ""
"A bag stitched together from leather scraps.  Doesn't hold an awful lot but "
"is easy to wear."
msgstr "由許多皮革縫製成的袋子。雖然裝的不多， 但是很好攜帶。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "drop leg pouch"
msgid_plural "drop leg pouches"
msgstr[0] "绑腿袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "drop leg pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch that can be worn on the thighs using buckled straps.  This variety is "
"favored by the military."
msgstr "一个用扣带绑在大腿上的战术口袋，深受军队人员喜爱。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of diving pouches"
msgid_plural "pairs of diving pouches"
msgstr[0] "潛水袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of diving pouches"
msgid ""
"A set of pouches that can be worn on the thighs using buckled neoprene rig.  "
"This variety is favored by the divers."
msgstr "一对用氯丁橡胶腿环固定在大腿上的口袋，深受潜水者的喜爱。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
msgid "drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "腿包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "drop leg bag"
msgid ""
"A bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled "
"straps.  Provides some extra storage for outdoor activities."
msgstr "一个可以绑在大腿和臀部上的绑腿包，有着可调节的扣带。为户外运动提供一些额外的存储空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of variant "drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
msgid ""
"A black bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled "
"straps.  Commonly used by motorcycle riders."
msgstr "一個附有可調式扣帶的黑色包，可以穿掛在大腿和臀部。機車騎士很常使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of variant "drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
msgid ""
"A khaki bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled "
"straps.  Works nicely with a pair of khaki pants."
msgstr "一个可以绑在大腿和臀部上的卡其色绑腿包，有着可调节的扣带。和卡其色的裤子很配。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of variant "drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
msgid ""
"A purple bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable buckled "
"straps.  Perfect for the ladies that want a cooler way of carrying their "
"personal items."
msgstr "一个可以绑在大腿和臀部上的紫色绑腿包，有着可调节的扣带。非常适合那些想以更酷的方式携带个人物品的女士。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
msgid "camo drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "camo drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "迷彩腿包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of variant "camo drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
msgid ""
"A green bag with camouflage print that can be worn on the thighs and hips "
"using adjustable buckled straps.  For those that have a military heart."
msgstr "一个可以绑在大腿和臀部上的军绿色迷彩绑腿包，有着可调节的扣带。适合那些心怀军旅梦的人。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
msgid "steampunk drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "steampunk drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "蒸氣龐克腿包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of variant "steampunk drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
msgid ""
"A black and dark gold bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using "
"adjustable buckled straps, with a steampunk design and chains all over it.  "
"Perfect for a wide variety of costumes."
msgstr "一个可以绑在大腿和臀部上的黑色和深金色绑腿包，有着可调节的扣带。采用蒸汽朋克设计，周围许多铁链装饰。适合搭配各类COS服装。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
msgid "skull drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "skull drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "骷髏頭腿包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of variant "skull drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
msgid ""
"A jet-black bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable "
"buckled straps, with skulls and spikes all over it.  Perfect for a rider of "
"the apocalypse."
msgstr "一个可以绑在大腿和臀部上的深黑色绑腿包，有着可调节的扣带，四周点缀着骷髅和尖刺装饰。非常适合末日之后的骑手们。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
msgid "founders' leg bag"
msgid_plural "founders' leg bags"
msgstr[0] "創始者腿包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of variant "founders' leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
msgid ""
"A garishly colored red, white, and blue bag that can be worn on the thighs "
"and hips using adjustable buckled straps, with the stylized depiction of "
"George Washington's face gazing sternly from the side.  Perfect for carrying "
"the dreams of the founding fathers wherever you go."
msgstr ""
"一款顏色艷麗，有紅、白、藍三色的小袋子，附有可調式扣帶，能掛在腰腿上，上面裝飾著喬治華盛頓從側面嚴肅凝視的臉部圖案。無論你走到哪裡，都非常適合承載開國元勳的"
"夢想。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small leg purse"
msgid_plural "small leg purses"
msgstr[0] "綁腿錢包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "small leg purse"
msgid ""
"A small purse that can be worn on the upper leg using buckled straps, easier "
"to use than on the arm.  For those who want to wear a dress without pockets "
"while carrying their phone and money.  Use it to adjust it to fit your arm."
msgstr "一个小钱包，可以用扣带绑在大腿上，比绑在手臂上时更容易使用。适合那些想穿着没有口袋的连衣裙，但又需要携带手机和零钱的人。使用它将其调成能绑在手臂上的大小。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "small leg purse"
msgid "Adjust on the arm"
msgstr "调成绑臂"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "small leg purse"
#, c-format
msgid "You adjust your %s to wear it on your arm."
msgstr "你把 %s 调成绑在手臂上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armband pouch"
msgid_plural "armband pouches"
msgstr[0] "臂袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "armband pouch"
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be worn on the upper arm using buckled straps.  This "
"is a favored item among sports & camping enthusiasts.  Use it to adjust it to "
"fit your leg."
msgstr "一个可以用系带扣在上臂的小袋子。这是一件深受运动和野营爱好者喜爱的装备。使用它将其调成能绑在大腿上的大小。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "armband pouch"
msgid "Adjust on the leg"
msgstr "调成绑腿"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "armband pouch"
#, c-format
msgid "You adjust your %s to wear it on your leg."
msgstr "你把 %s 调成绑在大腿上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ankle wallet pouch"
msgid_plural "ankle wallet pouches"
msgstr[0] "腳踝式錢包袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "ankle wallet pouch"
msgid ""
"A small concealed wallet pouch worn on the ankle.  If you strap it under your "
"clothes, it can help you keep your wallet hidden and safe."
msgstr "一个能够绑在脚踝上的隐蔽小钱包。如果你把它穿在其他衣物下方，它能把你的钱藏好不被发现。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift knapsack"
msgid_plural "makeshift knapsacks"
msgstr[0] "粗製背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift knapsack"
msgid ""
"A pair of pants with the bottom ends tied with string, and then passed "
"through the belt loops so the knapsack can be carried on the back."
msgstr "一條底部被繩索綁起來的褲子， 繩索接著穿過腰帶圈， 使得整個包能夠背在背上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift sling"
msgid_plural "makeshift slings"
msgstr[0] "粗製斜肩袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift sling"
msgid "A large sheet tied into a crude, over-the-shoulder sling."
msgstr "用一大塊布罩繞過肩膀綁成的粗糙的斜肩袋。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "messenger bag"
msgid_plural "messenger bags"
msgstr[0] "郵差包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "messenger bag"
msgid "Light and easy to wear, but doesn't offer much storage."
msgstr "輕便好背的包包， 但是沒有多少儲物空間。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "messenger bag"
msgid "You slide the bag to your side."
msgstr "你把包移到身边。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "messenger bag"
msgid "You move the bag to your back."
msgstr "你把包移到背上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "MOLLE assault pack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE assault packs"
msgstr[0] "MOLLE 突擊背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "MOLLE assault pack"
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"backpack.  Covered with pockets and straps, it strikes a fine balance between "
"storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets to the outside "
"rigging."
msgstr ""
"一件新一代模塊化的改進型軍用背包，相比普通背包它更加輕便舒適，且提供更可觀的存儲空間，取得了存儲空間與累贅度之間的完美平衡。可以將附件口袋安裝在外部攜行具上"
"。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "MOLLE medium rucksack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE medium rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "MOLLE 中型背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "MOLLE medium rucksack"
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"medium rucksack.  Covered with straps for modularity, it strikes a fine "
"balance between storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets "
"to the outside rigging."
msgstr ""
"一件新一代模塊化的改進型軍用中型背包，相比普通背包它更加輕便舒適，且提供更可觀的存儲空間，取得了存儲空間與累贅度之間的完美平衡。可以將附件口袋安裝在外部攜行"
"具上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "MOLLE large rucksack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE large rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "MOLLE 大型背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "MOLLE large rucksack"
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military large "
"rucksack.  Covered with straps for modularity, it strikes a fine balance "
"between storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets to the "
"outside rigging."
msgstr ""
"一件新一代模塊化的改進型軍用大型背包，相比普通背包它更加輕便舒適，且提供更可觀的存儲空間，取得了存儲空間與累贅度之間的完美平衡。可以將附件口袋安裝在外部攜行"
"具上。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "net backpack"
msgid_plural "net backpacks"
msgstr[0] "網子背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "net backpack"
msgid ""
"A bag woven together from strings, with straps to wear it on back.  Lighter "
"than a standard backpack, but more awkward to carry when loaded and unable to "
"hold small or heavy items."
msgstr "一个用绳子编织成的包，有条能让你背在身上的带子。比标准背包轻，但在装满时更显累赘，而且无法携带过小或过重的物品。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "petpack"
msgid_plural "petpacks"
msgstr[0] "寵物袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "petpack"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm this would allow your four-legged friend to see the "
"world, now it's used to shield them from the world."
msgstr "在大災變之前，這是讓你四條腿的朋友出門親近這世界的用具，現在它被用來保護牠們遠離這世界。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic shopping bag"
msgid_plural "plastic shopping bags"
msgstr[0] "塑膠購物袋"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic shopping bag"
msgid "A bag used to carry groceries home."
msgstr "一個便於攜帶雜貨的袋子。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "purse"
msgid_plural "purses"
msgstr[0] "皮包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "purse"
msgid ""
"A fancy leather purse from a well-known designer.  A bit cumbersome to wear, "
"but provides some storage."
msgstr "一位著名设计师设计的精美皮包。穿戴略显累赘，但能提供一些存储空间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pouch"
msgid_plural "pouches"
msgstr[0] "小袋子"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "pouch"
msgid ""
"A makeshift bag, cobbled together from rags.  Really gets in the way, but "
"provides a decent amount of storage."
msgstr "一個用布條縫製成的臨時袋子。很陽春， 但是提供了一定的儲物空間。"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military rucksack"
msgid_plural "military rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "軍用背包"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
