msgid_plural "tempered steel chainmail hauberks"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲長衣（回火鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "mild steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "无袖连体锁环衣（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "medium steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "无袖连体锁环衣（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "high steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "无袖连体锁环衣（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "hardened steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "无袖连体锁环衣（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "tempered steel chainmail sleeveless jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "无袖连体锁环衣（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "chainmail jumpsuit"
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  Combine "
"with a gambeson or other padded layer for optimal protection."
msgstr "一件自制的锁环服，没有覆盖头部，衣服下摆也只延伸到大腿中段。与软铠或其他内衬一同穿着时能提供更好的保护效果。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel chainmail jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "mild steel chainmail jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "锁环连体衣（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel chainmail jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "medium steel chainmail jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "锁环连体衣（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel chainmail jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "high steel chainmail jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "锁环连体衣（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel chainmail jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "hardened steel chainmail jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "锁环连体衣（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel chainmail jumpsuit"
msgid_plural "tempered steel chainmail jumpsuits"
msgstr[0] "锁环连体衣（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "chainmail armor"
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail suit.  Combine with a gambeson or other padded "
"layer for optimal protection."
msgstr "一套自制的完整链甲套装。与软铠或其他内衬一同穿着，能够提供最佳保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲套裝"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "chainmail armor"
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail suit.  The metal shows signs of rust and "
"corrosion.  Combine with a gambeson or other padded layer for optimal "
"protection."
msgstr "一套自制的锁环甲套装，金属有生锈和腐蚀的迹象。与软铠或其他内衬一同穿着时能提供更好的保护效果。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "mild steel chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "锁环甲（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "medium steel chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲套裝（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "high steel chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲套裝（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "hardened steel chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲套裝（硬化鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "tempered steel chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲套裝（回火鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "faraday chainmail suit"
msgid_plural "faraday chainmail suits"
msgstr[0] "絕緣鏈甲裝"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "faraday chainmail suit"
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail suit that can be worn over your normal clothing. "
" The suit is conductively interconnected with a cage covering the face, "
"protecting against electricity."
msgstr "一套自制的锁环甲套装，可以穿在你正常的衣服上。衣服内各个部件是导电连接，形成了一个法拉第笼，能有效防护电击。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cleansuit"
msgid_plural "cleansuits"
msgstr[0] "無塵衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "cleansuit"
msgid ""
"A simple hazardous materials handling suit.  Though somewhat restrictive and "
"fragile, wearing it will provide excellent protection against ambient "
"radiation."
msgstr "一套簡單的危險物質處理套裝。雖然有點拘束並且脆弱，但是能提供絕佳的防護能力以抵禦環境輻射。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "entry suit"
msgid_plural "entry suits"
msgstr[0] "避火衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "entry suit"
msgid ""
"A flame-resistant whole-body garment worn by firefighters as protection "
"against extreme heat.  It requires a separate gas mask for full protection "
"against smoke."
msgstr "一件消防员经常穿的重型防护服，能防护高温和火焰。需要额外配套的防化面具才能完全防护烟雾。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canine bite suit"
msgid_plural "canine bite suits"
msgstr[0] "犬咬防护服"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "canine bite suit"
msgid ""
"Designed to stop the injuries of dog bites, this thick, one piece suit is "
"often used in the rehabilitation of abused animals and in training dogs by "
"the police and military.  A base layer of aramid fabric has had strips of "
"soft body armor sewn into it to mimic quilting, and to soften the blunt of "
"animals jumping, slashing, or pouncing on the wearer."
msgstr "设计来防止犬类咬伤的的厚实一体式防护服，常用于警察或军队收容受虐动物或训练犬只。基层是凯夫拉材质，上面层叠缝有防护甲条从而卸掉动物飞扑、猛抓或撞击时的力道。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hazmat suit"
msgid_plural "hazmat suits"
msgstr[0] "防護衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "hazmat suit"
msgid ""
"An impermeable whole-body garment worn as protection against hazardous "
"materials.  Restrictive and fragile, wearing it will provide complete "
"protection against ambient radiation.  It requires a separate gas mask for "
"full protection."
msgstr "一套不透气的、十分累赘而且容易损坏的危险物处理全身防护服。穿上它能够完全防护环境中的辐射。只需要再戴一个防毒面具就能够给你全方位的防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flame-resistant suit"
msgid_plural "flame-resistant suits"
msgstr[0] "抗火衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant suit"
msgid ""
"A snug body suit made from thin and lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric.  "
"Tough yet breathable, it is light and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr "一套緊密貼身的全身套裝，由輕量的諾梅克斯阻燃纖維製成。強韌而透氣，穿在其他衣物之下仍然輕巧且舒適。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 environmental suit"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 environmental suits"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防護衣"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 environmental suit"
msgid ""
"A lightweight environmental suit incorporating Kevlar-lined boots and gloves, "
"worn by Hub personnel in their rare forays aboveground.  Colored brown and "
"blue, the white seal of Hub 01 is embroidered on both of its upper arms.  It "
"requires a separate gas mask for full protection."
msgstr ""
"一套轻便的环境防护服，包括凯夫拉内衬的靴子和手套，仅供 Hub 01 工作人员在执行少有的地面任务时穿着。主色调是棕色和蓝色，两侧上臂印着带有 Hub "
"01 白色标志的臂章。只需要再戴一个防毒面具就能够给你全方位的防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 environmental suit"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "activity suit"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "soft hazard suit"
msgid "Wear casually"
msgstr "松开"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 environmental suit"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "activity suit"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "soft hazard suit"
msgid "You slip out of the top of the suit and tie the sleeves around your waist."
msgstr "你脱下上衣，把袖子系在腰间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 environmental suit (casual)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 environmental suits (casual)"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 防護衣（僅下身）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 environmental suit (casual)"
msgid ""
"A lightweight environmental suit incorporating Kevlar-lined boots, worn by "
"Hub personnel in their rare forays aboveground.  Colored brown and blue, the "
"upper portion has been tied around the waist casually."
msgstr ""
"一套轻便的环境防护服，包括凯夫拉内衬的靴子和手套，仅供 Hub 01 工作人员在执行少有的地面任务时穿着。主色调是棕色和蓝色，两侧上臂印着带有 Hub "
"01 白色标志的臂章。上半部分被随意地系在腰间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 environmental suit (casual)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "activity suit (casual)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "soft hazard suit (casual)"
msgid "Wear normally"
msgstr "穿好"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 environmental suit (casual)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "activity suit (casual)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "soft hazard suit (casual)"
msgid "You untie the sleeves and put back on the top of the suit."
msgstr "你解开袖子，重新穿好衣服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "activity suit"
msgid_plural "activity suits"
msgstr[0] "Xedra防護服"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "activity suit"
msgid ""
"A single-piece brown and orange environmental suit, tailored in a way that "
"slightly recalls a military flight suit.  The letters \"X.E.D.R.A\" are "
"inscribed on its back, and a white shoulder patch on the right arm shows an "
"arrow reaching within rings of concentric circles.  It requires a separate "
"gas mask for full protection."
msgstr ""
"一件棕色和橙色的环境防护服，其剪裁方式略微让人想起军用飞行服。背部刻有\"X.E.D.R.A\""
"字样，右臂上的白色肩章显示一个箭头伸向同心圆环内。只需要再戴一个防毒面具就能够给你全方位的防护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "activity suit (casual)"
msgid_plural "activity suits (casual)"
msgstr[0] "Xedra防護服（僅下身）"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "activity suit (casual)"
msgid ""
"A single-piece brown and orange environmental suit, tailored in a way that "
"slightly recalls a military flight suit.  The upper portion has been tied "
"around the waist casually."
msgstr ""
"一件棕色和橙色的环境防护服，裁剪样式让人想起一件军用飞行服。它的背面印着\"X.E.D.R.A\""
"的字母，右臂上的白色肩章画着一个箭头射进一环套一环的同心圆内。上半部分被随意地系在腰间。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "suit"
msgid_plural "suits"
msgstr[0] "西裝"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "suit"
msgid "A full-body cotton suit.  Makes the apocalypse a truly gentlemanly experience."
msgstr "一套棉製的西裝， 末日之時也要來點紳士氣息。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "track touring suit"
msgid_plural "track touring suits"
msgstr[0] "賽車騎士套裝"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "track touring suit"
msgid ""
"A leather bodysuit with padding in high-impact areas, meant for motorcyclists "
"out on the track.  The leather is stiff but makes the armor much sturdier and "
"more protective than lighter counterparts."
msgstr "皮革連身衣，在高衝擊處配有襯墊，專為賽道上的機車騎士設計。皮革非常僵硬，但也使它比輕質盔甲更堅固，更具保護性。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dress uniform"
msgid_plural "dress uniforms"
msgstr[0] "軍禮服"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "dress uniform"
msgid ""
"A military officer's dress uniform from before the Cataclysm, complete with "
"rank and ribbons.  Just looking at it gives you an air of authority.  Perhaps "
"not the most practical military wear, but a very stylish option."
msgstr "大灾变前的军官制式礼服，配有军衔和缎带。只要看看它，你就会有一种权威感。也许不是最实用的军装，但却是非常时尚的选择。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military flight suit"
msgid_plural "military flight suits"
msgstr[0] "軍用飛行服"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "military flight suit"
msgid ""
"A sage-green US military flight suit.  It has various insignia embroidered "
"onto it."
msgstr "一件深绿色的美军飞行服。上面绣着各种徽章。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nomad plate armor"
msgid_plural "nomad plate armors"
msgstr[0] "遊牧民族板甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "nomad plate armor"
msgid ""
"A full body multilayered suit of plate armor with a 4 mm thick chest piece.  "
"The medium steel has been quenched, tempered and affixed over a full-body "
"layered suit of weight-distributing straps.  The armor has an integrated "
"breathable Lycra jumpsuit and the torso has a spall liner of aramid panels.  "
"Electronics run below the surface and circulate cool air to the skin, drawing "
"power from your internal CBM reservoir."
msgstr ""
"一件胸甲厚4"
"毫米的板甲套装。中碳钢经过淬火和回火处理，并安在全身多层配重系带上。盔甲内有一件一体式透气氨纶连体衣，躯干处有一层由凯夫拉纤维板制成的防弹内衬。盔甲下有电子"
"设备运行，使用你自身的生化能量将冷气带到体表。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad plate armor"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad light plate armor"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad heavy plate armor"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad chainmail"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "advanced nomad jumpsuit"
msgid "You turn the climate control on."
msgstr "你打開了恆溫裝置。"

#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_storage.json
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "nomad plate armor"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "nomad light plate armor"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "nomad heavy plate armor"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "nomad chainmail"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "advanced nomad jumpsuit"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "nomad harness"
msgid "Your internal reservoir is empty."
msgstr "你的內部水庫是空的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nomad plate armor (on)"
msgid_plural "nomad plate armors (on)"
msgstr[0] "遊牧民族板甲（開）"

#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad plate armor (on)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad light plate armor (on)"
