msgid_plural "ichcahuipillis"
msgstr[0] "纳瓦特尔布甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ichcahuipilli"
msgid ""
"A Mesoamerican armor of Nahuatl origin, somewhat similar to a European "
"gambeson.  It is made of unspun cotton between two layers of quilted cotton "
"crystalized by brine, edged with leather around its holes.  It is extremely "
"thick and offers superb protection, but is also heavy.  This bad boy once "
"stopped Spanish bullets and Aztec missiles alike, now its time has come to "
"stop zombie bites."
msgstr ""
"源自中美洲纳瓦特尔人的盔甲，类似欧洲的软铠。纳瓦特尔布甲由两层由盐水硬化的未纺棉花制成的，甲上有孔，孔边镶有皮革。这种布甲很厚，保护性能优秀，但重量拖了后腿"
"。这种布甲曾经挡下西班牙的子弹和阿兹特克的投石，现在我们的好小子该挡僵尸了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lorica segmentata"
msgid_plural "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[0] "環片甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "lorica segmentata"
msgid ""
"An ancient Roman laminar armor, made of overlapping metal strips connected to "
"internal leather straps."
msgstr "一件古羅馬鎧甲， 以重疊的金屬片條構成， 金屬片之間以皮帶繫穩。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cataphract armor"
msgid_plural "suits of cataphract armor"
msgstr[0] "甲胃護胸"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "cataphract armor"
msgid ""
"This armor, made of interlocking plates of burnished bronze, appears to be "
"either a high-quality recreation or a genuine artifact.  Despite having an "
"ancient design, it is in mint condition aside from some battle damage.  It "
"covers from the shoulders to the hips and is of extremely high quality."
msgstr ""
"这件青铜甲胄由相互连接的抛光青铜板制成，看起来要么是高质量的现代重制品，要么是真正的古代遗物。尽管样式十分古老，除了表面的一些战斗损伤，它仍旧完好无缺。它覆"
"盖的部位从头部到腰部，品质极高。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "鐵板胸甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"Two sheets of metal hammered to fit your torso and riveted to leather belts "
"to act as straps.  Heavy, uncomfortable, and difficult to move in, but it "
"should help keep your blood inside your body."
msgstr "两块金属板，经过敲打以贴合你的躯干，并铆接在皮带上作为肩带。沉重、不舒服且很难穿上，但它应该有助于保持你的血还在你的身体里。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "hardened sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "钢板胸甲（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"A chest guard made of hammered sheet metal, hardened for added protection.  "
"It's not any easier to move in, but it is much sturdier now."
msgstr "由金属板捶打出来的胸甲，经过硬化处理提升防护能力。穿上这东西本来就不容易，但起码这个在变得更坚固的同时没有变得更难穿。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "heavy sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "重型鐵板胸甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"A double-decker chest guard made from two sheets of metal layered over each "
"other and hammered to fit your torso.  Monstrously heavy, but it's quite "
"protective and the thicker material makes it sturdier."
msgstr "双层厚的钢板胸甲，由两层金属板叠在一起，并照着躯干形状捶打制成。非常重，但防护能力也很棒，更厚的材料使它更加坚固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened heavy sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "hardened heavy sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "重型钢板胸甲（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened heavy sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"Double-thick, hardened sheet metal hammered to fit your torso.  Offers the "
"best protection a junkyard knight could ask for."
msgstr "双层金属板锤打而成，并经过硬化处理的胸甲。对于垃圾场骑士而言，这件装备的防护能力已经是顶级的了。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "light sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "light sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "輕型鐵板胸甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "light sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"One sheet of metal, cut in half to only cover your upper torso and back and "
"riveted to leather belts to act as straps.  It's heavy and uncomfortable, but "
"at least you can bend at the waist."
msgstr "一块金属板，切成两半，只覆盖你的上半身和背部，并铆接到皮带上作为肩带。很重，很不舒服，但至少穿着时可以弯腰。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened light sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "hardened light sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "轻型钢板胸甲（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened light sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"Sheet metal cut to only cover your upper torso and hardened for extra "
"protection.  Provides a decent compromise between protection and being able "
"to move."
msgstr "由金属板捶打而成的胸甲，仅覆盖上半躯干，经过硬化处理以提供额外保护。在防护和移动能力之间提供了一个不错的折中方案。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bookplate"
msgid_plural "bookplates"
msgstr[0] "書甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bookplate"
msgid "A crude form of armor made from thickly-stacked paper and rolls of duct tape."
msgstr "一件由一叠叠厚纸和胶带制成的简易护甲。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tireplate"
msgid_plural "tireplates"
msgstr[0] "簡易輪胎胸甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tireplate"
msgid ""
"Armor fashioned from overlapping chunks of tire and rolls of duct tape, "
"covering the shoulders and torso."
msgstr "一套将许多块轮胎片叠在一起，然后用强力胶带粘牢的胸甲，覆盖了双肩和躯干。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "base chainmail vest"
msgid ""
"A customized mild steel chainmail vest.  It's a sleeveless piece of chainmail "
"with small straps designed to better distribute the weight."
msgstr "一件自制的低碳钢锁环胸甲，这件无袖胸甲由多条带子连结，均匀地分散装甲的重量。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chainmail vest"
msgid_plural "chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "chainmail vest"
msgid ""
"A customized chainmail vest.  The metal shows signs of rust and corrosion.  "
"It's a sleeveless piece of chainmail with small straps designed to better "
"distribute the weight."
msgstr "一件自制锁环胸甲，金属有生锈和腐蚀的迹象。这件无袖胸甲由多条带子连结，均匀地分散装甲的重量。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel chainmail vest"
msgid_plural "mild steel chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲背心（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel chainmail vest"
msgid_plural "medium steel chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲背心（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel chainmail vest"
msgid_plural "high steel chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲背心（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel chainmail vest"
msgid_plural "hardened steel chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲背心（硬化鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel chainmail vest"
msgid_plural "tempered steel chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "鏈甲背心（回火鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cloth-padded shirt"
msgid_plural "cloth-padded shirts"
msgstr[0] "墊布衫"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "cloth-padded shirt"
msgid ""
"A thick cotton sweatshirt that an amateur tailor sewed ever-increasing "
"amounts of cloth onto, providing noticeable, if haphazard padding."
msgstr "一件厚厚的棉质运动衫，由某个业余裁缝在上面缝制了一大堆布料。很随意，但是十分引人注目，也有一些防护效果。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cloth-padded sleeveless shirt"
msgid_plural "cloth-padded sleeveless shirts"
msgstr[0] "墊布無袖衫"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "cloth-padded sleeveless shirt"
msgid ""
"A thick cotton shirt with the sleeves cut off and large amounts of cloth sewn "
"in to make a padded vest.  It would be fashionable, if not for all the "
"disparate colors from the patchwork cotton cannibalized from other random "
"clothes."
msgstr ""
"一件厚厚的棉质衬衫，袖子被剪掉，大量的布料被缝在里面，最终变成了一件超级厚的背心。如果不是因为各种从其它衣服上裁下来的花花绿绿布料混合起来太辣眼睛，这一定能"
"引领新的时尚潮流。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hard chest guard"
msgid_plural "hard chest guards"
msgstr[0] "硬質護胸"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hard chest guard"
msgid "A solid vest of plastic padding protecting your torso."
msgstr "一件结实的塑料内衬的护胸，用来保护你的躯干。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cuirass"
msgid_plural "cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "胸甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "cuirass"
msgid ""
"A steel breastplate, and a vital part of plate armor.  Even as full armor "
"went into decline, cuirasses remained in use among cavalry in Europe."
msgstr "一副鐵製胸甲， 是板甲的重要部分。即使全身鎧甲走向沒落， 胸甲仍然在歐洲的騎兵隊中被使用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap cuirass"
msgid_plural "scrap cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "廢金屬胸甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap cuirass"
msgid "A cuirass made from scraps of metal secured by simple strings."
msgstr "一件用金属碎片做成的护甲，碎片之间用小绳子固定。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tire cuirass"
msgid_plural "tire cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "輪胎胸甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tire cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made from thick chunks of tire secured by simple strings; the loose "
"collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the most convenient "
"protection."
msgstr "一套用厚橡胶块做成的胸甲，碎片之间用小绳子固定。这些松垮的小片片能提供不错的防护，但是还不够完美。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fencing jacket"
msgid_plural "fencing jackets"
msgstr[0] "擊劍外套"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "fencing jacket"
msgid ""
"A padded jacket with a zipper on the back, used by fencers to prevent "
"accidents."
msgstr "一件拉链在背后、防止击剑时发生意外的厚夹克。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armored motorcycle jacket"
msgid_plural "armored motorcycle jackets"
msgstr[0] "裝甲機車夾克"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "armored motorcycle jacket"
msgid ""
"A thick motorcycle jacket with metal plates drilled onto various areas for "
"increased protection."
msgstr "厚厚的機車夾克，各處都鑲有金屬板，以增強防護力。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armored jean jacket"
msgid_plural "armored jean jackets"
msgstr[0] "盔甲牛仔夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "armored jean jacket"
msgid ""
"A denim jacket reinforced with metal plates.  Adequately protective, but not "
"very sturdy."
msgstr "用金屬板加固的牛仔布夾克。防護性還行，但不是很堅固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armored jean vest"
msgid_plural "armored jean vests"
msgstr[0] "装甲牛仔背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "armored jean vest"
msgid ""
"A denim vest reinforced with metal plates.  Adequately protective, but not "
"very sturdy."
msgstr "用金屬板加固的牛仔布背心。防護性還行，但不是很堅固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened armored motorcycle jacket"
msgid_plural "hardened armored motorcycle jackets"
msgstr[0] "硬化裝甲機車夾克"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened armored motorcycle jacket"
msgid ""
"A thick motorcycle jacket with hardened metal plates drilled onto various "
"areas for highly increased protection."
msgstr "厚厚的機車夾克，各處都鑲有硬化金屬板，大幅增強了防護力。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened armored jean jacket"
msgid_plural "hardened armored jean jackets"
msgstr[0] "硬化装甲牛仔夹克"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened armored jean jacket"
msgid ""
"A denim jacket reinforced with hardened steel plates.  Highly protective, but "
"not very sturdy."
msgstr "用硬化鋼板加固的牛仔布夾克。防護能力很高，但不是很堅固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened armored jean vest"
msgid_plural "hardened armored jean vests"
msgstr[0] "硬化装甲牛仔背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened armored jean vest"
msgid ""
"A denim vest reinforced with hardened steel plates.  Highly protective, but "
"not very sturdy."
msgstr "用硬化鋼板加固的牛仔布背心。防護能力很高，但不是很堅固。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "occult bone armor"
msgid_plural "occult bone armors"
msgstr[0] "邪異骨甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "occult bone armor"
msgid ""
"A black jacket made from thick leather and covered with intricately carved "
"bones.  You've never seen patterns like those before, each time you look at "
"them you spot a new one as if they were changing on their own."
msgstr "一件由厚皮制成的黑色夹克，上面布满了雕刻复杂的骨头。你以前从来没有见过上面这种花纹，每当你再次细细查看，你就会发现一个新的花纹，好像它们会自己改变一样。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tire motorcycle jacket"
msgid_plural "tire motorcycle jacket"
msgstr[0] "胎皮機車夾克"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tire motorcycle jacket"
msgid ""
"A motorcycle jacket reinforced with chunks of thick rubber tire.  Thick and "
"highly resistant to blunt force."
msgstr "用大塊厚橡膠輪胎胎皮加固的機車夾克。非常厚，對鈍擊有很好的防護能力。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lamé (foil)"
msgid_plural "lamés (foil)"
msgstr[0] "電子擊劍服（鈍劍）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "lamé (foil)"
msgid ""
"A thin, lightweight conductive vest with the zipper on the back used by "
"fencers for electronic scoring.  Its outer layer is a woven mix of sturdy "
"cotton and stainless steel strands."
msgstr "一見輕薄的導電背心，背後有拉鍊供擊劍運動員使用，被用來在擊劍中電子計分。它的外層由紮實的棉和不鏽鋼絲織成。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lamé (saber)"
msgid_plural "lamés (saber)"
msgstr[0] "電子擊劍服（軍刀）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "lamé (saber)"
msgid ""
"A thin, lightweight conductive jacket used by fencers for electronic scoring. "
" Its outer layer is a woven mix of sturdy cotton and stainless steel strands."
msgstr "一見輕薄的導電夾克供擊劍運動員使用，被用來在擊劍中電子計分。它的外層由紮實的棉和不鏽鋼絲織成。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "football armor"
msgid_plural "football armors"
msgstr[0] "美式足球護具"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "football armor"
msgid ""
"Heavy polycarbonate armor for your upper torso.  Normally worn by football "
"players."
msgstr "一件沉重的聚碳酸酯护甲，通常由橄榄球球员穿着。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Kevlar vest"
msgid ""
"A lightweight level II ballistic vest, suitable for wearing under a coat or "
"other outer wear."
msgstr "輕型二級防彈背心，適合穿在大衣或其他外套裡面。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "motorcycle armor"
msgid_plural "motorcycle armors"
msgstr[0] "機車護甲"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "motorcycle armor"
msgid ""
"A light jacket made of a stretch mesh covered in plastic pads meant for "
"motorcyclists.  Made to be much more comfortable to wear than leather "
"alternatives, but the underlying Lycra isn't protective at all."
msgstr "一款由彈性網布製成的輕便夾克，上面覆蓋著塑膠墊，專為機車騎士設計。與皮革版相比，穿著起來更加舒適，但底層的萊卡纖維根本沒有保護作用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "underarm protector"
msgid_plural "underarm protectors"
msgstr[0] "腋下護具"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "underarm protector"
msgid ""
"A sturdy cotton plastron that protects much of the torso, the dominant "
"shoulder, and underarm while fencing."
msgstr "一個厚實的棉胸甲，能夠在擊劍時保護大部分的軀幹、慣用肩膀、還有腋下。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic chest protector"
msgid_plural "plastic chest protectors"
msgstr[0] "塑膠護胸"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic chest protector"
msgid ""
"A rigid plastic plastron with molded cups to be worn by female fencers for "
"protection while fencing."
msgstr "一個有著堅硬罩杯形狀的塑膠胸甲，在擊劍時給女性擊劍運動員提供保護。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armored leather vest"
msgid_plural "armored leather vests"
msgstr[0] "裝甲皮革背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "armored leather vest"
msgid "An armored vest made from thick leather and metal plates."
msgstr "一件由厚皮革和金属板制成的护甲背心。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened armored leather vest"
msgid_plural "hardened armored leather vests"
msgstr[0] "覆甲皮背心"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened armored leather vest"
msgid ""
"An armored vest made from thick leather and metal plates which have been "
"hardened for superb protection."
msgstr "一件带护甲的皮背心，由厚皮革和经硬化处理的金属板制成，提供不俗的防御。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel light chestplate"
msgid_plural "mild steel light chestplates"
msgstr[0] "輕型胸甲（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel light chestplate"
msgid "A light chestplate, 2 mm thick.  This one has been made with mild steel."
msgstr "一件厚2毫米的轻型护胸。这件是用低碳钢做的。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel light chestplate"
msgid_plural "medium steel light chestplates"
msgstr[0] "輕型胸甲（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel light chestplate"
msgid ""
"A light chestplate, 2 mm thick.  Made with tougher medium steel, offering "
"solid protection."
msgstr "一款轻型胸甲，厚度为2毫米。采用更坚硬的中碳钢制成，提供坚固的保护。"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
