#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leather-padded shirt"
msgid ""
"Armor made of combined pre-Cataclysm clothing.  Sections from leather "
"clothing are tightened and affixed to a thick cotton shirt, excluding the "
"joints."
msgstr "一套将大灾变前的服装拼接而成的护甲。从其它衣物上裁下来的皮革片被紧固到了一件厚棉衬衫上，避开了关节处。"

