"police officers.  MOLLE webbing is attached to the torso and the word POLICE "
"is emblazoned across the front."
msgstr "由防暴警察使用的坚硬胸部护甲，可以与护腿和护臂相连。大腿上系有MOLLE织带，前面印有\"警察\"字样。"

