msgstr[0] "《柴油動力雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Diesel Power" of item "Top Gear magazine"
msgid ""
"An automotive magazine, focused on heavily modifying trucks, SUVs, and cars "
"powered by diesel."
msgstr "一本汽車雜誌，內容主要針對大規模改裝的卡車、運動型多用途車（SUV）和柴油動力車。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
msgid "Cruisin' Style Magazine"
msgid_plural "issues of Cruisin' Style Magazine"
msgstr[0] "《巡遊風格月刊》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Cruisin' Style Magazine" of item "Top Gear
#. magazine"
msgid "A really old issue about classic car maintenance and restoration."
msgstr "關於經典汽車維護和修復的老雜誌。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
msgid "Hot Rod"
msgid_plural "issues of Hot Rod"
msgstr[0] "《改裝高速汽車月刊》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Hot Rod" of item "Top Gear magazine"
msgid "Monthly magazine about hot rodding, drag racing, and muscle cars."
msgstr "關於改裝車、飆車和肌肉車的月刊。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
msgid "Motor Trend"
msgid_plural "issues of Motor Trend"
msgstr[0] "《汽車趨勢》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Motor Trend" of item "Top Gear magazine"
msgid "Boring automobile magazine with a big shiny label."
msgstr "無聊的汽車雜誌，上面有一個閃亮的大標籤。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Top Gear magazine"
msgid "Quatro Rodas"
msgid_plural "issues of Quatro Rodas"
msgstr[0] "《Quatro Rodas》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Quatro Rodas" of item "Top Gear magazine"
msgid ""
"It seems to be a car magazine, but you can only understand the images, as the "
"text is written in another language."
msgstr "它看起來像是一本汽車雜誌，但你只能看懂圖像，因為文字是用另一種語言寫的。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
msgid "The Rules of the Road"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rules of the Road"
msgstr[0] "《道路交通安全規則》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of "The Rules of the Road"
#. ~ Description of variant "The Rules of the Road" of item "The Rules of the
#. Road"
msgid ""
"A thick textbook for beginning drivers.  It contains chapters on laws, safe "
"vehicle operation, and defensive driving concepts."
msgstr "一本供駕駛初學者的厚重課本。包含了交通法規、車輛安全操控和防禦性駕駛的章節。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
msgid "Guide to Passing the Driving Test"
msgid_plural "copies of Guide to Passing the Driving Test"
msgstr[0] "《駕駛考照指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Guide to Passing the Driving Test" of item "The
#. Rules of the Road"
msgid ""
"A thick, heavy book about every thing you may be asked in your driving exam.  "
"The biggest part of the book contains a 'theory test' with detailed answers, "
"and many how-to's related to driving overall."
msgstr "這是一本厚重的書，涵蓋了駕駛考試中可能會問到的所有問題。本書的大部分內容包含帶有詳細答案的“理論測試”，以及許多與整體駕駛相關的操作方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
msgid "The official DVSA guide to driving"
msgid_plural "copies of The official DVSA guide to driving"
msgstr[0] "《DVSA 官方駕駛指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The official DVSA guide to driving" of item "The
#. Rules of the Road"
msgid ""
"This book is packed with comprehensive information about driving, how to do "
"it properly, and take joy in it.  You wonder how this manual made it here, as "
"DVSA is a British organization, and the book contains information about "
"specific British driving rules."
msgstr ""
"本書包含有關駕駛、如何正確駕駛並從中獲得樂趣的全面資訊。你想知道這本手冊怎麼會出現在這，因為 DVSA "
"是一個英國組織，而且該書內容是英國的駕駛規則資訊。（譯註：DVSA，Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency，英國駕駛標準局）"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
msgid "Automated Driving and Driver Assistance Systems"
msgid_plural "copies of Automated Driving and Driver Assistance Systems"
msgstr[0] "《自動駕駛與駕駛輔助系統》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Automated Driving and Driver Assistance Systems"
#. of item "The Rules of the Road"
msgid ""
"This book explains the technologies and approaches of advanced driving "
"systems, how they are designed, and why it is hard to get a good result.  It "
"is difficult to understand sometimes, but it shows driving from a perspective "
"an average driver wouldn't think about."
msgstr "这本书解释了先进驾驶系统的技术和手段，从它们是如何设计的，到为什么很难取得好的效果。这本书有时很难理解，但它从一个普通司机不会想到的角度展示了驾驶。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Rules of the Road"
msgid "The Driving Instructor's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Driving Instructor's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "《駕駛教練手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Driving Instructor's Handbook" of item "The
#. Rules of the Road"
msgid ""
"Detailed textbook about how to provide driving lessons, what may be "
"discussed, and how to prevent dangerous situations and collisions."
msgstr "关于如何提供驾驶课程、应该讨论的内容以及如何防止危险情况和碰撞的详细教科书。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of "AAA Guide"
#. ~ Description of variant "AAA Guide" of item "AAA Guide"
msgid ""
"A tourist-centric guide to points of interest throughout the country.  This "
"particular copy is apparently the Anonymous Anarchist's Annual: the cover "
"conceals a wealth of ways to help stick it to The Man, along with plenty of "
"advice for avoiding police."
msgstr "一本觀光導向的全國各地景點指南。這本特別的副本顯然是匿名無政府主義者的年鑑：書皮暗藏了許多擺脫監視器的方法，以及大量避開警察的建議。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
msgid "The Anarchist Cookbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Anarchist Cookbook"
msgstr[0] "《無政府主義者食譜》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Anarchist Cookbook" of item "AAA Guide"
msgid ""
"Classic illegal manual about making weapons and explosives.  The first page "
"contains a quote from its author William Powell, that describes it as \"a "
"youthful indiscretion or mistake that can haunt someone during their early "
"years or even longer\"."
msgstr ""
"關於製造武器和爆炸物的經典非法手冊。第一頁引用了其作者威廉·鮑威爾（William "
"Powell）的一句話：「年輕時的輕率行為或錯誤，可能會困擾某人前半生甚至更長時間」。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
msgid "Science of Revolutionary Warfare"
msgid_plural "copies of Science of Revolutionary Warfare"
msgstr[0] "《革命戰爭的科學》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Science of Revolutionary Warfare" of item "AAA
#. Guide"
msgid ""
"A small, shabby book about making explosives, poisons, and weapons with "
"resources you may find in your backyard."
msgstr "這是一本小而破舊的書，內容是教你如何用在後院找到的資源製作炸藥、毒藥和武器。"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "AAA Guide"
msgid "The Poor Man's James Bond"
msgid_plural "copies of The Poor Man's James Bond"
msgstr[0] "《窮人的詹姆士龐德》"

#: data/json/items/book/driving.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Poor Man's James Bond" of item "AAA Guide"
msgid ""
"A collection of American paramilitary knowledge throughout history, "
"containing a lot of information about how to make dangerous weapons and "
"explosives in pretty dry language."
msgstr "美國歷史上準軍事知識的集合，其中包含大量有關如何製造危險武器和爆炸物的資訊，但是用字遣詞相當枯燥乏味。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Advanced Electronics"
msgid_plural "copies of Advanced Electronics"
msgstr[0] "《進階電子學》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Advanced Electronics"
msgid "A college textbook on circuit design."
msgstr "一本有關電路設計的大學課本。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Arduino Experiments"
msgid_plural "copies of Arduino Experiments"
msgstr[0] "《Arduino 實驗手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Arduino Experiments"
msgid "A textbook-sized book of electronics and robotics experiments."
msgstr "一本教科書大小的書，內容是電子學和機器人實驗。（譯註：Arduino 是一家義大利開源硬體和軟體公司、專案和使用者社群。）"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ham Radio Illustrated"
msgid_plural "issues of Ham Radio Illustrated"
msgstr[0] "《火腿族畫報》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Ham Radio Illustrated"
msgid ""
"An amusing magazine about ham radio, with lots of diagrams and illustrations "
"for making your own electronic devices."
msgstr "一個有趣的業餘無線電雜誌， 內含大量的圖表和插圖， 教你製作自己的電子設備。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "What's a Transistor?"
msgid_plural "copies of What's a Transistor?"
msgstr[0] "《什麼是電晶體？》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "What's a Transistor?"
msgid "A basic manual of electronics and circuit design."
msgstr "一本基礎的電子與電路設計的手冊。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "101 Important Integrated Circuits"
msgid_plural "copies of 101 Important Integrated Circuits"
msgstr[0] "《101 種重要的積體電路》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "101 Important Integrated Circuits"
msgid ""
"This reference manual contains datasheets and pinout diagrams for 101 of the "
"most popular IC chips, including the 555 timer, LM358 op-amp, and LM317 "
"voltage regulator, along with logic chips from the 74xx family, and even the "
"6502 8-bit processor.  If you want to do anything useful with integrated "
"circuits, a reference like this would be indispensable."
msgstr ""
"這本參考手冊包含 101 種最受歡迎的 IC 晶片的資料表和接腳圖，包括 555 定時器、LM358 運算放大器和 LM317 穩壓器，以及 74xx "
"系列的邏輯晶片，甚至還有 6502 8 位元處理器。如果你想用積體電路做任何有用的事情，這樣的參考手冊是不可或缺的。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Amateur Home Radio for Enthusiasts"
msgid_plural "copies of Amateur Home Radio for Enthusiasts"
msgstr[0] "《業餘無線電愛好者》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Amateur Home Radio for Enthusiasts"
msgid ""
"A book about ham radio and citizen's band radio.  It contains numerous "
"diagrams and illustrations explaining the science behind the electronics."
msgstr "一本關於業餘無線電愛好者和民用波段無線電的書。它運用了大量的圖表和插圖來解釋背後的科學原理。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "computer printout"
msgid_plural "computer printouts"
msgstr[0] "《電腦列印輸出表》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "computer printout"
msgid ""
"One side of this sheet is printed with a meaningless jumble of characters, "
"but the other side shows a complicated, hand-drawn circuit diagram."
msgstr "這表的一面印滿了無意義的混亂字元， 但另一面卻有複雜的手繪電路圖。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Role of Robotics in Modern Day Manufacturing"
msgid_plural "copies of The Role of Robotics in Modern Day Manufacturing"
msgstr[0] "《機器人技術如何應用於現代製造業》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "The Role of Robotics in Modern Day Manufacturing"
msgid ""
"A hefty book containing a whole bunch of technical info on industrial "
"robotics.  While constructing these robots are no doubt outside any realm of "
"feasibility, the information provided still has a fair bit to teach about "
"complex electronics."
msgstr "一本厚重的书籍，塞满了关于工业机器人的技术细节。虽然在灾变后的世界重建这些机器人像天方夜谭，但书中知识仍能教会你不少精密构造的门道。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lab journal-Herrera"
msgid_plural "lab journals-Herrera"
msgstr[0] "《實驗室日誌 - Herrera》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "lab journal-Herrera"
msgid ""
"This hefty binder contains a multitude of diagrams and technical "
"specifications for various electronic materials.  Some of the diagrams use "
"symbols you've not seen before…"
msgstr "這沉重的文件含有大量的圖表和各種電子材料的技術規範。有些圖表運用了你從來沒看過的符號…"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "2XI design binder-CLASSIFIED"
msgid_plural "2XI design binders-CLASSIFIED"
msgstr[0] "《2XI 設計活頁夾 - 機密》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "2XI design binder-CLASSIFIED"
msgid ""
"This DoubleTech Industries binder has several intimidating security warnings "
"on the cover.  Probably because it contains complete design specs, technical "
"drawings, and test results for their military-grade bionic implants."
msgstr "這本 DoubleTech 工業的活頁夾在封面上有幾個令人生畏的安全警告。可能是因為它包含了軍用級生化插件的完整設計規格、技術圖和測試結果。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plans for a radio repeater mod"
msgid_plural "plans for a radio repeater mod"
msgstr[0] "《無線電中繼器模組計劃書》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "plans for a radio repeater mod"
msgid ""
"Instructions on how to create a mod for a radio station terminal which "
"converts the entire system into a repeater."
msgstr "一本關於製作模組的教學。這模組安裝在廣播電台終端機後，能把整個系統轉換成一個自主中繼器。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Electronic Circuit Theory"
msgid_plural "copies of Electronic Circuit Theory"
msgstr[0] "《電子電路理論》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Electronic Circuit Theory"
msgid "An advanced college textbook on circuit theory, design, and organization."
msgstr "一本講述電路理論的進階大學課本， 包含了設計與組織的章節。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Robots for Fun & Profit"
msgid_plural "copies of Robots for Fun & Profit"
msgstr[0] "《快樂造機器人》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Robots for Fun & Profit"
msgid "A rare book on the design of robots, with lots of helpful step-by-step guides."
msgstr "少見的機器人製造刊物， 內容包含許多製造指引與製造過程。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "trifacet handling procedures"
msgid_plural "trifacet handling procedures"
msgstr[0] "《trifacet 處理程序》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "trifacet handling procedures"
msgid ""
"A heavy and disparate binder detailing the deactivation, storage and "
"transport procedures for a so called \"Trifacet\" UGV.  The pages and "
"schematics within have been compiled from the internal reports of a vast "
"array of governmental agencies, many of which you had never heard of before."
msgstr ""
"一本沉重且相當特別的活頁夾，詳細介紹了所謂的「Trifacet」無人地面載具的關閉、儲存和運輸程序。其中的頁面和示意圖是根據大量政府機構的內部報告彙編而成的"
"，其中許多機構你以前從未聽說過。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "CBM interface wiring reference"
msgid_plural "CBM interface wiring reference"
msgstr[0] "《CBM 介面接線參考文件》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "CBM interface wiring reference"
msgid ""
"A printed technical reference for the Exodii's CBM interface wire kit using "
"numerous alien symbols along with Anglic terminology.  Thankfully someone's "
"hand-written a legend for those symbols and terms along the margins, but "
"it'll still take significant electronics knowledge to decipher this document."
msgstr ""
"Exodii 的 CBM "
"介面接線組​​件的印刷技術參考文件，使用大量外星符號和英語拼寫術語。值得慶幸的是，有人在頁邊為這些符號和術語手寫了一個圖例，但仍需要大量的電子知識來破譯這份"
"文件。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nurse bot schematics"
msgid_plural "nurse bot schematics"
msgstr[0] "《護士機器人原理圖》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "nurse bot schematics"
msgid ""
"Bearing the logo of Uncanny, these are assembly plans, design specs, and "
"technical drawings for the nurse bot.  Most of this is useless to you, but "
"you could use the assembly plans to re-assemble the robot from salvaged parts."
msgstr ""
"帶有 Uncanny "
"的標誌，這些是護士機器人的裝配藍圖、設計規格和技術圖紙。其中大部分對你沒用，但你可以利用裝配藍圖，把搜刮來的機器人部件重新組裝成機器人。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grocery bot schematics"
msgid_plural "grocery bot schematics"
msgstr[0] "《雜貨店機器人原理圖》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "grocery bot schematics"
msgid ""
"Bearing the logo of Uncanny, these are assembly plans, design specs, and "
"technical drawings for the grocery bot.  Most of this is useless to you, but "
"you could use the assembly plans to re-assemble the robot from salvaged parts."
msgstr ""
"帶有 Uncanny "
"的標誌，這些是雜貨店機器人的裝配藍圖、設計規格和技術圖紙。其中大部分對你沒用，但你可以利用裝配藍圖，把搜刮來的機器人部件重新組裝成機器人。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "security bot schematics"
msgid_plural "security bot schematics"
msgstr[0] "《保全機器人原理圖》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "security bot schematics"
msgid ""
"Assembly plans, design specs, and technical drawings for the security bot.  "
"Most of this is useless to you, but you could use the assembly plans to "
"re-assemble the robot from salvaged parts."
msgstr "保全機器人的裝配藍圖、設計規格和技術圖紙。其中大部分對你沒用，但你可以利用裝配藍圖，把搜刮來的機器人部件重新組裝成機器人。"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "skitterbot schematics"
msgid_plural "skitterbot schematics"
msgstr[0] "《爬蟲機器人原理圖》"

#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "skitterbot schematics"
msgid ""
"Assembly plans, design specs, and technical drawings for the skitterbot.  "
"Most of this is useless to you, but you could use the assembly plans to "
"re-assemble the robot from salvaged parts."
msgstr "爬蟲機器人的裝配藍圖、設計規格和技術圖紙。其中大部分對你沒用，但你可以利用裝配藍圖，把搜刮來的機器人部件重新組裝成機器人。"

