#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Art of Glassblowing"
msgid_plural "copies of The Art of Glassblowing"
msgstr[0] "《玻璃吹制技藝》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Art of Glassblowing"
msgid ""
"A textbook that illustrates the science and technique of the ancient art of "
"glassblowing."
msgstr "一本講解傳統玻璃吹制技術的教科書。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Plastics & Polymers: Projects for the Classroom"
msgid_plural "copies of Plastics & Polymers: Projects for the Classroom"
msgstr[0] "《塑膠與聚合物：教學用》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Plastics & Polymers: Projects for the Classroom"
msgid ""
"A textbook that goes through types and material properties of various common "
"plastics, and how to use them in several common projects."
msgstr "一本教科書，講述各種常見塑膠材質的類型和材料特性，還有如何在常見項目中使用它們。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "metal casting reference manual"
msgid_plural "metal casting reference manuals"
msgstr[0] "《金屬鑄造參考手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "metal casting reference manual"
msgid "A textbook with information about casting various types of metals."
msgstr "一本包含有關鑄造各種金屬的資訊的教科書。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alloying reference manual"
msgid_plural "alloying reference manuals"
msgstr[0] "《合金化參考手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "alloying reference manual"
msgid "A textbook with information about alloying various types of metals."
msgstr "一本包含有關各種金屬合金化資訊的教科書。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Bronze Age Encyclopedia"
msgid_plural "copies of The Bronze Age Encyclopedia"
msgstr[0] "《青銅時代百科全書》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Bronze Age Encyclopedia"
msgid ""
"A huge textbook with information about the historic use of bronze around the "
"world, with well illustrated instructions of the manufacturing process of "
"armor, weapons and bronze tools."
msgstr "一本厚重的教科書，介紹了世界各地青銅的歷史用途，並附有關於盔甲、武器和青銅工具的製造過程的插圖說明。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Historic Warfare: The Bronze Age"
msgid_plural "copies of Historic Warfare: The Bronze Age"
msgstr[0] "《歷史戰爭：青銅時代》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Historic Warfare: The Bronze Age"
msgid ""
"An in-depth magazine about the use of bronze weapons in warfare.  There are "
"some images about their fabrication process."
msgstr "一本有深度的雜誌，描寫在戰爭中青銅武器的使用。有一些關於青銅武器製造過程的圖片。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Prop Builder's Molding and Casting Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Prop Builder's Molding and Casting Handbook"
msgstr[0] "《道具製造的造模和鑄造手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Prop Builder's Molding and Casting Handbook"
msgid ""
"The first book to contain, in one comprehensive volume, every molding and "
"casting procedure of use to the theater props builder of any skill level.  "
"The author demonstrates the techniques involved in over thirty materials from "
"papier-mache to breakaway glass."
msgstr "一本知識面廣博的書籍，是第一本包含了任何技能水平的劇院道具建造者所使用的每個造模和鑄造的步驟。作者示範了從混凝紙漿到糖玻璃等三十多種材料所涉及的技術。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Antique Adornments"
msgid_plural "copies of Antique Adornments"
msgstr[0] "《古風飾物》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Antique Adornments"
msgid ""
"A comprehensive and illustrated history of the techniques used to make "
"crowns, bracelets, necklaces, and other types of jewelry."
msgstr "全面、圖文並茂地介紹了用於製作王冠、手鐲、項鍊和其他類型珠寶的技術的歷史。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Crafty Crafter's Quarterly"
msgid_plural "Crafty Crafter's Quarterlies"
msgstr[0] "《工匠季刊》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Crafty Crafter's Quarterly"
msgid ""
"A fun quarterly magazine all about macaroni art and things you can make by "
"supergluing found objects together."
msgstr "每季出刊，主要介紹可以用強力膠製造的手工藝品雜誌。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "101 Crafts for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of 101 Crafts for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "《101 種適合初學者的工藝品》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "101 Crafts for Beginners"
msgid ""
"A large, paperback book detailing a hundred and one beginner's projects in "
"fabrication."
msgstr "一本大平裝書，詳細介紹了一百零一個初學者的製造專案。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Fletcher's Friend"
msgid_plural "copies of The Fletcher's Friend"
msgstr[0] "《箭箭好朋友》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Fletcher's Friend"
msgid ""
"This hefty book is devoted to folks looking to handcraft their own arrows.  "
"It starts with a hip and snappy disclaimer about the risks, both physical and "
"legal, of using explosives and flammable materials.  Look for its companion, "
"\"The Bowyer's Buddy\"!"
msgstr ""
"這本書是寫給需要自行手工製作箭矢的人。開頭使用了活潑生動的手法來聲明風險， 包含了使用爆炸與易燃物質在物理與法律上的危險性。還有另一本相關書， "
"\"弓弓好朋友\"！"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Bowyer's Buddy"
msgid_plural "copies of The Bowyer's Buddy"
msgstr[0] "《弓弓好朋友》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Bowyer's Buddy"
msgid ""
"This hefty book is dedicated to craftsfolk and outdoors-y types looking to "
"make their own bows.  It recommends its companion volume \"The Fletcher's "
"Friend\" for instructions on producing their ammunition."
msgstr "這本厚重的書是寫給需要自行手工製作弓的人。書裡面提到建議購入另一本相關書 \"箭箭好朋友\" 來製作箭矢。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Handloader's Helper"
msgid_plural "copies of The Handloader's Helper"
msgstr[0] "《手工填彈指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Handloader's Helper"
msgid ""
"Everything you could ever want to know about handloading ammunition, sealed "
"with a… childproof cover.  Apparently a liability thing, because the chapter "
"on explosive rounds covers them in excellent detail too."
msgstr "裡面有關於手工裝配子彈的所有知識， 封面有著… 18 禁的標誌。顯然這是必要的， 因為裡面有個章節詳細講述了高爆子彈。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Rivtech design binder"
msgid_plural "Rivtech design binders"
msgstr[0] "《Rivtech 設計文件夾》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Rivtech design binder"
msgid ""
"This Rivtech binder warns that \"Unauthorized readers are our best test "
"subjects.\" With good reason: it contains complete design specs and technical "
"drawings for their entire line of products."
msgstr "這本 Rivtech 有著警告標語， \"未經授權的讀者是我們最好的測試對象。\" 而理由很充分: 它包含了整個生產線的完整設計規格與技術藍圖。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lab journal-Gustav"
msgid_plural "lab journals-Gustav"
msgstr[0] "《實驗室日誌 - Gustav》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "lab journal-Gustav"
msgid ""
"This paper notebook is mostly full of boring logs, experimental observations "
"and notes.  Mixed in, however, are musings on how to use the lab's vapor "
"deposition machine to deposit amorphous carbon in a diamond-like form onto "
"common metals.  The author's intended goal was a better non-stick frying pan, "
"but you can think of a couple of better uses for it."
msgstr ""
"這個紙本筆記簿寫滿了無趣的紀錄、實驗的觀察和註記。同時混雜了一些迷思: 如何利用實驗室的汽相沉積裝置， "
"把不定形碳以近似於鑽石的結構附於一般金屬上面。作者原來的目標是製作更好的不粘煎鍋， 但你想到更好的用途。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Streetfighter's Sidekick"
msgid_plural "copies of The Streetfighter's Sidekick"
msgstr[0] "《街頭霸王的搭檔》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Streetfighter's Sidekick"
msgid ""
"A sizable how-to guide for making hand-to-hand combat weapons.  Though the "
"processes are thoroughly detailed and several illustrations are provided, "
"they rely heavily on technical jargon.  More for "
"machinists-turned-weaponsmiths than streetfighters, really."
msgstr "一本全面性介紹格鬥武器的指南。雖然流程講述詳細， 並提供了許多插圖， 但是只是賣弄名詞。更像是給轉行做自動武器的機械師而不是做街頭鬥毆的武器， 真的。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Art of Japanese Armormaking"
msgid_plural "copies of The Art of Japanese Armormaking"
msgstr[0] "《日本盔甲製作藝術》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Art of Japanese Armormaking"
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details various forms of ancient Japanese "
"armor crafting, and is well illustrated with lots of photos."
msgstr "以深度文章與技術角度， 介紹古老的日本武士盔甲製作技術， 佐以鉅細靡遺的大量圖片。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Arms and Armor of Imperial China"
msgid_plural "copies of Arms and Armor of Imperial China"
msgstr[0] "《帝制中國的武器與盔甲》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Arms and Armor of Imperial China"
msgid ""
"This textbook details the military history of ancient China, with a "
"particular focus on the nature of historical arms and armor.  It also details "
"some of the equipment used by other cultures that came into conflict with the "
"empire over various dynasties."
msgstr "這本教科書詳細介紹中國古代軍事史， 尤其側重於歷史的武器和盔甲的性質。它還詳細介紹了一些與帝國在各個朝代發生衝突的其他文明所使用的設備。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Tools of Warfare in the Arabic World"
msgid_plural "copies of Tools of Warfare in the Arabic World"
msgstr[0] "《阿拉伯世界戰爭的工具》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Tools of Warfare in the Arabic World"
msgid ""
"This exhaustive book details various forms of medieval period Middle Eastern "
"and South Asian weapons and armor.  It is incredibly detailed with diagrams "
"and pictures, but quite dry."
msgstr "这本内容详实的书事无巨细介绍了中世纪中东和南亚时期各种形式的武器和盔甲。它及其详尽，有图表和图片，但也相当枯燥。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Studies in Historic Armorsmithing"
msgid_plural "copies of Studies in Historic Armorsmithing"
msgstr[0] "《古代裝甲製作探討》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Studies in Historic Armorsmithing"
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details various forms of ancient European "
"armor crafting, and is well illustrated with lots of photos."
msgstr "以深度文章與技術角度， 介紹古老的歐洲裝甲製作技術， 佐以鉅細靡遺的大量圖片。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Art of Warfare in Precolumbian Mesoamericas"
msgid_plural "copies of The Art of Warfare in Precolumbian Mesoamericas"
msgstr[0] "《前哥倫布時期中美洲戰爭的藝術》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Art of Warfare in Precolumbian Mesoamericas"
msgid ""
"This intricate history book details the history of Mesoamerican warfare from "
"the sources of the native codices, Spanish records and contemporary "
"historians.  It contains descriptive diagrams and information on few of the "
"weapons and armor used, mainly of the Nahuatl speaking peoples.  You reckon "
"you could craft a few of these weapons with steel instead of obsidian."
msgstr ""
"这本复杂的历史书详细介绍了中美洲战争的历史，这些史料来自当地的抄本、西班牙的记录和当代历史学家。它载有关于主要由纳瓦特尔语民族所使用的少数武器和护甲的描述图"
"表和资料。你估计你可以用钢铁而不是黑曜石来制作这类武器。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "DIY Compendium"
msgid_plural "copies of DIY Compendium"
msgstr[0] "《自己動手做》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "DIY Compendium"
msgid ""
"A thick, hardbound book detailing countless projects for inventions that "
"claim to improve all aspects of life."
msgstr "一本厚重， 介紹各種可以增進生活樂趣的DIY工具書。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A History of Firefighting"
msgid_plural "copies of A History of Firefighting"
msgstr[0] "《消防史》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "A History of Firefighting"
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details the history of firefighting from "
"ancient times into the modern era, with a focus on the technology used to "
"save lives."
msgstr "這本專業讀物深入淺出地講述了從古至今的消防歷史， 以救死扶傷技術的革新為敘述核心。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Swords of the Samurai"
msgid_plural "copies of The Swords of the Samurai"
msgstr[0] "《武士刀大全》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Swords of the Samurai"
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details various forms of ancient Japanese "
"sword smithing, and is well illustrated with step by step photo instructions."
msgstr "以深度文章與技術角度， 介紹古老的日本武器鑄造技術， 佐以鉅細靡遺的圖片與精彩解說。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Historic Weaponsmith"
msgid_plural "copies of The Historic Weaponsmith"
msgstr[0] "《論古代武器鍛造》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Historic Weaponsmith"
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details various forms of ancient European "
"weapon smithing, and is well illustrated with step by step photo instructions."
msgstr "以深度文章與技術角度， 介紹古老的歐洲武器鑄造技術， 佐以鉅細靡遺的圖片與精彩解說。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Welding and Metallurgy"
msgid_plural "copies of Welding and Metallurgy"
msgstr[0] "《焊接與冶金》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Welding and Metallurgy"
msgid ""
"A rather technical textbook that illustrates the science and technique of "
"becoming a better welder."
msgstr "一本頗為技術性的教科書， 教導成為一個更好的焊工所要用到的科學和技術。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "101 Home Repairs"
msgid_plural "copies of 101 Home Repairs"
msgstr[0] "《居家修繕 101》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "101 Home Repairs"
msgid "A paperback book detailing 101 home repair projects for the novice carpenter."
msgstr "一本平裝書，詳細介紹了新手木匠的 101 個房屋維修項目。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Complete Home Repair Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of The Complete Home Repair Guide"
msgstr[0] "《完全居家修繕手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "The Complete Home Repair Guide"
msgid ""
"A massive book that details virtually every aspect of remodeling and "
"repairing a home, with concise terminology aimed at experienced carpenters."
msgstr "一本厚重的書， 詳細講述了如何進行居家修繕， 內容運用了資深老手才看的懂得簡潔術語。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Birdhouse Monthly"
msgid_plural "Birdhouse Monthlies"
msgstr[0] "《每月鳥籠》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Birdhouse Monthly"
msgid "A riveting periodical all about birdhouses and their construction."
msgstr "每月出刊的雜誌， 介紹鳥籠與建構方式。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Building for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Building for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "《第一次建築就上手》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Building for Beginners"
msgid "A large, paperback book detailing several beginner's projects in construction."
msgstr "一個大型的平裝書， 詳細介紹幾個初學者的建築工程。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Engineering 301"
msgid_plural "copies of Engineering 301"
msgstr[0] "《工程學 301》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Engineering 301"
msgid "A textbook on civil engineering and construction."
msgstr "一本有關市政工程與建築的課本。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Machinery's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Machinery's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "《機械手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Machinery's Handbook"
msgid ""
"This classic reference work contains extensive, dense chapters and tables on "
"materials, metrology, toolmaking, gears, threading and more.  This recent "
"edition includes extensive data on the latest techniques in additive "
"manufacturing.  If you need to know how best complete a certain machining "
"operation, the answer lies somewhere in these pages."
msgstr ""
"这本经典的参考书目包含了大量密集的章节和表格，内容涉及材料学、度量学、工具制造、传动装置、螺纹车工等各个方面。而这本最新的修订版，还包含了很多关于三维打印技"
"术的数据。如果你急于知道如何最优地完成某项加工作业，答案就藏在这本书的某一页里。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Concrete Constructions"
msgid_plural "copies of Concrete Constructions"
msgstr[0] "《混凝土建築》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Concrete Constructions"
msgid ""
"A collection of notable uses of concrete.  Contains detailed directions on "
"how to mix and use cement to form useful aggregates."
msgstr "这本书介绍了混凝土的各类主要用途。同时详细说明了混合水泥及骨料制成混凝土的过程。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "WX010 Living Armor Observations"
msgid_plural "copies of WX010 Living Armor Observations"
msgstr[0] "《WX010：活體鎧甲觀測紀錄》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "WX010 Living Armor Observations"
msgid ""
"This sheaf of papers seems to describe maintenance on a new form of ballistic "
"armor.  \"the regenerative plates though promising for field use do require "
"maintenance or combat to stop from becoming overgrown\"."
msgstr "这份文件似乎描述了如何维护一种新型防弹装甲板。\"再生装甲板虽然有望投入实际使用，但确实需要日常维护或参与实战，以防止生长过度\"。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Artillery of the Ancients"
msgid_plural "copies of Artillery of the Ancients"
msgstr[0] "《古代火砲》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Artillery of the Ancients"
msgid ""
"This is a history book detailing the siege machines and field artillery of "
"some ancient civilizations.  It contains detailed diagrams that explain how "
"such devices were assembled and maintained."
msgstr "这是一本历史书，详细介绍了一些古代文明的攻城器械和野战火炮。书中包含详细的图表，解释了这些设备是如何组装和维护的。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Dino Dave's cardboard notebook"
msgid_plural "copies of Dino Dave's cardboard notebook"
msgstr[0] "《Dino Dave 的紙板筆記本》"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of "Dino Dave's cardboard notebook"
msgid ""
"This school notebook contains an astounding amount of \"recipes\" of various "
"cardboard utilities, ranging from the wholly impractical to completely "
"impossible.  Despite that, they're illustrated in a surprisingly thorough "
"manner, to the point where you could possibly learn something from studying "
"the chicken scratch and schematics in detail.  The last page thanks a number "
"of names, some of which you recognize from the refugee center.  Your name "
"covers half the page.  At the bottom, it warns you not to let \"the sandman\" "
"read it."
msgstr ""
"这本学校笔记本包含了数量惊人的各种纸板工具的配方，从完全不实用到完全不可能。尽管如此，它们的图解却出人意料地详尽，以至于你可以通过详细研究这些鸡毛蒜皮和示意"
"图学到一些东西。最后一页是一些名字，其中一些你在难民中心见过。你的名字占了半页。 底部警告你不要让\"沙人 \"看到这本笔记。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Guide to Advanced Emergency Care"
msgid_plural "copies of Guide to Advanced Emergency Care"
msgstr[0] "《高級急救護理指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "Guide to Advanced Emergency Care"
msgid ""
"A thick textbook for paramedics describing advanced lifesaving procedures and "
"field-expedient care methods."
msgstr "一本厚厚的教科書， 教導醫護人員進階的急救和現場處理方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Paramedics"
msgid_plural "issues of Paramedics"
msgstr[0] "《醫療雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "Paramedics"
msgid "An educational magazine for EMTs."
msgstr "一本提供給緊急醫療人員的教育性雜誌。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Big Book of First Aid"
msgid_plural "copies of The Big Book of First Aid"
msgstr[0] "《急救大全》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "The Big Book of First Aid"
msgid "It's big and heavy, but full of great information about first aid."
msgstr "這本書又大又重， 充滿了有關於急救的大量資訊。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pocket Guide to First Aid"
msgid_plural "copies of Pocket Guide to First Aid"
msgstr[0] "《急救口袋指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "Pocket Guide to First Aid"
msgid ""
"This pocket-sized leather-bound guide to first aid combines a wealth of "
"concise information with simple to follow instructions and easy to read "
"illustrations."
msgstr "這是一本口袋大小的皮革封面的急救指南， 有著簡單的步驟指示以及易讀的插圖。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "First Responder Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of First Responder Handbook"
msgstr[0] "《先遣急救員手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "First Responder Handbook"
msgid ""
"A hardbound book detailing advanced first aid techniques and field-expedient "
"medical care."
msgstr "一本精裝書， 詳細介紹了進階的急救技術與適合現場操作的醫療照護。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "First Aid Kit Instruction Booklet"
msgid_plural "copies of First Aid Kit Instruction Booklet"
msgstr[0] "《急救箱使用說明書》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "First Aid Kit Instruction Booklet"
msgid "Illustrated how-to guide for your first aid kit."
msgstr "提供圖解指南， 教你如何進行急救。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Physicians' Desk Reference"
msgid_plural "copies of Physicians' Desk Reference"
msgstr[0] "《內科醫生案例參考》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "Physicians' Desk Reference"
msgid ""
"This hefty volume contains all the legally mandated information relevant to "
"physicians for writing prescriptions, generously supported by the efforts and "
"contributions of major pharmaceutical companies.  For the most part, it "
"provides information identical to what is available on that of medication "
"packaging inserts, and cannot match the completeness of digital "
"pharmaceutical references like MediSoft.  At least it doesn't need power to "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"这本大部头参考书包含了所有法律规定的内科医生开具处方所需的信息，其编纂和出版离不开各大制药公司的大力支持与贡献。这本书绝大多数部分的内容和药物包装里的说明书"
"完全一致，完整性也比不上 Medisoft 等数字化药物参考数据库，但至少它不需要插电就能阅读。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Merck Veterinary Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of Merck Veterinary Manual"
msgstr[0] "《默克公司獸醫手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "Merck Veterinary Manual"
msgid ""
"This expansive text covers 'all domestic species and diseases in veterinary "
"medicine worldwide'.  Should you need information regarding zoonotic "
"diseases, off-label use of medication for animals, common dysfunctions and "
"diseases of animals, or any other veterinary reference info, this is your "
"book.  There are some interesting new chapters on animal cloning in this "
"edition."
msgstr ""
"這篇巨著涵蓋了「全球獸醫學中的所有國內物種和疾病」。如果你需要有關人畜共患疾病、處方籤外使用動物藥物，常見功能障礙和動物疾病的資訊，或任何其他獸醫參考資料，"
"那這就是你需要的書。這個版本中有一些關於動物複製的有趣新章節。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Textbook of Advanced Toxicology"
msgid_plural "copies of Textbook of Advanced Toxicology"
msgstr[0] "《高級毒理學教科書》"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
#. ~ Description of "Textbook of Advanced Toxicology"
msgid ""
"This unassuming volume details the broad spectrum of chemical and biological "
"toxins known to modern medicine.  While the obvious focus of the book is the "
"therapy of such poisonings, there are lengthy sections describing the "
"structure and synthesis of some compounds of interest."
msgstr "这个大部头详细讲解了各类现代医学已知的化学物质和生物毒素。虽然这本书的重点在于中毒的治疗，但还是用很多篇幅描述了一些有趣的化合物的结构和合成。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid "Guns n Ammo"
msgid_plural "issues of Guns n Ammo"
msgstr[0] "《槍與彈藥》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "Guns n Ammo"
#. ~ Description of variant "Guns n Ammo" of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid "Reviews of firearms, and various useful tips about their use."
msgstr "介紹各類槍械的書籍， 並提供許多使用上的建議。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
