"Annual magazine about firearms, weapon collections, self-defense, same as "
"some practical and legal advices."
msgstr "关于枪支、武器收藏和自卫的年度杂志，以及一些实用的法律建议。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid "Recoil"
msgid_plural "issues of Recoil"
msgstr[0] "《後座力》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Recoil" of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid ""
"A modern magazine about handguns, tactical weapons, knives, and shooting "
"activities.  It says there is a fold-out target, but someone took it off."
msgstr "一本关于手枪、战术武器、刀具和射击活动的现代杂志。上面说印有一页折叠式靶子，但有人把它拿掉了。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid "SWAT"
msgid_plural "issues of SWAT"
msgstr[0] "《特種武器和戰術部隊雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "SWAT" of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid ""
"\"Special Weapons And Tactics for the prepared American\", this magazine "
"contains info about firearms, law enforcement, and related interests, with a "
"focus on SWAT police officers."
msgstr "这本杂志是\"为有准备的美国人准备的特殊武器和战术\"，包含枪支、执法等信息，重点关注特警。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid "Bullet Point"
msgid_plural "issues of Bullet Point"
msgstr[0] "《彈頭雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Bullet Point" of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid ""
"Small magazine about ammo and firearms, and how to choose, use, and maintain "
"them properly."
msgstr "关于如何选择、使用和正确维护强制与弹药的小杂志。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid "Trigger Happy"
msgid_plural "issues of Trigger Happy"
msgstr[0] "《觸發快樂》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Trigger Happy" of item "Guns n Ammo"
msgid ""
"Modern magazine for young people about firearms, self-defense, different "
"competitions, and reviews."
msgstr "面向年轻人的现代杂志，介绍枪支、自卫、各种竞赛以及评论。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "《槍械說明書》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
#. ~ Description of variant "The Gun Owner's Handbook" of item "The Gun
#. Owner's Handbook"
msgid ""
"A thick soft-cover book that claims to be a complete guide to safely "
"operating, maintaining, and repairing firearms."
msgstr "一本軟皮書， 內容有著關於槍械安全操作、保養、修理的資訊。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid "FM 3-90-1: Offense And Defense"
msgid_plural "copies of FM 3-90-1: Offense And Defense"
msgstr[0] "《FM 3-90-1：進攻與防守》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "FM 3-90-1: Offense And Defense" of item "The Gun
#. Owner's Handbook"
msgid ""
"Official U.S. Army manual about basics and tactics of moving and attacking a "
"target - how to shoot, how to hide, how to retreat, and how to defend."
msgstr "美国陆军官方手册，讲述了移动和攻击目标的基本知识和战术——如何射击、如何隐藏、如何撤退，以及如何防守。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid "Surplus Military"
msgid_plural "issues of Surplus Military"
msgstr[0] "《過剩軍用品》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Surplus Military" of item "The Gun Owner's
#. Handbook"
msgid ""
"A journal about modern and old firearms, their style, manufacturing, and "
"usage."
msgstr "一本關於現代和古代槍支及其型號、製造和使用的雜誌。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid "Owning a Modern Firearm"
msgid_plural "copies of Owning a Modern Firearm"
msgstr[0] "《擁有一支現代槍械》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Owning a Modern Firearm" of item "The Gun Owner's
#. Handbook"
msgid ""
"Essential handbook detailing how to own, use, and properly maintain a "
"modern-day firearm."
msgstr "詳細介紹如何擁有、使用和正確維護現代槍支的基本手冊。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid "Practical Shooting Training"
msgid_plural "copies of Practical Shooting Training"
msgstr[0] "《實戰射擊訓練》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Practical Shooting Training" of item "The Gun
#. Owner's Handbook"
msgid ""
"Step-by-step instructions on how to use a gun, with lot of drills for each "
"level."
msgstr "由浅到深的枪械使用指南，每个级别都有大量的演习。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid "The Illustrated History of Firearms"
msgid_plural "copies of The Illustrated History of Firearms"
msgstr[0] "《槍械歷史圖解》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Illustrated History of Firearms" of item "The
#. Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid ""
"A reference book that contains hundreds of images of firearms inside, with "
"lot of comments from professionals and information about each model."
msgstr "一本包含数百张枪械图片的参考书，里面有很多专业人士的评论和关于每种型号的信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid "Long Range Shooting Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Long Range Shooting Handbook"
msgstr[0] "《遠距離射擊手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Long Range Shooting Handbook" of item "The Gun
#. Owner's Handbook"
msgid ""
"\"The Complete Beginner's Guide to Precision Rifle Shooting\", this book "
"contains information about shooting equipment, terminology, principles, and "
"covers the theory of long-range shooting.  It has a lot practical advices "
"about marksmanship."
msgstr "\"精确步枪射击的完全入门指南\"，这本书包含了有关射击设备、术语、原则的信息，并涵盖了远程射击的理论，还有很多关于枪法的实用建议。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid "The Rifle-Musket"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rifle-Musket"
msgstr[0] "《步槍 - 毛瑟槍》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Rifle-Musket" of item "The Gun Owner's
#. Handbook"
msgid ""
"\"A Practical Treatise on the Enfield-Pritchett Rifle, Recently Adopted in "
"the British Service\".  This is a practical guide to using the newly adopted "
"P-1853 Enfield Rifle-Musket.  Despite being written in 1854, it still has lot "
"of useful information about shooting, as well as information about how to "
"maintain this antique rifle."
msgstr ""
"\"关于最近在英国军队中采用的恩菲尔德-普里切特步枪的实用论述\"。这是一本关于新采用的P-1853恩菲尔德膛线火枪的实用指南。尽管写于1854"
"年，它仍然有很多关于射击，以及维护这种古董步枪的信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pocket Guide to Firearm Safety"
msgid_plural "copies of Pocket Guide to Firearm Safety"
msgstr[0] "《槍械安全口袋指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "Pocket Guide to Firearm Safety"
msgid ""
"This pocket-sized leather-bound guide to firearm safety combines a wealth of "
"concise information with simple to follow instructions and easy to read "
"illustrations."
msgstr "這個袖珍皮革裝訂的槍械安全指南結合了豐富的資訊， 並且使用簡單的步驟搭配易於閱讀的插圖來說明。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid_plural "copies of Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgstr[0] "《彈道學：理論，設計和應用》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application" of
#. item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"This hefty, hardbound textbook is written in obtuse, complex language.  If "
"you already knew a bit about engineering and fabrication, it might be a "
"useful reference on gunsmithing and design, but without that knowledge it'd "
"be better used to prop up a table."
msgstr ""
"这本大部头精装教材以艰深复杂的语言写成。如果你了解一些工程学和制造的相关知识，那它在枪械制造和设计方面是本有用的参考书；如果一点也不懂的话，那就只能用来垫桌"
"脚了。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid "The Complete Guide to Gunsmithing"
msgid_plural "copies of The Complete Guide to Gunsmithing"
msgstr[0] "《槍械製造大全》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Complete Guide to Gunsmithing" of item
#. "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"This fairly old book is a highly detailed and essential reference for any gun "
"enthusiast, and covers everything from the use of proper tools to how to get "
"a gunsmithing job."
msgstr "这本年代久远的书对于任何枪械爱好者来说都是非常详细和必备的参考资料，涵盖了从合适工具的使用到如何获得枪械制造工作的一切。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid "Professional Gunsmithing"
msgid_plural "copies of Professional Gunsmithing"
msgstr[0] "《專業槍械製造》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Professional Gunsmithing" of item "Ballistics:
#. Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"A guide for gun shop owners, this book contains lots of information about "
"weapons and weapon maintenance."
msgstr "写给枪械店老板的指南，包含了很多关于武器及其维护的信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid "Gunsmithing - Rifles"
msgid_plural "copies of Gunsmithing - Rifles"
msgstr[0] "《槍械製造 - 步槍》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Gunsmithing - Rifles" of item "Ballistics:
#. Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"The book contains step-by-step instructions to repair and maintain all major "
"rifle types, from the AR-15 and AK-47 to the M1 Garand.  It also details many "
"different projects and enhancements for gun owners."
msgstr "该书包含了从 AR-15、AK-47 到 M1 加兰德等所有主要步枪类型的维修和保养的逐步说明。里面还有枪主可能感兴趣的各种改装升级项目的详解。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"Gunsmithing: A Manual of Firearm Design, Construction, Alteration and "
"Remodeling"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Gunsmithing: A Manual of Firearm Design, Construction, Alteration "
"and Remodeling"
msgstr[0] "《槍械製造：槍械設計、製造、改裝改造手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Gunsmithing: A Manual of Firearm Design,
#. Construction, Alteration and Remodeling" of item "Ballistics: Theory,
#. Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"This book contains extremely precise instructions for fixing different issues "
"with your gun.  Having lots of modern photos is a huge advantage, though the "
"fact that it's a reprint of a book from the 1950s is not."
msgstr "这本书包含修复各种枪械故障的相当详细的步骤讲解。这本书的优点是里面有许多清晰的现代图片，但缺点是这本书只是 1950 年代的一本书籍的重印版。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid "The Guns of John Moses Browning"
msgid_plural "copies of The Guns of John Moses Browning"
msgstr[0] "《約翰·白朗寧的槍》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Guns of John Moses Browning" of item
#. "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"A major biography of John Moses Browning, \"the Thomas Edison of guns\", this "
"book describes his story, and the inventions he made, as well as decisions "
"behind their development, processes, manufacturing, and usage."
msgstr ""
"一本关于约翰·摩西·勃朗宁——\"枪械界的托马斯·爱迪生\""
"——的大型传记，讲述了勃朗宁的故事、他所发明的枪支以及这些枪支的研发、生产、组装、投入使用等环节背后的种种细节。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid "DIY Guns: Easy DIY Gunsmithing Projects"
msgid_plural "issues of DIY Guns: Easy DIY Gunsmithing Projects"
msgstr[0] "《輕輕鬆鬆 DIY 槍械製造與改裝》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "DIY Guns: Easy DIY Gunsmithing Projects" of item
#. "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"A big magazine about different gunsmithing projects, from tuning your gun to "
"making a brand new one using common techniques."
msgstr "一本厚厚的杂志，记载了各种改枪的案例，从如何校准你的枪支到如何造一支全新的都有记载。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ballistics: Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid "The Book of the Crossbow"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of the Crossbow"
msgstr[0] "《十字弓之書》"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Book of the Crossbow" of item "Ballistics:
#. Theory, Design, and Application"
msgid ""
"This book details the long story of crossbows - a devastating weapon which "
"improved medieval distance warfare drastically - with lot of illustrations "
"and information about additional weapons, like ballistae and catapults."
msgstr "这本书详细梳理了十字弩——一种彻底改变了中世纪近距离作战的强力武器——的历史，配有许多插图，还顺带介绍了弩炮和投石车等武器。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid_plural "issues of High Explosives Quarterly"
msgstr[0] "《烈性炸藥季刊》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of "High Explosives Quarterly"
#. ~ Description of variant "High Explosives Quarterly" of item "High
#. Explosives Quarterly"
msgid ""
"An interesting quarterly report about rocket launchers and recoilless rifles. "
" There are lots of large, exciting photos of explosions and weaponry."
msgstr "內容關於火箭發射器和無後座力炮的一個有趣的季刊。有很多大篇幅與令人興奮的爆炸照片和武器裝備。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid "Launchers, Lobbers and Rockets Engineer"
msgid_plural "copies of Launchers, Lobbers and Rockets Engineer"
msgstr[0] "《發射器、投彈器和火箭工程師》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Launchers, Lobbers and Rockets Engineer" of item
#. "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid ""
"DIY guide about different ballistic launchers, how they work, and how to "
"build one."
msgstr "关于各种弹道发射器的DIY指南书，讲述它们的工作原理与实现方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid "Katyusha"
msgid_plural "copies of Katyusha"
msgstr[0] "《Katyusha 多火箭發射器》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Katyusha" of item "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid ""
"This book shows the history of Soviet Multiple Rocket Launcher systems, "
"developed in a late 1930s, the reasons to use it, problems solved while "
"designing them, and tactics for using them."
msgstr "这本书介绍了苏联于1930年代末期研发的多重火箭弹发射器系统的发展历史，还讲了选择它的理由，设计时的困难和具体使用方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid "The Rocket Propelled Grenade"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rocket Propelled Grenade"
msgstr[0] "《火箭推進榴彈》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Rocket Propelled Grenade" of item "High
#. Explosives Quarterly"
msgid ""
"Part of a big series about different small arms, this book details RPGs - how "
"they were created, how they were used, and how they are used now in modern "
"times."
msgstr "这本书是关于不同小型武器的系列丛书的一部分，详细介绍了RPG——它们是如何被创造出来的，它们是曾经如何被使用的，以及它们在现代是如何使用的。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid "Field Artillery"
msgid_plural "issues of Field Artillery"
msgstr[0] "《野戰砲兵》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Field Artillery" of item "High Explosives
#. Quarterly"
msgid ""
"A professional magazine about artillery, published by the US Field Artillery "
"Corps.  Lots of articles analyze using modern artillery in different wars, "
"modern and future technologies, and the most recent discoveries in ballistics "
"and field engineering."
msgstr "一本关于炮兵的专业杂志，由美国野战炮兵出版。里面许多文章分析了现代火炮在不同战争中的使用，现代和未来的技术，以及弹道学和野战工程的最新发现。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid_plural "copies of Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgstr[0] "《簡氏迫擊砲和火箭發射器》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
#. ~ Description of variant "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers" of item
#. "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid ""
"An incredibly detailed guide to modern rockets, mortars, grenade launchers, "
"and recoilless weaponry.  Lavishly illustrated with color photographs, it "
"contains a wealth of information."
msgstr "一個令人難以置信的詳細指南， 內容有關於現代火箭、迫擊砲、榴彈發射器、和無後坐力武器。內含珍貴插圖與彩色照片， 並有許多豐富的資訊。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid "U.S. Grenade Launchers"
msgid_plural "copies of U.S. Grenade Launchers"
msgstr[0] "《美國榴彈發射器》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "U.S. Grenade Launchers" of item "Jane's Mortars
#. and Rocket Launchers"
msgid ""
"Part of a big series about different small arms, this book tells about the "
"M79.  Created to fill the gap between hand grenade and light mortar, this "
"weapon became an iconic symbol of the Vietnam War, and still serves its role "
"perfectly."
msgstr ""
"作为关于不同小型武器的大型系列的一部分，这本书讲述了 "
"M79。这种武器旨在填补手榴弹和轻型迫击炮之间的空白，成为越南战争的标志性象征，并且仍然完美地发挥其作用。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid "Catalogue of Standard Ordnance Items: Volume 3 & 4"
msgid_plural "copies of Catalogue of Standard Ordnance Items: Volume 3 & 4"
msgstr[0] "《標準軍械品目錄：第 3 卷和第 4 卷》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Catalogue of Standard Ordnance Items: Volume 3 &
#. 4" of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid ""
"A giant, comprehensive list of every U.S. Army weapon, munition, and piece of "
"equipment that was used during World War II, with small, but detailed "
"information about each of them.  Volume 3 describes light weapons like "
"grenade launchers, recoilless rifles, man-portable anti-tank and air-defense "
"missiles and mortars, and Volume 4 describes different heavy ammunition from "
"20mm to 16 inch hand and rifle grenades."
msgstr ""
"一份巨大而全面的清单，列出了第二次世界大战期间使用的每件美国陆军武器、弹药和装备，并附有关于每一种的小而详细的信息。第3"
"卷描述了榴弹发射器、无后坐力步枪、便携式反坦克和防空导弹和迫击炮等轻武器，第4卷描述了从20毫米到16英寸(约41厘米)的各种重型弹药。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid "FM 3-09: Fire Support and Field Artillery Operations"
msgid_plural "copies of FM 3-09: Fire Support and Field Artillery Operations"
msgstr[0] "《FM 3-09：火力支援與野戰砲兵作戰》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "FM 3-09: Fire Support and Field Artillery
#. Operations" of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid ""
"Official U.S. Army manual about principles and functions for fire support "
"elements and field artillery.  Most of it is about the functions and "
"operations of artillery, alongside some ballistic calculations."
msgstr "关于火力支援部队和野战炮兵的原理和功能的美国陆军官方手册。其中大部分是关于火炮的功能和操作，也一些弹道计算。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid "FM 3-22.3: Stryker Gunnery"
msgid_plural "copies of FM 3-22.3: Stryker Gunnery"
msgstr[0] "《FM 3-22.3：史崔克火砲裝甲車》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "FM 3-22.3: Stryker Gunnery" of item "Jane's
#. Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid ""
"Official U.S. Army manual about using different light weapons - M203, ITAS "
"M41, TOW and Javelins."
msgstr "美国陆军的官方手册，讲述如何使用Stryker装甲车车载武器，如M203、M41陶氏反坦克导弹和标枪反坦克导弹等。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid "FM 23-11: 90mm Recoilless Rifle, M67"
msgid_plural "copies of FM 23-11: 90mm Recoilless Rifle, M67"
msgstr[0] "《FM 23-11：90mm 無後座力砲，M67》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "FM 23-11: 90mm Recoilless Rifle, M67" of item
#. "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid ""
"Official U.S. Army manual for using the M67 anti-tank rifle - theory, "
"practice, and essential information."
msgstr "美国陆军的官方手册，讲述如何使用M67反坦克炮，包括理论、练习方法和相关信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid "Jane's Flamethrowers and Firestarters"
msgid_plural "copies of Jane's Flamethrowers and Firestarters"
msgstr[0] "《簡氏火焰噴射器和燃燒武器》"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Jane's Flamethrowers and Firestarters" of item
#. "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid ""
"A detailed, full-colored guide to flamethrowers, incendiary weapons, and "
"napalm.  It builds off of information provided in its sister book, Jane's "
"Mortars and Rocket Launchers, and so it's mostly incomprehensible to anyone "
"without prior knowledge."
msgstr ""
"火焰噴射器，燃燒武器和凝固汽油彈的詳細全彩指南。它建立在其姊妹書《簡氏迫擊砲和火箭發射器》中提供的信息之上，因此對於沒有該領域知識的人來說，這本書幾乎是不可"
"理解的。"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgid "MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgid_plural "copies of MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgstr[0] "《MIT的開鎖指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
#. ~ Description of "MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
#. ~ Description of variant "MIT Guide to Lock Picking" of item "MIT Guide to
#. Lock Picking"
msgid ""
"A home-made booklet with large black-and-white pictures of several types of "
"modern locks and general information on how to crack them open."
msgstr "一本自制的小册子，上面有着一些巨大的现代锁结构的黑白图示，以及如何打开它们的基本资料。"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgid "The CIA Lockpicking Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of The CIA Lockpicking Manual"
msgstr[0] "《中央情報局開鎖手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The CIA Lockpicking Manual" of item "MIT Guide to
#. Lock Picking"
msgid ""
"It says it is a reproduction of the United States Central Intelligence "
"Agency's Field Operative Training Manual that describes how to lockpick.  For "
"such a big name it has a surprisingly small amount of information, only "
"covering the topic on a very basic level."
msgstr "这本书自称来自美国中央情报局（CIA）关于撬锁的行动训练手册。盛名之下却难符其实，只讲了很基础的撬锁内容。"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgid "Keys To The Kingdom"
msgid_plural "copies of Keys To The Kingdom"
msgstr[0] "《王國的鑰匙》"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Keys To The Kingdom" of item "MIT Guide to Lock
#. Picking"
msgid ""
"This book contain lots of information for experienced lockpickers, like "
"possible tools that can be used, different types of locks that were produced, "
"and even some tips to avoid lockpicking - sometimes it's easier to break a "
"lock, door, or even wall itself."
msgstr "这本书包含了撬锁匠的经验，包括工具的选用、锁具的结构，甚至有避免被撬锁的技巧。\"有些时候撬锁很难，与其撬开它还不如暴力拆锁，甚至是暴力拆墙\"。"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgid "E-Z Picking Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of E-Z Picking Manual"
msgstr[0] "《輕輕鬆鬆學開鎖》"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
#. ~ Description of variant "E-Z Picking Manual" of item "MIT Guide to Lock
#. Picking"
msgid ""
"The combined experience of a few different locksmiths of how to do it "
"properly, what skillset is required, and where it is legal to use it.  It "
"says it comes with a DVD, but you can't find it anywhere nearby."
msgstr "综合了几个不同锁匠的经验，讲解如何正确地撬锁，需要哪些技巧，以及在何处使用才合法的。书上说附赠有DVD，但书页里没有，估计已经找不到了。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handwritten note"
msgid_plural "handwritten notes"
msgstr[0] "手寫筆記"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Description of "handwritten note"
msgid ""
"A small, meticulously folded piece of paper, filled with tiny handwriting and "
"some surprisingly precise diagrams of subway tunnels, ventilation shafts, "
"and… guard shifts?  You have the feeling they weren't supposed to write any "
"of this stuff down."
msgstr "一张精心折叠的小纸条，上面写满了细小的笔迹和一张令人惊讶的精确地铁隧道图，通风井，还有……警卫值班表？你觉得他们不应该把这些东西就这样随意的记录下来。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "handwritten note"
msgid "You add the hidden stations to your map"
msgstr "你將隱藏地點標繪在地圖上。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military operations map"
msgid_plural "military operations maps"
msgstr[0] "軍事行動地圖"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Description of "military operations map"
msgid ""
"A printed topographical map of the local area.  Originally of military "
"origin, it details the locations of evacuation centers and military "
"facilities.  Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr "一份本地区的打印地形图。地图资料来自军方，详细记录了疏散中心和军事设施的位置。使用这份地图后会往你的地图上添加几个目标地点。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "military operations map"
msgid "You add roads and facilities to your map."
msgstr "你將公路和設施標繪在你的地圖上。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "survivor's map"
msgid_plural "survivor's maps"
msgstr[0] "生存者地圖"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Description of "survivor's map"
msgid ""
"A hand-drawn map of the local area.  Whoever created it has marked down the "
"locations of nearby supply sources including gun stores and gas stations.  "
"Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr "一份当地的手绘地图。绘制这份地图的人标记了附近的物资补给点，包括枪店和加油站。使用它会在你的地图上将这些地方标注出来。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "survivor's map"
msgid "You add roads and possible supply points to your map."
msgstr "你將公路及可能的補給點標繪在你的地圖上。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "road map"
msgid_plural "road maps"
msgstr[0] "公路地圖"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Description of "road map"
msgid ""
"A road map for the local area.  Listing information on civic sites like "
"hospitals and police stations, it can be used to add points of interest to "
"your map."
msgstr "一张本地行车路线图。主要标记了公共服务场所，如医院、警察局等等。使用后会在你的地图上将这些地方标注出来。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "road map"
msgid "You add roads and points of interest to your map."
msgstr "你將公路和特殊地點標繪在你的地圖上。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "subway maintenance map"
msgid_plural "subway maintenance maps"
msgstr[0] "地下鐵維護地圖"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Description of "subway maintenance map"
msgid ""
"A map of subway tunnels formerly used by public maintenance workers.  Using "
"it will add subway lines and underground stations to your map."
msgstr "一张曾经由维修人员使用的地铁线路图。使用后会在你的地图上将这些地方标注出来。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "subway maintenance map"
msgid "You add subway lines and underground stations to your map."
msgstr "你在地圖上標記了地鐵路線和地鐵站。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "subway map"
msgid_plural "subway maps"
msgstr[0] "地铁地图"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Description of "subway map"
msgid ""
"A schematic diagram of local subway networks, too stylized to garter much "
"useful information.  Using it will add subway stations to your map."
msgstr "当地地铁网络的示意图，然而太过花里胡哨，无法提供太多有用的信息。使用它可以将地铁站添加到地图中。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "subway map"
msgid "You add subway stations to your map."
msgstr "你在地图上标记了地铁站。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "drainage system map"
msgid_plural "drainage system maps"
msgstr[0] "排水系统地图"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
#. ~ Description of "drainage system map"
msgid ""
"A map of sewers formerly used by public maintenance workers.  Using it will "
"add sewer systems and facilities to your map."
