msgid "Official Taekwondo Training Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of Official Taekwondo Training Manual"
msgstr[0] "《官方跆拳道訓練手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Description of "Official Taekwondo Training Manual"
msgid "A complete guide to Taekwondo."
msgstr "一部完整的跆拳道指南。"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Becoming One with the Tao"
msgid_plural "copies of Becoming One with the Tao"
msgstr[0] "《混元一氣》"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Description of "Becoming One with the Tao"
msgid "A complete guide to T'ai Chi Ch'uan."
msgstr "一本完整的太極拳拳譜。"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The White Tiger"
msgid_plural "copies of The White Tiger"
msgstr[0] "《白虎》"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Description of "The White Tiger"
msgid "A complete guide to Tiger Kung Fu."
msgstr "一本完整的虎形拳拳譜秘籍。"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Zui Quan and You"
msgid_plural "copies of Zui Quan and You"
msgstr[0] "《醉拳拳法》"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Description of "Zui Quan and You"
msgid "A complete guide to Zui Quan."
msgstr "一部完整的醉拳拳譜。"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Way of the Spear"
msgid_plural "copies of The Way of the Spear"
msgstr[0] "《矛之道》"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Description of "The Way of the Spear"
msgid "A complete guide to Sōjutsu."
msgstr "一部完整的日本槍術指南。"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Beautiful Springtime"
msgid_plural "copies of Beautiful Springtime"
msgstr[0] "《詠春拳譜》"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Description of "Beautiful Springtime"
msgid "A complete guide to Wing Chun Kung-fu."
msgstr "一本詠春功夫的完整指南。"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Description of "Fior Di Battaglia"
msgid ""
"A completely translated medieval guide teaching various techniques with "
"polearms.  There is a chapter about the many variations of common polearms… "
"there are even pictures!"
msgstr "一本完全翻譯的中世紀指南，教授各種長柄武器技術。 有一章介紹常見長柄武器的多種變體……甚至還有圖片！"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Historic European Swordfighting"
msgid_plural "copies of Historic European Swordfighting"
msgstr[0] "《歷史悠久的歐洲劍術》"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
#. ~ Description of "Historic European Swordfighting"
msgid ""
"A complete guide to medieval swordsmanship.  Compares the German and Italian "
"traditions for a multitude of swords, in and out of armor, with and without "
"shield."
msgstr "中世紀劍術完整指南。比較了德國和義大利傳統的各種劍，無論是穿盔甲還是不穿盔甲，帶盾牌還是不帶盾牌。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Internal Combustion Fundamentals"
msgid_plural "copies of Internal Combustion Fundamentals"
msgstr[0] "《內燃機原理》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "Internal Combustion Fundamentals"
msgid ""
"A college-level textbook that details the operation, maintenance, and repair "
"of internal combustion engines."
msgstr "一本大學教科書， 詳細介紹了內燃機引擎的操作、維護和修理。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pneumatic Pnowledge"
msgid_plural "copies of Pneumatic Pnowledge"
msgstr[0] "《空氣動力學》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "Pneumatic Pnowledge"
msgid ""
"A whimsical guide to the world of building and designing compressed air and "
"pneumatic devices, loaded with puns and dry technical diagrams.  It is "
"unclear who the audience for a book like this would be."
msgstr "這是一本關於建造和設計壓縮空氣和氣動設備領域的異想天開的指南，其中充滿了雙關語和枯燥乏味的技術圖表。目前尚不清楚這樣一本書設定的讀者群是誰。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "army improvised field repairs manual"
msgid_plural "army improvised field repairs manuals"
msgstr[0] "軍用應急修理手冊"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "army improvised field repairs manual"
msgid ""
"A compact manual with faded print detailing a number of improvised field "
"repairs that can be made to vehicles."
msgstr "一本印刷褪色的小手冊， 詳細介紹了一些對車輛進行臨時野戰修理的方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Popular Mechanics"
msgid_plural "issues of Popular Mechanics"
msgstr[0] "《流行機械誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "Popular Mechanics"
msgid ""
"A magazine about mechanical innovations.  Full of entertaining articles and "
"advertisements for esoteric gadgets."
msgstr "一本關於機械創新的雜誌。充滿各種關於科技小玩意的有趣的文章和廣告。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makerspace kit instructions"
msgid_plural "copies of makerspace kit instructions"
msgstr[0] "《創客學習工具說明書》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "makerspace kit instructions"
msgid ""
"Instructions and blueprints for dozens of projects of increasing complexity "
"for anyone new to the maker community."
msgstr "一打以上的說明書和藍圖，複雜度逐漸提高，適合任何新加入創客社群的人學習娛樂。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "robotics kit instructions"
msgid_plural "copies of robotics kit instructions"
msgstr[0] "《機器人玩具說明書》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "robotics kit instructions"
msgid ""
"Instructions and blueprints for dozens of projects of increasing complexity.  "
"An introduction to toy robots."
msgstr "數十個項目的說明和藍圖，複雜逐步增加。玩具機器人的入門簡介。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Stirling engine kit instructions"
msgid_plural "copies of Stirling engine instructions"
msgstr[0] "《史特靈引擎說明書》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "Stirling engine kit instructions"
msgid ""
"Instructions and blueprints for building toy Stirling engines.  An "
"introduction to engine principles."
msgstr "製造玩具史特靈引擎的藍圖和說明書。適合引擎原理入門。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Under the Hood"
msgid_plural "copies of Under the Hood"
msgstr[0] "《深入了解汽車引擎》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "Under the Hood"
msgid "An advanced mechanics manual, covering all sorts of topics."
msgstr "一本深入探討機械力學的動力雜誌， 涵蓋了各種主題。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lab journal-Curie"
msgid_plural "lab journals-Curie"
msgstr[0] "《實驗室日誌 - Curie》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "lab journal-Curie"
msgid ""
"This lab notebook is filled with the collective discoveries and refinements "
"of a research team dedicated to nuclear energy.  You don't think you're ready "
"to start a second Cataclysm, but the general information provided might be "
"useful…"
msgstr "這本實驗室筆記本寫滿了致力於核能研究的團隊的集體發現和改進。你認為你還沒有準備好開始第二次大災變，但提供的一般資訊可能會有用..."

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hot Rod Chassis & Suspension Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Hot Rod Handbook"
msgstr[0] "《飛車改裝手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "Hot Rod Chassis & Suspension Handbook"
msgid ""
"By learning the fundamentals of chassis building and suspension design you "
"will gain the critical knowledge needed to hot rod properly."
msgstr "透過學習底盤構造和懸吊設計的基礎知識，你將獲得正確改裝高速汽車所需的關鍵知識。"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mechanical Mastery"
msgid_plural "copies of Mechanical Mastery"
msgstr[0] "《機械達人》"

#: data/json/items/book/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of "Mechanical Mastery"
msgid ""
"An advanced guide on mechanics and welding, covering topics like \"Grinding "
"off rust\" and \"Making cursive E's\"."
msgstr "一本先進的力學和焊接指南， 涵蓋了許多其他書籍的內容。"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid "CQB Monthly"
msgid_plural "issues of CQB Monthly"
msgstr[0] "《近戰格鬥月刊》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "CQB Monthly"
#. ~ Description of variant "CQB Monthly" of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid ""
"An in-depth look at various styles of close quarters fighting.  There's an "
"amusing essay about dirty tricks in the front section."
msgstr "一本讓你深入了解各種不同風格近身格鬥的月刊。開頭有一部分關於耍賤招的有趣文章。"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid "Savage Street Fighting"
msgid_plural "copies of Savage Street Fighting"
msgstr[0] "《野蠻街頭鬥毆》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Savage Street Fighting" of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid ""
"A barbaric guide detailing how to win a fight in the worst possible scenarios "
"- mostly about how to retreat from such a fight, but it still has some "
"information in case you have no another way."
msgstr "一本野蠻的指南，詳細介紹瞭如何在最糟糕的情況下贏得一場戰鬥——主要是關於如何從這樣的戰鬥中撤退，但它仍然提供了一些資訊，以防你沒有其他退路。"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid "Maximum Damage"
msgid_plural "copies of Maximum Damage"
msgstr[0] "《最大傷害》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Maximum Damage" of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid ""
"This book teaches how to predict enemy attacks, with a nice explanation of "
"how to react to each of them - both defense and counterattacks."
msgstr "這本書教授如何預測敵人的攻擊，並很好地解釋如何應對每種攻擊 - 防禦和反擊。"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid "Out of the Cage"
msgid_plural "copies of Out of the Cage"
msgstr[0] "《走出八角籠》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Out of the Cage" of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid ""
"This book shows lot of techniques to defeat an experienced martial artist - "
"brutal and dirty."
msgstr "這本書展示了許多擊敗經驗豐富的武術家的技巧——殘酷且骯髒。"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid "Combat Pressure Points"
msgid_plural "copies of Combat Pressure Points"
msgstr[0] "《專打要害》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Combat Pressure Points" of item "CQB Monthly"
msgid ""
"An illustrated handbook about the human body, how it works, and how to "
"destroy it with fairly easy steps."
msgstr "這是一本關於人體的結構、如何運作以及如何透過相當簡單的步驟摧毀人體的圖文並茂的手冊。"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgid "Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgstr[0] "《近身格鬥技巧手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
#. ~ Description of variant "Close Quarter Fighting Manual" of item "Close
#. Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgid ""
"A well-thumbed hardbound book which illustrates simple strategies and "
"techniques for close quarters combat encounters."
msgstr "很好翻的一本精裝書， 內容有插畫來說明簡單的近身格鬥策略和技巧。"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgid "Survival Weapons"
msgid_plural "copies of Survival Weapons"
msgstr[0] "《生存武器》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Survival Weapons" of item "Close Quarter Fighting
#. Manual"
msgid ""
"\"Will You Be The Last One Standing?\", asks the author on the first page.  "
"You don't know the answer, but this book contains plenty of info to reach "
"this target."
msgstr "「你會成為最後一個站著的人嗎？」，作者在第一頁上問道。你不知道答案，但是本書包含了實現這一目標的大量資訊。"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgid "Facing Violence"
msgid_plural "copies of Facing Violence"
msgstr[0] "《面對暴力》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Facing Violence" of item "Close Quarter Fighting
#. Manual"
msgid ""
"Different techniques to end the fight fast, easy, and without going to "
"prison.  Luckily no one can imprison you anymore!"
msgstr "各種技巧可以快速、輕鬆地結束戰鬥，而且無需入獄。幸運的是，沒有人可以再囚禁你了！"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Close Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgid "Training for Sudden Violence"
msgid_plural "copies of Training for Sudden Violence"
msgstr[0] "《突發暴力應對訓練》"

#: data/json/items/book/melee.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Training for Sudden Violence" of item "Close
#. Quarter Fighting Manual"
msgid ""
"This book contains professional instructions to prepare and prevail in "
"dangerous situations, both physically and psychologically."
msgstr "本書包含了在身體和心理上為危險情況做好準備並戰勝危險的專業指導。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Zombie Survival Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of Zombie Survival Guide"
msgstr[0] "《末日求生指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Zombie Survival Guide"
msgid ""
"While this seems like it would be very useful in this situation, the sheer "
"amount of misinformation present makes it practically useless."
msgstr "在目前這情形下， 這本書乍看起來很實用， 但是裡面充滿了與事實相差甚遠的知識， 使得這本書變成跟廢物沒兩樣。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black box transcript"
msgid_plural "black box transcripts"
msgstr[0] "黑盒子紀錄"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "black box transcript"
msgid "A full flight log for a military aircraft.  Nothing of interest stands out."
msgstr "軍機飛行的黑盒子， 紀錄飛行紀錄與相關參數， 沒什麼特別的地方。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ranch Prospectus"
msgid_plural "Ranch Prospectus"
msgstr[0] "《牧場創建計劃書》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Ranch Prospectus"
msgid ""
"A short paper of the economic viability of constructing an agricultural "
"outpost."
msgstr "一篇簡短文章， 講述建造農業哨站在經濟方面的可行性。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "standpipe maintenance log"
msgid ""
"This binder details the scheduled maintenance for several plumbing systems "
"throughout the facility."
msgstr "這個文件詳細記錄了貫穿各設施的管道系統的維護狀況。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "book of essays"
msgid_plural "books of essays"
msgstr[0] "《散文書籍》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "book of essays"
msgid ""
"A collection of essays by various authors from around the world, including "
"works by Churchill, Mailer, Eco, and Voltaire."
msgstr "蒐羅世界各地不同作者的散文作品的合集， 其中包括丘吉爾、梅勒、艾可、和伏爾泰。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Cataclysm"
msgid_plural "copies of The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Cataclysm"
msgstr[0] "《災變漫游指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Cataclysm"
msgid ""
"Inscribed on the cover in large, friendly letters, is the message \"Don't "
"Panic\"."
msgstr "封面上用易讀的字體寫著大大的 \"別慌\"。(此物品引用電影: \"星際大奇航\" 海報的梗)"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "comic book"
msgid_plural "comic books"
msgstr[0] "《漫畫》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "comic book"
msgid "A super-hero comic."
msgstr "一本超級英雄漫畫。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Computer Gaming"
msgid_plural "issues of Computer Gaming"
msgstr[0] "《電腦遊戲雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Computer Gaming"
msgid "Reviews of recently released computer games and previews of upcoming titles."
msgstr "登載已發售電腦遊戲的評論以及未發售遊戲的介紹。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "TIME magazine"
msgid_plural "TIME magazines"
msgstr[0] "《時代雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "TIME magazine"
msgid "Current events concerning a bunch of people who're all (un)dead now."
msgstr "報導一堆有名的人， 不論現在他們現在是死是活， 死了又活， 或是活了又死的。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Analyst"
msgid_plural "issues of The Analyst"
msgstr[0] "《分析師雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The Analyst"
msgid ""
"This news magazine has been described as \"a kind of Reader's Digest for "
"America's corporate elite.\"  These concerns are, of course, behind us now."
msgstr "這本新聞雜誌被形容為「一種企業菁英的讀者文摘。」 上面的各種擔憂，當然現在都可以拋諸腦後了。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Playboy"
msgid_plural "issues of Playboy"
msgstr[0] "《花花公子》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Playboy"
msgid "You can read it for the articles.  Or not."
msgstr "基本上這個雜誌的內容不用說明了。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Rural Digest-Examiner"
msgid_plural "issues of Rural Digest-Examiner"
msgstr[0] "《鄉村文摘》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Rural Digest-Examiner"
msgid ""
"A newsweekly covering regional events.  There is an article on the winter's "
"snowstorms and several letters to the editor concerning the community "
"response."
msgstr "一個區域性的新聞週刊。有一篇關於冰風暴的文章與讀者來信的專欄。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "adventure novel"
msgid_plural "adventure novels"
msgstr[0] "《冒險小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "adventure novel"
msgid ""
"The stirring tale of a race against time, in search of a lost city located in "
"the heart of the African continent."
msgstr "一個與時間賽跑的熱血故事， 內容是關於搜索一個坐落於非洲大陸的失落城市。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "buddy novel"
msgid_plural "buddy novels"
msgstr[0] "《兄弟小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "buddy novel"
msgid ""
"A gripping tale of two friends struggling to survive on the streets of New "
"York City."
msgstr "一個扣人心弦的故事， 講述兩個朋友在紐約市街頭掙扎求存。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crime novel"
msgid_plural "crime novels"
msgstr[0] "《犯罪小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "crime novel"
msgid ""
"After their diamond heist goes wrong, the surviving criminals begin to "
"suspect that one of them is a police informant."
msgstr "鑽石搶劫案出錯後， 倖存的罪犯開始懷疑， 同伴其中一人是警方的線人。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "crime novel"
msgid ""
"A story about three people in the fictional city of Los Santos: a gangster, "
"an upper-class man, and a psychopath.  They eventually band together to pull "
"off the biggest heist in the city's history."
msgstr "虚构都市洛圣都的三重奏：一个街头混混、上流精英与疯子的命运交织。他们最终联手策划了这座城市史上最疯狂的惊天劫案。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Murdered by the Grapevine"
msgid_plural "copies of Murdered by the Grapevine"
msgstr[0] "《被葡萄藤謀殺》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Murdered by the Grapevine"
msgid ""
"This cheap paperback tells the story of a mob boss done in by mere suspicion. "
" She never breaks a confidence, never rats out an accomplice, and never turns "
"her back on a friend.  Nonetheless her grip on the reigns of the underworld "
"is eroded by rumor and paranoia."
msgstr "這本廉價的平裝書講述了一個黑幫老大因懷疑而陷入困境的故事。她從不洩漏秘密，從不出賣同夥，從不背棄朋友。儘管如此，她對黑社會的統治仍被謠言和偏執所削弱。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Midnight Cop"
msgid_plural "copies of Midnight Cop"
msgstr[0] "《午夜警探》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Midnight Cop"
msgid ""
"In this bare-knuckled potboiler, a ruthless police detective schemes to shut "
"down local crime lords by pitting them against each other.  When "
"long-simmering resentments finally flare the city learns why they call it "
"\"the dead of night.\""
msgstr ""
"在這部赤裸裸的爛作品中，一名冷酷無情的警探計畫透過讓當地的犯罪頭目相互競爭來取締他們。當醞釀已久的怨恨終於爆發時，這座城市才明白為什麼他們稱之為「暗夜死神」"
"。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "drama novel"
msgid_plural "drama novels"
msgstr[0] "《戲劇小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "drama novel"
msgid "A real book for real adults."
msgstr "一本貨真價實的書，僅供成人閱讀。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "erotic novel"
msgid_plural "erotic novels"
msgstr[0] "《色情小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "erotic novel"
msgid "A hackneyed fictional narrative concealing low-grade literary smut."
msgstr "一本陳腔濫調的虛構敘事小說，包藏著低級的文學色情內容。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "experimental novel"
msgid_plural "experimental novels"
msgstr[0] "《實驗小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "experimental novel"
msgid ""
"A bizarre play about the philosophy of existential absurdity.  Or maybe it's "
"about two guys waiting for their friend to show up.  It's confusing."
msgstr "關於存在主義荒誕哲學的一個奇怪故事。或者只是在講述兩個傢伙在等他們的朋友現身。讓人猜不透。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fantasy novel"
msgid_plural "fantasy novels"
msgstr[0] "《奇幻小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "fantasy novel"
msgid "Basic sword & sorcery."
msgstr "劍與巫術。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horror novel"
msgid_plural "horror novels"
msgstr[0] "《恐怖小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "horror novel"
msgid "Maybe not the best reading material considering the situation."
msgstr "考慮目前的情況， 這東西也許不是最好的閱讀材料。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mystery novel"
msgid_plural "mystery novels"
msgstr[0] "《推理小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "mystery novel"
msgid "A detective investigates an unusual murder in a secluded location."
msgstr "一個僻靜的地點， 一起不尋常的謀殺， 一名偵探。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "road novel"
msgid_plural "road novels"
msgstr[0] "《公路小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "road novel"
msgid ""
"A tale about a group of friends who wander the USA in the 1960s against a "
"backdrop of jazz, poetry and drug use."
msgstr "講述了一群朋友在美國 60 年代， 爵士樂、詩歌、藥物濫用的背景下的漂泊故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Gore Longitude"
msgid_plural "copies of Gore Longitude"
msgstr[0] "《血色子午線》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Gore Longitude"
msgid ""
"Award-winning author Cornac McCaffordy weaves a chilling tale of horror and "
"strife, following the compellingly lucrative, seductively dangerous bounty "
"hunting and scalping trade across the western frontier."
msgstr "獲獎作家科馬克·麥卡錫編撰了一個關於恐怖和衝突的令人毛骨悚然的故事，講述了西部拓荒邊境利潤豐厚、危險誘人的賞金狩獵和剝頭皮交易的故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "romance novel"
msgid_plural "romance novels"
msgstr[0] "《愛情小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "romance novel"
msgid "Drama and mild smut."
msgstr "充滿戲劇性與中二病的小說。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Love and Circuses"
msgid_plural "copies of Love and Circuses"
msgstr[0] "《愛與馬戲團》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Love and Circuses"
msgid ""
"The passionate saga of two Boston politicians fiercely battling each other "
"for the mayor's office, and for Lydia's hand in marriage."
msgstr "兩位波士頓政客為市長職位和莉迪亞的婚姻而激烈爭奪的激情傳奇故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cloven Kisses"
msgid_plural "copies of Cloven Kisses"
msgstr[0] "《魔蹄之吻》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Cloven Kisses"
msgid ""
"When the devil falls in love with a warlock, his proposal must be infernally "
"wicked.  Will hooves, horns, and the scent of sulfur condemn love's flames to "
"hellfire?"
msgstr "当魔鬼与一个男巫坠入爱河时，他们的求婚仪式一定邪恶至极。蹄子、尖角和硫磺的气味会把爱情之焰变为地狱之火吗？"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Conquer Me Sweetly"
msgid_plural "copies of Conquer Me Sweetly"
msgstr[0] "《甜蜜地征服我》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Conquer Me Sweetly"
msgid ""
"Sweet Providence Books is delighted to offer you this romantic tale of "
"delicious dalliances and daring delights."
msgstr "甜蜜的天意出版社很荣幸能为你呈现这份充满了美味调情和大胆欢愉的浪漫小说。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Dubliner's Debutante"
msgid_plural "copies of Dubliner's Debutante"
msgstr[0] "《都柏林的初次亮相》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Dubliner's Debutante"
msgid ""
"His love songs were only for me, but I preferred the banjo over bagpipes.  "
"How could I ever love a kilted yankee of foreign breeding?"
msgstr "他的情歌只为我而作，但我更喜欢班卓琴而不是风笛。我怎么会喜欢外国血统的北方佬呢？"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Blood Diodes"
msgid_plural "copies of Blood Diodes"
msgstr[0] "《血色二極體》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Blood Diodes"
msgid ""
"He is an automaton, she is a reformed vampire, can love find a way?  In this "
"edgy romance by acclaimed author Kea Dekker, heartbreak is just the beginning."
msgstr "他是个机器人，她是个改过自新的吸血鬼，他们之间的爱情能找到出路吗？在这部由著名作家凯亚·德克尔创作的前卫浪漫小说中，心碎不过是刚刚开始。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Envying Heaven"
msgid_plural "copies of Envying Heaven"
msgstr[0] "《羨慕天堂》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Envying Heaven"
msgid ""
"When her fiancee names a star for her Wanda begins to wonder if an "
"astronomer's wife can ever compete with the allure of the cosmos."
msgstr "当她的未婚夫用她的名字命名一颗星星时，万达开始怀疑作为一位天文学家的妻子的自己能否与宇宙的魅力相媲美。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Tall, Dark, and Gruesome"
msgid_plural "copies of Tall, Dark, and Gruesome"
msgstr[0] "《高大、黑暗、可怕》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Tall, Dark, and Gruesome"
msgid ""
"Fatima's obsession with the dead threatens to consume her when she falls in "
"love with a restless ghost.  In this provocative romp celebrated author Kea "
"Dekker gently lifts the thin veil separating cold bodies from warm."
msgstr "法蒂玛对死者的痴迷可能将她吞噬，她爱上了一个不愿安息的鬼魂。在这部挑逗的浪漫小说中，著名作家凯亚·德克尔轻轻地掀开分隔在冰冷尸体和温暖人体之间的薄纱。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Along Came a Rider"
msgid_plural "copies of Along Came a Rider"
msgstr[0] "《騎手來了》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Along Came a Rider"
msgid ""
"When Beth's career as a pro steeplechase jockey threatens to divide her from "
"her lover, Beth has to act fast.  Will she ever find a man that can keep up "
"with her racing heart?"
msgstr "贝丝作为职业障碍赛马师的生涯开始有把她与她的情人分隔开的危险，她必须迅速采取行动。她能否找到一个能跟得上她的奔腾脉搏的男人呢？"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Rogue's Virtue"
msgid_plural "copies of Rogue's Virtue"
msgstr[0] "《盜亦有道》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Rogue's Virtue"
msgid ""
"Can Victoria reform the fugitive from justice who wooed her with false "
"pretenses and true passion?"
msgstr "維多利亞能否改造那個以虛假藉口和真實熱情追求她的逃犯？"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Death of My Secret Life"
msgid_plural "copies of The Death of My Secret Life"
msgstr[0] "《我的秘密生活的終結》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The Death of My Secret Life"
msgid ""
"Makeda comes out to her family, but she's still got plenty of skeletons in "
"her closet.  Best selling authoress Kea Dekker breaks all the rules in this "
"macabre story of love and lies."
msgstr "瑪凱妲向家人出櫃，但她的衣櫥裡仍然藏著許多秘密。暢銷書女作家凱亞·德克爾在這個關於愛情與謊言的恐怖故事中打破了所有規則。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ ISBN 9781568364278
#. ~ Item name
msgid "samurai novel"
msgid_plural "samurai novels"
msgstr[0] "《武士小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ ISBN 9781568364278
#. ~ Description of "samurai novel"
msgid ""
"The classic tale of a wandering swordsman who comes to a small settlement and "
"is hired to help the townsfolk defend themselves from a band of marauding "
"outlaws.  This hardback is quite hefty."
msgstr "經典的故事， 講述一個小鎮來了一個陌生劍士被雇用來幫忙鎮民防衛， 阻止劫匪的入侵。這本精裝書相當沉重。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "satire novel"
msgid_plural "satire novels"
msgstr[0] "《諷刺小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "satire novel"
msgid ""
"A political satire of the pre-apocalypse world.  Looking back on it from this "
"side of Armageddon makes it seem all the more ridiculous."
msgstr "災變前世界的政治諷刺。大災變後回頭來看， 使得它看起來更加諷刺。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The House of God"
msgid_plural "copies of The House of God"
msgstr[0] "《上帝之家》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The House of God"
msgid ""
"Set in a lightly disguised Boston hospital of high repute, Samuel Shem's "
"novel dives deep into the agony of absurdity."
msgstr "这部以塞缪尔·闪姆笔名出品的小说以一家名声显赫的波士顿医院为背景，稍作修改掩饰，深入探索了其中种种荒谬所带来的痛苦。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Catch-22"
msgid_plural "copies of Catch-22"
msgstr[0] "《第22條軍規》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Catch-22"
msgid ""
"There is a short informational forward in this paperback edition of Catch-22. "
" Apparently the original title for Joseph Heller's excruciatingly brilliant "
"war satire was \"Catch-11.\""
msgstr "这本《第二十二条军规》平装版有份简短介绍背景的前言。显然，约瑟夫·海勒这部极其精彩的战争讽刺小说的初版标题是《第十一条军规》。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780802130112
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Master and Margarita"
msgid_plural "copies of Master and Margarita"
msgstr[0] "《大師與瑪格麗特》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ ISBN 9780802130112
#. ~ Description of "The Master and Margarita"
msgid ""
"Featuring a cast that includes Satan, Pontius Pilate, Jesus Christ, vampires, "
"a talking cat, and the literary elite of Moscow, this novel by Mikhail "
"Bulgakov explores philosophical issues on the nature of good and evil."
msgstr "米哈伊爾·布爾加科夫的這部小說的主角包括撒旦、蓬提烏斯·皮拉圖斯、耶穌基督、吸血鬼、會說話的貓和莫斯科的文學精英，探討了善惡本質的哲學問題。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Handful of Dust"
msgid_plural "copies of A Handful of Dust"
msgstr[0] "《一掬塵土》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "A Handful of Dust"
msgid ""
"Laced with cynicism, Evelyn Waugh's \"A Handful of Dust\" satirizes a stratum "
"of characters who have wealth, but lack any other credentials."
msgstr "伊夫林‧沃的《一掬塵土》充滿了憤世嫉俗，諷刺了一群擁有財富但缺乏任何其他資歷的人物。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cat's Cradle"
msgid_plural "copies of Cat's Cradle"
msgstr[0] "猫的摇篮"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Cat's Cradle"
msgid ""
"A paperback edition of Kurt Vonnegut's fourth novel, in which the threat of "
"nuclear destruction isn't much of an influence on human nature."
msgstr ""
"寇特·馮內果第四部小說的平裝本，書中核子毀滅的威脅對人性沒有太大影響。（譯註：書名「貓的搖籃」是花繩遊戲的一種圖案。那年，（虛構的）「原子彈之父」與孩子玩著"
"名為「貓的搖籃」的翻花繩遊戲；同一時刻，世界上第一顆原子彈落地爆炸…。）"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spy novel"
msgid_plural "spy novels"
msgstr[0] "《間諜小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "spy novel"
msgid "A tale of intrigue and espionage among Nazis, no, Commies, no, Iraqis!"
msgstr ""
"一本充满了阴谋和谍战的故事，对手的阵营扑朔迷离，剧情紧张刺激。\n"
"\"对手是纳粹……不，是共党，不，是伊拉克人！\""

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Come Fly the Treacherous Skies"
msgid_plural "copies of Come Fly the Treacherous Skies"
msgstr[0] "《飛翔在險惡的天空》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Come Fly the Treacherous Skies"
msgid ""
"This tale of intrigue betrays the story of a debonair mechanic driven by a "
"lust for revenge.  As she uncovers a sophisticated network of amateur pilots "
"turned smugglers, the good guys and the bad guys begin to all look the same."
msgstr ""
"这个充斥了各类阴谋的故事揭露了一个温文尔雅的机械师被复仇欲望驱使的故事。当她发现一个由业余飞行员变成的走私犯们构成的复杂地下网络时，好人和坏人的分界开始变得"
"越来越模糊。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Lies, Damn Lies, and Rocket Science"
msgid_plural "copies of Lies, Damn Lies, and Rocket Science"
msgstr[0] "《謊言，該死的謊言，和火箭科學》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Lies, Damn Lies, and Rocket Science"
msgid ""
"This spy novel tells the story of a jaded rocket scientist looking for "
"redemption in all the wrong places.  As selling state secrets becomes her "
"career, she learns there isn't much of difference between a double-agent and "
"a triple-agent."
msgstr "这部间谍小说讲述了一个疲惫的火箭科学家在各种错误的地方寻找自我救赎的故事。随着出卖国家机密成为她的职业，她意识到双重间谍和三重间谍之间没有太大区别。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "swashbuckling novel"
msgid_plural "swashbuckling novels"
msgstr[0] "《霸道小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "swashbuckling novel"
msgid ""
"An exciting seventeenth century tale of how an enslaved Irish doctor and his "
"comrades-in-chains escape and become heroic pirates of the Robin Hood variety."
msgstr "一個刺激的十七世紀故事， 講述一個被奴役的愛爾蘭醫生與他的同志如何逃脫， 並成為了羅賓漢型的英雄海盜。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Black Freighter"
msgid_plural "copies of The Black Freighter"
msgstr[0] "《黑色貨輪》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The Black Freighter"
msgid ""
"Who watches the watchmen?  Pirate Jenny, that's who!  This swashbuckling "
"adventure novel will make you feel swell."
msgstr "誰看守守望者？海盜珍妮，就是這個人！這本華麗地進行大膽而浪漫的冒險小說會讓你感到海浪的洶湧。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Captain Gosnold and the Sea Rovers of Buzzards Bay"
msgid_plural "copies of The Sea Rovers"
msgstr[0] "戈斯诺德船长和秃鹫湾的海盗们"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Captain Gosnold and the Sea Rovers of Buzzards Bay"
msgid ""
"This lengthy paperback novel describes the ocean exploits of Captain Gosnold. "
" The British consider him an outlaw, but in America he is a patriot."
msgstr "这部长篇平装小说描述了戈斯诺德船长的海上冒险之旅。英国人认为他是个亡命之徒，但美国人认为他是个爱国英雄。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Code of the Buccaneer"
msgid_plural "copies of The Buccaneer"
msgstr[0] "海盗守则"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The Code of the Buccaneer"
msgid ""
"The cover of this paperback pirate story shows a shirtless man and a near "
"shirtless woman.  Clearly it is not a dress code."
msgstr "这本平装海盗小说的封面画着一个赤膊上阵的男海盗和一个近乎赤膊上阵的女海盗。显然这本书不是着装守则。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thriller novel"
msgid_plural "thriller novels"
msgstr[0] "《驚悚小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "thriller novel"
msgid "A suspenseful tale of betrayal and revenge."
msgstr "一個懸疑的故事， 有關於背叛和復仇。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tragedy novel"
msgid_plural "tragedy novels"
msgstr[0] "《悲劇小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "tragedy novel"
msgid ""
"The story of two young lovers whose feuding families threaten to keep them "
"apart."
msgstr "兩個年輕的戀人， 受到家族鬥爭的影響， 而使他們分開的故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "war novel"
msgid_plural "war novels"
msgstr[0] "《戰爭小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "war novel"
msgid ""
"A thrilling narrative of survival in a prisoner of war camp during the Second "
"World War, filled with riveting subplots about rat farming and dysentery."
msgstr "講述一個驚心動魄的二戰戰俘營中的生存故事， 內容充滿了老鼠、農業、以及痢疾。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "war novel"
msgid ""
"A story about a Bosnian citizen who goes through many hardships and near "
"death during the breakup of Yugoslavia."
msgstr "一個關於波士尼亞公民在南斯拉夫解體期間， 經歷了許多艱難和接近死亡的故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "western novel"
msgid_plural "western novels"
msgstr[0] "《西部小說》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "western novel"
msgid ""
"The classic tale of a gunfighting stranger who comes to a small settlement "
"and is hired to help the townsfolk defend themselves from a band of marauding "
"outlaws."
msgstr "經典的故事， 講述一個小鎮來了一個陌生槍手被雇用來幫忙鎮民防衛， 阻止劫匪的入侵。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Atwixt a Brace of Cacti"
msgid_plural "copies of Atwixt a Brace of Cacti"
msgstr[0] "在一对仙人掌中间"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Atwixt a Brace of Cacti"
msgid ""
"A grizzled clodhopper interviews a mess of rangehands, flummoxing longhorns "
"and tenderfoot alike in a flusteration of jawing."
msgstr "一个缠人的乡巴佬的对一帮海盗们的访谈记录，充满了让长角牛和旱鸭子们焦躁不安张嘴困惑不已的各种海盗术语。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Stinky Bart Puts on Starch"
msgid_plural "copies of Stinky Bart Puts on Starch"
msgstr[0] "恶臭巴特浆上新装"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Stinky Bart Puts on Starch"
msgid ""
"A local bandit, driven by sadistic impulses, begins offering unlicensed "
"dentistry to brave frontiersmen with few options and fewer teeth."
msgstr "一个当地强盗，在自虐冲动驱使下，开始向勇敢的开拓者们提供无证牙医服务，选项很少而牙齿更少的服务。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Six Beans in the Wheel"
msgid_plural "copies of Six Beans in the Wheel"
msgstr[0] "左轮里的六颗豆"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Six Beans in the Wheel"
msgid ""
"The safety is off in this gun slinging tale of revenge and redemption by "
"acclaimed author El Amor."
msgstr "在这部由著名作家艾尔·阿莫尔撰写的复仇与救赎的西部枪战小说中，保险已经完全打开了。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Irons at Calico Queen Annex"
msgid_plural "copies of Irons at Calico Queen Annex"
msgstr[0] "印花女王镇的枪手们"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Irons at Calico Queen Annex"
msgid ""
"The establishment of a telegraph line into the recently named town of Calico "
"Queen threatens to bring with it the long arm of the law.  A trio of "
"enterprising gunfighters hatches a plan to keep Calico Queen wild by looting "
"the supply wagons."
msgstr ""
"刚被命名的印花女王镇上建起了一条新电报线，它所带来联邦法律的长臂可能威胁小镇的自由。三名富有进取心的枪手策划了一桩抢劫计划，通过打劫补给车队来保持印花女王镇"
"的狂野本性。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Riot on the Range"
msgid_plural "copies of Riot on the Range"
msgstr[0] "牧场暴乱"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Riot on the Range"
msgid ""
"Best selling author El Amor paints a visceral study in red with his latest "
"western saga: Riot on the Range."
msgstr "畅销书作家艾尔·阿莫尔用他最新的西部传奇小说《牧场暴乱》深入肺腑地描绘出鲜红的西部风土人情。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Vaquero Sun"
msgid_plural "copies of Vaquero Sun"
msgstr[0] "放牛娃的太阳"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Vaquero Sun"
msgid ""
"Western author El Amor relates the story of a dispossessed young man inspired "
"by a heat stroke delusion to pursue justice against an evil land baron."
msgstr "西部小说作家艾尔·阿莫尔讲述了一个被剥夺了权利的年轻人在一次中暑引发的幻觉的鼓舞下向邪恶的地主讨回正义的故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Vendetta Riders"
msgid_plural "copies of The Vendetta Riders"
msgstr[0] "《宿願騎手》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The Vendetta Riders"
msgid ""
"A wild young man, fast on the draw, who thinks he has nothing to lose, falls "
"in with a group of gun runners."
msgstr "一个狂野的年轻人，拔枪很快，认为自己一无所有，和一群同样的持枪骑手一起行动的故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "phone book"
msgid_plural "phone books"
msgstr[0] "《電話簿》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "phone book"
msgid ""
"This hefty volume contains the telephone numbers of individuals, businesses, "
"and utilities.  Pretty useless during the apocalypse and all."
msgstr "这本厚厚的书包含了许多个人、企业和公共事业单位的电话号码。在大灾变中已经完全没有用了。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "photo album"
msgid_plural "photo albums"
msgstr[0] "《相簿》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "photo album"
msgid ""
"A leather album full of photos of somebody's family.  You don't know any of "
"the people in them, but seeing these pictures still makes you think of "
"happier times."
msgstr "一本皮革封面的相簿，裝滿了某人的家族照片。你不認識裡面的任何人，但是看著這些照片能讓你想到往日的美好時光。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "book of plays"
msgid_plural "books of plays"
msgstr[0] "《名劇選集》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "book of plays"
msgid ""
"A collection of plays by various authors from around the world, including "
"scripts by Wilde, Beckett, Checkov, and Shakespeare."
msgstr "來自世界各地不同的作者的劇集， 包括王爾德、貝克特、契訶夫、和莎士比亞劇本的合集。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "book of poetry"
msgid_plural "books of poetry"
msgstr[0] "《詩集》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "book of poetry"
msgid ""
"A collection of poetry by various authors from around the world, including "
"writings by Dickinson, Goethe, Thoreau, and Yeats."
msgstr "來自世界各地不同的作者的詩歌集合， 著作包括狄金森， 歌德， 梭羅和葉芝。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "priest's diary"
msgid_plural "priests' diaries"
msgstr[0] "神父日記"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "priest's diary"
msgid "A small book filled with journal entries in Latin.  You can read Latin, right?"
msgstr "一本写满了拉丁语的日记小册子。你会拉丁语的，对吧？"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "corporate accounting ledger"
msgid_plural "corporate accounting ledgers"
msgstr[0] "《企業財務報表》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "corporate accounting ledger"
msgid "If you knew what to look for, something might stand out…"
msgstr "一册账本，如果你看懂的话，某笔交易显得尤为突出……"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "patient treatment records"
msgid_plural "patient treatment records"
msgstr[0] "病歷資料"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "patient treatment records"
msgid "A massive stack of medical records that contain every gory detail."
msgstr "一大疊病歷表格， 包含許多血淋淋的治療過程。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "national weather transcripts"
msgid_plural "national weather transcripts"
msgstr[0] "《全國氣象報告》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "national weather transcripts"
msgid "Old weather records that are about as interesting as a rock."
msgstr ""
"过去的天气记录读起来如同石头一样，毫无趣味。\n"
"\"数据爱好者可能会读的津津有味。\""

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "big book of short stories"
msgid_plural "big books of short stories"
msgstr[0] "《短篇故事集》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "big book of short stories"
msgid ""
"This humongous volume contains a vast collection of short stories by "
"different authors, spanning a wide variety of topics and genres."
msgstr "網羅了世界各地由不同作者創作的短篇故事，大量收集橫跨各式各樣的主題和題材。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "book of tall tales"
msgid_plural "books of tall tales"
msgstr[0] "《荒誕故事集》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "book of tall tales"
msgid ""
"An entertaining collection of early American folklore, featuring tales of "
"larger than life individuals and their amazing adventures."
msgstr "一個有趣的早期美國民間傳說收集， 特點是內容有大型生物和驚人的冒險故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Visions in Solitude"
msgid_plural "copies of Visions in Solitude"
msgstr[0] "《獨處的視野》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Visions in Solitude"
msgid "A small book detailing 'visions' a prisoner had on death row."
msgstr "一本冊子記載著一位死刑犯在牢裡看到的 \"景象\"。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "book of classic literature"
msgid_plural "books of classic literature"
msgstr[0] "《經典文學選集》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "book of classic literature"
msgid "A book of classic literature, timeless and enjoyable but a bit dense to read."
msgstr "一本經典文學，殺時間且有趣但閱讀時有點燒腦。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of Dickens' \"Bleak House\"."
msgstr "這是著名作家狄更斯的“荒涼之屋”的一本副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Great Expectations\" by Charles Dickens."
msgstr "這是著名作家查爾斯·狄更斯的“遠大前程（孤星血淚）”的副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of William Shinderling's \"Under the Beech Trees\"."
msgstr "這是William Shinderling的“Under the Beech Trees”的副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a collection of three Jane Austen novels: \"Pride and Prejudice\", "
"\"Sense and Sensibility\", and \"Emma\"."
msgstr "這是簡·奧斯汀三部小說的合訂本：《傲慢與偏見》，《理智與情感》，以及《艾瑪》。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a well-worn paperback copy of \"Lord of the Flies\"."
msgstr "這是小說《蒼蠅王》的精裝版平裝本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"To Kill a Mockingbird\" by Harper Lee."
msgstr "這是哈波·李的“梅岡城故事”的副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of F. Scott Fitzgerald's \"The Great Gatsby.\""
msgstr "這是F·史考特·費茲傑羅的“大亨小傳”的副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of Michael Abanaderly's lesser-known work, \"He Walks\"."
msgstr "迈克尔·阿巴纳德利所著的《他走路》，一部鲜为人知的作品。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a collection of several vintage science fiction stories by Ray "
"Bradbury."
msgstr "這是雷·布萊伯利的科幻作品精選集。（雷·道格拉斯·布萊伯利是美國科幻、奇幻、恐怖小說作家，代表作品有《火星紀事》及《華氏 451 度》。）"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Adventures of Tom Sawyer\" by Mark Twain."
msgstr "這是馬克吐溫的“湯姆歷險記”的副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is an illustrated copy of \"Innocents Abroad\" by Mark Twain."
msgstr "這是馬克吐溫的“Innocents Abroad”的含插圖副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of Bram Stoker's \"Dracula\", with scholarly commentary in the "
"margins."
msgstr "這是伯蘭·史杜克的“德古拉”的副本，書頁邊緣有學術性評論。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a large print copy of Tolstoy's \"War and Peace\".  It might make a "
"decent improvised weapon."
msgstr "這是托爾斯泰“戰爭與和平”的大型印刷版。基於它的重量，可以讓你的敵人見識何謂\"文字的力量\"。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a paperback copy of the well-known classic \"Dark Days Ahead\", by K. "
"G. Ranade.  There are scrawled margin notes all over it, apparently the "
"workings of a confused and feverish mind."
msgstr "這是K. G. Ranade的著名的經典“Dark Days Ahead”的平裝本。整本書到處都有潦草的頁緣筆記，顯然是一顆困惑和狂熱的頭腦的產物。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a copy of \"Jane Eyre\".  The cover art is quite out of place, making "
"it look more like a dime-store romance novel."
msgstr "這是《簡愛》的副本。封面美術相當\"專業\"，使它看起來更像一本便利商店中會出現的總裁小說。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a perfectly preserved hardcover copy of \"The Gunslinger\" by Stephen "
"King, autographed by the author.  It contains a certificate of authenticity "
"pronouncing it to be a first edition."
msgstr "這精心保存的精裝本是由作者親筆簽名的史蒂芬·金的“最後的槍客”。隨附一張初版保證書。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This paperback copy of \"Wuthering Heights\" has a large coffee stain on the "
"first page."
msgstr "這本“咆哮山莊”的平裝本在第一頁上有一個很大的咖啡漬。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a hardbound copy of \"Lady Chatterly's Lover\", by D. H. Lawrence.  "
"It has some very explicit illustrations."
msgstr "這是D.H.勞倫斯的“查泰萊夫人的情人”的精裝本。內含一些非常\"鉅細靡遺\"的插圖。如果你看膩了花花公子..."

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a hardbound copy of \"The Catcher in the Rye.\".  It has some very "
"nicely done illustrations."
msgstr "這是“麥田捕手”的精裝本。它有一些畫得非常好的插圖。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a collection of classic renaissance era stories, headlined by \"Don "
"Quixote\"."
msgstr "這是一系列經典文藝復興時期的故事，由“堂吉訶德”主演。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a paperback copy of \"The Fellowship of the Ring\" by Tolkien."
msgstr "這是托爾金的“魔戒現身”的平裝本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a paperback copy of \"The Two Towers\" by Tolkien."
msgstr "這是托爾金的“雙城奇謀”平裝本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a paperback copy of \"The Return of the King\" by Tolkien."
msgstr "這是托爾金的“王者再臨”的平裝本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a hardbound collection of George Orwell's works, including \"1984\" "
"and \"Animal Farm\" as well as many of his less infamous titles."
msgstr "這是喬治奧威爾作品的精彩集合，包括“1984”和“動物農莊”以及他不那麼臭名昭著的作品。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a paperback copy of \"Little Women\" by Louisa May Alcott.  It "
"appears to have been read a great many times."
msgstr "這是露意莎·奧爾柯特的“小婦人”的平裝本。它似乎被閱讀了很多次。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a paperback copy of \"Of Mice and Men\" by Steinbeck."
msgstr "這是約翰·史坦貝克的“人鼠之間”的平裝本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a hefty hardcover copy of \"Run and Run Again\" by Finn Calpay.  "
"There is a lengthy forward about the controversy around the book's release."
msgstr "這是Finn Calpay的“Run and Run Again”的精裝本。這本書的發行產生很大的爭議。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid ""
"This is a hardcover copy of \"The Gates Have Opened\" by Arianna Methusalah.  "
"You feel like you've read this before, but can't remember where.  Something "
"about the book fills you with unease."
msgstr ""
"這是Arianna Methusalah的“The Gates have "
"Opened”的精裝本。你覺得你以前讀過這個，但不記得在哪裡。關於這本書的一些東西讓你感到不安。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Count of Monte Cristo\" by Dumas."
msgstr "這是杜馬斯的“基督山伯爵”的副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Secret Garden\" by Frances Burnett."
msgstr "這是法蘭西絲·霍森·柏納特的“秘密花園”的副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Lieutenant Hornblower\" by C.S. Forester."
msgstr "這是西索·史考特·佛瑞斯特的\"海軍上尉霍恩布洛爾\"副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Master and Commander\" by Patrick O'Brian."
msgstr "這是帕特里克·歐布萊恩的“怒海爭鋒”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Warden\" by Anthony Trollope."
msgstr "這是安東尼.特羅洛普的“巴塞特郡養老院”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Far Side of the World\" by Patrick O'Brian."
msgstr "這是帕特里克·歐布萊恩的“極地遠征”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"HMS Surprise\" by Patrick O'Brian."
msgstr "這是帕特里克·歐布萊恩的“驚奇號”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Barchester Towers\" by Anthony Trollope."
msgstr "這是安東尼·特羅洛普的“巴徹斯特教堂尖塔”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Land Ironclads\" by H.G. Wells."
msgstr "這是H.G.威爾斯的“陸上鐵甲”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Great Boer War\" by Arthur Conan Doyle."
msgstr "這是亞瑟.柯南.道爾的“偉大的布爾戰爭副本”。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Crime of the Congo\" by Arthur Conan Doyle."
msgstr "這是亞瑟.柯南.道爾的“剛果的罪刑”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Parasite\" by Arthur Conan Doyle."
msgstr "這是亞瑟.柯南.道爾的“寄生蟲”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"By Stroke of Sword\" by Andrew Balfour."
msgstr "這是安德魯.貝爾福的“一劍之下”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Secret Agent\" by Joseph Conrad."
msgstr "這是喬瑟夫.康拉德的“密探”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Lord Jim\" by Joseph Conrad."
msgstr "這是約瑟夫.康拉德的“吉姆爺”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Vanity Fair\" by William Makepeace Thackeray."
msgstr "這是威廉·梅克比斯·薩克萊的“浮華世界”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Luck of Barry Lyndon\" by William Makepeace Thackeray."
msgstr "這是威廉·梅克比斯·薩克萊的“巴瑞·林登的運氣”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"North and South\" by Elizabeth Gaskell."
msgstr "這是伊莉莎白·蓋斯凱爾的“北與南”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Mayor of Casterbridge\" by Thomas Hardy."
msgstr "這是托馬斯·哈代的“卡斯特橋市長”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Wessex Tales\" by Thomas Hardy."
msgstr "這是托馬斯·哈代的“威塞克斯故事集”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Far from the Madding Crowd\" by Thomas Hardy."
msgstr "這是托馬斯·哈代的“遠離塵囂”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Captains Courageous\" by Rudyard Kipling."
msgstr "這是魯德亞德·吉卜林的“勇敢的船長”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"The Canterbury Tales\" by Geoffrey Chaucer."
msgstr "這是傑弗裡．喬叟的“坎特伯雷故事集”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Harold, the Last of the Saxons\" by Edward Bulwer-Lytton."
msgstr "這是愛德華.布爾沃.利頓的“哈羅德：最後的薩克遜之王”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Mr Midshipman Easy\" by Frederick Marryat."
msgstr "這是弗雷德里克.馬里亞特的“海軍候補生：伊齊先生”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "book of classic literature"
msgid "This is a copy of \"Peter Simple\" by Frederick Marryat."
msgstr "這是弗雷德里克.馬里亞特的“彼得.辛普”副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "collector's edition book"
msgid_plural "collector's edition books"
msgstr[0] "收藏家的典藏"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "collector's edition book"
msgid "A unique, valuable book that has been kept as a collector's item."
msgstr "一本獨特的，有價值的書，作為收藏家的收藏。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a high-quality leather bound copy of Charles Dickens' \"A Tale of Two "
"Cities\"."
msgstr "這是查爾斯狄更斯的“雙城記”的高品質皮革裝訂副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a very old but well-preserved copy of Charles Dickens' \"Oliver "
"Twist\"."
msgstr "這是查爾斯狄更斯的“孤雛淚”的一個非常古老但保存完好的副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This high-quality copy of Jane Austen's \"Pride and Prejudice\" is dog-eared "
"and looks to have been read many times."
msgstr "這本簡奧斯丁的“傲慢與偏見”的高品質副本是有多處書頁折角，看起來已被多次閱讀。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a hefty, hardcover print of William Shinderling's \"Vanity before "
"Justice\" with beautiful illustrations."
msgstr "這是威廉·辛德林（William Shinderling）的“正義之前的虛榮”（Vanity before Justice）的精美印刷版，附有精美的插圖。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This copy of Jane Austen's \"Sense and Sensibility\" has a certificate of "
"authenticity declaring it to be an early edition.  It would have been worth "
"an enormous amount of money, not long ago."
msgstr "簡奧斯汀的“理智與情感”副本，隨附真品證書，宣稱它是早期版本。它本來值一大筆錢，但是現在...。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid "This is an excellent quality copy of \"To Kill a Mockingbird\" by Harper Lee."
msgstr "這是哈波·李的“梅岡城故事”的高品質副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a high-quality leather bound copy of F. Scott Fitzgerald's \"The "
"Great Gatsby.\""
msgstr "這是F·史考特·費茲傑羅的“大亨小傳”的高品質皮革裝訂副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a hefty, hardcover print of Michael Abanaderly's opus, \"Lady "
"Wanderlust\".  It is over a hundred years old, but doesn't look it."
msgstr "這沉重的精裝書是Michael Abanaderly的作品“Lady Wanderlust”。它有一百多年的歷史，但看起來像全新的。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This copy of Ray Bradbury's \"Fahrenheit 451\" has a certificate of "
"authenticity declaring it to be an early edition.  It would have been worth "
"an enormous amount of money, not long ago."
msgstr "雷·道格拉斯·布萊伯利的“華氏451度”副本，隨附真品證書，宣稱它是早期版本。它本來值一大筆錢，但是現在...。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This high-quality copy of \"Pride and Prejudice and Zombies\" has been "
"autographed by the author."
msgstr "這本高品質的“傲慢與偏見與殭屍”副本已由作者親筆簽名。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a high-quality leather bound copy of \"The Adventures of Huckleberry "
"Finn\" by Mark Twain.  It contains some margin notes which themselves are "
"quite old, and look to have been done by a scholar of some sort."
msgstr "這是馬克吐溫的“頑童歷險記”的高品質皮革裝訂副本。它包含一些本身相當陳舊的頁緣註釋，並且看起來是由某位學者完成的"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a very nice print of Bram Stoker's \"Dracula\".  It has a certificate "
"of authenticity with it that declares it a genuine early edition."
msgstr "這是伯蘭·史杜克的“德古拉”完美的印刷版。它有一個真品證書，宣稱它是一個真正的早期版本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This copy of Douglas Adams' \"The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy\" has a "
"certificate of authenticity declaring it to be a first edition, and is "
"autographed by the author himself."
msgstr "這本道格拉斯亞當斯的“銀河便車指南“有一份真品證書，宣稱它是第一版，並由作者親自簽名。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a high-quality leather bound copy of the well-known classic \"Dark "
"Days Ahead\", by K. G. Ranade."
msgstr "這是由K. G. Ranade著名的經典“Dark Days Ahead”的高品質皮革裝訂副本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a well-kept leather bound copy of \"Oryx and Crake\" by Margaret "
"Atwood.  Inscribed in the inner cover is a faded note wishing the owner a "
"happy birthday."
msgstr "這是瑪格麗特阿特伍德（Margaret Atwood）保存完好的“Oryx and Crake”皮革裝訂副本。內封面上刻有一張褪色的紙條，祝主人生日快樂。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This bright orange hardcover copy of \"1984\" by George Orwell has been "
"carefully preserved, and appears to be a first or second edition judging from "
"the publisher's information."
msgstr "喬治·奧威爾（George Orwell）的這本亮橙色封面精裝版“1984”經過精心保存，從出版商的信息來看似乎是第一版或第二版。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a very nice copy of \"Lady Chatterly's Lover\", probably quite "
"expensive in the days before the apocalypse."
msgstr "這是“查特利夫人的情人”的一個狀況良好的副本，在災變之前可能相當昂貴。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a high quality early edition hardcover copy of \"The Handmaid's "
"Tale\" by Margaret Atwood, signed by the author."
msgstr "這是由作者簽名的瑪格麗特阿特伍德的“使女的故事”的高品質早期版精裝本。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This ancient and worn book looks to be an 18th or early 19th century "
"handwritten copy of \"Don Quixote\".  In the days of book traders it would "
"have been worth an absolute fortune.  Now it's either a priceless piece of "
"history, some light reading before bed, or excellent kindling."
msgstr ""
"這本古老而破舊的書看起來是18世紀或19"
"世紀初“唐吉訶德”的手抄本。在圖書交易有市場的災變前，它本來值得一切。現在它要麼是無價的歷史文物，或是輕鬆的床邊讀物。同時也是出色的燃料。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
msgid ""
"This is a first edition copy of Terry Pratchett's \"The Colour of Magic\".  "
"In the inner cover is a handwritten note that reads \"To Chris, thanks for "
"believing I could do it.  Best regards, Terry.\""
msgstr "這是泰瑞·普萊契的“The Colour of Magic”的初版。在內封面是一個手寫的筆記，寫著“給克里斯，感謝你對我的信心。泰瑞上。”"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Economicon of Dobbs"
msgid_plural "copies of The Economicon"
msgstr[0] "《經濟學》"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The Economicon of Dobbs"
msgid ""
"These are the prescriptures Pile 18 Disk sg30 File 14.  \"Look, small brain "
"of pink earth inside my null-grasping, and she/he receives Logos; and it lay "
"with the Wor.\""
msgstr "以下条例引自第18堆栈第30磁盘阵列第14文件：\"看，在我零值抓取中的粉色地球上的小脑瓜子们，而他/她将被赐予罗格斯（理性/图标）；而它将与吾同行。\""

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Bobliographon"
msgid_plural "copies of The Bobliographon"
msgstr[0] "鲍勃文献集"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "The Bobliographon"
msgid ""
"The back cover of this cheaply published paperback reads: \"These "
"newly-released SubGenius revelations will SHOCK those who think they know "
"Bob!  Unpredictables are not alone and possess amazing hidden powers of their "
"own!  In a world without slack, a yeti lust revival saunters about.  WARNING: "
"Do not fail to pay full price for this book; JHVH-1's wrath knows some "
"bounds.\""
msgstr ""
"这本廉价出版的平装本的封底写着：\""
"这些最新发布的对非天才人群的揭秘将会让那些自以为了解鲍勃的人震惊！不可预测的事物并非孤立存在，而且它们自身就拥有着惊人的隐藏力量！在一个没有懈怠的世界里，野"
"人般的欲望重新在世间游荡。警告：不要忘记为这本书付全价；JHVH-1的愤怒上有边界。\""

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Glimpses of Solomon in Yellow"
msgid_plural "copies of Solomon in Yellow"
msgstr[0] "瞥见黄衣所罗门"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Glimpses of Solomon in Yellow"
msgid ""
"This paperback is titled \"Glimpses of Solomon in Yellow; The Initiation "
"Rites of the Starry Wisdom Covenant, by Dr. Enoch Craven.\"  It describes not "
"just the investiture of new adherents, but the history and beliefs of the "
"Church of Starry Wisdom.  Someone has defaced the sparse citations section by "
"scrawling \"PUPPETS OF ROME!\" over its few pages.  The book does not provide "
"any biography for Dr. Craven, let alone academic credentials."
msgstr ""
"这本平装书的标题是《瞥见黄衣所罗门：星慧之约的入会仪式，伊诺·克雷文著》它不仅描述了新信徒的授职仪式，还描述了星之智慧教堂的历史和信仰。有人在其中几页稀疏的"
"引文部分潦草地涂写上了\"罗马的木偶！\"。这本书没有提供任何关于克雷文博士的人物介绍，更不用说学位证书了。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grimoire"
msgid_plural "grimoires"
msgstr[0] "死灵之书"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "grimoire"
msgid ""
"A hefty book with a thick leather cover and metal clasps.  Both covers are "
"completely empty, though on the first page there is an author's name written "
"in English: \"Abdul Alhazred\"; below it the book title is written in "
"Arabian: \"العزيف\", and below it in Greek: \"Νεκρονομικόν\".  The book looks "
"very old and sinister."
msgstr ""
"一本有厚皮革封面和金属扣的厚书。两侧封面都是空白的，不过扉页上书写着作者的英文名字：\"阿卜杜·阿尔哈兹莱德\"；在其下方用阿拉伯语写着书名：\""
"العزيف\"，然后下方又用希腊语写着：\"Νεκρονομικόν\"。这本书看起来既古老又邪恶。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Siddur"
msgid_plural "Siddurim"
msgstr[0] "西都尔"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Siddur"
msgid ""
"A Siddur, or prayerbook, contains the set order of prayers for Jewish "
"religious services.  This one is comprehensive, divided into morning, "
"afternoon, and evening prayers for both weekdays and Shabbat, along with "
"separate sections for minor and major holidays."
msgstr "一本西杜尔（Siddur）祈祷书，包含了犹太教宗教仪式的固定祈祷顺序。这本书很全面，分为平日和安息日的早晨、下午和晚上的祈祷，以及小节日和大节日的单独部分。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Judaica hardcover"
msgid_plural "Judaica hardcovers"
msgstr[0] "犹太教精装本"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Judaica hardcover"
#. ~ Description of "Judaica softcover"
msgid ""
"This is a book of Judaica.  You're a real mensch if you managed to find this "
"one."
msgstr "这是一本犹太教典籍。如果你专门来找这个，你真是个虔诚信徒。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "Hell in Jewish Literature"
msgid_plural "copies of Hell in Jewish Literature"
msgstr[0] "犹太教义中的地狱描写"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Hell in Jewish Literature" of item "Judaica
#. hardcover"
msgid ""
"A analysis of rabbinic discussions of Gehinnom, the Jewish afterlife for the "
"cleansing of sins, including how big it is, how hot it is, who goes there, "
"how long they stay there, whether there is any relief from their punishments "
"in the meantime, and exactly what shape Gehinnom is."
msgstr ""
"分析拉比们对地狱Gehinnom的讨论，这是犹太人用来清洗罪恶的死后，包括它有多大，有多热，谁会去那里，在那里呆多久，在此期间他们的惩罚是否得到了缓解，以及"
"Gehinnor到底是什么形状。在犹太教中，Gehinnom指的是不悔改的灵魂在死后去往的一个地方，在那里他们会被净化，去除精神上的污秽，然后才能回到上帝的"
"面前。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "Mimekor Yisrael, Book One: The National Tales"
msgid_plural "copies of Mimekor Yisrael, Book One: The National Tales"
msgstr[0] "米哥·以色列（卷一：民族故事）"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Mimekor Yisrael, Book One: The National Tales" of
#. item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"A collection of Jewish folktales, from Ashmedai king of demons to "
"golem-making rabbis, from the Torah scholar who showed Aristotle the futility "
"of philosophy to how Satan refused to bow to Adam because Adam was created "
"from the dust of the earth, from martyrs murdered by Christian persecutors to "
"General Joab single-handedly killing two thousand Amalekites so that when the "
"blood ran out like a river through the city gates his troops knew to stop "
"besieging the city and assault it, and dozens more besides."
msgstr ""
"犹太民间故事集，从恶魔之王阿什梅代到制作傀儡的拉比，从向亚里士多德展示哲学徒劳的托拉学者，到撒旦拒绝向亚当鞠躬，因为亚当是从地球的尘埃中创造出来的，从被迫害"
"基督教的人杀害的烈士，到约押将军单枪匹马杀死了两千名亚玛力人，以至于当血像河流一样从城门流出来时，他的部队知道要停止围攻城市并攻击它，此外还有几十个其他民间"
"故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "On the Doorposts of Your House"
msgid_plural "copies of On the Doorposts of Your House"
msgstr[0] "在你家门柱之上"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "On the Doorposts of Your House" of item "Judaica
#. hardcover"
msgid ""
"A list of prayers, meditations, and rituals for use at home, from lighting "
"the Shabbat candles to welcoming a new child into the household."
msgstr "一份在家里使用的祈祷、冥想和仪式清单，从点燃安息日蜡烛到欢迎新孩子进入家庭。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "The Observant Life: The Wisdom of Contemporary Judaism for Contemporary Jews"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Observant Life: The Wisdom of Contemporary Judaism for "
"Contemporary Jews"
msgstr[0] "遵守戒律的生活：当代犹太人的当代犹太教智慧"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Observant Life: The Wisdom of Contemporary
#. Judaism for Contemporary Jews" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"A long discussion of the ways in which Judaism's ancient rituals, traditions, "
"and ethical practices are still relevant and meaningful in the modern world.  "
"Unfortunately, there's no discussion of post-apocalyptic Judaism."
msgstr "关于犹太教古老的仪式、传统和伦理实践在现代世界中的相关性和意义的长篇讨论。 遗憾的是，书中没有讨论末世后的犹太教。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "Siddur Tisha b'Av"
msgid_plural "copies of Siddur Tisha b'Av"
msgstr[0] "Siddur Tisha b'Av"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Siddur Tisha b'Av" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"A prayerbook for Tisha b'Av, the most solemn day in the Jewish year.  This "
"one also contains the full text of the book of Lamentations and selected "
"commentaries."
msgstr "提沙节的祈祷书，这是犹太一年中最庄严的一天。这本书还包含了《哀歌集》的全文和精选的评论。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "Coming to Terms with America: Essays on Jewish History, Religion, and Culture"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Coming to Terms with America: Essays on Jewish History, Religion, "
"and Culture"
msgstr[0] "与美国和解：犹太历史、宗教和文化随笔"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Coming to Terms with America: Essays on Jewish
#. History, Religion, and Culture" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"A series of fifteen essays by Jonathan Sarna on Jews' attempt to be both "
"distinctively Jewish but also definitely American, covering the American "
"Revolution through to contemporary times."
msgstr "这是乔纳森·萨尔纳的十五篇系列文章，关于犹太人试图既成为犹太人又成为美国人，从美国革命到当代。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "In This Hour"
msgid_plural "copies of In This Hour"
msgstr[0] "在这一刻"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "In This Hour" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"An English translation of works written by Rabbi Abraham Joshua Heschel "
"during the Nazi rule of Germany and Rabbi Heschel's exile in England, "
"concerning historic and current persecution and his vision for Jewish "
"education."
msgstr "亚伯拉罕·约书亚·赫舍尔拉比在纳粹德国统治期间和赫舍尔拉比流亡英国期间所写的作品的英文译本，涉及历史和当前的迫害以及他对犹太教育的愿景。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"Jewish Literacy: The Most Important Things to Know About the Jewish Religion, "
"Its People and Its History"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Jewish Literacy: The Most Important Things to Know About the Jewish "
"Religion, Its People and Its History"
msgstr[0] "犹太文学：关于犹太宗教、其人民及其历史的最重要的事情"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Literacy: The Most Important Things to
#. Know About the Jewish Religion, Its People and Its History" of item
#. "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"Rabbi Joseph Telushkin's encyclopedic tome of Jewish life, running to "
"hundreds of chapters and answering questions about the Hebrew bible, the "
"Talmud, the holidays and rituals, the Holocaust, Israel and the diaspora, and "
"everything in between."
msgstr "约瑟夫·特鲁什金拉比的犹太生活百科全书，包含数百个章节，解答了关于希伯来圣经、《塔木德》、节日和仪式、大屠杀、以色列及其散居历史等方方面面的问题。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"Biblical Literacy: The Most Important People, Events and Ideas of the Hebrew "
"Bible"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Biblical Literacy: The Most Important People, Events and Ideas of "
"the Hebrew Bible"
msgstr[0] "圣经文学：希伯来圣经中最重要的人物、事件和思想"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Biblical Literacy: The Most Important People,
#. Events and Ideas of the Hebrew Bible" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"Rabbi Joseph Telushkin's exploration and analysis of the Hebrew Bible, "
"containing a myriad of commentary and analysis, including on famous stories "
"like the Binding of Isaac or the Exodus, a discussion of the weekly Torah "
"readings that form part of the Jewish liturgical calendar, and a list of all "
"613 mitzvot."
msgstr ""
"约瑟夫·特鲁什金拉比关于希伯来圣经的探索和分析，包含了大量的评注和分析，包括对诸如以撒的献祭或出埃及记等著名故事的解读、对构成犹太礼拜日历一部分的每周妥拉阅"
"读的讨论，以及 613 条戒律的所有列表。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "This Is Real and You Are Completely Unprepared"
msgid_plural "copies of This Is Real and You Are Completely Unprepared"
msgstr[0] "这是真的，而你毫无防备"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "This Is Real and You Are Completely Unprepared"
#. of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"An in-depth discussion of the High Holy Days, starting with the Three Weeks "
"and Nine Days before Tisha b'Av and continuing all the way through Sukkot, as "
"a single period of rising and falling emotion, wherein each individual "
"prepares themselves to stand before God.  A very well-known book that some "
"people read every year and others mean to get around to finally reading this "
"year."
msgstr ""
"这本书深入讨论了至高圣日，从提沙节前的三周和九天开始，一直到住棚节，情绪起起落落，每个人都准备面对上帝的审判。这是一本非常著名的书，有些人每年都会读，而另一"
"些人则打算在今年抽出时间最终读一回。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "OU Manual for Checking Fruits and Vegetables"
msgid_plural "copies of the OU Manual for Checking Fruits and Vegetables"
msgstr[0] "蔬果检查实用指南"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "OU Manual for Checking Fruits and Vegetables" of
#. item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"A comprehensive guide to checking produce for insect infestation and how to "
"prepare produce according to Jewish dietary law."
msgstr "一份全面的指南，用于检查农产品是否受到虫害，以及如何根据犹太教法准备食材。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "Shalom Rav, Volume 1"
msgid_plural "copies of Shalom Rav, Volume 1"
msgstr[0] "沙洛姆文集（第一卷）"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Shalom Rav, Volume 1" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"Rabbi Shalom Rosner's commentary on the weekly Torah portion, covering the "
"books of Genesis and Exodus."
msgstr "拉比沙洛姆·罗斯纳对每周《托拉》部分的评论，涵盖了《创世记》和《出埃及记》。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "Shalom Rav, Volume 2"
msgid_plural "copies of Shalom Rav, Volume 2"
msgstr[0] "Shalom Rav，第二卷"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Shalom Rav, Volume 2" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"Rabbi Shalom Rosner's commentary on the weekly Torah portion, covering the "
"books of Leviticus, Numbers, and Deuteronomy."
msgstr "拉比沙洛姆·罗斯纳对每周《托拉》部分的评论，涵盖了《利未记》、《民数记》和《申命记》。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "The Origins of Judaism: An Archaeological-Historical Reappraisal"
msgid_plural "copies of The Origins of Judaism: An Archaeological-Historical Reappraisal"
msgstr[0] "犹太教的起源：考古历史的再评价"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Origins of Judaism: An Archaeological-
#. Historical Reappraisal" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"An examination of the archaeological evidence behind the beginning of many "
"Jewish traditions, including eschewing pork, adopting tefillin and placing "
"mezuzot on doorposts, and circumcision."
msgstr "一项考察许多犹太传统文化和宗教习俗起源的考古学研究，包括禁食猪肉的习俗、佩戴经文匣的要求、在门柱上放置门柱圣卷的传统以及割礼仪式的起源。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "The Guide for the Perplexed"
msgid_plural "copies of the Guide for the Perplexed"
msgstr[0] "迷途指津"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Guide for the Perplexed" of item "Judaica
#. hardcover"
msgid ""
"An English translation of the great sage Rabbi Moses ben Maimon's work "
"finding common points between natural philosophy and Talmudic scholarship.  "
"Contains the famous Thirteen Principles of Faith, accepted by many Jews as a "
"summary of the fundamental beliefs of Judaism."
msgstr "伟大的圣人拉比摩西·本·迈蒙作品的英译本，寻找自然哲学和塔木德学术之间的共同点。包含著名的信仰十三原则，被许多犹太人接受为犹太教基本信仰的总结。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Genesis"
msgid_plural "copies of the Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Genesis"
msgstr[0] "犹太出版协会摩西五经评注：创世记"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary:
#. Genesis" of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid ""
"A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing "
"the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume "
"is for the book of Genesis."
msgstr "由学者和学者撰写的一系列律法注释，包括传统的希伯来语文本、翻译和各种注释。这卷书是为《创世记》而编撰的。"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica hardcover"
msgid "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Exodus"
