"A good guide for both sportsmen and gun collectors, this book contains "
"information about classic shotguns and their usage."
msgstr "一本无论是对射击运动员还是收藏家来说，都十分有价值的好书，包含了很多关于经典霰弹枪及其使用方法的信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/shotgun.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Shotguns: The Art and Science"
msgid "USMC M1014 technical manual"
msgid_plural "USMC M1014 technical manuals"
msgstr[0] "《美國海軍陸戰隊 M1014 霰彈槍技術手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/shotgun.json
#. ~ Description of variant "USMC M1014 technical manual" of item "Shotguns:
#. The Art and Science"
msgid ""
"A pocket-sized book printed in 2000 by the United States Marine Corps for "
"official use.  It describes the operation, repair, and cleaning of the "
"Benelli M1014 shotgun.  Though specific to the M4, it can provide a wealth of "
"information to the trained eye."
msgstr ""
"美国海军陆战队于2000年出版的一本袖珍书，军用版本。介绍了贝尼利M1014霰弹枪的操作、维修和清洁。虽然是针对M1014"
"的，但有经验的读者可以从中获得丰富的信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Submachine Gun Enthusiast"
msgid "Submachine Gun Enthusiast"
msgid_plural "issues of Submachine Gun Enthusiast"
msgstr[0] "《衝鋒槍愛好者》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of "Submachine Gun Enthusiast"
#. ~ Description of variant "Submachine Gun Enthusiast" of item "Submachine
#. Gun Enthusiast"
msgid ""
"An in-depth magazine about submachine guns and shooting.  There is an "
"exhaustive article about close quarter combat techniques in the front."
msgstr "一本深入介紹關於衝鋒槍射擊的雜誌。在前面有一篇關於近距離作戰技術的詳盡文章。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Submachine Gun Enthusiast"
msgid "The MP5 Submachine Gun"
msgid_plural "copies of The MP5 Submachine Gun"
msgstr[0] "《MP5 衝鋒槍雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The MP5 Submachine Gun" of item "Submachine Gun
#. Enthusiast"
msgid ""
"A small, shiny journal about the most famous machine gun in the world, H&K "
"MP5, and how it is used currently."
msgstr "一本閃亮的小雜誌，內容講述世界上最著名的機槍 H&K MP5 及其在當代的應用。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Submachine Gun Enthusiast"
msgid "Guns & Weapons for Law Enforcement"
msgid_plural "issues of Guns & Weapons for Law Enforcement"
msgstr[0] "《執法槍枝和武器》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Guns & Weapons for Law Enforcement" of item
#. "Submachine Gun Enthusiast"
msgid ""
"A relatively old magazine about modern automatic firearms police may use.  "
"This issue talks about submachine guns and the brand new KRISS Super V .45 "
"ACP specifically."
msgstr ""
"一本關於現代自動槍械的相對較舊的雜誌。警察也許會看。本集專門討論衝鋒槍和全新的使用 .45 吋口徑柯特自動手槍（.45 ACP）彈藥的 KRISS "
"Super V 衝鋒槍。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgstr[0] "《衝鋒槍手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
#. ~ Description of variant "The Submachine Gun Handbook" of item "The
#. Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid ""
"This concise guide details the proper care and operation of most forms of "
"machine pistols and submachine guns currently used by regular armed and "
"reserve forces, as well as several obsolete weapons."
msgstr "這本簡明指南詳細介紹了正規武裝部隊和預備役部隊目前使用的大多數機關手槍和衝鋒槍，以及幾種過時武器的正確保養和操作方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid "The Mac Man"
msgid_plural "copies of The Mac Man"
msgstr[0] "MAC冲锋枪背后的男人"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Mac Man" of item "The Submachine Gun
#. Handbook"
msgid ""
"The full story of Gordon Ingram and his revolutionary machine gun designs: "
"the Model 6, MAC-10, MAC-11, and SWD."
msgstr "讲述了戈登·英格拉姆以及他改进的冲锋枪Model 6、MAC-10、MAC-11和SWD的完整故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid ""
"The Development of Sub-Machine Guns and their Ammunition from World War 1 to "
"the Present Day"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Development of Sub-Machine Guns and their Ammunition from World "
"War 1 to the Present Day"
msgstr[0] "一战以来的冲锋枪及其弹药演变史"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Development of Sub-Machine Guns and their
#. Ammunition from World War 1 to the Present Day" of item "The Submachine Gun
#. Handbook"
msgid ""
"A comprehensive study of the development and use of the sub-machine gun since "
"World War I, including a country-by-country survey of equipment used, with "
"lots of illustrations and precise information."
msgstr "一战至今关于冲锋枪的发展使用的一本全面研究书籍，包括各各国的装备情况，附有许多插图和精确信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid "American Submachine Guns 1919–1950"
msgid_plural "copies of American Submachine Guns 1919–1950"
msgstr[0] "《美國衝鋒槍：1919～1950》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "American Submachine Guns 1919–1950" of item "The
#. Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid ""
"A fully illustrated book about famous submachine guns, their design, "
"construction, and testing, as well as their accessories such as magazines, "
"ammunition, webbing, and cleaning kits."
msgstr "一本關於著名衝鋒槍的設計、構造和測試以及配件（如彈匣、彈藥、背帶和清潔套件）的完整圖解書籍。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid "Firearm Anatomy"
msgid_plural "copies of Firearm Anatomy"
msgstr[0] "《槍械解析詳解》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Firearm Anatomy" of item "The Submachine Gun
#. Handbook"
msgid ""
"Part of a big series about weapons and their complexity, this issue describes "
"the long history of the M1A1 Thompson Submachine gun - when it was created, "
"why, and why it is iconic now."
msgstr "有關武器及其複雜性的系列叢書的其中一部，本期介紹了 M1A1 湯普森衝鋒槍的悠久歷史 - 它何時被發明、為何被發明以及為什麼它現在會成為指標。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid "An Amateur's Guide for the Colt's Thompson Submachine Gun"
msgid_plural "copies of An Amateur's Guide for the Colt's Thompson Submachine Gun"
msgstr[0] "《柯特湯普森衝鋒槍業餘愛好者指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "An Amateur's Guide for the Colt's Thompson
#. Submachine Gun" of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid ""
"A 200-page collector's manual advising how to buy a real, old Tommy Gun, with "
"detailed info on each model, info about maintenance and shooting, and stories "
"about its usage in the St. Louis Police Department."
msgstr "一本200页的手册，指导如何买一把老式汤米冲锋枪，对每种型号都有详细的介绍信息，教你如何保养和射击。还讲述了这些枪在圣路易斯警察部门的故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid "Submachine Guns Caliber .45"
msgid_plural "copies of Submachine Guns Caliber .45"
msgstr[0] "《.45 口徑衝鋒槍雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Submachine Guns Caliber .45" of item "The
#. Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid ""
"Part of an old army field manual, this book explains the usage and "
"maintenance of the M3 and M3A1, and how it was adopted into U.S. Army service "
"in 1942."
msgstr "旧陆军野战手册的节选，这本书主要讲解了M3和M3A1冲锋枪的使用与维护，以及它如何在1942年被美国陆军所采用。"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid "Maintenance on the MP40, PPSH41, M3A1, and Sten MKII Submachine Guns"
msgid_plural "copies of Maintenance on the MP40, PPSH41, M3A1, and Sten MKII Submachine Guns"
msgstr[0] "《MP40、PPSH41、M3A1 和 Sten MKII 衝鋒槍的保養手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/smg.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Maintenance on the MP40, PPSH41, M3A1, and Sten
#. MKII Submachine Guns" of item "The Submachine Gun Handbook"
msgid ""
"A short manual about the disassembly, reassembly, maintenance, operation, and "
"repair of some old machine guns.  Seems it has lack of some info, but better "
"than nothing."
msgstr "一本关于老式冲锋枪拆装、保养、维修、操作的简短手册。缺少某些信息，但比没有好。"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "US Weekly"
msgid_plural "US Weeklies"
msgstr[0] "《美國週報》"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Description of "US Weekly"
msgid "Weekly news about a bunch of famous people who're all (un)dead now."
msgstr "每週的新聞以及一堆有名的人， 不論現在他們現在是死是活， 死了又活， 或是活了又死的。"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Self-Esteem for Dummies"
msgid_plural "copies of Self-Esteem for Dummies"
msgstr[0] "《給傻瓜的建立自信》"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Description of "Self-Esteem for Dummies"
msgid "Full of useful tips for showing confidence in your speech."
msgstr "充滿了許多展現自信與口才的有用提示。"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Principles of Effective Communication"
msgid_plural "copies of Principles of Effective Communication"
msgstr[0] "《高效率溝通原則》"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Description of "Principles of Effective Communication"
msgid "A hardbound book devoted to being an effective and persuasive speaker."
msgstr "一本精裝書， 教導如何成為一個有效和有說服力的演講者。"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Dungeon Master's Guide: 6th Edition"
msgid_plural "copies of Dungeon Master's Guide: 6th Edition"
msgstr[0] "《地下城主指南：第六版》"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Description of "Dungeon Master's Guide: 6th Edition"
msgid ""
"A thick, hardcover volume with everything needed to weave legendary stories.  "
"It's full of information, but finding the things you're looking for can be a "
"chore."
msgstr "一本厚重的精裝本， 內容有編述傳奇故事所需的一切資料。雖然它有極豐富的內容， 但要找到你正在尋找的東西可能是件苦差事。"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Nail Your Law Firm Interview"
msgid_plural "copies of Nail Your Law Firm Interview"
msgstr[0] "《搞定你的律師事務所面試》"

#: data/json/items/book/speech.json
#. ~ Description of "Nail Your Law Firm Interview"
msgid ""
"This lightweight book proclaims itself to be \"the ONLY gold star interview "
"guide for lawyers interviewing in any type of job interview.\"  It was "
"supposed to help new lawyers find work."
msgstr "这本薄薄的书宣称自己是\"在任何工作面试类书籍中，律师的*唯一*一本面试指导宝典\"。这本书适用于正在求职的新律师。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mycenacean Hymns"
msgid_plural "copies of Mycenacean Hymns"
msgstr[0] "迈锡尼的赞美诗"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Mycenacean Hymns"
msgid ""
"A vellum book containing the hymns central to the Marloss faith.  As the "
"verses lead into each other, the text sings of unity and promised paradise."
msgstr "一本羊皮纸书，包含了以马洛斯信仰为中心的赞美诗。这些诗句彼此相通，经文歌颂统一和信仰的天堂。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "King James Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of the King James Bible"
msgstr[0] "《詹姆士王聖經》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "King James Bible"
msgid ""
"An English translation of the Christian Bible, which originated in England in "
"the early 1600s."
msgstr "聖經的英譯本， 最早於十七世紀初的英格蘭出版。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Eastern Orthodox Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of the Eastern Orthodox Bible"
msgstr[0] "《東正教聖經》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Eastern Orthodox Bible"
msgid "An English copy of the Eastern Orthodox translation of the Christian Bible."
msgstr "一本东正教的圣经英译本，和天主教圣经有很大不同。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Gideon Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of the Gideon Bible"
msgstr[0] "《基甸會聖經》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Gideon Bible"
msgid ""
"An English translation of the Christian Bible, distributed free of charge by "
"Gideons International."
msgstr "聖經的英譯本， 由國際基甸會免費發放。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "New American Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of the New American Bible"
msgstr[0] "新美国圣经复印本"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "New American Bible"
msgid ""
"An English translation of the Bible, first published in 1970.  It is accepted "
"by the Catholic dioceses of the United States of America and the Philippines."
msgstr "圣经的英文翻译版，首次出版于 1970 年，被美国和菲律宾天主教区批准。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The New World Translation of the Holy Scriptures"
msgid_plural "copies of the New World Translation of the Holy Scriptures"
msgstr[0] "新世界圣经译本"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The New World Translation of the Holy Scriptures"
msgid ""
"An English translation of the Bible published by the Watch Tower Bible and "
"Tract Society, used and distributed by Jehovah's Witnesses."
msgstr "守望台圣经书社出版的英文版圣经，由耶和华见证人使用和分发。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Holman Christian Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of the Holman Christian Bible"
msgstr[0] "霍尔曼基督教圣经复印本"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Holman Christian Bible"
msgid ""
"An English translation of the Christian Bible by Holman Bible Publishers, "
"developed by the Southern Baptist Convention.  It is primarily used within "
"Baptist circles."
msgstr "美南浸信会译制的基督教圣经的英文译本，由霍尔曼圣经出版社出版。 它主要在浸信会圈子内使用。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Douay-Rheims Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of the Douay-Rheims Bible"
msgstr[0] "杜埃-兰斯圣经的复印本"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Douay-Rheims Bible"
msgid ""
"An uncommon English translation of the Christian Bible, completed in 1609.  "
"It is based on the Latin Vulgate, and remained popular among traditionalist "
"Catholics."
msgstr "一种罕见的基督教圣经英文译本，完成于1609年。它基于拉丁版圣经译制，仍然受到传统天主教徒的欢迎。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Orthodox Tewahedo Biblical Canon"
msgid_plural "copies of the Orthodox Tewahedo Biblical Canon"
msgstr[0] "正教台瓦西多圣经的复印本"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Orthodox Tewahedo Biblical Canon"
msgid ""
"This is very rare English translation of the Orthodox Tewahedo Biblical "
"Canon, a collection of religious texts that form the basis of the Ethiopian "
"Orthodox Church's faith and doctrine, probably acquired by a immigrant, "
"collector or theologist.  This canon is distinct from the Protestant and "
"Catholic biblical canons, as it contains additional books that are not part "
"of the Hebrew Bible or the Old Testament."
msgstr ""
"这是一种非常罕见的正教经典的台瓦西多的英文译本圣经，这些宗教文字构成了埃塞俄比亚正教教会的信仰和教义基础，可能是从移民、收藏家或神学家那里获得的。这一经典与"
"新教和天主教的圣经不同，因为它额外包含了希伯来圣经或旧约中没有的书籍。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Holy Piby"
msgid_plural "copies of The Holy Piby"
msgstr[0] "皮比圣书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Holy Piby"
msgid ""
"A compilation of texts and interpretations of the Christian Bible that focus "
"on the history, culture, and religious beliefs of the Rastafarian community.  "
"It aims to provide an alternative perspective on the origins of the world and "
"its people, emphasizing the African roots of the Rastafarian faith."
msgstr ""
"一本汇编了基督教圣经文本和解释的书籍，侧重于拉斯塔法里社区的历史、文化和宗教信仰。它旨在提供一个关于世界及其人民起源的不同观点，同时强调了拉斯塔法里信仰的非"
"洲渊源。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Children's Catholic Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of a Children's Catholic Bibles"
msgstr[0] "儿童天主教圣经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Children's Catholic Bible"
msgid ""
"A small, lightweight Catholic Bible intended for children, containing a "
"extremely easy to understand English writing and many illustrations."
msgstr "一本专为儿童设计的小巧轻便的天主教圣经，包含极易理解的英文语言和许多插图。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Children's Protestant Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of a Children's Protestant Bibles"
msgstr[0] "儿童新教圣经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Children's Protestant Bible"
msgid ""
"A small, lightweight Protestant Bible intended for children, containing a "
"extremely easy to understand English writing and many illustrations."
msgstr "一本专为儿童设计的小巧轻便的新教圣经，包含极易理解的英文语言和许多插图。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Common Catechism"
msgid_plural "copies of The Common Catechism"
msgstr[0] "常用教义问答"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Common Catechism"
msgid ""
"A hardcover edition of 'The Common Catechism: A Book of Christian Faith', an "
"ecumenical Christian catechism that is the result of Roman "
"Catholic-Protestant dialogue and work."
msgstr "《共同教义问答：基督教信仰之书》的精装版，是罗马天主教和新教之间对话和合作的结果，这是一部普世基督教教义问答书。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Catechism of The Catholic Church"
msgid_plural "copies of the Catechism of The Catholic Church"
msgstr[0] "天主教教义问答"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Catechism of The Catholic Church"
msgid ""
"A hardcover, updated edition of the 'Catechism of The Catholic Church', a "
"compendium of Catholic doctrine, teachings, beliefs, and moral guidance.  "
"This book serves as a guide for Catholics to understand and deepen their "
"faith, providing a systematic presentation of the essential teachings of the "
"Catholic Church."
msgstr "一本精装的，新版的《天主教教义问答》，是天主教信仰、教导、信条和道德指导的概要。这本书作为天主教徒理解和加深信仰的指南，系统地呈现了天主教教会的基本教义。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Westminster Catechism"
msgid_plural "copies of the Westminster Catechism"
msgstr[0] "《威斯敏斯德信条及大小教理问答》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Westminster Catechism"
msgid ""
"The Westminster Shorter Catechism and the Westminster Larger Catechism into "
"one single large, hardcover book.  It serves as the doctrinal standard in the "
"Reformed tradition of Protestant Christianity, a concise and systematic "
"summary of Christian beliefs, intended to be used for teaching and "
"instruction (and also one of the Four Forms of Unity, depending on the "
"denomination).  This catechism is also divided into a series of questions and "
"answers, covering various aspects of theology, morality, and Christian living."
msgstr ""
"由《威斯敏斯特短篇信仰问答》与《威斯敏斯特大教理问答》整合而成的大型精装书。书中阐释了基督教改革宗系统神学教义的最基本框架，对基督教信仰的简明而系统的总结，"
"旨在用于教学和指导（也是英、美的长老派及北美的公理会与浸信会联合信条之一，具体用法取决于教派）。这本教义通过一系列的问答，呈现了神学、道德和基督徒生活的各个"
"方面。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Luther's Catechism"
msgid_plural "copies of the Luther's Catechism"
msgstr[0] "路德宗教理问答"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Luther's Catechism"
msgid ""
"The Luther's Small Catechism and the Luther's Large Catechism into one single "
"large, hardcover book.  It contains a summary of Christian doctrine and was "
"intended to be used as a teaching tool for laypeople, particularly parents "
"and pastors, to instruct them in the basic principles of the Christian faith."
msgstr ""
"《路德小教理问答》和《路德大教理问答》合订的为一本大型精装书。它包含了基督教教义的总结，旨在作为非信徒（特别是父母和牧师）的教学工具，指导他们了解基督教信仰"
"的基本原则。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Buddhist Catechism"
msgid_plural "copies of the Buddhist Catechism"
msgstr[0] "佛教教义问答"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Buddhist Catechism"
msgid ""
"A paperback book written by Henry Steel Olcott and Published in 1881.  It "
"serves as an introductory guide to Buddhism, providing a concise overview of "
"its principles, practices, and history.  The book presents a series of "
"questions and answers that cover various aspects of Buddhism, including the "
"life of the Buddha, the Four Noble Truths, the Eightfold Path, karma, "
"rebirth, meditation, and ethics."
msgstr ""
"亨利·斯太尔·奥尔科特创作的一本平装书，出版于1881"
"年。它是佛教的入门指南，简要介绍了佛教的原理、实践和历史。这本书提出了一系列的问题和答案，涵盖了佛教各个方面的理论，包括佛的一生、四谛、八正道、十二缘起支、"
"轮回、冥想和伦理思想。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Safinatun Najah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Safinatun Najah"
msgstr[0] "法源论纲"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Safinatun Najah"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Safinatun Najah, a renowned manual of "
"Islamic jurisprudence, specifically focusing on the Shafi'i school of "
"thought.  It serves as a comprehensive guide for Muslims seeking knowledge "
"and understanding of the principles and practices of Islam."
msgstr "著名的伊斯兰法学手册《法源论纲》的精装英译本，专门关注沙斐仪学派。它是穆斯林寻求知识和理解伊斯兰教原则和实践的全面指南。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Heidelberg Catechism"
msgid_plural "copies of the Heidelberg Catechism"
msgstr[0] "海德堡要理问答"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Heidelberg Catechism"
msgid ""
"A hardcover, updated edition of the 'Heidelberg Catechism', a Protestant "
"confession of faith and also a guide for religious instruction, written in "
"1563 (and also one of the Three Forms of Unity, or Four Forms of Unity, "
"depending on the denomination).  The contents consists of 129 questions and "
"answers, divided into three main sections: guilt, grace, and gratitude.  Each "
"section addresses a different aspect of the Christian faith and is intended "
"to be memorized and understood by believers."
msgstr ""
"《海德堡要理问答》的精装更新版，这是一本基督教新教的信仰告白和宗教教育指南，写于1563"
"年（也是《信仰统一三形态》或《信仰统一四形态》之一，取决于不同的教派）。其内容包含129"
"个问答，分为罪、恩典和感恩三大主要部分。每个部分都涉及基督教信仰的不同方面，旨在让信徒熟记并理解。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Philaret Catechism"
msgid_plural "copies of the Philaret Catechism"
msgstr[0] "菲拉列特教理问答"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Philaret Catechism"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Philaret Catechism, written by the "
"Metropolitan Philaret of Moscow in the 19th century.  This book serves as a "
"comprehensive guide to the teachings and beliefs of the Eastern Orthodox "
"Church, structured in a question-and-answer format and covers various aspects "
"of Christian doctrine, including theology, morality, sacraments, prayer, and "
"the Ten Commandments."
msgstr ""
"《菲拉列特教理问答》的精装英译本，由莫斯科都主教菲拉列特于19"
"世纪撰写。该书是一本全面介绍东正教教义和信仰的指南，采用问答形式，涵盖基督教教义的各个方面，从神学、道德、圣礼、祈祷到十诫。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Keach's Catechism"
msgid_plural "copies of the Keach's Catechism"
msgstr[0] "基赤要理"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Keach's Catechism"
msgid ""
"A hardcover edition of the Keach's Catechism, a Reformed Baptist catechism "
"consisting of a set of basic questions and answers from scripture teaching "
"readers the basics of the Baptist faith."
msgstr "《基赤要理》的精装版，这是一部改革浸信会要理，由一系列基于圣经的基本问答组成，教导读者浸信会信仰的基础知识。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pentecostal Catechism"
msgid_plural "copies of the Pentecostal Catechism"
msgstr[0] "五旬节派要理"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Pentecostal Catechism"
msgid ""
"A hardcover edition of the Pentecostal Catechism, a comprehensive guide to "
"the beliefs, practices, and teachings of the Pentecostal movement within "
"Christianity."
msgstr "《五旬节派要理》的精装版，这是一本全面指导基督教内五旬节运动信仰、实践和教义的指南。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Canons of Dort"
msgid_plural "copies of the Canons of Dort"
msgstr[0] "多特信经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Canons of Dort"
msgid ""
"A rare English translation of the Canons of Dort, a significant theological "
"document within the Reformed tradition.  It consists of five main points: The "
"Corruption of Human Nature, Unconditional Election, Limited Atonement, "
"Irresistible Grace and Perseverance of the Saints.  It is also one of the "
"Three Forms of Unity, or Four Forms of Unity, depending on the denomination."
msgstr ""
"《多特信经》（改革宗传承中的重要神学文献）的罕见英译本。包括五个要点：人性的败坏、无条件的拣选、有限的赎罪、不可抗拒的恩典和圣徒的坚忍不拔。在不同教派中，它"
"还是三项联合信条或者四项联合信条中的一项。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Confession of Faith"
msgid_plural "copies of the Confession of Faith"
msgstr[0] "信条"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Confession of Faith"
msgid ""
"A rare English translation of the Confession of Faith, also known as the "
"Belgic Confession.  It is a collection of documents in Christian theology and "
"written statements of belief or doctrines.  These confessions aim to "
"summarize and articulate the core beliefs of particular Christian "
"denominations and traditions.  It also serve as a guide for the members of "
"the church to understand and uphold the essential teachings of their faith.  "
"It is also one of the Three Forms of Unity, or Four Forms of Unity, depending "
"on the denomination."
msgstr ""
"《信条》的罕见英译本，又名《比利时信条》。它是基督教神学和信仰或教义书面声明的文档合集。这些信条旨在总结和阐明特定基督教教派及其传承的核心信仰。它也成为了教"
"会成员理解和维护信仰的基本教义的指南。在不同教派中，它还是三项联合信条或者四项联合信条中的一项。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Orthodox Church"
msgid_plural "copies of The Orthodox Church"
msgstr[0] "正教会"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Orthodox Church"
msgid ""
"A paperback edition of 'The Orthodox Church: An Introduction to Eastern "
"Christianity', written by Timothy Ware.  This book provides a comprehensive "
"overview of the history, theology, and practices of the Eastern Orthodox "
"Church, and an introduction to the Orthodox faith for those unfamiliar with "
"it, as well as a deeper exploration for those seeking to deepen their "
"understanding."
msgstr ""
"平装版《正教会：东方基督教简介》，提摩太·瓦雷著。这本书全面概述了东正教的历史、理念和作风，向不熟悉的人介绍东正教的信仰，也能为想要详细了解的人提供更深层次"
"的内容。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Didascalia Apostolorum"
msgid_plural "copies of the Didascalia Apostolorum"
msgstr[0] "宗徒训诲录"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Didascalia Apostolorum"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of the Didascalia Apostolorum, an ancient "
"Christian text that provides instructions and guidelines for the organization "
"and governance of the early Christian Church.  The Didascalia Apostolorum is "
"attributed to the Twelve Apostles, and is believed to have been written in "
"the third century AD."
msgstr "《宗徒训诲录》的平装英文译本，一本古老的基督教典籍，是早期基督教会组织和管理的说明与指导书。《宗徒训诲录》来自十二宗徒，被认为著成于三世纪。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Ladder of Divine Ascent"
msgid_plural "copies of The Ladder of Divine Ascent"
msgstr[0] "神圣攀登的天梯 "

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Ladder of Divine Ascent"
msgid ""
"A commercial-grade, hardcover English edition of The Ladder of Divine Ascent, "
"a well-known spiritual guidebook written in the 6th century by John Climacus, "
"an Orthodox Christian monk.  This book is composed of many chapters, each "
"representing a rung on the ladder, symbolizing the spiritual journey towards "
"union with God."
msgstr ""
"著名书籍《神圣攀登的天梯 "
"》的精装英文版，为读者提供灵魂的指引，由6世纪的东正教僧侣所著。此书包括许多章节，每一章都代表着一级阶梯，象征着与上帝联系同一的更进一步。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Jaiva Dharma"
msgid_plural "copies of the Jaiva Dharma"
msgstr[0] "微灵天职"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Jaiva Dharma"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of the Jaiva Dharma, a significant "
"philosophical and devotional book written by Srila Bhaktivinoda Thakura, a "
"prominent spiritual leader and philosopher in the Gaudiya Vaishnava Hindu "
"tradition.  This book delves into the essential teachings of the "
"Bhagavad-gita and the Srimad-Bhagavatam, providing deep insights into the "
"nature of the soul, its relationship with God, and the process of spiritual "
"realization."
msgstr ""
"《微灵天职》的平装英译本，Gaudiya Vaishnava派印度教中杰出的精神领袖和哲学家Srila Bhaktivinoda "
"Thakura所著，充满了哲理与虔诚。这本书深入研究了《博伽梵歌》和《圣典博伽梵歌》的基本教义，提供了对灵魂本质的深刻见解，灵魂与神的关系，以及悟道的步骤。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Book of the Counsels of Zoroaster"
msgid_plural "copies of the Book of the Counsels of Zoroaster"
msgstr[0] "琐罗亚斯德箴言录"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Book of the Counsels of Zoroaster"
msgid ""
"This is a rare English translation of the 'Book of the Counsels of "
"Zoroaster', also known as 'Pand-namag i Zardust', a post-Sasanian compendium "
"of apothegms intended to instruct every Zoroastrian male, upon his attaining "
"the age of fifteen years, in fundamental religious and ethical principles, as "
"well as in the daily duties incumbent upon him."
msgstr ""
"《琐罗亚斯德箴言录》的罕见英译本，又名《Pand-namag i "
"Zardust》，后萨珊王朝时期的一本箴言合集，旨在指导年满15岁的拜火教男信徒学习基本的宗教和伦理原则，以及日常义务。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Anglican Book of Common Prayer"
msgid_plural "copies of the Anglican Book of Common Prayer"
msgstr[0] "圣公宗公祷书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Anglican Book of Common Prayer"
msgid ""
"A hardcover edition of the Anglican Book of Common Prayer.  It once held "
"great significance in the Anglican Church, but still contain a collection of "
"liturgical prayers, rites, catechisms and instructions that provide a "
"standardized format for various religious services and ceremonies."
msgstr "《圣公宗公祷书》的精装版。它曾在圣公宗中占有重要地位，但现在其中包含的礼仪祷文、仪式、教义和说明依然为各种宗教仪式和典礼提供了标准化格式。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Kebra Negast"
msgid_plural "copies of the Kebra Negast"
msgstr[0] "列王荣耀记"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Kebra Negast"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Kebra Negast, also known as the Glory "
"of the Kings.  It is an ancient Ethiopian text that holds significant "
"religious and historical value for the Ethiopian Orthodox Church and the "
"Rastafarian movement.  It is a compilation of sacred stories and legends that "
"revolve around the life of King Solomon and the Queen of Sheba, as well as "
"the birth and early life of King Menelik I, the founder of the Ethiopian "
"Empire."
msgstr ""
"《列王荣耀记》的精装英译本，也被称为《王之荣耀》。这是一部古埃塞俄比亚的文书，对埃塞俄比亚东正教和拉斯特法里运动具有重要的宗教和历史价值。这是一部神圣故事和"
"传说的合集，围绕所罗门王和示巴女王的生活，以及埃塞俄比亚帝国的创始人孟尼利克王一世的出生和早期生活。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Guru Granth Sahib"
msgid_plural "copies of The Guru Granth Sahib"
msgstr[0] "《永存師尊》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Guru Granth Sahib"
msgid "A single-volume copy of the central religious texts of Sikhism."
msgstr "錫克教的宗教核心文本。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hadith"
msgid_plural "copies of Hadith"
msgstr[0] "《穆罕默德聖訓》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Hadith"
msgid ""
"A Muslim religious text containing an account of the sayings and actions of "
"the prophet Muhammad."
msgstr "穆斯林的典籍， 是先知穆罕默德的言行錄。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Principia Discordia"
msgid_plural "copies of Principia Discordia"
msgstr[0] "《渾沌原則》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Principia Discordia"
msgid ""
"A book that embodies the main beliefs of Discordianism.  It seems to "
"primarily concern chaos, and features a card in the back which informs you "
"that you are now a 'genuine and authorized Pope of Discordia'."
msgstr "一本體現了渾沌學說主要信仰的書。似乎著眼於混沌學， 在書背的小卡上有 '你現在就是正式授權的渾沌教宗' 字樣。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Kojiki"
msgid_plural "copies of The Kojiki"
msgstr[0] "《古事記》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Kojiki"
msgid ""
"The oldest extant chronicle of Japan's myths and history, the stories "
"contained in the Kojiki are part of the inspiration behind Shinto practices."
msgstr "現存最古老的日本歷史神話編年史， 古事記中一部分的故事啟發了神道教的發展。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Nihon Shoki"
msgid_plural "copies of the Nihon Shoki"
msgstr[0] "日本书纪"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Nihon Shoki"
msgid ""
"Also known as 'Chronicles of Japan', it is considered one of the two most "
"important and oldest chronicles of ancient Japan, the other being the Kojiki. "
" The Nihon Shoki covers the history of Japan with a compilation of myths, "
"legends, religious practices, rituals and historical events."
msgstr "一本日本编年史，是古代日本最重要且久远的纪年史书，另一本是古事记。《日本书纪》从神话、传说、宗教、仪式和历史事件等多个方面记录了日本历史。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Fudoki"
msgid_plural "copies of the Fudoki"
msgstr[0] "古风土记"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Fudoki"
msgid ""
"A somewhat large paperback book containing a extensive compilation of "
"historical records and chronicles that originated in ancient Japan (probably "
"during the Nara and Heian periods).  It covers local legends, folklore, "
"religious beliefs, agricultural practices, dialects, historical events, "
"quantity and quality of resources, boundaries, topography, climate, flora, "
"fauna, and cultural practices of several Japanese provinces at that time."
msgstr ""
"一本稍大的平装书，包含了许多关于古代日本（奈良与平安时期）的历史记录和编年记载。内容覆盖了本土神话、民俗传说、宗教信仰、地方方言、农业实践、历史事件、资源分"
"布、地界、地形、气候、植被、物种，以及一些文化现象和日本当时的行省设置。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ofudekasi"
msgid_plural "copies of the Ofudekasi"
msgstr[0] "御笔先"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Ofudekasi"
msgid ""
"A large English translation of the most significant of the three scriptures "
"within the Tenrikyo religious tradition (the other two being the Mikagura-uta "
"and Osashizu).  It serves as an essential text that provides a comprehensive "
"understanding of the fundamental beliefs and doctrines of Tenrikyo."
msgstr ""
"《御书》是天理教（Tenrikyo）宗教传统中三部最重要经文之一的大部头英文译本（其余两部为《御歌》和《御笔之旨》）。它作为一部必读的经文，为人们全面理解天"
"理教的基本信仰和教义提供了深刻见解。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mikagura-uta"
msgid_plural "copies of the Mikagura-uta"
msgstr[0] "御神乐歌"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Mikagura-uta"
msgid ""
"A English translation of the Mikagura-uta, one of the most significant books "
"within the Tenrikyo Religious Tradition.  It is a collection of hymns and "
"prayers that serve as a guide for the followers of the Tenrikyo."
msgstr "《御歌》是天理教宗教传统中最重要的书籍之一的英文译本。它是一系列赞美诗和祈祷文的集合，为天理教的信徒们提供了行为指南。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Osashizu"
msgid_plural "copies of the Osashizu"
msgstr[0] "御指图"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Osashizu"
msgid ""
"A English translation of the Osashizu, one of the most significant books "
"within the Tenrikyo Religious Tradition.  It serves as a guide for followers "
"of the religion or people wishing to learn about it, providing spiritual "
"teachings, ethical principles, and practical advice on various aspects of "
"life."
msgstr ""
"《御笔之旨》是天理教宗教传统中最重要的书籍之一的英文译本。它既是信徒们的宗教指南，也是希望了解天理教的人们的学习资料。它提供了精神教诲、道德原则以及关于生活"
"各个方面的实用建议。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Doctrines of Tenrikyo"
msgid_plural "copies of the Doctrines of Tenrikyo"
msgstr[0] "天理教教典"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Doctrines of Tenrikyo"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of Tenrikyo's official doctrine.  This book "
"explains the basic teachings of the Tenrikyo Religious Tradition."
msgstr "一本天理教官方教义，英文平装本。这本书阐释了天理教的基本教义。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Life of Oyasama, Foundress of Tenrikyo"
msgid_plural "copies of The Life of Oyasama, Foundress of Tenrikyo"
msgstr[0] "天理教创始人中山美伎的一生"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Life of Oyasama, Foundress of Tenrikyo"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of Tenrikyo's hagiography of Miki Nakayama, "
"foundress of the Tenrikyo Religious Tradition."
msgstr "一本天理教对其创始人中山美伎的传记，英文平装本。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Anecdotes of Oyasama, Foundress of Tenrikyo"
msgid_plural "copies of The Anecdotes of Oyasama, Foundress of Tenrikyo"
msgstr[0] "天理教创始人中山美伎轶事"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Anecdotes of Oyasama, Foundress of Tenrikyo"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of an anthology of anecdotes about Oyasama "
"that were passed down orally by her first followers and later written down "
"and verified."
msgstr "一本英文平装本，收录了中山美伎的趣闻轶事。这些趣闻最初由她的首批追随者口口相传，后来得以文字记录和查证。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Buluotuo"
msgid_plural "copies of the Buluotuo"
msgstr[0] "布洛陀"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Buluotuo"
msgid ""
"This is very rare English translation of the Buluotuo, a sacred epic in "
"Moism, the religion of most Zhuang people, the largest ethnic minority of "
"China.  This book addresses the creation of the Universe and life as well as "
"how to live a religiously meritorious life inside Moism.  This book also "
"contains information on entities, deities, gods, goddesses, prayers, "
"practices and rituals of Moism."
msgstr ""
"一本《布洛陀经诗》稀有的的英译本，《布洛陀经诗》是中国最大的少数民族的主要信仰——摩教的宗教经典。这本书讲述了人类的起源和生命的诞生，以及如何遵循摩教的思想"
"做功德。这本书还介绍了摩教的神明，祈祷经文和各类宗教仪式。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Guodian Texts"
msgid_plural "copies of the Guodian Texts"
msgstr[0] "郭店简"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Guodian Texts"
msgid ""
"A rare and extensive study and translation of all the manuscripts of The "
"Guodian Chu Slips by Scott Cook.  The original slip-texts include both Taoist "
"and Confucian works that offered fresh information for scholars studying the "
"history of philosophical thought in ancient China."
msgstr ""
"斯科特·库克（Scott "
"Cook）对《郭店楚简》的所有手稿进行了罕见且详尽的研究与翻译。原简文中的内容既有道家作品，也有儒家作品，为学者研究中国古代哲学思想史提供了全新的资料。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Popol Vuh"
msgid_plural "copies of the Popol Vuh"
msgstr[0] "普普尔乌"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Popol Vuh"
msgid ""
"A English edition of the Popol Vuh, a sacred book of the K'iche' Maya people, "
"a native group from the Guatemalan highlands.  It is a combination of "
"creation myths, historical narratives, and heroic legends that revolve around "
"the K'iche' people's origins, culture, and the deities that govern their "
"universe."
msgstr ""
"《波波尔·乌》的英文版，这是基切玛雅人——一个来自危地马拉高地的土著群体的神圣之书。它融合了创世神话、历史叙述和英雄传奇，围绕着基切人的起源、文化以及掌管他"
"们宇宙的神灵展开。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Codex Borbonicus"
msgid_plural "copies of the Codex Borbonicus"
msgstr[0] "波旁尼克手抄本"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Codex Borbonicus"
msgid ""
"A extremely rare English edition of the Codex Borbonicus, an ancient "
"pre-Columbian Mesoamerican manuscript that provides valuable insights into "
"the religious and ritual practices of the Aztecs.  It contains original "
"pictures, illustrations, detailed information about the tonalpohualli (the "
"sacred 260-day calendar), the xiuhpohualli (the agricultural year), deities, "
"rituals, and ceremonies.  This codex also includes depictions and information "
"of various gods and goddesses, sacrificial rites, and astronomical phenomena."
msgstr ""
"《波旁尼克手抄本》的英文版极为罕见，这是一部古老的前哥伦布时期中美洲手稿，为我们深入了解阿兹特克人的宗教和仪式习俗提供了宝贵线索。它包含原始图片、插图，以及"
"关于托纳波胡亚利（神圣的260"
"天历法）、修波胡亚利（农业年历）、神明、仪式和庆典的详细信息。此外，这部法典还描绘了众多神祇、女神的形象，介绍了祭祀仪式和天文现象。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Huarochirí Manuscript"
msgid_plural "copies of the Huarochirí Manuscript"
msgstr[0] "瓦罗奇里手稿"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Huarochirí Manuscript"
msgid ""
"A uncommon English edition of the Huarochirí Manuscript, a collection of "
"Quechua narratives that provides valuable insights into the religious "
"beliefs, rituals, and cosmology of the Inca people."
msgstr "一份不常见的英文版《瓦洛奇里手稿》，这部手稿汇集了克丘亚语叙事作品，为我们深入了解印加人的宗教信仰、仪式和宇宙观提供了宝贵资料。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ugaritic Texts"
msgid_plural "copies of the Ugaritic Texts"
msgstr[0] "乌加里特文本"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Ugaritic Texts"
msgid ""
"A pretty rare English translation of the Ugaritic Texts, a collection of "
"ancient mythological, religious and literature texts regarding the "
"Canaanites.  It contains religious epics such as the Baal Cycle, which "
"recounts the myths surrounding the storm god Baal, as well as hymns, prayers, "
"and rituals that shed light on the religious worldview of the ancient "
"Canaanites and their practices."
msgstr ""
"一份相当罕见的英文版《乌加里特文献》，这是一系列关于迦南人的古代神话、宗教和文学文本的集合。其中包含宗教史诗，如《巴力周期》，它讲述了围绕风暴之神巴力的神话"
"；还有赞美诗、祈祷文和仪式，它们揭示了古代迦南人的宗教世界观和实践。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Book of Kells"
msgid_plural "copies of the Book of Kells"
msgstr[0] "凯尔斯书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Book of Kells"
msgid ""
"A extremely rare English translation of the Book of Kells, a highly decorated "
"and illuminated Celtic manuscript, primarily containing the four Gospels of "
"the New Testament.  This translation mimics perfectly the art and style of "
"the original manuscript, including its elaborate calligraphy, with each "
"letter meticulously designed and adorned with various motifs, including "
"animals, humans, and knotwork patterns."
msgstr ""
"及其稀有的《凯尔斯书》英文精译本，一本看起来装饰精美、光芒四射的凯尔特手稿，主要包含四部新约福音书，这版译本完美地模仿了原始手稿的艺术风格，包括其精心设计的"
"书法，每一个字母都经过精心设计，并装饰成动物，人，绳结的图案。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Book of Leinster"
msgid_plural "copies of the Book of Leister"
msgstr[0] "伦斯特集"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Book of Leinster"
msgid ""
"A incredibly rare English translation of the Book of Leinster, a significant "
"and ancient compilation of Irish literature and history, dating back to the "
"12th century.  It contains annals, genealogies, historical texts, legal "
"tracts, secular and religious poetry and stories from Irish mythology, such "
"as the epic tale \"Táin Bó Cúailnge\", which tells the story of the legendary "
"warrior Cú Chulainn and the cattle raid of Cooley."
msgstr ""
"一本极为罕见的《莱恩斯特之书》英文译本，这是一部重要的古老爱尔兰文学与历史汇编，可追溯至12"
"世纪。它收录了编年史、家谱、历史文本、法律条文、世俗与宗教诗歌，以及爱尔兰神话中的故事，如史诗般的“塔因·博·库阿林格”，讲述了传奇战士库丘林与库利牧场的牛"
"群劫掠事件。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mabinogion"
msgid_plural "copies of the Mabinogion"
msgstr[0] "马比诺吉昂"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Mabinogion"
msgid ""
"A rare English translation of the Mabinogion, a collection of twelve medieval "
"Welsh tales, dating back to the 11th and 12th centuries.  It provide a "
"valuable insight into the mythology, history, religion and culture of "
"medieval Wales."
msgstr ""
"一本稀有的《马比诺吉昂》英文译本，这是一部包含十二篇中世纪威尔士传说的作品集，可追溯至11至12"
"世纪。它为我们提供了了解中世纪威尔士神话、历史、宗教和文化的宝贵视角。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Atra-Hasis"
msgid_plural "copies of the Atra-Hasis"
msgstr[0] "阿特拉哈西斯"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Atra-Hasis"
msgid ""
"A rare English translation of the Mesopotamian Epic Atra-Hasis.  Named for "
"its protagonist, Atrahasis ('exceedingly wise'), the Atra-Hasis include both "
"a creation myth and one of three surviving Babylonian flood myths."
msgstr ""
"一本稀有的英译版美索不达米亚史诗《阿特拉-"
"哈西斯》，这部作品以其主角“阿特拉哈西斯”（意为“极度睿智者”）命名，其中包含了美索不达米亚创世神话以及现存三部巴比伦洪水神话之一的故事内容。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Enki and Ninhursag Myth"
msgid_plural "copies of the Enki and Ninhursag Myth"
msgstr[0] "恩基和宁胡尔萨格的传说"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Enki and Ninhursag Myth"
msgid ""
"A pretty uncommon English translation of the Enki and Ninhursag Myth, a "
"Sumerian creation myth that explains the origins of the world, humanity, and "
"the gods."
msgstr "一部颇为罕见的英译版《恩基与宁胡尔萨格神话》，该神话源自苏美尔文明，阐释了世界起源、人类诞生以及诸神创生的故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Descent of Inanna"
msgid_plural "copies of The Descent of Inanna"
msgstr[0] "伊南娜的后裔"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Descent of Inanna"
msgid ""
"A very rare English translation of the Descent of Inanna, an ancient Sumerian "
"myth that recounts the journey of the goddess Inanna into the underworld, "
"where she seeks to confront her sister Ereshkigal, the Queen of the "
"Underworld."
msgstr "一部极为稀有的英译版《伊南娜下冥界》，这是一部古苏美尔神话，讲述了女神伊南娜深入冥界，意图挑战其姐姐——冥界女王埃列什基伽尔的历险过程。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Heliand"
msgid_plural "copies of the Heliand"
msgstr[0] "撒克逊福音书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Heliand"
msgid ""
"A English translation of the Heliand, an Old Saxon epic poem that narrates "
"the life and passion of Jesus Christ.  It begins with the Annunciation to the "
"Virgin Mary and continues with the birth of Jesus.  It then narrates the "
"story of Jesus' childhood, his baptism by John the Baptist, and his public "
"ministry.  This poem also includes various miracles performed by Jesus, such "
"as healing the sick, raising the dead, and calming the storm."
msgstr ""
"一份英译版《海尔兰德》，这是一部古老的撒克逊史诗，讲述了耶稣基督的生活与受难事迹。诗歌自天使向圣母玛利亚宣告受胎开始叙述，继而展开耶稣诞生的故事。接着描绘了"
"耶稣童年时期的情景，他的洗礼由施洗者约翰主持，并进一步讲述了他的公开传道生涯。在这首诗中，还记录了耶稣所行的各种奇迹，如治愈病人、复活死者以及平息风暴等。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Alphabet of Sirach"
msgid_plural "copies of the Alphabet of Sirach"
msgstr[0] "西拉书的字母"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Alphabet of Sirach"
msgid ""
"A rare English translation of the Alphabet of Sirach, a compilation of two "
"lists of proverbs, 22 in Jewish Babylonian Aramaic and 22 in Medieval Hebrew "
"(all translated to English), both arranged as alphabetic acrostics, with each "
"proverb followed by an aggadic commentary."
msgstr ""
"一部罕见的英译版《便西拉智训字母篇》，该书汇编了两组共44条箴言，其中22条采用犹太巴比伦阿拉米语编写，另外22"
"条则以中世纪希伯来语写成（所有内容均翻译成了英文）。这些箴言特别地按照字母顺序排列成首尾相连的串句形式，每条箴言后均附有一段aggadic（阿加达）注释性质"
"的评论。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Buddha and His Dhamma"
msgid_plural "copies of The Buddha and His Dhamma"
msgstr[0] "佛陀及其教法"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Buddha and His Dhamma"
msgid ""
"A English translation of The Buddha and His Dhamma by B. R. Ambedkar.  It is "
"a interpretation of the Buddhist path and the scripture for those who follow "
"Navayana Buddhism."
msgstr "一本《佛陀及其法》英文译本，是B.R. 阿姆贝卡对佛教道路和经文的阐释，它是那些追随新佛教（Navayana Buddhism）之人的教义。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Panaturan"
msgid_plural "copies of the Panaturan"
msgstr[0] "帕纳图兰"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Panaturan"
msgid ""
"A extremely rare English translation of the Panaturan, the Holy Scripture of "
"the Kaharingan religion.  It is a guide for its adherents and followers, "
"providing them with spiritual teachings, moral lessons, and principles to "
"live by."
msgstr "一本极其罕见的《帕纳图兰》英译本，这是卡哈林甘宗教的圣典。它为信徒们提供精神指引、道德教诲与生活准则。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Zhivotnaya Kniga"
msgid_plural "copies of the Zhivotnaya Kniga"
msgstr[0] "生命之书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Zhivotnaya Kniga"
msgid ""
"A extremely rare English translation of the Zhivotnaya Kniga (Book of Life).  "
"It is a collection of written and translated Doukhobor oral holy hymns, but "
"this book also has the Russian version alongside the English translations."
msgstr "一本极为罕见的《生命之书》英文译本。它汇集了书面记录并翻译的道库霍伯尔圣洁赞美诗，且书中同时包含了俄文原文与对应的英文译文。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Book of Mormon"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of Mormon"
msgstr[0] "《摩門之書》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Book of Mormon"
msgid ""
"The sacred text of the Latter Day Saint movement of Christianity, originally "
"published in 1830 by Joseph Smith."
msgstr "基督教後期聖徒運動的神聖文本， 最初由約瑟夫·史密斯發表於 1830 年。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Holy Books of the East"
msgid_plural "copies of the Holy Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第二卷"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Holy Books of the East"
msgid ""
"It is a monumental 50-volume set of English translations of Asian religious "
"texts.  It incorporates the essential sacred texts of Hinduism, Buddhism, "
"Taoism, Confucianism, Zoroastrianism, Jainism, and Islam."
msgstr "这是一本包含亚洲宗教文本英译的鸿篇巨作，共50卷。其中汇编了印度教、佛教、道教、儒家、琐罗亚斯德教、耆那教以及伊斯兰教等各大宗教的核心圣典。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Holy Books of the East"
msgid "Sacred Book of the East Vol. 1"
msgid_plural "copies of the first volume of the Sacred Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第一卷"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Book of the East Vol. 1" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
msgid ""
"It contains The Upanishads, part 1/2: Khândogya Upanishad, Talavakâra (or "
"Kena-Upanishad), Aitareya-Âranyaka, Kaushîtaki-Brâhmana and "
"Vâjasaneyi-Sâmhita Upanishad."
msgstr ""
"这本书包含《奥义书》第1/2部分的《乔达磨奥义书》（Khândogya "
"Upanishad）、《凯那奥义书》（Talavakâra）、《爱达瑞亚森林书》（Aitareya-"
"Âranyaka）、《考希塔基奥义书》（Kaushîtaki-Brâhmana）以及《伐遮斯内义奥义书》（Vâjasaneyi-Sâmhita "
"Upanishad）。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Holy Books of the East"
msgid "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 2"
msgid_plural "copies of the second volume of the Sacred Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第二卷"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 2" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
msgid ""
"It contains The Sacred Laws of the Aryas (Dharmasastra), part 1/2: Âpastamba, "
"Gautama, Vâsishtha and Baudhâyana."
msgstr ""
"这本书包含《雅利安人法经》（Dharmasastra）第1/2"
"部分中的《阿帕斯檀跋法经》（AÂpastamba）、《乔达磨法经》（Gautama）、《婆私咤法经》（Vâsishtha）以及《包德哈亚那法经》（Baudh"
"âyana）。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Holy Books of the East"
msgid "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 3"
msgid_plural "copies of the third volume of the Sacred Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第三卷"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 3" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
msgid ""
"It contains The Sacred Books of China, part 1/6, the texts of Confucianism: "
"The Shû King (Classic of History), Book of Thang, Books of Yu, Books of Hsiâ, "
"Books of Shang, Books of Kâu, Shih King, the Book of Odes (Classic of Poetry, "
"I - Odes of the Temple and the Altar, II - Minor Odes of the Kingdom, III - "
"Major Odes of the Kingdom, IV - Lessons from the States) and The Hsiâo King "
"(Classic of Filial Piety)."
msgstr ""
"这本书包含了《中国圣书》第1/6"
"部分中的儒家经典，《尚书》（包含《尧典》、《虞书》、《夏书》、《商书》、《周书》）、《诗经》（包含《颂》、《小雅》、《大雅》、《风》）以及《孝经》。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Holy Books of the East"
msgid "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 4"
msgid_plural "copies of the fourth volume of the Sacred Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第四卷"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 4" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
msgid "It contains The Zend-Avesta, part 1/3: Vendîdâd."
msgstr "这本书包含了《赞德-阿维斯塔》的第1/2部分——《旺迪达德》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Holy Books of the East"
msgid "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 5"
msgid_plural "copies of the fifth volume of the Sacred Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第五卷"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 5" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
msgid ""
"It contains the Pahlavi Texts, part 1/5: Bundahis, selections of Zâd-sparam, "
"Bahman Yast, Shâyast lâ-Shâyast."
msgstr ""
"这本书包含了《帕赫拉维文本》第1/5部分的内容，包括《邦达希斯》（Bundahis）、《扎德·斯帕拉姆选集》（Zâd-sparam "
"selections）、《巴赫曼雅斯特》（Bahman Yast）以及《沙耶斯特·拉·沙耶斯特》（Shâyast lâ-Shâyast）。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Holy Books of the East"
msgid "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 6"
msgid_plural "copies of the sixth volume of the Sacred Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第六卷"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 6" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
msgid "It contains The Holy Qur'an part 1/2, from chapters I to XVI."
msgstr "这本书包含了《古兰经》的第一部分，涵盖了从第一章到第十六章的内容。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Holy Books of the East"
msgid "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 7"
msgid_plural "copies of the seventh volume of the Sacred Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第七卷"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 7" of item "Holy
#. Books of the East"
msgid "It contains The Institutes of Vishnu."
msgstr "这本书包含了《毗湿奴法典》。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Holy Books of the East"
msgid "Sacred Books of the East Vol. 8"
msgid_plural "copies of the eighth volume of the Sacred Books of the East"
msgstr[0] "东方圣书第八卷"

