msgid ""
"A hardcover copy of the Spiral Dance, written by Starhawk, a prominent "
"author, and activist in the fields of feminism, spirituality, and "
"environmentalism.  First published in 1979, this book explores the beliefs, "
"practices, and history of the Goddess movement, which is a spiritual and "
"feminist response to patriarchal religions.  The Goddess movement seeks to "
"reclaim and revive the worship of the divine feminine in various forms."
msgstr ""
"一本《螺旋之舞》精装本。这本书的作者斯塔霍克是一位杰出的作家，也是一位女权主义、灵性和环保主义领域的活动家。该书于1979"
"年首次出版，探讨了女神运动的信仰、实践和历史，作为对父权宗教的女权主义的灵性回应。女神运动寻求以各种形式复兴对神圣女性的崇拜。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Dianetics"
msgid_plural "copies of Dianetics"
msgstr[0] "《戴尼提》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Dianetics"
msgid ""
"This book is the canonical text of Scientology.  Written by a science fiction "
"author, it contains self-improvement techniques and musings on psychology "
"called Dianetics."
msgstr "這本書是山達基教的經典。它是由一個科幻小說家撰寫，這種自我幫助系統和心理冥想被稱為戴尼提。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Book of the SubGenius"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of the SubGenius"
msgstr[0] "《飛碟教之書》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Book of the SubGenius"
msgid ""
"A book about the Church of the SubGenius.  It seems to involve a salesman "
"named J. R. \"Bob\" Dobbs and a concept called 'slack'."
msgstr "一本關於飛碟教的書。似乎跟某個叫做 J. R. \"Bob\" 的推銷員有關， 並且有著鬆散的學說。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Book of Mozilla"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of Mozilla"
msgstr[0] "火狐之书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Book of Mozilla"
msgid ""
"A mysterious deep-red book with the title 'The Book of Mozilla' at the front. "
" The contents of this book are written in some sort of easy-to-understand "
"computer language and are a collection of prophetic and apocryphal verses of "
"unknown origin."
msgstr "一本绯红色的神秘书籍，封面写着“Mozilla之书”。这本书用某种易于理解的计算机语言编写，涉及预言和对圣经的拙劣模仿，而这些内容的源头则不为人知。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Blue Book of the Blue Frog"
msgid_plural "copies of the Blue Book of the Blue Frog"
msgstr[0] "蓝青蛙的蓝皮书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Blue Book of the Blue Frog"
msgid ""
"A curious handwritten blue book of unknown origin.  The contents of this book "
"are complex, regarding stories of the 'Blue Frog', a strange cult called 'The "
"Blue Frog Cult', its prophecies, the rules that the cult's followers must "
"adhere to and also the practices, religious and political hierarchy of this "
"cult.  Not much for a scavenger."
msgstr ""
"一本来历不明的手写蓝色小书，引人好奇。书中内容错综复杂，讲述了一个名为“蓝蛙”的奇异传说，以及与其相关的“蓝蛙教”——一个诡异的信仰团体，包括其预言、信徒必"
"须遵循的戒律，以及该教派的宗教与政治等级制度等。对拾荒者来说，这似乎不太实用。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Mahayana Sutras"
msgid_plural "copies of The Mahayana Sutras"
msgstr[0] "大般涅槃经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Mahayana Sutras"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Mahayana Sutras, a collection of "
"scriptures that form the foundation of Mahayana Buddhism.  Those cover a wide "
"range of topics and teachings, including, but not limited to, discourses on "
"meditation, ethics, philosophy, cosmology, and the nature of reality."
msgstr "《大乘佛经》的精装英文译本，是构成大乘佛教基础的经文集。 这些涵盖了广泛的主题和教义，包括但不限于关于冥想、伦理学、哲学、宇宙学和现实本质的论述。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Tibetan Buddhist Canon"
msgid_plural "copies of the Tibetan Buddhist Canon"
msgstr[0] "藏传佛教大藏经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Tibetan Buddhist Canon"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Tibetan Buddhist Canon, also known as "
"the Kangyur and Tengyur, or Vajrayana Canon.  It contains a vast collection "
"of sacred texts that form the basis of the Buddhist teachings in Tibetan "
"Buddhism.  It consists of two main parts: the Kangyur, which contains the "
"translated words of the Buddha, and the Tengyur, which comprises commentaries "
"by Indian and Tibetan scholars."
msgstr ""
"一本英文精装版《藏传佛教大藏经》，亦称为《甘珠尔》与《丹珠尔》，或《金刚乘藏经》。这部藏经汇集了构成藏传佛教教义基础的大量神圣文献。它分为两大主要部分：《甘"
"珠尔》收录佛陀的译文，而《丹珠尔》则包含印度与西藏学者的注释作品。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Bhagavad Gita"
msgid_plural "copies of The Bhagavad Gita"
msgstr[0] "薄伽梵歌"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Bhagavad Gita"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of The Bhagavad Gita, a 700-verse Hindu "
"scripture.  It is written in the form of a dialogue between Prince Arjuna and "
"the god Krishna, who serves as his charioteer.  The conversation takes place "
"on the battlefield of Kurukshetra just before the start of a great war "
"between two factions of a royal family."
msgstr ""
"一本英文精装版《薄伽梵歌》。这是一部深具灵性的印度教圣典，包含700"
"个诗节。本书以对话形式展开，讲述了在库鲁克谢特拉战场上，王子阿周那在战前紧张时刻与其战车御者神克里希纳之间的深刻对话。这场对话发生在一场因王室内部纷争而引发"
"的即将爆发的宏伟战役之前。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Mahabharata"
msgid_plural "copies of The Mahabharata"
msgstr[0] "摩诃婆罗多"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Mahabharata"
msgid ""
"A large and complete hardcover English translation of The Mahabharata, the "
"most revered and significant ancient texts in Indian literature and Hindu "
"mythology.  It is an epic narrative that has been passed down through "
"generations and has been a source of inspiration and guidance for millions of "
"people before and possibly during and after the Cataclysm.  The epic is "
"divided into 18 books or parvas, each focusing on different aspects of the "
"story, such as the genealogy of the Pandavas, the education of the Pandavas, "
"and the great war of Kurukshetra."
msgstr ""
"《摩诃婆罗多》的大型完整精装英文译本，是印度文学和印度教神话中最受尊敬和最重要的古代文本。这是一个史诗般的叙事，代代相传，在大灾难之前、期间和之后，它一直是"
"数百万人的灵感和指导来源。这部史诗分为18本书，每本书都聚焦于故事的不同方面，如潘达瓦人的家谱、潘达瓦的教育和库鲁克谢特拉的伟大战争。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Ramayana"
msgid_plural "copies of The Ramayana"
msgstr[0] "罗摩衍那"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Ramayana"
msgid ""
"A complete hardcover English translation of The Ramayana, an ancient Indian "
"epic that holds great religious and cultural significance in Hinduism.  It is "
"considered one of the two major Sanskrit epics of ancient Indian literature "
"and tells the story of Prince Rama, an incarnation of Lord Vishnu, who "
"embarks on a journey to rescue his wife Sita from the demon king Ravana.  The "
"epic is divided into seven books, known as Kandas, and presents a narrative "
"that encompasses themes of devotion, righteousness, duty, honor, love, and "
"the triumph of good over evil."
msgstr ""
"《罗摩衍那》是印度古代的一部史诗，在印度教中具有重要的宗教和文化意义。它被认为是古代印度文学的两大梵文史诗之一，讲述了毗湿奴神的化身、王子罗摩在拯救被恶魔罗"
"波那掳走的妻子悉多的旅途中的故事。这部史诗分为七卷，称为“卡拉达”，讲述了关于忠诚、正义、责任、荣誉、爱情以及善战胜恶的故事。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Puranas"
msgid_plural "copies of The Puranas"
msgstr[0] "往世书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Puranas"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of The Puranas, a collection of ancient "
"Indian texts that form an integral part of Hindu literature.  They are "
"considered to be among the oldest and most authoritative scriptures in "
"Hinduism, alongside the Vedas.  It consist of a vast collection of "
"narratives, legends, genealogies, cosmology, theology, philosophy, and "
"rituals related to Hinduism, and are classified into two main categories: "
"Mahapuranas (major Puranas) and Upapuranas (minor Puranas)."
msgstr ""
"一本精装版的《往世书》的英文译本，这是古代印度文本的合集，是印度教文学的不可或缺的一部分。它们与《吠陀》一起被认为是印度教中最古老和最权威的经典之一。该书包"
"含了大量的叙事、传说、家谱、宇宙学、神学、哲学和与印度教相关的仪式，被分为两大类：大往世书（Mahapuranas）和小往世书（Upapuranas）。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Agamas"
msgid_plural "copies of The Agamas"
msgstr[0] "传承经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Agamas"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of The Agamas, a collection of scriptures in "
"Hinduism that provide detailed guidelines for rituals, temple construction, "
"worship practices, and philosophical teachings, and are considered "
"authoritative texts by several Hindu sects, particularly those that follow "
"the Shaiva and Shakta traditions."
msgstr ""
"一本平装版的《阿迦摩经》的英文译本，这部印度教的经典文集提供了对宗教仪式、寺庙建筑、礼拜活动和哲学教义的详细指导，并被多个印度教教派，特别是湿婆派和夏克提派"
"，视为权威文本。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Jain Agamas"
msgid_plural "copies of the Jain Agamas"
msgstr[0] "耆那教圣典"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Jain Agamas"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of the Jain Agamas, the most authoritative "
"and sacred scriptures in Jainism.  The Jain Agamas consist of two main "
"categories: the Angas and the Upangas.  The Angas are considered the primary "
"scriptures, while the Upangas are supplementary texts that provide further "
"explanations and commentaries on various aspects of Jain philosophy and "
"practice."
msgstr ""
"这本英文平装版的《耆那教圣典》是耆那教中最权威和神圣的经典文献。《耆那教圣典》主要分为两个类别：主经（Angas）和附经（Upangas）。主经被认为是主要"
"的经典，而附经是补充文本，提供了关于耆那教哲学和实践各个方面的进一步解释和评论。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Sutras of the Buddha"
msgid_plural "copies of The Sutras of the Buddha"
msgstr[0] "《佛陀經藏》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Sutras of the Buddha"
msgid "A collection of discourses attributed to the Buddha and his close disciples."
msgstr "一本佛陀諸弟子與佛陀間對話的合輯。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Zara Avesta"
msgid_plural "copies of the Zara Avesta"
msgstr[0] "阿维斯陀经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Zara Avesta"
msgid ""
"A rare hardcover English translation of the Zara Avesta, a collection of "
"sacred hymns, prayers, and liturgies, which are believed to have been "
"revealed by Zoroaster himself.  It is considered an essential guide to living "
"a righteous life in Zoroastrianism, as it provides moral teachings, ethical "
"principles, and spiritual insights."
msgstr ""
"一本珍稀的《阿维斯陀经》英译精装本，这是一部神圣的赞美诗、祈祷词和礼仪的合集，被认为是由查拉图斯特拉本人亲自揭示的。因其提供了道德教义、伦理原则和精神洞察，"
"因此被它被视为拜火教的教义生活的基本指南。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Theogony"
msgid_plural "copies of the Theogony"
msgstr[0] "神谱"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Theogony"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of the Theogony, a Greek epic poem attributed "
"to the ancient poet Hesiod.  It is one of the oldest surviving works of Greek "
"literature and provides a comprehensive account of the origins and "
"genealogies of the Greek gods, as well as the creation of the universe and "
"the establishment of divine order."
msgstr ""
"一本《神谱》的平装英译本。这是一部古希腊诗人赫西俄德所著的史诗，是现存最古老的希腊文学作品之一。 "
"这部作品详细讲述了希腊众神的起源、谱系，以及宇宙的诞生和神界的秩序建立。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Orphic Hymns"
msgid_plural "copies of The Orphic Hymns"
msgstr[0] "俄耳甫斯祷歌"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Orphic Hymns"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of The Orphic Hymns, a collection of ancient "
"Greek hymns attributed to the legendary poet Orpheus.  These hymns are a "
"significant source of information about Greek religion, philosophy, and "
"literature.  It is divided in a set of 88 hymns, divided into 10 sections, "
"and the hymns are dedicated to various gods and goddesses in the Greek "
"pantheon, as well as to heroes and abstract concepts."
msgstr ""
"一本《俄耳甫斯祷歌》的平装英译本。这是一部古希腊时期归功于传奇诗人奥菲斯的古老赞歌集，是了解希腊宗教、哲学和文学的重要资料。全书分为十个章节，共88"
"首颂歌，献给希腊神话中的众神、女神、英雄以及抽象的概念。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Orphic Gold Tablets"
msgid_plural "copies of The Orphic Gold Tablets"
msgstr[0] "俄耳甫斯金片"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Orphic Gold Tablets"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of the many texts, hymns and inscriptions "
"found in the Orphic Gold Tablets, a series of ancient Greek texts found on "
"gold leaves, dating back to the 4th century BCE.  This book contain Orphic "
"teachings and rituals, which are believed to have been used by initiates in "
"Orphic mystery cults, offering guidance on purification, initiation, and the "
"afterlife, as well as instructions for living a virtuous life in accordance "
"with the Greek gods' will."
msgstr ""
"一本翻译了《奥尔菲克金板》中的众多文本、赞美诗和铭文的平装英译本。《奥尔菲克金板》是刻写在金叶上一系列古希腊文献，其历史可以追溯到公元前4"
"世纪。该书包含了奥尔菲斯教的教义和仪式，据说这些教义和仪式曾被奥尔菲斯这一神秘教派的入教者使用，这本书提供了关于净化、入教和来世的指导，以及如何根据希腊神祇"
"的旨意，去过高尚生活的指示。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Res Gestae Divi Augusti"
msgid_plural "copies of the Res Gestae Divi Augusti"
msgstr[0] "奥古斯都神的功业记"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Res Gestae Divi Augusti"
msgid ""
"A rare, paperback English translation of the Res Gestae Divi Augusti, or "
"'Deeds of the Divine Augustus', a inscription commissioned by the Roman "
"Emperor Augustus himself.  It is a list of his accomplishments and claims to "
"divine status, emphasizing his role in the Roman Imperial Cult.  This "
"inscription provides insight into the religious beliefs and practices "
"surrounding the emperor during these stages of the Roman Imperial Cult."
msgstr ""
"一本稀有的英文平装版译本，内容是《神圣奥古斯都的事迹》（Res Gestae Divi "
"Augusti），由罗马皇帝奥古斯都亲自委托制作的铭文，铭文列举了他的功绩和对神权的宣称，突出了他在罗马帝国崇拜中的作用。这份铭文为了解罗马帝国崇拜早期阶段"
"围绕皇帝的宗教信仰和实践提供了深入视角。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Historia Augusta"
msgid_plural "copies of the Historia Augusta"
msgstr[0] "罗马君王传"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Historia Augusta"
msgid ""
"A large, rare hardcover English translation of the Historia Augusta, a "
"collection of biographies of Roman emperors.  It also contains information "
"about the Imperial Roman Cult, including its rituals, symbols, and the role "
"of such emperors in the cult."
msgstr "这是一本大型且稀有的精装《罗马帝国史》英文译本，收录了罗马皇帝的传记。书中还介绍了罗马帝国崇拜，包括其仪式、象征以及皇帝在其中的地位。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Corpus Hermeticum"
msgid_plural "copies of The Corpus Hermeticum"
msgstr[0] "赫尔墨斯文集"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Corpus Hermeticum"
msgid ""
"A rare, paperback English translation of The Corpus Hermeticum, a collection "
"of ancient philosophical and religious texts that are attributed to Hermes "
"Trismegistus, a legendary figure in ancient Egyptian and Greek mythology.  "
"The contents of this book consists of a series of dialogues or discourses "
"that explore various philosophical and theological concepts.  These texts "
"cover a wide range of topics, including cosmology, theology, metaphysics, "
"ethics, and spirituality at the time.  The overarching theme throughout the "
"Corpus Hermeticum is the pursuit of spiritual knowledge and the attainment of "
"divine wisdom."
msgstr ""
"一本罕见的《赫耳墨斯文集》（Corpus "
"Hermeticum）英文译本平装书，该书收录了古代哲学和宗教文本，这些文本被认为是出自古埃及和希腊神话中的传奇人物——赫耳墨斯·特里斯墨吉斯忒斯之手。本书"
"的内容包括一系列探索哲学和神学概念的对话或论述，覆盖了当时的宇宙学、神学、形而上学、伦理学和灵性等诸多领域。《赫耳墨斯文集》贯穿始终的主题是追求灵性知识，并"
"最终获得神圣的智慧。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Mithraic Inscriptions"
msgid_plural "copies of The Mithraic Inscriptions"
msgstr[0] "密特拉铭文"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Mithraic Inscriptions"
msgid ""
"A commercial-grade, paperback English edition of The Mithraic Inscriptions, a "
"book that explains the ancient Mithraic religion and its various "
"inscriptions, artifacts, characteristics and rituals.  The book, written by a "
"team of scholars and experts in the field, aims to provide a comprehensive "
"understanding of the Mithraism and its significance in the ancient world."
msgstr ""
"一本《密特拉教铭文》（The Mithraic "
"Inscriptions）的商业平装英文版。书中详细阐述了古代密特拉教的宗教信仰，并对相关的铭文、文物、特点和仪式进行了分析。该书由该领域的学者和专家团队共"
"同编写，旨在为读者提供关于密特拉教和其在古代世界重要性的全面认知。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Tengriism: The Religion of Ancient Mongolia"
msgid_plural "copies of Tengriism: The Religion of Ancient Mongolia"
msgstr[0] "腾格里教:古代蒙古的信仰"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Tengriism: The Religion of Ancient Mongolia"
msgid ""
"A paperback English edition of the Tengriism: The Religion of Ancient "
"Mongolia.  This book contains epics, oral traditions and everything else "
"related to Tengriism, including information about the Khans of Mongolia, "
"shamanic rituals and folklore."
msgstr ""
"一本《腾格里信仰：古代蒙古的宗教》（Tengriism: The Religion of Ancient "
"Mongolia）的英文平装书。书中收录了与腾格里信仰相关的史诗、口头传统等所有内容，包括蒙古可汗、萨满仪式和民间传说等信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Classic of Mountains and Seas"
msgid_plural "copies of the Classic of Mountains and Seas"
msgstr[0] "山海经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Classic of Mountains and Seas"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Classic of Mountains and Seas (Shan "
"Hai Jing).  This book primarily focuses on the description of various "
"mythical creatures, gods, goddesses, rituals and geographical features of "
"ancient China."
msgstr "一本《山海经》（Shan Hai Jing）的精装英文译本，主要记述了古代中国的各种神话生物、神祇、女神、祭祀仪式，以及地理特征。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Tripitaka Koreana"
msgid_plural "copies of the Tripitaka Koreana"
msgstr[0] "高丽大藏经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Tripitaka Koreana"
msgid ""
"An extremely large, huge English translation of the Tripitaka Koreana, a "
"Korean collection of the Tripitaka that can be considered as the Korean Canon."
msgstr "一部非常详细的，巨大的《八万大藏经》的英文译本，一部可以被视作朝韩文化经典的典藏版书籍。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Moʻolelo"
msgid_plural "copies of the Moʻolelo"
msgstr[0] "Moʻolelo：夏威夷传说信仰"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Moʻolelo"
msgid ""
"A grass-cover English edition of the Moʻolelo, a collection of traditional "
"Hawaiian stories, texts and oral traditions, that have been compiled, "
"translated, and documented in written form.  This book also includes "
"information on the deities and entities of the traditional religion of "
"Hawaii, alongside rituals and practices."
msgstr ""
"一本草编封面的英文版《Moʻolelo》，其中汇集了传统的夏威夷故事、文献和口头流传的传说，这些内容已被整理、翻译并以文字形式保存。同时介绍了夏威夷传统宗教"
"的神灵和实体，以及相关的仪式和实践活动。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Te Ao Māori"
msgid_plural "copies of the Te Ao Māori"
msgstr[0] "Te Ao Māori：毛利文化世界"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Te Ao Māori"
msgid ""
"A collection of written oral traditions of the religion of the Maori people, "
"including the Whakapapa (genealogy and the relationships between the living, "
"the dead, and the natural world), the Tikanga (customs, traditions, and "
"protocols that govern the daily lives of the Maori people), Waiata (songs "
"that play a significant role in the Traditional Maori Religion), Pepeha (a "
"personal statement that outlines one's whakapapa, or genealogy, and "
"connection to the land) and Taonga Tūtahi (sacred treasures and objects that "
"hold spiritual significance for the Maori people), as well as inscriptions "
"regarding the deities, entities and religious traditions of the Maori "
"Religion."
msgstr ""
"一本毛利人宗教传统口述记录汇编。书中包含「瓦卡帕帕」，即族谱，和生者、死者与自然世界的关系；「提康加」，即主导毛利人日常生活的习俗、传统和规则；「怀阿塔」，"
"即传统毛利宗教中的重要歌曲；「佩佩哈」，即概括某人「瓦卡帕帕」和其与土地联系的语句；以及「陶加-"
"图塔希」，即对毛利人具有珍贵精神意义的圣物，和关于毛利宗教的神迹、实体和宗教传统的铭文。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Native Religion of New England"
msgid_plural "copies of The Native Religion of New England"
msgstr[0] "新英格兰的本土宗教"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Native Religion of New England"
msgid ""
"A collection of written oral traditions and written records regarding the "
"religious tradition of the many native groups and tribes of New England (such "
"as the Wampanoag, Narragansett, Mohegan, and Penobscot).  This book also "
"contain information regarding the deities, entities and religious "
"characteristics and hierarchy of these groups, as well as historical, "
"geographical, social, political and cultural information."
msgstr ""
"一本关于新英格兰许多土著群体和部落如万帕诺阿格人、纳拉干塞特人、莫希根人和佩诺布斯克人的口头和书面宗教传统的汇编。 "
"这本书还载有关于这些群体的神、实体和宗教特征及等级的信息,以及历史、地理、社会、政治和文化信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Compilation of Divine Messages"
msgid_plural "copies of The Compilation of Divine Messages"
msgstr[0] "神圣讯息汇编"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Compilation of Divine Messages"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Thanh Ngon Hiep Tuyen (Compilation of "
"Divine Messages), a compilation of divine messages received by Cao Dai "
"mediums during séances in Cao Dai temples.  These messages are believed to be "
"communication from various divine beings, including saints, sages, and "
"deities.  The mediums serve as channels through which these messages are "
"transmitted to the followers."
msgstr ""
"这是一本《圣言合选》（Thanh Ngon Hiep "
"Tuyen）的英文精装版译本，收录了高台教乩童在高台寺庙扶乩时接收到的神圣信息。这些信息被认为是来自各种神祇的沟通，包括圣徒、圣贤和神灵。乩童是这些信息传递"
"给信徒的渠道。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Pyramid Texts"
msgid_plural "copies of The Pyramid Texts"
msgstr[0] "金字塔铭文"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Pyramid Texts"
msgid ""
"A hardcover, English translation of The Pyramid Texts.  These texts were "
"intended to guide the deceased pharaohs through the Egyptian afterlife, "
"providing them with magical spells, hymns, and instructions for their "
"journey.  The Pyramid Texts contain a wealth of information about ancient "
"Egyptian beliefs in the afterlife, the gods, and the role of the pharaoh as a "
"mediator between the mortal world and the divine."
msgstr ""
"《金字塔文本》的英文精装版译本。这些文字旨在引导逝去的法老穿越埃及来世，为他们的旅程提供魔法咒语、赞美诗和指导。金字塔文本包含了关于古埃及人对来世、神祇的信"
"仰以及法老作为凡间与神界中介的作用的丰富信息。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Coffin Texts"
msgid_plural "copies of The Coffin Texts"
msgstr[0] "棺椁文"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Coffin Texts"
msgid ""
"A hardcover, English translation of The Coffin Texts, a collection of magical "
"spells and texts originally inscribed on the inner surfaces of wooden "
"coffins.  These texts were intended to protect the deceased and ensure their "
"safe passage through the Egyptian afterlife.  The Coffin Texts provide a "
"insight into the religious beliefs of ancient Egyptians and its contemporary "
"revival, Kemeticism."
msgstr ""
"《棺椁文本》的英文精装版译本，收录了最初刻在木制棺椁内壁上的魔法咒语和文本。这些文本旨在保护死者并确保他们安全地穿越埃及来世。《棺椁文本》为了解古埃及人的宗"
"教信仰及其当代复兴运动——凯米特教——提供了深入的见解。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Book of the Dead"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of the Dead"
msgstr[0] "死者之书"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Book of the Dead"
msgid ""
"A hardcover, English translation of the Book of the Dead, a collection of "
"funerary texts dating from the New Kingdom to the Greco-Roman period and "
"contains spells and instructions to help the deceased navigate the Egyptian "
"afterlife."
msgstr "《死者之书》的英文精装版译本，收录了从新王国到古希腊-罗马时期的葬礼文本，并包含了引导死者前往埃及来世的咒语和指示。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Orishas and Their Deities"
msgid_plural "copies of Orishas and Their Deities"
msgstr[0] "众神之舞中的众神"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Orishas and Their Deities"
msgid ""
"A paperwork English edition of the Orishas and Their Deities (Orixás e Suas "
"Divindades), written by José Honorato do Rego.  This book provides an "
"extensive overview of the orishas and their associated deities.  It delves "
"into the history, characteristics, and roles of these divine beings within "
"the Umbanda religion, a syncretic Afro-Brazilian religion that combines "
"elements of African, Native Brazilian, and European traditions."
msgstr ""
"一本何塞·奥诺拉托·多·雷戈所著的《奥西里斯及其神祇》（Orixás e Suas "
"Divindades）的英文平装译本，书中全面阐述了奥西里斯及其相关的神祇。这本书深入分析了这些神祇在翁班达教（一种融合了非洲、巴西原住民和欧洲传统的非洲裔"
"巴西宗教）的历史、特征和作用。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Tao Te Ching"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tao Te Ching"
msgstr[0] "道德经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Tao Te Ching"
msgid ""
"A stylized, hardcover English translation of the Tao Te Ching, also known as "
"the Dao De Jing.  It is a Chinese philosophical and spiritual text believed "
"to have been written by Laozi, a legendary figure in ancient Chinese history, "
"and is considered one of the most important works in Taoism, an ancient "
"Chinese philosophy and religion that emphasizes living in harmony with the "
"Tao."
msgstr "一本风格化的精装本英译版道德经。道德经是一部中国哲学作品，传说是由上古时期的老子所作，并且被认为是道家的重要代表作，道家思想强调与道和谐共生。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Four Books and Five Classics"
msgid_plural "copies of The Four Books and Five Classics"
msgstr[0] "四书五经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Four Books and Five Classics"
msgid ""
"A large hardcover book containing the two collections of ancient Chinese "
"texts that have played a significant role in shaping Chinese culture, "
"education, and philosophy.  These texts are considered foundational works in "
"Confucianism and have been studied by scholars and students for centuries."
msgstr ""
"一本精装大册，收录了两种对中国文化、教育和哲学产生深远影响的古代典籍丛书，即四书和五经。这些经典被视为儒家思想的奠基之作，数百年来以来都作为学者和学生的研习"
"对象。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cruzeiro"
msgid_plural "copies of the Cruzeiro"
msgstr[0] "克鲁塞罗"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Cruzeiro"
msgid ""
"An English collection of teachings from Raimundo Irineu Serra, the founder of "
"Santo Daime, a syncretic religious movement that combines elements of "
"Christianity, African traditions, and Native Brazilian beliefs.  It is "
"considered a sacred scripture by the movement's followers."
msgstr ""
"一本收录了圣达墨（Santo Daime）创始人雷蒙多·伊里内乌·塞拉（Raimundo Irineu "
"Serra）教诲的英文作品集。圣达墨是一个融合了基督教、非洲传统和巴西土著信仰的混合宗教运动，该作品集被该运动的追随者视为神圣经典。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Ogam and Ipade"
msgid_plural "copies of The Ogam and Ipade"
msgstr[0] "欧甘和伊帕德"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Ogam and Ipade"
msgid ""
"A good-sized book containing the Ogam (Ogã, a collection of sacred hymns that "
"praise the Orishas, sung during rituals and ceremonies, an essential part of "
"the worship and devotion to the deities), and the Ipade (Ipadê, a collection "
"of sacred stories, myths, and legends that explain the origins of the "
"Orishas, the creation of the world, and the history of the religion), "
"directly linked to Afro-Brazilian religions such as Umbanda and Candomble."
msgstr ""
"一本大册，收录了欧甘(Ogã，一份在仪式和祭典中吟唱的圣歌合集，旨在赞美奥里沙神，是礼拜和敬神不可或缺的一部分)，和伊帕德("
"Ipadê，一份圣故事、神话和传说的合集，解释了奥里沙神的起源，世界的诞生和宗教的历史)，这些合集与巴西非裔宗教如翁班达(Umbanda)和坎东布勒("
"Candomble)相关。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Siddur"
msgid ""
"This is a lightweight collection of prayers and blessings that are recited by "
"Jews during various parts of their daily lives, religious ceremonies, and "
"festivals."
msgstr "一本轻便的合集，记载了犹太人的祈祷和祝福合集，他们在日常生活、宗教仪式和节日的各个环节都会诵读。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Talmud"
msgid_plural "volumes of the Talmud"
msgstr[0] "塔木德"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Talmud"
msgid ""
"One of the central texts of Rabbinic Judaism, the Talmud expounds upon the "
"Hebrew Bible with teachings and opinions of thousands of rabbis."
msgstr "一個拉比猶太教的核心文本， 猶太法典闡述了在希伯來聖經與教義和數千拉比的意見。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 1, Tractate Berakhot (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 1, Tractate Berakhot (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷一）Berakhot（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 1, Tractate Berakhot (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 1 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Berakhot.  It "
"is concerned with rules relating to the Shema and the Amidah."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第一卷，对应Berakhot第二节的内容。主要讲跟Shema与Amidah相关的规则。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 2, Tractate Berakhot (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 2, Tractate Berakhot (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二）Berakhot（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 2, Tractate Berakhot (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 2 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Berakhot.  It "
"discusses rules relating to prayers, primarily those before or after eating "
"but it also touches on prayers that occur on special occasions such as "
"hearing thunder or being unexpectedly delivered from danger."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二卷，对应Berakhot第二节的内容。它讨论有关祷告，主要是在就餐前的祷告，但也讨论其他特殊场景的祷告，比如聆听闪电或意外"
"身处危险时的祷告。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 3, Tractate Pe'ah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 3, Tractate Pe'ah"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三）Pe'ah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 3, Tractate Pe'ah" of item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 3 of 51, containing Tractate Pe'ah.  It discusses agriculture, "
"of harvesting, and providing food for the poor."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三卷，对应Pe'ah的内容。主要讲述了农业，收获，以及向贫困的人施与食物。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 4, Tractate Demai"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 4, Tractate Demai"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四）Demai"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 4, Tractate Demai" of item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 4 of 51, containing Tractate Demai.  It discusses rules for "
"dubiously-tithed produce."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四卷，对应Demai的内容。讨论了产品交税的疑点。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 5, Tractate Kilayim"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 5, Tractate Kilayim"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷五）Kilayim"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 5, Tractate Kilayim" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 5 of 51, containing Tractate Kilayim.  It discusses "
"prohibitions on the mixing of different kinds, such as wearing wool and linen "
"clothing or planting anything other than grapes in a vineyard."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第五卷，对应Kilayim的内容。讨论了其他种类的禁忌，如穿着羊毛和亚麻衣服或在葡萄园中种其他作物。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 6, Tractate Shevi'it (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 6, Tractate Shevi'it (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷六）Shevi'it（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 6, Tractate Shevi'it (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 6a of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Shevi'it.  It "
"discusses the Shemitah year, the seventh year where fields must lie fallow."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第六卷，对应Shevi'it第一部分的内容。它讨论了希米塔年，即必须田地进行休耕的第七年。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 7, Tractate Shevi'it (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 7, Tractate Shevi'it (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷七）Shevi'it（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 7, Tractate Shevi'it (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 7 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Shevi'it.  It "
"continues the discussion of the Shemitah year, the seventh year where fields "
"must lie fallow."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第七卷，对应Shevi'it第二部分的内容。它继续上卷讨论希米塔年，即必须田地进行休耕的第七年。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 8, Tractate Terumot (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 8, Tractate Terumot (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷八）Terumot（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 8, Tractate Terumot (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 8 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Terumot.  It "
"discusses terumot, portions of agriculture produce that are given directly to "
"the Kohanim priestly class."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第八卷，对应Terumot第一部分的内容。它讨论特鲁莫特，即部分农产品直接提供给科哈尼姆祭司阶层。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 9, Tractate Terumot (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 9, Tractate Terumot (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷九）Terumot（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 9, Tractate Terumot (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 9 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Terumot.  It "
"continues the discussion of terumot, portions of agriculture produce that are "
"given directly to the Kohanim priestly class."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第九卷，对应Terumot第二部分的内容。它继续上卷讨论特鲁莫特，即部分农产品直接提供给科哈尼姆祭司阶层。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 10, Tractate Maasrot"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 10, Tractate Maasrot"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十）Maasrot"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 10, Tractate Maasrot" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 10 of 51, containing Tractate Maasrot.  It discusses the "
"separation of the harvest into tithes, and the portions given to the Tribe of "
"Levi, the poor, or the people of Jerusalem."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十卷，对应Maasrot的内容。它主要讨论将收获分成十份，以及将部分分给Levi部落、穷人或耶路撒冷人。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 11, Tractate Maaser Sheni"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 11, Tractate Maaser Sheni"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十一）Maaser Sheni"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 11, Tractate Maaser Sheni" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 11 of 51, containing Tractate Maaser Sheni.  It discusses the "
"practice of consuming a portion of the yearly harvest in Jerusalem, or "
"exchanging it for money used to buy food in Jerusalem to hold a feast."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十一卷，对应Maaser "
"Sheni的内容。它主要讨论在耶路撒冷吃掉一部分年收成的习俗，或者用这些收成换成钱在耶路撒冷购买食物以举行宴会。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 12, Tractate Challah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 12, Tractate Challah"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十二）Challah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 12, Tractate Challah" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 12 of 51, containing Tractate Challah.  It discusses the "
"practice of baking bread with the first portion of harvested grain and "
"tithing it as an offering."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十二卷，对应Challah的内容。它主要讨论用收获的谷物的第一部分烘烤面包并将其作为供品的做法。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十三）Orlah & Bikkurim"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 13 of 51, containing Tractates Orlah and Bikkurim.  Both "
"tractates discuss the practice of letting a fruit tree grow for three years "
"before harvesting it."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三卷，对应Orlah & Bikkurim的内容。这两部分都在讨论让一棵果树在收获前生长三年的做法。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 14, Tractate Shabbat (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 14, Tractate Shabbat (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十四）Shabbat（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 14, Tractate Shabbat (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 14 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Shabbat.  It "
"discusses the thirty-nine types of prohibited labor."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十四卷，对应Shabbat第一部分的内容。它主要讨论三十九种禁止的行为。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 15, Tractate Shabbat (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 15, Tractate Shabbat (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十五）Shabbat（中）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 15, Tractate Shabbat (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 15 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Shabbat.  It "
"discusses the prohibitions of carrying items or transporting animals on "
"Shabbat."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十五卷，对应Shabbat第二部分的内容。它主要讨论在安息日禁止携带物品或运送动物。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 16, Tractate Shabbat (Part 3)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 16, Tractate Shabbat (Part 3)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十六）Shabbat（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 16, Tractate Shabbat (Part 3)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 16 of 51, containing the third part of Tractate Shabbat.  It "
"discusses the positive commandments of Shabbat, such as lighting candles and "
"eating a festive meal, and continues the discussion of prohibited types of "
"labor."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十六卷，对应Shabbat第一部分的内容。它主要讨论安息日的允许行为，如点燃蜡烛和吃节日大餐，并继续讨论禁止类型的劳动。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 17, Tractate Eruvin (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 17, Tractate Eruvin (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十七）Eruvin（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 17, Tractate Eruvin (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 17 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Eruvin.  It "
"discusses the ways to expand the allowable areas in which one may carrying "
"items or transport items on Shabbat."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十七卷，对应Eruvin第一部分的内容。它主要讨论扩大允许在安息日携带物品或运输物品的区域的方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 18, Tractate Eruvin (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 18, Tractate Eruvin (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十八）Eruvin（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 18, Tractate Eruvin (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 18 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Eruvin.  It "
"continues discussing the ways to expand the allowable areas in which one may "
"carrying items or transport items on Shabbat."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十八卷，对应Eruvin第二部分的内容。它继续讨论扩大安息日可携带物品或运输物品的容许范围的方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 19, Tractate Pesachim (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 19, Tractate Pesachim (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷十九）Pesachim（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 19, Tractate Pesachim (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 19 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Pesachim.  It "
"discusses laws relating to Passover, such as the proper disposal of leaven "
"and the preparation of unleavened bread."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第十九卷，对应Pesachim第一部分的内容。它主要讨论有关逾越节的规定，例如妥善取出酵母准备无酵面包。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 20, Tractate Pesachim (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 20, Tractate Pesachim (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十）Pesachim（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 20, Tractate Pesachim (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 20 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Pesachim.  It "
"continues the discussion of laws relating to Passover, such as whether "
"servants are allowed to slaughter the Passover sacrifice or what to do if the "
"Seder occurs on a Friday night."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十卷，对应Pesachim第二部分的内容。它继续讨论与逾越节有关的法律，例如是否允许仆人宰杀逾越节祭品，或者如果逾越节家宴"
"在星期五晚上举行，该怎么办。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 21, Tractate Shekalim"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 21, Tractate Shekalim"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（二十一）Shekalim"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 21, Tractate Shekalim" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 21 of 51, containing Tractate Shekalim.  It discusses the "
"taxes paid to maintain the Temple and the priesthood."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十一卷，对应Shekalim的内容。它讨论维持圣殿和祭司职位所缴纳的税款。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 22, Tractate Yoma"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 22, Tractate Yoma"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十二）Yoma"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 22, Tractate Yoma" of item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 22 of 51, containing Tractate Yoma.  It discusses the rituals "
"and laws related to Yom Kippur, primarily concerned with the Temple service."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十二卷，对应Yoma的内容。它讨论与赎罪日有关的仪式和法律，主要与寺庙服务有关。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 23, Tractate Sukkah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 23, Tractate Sukkah"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十三）Sukkah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 23, Tractate Sukkah" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 23 of 51, containing Tractate Sukkah.  It discusses the "
"rituals and laws related to Sukkot, such as dwelling in the Sukkah and the "
"four species of plants."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十三卷，对应Sukkah的内容。它讨论与Sukkot有关的礼法和规定，例如在Sukkot中的住房和四种植物。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 24, Tractate Beitzah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 24, Tractate Beitzah"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十四）Beitzah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 24, Tractate Beitzah" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 24 of 51, containing Tractate Beitzah.  It discusses laws "
"common to all Torah-derived holidays, such as prohibitions on work and the "
"proper preparation of food."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十四卷，对应Beitzah的内容。它主要讨论所有摩西五经衍生节日所共有的规定，例如工作的禁忌和准备食物的规定。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 25, Tractate Rosh Hashanah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 25, Tractate Rosh Hashanah"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十五）Rosh Hashanah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 25, Tractate Rosh Hashanah" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 25 of 51, containing Tractate Rosh Hashanah.  It discusses "
"rituals and laws related to Rosh Hashanah, such as blowing the shofar, as "
"well as the proper way to celebrate the festival of a new month."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十五卷，对应Rosh Hashanah的内容。它讨论了与犹太新年有关的仪式和法律，比如吹羊角号，以及庆祝新月的正确方式。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 26, Tractate Taanit"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 26, Tractate Taanit"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十六）Taanit"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 26, Tractate Taanit" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 26 of 51, containing Tractate Taanit.  It discusses laws "
"related to fasting, as well as proper method of praying for rain to avoid "
"famine."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十六卷，对应Taanit的内容。它讨论了有关斋戒的规定，以及祈求降雨避免饥荒的正确方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 27, Tractate Megillah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 27, Tractate Megillah"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十七）Megillah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 27, Tractate Megillah" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 27 of 51, containing Tractate Megillah.  It discusses laws of "
"reading the Book of Esther on Purim, as well as commentary on the story of "
"Esther itself."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十七卷，对应Megillah的内容。它讨论了在普珥节阅读以斯帖书的规定，以及对以斯帖书本身内容的评述。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 28, Tractate Chagigah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 28, Tractate Chagigah"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十八）Chagigah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 28, Tractate Chagigah" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 28 of 51, containing Tractate Chagigah.  It discusses the "
"practice of offering ritual sacrifices at the Temple on festival days, with "
"frequent interruptions to discuss the Book of Genesis."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十八卷，对应Chagigah的内容。它讨论了在节日的日子里在寺庙里举行祭祀仪式的做法，经常被打断来讨论《创世记》。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 29, Tractate Moed Katan"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 29, Tractate Moed Katan"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷二十九）Moed Katan"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 29, Tractate Moed Katan" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 29 of 51, containing Tractate Moed Katan.  It discusses Chol "
"HaMoed, the minor holidays in between the first and last days of Sukkot and "
"Passover.  It also has the famous story of the Oven of Akhnai, from which the "
"principle is derived that \"The Torah is not in heaven\"."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第二十九卷，对应Moed Katan的内容。它讨论了住棚节和逾越节第一天和最后一天之间的小节日Chol "
"HaMoed。它记录了著名的阿赫奈烤炉的故事，从中得出了“托拉不在天堂”的原则。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 30, Tractate Yevamot (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 30, Tractate Yevamot (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十）Yevamot（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 30, Tractate Yevamot (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 30 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Yevamot.  It "
"deals with the laws of Yibbum, often translated as \"Levirate marriage,\" the "
"requirement of a man to marry his brother's widow."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第六卷，对应Yevamot第一部分的内容。它涉及到 Yibbum "
"的法律，通常被翻译成“夫兄弟婚”，一个男人必须和他兄弟的遗孀结婚。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 31, Tractate Yevamot (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 31, Tractate Yevamot (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十一）Yevamot（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 31, Tractate Yevamot (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 31 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Yevamot.  It "
"continues the discussion of the laws of Yibbum, often translated as "
"\"Levirate marriage,\" and the circumstances in which it does or does not "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十一卷，对应Yevamot第二部分的内容。它继续讨论Yibbum的法律，通常被翻译为“夫兄弟婚”，以及在什么情况下它适用或"
"不适用。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 32, Tractate Ketubot (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 32, Tractate Ketubot (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十二）Ketubot（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 32, Tractate Ketubot (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 32 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Ketubot.  It "
"discusses the marriage contract (Ketubah), and the marital obligations "
"between husband and wife."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十二卷，对应Ketubot第一部分的内容。它讨论了婚姻契约（Ketubah） ，以及夫妻之间的婚姻义务。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 33, Tractate Ketubot (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 33, Tractate Ketubot (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十三）Ketubot（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 33, Tractate Ketubot (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 33 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Ketubot.  It "
"continues the discussion of the marriage contract, as well as divorce and "
"giving formal testimony."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十三卷，对应Ketubot第二部分的内容。它继续讨论婚姻约定，以及离婚和正式证词。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 34, Tractate Nedarim"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 34, Tractate Nedarim"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十四）Nedarim"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 34, Tractate Nedarim" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 34 of 51, containing Tractate Nedarim.  It deals with the "
"making and breaking of vows and the conditions under which vows are "
"automatically void."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十四卷，对应Nedarim的内容。它涉及誓言的制定和违背，以及誓言自动失效的条件。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 35, Tractate Nazir (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 35, Tractate Nazir (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十五）Nazir（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 35, Tractate Nazir (Part 1)" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 35 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Nazir.  It "
"deals with Nazirites, who make vows to abstain from wine, cutting their hair, "
"and avoiding contact with the dead."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第六卷，对应Nazir第一部分的内容。它主要关于拿撒勒人，他们发誓不喝酒，剪头发，避免与死者接触。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 36, Tractate Nazir (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 36, Tractate Nazir (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十六）Nazir（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 36, Tractate Nazir (Part 2)" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 36 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Nazir.  It "
"continues the discussion of Nazirite vows, as well as the transmission of "
"ritual impurity between objects."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十六卷，对应Nazir第二部分的内容。它继续讨论拿撒勒人的誓言，以及在物体之间传递不洁的仪式。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 37, Tractate Sotah (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 37, Tractate Sotah (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十七）Sotah（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 37, Tractate Sotah (Part 1)" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 37 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Sotah.  It "
"contains a discussion of the sotah, or \"bitter water\", ritual for a woman "
"suspected of adultery by her husband."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十七卷，对应Sotah第一部分的内容。它包含关于sotah，或是“苦水”的讨论，一个被丈夫怀疑通奸的女人的仪式。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 38, Tractate Sotah (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 38, Tractate Sotah (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十八）Sotah（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 38, Tractate Sotah (Part 2)" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 38 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Sotah.  It "
"continues a discussion of the sotah, as well as a long discussion over the "
"entrance of the Israelites into the land of Israel."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十八卷，对应Sotah第二部分的内容。它继续了关于sotah的讨论，并展开了关于以色列人进入以色列地的长长讨论。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 39, Tractate Gittin (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 39, Tractate Gittin (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷三十九）Gittin（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 39, Tractate Gittin (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 39 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Gittin.  It "
"discusses the Get, the formal document of divorce, and the specifications for "
"its preparation and writing."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第三十九卷，对应Gittin第一部分的内容。它讨论了Get这个正式离婚的文件，以及其准备和写作的规范。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 40, Tractate Gittin (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 40, Tractate Gittin (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十）Gittin（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 40, Tractate Gittin (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 40 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Gittin.  It "
"continues the discussion of the Get, as well the process of  \"Tikkun Olam\", "
"or repairing the world."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第六卷，对应Gittin第二部分的内容。它继续讨论Get，以及“ Tikkun Olam”，或称作修复世界的过程。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 41, Tractate Kiddushin"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 41, Tractate Kiddushin"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十一）Kiddushin"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 41, Tractate Kiddushin" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 41 of 51, containing Tractate Kiddushin.  It discusses the "
"laws of betrothal and the rules governing interactions between unmarried men "
"and women."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十一卷，对应Kiddushin的内容。它讨论了订婚法和未婚男女之间互动的规则。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 42, Tractate Bava Kamma"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 42, Tractate Bava Kamma"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十二）Bava Kamma"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 42, Tractate Bava Kamma" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 42 of 51, containing Tractate Bava Kamma.  It discusses torts "
"and the proper ways to deal with damages inflicted on people and property."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十二卷，对应Bava Kamma的内容。它讨论了侵权行为以及对人身和财产造成损害的正确处理方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 43, Tractate Bava Metzia"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 43, Tractate Bava Metzia"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十三）Bava Metzia"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 43, Tractate Bava Metzia" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 43 of 51, containing Tractate Bava Metzia.  It discusses "
"interpersonal disputes such as lost property, renting, and obligations of "
"workers and employers, with a digression into how great sages who spend their "
"lives studying Torah are.  It also reiterates the story of the Oven of Akhnai."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十三卷，对应Bava "
"Meztia的内容。它讨论了人与人之间的纠纷，比如财产损失、租赁、工人和雇主的义务等等，并且离题了研究摩西五经的圣人们是多么伟大。它还重申了阿克奈烤炉的故事"
"。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 44, Tractate Bava Basra"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 44, Tractate Bava Basra"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十四）Bava Basra"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 44, Tractate Bava Basra" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 44 of 51, containing Tractate Bava Basra.  It discusses "
"business relationships and the laws of inheritance."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十四卷，对应Bava Basra的内容。它讨论了商业关系和继承法。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 45, Tractate Sanhedrin (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 45, Tractate Sanhedrin (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十五）Sanhedrin（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 45, Tractate Sanhedrin (Part 1)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 45 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Sanhedrin.  It "
"discusses the selection of judges and the formation of courts."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十五卷，对应Sanhedrin第一部分的内容。它讨论了法官的选任和法院的形成。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 46, Tractate Sanhedrin (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 46, Tractate Sanhedrin (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十六）Sanhedrin（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 46, Tractate Sanhedrin (Part 2)" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 46 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Sanhedrin.  It "
"continues the discussion of judges, the punishments administered by the "
"courts, and ends with a discussion of who will have a place in Olam Haba, the "
"afterlife."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十六卷，对应Sanhedrin第一部分的内容。它继续讨论判决，法院实施的惩罚，并以对谁将在 Olam "
"Haba，即来世拥有一席之地的讨论结尾。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 47, Tractate Shevuot"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 47, Tractate Shevuot"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十七）Shevuot"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 47, Tractate Shevuot" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 47 of 51, containing Tractate Shevuot.  It discusses formal "
"oaths, such as those taken by witnesses in court."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十七卷，对应Shevuot的内容。它讨论了正式的誓言，例如证人在法庭上的誓言。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 48, Tractate Avodah Zara (Part 1)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 48, Tractate Avodah Zara (Part 1)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十八）Avodah Zara（上）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 48, Tractate Avodah Zara (Part 1)"
#. of item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 48 of 51, containing the first part of Tractate Avodah Zara.  "
"It discusses forbidden idolatry and the laws regulating contact and commerce "
"with idolators."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十八卷，对应Avodah Zara第一部分的内容。它讨论了偶像崇拜禁忌以及与偶像崇拜者接触和交易的律令规定。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 49, Tractate Avodah Zara (Part 2)"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 49, Tractate Avodah Zara (Part 2)"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷四十九）Avodah Zara（下）"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 49, Tractate Avodah Zara (Part 2)"
#. of item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 49 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Avodah Zara.  "
"It continues the discussion of contact and commerce with idolators, including "
"the prohibition on buying or consuming wine that may have been used in "
"sacrifices to idols."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第四十九卷，对应Avodah "
"Zara第二部分的内容。它继续讨论与偶像崇拜者的接触和贸易的规定，包括禁止购买或消费可能祭祀过偶像的葡萄酒。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 50, Tractates Makkot & Horayot"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 50, Tractates Makkot & Horayot"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷五十）Makkot & Horayot"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 50, Tractates Makkot & Horayot" of
#. item "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 50 of 51, containing Tractates Makkot and Horayot.  Tractate "
"Makkot discusses punishments administered by a court of law and Tractate "
"Horayot discuss redress for errors committed by the court and how to atone "
"for sins committed by kings, high priests, and other officials."
msgstr ""
"这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第五十卷，对应Makkot & Horayot的内容。Makkot 部分讨论由法院实施的惩罚，Horayot "
"部分讨论对法院所犯错误的补救，以及弥补国王、大祭司和其他官员所犯的罪行。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 51, Tractate Niddah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 51, Tractate Niddah"
msgstr[0] "塔木德（卷五十一）Niddah"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 51, Tractate Niddah" of item
#. "Talmud"
msgid ""
"This is volume 51 of 51, containing Tractate Niddah.  It discusses the ritual "
"status of a menstruating woman, the prohibition on marital relations, and "
"different kinds of bloody discharges."
msgstr "这是犹太典籍塔木德五十一卷中的第五十一卷，对应Niddah的内容。它讨论了经期妇女的仪式地位，婚姻关系的禁忌，以及各种不同流血的规定。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Tanakh"
msgid_plural "copies of Tanakh"
msgstr[0] "《希伯來聖經》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Tanakh"
msgid "A single-volume book containing the complete canon of the Jewish Bible."
msgstr "一卷書， 包含了猶太聖經的所有章節。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Torah"
msgid_plural "copies of the Torah"
msgstr[0] "托拉"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Torah"
msgid ""
"The five books of Moses, written on animal skin by a trained scribe in "
"accordance with the laws and customs of traditional Jewish calligraphy and "
"bound onto wooden rollers.  Once very expensive, it would now be beyond "
"price, if there are any Jewish communities left to use it."
msgstr "摩西五经，由训练有素的抄写员按照传统犹太书法抄写在兽皮上，并以木筒装订。它曾经极度昂贵，如今则是无价之宝——如果还有犹太人要用到它。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Tripitaka"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tripitaka"
msgstr[0] "《大藏經》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Tripitaka"
msgid ""
"A collection of sacred Buddhist writings describing their canons of "
"scriptures."
msgstr "神聖的佛教著作合輯， 描述佛教的教規。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Upanishads"
msgid_plural "copies of The Upanishads"
msgstr[0] "《奧義書》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Upanishads"
msgid ""
"A collection of sacred Hindu writings regarding the nature of reality and "
"describing the character and form of human salvation."
msgstr "神聖的印度教著作合輯， 關於現實的本質和描述人類救贖的性質與形式。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Four Vedas"
msgid_plural "copies of The Four Vedas"
msgstr[0] "《四吠陀經》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Four Vedas"
msgid ""
"A single volume containing all four Vedas, which are the oldest scriptures of "
"Hinduism."
msgstr "一個包含所有四個吠陀經的合輯本， 這是印度教最古老的經文。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Enuma Elish"
msgid_plural "copies of the Enuma Elish"
msgstr[0] "埃努玛·埃利什"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Enuma Elish"
msgid ""
"A paperback English translation of the Enuma Elish, an ancient collection "
"originally written in seven tablets that contain the Babylonian creation myth "
"and cosmology.  It describes the birth of the gods, the formation of the "
"universe, and the struggle for power among various deities."
msgstr ""
"《埃努玛·埃利什》的英文平装译本，这是一部由七块泥板组成的古老文献集，其中包含了巴比伦的创世神话和宇宙观。它描述了诸神的诞生、宇宙的形成，以及众神之间对权力"
"的争夺。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hávamál"
msgid_plural "copies of Hávamál"
msgstr[0] "《哈瓦瑪爾》"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Hávamál"
msgid ""
"An English translation of several Old Norse poems.  The poems contain "
"proverbs and stories attributed to the god Odin, many transcribed from oral "
"history."
msgstr "一本翻譯成英文的古北歐語詩集。詩集包含了有關歐丁神的諺語與故事的由來， 大部份是謄寫自口述歷史。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ginza Rabba"
msgid_plural "copies of the Ginza Rabba"
msgstr[0] "银座拉巴"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Ginza Rabba"
msgid ""
"A large English translation of the Ginza Rabba, also known as The Book of "
"Adam, a scripture Sacred for the Mandaeans.  It is a compilation of various "
"oral teachings and written texts, including literature on a wide variety of "
"topics such as liturgy, hymns, theological texts, didactic texts, as well as "
"both religious and secular poetry."
msgstr ""
"一本《银座拉巴》的大型英文译本，也被称作《亚当之书》，是曼达安教的圣典。这是一本收录了各种口述教义和书面文本的著作，包括礼拜仪式、赞美诗、神学文本、教义文本"
"，还有宗教和世俗的诗歌。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Qolastā"
msgid_plural "copies of the Qolastā"
msgstr[0] "科拉斯塔"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Qolastā"
msgid ""
"A English translation of the Qolastā, the canonical prayer book of the "
"Mandaeans."
msgstr "一部《科拉斯塔》的英文译本，这本书是是曼达安教派的正统祈祷书。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Drasa d-Yahya"
msgid_plural "copies of the Drasa d-Yahya"
msgstr[0] "曼达约翰福音"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Drasa d-Yahya"
msgid ""
"A English translation of the Drasa d-Yahya, also known as the Mandaean Book "
"of John.  It contains accounts of John's life and miracles, as well as a "
"number of polemical conversations with Jesus and tractates where Anush Uthra "
"(Enosh) performs miracles in the style of Jesus's deeds in Jerusalem."
msgstr "一本《曼达约翰福音》的英文译本。此书记录了约翰的生活和展示的奇迹，以及与耶稣的多次辩论，还收录了安舒乌斯拉在耶路撒冷以耶稣的风格展示奇迹的演说集。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Kitáb-i-Aqdas"
msgid_plural "copies of the Kitáb-i-Aqdas"
msgstr[0] "亚格达斯经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Kitáb-i-Aqdas"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Kitáb-i-Aqdas, also known as The Most "
"Holy Book.  Written by Baha'u'llah, the founder of the Baha'i Faith, in a "
"poetic and mystical style.  It encompasses a wide range of topics, including "
"the nature of God, the purpose of human existence, the role of religion in "
"society, and the principles governing human conduct.  It also contains laws "
"and regulations that govern various aspects of Baha'i life, such as marriage, "
"family life, and the administration of the Baha'i community."
msgstr ""
"一本精装的英文版《亚格达斯经》，也称为《至圣之书》。由巴哈伊信仰的创立者，巴哈欧拉（Baha'u'"
"llah）采用诗意且神秘的风格创作而成。书中涵盖了广泛的主题，包括神的本质、人类存在的目的、宗教在社会中的角色以及人类行为的准则。它还包含了约束巴哈伊教徒生"
"活各个方面的规矩和戒律，例如婚姻、家庭生活以及巴哈伊社区的管理。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Kitáb-i-Íqán"
msgid_plural "copies of the Kitáb-i-Íqán"
msgstr[0] "基塔比伊甘"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Kitáb-i-Íqán"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Kitáb-i-Íqán, also known as the Book "
"of Certitude.  It was written by Baha'u'llah, the founder of the Baha'i "
"Faith, and addresses theological and philosophical aspects of religion, "
"provides guidance on understanding spiritual truth and recognizing divine "
"messengers throughout history.  This book also explores themes such as the "
"nature of God, the purpose of religion, the progression of revelation, and "
"the spiritual significance of the Baha'i Faith in relation to other religions."
msgstr ""
"《基塔布·伊·伊坎》（又称《确证之书》）的英文精装译本。该书由巴哈伊信仰的创始人巴哈欧拉撰写，探讨了宗教的神学和哲学方面，为理解精神真理和认识历史上的神圣使"
"者提供了指引。此书还探讨了诸如上帝的本质、宗教的目的、启示的进展，以及巴哈伊信仰相对于其他宗教的精神意义等主题。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Hidden Words"
msgid_plural "copies of The Hidden Words"
msgstr[0] "隐言经"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Hidden Words"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Kalimát-i-Maknúnih, also known as the "
"Hidden Words.  It was written by Baha'u'llah, the founder of the Baha'i "
"Faith, during his exile in Baghdad.  This book covers a wide range of themes, "
"including love, detachment, unity, humility, justice, and the recognition of "
"God.  Each passage is concise and poetic, expressing profound spiritual "
"truths in a simple yet profound manner.  One distinctive feature of this book "
"is its universal appeal: while it was revealed within the context of the "
"Bahá'í Faith, its teachings transcend religious boundaries and are applicable "
"to people from all backgrounds."
msgstr ""
"《Kalimát-i-Maknúnih》(又称《隐言经》) "
"的英文精装译本。该书由巴哈伊信仰的创始人巴哈欧拉在巴格达流放期间撰写。本书涵盖了广泛的主题，包括爱情、超脱、团结、谦虚、正义以及对上帝的认识。每段文字简洁而"
"富有诗意，以简单而深刻的方式表达出深刻的精神真理。本书的一个显著特点是其普遍吸引力：虽然它是在巴哈伊信仰的背景下进行启示的，但其教义跨越了宗教的边界，适用于"
"来自任何背景的人们。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Baha'i Prayers"
msgid_plural "copies of the Baha'i Prayers"
msgstr[0] "巴哈伊祷文"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "Baha'i Prayers"
msgid ""
"A lightweight, paperback book containing a collection of prayers, "
"meditations, and devotional readings that are used for personal reflection, "
"worship, and spiritual nourishment for followers, adherents or sympathizers "
"of the Baha'i Faith."
msgstr "一本轻便的平装书籍，收录了祈祷词、冥想和虔诚读物，供巴哈伊信仰的追随者、拥护者和共鸣者在个人反思、礼拜和精神滋养中诵读。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Secret of Divine Civilization"
msgid_plural "copies of The Secret of Divine Civilization"
msgstr[0] "神圣文明的秘密"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "The Secret of Divine Civilization"
msgid ""
"A hardcover English translation of the Risali-yi-madaniyyih, also known as "
"The Secret of Divine Civilization.  It was written by 'Abdu'l-Bahá, the son "
"of Bahá'u'lláh, founder of the Bahá'í Faith.  This book addresses various "
"aspects of social and economic development, advocating for progressive "
"reforms and offering guidance on how societies can advance spiritually, "
"intellectually, and materially.  It explores principles that can contribute "
"to the progress and well-being of individuals and societies, emphasizing the "
"importance of education, justice, equality, and unity.  A perfect book for "
"rebuilding society once again."
msgstr ""
"《Risali-yi-madaniyyih》(又称《神圣文明的秘密》) "
"的英文精装译本。由阿博都-"
"巴哈，巴哈伊信仰创始人巴哈欧拉之子所著。本书涉及社会与经济发展的各个方面，主张渐进式的改革，指导社会如何在精神、理智、物质上取得发展。本书探索有助于发展和个"
"人、社会安康的准则，强调教育、公正、平等和团结的重要性。对于重建社会，这是一本完美的书。"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "'Some Answered Questions'"
msgid_plural "copies of 'Some Answered Questions'"
msgstr[0] "已被回答的问题"

#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
#. ~ Description of "'Some Answered Questions'"
msgid ""
"A hardcover book containing a collection of transcriptions of table talks "
"given by 'Abdu'l-Bahá in 'Akká between 1904 and 1906 in response to questions "
"posed by Laura Dreyfus-Barney, an American Bahá'í resident in Paris, and "
"first published in 1908.  This book provides clarity, guidance, and "
"understanding to Baha'is and those seeking to learn more about the religion."
msgstr ""
"一本精装书籍，收录了阿博都-巴哈于1904~1906年间在阿卡回答居住在巴黎的美裔巴哈伊信徒劳拉·德雷弗斯·巴尼所提出问题的演讲合集，初次于1908"
"年出版。本书为巴哈伊信徒和那些想深入了解巴哈伊信仰的人提供了明辨、指导与领悟。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid "Duelist's Annual"
msgid_plural "issues of Duelist's Annual"
msgstr[0] "《鬥劍年鑑》"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of "Duelist's Annual"
#. ~ Description of variant "Duelist's Annual" of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid ""
"An annual publication about fencing and dueling.  There are many good "
"illustrations which describe proper technique and form."
msgstr "一本關於擊劍以及對戰的年刊。裡面詳細了記載了許多有用的技巧及方法。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid "Fencer's Start-Up"
msgid_plural "copies of Fencer's Start-Up"
msgstr[0] "剑术入门"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Fencer's Start-Up" of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid ""
"A beginner's guide to traditional and sport fencing - rules, proper defense "
"and offense, movement, etc."
msgstr "一本传统剑术或体育剑术的入门指南，讲解规则，进攻与防守和步伐等知识。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid "Learning Fencing"
msgid_plural "copies of Learning Fencing"
msgstr[0] "剑术学习"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Learning Fencing" of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid ""
"A childish book about fencing, where the mascot Foily guides the reader "
"through the different nuances of fencing with lots of photos and images."
msgstr "一本关于剑术的书，给小孩子看的，吉祥物Foily通过许多照片和图像引导读者区分剑术中的细微差别。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid "The Complete Guide to Fencing"
msgid_plural "copies of The Complete Guide to Fencing"
msgstr[0] "剑术完整指南"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Complete Guide to Fencing" of item "Duelist's
#. Annual"
msgid ""
"A thick book, written by professional fencers, that covers every possible "
"aspect of modern sport fencing."
msgstr "一本由专业剑术家写的厚书，包括了现代剑术运动可能的方方面面。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid "Fencing: Skills, Tactics, Training"
msgid_plural "copies of Fencing: Skills, Tactics, Training"
msgstr[0] "击剑：技能、技巧、训练"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Fencing: Skills, Tactics, Training" of item
#. "Duelist's Annual"
msgid ""
"A textbook for fence instructors that fulfills every aspect a fencer must "
"know, from the very basics to a master level, from theory to drill training "
"exercises."
msgstr "一本给指导者的击剑教科书，包括了击剑者需要知道的每个方面。从非常基础到大师水平，从理论分析到练习技巧都囊括其中。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid "Modern Saber Fencing"
msgid_plural "copies of Modern Saber Fencing"
msgstr[0] "现代击剑"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Modern Saber Fencing" of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid ""
"This book highlights the modern technologies used in fencing, with new "
"possible techniques and scientific research that underlies the latest "
"training methods."
msgstr "本书重点介绍了击剑中使用的现代技术，以及作为最新训练方法基础的新技术和科学研究。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Duelist's Annual"
msgid "Fencing: A Renaissance Treatise"
msgid_plural "copies of Fencing: A Renaissance Treatise"
msgstr[0] "击剑：文艺复兴时期的论文"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Fencing: A Renaissance Treatise" of item
#. "Duelist's Annual"
msgid ""
"An ancient treatise explaining the fundamental ideas of fencing that are "
"still used today - distance, time, line, blade opposition, counterattacks, "
"countertime, etc."
msgstr "一本古老的论文，解释了今天仍在使用的击剑的基本思想——距离、时间、线、刀锋对立、反击等。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid_plural "copies of FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgstr[0] "《FM 23-25 陸軍刺刀手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
#. ~ Description of variant "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual" of item "FM 23-25
#. Army bayonet manual"
msgid "A hefty military field manual about bayonet usage and combat theory."
msgstr "一本講述刺刀使用與作戰理論的軍事書籍。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid "The Halberd and Other European Pole Arms, 1300-1650"
msgid_plural "copies of The Halberd and Other European Pole Arms, 1300-1650"
msgstr[0] "戟和其他欧洲变种，1300-1650 年"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Halberd and Other European Pole Arms,
#. 1300-1650" of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid ""
"Small, but comprehensive introduction to the pole arms of medieval Europe: "
"from the simple pike, through the halberd in its many forms, to the roncone, "
"bardiche, and many others."
msgstr "一本袖珍但内容全面的中世纪欧洲长柄武器讲解书，从长矛、各种战戟，到镗、月刃斧和许多其他武器都有提及。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid "Boarders Away: With Steel-Edged Weapons and Polearms"
msgid_plural "copies of Boarders Away: With Steel-Edged Weapons and Polearms"
msgstr[0] "无懈可击：钢刃武器与长柄武器"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Boarders Away: With Steel-Edged Weapons and
#. Polearms" of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid ""
"An all-encompassing study of naval armament under fighting sail.  This volume "
"covers pikes and fighting blades in use between 1626 and 1826."
msgstr "研究战船上军备武器的百科全书。这一部内容关于1626年到1826年间使用的矛和战刃。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid "Polearms of Paulus Hector Mair"
msgid_plural "copies of Polearms of Paulus Hector Mair"
msgstr[0] "Paulus Hector Mair的长柄武器"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Polearms of Paulus Hector Mair" of item "FM 23-25
#. Army bayonet manual"
msgid ""
"The summarized and preserved experience of Paulus Hector Mair, an ancient "
"German fencing master, using spears, lances, halberds, poleaxes, and similar "
"weapons."
msgstr "由Paulus Hector Mair，一位德国古代的剑术大师，总结和记录的关于矛、枪、戟、长柄斧等一系列武器的经验。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid "Hafted Weapons in Medieval and Renaissance Europe"
msgid_plural "copies of Hafted Weapons in Medieval and Renaissance Europe"
msgstr[0] "中世纪及文艺复兴时期欧洲的带柄武器"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Hafted Weapons in Medieval and Renaissance
#. Europe" of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid ""
"Research about the long history of a huge variety of weapons in medieval "
"times, with lots of illustrations."
msgstr "关于中世纪众多型制各异武器漫长历史的研究，附有很多插图和说明。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet manual"
msgid "Japanese Spears"
msgid_plural "copies of Japanese Spears"
msgstr[0] "日本矛研究"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Japanese Spears" of item "FM 23-25 Army bayonet
#. manual"
msgid ""
"A fully illustrated guide to the use of polearms, ranging from the earliest "
"halberds and spears reaching Japan from the Asian mainland to the "
"sophisticated naginata, nagamaki, and various forms of yari used by the "
"Japanese samurai through the medieval period."
msgstr "一本完整的带插图的关于长柄武器的书籍，从由亚洲大陆传到日本的早期戟和矛，到之后中世纪时期日本武士使用的精巧的薙刀、长卷和各种枪都有提及。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid_plural "copies of Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgstr[0] "《特種部隊刀技》"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
#. ~ Description of variant "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques" of item "Spetsnaz
#. Knife Techniques"
msgid "A classic Soviet text on the art of attacking with a blade."
msgstr "一本俄文寫的書， 有關刀戰鬥的技巧。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "Knife Fighting Targets"
msgid_plural "copies of Knife Fighting Targets"
msgstr[0] "白刃作战目标"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Knife Fighting Targets" of item "Spetsnaz Knife
#. Techniques"
msgid ""
"Simple, practical and useful martial art techniques to use in a fight.  On "
"the first page the author says they will not be held responsible for any harm "
"caused by using advice from this book."
msgstr "简单、实际、好用的作战武术。在第一页作者声明：对本书提供建议造成的任何伤害，我们均不承担任何责任。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "Book of Knives"
msgid_plural "copies of Book of Knives"
msgstr[0] "白刃战技巧"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Book of Knives" of item "Spetsnaz Knife
#. Techniques"
msgid ""
"Authored by a state trooper and policeman from Michigan, it contains a lot of "
"experience on real fights with a knife and against a knife."
msgstr "由一位密歇根州警所著，包括了许多真实刀战或对抗刀战时有用的经验。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "The Ka-Bar Knife Combat Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of The Ka-Bar Knife Combat Manual"
msgstr[0] "卡巴匕首战斗手册"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Ka-Bar Knife Combat Manual" of item "Spetsnaz
#. Knife Techniques"
msgid ""
"This manual teaches the reader to use the Ka-Bar, an iconic knife of the U.S. "
"Army that carries the energy and spirit of soldiers."
msgstr "这本手册教导读者如何使用卡巴，一把承载美军士兵精神的标志性匕首。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "Put 'Em Down, Take 'Em Out!"
msgid_plural "copies of Put 'Em Down, Take 'Em Out!"
msgstr[0] "放倒他们，然后赶走他们"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Put 'Em Down, Take 'Em Out!" of item "Spetsnaz
#. Knife Techniques"
msgid ""
"\"Knife Fighting Techniques From Folsom Prison\".  This book describe "
"fighting with a shiv in the tight walls of a jail."
msgstr "\"来自Folsom监狱的匕首战斗技巧\" 这本书描述了如何在监狱的窄墙之间持刀战斗。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "Queen of Knives"
msgid_plural "copies of Queen of Knives"
msgstr[0] "刃之女皇"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Queen of Knives" of item "Spetsnaz Knife
#. Techniques"
msgid "A small, femme-oriented manual about self-defense with knife."
msgstr "一本面向女性的小书，讲解如何用匕首自卫。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "Secrets of the Karambit"
msgid_plural "copies of Secrets of the Karambit"
msgstr[0] "爪刀的秘密"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Secrets of the Karambit" of item "Spetsnaz Knife
#. Techniques"
msgid ""
"This book aspires to describe and explain the history, design, materials, and "
"demonstrate deployment and drills with the unusual Indonesian weapon known as "
"the karambit knife.  The final impression is disappointing."
msgstr "一本试图描述并解释一种印度尼西亚的稀有武器——爪刀的历史、设计、材料，并展示其使用和练习方法的书。最后的结论令人失望。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "Combat Knives and Knife Combat"
msgid_plural "copies of Combat Knives and Knife Combat"
msgstr[0] "战术匕首与作战"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Combat Knives and Knife Combat" of item "Spetsnaz
#. Knife Techniques"
msgid ""
"A comprehensive compendium about different types of knives and their usage in "
"various martial arts."
msgstr "一本关于在不同武术中，各种匕首及其用法的全面纲要。"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Spetsnaz Knife Techniques"
msgid "The Silent Bodyguard"
msgid_plural "copies of The Silent Bodyguard"
msgstr[0] "无言守护者"

#: data/json/items/book/stabbing.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Silent Bodyguard" of item "Spetsnaz Knife
#. Techniques"
msgid ""
"\"The Art of Knife Fencing & the Chronicles of the Modern Fighting Knife and "
"their Wielders\".  This book teaches the reader how to defend against an "
"aggressor with various weapons."
msgstr "\"匕首剑术与现代战匕及其锻造者的编年史\" 这本书告诉犊子如何对付带有不同武器的敌人。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Survival Under Atomic Attack"
msgid_plural "copies of Survival Under Atomic Attack"
msgstr[0] "《核戰生存法則》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Survival Under Atomic Attack"
msgid ""
"A wordy and intricate guide to wilderness and urban survival in a worst-case "
"scenario.  While filled with loads of useful information, the madman who "
"wrote this was a terrible writer, and gleaning knowledge from the rants is a "
"chore."
msgstr "一本囉嗦和複雜的的書， 說明如何在曠野和城市的最壞情況下生存。雖然充斥著大量有用的信息， 但寫出這個的瘋子文筆不佳， 讓你很難從裡面學到什麼。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Through the Lens"
msgid_plural "copies of Through the Lens"
msgstr[0] "《透過鏡頭》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Through the Lens"
msgid ""
"A colorful digest devoted to backpacking and wilderness photography.  The "
"photos are beautiful, though the terminology in the sections on survivalcraft "
"assume some proficiency."
msgstr "豐富多彩的荒野專業攝影雜誌。這些照片很美麗， 雖然對生存沒有什麼太大幫助。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Alpha Male Quarterly"
msgid_plural "Alpha Male Quarterlies"
msgstr[0] "《男人幫》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Alpha Male Quarterly"
msgid ""
"A full-size glossy men's magazine.  There's a brief article about hiking and "
"a list of simple wilderness survival tips somewhere in between the photos of "
"bikini-clad women and the gadget advertisements."
msgstr "一本 A4 大小亮面男士主題季刊。在穿著比基尼的女性照片和小玩意兒廣告之間，有一篇關於徒步旅行的簡短文章和一系列簡單的荒野生存技巧。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Outdoor Adventures"
msgid_plural "issues of Outdoor Adventures"
msgstr[0] "《野外冒險家》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Outdoor Adventures"
msgid ""
"A glossy magazine about surviving and hunting in the wilderness.  There's an "
"exciting article about a bear attack in the back pages."
msgstr "一本關於在荒野中生存和狩獵的亮面雜誌。在後面的頁面有一個關於被熊襲擊的刺激文章。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pitching a Tent"
msgid_plural "copies of Pitching a Tent"
msgstr[0] "《搭個帳篷》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Pitching a Tent"
msgid "A guide detailing the basics of woodsmanship and outdoor survival."
msgstr "一本有關於野外求生器具製作與操作的手冊。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pocket Survival Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of Pocket Survival Guide"
msgstr[0] "《生存口袋指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Pocket Survival Guide"
msgid ""
"This pocket-sized leather-bound survival guide combines a wealth of concise "
"information with simple to follow instructions and easy to read illustrations."
msgstr "這個袖珍皮革裝訂的生存指南結合了豐富的資訊， 並且使用簡單的步驟搭配易於閱讀的插圖來說明。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Autobiography of a Mountain Man"
msgid_plural "copies of Autobiography of a Mountain Man"
msgstr[0] "《山地人自傳》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Autobiography of a Mountain Man"
msgid ""
"An amusing historical novel filled with detailed descriptions of surviving in "
"the wild, potentially containing great insights for an experienced "
"outdoorsman."
msgstr "一本充滿了在野外生存與有趣歷史故事的詳盡書籍， 可能含有豐富的野外經驗知識。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Outdoor Survival Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of Outdoor Survival Guide"
msgstr[0] "《野外生存指南》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Outdoor Survival Guide"
msgid ""
"A thick soft-cover book filled with vital information about surviving in the "
"wild, aimed at the experienced backpacker."
msgstr "一本平裝的厚書本， 包含了關於在野外生存的重要資訊， 主要針對有經驗的背包客。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Introduction to Plant Biology"
msgid_plural "copies of Introduction to Plant Biology"
msgstr[0] "《植物學導論》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Introduction to Plant Biology"
msgid ""
"A college-level textbook about plants of all shapes and sizes.  Covers a wide "
"range of subjects, from horticulture to the identification of tropical "
"plants.  As such, it is of limited practical use in your current situation."
msgstr "这是一本关于各式各样不同形状大小的植物的大学教材，涵盖范围十分广泛，从园艺学到热带植物分类学。但它显然对你目前的处境的协助非常有限。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Wonderful World of Arthropodology"
msgid_plural "copies of The Wonderful World of Arthropodology"
msgstr[0] "《奇妙的節肢動物世界》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "The Wonderful World of Arthropodology"
msgid ""
"A three-volume doorstopper introducing the whole breadth of modern "
"arthropodology, beginning with a lengthy section on the comparative anatomy "
"of the described taxa.  The authors somehow manage to maintain a gushingly "
"enthusiastic tone, even as they describe the grisly effects of arthropod "
"venoms or the mating habits of horseshoe crabs.  Given the curious lack of "
"man-sized wasps in the illustrations, you have to wonder how much of the "
"content is still applicable."
msgstr ""
"本书一共三卷，介绍了现代节肢动物学的全部内容，开篇就用了很长的篇幅介绍了节肢动物的种群分类和解剖学。作者在描述节肢动物毒液的可怕效果或是马蹄蟹的交配习性时，"
"还不知为何保持着一种滔滔不绝的热情语调。考虑到插图中并未包含如今这种成人大小的奇怪黄蜂，你不得不想知道书里还有多少内容仍然适用。"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Natural Remedies of New England"
msgid_plural "copies of Natural Remedies of New England"
msgstr[0] "《新英格蘭的天然草藥》"

#: data/json/items/book/survival.json
#. ~ Description of "Natural Remedies of New England"
msgid ""
"A leather-bound manuscript, it features native herbal remedies with "
"hand-colored illustrations of each plant."
msgstr "一本皮革裝訂的手稿，描述了多種本地的天然草藥並附有手繪插圖。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Swim Planet"
msgid "Swim Planet"
msgid_plural "issues of Swim Planet"
msgstr[0] "《游泳星球》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of "Swim Planet"
#. ~ Description of variant "Swim Planet" of item "Swim Planet"
msgid "The world's leading resource about aquatic sports."
msgstr "世界領先的水上運動雜誌。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Swim Planet"
msgid "Men's Fitness"
msgid_plural "issues of Men's Fitness"
msgstr[0] "《男子健身》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Men's Fitness" of item "Swim Planet"
msgid ""
"A shiny magazine about fitness, nutrition, and sports, mostly oriented "
"towards men."
msgstr "一本关于健身、营养和运动的闪亮杂志，主要面向男性。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Swim Planet"
msgid "Iron Man"
msgid_plural "issues of Iron Man"
msgstr[0] "《鋼鐵男子》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Iron Man" of item "Swim Planet"
msgid "A quarterly issue about natural bodybuilding, weightlifting, and powerlifting."
msgstr "关于自然健美、举重和力量举重的季刊。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Swim Planet"
msgid "Muscle & Fitness"
msgid_plural "issues of Muscle & Fitness"
msgstr[0] "《肌肉與健身》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Muscle & Fitness" of item "Swim Planet"
msgid ""
"A magazine about mainstream fitness and simple bodybuilding, containing "
"articles about different training techniques, nutrition tips, and doctor "
"recommendations."
msgstr "一本關于主流健身和簡單健美的雜志，包含有關不同訓練技術、營養提示和醫生建議的文章。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Swim Planet"
msgid "Muscular Development"
msgid_plural "issues of Muscular Development"
msgstr[0] "《肌肉發育》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Muscular Development" of item "Swim Planet"
msgid ""
"A monthly issue which covers mostly fitness and bodybuilding themes.  Lots of "
"muscular men aggressively poke at you from the cover."
msgstr "一本主要讲健康与塑身的月刊。封面上的肌肉男直勾勾地盯着你。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Swim Planet"
msgid "Bicycling"
msgid_plural "issues of Bicycling"
msgstr[0] "《騎自行車》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Bicycling" of item "Swim Planet"
msgid ""
"A small magazine about the bicycle scene, tips about the buying and "
"maintenance of bikes, and different types of training you can do with them."
msgstr "一本关于自行车的小杂志，包含有购买和维修自行车的指南，以及如何用它们进行的不同类型的训练。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgstr[0] "《水中求生訓練手冊》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
#. ~ Description of variant "Water Survival Training Field Manual" of item
#. "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"A commercially produced survival guide that details swimming and deep water "
"survival techniques tailored to emergency scenarios."
msgstr "一本市售的生存指南， 內容有關於游泳與緊急狀況時的深水生存技巧。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "Built from Broken"
msgid_plural "copies of Built from Broken"
msgstr[0] "重塑强健体魄"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Built from Broken" of item "Water Survival
#. Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"\"A Science-Based Guide to Healing Painful Joints, Preventing Injuries, and "
"Rebuilding Your Body\".  This book details a way to build your body without "
"painful and exhausting training, with a proper training program and "
"step-by-step instructions."
msgstr ""
"\"一本基于科学研究的指南书，告诉你如何从剧烈的关节疼痛中恢复，如何避免伤害，以及如何重塑你的身体\""
"。这本书详细讲解了如何在避免痛苦且超负荷训练的前途下，强健你的身体。并附有细致到每一步的训练项目。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "Science of Running"
msgid_plural "copies of Science of Running"
msgstr[0] "跑步的学问"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Science of Running" of item "Water Survival
#. Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"This book contains comprehensive information about how anatomy and physiology "
"function in running, training plans, and many new exercises for new runners."
msgstr "这本书从生理学和解剖学的角度详解说明了奔跑的运作机制，也为跑步爱好者提供了一些训练计划和锻炼项目。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "Overcoming Gravity"
msgid_plural "copies of Overcoming Gravity"
msgstr[0] "征服你的体重"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Overcoming Gravity" of item "Water Survival
#. Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"\"A Systematic Approach to Gymnastics and Bodyweight Strength\", this thick "
"book is a gold mine of information about strength-oriented bodyweight "
"workout, including scientific principles, different routines, methods, detail "
"about progression, and a huge variety of exercises and their modifications."
msgstr ""
"\"关于体操和自重力量训练的系统方法\""
"。这本厚书包含了自重力量训练的丰富信息，提供了科学的准则，不同的训练、方法，各个阶段的建议。以及大量的练习项目及其变体。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "Calisthenics for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Calisthenics for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "健美操入门"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Calisthenics for Beginners" of item "Water
#. Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"A step-by-step guide about fitness and working out using only your body, with "
"a huge variety of difficulties in exercises."
msgstr "一本全程只用到你的身体的逐步讲解的健身指南，在练习的过程中你可能会遇到很多困难。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "The Squat Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of The Squat Bible"
msgstr[0] "练腿神书"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Squat Bible" of item "Water Survival Training
#. Field Manual"
msgid ""
"200 pages of different squat trainings, with comprehensive info on what each "
"of them is designed to train."
msgstr "足足200页关于各种蹲式训练的书，对每一种训练设计训练的目标肌肉都有详细的讲解。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "Functional Training and Beyond"
msgid_plural "copies of Functional Training and Beyond"
msgstr[0] "身体功能训练"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Functional Training and Beyond" of item "Water
#. Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"The best book for someone who wants to build a better body - from the start "
"to an advanced level."
msgstr "对于任何想从起步到较高层次练出更强健的身体的人，选这本书准没错。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "New Functional Training for Sports"
msgid_plural "copies of New Functional Training for Sports"
msgstr[0] "体育素质训练新编"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "New Functional Training for Sports" of item
#. "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"Concepts, methods, exercises and programs for athletes of different sports, "
"with demonstrations, commentary, and analysis of key exercises."
msgstr "这本书记载了不同专业体育运动的概念，方法，练习和项目，并对重要的练习附有说明，解释和分析。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "The World's Fittest Book"
msgid_plural "copies of The World's Fittest Book"
msgstr[0] "《世界健身大全》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The World's Fittest Book" of item "Water Survival
#. Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"\"How to Train for Anything and Everything, Anywhere and Everywhere\", this "
"book contains different types of trainings for everyone."
msgstr "「如何隨時隨地進行任何部位的訓練」，這本書包含了適合每個人的各種類型的培訓。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "Blueprint"
msgid_plural "copies of Blueprint"
msgstr[0] "《健身新藍圖》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Blueprint" of item "Water Survival Training Field
#. Manual"
msgid ""
"The cutting-edge training program to make you stronger than ever, from zero "
"to superhuman, in a year."
msgstr "尖端的訓練計劃讓你在一年內從零到超人，變得比以往任何時候都更強大。"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Water Survival Training Field Manual"
msgid "Hard Work Pays Off"
msgid_plural "copies of Hard Work Pays Off"
msgstr[0] "《努力就有回報》"

#: data/json/items/book/swimming.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Hard Work Pays Off" of item "Water Survival
#. Training Field Manual"
msgid ""
"A training manual for someone ready to spend lot of time and energy on "
"training, with detailed instructions and comments."
msgstr "為準備花費大量時間和精力進行培訓的人員提供的培訓手冊，其中包含詳細的說明和評論。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Boston AnimeCon magazine"
msgid_plural "Boston AnimeCon magazines"
msgstr[0] "《波士頓動漫展雜誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Boston AnimeCon magazine"
msgid ""
"A short magazine printed as an advertisement for the now canceled Boston "
"AnimeCon.  A few costume ideas are intermixed with miscellaneous information "
"about the event."
msgstr "一本薄薄的雜誌，內容是宣傳最近被取消的波士頓動漫討論會。一些動漫服裝的想法混雜在其他關於本次討論會的資訊。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Beauty Magazine"
msgid_plural "Beauty Magazines"
msgstr[0] "《美人誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Beauty Magazine"
msgid ""
"A full-size glossy women's magazine.  There are a few simple patterns and "
"basic sewing tips somewhere in between the fashion photos and the makeup "
"advertisements."
msgstr "一本 A4 大小亮面的女性雜誌。在時尚照片和化妝廣告之間有一些簡單的縫紉樣式與基本的縫紉技巧。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sew Awesome Monthly"
msgid_plural "Sew Awesome Monthlies"
msgstr[0] "《阿縫嫂月刊》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Sew Awesome Monthly"
msgid ""
"A well presented monthly magazine all about knitting, crocheting, and "
"needlepoint.  Filled with ideas and project patterns."
msgstr "內容呈現許多關於針織， 鉤針， 刺繡的多樣化裁縫書籍。充滿了許多有意思的想法。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sew What? Clothing!"
msgid_plural "copies of Sew What? Clothing!"
msgstr[0] "《縫紉？衣服！》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Sew What? Clothing!"
msgid "A colorful book about tailoring."
msgstr "一本繽紛色彩的裁縫書籍。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clothing designer's portfolio"
msgid_plural "clothing designer's portfolios"
msgstr[0] "《服裝設計師的作品集》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "clothing designer's portfolio"
msgid ""
"A leather bound portfolio that once belonged to a clothing designer.  Filled "
"with sketches and notes, a skilled tailor could learn a lot from this volume."
msgstr "這個皮革文件夾曾經為某個服裝設計師所擁有， 裡面是滿滿的草圖與筆記， 熟練的裁縫師方可從中取經。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Traditional Japanese Kimono"
msgid_plural "copies of Traditional Japanese Kimono"
msgstr[0] "《日本傳統和服》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Traditional Japanese Kimono"
msgid "An illustrated textbook on the crafting of Japanese traditional garb."
msgstr "關於日本傳統服裝製作的插圖教科書。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Friendly, Humane Fashion"
msgid_plural "copies of Friendly, Humane Fashion"
msgstr[0] "《更和善，人性化的時尚》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Friendly, Humane Fashion"
msgid ""
"An educational book detailing the uses of fake fur, as well as its benefits "
"and disadvantages.  The prose is rather passionate, and a disclaimer on the "
"cover proudly states that the book is printed and distributed by the Gryphon "
"Animal Rights Organization."
msgstr "一本教育性的書籍， 詳細介紹人造毛皮的使用， 並剖析它的利弊。文詞間滿溢熱情， 封面上的免責聲明自豪地寫著: 這本書是由獅鷲動物權利組織印刷和發行的。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sewing Techniques for Designers"
msgid_plural "copies of Sewing Techniques for Designers"
msgstr[0] "《金牌設計師的裁縫技巧》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Sewing Techniques for Designers"
msgid ""
"A massive, hardbound book full of a wealth of information for the "
"professional clothing designer."
msgstr "一本精裝的裁縫大百科， 充滿了有關專業服裝設計的豐富內容。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ye Scots Beuk o Tailorin'"
msgid_plural "copies of Ye Scots Beuk o Tailorin'"
msgstr[0] "《蘇格蘭傳統服飾》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Ye Scots Beuk o Tailorin'"
msgid ""
"A translated Gaelic book from Scotland.  While boring to read due to its "
"technical tone, it provides insights into Scottish culture and information "
"about tailoring."
msgstr "一本翻译自苏格兰盖尔语的书。虽然书中的术语使其读起来很枯燥，但它能提供对苏格兰文化和缝纫技艺的深入解析。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Dieselpunk Designs"
msgid_plural "copies of Dieselpunk Designs"
msgstr[0] "《柴油龐克服裝設計》"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "Dieselpunk Designs"
msgid ""
"A large, leatherbound book containing a number of leather and rubber recipes "
"for the fashionable dieselpunk."
msgstr "一本巨大的皮革装订的书籍，书中描写了许多皮革和橡胶制品配方，专为时尚的柴油机朋克准备。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nomad cowl blueprint"
msgid_plural "nomad cowl blueprints"
msgstr[0] "遊牧兜帽設計圖"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "nomad cowl blueprint"
msgid ""
"A simple printed pamphlet with clear illustrations and very few words "
"describing how to make what appears to be a well-designed and comfortable "
"cowl offering protection from the elements and physical injury.  The "
"directions do not offer much guidance beyond the plans themselves; this will "
"take a little skill to interpret."
msgstr ""
"一本印刷简单的小册子，带有清晰的插图和很少的文字，描述了如何制作一件设计精良、十分舒适的兜帽，能防护恶劣天气和身体伤害。除了设计本身，没有提供太多额外说明指"
"导；这需要有点技能才能理解其中的文字。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nomad bodyglove blueprint"
msgid_plural "nomad bodyglove blueprints"
msgstr[0] "遊牧緊身衣設計圖"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "nomad bodyglove blueprint"
msgid ""
"A simple printed pamphlet with clear illustrations and very few words "
"describing how to make what appears to be a tight-fitting but protective "
"bodysuit, with options to reinforce it with Kevlar threads.  The directions "
"do not offer much guidance beyond the plans themselves; this will take a "
"little skill to interpret."
msgstr ""
"一本印刷简单的小册子，带有清晰的插图和很少的文字，描述了如何制作一件紧身但有保护作用的连体衣，可以选择用凯夫拉纤维加固。除了设计本身，没有提供太多额外说明指"
"导；这需要有点技能才能理解其中的文字。"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nomad jumpsuit blueprint"
msgid_plural "nomad jumpsuit blueprints"
msgstr[0] "遊牧連身衣設計圖"

#: data/json/items/book/tailor.json
#. ~ Description of "nomad jumpsuit blueprint"
msgid ""
"A simple printed pamphlet with clear illustrations and very few words "
"describing how to make what appears to be a jumpsuit designed to survive the "
"long-term wear and tear of exploring the apocalyptic wasteland, with a lot of "
"storage capacity.  The directions do not offer much guidance beyond the plans "
"themselves; this will take a little skill to interpret.  There seems to be "
"room within the directions to make a simpler, lighter version, or a "
"leather-reinforced version."
msgstr ""
"一本印刷简单的小册子，带有清晰的插图和很少的文字，描述了如何制作一件连身衣，看起来像是用来探索这片末日后的荒原时能经受住长期磨损而设计的，有着很大的存储空间"
"。除了设计本身，没有提供太多额外说明指导；这需要有点技能才能理解其中的文字。根据其中的指导可以制造出样式较为简单的轻便版本，或者是皮革强化的版本。"

#: data/json/items/book/throw.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "Diskobolus"
msgid "Diskobolus"
msgid_plural "issues of Diskobolus"
msgstr[0] "《丟鐵餅誌》"

#: data/json/items/book/throw.json
#. ~ Description of "Diskobolus"
#. ~ Description of variant "Diskobolus" of item "Diskobolus"
msgid "A biannual magazine devoted to the art and science of discus-throwing."
msgstr "一本半年出刊的雜誌， 介紹專業的鐵餅投擲的藝術和科學。"

#: data/json/items/book/throw.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Diskobolus"
msgid "The Perfect Throw"
msgid_plural "copies of The Perfect Throw"
msgstr[0] "完美投掷"

#: data/json/items/book/throw.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Perfect Throw" of item "Diskobolus"
msgid ""
"This book has pretty good information about ways to throw a hatchet, from a "
"World Axe Throwing Championship champion.  You are surprised there was a "
"championship for axe throwing."
msgstr "这本书由世界飞斧投掷冠军参与编写，对于短柄斧的投掷讲解得很好。\"什么，这玩意也有比赛，还有世界冠军?\""

#: data/json/items/book/throw.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Diskobolus"
msgid "Sergeant Shenk's Comprehensive Book on Knife Throwing"
msgid_plural "copies of Sergeant Shenk's Comprehensive Book on Knife Throwing"
msgstr[0] "《Shenk 中士的飛刀技巧詳解》"

#: data/json/items/book/throw.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sergeant Shenk's Comprehensive Book on Knife
#. Throwing" of item "Diskobolus"
msgid "Illustrated booklet, that covers the basics of knife throwing."
msgstr "一本帶插圖的書，包括了飛刀投擲的多數基本技巧。"

#: data/json/items/book/throw.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "The Complete Guide to Pitching"
msgid "The Complete Guide to Pitching"
msgid_plural "copies of The Complete Guide to Pitching"
