#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lemonade"
msgid_plural "lemonade"
msgstr[0] "檸檬水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "lemonade"
msgid ""
"Lemon juice mixed with water and sugar to dull the sourness.  Delicious and "
"refreshing."
msgstr "混合了水與糖以緩和其酸味的檸檬汁， 美味又提神。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orangeade"
msgid_plural "orangeade"
msgstr[0] "柳橙飲料"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "orangeade"
msgid "Cheap orange flavored beverage with limited vitamins."
msgstr "廉價柳橙味飲品，有些維他命。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grapeade"
msgid_plural "grapeade"
msgstr[0] "葡萄飲料"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "grapeade"
msgid "Cheap grape flavored beverage with limited vitamins."
msgstr "廉價葡萄味飲品，有些維他命。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lemon-lime soda"
msgid_plural "lemon-lime soda"
msgstr[0] "檸檬酸橙汽水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "lemon-lime soda"
msgid ""
"Unlike cola this is caffeine free, however it is still carbonated and has "
"plenty of sugar and a lemon-lime taste."
msgstr "不同於可樂，這飲料不含咖啡因，然而還是加入了碳酸、大量糖和檸檬酸橙味了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lotus tea"
msgid_plural "lotus tea"
msgstr[0] "蓮花茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "lotus tea"
msgid "A healthy beverage made from lotus flowers steeped in boiling water."
msgstr "一種健康的飲品, 把蓮花以沸水沖泡而成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mexican hot chocolate"
msgid_plural "Mexican hot chocolate"
msgstr[0] "墨西哥熱巧克力"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "Mexican hot chocolate"
msgid ""
"This semi-bitter chocolate drink made from cocoa, cinnamon, and chilies "
"traces its history to the Maya and Aztecs.  Perfect for a cold winter day."
msgstr "這種由可可、肉桂和辣椒配製成的微苦巧克力飲料，能追溯到瑪雅和阿茲特克人的歷史。在寒冷的冬日中無比完美。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "coffee milk"
msgid_plural "coffee milk"
msgstr[0] "咖啡牛奶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "coffee milk"
msgid ""
"Coffee syrup or black coffee mixed into milk.  It's been the state drink of "
"Rhode Island since 1993."
msgstr "咖啡糖漿或黑咖啡混入牛奶中。自1993年以來一直是羅德島州的代表性飲料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "milk tea"
msgid_plural "milk tea"
msgstr[0] "奶茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "milk tea"
msgid "Hot tea with cold milk."
msgstr "熱茶加入冷牛奶。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orange juice"
msgid_plural "orange juice"
msgstr[0] "柳橙汁"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "orange juice"
msgid ""
"Store-bought orange juice.  Refreshing, tasty, and a great source of Vitamin "
"C."
msgstr "商店買的柳橙汁。清爽可口，是維生素 C 的優良來源。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fresh orange juice"
msgid_plural "fresh orange juice"
msgstr[0] "鮮榨柳橙汁"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "fresh orange juice"
msgid "Freshly-squeezed from real oranges!  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "從真的柳橙新鮮壓榨出的果汁！好喝又營養。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orange soda"
msgid_plural "orange soda"
msgstr[0] "橘子汽水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "orange soda"
msgid ""
"Unlike cola this is caffeine free, however it is still carbonated, sweet, and "
"tastes vaguely orange-like."
msgstr "不像可樂， 這飲料不含咖啡因， 然而還是加入了碳酸與糖， 以及隱約的橘子味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pine needle tea"
msgid_plural "pine needle tea"
msgstr[0] "松針茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "pine needle tea"
msgid ""
"A fragrant and healthy beverage made from pine needles steeped in boiling "
"water."
msgstr "一種芬芳的健康飲品， 把松葉以沸水沖泡而成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grape drink"
msgid_plural "grape drink"
msgstr[0] "葡萄汽水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "grape drink"
msgid ""
"A mass-produced grape flavored beverage of artificial origin.  Good for when "
"you want something that tastes like fruit, but still don't care about your "
"health."
msgstr "一罐大規模生產的人工香精飲料。雖然有著香甜的口味，但是仍然不是很健康。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mycus juice"
msgid_plural "Mycus juice"
msgstr[0] "馬庫斯果汁"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "Mycus juice"
msgid "Freshly-squeezed from the fruit of the Mycus."
msgstr "從馬庫斯果新鮮壓榨出的果汁。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "root beer"
msgid_plural "root beer"
msgstr[0] "麥根沙士"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "root beer"
msgid "Like cola, but without caffeine.  Still not that healthy."
msgstr "像可樂但是不含咖啡因， 一樣對身體不好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "root beer"
msgid ""
"Like cola, but without caffeine.  Still not that healthy, but better than the "
"canned stuff."
msgstr "像可樂但是不含咖啡因，一樣對身體不好，但總比罐裝的好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tonic water"
msgid_plural "tonic water"
msgstr[0] "通寧水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "tonic water"
msgid ""
"A carbonated soft drink which contains quinine, giving it a bitter flavor.  "
"Originally used as a prophylactic against malaria, this modern variant is "
"unsuitable for this purpose as it contains much less quinine and is also "
"sweetened."
msgstr "一種碳酸飲料，其中的奎寧賦予苦味。原本是用來預防瘧疾的，現代則不適用於此用途，因為它的奎寧含量少了很多，而且多了甜味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spezi"
msgid_plural "spezi"
msgstr[0] "spezi 橘子可樂"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "spezi"
msgid ""
"Originating in Germany almost a century ago, this mix of cola and orange soda "
"tastes great."
msgstr "原產於德國近一個世紀前， 這樣搭配可樂和橘子汽水的味道好極了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sports drink"
msgid_plural "sports drink"
msgstr[0] "運動飲料"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sports drink"
msgid ""
"A flavored drink consisting of a special blend of electrolytes and simple "
"sugars.  It tastes vaguely like fruit with a slight chemical aftertaste."
msgstr "一種由電解質和單糖混合而成的調味飲料。喝起來隱約有水果味，並帶有輕微的化學餘味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spurge tea"
msgid_plural "spurge tea"
msgstr[0] "大戟花茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "spurge tea"
msgid ""
"A healthy beverage made from spurge flowers steeped in boiling water.  Can be "
"used to prevent asthma attacks."
msgstr "由大戟花浸泡在沸水中製成的健康飲料。可用於預防哮喘。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "spurge tea"
msgid "You no longer need to worry about asthma attacks, at least for a while."
msgstr "你不再需要擔心哮喘了，至少在一定時間內。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rehydration drink"
msgid_plural "rehydration drink"
msgstr[0] "補水飲料"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "rehydration drink"
msgid ""
"A basic oral rehydration therapy drink.  It will rehydrate you faster than "
"water, but tastes like bottled sweat."
msgstr "基本的口服補液飲料。它補水的速度比水快，但喝起來卻像瓶裝的汗水。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sweet water"
msgid_plural "sweet water"
msgstr[0] "糖水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sweet water"
msgid "Water with sugar or honey added.  Tastes okay."
msgstr "添加了糖或蜂蜜的水。味道也就還好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black tea"
msgid_plural "black tea"
msgstr[0] "紅茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "black tea"
msgid ""
"The beverage of gentlemen everywhere, made from applying hot water to "
"oxidized leaves of the tea plant \"Camellia sinensis\"."
msgstr "供全球每位紳士享用的飲品，以熱水沖泡茶樹的發酵葉子製成（茶）。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "willowbark tea"
msgid_plural "willowbark tea"
msgstr[0] "柳樹皮茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "willowbark tea"
msgid ""
"A bitter tea made by boiling willow bark in water, used since ancient times "
"as a mild painkiller."
msgstr "柳樹皮水煮後製成的苦茶，自古以來就被用作溫和的止痛藥。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bark tea"
msgid_plural "bark tea"
msgstr[0] "樹皮茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "bark tea"
msgid ""
"Often regarded as folk medicine in some countries, bark tea tastes awful and "
"tends to dry you out, but can help flush out stomach or other gut bugs."
msgstr "在一些國家通常被視為民間藥方， 味很道糟糕且會讓你更渴， 但能幫助排除胃或腸道等問題。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "V8"
msgid_plural "V8"
msgstr[0] "波蜜果菜汁"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "V8"
msgid "Contains up to eight vegetables!  Nutritious and tasty."
msgstr "含有八種蔬果！ 營養又好喝。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "water"
msgid ""
"Water, the stuff of life, necessary for all kinds of crafting, cleaning, and "
"avoiding an agonizing death by dehydration.  You should boil or purify it "
"before using it as drinking water."
msgstr "水，生命之所需，可用在各種製作、清潔、避免痛苦的脫水致死。煮沸或過濾後飲用會更安全。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "murky water"
msgid_plural "murky water"
msgstr[0] "渾水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "murky water"
msgid ""
"Water, the stuff of life.  This water looks like it has quite a bit of life "
"in it in fact, and not the good kind.  You should filter and sterilize it if "
"you want to drink it."
msgstr "水，生命之所需。事實上，這水看起來有相當多的生命，不過不是好的那種。應該過濾並消毒後才能飲用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clean water"
msgid_plural "clean water"
msgstr[0] "淨水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "clean water"
msgid "Fresh, clean water.  Truly the best thing to quench your thirst."
msgstr "新鮮純淨的淡水， 解身體的渴。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spring water"
msgid_plural "spring water"
msgstr[0] "泉水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "spring water"
msgid "Natural alpine spring water, bottled at the source."
msgstr "天然高山泉水，在水源地裝瓶。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mineral water"
msgid_plural "mineral water"
msgstr[0] "礦泉水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "mineral water"
msgid "Fancy mineral water, so fancy it makes you feel fancy just holding it."
msgstr "優質的礦泉水， 太優質了讓你連拿著瓶子都覺得優質。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "green tea"
msgid_plural "green tea"
msgstr[0] "綠茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "green tea"
msgid ""
"Made from applying hot water to leaves of the tea plant \"Camellia "
"sinensis\".  Green tea has a lighter, fresher taste than black and is "
"traditionally preferred in Asian cultures."
msgstr "由茶樹，學名 Camellia sinensis 的茶葉和熱水沖泡而成。綠茶嘗起來比紅茶更清淡、新鮮，是亞洲傳統文化的首選。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fruit tea"
msgid_plural "fruit tea"
msgstr[0] "水果茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "fruit tea"
msgid ""
"A tasty beverage made with herbs and dried fruit from plants other than the "
"tea plant.  While colloquially called 'tea', technically it's an infusion."
msgstr "用茶以外的的草藥和乾果製成的美味飲料。雖然俗稱為「茶」，但嚴格來說，它是一種沖泡飲。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sweetened coffee"
msgid_plural "sweetened coffee"
msgstr[0] "加糖咖啡"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sweetened coffee"
msgid ""
"The morning ritual of the pre-apocalyptic world, created from coffee cherries "
"through a complex process of seed removal, roasting, grinding, and brewing.  "
"Coffee is substantially richer in caffeine than its rival tea.  With added "
"sweetener for better taste."
msgstr "在大災變前是種早晨儀式，咖啡豆經過複雜的一系列揀選、烘焙、研磨和調製最終所得到的飲品。咖啡相較它的對手，茶含有更高的咖啡因。加入甜味劑提升口味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sweetened tea"
msgid_plural "sweetened tea"
msgstr[0] "加糖茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sweetened tea"
msgid ""
"The beverage of gentlemen everywhere, made from applying hot water to leaves "
"of the tea plant \"Camellia sinensis\".  With added sweetener for a better "
"taste.  Can also be served cold as iced tea."
msgstr "供全球每位紳士享用的飲品，以熱水沖泡茶樹的葉子製成。加入了甜味劑來提升味道。也能作為冰茶冷飲。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "sweetened tea" when FLAG matches COLD
msgid "iced tea"
msgid_plural "iced tea"
msgstr[0] "冰茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sweetened milk tea"
msgid_plural "sweetened milk tea"
msgstr[0] "加糖奶茶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sweetened milk tea"
msgid "Hot tea with cold milk and added sweetener."
msgstr "熱茶加入冷牛奶，台南口味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sweetened coffee substitute"
msgid_plural "sweetened coffee substitute"
msgstr[0] "加糖咖啡替代品"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sweetened coffee substitute"
msgid ""
"Homemade not-coffee created from the Kentucky coffeetree, just like the "
"Meskwaki tribe!  Doesn't actually have any caffeine, but it'll pass in a "
"pinch.  The added sweetener neutralizes the bitterness somewhat."
msgstr "用肯塔基咖啡樹自製假咖啡，就像 Meskwaki 部落一樣！實際上不含任何咖啡因，但別無他選時還行。加了甜味劑來稍微中和苦味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sweetened coffee milk"
msgid_plural "sweetened coffee milk"
msgstr[0] "加糖咖啡牛奶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sweetened coffee milk"
msgid ""
"Coffee syrup mixed into milk.  It's been the state drink of Rhode Island "
"since 1993.  With added sweetener for those who like it even sweeter.  Can "
"also be served cold as iced coffee."
msgstr "將咖啡糖漿混入牛奶中。自 1993 年以來，它一直是羅德島的州飲。添加了甜味劑，適合喜歡更甜的人。也可冷藏成冰咖啡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "sweetened coffee milk" when FLAG matches COLD
msgid "iced coffee"
msgid_plural "iced coffee"
msgstr[0] "冰咖啡"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tomato juice"
msgid_plural "tomato juice"
msgstr[0] "番茄汁"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "tomato juice"
msgid ""
"A thick red liquid, made from tomatoes.  Not to everyone's taste, it is a "
"healthy and refreshing drink when chilled."
msgstr "由番茄製成的濃稠紅色液體。雖然不是每個人都喜歡，但冷藏後卻是一種健康又清爽的飲料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ayran"
msgid_plural "ayran"
msgstr[0] "杜格優格"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "ayran"
msgid ""
"A cold savory yogurt-based beverage popular across Western Asia, Central "
"Asia, Southeastern Europe, North Asia and Eastern Europe."
msgstr "一種以冰涼優格為主體的飲料，流行於西亞、中亞、東南歐、北亞和東歐。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "diet cola"
msgid_plural "diet cola"
msgstr[0] "無糖可樂"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "diet cola"
msgid "Things go lighter with Cola Zero!  No sugar, no caffeine, no worries!"
msgstr "可樂零讓一切更輕盈！無糖、無咖啡因，無後顧之憂！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "diet orange soda"
msgid_plural "diet orange soda"
msgstr[0] "無糖橘子汽水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "diet orange soda"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Trofica brand zero-sugar soda with natural orange flavors.  Now with 99% less "
"calories!"
msgstr "Trofica 牌零糖汽水，含天然橙味。現在熱量減少 99%！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "diet tropical soda"
msgid_plural "diet tropical soda"
msgstr[0] "無糖熱帶汽水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "diet tropical soda"
msgid ""
"Trofica brand zero-sugar soda.  Made with all-natural pineapple, kiwi, and "
"passionfruit flavors that taste just like real fruit with none of the real "
"sugar!"
msgstr "Trofica 牌無糖汽水。由全天然鳳梨、奇異果和嘗起來就像的水果的百香果香味，而且沒有真正的糖！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "diet energy cola"
msgid_plural "diet energy cola"
msgstr[0] "無糖能量可樂"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "diet energy cola"
msgid ""
"Hill Mist 'Puebla Punch', a popular zero-sugar energy drink with enough "
"caffeine to keep you awake but none of the calories that keep you going.  It "
"looks and tastes like blue automotive coolant."
msgstr ""
"Hill Mist 「Puebla "
"潘趣酒」，一種廣受歡迎的零糖能量飲料，含有足以讓你保持清醒的咖啡因，但卻沒有讓你維持行動的熱量。它看起來和喝起來都像藍色的汽車冷卻液。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Foodplace's refreshing drink™"
msgid_plural "Foodplace's refreshing drink™"
msgstr[0] "美食中心清涼飲™"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "Foodplace's refreshing drink™"
msgid ""
"A curious entry to the diet soda market by Foodplace, the \"Refreshing "
"Drink™\" tastes just like real human beverages and contains no additives "
"proven to cause diabetes or heart diseases!"
msgstr "由 Foodplace 進軍無糖汽水市場推出的奇特產品，「清爽飲™」的口感與真正的人類飲料無異，而且不含任何經證實會導致糖尿病或心臟病的添加物！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sparkling water"
msgid_plural "sparkling water"
msgstr[0] "氣泡水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sparkling water"
msgid "Plain, naturally carbonated mineral water with a subtle bitterness."
msgstr "純天然碳酸礦泉水，帶有些微的苦味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peach sparkling water"
msgid_plural "peach sparkling water"
msgstr[0] "蜜桃氣泡水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "peach sparkling water"
msgid "Naturally carbonated mineral water with a hint of peach flavoring."
msgstr "純天然碳酸礦泉水，帶有淡淡的蜜桃味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pomegranate sparkling water"
msgid_plural "pomegranate sparkling water"
msgstr[0] "石柳氣泡水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "pomegranate sparkling water"
msgid ""
"Naturally carbonated mineral water with pomegranate flavoring.  Fruity and "
"bitter."
msgstr "純天然碳酸礦泉水，帶有石柳味和苦味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "water (purifying)"
msgid_plural "water (purifying)"
msgstr[0] "水（净化中）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "water (purifying)"
msgid ""
"You've dissolved tablets of disinfecting chemicals in this water to purify "
"it.  Soon it'll be ready to drink."
msgstr "你已经在水里溶解了消毒药片，很快就净化完毕能够饮用了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "water (purifying)"
msgid ""
"After using the tablets and carefully decanting out the resulting clean "
"water, it's ready to drink"
msgstr "使用药片处理后，小心地倾倒出干净的水，水就可以安全饮用了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "water (purifying)"
msgid ""
"The chlorine released by the tablets is still working.  You still need to "
"wait a bit before you can drink it."
msgstr "净水药片释放的氯正在消毒。 你还得等一会才能喝。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tomato sauce"
msgid_plural "tomato sauce"
msgstr[0] "番茄紅醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "tomato sauce"
msgid "A minimally seasoned sauce of cooked tomatoes."
msgstr "一種將煮熟番茄以最低限度調味的醬汁。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "maple sap"
msgid_plural "maple sap"
msgstr[0] "楓樹樹汁"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "maple sap"
msgid "A water and sugar solution that has been extracted from a maple tree."
msgstr "從楓樹抽出的水和糖的混合液。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mayonnaise"
msgid_plural "mayonnaise"
msgstr[0] "美乃滋醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "mayonnaise"
msgid ""
"A gloppy mix of egg, oil, and salt that is traditionally used to moisten "
"sandwiches."
msgstr "一種由雞蛋，油和鹽的混合物，傳統上用來滋潤三明治。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ketchup"
msgid_plural "ketchup"
msgstr[0] "番茄醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "ketchup"
msgid "A viscous paste of tomato, salt, and vinegar."
msgstr "一種粘稠的膏狀物，由番茄，鹽和醋醬製成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "barbecue sauce"
msgid_plural "barbecue sauce"
msgstr[0] "烤肉醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "barbecue sauce"
msgid ""
"Invented in the American south, barbecue sauce is sweet, dark, and full of "
"spices like garlic, pepper, and cayenne.  It's often used in meat dishes as a "
"marinade or condiment."
msgstr "这种烧烤酱最早起源于美国南部，甜味浓郁，富含大蒜、胡椒和辣椒等香料。它常被用作肉制品的腌料或调味品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "honey mustard"
msgid_plural "honey mustard"
msgstr[0] "蜂蜜芥末醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "honey mustard"
msgid ""
"A tangy, sweet, and creamy sauce that perfectly complements salads and fried "
"food."
msgstr "一种浓郁、甜美的酱汁，看起来有点像奶油，与沙拉和油炸食品完美搭配。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "mustard"
msgid ""
"A condiment made from the seeds of a mustard plant (\"Brassica\" or "
"\"Sinapis\"), vinegar, salt, and spices."
msgstr "一種以芥菜籽（黃芥或白芥）、醋、鹽和香料製成的調味品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "forest honey"
msgid_plural "forest honey"
msgstr[0] "森林蜜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "forest honey"
msgid ""
"Honey, that stuff bees make.  This one is \"forest honey\", a liquid form.  "
"It never spoils, and is good for your digestion."
msgstr "一份由蜜蜂酿造的蜂蜜，也就是\"森林蜂蜜\"，现在处于液态形式。它有助于消化，并且永远不会变质。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vinegar"
msgid_plural "vinegar"
msgstr[0] "醋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "vinegar"
msgid ""
"Shockingly tart white vinegar.  This is what you get when you let your booze "
"ferment too long."
msgstr "酸得可怕的白醋。這是因為你把酒發酵過久產生的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetable cooking oil"
msgid_plural "vegetable cooking oil"
msgstr[0] "植物性烹飪油"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetable cooking oil"
msgid "Thin yellow vegetable oil used for cooking."
msgstr "淡黃色的植物油， 可用於烹飪。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "animal cooking oil"
msgid_plural "animal cooking oil"
msgstr[0] "動物性烹飪油"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "animal cooking oil"
msgid "Thin yellow animal oil used for cooking."
msgstr "淡黃色的動物油，可用於烹飪。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "molasses"
msgid_plural "molasses"
msgstr[0] "糖蜜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "molasses"
msgid ""
"An extremely sugary tar-like syrup, produced by repeatedly boiling the juice "
"of sugarcane or sugar beets.  It has a slightly bitter aftertaste."
msgstr "一種含有大量糖份的焦油狀糖漿，通過反复煮沸甘蔗汁或甜菜汁製成。它有一點點苦澀的餘味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grenadine syrup"
msgid_plural "grenadine syrup"
msgstr[0] "石榴糖漿"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "grenadine syrup"
msgid ""
"Extremely sweet syrup made from sugar and pomegranate juice.  It's meant to "
"be mixed with other drinks, rather than drink it as is."
msgstr "由糖和石榴汁制成的极甜的糖浆。用于和其它饮料混合，而不是直接喝。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horseradish"
msgid_plural "horseradish"
msgstr[0] "辣根"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "horseradish"
msgid "A spicy grated root vegetable packed in vinegared brine."
msgstr "一包以醋跟鹽醃的磨碎鮮辣根菜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "coffee syrup"
msgid_plural "coffee syrup"
msgstr[0] "咖啡糖漿"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "coffee syrup"
msgid ""
"A thick syrup made of water and sugar strained through coffee grounds.  Can "
"be used to flavor many foods and beverages."
msgstr "水和糖與濃縮咖啡製成的濃厚糖漿。可用於許多食品和飲料， 增添風味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "coconut water"
msgid_plural "coconut water"
msgstr[0] "椰子水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "coconut water"
msgid "Sweet-tasting cloudy liquid extracted from a coconut."
msgstr "从椰子中提取的味道甜美的混浊液体。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salca"
msgid_plural "salca"
msgstr[0] "土耳其番茄酱"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "salca"
msgid ""
"Tomato paste of Turkish origin made from pureed in-season tomatoes reduced "
"over the sun or heat."
msgstr "源自土耳其的番茄酱，由当季的番茄泥在阳光下或高温下融化而成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pekmez"
msgid_plural "pekmez"
msgstr[0] "葡萄糖浆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink_other.json
#. ~ Description of "pekmez"
msgid "A molasses-like syrup obtained after condensing juices of grape must."
msgstr "凝结葡萄汁后得到的类似于糖浆的液体。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestible_overrides.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chicken egg"
msgid_plural "chicken eggs"
msgstr[0] "雞蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "chicken egg"
msgid "A nutritious egg laid by a bird."
msgstr "一枚由禽类下的营养丰富的蛋，可以加工后作为其它料理，或许还可以孵化出一些有趣的东西。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "unfertilized bird egg"
msgid_plural "unfertilized bird eggs"
msgstr[0] "鳥蛋（未受精）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "unfertilized bird egg"
msgid ""
"A nutritious egg laid by a bird.  This one is unfertilized and probably from "
"a farm."
msgstr "一枚由禽类下的营养丰富的蛋。这枚蛋还未受精，可能来自附近的农场。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ruffed grouse egg"
msgid_plural "ruffed grouse eggs"
msgstr[0] "披肩榛鸡蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestible_overrides.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "feral pigeon egg"
msgid_plural "feral pigeon eggs"
msgstr[0] "野鴿蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "American crow egg"
msgid_plural "American crow eggs"
msgstr[0] "美洲乌鸦蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raven egg"
msgid_plural "raven eggs"
msgstr[0] "渡鴉蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blue jay egg"
msgid_plural "blue jay eggs"
msgstr[0] "冠藍鴉蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cardinal egg"
msgid_plural "cardinal eggs"
msgstr[0] "北美紅雀蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "American robin egg"
msgid_plural "American robin eggs"
msgstr[0] "美洲知更鸟蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "American robin egg"
msgid ""
"A nutritious egg laid by a robin.  The shell is colored a distinctive light "
"blue."
msgstr "一枚由知更鸟下的营养丰富的蛋。外壳呈现独特的浅蓝色。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sparrow egg"
msgid_plural "sparrow eggs"
msgstr[0] "麻雀蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black-capped chickadee egg"
msgid_plural "black-capped chickadee eggs"
msgstr[0] "黑冠山雀蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cedar waxwing egg"
msgid_plural "cedar waxwing eggs"
msgstr[0] "雪松太平鸟蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mallard egg"
msgid_plural "mallard eggs"
msgstr[0] "綠頭鴨蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "domestic duck egg"
msgid_plural "domestic duck eggs"
msgstr[0] "家鸭蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Canada goose egg"
msgid_plural "Canada goose eggs"
msgstr[0] "加拿大雁蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wild turkey egg"
msgid_plural "wild turkey eggs"
msgstr[0] "野生火雞蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "domestic turkey egg"
msgid_plural "domestic turkey eggs"
msgstr[0] "驯养火鸡蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ring-necked pheasant egg"
msgid_plural "ring-necked pheasant eggs"
msgstr[0] "环颈雉蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "domestic guineafowl egg"
msgid_plural "domestic guineafowl eggs"
msgstr[0] "家养珍珠鸡蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "worm snake egg"
msgid_plural "worm snake eggs"
msgstr[0] "蠕蛇蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "painted turtle egg"
msgid_plural "painted turtle eggs"
msgstr[0] "錦龜蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "common snapping turtle egg"
msgid_plural "common snapping turtle eggs"
msgstr[0] "擬鱷龜蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "five-lined skink egg"
msgid_plural "five-lined skink eggs"
msgstr[0] "五线石龙子蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ant egg"
msgid_plural "ant eggs"
msgstr[0] "蟻卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "ant egg"
msgid ""
"A large, heavy ant egg, the size of a softball.  Extremely nutritious, but "
"incredibly gross."
msgstr "一枚巨大的蚂蚁的卵，有垒球般大，超级有营养，它的蛋白质是牛肉的6倍。如果你是贝爷的话。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acid ant egg"
msgid_plural "acid ant eggs"
msgstr[0] "酸性蚂蚁卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "acid ant egg"
msgid ""
"A large, heavy acid ant egg, the size of a softball.  Extremely nutritious, "
"but incredibly gross."
msgstr "一个大而重的酸性蚂蚁蛋，垒球大小。 营养丰富，令人难以置信。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "roach egg"
msgid_plural "roach eggs"
msgstr[0] "蟑螂卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "roach egg"
msgid "A fist-sized egg from a giant roach.  Incredibly gross."
msgstr "巨大蟑螂下的蛋， 拳頭大小， 極度噁心。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plague vector egg"
msgid_plural "plague vector eggs"
msgstr[0] "瘟疫病媒卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "plague vector egg"
msgid "A fist-sized egg from a plague vector.  Incredibly gross."
msgstr "一只瘟疫传染者生的拳头大小的蛋。看起来十分恶心。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "locust egg"
msgid_plural "locust eggs"
msgstr[0] "蝗蟲卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "locust egg"
msgid "A fist-sized egg from a locust."
msgstr "蝗蟲下的卵， 拳頭大小。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dragonfly egg"
msgid_plural "dragonfly eggs"
msgstr[0] "蜻蜓卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "dragonfly egg"
msgid ""
"The still-wet egg of a mutated dragonfly.  Serves as a disgusting substitute "
"for the real thing, just don't let it hatch in the water."
msgstr "一些变异蜻蜓产下的湿乎乎的虫卵。可以当成真蛋使用的恶心替代品，最好别让它在水里孵出来。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "firefly egg"
msgid_plural "firefly eggs"
msgstr[0] "螢火蟲卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "firefly egg"
msgid "The fist-sized egg of a mutant firefly.  Glows faintly in the dark."
msgstr "變異螢火蟲的卵，拳頭大小。在黑暗中微微發光。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "centipede egg"
msgid_plural "centipede eggs"
msgstr[0] "蜈蚣卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "centipede egg"
msgid ""
"A large, soft egg of a mutant centipede.  Inside, you can already see a "
"bundle of spindly legs, twitching in anticipation."
msgstr "突变蜈蚣的大而柔软的卵。在里面，你已经可以看到一些细长的腿，在中抽搐。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wasp egg"
msgid_plural "wasp eggs"
msgstr[0] "黃蜂卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "wasp egg"
msgid ""
"A white, flexible wasp egg.  It looks like a pristine grain of rice the size "
"of your palm."
msgstr "一个白而柔软的黄蜂卵。它看起来像一粒完美的稻米，但有你手掌那么大。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stag beetle egg"
msgid_plural "stag beetle eggs"
msgstr[0] "鍬形蟲卵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "stag beetle egg"
msgid ""
