#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of ice cream"
msgid_plural "servings of ice cream"
msgstr[0] "冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of ice cream"
msgid "A sweet, frozen food made with milk and liberal amounts of sugar."
msgstr "一种用牛奶和大量糖制成的冰镇甜品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of dairy dessert"
msgid_plural "servings of dairy dessert"
msgstr[0] "合成奶味冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of dairy dessert"
msgid ""
"Government regulations dictate that since this isn't *technically* ice cream, "
"it can be called a dairy dessert instead.  You can't really taste the "
"difference."
msgstr "根据相关政府法规，这份甜点的成分使其不足以被称为\"冰淇淋\"，最多只能被称为\"含乳甜点\"。你实在是尝不出来有什么区别。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of chocolate ice cream"
msgid_plural "servings of chocolate ice cream"
msgstr[0] "巧克力冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of chocolate ice cream"
msgid "A sweet, frozen food made with chocolate milk and liberal amounts of sugar."
msgstr "一种用巧克力乳和大量糖制成的冰镇甜品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sundae cup"
msgid_plural "sundae cups"
msgstr[0] "聖代冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "sundae cup"
msgid ""
"A small cup of frozen dairy dessert that is half chocolate, half vanilla, and "
"all delicious."
msgstr "一小杯乳製甜冰品，一半是巧克力，一半是香草，都非常美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of candy ice cream"
msgid_plural "servings of candy ice cream"
msgstr[0] "什锦冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of candy ice cream"
msgid "Ice cream with bits of chocolate, caramel, or other sweet candy mixed in."
msgstr "一份混入了一点巧克力、焦糖或是其他糖果的冰淇淋。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of fruity ice cream"
msgid_plural "servings of fruity ice cream"
msgstr[0] "水果冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of fruity ice cream"
msgid "Small bits of sweet fruit have been tossed into this ice cream."
msgstr "一份混入了许多水果块的冰淇淋。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of frozen custard"
msgid_plural "servings of frozen custard"
msgstr[0] "蛋黄酱冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of frozen custard"
msgid ""
"A treat made famous on Coney Island, made like ice cream but with egg yolk "
"added in.  Its storing temperature is warmer, and it lasts a little longer "
"than regular ice cream."
msgstr "康尼岛著名的冰镇甜品，与冰淇淋很相似，但除了奶油和糖之外还加入了蛋黄酱。它的储存温度略高，保质期也长一些。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of frozen yogurt"
msgid_plural "servings of frozen yogurt"
msgstr[0] "酸奶冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of frozen yogurt"
msgid ""
"Tarter than ice cream, this is made with yogurt and other dairy products, and "
"is generally lower-fat compared to ice cream."
msgstr "略酸的冰淇淋，由酸奶与其他乳制品制成，与普通冰淇淋相比，脂肪含量更低。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of sorbet"
msgid_plural "servings of sorbet"
msgstr[0] "雪芭"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of sorbet"
msgid "A simple frozen dessert made from water and fruit juice."
msgstr "一种简单的冰镇甜点，由水和果汁制成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serving of gelato"
msgid_plural "servings of gelato"
msgstr[0] "意式冰淇淋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
#. ~ Description of "serving of gelato"
msgid ""
"Italian-style ice cream.  It is denser and less airy, giving it a richer "
"flavor and texture."
msgstr "意大利式冰淇淋，与一般冰淇淋相比，它的空气含量更少，这带来了更致密的口感，更浓郁的味道。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked strawberry"
msgid_plural "cooked strawberry"
msgstr[0] "草苺糊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked strawberry"
msgid "It's like strawberry jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "它有點像草莓果醬， 只是沒有加糖。"

