#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked blueberry"
msgid "It's like blueberry jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "它有點像藍莓果醬， 只是沒有加糖。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peaches in syrup"
msgid_plural "peaches in syrup"
msgstr[0] "蜜漬桃子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "peaches in syrup"
msgid "Yellow cling peach slices packed in light syrup."
msgstr "黃色的水蜜桃片， 浸泡在糖水當中。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canned pineapple"
msgid_plural "canned pineapple"
msgstr[0] "鳳梨罐頭"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "canned pineapple"
msgid "Canned pineapple rings in water.  Quite tasty."
msgstr "切成環狀的鳳梨浸在糖水裡。滿好吃的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lemonade drink mix"
msgid_plural "lemonade drink mix"
msgstr[0] "檸檬水沖劑"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "lemonade drink mix"
msgid ""
"Tangy yellow powder that smells strongly of lemons.  Can be mixed with water "
"to make lemonade."
msgstr "帶有強烈檸檬氣味的黃色粉末。能與水混合作出檸檬水。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orangeade drink mix"
msgid_plural "orangeade drink mix"
msgstr[0] "甜橙味果珍冲饮"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "orangeade drink mix"
msgid " Can be mixed with water to make orange juice."
msgstr "可以加水冲泡制作橙汁。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grapeade drink mix"
msgid_plural "grapeade drink mix"
msgstr[0] "葡萄味果珍冲饮"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "grapeade drink mix"
msgid " Can be mixed with water to make grape juice."
msgstr "可以加水冲泡制作葡萄汁。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked fruit"
msgid_plural "cooked fruit"
msgstr[0] "水果糊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked fruit"
msgid "It's like fruit jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "它有點像果醬， 只是沒有加糖。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fruit jam"
msgid_plural "fruit jam"
msgstr[0] "果醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "fruit jam"
msgid "Fresh fruit cooked with sugar to make it last longer."
msgstr "一些加糖熬煮后使保质期更长、更利于保存的酱状水果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dehydrated fruit"
msgid_plural "dehydrated fruit"
msgstr[0] "脫水水果乾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "dehydrated fruit"
msgid ""
"Dehydrated fruit flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will remain "
"edible for an incredibly long time.  They are useful for several cooking "
"recipes."
msgstr "脫水過的水果。在合適的儲存下， 這個乾燥食物能夠保持長時間不壞。能用於數種食譜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rehydrated fruit"
msgid_plural "rehydrated fruit"
msgstr[0] "加水水果乾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "rehydrated fruit"
msgid ""
"Reconstituted fruit flakes, which are much more enjoyable to eat now that "
"they have been rehydrated."
msgstr "沖調過的脫水水果乾， 重新加了水之後讓這東西變得更好吃了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fruit slice"
msgid_plural "fruit slice"
msgstr[0] "水果切片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "fruit slice"
msgid "Fruit slices soaked in a sugar syrup to preserve freshness and appearance."
msgstr "水果片浸泡在糖水里，以保持新鲜和美观。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canned fruit"
msgid_plural "canned fruit"
msgstr[0] "水果罐頭"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "canned fruit"
msgid ""
"This sodden mass of preserved fruit was boiled and canned in an earlier life. "
" Bland, mushy, and losing its color."
msgstr "一团被煮的湿漉漉的水果，在刚煮熟的时候就用罐头封装密封。淡而无味，软成糊状而且失去了原有的色泽。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pumpkin yeast bread"
msgid_plural "pumpkin yeast bread"
msgstr[0] "南瓜酵母麵包"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "pumpkin yeast bread"
msgid ""
"A festive autumnal bread with a golden color in either rolls or sliced loaves "
"of bread."
msgstr "一種秋季節慶麵包，有著金黃的顏色的麵包捲或是切片的麵包。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardtack pudding"
msgid_plural "hardtack puddings"
msgstr[0] "硬麵包布丁"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "hardtack pudding"
msgid ""
"An old recipe from the American Civil War, designed to make hardtack more "
"palatable.  The hardtack is crushed and combined with water and flour to make "
"dough, followed by kneading in pieces of fruit.  The dough is then boiled "
"into bread pudding chunks and topped with sweeteners.  Soldiers would call "
"this a dessert."
msgstr ""
"美国内战时期的老菜谱，旨在使压缩饼干更加美味。将压缩饼干碾碎并与水和面粉混合制成面团，与水果丁揉在一起。然后将面团煮成面包布丁块，并在上面撒上甜味剂。士兵们"
"会称之为甜点。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Jerusalem artichoke fruit dessert"
msgid_plural "Jerusalem artichoke fruit dessert"
msgstr[0] "洋姜水果沙拉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "Jerusalem artichoke fruit dessert"
msgid ""
"Chopped Jerusalem artichoke combined with any fruit that is in season or at "
"hand.  Surprisingly tasty."
msgstr "切碎的洋姜与当季或者手头刚好有的水果结合在一起。出乎意料地美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "brandied fruit"
msgid_plural "brandied fruit"
msgstr[0] "酒漬水果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "brandied fruit"
msgid "Whole fruits preserved in 40 proof or higher alcohol."
msgstr "整顆水果保存在40標準酒度或更高的酒中。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toast-em"
msgid_plural "toast-ems"
msgstr[0] "吐司餅乾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "toast-em"
msgid ""
"A dry toaster pastry coated with solid frosting.  This one is strawberry "
"flavored, what luck!"
msgstr "洒满糖霜的干烤面包糕点。这个是草莓味的，运气真不错！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "toast-em"
msgid ""
"A dry toaster pastry coated with solid frosting.  This one is blueberry "
"flavored!"
msgstr "洒满糖霜的干烤面包糕点。这个是蓝莓味的！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "toast-em"
msgid ""
"A dry toaster pasty, usually coated with solid frosting.  Sadly, this one is "
"not."
msgstr "干烤的面包糕点，通常都会洒满糖霜。可惜的是，这个没有。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade toast-em"
msgid_plural "homemade toast-ems"
msgstr[0] "自製果醬吐司餅乾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade toast-em"
msgid "A homemade toaster pastry, filled with fruit but lacking icing."
msgstr "自制的面包糕点，里面装满了水果，但没有糖霜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toaster pastry (uncooked)"
msgid_plural "toaster pastries (uncooked)"
msgstr[0] "吐司機點心 (生)"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "toaster pastry (uncooked)"
msgid ""
"A delicious fruit-filled pastry that you can cook in your toaster.  It even "
"comes with frosting!  Cook it to make it tastier."
msgstr "一个可以在烤面包机里烤制的夹心水果面包，上面还带着糖霜！加热后更美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toaster pastry"
msgid_plural "toaster pastries"
msgstr[0] "吐司機點心"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "toaster pastry"
msgid ""
"A delicious fruit-filled pastry that you've cooked.  It even comes with "
"frosting!"
msgstr "一種能利用烤吐司機來烹調的水果點心。甚至還有裹糖霜！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "toaster pastry"
msgid "A delicious homemade fruit-filled pastry that you've cooked."
msgstr "一份你自己做的美味自制烤夹心面包。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toaster pastry with buttercream"
msgid_plural "toaster pastries with buttercream"
msgstr[0] "烤奶油夾心麵包"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "toaster pastry with buttercream"
msgid ""
"A delicious homemade fruit-filled pastry that you've cooked.  It even comes "
"with buttercream!"
msgstr "一份你自己做的美味自制烤夹心面包，上面甚至还有奶油！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "buttercream icing"
msgid_plural "cups of buttercream icing"
msgstr[0] "奶油糖霜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "buttercream icing"
msgid ""
"Smooth, sugary buttercream icing.  Almost good enough to forget the end of "
"everything."
msgstr "一份光滑的含糖奶油糖霜。几乎足以让你忘记万物的终结。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potato chips"
msgid_plural "potato chips"
msgstr[0] "洋芋片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "potato chips"
msgid "A handful of plain, salted potato chips."
msgstr "一大把單純的加鹽洋芋片。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "potato chips"
msgid "Oh man, you love these chips!  Score!"
msgstr "喔， 你一定會喜歡這些洋芋片的！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pretzels"
msgid_plural "pretzels"
msgstr[0] "椒鹽脆餅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "pretzels"
msgid ""
"A handful of tiny, heavily-salted bread twists.  A tasty treat, but they'll "
"make you thirsty."
msgstr "一把小小的咸味饼干。十分美味的小吃，但它们会让你口渴。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chocolate-covered pretzel"
msgid_plural "chocolate-covered pretzel"
msgstr[0] "巧克力椒鹽脆餅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chocolate-covered pretzel"
msgid "A handful of tiny bread twists covered in chocolate."
msgstr "一把小小的咸味饼干，被覆盖了一层巧克力。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chocolate bar"
msgid_plural "chocolate bars"
msgstr[0] "巧克力棒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chocolate bar"
msgid "A bar of chocolate from a popular candy brand.  A delicious treat."
msgstr "来自流行糖果品牌的巧克力棒。美味的小吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "marshmallows"
msgid_plural "marshmallows"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "marshmallows"
msgid "A handful of squishy, fluffy, puffy, delicious marshmallows."
msgstr "數個柔軟、蓬鬆、美味的棉花糖。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "s'mores"
msgid_plural "s'mores"
msgstr[0] "巧克力棉花糖夾心餅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "s'mores"
msgid "A pair of graham crackers with some chocolate and a marshmallow between them."
msgstr "兩片餅乾內餡夾著巧克力與棉花糖。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peanut butter candy"
msgid_plural "peanut butter candy"
msgstr[0] "奶油花生糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "peanut butter candy"
msgid "A handful of peanut butter cups… your favorite!"
msgstr "少量奶油花生糖… 你的最愛！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chocolate candy"
msgid_plural "chocolate candy"
msgstr[0] "巧克力糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chocolate candy"
msgid "A handful of colorful chocolate-filled candies."
msgstr "一把巧克力夹心糖果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chewy candy"
msgid_plural "chewy candy"
msgstr[0] "軟糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chewy candy"
msgid "A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candies."
msgstr "五颜六色的水果味糖果，很有嚼劲。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gummy candy"
msgid_plural "gummy candy"
msgstr[0] "軟糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "gummy candy"
msgid "A handful of colorful fruit- and soda-flavored gummy candies."
msgstr "一把五顏六色的水果味和蘇打味的軟糖。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegan gummy candy"
msgid_plural "vegan gummy candy"
msgstr[0] "素食軟糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "vegan gummy candy"
msgid ""
"A handful of colorful fruit- and soda-flavored vegan gummy candies made from "
"agar instead of animal gelatin.  They have kind of a strange texture, but "
"they're still tasty."
msgstr "一把五顏六色的水果味和蘇打味的素食軟糖，由寒天取代動物明膠製成。雖然口點有點奇怪不過還是很好吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chewy reptilian candy"
msgid_plural "chewy reptilian candy"
msgstr[0] "QQ爬蟲軟糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chewy reptilian candy"
msgid ""
"A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candies shaped in a reptilian "
"fashion.  Made by SugarRush."
msgstr "有嚼勁的五顏六色水果味糖果，做成了爬蟲類的外型。由 SugarRush 出品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "candy cattle"
msgid_plural "candy cattle"
msgstr[0] "小牛糖果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "candy cattle"
msgid "A handful of chocolate candies shaped like cows."
msgstr "一把牛型巧克力糖果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "licorice"
msgid_plural "licorice"
msgstr[0] "甘草糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "licorice"
msgid "A swirly confectionary treat in strings of sweet-tasting candy."
msgstr "長條纏成螺旋狀的香甜糖果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "powder candy sticks"
msgid_plural "powder candy sticks"
msgstr[0] "粉末糖果條"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "powder candy sticks"
msgid "Thin paper tubes of sweet & sour candy powder.  Who thinks of this stuff?"
msgstr "用細長的包裝紙裝了酸甜味的糖果粉。誰想出這玩意的？"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "candy bracelet"
msgid_plural "candy bracelets"
msgstr[0] "糖果手鐲"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "candy bracelet"
msgid ""
"A candy bracelet made by stringing candies onto a thread.  In theory, you "
"could both wear and eat the bracelet."
msgstr "将糖果串在一根线上制成的糖果手链。理论上，你可以一边戴一边吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "maple syrup candy"
msgid_plural "maple syrup candy"
msgstr[0] "楓糖漿糖果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "maple syrup candy"
msgid ""
"A handful of golden, translucent leaf candies made with pure maple syrup.  "
"They melt slowly in your mouth as you savor the taste of real maple."
msgstr "一把由純楓糖漿製成的金色、半透明薄片糖果，吃起來慢慢融化，讓你品嚐真正的楓樹的味道。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "graham cracker"
msgid_plural "graham crackers"
msgstr[0] "全麥餅乾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "graham cracker"
msgid ""
"These dry, sugary crackers will leave you thirsty, but they go well with some "
"chocolate and marshmallows."
msgstr "这些又干又甜的饼干会让你口渴，但与一些巧克力和棉花糖很相配。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "graham cracker chunks"
msgid_plural "graham cracker chunks"
msgstr[0] "全麥餅乾塊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "graham cracker chunks"
msgid ""
"These dry, sugary cracker pellets will leave you thirsty, and they're not the "
"right size to make s'mores with.  Made by SugarRush!"
msgstr "这些又干又甜的小饼干会让你口渴，而且它们的大小不适合用来制作果塔饼干。由 SugarRush 出品！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cookie"
msgid_plural "cookies"
msgstr[0] "餅乾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cookie"
msgid "A sweet, delicious cookie, just like grandma used to bake."
msgstr "香甜可口的饼干，就像奶奶烤的一样。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cookie egg"
msgid_plural "cookie eggs"
msgstr[0] "曲奇蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cookie egg"
msgid "A sweet, delicious cookie, shaped like an egg.  Made by SugarRush!"
msgstr "香甜可口的饼干，形状像蛋一样。SugarRush出品！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "maple syrup"
msgid_plural "maple syrup"
msgstr[0] "楓糖漿"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "maple syrup"
msgid ""
"Boiling the sap of a maple tree has concentrated it into this sweet, "
"delicious maple syrup."
msgstr "通过把枫树的汁液煮沸，浓缩而成的香甜可口的枫糖浆。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sugar beet syrup"
msgid_plural "sugar beet syrup"
msgstr[0] "甜菜糖漿"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "sugar beet syrup"
msgid ""
"A thick syrup produced from shredded sugar beets.  Useful in cooking as a "
"sweetener."
msgstr "用碎甜菜製作的濃糖漿。在烹飪時是種很好的甜味劑。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "simple syrup"
msgid_plural "simple syrup"
msgstr[0] "简易糖浆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "simple syrup"
msgid ""
"A simple syrup, made of just sugar and water.  Used usually as a sweetener "
"for stuff like cocktails."
msgstr "一种简易糖浆，仅由糖和水制成。通常用作鸡尾酒等饮品的甜味剂。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "corn syrup"
msgid_plural "corn syrup"
msgstr[0] "玉米糖浆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "corn syrup"
msgid "A syrup made from corn."
msgstr "从玉米中提取制得的糖浆。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cake"
msgid_plural "cakes"
msgstr[0] "蛋糕"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cake"
msgid ""
"Delicious sponge cake with buttercream icing.  Happy Birthday is written on "
"top in frosting."
msgstr ""
"一份裹上了香浓糖衣的新鲜蛋糕，里面还有满满的奶油。糖霜顶上还写着\"生日快乐\"。\n"
"\"或许现在应该改名叫末日快乐了。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cake"
msgid "Delicious chocolate cake.  It has all the icing.  All of it."
msgstr "美味的巧克力蛋糕。裹滿了糖衣。滿滿的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cake"
msgid ""
"A cake coated in the thickest icing you've ever seen.  Someone has written "
"guff in quotation marks on it…"
msgstr "裹滿了你從沒看過的厚厚糖衣。有人在蛋糕上面寫了瘋話…"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "unholy debug angel cake"
msgid_plural "unholy debug angel cakes"
msgstr[0] "邪恶调试天使蛋糕"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "unholy debug angel cake"
msgid ""
"This unholy confection of delight does not lie, it packs a heavenly amount of "
"calories in each sinful bite.  For debug use only."
msgstr "这份不圣洁的甜美点心绝不虚假，每一口罪恶的享受中都蕴含着天堂般的热量。仅供调试使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chocolate-covered coffee beans"
msgid_plural "chocolate-covered coffee beans"
msgstr[0] "巧克力咖啡豆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chocolate-covered coffee beans"
msgid ""
"Roasted coffee beans coated with dark chocolate, a natural source of "
"concentrated caffeine."
msgstr "一些黑巧克力咖啡豆，来自自然的满满的咖啡因享受。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fast-food French fries"
msgid_plural "fast-food French fries"
msgstr[0] "速食薯條"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "fast-food French fries"
msgid "Salty, deep-fried potatoes from a fast food restaurant."
msgstr "来自快餐店的咸味炸土豆。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "French fries"
msgid_plural "French fries"
msgstr[0] "薯條"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "French fries"
msgid ""
"Homemade deep-fried potatoes or other tubers, with a touch of salt.  Crunchy "
"and delicious."
msgstr "自家製的炸馬鈴薯或其他塊莖拿去炸，撒上一點鹽。香脆可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "French fries" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. groundnut_prepared
msgid "ground nut fries"
msgid_plural "ground nut fries"
msgstr[0] "花生薯條"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Julienne fries"
msgid_plural "Julienne fries"
msgstr[0] ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "Julienne fries"
msgid ""
"Homemade deep-fried potatoes cut long and thin, with a touch of salt.  These "
"were somewhat of a fad before the world ended.  Crunchy and delicious."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "poutine"
msgid_plural "poutine"
msgstr[0] "肉汁奶酪薯条"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "poutine"
msgid ""
"A serving of fries, covered in cheese curds and hot gravy.  While cheese "
"curds are more appropriate and traditional, some other cheeses may be used.  "
"A Canadian staple."
msgstr "一份覆盖着奶酪凝乳和热肉汁的薯条。虽然奶酪凝乳更合适也更传统，但也可以使用其他一些奶酪。加拿大主食。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peppermint patty"
msgid_plural "peppermint patties"
msgstr[0] "薄荷餡餅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "peppermint patty"
msgid "A handful of soft, chocolate-covered peppermint patties… yum!"
msgstr "一把被软巧克力包裹着的薄荷馅饼，味道好极了！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Necco wafers"
msgid_plural "Necco wafers"
msgstr[0] "Necco 威化餅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "Necco wafers"
msgid ""
"A handful of candy wafers in assorted flavors: orange, lemon, lime, clove, "
"chocolate, wintergreen, cinnamon, and licorice.  Yum!"
msgstr ""
"一大包糖果，什锦口味：橙，柠檬，青柠，丁香，巧克力，冬青，桂皮，甘草，非常美味。\n"
"\"看到彩虹，吃定彩虹~！\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "candy cigarette"
msgid_plural "candy cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "香煙糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "candy cigarette"
msgid ""
"Flavored sugar sticks designed to look like cigarettes.  Anti-smoking reports "
"from the Surgeon General have caused a pretty big drop in their popularity "
"since the 1960s."
msgstr "设计成香烟形状的风味糖棒。自1960年代以来，外科医生的反吸烟报告导致其流行程度大幅下降。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "caramel"
msgid_plural "caramel"
msgstr[0] "焦糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "caramel"
msgid "Some caramel.  Sticky and sweet, but not very exciting by itself."
msgstr "一些焦糖。粘稠而甜美，但它本身并不是很令人兴奋。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "caramel apple"
msgid_plural "caramel apples"
msgstr[0] "焦糖蘋果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "caramel apple"
msgid ""
"A caramel-covered apple.  Best served on an autumn day, at a harvest fair, on "
"a stick - but those days are long gone."
msgstr "焦糖覆盖的苹果。最好是在某个秋日，在丰收博览会上，串在棍子上吃——但那些日子早已一去不复返了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "potato chips"
msgid "Betcha can't eat just one."
msgstr "我賭你絕對停不下來。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tortilla chips"
msgid_plural "tortilla chips"
msgstr[0] "墨西哥玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "tortilla chips"
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas.  They're not bad on their own, but "
"they could really use some cheese, maybe some meat."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片。单独吃起来也不错，不过再来点奶酪，或者是加点肉就更棒了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cheese nachos"
msgid_plural "cheese nachos"
msgstr[0] "起司玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cheese nachos"
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with cheese melted on top.  Could "
"stand to have some meat."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，一层奶酪熔化在上面。再来点肉就更棒了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "meat nachos"
msgid_plural "meat nachos"
msgstr[0] "加肉玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "meat nachos"
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with ground meat on top.  Could "
"probably use some cheese, though."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，上面有碎肉。再来点奶酪就更棒了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos" when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
msgid "niño nachos"
msgid_plural "niño nachos"
msgstr[0] "加人肉玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
msgid "nibelung nachos"
msgid_plural "nibelung nachos"
msgstr[0] "矮人玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. mutant
msgid "nachos con chupacabra"
msgid_plural "nachos con chupacabra"
msgstr[0] "卓柏卡布拉玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "meat nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "meat nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "加肉起司玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "meat nachos with cheese"
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas smothered in cheese and ground meat.  "
"Delicious."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，裹着奶酪和碎肉。十分可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos with cheese" when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
msgid "niño nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "niño nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "人肉起司玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos with cheese" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
msgid "nibelung nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "nibelung nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "矮人起司玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos with cheese" when
#. COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches mutant
msgid "cheese and chupacabra nachos"
msgid_plural "cheese and chupacabra nachos"
msgstr[0] "卓柏卡布拉起司玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetarian nachos"
msgid_plural "vegetarian nachos"
msgstr[0] "素食玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetarian nachos"
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with beans on top.  Could probably use "
"some cheese, though."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，上面加有豆子。再来点奶酪就更棒了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetarian nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "vegetarian nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "起司和素食玉米片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetarian nachos with cheese"
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, smothered in cheese and beans.  "
"Delicious, even if you're not a vegetarian."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，裹着奶酪和豆子。即使你不是素食主义者，它也十分美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pork stick"
msgid_plural "pork sticks"
msgstr[0] "豬肉條"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "pork stick"
msgid "Salty dried pork.  Tastes good, but it will make you thirsty."
msgstr "鹽漬的豬肉。好吃， 只是吃的時候口會渴。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "microwave burrito"
msgid_plural "microwave burritos"
msgstr[0] "微波墨西哥捲餅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "microwave burrito"
msgid ""
"A small, microwavable steak & cheese burrito, like those found at gas "
"stations."
msgstr "微波食品的一种——小分量的牛排、奶酪与玉米煎饼装在一个盒子里，大多数加油站有售。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "uncooked TV dinner"
msgid_plural "uncooked TV dinner"
msgstr[0] "生餐包"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "uncooked TV dinner"
msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Not as appetizing as it "
"would be if heated up."
msgstr "一磅的肉类加上一磅的碳水化合物，看起来并不是那么可口的样子，如果能加热一下就好了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked TV dinner"
msgid_plural "cooked TV dinner"
msgstr[0] "熟餐包"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked TV dinner"
msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Now that it's been heated "
"up, it's much tastier but will also spoil more quickly."
msgstr "一磅多汁的肉类加上一磅香喷喷的碳水化合物！新鲜出炉，风味更佳，但也会更快变质。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deep-fried chicken"
msgid_plural "deep-fried chicken"
msgstr[0] "炸雞"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "deep-fried chicken"
msgid "Fast-food chicken, deep-fried in oil.  It's greasy and delicious."
msgstr "油炸速食炸雞。油滋滋美滋滋。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chili dog"
msgid_plural "chili dogs"
msgstr[0] "辣醬熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chili dog"
msgid "A hot dog with chili con carne on top.  Yum!"
msgstr "一根盖有辣肉酱的热狗，香辣可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "uncooked corn dog"
msgid_plural "uncooked corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "生玉米熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "uncooked corn dog"
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  It would taste "
"much better cooked."
msgstr "一份经过深加工的香肠，裹在面糊里炸熟的生热狗，可以直接食用，但加热一下会更好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked corn dog"
msgid_plural "cooked corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "炸熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked corn dog"
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  Now that it's "
"been cooked, this corn dog tastes much better, but will spoil faster."
msgstr "一份经过深加工的香肠，裹在面糊里炸熟的热狗，比起生的尝起来更棒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade corn dog"
msgid_plural "homemade corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "自家製炸熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade corn dog"
msgid "A homemade sausage, dipped in batter and deep fried."
msgstr "一根蘸上面糊油炸而成的自制香肠。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chocolate pancake"
msgid_plural "chocolate pancakes"
msgstr[0] "巧克力煎餅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chocolate pancake"
msgid ""
"Fluffy and delicious pancakes with real maple syrup, with delicious chocolate "
"baked right in."
msgstr "剛出爐的既蓬鬆可口並且淋上純正楓糖漿的美味巧克力煎餅。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chocolate waffle"
msgid_plural "chocolate waffles"
msgstr[0] "巧克力鬆餅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chocolate waffle"
msgid ""
"Crunchy and delicious waffles with real maple syrup, with delicious chocolate "
"baked right in."
msgstr "剛出爐的既蓬鬆可口並且淋上純正楓糖漿的美味巧克力鬆餅。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cheese spread"
msgid_plural "cheese spreads"
msgstr[0] "起司抹醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cheese spread"
msgid "Processed cheese spread."
msgstr "處理過的起司抹醬。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cheese fries"
msgid_plural "cheese fries"
msgstr[0] "起司薯條"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cheese fries"
msgid "Fried potatoes with delicious cheese smothered on top."
msgstr "油炸馬鈴薯。有著美味的起士淋在上面。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "onion rings"
msgid_plural "onion rings"
msgstr[0] "洋蔥圈"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "onion rings"
msgid "Battered and fried onions.  Crunchy and delicious."
msgstr "反復油炸的洋蔥圈。香脆可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "uncooked hot dog"
msgid_plural "uncooked hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "生熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "uncooked hot dog"
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, commonplace at baseball games before the "
"Cataclysm.  It would taste much better cooked."
msgstr "一个高度加工的香肠，常见于各个快餐行业之中或者棒球赛的看台上。加热后口感更佳。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "campfire hot dog"
msgid_plural "campfire hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "火烤熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "campfire hot dog"
msgid ""
"A simple hot dog, cooked over an open fire.  Would be better on a bun, but "
"it's quite an improvement over eating it uncooked."
msgstr "一份经过简单的明火烤熟加工的热狗，味道尝起来显然没有裹上面包与其他调料的更好，但作为充饥品已经非常不错了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked hot dog"
msgid_plural "cooked hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked hot dog"
msgid ""
"Surprisingly, not made from dog.  Now that it's been cooked, this hot dog "
"tastes much better, but will spoil faster."
msgstr "一份经过加热的热狗，已经做熟了，尝起来更棒，但也更容易变质。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "new york wiener"
msgid_plural "new york wieners"
msgstr[0] "紐約熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "new york wiener"
msgid ""
"What's better than a hot dog?  A hot dog smothered in ground meat and chopped "
"onions, of course!"
msgstr "有什麼比熱狗更好？當然是被肉末和洋蔥碎埋住的熱狗！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "malted milk balls"
msgid_plural "malted milk balls"
msgstr[0] "麥芽牛奶球"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "malted milk balls"
msgid ""
"Crunchy sugar in chocolate capsules.  The malt gives them a distinct, yet "
"delicious flavor."
msgstr "包裹著巧克力的香脆糖球。麥芽賦予了它獨特又好吃的口感。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "candy-coated peanuts"
msgid "Peanuts coated in a sweet, crunchy candy coating.  A regional delicacy."
msgstr "裹着一层香甜酥脆的焦糖的花生。本地特色美食。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "freeze-dried meal"
msgid_plural "freeze-dried meals"
msgstr[0] "冷凍乾燥食品"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "freeze-dried meal"
msgid ""
"A sealed plastic bag containing a full dehydrated meal.  This one contains a "
"hearty beef and egg breakfast."
msgstr "一個密封的塑膠袋，裡面裝有完整的脫水餐。這份包含豐盛的牛肉和雞蛋早餐。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rehydrated freeze-dried meal"
msgid_plural "rehydrated freeze-dried meals"
msgstr[0] "解凍冷凍乾燥食品"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "rehydrated freeze-dried meal"
msgid "A rehydrated beef and egg breakfast meal meant for camping or hiking."
msgstr "適合露營或遠足的泡發牛肉雞蛋早餐。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military chocolate bar"
msgid_plural "military chocolate bars"
msgstr[0] "軍用巧克力棒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "military chocolate bar"
msgid ""
"A thick, dense bar of military chocolate.  While tough to chew and not very "
"appetizing, it provides almost a day's worth of calories in portable form."
msgstr "一块厚重的军用巧克力棒。虽然很难咀嚼，味道也不是很好，但便携式的它能为你提供几乎一天的热量。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gelatin dessert powder"
msgid_plural "gelatin dessert powder"
msgstr[0] "明膠果凍粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "gelatin dessert powder"
msgid ""
"A serving of sugary, fruit-flavored gelatin dessert powder.  Just add water "
"and set."
msgstr "一份含糖的水果味明胶甜点粉。只需加水并凝固。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "unflavored gelatin dessert"
msgid_plural "unflavored gelatin desserts"
msgstr[0] "無添加果凍"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "unflavored gelatin dessert"
msgid ""
"An unflavored jiggly, sugary treat made from gelatin and sugar.  It would "
"taste better with some flavor."
msgstr "一种由明胶和糖制成的无风味的含糖甜点。再加点调味，味道会更好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "processed gelatin dessert"
msgid_plural "processed gelatin desserts"
msgstr[0] "加工果凍"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "processed gelatin dessert"
msgid ""
"A jiggly, sugary, fruit-flavored treat made from boxed mix.  A kid favorite "
"pre-Cataclysm."
msgstr "一种由预拌粉制成的零食，摇摇晃晃，富含糖分，还有水果风味。大灾变前孩子们的最爱。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade gelatin dessert"
msgid_plural "homemade gelatin desserts"
msgstr[0] "自制果凍"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade gelatin dessert"
msgid ""
"A homemade jiggly, sugary treat made from gelatin and sugar, flavored with "
"fruit juice.  A kid favorite pre-Cataclysm."
msgstr "一种由明胶和糖制成摇摇晃晃的含糖甜点，自制时加入了果汁调味。在大灾变前是孩子们的最爱。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fruit filled gelatin dessert"
msgid_plural "fruit filled gelatin desserts"
msgstr[0] "水果果凍"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "fruit filled gelatin dessert"
msgid ""
"A jiggly, sugary treat made from gelatin and sugar, flavored with fruit juice "
"and set with fruit.  A kid favorite pre-Cataclysm and a healthy treat."
msgstr "一种由明胶和糖制成摇摇晃晃的含糖甜点，加入了果肉和果汁调味。在大灾变前是孩子们的最爱。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegan gelatin dessert"
msgid_plural "vegan gelatin desserts"
msgstr[0] "素食果凍"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "vegan gelatin dessert"
msgid ""
"A vegan friendly homemade jiggly, sugary treat made from agar and sugar, "
"flavored with fruit juice.  A kid favorite pre-Cataclysm.  They'll never know "
"the difference."
msgstr "一种素食者可食用的由琼脂和糖制成摇摇晃晃的含糖甜点，自制时加入了果汁调味。在大灾变前是孩子们的最爱，他们尝不出来区别的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fruit filled vegan gelatin dessert"
msgid_plural "fruit filled vegan gelatin desserts"
msgstr[0] "素食水果果凍"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "fruit filled vegan gelatin dessert"
msgid ""
"A vegan friendly jiggly, sugary treat made from agar and sugar, flavored with "
"fruit juice and set with fruit.  A kid favorite pre-Cataclysm and a healthy "
"treat."
msgstr "一种素食者可食用的由琼脂和糖制成摇摇晃晃的含糖甜点，加入了果肉和果汁调味。在大灾变前是孩子们的最爱。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pasta carbonara"
msgid_plural "pasta carbonara"
msgstr[0] "奶油培根意大利面"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "pasta carbonara"
msgid "A famous Italian pasta dish made with egg, pecorino and bacon."
msgstr "一道著名的意大利面食，由鸡蛋、佩科里诺干酪和培根做成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "amatriciana pasta"
msgid_plural "amatriciana pasta"
msgstr[0] "番茄培根意大利面"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "amatriciana pasta"
msgid "A famous Italian pasta dish made with red sauce, pecorino and bacon."
msgstr "一道著名的意大利面食，由番茄酱、佩科里诺干酪和培根做成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plain crepe"
msgid_plural "plain crepes"
msgstr[0] "原味可丽饼"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "plain crepe"
#. ~ Description of "crepe"
msgid "Krampouezh, known worldwide as 'crepe' is a traditional, thin Breton pancake."
msgstr "法式薄饼，俗称可丽饼，是法国布列塔尼传统的煎薄饼。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crepe"
msgid_plural "crepes"
msgstr[0] "可丽饼"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "marshmallow fluff"
msgid_plural "marshmallow fluff"
msgstr[0] "棉花软糖团"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#. ~ Description of "marshmallow fluff"
msgid "Delicious and creamy delight, half of the famous Fluffernutter."
msgstr "美味且细腻蓬松的小玩意，著名的Fluffernutter甜点其中一半的组成部分。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw sausage"
msgid_plural "raw sausages"
msgstr[0] "生香腸"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "raw sausage"
msgid "A hefty raw sausage, prepared for smoking or cooking."
msgstr "一條沉重的生香腸， 已準備好用於煙燻或烹煮。"

