#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "Indian taco"
msgid ""
"Frybread topped with beans, meat, and lettuce.  Originally conceived by the "
"Navajo in the 19th century, only having available basic foodstuffs provided "
"by the US-government after forced expulsion from their homelands, this dish "
"became popular with many Native Americans and is often served at Powwows or "
"other festivities."
msgstr ""
"油煎玉米饼，上面摆着豆子、肉和生菜。由19"
"世纪的纳瓦霍人发明，他们被驱逐出家园，只能吃美国政府提供的基本食物。这道菜在许多美洲原住民社区中颇受欢迎，经常在帕瓦祈祷仪式上或其他节日时食用。"

