#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Sound description of spell "cold_snap ( Cold Snap )"
msgid "crack"
msgid_plural "crack"
msgstr[0] "快克"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "crack"
msgid ""
"Deprotonated cocaine crystals, incredibly addictive and deleterious to brain "
"chemistry."
msgstr "純化的的古柯鹼結晶， 極度容易令人上癮。此藥品會傷害大腦。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "crack"
msgid "You smoke your crack rocks.  Mother would be proud."
msgstr "你抽了你的快克。你老母會以你為榮。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "non-drowsy cough syrup"
msgid_plural "non-drowsy cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "無睡意止咳糖漿"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "non-drowsy cough syrup"
msgid ""
"Daytime cold and flu medication, non-drowsy formula.  Will suppress coughing, "
"aching, headaches and runny noses, but you'll still need lots of fluids and "
"rest."
msgstr "白天使用的对抗感冒和流感的药物，吃了不瞌睡。可以抑制咳嗽，疼痛，头痛，流鼻涕，但你仍然需要多喝水和休息。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antiseptic"
msgid_plural "antiseptic"
msgstr[0] "消毒劑"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antiseptic"
msgid "A powerful antiseptic commonly used to disinfect wounds."
msgstr "一份强效的抗菌剂，用于给伤口消毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift antiseptic"
msgid_plural "makeshift antiseptic"
msgstr[0] "粗製消毒劑"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift antiseptic"
msgid "Makeshift antiseptic made from ethanol.  Can be used to disinfect wounds."
msgstr "一份用乙醇制成的简易抗菌剂，可用于伤口消毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "prescription sedative"
msgid_plural "prescription sedative"
msgstr[0] "長效鎮靜劑"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "prescription sedative"
#. ~ Description of variant "diazepam" of item "prescription sedative"
msgid ""
"A strong benzodiazepine drug used to treat muscle spasms, anxiety, seizures, "
"and panic attacks."
msgstr "強力的苯甲二氮䓬藥劑， 用於治療肌肉痙攣， 焦慮， 癲癇發作和驚恐症發作。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cannabis shatter"
msgid_plural "cannabis shatter"
msgstr[0] "大麻塊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "cannabis shatter"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular style "
"of concentrate is in a thin sheet and shatters like glass at room "
"temperature.  Arguably one of the better styles of concentrate compared to "
"wax, crumble, or distillate.  Normal cannabis contains around 20% THC; this "
"shatter should be around 55% THC."
msgstr ""
"一份高度浓缩的大麻精油，又被称为大麻脂。这种精油在室温下凝聚成薄片状，像玻璃一样易碎。与大麻蜡，大麻粉或大麻提取液相比，它可以说是一种更好的浓缩方式。普通大"
"麻的THC含量约为20%，而这块大麻脂的THC含量至少在55%左右。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "cannabis shatter"
msgid "You take a dab.  Wow, that's got some killer terpenes!"
msgstr "你服用了一些大麻块。哇哦，里面的大麻萜烯可真够劲！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cannabis wax"
msgid_plural "cannabis wax"
msgstr[0] "大麻蠟"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "cannabis wax"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular style "
"of concentrate is yellow and waxy at room temperature.  Normal cannabis "
"contains around 20% THC; this wax should be around 45% THC."
msgstr "一份高度浓缩的大麻精油，又被称为大麻脂。这种特殊的浓缩液在室温下呈黄色蜡状。普通大麻的THC含量约为20%，而这块大麻蜡的THC含量至少在45%左右。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "cannabis wax"
msgid "You take a dab of wax.  *cough cough* Good stuff!"
msgstr "你服用了一些大麻蜡。*咳咳*好货色！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cannabis distillate"
msgid_plural "cannabis distillate"
msgstr[0] "大麻精油"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "cannabis distillate"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract.  This style of extract goes through the most "
"processing, eliminating most if not all harmful ingredients.  Normal cannabis "
"contains around 20% THC; this distillate should be around 88% THC.  Can be "
"smoked using a refillable electronic cigarette."
msgstr ""
"一份高度浓缩的大麻精油。这种精油经过了最多步骤的加工处理，去除了几乎所有有害成分。普通大麻的THC含量约为20%，而这种大麻提取液的THC含量至少在88%"
"左右。可以用可重新填充的电子烟吸食。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "cannabis distillate"
msgid "You take a dab of distillate.  Sooooo smooth…"
msgstr "你服用了一些大麻精油。真～～～爽……"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electronic cigarette"
msgid_plural "electronic cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "電子菸"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "electronic cigarette"
msgid ""
"This battery-operated device vaporizes a liquid that contains flavorings and "
"nicotine.  A less harmful alternative to traditional cigarettes, but it's "
"still addictive.  It can't be reused once it's empty."
msgstr "這個電子裝置把尼古丁和調味劑液體蒸騰混合在一起。雖然比傳統香菸危險性小， 但是仍然會讓人上癮。這是一次性的， 無法裝填。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "saline eye drops"
msgid_plural "saline eye drops"
msgstr[0] "眼藥水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "saline eye drops"
msgid ""
"Sterile saline eye drops.  Can be used to treat dry eyes, or to wash out "
"contaminants."
msgstr "無菌生理食鹽眼藥水。可用於治療乾眼， 或洗出在眼裡的異物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steroid eyedrops"
msgid_plural "steroid eyedrops"
msgstr[0] "類固醇眼藥水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "steroid eyedrops"
msgid ""
"A topical corticosteroid in the form of eye drops.  Can be used to treat "
"irritation and inflammation of the eyes."
msgstr "含有外用皮質類固醇的眼藥水。能用來治療眼部刺激和發炎。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "steroid eyedrops"
msgid "You put the anti-inflammatory eyedrops into your eyes."
msgstr "你将眼药水滴入眼内。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flu shot"
msgid_plural "flu shots"
msgstr[0] "流感疫苗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "flu shot"
msgid ""
"A pharmaceutical flu shot designed for mass vaccinations, still in its "
"packaging.  Purported to provide immunity to influenza, for the flu season "
"for which it was developed."
msgstr "一支用于大规模疫苗接种的医用流感疫苗，尚未开封。旨在为出厂时的流感季节中流行的毒株提供免疫。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hand-rolled cigarette"
msgid_plural "hand-rolled cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "手捲煙"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "hand-rolled cigarette"
msgid ""
"A roll-your-own cigarette.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Despite being hand crafted, it's still highly addictive and hazardous to "
"health."
msgstr "一根你自己卷的香烟，刺激感知，并且降低进食欲望。即便自产自销，依旧无法掩盖会导致上瘾且有害健康的事实。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heroin"
msgid_plural "heroin"
msgstr[0] "海洛因"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "heroin"
msgid ""
"An extremely strong opioid narcotic derived from morphine.  Incredibly "
"addictive, the risk of overdose is extreme, and the drug is contraindicated "
"for nearly all medical purposes."
msgstr "由嗎啡萃取的高濃度鴉片類麻醉劑。極其容易上癮， 用藥過量的風險很高， 即使在醫用方面都幾乎被禁絕。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "heroin"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "morphine"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "serendipnol"
msgid "You shoot up."
msgstr "你注射了一發。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potassium iodide tablet"
msgid_plural "potassium iodide tablets"
msgstr[0] "碘化鉀藥片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "potassium iodide tablet"
msgid ""
"A potassium iodide tablet.  If taken prior to exposure, they help to mitigate "
"injury caused by radiation absorption."
msgstr "一片碘化钾。在接触辐射前使用，可减少辐射产生的不良影响。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "potassium iodide tablet"
msgid "You take some potassium iodide."
msgstr "你服用一些碘片。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "joint"
msgid ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a "
"piece of paper and ready for smokin'."
msgstr "大麻、狼藥、草。不管你怎麼叫他， 把它用張紙捲起來， 然後準備抽。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pink tab"
msgid_plural "pink tabs"
msgstr[0] "搖頭丸"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "pink tab"
msgid ""
"A tiny pink tabs resembling a postage stamp, dosed with some sort of drug.  "
"Really only useful for entertainment.  Will cause hallucinations."
msgstr "类似邮票的粉红色小纸片，加入了某种药物。只是消遣性毒品，会引起幻觉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "pink tab"
msgid "You eat the pink tablet."
msgstr "你吃了搖頭丸。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgid_plural "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgstr[0] "次級冰毒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgid ""
"A profoundly addictive and powerful stimulant.  While extremely effective at "
"enhancing alertness, it is hazardous to health and the risk of an adverse "
"reaction is great."
msgstr "一個高度成癮性的強力興奮劑。雖然能夠非常有效地提高警覺性， 但是它危害健康和不良反應的風險是更大。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high-grade methamphetamine"
msgid_plural "high-grade methamphetamine"
msgstr[0] "高級冰毒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "high-grade methamphetamine"
msgid ""
"A profoundly addictive and powerful stimulant.  While extremely effective at "
"enhancing alertness, it is hazardous to health and the risk of an adverse "
"reaction is great.  This one could have only been made by a great chemist."
msgstr "一种高度的成瘾性和强大的兴奋剂。而在提高警觉性非常有效，但是对健康和产生不良反应的风险是巨大的。只有一位伟大的化学家才能做出纯度这么高的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "morphine"
msgid_plural "morphine"
msgstr[0] "嗎啡"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "morphine"
msgid ""
"A very strong, naturally-occurring narcotic used to treat intense pain in "
"hospital settings.  You'll need a syringe to inject it, and it's very "
"addictive, so be careful."
msgstr "一種非常強效的天然麻醉劑，用于抑制醫院治療過程中的劇烈疼痛。你需要一個注射器來注射它，這種藥物非常容易上瘾，小心使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wintergreen oil"
msgid_plural "wintergreen oil"
msgstr[0] "冬青油"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "wintergreen oil"
msgid ""
"An ointment infused with wintergreen oil.  Has mild antiseptic properties, "
"and can ease the pain caused by wounds."
msgstr "一份加入了冬青油的软膏。具有微弱的抗菌作用，可以缓解受伤引起的疼痛。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mugwort oil"
msgid_plural "mugwort oil"
msgstr[0] "艾草油"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "mugwort oil"
msgid ""
"Some essential oil made from mugwort, which may kill parasites when ingested. "
" Consume it with water!"
msgstr "由艾草作成的油， 攝取後或許能殺死寄生蟲。配水喝吧！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nicotine gum"
msgid_plural "nicotine gums"
msgstr[0] "尼古丁嚼片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "nicotine gum"
msgid ""
"Mint flavored sugar-free nicotine chewing gum.  For smokers who desire to "
"quit."
msgstr "薄荷口味的無糖尼古丁嚼片。供戒煙中的人使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cough syrup"
msgid_plural "cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "止咳糖漿"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "cough syrup"
msgid ""
"Nighttime cold and flu medication.  Useful when trying to sleep with a head "
"full of virions.  Will cause drowsiness."
msgstr "適合夜晚服用的感冒藥， 治療感冒與流感。會造成嗜睡， 但是能抑制各種症狀讓你好好休息。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antihistamine pill"
msgid_plural "antihistamine pill"
msgstr[0] "抗組織胺藥丸"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antihistamine pill"
msgid ""
"Over-the-counter allergy medication.  These are meant to be taken once a day "
"and can cause drowsiness."
msgstr "非处方抗过敏药，每日一服，会导致嗜睡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "antihistamine pill"
msgid "You take an antihistamine pill."
msgstr "你服用了抗組織胺藥丸。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "oxycodone"
msgid_plural "oxycodone"
msgstr[0] "可待因酮"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "oxycodone"
msgid ""
"A strong semi-synthetic narcotic used in the treatment of intense pain.  "
"Highly addictive."
msgstr "強效半合成麻醉劑， 用於治療持續疼痛， 具有成癮性。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeping pill"
msgid_plural "sleeping pills"
msgstr[0] "安眠藥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeping pill"
msgid ""
"A habit-forming tranquilizer with a variety of psychoactive side effects.  "
"Used in the treatment of insomnia."
msgstr "用于治疗失眠的镇静剂。有成瘾性和各种精神上的副作用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "sleeping pill"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "poppy sleep"
#, c-format
msgid "You take a %s."
msgstr "你服用了 %s。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "sleeping pill"
msgid "Ambien"
msgid_plural "Ambien"
msgstr[0] "唑吡坦"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Ambien" of item "sleeping pill"
msgid "Its generic name is zolpidem tartarate."
msgstr "这是一种安眠药，通用名是酒石酸唑吡坦。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "poppy painkiller"
msgid_plural "poppy painkiller"
msgstr[0] "罌粟止痛藥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "poppy painkiller"
msgid ""
"A potent opioid palliative produced by the refining of the mutated poppy.  "
"Notably devoid of euphoric or sedative effects, but as an opiate it can still "
"be addictive."
msgstr "一些变异的罂粟提炼所产生的缓解剂。值得注意的是它并没有令人愉悦或镇静的作用，但作为阿片制剂它仍然具备成瘾性。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "poppy sleep"
msgid_plural "poppy sleep"
msgstr[0] "罌粟安眠藥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "poppy sleep"
msgid ""
"A potent sleep aid extracted from mutated poppy seeds.  Effective, but as an "
"opiate it can be addictive."
msgstr "由变异的罂粟种子中提取的强力辅助睡眠药物。很有效，但作为阿片制剂它可能会让人上瘾。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "poppy cough syrup"
msgid_plural "poppy cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "罌粟止咳藥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "poppy cough syrup"
msgid "Cough syrup made from mutated poppy.  Will make you sleepy."
msgstr "以突變罌粟製成的止咳藥， 會令你昏昏欲睡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
msgid_plural "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
msgstr[0] "預防性抗毒注射劑"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
msgid ""
"An experimental, cutting-edge antivenom in the form of a small amber vial, "
"designed to be injected a few hours before venom exposure.  It was developed "
"in top secret by the military in response to increasing biological/chemical "
"warfare."
msgstr "一种实验性的尖端抗毒药，装在琥珀色的小型玻璃管内，用于在暴露于毒素下的几小时前注射。军方在不断增加的生化战争威胁下秘密开发了这一药物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "injectable prophylactic
#. antivenom"
msgid ""
"You inject a vial of prophylactic antivenom into your arm.  You feel a bit "
"queasy."
msgstr "你将一支抗毒药注射进你的手臂。你感觉有点反胃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antidepressant"
msgid_plural "antidepressant"
msgstr[0] "抗憂鬱藥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antidepressant"
msgid ""
"A common and popular antidepressant.  It will elevate mood, and can "
"profoundly alter the effects of other drugs.  It is only rarely "
"habit-forming, though adverse reactions are not uncommon."
msgstr "一种广泛使用的广谱抗抑郁药物。可以使心情愉快，并强烈的影响其他药物的效果。只有极低的成瘾性，即使如此，不良反应也是挺普遍的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "antidepressant"
msgid "Prozac"
msgid_plural "Prozac"
msgstr[0] "百忧解"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Prozac" of item "antidepressant"
msgid "Its generic name is fluoxetine."
msgstr "这是一种抗抑郁药，通用名是氟西汀。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Prussian blue tablet"
msgid_plural "Prussian blue tablets"
msgstr[0] "普魯士藍藥片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "Prussian blue tablet"
msgid ""
"A tablet containing oxidized ferrous ferrocyanide salts.  Capable of purging "
"nuclear contaminants from the body if taken after radiation exposure."
msgstr "含有亚铁氰化铁盐的药片。能够清除体内的核辐射污染，接触辐射后服用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "Prussian blue tablet"
msgid "You take some Prussian blue."
msgstr "你服用了一些普魯士藍藥片。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hemostatic powder"
msgid_plural "hemostatic powder"
msgstr[0] "止血粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "hemostatic powder"
msgid ""
"A powdered antihemorrhagic compound that reacts with blood to immediately "
"form a gel-like substance that stops bleeding."
msgstr "粉末狀的抗出血化合物， 能與血液發生反應， 立即形成一種凝膠狀物質迅速止血。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "saline solution"
msgid_plural "saline solution"
msgstr[0] "生理食鹽水"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "saline solution"
msgid ""
"A solution of sterilized water and salt for intravenous infusion or washing "
"contaminants from one's eyes."
msgstr "消毒過的食鹽水， 常用於靜脈注射， 或是洗去眼睛裡的髒東西。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antipsychotic"
msgid_plural "antipsychotic"
msgstr[0] "抗精神病藥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antipsychotic"
msgid ""
"Anti-psychotic medication.  Used to stabilize brain chemistry, it can arrest "
"hallucinations and other symptoms of psychosis.  Carries a sedative effect."
msgstr "抗精神病藥物，用於穩定大腦中的化學物質，它可以解除幻覺等精神病症狀。也有附帶鎮靜劑的作用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "antipsychotic"
msgid "Thorazine"
msgid_plural "Thorazine"
msgstr[0] "冬眠灵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Thorazine" of item "antipsychotic"
msgid "Its generic name is chlorpromazine."
msgstr "这是一种抗精神病药，通用名是氯丙嗪。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thyme oil"
msgid_plural "thyme oil"
msgstr[0] "麝香草精油"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "thyme oil"
msgid ""
"Some essential oil made from thyme, which can act as a mildly irritating "
"antiseptic."
msgstr "從麝香草中提取出來的油， 它可以作為有輕微刺激的消毒劑。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rolling tobacco"
msgid_plural "rolling tobacco"
msgstr[0] "手捲菸草"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "rolling tobacco"
msgid ""
"Loose, fine-cut tobacco leaves.  Popular in Europe and among hipsters.  "
"Highly addictive and hazardous to health.\n"
"Can either be rolled into a cigarette with some rolling papers or smoked "
"through a pipe."
msgstr ""
"鬆散， 切細的菸葉。在歐洲跟嬉皮間很受歡迎。有成癮性且危害健康。\n"
"可以用捲菸紙捲成香菸或者用菸管抽。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "rolling tobacco"
msgid "You smoke some tobacco."
msgstr "你抽了幾口菸。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tramadol"
msgid_plural "tramadol"
msgstr[0] "曲馬多"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "tramadol"
msgid ""
"A painkiller used to manage moderate pain.  The effects last for several "
"hours, but are relatively subdued for an opioid."
msgstr "一種能夠用於治療中度疼痛的止痛藥。效果會持續幾個小時， 但是是相對溫和的鴉片類藥物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "multivitamin"
msgid_plural "multivitamin"
msgstr[0] "綜合維他命"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "multivitamin"
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in pill form.  An option of "
"last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  Excess use can cause "
"hypervitaminosis."
msgstr "包裝成膠囊藥丸形式的必備膳食營養素。無法均衡飲食時的不得已選項。過多食用會導致維他命過多症。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "multivitamin"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "calcium tablet"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "bone meal tablet"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "flavored bone meal tablet"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "vitamin C supplement"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "vitamin C supplement
#. fragment"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "wyld candy"
#, c-format
msgid "You take the %s."
msgstr "你吃了 %s。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "calcium tablet"
msgid_plural "calcium tablets"
msgstr[0] "鈣片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "calcium tablet"
msgid ""
"A white calcium tablet.  Widely used by elderly people with osteoporosis as a "
"method to supplement calcium before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"一种白色的钙片。在大灾变之前广泛用于给骨质疏松的老人补充钙质。\n"
"\"经过全新科技配方研制而成，一片顶五片儿，一口气上五楼不费劲儿。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bone meal tablet"
msgid_plural "bone meal tablets"
msgstr[0] "骨粉片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "bone meal tablet"
msgid ""
"A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Tastes horrible and is "
"hard to swallow but it does its job."
msgstr "一份用骨粉制成的自制钙补充剂。尝起来口感很糟糕，很难下咽，但它起码管点用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flavored bone meal tablet"
msgid_plural "flavored bone meal tablets"
msgstr[0] "調味骨粉片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "flavored bone meal tablet"
msgid ""
"A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Due to some sweeteners "
"mixed in to counteract the powdery texture and the taste of ash, it's almost "
"as palatable as the pre-Cataclysm tablets."
msgstr "一份用骨粉制成的自制钙补充剂。由于添加了甜味剂来抵消原本的粉状口感和骨灰味道，它现在几乎和大灾变前的药片一样可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vitamin C supplement"
msgid_plural "vitamin C supplements"
msgstr[0] "维生素C补充剂"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "vitamin C supplement"
msgid ""
"A small white tablet promising more vitamin C than a human can conceivably "
"absorb."
msgstr "一片小小的白色药片，保证提供比人体能够吸收的更多的维生素C。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vitamin C supplement fragment"
msgid_plural "vitamin C supplement fragments"
msgstr[0] "维生素C片碎块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "vitamin C supplement fragment"
msgid ""
"a small slice of a vitamin C supplement, providing as much vitamin C as a "
"human can conceivably absorb."
msgstr "一小片维生素C补充剂，这里面的维生素C含量已达到人体可吸收的极限。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gummy vitamin"
msgid_plural "gummy vitamin"
msgstr[0] "維他命軟糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "gummy vitamin"
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in a fruit-flavored chewy "
"candy form.  An option of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  "
"Excess use can cause hypervitaminosis."
msgstr "包裝成軟糖形式的必備膳食營養素。無法均衡飲食時的不得已選項。過多食用會導致維他命過多症。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homeopathic pill"
msgid_plural "homeopathic pills"
msgstr[0] "順勢療法藥丸"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "homeopathic pill"
msgid ""
"A homeopathic pill, prepared through the repeated dilution of an active "
"ingredient with water.  The label purports that these pills are able to "
"maintain general wellness."
msgstr "一片順勢療法藥丸，通過用水反複稀釋活性成分制成。標簽上聲稱這些藥片能保持身體健康。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "homeopathic pill"
#, c-format
msgid "You swallow the %s.  You wait in anticipation of its effects."
msgstr "你服用了%s。並等著他發揮功效。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
msgid ""
"An Oscillococcinum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one "
"part duck offal with 10^400 parts water.  The label purports that these pills "
"are able to treat flu-like symptoms and maintain general wellness."
msgstr "一片\"欧斯洛可舒能\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^400份水稀释一份鸭内脏制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗类似流感症状并保持身体健康。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
msgid ""
"An Arsenicum album homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one "
"part arsenic trioxide with 10^24 parts water.  Purported to treat anxiety, "
"various digestive disorders, and arsenic poisoning."
msgstr "一片\"白砷\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^24份水稀释一份三氧化二砷制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗焦虑、各种消化系统疾病和砷中毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
msgid ""
"An Allium cepa homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one part "
"onion with 10^30 parts water.  The label states that these pills can "
"ameliorate symptoms of asthma, gastrointestinal disorders, and bronchitis.  "
"You briefly wonder if it can cure fungal infections."
msgstr ""
"一片\"洋葱\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^30"
"份水稀释一份洋葱制成。标签声称这些药丸可以改善哮喘，胃肠道疾病和支气管炎的症状。你想知道它们是否可以治愈真菌感染。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
msgid ""
"An Arum tryphillum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of the "
"jack-in-the-pulpit plant with 10^30 parts water.  The label claims that the "
"pills are able to treat voice loss."
msgstr "一片\"阿鲁姆泰菲利姆\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^30份水稀释一份黄花菖蒲制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗失音症状。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
msgid ""
"An Aesculus hippocastanum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of "
"horse chestnut with 10^30 parts water.  These pills are meant to treat "
"dysentery and hemorrhoids."
msgstr "一片\"七叶树\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^30份水稀释一份马栗制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗痛经和痔疮。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
msgid ""
"A Lachesis mutus pill, prepared through the dilution of the venom of the "
"bushmaster snake with 10^1000 parts water.  These pills are claimed to be an "
"effective treatment for sore throat."
msgstr "一片\"丛林王\"牌顺势疗法药丸，用10^1000份水稀释一份棕蛇毒液制成。标签声称这些药片能够治疗咽喉肿痛。"

