msgstr "一罐粘稠的粉紅色胃藥糖漿，能緩解胃部不適，平息嘔吐衝動。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "heartburn medicine"
msgid "You take some heartburn medicine."
msgstr "你服用了一些胃藥。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
