msgid_plural "broad-spectrum antibiotics"
msgstr[0] "強效抗生素"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "broad-spectrum antibiotics"
msgid ""
"A broad-spectrum antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the "
"spread of infection.  It contains nearly toxic levels of antibiotics, but can "
"treat any bacterial infections you may encounter.  One dose lasts twelve "
"hours."
msgstr "一種醫生才能開立的廣譜抗生素，用於預防或阻止感染擴散。雖然它具有近似毒素等級的抗生素，但能夠治療你遭受的任何細菌感染。一劑藥效持續十二小時。"

