#. ~ Description of "peanut butter spread"
msgid "Processed peanut butter spread."
msgstr "一份工厂出品的抹面包用的加工花生酱。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acorns"
msgid_plural "acorns"
msgstr[0] "橡實"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Description of "acorns"
msgid ""
"A handful of acorns, still in their shells.  Squirrels like them, but they "
"taste terribly bitter and can upset your stomach."
msgstr "一把橡子，还带着壳。松鼠的挚爱，当然你不是松鼠，味道非常苦，让你感到恶心。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked acorns"
msgid_plural "cooked acorns"
msgstr[0] "熟橡實"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked acorns"
msgid ""
"A serving of acorns that have been hulled, chopped, and boiled in water "
"before being thoroughly toasted until dry.  Filling and nutritious."
msgstr "這份橡實己經去殼、切碎、並且在下水煮熟前被徹底烘烤直到乾燥。份量足夠而且營養豐富。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "roasted acorns"
msgid_plural "roasted acorns"
msgstr[0] "烘烤橡實"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Description of "roasted acorns"
msgid "A handful of roasted nuts from an oak tree."
msgstr "一把橡实，已经烤熟了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blanched acorns"
msgid_plural "blanched acorns"
msgstr[0] "浸泡橡實"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Description of "blanched acorns"
msgid ""
"A handful of mushy blanched acorns.  No longer bitter, but not pleasant to "
"eat in this state."
msgstr "一把浸透了水的糊状橡实。不再苦涩，但在直接这样吃口感可不太好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blanching acorns"
msgid_plural "blanching acorns"
msgstr[0] "泡過的橡實"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Description of "blanching acorns"
msgid ""
"A mix of water and hulled acorns, slowly leaching the tannins.  It'll take "
"about a week before they're palatable."
msgstr "水和去壳橡实的混合物，正在慢慢浸出单宁。约需一周才能令其变得适口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "blanching acorns"
msgid ""
"After a week of changing water and taste-testing, the acorns are no longer "
"bitter and ready to decant."
msgstr "经过一周的换水和口味测试，橡实不再苦涩，可以滗水了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "blanching acorns"
msgid "The acorns are still bitter."
msgstr "橡实依旧苦涩。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegan butter"
msgid_plural "vegan butter"
msgstr[0] "植物黄油"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#. ~ Description of "vegan butter"
msgid ""
"A light brown butter substitute made from nuts.  Differs from other nut "
"butters in that the fats are removed from the meat and only the fats retained."
msgstr "一种浅棕色的坚果制黄油替代品。与其他坚果酱不同，其制作过程中分离了果肉仅保留油脂成分。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "faux gras"
msgid_plural "faux gras"
msgstr[0] "肥肝"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "faux gras"
msgid ""
"Though this meal is technically not foie gras, you have a feeling neither the "
"French nor animal rights groups are likely to criticize it now."
msgstr "雖然這道菜嚴格來說並不是鵝肝，但您可以預感法國人或動物保護團體現在都不會批評你了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "liver & onions"
msgid_plural "liver & onions"
msgstr[0] "生肝炒洋蔥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "liver & onions"
msgid "A classic way to serve liver."
msgstr "傳統的肝臟料理法。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fried liver"
msgid_plural "fried liver"
msgstr[0] "炸生肝"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "fried liver"
msgid "Tasty deep-fried liver, a Southern delicacy."
msgstr "美味油炸肝，南方佳餚。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fried heart"
msgid_plural "fried heart"
msgstr[0] "炸心臟"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "fried heart"
msgid ""
"Tasty deep-fried heart, retaining most of its texture and gaining that "
"delicious fried taste."
msgstr "美味油炸心臟，保留大部分口感並增添了油炸的風味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stuffed heart"
msgid_plural "stuffed heart"
msgstr[0] "包餡心臟"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "stuffed heart"
msgid "Chunks of heart filled with vegetables and spices."
msgstr "心臟中塞滿了蔬菜和香料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "humble pie"
msgid_plural "humble pies"
msgstr[0] "內臟派"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "humble pie"
msgid ""
"Also known as 'Umble' pie, made with chopped organ meats.  Not half bad, and "
"full of vitamins!"
msgstr "也被稱為雜碎派，由切碎的動物內臟製成。沒有聽起來那麼難吃，並且富含維他命！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stewed tripe"
msgid_plural "stewed tripe"
msgstr[0] "燉胃袋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "stewed tripe"
msgid ""
"Stomach lining, cut up and stewed for an hour in broth.  Better than it "
"sounds."
msgstr "胃黏膜，切好後在高湯裡熬一個小時。嚐起來比聽起來好吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deep-fried tripe"
msgid_plural "deep-fried tripe"
msgstr[0] "油炸胃袋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "deep-fried tripe"
msgid ""
"Some people don't enjoy the taste or texture of organ meat, so deep-frying is "
"a great way to disguise both."
msgstr "有些人不喜欢内脏肉的味道或质地，所以油炸是解决这种问题的好方法。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leverpostej"
msgid_plural "leverpostej"
msgstr[0] "北歐肝醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "leverpostej"
msgid "A traditional Danish pate.  Probably better if you spread it on some bread."
msgstr "傳統的丹麥肉醬。把它塗在麵包上可能會更好吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fried brain"
msgid_plural "fried brain"
msgstr[0] "油炸腦"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "fried brain"
msgid "I don't know what you were expecting.  It's brain.  It's deep-fried.  Enjoy!"
msgstr "你可别对它抱太大期望了。这依然是个脑子，只是被油炸了一遍，好好享受吧！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deviled kidney"
msgid_plural "deviled kidney"
msgstr[0] "芥末醬腎臟冷盤"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "deviled kidney"
msgid ""
"A delicious way to prepare kidneys, originating from Victorian England.  You "
"had to make some substitutions in the devilling sauce, but it still came out "
"damn good."
msgstr "一种烹饪肾脏的美味方法，起源于维多利亚时代的英国。虽然你只能用别的调料来替代\"魔鬼酱\"，但最后的味道依然很棒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grilled sweetbread"
msgid_plural "grilled sweetbread"
msgstr[0] "烤胸腺"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "grilled sweetbread"
msgid "Not sweet like the name would suggest, but delicious all the same!"
msgstr "吃起来一点也不甜，但仍然美味。（注：杂碎英文被称为sweetbread）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canned liver"
msgid_plural "canned liver"
msgstr[0] "罐裝肝髒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "canned liver"
msgid "Livers preserved in a can.  Chock-full of B vitamins!"
msgstr "在罐子裏密封保存的肝髒。富含維生素B！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canned heart"
msgid_plural "canned heart"
msgstr[0] "罐装心脏"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "canned heart"
msgid "Chunks of heart preserved in a can."
msgstr "保存在罐子里的心脏。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lung provence"
msgid_plural "lung provence"
msgstr[0] "普羅旺斯香草肺片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "lung provence"
msgid ""
"A French lung dish, made by poaching the lungs before pan-frying them with "
"onion, tomato, seasonings, and a generous amount of wine."
msgstr "一种法式肺脏料理，先将肺煮熟，然后与洋葱、番茄、调味料和大量葡萄酒一起煎。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "töttchen"
msgid_plural "töttchen"
msgstr[0] "明斯特炖杂碎"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "töttchen"
msgid ""
"A German peasant dish that converts many less-desirable meat cuts and organs "
"into a palatable meal with the liberal application of butter, sugar, and wine."
msgstr "德國農家的食物，加入大量奶油、糖、酒來將許多比較不上相的肉和內臟做成可口的佳餚。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrambled eggs and brain"
msgid_plural "scrambled eggs and brain"
msgstr[0] "腦袋炒蛋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "scrambled eggs and brain"
msgid "Brain and eggs, why didn't you ever think to put these together?"
msgstr "脑花加蛋，以前怎么就没想到把它们凑一对儿呢？"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sausage casing"
msgid_plural "sausage casings"
msgstr[0] "香腸腸衣"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "sausage casing"
msgid ""
"Sausage casings made from animal intestines.  Ready to be used for forming "
"meat products."
msgstr "由動物腸製成的香腸腸衣。 準備用於加工肉製品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "artificial sausage casing"
msgid_plural "artificial sausage casings"
msgstr[0] "人造腸衣"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "artificial sausage casing"
msgid ""
"Sausage casings made from plastic bags.  Ready to be used for forming meat "
"products."
msgstr "用塑膠袋做成的腸衣，準備用於加工肉製品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade hot dog"
msgid_plural "homemade hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "自製熱狗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried bottle gourd"
msgid_plural "dried bottle gourds"
msgstr[0] "干葫芦"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "dried bottle gourd"
msgid ""
"A vegetable from the gourd family, bottle gourds were brought to the Americas "
"by the first Native American settlers crossing the Bering strait.  This one "
"has been dried for processing into a watertight container."
msgstr "一种葫芦科的蔬菜，由第一批穿越白令海峡的美洲土著定居者带到美洲。这个葫芦已经烘干，准备加工成一个水密容器。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chewing gum"
msgid_plural "chewing gums"
msgstr[0] "口香糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "chewing gum"
msgid "Sugar-free chewing gum."
msgstr "無糖口香糖。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, peppermint"
msgid_plural "gum, peppermint"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（胡椒薄荷）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, peppermint" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"The classic of classics, a flavor that provides a fresh and invigorating "
"sensation in the mouth, as well as freshening breath."
msgstr "經典中的經典，可以振奮精神，清新口氣。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, spearmint"
msgid_plural "gum, spearmint"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（留兰香）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, spearmint" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"Spearmint is a slightly sweeter and milder version of peppermint, providing a "
"fresher taste and is also good for freshening breath."
msgstr "相比於薄荷，綠薄荷更為溫和，且帶有一絲甜味，同樣能清新口氣。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, wintergreen"
msgid_plural "gum, wintergreen"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（冬青）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, wintergreen" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"Wintergreen has a cool and refreshing taste, similar to mint, but with a "
"slightly sweeter flavor."
msgstr "冬青有一種類似于薄荷的冰涼清爽的味道，但味道略甜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, bubblegum"
msgid_plural "gum, bubblegum"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（泡泡糖）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, bubblegum" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"Bubblegum is a nostalgic flavor that's reminiscent of the classic pink "
"bubblegum flavor that kids love.  It's basically a combination of various "
"flavors."
msgstr "泡泡糖是一種懷舊的味道，讓人想起孩子們喜歡的經典粉紅色泡泡糖的味道。它基本上是各種口味的結合。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, strawberry"
msgid_plural "gum, strawberry"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（草莓）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, strawberry" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This strawberry-flavored chewing gum offers a sweet and juicy taste, "
"reminiscent of fresh strawberries."
msgstr "這款草莓口香糖口感甜美，讓人想起新鮮的草莓。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, cherry"
msgid_plural "gum, cherry"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（樱桃）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, cherry" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This cherry-flavored chewing gum is both sweet and tart, with a delicious "
"fruity flavor."
msgstr "這款櫻桃口香糖酸甜可口，猶如美味的水果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, orange"
msgid_plural "gum, orange"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（橙子）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, orange" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This orange-flavored chewing gum provides a fresh and fruity taste, like "
"biting into a juicy orange."
msgstr "这款柳橙口香糖味道清新，吃下去后仿佛咬了一口多汁的柳橙。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, watermelon"
msgid_plural "gum, watermelon"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（西瓜）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, watermelon" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This watermelon-flavored chewing gum has a sweet and fruity flavor, perfect "
"for summertime."
msgstr "這款西瓜味口香糖味道清甜，很適合夏天食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, blueberry"
msgid_plural "gum, blueberry"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（蓝莓）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, blueberry" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This blueberry-flavored chewing gum has a fruity, tangy flavor with a "
"slightly sweet taste."
msgstr "這款藍莓口香糖果味濃烈，但並不十分甜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, pineapple"
msgid_plural "gum, pineapple"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（菠萝）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, pineapple" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This pineapple-flavored chewing gum has a sweet and tangy taste, perfect for "
"those looking for a tropical twist."
msgstr "這款鳳梨口香糖味道甜美，很適合那些熱衷熱帶風味的人。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, green apple"
msgid_plural "gum, green apple"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（青苹果）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, green apple" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This green apple-flavored gum is crisp and refreshing, with a slightly sour "
"and sweet taste, more sour and sweet than the regular apple-flavored one."
msgstr "這款青蘋果口香糖味道酸甜清爽，比一般的蘋果口香糖要更加酸甜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, mango"
msgid_plural "gum, mango"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（芒果）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, mango" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This uncommon mango-flavored chewing gum has a sweet, tropical taste, "
"reminiscent of fresh mangos."
msgstr "這款不太常見的芒果口香糖帶有熱帶水果特有的甜味，讓人想起新鮮芒果的味道。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, lemonade"
msgid_plural "gum, lemonade"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（柠檬水）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, lemonade" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This lemonade-flavored chewing gum provides a zesty and citrusy burst of "
"flavor."
msgstr "這款檸檬口香糖有著一股活潑而刺激的檸檬味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, pomegranate"
msgid_plural "gum, pomegranate"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（石榴）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, pomegranate" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This pomegranate-flavored chewing gum has a blend of tart and sweet taste for "
"a unique, fruity flavor."
msgstr "這款石榴味口香糖有著石榴獨特的味道，酸酸甜甜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, raspberry"
msgid_plural "gum, raspberry"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（木莓）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, raspberry" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This raspberry-flavored chewing gum has a fruity and tart taste with a "
"slightly sweet finish, offering a tangy and refreshing pop of flavor."
msgstr "這款覆盆子口香糖有著濃烈的酸味，而其後的回甘則帶來了些許清爽。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, kiwi"
msgid_plural "gum, kiwi"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（猕猴桃）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, kiwi" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This kiwi-flavored chewing gum provides a sweet and tangy taste, reminiscent "
"of fresh kiwis."
msgstr "這款奇異果口香糖味道甜美，讓人想起新鮮的奇異果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, peach"
msgid_plural "gum, peach"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（桃子）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, peach" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This peach-flavored chewing gum offers a sweet, slightly tangy, and earthy "
"taste, reminiscent of fresh peaches."
msgstr "這款蜜桃口香糖甜味稍重，有著泥土的芳香，就像是新鮮的蜜桃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "chewing gum"
msgid "gum, blackberry"
msgid_plural "gum, blackberry"
msgstr[0] "口香糖（黑莓）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of variant "gum, blackberry" of item "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"This blackberry-flavored gum has a sweet taste, combined with a subtle "
"tartness, offering a fruity and refreshing flavor."
msgstr "這款黑莓味口香糖酸中帶甜，有著清爽的水果味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "slime glob"
msgid_plural "slime globs"
msgstr[0] "黏液球"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "slime glob"
msgid ""
"A little hunk of glop that fell off a slime monster.  It doesn't seem "
"hostile, but it does wiggle occasionally."
msgstr "一小块从变形怪身上掉下的糊状物，似乎已经没有了敌意，但偶尔会蠕动几下。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "honey comb"
msgid_plural "honey combs"
msgstr[0] "蜂巢"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "honey comb"
msgid "A large chunk of wax filled with honey.  Very tasty."
msgstr "一大塊沾滿蜂蜜的蜂蠟。非常美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of beeswax"
msgid_plural "chunks of beeswax"
msgstr[0] "蜂蜡块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of beeswax"
msgid ""
"A large chunk of beeswax.  Despite being used in some cooking recipes, "
"beeswax in itself is indigestible to humans."
msgstr "一大块蜂蜡。尽管会在一些食谱中使用，但蜂蜡本身对人类而言是难以消化的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "royal jelly"
msgid_plural "royal jelly"
msgstr[0] "蜂王漿"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "royal jelly"
msgid ""
"A translucent hexagonal chunk of wax, filled with dense, milky, bitter and "
"acidic-tasting jelly.  Though some hold it as a panacea, it doesn't have any "
"medical benefit.  Still it is rich with the most beneficial substances the "
"hive can produce."
msgstr "半透明的六角形蠟塊，充滿緻密像牛奶般嘗起來苦澀和酸性的果凍。 儘管有人認為它是萬能藥，但它並沒有任何醫療效果。 它仍然富含蜂巢能產生的各種有益營養。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "honeydew"
msgid_plural "honeydew"
msgstr[0] "蜜露"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "honeydew"
msgid ""
"A sugar-rich sticky substance, produced by aphids from plant sap.  Ants and "
"bees love it."
msgstr "一种富含糖的粘性物质，由吸取植物汁液的蚜虫产生。蚂蚁和蜜蜂都喜欢它。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Marloss berry"
msgid_plural "Marloss berries"
msgstr[0] "馬洛斯莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "Marloss berry"
msgid ""
"This looks like a blueberry the size of your fist, but pinkish in color.  It "
"has a strong but delicious aroma, but is clearly either mutated or of alien "
"origin."
msgstr "看起來像是拳頭大的藍莓， 只是顏色是粉紅色。有很強烈的香氣， 很明顯是外星的突變品種。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Marloss gelatin"
msgid_plural "Marloss gelatin"
msgstr[0] "馬洛斯凝膠"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "Marloss gelatin"
msgid ""
"This looks like a handful of lemon-colored liquid which has taken a set, much "
"like pre-Cataclysm Jello.  It has a strong but delicious aroma, but is "
"clearly either mutated or of alien origin."
msgstr "这看起来就像凝固住的柠檬色液体，活像末日前的果冻。香气浓郁，芬芳扑鼻，但显然经过了变异，或许是外星产物也说不准。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mycus fruit"
msgid_plural "Mycus fruits"
msgstr[0] "馬洛斯果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "Mycus fruit"
msgid ""
"Humans might call this a Gray Delicious apple: large, gray, and smells even "
"better than the Marloss.  If they didn't reject it for its alien origins.  "
"But we know better."
msgstr "人們也許會稱它為美味灰蘋果: 大、灰、聞起來甚至比馬洛斯果更好。如果他們不因為它是外星物種而拒絕食用的話，我們會更好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "yeast"
msgid_plural "yeast"
msgstr[0] "酵母"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "yeast"
msgid "A powder-like mix of cultured yeast, good for baking and brewing alike."
msgstr "粉狀的混合培養酵母， 適合用來烘焙和釀造。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "yogurt starter culture"
msgid_plural "yogurt starter culture"
msgstr[0] "酸奶发酵剂"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "yogurt starter culture"
msgid "A powder-like mix of cultured yogurt bacteria, good for fermenting yogurt."
msgstr "一种由用于发酵酸奶的细菌混合而成的粉末状混合物，用于发酵酸奶。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "koji"
msgid_plural "koji"
msgstr[0] "清酒酒麴"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "koji"
msgid ""
"Some ground rice covered with a special kind of mold used for "
"saccharification and fermentation in Japanese cuisine."
msgstr "一些表面覆盖着一种特殊的霉菌的碎米，在日本料理中用于糖化和发酵。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "powdered gelatin"
msgid_plural "powdered gelatin"
msgstr[0] "明膠粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "powdered gelatin"
msgid "Dried and powdered gelatin, used as a gelling agent when mixed with water."
msgstr "經過烘乾的粉狀明膠，可以用來與水混合成為凝膠。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fresh gelatin"
msgid_plural "fresh gelatin"
msgstr[0] "新鮮明膠"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "fresh gelatin"
msgid "Fresh gelatin.  Not vegan-friendly!"
msgstr "新鮮的明膠。素食主義者禁止食用！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chitin powder"
msgid_plural "chitin powder"
msgstr[0] "甲殼粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "chitin powder"
msgid "This chitin powder can be used to craft fertilizer and some other things."
msgstr "這些甲殼粉可用來製作肥料或者其他東西。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "napkin"
msgid_plural "napkins"
msgstr[0] "餐巾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "napkin"
msgid "A napkin.  Can be used for fires."
msgstr "一張餐巾。能夠拿來燒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "piece of cardboard"
msgid_plural "pieces of cardboard"
msgstr[0] "硬纸板"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "piece of cardboard"
msgid "A piece of cardboard."
msgstr "一塊紙版。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canned beans"
msgid_plural "canned beans"
msgstr[0] "罐裝豆子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "canned beans"
msgid ""
"Canned beans.  A staple among canned goods, these are reputedly good for "
"one's coronary health."
msgstr "罐裝豆子。罐頭食品中的主食， 據說對於人體冠狀動脈的健康很好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried beans"
msgid_plural "dried beans"
msgstr[0] "乾豆子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "dried beans"
msgid ""
"Dehydrated great northern beans.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually "
"inedible when dry."
msgstr "脫水過的大北豆。當煮熟時美味又營養， 但如果是乾燥的則幾乎不能食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked beans"
msgid_plural "cooked beans"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的豆子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked beans"
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked great northern beans."
msgstr "一份豐盛的燉大北豆。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tofu"
msgid_plural "tofu"
msgstr[0] "豆腐"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "tofu"
#. ~ Description of "fried tofu"
msgid ""
"Tofu, a soy protein crucial to East Asian cuisine.  It absorbs flavors very "
"well and can be used as a meat alternative in many dishes."
msgstr "豆腐，一種對東亞美食至關重要的大豆蛋白。它非常容易吸收香味，並且可以作為許多菜餚的肉類替代品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fried tofu"
msgid_plural "fried tofu"
msgstr[0] "炸豆腐"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dehydrated tofu"
msgid_plural "dehydrated tofu"
msgstr[0] "脫水豆腐"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "dehydrated tofu"
msgid "Dehydrated tofu, sealed and still extra firm to last a long time."
msgstr "脫水豆腐，密封，可以長期保存。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw soybeans"
msgid_plural "raw soybeans"
msgstr[0] "生大豆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "raw soybeans"
msgid ""
"Beige colored beans.  They have many uses, but in their raw form are fairly "
"poisonous to humans."
msgstr "米黄色的豆子。它们有很多用途，但生吃对人类来说有剧毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried soybeans"
msgid_plural "dried soybeans"
msgstr[0] "干大豆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "dried soybeans"
msgid ""
"Beige colored beans, dried until rock hard.  They'll need to be cooked or "
"processed before use."
msgstr "干燥的米黄色的豆子，坚如磐石。它们在使用前需要经过烹饪或加工。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw edamame"
msgid_plural "raw edamame"
msgstr[0] "生毛豆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "raw edamame"
msgid ""
"Raw soybeans still in their pod.  They can be cooked as-is or shelled for "
"further processing, but in their raw form, they're toxic to humans."
msgstr "未去荚的豆子。它们可以直接烹饪，或者去壳进行进一步加工，但生吃对人类来说有毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blood rice pudding"
msgid_plural "blood rice pudding"
msgstr[0] "米血糕"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "blood rice pudding"
msgid ""
"Blood rice pudding is a pastry made from blood and rice grains.  Best with "
"chopped peanuts, but also good to eat with various seasonings."
msgstr "米血糕是由血和米粒製成的糕點。加上碎花生就是絕配，不過加上其它調味料也很好吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Foodplace's delicious food™"
msgid_plural "Foodplace's delicious food™"
msgstr[0] "美食中心美食™"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "Foodplace's delicious food™"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The best-seller from Foodplace, delicious food™, is made with real foodstuff "
"and is guaranteed 100% edible!"
msgstr "美食中心的暢銷品——美食™，是由真正的食物製成並且保證 100% 可食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Foodplace's appropriate snack™"
msgid_plural "Foodplace's appropriate snack™"
msgstr[0] "美食中心隨口小吃™"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "Foodplace's appropriate snack™"
msgid "Real foodstuff now in a pocket size format!"
msgstr "真正的美食，可以放在口袋裡的！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked lentils"
msgid_plural "cooked lentils"
msgstr[0] "熟扁豆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked lentils"
msgid "Wet, cooked lentils.  Humble and nutrient-rich, but pretty bland."
msgstr "水煮熟的扁豆。简单且营养丰富，但味道寡淡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "coffee powder"
msgid_plural "coffee powder"
msgstr[0] "咖啡粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "coffee powder"
msgid ""
"Ground coffee beans.  You can boil it into a mediocre stimulant, or something "
"better if you had an atomic coffee pot."
msgstr "磨碎的咖啡豆。如果你有一個原子咖啡壺， 可以把它煮成差強人意的興奮劑… 或某種更好的東西。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Kentucky coffee grounds"
msgid_plural "Kentucky coffee grounds"
msgstr[0] "肯塔基州咖啡渣"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "Kentucky coffee grounds"
msgid ""
"Coffee grounds created through washing, cleaning, and roasting the pods from "
