msgstr[0] "蛋白奶昔"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Description of "protein shake"
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty beverage made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit."
msgstr "由濃厚的蛋白質糊與營養水果做成的風味飲料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "protein shake" when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
msgid "soylent green shake"
msgid_plural "soylent green shake"
msgstr[0] "蛋白果汁（人肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "protein shake" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
msgid "sapient green shake"
msgid_plural "sapient green shake"
msgstr[0] "蛋白果汁（亞人肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fortified protein shake"
msgid_plural "fortified protein shake"
msgstr[0] "強化蛋白奶昔"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Description of "fortified protein shake"
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty beverage made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit.  It has been supplemented with extra vitamins and minerals."
msgstr "由蛋白质粉和水果混合而成的营养丰富的美味饮料，口感醇厚。特别添加人体所需的维生素和矿物质，均衡膳食营养。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "fortified protein shake" when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
msgid "fortified soylent green shake"
msgid_plural "fortified soylent green shake"
msgstr[0] "增強型蛋白奶昔（人肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "fortified protein shake" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
msgid "fortified sapient green shake"
msgid_plural "fortified sapient green shake"
msgstr[0] "增強型蛋白奶昔（亞人肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fortified milk"
msgid_plural "fortified milk"
msgstr[0] "蛋白奶"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Description of "fortified milk"
msgid ""
"Milk enriched with protein powder, it's extra healthy and doesn't taste too "
"bad."
msgstr "添加了蛋白粉的牛奶，特别健康，味道也不太差。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "fortified milk" when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
msgid "soylent milk"
msgid_plural "soylent milk"
msgstr[0] "蛋白奶（人肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "fortified milk" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
msgid "sapient-enhanced milk"
msgid_plural "sapient-enhanced milk"
msgstr[0] "蛋白奶（亞人肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "fortified milk" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. mutant
#, c-format
msgid "freaky %s"
msgid_plural "freaky %s"
msgstr[0] "%s（變異肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "protein smoothie"
msgid_plural "protein smoothie"
msgstr[0] "蛋白水果奶昔"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Description of "protein smoothie"
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty smoothie made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit mixed into milk."
msgstr "一份浓稠可口的奶昔，由提纯蛋白粉和营养丰富的水果混合在牛奶中制成。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "protein smoothie" when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
msgid "soylent smoothie"
msgid_plural "soylent smoothie"
msgstr[0] "蛋白水果奶昔（人肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "protein smoothie" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
msgid "sapient green smoothie"
msgid_plural "sapient green smoothie"
msgstr[0] "蛋白水果奶昔（亞人肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "apple"
msgid_plural "apples"
msgstr[0] "蘋果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "apple"
msgid ""
"An iconic and delicious fruit grown and enjoyed across the world, used for "
"generations in folk medicine as doctor repellant."
msgstr ""
"一种\"标志性\"的美味水果，在世界各地都有种植和食用，世世代代在民间医学中用作医生驱避剂。\n"
"\"一天一苹果，医生远离我。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crabapple"
msgid_plural "crabapples"
msgstr[0] "野苹果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "crabapple"
msgid ""
"A term used to describe both wild apples native to North America as well as "
"less appetizing feral varieties, these are rather small and far too sour."
msgstr "北美本土的野生苹果属植物果实，或者苹果的味道不佳的野化品种。这些野苹果很小，而且太酸了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "banana"
msgid_plural "bananas"
msgstr[0] "香蕉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "banana"
msgid ""
"A long, curved yellow fruit in a peel.  Some people like using them in "
"desserts.  Those people are probably dead."
msgstr "一根長而彎曲的黃色水果。有些人喜歡用這東西來做甜點。這些人大概已經死了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "orange"
msgid ""
"A sweet citrus fruit.  Also comes in juice form.  In case you were wondering, "
"the color is named after the fruit, not the other way around."
msgstr "一种甜柑橘类水果。可以榨成果汁。以免你真的会好奇为什么橙子是橙色：\"橙\"色是从水果得来的，而不是反过来。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lemon"
msgid_plural "lemons"
msgstr[0] "檸檬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "lemon"
msgid ""
"A very sour citrus fruit.  Can be eaten if you're desperate, but you should "
"probably look for some other cooking application for this."
msgstr "一种非常酸的柑橘类水果。如果你真的很想直接吃，也不是不行，但你或许应该为它寻找一些别的料理用途。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of blueberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of blueberries"
msgstr[0] "藍莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of blueberries"
msgid ""
"A handful of tasty sweet-tart berries.  They're blue, but that doesn't mean "
"they're sad."
msgstr "一把美味的酸甜浆果。它们是蓝色的，但这并不意味着它们很伤心（blue）。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of hobbleberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of hobbleberries"
msgstr[0] "绊步莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of hobbleberries"
msgid ""
"Some black hobbleberries.  They are quite sweet.  Before they ripened, they "
"were deceptively red and utterly bitter."
msgstr "一些黑色的绊步莓，味道非常甜美。在成熟之前，它们呈欺骗性的红色，且极为苦涩。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of autumn olives"
msgid_plural "handfuls of autumn olives"
msgstr[0] "秋橄榄"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of autumn olives"
msgid ""
"Not tasting anything like olives, this sweet, red and very nutritious fruit "
"can also be used as a tomato-substitute in some cases."
msgstr "这种红色，甜美且富有营养的水果，吃起来完全不像橄榄，有时候也可以作为番茄的替代品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of strawberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of strawberries"
msgstr[0] "草莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of strawberries"
msgid ""
"A handful of tasty, juicy red berries with visible seeds on the outside of "
"the skin.  Often found growing wild in fields."
msgstr "一把美味多汁的红色浆果，果皮外面有可见的种子。经常可以在田野中找到野生的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of cranberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of cranberries"
msgstr[0] "蔓越莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of cranberries"
msgid ""
"A handful of very bitter red berries, probably grown locally in "
"Massachusetts.  Good for urinary tract health."
msgstr "一把红色的酸浆果，主要在马萨诸塞州当地生长。有益于泌尿道健康。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of raspberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of raspberries"
msgstr[0] "覆盆子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of raspberries"
msgid "A handful of sweet red berries, each with a hollow core."
msgstr "一把红色甜浆果，每颗都有一个空的果核。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of huckleberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of huckleberries"
msgstr[0] "越橘莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of huckleberries"
msgid "A handful of huckleberries, often times confused for blueberries."
msgstr "一把美洲越橘，经常会和蓝莓混淆。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "starry false Solomon's seal berries"
msgid_plural "starry false Solomon's seal berries"
msgstr[0] "舞鶴草漿果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "starry false Solomon's seal berries"
msgid ""
"A bunch of deep red berries with a pleasant bittersweet flavor.  Can have a "
"laxative effect if eaten in large quantities."
msgstr "一把深红色的浆果，有股令人愉悦的甘苦回甜的味道。大量食用可以通便。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mayapple"
msgid_plural "mayapples"
msgstr[0] "鬼臼果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "mayapple"
msgid ""
"A small, edible fruit of an otherwise toxic plant.  You should not eat too "
"many of them."
msgstr "一种小型可食用的浆果，来自有毒植物。你不应该吃太多。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wintergreen berries"
msgid_plural "wintergreen berries"
msgstr[0] "冬青莓果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "wintergreen berries"
msgid "A handful of sweet, brilliant red berries of the wintergreen shrub."
msgstr "一把冬青灌木所结出的芬芳而鲜艳的红色浆果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of mulberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of mulberries"
msgstr[0] "桑葚"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of mulberries"
msgid ""
"This red variety of mulberries is unique to eastern North America, and is "
"said to have the strongest flavor of any variety in the world."
msgstr "一把北美桑椹，这种红色品种是北美东部所独有的，据说是世界上所有品种中风味最浓的一个品种。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of elderberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of elderberries"
msgstr[0] "接骨木果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of elderberries"
msgid "A handful of elderberries, toxic when eaten raw but great when cooked."
msgstr "一把接骨木果，生吃有毒，但煮熟后很美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of nannyberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of nannyberries"
msgstr[0] "保姆莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of nannyberries"
msgid "Some dark blue nannyberries, tasting like prunes mixed with banana."
msgstr "一把深蓝色的保姆莓，尝起来就像是香蕉和梅干的混合味道"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of tupelo fruits"
msgid_plural "handfuls of tupelo fruits"
msgstr[0] "多花蓝果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of tupelo fruits"
msgid ""
"Some dark blue tupelo fruits.  They are tart and feature a hard seed but are "
"still enjoyable."
msgstr "一把深蓝色的多花蓝果，它们味道酸涩，有坚硬的种子，但仍然很好吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of chokeberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of chokeberries"
msgstr[0] "野樱莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of chokeberries"
msgid ""
"A handful of black chokeberries.  They look similar to blackcurrant.  Big and "
"juicy but actually exceedingly sour."
msgstr "一把紫樱莓，它们看起来类似于黑醋栗。果实大而多汁，但实际上非常酸。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of rose hips"
msgid_plural "handfuls of rose hips"
msgstr[0] "薔薇果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of rose hips"
msgid ""
"A handful of fruits grown from pollinated rose flowers.  Full of irritating "
"hairs and hard seeds, they'll need to be disassembled before eating."
msgstr "一些授粉成功的玫瑰花长成的果实。里面充满了扎人的毛刺和坚硬的种子，食用前需要先拆解。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut rose hips"
msgid_plural "cut rose hips"
msgstr[0] "玫瑰果块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "cut rose hips"
msgid ""
"Tart little fruits grown from a rose bush, now separated from their inedible "
"seeds and spines."
msgstr "玫瑰丛里长出的酸味小果实，已经去掉了不可食用的种子和毛刺。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "juice pulp"
msgid_plural "juice pulp"
msgstr[0] "果渣"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "juice pulp"
msgid ""
"A handful of stringy pulp, left-over from juicing some kind of fruit.  It's "
"not very tasty, but contains a lot of healthy fiber."
msgstr "一把粘稠的果肉，某种水果榨汁后剩下的。不太好吃，但富含膳食纤维。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pear"
msgid_plural "pears"
msgstr[0] "梨子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "pear"
msgid "A juicy, bell-shaped pear.  Yum!"
msgstr "多汁，鐘形的梨子。好吃！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "guava"
msgid_plural "guavas"
msgstr[0] "芭樂"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "guava"
msgid ""
"A sweet, sandy-textured fruit with pink flesh native to the Caribbean, "
"Central America, and South America.  Great for making milkshakes."
msgstr "一种甜美的沙质水果，果肉呈粉红色，原产于加勒比海、中美洲和南美洲。非常适合制作奶昔。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of passionfruit"
msgid_plural "handfuls of passionfruit"
msgstr[0] "百香果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of passionfruit"
msgid ""
"A sweet, acidic fruit originating from South America.  It grows on vines and "
"is filled with seeds like a pomegranate.  Also known as the maracuya."
msgstr "一种味道酸甜的水果，原产于南美洲，生长在藤蔓上，果实内长满了种子，像石榴一样。也被称为马拉库亚。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lulo"
msgid_plural "lulos"
msgstr[0] "奎東茄"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "lulo"
msgid ""
"An acidic fruit found in South America and the Caribbean, it looks like a "
"hairy orange and is used mainly for juice and desserts.  Also known as the "
"naranjilla."
msgstr "一种产于南美洲和加勒比海的酸性水果，看起来像多毛的橘子，主要用于果汁和甜点。也被称为纳兰吉拉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grapefruit"
msgid_plural "grapefruits"
msgstr[0] "葡萄柚"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "grapefruit"
msgid ""
"A hybrid citrus fruit descended from the orange, whose taste ranges from sour "
"to semi-sweet, and a little bitter."
msgstr "一种由橙子杂交而来的柑橘类水果，有酸味又有一点甜味，还略带苦味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of cherries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of cherries"
msgstr[0] "櫻桃"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of cherries"
msgid ""
"A sweet red fruit that grows on trees.  If you have some time on your hands, "
"maybe you could figure out how to do that trick where you tie a knot in the "
"stem with your tongue."
msgstr "一种长在树上的甜红色果实。如果你手头有一些时间，也许可以练习一下那个用舌头给樱桃梗打结的技巧。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plum"
msgid_plural "plums"
msgstr[0] "李子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "plum"
msgid "A large purple plum.  Tasty and good for your digestion."
msgstr "一把紫色的大李子，饱满圆润，玲珑剔透，形态美艳，口味甘甜，美味又有助于消化。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of grapes"
msgid_plural "handfuls of grapes"
msgstr[0] "葡萄"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of grapes"
msgid ""
"A handful of juicy grapes.  Quite calorie-dense compared to most fruit, and "
"you might be able to make them into wine if you're ambitious enough."
msgstr "一串多汁的葡萄，与大多数水果相比，它的热量相当高。如果你有雄心壮志——以及耐心，还可以把它们酿成酒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pineapple"
msgid_plural "pineapples"
msgstr[0] "鳳梨罐頭"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "pineapple"
msgid ""
"A large, spiky tropical fruit.  A tough rind protects the tasty flesh inside, "
"and digging into it as-is would be pretty inefficient and messy.  You should "
"find a knife or something vaguely knife-like to cut it up with."
msgstr "大而尖的热带水果。坚硬的外皮可以保护里面美味的果肉。想完整去掉果皮可是个技术活。当然也可以用\"迪拜刀法\"，前提是你有刀。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of pineapple chunks"
msgid_plural "handfuls of pineapple chunks"
msgstr[0] "鳳梨片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of pineapple chunks"
msgid ""
"A handful of pineapple chunks.  Delicious and a great source of Vitamin C, "
"though a bit sour."
msgstr "一捧菠萝果肉，十分美味，而且富含维生素C，就是有点酸。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "coconut"
msgid_plural "coconuts"
msgstr[0] "椰子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "coconut"
msgid ""
"A tropical fruit with a hard, hairy shell and a hollow inside full of liquid "
"and edible flesh.  If you want to eat it, you'll have to find something heavy "
"to crack open the shell and something sharp to remove the 'meat'."
msgstr ""
"一种热带水果，外壳坚硬而多毛，保护着里面装着的汁水与果肉。想吃的话，要先找个钝器把壳砸开，再找个锐器把果肉刮下来。\n"
"\"从小喝到大\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of coconut flesh"
msgid_plural "handfuls of coconut flesh"
msgstr[0] "椰肉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of coconut flesh"
msgid "A handful of coconut flesh.  It's surprisingly calorie-dense."
msgstr "椰子的果肉，卡路里含量惊人。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peach"
msgid_plural "peaches"
msgstr[0] "桃子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "peach"
msgid "This fruit's large pit is surrounded by its tasty flesh."
msgstr "這水果的果核被許多美味的果肉包裹著。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "watermelon"
msgid_plural "watermelons"
msgstr[0] "西瓜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "watermelon"
msgid ""
"A deep green melon, bigger than your head.  It is very juicy!  You should be "
"able to take it apart with a knife."
msgstr "一个深绿色的比你的头还大的多汁甜瓜！你应该能够用刀把它切开。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "watermelon wedge"
msgid_plural "watermelon wedges"
msgstr[0] "西瓜片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "watermelon wedge"
msgid "A yummy wedge of watermelon.  A handheld snack that tastes like summer."
msgstr "一片美味的西瓜。一种有夏日味道的手持式小吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cantaloupe melon"
msgid_plural "cantaloupe melons"
msgstr[0] "哈密瓜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "cantaloupe melon"
msgid ""
"A large and very sweet orange fruit.  Technically a berry, like all melons "
"are.  You should be able to take it apart with a knife."
msgstr "一种大而甜的橙色水果。严格地说是一种浆果，就像所有的甜瓜一样。你应该能够用刀把它切开。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of cantaloupe melon chunks"
msgid_plural "handfuls of cantaloupe melon chunks"
msgstr[0] "哈密瓜塊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of cantaloupe melon chunks"
msgid ""
"A handful of cantaloupe melon chunks.  A great snack by itself or in a fruit "
"salad."
msgstr "一把哈密瓜块。可以直接吃，也可以用于制作水果沙拉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of blackberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of blackberries"
msgstr[0] "黑莓"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of blackberries"
msgid ""
"A darker cousin of the raspberry.  The color isn't actually what sets them "
"apart - the identifying characteristic is whether the stem stays connected to "
"the fruit when it's first picked."
msgstr "树莓的深色近亲。颜色并不是区分它们的关键——重点特征是首次采摘时，果梗是否与果实相连。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mango"
msgid_plural "mangos"
msgstr[0] "芒果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "mango"
msgid ""
"A fleshy tropical fruit with a large pit.  Better enjoy it soon, you're "
"pretty sure more of these aren't going to be imported for a long time."
msgstr "多肉的热带水果，带有一个大果核。最好赶快吃掉，你十分确定，在很长一段时间内，再也不会有人进口这种东西了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pomegranate"
msgid_plural "pomegranates"
msgstr[0] "石榴"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "pomegranate"
msgid "Under this pomegranate's spongy skin lie hundreds of fleshy seeds."
msgstr "一个石榴，海绵一样的果皮下面有着数以百计被果肉包裹的种子，甘甜可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "papaya"
msgid_plural "papayas"
msgstr[0] "木瓜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "papaya"
msgid "A very sweet and soft tropical fruit."
msgstr "一個很甜， 果肉又柔軟的熱帶水果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kiwi"
msgid_plural "kiwis"
msgstr[0] "奇異果"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "kiwi"
msgid "A large, brown, and fuzzy-skinned berry.  Its delicious insides are green."
msgstr "一个大大的，有着棕色毛绒外皮的水果，绿色的果肉有着奇异的味道。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of apricots"
msgid_plural "handfuls of apricots"
msgstr[0] "杏子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of apricots"
msgid "A handful of smooth-skinned fruits related to the peach."
msgstr "一把杏子，表皮很光滑，有着味甜多汁的暗黄色果肉，是桃子的近亲。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cholla bud"
msgid_plural "cholla buds"
msgstr[0] "仙人掌花蕾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "cholla bud"
msgid ""
"The edible bud of a cholla cactus, with its spines removed; the candy of the "
"Mojave indigenous peoples.  Tastes similar to asparagus."
msgstr "可食用的仙人掌花蕾，刺已经去掉了，是莫哈维沙漠土著的最爱。尝起来有点像芦笋。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of nopales"
msgid_plural "handfuls of nopales"
msgstr[0] "仙人掌莖片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of nopales"
msgid "A handful of edible pads from a cactus."
msgstr "一种仙人掌的肉质茎，可以作为蔬菜食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "corn cob"
msgid_plural "corn cobs"
msgstr[0] "玉米"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "corn cob"
msgid ""
"A corn cob full of delicious golden kernels.  You can eat them on the cob or "
"shell it for cooking."
msgstr "一个装满美味的金色果仁的玉米棒子。你可以直接抓住棒子吃，也可以把它剥下来煮。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "corn kernels"
msgid_plural "corn kernels"
msgstr[0] "玉米粒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "corn kernels"
msgid "Delicious golden kernels of corn."
msgstr "美味的金黄色玉米粒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "empty corn cob"
msgid_plural "empty corn cobs"
msgstr[0] "玉米芯"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "empty corn cob"
msgid ""
"An empty corn cob.  No longer contains any edible kernels, but it can be used "
"to make stock or as fuel."
msgstr "一个脱粒的玉米芯。不再包含任何可食用的玉米粒，但可以用来制作物品或作为燃料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "popcorn cob"
msgid_plural "popcorn cobs"
msgstr[0] "爆米花玉米棒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "popcorn cob"
msgid ""
"A popcorn cob full of popcorn kernels.  You can eat them on the cob or shell "
"it for cooking."
msgstr "一根长满爆米花粒的玉米棒。你可以直接啃着吃，也可以剥下来烹饪。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw popcorn"
msgid_plural "raw popcorn"
msgstr[0] "爆米花玉米"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "raw popcorn"
msgid ""
"A special variety of corn which could be used for making popcorn, after it's "
"dried.  Unlike normal corn, it's not sweet and is more dry."
msgstr "一種特殊的玉米品種，乾燥後可直接拿來做爆米花。和普通的玉米不同，它比較不甜且相當乾。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "popcorn kernels"
msgid_plural "popcorn kernels"
msgstr[0] "生爆米花"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "popcorn kernels"
msgid ""
"Dried kernels from a particular type of corn.  Inedible raw, they can be "
"cooked to make a tasty snack."
msgstr "这种干燥过的玉米粒来自于一种特殊种类的玉米。不能生吃，但是加以烹饪就会成为美味的佳肴。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "popcorn"
msgid_plural "popcorn"
msgstr[0] "爆米花"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "popcorn"
msgid ""
"Plain, unseasoned popcorn.  Not as tasty as other kinds, but healthier as a "
"result."
msgstr "一份质朴且毫无味道的\"原味\"爆米花，味道不如加料的爆米花，但是相比之更加绿色健康无污染。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salted popcorn"
msgid_plural "salted popcorn"
msgstr[0] "加鹽爆米花"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "salted popcorn"
msgid "Popcorn with salt added for extra flavor."
msgstr "加鹽口味的爆米花有著獨特的風味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "buttered popcorn"
msgid_plural "buttered popcorn"
msgstr[0] "奶油爆米花"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "buttered popcorn"
msgid "Popcorn with a light covering of butter for extra flavor."
msgstr "加入淡淡奶油的爆米花有著獨特的風味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wheat stalks"
msgid_plural "wheat stalks"
msgstr[0] "小麦麦穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "wheat stalks"
msgid "A sheaf of freshly-cut wheat, now ready for drying in a stook or smoker."
msgstr "一捆刚刚收割的小麦，现在可以放在炉灶或烟熏架里烘干了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried wheat stalks"
msgid_plural "dried wheat stalks"
msgstr[0] "干小麦麦穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "dried wheat stalks"
msgid ""
"A sheaf of dried wheat stalks.  These will require threshing before anything "
"can be done with them."
msgstr "一捆干燥的小麦麦穗。在使用它们做任何事情之前，你都需要取下上面的麦子。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "threshed wheat"
msgid_plural "threshed wheat"
msgstr[0] "脱粒小麦"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "threshed wheat"
msgid ""
"Wheat with the chaff still mixed in.  It will have to be winnowed before it's "
"usable."
msgstr "混着谷壳的小麦，它必须经过扬谷才能使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chaff"
msgid_plural "chaff"
msgstr[0] "谷壳"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "chaff"
msgid ""
"Loose bits of dried straw and seed casings from winnowed grain.  There are a "
"few fragments of seeds still mixed in, a big enough pile of this stuff could "
"be made into bird food or cattle fodder."
msgstr "松散的干稻草和筛过的谷壳。里面仍有混着一些种子碎屑，可以收集起来制成鸟食或牛饲料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wheat"
msgid_plural "wheat"
msgstr[0] "小麥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "wheat"
msgid ""
"A heap of dried wheatberries, ready for planting.  They're hard as gravel, "
"but could be boiled for food or ground into flour."
msgstr "一堆干小麦，可以用于种植。它们像砾石一样坚硬，但可以煮成食物或磨成面粉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "barley stalks"
msgid_plural "barley stalks"
msgstr[0] "大麦麦穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "barley stalks"
msgid "A sheaf of freshly-cut barley, now ready for drying in a stook or smoker."
msgstr "一捆刚刚收割的大麦，现在可以放在炉灶或烟熏架里烘干了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried barley stalks"
msgid_plural "dried barley stalks"
msgstr[0] "干大麦麦穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "dried barley stalks"
msgid ""
"A sheaf of dried barley stalks.  These will require threshing before anything "
"can be done with them."
msgstr "一捆干燥的大麦麦穗。在使用它们做任何事情之前，你都需要取下上面的麦子。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "threshed barley"
msgid_plural "threshed barley"
msgstr[0] "脱粒大麦"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "threshed barley"
msgid ""
"Barley with the chaff still mixed in.  It will have to be winnowed before "
"it's usable."
msgstr "混着谷壳的大麦，它必须经过扬谷才能使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "barley"
msgid_plural "barley"
msgstr[0] "大麥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "barley"
msgid ""
"A pile of dried barleycorn, a staple of brewing everywhere.  It can be "
"planted, boiled, or ground into flour."
msgstr "一堆干大麦，世界各地都用它当主食。它可以种植，也可以煮成食物或磨成面粉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "oat stalks"
msgid_plural "oat stalks"
msgstr[0] "燕麦麦穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "oat stalks"
msgid "A sheaf of freshly-cut oats, now ready for drying in a stook or smoker."
msgstr "一捆刚刚收割的燕麦，现在可以放在炉灶或烟熏架里烘干了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried oat stalks"
msgid_plural "dried oat stalks"
msgstr[0] "干燕麦麦穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "dried oat stalks"
msgid ""
"A sheaf of dried oat stalks.  These will require threshing before anything "
"can be done with them."
msgstr "一捆干燥的燕麦麦穗。在使用它们做任何事情之前，你都需要取下上面的麦子。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "threshed oats"
msgid_plural "threshed oats"
msgstr[0] "脱粒燕麦"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "threshed oats"
msgid ""
"Oats with the chaff still mixed in.  They will have to be winnowed before "
"they're usable."
msgstr "混着谷壳的燕麦，它必须经过扬谷才能使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "oats"
msgid_plural "oats"
msgstr[0] "燕麥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "oats"
msgid "A pile of raw oats."
msgstr "一堆生燕麦。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wild rice stalks"
msgid_plural "wild rice stalks"
msgstr[0] "野生稻稻穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "wild rice stalks"
msgid "A sheaf of wild rice stalks, ready for drying."
msgstr "一捆野生稻稻穗，可以拿去干燥了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried wild rice stalks"
msgid_plural "dried wild rice stalks"
msgstr[0] "干野生稻稻穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "dried wild rice stalks"
msgid ""
"A bunch of dry wild rice stalks.  Threshing these would knock the grains "
"loose."
msgstr "一捆干燥的野生稻稻穗，需要脱粒后才能使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "wild rice"
msgid ""
"Raw wild rice, still in its fibrous shell.  It'll need to be milled before "
"it's edible for humans."
msgstr "生的野生稻，仍被包裹在其纤维状的外壳中。它需要经过研磨才能供人类食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "buckwheat"
msgid_plural "buckwheat"
msgstr[0] "蕎麥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "buckwheat"
msgid ""
"Dry seeds from a wild buckwheat plant.  Inedible in their present state, they "
"are commonly cooked or ground into flour."
msgstr "从野生荞麦里收获的干荞麦，不能生吃，通常要把他们磨成粉或者放在水里煮熟。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canola stalks"
msgid_plural "canola stalks"
msgstr[0] "油菜籽籽穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "canola stalks"
msgid "A sheaf of tall grass with slender little seed pods, now ready for drying."
msgstr "一捆有着细长的小籽荚的长穗，现在可以拿去烘干了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried canola stalks"
msgid_plural "dried canola stalks"
msgstr[0] "干油菜籽籽穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "dried canola stalks"
msgid "A sheaf of dry grass, it must be threshed to separate out the seeds."
msgstr "一捆干草，必须经过脱粒才能从中分出种子。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "threshed canola"
msgid_plural "threshed canola"
msgstr[0] "脱粒油菜籽"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "threshed canola"
msgid "Round black seeds mixed in with dry chaff."
msgstr "和干谷壳混合在一起的圆形的黑色种子。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "canola seeds"
msgid_plural "canola seeds"
msgstr[0] "油菜籽"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "canola seeds"
msgid "A heap of round black seeds, typically milled and pressed for their oil."
msgstr "一堆圆形的黑色种子，通常用于碾磨和压榨以获得油。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried lentil stalks"
msgid_plural "dried lentil stalks"
msgstr[0] "干扁豆豆穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "dried lentil stalks"
msgid ""
"A pile of short stalks with lentils rattling in their pods.  These plants "
"dried in the field and didn't need a tool to harvest, but they'll still need "
"to be threshed and winnowed."
msgstr "一捆长着豆荚的短茎，扁豆在豆荚里嘎嘎作响。这些植物可以直接在田里晾干，不需要用工具收割，但仍需要脱粒和扬谷。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "threshed lentils"
msgid_plural "threshed lentils"
msgstr[0] "脱粒扁豆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "threshed lentils"
msgid ""
"Lentils with chaff mixed in.  These will have to be winnowed before they're "
"usable."
msgstr "混着豆荚的燕麦，它必须经过扬谷才能使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried lentils"
msgid_plural "dried lentils"
msgstr[0] "乾扁豆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "dried lentils"
msgid ""
"A humble but nutrient-rich legume.  They should be cooked prior to "
"consumption, unless you're planning to plant them."
msgstr "一种不起眼但富含营养的豆类。食用前应该先煮熟，除非你想拿去种。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "buckwheat stalks"
msgid_plural "buckwheat stalks"
msgstr[0] "荞麦麦穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "buckwheat stalks"
msgid ""
"These leafy stalks only get about waist-high and technically aren't a grass, "
"but thanks to their long stems and nutritious seeds, they can still be farmed "
"like any other cereal crop."
msgstr "这些多叶的茎秆只有齐腰高，严格意义上讲也不是草，但由于它们的长茎和营养丰富的种子，它们仍然可以像其他谷物作物一样用于种植。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried buckwheat stalks"
msgid_plural "dried buckwheat stalks"
msgstr[0] "干荞麦麦穗"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "dried buckwheat stalks"
msgid ""
"A heap of dried buckwheat.  It'll need to be threshed before eating, unless "
"you're a cow."
msgstr "一堆干燥的荞麦麦穗。除非你是一头牛，否则在吃之前需要把它脱粒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "threshed buckwheat"
msgid_plural "threshed buckwheat"
msgstr[0] "脱粒荞麦"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_grain.json
#. ~ Description of "threshed buckwheat"
msgid ""
"A pile of buckwheat seeds with some chaff still mixed in.  Once it's "
"winnowed, it'll be ready for use."
msgstr "混着谷壳的荞麦，它必须经过扬谷才能使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bee balm"
msgid_plural "bee balm"
msgstr[0] "管蜂香草"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "bee balm"
msgid "A snow-white flower also known as wild bergamot.  Smells faintly of mint."
msgstr "一種雪白的花， 也被叫作野生佛手柑， 有一點薄荷味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of ground nuts"
msgid_plural "handfuls of ground nuts"
msgstr[0] "美洲土圞兒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of ground nuts"
msgid ""
"An almost forgotten staple of the native tribes, called the Indian potato by "
"some.  Very nutritious, but mildly toxic unless cooked."
msgstr "一種幾乎被遺忘的土著主食，有些人會稱呼它為印地安人馬鈴薯。非常營養，不過生食具有微毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wild sarsaparilla root"
msgid_plural "wild sarsaparilla roots"
msgstr[0] "野生菝葜根"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "wild sarsaparilla root"
msgid ""
"This aromatic rhizome can be eaten as is in an emergency, but it is much "
"better used for making beverages.  Its taste is pleasant but it is also tough "
"and stringy."
msgstr "这种芳香的根茎可以在紧急情况下食用，但它最好用于制作草药茶。它的味道沁人心脾，但也硬而多筋。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Jerusalem artichoke"
msgid_plural "Jerusalem artichokes"
msgstr[0] "菊芋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "Jerusalem artichoke"
msgid ""
"A slightly sweet tuber.  Contains much inulin which may cause some minor "
"issues with your digestive tract, so it should be cooked."
msgstr "一种略带甜味的块茎。含有大量菊糖，可能会导致消化道出现一些小问题，所以应该煮熟后食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wild garlic"
msgid_plural "wild garlic"
msgstr[0] "野生大蒜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "wild garlic"
msgid ""
"Also called ramps, this delicate leafy vegetable is healthy and a tasty "
"ingredient for many dishes."
msgstr "这株纤细的多叶蔬菜也被称为北美野韭，是许多菜肴的健康美味配料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broccoli"
msgid_plural "broccoli"
msgstr[0] "花椰菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "broccoli"
msgid ""
"A big stalk of broccoli.  It's a bit tough, but rich in Vitamin C and quite "
"delicious when properly cooked."
msgstr ""
"一大根西兰花。有点硬，但富含维生素C，煮熟后非常美味。\n"
"\"即使是非常有营养的食物，无脑向别人推荐也是不对的。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cabbage head"
msgid_plural "cabbage head"
msgstr[0] "高麗菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cabbage head"
msgid "A head of crisp white cabbage.  You should probably prepare it before eating."
msgstr "一顆清脆的白高麗菜。或許你該處理好再食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of shredded cabbage"
msgid_plural "handfuls of shredded cabbage"
msgstr[0] "高麗菜絲"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of shredded cabbage"
msgid "A handful of shredded cabbage."
msgstr "一把切碎的高麗菜絲。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grape leaves"
msgid_plural "grape leaves"
msgstr[0] "葡萄葉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "grape leaves"
msgid ""
"Edible leaves of the grape vine.  Typically used in salads or as a food "
"wrapping."
msgstr "葡萄藤上结出的可食用的叶子。通常用于沙拉或食品包装。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of radish taproots"
msgid_plural "handfuls of radish taproots"
msgstr[0] "一把萝卜主根"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of radish taproots"
msgid "A handful of crunchy red radish taproots."
msgstr "一把松脆的红萝卜主根。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of spinach"
msgid_plural "handfuls of spinach"
msgstr[0] "菠菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of spinach"
msgid ""
"A bunch of spinach leaves.  Their ability to provide one with superhuman "
"strength has been greatly exaggerated by popular media."
msgstr "一束菠菜叶。和大众媒体宣传的不同，吃了并不会拥有超人的力量。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "carrot"
msgid_plural "carrots"
msgstr[0] "紅蘿蔔"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "carrot"
msgid "A healthy root vegetable.  Rich in vitamin A!"
msgstr "一個健康的根類蔬菜。富含維他命 A！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cattail rhizome"
msgid_plural "cattail rhizomes"
msgstr[0] "香蒲根莖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cattail rhizome"
msgid ""
"A stout, branching rhizome from a cattail plant.  Its crisp white flesh is "
"very starchy and fibrous, but you really ought to cook it before you attempt "
"to eat it."
msgstr ""
"一根粗壮的香蒲的根茎，新鲜的白色组织富含纤维，毛毛糙糙，你得煮熟它才能吃下肚子。\n"
"\"据说有人在沼泽中靠这些根茎活了很久。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lotus root"
msgid_plural "lotus roots"
msgstr[0] "莲藕"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "lotus root"
msgid ""
"The rhizome of the lotus, which has many tubular cavities inside, can be "
"eaten both raw and cooked."
msgstr "带有许多管状空腔的莲花根茎，可以生吃也可以烹调后食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cattail stalk"
msgid_plural "cattail stalks"
msgstr[0] "香蒲秸稈"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cattail stalk"
msgid ""
"A stiff, green stalk from a cattail plant.  It is starchy and fibrous, but it "
"would be much better if you cooked it."
msgstr "来自香蒲的绿色硬茎。它富含淀粉和纤维，但如果你把它煮熟会更美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plant stalk"
msgid_plural "plant stalks"
msgstr[0] "植物茎杆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "plant stalk"
msgid ""
"A stiff, green stalk from a plant.  It is starchy and fibrous, but it would "
"be much better if you cooked it."
msgstr "来自一株植物的绿色硬茎。它富含淀粉和纤维，烹饪后会更美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "celery"
msgid_plural "celery"
msgstr[0] "芹菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "celery"
msgid ""
"A single stalk of celery.  Neither tasty nor very nutritious, but it goes "
"well with salad."
msgstr "一根芹菜。既不好吃也不很有营养的蔬菜，但它的口感很适合沙拉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cotton boll"
msgid_plural "cotton bolls"
msgstr[0] "棉桃"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cotton boll"
msgid ""
"A tough protective capsule bulging with densely-packed fibers and seeds, this "
"cotton boll can be processed into usable material with the right tools."
msgstr "一个充满了浓密的纤维和种子的坚硬保护荚，可以用适当的工具加工成有用的材料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chili pepper"
msgid_plural "chili peppers"
msgstr[0] "辣椒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "chili pepper"
msgid ""
"A spicy chili pepper.  Not the best on its own, but adds great flavor when "
"used in cooking."
msgstr "一种辣椒。单吃不怎么样，但在烹饪中使用能增添超棒的风味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut chili pepper"
msgid_plural "cut chili peppers"
msgstr[0] "辣椒块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cut chili pepper"
msgid "A chili pepper that's been cut into pieces.  The seeds have been removed."
msgstr "被切成块的辣椒，里面的种子已被摘除。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salad cucumber"
msgid_plural "salad cucumbers"
msgstr[0] "沙拉黄瓜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "salad cucumber"
msgid ""
"The larger cousin of a pickle.  A vegetable from the gourd family.  Not "
"especially flavorful, but very refreshing."
msgstr "泡菜用黄瓜的大个表亲。葫芦科的一种蔬菜。不是特别香，但是很清爽。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut salad cucumber"
msgid_plural "cut salad cucumbers"
msgstr[0] "沙拉黄瓜块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cut salad cucumber"
msgid "A chopped-up salad cucumber."
msgstr "一份切好的沙拉黄瓜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gherkin cucumber"
msgid_plural "gherkin cucumbers"
msgstr[0] "小黄瓜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "gherkin cucumber"
msgid ""
"A pickle before it becomes a pickle.  Gherkins are smaller cucumbers that - "
"you guessed it - are used to make pickles."
msgstr "变成泡菜黄瓜之前的泡菜用黄瓜。小黄瓜是一种用来做泡菜的黄瓜，你猜对了，它个头比较小。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut gherkin cucumber"
msgid_plural "cut gherkin cucumbers"
msgstr[0] "小黄瓜块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cut gherkin cucumber"
msgid "A chopped-up gherkin cucumber."
msgstr "一份切好的小黄瓜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dahlia root"
msgid_plural "dahlia roots"
msgstr[0] "大麗菊根"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "dahlia root"
msgid ""
"The large, tuberous root of a dahlia flower.  It smells spicy, but is too "
"starchy to eat without cooking."
msgstr "大麗菊的大塊根莖。聞起來有點辣，如果不經過烹調會是澱粉狀難以下嚥。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salsify root"
msgid_plural "salsify roots"
msgstr[0] "婆羅門參"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "salsify root"
msgid ""
"A highly nutritious root, it is tough and bland until cooked, at which point "
"it tastes strangely similar to oysters."
msgstr "一种营养丰富的根，在煮熟之前又韧又无味，此时它的味道很奇怪地与牡蛎非常相似。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chicory root"
msgid_plural "chicory roots"
msgstr[0] "菊苣根"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "chicory root"
msgid "A very bitter root, not meant to be eaten raw."
msgstr "一种非常苦的根，不适合生吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wild root"
msgid_plural "wild roots"
msgstr[0] "野根"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "wild root"
msgid ""
"These are often wild carrots, but beware of poisonous lookalikes.  In any "
"case, the root is tough and is not as tasty as a real raw carrot."
msgstr "这些通常是野生胡萝卜，但要当心某些会有毒。无论如何，这些根茎都很硬，不像真正的生胡萝卜那么好吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dogbane"
msgid_plural "dogbane"
msgstr[0] "毒狗草"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "dogbane"
msgid "A stalk of dogbane.  It has very fibrous stems and is mildly poisonous."
msgstr "一條毒狗草的莖，它具有非常多的纖維質和輕微的毒性。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "garlic bulb"
msgid_plural "garlic bulbs"
msgstr[0] "蒜頭"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "garlic bulb"
msgid ""
"A pungent garlic bulb.  Popular as a seasoning for its strong flavor.  Can be "
"disassembled into cloves."
msgstr "一块味道刺鼻的大蒜鳞茎。因其浓郁的气味，是常见的香辛调味料。可以拆解为可种植的蒜瓣。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "garlic clove"
msgid_plural "garlic cloves"
msgstr[0] "蒜瓣"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "garlic clove"
msgid "Cloves of garlic.  Useful as a seasoning."
msgstr "大蒜瓣。可以当作调味料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hops flower"
msgid_plural "hops flowers"
msgstr[0] "啤酒花"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "hops flower"
msgid "A cluster of small cone-like flowers, indispensable for brewing beer."
msgstr "一小朵錐狀的花， 釀造啤酒的必備材料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horseradish root"
msgid_plural "horseradish roots"
msgstr[0] "辣根的根"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "horseradish root"
msgid ""
"A large white tapered root of a horseradish plant.  Way too spicy to eat in "
"this form, but can be used for making condiments."
msgstr "一根巨大的白色锥形辣根根茎。这样直接吃太辣了，但可以用来做调味品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lettuce head"
msgid_plural "lettuce head"
msgstr[0] "生菜头"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "lettuce head"
msgid ""
"A crisp head of iceberg lettuce.  You should probably prepare it before "
"eating."
msgstr "一颗脆脆的冰山生菜。在烹饪前你可能需要先处理一下。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of shredded lettuce"
msgid_plural "handfuls of shredded lettuce"
msgstr[0] "生菜絲"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of shredded lettuce"
msgid "A handful of shredded iceberg lettuce."
msgstr "一把切碎的生菜丝。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mugwort"
msgid_plural "mugwort"
msgstr[0] "艾草"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "mugwort"
msgid "A stalk of mugwort.  Smells wonderful."
msgstr "一條艾草的莖。聞起來很棒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "onion"
msgid_plural "onions"
msgstr[0] "洋蔥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "onion"
msgid "An aromatic onion used in cooking.  Cutting these up can make your eyes sting!"
msgstr "烹飪時常用到的洋蔥。切割這個東西會讓你的眼睛刺痛！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fungal fluid sac"
msgid_plural "fungal fluid sacs"
msgstr[0] "真菌液囊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "fungal fluid sac"
msgid ""
"A fluid bladder from a fungus-based lifeform.  Not very nutritious, but safe "
"to eat."
msgstr "一个来自于某种真菌类生物的液体囊包。没什么营养，但吃起来应该是安全的。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw potato"
msgid_plural "raw potatoes"
msgstr[0] "生馬鈴薯"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "raw potato"
msgid ""
"A potato, mildly toxic and not very tasty raw.  Delicious and filling when "
"properly cooked."
msgstr "馬鈴薯，生吃帶有些微毒性而且不好吃。正確烹調後好吃又飽胃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooking banana"
msgid_plural "cooking bananas"
msgstr[0] "大蕉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cooking banana"
msgid ""
"A much less sweet and more starchy relative of the banana; unlike dessert "
"bananas, they usually are eaten cooked rather than raw, and can be processed "
"into flour.  They are a staple food in tropical regions of the world.  Also "
"known as plantains."
msgstr "香蕉的近亲，没那么甜，但淀粉含量更高；与水果香蕉不同，芭蕉通常煮熟后食用，而非生吃，也可以加工成面粉。它们是世界热带地区的主食。又名普拉塔恩。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pumpkin"
msgid_plural "pumpkins"
msgstr[0] "南瓜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "pumpkin"
msgid ""
"A large gourd, about the size of a person's head.  It'll require some "
"disassembly before use."
msgstr "一个有大约一个人的头那么大的瓜。在使用前需要先切开。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut pumpkin"
msgid_plural "cut pumpkin"
msgstr[0] "南瓜块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cut pumpkin"
msgid ""
"A quarter section of a pumpkin.  The seeds and stringy inner pulp have been "
"removed."
msgstr "南瓜的四分之一块。种子和粘稠的内果肉已被去除。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horseradish greens"
msgid_plural "horseradish greens"
msgstr[0] "辣根葉子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "horseradish greens"
msgid ""
"Leaves of a horseradish plant with a sharp, bitter and peppery taste.  "
"They're edible, but not commonly eaten."
msgstr "辣根植物的葉子，帶有強烈，苦味和胡椒味。 它們可以食用，但並不常作為食用用途。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "dandelion"
msgid ""
"A handful of freshly-picked yellow dandelions.  In their current raw state "
"they are quite bitter."
msgstr ""
"一把新摘取的黄色蒲公英。\n"
"\"别想让我生吃这苦玩意。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "burdock"
msgid "Burdock, a bitter thistle-like vegetable.  Can be eaten raw or cooked."
msgstr "牛蒡，一種像是苦薊的植物。能夠生吃或先煮過。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of bamboo shoots"
msgid_plural "handfuls of bamboo shoots"
msgstr[0] "竹筍"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of bamboo shoots"
msgid ""
"Raw woody bamboo shoots, they require some preparation before they can be "
"eaten safely."
msgstr "生竹笋，在能够被安全食用前，需要先做一些处理。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rhubarb"
msgid_plural "rhubarbs"
msgstr[0] "大黃"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "rhubarb"
msgid "A sour stalk of the rhubarb plant, often used in baking pies."
msgstr "北美菜用大黄的肉质叶柄，很酸，烤馅饼时常用它。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sugar beet"
msgid_plural "sugar beets"
msgstr[0] "甜菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "sugar beet"
msgid ""
"This fleshy root is ripe and flowing with sugars; it'll just take some "
"processing to extract them."
msgstr "这块新鲜的根茎已经成熟并且充满了糖分。只差最后一些步骤，赶紧把它们都榨出来吧。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black tea leaves"
msgid_plural "black tea leaves"
msgstr[0] "紅茶茶葉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "black tea leaves"
msgid ""
"Dried leaves of a tropical plant.  You can boil them into tea, or you can "
"just eat them raw.  They're pretty gross and not too filling that way, though."
msgstr "热带植物的晒干的叶子，可以当茶叶泡，还可以直接嚼着吃，只是不饱肚子而且令人恶心。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pile of wintergreen leaves"
msgid_plural "piles of wintergreen leaves"
msgstr[0] "冬青樹葉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "pile of wintergreen leaves"
msgid ""
"These leaves smell strongly medicinal.  When chewed, they first taste sweet "
"but the aftertaste is incredibly bitter.  These leaves contain good amounts "
"of methyl salicylate and merely chewing them may have a similar effect to "
"aspirin."
msgstr "这些叶子闻起来有股草药味。咀嚼时，它们最初尝起来有点甜，但回味却极其苦涩。这些叶子中含有大量的水杨酸甲酯，仅仅咀嚼它们可能会产生与阿司匹林相似的效果。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "pile of wintergreen leaves"
msgid "You chew the wintergreen leaves."
msgstr "你嚼了嚼冬青葉子。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "green tea leaves"
msgid_plural "green tea leaves"
msgstr[0] "綠茶茶葉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "green tea leaves"
msgid ""
"Dried leaves of a tropical plant.  You can boil them into green tea, or you "
"can just eat them raw.  They're pretty gross and not too filling that way, "
"though."
msgstr "热带植物的晒干的叶子，可以泡成绿茶，还可以直接嚼着吃，只是不饱肚子而且令人恶心。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tomato"
msgid_plural "tomatoes"
msgstr[0] "番茄"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "tomato"
msgid ""
"A juicy red tomato.  It gained popularity in Italy after being brought back "
"from the New World."
msgstr "一个鲜美多汁的番茄，从新大陆引入之后就在意大利广泛被食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut tomato"
msgid_plural "cut tomatoes"
msgstr[0] "番茄块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cut tomato"
msgid "A cut-up tomato with the seeds removed."
msgstr "去掉籽的切好的番茄。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "triffid flesh"
msgid_plural "triffid flesh"
msgstr[0] "三尖树肉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "triffid flesh"
msgid ""
"An weird looking chunk of plant matter that's a shade of yellow and green, "
"with oddly thick fibers.  It smells like a mix of rotted wood and dirt, and "
"it leaks a clear fluid."
msgstr "一块看起来很奇怪的植物，有着黄色和绿色的阴影和奇怪的粗纤维。它闻起来像腐烂的木头和污垢的混合物，还会泄漏一些清澈的液体。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien fungus chunk"
msgid_plural "alien fungus chunks"
msgstr[0] "外星真菌塊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "alien fungus chunk"
msgid ""
"A chunk of fungal matter from some sort of alien mushroom creature.  Eating "
"unfamiliar mushrooms is a bad idea."
msgstr "一大块外星真菌物质。乱吃陌生蘑菇小心躺板板哦。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wild vegetables"
msgid_plural "wild vegetables"
msgstr[0] "野菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "wild vegetables"
msgid ""
"An assortment of edible-looking wild plants.  Most are quite bitter-tasting.  "
"Some are inedible until cooked."
msgstr "大量看起來可以吃的野生植物， 但是大多數都苦苦的不好吃， 有些甚至煮熟了也不能吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zucchini"
msgid_plural "zucchinis"
msgstr[0] "西葫蘆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "zucchini"
msgid "A tasty summer squash."
msgstr "美味的西葫蘆。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut zucchini"
msgid_plural "cut zucchinis"
msgstr[0] "西葫芦块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cut zucchini"
msgid "A chopped-up summer squash.  The seeds have been removed."
msgstr "一种切碎的夏日瓜果。种子已被摘除。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of raw beans"
msgid_plural "handfuls of raw beans"
msgstr[0] "生腰豆"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of raw beans"
msgid ""
"Raw, uncooked kidney beans.  They are mildly toxic to humans in this form, "
"but you could cook them to make them tasty."
msgstr "一些未煮過的生腰豆。對人體有著微量毒性，不過煮過之後就會變得美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fiddleheads"
msgid_plural "fiddleheads"
msgstr[0] "蕨類嫩芽"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "fiddleheads"
msgid ""
"A handful of immature fern fronds, still curled up like the head of a fiddle. "
" Delicious when cooked, but consuming them raw can cause food poisoning."
msgstr "一把未成熟的蕨菜叶子，仍像小提琴头一样蜷曲着。烹饪后味道鲜美，但生吃会引起食物中毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of young leaves"
msgid_plural "handfuls of young leaves"
msgstr[0] "嫩葉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of young leaves"
msgid ""
"Some young leaves from miscellaneous plants.  They're tender enough to eat, "
"but not very tasty on their own."
msgstr "来自各种植物的嫩叶。很嫩，可以吃，单独食用时味道不怎么样。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of chicory greens"
msgid_plural "handfuls of chicory greens"
msgstr[0] "菊苣"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of chicory greens"
msgid "Some chicory greens.  They are quite bitter but high in calcium."
msgstr "一些菊苣叶。它们相当苦，但富含钙质。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Japanese knotweed stems"
msgid_plural "Japanese knotweed stems"
msgstr[0] "虎杖莖桿"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "Japanese knotweed stems"
msgid ""
"Some young Japanese knotweed stems.  They taste a bit like rhubarb and "
"contain good amounts of vitamin A.  Refreshing."
msgstr "一些日本虎杖的嫩茎秆。它们尝起来有点像大黄，含有大量的维生素A。十分提神。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bell pepper"
msgid_plural "bell peppers"
msgstr[0] "甜椒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "bell pepper"
msgid ""
"A green bell pepper.  Eating it whole and raw would be kind of a hassle, "
"considering all the seeds."
msgstr "青椒，生吃這東西會有些困難，畢竟裡面塞滿了種子。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut bell pepper"
msgid_plural "cut bell peppers"
msgstr[0] "灯笼椒块"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cut bell pepper"
msgid "A chopped up bell pepper with the seeds removed."
msgstr "去掉籽的切好的灯笼椒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wheat-free flour"
msgid_plural "wheat-free flour"
msgstr[0] "無麩質麵粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "wheat-free flour"
msgid ""
"This wheat-free white flour is useful for baking items for those with grain "
"intolerances."
msgstr "不含小麥的白麵粉，很適合用來烘焙食物給那些對穀物過敏的人吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw bottle gourd"
msgid_plural "raw bottle gourds"
msgstr[0] "生葫芦"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "raw bottle gourd"
msgid ""
"A vegetable from the gourd family, bottle gourds were brought to the Americas "
"by the first Native American settlers crossing the Bering strait.  It can be "
"further prepared to produce a hard, watertight shell, usable as a "
"biodegradable liquid container.  Eating it doesn't look worth it."
msgstr "葫芦科的一种蔬菜，由第一批穿越白令海峡的美洲土著定居者带到美洲。它可以进一步制备出坚硬的、不透水的外壳，能制成可降解的液体容器。没必要吃这个。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "eggplant"
msgid_plural "eggplants"
msgstr[0] "茄子"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "eggplant"
msgid ""
"A normal and healthy purple eggplant.  Needs to be disassembled before being "
"useful for cooking."
msgstr "一个普通且健康的紫色茄子。在烹饪前需要先处理一下。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut eggplant"
msgid_plural "cut eggplants"
msgstr[0] "茄子段"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "cut eggplant"
msgid "A cut-up eggplant with many of the seeds picked out."
msgstr "切好的茄子，里面的种子已经被去除。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "seaweed"
msgid_plural "seaweed"
msgstr[0] "海藻"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "seaweed"
msgid ""
"A handful of slimy seaweed.  It doesn't look edible, but properly dried, it "
"might make for decent kindling."
msgstr "一把滑溜溜的海藻。看上去不适合食用，但如果好好晒干，或许能成为不错的燃料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pile of seaweed"
msgid_plural "pile of seaweed"
msgstr[0] "一堆海藻"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "pile of seaweed"
msgid ""
"A slimy heap of seaweed.  It doesn't look edible, but properly dried, it "
"might make for decent kindling."
msgstr "一把滑溜溜的海藻。看上去不适合食用，但如果好好晒干，或许能成为不错的燃料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "sea lettuce"
msgid ""
"A handful of edible green seaweed.  It makes a good snack as-is, but can be "
"dried or prepared in a number of ways."
msgstr "一把可食用的綠色海藻。它可以做為零食直接食用，也可以曬乾或以多種方式烹調。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "sugar kelp"
msgid ""
"A sizable strip of new growth harvested from a sugar kelp.  While these are "
"most often dried, it seems edible enough as is."
msgstr "從糖海帶上採收的大片新芽。儘管這些海藻通常會被曬乾，但現在看來已經能食用了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#. ~ Description of "bladderwrack"
msgid ""
"A leafy bunch of seaweed covered in air bladders.  Many claims are made about "
"its health benefits, but at least as a foodstuff, it's no better or worse "
"than other edible seaweed."
msgstr "一束长满气囊的海藻。关于它的健康益处有许多说法，但至少作为食物来说，它与其他可食用海藻无异，既不更好也不更差。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grilled cheese sandwich"
msgid_plural "grilled cheese sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "烤起司三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "grilled cheese sandwich"
msgid ""
"A delicious grilled cheese sandwich, because everything is better with melted "
"cheese."
msgstr "一個美味的烤起司三明治， 因為融化的起司讓世界變得更美好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "egg salad sandwich"
msgid_plural "egg salad sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "雞蛋沙拉三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "egg salad sandwich"
msgid "A delicious egg salad sandwich."
msgstr "好吃的雞蛋沙拉三明治。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deluxe sandwich"
msgid_plural "deluxe sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "豪華三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "deluxe sandwich"
msgid ""
"A sandwich of meat, vegetables, and cheese with condiments.  Tasty and "
"nutritious!"
msgstr "一份夾著肉、蔬菜、起司配上調味料的三明治。美味又營養！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "deluxe sandwich" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING
#. matches mutant
msgid "\"deluxe\" sandwich"
msgid_plural "\"deluxe\" sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "\"豪華\" 三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "deluxe sandwich" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING
#. matches egg
msgid "deluxe breakfast sandwich"
msgid_plural "deluxe breakfast sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "特级加蛋三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "reuben sandwich"
msgid_plural "reuben sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "魯賓三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "reuben sandwich"
msgid ""
"A pre-Cataclysm classic, probably made with significant substitutions.  Key "
"components are the special sauce and sauerkraut, with bread, meat, and cheese "
"fried in a pan."
msgstr "一款大灾变前的经典美食，可能含有特别的配方成分。关键成分是特制酱汁和德式酸菜，配上面包、肉和奶酪在锅里煎熟。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "reuben sandwich" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING
#. matches mutant
msgid "\"fauxben\" sandwich"
msgid_plural "\"fauxben\" sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "\"魯賓\"三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cucumber sandwich"
msgid_plural "cucumber sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "黃瓜三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "cucumber sandwich"
msgid "A refreshing cucumber sandwich.  Not very filling, but quite tasty."
msgstr "清爽的黃瓜三明治。不太能夠填飽肚子， 但相當好吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cheese sandwich"
msgid_plural "cheese sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "起司三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "cheese sandwich"
msgid "A simple cheese sandwich."
msgstr "一個簡單的起司三明治。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jam sandwich"
msgid_plural "jam sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "果醬三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "jam sandwich"
msgid "A delicious jam sandwich."
msgstr "好吃的果醬三明治。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jam and cheese sandwich"
msgid_plural "jam and cheese sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "起司果醬三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "jam and cheese sandwich"
msgid "A delicious jam and cheese sandwich."
msgstr "美味的起司果醬三明治。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jam and butter sandwich"
msgid_plural "jam and butter sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "奶油果醬三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "jam and butter sandwich"
msgid "A delicious jam and butter sandwich."
msgstr "好吃的奶油果醬三明治。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fairy bread"
msgid_plural "fairy bread"
msgstr[0] "仙女麵包"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "fairy bread"
msgid ""
"An 'open-faced sandwich' consisting of sliced white bread, a healthy "
"crust-to-crust slathering of butter, and sprinkles.  Supposedly a staple of "
"birthday parties in Australia."
msgstr "一種“開放式三明治”，一片白吐司、抹上一層奶油，並撒上滿滿的彩色糖砂。據說是澳大利亞生日派對的主食。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "honey sandwich"
msgid_plural "honey sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "蜂蜜三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "honey sandwich"
msgid "A delicious honey sandwich."
msgstr "美味的蜂蜜三明治。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boring sandwich"
msgid_plural "boring sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "單調的三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "boring sandwich"
msgid ""
"A simple sauce sandwich.  Not very filling, but it beats eating just the "
"bread."
msgstr "单一调味酱的三明治。不是很美味，但比起面包夹面包好得多。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetable sandwich"
msgid_plural "vegetable sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "蔬菜三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetable sandwich"
msgid "Bread and vegetables, that's it."
msgstr "麵包跟蔬菜， 就這樣。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetable sandwich with cheese"
msgid_plural "vegetable sandwiches with cheese"
msgstr[0] "蔬菜奶酪三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetable sandwich with cheese"
msgid ""
"A vegetarian combination of cheese and vegetable on bread, simple yet "
"satisfying."
msgstr "面包配上奶酪和蔬菜的素食组合，简单却美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "meat sandwich"
msgid_plural "meat sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "肉三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "meat sandwich"
msgid "Bread and meat, that's it."
msgstr "麵包跟肉， 就這樣。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat sandwich" when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
msgid "slob sandwich"
msgid_plural "slob sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "人肉三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat sandwich" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
msgid "satyr sandwich"
msgid_plural "satyr sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "亞人肉三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat sandwich" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. mutant
#. ~ Conditional name for "meat soup" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. mutant
#, c-format
msgid "mutant %s"
msgid_plural "mutant %s"
msgstr[0] "%s（突變肉）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peanut butter sandwich"
msgid_plural "peanut butter sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "花生醬三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "peanut butter sandwich"
msgid ""
"Some peanut butter smothered between two pieces of bread.  Not very filling, "
"and will stick to the roof of your mouth like glue."
msgstr "一份将花生酱夹在两片面包之中的三明治，分量不大，花生酱让口感变得很粘。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "PB&J sandwich"
msgid_plural "PB&J sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "花生果醬三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "PB&J sandwich"
msgid ""
"A delicious peanut butter and jelly sandwich.  It reminds you of the times "
"your mother would make you lunch."
msgstr "美味的花生果醬三明治。這讓會令你想起你與你母親一起野餐的時候。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "PB&H sandwich"
msgid_plural "PB&H sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "蜂蜜花生醬三明治"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Description of "PB&H sandwich"
msgid ""
"Some damned fool put honey on this peanut butter sandwich, who in their right "
"mind- oh wait, this is pretty good."
msgstr ""
"一份将蜂蜜涂抹在花生酱三明治，简单的加工却让本身单调的花生酱变得美味起来。\n"
"\"哪个傻瓜把蜂蜜抹在花生酱三明治上面……等等，尝起来还不错。\""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "PB&M sandwich"
msgid_plural "PB&M sandwiches"
