"reconstituted with water.  Not the most exciting meal but better than plain "
"water."
msgstr "即食的春菜湯泡麵，由脫水麵條和蔬菜加水調製而成。算不上令人興奮的一餐，但總比開水好。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "instant spring vegetable soup powder"
msgid_plural "instant spring vegetable soup powder"
msgstr[0] "春菜麵調理包"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
#. ~ Description of "instant spring vegetable soup powder"
msgid ""
"Instant spring vegetable soup powder made from dehydrated noodles and "
"vegetables.  Mix with water to create a mildly improved meal."
msgstr "由脫水麵條和蔬菜製成的即食春菜調理包，與開水混合成稍微改善的一餐。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "coq au vin"
msgid_plural "coq au vin"
msgstr[0] "红酒烩鸡"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
#. ~ Description of "coq au vin"
msgid "French chicken stew braised with red wine."
msgstr "法式燉雞佐紅酒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chili powder"
msgid_plural "chili powder"
msgstr[0] "辣椒粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "chili powder"
msgid "Chili P, yo!  Not edible on its own, but it could be used to make seasoning."
msgstr "一份辣椒粉，没法直接食用，但可以在制造食品时当作调味料使用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "garlic powder"
msgid_plural "garlic powder"
msgstr[0] "大蒜粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "garlic powder"
msgid ""
"Garlic that has been dehydrated and ground into a powder.  A must-have "
"seasoning in any pantry."
msgstr "經過脫水處理並磨成粉末的大蒜，每家廚房必備的調味品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hot sauce"
msgid_plural "hot sauce"
msgstr[0] "辣醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "hot sauce"
msgid ""
"Flamin' hot sauce.  It'd be a bad idea to drink it on its own.  You should "
"probably wash your hands after handling it, too."
msgstr "火辣辣的辣酱，不适合直接喝掉。接触后最好洗下手。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cinnamon"
msgid_plural "cinnamon"
msgstr[0] "肉桂"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "cinnamon"
msgid "Ground cinnamon bark with a sweet but slightly spicy aroma."
msgstr "肉桂皮， 甜美而略帶辛辣香氣。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "curry powder"
msgid_plural "curry powder"
msgstr[0] "咖哩粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "curry powder"
msgid ""
"A blend of spices meant to be used in some South Asian dishes.  Can't be "
"eaten raw, why would you even try that?"
msgstr "融合了許多香料的調味品， 可以使用在一些南亞菜餚中。不能生吃， 為什麼你會想要那麼做？"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black pepper"
msgid_plural "black pepper"
msgstr[0] "黑胡椒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "black pepper"
msgid "Ground black spice berries with a pungent aroma."
msgstr "帶著一股刺鼻香氣的黑色香料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spicebush berries"
msgid_plural "spicebush berries"
msgstr[0] "洋腊梅"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "spicebush berries"
msgid ""
"Small, red berries with a pungent aroma.  It is said they are comparable to "
"allspice, but also boasting their own flavor profile."
msgstr "小的红色浆果，有强烈的香味。据说它们与百香果相似，但也独具风味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dry spicebush berries"
msgid_plural "dry spicebush berries"
msgstr[0] "洋腊梅干"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "dry spicebush berries"
msgid "These formerly red berries now have a stronger aroma after being dehydrated."
msgstr "这曾经的红色小浆果现在经过脱水后气味更强烈。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salt"
msgid_plural "salt"
msgstr[0] "鹽"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "salt"
msgid ""
"Yuck!  You surely wouldn't want to eat this.  It's good for preserving meat "
"and cooking, though."
msgstr "噁， 你絕對不會想要直接吃這個的。但是用來保存肉類或烹飪時很好用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Italian seasoning"
msgid_plural "Italian seasoning"
msgstr[0] "義大利調味料"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "Italian seasoning"
msgid "A fragrant mix of dried oregano, basil, thyme and other spices."
msgstr "混合了芬芳的乾牛至， 羅勒， 百里香等香料的調味料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "seasoned salt"
msgid_plural "seasoned salt"
msgstr[0] "調味鹽"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "seasoned salt"
msgid "Salt mixed with a fragrant blend of secret herbs and spices."
msgstr "混合著一些神祕香料的鹽。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sugar"
msgid_plural "sugar"
msgstr[0] "糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Description of "sugar"
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet sugar.  Bad for your teeth and surprisingly not very tasty on "
"its own."
msgstr "甜蜜蜜的糖。對你的牙齒不好並且不適合直接吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sprinkles"
msgid_plural "sprinkles"
msgstr[0] "彩糖"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "sprinkles"
msgid ""
"Known as nonpareils, sprinkles, jimmies, sugar strands or "
"'hundreds-and-thousands', these colorful balls, rods or flakes of sugar and "
"starch are intended for use decorating soft surfaces of sweets.  Like sugar, "
"they are bad for your teeth and surprisingly not very tasty on their own."
msgstr "又叫做巧克力米，這些五顏六色的糖球、糖棒或糖片是用來裝飾糖果的表面。和糖一樣對你的牙齒有害，而且單獨食用也不太美味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wild herbs"
msgid_plural "wild herbs"
msgstr[0] "野生草藥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "wild herbs"
msgid ""
"A tasty collection of wild herbs including violet, sassafras, mint, clover, "
"purslane, and fireweed."
msgstr "一個美味的綜合草藥，包含了紫羅蘭、黃樟、薄荷、三葉草、馬齒莧、和雜草。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soy sauce"
msgid_plural "soy sauce"
msgstr[0] "醬油"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "soy sauce"
msgid "Salty fermented soybean sauce."
msgstr "大豆發酵鹹醬油。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thyme"
msgid_plural "thyme"
msgstr[0] "麝香草"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "thyme"
msgid "A stalk of thyme.  Smells delicious."
msgstr "一根麝香草。聞起來很好吃。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mustard powder"
msgid_plural "mustard powder"
msgstr[0] "芥末籽粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "mustard powder"
msgid "A fragrant yellow powder.  Not edible in this form."
msgstr "好聞的黃色粉末。無法直接食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "artificial sweetener"
msgid_plural "artificial sweetener"
msgstr[0] "人造甜味劑"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
#. ~ Description of "artificial sweetener"
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet sugar?  No, it is bitter-sweet artificial sweetener.  No "
"calories, no worries."
msgstr "好甜，甜蜜的糖？不，這只是吃起來甜的人造甜味劑。沒有熱量沒有負擔。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
