"Exposed cloves of garlic that have been coated in oil and then roasted.  Much "
"better than eating them raw."
msgstr "剝開外皮的蒜瓣塗上油後烤熟。比生吃好吃多了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "roasted chili pepper"
msgid_plural "roasted chili peppers"
msgstr[0] "烤辣椒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "roasted chili pepper"
msgid ""
"A chili pepper that has been roasted on high heat, with the skin removed.  "
"This has taken out most of the spice, and it's much better than eating it raw."
msgstr "辣椒經過高溫烘烤並去掉外皮。這樣可以去除大部分的辣味，比生吃好吃多了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked dandelion greens"
msgid_plural "cooked dandelion greens"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的蒲公英葉"

