"Dehydrated long-grain rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually "
"inedible when dry."
msgstr "脫水過的白長米。當煮熟時美味又營養， 但如果是乾燥的則幾乎不能食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dry wild rice"
msgid_plural "dry wild rice"
msgstr[0] "野米"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "dry wild rice"
msgid ""
"Raw, milled wild rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually inedible "
"when dry."
msgstr "碾磨的野生生米。煮熟後美味又有營養，乾燥的狀態幾乎無法食用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked rice"
msgid_plural "cooked rice"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的飯"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked rice"
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked long-grain white rice."
msgstr "一份豐盛的白長米飯。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked wild rice"
msgid_plural "cooked wild rice"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的野米"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked wild rice"
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked wild rice."
msgstr "一份豐盛的野米飯。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fried rice"
msgid_plural "fried rice"
