#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salted veggy chunk"
msgid_plural "salted veggy chunks"
msgstr[0] "鹽漬蔬菜塊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "salted veggy chunk"
msgid ""
"Vegetable chunks pickled in a salt bath.  Goes well with burgers, if you can "
"find one."
msgstr "在鹽中醃製的蔬菜塊。搭配漢堡很適合，前提是你找的到漢堡。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spaghetti al pesto"
msgid_plural "spaghetti al pesto"
msgstr[0] "蒜香義大利麵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "spaghetti al pesto"
msgid "Spaghetti with a generous helping of pesto on top.  Yum!"
msgstr "義大利麵，上面灑滿了美味香蒜，太迷人了！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pickle"
msgid_plural "pickles"
msgstr[0] "酸黃瓜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "pickle"
msgid ""
"A small pickled cucumber.  Rather sour, but tastes good and lasts for a long "
"time."
msgstr "一小條酸黃瓜。非常酸，但很美味，而且能夠保存很久。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sauerkraut w/ sauteed onions"
msgid_plural "sauerkraut w/ sauteed onions"
msgstr[0] "德國酸菜配炒洋蔥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "sauerkraut w/ sauteed onions"
msgid ""
"A delicious sautee of lovely diced onions and sauerkraut.  The smell alone is "
"enough to make your mouth water."
msgstr "一道混合洋蔥絲和德國酸菜的美味小炒。單是氣味就足以令你垂涎欲滴。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pickled veggy"
msgid_plural "pickled veggy"
msgstr[0] "醃菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "pickled veggy"
msgid ""
"A serving of crisply brined and canned vegetable matter.  Tasty and "
"nutritious."
msgstr "脆爽的醃製蔬菜，美味又營養。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "pickled veggy" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. garlic_clove
#. ~ Conditional name for "fried pickled veggy" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. veggy_pickled_garlic_clove
#, c-format
msgid "%s, garlic clove"
msgid_plural "%s, garlic clove"
msgstr[0] "%s（蒜瓣）"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fried pickled veggy"
msgid_plural "fried pickled veggies"
msgstr[0] "炸醃菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "fried pickled veggy"
msgid ""
"A serving of fried pickled vegetables, tangy with a crunchy golden-brown "
"coating."
msgstr "一份油炸醃菜，香濃的味道加上金黃色的脆皮。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dehydrated vegetable"
msgid_plural "dehydrated vegetable"
msgstr[0] "脫水蔬菜乾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "dehydrated vegetable"
msgid ""
"Dehydrated vegetable flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will "
"remain edible for an incredibly long time."
msgstr "脫水過的蔬菜。在合適的儲存下， 這個乾燥食物能夠保持長時間不壞。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "dehydrated vegetable" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. eggplant
#, c-format
msgid "%s, eggplant"
msgid_plural "%s, eggplant"
