#. ~ Conditional name for "dehydrated vegetable" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. eggplant_cut
#, c-format
msgid "%s, cut eggplant"
msgid_plural "%s, cut eggplant"
msgstr[0] "%s，茄子段"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "dehydrated vegetable" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. veggy
#, c-format
msgid "%s, triffid flesh"
msgid_plural "%s, triffid flesh"
msgstr[0] "%s，三尖树肉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dehydrated chili pepper"
msgid_plural "dehydrated chili peppers"
msgstr[0] "脫水辣椒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "dehydrated chili pepper"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated chili pepper.  Still not great, but you can easily ground or "
"mill it into powder."
msgstr "脫水的辣椒。還不算好吃，但你可以很容易地把它研磨或磨成粉末。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dehydrated garlic clove"
msgid_plural "dehydrated garlic cloves"
msgstr[0] "脫水蒜瓣"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "dehydrated garlic clove"
msgid ""
"Dehydrated garlic.  You definitely don't want to eat these like this, but "
"they can be milled or grounded into garlic powder."
msgstr "脫水大蒜。你絕對不會想直接吃的，但它們可以磨碎或磨成蒜粉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dehydrated corn kernels"
msgid_plural "dehydrated corn kernels"
msgstr[0] "脱水玉米粒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "dehydrated corn kernels"
msgid "A handful of dried corn kernels."
msgstr "一把脫水玉米粒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rehydrated vegetable"
msgid_plural "rehydrated vegetable"
msgstr[0] "加水蔬菜乾"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "rehydrated vegetable"
msgid ""
"Reconstituted vegetable flakes, which are much more enjoyable to eat now that "
"they have been rehydrated."
msgstr "沖調過的脫水蔬菜， 重新加了水之後讓這東西變得更好吃了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rehydrated chili pepper"
msgid_plural "rehydrated chili peppers"
msgstr[0] "泡發辣椒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "rehydrated chili pepper"
msgid ""
"Reconstituted chili pepper.  It isn't less spicy after dehydrating and "
"rehydrating but it can be used to flavor your dishes again."
msgstr "泡發好的辣椒。脫水再泡發之後，它的辣度並不會降低，但可以再次用來調味你的料理。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rehydrated garlic clove"
msgid_plural "rehydrated garlic cloves"
msgstr[0] "泡發蒜瓣"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "rehydrated garlic clove"
msgid ""
"Reconstituted garlic cloves, much more edible than its dehydrated state, "
"although the flavor and texture has changed in the process.  Can be used for "
"recipes, albeit its shelf life is shortened by a great margin."
msgstr "泡發的蒜瓣，比乾吃更好吃，雖然風味和口感全變了。儘管蒜瓣泡發後很快會壞，還是能用在食譜中。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rehydrated corn kernels"
msgid_plural "rehydrated corn kernels"
msgstr[0] "復水玉米粒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "rehydrated corn kernels"
msgid ""
"Reconstituted corn kernels, much more enjoyable to eat now that they have "
"been rehydrated."
msgstr "泡發復原過的玉米粒，加了水之後比乾吃更好吃了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetable salad"
msgid_plural "vegetable salad"
msgstr[0] "蔬菜沙拉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetable salad"
msgid "A salad made with all kind of vegetables."
msgstr "各種蔬菜製作的沙拉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dried salad"
msgid_plural "dried salad"
msgstr[0] "乾燥沙拉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "dried salad"
msgid ""
"A dried salad packed in a box with mayonnaise and ketchup.  Add water to "
"enjoy."
msgstr "裝在盒子裡的乾燥沙拉，配有美乃滋醬與番茄醬包。加水即享。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "insta-salad"
msgid_plural "insta-salad"
msgstr[0] "即食沙拉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "insta-salad"
msgid ""
"A dried salad with water added, not very tasty but still a decent "
"substitution for real salad."
msgstr "加水後的乾燥沙拉，不好吃，但仍然是一個像樣的替代品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "baked dahlia root"
msgid_plural "baked dahlia roots"
msgstr[0] "烤大麗菊根"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "baked dahlia root"
msgid ""
"Baking this dahlia root has broken down the starch, making it softer and "
"sweeter."
msgstr "烘烤過的大麗菊根，分解了它的澱粉結構，使其較軟且甜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "roasted salsify"
msgid_plural "roasted salsifies"
msgstr[0] "烤婆羅門參"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "roasted salsify"
msgid ""
"Now that it's been properly cooked, this salsify tastes vaguely like oysters. "
" Makes a great side dish."
msgstr "用正確的方式煮熟之後，這婆羅門參的味道就像牡蠣一樣。是一種很好的配菜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sushi rice"
msgid_plural "sushi rice"
msgstr[0] "壽司米"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "sushi rice"
msgid "A serving of sticky vinegared rice, commonly used in sushi."
msgstr "一份常被用在壽司上的醋飯。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "onigiri"
msgid_plural "onigiri"
msgstr[0] "飯糰"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "onigiri"
msgid ""
"A triangular block of tasty sushi rice with a healthy green vegetable folded "
"around it."
msgstr "一個以健康綠色蔬菜包起美味的壽司飯做成的三角飯糰。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetable hosomaki"
msgid_plural "vegetable hosomaki"
msgstr[0] "蔬菜細捲"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetable hosomaki"
msgid ""
"Delicious chopped vegetables wrapped in tasty sushi rice and rolled up in a "
"healthy green vegetable."
msgstr "以健康綠色蔬菜包起可口的壽司飯與碎菜做成的細捲壽司。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dehydrated alien fungus chunk"
msgid_plural "dehydrated alien fungus chunks"
msgstr[0] "脫水外星真菌塊"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "dehydrated alien fungus chunk"
msgid ""
"Pieces of alien mushroom that have been dried to prevent them from rotting "
"away.  They will still poison you if you eat them."
msgstr "一些外星蘑菇，已做好乾燥處理避免腐敗。吃了還是會中毒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sauerkraut"
msgid_plural "sauerkraut"
msgstr[0] "德國酸菜"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "sauerkraut"
msgid ""
"This crunchy, sour topping made from lettuce or cabbage is perfect for your "
"hot dogs and hamburgers, or, if you're desperate, straight to your stomach."
msgstr "這種脆脆、酸酸的餡料由萵苣或是捲心菜製成， 配上熱狗和漢堡包就最完美了。不過你很餓的話也可以直接吃下肚。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nopalito"
msgid_plural "nopalitos"
msgstr[0] "炒仙人掌"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "nopalito"
msgid "A less prickly version of cactus pads."
msgstr "沒那麼多刺的仙人掌莖葉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled fiddleheads"
msgid_plural "boiled fiddleheads"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的蕨類嫩芽"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled fiddleheads"
msgid "Boiled fiddleheads.  Not bad, but would be better sauteed in butter."
msgstr "煮熟的蕨類嫩芽，嚐起來還不錯，若能用奶油嫩煎，那味道就更香了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sauteed fiddleheads"
msgid_plural "sauteed fiddleheads"
msgstr[0] "嫩煎蕨類嫩芽"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "sauteed fiddleheads"
msgid "Fiddleheads sauteed in fat.  Tender and delicious."
msgstr "蕨類嫩芽用脂肪嫩煎過。鮮嫩可口。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sauteed Jerusalem artichoke"
msgid_plural "sauteed Jerusalem artichokes"
msgstr[0] "炒過的菊芋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "sauteed Jerusalem artichoke"
msgid ""
"Most of this artichoke's inulin has been converted into fructose after "
"cooking, and it now tastes pleasantly sweet."
msgstr "菊芋的菊糖在烹煮後大部分都轉換成了果糖，現在吃起來有種宜人的甜味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled Jerusalem artichoke"
msgid_plural "boiled Jerusalem artichokes"
msgstr[0] "水煮菊芋"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled Jerusalem artichoke"
msgid "Still crunchy but much more palatable than raw, with a slight nutty taste."
msgstr "仍然脆脆的，但比生的可口，有輕微的堅果味道。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked bell pepper"
msgid_plural "cooked bell peppers"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的甜椒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked bell pepper"
msgid ""
"A cored and cooked bell pepper.  It is far more enjoyable now that the seeds "
"are removed."
msgstr "煮熟的去籽甜椒。種子移除掉之後更享受了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "prepared ground nuts"
msgid_plural "prepared ground nuts"
msgstr[0] "處理過的美洲土圞兒"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "prepared ground nuts"
msgid ""
"Ground nuts that have been peeled and then boiled, to destroy the harmful "
"protease inhibitors.  Safe to eat, but need further cooking to become "
"palatable.  Can be used much like potatoes."
msgstr "已經去殼且煮過來去除有害蛋白酶抑制劑的美洲土圞兒。可以安全食用但是需要進一步的烹飪來讓它變好吃。煮起來和馬鈴薯差不多。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled ground nuts"
msgid ""
"Boiled ground nuts.  They look and taste a little like potatoes, but with a "
"slight nutty taste."
msgstr "水煮美洲土圞兒。它們看起來和嘗起來有點像馬鈴薯，不過多了點堅果味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json data/json/snippets/music.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Snippet in category "<musicgenre_noun>"
msgid "salsa"
msgid_plural "salsa"
msgstr[0] "莎莎醬"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "salsa"
msgid ""
"Chopped tomatoes, spices, and any number of other vegetables, used as a "
"condiment in Mexican food.  Not so good on its own, but great in a dish."
msgstr "切碎的番茄、香料和其他蔬菜，在墨西哥菜中用作調味料。單獨食用不太好吃，但放在料理中就很不錯。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Melitzanosalata"
msgid_plural "Melitzanosalata"
msgstr[0] "希腊茄子沙拉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "Melitzanosalata"
msgid ""
"A Greek eggplant dip.  The eggplants are baked until almost falling apart and "
"seasoned with a big help of garlic, then mixed with some oil and acid."
msgstr "希臘茄子沾醬。將茄子烘烤至幾乎軟爛，加入大蒜調味，再拌入一些油和檸檬汁。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sauteed onions"
msgid_plural "sauteed onions"
msgstr[0] "炒洋蔥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "sauteed onions"
msgid "Onions cooked up in oil and spices, often used as a topping or side in dishes."
msgstr "洋蔥在油和香料中煎熟，通常用作料理的佐料或配菜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kombu"
msgid_plural "kombu"
msgstr[0] "昆布"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "kombu"
msgid ""
"An essential component of Japanese cuisine, this dried sheet of seaweed has "
"hardened to the point of inedibility.  Boiled in water, it should make an "
"excellent broth."
msgstr "日本料理中重要的組成之一，這片曬乾的海藻已經硬到無法食用。把它放在水中煮，可以煮出優秀的高湯。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mashed potato"
msgid_plural "mashed potato"
msgstr[0] "馬鈴薯泥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "mashed potato"
msgid "Boiled potatoes mashed together with salt & oil."
msgstr "煮熟的馬鈴薯搗爛後加上鹽和油。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled grain"
msgid_plural "boiled grain"
msgstr[0] "熟麥"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled grain"
msgid ""
"Whole wheat or barley kernels that have been boiled in water.  Very bland on "
"their own, but will do if you can't prepare them in a different way."
msgstr "用水煮熟的大麥或者小麥。吃起來毫無味道，但如果你實在不會料理，也能吃飽吧。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw spaghetti pasta"
msgid_plural "raw spaghetti pasta"
msgstr[0] "生義式細麵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "raw spaghetti pasta"
msgid ""
"A type of pasta usually used when preparing spaghetti.  It could be eaten raw "
"if you're desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr "製作義大利直麵時常用的一種麵食。如果走投無路時，也能生吃，但是煮過後的味道會好很多。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw lasagne pasta"
msgid_plural "raw lasagne pasta"
msgstr[0] "生義式千層麵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "raw lasagne pasta"
msgid ""
"A pasta sheet used in making lasagne.  It could be eaten raw if you're "
"desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr "用來製作千層麵的寬麵皮。如果走投無路時，也能生吃，但是煮過後的味道會好很多。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled noodles"
msgid_plural "boiled noodles"
msgstr[0] "水煮的麵條"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled noodles"
msgid "Fresh wet noodles.  Fairly bland, but fills you up."
msgstr "新鮮濕潤的麵條。沒有調味， 至少能果腹。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw macaroni"
msgid_plural "raw macaroni"
msgstr[0] "生通心粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "raw macaroni"
msgid "It could be eaten raw if you're desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr "雖然你很餓的話也可以直接吃， 但煮過後會更好吃些。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mac & cheese"
msgid_plural "mac & cheese"
msgstr[0] "起司通心麵"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "mac & cheese"
msgid "When the cheese starts flowing, Kraft gets your noodle going."
msgstr "當起司開始融化時， 美味的通心麵就出現了。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flour"
msgid_plural "flour"
msgstr[0] "麵粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "flour"
msgid "This enriched white flour is useful for baking."
msgstr "這個白色的營養強化麵粉在烘焙時很有用。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bread flour"
msgid_plural "bread flour"
msgstr[0] "高筋麵粉"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "bread flour"
msgid ""
"This white flour is useful for adding more stretch and chew to bread while "
"baking."
msgstr "這白色麵粉很適合烘焙時用來增加麵包的韌性和嚼勁。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "oatmeal"
msgid_plural "oatmeal"
msgstr[0] "燕麥片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "oatmeal"
msgid ""
"Dry flakes of flattened grain.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, it also "
"doubles as food for horses while dry."
msgstr "脫水後的乾扁穀類糧食。當煮熟時美味又營養， 當乾燥時它也能兼作馬飼料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked oatmeal"
msgid_plural "cooked oatmeal"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的燕麥片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked oatmeal"
msgid ""
"A filling and nutritious New England classic that has sustained pioneers and "
"captains of industry alike."
msgstr "營養又飽足的新英格蘭經典餐點， 受到開墾者與企業領袖的一致好評。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deluxe cooked oatmeal"
msgid_plural "deluxe cooked oatmeal"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的豪華燕麥片"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
#. ~ Description of "deluxe cooked oatmeal"
