#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bucket"
msgid_plural "buckets"
msgstr[0] "水桶"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "bucket"
msgid ""
"A galvanized bucket for peanuts, chilled wine, iced beer, lobster, crab legs, "
"French fries, animal feed, farm use, tailgating, crafts, planting flowers, "
"holding gift baskets, containing a fruit basket and herbs, loose item "
"storage, or as an ice bucket."
msgstr "鍍鋅桶，可用於裝花生、冰鎮酒、冰啤酒、龍蝦、蟹腿、薯條、動物飼料、農場使用、露營、手工藝、種植花卉、裝禮物籃、裝滿水果和香草、零散物品儲存，或用作冰桶。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large plastic bucket"
msgid_plural "large plastic buckets"
msgstr[0] "大塑膠水桶"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "large plastic bucket"
msgid "A bright orange plastic bucket about the size of your torso."
msgstr "亮橘色塑膠水桶，跟你的軀幹差不多大。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden bucket"
msgid_plural "wooden buckets"
msgstr[0] "木水桶"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden bucket"
msgid ""
"A wooden bucket.  Carefully chiseled out of a hardwood log section, almost "
"like a dugout canoe.  Holds 5 liters of water and has a wooden carrying "
"handle."
msgstr "一個木水桶。就像獨木舟一樣由原木段精心鑿成。可盛載 5 公升的水，並有一個木制把手。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hydration pack"
msgid_plural "hydration packs"
msgstr[0] "水袋背包"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "hydration pack"
msgid ""
"A slim and lightweight insulated plastic bladder worn on the back or within a "
"hydration pouch in a backpack.  It has a large pocket and a capped mouth for "
"filling with liquid, with a hose that allows the wearer to drink hands-free."
msgstr "纖薄輕巧的絕緣塑膠水袋，可穿戴在背上或裝在背包專用袋。它有一個大口袋，有一個方便用注水的蓋子，還有可以讓佩戴者空出雙手喝水的管子。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aluminum can"
msgid_plural "aluminum cans"
msgstr[0] "鋁罐"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "aluminum can"
msgid "An aluminum can, like what soda comes in."
msgstr "一個鋁製罐子， 通常裝過了可樂之類的東西。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "paper carton"
msgid_plural "paper cartons"
msgstr[0] "飲料紙盒"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "paper carton"
msgid ""
"A half-gallon carton constructed of a paper, aluminum, and plastic laminate.  "
"It has a threaded cap to keep liquid from leaking out."
msgstr "由紙、鋁、塑膠壓力板做成的半加侖紙桶。它有一個螺紋蓋，可防止液體洩漏。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "milk carton"
msgid_plural "milk cartons"
msgstr[0] "牛奶紙盒"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "milk carton"
msgid ""
"A half-gallon carton constructed of thick, waterproof paper.  It has a "
"threaded cap to keep the contents from leaking out."
msgstr "由厚防水紙做成的半加侖紙桶。它有一個螺紋蓋，可防止內容物洩漏。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "egg carton"
msgid_plural "egg cartons"
msgstr[0] "蛋盒"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "egg carton"
msgid "A cardboard container with 12 individual cavities for storing eggs."
msgstr "一個帶有12個凹洞的紙板容器，可以存放12個蛋。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vacuum-packed bag"
