msgstr "小型鐵罐，通常用來裝鮪魚。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium tin can"
msgid_plural "medium tin cans"
msgstr[0] "中型鐵罐"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "medium tin can"
msgid "A medium tin can, like what soup comes in."
msgstr "中型鐵罐，通常用來裝湯。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic canteen"
msgid_plural "plastic canteens"
msgstr[0] "塑膠水壺"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic canteen"
msgid ""
"A military-style water canteen with a 1.5 liter capacity.  Commonly worn at "
"the hip."
msgstr "一個軍用水壺， 有 1.5 公升的容量。通常穿在臀部位置。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thermos"
msgid_plural "thermoses"
msgstr[0] "保溫瓶"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "thermos"
msgid ""
"A Thermos brand vacuum flask.  Built for temperature retention, helps keep "
"things hot or cold.  Contains 1 L of liquid."
msgstr "膳魔師牌的真空保溫瓶。專為保溫而設計， 有助於內容物的保溫或保冷。可裝 1 公升的液體。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clay canister"
msgid_plural "clay canisters"
msgstr[0] "陶罐"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "clay canister"
msgid ""
"A fragile clay vessel with a waterproofed hide lid.  It can be used to make "
"crude impact grenades or to store liquid."
msgstr "一个易碎的陶容器，带有防水皮革盖子。可以用来制造简易的撞击引信手雷，或者储存液体。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clay cup"
msgid_plural "clay cups"
msgstr[0] "陶杯"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "clay cup"
msgid "A simple clay cup used for holding liquid."
msgstr "一个简单的盛放液体的陶土杯子。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clay hydria"
msgid_plural "clay hydrias"
msgstr[0] "陶製水罐"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "clay hydria"
msgid ""
"A 15-liter clay pot with three handles for carrying and pouring.  It also has "
"a waterproofed hide lid."
msgstr "一个15升容量的三柄陶罐，用来装运液体或者将其泼出去。还有个防水皮革盖子。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large clay pot"
msgid_plural "large clay pots"
msgstr[0] "陶製大甕"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "large clay pot"
msgid ""
"A bulky and heavy clay pot with a waterproofed hide lid, meant to store "
"water, but can carry other liquids in a pinch."
msgstr "一個笨重的陶製大甕， 配有防水的皮蓋子。可用來裝水， 有需要時也可拿來裝其他液體。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large clay pot (no lid)"
msgid_plural "large clay pots (no lid)"
msgstr[0] "大陶罐（无盖）"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "large clay pot (no lid)"
msgid ""
"A bulky and heavy clay pot, meant to store water, but can carry other liquids "
"in a pinch."
msgstr "一個笨重的陶鍋，可用來裝水，也可拿來裝其他液體。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic cup"
msgid_plural "plastic cups"
msgstr[0] "塑膠杯"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic cup"
msgid "A small, vacuum-formed cup."
msgstr "一只真空包装的杯子。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "foil cup"
msgid_plural "foil cups"
msgstr[0] "鋁箔杯"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "foil cup"
msgid ""
"An improvised foldable cup made from aluminum foil.  It can contain liquid "
"and is usable for boiling water."
msgstr "由铝箔纸制成的简易折叠杯。它可以装液体，也能用来煮沸水。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glass flask"
msgid_plural "glass flasks"
msgstr[0] "玻璃燒瓶"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "glass flask"
msgid "A 250 mL laboratory conical flask, with a rubber stopper."
msgstr "一个 250 毫升的实验室用锥形瓶，附带橡胶塞。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "test tube"
msgid_plural "test tubes"
msgstr[0] "試管"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "test tube"
msgid "A 10 mL laboratory cylindrical test tube, with a rubber stopper."
msgstr "一个 10 毫升的实验室用圆柱形试管，附带橡胶塞。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "beaker"
msgid_plural "beakers"
msgstr[0] "燒杯"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "beaker"
msgid "A 250 mL laboratory beaker.  Basically a cup with delusions of grandeur."
msgstr "一个 250 毫升的实验用烧杯。其实就是个自命不凡的杯子。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "graduated cylinder"
msgid_plural "graduated cylinders"
msgstr[0] "刻度量筒"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "graduated cylinder"
msgid ""
"A tall, narrow glass cylinder with precise markings for measuring fluid "
"quantities.  An important science tool, it is also useful for anal-retentive "
"chefs."
msgstr "一种高而窄的玻璃圆筒，有用于量取液体的精确的刻度。这是一个重要的科学工具，对过于拘泥小节的厨师也很有用。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "microcentrifuge tube"
msgid_plural "microcentrifuge tubes"
msgstr[0] "微量離心管"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "microcentrifuge tube"
msgid ""
"A plastic tube with a little built in snap-cap, a great way to store a tiny "
"amount of liquid.  Great for Jell-O shots if 1 mL is enough of a shot for "
"you.  Cool people call these \"eppies\"."
msgstr "有内置密封盖的塑料管，适合用来存放少量液体。想要只吃一毫升果冻时也可以用它来装。一种比较酷的叫法是 \"eppies\"。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Petri dish"
msgid_plural "Petri dishes"
msgstr[0] "培養皿"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "Petri dish"
msgid ""
"A 90 mm Petri dish, commonly used in labs dealing with microorganisms or "
"tissue samples."
msgstr "90 公釐培養皿，常用於處理微生物或組織樣本的實驗室。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hip flask"
msgid_plural "hip flasks"
msgstr[0] "隨身酒壺"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "hip flask"
msgid ""
"A 250 mL metal flask with a hinged screw-on lid, commonly used to discreetly "
"transport alcohol."
msgstr "一个容量为 250 毫升的金属水壶，有个带铰链的旋盖，是酒鬼们暗地里携带酒精时的首选容器。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "3 L glass jar"
msgid_plural "3 L glass jars"
msgstr[0] "3 公升玻璃罐"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "3 L glass jar"
msgid ""
"A three-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  "
"Preserves its contents from rot until opened."
msgstr "有著 3 公升容量的金屬旋蓋玻璃罐，多用於罐頭。保存內容物以免在打開前腐敗。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "0.5 L glass jar"
msgid_plural "0.5 L glass jars"
msgstr[0] "半公升玻璃罐"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "0.5 L glass jar"
msgid ""
"A half-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  "
"Preserves its contents from rot until opened (assuming it was sterile before "
"sealing)."
msgstr "有著 500 毫升容量的金屬旋蓋玻璃罐，多用於罐頭。保存內容物以免在打開前腐敗（預先消毒過的話）。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic jerrycan"
msgid_plural "plastic jerrycans"
msgstr[0] "塑膠油桶"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic jerrycan"
