"A bulky plastic jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but can carry other liquids in "
"a pinch."
msgstr "一個龐大的塑料油桶， 主要用來裝燃料， 但是也能用來裝其他液體。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steel jerrycan"
msgid_plural "steel jerrycans"
msgstr[0] "金屬油桶"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "steel jerrycan"
msgid "A steel jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but can carry other liquids in a pinch."
msgstr "一個鋼製油桶， 主要用來裝燃料， 但是也能用來裝其他液體。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clay jug"
msgid_plural "clay jugs"
