"A 2.8 ounce squeeze tube, used for storing the likes of silicone caulk, "
"paint, or food dressing."
msgstr "一个 2.8 盎司的可挤压塑料软管，用于存放硅胶填缝剂、油漆或食品调味料之类的东西。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bottle gourd"
msgid_plural "bottle gourds"
msgstr[0] "葫芦"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "bottle gourd"
msgid ""
"A hard, watertight container made from a dried bottle gourd.  Can be used "
"similar to a canteen or just for storing liquids."
msgstr "一个用干葫芦做成的硬质水密容器。可以像水壶一样使用，或者仅仅用于储存液体。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
