#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic paint can"
msgid "A plastic paint can, able to hold a gallon of liquid."
msgstr "塑膠油漆罐，可容納一加侖的液體。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lunchbox"
msgid_plural "lunchboxes"
msgstr[0] "午餐盒"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "lunchbox"
msgid "A plastic box, commonly used to store lunch and utensils to eat it with."
msgstr "一个塑料盒，通常用于装午餐和配套餐具。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pencil case"
msgid_plural "pencil cases"
msgstr[0] "铅笔盒"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "pencil case"
msgid ""
"A small fabric container with a zipper.  Commonly used by children to store "
"school supplies."
msgstr "一个带拉链的小编织袋。通常用于学龄儿童装文具。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cardboard roll"
msgid_plural "cardboard rolls"
msgstr[0] "紙管"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "cardboard roll"
msgid ""
"A small cardboard roll used to conveniently store materials such as tape or "
"toilet paper."
msgstr "一種小型的硬紙捲筒，用于方便地儲存諸如膠帶或捲筒衛生紙等物品。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden tankard"
msgid_plural "wooden tankards"
msgstr[0] "木质水槽"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden tankard"
msgid "A low-tech solution for all your guzzling needs.  Drink responsibly."
msgstr "一个低技术含量的解决方案，满足你所有的暴饮暴食需求。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steel tankard"
msgid_plural "steel tankards"
msgstr[0] "钢质啤酒杯"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "steel tankard"
msgid ""
"While not as historic as one may think, it's considered a finer luxury in "
"these trying times.  Drink responsibly."
msgstr "虽然没有人们想象的那么具有历史意义，但在这个艰难的时期，它被认为是一种更精致的奢侈品。请对饮酒负起责任来！"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pillbox"
msgid_plural "pillboxes"
msgstr[0] "药盒"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "pillbox"
msgid ""
"A simple plastic pill organizer with a small compartment for each day of the "
"week."
msgstr "一个简单的塑料药丸整理器，一周中的每一天都有一个小药丸。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large pillbox"
msgid_plural "large pillboxes"
msgstr[0] "大药盒"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "large pillbox"
msgid ""
"A large plastic pill organizer with compartments for two weeks of daily "
"medication."
msgstr "一个大的塑料药丸收纳器，可以存放两周的每日药物。"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nicotine pouch can"
msgid_plural "nicotine pouch cans"
msgstr[0] "含烟罐"

#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "nicotine pouch can"
msgid ""
"TYNN 15 NICOTINE POUCHES WARNING: This product contains an addictive "
"chemical, nicotine."
msgstr ""
"TYNN 15尼古丁含烟\n"
"警告：本产品含有成瘾性化学物质尼古丁。"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "marksmen's conversion kit"
msgid_plural "marksmen's conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "射手改装套件"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Description of "marksmen's conversion kit"
msgid ""
"This is an expansive cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and "
"emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled high-caliber rifle.  "
"Containing appropriate retool components for a larger than typical given "
"weapon platform, including big-bore upper receiver assemblies, quick-swap "
"sniper barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could "
"be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"这是个宽大的纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的大口径步枪的炫酷图片。包含专为大型模块化武器设计的改装配件，包括大口径的上机匣组件、快拆狙击枪管以及"
"各种配件（如弹匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large rifle conversion kit"
msgid_plural "large rifle conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "长枪改装套件"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Description of "large rifle conversion kit"
msgid ""
"This is a large cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and "
"emblazoned with the stylized image of a large, assembled rifle.  Containing "
"appropriate retool components for a given weapon platform, including "
"high-caliber upper receiver assemblies, quick-swap marksman barrels, and "
"assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber "
"a compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"这是个大的纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的炫酷长枪图片。包含专为模块化武器设计的改装配件，包括大口径的上机匣组件、快拆射手枪管以及各种配件（如弹"
"匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "standard rifle conversion kit"
msgid_plural "standard rifle conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "标准步枪改装套件"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Description of "standard rifle conversion kit"
msgid ""
"This is a sturdy cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings and "
"emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled rifle.  Containing "
"appropriate retool components for an average weapon platform, including upper "
"receiver assemblies, swappable barrels, and assorted extras (such as "
"magazines), its contents could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"这是个硬纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的炫酷步枪图片。装有一般模块化武器都可用的改装配件，包括上机匣组件、可更换枪管以及各种配件（如弹匣等）。这"
"些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "SBR conversion kit"
msgid_plural "SBR conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "短管步枪改装套件"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Description of "SBR conversion kit"
msgid ""
"This is a modestly proportioned cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer "
"markings and emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled, "
"short-barreled rifle.  Containing appropriate retool components for a given "
"weapon platform, including compact upper receiver assemblies, short "
"quick-swap barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents "
"could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"这是个比例适中的纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的短管步枪的炫酷图片。包含为特定模块化武器设计的改装配件，包括紧凑型上机匣组件、快拆短枪枪管以及各"
"种配件（如弹匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "micro-carbine conversion kit"
msgid_plural "micro-carbine conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "微型卡宾枪改装套件"

#: data/json/items/containers/conversions.json
#. ~ Description of "micro-carbine conversion kit"
msgid ""
"This is a relatively small cardboard box, stamped with manufacturer markings "
"and emblazoned with the stylized image of an assembled, extremely compact "
"carbine.  Containing appropriate retool components for a given weapon "
"platform, including adorably small upper receiver assemblies, pistol-length "
"swappable barrels, and assorted extras (such as magazines), its contents "
"could be used to rechamber a compatible rifle."
msgstr ""
"这是个相对较小的纸板箱，印有制造厂商的标志以及一把装满配件的紧凑型卡宾枪的炫酷图片。包含为特定模块化武器设计的改装配件，包括袖珍上机匣组件、可更换的手枪型枪"
"管以及各种配件（如弹匣等）。这些套件可以给对应的武器改造弹仓。"

#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shrink wrapping"
msgid_plural "shrink wrappings"
msgstr[0] "热缩膜"

#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "shrink wrapping"
msgid ""
"Polymer plastic material, that shrinks tightly over whatever it is covering.  "
"Disposable."
msgstr "聚合塑料材料，无论覆盖在任何东西上都能紧密收缩。一次性用品。"

#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "trash can"
msgid ""
"A big trashcan in which you can store, you guessed it, trash.  Made out of "
"plastic, so it's watertight but fragile and won't survive if you try to carry "
"something really heavy in it."
msgstr "一个大垃圾桶，你猜你可以在里面储存，对，垃圾。它由塑料制成，所以是防水的，但塑料垃圾桶很脆弱，如果你试图携带非常重的东西，它很有可能会罢工（物理）。"

#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json data/json/vehicleparts/cargo.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "industrial trash can"
msgid_plural "industrial trash cans"
msgstr[0] "工业垃圾箱"

#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "industrial trash can"
msgid ""
"A really big trashcan in which you can store, you guessed it, trash, ready "
"for the garbage truck to pick up.  Made out of thick plastic, this can was "
"meant for household or industrial use, something you roll up to the curb once "
"a week."
msgstr "一个超大垃圾箱，你可在里面装各种……没错，垃圾，好方便垃圾车来运走。这个垃圾箱由厚塑料制成，可用于居民或工业用途，一般每周拖到路边一次。"

#: data/json/items/containers/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small liquid bag"
msgid_plural "small liquid bags"
