"Small bag, similar to an IV bag, that previously stored a sterilized saline "
"solution.  Whatever it stores now, it is not safe to put in your veins."
msgstr "小袋，类似于静脉输液袋，先前储存灭菌盐水。不管它现在储存了什么，注入你的血管都不安全。"

