msgstr "一个外表粗糙的小塑料盒子，盖子由几个小闩锁牢牢固定。"

#: data/json/items/containers/lab.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "30 gallon barrel"
msgid_plural "30 gallon barrels"
msgstr[0] "30 加侖桶"

#: data/json/items/containers/lab.json
#. ~ Description of "30 gallon barrel"
msgid ""
"A huge plastic barrel with a watertight lid.  It's surface is completely "
"covered with hazard warning labels and, most importantly, a giant red tape, "
"that reads \"IMPURE CATALYST, DO NOT USE, FAILED SAMPLE, DO NOT USE, IMPURE "
"CATALYST…\""
msgstr ""
"一个带水密盖的巨大塑料桶。它的表面完全覆盖着危险警告标签，最重要的是，一个巨大的红色胶带，上面写着“不纯催化剂，请勿使用，样品不合格，请勿使用，不纯催化剂…"
"…”"

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
