msgid_plural "inactive TALON UGVs"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的 TALON 無人地面載具"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive TALON UGV"
msgid ""
"An inactive TALON UGV equipped with an M16A4.  Using this item involves "
"loading the unit with the factory-loaded 5.56x45mm rounds in your inventory "
"(if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever 5.56x45mm you do "
"NOT want to give the robot), turning it on, and placing it on the ground.  If "
"reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the security bot will then identify "
"you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack all enemies with its "
"rifle."
msgstr ""
"一台未激活的鹰爪型无人车，配有一把 M16A4 步枪。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动，并装填你物品栏内的原装 5.56x45mm "
"弹药（如果你只想装填部分弹药，请先把不需装填的弹药移出物品栏）。若成功编程放置，无人车会将你识别为友方，自主行动或跟随你，并采用内置步枪攻击附近的所有敌人。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive TALON UGV"
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive M202A1 TALON UGV"
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive TALON UGV Liberty
#. Edition"
msgid "The security bot beeps affirmatively and begins scanning for hostiles."
msgstr "保全機器人肯定地發出嗶嗶聲並開始搜尋敵蹤。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive TALON UGV"
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive M202A1 TALON UGV"
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive TALON UGV Liberty Edition"
msgid "You misprogram the security bot and it trains its gun on you.  RUN!"
msgstr "你没设好这台安防机器人的程序，它把枪对准了你。快跑吧！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive M202A1 TALON UGV"
msgid_plural "inactive M202A1 TALON UGVs"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的 M202A1 TALON 無人地面載具"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive M202A1 TALON UGV"
msgid ""
"An inactive TALON UGV equipped with an M202A1.  Using this item involves "
"loading the unit with the M235 rockets in your inventory (if you wish to "
"divide your ammunition, set aside whatever M235 rockets you do NOT want to "
"give the robot), turning it on, and placing it on the ground.  If "
"reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the security bot will then identify "
"you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack all enemies with its "
"M202A1."
msgstr ""
"一台未激活的鹰爪型无人车，配有一把 M202A1 火箭筒。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动，并装填你物品栏内的 M235 "
"火箭弹（如果你只想装填部分弹药，请先把不需装填的弹药移出物品栏）。若成功编程放置，无人车会将你识别为友方，自主行动或跟随你，并采用内置 M202A1 "
"火箭筒攻击附近的所有敌人。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive TALON UGV Liberty Edition"
msgid_plural "inactive TALON UGVs Liberty Edition"
msgstr[0] "自由号鹰爪无人车（关）"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive TALON UGV Liberty Edition"
msgid ""
"This bot has had tubes welded above the original guns that allow it to shoot "
"fireworks in order to blind and stun attackers.  With fireworks being harder "
"to come by then the ammo for the original weapons, the best option would be "
"to convert it back to it's original guns.  It should be easy enough to give "
"it back the use of the original M16A4."
msgstr ""
"这台机器人在其原有的枪械上方焊接了发射管，能够发射“烟花”用以致盲并眩晕攻击者。然而，鉴于“烟花”相较于原武器弹药更为稀缺，最明智的选择是将其恢复成原本的武"
"装配置。重新装配回M16A4步枪应当是足够简单的。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive nurse bot"
msgid_plural "inactive nurse bots"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的護士機器人"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive nurse bot"
msgid ""
"An inactive nurse bot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and "
"reactivating its mechanical body.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, "
"the nurse bot will then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow "
"you, and assist you in surgeries."
msgstr "一台未激活的护士机器人。使用该物品以将它放置在地面上并重新激活其机械体。若成功编程放置，护士机器人会将你识别为友方，自主行动或跟随你，并协助你进行手术。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive nurse bot"
msgid "The nurse bot beeps affirmatively and awaits orders."
msgstr "護士機器人肯定地發出嗶嗶聲並等待命令。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive nurse bot"
msgid "You misprogram the nurse bot.  It's looking at you funny."
msgstr "你把護士機器人的程式搞亂了。它機器人的程式搞亂了。它好笑地看著你。"

