msgid "inactive broken cyborg"
msgid_plural "inactive broken cyborgs"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的壞掉的生化人"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive broken cyborg"
msgid ""
"A deactivated broken cyborg, the last shreds of its humanity still rotting "
"away.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and reactivating its "
"mechanical body.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the cyborg will "
"then follow you and attack enemies.  You monster."
msgstr "一台未激活的破损改造人，它最后依然残留着几分人性。使用该物品以将它放置在地面上并重新激活其机械体。若成功编程放置，改造人将跟随你攻击敌人（你这个魔鬼）。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive broken cyborg"
msgid ""
"The broken cyborg rises to the sound of screeching metal and peers around for "
"hostiles."
msgstr "破损的改造人在金属的摩擦声中站起，四处寻找敌人。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive broken cyborg"
msgid "The broken cyborg lets out a howl of agony and attacks you!"
msgstr "破损的改造人发出痛苦的嚎叫并攻击你！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive prototype cyborg"
msgid_plural "inactive prototype cyborgs"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的原型生化人"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive prototype cyborg"
msgid ""
"A deactivated prototype cyborg, glimpses of humanity can still be seen in its "
"empty eyes.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground and "
"reactivating its mechanical body.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, "
"the cyborg will then follow you and attack enemies.  You monster."
msgstr ""
"一台未激活的原型改造人，在他空洞的眼中仍能看到残存的人性。使用该物品以将它放置在地面上并重新激活其机械体。若成功编程放置，改造人将跟随你攻击敌人（你这个魔鬼"
"）。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive prototype cyborg"
msgid ""
"The prototype cyborg rises to the sound of screeching metal and peers around "
"for hostiles."
msgstr "原型改造人在金属的摩擦声中站起，四处寻找敌人。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive prototype cyborg"
msgid "The prototype cyborg lets out a howl of agony and attacks you!"
msgstr "原型改造人发出痛苦的嚎叫并攻击你！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive cleaner bot"
msgid_plural "inactive cleaner bots"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的清潔機器人"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive cleaner bot"
msgid ""
"An inactive cleaner bot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground "
"and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the cleaner bot "
"will respond to future commands."
msgstr "一台未激活的清洁机器人。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，清洁机器人将会遵守你发出的指令。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive cleaner bot"
msgid "The cleaner bot emits a friendly beep and starts scrubbing."
msgstr "清潔機器人發出了友善的嗶嗶聲並開始刷洗。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive cleaner bot"
msgid "The cleaner bot plays an error sound, but starts cleaning anyway."
msgstr "清潔機器人發出錯誤提示音，但還是開始進行清潔。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive demining bot"
msgid_plural "inactive demining bots"
msgstr[0] "排雷机器人（关）"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive demining bot"
msgid ""
"An inactive demining robot.  Using this item involves placing it on the "
"ground and turning it on."
msgstr "一台未激活的排雷机器人。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive demining bot"
msgid "The demining bot whirs and tunnels into the ground."
msgstr "排雷机器人呼啸着钻入地下。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive demining bot"
msgid "The demining bot spins out of control and lunges at you.  Make way!"
msgstr "排雷机器人旋转着钻头——失控了，它向你冲来，快让开！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive skitterbot"
msgid_plural "inactive skitterbots"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的爬蟲機器人"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive skitterbot"
msgid ""
"An inactive skitterbot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground "
"and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the robot will "
"race towards enemies and shock them."
msgstr "一台未激活的掠行无人机。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，掠行无人机将会冲向敌人并电击它们。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive skitterbot"
msgid "The skitterbot gives a quick bow and scurries away."
msgstr "爬蟲機器人快速鞠躬後，又迅速走開了。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive skitterbot"
msgid "The skitterbot darts around you and menacingly clicks its tasers."
msgstr "掠行无人机在你周围快速游走，电击枪发出威胁性的咔嗒声。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive exterminatron"
msgid_plural "inactive exterminatrons"
msgstr[0] "根除者无人机（关闭）"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive exterminatron"
msgid ""
"An inactive Hub 01 exterminatron.  Using this item involves placing it on the "
"ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and reloaded successfully, the "
"robot will track you while providing fire-support."
msgstr "一台未激活的 Hub 01 根除者无人机。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，根除者无人机将在提供火力支持的同时跟随你。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive exterminatron"
msgid ""
"The exterminatron gives a quick bow and starts scanning the horizon for "
"threats."
msgstr "根除者无人机点头致意，随即开始搜剿传感器中所有被视为威胁的目标。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive exterminatron"
msgid "You misprogram the exterminatron and it trains its gun on you.  RUN!"
msgstr "你把机器人编程错了，它把枪口对准了你。快跑！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive lab defense bot"
msgid_plural "inactive lab defense bots"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的實驗室警衛機器人"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive lab defense bot"
msgid ""
"An inactive experimental robot plundered from a science lab.  It resembles a "
"human-sized spider and was designed to deploy manhacks.  Using this item "
"involves placing it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and "
"rewired successfully, the robot will race towards enemies and deploy a "
"variety of experimental devices."
msgstr ""
"一台未激活的从科学实验室里偷来的实验性机器人。它类似一个人类大小的蜘蛛，被用于部署无人机。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，实验性机器人会冲向"
"敌人并部署各种非常\"实验性\"的设备。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive lab defense bot"
msgid "The lab defense bot shudders briefly and skitters away."
msgstr "实验室原型机器人短暂地颤抖，然后跑开了。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive lab defense bot"
msgid ""
"The lab defense bot raises its front legs and shines a multitude of colored "
"lights in your face!"
msgstr "實驗室警衛機器人舉起前腿，用彩色光線照對你的臉照射！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive milspec searchlight"
msgid_plural "inactive milspec searchlights"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的軍規探照燈"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive milspec searchlight"
msgid ""
"An inactive military-grade automated searchlight.  Using this item involves "
"placing it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired "
"successfully, the searchlight will then identify you as an ally, survey the "
"area, and illuminate approaching hostiles.  Seems to have an unhealthy "
"fascination with you."
msgstr ""
"一台未激活的军用级自动探照灯。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，探照灯会将你识别为友方，调查附近区域，并照亮接近的敌人。它似乎对你有一种不健康"
"的迷恋。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive milspec searchlight"
msgid "The searchlight flares up and establishes a perimeter."
msgstr "探照燈亮起來並建立探照範圍。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive milspec searchlight"
msgid "A bright light blinds you as the searchlight refuses to turn away from you."
msgstr "當探照燈鎖定你之後，強烈的燈光讓你睜不開眼睛。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive dispatch"
msgid_plural "inactive dispatches"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的無人機母艦"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive dispatch"
msgid ""
"An inactive Northrop Dispatch, guard model, serving as a mobile assembler and "
"deployer of kamikaze manhacks for defense.  Activate it to place it onto the "
"ground; due to a one-way switch triggered during deactivation, however, it "
"will be nonaggressive, and serves only as a distraction."
msgstr ""
"一台未激活的诺斯罗普派遣者，警卫型号。它通过装配和部署飞锯无人机进行防御。使用它可将其放置在地上，但是由于在关闭时触发了单向开关，它将不具有攻击性，并且只能"
"起到分散敌人注意力的作用。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive dispatch"
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive military dispatch"
msgid "The dispatch whirs onto its legs and searches for a target."
msgstr "派遣者呼啸着移动并开始寻找目标。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive dispatch"
msgid "The dispatch turns on you, whacking at you with its arms!"
msgstr "派遣者转向你，用它的手臂向你猛击过来！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive military dispatch"
msgid_plural "inactive military dispatches"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的軍用母艦"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive military dispatch"
msgid ""
"An inactive Northrop Dispatch, military model, serving as a mobile assembler "
"and deployer of lethal manhacks for combat situations.  Activate it to place "
"it onto the ground; due to a one-way switch triggered during deactivation, "
"however, it will be nonaggressive, and serves only as a distraction."
msgstr ""
"一台未激活的诺斯罗普派遣者，军用型号。它通过装配和部署飞锯无人机进行攻击。使用它可将其放置在地上，但是由于在关闭时触发了单向开关，它将不具有攻击性，并且只能"
"起到分散敌人注意力的作用。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive military dispatch"
msgid "The dispatch turns on you, slashing at you with its arms!"
msgstr "派遣者转向你，用它的手臂向你猛击过来！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive loudspeaker"
msgid_plural "inactive loudspeakers"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的擴音器"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive loudspeaker"
msgid ""
"An inactive automated loudspeaker.  Using this item involves placing it on "
"the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the "
"loudspeaker will continuously shout pre-recorded messages."
msgstr "一台未激活的自动扩音器。使用该物品以将它放置在地上启动。若成功编程放置，扩音器将会不停发出提前录制的声音。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive loudspeaker"
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive loudspeaker"
msgid "The loudspeaker activates and begins its nonstop shouts."
msgstr "扩音器打开了，开始不停发出响亮的喊声。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive taser hack"
msgid_plural "inactive taser hacks"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的電擊槍無人機"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive taser hack"
msgid ""
"An inactive taser hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the "
"air.  This one has a taser and attacks by flying at its target and delivering "
"an electric shock.  Use this item to reprogram and release the taser hack.  "
"Electronics and computer skills determine if the targeting matrix is "
"reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr ""
"一台未啟動的電擊槍無人機。 Manhacks "
"是拳頭大小的可以在空中飛行的機器人。這台配有電擊槍，透過飛向目標並發出電擊來進行攻擊。使用它來編改程式並釋出電擊槍無人機。電子和電腦技能決定了編改搜敵矩陣程"
"式是否能夠成功。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive taser hack"
msgid "The taser hack flies from your hand and surveys the area!"
msgstr "電擊槍無人機從你手中飛出並勘察該區域！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive taser hack"
msgid "You misprogram the taser hack; run!"
msgstr "你把電擊槍無人機的程式搞亂了！快跑！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive trifacet"
msgid_plural "inactive trifacets"
msgstr[0] "trifacets（關閉）"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive trifacet"
msgid ""
"A featureless quartz pyramid that, although obviously artificial, shows no "
"real indication of ever having been an advanced robot.  Perhaps you could try "
"reactivating it?"
msgstr "一个平平无奇的石英金字塔，虽然明显应该是人造产物，但并没有真正的迹象表明它曾经是一只高级的机器人。也许你可以试着重新激活它？"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive triakis"
msgid_plural "inactive triakis"
msgstr[0] "关闭“皱唇鲨”"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive triakis"
msgid ""
"You know this artfully craved piece of gold hued ceramics to be a robot of "
"some kind, but it seems impossible to interact with it."
msgstr "这尊精雕细琢的金黄色陶瓷工艺品看起来像某种机器人，但似乎无法与其互动。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive golden monolith"
msgid_plural "inactive golden monoliths"
msgstr[0] "黄金巨石（关）"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive delta"
msgid_plural "inactive deltas"
msgstr[0] "三角形（关）"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive delta"
msgid ""
"A small piece of inscrutable alloy shaped like an arrow's broadhead.  It "
"looks like a robot boomerang."
msgstr "一小块材质不明的合金，形状类似于箭矢的宽箭头，看起来像一个机器人回力镖。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive security drone"
msgid_plural "inactive security drones"
msgstr[0] "未啟動的保全無人機"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive security drone"
msgid ""
"An inactive security drone.  They are fist-sized robots that fly through the "
"air.  They have a scanner, lens and speaker.  Use this item to reprogram and "
"activate the security drone.  Electronics and computer skill determines if "
"the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr ""
"一台未激活的安防无人机，一种拳头大小的飞行机器人。这台无人机的内部搭载了一台读卡器，摄像机及扬声器。使用它以将其激活。电子学和计算机学等级决定了你将其重新编"
"程的成功几率。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive security drone"
msgid "The security drone flies from your hand and surveys the area!"
msgstr "这台安防无人机从你手上飞起，在附近区域自动寻找目标中！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive security drone"
msgid "You misprogram the drone; it's hostile!"
msgstr "你把無人機的程式搞亂了；變成敵對狀態！"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive camspy"
msgid_plural "inactive camspies"
msgstr[0] "侦察无人机（关）"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive camspy"
msgid ""
"An inactive camspy.  Using this item involves turning it on and launching it. "
" If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the camspy will then keep watch "
"for intruders."
msgstr "一架未激活的侦察无人机。使用该物品以将它启动并释放。若成功编程放置，侦察无人机会持续寻找入侵者。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive camspy"
msgid "The camspy hums and takes to the sky."
msgstr "侦察无人机嗡嗡作响，飞向天空。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive camspy"
msgid "The camspy hums and appears to reconnect to whoever was piloting it before."
msgstr "侦察无人机嗡嗡作响，似乎重新连接到了之前控制它的人。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/nether.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rubber yugg corpse"
msgid_plural "rubber yugg corpses"
msgstr[0] "橡胶状尤格巨噬虫尸体"

#: data/json/items/corpses/nether.json
#. ~ Description of "rubber yugg corpse"
msgid ""
"An oversized hollow tube made of black semi-liquid rubbery substance.  It is "
"vaguely shaped like a yugg."
msgstr "一个由黑色半液态橡胶状物质构成的超大型中空管状物，形状模糊地勾勒出尤格巨噬虫的样子。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/nether.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "massive fleshy tube"
msgid_plural "massive fleshy tubes"
msgstr[0] "巨型肉质管"

#: data/json/items/corpses/nether.json
#. ~ Description of "massive fleshy tube"
msgid ""
"An oversized tube of faintly green raw flesh of nondescript origin.  It is "
"vaguely shaped like a yugg."
msgstr "一根巨大的管状物，由淡绿色的血肉制成，来源不明，形状有点像尤格巨噬虫。"

#: data/json/items/corpses/nether.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jade yugg statue"
msgid_plural "jade yugg statues"
msgstr[0] "尤格巨噬虫玉雕"

#: data/json/items/corpses/nether.json
#. ~ Description of "jade yugg statue"
msgid ""
"A statue of a yugg, made entire out of jade.  If jade was still worth "
"anything this could fetch a fortune.  A shame the world ended."
msgstr "一座尤格巨噬虫的雕像，完全由玉石制成。如果现在玉还值点钱的话，它能让你大赚一笔。可惜大灾变到来了。"

#: data/json/items/furniture/decorative.json
#. ~ Description of "standing mirror"
msgid ""
"A full-length mirror mounted in a sleek aluminum frame.  Metal stand is "
"currently folded."
msgstr "一面全尺寸的穿衣镜，架设在纤薄的铝制框架上。现在金属支架被收起来以节省空间。"

#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden chair"
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to rest "
"your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat a "
"meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again."
msgstr "簡潔的木椅，有四隻腳、座椅和靠背。適合讓你的腳休息，再來張桌子，你就可以邊吃飯邊假裝一切正常了。"

#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden stool"
msgid ""
"A simple stool, with four legs and a seat.  While it's a touch more "
"maneuverable to sit on, the lack of back support means it's significantly "
"less comfortable than a normal chair."
msgstr "一把简单的凳子，有四条腿和一个座位。虽然坐起来更灵活，但缺乏背部支撑意味着它明显不如普通椅子舒适。"

#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
#. ~ Description of "log stool"
msgid ""
"A short section from a tree trunk with one of the flat ends smoothed down.  "
"Makes for a decent place to sit, but not quite a real chair."
msgstr "一小段从树干上取下来的原木，其中一端被磨平。它是块坐下来的好地方，但还算不上一把真正的椅子。"

#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
#. ~ Description of "bar stool"
msgid ""
"A bar stool with a leather seat on a steel support.  Not practical for "
"sleeping at all but it does feel nicer than sitting on the ground."
msgstr "一个酒吧凳子，钢支架上有一个皮革座椅。用来睡觉一点都不实用，但确实比坐在地上感觉更好。"

#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
#. ~ Description of "plywood chair"
msgid ""
"A simple chair made of plywood on a steel frame.  Quite uncomfortable but "
"works for sleeping if it's the only option available."
msgstr "一把简单的椅子，由胶合板固定在钢制框架上制成。相当不舒服，但确实可以用来睡觉，如果这是唯一选择的话。"

#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
#. ~ Description of "black wooden chair"
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to rest "
"your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat a "
"meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again.  This "
"particular chair was painted black."
msgstr "簡潔的木椅，有四隻腳、座椅和靠背。適合讓你的腳休息，再來張桌子，你就可以邊吃飯邊假裝一切正常了。這把椅子上了黑色漆。"

#: data/json/items/furniture/seating.json
#. ~ Description of "white wooden chair"
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to rest "
"your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat a "
"meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again.  This "
"particular chair was painted white."
msgstr "簡潔的木椅，有四隻腳、座椅和靠背。適合讓你的腳休息，再來張桌子，你就可以邊吃飯邊假裝一切正常了。這把椅子上了白色漆。"

#: data/json/items/generic/ammolink.json
#. ~ Description of "ammo belt linkage"
msgid "A small metal linkage from a disintegrating ammo belt."
msgstr "一小塊金屬鏈， 把彈鏈解體後的零件。"

#: data/json/items/generic/ammolink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".223 ammo belt linkage"
msgid_plural ".223 ammo belt linkages"
msgstr[0] ".223 彈鏈帶"

#: data/json/items/generic/ammolink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".308 ammo belt linkage"
msgid_plural ".308 ammo belt linkages"
msgstr[0] ".308 彈鏈帶"

#: data/json/items/generic/ammolink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "40mm grenade belt linkage"
msgid_plural "40mm grenade belt linkages"
msgstr[0] "40mm 榴彈鏈帶"

#: data/json/items/generic/ammolink.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ".50 ammo belt linkage"
msgid_plural ".50 ammo belt linkages"
msgstr[0] ".50 彈鏈帶"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soap dish"
msgid_plural "soap dishes"
msgstr[0] "肥皂盒"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "soap dish"
msgid ""
"A shallow dish for holding a bar of soap.  It has ridges to help drain water "
"away from the dish.  Not the most exciting of items."
msgstr "一塊淺盤，用來放肥皂。有著方便排水的山脊。不是一個令人激動的物品。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shaving razor"
msgid_plural "shaving razors"
msgstr[0] "刮鬍刀"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "shaving razor"
msgid ""
"A razor blade on a comfortable handle.  Much easier to shave with than a "
"loose razor."
msgstr "一個有舒適手把的刮鬚刀片，比單純拿著刮鬚刀片要好用的多。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toothbrush"
msgid_plural "toothbrushes"
msgstr[0] "牙刷"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "toothbrush"
msgid "A plastic brush with soft bristles for cleaning your teeth."
msgstr "帶有軟毛的塑膠刷，用來清潔牙齒。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toothbrush"
msgid ""
"A plastic brush with soft bristles for cleaning your teeth.  It has a cheap, "
"blocky handle and is likely meant to be disposable."
msgstr "帶有軟毛的塑膠刷，用來清潔牙齒。 它的握把看起來很廉價，很可能是一次性使用的。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toothbrush"
msgid ""
"A combination toothbrush and gum massager.  It has an ergonomic silicone "
"grip.  Luxurious!"
msgstr "一根带有牙龈按摩器的复合型牙刷。它有一个符合人体工程学的硅橡胶握把。真是豪华！"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toothbrush"
msgid ""
"A plastic brush with soft bristles for cleaning your teeth.  The blue and "
"white pattern on the handle implies cleanliness."
msgstr "帶有軟毛的塑膠刷，可清潔牙齒。 握把上的藍色和白色圖案代表清潔的意思。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toothbrush"
msgid ""
"A short toothbrush designed for children.  It has a wide-eyed cartoon pony on "
"the handle."
msgstr "一根专为儿童设计的短牙刷。手柄上有一只大眼睛的卡通小马。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toothbrush"
msgid ""
"A short toothbrush designed for children.  It has a grinning red racecar on "
"the handle."
msgstr "一根专为儿童设计的短牙刷。手柄上有一辆笑逐颜开的红色赛车。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tampon"
msgid_plural "tampons"
msgstr[0] "衛生棉條"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "tampon"
msgid "A small cotton tampon with a plastic applicator."
msgstr "带有塑料涂抹器的小棉条。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "tampon"
msgid ""
"A small cotton tampon with a plastic applicator.  Useless for some, an "
"invaluable commodity for others."
msgstr "带有塑料涂抹器的小棉条。 对某些人来说毫无用处，对另一些人来说却是无价的商品。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "tampon"
msgid "A 'light' cotton tampon with a plastic applicator rated for light flows."
msgstr "一种\"轻型\"棉质卫生棉条，带有一个塑料涂抹器，适用于小流量。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "tampon"
msgid "A 'super' cotton tampon with a plastic applicator rated for heavy flows."
msgstr "一种\"超级\"棉质卫生棉条，带有塑料涂抹器，适用于大流量。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "tampon"
msgid "A small, lavender-scented cotton tampon with a plastic applicator."
msgstr "带有薰衣草香味的小棉条，带有塑料涂抹器。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "tampon"
msgid ""
"A small cotton tampon with a plastic applicator proudly claiming to be "
"anti-microbial.  Ultra-fine print indicates that this tampon has no "
"noticeable health benefits compared to others."
msgstr "一个小小的棉质卫生棉条，上面有一个塑料涂抹器，自豪地宣称它是抗菌作用。超细印花表明，与其他卫生棉条相比，这种卫生棉条对健康没有明显的益处。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "tampon"
msgid ""
"An expensive-looking tampon with a fancy, smooth plastic applicator.  The "
"ultra-soft cotton has the appearance of a fluffy cloud."
msgstr "一种看起来很贵的卫生棉条，上面有一个漂亮光滑的塑料涂抹器。这种超柔软的棉花看起来像一团蓬松的云朵。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "tampon"
msgid ""
"A cheap-looking tampon.  The cotton looks rough, the plastic applicator has a "
"few sharp edges, and the string is somehow already knotted."
msgstr "一个看起来很便宜的卫生棉条。 棉花看起来很粗糙，塑料涂抹器有一些锋利的边缘，而且绳子不知何故已经打结了。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "menstrual pad"
msgid_plural "menstrual pads"
msgstr[0] "衛生棉"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "menstrual pad"
msgid "An absorbent pad."
msgstr "一种可以吸收液体的垫子。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "menstrual pad"
msgid ""
"An absorbent menstrual pad.  Unfortunately, not as useful as a bandage as "
"you'd think.  The adhesive is on the side opposite of the absorbent part."
msgstr "能吸水的衛生棉。不幸的是，它不像你想像中的那樣能當繃帶使用。黏合劑在吸水側的反面。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "menstrual pad"
msgid "A small panty-liner only meant for the lightest flows."
msgstr "一款仅适用于最小流量的内裤里衬垫。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "menstrual pad"
msgid "A large menstrual pad meant for use overnight."
msgstr "一个大的月经垫，用于过夜。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "menstrual pad"
msgid ""
"An absorbent menstrual pad with racing stripes, for the fastest flows.  "
"Probably."
msgstr "带有赛车条纹的吸收性月经垫，可能是为最快的经流准备的。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "menstrual pad"
msgid "An absorbent menstrual pad that smells strongly of essential oils."
msgstr "一种吸收性月经垫，闻起来有强烈的精油味。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "menstrual pad"
msgid ""
"A pride-themed menstrual pad in trans flag coloring.  'Men can bleed too!' is "
"proudly written on the packaging."
msgstr "以反式旗帜颜色为主题的骄傲主题月经垫。包装上自豪地写着： 男人也会流血！。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "menstrual pad"
msgid ""
"A cheap menstrual pad.  The cotton somehow looks like sandpaper and is almost "
"see-through thin."
msgstr "便宜的月经垫。 棉花不知何故看起来像砂纸，薄如蝉翼。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "menstrual cup"
msgid_plural "menstrual cups"
msgstr[0] "月亮杯"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "menstrual cup"
msgid ""
"A tiny, washable, flexible plastic cup about the size of a medicine cup for "
"catching menstrual flow."
msgstr "一個小巧、可清洗、有彈性的塑膠杯，大小和藥杯差不多，用來收集經血。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hairbrush"
msgid_plural "hairbrushes"
msgstr[0] "髮刷"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "hairbrush"
msgid "An instrument of hair torture."
msgstr "一个用来折磨头发的工具。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "hairbrush"
msgid "An instrument of hair torture.  There are round safety tips on the bristles."
msgstr "一个用来折磨头发的工具。刚毛尖端有许多圆形的安全帽。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "hairbrush"
msgid "An old-fashioned hair-straightening device with a faux-wood handle."
msgstr "一根带有人造木柄的老式直排头发梳理工具。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "hairbrush"
msgid "A soft, cushioned hairbrush.  The shiny chrome design appears modern."
msgstr "一根柔软的带有软垫的发梳。闪亮的镀铬设计看起来很现代。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "hairbrush"
msgid ""
"A tacky kid's hairbrush.  The cartoon whale on the handle seems friendly "
"enough."
msgstr "一把幼稚的兒童髮刷。握柄上有個看起來很友善的卡通鯨魚。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hair curler"
msgid_plural "hair curlers"
msgstr[0] "捲髮器"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "hair curler"
msgid "A soft plastic cylinder you can wrap a lock of your hair around to curl it."
msgstr "一个柔软的塑料圆柱体，可以用它把你的头发卷曲起来。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dental floss"
msgid_plural "rolls of dental floss"
msgstr[0] "牙線"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "dental floss"
msgid ""
"Twenty-five yards of finely waxed thread wound up inside a plastic container. "
" Perfect for picking bits of smoked meat out of your teeth.  Disassemble to "
"use the thread for something else."
msgstr "25 碼長的塗蠟細線收在塑膠容器內。適合把你齒間的燻肉挑出來。拆解來把縫線另作他用。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "comb"
msgid_plural "combs"
msgstr[0] "梳子"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "comb"
msgid "A grooming tool with teeth for straightening your hair."
msgstr "一个带有许多梳齿的梳妆工具，能用来理顺你的头发。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "comb"
msgid ""
"Somehow, a few teeth have already broken off the end of this otherwise "
"pristine comb."
msgstr "不知為何，這把梳子已经斷了幾颗牙。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "comb"
msgid ""
"A grooming tool with teeth for straightening your hair.  This one is narrow, "
"black and austere."
msgstr "一个带有许多梳齿的梳妆工具，能用来理顺你的头发。这把又窄又黑又朴实。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "comb"
msgid "A comb made of soft plastic.  Its tortoiseshell pattern makes it seem antique."
msgstr "用軟塑膠製成的梳子。 它的玳瑁圖案讓它看起來像古董。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "comb"
msgid "A comb which folds on a hinge, in case you want to look like a greaser."
msgstr "一把带有折叠铰链的梳子，想当油头滑面的时髦少年就带上它吧。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toilet plunger"
msgid_plural "toilet plungers"
msgstr[0] "馬桶吸盤"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "toilet plunger"
msgid "A rubber-tipped tool for unclogging pipes, or a club for an immature survivor."
msgstr "一根用来通管道的带有橡胶头的工具，也是一根新手幸存者所使用的棍子。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "professional plunger"
msgid_plural "professional plungers"
msgstr[0] "專業馬桶疏通器"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "professional plunger"
msgid ""
"This hollow plastic toilet plunger's bell compresses like an accordion.  It "
"is efficient at its intended purpose, and complete rubbish as a weapon."
msgstr "這支中空塑膠馬桶疏通器的鐘形部件可以像手風琴一樣壓縮。它能有效地達到其預期目的，但作為武器完全是垃圾。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toilet paper"
msgid_plural "rolls of toilet paper"
msgstr[0] "衛生紙"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "toilet paper"
msgid "A luxurious remnant of civilization."
msgstr "一卷人类文明最后的奢华遗物。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid ""
"Imagine the thinnest, most disposable paper you could possibly make.  Now "
"imagine something thinner than that."
msgstr "用尽你的想象力想象一下最薄、最一次性的厕纸。然后再想象一下比这更薄的东西。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid ""
"This roll of toilet paper is two-ply and quilted, for vandalizing houses more "
"comfortably than ever."
msgstr "这卷厕纸采用双层纸张，中间还加了衬垫，用来破坏房屋比以往任何时候都更舒适。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid "This brand of toilet paper is designed to dissolve completely in water!"
msgstr "这个牌子的厕纸号称完全溶于水！"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid "Images of your least favorite politician are printed on each individual sheet."
msgstr "你最讨厌的政客的照片被印在每一张厕纸上。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid ""
"A luxurious remnant of civilization.  The splinters of unprocessed wood "
"visible in this one make it seem less luxurious, though."
msgstr "一卷人类文明最后的奢华遗物。不过，其中可见的未经加工的木屑使它看起来不那么奢华了。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hair dryer"
msgid_plural "hair dryers"
msgstr[0] "吹風機"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "hair dryer"
msgid ""
"This tool dries your hair by pushing air through a coil of hot wires.  The "
"heat can be toggled on and off."
msgstr "这种工具通过一卷热线来加热空气并将其吹出，可以用于吹干头发，也可以关闭加热功能直接吹风。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "curling iron"
msgid_plural "curling irons"
msgstr[0] "捲髮鉗"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "curling iron"
msgid ""
"A wand made of heat-resistant ceramics.  When plugged into an outlet, it is "
"hot enough to shape your hair into curls.  Too bad the power's out."
msgstr "一根采用耐热陶瓷制成的短棒。当插入插座后，它能够加热到使你的头发卷曲的温度。可惜停电了。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toilet brush"
msgid_plural "toilet brushes"
msgstr[0] "馬桶刷"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "toilet brush"
msgid ""
"Zombies cannot be intimidated or humiliated, so this stiff brush is only "
"useful for scouring toilet bowls."
msgstr "殭屍不會害怕這東西或嫌它骯髒，所以這種堅硬的刷子只能用來刷洗馬桶。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lice comb"
msgid_plural "lice combs"
msgstr[0] "去蝨梳"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "lice comb"
msgid ""
"A stainless-steel comb with spiral grooved teeth designed to remove pesky "
"parasites from hair.  Even just thinking about it makes you itch."
msgstr "一把带有密集螺旋槽齿的不锈钢排梳，用于去除毛发中讨厌的跳蚤。即使只是想一想也会让你浑身发痒。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bath toy"
msgid_plural "bath toys"
msgstr[0] "泡澡玩具"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "bath toy"
#. ~ Snippet of item "bath toy"
msgid "A plastic floating bath toy."
msgstr "一個塑膠製可以飄浮在浴缸上的玩具。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "bath toy"
msgid "A yellow rubber duck.  Designed to dropped in the bath."
msgstr "一只黄色的橡皮鸭。可以丢进浴缸里。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "bath toy"
msgid "A black rubber duck with large white eyes.  Designed to dropped in the bath."
msgstr "一只黑色的橡皮鸭，长着一双大大的白眼睛。可以丢进浴缸里。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "bath toy"
msgid "A small green dinosaur with a wide grin.  Designed for bath time."
msgstr "一只咧嘴笑的绿色小恐龙。专为泡澡时间设计。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electric toothbrush"
msgid_plural "electric toothbrushes"
msgstr[0] "電動牙刷"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "electric toothbrush"
msgid "A plastic electric toothbrush."
msgstr "一把塑膠製電動牙刷。"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic soap bottle"
