#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "merch"
msgid_plural "merch"
msgstr[0] "商票"

#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
#. ~ Description of "merch"
msgid ""
"The Free Merchant Certified Note, also known by names such as a 'c-note' or "
"'merch', is a currency based on old American bills.  Fifty dollar bills and "
"larger are printed with a promissory note signed by the treasurer of the Free "
"Merchants, along with a complex design.  The note explains that this can be "
"exchanged for food, water, and other services through the Free Merchants in "
"the Refugee Center."
msgstr ""
"自由商會信用票也被稱為「C票」或「商票」，是基於舊美鈔的貨幣。五十美元或更大幣值的鈔票擁有復雜的設計，並且由自由商會的財務主管簽署。這上面說，這可以與難民中"
"心的自由商會換取食物，水和其他服務。"

#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
