#. ~ Description of ".22 pipe rifle"
#. ~ Description of gun "pipe rifle: .38 Special"
#. ~ Description of "pipe rifle: .38 Special"
#. ~ Description of gun ".44 Magnum pipe rifle"
#. ~ Description of ".44 Magnum pipe rifle"
msgid ""
"A home-made rifle.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer to "
"strike the single round it holds."
msgstr "一把土製的步槍。簡單地把鋼管連接到有擊鎚的彈倉, 能夠進行單發射擊。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] "捕猎步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of gun "tube fed varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "tube fed varmint rifle"
msgid ""
"A lightweight and modular pistol caliber hunting carbine, firing the low "
"power .22 LR cartridge.  Before the Cataclysm, a mix of high customizability, "
"cheap ammunition, and low recoil made this a very popular varmint rifle among "
"civilian shooters."
msgstr "一把轻便模块化的手枪弹狩猎卡宾枪，发射.22LR弹药。在大灾变前，因高度可定制性、廉价的弹药和低后坐力而使其成为平民射手间十分流行的猎人步枪。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "varmint rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "varmint rifle"
msgid "Ruger 10/22 rifle"
msgid_plural "Ruger 10/22 rifles"
msgstr[0] "儒格 10/22 步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "varmint rifle" of gun "Ruger 10/22 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger 10/22 rifle" of item "varmint rifle"
msgid ""
"A combination of negligible recoil, high customization, and inexpensive "
"ammunition made the Ruger 10/22 a popular choice among enthusiasts and small "
"game hunters.  Even though it fires the weak .22 round, it's perfectly "
"capable of killing."
msgstr ""
"儒格 10/22 結合了低後座力、可模組化改造與彈藥相當便宜的特性, 讓它受到一些槍枝狂熱份子的喜愛。雖然是使用威力較低的 .22 彈藥, "
"但對殺人來說是綽綽有餘。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "full-auto varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "full-auto varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] "全自动 小型狩猎步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "full-auto varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "full-auto varmint rifle"
msgid "A handy and lightweight rifle, modified to fire semi and full auto."
msgstr "一款轻便且易于操作的步枪，经过改造可选择半自动和全自动射击。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "full-auto varmint rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "full-auto varmint rifle"
msgid "full-auto Ruger 10/22 rifle"
msgid_plural "full-auto Ruger 10/22 rifles"
msgstr[0] "全自動儒格 10/22 步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "full-auto varmint rifle" of gun "full-auto Ruger
#. 10/22 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "full-auto Ruger 10/22 rifle" of item "full-auto
#. varmint rifle"
msgid ""
"A Ruger 10/22 modified post-Cataclysm to selective fire.  While the .22 round "
"isn't very powerful, full auto makes it a lot more effective, and still "
"easily controllable in full auto."
msgstr "这是一支灾变后改装成可选择射击模式的鲁格10/22步枪。尽管.22口径子弹威力有限，但全自动射击使其威力大增，且在此模式下仍易于控制。"

