#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".22 caliber revolver"
msgid_plural ".22 caliber revolvers"
msgstr[0] ".22 口径左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".22 caliber revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".22 caliber revolver"
msgid "A comparatively dainty revolver, chambered for 8 tiny rounds of .22 LR."
msgstr "一支比较精致的左轮手枪，可装8发 .22 口径的小子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 caliber revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".22 caliber revolver"
msgid "Ruger LCR .22 revolver"
msgid_plural "Ruger LCR .22 revolvers"
msgstr[0] "儒格 LCR .22 左輪手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".22 caliber revolver" of gun "Ruger LCR .22
#. revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger LCR .22 revolver" of item ".22 caliber
#. revolver"
#. ~ Description of gun "conceal-carry six-shooter"
#. ~ Description of "conceal-carry six-shooter"
msgid ""
"A compact, double-action-only revolver designed for easy concealment, with a "
"stainless steel cylinder and aluminum frame."
msgstr "一把為隱藏性而設計的小型、純雙動扳機左輪手槍, 它有一個不銹鋼旋轉彈膛以及鋁製框架。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "firefly training pistol"
msgid_plural "firefly training pistols"
msgstr[0] "GSG 训练手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "firefly training pistol"
#. ~ Description of "firefly training pistol"
msgid ""
"A medium sized, .22 caliber semi-automatic pistol, for training with a pistol "
"similar to more powerful pistols.  Built from aluminum and polymer "
"components, the weapon is lightweight and concealable, but its chambering is "
"not very powerful."
msgstr "一把中等大小，.22口径的半自动手枪，用于在手枪训练中代替相似的，威力更大的手枪。整把枪由铝与聚合物材料制造而成，轻便又易携带，但其使用的弹药威力较小。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "firefly training pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "firefly training pistol"
msgid "GSG Firefly"
msgid_plural "GSG Fireflies"
msgstr[0] "GSG \"萤火虫\"手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "firefly training pistol" of gun "GSG Firefly"
#. ~ Description of variant "GSG Firefly" of item "firefly training pistol"
msgid ""
"The GSG firefly is a .22 semi-automatic handgun.  While the GSG Firefly "
"started off as the SIG Mosquito, after the Mosquito ceased production, German "
"Sport Guns picked it up and renamed it to the Firefly."
msgstr ""
"GSG \"萤火虫\"手枪是一把 .22 口径的半自动手枪。虽然 GSG "
"\"萤火虫\"手枪源自西格\"蚊\"式手枪，但在\"蚊\"式手枪停产后，德国运动枪械公司将其收购并更名为\"萤火虫\"。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Walther training pistol"
msgid_plural "Walther training pistols"
msgstr[0] "瓦尔特训练手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Walther training pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Walther training pistol"
msgid ""
"A dainty training pistol offered by the Walther Arms company, making use of "
"the .22 LR cartridge, for training on a pistol very similar to more powerful "
"pistols."
msgstr "瓦尔特武器公司所生产的一种训练手枪，使用.22 LR弹药，用于训练以适应威力更大的手枪。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Walther training pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Walther training pistol"
msgid "Walther P22 pistol"
msgid_plural "Walther P22 pistols"
msgstr[0] "瓦尔特P22手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Walther training pistol" of gun "Walther P22
#. pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Walther P22 pistol" of item "Walther training
#. pistol"
msgid ""
"The Walther P22 is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol intended for "
"training with a platform very similar to more defensive handguns.  It is "
"about half the size of most Walthers.  It is made mostly with plastic, with "
"the slide and key components (other than the barrel) being made of die-cast "
"zinc alloy."
msgstr ""
"瓦尔特 P22 "
"手枪是一种采用反冲式枪机的半自动手枪，用于训练平台，非常类似于防御性手枪。只有其他瓦尔特手枪型号一半的大小。基本由塑料制造，只有套筒和一些关键部件由锌合金压"
"铸而成。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "high capacity handgun"
msgid_plural "high capacity handguns"
msgstr[0] "高容量手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "high capacity handgun"
#. ~ Description of "high capacity handgun"
msgid ""
"A large capacity handgun, chambered in .22 and feeding from quad stack "
"magazines.  Used both recreationally and in competition."
msgstr "这是一种大容量手枪，口径为.22，采用四排弹匣供弹。既适用于休闲射击，也常见于竞技比赛之中。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "high capacity handgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "high capacity handgun"
msgid "CP33"
msgid_plural "CP33s"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec CP33半自动手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "high capacity handgun" of gun "CP33"
#. ~ Description of variant "CP33" of item "high capacity handgun"
msgid ""
"The Kel-Tec CP33, standing for Competition Pistol 33, is a .22 semi automatic "
"pistol targeted towards competition shooters and recreational shooters alike, "
"with the ability to feed from 33 round quad stack magazines, or even 50 with "
"an extension.  While in a fairly weak cartridge, the capacity makes it quite "
"a formidable weapon in the right hands."
msgstr ""
"Kel-Tec "
"CP33手枪，全称为“竞赛手枪33”，是一款面向竞赛射手及休闲射击爱好者设计的.22口径半自动手枪。该枪可使用33"
"发四排弹匣供弹，装上扩容弹匣底板后甚至可达50发容量。尽管使用的子弹威力相对较弱，但在合适的使用者手中，凭借其高容量的特点，仍是一款相当有威力的武器。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ruger target pistol"
msgid_plural "Ruger target pistols"
msgstr[0] "儒格打靶手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger target pistol"
msgid ""
"A light and handy .22 LR handgun from Ruger, this handgun is one of the most "
"popular .22 handguns ever created."
msgstr "鲁格公司出品的一款轻巧便捷的.22 LR口径手枪，是史上最受欢迎的.22口径手枪之一。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ruger target pistol"
msgid "Ruger Mark II"
msgid_plural "Ruger Mark IIs"
msgstr[0] "儒格 MK II 手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger target pistol" of gun "Ruger Mark II"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger Mark II" of item "Ruger target pistol"
msgid ""
"The 2nd version of the Ruger Standard, which replaced production of the "
"Standard in 1982 and continued until 2005 with the main feature of having "
"adjustable sights.  Features a 5.5 inch barrel and feeds from a 10 round "
"magazine."
msgstr ""
"鲁格标准手枪的第二代产品，自1982年起接替了初代标准手枪的生产，直至2005年，其主要特点是配备了可调节瞄准具。该手枪具有5.5英寸(约14厘米)"
"枪管，并使用10发弹匣供弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ruger target pistol"
msgid "Ruger Mark III"
msgid_plural "Ruger Mark IIIs"
msgstr[0] "儒格 MK III 手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger target pistol" of gun "Ruger Mark III"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger Mark III" of item "Ruger target pistol"
msgid ""
"The 3rd version of the Ruger Standard, which replaced production of the Mark "
"II in 2005 and continued until 2016.  Features a 5.5 inch barrel and feeds "
"from a 10 round magazine."
msgstr ""
"这是鲁格标准手枪的第三代产品，自2005年起取代了马克II的生产，并一直持续到2016年。该手枪配备有一个5.5英寸(约14厘米)的枪管，并使用10"
"发弹匣供弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Ruger target pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ruger target pistol"
msgid "Ruger Mark IV"
msgid_plural "Ruger Mark IVs"
msgstr[0] "儒格 MK IV 手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger target pistol" of gun "Ruger Mark IV"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger Mark IV" of item "Ruger target pistol"
msgid ""
"The 4th, and most modern version of the Ruger Standard.  Still in production "
"since 2016, and has a simplified disassembly feature.  Has a 5.5 inch barrel "
"and feeds from a 10 round magazine."
msgstr "鲁格标准手枪的第四代，也是最新的一代，自2016年起持续生产至今，特点在于简化了拆卸过程。该型号配备5.5英寸(约14厘米)枪管，并使用10发弹匣供弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "pump action varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "pump action varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] "泵动 小型狩猎步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "pump action varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "pump action varmint rifle"
msgid ""
"A lightweight, wood framed pump action rifle, holding 15 rounds of .22 with "
"an 18 inch barrel.  While pump actions tend to be largely shotguns, they can "
"be made in calibers such as .22 LR."
msgstr ""
"一把轻便的木制枪身泵动步枪，使用18英寸(约46厘米)枪管，可容纳15发.22 弹。虽然采用泵动式结构的大多是霰弹枪，但它们也可以使用诸如 .22 "
"LR这样的口径。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "pump action varmint rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "pump action varmint rifle"
msgid "Rossi Gallery"
msgid_plural "Rossi Galleries"
msgstr[0] "罗西 画廊枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pump action varmint rifle" of gun "Rossi Gallery"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi Gallery" of item "pump action varmint
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"A modern take on the Winchester 1890, the Rossi Gallery is a .22 LR rifle, "
"notably using a pump action.  Much like a pump action shotgun, the magazine "
"tube is below its 18 inch barrel and can hold 15 rounds.  While pump actions "
"are quite often associated with shotguns, the mechanism can be applied to "
"rifles as well, though in practice it's limited to .22 LR."
msgstr ""
"罗斯画廊步枪是温彻斯特1890的现代改良版，采用.22 "
"LR口径，最显著的特点是泵动式设计。与泵动霰弹枪类似，它的18英寸(46cm)枪管下方装有弹仓管，可容纳15"
"发子弹。虽然泵动机构通常与霰弹枪挂钩，但这种机制同样适用于步枪——尽管实际上也仅限于.22 LR口径。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".22 six-shooter"
msgid_plural ".22 six-shooters"
msgstr[0] ".22 六发左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".22 six-shooter"
#. ~ Description of ".22 six-shooter"
msgid "A revolver chambered in .22 LR, with 6 shots and a 6.5 inch barrel."
msgstr "一把 .22 LR口径的左轮手枪，使用6.5英寸(约17厘米)长的枪管，可容纳6发子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 six-shooter"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".22 six-shooter"
msgid "Heritage Rough Rider 6.5\""
msgid_plural "Heritage Rough Riders 6.5\""
msgstr[0] "遗产牌粗犷骑士6.5英寸左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".22 six-shooter" of gun "Heritage Rough Rider
#. 6.5""
#. ~ Description of variant "Heritage Rough Rider 6.5"" of item ".22 six-
#. shooter"
msgid ""
"A cheap, single action revolver chambered in .22 LR.  While it makes for a "
"handy plinking gun, the single action mechanism, size of the firearm, "
"combined with the lack of a swing out cylinder makes for a less than ideal "
"zombie fighting handgun."
msgstr ""
"一把廉价的单动式左轮手枪，使用.22 "
"LR口径的子弹。虽然它作为打靶练习枪还凑合，但单动式击发、枪支口径以及缺少可甩出的弹仓，使得它在对付丧尸时并不是把理想好枪。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "large .22 six-shooter"
msgid_plural "large .22 six-shooters"
msgstr[0] "大号.22六发左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "large .22 six-shooter"
#. ~ Description of "large .22 six-shooter"
msgid "A revolver chambered in .22 LR, with 6 shots and a 9 inch barrel."
msgstr "一把 .22 LR口径的左轮手枪，使用9英寸(约23厘米)长的枪管，可容纳6发子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "large .22 six-shooter"
#. ~ Variant name of item "large .22 six-shooter"
msgid "Heritage Rough Rider 9\""
msgid_plural "Heritage Rough Riders 9\""
msgstr[0] "遗产牌粗犷骑士9英寸左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "large .22 six-shooter" of gun "Heritage Rough
#. Rider 9""
#. ~ Description of variant "Heritage Rough Rider 9"" of item "large .22 six-
#. shooter"
msgid ""
"A cheap, single action revolver chambered in .22 LR.  While it makes for a "
"handy plinking gun, the single action mechanism, size of the firearm, "
"combined with the lack of a swing out cylinder makes for a less than ideal "
"zombie fighting handgun, even with the slightly increased performance from "
"the longer barrel."
msgstr ""
"一把廉价的单动式左轮手枪，使用.22 "
"LR口径的子弹。虽然它作为打靶练习枪还凑合，但单动式击发、枪支口径以及缺少可甩出的弹仓，使得它在对付丧尸时并不是把理想好枪。即使更长的枪管提升了一点性能，也"
"只是杯水车薪。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".22 1911 pistol"
msgid_plural ".22 1911 pistols"
msgstr[0] ".22 1911 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".22 1911 pistol"
#. ~ Description of ".22 1911 pistol"
msgid "A 1911 in .22 LR, with a 4 1/4\" barrel, and feeding from 10 round magazines."
msgstr "一把.22 LR口径的1911手枪，配有4.25英寸(约11厘米)的枪管，并使用10发弹匣供弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 1911 pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".22 1911 pistol"
msgid "1911-22"
msgid_plural "1911-22s"
msgstr[0] "1911-22 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".22 1911 pistol" of gun "1911-22"
#. ~ Description of variant "1911-22" of item ".22 1911 pistol"
msgid ""
"A 1911 handgun with \"1911-22\" stamped on the slide.  While .22 LR 1911s "
"were first devised as a training aid for US soldiers, it found large civilian "
"use from concealed carry to plinking thanks to the readily available "
"ammunition and familiar platform."
msgstr ""
"滑盖上刻有“1911-22”的1911 "
".22口径手枪。这款手枪最初是为了训练美国士兵而设计的，但由于弹药充足且枪型熟悉，很快在民间流行起来，无论是便携防身还是休闲打靶都非常合适。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "small game lever-action rifle"
msgid_plural "small game lever-action rifles"
msgstr[0] "小型狩猎杠杆式步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "small game lever-action rifle"
msgid ""
"A .22 Long Rifle lever-action rifle, which holds 15 rounds of ammo.  While "
"quite useful against small game, its effectiveness isn't as great against the "
"undead."
msgstr "一支.22 LR口径的杠杆式步枪，可装载15发子弹。虽然它对小型猎物非常有效，但对丧尸的杀伤力就显得有些不足了。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "small game lever-action rifle"
msgid "Rossi Rio Bravo"
msgid_plural "Rossi Rio Bravos"
msgstr[0] "罗西 Rio Bravo 杠杆式步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "small game lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi Rio
#. Bravo"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi Rio Bravo" of item "small game lever-action
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Rio Bravo features an 18\" barrel "
"with 15 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is loaded from the front "
"of the rifle.  The mechanical origins date back decades, being based off of "
"Rossi's R92 series of rifles which themselves were based off of the "
"Winchester 1892."
msgstr ""
"Rio Bravo是一款现代化的.22 "
"LR杠杆式步枪，其特点是18英寸(约46厘米)枪管，管状弹匣中装有15发弹药，从步枪前部装载。机械起源可以追溯到几十年前，基于Rossi的R92"
"系列步枪，而该系列步枪本身基于温彻斯特1892。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "small game lever-action rifle"
msgid ""
"A .22 Long Rifle lever-action rifle, which holds 16 rounds of ammo.  While "
"quite useful against small game, its effectiveness isn't as great against the "
"undead."
msgstr "一支.22 LR口径的杠杆式长步枪，可装载15发子弹。虽然它对小型猎物非常有效，但对丧尸的杀伤力就显得有些不足了。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "small game lever-action rifle"
msgid "Henry Golden Boy"
msgid_plural "Henry Golden Boys"
msgstr[0] "亨利黄金男孩步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "small game lever-action rifle" of gun "Henry
#. Golden Boy"
#. ~ Description of variant "Henry Golden Boy" of item "small game lever-
#. action rifle"
msgid ""
"A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Henry Golden Boy features an 20\" "
"octagonal barrel with 16 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is loaded "
"from the front of the rifle.  It fairly resembles the original Henry Model "
"1860 with its brass colored receiver, though with wooden furniture at the "
"front, and without a doubt using modern manufacturing."
msgstr ""
"亨利黄金男孩是一款现代化的.22 "
"LR杠杆式步枪，其特点是20英寸(约51厘米)的八角形枪管，管状弹匣中装有16发弹药，从步枪前部装载。它与原始的亨利M1860"
"步枪非常相似，带有黄铜色的接收器，但前部有木制装具，毫无疑问使用了现代制造工艺。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "tube fed varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "tube fed varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] "管式 小型狩猎步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "tube fed varmint rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "tube fed varmint rifle"
msgid "Marlin Model 60"
msgid_plural "Marlin Model 60s"
msgstr[0] "马林 Model 10 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "tube fed varmint rifle" of gun "Marlin Model 60"
#. ~ Description of variant "Marlin Model 60" of item "tube fed varmint rifle"
msgid ""
"The Model 60 is a semi-automatic rifle chambered in .22 LR, and looks awfully "
"familiar to a 10/22.  However, instead of a detachable magazine, it features "
"a tubular magazine below the barrel.  While out of production, a large number "
"of them have been made since the 60s, making it a very commonplace rifle."
msgstr ""
"Model 60是一款.22 LR口径的半自动步枪，看起来与鲁格 "
"10/22步枪非常相似。不过，它没有可拆卸弹匣，而是在枪管下方装有一个管状弹仓。虽然已经停产，但自60"
"年代以来生产了大量这种步枪，使其成为一种非常常见的枪支。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "high capacity revolver"
msgid_plural "high capacity revolvers"
msgstr[0] "大弹容左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "high capacity revolver"
#. ~ Description of "high capacity revolver"
msgid "A revolver chambered in .22 LR, with 10 shots and a 6 inch barrel."
msgstr "一把 .22 LR口径的左轮手枪，使用6英寸(约23厘米)长的枪管，可容纳10发子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "high capacity revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item "high capacity revolver"
msgid "S&W 617"
msgid_plural "S&W 617s"
msgstr[0] "S&W 617 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "high capacity revolver" of gun "S&W 617"
#. ~ Description of variant "S&W 617" of item "high capacity revolver"
msgid ""
"The S&W 617 is a fine revolver, chambered in .22 LR.  However, instead of "
"more common 6 rounds revolvers come in, this revolver has a 10 round capacity "
"cylinder.  While still a revolver, and to boot a revolver in .22 LR, 10 is "
"still bigger than 6."
msgstr ""
"S&W 617型左轮手枪堪称.22 LR口径中的精品。与普通六发弹巢不同，这款左轮配备了十发容量的转轮——虽然仍是.22 "
"LR口径的左轮，但十发终究比六发来得实在。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".22 plinking handgun"
msgid_plural ".22 plinking handguns"
msgstr[0] ".22 练习手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".22 plinking handgun"
#. ~ Description of ".22 plinking handgun"
msgid "A small handgun with a short barrel.  Feeds from 10 round magazines."
msgstr "一把短枪管的小手枪，使用10发弹匣供弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 plinking handgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".22 plinking handgun"
msgid "Ruger SR22"
msgid_plural "Ruger SR22s"
msgstr[0] "鲁格 SR22手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".22 plinking handgun" of gun "Ruger SR22"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger SR22" of item ".22 plinking handgun"
msgid ""
"A very popular handgun, the SR22 is a more conventional pistol than Ruger's "
"other famous .22 LR handguns, the Ruger Standards.  While .22 LR is still "
"capable of killing, the very short barrel brings that into question."
msgstr ""
"SR22作为一款广受欢迎的.22 LR手枪，比鲁格公司另一款著名的\"标准型\"更符合传统手枪设计。虽然.22 "
"LR子弹仍具杀伤力，但过短的枪管不禁让人对此产生存疑。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Glock 44"
msgid_plural "Glock 44s"
msgstr[0] "格洛克 44 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 44"
#. ~ Description of "Glock 44"
msgid ""
"A Glock chambered in .22LR.  While effective against paper targets and "
"rodents, it will struggle against the walking dead."
msgstr "一款发射.22LR口径的格洛克手枪。打打纸靶子和老鼠还行，但拿来打丧尸就有点吃力了。"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "modern varmint rifle"
msgid_plural "modern varmint rifles"
msgstr[0] "modern varmint rifles"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "modern varmint rifle"
#. ~ Description of "modern varmint rifle"
msgid ""
"Resembling a military rifle, this firearm is made from polymer.  Despite its "
"looks, it only shoots .22 LR in a semi-automatic fashion."
msgstr ""
"Resembling a military rifle, this firearm is made from polymer.  Despite its "
"looks, it only shoots .22 LR in a semi-automatic fashion."

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "modern varmint rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "modern varmint rifle"
msgid "M&P 15-22"
msgid_plural "M&P 15-22s"
msgstr[0] "M&P 15-22s"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant "modern varmint rifle" of gun "M&P 15-22"
#. ~ Description of variant "M&P 15-22" of item "modern varmint rifle"
msgid ""
"A .22 LR version of the M&P-15, this rifle resembles an AR-15 in form and "
"function, but does not have the ability for compatible uppers or lowers."
msgstr ""
"A .22 LR version of the M&P-15, this rifle resembles an AR-15 in form and "
"function, but does not have the ability for compatible uppers or lowers."

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "AR-15"
msgid_plural "AR-15s"
msgstr[0] "AR-15 自動步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "AR-15"
#. ~ Description of "AR-15"
msgid ""
"This ubiquitous rifle is the forefather of the M16 rifle series.  It is "
"lightweight and accurate, but will malfunction if not properly maintained.  "
"This one is a semi-automatic civilian version."
msgstr "這把普及的步槍是 M16 步槍系列的始祖。它重量輕，準確，但如果維護不當會常發生故障。這一把是半自動民用版。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json data/json/items/gun/44.json
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json data/json/items/gun/robofac_gun.json
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Location of gun mod
msgid "bore"
msgstr "槍膛"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "AR \"pistol\""
msgid_plural "AR \"pistols\""
msgstr[0] "AR \"pistols\""

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "AR "pistol""
#. ~ Description of "AR "pistol""
msgid ""
"The common AR-15 platform, with its stock removed and buffer tube covered by "
"a thick, padded sleeve that allows the user to brace it like a rifle.  AR "
"pistols lack stocks, or have arm braces due to restrictions on short barreled "
"rifles, and so without a stock, they're legally classified as a pistol."
msgstr ""
"The common AR-15 platform, with its stock removed and buffer tube covered by "
"a thick, padded sleeve that allows the user to brace it like a rifle.  AR "
"pistols lack stocks, or have arm braces due to restrictions on short barreled "
"rifles, and so without a stock, they're legally classified as a pistol."

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M27 assault rifle"
msgid_plural "M27 assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "M27 突擊步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M27 assault rifle"
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4 Carbine, the M27 assault rifle features most of "
"the former's strengths, while being considerably more durable.  It is "
"chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr "M27 突击步枪旨在取代 M4 卡宾枪，保留了前者大部分优点，同时更耐用。它的口径为 5.56x45mm，可使用 STANAG 弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "M27 assault rifle"
msgid "H&K416 A5 rifle"
msgid_plural "H&K416 A5 rifles"
msgstr[0] "H&K416 A5 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "H&K416 A5 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "H&K416 A5 rifle" of item "M27 assault rifle"
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4A1, the Heckler and Koch 416A5 features most of the "
"former's strengths, while being considerably more durable."
msgstr "本槍被設計用來取代 M4A1 步槍, 黑克勒&科赫公司生產的 416A5 步槍有著前者的優點, 而且更加的耐用。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "M27 assault rifle"
msgid "M27 IAR carbine"
msgid_plural "M27 IAR carbines"
msgstr[0] "M27 IAR 卡宾枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "M27 IAR carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "M27 IAR carbine" of item "M27 assault rifle"
msgid ""
"A H&K416 carbine outfitted with a heavier barrel to enable higher amounts of "
"suppressive fire while retaining a good degree of mobility."
msgstr "一把改裝過的 H&K416 卡賓槍, 裝有更重的槍管以提供更強的壓制火力, 同時又保持了一定機動性。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "M27 assault rifle"
msgid "M38 DMR rifle"
msgid_plural "M38 DMR rifles"
msgstr[0] "M38 DMR 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "M38 DMR rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "M38 DMR rifle" of item "M27 assault rifle"
msgid ""
"The M38 Designated Marksman Rifle is an M27 IAR, itself derived from a "
"H&K416, selected for accuracy, and outfitted with a variable power scope and "
"a QDSS suppressor."
msgstr ""
"M38 精确射手步枪就是安装了变倍光学瞄准镜的 M27 IAR，该枪以HK 416 型步枪为基础改进而来，经过调校，并配备了可变功率瞄准镜和 QDSS "
"消音器。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "FN SCAR-L"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR-Ls"
msgstr[0] "FN SCAR-L"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "FN SCAR-L"
#. ~ Description of "FN SCAR-L"
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular assault rifle specially designed for the United "
"States Special Operations Command.  The 'L' in its name stands for light, as "
"it uses the lightweight .223 round."
msgstr "一把高精準且可附掛武器的突擊步槍, 專由美國特種部隊單位所使用。在其名稱中的 \"L\" 代表輕量, 因為它使用輕量的 .223子彈。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "civilian FN SCAR-L rifle"
msgid_plural "civilian FN SCAR-L rifles"
msgstr[0] "民用 FN SCAR-L 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "civilian FN SCAR-L rifle"
#. ~ Description of "civilian FN SCAR-L rifle"
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular rifle specially designed for the United States "
"Special Operations Command, in semi-auto only to be sold on the civilian "
"market."
msgstr "一款专为美国特种作战部队设计的高精度模块化步枪，民用市场仅有半自动版本售卖。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "civilian FN SCAR-L rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "civilian FN SCAR-L rifle"
msgid "FN SCAR 16S"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR 16Ss"
msgstr[0] "FN SCAR 16S 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "civilian FN SCAR-L rifle" of gun "FN SCAR 16S"
#. ~ Description of variant "FN SCAR 16S" of item "civilian FN SCAR-L rifle"
msgid ""
"The SCAR 16S is the civilian-legal version of the SCAR-L rifle.  It is still "
"very expensive, not like that matters now anymore."
msgstr "SCAR 16S是SCAR-L步枪的合法民用版本。价格虽然依旧昂贵，但在这末世里钱早就没意义了。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "SL8 civilian rifle"
msgid_plural "SL8 civilian rifles"
msgstr[0] "SL8 民用步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "SL8 civilian rifle"
#. ~ Description of "SL8 civilian rifle"
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic clone of an older German assault rifle.  Due to importation "
"bans, it is semi-auto and can only feed from 10 round magazines."
msgstr "一把老式德国突击步枪的半自动仿制品，由于进口禁令，只能使用半自动射击和使用10发弹匣供弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "SL8 civilian rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "SL8 civilian rifle"
msgid "SL8-6"
msgid_plural "SL8-6s"
msgstr[0] "SL8-6 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "SL8 civilian rifle" of gun "SL8-6"
#. ~ Description of variant "SL8-6" of item "SL8 civilian rifle"
msgid ""
"The SL8 is an importation-legal gun similar to the German G36, made to be "
"semi-auto only, and to only feed from 10 round single stack magazines.  It "
"also features a distinctive thumbhole stock, a polymer handguard, and a top "
"rail for mounting optics."
msgstr ""
"SL8是一款设计符合进口法规的枪支，其设计与德国 G36 相似，但仅可使用半自动射击模式，只能装载 10 "
"发单排弹匣。SL8还配备了标志性的拇指孔枪托、聚合物护木和可安装瞄准镜的顶部导轨。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M249 machine gun"
msgid_plural "M249 machine guns"
msgstr[0] "M249 机枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M249 machine gun"
#. ~ Description of "M249 machine gun"
msgid ""
"The M249 is a mountable machine gun used by the US military and SWAT teams.  "
"Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the M249 is designed to fire many "
"rounds very quickly."
msgstr "M249是一個可掛載使用的機槍, 常用在美國軍方和特警隊上。相當不準確且難以控制。M249 可以在短時間內發射大量子彈。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json data/json/items/gun/308.json
#: data/json/items/gun/40.json data/json/items/gun/545x39.json
#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
