#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
#. ~ Firing mode of gun mod
msgid "burst"
msgstr "連發"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M249S machine gun"
msgid_plural "M249S machine guns"
msgstr[0] "M249S 机枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M249S machine gun"
#. ~ Description of "M249S machine gun"
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic civilian variant of the M249 machine gun, "
"manufactured for sport shooting and collectors market.  Notably, it retains "
"the ability to be belt fed, an uncommon feature in civilian firearms."
msgstr "这是M249机枪的半自动民用版本，专为运动射击和收藏家市场制造。值得注意的是，它保留了用弹药带供弹的能力，这个特色功能在民用枪械中不太常见。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M4 carbine"
msgid_plural "M4 carbines"
msgstr[0] "M4 卡賓槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M4 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "M4 carbine"
msgid ""
"A popular carbine, long used by the US military.  Though accurate, small, and "
"lightweight, it is infamous for its unreliability when not properly "
"maintained.  It is chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"一把常見的步槍, 被美國軍方長期使用。精確、體積小、重量輕, 但是其可靠性之差臭名昭彰, 特別是在缺乏保養的情況下。它的口徑是 5.56x45mm "
"並且可使用 STANAG 彈匣"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M4 carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item "M4 carbine"
msgid "M4A1 carbine"
msgid_plural "M4A1 carbines"
msgstr[0] "M4A1 卡宾枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M4 carbine" of gun "M4A1 carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "M4A1 carbine" of item "M4 carbine"
msgid ""
"A popular carbine, long used by the US military.  Though accurate, small, and "
"lightweight, it is infamous for its unreliability when not properly "
"maintained."
msgstr "一把常見的步槍, 被美國軍方長期使用。精確、體積小、重量輕, 但是其可靠性之差臭名昭彰, 特別是在缺乏保養的情況下。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M4 carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item "M4 carbine"
msgid "Mk 18 CQBR carbine"
msgid_plural "Mk 18 CQBR carbines"
msgstr[0] "Mk 18 CQBR 卡賓槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M4 carbine" of gun "Mk 18 CQBR carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "Mk 18 CQBR carbine" of item "M4 carbine"
msgid ""
"This is a shorter M4 carbine with a 10.3 inch barrel, intended for confined "
"spaces and close quarters battle situations."
msgstr "这是一种短 M4 卡宾枪，枪管长为 10.3 英寸（约26厘米），适用于密闭空间和室内近战环境。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M16 burst rifle"
msgid_plural "M16 burst rifles"
msgstr[0] "M16 點放步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M16 burst rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M16 burst rifle"
msgid ""
"The M16 is a common assault rifle descended from the AR-15, used by "
"militaries across the world for over 50 years.  It fires in three round "
"bursts, ensuring the rifle is more accurate, but at the cost of being slower "
"than other assault rifles.  It is chambered in 5.56x45mm rounds, and accepts "
"STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"M16 步枪是一款源自 AR-15 "
"步枪的通用突击步枪，被世界各地的军队使用了50多年。它采用三连发射击模式，确保步枪更加精确，但代价是射击速度比其他突击步枪慢。它的口径为 "
"5.56x45mm，可使用 STANAG 弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M16 burst rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "M16 burst rifle"
msgid "M16A4 rifle"
msgid_plural "M16A4 rifles"
msgstr[0] "M16A4 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M16 burst rifle" of gun "M16A4 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "M16A4 rifle" of item "M16 burst rifle"
msgid ""
"The M16 is a very common assault rifle descended from the AR-15, used by "
"militaries across the world for over 50 years.  It is a gas-operated, "
"rotating bolt rifle known for its accuracy and controllable recoil."
msgstr "M16 是一种源自 AR-15 的十分常见的突击步枪，在过去 50 年内被全球的军队广泛使用。这是一种转拴式气动步枪，以其高命中率和易于掌控的后坐力而出名。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "3 rd."
msgstr "3 連發"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M16 auto rifle"
msgid_plural "M16 auto rifles"
msgstr[0] "M16 自動步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M16 auto rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M16 auto rifle"
msgid ""
"The M16 is a very common assault rifle descended from the AR-15, used by "
"militaries across the world for over 50 years.  Unlike its more common "
"brother, the M16 burst rifle, this one has full-auto capabilities.  It is "
"chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"M16 步枪是一款源自 AR-15 步枪的通用突击步枪，被世界各地的军队使用了50多年。与更常见的兄弟款 M16 "
"短连发步枪不同，这款步枪具有全自动射击模式。它的口径为 5.56x45mm，可使用 STANAG 弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M16 auto rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "M16 auto rifle"
msgid "M16A3 rifle"
msgid_plural "M16A3 rifles"
msgstr[0] "M16A3 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M16 auto rifle" of gun "M16A3 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "M16A3 rifle" of item "M16 auto rifle"
msgid ""
"The M16 is a very common assault rifle descended from the AR-15, used by "
"militaries across the world for over 50 years.  It is a gas-operated, "
"rotating bolt rifle known for its accuracy and controllable recoil.  This one "
"is a relatively rare M16A3, with full auto capability."
msgstr ""
"M16 是一种源自 AR-15 的十分常见的突击步枪，在过去 50 "
"年内被全球的军队广泛使用。这是一种转拴式气动步枪，以其高命中率和易于掌控的后坐力而出名。全自动的 M16A3 突击步枪市面上很少见。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ruger Mini-14 carbine"
msgid_plural "Ruger Mini-14 carbines"
msgstr[0] "鲁格 Mini-14 卡宾枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger Mini-14 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger Mini-14 carbine"
msgid ""
"A small, lightweight semi-auto carbine designed for civilian and police use.  "
"Its superb accuracy and low recoil makes it more suitable than full-auto "
"rifles for some situations."
msgstr "一把小型輕量的半自動卡賓槍, 屬於民用及警用武器。其超群的準確度與低後座力讓其有時比全自動步槍更能勝任某些任務。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "SIG civilian rifle"
msgid_plural "SIG civilian rifles"
msgstr[0] "SIG民用步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "SIG civilian rifle"
#. ~ Description of "SIG civilian rifle"
msgid ""
"A civilian variant of an automatic Swiss rifle for military service.  Accepts "
"STANAG magazines."
msgstr "这是一款瑞士军用自动步枪的民用型变种，能够兼容STANAG标准弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "SIG civilian rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "SIG civilian rifle"
msgid "SIG SG 556"
msgid_plural "SIG SG 556s"
msgstr[0] "SIG556突击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "SIG civilian rifle" of gun "SIG SG 556"
#. ~ Description of variant "SIG SG 556" of item "SIG civilian rifle"
msgid ""
"The SG 556 is a civilian model of the Swiss SIG SG 550 series, manufactured "
"in New Hampshire.  It lacks any automatic fire capability and has a 16 inch "
"barrel, but still retains a folding stock, with the feature of feeding from "
"STANAG magazines instead of the SG 550 series magazines."
msgstr ""
"SG 556是瑞士SIG SG "
"550系列步枪的民用版本，产自美国新罕布什尔州。它不具备全自动射击功能，并配有16英寸(约41厘米)"
"的枪管，但保留了可折叠枪托的设计。此外，它的一个特点是能使用STANAG弹匣，而非SG 550系列原配的弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "AUG assault rifle"
msgid_plural "AUG assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "AUG 突擊步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "AUG assault rifle"
#. ~ Description of "AUG assault rifle"
msgid "An assault rifle chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepting AUG magazines"
msgstr "一把 5.56x45mm 口径的突击步枪，可使用 AUG 弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "AUG assault rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "AUG assault rifle"
msgid "Steyr AUG"
msgid_plural "Steyr AUGs"
msgstr[0] "斯泰爾 AUG"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "AUG assault rifle" of gun "Steyr AUG"
#. ~ Description of variant "Steyr AUG" of item "AUG assault rifle"
msgid ""
"The Steyr AUG is an Austrian assault rifle that uses a bullpup design.  It is "
"used in the armed forces and police forces of many nations, and enjoys low "
"recoil and high accuracy."
msgstr "斯泰爾 AUG 是一把採用了犢牛式設計的澳製突擊步槍。被用在許多國家的武裝部隊以及軍警上, 低後座力且高準確度。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "ZPAP AK-style rifle"
msgid_plural "ZPAP AK-style rifles"
msgstr[0] "ZPAP AK式步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "ZPAP AK-style rifle"
#. ~ Description of "ZPAP AK-style rifle"
msgid "A civilian AK pattern rifle, chambered in 5.56x45 NATO."
msgstr "一把民用AK型步枪，使用 5.56x45 NATO 弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "ZPAP AK-style rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "ZPAP AK-style rifle"
msgid "ZPAP M90"
msgid_plural "ZPAP M90s"
msgstr[0] "ZPAP M90"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "ZPAP AK-style rifle" of gun "ZPAP M90"
#. ~ Description of variant "ZPAP M90" of item "ZPAP AK-style rifle"
msgid ""
"A Serbian-made AK pattern rifle made by Zastava in 5.56x45mm NATO.  To avoid "
"import restrictions, Zastava USA has added a number of American-made parts."
msgstr "Zastava在塞尔维亚使用 5.56x45mm NATO 弹药标准制造的AK型步枪。为了避免进口限制，Zastava USA 增加了一些美国制造的零件。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Desert Tech bullpup carbine"
msgid_plural "Desert Tech bullpup carbines"
msgstr[0] "DT 无托卡宾"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Desert Tech bullpup carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Desert Tech bullpup carbine"
msgid ""
"Produced by the Desert Tech gun company, this is a highly modular, "
"semi-automatic rifle of remarkably modest dimensions.  The weapon is notable "
"for the simplicity of converting it to fire a wide number of different "
"cartridges, with retool kits for .223 Remington, .308 Winchester, and .300 "
"AAC Blackout being available."
msgstr ""
"由沙漠科技制造，这只高度模块化的半自动步枪有着很合适的尺寸。它的特色是便于改装使用各种口径的子弹，只要你有合适的改装工具，可以改成.223雷明顿，.308"
"温彻斯特，或者是.300 AAC BLACKOUT。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Desert Tech bullpup carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Desert Tech bullpup carbine"
msgid "Desert Tech MDRX carbine"
msgid_plural "Desert Tech MDRX carbines"
msgstr[0] "DT MDRX 卡宾枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Desert Tech bullpup carbine" of gun "Desert Tech
#. MDRX carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "Desert Tech MDRX carbine" of item "Desert Tech
#. bullpup carbine"
msgid ""
"Bringing a compact, highly modular, and soft-recoiling weapon system to the "
"table, the Desert Tech Micro Dynamic Rifle Extreme (MDRX) is a gas-operated "
"bullpup carbine originally unveiled in 2014, with this updated model of the "
"weapon having been released in 2019.  One of the rifle's most notable "
"features is the utter simplicity of swapping the carbine's chambering, with "
"an easy change of the barrel, bolt, and a handful of other components being "
"all the steps required to chamber the MDRX for either .223 Remington, .308 "
"Winchester, or .300 AAC Blackout."
msgstr ""
"沙漠科技小型动态极限步枪（MDRX）作为紧凑、高度模块化、低后坐力的武器进入人们的视野，2014年发布了最初的气动无托版本，又于2019"
"年发布升级版本。该款步枪最明显的特征就是改装枪械口径十分简单，将MDRX改为.223雷明顿，.308温彻斯特或是.300AAC "
"BLACKOUT的各个步骤都有许多方便的组件工具。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Bren 5.56x45mm carbine"
msgid_plural "Bren 5.56x45mm carbines"
msgstr[0] "Bren 5.56×45mm 卡宾枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Bren 5.56x45mm carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Bren 5.56x45mm carbine"
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic clone of the Czech Republic's standard infantry carbine, "
"sold for civilian sport shooting and recreational use, this modular rifle "
"makes use of the standard magazines of the AR-15 platform and a 5.56x45mm "
"cartridge."
msgstr "一款捷克制式步兵卡宾枪的半自动仿制品，专为民用运动射击和休闲用途而设计。这款模块化步枪采用 AR-15 平台的标准弹匣和 5.56x45mm 口径弹药。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json data/json/items/gun/762.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Bren 5.56x45mm carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Bren 5.56x45mm carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Bren 7.62mm carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Bren 7.62mm carbine"
msgid "CZ Bren 2 carbine"
msgid_plural "CZ Bren 2 carbines"
msgstr[0] "CZ Bren 2 卡宾枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Bren 5.56x45mm carbine" of gun "CZ Bren 2
#. carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "CZ Bren 2 carbine" of item "Bren 5.56x45mm
#. carbine"
msgid ""
"Hailing from the Czech Republic, this modular carbine supplanted the older CZ "
"805 rifle within Czech military use, improving upon the former's features and "
"bringing fully ambidextrous controls, a streamlined design, and an easily "
"adjustable gas system to the table.  Chambered for the 5.56x45mm NATO "
"cartridge, this particular weapon possesses a 16.5-inch barrel and is a "
"civilian MS, 'modular semi-automatic,' model.  Incorporating a number of "
"US-made parts, the weapon features a removable muzzle break rather than the "
"flash hider that comes standard with military rifles."
msgstr ""
"这只由捷克共和国制造的模块化卡宾枪替换掉了原先捷克军队使用的CZ "
"805步枪，在前者的基础上增加了控制握持的人机功效，改为流线型设计，还加装了便于调整的气量控制系统。该枪有16.5英寸（约42厘米）枪管，使用5.56×45"
"mm NATO弹药，型号为'模块化半自动'（MS）。因为使用了一系列美产部件，这把枪有一个可拆卸消音器，而不是本国军用步枪标准的消焰器。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "bolt-action trail carbine"
msgid_plural "bolt-action trail carbines"
msgstr[0] "栓动式卡宾枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "bolt-action trail carbine"
#. ~ Description of "bolt-action trail carbine"
msgid ""
"Compact, svelte, and lightweight, this Leen bolt-action rifle packs the same "
"features of larger sporting weapons into a backpack-sized package.  "
"Possessing an adjustable buttstock, a detachable magazine-based system, and a "
"quick-swap barrel that can be exchanged to accommodate the firing of .223 "
"Remington or 7.62x39mm Soviet ammunition, the weapon is a commendable "
"backpacker or prepper rifle."
msgstr ""
"紧凑、修长且轻便的李恩栓动步枪，与可放入背包的体育步枪特性类似。有一个可调的后托、一个可拆卸弹匣系统及一个快拆枪管，可以换成.223雷明顿或7.62×39"
"mm苏制弹药，总之这种武器的特点就是便于出行时携带。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "bolt-action trail carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item "bolt-action trail carbine"
msgid "CZ 600 TRAIL rifle"
msgid_plural "CZ 600 TRAIL rifles"
msgstr[0] "CZ 600 TRAIL 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "bolt-action trail carbine" of gun "CZ 600 TRAIL
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "CZ 600 TRAIL rifle" of item "bolt-action trail
#. carbine"
msgid ""
"A handy bolt-action offering from CZ, the 600 Trail is a box magazine-fed "
"ranch rifle that utilizes an aluminum chassis to keep its overall heft to a "
"minimum.  Possessing an extendable buttstock, extensive modularity, and a "
"quick-swap barrel assembly switchable to accommodate the firing of either "
".223 or 7.62x39mm ammunition, the rifle was intended for use by backpackers, "
"trail hikers, and preppers."
msgstr ""
"600 Trail 是 "
"CZ公司生产的的一种便利的栓动式牧场步枪，由弹匣供弹。它采用铝制底盘使其整体重量保持在最低限度。该步枪拥有可伸缩的枪托、泛用的模块化设计和快拆枪管组件，以适"
"应 .223 或 7.62x39 毫米弹药，旨在供背包客、越野徒步旅行者和准备者使用。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "5.56x45mm bullpup rifle"
msgid_plural "5.56x45mm bullpup rifles"
msgstr[0] "5.56x45mm 无托步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "5.56x45mm bullpup rifle"
#. ~ Description of "5.56x45mm bullpup rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use "
"of polymers and aluminum, using standard magazines of the AR-15 platform and "
"a 5.56x45mm cartridge."
msgstr "这是一把半自动的无托步枪，由于使用了聚合物和铝的材质枪体十分轻便。使用AR-15系标准弹匣及5.56×45mm口径弹药。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "5.56x45mm bullpup rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "5.56x45mm bullpup rifle"
msgid "Kel-Tec RDB rifle"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec RDB rifles"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec RDB 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "5.56x45mm bullpup rifle" of gun "Kel-Tec RDB
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Kel-Tec RDB rifle" of item "5.56x45mm bullpup
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use "
"of polymers and aluminum, using standard magazines from the AR-15 platform "
"and the 5.56 NATO cartridge.  The name stands for rifle, downward-ejection, "
"bullpup, and its design was intended to incorporate some technical solutions, "
"such as downward case ejection and convenience for left-handers, to solve "
"some problems with bullpup guns.  However, the good idea's execution is not "
"as perfect as the manufacturer (and user) would like.  No good idea from "
"Kel-Tec is immune to Kel-Tec manufacturing issues, sadly."
msgstr ""
"这是一把半自动无托式步枪，由于使用了聚合物和铝的材质枪体十分轻便。使用AR-15系标准弹匣及5.56×45"
"mm口径弹药。其名字已经很好地代表了这把步枪：下方抛壳、无托结构、为特殊技术原因设计，例如，下方抛壳便于左手持枪使用，同时解决了一些无托式步枪的问题。不过虽"
"然设计理念很美好，但制造厂商（及用户）就不一定喜欢了。\"没有一个好点子能避免被凯尔科技制造问题拖后腿，真可惜。\""

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "IWI Tavor X95"
msgid_plural "IWI Tavor X95s"
msgstr[0] "IWI 塔沃尔 X95 突击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "IWI Tavor X95"
#. ~ Description of "IWI Tavor X95"
msgid ""
"The Tavor is an Israeli series of bullpup rifles designed and produced by "
"Israel Weapon Industries.  This is the Tavor X95, a civilian-legal rifle "
"lacking any full-auto capability, and sporting a 16.5\" barrel.  Chambered in "
"5.56/.223, this rifle feeds from STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"塔沃尔是以色列武器工业公司设计和生产的以色列系列无托步枪。这是塔沃尔 "
"X95，一种缺乏全自动功能的民用合法步枪，配备16.5英寸(约42厘米)枪管。这款步枪的口径为5.56/.223，由STANAG弹匣供弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "sporter AR rifle"
msgid_plural "sporter AR rifles"
msgstr[0] "竞赛型 AR 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "sporter AR rifle"
#. ~ Description of "sporter AR rifle"
msgid ""
"A lightweight AR-15 platform rifle, capable of feeding standard AR magazines. "
" Unlike the military versions, it has no threaded barrel or collapsing stock."
msgstr "一把轻量化的 AR-15 平台步枪，兼容标准规格的 AR 弹匣。不同于军用版本，它没有螺纹枪管或者折叠式枪托。"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "sporter AR rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "sporter AR rifle"
msgid "M&P 15"
msgid_plural "M&P 15s"
msgstr[0] "M&P 15s"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "sporter AR rifle" of gun "M&P 15"
#. ~ Description of variant "M&P 15" of item "sporter AR rifle"
msgid ""
"S&Ws version of the AR-15, the M&P-15 is a very common rifle.  Despite being "
"very similar to an AR-15 in both form and function, the receivers and uppers "
"are incompatible."
msgstr ""
"S&Ws version of the AR-15, the M&P-15 is a very common rifle.  Despite being "
"very similar to an AR-15 in both form and function, the receivers and uppers "
"are incompatible."

#: data/json/items/gun/270win.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "bolt-action hunting rifle"
msgid_plural "bolt-action hunting rifles"
msgstr[0] "栓动猎枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/270win.json
#. ~ Description of gun "bolt-action hunting rifle"
#. ~ Description of "bolt-action hunting rifle"
msgid ""
"Featuring a handsome set of wooden furnishings, a classic design, and a no "
"nonsense .270 caliber chambering, this is a powerful hunting rifle.  With a "
"tried and proven pedigree dating back over 60 years, millions of such rugged "
"arms have been made, exported, and used throughout the United States and the "
"world at large.  Where hunting is concerned, this is a highly capable and "
"well proven weapon in all respects.  Fortunate, given that your prey in these "
"dark days may turn out to be a little bit more feisty than typical "
"White-Tailed deer, moose, and black bears."
msgstr ""
"一把经典款式的枪，带有漂亮的木制装饰，以及不折不扣的.270口径枪膛，是一把强大的狩猎步枪。这种坚固的枪械有着60"
"多年久经考验的血统，被数以百万计地制造、出口，并在整个美国和世界范围内使用。就打猎而言，这是一种能力很强、在各方面都得到充分证明的武器。幸运的是，在这些黑暗"
"的日子里，你的猎物可能会变得比典型的白尾鹿、驼鹿和黑熊更加好斗。"

#: data/json/items/gun/270win.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "bolt-action hunting rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "bolt-action hunting rifle"
msgid "Remington 700 .270 Win rifle"
msgid_plural "Remington 700 .270 Win rifles"
msgstr[0] "雷明顿 700 步枪（.270 温彻斯特弹）"

#: data/json/items/gun/270win.json
#. ~ Description of variant "bolt-action hunting rifle" of gun "Remington 700
#. .270 Win rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Remington 700 .270 Win rifle" of item "bolt-
#. action hunting rifle"
msgid ""
"A classic bolt-action rifle chambered for .270 Winchester, very popular among "
"hunters.  This is a CDL SF model with a forged, fluted, 416 stainless steel "
"barrel threaded into the receiver and a recessed bolt face.  It has checkered "
"walnut furniture and a recoil pad to reduce perceived recoil."
msgstr ""
"一把经典的栓动步枪，使用.270温彻斯特弹，在猎人中十分流行。这把CDL SF 型号属于经典奢华版，线膛枪管使用 416 "
"不锈钢锻造，枪管-枪机连续膛线，以及嵌入式枪栓。它的核桃木枪托上装饰着格子图案，还有一个用于减少后坐力的托垫。"

#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M2010 ESR"
msgid_plural "M2010 ESR"
msgstr[0] "M2010 增強型狙擊步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M2010 ESR"
#. ~ Description of "M2010 ESR"
msgid ""
"A bolt-action, box-magazine-fed sniper rifle chambered in the powerful .300 "
"Winchester Magnum round.  The M2010 had completely replaced the M24 rifle "
"series by 2017."
msgstr "一把栓动狙击步枪，弹匣供弹，使用威力强大的.300温彻斯特马格南弹药。M2010 狙击步枪在2017年完全取代了M24系列狙击步枪。"

#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Weatherby Mark V"
msgid_plural "Weatherby Mark V"
msgstr[0] "Weatherby Mark V"

#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Weatherby Mark V"
#. ~ Description of "Weatherby Mark V"
msgid ""
"The Weatherby Mark V is one of the world's finest bolt-action rifles.  "
"Designed in 1955 by Roy Weatherby and Fred Jennie, it has a strong action "
"designed to safely fire high-pressure cartridges.  These rifles were "
"presented to celebrities as part of a marketing campaign."
msgstr ""
"韦瑟比 Mark V "
"步枪是世界上最好的旋转拴动式步枪之一，在1955"
"年由罗伊·韦瑟比和佛莱德·珍妮两人设计。其牢靠的机械设计使其可以安全地发射高压弹药。这杆步枪被视为市场销售的成功品。"

#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Winchester Model 70"
msgid_plural "Winchester Model 70s"
msgstr[0] "溫徹斯特 M70 步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Winchester Model 70"
#. ~ Description of "Winchester Model 70"
msgid ""
"The Winchester Model 70 is a bolt-action sporting rifle.  It has an iconic "
"place in American sporting culture and has been held in high regard by "
"shooters since it was introduced in 1936."
msgstr "温彻斯特 Model 70步枪是一种竞赛栓动步枪，在美国射击竞赛文化中有着标志性的地位，自从1936年发布之后就广受射手们的喜爱。"

#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ruger Precision Rifle"
msgid_plural "Ruger Precision Rifles"
msgstr[0] "Ruger 精准步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/300.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger Precision Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger Precision Rifle"
msgid ""
"Originally introduced to the Ruger gun corporation's family of high-end "
"marksman rifles in 2015, the Ruger Precision Rifle is a modern and highly "
"modular long-range bolt-action weapon.  By incorporating a unique in-line "
"recoil path that manages recoil from the rear of the receiver to the "
"buttstock, as opposed to traditional bedding, the rifle offers maximal "
"accuracy potential, while the arm's additional bells and whistles, an "
"incorporated marksman's trigger, muzzle brake, and this particular rifle's "
"powerhouse chambering of .300 Win Mag, help to make the most from any "
"long-range engagement."
msgstr ""
"最初2015"
"年是鲁格枪族新的高端步枪成员，鲁格精准射手步枪是一把现代高度模块化的远距离栓动式武器。独特的内线回弹路径将后坐力从枪机后部转移到枪托上，与传统的后托缝填充不"
"同，这使得该步枪活得了最大的精度潜力。这支武器还有一些格外喜人的设计，如射手级扳机、消音器、以及特制的.300口径枪膛，使其性能处于远距离步枪的顶尖水平。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "BLR lever-action hunting rifle"
msgid_plural "BLR lever-action hunting rifles"
msgstr[0] "BLR 杠杆式狩猎步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of gun "BLR lever-action hunting rifle"
#. ~ Description of "BLR lever-action hunting rifle"
msgid ""
"A highly accurate lever-action hunting rifle chambered for the powerful "
".30-06 round.  Notable for using a detachable magazine instead of a "
"traditional tube."
msgstr "一把高精準度的槓桿式獵槍, 可使用殺傷力強大的 .30-06 彈藥。使用可拆式彈匣, 而不是傳統的管狀結構。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "BLR lever-action hunting rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "BLR lever-action hunting rifle"
msgid "Browning BLR"
msgid_plural "Browning BLRs"
msgstr[0] "白朗寧 BLR"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of variant "BLR lever-action hunting rifle" of gun "Browning
#. BLR"
#. ~ Description of variant "Browning BLR" of item "BLR lever-action hunting
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"The Browning BLR is notable for being a lever-action rifle, chambered in "
"calibers with spitzer bullets.  This is unusual for lever-actions, as a "
"spitzer bullet risks setting off other cartridges in a typical tube magazine. "
" The BLR gets around this issue by utilizing box magazines instead, making it "
"quite unique among other lever-action rifles.  This one is chambered for "
"30-06."
msgstr ""
"勃朗宁 BLR 是一款著名的杠杆式步枪，采用在杠杆式步枪中并不常见的尖头弹，因为尖头弹容易引爆常规的管状弹匣内的其他子弹。勃朗宁 "
"BLR通过使用盒式弹匣解决了这个问题，在杠杆式步枪中显得非常独特。这支枪发射的是 30-06 口径。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Garand battle rifle"
msgid_plural "Garand battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "加兰德战斗步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Garand battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Garand battle rifle"
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic .30-06 battle rifle, developed to replace the M1903 "
"Springfield.  It didn't completely supplant the older bolt-action until after "
"World War II."
msgstr "一把 .30-06 口徑的半自動戰鬥步槍, 設計時打算全面取代拉栓式的 M1903 春田步槍, 但這目標直到二戰完結後才完成。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Garand battle rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Garand battle rifle"
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M1 Garand"
msgid_plural "M1 Garand"
msgstr[0] "M1 加蘭德步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Garand battle rifle" of gun "M1 Garand"
#. ~ Description of variant "M1 Garand" of item "Garand battle rifle"
msgid ""
"The M1 Garand is a widely celebrated battle rifle, being one of the most "
"mass-produced battle rifles in the world.  It saw widespread use in the US "
"military, being used extensively in WW2 and the Korean War.  While its "
"military use has dwindled down, being out of US service for more than 50 "
"years, some of its mechanical influence still remains through rifles such as "
"AKs or M14s.  It still sees widespread use in civilian spaces as an accurate "
"competition or hunting rifle."
msgstr ""
"M1 "
"加兰德是一款广受赞誉的战斗步枪，是世界上产量最高的战斗步枪之一。曾在美国军队中广泛投入使用，大量服役于二战和朝鲜战争中。虽然如今其军事列装已经减少，在美国军"
"队中退役了超过 50 年，其机械设计仍然通过 AK 和 M14 等步枪得以体现。M1 加兰德在民间领域作为精准的比赛用或狩猎步枪仍广受欢迎。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Springfield rifle"
msgid_plural "Springfield rifles"
msgstr[0] "斯普林费尔德（春田）步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Springfield rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Springfield rifle"
msgid ""
"A powerful military rifle chambered in .30-06, developed to replace the US "
"Army's older Krag rifle.  It served as the main American rifle in World War "
"I, was used alongside the M1 Garand in World War II, and was used as a sniper "
"rifle as late as the Vietnam War."
msgstr ""
"一把威力强大的 .30-06 "
"口径军用步枪，被研发以取代当时在美军服役的卡拉格-"
"约根森步枪。从作为第一次世界大战时美军的主要制式装备步枪，它一直都在服役，在第二次世界大战时同本来要取代它的M1"
"加兰德步枪平起平坐，也作为狙击步枪在越南战场使用到最后撤装。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Springfield rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Springfield rifle"
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M1903 Springfield"
msgid_plural "M1903 Springfields"
msgstr[0] "M1903 春田步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Springfield rifle" of gun "M1903 Springfield"
#. ~ Description of variant "M1903 Springfield" of item "Springfield rifle"
msgid ""
"A powerful military rifle originally chambered in .30-03 Springfield, "
"developed to replace the US Army's older Krag rifle.  It was quickly "
"rechambered into the .30-06 caliber with its spitzer bullet.  While an "
"American rifle produced and developed around WW1, manufacturing couldn't keep "
"up with demand, and saw service alongside the M1917 Enfield, a British rifle "
"rechambered for the American 30-06.  It saw service as a sniper rifle up to "
"the Vietnam War, but nowadays is mainly used by civilians, either as hunting "
"rifles or in collections."
msgstr ""
"一款强力的军用步枪，最初采用.30-03 Springfield弹药，用于取代美国陆军的旧款克拉格步枪，后来很快改为使用.30-06 "
"被甲空尖弹。尽管这款美国步枪是在第一次世界大战期间开发的，但因为生产规模无法满足需求，因而与M1917恩菲尔德步枪一同投入使用，后者为美国.30-06"
"口径改装的英国步枪。这款步枪一直作为狙击步枪并服役至越南战争，现在主要在民间流通，作为猎枪或收藏品。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "BAR rifle"
msgid_plural "BAR rifles"
msgstr[0] "BAR步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of gun "BAR rifle"
#. ~ Description of "BAR rifle"
msgid ""
"This heavy rifle was designed near the end of World War I, and provided fire "
"support for the US Army from World War II all the way to the Vietnam War.  "
"Too much firepower to serve as a battle rifle, but not enough to be an ideal "
"light machine gun, it still found a niche on the battlefield."
msgstr ""
"这挺重型步枪设计于第一次世界大战末期，自第二次世界大战起直至越南战争，一直为美国陆军提供火力支援。它的火力对于战斗步枪来说过于猛烈，但作为轻机枪又稍显不足，"
"却在战场上找到了自己的独特定位。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "BAR rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "BAR rifle"
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Browning Automatic Rifle"
msgid_plural "Browning Automatic Rifles"
msgstr[0] "白朗寧自動步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of variant "BAR rifle" of gun "Browning Automatic Rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Browning Automatic Rifle" of item "BAR rifle"
msgid ""
"Designed near the end of World War I, the BAR provided fire support for the "
"US Army from World War II all the way to the Vietnam War.  Originally "
"developed to fill a now outdated role as an \"automatic rifle\", it was "
"pushed into service for use as a light machine gun.  Despite being heavy and "
"cumbersome, without filling its designed role, it saw service for over 50 "
"years.  While newer models have a slow and fast fully automatic setting, this "
"one is an older one, with just semi and full auto."
msgstr ""
"勃朗宁 BAR "
"诞生于一战末期，从二战一直到越战都在美军中服役。它最初是作为“自动步枪”设计的，从现在的眼光看来这个定位已经过时了，在后来充当了轻机枪的角色。虽然这把枪相当"
"笨重，且没有发挥其最初的设计用途，但仍然服役了超过50年。新一些的型号有快慢两档的全自动射击模式，但这支是老型号，只有半自动和全自动两种模式。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Remington 700 .30-06 rifle"
msgid_plural "Remington 700 .30-06 rifles"
msgstr[0] "雷明顿 700 步枪（.30-06 弹）"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Remington 700 .30-06 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Remington 700 .30-06 rifle"
msgid ""
"A very popular and durable hunting or sniping rifle.  Popular among SWAT and "
"US Marine snipers.  Highly damaging, but perhaps not as accurate as the "
"competing Browning BLR."
msgstr "一把受歡迎又可靠的步槍, 常用於狩獵或是狙擊。在特警或是美國海軍陸戰隊的狙擊手中常見。極高的傷害值, 但是可能沒有比其對手白朗寧 BLR 準確。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ruger Guide rifle"
msgid_plural "Ruger Guide rifles"
msgstr[0] "鲁格 导猎步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger Guide rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger Guide rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a popular and sturdy long-range rifle that has been in production by "
"the Ruger gun company for several decades.  Using a bolt-action feed system, "
"the rifle features a four round capacity of .30-06 cartridges and has the "
"capability to dispatch said rounds with a level of accuracy that would make "
"comparable hunting rifles blush."
msgstr ""
"这把畅销的远距离步枪十分耐用，由鲁格枪械公司在几十年前初次生产。该枪使用一套栓动式供弹系统，可以容纳四发.30-06"
"口径的子弹，并能以较高的精度发射，这使得它在一众猎枪中脱颖而出。"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Ruger Guide rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ruger Guide rifle"
msgid "Ruger M77 Hawkeye rifle"
msgid_plural "Ruger M77 Hawkeye rifles"
msgstr[0] "鲁格 M77 鹰眼步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/3006.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger Guide rifle" of gun "Ruger M77 Hawkeye
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger M77 Hawkeye rifle" of item "Ruger Guide
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"A popular bolt-action hunting rifle first introduced in 2006, the Ruger M77 "
"was originally intended to be a modernized Mauser 98-style long gun.  To this "
"end, the weapon features a Mauser-type fixed blade extractor and an angled "
"large screw that tightly beds the action into the stock.  This particular "
"rifle is a variant with additional features, a smoother trigger, and a "
"recontoured buttstock."
msgstr ""
"作为一种最初产于2006年的狩猎用栓动式步枪，鲁格M77 最初是作为毛瑟98式 "
"步枪的现代化版本而设计。因此，它有着毛瑟同款的退弹装置，以及大号的斜角螺丝将枪膛与枪托紧紧固定。这支步枪有着额外的改装，有更流畅的扳机及一个精心打磨的后托。"

#: data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "SIG MCX Rattler SBR"
msgid_plural "SIG MCX Rattler SBRs"
msgstr[0] "SIG MCX 響尾蛇短管步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json
#. ~ Description of gun "SIG MCX Rattler SBR"
#. ~ Description of "SIG MCX Rattler SBR"
msgid ""
"A gas-operated rifle, with a short 5.5 inch barrel, built-in thin folding "
"stock, and full rail mount on the upper receiver.  This particular one is a "
"select-fire military version."
msgstr "一种气动式步枪，带有5.5英寸（约14厘米）的短枪管，内置可折叠枪托，以及安装在上机匣的全长导轨。这个型号是可选择射击模式的军用版本。"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Enfield battle rifle"
msgid_plural "Enfield battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "恩菲尔德 战斗步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Enfield battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Enfield battle rifle"
msgid ""
"An iconic weapon of both the First and Second World Wars, this bolt-action "
"rifle has seen deployment in the hands of Commonwealth troops across Europe "
"and beyond.  Firing the .303-caliber cartridge and making use of 10-round "
"Enfield magazines, the firearm's reputation precedes it."
msgstr "一战与二战的标志性武器，这种栓动式步枪已在欧洲及其他地区的英联邦军队手中部署。 发射 .303 口径弹药并使用恩菲尔德10发弹匣，枪的名气大过了枪支本身。"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Enfield battle rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Enfield battle rifle"
msgid "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifle"
msgid_plural "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifles"
msgstr[0] "SMLE No. 1 Mk III 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Enfield battle rifle" of gun "SMLE No. 1 Mk III
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifle" of item "Enfield battle
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"An English darling and icon of the First World War, the Short Magazine "
"Lee-Enfield Mk III was the standard issue battle rifle of the British "
"commonwealth from 1907.  Chambered for .303 ammunition, the rifle makes use "
"of ten-round detachable magazines.  With its full-length wooden handguard, "
"brass buttplate, and smooth action, the Lee-Enfield cuts a recognizable "
"profile in either the trenches of the Great War or the zombie-strewn "
"wastelands."
msgstr ""
"李-恩菲尔德短式弹夹步枪Mk "
"III是英国第一次世界大战时期的英国宝贝和标志，自1907年起成为英国联邦的标准装备战斗步枪。该步枪使用.303"
"弹药，具有十发可拆卸弹夹，配有全长的木质护手，黄铜枪托板和平滑的操作，可在一战的战壕或丧尸横行的荒野中轻易与众不同。"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "updated Enfield rifle"
msgid_plural "updated Enfield rifles"
msgstr[0] "改进型恩菲尔德步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#. ~ Description of gun "updated Enfield rifle"
#. ~ Description of "updated Enfield rifle"
msgid ""
"An evolution of Britain's First World War battle rifle, this bolt-action "
"firearm uses the same .303-caliber cartridge as its forerunner.  Much beloved "
"across the globe by collectors, rifles like this served as England's infantry "
"rifle well into the 1950s, with a specialized sniper variant remaining in "
"service until the early nineties."
msgstr ""
"这种枪栓式步枪是英国一战时所使用的战斗步枪的演变，使用与其前身相同的.303口径弹药。这款步枪深受全球收藏家的喜爱，作为英国的步兵步枪一直到使用到20世纪5"
"0年代，而专门的狙击型一直服役到90年代初。"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "updated Enfield rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "updated Enfield rifle"
msgid "Lee-Enfield No. 4 Mk I rifle"
msgid_plural "Lee-Enfield No. 4 Mk I rifles"
msgstr[0] "李-恩菲尔德 No. 4 Mk I 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#. ~ Description of variant "updated Enfield rifle" of gun "Lee-Enfield No. 4
#. Mk I rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Lee-Enfield No. 4 Mk I rifle" of item "updated
#. Enfield rifle"
msgid ""
"A Second World War progression of the British Commonwealth's Lee-Enfield "
"battle rifle, the No. 4 began its decades-long service life in 1939.  "
"Externally similar to its forefather, the rifle possesses a reinforced "
"receiver, an adjusted nose cap, and a heavier barrel.  Still chambered for "
"the same .303-caliber cartridge, the No. 4 represents one of the most "
"populous firearm imports in U.S. history."
msgstr ""
"作为英联邦李-恩菲尔德战斗步枪的第二次世界大战升级版，第4号步枪于 1939 "
"年开始其长达几十年的服役生涯。在外观上与其前身相似，该步枪拥有加强型机匣、经过调整的枪托盖和更重的枪管。使用相同的 .303 "
"口径子弹，第4号步枪代表了美国历史上进口数量最多的枪支之一。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Belgian battle rifle"
msgid_plural "Belgian battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "比利时战斗步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Belgian battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Belgian battle rifle"
msgid ""
"Originally designed during the Cold War, this gun is probably the most "
"successful battle rifle ever designed.  Despite being labeled as obsolete, "
"its tunable gas system ensures both reliability and low recoil, allowing the "
"FAL to keep up even among modern competitors.  This is a semi-automatic clone "
"built by a domestic manufacturer."
msgstr ""
"这把枪最初设计于冷战时期，可能是有史以来最成功的战斗步枪。尽管被贴上了过时的标签，但其可调气体系统确保了可靠性和低后坐力，使FAL在现代竞争对手中保持领先。"
"这是由国内制造商制造的半自动复制品。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Belgian battle rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Belgian battle rifle"
msgid "DSA SA-58 rifle"
msgid_plural "DSA SA-58 rifles"
msgstr[0] "DSA SA-58 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Belgian battle rifle" of gun "DSA SA-58 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "DSA SA-58 rifle" of item "Belgian battle rifle"
msgid ""
"Originally designed during the Cold War, the FAL is probably the most "
"successful battle rifle ever designed.  Despite being labeled as obsolete, "
"its tunable gas system ensures both reliability and low recoil, allowing the "
"FAL to keep up even among modern competitors.  This is a semi-automatic clone "
"of the SA-58 pattern built by DSA."
msgstr ""
"FAL最初设计于冷战时期，可能是有史以来最成功的战斗步枪。尽管被贴上了过时的标签，但其可调气体系统确保了可靠性和低后坐力，使FAL在现代竞争对手中保持领先。"
"这是DSA公司按SA-58模型生产的半自动复制品。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "G3 battle rifle"
msgid_plural "G3 battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "G3 战斗步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "G3 battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "G3 battle rifle"
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic, domestically produced clone of an early battle rifle "
"developed after the end of WWII.  Known as the PTR 91, it is a fantastically "
"reliable, cheap to produce rifle that continues to serve in conflict regions. "
" Though the action is legendary, its handling characteristics and harsher "
"recoil leave something to be desired."
msgstr ""
"一种在二战结束后研发的半自动、美国产仿制的早期战斗步枪。PTR "
"91是一种非常可靠、生产成本低廉的步枪，用以继续在冲突地区服役。尽管此枪机械结构堪称传奇，但其不易操控和巨大的后坐力仍需改进。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "G3 battle rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "G3 battle rifle"
msgid "PTR 91 rifle"
msgid_plural "PTR 91 rifles"
msgstr[0] "PTR 91 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "G3 battle rifle" of gun "PTR 91 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "PTR 91 rifle" of item "G3 battle rifle"
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic, domestically produced clone of an early battle rifle "
"developed after the end of WWII.  The PTR 91 is a fantastically reliable, "
"cheap to produce rifle that continues to serve in conflict regions.  Though "
"the action is legendary, its handling characteristics and harsher recoil "
"leave something to be desired."
msgstr ""
"一种在二战结束后研发的半自动、美国产仿制的早期战斗步枪。PTR "
"91是一种非常可靠、生产成本低廉的步枪，用以继续在冲突地区服役。尽管此枪机械结构堪称传奇，但其不易操控和巨大的后坐力仍需改进。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "G3 battle rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "G3 battle rifle"
msgid "Century C308 rifle"
msgid_plural "Century C308 rifles"
msgstr[0] "世纪武器 C308 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "G3 battle rifle" of gun "Century C308 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Century C308 rifle" of item "G3 battle rifle"
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic, domestically produced clone of the CETME Model C, the "
"progenitor of the famous H&K G3 battle rifle.  The CETME is a fantastically "
"reliable, cheap to produce rifle that continues to serve in conflict regions. "
" Though the action is legendary, its handling characteristics and harsher "
"recoil leave something to be desired."
msgstr ""
"一款美国仿制半自动C型步枪，该型步枪是著名的H&K "
"G3战斗步枪的前身。C型步枪是一种非常可靠、生产成本低廉的步枪，用以继续在冲突地区服役。尽管此枪机械结构堪称传奇，但其不易操控和巨大的后坐力仍需改进。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M134D-H Minigun"
msgid_plural "M134D-H Miniguns"
msgstr[0] "M134D-H 迷你砲"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M134D-H Minigun"
#. ~ Description of "M134D-H Minigun"
msgid ""
"The M134D-H Minigun is a (relatively) lightweight heavy rotary machine gun.  "
"Its six barrels are rotated by an electric motor, powered by UPS or vehicle.  "
"If you could find enough ammo for it, it would become a devastating weapon.  "
"It must be mounted on a vehicle before use."
msgstr ""
"M134D-H 迷你炮是一支（相對）輕量的重型旋轉式機槍。六支槍管以 UPS 或車輛供電的電動馬達旋轉。如果你有足夠的子彈的話, "
"這武器會是一件毀滅性的武器。它必須安裝在車輛上使用。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "low auto"
msgstr "低自動"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json data/json/items/gun/ups.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "high auto"
msgstr "高自動"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M14 EBR-RI rifle"
msgid_plural "M14 EBR-RI rifles"
msgstr[0] "M14 EBR-RI 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M14 EBR-RI rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M14 EBR-RI rifle"
msgid ""
"A highly modified version of the M14 rifle designed to cover both CQB and "
"designated marksman roles.  A very powerful and versatile rifle, if somewhat "
"heavy."
msgstr "一把經過高度修改的 M14 步槍，它被設計來兼具近距離戰鬥與狙擊的功能，威力強大且用途廣泛，只是有點重。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "American battle rifle"
msgid_plural "American battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "美国战斗步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "American battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "American battle rifle"
msgid ""
"This civilian variant of an American battle rifle is essentially a rifle from "
"World War 2 with a detachable magazine stuck in it that was sold to the "
"military as a cheap, do-all rifle that could replace many other weapon "
"systems.  While it delivered none of those things, it was an acceptable "
"rifle, if marginally inferior to its contemporaries."
msgstr ""
"这款美国战斗步枪的民用版本质上是一把二战时期的步枪，里面有一个可拆卸的弹匣，作为一种廉价的通用步枪卖给了军方，可以取代许多其他武器系统。虽然其差强人意，但其"
"任然是一款可以接受的步枪，与同时代的步枪相比略有逊色。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "American battle rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "American battle rifle"
msgid "M1A rifle"
msgid_plural "M1A rifles"
msgstr[0] "M1A 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "American battle rifle" of gun "M1A rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "M1A rifle" of item "American battle rifle"
msgid ""
"This civilian variant of the M14 is essentially the M1 Garand from World War "
"2 with a detachable magazine stuck in it that was sold to the military as a "
"cheap, do-all rifle that could replace many other weapon systems.  While it "
"delivered none of those things, it was an acceptable rifle, if marginally "
"inferior to its contemporaries."
msgstr ""
"这把M14的民用版本质上是二战时期的M1"
"加兰德步枪，里面有一个可拆卸的弹匣，作为一种廉价的通用步枪卖给了军方，可以取代许多其他武器系统。虽然其差强人意，但其任然是一款可以接受的步枪，与同时代的步枪"
"相比略有逊色。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M240 machine gun"
msgid_plural "M240 machine guns"
msgstr[0] "M240 机枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M240 machine gun"
#. ~ Description of "M240 machine gun"
msgid ""
"The M240 is a medium machine gun used by the US military, replacing the older "
"M60.  Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the M240 is designed to fire "
"many rounds very quickly."
msgstr "M240 通用機槍是美國軍方採用的中型機槍，取代了舊式的 M60 通用機槍。準確度低而且難以控制。M240 通用機槍可以在短時間內發射大量子彈。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M60 machine gun"
msgid_plural "M60 machine guns"
msgstr[0] "M60 机枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M60 machine gun"
#. ~ Description of "M60 machine gun"
msgid ""
"The M60 is a general-purpose machine gun developed to replace the .30-caliber "
"M1918 and M1919.  Heavy and difficult to handle fired from the shoulder, as "
"most people aren't action-movie heroes."
msgstr "M60 是一把通用機槍, 旨在取代 .30 口徑的 M1918 和 M1919。槍身沉重, 難以在缺乏支撐下提槍射擊, 因為大多數人都不是動作片英雄。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M60 semi auto machine gun"
msgid_plural "M60 semi auto machine guns"
msgstr[0] "M60 半自动机枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M60 semi auto machine gun"
#. ~ Description of "M60 semi auto machine gun"
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic civilian variant of the M60 machine gun, retaining the "
"ability to be belt fed, an uncommon feature in civilian firearms."
msgstr "一把M60机枪的半自动民用版本。值得注意的是，它保留了用弹药带供弹的能力，这个特色功能在民用枪械中不太常见。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Savage 111F rifle"
msgid_plural "Savage 111F rifles"
msgstr[0] "萨维奇 111F 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Savage 111F rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Savage 111F rifle"
msgid ""
"A very accurate rifle chambered for the powerful .308 round.  Its very low "
"ammo capacity is offset by its accuracy and near-complete lack of recoil."
msgstr "一把裝填 .308 口徑子彈的強大步槍。其極高的準確度以及極低的後座力可以讓你忽視它彈藥容量很少的事實。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "FN SCAR-H rifle"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR-H rifles"
msgstr[0] "FN SCAR-H 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "FN SCAR-H rifle"
#. ~ Description of "FN SCAR-H rifle"
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular battle rifle specially designed for the United "
"States Special Operations Command.  The 'H' in its name stands for heavy, as "
"it uses the powerful .308 round."
msgstr "一把高精準且可附掛武器的戰鬥步槍, 專由美國特種部隊單位所使用。在其名稱中的 \"H\" 代表重型, 因為它使用強大的 .308 子彈。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "FN SCAR-H sniper rifle"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR-H sniper rifles"
msgstr[0] "FN SCAR-H 狙击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "FN SCAR-H sniper rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "FN SCAR-H sniper rifle" of gun "FN SCAR-H MK 20
#. SSR"
#. ~ Description of "FN SCAR-H sniper rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "FN SCAR-H MK 20 SSR" of item "FN SCAR-H sniper
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"Sniper Support Rifle, this semi-auto variant of SCAR-H is designed for a "
"long-range precision application, to be used by dedicated marksman.  Includes "
"extended barrel, bipod, and a few additional attachment for greater comfort "
"of a user."
msgstr "这款SCAR-H半自动改型狙击支援步枪，专为远距离精确射击设计，供专业射手使用。配备加长枪管、两脚架及若干提升操作舒适度的附加配件。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "FN SCAR-H sniper rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "FN SCAR-H sniper rifle"
msgid "FN SCAR-H MK 20 SSR"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR-H MK 20 SSR"
msgstr[0] "FN SCAR-H MK 20 SSR "

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "civilian FN SCAR-H rifle"
msgid_plural "civilian FN SCAR-H rifles"
msgstr[0] "民用 FN SCAR-H 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "civilian FN SCAR-H rifle"
#. ~ Description of "civilian FN SCAR-H rifle"
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular battle rifle specially designed for the United "
"States Special Operations Command.  This one is a civilian model, limited to "
"semi-auto."
msgstr "这款高精度模块化战斗步枪专为美国特种作战司令部设计。此为民用版本，仅限半自动射击。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "civilian FN SCAR-H rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "civilian FN SCAR-H rifle"
msgid "FN SCAR 17S"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR 17S"
msgstr[0] "FN SCAR 17S 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "civilian FN SCAR-H rifle" of gun "FN SCAR 17S"
#. ~ Description of variant "FN SCAR 17S" of item "civilian FN SCAR-H rifle"
msgid ""
"The SCAR 17S is the semi-auto version of the SCAR-H rifle used in the "
"military.  With how powerful .308 is, maybe having it in semi-auto only is a "
"blessing."
msgstr "SCAR 17S 是SCAR-H 军用步枪的半自动民用版本。考虑到.308弹药的强大威力，只有半自动或许是件好事。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M24 rifle"
msgid_plural "M24 rifles"
msgstr[0] "M24 狙击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M24 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M24 rifle"
msgid ""
"The M24 Sniper is the military and police version of the Remington Model 700 "
"rifle, M24 being the model name assigned by the United States Army after "
"adoption as their standard sniper rifle in 1988.  The M24 is referred to as a "
"'weapon system' because it consists of not only a rifle, but also a "
"detachable telescopic sight and other accessories."
msgstr ""
"M24 狙击步枪是雷明顿 700 步枪的军用及警用版本。该型号的命名源自美国陆军于1988年将其作为标准狙击步枪使用。M24 "
"也被称为\"武器系统\"，因为它不单单是一把步枪，还包含了可拆卸的望远镜式瞄准镜和其他配件。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "HK417 rifle"
msgid_plural "HK417 rifles"
msgstr[0] "HK417步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "HK417 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "HK417 rifle" of gun "HK417 A2 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "HK417 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "HK417 A2 rifle" of item "HK417 rifle"
msgid ""
"A German battle rifle with a 13\" barrel and telescopic stock.  It is a "
"gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle with a short-stroke piston design similar "
"to that of the G36."
msgstr "一种德国战斗步枪，枪管13英寸(约33厘米)，枪托可伸缩。它是一种气动旋转螺栓步枪，具有类似 G36 步枪的短冲程活塞设计。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "HK417 rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "HK417 rifle"
msgid "HK417 A2 rifle"
msgid_plural "HK417 A2 rifles"
msgstr[0] "HK417 A2 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "HK417 marksman's rifle"
msgid_plural "HK417 marksman's rifles"
msgstr[0] "HK417精确射手步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "HK417 marksman's rifle"
#. ~ Description of "HK417 marksman's rifle"
msgid ""
"A gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle accurate to 1.5 MOA with standard "
"ammunition, and featuring an aluminum upper receiver for reduced weight."
msgstr "一把导气式，搭配滚转式枪机的步枪，使用标准弹药精度可达到1.5角分。包含一个铝制上机匣以减轻重量。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "HK417 marksman's rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "HK417 marksman's rifle"
msgid "M110A1 rifle"
msgid_plural "M110A1 rifles"
msgstr[0] "M110A1 狙击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "HK417 marksman's rifle" of gun "M110A1 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "M110A1 rifle" of item "HK417 marksman's rifle"
msgid ""
"A derivative of H&K's G28 with an aluminum upper receiver to meet US Army "
"weight requirements.  It is a gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle accurate to "
"1.5 MOA with standard ammunition."
msgstr "H&K G28 狙击步枪的衍生版产物，配备可调节枪托及可拆卸两脚架。它是一种气动、旋转上膛的栓式步枪，使用标准弹药时可精确到 1.5 MOA。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "PAP AK-style rifle"
msgid_plural "PAP AK-style rifles"
msgstr[0] "PAP AK式步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "PAP AK-style rifle"
#. ~ Description of "PAP AK-style rifle"
msgid "A civilian AK pattern rifle, chambered in 7.62x51mm NATO."
msgstr "一把民用AK型步枪，使用 7.62x51 NATO 弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "PAP AK-style rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "PAP AK-style rifle"
msgid "PAP M77 rifle"
msgid_plural "PAP M77 rifles"
msgstr[0] "PAP M77 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "PAP AK-style rifle" of gun "PAP M77 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "PAP M77 rifle" of item "PAP AK-style rifle"
msgid ""
"A Serbian-made AK pattern rifle made by Zastava in 7.62x51mm NATO.  To avoid "
"import restrictions, Zastava USA has added a number of American-made parts."
msgstr "Zastava在塞尔维亚使用 7.62x51mm NATO 弹药标准制造的AK型步枪。为了避免进口限制，Zastava USA 增加了一些美国制造的零件。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "AR-10 rifle"
msgid_plural "AR-10 rifles"
msgstr[0] "AR-10 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "AR-10 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "AR-10 rifle"
msgid ""
"Somewhat similar to the later AR-15, the AR-10 is a gas-operated, rotating "
"bolt rifle chambered for 7.62x51mm rounds."
msgstr "与后来的 AR-15 步枪有点相似，AR-10 步枪是一种气动旋转式螺栓步枪，使用7.62x51mm口径的子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle"
msgid_plural "7.62x51mm bullpup rifles"
msgstr[0] "7.62x51mm 无托步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle"
#. ~ Description of "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use "
"of polymers and aluminum, using standard magazines of the heavy automatic "
"rifle and a 7.62x51mm cartridge."
msgstr "这是一款小型半自动步枪，由于使用了聚合物和铝材制造，枪身较轻，使用重型自动步枪的标准弹匣和7.62x51mm口径的子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle"
msgid "Kel-Tec RFB rifle"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec RFB rifles"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec RFB 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle" of gun "Kel-Tec RFB
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Kel-Tec RFB rifle" of item "7.62x51mm bullpup
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightweight, polymer frame, "
"using magazines from the FN FAL and the .308 Winchester cartridge.  The "
"rifle, forward-ejection, bullpup (abbreviated as RFB) features forward case "
"ejection, ambidextrous controls, and structural use of the barrel, uncommon "
"in modern designs."
msgstr ""
"这是一把使用轻质聚合材料框架的半自动无托式步枪，兼容FN FAL步枪的弹匣和 .308 "
"温切斯特子弹。这把前抛壳无托步枪（简称RFB）的特点是前抛壳、高操控性以及现代枪械设计中少见的结构化枪管。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "scouting rifle"
msgid_plural "scouting rifles"
msgstr[0] "侦查步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of gun "scouting rifle"
#. ~ Description of "scouting rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a versatile, all-purpose hunting rifle.  To this end, it is "
"exceedingly lightweight, contains an inbuilt polymer bipod, and fits a spare "
"magazine inside the stock for fast reloading.  While these features made for "
"a hunting rifle too universal for widespread adoption, they might yet fulfill "
"a vital scouting niche for survivors in the post-Cataclysm world."
msgstr ""
"这是一支多功能、通用的猎枪。为此，它非常轻，包含一个内置的聚合物两脚架，并在枪托内安装一个备用弹匣，以便快速重新装载。虽然这些功能使猎枪过于普遍，无法广泛采"
"用，但它们可能会为后大灾难世界的幸存者提供重要的侦察位置。"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "scouting rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "scouting rifle"
msgid "Steyr Scout rifle"
msgid_plural "Steyr Scout rifles"
msgstr[0] "斯太尔侦查步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
#. ~ Description of variant "scouting rifle" of gun "Steyr Scout rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Steyr Scout rifle" of item "scouting rifle"
msgid ""
"The Steyr Scout is Steyr's interpretation of Jeff Cooper's concept of a "
"'scout rifle', a versatile, all-purpose hunting rifle.  To this end, it is "
"exceedingly lightweight, and contains a built-in polymer bipod, and fits a "
"spare magazine inside the stock for fast reloading.  While these features "
"made for a hunting rifle too universal for widespread adoption, they might "
"yet fulfill a vital scouting niche for survivors in the post-Cataclysm world."
msgstr ""
"斯太尔侦察步枪是斯太尔公司对杰夫·库珀的“侦察步枪”概念的诠释，这这是一支多功能、通用的猎枪。为此，它非常轻，包含一个内置的聚合物两脚架，并在枪托内安装一个"
"备用弹匣，以便快速重新装载。虽然这些功能使猎枪过于普遍，无法广泛采用，但它们可能会为后大灾难世界的幸存者提供重要的侦察位置。"

#: data/json/items/gun/30carbine.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M1 carbine"
msgid_plural "M1 carbines"
msgstr[0] "M1 卡賓槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/30carbine.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M1 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "M1 carbine"
msgid ""
"A light rifle developed during the Second World War to provide a less "
"cumbersome weapon for soldiers that didn't need the firepower of the M1 "
"Garand.  Firing the .30 Carbine cartridge, it provides more firepower than a "
"pistol and is easier to carry than most other rifles."
msgstr ""
"一把在第二次世界大战期间研制的轻型步枪，为不需要 M1 加兰德步枪火力的士兵提供一种不那么笨重的武器。使用 .30 "
"卡宾枪弹药，比手枪威力更大，又比其他步枪更容易携带。"

#: data/json/items/gun/30carbine.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M2 carbine"
msgid_plural "M2 carbines"
msgstr[0] "M2 卡賓槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/30carbine.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M2 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "M2 carbine"
msgid ""
"An improved version of the M1 carbine offering full-auto capability, the M2 "
"carbine was rare and coveted among collectors even before the world ended.  "
"Takes M1 carbine magazines."
msgstr "M2 卡宾枪是 M1 卡宾枪的改进型号，增加了全自动模式，甚至在世界末日之前，M2 卡宾枪在收藏家中也十分罕见，令人垂涎。使用 M1 卡宾枪弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Walther PPK pistol"
msgid_plural "Walther PPK pistol"
msgstr[0] "瓦尔特PP手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Walther PPK pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Walther PPK pistol"
msgid ""
"One of the most famous handguns of the 20th century.  Your name is not Bond, "
"but you might find this little gun still useful."
msgstr "它是 20 世紀最有名的手槍之一。你不叫龐德, 但你可能會發現這個小手槍還是有用的。"

#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Kel-Tec P-32 pistol"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec P-32 pistols"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec P-32半自动手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/32.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Kel-Tec P-32 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Kel-Tec P-32 pistol"
msgid ""
"One of Kel-Tec's oldest designs, the P-32 is a popular option for deep "
"concealment and backup usage.  Despite its extreme light weight and small "
"size, its .32 ACP chambering makes for good handling and recoil control."
msgstr ""
"作为Kel-Tec数控工业公司最古老的设计之一，P-32手枪常常在秘密渗透和火力支援时使用。虽然它的重量非常轻，体积也很小，但是它的 .32ACP "
"口径使它的后坐力很小，易于控制。"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "AI bolt-action sniper rifle"
msgid_plural "AI bolt-action sniper rifles"
msgstr[0] "精密国际栓动狙击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Description of gun "AI bolt-action sniper rifle"
#. ~ Description of "AI bolt-action sniper rifle"
msgid ""
"A high-precision bolt-action sniper rifle, in service with special operations "
"members of the US Navy prior to the Cataclysm.  Firing the powerful .338 "
"Lapua cartridge, the weapon feeds from detachable five round Accuracy "
"International magazines."
msgstr "这是一支高精度栓动式狙击步枪，在“大灾变”之前列装于美国海军特种作战部队。它使用威力强大的.338 拉普马格南弹，使用可拆卸的精密国际牌5发弹匣进行供弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "AI bolt-action sniper rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "AI bolt-action sniper rifle"
msgid "McMillan Tac-338 rifle"
msgid_plural "McMillan Tac-338 rifles"
msgstr[0] "麦克米兰 Tac-338 狙击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Description of variant "AI bolt-action sniper rifle" of gun "McMillan
#. Tac-338 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "McMillan Tac-338 rifle" of item "AI bolt-action
#. sniper rifle"
msgid ""
"Chambering the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Tac-338 is a high-precision, "
"bolt-action sniper rifle that, before the Cataclysm, complemented the arsenal "
"of the US Navy Special Warfare unit.  Providing Navy SEAL marksmen with the "
"capability to land effective shots on targets at a typical range of 1600 "
"meters, a valuable capability for the long-distance engagements prevalent "
"during the US army's war on terror, the rifle comes kitted with an adjustable "
"cheek pad, butt hook, and muzzle break."
msgstr ""
"Tac-338 是一款高精度的栓动式狙击步枪，使用 .338 Lapua 弹药。在大灾变前，是美国海军特种作战部队武器库的补充。 能让海豹突击队狙击手在 "
"1600 米的典型射程内有效射击目标，这种能力在美军反恐战争时期常见的远距离交战中非常可贵。该步枪配备了可调节的托腮板，枪托钩和枪口制动器。"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "single-shot target rifle"
msgid_plural "single-shot target rifles"
msgstr[0] "单发靶枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Description of gun "single-shot target rifle"
#. ~ Description of "single-shot target rifle"
msgid ""
"A bolt-action precision rifle with the potential for impressive accuracy, "
"this particular weapon makes use of the powerful .338 Lapua cartridge and is "
"decked in a handsome set of wooden furniture, providing the rifle with a "
"classical mystique.  Unfortunately, the weapon's single-round magazine and a "
"lack of factory iron sights, which makes target acquisition an exercise in "
"futility unless a gunsight is installed, make the rifle limited in its "
"post-Cataclysm utility."
msgstr ""
"这是一款精度极高的栓动式精确步枪，它使用强力的 .338 拉普阿弹，配有漂亮的木制装饰，为步枪提供了古典的神秘感。 "
"不幸的是，由于该武器的单发弹匣且没有机瞄，除非安装瞄准具，否则连瞄准目标都做不到，这使得它在大灾变后的实用性受到限制。"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "single-shot target rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "single-shot target rifle"
msgid "Savage 112 Magnum Target rifle"
msgid_plural "Savage 112 Magnum Target rifles"
msgstr[0] "萨维奇 112 马格南靶枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Description of variant "single-shot target rifle" of gun "Savage 112
#. Magnum Target rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Savage 112 Magnum Target rifle" of item "single-
#. shot target rifle"
msgid ""
"A highly-accurate precision rifle chambered for the powerful .338 Lapua "
"cartridge, the Savage 112 Magnum Target is a classically designed bolt-action "
"rifle in both its fit and finish, with a heavy barrel, a hardwood stock, and "
"an attached muzzle brake.  Unfortunately for the weapon and its users, a "
"traditional veneer, no matter how admittedly swanky, isn't conducive to "
"tactical effectiveness, as demonstrated by the 112 Magnum Target's mighty "
"magazine size of one entire cartridge and lack of any factory-attached sights."
msgstr ""
"萨维奇 112 马格南“目标”步枪是一款设计经典的高精度栓动式精密步枪，使用强力的 .338 "
"拉普阿弹，配有重枪管、硬木枪托和加装式枪口制退器，无论是装配还是表面处理都做得很好。 "
"不幸的是，对于武器及其使用者来说，再好看的饰面，也不提供战术价值。它'大容量'的一发弹匣以及出厂没有附装任何瞄准具很好的证明了这一点。"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Barrett precision rifle"
msgid_plural "Barrett precision rifles"
msgstr[0] "巴雷特 精准步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Barrett precision rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Barrett precision rifle"
msgid ""
"A box magazine-fed bolt-action precision rifle developed by the Barrett Arms "
"Company, firing the .338 Lapua cartridge.  A civilian copy of more versatile "
"military weapons, this rifle is a remarkably well-crafted piece of "
"anti-personnel engineering despite lacking the sheer modularity of its "
"Marshal sister, and is still capable of engaging targets at extreme distances."
msgstr ""
"由 Barrett Arms Company 研制的盒式弹匣供弹栓动精密步枪，发射 .338 拉普阿弹。 "
"作为军队武器的民用仿制品，它仍是杰出的人员杀伤武器。尽管它不像制式版本的姊妹那样完全模块化，但在极远距离打击目标的能力一点不弱。"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Barrett precision rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Barrett precision rifle"
msgid "Barrett MRAD SMR rifle"
msgid_plural "Barrett MRAD SMR rifles"
msgstr[0] "巴雷特 MRAD SMR 步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Barrett precision rifle" of gun "Barrett MRAD SMR
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Barrett MRAD SMR rifle" of item "Barrett
#. precision rifle"
msgid ""
"Chambered for the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Barrett MRAD SMR is a civilian "
"variant of the MK22 MRAD sniper rifle, which was in service with elements of "
"the US army and is often regarded as one of the finest bolt-action sniper "
"rifles ever developed.  The primary differences that set this weapon apart "
"from its Marshal sibling are the removal of the MRAD's caliber conversion "
"capabilities and the installation of a fixed buttstock.  These changes have "
"resulted in a lighter and slimmer rifle that, most importantly for the "
"discerning pre-Cataclysmic precision shooter, didn't require a second "
"mortgage to purchase."
msgstr ""
"采用 .338 Lapua 弹药的巴雷特 MRAD SMR 是 MK22 MRAD "
"狙击步枪的民用改型，它曾在美国军队服役，通常被认为是有史以来最好的栓动式狙击步枪之一。这种武器与其姊妹型号的区别主要在于取消了 MRAD "
"的口径转换功能并安装了固定枪托。这使它更轻更薄，最重要的是对于大灾变前挑剔的精确射手来说，它不需要二次抵押购买。"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "modular sniper rifle"
msgid_plural "modular sniper rifles"
msgstr[0] "模块化狙击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Description of gun "modular sniper rifle"
#. ~ Description of "modular sniper rifle"
msgid ""
"A weapon platform that prides itself on modularity and customizability, this "
"highly accurate precision rifle may be configured with various caliber "
"conversion kits that can allow it to fire either the .338 Lapua, .300 Win "
"Mag, or .308 Winchester cartridges.  The rifle's size prevents it from being "
"a particularly mobile piece of equipment, but the weapon's folding buttstock "
"aids in portability."
msgstr ""
"以模块化和定制性而自豪的步枪平台，这种高精度的精密步枪可以搭配各种口径转换套件，以发射 .338 拉普阿、.300 温彻斯特马格南或 .308 "
"温彻斯特子弹。 枪身的尺寸使其无法成为特别便携的装备，但武器的折叠式枪托有助于携带。"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "modular sniper rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "modular sniper rifle"
msgid "Accuracy International AXMC rifle"
msgid_plural "Accuracy International AXMC rifles"
msgstr[0] "精密国际 AXMC 狙击步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/338lapua.json
#. ~ Description of variant "modular sniper rifle" of gun "Accuracy
#. International AXMC rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Accuracy International AXMC rifle" of item
#. "modular sniper rifle"
msgid ""
"Produced by the British precision rifle company Accuracy International, the "
"AX Modular Caliber Weapon System is a highly-accurate combat sniper rifle "
"offered to military, law enforcement, and civilian precision marksmen.  The "
"rifle is compatible with a wide range of aftermarket components, including "
"caliber conversion kits, and is built upon a base aluminum chassis, into "
"which the weapon's parts may be installed or removed at the user's discretion."
msgstr ""
"AX 模块化武器平台由英国精确步枪公司 "
"精密国际所生产，是一款高精度的战斗狙击步枪，适用于军队、执法部门和精确射击爱好者。该步枪兼容大量的零售组件，也能使用口径改装套件。由于组装于铝制基座上，武器"
"配件可以按用户的需求安装或拆卸。"

#: data/json/items/gun/357sig.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "SIG P226"
msgid_plural "SIG P226s"
msgstr[0] "SIG P226 手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/357sig.json
#. ~ Description of gun "SIG P226"
#. ~ Description of "SIG P226"
msgid ""
"A SIG Sauer P226 chambered for .357 SIG.  The P226 is a DA/SA, short-recoil "
"operated semi-automatic pistol."
msgstr "一把裝填了.357 SIG子彈的SIG 紹爾 P226手槍。P226是一款單/雙動操作方式的短行程後座式半自動手槍。"

#: data/json/items/gun/357sig.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "SIG P320 Compact"
msgid_plural "SIG P320 Compacts"
msgstr[0] "SIG P320 緊湊型手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/357sig.json
#. ~ Description of gun "SIG P320 Compact"
#. ~ Description of "SIG P320 Compact"
msgid ""
"The P320 Compact is a semi-automatic, short recoil operated pistol.  This one "
"is chambered for .357 SIG."
msgstr "西格 P320 紧凑型手枪是一种半自动的短反冲手枪。这一把使用 .357 西格弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/36paper.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "civil war six-shooter"
msgid_plural "civil war six-shooters"
msgstr[0] "南北战争六发左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/36paper.json
#. ~ Description of gun "civil war six-shooter"
#. ~ Description of "civil war six-shooter"
msgid ""
"The Colt Model 1861 Navy cap & ball .36-caliber revolver was a six-shot, "
"single-action percussion weapon produced by Colt's Manufacturing Company from "
"1861 until 1873."
msgstr "柯特 M1861 海軍型轉輪手槍是一把 .36 口徑的單動式左輪手槍，可裝彈 6 發。由塞繆爾·柯特所研製。該槍一直持續生產至 1873 年。"

#: data/json/items/gun/36paper.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "civil war six-shooter"
#. ~ Variant name of item "civil war six-shooter"
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Colt M1861 Navy"
msgid_plural "Colt M1861 Navy"
msgstr[0] "柯特 M1861 海軍型轉輪手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/36paper.json
#. ~ Description of variant "civil war six-shooter" of gun "Colt M1861 Navy"
#. ~ Description of variant "Colt M1861 Navy" of item "civil war six-shooter"
msgid ""
"The Colt M1861 is a black powder, cap & ball revolver dating back to the "
"Civil War.  While reloading it takes quite a while due to having to put a "
"primer on each chamber manually, instead of having the primer in one unit "
"with the casing, like metallic cartridges.  However, for the time 6 shots in "
"quick succession was a great thing for cavalry and officers to have on the "
"field, though this version was much rarer than the more popular Colt M1860.  "
"Nowadays, this firearm is completely outdated, and only sees use in "
"collections, reenactment, or special shooting competitions.  However, black "
"powder guns such as this are less regulated than more modern firearms, so it "
"is sometimes the first gun a youth may buy.  This one is chambered in .36, "
"weaker than the M1860's .44."
msgstr ""
"柯特 M1861 "
"海軍型轉輪手槍是一把使用黑火藥、帽和球的左輪手槍，其歷史可追溯至美國內戰時期。重新裝填時需要相當長的時間，因為必須手動在每個彈膛上放置底火，而不是像金屬彈藥"
"那樣將底火與外殼裝在一個單元中。然而，當時快速連續射擊 6 發對於騎兵和軍官來說是一件很棒的事情，儘管比更受歡迎的柯特 M1860 "
"陸軍型轉輪手槍要少得多。如今，這種槍械已經完全過時了，只有在收藏、復刻或特殊射擊比賽中才會使用。然而，與更現代的槍支相比，此類黑火藥槍的監管較少，因此有時它"
"是年輕人可能購買的第一支槍。這把槍的彈膛口徑為 .36 吋，比柯特 M1860 陸軍型轉輪手槍的 .44 吋口徑威力更小。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "double barrel .38 pistol"
msgid_plural "double barrel .38 pistols"
msgstr[0] ".38口径双管手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun "double barrel .38 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "double barrel .38 pistol"
msgid ""
"A crudely made double barrel pistol firing .38 Special ammo.  Unfortunately, "
"the name is less about the double barrels and more about the number of shots "
"you'll get before it breaks down on you."
msgstr ""
"一把自制的双管 .38 特制弹手枪。不幸的是，这枪名字里的\"双发\"指的不是它有几根枪管，而是它坏掉之前能发射多少发子弹。\n"
"\"哈哈搞到一把双管霰……手、手枪？\""

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "six-shooter"
msgid_plural "six-shooters"
msgstr[0] "六发左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun "six-shooter"
#. ~ Description of "six-shooter"
msgid ""
"A six-shot revolver, produced since 1899 and known as the most popular "
"handgun of the 20th century.  It has a swing-out cylinder for ease of "
"reloading."
msgstr "一把六发左轮手枪，最早于1899年生产，被誉为20世纪最流行的手枪。弹仓能够侧向旋出，便于重新装填。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "six-shooter"
#. ~ Variant name of item "six-shooter"
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "S&W Model 10"
msgid_plural "S&W Model 10s"
msgstr[0] "S&W Model 10 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant "six-shooter" of gun "S&W Model 10"
#. ~ Description of variant "S&W Model 10" of item "six-shooter"
msgid ""
"The Model 10 is one of the oldest firearm models still in production, and "
"most produced handguns, with production dating back to 1899.  Starting life "
"as the Model 1899 Hand Ejector, it only picked up the current name of Model "
"10 in the 1950s.  Despite .38 Special and .357 Magnum being the same caliber, "
"Model 10s were produced to handle blackpowder loads, and while modern "
"smokeless loads of .38 Special work fine, .357 Magnum could cause the Model "
"10 to catastrophically fail."
msgstr ""
"10型左轮是仍在生产的最古老的枪械型号之一，也是生产最多的手枪，其生产可以追溯到1899年。它最初是手动退弹的1899型，直到20世纪50年代才更名为10"
"型。尽管.38 特制弹和.357 马格南弹的口径相同，但10型的生产是为了处理黑火药装载，而.38 特制弹装载现代无烟火药具有优良特性，.357 "
"马格南弹可能会导致10型左轮发生灾难性故障。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "pipe rifle: .38 Special"
msgid_plural "pipe rifles: .38 Special"
msgstr[0] ".38 特殊彈 鋼管步槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "conceal-carry six-shooter"
msgid_plural "conceal-carry six-shooters"
msgstr[0] "隐蔽型六发左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "conceal-carry six-shooter"
#. ~ Variant name of item "conceal-carry six-shooter"
msgid "Ruger LCR"
msgid_plural "Ruger LCRs"
msgstr[0] "鲁格 LCP 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant "conceal-carry six-shooter" of gun "Ruger LCR"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger LCR" of item "conceal-carry six-shooter"
msgid ""
"The Ruger LCR (Lightweight Compact Revolver) is a modern revolver, starting "
"production in just 2010.  It's a lightweight, aluminum-framed revolver, "
"designed for conceal carry with its double-action-only trigger, lightweight "
"and compact size.  Due to the double-action trigger, it is more possible to "
"carry it in your pocket instead of a holster due to the heavy trigger, but "
"still ill-advised."
msgstr ""
"鲁格 "
"LCR（紧凑型轻型左轮手枪）是一款现代左轮手枪，于2010"
"年开始生产，采用了轻型的铝制框架，设计紧凑轻便，专为隐蔽携带而设计，并采用了纯双动扳机。由于双动扳机的扳机力度较重，因此理论上比放在枪套，更适合放在口袋中携"
"带，但还是不建议这么干。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "classic .357 revolver"
msgid_plural "classic .357 revolver"
msgstr[0] "经典款 .357 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun "classic .357 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "classic .357 revolver"
msgid ""
"A six inch revolver chambered in .357 Magnum/.38 Special.  Favorite of "
"sheriffs and post-Cataclysm survivor group leaders."
msgstr "一把6英寸(约15厘米)枪管型左轮，使用.357 马格南弹或.38 特制弹。治安官和大灾变后幸存者领袖的最爱。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "classic .357 revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item "classic .357 revolver"
msgid "Colt Python"
msgid_plural "Colt Python"
msgstr[0] "柯尔特蟒蛇型左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant "classic .357 revolver" of gun "Colt Python"
#. ~ Description of variant "Colt Python" of item "classic .357 revolver"
msgid ""
"Made by Colt, this six inch six-shooter is one of the most lauded revolvers "
"ever produced.  Can fire .38 Special and .357 Magnum."
msgstr "这把6英寸(约15厘米)枪管型左轮由柯尔特制造，是有史以来最受喜爱的左轮手枪之一。它可以发射.38 特制弹或者.357 马格南弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "7-shots .357 revolver"
msgid_plural "7-shots .357 revolver"
msgstr[0] ".357 7发左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun "7-shots .357 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "7-shots .357 revolver"
msgid "A revolver chambered in .357, with a 6 inch barrel and 7 shots."
msgstr "一把 .357 口径的左轮手枪，使用6英寸(约15厘米)长的枪管，可容纳7发子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "7-shots .357 revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item "7-shots .357 revolver"
msgid "S&W 686 Plus"
msgid_plural "S&W 686 Plus"
msgstr[0] "S&W 686 Plus 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant "7-shots .357 revolver" of gun "S&W 686 Plus"
#. ~ Description of variant "S&W 686 Plus" of item "7-shots .357 revolver"
msgid ""
"Introduced in the 90's, Smith & Wesson's model 686 'Plus' features a robust "
"stainless steel frame, an adjustable front sight and a seventh shot that's "
"sure to save your life."
msgstr "史密斯威森 686 “Plus”型左轮诞生于90年代，具有坚固的不锈钢枪身，一个可调整前准星，并且弹仓容量多一发，关键时刻能救你一命。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".357 revolver"
msgid_plural ".357 revolver"
msgstr[0] ".357 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".357 revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".357 revolver"
msgid "A revolver chambered in .357, with a 6 inch barrel and 6 shots."
msgstr "一把 .357 口径的左轮手枪，使用6英寸(约15厘米)长的枪管，可容纳6发子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".357 revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".357 revolver"
msgid "Chiappa Rhino"
msgid_plural "Chiappa Rhinos"
msgstr[0] "齐亚帕\"犀牛\"左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".357 revolver" of gun "Chiappa Rhino"
#. ~ Description of variant "Chiappa Rhino" of item ".357 revolver"
msgid ""
"An innovative, futuristic looking revolver designed by Emilio Ghisoni after "
"developing the Mateba, its most distinctive feature is its barrel, aligned "
"with the bottom chamber of its hexagonal cylinder to alleviate muzzle flip."
msgstr "埃米利奥·吉索尼在开发马特巴自动左轮后设计的一种新颖的、具有未来感的左轮手枪，其最显著的特点是枪管与六角圆柱的底腔对齐，以减轻枪口上跳效应。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
msgid_plural ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
msgstr[0] ".357口径 短管左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
msgid ""
"Short, stout, and compact, this stainless steel revolver is a handy dispenser "
"of .357-magnum, or lower-power .38-caliber, cartridges.  Six rounds fit "
"within the weapon, though its small stature and short barrel ensure that each "
"pull of the trigger is all but a pyrotechnic spectacle: flashy, loud, and "
"jumpy."
msgstr ""
"短小精悍，紧凑灵巧。这款不锈钢左轮手枪可以快速地射出.357 马格南弹或威力低一些的 .38 "
"弹。可容纳六发子弹，但其小巧的枪身和短枪管，导致每次扣动扳机都像举行一场烟火表演：火光大作、声响巨大，且枪口跳动巨大无比。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
msgid "Rossi RP63 revolver"
msgid_plural "Rossi RP63 revolvers"
msgstr[0] "罗西 RP63 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver" of gun "Rossi
#. RP63 revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi RP63 revolver" of item ".357-caliber snub-
#. nosed revolver"
msgid ""
"A small frame, stainless-steel Brazilian wheel gun with rubberized grips, a "
"serrated front sight, and a satin finish, boasting a 6-round cylinder of "
".357-magnum persuasion.  Affordable, before the world collapsed, and "
"confidently asserted by Rossi themselves to be the ideal carry gun for its "
"rounded butt and 3-inch barrel, you aren't wholly sure that such assertions "
"accounted for zombies."
msgstr ""
"一款小型、不锈钢巴西左轮手枪，配有橡胶握把、锯齿状准星和缎面处理，弹巢可装填六发 .357 "
"马格南弹。在大灾变降临之前，这把枪的价格平易近人，且罗西公司曾自信地宣称，其圆润的枪托和 3 "
"英寸(约8厘米)枪管，是理想的随身携带之选，但你现在不确定对上丧尸后这说法还靠不靠谱。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle"
msgid_plural "reproduction .357 lever-action rifles"
msgstr[0] "再版 .357 杠杆步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle"
msgid ""
"This fine lever-action rifle is chambered in the powerful .357 Magnum "
"cartridge, with an 20\" barrel with a tube-fed magazine.  Go get 'em cowboy!"
msgstr "这把优秀的杠杆式步枪采用威力巨大的.357 马格南弹为弹药，一根20英寸(约51厘米)枪管配上管式弹匣。干翻它们，牛仔！"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle"
msgid "Uberti 1873"
msgid_plural "Uberti 1873s"
msgstr[0] "乌贝蒂 1873 杠杆步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle" of gun
#. "Uberti 1873"
#. ~ Description of variant "Uberti 1873" of item "reproduction .357 lever-
#. action rifle"
msgid ""
"The 1873 is a rifle platform developed all the way in, unsurprisingly, 1873.  "
"This one is a fairly faithful Uberti reproduction, although the original "
"1873s pre-dated .357 Magnum, and even .38 Special.  This one has a "
"case-hardened finish, wood furniture, and octagonal barrel."
msgstr ""
"不出所料，1873是1873年开发的步枪。这是一个相当忠实的乌贝蒂复制品，尽管原始的1873年代早于.357 马格南弹，甚至.38 "
"特制弹。这一支进行了表面硬化处理，具有木制装具和八角形桶。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifle"
msgid_plural "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifles"
msgstr[0] ".357 长枪管 杠杆式步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifle"
msgid ""
"This lever-action rifle is chambered in the powerful .357 Magnum cartridge, "
"with an 20\" barrel with a tube-fed magazine.  Go get 'em cowboy!"
msgstr "这把杠杆式步枪采用威力巨大的.357 马格南弹，一根20英寸(约51厘米)枪管配上管式弹匣。干翻它们，牛仔！"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of gun "long-barreled .44 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "long-barreled .44 lever-action rifle"
msgid "Rossi R92 20\""
msgid_plural "Rossi R92s 20\""
msgstr[0] "罗西 R92s 20英寸 杠杆式步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifle" of gun
#. "Rossi R92 20""
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi R92 20"" of item "long-barreled .357 lever-
#. action rifle"
msgid ""
"The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, "
"featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim "
"to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the "
"lever-action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 20\" "
"barrel, and 10 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."
msgstr ""
"R92 "
"是罗西（Rossi）公司大受欢迎的杠杆式步枪系列，涵盖多种不同口径和枪管长度。它们并非旧式步枪的简单复刻，而是对杠杆式步枪的现代演绎。这款特殊的步枪配有木制"
"部件、20 英寸(约51厘米)枪管，可填装 10 发 .357 马格南弹或 .38 特制弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".357 lever-action rifle"
msgid_plural ".357 lever-action rifles"
msgstr[0] ".357 杠杆式步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".357 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of ".357 lever-action rifle"
msgid ""
"This fine lever-action rifle is chambered in the powerful .357 Magnum "
"cartridge, with an 16\" barrel with a tube-fed magazine.  Go get 'em cowboy!"
msgstr "这把优秀的杠杆式步枪采用威力巨大的.357 马格南弹为弹药，一根16英寸(约41厘米)枪管配上管式弹匣。干翻它们，牛仔！"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".357 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".357 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".44 lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".44 lever-action rifle"
msgid "Rossi R92 16\""
msgid_plural "Rossi R92s 16\""
msgstr[0] "罗西 R92s 16英寸 杠杆式步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".357 lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi R92 16""
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi R92 16"" of item ".357 lever-action rifle"
msgid ""
"The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, "
"featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim "
"to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the "
"lever-action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 16\" "
"barrel, and 8 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."
msgstr ""
"R92 "
"是罗西（Rossi）公司大受欢迎的杠杆式步枪系列，涵盖多种不同口径和枪管长度。它们并非旧式步枪的简单复刻，而是对杠杆式步枪的现代演绎。这款特殊的步枪配有木制"
"部件、16 英寸(约41厘米)枪管，可填装 8 发 .357 马格南弹或 .38 特制弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".38 conceal carry revolver"
msgid_plural ".38 conceal carry revolver"
msgstr[0] ".38 隐蔽携行左轮"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".38 conceal carry revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".38 conceal carry revolver"
msgid ""
"This .38 revolver is quite small and lightweight, due to its short barrel and "
"aluminum material."
msgstr "这把.38左轮相当轻盈小巧，得益于其较短的枪管和铝制材质。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".38 conceal carry revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".38 conceal carry revolver"
msgid "S&W model 642"
msgid_plural "S&W model 642s"
msgstr[0] "S&W model 642 左轮"

#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".38 conceal carry revolver" of gun "S&W model
#. 642"
#. ~ Description of variant "S&W model 642" of item ".38 conceal carry
#. revolver"
msgid ""
"A modern version of the Airweight, the 642 is a lightweight .38 caliber "
"revolver, made with an aluminum frame."
msgstr "642型是轻量化.38口径左轮手枪的现代改良版，采用铝制框架打造，延续了\"Airweight\"系列的轻巧特性。"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "MAC-11 machine pistol"
msgid_plural "MAC-11 machine pistols"
msgstr[0] "MAC-11 冲锋枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Description of gun "MAC-11 machine pistol"
#. ~ Description of "MAC-11 machine pistol"
msgid ""
"A lesser known variant of the MAC-10, this machine pistol is chambered in "
".380 ACP for a smaller overall size while remaining inherently subsonic.  "
"Smaller in almost every dimension, this inexpensive automatic weapon was "
"declared 'fit only for combat in a phone booth' due to its low weight and "
"absurd fire rate ranging from 1200 to 1400 rounds per minute."
msgstr ""
"MAC-10 冲锋枪的一个鲜为人知的衍生型号，使用 .380 ACP "
"弹药。虽然整体尺寸较小，子弹初速仍可达到亚音速。这款廉价的自动武器和其他冲锋枪相比在任何方面上都要更小，由于其重量轻，而且射速高达每分钟1200到1400"
"发，因此被称为\"仅适用于电话亭中的战斗\"。"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ruger LCP pistol"
msgid_plural "Ruger LCP pistols"
msgstr[0] "鲁格 LCP 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger LCP pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger LCP pistol"
msgid ""
"One of the best-selling modern day 'pocket pistols', the LCP is an "
"affordable, polymer framed pistol chambered in .380 ACP.  Despite the round's "
"relatively low power, the pistol's low weight and short sight radius make for "
"moderately poor handling."
msgstr ""
"作为当今最畅销的袖珍手枪之一，鲁格 LCP "
"手枪是一款价格合理的手枪，聚合物枪身，装配.380口径弹药。子弹的威力相对较低，手枪的重量轻，瞄准基线短，使得手枪的操控性较差。"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Hi-Point CF-380 pistol"
msgid_plural "Hi-Point CF-380 pistols"
msgstr[0] "Hi-Point CF-380 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Hi-Point CF-380 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Hi-Point CF-380 pistol"
msgid ""
"The Hi-Point CF-380 is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol designed by "
"Hi-Point Firearms, which is known for making inexpensive firearms, and for "
"making said firearms bulky and uncomfortable.  Hi-Points have slides made "
"with a zinc pot-metal which is relatively fragile compared to steel slides."
msgstr ""
"Hi-Point CF-380 手枪是一种采用反冲式枪机的半自动手枪，由 Hi-Point 设计。Hi-Point "
"以制造廉价武器而知名，其生产的武器常常体积巨大且使用不便。Hi-Point 制造的枪械的套筒由锌合金制成，相比钢制套筒来说比较脆弱。"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbine"
msgid_plural ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbines"
msgstr[0] ".380 ACP 手槍口徑卡賓槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbine"
#. ~ Description of ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbine"
msgid ""
"A pistol-caliber carbine chambered in .380 ACP.  It is more powerful and "
"accurate than an equivalent pistol but the .380 ACP round is nonetheless "
"fairly weak.  Accepts 10-round magazines, which are not shared with any .380 "
"ACP pistol unlike many other similar pistol-caliber carbines."
msgstr ""
"手槍口徑的卡賓槍，使用 .380 柯特自動手槍（.380 ACP）彈藥。它比同等級手槍威力更大、精度更高，但 .380 ACP 彈藥仍然相當弱。可裝填 "
"10 發彈匣，與許多其他類似的手槍口徑卡賓槍不同，該彈匣不能與任何 .380 ACP 手槍共用。"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbine"
msgid "Hi-Point 3895 carbine"
msgid_plural "Hi-Point 3895 carbines"
msgstr[0] "Hi-Point 3895 卡宾枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbine" of gun "Hi-Point
#. 3895 carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "Hi-Point 3895 carbine" of item ".380 ACP pistol-
#. caliber carbine"
msgid ""
"A pistol-caliber carbine chambered in .380 ACP, designed by Hi-Point "
"Firearms.  Its 16.5\" barrel provides extra stopping power over an equivalent "
"pistol, but .380 is still a relatively weak caliber.  Accepts 10-round "
"magazines, which are notably not interchangeable with those of CF380 pistols."
msgstr ""
"手槍口徑的卡賓槍，使用 .380 柯特自動手槍（.380 ACP）彈藥，由 Hi-Point 槍械公司設計。其 16.5 "
"英寸槍管比同等級的手槍提供了額外的制止力，但 .380 仍然是一個相對較弱的口徑。可裝填 10 發彈匣，彈匣不能與 CF.380 手槍共用。"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".380 conceal carry handgun"
msgid_plural ".380 conceal carry handguns"
msgstr[0] ".380 隐蔽携行手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".380 conceal carry handgun"
#. ~ Description of ".380 conceal carry handgun"
msgid "A very small and lightweight handgun, firing the .380 ACP cartridge."
msgstr "一款非常小巧轻便的手枪，发射.380 ACP弹药。"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".380 conceal carry handgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".380 conceal carry handgun"
msgid "S&W M&P Bodyguard"
msgid_plural "S&W M&P Bodyguards"
msgstr[0] "史密斯&威森 M&P “保镖” 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".380 conceal carry handgun" of gun "S&W M&P
#. Bodyguard"
#. ~ Description of variant "S&W M&P Bodyguard" of item ".380 conceal carry
#. handgun"
msgid ""
"A now-discontinued conceal carry gun, the S&W Bodyguard is a small and "
"lightweight conceal carry gun, firing the .380 ACP cartridge.  Despite the "
"short barrel and weak cartridge, it is still enough for self defense.  Even "
"though it's discontinued, it still remains as a very popular firearm."
msgstr ""
"一款小巧轻便的隐蔽携带手枪，史密斯&威森公司出品，发射.380 ACP "
"弹，不过现在已经停产了。尽管枪管太短而弹药威力弱，但用于自卫依然足够。即使已经停产，它至今仍是一款非常受欢迎的枪械。"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Glock 42"
msgid_plural "Glock 42s"
msgstr[0] "Glock 42 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 42"
#. ~ Description of "Glock 42"
msgid ""
"The smallest gun Glock produces, chambered in .380 ACP.  Even though it is "
"small a small gun that shoots a weak cartridge, it is still effective against "
"small game, paper targets, and zombified children"
msgstr "格洛克公司生产的最小型号，采用.380 ACP口径。尽管只是一把发射低威力弹的小手枪，但它在对付小型猎物、纸靶和丧尸儿童时依然有效。"

#: data/json/items/gun/38super.json data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M1911A1"
#. ~ Variant name of item "M1911A1"
msgid "M1911A1"
msgid_plural "M1911A1s"
msgstr[0] "M1911A1 手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/38super.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M1911A1"
#. ~ Description of "M1911A1"
msgid ""
"The M1911A1 is an extremely popular pistol known for its reliability.  This "
"one is chambered for .38 Super."
msgstr "M1911A1是一种非常流行的手枪，以其可靠性而闻名。这一把使用 .38 超级弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Glock 22"
msgid_plural "Glock 22"
msgstr[0] "克拉克 22 手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 22"
#. ~ Description of "Glock 22"
msgid ""
"A .40 S&W variant of the popular Glock 17 pistol.  The standard-issue firearm "
"of the FBI from 1997-2016, and of countless other law enforcement agencies "
"worldwide."
msgstr "一款受大众欢迎的 .40 S&W 口径的格洛克 17 手枪。曾是 1997 年至 2016 年间 FBI 的标准配枪，也是全球无数执法机构的标配武器。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Glock 23"
msgid_plural "Glock 23"
msgstr[0] "Glock 23 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 23"
#. ~ Description of "Glock 23"
msgid ""
"A compact version of the Glock 22, chambered in .40 S&W.  Popular among "
"civilian and law enforcement alike for its capacity, durability, and "
"reliability."
msgstr "格洛克 23手枪是格洛克 22手枪的紧凑款，同样发射.40 S&W子弹。凭借其弹匣容量、耐用性和可靠性，在民用和执法领域广受欢迎。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Glock 27"
msgid_plural "Glock 27"
msgstr[0] "格洛克 27 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Glock 27"
#. ~ Description of "Glock 27"
msgid ""
"A diminutive pistol chambered in .40 S&W. Widely popular among concealed "
"carriers, its popularity soared further in the months leading up to the "
"Cataclysm, partly due to its ability to fit the higher cpacity magazines of "
"its older brothers."
msgstr ""
"一款紧凑型的.40 "
"S&W口径手枪，因便于隐蔽携带而广受欢迎。尤其是在“大灾变”爆发前的数月间，这款手枪的人气更是高涨，归功于它可以兼容同系列大尺寸格洛克手枪的大容量弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Beretta Px4 Storm .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Beretta Px4 Storm .40 S&Ws"
msgstr[0] "貝瑞塔 Px4 Storm 手槍 .40 S&W"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Beretta Px4 Storm .40 S&W"
#. ~ Description of "Beretta Px4 Storm .40 S&W"
msgid ""
"Lighter than Beretta's iconic 92 series of guns, the Px4 Storm was built by "
"utilizing light-weight polymer construction with steel inserts.  Its shape "
"was also optimized for concealed carry.  This one is chambered in .40 S&W."
msgstr ""
"比伯莱塔出品的标志性的92系列手枪要轻，Px4 \"风暴\"手枪充分利用了轻便的带钢制插件的聚合材料主体结构。它的形状也被设计得便于隐蔽携带。这一把使用 "
".40 S&W 弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "SIG Pro .40"
msgid_plural "SIG Pro .40"
msgstr[0] "SIG Pro .40"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Description of gun "SIG Pro .40"
#. ~ Description of "SIG Pro .40"
msgid ""
"Originally marketed as a lightweight and compact alternative to older SIG "
"handguns, the Pro .40 is popular among European police forces."
msgstr "最主要是銷售給輕武裝人員用來接替舊式的 SIG 手槍, 這把 Pro .40 在歐洲警力中很受歡迎。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Luty SMG: .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Luty SMGs: .40 S&W"
msgstr[0] "Luty 衝鋒槍: .40 S&W"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Luty SMG: .40 S&W"
#. ~ Description of "Luty SMG: .40 S&W"
msgid ""
"A Luty pattern makeshift smoothbore SMG crudely constructed out of various "
"steel parts using advanced powered hand tools; likely one of the most complex "
"guns that is feasible to make outside of a machine shop, but still very "
"unreliable.  This one is chambered for .40 S&W cartridges and accepts "
"custom-made makeshift magazines."
msgstr ""
"Luty式自制无膛线冲锋枪，使用具有更先进动力的手动工具，由各种钢制零件拼凑而成。也许是能够在工厂车间外制造出的最复杂的枪支之一，但仍然很不可靠。这一款专为"
".40 S&W 弹设计，同时能够兼容自制弹匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Browning Hi-Power .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Browning Hi-Power .40 S&Ws"
msgstr[0] "白朗寧 Hi-Power .40 S&W 手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Browning Hi-Power .40 S&W"
#. ~ Description of "Browning Hi-Power .40 S&W"
msgid ""
"The Browning Hi-Power is a semi-automatic handgun developed shortly before "
"the Second World War.  Widely issued since then, it remains in use by India, "
"Canada, and Australia.  This is a commercial variant produced by Browning "
"Arms in .40 S&W."
msgstr ""
"勃朗宁大威力手枪是一种二战前不久研制的半自动手枪。当时被广泛使用，而目前仍有在印度、加拿大和澳大利亚使用。这把属于勃朗宁武器公司开发的发射 .40 S&W "
"弹的商业型号。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Hi-Point Model JCP"
msgid_plural "Hi-Point Model JCP"
msgstr[0] "Hi-Point JCP 型手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/40.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Hi-Point Model JCP"
#. ~ Description of "Hi-Point Model JCP"
msgid ""
"The Hi-Point Model JCP is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol designed "
"by Hi-Point Firearms, which is known for making inexpensive firearms, and for "
"making said firearms bulky and uncomfortable.  Hi-Points have slides made "
"with a zinc pot-metal which is relatively fragile compared to steel slides."
msgstr ""
"Hi-Point JCP 型手枪是一种采用反冲式枪机的半自动手枪，由 Hi-Point 设计。Hi-Point "
"以制造廉价武器而知名，其生产的武器常常体积巨大且使用不便。Hi-Point 制造的枪械的套筒由锌合金制成，相比钢制套筒来说比较脆弱。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M320 standalone launcher"
msgid_plural "M320 standalone launchers"
msgstr[0] "M320 獨立榴彈發射器"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M320 standalone launcher"
#. ~ Description of "M320 standalone launcher"
msgid ""
"Heckler & Koch's M320 grenade launcher offers the functionality of larger "
"launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  This "
"one is combined with a buttstock for standalone operation."
msgstr "H&K公司出品的M320型榴弹发射器以降低精度为代价，将更强大的榴弹发射器的功能塞进了更小的体积之中。这个型号有一个内置枪托可以单兵操作。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M79 launcher"
msgid_plural "M79 launchers"
msgstr[0] "M79 榴彈發射器"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M79 launcher"
#. ~ Description of "M79 launcher"
msgid ""
"A widely-used grenade launcher that first saw use by American forces in the "
"Vietnam War.  Though mostly replaced by more modern launchers, the M79 still "
"sees use with many units worldwide."
msgstr "这是一种广泛运用的榴弹发射器，最早由美国在越南战争中使用。虽然它几乎已经被更现代的发射器所取代，但M79型仍然在世界上许多部队中使用。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Milkor MGL"
msgid_plural "Milkor MGL"
msgstr[0] "米爾科姆連發榴彈發射器"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Milkor MGL"
#. ~ Description of "Milkor MGL"
msgid ""
"The Milkor Multi-Grenade Launcher is designed to compensate for the drawback "
"of single-shot grenade launchers by allowing sustained heavy firepower.  "
"However, it is still slow to reload and must be used with careful planning."
msgstr "米爾科姆公司的連發榴彈發射器能提供持續而猛烈的火力, 彌補了單發式的不足。然而, 它的裝填速度仍然很緩慢, 使用時必須仔細的斟酌。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M203 array"
msgid_plural "M203 arrays"
msgstr[0] "M203 榴彈發射器陣列"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x46mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M203 array"
#. ~ Description of "M203 array"
msgid "An array of six M203 grenade launchers for use on the TALON UGV platform."
msgstr "在鹰爪型无人车平台上使用的六管 M203 榴弹发射器阵列。"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x53mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Mark 19 grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "Mark 19 grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "Mark 19 榴彈發射器"

#: data/json/items/gun/40x53mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Mark 19 grenade launcher"
#. ~ Description of "Mark 19 grenade launcher"
msgid ""
"A heavy, tripod-mounted belt-fed grenade launcher used by the US Military "
"since the start of the Cold War all the way to the Cataclysm, and if you can "
"find some 40mm grenades, maybe even beyond."
msgstr "这种重型三脚架式榴弹发射器被美国军方使用自冷战后一直用到大灾变发生，如果你能找到一些40mm榴弹，你绝对可以继续用下去。"

#: data/json/items/gun/410shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Winchester M37 .410"
msgid_plural "Winchester M37 .410s"
msgstr[0] ".410 溫徹斯特 M37 霰彈槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/410shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Winchester M37 .410"
#. ~ Description of "Winchester M37 .410"
msgid ""
"A single-shot break-action shotgun, chambered in .410 bore.  Designed as a "
"lower-recoil alternative to 12 gauge shotguns, it is light and easy to "
"manufacture."
msgstr "一把单发开膛式霰弹枪，采用.410口径。设计得比12口径霰弹枪有更低的后坐力，它很轻便而且制造起来很简单。"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Desert Eagle pistol"
msgid_plural "Desert Eagle pistol"
msgstr[0] "沙漠之鹰 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Desert Eagle pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Desert Eagle pistol"
msgid ""
"An icon of popular culture more than a practical weapon, this massive pistol "
"can shoot a variety of magnum handgun rounds depending on the conversion kit "
"and magazine used."
msgstr "这把巨型手枪是流行文化的象征，而不是实用武器，它可以根据使用的转换套件和弹匣发射各种马格南手枪子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Desert Eagle pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Desert Eagle pistol"
msgid "Desert Eagle Mark XIX pistol"
msgid_plural "Desert Eagle Mark XIX pistols"
msgstr[0] "沙漠之鹰 Mark XIX 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Desert Eagle pistol" of gun "Desert Eagle Mark
#. XIX pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Desert Eagle Mark XIX pistol" of item "Desert
#. Eagle pistol"
msgid ""
"Needing little introduction, the Desert Eagle's impact on popular culture is "
"almost as massive as the pistol itself.  The newest Mark XIX model introduced "
"a more modern optics rail.  It was sold in multiple hard-hitting magnum "
"calibers and can swap between them using conversion kits and the appropriate "
"magazine."
msgstr ""
"无需多说，沙漠之鹰对流行文化的影响几乎与手枪本身一样巨大。最新的Mark "
"XIX型带有可安装现代光学瞄具的轨道。它可以根据使用的转换套件和弹匣发射各种马格南手枪子弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Desert Eagle pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Desert Eagle pistol"
msgid "golden Desert Eagle Mark XIX pistol"
msgid_plural "golden Desert Eagle Mark XIX pistols"
msgstr[0] "黄金沙漠之鹰 Mark XIX 手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Desert Eagle pistol" of gun "golden Desert Eagle
#. Mark XIX pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "golden Desert Eagle Mark XIX pistol" of item
#. "Desert Eagle pistol"
msgid ""
"Needing little introduction, the Desert Eagle's impact on popular culture is "
"almost as massive as the pistol itself.  The newest Mark XIX model introduced "
"a more modern optics rail.  It was sold in multiple hard-hitting magnum "
"calibers and can swap between them using conversion kits and the appropriate "
"magazine.  For maximum style points (or tackiness, depending on taste), this "
"one is plated in what appears to be 24-karat gold."
msgstr ""
"无需多说，沙漠之鹰对流行文化的影响几乎与手枪本身一样巨大。最新的Mark "
"XIX型带有可安装现代光学瞄具的轨道。它可以根据使用的转换套件和弹匣发射各种马格南手枪子弹。为了时髦（或俗气，取决于品味），这把手枪表面镀有24k纯金"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Henry Big Boy .44 rifle"
msgid_plural "Henry Big Boy .44 rifles"
msgstr[0] "亨利\"大男孩\" .44 马格南步枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Henry Big Boy .44 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Henry Big Boy .44 rifle"
msgid ""
"This fine lever-action rifle is chambered in the powerful .44 Magnum "
"cartridge and features a sleek octagonal barrel with a tube fed magazine.  Go "
"get 'em cowboy!"
msgstr "这把杠杆式步枪采用威力巨大的.44马格南弹药，一根造型独特的光滑的八角形枪管配上一个管式供弹弹匣。干翻它们，牛仔！"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".44 Magnum pipe rifle"
msgid_plural ".44 Magnum pipe rifles"
msgstr[0] "自制钢管步枪（.44马格南口径）"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".44 revolver"
msgid_plural ".44 revolvers"
msgstr[0] ".44 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".44 revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant ".44 revolver" of gun "S&W 629 revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".44 revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "S&W 629 revolver" of item ".44 revolver"
msgid ""
"A stainless steel, six-shot, double-action revolver with a matte black "
"plastic handle manufactured by Smith & Wesson.  Though hardly the most "
"powerful handgun in the world any more, it could still blow a zombie's head "
"clean off."
msgstr ""
"一把不銹鋼製, 六發裝, 雙動扳機型, 有著黑色塑膠握把的左輪, 由Smith & Wesson公司製造。雖然不是世界上最強大的手槍, "
"但要把殭屍爆頭還是綽綽有餘。"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".44 revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".44 revolver"
msgid "Ruger Redhawk revolver"
msgid_plural "Ruger Redhawk revolvers"
msgstr[0] "鲁格\"红鹰\"左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".44 revolver" of gun "Ruger Redhawk revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger Redhawk revolver" of item ".44 revolver"
msgid ""
"One of the most powerful handguns in the world when it was released in 1979, "
"the Redhawk offers very sturdy construction, with an appearance that is "
"reminiscent of \"Wild West\" revolvers."
msgstr "自1979年便開始出現的其中一把強大的手槍, 這把紅鷹有著非常堅固的構造, 外型讓人聯想到西部時代的左輪槍。"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".44 revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".44 revolver"
msgid "S&W 629 revolver"
msgid_plural "S&W 629 revolvers"
msgstr[0] "S&W 629 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".44 long barrel hunting revolver"
msgid_plural ".44 long barrel hunting revolvers"
msgstr[0] ".44 长枪管狩猎左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".44 long barrel hunting revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".44 long barrel hunting revolver"
msgid ""
"A large-frame revolver with a modern plastic handle.  Too large for law "
"enforcement, it was mostly used by sport shooters and hunters, for the "
"manufacturer deemed it to be the most accurate .44-caliber revolver in their "
"line.  This one has an extended 8-inch barrel."
msgstr ""
"一款带有现代塑料握把的大型左轮手枪，对于执法机构来说尺寸过于庞大。制造商认为它是他们系列中最精确的 .44 "
"口径左轮手枪，主要用于竞技射击和狩猎。这把左轮配有一根加长的 8 英寸(约20厘米)枪管。"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".44 long barrel hunting revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".44 long barrel hunting revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".44 hunting revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".44 hunting revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".44 short barrel hunting revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".44 short barrel hunting revolver"
msgid "Colt Anaconda"
msgid_plural "Colt Anacondas"
msgstr[0] "柯尔特巨蟒型 左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".44 long barrel hunting revolver" of gun "Colt
#. Anaconda"
#. ~ Description of variant "Colt Anaconda" of item ".44 long barrel hunting
#. revolver"
msgid ""
"A large-frame double-action revolver with a modern plastic handle.  Too large "
"for law enforcement, it was mostly used by sport shooters and hunters, for "
"Colt deemed it to be the most accurate .44-caliber revolver in their line.  "
"This one has an extended 8-inch barrel."
msgstr ""
"一款带有现代塑料握把的大型双动左轮手枪，对于执法机构来说尺寸过于庞大。柯尔特公司认为这是他们系列中最精确的 .44 "
"口径左轮手枪，主要用于竞技射击和狩猎。这把左轮配有一根加长的 8 英寸(约20厘米)枪管。"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid ".44 hunting revolver"
msgid_plural ".44 hunting revolvers"
msgstr[0] ".44 狩猎左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".44 hunting revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".44 hunting revolver"
msgid ""
"A large-frame revolver with a modern plastic handle.  Too large for law "
"enforcement, it was mostly used by sport shooters and hunters, for the "
"manufacturer deemed it to be the most accurate .44-caliber revolver in their "
"line.  This one has a 6-inch barrel."
msgstr ""
