#: data/json/items/gun/44paper.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "civil war revolver"
msgid_plural "civil war revolvers"
msgstr[0] "南北战争左轮手枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/44paper.json
#. ~ Description of gun "civil war revolver"
#. ~ Description of "civil war revolver"
msgid ""
"The Colt Army Model 1860 is a cap & ball .44-caliber revolver.  It was used "
"during the American Civil War, and made by Colt's Manufacturing Company."
msgstr "柯特 M1860 陸軍型轉輪手槍是一把 .44 口徑的左輪手槍。由柯特製造公司所研製。它被使用於美國南北戰爭期間。"

#: data/json/items/gun/44paper.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "civil war revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item "civil war revolver"
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Colt M1860 Army"
msgid_plural "Colt M1860 Army"
msgstr[0] "柯特 M1860 陸軍型轉輪手槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/44paper.json
#. ~ Description of variant "civil war revolver" of gun "Colt M1860 Army"
#. ~ Description of variant "Colt M1860 Army" of item "civil war revolver"
msgid ""
"The Colt M1860 is a black powder, cap & ball revolver dating back to the "
"Civil War.  While reloading it takes quite a while due to having to put a "
"primer on each chamber manually, instead of having the primer in one unit "
"with the casing, like metallic cartridges.  However, for the time 6 shots in "
"quick succession was a great thing for cavalry and officers to have on the "
"field.  Nowadays, this firearm is completely outdated, and only sees use in "
"collections, reenactment, or special shooting competitions.  However, black "
"powder guns such as this are less regulated than more modern firearms, so it "
"is sometimes the first gun a youth may buy.  This one is chambered in .44, "
"and while the number may remind some of .44 Magnum, it has nowhere near the "
"ballistic effectiveness of .44 Magnum."
msgstr ""
"柯特 M1860 "
"陸軍型轉輪手槍是一把使用黑火藥、帽和球的左輪手槍，其歷史可追溯至美國內戰時期。重新裝填時需要相當長的時間，因為必須手動在每個彈膛上放置底火，而不是像金屬彈藥"
"那樣將底火與外殼裝在一個單元中。不過，對當時的騎兵和軍官來說，在戰場上快速連發 6 "
"槍已經是一件很棒的事了。如今，這種槍械已經完全過時了，只有在收藏、復刻或特殊射擊比賽中才會使用。然而，與更現代的槍支相比，此類黑火藥槍的監管較少，因此有時它"
"是年輕人可能購買的第一支槍。這把槍的彈膛口徑為 .44 吋，雖然這個數字可能讓人想起 .44 麥格農彈，但它的彈道效能遠不及 .44 麥格農彈。"

#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Glock submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of "Glock submachine gun"
msgid "A submachine gun chambered in .45 ACP, accepting Glock magazines."
msgstr "一支 .45 吋口徑的衝鋒槍，可裝填克拉克彈匣。"

#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
