#. submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Thompson M1928A1 submachine gun" of item
#. "Thompson submachine gun"
msgid ""
"An American-made submachine gun developed during the very end of World War I, "
"too late to see action.  Infamous during the 1920s for its use by gangsters, "
"and used during World War II before being mostly replaced with less-expensive "
"alternatives."
msgstr ""
"在第一次世界大戰末期開發的美國製造的衝鋒槍，但為時已晚，無法發揮作用。在 1920 "
"年代因被黑幫使用而惡名昭彰，並在第二次世界大戰期間使用，之後大部分被更便宜的替代品所取代。（譯註：黑幫濫用因此有湯米衝鋒槍（Tommy "
"Gun）、芝加哥打字機（Chicago Typewriter）、芝加哥小提琴（Chicago Violin）或芝加哥鋼琴（Chicago "
"Piano）等綽號。）"

