#: data/json/items/gun/cannon.json
#. ~ Description of gun "3-inch ordnance rifle"
#. ~ Description of "3-inch ordnance rifle"
msgid ""
"A light cannon widely used in the American Civil War, noted for its "
"reliability."
msgstr "美国内战中广泛使用的一种轻型火炮，以其可靠性而闻名。"

#: data/json/items/gun/chemical_spray.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "makeshift chemical thrower"
msgid_plural "makeshift chemical throwers"
msgstr[0] "粗製化學藥劑噴灑器"

#: data/json/items/gun/chemical_spray.json
#. ~ Description of gun "makeshift chemical thrower"
#. ~ Description of "makeshift chemical thrower"
msgid ""
"A bulky, self-made chemical sprayer with an internal conversion mechanism "
"that allows all sorts of chemicals to be dispersed to your surroundings."
msgstr "一個笨重的自製化學藥劑噴灑器, 裡面有著內部轉換機制, 能把各種化學物質噴灑到四周。"

#: data/json/items/gun/combination.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "combination gun"
msgid_plural "combination guns"
msgstr[0] "拼裝槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/combination.json
#. ~ Description of gun "combination gun"
#. ~ Description of "combination gun"
msgid ""
"A break action firearm comprised of a .30-06 barrel over two 12 gauge smooth "
"bore barrels.  Historically used by egomaniac hunters in Africa, now used by "
"their egomaniac descendants in New England."
msgstr ""
"一把后装式组合枪械，由一根 .30-06 "
"口径的线膛枪管，及下方两根装填12"
"号霰弹的滑膛枪管组成。这类枪械在历史上曾经在非洲被那些贪心不足的偷猎者们用来射杀大小动物，而现在则被新英格兰的那些同样自大的后人们继续使用。"

#: data/json/items/gun/combination.json
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
msgid "conversion"
msgstr "改裝"

#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Exodii hand mortar"
msgid_plural "Exodii hand mortars"
msgstr[0] "流亡族手持迫击炮"

#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Exodii hand mortar"
#. ~ Description of "Exodii hand mortar"
msgid ""
"Originating from big game express smoothbores and heavy fowling pieces "
"adapted for wallguns, the Brogyeki '23 is an over/under break action 'pistol' "
"that is (unfortunately?) capable of launching its original 27.3 x 110 Diyua "
"express slug and shot loads as well as the wide array of payloads in 27.3 x "
"44 Diyua.  A simple wire stock collapses neatly along its octagonal barrels, "
"which feature a combination of sighting devices necessary for launching its "
"numerous loads, in addition to the usual Exodii retrofits.  Unless you are a "
"quadrupedal cyborg with this gun in a shock absorbing mount, recoil with the "
"27.3 x 110 Diyua shells will be *stout*."
msgstr ""
"Brogyeki '23源自用于狩猎大型动物的大口径滑膛枪，这种重型猎枪又常被用作抬枪。这是一款叠筒中折式“手枪”，（不幸的是？）它既能发射原装的27.3 "
"x 110 Diyua大口径独头弹与霰弹，也能发射27.3 x 44 "
"Diyua口径的一系列弹药。它八角形的枪管上附有一套瞄具，用于发射多种弹药，枪管旁边是折叠整齐的金属线枪托，同时还经过了常规的流亡族改造。除非你是一个带有减"
"震器的四足生化人，否则发射27.3 x 110 Diyua弹的后坐力会*很大*。"

