msgid_plural "Khuunäöfaai ordnance cannons"
msgstr[0] "锟厄焚军械炮"

#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Exodii ordnance cannon" of gun "Khuunäöfaai
#. ordnance cannon"
#. ~ Description of variant "Khuunäöfaai ordnance cannon" of item "Exodii
#. ordnance cannon"
msgid ""
"An oddball in the Exodii's oddball selection of armaments - This robust, "
"shoulder mounted weapons platform started life not as a weapon, but as a "
"ceremonial firework cannon, mounted in droves atop of parade tanks the size "
"of buildings by some globe spanning military culture.  Little of its original "
"design remains under the retrofits and wear, with even its engravings worn "
"down to nothing by time.  The Khuunäöfaai finds its niche in disposing "
"incoming hordes from large distances, helped by the variety of chemical "
"payloads its been modified to fire."
msgstr ""
"流亡族所选古怪的武器中的一种更怪的怪胎——这个坚固的肩扛式武器平台最初不是作为武器，而是作为一种仪式烟花炮，由一些遍及全球的军事文化体将其大量的地安装在楼宇"
"般大小的阅兵坦克上。它的原始设计几乎在一次次的翻新和磨损中所剩无几，甚至它的雕刻也随着时间的推移而磨损殆尽。锟厄焚军械炮设计定位于处理远距离的成群结队的人，"
"这得益于其经过改装的各种化学有效载荷。"

#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
msgid "sights_mount"
msgstr "sights_mount"

#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Exodii Sapra grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "Exodii Sapra grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "流亡族 Sapra 榴弹发射器"

#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Exodii Sapra grenade launcher"
#. ~ Description of "Exodii Sapra grenade launcher"
msgid ""
"The Sapra '36 is a short smoothbore bolt-action grenade launcher, fitted with "
"a 5-round box magazine and a large, efficient muzzle brake.  Designed in the "
"interwar period following the proliferation of Brogyeki '23, the Sapra was "
"intended to assist in riots, ambushes and assaulting in urban operations, "
"where explosives applied in quick succession could make short work of "
"targets.  To further assist in riot operations, the Sapra can be fitted with "
"a bayonet, a frivolity that the Exodii almost immediately discarded.  Unlike "
"the Brogyeki, the Sapra is incapable of chambering the longer 27.3 x 110 "
"Diyua shells.  The Exodii have replaced the stock with an aluminum alloy "
"chassis, leaving behind the original wood ones as they became damaged."
msgstr ""
"Sapra '36是一款短管滑膛栓动式榴弹发射器，配有一个5发盒式弹匣和一个大而有效的制退器。Sapra是在两次大战的间隙中伴随着Brogyeki "
"'23的盛行而设计出来的，用于协助镇暴，伏击或城市作战，通过快速发射多发榴弹迅速消灭目标。Sapra还可以安装刺刀以进一步协助镇暴，但流亡族很快就弃置了这个"
"并无大用的设计。和Brogyeki不同的是， Sapra无法发射更长的27.3x110 "
"Diyua弹。由于原先的木制枪托已经受损，流亡族将它们替换成了铝合金支架。"

