msgid_plural "12-gauge Gatling guns"
msgstr[0] "12号口径加特林霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "12-gauge Gatling gun"
#. ~ Description of "12-gauge Gatling gun"
msgid ""
"An electrically driven six barrel Gatling shotgun, fed from handmade cloth "
"belts.  Even properly mounted, this seems like an unwieldy beast, and the six "
"separate barrels make for difficult zeroing.  The externally driven action "
"means this is much less likely to jam."
msgstr ""
"一台电力驱动的六管加特林霰弹枪，采用自制的布弹药带供弹。即使被正确地安装在载具上，它也是一台笨重的野兽，而六根独立的枪管让你很难为其校正瞄具。由于采用外置机"
"构来驱动枪机，它不太容易卡弹。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "compact bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "compact bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "紧凑无托霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "compact bullpup shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "compact bullpup shotgun"
msgid ""
"This pump-action shotgun uses a system of twin magazines to carry 14 total "
"rounds of 12-gauge shotgun shells.  As the weapon's trigger is situated "
"forwards of the chamber in what is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the "
"firearm's notably more compact than its peers despite having a higher "
"capacity when compared against more classically designed shotguns."
msgstr ""
"这把泵动式霰弹枪使用一个由两个管形弹匣组成的系统来携带总共14发12号口径霰弹。由于该武器的扳机位于膛室前方，被称为\"无托式\""
"设计，虽然与更经典设计的霰弹枪相比其容量相对较高，但它的结构明显比同类武器更紧凑。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
