msgstr "雙發"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "鋼管霰彈槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "pipe shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "pipe shotgun"
msgid ""
"A home-made shotgun.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer "
"to strike the single round it holds."
msgstr "一把自製的霰彈槍。簡單地把鋼管連接到有擊鎚的彈倉, 能夠進行單發射擊。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "5-round hunting shotgun"
msgid_plural "5-round hunting shotguns"
msgstr[0] "5发狩猎霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "5-round hunting shotgun"
msgid ""
"A classic shotgun in nearly every respect; big, bulky, and intimidating, guns "
"such as this one have been made for over a century in one form or another, "
"coming in both pump-action and semi-automatic models.  Serving both "
"competition-shooting, law-enforcement, and hunting roles, this firearm is "
"sporting a standard-capacity 5-round magazine tube.  Despite the firearm's "
"low magazine space, what it lacks in capacity it makes up for in sheer "
"close-range effectiveness and stopping power."
msgstr ""
"在几乎所有方面都称得上是非常经典的霰弹枪；一个多世纪以来，像这种又大又笨、非常吓人的枪支一直被以各种形式制造，既有泵动式，也有半自动式。这款枪满足了竞赛射击"
"、执法和打猎的需要，具有标准容量的5发弹匣。尽管枪械的弹匣空间很小，但容量上的不足由它在近距离时的有效性和停止力所补偿。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "5-round hunting shotgun"
msgid "Remington 870 Wingmaster shotgun"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 Wingmaster shotguns"
msgstr[0] "雷明顿 870 \"翼主\"霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "5-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Remington 870
#. Wingmaster shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Remington 870 Wingmaster shotgun" of item
#. "5-round hunting shotgun"
msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular "
"shotguns on the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement "
"agencies alike thanks to its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is "
"a 28 inch barreled model for hunting fowl and game."
msgstr ""
"雷明顿870霰弹枪是市面上最受欢迎的霰弹枪之一，共计制造了超过一千万只。由于其优秀的命中率和高初速而受到各国猎人和执法机关的青睐。这款型号采用28英寸（约7"
"1厘米）枪管，用于狩猎各式禽鸟和猎物。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "4-round hunting shotgun"
msgid_plural "4-round hunting shotguns"
msgstr[0] "4-round hunting shotguns"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "4-round hunting shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "4-round hunting shotgun"
msgid ""
"A 4-round pump-action shotgun, ones like these have existed for many decades, "
"and are still very popular due to their reliability and lethality, whether "
"for hunting or home defense."
msgstr ""
"A 4-round pump-action shotgun, ones like these have existed for many decades, "
"and are still very popular due to their reliability and lethality, whether "
"for hunting or home defense."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "4-round hunting shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "4-round hunting shotgun"
msgid "Ithaca M37 Featherlight shotgun"
msgid_plural "Ithaca M37 Featherlight shotguns"
msgstr[0] "伊萨卡 M37 Featherlight 霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "4-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Ithaca M37
#. Featherlight shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ithaca M37 Featherlight shotgun" of item "4-round
#. hunting shotgun"
msgid ""
"A seasoned veteran of America's sporting culture, the Ithaca M37 is the "
"oldest pump-action shotgun still in active production.  The M37 has served "
"hunters and officers for over eight decades, featuring a bottom-feeding and "
"ejecting design that keeps the action sealed from the elements.  An heirloom "
"that retains its utility all the way from pre-Cataclysm hunting expeditions "
"up into the depths of alien environments, it would be wise to keep it handy, "
"for close encounters."
msgstr ""
"作为伴随美国猎枪运动的老伙计，伊萨卡M37霰弹枪是在产泵动式霰弹枪中最老的型号了，已被猎人与军官使用超过80"
"年。它底部供弹与抛壳的设计保护内部机构不受环境影响。作为一把大灾变前某个狩猎队的传家宝，到如今天翻地覆的环境中也依旧完全胜任，你最好把它放在顺手的地方，以备"
"近战。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "4-round semi-auto hunting shotgun"
msgid_plural "4-round semi-auto hunting shotguns"
msgstr[0] "4-round semi-auto hunting shotguns"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "4-round semi-auto hunting shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "4-round semi-auto hunting shotgun"
msgid ""
"A reliable 4 round semi-automatic hunting shotgun, capable of delivering it's "
"lethal shot quicker than a pump action.  However, it cannot cycle lower power "
"loads like birdshot."
msgstr ""
"A reliable 4 round semi-automatic hunting shotgun, capable of delivering it's "
"lethal shot quicker than a pump action.  However, it cannot cycle lower power "
"loads like birdshot."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "4-round semi-auto hunting shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "4-round semi-auto hunting shotgun"
msgid "Browning Auto 5 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Browning Auto 5 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "勃朗宁 Auto 5 霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "4-round semi-auto hunting shotgun" of gun
#. "Browning Auto 5 shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Browning Auto 5 shotgun" of item "4-round semi-
#. auto hunting shotgun"
msgid ""
"This humble looking shotgun was the earliest successful semi-automatic "
"shotgun, and the second most successful in U.S. history, with over 2.7 "
"million made between 1902 and 1998.  The recoil tuning mechanism under the "
"handguard and long dwell time of the action make for pleasant shooting.  "
"However, despite the name, it only fits 4 in the tube and not 5."
msgstr ""
"This humble looking shotgun was the earliest successful semi-automatic "
"shotgun, and the second most successful in U.S. history, with over 2.7 "
"million made between 1902 and 1998.  The recoil tuning mechanism under the "
"handguard and long dwell time of the action make for pleasant shooting.  "
"However, despite the name, it only fits 4 in the tube and not 5."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "4-round semi-auto fowling shotgun"
msgid_plural "4-round semi-auto fowling shotguns"
msgstr[0] "4-round semi-auto fowling shotguns"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "4-round semi-auto fowling shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "4-round semi-auto fowling shotgun"
msgid ""
"This is a 4 round semi-automatic shotgun, with the ability to automatically "
"cycle birdshot as well.  Not like birdshot will do you much good against the "
"undead."
msgstr ""
"This is a 4 round semi-automatic shotgun, with the ability to automatically "
"cycle birdshot as well.  Not like birdshot will do you much good against the "
"undead."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "4-round semi-auto fowling shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "4-round semi-auto fowling shotgun"
msgid "Remington 1100 competition shotgun"
msgid_plural "Remington 1100 competition shotguns"
msgstr[0] "雷明顿 1100 竞赛型霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "4-round semi-auto fowling shotgun" of gun
#. "Remington 1100 competition shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Remington 1100 competition shotgun" of item
#. "4-round semi-auto fowling shotgun"
msgid ""
"This semi-automatic shotgun features a self compensating gas system that will "
"feed a wide array of shells while also reducing recoil.  Introduced in 1963, "
"it is favored by law enforcement, hunters and competition shooters, and has "
"been the best-selling autoloading shotgun in U.S. history.  This is the "
"nickel finished, teflon coated competition model, with a full length magazine "
"tube and 30 inch barrel."
msgstr ""
"这把半自动霰弹枪采用一套自补偿的排气系统，使其能够使用各类弹药供弹的同时也减少了枪械的后坐力。它于1963"
"年推出，深受执法人员、猎人和竞赛选手的青睐，是美国历史上最畅销的自动装弹霰弹枪。这把是表面采用镍抛光，并涂上了聚四氟乙烯涂层的竞赛用型号，使用全枪长管状弹匣"
"和一根30英寸（约76厘米）的枪管。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "breaching shotgun"
msgid_plural "breaching shotguns"
msgstr[0] "破門型霰彈槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "breaching shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "breaching shotgun"
msgid ""
"This shotgun has a short barrel and no stock, and is set up for breaching "
"doors.  It is small enough to carry as a secondary weapon, but has fairly "
"unpleasant recoil and no sights."
msgstr "这把霰弹枪枪管很短，而且没有枪托，专门用来破门。它体积很小，可以作为副武器携带，但后坐力相当令人难受，而且没有瞄准器。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "breaching shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "breaching shotgun"
msgid "Remington 870 MCS shotgun"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 MCS shotguns"
msgstr[0] "雷明顿 870 MCS 霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "breaching shotgun" of gun "Remington 870 MCS
#. shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Remington 870 MCS shotgun" of item "breaching
#. shotgun"
msgid ""
"This Remington 870 Modular Combat System shotgun is currently set up for "
"breaching operations, with a 10 inch barrel and no stock.  It is small enough "
"to carry as a secondary weapon, specifically to pop open any pesky doors you "
"might come across.  The grip's design makes for controllable yet unpleasant "
"recoil, and the barrel lacks any sights."
msgstr ""
"这把雷明顿 870 "
"模块化战斗霰弹枪专为室内破门行动而设计，采用10英寸（约25"
"厘米）的枪管而且没有枪托。它体积足够小，可以作为次武器携带，特别适合用来打开你所遇到的任何烦人的门。握把设计使后坐力可控但仍会引起不适，而枪管上缺乏任何瞄具"
"。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "7-round riot shotgun"
msgid_plural "7-round riot shotguns"
msgstr[0] "7发防暴霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "7-round riot shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "7-round riot shotgun"
msgid ""
"A brother of more typical hunting style shotguns, this particular model was "
"most often seen utilized for self-defense or law-enforcement purposes.  "
"Featuring a shortened 18.5 inch barrel and extended 7-round magazine tube, "
"it's a very versatile and reliable weapon."
msgstr ""
"作为更经典的狩猎用霰弹枪的兄弟，这种特殊型号的霰弹枪最常被用于自卫或执法目的。它有根缩短的18.5英寸（约47厘米）枪管和加长的7"
"发弹匣，是一种非常灵活和可靠的武器。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "7-round riot shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "7-round riot shotgun"
msgid "Remington 870 Express shotgun"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 Express shotguns"
msgstr[0] "雷明顿 870 \"急速\"霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "7-round riot shotgun" of gun "Remington 870
#. Express shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Remington 870 Express shotgun" of item "7-round
#. riot shotgun"
msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular "
"shotguns on the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement "
"agencies alike thanks to its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is "
"an 18.5 inch barreled defensive model."
msgstr ""
"雷明顿 870 "
"霰弹枪是市面上最受欢迎的霰弹枪之一，共计制造了超过一千万只。由于其优秀的命中率和高初速而受到各国猎人和执法机关的青睐。这款型号采用18.5英寸（约47"
"厘米）枪管，主要用于自卫。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "revolving shotgun"
msgid_plural "revolving shotguns"
msgstr[0] "左轮霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "revolving shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "revolving shotgun"
msgid ""
"A shotgun modified to use a revolver cylinder mechanism, it can hold 6 "
"cartridges."
msgstr "一把改造過的霰彈槍, 使用了轉輪的彈倉, 能夠裝填6發子彈。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "assault shotgun"
msgid_plural "assault shotguns"
msgstr[0] "突击霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "assault shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "assault shotgun"
msgid ""
"Built in the same style as the venerable AK series of rifles, this Russian "
"exported firearm feeds from detachable magazines rather than making use of a "
"standard tubular design like most commercial shotguns.  With 10 and 30-round "
"magazines available, reloading is rendered a much quicker procedure than can "
"ever be accomplished with conventional bottom-feeding firearms."
msgstr ""
"这款俄式霰弹枪与经久不衰的AK系列步枪风格相同，使用可拆卸弹匣供弹，而不是像大多数民用霰弹枪一样使用标准管状弹匣设计。由于有10发和30"
"发弹匣可供使用，重新装弹的过程比传统的底部供弹枪械要快得多。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "assault shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "assault shotgun"
msgid "Saiga-12 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Saiga-12 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "Saiga-12 霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "assault shotgun" of gun "Saiga-12 shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Saiga-12 shotgun" of item "assault shotgun"
msgid ""
"The Saiga-12 is a semi-automatic shotgun designed on the same Kalashnikov "
"pattern as the AK-47 rifle.  It reloads with a magazine, rather than one "
"shell at a time like most shotguns.  It is one of the last designs of Mikhail "
"Kalashnikov, and was popular in open division shotgun competitions prior to "
"its ban from import via executive order."
msgstr ""
"Saiga-12 霰弹枪是一把采用了与 AK-47 "
"步枪相同的卡拉什尼科夫布局的半自动霰弹枪。与其他霰弹枪不同，它用弹匣供弹。这是米哈伊尔·卡拉什尼科夫的生前最后设计之一，在被政府行政命令禁止进口之前，它在公"
"开类分区的霰弹枪竞赛中很受欢迎。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "double-barreled shotgun"
msgid_plural "double-barreled shotguns"
msgstr[0] "双管霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "double-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "double-barreled shotgun"
msgid ""
"The classic double-barreled shotgun, with the barrels arranged side-by-side.  "
"It consists of little more than 2 barrels, a striker to hit the shell, and a "
"wooden stock"
msgstr ""
"The classic double-barreled shotgun, with the barrels arranged side-by-side.  "
"It consists of little more than 2 barrels, a striker to hit the shell, and a "
"wooden stock"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "double-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "double-barreled shotgun"
msgid "S&R Ranger 12 gauge shotgun"
msgid_plural "S&R Ranger 12 gauge shotguns"
msgstr[0] "S&R Ranger 12 gauge shotguns"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "double-barreled shotgun" of gun "S&R Ranger 12
#. gauge shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "S&R Ranger 12 gauge shotgun" of item "double-
#. barreled shotgun"
msgid ""
"An antique double-barreled shotgun chambered in 12 gauge.  These were made by "
"many different manufacturers, but these inexpensive firearms were all sold in "
"the Sears and Roebuck catalog in the days of yore."
msgstr ""
"An antique double-barreled shotgun chambered in 12 gauge.  These were made by "
"many different manufacturers, but these inexpensive firearms were all sold in "
"the Sears and Roebuck catalog in the days of yore."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "double-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "double-barreled shotgun"
msgid "Parker Bros. Trojan 12 gauge shotgun"
msgid_plural "Parker Bros. Trojan 12 gauge shotguns"
msgstr[0] "Parker Bros. Trojan 12 gauge shotguns"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "double-barreled shotgun" of gun "Parker Bros.
#. Trojan 12 gauge shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Parker Bros. Trojan 12 gauge shotgun" of item
#. "double-barreled shotgun"
msgid ""
"An antique double-barreled shotgun chambered in 12 gauge.  Not to be confused "
"with the board game company of the same name, Parker Bros. made shotguns from "
"1867 to 1942, before they were phased out of production by Remington, who had "
"acquired the company the previous decade.  These shotguns were sold in many "
"different \"grades\" at varying price points, with higher quality of "
"engravings being included at higher cost.  This particular shotgun is a "
"\"Trojan\", which was the cheapest grade Parker Bros. sold."
msgstr ""
"An antique double-barreled shotgun chambered in 12 gauge.  Not to be confused "
"with the board game company of the same name, Parker Bros. made shotguns from "
"1867 to 1942, before they were phased out of production by Remington, who had "
"acquired the company the previous decade.  These shotguns were sold in many "
"different \"grades\" at varying price points, with higher quality of "
"engravings being included at higher cost.  This particular shotgun is a "
"\"Trojan\", which was the cheapest grade Parker Bros. sold."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "double-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "double-barreled shotgun"
msgid "CZ Bobwhite 12 gauge shotgun"
msgid_plural "CZ Bobwhite 12 gauge shotguns"
msgstr[0] "CZ Bobwhite 12 gauge shotguns"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "double-barreled shotgun" of gun "CZ Bobwhite 12
#. gauge shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "CZ Bobwhite 12 gauge shotgun" of item "double-
#. barreled shotgun"
msgid ""
"A relatively modern double-barreled shotgun chambered in 12 gauge.  \"CZ\" "
"stands for \"Česká zbrojovka\", or Czech armory.  CZ's weapons are either "
"Czech imports or produced by their US based subsidiaries.  This specific "
"model is the Bobwhite, with a wooden stock and black chrome barrels."
msgstr ""
"A relatively modern double-barreled shotgun chambered in 12 gauge.  \"CZ\" "
"stands for \"Česká zbrojovka\", or Czech armory.  CZ's weapons are either "
"Czech imports or produced by their US based subsidiaries.  This specific "
"model is the Bobwhite, with a wooden stock and black chrome barrels."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "triple-barreled shotgun"
msgid_plural "triple-barreled shotguns"
msgstr[0] "三管霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "triple-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "triple-barreled shotgun"
msgid "A pretty modern-looking shotgun that has three barrels."
msgstr "一把具有三个枪管的漂亮的现代猎枪。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "triple-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "triple-barreled shotgun"
msgid "Triple Honcho"
msgid_plural "Triple Honchos"
msgstr[0] "“Honchos”三管霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "triple-barreled shotgun" of gun "Triple Honcho"
#. ~ Description of variant "Triple Honcho" of item "triple-barreled shotgun"
msgid ""
"Made by Charles Daly, this modern three-barrel shotgun had a unique balance "
"between how much it cost and how little firepower it could release with its "
"18.5-inch barrels.  Luckily, you do not need to pay the full price for it "
"anymore."
msgstr ""
"这款由查尔斯·戴利制造的现代三枪管霰弹枪，在其价格和 18.5 "
"英寸(约47厘米)枪管所能释放的火力之间，有着一种独特的平衡。幸运的是，你现在无需再支付其原价。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "single barrel shotgun"
msgid_plural "single barrel shotguns"
msgstr[0] "單管霰彈槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "single barrel shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "single barrel shotgun"
msgid ""
"An old shotgun, possibly antique.  It is little more than a barrel, a wood "
"stock, and a hammer to strike the cartridge.  Its simple design keeps it both "
"light and accurate."
msgstr "一把舊式的霰彈槍, 可能是個古董。是個槍管, 槍機, 擊鎚的綜合體。簡約的設計讓其輕量且準確。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "single barrel shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "single barrel shotgun"
msgid "H&R Topper 58"
msgid_plural "H&R Topper 58s"
msgstr[0] "H&R Topper 58s"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "single barrel shotgun" of gun "H&R Topper 58"
#. ~ Description of variant "H&R Topper 58" of item "single barrel shotgun"
msgid ""
"A single barreled 12 gauge shotgun with an 18.5 inch barrel, produced by H&R. "
" While Harrington and Richardson has gone through many different "
"acquisitions, name changes, and bankruptcies, it produces the same or similar "
"weapons that it did in the early 20th century.  This particular model, the "
"58, was mass-produced between 1974-1981."
msgstr ""
"A single barreled 12 gauge shotgun with an 18.5 inch barrel, produced by H&R. "
" While Harrington and Richardson has gone through many different "
"acquisitions, name changes, and bankruptcies, it produces the same or similar "
"weapons that it did in the early 20th century.  This particular model, the "
"58, was mass-produced between 1974-1981."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "auto-loading bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "自动无托霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
msgid ""
"Looking more like some form of sci-fi prop gun than an actual firearm, this "
"weapon uses a system of three different magazines to field 15 12-gauge "
"shotgun shells within a comparatively compact design.  As the weapon's "
"trigger assembly is situated forwards of the chamber and magazines in what is "
"termed as a 'bullpup' design, the firearm's notably more compact than its "
"peers despite having a higher capacity when compared against more classically "
"designed shotguns."
msgstr ""
"这种武器看起来更像某个科幻电影里的道具枪，而不是真正的枪支，它使用一个由三个管状弹匣组成的系统，在一个相对紧凑的设计中装填15"
"发霰弹。由于该武器的扳机位于膛室前方，和弹匣供弹设计一同被称为\"无托式\""
"设计，虽然与更经典设计的霰弹枪相比其弹容量相对较高，但它的结构明显比同类武器更紧凑。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
msgid "Tavor TS12 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Tavor TS12 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "Tavor TS12 霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "auto-loading bullpup shotgun" of gun "Tavor TS12
#. shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Tavor TS12 shotgun" of item "auto-loading bullpup
#. shotgun"
msgid ""
"A triple tube magazine fed, gas-operated bullpup shotgun of Israeli Weapon "
"Industries make.  It is capable of loading 15 shells, all in a relatively "
"small package.  Like many other modern IWI designs, this looks more like a "
"sci-fi prop gun than a firearm.  An integral top rail is provided for "
"mounting sights."
msgstr ""
"一把由以色列武器工业制造，使用三管弹匣供弹，由气体驱动的无托式霰弹枪。它的弹匣一次能装入15"
"发霰弹，全部装在一个体积相对较小的外包装中。和以色列武器工业的许多其他现代枪械设计一样，它看起来更像是科幻道具，而非一把枪。内置的顶部导轨能够用来安装瞄具。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "double-barreled pump shotgun"
msgid_plural "double-barreled pump shotguns"
msgstr[0] "双管泵动霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "double-barreled pump shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "double-barreled pump shotgun"
msgid ""
"A hefty shotgun with a double-barrel configuration, though each barrel feeds "
"from its own magazine, making the weapon actually two firearms in a single "
"frame.  While each barrel has its own associated trigger, considering there "
"is a single pump to actuate both mechanisms, one can't really use it "
"precisely.  This, however, isn't to say that the weapon isn't fit for the "
"service of shooting zombies at point blank ranges."
msgstr ""
"一把笨重的双枪管霰弹枪，每个枪管由各自的弹匣供弹，因此这把武器实质上是在一个枪身里塞了两把枪。虽然每个枪管有各自对应的扳机，但两个枪机是同时由一个可滑动护木"
"驱动的，因此无法精确使用。尽管如此，这把武器在近距离打丧尸还是不成问题的。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "double-barreled pump shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "double-barreled pump shotgun"
msgid "DP-12"
msgid_plural "DP-12s"
msgstr[0] "DP-12 霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "double-barreled pump shotgun" of gun "DP-12"
#. ~ Description of variant "DP-12" of item "double-barreled pump shotgun"
msgid ""
"A bullpup, 12-gauge, pump-action, double-barreled mouthful of a shotgun.  "
"Each barrel feeds from its own magazine, making the weapon actually two "
"firearms in a single frame, and, while each barrel has its own associated "
"trigger, the presence of a single pump to actuate both mechanisms means that "
"it cannot be used precisely.  This, however, isn't to say that the weapon "
"isn't fit for the service of shooting zombies at point blank ranges."
msgstr ""
"一把无托式，12"
"号口径，泵动式，前缀多的要死的双管霰弹枪。每个枪管由各自的弹匣供弹，因此这把武器实质上是在一个枪身里塞了两把枪。虽然每个枪管有各自对应的扳机，但两个枪机是同"
"时由一个可滑动护木驱动的，因此无法精确使用。尽管如此，这把武器在近距离打丧尸还是不成问题的。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
msgid_plural "bootleg lever-action shotguns"
msgstr[0] "土製槓桿式霰彈槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
msgid ""
"A lever-action shotgun with a very short barrel and no stock, with room for 6 "
"rounds of 12 gauge shotshells.  Likely a bootlegged replica of a pre-1900 "
"firearm, it would pair nicely with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley Davidson, "
"and seems ready to terminate your cataclysmic adversaries."
msgstr ""
"一把杠杆式霰弹枪，枪管很短，没有枪托，可装填6发12号霰弹。它很可能是某把1900"
"年前霰弹枪的自制复制品，可以与摩托车夹克和哈雷摩托完美搭配，随时准备好轰飞大灾变后的一切敌人。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
msgid "1887 bootleg shotgun"
msgid_plural "1887 bootleg shotguns"
msgstr[0] "1887 盜版霰彈槍"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "bootleg lever-action shotgun" of gun "1887
#. bootleg shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "1887 bootleg shotgun" of item "bootleg lever-
#. action shotgun"
msgid ""
"One of the first commercially successful repeating shotguns, the Winchester "
"1887 was specifically made lever-action at Winchester's request.  Though "
"later overshadowed in success by pump designs, the 1887 remains popular "
"today.  This one has a very short barrel, no stock, and would pair nicely "
"with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley Davidson."
msgstr ""
"作为首批在商业上成功的连发霰弹枪之一，温彻斯特 1887 霰弹枪的杠杆式枪机是应温彻斯特本人要求特意制造的。尽管后来由于泵动式枪机的成功设计而黯然失色，但 "
"1887 霰弹枪至今仍广受欢迎。这把霰弹枪的枪管特别短，也没有枪托，而且看上去和摩托车夹克和哈雷戴维森摩托非常匹配。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "6-round trenchgun"
msgid_plural "6-round trenchguns"
msgstr[0] "6发堑壕霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "6-round trenchgun"
#. ~ Description of "6-round trenchgun"
msgid ""
"Whether or not you ever wondered what would happen if one was to attach a "
"shotgun atop a sword, the result of such an inquiry now rests before you in "
"all its metallic glory.  Coming outfitted with a large 17 inch sword bayonet "
"and a wooden heat shield to protect the user's hands from the barrel when it "
"heats up during firing, this pump-action shotgun practically drips menace and "
"looks like it's straight out of the trenches of World War I.  There aren't "
"any more trenches to clear, so the next zombie-infested town will have to "
"suffice."
msgstr ""
"你是否想过，如果在霰弹枪口按上一把剑会发生什么？这个问题的答案现在就摆在你面前。配备了一把17英寸（约43"
"厘米）长的利剑刺刀，以及一个木制隔热板，以保护使用者的手在射击过程中不被枪管烫伤，这把泵动式霰弹枪威胁度几乎快溢出来了，看起来仿佛直接来自第一次世界大战的战"
"壕一般。现在并没有更多的战壕需要清理，但下一个丧尸出没的城镇也不是不行。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round trenchgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "6-round trenchgun"
msgid "M1897 Trench Gun"
msgid_plural "M1897 Trench Guns"
msgstr[0] "M1897 戰壕清道夫"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "6-round trenchgun" of gun "M1897 Trench Gun"
#. ~ Description of variant "M1897 Trench Gun" of item "6-round trenchgun"
msgid ""
"The Winchester 1897 was one of the first commercially-successful pump-action "
"shotguns.  In its 'trench' configuration it has become a heavily-romanticized "
"American icon of World War I.  With its barrel shroud, bayonet lug, and 17 "
"inch bayonet, this shotgun is undeniably fearsome in appearance.  There "
"aren't any more trenches to clear, so the next zombie-infested town will have "
"to suffice."
msgstr ""
"温彻斯特 1897 "
"霰弹枪是首批在商业上成功的泵动霰弹枪之一。它的\"堑壕战\"型号已经成为一个高度浪漫化的一战美国象征。它的枪套、刺刀卡口和17英寸(约43厘米)"
"长的刺刀，无可否认，让这把霰弹枪看上去十分骇人。现在已经没有战壕需要清理，但来个充满丧尸的城镇也足够了。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
msgid_plural "4-round waterfowl shotguns"
msgstr[0] "4发水禽霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
msgid ""
"This is a lanky, though relatively light, semi-automatic shotgun fitted with "
"a plastic, dimple buttstock and forend, a representative of many such guns "
"employed in fighting the true, greatest foe: geese.  An under-slung magazine "
"tube retains three shells in complement with a chambered cartridge, lending "
"the gun a somewhat modest capacity despite its durability and reliable action."
msgstr ""
"这是一把修长，重量相对较轻的半自动霰弹枪，装配有塑料防滑纹枪托和前护木，是用于对抗真正头号大敌——鹅的枪械之一。枪身下方挂载的弹药管可携带三发子弹，配合膛内"
"一发，共携带4发弹药。尽管携弹量一般，该枪凭借其耐用性和可靠的射击动作脱颖而出。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
msgid "Benelli M2 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Benelli M2 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "伯奈利 M2 霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "4-round waterfowl shotgun" of gun "Benelli M2
#. shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Benelli M2 shotgun" of item "4-round waterfowl
#. shotgun"
msgid ""
"Workhorse, companion, and Italian hole-puncher: the M2 forms the backbone of "
"the Benelli's venerable line of Super 90 shotguns, utilizing the company's "
"signature inertia-driven system to snap out 12-gauge shells with alacrity.  "
"Though possessing a 3-round magazine tube, the shotgun's dimpled, synthetic "
"furniture, cryogenically treated barrel, and robust action capable of "
"withstanding magnum loads make it a hardy option, even for the post-Cataclysm "
"survivor."
msgstr ""
"主力、伙伴和意大利打孔机：M2霰弹枪构成了伯奈利久负盛名的Super "
"90霰弹枪系列的支柱，利用该公司标志性的惯性驱动系统，能快速倾泻出12号霰弹。虽然只有一个3"
"发管型弹匣，但霰弹枪那带凹槽的合成护木，低温处理的枪管，以及可以承受马格南弹的可靠枪机，使它成为一个优秀的选择，即使对于大灾变后的幸存者来说也是如此。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "4-round waterfowl shotgun"
msgid "Benelli SBE 3 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Benelli SBE 3 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "伯奈利 SBE 3 霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "4-round waterfowl shotgun" of gun "Benelli SBE 3
#. shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Benelli SBE 3 shotgun" of item "4-round waterfowl
#. shotgun"
msgid ""
"A relatively light, semi-automatic fowling peace finished in black furniture "
"with trim lines and a slender forend, the Super Black Eagle (SBE) shotgun "
"operates off of Benelli's inertia-driven recoil system.  Synonymous with "
"versatility and reliability, it's a decades-beloved design incorporating one "
"of the earliest actions rated to chamber 3-inch magnum shotgun shells, with "
"this 2023 updated version coming fitted with a recoil pad."
msgstr ""
"超级黑鹰（SBE）霰弹枪是一种相对轻便的半自动枪械，由黑色护木装饰而成，带有装饰线和细长的枪柄。它使用贝内利的惯性驱动后坐力系统。它是多功能性和可靠性的代名"
"词，是数十年来备受喜爱的设计，结合了最早被评为3英寸马格南霰弹枪弹的动作之一，这个2023年的更新版本配备了后坐力垫。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "6-round tactical shotgun"
msgid_plural "6-round tactical shotguns"
msgstr[0] "6发战术霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "6-round tactical shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "6-round tactical shotgun"
msgid ""
"A black-finished shotgun fit for the gentlemanly pursuit of blowing very "
"large holes through the residence of the Cataclysm, be it zombie, goose, or "
"tiny abomination, this semi-automatic longarm fields five shotgun shells "
"within its tubular magazine.  Aesthetically pleasing with its dimpled "
"buttstock and forend, the weapon features an underslung pistol-style grip and "
"a gel cushion on the back of the stock for recoil mitigation."
msgstr ""
"这是一把有着黑色涂装的霰弹枪，一把符合绅士追求的武器：在大灾变之下，面对不论是丧尸、鹅还是小型的恐怖生物，都能在他们身上轰出硕大的孔洞。这款半自动长枪在其管"
"状弹匣中装载了五发霰弹。它有着美观的防滑纹枪托和前护木，设计有下挂手枪式握把，并在枪托后部配备了减震凝胶垫，以减轻后坐力。"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round tactical shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "6-round tactical shotgun"
msgid "Benelli M2 Tactical shotgun"
msgid_plural "Benelli M2 Tactical shotguns"
msgstr[0] "伯奈利 M2 战术霰弹枪"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "6-round tactical shotgun" of gun "Benelli M2
#. Tactical shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Benelli M2 Tactical shotgun" of item "6-round
#. tactical shotgun"
msgid ""
"Where the full-sized Benelli M2 shotgun is a hefty stallion, this "
"mission-oriented tactical iteration is a trim race horse, with an 18.5-inch "
"barrel, dimpled grip surfaces, and an underslung pistol grip.  Ghost-ring "
"aperture-sights, a recoil-padded buttstock, and a cryogenically-treated "
"barrel all join hands to ensure that you can carry out your post-Cataclysm "
"farming duties: seeding lead shot into fields of zombies."
msgstr ""
"在全尺寸的Benelli M2猎枪是一匹高矮的马匹的地方,这种面向任务的战术迭接是一匹有18.5英寸长的枪管,凹陷的握把表面,以及下垂的手枪握把. "
"鬼环孔径视线,后坐力相加的枪托,和经低温处理的枪管都携手合作,确保你能够完成卡塔克林斯姆后耕作任务:将铅投入僵尸的田地."

