"A counterweight placed forward of the bow's grip allows for greater accuracy. "
" Aside from increased weight and size, there are no drawbacks."
msgstr "一個裝在弓握把前的秤錘, 可使命中率提昇。除了增加重量跟體積外, 沒有任何負面影響。"

