#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "match trigger"
msgid_plural "match triggers"
msgstr[0] "競賽扳機"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "match trigger"
#. ~ Description of "match trigger"
msgid ""
"A precision weighted trigger assembly that slightly improves a firearm's "
"accuracy."
msgstr "精密加重的扳機組件，可略微提高槍械的準確性。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "drop-in auto sear"
msgid_plural "drop-in auto sears"
msgstr[0] "插入式自动阻铁"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "drop-in auto sear"
#. ~ Description of "drop-in auto sear"
msgid ""
"A vaguely 'U'-shaped piece of metal with a vaguely 'T'-shaped flapper on a "
"pin.  Once tucked into an AR-15's lower receiver, the rifle will become "
"selective fire-capable.  The handcrafted-sear surface isn't as good as actual "
"full-auto parts, so precision and reliability suffer slightly."
msgstr ""
"一个U形金属片和一个T形活动挡板通过转轴组装在一起。把它塞进AR-15"
"步枪的下机匣里，能够改变射击模式。由于自制挡板的表面不如实际的全自动阻铁好，所以精度和可靠性略有下降。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "lightning link"
msgid_plural "lightning links"
msgstr[0] "\"闪电链\"扳机"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "lightning link"
#. ~ Description of "lightning link"
msgid ""
"Originally designed for the Colt SP-1, this 'reproduction' is intended to "
"convert an AR-15 into a full-auto only rifle.  Once the necessary "
"modifications are made and the link is in place, semi-auto is disabled and "
"full-auto is enabled.  Reliability and precision suffer greatly due to "
"questionable craftsmanship and lack of unobtainium SP-1 parts."
msgstr ""
"最初为柯尔特SP-1步枪设计，这个\"复刻品\"可将一把 AR-15 "
"步枪变成一把全自动步枪。当所需的修改到位并安装上\"闪电链\"扳机之后，将不再使用半自动模式，而是使用全自动模式发射。由于制造工艺有问题，以及难以获得的 "
"SP-1 原装件，改装后的枪械可靠性和精度受到很大影响。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "Glock auto sear plate"
msgid_plural "Glock auto sear plates"
msgstr[0] "克拉克自動卡扣"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "Glock auto sear plate"
#. ~ Description of "Glock auto sear plate"
msgid ""
"A relatively simple switch or button mechanism that replaces the back plate "
"of a Glock slide, allowing it to function as a select-fire machine pistol.  A "
"highly illegal modification, but the feds are zombie food anyway.  This will "
"fit any standard Glock pistol in 9mm, .40, .45, 10mm, or .357 caliber."
msgstr ""
"一个结构还算简单的扳机或按钮模组，取代了格洛克手枪滑槽的背板，将其改造成一把可选射击模式的自动手枪。这算是极度违法的改装，但反正联邦调查局都已经成为丧尸们的"
"大餐了。该模组适用于任何9mm、.40口径、.45口径、10mm或.357口径标准的格洛克手枪。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "TEC-9 full auto sear"
msgid_plural "TEC-9 full auto sears"
msgstr[0] "TEC-9自动阻铁"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "TEC-9 full auto sear"
#. ~ Description of "TEC-9 full auto sear"
msgid ""
"A relatively simple modification of some of a TEC-9's internal fire-control "
"components, converting it to a fully-automatic-only machine pistol.  Calling "
"this hilariously illegal would be an understatement, but anyone who'd care is "
"probably long gone by now."
msgstr ""
"这个模组对TEC-9的一些内部扳机结构进行了相对简单的改造，将其改造成为全自动冲锋枪。把这种改装称为\"违法行为\""
"甚至都算轻描淡写，但会关心这种事情的人应该都已经与世长辞了。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "balanced recoil system"
msgid_plural "balanced recoil systems"
msgstr[0] "后坐力平衡系统"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "balanced recoil system"
#. ~ Description of "balanced recoil system"
msgid ""
"A complex set of parts designed to minimize recoil using a reciprocating "
"counterweight."
msgstr "一套复杂的枪械模组，使用往复式配重来最大限度地降低后坐力。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "M249 select fire trigger"
msgid_plural "M249 select fire triggers"
msgstr[0] "M249快慢机"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "M249 select fire trigger"
#. ~ Description of "M249 select fire trigger"
msgid ""
"A trigger modification that allows the M249 to switch between semi and full "
"automatic modes."
msgstr "一个选择开火模式的小扳机，可以让M249在半自动与全自动开火模式间切换。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "pristine condenser"
msgid_plural "pristine condensers"
msgstr[0] "pristine condensers"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "pristine condenser"
#. ~ Description of "pristine condenser"
msgid "A condenser unit for the Caotel Sr2.2, seemingly in perfect condition."
msgstr "卡特尔 Sr2.2的冷凝器单元，看起来状态完美。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "M240 select fire trigger"
msgid_plural "M240 select fire triggers"
msgstr[0] "M240快慢机"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "M240 select fire trigger"
#. ~ Description of "M240 select fire trigger"
msgid ""
"A trigger modification that allows the M240 to switch between semi and full "
"automatic modes."
msgstr "一个选择开火模式的小扳机，可以让M240在半自动与全自动开火模式间切换。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "replaceable furniture kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable furniture kits"
msgstr[0] "可更换枪具套装"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "replaceable furniture kit"
#. ~ Description of "replaceable furniture kit"
msgid ""
"A kit consisting of various steel and plastic parts.  When installed, it will "
"permanently modify and partially replace some of the weapon's furniture so "
"that it can be easily changed if needed.  This allows installing any kind of "
"more advanced grips or other furniture."
msgstr ""
"一个由各种钢和塑料部件组成的套件；安装后，它将永久性地修改和部分替换枪具握把的一些组件，以便需要时能够很容易地替换。这样使老式枪械可以安装上各种各样更高级的"
"握把。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "side mount"
msgid_plural "side mounts"
msgstr[0] "导轨底座"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "side mount"
#. ~ Description of "side mount"
msgid ""
"A plastic mount for attaching a rail accessory, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any weapon, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for "
"bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr "一个塑料支架，用于连接导轨模组，设计成可以永久安装在几乎任何枪械上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的老式枪械满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "sights mount"
#. ~ Description of "sights mount"
msgid ""
"A plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently installed "
"onto almost any weapon other than launchers and pistols, along with some "
"fasteners.  Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr "一个塑料支架，用于安装各种瞄具模组，设计成可以永久安装在除发射器和手枪以外几乎任何枪械上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的老式枪械满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "launcher sights mount"
msgid_plural "launcher sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "發射器瞄具座"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "launcher sights mount"
#. ~ Description of "launcher sights mount"
msgid ""
"A plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently installed "
"onto almost any launcher, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for bringing out "
"your inner tacticool on rocket launchers."
msgstr "一个塑料支架，用于安装各种瞄具模组，设计成可以永久安装在几乎任何发射器上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的火箭发射器满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "pistol sights mount"
msgid_plural "pistol sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "手槍瞄具座"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol sights mount"
#. ~ Description of "pistol sights mount"
msgid ""
"A plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently installed "
"onto almost any pistol, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for bringing out "
"your inner tacticool on pocket pistols."
msgstr "一个塑料支架，用于安装各种瞄具模组，设计成可以永久安装在几乎任何手枪上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的手枪满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "replaceable stock kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable stock kits"
msgstr[0] "可更换枪托套装"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "replaceable stock kit"
#. ~ Description of "replaceable stock kit"
msgid ""
"A kit consisting of various steel parts.  When installed, it will remove the "
"weapon's original fixed stock, install a new stock mount in its place, modify "
"the original stock to fit it and then reattach it to the gun, or simply "
"attach a stock mount if the gun had no stock to start with.  This allows easy "
"installation of any kind of more advanced stocks."
msgstr ""
"一套包含若干钢制部件的改装包；安装在枪支上后，它会先移除掉枪支原有的固定枪托，在原枪托处安装一个枪托安装底座，调整原枪托以适应安装底座，最后将原枪托安装在底"
"座上；如果枪本来没有枪托，它只会安装一个安装底座。安装底座允许将各种高级枪托简单的安装在枪上。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "bottom mount"
msgid_plural "bottom mounts"
msgstr[0] "管下底座"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "bottom mount"
#. ~ Description of "bottom mount"
msgid ""
"A plastic mount for attaching an underbarrel accessory, designed to be "
"permanently installed onto almost any weapon, along with some fasteners.  "
"Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr "一个塑料支架，用于连接管下枪械模组，设计成可以永久安装在几乎任何枪械上，只要些紧固件就行。能让你的老式枪械满足你内心对战术酷的渴望。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "rail bayonet mount"
msgid_plural "rail bayonet mounts"
msgstr[0] "导轨刺刀底座"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "rail bayonet mount"
#. ~ Description of "rail bayonet mount"
msgid ""
"A one-piece mount for attaching a bayonet to a firearm's accessory rail, in "
"case that was a thing you wanted.  Ideal for making newer guns pointier."
msgstr "这是一个一体式支架，用于将刺刀安装在枪械的附件导轨上，如果你有这样的需求的话。它非常适合让新式枪械更加尖锐。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "compensator"
msgid_plural "compensators"
msgstr[0] "补偿器"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "compensator"
#. ~ Description of "compensator"
msgid ""
"A compensator contains a number of holes or slits to vent some of the exhaust "
"gasses of a gun upwards to reduce muzzle climb, while also increasing noise "
"and bulk slightly."
msgstr "这是一个补偿器，包含多个孔或缝隙，用于将部分枪口排出的废气向上排出，以减少枪口上跳的情况，但同时也会稍微增加噪音和体积。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "muzzle brake"
msgid_plural "muzzle brakes"
msgstr[0] "砲口制退器"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "muzzle brake"
#. ~ Description of "muzzle brake"
msgid ""
"A muzzle brake redirects exhaust gases to reduce recoil, at the cost of "
"increasing bulk, noise, and reducing accuracy slightly."
msgstr "一个枪口制退器，通过改变排放气体的方向来降低后坐力，但会增大噪音，降低便携性与精度。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "homemade suppressor"
msgid_plural "homemade suppressors"
msgstr[0] "自製滅音器"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "homemade suppressor"
#. ~ Description of "homemade suppressor"
msgid ""
"A homemade suppressor made from a pipe and improvised wipe media.  For as "
"long as the wipes hold up, it will reduce the amount of noise and muzzle "
"flash generated by the report of a firearm.  Gunfire is extremely loud and "
"can damage your hearing without protection; a suppressor will bring the "
"loudness of a report down to generally safe levels, as well as slightly "
"reducing recoil and muzzle velocity.  This simple suppressor is large and, "
"when attached, will interfere with your ability to aim down the base sights "
"of the gun."
msgstr ""
"一个用钢管和简易消音材料拼凑而成的自制消音器。只要消音材料还在，就能减弱火药武器发射时所产生的噪音和枪口火焰。子弹发射时如果没有防护的状态下，发出的噪音甚至"
"可以伤害听力。消音器可以把枪声在输出后降低到一个可以接受的范围内。消音器会减少后坐力但是降低枪口初速度。由于自制消音器体型巨大，安装后会遮挡枪械原本的瞄具的"
"视线。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "'solvent trap' suppressor"
msgid_plural "'solvent trap' suppressors"
msgstr[0] "'solvent trap'牌 滅音器"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "'solvent trap' suppressor"
#. ~ Description of "'solvent trap' suppressor"
msgid ""
"An automotive filter crudely adapted to mate up with a firearm's barrel, "
"creating an illegal, unregistered suppressor.  Good thing there don't seem to "
"be any ATF agents around to arrest you.  While close in design to a real "
"suppressor, it was not designed for the high pressures involved in gunfire "
"and will eventually lose effectiveness.  The filter is large and, when "
"attached, will interfere with your ability to aim down the base sights of the "
"gun."
msgstr ""
"一个改装过的汽车过滤器，可以与枪支配合使用，变成非法的枪支消音器。幸好周围没有ATF探员逮捕你。虽然原理和真正的消音器很接近，但它并不是为枪械之类的高压环境"
"而设计的，最终会失效。由于自制消音器体型巨大，安装后会遮挡枪械原本瞄具的视线。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "shotgun suppressor"
msgid_plural "shotgun suppressors"
msgstr[0] "霰彈槍滅音器"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "shotgun suppressor"
#. ~ Description of "shotgun suppressor"
msgid ""
"A large suppressor designed to work with shotguns.  It's a lot more complex "
"than a suppressor for a pistol or rifle."
msgstr "体积巨大的霰弹枪用消声器，相比手枪和步枪消声器更复杂。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "suppressor"
msgid_plural "suppressors"
msgstr[0] "滅音器"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "suppressor"
#. ~ Description of "suppressor"
msgid ""
"A suppressor reduces the amount of noise and muzzle flash generated by the "
"report of a firearm.  Gunfire is extremely loud and can damage your hearing "
"without protection; a suppressor will bring the loudness of a report down to "
"generally safe levels."
msgstr "滅音器可以減少槍械發射時所產生的聲音與火光。發射槍械的音量非常高，且能在沒有保護時損害你的聽覺，一個滅音器可以將這些音量降低至安全值。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "MP5SD integral suppressor"
msgid_plural "MP5SD integral suppressors"
msgstr[0] "MP5SD 內置滅音器"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "MP5SD integral suppressor"
#. ~ Description of "MP5SD integral suppressor"
msgid ""
"The integrated suppressor for the H&K MP5SD.  Its large expansion chamber "
"decelerates ammunition via several ports in the barrel, rendering most ammo "
"subsonic at the cost of terminal performance.  It is not as effective as "
"modern designs."
msgstr ""
"H&K MP5SD "
"冲锋枪的内置消音器。消音器中的大型膨胀仓及枪管上的多处排气门能够将大多数子弹的速度降至亚音速，但同时也降低了其弹道性能。现代消音器的性能已经超越了这种消音器"
"。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "pistol suppressor"
msgid_plural "pistol suppressors"
msgstr[0] "手枪消音器"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/muzzle.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol suppressor"
