"An angled grip set at 45° that attaches to a side rail, allowing for a grip "
"while leaving the underbarrel rail free, or on guns that have integral bipods."
msgstr "一种设计为倾斜45°的握把，连接在侧面的导轨上，允许在不占用下导轨的情况下提供抓握点，或者安装在具有内置双脚架的枪支上。"

