"The integrated 12 gauge shotgun barrel of the Chiappa M6 Survival Gun.  It's "
"irremovable."
msgstr "M6 生存步枪集成的12号口径霰弹枪。无法拆除。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
