#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "wire monopod, collapsed"
#. ~ Description of "wire monopod, collapsed"
msgid ""
"A folding wire monopod designed to attach to a Type 99 Arisaka's front barrel "
"band, intended to give soldiers a stabler platform from which to shoot while "
"prone.  Less effective than an actual bipod and ungainly long, it was largely "
"cut from active issue relatively soon into the Second World War.  This one is "
"currently stowed in the folded position and cannot aid you while firing."
msgstr ""
"一个折叠式铁丝脚架，设计用于安装在九九式有坂步枪的前枪管箍上，旨在为士兵提供更稳定的平台，以便在俯卧时射击。它不如真正的双脚架有效，而且又长又笨重，在第二次"
"世界大战初期就被大量裁减。这款脚架目前处于折叠状态，在射击时无法为你提供帮助。"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wire monopod, collapsed"
msgid "You flip out the monopod and lock it into position."
msgstr "You flip out the monopod and lock it into position."

