#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "collapsed boarding axe"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "megachette (folded)"
msgid "Expand"
msgstr "伸展"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "expandable baton"
msgid "You snap open your baton."
msgstr "你啪的一聲彈開你的甩棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "expandable baton (extended)"
msgid_plural "expandable batons (extended)"
msgstr[0] "甩棍（伸展）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "expandable baton (extended)"
msgid ""
"A telescoping baton that collapses for easy storage.  Makes a good melee "
"weapon.  Activate to collapse."
msgstr "一把叠缩式短棍，缩小后更易于携带。这是一件不错的的近战武器。激活以收回。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "expandable baton (extended)"
msgid "You collapse your baton."
msgstr "你收回了你的甩棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "battle axe"
msgid_plural "battle axes"
msgstr[0] "戰斧"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Though intended for use as a weapon, it can "
"also be pressed into service as a rather clumsy woodcutting tool."
msgstr "一把专为战斗而设计的巨斧。虽然只建议作为武器使用，但也可以勉强当作一把相当笨拙的伐木工具。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "battle axe"
msgid "A dull, cheaply-made replica of a huge axe designed for warfare."
msgstr "一把专为战斗而设计的巨斧。此款外观、造型和材料与正品有差异，为廉价复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Or it would be, but the axe heads aren't "
"seated properly at all."
msgstr "一把专为战斗而设计的巨斧。或者说本应是一把专为战斗而设计的巨斧，因为斧头根本没有被正确安装。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel battle axe"
msgid_plural "mild steel battle axes"
msgstr[0] "戰斧（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Made of mild steel, it's passable as a "
"weapon, but lacking a proper grip or a razor sharp edge leaves it somewhat "
"lacking."
msgstr "一把专为战斗而设计的巨斧。  由低碳钢制成。作为武器来说还算过得去，缺乏适当的握把和锋利的斧刃使其有些欠缺。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel battle axe"
msgid_plural "medium steel battle axes"
msgstr[0] "戰斧（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Made of medium steel, this isn't the "
"greatest weapon ever forged but it has a decent edge and a real handle."
msgstr "一把专为战斗而设计的巨斧。  由中碳钢制成。这虽然不是有史以来最伟大的武器，但它有一个不错的刀刃和一个真正的握把。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel battle axe"
msgid_plural "high steel battle axes"
msgstr[0] "戰斧（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Made of high steel, this is a solid, "
"dependable weapon."
msgstr "一把专为战斗而设计的巨斧。  由高碳钢制成。坚实可靠，值得信赖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel battle axe"
msgid_plural "hardened steel battle axes"
msgstr[0] "戰斧（硬化鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Made of hardened steel, this would be the "
"envy of any Viking raider."
msgstr "一把专为战斗而设计的巨斧。  由硬化碳钢制成。维京海盗看了都嫉妒。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel battle axe"
msgid_plural "tempered steel battle axes"
msgstr[0] "戰斧（回火鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Made of tempered steel, this is a weapon "
"that could fell a jötunn."
msgstr "一把專為戰鬥而設計的巨斧。由回火鋼制成。並非只有風暴才能擊倒大樹，用這玩意兒也成。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blackjack"
msgid_plural "blackjacks"
msgstr[0] "粗頭短棒"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "blackjack"
msgid ""
"A short, easily concealed bludgeoning weapon consisting of a weight embedded "
"at the end of a short leather shaft.  Formerly used by law enforcement, this "
"weapon is meant to stun or knock out the subject, although head strikes have "
"a high risk of causing a permanent, disabling brain injury or being fatal."
msgstr ""
"一把便于藏匿的短槌，由皮革制成的手柄加上顶端的配重制成。以前被执法部门使用，主要用于眩晕或击晕目标，但是对头部的攻击仍然有很高的概率造成永久性致残的脑损伤，"
"甚至致命。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bokken"
msgid_plural "bokken"
msgstr[0] "日式木刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "bokken"
msgid ""
"A solid wood 'training' katana, exactingly crafted to mimic the weight and "
"balance of the real thing.  Despite its lack of a sharp metal edge, it's "
"still quite capable of inflicting deadly wounds."
msgstr ""
"一柄训练用的木刀，严格模仿真正武士刀的重量和平衡，尽管缺乏一个锋利的刀锋，但它仍然有相当的能力去造成致命的伤害。\n"
"\"洞 爷 湖\""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "bokken"
msgid ""
"A solid wood 'training' katana.  It feels far too light to make an effective "
"weapon."
msgstr "一柄训练用的木刀，但手感太轻了，不是一把好武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "bokken"
msgid ""
"A solid wood 'training' katana.  It looks to be mass-produced, and not quite "
"as effective as the real deal."
msgstr "一柄训练用的木刀，看上去像是批量生产的便宜货，不如纯手工打造的真品那么好用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bowling pin"
msgid_plural "bowling pins"
msgstr[0] "保齡球瓶"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "bowling pin"
msgid "A standard bowling pin.  Makes a decent melee weapon, if somewhat short."
msgstr "一只标准保龄球瓶。你非要当成武器去砸丧尸也行，就是有点短。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "barbed wire bat"
msgid_plural "barbed wire bats"
msgstr[0] "帶刺鐵絲球棒"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "barbed wire bat"
msgid "A baseball bat wrapped with barbed wire.  A brutal melee weapon."
msgstr "一根上面纏繞著帶刺鐵絲的球棒。野蠻的近戰武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bolt studded bat"
msgid_plural "bolt studded bats"
msgstr[0] "bolt studded bats"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "bolt studded bat"
msgid ""
"A baseball bat with bolts drilled into it, concentrating the force of an "
"impact onto a smaller point like a real mace."
msgstr ""
"A baseball bat with bolts drilled into it, concentrating the force of an "
"impact onto a smaller point like a real mace."

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "walking cane"
msgid_plural "walking canes"
msgstr[0] "手杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "walking cane"
msgid ""
"Handicapped or not, you always walk in style.  Consisting of a metal "
"headpiece and a wooden body, this makes a great bashing weapon in a pinch."
msgstr "無論你肢體有沒有殘缺， 你總是可以用一根手杖讓你走路有風。由木製桿身加上金屬頭所組成， 在危急時可以成為相當好的鈍擊武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sinister cane"
msgid_plural "sinister canes"
msgstr[0] "邪惡手杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "sinister cane"
msgid ""
"A sinister looking cane made of plastic.  It has a shiny red orb gripped by "
"claws at the handle."
msgstr "一根看起来很邪恶的塑料手杖。它的把手上有个爪子，抓着一颗闪亮的红球。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cheap wizard cane (off)"
msgid_plural "cheap wizard canes (off)"
msgstr[0] "廉價法師手杖（關）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "cheap wizard cane (off)"
msgid ""
"An arcane but cheap-looking cane made of plastic.  It has a white light-up "
"orb on the end.  Using it will turn it on and provide a weak light."
msgstr "一根看起来很神秘但廉价的塑料手杖。它的把手顶部有个白色的发光球体。使用它会打开它，并提供些许微弱的光。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "cheap wizard cane (off)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wizard cane (off)"
msgid "You turn the wizard cane on."
msgstr "你打開了法師手杖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "cheap wizard cane (off)"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "wizard cane (off)"
msgid "The wizard cane's batteries are dead."
msgstr "法師手杖的電池沒電了。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cheap wizard cane (on)"
msgid_plural "cheap wizard canes (on)"
msgstr[0] "廉價法師手杖（開）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "cheap wizard cane (on)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wizard cane (on)"
msgid "You turn the wizard cane off."
msgstr "你關閉了法師手杖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wizard cane (off)"
msgid_plural "wizard canes (off)"
msgstr[0] "法師手杖（關）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "wizard cane (off)"
msgid ""
"An arcane-looking cane made of wood and aluminum.  It has a white light-up "
"orb on the end.  Using it will turn it on and illuminate the area around you."
msgstr "一根看起来很神秘的手杖，用木头和铝合金制成。它的顶部有个白色的发光球体。使用它以打开，并照亮四周。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wizard cane (on)"
msgid_plural "wizard canes (on)"
msgstr[0] "法師手杖（開）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift walking cane"
msgid_plural "makeshift walking canes"
msgstr[0] "粗製手杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift walking cane"
msgid "An improvised cane.  It also works as a basic bashing weapon in a pinch."
msgstr "一根自制的拐杖。在紧要关头时可以用来当作简单的钝击武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden club"
msgid_plural "wooden clubs"
msgstr[0] "木棒"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden club"
msgid ""
"A plank of wood that's been snapped in half, with a crude handle whittled "
"into one end.  It looks like a poorly-made cricket bat."
msgstr "一块被折成两半的木板，一端被削成一个粗糙的握柄，看起来像一个做工粗糙的板球拍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large wooden club"
msgid_plural "large wooden clubs"
msgstr[0] "大木棒"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "large wooden club"
msgid ""
"A long plank of wood with a crude handle whittled into one end.  It's barely "
"an improvement, but at least it is slightly easier to wield than just the "
"plank on its own."
msgstr "一块长长的木板，一端被削成一个粗糙的握柄。和普通的木板相比几乎没什么改进，但至少更容易挥舞。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crutches"
msgid_plural "pairs of crutches"
msgstr[0] "拐杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "crutches"
msgid "A pair of crutches."
msgstr "一雙枴杖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift crutches"
msgid_plural "pairs of makeshift crutches"
msgstr[0] "粗製拐杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift crutches"
msgid "A pair of wooden makeshift crutches."
msgstr "一雙木製的粗製拐杖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json data/mods/MMA/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cudgel"
msgid_plural "cudgels"
msgstr[0] "棒槌"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "cudgel"
msgid ""
"A long, slender wooden rod.  While traditionally intended as a training tool, "
"it still makes a good melee weapon in a pinch."
msgstr "一根细长的木棍。虽然传统上是作为一种训练工具，但在紧要关头，它仍然是把好用的近战武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "golf club"
msgid_plural "golf clubs"
msgstr[0] "高爾夫球桿"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "golf club"
msgid ""
"A long handle with a big metal head, flat on one side, for driving golf "
"balls.  Fore!"
msgstr "一根長鐵桿， 尾部是扁平的金屬頭， 用來駕馭高爾夫球。球來了！"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sledge hammer"
msgid_plural "sledge hammers"
msgstr[0] "大鎚"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "sledge hammer"
msgid ""
"A large, heavy hammer.  A very hard-hitting melee weapon, but it's slow to "
"swing and will probably exhaust you quickly."
msgstr "一把大而重的锤子，非常粗暴的近战武器。但它挥舞起来很慢，而且可能很快让你筋疲力尽。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "short sledge hammer"
msgid_plural "short sledge hammers"
msgstr[0] "短柄大槌"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "short sledge hammer"
msgid ""
"A sledge hammer with a notably shorter handle.  This makes it worse as a "
"melee weapon, but a more portable tool."
msgstr "一个手柄明显较短的大钢锤，作为近战武器没那么好用，但却是一种更便携的工具。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "engineer's hammer"
msgid_plural "engineer's hammers"
msgstr[0] "工程師的鎚子"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "engineer's hammer"
msgid ""
"A stout and hefty hammer, more akin to a sledge than a typical ball-peen.  "
"Useful for portable demolition work, but very unwieldy as a weapon."
msgstr "一把结实而有分量的锤子，相比于一般的圆头锤，更像一把大钢锤。作为一把便携工具，在拆除工作中十分有用，但作为武器用起来十分笨拙。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy sledge hammer"
msgid_plural "heavy sledge hammers"
msgstr[0] "重型大鎚"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy sledge hammer"
msgid ""
"A large sledge hammer with a massive, heavy head.  This unwieldy tool is "
"meant to break concrete, rock, brick, anything really."
msgstr "一把巨大的钢锤，有着一个同样巨大而沉重的锤头。这个笨重的工具能轻易砸碎混凝土、岩石、砖块，任何东西。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hockey stick"
msgid_plural "hockey sticks"
msgstr[0] "曲棍球桿"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "hockey stick"
msgid ""
"A curved wooden stick with a wide and flat end.  Commonly used by hockey "
"players."
msgstr "一把尾端彎曲扁平的木棍。曲棍球員專用器材。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homewrecker"
msgid_plural "homewreckers"
msgstr[0] "家用破壞者"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "homewrecker"
msgid ""
"A long piece of wood with several chunks of steel firmly tied to it.  The "
"resulting weapon is unwieldy and slow but very heavy hitting."
msgstr "一根粗重的長木棍一頭裝上了幾塊鋼塊。也因為這樣既笨重又難揮， 但能造成非常沉重的打擊。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glass bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "glass bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "阿兹特克玻璃锯剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "glass bladed macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"A flat wooden club with sharpened pieces of glass stuck to both sides.  "
"Somewhat accurate to the actual thing."
msgstr "一个两边镶有磨尖玻璃碎片的扁平木棍。在某种程度上与原版实物相符。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "teeth-bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "teeth-bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "阿兹特克木齿刃"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "teeth-bladed macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"A flat wooden club with impossibly-sharp teeth stuck to both sides.  Fragile "
"yet very sharp."
msgstr "一种扁平的木棒，两边都有锋利得令人难以置信的牙齿。易碎但非常锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone lined macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "stone lined macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "阿兹特克石锯剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "stone lined macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"An improvised version of the close combat weapon that was mainly used by "
"Aztecs.  It's not very sturdy, but it will break someone's skull open and "
"give them a good cut."
msgstr "阿兹特克人所使用的近战武器的自制版。并不结实，但依然人的头骨敲开，造成巨大伤口。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "makeshift macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "粗製刃棒"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"A poor imitation of the close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec warriors, "
"made with a large wooden club and carefully hammered razors.  Although not "
"very sturdy, it delivers some nasty cuts and bruises."
msgstr "阿兹特克人所使用的近战武器的仿制版，用一根大木棍和精心打磨的剃刀制成，并不结实，但仍能造成一些严重的割伤和擦伤。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "mild steel bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "阿兹特克钢锯剑（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"A modern reimagining of the large close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec "
"warriors, made of a sturdy wooden club and sharp blades forged from mild "
"steel.  Blades are definitely sturdier than obsidian ones.  Not great, not "
"terrible."
msgstr "阿兹特克人所使用的近战武器的现代版，由坚固的木棍和由低碳钢锻造的钢刃制成。钢刃肯定比黑曜石的更结实。不好不坏。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "medium steel bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "阿兹特克钢锯剑（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"A modern reimagining of the large close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec "
"warriors, made of a sturdy wooden club and sharp blades forged from medium "
"steel.  Blades are definitely sturdier than obsidian ones."
msgstr "阿兹特克人所使用的近战武器的现代版，由坚固的木棍和由中碳钢锻造的钢刃制成。钢刃肯定比黑曜石的更结实。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "high steel bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "阿兹特克钢锯剑（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"A modern reimagining of the large close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec "
"warriors, made of a sturdy wooden club and sharp blades forged from high "
"steel.  Blades are definitely sturdier than obsidian ones."
msgstr "阿兹特克人所使用的近战武器的现代版，由坚固的木棍和由高碳钢锻造的钢刃制成。钢刃肯定比黑曜石的更结实。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "hardened steel bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "阿兹特克钢锯剑（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"A modern reimagining of the large close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec "
"warriors, made of a sturdy wooden club and sharp blades forged from hardened "
"steel.  Blades are definitely sturdier than obsidian ones."
msgstr "阿兹特克人所使用的近战武器的现代版，由坚固的木棍和由硬化碳钢锻造的钢刃制成。钢刃肯定比黑曜石的更结实。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "tempered steel bladed macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "阿兹特克钢锯剑（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel bladed macuahuitl"
msgid ""
"A modern reimagining of the large close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec "
"warriors, made of a sturdy wooden club and sharp blades forged from tempered "
"steel.  You can single-handedly avenge the fallen nations of Mesoamerica with "
"this one."
msgstr "阿兹特克人所使用的近战武器的现代版，由坚固的木棍和由回火碳钢锻造的钢刃制成。你可以单枪匹马的用这把兵器为中美洲的亡国复仇。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ironshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "ironshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鐵頭長杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "ironshod quarterstaff"
msgid "A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps."
msgstr ""
"一根木质长棍，两端箍上金属圈并装上金属包头来加固。\n"
"\"吃俺老孙一棒！\""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "mild steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鐵頭長杖（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been "
"forged with mild steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits just "
"that little bit harder."
msgstr "一根木质长棍，两端箍上金属圈并装上金属包头来加固。  这根长棍的金属包头由低碳钢而非普通的铁制成，因此它打击的力度更强些。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "medium steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鐵頭長杖（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been "
"forged with medium steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits just "
"that little bit harder."
msgstr "一根木质长棍，两端箍上金属圈并装上金属包头来加固。  这根长棍的金属包头由中碳钢而非普通的铁制成，因此它打击的力度更强些。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "high steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鐵頭長杖（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "high steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been "
"forged with high steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits just "
"that little bit harder."
msgstr "一根木质长棍，两端箍上金属圈并装上金属包头来加固。  这根长棍的金属包头由高碳钢而非普通的铁制成，因此它打击的力度更强些。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "hardened steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鐵頭長杖（硬化鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been "
"forged with hardened steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits just "
"that little bit harder."
msgstr "一根木质长棍，两端箍上金属圈并装上金属包头来加固。  这根长棍的金属包头由硬化碳钢而非普通的铁制成，因此它打击的力度更强些。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "tempered steelshod quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "鐵頭長杖（回火鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steelshod quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A long wooden staff reinforced with metal bands and caps.  This one has been "
"forged with tempered steel rather than the traditional iron, and so hits just "
"that little bit harder."
msgstr "一根木质长棍，两端箍上金属圈并装上金属包头来加固。  这根长棍的金属包头由回火碳钢而非普通的铁制成，因此它打击的力度更强些。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lucerne hammer"
msgid_plural "lucerne hammers"
msgstr[0] "琉森鎚"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "lucerne hammer"
msgid ""
"A versatile polearm with a spiked hammer head, a spike, and a hook attached "
"to a beefy wooden pole."
msgstr "一把多功能的长柄武器，上面有一个钉锤头（又称鸦喙），一个矛头，和一道弯钩。由于其针对各种目标的广泛适应性，在骑兵作战中大放异彩，实用主义派冷兵器的顶尖之作。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "lucerne hammer"
msgid ""
"A cheap piece of crap imitation of a versatile polearm with a spiked hammer "
"head, probably meant to be used for LARPing."
msgstr "一把多功能长柄武器的拙劣仿制品，上面有一个钉锤头，也许只是用来Cosplay的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade polehammer"
msgid_plural "homemade polehammers"
msgstr[0] "自制长柄锤"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade polehammer"
msgid ""
"A standard hammerhead solidly mounted at the end of a proper spear shaft.  "
"The long leverage provides surprising balance and impact force.  Simple and "
"effective."
msgstr "一个标准的锤头，一根合适的矛杆，牢牢组合制成。长杆提供了出乎意料的平衡性和冲击力。朴实而有效。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift homemade polehammer"
msgid_plural "makeshift homemade polehammers"
msgstr[0] "简易自制长柄锤"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift homemade polehammer"
msgid ""
"A standard hammerhead mounted at the end of a long stick.  It is far from "
"being a proper weapon, but it allows you to bash zombie heads from a safe "
"distance."
msgstr "把标准锤头装在一根长棍上制成。 虽然不能说它是一件合格的武器，但它可以让你在安全的距离上安全地敲碎丧尸的脑袋。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mace"
msgid_plural "maces"
msgstr[0] "硬頭錘"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "mace"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It is "
"heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating."
msgstr "一柄中世纪武器，木把手顶端有个沉重的金属块，曾作为骑兵突袭的主要武器。虽然非常沉，挥舞起来也很慢，但它的粉碎打击是毁灭性的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "mace"
msgid ""
"A light, cheaply-made replica of a medieval weapon that would normally "
"consist of a wood handle with a heavy metal head."
msgstr "一柄中世纪武器，木把手顶端有个沉重的金属块，曾作为骑兵突袭的主要武器。这把是廉价的复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "mace"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  The "
"head feels a bit loose."
msgstr "一柄中世纪武器，木把手顶端有个沉重的金属块，曾作为骑兵突袭的主要武器。这把的锤头有点松了。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel mace"
msgid_plural "mild steel maces"
msgstr[0] "钉头槌（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel mace"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It is "
"heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This one is "
"custom-made with mild steel, which technically still works fine but tends to "
"blunt more easily, and the grip is kind of bad."
msgstr ""
"一柄中世纪武器，木把手顶端有个沉重的金属块，曾作为骑兵突袭的主要武器。虽然非常沉，挥舞起来也很慢，但它的粉碎打击是毁灭性的。这柄是用低碳钢定制的。严格来说用"
"起来还不错，但极易变钝，持握感糟糕。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel mace"
msgid_plural "medium steel maces"
msgstr[0] "钉头槌（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel mace"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It is "
"heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This one is "
"custom-made with medium steel which is passable, but hardly the pinnacle of "
"weapon making."
msgstr ""
"一柄中世纪武器，木把手顶端有个沉重的金属块，曾作为骑兵突袭的主要武器。虽然非常沉，挥舞起来也很慢，但它的粉碎打击是毁灭性的。这柄是用中碳钢定制的。还算凑合，"
"但肯定不是最好的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel mace"
msgid_plural "high steel maces"
msgstr[0] "钉头槌（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel mace"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It is "
"heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This one is "
"custom-made with high steel and is a solid, dependable weapon."
msgstr ""
"一柄中世纪武器，木把手顶端有个沉重的金属块，曾作为骑兵突袭的主要武器。虽然非常沉，挥舞起来也很慢，但它的粉碎打击是毁灭性的。这柄是用高碳钢定制的。坚实可靠，"
"值得信赖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel mace"
msgid_plural "hardened steel maces"
msgstr[0] "钉头槌（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel mace"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It is "
"heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This one is "
"custom-made with hardened steel and can pulverize bones."
msgstr ""
"一柄中世纪武器，木把手顶端有个沉重的金属块，曾作为骑兵突袭的主要武器。虽然非常沉，挥舞起来也很慢，但它的粉碎打击是毁灭性的。这柄是用硬化碳钢定制的。碎骨专业"
"户。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel mace"
msgid_plural "tempered steel maces"
msgstr[0] "钉头槌（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel mace"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It is "
"heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This one is "
"custom-made with tempered steel and will crack skulls like watermelons."
msgstr ""
"一柄中世纪武器，木把手顶端有个沉重的金属块，曾作为骑兵突袭的主要武器。虽然非常沉，挥舞起来也很慢，但它的粉碎打击是毁灭性的。  "
"这柄是用回火碳钢定制的。敲碎丧尸脑袋就像敲西瓜一样简单。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "simple mace"
msgid_plural "simple maces"
msgstr[0] "簡易硬頭錘"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "simple mace"
msgid ""
"A stick with a circular lump of metal tied to it in a facsimile of a mace.  "
"You could probably improve it by finding a way to pin the head to the handle."
msgstr "一根木棍，上面套着一块环形金属，像是一把狼牙棒。你也许能找到某种方法，将锤头进一步同握把固定，来提升它的耐用程度。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "trench mace"
msgid_plural "trench maces"
msgstr[0] "戰壕突擊兵狼牙棒"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "trench mace"
msgid ""
"A mace made from a circular chunk of steel pinned to the end of a stick.  You "
"can feel your inner Trench Raider come alive when you wield it."
msgstr "一把狼牙棒，由釘在棍子末端的圓形鋼塊構成。當你揮舞它時，你感到你與戰壕突擊兵精神同在。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pipe mace"
msgid_plural "pipe maces"
msgstr[0] "鋼管硬頭錘"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "pipe mace"
msgid ""
"A pipe with a handful of pipe fittings screwed onto the end to give it a "
"weighty head for bashing."
msgstr "一根一头拧上了一大堆管道连接件的钢管，使它头部变得很沉，适合用来砸人。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "great pipe mace"
msgid_plural "great pipe maces"
msgstr[0] "鋼管巨錘"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "great pipe mace"
msgid ""
"Two pipes fitted end-to-end with more pipe fittings screwed onto the far end. "
" The result is a large, but awkward bludgeon."
msgstr "两根钢管端对端连接在一起，一头拧上了更多的管道连接件。结果是一根巨大但笨拙的大棒子。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pipe staff"
msgid_plural "pipe staffs"
msgstr[0] "鋼管長杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "pipe staff"
msgid "Three pipes fitted end-to-end in a heavy facsimile of a quarterstaff."
msgstr "三根鋼管一支連著一支接在一起，變成了一根笨重的金屬長杖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze mace"
msgid_plural "bronze maces"
msgstr[0] "青銅鎚"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze mace"
msgid ""
"While nothing more than a bronze sphere on a stick, it is still surprisingly "
"effective."
msgstr "虽然只不过是安在棍子上的一个青铜球，但它仍然出人意料地有效。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift sap"
msgid_plural "makeshift saps"
msgstr[0] "粗製鉛頭短棒"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift sap"
msgid ""
"An improvised sap, also known as a cosh, slapjack, and slapper.  A short, "
"flat bludgeoning weapon consisting of a weight embedded between two patches "
"of leather."
msgstr "一根简易皮革短槌，用两片皮革夹住一块配重，制成的扁平钝击武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mjölnir"
msgid_plural "Mjölnirs"
msgstr[0] "雷神錘"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "Mjölnir"
msgid ""
"A large hammer, forged from the heart of a dying star.  It bears the "
"inscription:\n"
"\n"
"Whosoever holds this hammer,\n"
"If he be worthy,\n"
"Shall possess the power to…\n"
"CRUSH!'"
msgstr ""
"一把名为妙尔尼尔的神锤，用白矮星的星核打造。上面有着一道铭文：\n"
"\n"
"执此锤者，\n"
"如其适格，\n"
"当承神威以……\n"
"摧毁！！"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "morningstar"
msgid_plural "morningstars"
msgstr[0] "釘頭錘"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "morningstar"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy, spiked metal ball "
"on the end.  It deals devastating crushing damage, and the spikes easily "
"puncture soft targets."
msgstr ""
"一柄中世纪的武器，木柄上面附有一个满是尖刺的金属球，步兵对付具甲骑兵的主要武器之一，亦是骑兵间流行的杀敌利器。它能造成毁灭性的钝击伤害，而且尖刺很容易刺穿软"
"体目标。\n"
"\"带钉之锤形如晨星，耀眼且致命的诗意。\""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "morningstar"
msgid ""
"A light, cheaply-made replica of a medieval weapon that would normally "
"consist of a wood handle with a heavy, spiked metal ball on the end."
msgstr "一柄中世纪的武器，木柄上面附有一个满是尖刺的金属球，步兵对付具甲骑兵的主要武器之一。这把是廉价的复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "morningstar"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy, spiked metal ball "
"on the end.  The weight feels off on this one, and the spikes are blunted."
msgstr "一柄中世纪的武器，木柄上面附有一个满是尖刺的铁球，步兵对付具甲骑兵的主要武器之一。这把的重量感觉不对，而且刺也变钝了。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nail bat"
msgid_plural "nail bats"
msgstr[0] "釘棒"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "nail bat"
msgid ""
"A baseball bat with several nails driven through it, an excellent melee "
"weapon."
msgstr "一根上面有許多鐵釘的球棒， 絕佳的近戰武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nailboard"
msgid_plural "nailboards"
msgstr[0] "釘板"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "nailboard"
msgid ""
"A plank of wood with several nails through one end; essentially a simple "
"mace.  Makes an acceptable melee weapon."
msgstr "一块木板，上面钉着许多锋利的尖钉，使钝击更能附加若干刺击伤害。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pool cue"
msgid_plural "pool cues"
msgstr[0] "撞球桿"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "pool cue"
msgid ""
"A hardwood stick designed for hitting colorful balls around a felt table.  "
"Truly, the coolest of sports."
msgstr ""
"一个前细后粗的硬木台球杆，用于在桌面上击打一些五颜六色的台球。\n"
"\"酒吧混斗的常规武器。\""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "PR-24 baton (extended)"
msgid_plural "PR-24 batons (extended)"
msgstr[0] "PR-24 甩棍（伸展）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "PR-24 baton (extended)"
msgid ""
"The Monadnock PR-24 baton is a collapsible, lightweight, side-handle baton "
"used by law enforcement all over the world.  The PR designation is rumored to "
"mean Public Relations.  Activate to retract."
msgstr "莫納德諾克 PR-24 式甩棍是種可伸縮收納、輕量、側握式的甩棍，廣為全世界的執法單位所使用。PR 傳說是指公共關係。啟動來收回甩棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "PR-24 baton (extended)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "telescoping fishing rod"
msgid "Retract"
msgstr "縮回"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "PR-24 baton (extended)"
msgid "You collapse your PR-24 baton."
msgstr "你收回了你的 PR-24 甩棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "PR-24 baton (retracted)"
msgid_plural "PR-24 batons (retracted)"
msgstr[0] "PR-24 甩棍（伸展）"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "PR-24 baton (retracted)"
msgid ""
"The Monadnock PR-24 baton is a collapsible, lightweight, side-handle baton "
"used by law enforcement all over the world.  The PR designation is rumored to "
"mean Public Relations.  Activate to extend."
msgstr "莫納德諾克 PR-24 式甩棍是種可伸縮收納、輕量、側握式的甩棍，廣為全世界的執法單位所使用。PR 傳說是指公共關係。啟動來伸出甩棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "PR-24 baton (retracted)"
msgid "You snap open your PR-24 baton."
msgstr "你啪的一聲彈開你的 PR-24 甩棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "長杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A sturdy staff carved out of wood.  Lightweight and long, it is surprisingly "
"easy to handle."
msgstr "一根用木头制成的结实棍棒。既轻且长，易于操作。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bō"
msgid_plural "bō"
msgstr[0] "沖繩手杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "bō"
msgid ""
"A wooden staff weapon used in Okinawan martial arts.  Finely sanded and "
"treated with oil for integrity."
msgstr "冲绳传统武术中所使用的木制棍棒。被人精细打磨并上油处理，确保其完好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rock in a sock"
msgid_plural "rocks in socks"
msgstr[0] "裝有石頭的襪子"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "rock in a sock"
msgid ""
"A pair of nested socks with a stone tied inside.  A true weapon of "
"desperation."
msgstr "一对套在一起的袜子，里面装了个石头。绝对是绝境下才会使用的武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic shank"
msgid_plural "plastic shanks"
msgstr[0] "塑膠粗製小刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic shank"
msgid "An oblong plastic object with the far end ground down into a stabbing point."
msgstr "一片长方形的塑料，一端被磨尖成匕首形状。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shillelagh"
msgid_plural "shillelaghs"
msgstr[0] "愛爾蘭手杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "shillelagh"
msgid ""
"A stout, knotty stick with a large knob at the top that has been left to cure "
"in a chimney.  A traditional Irish weapon, the shillelagh was originally used "
"for settling disputes in a gentlemanly manner."
msgstr "一根短粗木棍，顶端有一个巨大的突起，在烟囱内熏制而成。这是一种传统的爱尔兰武器，最初用于以具有绅士风度的方式解决争端。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "loaded stick"
msgid_plural "loaded sticks"
msgstr[0] "硬頭愛爾蘭手杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "loaded stick"
msgid ""
"A stout knotty stick with a large knob at the top that has been left to cure "
"in a chimney.  A traditional Irish weapon, the shillelagh was originally used "
"for settling disputes in a gentlemanly manner.  The knob has been hollowed "
"and filled with molten heavy metal to pack more of a punch."
msgstr ""
"一根短粗的木棍，顶端有一个巨大的突起，在烟囱内熏制而成。这是一种传统的爱尔兰武器，最初用于以具有绅士风度的方式解决争端。这把木槌的突起被挖空浇铸了金属，具有"
"更强的攻击力。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "shillelagh"
msgid ""
"A fake shillelagh massproduced as a souvenir for tourists.  This knotty stick "
"has not been cured in a chimney like a traditional shillelagh, but instead "
"has had fake black soot painted on."
msgstr "一根仿制的爱尔兰木槌，只是量产的纪念品。这根木槌没有像传统爱尔兰木槌一样在烟囱内熏制过，而是在上面涂上了假烟灰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "powered quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "powered quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "電擊長杖"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "powered quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"An ironshod quarterstaff that has a high-voltage stun gun built into the "
"handle.  The stun gun is wired to the metal caps at either end of the staff, "
"allowing you to zap a dangerous opponent should beating them senseless with "
"it prove too hazardous."
msgstr ""
"一柄铁头木棒，内置有高压电击枪。电击枪发出的电流能传导至棍棒两端的金属帽上，如果碰到了光是用棍打不太安全的对手，可以不讲武德地把它电晕，再一顿痛殴。\n"
"\"电子兵器，小子。\""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical tonfa (off)"
msgid_plural "tactical tonfas (off)"
msgstr[0] "戰術旋棍 (關閉)"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical tonfa (off)"
msgid ""
"A reinforced plastic tonfa; the core is filled with capacitors and a "
"high-yield rechargeable storage battery.  When a switch on the handle is "
"pressed, a high-voltage current is transmitted to the two electrodes mounted "
"in the end of the tonfa, and by extension to anyone unfortunate enough to be "
"in contact with them.  It also has a nifty flashlight, which is off at the "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"一把强化的塑料警棍，内部装着电容与电池仓。当握把上的开关被按下去时，一股高压电流会被传导至安装在警棍顶端的两个电极上，然后输出给任何接触到电极的倒霉蛋身上。"
"它还有个别致的小手电筒，现在处于关闭的状态。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical tonfa (on)"
msgid_plural "tactical tonfas (on)"
msgstr[0] "戰術旋棍 (啟動)"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical tonfa (on)"
msgid ""
"A reinforced plastic tonfa; the core is filled with capacitors and a "
"high-yield rechargeable storage battery.  When a switch on the handle is "
"pressed, a high-voltage current is transmitted to the two electrodes mounted "
"in the end of the weapon, and by extension to anyone unfortunate enough to be "
"in contact with them.  The integral flashlight is turned on, continually "
"draining power and lighting the surrounding area."
msgstr ""
"一根强化的塑料警棍，内部装着电容与电池仓。当握把上的开关被按下去时，一股高压电流会被传导至安装在警棍顶端的两个电极上，然后输出给任何接触到电极的倒霉蛋身上。"
"它上面的手电筒已经开启，不断耗电来产生光亮。激活它来关闭。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tonfa"
msgid_plural "tonfas"
msgstr[0] "旋棍"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "tonfa"
msgid ""
"A hard plastic truncheon commonly employed by police.  Originally an Okinawan "
"weapon, it consists of a stick with a perpendicular handle attached a third "
"of the way down its length."
msgstr "一根通常被警察所使用的硬塑膠製短棍。源自沖繩的武器， 由一個握柄垂直連結於棍子的三分之一處所組成。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden tonfa"
msgid_plural "wooden tonfas"
msgstr[0] "木製旋棍"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden tonfa"
msgid ""
"A stout wooden truncheon of the sort commonly employed by police.  Originally "
"an Okinawan weapon, it consists of a stick with a perpendicular handle "
"attached a third of the way down its length."
msgstr "一根通常被警察所使用的木製結實短棍。源自沖繩的武器， 由一個握柄垂直連結於棍子的三分之一處所組成。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "welded battle axe"
msgid_plural "welded battle axes"
msgstr[0] "焊接战斧"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "welded battle axe"
msgid ""
"A savage-looking battle axe made out of layered sheet metal welded into two "
"pipes held together with fittings, vaguely forming a upside-down L shape.  "
"This should be structurally stable.  Hopefully."
msgstr "一把看起来很野蛮的战斧，由层叠的金属板焊接到用连接件将两根管子大致组成的倒置L形上。应该还挺结实的，希望如此。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bolted battle axe"
msgid_plural "bolted battle axes"
msgstr[0] "栓接战斧"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "bolted battle axe"
msgid ""
"A savage-looking battle axe made out of layered sheet metal bolted to two "
"pipes held together with fittings, vaguely forming a upside-down L shape.  "
"Swing it with all your might."
msgstr "一把看起来很野蛮的战斧，由层叠的金属板栓接到用连接件将两根管子大致组成的倒置L形上。用上全力挥动它把。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "war hammer"
msgid_plural "war hammers"
msgstr[0] "戰槌"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Description of "war hammer"
msgid ""
"A medieval hammer with a spike on one end, made for battle.  Its odd shape "
"and balance make it an excellent weapon, but an ineffective tool."
msgstr "一把中世纪风格的战锤，一端有根尖刺。它古怪的外形和平衡使它成为一把优秀的武器，不过敲起钉子来就没有五金店里的锤子好用了。"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "breacher"
msgid_plural "breachers"
msgstr[0] "breachers"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "breacher"
msgid ""
"Some sort of large prybar of a make and manufacturer you've never seen "
"before.  On the heavier end is a set of thick, crabclaw like shears connected "
"to a hydraulic piston, capable of cutting or prying through metal with great "
"force.  The Exodii use these for general purpose breaching and scrapping "
"heavy machines, and it's been retrofitted to run on their bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Some sort of large prybar of a make and manufacturer you've never seen "
"before.  On the heavier end is a set of thick, crabclaw like shears connected "
"to a hydraulic piston, capable of cutting or prying through metal with great "
"force.  The Exodii use these for general purpose breaching and scrapping "
"heavy machines, and it's been retrofitted to run on their bionic power."

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sapper"
msgid_plural "sappers"
msgstr[0] "sappers"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "sapper"
msgid ""
"A metal pole saw covered in faded orange paint and warning labels written in "
"an unknown language.  The circular blade at the end is over an inch thick, "
"its deeply dished grooves suggesting its purpose as a digging implement "
"rather than a cutter.  The Exodii use these to chew through reinforced walls "
"like concrete or solid steel, and it's been retrofitted to run on their "
"bionic power."
msgstr ""
"A metal pole saw covered in faded orange paint and warning labels written in "
"an unknown language.  The circular blade at the end is over an inch thick, "
"its deeply dished grooves suggesting its purpose as a digging implement "
"rather than a cutter.  The Exodii use these to chew through reinforced walls "
"like concrete or solid steel, and it's been retrofitted to run on their "
"bionic power."

#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bionic claws"
msgid_plural "bionic claws"
msgstr[0] "生化爪"

#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
#. ~ Description of "bionic claws"
msgid "Short, sharp claws made from a high-tech metal."
msgstr "用高科技合金制成的爪子，短而锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "monomolecular blade"
msgid_plural "monomolecular blades"
msgstr[0] "單分子刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
#. ~ Description of "monomolecular blade"
msgid ""
"A foot-long blade made from high-tech alloy and edged with bonded "
"nanocrystals."
msgstr "由最先端科技所打造約一尺的合金刀刃， 它的刀鋒是號稱只有一分子寬的奈米晶體所製作的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bullwhip"
msgid_plural "bullwhips"
msgstr[0] "皮製長鞭"

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "bullwhip"
msgid ""
"A long strip of braided leather with a handle on one end.  Originally "
"developed to settle disagreements with cattle, it's better used now for "
"flaying the rotten flesh off of walking corpses.  Great for when a problem "
"comes along."
msgstr "一條由皮革編織而成的長帶子， 尾端綁著一個把手。這個玩意最初是用來馴服不聽話的家畜， 現在則有更好的用途: 用來把殭屍的爛肉剝下來， 你用的上的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scourge"
msgid_plural "scourges"
msgstr[0] "九尾鞭"

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "scourge"
msgid ""
"The \"cat 'o nine tails\", a handle with nine short leather whips, each "
"sporting a razor-sharp metal tip.  This ancient instrument of torture causes "
"massive bleeding, but by design is inefficient as a weapon."
msgstr "九尾鞭，又被人称为\"九尾猫\"。一个带着九根短皮鞭的手柄，每根皮鞭的顶端都有锋利的金属尖刺。这种古老的酷刑手段能够导致大量出血，但作为武器使用时并不出色。"

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stun gun"
msgid_plural "stun guns"
msgstr[0] "電擊槍"

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "stun gun"
msgid ""
"A high-powered stun gun.  Use this item to attempt to electrocute an adjacent "
"enemy, temporarily paralyzing them."
msgstr "一把高能电击枪。激活以尝试电击身边的敌人，暂时使其瘫痪。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pitchfork"
msgid_plural "pitchforks"
msgstr[0] "乾草叉"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pitchfork"
msgid ""
"An agricultural tool with a long wooden shaft and four spikes.  Normally used "
"to lift hay."
msgstr ""
"一杆农具，多用于农民用来翻干草堆，一杆长柄上有着四根分叉，作为武器时可将敌人缴械，同时格挡敌人的攻击，攻防兼备的近战利器。\n"
"\"对某个白发猫眼的猎人有必杀效果。\""

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pointy stick"
msgid_plural "pointy sticks"
msgstr[0] "尖木棍"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pointy stick"
msgid "A simple wooden pole with one end sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一根简单的木质长杆，一头被削尖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "long pointy stick"
msgid_plural "long pointy sticks"
msgstr[0] "長尖木棍"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "long pointy stick"
msgid "A stout pole with one end sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一根结实的长杆，一头被削尖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fire-hardened wooden spear"
msgid_plural "fire-hardened wooden spears"
msgstr[0] "碳化木矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "fire-hardened wooden spear"
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a fire-hardened point."
msgstr "一根结实的木杆，尖端被火烤过而硬化。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden spear"
msgid_plural "wooden spears"
msgstr[0] "木矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden spear"
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a whittled point."
msgstr "一根结实的木杆，一头被雕刻得十分尖锐。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sharpened spear shaft"
msgid_plural "sharpened spear shafts"
msgstr[0] "磨尖矛杆"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "sharpened spear shaft"
msgid ""
"You've gone through the effort of making a proper spear shaft, but instead of "
"attaching something sharp to the end you just whittled a point into the wood. "
" The peak of pointy stick technology."
msgstr "你花了很大力气制作一个合适的矛杆，但你没有在末端装上任何尖锐的东西，而只是在木头上刻出了一个尖。不管怎样，这东西都代表了尖木棍技术的顶峰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift war scythe"
msgid_plural "makeshift war scythes"
msgstr[0] "粗製戰鐮"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift war scythe"
msgid ""
"This farming tool has been modified into an improvised weapon by rotating its "
"blade 90 degrees, transforming it into a deadly giant blade on the end of a "
"stick.  It's quite fragile, however."
msgstr "这种农用镰刀的刀刃旋转了90度，被改造成一种简易的武器，巨大而致命，就是不太耐用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "simple makeshift glaive"
msgid_plural "simple makeshift glaives"
msgstr[0] "粗製簡易長柄刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "simple makeshift glaive"
msgid ""
"A large blade attached to a stout section of tree branch.  It could do a "
"considerable amount of damage, but the blade isn't secured very well and "
"could easily break off."
msgstr "一把大刀安在一段粗壮的树枝上，可以造成相当大的伤害，但刀片不太稳固，可能很容易断掉。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift glaive"
msgid_plural "makeshift glaives"
msgstr[0] "粗製長柄刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift glaive"
msgid ""
"A stout tree branch that has been carefully split and reinforced.  At the "
"split point, a sharp blade has been bolted into place and reinforced with "
"layers of sturdy wrapped bindings."
msgstr "一个坚固的粗树枝，在一端劈开并栓接了一把锋利的刀刃，并且用几层结实的材料绑稳。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spike on a stick"
msgid_plural "spikes on sticks"
msgstr[0] "尖刺綁長棍"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "spike on a stick"
msgid ""
"A flimsy pole made of wood with a basic metal spike tied to it.  It's barely "
"sharp, and crudely constructed, but it will keep the zombies out of arm's "
"reach until you can find something better."
msgstr "一个脆弱的长柄武器，由木棍上面绑上一个金属刺做成。不怎么锋利，制造水平不佳，但是在你找到更好的武器之前可以用来把丧尸拒于手臂的攻击范围之外。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "simple knife spear"
msgid_plural "simple knife spears"
msgstr[0] "簡單的刀矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "simple knife spear"
msgid ""
"A flimsy pole made of wood with a knife bound to the end.  It's long enough "
"to slice from a distance, but the knife isn't that well attached.  You could "
"take a bit more time to carefully split the shaft and attach the knife blade "
"more permanently."
msgstr ""
"一个脆弱的长柄武器，由木棍上面绑上一把刀制成。它的长度让你能够从较远距离攻击，但是刀绑得并不是很牢固。要是你多花一些时间，也许可以仔细劈开矛柄，然后更加持久"
"地把刀刃固定到上面。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift knife spear"
msgid_plural "makeshift knife spears"
msgstr[0] "自制刺刀长矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift knife spear"
msgid ""
"A long stick that has been carefully split and reinforced.  At the split "
"point, a sharp blade has been bolted into place and reinforced with layers of "
"sturdy wrapped bindings."
msgstr "一根长木棍，在一端劈开并栓接了一把锋利的刀刃，并且用几层结实的材料绑稳。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "knife spear"
msgid_plural "knife spears"
msgstr[0] "刀矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "knife spear"
msgid ""
"A stout wooden pole with the blade of a knife bolted into place at the end.  "
"The shape of a knife blade isn't ideal for a spear, but it's still very sharp "
"and effective."
msgstr "一根结实的矛杆，末端栓接着一把刀刃。刀刃的形状对于长矛来说并不理想，但依然十分锋利好用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade halfpike"
msgid_plural "homemade halfpikes"
msgstr[0] "自製短矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade halfpike"
msgid ""
"A short do-it-yourself spear made out of a long stick with a metal spike "
"seated and bound into place at its tip."
msgstr "一根自制的短矛，长木棍的一端安装并固定有金属尖刺。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crude steel spear"
msgid_plural "crude steel spears"
msgstr[0] "简易钢矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "crude steel spear"
msgid ""
"A stout wooden pole with a misshapen metal spike seated into the end and "
"bolted into place."
msgstr "一根结实的矛杆，末端有一个奇形怪状的金属矛头，用螺栓固定住。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "copper spear"
msgid_plural "copper spears"
msgstr[0] "銅矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "copper spear"
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a spearhead worked from copper."
msgstr "一根有著銅製槍頭的結實木棒。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steel spear"
msgid_plural "steel spears"
msgstr[0] "鋼矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "steel spear"
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a hand-forged steel spearhead."
msgstr "一根有手工鍛造鋼鐵槍頭的結實木棒。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sharpened pipe"
msgid_plural "sharpened pipes"
msgstr[0] "磨尖鋼管"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "sharpened pipe"
msgid "A pipe with one end cut off at an angle."
msgstr "一端被切断磨出尖角的钢管。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "basic pipe spear"
msgid_plural "basic pipe spears"
msgstr[0] "簡易鋼管矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "basic pipe spear"
msgid "Three pipes tightly fit together with one end cut down to a point."
msgstr "三根钢管被紧紧地固定在一起，其中一端被切断成矛尖。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pipe spear"
msgid_plural "pipe spears"
msgstr[0] "鋼管矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pipe spear"
msgid ""
"Three pipes tightly fit together with some wrappings for a handle around one "
"end and a sharp tip on the other."
msgstr "三根钢管被紧紧地固定在一起，其中一端有个握柄，另一端被磨尖成矛头。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pointed rebar"
msgid_plural "pointed rebars"
msgstr[0] "尖銳鋼筋"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pointed rebar"
msgid "A rod of rebar that's been crudely hammered into a point."
msgstr "一根被锤子锤得锋利的钢筋。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sharpened rebar"
msgid_plural "sharpened rebars"
msgstr[0] "磨尖鋼筋"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "sharpened rebar"
msgid "A rod of rebar that's been cut and sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一根被切断并磨尖的钢筋。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rebar spear"
msgid_plural "rebar spears"
msgstr[0] "鋼筋矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "rebar spear"
msgid "Two rods of rebar welded together with a pointed tip."
msgstr "两根被焊接在一起的钢筋，一端十分尖利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "qiang"
msgid_plural "qiang"
msgstr[0] "中式槍"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "qiang"
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese spear, typically with a tassel just below the spearhead "
"and larger than most European spears.  One of the four major weapons in "
"folklore, alongside the dao saber, jian sword, and gun staff."
msgstr "一把古中国长枪，在枪头之下附有枪缨，比大多数欧洲矛要大。在民间传说中，属刀、剑、枪、棍四大兵器之一。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "halberd"
msgid_plural "halberds"
msgstr[0] "長戟"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "halberd"
msgid ""
"A versatile polearm with an axe blade, a spike, and other fun things attached "
"to a long, sturdy stick."
msgstr "一把多功能的长柄武器，长粗木棍上固定有一个斧头，一个矛头，以及其他装饰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "halberd"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply made replica of a polearm with an axe blade, a spike, and "
"other fun things attached to a thick pole."
msgstr "一把长柄武器的廉价拙劣复制品，粗木棍上固定有一个斧头，一个矛头，以及其他装饰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glaive"
msgid_plural "glaives"
msgstr[0] "長柄刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "glaive"
msgid "A sturdy polearm with a sizable single-edged blade on the end."
msgstr "一把结实的长柄武器，末端为一个相当长的单刃刀，形如偃月刀与朴刀，起源于威尔士。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "naginata"
msgid_plural "naginata"
msgstr[0] "薙刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "naginata"
msgid ""
"A sturdy polearm with a curved blade, made in the same manner as the katana "
"and other Japanese blades.  Occasionally used by samurai in early periods, or "
"by their wives in defense of the household."
msgstr "一把結實的長柄武器， 有著彎曲的刀身， 使用的製作手法與日本武士刀類同。古代的日本武士偶爾會使用， 他們的妻子亦會當作自衛武器使用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "naginata"
msgid ""
"A sturdy polearm with a curved blade, made in the same manner as the katana "
"and other Japanese blades.  This one has a bit of wiggle to its blade and "
"feels a bit shoddily made."
msgstr "一把坚硬的带弯曲刀刃的长柄刀，用与武士刀和其他日本刀刃相同的方式制成。这把刀的刀刃有点晃动，感觉有点粗制滥造。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "naginata"
msgid ""
"A dull, slightly floppy replica of a Japanese polearm with a curved blade.  "
"With a little difficulty, you could use it administer a solid slap from a "
"distance."
msgstr "一把无光泽，还有点松动的复制品：带着弯曲刀片的日本薙刀。花点力气，你就可以用它从远处拍出一记结实的耳光。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden javelin"
msgid_plural "wooden javelins"
msgstr[0] "木標槍"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden javelin"
msgid "A fire-hardened wooden spear honed to a sharper point."
msgstr "一个前端磨尖并用火烤硬化的木制长矛。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "iron javelin"
msgid_plural "iron javelins"
msgstr[0] "鐵標槍"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "iron javelin"
msgid "An iron-tipped wooden throwing spear."
msgstr "一支装有铁制矛头的木柄标枪。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden pike"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft with a fire-hardened "
"point."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆，雕刻出矛尖并经过火焰硬化而成。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "copper pike"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a copper "
"spearhead."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆与铜制矛尖结合而成。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze pike"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a bronze "
"spearhead."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆与青铜矛尖结合而成。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pike"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a steel "
"spearhead."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆与钢制矛尖结合而成。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pike"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply made replica of a medieval weapon consisting of a very long "
"wooden shaft tipped with an iron spearhead."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆与铁制矛尖结合而成。这把是廉价且拙劣的复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pike"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with an iron "
"spearhead.  The head seems to be pretty dull, and the whole thing feels "
"poorly made."
msgstr "一把中世纪武器，由一根非常长的木杆与铁制矛尖结合而成。这把矛尖已经被磨钝了，而且整体感觉做工很差。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "war scythe"
msgid_plural "war scythes"
msgstr[0] "戰鐮"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "war scythe"
msgid ""
"A pole weapon with a curving single-edged blade.  Its blade bears some "
"superficial resemblance to that of an agricultural scythe from which it "
"likely evolved."
msgstr "有弯曲的单侧刀刃的杆状武器。它的刀刃表面有点像农用镰刀，很可能是从农用镰刀演变而来的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dory"
msgid_plural "dories"
msgstr[0] "長槍"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "dory"
msgid ""
"A well-made spear with a bronze head, Greek in origin.  Despite its large "
"size, it was frequently used one-handed."
msgstr "一支制作精良的青铜头长矛，起源于希腊。尽管它的尺寸很大，但通常依然是单手使用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze spear"
msgid_plural "bronze spears"
msgstr[0] "青銅矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze spear"
msgid "A forged spear with a bronze head."
msgstr "一支带有青铜锻造矛头的长矛。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "poleaxe"
msgid_plural "poleaxes"
msgstr[0] "戰斧"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "poleaxe"
msgid ""
"A polearm with an axe head, a small hammer on the back, and a short "
"dagger-like spike on top.  It's less heavy than most polearms and has a "
"smaller head, making it slightly quicker."
msgstr "一把带有斧头的长柄武器，另一面有一个小锤子，顶部有一个类似匕首的的短尖。它没有大多数长柄武器那么重，头也更小，挥舞速度更快。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ji"
msgid_plural "ji"
msgstr[0] "中式戟"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "ji"
msgid ""
"A bronze polearm that originated in the Shang dynasty of China, if not "
"earlier.  It combines a spear head with the perpendicular blade of the "
"earlier ge or dagger-axe."
msgstr "一把起源自中国商朝或是更早时期的青铜长柄武器。它的顶部由矛尖和垂直于矛尖的，被称作戈的刀刃组成。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone spear"
msgid_plural "stone spears"
msgstr[0] "石矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "stone spear"
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a sharp stone spearhead."
msgstr "一根有著尖石槍頭的結實木棒。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "simple stone spear"
msgid_plural "simple stone spears"
msgstr[0] "简易石矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "simple stone spear"
msgid "A long stick with a sharp stone spearhead."
msgstr "一根长木棍，一端配有尖锐的石制矛头。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "makeshift tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "简易阿兹特克长矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift tepoztopili"
msgid ""
"This is a long polearm with an oar-like oval head covered with razors.  Its "
"shape make it suitable for both thrusting and slashing.  It resembles the "
"Mesoamerican Tepoztopili, though the shaft is not very sturdy."
msgstr "一把长矛，椭圆形的顶部镶嵌着剃刀。这个武器的形状使它既适合刺也适合砍。类似于中美洲的阿兹特克长矛，尽管它的矛杆不是很结实。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glass bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "glass bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "玻璃阿兹特克长矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "glass bladed tepoztopili"
msgid ""
"This is a long polearm with an oar-like oval head covered with glass.  Its "
"shape make it suitable for both thrusting and slashing.  It resembles the "
"Mesoamerican Tepoztopili, though the shaft is not very sturdy."
msgstr "一把长矛，椭圆形的顶部镶嵌着玻璃。这个武器的形状使它既适合刺也适合砍。类似于中美洲的阿兹特克长矛，尽管它的矛杆不是很结实。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "stone bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "石制阿兹特克长矛"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "stone bladed tepoztopili"
msgid ""
"This is a long polearm with an oar-like oval head covered with stones.  Its "
"shape make it suitable for both thrusting and slashing.  It resembles the "
"Mesoamerican Tepoztopili, though the shaft is not very sturdy."
msgstr "一把长矛，椭圆形的顶部镶嵌着石头。这个武器的形状使它既适合刺也适合砍。类似于中美洲的阿兹特克长矛，尽管它的矛杆不是很结实。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "mild steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "钢制阿兹特克长矛（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It's an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp mild steel blades, firmly "
"attached to a stout spear shaft."
msgstr "这是中美洲阿兹特克长矛的重制版。雕刻成椭圆形的矛头上面镶嵌着锋利的低碳钢刃，牢牢地固定在结实的矛杆上。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "medium steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "钢制阿兹特克长矛（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It has an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp medium steel blades, firmly "
"attached to a stout spear shaft."
msgstr "这是中美洲阿兹特克长矛的重制版。雕刻成椭圆形的矛头上面镶嵌着锋利的中碳钢刃，牢牢地固定在结实的矛杆上。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "high steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "钢制阿兹特克长矛（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It has an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp high steel blades, firmly "
"attached to a stout spear shaft."
msgstr "这是中美洲阿兹特克长矛的重制版。雕刻成椭圆形的矛头上面镶嵌着锋利的高碳钢刃，牢牢地固定在结实的矛杆上。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "hardened steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "钢制阿兹特克长矛（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It has an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp hardened steel blades, "
"firmly attached to a stout spear shaft."
msgstr "这是中美洲阿兹特克长矛的重制版。雕刻成椭圆形的矛头上面镶嵌着锋利的硬化碳钢刃，牢牢地固定在结实的矛杆上。"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid_plural "tempered steel bladed tepoztopilis"
msgstr[0] "钢制阿兹特克长矛（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel bladed tepoztopili"
msgid ""
"This is a redesigned version of the Mesoamerican tepoztopili.  It has an "
"elliptical piece of carved wood lined with sharp tempered steel blades, "
"firmly attached to a stout spear shaft.  It's a weapon worthy of being "
"wielded by Huitzilopochtli himself."
msgstr ""
"这是中美洲阿兹特克长矛的重制版。雕刻成椭圆形的矛头上面镶嵌着锋利的回火碳钢刃，牢牢地固定在结实的矛杆上。这是一把值得威齐洛波契特里（阿兹特克神话中的战神）亲"
"自使用的武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "2-by-sword"
msgid_plural "2-by-swords"
msgstr[0] "2x4 木劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "2-by-sword"
msgid ""
"A plank with a handle and a whittled-down point.  Not much good for slashing, "
"but much better than your bare hands."
msgstr "一块木板，装上护手后削尖了头做成木剑。不太适合拿来挥砍，但总比赤手空拳要好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zweitimber"
msgid_plural "zweitimbers"
msgstr[0] "雙手木劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "zweitimber"
msgid ""
"A plank with a handle and a whittled-down point, left large enough to require "
"two hands.  Still not much good for slashing, but far better than the plank "
"on its own."
msgstr "一块带有握柄的木板，顶部被削尖，个头不小，需要双手持握。虽然依旧不太适合挥砍，但比木板本身要好得多。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nord"
msgid_plural "nords"
msgstr[0] "釘劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "nord"
msgid ""
"A nail sword, or nord for short.  This wooden sword has a dozen nails "
"sticking out at jagged angles from the edge of the blade, making it much "
"better at chopping than slashing."
msgstr "钉齿剑（nail sword），简称\"nord\"。这把木剑从剑刃上伸出很多钉子，组成锯齿状，使其相较于挥砍更适合用于切刺。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap sword"
msgid_plural "scrap swords"
msgstr[0] "废料剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap sword"
msgid ""
"Several bits of thin scrap metal crudely beat into the semblance of an edge "
"over a wooden sword.  The added weight is unbalanced, but the jagged edge "
"offers a good bit of slashing power."
msgstr "一些廢鐵條被很粗糙的硬加在原本的木劍上， 所增加的額外重量導致整把武器重心並不平衡， 但其鋸齒狀的刀刃提供了較好的砍擊強度。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap greatsword"
msgid_plural "scrap greatswords"
msgstr[0] "废料巨剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap greatsword"
msgid ""
"A large wooden sword with scrap metal hammered over it into something "
"pretending to be an edge.  The extra weight almost completely front-loads the "
"balance, and it hurts your wrists just to wield."
msgstr "一把大木剑，上面有用废金属敲打成的\"剑刃\"。额外的重量严重破坏了平衡，光是挥舞起来就会伤到手腕。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "welded sword"
msgid "welded sword"
msgid_plural "welded swords"
msgstr[0] "焊接剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "welded sword"
#. ~ Description of variant "welded sword" of item "welded sword"
msgid ""
"A vicious single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered twice over "
"itself then welded together.  It's not as robust as a proper forged sword, "
"but the edge is wickedly sharp."
msgstr "一把十分狂野的单刃剑，由金属板折叠后焊接而成。它不像正规的锻造剑那样坚固，但其边缘却非常锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "welded sword"
msgid "bolted sword"
msgid_plural "bolted swords"
msgstr[0] "栓接剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of variant "bolted sword" of item "welded sword"
msgid ""
"A vicious single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered twice over "
"itself then bolted together.  It's not quite a katana made from steel folded "
"a thousand times over, but it has a certain industrial charm to it."
msgstr "一把十分狂野的单刃剑，由金属板折叠后后用螺栓连接而成。它不是那种千锤百炼而成的武士刀，但却有某种工业的魅力。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "welded greatsword"
msgid "welded greatsword"
msgid_plural "welded greatswords"
msgstr[0] "焊接巨剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "welded greatsword"
#. ~ Description of variant "welded greatsword" of item "welded greatsword"
msgid ""
"A long-handled single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered thrice over "
"itself then welded together.  The extra length and weight makes it a tad "
"awkward, but gives it a lot of slashing power."
msgstr "一把长柄单刃剑，由金属板折叠成三层后焊接而成。额外的长度和重量使它有点笨拙，但也带来了更强的劈砍能力。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "welded greatsword"
msgid "bolted greatsword"
msgid_plural "bolted greatswords"
msgstr[0] "栓接巨剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of variant "bolted greatsword" of item "welded greatsword"
msgid ""
"A long-handled single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered thrice over "
"itself then bolted together.  It vaguely resembles a Japanese nagamaki if you "
"squint."
msgstr "一把长柄单刃剑，由金属板折叠成三层后用螺栓连接而成。如果你眯起眼睛，它看起来和一把日式的长卷刀差不多。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "metal sword"
msgid_plural "metal swords"
msgstr[0] "金屬劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "metal sword"
msgid ""
"An imitation of a true sword forged by someone who knows what swords look "
"like, at least.  Made from whatever scrap metal was on hand, it has the "
"general shape of a sword, and it is sharp, but it is a bit heavier than it "
"should be and the balance isn't quite right."
msgstr "一把真剑的仿制品，由某个至少知道剑是什么样子的人锻造而成。它由一些现成的金属废料制作而成，有剑的一般形状，锋利，但比正规剑要沉，平衡性也不太好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "metal greatsword"
msgid_plural "metal greatswords"
msgstr[0] "金属巨剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "metal greatsword"
msgid ""
"A large, crudely-forged blade.  It's too big to be called a sword.  Too "
"massive, too thick, too heavy, and far too rough."
msgstr "一把粗劣锻造制成的大刀，大到不能称之为剑。太大、太厚、太沉，而且太粗糙。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "metal fencing sword"
msgid_plural "metal fencing swords"
msgstr[0] "金属刺剑"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "metal fencing sword"
msgid ""
"Calling this a rapier is a stretch.  It's robust and very pointy, but more "
"akin to a long metal spike with a handguard than the elegant swords of the "
"Renaissance."
msgstr "说这是一把刺剑还是太勉强了。它很结实，非常尖，但更像是一把带护手的长金属钉，而不是文艺复兴时期的优雅刺剑。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "switchblade"
msgid "switchblade"
msgid_plural "switchblades"
msgstr[0] "彈簧刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "switchblade"
#. ~ Description of variant "switchblade" of item "switchblade"
msgid ""
"A long, thin knife with a spring-loaded blade that rests inside the handle "
"while not in use."
msgstr "又长又细的弹簧小刀，不用时可以把刀刃收在刀柄里面，使用时自动弹出。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "switchblade"
msgid "balisong"
msgid_plural "balisongs"
msgstr[0] "蝴蝶刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of variant "balisong" of item "switchblade"
msgid ""
"A flashy knife with hinged handles that completely conceal the blade while "
"folded.  Popular among movie gangbangers and people who thought fidget "
"spinners were too safe."
msgstr "一把华丽的小刀，带有铰链手柄，折叠时刀片完全隐藏。在认为指尖陀螺太安全了的人，以及那些电影里的黑帮之间很受欢迎。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "folding knife"
msgid_plural "folding knives"
msgstr[0] "摺疊刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "folding knife"
msgid ""
"A small folding knife with a locking blade and a pocket clip.  Not as good a "
"weapon as a solid fixed-blade knife, but better than a penknife."
msgstr "一把小型折叠刀，有着一个可以伸缩的锁口刀片，背面有个口袋夹。和刀身固定的刀具相比，它不适合当作武器使用，但总比一个削笔刀好些。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "utility folding knife"
msgid_plural "utility folding knives"
msgstr[0] "多用途折叠刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "utility folding knife"
msgid ""
"A 'Hideman' brand folding knife, this model includes extra utility options "
"such as a screwdriver, awl, and small pry bar."
msgstr "一把“Hideman”品牌的折叠刀，这款折叠刀包括多种实用选项，例如螺丝刀、锥子和一根小撬棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "USMC bayonet"
msgid_plural "USMC bayonets"
msgstr[0] "海军陆战队刺刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "USMC bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "USMC bayonet"
msgid ""
"A modern bayonet in use with the US Marine Corps, adopted in an effort to "
"improve USMC hand-to-hand fighting capabilities.  The bayonet is optimized to "
"function as a fighting knife, sporting an ergonomic handle that will minimize "
"hand fatigue during combat.  The blade tip is sharper in profile than other "
"bayonets to assist in penetrating body armor, and also features a small "
"serrated section to provide for some utility."
msgstr ""
"美国海军陆战队使用的一种现代刺刀，旨在提高美国海军陆战队的肉搏战能力。刺刀被优化为战斗刀，具有符合人体工程学的手柄，可以在战斗中最大限度地减少手部疲劳。刀尖"
"在轮廓上比其他刺刀更锋利，以提供破甲效果，并且还具有一个小锯齿部分，以提供其他效用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "Bayonet"
msgid_plural "Bayonets"
msgstr[0] "刺刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "Army bayonet"of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "Army bayonet" of item "Bayonet"
msgid ""
"The current issue Army bayonet, before the Cataclysm anyways.  It is thick, "
"heavy, and surprisingly sharp.  This bayonet also functions as a wire cutter, "
"and a mediocre saw for cutting through aircraft fuselage.  That the handle "
"and tang can be completely disassembled from the blade is surely a fact of "
"great comfort to the soldier, survivalist, and you."
msgstr "大灾难前最新版的陆军刺刀。刀身厚重且锋利。这种刺刀还可以作为剪线钳和锯子使用。刀柄和刀根可以从刀刃上拆卸下来，这对士兵、生存主义者和你来说无疑是一个好消息。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Bayonet"
msgid "Army bayonet"
msgid_plural "Army bayonets"
msgstr[0] "军用刺刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Bayonet"
msgid "AK bayonet"
msgid_plural "AK bayonets"
msgstr[0] "AK刺刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of variant "AK bayonet"of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "AK bayonet" of item "Bayonet"
msgid ""
"A 6H4 bayonet for Kalashnikov pattern rifles, usually imported military "
"surplus from eastern bloc countries.  The blade is made of stainless steel "
"and the handle of a lightweight and durable plastic.  It features a middling "
"metal saw on the spine of the blade, and can function as a wire cutter as "
"well.  Though it is quite sturdy, it can't hold an edge very well."
msgstr ""
"用于卡拉什尼科夫步枪的6H4"
"刺刀，从东方集团国家进口的多余军事物资。刀身由不锈钢制成，手柄由轻便耐用的塑料制成。它的特点是在刀脊上有一段中等长度的锯齿，也可以作为剪线钳使用。虽然很结实"
"，但不好抓握。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Bayonet"
msgid "L-backswerda"
msgid_plural "L-backswerdas"
msgstr[0] "L-backswerdas"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of variant "L-backswerda"of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "L-backswerda" of item "Bayonet"
msgid ""
"A bayonet, although not of any model you're familiar with.  Despite "
"differences in appearance it seems analogous to any other bayonet - The "
"chrome shaded blade is worn but well-maintained, with a grooved edge on its "
"back to act as a sawing implement.  The handle and guard have some additional "
"mechanisms installed to help affix it to a variety of firearms."
msgstr ""
"A bayonet, although not of any model you're familiar with.  Despite "
"differences in appearance it seems analogous to any other bayonet - The "
"chrome shaded blade is worn but well-maintained, with a grooved edge on its "
"back to act as a sawing implement.  The handle and guard have some additional "
"mechanisms installed to help affix it to a variety of firearms."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "National Guard bayonet"
msgid_plural "National Guard bayonets"
msgstr[0] "国民警卫队刺刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "National Guard bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "National Guard bayonet"
msgid ""
"A Cold War era Army bayonet that has only partially been replaced by newer "
"models.  It has an apocalypse-proof full-tang, double-edged high steel blade "
"terminating in a spear point.  The no-frills design makes for both a good "
"fighting knife and bayonet, a fact that was appreciated when reserve stocks "
"of these were issued out to National Guardsmen."
msgstr ""
"一把冷战时期的军队刺刀，这种刺刀目前只有一部分被新式刺刀替换。该刺刀采用末日生存刀一样的全龙骨结构，高碳钢的双刃刀身之上是矛形的刀尖。这种简洁的设计让它能出"
"色地兼任格斗刀和刺刀，这一事实在库存刺刀发放给国民警卫队时得到了证明。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hunting knife"
msgid_plural "hunting knives"
msgstr[0] "獵刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hunting knife"
msgid ""
"Commonly used by hunters, this single-edged sheath knife is designed for "
"cutting and skinning game rather than combat."
msgstr "猎人常用的刀具，这种单刃带鞘的小刀专用于切削、剥皮等用途，而不是战斗。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "KA-BAR knife"
msgid_plural "KA-BAR knives"
msgstr[0] "卡巴猎刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "KA-BAR knife"
msgid ""
"The KA-BAR was developed by the United States Marine Corps in 1942 by "
"modifying hunting knife designs to be more soldier-proof.  The handle is made "
"of stacked leather washers, and the blade is made of easy to sharpen high "
"steel, making for a popular fighting, hunting and utility knife.  The blade "
"is marked 'USMC'."
msgstr ""
"KA-BAR 是美国海军陆战队于 1942 "
"年通过修改猎刀设计而开发的，更适合士兵使用。手柄由堆叠的皮革垫圈制成，刀片由易于打磨的高碳钢制成，是一把流行的格斗、狩猎和实用刀。刀片上标有“USMC”。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "survival knife"
msgid_plural "survival knives"
msgstr[0] "生存者戰鬥刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "survival knife"
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade."
msgstr "一把常见于特种部队、野外求生爱好者所用的大号生存刀。刀身径直，刀背上有着一排锯齿，有着砍、锯、刺等多种用途，握柄底端镶嵌着一个迷你指南针。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "mild steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "生存刀（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel survival knife"
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade.  "
"It's custom-made of mild steel, you could probably find better in a hunting "
"store."
msgstr ""
"一把常见于特种部队、野外求生爱好者所用的大号生存刀。刀身径直，刀背上有着一排锯齿，有着砍、锯、刺等多种用途，握柄底端镶嵌着一个迷你指南针。  "
"这把是用低碳钢定制的。你在狩猎店你能找到更好的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "medium steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "生存刀（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel survival knife"
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade.  "
"Made of medium steel, this is about as good as store bought."
msgstr ""
"一把常见于特种部队、野外求生爱好者所用的大号生存刀。刀身径直，刀背上有着一排锯齿，有着砍、锯、刺等多种用途，握柄底端镶嵌着一个迷你指南针。  "
"这把是用中碳钢定制的。这把和狩猎店里卖的差不多。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "medium steel survival knife"
msgid "A hidden handle compartment.  Unscrew the compass to access."
msgstr "一个隐藏的把手隔间，拧开指南针就可以打开。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "high steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "生存刀（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel survival knife"
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade.  "
"A competent weapon and tool, if not the best at any of them."
msgstr ""
"一把常见于特种部队、野外求生爱好者所用的大号生存刀。刀身径直，刀背上有着一排锯齿，有着砍、锯、刺等多种用途，握柄底端镶嵌着一个迷你指南针。  "
"这把是用高碳钢定制的。虽然没有在各方面都做到最好，但它是一把得力的武器及工具。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "hardened steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "生存刀（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel survival knife"
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade.  "
"Now this, this is a knife."
msgstr ""
"一把常见于特种部队、野外求生爱好者所用的大号生存刀。刀身径直，刀背上有着一排锯齿，有着砍、锯、刺等多种用途，握柄底端镶嵌着一个迷你指南针。  "
"这把是用硬化碳钢定制的。嗯，这才能被叫做“刀”。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel survival knife"
msgid_plural "tempered steel survival knives"
msgstr[0] "生存刀（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel survival knife"
msgid ""
"This massive knife features a hollow handle with a compass built into the "
"pommel and a row of fearsome-looking saw teeth along the back of its blade.  "
"Time to go Rambo on this apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"一把常见于特种部队、野外求生爱好者所用的大号生存刀。刀身径直，刀背上有着一排锯齿，有着砍、锯、刺等多种用途，握柄底端镶嵌着一个迷你指南针。  "
"这把是用回火碳钢定制的。是时候像兰博一样对这个末日做出回应了。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "F-S fighting knife"
msgid_plural "F-S fighting knives"
msgstr[0] "F-S战斗匕首"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "F-S fighting knife"
msgid ""
"Arguably the most famous combat knife in military history, this blackened "
"double-edged knife is made of drop-forged steel and knurled brass.  The "
"balance of the knife is such that it can be tossed from one hand to the other "
"instinctively, and the spear point allows for easy insertion into an "
"unsuspecting foe's heart.  While this knife is great in a fight, it's not "
"very good as a tool.  The ricasso declares this to be a 'Fairbairn-Sykes "
"knife', with a National Stocking Number of '1095-99-963-2037'."
msgstr ""
"可以说是军事历史上最著名的战斗刀，这把黑色的双刃刀是由滴锻钢和滚花黄铜制成的。刀的平衡使它可以本能地从一只手抛向另一只手，刀尖可以很容易地插入毫无防备的敌人"
"的心脏。虽然这把刀在打斗中很好用，但作为工具却不怎么好用。里卡索宣称这是一把“费尔贝恩-赛克斯刀”，柄上有编号：“1095-99-963-2037”。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Swiss Army knife"
msgid_plural "Swiss Army knives"
msgstr[0] "瑞士刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "Swiss Army knife"
msgid ""
"An iconic pocket knife imported from Europe.  Its red plastic handle conceals "
"many small tools."
msgstr "一個從歐洲進口的經典口袋刀， 他的紅色塑膠刀柄裡面隱藏著許多的工具。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "trench knife"
msgid_plural "trench knives"
msgstr[0] "雙刃短刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "trench knife"
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking."
msgstr ""
"一把钢制护手的匕首，用于保护指关节，也可以用来敲击或者格挡。专为第一次世界大战中残酷的肉搏战设计的武器，让士兵们在狭窄的战壕里互相厮杀，独特的刃形可以令其轻"
"易撬开或凿穿钢盔，对付丧尸也是同样如此。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "mild steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "战壕匕首（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel trench knife"
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is "
"poorly made of mild steel with barely a proper grip."
msgstr ""
"一把结构紧凑的作战匕首，带有钢制护手以保护手关节。用来敲人和格挡也都很不错。专为第一次世界大战中残酷的肉搏战设计的武器，让士兵们在狭窄的战壕里互相厮杀。  "
"这把由低碳钢制成，工艺粗糙，握柄也不舒服。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "medium steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "战壕匕首（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel trench knife"
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is "
"made of medium steel and is about shop quality."
msgstr ""
"一把结构紧凑的作战匕首，带有钢制护手以保护手关节。用来敲人和格挡也都很不错。专为第一次世界大战中残酷的肉搏战设计的武器，让士兵们在狭窄的战壕里互相厮杀。  "
"这把由中碳钢制成，品质和商店里卖的差不多。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "high steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "战壕匕首（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel trench knife"
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is "
"made of high steel and is probably as good as a WWI trench knife."
msgstr ""
"一把结构紧凑的作战匕首，带有钢制护手以保护手关节。用来敲人和格挡也都很不错。专为第一次世界大战中残酷的肉搏战设计的武器，让士兵们在狭窄的战壕里互相厮杀。  "
"这把由高碳钢制成，应该与一战时的一样好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "hardened steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "战壕匕首（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel trench knife"
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is "
"made of hardened steel, an officer's weapon if ever there was one."
msgstr ""
"一把结构紧凑的作战匕首，带有钢制护手以保护手关节。用来敲人和格挡也都很不错。专为第一次世界大战中残酷的肉搏战设计的武器，让士兵们在狭窄的战壕里互相厮杀。  "
"这把由硬化碳钢制成，如果说有一把军官佩刀，那么非它莫属。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "tempered steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "战壕匕首（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel trench knife"
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is "
"made of tempered steel, and you feel you could hold a trench against an army "
"of zombies with it."
msgstr ""
"一把结构紧凑的作战匕首，带有钢制护手以保护手关节。用来敲人和格挡也都很不错。专为第一次世界大战中残酷的肉搏战设计的武器，让士兵们在狭窄的战壕里互相厮杀。  "
"这把由回火碳钢制成。你感觉凭借它可以抵挡住一支丧尸军队的攻击。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift knife"
msgid_plural "makeshift knives"
msgstr[0] "粗製刀子"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift knife"
msgid ""
"A knife consisting of a long, somewhat sharpened spike and a tightly-wrapped "
"rag as a handle.  Not as good as a real knife, but it'll do in a pinch."
msgstr "一把小刀，由一根略微锋利的钉刺组成，一边紧紧包裹有破布作为握柄。虽然没有真正的刀子好，但在紧要关头也能用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glass shiv"
msgid_plural "glass shivs"
msgstr[0] "玻璃短刃"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "glass shiv"
msgid "A glass shard with wrapping at one end so it can be safely wielded."
msgstr "將玻璃碎片的一端裹起， 因此可以更加安全地揮舞。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bone shiv"
msgid_plural "bone shivs"
msgstr[0] "骨制小刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "bone shiv"
msgid ""
"A femur or other bone, about 20 cm long, which has been broken at one end and "
"sharpened into a cutting tool.  Its jagged edge is wicked but fragile."
msgstr "把大約 20公分長的股骨或其他骨頭的其中一端弄斷然後弄尖成一把切割工具。鋸齒狀的邊緣很陰險但脆弱。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "baselard"
msgid_plural "baselards"
msgstr[0] "德國短匕劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "baselard"
msgid ""
"A medieval dagger forged from rough iron.  It is not the sharpest tool in the "
"shed, but it is certainly one of the largest."
msgstr "一把用粗铁锻造的中世纪匕首。它也许不是工具棚里最锋利的工具，但肯定是最大个之一。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift machete"
msgid_plural "makeshift machetes"
msgstr[0] "粗製開山刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift machete"
msgid ""
"A large blade with one end wrapped in duct tape to make a crude handle, "
"making it easier to wield as a rough machete."
msgstr "一把大刀，一端用胶带缠住，做成一个粗糙的刀柄，使其更容易作为一把粗糙的砍刀挥舞。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "machete"
msgid_plural "machetes"
msgstr[0] "開山刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "machete"
msgid ""
"This huge steel knife makes an excellent tool for cutting down large "
"vegetation or other 'obstacles.'"
msgstr "這把大鋼刀能夠砍下大型植物或是其他 '阻礙' 。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat machete"
msgid_plural "combat machetes"
msgstr[0] "戰鬥開山刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "combat machete"
msgid ""
"This common gardening tool has been customized and rebalanced to improve its "
"performance as a weapon."
msgstr "這把常見的園藝工具被改造過了， 現在比較適合當一把武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "tempered steel combat machete"
msgid "tempered steel combat machete"
msgid_plural "tempered steel combat machetes"
msgstr[0] "战斗砍刀（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel combat machete"
#. ~ Description of variant "tempered steel combat machete" of item "tempered
#. steel combat machete"
msgid ""
"This common gardening tool has been customized, rebalanced and tempered to "
"dramatically improve its performance as a weapon."
msgstr "一把曾经的普通砍刀，经过回火和精心的重心调整，原本普通的园艺工具现在当作武器使用起来非常顺手。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tempered steel combat machete"
msgid "hazardous environment blade"
msgid_plural "hazardous environment blades"
msgstr[0] "危险环境自卫砍刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of variant "hazardous environment blade" of item "tempered
#. steel combat machete"
msgid ""
"This black tempered steel bushcraft machete has been reinforced for use in "
"exotic environments.  \"HE Blade\" is engraved in the steel."
msgstr "这款黑色回火碳钢弯刀经过加固，可在危险环境中使用。刀片上刻着\"危险环境自卫砍刀\"。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "machete multitool"
msgid_plural "machete multitools"
msgstr[0] "多功能開山刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "machete multitool"
msgid ""
"A thin, wobbly steel blade with sawteeth on one side and a flat chisel tip "
"for digging.  More of a jackass of all trades than a jack of them."
msgstr "细长又摇摇晃晃的的钢刃的一侧有着锯齿，顶部是一个能用来挖掘的凿头。门门精通，样样稀松。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵軍刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onward.  "
"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon."
msgstr "一把骑兵用弯刀，从近代起就成为骑兵的近战武器。轻便，但同时又是致命的斩击武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "mild steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵軍刀（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  "
"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the "
"sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一把骑兵用弯刀，从近代起就成为骑兵的近战武器。轻便，但同时又是致命的斩击武器。\n"
"\n"
"这把弯刀由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "medium steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵軍刀（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  "
"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, "
"this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and "
"the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"一把骑兵用弯刀，从近代起就成为骑兵的近战武器。轻便，但同时又是致命的斩击武器。\n"
"\n"
"这把弯刀由中碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "high steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "騎兵軍刀（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  "
"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper "
"weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"一把骑兵用弯刀，从近代起就成为骑兵的近战武器。轻便，但同时又是致命的斩击武器。\n"
"\n"
"这把弯刀由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，刀刃也相当锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "hardened steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "骑兵刀（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  "
"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, "
"this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is "
"perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"一把骑兵用弯刀，从近代起就成为骑兵的近战武器。轻便，但同时又是致命的斩击武器。\n"
"\n"
"这把弯刀由经过表面硬化的低碳钢制成，带有一个与你的手完美贴合的模制握把，看起来和能在博物馆里找到的任何武器一样好。平衡性很完美，边缘像剃刀一样锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "tempered steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "骑兵刀（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  "
"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the "
"blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"一把骑兵用弯刀，从近代起就成为骑兵的近战武器。轻便，但同时又是致命的斩击武器。\n"
"\n"
"这把弯刀由经过回火处理的中碳钢制成，堪称为杰作：握柄、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，是剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a curved sword associated with cavalry from "
"the Early Modern period onwards."
msgstr "一把骑兵用弯刀，从近代起就成为骑兵的近战武器。此款外观、造型和材料与正品有差异，为廉价复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kris"
msgid_plural "krises"
msgstr[0] "馬來短劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "kris"
msgid ""
"This wavy-bladed dagger is from Southeast Asia.  The design of the blade "
"causes it to make broad, painful wounds."
msgstr "东南亚原产的波纹状刀刃的匕首。刀刃的形状让它善于制造又大又疼的伤口。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "kris"
msgid "A dull, cheap replica of a wavy-bladed dagger from Southeast Asia."
msgstr "一柄起源于爪哇的短剑，是马来人的特有武器，剑刃呈蛇状波形，多为仪式所用。此款外观、造型和材料与正品有差异，为廉价复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/MMA/exemplar_weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kukri"
msgid_plural "kukris"
msgstr[0] "反曲刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "kukri"
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a modern take on a traditional weapon that "
"originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved edge, "
"it can be used as both a tool and a weapon."
msgstr "这种多功能的传统武器起源于尼泊尔。具有重厚的刀身和向内弯曲的刀刃，可以用来作为一种工具和武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel kukri"
msgid_plural "mild steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "廓尔喀弯刀（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel kukri"
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of mild steel, and barely has a proper handle.  You'd "
"probably find a better version in a store somewhere."
msgstr ""
"这把起源于尼泊尔的传统武器用途广泛，由手工锻打制成。厚实的刀片向内弯曲，呈典型的反曲刀形制。这一把由低碳钢制成，细节处理得并不好。去商店里找一把更好的来用吧"
"。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel kukri"
msgid_plural "medium steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "廓尔喀弯刀（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel kukri"
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of medium steel, and is about what you'd expect to see "
"in a hunting shop."
msgstr "这把起源于尼泊尔的传统武器用途广泛，由手工锻打制成。厚实的刀片向内弯曲，呈典型的反曲刀形制。这一把由中碳钢制成，质量是狩猎用品店的标准水平。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel kukri"
msgid_plural "high steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "廓尔喀弯刀（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel kukri"
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of high steel and is a well-made piece."
msgstr "这把起源于尼泊尔的传统武器用途广泛，由手工锻打制成。厚实的刀片向内弯曲，呈典型的反曲刀形制。这一把由高碳钢制成，是锻造大师的杰作。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel kukri"
msgid_plural "hardened steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "廓尔喀弯刀（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel kukri"
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of hardened steel and is a fine tool and weapon."
msgstr "这把起源于尼泊尔的传统武器用途广泛，由手工锻打制成。厚实的刀片向内弯曲，呈典型的反曲刀形制。这一把由硬化碳钢制成，既是好用的工具，也是趁手的武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel kukri"
msgid_plural "tempered steel kukris"
msgstr[0] "廓尔喀弯刀（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel kukri"
msgid ""
"This versatile implement is a custom-forged version of a traditional weapon "
"that originated in Nepal.  Featuring a heavy blade with an inwardly-curved "
"edge, this one is made of tempered steel and truly a weapon worthy of a post "
"apocalyptic gurkha."
msgstr ""
"这把起源于尼泊尔的传统武器用途广泛，由手工锻打制成。厚实的刀片向内弯曲，呈典型的反曲刀形制。这一把由回火碳钢制成，如果你是廓尔喀人，那真应该在这大灾变后搞一"
"把。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "jian"
msgid_plural "jian"
msgstr[0] "中式劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "jian"
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate guard and a "
"tassel attached to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, "
"alongside the dao saber, qiang spear, and gun staff."
msgstr "一把古中国剑，双刃开锋，剑身长直，护手带有装饰，柄端附有流苏。民间传说中四大武器之一，其余三个是：刀、枪和棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel jian"
msgid_plural "mild steel jian"
msgstr[0] "中式劍（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel jian"
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate guard and a "
"tassel attached to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, "
"alongside the dao saber, qiang spear, and gun staff.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the "
"sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一把古中国剑，双刃开锋，剑身长直，护手带有装饰，柄端附有流苏。民间传说中四大武器之一，其余三个是：刀、枪和棍。\n"
"\n"
"这把剑由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel jian"
msgid_plural "medium steel jian"
msgstr[0] "中式劍（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel jian"
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate guard and a "
"tassel attached to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, "
"alongside the dao saber, qiang spear, and gun staff.\n"
"\n"
"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, "
"this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and "
"the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"一把古中国剑，双刃开锋，剑身长直，护手带有装饰，柄端附有流苏。民间传说中四大武器之一，其余三个是：刀、枪和棍。\n"
"\n"
"这把剑由中碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel jian"
msgid_plural "high steel jian"
msgstr[0] "中式劍（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel jian"
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate guard and a "
"tassel attached to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, "
"alongside the dao saber, qiang spear, and gun staff.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper "
"weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"一把古中国剑，双刃开锋，剑身长直，护手带有装饰，柄端附有流苏。民间传说中四大武器之一，其余三个是：刀、枪和棍。\n"
"\n"
"这把剑由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，刀刃也相当锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
