msgstr[0] "長劍（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel longsword"
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later "
"two-handed swords in size.  It's well-balanced and surprisingly easy to use "
"due to its two-handed grip, but requires a larger baldric or scabbard, "
"compared to smaller swords.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper "
"weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"一把经典中世纪长剑，体积介乎于骑士剑和后期的双手剑之间。相较于其他较小的剑，它的平衡性很好，而且因为使用了双手握把，非常容易使用，但需要剑鞘（背）或剑鞘（肩"
"）来收起。\n"
"\n"
"由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，剑刃也相当锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel longsword"
msgid_plural "hardened steel longswords"
msgstr[0] "长剑（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel longsword"
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later "
"two-handed swords in size.  It's well-balanced and surprisingly easy to use "
"due to its two-handed grip, but requires a larger baldric or scabbard, "
"compared to smaller swords.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, "
"this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is "
"perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"一把经典中世纪长剑，体积介乎于骑士剑和后期的双手剑之间。相较于其他较小的剑，它的平衡性很好，而且因为使用了双手握把，非常容易使用，但需要剑鞘（背）或剑鞘（肩"
"）来收起。\n"
"\n"
"由表面硬化碳钢制成，带有一个与你的手完美贴合的模制握把，看起来和能在博物馆里找到的任何武器一样好。平衡性很完美，剑刃像剃刀一样锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel longsword"
msgid_plural "tempered steel longswords"
msgstr[0] "长剑（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel longsword"
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later "
"two-handed swords in size.  It's well-balanced and surprisingly easy to use "
