"compared to smaller swords.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the "
"blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"一把经典中世纪长剑，体积介乎于骑士剑和后期的双手剑之间。相较于其他较小的剑，它的平衡性很好，而且因为使用了双手握把，非常容易使用，但需要剑鞘（背）或剑鞘（肩"
"）来收起。\n"
"\n"
"由回火碳钢制成，堪称为杰作：握把、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "longsword"
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later "
"two-handed swords in size.  You feel like the pommel could just snap off if "
"you used it."
msgstr "一把经典中世纪长剑，体积介乎于骑士剑和后期的双手剑之间。不过这把是仿制品，你担心用力挥舞它时剑柄会突然断掉。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "longsword"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of the classic medieval longsword.  It requires "
"a larger baldric or scabbard compared to smaller swords."
msgstr "一把经典中世纪长剑的廉价复制品。相较于其他较小的剑，它需要剑鞘（背）或剑鞘（肩）来收起。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "arming sword"
msgid_plural "arming swords"
msgstr[0] "騎士劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "arming sword"
msgid "A classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed."
msgstr "一把经典的中世纪剑，大小正好可以单手使用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel arming sword"
msgid_plural "mild steel arming swords"
msgstr[0] "騎士劍（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel arming sword"
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the "
"sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一把经典的中世纪剑，大小正好可以单手使用。\n"
"\n"
"这把剑由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel arming sword"
msgid_plural "medium steel arming swords"
msgstr[0] "騎士劍（中碳鋼）"

