#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/MMA/exemplar_weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "xiphos"
msgid_plural "xiphe"
msgstr[0] "西福斯短劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "xiphos"
msgid ""
"A bronze sword of ancient Greek origin, wielded as a sidearm to the dory "
"spear."
msgstr "一把源自古希臘的青銅劍， 多律長槍以外的副武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "khopesh"
msgid_plural "khopeshes"
msgstr[0] "霍佩什彎刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "khopesh"
msgid ""
"This ancient bronze weapon features a curved, sickle-like blade sharpened on "
"the outside edge.  Associated with the New Kingdom period of Ancient Egypt, "
"it was designed mainly to hack through the light armor common to the region."
msgstr "这把古老的青铜兵器有一个弯曲、镰刀状的锋利外刃。发源于古埃及新王国时期，它的主要目的是砍开当地盛行的轻装甲。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dao"
msgid_plural "dao"
msgstr[0] "中式刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "dao"
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese sword consisting of a curved blade and a guard with a "
"cupped design.  Existing since the Shang dynasty, this one is made of bronze. "
" One of the four major weapons in folklore, alongside the jian sword, qiang "
"spear, and gun staff."
msgstr "一把古中國刀， 由青銅製成， 刀身微曲， 配以杯形護手。源自商代的設計。民間傳說中四大武器之一， 其餘三個是: 劍、槍和棍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze sword"
msgid_plural "bronze swords"
msgstr[0] "青銅劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze sword"
msgid ""
"An imitation of a sword made from bronze.  It is a capable weapon, but it "
"cannot compare to actual swords."
msgstr "一把青铜剑的仿制品。它是把还可以的武器，但无法与真正的剑相比。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "sword bayonet"
msgid_plural "sword bayonets"
msgstr[0] "劍刺刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "sword bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "sword bayonet"
msgid ""
"A long, knife bladed bayonet that can be attached to the front of a rifle, "
"converting it into a pike.  It is long enough to be used as a short sword "
"when unmounted."
msgstr "一种长长的带刃刺刀，可以连接在步枪的前部，当作一只长矛使用。这柄刺刀足够长，可以以在卸下时当短剑用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tanto"
msgid_plural "tanto"
msgstr[0] "短刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tanto"
msgid ""
"Long Japanese knives like this more-modern remake were the samurai's backup "
"weapon, before the advent of the larger wakizashi.  It's still a deadly "
"blade, even if it's smaller than its more famous relatives."
msgstr "相對於長日本刀， 在較大把的脇差出現前， 是武士們的備用武器。它仍然是把致命的刀具， 即使它比其更著名的親戚小把。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tanto"
msgid ""
"Long Japanese knives like this more-modern remake were the samurai's backup "
"weapon, before the advent of the larger wakizashi.  This one doesn't feel "
"well-balanced."
msgstr ""
"一把日式短刀，在胁差发明之前曾经是武士的备用武器。虽然比更有名的日本刀小，但仍然是把致命的武器。这把感觉握起来不太匀称。\n"
"\"在末世的绝望中可以赋予你更具意义的自尽方式。\""

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tanto"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a long Japanese knife, typically used as a "
"samurai's backup weapon."
msgstr "一把日式短刀，在胁差发明之前曾经是武士的备用武器。这把是廉价的复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "wakizashi"
msgid_plural "wakizashi"
msgstr[0] "脇差"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "wakizashi"
msgid ""
"A comparatively-common Japanese short sword.  Smaller and lighter than a "
"katana, but still effective in combat."
msgstr "一柄短刀，日本武士用于室内及其他狭小空间贴身战斗，通常随身携带，遭遇袭击时，在打刀、太刀不利于使用的情况下自卫。"

