"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, "
"this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and "
"the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于德国，十三世纪初登场的双手巨剑，造型威武、重量惊人，多为骑士一对一决斗中使用，而后特别受到德国与瑞士的佣兵们的喜爱。\n"
"\n"
"这把巨剑由中碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel zweihänder"
msgid_plural "high steel zweihänders"
msgstr[0] "德國雙手劍（高碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel zweihänder"
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  It packs a real wallop.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper "
"weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于德国，十三世纪初登场的双手巨剑，造型威武、重量惊人，多为骑士一对一决斗中使用，而后特别受到德国与瑞士的佣兵们的喜爱。\n"
"\n"
"这把巨剑由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，刀刃也相当锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel zweihänder"
msgid_plural "hardened steel zweihänders"
msgstr[0] "双手巨剑（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel zweihänder"
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  It packs a real wallop.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, "
"this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is "
"perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于德国，十三世纪初登场的双手巨剑，造型威武、重量惊人，多为骑士一对一决斗中使用，而后特别受到德国与瑞士的佣兵们的喜爱。\n"
"\n"
"这把巨剑由经过表面硬化的低碳钢制成，带有一个与你的手完美贴合的模制握把，看起来和能在博物馆里找到的任何武器一样好。平衡性很完美，边缘像剃刀一样锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel zweihänder"
msgid_plural "tempered steel zweihänders"
msgstr[0] "双手巨剑（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel zweihänder"
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  It packs a real wallop.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the "
"blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于德国，十三世纪初登场的双手巨剑，造型威武、重量惊人，多为骑士一对一决斗中使用，而后特别受到德国与瑞士的佣兵们的喜爱。\n"
"\n"
"这把巨剑由经过回火处理的中碳钢制成，堪称为杰作：握柄、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，是剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "zweihänder"
msgid ""
"A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  You're not quite sure it's supposed to "
"be this bendy."
msgstr "一把德制巨型双手剑，极具视觉冲击力。不知是设计师的奇思妙想，还是铸剑师的偷奸耍滑，这把剑的剑刃有些不妙的弯曲。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "zweihänder"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a huge two-handed sword from Germany.  Even "
"blunted, it still packs a wallop."
msgstr "一把来自德国的双手巨剑，但这是拙劣而廉价的仿制品，不过造型依然十分威武。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "karambit"
msgid_plural "karambits"
msgstr[0] "爪刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "karambit"
msgid ""
"A traditional Indonesian small knife.  This one is sharp and could be an "
"effective weapon."
msgstr "传统的印尼小刀。它十分锋利，也许是一种有效的武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kirpan"
msgid_plural "kirpans"
msgstr[0] "錫克短刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "kirpan"
msgid ""
"A ceremonial dagger carried by Sikh men.  This one is sharp and could be an "
"effective weapon."
msgstr "锡克教徒使用的礼仪匕首，它十分锋利，也许是一种有效的武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "kirpan"
msgid ""
"A ceremonial dagger carried by Sikh men.  This one is not particularly "
"well-made."
msgstr "锡克教徒使用的礼仪匕首，这把看上去工艺并不怎么样。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json data/json/recipes/nested.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "nodachi"
msgid_plural "nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "nodachi"
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for "
"its size."
msgstr "一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "mild steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel nodachi"
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for "
"its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the "
"sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。\n"
"\n"
"这把刀由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "medium steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel nodachi"
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for "
"its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, "
"this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and "
"the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。\n"
"\n"
"这把刀由中碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

