#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "tempered steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel nodachi"
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for "
"its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the "
"blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。\n"
"\n"
"这把刀由经过回火处理的中碳钢制成，堪称为杰作：握柄、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，是剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "nodachi"
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for "
"its size, but also much bendier than a sword should be."
msgstr "一柄日式弯刃双手大刀，相比于其尺寸来说轻得有点过头了，比起真刀来容易弯折。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "nodachi"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  "
"It is surprisingly light for its size."
msgstr "一柄日本武士骑马作战时所用的野太刀，亦称\"大太刀\"。此款外观、造型和材料与正品有差异，为廉价复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fencing foil"
msgid_plural "fencing foils"
msgstr[0] "擊劍鈍劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "fencing foil"
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  Unfortunately, a "
"fencing foil is rather useless as a weapon due to its flexible shaft and dull "
"tip."
msgstr "一把用于击剑的武器，击剑运动被认为是所有运动中最为高贵的。但是在大灾变后，这把剑身软又钝的剑没什么用。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sharpened foil"
msgid_plural "sharpened foils"
msgstr[0] "磨尖鈍劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "sharpened foil"
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing foil has had its electrical plunger "
"assembly removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still "
"lacks a cutting edge, it is now somewhat more lethal, yet still familiar to "
"the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"这把曾经人畜无害的花剑的压力感应器已经被移除，末端被粗糙地磨尖。虽然它还是没有剑刃，但磨尖的末端已经使它带有一定程度的致命性，对于熟悉击剑的人来说还是比较有"
"用的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electrified foil"
msgid_plural "electrified foils"
msgstr[0] "電擊鈍劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "electrified foil"
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing foil may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been made "
"to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to the "
"guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  Thrusting "
"the sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch will deliver "
"a painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"这把花剑的改装可以说毫无体育精神，但是能够给你在这场末日比赛中带来一点优势。这把花剑的把手经过了充分绝缘改装，剑格上接上了一把高压电击枪，并通过电子计分器的"
"电路连到了花剑末端。如果你在击打敌人时按下电击开关，就可以释放出一道强烈的电击。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fencing épée"
msgid_plural "fencing épées"
msgstr[0] "擊劍銳劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "fencing épée"
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  While not designed "
"for combat the épée is the heaviest and stiffest of the fencing weapons, and "
"therefore perhaps still useful in your situation."
msgstr "一把用于击剑的武器，击剑运动被认为是所有运动中最为高贵的。虽然并非专为战斗而设计，但这种剑是各种比赛用剑中最为沉重和坚固的一种，因此在实战中仍然有效。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sharpened épée"
msgid_plural "sharpened épées"
msgstr[0] "磨尖銳劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "sharpened épée"
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing épée has had its electrical plunger "
"assembly removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still "
"lacks a cutting edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still familiar "
"to the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"这把曾经人畜无害的重剑的压力感应器已经被移除，末端被粗糙地磨尖。虽然它还是没有剑刃，但磨尖的末端已经使它带有相当程度的致命性，对于熟悉击剑的人来说还是比较有"
"用的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electrified épée"
msgid_plural "electrified épées"
msgstr[0] "電擊銳劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "electrified épée"
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing épée may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been made "
"to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to the "
"guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  Thrusting "
"the sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch will deliver "
"a painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"这把重剑的改装可以说毫无体育精神，但是能够给你在这场末日比赛中带来一点优势。这把重剑的把手经过了充分绝缘改装，剑格上接上了一把高压电击枪，并通过电子计分器的"
"电路连到了重剑末端。如果你在击打敌人时按下电击开关，就可以释放出一道强烈的电击。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fencing saber"
msgid_plural "fencing sabers"
msgstr[0] "擊劍軍刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "fencing saber"
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  Not designed for "
"combat the saber at least bears an edge and so outperforms the foil, though "
"still lacks the weight of the épée."
msgstr "一把用于击剑的武器，击剑运动被认为是所有运动中最为高贵的。虽然并非专为战斗而设计，也缺少重剑那般的重量，但这把至少具备刃口，因此比花剑更具实战性。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sharpened saber"
msgid_plural "sharpened sabers"
msgstr[0] "磨尖軍刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "sharpened saber"
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing saber has had its rounded tip snapped "
"off and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still lacks a "
"cutting edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still familiar to the "
"practiced fencer."
msgstr "这把曾经人畜无害的佩剑的钝尖已经被折断，末端被粗糙地磨尖。虽然它还是没有剑刃，但磨尖的剑尖已经使它带有相当程度的致命性，对于熟悉击剑的人来说还是比较有用的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electrified saber"
msgid_plural "electrified sabers"
msgstr[0] "電擊軍刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "electrified saber"
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing saber may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been made "
"to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to the "
"guard, wired to the tip along the saber's groove.  Thrusting the sharpened "
"tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch will deliver a painful "
"electric shock."
msgstr ""
"这把佩剑的改装可以说毫无体育精神，但是能够给你在这场末日比赛中带来一点优势。这把佩剑的把手经过了充分绝缘改装，剑格上接上了一把高压电击枪，并沿着佩剑的血槽连"
"到了剑的末端。如果你在击打敌人时按下电击开关，就可以释放出一道强烈的电击。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hollow cane"
msgid_plural "hollow canes"
msgstr[0] "拐杖刀鞘"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hollow cane"
msgid ""
"A cane designed to conceal a blade.  This was a popular fashion accessory for "
"the wealthy during the 18th and 19th centuries."
msgstr "設計來藏刀的拐杖。在18和19世紀是一種流行的時尚配件，為權貴所喜愛。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sword cane"
msgid_plural "sword canes"
msgstr[0] "拐杖刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "sword cane"
msgid "A sword with a thin blade designed to be hidden inside a hollow cane."
msgstr "一把設計成能夠隱藏於拐杖刀鞘的薄刃劍。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broadsword"
msgid_plural "broadswords"
msgstr[0] "闊劍"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
msgid ""
"An Early Modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  "
"Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers."
msgstr "一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel broadsword"
msgid_plural "mild steel broadswords"
msgstr[0] "闊劍（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel broadsword"
msgid ""
"An early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  "
"Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the "
"sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。\n"
"\n"
"这把剑由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel broadsword"
msgid_plural "medium steel broadswords"
msgstr[0] "闊劍（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel broadsword"
msgid ""
"An early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  "
"Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, "
"this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and "
"the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。\n"
"\n"
"这把剑由中碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel broadsword"
msgid_plural "high steel broadswords"
msgstr[0] "闊劍（高碳鋼）"

