#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jade nagamaki"
msgid_plural "jade nagamaki"
msgstr[0] "翡翠长卷刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "jade nagamaki"
msgid ""
"A master smith painstakingly flaked its flowing blade from meteoric sea-green "
"stone.  The hilt's cordage is speckled by gold flakes from the tumultuous "
"waters where the blade was whet, and the chosen tsuba depicts an "
"all-devouring snake."
msgstr "一位制剑大师剥离海绿色原石，制成的長巻（一种日刀）。剑柄绳索上点缀着来自打磨刀刃的汹涌海水中的金片，护手上描绘了一条吞噬一切的蛇。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "butterfly sword"
msgid_plural "butterfly swords"
msgstr[0] "蝴蝶刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "butterfly sword"
msgid ""
"A Shaolin butterfly sword, about the same size as a machete but with hand "
"guards and wider blades.  Traditionally used in pairs, but just one is more "
"than enough."
msgstr "少林蝴蝶刀，大小近似于砍刀，但装护手和更宽的刀刃。传统上双刀成对使用，但一把也足够了。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cutlass"
msgid_plural "cutlasses"
msgstr[0] "海盜彎刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
