msgid ""
"A broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates, as its short blade is "
"easy to handle in close quarters."
msgstr "一把因被水手与海盗广泛使用而闻名的阔刃军刀，偏短的刀刃让它在近身时得心应手。"

