msgstr[0] "短弯刀（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel cutlass"
msgid ""
"A broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates, as its short blade is "
"easy to handle in close quarters.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, "
"this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is "
"perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"一把因被水手与海盗广泛使用而闻名的阔刃军刀，偏短的刀刃让它在近身时得心应手。\n"
"\n"
"这把刀由经过表面硬化的低碳钢制成，带有一个与你的手完美贴合的模制握把，看起来和能在博物馆里找到的任何武器一样好。平衡性很完美，边缘像剃刀一样锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel cutlass"
msgid_plural "tempered steel cutlasses"
msgstr[0] "短弯刀（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel cutlass"
msgid ""
"A broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates, as its short blade is "
"easy to handle in close quarters.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the "
"blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"一把因被水手与海盗广泛使用而闻名的阔刃军刀，偏短的刀刃让它在近身时得心应手。\n"
"\n"
"这把刀由经过回火处理的中碳钢制成，堪称为杰作：握柄、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，是剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "cutlass"
msgid ""
"A broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates.  This sword appears "
"to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a few swings."
msgstr "这种阔刃军刀因为普遍被水手与海盗使用而闻名。偏短的刀刃让它在近身时得心应手。这一把看上去很糟糕，但挥舞几次问题不大。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "cutlass"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a broad saber known for its use by sailors "
"and pirates."
msgstr "一把阔刃军刀的拙劣仿制品，因为普遍被水手与海盗使用而闻名。此款外观、造型和材料与正品有差异，为廉价复制品。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "德式戰刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "kriegsmesser"
msgid ""
"A single-edged two-handed sword of German design, with a long, curved blade.  "
"It became popular across Europe due to its low cost while maintaining strong "
"cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword."
msgstr "起源于德国的双手巨剑，带有长而弯曲的刀片。与更复杂的长剑相比，它成本低廉，同时仍有强大的切割力，因此在欧洲广受欢迎。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "mild steel kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "德式戰刀（低碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel kriegsmesser"
msgid ""
"A single-edged hand-and-a-half-sword of German design, with a long, curved "
"blade.  It became popular across Europe due to its low cost while maintaining "
"strong cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the "
"sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"起源于德国的双手巨剑，带有长而弯曲的刀片。与更复杂的长剑相比，它成本低廉，同时仍有强大的切割力，因此在欧洲广受欢迎。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "medium steel kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "德式戰刀（中碳鋼）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel kriegsmesser"
msgid ""
"A single-edged two-handed sword of German design, with a long, curved blade.  "
"It became popular across Europe due to its low cost while maintaining strong "
"cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword.\n"
"\n"
"Made with medium steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, "
"this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and "
"the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"起源于德国的双手巨剑，带有长而弯曲的刀片。与更复杂的长剑相比，它成本低廉，同时仍有强大的切割力，因此在欧洲广受欢迎。\n"
"\n"
"这把由中碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "high steel kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "德式戰刀（高碳鋼）"

