msgid ""
"A distinct Dacian sword that curves forward, allowing you to bypass shields "
"or hook and pull enemies, while delivering decent chopping damage.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the "
"sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一种曾经由达西安人使用的独特弯刀，让你可以绕过盾牌并钩拉敌人，同时提供不错的斩击伤害。\n"
