msgid_plural "punch daggers"
msgstr[0] "拳刃"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "punch dagger"
msgid ""
"A short, sharp double-edged dagger made to be gripped in the palm, with the "
"blade protruding between the fingers."
msgstr "一把短而锋利的双刃匕首，可以紧握在手心，刀刃从指缝中露出来。它是起源于印度的冷兵器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "razorbar katar"
msgid_plural "razorbar katars"
msgstr[0] "劍棘拳刃"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "razorbar katar"
msgid ""
"Five pieces of rebar sharpened to cruel points and strapped to a brace "
"fastened at the wrist and forearm on both arms.  The next bub better watch "
"out."
msgstr "一把传统武器，5根磨尖了的钢筋被焊接在拳套支架上，支架固定在手腕和前臂上。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tiger claws"
msgid_plural "tiger claws"
msgstr[0] "虎爪"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tiger claws"
msgid ""
"Also called bagh nakha or iron paw, this small claw-like bladed weapon from "
"India is designed to be concealed under and against the palm."
msgstr "一个小型刃爪武器，发源于印度，也被称作\"bagh nakha\"或\"铁爪\"。其小巧的体型使其能够被轻易隐藏在掌心之中。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "Enfield No. 4 bayonet"
msgid_plural "Enfield No. 4 bayonets"
msgstr[0] "恩菲尔德四号步枪刺刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "Enfield No. 4 bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "Enfield No. 4 bayonet"
msgid ""
"This is a vintage spike bayonet for the British Lee Enfield No. 4 rifle, "
"featuring a distinct cruciform blade and socket-based mounting system."
msgstr "这是柄用于英国李恩菲尔德四号步枪的复古刺刀，具有独特的十字形刀片和一个基于插座的安装系统。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "Type 30 bayonet"
msgid_plural "Type 30 bayonets"
msgstr[0] "30式刺刀"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "Type 30 bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "Type 30 bayonet"
msgid ""
"An essential tool within any 20th-century Japanese soldier's toolbox, the "
"Type 30 is a massive, single-edged sword-style bayonet intended for use with "
"Arisaka rifles and even light machineguns.  Possessing a J-shaped quillon "
"guard for hooking an opponent's weapon during combat, the bayonet, when "
"dismounted, acts like a particularly sizable machete."
msgstr ""
"作为20世纪日本兵的工具箱中的必备工具，30"
"式刺刀是一种巨大的单刃剑式刺刀，可以安装在有坂步枪，甚至是轻机枪上。它有个J形的护手，可以在战斗时钩住对手的武器。当它从枪身取下时，看上去就像一把特别大的砍"
"刀。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel talwar"
msgid_plural "mild steel talwars"
msgstr[0] "塔瓦弯刀（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel talwar"
msgid ""
"A curved sword used by the Raj of India in the 16th century, a talwar is "
"usually impeccably decorated and able to take off a limb with a single swipe.\n"
"\n"
"This one however is made of mild steel and lacks even a proper grip, you can "
"definitely do better."
msgstr ""
"塔瓦弯刀是十六世纪时印度统治者常用的武器。它通常被装饰得极为精美，能够在一挥之间斩断肢体。\n"
"\n"
"然而这把是由低碳钢制成的，甚至没有合适的握柄，你或许会倾向于找把更好的。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel talwar"
msgid_plural "medium steel talwars"
msgstr[0] "塔瓦弯刀（中碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "medium steel talwar"
msgid ""
"A curved sword used by the Raj of India in the 16th century, a talwar is "
"usually impeccably decorated and able to take off a limb with a single swipe.\n"
"\n"
"This one has a proper grip and is made of medium steel, but doesn't have the "
"distinctive circular pommel yet."
msgstr ""
"塔瓦弯刀是十六世纪时印度统治者常用的武器。它通常被装饰得极为精美，能够在一挥之间斩断肢体。\n"
"\n"
"这把是由中碳钢制成的，有着不错的握柄，但还是缺少标志性的圆碟形刀首。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high steel talwar"
msgid_plural "high steel talwars"
msgstr[0] "塔瓦弯刀（高碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "high steel talwar"
msgid ""
"A curved sword used by the Raj of India in the 16th century, a talwar is "
"usually impeccably decorated and able to take off a limb with a single swipe.\n"
"\n"
"This one has a proper grip and is made of high steel, you've even gotten the "
"circular pommel right!"
msgstr ""
"塔瓦弯刀是十六世纪时印度统治者常用的武器。它通常被装饰得极为精美，能够在一挥之间斩断肢体。\n"
"\n"
"这把是由高碳钢制成的，有着不错的握柄，甚至圆碟刀首也做得很还原！"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel talwar"
msgid_plural "hardened steel talwars"
msgstr[0] "塔瓦弯刀（硬化碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel talwar"
msgid ""
"A curved sword used by the Raj of India in the 16th century, a talwar is "
"usually impeccably decorated and able to take off a limb with a single swipe.\n"
"\n"
"This one has a proper grip and is made of hardened steel and is otherwise a "
"fine weapon."
msgstr ""
"塔瓦弯刀是十六世纪时印度统治者常用的武器。它通常被装饰得极为精美，能够在一挥之间斩断肢体。\n"
"\n"
"这把是由硬化碳钢制成的，有着不错的握柄，从各种方面来说都是把不错的武器。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel talwar"
msgid_plural "tempered steel talwars"
msgstr[0] "塔瓦弯刀（回火碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel talwar"
msgid ""
"A curved sword used by the Raj of India in the 16th century, a talwar is "
"usually impeccably decorated and able to take off a limb with a single swipe.\n"
"\n"
"This one has a proper grip and is made of tempered steel, and pre-apocalypse "
"a Raj could have used it."
msgstr ""
"塔瓦弯刀是十六世纪时印度统治者常用的武器。它通常被装饰得极为精美，能够在一挥之间斩断肢体。\n"
"\n"
"这把是由回火碳钢制成的，有着不错的握柄。持此刀者将加冕为印度Raj。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel kilij"
msgid_plural "mild steel kilijes"
msgstr[0] "基利杰弯刀（低碳钢）"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel kilij"
msgid ""
"A Turkish saber, the kilij is quite a bit heavier than most Middle Eastern "
"sabers and has a distinctive wide tip called a yelman, which gives it vicious "
"cutting power but means it requires a special scabbard.\n"
"\n"
"This one has been made of mild steel, and doesn't even have a proper grip or "
"truly sharp edge."
msgstr ""
"基利杰是一种土耳其军刀，比大多数中东军刀都要重一些，被称为\"耶尔曼\"的宽大刀尖赋予了它强悍的切割能力，但也意味着它需要一个特殊的刀鞘。\n"
"\n"
"这把刀由不仅低碳钢制成，而且没有合适的握把或者锋利的刀刃。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medium steel kilij"
msgid_plural "medium steel kilijes"
msgstr[0] "基利杰弯刀（中碳钢）"

