"for repairing windows."
msgstr "一塊大玻璃，大約三乘四英尺。很容易破碎。用於修理窗戶。"

#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "sheet of glass"
msgid ""
"You break the pane and place the shards on the ground, ready to be cracked by "
"something passing by."
msgstr "你打破玻璃並將碎片鋪在地上，準備被路過的東西壓碎。"

