#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "netherium warp grenade"
msgid "Pull pin"
msgstr "拉開插銷"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "flashbang"
msgid "You pull the pin on the flashbang."
msgstr "你拉開閃光彈的安全插銷。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active flashbang"
msgid_plural "active flashbangs"
msgstr[0] "啟動中閃光彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active flashbang"
msgid ""
"This flashbang is active, and will soon detonate with intense light and "
"sound, blinding, deafening, and disorienting anyone nearby.  It may be a good "
"idea to throw it!"
msgstr "正如字面所述，这颗震撼弹已经被激活了，请背过身去，捂上耳朵，然后在心里默数\"1、2、3，木头人！\""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/grenades.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active flashbang"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active EMP grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active scrambler grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive pipebomb"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active cryo grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active Granade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active netherium warp grenade"
#, c-format
msgid "You've already pulled the %s's pin, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "你已經拉開 %s 的插銷了, 試著把它投出去看看。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "fungicidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "殺菌瓦斯手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid ""
"A canister grenade filled with fungicidal solution.  Use this item to pull "
"the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active fungicidal grenade.  In "
"five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile gas that is highly toxic to "
"fungal life forms."
msgstr "一个装满抗真菌溶液的筒状手雷。使用该物品将会拔下插销并点燃引信。五秒后它会开始释放对真菌生物具有高度毒性的挥发性喷雾。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "fungicidal gas grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "makeshift fungicidal gas grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tear gas grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "insecticidal gas grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid "You pull the pin."
msgstr "你拔掉了保險銷。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armed fungicidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed fungicidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "殺菌瓦斯手榴彈（啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "armed fungicidal gas canister"
msgid ""
"This fungicidal bomb has had its pin removed and is (or will shortly be) "
"expelling highly toxic gas."
msgstr "这个抗真菌手雷的插销已被拔出，并且正在释放有毒气体。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift fungicidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "粗製殺菌瓦斯手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid ""
"A makeshift canister grenade filled with fungicidal solution.  Use this item "
"to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active fungicidal "
"grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile gas that is "
"highly toxic to fungal life forms."
msgstr "一个装满抗真菌溶液的自制筒状手雷。使用该物品将会拔下插销并点燃引信。五秒后它会开始释放对真菌生物具有高度毒性的挥发性喷雾。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "粗製殺菌瓦斯手榴彈（啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canister"
msgid ""
"This makeshift fungicidal bomb has had its pin removed and is (or will "
"shortly be) expelling highly toxic gas."
msgstr "这个自制抗真菌手雷的插销已被拔出，并且正在释放有毒气体。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift gas canister"
msgid_plural "makeshift gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "粗製毒氣彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift gas canister"
msgid ""
"A crude gas bomb made using household chemicals.  Use this item to arm it.  "
"In three seconds it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for a short time.  "
"This gas poisons those exposed to it, in addition to obscuring vision and "
"scent."
msgstr "一个由家用化学药品制成的自制催泪手雷。使用以激活它。在三秒后，它会开始释放有毒气体。这种气体会使吸入的生物中毒，也能遮蔽视野和掩盖气味。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "makeshift gas canister"
msgid "Arm"
msgstr "手臂"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "makeshift gas canister"
msgid "You arm the makeshift gas canister."
msgstr "你啟動了粗製毒氣彈。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active makeshift gas canister"
msgid_plural "active makeshift gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "粗製毒氣彈（已啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active makeshift gas canister"
msgid ""
"This homemade canister of poison gas has been unsealed, and is (or will "
"shortly be) expelling highly toxic gas.  You should consider getting rid of "
"it soon."
msgstr "這罐自製的毒氣彈已經打開了， 這表明它正在 (或即將要) 排出劇毒氣體。你應該考慮快點扔掉它。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active makeshift gas canister"
#, c-format
msgid "You've already armed the %s, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "你已經啟動了 %s， 試試看丟擲出去吧。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/price_overrides/grenades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grenade"
msgid_plural "grenades"
msgstr[0] "手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "grenade"
msgid ""
"A military-grade fragmentation hand grenade.  Use this item to pull the pin "
"and start the fuse.  You will then have five seconds before it explodes; "
"throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一个军用破片手雷，使用此物品以拔掉插销，之后你有五秒的时间去扔掉它。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/grenades.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "incendiary grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "HE grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "cryo grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "neurotoxin grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "inferno grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "makeshift inferno grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "netherium warp grenade"
msgid "You pull the pin on the grenade."
msgstr "你拉開手榴彈的安全插銷。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active grenade"
msgid_plural "active grenades"
msgstr[0] "啟動中手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active grenade"
msgid ""
"This fragmentation grenade is active, and will explode any second now.  "
"Better throw it!"
msgstr "一个拔了插销的手雷，活脱脱的烫手山芋，赶紧扔敌人脸上！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/price_overrides/grenades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "EMP手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "EMP grenade"
msgid ""
"A grenade that generates an electromagnetic pulse with a low-inductance "
"capacitor bank discharged into a single-loop antenna.  It also produces a "
"mild electric shock cloud.  Use this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, "
"turning it into an active EMP grenade.  You will then have three seconds "
"before it detonates, creating an EMP field that damages robots and drains "
"bionic energy."
msgstr ""
"一个使用低电感电容连接单环天线放电来产生电磁脉冲的EMP手雷。放电会产生一团会轻微电击敌人的电云。拔下插销来使用EMP手雷，你有三秒时间去扔掉它，它会产生一"
"个EMP电场来破坏机器人和消耗生化能量，以使其周围的电子设备瘫痪。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "EMP grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "scrambler grenade"
#, c-format
msgid "You pull the pin on the %s."
msgstr "你拉開 %s 的安全插銷。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "active EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "啟動中EMP手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active EMP grenade"
msgid ""
"This EMP grenade is active and will shortly detonate, creating a large EMP "
"field that damages robots and drains bionic energy, as well as a mild "
"electric shock cloud.  You may not want to be holding it much longer."
msgstr "很好，这个EMP手雷已经被激活了，很快就会引爆并产生电磁脉冲以及一团电云，这会破坏附近的机器人并损耗生化能量。你需要做的就是把它用力丢出去，然后就等着瞧吧。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/price_overrides/grenades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "incendiary grenade"
msgid_plural "incendiary grenades"
msgstr[0] "燃燒手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "incendiary grenade"
msgid ""
"A military-grade incendiary hand grenade.  Use this item to pull the pin and "
"start the fuse.  You will then have five seconds before it explodes into a "
"raging inferno; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一个军用燃烧手雷，使用此物品以拔掉插销。之后五秒它就会把周围烧成火焰地狱，记得扔远点。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active incendiary grenade"
msgid_plural "active incendiary grenades"
msgstr[0] "啟動的燃燒手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active incendiary grenade"
msgid ""
"An active incendiary grenade, likely to burst into an inferno any second now. "
" Better throw it!"
msgstr "一个拔了插销的燃烧手雷，随时都会变成火焰地狱，赶紧扔敌人脸上！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tear gas grenade"
msgid_plural "tear gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "催淚瓦斯榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "tear gas grenade"
msgid ""
"A canister grenade filled with noxious irritant.  Use this item to pull the "
"pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active tear gas grenade.  In five "
"seconds it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for some time.  This gas "
"damages and slows those who enter it, as well as obscuring vision and scent."
msgstr ""
"一个装满强烈刺激性气体的筒状手雷。使用该物品将会拔下保险销并点燃引信。五秒后它会开始释放具有高度毒性的气体，让所有进入毒气的倒霉蛋受到毒害，速度下降，同时阻"
"碍视线和掩盖气味。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armed tear gas grenade"
msgid_plural "armed tear gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "催泪手雷（激活）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "armed tear gas grenade"
msgid ""
"This tear gas grenade has had its pin removed and is (or will shortly be) "
"expelling highly noxious gas."
msgstr "这个催泪手雷的插销已被拔出，并且正在释放有毒气体。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "殺蟲瓦斯手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid ""
"A canister grenade filled with insecticidal solution.  Use this item to pull "
"the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active insecticidal grenade.  "
"In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile gas that is highly toxic to "
"insect life forms."
msgstr "一个装满杀虫溶剂的筒状手雷。使用该物品将会拔下插销并点燃引信。五秒后它会开始释放对昆虫具有高度毒性的挥发性喷雾。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armed insecticidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed insecticidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "殺蟲瓦斯手榴彈（啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "armed insecticidal gas canister"
msgid ""
"This insecticidal grenade has had its pin removed and is (or will shortly be) "
"expelling highly toxic gas."
msgstr "这个杀虫剂手雷的插销已被拔出，并且正在释放有毒气体。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "粗製殺蟲瓦斯手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid ""
"A makeshift canister grenade filled with insecticidal solution.  Use this "
"item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active "
"insecticidal grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile gas "
"that is highly toxic to insect life forms."
msgstr "一个装满杀虫溶剂的自制筒状手雷。使用该物品将会拔下插销并点燃引信。五秒后它会开始释放对昆虫具有高度毒性的挥发性喷雾。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "自制杀虫剂手雷（激活）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid ""
"This makeshift insecticidal grenade has had its pin removed and is (or will "
"shortly be) expelling highly toxic gas."
msgstr "这个自制杀虫剂手雷的插销已被拔出，并且正在释放有毒气体。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "packed disposable rocket launcher"
msgid_plural "packed disposable rocket launchers"
msgstr[0] "封装好的一次性火箭发射器"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "packed disposable rocket launcher"
msgid ""
"A packed, disposable light anti-tank rocket launcher.  Once fired, it cannot "
"be reloaded and must be disposed of.  Activate it to pop it out and make it "
"ready to fire."
msgstr "一种封装成型的一次性轻型反坦克火箭发射器。一旦开火，就不能复装，必须处理。激活它，使其弹出并准备开火。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "packed disposable rocket launcher"
msgid "You pull the activating lever, readying the LAW to fire."
msgstr "你拉起保險, 準備發射66火箭彈。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "packed disposable rocket launcher"
msgid "M72 LAW (packed)"
msgid_plural "M72 LAWs (packed)"
msgstr[0] "M72 LAW火箭筒（封装）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M72 LAW (packed)" of item "packed disposable
#. rocket launcher"
msgid ""
"The M72 LAW (Light Anti-armor Weapon) is a one-time use lightweight rocket "
"launcher, meant to take out tanks and other armored vehicles.  Designed to "
"replace the earlier Bazookas, it features a shaped-charge warhead to pierce "
"armor.  Though weaker than the more modern and heavier AT4, it's still in "
"service to this day.  Due to its design, you must unpack it to use it, and it "
"cannot be reloaded.  Activate to unpack."
msgstr ""
"M72 "
"LAW是一种一次性轻型火箭筒，用于打击坦克与其它装甲载具。它被设计来取代巴祖卡火箭筒，具有一个锥形装药弹头用来穿透装甲。尽管其威力比更为现代的AT4"
"火箭筒要弱，但它重量更轻，至今仍在服役。由于其设计，你在使用前必须将其展开，并且无法装填。激活以展开。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "SADM mininuke"
msgid_plural "SADM mininukes"
msgstr[0] "SADM微型核弹"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "SADM mininuke"
msgid ""
"The B54 Special Atomic Demolition Munition is an extremely powerful weapon, a "
"portable nuclear bomb, using the smallest nuclear warhead in US inventory.  "
"It is housed inside a extremely sturdy transit container.  Use it to activate "
"the timer.  You guess that the explosion would be large enough to take out a "
"small house."
msgstr ""
"B54"
"特种原子爆破弹药是一种威力极大的武器，这是一种便携式核弹，使用的是美国存有的最小的核弹头。它装在一个极其坚固的运输容器内。使用它来启动计时器。你觉得其爆炸的"
"威力足以摧毁一座小房子。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active SADM mininuke"
msgid_plural "active SADM mininukes"
msgstr[0] "SADM微型核弹（激活）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active SADM mininuke"
msgid ""
"The nuclear bomb looks no different from the outside, yet you know that the "
"device is armed and counting down.  You should probably get far, far away "
"from it."
msgstr "这枚核弹的外观看起来并无变化，但你知道这个装置已经激活，正在倒计时。你或许应该离它远远的。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "汽油彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "Molotov cocktail"
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a rag inserted.  Use this item to light the "
"rag.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your inventory to do "
"this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr "一罐瓶口塞著布條， 裡頭裝有易燃液體的瓶子。使用這個物品以點燃布條， 當然， 你需要有個打火機或火柴才行。點燃後， 投擲出去會產生火焰。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "Molotov cocktail"
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a flaming rag stoppered in its neck.  "
"Throwing it will shatter the bottle on impact and ignite a fireball.  "
"Dropping it will set you on fire, so don't do that unless you want to burn to "
"death."
msgstr "一瓶塞着一块点燃的破布的易燃液体。投出去就能令火焰漫出，当然不扔可是会火烧眉毛的，随手扔地上不小心乱丢的话就会让你尝到随手扔垃圾的教训。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/price_overrides/grenades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "干擾手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "scrambler grenade"
msgid ""
"A specialized grenade designed to scramble robots' IFF control chips.  This "
"converts the robot to your side for a short time, before the backup systems "
"kick in.  Use this item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into "
"an active scrambler grenade."
msgstr "这是一个特制的EMP手雷，用来获取机器人芯片的控制权，从而让它们站在你这边。可惜，效果只能维持一会，然后就会被机器人的备用系统取代。使用它来拔出插销。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "active scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "啟動中干擾手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active scrambler grenade"
msgid ""
"This scrambler grenade is active and will soon detonate, releasing a control "
"wave that temporarily converts robots to your side."
msgstr "一个拔了插销的扰频手雷，马上就会爆炸并发出一道控制波束，使机器人暂时与你为伍。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/price_overrides/grenades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "煙霧彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "smoke bomb"
msgid ""
"A canister grenade filled with a variety of pyrotechnic chemicals.  Use this "
"item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active smoke "
"bomb.  Five seconds after you do that, it will begin to expel a thick black "
"smoke.  This smoke will slow those who enter it, as well as obscuring vision "
"and scent."
msgstr "一个装满各种发烟物质的筒状手雷。使用该物品将会拔下插销并点燃引信。五秒后它会开始释放浓厚的黑烟，让所有进入其中的倒霉蛋速度下降，同时阻碍视线和掩盖气味。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armed smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "armed smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "啟動的煙霧彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "armed smoke bomb"
msgid ""
"This smoke bomb has had its pin removed and is (or will shortly be) expelling "
"thick smoke."
msgstr "这个烟雾弹的插销已被拔出，并且正在释放浓烟。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rocket candy"
msgid_plural "rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "糖制固態火箭燃料"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "rocket candy"
msgid ""
"A pear-shaped chunk of rocket candy obtained by heating saltpeter with sugar "
"and casting the obtained liquid.  Can serve as a rocket fuel, but also as a "
"smokescreen - if you light the narrow end, you should be able to throw it "
"before the flame reaches the broad end."
msgstr "梨形的火箭糖。加热硝石与糖的混合物熔融后凝固而成，可以作为火箭燃料，也可以用于制造烟幕——点燃较窄的一端，在烧尽之前把它丢出去。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "rocket candy"
msgid "Light candy"
msgstr "點燃糖果"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "rocket candy"
msgid "You light the rocket candy on fire.  Throw it!"
msgstr "你已經點燃了火箭糖。快扔了它!"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "burning rocket candy"
msgid_plural "burning rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "糖制固態火箭燃料（燃燒中）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "burning rocket candy"
msgid ""
"A chunk of rocket candy that has been lit on fire and burns with a loud hiss, "
"spewing forth large amounts of smoke."
msgstr "这是块已经点着了的火箭软糖，在响亮的嘶嘶燃烧声中喷涌出大量的浓烟。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "burning rocket candy"
msgid "You've already lit the fuse - get rid of it immediately!"
msgstr "你已經點燃了引信，立即把它丟出去！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "小型自製軍用炸藥手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts.  Use this item to "
"light the fuse.  You will then have five seconds before it explodes; throwing "
"it would be a good idea."
msgstr "用各种零件拼凑成的自制手雷。使用此物品来点燃导火索，之后你有差不多有5秒钟时间去扔掉它。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"You light the fuse on the improvised grenade.  Throw it before it blows up in "
"your face!"
msgstr "你点燃了自制手雷的引信。赶紧在你的脸被炸掉之前扔出去！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "active military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "小型自製軍用炸藥手榴彈（已啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"The fuse on this improvised grenade is lit, and it will explode any second "
"now.  Better throw it!"
msgstr "一个已经点燃了的自制手雷，活脱脱的烫手山芋，赶紧扔敌人脸上！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive small
#. homemade grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive homemade
#. grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active homemade grenade"
#, c-format
msgid "You've already lit the %s's fuse, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "你已經點燃了 %s 的引信, 試著把它投出去看看。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "military explosive homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "自製軍用炸藥手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "active military explosive homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "自製軍用炸藥手榴彈（已啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military explosive pipebomb"
msgid_plural "military explosive pipebombs"
msgstr[0] "軍用火藥鋼管炸彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "military explosive pipebomb"
msgid ""
"A section of steel pipe filled with military explosives.  Use this item to "
"pull the pin, giving you six seconds to get away from it before it detonates."
msgstr "一根塞满了军用级炸药的钢管。使用此物品来拔掉插销，之后你差不多有6秒钟逃出它的爆炸范围。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive pipebomb"
msgid "You pull the pin on the pipebomb."
msgstr "你拉開了鋼管炸彈的插銷。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active military explosive pipebomb"
msgid_plural "active military explosive pipebombs"
msgstr[0] "軍用炸藥鋼管炸彈（點燃）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive pipebomb"
msgid ""
"This pipebomb's pin is pulled, and it will explode any second now.  Throw it "
"immediately!"
msgstr "鋼管炸彈的插銷已經被拉開且隨時可能會爆炸。馬上將它丟出去！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military explosive bomb"
msgid_plural "military explosive bombs"
msgstr[0] "軍用火藥炸彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "military explosive bomb"
msgid ""
"A homemade explosive device, consisting of a large plastic jug filled with "
"military explosives and scrap metal, equipped with a delayed fuse.  Use this "
"item to pull the pin.  Once you do, it should explode after about 20 seconds."
msgstr "一个自制的爆炸装置，由一个装满了军用级炸药和废金属的大塑料罐制成，有个延时引信。使用此物品来拔出插销，20秒后就炸了。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive bomb"
msgid ""
"You pull the pin on the small bootleg fragmentation device.  Get rid of it "
"quickly!"
msgstr "你點燃了小型手工製破片爆破裝置的引線。你最好盡快遠離它!"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active military explosive bomb"
msgid_plural "active military explosive bombs"
msgstr[0] "軍用火藥炸彈（點燃）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive bomb"
msgid ""
"A homemade explosive device, consisting of a large plastic jug filled with "
"military explosives and scrap metal.  Its fuse has been lit, its final "
"countdown starting."
msgstr "一个自制炸弹，由一个装满了军用级炸药和废金属的大塑料罐制成，有个延时引信。引信已经被触发，它即将迎来终结。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive bomb"
msgid "You've already pulled the pin - run!"
msgstr "你已經拔開了保險銷－快跑！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military explosive 50 L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "military explosive 50 L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "军用炸药自制 50 升油罐炸弹"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "military explosive 50 L barrel bomb"
msgid ""
"A metal keg filled with military explosives.  Once it has been activated, it "
"will explode after 100 seconds, raining fire and steel on everything in sight."
msgstr "一个装满了军用级炸药的金属罐。起爆药放置在核心以确保点燃后 100 秒能完全引爆，向视野中的一切泼洒钢铁与烈焰之雨。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "military explosive 50 L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "military explosive 100 L barrel bomb"
msgid "Activate fuze"
msgstr "點燃引信"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive 50 L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive 100 L barrel bomb"
msgid "You activate the fuze on the barrel bomb.  Clear the area!"
msgstr "你點燃了桶裝炸彈的引線。淨空這個地區！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active military explosive 50 L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "active military explosive 50 L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "军用炸药自制 50 升油罐炸弹（点燃）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive 50 L barrel bomb"
msgid ""
"A metal keg filled with military explosives.  It has been activated and will "
"soon explode, delivering its entire destructive power to everything in sight."
msgstr "一个装满了军用级炸药的金属罐。引信已经激活了，一旦它引燃了中间的起爆药，金属罐就会爆炸，具有毁灭视野内的一切物品的破坏力。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive 50 L barrel
#. bomb"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active military explosive 100 L barrel
#. bomb"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active 50 L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active 100 L barrel bomb"
msgid "You've already activated the bomb - clear the area immediately!"
msgstr "你已经激活了引信，赶紧离开这里！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military explosive 100 L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "military explosive 100 L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "军用炸药自制 100 升油罐炸弹"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "military explosive 100 L barrel bomb"
#. ~ Description of "100 L barrel bomb"
msgid ""
"A 100 L metal barrel filled with military explosives.  Once it has been "
"activated it will explode after 100 seconds, raining fire and steel on "
"everything in sight."
msgstr "一个装满了军用级炸药的 100 升金属罐。起爆药放置在核心以确保点燃后 100 秒能完全引爆，向视野中的一切泼洒钢铁与烈焰之雨。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active military explosive 100 L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "active military explosive 100 L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "军用炸药自制 100 升油罐炸弹（点燃）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive 100 L barrel bomb"
#. ~ Description of "active 100 L barrel bomb"
msgid ""
"A 100 L metal barrel filled with military explosives.  It has been activated "
"and will soon explode, delivering its entire destructive power to everything "
"in sight."
msgstr "一个装满了军用级炸药的 100 升金属罐。引信已经激活了，一旦它引燃了中间的起爆药，金属罐就会爆炸，具有毁灭视野内的一切物品的破坏力。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "小型自製手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from spare parts.  Use this "
"item to light the fuse.  You will then have 5 seconds before it explodes; "
"throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "用各种零件拼凑成的自制手雷。使用此物品来点燃导火索，之后你有差不多有5秒钟时间去扔掉它。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "active small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "小型自製手榴彈（已啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "自製手榴彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "active homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "自製手榴彈（已啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pipebomb"
msgid_plural "pipebombs"
msgstr[0] "鋼管炸彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "pipebomb"
msgid ""
"A section of steel pipe filled with explosives.  Use this item to light the "
"fuse, giving you six seconds to get away from it before it detonates.  You'll "
"need a lighter or some matches to use it."
msgstr "一根塞满了炸药的钢管，带有引信。使用此物品来点燃引信，之后你差不多有6秒钟逃出它的爆炸范围。你需要一个打火机或者火柴来点燃引信。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pipebomb"
msgid "You light the fuse on the pipe bomb."
msgstr "你點燃了鋼管炸彈的引信。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active pipebomb"
msgid_plural "active pipebombs"
msgstr[0] "鋼管炸彈（已啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active pipebomb"
msgid ""
"This pipebomb's fuse is lit, and it will explode any second now.  Throw it "
"immediately!"
msgstr "鋼管炸彈的引信已經被點燃且隨時可能會爆炸。馬上將它丟出去！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade bomb"
msgid_plural "homemade bombs"
msgstr[0] "自製炸彈"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade bomb"
msgid ""
"A homemade explosive device, consisting of a large plastic jug filled with "
"stable explosives and scrap metal, equipped with a long fuse.  Use this item "
"to light the fuse.  Once you do, it should explode after about 20 seconds."
msgstr "这是一个自制炸弹，由一个装满了稳定炸药和废金属的大塑料罐制成，有根长长的导火索。使用此物品来点燃引信，20秒后就炸了。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "homemade bomb"
msgid ""
"You light the fuse on the small improvised fragmentation device.  Get rid of "
"it quickly!"
msgstr "你點燃了小型粗製破片爆破裝置的引線。你最好盡快遠離它!"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade bomb"
msgid ""
"A homemade explosive device, consisting of a large plastic jug filled with "
"stable explosives and scrap metal.  Its fuse has been lit, its final "
"countdown starting."
msgstr "一个自制炸弹，由一个装满了军用级炸药和废金属的大塑料罐制成，有个延时引信。引信已经被触发，它即将迎来终结。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "homemade bomb"
msgid "You've already lit the fuse - run!"
msgstr "你已經點燃了引信, 跑!"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade demolition charge"
msgid_plural "homemade demolition charges"
msgstr[0] "自製炸藥包"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade demolition charge"
msgid ""
"An improvised demolition charge.  Use this item to light the fuse.  You will, "
"of course, need a lighter or matches in your inventory to do this.  20 "
"seconds after lighting the fuse, it will explode, so get away!"
msgstr "一个自制的炸药包。激活此物品可以点燃它，当然，你得有个打火机或火柴。引信燃烧时间有20秒，在爆炸前，快点跑吧！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "homemade demolition charge"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "acetylene lamp (off)"
#, c-format
msgid "You light the %s."
msgstr "你點亮了 %s。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homemade demolition charge (lit)"
msgid_plural "homemade demolition charges (lit)"
msgstr[0] "自製炸藥包（點燃）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "homemade demolition charge (lit)"
msgid ""
"The fuse on this primitive demolition charge is lit and hissing.  It'll "
"explode any moment now."
msgstr "這個原始炸藥包的引線已經點燃並嘶嘶作響。將會隨時被引爆。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "50 L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "50 L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "50 升油罐炸弹"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "50 L barrel bomb"
msgid ""
"A metal keg filled with stable explosives.  Contains a volatile explosive "
"core, so 100 seconds after the fuse has been lit the charge will detonate "
"completely, delivering its entire destructive power to everything in sight."
msgstr "一个装满了许多稳定炸药的金属罐。起爆药放置在核心以确保点燃后 100 秒能完全引爆，并具有毁灭视野内的一切物品的破坏力。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "50 L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "100 L barrel bomb"
msgid "Activate fuse"
msgstr "点燃引信"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "50 L barrel bomb"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "100 L barrel bomb"
msgid "You activate the fuse on the barrel bomb.  Clear the area!"
msgstr "你激活了自制油罐炸弹的引信。马上离开！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active 50 L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "active 50 L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "50 升油罐炸弹（点燃）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active 50 L barrel bomb"
msgid ""
"A metal keg filled with stable explosives.  The fuse has been lit and once it "
"ignites the primary explosive, the bomb will detonate and rain fire and steel "
"on everything in sight."
msgstr "一个装满了许多稳定炸药的金属罐。导火索已经点燃了，一旦它引燃了中间的起爆药，金属罐就会爆炸并向视野中的一切泼洒钢铁与烈焰之雨。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "100 L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "100 L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "100 升油罐炸弹"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active 100 L barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "active 100 L barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "100 升油罐炸弹（点燃）"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "60 mm mortar propellant charge"
msgid_plural "60 mm mortar propellant charges"
msgstr[0] "60mm 迫击炮弹装药"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "60 mm mortar propellant charge"
msgid ""
"Small explosive in a form of donut without a piece, this thing is designed to "
"be attached on the mortar shell tail, to increase the projectile velocity "
"and, therefore, its range.  Since the projectile it was connected to was "
"already shot, you can only cut it for its content."
msgstr "这种呈无缺口甜甜圈状的小型爆炸物，设计用于安装在迫击炮弹尾部，以提高炮弹速度，从而增加其射程。由于它所连接的炮弹已经发射，所以只能切开它以获取内部物品。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electric firestarter"
msgid_plural "electric firestarters"
msgstr[0] "電子點火器"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "electric firestarter"
msgid ""
"A crudely-made electric firestarter, which can function as an inefficient "
"lighter."
msgstr "一个做工简陋的电子生火工具，也可以当作一只效率不高的打火机。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bow fire drill"
msgid_plural "bow fire drills"
msgstr[0] "弓式鑽火器"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "bow fire drill"
msgid ""
"A simple item for starting fires with friction between a notched plank and "
"wooden shaft.  The shaft is spun rapidly with a sawing motion by a bowstring "
"wrapped around it.  Very slow to acquire a usable ember."
msgstr "简单的生火装置，用木轴在凹槽木板上摩擦以取得火种。将木轴缠绕在弓弦上，像拉锯一样使它快速旋转。以这种方式生火速度非常慢。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pump fire drill"
msgid_plural "pump fire drills"
msgstr[0] "泵式鑽火器"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "pump fire drill"
msgid ""
"A simple item for starting fires by friction between a notched plank and "
"wooden shaft, with a flywheel attached.  The shaft is spun rapidly with a "
"pumping motion by a cord wrapped around it.  Slow to acquire a usable ember."
msgstr "易洛魁族人发明的简单生火装置，用带飞轮的木轴在凹槽木板上摩擦以取得火种。轴上缠有回绕的绳索，泵动此装置即可带动木轴高速旋转。以这种方式生火速度比较慢。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flint and steel"
msgid_plural "sets of flint and steel"
msgstr[0] "一套打火石"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "flint and steel"
msgid ""
"A piece of flint paired with a hardened high carbon steel striker.  Use it to "
"spark a flame."
msgstr "这是一片燧石和一根高碳钢撞针。用它来点燃火焰。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lighter"
msgid_plural "lighters"
msgstr[0] "打火機"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "lighter"
msgid ""
"A disposable plastic lighter, capable of creating a small flame with the "
"flick of a finger.  Allows you to use various drugs like cigarettes, light "
"explosives like Molotov cocktails, or light nearby items on fire."
msgstr "一个一次性的塑料打火机。打火机可以用来点燃香烟、燃烧瓶之类的东西。还可以用它来生火，从而点燃附近的可燃物。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magnifying glass"
msgid_plural "magnifying glasses"
msgstr[0] "放大鏡"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "magnifying glass"
msgid ""
"A magnifying glass, for closely examining fine details.  It can also be used "
"for starting fires if direct sunlight is available."
msgstr "放大镜，用于观察事物的细节。如果有直射的阳光，也可以用来生火。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crude glass lens"
msgid_plural "crude glass lenses"
msgstr[0] "簡易玻璃鏡片"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "crude glass lens"
msgid ""
"A very low-quality focusing lens, made from non-optical-grade glass.  Useless "
"for building most optical devices, but you can start a fire with it if "
"sunlight is available."
msgstr "一个质量非常低的聚焦透镜，用非光学玻璃制成。对于制造大多数光学设备来说都是没用的，但如果阳光充足，你可以用它生火。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fire piston"
msgid_plural "fire pistons"
msgstr[0] "活塞打火器"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "fire piston"
msgid ""
"A firestarting tool of Southeast Asian origin, consisting of a thin, hollow "
"wooden cylinder sealed at one end and open at the other, and a wooden piston "
"forming an airtight circular seal with it, making use of rapid and adiabatic "
"air compression to ignite a piece of tinder.  It also comes with a tinder "
"container to keep tinder dry.  Use it to start a fire."
msgstr ""
"起源于东南亚的生火装置，由一个一端密封另一端敞开的薄壁空心木圆筒、一个与之形成气密的圆形木质活塞组成，利用快速压缩绝热空气来点燃火绒。此外，它还配有一个火绒"
"罐，用来保持火绒干燥。激活它以生火。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "matchbook"
msgid_plural "matchbooks"
msgstr[0] "火柴紙板"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "matchbook"
msgid ""
"A small book of matches with a coarse strike surface on the outside flap for "
"lighting them.  Allows you to use various drugs like cigarettes, light "
"explosives like Molotov cocktails, or light nearby items on fire.  Due to the "
"matches being lightly glued to the matchbook, they can be removed, but not "
"replaced on the book."
msgstr ""
"一板火柴，纸板外侧有个能摩擦点燃火柴的粗糙表面。用于使用香烟等毒品，或是点燃燃烧瓶等爆炸物，也可以点燃附近的物品。由于火柴被轻轻地粘在火柴盒上，因此可以将其"
"取下，但无法直接更换。\"曾经流行于世界，而后逐渐的被打火机取代，但如今在你的手里，绽放的不只是火焰。\""

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "survival match"
msgid_plural "survival matches"
msgstr[0] "生存火柴"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "survival match"
msgid "A solid strike anywhere match.  One and done."
msgstr "一根随处可以擦燃的火柴，只要这一个就能生火。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "matchbox"
msgid_plural "matchboxes"
msgstr[0] "火柴盒"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "matchbox"
msgid ""
"A small box of matches with a coarse strike surface on the side for lighting "
"them.  Allows you to use various drugs like cigarettes, light explosives like "
"Molotov cocktails, or light nearby items on fire."
msgstr ""
"一盒火柴，侧面有个能摩擦点燃火柴的粗糙表面。使用许多物品都需要火柴，例如香烟及某些等各种药物，或是点燃燃烧瓶等。你也可以使用火柴来点燃附近的物品。\n"
"\n"
"\"曾经流行于世界，而后逐渐的被打火机取代，但如今在你的手里，绽放的不只是火焰。\""

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "refillable lighter"
msgid_plural "refillable lighters"
msgstr[0] "可充填打火機"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "refillable lighter"
msgid ""
"A stylish lighter featuring a flip-top cover and a refuelable tank, capable "
"of creating a small flame with the flick of a finger.  Allows you to use "
"various drugs like cigarettes, light explosives like Molotov cocktails, or "
"light nearby items on fire."
msgstr "一个时髦的可补充燃料的翻盖打火机。可以用来点燃香烟、燃烧瓶之类的东西，或点燃附近的可燃物。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "refillable lighter"
msgid "You flick the lighter."
msgstr "你彈動打火機。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "refillable lighter"
msgid ""
"A stylish lighter featuring a flip-top cover and a refuelable tank.  It is "
"lit."
msgstr "一个可补充燃料的翻盖打火机。已经点燃了。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "refillable lighter"
msgid "You extinguish the lighter."
msgstr "你熄滅打火機。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "refillable butane lighter"
msgid_plural "refillable butane lighters"
msgstr[0] "可充填打火機"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "refillable butane lighter"
msgid ""
"A large lighter with a trigger and a safety, reloaded by fitting a can of "
"butane inside the base.  Allows you to use various drugs like cigarettes, "
"light explosives like Molotov cocktails, or light nearby items on fire."
msgstr "一个带有扳机和保险装置的大型打火机，通过在底座内安装一罐丁烷来重新填充。可以点燃香烟、燃烧瓶之类的东西。还可以用它来生火，从而点燃附近的可燃物。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ember carrier"
msgid_plural "ember carriers"
msgstr[0] "餘火裝載器"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "ember carrier"
msgid ""
"A small container for holding tinder, with holes punched in it to provide a "
"controlled airflow.  It can nurture a smoldering ember for a long time, to "
"start fires without modern tools."
msgstr "带有通气孔，用于保存火种的小型容器。可以让余火保持很长一段时间，缺乏现代工具时可用于生火。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "ember carrier"
msgid "You light the tinder."
msgstr "你點亮火種。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "ember carrier"
msgid "The ember carrier is out of tinder."
msgstr "餘火裝載器沒有火種。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ "need_fire_msg" action message of item "ember carrier"
msgid "You need a lighter or fire to light this."
msgstr "你需要一個打火機或火源來點燃它。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ember carrier (lit)"
msgid_plural "ember carriers (lit)"
msgstr[0] "餘火裝載器 (點燃)"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "ember carrier (lit)"
msgid ""
"A small container for holding tinder, with holes punched in it to provide a "
"controlled airflow.  An ember is smoldering inside it, and can be used to "
"start a campfire."
msgstr "一个用来装引火物的小盒子，盒子上有个小洞以保持空气流通，里面的引火物里还有些火星在缓缓燃烧。它可以用来点燃篝火。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "ember carrier (lit)"
msgid "The ember is extinguished."
msgstr "餘燼熄滅了。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electric lighter"
msgid_plural "electric lighters"
msgstr[0] "电打火机"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "electric lighter"
msgid "A rechargeable electric lighter."
msgstr "可充电电打火机。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mini lighter"
msgid_plural "mini lighters"
msgstr[0] "微型打火機"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
#. ~ Description of "mini lighter"
msgid ""
"A miniature disposable plastic lighter, capable of creating a small flame "
"with the flick of a finger.  Allows you to use various drugs, like "
"cigarettes, light explosives like Molotov cocktails, or light nearby items on "
"fire."
msgstr "一个一次性的小型塑料打火机。打火机可以用来点燃香烟、燃烧瓶之类的东西。还可以用它来生火，从而点燃附近的可燃物。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crash axe"
msgid_plural "crash axes"
msgstr[0] "應急斧"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "crash axe"
msgid ""
"A short, lightweight emergency tool with a quarter-circular blade, a short "
"pick opposite the blade, and an insulated handle.  Used on airplanes to chop "
"down or pry walls or cabinets to gain access in case of a fire."
msgstr "一个轻便应急用短斧，由一个扇形的斧刃、与斧刃相对的锄尖和一根绝缘手柄组成。用于在飞机火灾时砍开或撬开墙壁或机舱。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large fire extinguisher"
msgid_plural "large fire extinguishers"
msgstr[0] "大型滅火器"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "large fire extinguisher"
msgid ""
"An emergency fire extinguisher containing five gallons of fire-retardant "
"foam.  Useful for putting out adjacent fires."
msgstr "裝有五加侖阻燃泡沫的緊急滅火器。可用於撲滅鄰近的火焰。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fire axe"
msgid_plural "fire axes"
msgstr[0] "消防斧"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "fire axe"
msgid ""
"A large, two-handed pickhead axe normally used by firefighters.  It makes a "
"powerful melee weapon, but is a bit slow to recover between swings.  The "
"pickhead is for spiking into doors and glass and is not effective at hooking "
"limbs of opponents."
msgstr ""
"一把用于清理着火或易燃材料，切断火势蔓延的大斧，还可以劈开被烧变形的门窗，解救被困的人，如今可以用来解救受困于腐烂身体中的痛苦灵魂。一种强大的近战武器，但在"
"摆动之间恢复有点慢。镐头用于刺入门和玻璃，对钩住对手的四肢无效。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "fire axe"
msgid "Marrying strap for a Halligan bar."
msgstr "消防破拆棍绑带"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Halligan bar"
msgid_plural "Halligan bars"
msgstr[0] "哈利根鐵鋌"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "Halligan bar"
msgid ""
"A heavy, multiple-use tool commonly carried by firefighters, law enforcement, "
"and military rescue units.  Use it to open locked doors without destroying "
"them or to lift manhole covers.  You could also wield it to bash some heads "
"in."
msgstr "重型多用工具，通常被消防员、执法部门和救灾部队使用。用它来撬开房门和井盖吧！当然，砸丧尸也行。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small fire extinguisher"
msgid_plural "small fire extinguishers"
msgstr[0] "小滅火器"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "small fire extinguisher"
msgid ""
"A handheld fire extinguisher containing a liter of highly compressed CO2 gas. "
" Useful for putting out adjacent fires."
msgstr "这是一个手提灭火器，内含高压的二氧化碳气体。能够有效的扑灭附近的火势。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "throwable fire extinguisher"
msgid_plural "throwable fire extinguishers"
msgstr[0] "投擲式滅火器"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "throwable fire extinguisher"
msgid ""
"A fire extinguisher in grenade form.  While not as effective as a regular "
"fire extinguisher, you can use it from a farther distance.  It has a plastic "
"plug that can be pulled, but is primarily activated by heat, so just throw it "
"into the flames."
msgstr "一个手榴弹式的灭火器。虽然效果不如常规灭火器，但可以从远处使用它。它有个可以拉开的塑料保险销，但主要依靠受热后自动引爆，所以只要把它扔进火中即可。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "throwable fire extinguisher"
msgid "Pull plug"
msgstr "拔開保險"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "throwable fire extinguisher"
msgid "You pull the plug on the extinguisher grenade."
msgstr "你拔開了投擲式滅火器的保險銷。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active throwable fire extinguisher"
msgid_plural "active throwable fire extinguishers"
msgstr[0] "投擲式滅火器（已啟動）"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "active throwable fire extinguisher"
msgid ""
"An active extinguisher grenade, likely to burst any second now.  Better throw "
"it!"
msgstr "一个拔了插销的投掷型灭火手雷，随时都会引爆，快点扔掉吧！"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pike pole"
msgid_plural "pike poles"
msgstr[0] "消防火鉤"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "pike pole"
msgid ""
"A durable tool consisting of a sturdy fiberglass shaft tipped with a small "
"steel hook."
msgstr ""
"一把由坚固牢靠的玻璃纤维手柄和手柄顶端的小号钢制弯钩制成的耐用工具，通常用于救援火灾现场时的破拆吊顶、拉钩电线及清理阻碍工作，也可以用来掀起丧尸的头盖骨。使"
"用时请小心不要把自己的皮磕破了。（注：消防火钩英文名为pike pole）"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "EOD hot stick"
msgid_plural "EOD hot sticks"
msgstr[0] "排爆操作杆"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "EOD hot stick"
msgid ""
"A durable tool consisting of a sturdy fiberglass shaft tipped with a set of 3 "
"hooks, one large opposed by two small.  Hot sticks are used to maintain some "
"standoff distance when manual manipulation of explosives is necessary, and "
"robot assistance is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"一把结实耐用的工具，由坚固的玻璃纤维主体杆和其顶部三个钩子组成，其中一个大钩子正对着两个小钩子。当需要手动操纵爆炸装置而排爆机器人又无法协助时，操作杆可以用"
"于保持一定的距离。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "New York hook"
msgid_plural "New York hooks"
msgstr[0] "紐約鈎"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
#. ~ Description of "New York hook"
msgid ""
"A shaft with a pair of hooks on one end and a pry bar on the other, forged "
"from a single piece of steel."
msgstr "一根金属杆，一端有个双钩，另一端是一个撬棍，用一整块钢锭锻造而成。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic fish trap"
msgid_plural "plastic fish traps"
msgstr[0] "塑膠製捕魚器"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic fish trap"
msgid ""
"A makeshift fish trap made from plastic bottles.  It's simple, even "
"primitive, but easy to use.  The principle of action: the fish swims inside "
"to eat the bait, but can't get out.  Not humane and prohibited by law, but "
"there are no cops left to care."
msgstr ""
"由塑料瓶改装来的简易捕鱼器。非常简单，甚至原始，但是易用。工作原理：鱼为了吃饵游进来，但是出不去。这玩意和自由博爱背道而驰，同时被美帝法律禁止，不过末世后谁"
"还把条子当回事呢。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "basket fish trap"
msgid_plural "basket fish traps"
msgstr[0] "籃子捕魚器"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "basket fish trap"
msgid ""
"A long wicker fish trap made from bark, reeds, cordage, or other natural "
"materials.  It's a staple fishing tool in many pre-industrial societies.  The "
"principle of action: the fish swims inside to eat the bait, but can't get out."
msgstr "一个用树皮、芦苇、绳索或其他天然材料制成的长长的柳条捕鱼器。它是许多前工业化社会的主要捕鱼工具。工作原：鱼为了吃饵游进来，但是出不去。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fishing hook"
msgid_plural "fishing hooks"
msgstr[0] "魚鉤"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "fishing hook"
msgid "A simple metal fishing hook."
msgstr "一个简易金属鱼钩。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "improvised fishing hook"
msgid_plural "improvised fishing hooks"
msgstr[0] "粗製魚鉤"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "improvised fishing hook"
msgid "An improvised fishing hook carved from wood or bone."
msgstr "一個由木頭或是骨頭製成的粗製魚鉤。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "basic fishing rod"
msgid_plural "basic fishing rods"
msgstr[0] "簡易釣竿"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "basic fishing rod"
msgid ""
"'Fishing rod' might be a bit too charitable of a description.  In truth, this "
"is a stick with a piece of string and a hook."
msgstr "用 \"釣竿\" 來稱呼它有點名過其實。事實上， 這只是一根帶著繩子和鈎子的木棒而已。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pro fishing rod"
msgid_plural "pro fishing rods"
msgstr[0] "專業釣魚竿"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "pro fishing rod"
msgid ""
"A professional fishing rod with a matching set of weights.  With this, you "
"should be able to catch 'em all."
msgstr "一把专业的钓鱼竿，配有适宜的配重。钩弯饵鲜，鲤鱼王都能给你钓起来。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "two-piece fishing rod (packed)"
msgid_plural "two-piece fishing rods (packed)"
msgstr[0] "两节式鱼竿（收起）"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "two-piece fishing rod (packed)"
msgid ""
"A commercial two-piece fishing rod that has been disassembled for ease of "
"transport and storage."
msgstr "一种商用两节式钓鱼竿，已拆卸，便于运输和储存。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "two-piece fishing rod (packed)"
msgid "Assemble"
msgstr "组装"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "two-piece fishing rod (packed)"
msgid "You put together your two-piece fishing rod."
msgstr "你把两节式鱼竿组装在一起。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "two-piece fishing rod"
msgid_plural "two-piece fishing rods"
msgstr[0] "两节式鱼竿"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "two-piece fishing rod"
msgid "A commercial two-piece fishing rod, assembled and ready for use."
msgstr "商业两节式钓鱼竿，已组装好并准备使用。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "two-piece fishing rod"
msgid "Disassemble"
msgstr "拆解"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "two-piece fishing rod"
msgid "You take apart your two-piece fishing rod."
msgstr "你把两件式钓鱼竿拆开。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "telescoping fishing rod (packed)"
msgid_plural "telescoping fishing rods (packed)"
msgstr[0] "伸缩式钓鱼竿（缩回）"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "telescoping fishing rod (packed)"
msgid ""
"A commercial telescoping fishing rod that has been retracted for ease of "
"transport and storage."
msgstr "一种商用伸缩式钓鱼竿，已缩回，便于运输和储存。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "telescoping fishing rod (packed)"
msgid "You extend your telescoping fishing rod."
msgstr "你伸出伸缩式钓鱼竿。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "telescoping fishing rod"
msgid_plural "telescoping fishing rods"
msgstr[0] "伸缩式钓鱼竿"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "telescoping fishing rod"
msgid "A commercial telescoping fishing rod, extended and ready for use."
msgstr "商用伸缩式钓鱼竿，已展开并随时可用。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "telescoping fishing rod"
msgid "You retract your telescoping fishing rod."
msgstr "你收回你的伸缩钓鱼竿。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic hand fishing reel"
msgid_plural "plastic hand fishing reels"
msgstr[0] "塑膠釣魚筒"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic hand fishing reel"
msgid ""
"A commercial hand fishing reel.  It is a short rod with a section on one end "
"with fishing line wrapped around it, with a rotating guard around that.  It "
"is not as effective as a normal fishing pole, but is much more compact."
msgstr "一种商用钓鱼轮。它是一根短杆，一头有个能够缠绕钓鱼线的滑轮，外面有一个能够旋转的护罩。它不像普通的钓竿那么有效，但比它们要紧凑得多。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden hand fishing reel"
msgid_plural "wooden hand fishing reels"
msgstr[0] "木制钓鱼轮"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden hand fishing reel"
msgid ""
"A short wooden rod with a section on one end with fishing line wrapped around "
"it, with a notch to put the string though to help pull in fish.  It is not as "
"effective as a normal fishing pole, but is much more compact than them."
msgstr "一根短木杆，末端有个用来绕鱼线的凹槽。这玩意没有常规钓竿好用，但比它们要紧凑得多。"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hand press"
msgid_plural "hand presses"
msgstr[0] "手動壓彈器"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
#. ~ Description of "hand press"
msgid ""
"A small hand press for hand loading firearm ammunition.  It comes with "
"everything you need to start hand loading your own munitions."
msgstr "小型的手工压弹机，足够你进行各种复装弹药制备。"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift shotshell 'press'"
msgid_plural "makeshift shotshell 'presses'"
msgstr[0] "粗製霰彈手壓器"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift shotshell 'press'"
msgid ""
"A collection of items improvised for field reloading of shotshells.  A plank "
"with a hole cut in the center, a medium-sized nail, and a whittled dowel are "
"used to seat wads, decap primers, and (carefully!) reprime hulls.  Powder and "
"shot are measured with a cut-down shotshell hull.  The opposite side of the "
"plank has been shaped to allow for roll-crimping of the plastic hulls.  "
"There's no provision for resizing, so reloaded hulls will fire best in the "
"firearm they were fired from."
msgstr ""
"一套可以用来随时重新装填霰弹的简易装置。它由一根中间开孔的木板、一根中号钉子和一根木销组成，分别用于放置填料、打开并（小心地）装上底火。火药和弹丸通过一颗切"
"短的霰弹壳来称量。木板的另一侧被制成能够碾压卷曲塑料弹壳的形状。这套装置不能改弹药口径，因此复装的霰弹在之前发射的枪里发射效果最好。"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kinetic bullet puller"
msgid_plural "kinetic bullet pullers"
msgstr[0] "卸彈器"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
#. ~ Description of "kinetic bullet puller"
msgid "A tool used for properly disassembling firearm ammunition."
msgstr "一个用来拆解子弹的装置。"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "internal gasoline tank"
msgid_plural "internal gasoline tanks"
msgstr[0] "内置汽油罐"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "internal gasoline tank"
msgid "The internal tank for a gasoline fuel cell bionic."
msgstr "用于汽油燃料电池CBM的内置燃料罐。"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "internal ethanol tank"
msgid_plural "internal ethanol tanks"
msgstr[0] "内置乙醇罐"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "internal ethanol tank"
msgid "The internal ethanol tank for an ethanol burner bionic."
msgstr "用于酒精锅炉CBM的内置燃料罐。"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "internal oil tank"
msgid_plural "internal oil tanks"
msgstr[0] "内置油罐"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "internal oil tank"
msgid "The internal oil tank for an oil generator bionic."
msgstr "用于燃油发电机CBM的内置油罐。"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "internal battery compartment"
msgid_plural "internal battery compartments"
msgstr[0] "内置电池仓"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "internal battery compartment"
msgid ""
"The internal compartment for holding medium sized batteries, for a battery "
"system bionic."
msgstr "电池供能CBM的一部分，用于容纳中型电池的内置电池仓。"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "integrated multitool"
msgid_plural "integrated multitool"
msgstr[0] "多功能整合工具手"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "integrated multitool"
msgid "Integrated bionic tools implanted in your fingers."
msgstr "植入手指的集成仿生工具。"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "integrated welder"
msgid_plural "integrated welder"
msgstr[0] "內置電焊機"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "integrated welder"
msgid "Integrated bionic miniature welding tool implanted in your fingers."
msgstr "一個小型仿生電焊機被植入到了你的手指中。"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "integrated multimeter"
msgid_plural "integrated multimeter"
msgstr[0] "內置三用電錶"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "integrated multimeter"
msgid "Integrated bionic multimeter implanted in your fingers."
msgstr "一個仿生三用電表被植入到了你的手指中。"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "integrated soldering iron"
msgid_plural "integrated soldering iron"
msgstr[0] "內置電烙鐵"

#: data/json/items/tool/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "integrated soldering iron"
msgid "Integrated soldering iron and screwdriver set."
msgstr "內置電烙鐵和螺絲起子工具組。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small kitchen knife"
msgid_plural "small kitchen knives"
msgstr[0] "小菜刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "small kitchen knife"
msgid "steak knife"
msgid_plural "steak knives"
msgstr[0] "餐刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "steak knife" of item "small kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A sharp knife designed for cutting meat.  It makes a poor melee weapon, but "
"is decent at butchering corpses."
msgstr "一把较为尖锐、带有小锯齿的西餐餐具，设计用来在餐桌上切牛排。虽然是把很差劲的近战武器，但用来屠宰尸体还行。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "small kitchen knife"
msgid "paring knife"
msgid_plural "paring knives"
msgstr[0] "削皮刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "paring knife" of item "small kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A short-bladed knife with a sharp blade, made for fine controlled cuts to "
"vegetables without using a cutting board."
msgstr "一把刀口锋利的短刃刀，可以在不使用砧板的情况下对蔬菜进行精细切割。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large kitchen knife"
msgid_plural "large kitchen knives"
msgstr[0] "大菜刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid "chef knife"
msgid_plural "chef knives"
msgstr[0] "廚師刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "chef knife" of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A long-bladed kitchen knife.  The blade is wider than the handle, giving room "
"for the wielder's knuckles, and it has a characteristic curve for a fast "
"rocking action for chopping vegetables.  It makes an acceptable melee weapon, "
"but the wide blade is unwieldy for butchering."
msgstr "一把长刃菜刀。刀刃比把手宽，为持刀者的指关节提供了空间，刀刃的特殊曲线使它在切菜时可以快速来回摇动。作为近战武器还行，但宽大的刀身在屠宰时不太方便。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid "carving knife"
msgid_plural "carving knives"
msgstr[0] "雕刻刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "carving knife" of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A long-bladed kitchen knife with a thin, slightly curved blade for deftly "
"slicing meat either in flat sheets or around the bone.  It makes a decent "
"melee weapon, and is excellent for butchery."
msgstr "一把长刃菜刀，有一个轻薄、稍微弯曲的刀刃，能够灵巧地将肉切成薄片或剔除骨头。一把不错的近战武器，屠宰时也十分好用。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid "bread knife"
msgid_plural "bread knives"
msgstr[0] "麵包刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "bread knife" of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"This knife has quite a long blade with a scalloped edge for cutting bread.  "
"It's not that sharp, but its length and heft mean it could do a bit of damage "
"and cause some nasty tearing."
msgstr "這把刀有著相當長用來切麵包的鋸齒刀刃。它不怎麼鋒利但是它的長度重量使它能夠造成一些傷害和陰險的撕裂傷。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "huge kitchen knife"
msgid_plural "huge kitchen knives"
msgstr[0] "巨型菜刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "huge kitchen knife"
msgid "butcher knife"
msgid_plural "butcher knives"
msgstr[0] "菜刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "butcher knife" of item "huge kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A sharp, heavy knife.  It makes a good melee weapon, and is an ideal item for "
"butchering corpses."
msgstr "一把锋利而厚重的刀子。是把不错的近战武器，也是用于屠宰尸体的理想工具。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cleaver"
msgid_plural "cleavers"
msgstr[0] "剁肉刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "cleaver"
msgid "meat cleaver"
msgid_plural "meat cleavers"
msgstr[0] "切肉刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "meat cleaver" of item "cleaver"
msgid ""
"A menacing-looking knife with a broad, square-shaped blade.  Its heft and "
"sharpness would make it a very effective melee weapon and an excellent "
"butchering tool."
msgstr "一把看起来很凶险的刀，刀身宽大，呈方形。它的重量和锋利度也使它成为一种非常有效的近战武器，也是一种优秀的屠宰工具。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "cleaver"
msgid "vegetable cleaver"
msgid_plural "vegetable cleavers"
msgstr[0] "切菜刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "vegetable cleaver" of item "cleaver"
msgid ""
"A menacing-looking knife with a broad, square shaped blade, curved for fast "
"vegetable chopping.  Its heft and sharpness make it a decent weapon as well, "
"although not as good as a meat cleaver."
msgstr "一把看起来很凶险的刀，刀身宽大，呈方形，刀刃弯曲，能够快速切开蔬菜。它的分量和锋利度也使它成为一种不错的武器，虽然不如剁肉刀。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "copper knife"
msgid_plural "copper knives"
msgstr[0] "銅刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of "copper knife"
msgid ""
"A knife made of crudely-worked copper with a simple handle.  Primitive, but a "
"step above stone-age."
msgstr "一把粗糙的自制铜刀，带着一个简单的把手。很原始，但比石器时代更上了一步。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze knife"
msgid_plural "bronze knives"
msgstr[0] "青銅小刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze knife"
msgid ""
"A cast bronze knife with a full tang, with a handle wrapped in cord and "
"leather, lovingly work-hardened and sharpened to a fine edge."
msgstr "一把铸造成型的青铜小刀，刀柄用绳索和皮革包裹，刃口经过精心加工硬化，十分锋利。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dive knife"
msgid_plural "dive knives"
msgstr[0] "潛水刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of "dive knife"
msgid ""
"A short, sturdy knife with a serrated edge for cutting lines and straps, and "
"a blunt tip for prying.  Used primarily by divers, this knife has been fitted "
"with cork to slow its descent if dropped underwater, so it takes up more "
"space than usual."
msgstr ""
"一个短而结实的匕首，锯齿状的刀刃能够切割绳子和皮带，边缘一个钝头可当做小型撬棍使用。这种刀主要由潜水员使用，它有个软木塞，如果落入水中，可以减缓下降速度，因"
"此它比普通的刀更占空间。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "honey scraper"
msgid_plural "honey scrapers"
msgstr[0] "割蜜刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of "honey scraper"
msgid ""
"A sharp, knife-like tool used for harvesting honey from beehives.  Makes a "
"passable melee weapon."
msgstr "一把锋利的刀状工具。用来从蜂巢收集蜂蜜。勉强能够拿来当近战武器。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pocket knife"
msgid_plural "pocket knives"
msgstr[0] "口袋刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of "pocket knife"
msgid ""
"A small pocket knife.  It isn't great for combat, but it's better than "
"nothing.  It's sharp enough to butcher with."
msgstr "一把小巧的折刀，作为武器那是相当糟糕，但总比没有好。不过足够用来切肉了。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone knife"
msgid_plural "stone knives"
msgstr[0] "石刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of "stone knife"
msgid ""
"A sharpened stone set into a hollowed handle.  Not nearly as usable as a "
"proper knife, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr "一块磨利的石头，插进一个带洞的手柄里。怎么看也不太像匕首，用起来也不那么方便，但总比赤手空拳要好。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boxcutter knife"
msgid_plural "boxcutter knives"
msgstr[0] "開箱刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of "boxcutter knife"
msgid ""
"A small knife designed for opening boxes.  It could cause some damage, but it "
"really should be used against inanimate objects.  It is too small to "
"effectively butcher corpses with."
msgstr "一把小巧且锋利的刀具，专门用来打开纸箱。它能造成一些伤害，但只能打中不会动的物体。它太小了，不能用来有效地屠宰尸体。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone chopper"
msgid_plural "stone choppers"
msgstr[0] "石製砍砸器"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of "stone chopper"
msgid ""
"A rock with sharpened edges, produced by knapping.  Works as a crude cutting "
"and butchering tool, if nothing else is available."
msgstr "一快有著銳利邊緣的石頭，由打製製成。可以拿來當做切割和屠宰的粗糙工具。如果沒有其他東西可用。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "digging stick"
msgid_plural "digging sticks"
msgstr[0] "掘土棒"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "digging stick"
msgid ""
"A large stick with the end carved into a broad blade for digging.  It could "
"be used to dig shallow pits, but not deep ones."
msgstr "一根长长的木棍，底端削成了类似锄头的宽刃形状。可以用来挖掘浅坑，但是挖不了多深。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "trowel"
msgid_plural "trowels"
msgstr[0] "園藝鏟"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "trowel"
msgid "A small, sharp gardening shovel, perfect for digging up grubs and worms."
msgstr "一把小巧的， 鋒利的園藝鏟， 非常適合挖掘幼蟲和蠕蟲。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hoe"
msgid_plural "hoes"
msgstr[0] "鋤頭"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "hoe"
msgid ""
"A farming implement.  You can use it to turn tillable land into a "
"slow-to-cross pile of dirt, or dig a shallow pit."
msgstr "一件农具。可用于把可耕种土地锄成难以穿行的土堆，或者挖一个浅坑。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze hoe"
msgid_plural "bronze hoes"
msgstr[0] "青銅鋤頭"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze hoe"
msgid ""
"A farming implement made from bronze.  The added heft and durability should "
"let you till soil for farming more easily as well."
msgstr "一把用青铜制成的农具，但增加的重量和耐用性应该让你更容易耕作土壤。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden shovel"
msgid_plural "wooden shovels"
msgstr[0] "木鏟"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden shovel"
msgid ""
"A crude shovel with a shovelhead made from wood, historically used as an "
"alternative to metal shovels when metal was too expensive.  It works passably "
"well, but really can't compare to a metal shovel."
msgstr "一把粗糙的铲子，铲头由木头制成，在历史上金属太贵时用作金属铲子的替代品。它功能类似铲子，但比真正的铲子差太多。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "metal rake"
msgid_plural "metal rakes"
msgstr[0] "金屬耙子"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "metal rake"
msgid "A sturdy metal rake, a must-have during autumn."
msgstr "堅固的金屬耙子，秋天的必備品。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic rake"
msgid_plural "plastic rakes"
msgstr[0] "塑膠耙子"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic rake"
msgid ""
"A cheap plastic rake.  Will break quite quickly if used for anything other "
"than raking leaves."
msgstr "一把廉价的塑料耙子。如果把它用于除了耙树叶以外的任何用途，都会很快损坏它。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scythe"
msgid_plural "scythes"
msgstr[0] "大鐮"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "scythe"
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned farming tool used to cut tall grass.  Despite being a giant "
"blade on the end of a stick, it is incredibly awkward to use for anything but "
"its intended purpose."
msgstr "老式农业工具，专门用来割杂草。尽管它的棍子末端装上了一片巨大的刀片，但除了本来的用途之外，它非常难以用于任何其他用途。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "scythe"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of an old-fashioned farming tool used to cut "
"tall grass."
msgstr "一把用于割杂草的老式农具的无趣、廉价的复制品。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grim reaper's scythe"
msgid_plural "grim reaper's scythes"
msgstr[0] "死神鐮刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "grim reaper's scythe"
msgid ""
"A long, crooked tool used to reap souls, with a skull engraved in its blade.  "
"Let the harvest begin."
msgstr "一把长而弯曲的镰刀，用来收割灵魂，刀片上刻着骷髅头骨。让收割开始吧。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shovel"
msgid_plural "shovels"
msgstr[0] "鏟子"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "shovel"
msgid "A digging tool.  Use it to dig pits adjacent to your location."
msgstr "一个挖坑工具，你可以用它在你周围挖坑。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "snow shovel"
msgid_plural "snow shovels"
msgstr[0] "雪鏟"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "snow shovel"
msgid ""
"A sturdy metal shovel used for picking up snow and moving it somewhere else.  "
"It was useful before the Cataclysm, but now it's useless."
msgstr "一种结实的金属铲，用来将雪铲除并把它移到其他地方。它在大灾变之前很有用，但现在已经没用了。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plastic snow shovel"
msgid_plural "plastic snow shovels"
msgstr[0] "塑膠雪鏟"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "plastic snow shovel"
msgid ""
"A cheap plastic shovel used for picking up snow and moving it somewhere else. "
" It was useful before the Cataclysm, but now it's useless."
msgstr "一种便宜的塑料铲，用来将雪铲除并把它移到其他地方。它在大灾变之前很有用，但现在已经没用了。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone sickle"
msgid_plural "stone sickles"
msgstr[0] "石鐮"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "stone sickle"
msgid ""
"A primitive tool for cutting grass.  The sharp, crescent-shaped stone at the "
"end of the handle is barely good enough for the job."
msgstr "一个用来割草的简易工具。手柄末端是一块磨尖的新月形石头，只能勉强完成这项工作。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json data/mods/MMA/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sickle"
msgid_plural "sickles"
msgstr[0] "鐮刀"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "sickle"
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned farming tool for cutting tall grass.  Despite being a "
"massive curved blade on a handle, it is incredibly awkward to use for "
"anything but its intended purpose."
msgstr "老式农业工具，专门用来割杂草。尽管它的棍子末端装上了一片巨大的刀片，但除了本来的用途之外，它非常难以用于任何其他用途。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze sickle"
msgid_plural "bronze sickles"
msgstr[0] "青銅鐮"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze sickle"
msgid ""
"A handheld grass-cutting tool with a cast bronze blade, fastened to a wood "
"handle wrapped with leather."
msgstr "一把手持割草工具，带有铸造而成的青铜刀片，固定在用皮革包裹的木把手上。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bill"
msgid_plural "bills"
msgstr[0] "長柄鍥"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "bill"
msgid ""
"A long, slightly curved and hooked steel blade on the end of a sturdy shaft.  "
"Could be used to thoroughly ruin something's day, or cut branches and small "
"trees."
msgstr "一个长长的，稍微弯曲和钩状斧头，结实地安装在柄端上。可以用来彻底弄糟某人的一天，或者用来砍树枝。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze bill"
msgid_plural "bronze bills"
msgstr[0] "青銅長柄鍥"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze bill"
msgid ""
"A long, slightly curved and hooked bronze blade on the end of a sturdy shaft. "
" Could be used to thoroughly ruin something's day, or cut branches and small "
"trees."
msgstr "一个结实地安装在柄端上的稍微弯曲的钩状青铜长斧头。可以用来彻底搞砸某人的一天，或者用来砍点灌木或者小树什么的。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hedge trimmer (off)"
msgid_plural "hedge trimmers (off)"
msgstr[0] "修枝機 (關閉)"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "hedge trimmer (off)"
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  A long line of "
"sharp-edged teeth extends from the engine; turning the trimmer on will make "
"them rapidly vibrate.  The poor man's chainsaw as far as the zombies are "
"concerned."
msgstr "無線， 雙面， 汽油動力修枝機。一長列鋒利的齒刃從發動機延伸出來， 啟動修剪時會讓它們快速振動。對付殭屍而言這是窮人版的電鋸。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ value of variable 'success_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_activate__trimmer" in use action of item "hedge trimmer
#. (off)"
msgid "With a roar, the hedge trimmer leaps to life!"
msgstr "隨著一陣咆哮, 修枝機啟動了!"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hedge trimmer (on)"
msgid_plural "hedge trimmers (on)"
msgstr[0] "修枝機 (啟動)"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ Description of "hedge trimmer (on)"
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  It is currently "
"on, ready to do some zombie topiary; use this item to turn it off."
msgstr "無線， 雙面， 汽油動力修枝機。目前正準備對殭屍修剪一下。使用它來關閉。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
#. ~ value of variable 'sound_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_running__trimmer" in use action of item "hedge trimmer
#. (on)"
msgid "Your hedge trimmer rumbles."
msgstr "你的修枝機正發出隆隆聲。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "atomic lamp"
msgid_plural "atomic lamps"
msgstr[0] "原子燈"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "atomic lamp"
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this very "
"expensive lamp will emit a small amount of light for at least a decade.  "
"Before the Cataclysm, it was mostly an expensive way to show off your "
"preparedness.  Now, it's actually really useful.  Use it to close the cover "
"and hide the light."
msgstr ""
"非常昂贵的灯，由神奇的核衰变能源为低功耗LED供电，能够连续发光至少10"
"年。在大灾变之前，这主要是一种炫耀战备的奢侈玩法。而今，它真的派上了用场。激活它以遮住灯光。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "atomic lamp"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "everglow matrix lamp (uncovered)"
msgid "You close the lamp's cover."
msgstr "你關上了燈罩。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "atomic lamp (covered)"
msgid_plural "atomic lamps (covered)"
msgstr[0] "原子燈 (蓋上)"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "atomic lamp (covered)"
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this very "
"expensive lamp will emit a small amount of light for at least a decade.  "
"Before the Cataclysm, it was mostly an expensive way to show off your "
"preparedness.  Now, it's actually really useful.  The cover is closed.  Use "
"it to open the cover and show the light."
msgstr ""
"非常昂贵的灯，由神奇的核衰变能源为低功耗LED供电，能够连续发光至少10"
"年。在大灾变之前，这主要是一种炫耀战备的奢侈玩法。而今，它真的派上了用场。现在灯光已经被遮住了，激活以使它重现光芒。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "atomic lamp (covered)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "everglow matrix lamp (covered)"
msgid "You open the lamp's cover."
msgstr "你打開了燈罩。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "atomic reading light"
msgid_plural "atomic reading lights"
msgstr[0] "原子閱讀燈"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "atomic reading light"
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at least "
"a decade.  It is also available with a cute cartoon bear cover to turn it "
"into a nightlight for a very wealthy child with a fear of the dark.  Use it "
"to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""
