msgstr[0] "耐用手電筒（關閉）"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty flashlight (off)"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty LED flashlight with a durable polymer housing.  It's "
"impact-resistant, chemical-resistant, waterproof and certified for use in "
"hazardous environments.  Designed for firefighters, rescue personnel and "
"miners but it can also be used for smacking hooligans.  It has a "
"spring-loaded clip that can be attached to your torso."
msgstr ""
"耐用 LED "
"手电筒，采用耐用的聚合材料外壳。它耐冲击、耐化学腐蚀、防水，并通过了危险环境使用认证。专为消防员、救援人员和矿工设计，当然也可用于殴打小混混。它有一个弹簧夹"
"，可以连接到你的躯干上。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "heavy-duty flashlight (off)"
