#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted skeletal zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted skeletal zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌尘骷髅丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted skeletal zombie"
msgid ""
"This moving corpse covered in knobby bone growths has been heavily dusted "
"with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "这具移动的尸体上长满了结块的骨头，上面被厚厚的灰色粉尘覆盖着。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk skeleton"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk skeletons"
msgstr[0] "菌颅骷髅丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk skeleton"
msgid ""
"This already horrific moving corpse covered in bony growths has also grown a "
"short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "这具已经很可怕的移动尸体上长满了骨赘物，头骨上还长出了一根短茎的灰色真菌。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal skeletal zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal skeletal zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌骷髏殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal skeletal zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal bone brute"
msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the twisted bone growths that cover this "
"creature.  Spores linger in the air around it."
msgstr "真菌从覆盖在这只怪物的扭曲的骨板缝隙中长出。它周围的空气中飘荡着孢子尘。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted skeletal brute"
msgid_plural "dusted skeletal brutes"
msgstr[0] "菌尘骸骨丧尸兽"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted skeletal brute"
msgid ""
"This moving corpse covered in twisted bone growths has been heavily dusted "
"with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "这具扭曲的尸体上长满了结块的骨头，上面被厚厚的灰色粉尘覆盖着。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungalizing bone brute"
msgid_plural "fungalizing bone brutes"
msgstr[0] "菌颅骸骨丧尸兽"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungalizing bone brute"
msgid ""
"This already horrific moving corpse covered in twisted bony growths has also "
"grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "这具已经很可怕的移动尸体上长满了扭曲的骨赘物，头骨上还长出了一根短茎的灰色真菌。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal bone brute"
msgid_plural "fungal bone brutes"
msgstr[0] "真菌骸骨丧尸兽"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted skeletal hulk"
msgid_plural "dusted skeletal hulks"
msgstr[0] "菌尘骸骨浩克"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted skeletal hulk"
msgid ""
"This towering creature covered in plated bone has been heavily dusted with a "
"thick gray powder."
msgstr "这个高耸的生物全身覆盖着板状骨骼，被一层厚厚的灰色粉尘覆盖着。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk juggernaut"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk juggernauts"
msgstr[0] "菌颅骸骨浩克"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk juggernaut"
msgid ""
"Layers of plates of bone rise high above, ending in a short stalk of gray "
"fungus bursting from the enormous bulging skull."
msgstr "层层叠叠的骨板高高耸立，顶端是一个巨大的膨隆颅骨，颅骨上长出一小截灰色真菌茎秆。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal juggernaut"
msgid_plural "fungal juggernauts"
msgstr[0] "真菌巨人"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal juggernaut"
msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the ossified plates of this ponderous bone "
"titan, and it seems even its eyes are lost to it.  A dust of spores lands on "
"the ground with every sluggish stomp of its heavy legs."
msgstr "真菌从这只笨重的骷髅巨兽的骨板缝隙中长出，它的眼睛似乎已经被真菌破坏。它移动缓慢，而每一次踏步都使一片孢子尘飘落在地。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted zombie child"
msgid_plural "dusted zombie children"
msgstr[0] "菌尘儿童丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted zombie child"
msgid ""
"This small, stumbling child has been dusted with a thick gray powder.  "
"Something about the way it moves is uncanny."
msgstr "这个幼小、步履蹒跚的儿童体表被一层厚厚的灰色粉尘覆盖着。它移动的方式看起来有某种怪诞。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk child"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk children"
msgstr[0] "菌颅儿童丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk child"
msgid ""
"This child moves slowly, as though sleepy.  A short stalk of gray fungus has "
"burst from the top of the little head."
msgstr "这个孩子走得很慢，就像没睡醒似的。一根短小的灰色真菌从他的小脑袋顶部冒了出来。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal child"
msgid_plural "fungal children"
msgstr[0] "真菌幼童"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal child"
msgid ""
"It is hard to recognize a human child in this creature.  Disgusting-looking "
"mold covers most of its skin.  Many cracks perforate its body, with small "
"fungal stalks poking through."
msgstr "很難在這種生物上辨識出人類兒童。 令人作嘔的真菌掩蓋了大部分皮膚。 它的身體上被細小的真菌莖刺穿出許多裂縫。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted boomer"
msgid_plural "dusted boomers"
msgstr[0] "覆尘爆汁丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted boomer"
msgid ""
"This rotund and bloated corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray "
"powder."
msgstr "这具圆胖浮肿的尸体被一层厚厚的灰色粉尘覆盖着。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk boomer"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk boomers"
msgstr[0] "菌颅爆汁丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk boomer"
msgid ""
"This rotund and bloated corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus "
"bursting from the skull."
msgstr "这具圆胖臃肿的尸体长出了一根从头骨中爆裂的灰色真菌。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal boomer"
msgid_plural "fungal boomers"
msgstr[0] "真菌嘔吐者"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal boomer"
msgid ""
"A rotund and bloated human body with pasty, fungus-ridden flesh.  Its mouth "
"drips with a frothing gray sludge."
msgstr "一個肥胖的殭屍， 皮膚佈滿粘糊的灰黴。血肉呈現灰色半透明的， 嘴掛著一團灰色的污泥。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted zombie wretch"
msgid_plural "dusted zombie wretches"
msgstr[0] "菌尘可怜虫"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted zombie wretch"
msgid ""
"This small child lies on the ground shaking gently, dusted with a thick gray "
"powder.  The chest of the child appears to have broken open like a gory "
"flower and there is strange pulsing movement and also unpleasant wet sounds "
"within."
msgstr "这个孩童尸骸躺在地上微微颤抖，身上沾满厚厚的灰色粉末。它的胸膛像一朵血淋淋的花一样裂开，里面传来奇怪的脉动和令人不适的湿黏声响。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk wretch"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk wretches"
msgstr[0] "菌颅可怜虫"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk wretch"
msgid ""
"This small child lies on the ground smiling serenely, a short stalk of gray "
"fungus bursting triumphantly from the top of the little head.  The chest of "
"the child appears to have broken open like a gory flower and there is strange "
"pulsing movement and also unpleasant wet sounds within."
msgstr ""
"这个小孩躺在地上，似乎笑得很安详。一株灰色的小真菌从他的头顶上得意洋洋的地挤了出来。孩子破损的胸部似乎像一朵血淋淋的花一样绽放开来，里面隐约发出奇怪的跳动声"
"和令人不快的湿漉漉的声音。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal wretch"
msgid_plural "fungal wretches"
msgstr[0] "真菌可憐蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wretch"
msgid ""
"This severely deformed child lies on its back, its ribs exposed to the sky.  "
"With its limbs contorted in ways only possible through a lack of bones, the "
"child's ribcage stretches far beyond the boundaries of human biology, "
"appearing akin to a bony hive coated in quivering fungal matter.  Spores "
"occasionally waft from its hollowed interior, and, periodically, you can "
"catch sight of weak movement within the abomination's guts."
msgstr ""
"这个躯体严重变形的孩童躺在地上，肋骨暴露朝向天上，四肢被扭曲得像是没有骨头一样，胸腔扩张超过了人生理能达到的程度，整体看起来就像长满了真菌的骨肉蜂巢。真菌孢"
"子时不时地从体内空腔飘出，你也可以看到令人恶心的肠子内有东西正在周期性地微弱蠕动。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "fungal wretch"
msgid ""
"Through a plume of fungal spores, a small beast struggles to take flight from "
"the wretch's abdomen!"
msgstr "伴随一簇真菌孢子，这个小可怜虫的腹部里飞出了一只小型怪兽！"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted raptor"
msgid_plural "dusted raptors"
msgstr[0] "菌尘血鸷"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted raptor"
msgid ""
"Heavily dusted with a thick gray powder, this small, winged predator darts "
"through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  "
"A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet."
msgstr "这种有翅膀的小型捕食者身上沾满了厚厚的灰色粉末，用三只海绵状的翅膀在空中飞奔，看起来像是被拉长的人手。一根陡峭的锯齿状尖刺从翅膀相接处伸出。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk raptor"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk raptors"
msgstr[0] "菌颅血鸷"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk raptor"
msgid ""
"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three spongy wings that "
"look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the "
"point where the wings meet, joined by a short stalk of gray fungus reaching "
"upward."
msgstr "这种有翅膀的小型捕食者用三只海绵状的翅膀在空中跳跃，看起来像伸展的人手。翅膀相接处伸出一根陡峭的锯齿状刺，上面衔接着一根向上延伸的灰色真菌。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal raptor"
msgid_plural "fungal raptors"
msgstr[0] "真菌血鷲"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal raptor"
msgid ""
"Infested by a thick crust of fungal growth, this small, winged predator darts "
"through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  "
"A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet.  It looks "
"like nothing you've seen on Earth, and yet strangely like it is made of human "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"被一层生长着厚厚真菌的外壳所感染，这种长着翅膀小型猛兽在空中飞来飞去，它的三对翅膀上十分蓬松，看起来就像被拉长的人手。在翅膀会合的地方长出了一根锯齿状的尖刺"
"。它看上去根本一点都不像地球上的任何生物，然而奇怪的是，它又是由各种人类的肢体构成的。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted zombie runner"
msgid_plural "dusted zombie runners"
msgstr[0] "菌尘追猎丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted zombie runner"
msgid ""
"This recently-risen body has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder, "
"but still moves quickly."
msgstr "这个刚复活的丧尸体表被一层厚厚的灰色粉尘覆盖着，但仍然跑得很快。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk runner"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk runners"
msgstr[0] "菌颅追猎丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk runner"
msgid ""
"This recently-risen body has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from "
"the skull.  This appears to slow it down in some way."
msgstr "这具最近复活的尸体长出了一株从头骨中爆裂的灰色真菌。这似乎在某种程度上减缓了它原本的速度。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal runner"
msgid_plural "fungal runners"
msgstr[0] "真菌追猎丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal runner"
msgid ""
"Fungal sprouts seem to support the host's broken legs like crude splints.  "
"Even with its eyes shrouded with tiny spores, it darts towards anything that "
"seems to move in a small radius."
msgstr "真菌芽似乎像粗糙的夹板一样支撑着宿主的断腿。 即使它的眼睛笼罩着微小的孢子，它也会冲向任何似乎在小半径范围内移动的东西。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted decayed zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted decayed zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌尘腐朽丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted decayed zombie"
msgid "This badly decayed corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "这具严重腐坏的尸体被一层厚厚的灰色粉末覆盖着。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk rotter"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk rotters"
msgstr[0] "菌颅腐烂丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk rotter"
msgid ""
"This badly decayed corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting "
"from the skull."
msgstr "这具严重腐坏的尸体的头骨上爆裂般长出一根灰色真菌。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal rotter"
msgid_plural "fungal rotters"
msgstr[0] "真菌腐烂丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal rotter"
msgid ""
"The rotten skin that flakes from the host's body seems to be covered in tiny "
"blue dots; occasional popping and crackling sounds are heard, like cracking "
"wood.  This corpse can't be discerned as human by the naked eye."
msgstr "从宿主身上剥落的腐烂皮肤上似乎布满了蓝色的小点； 偶尔会听到爆裂声和噼啪声，就像木头破裂的声音。 这具尸体用肉眼根本无法辨别是人类。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted tough zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted tough zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌尘健壮丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted tough zombie"
msgid "This muscular moving corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "这具壮硕的尸体被一层厚厚的灰色粉末覆盖着。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk bulk"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk bulks"
msgstr[0] "菌颅健壮丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk bulk"
msgid ""
"This muscular corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the "
"skull."
msgstr "这具肌肉发达的尸体长出了一根从头骨中爆裂的灰色真菌短茎。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal bulk"
msgid_plural "fungal bulks"
msgstr[0] "真菌浩克丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal bulk"
msgid ""
"This terrifying fungal construct seems to have lost all facial features, its "
"face covered in thick fungal sprouts.  Its arms end in jagged points as "
"fungal tendrils burst forth."
msgstr "这个可怕的真菌丧尸似乎失去了所有的面部特征，它的脸上覆盖着厚厚的真菌芽。 它的手臂末端呈锯齿状，真菌须从中爆发出来。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted brute zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted brute zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌尘丧尸兽"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted brute zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's entire body bulges with distended muscles heavily dusted with a "
"thick gray powder."
msgstr "这个僵尸的全身都鼓了起来，肌肉膨胀，上面沾满了厚厚的灰色粉末。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk brute"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk brutes"
msgstr[0] "菌颅丧尸兽"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk brute"
msgid ""
"This inhumanly muscular corpse has numerous festering wounds and has grown a "
"short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "这具肌肉异常发达的尸体有许多溃烂的伤口，头骨上长出了一根短茎的灰色真菌。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal brute"
msgid_plural "fungal brutes"
msgstr[0] "真菌丧尸兽"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal brute"
msgid ""
"This bulky fungal construct seems to have lost all facial features, its chest "
"and face covered in thick fungal sprouts.  Its arms and legs are grotesquely "
"swollen."
msgstr "这种庞大而笨重的真菌丧尸似乎已经失去了所有的面部特征，它的胸部和面部覆盖着厚厚的真菌芽。它的胳膊和腿肿得很厉害。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted zombie hulk"
msgid_plural "dusted zombie hulks"
msgstr[0] "菌尘浩克丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted zombie hulk"
msgid ""
"This zombie's muscular body has swollen to six times the size of an average "
"person and has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "这只丧尸浑身肌肉虬结，肿胀至常人六倍大小，体表覆满厚重的灰色粉末。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk hulk"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk hulks"
msgstr[0] "菌颅浩克丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk hulk"
msgid ""
"This enormous muscular corpse has swollen six times larger and has grown a "
"short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "这具魁梧的腐尸肿胀了六倍有余，颅顶爆出一丛灰白菌株。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal hulk"
msgid_plural "fungal hulks"
msgstr[0] "真菌浩克丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal hulk"
msgid ""
"This inhumanly warped and swollen fungal construct is entirely covered in "
"thick fungal sprouts.  The body shape is still roughly humanoid but the size "
"is too large, about the size of six people combined."
msgstr "这具扭曲肿胀的菌尸构造体浑身覆满厚实菌芽，身形尚存人形轮廓，但体积异常庞大，约莫六具人体堆叠而成。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted crawling zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted crawling zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌尘爬行丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted crawling zombie"
msgid ""
"This moving corpse with badly damaged legs has been heavily dusted with a "
"thick gray powder."
msgstr "这具移动的尸体双腿严重受损，全身覆盖着厚厚的灰色粉尘。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk crawler"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk crawlers"
msgstr[0] "菌颅爬行丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk crawler"
msgid ""
"This moving corpse with badly damaged legs has grown a short stalk of gray "
"fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "这具移动的尸体双腿严重受损，颅骨上长出了一簇灰色菌株。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal zombie crawler"
msgid_plural "fungal zombie crawlers"
msgstr[0] "真菌爬行丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal zombie crawler"
msgid ""
"This fungal monster struggles to move as bulbous mushrooms grow from its "
"exposed back.  Its leg seems to be wrapped in sturdy tendrils, and its arms "
"visibly swell and pop gruesomely with each drag along the ground."
msgstr "这头真菌怪兽背上长满了球根状的蘑菇，艰难地爬行着。它的腿似乎被结实的卷须包裹着，而它的胳膊在每一次拖动时都会明显肿胀并发出令人毛骨悚然的爆裂声。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted fat zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted fat zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌尘肥胖丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted fat zombie"
msgid "This heavy moving corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "这具沉重的尸体被一层厚厚的灰色粉末覆盖着。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal stalk feeder"
msgid_plural "fungal stalk feeders"
msgstr[0] "菌颅肥胖丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal stalk feeder"
msgid ""
"This heavy corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the "
"skull."
msgstr "这具肥胖的尸体的头骨上爆裂般长出一根灰色真菌。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal feeder"
msgid_plural "fungal feeders"
msgstr[0] "真菌肥胖丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal feeder"
msgid ""
"Thousands upon thousands of fungal bulbs, sprouts and tendrils jut out from "
"every angle of this walking carcass.  Large patches of yellow pulsating mold "
"seem to be growing in the zombie's fat folds."
msgstr "成千上万的真菌球茎、芽苗和卷须从这具行走的尸体的各个角度伸出。 大片的黄色脉动霉菌似乎正在丧尸的脂肪褶皱中生长。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌尘结痂丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted scarred zombie"
msgid "This heavily scarred moving corpse has been covered with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "这具伤痕累累的走尸上覆盖着一层厚厚的灰色粉末。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungalizing scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "fungalizing scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌颅结痂丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungalizing scarred zombie"
msgid ""
"This heavily scarred moving corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus "
"bursting from the skull."
msgstr "这具伤痕累累的走尸头骨中爆裂般长出一根灰色真菌。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scarred fungal zombie"
msgid_plural "scarred fungal zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌结痂丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scarred fungal zombie"
msgid ""
"The tough callouses and scar tissue of this unfortunate corpse are the only "
"remaining signs of something once made of flesh; any spot seemingly soft "
"enough has been thoroughly punctured by thick fungal tendrils that have "
"started to creep over this disfigured husk."
msgstr ""
"这具不幸的遗体上那些坚硬的茧和疤痕组织，是曾经由血肉之躯构成的唯一残余迹象；任何看似柔软的部位，都已被粗壮的真菌卷须彻底刺穿，这些卷须已经开始在这具变形的躯"
"壳上蔓延开来。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dusted acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "dusted acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌尘酸液丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dusted acidic zombie"
msgid "This acrid smelling moving corpse has been covered with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "这具散发着刺鼻气味的走尸身上覆盖着一层厚厚的灰色粉末。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungalizing acid zombie"
msgid_plural "fungalizing acid zombies"
msgstr[0] "菌颅酸液丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungalizing acid zombie"
msgid ""
"This sickly looking moving corpse with prominent yellow veins has grown a "
"short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "这具病态的行尸通体泛着刺眼的黄绿色血管，颅顶赫然爆出一簇灰白菌株。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic fungal zombie"
msgid_plural "acidic fungal zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌酸液丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic fungal zombie"
msgid ""
"A grotesque fusion of rot and mycelium, this zombie's flesh is pocked with "
"open sores that lazily drool a strange yellow-green acid.  Pale fungal stalks "
"have burst through its corroded skin, their slimy caps dripping with what "
"seems to be the same fluid.  The air around it is thick with the scent of rot "
"and acrid chemicals."
msgstr ""
"这具畸变的腐尸与菌丝融为一体，溃烂的皮肉上布满渗着黄绿色酸液的疮口。惨白的菌柄从腐蚀的皮肤中爆出，黏滑的菌盖滴落着同样的诡异液体。它周身萦绕着腐烂与刺鼻化学"
"物质混合的浊臭。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal dog"
msgid_plural "fungal dogs"
msgstr[0] "真菌狗"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal dog"
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated, and again reanimated corpse of a what looked like the "
"concept of a canine.  It has lost almost all of its dog-like features, except "
"for its constant aggressive growling, and tendency to bite.  It shakes its "
"fur like a wet dog, sending tiny spore clouds everywhere."
msgstr ""
"一具腐败的复活过又被再次复活的尸体，看起来像是犬科动物。除了不断的攻击性咆哮和咬人的倾向，它几乎失去了所有称得上是狗的特征。它像被淋湿的狗一样抖动着皮毛，到"
"处释放出微小的孢子云。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antlered fungal horror"
msgid_plural "antlered fungal horrors"
msgstr[0] "真菌鹿角兽"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antlered fungal horror"
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic beast has lost any semblance of what a moose is, aside "
"from its outgrown antlers, now covered in writhing fungal tendrils, seemingly "
"trying to break into the cracking bone.  The animated corpse seems to be in a "
"state of constant disrepair, held together by strange, sticky blue orbs."
msgstr ""
"这只曾经高贵强壮的野兽除了头上因生长过度而覆盖着扭动真菌卷须的鹿角外已完全失去了驼鹿的模样，卷须似乎正试图侵入那些开裂的骨骼。这具行尸走肉似乎处于持续破损的"
"状态，只能由一些奇怪而粘稠的蓝色球体勉强拼凑在一起。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal pouncer"
msgid_plural "fungal pouncers"
msgstr[0] "真菌突袭兽"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal pouncer"
msgid ""
"This four legged, oversized cat seems to spew spores from its pawpads with "
"each clumsy landing, as if constantly gaining and losing balance in air."
msgstr "这只四足巨型猫科动物每次笨拙地着陆时，似乎都会从爪垫中喷出孢子，仿佛在空中不断获得和失去平衡。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid " rotten fungal horse"
msgid_plural " rotten fungal horses"
msgstr[0] "腐坏的真菌马"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster " rotten fungal horse"
msgid ""
"This hulking horse-figure seems to re-learn galloping with every step, as "
"large fungi cling and sprout off of its mane.  It travels towards anything "
"moving, even though in the center of each eye lies multiple fungal blooms."
msgstr "随着大型的真菌依附在它的鬃毛中并喷出，这只笨拙的马状生物似乎在每一个步伐中重新学习飞奔。它奔向每个活动着的东西，即使每只眼睛的中心都长着数朵真菌花。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiger fungal wight"
msgid_plural "tiger fungal wights"
msgstr[0] "真菌幽灵虎"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiger fungal wight"
msgid ""
"This rotting tiger has lost its stumble, as large fungal bulbs seem to have "
"extended its pawpads thoroughly.  Its head crackles when trying to turn, "
"seemingly stuck facing forward."
msgstr "这只腐烂的老虎失去了蹒跚而行的机会，因为巨大的真菌球茎似乎已经将它的爪垫完全撑开。当它试图转头时，头部会发出爆裂声，像是被卡在了正前方的齿轮。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal wight"
msgid_plural "fungal wights"
msgstr[0] "真菌幽灵鹿"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wight"
msgid ""
"This deer's thick fur is spotted with blue orbs that seem to pop and ooze "
"every few minutes, and its rotten skin seems unable to fall off, held "
"together by thick fungal bedding underneath."
msgstr "这只鹿厚厚的皮毛上长出了蓝色的球体，这些球体似乎每隔几分钟就会爆裂流脓，它腐烂的皮肤似乎无法脱落，下面生长着厚厚的真菌垫层。"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal reindeer"
msgid_plural "fungal reindeer"
msgstr[0] "真菌驯鹿"

#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal reindeer"
msgid ""
"This bumpy, discolored reindeer resembles a malformed Rudolph, its nose "
"having a faintly glowing red fungal sprout.  It'd look almost comical if it "
"wasn't mutilating bodies with its innate strength."
msgstr "这只凹凸不平、浑身褪色的驯鹿像一只畸形的鲁道夫，鼻子上长着一根微微发光的红色真菌芽。如果不是残破的躯体还包含着天生的强大力量的话，它看上去十分滑稽。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dark wyrm"
msgid_plural "dark wyrms"
msgstr[0] "暗古龍"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dark wyrm"
msgid ""
"A huge mutated worm living deep underground.  It has a round, gaping mouth "
"lined with dagger-like teeth, and its flesh is slick with bubbling blue slime."
msgstr "一只变异的巨大蠕虫，隐匿在地下深处。它的圆形大口之中长着一圈刀刃般的利齿，血肉中泛着冒泡的蓝色黏液。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "graboid"
msgid_plural "graboids"
msgstr[0] "食人砂蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "graboid"
msgid ""
"This huge subterranean creature is a far cry from its earthworm ancestors.  "
"Despite only seeing its head, you can tell its grown to a mind-boggling size. "
" While the image may be quite unsettling, it doesn't appear to pay you any "
"mind."
msgstr ""
"这种巨大的地下生物与其蚯蚓祖先相去甚远。尽管你只能看到它的头，但可以看出它已经长到了令人难以置信的大小。虽然眼前的场景很令人不安，但它似乎对你的存在毫不在意"
"。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "graboid half worm"
msgid_plural "graboid half worms"
msgstr[0] "半截地魔虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "graboid half worm"
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded graboid."
msgstr "一个地魔虫被切断的部份，体液从断肢部分渗出，还在不断扭动着。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant half worm"
msgid_plural "giant half worms"
msgstr[0] "半截巨型蠕虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant half worm"
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded giant worm."
msgstr "一個巨蟲被切斷的部份， 還在扭動著。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant earthworm"
msgid_plural "giant earthworms"
msgstr[0] "半截蚯蚓"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant earthworm"
msgid ""
"A huge, mutated garden worm peeking out from the earth - pink, ringed, and "
"most importantly docile.  Despite its size and looks, it appears to be "
"peaceful."
msgstr "一只巨大的变异蚯蚓从地上向外窥视——粉红色，有环，最重要的是温顺。与它的大小和外观不同，但它看起来很安静。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized earthworm"
msgid_plural "oversized earthworms"
msgstr[0] "超大蚯蚓"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized earthworm"
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large wriggling earthworm with the moist earth still clinging "
"to its slimy body.  Despite its size it appears to be peaceful, a refreshing "
"change for once."
msgstr "一条不停蠕动的大型蚯蚓，黏糊糊的身体上还粘着潮湿的泥土，令人不安。与它的大小和外观不同，但它看起来很安静，总算是个令人耳目一新的变化。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized half worm"
msgid_plural "oversized half worms"
msgstr[0] "半截超大蚯蚓"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized half worm"
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded oversized worm."
msgstr "一條受傷的超大蚯蚓被切斷部分，不斷扭動著。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "earthworm larva"
msgid_plural "earthworm larvae"
msgstr[0] "蚯蚓幼虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "earthworm larva"
msgid "A white wriggling worm."
msgstr "一条蠕动的白色蚯蚓。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized cockroach"
msgid_plural "oversized cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "超大蟑螂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cockroach"
msgid "An aggressive mutant cockroach the size of a small dog."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异蟑螂，攻击性很强，长着巨大的口器与坚硬的外壳，浑身散发着恶心的味道，在地上疯狂的爬行寻找食物。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skittering plague"
msgid_plural "skittering plagues"
msgstr[0] "疾行瘟疫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skittering plague"
msgid ""
"A giant, sickly-looking cockroach that appears to be using the undead as its "
"primary food source.  The diet of infected flesh doesn't seem to harm it, but "
"something about the roach's biology is clearly changing.  It doesn't seem "
"interested in you."
msgstr ""
"一只看起来得了病的巨型蟑螂，似乎正在利用丧尸作为其主要的食物来源。长期食用受感染的肉似乎并未对它造成伤害，但这只蟑螂的某些生化特性显然以及发生了变化。它似乎"
"对你不感兴趣。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "plague nymph"
msgid_plural "plague nymphs"
msgstr[0] "瘟疫若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "plague nymph"
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking mutant cockroach about the size of a rat, raised from birth "
"on a healthy diet of zombie flesh.  It still has enough natural instinct left "
"to avoid approaching you."
msgstr "一只体型和老鼠一般大小的变异蟑螂幼虫，看起来得了病，从出生起就以丧尸血肉为食。它还保留了足够的本能懂得避免接近你。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "plague vector"
msgid_plural "plague vectors"
msgstr[0] "瘟疫病媒"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "plague vector"
msgid ""
"This giant cockroach has been feeding on the undead for some time and started "
"to mutate chaotically.  Extra limbs and growths sprout from its thorax, and "
"it is notably aggressive even to creatures much larger than itself."
msgstr "这只巨型蟑螂以丧尸为食已经有一段时间了，并开始无序的变异。额外的肢体和器官从它的胸腔中生长出来，它甚至对比自己体型大得多的生物也表现出明显的攻击性。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "巨型蟑螂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach"
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a dog.  This size advantage is apparently all "
"it needs to start regarding humans as food!"
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异蟑螂。显然，这点体型优势足以使其将人类列入菜单！"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid_plural "giant cockroach nymphs"
msgstr[0] "巨型蟑螂若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid "A baby mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "跟老鼠一樣大的異變蟑螂嬰兒。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "pregnant giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "懷孕的巨型蟑螂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog.  Its abdomen is heavily swollen "
"with eggs."
msgstr "跟小狗一樣大的異變蟑螂。它的腹部被無數蟲卵撐得非常腫脹。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized silverfish"
msgid_plural "oversized silverfish"
msgstr[0] "超大衣魚"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized silverfish"
msgid "An oversized mutated silverfish the size of a small dog."
msgstr "一隻超大的變種蠹魚，體型有小狗那麼大。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant silverfish"
msgid_plural "giant silverfish"
msgstr[0] "巨型衣鱼"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant silverfish"
msgid ""
"A mutant silverfish roughly the size of a person.  Doesn't seem at all "
"interested in you."
msgstr "一只体型和成人一般大小的变异衣鱼。似乎对你一点也不感兴趣。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant silverfish nymph"
msgid_plural "giant silverfish nymphs"
msgstr[0] "巨型衣魚若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant silverfish nymph"
msgid "A baby mutant silverfish about the size of a rat."
msgstr "一只体积约有老鼠一样大的变异衣鱼幼虫。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized bee"
msgid_plural "oversized bees"
msgstr[0] "超大蜜蜂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized bee"
msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog."
msgstr "跟小狗一樣大的異變蜜蜂。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant bee"
msgid_plural "giant bees"
msgstr[0] "巨蜂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant bee"
msgid ""
"With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black and "
"yellow markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr "帶著菜刀大小的刺針， 這隻跟狗一樣大的昆蟲有著黑黃相間的條紋警告你別靠近。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "alpha bee"
msgid_plural "alpha bees"
msgstr[0] "超巨型蜜蜂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "alpha bee"
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant bee with black and white markings and a long stinger "
"spelling doom."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的变异蜜蜂，长着黑白相间的条纹和一根标志着厄运的长毒刺。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized centipede"
msgid_plural "oversized centipedes"
msgstr[0] "超大蜈蚣"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized centipede"
msgid ""
"A brightly-colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering "
"quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but "
"beware its venom."
msgstr "一只颜色鲜艳的变异蜈蚣，有狗一般大小，快速地在灌木丛中穿行。它也许不会把你当作猎物，但是要小心它的毒液。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant centipede"
msgid_plural "giant centipedes"
msgstr[0] "巨型蜈蚣"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant centipede"
msgid ""
"A two-meter-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles "
"and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of "
"spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly "
"orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr "一只两米长的蜈蚣，身上长着一双挂着毒液的颚和多得吓人的用于抓取的肢体，用几十只腿迅捷地移动。它长着一双小型复眼，但是似乎主要通过触须来感知四周。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "centipede larva"
msgid_plural "centipede larvae"
msgstr[0] "蜈蚣幼虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "centipede larva"
msgid ""
"A juvenile centipede.  Despite its young age it is still quite large and you "
"reckon these mandibles could pack quite a bite."
msgstr "一条幼年蜈蚣。虽然他不是完全体，但体型已经很大了，它的下颚提醒着你它巨大的咬合力。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "centipede matriarch"
msgid_plural "centipede matriarchs"
msgstr[0] "蜈蚣女皇"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "centipede matriarch"
msgid ""
"A giant centipede grown even larger, hind segments curled up to protect a "
"huge clump of eggs and its children of different ages.  Sometimes one of its "
"young gets shaken off by its clutchmates and disappears into the underbrush."
msgstr "一只更加庞大的巨型蜈蚣，尾部卷起并保护着一大堆卵和不同年龄的小蜈蚣。一两只小蜈蚣不时从母虫身上掉落下来，然后消失在灌木丛之中。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "centipede matriarch"
msgid "A small centipede is shaken off in the struggle!"
msgstr "一只小蜈蚣在母虫的挣扎中掉了下来！"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "armored centipede"
msgid_plural "armored centipedes"
msgstr[0] "裝甲蜈蚣"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "armored centipede"
msgid ""
"A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of metallic "
"gray, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living animal.  Its "
"mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialized to hunt prey at least "
"as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if you'd fare better."
msgstr ""
"一只巨大的变异蜈蚣，身体覆盖着互相连接的银灰色甲壳，这使你想起了脱轨的火车而不是活的生物。它的下颚末端是锯齿状的，似乎专门用于捕猎和它一样带有厚重甲壳的生物"
"。你可不想和它比试比试。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized house centipede"
msgid_plural "oversized house centipedes"
msgstr[0] "超大地中海蚰蜒"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized house centipede"
msgid ""
"A mass of spindly legs the size of a large dog.  It is watching you intently, "
"but doesn't go out of its way to hunt you."
msgstr "一只大型犬大小的多足怪物。它正死死盯着你，但并未主动发起攻击。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant house centipede"
msgid_plural "giant house centipedes"
msgstr[0] "巨型蚰蜒"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant house centipede"
msgid ""
"A house centipede grown to immense size, with a slender body the size of a "
"child held up by a constantly-twitching mess of legs.  Already a fearsome "
"hunter at its normal scale, both its hunger and range of acceptable prey grew "
"to match its new size."
msgstr ""
"一只生长到了巨型的蚰蜒，儿童大小的细长身躯由一团不断抽搐的下肢支撑着。即使在原来的体型下它已经是一个可怕的猎手，它的饥渴和猎物菜单也在不断增长、扩充，直到符"
"合它现在的体型。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant house centipede larva"
msgid_plural "giant house centipede larvae"
msgstr[0] "巨型蚰蜒幼虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant house centipede larva"
msgid "A baby house centipede about the size of a rat."
msgstr "一只体积约有老鼠一样大的蚰蜒的幼虫。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant dragonfly naiad"
msgid_plural "giant dragonfly naiads"
msgstr[0] "巨大蜻蜓幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly naiad"
msgid ""
"A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimeter long and "
"feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its "
"sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into "
"something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr "一只蜻蜓的掠食性水生幼虫，通常只有一厘米长，以小鱼为食，但现在已经长到鲶鱼般大小。在它锋利的下颌下，你可以看到它卷起的下颚变成了类似于带刺长矛的东西。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant dragonfly"
msgid_plural "giant dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "巨大蜻蜓"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly"
msgid ""
"A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to "
"the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized "
"pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""
"一只凶猛的、明亮的绿色蜻蜓，尽管长到了幼童大小，但仍然闪电般地飞快。它的头只不过剩下一双篮球大小的彩虹复眼，它的经过进化专门用来抓住猎物的腿上长满了弯曲的锋"
"利尖刺。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fused dragonflies"
msgid_plural "fused dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "巨型融合蜻蜓"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fused dragonflies"
msgid ""
"What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is "
"actually the unholy union of two dragonflies in the act of mating, bodies "
"still locked into the telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and "
"abdomens form an egg sac they sluggishly pull between them, periodically "
"dropping a handful of glistening eggs."
msgstr ""
"看起来是一个巨大的昆虫，腹部十分肿胀，但实际上是由两只正在交配的蜻蜓所组成的可怕融合体，从它们仍然如同锁紧的心脏一般的身体就能够看出来。它们的翅膀和腹部的残"
"骸形成了一个卵囊，缓慢地拖在身后，时而产下许多闪闪发光的卵。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized firefly"
msgid_plural "oversized fireflies"
msgstr[0] "超大螢火蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized firefly"
msgid ""
"A mutated firefly grown to the size of a large housecat, brightly glowing "
"abdomen bobbing up and down as it tries to impress its unseen mate.  It looks "
"strangely uninterested in you and everything else."
msgstr "一只家猫大小的变异萤火虫，腹部来回跳动、发出荧光，试图给它找不见的求偶对象留点深刻印象。它出奇地对你和其他东西一点都不感兴趣。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "firefly larva"
msgid_plural "firefly larvae"
msgstr[0] "萤火虫幼体"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "firefly larva"
msgid ""
"An oversized larva of a firefly.  Shockingly large when compared to the "
"adults of its kind."
msgstr "超大螢火蟲的幼蟲。跟一般成年螢火蟲相比，其體型都大得驚人。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized fly"
msgid_plural "oversized flies"
msgstr[0] "超大蒼蠅"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized fly"
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a small dog.  Its buzzing is high-pitched and "
"somehow sad."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的变异苍蝇。它发出高亢的嗡嗡声，看上去让人莫名悲伤。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant fly"
msgid_plural "giant flies"
msgstr[0] "巨蠅"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant fly"
msgid ""
"A tremendous housefly the size of a dog, predictably accompanied by a loud, "
"incessant buzzing sound."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异苍蝇。它在空中飞来飞去，不停地嗡嗡作响。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant grub"
msgid_plural "giant grubs"
msgstr[0] "巨型蛆虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant grub"
msgid "A grub the size of a small dog."
msgstr "一只长到小型犬体型的蛆虫。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "frigate fly"
msgid_plural "frigate flies"
msgstr[0] "軍艦蠅"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "frigate fly"
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a cow, creating a loud buzzing sound as it "
"inexplicably stays airborne."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的变异家蝇，当它令人费解地停在空中时，发出响亮的嗡嗡声。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized mosquito"
msgid_plural "oversized mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "超大蚊子"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized mosquito"
msgid "A mutant mosquito the size of a small dog, buzzing and fluttering erratically."
msgstr "一隻和小狗一樣大的突變蚊子，嗡嗡作響，飄忽不定。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mosquito"
msgid_plural "giant mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "巨蚊"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito"
msgid ""
"A giant mutant mosquito the size of a dog, fluttering erratically.  Its face "
"is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的巨型变异蚊子，在空中嗡嗡的飞着，飘忽不定。它的脸上长着一根又长又尖的细管。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mosquito larva"
msgid_plural "giant mosquito larvae"
msgstr[0] "巨型蚊怪幼虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito larva"
msgid "A large mosquito larva.  A bit more unsettling now that it isn't microscopic."
msgstr "一只巨大的蚊子幼虫。往日常见的小虫子长到这么大让你有些不安。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid_plural "bloodbank mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "超巨型蚊子"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a cow, with huge, thin wings and legs.  Its "
"face is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的变异蚊子，长着巨大而细薄的翼和腿，在空中嗡嗡的飞着，飘忽不定。它的脸上长着一根又长又尖的细管。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized moth fly"
msgid_plural "oversized moth flies"
msgstr[0] "超大蛾蚋"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized moth fly"
msgid "A mutant moth fly the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "一只有兔子大小的变异蛾蚋。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth fly"
msgid_plural "giant moth flies"
msgstr[0] "巨型蛾蚋"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth fly"
msgid "A moth fly the size of a small dog.  It appears to pay you no mind."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的蛾蚋。它似乎对你没有兴趣。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth fly larva"
msgid_plural "giant moth fly larvae"
msgstr[0] "巨型蛾蚋幼虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth fly larva"
msgid "A large moth fly larva."
msgstr "一只大型的蛾蚋幼虫。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized cellar spider"
msgid_plural "oversized cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "超大地窖蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cellar spider"
msgid ""
"A cellar spider - also known as \"daddy long-legs\" - grown to distressing "
"size.  Its body is about the size of your head, with the long, spindly legs "
"raising it up to your knee.  It tries getting away from you with an "
"unnervingly fluid run."
msgstr "一只地窖蛛——也被称为\"长腿爸爸\"——长到了令人痛心的大小。它的身体和你的头差不多大，细长的腿可以举到你的膝盖上。它试图以一种令人不安的流畅步伐远离你。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cellar spider"
msgid_plural "giant cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大地窖蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cellar spider"
msgid ""
"A huge brown spider in constant movement, with a small body the size of a "
"child held up at chest level by a set of spindly legs that branch into "
"three-pronged graspers at the end.  Unlike the smaller variant it obviously "
"decided hunting you is worth a try, and follows you with mandibles chittering "
"in anticipation."
msgstr ""
"一只不停移动的巨大棕色蜘蛛，有一个孩子大的身体被一组细长的腿在胸前支撑住，这些腿在末端分支成三叉的抓手。与较小的变种不同，它显然觉得狩猎你值得一试，下颌骨一"
"边发出叽叽喳喳的声音，一边期待地尾随着你。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cellar spiderling"
msgid_plural "cellar spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "地窖幼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cellar spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile cellar spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "一只幼年的地窖蜘蛛，大概有一个啤酒瓶那么大。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mommy long-legs"
msgid_plural "mommy long legs"
msgstr[0] "雌地窖蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mommy long-legs"
msgid ""
"This surprisingly shy giant cellar spider holds a head-sized ball of crawling "
"spiderlings of different ages in its mandibles, carefully balancing on her "
"long legs not to drop the precious cargo.  She seems uninterested in you."
msgstr "这只意外害羞的巨型地窖蛛用下颚叼着一个脑袋大的球，年龄不一的小蜘蛛在里面爬来爬去。她小心地用长腿保持平衡以避免弄丢了这珍贵的货物——对你似乎不感兴趣。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "mommy long-legs"
msgid "The spiderlings fall to the ground!"
msgstr "一群小蜘蛛掉到了地上！"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "warehouse spider"
msgid_plural "warehouse spiders"
msgstr[0] "倉庫蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "warehouse spider"
msgid ""
"A tangle of branching chitinous legs operating seemingly independently, "
"somehow still managing to carry a cow-sized central body.  A number of "
"malformed, twitching legs hang from the cephalothorax, but the head -and "
"especially the mandibles- still seem to be in working order."
msgstr ""
"一堆缠结的几丁质腿似乎各有自己的想法，不知怎的仍然设法承载着有一头牛大的躯干。许多畸形、抽搐的腿从头胸部垂下来，但头部——尤其是下颚——似乎仍处于正常工作状"
"态。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "warehouse spider"
msgid "The maimed legs start twitching erratically!"
msgstr "残废的腿开始不规律地抽搐！"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "detached spider leg"
msgid_plural "detached spider legs"
msgstr[0] "断蜘蛛腿"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "detached spider leg"
msgid ""
"The strangely branching leg of a mutated cellar spider that… fell?  crawled?  "
"off of the main body when hurt.  It now flails about blindly, irregular "
"clawed appendages grasping at anything that comes close."
msgstr "一条分支出来的变异地窖蛛腿，因为受伤从躯干上脱离了下来……但还在爬行？它现在盲目地挥舞着，末端不规则的爪状结构试图抓住任何靠近的东西。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized jumping spider"
msgid_plural "oversized jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "超大蠅虎"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized jumping spider"
msgid ""
"A mutant spider the size of a small dog with long forelegs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr "一隻體型如小狗的變種蜘蛛，長前腿、大眼睛，還有超大的獠牙。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant jumping spider"
msgid_plural "giant jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大跳蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant jumping spider"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant spider with big forelegs and two pairs of "
"inquisitive-looking eyes.  It can leap quite quickly, even into the treetops."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异蜘蛛，长着大大的前腿和两对好奇的眼睛。它可以快速跳跃，甚至可以跳到树梢上。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jumping spiderling"
msgid_plural "jumping spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "跳蛛幼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jumping spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile jumping spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "一只幼年的跳蛛，大概有一个啤酒瓶那么大。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "missile spider"
msgid_plural "missile spiders"
msgstr[0] "導彈跳蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "missile spider"
msgid ""
"An enormous hairy mutated spider the size of a cow, with strong forelegs and "
"a raised, bloated thorax.  Its vast increase in size has caused it to lose "
"much of its mobility, and when near it you can smell rotten eggs for some "
"reason…"
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的巨型多毛变异蜘蛛，前腿强壮，胸部凸起。它体积的巨大增加使它失去了大部分活动能力，但当你靠近它时，不知为何会闻到臭鸡蛋的味道……"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "oversized trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "超大暗門蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized trapdoor spider"
msgid ""
"A dark brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a bulbous thorax, big eyes, "
"and oversized fangs."
msgstr "一種深棕色變種蜘蛛，大小如狗，有球狀胸部、大眼睛和超大獠牙。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "giant trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大螲蟷蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid ""
"A gigantic dark brown spider with a bulbous thorax.  It digs a deep "
"underground burrow that serves as a pit to trap unwary prey."
msgstr "一只巨大的深棕色蜘蛛，长着球型的胸腔，会挖掘出一个大坑，等待粗心大意的猎物掉入陷阱。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "trapdoor spiderling"
msgid_plural "trapdoor spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "螲蟷幼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "trapdoor spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile trapdoor spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "一只螲蟷幼蛛，大概有一个啤酒瓶那么大。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deathtrap spider"
msgid_plural "deathtrap spiders"
msgstr[0] "超巨型螲蟷蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deathtrap spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark "
"brown in color.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to "
"see the light of day again."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的变异蜘蛛，腿十分粗壮，胸部球状，呈深棕色。任何被它拖进地下巢穴的东西都不可能再见到阳光。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized web spinning spider"
msgid_plural "oversized web spinning spiders"
msgstr[0] "超大網蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized web spinning spider"
msgid ""
"A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr "和狗一樣大的淺灰色突變蜘蛛，牠有著細長的腿、大眼睛和超大的獠牙。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant web spider"
msgid_plural "giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大網蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant web spider"
msgid ""
"A giant, light gray mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become ensnared "
"in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr "一只巨大的浅灰色织网蜘蛛，在丛林树木间编织这死亡的蛛网，等待猎物的上门。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wyrd spider"
msgid_plural "wyrd spiders"
msgstr[0] "超巨型蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wyrd spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in color. "
" It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from fleeing."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的的变异草蛛，长着细长的腿，呈浅灰色。它动动十分笨重，依靠自己的网防止猎物逃跑。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "web spiderling"
msgid_plural "web spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "网蛛幼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "web spiderling"
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant grass spider, about the size of a beer bottle.  Too young to "
"be venomous, or to walk proficiently for that matter."
msgstr "一只幼年巨型草蛛，约莫啤酒瓶大小。年纪尚小，既无毒性，爬行也还不利索。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized black widow spider"
msgid_plural "oversized black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "超大黑寡婦蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized black widow spider"
msgid ""
"A black mutant spider the size of a small dog with a long legs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs.  There is a red hourglass shape on its thorax."
msgstr "黑色變種蜘蛛，體型如小狗，長著長腿、大眼睛和超大的獠牙。它的胸部有一個紅色的沙漏形狀。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant black widow"
msgid_plural "giant black widows"
msgstr[0] "巨大黑寡婦蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on "
"its thorax.  A highly venomous nightmare come to life."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异黑寡妇蜘蛛。在它的胸前有着一个红色沙漏状的图案。这种蜘蛛毒素更加猛烈，犹如噩梦来袭。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black death widow"
msgid_plural "black death widows"
msgstr[0] "超巨型黑寡婦蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black death widow"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated black widow spider with a distinctive red hourglass shape "
"on its thorax.  Still possesses its infamous venom, but it probably doesn't "
"even need that to crush you like a bug."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的变异黑寡妇蜘蛛，在它的胸前有着一个红色沙漏状的图案。它仍然拥有臭名昭著的毒液，但它甚至不需要用上，就能把你像虫子一样碾碎。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black widow spiderling"
msgid_plural "black widow spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "黑寡妇幼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black widow spiderling"
msgid ""
"The horrid spawn of a giant black widow spider.  Though, given the size that "
"it currently is, it appears relatively harmless."
msgstr "巨型黑寡妇蜘蛛的后代，看起来就让人觉得很不爽。不过考虑到它目前的体型，应该还没什么危险。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wolf spider"
msgid_plural "oversized wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "超大狼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wolf spider"
msgid ""
"A shaggy brown mutant spider the size of a dog with eight long legs, two "
"especially big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr "一隻毛茸茸的棕色變種蜘蛛，有狗那麼大，長著八條長腿，兩隻特別大的眼睛，還有超大的獠牙。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wolf spider"
msgid_plural "giant wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "巨大狼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wolf spider"
msgid ""
"A wolf spider mutated to about thirty times its normal size, it moves quickly "
"and aggressively to catch and consume prey."
msgstr "突變狼蛛， 為普通狼蛛的三十倍大小， 移動迅速且富有攻擊性。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wolf spiderling"
msgid_plural "wolf spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "狼蛛幼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wolf spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile wolf spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "一只幼年的狼蛛，大概有一个啤酒瓶那么大。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "necrowolf spider"
msgid_plural "necrowolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "死靈巨狼蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "necrowolf spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy mutant wolf spider.  Its mouthparts have noticeably "
"changed, and it moves much more slowly now with the additional weight it "
"needs to carry."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的多毛变异狼蛛。它的口器已经发生了明显的变异，由于如今需要带动额外体重，它的移动速度要慢得多。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wasp larva"
msgid_plural "wasp larvae"
msgstr[0] "黃蜂幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wasp larva"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized white grub, featureless apart from a vestigal mouthpart.  It "
"hangs upside-down in its cell, and regurgitates sweet-smelling fluid in "
"return for the scraps of viscera fed to it by the workers below."
msgstr "一只小狗大小的白色幼虫，除了退化的口器外没有其他特征。它倒挂在自己的巢室里，并反刍出一种带有甜味的液体，以换取下面工蜂给它喂食内脏碎片。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wasp pupa"
msgid_plural "wasp pupae"
msgstr[0] "黃蜂蛹"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wasp pupa"
msgid ""
"A wasp larva undergoing metamorphosis into a full-grown giant wasp.  It looks "
"like a strangely immobile adult coated in a thin white membrane, its legs and "
"wings packed tightly into its cell."
msgstr "一只黄蜂幼虫，正在蜕变成为一只成年巨型黄蜂。它看起来像一个被一层薄薄的白色薄膜包裹着的奇怪凝结不动的成年体，它的腿和翅膀紧紧地包在巢室里。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp"
msgid_plural "oversized wasps"
msgstr[0] "超大黃蜂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp"
msgid ""
"A huge wasp the size of a large cat with bright yellow markings on her "
"jet-black carapace and a threatening stinger.  She flies around erratically, "
"searching for smaller prey."
msgstr "一只体型有成年猫那么大的巨型黄蜂，黑色的甲壳上长着亮黄色的斑纹，还有一根凶猛的毒刺。它飘忽不定地飞行，寻找着比它更小的猎物。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp guard"
msgid_plural "oversized wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "超大黃蜂守衛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp guard"
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp worker, buzzing around the nest.  While her foraging sisters "
"are relatively content to leave you be, this one won't hesitate to attack "
"anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr "一只变异的巨型黄蜂工蜂，在它的巢穴周围嗡嗡作响。虽然它的觅食蜂姐妹相对而言不爱搭理你，但这只会毫不犹豫地攻击任何它认为对巢穴构成威胁的东西。别在此逗留了。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp queen"
msgid_plural "oversized wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "超大黃蜂蜂后"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp queen"
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp queen grown to the size of a person, laying a single white egg "
"in each empty cell she comes across while scurrying around on the paper walls "
"of her home.  She struggles to fit into some of them, but the newer cells "
"seem to be getting larger…"
msgstr ""
"一只长到了成人的大小的变异黄蜂蜂后，它在其巢穴的纸墙上到处乱爬，并在每一个空巢室中都产下一枚白色的卵。它的体型很难被塞进其中某些巢室之中，但新建的巢室看起来"
"都似乎变得越来越大……"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp"
msgid_plural "giant wasps"
msgstr[0] "巨黃蜂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp"
msgid ""
"A gigantic wasp worker, scouring the landscape for an easy meal to feed the "
"next generation.  Her abdomen glowers with ominous yellow stripes and ends in "
"a half-hidden stinger the size of a kitchen knife."
msgstr "一只巨型黄蜂工蜂，在周围土地上搜寻着狩猎目标来喂养下一代。它的腹部上的黄色条纹发出不祥的光，末端长着一根菜刀大小的半隐藏的毒刺。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp guard"
msgid_plural "giant wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "巨黃蜂守衛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp guard"
msgid ""
"A wasp worker grown to the size of a person, buzzing around her home.  While "
"her foraging sisters are relatively content to live and let live, this one "
"won't hesitate to attack anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't "
"linger."
msgstr ""
"一只体型长到成人大小的巨型黄蜂工蜂，在它的巢穴周围嗡嗡作响。虽然它的觅食蜂姐妹相对而言不爱搭理你，但这只会毫不犹豫地攻击任何它认为对巢穴构成威胁的东西。别在"
"此逗留了。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp queen"
msgid_plural "giant wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "巨黃蜂后"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp queen"
msgid ""
"A yellowjacket queen grown to the size of a horse, towering over her "
"daughters.  Even with her abdomen swollen with eggs and wings long unused she "
"still poses a threat to interlopers, should her children have failed at "
"subduing them."
msgstr ""
"一只体型像马一样大的身披黄夹克的蜂后，在它的女儿之中如同鹤立鸡群一般。即使它们的腹部长满了卵，翅膀也早已无用，但当它的子民未能制服入侵者时，它自身仍能对入侵"
"者构成威胁。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik larva"
msgid_plural "dermatik larvae"
msgstr[0] "變異蜂幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik larva"
msgid ""
"A fat white grub as big as a squirrel, with a pair of large, spadelike "
"mandibles."
msgstr "大約松鼠大小的肥胖蟲子， 有著一對大如鏟子的下顎。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik"
msgid_plural "dermatiks"
msgstr[0] "變異蜂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik"
msgid ""
"A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge ovipositor "
"extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a suitable home "
"for her many, many children."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的彩色的寄生蜂，腹部长着一个巨大的产卵器。它飞来飞去，为她许许多多的孩子寻找一处合适的家。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik midwife"
msgid_plural "dermatik midwives"
msgstr[0] "變異保育蜂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik midwife"
msgid ""
"A dermatik grown even larger, her wings and ovipositor chewed off by her "
"sisters.  She now stands watch in the nest, tending to the unfortunate hosts "
"dragged home and ensuring they don't perish before their purpose is fulfilled."
msgstr "一只翅膀和产卵器被她的姐妹们啃掉了的寄生蜂。它现在在巢穴里当看守，照顾那些被拖回家的不幸宿主，确保他们不会在目标实现之前死去。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "motionless deer"
msgid_plural "motionless deers"
msgstr[0] "一動不動的鹿"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "motionless deer"
msgid ""
"A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, "
"terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and "
"flee."
msgstr "一只瘫痪且瘦弱的鹿。当它注意到你的存在时，它抽搐了一下，当它发现自己无法站立或逃跑时，恐惧的眼睛在浑浊的眼眶中不停打转。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "motionless deer"
msgid "The sudden motion of their host cause some dermatik larvae to flee!"
msgstr "由于宿主突然的移动，导致一些寄生蜂幼虫逃了出来！"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "helpless dog"
msgid_plural "helpless dogs"
msgstr[0] "無助的狗"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "helpless dog"
msgid ""
"A barely living dog, panting in a pool of slime and blood.  As you draw near "
"it lets out a faint whimper, and you see the smallest hint of a twitch in its "
"tail."
msgstr "一只勉强还活着的狗，在一滩黏液和血泊中不停喘息。当你走近它时，它发出微弱的呜咽声，你看到它尾巴上有轻微的抽搐。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "twitching spider"
msgid_plural "twitching spiders"
msgstr[0] "不斷抽蓄的蜘蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "twitching spider"
msgid ""
"A giant, mutated spider lying on its back, legs twitching without pause.  A "
"translucent slime, mixed with its ichor seeps from its joints, and its chitin "
"is marked by numerous exit wounds."
msgstr "一只巨大的变异蜘蛛仰卧着，腿不停地抽搐。一种半透明的黏液，与它自身的体液混合后，从它的关节渗出，它的几丁质外壳上有许多破裂钻出的伤口。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized ant"
msgid_plural "oversized ants"
msgstr[0] "超大螞蟻"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized ant"
msgid ""
"A mutant red ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  She "
"possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异红蚂蚁，浑身覆盖着几丁质甲壳，长着一双扭动的触角和可怖的下颚。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant ant"
msgid_plural "giant ants"
msgstr[0] "巨蟻"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant ant"
msgid ""
"An enormous red ant covered in chitinous plates.  She possesses a pair of "
"wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr "一只红色巨蚁，浑身覆盖着几丁质甲壳，长着一双扭动的触角和可怖的下颚。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized acidic ant"
msgid_plural "oversized acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "超大酸性螞蟻"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small "
"orifice at the tip.  Glistening liquid drips out periodically."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异棕色蚂蚁，它肿胀的腹部末端长着一个小孔，有闪闪发光的液体不时从中滴出。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "酸液巨蟻"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A monstrous brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small orifice "
"at the tip.  Glistening liquid seems to drip out periodically."
msgstr "一只红色巨蚁，它肿胀的腹部末端长着一个小孔，似乎有闪闪发光的液体周期性地从中滴出。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "giant acidic ant"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic ant larva"
#. ~ Death message of monster "giant acidic soldier ant"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic zombear"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic zombie horse"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "corrosive zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "spitter zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "wretched puker"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic zombie dog"
#. ~ Death message of monster "gastro bufo"
#. ~ Death message of monster "MoxPhore Emetic"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acid dilophosaurus"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acid ceratosaurus"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body leaks acid."
msgstr "%s 的軀體滲出酸液。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic ant larva"
msgid_plural "acidic ant larvae"
msgstr[0] "酸液巨蟻幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic ant larva"
msgid ""
"A squirming yellow grub that seems to be oozing liquid from both ends of its "
"body.  It appears its chitin hasn't developed enough to resist acid."
msgstr "一只蠕动的黄色蠕虫，身体两端似乎微微渗着液体。看来它的几丁质外皮尚未发展出足够的酸抗性。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic queen ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic queen ants"
msgstr[0] "巨型酸蚁蚁后"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic queen ant"
msgid ""
"An enormous brown ant with an elongated, pulsating abdomen.  Her orifice "
"seems developed only for egg-laying rather than spraying acid like the rest "
"of the colony, but she doesn't seem affected by the acrid liquid either."
msgstr "一只棕色巨蚁，长着不断搏动拉伸的腹部，它的孔口似乎只用于产卵，而不是像其他同类一样喷射酸液，并且腐蚀液体对其似乎没有影响。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic soldier ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "巨型酸蚁士兵"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A massive woolly brown ant that towers over the worker ants with a giant head "
"crest.  Along with her huge mandibles, a corrosive liquid seeps from the end "
"of her bloated abdomen."
msgstr "一只毛茸茸的棕色巨蚁，长着高出工蚁的巨大头冠，以及巨大的下颚，某种腐蚀性液体从它膨胀的腹部的尾端渗出。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "super soldier acidic ant"
msgid_plural "super soldier acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "超巨型酸蚁士兵"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, woolly brown ant.  Corrosive liquid seeping from her huge "
"mandibles.  Given the relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't "
"doubt that this one could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr ""
"一只体型和奶牛一般大小的毛茸茸褐色巨蚁，。腐蚀性液体从它的巨大下颚渗出。考虑到蚂蚁的相对力量与其身体大小的关系，你毫不怀疑这只蚂蚁能轻易推着汽车到处跑，或者"
"撕裂坚固的墙壁。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ant larva"
msgid_plural "ant larvae"
msgstr[0] "螞蟻幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ant larva"
msgid ""
"A pulsating sausage of glistening white flesh, the size of a large cat.  On "
"one end is a set of squirming mouth parts."
msgstr "一條有脈動的白色血肉， 大小與大貓的尺寸相仿。在一端有著蠕動的口器。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant queen ant"
msgid_plural "giant queen ants"
msgstr[0] "巨型蚁后"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant queen ant"
msgid ""
"A colossal red ant with a bulging, bloated thorax.  She moves slowly and "
"deliberately, tending to nearby eggs and continually laying more."
msgstr "一只胸腔肿胀的巨大的红色蚂蚁。它移动缓慢而从容，在照顾四周的卵的同时继续产下更多的蚁卵。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant soldier ant"
msgid_plural "giant soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "巨型兵蚁"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A huge and hairy red ant almost twice the size of other giant ants.  Bulging "
"pincers extend from her jaws."
msgstr "一只毛茸茸的红色巨蚁，几乎有其他巨蚁两倍大小。从它的下颚伸出一对凸出的钳子。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "super soldier ant"
msgid_plural "super soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "超級兵蟻"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy red ant.  Bulging pincers extend from her jaws.  Given the "
"relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't doubt that this one "
"could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr ""
"一只体型和奶牛一般大小的毛茸茸的红色巨蚁。它的下巴长出了一对凸出的钳子。考虑到蚂蚁的相对力量与其身体大小的关系，你毫不怀疑这只蚂蚁能轻易推着汽车到处跑，或者"
"撕裂坚固的墙壁。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized locust"
msgid_plural "oversized locusts"
msgstr[0] "超大蝗蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized locust"
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a small dog, with big eyes and "
"long, powerful legs."
msgstr "一只体型和小狗一般大小的黄褐色变异蝗虫，长着一双大眼和有力的长腿。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant locust"
msgid_plural "giant locusts"
msgstr[0] "巨大蝗蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant locust"
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a dog with big eyes and long, "
"powerful legs.  You don't think it'll eat you, but it could cause massive "
"damage to nearby plants."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的黄褐色变异蝗虫，长着一双大眼和有力的长腿。它可能不会吃掉你，但是会严重损害周围的植被。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "famine"
msgid_plural "famines"
msgstr[0] "超巨型蝗蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "famine"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized yellow and brown mutated locust with huge, staring eyes and long, "
"powerful legs.  The bane of the post-apocalyptic farmer."
msgstr "一只体型和奶牛一般大小的黄褐色变异蝗虫，长着一双大眼和有力的长腿。大灾变后农民的祸害。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "locust nymph"
msgid_plural "locust nymphs"
msgstr[0] "巨蝗若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "locust nymph"
msgid ""
"A locust the size of a rabbit.  You'd hate to think what a swarm of these "
"could do."
msgstr "跟兔子一般大的巨蝗幼蟲。你難以想像要是這物種成群該怎麼辦。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized aphid"
msgid_plural "oversized aphids"
msgstr[0] "超大蚜蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized aphid"
msgid ""
"This huge aphid is as big as a hamster.  It's not as thirsty as bigger ones, "
"but a herd of these could eat your crops easily."
msgstr "一只体型和仓鼠一般大小的蚜虫。虽然它不像大的那么饥渴，但一群这样的家伙可以很轻松地吃光你的庄稼。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant aphid"
msgid_plural "giant aphids"
msgstr[0] "巨型蚜蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant aphid"
msgid ""
"A green aphid about the size of a rabbit.  It is constantly searching for "
"plants to suck from."
msgstr "一只体型和兔子一般大小的蚜虫。它不断地寻找可以吸取的植物。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized praying mantis"
msgid_plural "oversized praying mantises"
msgstr[0] "超大螳螂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized praying mantis"
msgid ""
"A green mutant insect with sharp grappling spikes on its front legs.  It's a "
"little smaller than an adult person."
msgstr "一只绿色的变异昆虫，前腿上长着尖锐的钩刺。它的体型比成年人稍小一点。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant praying mantis"
msgid_plural "giant praying mantises"
msgstr[0] "巨型螳螂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant praying mantis"
msgid ""
"An enormous green insect grown to about the size of a bear.  It moves in a "
"weird, dance-like pattern and looks ready to chop your head off at any moment."
msgstr "一只体型和熊一般大小的巨型绿色昆虫。它以一种奇怪的、舞蹈般的模式移动，仿佛随时都可能把你的头砍掉。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "praying mantis nymph"
msgid_plural "praying mantis nymphs"
msgstr[0] "螳螂若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "praying mantis nymph"
msgid ""
"A mantis nymph about the size of a dog.  Even though its far smaller than the "
"adults, you have a feeling it wouldn't take kindly to you coming too close."
msgstr "一隻大約有狗那麼大的螳螂若蟲。儘管它比成年人小得多，但你有一種感覺，你離它太近的話它將不會善待你。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "great mantis"
msgid_plural "great mantises"
msgstr[0] "超巨型螳螂"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "great mantis"
msgid ""
"This ferocious cow-sized mantis stalks the fields of New England.  It's "
"probably capable of killing a moose with its powerful arms."
msgstr "這隻像牛一般大小的兇猛螳螂在新英格蘭的田野裡出沒。它也許能夠用強大的前臂殺死駝鹿。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mole cricket"
msgid_plural "giant mole crickets"
msgstr[0] "巨型螻蛄"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mole cricket"
msgid ""
"An enormous underground bug.  Beware its ear-splitting screech and strong "
"shovel-like front legs."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的地下昆虫。当心它所发出刺耳的尖叫声和结实的铲子形前腿。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mole cricket nymph"
msgid_plural "mole cricket nymphs"
msgstr[0] "螻蛄若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mole cricket nymph"
msgid "A whitish mole cricket nymph the size of a dog."
msgstr "一隻像狗那麼大的白色螻蛄若蟲。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized lady bug"
msgid_plural "oversized lady bugs"
msgstr[0] "超大瓢蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized lady bug"
msgid ""
"This is a mutated lady bug the size of a big dog.  While not as dangerous as "
"her giant sisters, she's still troublesome to deal with."
msgstr "一只体型和大狗一般的变异瓢虫。虽然不像她的巨型姐妹那样危险，但她仍然很难对付。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant lady bug"
msgid_plural "giant lady bugs"
msgstr[0] "巨型瓢蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant lady bug"
msgid ""
"The normal-sized version of this red and black beetle is generally considered "
"cute, and is adored by children and associated with good luck.  This monster, "
"on the other hand is clearly a ferocious predator capable of killing swarms "
"of ants, aphids, and unprepared humans."
msgstr ""
"这种红黑相间的甲虫的正常体型下通常被认为很可爱，深受孩子们的喜欢，被认为会带来好运。另一方面，这种怪物显然变成了某种凶猛的捕食者，能够杀死成群的蚂蚁、蚜虫和"
"毫无准备的人类。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lady bug larva"
msgid_plural "lady bug larvae"
msgstr[0] "瓢虫幼体"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lady bug larva"
msgid ""
"A large armored larva looking not unlike a centipede.  Even though it's just "
"a juvenile the armor on its back already looks functional."
msgstr "一只身上有甲壳的大瓢虫，不像是蜈蚣。即便还是幼虫，但它背上的甲壳看起来已经有实际作用了。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized grasshopper"
msgid_plural "oversized grasshoppers"
msgstr[0] "超大蚱蜢"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized grasshopper"
msgid "A large grasshopper a few times bigger than a regular one."
msgstr "一只体型比普通蚱蜢大几倍的大蚱蜢。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant grasshopper"
msgid_plural "giant grasshoppers"
msgstr[0] "巨型蚱蜢"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant grasshopper"
msgid ""
"A huge green grasshopper about the size of a big dog, with long and strong "
"back legs.  It hops, it hops and never stops."
msgstr "一只体型和大狗一般大小的巨型绿色蚱蜢，后腿又长又壮。它跳啊，跳啊，跳个不停。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grasshopper nymph"
msgid_plural "grasshopper nymphs"
msgstr[0] "蚱蜢若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grasshopper nymph"
msgid "A grasshopper nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "一隻像兔子那麼大的蚱蜢若蟲。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant stag beetle larva"
msgid_plural "giant stag beetle larvae"
msgstr[0] "大型鍬形蟲幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant stag beetle larva"
msgid ""
"Something about this cow-sized larva is pitiable, despite its immense size "
"and sickening cream color."
msgstr "这只体型有奶牛大小的幼虫有些无助，尽管它体形巨大，而且呈出令人恶心的奶油色。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant stag beetle"
msgid_plural "giant stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "大型鍬形蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant stag beetle"
msgid ""
"It was called a giant even before the Cataclysm, but now this mutant beetle "
"is the size of a small horse.  It looks ready to molt again, even though "
"parts of the shell are still soft."
msgstr "虽然在大灾变之前这种昆虫的体型就已经很大了，但现在这种变异甲虫有一匹小马那么大。它看起来准备再次蜕皮，即使外壳部分仍然柔软。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "massive stag beetle"
msgid_plural "massive stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "巨型鍬形蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "massive stag beetle"
msgid ""
"This enormous stag beetle has reached mutated maturity, but continues to "
"grow.  Thankfully, that growth is exposing vulnerable cracks of flesh in the "
"strained chitin."
msgstr "这只体型巨大的鹿甲虫已经变异成熟，但仍在继续生长。谢天谢地，异常生长暴露出了变形甲壳裂缝下脆弱的肉体。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "massive stag
#. beetle"
msgid "a soft section of chitin"
msgstr "柔軟的甲殼"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "massive stag
#. beetle"
msgid "a crack in the chitin"
msgstr "甲殼上的裂痕"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "titan stag beetle"
msgid_plural "titan stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "超巨型鍬形蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "titan stag beetle"
msgid ""
"This stag beetle rivals an armored personnel carrier in size, bearing horns "
"that could fell a tree and chitin thick enough to ignore most bullets.  Its "
"bulky shell looks nigh-impenetrable, and the cracks have sealed with a foul "
"paste."
msgstr ""
"这种鹿甲虫的大小可以与一辆装甲运兵车媲美，它的角可以轻松推倒大树，甲壳厚度可以无视大多数子弹。它笨重的外壳看起来几乎无法穿透，而且甲壳上的裂缝已经被某种肮脏"
"黏液封死了。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "titan stag beetle"
msgid "a foul scar in the chitin"
msgstr "甲壳上的可怕疤痕"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant antlion larva"
msgid_plural "giant antlion larvae"
msgstr[0] "巨型蟻獅幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant antlion larva"
msgid ""
"This huge grub has powerful mandibles and a hungry look.  It hides in the "
"dirt and awaits its prey."
msgstr "这只巨大的幼虫长着强壮的下颚，看起来很饥饿。它躲在泥土里等待着猎物送上门。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant adult antlion"
msgid_plural "giant adult antlions"
msgstr[0] "巨型蟻獅"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant adult antlion"
msgid ""
"A ferocious mutant flying antlion as big as a cat, darting through the air "
"with a cluster of fangs for a mouth.  Despite its dangerous looks, it doesn't "
"seem interested in you."
msgstr "一只体型和猫一般大小的变异飞行蚁蛉，十分凶猛，四处飞窜，长着锋利的獠牙。尽管看起来很危险，但它似乎对你不感兴趣。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized water strider"
msgid_plural "oversized water striders"
msgstr[0] "超大水黽"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized water strider"
msgid ""
"This water bug is several times larger than a regular one.  Its movements are "
"fast and fluid."
msgstr "这只水生昆虫大小比普通的要大上好几倍。它的动作既快又流畅。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water strider"
msgid_plural "giant water striders"
msgstr[0] "巨型水黽"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water strider"
msgid ""
"This water glider is about as big as a domestic cat.  Its legs are more "
"fin-like and a swollen body is mostly submerged underwater."
msgstr "一只体型和家猫一般大小的水黾。它的腿更像鳍，肿胀的身体大部分被淹没在水下。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "water strider nymph"
msgid_plural "water strider nymphs"
msgstr[0] "水黽若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "water strider nymph"
msgid "A water strider nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "一隻像兔子那麼大的水黽若蟲。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized butterfly"
msgid_plural "oversized butterflies"
msgstr[0] "超大蝴蝶"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized butterfly"
msgid ""
"An oversized butterfly with vibrant colored markings.  Unlike the other big "
"insects of the Cataclysm this is a very peaceful nectivore."
msgstr "一隻超大的蝴蝶，身上有鮮豔的彩色斑紋。與大災變中的其他變種大昆蟲不同，這是一種非常平靜的食蜜昆蟲。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant butterfly"
msgid_plural "giant butterflies"
msgstr[0] "巨型蝴蝶"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant butterfly"
msgid ""
"A mutated butterfly larger than a human.  Despite its size it is very "
"lightweight and feeds mainly on the nectar produced by triffid flowers."
msgstr "一只体型比人稍大的变异蝴蝶。尽管它的体积很大，但重量很轻，主要以三尖树花蜜为食。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "emperor butterfly"
msgid_plural "emperor butterflies"
msgstr[0] "帝王蝴蝶"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "emperor butterfly"
msgid ""
"An enormous butterfly with regal looking wings.  This giant of the sky flies "
"cheerfully under the sun, leaving dust as it passes."
msgstr "一只长着帝王般翅膀的巨型蝴蝶。这个天空中的巨人在阳光下欢快地飞翔，在经过时留下了无数微尘。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized moth"
msgid_plural "oversized moths"
msgstr[0] "超大飛蛾"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized moth"
msgid ""
"An oversized moth with its typical wood-like motifs.  It is as peaceful as "
"the mutated butterflies found during the day."
msgstr "一隻超大飛蛾，具有典型的木質圖案。就像白天發現的變種蝴蝶一樣平靜。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth"
msgid_plural "giant moths"
msgstr[0] "巨型飞蛾"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth"
msgid ""
"A mutated moth larger than a human.  It silently flies with its huge wings "
"after dusk looking for nocturnal flowers to feed upon."
msgstr "一只体型比人稍大的变异飞蛾。在黄昏后，它用巨大的翅膀静静地飞翔，寻找夜间活动的花朵为食。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lunar moth"
msgid_plural "lunar moths"
msgstr[0] "月后飞蛾"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lunar moth"
msgid ""
"A majestic moth painted in pale colors.  This giant of the night only comes "
"out after the moon is out, leaving glittering dust."
msgstr "一只浑身惨白的体型雄伟的巨型飞蛾。这个夜晚中的巨人只有在月亮出来后才出来，所过之处留下微尘。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant caterpillar"
msgid_plural "giant caterpillars"
msgstr[0] "巨型毛毛虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant caterpillar"
msgid ""
"The larval stage of a butterfly or a moth.  This one appears to be about your "
"size so you can only imagine the size of the insect that it will grow into."
msgstr "蝴蝶或蛾子的幼虫阶段。这只看起来已经和你的大小差不多了，所以你只能想象它蜕变为成虫后会有多大。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cocoon"
msgid_plural "giant cocoons"
msgstr[0] "巨茧"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cocoon"
msgid ""
"A caterpillar undergoing a metamorphosis.  Considering the size of the cocoon "
"you have a feeling the emerging adult will be massive as well."
msgstr "正在蜕变的毛毛虫。考虑到茧的大小，你已经能感觉到新生的成虫会有多巨大了。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cicada nymph"
msgid_plural "cicada nymphs"
msgstr[0] "蟬若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cicada nymph"
msgid ""
"The mutated larval form of a cicada.  It doesn't produce noise like the "
"adults but its digging claws seem suited for scratching."
msgstr "蝉的变异幼虫。它不像成蝉那样发出噪音，但它的用来挖掘的爪子似乎很能抓挠。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cicada"
msgid_plural "giant cicadas"
msgstr[0] "巨型蝉"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cicada"
msgid ""
"A huge cicada the size of a person.  These insects are mostly harmless but "
"may bite if attacked and produce a loud buzzing sound."
msgstr "一只体型和人一般大小的巨型蝉。这些昆虫大多无害，但如果受到攻击，可能会咬人并发出响亮的嗡嗡声。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant woodlouse"
msgid_plural "giant woodlice"
msgstr[0] "巨型潮虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant woodlouse"
msgid ""
"A woodlouse grown to the size of a dog.  These humble crustaceans are "
"harmless and enjoy damp places."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的潮虫。这些不起眼的甲壳类动物无害，喜欢潮湿的地方。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "woodlouse manca"
msgid_plural "woodlouse mancae"
msgstr[0] "潮虫若虫"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "woodlouse manca"
msgid ""
"Woodlice reproduce by carrying their eggs in a pouch and releasing them as "
"juveniles.  Their mancae look like small adults except for their pale color."
msgstr "潮虫通过将卵装入育儿袋中并等其长成幼体后再释放来繁殖。除了苍白的颜色，它们的幼虫看起来像是缩小版的成虫。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water tiger"
msgid_plural "giant water tigers"
msgstr[0] "巨型龙虱"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water tiger"
msgid ""
"The predatory, aquatic larva of a diving beetle grown to large proportions.  "
"It is quite slow but still a good ambusher."
msgstr "一只体形庞大的捕食性水生幼虫。它相当慢，但仍然是一个很好的伏击者。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant diving beetle"
msgid_plural "giant diving beetles"
msgstr[0] "巨型龍蝨"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant diving beetle"
msgid ""
"Water beetles can be found in all freshwater environments, with diving "
"beetles being their predatory variant.  These however seem to have grown far "
"larger with the Cataclysm."
msgstr "龙虱可以各种淡水环境中找到，水龟虫是它们的捕食者变种。然而，随着大灾变的发生，这些昆虫体型似乎变得更大了。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water scorpion"
msgid_plural "giant water scorpions"
msgstr[0] "巨型水蝎"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water scorpion"
msgid ""
"A slender relative of the water bug, grown close to human size.  It uses its "
"long tail as a snorkel while ambushing prey."
msgstr "龙虱的近亲，体形修长，体型长到和人一般大小。在伏击猎物时，它用它的长尾作为通气管。"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "water scorpion nymph"
msgid_plural "water scorpion nymphs"
msgstr[0] "水斧蟲若蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "water scorpion nymph"
msgid "The nymph of a water scorpion, looks like a smaller version of its parents."
msgstr "水斧蟲若蟲，看起來像是它父母的縮小版。"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fleshy shambler"
msgid_plural "fleshy shamblers"
msgstr[0] "鮮肉跛行獸"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fleshy shambler"
msgid ""
"An amalgamation of throbbing organs from various creatures have fused "
"together into this lurching, vaguely-humanoid shape.  Its myriad "
"roughly-formed mouths susurrate in a chorus of sibilant groans and whispers."
msgstr "各种生物跳动的器官融合在一起，形成了这个蹒跚而行、略为人型的怪物。无数临时拼凑形成的嘴颤抖着不断发出咝咝作响的呻吟和低语。"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flesh golem"
msgid_plural "flesh golems"
msgstr[0] "血肉魔像"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flesh golem"
msgid ""
"A seeping conglomeration of spasming muscle and organs have fused together "
"into this towering caricature of the human form.  Various organs fall off of "
"its hulking body only to be reabsorbed moments later."
msgstr "一只体型高耸的怪诞人型怪物，由痉挛的肌肉和器官融合而成。各种器官从它笨重的身体上脱落，但马上就重新被其躯体吸收。"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jabberwock"
msgid_plural "jabberwocks"
msgstr[0] "變種人魔獸"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jabberwock"
msgid ""
"A putrid amalgamation of body parts from humans and other creatures have "
"fused together in this aberration of flesh.  The eyes of all the heads dart "
"about rapidly and the mouths form a chorus of groaning screams."
msgstr "許多腐爛的人類和動物融合成噁心的形體， 上面的所有頭顱會快速的眨眼而嘴巴會發出尖叫與呻吟。"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "stalker octopus"
msgid_plural "stalker octopuses"
msgstr[0] "章魚潛行者"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Description of monster "stalker octopus"
msgid ""
"This octopus seems larger than you remember from visits to the aquarium and "
"doesn't seem as slowed by land as would be expected.  Its body seems to mimic "
"its surroundings."
msgstr "这只章鱼看起来比你参观水族馆时记得的要大，而且也并未如你所想的那样在陆地上减慢速度。它的身体似乎在模仿周围的环境。"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "octopus spawn"
msgid_plural "octopus spawns"
msgstr[0] "章魚幼仔"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "octopus spawn"
#. ~ Description of monster "Cecaelian Spawn"
msgid ""
"A young Cecaelia.  If one is out here, a very protective parent is likely "
"nearby."
msgstr "一個年輕的章魚人。如果你發現了一個，那保護欲極強的父母肯定也在附近。"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "kraken"
msgid_plural "kraken"
msgstr[0] "克拉肯海怪"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Description of monster "kraken"
msgid "The kind of octopus that can take down small boats by itself."
msgstr "這種章魚的體型足以輕易擊沉一條小船。"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scylla"
msgid_plural "scylla"
msgstr[0] "斯庫拉"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scylla"
msgid ""
"The water froths as a great bulk of tentacles breach the surface.  A great "
"bulk swiftly rises until the beak rises above the water and a shriek erupts "
"from the beast."
msgstr "水面不停得冒出泡泡，随后大量触手突出水面。一个巨大的身体迅速浮现上升，直到尖喙露出水面，随后这只怪兽发出刺耳的尖啸。"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Message of spell "green_maintenance_check ( Green Maintenance Badge Trait
#. )"
#. ~ Message of spell "yellow_maintenance_check ( Ocher Maintenance Badge
#. Trait )"
#. ~ Message of spell "blue_maintenance_check ( Blue Maintenance Badge Trait
#. )"
#. ~ Message of spell "blue_maintenance_check2 ( Blue Maintenance Badge Trait
#. )"
#. ~ Message of spell "green_researcher_check ( Light Green Researcher Badge
#. Trait )"
#. ~ Message of spell "black_security_check ( Black Security Badge Trait )"
msgid "the drone scans for your ID badge."
msgstr "无人机扫描了你的访问授权钥匙卡。"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "GREEN_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "YELLOW_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLUE_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLUE_MAINTENANCE_ALARM2"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "GREEN_RESEARCHER_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLACK_SECURITY_ALARM"
msgid "Hello, valued employee."
msgstr "欢迎回来，重要雇员。"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "GREEN_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "YELLOW_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLUE_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLUE_MAINTENANCE_ALARM2"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "GREEN_RESEARCHER_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLACK_SECURITY_ALARM"
msgid "Remain in place, unauthorized person.  Security has been activated."
msgstr "留在原地，未授权人员。安保措施已激活。"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "GM security drone"
msgid_plural "GM security drones"
msgstr[0] "保全無人機（綠色）"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Description of monster "GM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "OM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "BM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "LGR security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "BS security drone"
msgid ""
"A small quadcopter drone, it has a camera and speaker visible.  It patrols "
"the surrounding area in a regular manner, continuously scanning individuals "
"it encounters even if there is hardly anything left of them."
msgstr "一架小型四旋翼无人机，上面安装了摄像头和扬声器。它定期巡逻附近区域，不断扫描它遇到的每个人，即便这里已经没有多少活人了。"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "GM security drone"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "OM security drone"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "BM security drone"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "LGR security drone"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "BS security drone"
msgid "Remain still.  Scanning for authorization."
msgstr "請勿移動。掃描授權狀態中。"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "OM security drone"
msgid_plural "OM security drones"
msgstr[0] "保全無人機（赭色）"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "BM security drone"
msgid_plural "BM security drones"
msgstr[0] "保全無人機（藍色）"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "LGR security drone"
msgid_plural "LGR security drones"
msgstr[0] "保全無人機（淺綠色）"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "BS security drone"
msgid_plural "BS security drones"
msgstr[0] "保全無人機（黑色）"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bat"
msgid_plural "bats"
msgstr[0] "蝙蝠"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bat"
msgid ""
"One of the vesper bats, a family of winged insect-eating mammals.  It roosts "
"in caves and other hollows, and uses a form of echolocation to aerially "
"navigate through tricky terrain at rapid speeds."
msgstr "夜行蝙蝠的一種， 一種群居性的吃昆蟲的有翅哺乳類。其棲息於洞窟或凹地， 利用超音波來進行定位， 同時夠在錯綜複雜的地形快速的飛行。"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black bear cub"
msgid_plural "black bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "黑熊幼崽"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black bear cub"
msgid ""
"A juvenile American black bear.  This one isn't much of a threat, but be wary "
"of its parent; black bears are known for their protectiveness."
msgstr "幼年的美國黑熊。看起來沒太多威脅性，但最好警惕牠的父母；黑熊是以保護幼體而聞名。"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black bear"
msgid_plural "black bears"
msgstr[0] "黑熊"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black bear"
msgid ""
"The American black bear.  A large omnivorous scavenger, it has powerful claws "
"and jaws, and is an effective ambush hunter.  Most individuals are shy around "
"humans, but they're fiercely protective of their cubs."
msgstr "美國黑熊。大型的雜食性動物，擁有強力的爪子與下顎，是個有效率的伏擊狩獵者。大部分的個體都不太會主動靠近人類，但會在保護幼熊時變得兇猛。"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "beaver"
msgid_plural "beavers"
msgstr[0] "河狸"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "beaver"
msgid ""
"The North American beaver, the continent's largest rodent.  Its paddle-shaped "
"tail helps ferry it through the water, and its prominent teeth can chew "
"through wood, which it uses to build dam-like nests in lakes and streams."
msgstr "北美的河狸， 陸地上最大的囓齒動物。其槳形的尾巴， 能在水中擺動前進， 突出的牙齒能夠咬斷木頭， 並且能夠用來在水流中建造類似水壩的巢。"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "beaver kit"
msgid_plural "beaver kits"
msgstr[0] "河狸幼崽"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "beaver kit"
msgid "A small baby beaver."
msgstr "一只小小的河狸幼崽。"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black rat"
msgid_plural "black rats"
msgstr[0] "黑鼠"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black rat"
msgid ""
"The black rat, an omnivorous rodent with sheer black fur and a long, rough "
"tail.  Harbinger of pestilence, famine, and mange, it will sometimes swarm "
"over the dead or dying."
msgstr "這隻黑鼠是一種雜食性動物， 有著黑色毛皮與長長粗粗的尾巴。瘟疫、饑荒的帶原者， 有時候會對著屍體或瀕死之人蜂擁而上。"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lab rat"
msgid_plural "lab rats"
msgstr[0] "實驗白老鼠"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lab rat"
msgid ""
"The albino Norway rat, an omnivorous rodent with sleek white fur and a long, "
"rough tail.  While its ancestors were harbingers of plague, these clever "
"animals are omnipresent in modern biomedical research.  Due to its albino "
"nature, its vision in both day and nighttime environments is very diminished."
msgstr ""
"通体雪白的挪威大鼠，是一只杂食性啮齿动物，皮毛油亮，尾巴粗长。虽然它们的祖先曾是瘟疫的预兆，但这些机敏的生物如今遍布现代生物医学实验室。由于白化特征，它在昼"
"夜环境下的视力都极为低下。"

