msgid "the knee"
msgstr "膝盖"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "debug monster"
msgid "the bugs"
msgstr "bug错误"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "weak debug grabber"
msgid_plural "weak debug grabbers"
msgstr[0] "抓取测试怪物（弱）"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "weak debug grabber"
msgid ""
"This monster exists only for grab testing purposes.  Same grab strength as a "
"basic zombie."
msgstr "这个怪物只用于抓取功能的测试。抓取能力与基础丧尸等同。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "middle-strength debug grabber"
msgid_plural "middle-strength debug grabbers"
msgstr[0] "抓取测试怪物（中）"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "middle-strength debug grabber"
msgid ""
"This monster exists only for grab testing purposes.  Same grab strength as a "
"Tier 2 grabbing zombie."
msgstr "这个怪物只用于抓取功能的测试。抓取能力与二级丧尸等同。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strong debug grabber"
msgid_plural "strong debug grabbers"
msgstr[0] "抓取测试怪物（强）"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strong debug grabber"
msgid ""
"This monster exists only for grab testing purposes.  Same grab strength as a "
"Tier 3 grabbing zombie."
msgstr "这个怪物只用于抓取功能的测试。抓取能力与三级丧尸等同。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_debug_grabber_left"
msgid "This grab testing monster has a strange fascination with your left arm."
msgstr "这只抓取测试怪物格外中意于你的左臂。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_debug_grabber_right"
msgid "This grab testing monster has a strange fascination with your right arm."
msgstr "这只抓取测试怪物格外中意于你的右臂。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "weak debug puller"
msgid_plural "weak debug pullers"
msgstr[0] "拉取测试怪物（弱）"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "weak debug puller"
msgid ""
"This 100kg monster exists only to test ranged pulls using the base 0.5 pull "
"weight ratio."
msgstr "这只100kg的怪物只用于拉取功能的测试，使用基础0.5拉动重量比的范围。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strong debug puller"
msgid_plural "strong debug pullers"
msgstr[0] "拉取测试怪物（强）"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strong debug puller"
msgid "This 100kg monster is strong enough to pull 250kg targets."
msgstr "这只100kg的怪物只用于拉取功能的测试，强大可以拉动250kg的目标。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "incompetent debug puller"
msgid_plural "incompetent debug pullers"
msgstr[0] "拖拽测试怪物（失败）"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "incompetent debug puller"
msgid ""
"This monster exists only to fail pulling its target despite technically being "
"able to.  Truly a cursed existence."
msgstr "这只怪物虽然有这种能力，但在拉取目标时成功概率为0，必定会失败。老倒霉蛋了。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "debug dragger"
msgid_plural "debug draggers"
msgstr[0] "拖动测试怪物"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "debug dragger"
msgid "This monster exists to drag you behind it briefly."
msgstr "这个怪物的存在是为了把你短暂地拖在它后面。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "weakpoint monster"
msgid_plural "weakpoint monsters"
msgstr[0] "测试用弱点怪物"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "weakpoint monster"
msgid "This monster exists only for weakpoint testing purposes."
msgstr "这只怪物只会在程序测试状态存在。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "weakpoint monster"
msgid "impossible to hit"
msgstr "无法命中"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ancient red dragon"
msgid_plural "ancient red dragons"
msgstr[0] "古代紅龍"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ancient red dragon"
msgid ""
"A towering, hulking dragon, with tremendous, curving horns and shining red "
"scales, its glowing maw peeled back in a hateful grimace as its eyes bore "
"into yours."
msgstr "一條巨大，笨重的龍，有著彎曲的尖角與閃亮的紅色鱗片，牠銳利的眼神從至高威嚴的龍顏上直瞪著你。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "generator"
msgid_plural "generators"
msgstr[0] "發電機"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "generator"
msgid "Your precious generator, noisily humming away.  Defend it at all costs!"
msgstr "你最珍惜的發電機， 發出嗡嗡的噪音。不惜代價保護它！"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "your mother"
msgid_plural "your mothers"
msgstr[0] "你媽"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "your mother"
msgid "Mom?"
msgstr "媽咪？"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "evil multi-cooker"
msgid_plural "evil multi-cookers"
msgstr[0] "邪惡的大同電鍋"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "evil multi-cooker"
msgid "The multi-cooker's got a mind of its own!  Look out!"
msgstr "那個大同電鍋有自我意識！小心了！"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mannequin"
msgid "Is this mannequin moving?"
msgstr "這個服裝模特兒在動?"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hologram"
msgid_plural "holograms"
msgstr[0] "全像投影"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hologram"
msgid "An image made from light, nearly identical to the real deal."
msgstr "完全由光組成的影像，與它參照的對象幾乎沒有區別。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "inflatable dragon"
msgid "A giant inflatable dragon for Halloween decorations."
msgstr "用於萬聖節裝飾的巨型充氣龍。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "inflatable ghost"
msgid "A human-sized inflatable ghost for Halloween decorations."
msgstr "用於萬聖節裝飾的真人大小的充氣幽靈。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mannequin decoy"
msgid "A human-sized mannequin, speaking pre-recorded phrases."
msgstr "一個真人大小的人體模型，說出預先錄製的短語。"

#: data/json/monsters/misc.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "mannequin decoy"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s falls over!"
msgstr "%s摔倒了！"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "freshwater snail"
msgid_plural "freshwater snails"
msgstr[0] "淡水蝸牛"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "freshwater snail"
msgid ""
"A tiny and shelled aquatic gastropod of either native or introduced stock.  "
"Dangerous to eat raw but properly cooked and cleaned it may serve as a fine "
"dish."
msgstr "一種微小的帶殼水生腹足動物，為本地或引進族群。生吃很危險，但經過適當煮熟和清洗，它也許會成為一道美味佳餚。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized snail"
msgid_plural "oversized snails"
msgstr[0] "超大蝸牛"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized snail"
msgid ""
"A shelled gastropod either of native or introduced stock.  This one looks "
"larger than usual."
msgstr "本地或引進族群的帶殼腹足動物。這隻看起來比平常尺寸大一些。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant snail"
msgid_plural "giant snails"
msgstr[0] "巨型蝸牛"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant snail"
msgid "A snail grown to human size.  Its mouth and underside dripping acid."
msgstr "一隻蝸牛長到了人類的大小。它的嘴和底面滴著酸液。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "snail larva"
msgid_plural "snail larvae"
msgstr[0] "蝸牛幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "snail larva"
msgid "A small snail larva."
msgstr "一隻小小的小蝸牛幼蟲。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "colossal snail"
msgid_plural "colossal snails"
msgstr[0] "超巨型蝸牛"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "colossal snail"
msgid ""
"An enormous gastropod with a massive shell on its back.  It slowly crawls "
"over the ground while leaving acid in its path."
msgstr "一種巨大的腹足動物，背上有巨大的殼。它慢慢地在地面上爬行，同時在路徑上留下酸液。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized slug"
msgid_plural "oversized slugs"
msgstr[0] "超大蛞蝓"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized slug"
msgid ""
"A gastropod either of native or introduced stock.  This one looks larger than "
"usual."
msgstr "本地或引進族群的腹足動物。這隻看起來比平常尺寸大一些。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant slug"
msgid_plural "giant slugs"
msgstr[0] "巨大蛞蝓"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant slug"
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large mutated slug as large as a human.  Venom drips from what "
"must be its mouth, and it is covered with sticky mucus."
msgstr "與人類一樣大的令人不安的變異蛞蝓。毒液從它的嘴裡滴出來，它身體覆蓋著粘稠的粘液。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "slug larva"
msgid_plural "slug larvae"
msgstr[0] "蛞蝓幼蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "slug larva"
msgid "A small slug larva."
msgstr "一隻小小的蛞蝓幼蟲。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "colossal slug"
msgid_plural "colossal slugs"
msgstr[0] "超巨型蛞蝓"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "colossal slug"
msgid ""
"A mutated leopard slug, as wide as a golf cart.  Venom dripping from its "
"fanged maw as it slithers around slowly, leaving a trail of glistening slime."
msgstr "變異的大蛞蝓，有高爾夫球車那麼寬。當它緩慢地滑行時，毒液從它長滿尖牙的嘴裡滴下來，留下一道閃閃發光的粘液痕跡。"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sludge crawler"
msgid_plural "sludge crawlers"
msgstr[0] "變種泥蟲"

#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sludge crawler"
msgid ""
"A sluglike creature, eight feet long and the width of a refrigerator.  Its "
"black body glistens as it oozes its way along the ground.  Eyestalks "
"occasionally push their way out of the oily mass and look around."
msgstr "像蛞蝓一樣的生物，八英尺長，冰箱寬。它黑色的身體閃閃發光沿著地面前進時，就像不斷往前滲出的黏液。眼柄偶爾會從油膩的團塊中伸出來環顧四周。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "experimental mutant"
msgid_plural "experimental mutants"
msgstr[0] "實驗突變體"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "experimental mutant"
msgid ""
"A deformed mutant in a torn jumpsuit, looking at you with insane hatred.  "
"Their skin is a chaotic mix of scales, fur and chitin, and their fingers end "
"in long talons."
msgstr "一個穿著破爛連身服的畸形突變體，用瘋狂的仇恨盯著你。它的皮膚是鱗片、毛皮和甲殼質的混亂混合體，它的手指末端有長長的爪子。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bestial mutant"
msgid_plural "bestial mutants"
msgstr[0] "野獸突變體"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bestial mutant"
msgid ""
"A towering mutated test subject, covered in thick fur and the torn bottom "
"part of a jumpsuit.  Their legs end in large padded feet not unlike a dog's, "
"but they still manage to stand upright, freeing up their clawed hands to tear "
"you apart."
msgstr ""
"一個身材高大的變異測試對象，全身覆蓋著厚厚的毛皮，連身服的底部也被撕破了。它們的腿末端長著大腳墊，與狗的腳沒什麼不同，但它們仍然能夠直立站著，伸出長著爪子的"
"手來把你撕碎。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ungulate mutant"
msgid_plural "ungulate mutants"
msgstr[0] "有蹄突變體"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ungulate mutant"
msgid ""
"A gigantic mutated test subject, still wearing the tattered remains of an "
"orange jumpsuit.  They walk on four warped legs ending in hooves, and their "
"head is dominated by a glistening, tangled crown of antlers that scratch the "
"ceiling."
msgstr "一個巨大的變異測試對象，仍然穿著橙色連身服的破爛殘骸。它們用四條彎曲的腿行走，腿的末端是蹄子，它們的頭部由閃閃發光、糾纏不清的鹿角佔據，鹿角劃破了天花板。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "arthropod mutant"
msgid_plural "arthropod mutants"
msgstr[0] "節肢突變體"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "arthropod mutant"
msgid ""
"A horribly mutated experimental subject.  Their original body - still wearing "
"an orange jumpsuit - flops around lifelessly, carried by twelve segmented "
"legs covered in hairy chitin erupting from their back.  At the base of the "
"front pair of legs, an almost-human scalp gives way to a dozen "
"irregularly-sized eyes and a set of mandibles, and from their hind end a "
"stinger not unlike a scorpion's emerges."
msgstr ""
"一個可怕的突變實驗對象。他們原來的身體——仍然穿著橙色的連身服——毫無生氣地翻來覆去，由十二條腿支撐著，腿上覆蓋著從背部噴出的毛茸茸的幾丁質。在最前面雙腿的"
"基部，有一個幾乎與人類相似的頭皮，裡面有十幾個大小不一的眼睛和一組下顎骨，而從它身體後部末端伸出了一根像蝎子那樣的毒刺。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "camouflaged mutant"
msgid_plural "camouflaged mutants"
msgstr[0] "偽裝突變體"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "camouflaged mutant"
msgid ""
"A mutated test subject, running on all fours at alarming speed.  Their short "
"fur changes color to match the background in an instant, making you struggle "
"to keep the thing in focus.  Their thin limbs end in long talons, and their "
"mouth is held perpetually open by a set of knife-sized fangs."
msgstr ""
"一个变异实验对象，以惊人的速度用四肢奔跑。它的短毛会在瞬间改变颜色以匹配背景，使你很难盯住它的移动路径。它纤细的四肢末端变成长长的爪子，它的嘴被一对刀刃大小"
"永远张开的尖牙所取代。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "transcendent mutant"
msgid_plural "transcendent mutants"
msgstr[0] "超凡突變體"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "transcendent mutant"
msgid ""
"An experimental subject wearing a surprisingly clean orange jumpsuit.  They "
"look unchanged at a distance, but as you approach their head spins towards "
"you with unnatural speed.  Their face is disconcertingly beautiful, but their "
"eyes shine with an intelligence far beyond human - and a deep disgust "
"directed at you."
msgstr ""
"一个实验对象，穿着一件干净得出奇的橙色连身衣。它在远处看起来没有变异化的迹象，但当你走近时，它的头以一种不自然的速度向你旋转。它的脸令人不安地美丽，但它的眼"
"中闪耀着远远超出人类的智慧——以及对你的深深厌恶。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "transcendent mutant"
msgid ""
"The mutant gestures at you and barks a few orders, sending its pack of "
"mutants into a frenzy."
msgstr "变种人向你做手势，吼出了几句指令，让它周围的一群变种人陷入疯狂。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mutant child"
msgid_plural "mutant children"
msgstr[0] "變種幼童"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mutant child"
msgid ""
"A thin child with a shaved head, wearing a too-large white lab coat over a "
"baggy orange jumpsuit.  They turn their head towards you with uncanny speed, "
"and you're taken aback by the inhuman curiosity burning in their eyes.  Their "
"angelic smile does very little to reassure you of their intentions."
msgstr ""
"一个剃了光头的瘦小孩子，穿着一件太大的白色实验服，外面套着一件宽松的橙色连身衣。它以不可思议的速度把头转向你，你被它眼中燃烧着非人好奇心吓了一跳。天使般的微"
"笑并不能让你确信它的意图。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "mutant child"
msgid ""
"The child's eyes widen, and they try to say something before falling to the "
"ground."
msgstr "孩子的眼睛睁得大大的，它试图在倒下之前说些什么。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shelled mutant"
msgid_plural "shelled mutants"
msgstr[0] "帶殼突變體"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shelled mutant"
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant hidden beneath a gray segmented shell, crawling on a "
"carpet of innumerable tentacles covered with suckers.  They hold three "
"thicker, branching limbs high on their front end, each dotted with dozens of "
"unblinking eyeballs."
msgstr "一个巨大的变种人，藏在一个分段的灰壳下，用无数覆盖着吸盘的触角在地毯上爬行。它的前端高举着三条较粗的分支肢体，每一条肢体上都点缀着几十个不眨眼的眼球。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Cerbearus"
msgid_plural "Cerbearuses"
msgstr[0] "三頭熊"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Cerbearus"
msgid ""
"Sometime between the Cataclysm and now, this black bear has gained two extra "
"heads.  This doesn't seem to have improved its disposition."
msgstr "从大灾变之后，这只黑熊又多了两个脑袋。但这似乎没有改变它暴躁的性格。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dambreaker"
msgid_plural "dambreakers"
msgstr[0] "毀壩河狸"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dambreaker"
msgid ""
"This mutated beaver is almost double its normal size, and its back is covered "
"with tough-looking bristles."
msgstr "这只变异河狸的体型几乎是原来的两倍，它的背部长满了坚硬的鬃毛。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dambreaker kit"
msgid_plural "dambreaker kits"
msgstr[0] "溃坝河狸幼崽"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dambreaker kit"
msgid "An unnaturally large baby beaver with an array of bristles covering its back."
msgstr "一只体型异常庞大的幼年溃坝河狸，背上布满粗硬的鬃毛。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feaver"
msgid_plural "feavers"
msgstr[0] "狂熱河狸"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feaver"
msgid ""
"This mutant beaver's body is covered with brightly-colored feathers in a "
"particularly eyecatching pattern.  It must have been very lucky not to have "
"been caught by a predator before now."
msgstr "这种变异河狸身体上覆盖着色彩鲜艳的羽毛，图案特别醒目。之前他一定足够幸运没有被捕食者抓住。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bald beaver kit"
msgid_plural "bald beaver kits"
msgstr[0] "秃毛幼狸"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bald beaver kit"
msgid ""
"This beaver kit lacks any fur covering its body, instead looking reminiscent "
"of a plucked chicken."
msgstr "这只覆羽河狸幼崽身上的毛都还没长出来，你感觉它看起来像只拔了毛的鸡。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grinning coyote"
msgid_plural "grinning coyotes"
msgstr[0] "獰笑郊狼"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grinning coyote"
msgid ""
"Were it not for the misshapen snout and visible teeth, this would look like "
"an ordinary Northeastern coyote.  Closer inspection of its mouth reveals row "
"after row of serrated, shark-like teeth."
msgstr "如果不看它变形的鼻子和牙齿，这就是一只郊狼。但仔细看它的嘴巴，可以发现成排像鲨鱼一样的锯齿状牙齿。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grinning coyote pup"
msgid_plural "grinning coyote pups"
msgstr[0] "龇牙郊狼幼崽"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grinning coyote pup"
#. ~ Description of monster "slavering coyote pup"
msgid "A cute coyote pup.  Though, on a closer look, something is off about it."
msgstr "一只可爱的郊狼幼崽。不过仔细一看，总觉得哪里不对劲。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "slavering coyote"
msgid_plural "slavering coyotes"
msgstr[0] "垂涎郊狼"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "slavering coyote"
msgid ""
"Unnatural bulges line the neck of this obviously-mutated coyote; green-tinted "
"foam flecks from its lips, and there's a crazed look in its eyes."
msgstr "一只明显变异的郊狼，颈部有不自然的鼓包，它的嘴边有飞溅出来的绿色泡沫，眼神中只有疯狂。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "slavering coyote pup"
msgid_plural "slavering coyote pups"
msgstr[0] "流涎郊狼幼崽"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spideer"
msgid_plural "spideers"
msgstr[0] "蜘蛛鹿"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spideer"
msgid ""
"This once-ordinary deer has grown a disturbingly agile array of extra limbs, "
"plus three extra eyes.  Its antlers wriggle subtly in the wind."
msgstr "一只曾经普通的变异鹿，如今多长出了些令人不安的肢体和三只灵活转动的眼睛，鹿角在风中敏锐的蠕动着。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spideer fawn"
msgid_plural "spideer fawns"
msgstr[0] "蜘蛛小鹿"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spideer fawn"
msgid ""
"This obviously mutated adolescent deer moves unsteadily on its eight legs, "
"nervously scanning the area with all five eyes."
msgstr "这只明显变异的幼鹿用八只脚不太稳定地移动，五只眼睛紧张地扫视着周边区域。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mongrel"
msgid_plural "mongrels"
msgstr[0] "雜種狗"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mongrel"
msgid ""
"This dog of unidentifiable breed looks like it has seen better days.  Its "
"wiry hair is patchy, revealing scales underneath, but it still happily wags "
"its tails anyways."
msgstr "这只无法辨认品种的狗看起来已经独自生存了好些日子，它的毛看起来乱七八糟的，但它仍然高兴地摇着尾巴。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Loper"
msgid_plural "Lopers"
msgstr[0] "冲锋犬"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Loper"
msgid ""
"This dog has undergone visible mutation.  While its body is larger than "
"normal, its legs are noticeably elongated, muscular and covered in long "
"cord-like fur.  It easily stands as tall as you and watches your every move "
"closely with reflective eyes."
msgstr ""
"这只狗发生了明显的变异。虽然它的身体比正常情况下大，但它的腿明显细长，肌肉发达，覆盖着长长的绳索状毛皮。它很容易站得和你一样高，用反光的眼睛仔细观察你的一举"
"一动。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Loper puppy"
msgid_plural "Loper puppies"
msgstr[0] "幼年冲锋犬"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Loper puppy"
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about "
"its legs seems off."
msgstr "一只可爱但不同寻常的小狗。它高兴地摇着尾巴，但腿上似乎有些不对劲。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Mauler"
msgid_plural "Maulers"
msgstr[0] "撕裂犬"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Mauler"
msgid ""
"This stocky dog has undergone visible mutation.  Its jaw has widened and "
"features more teeth than any dog should ever have.  While its toothy grin is "
"unnerving, its tail wags as energetically as ever."
msgstr "这只粗壮的狗发生了明显的变异。它的下巴变宽了，牙齿比任何狗都多。虽然它龇牙咧嘴的笑容令人不安，但它的尾巴却像往常一样充满活力地摇摆着。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Mauler puppy"
msgid_plural "Mauler puppies"
msgstr[0] "幼年撕裂犬"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Mauler puppy"
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about "
"its mouth seems off."
msgstr "一只可爱但不寻常的小狗。它高兴地摇着尾巴，但它的嘴似乎有些不对劲。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Thrasher"
msgid_plural "Thrashers"
msgstr[0] "猛禽犬"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Thrasher"
msgid ""
"This dog has undergone visible mutation.  Its paws are larger than normal and "
"have developed long digging nails.  Its fur is extremely short, barely "
"covering its leathery skin."
msgstr "这只狗发生了明显的变异。它的爪子比正常的要大，并且长出了长长的指甲。它的毛皮非常短，几乎覆盖在坚韧的皮肤上。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Thrasher puppy"
msgid_plural "Thrasher puppies"
msgstr[0] "幼年猛禽犬"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Thrasher puppy"
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about "
"its paws seems off."
msgstr "一只可爱但不寻常的小狗。它高兴地摇着尾巴，但是它的爪子看起来有些不对劲。"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dextrous raccoon"
msgid_plural "dextrous raccoons"
msgstr[0] "灵巧浣熊"

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dextrous raccoon"
msgid ""
"Its paws have grown to be longer, and it seems capable of briefly standing on "
"its hindlimbs.  You wonder if this sleazy beast is able to open doors yet."
msgstr "它的爪子变得更长了，似乎能短暂用后腿站立。你不禁怀疑这个坏家伙是不是已经学会开门了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "albino penguin"
msgid_plural "albino penguins"
msgstr[0] "白化企鵝"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "albino penguin"
msgid ""
"An eight-foot-tall, ghastly white penguin.  Its muscular body suggests "
"immense strength, but it seems placid unless otherwise provoked."
msgstr "一只八英尺（约2.4米）高、可怕的白色企鹅。它肌肉发达的身体显示出巨大的力量，但除非挑衅它，通常不会主动攻击人类。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "amigara horror"
msgid_plural "amigara horrors"
msgstr[0] "阿彌殼怪"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "amigara horror"
msgid ""
"A hellish, vaguely humanoid horror, two stories tall.  Its face is "
"grotesquely stretched out, its limbs deformed to unrecognizable outgrowths."
msgstr "地獄般的的恐怖人形怪物。約兩層樓高， 它的臉部扭曲的延伸出去， 四肢變形， 面目全非。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "blank body"
msgid_plural "blank bodies"
msgstr[0] "空白體"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "blank body"
msgid ""
"This is some form of unnatural changeling creature; its appearance is a bland "
"mockery of the human form.  Featureless and pale, its repugnant countenance "
"is all the more unsettling due to its lack of eyes and distinguishing "
"features except for a perfectly round mouth.  Adding to its unearthly "
"appearance is the way it moves, stiff and doll-like as though it was only "
"feigning knowing how to walk."
msgstr ""
"这是某种形式的非自然的变异生物；它的外表是对人类外形的平淡嘲弄。 "
"它没有特征，脸色苍白，除了一张完美的圆嘴外，没有眼睛和明显的特征，因此它令人厌恶的面孔更令人不安。 "
"它移动的方式更让人觉得不伦不类，僵硬得像个洋娃娃，仿佛它只是在假装知道如何走路。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "blood sacrifice"
msgid_plural "blood sacrifices"
msgstr[0] "血祭者"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "blood sacrifice"
msgid ""
"A defiled human body, once living.  Tortured to death long ago, it remains "
"chained to the altar, the putrescent flays of its peeled skin quivering like "
"so much flotsam upon a murky pond."
msgstr "這個可憐的受害者在不久前被折磨至死。並且被鐵鍊拴著， 皮膚破爛斑駁的被扒下，漂浮在血泊之中。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "breather"
msgid_plural "breathers"
msgstr[0] "喘息者"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "breather"
msgid ""
"This is some sort of unearthly pink flesh sac; moist and ridged with veins, "
"it is otherwise without discernible exterior features.  Seemingly immobile "
"and defenseless, it sits in place, swelling and collapsing upon itself as it "
"breathes."
msgstr "這是一種不自然的粉紅色肉囊。濕潤且具血管脈紋，沒有其它明顯的外部特徵。他似乎不做任何行動，且無任何防備的坐落於此，隨著呼吸頻率起伏。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "breather"
msgid ""
"A weird mass of immobile, breathing pink goo.  The other breathers seem to "
"originate from this one."
msgstr "一团呈粉红色诡异的，停滞不动的黏答答的血肉。其他的血肉呼吸者似乎都产自这个。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shrapnel swarm"
msgid_plural "shrapnel swarms"
msgstr[0] "裂片集群"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shrapnel swarm"
msgid ""
"Uncountable jagged spikes, cleaving reality as they fly through its invisible "
"seams."
msgstr "无数锯齿状的尖刺划破了现实，仿佛穿行于你所看不见的裂隙一般。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "shrapnel swarm"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s grows inert."
msgstr "%s 逐渐停止了移动。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "structural spur"
msgid_plural "structural spurs"
msgstr[0] "裂隙尖刺"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "structural spur"
msgid ""
"Misshapen spikes of concrete and rebar crumble upwards from the floor, held "
"aloft by strands of visual distortion.  Sound around it is drowned and "
"distorted into an incessant drone."
msgstr "无数残缺的混凝土和钢筋尖刺从地板向上刺出，被一串串的扭曲视觉的细丝固定在高处。它周围的声音被其淹没，扭曲成永不停歇的蜂鸣声。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "structural spur"
#, c-format
msgid "The distortion fades as the %s crumbles."
msgstr "时空扭曲随着%s破碎而逐渐消失。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "structural spur"
msgid "Scraps of metal fly off the spur and into the nearby swarms!"
msgstr "许多金属碎片从空间尖岔中飞出，汇合成一个裂片集群！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "void weaver"
msgid_plural "void weavers"
msgstr[0] "虚空编织者"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "void weaver"
msgid ""
"Articulated limbs slip into the outlines of shadow, each a conduit for the "
"kaleidoscopic maw from which they emerge."
msgstr "关节铰接的肢体滑入阴影的轮廓，每一个出现之处都是通往万花筒般无底深渊的管道。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "void weaver"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s dissolves into inert shadows."
msgstr "%s消融在了迟滞的阴影中。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hanging maw"
msgid_plural "hanging maws"
msgstr[0] "悬空巨口"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hanging maw"
msgid ""
"An explosion of glistening fangs, itself but a small reflection of the "
"greater horror."
msgstr "一口闪闪发光的獠牙，它本身只是巨大恐惧反映出的一点小小部分。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "hanging maw"
#. ~ Death message of monster "hanging limb"
#. ~ Death message of monster "weaver juvenile"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s shatters like pane of glass."
msgstr "%s如玻璃一样碎裂开了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hanging limb"
msgid_plural "hanging limbs"
msgstr[0] "悬空肢体"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hanging limb"
msgid "A limb of shadow, itself but a small reflection of a greater horror."
msgstr "由暗影组成的一条肢体，它本身只是巨大恐惧反映出的一点小小部分。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "weaver juvenile"
msgid_plural "weaver juveniles"
msgstr[0] "幼年编织者"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "weaver juvenile"
msgid ""
"The distressed movements of the juvenile reveal conjoined layers of flailing "
"legs and fangs.  It is no spider as you know it."
msgstr "这只幼年编织者焦虑的爬行，显露出它一层层连接在一起的腿和獠牙。这不是你认识的任何一种蜘蛛。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skewered juvenile"
msgid_plural "skewered juveniles"
msgstr[0] "虚弱幼体"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skewered juvenile"
msgid "Layers of flailing limbs struggle against an impaled emerald lance."
msgstr "层层叠叠的舞动肢体被一支祖母绿短矛死死钉在地上，仍在不断挣扎着。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wraith"
msgid_plural "wraiths"
msgstr[0] "幽靈"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wraith"
msgid ""
"A gigantic shadow, chaotically changing in shape and volume.  Two piercing "
"orbs of light dominate what can only be described as its head."
msgstr "一个巨大的暗影怪物，形状和体积毫无规律的不停变化，两颗光球占据着一块只能被描述成它头部的部分。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dementia"
msgid_plural "dementias"
msgstr[0] "瘋狂者"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dementia"
msgid ""
"A crazed individual, the bloody scars on the side of its shaved head suggest "
"some sort of partial lobotomy."
msgstr "一个头上带有血淋淋的伤疤的怪人，显然是接受过某种脑叶切除手术，疯狂转动的瞳孔搜索着附近一切它想杀死的生物，充满着攻击性。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dog"
msgid_plural "dogs"
msgstr[0] "狗"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dog"
msgid ""
"A domesticated mongrel of the canine persuasion.  In the absence of human "
"society, it has turned feral."
msgstr "一隻曾經被馴服的雜種犬。在人類社會瓦解的情況下， 已經恢復野性。看起來極為兇殘。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "dog"
#. ~ Death message of monster "tentacle dog"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s emerges!"
msgstr "%s出現了！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flaming eye"
msgid_plural "flaming eyes"
msgstr[0] "火焰之眼"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flaming eye"
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air "
"through some unknown agency.  Wreathed in unnatural flickering blue flame, it "
"possesses a blazing yellow iris with a slitted pupil like that of a cat, and "
"trails a set of flailing black tendrils as it slowly drifts about.  You "
"involuntarily get a heavy, sinking feeling deep in your gut as you watch its "
"gaze comb over the world around it."
msgstr ""
"一只体型有如成人大小而脱离了肉体的巨大眼球，通过某种未知的方式在空中四处漂浮。浑身上下笼罩在一种超自然的蓝色火焰之中，它长着炽热发光的黄色虹膜和如同猫一般的"
"瞳孔，而在它缓缓漂浮的身躯之后长出了许多四处挥舞的黑色触须。当它的目光扫过周遭时，你的内心深处不由得产生了一种厚重、坠落的感觉。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flying polyp"
msgid_plural "flying polyps"
msgstr[0] "飛天水螅"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flying polyp"
msgid ""
"A half-polypous, utterly alien creature.  It's only partly material and has "
"the ability to fly, despite the absence of wings.  It produces strange "
"whistling noises which dominate every other sound."
msgstr ""
"一只源自克苏鲁神话的盲目者亚种，完完全全的异界生物。它的身体仅有一半是由物质构成，虽然没有翅膀却能够在空中飞行。它在移动时发出奇怪的呼啸声，压倒了其他所有的"
"声音。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "star vampire"
msgid_plural "star vampires"
msgstr[0] "星之精"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "star vampire"
msgid ""
"Originally invisible, you can now see the myriad thin tentacles tipped with "
"gnashing maws that make up this creature.  The small central body is "
"dominated by an enormous fanged mouth from which emerges a near-constant "
"high-pitched tittering."
msgstr ""
"虽然一开始不可见，但现在你可以看到组成这只生物的身体的无数细长触手，触手顶端上面长着张牙舞爪的大嘴。小小的身体被一张巨大的布满尖牙的大嘴所支配，从嘴里发出近"
"乎持续的高声奸笑。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s bites your %2$s with its fang-filled maw!"
msgstr "%1$s满是尖牙的嘴一口咬到了你的%2$s！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s bites <npcname>'s %2$s with its fang-filled maw!"
msgstr "%1$s满是尖牙的嘴一口咬到了<npcname>的%2$s！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s试图咬向你的%2$s，但没能穿透护甲。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s试图咬向<npcname>的%2$s，但没能穿透护甲。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s fastens onto your %2$s and greedily drinks your blood!"
msgstr "%1$s牢牢缠上你的%2$s，贪婪地痛饮你的鲜血！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s fastens onto <npcname>'s %2$s and greedily drinks their blood!"
msgstr "%1$s牢牢缠上<npcname>的%2$s，贪婪地痛饮鲜血！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto you, but you dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s试图缠住你，但你躲开了！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto you <npcname>, but they dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s试图缠上你的 <npcname>，但被躲开了！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s试图缠上你的%2$s，但没能穿透护甲。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s试图缠上<npcname>的%2$s，但没能穿透护甲。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto <npcname>, but they dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s试图缠上<npcname>，但被躲开了！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_star_vampire_coiling"
msgid ""
"Originally invisible, you can now see the thick coiling tentacles tipped with "
"rather flat maws that make up this creature.  The small central body is "
"dominated by an enormous mouth from which emerges a near-constant "
"high-pitched tittering."
msgstr ""
"虽然一开始不可见，但现在你可以看到组成这只生物的身体的厚实缠绕在一起的触手，触手顶端上面长着相当扁平的大嘴。小小的身体被一张巨大的嘴所支配，从嘴里发出近乎持"
"续的高声奸笑。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s bites your %2$s with its maw!"
msgstr "%1$s用大嘴咬中了你的%2$s！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s bites <npcname>'s %2$s with its maw!"
msgstr "%1$s用大嘴咬中了<npcname>的%2$s！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s clutches onto your %2$s and starts sucking up your blood!"
msgstr "%1$s牢牢缠上你的%2$s，开始吸血！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s clutches onto <npcname>'s %2$s and starts sucking up their blood!"
msgstr "%1$s牢牢缠上<npcname>的%2$s，开始吸血！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to clutch onto you, but you dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s试图缠住你，但你躲开了！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to clutch onto you <npcname>, but they dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s试图缠上<npcname>，但被躲开了！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to clutch onto your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s试图缠上你的%2$s，但没能穿透护甲。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to clutch onto <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s试图缠上<npcname>的%2$s，但没能穿透护甲。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unseen hunter"
msgid_plural "unseen hunters"
msgstr[0] "隱形獵手"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unseen hunter"
msgid ""
"There was nothing here a moment ago, but now you see the faintest outline of "
"an otherworldly creature approaching you with jittery leaps.  Trying to focus "
"on it reveals a pointed beak dripping translucent fluid and rows upon rows of "
"bladed legs grasping the floor, before your eyes begin to burn and your head "
"starts to spin."
msgstr ""
"剛才這裡什麼都沒有，但現在你看到一個精神體的最模糊的輪廓，緊張地跳躍著接近你。當你試著集中注意力觀察它，會發現它有一個尖尖的喙，滴著半透明的液體，一排又一排"
"的帶刀刃的腿抓住了地板，然後你的眼睛開始灼熱，你的頭開始暈眩。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gozu"
msgid_plural "gozus"
msgstr[0] "牛頭人"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gozu"
msgid ""
"This is some sort of unnatural cross between a bull and a man.  Quite "
"different from the minotaur of legend, it possesses a shaggy white bull's "
"head on an otherwise unremarkable human body.  Clad in sagging socks and "
"stained jockey shorts, it grunts and snuffles, drooling ropey strands of "
"white slobber down its chest.  You occasionally catch a glint in its eyes and "
"freeze up involuntarily, like a deer in headlights."
msgstr ""
"一只半人半牛的奇特异界生物。与希腊传说中的牛头怪不同，这只怪物仅仅是一个毛茸茸的白色公牛头长在一个除此之外平凡无奇的人类身躯上。它穿着松垮垮的袜子和沾满血的"
"骑师裤，不断发出哼哼唧唧的咕噜声，从嘴边不断垂下细长而浓白色的口水沾满了胸口。你偶尔会在它的眼睛里看到一闪而过的光芒，然后不由自主地僵住，就像一只被车灯照到"
"的鹿。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gracken"
msgid_plural "grackens"
msgstr[0] "格拉肯"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gracken"
msgid ""
"This is some form of eldritch monstrosity; an uncouth black being with "
"smooth, oily skin and unpleasant horns that curve inward toward each other.  "
"Tall and thin, the shadows cling unnaturally to its vaguely defined humanoid "
"form as it shuffles along, its hands twitching and spasming so rapidly as to "
"appear a little more than a black blur of claws.  Despite the night-terror "
"esque appearance, it doesn't appear aggressive."
msgstr ""
"一只来自古老传说的邪恶怪物。这只外表笨拙的黑色生物长着光滑油腻的皮肤，头上有着两只朝内弯曲的丑陋的角。阴影不自然地依附在那勉强可分辨的又瘦又高的人形身躯上，"
"并随着它缓慢移动。它的双手抽搐如此之快，只能看见许多利爪的黑色残影。尽管有梦魇般的外表，但它似乎并不具有攻击性。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tentacle dog"
msgid_plural "tentacle dogs"
msgstr[0] "觸手狗"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tentacle dog"
msgid "A dog's body with a mass of ropey, black tentacles reaching out from its head."
msgstr "有著黏稠身體的狗， 黑色的觸手從頭部延伸出來。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "star-crowned hound"
msgid_plural "star-crowned hound"
msgstr[0] "星冠猎犬"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "star-crowned hound"
msgid ""
"Isometry is torn from the fine structure of space, and the emptiness between "
"disgorges its terrible brood upon the world.  Its form is both "
"incomprehensibly vast and infinitely narrow, with splayed limbs that could "
"fold into the paper-thinness of edges."
msgstr "空间的精妙结构被生生撕裂，从虚无中爬出这头可怖的怪物。它的身形在庞大与纤细间诡异地变换，伸展的肢体能折叠成剃刀般锋利的薄片。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hound of Tindalos"
msgid_plural "hounds of Tindalos"
msgstr[0] "廷達洛斯獵犬"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hound of Tindalos"
msgid ""
"A grotesque dog-like beast, its frame is angular and emaciated and its head "
"is like that of an abyssal fish.  When it moves, its twisted limbs duplicate, "
"merge, disappear, and reform in dissonance, as if a hundred copies of itself "
"were somehow forced to inhabit the same space.  Extraneous to our reality, it "
"moves between the corners of the world, hunting those that would dare step "
"beyond time and space."
msgstr ""
"一只怪诞的如猎犬般的怪物，它的身躯瘦骨嶙峋，头部就如一条来自地狱深渊的鱼。当它移动的时候，扭曲的肢体以一种诡异的方式复制、融合、消失和重组，就仿佛有上百个自"
"身的复制品被以某种未知的方式强行栖居在同一个空间里。它游离在我们的现实世界之外，在无数世界的角落之间移动，猎杀那些胆敢穿越时空的人。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "human snail"
msgid_plural "human snails"
msgstr[0] "人面蝸"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "human snail"
msgid ""
"An enormous fleshy snail, with an oddly human face.  Eyestalks protrude from "
"where the eyes should be."
msgstr "一隻令人驚悚的巨大人面蝸牛。本應有眼睛的地方卻是一對觸角。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hunting horror"
msgid_plural "hunting horrors"
msgstr[0] "恐怖獵手"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hunting horror"
msgid ""
"This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously "
"distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself "
"with the aid of black, rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions.  The wings beat "
"slowly like an eagle while the body coils through the air like how an eel "
"swims in water."
msgstr ""
"一只体型巨大的如毒蛇一般的怪物，长着一个怪异而扭曲的头部和许许多多爪子一样的附肢。它的身体依靠着尺寸巨大的黑色且有弹性的翅膀支撑而部分竖起。翅膀像鹰一样缓慢"
"地拍打，而身体像鳗鱼在水中游动一样在空中盘旋。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "kreck"
msgid_plural "krecks"
msgstr[0] "幽冥獵犬"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "kreck"
msgid ""
"This is some form of otherworldly hound.  Lean and hungry-looking, its "
"twisted red flesh is stretched tightly across its misshapen, angular frame.  "
"Loping grotesquely along, its unusually long neck stretches forward, its "
"skull-like head near the ground as it sniffs out its prey.  Its foulness "
"partially veiled by some arcane force, it seems to almost flicker in and out "
"of your perceptions as if you were looking at it from the corner of your "
"vision."
msgstr ""
"一只来自异界的如同猎犬一般的怪物。身形瘦弱仿佛饥肠辘辘一般，扭曲的红色肉体紧紧地覆盖在它畸形而又瘦骨嶙峋的骨架之上。随着它步伐怪异地四处飞奔，它那异乎寻常的"
"长颈向前伸出，它骷髅一般的头颅贴近地面四处嗅探寻找猎物。它的邪恶似乎被某种神秘力量所掩盖于体内，你能够感觉到它的外形不断在你眼前隐约闪烁，就像你从你余光里看"
"着它。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadow"
msgid ""
"An animate shadow.  Looking like nothing more than an errant patch of normal "
"shadow, it draws your attention by the way it moves subtly and whispers "
"softly in the back of your mind.  Strange intrusive thoughts accompany the "
"quiet murmur, trying to forcefully supplant your own."
msgstr ""
"一团移动的暗影，看起来不过是一块罕见的影子，但它细微的移动吸引了你的注意力，并开始在你的脑海中轻声低语。 "
"怪异的侵入性想法伴随着低声的耳语，试图强行取代你的神志。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadow snake"
msgid_plural "shadow snakes"
msgstr[0] "暗影蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadow snake"
msgid ""
"An animate shadow in the form of a long and sinuous snake.  Translucent and "
"dark, it glides silently across the floor, wriggling and flexing as it moves."
msgstr "一只活着的暗影，外形如同一条细长弯曲的蛇。它悄无声息地在地板上蜿蜒滑行，透明而黝黑的身体随之蠕动和弯曲。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shoggoth"
msgid_plural "shoggoths"
msgstr[0] "修格斯"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shoggoth"
msgid ""
"A gargantuan protoplasmic blob, constantly reshaping, forming new pseudopods "
"seemingly at will.  All over its body are eyes that form and disappear.  The "
"rapid and chaotic way it reconstitutes itself gives the impression of it "
"boiling over with some kind of primordial fury."
msgstr ""
"那是一个体型无比巨大的，身上不断分裂出四处挥舞的触手，外形不定的巨型变形怪。遍布它全身的无数只眼睛，不断地在体表形成又消失。它快速而混乱地重组自己，给人一种"
"它沸腾着某种原始的愤怒的印象。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "thing"
msgid ""
"An amorphous black creature, detaching and sprouting tentacles without any "
"apparent pause."
msgstr "一種不定形的黑色生物， 其伸出的觸手迅速的扭動著。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "twisted body"
msgid_plural "twisted bodies"
msgstr[0] "扭曲肢體"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "twisted body"
msgid ""
"A human body, but with its limbs, neck, and hair impossibly twisted.  It "
"clambers around swiftly, making awful screeching sounds."
msgstr "有著人的身體， 但是四肢、頸部， 以及頭髮卻不可思議地扭曲著。它四處攀爬、動作流暢， 發出令人難以忍受的刺耳聲音。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "yugg"
msgid_plural "yuggs"
msgstr[0] "尤格"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "yugg"
msgid ""
"A huge, slimy worm-like creature.  Its pale, flattened head drips an oily "
"mucus as it breaches the ground, searching for prey.  Its pinkish mouth opens "
"and closes, revealing long fangs glistening with ropey strands of saliva, "
"which leave smoldering stains wherever they drip."
msgstr ""
"一只巨大而粘滑的蠕虫状生物。它苍白而扁平的头部在它钻出地面寻找猎物时会不断滴下油性黏液。它的粉红色的大嘴一张一合，露出沾满丝丝恶心唾液的长牙。无论唾液滴在哪"
"里都会留下燃烧的痕迹。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "yugg"
msgid "The yugg launches a viscous barb!"
msgstr "尤格巨噬虫射出了一根粘液毒刺！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "yugg"
msgid "SCREEE!!!!"
msgstr "SCREEE!!!!"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "vortex"
msgid_plural "vortexes"
msgstr[0] "渦流怪"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "vortex"
msgid "A twisting spot in the air, with some kind of morphing mass at its center."
msgstr "空氣中的一個氣流扭曲點， 有某種東西在其中心點。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shifting mass"
msgid_plural "shifting masses"
msgstr[0] "幻形怪"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shifting mass"
msgid ""
"An animate blotch of conflicting symmetries, erratically hovering through the "
"air.  It's not even real enough to hold a stable shape, and its entire form "
"is constantly in flux.  You can see through it - not as if it were "
"transparent, but as if it isn't quite fully here."
msgstr ""
"一团活生生的充满矛盾而又对称的班点，不规则地在空中盘旋。它甚至无法保持稳定状态，整体形状都在不断变化。你可以看穿它——不是因为它是透明的，而是因为它仿佛不完"
"全位于这个空间之中。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/summoned_monsters.json
#: data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "shifting mass"
#. ~ Death message of monster "impossible shape"
#. ~ Death message of monster "guilt"
#. ~ Death message of monster "sloth"
#. ~ Death message of monster "armored warrior with mace"
#. ~ Death message of monster "armored warrior with axe"
#. ~ Death message of monster "warrior with spear"
#. ~ Death message of monster "warrior with sword"
#. ~ Death message of monster "shadowy warrior"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s fades away."
msgstr "%s消逝了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shifting mass"
msgid ""
"The shifting mass passes through you as if you were an illusion, and a slight "
"wave of fatigue washes over you."
msgstr "幻形怪穿透了你的身体，仿佛它是一个幻觉，一股轻微的疲倦感席卷了你。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "impossible shape"
msgid_plural "impossible shapes"
msgstr[0] "無形之形"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "impossible shape"
msgid ""
"A twisted shape floating in midair; its angles don't seem to quite add up - "
"it hurts to look at.  Is it inanimate?  Alive?  Something else?  You can't "
"make heads or tails of it at all, but you can see through it - not as if it "
"were transparent, but as if it isn't quite fully here."
msgstr ""
"一个扭曲的形状漂浮在半空中；它的角度似乎完全不合逻辑——光是看着就让你头痛。它是死的吗？是活的吗？还是别的什么？你对此毫无头绪。你可以看穿它，不是因为它是透"
"明的，而是因为它仿佛不完全位于这个空间之中。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "impossible shape"
msgid "You get a very clear view of the impossible shape."
msgstr "你忽然能清楚的看到無形之形。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "absence"
msgid_plural "absences"
msgstr[0] "空虛"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "absence"
msgid ""
"Every sense you have claims this space to be empty, but your mind is not "
"fooled.  There is an emptiness here that is far from natural or safe."
msgstr "你的每種感官都在告訴你個空間是空的，但你的頭腦沒有被愚弄。這裡的空，遠非自然且絕不安全。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "absence"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s returns to normal levels of empty."
msgstr "%s附近的空間恢復正常的空了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "absence"
msgid "The absence intensifies."
msgstr "空虛的感覺加深了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant appendage"
msgid_plural "giant appendages"
msgstr[0] "巨型附肢"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant appendage"
msgid ""
"A gigantic, probing appendage blindly feeling the area around it.  All of "
"your senses scream at you that it's the size of a truck, and yet it only "
"takes up about as much space in the world as you do.  It seems to be jutting "
"through a portal, suggesting that it's merely a smaller extension of "
"something much larger."
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的探测附肢盲目地感觉周围的区域。你所有的感官都在向你尖叫，它有辆卡车那么大，但它在这个世界上所占的空间却和你类似。它似乎是从一个传送门伸进来，表明它"
"不过是某只更巨大的怪物的小型延伸部分。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "giant appendage"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is pulled back through the closing portal."
msgstr "%s縮回了關閉中的傳送門。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flatlander"
msgid_plural "flatlanders"
msgstr[0] "平地人"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flatlander"
msgid ""
"An oblong figure floating parallel with the ground, some feet in the air like "
"a piece of paper - Its far thinner than one as well, to the point it would be "
"invisible if looked at with the right angle."
msgstr "一个长条形的身影平躺着漂浮在地面上，双脚像一张纸一样悬空——它也比纸张薄得多，转到合适的角度，甚至都看不见它。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "flatlander"
#. ~ Death message of monster "swarm structure"
#. ~ Death message of monster "twisting blade"
#, c-format
msgid "Your memory can't decide whether the %s was even there in the first place."
msgstr "你的记忆无法确定%s是否一直就待在那里。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "flatlander"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Standing close to the %s, your body is violently dragged down to the second "
"dimension.  You're there for only an instant but the experience is enough to "
"send you reeling."
msgstr "站在靠近%s的地方，你的身体被剧烈地降至二维。你虽然只在那里呆了一瞬间，但这种经历足以让你感到浑身作呕。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "memory"
msgid_plural "memories"
msgstr[0] "往昔回憶"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "memory"
msgid ""
"The silhouette of a human body, reaching towards you like it needs help.  It "
"has no eyes, but you can still feel it staring through you."
msgstr "人型剪影向你伸出手，好像它需要帮助一般。它没有眼睛，但你觉得它紧盯着你的眼神穿透了你。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "memory"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s begins to cry as it disappears."
msgstr "%s不断哭号并消失。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "swarm structure"
msgid_plural "swarm structures"
msgstr[0] "裂隙蜂群"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "swarm structure"
msgid ""
"Your mind can't decide if this is a vast structure, or an endless swarm of "
"tiny flying sharp things.  The only thing you know for sure is that it is far "
"too large to fit in the space it occupies."
msgstr "你的大脑无法分辨这是一个巨大的结构，还是由无穷无尽的小型飞行锋利物品组成的集群。你唯一能确定的是，它太大了，本不可能放进它所占据的空间之中。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "swarm structure"
msgid "The integrity of spacetime is violated."
msgstr "时空的连续性被违背了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "twisting blade"
msgid_plural "twisting blades"
msgstr[0] "幻形利刃"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "twisting blade"
msgid ""
"You are uncertain whether this dwarfs you or you dwarf it.  Its exact shape "
"and number of dimensions is constantly changing, but it is always sharp "
"enough to cut a moment in half."
msgstr "你不确定是它让你相形见绌还是你让它相形见绌。它的确切形状和尺寸不停变化，但它总是足够锋利，可以将时间斩断。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "twisting blade"
msgid "You are cut in ways worse than physical."
msgstr "你被比物理更糟糕的方式割伤了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "chunk of unknown material"
msgid_plural "chunks of unknown material"
msgstr[0] "不明材料块"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chunk of unknown material"
msgid ""
"This formless, pitch-black mass wriggles on the ground as it reshapes itself "
"before your eyes.  It slowly drags itself towards you with many tendrils of "
"varied sizes.  As it gets closer to you, its wriggling intensifies as if it "
"reacted to you."
msgstr "这个无形的、漆黑的物体在地面上蠕动，在你眼前不停地重塑自己。它用无数大小不一的触手慢慢地把自己拖向你。当它靠近你时，它的蠕动加剧，好像对你有反应。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "chunk of unknown material"
msgid ""
"The material stabilizes and reforms itself into a small chunk of unknown "
"composition."
msgstr "不明材料块稳定下来，并将自身改造成一小块不明组分。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "chunk of unknown material"
msgid "The chunk twists and tears itself as it reacts to your presence!"
msgstr "不明材料块扭曲并撕裂自己，对你的存在做出反应！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pulsating chunk of unknown material"
msgid_plural "pulsating chunks of unknown material"
msgstr[0] "不明材料块（搏动中）"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pulsating chunk of unknown material"
msgid ""
"This formless, pitch-black mass wriggles and pulses on the ground as it "
"reshapes itself before your eyes.  It slowly drags itself towards you with "
"many tendrils of varied sizes.  As it gets closer to you, its pulsing "
"intensifies as if it reacted to you."
msgstr "这个无形的、漆黑的物体在地面上蠕动并搏动，在你眼前不停地重塑自己。它用无数大小不一的触手慢慢地把自己拖向你。当它靠近你时，它的搏动加剧，好像对你有反应。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "resonating chunk of unknown material"
msgid_plural "resonating chunks of unknown material"
msgstr[0] "不明材料块（共鸣中）"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "resonating chunk of unknown material"
msgid ""
"This formless, pitch-black mass wriggles violently and noisily on the ground "
"as it reshapes itself before your eyes.  It slowly drags itself towards you "
"with many tendrils of varied sizes sparkling with electricity.  As it gets "
"closer to you, its wriggling intensifies and its sparks grow brighter as if "
"it reacted to you."
msgstr ""
"这个无形的、漆黑的物体在地面上疯狂抖动并发出噪声，在你眼前不停地重塑自己。它用无数大小不一的散发电火花的触手慢慢地把自己拖向你。当它靠近你时，电火花变得更亮"
"，好像对你有反应。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pale reflection"
msgid_plural "pale reflections"
msgstr[0] "苍白倒影"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pale reflection"
msgid ""
"This looks nothing like you.  It's barely real.  So why does your mind keep "
"mistaking it for you?"
msgstr "这个东西看起来完全不像你，甚至不像是真实存在的。那么为什么你的大脑总是把它误认为是你呢？"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "pale reflection"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s vanishes but you can still feel it."
msgstr "%s消失了，但你仍然可以感受到它。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pale reflection"
#, c-format
msgid "You can feel the %s."
msgstr "你可以感受到%s的存在。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "twisted reflection"
msgid_plural "twisted reflections"
msgstr[0] "扭曲倒影"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "twisted reflection"
msgid ""
"This looks almost nothing like you.  Its form isn't even stable.  So why does "
"your mind keep mistaking it for you?"
msgstr "这个东西看起来并不像你，甚至形态都不稳定。那么为什么你的大脑总是把它误认为是你呢？"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dark reflection"
msgid_plural "dark reflections"
msgstr[0] "黑暗倒影"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dark reflection"
msgid ""
"This only looks a little like you.  It's obviously not you.  So why does your "
"mind keep mistaking it for you?"
msgstr "这个东西看起来只和你有一点相似，但显然不是你。那么为什么你的大脑总是把它误认为是你呢？"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "better half"
msgid_plural "better halves"
msgstr[0] "更好的你"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "better half"
msgid ""
"This doesn't look like you.  It looks like what you've dreamed you could be.  "
"Why does your mind keep mistaking you for a bad copy of it?"
msgstr "这个东西看起来不像你，而是像你梦寐以求的样子。为什么你的大脑总是把你误认为是它的劣质仿冒品？"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mercenary officer"
msgid_plural "mercenary officers"
msgstr[0] "佣兵军官"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mercenary officer"
msgid ""
"A figure in a high-tech suit, their outline contorted as though you were "
"viewing them through a prism.  Their movements are strained but determined, "
"pushing through apparent pain with feverish resolve, dead-set on reaching "
"their target."
msgstr "一个身着高科技服装的身影，他们的轮廓扭曲，就像你透过棱镜看到的一样。 他们的动作紧张而坚定，带着狂热的决心忍着明显的疼痛，一心只想到达目标。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mercenary officer"
msgid "The creature screams \"SOMEONE HELP ME, ANYONE!\"."
msgstr "这个生物拼命叫喊着\"帮帮我，谁来帮帮我！\""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mercenary ghost"
msgid_plural "mercenary ghosts"
msgstr[0] "佣兵鬼魂"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mercenary ghost"
msgid ""
"A figure in combat gear, distorted and shattered like broken glass.  They "
"thrash around as they move, an expression of shock and anguish frozen on "
"their face."
msgstr "一个个身着战斗服的身影，像破碎的玻璃一样扭曲、破碎。 他们一边移动一边扭动着身体，震惊和痛苦的表情凝固在脸上。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "mercenary ghost"
msgid "The soldier fades away to nothing."
msgstr "这个佣兵鬼魂永远的消逝了，什么也没剩下。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tainted shadow"
msgid_plural "tainted shadows"
msgstr[0] "污秽暗影"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tainted shadow"
msgid "Your shadow is host to something alien."
msgstr "你的影子仿佛是某些怪东西的宿主。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "tainted shadow"
msgid "Your shadow seemingly becomes normal again."
msgstr "你的影子似乎又恢复正常了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "person"
msgid_plural "persons"
msgstr[0] "人"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "person"
msgid ""
"A common human.  It looks exactly like a human looks.  You can see them.  "
"They can see you.  You know they know you can see them.  They know you know "
"you can see them.  They move towards you."
msgstr "一个普通的人类，看起来和人类一模一样。你可以看到它。它可以看到你。你知道它知道你可以看到它。它知道你知道你可以看到他。它朝你而来。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "person"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s just disappeared."
msgstr "这个%s就这么突然消失了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "person"
msgid "You feel something was destroyed inside you."
msgstr "你觉得你内在的某些东西被摧毁了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "guilt"
msgid_plural "guilts"
msgstr[0] "罪恶"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "guilt"
msgid ""
"An animate blotch of conflicting shapes, when you look at or think of this, "
"memories of your wrongdoings rise to the surface."
msgstr "一堆相互冲突的动态不明形体，当你看到它或想到它时，过去犯下的错误浮出水面。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "guilt"
msgid ""
"The guilt makes no physical movement and yet you feel the force of its "
"assault.  Everything feels heavier."
msgstr "罪恶没有任何移动，但你却能感受到它向你攻来的力量。一切都感觉更重了。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sloth"
msgid_plural "sloths"
msgstr[0] "怠惰"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sloth"
msgid ""
"An animate blotch of conflicting shapes, when you look at or think of this, a "
"desire to stop moving rises."
msgstr "一堆相互冲突的动态不明形体，当你看到它或想到它时，忽然有一种想要停下一切的冲动。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "sloth"
msgid ""
"The sloth does nothing, and you feel time itself aiding your desire to do "
"nothing."
msgstr "怠惰什么都没有做，你感觉时间本身也让你什么都不要做。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hanging roper"
msgid_plural "hanging ropers"
msgstr[0] "吊挂捕猎者"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hanging roper"
msgid ""
"What looks to be a loose mass of worm-like appendages reveals a solid body "
"beneath, a great maw of rows of serrated fangs taking up most of the body.  "
"It is either very lethargic or stalking prey, sitting in place without much "
"obvious motion."
msgstr ""
"它看起来由一堆蠕虫般的增生肉瘤组成，盖着下方的坚实身体，一张布满锯齿的血口占据了身体的大部分。它要么就萎靡不振，要么就在等待伏击猎物，伫立在原地没有什么明显"
"的移动。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "carrion grub"
msgid_plural "carrion grubs"
msgstr[0] "食腐幼虫"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "carrion grub"
msgid ""
"A wriggling brown grub of unnatural origin, slithering along the ground and "
"unnaturally pulsating.  As it moves along, it chews through any available "
"flesh with surprising speed."
msgstr "一种不像是自然界的的蠕动的棕色蛴螬，沿着地面滑行，不自然地脉动着。 一路上它以惊人的速度咀嚼着任何可用的肉体。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spearfisher"
msgid_plural "spearfishers"
msgstr[0] "尖刺怪犬"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spearfisher"
msgid ""
"A strange quadrupedal creature with long, lanky limbs and a gaping maw.  A "
"long sharp spike protrudes from it's back, which occasionally launches from "
"its' joint to stab prey before slinking back in."
msgstr "一只奇怪的四足动物，有一张大嘴与修长的四肢。 一根修长的利刺从它的背上钻出，偶尔发射出去刺击猎物。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strange leech"
msgid_plural "strange leeches"
msgstr[0] "诡异蚂蝗"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strange leech"
msgid ""
"A very wet, snake-like creature which you estimate to be five feet long, "
"covered in slime and slithering about.  Occasionally, it will attach itself "
"to the flesh around it and begins to suck."
msgstr "一条体表潮湿、外形像蛇的生物，估计有五英尺（约1.5米）长，浑身都是黏液，四处滑动。偶尔，它会附在周围的肉上，开始吸吮。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "eldritch huntsman"
msgid_plural "eldritch huntsmen"
msgstr[0] "异界猎手"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "eldritch huntsman"
msgid ""
"Tall, partially armored, barely humanoid creature with a long appendage "
"growing out of its side.  Flexible spearlike rods protrude throughout its "
"body, seemingly holstered under the skin.  It feverishly darts and scouts the "
"surroundings, looking to rip its victims apart."
msgstr "高大的类人生物，体表覆盖着部分甲壳。侧腹延伸出畸形长肢，皮下隐约可见可伸缩的矛状骨刺。它神经质地穿梭于废墟间，时刻搜寻着能撕成碎片的猎物。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "eldritch huntsman"
msgid "huntsman's appendage hurls a sharp outgrowth out of its body!"
msgstr "猎手的附肢从体内激射出一根锋利骨刺！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "eldritch huntsman"
msgid "rapid clicking, increasing in pitch!"
msgstr "急促的咔嗒声，音调越来越高！"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "eldritch huntsman"
msgid "slow clicking."
msgstr "缓慢的咔嗒声"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "nether fish symbiote"
msgid_plural "nether fish symbiotes"
msgstr[0] "异界共生鱼"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "nether fish symbiote"
msgid ""
"A small fish symbiote that resembles a deformed, eyeless piranha.  It swims "
"blindly in the yellow ichor, wriggling incessantly with malicious intent."
msgstr "一只小型的共生鱼，样子像没有眼睛的食人鱼。它在黄色的脓水里盲目地游动，一刻不停地扭动着身躯，酝酿着恶毒的意图。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "veiled butterfly"
msgid_plural "veiled butterflies"
msgstr[0] "朦胧蝴蝶"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "veiled butterfly"
msgid ""
"There is barely anything there, but you do notice hints of a faint, "
"translucent veiled creature that you can only describe as butterfly-like.  "
"While strangely alluring, it seems unsuited to the atmosphere and is slowly "
"falling apart."
msgstr ""
"这里仿佛什么东西都没有，但你确实注意到了某种微弱的、半透明的、朦胧生物的存在迹象，你只能把它描述成蝴蝶形状。虽然外观奇怪地迷人，但它似乎不适应这个世界的大气"
"，而且正在慢慢分崩离析。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "veiled butterfly"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s fades away into nothingness."
msgstr "%s渐渐消逝了，什么也没剩下。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "writhing root"
msgid_plural "writhing roots"
msgstr[0] "扭曲根茎"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "writhing root"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of curious looking roots, constantly trying to grow and expand "
"but failing miserably.  It has grown weak, as if incompatible with the very "
"soil it is in."
msgstr "一小块看起来很奇怪的根茎，不断地试图生长和扩张，但毫无进展。它变得很虚弱，似乎与它所处的土壤格格不入。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "eldritch stomper"
msgid_plural "eldritch stompers"
msgstr[0] "异界践踏者"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "eldritch stomper"
msgid ""
"Mostly covered in wet-looking, long strands that remind you firmly of hair, "
"this abomination has a single but very pronounced leg.  It keeps its balance "
"with its odd hair on the rear.  Yet it seems to shrivel and die with each "
"gust of wind it is hit with."
msgstr ""
"这团可憎之物浑身覆满湿漉漉的长条状组织，令人不寒而栗地联想到人类毛发。它仅靠一条异常粗壮的独腿移动，后部长着的怪异鬃毛帮助保持平衡。但每当狂风袭来，它的躯体"
"就会迅速干瘪枯萎，仿佛随时会毙命。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strange bug"
msgid_plural "strange bugs"
msgstr[0] "奇特昆虫"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strange bug"
msgid ""
"This small, three legged bug-like creature curiously wriggles its 5 antennae. "
" Its body somewhat reminds you of a stink bug.  It looks like a fish out of "
"water and is getting weaker by the minute."
msgstr "这种三条腿的小型昆虫一样的生物奇怪地扭动着它的5根触角。它的身体让你想起了一只臭虫。它看起来像一条刚刚出水的鱼，而且每一分钟都变得更加虚弱。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of alien flesh"
msgid_plural "chunks of alien flesh"
msgstr[0] "外星肉塊"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chunk of alien flesh"
msgid ""
"A writhing mass of strange flesh and something that oddly resembles "
"tentacles.  It is getting more pale by the minute."
msgstr "一团蠕动的怪异肉块，上面还诡异地长着类似触须的东西。它的颜色正以肉眼可见的速度变得苍白。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "waterbed skulker"
msgid_plural "waterbed skulkers"
msgstr[0] "水床潜行者"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "waterbed skulker"
msgid ""
"Pink and translucent, with all of its otherworldly organs visible through its "
"skin, this meter-high conical creature creeps along the seabed with its "
"stubby, furry legs.  It contracts some kind of retracted barbed filaments "
"into an orifice at its rear as it aims it at potential prey."
msgstr "这只粉红色半透明的圆锥形生物约有一米高，皮肤下清晰可见各种异界器官。它用短粗的毛腿在海底缓缓爬行，同时将某种可伸缩的带刺触须缩回尾部孔洞，瞄准潜在猎物。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "waterbed skulker"
msgid "filaments"
msgstr "丝状物"

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "waterbed skulker"
msgid "vital organs"
msgstr "重要器官"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "iridescent cat"
msgid_plural "iridescent cats"
msgstr[0] "彩虹貓"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "iridescent cat"
msgid ""
"As it moves, this cat's colors shift unnaturally in the light.  You can't "
"make out the breed, but its fur pattern seems to change with every step."
msgstr "这只猫在阳光移动时下呈现不同的颜色。你看不出它的品种，但它的毛皮似乎每步都在变化。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "liquid cat"
msgid_plural "liquid cats"
msgstr[0] "液态猫"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "liquid cat"
msgid ""
"It is universally known that cats are liquid, but this cat's body is actually "
"quivering while it walks around.  It also enjoys resting while twisting its "
"body in ways that would break a normal cat's bones."
msgstr "众所周知，猫是液体。但这只猫的身体在四处走动时，实际上是在颤动。它享受休息时光的时候，还会把身体扭曲成能把正常猫骨头折断的程度。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "liquid cat"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body splashes one last time."
msgstr "%s的身体最后一次溅射开来。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "void cat"
msgid_plural "void cats"
msgstr[0] "虚空之猫"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "void cat"
msgid ""
"Seeing how unnaturally dark this black cat's fur is, you are certain this is "
"no ordinary cat.  Its fur seems to absorb light from the surroundings."
msgstr "看到这只黑猫的毛黑得不自然，你确定这不是普通的猫。它的毛似乎吸收了周围的光线。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "translucent dog"
msgid_plural "translucent dogs"
msgstr[0] "半透明犬"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "translucent dog"
msgid ""
"This dog doesn't cast a shadow, and if you squint hard enough you can see "
"right through it.  Its condition doesn't appear to do any harm to it, though "
"it seems to cause trouble when it tries to groom itself."
msgstr "这只狗没有影子，如果你用力眯起眼睛，就能\"看穿\"它。这种状况似乎没对它造成任何危害，不过当它梳理狗毛时可能会有些麻烦。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triclopean dog"
msgid_plural "triclopean dogs"
msgstr[0] "三眼犬"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triclopean dog"
msgid ""
"A rather average looking dog until you notice the third eye, right on its "
"forehead, covered by a thick eyelid.  Whenever its open, small particles of "
"dust from the ground rise and swirl around it."
msgstr "一只看起来相当普通的狗，直到你注意到它的第三只眼睛，就在它的额头上，被厚厚的眼皮覆盖。每当它睁开时，地面上的小颗粒灰尘就会上升，在它周围旋转。"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unknowable dog"
msgid_plural "unknowable dogs"
msgstr[0] "不可知犬"

#: data/json/monsters/nether_animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unknowable dog"
msgid ""
"You are completely unable to recall anything about what this dog looks like.  "
"You know it's a dog, you know it's there, you know you can see it, but any "
"further information about it isn't retained in your mind."
msgstr "你完全无法回忆起这只狗的样貌。你知道那里有一条狗，你能看到它，但关于它的任何进一步信息都没有保留在你的脑海中。"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leech blossom"
msgid_plural "leech blossoms"
msgstr[0] "水蛭花"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leech blossom"
msgid ""
"A resplendent alien fern, crowned with flowers colored deep indigo.  It "
"appears to be the centerpiece of this otherworldly bloom."
msgstr "一株光彩夺目的异界蕨类植物，顶端长着一朵深靛蓝色的花。它似乎是这片异界植物盛开的核心。"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "leech blossom"
msgid "Lightning arcs from the leech blossom!"
msgstr "怒放水蛭花射出了一道电弧！"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "leech blossom"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "leech stalk"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "leech pod cluster"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "root runner"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "root drone"
msgid "a faint buzz"
msgstr "轻微的嗡嗡声"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leech stalk"
msgid_plural "leech stalks"
msgstr[0] "水蛭花莖桿"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leech stalk"
msgid ""
"A resplendent and voluminous alien fern.  A faint buzzing sound emanates from "
"it, and the shadow cast by its canopy continuously glows with electric charge."
msgstr "一株光彩夺目而硕大的异界蕨类植物。从它身上散发出一股微弱的嗡嗡声，它高大的冠顶所投射出的阴影之下不断有电荷在发光。"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "leech stalk"
msgid "Lightning arcs from the leech stalk!"
msgstr "水蛭花茎秆射出了一道电弧！"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "signal tree"
msgid_plural "signal trees"
msgstr[0] "訊號樹"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of monster "signal tree"
msgid ""
"A trunk reaches tall into the sky, its topmost branches glowing with yellow "
"light.  A low drum periodically shakes its vicinities."
msgstr "这棵树的树干高高耸立入云，其最顶端的树枝发出黄光。它周期性地发出一阵阵低沉的鼓声震撼着四周。"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leech pod cluster"
msgid_plural "leech pod clusters"
msgstr[0] "水蛭花苞"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leech pod cluster"
msgid ""
"The translucent egg pods of an alien plant, firmly attached by luminous "
"rhizomes.  You can barely distinguish a root drone floating within a cloudy "
"substance."
msgstr "一小丛半透明的异界植物卵荚，牢牢地依附在发光的根茎之上。你勉强能够分辨出漂浮在其浑浊物质之中的根状工蜂。"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "leech pod cluster"
msgid "Lightning arcs from the pod cluster!"
msgstr "水蛭花苞射出一道電弧！"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "root runner"
msgid_plural "root runners"
msgstr[0] "根狀追獵者"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of monster "root runner"
msgid ""
"This clump of woody vegetation hastily clambers around in a lizard-like "
"fashion.  Three translucent scale-leaves stand tall on the backside of the "
"creature, and the thin ridges within them periodically glow through some "
"unknown means.  It's seemingly a symbiote of the nearby alien ferns, and "
"looks ready to defend them with its life."
msgstr ""
"这丛木本植物像壁虎一样在四周快速地爬来爬去。有三片半透明的鳞状叶片高高耸立在其背部，其中的细脊状结构周期性地通过某种未知的方式发光。它似乎是这附近异界蕨类植"
"物的共生体，看起来已经准备好用生命来保护它们了。"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "root runner"
msgid "Sparks fly from the root runner!"
msgstr "根狀追獵者射出一道電火花！"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "root drone"
msgid_plural "root drones"
msgstr[0] "根狀工蜂"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of monster "root drone"
msgid ""
"A small bulb with a beak-like protuberance, skittishly roaming about under "
"three tendril rhizomes.  Dripping and glistening, it resembles a newborn "
"animal rather than a sapling grown from seeds."
msgstr "一种长着喙状突起的小型木本植物，使用下方三根卷须状根茎在让人捉摸不定地四处游荡。它更像是一只刚刚出生的生物，而非一株刚刚从种子长成的树苗。"

#: data/json/monsters/power_leech.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "root drone"
msgid "Lightning arcs from the root pod!"
msgstr "根狀工蜂射出一道電弧！"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "timber rattlesnake snakelet"
msgid_plural "timber rattlesnake snakelets"
msgstr[0] "幼年木纹响尾蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "timber rattlesnake snakelet"
msgid ""
"A timber rattlesnake in its hatchling stage.  It will eventually grow a "
"rattle and learn how to hunt."
msgstr "一只刚孵化出的木纹响尾蛇。它最终会长出尾环，学会如何捕猎。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "timber rattlesnake"
msgid_plural "timber rattlesnakes"
msgstr[0] "木纹响尾蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "timber rattlesnake"
msgid ""
"The most venomous viper native to New England.  Climatic changes have "
"extended its range far into the north."
msgstr "新英格兰地区毒性最强的响尾蛇。 气候的变化使其分布范围向北延伸。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "common garter snake"
msgid_plural "common garter snakes"
msgstr[0] "束带蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "common garter snake"
msgid "A common species of snake found all across North America."
msgstr "一种常见的蛇类，在整个北美洲都有分布。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "common garter snake snakelet"
msgid_plural "common garter snake snakelets"
msgstr[0] "幼年束带蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "common garter snake snakelet"
msgid "A garter snake in its juvenile stage."
msgstr "一只刚孵化出的幼年束带蛇。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "worm snake"
msgid_plural "worm snakes"
msgstr[0] "蠕蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "worm snake"
msgid "A small burrowing reptile that's just enjoying its time hunting earthworms."
msgstr "一种小型穴居爬行动物，正悠闲地享受捕猎蚯蚓的时光。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "worm snake snakelet"
msgid_plural "worm snake snakelets"
msgstr[0] "幼年蠕蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "worm snake snakelet"
msgid ""
"A worm snake in its hatchling stage.  Not that much smaller than an adult, "
"actually."
msgstr "一只刚孵化出的幼年蠕蛇。 和成年蠕蛇相比并没有小上多少。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "painted turtle"
msgid_plural "painted turtles"
msgstr[0] "錦龜"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "painted turtle"
msgid "A dark-colored species of freshwater turtle with bright orange markings."
msgstr "淡水龟中颜色较深的一种，身上有明亮的橙色斑纹。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "painted turtle hatchling"
msgid_plural "painted turtle hatchlings"
msgstr[0] "幼年錦龜"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "painted turtle hatchling"
msgid "A painted turtle in its hatchling stage."
msgstr "一隻剛孵化的幼年錦龜。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "common snapping turtle"
msgid_plural "common snapping turtles"
msgstr[0] "擬鱷龜"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "common snapping turtle"
msgid "A prehistoric-looking species of freshwater turtle with a nasty bite."
msgstr "一种外形像史前生物的淡水龟，咬合力很强。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "common snapping turtle hatchling"
msgid_plural "common snapping turtle hatchlings"
msgstr[0] "幼年擬鱷龜"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "common snapping turtle hatchling"
msgid "A common snapping turtle in its hatchling stage."
msgstr "一隻剛孵化的幼年擬鱷龜。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "five-lined skink"
msgid_plural "five-lined skinks"
msgstr[0] "五线石龙子"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "five-lined skink"
msgid "A small species of skink.  The only native lizard of New England."
msgstr "一种小型石龙子。 新英格兰唯一的原生蜥蜴。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "five-lined skink hatchling"
msgid_plural "five-lined skink hatchlings"
msgstr[0] "幼年五线石龙子"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "five-lined skink hatchling"
msgid "A five-lined skink in its hatchling stage."
msgstr "一只刚孵化出的幼年五线石龙子。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mutant rattlesnake"
msgid_plural "mutant rattlesnakes"
msgstr[0] "突变响尾蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mutant rattlesnake"
msgid ""
"A mutated timber rattlesnake, about three times as large as the norm.  While "
"it isn't big enough to regard humans as potential prey, it is more aggressive "
"and dangerous compared to a normal rattler."
msgstr "突變的森林響尾蛇，約為標準的三倍大小。雖然它還未大到足以把人類當成獵物，它比普通響尾蛇更具侵略性和危險。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mutant rattlesnake snakelet"
msgid_plural "mutant rattlesnake snakelet"
msgstr[0] "幼年突变响尾蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mutant rattlesnake snakelet"
msgid ""
"A large mutated timber rattlesnake in its hatchling stage.  It will "
"eventually grow a rattle and learn how to hunt."
msgstr "一只刚孵化的大型变异木纹响尾蛇。它最终会长出尾环，学会如何捕猎。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant rattlesnake"
msgid_plural "giant rattlesnakes"
msgstr[0] "巨大響尾蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant rattlesnake"
msgid ""
"A large mutated timber rattlesnake, about six times as large as the norm.  "
"While it still isn't big enough to regard humans as potential prey, it is "
"much more aggressive and dangerous compared to a normal rattler."
msgstr "一条变异的巨型木纹响尾蛇，约有普通响尾蛇的六倍体积，虽然体型仍没有大到可以将人类当作猎物，但相比普通的响尾蛇更具有侵略性且更危险。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deathrattle serpent"
msgid_plural "deathrattle serpents"
msgstr[0] "巨型響尾蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deathrattle serpent"
msgid ""
"A primal fear strikes when the club-like tail of this massively warped snake "
"shifts, an assortment of bones rattling softly.  Multiple sets of hollow "
"fangs have erupted in its maw, which itself is flanked by skinless ropes of "
"powerful muscle.  Its scales constantly shed off and regrow with unnatural "
"speed."
msgstr ""
"当这条巨大而扭曲的蛇的棒状尾巴移动时，一种原始的恐惧朝你袭来，各种各样的骨头轻轻地嘎嘎作响。它的大嘴已经长出了好几对中空的毒牙，而大嘴两侧则是没有皮肤的强健"
"肌肉纤维。它的鳞片以不自然的速度不断脱落和再生。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sewer snake"
msgid_plural "sewer snakes"
msgstr[0] "水道蛇"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sewer snake"
msgid ""
"An aggressive mutant variety of the worm snake, turned pale yellow from lack "
"of sunlight.  It swarms beneath the ground, and is named for its habit of "
"infesting sewer lines."
msgstr "这是一种具有攻击性的变异盲蛇，缺少阳光照射使其身体变成淡黄色。这种生物在地下生活，并以其群聚在下水道的习性而命名。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tadpole"
msgid_plural "tadpoles"
msgstr[0] "蝌蚪"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"The larval form of some species of frog.  This one is only hypothetical and "
"you shouldn't be seeing it without debug."
msgstr "蛙类蝌蚪的虚拟模板。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"A speckled, gray-brown tadpole.  Its tail is broad and paddle-like, and its "
"body rotund.  Sometime soon it will grow legs and lose its tail entirely."
msgstr "有斑点的灰褐色蝌蚪。它的尾巴宽阔，像桨一样，身体圆滚滚的。不久的将来，它会长出腿，完全失去尾巴。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"Every part of this speckled, green-brown tadpole is thick and broad.  It must "
"be from some larger species of frog."
msgstr "这只有斑点的绿褐色蝌蚪的每一部分都又厚又宽。它一定来自某种较大的青蛙。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"The larval form of some species of frog.  Soon enough it will undergo "
"metamorphosis into its adult form.  This dark, speckled one has a rather "
"large, bulbous body compared to its thin, tapered tail."
msgstr "蛙类的幼年形态。很快它就会蜕变成成体。与细长的锥形尾巴相比，这只深色、有斑点的蝌蚪有着相当大的球状身体。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"A tiny larval frog.  Almost solid black, this one is barely a speck in the "
"water around it."
msgstr "一只小小的青蛙蝌蚪。它几乎是纯黑的，在它周围的水中几乎只有一个斑点。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"This rather unique tadpole might be mistaken for a small fish.  It sports a "
"very broad tail with bright red-orange coloration at its end, dotted with "
"black spots."
msgstr "这种相当独特的蝌蚪可能会被误认为是一种小鱼。它有一条非常宽的尾巴，尾巴末端有明亮的红橙色，点缀着黑点。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"A brown and tan speckled tadpole with a wide body and very broad, "
"feather-shaped tail."
msgstr "一条棕色和棕褐色斑点的蝌蚪，身体宽大，尾巴非常宽阔，呈羽毛状。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"This yellowish tadpole is covered in flecks of brown and cream coloring.  Its "
"eyes rest close together on a notably pointed face."
msgstr "这条黄褐色的蝌蚪身上布满棕色与米色的斑点。两只眼睛紧挨在突出的尖脸上。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid "A corpulent green tadpole with a yellow underbelly and black speckles."
msgstr "一条肥硕的绿色蝌蚪，腹部泛黄，布满黑色斑点。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid ""
"This mottled brown tadpole appears rather typical until you can get a glimpse "
"from the side.  Then its high, peaked mouth and low round belly stand out in "
"profile."
msgstr "这只斑驳的棕色蝌蚪乍看寻常，侧面看却显得怪异非常，高耸的尖嘴与浑圆的腹部形成了鲜明对比。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
msgid "A squat and wide-bellied tadpole with wide-set eyes."
msgstr "蝌蚪体型扁平，腹部宽大，眼睛睁得大大的。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant tadpole"
msgid_plural "giant tadpoles"
msgstr[0] "巨型蝌蚪"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
msgid "A tadpole the size of a bass.  It could win awards if it hadn't been debugged."
msgstr "巨型蝌蚪的虚拟模板。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
msgid ""
"A giant, gray-brown tadpole.  Its body is covered in irregular, chaotic "
"speckles of pitch black and chalk white."
msgstr "一只巨大的灰棕色蝌蚪。它的身体表面覆盖着不规则、混乱的漆黑和白垩斑点。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
msgid ""
"This giant, green tadpole would have been an oddity before the collapse.  Now "
"it's simply part of the scenery."
msgstr "在世界末日之前，这只巨大的绿色蝌蚪会是个怪胎。而现在它只是风景的一部分。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
msgid ""
"This big tadpole has already grown some warty bumps on its softball-sized "
"body.  Its nearly whip-thin tail appears to have no trouble propelling its "
"much larger core."
msgstr "这只大蝌蚪垒球大小的身体上已经长出了一些疣状肿块。它近乎鞭状的细长尾巴似乎能够毫不费力地推动其更大的身体。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
msgid ""
"Some kind of giant tadpole.  This speckled one has a body the size of a "
"grapefruit and a thin, tapered tail.  It flits about the water in quick "
"bursts."
msgstr "某种巨型蝌蚪。这只布满斑点的蝌蚪身体有柚子那么大，还有一条细细的锥形尾巴。它在水面上快速地跳跃。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
msgid ""
"A much larger than average tadpole.  Despite its unusual size, it is hard to "
"make out any features from its dark, almost black, tint."
msgstr "一条比普通蝌蚪大得多的家伙。尽管它体型异常，但在那近乎漆黑的深色中，很难辨认出任何特征。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
msgid ""
"This tadpole's expanded size only eccentuates its other unique feature.  Its "
"tail fin is a vibrant gradient of crimson to yellow."
msgstr "这只蝌蚪膨胀的体型反而突显了它更独特的特征，从猩红到明黄的渐变色尾鳍格外醒目。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "proxy frog"
msgid_plural "proxy frogs"
msgstr[0] "虚拟青蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "proxy frog"
msgid "A hypothetical frog, if you're seeing this there's a problem."
msgstr "占位青蛙。你要是看到这个说明出bug了。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leopard frog"
msgid_plural "leopard frogs"
msgstr[0] "豹蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leopard frog"
msgid ""
"Leopard frogs are named for the brown spots on their backs and legs.  "
"Although limited by size, they too are voracious predators."
msgstr "豹蛙因其背部和腿部的褐色斑点而得名。尽管受体型限制，它们也是贪婪的捕食者。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strangely-patterned frog"
msgid_plural "strangely-patterned frogs"
msgstr[0] "怪图青蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strangely-patterned frog"
msgid ""
"This large frog is covered in chaotic markings like a fractal river map over "
"a background of TV static.  While most lose their gills during metamorphosis, "
"this frog seems to have retained them, or something like them."
msgstr "这只大青蛙身上布满了混乱的标记，就像电视噪声背景上的分形河流地图一样。虽然大多数青蛙在变态过程中失去了鳃，但这只青蛙似乎保留了它们，或者类似的东西。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bullfrog"
msgid_plural "bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] "牛蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bullfrog"
msgid ""
"The American bullfrog, in its natural habitat.  It feeds on insects, mice, "
"lizards, and any other living thing it can stuff down its gullet."
msgstr "一种美国牛蛙。 它以昆虫、老鼠、蜥蜴和其他任何能塞进它嘴里的生物为食。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strange bullfrog"
msgid_plural "strange bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] "怪异牛蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strange bullfrog"
msgid ""
"Based on its vestigial tail, you would surmise that this bullfrog still has "
"some growing to do.  That is if it weren't already larger than any adult frog."
msgstr "根据它残存的尾巴，你猜测这只牛蛙仍会继续长大。然而它的体型已经比任何成年青蛙都大了。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Fowler's toad"
msgid_plural "Fowler's toads"
msgstr[0] "福勒蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Fowler's toad"
msgid ""
"Fowler's toads secrete a harmful and distasteful compound from their backs.  "
"This helps safeguard them from predators and also gives them a distinctive "
"odor like boiled peanuts."
msgstr "福勒蟾蜍从背部分泌一种有害且令人厌恶的化合物。这有助于保护它们免受捕食者的攻击，也给它们带来了一种独特的气味，就像煮花生一样。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "foul toad"
msgid_plural "foul toads"
msgstr[0] "惡臭蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "foul toad"
msgid ""
"You could almost smell it before you saw it.  This toad reeks.  You're not "
"quite sure what like, but it's hot and musky and it sticks in your nose until "
"you're tasting it."
msgstr "在你看到它之前，你几乎可以闻到它的味道。这蟾蜍散发着臭味。你不太确定它喜欢什么，但它又热又有麝香味，在你品尝之前它会一直粘在你的鼻子里。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "American toad"
msgid_plural "American toads"
msgstr[0] "美洲蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "American toad"
msgid ""
"American toads can vary greatly in appearance.  Individual toads will shift "
"their coloration and patterning throughout the seasons to better camouflage."
msgstr "美洲蟾蜍的外表差别很大。单个蟾蜍会在整个季节改变它们的颜色和图案，以更好地伪装。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "odd toad"
msgid_plural "odd toads"
msgstr[0] "怪异蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "odd toad"
msgid ""
"Wide as a watermelon and halfway up to your knee, this toad's size is "
"alarming.  So too are its odd proportions.  It's as if it hasn't fully grown."
msgstr "这种蟾蜍有西瓜那么宽，高度到你半膝盖，其大小令人震惊。它的奇怪比例也是如此。就好像还没有完全长成一样。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spring peeper"
msgid_plural "spring peepers"
msgstr[0] "春雨蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spring peeper"
msgid ""
"This diminutive frog has a distinctive chirping call and bands of darker skin "
"that come to form a rough 'X' shape on its back."
msgstr "这种体型小巧的青蛙叫声独特，背部的深色条纹构成十字交叉的花纹。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "vocal treefrog"
msgid_plural "vocal treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "发声树蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "vocal treefrog"
msgid ""
"A small brown frog with a very big voice.  When it calls, its whole "
"criss-crossed torso expands and trembles like an inflatable suit.  The loud "
"squeaky sound it makes is more charming than troubling.  The frequency can be "
"exhausting."
msgstr ""
"一只棕色的小青蛙，叫声很响亮。当它叫的时候，整个纵横交错的躯干就会像充气娃娃一样膨胀并颤抖。它发出的响亮的呱呱声与其说是迷人，不如说是令人不安。叫声的频率听"
"着有点折磨人。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gray treefrog"
msgid_plural "gray treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "灰树蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gray treefrog"
msgid ""
"This treefrog can change its coloration much like a chameleon, shifting from "
"a near-white gray, through greens and browns, to a dark, almost charcoal "
"color."
msgstr "这种树蛙能够像变色龙一样改变颜色，它的色彩从灰白色开始，经过绿色和棕色的变化，最终转变成深色、几近炭黑色。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shifting treefrog"
msgid_plural "shifting treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "变色树蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shifting treefrog"
msgid ""
"You've seen it wrinkle its skin into bark and disappear on a tree; settle on "
"a toadstool and take its spots.  It's no trick of the light, this frog's skin "
"shifts not just color but texture."
msgstr "你曾见过它将皮肤皱成树皮隐身于树上；你也曾见过它停在蘑菇上并模仿出斑点。这不仅仅是光线的幻觉，这只蛙的皮肤不仅可以改变颜色，还能改变纹理。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mink frog"
msgid_plural "mink frogs"
msgstr[0] "水鼬蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mink frog"
msgid ""
"This pungent frog is named for the mammal with which it shares both name and "
"odor.  Its skin is light green underneath a heavy spatter of almost black "
"mottling."
msgstr "这种气味浓烈的蛙因与其同名同味的哺乳动物而得名。它的皮肤呈浅绿色，下面布满厚厚的近乎黑色的斑点。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tailed frog"
msgid_plural "tailed frogs"
msgstr[0] "尾蟾"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tailed frog"
msgid ""
"This very large, funky frog has an accentuated, paddle-like tail that "
"accounts for half its body mass.  It is green with many brown spots "
"scattering across its back."
msgstr "这种体型巨大、造型奇特的青蛙有一条突出的桨状尾巴，占其体重的一半。它是绿色的，背部散布着许多棕色斑点。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pickerel frog"
msgid_plural "pickerel frogs"
msgstr[0] "狗鱼蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pickerel frog"
msgid ""
"The pickerel frog is identifiable by two rows of roughly square-shaped spots "
"that run along its back, shaded a darker brown than the rest of their skin.  "
"Though not more than an irritant to humans, their skin secretions are known "
"for being fatal to most things their size."
msgstr "狗鱼蛙可以通过其背部两排大致方形的斑点认出，颜色比其他皮肤更偏深棕。虽然狗鱼蛙的皮肤分泌物对人类无害，但对大多数体型相同的生物来说都是致命的。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "palette frog"
msgid_plural "palette frogs"
msgstr[0] "彩斑蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "palette frog"
msgid ""
"You're quite sure that no frog this bright and garish could be native to New "
"England.  Most of its skin is a light brown, but the large, squarish patches "
"on its back and legs are of every different hue, all of them bright."
msgstr "你十分确信，新英格兰地区不可能有如此鲜艳刺眼的青蛙。它的大部分皮肤呈浅棕色，但背部和腿上的大块方形斑纹却色彩斑斓，每一块都鲜艳夺目。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "green frog"
msgid_plural "green frogs"
msgstr[0] "青蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "green frog"
msgid ""
"True to its name this frog is green.  Though this one is certainly of the "
"Northern subspecies, they are common throughout, and native to, the Eastern "
"half of North America.  The shades of green can vary greatly and there might "
"be some brown on the limbs or mottled on the back."
msgstr "正如其名，这只蛙是绿色的。虽然这只肯定是北方亚种，但它们在北美东部很常见也原产于那里。它们的绿色色调可能差别很大，四肢可能有些棕色，背部可能有杂色。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wood frog"
msgid_plural "wood frogs"
msgstr[0] "林蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wood frog"
msgid ""
"This frog wears a pattern of tans and browns, with a darker eye mask and a "
"light cream underbelly.  Its coverings make for great camouflage among the "
"dry leaves and tree bark."
msgstr "这只蛙全身呈棕褐色，眼罩颜色较深，腹部呈浅奶油色。它的外皮在枯叶和树皮中具有极佳的伪装性。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spadefoot toad"
msgid_plural "spadefoot toads"
msgstr[0] "锄足蟾"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spadefoot toad"
msgid ""
"The eastern variety of the American spadefoot toad is a squat, round toad "
"with vertical pupils.  Its body is colored a muddy mixture of browns, tans, "
"and yellow-greens.  Their name comes from the keratinous projection on their "
"hind legs that aids them in digging."
msgstr "美洲锄足蟾的东部种是一种体形矮胖、圆润、瞳孔竖直的蟾蜍。其身体呈泥泞的棕色、棕褐色和黄绿色的混合。其名字源于后腿上的角质突起，有助于挖掘。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "many-legged frog"
msgid_plural "many-legged frogs"
msgstr[0] "多足蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "many-legged frog"
msgid ""
"You see a whole leopard frog and then some.  This poor thing must have almost "
"a dozen extra legs sticking off of it.  It is difficult to determine an exact "
"number as most of them are underdeveloped or otherwise malformed."
msgstr "你看见了一只豹蛙，而且远不止于此。这只可怜的小家伙身上长出来了大约一打多余的腿。因为这些腿大多是未长成或畸形的，你很难分辨它的具体数目。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "many-legged frog"
msgid ""
"A green frog that has suffered some kind of mutation.  At its hips it has "
"clusters of extra legs, some are complete but others lack feet or end at the "
"first joint."
msgstr "一只变异的绿色青蛙。它的腿根长有成簇的额外肢体，有些发育完整，另一些则缺少脚掌或仅剩第一节关节。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "many-legged frog"
msgid ""
"This cream and brown frog looks more like a great insect in profile.  It has "
"evidently mutated, growing many additional, spindly legs that rise high "
"before attempting to bend back downwards."
msgstr "这只奶油色与棕色相间的青蛙从侧面看更像一只巨大的昆虫。它显然发生了变异，长出了许多额外的细腿，这些腿高高翘起，看上去试图向后弯折。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized proxy frog"
msgid_plural "oversized proxy frogs"
msgstr[0] "虚拟超巨型青蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized proxy frog"
msgid ""
"An unreal frog of unusually large size.  This one is here by mistake; likely "
"drawn by some kind of (de)bug."
msgstr "超巨型青蛙模板。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mutant bullfrog"
msgid_plural "mutant bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] "變異牛蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mutant bullfrog"
msgid ""
"A mutant bullfrog larger than most dogs.  It looks unwell, as if this growth "
"spurt was less than comfortable."
msgstr "一种比大多数狗都大的变异牛蛙。看起来它情况不太妙，好像这个突然增长的过程让它不太舒服。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized toad"
msgid_plural "oversized toads"
msgstr[0] "超大蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized toad"
msgid ""
"This toad seems to have been mutated to absurd size by the Cataclysm.  It's "
"only half your size but that hardly feels comforting."
msgstr "这只蟾蜍似乎因为大灾变而变异到了荒谬的大小。尽管它只有你体型的一半，但它几乎不会让人觉得安心。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "staticskin frog"
msgid_plural "staticskin frogs"
msgstr[0] "静电青蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "staticskin frog"
msgid ""
"Bioluminescent trails trace through the dark speckled patterns on this "
"oversized frog's skin.  What would be cleanly defined spots on another frog, "
"are instead fragmented collages of gray and black pigment over pale skin.  "
"Its vestigial gills have grown into something else.  You can see them bulging "
"the flesh under its mouth."
msgstr ""
"生物发光痕迹在这只巨型青蛙皮肤上的黑色斑点图案上传递。在其他青蛙身上原本清晰的斑点，现在却变成了苍白皮肤上碎片分布的灰色和黑色染料拼贴画。它早已退化的鳃已经"
"长成了别的东西。你可以看到它们嘴中的血肉鼓胀起来。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "greasy stinktoad"
msgid_plural "greasy stinktoads"
msgstr[0] "油污蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "greasy stinktoad"
msgid ""
"This lumpy oversized toad is a real stinker!  A miasma like rotted onions "
"coated in rancid peanut butter surrounds it.  Even approaching it makes your "
"eyes water and your throat tighten until you're coughing to catch breath.  It "
"doesn't help that its leathery skin looks to be coated in a thick greasy "
"substance, no doubt related to the creature's horrid odor."
msgstr ""
"这只硕大的巨型蟾蜍真的很臭！它周围弥漫着一种像裹着腐烂花生酱的腐烂洋葱一样的恶臭。光是靠近它就让你的眼睛流泪，喉咙发紧，直到你咳嗽得喘不过气来。它坚韧的皮肤"
"上似乎覆盖着一层厚厚的油腻物质，毫无疑问，这与这种生物恐怖臭味有关。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jumbo treefrog"
msgid_plural "jumbo treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "巨型树蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jumbo treefrog"
msgid ""
"On, thick over-proportioned legs this large treefrog slings its weight with "
"notable force.  It doesn't seem a danger, but its size is still cause for "
"concern.  Even scrunched up, it is as large as a Thanksgiving turkey."
msgstr "这只巨大的树蛙用一双比例不符的粗腿以可观的力量吊起全身重量。它看起来并不危险，但其体型大小仍然令人担忧。即使缩成一团，它也和一只感恩节火鸡一样大。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wailing treefrog"
msgid_plural "wailing treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "哀嚎树蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wailing treefrog"
msgid ""
"Now the size of a dog, this tan, speckled tree frog will not stop making "
"noise.  Its increased size has only boosted its volume.  It belts out sound "
"in a relentless series of piercing, grinding chirps."
msgstr "体型已经长到有狗那么大了，现在这只棕褐色、有斑点的树蛙时刻不停地发出噪音。它增大的体型只会增加叫声的音量。它不停地发出一阵阵无情的尖利、刺耳的鸣叫声。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mimic treefrog"
msgid_plural "mimic treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "拟态树蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mimic treefrog"
msgid ""
"You've seen enough to gather that this is a frog with some very specialized "
"camouflage.  Its skin appears able to reactively change texture and color to "
"match its surroundings.  Like a morphing ghillie suit it can extend filaments "
"to mimic individual leaves and blades of grass.  It is keen enough to match "
"the swaying of brush in the wind."
msgstr ""
"你详细地观察了好一阵子，可以断定这是一只带有非常专业伪装的某种树蛙。它的皮肤似乎能够跟随环境改变纹理和颜色以适应周围的环境。就像变形的吉利服一样，它可以延伸"
"细长的毛发来模仿单个叶子和草叶。毛发相似程度足以与风中摇曳的毛刷相匹配。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant bullfrog"
msgid_plural "giant bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] "巨型牛蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant bullfrog"
msgid ""
"A mutated bullfrog taller than you are.  It stares with amber eyes as it "
"considers the easiest way to swallow you whole."
msgstr "一隻綠色厚皮的青蛙。它把你當做蟲子， 能夠簡單的把你吞下。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant toad"
msgid_plural "giant toads"
msgstr[0] "巨型蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant toad"
msgid ""
"This toad has grown bigger than a human.  It looks uninterested in eating you "
"but you better not give it a chance."
msgstr "这只蟾蜍长得比人还大。它看起来对吃你不感兴趣，但你最好不要给它机会。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "taser tongue"
msgid_plural "taser tongues"
msgstr[0] "电舌怪"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "taser tongue"
msgid ""
"This pale, trash can-sized frog sports a series of faintly glowing spots "
"among its chaotic skin patterns.  The glow seems most concentrated around its "
"unusually bulky neck and mouth.  Its dark eyes scan for an appetizing target."
msgstr "这只体表苍白、垃圾桶大小的青蛙在其混乱的皮肤图案上长着有一系列微弱发光的斑点。光芒似乎最集中在其异常庞大的颈部和嘴巴周围。它的黑色眼睛不停扫描着开胃大餐。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant hogtoad"
msgid_plural "giant hogtoads"
msgstr[0] "巨型猪蟾"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant hogtoad"
msgid ""
"This large, odious, boar-sized toad shares some features with its namesake.  "
"It grunts, roots and wallows, but more striking are the dense tusk-like "
"growths sprouting from its face and jaw.  Though they seem to be most "
"effective for burrowing and protection, in places they come to curved points "
"that look quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"一只体型巨大、令人厌恶、野猪大小的蟾蜍，有着与它名字的相同的特征。它会发出咕噜声、扎根和打滚，但更引人注目的是从它的脸和下巴上长出獠牙状生长物。尽管看起来是"
"更适合挖掘而非自卫，但在某些弯曲的地方看起来相当尖锐。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "colossal croaker"
msgid_plural "colossal croakers"
msgstr[0] "超巨型牛蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "colossal croaker"
msgid ""
"Bloated to titanic size, rivaling a moose, this mutated bullfrog takes "
"several seconds just to blink each vacant eye.  In place of the cognition it "
"has lost, the beast has gained an even more voracious appetite and the might "
"to sustain it."
msgstr "这只变异的牛蛙体型十分庞大，可以与驼鹿媲美，每眨次都需要好几秒钟的时间。取代它所失去的认知能力，它获得了更贪婪的食欲和维持食欲的力量。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gargantuan toad"
msgid_plural "gargantuan toads"
msgstr[0] "超巨型蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gargantuan toad"
msgid ""
"This toad is of truly enormous stature, larger than many cars.  You can't "
"help but wonder if it could fit as many people inside."
msgstr "这只蟾蜍的体型确实巨大，比许多汽车还要大。你不禁想知道它的体内是否也能容纳下那么多人。"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "great beaked toad"
msgid_plural "great beaked toads"
msgstr[0] "巨喙蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "great beaked toad"
msgid ""
"This massive toad's jaw bones have grown out from its lips into a powerful "
"beak, large enough to snap a bicycle in two.  The bony growths extend to its "
"face, ringing its eyes and shielding its parotoid glands, swollen with "
"poison.  Though intimidating, it appears more interested in a soothing mud "
"bath than anything violent."
msgstr ""
"这只巨型蟾蜍的下颌骨已经从嘴唇长出，形成了一个强大的喙，大到足以将一辆自行车咬成两半。骨头生长延伸到它的前脸，包围住它的眼睛并保护它因充满毒液而肿胀的腮腺。"
"虽然很吓人，但相比暴力行为，它似乎对舒缓的泥浴更感兴趣。"

#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "prototype laser turret"
msgid_plural "prototype laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "原型雷射砲塔"

#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "prototype laser turret"
msgid ""
"This appears to be a very experimental automated tower.  Lacking armor "
"plating and seemingly half-built, it's little more than an oversized laser "
"emitter and a camera, both welded to a swiveling platform."
msgstr ""
"它似乎是一台实验性的自动化炮塔。尚未安装装甲板，看起来像是半成品一般，像是在一台加大号的激光发射器上安装了一个摄像头，两者都被焊接在一个能够旋转的炮塔底座上"
"。"

#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Hub 01 camspy"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 camspies"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 偵察無人機"

#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Hub 01 camspy"
msgid ""
"A white and brown quadcopter drone mounting what looks to be a camera dome "
"and a large antenna array.  It calmly hovers a comfortable distance above the "
"ground, surveiling its surroundings with cold indifference."
msgstr "一架白棕色的四旋翼无人机，安装了一个看起来像是摄像头的圆顶和一个大型天线阵列。它平静地在离地面较高的地方盘旋着，冷漠地监视着周围的环境。"

#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Hub 01 exterminatron"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 exterminatrons"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 根除者无人机"

#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Hub 01 exterminatron"
msgid ""
"An armed and up-armored skitterbot, clad in white plastic plating and "
"mounting a stripped down 7.62 battle rifle over its original cam-arm."
msgstr "一台全副武装的掠行无人机，覆盖白色的塑料装甲板，在原来的辅助臂上安装了一支简化版本的 7.62mm 口径战斗步枪。"

#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Hub 01 exterminatron"
msgid "The exterminatron legs lock into place as it swings its turret to bear."
msgstr "根除者无人机的腿部固定在原地，同时转动炮塔对准目标。"

#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Hub 01 exterminatron"
msgid "\"Teep.\""
msgstr "“嘀嗒。”"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lab rat"
msgid ""
"The albino Norway rat, an omnivorous rodent with sleek white fur and a long, "
"rough tail.  While its ancestors were harbingers of plague, these clever "
"animals are omnipresent in modern biomedical research."
msgstr "挪威白化鼠，一种杂食性啮齿动物，长着光滑的白色毛皮和长而粗糙的尾巴。虽然它的祖先是瘟疫的象征，但这些聪明的动物在现代生物医学研究中无处不在。"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "big rat"
msgid_plural "big rats"
msgstr[0] "變異大老鼠"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "big rat"
msgid ""
"This cat-sized rat snuffles along the ground looking for things to eat.  It "
"hisses at anything that comes near it, baring sizable teeth."
msgstr "这只体型和猫一般大小的老鼠在地上嗅来嗅去寻找食物。它会对任何靠近的东西发出嘶嘶声，露出尖利的大牙齿。"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zap rattigan"
msgid_plural "zap rattigans"
msgstr[0] "霹靂鼠"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zap rattigan"
msgid "This cat sized albino mouse sparks randomly, whenever anything approaches it."
msgstr "这只体型和猫一般大小的白化老鼠在任何东西接近它时都会随机发出火花。"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tunnel runner"
msgid_plural "tunnel runners"
msgstr[0] "隧道追獵鼠"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tunnel runner"
msgid ""
"Prior to the Cataclysm someone might have referred to this dog-sized rat as a "
"'mass of claws and teeth,' but that could describe nearly everything you meet "
"these days.  In any case, this particular mass of claws and teeth is eyeing "
"its surroundings hungrily."
msgstr ""
"在大灾变之前，有人可能会把这只从地底爬出来的巨大老鼠称为\"一团尖牙利爪\""
"，但这几乎可以描述你现在遇到的一切。不管怎样，这团尖牙和利爪正贪婪地注视着周围的环境。"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pack rat"
msgid_plural "pack rats"
msgstr[0] "林鼠"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pack rat"
msgid ""
"This humanoid rodent stands over five feet tall, it pokes and bites at "
"anything shiny, hastily shoving anything of interest into its mouth."
msgstr "这种人形啮齿动物身高超过五英尺（约1.5米），会去戳和咬任何闪闪发光的东西，然后匆忙将一切感兴趣的东西塞进嘴里。"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Mouse of NEMA"
msgid_plural "Mice of NEMA"
msgstr[0] "NEMA鼠人"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Mouse of NEMA"
msgid ""
"This albino, humanoid mouse walks on its hind legs.  You can see eddies of "
"wind swirl unnaturally around it as it moves, debris caught in its wake."
msgstr "这只白化的人形老鼠用后腿行走。你可以看到空气漩涡在它周围不自然地旋转，无数碎石随着它的尾迹裹挟舞动。"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mausketeer"
msgid_plural "mausketeers"
msgstr[0] "鼠人騎兵"

#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mausketeer"
msgid ""
"This humanoid rat seems to be inexplicably dressed for a renfaire in an "
"imitation of Ancien Régime light cavalry, complete with a sword."
msgstr "这只人形老鼠似乎莫名其妙地穿着一件模仿法国旧制度下国王火枪卫队轻骑兵的服装，还配上了一把剑。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "A shadow?"
msgid_plural "A shadow?"
msgstr[0] "影子？"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Description of monster "A shadow?"
msgid ""
"Something is there!  Against all reason, this shadow lurks at the corners of "
"your vision.  You close your eyes, but still, it is there.  No matter how far "
"you run, it is there.  In pitchest black, it is there.  Now you will know why "
"you fear the night."
msgstr ""
"有什么东西在那里！毫无疑问，这个阴影潜伏在你视野的角落。即使闭上眼睛，它依然存在。无论逃多远，它都紧随其后。在一片漆黑中，它也从不离开。现在你将明白你为什么"
"如此畏惧黑夜。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "A shadow?"
msgid "The ground blackens before you."
msgstr "你眼前变黑了。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "A shadow?"
msgid "Your hearing is overwhelmed by a booming sound!"
msgstr "你的听觉被一声巨响淹没！"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIEUTENANT_DRAIN_LIFE_TERRAIN"
msgid "The air rings out with a piercing shriek!"
msgstr "空气中响起了刺耳的尖叫声！"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eater_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIEUTENANT_SPAWN_SHADOW_MESSAGE"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LIEUTENANT_SPAWN_SHADOW_MESSAGE"
msgid "You shiver as the night closes in…"
msgstr "你在夜幕降临下颤抖"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/vanilla_overwrites.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIEUTENANT_SHADOW_WITHDRAWS_FOR_NOW"
msgid "The wind laughs through the night"
msgstr "风的笑声传遍了夜幕"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/vanilla_overwrites.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIEUTENANT_SHADOW_WITHDRAWS_FOR_NOW"
msgid "…but it grows more distant for now."
msgstr "……但现在它变得越来越遥远了。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LIEUTENANT_SHADOW_CATCHUP"
msgid "You can't outrun your own shadow!"
msgstr "你无法逃离自己的影子！"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_early"
msgid ""
"Even out here you can still see the burning cities lighting up the horizon.  "
"What scares you most is not the gunshots you sometimes hear in the far "
"distance, but the idea of what people keep shooting at.  Tonight you hear "
"automatic gunfire winding down into single shots.\n"
"\n"
"Just what could make them shoot that much, all the way out here?"
msgstr ""
"即使在这里，你仍然可以看到燃烧的城市照亮了地平线。最让你害怕的不是你有时在远处听到的枪声，而是人们不断开枪的对象。今晚你听见自动枪声逐渐变成单发射击。\n"
"\n"
"到底是什么能让他们大老远跑到这里来射那么多枪？"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_early"
msgid ""
"You suddenly realize this area seems almost devoid of life.  The few bits of "
"blackened grass you can see are barely recognizable as grass, even "
"discounting the night.  Sure the zombies might be tearing people apart, but "
"what happened to the grass?  What, is the grass coming to life to eat people "
"too?\n"
"You snort at the idea, but it doesn't feel safe out here."
msgstr ""
"你突然意识到这个区域似乎几乎没有生命。即使不考虑夜晚，你能看到的几片黑色的草也几乎认不出是草。当然，丧尸可能会把人撕成碎片，但是草怎么了？什么，草也复活来吃"
"人了？\n"
"你对这个想法嗤之以鼻，但这里总感觉不安全。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_early"
msgid "You have a vague feeling of being watched."
msgstr "你有种隐约的被人监视的感觉。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_early"
msgid ""
"Your ears perk up as something rustles, but it just turns out to be "
"unnaturally withered and blackened vegetation you stepped on.  Wait, this can "
"not have happened on its own."
msgstr "一阵窸窸窣窣的声音让你竖起了耳朵，但发现只是你踩到了一些不自然地枯萎变黑的植被。等等，这不可能是自然形成的。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_early"
msgid "The night feels longer than usual."
msgstr "今夜特别漫长"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_early"
msgid "You suddenly yearn for a beautiful sunrise."
msgstr "你突然渴望一场美丽的日出。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_early"
msgid "The wind faintly cries into the night."
msgstr "夜风呜咽，声声入耳"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_early"
msgid "The darkness makes you nervous."
msgstr "黑暗使你神经紧绷。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid ""
"The nights are mostly calm and lonely nowadays, but you could almost swear "
"it's been getting darker since the Cataclysm.  Every once in a while you feel "
"like the darkness is creeping up on you when you turn your back."
msgstr "如今的夜晚大多平静而孤独，但你几乎可以发誓，自大灾变以来，夜变得越来越黑。有时候当你转身时，你会感觉黑暗正在向你袭来。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid ""
"The wind sure is howling tonight.  It almost sounds like something is out "
"there.  Out here.  With you."
msgstr "今晚的风确实有点喧嚣。听起来好像有什么东西在那里。在这里。等着你。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid ""
"In the distance you think you saw something …skitter?  Crawl?  It didn't move "
"like anything you've seen before.  Whatever it was, it's probably a bad idea "
"to let it surprise you in unfamiliar terrain in the darkness."
msgstr "在远处，你认为你看到了一些东西……掠过？爬过？它的移动方式不像是你以前见过任何生物。无论它是什么，让它在黑暗且陌生的地形中给你带来惊喜可不是个好主意。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid "You gut tells you that something is right around the corner."
msgstr "你的直觉告诉你，有什么东西就要到来了。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid ""
"You narrowly avoid stepping into a black tangle of withered, blackened "
"vegetation.  A trail of weird soot leads away from it."
msgstr "你险些踩进一团枯萎发黑的植被。一条奇怪的灰烬痕迹从那里延伸出去。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid "The night feels like it is dragging on for eternity."
msgstr "夜晚仿佛被拉长到了永恒。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid ""
"You suddenly long for a bright and beautiful morning, almost as in "
"desperation."
msgstr "你突然渴望一个明亮而美丽的早晨，几乎带着一种绝望。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid ""
"Suddenly, there are some vague, but threatening shapes in the distance you do "
"not recognize."
msgstr "突然间，远处出现了一些模糊但充满威胁的轮廓，你无法辨认它们是什么。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid "For a moment, the wind picks up and whistles an eerie song."
msgstr "片刻间，风势加剧，吹出一首诡异的曲调。"

#: data/json/monsters/singularities.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Shadow_Warnings_Snippets_late"
msgid "The darkness makes you anxious."
msgstr "四周的黑暗让你感到焦虑。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Description of monster "slime"
msgid ""
"A black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of living "
"oil."
msgstr "一團彷彿活著的石油滲出地面的黑色黏稠物。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brain slime"
msgid_plural "brain slimes"
msgstr[0] "黏球腦怪"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brain slime"
msgid ""
"A gigantic black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil.  Other slimes seem to swarm around it."
msgstr "一個又大又黏的黑色黏稠物，在從地面上流來流去，就像一團有生命的原油球。其他的黏液球似乎都聚集在它的身邊。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "big slime"
msgid_plural "big slimes"
msgstr[0] "大黏球怪"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Description of monster "big slime"
msgid ""
"A large black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil."
msgstr "一團彷彿活著的石油滲出地面的黑色黏稠物。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "small slime"
msgid_plural "small slimes"
msgstr[0] "小黏球怪"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Description of monster "small slime"
msgid ""
"A small black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil."
msgstr "一小團彷彿活著的石油滲出地面的黑色黏稠物。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "small slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "tadpole constrictor"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body melts away."
msgstr "%s 的尸体融化了。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "amoebic mold"
msgid_plural "amoebic molds"
msgstr[0] "阿米巴黴菌"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Description of monster "amoebic mold"
msgid ""
"A formless slime mold the size of a cow.  Crusty bits of cytoplasm fall away "
"as it oozes across the ground."
msgstr "一種沒有形體的黏菌， 大小與約牛相仿。其細胞壁崩落的結果就是它只能在地上爬行。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "slime microbian"
msgid_plural "slime microbians"
msgstr[0] "黏液微生物群落"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Description of monster "slime microbian"
msgid "A small wriggling slime, a first line of defense for the colony."
msgstr "一团蠕动的小型变形怪，是种群中的第一道防线。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "slime microbian"
#. ~ Death message of monster "slime ocularium"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body dissolves into acid."
msgstr "%s 的軀幹被酸液侵蝕。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "slime ocularium"
msgid_plural "slime oculariums"
msgstr[0] "黏液眼怪"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Description of monster "slime ocularium"
msgid ""
"A spire of hardened slime, coated in rotating eyespots and glistening ocular "
"nerves."
msgstr "一只变硬的尖顶变形怪，覆盖着不停旋转的眼柄和闪闪发光的眼神经。"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sewer slime"
msgid_plural "sewer slimes"
msgstr[0] "下水道变形怪"

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sewer slime"
msgid ""
"This moving, black glob emits a foul stench.  It has incorporated both the "
"liquid and solid contents of the sewer water."
msgstr ""
"This moving, black glob emits a foul stench.  It has incorporated both the "
"liquid and solid contents of the sewer water."

#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "sewer slime"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts, releasing its vile contents!"
msgstr "%s 爆炸开来，释放出其体内恶臭的液体！"

#: data/json/monsters/starers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "starer"
msgid_plural "starers"
msgstr[0] "凝視者"

#: data/json/monsters/starers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "starer"
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_starer_crowbar"
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_starer_axe"
msgid ""
"A horribly burned human, reeking of charred meat.  Their flesh has mended "
"into a leathery shell, and the pupils of their wide-open eyes are dilated and "
"the iris and sclera are bloodshot.  Somehow they still breathe, in deep, "
"ragged gulps."
msgstr "一具被烧焦的可怕人类尸体，散发着烧焦血肉的气味。它烧焦的血肉已经融合成坚韧的外壳，眼睛睁大瞳孔扩张，虹膜和巩膜充血。不知怎的，它仍在呼吸着，深深地吞咽着。"

#: data/json/monsters/starers.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "starer"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mon_starer_crowbar"
msgid "The starer throws a rock!"
msgstr "凝視者投擲了石頭！"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "biollante sprig"
msgid_plural "biollante sprigs"
msgstr[0] "植物獸細枝"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "biollante sprig"
msgid "A short, fat stalk with broad leaves and tiny flower buds."
msgstr "一根矮胖的肉茎，上面长着宽阔的叶子和幼小的花苞。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "biollante sprout"
msgid_plural "biollante sprouts"
msgstr[0] "植物獸新芽"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "biollante sprout"
msgid ""
"A thick stalk that rises five feet from the ground, with heavy, broad leaves "
"at its base.  Purple flower buds adorn the top."
msgstr "一根粗壮的肉茎，顶端离地面约五英尺（约1.5米）高，底部长满了宽阔的叶子。最顶部装点着一个紫色的花苞。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "biollante"
msgid_plural "biollantes"
msgstr[0] "植物獸"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "biollante"
msgid ""
"A drooped, quivering plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  "
"Its petals are closed, and pulsate ominously."
msgstr "厚實的莖上有紫色的花。花瓣是閉合的，並且有令人不安的搏動。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "creeper hub"
msgid_plural "creeper hubs"
msgstr[0] "變種藤蔓中樞"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "creeper hub"
msgid ""
"A thick stalk, rooted to the ground.  It rapidly sprouts thorny vines in all "
"directions."
msgstr "厚實的植物莖紮根到地面。有棘刺的藤蔓往四面八方迅速生長。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "creeper vine"
msgid_plural "creeper vines"
msgstr[0] "變種藤蔓莖"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "creeper vine"
msgid "A thorny vine, twisting wildly as it grows with incredible speed."
msgstr "厚實的植物莖。因為生長的速度快， 而瘋狂的扭曲纏繞。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid sprig"
msgid_plural "triffid sprigs"
msgstr[0] "食人樹細枝"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid sprig"
msgid ""
"A teeny-tiny triffid that has recently germinated.  Like a house cat, you "
"know it wants to eat you but it just can't figure out how."
msgstr "一個微小的食人樹最近發芽了。就像家貓一樣，你知道它想吃了你，但它卻不知道該怎麼做。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid sprout"
msgid_plural "triffid sprouts"
msgstr[0] "食人樹幼苗"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid sprout"
msgid ""
"A small triffid, only a few feet tall.  It has not yet developed bark, but "
"its sting is still sharp and deadly."
msgstr "一株小型的食人樹， 只有幾呎高。莖齒的部份還沒發育完全， 但是很刺且鋒利， 被咬到還是很致命。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid"
msgid_plural "triffids"
msgstr[0] "食人樹"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid"
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  "
"Nature is healing."
msgstr "一株缓慢爬行的行走植物，和驼鹿一般高。它有一根被厚树皮覆盖着的茎部，上面支撑着内含麻痹毒刺的花冠状头部。大自然可真是\"治愈\"啊。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid queen"
msgid_plural "triffid queens"
msgstr[0] "食人樹王后"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid queen"
msgid ""
"A ponderous and particularly arborescent triffid.  It has enormous red petals "
"surrounded by a haze of spores, and two thick barbed vines stick out from the "
"stems like wary harpoons."
msgstr "一棵笨重且樹枝特化的食人樹。擁有圍繞著孢子霧的巨大紅色花朵， 以及伸出一對像魚叉一樣粗壯的刺藤莖。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "vine beast"
msgid_plural "vine beasts"
msgstr[0] "藤蔓獸"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "vine beast"
msgid ""
"An animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with alarming "
"speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the center from which they grow is "
"concealed."
msgstr "以驚人的速度移動的籐蔓， 因為籐蔓厚重而糾結， 讓你看不出中心有什麼。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungicidal triffid"
msgid_plural "fungicidal triffids"
msgstr[0] "抗真菌三尖树"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungicidal triffid"
msgid ""
"A stout, woody plant that can dig through the ground and flick spines from "
"its branches.  The thorns carry a fungicidal compound with paralytic effects."
msgstr "一棵粗壮的木质植物，能沿着地面掘进，用自己带刺的荆棘拍打敌人。荆棘上分泌出带有麻痹作用的化合物，但似乎也能提炼出带有抗真菌效果的成分。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "triffid flower"
msgid_plural "triffid flowers"
msgstr[0] "食人樹花"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid flower"
msgid ""
"A giant plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  Its petals are "
"open with an ominous shine in the center."
msgstr "一株体型巨大的植物，粗茎顶端长着一朵紫色的花。它张开的花瓣之中散发出不祥的光芒。"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_triffid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#: data/mods/alt_map_key/overmap_terrain_pink.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "triffid heart"
msgid_plural "triffid hearts"
msgstr[0] "食人樹心臟"

#: data/json/monsters/triffid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "triffid heart"
msgid ""
"A knot of tubular roots, flowing with sap and beating like a heart.  Strands "
"of vascular tissue reach out to the surrounding root walls."
msgstr "一個看起來很詭異的心臟樣貌的東西。它緩慢的搏動， 並供給能量給予圍繞在其上的植根牆。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "improvised MP5 turret"
msgid_plural "improvised MP5 turrets"
msgstr[0] "粗製 MP5 砲塔"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "improvised MP5 turret"
msgid ""
"A 9mm MP5 attached to a motorized chassis with basic autonomous software "
"control.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when its magazine is "
"empty, and the fire control system is only designed for semi-automatic fire."
msgstr "一把9mm MP5冲锋枪被连接在安装了自动瞄准软件的机动式底盘上。但是由于缺少重新上弹的机械装置，所以没法自动重新装填，并且火控系统只能半自动射击。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "milspec searchlight"
msgid_plural "milspec searchlights"
msgstr[0] "軍規探照燈"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "milspec searchlight"
msgid ""
"A pylon boasting three high-powered searchlights with automated search AI, "
"continually seeking targets."
msgstr "一个安装了自动搜索AI的三路大功率探照灯，不停地搜寻着目标。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgstr[0] "M2HB 自主性通用遙控武器台 II"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a .50 caliber M2HB "
"machine gun."
msgstr "一台M153 CROWS II 自主武器系统的升级型号，安装了自主操作软件。这一台配备了一支 .50 口径 M2HB 机枪。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgstr[0] "M249 自主性通用遙控武器台 II"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a 5.56 caliber M249 "
"machine gun."
msgstr "一台M153 CROWS II 自主武器系统的升级型号，安装了自主操作软件。这一台配备了一支 5.56mm 口径 M249 机枪。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgstr[0] "M240 自主性通用遙控武器台 II"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a 7.62 caliber M240 "
"machine gun."
msgstr "一台M153 CROWS II 自主武器系统的升级型号，安装了自主操作软件。这一台配备了一支 7.62mm 口径 M240 机枪。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "riot control platform"
msgid_plural "riot control platforms"
msgstr[0] "鎮暴裝置"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "riot control platform"
msgid ""
"These TALON-derived riot control platforms were widely publicized a few years "
"before the Cataclysm as a new semi-autonomous device that could fire "
"less-lethal rounds with far more accuracy than a human, ensuring safer hits "
"against a target's limbs.  They were quickly adopted by prisons and "
"inner-city police forces, where they demonstrated that 'less lethal' does not "
"mean 'non-lethal'.  In the days before the Cataclysm, massive stockrooms of "
"these things were put into circulation.  On the bright side, although it "
"shoots autonomously, it requires a human operator to relocate, so it's not "
"mobile anymore."
msgstr ""
"这台由鹰爪型无人车衍生而来的防暴平台在大灾变发生前几年被作为一款新型半自主装置而被广泛宣传，可以发射出比人类精确得多的低致命性子弹，从而确保只对目标四肢进行"
"更无害的打击。它们很快就被监狱和中心城区警察所采纳，在那里验证了其\"低致命性\"与\"非致命性\""
"的不同。在大灾变发生前的几天里，有满满几仓库的该型号平台被投入使用。乐观点看，虽然它能够自主射击，但它需要一个人工操作者来更换位置，所以它已经无法再移动了。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "riot control platform"
msgid ""
"\"Universal curfew is in effect.  Please return to your home.  This unit is "
"authorized to open fire.\""
msgstr "＂全天候宵禁已生效，請立刻返回家中。本單位已被授權開火。＂"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "loudspeaker"
msgid_plural "loudspeakers"
msgstr[0] "擴音器"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "loudspeaker"
msgid "A high-powered loudspeaker set to loudly repeat messages on a loop."
msgstr "一台大功率扩音器，一遍又一遍响亮地重复着的预先录制的信息。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "upcycled turret"
msgid_plural "upcycled turrets"
msgstr[0] "改造砲塔"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "upcycled turret"
msgid ""
"This hefty turret appears to be bolted together out of various scraps of "
"technology, many of them extremely foreign-looking.  It is equipped with a "
"hefty-looking machine gun."
msgstr "这座巨大的炮塔似乎是用各种高科技零件拼凑而成的，其中有许多看起来非常奇怪的零件。它配备了一把看起来很结实的机枪。"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "upcycled turret"
msgid "\"Beep.\""
msgstr "\"嗶。\""

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "custom plated turret"
msgid_plural "custom plated turrets"
msgstr[0] "自製覆甲砲塔"

#: data/json/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "custom plated turret"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a M249 and reinforced "
"with heavy plating."
msgstr "一台M153 CROWS II 自主武器系统的升级型号，安装了自主操作软件。这一台配备了一支 M249 机枪，并用厚厚的装甲加固。"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grocery bot"
msgid_plural "grocery bots"
msgstr[0] "雜貨店機器人"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grocery bot"
msgid ""
"A popular product from Uncanny, this friendly android can carry your bag or "
"push your grocery cart for you.  You know it's friendly because its "
"human-esque face is constantly smiling at you.  According to the ads, it uses "
"a state-machine of a complexity never seen before.  Uncanny even hired "
"professional actors to record its lines.  Examine to befriend."
msgstr ""
"这个友善的机器人是安可异公司的一款大受欢迎的产品，能够为你携带包裹或者帮你推购物车。你确信它是友善的，因为它的仿人脸庞一直对你露出微笑。广告宣称该机器人采用"
"了前所未见的复杂状态机系统。安可异公司甚至请了专业的配音演员来为其配音。查看以建立友谊。"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "busted grocery bot"
msgid_plural "busted grocery bots"
msgstr[0] "損傷的雜貨店機器人"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "busted grocery bot"
msgid ""
"A busted grocery bot, it can still carry your bag but its arms are too "
"damaged to push a grocery cart.  Despite its current state, it's still "
"smiling at you.  Examine to befriend."
msgstr "一个残缺的食杂店机器人。它仍然能帮你拎包，但手臂已经损坏，不能再推购物车了。即使是在这种状况下，它仍然对你露出微笑。查看以建立友谊。"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cleaner bot"
msgid_plural "cleaner bots"
msgstr[0] "清潔機器人"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cleaner bot"
msgid ""
"The Ford Sanitron, a utility robot designed for cleaning up waste material in "
"hazardous conditions."
msgstr "福特Sanitron， 一個設計用於危險環境下清理廢棄物的實用機器人。"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "demining bot"
msgid_plural "demining bots"
msgstr[0] "排雷机器人"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "demining bot"
msgid ""
"A snake-like, segmented robot built to tunnel into the ground and detonate "
"landmines."
msgstr "一個似蛇的機器人， 設計用來鑽入地底引爆地雷的用途。"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "nurse bot"
msgid_plural "nurse bots"
msgstr[0] "護士機器人"

#: data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "nurse bot"
msgid ""
"The first product from Uncanny, a towering four-armed humanoid with a gentle "
"face.  The details of its visage are striking, but the stiffness of it makes "
"you really uncomfortable.  The end of the world did not stop it from looking "
"for patients to assist."
msgstr "安可异公司的第一款产品，一个高耸的四臂人形机器人，五官柔和。它容貌细节令人称奇，但它冷漠的表情让你感到非常不舒服。世界末日并没有阻止它寻找病人协助。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax trifacet"
msgid_plural "Yrax trifacets"
msgstr[0] "Yrax trifacets"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax trifacet"
msgid ""
"Three dual leg modules join with each lower vertex of a pyramidal body, in a "
"abstract configuration that vaguely recalls an alien arthropod.  Devoid of "
"any exterior signs that betray its artificial origin, it looks like it could "
"fold itself into a perfectly featureless quartz pyramid.  It crawls with a "
"gait like none you've seen before, its minute movements too fast for your "
"eyes to track."
msgstr ""
"三个双足模块连接在金字塔形躯体的每个底角上，构成一种令人隐约联想到外星节肢生物的抽象形态。它表面没有任何暴露人造特征的痕迹，看起来能折叠成毫无特征的石英金字"
"塔。爬行姿态前所未见，细微动作快得令人难以捕捉。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Yrax trifacet"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Yrax delta"
msgid "a fast sequence of clicking tones."
msgstr "一系列快速的咔嗒声。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax triakis"
msgid_plural "Yrax triakis"
msgstr[0] "三棱蛇构体"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax triakis"
msgid ""
"Short-snakelike limbs seamlessly extend from an aggressively faceted body.  "
"Its movements keep it low to the ground, coiled like a trap waiting to spring."
msgstr "短蛇状的肢体从棱角分明的主体上无缝延展。它紧贴着地面盘踞游走，如同陷阱般蓄势待发。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax sphenocorona"
msgid_plural "Yrax sphenocoronae"
msgstr[0] "棱冠体"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax sphenocorona"
msgid ""
"Manipulator arrays seamlessly protract from asymmetric facets, their testing "
"spaces undisturbed by the forces affixing it to the sky."
msgstr "不对称的棱面上无声滑出机械触须阵列，即便被束缚在空中，它的实验区域仍不受丝毫扰动。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax sphenocorona"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Yrax sphenocorona"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s abruptly falls to the ground!"
msgstr "%s猛然坠落在地面上！"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Yrax sphenocorona"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "golden monolith"
#, c-format
msgid "Shards of gleaming alloy detach from the %s's surface!"
msgstr "闪亮的合金碎片从%s表面剥离！"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "golden monolith"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s unfolds into an alien robot!"
msgstr "%s不断伸缩变形，展开成一个外星机械生物！"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax apeirohedron"
msgid_plural "Yrax apeirohedra"
msgstr[0] "无限面体"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax apeirohedron"
msgid "Its uncountable surfaces flow against each other in a dazzling sea of gold."
msgstr "无数的表面，在闪耀的金色海洋中交错流动。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax apeirohedron"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s folds away."
msgstr "%s折叠了起来。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid_plural "Yrax quadraphracts"
msgstr[0] "四棱战构体"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid ""
"A gleaming, burnished gold, four legged structure the size of a small "
"vehicle, but much taller; this looks vaguely robotic, but too smooth and "
"perfect to fit in this world.  Its legs are smooth faceted figures, with no "
"visible joints, and hold its gem-like body aloft with an eery, sculpted "
"grace.  At the peak of the gem-body is a deep, goblet-shaped crown that "
"slowly swivels about, pointing at nothing in specific.  Though nothing about "
"its appearance is familiar to you, it nevertheless strikes you with a mixture "
"of awe and dread."
msgstr ""
"一座抛光黄金铸造的四足构造体，尺寸堪比小型车辆却更为高耸。它看似机械造物，但过于流畅完美的外形与这方世界格格不入。无关节的棱面足肢以诡异的雕塑感托起宝石般的"
"躯干，顶端深陷的杯状冠冕缓缓旋转，漫无目的地指向虚空。虽全然陌生，却令人本能地生出敬畏与恐惧交织的战栗。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "The quadraphract collapses, dead at last."
msgstr "四棱战构体轰然倒塌，终于停止了活动"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "reality seems to warp around the quadraphract's crown as it fires."
msgstr "当四棱战构体开火时，其冠冕周围的空间似乎发生扭曲"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "a deep thrumming sound."
msgstr "低沉的嗡鸣声"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "quadraphract leg"
msgid_plural "quadraphract legs"
msgstr[0] "战构体足节"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "quadraphract leg"
msgid ""
"A morphing lune of burnished gold attached to the greater structure.  "
"Seemingly jointless it moves with a fluid grace, allowing the quadraphract to "
"glide aboveground with a speed and agility that belies its size."
msgstr "连接在主体结构上的金色月牙状可变形部件。看似无关节的设计却能流畅运动，使四棱战构体能够以与庞大身躯不符的速度和敏捷性在地面滑行。"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "quadraphract leg"
msgid "The quadraphract stumbles as one of its legs looses coherence and collapses."
msgstr "随着一条足节失去结构稳定性而坍塌，四棱战构体踉跄了几步"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax delta"
msgid_plural "Yrax deltas"
msgstr[0] "三角刃体"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax delta"
msgid ""
"A kite shaped blade of metal, darting through air and foes by indiscernible "
"means."
msgstr "金属打造的筝形刀刃，以难以捉摸的轨迹在空气与敌群中穿梭"

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Yrax delta"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#, c-format
msgid "A bolt of electricity arcs from %s!"
msgstr "%s突然射出一道电弧！"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal dog"
msgid_plural "skeletal dogs"
msgstr[0] "骷髏犬"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal dog"
msgid ""
"This undead canine has shed all of its skin, revealing a carapace of fused "
"bones and ribs.  This walking suit of bone seems to be controlled by a net of "
"veins and sinews which pulse with glistening black goo."
msgstr "这只丧尸犬的毛皮早已全部脱落，露出了内部由骨骼和肋骨融合而成的甲壳。这套会行走的骨甲似乎被一团充满了闪闪发光的黑色黏液的血管和肌腱网所驱动。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "barghest"
msgid_plural "barghests"
msgstr[0] "犬魔"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "barghest"
msgid ""
"A huge swollen zombie dog, smeared black with slime.  Its teeth have grown "
"longer, and its broad back ripples with muscles and oozing wounds."
msgstr "一只体型巨大而肿胀的丧尸犬，身体表面涂满了黑色的黏液。它的牙齿变得更长，宽阔的后背上布满了肌肉和渗出脓液的伤口。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cuspated dog"
msgid_plural "cuspated dogs"
msgstr[0] "尖喙狗"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cuspated dog"
msgid ""
"This dog's snout and jaw have seemingly fused together, the skin and flesh "
"ranging from completely gone to barely hanging on.  The boney mass as a whole "
"has an incredibly sharp yet jagged point.  It stumbles around, barely keeping "
"its hefty 'beak' from hitting the ground."
msgstr ""
"这只狗的鼻子和下巴似乎已经融合在一起，皮肤和肌肉从完全消失到几乎没有粘住。整个骨块形成了一个极其锋利且锯齿状的尖喙。随着它蹒跚而行，巨大的“喙”差点撞到地面"
"。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "howling dog"
msgid_plural "howling dogs"
msgstr[0] "哀嚎狗"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "howling dog"
msgid ""
"The underbelly of this undead canine expands and contracts arrhythmically, "
"almost like it's breathing.  Despite that, it is clearly in an advanced state "
"of decomposition.  Its snout and throat appear far too large for its species, "
"and the remains of its eyes appear much more analytical than its brethren."
msgstr ""
"这只不死犬科动物的下腹部有节奏地扩张和收缩，几乎就像它在呼吸一样。尽管如此，它浑身显然已经高度腐败。它的鼻子和喉咙像对于原始物种来说显得太大了，而且它残存的"
"双眼似乎比它的同僚们更具分析能力。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched dog"
msgid_plural "scorched dogs"
msgstr[0] "烧焦丧尸犬"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched dog"
msgid ""
"A charred and damaged corpse of a canid, covered in fused patches of burnt "
"hide and flesh."
msgstr "一头烧焦的丧尸犬，焦黑的皮毛与血肉熔结成块，浑身布满可怖的灼伤痕迹。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hulking horror"
msgid_plural "hulking horrors"
msgstr[0] "恐怖巨犬"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hulking horror"
msgid ""
"What may once have been a dog is now a grotesquely swollen monstrosity, "
"standing on four limbs as wide as trash cans and showing massive, jagged "
"teeth."
msgstr "曾经是一只狗的怪物，身体已经肿胀得十分荒唐，四肢像垃圾桶一样粗壮，长着巨大的锯齿状牙齿。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched hulking dog"
msgid_plural "scorched hulking dogs"
msgstr[0] "烧焦浩克犬"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched hulking dog"
msgid ""
"A charred and damaged corpse of what you can only assume was once a horribly "
"mutated dog.  Covering its entire body is a layer of fused and melted hide, "
"giving it an armored appearance."
msgstr "一头烧焦的丧尸犬，依稀能辨认出曾是条变异恶犬。它全身覆盖着一层熔融硬化的表皮，宛如披着铠甲。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "boneplate wolf"
msgid_plural "boneplate wolves"
msgstr[0] "骨甲狼"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "boneplate wolf"
msgid ""
"A four-legged creature covered in fused bony plates, shaped somewhat like a "
"dog or wolf.  Joints and cracks across its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr "一隻全身覆蓋者骨甲的四足生物，外型看起來像某種狗或者狼。周身的關節和隙縫有著看起來黑色的黏著物質。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skull pig"
msgid_plural "skull pigs"
msgstr[0] "骷髏豬"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skull pig"
msgid ""
"This undead boar appears to have been a truly massive specimen in life.  "
"Stretching eight to nine feet in length, the most arresting feature of this "
"animal is that the enamel of its tusks has spread across its face, leaving a "
"skull-like appearance with deep-set eye holes."
msgstr ""
"这只丧尸野猪如同是活着的特别巨大的巨型生物标本一样。这只怪物体型有八到九英尺（约2.6"
"米）长，其中最引人注目的特征是，它獠牙上的珐琅质已经完全覆盖了正脸，留下了颅骨般的外观和深陷的眼孔。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "trench pig"
msgid_plural "trench pigs"
msgstr[0] "壕溝野豬"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "trench pig"
msgid ""
"Billowing clouds of yellowish gas precede a boar-shaped shadow.  Glimpses of "
"a zombified boar are quickly obscured by the gases spewing forth from the "
"open wounds on its body."
msgstr "滚滚的黄色气云不断地从一只隐隐若现的野猪形阴影上散发出来。这只偶尔出现的丧尸野猪很快被它尸体上数道开放伤口中释放出的气体掩盖起来。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal wolf"
msgid_plural "skeletal wolves"
msgstr[0] "骷髏狼"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal wolf"
msgid ""
"This undead canine has shed all of its skin, revealing a carapace of fused "
"bones and ribs."
msgstr "这具不死犬尸已褪尽全身皮毛，裸露的骨骼与肋骨融合成甲壳状躯壳。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spearcat hunter"
msgid_plural "spearcat hunters"
msgstr[0] "矛貓獵手"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spearcat hunter"
msgid ""
"This undead cougar's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its fur is torn, "
"revealing deep, festering wounds.  Its claws and teeth are unnaturally long, "
"and sharpened into dangerous looking spikes."
msgstr "这只丧尸美洲狮的双眼渗出漆黑粘稠的液体，皮毛撕裂处露出溃烂的深创。它的爪牙异样修长，锐化成狰狞的尖刺。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal zombear"
msgid_plural "skeletal zombears"
msgstr[0] "骷髏殭屍熊"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal zombear"
msgid ""
"As if a zombified bear wasn't already a problem, this one is layered in thick "
"bone growths that protect it from harm.  The irregular way the plates grow "
"against each other has somewhat stifled its movement, but not enough to stop "
"it from easily gaining up on you."
msgstr "似乎丧尸熊还不够带劲，这只丧尸熊身上开始长出厚厚的骨制防护层来抵挡伤害。这些骨质甲板在某种程度上有些阻碍它的运动，但它仍能轻易的追上你。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadowcat"
msgid_plural "shadowcats"
msgstr[0] "幽靈貓"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadowcat"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is the outline of a large, "
"shambling cat."
msgstr "这只丧尸怪物被一层不可思议的阴影所笼罩，看上去似如光线也拒绝去接触它一般。你唯一能够分辨出来的是一个步履蹒跚的大型猫科动物轮廓。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombear"
msgid_plural "acidic zombears"
msgstr[0] "酸液殭屍熊"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombear"
msgid ""
"Most of this bear's fur has burnt off and its body looks to be falling apart, "
"not entirely immune to its own acidic fluids.  Despite its weakened state, "
"the strength of a bear hasn't left it."
msgstr "这只熊怪的大多数皮毛已被酸蚀殆尽，身体结构看起来岌岌可危，还没有完全免疫它自己产生的酸液。尽管它现在很虚弱，但不要忘了它体内还是有着熊的力量。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombie horse"
msgid_plural "acidic zombie horses"
msgstr[0] "酸性丧尸马"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie horse"
msgid ""
"The abdomen of this once majestic horse has grown rotund to the point you can "
"see through the skin, at the reservoir of caustic bile inside.  Its neck is "
"equally enlarged as well as slightly longer than normal."
msgstr "这匹曾经雄伟的马腹部已经变得臃肿，以至于你可以透过皮肤，看到里面的腐蚀性巨大胆囊。它的脖子也同样变粗，而且比正常情况下略长。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sinewy warhorse"
msgid_plural "sinewy warhorses"
msgstr[0] "战争之马"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sinewy warhorse"
msgid ""
"A zombified horse without skin, its overgrown, bloody musculature clear for "
"all to see.  Some muscles occasionally tear from their tendons as it barrels "
"towards its target, flailing around like a loose hose before weaving back "
"into place."
msgstr "一匹没有皮肤的丧尸马，过度生长的血淋淋肌肉组织清晰可见。当它冲向目标时，一些肌肉偶尔会从肌腱上撕裂，像一条松散的软管一样甩来甩去，然后再织回原处。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "smoldering stallion"
msgid_plural "smoldering stallions"
msgstr[0] "闷烧之马"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "smoldering stallion"
msgid ""
"This undead horse has a charred hide as black as soot, the underside of which "
"is littered with gashes and holes.  Pillars of choking black smoke pour from "
"the wounds, smothering everything that draws near."
msgstr "这匹不死的马的皮肤像煤灰一样焦黑，布满了伤口和洞。呛人的黑烟柱从伤口处涌出，熏死了靠近的一切。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pale charger"
msgid_plural "pale chargers"
msgstr[0] "死亡之马"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pale charger"
msgid ""
"With plates of asymmetrical bone tissue overlapping its body, this ignoble "
"steed needs no rider for you to fear its approach.  Completing its ghoulish "
"look is an overgrown skull which, judging by the flattened and battered "
"forehead, has become its main weapon."
msgstr "这匹怪异的马身上重叠着不对称的骨板，不需要骑手，你就会害怕它的到来。头骨已经过度增生探出头部，从它扁平而带有裂痕的前额来看，这已经成了它的主要武器。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antlered hammer"
msgid_plural "antlered hammers"
msgstr[0] "錘頭鹿角獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antlered hammer"
msgid ""
"This once-great moose's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is "
"torn and scarred.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, "
"festering wounds."
msgstr "這頭曾經雄偉的駝鹿，現在眼睛裡滲出黑色的油狀液體，它的肉被撕裂，傷痕累累。它的整個身體隆起，肌肉腫脹，傷口腫脹、潰爛。"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "thorny moose shambler"
msgid_plural "thorny moose shamblers"
msgstr[0] "刺棘駝鹿跛行獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "thorny moose shambler"
msgid ""
"This once-great moose is covered with long, matted hair twisted with thorny "
"vines that wrap together and then twist back into its body.  Long, "
"interlocking thorns wrap its antlers, dripping with a silvery liquid."
msgstr ""
"這頭曾經雄偉的駝鹿，現在全身長滿了長長的、亂七八糟的毛髮，上面纏繞著帶刺的藤蔓，這些藤蔓纏繞在一起，然後又纏繞回它的身體裡。長長的、交錯的荊棘包裹著它的鹿角"
"，滴著銀色的液體。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jawed terror"
msgid_plural "jawed terrors"
msgstr[0] "恐怖的下顎"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jawed terror"
msgid ""
"Once a normally-aggressive, normally-hungry bull shark, this undead terror is "
"now even more aggressive and more hungry, possibly thanks to its lack of a "
"functioning brain."
msgstr "它曾經是一隻飢餓富有攻擊性的公牛鯊， 現在雖然更加的有攻擊性而且更飢餓了， 但幸好它現在不會用腦， 只會依靠本能。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "abyssal terror"
msgid_plural "abyssal terrors"
msgstr[0] "深渊恐鲨"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "abyssal terror"
msgid ""
"Once a former apex predator of the seas, now an undead nightmare, this "
"zombified Great White shark terrorizes the waters with its relentless hunger "
"and aggression."
msgstr "这只丧尸化的大白鲨曾经是海洋的顶级捕食者，而现在成为了不死的梦魇，以其无尽的饥饿和攻击性为海洋带来恐惧。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie dog"
msgid_plural "zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] "殭屍狗"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dog"
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated corpse of a canine; a sinewy beast which can easily "
"outpace its two-legged friends."
msgstr "這是隻強而有力的犬科畸形生物， 向前的追擊速度比牠兩條腿的朋友更快。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Z-9"
msgid_plural "Z-9s"
msgstr[0] "Z-9"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Z-9"
msgid ""
"A zombified version of one of the German Shepherd dogs used in law "
"enforcement.  Its deformed body is encased in a protective Kevlar harness."
msgstr "一隻變成殭屍的警犬，德國牧羊犬犬種。它變形的身軀仍然套著克維拉胸背帶。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rot-weiler"
msgid_plural "rot-weilers"
msgstr[0] "腐爛犬屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rot-weiler"
msgid ""
"An acrid smell accompanies this animated canine corpse.  Its whole body is "
"covered in chains of pulsing cysts and slime-dribbling ulcers."
msgstr "刺鼻的氣味籠罩著這具犬類腐屍。它全身都佈滿了脈動的囊腫， 從中滴下粘稠的潰瘍膿汁。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grim howler"
msgid_plural "grim howlers"
msgstr[0] "猙獰咆哮者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grim howler"
msgid ""
"A zombified wolf.  Its mouth oozes with a black substance, coating its "
"vicious-looking white fangs."
msgstr "一隻殭屍狼， 牠有著一口凶狠的白色尖牙， 從他的齒縫間滲出黑色的物質。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombear"
msgid_plural "zombears"
msgstr[0] "殭屍熊"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombear"
msgid ""
"This black bear's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is torn and "
"scarred.  It shuffles as it walks."
msgstr "這隻黑熊的眼睛滲出深色油狀液體，並且其血肉殘破不堪。正在跌跌撞撞的走著。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "festering boar"
msgid_plural "festering boars"
msgstr[0] "潰爛的野豬"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "festering boar"
msgid ""
"A zombified omnivore descended from the wild boar.  Now it's got black goo "
"all over it, instead of mud."
msgstr "一隻殭屍化、雜食性的野豬， 但是它身上沾染的不是泥土， 而是黑色的黏液。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombeaver"
msgid_plural "zombeavers"
msgstr[0] "殭屍河狸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombeaver"
msgid ""
"This wall-eyed beast has a large wound on its side, its gore-stained ribs "
"clearly visible.  Its most prominent features are the fearsome incisors "
"dribbling thick, black goo from inside its mouth.  It doesn't look interested "
"in chewing on trees anymore."
msgstr "这只长着白星眼的怪兽身体侧面有个巨大伤口，血迹斑斑的肋骨清晰可见。它最突出的特征是一对可怕的门牙和嘴中不断滴下的厚厚的黑色黏液。它看起来不再想要啃树了。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antlered horror"
msgid_plural "antlered horrors"
msgstr[0] "恐怖鹿角獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antlered horror"
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic moose has succumbed to the infection that is killing "
"the world.  Shiny green blowflies swarm the vast, suppurated patches of "
"purulent flesh where its skin has sloughed away, and its remaining fur is "
"black and matted with necrotic discharge."
msgstr "这只曾经高贵强壮的驼鹿已经向正在毁灭世界的感染屈服。脱落的皮肤将化脓溃烂的血肉暴漏在外，滋生大量的绿头苍蝇。残余的毛皮则被腐败物染成了黑色。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "decayed pouncer"
msgid_plural "decayed pouncers"
msgstr[0] "腐爛撲咬者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "decayed pouncer"
msgid ""
"A normal-looking cougar, except that its hind legs are swollen, and its eyes "
"bulge with black goo."
msgstr "一条看似正常的美洲狮，但仔细观察会发现它的后腿肿了，眼睛凸起并流着黑色的黏液。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie horse"
msgid_plural "zombie horses"
msgstr[0] "殭屍馬"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie horse"
msgid ""
"From the deteriorated state of this undead horse's ghastly "
"features--protruding ribs, off-white skull, and decayed, tattered muscles--it "
"doesn't seem like it should put up much of a fight, but something deep inside "
"gives it power.  Black, reeking ichor drips from its wounds."
msgstr ""
"这匹丧尸马有着可怕的外表，从它突出的肋骨、发白的头骨、腐朽破烂的肌肉来看，它似乎无法进行太多的战斗，但它变异后的力量让它变得更加强大。黑色发臭的体液从伤口上"
"缓缓滴下。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiger wight"
msgid_plural "tiger wights"
msgstr[0] "倀虎"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiger wight"
msgid ""
"This tiger stumbles and sways, its jaws slack, its eyes wide open and shining "
"black."
msgstr "这只看似正常的老虎走起路来摇摇晃晃的，下巴松弛，眼睛睁得大大的，漆黑的眼睛正闪闪发亮。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie sheep"
msgid_plural "zombie sheep"
msgstr[0] "丧尸绵羊"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie sheep"
msgid ""
"This sheep's once pure white wool is now barely hanging by its rotten flesh, "
"held together by dried mud and blood.  Its legs now buckle as the rotten "
"muscles have a hard time sustaining the rest of the body."
msgstr "这只绵羊身上沾着干泥和污血的腐肉已经挂不住它那曾经纯白色的羊毛，由于腐烂的肌肉很难支撑身体的其余部分，它现在只能屈膝着腿。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie goat"
msgid_plural "zombie goats"
msgstr[0] "丧尸山羊"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie goat"
msgid ""
"The moving corpse of what once was a goat is now left stumbling around, with "
"pitch black empty eyes, looking for anything alive to kill."
msgstr "这具曾经是山羊的尸体现在正蹒跚而行，嗜杀的欲望让它那双漆黑空洞的眼睛不断地寻找着任何活物。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie cow"
msgid_plural "zombie cows"
msgstr[0] "殭屍牛"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cow"
msgid ""
"Once a placid cow, this leathery horror stumbles and shudders, its pulsing "
"black eyes scanning for prey.  Dairy cows have no natural weapons, but a "
"zombie as big, heavy, and murderous as this is still extremely dangerous."
msgstr "曾经是一头平静的母牛，这只皮革包裹的恐怖怪物蹒跚着，颤抖着。虽然奶牛没有天生的武器，但像这样又大又重的凶残丧尸奶牛仍然极其危险。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombull"
msgid_plural "zombulls"
msgstr[0] "殭屍公牛"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombull"
msgid ""
"This enormous, terrifyingly fast creature with oily black eyes and dreadful "
"horns was once a domestic bull.  While live bulls can be temperamental, "
"unbridled rage is now this one's only emotion."
msgstr "曾经是一头家养的公牛，这只巨大且速度惊人的怪物长着黑色油光的眼睛和可怕的尖角。即便是活生生的公牛也会喜怒无常，而如今难以掩盖的愤怒是它唯一的情绪。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie llama"
msgid_plural "zombie llamas"
msgstr[0] "丧尸美洲驼"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie llama"
msgid ""
"This llama oozes a dark oil from a multitude of lesions and cuts.  Its wool "
"has sloughed off with parts of its skin, revealing pulsating muscles and "
"flesh.  Its mouth drips with a sickly green substance which it seems to be "
"chewing on."
msgstr "这只羊驼从许多伤口中渗出黑色液体，毛皮已经和部分皮肤一起脱落，露出跳动的肉块。它的嘴里滴着一种恶心的绿色物质，似乎在咀嚼。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "zombie llama"
msgid "The vicious vicuña spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr "酸尸羊驼吐出了一团酸液！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "woodland wight"
msgid_plural "woodland wights"
msgstr[0] "林地屍妖"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "woodland wight"
msgid ""
"A pale, stumbling, white-tailed deer, rivulets of slime running down its "
"neck.  Its limbs twist and bend in unnatural, haphazard directions, and yet "
"it moves with uncanny strength and speed.  Thanks to the Cataclysm, it has "
"now turned the tables; what was once prey, now itself preys on coyotes, "
"wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"一只肤色苍白、步履蹒跚的白尾鹿，黑色黏液的溪流顺着它的脖子流下来。它的四肢扭动弯曲成奇怪而随意的模样，但充满了非自然的力量和速度。多亏了大灾变，它现在扭转了"
"局面；曾经的猎物，现在自己甚至能够猎杀郊狼、狼和巨型变异蜘蛛。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie reindeer"
msgid_plural "zombie reindeers"
msgstr[0] "丧尸驯鹿"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie reindeer"
msgid ""
"Once a majestic caribou, this undead creature barely resembles Santa's "
"helpful reindeer and seems to only be interested in human flesh."
msgstr "曾经是一只高贵强壮的驯鹿，被丧尸化后已经与圣诞老人的驯鹿大相径庭，只渴望着人类的血肉。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie>"
msgid "zombie"
msgid_plural "zombies"
msgstr[0] "殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie"
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying as it moves, an unstoppable rage visible in its oily "
"black eyes."
msgstr "一個人的軀體，搖搖晃晃的移動，從他黑色的眼睛看得出他無法阻擋的憤怒。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] "疤面殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scarred zombie"
msgid ""
"A deformed human body, its skin transformed into one thick, calloused "
"envelope of scar tissue."
msgstr "一个畸形丧尸，它的皮肤变成了一层厚厚的、带硬壳的疤痕组织。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie cop"
msgid_plural "zombie cops"
msgstr[0] "警察殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cop"
msgid "A human body covered by a weather-beaten and badly damaged set of police gear."
msgstr "一个曾经是警察的丧尸，身上披着经历了风吹雨打而受损严重的防暴装备，目光不再紧盯着昔日的罪犯，而是在搜索鲜活的肉体。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "crawling zombie"
msgid_plural "crawling zombies"
msgstr[0] "爬行殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crawling zombie"
msgid ""
"This human corpse drags itself along slowly with its arms.  Its legs are "
"damaged beyond repair."
msgstr "這具腿部已經殘破不堪的人形殭屍正用自己的手臂慢慢的爬著。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fat zombie"
msgid_plural "fat zombies"
msgstr[0] "肥胖疆屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fat zombie"
msgid ""
"Stumbling as it moves, this corpse of an overweight human regards its "
"surroundings with an empty black gaze."
msgstr "一個搖搖晃晃移動的肥胖屍體， 有著空洞的黑色眼睛。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "firefighter zombie"
msgid_plural "firefighter zombies"
msgstr[0] "消防員殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "firefighter zombie"
msgid ""
"A decaying human body clad in tattered firefighting gear.  It staggers "
"aimlessly, reeking of smoke and decay.  Its protective mask prevents it from "
"attempting to bite you."
msgstr "一具穿着破烂消防装备的腐败人体，漫无目的地蹒跚着，散发着毒瘴与腐烂的气息。它戴着的防护面具让它没法试图咬你。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hazmat zombie"
msgid_plural "hazmat zombies"
msgstr[0] "防護衣殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hazmat zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie is completely encased in a protective suit that apparently failed "
"to protect it from whatever this infection is.  At least it can't bite you "
"from inside that suit."
msgstr "这只丧尸被完全包裹在防护服中，显然这无法保护它免受感染。至少它没法从防护服里面咬你。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "hazmat zombie"
msgid "a tear in its hazmat suit"
msgstr "防化服上的裂痕"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "decayed zombie"
msgid_plural "decayed zombies"
msgstr[0] "腐爛殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "decayed zombie"
msgid ""
"A once-dead human corpse.  Its discolored, swollen flesh is riddled with "
"festering wounds and open sores."
msgstr "一具曾经死去的人类尸体。它褪色的浮肿肉体布满了溃烂的伤口与醒目的脓疮。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "SWAT zombie"
msgid_plural "SWAT zombies"
msgstr[0] "特警殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "SWAT zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie was part of a specialized unit of law enforcement.  It still "
"wears a battered armor with the SWAT logo emblazoned on the front.  The "
"protective mask makes its head a difficult target, but also prevents it from "
"biting you."
msgstr "这只丧尸曾经是一个特别执法行动部门的成员。它仍然穿着一件破旧的护甲，上面印有SWAT特警的标志。防护面具使它的头部成为难以攻击的目标，但也能防止它咬你。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tough zombie"
msgid_plural "tough zombies"
msgstr[0] "強壯殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tough zombie"
msgid ""
"This was once an athletic human, now a brutal monster.  Its facial features "
"are twisted into an expression of pure rage."
msgstr "这只丧尸曾经是一名运动员，如今成为了凶残的丧尸怪物。它面孔扭曲，每一个毛孔都释放出纯粹的破坏欲望。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sleek zombie"
msgid_plural "sleek zombies"
msgstr[0] "時髦殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sleek zombie"
msgid "This zombie is rather sleek and scantily clothed."
msgstr "这只丧尸非常时髦并且衣着暴露。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bouncer zombie"
msgid_plural "bouncer zombies"
msgstr[0] "保鑣殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bouncer zombie"
msgid ""
"This muscular zombie is dressed in the tattered remnants of a security "
"uniform."
msgstr "这只强壮的丧尸身上穿着残留的破烂保安制服。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie medic"
msgid_plural "zombie medics"
msgstr[0] "醫生殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie medic"
msgid ""
"This shambling corpse is dressed like a medical professional.  It was either "
"a doctor, or only played one on TV."
msgstr "这具蹒跚而行的尸体穿着得像个医学专家。要么它曾经真的是医生，要么就是它在电视上演过一个。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "medical horror"
msgid_plural "medical horrors"
msgstr[0] "醫生殭屍獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "medical horror"
msgid ""
"A former doctor of some sort, though its uniform has been torn apart.  You "
"assume the oversized muscles that cover it to be the culprit."
msgstr "或许它曾经是某种医生，但它的制服已经被身上硕大的肌肉撕碎了。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "regenerating zombie medic"
msgid_plural "regenerating zombie medics"
msgstr[0] "再生丧尸医生"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "regenerating zombie medic"
msgid ""
"The zombified remains of a practitioner of medicine, you aren't certain what "
"field - your focus is instead drawn to the way that its pink flesh snakes all "
"over it, weaving its way over wounds and injuries."
msgstr "一个分不清是哪个领域的医学工作者遗体，显然已经丧尸化了。你注意到，粉红的血肉正盘布在它的伤口和残躯上，四处蔓延。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sawbones"
msgid_plural "sawbones"
msgstr[0] "鉅骨殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sawbones"
msgid ""
"A malformed armor of misshapen bone has grown over this zombie, having pushed "
"what remains of the skin out of the way.  The clothes of a medical worker are "
"still draped over it."
msgstr "这只丧尸身上长出了一副畸形的骨头盔甲，已经把剩下的皮肤推开了。上面仍然披着一套医务工作者的衣服。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "doctor burns"
msgid_plural "doctor burns"
msgstr[0] "酸液醫生殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-medical.json
#. ~ Description of monster "doctor burns"
msgid ""
"This is the body of a doctor or nurse of some kind.  It's hard to tell now "
"that most of its clothing has corroded away from whatever vile acid its "
"secreting."
msgstr "一具医生或护士的尸体，具体是哪种，看不出来。它的大部分衣服已经被分泌出的恶心酸液腐蚀掉了。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pupating zombie crawler"
msgid_plural "pupating zombie crawlers"
msgstr[0] "蟲蛹爬行殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pupating zombie crawler"
msgid ""
"This half of a human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover "
"everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange "
"rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "这半具人类尸体自脖子以下的一切都被一种黑色粘稠的纤维包裹着。在其下方有什么东西正在有规律的不停搏动，看上去十分怪异。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_zombie_crawler_pupa"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_zombie_pupa"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_brute_pupa"
#, c-format
msgid "%s bursts, and gore-smeared winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr "%s的身体爆开，许多血迹斑斑的带翼怪兽从尸体中爬了出来！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pupating zombie"
msgid_plural "pupating zombies"
msgstr[0] "蟲蛹殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pupating zombie"
msgid ""
"This human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover everything "
"from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic "
"movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "這具人類屍體被黏稠的黑色纖維包裹著，覆蓋著從脖子以下的所有東西。最下面有一種奇怪的律動，看起來很怪誕。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pupating brute"
msgid_plural "pupating brutes"
msgstr[0] "蟲蛹殭屍獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pupating brute"
msgid ""
"This muscular human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover "
"everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange "
"rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "这具肌肉肿胀的人类尸体自脖子以下的一切都被一种黑色粘稠的纤维包裹着。在其下方有什么东西正在有规律的不停搏动，看上去十分怪异。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hive hulk"
msgid_plural "hive hulks"
msgstr[0] "蜂巢浩克"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hive hulk"
msgid ""
"The bloated torso of this gigantic corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers.  "
"Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to "
"behold."
msgstr "这具巨大的肌肉肿胀的人类尸体被一种黑色粘稠的纤维包裹着。在其下方有什么东西正在有规律的不停搏动，看上去十分怪异。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_hulk_pupa"
#, c-format
msgid "%s opens its mouth, and a gore-smeared winged beast flies out of it!"
msgstr "%s张开巨口，一只血迹斑斑的带翼怪兽从中爬了出来！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shady pupating zombie"
msgid_plural "shady pupating zombies"
msgstr[0] "黑影蟲蛹殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shady pupating zombie"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"what once may have been a human being, but its edges bulge rhythmically in "
"places that are not anatomically possible for humans."
msgstr "一種神秘的陰影籠罩著這個生物。你可以辨認出曾經可能是人類的輪廓，但它的邊緣在人體解剖學上不該有的地方有規律地凸起。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-pupating.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_zombie_pupa_shady"
#, c-format
msgid "%s bursts, and shadowy winged beasts climb out of the corpse!"
msgstr "%s的身体爆开，许多暗色的带翼怪兽从尸体中爬了出来！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "batwing zombie"
msgid_plural "batwing zombies"
msgstr[0] "蝙蝠翼殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "batwing zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's arms have stretched far beyond human limits, the skin "
"lengthened into a gruesome, fleshy membrane.  The mutation does not suit it "
"well: it moves clumsily, even compared to other zombies, but can occasionally "
"leap a significant distance."
msgstr "這隻殭屍的手臂已經遠遠超越了人類的極限，皮膚拉長成一層可怕的肉質薄膜。這種突變不太適合它：即使與其他殭屍相比，它的移動也很笨拙，但偶爾可以跳躍很長的距離。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "garghoul"
msgid_plural "garghouls"
msgstr[0] "石像鬼殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "garghoul"
msgid ""
"This zombie's arms have stretched far beyond human limits, the skin "
"lengthened into a gruesome, fleshy membrane.  The rest has become emaciated, "
"with thin, rope-like muscles ripping through taut flesh.  While it doesn't "
"appear to be able to fly, it uses its mutated arms to make shockingly fast "
"leaps through the air."
msgstr ""
"這隻殭屍的手臂已經遠遠超越了人類的極限，皮膚拉長成一層可怕的肉質薄膜。其餘的身體已變得孱弱，瘦弱的繩索狀肌肉撕裂了繃緊的肌肉。雖然它似乎無法飛行，但它利用變"
"異的手臂在空中進行驚人的快速跳躍。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flesh-raptor"
msgid_plural "flesh-raptors"
msgstr[0] "血鷲"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flesh-raptor"
msgid ""
"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three thinly-haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out "
"from the point where the wings meet.  It looks like nothing you've seen on "
"Earth, and yet strangely like it is made of human parts."
msgstr ""
"這種小型的、有翅膀的掠食者用三片薄毛的翅膀在空中飛翔，這些翅膀看起來就像人類伸展的雙手。一根鋸齒狀的尖刺從翅膀的交會處伸出。它看起來不像你在地球上見過的任何"
"東西，但奇怪的是它像是由人體部件製成的。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadow raptor"
msgid_plural "shadow raptors"
msgstr[0] "暗影血鷲"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadow raptor"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"three flapping wings connected to a jagged, pointed object."
msgstr "一種神秘的陰影籠罩著這個生物。你可以辨認出三個扇動的翅膀的輪廓，這些翅膀連接到一個鋸齒狀的尖頭物體上。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgid_plural "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgstr[0] "不穩定的血鷲"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgid ""
"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three thinly-haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  A jagged spike juts out from the "
"point where the wings meet, and a bloated, fleshy belly hangs beneath.  A "
"sharp smell of rotten eggs hangs around it."
msgstr ""
"这种长着翅膀小型猛兽在空中飞来飞去，它的三对翅膀上长着稀疏的毛发，看起来就像被拉长的人手。在翅膀会合的地方长出了一根锯齿状的尖刺，下方吊着臃肿多肉的肚子。一"
"股刺鼻的臭鸡蛋味笼罩着它。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zaptor"
msgid_plural "zaptors"
msgstr[0] "雷鷲"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zaptor"
msgid ""
"This small, winged predator darts through the air on three thinly-haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  A jagged spike with a pulsing "
"electrical glow juts out from the point where the wings meet."
msgstr "这种长着翅膀小型猛兽在空中飞来飞去，它的三对翅膀上长着稀疏的毛发，看起来就像被拉长的人手。在翅膀会合的地方长出了一根不断冒出电火花的锯齿状的尖刺。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "酸液殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie"
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking zombie.  Its skin looks especially thin, with a sticky, "
"yellow fluid flowing through the clearly visible veins."
msgstr "一具滿臉病容的殭屍。它的皮膚看起來特別薄， 清晰可見的靜脈裡頭流淌著粘性黃色液體。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "corrosive zombie"
msgid_plural "corrosive zombies"
msgstr[0] "腐蝕殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "corrosive zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie has swollen to immense proportions, but still manages to hold "
"itself together with semi-congealed acid all over its bloated, leathery body. "
" It moves clumsily, but spits from a large reserve of acid with uncanny "
"accuracy."
msgstr "一只全身大部分都浮肿的丧尸，但是在他臃肿的身体里由于一些半凝固的胶体酸液，仍然能够保持着大概的轮廓。它移动十分笨拙，但将体内储备的大量强酸吐出，精确得出奇。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "corrosive zombie"
msgid "The corrosive zombie spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr "腐蝕殭屍吐出了一坨酸液球！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spitter zombie"
msgid_plural "spitter zombies"
msgstr[0] "噴吐殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spitter zombie"
msgid ""
"A hunched human body with its eyes pushed up into its forehead and drooping "
"cheeks, most of its face is occupied by a puckered mouth.  Its stomach is "
"swollen and nearly translucent, with a sickly yellow tint."
msgstr "這個殭屍的整張臉幾乎被退化成了噴管狀的嘴巴所盤據， 他的腹部腫脹並呈現半透明， 流動著濃稠的黃色液體。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wretched puker"
msgid_plural "wretched pukers"
msgstr[0] "可怕嘔吐者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wretched puker"
msgid ""
"A degenerate corpse, shambling as it walks.  Various pieces of trash and "
"waste materials have melded into the black goo leaking from its skin."
msgstr "一具蹒跚移动的腐化尸体。各种各样的垃圾和废料已经融化成从皮肤上不断渗出的黑色黏液。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombie dog"
msgid_plural "acidic zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] "酸液殭屍狗"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie dog"
msgid ""
"A deformed, sickly-looking animated corpse of a canine.  A dangerous-looking "
"yellow saliva drips from its mouth."
msgstr "残缺扭曲、不堪入目的犬类活尸。怵目惊心的黄涎从其嘴中滴落。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "blistered horror"
msgid_plural "blistered horrors"
msgstr[0] "膿胞恐獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#. ~ Description of monster "blistered horror"
msgid ""
"A huge canine with multiple large, foul-looking blisters covering its body.  "
"A corrosive liquid spills from its menacing-looking mouth."
msgstr "身上覆盖多处恶臭脓疱的巨犬。腐蚀性液体从其狰狞的口中溢出。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiny meat cocoon"
msgid_plural "tiny meat cocoons"
msgstr[0] "微型肉茧"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiny meat cocoon"
msgid ""
"A small, wet sack of pink skin, with something dog-sized moving around "
"underneath the surface.  Black roots anchor it to the ground."
msgstr "一个由粉红色皮肤组成的潮湿小袋子，表面下有狗大小的东西在蠕动。黑色的树根状结构将它固定在地面上。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "tiny meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "small meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "large meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "gigantic meat cocoon"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explodes in a shower of gore!"
msgstr "%s在一片血雨中爆炸了！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "small meat cocoon"
msgid_plural "small meat cocoons"
msgstr[0] "小型肉茧"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "small meat cocoon"
msgid ""
"A sack of pink flesh sitting in the middle of a net of black roots.  At "
"irregular intervals it shudders as something (or multiple somethings?) inside "
"changes position.  You're not sure you want to know what's inside."
msgstr "一个粉红色的肉袋子固定在黑色根状物间，随着里面的东西（或多个东西）改变位置，它不定期地颤抖着。你不确定你是否想知道里面有什么。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "large meat cocoon"
msgid_plural "large meat cocoons"
msgstr[0] "大型肉茧"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "large meat cocoon"
msgid ""
"A mass of pink flesh the size of a fridge squirming constantly, black veins "
"anchoring it to the ground.  Occasionally a malformed limb pushes against the "
"skin from the inside, before a churn of the cocoon pushes it back.  Not ready "
"yet, it seems."
msgstr "一团冰箱大小的粉红色血肉不断蠕动着，黑色的血管将它固定在地面上。偶尔有一个畸形的肢体向外推动皮肤，然后被茧的搅动推回去。似乎还没有准备好。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gigantic meat cocoon"
msgid_plural "gigantic meat cocoons"
msgstr[0] "巨型肉茧"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gigantic meat cocoon"
msgid ""
"A rigid, off-white lump of flesh the size of a small car constricted by bands "
"of rope-sized pulsing black veins that tie it to the floor below.  The whole "
"thing is shuddering constantly, and gives off an otherworldly stench."
msgstr "一个僵硬的米白色肉块，有一辆小汽车那么大，被绳索大小的黑色血管束缚着，把它固定在下面的地板上。整个肉茧在不断地颤抖，并散发出一种另类的臭味。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "swarming amalgamation"
msgid_plural "swarming amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "迷你融合怪"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "swarming amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A small, flat creature dashing around erratically on seven short legs.  Its "
"form is dominated by an oversized set of black mandibles on an almost "
"comically small head, featureless apart from a single black eye.  The rest of "
"the body is covered with sickly white skin crisscrossed by black veins."
msgstr ""
"一只体型扁平的小生物正用七条短腿慌乱地窜动。它滑稽的小脑袋上长着不成比例的黑色巨颚，除了一只漆黑的独眼外再无其他器官。惨白的皮肤覆盖着其余躯体，表面布满纵横"
"交错的黑色血管脉络。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "vigilant amalgamation"
msgid_plural "vigilant amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "警戒融合怪"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "vigilant amalgamation"
msgid ""
"An inflated white body carried by five dainty legs, waving its remaining two "
"limbs constantly.  Each one is tipped by a head-sized compound eye, "
"independently scanning the horizon for prey."
msgstr "一个肿胀的白色身体，由五条细小的腿支撑，不断挥舞着剩下的两条腿。每条腿的顶端都有一只和头一样大的复眼，各自不断扫描着地平线，寻找猎物。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "vigilant amalgamation"
msgid "The amalgamation screams!"
msgstr "融合怪发出了尖叫声！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "caustic amalgamation"
msgid_plural "caustic amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "强酸融合怪"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "caustic amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A gangly creature running on six legs, its form made irregular by the green "
"pustules at the limbs' base, each feeding into a large vein leading to two "
"blackened claws.  What must have been a seventh leg fused with the creature's "
"head forming a jagged proboscis emerging from below its eyes, dripping a "
"caustic liquid."
msgstr ""
"一只用六条腿奔跑的奇怪生物，它的形状因四肢根部的绿色脓包变得不规则，每个脓包都通往一条大血管，通向两个发黑的爪子。第七条腿和它的头融合在一起，形成一个锯齿状"
"的颚，从眼睛下面冒出来，滴下一种腐蚀性的液体。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leaping amalgamation"
msgid_plural "leaping amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "跳跃融合怪"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leaping amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A four-legged white creature about the size of a human, running with a "
"decidedly feline gait, the three remaining limbs holding an "
"almost-translucent skin membrane outstretched on its side and rear.  Much of "
"its head is taken up by a beak like a raven's, which opens to reveal a set of "
"jagged black teeth."
msgstr ""
"一只四条腿的白色生物，大小和人差不多，以一种明显的猫科动物步态奔跑，剩下的三条肢体在侧面和后面撑起一层几乎透明的皮膜。它的头部大部分被一个像乌鸦一样的喙占据"
"，张开后露出一组锯齿状的黑牙。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "charged amalgamation"
msgid_plural "charged amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "放电融合怪"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "charged amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A short, crablike creature waddling around on six multi-jointed legs, its "
"body dominated by a large glowing organ bulging from between the white armor "
"plates.  A single raised appendage connects to the mass, its tip surrounded "
"by brilliant white sparks."
msgstr ""
"一只螃蟹形状的矮小生物，用六条多关节的腿蹒跚而行，它的身体被一个巨大的发光器官占据，从白色的甲壳板之间鼓起。一个凸起的附着物与这团东西相连，其顶端被灿烂的白"
"色火花包围。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#, c-format
msgid "A cloud of electricity explodes from the %s"
msgstr "一团电弧云从%s的身体上爆发开来！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brutish amalgamation"
msgid_plural "brutish amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "狂暴融合怪"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brutish amalgamation"
msgid ""
"A large, thickly armored creature built not unlike a bear, if a bear had a "
"long, clubbed tail and two short limbs ending in black talons framing a "
"vertical mouth on an otherwise smooth, featureless head.  On second thought, "
"not that much like a bear at all."
msgstr ""
"一只带有厚重装甲的巨大生物，长得和熊差别不是很大——如果熊有大木棒一样的尾巴，上面还长着两条短肢，末端是黑色的爪子，另一端有张垂直的嘴，光滑到看不出来是头的"
"话。转念一想，这根本就不像熊。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie frog"
msgid_plural "zombie frogs"
msgstr[0] "丧尸青蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie frog"
msgid ""
"A hypothetical frog of the zombie variety.  You should not be seeing it "
"without debug."
msgstr "虚拟丧尸青蛙模板。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "frog mother"
msgid_plural "frog mothers"
msgstr[0] "青蛙之母"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "frog mother"
msgid ""
"A large, bulbous creature with an extremely large mouth and small, stubby "
"legs with no feet.  Drenched in an oily greenish-black substance, its flesh "
"seems to rapidly decompose and reconstitute itself, and it is covered in "
"large, white pustules that seem ready to pop."
msgstr ""
"一只体型巨大的浑圆怪物，嘴巴张得非常大，腿又小又短，几乎看不见它的脚。它浑身覆盖着一层油乎乎黑绿色物质，血肉似乎会迅速分解和自我重建，而且身上长着无数巨大的"
"白色脓疱，似乎随时会破裂。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "frog mother"
msgid ""
"Some of the pustules pop, and the frog mother opens her mouth and vomits "
"tadpoles!"
msgstr "有些脓疱爆裂了，蛙母张开了大嘴吐出了一些蝌蚪！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tadpole constrictor"
msgid_plural "tadpole constrictors"
msgstr[0] "蝌蚪蟒"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole constrictor"
msgid ""
"The only resemblance this creature bears to a tadpole is its slick "
"black-green skin and slender body.  Its three appendages, resembling long "
"tentacles or pseudopods, propel it across the ground at maddening speed.  It "
"has no outward sensory organs or a mouth, and steam rises from its skin as if "
"it is burning away its own lifeforce to catch you."
msgstr ""
"这种生物和蝌蚪的唯一相似之处是它光滑的黑绿色皮肤和细长的身体。它身上所长着的三条附肢，像是长长的触手或是假足一般，以令人发狂的速度推动它穿过地面。它没有任何"
"外在的感官或嘴，但有股蒸汽从它皮肤上冒出，仿佛它正在燃烧自己的生命来抓住你一般。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant zombie bullfrog"
msgid_plural "giant zombie bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] "巨型丧尸牛蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant zombie bullfrog"
msgid ""
"The wound covered skin of this large bullfrog appears to be peeling in "
"places, revealing a black goop beneath the surface.  Its vacant stare passes "
"by anything that isn't food, and it will leap to devour anything it can."
msgstr "這隻大牛蛙身上覆蓋著的皮膚似乎正從傷口上剝落，露出了底下的黑色黏液。他空洞的目光掃過任何不是食物的東西，準備好跳起並吞噬任何食物。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "colossal zombie bullfrog"
msgid_plural "colossal zombie bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] "超巨型丧尸牛蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "colossal zombie bullfrog"
msgid ""
"This gigantic zombified frog lets out an ear splitting unholy wail as it "
"slowly takes notice of you.  Its mostly lethargic movements are offset by its "
"ability to leap great distances using its gargantuan stout legs."
msgstr "这只巨大的丧尸青蛙慢慢注意到你，随后会发出一声震耳欲聋的邪恶哀号。它的大部分缓慢慵懒的动作被巨大而粗壮的双腿的远距离跳跃能力所抵消。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie toad"
msgid_plural "zombie toads"
msgstr[0] "丧尸蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie toad"
msgid ""
"The revivified remains of a giant mutant toad.  Its condition has left it "
"slowed but no less dangerous."
msgstr "一只复活的巨型变异蟾蜍尸体。它的身体状况使其速度减慢，但危险性却丝毫不减。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zapping zombfrog"
msgid_plural "zapping zombfrogs"
msgstr[0] "电击丧尸蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zapping zombfrog"
msgid ""
"The hum coming from this giant, rotten frog sounds unlike any kind of "
"vocalization.  The sound is clearly a result of the bolts of electricity that "
"skip across its skin and arc between its lips."
msgstr "这只巨大的腐烂青蛙发出的嗡嗡声听起来不同于任何一种发声方式。这声音显然是电流穿过它的皮肤并在它的嘴唇之间划出电弧而产生的。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bloated zombie toad"
msgid_plural "bloated zombie toads"
msgstr[0] "bloated zombie toads"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloated zombie toad"
msgid ""
"This zombified toad wobbles as it drags along its immense, inflated form.  A "
"yellow-brown sludge dribbles from its mouth and seeps out from its bulging, "
"cracking skin."
msgstr "这只丧尸蟾蜍拖着巨大、鼓胀的身体蹒跚而行。黄棕色的淤泥从它的嘴里滴下来，并从它鼓起、开裂的皮肤中渗出。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "bloated zombie toad"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body bursts, expelling sludge."
msgstr "%s 的身体爆炸开来，释放出污泥。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie treefrog"
msgid_plural "zombie treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "丧尸树蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie treefrog"
msgid ""
"The pale, empty eyes of this large, reanimated treefrog still swivel in their "
"sockets, searching for prey.  Its steps are ungainly but its hind legs look "
"capable of great leaps."
msgstr "这只复活的大树蛙苍白、空洞的眼睛仍然在眼窝里转动，四处寻找猎物。它的步伐笨拙，但后腿看起来能够跳出很远。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadow leaper"
msgid_plural "shadow leapers"
msgstr[0] "暗影跳跃者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadow leaper"
msgid ""
"A lithe and leggy form rests flat against the ground, wreathed in darkness.  "
"When it leaps, the shadows follow with it."
msgstr "一个柔软而长腿的身影平躺在地上，笼罩在黑暗中。当它跳跃时，阴影也随之跟随。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "warted monstrosity"
msgid_plural "warted monstrosities"
msgstr[0] "长疣怪形"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "warted monstrosity"
msgid ""
"A festering toad the size of a dune buggy.  It struggles to pull its bulk "
"towards you.  The warts covering its back appear fit to burst with yellow "
"sludge, and more of the stuff flows freely from both ends of it."
msgstr "一只溃烂的蟾蜍，大小如沙丘怪兽车。它挣扎着把躯体拉向你。 覆盖在它背部的疣似乎会爆裂出黄色的淤泥，而且更多类似的东西从前后两端自由地流出。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "warted monstrosity"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body bursts, expelling a copious amount of sludge."
msgstr "%s 的身体爆炸开来，释放出大量污泥。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "death mask zombie toad"
msgid_plural "death mask zombie toads"
msgstr[0] "死面丧尸蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "death mask zombie toad"
msgid ""
"The face and head of this enormous once-frog is encased in ossified tissue.  "
"Its dead eyes peer out from this death mask of hardened bone, which curves "
"into a jagged beak around its mouth.  Even its warts appear to have stiffened "
"into dense osteoderms."
msgstr ""
"这只巨型青蛙的脸和头被骨化的组织包裹着。它死气沉沉的眼睛从坚硬的骨头制成的死亡面具中伸出头来，面具在嘴部四周弯曲成锯齿状的喙。就连它的疣似乎也凝聚成了致密的"
"骨皮。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leaping husk"
msgid_plural "leaping husks"
msgstr[0] "跳跃蛙壳"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leaping husk"
msgid ""
"The dehydrated remains of a frog, like the unfortunate sort you might find "
"trapped between a window and screen.  This one is much larger than those and "
"surely capable of doing you real harm.  You see its dry skin crack and shed "
"wisps of tainted dust as it moves."
msgstr ""
"青蛙脫水後的殘骸，就像你可能會發現被困在窗戶和紗窗之間的那種不幸的青蛙。這隻比那些大得多，絕對有可能傷到你。你可以看到它乾燥的皮膚裂開，並在移動時掉下一縷一"
"縷的灰塵。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "leaping husk"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "leaping husk"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "batrachian mummy"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "batrachian smoker"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s crumbles!"
msgstr "The %s crumbles!"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "batrachian mummy"
msgid_plural "batrachian mummies"
msgstr[0] "木乃伊蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "batrachian mummy"
msgid ""
"The ambulatory, desiccated corpse of an enormous amphibian.  What papery skin "
"remains hugs tightly to the bones and shrunken flesh beneath.  Each "
"stuttering leap it makes leaves it looking worse off as it sheds clouds of "
"ash and soot."
msgstr "这是一具两栖动物的干尸。 残存的纸质皮肤紧紧包裹着下面的骨头和萎缩的肉体。 它每一次踉跄的跳跃都会让它看起来更加狼狈，灰烬和烟尘越积越多。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "batrachian smoker"
msgid_plural "batrachian smokers"
msgstr[0] "发烟蛙蛙"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "batrachian smoker"
msgid ""
"Even without the haze of smoke that constantly fumes off of it, it would be "
"difficult to tell what this once was.  The massive thing seems to have dried "
"out and shriveled up, though unevenly.  Rind through core it has warped.  Its "
"whole dry body crinkles and folds as it moves."
msgstr ""
"即便没有那层不断冒出的烟幕，也难以辨认这具生物原本的形态。这具庞然大物似乎已经干瘪萎缩，但萎缩得并不均匀。从表皮到内部都发生了扭曲异变。它整个干瘪的身躯会随"
"着移动而褶皱凹曲。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gastro bufo"
msgid_plural "gastro bufos"
msgstr[0] "强酸蟾蜍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gastro bufo"
msgid ""
"A massive toad stumbling around while leaking acid from its skin.  Doesn't "
"look friendly at all."
msgstr "一只巨大的蟾蜍蹒跚而行，同时从皮肤中不断朝外滴出酸液。看起来一点也不友好。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched zombie child"
msgid_plural "scorched zombie children"
msgstr[0] "烧焦儿童丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched zombie child"
msgid ""
"A diminutive humanoid figure, its body ravaged by fire into a blackened, "
"charred shell.  Its leathery flesh has mended in patches, and the tattered "
"clothing is still clinging to its emaciated frame making it clear it once was "
"- and still is - the body of a child."
msgstr "一个身材矮小的人形，它的身体被火烧成焦黑的外壳。它皮革般的血肉融合成团，破烂的衣服仍然粘在它瘦弱的身躯上，这表明它曾经是——而且仍然是——一个孩子的身体。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched zombie brute"
msgid_plural "scorched zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] "烧焦丧尸兽"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched zombie brute"
msgid ""
"An oversized charred human form.  The remains of its burnt and blackened "
"musculature are clearly visible between the cracks of the shell formed from "
"its melted skin."
msgstr "一个体型巨大的焦黑人形生物。在其融化的皮肤所形成的硬壳裂缝之间，可以清晰地看到它那被烧得焦黑的肌肉组织残骸。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched zombie"
msgid_plural "scorched zombies"
msgstr[0] "焦皮殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched zombie"
msgid ""
"A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery "
"flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armored appearance."
msgstr "一只严重灼烧的丧尸，仍散发着烤肉焦臭。其如今如皮革般的皮肉已结痂成块，形成近似装甲的外观。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched lasher"
msgid_plural "scorched lashers"
msgstr[0] "烧焦鞭笞者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched lasher"
msgid ""
"A heavily burned corpse with unnaturally long arms dragging behind it as it "
"moves.  The burnt scar tissue covering it gives it a mildly armored "
"appearance."
msgstr "一具严重烧焦的尸体，移动时会将长到不自然的双臂拖曳在身后。烧伤疤痕如轻甲般覆盖全身。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fiend"
msgid_plural "fiends"
msgstr[0] "惡魔"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fiend"
msgid ""
"A monstrous burnt vaguely humanoid creature, walking around on its knuckles "
"like a gorilla.  Tattered and blackened strands of muscle fibers dangle all "
"around its body, with patches of fused melded skin and bone visible between.  "
"Its forelimbs end in lengthy skeletal claws."
msgstr ""
"一个被烧得模糊不清的人形怪物，像大猩猩一样用指关节走来走去。 破烂发黑的肌肉纤维缠绕在它的身体周围，其间还能看到融合在一起的皮肤和骨头。 "
"它的前肢末端是长长的骷髅爪。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_zombie_scorched_rust"
msgid ""
"A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery "
"flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armored appearance.  This one "
"appears to have metal fragments sticking out of its body."
msgstr ""
"A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery "
"flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armored appearance.  This one "
"appears to have metal fragments sticking out of its body."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_burned.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_zombie_fiend_rust"
msgid ""
"An oversized charred human form.  The remains of its burnt and blackened "
"musculature are clearly visible between the cracks of the shell formed from "
"its melted skin.  This one appears to have metal fragments sticking out of "
"its body."
msgstr ""
"An oversized charred human form.  The remains of its burnt and blackened "
"musculature are clearly visible between the cracks of the shell formed from "
"its melted skin.  This one appears to have metal fragments sticking out of "
"its body."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie child"
msgid_plural "zombie children"
msgstr[0] "殭屍小孩"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie child"
msgid ""
"It was only a child, and little is different about it now aside from the "
"hungry look in its eyes.  You'd be hard-pressed to not feel like you were "
"killing an actual child by putting it down."
msgstr "它只是一个孩子，现在除了眼中的饥饿，外表没有什么不同了。你在杀死它时很难摆脱自己是在杀死一个真正的孩子的感觉。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "anklebiter"
msgid_plural "anklebiters"
msgstr[0] "腳踝啃咬者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "anklebiter"
msgid ""
"This horrifying little mutated wretch looks to have once been a child, but "
"its massive gaping jaws are now far more suggestive of a predatory beast."
msgstr "這個可怕的小型變種怪看起來像是小孩， 但是它的巨大下顎讓人覺得更像是掠食性野獸。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "creepy crawler"
msgid_plural "creepy crawlers"
msgstr[0] "恐怖爬行者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "creepy crawler"
msgid ""
"What was once a child is now a mutant beast with blackened skin and massive "
"eyes.  This abomination's vile form makes a mockery of its human origin."
msgstr "曾经是个小孩，但现在已经成了变异怪兽，有着发黑的表皮及巨大的眼睛。这可憎的邪恶生物就是对其人类起源的嘲弄。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shriekling"
msgid_plural "shrieklings"
msgstr[0] "小尖叫殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shriekling"
msgid ""
"This heavily mutated child zombie twitches and flails its limbs in "
"painful-looking spasms as it runs about."
msgstr "这个严重变异的儿童丧尸移动时四肢四处抽搐，看着如同痉挛疼痛一般。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "snotgobbler"
msgid_plural "snotgobblers"
msgstr[0] "鼻涕貪吃者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "snotgobbler"
msgid ""
"This swollen, gooey-looking mutant child looks bad, even for a zombie.  Maybe "
"that's why it seems to want a hug so badly."
msgstr "这孩子是一个肿肿的，粘稠的变异怪物。即使是按丧尸的标准，看起来也很糟糕。也许这就是为什么它似乎如此迫切地想要一个拥抱。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sproglodyte"
msgid_plural "sproglodytes"
msgstr[0] "夜行掠食童屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sproglodyte"
msgid ""
"This crouching child-mutant's face is dominated by a pair of huge black eyes, "
"and its fingertips end in sharp claws."
msgstr "这个蜷缩着的变异小孩的脸上长着一对巨大的黑眼睛，它的指尖末端有着锋利的爪子。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "howling waif"
msgid_plural "howling waifs"
msgstr[0] "嚎叫流浪兒"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "howling waif"
msgid ""
"Undeath has not been kind to the children of the apocalypse.  This one is "
"little more than a reanimated membrane of skin stretched across tiny brittle "
"bones."
msgstr "不死生物在大災變時並不會因為是小孩就心存仁慈。這個傢伙就像是一具伸出尖銳骨頭的小人皮囊。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wretched hatchery"
msgid_plural "wretched hatcheries"
msgstr[0] "邪恶孵化场"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wretched hatchery"
msgid ""
"Lethargically resting on its back, this hideous mass of sagging flesh and "
"writhing organs, which used to be a child, twitches feebly as its midsection "
"churns.  Almost bursting from its skin, the child's ribcage has arched "
"outward, forming a hive-like construct covered by severely stretched "
"epidermis.  Through the wretched organism's taut abdominal flesh, you witness "
"small forms swarming within its ribcage—its guts roiling as new beings are "
"sculpted from pilfered flesh and bone.  The creature's limbs rest haphazardly "
"on the ground, contorted in ways that suggest the absence of bones or any "
"interior construct."
msgstr ""
"这团可怕的下垂着的肉和扭动的器官曾经是一个孩子，当它的腹部翻腾时它会虚弱地抽搐。孩子的胸腔几乎从皮肤上裂开，向外拱起形成一个蜂巢状的结构，表皮严重拉伸。通过"
"这只可怜的生物紧绷的腹部肌肉你可以看到小动物在它的胸腔里蜂拥而至——当新的生物从被偷走的肉和骨头中雕刻出来时，它的内脏在翻滚。这种生物的四肢随意地躺在地上，"
"扭曲的方式表明没有骨头或任何内部结构。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_children.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "wretched hatchery"
msgid "Ripping and tearing, a small beast burrows free of the wretch's abdomen!"
msgstr "伴随着撕裂和哀嚎，这个小可怜虫的腹部里钻出了一只小型怪兽！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal master"
msgid_plural "skeletal masters"
msgstr[0] "骸骨主宰"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal master"
msgid ""
"A strange zombie covered in bone plates from face to toe.  Despite the added "
"weight on its body, its movements are coordinated, almost as if capable of "
"analyzing your movements."
msgstr "一个从头到脚被骨板覆盖的奇怪丧尸。尽管骨板让它的身体变得更加沉重，但它的动作是协调的，好像可以分析你的动作一样。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie lich"
msgid_plural "zombie liches"
msgstr[0] "丧尸巫妖"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_command.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie lich"
msgid ""
"A twisted visage of the human body decked in bone from head to toe.  Its "
"vague shape is reminiscent of some tabletop monster, and it walks and watches "
"your actions with a cold and calculating demeanor."
msgstr "一具从头到脚都被骨头覆盖的扭曲的人体。它模糊的形状让人联想到一些桌游里的怪物，它冷酷而精明地行动着，同时一边在观察你的行为。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#. ~ Name of a trap
msgid "dormant zombie corpse"
msgstr "休眠的丧尸尸体"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#. ~ Message when player triggers trap "tr_dormant_corpse"
#. ~ Message when NPC triggers trap "tr_dormant_corpse"
msgid "A zombie rises from the ground!"
msgstr "一只丧尸从地底爬了出来！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "cause_loud_moaning ( cause loud moaning )"
msgid "a zombie moaning!"
msgstr "一只丧尸正在呻吟！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shocker brute"
msgid_plural "shocker brutes"
msgstr[0] "電擊獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shocker brute"
msgid ""
"A huge beast covered in visible scarring from the lightning bolts that arc "
"out of its body.  Being near it, you can hear a slight humming, like that of "
"an electrical transformer."
msgstr "一个覆盖着疤痕的巨型丧尸，那些疤痕来自其体内闪电激发出来的电弧。当靠近它的时候，你可以听到轻微而又低沉的嗡嗡声，像是工作中的交流电变压器一样。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shocker zombie"
msgid_plural "shocker zombies"
msgstr[0] "電擊殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shocker zombie"
msgid "A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy."
msgstr "這個殭屍的肉體是藍色的， 並且發出劈哩啪啦的電流聲。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "incandescent husk"
msgid_plural "incandescent husks"
msgstr[0] "白熾體"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Description of monster "incandescent husk"
msgid ""
"This zombie is visible only as a glowing white silhouette that you have to "
"squint to see, cloaked in a crackling field of lightning that pulses like a "
"beating heart.  It walks slowly and deliberately, the thunderstorm "
"surrounding it eagerly jumping to anything conductive within its grasp."
msgstr "這個殭屍在你的眼中呈現一個發光的白色輪廓，包覆著一個跳動的電場，牠很慢和從容地行走，周圍的電場會立即擊中至任何在範圍內能傳導的東西。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zapper zombie"
msgid_plural "zapper zombies"
msgstr[0] "電流殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_electric.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zapper zombie"
msgid ""
"A very pale dead body with the worst case of static hair you have ever seen.  "
"Sparks of electricity frequently jump off it, lighting it up in the dark.  "
"You might not want to touch it with your bare hands, or anything conductive."
msgstr "一具非常苍白的尸体，长着你所见过的最糟糕的带电头发。电火花偶尔从它身上射出来，在黑暗中点亮它。你也许不该徒手或是用任何导电的物体触摸它。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "boomer"
msgid_plural "boomers"
msgstr[0] "嘔吐者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "boomer"
msgid ""
"A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief and layered in rolls of fat.  It "
"emits a horrible odor, and a putrid pink sludge dribbles from its mouth."
msgstr "脂肪臃腫下垂的肥胖殭屍。散發出可怕的腐爛氣味， 粉紅色的粘液從它的嘴滴下。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "huge boomer"
msgid_plural "huge boomers"
msgstr[0] "巨大嘔吐者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "huge boomer"
msgid ""
"This boomer, normally swollen and ready to burst, has strengthened and "
"solidified.  The bile dribbling from its mouth also appears to have changed…"
msgstr "這個隨時會爆裂的嘔吐者同樣腫脹，但變得更強壯更堅硬。從它口中滴落的膽汁似乎也不同了…"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "huge boomer"
#, c-format
msgid "A %s explodes!"
msgstr "%s爆炸了！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bloated zombie"
msgid_plural "bloated zombies"
msgstr[0] "浮腫殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloated zombie"
msgid ""
"With its gray skin swollen to near-rupture with putrid gas, this cyst-covered "
"zombie looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of "
"disturbances."
msgstr "這隻殭屍身上布滿了膿包， 他蒼白的肌膚之下就快要被體內腐敗的氣體撐破， 就算是極其輕微的打擊都能讓他爆炸。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sleepwalker zombie"
msgid_plural "sleepwalker zombies"
msgstr[0] "夢游殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sleepwalker zombie"
msgid ""
"A zombie swollen with a bluish, oddly sweet smelling gas.  It stumbles around "
"even more than regular zombies, as if heavily intoxicated."
msgstr "这只丧尸的肚子被某种蓝色的、奇怪的甜味气体撑得鼓鼓胀胀的。它走起路来比普通丧尸更加跌跌撞撞，仿佛喝醉了一般。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "swollen tearjerker"
msgid_plural "swollen tearjerkers"
msgstr[0] "催泪丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "swollen tearjerker"
msgid ""
"A bloated corpse, its ballooning skin blistered and rashy and its face caked "
"in mucus.  The off-color orange gas that occasionally leaks from it makes "
"your eyes water and smells faintly of pepper."
msgstr "一具臃肿的尸体，它膨胀的皮肤起了很多水泡，泛着红晕，脸上结着黏液。偶尔从它身上漏出的异常橙色气体让你\"潸然泪下\"，还带有淡淡的胡椒味。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "boomer glutton"
msgid_plural "boomer gluttons"
msgstr[0] "暴食爆炸殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "boomer glutton"
msgid ""
"A large, grotesque ball of flesh and fat.  Seemingly vestigial limbs flop "
"around haphazardly as it rolls across the ground.  You occasionally catch a "
"glimpse of bulging eyes and a distended gaping maw oozing some sort of black "
"sludge."
msgstr "一个巨大而怪诞的血肉和脂肪组成的肉球。当它在地面上滚动时，看似残存的四肢随之肆意摇摆。你偶尔会瞥见一双鼓鼓的眼睛和一只张开的大嘴、从中不断渗出某种黑色淤泥。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "boomer glutton"
msgid "The glutton vomits sludge!"
msgstr "贪食爆汁丧尸吐出了一团淤泥！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bombardier boomer"
msgid_plural "bombardier boomers"
msgstr[0] "投彈爆炸殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bombardier boomer"
msgid ""
"This zombie's exposed ribcage is encircled by swollen lungs and other organs. "
" You would prefer to be far away when they burst."
msgstr "这只丧尸肿胀的肺脏和其他器官似乎快要从胸腔里爆出来了。当它们爆炸时，你最好躲得远远的。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_explosive.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "bombardier boomer"
msgid "A bombardier boomer explodes!"
msgstr "投彈爆炸殭屍爆炸了！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust zombie"
msgid_plural "rust zombies"
msgstr[0] "鐵鏽殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust zombie"
msgid ""
"A zombie impaled with a multitude of metal fragments, each covered with a "
"thick layer of rust that seems to propagate to other parts of its body.  You "
"can't remember the last time you got a tetanus shot, so it would be best not "
"to let this thing touch you."
msgstr ""
"这只丧尸浑身上下穿刺着无数覆盖着厚厚铁锈的金属碎片，碎片上的铁锈似乎已经扩散到了尸体的其他部位。你不记得上次注射破伤风疫苗是什么时候了，所以最好不要让它碰你"
"。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust shell zombie"
msgid_plural "rust shell zombies"
msgstr[0] "鏽殼殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust shell zombie"
msgid ""
"Jagged fragments of rust-bitten metal have fused into this zombie's flesh and "
"displaced parts of its spine."
msgstr "锈蚀的锯齿状金属破片融合进丧尸的血肉中并取代了部分脊椎。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust plated zombie"
msgid_plural "rust plated zombies"
msgstr[0] "鏽甲殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust plated zombie"
msgid ""
"Ruptures in this zombie's skin expose fragments of metal arranged like armor "
"underneath.  Black sludge can be seen in places where the rust has receded."
msgstr "丧尸皮肤破裂处露出的金属破片，如同交织于皮下的甲胄。在锈迹消退之处可以看到黑色的污泥。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust urchin"
msgid_plural "rust urchins"
msgstr[0] "鏽酸刺獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust urchin"
msgid ""
"A spiked horror of a zombie covered in long, rusty spikes.  A walking tetanus "
"infection waiting to happen."
msgstr "一只浑身长满锈刺的恐怖丧尸。一个等待发生的会行走的破伤风感染。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rust fist brute"
msgid_plural "rust fist brutes"
msgstr[0] "鏽拳殭屍獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_ferrous.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rust fist brute"
msgid ""
"This brute of a zombie is covered in rusted metal detritus.  Chunks of metal "
"smashed through its arms have deformed them into hammers."
msgstr "这只丧尸兽身上覆盖着生锈的金属破片。大块的金属砸穿了它的手臂，并融合成了锤子一样的形状。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "crawler"
msgid_plural "crawlers"
msgstr[0] "爬行怪"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crawler"
msgid ""
"A conglomeration of human parts fused together in a horrible mishmash of "
"function, slowly dragging its eldritch body across the ground."
msgstr "由許多人體組織交雜融合在一起的噁心形體， 緩慢的在地面拖行著他們的厚皮與猙獰的軀體。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dissoluted devourer"
msgid_plural "dissoluted devourers"
msgstr[0] "放蕩吞噬者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dissoluted devourer"
msgid ""
"Human bodies fused together into a colossus, with heads and limbs sticking "
"out of its bloated body.  The nature of the thing makes it difficult to "
"estimate how close it is to dying, and its capabilities might change if it "
"manages to assimilate more zombies into itself."
msgstr ""
"由人类躯体融合而成的巨型怪物，膨胀的身体上伸出好几个头颅和肢体。这种东西的性质使得我们很难估计它离死亡有多近，在它将更多的丧尸同化进体内后，它的能力可能会改"
"变。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "melded task force"
msgid_plural "melded task forces"
msgstr[0] "融合特遣隊"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "melded task force"
msgid ""
"A tangle of security personnel fused with their gear and with each other, "
"warped limbs and flesh-covered equipment moving in strange unison.  Every so "
"often you glimpse a pitch-black figure at its center, limbs mirroring the "
"movements of the larger mass."
msgstr ""
"一堆保安尸体与他们的装备相互融合，扭曲的四肢和覆盖着肉体的装备异曲同工地移动着。每隔一段时间，你就会看见一只漆黑的身影从它的体内钻出，四肢的移动方式和它更大"
"的主体一样。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "melded task force"
msgid ""
"The creature grows sluggish before freezing in place for a moment.  Suddenly "
"its flesh turns black and recedes to coat the central figure, which reaches "
"out towards you before collapsing into a pinprick of shimmering air.  Torn "
"uniforms and other gear tumble to the ground."
msgstr ""
"这只怪物动作逐渐迟缓，直到停在原地静止片刻。突然，它的血肉变黑并渐渐褪去，从中浮现出其体内的躯体，它向你伸出手来，然后突然塌陷成一团闪闪发光的空气。被撕碎的"
"制服和其他装备掉落在地上。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "melded task force"
msgid "A handful of flesh wriggles loose from the mass and takes flight!"
msgstr "几块血肉从主体中挣脱出来，然后飞起来了！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "trapped tendril"
msgid_plural "trapped tendrils"
msgstr[0] "困陷卷鬚"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "trapped tendril"
msgid ""
"A great tendril of mutated flesh and sharpened bone.  Emerging from a crevice "
"in the ruined floor, hundreds of human limbs seek freedom and writhe "
"incessantly from underneath its grotesque carapace.  As enormous as it may "
"be, you feel certain that this is just part of a much bigger creature, for "
"when it moves, you can feel this whole ruin tremble, as though an unseen "
"giant is struggling against the weight of its concrete tomb."
msgstr ""
"一只血肉和尖骨组成的巨型触手。它从破损的地面的一个缝隙中伸出，缝隙之下无数的人类残肢在怪异的甲壳下不停蠕动，希望重获自由。虽然这只触手已经无比巨大，你仍然确"
"信这只是一只更大生物的一部分，因为当触手移动时，你能感觉到整个废墟的震动，如同一只未知的巨人正在与它的混凝土坟墓抗争。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gangrenous flesh"
msgid_plural "gangrenous flesh"
msgstr[0] "壞疽血肉"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous flesh"
msgid ""
"Covered in grievous wounds, this wretch's gray skin has bloated to "
"near-rupture with putrid gas.  Between lumps of unrecognizable gore, a human "
"head lamely follows your movements with empty, black eyes."
msgstr "这个可怜虫的灰色皮肤上布满了严重的伤口，在腐败气体的压力下几乎就要爆炸。在不可辨认的血肉之中，一个人类头颅用空洞的黑色眼珠注视着你的行动。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gangrenous crawler"
msgid_plural "gangrenous crawlers"
msgstr[0] "壞疽爬行者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous crawler"
msgid ""
"A nightmarish, spidery abomination born from human gore.  It deftly crawls "
"between the walls and ceiling with limbs grown from its own disjointed ribs."
msgstr "一只噩梦般的蛛形怪物，由人类血肉变成。它敏捷地在墙壁和天花板上爬行，断离的肋骨构成了它的肢体。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gangrenous impaler"
msgid_plural "gangrenous impalers"
msgstr[0] "壞疽穿刺者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gangrenous impaler"
msgid ""
"A corpse hideously twisted into an insect-like form.  A hollow tendril "
"reaches out from its open thorax."
msgstr "这个尸体以骇人的方式扭曲，变成了昆虫一般的形状。从它的胸腔之中伸出了一只中空的触手。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "gangrenous impaler"
msgid "The impaler launches a barb!"
msgstr "坏疽穿刺者射出了一根毒刺！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "gangrenous impaler"
msgid "unch"
msgstr "unch"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scissorlimbs"
msgid_plural "scissorlimbs"
msgstr[0] "利剪血肉蛛"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scissorlimbs"
msgid ""
"A nightmarish spider of gore standing tall among the ruins, keeping silent "
"watch of the blighted landscape.  Its spindly limbs of bone slip between the "
"rubble with otherworldly speed."
msgstr "一团如同梦魇般的蜘蛛形状的血肉高高地矗立在废墟中，无声地守护着眼前残破的景色。它细长的骨头四肢以难以置信的速度在瓦砾中滑动。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hanging innards"
msgid_plural "hanging innards"
msgstr[0] "吊掛內臟"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hanging innards"
msgid ""
"Great snakes of flesh hang from the ceiling above, madly thrashing and "
"reaching about."
msgstr "一大块巨大的蛇形血肉从天花板悬吊下来，疯狂地四处拍打着，不断搜寻着猎物。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spasming lump"
msgid_plural "spasming lumps"
msgstr[0] "痙攣肉塊"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spasming lump"
msgid ""
"A great pile of merged bodies and mutated flesh.  It spasms in an arrhythmic "
"and desperate manner."
msgstr "一大团融合在一起的尸体和变异血肉。它不断痉挛，如同心率失常的心脏病人般绝望地搏动。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_fusion.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flesh wall"
msgid ""
"A great lump of mutated flesh.  It resembles the innards of some gigantic "
"creature, and is covered in a grid of diminutive veins."
msgstr "一大团体积巨大的变异肉体。它看起来像是某种巨型生物的内脏，表面覆盖着纤细血管构成的网络。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie scientist"
msgid_plural "zombie scientists"
msgstr[0] "科學家殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie scientist"
msgid ""
"The remaining protective gear, laboratory equipment, and long, formerly white "
"labcoat tell you that this zombie was some kind of researcher before turning."
msgstr "仍留在身上的防護裝備、實驗室設備和長長的、曾經潔白的實驗服告訴你，這個殭屍在死亡之前是某種研究員。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie security guard"
msgid_plural "zombie security guards"
msgstr[0] "保全殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie security guard"
msgid ""
"A shambling human corpse wearing a gray uniform and a bulletproof vest with "
"\"SECURITY\" emblazoned across the front.  It looks like this guard was quite "
"physically fit before its death; it moves quickly and powerfully, albeit "
"clumsily."
msgstr "一具步履蹣跚的人類屍體，穿著灰色制服和防彈背心，前面印有「安全」字樣。看來這個警衛生前身體還算健康，它移動迅速而有力，儘管有些笨拙。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "phase skulker"
msgid_plural "phase skulkers"
msgstr[0] "相位潛伏者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Description of monster "phase skulker"
msgid ""
"What remains of a researcher lost to the portal storms, twisted and enervated "
"by the presences that lurk beneath natural perception.  It walks and stumbles "
"in a stuttered manner, and is granted tenuous corporeality only by grace of "
"the experimental gear it wore when it died."
msgstr "一具迷失在传送门风暴中的研究者的遗骸，被暗藏的某种肉眼不可见的存在扭曲和削弱。它断断续续地蹒跚而行，仅靠着生前曾经所穿着的实验装备维持着脆弱的躯体。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "phase skulker"
msgid "The skulker shifts and melts inwards before disappearing!"
msgstr "潛伏者變形然後向內融化最後消失不見。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/monsters/weakpoints.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "phase skulker"
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "phase shrike"
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing the "stomach_armour" weakpoint
msgid "a gap in the armor"
msgstr "護甲的缺口"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "phase shrike"
msgid_plural "phase shrikes"
msgstr[0] "相位復仇者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Description of monster "phase shrike"
msgid ""
"What remains of a researcher lost to the portal storms, twisted and enervated "
"by the presences that lurk beneath natural perception.  It unnaturally "
"skitters on four bone-plated spikes, its every motion trailing an aura of "
"energetic distortion."
msgstr ""
"一具迷失在传送门风暴中的研究者的遗骸，被暗藏的某种肉眼不可见的存在扭曲和削弱。它依靠四只布满骨头的尖刺不自然地滑行，它的每一个动作都留下一道充满了扭曲能量的"
"光环。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_lab.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "phase shrike"
msgid "The shrike shifts and disappears amidst an electric surge!"
msgstr "相位复仇者突然移位，消失在一道电光之中！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "slavering biter"
msgid_plural "slavering biters"
msgstr[0] "垂涎撕咬者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "slavering biter"
msgid ""
"A distorted and swollen human body.  Its jaws have elongated into a "
"crocodile-like snout, dripping with foul-smelling saliva."
msgstr "一具扭曲腫漲的人體。它的下頜拉長到像鱷魚一般， 惡臭的口水緩緩滴落。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/zed_plant.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "slavering biter"
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "mangrove lurker"
msgid "the inside of its mouth"
msgstr "张开的嘴"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brainless zombie"
msgid_plural "brainless zombies"
msgstr[0] "無腦殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brainless zombie"
msgid ""
"A zombie like any other, except that its facial features and skull have been "
"devastated.  It's unclear what caused the damage, but between the scraps of "
"flesh you can see that its face and brain are gone, though its ears remain "
"intact."
msgstr "一個普通殭屍，只是它的面部和頭蓋骨完全毀壞了。不清楚怎樣造成的，但是在血肉殘存處你觀察到它的臉部跟大腦都不見了，即使如此它的耳朵仍然完好。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "headless horror"
msgid_plural "headless horrors"
msgstr[0] "無頭巨怪"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "headless horror"
msgid ""
"This headless zombie has swollen to frightening proportions, towering almost "
"nine feet tall.  Six-foot-long feelers of black ooze blindly wave from its "
"neck, violently twitching at nearby sounds.  Its long stride allows it to "
"quickly pursue its targets, which it pummels into pulp with its huge, swollen "
"fists."
msgstr ""
"这个无头丧尸已经肿胀到可怕的比例，几乎九英尺约2.7米高。六英尺（约1.8"
"米）长的黑色软泥触角在它的脖子上盲目地挥动，对身边的声音作出剧烈地抽搐。它长长的触手让它能够迅速追上目标，并用它巨大而肿胀的拳头将目标打成肉酱。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bruiser zombie"
msgid_plural "bruiser zombies"
msgstr[0] "壮汉丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bruiser zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's right arm has been grotesquely deformed into a massive "
"mace-like shape.  What remains of its hand has been covered in spiky bone, "
"and the upper arm's skin is clearly coming apart from the pressure on it."
msgstr "这只丧尸的右臂已经变形为奇形怪状的巨型狼牙棒。它残存的手上覆盖着尖刺的骨头，上臂的皮肤因为压力而明显开裂。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie brute"
msgid_plural "zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] "殭屍獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie brute"
msgid ""
"This zombie's entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, "
"festering wounds."
msgstr "一個肌肉發生突變的大型殭屍，雙臂與雙腿都有著膨脹的肌肉以及潰爛的傷口。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie wrestler"
msgid_plural "zombie wrestlers"
msgstr[0] "摔跤手殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie wrestler"
msgid ""
"A slab of festering muscle the size of a well-toned bodybuilder.  With "
"popping and cracking sounds its arm muscles constantly lengthen and contract "
"as it reaches out with deformed muscular hands the size of dinner plates."
msgstr "一大坨溃烂的肌肉，有着如身材结实的健美爱好者体型般大小。当它伸出餐盘大小、肌肉发达的变异手臂时，伴随着爆裂声和破裂声，手臂上肌肉不断伸缩。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie nightstalker"
msgid_plural "zombie nightstalkers"
msgstr[0] "夜行者殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie nightstalker"
msgid ""
"Somehow, this brute hides in the dark like some kind of boogeyman.  Very "
"agile for such a large zombie."
msgstr "不知怎的， 這具野獸像夜魔一樣隱藏在黑暗中。儘管身型巨大， 卻非常敏捷。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie prowler"
msgid_plural "zombie prowlers"
msgstr[0] "潜行者丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie prowler"
msgid ""
"Enveloped in darkness is the outline of what used to be a person, quick and "
"spindly - and nigh invisible in the shadows.  Even with the unnatural "
"camouflage hiding its features you can make out large teeth and even larger "
"claws."
msgstr ""
"一具曾经是人类的瘦长身体被笼罩在黑暗之中，行动速度很快，基本上很难看得清。然而即使这种超自然的伪装隐藏了它的外部特征，你也可以辨认出它那巨大的牙齿和更大的爪"
"子。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "listener zombie"
msgid_plural "listener zombies"
msgstr[0] "大耳殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "listener zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's head was once obviously destroyed, the gaps in its scraps of "
"face now filling with a peculiar gray goo.  Human ears hang from the sides, "
"enormous and unsettling.  Thin slits at the front suggest it may have a (very "
"limited) sense of sight."
msgstr "这只丧尸的头很明显曾经被摧毁过，它脸上的裂口充满了一种特殊的灰色黏液。人类的耳朵从侧面垂下，巨大而令人恶心。眼睛前的狭缝表明它还可能还保留着一定的视力。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "relentless hulk"
msgid_plural "relentless hulks"
msgstr[0] "追獵者浩克"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "relentless hulk"
msgid ""
"A hulking zombie swollen to the size of six men.  Its inky black eyes are "
"locked on you.  No matter how far you run, it always seems to find you."
msgstr "一只体型肿胀到有六个人大小的巨型丧尸。它墨黑的眼睛紧盯着你。不管你跑多远，它似乎总能找到你。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grabber zombie"
msgid_plural "grabber zombies"
msgstr[0] "長臂殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grabber zombie"
msgid ""
"A badly deformed zombie.  Its arms dangle from its sides like the limbs of "
"some skinless ape, mindlessly groping at their surroundings."
msgstr "一只严重畸形的丧尸。它的四条胳膊像没有皮的猿猴四肢一样枯瘦，一边在身体四周晃悠，一边盲目的摸索着四周。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grappler zombie"
msgid_plural "grappler zombies"
msgstr[0] "抓鉤殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grappler zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's elongated arms drag along the ground as it moves.  It looks to "
"almost have a hunchback from the swollen shoulder muscles tearing though its "
"skin."
msgstr "这只丧尸在移动时，两条长长的手臂沿着地面拖动。肿胀的后背看上去就像是驼背了，肩膀上的肌肉也从撕破的皮里露出来。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie hollow"
msgid_plural "zombie hollows"
msgstr[0] "空靈殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hollow"
msgid ""
"This zombie's hollow black eyes survey its surroundings as it stretches and "
"bends in ways that whoever the original body belonged to never could.  The "
"only things that seem solid on this flexible, black-veined body are the rows "
"of sharp, black teeth.  You get the feeling that the only human thing "
"remaining is the skin, worn as one might wear clothes."
msgstr ""
"这只丧尸黝黑阴森的眼窝中空无一物，然而你却能感到它在巡视着周围。它的身体以一种原来主人永远无法达到的姿势卷曲变幻、辗转腾挪。在布满黑色血管的躯体上，唯一看起"
"来还结实的是那一排尖锐而漆黑的獠牙。你有一种感觉，那东西唯一能算是人体的东西就是剩下的那层皮，就像你穿着你的衣服那般。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie hulk"
msgid_plural "zombie hulks"
msgstr[0] "殭屍浩克"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hulk"
msgid ""
"A human corpse swollen to the size of six men, with arms as wide as trash "
"cans."
msgstr "一个全身肌肉都发生了变异的超大块头丧尸，体型约为六个人大小，双臂极为强壮，力量之大足以击碎墙壁，愤怒的破坏欲支配着它粉碎着所能见到的一切，极为危险。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie hunter"
msgid_plural "zombie hunters"
msgstr[0] "殭屍追獵者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie hunter"
msgid ""
"You're barely able to believe this thing was ever human; it scrambles about "
"on all fours, its nails and teeth sharpened into dangerous-looking spikes."
msgstr "你几乎无法相信这个怪物曾经是人类；它用四肢在地上爬行，指甲和牙齿都如同矛尖一般锋利。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie snapper"
msgid_plural "zombie snappers"
msgstr[0] "啃咬殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie snapper"
msgid ""
"With a crocodile-like snout and rows of protruding teeth, this swimwear-clad "
"zombie lurks in the water."
msgstr "有著鱷魚般的嘴與成排外突的尖牙， 這種穿泳衣的殭屍潛伏在水中。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "zombie snapper"
msgid "the inside of the mouth"
msgstr "张开的嘴"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie master"
msgid_plural "zombie masters"
msgstr[0] "殭屍王"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie master"
msgid ""
"This zombie's features have tightened, its lips pulled back into an unnatural "
"grin, revealing rows of blackened teeth beneath large, piercing eyes.  It "
"stands tall and its movements are fluid and tightly controlled.  A feeling of "
"danger permeates the surrounding air, and the light that falls on it seems "
"somehow harsher and more glaring."
msgstr ""
"这只丧尸的五官风干收紧，它的嘴唇回缩让它露出不自然的诡异笑容，暴露出在它炯炯有神的大眼睛下方的一排黝黑发亮的牙齿。它体型庞大，移动起来流畅而又如同经过严密控"
"制一般。它周围的空气弥漫着一股危险的气息，而照落在它身上的光线似乎变得更明亮刺眼。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie necromancer"
msgid_plural "zombie necromancers"
msgstr[0] "死靈殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie necromancer"
msgid ""
"A twisted mockery of the human form, emaciated, with jet-black skin and "
"glowing red eyes.  It is somehow painful to look at, awakening fears deep "
"within your psyche, and even the surrounding air seems more sinister, somehow "
"darker and more dangerous."
msgstr ""
"一具被扭曲得变形的人形丧尸，十分瘦弱，有着乌黑的皮肤和发光的红色瞳孔，看着它让你感到莫名的痛苦，仿佛唤醒你内心深处的恐惧，甚至连周围的空气都似乎变得更恶毒，"
"更黑暗，更危险了。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie necro-boomer"
msgid_plural "zombie necro-boomers"
msgstr[0] "死靈爆炸殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie necro-boomer"
msgid ""
"At first this creature looks like nothing more than a grotesque and "
"oleaginous husk, bloated and punctured by jet-black pustules.  When "
"approached, its glowing red eyes and an aching grin take form; its skin tears "
"and its guts teem with unmatched fecundity, as its gaze inspires fear of "
"nothing less than cosmic, inhuman ecstasy."
msgstr ""
"初看上去这只怪物看起来只不过是一个怪异而油腻的空壳，浑身肿胀，许多深黑色的脓疱刺破了它的表皮。当你走近它时，它的眼睛发出了红光并露出了痛苦的怪笑；它的皮肤撕"
"裂开，内脏充满了无与伦比的繁殖力，它的目光激发了你对它那广大无边而又非人般狂喜的恐惧。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "zombie necro-boomer"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s lets out an unholy screech, and the corpses around it stir."
msgstr "%s 发出了一声邪恶的尖叫，周围的尸体开始骚动。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie runner"
msgid_plural "zombie runners"
msgstr[0] "快跑殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie runner"
msgid ""
"This recently-risen body moves quickly, darting its head back and forth and "
"gnawing at its hands."
msgstr "這具剛復甦的軀體動作迅速， 頭部前後擺動， 還在啃自己的手。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "regenerating zombie"
msgid_plural "regenerating zombies"
msgstr[0] "再生殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "regenerating zombie"
msgid ""
"A hairless zombie.  Its pale, pinkish flesh appears to be squirming and "
"moving across its body, quickly covering and fixing any wounds that it "
"receives.  Its clothing is riddled with holes, suggesting someone else tried, "
"and failed, to take it down."
msgstr "一隻無毛的殭屍。它蒼白、粉紅色的血肉似乎在全身上下蠕動與位移，迅速覆蓋並修復它所受到的任何傷口。它的衣服上千瘡百孔，表示有人試圖殺死它，但失敗了。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fleshy hunter"
msgid_plural "fleshy hunters"
msgstr[0] "血肉狩獵者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fleshy hunter"
msgid ""
"A zombie prowling around on all fours; its exposed muscles churn and snake, "
"unraveling before restitching themselves elsewhere along its red-raw figure."
msgstr "一隻用四腳爬行的殭屍。它裸露的肌肉翻騰、蜿蜒、散開，然後移到它紅色的軀體上的其他地方重新融合在一起。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "regenerating abomination"
msgid_plural "regenerating abominations"
msgstr[0] "再生憎惡體"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "regenerating abomination"
msgid ""
"This zombie hardly resembles a human anymore - Its skeleton has been "
"repeatedly dismantled and reassembled into a horrid quadrupedal shape, like "
"some sort of mismatched action figure.  Slick, bloodied flesh writhes on its "
"frame with an almost viscous quality, digesting and reconstituting itself in "
"an endless ouroboros of undead flesh."
msgstr ""
"這隻殭屍幾乎不再像人類了——它的骨架被反覆拆卸並重新組裝成可怕的四足動物形狀，就像某種違和的可動人偶。光滑、血腥的肉體在它的黏稠的軀幹上翻騰滾動，不斷地消化"
"並重組自己，就像擁有不死肉體的無盡循環的銜尾蛇。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie predator"
msgid_plural "zombie predators"
msgstr[0] "掠食者殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie predator"
msgid ""
"With its joints in odd places and angles, this humanoid creature prowls "
"across the landscape with surprising speed.  Its teeth and arms are sharpened "
"into fine points, and black ooze seeps out from cuts between its muscles."
msgstr "憑藉著它位置異常、角度奇特的關節， 這種類人生物以驚人的速度逡巡在地表上。它的牙齒和雙爪相當銳利， 肌肉上的創口緩緩滲出黑色軟泥。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "screecher zombie"
msgid_plural "screecher zombies"
msgstr[0] "尖嘯殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "screecher zombie"
msgid ""
"A thin corpse, its chest swollen in what appears to be preparation.  A thick "
"black ooze drips from its open mouth."
msgstr "一具瘦弱的屍體，它的腫脹的胸部似乎預備要做什麼。厚厚的黑色軟泥從張開的嘴巴滴下來。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shady zombie"
msgid_plural "shady zombies"
msgstr[0] "黑影殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shady zombie"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is its shambling, human-shaped "
"outline."
msgstr "不可思議的陰影籠罩著這傢伙，好像光線本身也排斥觸摸它。你能認出的只有它蹣跚的步履，人類外型的輪廓。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shrieker zombie"
msgid_plural "shrieker zombies"
msgstr[0] "尖叫殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shrieker zombie"
msgid ""
"An elongated human body with a swollen chest and a gaping hole where its jaw "
"used to be."
msgstr "一個有著腫脹胸腔的人體， 下巴的部份已經被撕爛成一個大洞。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skull zombie"
msgid_plural "skull zombies"
msgstr[0] "顱骨殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skull zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie's head is a hideous gray skull, formed of human bone fragments "
"and some sort of goo.  Jagged teeth are visible as the thing works its jaw, "
"and lidless, disturbingly human eyes stare at you from their sockets.  The "
"thing's fleshy ears are four sizes too large and droop under their own weight."
msgstr ""
"這個殭屍的頭是一個可怕的灰色顱骨，由人類骨頭碎片和某種黏液組成。當它活動下顎時，鋸齒狀的牙齒清晰可見，沒有眼瞼、令人不安的人類眼睛從眼窩裡狠狠盯著你。這東西"
"的肉質耳朵比正常耳朵大了四倍，並且在自身重量的作用下下垂。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ocular zombie"
msgid_plural "ocular zombies"
msgstr[0] "多眼殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ocular zombie"
msgid ""
"This otherwise-regular zombie's head is absolutely filled to the brim with "
"eyes, half of them frantically swiveling in their orbits.  The other half are "
"staring directly at you."
msgstr "這隻異常的殭屍的頭上佈滿了眼睛，其中一半正瘋狂地旋轉，另一半則死死地盯著你。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "smoker zombie"
msgid_plural "smoker zombies"
msgstr[0] "煙霧殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "smoker zombie"
msgid ""
"A blackened and twisted naked human body.  Strips of flesh hang from its "
"frame, and it emits a constant haze of thick black smoke."
msgstr "漆黑且扭曲的赤裸人體，一條條的肉掛在它的軀幹上，而且它不斷地散發出濃濃的黑煙。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ashen brawler"
msgid_plural "ashen brawlers"
msgstr[0] "灰霧搏擊殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ashen brawler"
msgid ""
"A gigantic, twisted human frame with a menacing stance and rapid movements.  "
"Thick clouds of smoke pour from violent-looking eviscerations spread across "
"its muscular body, and its arms appear to have elongated massively."
msgstr "巨大、扭曲的人體軀幹，姿態兇猛，動作迅速。濃濃的煙霧從生猛的內臟中湧出，遍布它肌肉發達的身體，它的手臂似乎已被大幅拉長。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "swimmer zombie"
msgid_plural "swimmer zombies"
msgstr[0] "水鬼殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "swimmer zombie"
msgid "A zombie clad in swimwear.  Probably not a very graceful swimmer anymore."
msgstr "穿著泳衣的殭屍。他應該不能再優雅地游泳了。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "webbed zombie"
msgid_plural "webbed zombies"
msgstr[0] "蹼狀殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "webbed zombie"
msgid ""
"A slick and glistening human body clad in swimwear.  Its hands and feet are "
"heavily webbed, suggesting some kind of rapid evolutionary adaptation to "
"water."
msgstr "穿著泳衣的光滑閃亮的人體。它的手和腳有厚重的蹼，這表明它對水有某種快速的進化適應性。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie technician"
msgid_plural "zombie technicians"
msgstr[0] "技工殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie technician"
msgid ""
"Still wearing its work clothes and hardhat, this zombie likely used to work "
"on power lines or other electrical equipment."
msgstr "這隻殭屍仍然穿著工作服還有安全帽， 生前似乎是在電力、電子產業工作。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie miner"
msgid_plural "zombie miners"
msgstr[0] "礦工殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie miner"
msgid ""
"This zombie's face, hands, work clothes, and miner's helmet are fully covered "
"with stains of coal dust."
msgstr "這隻殭屍的臉、手、工作服、礦工頭盔上都沾滿了煤塵的污漬。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "thorny shambler"
msgid_plural "thorny shamblers"
msgstr[0] "刺棘跛行獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "thorny shambler"
msgid ""
"A shambling undead humanoid, its body overgrown with a tangled mass of "
"otherworldly vegetation.  Hunched over and dragging its feet as it moves, the "
"bramble utterly enveloping its upper half twitches and moves with a life of "
"its own, tendrils tipped with a paralytic sting."
msgstr ""
"一個步履蹣跚的類人不死生物，它的身體長滿了一堆糾結的異界植物。彎腰駝背，拖著腳移動。荊棘完全包裹著它的上半身，在它移動時不斷抽搐著，就像有自己的生命一樣，卷"
"鬚的尖端有令人麻痺的刺。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ravenous reenactor"
msgid_plural "ravenous reenactors"
msgstr[0] "饑渴演員"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ravenous reenactor"
msgid ""
"This shambling corpse is dressed in the tatters of an antiquated soldier's "
"uniform.  Either it was a historical reenactor, or zombies have also started "
"to time travel."
msgstr "这具蹒跚而行的尸体穿着破烂老旧的士兵制服。要么它曾经是位历史重演爱好者，要么就是丧尸也学会了时间旅行。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fursuited zombie"
msgid_plural "fursuited zombies"
msgstr[0] "fursuited zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fursuited zombie"
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying awkwardly in a torn cloth suit of an anthropomorphized "
"animal.  Black goo and blood cakes the suit, and it gives off a foul, rotting "
"odor."
msgstr "一具穿着被撕破的福瑞装的身体，正笨拙地摇晃着。黑色黏液和鲜血使它的衣服结了块，散发出阵阵恶臭。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Nomex zombie"
msgid_plural "Nomex zombies"
msgstr[0] "Nomex zombies"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Nomex zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie was a firefighter in its past life, still donned in its turnout "
"equipment - said equipment has melded with its flesh, with the tough, flame "
"resistant fibers becoming incorporated into its skin as armor and body mass."
msgstr ""
"This zombie was a firefighter in its past life, still donned in its turnout "
"equipment - said equipment has melded with its flesh, with the tough, flame "
"resistant fibers becoming incorporated into its skin as armor and body mass."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fireproof zombie"
msgid_plural "fireproof zombies"
msgstr[0] "防火丧尸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fireproof zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first "
"responder, the wilted remains of its turnout gear clinging to it like a "
"molted carapace.  Fibrous streaks resembling the fireproof materials of its "
"gear run through its flesh like roots, giving the thing a mottled, off-yellow "
"appearance as it prowls on all fours."
msgstr ""
"这只丧尸生前似乎是消防员或者类似的应急反应人员，其身上的救生装备残骸如同蜕皮紧紧地依附在它身上。装备上防火材料的纤维痕迹像树根一样穿过了它的肉体，使其匍匐的"
"四肢呈现斑驳的淡黄色。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fireproof grappler"
msgid_plural "fireproof grapplers"
msgstr[0] "fireproof grapplers"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fireproof grappler"
msgid ""
"This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first "
"responder, its body having ripped through and absorbed the majority of its "
"uniform.  Its torso and back are swollen, and its muscles are marbled with "
"knotted growths resembling the Nomex fibers of its former gear, feeding into "
"lanky arms that drag on the floor."
msgstr ""
"This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first "
"responder, its body having ripped through and absorbed the majority of its "
"uniform.  Its torso and back are swollen, and its muscles are marbled with "
"knotted growths resembling the Nomex fibers of its former gear, feeding into "
"lanky arms that drag on the floor."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fireproof brute"
msgid_plural "fireproof brutes"
msgstr[0] "fireproof brutes"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_nomex.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fireproof brute"
msgid ""
"This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first "
"responder, but the uniform is hardly recognizable at this point, as the thing "
"has grown new flesh and muscle overtop.  Its sinewy body has taken on a "
"composition similar to the uniform's fire-resistant fabric, most of it "
"congealed into a pair of clubs on the ends of its hands."
msgstr ""
"This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first "
"responder, but the uniform is hardly recognizable at this point, as the thing "
"has grown new flesh and muscle overtop.  Its sinewy body has taken on a "
"composition similar to the uniform's fire-resistant fabric, most of it "
"congealed into a pair of clubs on the ends of its hands."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "prisoner zombie"
msgid_plural "prisoner zombies"
msgstr[0] "囚犯殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Description of monster "prisoner zombie"
msgid ""
"Apparently this zombie was doing time when the Cataclysm struck.  It wears "
"black and white striped prisoner clothes, and tattoos can be seen on its "
"decaying skin."
msgstr "顯然，當大災變來臨時這隻殭屍正在獄中服刑。它穿着黑白條紋的囚衣，腐爛的皮膚上刻有紋身。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "prisoner zombie brute"
msgid_plural "prisoner zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] "囚犯殭屍獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Description of monster "prisoner zombie brute"
msgid "This muscular zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "這個滿是肌肉的殭屍穿著黑白條紋的囚衣。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fat prisoner zombie"
msgid_plural "fat prisoner zombies"
msgstr[0] "肥胖囚犯殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fat prisoner zombie"
msgid "This fat zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "這個肥胖的殭屍穿著黑白條紋的囚衣。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tough prisoner zombie"
msgid_plural "tough prisoner zombies"
msgstr[0] "強壯囚犯殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_prisoner.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tough prisoner zombie"
msgid "This tough-looking zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "這個看起來很強壯的殭屍穿著黑白條紋的囚衣。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal zombie"
msgid_plural "skeletal zombies"
msgstr[0] "骷髏殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal zombie"
msgid ""
"A monstrous overgrowth of ossified tissue has replaced this zombie's rotting "
"skin with an organic armor of dense bone.  Large clumps of black goo seep "
"from its joints as it shambles aimlessly, with sickening crackling sounds "
"filling the surrounding air."
msgstr "在殭屍化的腐爛皮膚上覆蓋著過度生長的骨化組織，成為了天然裝甲。大量的黑色黏液隨著他漫無目的移動時，從它的關節滲出，並且在空氣中迴盪著令人不寒而慄的關節聲響。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal brutes"
msgstr[0] "骸骨獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal brute"
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this zombie's rotten "
"skin.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr "扭曲生长的钙化骨板覆盖了这个丧尸的腐烂皮肤，关节和遍及全身的裂缝渗出黑色黏液。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal shocker"
msgid_plural "skeletal shockers"
msgstr[0] "電擊骸骨"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal shocker"
msgid ""
"Heavy, jagged bone plates have grown out of the surface of this zombie's "
"skin.  Underneath, its flesh glows and crackles with the occasional jolt of "
"electricity."
msgstr "参差不齐的沉重骨板从这只丧尸的体表长出。骨板之下的肉体发出闪光，并不时发出一道道电弧。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal juggernaut"
msgid_plural "skeletal juggernauts"
msgstr[0] "骸骨巨人"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal juggernaut"
msgid ""
"This hideous golem of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it like an unwanted burden.  Formerly soft and "
"vulnerable, bones grew around its form to protect it - only, they kept "
"growing.  And growing.  And growing."
msgstr ""
"這個猙獰的魔像，披覆著骨片與畸形的肉塊，拖著身後沉重而尖銳的肢體，如同它們是多餘的累贅般。原本柔軟而脆弱的骨頭已經圍繞著它的形體生長出來保護它－只是，骨頭們"
"不斷地、不斷地、不斷地繼續長出來。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal slasher"
msgid_plural "skeletal slashers"
msgstr[0] "skeletal slashers"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal slasher"
msgid ""
"The fingers of this bone-clad zombie have turned into ossified blades the "
"size of large knives.  Most of the soft tissue on its head is gone, exposing "
"a significantly thickened skull."
msgstr ""
"The fingers of this bone-clad zombie have turned into ossified blades the "
"size of large knives.  Most of the soft tissue on its head is gone, exposing "
"a significantly thickened skull."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal executioner"
msgid_plural "skeletal executioners"
msgstr[0] "skeletal executioners"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal executioner"
msgid ""
"The hands and forearms of this tall, bone-clad zombie have transformed into "
"sword-like ossified blades.  Its jaw is partially fused with the bone mask "
"covering its face, leaving sinister-looking gaps.  Its movements are stiff "
"but precise."
msgstr ""
"The hands and forearms of this tall, bone-clad zombie have transformed into "
"sword-like ossified blades.  Its jaw is partially fused with the bone mask "
"covering its face, leaving sinister-looking gaps.  Its movements are stiff "
"but precise."

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal reaper"
msgid_plural "skeletal reapers"
msgstr[0] "skeletal reapers"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_skeletal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal reaper"
msgid ""
"This large, bone-armored zombie has scythe-like blades in place of its hands, "
"resembling a praying mantis.  Its face is covered by a thick, ossified mask, "
"with its only remaining facial features being eyes that ooze black goo.  Its "
"movements are filled with unnatural rage."
msgstr ""
"這隻巨大的骨甲殭屍的手上有鐮刀狀的刀片，就像一隻螳螂。它的臉上覆蓋著一層厚厚的、僵化的面具，唯一剩下的臉部特徵是滲出黑色黏液的眼睛。它的動作充滿了不自然的憤"
"怒。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie soldier"
msgid_plural "zombie soldiers"
msgstr[0] "軍人殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie soldier"
msgid ""
"Once a soldier, it is dressed head to toe in combat gear and carries itself "
"rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr "曾經是個軍人， 它現在從頭到腳都穿著戰鬥裝備， 移動步伐很穩定的殭屍。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie soldier test only"
msgid_plural "zombie soldier test only"
msgstr[0] "測試用士兵殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie soldier test only"
msgid "This zombie soldier is for testing purposes only."
msgstr "這隻士兵殭屍僅供測試使用。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black-ops zombie"
msgid_plural "black-ops zombies"
msgstr[0] "隱密行動軍人殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black-ops zombie"
msgid ""
"This soldier zombie's skin radiates a sort of shadowy smoke that obscures its "
"outline, making its camouflage even harder to see against the background.  In "
"the darkness it would be nigh invisible."
msgstr "這名軍人殭屍的皮膚散發出一種模糊的煙霧，遮掩他的輪廓，在背景下很難看破他的偽裝，在黑暗中他是完全隱形的。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hunter-killer zombie"
msgid_plural "hunter-killer zombies"
msgstr[0] "獵人殺手殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hunter-killer zombie"
msgid ""
"Fragments of visible uniform hint that this monstrosity was once a soldier.  "
"Anything human is invisible, hidden inside a sheath of living shadow.  It "
"moves with preternatural fluidity and grace."
msgstr "身上残留的制服碎片表明这个怪物曾经是一名士兵。它失去了人类的所有特征，隐藏在仿佛有生命的阴影中。它的移动方式不可思议的优雅和灵动。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bilious soldier zombie"
msgid_plural "bilious soldier zombies"
msgstr[0] "暴躁軍人殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bilious soldier zombie"
msgid ""
"This staggering soldier wears a burnt gasmask, now fused to its face.  "
"Through the melted, bile-encrusted ruination of the mask protrudes some sort "
"of hardened, fleshy proboscis, with steaming corrosive fluid leaking from the "
"end."
msgstr ""
"这个蹒跚而行的士兵丧尸戴着一个烧坏的防毒面具，现在和它的脸融化在一起了。透过融化且被胆汁腐蚀结痂的面具，能看见似乎是某种已经硬化的肉质长喙，某种正在冒烟的腐"
"蚀性液体从中泄漏出来。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "bilious soldier zombie"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s launches a corrosive dart!"
msgstr "%s射出一道酸液！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "caustic soldier zombie"
msgid_plural "caustic soldier zombies"
msgstr[0] "腐蝕軍人殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "caustic soldier zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie wears what appears to have once been a soldier's uniform and "
"armor, now a series of cracked and melted plates that have fused to its skin "
"and thickened hide.  Its face and arms blister with strange, mutated tubes "
"that pulse and drip with acid."
msgstr ""
"这只丧尸穿着一件看起来曾经是士兵制服和盔甲的东西，现在已经变成了几块破裂融化的金属板，融到了它外表的厚皮之中。它的脸和胳膊被变异血管涨破，酸液不断随着血管的"
"跳动滴落在地上。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "caustic soldier zombie"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s launches a hail of corrosive darts!"
msgstr "%s射出許多酸液！"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Kevlar zombie"
msgid_plural "Kevlar zombies"
msgstr[0] "防彈衣殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie dons a uniform with heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  "
"Peculiarly, the uniform seems to have fused to its skin in certain places, "
"its flesh gripping the edges of its gear as though the body were trying to "
"absorb it."
msgstr "这只丧尸穿着一件缝有厚重防弹材料的制服，制服似乎在某些地方与它的皮肤融合了在一起，腐肉包住了那件制服的边缘，就像它的身体正在试图吸收它一样。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Kevlar brute"
msgid_plural "Kevlar brutes"
msgstr[0] "防彈衣殭屍獸"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar brute"
msgid ""
"This zombie was once wearing some kind of uniform with heavy, bulletproof "
"materials sewn in.  At this point it's impossible to tell what kind of "
"uniform it was: the monster's skin has grown over the fabric, splitting and "
"tearing it to shreds, turning the remaining Kevlar and other bits of armor "
"material into part of its hide.  Its hands have similarly fused into large, "
"leathery cudgels."
msgstr ""
"这只丧尸曾经穿着一种缝有重型防弹材料的制服。但现在已经看不出是什么制服了：怪物的外皮已经覆盖在原有织物上，将制服撕裂成碎片，把剩下的凯夫拉装甲和其他防弹材料"
"变成了它的一部分。同样的，它的双手也融合成了巨大的厚皮棍棒。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Kevlar hulk"
msgid_plural "Kevlar hulks"
msgstr[0] "防彈衣浩克"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Kevlar hulk"
msgid ""
"This zombie was once wearing some kind of now long-shredded uniform with "
"heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  It has grown into a hulking, "
"leatherbacked beast, its mutated skin taking on a strange texture similar to "
"the Kevlar bits embedded in it.  Its arms have twisted into enormous clubs of "
"misshapen bone that it drags on the ground behind it."
msgstr ""
"这只丧尸曾经穿着一种有重型防弹材料夹层的制服，但现在它已经长成了一只巨大的厚皮怪物，它变异的皮肤呈现出一种奇怪的纹理，类似于嵌入其中的凯夫拉甲块。它的手臂扭"
"曲成了巨大的畸形骨头棒，在它身后拖行。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie military pilot"
msgid_plural "zombie military pilots"
msgstr[0] "飛行軍官殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie military pilot"
msgid ""
"Once a pilot, it is wearing a flight suit and a sturdy-looking flight helmet. "
" The head twitches and adjusts constantly, following any and every source of "
"movement."
msgstr "曾经是一名飞行员，穿着飞行服，戴着看起来坚固的飞行头盔。头部不停抽搐，不断朝着各种运动源头调整。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "uniformed zombie"
msgid_plural "uniformed zombies"
msgstr[0] "軍裝殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "uniformed zombie"
msgid ""
"This undead soldier is adorned in standard military fatigues.  It carries "
"itself rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr "这个不死士兵浑身穿着制式军装。以丧尸的标准来说，它的行动相当稳健。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie mariner"
msgid_plural "zombie mariners"
msgstr[0] "水兵殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie mariner"
msgid ""
"Still dressed in the ragged remains of deep blue naval fatigues, it's clear "
"that this walking corpse was once a sailor of some description.  The US "
"Navy's insignia is embroidered on the shredded sleeve and shoulder of its "
"bloodied jacket, the dead crewman's battered cap is beaten into the remains "
"of its fractured skull and its inky black eyes are scanning the area around "
"it as dark ooze drips from its limply hanging maw."
msgstr ""
"这具行走的尸体仍然穿着深蓝色海军工作服的残迹，很明显，他曾经是一名水手。美国海军的标志绣在它那血淋淋的夹克的袖子和肩膀上，死去的船员破旧的帽子被打进了它破碎"
"的头骨的残骸里，它那墨黑的眼睛正在扫描周围的区域，黑色的软泥从它无力的下垂的胃里滴下来。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie officer"
msgid_plural "zombie officers"
msgstr[0] "軍官殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie officer"
msgid ""
"Dressed in the shredded blue dress uniform of a naval officer, this undead "
"corpse was evidently a higher ranking crewman in life.  Having more than "
"likely not been clad in body armor, the result now staggers before you: "
"horrific wounds exposed to the air and large portions of flesh and muscle "
"ripped from its glistening skeleton."
msgstr ""
"这具不死丧尸身穿海军军官的破碎蓝色制服，显然是一名级别更高的海员。很可能由于没有及时穿上防弹衣，结果现在你面前蹒跚而行：可怕的伤口暴露在空气中，大部分血肉从"
"闪闪发光的骨架上被撕碎垂落下来。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie marine"
msgid_plural "zombie marines"
msgstr[0] "海軍陸戰隊殭屍"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie marine"
msgid ""
"Dressed head to toe in naval combat equipment and with Marine insignia "
"embroidered on its gear, this lurching corpse still retains its physical "
"fitness in death.  From underneath its helmet, its inky black eyes scan the "
"area around it."
msgstr "从头到脚穿着海军作战装备，装备上绣着海军陆战队徽章，这具摇摇晃晃的尸体在死亡中仍保持着健壮的躯体。从头盔下面，它墨黑的眼睛扫视着周围的区域。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bestial stalker"
msgid_plural "bestial stalkers"
msgstr[0] "野獸追獵者"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bestial stalker"
msgid ""
"Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack "
"against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle "
"tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has "
"caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have "
"extended into spikes of bone.  The Marine insignias on the remains of the "
"creature's pulverized gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this "
"hulking abomination used to be."
msgstr ""
"這種四足笨重的變異野獸，在掠奪性移動時，匕首般的爪子在地面上發出咔噠聲：厚厚的裸露肌肉組織遍布其腐爛的身體。新增的組織導致手臂和背部的皮膚裂開，而這頭野獸的"
"牙齒已經延伸成骨刺。被粉碎的裝備殘骸上的海軍陸戰隊徽章，是這隻巨大的怪物曾經是一名士兵的唯一證明。"

#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
