#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks, bye."
msgstr "謝謝, 再見。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Well, I guess it's just us."
msgstr "嗯, 我想只剩我們了。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "At least we've got shelter."
msgstr "至少我們還有避難所。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What should we do now?"
msgstr "我們現在該怎麼辦?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any tips?"
msgstr "有建議嗎?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Want to travel with me?"
msgstr "你願意跟我一起旅行嗎?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Want to share some useful items with me?"
msgstr "可以給我一些有用的物品嗎？"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I don't know, look for supplies and other survivors I guess."
msgstr "我不知道, 我想應該就是蒐集物資以及找其他的生存者吧。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Maybe we should start boarding up this place."
msgstr "也許我們要開始把這個地方用木板加固起來。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I suppose getting a car up and running would be really be useful if we have "
"to move."
msgstr "如果我们必须搬家的话，用车来搬家会非常有用。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We could look for a farm.  They should have food and tools, and they aren't "
"close to cities."
msgstr "我们可以找一个农场。那里应该有食物和工具，而且离城市比较远。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "We should probably stay away from cities, even if they have lots of supplies."
msgstr "也许我们应该远离那些城市，即便那里有不少物资。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hmm, okay."
msgstr "嗯, 好吧。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "謝謝!"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Focus on the road, mate!"
msgstr "專心路況，夥伴！"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm driving here!"
msgstr "我在开车！"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm too thirsty, give me something to drink."
msgstr "我太渴了, 給我點能喝的東西。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm too hungry, give me something to eat."
msgstr "我太餓了, 給我點能吃的東西。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Nothing comes to my mind now.  Ask me later perhaps?"
msgstr "現在我什麼都沒想到。或許晚點再問我？"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I have some reason for not telling you."
msgstr "我有些苦衷，不能告訴你。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Ah, okay."
msgstr "啊，好的。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Not until I get some antibiotics…"
msgstr "除非你给我一点抗生素……"

