#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Leah Shepherds keeps sending me emails, and we just received the papers for "
"yet another lawsuit.\n"
" I don't know what you're thinking but this one is going to be really "
"difficult and could cost us.\n"
" The Board is going to be furious."
msgstr ""
"&来自：克里斯蒂·戈迪，运营高级副总裁\n"
"发往：彼得·圣特拉弗斯，研发高级副总裁\n"
"主题：谢菲尔德\n"
"\n"
"彼得，\n"
"利亚·谢菲尔德不断给我发电子邮件，我们刚刚又收到了一张法院传票。\n"
"我不知道你在想什么，但这样真的很难办，可能会让我们花费不少。\n"
"董事会会大发雷霆的。"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Vincent Fuels, Researcher\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: This is bad!\n"
"\n"
" While you were gone last night, the old man started to wake up and become "
"cranky.\n"
" We had to give him another dose of that elephant tranquilizer!\n"
" I think he might actually be strong enough to break out of his cell now.\n"
" We really need to do something before he kills someone!\n"
" I know this experiment meant a lot to you, but it isn't worth the risk "
"anymore!"
msgstr ""
"&来自：文森特·福尔斯，研究员\n"
"发往：彼得·圣特拉弗斯，研发高级副总裁\n"
"主题：情况很糟糕！\n"
"\n"
"昨晚你不在的时候，老人开始清醒，变得暴躁。\n"
"我们不得不再给他注射一剂大象镇静剂！\n"
"我想他现在可能真的强壮到可以冲出牢房了。\n"
"在他杀人之前，我们真的需要做点什么！\n"
"我知道这个实验对你来说意义重大，但现在不值得这么冒险了！"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Budget\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" You need to find a way to reverse what you did ASAP.\n"
" What exactly do you expect me to do to get us out of this?\n"
" The police are investigating us now for foul play."
msgstr ""
"&来自：克里斯蒂，戈迪，运营高级副总裁\n"
"发往：彼得·圣特拉弗斯，研发高级副总裁\n"
"主题：解决这一切\n"
"\n"
"彼得，\n"
"你需要找到一种方法来尽快扭转你所做的事情。\n"
"你到底希望我做什么才能让我们摆脱困境？\n"
"警方现在正在调查我们是否有违法行为。"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Unknown Sender\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Results\n"
"\n"
" Looking forward to your report at the next meeting.\n"
" I put a lot on the line for you, don't disappoint me, Peter.\n"
" Get me results."
msgstr ""
"&来自：未知发件人\n"
"发往：彼得·圣特拉弗斯，研发高级副总裁\n"
"主题：结果\n"
"\n"
"期待你在下次会议上的报告。\n"
"我为你付出了很多，别让我失望，彼得。\n"
"给我结果。"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Will Higgins, VP Information Technology\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Security\n"
"\n"
" Hello sir,\n"
" I understand your concerns about security.  Rest assured, myself and my team "
"take this very seriously.  I assure you that high-level encryption protects "
"all of our systems.\n"
" Nobody will be able to access any of our PCs without use of the owner's "
"fingerprint authentication, even in the event that the main power supply is "
"cut.\n"
" Nobody unauthorized will ever be able to read our emails or documents."
msgstr ""
"&来自：威尔·希金斯，信息技术副总裁\n"
"发往：彼得·圣特拉弗斯，研发高级副总裁\n"
"主题：安全性\n"
"\n"
"你好先生，\n"
"我理解你对信息安全有所担忧。请放心，我和我的团队非常重视这一点。我向你保证，高级加密可以保护我们所有的系统。\n"
"如果不使用所有者的指纹认证，任何人都无法访问我们的任何个人电脑，即使是主电源被切断的情况下也是如此。\n"
"未经授权的任何人都无法阅读我们的电子邮件或文件。"

