"utopia?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "Do you think there's any hope left?  Or are we just clinging to a lost cause?"
msgstr "Do you think there's any hope left?  Or are we just clinging to a lost cause?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Do you think there's anyone out there who knows the full story?  Someone with "
"all the answers?"
msgstr ""
"Do you think there's anyone out there who knows the full story?  Someone with "
"all the answers?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "Do you think we'll ever find a place where we can just… be safe?  Truly safe?"
msgstr "Do you think we'll ever find a place where we can just… be safe?  Truly safe?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever have a moment of peace?  Just one day where we don't "
"have to worry."
msgstr ""
"Do you think we'll ever have a moment of peace?  Just one day where we don't "
"have to worry."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "Do you think we'll ever rebuild?  Like, really rebuild?"
msgstr "Do you think we'll ever rebuild?  Like, really rebuild?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever see a world without fear again?  A place where kids "
"can play outside?"
msgstr ""
"Do you think we'll ever see a world without fear again?  A place where kids "
"can play outside?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever understand the full extent of what happened?  All the "
"whys and hows?"
msgstr ""
"Do you think we'll ever understand the full extent of what happened?  All the "
"whys and hows?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Ever hear about those places that supposedly have a natural immunity to the "
"virus?  Wonder if they're real."
msgstr ""
"Ever hear about those places that supposedly have a natural immunity to the "
"virus?  Wonder if they're real."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Ever think about how future generations will look at us?  If there even are "
"future generations."
msgstr ""
"Ever think about how future generations will look at us?  If there even are "
"future generations."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Ever think about how the animals are coping with all this?  Mutants are one "
"thing, but what about the regular ones?"
msgstr ""
"Ever think about how the animals are coping with all this?  Mutants are one "
"thing, but what about the regular ones?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Ever think about how weird it is that we're still here, fighting to survive?  "
"Like, why us?"
msgstr ""
"Ever think about how weird it is that we're still here, fighting to survive?  "
"Like, why us?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "Ever think about what you'd do differently if you knew this was coming?"
msgstr "Ever think about what you'd do differently if you knew this was coming?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if the animals have it better than us now?  Less to worry about, "
"just surviving."
msgstr ""
"Ever wonder if the animals have it better than us now?  Less to worry about, "
"just surviving."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if the plants and trees know what's happening?  If they feel it "
"too?"
msgstr ""
"Ever wonder if the plants and trees know what's happening?  If they feel it "
"too?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if there are places out there that haven't been touched by all "
"this?  Little pockets of normality?"
msgstr ""
"Ever wonder if there are places out there that haven't been touched by all "
"this?  Little pockets of normality?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if we're just in some kind of experiment?  Like, some twisted lab "
"rat scenario?"
msgstr ""
"Ever wonder if we're just in some kind of experiment?  Like, some twisted lab "
"rat scenario?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Every time I close my eyes, I can still see the riots.  Do you get that, or "
"is it just me?"
msgstr "每次闭上眼睛，我都能看到那场暴乱的画面。你明白了吗，还是只有我一个人会这样？"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I been thinkin' about rearranging my gear.  It's a real mess.  Don't wanna go "
"for my weapon and accidentally pull out a granola bar, right?"
msgstr "我一直在想重新整理下我的装备。真是一团糟。你可不想在拿武器时不小心拔出一根麦片棒，对吧？"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I can't help but think there's more to this than we know.  Like, some big "
"secret waiting to be uncovered."
msgstr ""
"I can't help but think there's more to this than we know.  Like, some big "
"secret waiting to be uncovered."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I can't shake the feeling that someone's watching us.  Like, we're not alone "
"in this."
msgstr ""
"I can't shake the feeling that someone's watching us.  Like, we're not alone "
"in this."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I can't stop thinking about those conspiracy theories.  Aliens, government "
"experiments gone wrong…what if some of it's true?"
msgstr ""
"I can't stop thinking about those conspiracy theories.  Aliens, government "
"experiments gone wrong…what if some of it's true?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I heard a story about a place where the dead don't rise.  Sounds too good to "
"be true, right?"
msgstr ""
"I heard a story about a place where the dead don't rise.  Sounds too good to "
"be true, right?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I just can't believe it's over.  I keep running my head back to the days it "
"all fell apart.  The riots.  The lies.  The psychos.  It never really felt "
"like it was going to go like this."
msgstr "我只是不敢相信一切都终结了。我不停地回想自从一切都崩溃的那天以来的经历。暴乱。谎言。精神病。从来没有感觉到这一切会变成这样子。"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I keep having dreams that zombies still remember who they were as people, and "
"are just trapped inside the bodies watching everything happen.  Haven't been "
"sleeping well."
msgstr "我一直梦到丧尸仍然记得自己作为人类时的身份，只是被困在尸体里，看着一切发生。这让我一直都没法睡一场好觉。"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I miss the little things, like traffic jams and crowded malls.  Never thought "
"I'd say that."
msgstr ""
"I miss the little things, like traffic jams and crowded malls.  Never thought "
"I'd say that."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I miss the simple things.  Like a hot shower.  Think we'll ever have that "
"again?"
msgstr ""
"I miss the simple things.  Like a hot shower.  Think we'll ever have that "
"again?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "I miss the taste of fresh food.  Think we'll ever have that again?"
msgstr "I miss the taste of fresh food.  Think we'll ever have that again?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I sometimes think about all the places I wanted to visit.  Wonder what "
"they're like now."
msgstr ""
"I sometimes think about all the places I wanted to visit.  Wonder what "
"they're like now."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I sometimes wonder if it's better to not know the full truth about what "
"caused all this."
msgstr ""
"I sometimes wonder if it's better to not know the full truth about what "
"caused all this."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "I used to be scared of the dark.  Now it's the least of my worries."
msgstr "I used to be scared of the dark.  Now it's the least of my worries."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "I used to dream about adventures.  This… this isn't what I had in mind."
msgstr "I used to dream about adventures.  This… this isn't what I had in mind."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I used to think the apocalypse would be more… glamorous, you know?  Less "
"dirt, more Mad Max."
msgstr ""
"I used to think the apocalypse would be more… glamorous, you know?  Less "
"dirt, more Mad Max."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I used to think the end of the world would bring people together.  Guess I "
"was wrong."
msgstr ""
"I used to think the end of the world would bring people together.  Guess I "
"was wrong."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "I used to think the world was big.  Now it feels so small, so fragile."
msgstr "I used to think the world was big.  Now it feels so small, so fragile."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I wish I could go bust a cap in one of those zombies right now, without all "
"the fuss about being scared for my life."
msgstr "我希望我现在就能一枪干翻自己变成那些丧尸中的一员，这样就不用为自己的生命操心了。"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I wonder if I should be getting more religious now, or less.  You know what "
"I'm sayin', <name_g>?"
msgstr "我不知道自己现在是应该变得更虔诚呢，还是更不虔诚。你懂我的意思吧，<name_g>？"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "I wonder if the government's still out there, holed up in some bunker."
msgstr "我想知道政府是否還存在，躲在某個地堡裡。"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I wonder if there are other dimensions where things didn't go to hell.  "
"Parallel worlds where everything's fine."
msgstr ""
"I wonder if there are other dimensions where things didn't go to hell.  "
"Parallel worlds where everything's fine."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I wonder if we'll ever see real civilization again, or if this is just the "
"new normal."
msgstr ""
"I wonder if we'll ever see real civilization again, or if this is just the "
"new normal."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors about entire towns just vanishing overnight.  No bodies, no "
"signs of struggle.  Creepy, huh?"
msgstr ""
"I've heard rumors about entire towns just vanishing overnight.  No bodies, no "
"signs of struggle.  Creepy, huh?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"I've heard whispers about groups out there, still trying to control things.  "
"Like some shadow government or something."
msgstr ""
"I've heard whispers about groups out there, still trying to control things.  "
"Like some shadow government or something."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid "People used to laugh at preppers.  Who's laughing now, huh?"
msgstr "People used to laugh at preppers.  Who's laughing now, huh?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Remember some of the crazy news from the end of the world?  The stuff that "
"got drowned out by the riot coverage I mean.  Like, didn't the governor of "
"Rhode Island secede from the Union or something?"
msgstr "还记得一些来自世界末日的疯狂新闻吗？我是说那些被暴乱报道淹没的东西。比如，罗得岛的州长不是说已经脱离联邦了吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Remember those stories about underground cities?  Wonder if anyone's living "
"down there now."
msgstr ""
"Remember those stories about underground cities?  Wonder if anyone's living "
"down there now."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Remember when people thought the internet would last forever?  Feels like a "
"joke now."
msgstr ""
"Remember when people thought the internet would last forever?  Feels like a "
"joke now."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Some say the world ending was nature's way of hitting the reset button.  What "
"do you think?"
msgstr ""
"Some say the world ending was nature's way of hitting the reset button.  What "
"do you think?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I think about those survivalist nutjobs.  Bet they're having the "
"last laugh now."
msgstr ""
"Sometimes I think about those survivalist nutjobs.  Bet they're having the "
"last laugh now."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the stars look different now.  Like, did they change "
"too?"
msgstr ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the stars look different now.  Like, did they change "
"too?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the world ended for a reason.  Like, maybe we needed a "
