"Now that we have some cover, we should reorganize that dining area into our "
"kitchen."
msgstr "現在我們有了一些遮蔽，我們應該將該用餐區重新組織到我們的廚房中。"

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/recipe_modular_firestation_1/recipe_modular_firestation1.json
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_firestation1_kitchen1"
