#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_awake"
msgid "You're really struggling with how long it's been since your last drink."
msgstr "你一直在纠结离上次喝酒到底有多久了。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_awake"
msgid "You're really dying for a drink now!"
msgstr "你真的很想喝一杯，现在！"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_asleep"
msgid "You dream of sitting at your favorite venue, enjoying a nice drink…"
msgstr "你梦到你坐在最喜欢的地方，享受着一杯美酒……"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"Talking to your friends for hours while having a couple drinks, just good "
"times, until you wake up alone and sober."
msgstr "你梦到和你的朋友聊上了好几个小时，喝几杯酒，真是一段美好的时光，直到你独自醒来。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream about searching an empty world for any kind of drink, for what "
"seems like ages.  At last, you find a strong beverage to appease your thirst, "
"only for it to be snatched away from you!"
msgstr "你梦到你在一个空荡荡的世界里找东西喝，似乎一直找了很多年。终于，你找到了一瓶烈酒来满足你的渴望，但是它又从你身边被夺走了！"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"Zombies crash through your bar setup at home, smashing the bottles and "
"spilling everything.  You fall to your knees in the wreckage and wait for the "
"end."
msgstr "丧尸冲进了你家的吧台，把瓶子砸了个粉碎，把一切都泼洒得遍地。你在残骸中跪下，等待结局。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_mild_awake"
msgid "You could use some diazepam."
msgstr "你想要來點安定劑。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_strong_awake"
msgid "You're shaking… you need some diazepam!"
msgstr "你開始顫抖… 你需要一些安定劑！"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream that you reach into your pocket and pull out a bottle full of that "
"wonderful diazepam candy…"
msgstr "你梦见你把手伸进口袋，从里面掏出一瓶美妙的地西泮糖果……"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"'A song plays in your dreams' ♪Lie still little bottle, and shake my shaky "
"hand.  Black coffee's not enough for me, I need a better friend♪."
msgstr "'一首歌在你的梦里响起' ♪静静躺着的小瓶子，握住我颤抖的手。黑咖啡对我来说还不够，我需要一个更好的朋友♪。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream about lying in an ocean of benzo boxes.  To your dismay, every "
"single box is empty…"
msgstr "你梦到躺在苯类药盒的海洋中。但令你沮丧的是，每个盒子都是空的……"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"That calm that soaks into your bones from the outside in that benzos bring.  "
"You wake and there is none of that calm to find."
msgstr "苯类药物带来的那种平静由外渗入你的骨头内。你醒来，却再也找不到那种平静。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_coke_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_coke_asleep"
msgid "You feel like you need a bump."
msgstr "你覺得你需要吸點粉。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_coke_awake"
msgid "What would you do for some coke, right now?"
msgstr "现在，你会为了找到些可卡因做什么？"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_crack_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_crack_asleep"
msgid "You're shivering, you need some crack."
msgstr "你在發抖, 你需要來點快克。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_coke_asleep"
msgid ""
"You should have a party with some cocaine, it's not like you have work "
"tomorrow."
msgstr "你应该开个派对，吸点可卡因，明天不像你要上班的日子。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_asleep"
msgid "You could use some nicotine."
msgstr "你想要來點尼古丁。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid "You need some nicotine."
msgstr "你需要來點尼古丁。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_awake"
msgid "You lick your lips as you think about lighting a cigarette."
msgstr "当你想着点燃一支香烟时，你舔了舔嘴唇。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream of a long conversation with a dead relative, a cigarette in their "
"hand and smoke wafts through your brain."
msgstr "你梦到与死去的亲人彻夜漫谈，他们手里都拿着一支香烟，烟雾在你的大脑中飘荡。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"In your dream you were standing around a campfire with a bunch of your now "
"dead friends, a cigarette between your lips.  The tobacco smell mixing in "
"with the wood smoke in the chill fall air."
msgstr "在你的梦中，你和你现在已经去世的朋友们站在一堆营火旁边，一根香烟夹在你的嘴唇之间。在秋天寒冷的空气中，烟草的味道夹杂着木柴的烟味。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream of sex with an old flame, but the realest part of the dream is the "
"post coital cigarette."
msgstr "你梦到与旧情人做爱，但梦中最真实的部分是事后的香烟。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"You wake with the imagined taste of smoke in your mouth; how long has it been "
"since that was true?"
msgstr "你醒来时仍然在遐想自己嘴里的烟味；这种事已经持续多久了？"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"Standing on the edge of a building with a cigarette in your hand, a horde of "
"zombies milling below.  You take one last long drag and flick the butt out "
"over the zombies then step off the ledge.  Waking with a start you can almost "
"taste the smoke and tar in your mouth."
msgstr "你站在一栋建筑的边缘，手里拿着一支烟，下面有一大群丧尸在转悠。你深吸一口烟，把烟蒂扔到丧尸身上，然后从边缘一步跳下。你醒来时嘴里仿佛尝到了烟和焦油的味道。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"In your dream you brutally disanimate several zombies and then tear through "
"their clothing looking for any unsmoked cigarettes"
msgstr "在你的梦里，你残忍地消灭了几个丧尸，然后撕开它们的衣物，寻找任何没有吸过的香烟。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_asleep"
msgid "Your hands start shaking… you need some painkillers."
msgstr "你的手掌開始顫抖… 你需要一些止痛藥。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_awake"
msgid ""
"If you don't find some opiates soon you might start engaging in reckless "
"behavior, you think to yourself."
msgstr "你開始想，如果不盡快找到一些鴉片類的藥物，你可能會開始做出魯莽的行為。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_awake"
msgid ""
"You daydream of crushing pills and snorting them through a rolled up dollar "
"bill.  The drip in the back of your throat presaging a fun time."
msgstr "你梦到把药丸压碎并通过卷起的美元钞票吸食它们。你咽喉深处的滴水预示着一段快乐时光。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_awake"
msgid "If I can just find some oxies, everything will be fine."
msgstr "只要我能找到些羟考酮，一切都会好起来。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_asleep"
msgid "♪It is not a habit, it is cool, I feel alive, I feel♪"
msgstr "♪这不是习惯，这很酷炫，我感觉活着，我感觉♪"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_asleep"
msgid "That warm rush fills your body in your dream, oxy's hug enveloping you."
msgstr "那种温暖的冲动在你的梦里充满了全身，氧气的拥抱包围了你。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_strong_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_strong_asleep"
msgid "You feel anxious.  You need your painkillers!"
msgstr "你覺得很焦慮。你需要你的止痛藥!"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_strong_awake"
msgid ""
"You need to find an unlooted pharmacy today before the lack of opiates kills "
"you."
msgstr "你需要找到一間還沒被搜刮過的藥局，以免鴉片戒斷害死你。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_strong_awake"
msgid "The best thing about the apocalypse is that you've become your own prescriber."
msgstr "世界末日的最大的好处就是你成为了自己的处方医生。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_strong_awake"
msgid "The doctor is in and the doctor says it's time for some morphine, stat!"
msgstr "医生进来然后说是时候来点吗啡了，起！"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"The same old dream: a bottle of oxycodone, a zipper bag, a hammer, a flat "
"surface and a dollar bill."
msgstr "同样的旧梦：一瓶羟考酮、一个拉链袋、一把锤子、一个平整的表面和一张美元钞票。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_strong_asleep"
msgid "♪Got a bag of pills I've been dealin'♪"
msgstr "♪弄到袋药我开吸♪"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_amphetamine_mild_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_amphetamine_mild_asleep"
msgid "You feel depressed.  Speed would help."
msgstr "你出現憂鬱症狀。興奮劑可改善這情形。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_amphetamine_strong_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_amphetamine_strong_asleep"
msgid "Your hands start shaking… you need a pick-me-up."
msgstr "你的手掌開始顫抖… 你需要提神的東西。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_amphetamine_paralysis_awake"
msgid "You stop suddenly, feeling bewildered."
msgstr "你突然停住並開始放空。"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_amphetamine_paralysis_asleep"
msgid ""
"You attempt to gasp as you wake, but your body initially refuses to respond "
"to your mind."
msgstr "当你醒来时试图喘气，但你的身体一开始拒绝回应你的思想。"

#: data/json/snippets/amigara.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "amigara1"
msgid ""
"ENTRY 47:\n"
"Our normal mining routine has unearthed a hollow chamber.  This would not be "
"out of the ordinary, save for the odd, perfectly vertical faultline found.  "
"This faultline has several odd concavities in it which have the more "
"superstitious crew members alarmed; they seem to be of human origin.\n"
"ENTRY 48:\n"
"The concavities are between 10 and 20 feet tall, and run the length of the "
"faultline.  Each one is vaguely human in shape, but with the proportions of "
"the limbs, neck and head greatly distended, all twisted and curled in on "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"条目47：\n"
"我们在日常采掘作业中发现了一个规模庞大的石窟。这本来并不奇怪，奇怪的是，我们在石窟尽头发现了一完全垂直的断壁。断面上有很多怪异的凹坑，让那些迷信的矿工惊惧异"
"常；它们看上去像是人造的。\n"
"条目48：\n"
"这些凹坑有3到6米高，布满了整个断层线。每个凹坑的外形都有点像人类，但四肢、脖子和头部的比例却大大扩张，全都扭曲蜷缩着。"

#: data/json/snippets/amigara.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "amigara2"
msgid ""
"ENTRY 49:\n"
"We've stopped mining operations in this area, obviously, until archaeologists "
"have the chance to inspect the area.  This is going to set our schedule back "
"by at least a week.  This stupid artifact-preservation law has been in place "
"for 50 years, and hasn't even been up for termination despite the fact that "
"these mining operations are the backbone of our economy.\n"
"ENTRY 52:\n"
"Still waiting on the archaeologists.  We've done a little light inspection of "
"the faultline; our sounding equipment is insufficient to measure the depth of "
"the concavities.  The equipment is rated at 15 miles depth, but it isn't made "
"for such narrow tunnels, so it's hard to say exactly how far back they go."
msgstr ""
"条目49：\n"
"我们已经停下了这儿的采矿作业。很显然，除非考古学家有机会来检查这儿，否则我们就搁在这了。这将使我们的计划至少推迟一周。这该死的文物保护法已经设立有50"
"多年了，居然还没被终止。毕竟矿业才是我们国家经济的支柱啊！\n"
"条目52：\n"
"还在等那些考古学家。我们稍微检查了下断层，我们手头的设备无法测量凹面的深度。这个设备的额定深度是15英里，但不能用于这种狭窄通道，所以很难说这有多长。"

#: data/json/snippets/amigara.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "amigara3"
msgid ""
"ENTRY 54:\n"
"I noticed a couple of the guys down in the chamber with a chisel, breaking "
"off a piece of the sheer wall.  I'm looking the other way.  It's not like the "
"eggheads are going to notice a little piece missing.  Fuck em.\n"
"ENTRY 55:\n"
"Well, the archaeologists are down there now with a couple of the boys as "
"guides.  They're hardly Indiana Jones types; I doubt they been below 20 feet. "
" I hate taking guys off assignment just to babysit the scientists, but if "
"they get hurt we'll be shut down for god knows how long.\n"
"ENTRY 58:\n"
"They're bringing in ANOTHER CREW?  Christ, it's just some cave carvings!  I "
"know that's sort of a big deal, but come on, these guys can't handle it?"
msgstr ""
"条目54：\n"
"我注意到下面房间里有几个人拿着凿子，正在凿其中一堵陡峭墙壁。我假装没看到。那帮呆头鹅一般的考古学家应该不会发现断壁有一小块缺口。一帮傻叉。\n"
"条目55：\n"
"好吧，这帮考古学者跟着一帮做向导的菜鸟下去了。但是他们看上去并不是印第安纳琼斯啊。我怀疑他们有没有下过地下20英寸（约6"
"米）。没想到还得给这帮科学家当保姆，可要是他们有个缺胳膊少腿的，天知道我们这矿井又得被关闭多久。\n"
"条目58：\n"
"他们还要再派一个考古小组？天啊，不就是几个洞窟雕刻吗？我知道这是件大事，但是拜托，这些家伙处理不了吗？"

#: data/json/snippets/amigara.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "amigara4"
msgid ""
"MINE OPERATIONS SUSPENDED; CONTROL TRANSFERRED TO AMIGARA PROJECT UNDER "
"IMPERATIVE 2:07B.\n"
"FAULTLINE SOUNDING HAS PLACED DEPTH AT 30.09 KM.\n"
"DAMAGE TO FAULTLINE DISCOVERED; NEPOWER MINE CREW PLACED UNDER ARREST FOR "
"VIOLATION OF REGULATION 87.08 AND TRANSFERRED TO LAB 89-C FOR USE AS "
"SUBJECTS.\n"
"QUALITY OF FAULTLINE NOT COMPROMISED.\n"
"INITIATING STANDARD TREMOR TEST…"
msgstr ""
"矿场作业暂停；根据命令2:07b将控制权移交给阿弥壳计划。\n"
"经测量裂痕深度为30.09km。\n"
"已检测到断层伤害；因违反第87.08条规定而逮捕了东北能源矿区所有成员并移送至89-C实验室作为测试对象使用。\n"
"断层质量未受损坏。\n"
"正在启动标准地震测试……"

