#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
msgid ""
"\"Dear diary.  Mommy and dad have been making us live in the basement for the "
"last few days.  It's to keep us safe, they say, but it gets really stuffy "
"during the night and I can't sleep, so I sometimes sneak upstairs.  Sometimes "
"I talk to Aunt Maria.  She always stays in the back yard and appears when the "
"sky goes all weird and when scary noises come from outside.  I always ask her "
"to come in, but she tells me she can't and that I should go out instead.  I "
"think it's because dad doesn't want her around, he always told me she died in "
"2001.  He's a liar, and I think he wants the monsters to eat her.  The door's "
"always locked, but I can reach the garage controls.\""
msgstr ""
"「親愛的日記。這幾天爸爸媽媽讓我們住在地下室。他們說這是為了保證我們的安全，但晚上真的很悶，我睡不著，所以有時我會偷偷跑上樓。有時我和瑪麗亞阿姨說話。她總是"
"呆在後院，當天空變得怪異以及外面傳來可怕的噪音時，她就會出現。我總是請她進來，但她告訴我她不能進來，並叫我出去陪她。我想這是因為爸爸不想讓她在身邊，他總是告"
"訴我她在2001年去世了。他是個騙子，我想他想讓怪物吃掉她。正門總是鎖著的，但我可以摸到車庫門的開關。」"

