msgid "Selfie with a monster"
msgstr "与怪物的合照"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"One of the more recent photos is a bald man with a beard taking a selfie on a "
"trail, with a tall black figure - that you recognize as one of the monsters "
"you saw mindlessly wandering around - in the midground facing him.  The man's "
"face is a mixture of confusion and an awkward smile."
msgstr ""
"最近的一张照片里，有个秃顶蓄须的男人在小径上自拍。背景中赫然立着个高大的黑色身影——你认出那正是游荡的怪物之一——正朝他迎面而立。男人脸上混杂着困惑与尴尬的"
"笑容。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Rat infestation"
msgstr "大鼠出没"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This is a video that was taken in a subway train.  Someone is obviously "
"giggling at someone reading a comically large newspaper when the train "
"suddenly halts and an unnaturally big rat scurries off into the darkness, "
"barely visible but its eyes reflect the light from the interior of the train. "
" You can hear a muffled \"What the fuck\" and the video ends with the train "
"continuing to the next station."
msgstr ""
"这是一段在地铁列车上拍摄的视频。当火车突然停下来时，一只不自然的大老鼠跑进了黑暗中，几乎看不见，但它的眼睛反射着火车内部的光线。显然，有人正对着一份滑稽的大"
"报纸咯咯笑着。你可以听到一声低沉的“他妈的”，视频以列车继续驶向下一站而结束。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Forum question about unknown plant"
msgstr "奇特植物的论坛讨论"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"A screenshot of a post in a very vintage looking forum about plants.\n"
"\n"
"Subject: Help identifying these weeds\n"
"Author: WildVariety\n"
"\n"
"\"I tried making my garden more suitable for bees and other insects by using "
"native flora but these poppies are looking unusual.  Are these really "
"poppies?  I can't stand their smell, it makes me feel woozy.\"\n"
"\n"
"An image is attached, showing a giant red flower with roots visible above "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"一个看起来非常复古的关于植物的论坛上的一篇帖子的屏幕截图。\n"
"\n"
"主题：帮助识别这些杂草\n"
"作者：WildVarity\n"
"\n"
"“我试着用当地的植物让我的花园更适合蜜蜂和其他昆虫，但这些罂粟花看起来很不寻常。这些罂粟真的是罂粟花吗？我受不了它们的气味，让我感到头晕。”\n"
"\n"
"附上一张图片，显示了一朵巨大的红花，根部在地面上可见。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Kitten on hunting"
msgstr "捕猎的猫咪"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"untitled2047-1803.mp4\n"
"\n"
"The video shows a patio door and some happy meowing can be heard.\n"
"\"Aww, Muffin, have you slain a leaf or grass hopper again?\" a feminine "
"voice asks.  A cat appears in front of the door and drops a crow, dripping "
"with black goo.  \"Eww, you shouldn't hunt birds!\", she turns around and is "
"visibly nervous.  \"Honey, what the hell is that?  Was that poor bird caught "
"in an oil spill?\""
msgstr ""
"无标题2047-1803.mp4\n"
"\n"
"视频显示一扇露台玻璃门，传来欢快的猫叫声。\"哎呀，松饼，你又捕到树叶还是蚂蚱啦？\"女声问道。一只花猫出现在门前，扔下只乌鸦——那鸟尸正滴落黑色黏液。\""
"呕！不许抓鸟！\"她转身时明显紧张起来。\"亲爱的，那鬼东西是什么？那只可怜的鸟是沾上石油了吗？\""

