#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"A series of 39 photographs were taken in the span of 2 minutes, all of them "
"blurry and only lit by the phone's camera flash, of a street in the dark.  "
"The final 2 photographs have the vague outline of several zombies in the "
"background, the camera flash reflecting in their eyes."
msgstr ""
"一系列在2分钟内连续拍摄了的39"
"张照片，这些照片都是模糊的，只被手机的相机闪光灯照亮，照片中的街道完全陷入了黑暗。最后两张照片的背景是几只丧尸的模糊轮廓，它们的眼睛里反射着相机的闪光灯。"

