msgstr "非发送的消息"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"A series of messages from the chat app\n"
"\"HONEY!!!\"\n"
"\"Take the kids and hide in the basement, I don't care if the roach "
"exterminator hasn't arrived yet, there is a huge riot happening out there!  I "
"will come back from work once the riot has settled down, i stuck in traffic.  "
"Please stay safe!  I love you!\"\n"
"The message is highlighted in red, as it was not sent."
msgstr ""
"聊天应用发来的一系列消息\n"
"“亲爱的！”\n"
"“带着孩子们躲到地下室去，我不在乎灭蟑螂的人还没到，外面发生了一场大骚乱！一旦骚乱平息下来，我会下班回来的，我被堵在路上了。请注意安全！我爱你！”\n"
"下面消息以红色突出显示，因为它没有发送成功。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "video of mutated crabs"
msgstr "变异螃蟹视频"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"untitled2047-1919.mp4\n"
"The video is taken by a person poking a black motionless crab-looking "
"creature with a stick.  They try to flip the creature over, when it moves and "
"suddenly jumps towards the camera.  You hear a scream and some distant "
"shuffling, but for the next 2 hours and 24 minutes the video seems to contain "
"only clouds slowly passing by the dropped smartphone until its battery dies."
msgstr ""
"未命名2047-1919.mp4\n"
"这段视频是由一个人用棍子戳一只黑色的一动不动的螃蟹生物拍摄的。当它移动并突然跳向摄像机时，他们试图将它翻过来。你听到了尖叫声和远处的拖着脚步的声音，但在接下"
"来的2小时24分钟里，视频中似乎只有云从掉落的智能手机上慢慢过去，直到电池耗尽。"

