msgstr "无壳子弹试射视频"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/taufledermaus_8x40_shooting.mp4.\n"
"\n"
"A middle aged man in a field shows off some pricey looking caseless "
"cartridges for an even pricier looking handgun, before shooting them at a "
"range of targets.  A slo-mo camera catches the shots ripping through a block "
"of ballistic gel like air."
msgstr ""
"下载/taufledermaus_8x40_Shooting.mp4.\n"
"\n"
"一名中年男子在田野里炫耀着一些看起来昂贵的无壳子弹，然后向一系列目标开枪。一台SLO-MO相机捕捉到了镜头穿过一块像空气一样的弹道凝胶。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "LARP went wrong"
msgstr "失控的真人游戏"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"One big footage for some live-action roleplay game, which is mostly "
"unremarkable until some guy with bloodstained clothes arrives running and "
"panting.  \"We need to evacuate.  Hayneth went crazy and someone brought real "
"steel weapons.  It's a bloodbath.  Everyone fights against everyone and it "
"has become one hell of a brawl.  Tim, call the cops right NOW.\" As the "
"camera man utters \"Are… are you serious, dude?\" in disbelief, a bloodied "
"warrior clad in foam armor can be seen in the distance and emits a "
"bloodcurdling war cry.  \"Shit!\", the camera man turns around.  After a "
"couple seconds of very shaky forest floor impressions, the video ends."
msgstr ""
"一段普通的真人角色扮演游戏录像，原本平淡无奇，直到一个浑身血污的男人气喘吁吁地冲进画面。\""
"快撤！海涅丝疯了，有人带了真家伙。现在完全是大屠杀，所有人都在互相厮杀，简直成了人间地狱。蒂姆，立刻报警！\"摄像师难以置信地嘟囔着\"老兄..."
"你认真的吗？\"时，远处出现了一个身穿泡沫盔甲的血腥战士，发出令人毛骨悚然的战吼。\"操！\"摄像师转身就跑。画面剧烈晃动了几秒森林地面后，视频戛然而止。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
