"（注：《哈利波特》台词\"You're a wizard, Harry\"）"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "CCTV of nuclear detonation"
msgstr "核爆监控录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"A short, silent CCTV tape of some small rest stop near a highway.  The whole "
"video is pretty glitched, and some parts are completely pitch black.  Near "
"the end, a huge explosion can be seen on the horizon, all while the camera "
"obviously malfunctions.  After a second, a grim and unnervingly familiar "
"mushroom cloud rises from the same spot, and the video ends."
msgstr ""
"一段静默的高速公路休息站监控录像。画面布满干扰条纹，部分片段完全漆黑。临近结尾时，地平线上突然爆发出剧烈闪光，监控镜头随即剧烈抖动。下一秒，熟悉的狰狞蘑菇云"
"从同一位置腾起——视频戛然而止。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Video of conspiracy theorist"
msgstr "阴谋论视频"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/government_lies_to_you.mp4\n"
"\n"
"A 20 minute video of some freak with a lot of trinkets on his body, who tries "
"to explain that the mass hysteria cases aren't caused by Chinese mind control "
"agents.  His own version, that it was the work of \"mushroom people I saw a "
"few days ago\" doesn't sound correct either."
msgstr ""
"下载/政府骗了你.mp4\n"
"\n"
"这是一段 20 "
"分钟的视频，视频中有个身上挂满了奇怪装饰品的怪人，他试图解释说，大规模狂躁症病例不是由中国精神控制剂引起的。他按自己的说法，这是\"几天前我看到的蘑菇人\""
"干的好事，但这听起来也不像是真相。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"An image from some movie, featuring a funky long-haired man, that says \"The "
"last 24 hours have been really exciting\"."
msgstr "一部电影中的一张图片，主角是一个时髦的长发男人，上面写道：“过去的24小时真的很令人兴奋”。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Weird CCTV footage"
msgstr "诡异监控录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Monochrome security camera footage of an intersection that was recorded on "
"April 15th.\n"
"\n"
"23:39: A person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits them at "
"full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, while the body is left "
"where it is.\n"
"23:50: Another person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car runs the "
"person over at full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, while "
"the body is left near the first victim.\n"
"00:01: Some person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits the "
"person at full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, with the "
"third body near the original two\n"
"The tape was cut here, to show the very end of the story\n"
"4:15: you see a giant pile of corpses, of at least two dozen bodies, each "
"wearing the same set of clothes.  Despite this, it seems that both drivers "
"and pedestrians do not care about it, simply trying to drive around the pile. "
" Another person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits them at "
"breakneck speed.  The driver seems unable to drive away, as the car is stuck "
"in the pile, so they leave the car, and try to push it out.  Some passing "
"pedestrians try to help them, and with some help the car gets unstuck.  The "
"driver drives away from the intersection, and the tape ends."
msgstr ""
"4月15日某十字路口的黑白监控影像\n"
"\n"
"23:39 行人横穿马路时，被疾驰车辆当场撞飞。肇事车辆扬长而去，尸体横陈路中\n"
"23:50 又一名行人试图过街，遭超速车辆碾压。司机逃逸后，尸体与首名遇难者叠在一起\n"
"00:01 第三人走向斑马线时，被飞驰汽车撞得粉碎。三具尸体在监控画面中形成三角阵列\n"
"（录像经过剪辑，直接跳转到最终章）\n"
"4:15 "
"尸堆已堆积成两三层楼高的小山，至少二十多具穿着同款服装的遗体。往来车辆与行人对尸山视若无睹，只是机械地绕行。当最新受害者被撞飞时，肇事车辆卡在尸堆中无法移动"
"。司机下车推搡车辆时，路过的行人竟纷纷上前帮忙。最终众人合力推出陷车，肇事者扬长而去——录像到此中断"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Photo of sliced piece of house"
msgstr "片状房屋照片"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"The photo depicts a serene and well-maintained terrace basked in warm, clear "
"weather.  The central part of the picture is an intriguing sight, where a "
"section of the terrace and a portion of the building behind it appear to have "
"been cleanly removed, as if erased from reality.  To the side, there is a "
"shattered flower pot, spilling out its soil and a plant with long, broad "
"leaves, some of which have also been cut away in a sharp, clean fashion, "
"almost as if sliced with a knife."
msgstr ""
"照片拍摄于一个阳光和煦的午后，整洁的露台透着岁月静好的气息。然而画面中央却呈现诡异景象——露台与后方建筑的一部分如同被橡皮擦抹去般凭空消失。画面边缘有个碎裂"
"的花盆，泥土间横陈着被切断的阔叶植物，切口平整得如同被利刃划过。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Footage of army assault"
msgstr "军队突击录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"untitled2047-2842.mp4\n"
"The video starts with a shaky view of a deserted city street, filmed through "
"a pane of glass framed by drawn curtains.  The grind of tracks and base-growl "
"of an engine dominate the choppy audio as an Abrams tank rumbles into view, "
"flanked by several squads of armed soldiers running beside the vehicle.  "
"Locked behind the rubber shell of a gas mask, each man carries an automatic "
"rifle, skulking carefully along the sides of the tank as the group proceeds "
"down the road.  As the view pans, a soldier leading the column briefly pauses "
"by a blown-open cellar, the cameraman audibly whispering hurried prayers as "
"the infantryman trains their rifle on the abyss.  The view jerks sharply as a "
"glistening, artery-like appendage writhes from an unseen point, crashing "
"through the soldier's mask and bursting out the back of their skull before "
"yanking them from the ground.  The desperate liturgies grow louder as the "
"view tilts up and reveals the opposite building's roof line, thickly coated "
"in a crust of churning cytoplasm and organ-like flesh, and over which the "
"hapless soldier's body is dragged out of sight, before a waterfall of blood "
"erupts and spurts across the convoy.  As the cameraman whimpers in terror, a "
"nightmarish, spidery amalgamation of flesh and bones clambers over the roof's "
"edge and plunges into the amassed soldiers.  The scene erupts in a mass of "
"gunfire and frantic screams."
msgstr ""
"未命名2047-2842.mp4 \n"
"\n"
"摇晃的镜头透过窗帘缝隙拍摄荒废的街道。履带碾轧声与引擎轰鸣中，一辆艾布拉姆斯坦克率领数支步兵小队推进。每个戴着防毒面具的士兵都紧握自动步枪，以坦克为掩体谨慎"
"前行。当镜头扫过一处炸开的地窖时，领头士兵突然驻足瞄准黑暗——拍摄者急促的祷告声里，一条血管状触须猛然刺穿其面具，从后脑爆出后将整个人拽离地面。 \n"
"\n"
"倾斜的镜头向上露出对面建筑屋顶：那里覆盖着沸腾的胞浆与脏器状组织，被拖走的士兵在血肉瀑布般的喷溅中消失。当拍摄者发出呜咽时，噩梦般的骨肉混合体正从屋顶边缘扑"
"向军队。画面最终淹没在枪火与惨叫声中。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Video of flying insects attack"
msgstr "飞虫袭击录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Peering down from what appears to be a security camera mount, this "
"monochromatic segment of footage is focused on a section of airport taxiway.  "
"A solitary, desert-drab plane rests upon the stretch of concrete, its "
"boarding stairs lowered, and its twin engines whining as it idles, the drone "
"of its motors almost eclipsing the distant screams and gunfire occasionally "
"conveyed through the crackling audio.  Minutes into the tape, a small group "
"of ragged people burst into view: assorted individuals in civilian garb "
"flanked by a scattering of soldiers, all running headlong towards the "
"aircraft.  A small child can be seen at the rear of the group, half carried "
"by a serviceman and lagging behind the main body.  Suddenly, a violent "
"flutter of gossamer wings fills the view as a dog-sized insectoid lunges past "
"the camera, the colorful wasp alighting on the child's back and snapping "
"large mandibles about them.  As a sickening, writhing carpet of wasps swarms "
"into view and the group's front-runners begin to hurry up the aircraft's "
"steps, a terrible game of tug of war ensues between the soldier and the "
"ever-growing number of frenzied parasitoids, culminating in the man reeling "
"back, showered in spurting blood, and clutching the child's chewed-off arm.  "
"As the screaming child is subsumed beneath a twitching carapace of legs and "
"pulsating ovipositors and the soldier is forced up the stairs, he pulls a "
"pistol and fires wildly into the swarm, the ammunition depleting before he's "
"dragged into the aircraft.  The last thing that the camera records is a "
"spherical object being flung from the plane's closing door—the item pinging "
"off the taxiing aircraft's wing and rolling into the frenzied crowd.  The "
"plane powers out of sight, moments before the footage goes white."
msgstr ""
"黑白画面从监控探头俯拍着停机坪区域。一架土黄色客机孤零零停在混凝土跑道上，舷梯垂落，双引擎怠速运转的嗡鸣几乎盖过远处零星的枪声与惨叫。 \n"
"\n"
"数分钟后，一群衣衫褴褛的逃亡者闯入镜头：平民装扮的男女被零星士兵护卫着冲向飞机。队伍末尾有个被军人半抱着的小男孩，正逐渐落后于主力。突然纱翼震颤声炸响，犬只"
"大小的斑斓巨蜂掠过监控探头，锋利口器钳住孩童后背。 \n"
"\n"
"当蜂群形成蠕动的活体地毯涌来时，领先者已冲上舷梯。士兵与疯狂增殖的寄生蜂展开惨烈拉锯战，最终他溅满鲜血踉跄后退，手中只抓着孩子被啃断的手臂。在孩童被脉动产卵"
"器与节肢组成的活体棺材吞没时，士兵被迫退向机舱，掏出手枪对蜂群胡乱射击直至子弹耗尽。 \n"
"\n"
"录像最后记录到：某个球状物从闭合的舱门抛出，在机翼上弹跳后滚入蜂群。飞机加速驶离的瞬间，监控画面变成雪白噪点。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "GET WELL SOON!"
msgstr "早日康复！"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"untitled2047-1564.mp4\n"
"\n"
"In what might be the first cheerful voices you've heard since the Cataclysm, "
"a muddle of laughs and good-natured conversation fills the recording's audio. "
" The view is filled by a small group of grinning college-age individuals "
"crowding in a haphazard line before the camera, a network of tents and "
"camping equipment visible in the gloom-shrouded field behind them.\n"
"\n"
"\"Hey Mallick\" chirps a feminine voice as the film pans across the assembly, "
"a handful of whooped salutations accompanying the speaker's voice.  \"We all "
"heard about you being laid up in the hospital after the scuffle in <city> "
"last week, and we wanted to say that we're actually really missing your "
"broken ass out here in bum fuck nowhere.  We're recording this video cause we "
"wanted to tell you…\"\n"
"\n"
"\"GET WELL SOON!\" As the raucous chorus of disjointed good wishes dies down, "
"the friends' grins rapidly melt away and are replaced by a look of unified "
"confusion as the call… repeats.  An uneasy silence falls across the group as, "
"from an unseen point in the darkness, the chant resounds, growing more "
"distorted and twisted with each inhuman repetition.  A muttered \"What the "
"fuck?\" can be heard as the call continues, seeming to grow louder or closer, "
"now accompanied with the audible crunch of trampled vegetation.  Nervously, a "
"young man draws a 10mm pistol from beneath his jacket and opens his mouth, "
"before a shapeless, pink mass gallops from the gloom behind him on many "
"nimble legs, wrapping mauve tendrils about his head as it grips his shoulders "
"with twitching claws, before wrenching its horrific tendrils and ripping the "
"man's head clean off.\n"
"\n"
"\"GET WELL SOON!\" screams the Mi-go, blood showering from its fleshy, "
"flower-like head before it lunges at the camera."
msgstr ""
"未命名2047-1564.mp4\n"
"\n"
"（这可能是大灾变后你听到的第一阵欢快声音）录音里混杂着笑声和善意的交谈。镜头前挤着一群咧嘴傻笑的大学生，在摄像机前站成歪歪扭扭的队列，他们身后幽暗的旷野上散"
"布着帐篷和野营器材。\n"
"\n"
"\"嘿马利克\"当镜头扫过人群时，一个女声轻快地说道，伴随着几声欢呼的问候。\"听说你上周在1"
"号区的混战中受伤住院了，我们想说你那欠揍的混蛋样儿在这鸟不拉屎的地方还真让人惦记。录这个视频是想告诉你......\"\n"
"\n"
"\"早日康复！\"杂乱无章的祝福声渐渐平息时，朋友们笑容突然凝固，取而代之的是集体困惑的表情——因为那个呼唤..."
"重复响起了。不安的沉默笼罩人群，黑暗中看不见的某处，那声呼唤不断回荡，每次非人的重复都变得更加扭曲。\"搞什么鬼？\""
"有人低声咒骂。呼唤声持续着，似乎越来越近，此刻还夹杂着植被被践踏的脆响。一个年轻人紧张地从夹克里掏出10"
"毫米手枪，正要开口——突然一团无定形的粉色肉团从身后幽暗中窜出，多只灵活的肢体飞奔而来，紫红色触须缠住他的头颅，抽搐的爪子扣住肩膀，接着猛力一扯——将他的脑"
"袋齐根撕下。\n"
"\n"
"\"早日康复！\"米-戈发出尖啸，血肉模糊的花苞状头颅喷洒着鲜血扑向镜头。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "What the fuck"
msgstr "这他妈什么鬼东西"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This appears to have been a segment of let's play footage, a face-cam section "
"occupying the film's upper corner and depicting an unshaven man sitting "
"within a windowed bedroom.  Maintaining an enthused monolog, the youth's "
"upbeat commentary plods along for most of the video, undisturbed by "
"intermittent, inhuman screams and distant detonations.  Indeed, even when the "
"sky beyond his window abruptly darkens, the man shows little reaction save "
"for moving to turn on an adjacent lamp, his commentary swiftly resuming "
"despite the device failing to turn on.\n"
"\n"
"Minutes pass, and, following a particularly violent glitch, an amorphous, "
"white shape can be seen suspended in the gloom, some distance beyond the "
"window.  A chain of malfunctions suddenly begins, each glitch rendering the "
"screen dark.  With every glitch, the form grows steadily closer until its "
"visage is suddenly pressed against the glass.  Bearing the shape of a woman, "
"with patches of fish-like scales knitting between jagged rows of protruding "
"teeth that emerge from its skin, the naked aberration grins with a mouth full "
"of slithering tentacles, its eye sockets replaced by gnashing maws, and many "
"dozens of staring eyes sunken into its undulating flesh.  Another malfunction "
"darkens the screen, only for the view to be nearly subsumed by the "
"nightmare's writhing face when vision returns, the creature's rotten, bloated "
"body merging straight through the still-babbling man's trunk.  A final "
"malfunction robs the footage of visuals, and when it returns, only the man "
"can be seen—sitting quietly alone, his bloodied, empty eye sockets staring at "
"the camera, his toothless maw gaping.  The film goes black, and for the final "
"minutes, only the man's soft crying can be heard."
msgstr ""
"这段视频似乎是某个实况主的直播片段，画面左上角的小窗里有个胡子拉碴的男人坐在带窗户的卧室中。年轻人全程保持着亢奋的独白，欢快的解说在大部分时间里平稳进行，偶"
"尔夹杂的非人尖叫和远处爆炸声都没能打断他。即便窗外天色骤然转暗，他也只是伸手去拧旁边的台灯——当发现灯没亮时，他的解说立刻又继续了下去。\n"
"几分钟后，在一阵剧烈花屏后，能看到窗外远处悬浮着模糊的白色人形。随后故障开始接连发生，每次花屏都会让画面变暗。那个形体随着每次故障不断逼近，最终突然将整张脸"
"贴在玻璃上——那是个类似人女性的畸形生物，裸露的皮肤上布满鱼鳞状斑块，参差的牙齿间蠕动着触须组成的口腔，眼窝被不断咬合的嘴部器官取代，数十颗眼球深陷在起伏的"
"皮肉中。又一阵花屏过后，当画面恢复时，这头噩梦造物扭曲的面孔几乎占满整个镜头，它腐烂浮肿的身躯已贯穿了仍在喋喋不休的主播躯干。\n"
"画面再现时只剩主播独自静坐，血淋淋的空眼窝直视镜头，没有牙齿的嘴巴大张着。影片最终陷入黑暗，最后几分钟里还能听到男人轻微的啜泣声。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Fungal bombardment by army"
msgstr "真菌轰炸行动档案"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This is an archived text sent through a messaging app.\n"
"\n"
"L. C. Carlsen: Yo, I just got this pick sent over from my buddy in the Air "
"Force.  Dude, check this shite out.n\n"
"An attached high-resolution photo shows an aerial view of several residential "
"and commercial city blocks, with most of the buildings leveled and heavy bomb "
"damage throughout.  A yawning chasm splits the ground where a main road had "
"evidently lain; the concrete thoroughfare burst open as though from some "
"tremendous subterranean pressure.  Mottled, gray mold cakes the surroundings, "
"swamping debris, street fixtures, and entire vehicles in layers of fungal "
"matter, giant, mushroom-like stems lifting heavy heads to the roofs of "
"buildings.  A solitary soldier stands atop a half-collapsed roof, quivering "
"mold reaching almost level with the structure's parapet.  The quality of the "
"photo is such that you can almost distinguish the individual tears that "
"dampen the soldier's cheeks and trace the bright outline of the flare that "
"they hold above their head."
msgstr ""
"这是一条通过即时通讯软件发送的存档信息\n"
"\n"
"L·C·卡尔森：喂，我刚收到空军兄弟发来的照片。卧槽，你们快看这鬼东西。\n"
"\n"
"随附的高清航拍照片显示：数片居民区与商业街区已沦为废墟，绝大多数建筑被夷为平地，爆炸痕迹遍布整片区域。主干道所在位置裂开狰狞的地缝，混凝土路面像是被某种巨大"
"的地下压力硬生生撕开。斑驳的灰白色菌毯覆盖了所有残骸——路灯、车辆残骸全都被层层真菌物质吞噬，巨型蘑菇状菌柄顶着硕大伞盖直抵楼顶。一名孤独的士兵站在半坍塌的"
"天台上，颤动的菌丝几乎与女儿墙齐平。照片精度极高，甚至能看清士兵脸颊上的泪痕，以及他高举过头顶的照明弹那刺眼的轮廓。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Food Place ad"
msgstr "美食地带广告"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This appears to be a promo video for Food Place brand food, depicting a "
"nondescript drive-through with an idling open-topped convertible containing a "
"family of four.  As the driver is handed a paper bag of generic fast food, a "
"sudden bolt of lightning arcs from the night sky, striking the bag and "
"reducing it to ashes.  With the family left exchanging wide-eyed glances, the "
"growl of an engine becomes audible over a steadily rising crescendo of music. "
" The soundtrack eventually resolves into a rock iteration of the American "
"anthem as a purple motorcycle bursts onto the scene, the Food Place logo "
"stamped upon the side, and its caped rider bearing the noble visage… of Food "
"Person!  Swiftly mounting the car's hood, the motorcycle soars in a "
"slow-motion arc across the convertible, its rider depositing a giant bag of "
"Food Place food into the arms of the cheering family.  Large, metallic text "
"stamps boldly across the view as the bike lands and roars into the distance.\n"
"\n"
"\"Food Place: The hero your stomach doesn't deserve… but needs!\"\n"
"\n"
"The text dissolves, replaced by three figures holding appropriately massive "
"hamburgers: Abraham Lincoln, Martin Luther King, and, in between them… Jesus?\n"
"\n"
"\"Food Place: food made by great Americans… for great Americans!\""
msgstr ""
"这似乎是美食地带品牌的宣传视频：一个普通汽车餐厅里，敞篷车内坐着四口之家。当司机接过纸袋装的标准快餐时，夜空中突然劈下一道闪电，将纸袋瞬间化为灰烬。就在全家"
"人目瞪口呆之际，引擎轰鸣声逐渐压过渐强的背景音乐——最终演变成摇滚版美国国歌！ \n"
"\n"
"紫色摩托车横空出世，车身印着美食地带logo，披风骑士露出威严面容…是美食侠！摩托车以慢动作腾空跃过敞篷车，骑士将巨型美食地带餐袋精准投进欢呼的一家人怀中。"
"机车落地远去的瞬间，金属质感大字震撼霸屏： \n"
"\n"
"\"美食地带—— 你的胃不配......却需要的英雄\" \n"
"\n"
"字幕消散后，三位手持巨型汉堡的人物登场：亚伯拉罕·林肯、马丁·路德·金，以及…中间那位是耶稣？ \n"
"\n"
"\"美食地带——伟大美国人制作…为伟大美国人服务！\" "

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Tourist from Costa Rica"
msgstr "哥斯达黎加游客"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This is an archived voice message sent through a chat app.\n"
"\n"
"The recording opens with the low purr of a vehicle's motor, with various "
"rattling clinks and clangs audible as a man's Hispanic accent forces its way "
"through the choppy audio.  \"HEY CHICA, CAN YOU GIVE A MAN ONE HELL OF A "
"WOOHOO?  I just got off the plane from Costa Rica—one full hour ahead of "
"schedule!  Let me tell you something: the airport was emptier than a fucking "
"graveyard, and the staff, sheesh, jumpier than Pablo when he sees the "
"neighbors' dog.  I didn't know that a few riots would put the fear of God in "
"all you gun-toting Americans, but if they're anything like down in San Jose, "
"I suppose I can't blame people.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the man talks, the regular thump of large helicopter rotors grows audible "
"in the background, the aircraft seeming to roar right overhead as the driver "
"concludes.  \"Anyway, I'm in a rental and heading to <city> right now; I "
"should be there in less than an hour.  I'll get back to you later.  There's a "
"pretty big roadblock ahead, and it looks like they're flagging me down.  I'll "
"see you soon, guapa, love…\"  The recording is cut short by a burst of "
"automatic gunfire."
msgstr ""
"这是一条通过聊天应用发送的语音存档。\n"
"\n"
"录音以车辆引擎低沉的轰鸣声开场，伴随着各种叮叮当当的金属碰撞声。一个带着西班牙口音的男声在断续的音频中费力地传来：\""
"嘿小妞，能给爷们来点刺激的不？我刚从哥斯达黎加的航班下来——比预定时间整整提前了一小时！跟你说，那机场空得跟他妈坟场似的，工作人员紧张得跟巴勃罗看见邻居家的"
"狗一样。没想到几场暴乱就把你们这些扛枪的美国佬吓得屁滚尿流，不过要是跟圣何塞那边的情况差不多，倒也不能怪他们。\"\n"
"\n"
"背景音里直升机桨叶的规律轰鸣越来越响，当说话者总结时，飞行器似乎正从头顶呼啸而过。\""
"总之我现在开着租来的车往<city>赶，不到一小时就能到。待会再联系。前面有个大路障，好像正在示意我停车。待会见啊美人，爱......\" "
"自动武器的扫射声突兀地切断了录音。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Audiomessages of a hiker"
msgstr "登山客录音"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"These are a series of five recent voice recordings, all taken on the same "
"day.\n"
"\n"
"18:31: A throaty, young woman's voice speaks into the microphone, restless "
"footfalls audible in the background.  \"Okay, can we all—that is, me—just "
"admit how fucked up it is that I've resorted to speaking to my phone to keep "
"my nerves from blowing up?  I heard that pretending like someone is listening "
"helps chill you out, but, Jesus, fuck, this ain't working.  Guess it's better "
"to pretend to talk to someone than to stay quiet, though.  Christ.  <city> "
"looked like God had decided to wack out the middle finger: bodies everywhere "
"and massive crowds of folks losing their collective shit.  Thank heaven, I'd "
"been out hiking and was able to turn tail and mosey back where I came from.  "
"I don't know how long I'd been walking before I found this cabin.  The place "
"looked deserted, and the door was unlocked, so I let myself in.  I guess I'll "
"hang out here until something happens.  Definitely better than slogging it "
"outside or trying to go back.\"\n"
"\n"
"19:55: \"You know, whoever owned this shack, you sure had one sick taste in "
"art.  Some of the walls have these largeish, glass-cased portraits that are, "
"honestly, really well painted.  Damn if ain't most of them skinless faces, "
"though.  Oh, and tentacles.  Lots of tentacles.\"  The speaker falls silent "
"as an unearthly squeal echoes in the distance.\n"
"\n"
"23:05: \"Windows.  The portraits were windows.  The faces aren't there "
"anymore.  God, help me.\"\n"
"\n"
"0:21: Amidst what sounds like distant, monstrous whispers and crashing "
"reverberations of unknown origin, the woman's hysterical, shrieking voice "
"sobs.  \"I blacked out a few minutes ago and found myself about to open the "
"front door.  I've tied myself to the stovetop.  They're out there!  They want "
"me to come out!  I don't want to go!  I don't want to!  I don't want…\"\n"
"\n"
"0:44: Interspersed by whining shrieks and heavy pants, the woman's voice "
"struggles to be heard within the distorted recording.  \"Snakes.  I see them! "
" They're everywhere!  They're inside of me; I know it!  slithering!  "
"Crawling!  Writhing!  I need to get them out.  Dear God, get them out of me!  "
"Get them out!\"  The sound of a drawer being wrenched open can be heard, "
"followed by the characteristic clatter of a metallic implement being drawn.  "
"The sickening sound of sawing meat and cracking bones can be heard, all but "
"lost beneath the woman's agonized screams.  For the last 15 minutes of the "
"recording, only the dripping sound of coils of wet, viscous material "
"dribbling to the ground can be heard."
msgstr ""
"徒步者的录音留言\n"
"这是同一天内录制的五段近期语音记录。\n"
"\n"
"18:31：一个沙哑的年轻女声对着麦克风说话，背景里能听到不安的踱步声。\""
"行吧，咱们——不对，就我——能不能承认对着手机说话来防止自己发疯这事儿有多离谱？听说假装有人听着能让人冷静，但操他妈的，根本没用。不过装模作样总比憋着强。老"
"天爷啊..."
"那些<city>的倒霉蛋简直像被上帝比了中指：满地尸体，成群的人集体发狂。幸亏我当时在徒步，还能调头溜回老路。不知道走了多久才找到这个小屋。看着没人，门也没"
"锁，我就进来了。估计得在这儿窝到出状况为止。总比在外头硬扛或者往回走强。\"\n"
"\n"
"19:55：\""
"我说啊，这破屋子的前主人审美真他妈邪门。墙上挂着几幅带玻璃框的大肖像，画得确实牛逼——可大部分都是剥了皮的脸。哦对了，还有触手。满墙都是触手。\""
"远处传来非人般的尖啸时，说话声戛然而止。\n"
"\n"
"23:05：\"那些画...是窗户。脸都不见了。上帝啊救救我。\"\n"
"\n"
"0:21：在仿佛来自深渊的低语和不明原因的撞击回响中，女人歇斯底里的哭喊时断时续。\""
"刚才昏过去，醒来发现自己正要去开前门。现在把自己拴在炉灶上了。它们就在外面！想骗我出去！我不要！我不要！我不要...\"\n"
"\n"
"0:44：录音严重失真，女人的声音混杂着刺耳尖叫和沉重喘息。\""
"蛇。我看见了！到处都是！它们钻进了我身体里，我知道！在爬！在扭！在蠕动！得弄出来。上帝啊，把它们弄出去！弄出去！\""
"抽屉被猛地拉开，金属工具当啷作响。随后是锯开血肉、劈断骨头的黏腻声响，全被凄厉惨叫盖过。最后十五分钟只剩潮湿黏稠的物质滴落在地的啪嗒声。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Footage of feral"
msgstr "Footage of feral"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"The footage opens with an angled view of a rumpled picnic blanket, surrounded "
"by the trunks and gnarled roots of trees and verdant shrubbery crowding the "
"extremities.  The blanket is nearly obscured by the dozing profile of a young "
"woman and three large dogs, one curled around her head like a pillow and the "
"others sprawled across her body.\n"
"\n"
"\"Here, ladies and gentlemen of America,\" speaks a young man's voice into "
"the microphone, \"we view a feral Annaliese in her natural habitat: buried "
"under several kilos of dog.\"  A light chuckle accompanies the remark as the "
"man shifts the view, the camera panning and bringing more of the environment "
"into sight.  The film's transit pauses as a young boy seated upon a bench "
"comes into frame, his face a slack, glass-eyed mask of indifference, a "
"rivulet of drool dribbling from his hanging mouth.  A small dog is perched "
"atop his knees, nuzzling at the child's motionless form and whimpering.\n"
"\n"
"A solitary, strangled yelp escapes the little dog's muzzle as the boy seizes "
"its snout and throat, deftly breaking its neck.  As a stunned \"holy mother "
"of God!\" can be heard from the cameraman, the view growing lopsided as he "
"evidently fumbles the device, a mix of emotions blossoms across the boy's "
"face.  The child's eyes well with tears, his mouth simultaneously twisting in "
"a smile as he systematically sets to snapping the dead dog's bones.  Amidst "
"the flurry of growls and barks emanating from the couple's recently awoken "
"dogs and a muttered, \"Anna, get the dogs and get to the truck; we better "
"leave,\" audible in the background, the video's final shot depicts the boy "
"staring straight into the camera, a goofy grin plastered across his face.  He "
"waves the dead canine's broken arm in a grotesque farewell."
msgstr ""
"镜头以倾斜角度开启：皱巴巴的野餐垫周围盘踞着扭曲的树根，茂密灌木丛挤压着画面边缘。垫子上几乎看不见年轻女子的轮廓——她与三条大狗相拥而眠，其中一条蜷在她头侧"
"当枕头，另两条横压在她身上。\n"
"\n"
"\"各位美国观众请看，\"年轻男声对着麦克风解说，\"这就是野生安娜丽丝的自然生活状态：埋在十几斤的大狗中间。\""
"镜头随着轻笑移动，展现出更多环境细节。画面突然定格：长椅上坐着个眼神呆滞的男孩，口水从张开的嘴角垂落。他膝头趴着的小狗正呜咽着拱动他僵硬的身躯。\n"
"\n"
"男孩突然掐住狗的口鼻扭断其脖颈，摄像机随后传来惊呼，\"圣母啊！\""
"。镜头剧烈晃动间，男孩脸上浮现出诡异的神情：泪水充盈眼眶，嘴角却扭曲成微笑，开始有条不紊地折断死狗的骨头。背景里充斥着惊醒的大狗们的狂吠，\""
"安娜！带狗上皮卡！快走！\"。视频最后定格在男孩直视镜头的画面——他晃动着狗尸断裂的前肢，露出痴呆般的笑容。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "CLEAR THE BRIDGE!"
msgstr "清空桥梁"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Peeking down from a pole mount, this segment of security camera footage films "
"the apex of a bridge overpass's boarding ramp.  A number of large police and "
"military vehicles loom at the concrete incline's foot, with a low line of "
"sandbags forming a makeshift checkpoint behind which several armed national "
"guardsmen and police officers stand at attention.  The view, however, is "
"mainly taken up by a veritable metal wall of civilian vehicles crawling in a "
"haphazard line across the bridge, disheveled groups of exhausted men, women, "
"and children flitting alongside the slow procession of evacuating vehicles.  "
"The footage proceeds in this fashion for several minutes, with new groups of "
"refugees being waved through by the soldiers, before a distant sonic boom "
"resounds through the audio.  Gradually coming to a halt, with the heads of "
"civilians and personnel alike inclined skyward and tense expressions adorning "
"unkempt faces, the stream stands in collective puzzlement as the sound of "
"powerful jet engines can be heard in the background, steadily rising in "
"volume.  The collective apathy dissolves into utter, terrified pandemonium as "
"a large shadow rapidly darkens the overpass and an officer suddenly screams, "
"\"CLEAR THE BRIDGE!\"\n"
"\n"
"With a number of fresh whistling sounds dominating the newly overwhelmed "
"soundscape, soldiers grab those they can and race clear of the checkpoint as "
"panicked civilians fling themselves off the overpass, rapidly joined by the "
"occupants of those vehicles on the edges of the stagnated convoy.  In the "
"last few shots, you can see the drivers of cars at the procession's heart "
"struggle to abandon their vehicles before a sleek form streaks from the sky, "
"the start of an ear-splitting explosion rips through the muddled audio, and "
"the view goes white."
msgstr ""
"这段监控录像从高处的杆架俯拍下来，镜头对准了天桥匝道的顶端。混凝土斜坡底部停着数辆军用警用大型车辆，沙袋堆成的简易检查站后方，几名国民警卫队士兵和警察正持枪"
"警戒。但画面大部分被逃难的车流占据——金属洪流般的民用车辆在桥上歪歪扭扭排成长龙，蓬头垢面的男女老幼沿着缓慢前行的车队仓皇奔走。\n"
"\n"
"录像就这样持续了几分钟，士兵们不断放行新抵达的难民群。直到远处突然传来音爆的轰鸣。车流渐渐停滞，无论是平民还是军警都仰起脏污的脸，在越来越近的喷气引擎声中露"
"出紧张神色。当巨大阴影笼罩天桥时，一名警官突然嘶吼：\"清空桥梁！\"——人群瞬间从麻木陷入彻底的恐慌。\n"
"\n"
"尖锐的呼啸声撕裂了音轨。士兵们拽着能抓住的人逃离检查站，惊惶的平民纷纷跳下天桥，停滞车队边缘的乘客也争先恐后翻越护栏。最后几个镜头里，你能看见核心车流的司机"
"们正拼命爬出车厢。随着流线型黑影从天而降，震耳欲聋的爆炸声吞没了杂音，画面霎时化作惨白。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Todo list"
msgstr "代办事项"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This appears to be somebody's saved to-do list, with a green checkmark "
"rounding off each entry, save for the last.\n"
"\n"
"To-do:\n"
"\n"
"Pack the car with a few weeks worth of provisions: clothes and shoes, "
"toiletries and medications, electronics and games, a portable steamer, and "
"camping equipment (tents, a cooking set, sleeping bags, a propane cooker, and "
"some tanks).  Dig out dad's Vietnam AK47 from the packing boxes in the "
"basement and hunt around for his old reloading equipment (look up how it "
"works).  If the kids ask, just say it's for hunting.\n"
"\n"
"File for extended leave from work and withdraw the kids from school.  If "
"Erith complains about having to leave uni and her girlfriend, say it's only "
"temporary.\n"
"\n"
"Take the car and stop by the supermarket for some pre-packed camping meals "
"before heading to pick up the kids.\n"
"\n"
"Head into Scofield's on the way out of town to pick up some bullets.  Should "
"probably ask Julian for advice and help; he plays videogames with this sort "
"of stuff.  Can I even buy ammo without having a license?  *Just found out "
"that different guns take different bullets and that reloading equipment isn't "
"used to reload guns.  Definitely ask Julian for help.\n"
"\n"
"Take the highway out north and meet up with Sandra at the rest stop 10 miles "
"out before traveling to her place in Rhode Island."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是某人保存的待办事项清单，每项都打着绿色对勾，唯独最后一条还没完成。\n"
"\n"
"待办事项：\n"
"\n"
"往车里塞够几周用的物资：衣服鞋子、洗漱用品和药品、电子设备和游戏机、便携蒸锅，还有野营装备（帐篷、炊具、睡袋、丙烷炉和几罐燃料）。去地下室打包箱里翻出老爸的"
"越战时期AK47，再找找他当年用的复装工具（查下怎么用）。孩子们要是问起来，就说是打猎用的。\n"
"\n"
"向公司申请长假，给孩子们办理休学手续。要是艾里斯抱怨要离开大学和女友，就说只是暂时的。\n"
"\n"
"开车顺路去超市买些即食野营餐，再去接孩子们。\n"
"\n"
"出城时绕到斯科菲尔德枪店买子弹。最好先问问朱利安的建议，那小子常玩这类生存游戏。没持枪证能买弹药吗？*"
"刚发现不同枪械要用不同子弹，复装工具也不是用来装弹的。必须找朱利安帮忙。\n"
"\n"
"沿北向高速公路开十英里，在休息站和桑德拉碰头，然后一起去她在罗德岛的住处"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Eco-rights protests schedule"
msgstr "生态权益抗议活动日程"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This appears to be a screen shot of a social media blog post, with the view "
"dominated by a full-color picture of a futuristic-looking wind turbine "
"standing tall against a backdrop of rolling hills and verdant pastures.  "
"Looming atop a distant mound squats a large nuclear energy facility, with a "
"forbiddingly dark mushroom cloud blossoming in the air above it and the "
"surrounding land a toxic, radioactive-green wasteland.  Regally poised atop "
"one of the turbine's blades stands a diminutive figure, bark-like skin "
"cladding them like armor and flowering buds crowning their scalp.  An estoc "
"carved from wood is securely wielded in their vine-composed arms and thrusts "
"towards the mushroom cloud, with the caption, \"Thrust Away Nuclear Energy, "
"Stab into the Future of Clean Electricity,\" looming over the scene.  The "
"rest of the post details the time and location arrangements for an eco-rights "
"protest in Vermont, scheduled to take place weeks before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是一张社交媒体博文的截图，画面中央矗立着一座造型前卫的风力发电机，背景是连绵起伏的丘陵与葱郁牧场。远处山丘上盘踞着庞大的核能设施，上方翻腾着不祥的暗色"
"蘑菇云，周围土地已化作泛着辐射绿光的废土。风车叶片顶端傲然立着个矮小身影，树皮般的皮肤如同铠甲，头顶盛开着花蕾。它用藤蔓构成的手臂紧握木制穿甲剑，直指蘑菇云"
"，配文\"刺穿核能阴云，剑指清洁能源未来\""
"悬于画面上方。帖子其余部分详细列出了佛蒙特州生态权益抗议活动的时间地点安排——这场集会预定在大灾变降临前数周举行。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Violence at eco-rights protests"
msgstr "生态权益抗议活动暴动"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"untitled2047-1676.mp4\n"
"The roof of a pickup truck slopes out of sight at the lowest extremities of "
"the video's view, with the rumble of the idling vehicle's engine all but lost "
"under the angered uproar of the veritable sea of people that crowd, stomp, "
"and chant for as far as the eye can see.  What appears to be a nuclear "
"reactor facility looms in the background, the mob's front ranks pressed "
"against the shuddering security fence encompassing the compound, a number of "
"nervous-looking, rifle-clutching guards standing behind the barrier.  "
"Interspersed among the horde are various people waving handmade signs, "
"fleeting glances at the boards affording a view of a painted, plant-like "
"anthropoid brandishing a sword towards a stylized mushroom cloud.  The chant, "
"\"FUCK OSWALD, FUCK NUCLEAR POWER, FUCK YOUR MOTHER!\" resounds through the "
"crackling audio, eventually dissolving into a tumult of enraged shrieks as "
"the guardsmen raise their rifles and fire a volley of warning shots over the "
"heads of the throng.  To a man, the crowd surges forward in heightened "
"fervor, flinging themselves against the fence line, with a handful even "
"attempting to scale the barrier.  Any further observation is cut short as the "
"truck's engine roars and the vehicle barrels forward, the cameraman flung "
"from the pickup's roof and rolling beneath the chassis.  The footage captures "
"a brief blur of speeding metal and the sickening sound of several tons of "
"vehicle crushing bodies before the tremendous crash of collapsing girders and "
"a series of savage, approving screams resound.  Lopsided and glitching, the "
"final moments of footage tapes a rush of legs storming past, the audio "
"capturing a rattle of frantic gunfire, triumphant and terrified shrieks, and "
"the meaty, splitting tear of limbs being forcibly wrenched from their sockets."
msgstr ""
"未命名2047-1676.mp4\n"
"视频底部可见皮卡车顶的一角，引擎空转的轰鸣几乎被铺天盖地的人潮怒吼淹没。目力所及之处尽是攒动的人头，示威者跺脚高喊，远处核反应堆设施阴森矗立。人群前锋推搡着"
"震颤的防护栅栏，后方持枪警卫面色紧张。抗议队伍中零星可见挥舞手绘标语牌的身影，匆匆一瞥可见画着植物状人形持剑刺向蘑菇云的图案。此起彼伏的\""
"去他妈的奥斯瓦尔德！去他妈的核能！去他妈的混账！\""
"口号伴随电流杂音炸响，最终在警卫朝天鸣枪示警时化作暴怒的尖叫狂潮。人群如熔岩般沸腾前涌，有人开始攀爬栅栏。随着皮卡突然加速，拍摄者从车顶滚落底盘下方。模糊画"
"面中闪过疾驰的金属，数吨重的车体碾过肉体的闷响，紧接着是钢梁坍塌的轰隆与阵阵嗜血的欢呼。最后几帧扭曲影像里，无数腿脚狂奔而过，背景音交织着凌乱枪声、胜利嚎叫"
"与令人毛骨悚然的肢体撕裂声。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Crazed horse"
msgstr "疯马"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This security tape captures the view of a rural gas station and the deserted, "
"tree-fringed roadway beyond.  The space beside one of the gas pumps is soon "
"filled as a large 4x4 motors into the frame, towing a bouncing and rocking "
"animal carriage behind it.  As the truck pulls up and a burly, bearded man "
"clambers out, insistent whinnies and heavy bangs emanate from the trailer's "
"interior.  Brows knit in concern, the driver potters with the pump as the "
"trailer trembles and shakes with the struggles of its displeased captive, the "
"neighs growing ever harsher and verging on a distorted scream by the time the "
"man's finished tending to his vehicle.  After he finishes gassing up, the "
"motorist replaces the nozzle and approaches the trailer, rapping on its side.\n"
"\n"
"\"Blacky,\" he calls out, \"the hell is wrong with you in there?\"\n"
"\n"
"A crushing blow bulges the trailer's shell, causing it to sway violently as "
"rivets burst and the man staggers back.  With successive blows shattering the "
"trailer's side panels, the head of a horse eventually forces its way through "
"a widening crack, shards of jagged metal stripping the flesh from its skull "
"as it struggles.  Scrambling to the door of his 4x4, the driver flings "
"himself into the vehicle as the undead beast crashes free, sniffing the air "
"for a few moments before rearing up and bringing its front hooves down on the "
"truck's windshield.  Cowering out of sight, the man's sobbing pleas and "
"screams are audible as the heavy utility vehicle is pummeled into a crumpled "
"wreck, the heap of mobile sinew that used to be his steed struggling to push "
"its snapping snout through the shattered window.\n"
"\n"
"Tearing the driver's side door free with a screech of ripping metal, the "
"animal tosses its head and lets loose a malformed shriek before it plunges "
"into the peeled-open cabin.  Muscles rippling and thrashing, the horse's "
"metal-flayed bulk obscures much of the scene, though the man's rising "
"screams, the nauseating sounds of bones being torn from their homes, and the "
"sprays of viscera pulsing through the vehicle's open gaps attest well enough "
"to the quadruped's brutal work."
msgstr ""
"这段监控录像拍摄到一座乡间加油站，以及树影斑驳的荒废公路。当一辆巨型越野车拖着颠簸摇晃的动物运输车厢闯入画面时，加油机旁的空地顿时被填满。卡车刚停稳，满脸络"
"腮胡的壮汉便爬出驾驶室，而拖车内部不断传出嘶鸣与沉重撞击声。司机皱眉摆弄油枪时，拖车因囚徒的激烈挣扎不停震颤，嘶鸣声逐渐扭曲成近乎尖叫的怪响。\n"
"\n"
"加完油后，司机挂回油枪走向拖车，敲击厢壁喊道：\"小黑，你他妈发什么疯？\"\n"
"\n"
"伴随金属撕裂的巨响，拖车外壳猛然凸起，铆钉迸射让壮汉踉跄后退。连续重击下，一匹马的头部终于冲破变形的侧板，挣扎时被锯齿状金属剥去了头皮的血肉。司机刚扑进越野"
"车，这头不死坐骑就彻底挣脱束缚，昂首嗅探数秒后扬起前蹄砸向挡风玻璃。\n"
"\n"
"当重型越野车被捶打成废铁时，可以听见男人躲在车内的哭嚎。那团曾经是骏马的蠕动筋肉正试图将獠牙密布的吻部挤进碎裂的车窗。随着金属撕裂的尖啸，怪物扯飞车门，发出"
"畸形嘶吼扑进敞开的驾驶室。尽管被血肉模糊的马身遮挡了大半视野，但男人骤然拔高的惨叫、骨骼被扯离关节的黏腻声响，以及从车身缝隙喷溅而出的内脏碎块，无不昭示着这"
"头四足怪物正在实施的暴行。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "deconstruct_your_fortunes_trailer.mp4"
msgstr "《拆解命运》电影预告片"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/deconstruct_your_fortunes_trailer.mp4\n"
"\n"
"The trailer opens with a low, orchestral rumble as the camera moves slowly "
"down a deserted, urban street.  \"Things were never the same after they "
"came,\" rumbles the booming voice of a narrator as the camera slinks past "
"decrepit structures, all devoid of any internal furnishings and missing walls "
"and roofs.  \"Swapping dirt for concrete, flesh for steel, and life for "
"business, they've left it all to rot.\"  Gliding past stacks of lumber and "
"other materials, the view homes in on a solitary building, zooming in through "
"a window and capturing a man standing in the foreground, facing a stout "
"refrigerator with his back turned towards the camera as he reaches for the "
"appliance.\n"
"\n"
"\"Now, it's time,\" the narrator utters, the music reaching a thunderous "
"peak… moments before the fridge door swings open and a comically sized "
"avalanche of hundreds of acorns pours forth.  \"For one man, to tear it all "
"down.\"\n"
"\n"
"The scene swiftly melds into a view of the man striding through a demolition "
"site, a sledgehammer braced across a single shoulder, and his steps "
"accompanied by a lively, trumpeting score.  \"They might call me mad, but "
"mark my words,\" he announces, hefting the tool, \"this place will be "
"returned to nature, so long as I breathe.\"  Heaving the hammer in an arc "
"towards a brick wall, the perspective shifts to the internal view of a "
"warehouse moments before the tool makes contact.  The character is leading a "
"small woman through the space.  \"They think they can keep me from tearing "
"this wreck down one brick at a time?\" he declares, halting before a giant "
"storage shelf.  \"Well, let me introduce you to my crew.\"  The camera pans "
"up, freezing on a shelf where a potted cactus and a Remora plushie sit, a "
"wooden sword and bunny ears duct-taped to the former, and an aluminum bat "
"held in the fins of the latter.\n"
"\n"
"A sudden smash cut brings the woman into view, her eyes tightly closed and "
"her fists clutching a pair of frying pans akimbo.  Cornered against a wall "
"with two rifle-bearing government robots looming before her, she maintains a "
"single, drawn-out scream of panicked terror as she windmills her arms, "
"pummeling the two motionless Secubots in a blur of weaponized culinary.  By "
"the time she tremulously opens her eyes, the machines have been rendered into "
"little more than sparking scrap metal.  A relieved sigh escapes her, moments "
"before the wall explodes.\n"
"\n"
"Metallic text stamps across the screen as the dust settles.\n"
"\n"
"\"Deconstruct Your Fortunes, coming to cinemas on May 4th!\""
msgstr ""
"路径：Downloads/拆解命运预告片.mp4\n"
"\n"
"低沉的管弦乐震颤中，镜头缓缓推进荒芜的都市街道。\"自从它们降临后，世界彻底变了，\""
"旁白声如闷雷滚过，画面掠过残缺的建筑骨架，那些被掏空内饰、只剩断壁残垣的混凝土躯壳。\""
"用水泥取代泥土，用钢铁置换血肉，把生机变作生意——最后任这一切腐朽。\""
"镜头滑过堆积的木材与建材，最终聚焦于一栋孤楼，穿过窗户捕捉到男人的背影：他正伸手去拉一台敦实的冰箱。\n"
"\n"
"\"现在，是时候了，\"旁白响起时，配乐攀至雷霆之巅——冰箱门猛然弹开，数百颗橡果如滑稽的山洪倾泻而出。\"让这个男人——\""
"画面瞬间切至拆迁工地，男人肩扛大锤踏着欢快的小号旋律走来，\"亲手终结这一切。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"他们或许觉得我疯了，\"他高举工具宣告，\"但只要我一息尚存，定要让此地重归自然！\""
"当大锤抡向砖墙的刹那，视角突转至仓库内部。男人正领着娇小女子穿行其间：\"以为派几个铁皮警卫就能阻止我拆楼？\"他在巨型货架前停步，\""
"来认识我的拆迁小队。\"镜头仰拍定格：货架上摆着盆栽仙人掌（绑着木剑与兔耳）和吸盘鱼玩偶（鱼鳍握着铝棍）。\n"
"\n"
"画面骤切！女子紧闭双眼，双手各执平底锅摆出战斗姿态。面对两台持枪政府机器人，她持续发出惊恐长嚎，双臂如风车般挥舞，将静止的Secubot砸成电光四溅的废铁。"
"刚喘着气睁眼——整面墙轰然炸裂！\n"
"\n"
"烟尘中浮现金属质感字幕：\n"
"《拆解命运》\n"
"5月4日\n"
"影院降临！"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "how_to_train_your_nightmares_trailer.mp4"
msgstr "《驯梦记》电影预告片"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/how_to_train_your_nightmares_trailer.mp4\n"
"\n"
"The trailer starts with a surreal violin score: a deathly pale woman in a lab "
"coat kneeling on a basement floor.  Head bowed over a collection of engraved "
"silver glyphs, her crimson hair drenched in rivulets of blood, and eyes "
"closed, she chants under her breath as a British cadenced voice, the same as "
"hers, speaks over the scene.  \"There are things stalking beyond the abysses "
"that drive the sane to madness.\"  Letting blood spatter upon the glyphs from "
"wounds hidden by her hair, the woman's breathing quickens as the objects "
"begin to sizzle, the view zooming upon her heavily scarred face as her eyes "
"slowly open and the music escalates.  \"But when insanity rains,\" fully "
"opening her eyes, the woman's irises are revealed to be burned scarlet, the "
"perspective filled by a view of one of them as the narration concludes, \"the "
"only thing left… is to transcend.\"\n"
"\n"
"After a moment of tense freeze frame, the music grows to a dynamic bass-drum "
"rhythm, the view zooming out and revealing the eyes of a tall, robed figure "
"stalking through the deserted mezzanine level of a shopping plaza.  With "
"their face lost in the shadow of a hood, their limbs bend in disturbingly "
"inhuman ways as they stride, moments before a clawed hand bursts from beneath "
"and whips them from the corridor.  Encircled by a throng of nightmarish, "
"slavering monstrosities, the figure rests still for a moment before their "
"robe bursts apart, revealing them to be an anthropoid composed of "
"intertwining tentacles.  Machine pistols clutched at the ends of their many "
"limbs, they latch to the ceiling and, in a hail of bullets, swing from the "
"floor and towards the view.\n"
"\n"
"The perspective shifts to a scene of the woman, wielding a bayonet-equipped "
"battle rifle, riding astride a motorcycle.  Weaving through a street crowded "
"with writhing eldritch abominations, she stabs from the bike as a viperine "
"creature wings behind her, the pair cutting a bloody swath through the crowd "
"before the view changes.\n"
"\n"
"Dozing in the back of a covered wagon within a barn, the woman rests, the "
"barn's doors wide open.  A spidery creature made from tentacles creeps in "
"through the opening, the camera shifting to its perspective as it crawls "
"towards the wagon.  Laying a leg upon the vehicle's lip, the view glances up, "
"only to reveal the viperine beast crouching atop the cart.  A still second "
"passes before the winged monstrosity dives, the view filled by its gaping "
"maw, before fleshy words bleed across the screen.\n"
"\n"
"\"How to Train Your Nightmares, coming to cinemas April 22nd!\""
msgstr ""
"路径：Downloads/驯梦记预告片.mp4\n"
"\n"
"诡谲的小提琴旋律中，身着实验服的苍白女子跪在幽暗地下室。她低垂着头，银质咒纹在她染血的绯红发丝下若隐若现。\"深渊之外游荡的存在，足以让清醒者陷入疯狂，\""
"与她声线相同的英伦腔旁白响起时，女子闭目吟诵，发间渗出的鲜血滴在咒纹上滋滋作响。镜头推近她布满疤痕的面庞，当双眼缓缓睁开，配乐骤然攀升：\""
"但当疯狂如雨倾泻——\"猩红如灼烧的虹膜占满银幕，\"唯剩……超越之道。\"\n"
"\n"
"紧绷的定格后，低音鼓点轰然炸响。画面拉远，兜帽遮面的高挑人影正在废弃商场中庭蹒跚而行。其肢体扭曲成非人的姿态，突然被廊道下方探出的利爪拽倒。当这群涎水横流的"
"噩梦生物围拢时，人影的长袍猛然爆裂——露出由触须纠缠而成的类人形体。多肢持冲锋枪的怪物吸附天花板，在弹雨倾泻中向镜头摆荡而来。\n"
"\n"
"转场画面里，女子骑着加装刺刀的步枪跨坐机车。她在挤满蠕动邪物的街道穿梭突刺，翼展如蛇的伴生兽紧随其后，二者撕开血肉通道。下一幕，女子正在谷仓的篷车中小憩，仓"
"门大敞。由触须构成的蛛形生物悄然潜入，镜头切换至其视角逼近篷车——当它前肢刚搭上车辕，车顶盘踞的蛇形猛兽骤然扑下，血盆大口占满画面。\n"
"\n"
"血肉凝聚成猩红字幕：\n"
"《驯梦记》\n"
"4月22日\n"
"撕裂银幕！"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "no_man's_land_trailer.mp4"
msgstr "《无人之地》电影预告片"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/no_man's_land_trailer.mp4\n"
"\n"
"The trailer opens with a distorted rendition of \"It's a Long Way to "
"Tipperary,\" with a muddy trench, piled high with the bodies of dead "
"soldiers, filling the scene and a dense layer of yellowish gas obscuring much "
"from direct sight.  Zooming down into the dugout, the camera focuses on the "
"mangled face of a dead infantryman sprawled in bloody water, his jaw blown "
"off and shrapnel embedded in its place.  Clouds of flies crawl over his "
"visage, dispersing in swarms as the music builds and the dead man's bloodshot "
"eyes open.  Staggering to his feet, the soldier shambles down the trench, "
"other corpses unsteadily rising in his wake.  The view pans out beyond the "
"trench and past the layer of gas, revealing hundreds of staggering "
"silhouettes moving in uneven, shambling lines before the escalating music "
"peeks and the scene smash cuts to an overhead view of 19th-century Paris.\n"
"\n"
"Hordes of zombies pour into the city, flashes of gunfire and artillery "
"strikes lighting up the chaotic scene as a line of soldiers attempt to fend "
"off the undead.  With the line breaking after a few seconds of frantic "
"combat, the camera zooms down on a solitary soldier freshly brought to the "
"ground in the midst of the surging wave of zombies, struggling to fend off "
"gnashing teeth and clawing hands.  Seeming to make eye contact with the "
"camera, the man lifts a hand in slow motion, revealing the pulled pins of "
"several grenades before the view is consumed by an explosion.\n"
"\n"
"With a fully fledged orchestral tidal wave scoring the scene, the trailer "
"cuts to a bird's-eye shot of the soldier frantically climbing a ladder, one "
"of his legs missing, and a child clinging to his back as a swarm of undead "
"climb over one another at the structure's foot.  As the infantryman climbs, "
"the view pulls out further and further, eventually depicting the landscape of "
"France, with most man-made lights absent from view and the entire landmass "
"awash with the flashes of heavy guns and detonations.  As the music reaches a "
"heart-throbbing crescendo, bullet holes spray across the scene, spelling out,\n"
"\n"
"\"No Man's Land, coming to cinemas June 15th!\""
msgstr ""
"这段预告片以扭曲变调的《蒂珀雷里很远》开场，泥泞战壕里堆叠着士兵尸体，黄浊毒雾笼罩视野。镜头推进到掩体深处，聚焦在血水中一具面部溃烂的步兵尸体——他的下颚被"
"炸飞，弹片嵌在血肉里。成群的苍蝇在他脸上爬动，当音乐渐强时突然四散，死者充血的双眼猛然睁开。\n"
"\n"
"这名士兵摇晃着站起，沿战壕蹒跚前行，身后尸体接连爬起。镜头拉出战壕穿过毒雾，展现数百个踉跄黑影组成的扭曲队列。音乐达到高潮时画面骤切，俯瞰视角下的十九世纪巴"
"黎城中，尸潮正涌过街道。\n"
"\n"
"枪火与炮击的闪光中，士兵防线在数秒内崩溃。镜头聚焦到某个被尸潮扑倒的士兵，他正拼命抵挡撕咬的利齿。慢镜头里他抬起手与观众对视，指间赫然是几颗拔掉插销的手榴弹"
"——随后画面被爆炸吞没。\n"
"\n"
"交响乐掀起滔天声浪，鸟瞰镜头中，断腿的士兵背着孩童攀爬梯子，建筑底部是层层叠叠的活尸群。随着他不断攀高，视野逐渐扩展至整个法国版图——人类灯火几乎熄灭，大地"
"被重炮闪光与爆炸映照得忽明忽暗。当音乐达到令人心悸的顶点时，弹孔在画面上扫出猩红字样：\n"
"\n"
"\"《无人之地》，6月15日血色上映！\""

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Maine disaster area"
msgstr "缅因州灾区"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This appears to be a screenshot from a newsreel: a reporter standing in the "
"foreground before the night-enveloped backdrop of a rubble-strewn crossroad, "
"the caption, \"Maine disaster area,\" printed in the upper corner.  Several "
"military transport vehicles idle in the midground, the white beams of their "
"headlights illuminating groups of civilians dressed in a shabby assortment of "
"streetwear and night clothes.  Clutching bundled possessions, children, and "
"pets, it's evident that they're being ushered towards the waiting vehicles, "
"with teams of heavily armed soldiers forming protective flanks and lines of "
"machinegun-equipped sandbags cordoning off roadways at the frame's "
"extremities.\n"
"\n"
"Stooping behind a building's window and peeking through partly opened "
"curtains, observing the humans' flight with beady, unblinking eyes, you can "
"make out an amorphous, white shape.  You're not sure what's stranger: that "
"the creature's somehow evaded notice by the dozens of watchful soldiers, or "
"that, for all the world, it resembles an inhumanly tall, muscular penguin."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是新闻纪录片中的一幕：记者站在前景处，身后是被夜色吞没的废墟十字路口，画面左上角印着\"缅因州灾区\""
"的字样。几辆军用运输车在画面中段空转着引擎，雪白的车灯照亮了衣衫褴褛的平民——他们穿着混杂的街头服饰与睡衣，怀里紧攥着包袱、孩童与宠物，正被引导着走向待命的"
"车辆。全副武装的士兵组成防护队列，架着机枪的沙袋路障将道路封锁在画面边缘。\n"
"\n"
"弓着身子躲在建筑窗后，透过半开的窗帘用圆睁不眨的眼睛观察人类逃亡时，能辨认出个模糊的白色轮廓。最令人毛骨悚然的不是这生物竟躲过了数十名警戒士兵的耳目，而是它"
"那扭曲的形态——活像只畸变的高大企鹅，浑身隆起的肌肉块根本不属于自然界。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "real_alien_autopsy!.mp4"
msgstr "外星生物解剖录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"downloads/real_alien_autopsy!.mp4\n"
"\n"
"An immaculately polished room fills the video's perspective, with various "
"metal workspaces lining the metallic walls and the camera angled downward "
"towards a stainless steel operating table.  Sprawled across the surface rests "
"an enormous, vaguely cylindrical form, its shapeless pink flesh encased "
"within an insectoid exoskeleton and sets of clawed appendages marching up the "
"length of its segmented body.  Membranous wings spread out from beneath the "
"organism's bulk, and a pyramidal construct, formed from petal-like ravels of "
"flesh, crowns it.\n"
"\n"
"Asian voices softly converse in the background as latex-gloved hands appear "
"from off frame and busy themselves with delicately cutting around one of the "
"creature's armored plates, the entire scene gently swaying as though the room "
"were located aboard an ocean-going vessel.  After much surgical manipulation, "
"the segment of exoskeleton eventually relinquishes its grasp before the "
"scalpel's insistent slicing, detaching with an unpleasantly wet, peeling "
"sound.  Trailing strands of connective tissue, the plate is set aside as the "
"blades dig into the comparatively delicate flesh beneath, laying the "
"internals bare with a trickle of seeping fluid and a wave of excited gabbles "
"from the unseen surgical crew.\n"
"\n"
"The beast's insides are a paradox of ordered chaos, with stacks of hairy, "
"finger-like structures extending deep within the creature and, like the "
"spokes of a wheel, connecting to a network of four interjoined sacks "
"clustered in a square at the core.  A cartilaginous latticework encircles the "
"sacks, a complicated network of piping running from the organs to various "
"points about the body.  Two constructs, which vaguely resemble the general "
"outline of a traditional lung but are composed of meaty disks connected to a "
"central stock, fill the upper half of the creature's form, with a large "
"amount of sickly yellow fluid flooding the entirety of its internal cavity.\n"
"\n"
"The rest of the video consists of various parts of the creature's anatomy "
"being extricated and examined, with a thick, resin-like substance extruding "
"from one of the sacks as it's sliced open."
msgstr ""
"目录/真实外星生物解剖录像!.mp4 \n"
"\n"
"镜头对准一间纤尘不染的实验室，金属墙壁旁排列着各式工作台。摄像机俯拍的角度下，不锈钢手术台上横亘着巨大的类圆柱形生物——无定形的粉红肉体被包裹在昆虫状外骨骼"
"中，成排带爪的附肢沿着分节躯体规律分布。膜状翅膀从生物体下方延展开来，顶端则耸立着由花瓣状血肉褶皱构成的锥形结构。 \n"
"\n"
"背景音里夹杂着亚洲语言的低声交谈。画面外突然伸来几双乳胶手套包裹的手，正小心切割着生物体某块甲壳。整个场景微微晃动，仿佛实验室位于远洋船只内部。经过长时间手"
"术操作，外骨骼碎片终于在手术刀持续切割下松脱，伴随着令人不适的黏腻剥离声。当连接组织的粘液丝被扯断后，这块甲板被搁置一旁，刀刃随即切入下方相对柔软的血肉，暴"
"露出的内脏组织渗出液体，引发镜头外医疗团队兴奋的嘈杂议论。 \n"
"\n"
"这怪物的内脏呈现出诡异的秩序感：毛发状的指状结构如轮辐般向体内纵深延伸，最终连接至核心处四个呈方形排列的互联囊泡。软骨网状结构包裹着这些囊泡，复杂的管道系统"
"从器官延伸至躯体各处。两个类似传统肺脏轮廓的构造占据了生物体上半部，实则由连接中央柱体的肉质圆盘构成，整个体腔内充斥着大量病态的黄绿色液体。 \n"
"\n"
"录像剩余部分记录了该生物各类器官的提取过程。当某个囊泡被切开时，浓稠的树脂状物质从切口缓缓渗出。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Audio message from Mandy"
msgstr "mandy的语音消息"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This is an archived voice message, seemingly received on the eve of the "
"Cataclysm from a number saved as \"Mandy.\"\n"
"\n"
"The sound of ragged, unsuccessfully stifled breaths fills the recording, with "
"hiccupped whimpers emitted at barely above a whisper as, in the background, a "
"man's shouting cadence and a woman's pleading sobs are audible.\n"
"\n"
"\"Jonas,\" sniffs a teen girl's voice.  \"I… I don't know what's happened, "
"but dad's gone crazy.  He's tied Mom to the radiator for the last hour, and… "
"oh God!  Jona, I think he's stripped her, and he's been turning on and off "
"the radiator and sometimes I hear him crooning about how much he loves her, "
"even as he's beating her and she's screaming.  I tried calling 911, but "
"nobody's answering, and he's locked me in the basement, and I\"\n"
"\n"
"The girl's speech dissolves into sob-clogged gasps as the woman's voice "
"escalates into a blood-curdling shriek, the scream growing sodden and "
"gurgling as the liquid spray of gushing viscera grows to dominate it.  Heavy "
"footfalls grow audible as the distant, gore-choked death rattle fades, "
"replaced by the burble of viscous fluids and the girl's uneven breaths.\n"
"\n"
"\"Ooh, little Manatee,\" calls a man's sing-song voice as the muffled click "
"of an opening door and the thump of bare feet on stairs register in the "
"recording.  \"Come on, sweety, it'll be easier if you just work with me.\"\n"
"\n"
"For a few moments, all that can be heard are the girl's desperately muffled "
"breaths and her father's searching footfalls.\n"
"\n"
"The recording is suddenly filled with the girl's terrified shrieks and the "
"swish of a struggling body being violently hauled across the floor, the "
"sounds growing distorted as the phone tumbles to the ground.  Swiftly gagged, "
"the daughter's weeping pleas are muffled, replaced by the retching of lungs "
"clawing for air as the man's monstrously soothing voice filters through the "
"recording.  \"There, there, little manatee,\" he croons, the sound of fingers "
"being comfortingly stroked through hair in contrast with the nauseous "
"gurgling of a throat freshly choking on vomit.  \"Don't fight it.  Go to "
"sleep now.  Soon, you'll be happy with Mom.  There, there.  Go to sleep, "
"darling.  I loved you.  I love you.\"\n"
"\n"
"The last few minutes of the recording are occupied by silence before the "
"father's voice returns.  He's weeping."
msgstr ""
"这是一段存档的语音留言，似乎是在大灾变前夕从一个备注为\"曼迪\"的号码接收到的。\n"
"\n"
"录音里充斥着压抑不住的粗重喘息声，伴随着抽泣般的呜咽。背景音里能听见男人有节奏的吼叫和女人哀求的哭声。\n"
"\n"
"\"乔纳斯...\"一个少女的声音带着鼻音，\"我...我不知道发生了什么，但爸爸疯了。他把妈妈绑在暖气片上已经一个小时了，而且..."
"天啊！乔纳，我觉得他扒光了她的衣服，一直在开关暖气阀门。我听见他一边打她、听她尖叫，一边哼着说有多爱她。我打了911，但没人接..."
"他把我锁在地下室，我——\"\n"
"\n"
"女孩的话被啜泣打断，此时女人的惨叫陡然拔高成令人毛骨悚然的尖啸，随后渐渐变成湿漉漉的咕噜声——喷溅的内脏液体声盖过了一切。沉重的脚步声渐近，远处血肉模糊的濒"
"死喘息消失了，只剩下粘稠液体的冒泡声和女孩不规律的呼吸。\n"
"\n"
"\"噢，小海牛~\"男人哼唱着推开门，赤脚踩在楼梯上的闷响被录了下来，\"乖女儿，配合点对大家都好。\"\n"
"\n"
"接下来只有女孩拼命压抑的呼吸声和父亲搜寻的脚步声。\n"
"\n"
"录音突然爆发出女孩惊恐的尖叫，以及一具挣扎的身体被粗暴拖过地板的摩擦声。手机摔落地面后声音变得扭曲。女儿被迅速堵住嘴，呜咽的哀求变成了肺部痉挛的干呕声，而男"
"人恶魔般温柔的絮语始终未停：\"好啦好啦，小海牛~\"他哼着，手指梳理头发的安抚声与喉咙被呕吐物堵塞的窒息声形成骇人对比，\""
"别反抗了。睡吧。很快你就能和妈妈团聚了。乖，睡吧亲爱的。爸爸爱过你...爸爸爱你...\"\n"
"\n"
"最后几分钟的录音是漫长的静默，直到父亲再度开口——这次是痛哭声。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Highway tape"
msgstr "高速路录音"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Gazing into a canvas of darkness, this tape seems to have originated from a "
"highway speed camera.  Utterly deserted, the thoroughfare stretches from one "
"end of the choppy frame to the other, the audio devoid of any sound save for "
"the death-rattle rasp of the wind.  Presently, footfalls and exhausted "
"breathing join the soundscape as two men stagger upon the scene, one hunched "
"and bearing the blood-soaked profile of the other.\n"
"\n"
"Clad in the remains of riot gear, the starlight glistening over the red wells "
"of bullet holes flowering across his back, the limply carried officer is "
"clearly dead.  His bearer, a slighter man with bloodshot, vacant eyes, "
"stumbles as he walks, his quivering lips moving as he maintains a "
"hoarsely-whispered, one-sided dialogue.  \"Don't worry, Kev,\" he wheezes.  "
"\"Carlhaven's just a couple miles up ahead.  I'm sure we'll find someone "
"there who can help you, and after you're better, we can go to my place on the "
"lake and wait for all this to die down.  I'll get us there, I promise.  You "
"just need to talk to me.  Please.  Tell me something.\"\n"
"\n"
"Catching his foot in a pothole, the man staggers to the concrete, the corpse "
"sprawling atop him as he lies face down.  \"I'm going to get us there.  I "
"promise.  I promise.  I just want you to wake up.  Please, Kev.  I've got to "
"get us there.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the man wretchedly whimpers, various figures begin to shamble up from the "
"same direction he came from.  Futilely trying to rise, the man only succeeds "
"in rolling himself into a sitting position as his crying grows harder.  "
"\"Please Kev… please.  I don't want to die alone,\" he bawls.  \"Please, wake "
"up and don't let me die alone.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the first zombie stumbles to within a few meters of the man, his sobs grow "
"quiet as he makes eye contact with the inhuman monster ushering in his "
"destruction.  Closing his eyes, he pulls the policeman's corpse into a tight "
"hug and lowers his head, planting a tender kiss on the dead man's lips.  The "
"embrace never breaks, even as the zombies descend upon him."
msgstr ""
"凝视着漆黑的画面，这盘录像带似乎来自高速公路的监控摄像头。空荡荡的路面在晃动的镜头中延伸，除了风中传来的死亡般嘶哑声响，再无其他动静。\n"
"\n"
"伴随着沉重的脚步声与喘息，两个男人踉跄地闯入画面。其中一人佝偻着背，怀里抱着浑身浸透鲜血的同伴。月光下，死者破碎的防暴服上弹孔如血花绽放，显然已气绝多时。抱"
"着他的消瘦男子双眼充血空洞，颤抖的嘴唇不断重复着嘶哑的独白：\"别怕，凯文...卡尔黑文镇就在前面...肯定能找到人救你...等你好起来..."
"我们就去湖边小屋...等这一切结束...我发誓会带你到那儿...求你...说句话...\"\n"
"\n"
"他突然被路面凹坑绊倒，尸体重重压在他背上。\"我一定会做到的...我发誓...求你醒过来...\""
"当他挣扎着撑起上身时，影影绰绰的身影正从他们来时的方向蹒跚逼近。\n"
"\n"
"男子突然爆发出撕心裂肺的哭喊：\"求你别让我孤独地死...\""
"当第一只丧尸逼近至数米内时，他的啜泣戛然而止。望着眼前非人的怪物，他闭眼将警官的尸体拥入怀中，低头在冰冷的唇上印下轻吻。直至尸群将他吞没，这个拥抱始终未曾松"
"开。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Bodycam footage"
msgstr "随身录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This appears to be a segment of bodycam footage, with the perspective shaking "
"as the wearer jogs through a dimly lit corridor, a drawn pistol's muzzle "
"leading the way.  Rounding a bend, any forward progress is promptly arrested "
"as a formally dressed woman comes into the shot.  Hefting a large "
"sledgehammer and crushing the skulls of zombie after zombie clambering "
"through a shattered window, an expression of childish glee is plastered "
"across her face.\n"
"\n"
"Glancing towards the camera, her maniacal grin grows wider as she abandons "
"her post and, stumbling on high heels, rushes towards the view.  Heedless of "
"the bullets that plunge into her gore-caked body, the enraptured look upon "
"the woman's face as she swings the mallet and blood spurts across the lens is "
"going to haunt you in your sleep."
msgstr ""
"这是一段执法记录仪拍摄的晃动画面。持枪者正在昏暗走廊中疾奔，枪管始终指向前方。拐角处突然出现一名身着正装的女子，迫使他猛然刹住脚步。<br><br>女子抡着"
"巨型碎颅锤，将不断从破碎窗户爬进的丧尸挨个爆头。她脸上洋溢着孩童般的欢快神情。当她瞥见镜头时，那癫狂的笑容骤然扩大。她不再理会丧尸，踩着踉跄的高跟鞋冲向镜头"
"。<br><br>子弹接连射入她血污斑驳的身躯，她却浑然不觉。铁锤挥舞间鲜血喷溅在镜头上，那张陶醉的面容必将成为你永恒的梦魇。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "E-journal"
msgstr "电子日志"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This seems to be a digital journal of some kind.  You browse through, and in "
"between the (frankly awful) poetry and occasional story concepts, there are a "
"couple actual journal entries.  The first is as follows:\n"
"\n"
"\"Killed someone today.  An actual, living person.  Well, a maybe, on that "
"last part.  They seemed… feral.  I panicked, and none of the group got to me "
"quick enough, so I just… hit them.  As hard as could.  With that hammer.  I "
"hate that it felt good.\"\n"
"\n"
"The next readable entry mentions the author using a hammer and a large "
"railroad spike together as a weapon.  It devolves into madness pretty quickly "
"from there."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是某人的备忘录。你翻阅着内容，在那些（说实话很糟糕的）诗歌和零星故事构思之间，夹杂着几篇真正的日记。第一篇写道：\n"
"\n"
"\"今天杀了人。一个活生生的、真实的人。好吧，最后这点可能存疑。它看起来...像个疯性野人。我慌了神，同伴都没来得及拦住我，我就..."
"抡起锤子砸了下去。用尽全力。我居然感到痛快，真恶心。\"\n"
"\n"
"下一篇可读的记载提到作者将锤子与大号铁道钉刺组合成武器。之后的内容很快就陷入了癫狂。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "government_overreach.mp4"
msgstr "政府_过激.mp4"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/government_overreach.mp4\n"
"\n"
"Overlooking a stage formed from a shipping crate placed upon a harbor wharf, "
"the view depicts a man dressed in combat fatigues standing atop the "
"container, two militiamen flanking him, and a line of bound and gagged "
"civilians kneeling in a line at the structure's edge: a potbellied man, an "
"athletic-looking woman, an adolescent girl, and a boy.  Crowds of people are "
"gathered at the container's foot, gazing up as the uniformed man speaks.\n"
"\n"
"\"My fellow Rhodians,\" he booms.  \"On behalf of the Narragansett "
"government, I stand before you to announce that, this morning, these "
"individuals,\" he pronounces, gesturing towards the bound captives with a "
"flourish of a drawn pistol, \"were detained as they attempted to cross our "
"borders, doubtlessly intended to be installed as sleeper agents during this "
"time of emergency.  That the United States would seek to invest in our "
"destruction, even as their own countrymen are falling before the undead, is "
"nothing short of disgusting.  Let the fates of these intruders serve as an "
"example to any who would challenge the sovereignty of Rhode Island!\"\n"
"\n"
"Stepping behind the restrained man, the speaker presses his pistol against "
"his head.  \"This man,\" he declares, \"was found to carry a weapon within "
"his vehicle and is doubtlessly a soldier of the United States.\"  The echo of "
"a solitary shot reverberates through the audio as the man's lifeless corpse "
"rolls from the container and plunges into the water below amidst muffled "
"shrieks from his fellow captives.\n"
"\n"
"\"This woman,\" the executioner thunders, stepping behind the prisoner in "
"question, \"was registered as possessing land within our borders.  Land, my "
"friends, upon which a bunker was built!\"  A second shot and a spray of "
"brains herald the woman's end as her body plunges to join her compatriot "
"before the man marches behind the huddled children.\n"
"\n"
"\"These kids aren't responsible for the actions of their government,\" he "
"somberly announces.  \"Yet, they will grow to be enemies of Rhode Island and "
"must be dealt with; the law bends for no one.\"\n"
"\n"
"Two more gunshots and two smaller splashes bring the video to an end."
msgstr ""
"路径：Download/政府_过激.mp4\n"
"\n"
"画面定格在港口码头一个由货运集装箱改造成的处刑台上。身着作战服的军官站在箱顶，两侧立着民兵，一排被捆缚的平民跪在边缘——大腹便便的男人、运动型女子、少女和男"
"孩。人群聚集在集装箱下方，仰望着正在演讲的军官。\n"
"\n"
"\"罗德岛的同胞们！\"他声如洪钟，\"我代表纳拉甘西特政府宣布——\"手枪\"咔嗒\"上膛，枪管划过被缚者的方向，\""
"今晨抓获的这批人企图偷越边境，显然是要在紧急状态下安插潜伏特工。当美国本土都沦陷于行尸走肉时，他们竟妄图摧毁我们，简直令人作呕！让这些入侵者的下场，成为挑战"
"罗德岛主权者的榜样！\"\n"
"\n"
"演讲者踱到被缚男子身后，枪口抵住太阳穴：\"此人车内藏有武器，必是美国军人。\"孤零零的枪声在码头回荡，尸体滚落集装箱坠入海中，其他俘虏发出沉闷的惊叫。\n"
"\n"
"\"而这个女人——\"行刑者大步跨到女囚身后，\"登记在我们境内的土地上竟建有地堡！\""
"第二声枪响伴随着脑浆迸裂，尸体追随同伴坠入海中。军官最后走向蜷缩的孩童。\n"
"\n"
"\"孩子不该为政府行为负责，\"他沉痛宣布，\"但长大后终将成为罗德岛之敌。法律面前，没有例外。\"\n"
"\n"
"两声枪响和两朵较小的水花后，视频戛然而止。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Kraken?"
msgstr "克拉肯？"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"The entire view pitches and rocks unsteadily, with the top bar of a ship's "
"guardrail visible at the frame's base and a frothing ocean stretching for as "
"far as the eye can see.  A muddled mix of desperate liturgies and shouts meld "
"with the background rattle of gunfire; the sounds all but drown beneath the "
"ear-splitting shriek of the video's subject: an enormous, writhing mass of "
"gelatinous tentacles breaching the water and tussling with the bows of a "
"military transport.  Floundering in the midground, the transport's all but "
"subsumed beneath the megalithic limbs, rows of hooked barbs digging into the "
"steel plating, the appendages connected to a gargantuan, scaly form that "
"thrashes beneath the waves.  As the vessel is hoisted from the water and the "
"tiny silhouettes of soldiers are dragged into the various slavering maws "
"lining the tentacles like masses of krill, small specks appear in the sky on "
"the horizon.\n"
"\n"
"A sonic boom resounds and the specks resolve into a flight of low-flying "
"fighter jets.  Bellies laden with ordinance, the aircraft dive towards the "
"struggle, harpoon missiles streaking free of their armament bays before they "
"steeply climb.  Columns of water and yellowish ichor spurt skyward as the "
"weapons find their mark, sending chunks of quivering flesh showering across "
"the scene as the pummeled ship crashes back into the water.  As the "
"behemoth's corpse slips beneath the waves, two jets bank around and sweep "
"low, depositing depth charges over the creature's liquid grave.\n"
"\n"
"As the subsurface bombs detonate in a wave of bloody water, the final shot "
"depicts the wrecked ship as it joins its attacker beneath the waves, a "
"solitary soldier clinging to the uppermost reaches of the vessel as it sinks "
"into the abyss."
msgstr ""
"整个画面剧烈摇晃颠簸，船舷护栏的横杆在画面底部时隐时现，翻腾的海面一直延伸到视野尽头。混杂着绝望祷词与嘶吼的人声在枪械的哒哒声中模糊不清，而所有这些声响都被"
"视频主角——那条正从海面隆起、与军用运输船船首缠斗的巨型胶质触手怪——发出的刺耳尖啸所淹没。在画面中段挣扎的运输船几乎被山岳般的触肢吞没，成排倒钩深深扎进钢"
"板，这些触须连接着潜藏于波涛之下的鳞甲巨躯。当整艘船被举出水面，士兵们渺小的剪影像磷虾群般被触手上密布的垂涎巨口吞噬时，天际线上突然出现了几个小点。\n"
"\n"
"随着音爆轰鸣，那些黑点显露出低空飞行的战斗机群。满载弹药的机群俯冲向战场，鱼叉导弹从武器舱呼啸而出，随后战机急速拉升。命中目标的武器激起参天水柱与黄浊体液，"
"被轰击的运输船砸回海面时，漫天都是簌簌抖落的血肉碎块。当巨兽尸体缓缓沉入波涛，两架战机调转机头低空掠过，在这怪物的液态坟场上投下深水炸弹。\n"
"\n"
"随着水下炸弹掀起血浪，最后一个镜头记录下残破的运输船追随袭击者沉入深渊。当船体坠向无底黑暗时，唯剩一名士兵死死攀附在最高处的桅杆上。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Kids on a field trip"
msgstr "郊游的孩童"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Swirling with a head-spinning meld of spurting reds and fleshy pinks, the sky "
"looms over a windswept street, the jittering view seemingly recorded by a "
"private property's security camera.  Bulging and receding, as though it were "
"the face of a storm-ravaged ocean, a road-facing lawn fills the foreground.  "
"A school bus rocks beyond the distorted greenery, the giggles of children "
"clear over the squeals of the vehicle's suspension and the deformed whispers "
"that tickle the edges of audibility.  The bus is coated in a carpet of "
"writhing, flopping, and quivering torsos and limbs, all seemingly from "
"children.  Rolling, through some indeterminate agency, along the vehicle's "
"sides, wiggling across its roof, and at times merging straight through the "
"metal, the bleeding body parts frolic across the bus.  Smiling and laughing, "
"the heads attached to the torsos revolve in ways that would break regular "
"necks, their jaws clamping about the faces of cohorts that they wriggle into, "
"both parties gnawing at each other's skulls before they merge strait through "
"one another.\n"
"\n"
"As the road buckles and an abyssal vortex twists into being beyond the bus, "
"all the flailing legs assemble beneath the chassis and lift the vehicle from "
"the ground, the children's eyes bursting from their sockets and wriggling to "
"the bus's front as the rest of the body parts assume positions upon the "
"seats.  The red-splattered distortion of children on a field trip sprints "
"into the portal, the children's heads still laughing."
msgstr ""
"血色漩涡与肉粉色云团在扭曲的天幕中翻涌，狂风呼啸的街道上方，监控摄像头正记录着这幅诡谲画面。如暴风雨肆虐的海面般起伏不定的草坪占据前景，一辆校车在畸变的绿植"
"后方剧烈摇晃。孩童的嬉笑盖过了悬挂系统的呻吟，以及那些在听觉边缘蠕动的低语。\n"
"\n"
"无数扭动的躯干与肢体如活体地毯覆盖着校车表面——全都像是来自孩子。这些渗血的残肢以不可名状的方式滚动着：沿着车身爬行，在车顶蠕动，时而直接穿透金属结构。连接"
"在躯干上的头颅以足以折断常人颈椎的角度旋转，大笑着将下颚嵌进同伴的面部。在彼此穿透融合前，双方都在啃噬对方的颅骨。\n"
"\n"
"当道路塌陷、深渊漩涡在校车后方成形时，所有挥舞的腿脚突然在底盘下集结，将整车抬离地面。孩子们的眼球爆出眼眶，蠕动着聚集到车头位置，其余肢体则整齐落座。这场血"
"色斑驳的扭曲远足最终冲向传送门，只剩笑声依旧在头颅间回荡。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "recording_april_20_03:50.mp3"
msgstr "录音_4月20日_03:50.mp3"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"recording_april_20_03:50.mp3\n"
"\n"
"The background of this recording is underscored by a bazaar of swirling noise "
"and muffled cracks emanating through the audio, causing a faint and "
"inexplicable tingling sensation to prickle at the roots of your teeth.  "
"\"Dear Diary,\" mumbles a child's voice.  \"It's been a few hours since all "
"the weirdness started, and there are still noises outside, so I guess it "
"isn't over.  We're still hiding in the armory building, and…\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Hey, kid,\" interjects a woman's horse voice.  \"We need to save that "
"thing's charge, so, mind not draining it all.\"\n"
"\n"
"Muttering a reluctant apology, a light thwack and swish jostle the audio as "
"some manner of cover is lowered over the recording device and the child "
"slides it to the floor, the feed still unterminated.  Moments pass, during "
"which only the disquieting sounds of a world in unnatural flux can be heard, "
"accompanied by the clinking of various small metal objects being toyed with "
"next to the microphone.  Eventually, the uncomfortable silence is broken as "
"the woman clears her voice.\n"
"\n"
"\"Listen… I'm sorry.  Honestly, I don't really care about it too much: it's "
"just that… I'm just as scared as you are.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I thought soldiers didn't get scared.\"\n"
"\n"
"Any form of reply is cut off as a frantic banging suddenly batters into the "
"soundscape: with a man's muffled shrieks for help audible as the child, alarm "
"raising their voice by several octaves, cries, \"That's dad!  We've got to "
"open the door!\"\n"
"\n"
"A scramble ensues, eventually culminating in the child's yelling protests as "
"they're evidently restrained.\n"
"\n"
"\"Listen to me,\" the woman's voice barks.  \"Kid, you can't open that door.  "
"The thing out there ain't your dad.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"What're you talking about?\" the youth sobs.  The soldier's cadence softens "
"with no small measure of sadness as she audibly pulls the struggling child to "
"a sitting position by the microphone.\n"
"\n"
"\"No one knows we're in here,\" she replies.  \"Nobody would be begging to be "
"let in.  Plus, no one could have lasted this long outside.  Just, cover your "
"ears.  It'll stop once it realizes it's not fooling anyone.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the screams and pleas grow increasingly distorted, eventually verging on a "
"blood-curdling wail, the youth sniffles, \"Then, what is it?\"\n"
"\n"
"Long moments pass, during which the child's weeping grows muted as they're "
"pulled into an evident embrace.  \"Not a person,\" the woman eventually "
"whispers.  \"Definitely not a person.\""
msgstr ""
"录音_4月20日_03:50.mp3\n"
"\n"
"背景音里充斥着诡异的杂音和闷响，听得人牙根发酸。\"亲爱的日记，\"一个孩子的声音嘟囔着，\""
"怪事开始好几个小时了，外面还有动静，看来还没结束。我们还躲在军械库里，然后......\"\n"
"\n"
"\"嘿，小鬼，\"一个沙哑的女声突然打断，\"省着点用那玩意儿的电量，别全耗光了。\"\n"
"\n"
"孩子不情不愿地道歉时，录音设备传来\"啪嗒\""
"一声轻响，像是被什么盖子罩住后滑落到地板上，但录音仍在继续。漫长的静默中，只能听见外界诡异的窸窣声，以及麦克风旁摆弄金属小物件的叮当声。最后女人清了清嗓子打"
"破沉默。\n"
"\n"
"\"听着...抱歉。其实我不是在乎那个...只是...我和你一样害怕。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"我以为军人不会怕。\"\n"
"\n"
"男人的呼救声突然炸响在录音里，孩子瞬间拔高八度的尖叫打断了对话：\"是爸爸！快开门！\"\n"
"\n"
"一阵混乱的扭打声后，传来孩子被制住时带着哭腔的抗议。\n"
"\n"
"\"听好，\"女人厉声道，\"门外那东西不是你父亲。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"你胡说什么？\"少年抽泣着。随着明显是把孩子按坐在麦克风旁的动静，女兵的声线柔和下来：\"没人知道我们在这儿..."
"真正的活人不可能在外面撑这么久。捂住耳朵吧，等它明白骗不到人就会停了。\"\n"
"\n"
"当求救声逐渐扭曲成令人毛骨悚然的嚎叫时，少年吸着鼻子问：\"那到底是什么？\"\n"
"\n"
"漫长的沉默里，啜泣声渐渐闷在某个怀抱中。\"不是人，\"女人最终轻声道，\"绝对不是人。\""

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "jameson_biotech_revealed!.mp4"
msgstr "詹姆斯生物科技真相曝光.mp4"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This appears to be a locally saved livestream archive, with the feed filming "
"a decrepit backstreet.  An older, bespectacled man and a middle-aged Latina "
"woman stand huddled in a line against the wall, their legs lashed to each "
"other and their hands bound to the front.  Beaming like a ray of sunshine, a "
"man dressed in tactical gear prances before them, a baseball bat resting "
"conspicuously upon his shoulder as he greets the camera.  \"Hey guys,\" he "
"says, \"this is Andre Diliman, and we're going to be putting our detective "
"hats on and figuring out who's to blame for all the shit going on, and we're "
"going to do that, with the help of these beautiful people right here, so "
"please, introduce yourselves.\"\n"
"\n"
"Exchanging resigned glances, the two captives lower their heads as the woman "
"mutters, \"I'm Dr. Martha Sharma.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"And I'm Dr. Conrad Sharma,\" her compatriot glumly adds.\n"
"\n"
"\"And both you fuckers work at Jameson Biotech,\" the spokesman concludes in "
"a sing-song cadence as he saunters before the couple.  \"We're going to start "
"easy.  The CDC has been saying that something's messing with people's brains: "
"making them act all aggressive.  Now, my question to you is simple: What did "
"y'all cook up in those labs of yours?\"\n"
"\n"
"Lifting her head and making eye contact with her questioner, the woman shakes "
"her head incredulously.  \"You fucking idiot.\"\n"
"\n"
"Nodding understandingly, the man turns away from the couple.  \"I see we "
"might need some harder persuasion, that's not too surprising.  Alexander, "
"Tomas, and Mary, bring in the kid… and the wire!\"\n"
"\n"
"Amidst a flurry of horrified protests from the captives, a gaunt man appears "
"from off-frame, a goofy grin creasing his unshaven face as he lugs a "
"squalling baby in his arms.  A second man and a woman follow him into view… "
"uncoiling a length of barbed wire.  Wrapping the rusted steel about the "
"infant's midsection, heedless of the pained wails emanating as the barbs "
"scrape its skin, the duo stand apart, gripping opposite ends of the makeshift "
"garrote.  \"Ok guys,\" the ringleader gleefully instructs, \"on my mark, "
"we'll give the little shit a light squeezing.  If the good doctors don't want "
"to talk after that… then I want it rendered into mincemeat!  3, 2, 1…\"\n"
"\n"
"Spouts of blood spurt in all directions as bullet-riddled bodies collapse to "
"the ground, the camera toppling rearwards as a bark of automatic gunfire "
"echoes through the audio, accompanied by the approaching, hurried stomps of "
"soldiers' boots."
msgstr ""
"这段本地保存的直播录像拍摄于一条破败的后巷。戴眼镜的老者和拉美裔中年女性紧贴着墙壁并排站立，双腿互缚，双手反绑。身着战术装备的男子扛着棒球棍在镜头前雀跃如朝"
"阳：\"老铁们好！我是安德烈·迪利曼，今天咱们要当回侦探——\"棒球棍在肩头轻叩，\"当然得靠这两位'贵宾'"
"帮忙，查查这烂摊子到底该谁背锅。来，做个自我介绍？\"\n"
"\n"
"两名俘虏交换了认命的眼神低下头。女人低头嗫嚅：\"玛莎·夏尔玛博士。\"\n"
"\"康拉德·夏尔玛博士。\"同伴闷声补充。\n"
"\"而你们两个杂种都在詹姆森生物科技工作~\"男子哼着调子在两人面前踱步，\""
"先从简单的来。疾病预防控制中心说有什么东西在搞烂人脑子，让人发疯。你们在实验室里造了什么孽？\"\n"
"\n"
"女人抬起头，与提问者对视，难以置信地摇摇头。\"傻逼。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"明白了。得来点硬的。\"安德烈恍然大悟般转身，\"亚历山大、托马斯、玛丽，把小崽子带来...还有铁丝网！\"\n"
"\n"
"在俘虏凄厉的哀嚎中，胡子拉碴的瘦子抱着啼哭的婴儿入镜，身后男女正展开带刺铁丝。三人不顾婴儿被铁刺刮破皮肤的惨叫，将生锈的铁丝绕在婴儿腰际，各执一端形成绞索。"
"\"听好了，\"安德烈兴奋地指挥，\"我数到三就开勒。要是咱们的贵宾们还不开口...\"他突然咧嘴一笑，\"就把这小杂种绞成肉酱！三、二、一……\"\n"
"\n"
"自动步枪的爆响撕裂空气。鲜血四溅，弹痕累累的躯体纷纷倒地，摄像机向后翻倒，急促的军靴声越来越近。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Video of, eeh, something"
msgstr "一段怪异的录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"The quality of this footage is both choppy and filled with the background "
"fluctuations of static, with the view being angled upwards through the "
"shattered beams of what used to have been a roof.  The structure looks as "
"though it's been the recipient of a mortar bombardment, with large swaths of "
"the roiling gray sky visible through the gaps and stifling volumes of heavy "
"fog rolling in over the edges.  Unsteadily zooming past the wreckage, the "
"camera focuses on the distant profile of a helicopter raveled in the depths "
"of the filth-tinged clouds, the drone of its rotors audible as the aircraft "
"beats its way through the bank of fog.  In the airspace around the machine, "
"you can vaguely detect bands of ebony black undulating through the "
"clouds—strands of oily darkness waning and fattening about its fuselage like "
"writhing sea serpents.\n"
"\n"
"Just as you fancy that the tendrils were bulging into outlines, shadowy limbs "
"extending from them, and, for a split second, appearing like suspended ranks "
"of unnaturally lanky figures, the whole view devolves into the screech of "
"static.  It takes you a moment to realize that what you originally took to be "
"the shriek of interference was actually just the video's audio.\n"
"\n"
"For the last 45 seconds, it transmits the distant sounds of many hundreds of "
"nearing, drawn-out screams."
msgstr ""
"这段影像画面支离破碎，布满雪花噪点。镜头从断裂的屋顶横梁间向上仰拍，整栋建筑仿佛遭受过迫击炮轰击，大片翻滚的灰暗天空从裂缝中显露，浓重的雾霾正从边缘翻涌而入"
"。\n"
"\n"
"摄像机摇晃着掠过废墟，聚焦在远处云雾中若隐若现的直升机轮廓上。螺旋桨的嗡鸣穿透雾墙传来，而在飞行器周围的空域中，隐约可见带状墨色物质在云层间蠕动——这些油污"
"般的黑暗如同海蛇般缠绕着机身，时而收缩时而膨胀。\n"
"\n"
"就在那些触须状阴影突然膨出轮廓、延伸出肢节的瞬间，当它们像一排排违反自然规律的瘦长人形悬浮在空中时，整个画面突然陷入刺耳的噪波。数秒后你才意识到，最初以为是"
"信号干扰的尖啸声，其实是录像本身的音频。\n"
"\n"
"在最后四十五秒里，录音持续传来数百道由远及近的、被拉长了的惨叫声。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Footage of some monster"
msgstr "怪物录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Scrolling through the device's video storage, you come across an archived "
"video message received, apparently, through a chat app a few days after the "
"first mass-spread portal storms.  Evidently taped through the low-grade "
"camera of a smartphone, the footage shows the interior view of a small room "
"bathed in darkness, a door visible in the background with several heavy-duty "
"dead bolts drawn, and the grime-caked face of a balding man hovering in the "
"foreground.  Quivering like a particularly well-bearded leaf, the man's gaze "
"continually darts around as he mutters into the microphone in a horse "
"cadence, barely above a whisper.\n"
"\n"
"\"Denis, I don't have a clue if you and Lorence are still alive; fuck knows, "
"after the shit that's been going on, I don't know how anyone can still be "
"alive, but, in the name of hell and Jesus Christ, I hope you are, because you "
"need to come get me, man; you really, really need to come get me out of here. "
" Something's gotten into my house.  I don't know what it wants; it hasn't "
"hurt me yet, but it's not leaving, it's not letting me leave, it just watches "
"me all day and all night, watching and following.  I managed to lock myself "
"in the broom closet.  I don't think it can get in, but you need to come get "
"me.  Please.  Please, for the love of God.  Send somebody.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the man's babbling trails onwards, your eyes are increasingly drawn to the "
"space over the door, where a slight quivering in the wall is steadily growing "
"more pronounced.  Suddenly, yellowed, rat-like incisors burst through the "
"space, furiously and swiftly gnawing a softball-sized hole through the wood.  "
"Noiselessly withdrawing, the fangs' place is taken by a disturbingly slender "
"arm that limply drapes itself through the aperture, the unnaturally long hand "
"at its end feeling along the wall with fingers that tangle like the leaves of "
"a spider plant.  The cameraman only grows wise to the spaghetti-thin limb's "
"intrusion as the fingers lightly cascade over his shoulders, moments before "
"the arm entwines about him with tentacle-like deftness.\n"
"\n"
"The view's sent spiraling to the ground as the limb constricts and whips him "
"rearwards, a sickening series of crunches and pained wails audible as the "
"man's slammed against the heavy door with machine gun rapidity.  The last few "
"shots consist of the man being yanked through a freshly splintered hole in "
"the door as, upside down, a horrifically bloated head slithers down the wall. "
" Domed like the cranium of an infant, sparsely furred, inset with "
"anglerfish-like eyes, and far too large for the ragged straw of flesh that "
"composes its neck, the being's skull passively observes the blooded, "
"screaming mess of a body that it's trying to feed through the "
"watermelon-sized gap.  It succeeds… eventually."
msgstr ""
"翻查设备视频存档时，你发现一条通过聊天软件接收的旧视频，时间标注在首批大规模传送门风暴爆发后数日。画面显然是用手机劣质摄像头拍摄的：幽暗小室内景，背景里嵌着"
"多重加固门栓的房门，前景晃动着个秃顶男人的脏污面孔。他像片长满胡须的树叶般颤抖着，眼珠不停乱转，对着麦克风发出沙哑的气声：\n"
"\n"
"\"丹尼斯，不知道你和劳伦斯还活着没...去他妈的，这鬼世道能活下来的都是怪物...但看在撒旦和耶稣份上，你们得来救我..."
"必须来！有东西闯进我家了。不知道它要什么...还没伤害我...可它不走...也不让我走...日夜盯着我...我躲进了扫具间...门应该能顶住...求你们.."
".\"\n"
"\n"
"男人絮叨时，你的目光不自觉被门框上方的异样吸引——墙面正泛起越来越明显的波纹。突然，几颗发黄的鼠类门齿刺穿墙体，飞速啃出垒球大小的破洞。利齿无声退去后，取而"
"代之的是条畸形细臂，末端蜘蛛兰叶片般的手指正摸索墙面。当那些手指拂过拍摄者肩膀时，他才惊觉这条意大利面粗细的肢体已如触手般缠上脖颈。\n"
"\n"
"画面天旋地转——那条胳膊将他猛拽向加固门，机枪般的撞击声与惨叫中，最后几个镜头记录着：男人被拖过新鲜破开的门洞时，天花板上正滑下颗肿胀头颅。那像婴儿头骨般隆"
"起的巨大颅顶稀稀拉拉长着毛发，颈部却只有束破烂的肉茎支撑，鮟鱇鱼似的眼珠冷静注视着正在西瓜大破洞处挣扎的血肉大餐...它最终得逞了。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Youtube survivor"
msgstr "生存系实况主"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Peering over the crumbling lip of a building's parapet and capturing the "
"sight of a heavily cratered cul-de-sac lit in the pale light of dawn, the "
"video's opening shots tilt hither and dither as the camera's carefully "
"adjusted and a low voice murmurs in the background.\n"
"\n"
"\"Well, it's day 4 of the apocalypse; the internet's still running somehow, "
"and that's my cue to post another video, so welcome back, y'all.  I never "
"thought that I'd be using YouTube as a way to try reaching out to people "
"during a fucking zombie cataclysm, but here we are, so… yeah.  If you're "
"watching, I guess, sound off in the comments that you're still around and, I "
"don't know, like and subscribe to your daily coverage of hell.\"\n"
"\n"
"The video's frame settles on the view of a modestly sized storefront, or, "
"more precisely, half of a storefront.  The establishment's been supplemented "
"by the addition of a semi-truck resting nose first through the shop's "
"merchandise window, and, as you watch, you can make out a faint staring of "
"movement from within the building.\n"
"\n"
"\"It's 9 in the morning.  I figured that y'all may as well join me as I see "
"who around here wants a sample of Grampa's cure-all, and it looks like, "
"folks, we have a taker.\"\n"
"\n"
"The barrel of a large-caliber rifle edges into the frame, escorted by the "
"rattle of a bolt being cycled and the slightly more unsettling tempo of the "
"cameraman softly humming, \"Another one bites the dust.\"  Thankfully for "
"your musical sensibilities, the humming dissolves into a surprised breath as "
"the rifle's sharply retreated from the parapet, the camera's jostled "
"rearwards, and, from the ruins of the store, a ragged woman clambers over the "
"debris and slides down upon the hood of the equally battered semi.  With her "
"eyes bloodshot and misted over with an unblinking glaze, the woman staggers "
"to her feet, an inflamed and seeping, purplish-red mass evident in her leg "
"that speaks to unhealed fractures.  Hoisting the concrete-dusted bundle of a "
"blanket and plushie to her chest as she all but collapses off the vehicle, "
"the footage zooms in on the survivor as she limps about the truck's trailer "
"and fumbles with the rear gate's locking latch, haltingly swinging the "
"barrier down with a rusted shriek.  Disappearing within the container, a "
"faint rattling announces the woman's eventual reemergence as she teeters "
"behind the push-bar of a baby stroller.  A wan smile touches the corner of "
"her slack lips as she parks the carriage by the truck, crumples to her knees, "
"and fusses over the basket, tucking the plush toy within before enveloping "
"the contents within the coverlet.\n"
"\n"
"As the woman drags herself to the steering position and unsteadily sets off "
"down the street, the film focuses on the stroller's interior.  The plastic "
"toy of a baby is swaddled within.  Only its staring eyes and jagged sneer are "
"visible across the shattered wreckage of the doll's face, and it's dressed in "
"a set of baby clothes.  You've never seen a garment so completely crusted "
"with dried blood."
msgstr ""
"透过摇摇欲坠的建筑矮墙，镜头捕捉到黎明微光中布满弹坑的死胡同。画面起初摇晃不定，随着摄像机逐渐调稳，背景传来低沉的喃喃自语。\n"
"\n"
"\"好吧，这是末日降临的第四天。互联网居然还没瘫痪，那我就继续录视频了——欢迎回来各位。没想到有朝一日我会在丧尸横行的鬼日子里用YouTube找人..."
"不过既然还能用，那就...嗯。要是你正看着这段，麻烦在评论区吱个声证明你还活着，顺便点个赞订阅每日地狱实况转播吧。\"\n"
"\n"
"画面最终定格在一间中等规模的店铺前——准确说是半间。这家店的橱窗被一辆半挂卡车撞得粉碎，车头直接怼进了货架区。仔细观察的话，能发现建筑物内有微弱的动静。\n"
"\n"
"\"现在是早上九点。干脆带你们见识下谁想来尝尝爷爷的万能灵药——看来有位志愿者已经等不及了。\"\n"
"\n"
"大口径步枪的枪管突然入画，伴随拉栓的金属碰撞声，还有拍摄者哼着小调的阴森节奏：\"又一位壮烈牺牲\""
"。好在枪管突然从墙头缩回时，哼唱变成了倒抽冷气的声音。镜头剧烈晃动后移，只见废墟里钻出个衣衫褴褛的女人，她翻过瓦砾滑到同样伤痕累累的卡车引擎盖上。那双布满血"
"丝的眼睛直勾勾盯着前方，腿上溃烂的紫红色肿块明显是未愈合的骨折伤。她紧抱着沾满水泥灰的毯子玩具包，几乎是滚下车的。镜头推近时，这个幸存者正跛着脚绕到挂车后方"
"，哆哆嗦嗦地摆弄后门锁扣，生锈的闸门在刺耳声响中缓缓落下。\n"
"\n"
"随着集装箱内传出的窸窣声，女人最终推着婴儿车摇摇晃晃地现身。她把推车停靠在卡车旁时，松弛的嘴角挤出个惨淡笑容。跪倒在地后，她仔细整理着车篮，先将毛绒玩具摆好"
"，再用毯子把里面的东西裹得严严实实。\n"
"\n"
"当女人挣扎着爬进驾驶座，歪歪斜斜驶离街道时，镜头聚焦在婴儿车内——塑料婴儿玩具被襁褓包裹着。只有那双瞪大的眼睛和锯齿状的狞笑从玩偶破碎的脸上显露出来，它穿着"
"套婴儿服。你从未见过被血痂浸透到这种程度的衣物。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Metro invitation"
msgstr "地铁邀约"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/Приходите в подполье.mp4\n"
"\n"
"Magnitudes darker than the soot-caked countenance of the man who forms this "
"video's subject, the footage captures a vertically shot view of arched "
"concrete walls and steel rail lines leading off into an impenetrable vale of "
"black.  The man, enwrapped within an olive-green military uniform and "
"clutching a rifle, stands framed within this utilitarian warren of grime and "
"rust, the beam of radiance from his weapon light quivering across his face as "
"his hands shiver.  In the background, you can pick up a low murmur of voices "
"along with a fainter series of reverberant clinks and clangs, the latter of "
"which are drowned out as the soldier's lips part in a croaky monologue, "
"thickly seasoned by an eastern European accent.\n"
"\n"
"\"Я 2-й лейтенант российских вооруженных сил Гавриил Фадеев, и я записываю "
"это сообщение для всех, кто еще находится в городе.  Поверхность больше не "
"безопасна; силы армии развалились.  Если вы на это способны, уходите под "
"землю, в линии метро.  Мы с моими людьми установили периметр в туннелях, "
"ведущих к Чистым Прудам.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the video trundles onwards, a level of peculiar distortion grows evident "
"in the footage.  It almost seems like, at points, micro-second-long clips of "
"a second film perspective have been embedded into the tape, struggling to "
"grow visible over the original footage before flashing by in a blur of brown, "
"red, and gray hues—too fast to properly catch.  You're about to fast-forward "
"the tape before, suddenly, as though in a hard-won breakthrough, the view of "
"the soldier dissolves and is replaced by a different perspective of the man, "
"presented within an alternative version of the tunnel.  At least… you think "
"what you're seeing is meant to be the tunnel.  It looks far more like the "
"pulsating interior of some beast's esophagus, and you have to do your best to "
"link that flailing, flesh-stripped thing immersed waist-deep in a bubbling "
"brown slurry in the frame's center with anything remotely human.  It stands, "
"held upright by a bulbous white appendage extending from the ceiling and "
"smothering the oozing remnants of its head.\n"
"\n"
"\"ЭТО ЛОЖЬ, ЭТО ЛОЖЬ,\" the thing that is and isn't a man screams, before a "
"club-like limb extends from the white mass, plows through its chest in a "
"shower of bone and mangled lungs, and the tape jumps back to the soldier.\n"
"\n"
"\"Приходите на линии метро,\" the man croaks.  \"У нас есть тепло.  У нас "
"есть еда.  Мы позаботимся о вас.\"  He smiles at the camera.  Half of his "
"face stays limp."
msgstr ""
"路径：Download/Приходите в подполье.mp4\n"
"画面比镜头中那个满脸煤灰的男人更加阴暗。垂直拍摄的视角里，拱形混凝土墙壁与生锈铁轨延伸进浓稠的黑暗深处。身着橄榄绿军装的士兵颤抖着握住步枪，武器照明灯的光束"
"在他污迹斑斑的脸上跳动。背景里隐约可辨低语声与金属碰撞的回响，直到他带着浓重东欧口音的沙哑独白盖过一切：\n"
"\n"
"(俄语)\""
"我是俄罗斯武装力量加夫里尔·法捷耶夫少尉。这条讯息留给所有仍在城里的幸存者。地面已不再安全，军队建制崩溃了。有能力的人请立即转移到地铁隧道。我们在地铁隧道建"
"立了防御圈......\"\n"
"\n"
"录像继续播放时，画面开始出现诡异的扭曲。某些瞬间仿佛有另一段影像在挣扎浮现，棕红灰三色交错的模糊帧率快得难以捕捉。就在你准备快进时，士兵的影像突然溶解——取"
"而代之的是某种浸泡在棕色黏液里的生物。它被天花板上垂下的白色瘤状物缠绕着头颅，勉强维持着人形站立。\n"
"\n"
"(俄语)\"都是谎言！全是谎言！\"这个似人非人的怪物嘶吼着。白色肿块突然伸出棒状肢体击穿它的胸腔，画面又跳回士兵。\n"
"\n"
"(俄语)\"来地铁隧道吧。\"男人半边脸僵笑着，\"这里有温暖，有食物，我们会保护你们。\""

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Beach video"
msgstr "海滩录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Brilliant white sands unfold under the view of this particular video, grains "
"of grit lightly swirling in the breeze and the rhythmic voice of ocean waves "
"murmuring in the background.  Pattering across the sand, with its wet fur "
"rendered yellowish white by the gravel that coats it, a large dog bounds "
"ahead of the camera with its snoot all but excavating a trench in the beach.  "
"As the view pursues the Labrador's progress, the perspective bouncing with "
"each of the unseen cameraman's steps, you can distinctly hear furtive, "
"child-like giggles escorting each of the canine's obsessive sniffs.  The "
"mirth swiftly perishes as the footage's forward momentum is arrested, the dog "
"having abruptly paused in its tracks with its muzzle raised in the air and "
"nostrils agitatedly flaring.  A series of puzzled murmurings accompany the "
"film as the quadruped slowly edges away from some unseen entity; its hackles "
"raised and chest vibrating with an escalating growl that culminates in an "
"outburst of furious howls.  As a small hand reaches from off-screen to calm "
"the maddened hound, the view gradually pans upwards.  The shift in elevation "
"reveals a deep trench scored horizontally down the width of the beach, "
"terminating at the lapping waterline.  It almost resembles the type of gouge "
"that a sizable, flat-bottomed boat would have left in the sand had such a "
"craft been dragged into the sea.  Almost.  The viscous pool of crusty, "
"greenish-yellow cytoplasm that cakes the trough places that particular "
"assessment into question."
msgstr ""
"刺眼的白沙在这段特殊影像中延展开来，沙粒在微风中轻旋，海浪声在背景中规律地低吟。一只皮毛被砂砾染成黄白色的大狗踏着潮湿的沙滩跑过镜头前方，它的鼻吻几乎要在海"
"滩上犁出沟壑。画面追随着拉布拉多犬的动作摇晃——显然拍摄者也在奔跑——能清晰听见孩童般的窃笑伴随着狗狗每一次专注的嗅探。\n"
"\n"
"欢快气氛骤然凝固。镜头突然停住，只见那狗猛然刹住脚步，仰起口鼻焦躁地抽动着鼻孔。随着四足动物缓缓后退的画面，胶片里传来困惑的嘀咕声——它背毛倒竖，胸腔震颤着"
"发出逐渐升级的咆哮，最终爆发成狂怒的嚎叫。当画面外伸出一只小手试图安抚发狂的猎犬时，镜头缓缓上移。\n"
"\n"
"抬升的视角显露出海滩上横亘着的一道深沟，一直延伸到拍打着浪花的水际线。那痕迹像是艘平底大船被拖进海里时在沙滩留下的拖痕。几乎像是。但沟槽里凝结着黄绿色粘稠胞"
"浆的恶心物质，彻底否定了这个推测。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "birthday_2026.mp4"
msgstr "生日_2026.mp4"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/birthday_2026.mp4\n"
"\n"
"As the video opens, your eyes are all but affronted by the medley of bright "
"hues that range across the screen like a star's unfurling corona: vibrant "
"orange tablecloths and emerald grass winking up at you from their position "
"under the protective arm of an outdoor gazebo.  The structure's fabric "
"apertures have been tied back, allowing volumes of light to spill in and "
"gently touch upon the huddle of people that stand poised in the foreground, "
"arrayed about a sizable table, and who are, to an attendee, livening the "
"film's audio with the multi-voiced stanzas of \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY!\"  Crouched "
"at the heart of this conflagration sits the delicious, if rather crude, "
"depiction of a Sherman tank cast in chocolate and green icing, the vehicle's "
"turret alight with six candles and its skittle armaments aimed at a small "
"child held aloft at the table's head by a fondly grinning man.  With their "
"tiny hand clutching a massive cake knife, the child's smiling happily, and, "
"as the singing reaches its peak, they puff up their small chest and direct a "
"valiant blow towards the candles (all be it still with the discreet "
"assistance of a handful of the partygoers).  In a glint of silver, the "
"blade's brought down upon the tank's hull, and the last few shots are of "
"various plates of chocolate tank armor being distributed to the party's "
"guests.\n"
"\n"
"The fact that, in the post-Cataclysm, you might very well recognize the face "
"of this same child you're watching lay into a section of chocolate tank tread "
"as it tries to peel bare your own organs with the same voracity hasn't eluded "
"you.  The notion will plague you for a long, long time to come."
msgstr ""
"路径：Downloads/生日_2026.mp4\n"
"\n"
"视频开始播放时，绚丽的色彩如恒星日冕般在屏幕上炸开：橙黄相间的桌布与翠绿的草地在露天凉亭的遮阳棚下格外扎眼。凉亭的防雨帘被卷起，阳光倾泻而入，温柔地笼罩着围"
"站在大餐桌前的人群。所有人正齐声高唱《生日快乐歌》，嘈杂的声浪充斥着整个画面。\n"
"\n"
"人群中央摆着个做工粗糙却诱人的谢尔曼坦克造型蛋糕，巧克力炮塔上插着六根蜡烛，糖果制成的炮管正对准餐桌尽头——那里有个被男人举到半空的笑呵呵小孩。孩子的小手攥"
"着巨型蛋糕刀，当歌声达到高潮时，他鼓起胸膛英勇地砍向蜡烛（当然少不了大人们暗中帮忙）。银光闪过，刀刃劈开巧克力装甲，最后几个镜头是宾客们分食坦克残骸的画面。"
"\n"
"\n"
"你突然意识到，大灾变后某天，这个正啃着巧克力履带的孩子，会有可能会用同样的贪婪撕开你的内脏。这个念头将在未来很长、很长时间里折磨着你。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Sagrada Familia destruction"
msgstr "圣家堂的陨灭"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Tinged by the scarlet light of a sun all but sunken on the horizon, long "
"shadows play across the view of concrete high-rises juxtaposed with "
"historical facades: an expansive boulevard laying several stories below the "
"camera's perspective and winding just beyond a vast structure that thrusts "
"into the darkening sky.  It takes you multiple seconds of blankly staring "
"before you realize that the sizable building in question is, or rather, used "
"to be, the Sagrada Familia.  The vast sheets of resinous growths that cocoon "
"the historical landmark and which almost seem to have been organically grown "
"from ground to spire-top make it look like a vast, throbbing organ rising "
"above the Barcelona skyline.\n"
"\n"
"As you watch, the view zooms out from the defaced structure, revealing a "
"concrete rooftop upon which, crouching, laying, and kneeling behind a low "
"parapet, a handful of soldiers dressed in Spanish army fatigues bustle about "
"a squat, mortar-like piece of ordinance while an officer discreetly peers "
"over the barrier with a pair of binoculars.  As the soldiers prepare the "
"portable artillery, the rasping growl of high-speed jet engines grows audible "
"through the tinny audio, resolving into a sonic boom that cracks through the "
"soundscape as, following a gesture from the officer, the mortar discharges "
"with a low thwump.  A plume of red follows the flare shell as it streaks into "
"the sky in a looping ark, detonating in a bright swirl of color that bathes "
"the Sagrada Familia in a relief of crimson and prompting its plasticky "
"coating to refract myriads of ruby shades.  In the heartbeat before "
"multi-role fighter jets dive from the sky, the flair's sputtering life casts "
"into stark relief many hundreds of unclear silhouettes that team about and "
"within the structure like ants.  To a speck, they collectively pause as "
"though in confusion, moments before dozens of incendiary warheads spear "
"through the structure and detonate in a shockwave of rubble: a vast flower "
"violently spreading petals of fire.\n"
"\n"
"As the landmark implodes and flames dance across the skyline, the last few "
"seconds of the video are centered on the soldiers.  Having abandoned their "
"cover in favor of observing the awesome destruction unfolding below, the "
"ragged men and women stand in a disheveled line, quietly gazing out at the "
"inferno engulfing the megalithic building and slowly spreading to immolate "
"surrounding structures.  As the last jet rolls free of its bombing run and "
"thunders overhead, the little squad's officer solemnly takes off his beret "
"and holds it to his heart as he watches the fire and, to the assembly's "
"right, you can see two men mutely hugging one another.  As the video closes, "
"atop that roof, there isn't a single pair of eyes or cheeks blackened from "
"drifting ash that are dry as the soldiers watch their city burn."
msgstr ""
"血色的夕阳浸染天际，混凝土高楼与古迹残影在暮光中交错——镜头下方，宽阔的林荫道盘旋数层，延伸至一座刺入暗沉苍穹的巨型建筑。你怔忡数秒才惊觉，那座被树脂状增生"
"体从地基到尖顶层层包裹、犹如搏动脏器般耸立于巴塞罗那地平线的庞然之物，竟是圣家堂的残骸。 \n"
"\n"
"画面骤然拉远，露出水泥屋顶上一队西班牙陆军士兵。他们蜷伏在矮墙后，围着迫击炮般的武器忙碌，军官则举着望远镜窥探。随着便携火炮准备就绪，喷气引擎的尖啸刺破杂音"
"，音爆骤响的瞬间，军官挥手示意，炮口发出沉闷的\"砰\""
"声。曳光弹划出猩红弧线，在圣家堂上空炸开绚烂火环，将胶质外壳折射成万千血晶。闪光熄灭前的刹那，数百模糊身影如蚁群在建筑内外躁动——下一秒，数十枚燃烧弹贯穿穹"
"顶，冲击波掀起烈焰花瓣，整座地标在火浪中崩塌。 \n"
"\n"
"视频末尾聚焦于这群士兵。他们弃了掩体，衣衫褴褛地站成一列，凝视火海吞噬巨石建筑并向四周蔓延。最后一架战机呼啸掠过时，军官肃然摘下贝雷帽按在胸前，右侧两名士兵"
"正无声相拥。镜头渐暗，屋顶上每张沾满飘灰的面孔都泪痕斑驳，他们望着故乡在烈火中沉沦。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Video of British officials evacuation"
msgstr "英国官员撤离录像"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This video is both extremely rocky and taken up by a bouncing and poorly shot "
"view of a car's headrest, the tinted windscreen beyond, and, ultimately, a "
"stretch of blacktop racing past in a vomit-inducing blur of black, grays, and "
"browns.  The rear gate of a military Land Rover is visible through the "
"armored sedan's windscreen, slaloming it's way through an ankle-deep stream "
"of water as it spearheads a convoy of adjoining vehicles with a dual-column "
"of Challenger II tanks looming to either side of the view, all lashed by rain "
"that thunders from an iron gray sky and peppers the windscreen.  The video "
"continues in this fashion for several minutes, with tombstones of concrete "
"buildings and scraggly patches of green whipping by before, with a squeal of "
"suspension and tires, the car swerves onto a broad stretch of asphalt and "
"judders to a halt, the expanse of Heathrow's runway zone unfurling beyond.  "
"As the escorting armored vehicles' hatches thump open, expelling uniformed "
"soldiers that jump to the waterlogged ground, the camera judders: the "
"perspective swinging about and filming the interior of the sedan's door "
"before it's summarily booted open, and the perspective's trained towards the "
"tarmac as a pair of well-appointed suede shoes plant themselves beyond the "
"threshold.\n"
"\n"
"As an indistinct tumult of snarls and groans starts to grow audible over the "
"rain and the chop of rotors slices into the audio, the view returns to the "
"horizontal and briefly takes in the sight of an officious-looking helicopter "
"with MOD markings idling upon a landing pad before the film assumes the view "
"of the cameramen's footwear once again.  With speed that would make an "
"Olympian proud, they all but fly across the concrete, stepping up and into "
"the aircraft in a matter of moments as the boom of gunshots echoes over the "
"throb of thunder.  What follows is a jumble of activity, the view buffeted "
"about as the cameraman buckles into a seat and you see other pairs of legs "
"carrying their owners into the cabin.  Eventually, the recorder swings the "
"view up past a series of pallid faces and directs the perspective through the "
"aircraft's side window.  Beyond the barrier, a line of Royal Marines are "
"forming a rifle-bristling shield around the helicopter, white flashes flaring "
"from their weapons as they direct warning volleys over the heads of a "
"gargantuan mass of, what you recognize to be, nigh-unanimously zombies baring "
"down on the procession like a meaty wave of mangled flesh.  Soon enough, you "
"can see blood spurting from the horde and running in pink lines with the rain "
"as the shots lose their friendly edge.\n"
"\n"
"As the last official-looking man boards the helicopter and collapses into a "
"seat, three soldiers break away from the rifle wall and, wearing the faces of "
"men who have just won the lottery, splash through the downpour, jumping "
"aboard the aircraft a heartbeat before the Sikorsky abandons its contact with "
"the Earth and lifts over the head of the massacre below.  As though the "
"entryways of their vehicles had been magically transfigured into the mouths "
"of vacuum cleaners, the marines still on the ground look as though they're "
"all but sucked into their armor, with the last hatch slamming closed just as "
"the horde crashes over the blocks of steel.  Plumes of exhaust rise from the "
"vehicles as they gear into motion, and those members of the gnawing flesh "
"wall that are recognizably feral have, largely, enough sense to bully their "
"way clear of the heavy military armor.  The zombies, on the other hand, don't "
"get the memo.  By the time the last Challenger bumps free of the tarmac, the "
"vehicles unanimously look like someone's sprayed them down with ketchup."
msgstr ""
"这段视频画面剧烈晃动，镜头始终对准汽车头枕和茶色挡风玻璃，最终定格在飞速掠过的沥青路面——黑色、灰色与棕色混杂成令人作呕的模糊色块。透过防弹轿车的挡风玻璃，"
"可见军用路虎的后舱门在领航车队中蛇行前进，两侧赫然排列着挑战者II型坦克双纵队。铁灰色的天空暴雨如注，雨点密集敲打着车窗。混凝土建筑墓碑般的轮廓与零星的绿色"
"植被在镜头中飞掠而过，直到刺耳的悬架摩擦声中，轿车猛然转向宽阔的跑道区域，在希思罗机场的停机坪上剧烈颠簸着停下。\n"
"\n"
"随着护卫装甲车的舱门砰砰打开，跳下积水泥地的制服士兵们让镜头再次晃动。视角突然转向轿车内门，随后被粗暴踹开，一双考究的麂皮皮鞋踏入停机坪。模糊不清的咆哮声逐"
"渐压过雨声，螺旋桨的轰鸣撕裂空气时，镜头短暂捕捉到印有国防部标志的直升机，旋即又落回拍摄者的鞋面。他们以奥运选手般的速度掠过混凝土地面，枪声在雷鸣中炸响的瞬"
"间，所有人已冲进机舱。\n"
"\n"
"接下来的画面颠簸混乱：苍白面孔在舷窗边闪动，窗外可见皇家海军陆战队正用步枪构筑防线。警告性的齐射白焰划过尸潮头顶——那是由扭曲血肉组成的恐怖浪潮，几乎全是蜂"
"拥而至的丧尸。很快子弹便失去威慑，粉色血线在雨中从尸群中喷溅而出。\n"
"\n"
"当最后一位官员模样的男子瘫坐在机舱时，三名士兵突然脱离枪阵，带着中彩票般的狂喜表情蹚过暴雨跳上直升机。西科斯基直升机离地的刹那，尸潮如海啸般吞没了地面装甲车"
"队。仍在车外的陆战队员仿佛被吸进钢铁罐头，最后一道舱门关闭的瞬间，丧尸群已撞上金属堡垒。当最后一辆挑战者坦克碾过染血的跑道时，所有装甲车辆都像被番茄酱淋透的"
"热狗。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "t_Be_An_Andrew.mp4"
msgstr "别学安德鲁.mp4"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"Downloads/Don't_Be_An_Andrew.mp4\n"
"\n"
"An almost offensively bright soundtrack assaults your ears as this video "
"opens—a piano, a drum set, and what sounds suspiciously like a saxophone "
"rubbing shoulders in the background and playing over the words of an animated "
"unicorn that stands in the foreground.  Dressed in a jumper with \"FEMA\" "
"printed across the chest in bright colors, the character's voice has less to "
"do with a magically glowing equine and more to do with a buttery "
"Anglo-American male with a cadence deeper than the Grand Canyon, more "
"reverberant than a set of church bells, and possessing an upbeat tone that "
"belies the subject content.\n"
"\n"
"\"What to do?\"  The unicorn muses, leaning an elbow contemplatively upon a "
"desk.\n"
"\n"
"\"It's a question that everybody's asking during these unhappy times, and "
"that many folks are giving wrong answers to.  With all the mean people going "
"around, you might find yourself, or might have even already been, in some "
"pretty scary situations!  So, let me tell you what to do.  Don't be an "
"Andrew.\"\n"
"\n"
"The scene shifts, showing an anthropomorphic mouse huddling within a cartoon "
"evacuation shelter as the unicorn's voice narrates over the top.\n"
"\n"
"\"This is Andrew.  Andrew needs to wait for people to come and take him to "
"safety, and he's currently in what we call an evacuation shelter, but "
"Andrew's decided that he's going to try and leave on his own!\"\n"
"\n"
"The mouse proceeds to peek out the shelter's door before trotting casually "
"into the road beyond.  This particular venture lasts for all of 3 seconds "
"before he summarily gets trampled by an on-coming pony, flattening into a "
"furry pancake upon the street as the unicorn resumes.\n"
"\n"
"\"Don't, do, this!  If you're in a safe area—a shelter, basement, or communal "
"gathering point—do not leave it for any reason.  People can't protect you if "
"they can't find you, so wait for grownups to come and take you to a safe "
"place.\"\n"
"\n"
"As the mouse peals himself off the street, a bus driven by a squirrel wearing "
"a cartoon army helmet motors up, and the rodent boards the vehicle.\n"
"\n"
"\"Don't be scared of the people sent to evacuate you.  They might look scary "
"with all the guns, but their only job is to keep you safe.\"\n"
"\n"
"The clip proceeds in this fashion for several more minutes, demonstrating, "
"among other matters, the importance of donning gasmasks when venturing "
"outside—always, as the unicorn jovially reminds, \"with the aid of an "
"adult,\" boiling water before drinking, and maintaining a blackout curfew—all "
"points helpfully illustrated by the titular Andrew dramatically failing to "
"adhere to all of the above.  The last frame of the video concludes with a "
"shot of the mouse safely installed within a brightly colored tent complex, a "
"number of other animals poised at the perimeters in cartoon military "
"uniforms, and a smattering of other characters dotted about the tents.  The "
"legend, \"THE FEDERAL EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT AGENCY, HERE TO PROTECT YOUR "
"SAFETY,\" spans the frame in block capitals."
msgstr ""
"路径：Downloads/别学安德鲁.mp4\n"
"视频开场就用近乎冒犯的欢快旋律轰炸你的耳膜——钢琴、架子鼓和疑似萨克斯风的乐器在背景里勾肩搭背，为前景中动画独角兽的旁白伴奏。这头穿着印有\"FEMA\""
"亮色连体衣的角色，嗓音毫无魔法骏马的空灵感，反倒像是个油滑的英美混血男声，节奏感比科罗拉多大峡谷更深沉，回响效果胜过整组教堂钟鸣，那欢快的语调与阴沉的主题形"
"成诡异反差。\n"
"\n"
"\"该怎么办？\"独角兽将前肘撑在办公桌上作沉思状。\n"
"\n"
"\"在这个糟糕的时代，所有人都在问这个问题，而多数人给出了错误答案。面对四处横行的暴徒，你可能已经——或即将——陷入危险处境！让我来告诉你正确答案：别学安德"
"鲁。\"\n"
"\n"
"画面切换成拟人化老鼠蜷缩在卡通避难所里，独角兽的画外音继续响起。\n"
"\n"
"\"这是安德鲁。他本该等待救援人员护送撤离，此刻正待在所谓的避难所里，但这家伙居然想独自开溜！\"\n"
"\n"
"老鼠鬼鬼祟祟探出避难所大门，大摇大摆晃到外面马路上。这场冒险仅维持了三秒钟，他就被疾驰而来的小马驹踩成毛茸茸的肉饼。独角兽的声音再度响起：\n"
"\n"
"\"千！万！别！学！他！如果你处在安全区域——避难所、地下室或集体安置点——无论如何都不要离开。救援人员找不到你就没法保护你，乖乖等大人带你去安全地带。\""
"\n"
"\n"
"当老鼠把自己从路面揭下来时，戴着卡通钢盔的松鼠驾驶巴士抵达，这只啮齿动物终于上了车。\n"
"\n"
"\"别害怕前来疏散你的工作人员。他们全副武装的样子可能很吓人，但唯一任务就是保护你的安全。\"\n"
"\n"
"视频后续用几分钟演示了更多生存要点：外出时必须佩戴防毒面具（独角兽欢乐提醒\"记得让大人帮忙\""
"）、饮水必须煮沸、严格遵守宵禁——每个环节都由安德鲁用惨烈失败进行生动示范。最后画面定格在老鼠安全抵达彩绘帐篷营地，周围站着穿卡通军装的其他动物，帐篷间散布"
"着各色角色。粗体标语横贯屏幕：\"联邦应急管理局·誓护万家平安\"。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "FEMA evacuation instructions"
msgstr "联邦应急疏散指南"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"This appears to be a civil-protection video, published by the Federal "
"Emergency Management Agency a handful of days before the official evacuation "
"order was declared.  Within the clip, standing within a plain-featured, "
"well-lit room behind a steel table, a close-shaven redhead in a light olive "
"shirt demonstrates the proper donning and doffing procedure for a gasmask, as "
"well as providing general tips and information for proper NBC conduct.  Mask "
"in hand and with an assortment of cylindrical filters arrayed upon the table, "
"she demonstrates dawning, screwing in the proper filter, pressurizing the "
"mask for an airtight seal, and repeatedly encouraging the viewer to "
"\"Remember, gentlemen, shave your chin first before even thinking about "
"trying to put on a mask.  That goes for you as well, ladies.  All that "
"hair—ponytails, pigtails, bangs, whatever—needs to go right out the window.  "
"You can keep the eyebrows, though.\"\n"
"\n"
"At the video's conclusion, the instructor outlines several tactics for "
"protecting one's self from biological contaminants, including several methods "
"for distilling water, sealing the edges of doors and window frames with "
"masking tape, and formulating a makeshift NBC suit from multi-layered "
"water-proof rubber storm coats, waders, gloves, and a liberal amount of duct "
"tape.  Ultimately, the clip rounds off with a solemn warning that \"all the "
"equipment in the world won't protect you from negligence and stupidity, for "
"all the keyboard warriors and self-proclaimed preppers watching.  All this "
"gear is only meant to allow you to evacuate to a safer area, and that's all "
"it'll do.  It won't let you ride out a catastrophe indefinitely, so it's "
"still important that you keep your heads down and proceed to an evacuation "
"gathering point if and when the call goes out.\""
msgstr ""
"这似乎是民防部门发布的应急教学视频，由联邦应急管理局在正式疏散令下达前数日公开。视频中，一名短发红发女子身着浅橄榄色制服，站在灯光惨白的钢制讲台后方，现场演"
"示防毒面具的正确佩戴步骤，同时讲解核生化防护的基本要点。她手持面具，将各种圆柱形滤毒罐排列在桌面上，逐步展示佩戴流程：旋紧滤罐、测试气密性，并不厌其烦地强调"
"\"先生们记住，刮净胡茬才是戴面具的前提。女士们也不例外——马尾辫、刘海、所有毛发都得处理干净。当然，眉毛可以留着。\"\n"
"\n"
"视频尾声部分，教官详述了防范生物污染的要领：包括多种净水方法、用胶带密封门窗缝隙，以及如何用多层防水雨衣、胶靴、手套和大量管道胶带拼凑临时防护服。最后画面定"
"格在肃穆的警告字幕上：\""
"所有装备都救不了粗心蠢货，这话说给键盘侠和末日爱好者听。这些装备唯一作用就是帮你撤到安全区，仅此而已。别妄想靠它们苟活，听到疏散广播就立刻低头赶往集合点。\""

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Fergie Hensen's suicide note"
msgstr "菲姬·恒森的自杀留言"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"The video starts with an exhausted-looking white woman with shaggy brown hair "
"clumsily setting her phone onto what you assume to be a table.  She then sits "
"back, leaving her face and upper body in frame with a stained wallpaper "
"behind her.  \"Hello, my name is Fergie Hensen, I am 47 years old and have "
"worked the last 10 years of my life as a neonatal nurse.  By the time you see "
"this video, I've committed suicide.\"  She winces and gasps in pain lifting "
"up her left arm - showing a massive bite mark leaking with muddy green pus.  "
"\"I don't have long before I die - and before I do, I have to say something "
"important, something you MUST remember.\"  She looks back at the camera with "
"a pained half-smile and gritted teeth, speaking with a low but sincere tone.  "
"\"You, you watching this video, don't ever give up, keep pushing, don't call "
"it quits by killing yourself.  Keep going for as long as you can.\"  Her "
"voice trembles and her eyes get watery, \"I… believe there are people out "
"there in this hell, people like you, who can make things better.\"  The woman "
"is trying her best to hold back the agonized tears streaming down her "
"disheveled face as her voice starts to crack.  \"Find happiness and friends "
"wherever you can, and remember you've got a purpose, and that purpose is not "
"only to survive, it's to thrive.\"  She lets out an anguished gasp, nearly "
"doubling over in pain before stammering out \"Promise me, please, j-just "
"promise me whoever you are, that you'll do that, please.\"  She then tries to "
"grab the phone off the table to stop recording, but it falls onto the floor "
"the video doesn't end until 7 seconds later.  In the time remaining, she "
"languorously picks the phone off the floor and holds it close to her face - "
"it is only then you register just how bloodshot her eyes are."
msgstr ""
"画面中，一个面容憔悴的白人女性正笨拙地将手机架在桌面上。她凌乱的棕发黏在汗湿的额头上，身后墙纸布满可疑的污渍。\"我叫弗吉·汉森，47"
"岁，当了十年新生儿护士...\"她突然抽搐着抬起左臂，溃烂的咬伤处正渗出墨绿色脓液，\"等你们看到这段录像时...我已经自杀了。\"\n"
"\n"
"剧痛让她倒抽冷气，却仍对着镜头挤出扭曲的微笑：\"听着...无论你是谁...别放弃...继续挣扎...\"她的声音开始破碎，浑浊的泪水冲开脸上的血污，\""
"这地狱里...还有像你这样的人...能让世界变好...\"\n"
"\n"
"濒死的喘息声中，她突然扑向镜头：\"答应我...不仅要活下去...要活得漂亮...\""
"手机坠地的闷响后，画面持续了七秒。最后映入眼帘的是她拾起手机的特写——那双布满血丝的眼睛里，凝固着某种近乎虔诚的恳求。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "Pepper spray strategy"
msgstr "辣椒喷雾战术"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"While looking through the device's collection of mundane photos and videos, "
"you stumble across a recording of some undated late-night CCTV footage taken "
"in a trashed suburban neighborhood.  10 seconds into the video, an alarmed "
"young woman sprints into view quickly followed by a feral man covered in "
"blood and muck.  He quickly catches up to her and grapples her left arm.  "
"They scuffle for quite some time until the woman manages to break his grip.  "
"Reaching hastily into her purse, she pulls a small can of pepper spray - "
"generously spraying it onto his face then shoulder-bashing the man onto the "
"pavement.  The man gurgles and fidgets in pain as the woman sprints into the "
"distance, out of the camera's view."
msgstr ""
"在翻看设备里那些平淡无奇的日常照片和视频时，你偶然发现了一段没有日期的深夜监控录像。画面中是一片狼藉的城郊街区。视频播放到第10"
"秒，一个惊慌失措的年轻女子突然闯入镜头，身后紧跟着个浑身血污的疯男人。他很快追上她，死死抓住了她的左臂。两人激烈扭打了好一阵，女子终于挣脱束缚。她慌乱地在手"
"提包里摸索，掏出一小罐辣椒喷雾——对着男人的脸就是一顿猛喷，接着用肩膀将他狠狠撞倒在柏油路上。男人痛苦地发出咕噜声，在地上抽搐挣扎，而女子早已冲出镜头范围，"
"消失在了远处的黑暗中。"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid "humorous?  giant spider photo"
msgstr "巨型蜘蛛照片"

#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"You find a zoomed-in photo of what appears to be a gargantuan brown recluse "
"spider (you guess to be relatively above the size of a cow) lying in wait for "
"its prey in a thick sprawling web strung between multiple pine trees.  The "
"sky is cloudy and the area surrounding and including the forest is relatively "
"foggy, but the photos have been edited to make the spider clearer.  There is "
"a caption overlaying a semi-transparent gray bar below the spider.  \"I "
"should've stayed in Atlanta dawg what the FUUCKKKKKK\" followed by a crying "
"and laughing emoji."
msgstr ""
"你发现一张放大的照片，画面里赫然是只体型堪比奶牛的棕色遁蛛，正盘踞在多棵松树间织就的巨大蛛网上守株待兔。阴云密布的天空下，整片雾气缭绕的森林都被后期处理过，"
"使得那只蜘蛛格外清晰。照片底部半透明灰色条幅上写着一行字：\"我他妈就该待在亚特兰大啊啊啊啊啊——\"后面跟着个笑哭的表情符号。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "A light breeze hits you from above."
msgstr "你的头顶突然吹过一阵微风。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "You notice a small patch of dust appear nearby."
msgstr "你注意到身边出现了一撮微尘。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "You smell a mild chemical odor you can't quite place."
msgstr "你闻到一股淡淡的化学气味，但找不到源头。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "Your hair stands on end as a faint electrical tingle washes over you."
msgstr "你的头发竖立着，一股微弱的电流刺痛感笼罩着你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "For a split second, a nearby object becomes hazy."
msgstr "有一瞬间，身旁某个物体变得朦胧。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "For a moment, all colors grow slightly brighter."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的颜色都微微变亮了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "For a moment, all distances seem to grow slightly."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的距离似乎都微微拉长了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"The straight lines of surrounding objects appear to be curved just so "
"slightly."
msgstr "周围物体的直边好像弯曲了一点点。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "The angles of geometric objects around don't appear to add up."
msgstr "周围几何物体的角度好像不太对。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/weather/dust_storm_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
#. ~ Snippet in category "DUST_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#. ~ Snippet in category "DUST_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "A gust of wind hits you from above."
msgstr "你的头顶突然吹过一阵风。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "You notice several small patches of dust appear nearby."
msgstr "你注意到身边出现了几撮微尘。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "You smell a chemical odor you can't quite place."
msgstr "你闻到一股化学气味，但找不到源头。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "Your hair stands on end as an electrical tingle washes over you."
msgstr "你的头发竖立着，一股电流刺痛感笼罩着你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "For a split second, several nearby objects become hazy."
msgstr "有一瞬间，身旁某些物体变得朦胧。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "For a moment, all colors grow brighter."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的颜色都变得更亮了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "For a moment, all distances seem to grow."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的距离似乎都拉长了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "The straight lines of the surrounding objects seem to gain some curvature."
msgstr "周围物体的直边看起来变得弯曲了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "The angles of the geometric objects around have gone awry and do not add up."
msgstr "周围几何物体的角度出现了偏差，不合情理。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "A gust of wind hits you from above and below."
msgstr "你的头顶和身下突然吹过一阵风。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "You notice several large patches of dust appear nearby."
msgstr "你注意到身边出现了几团灰尘。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "You smell a harsh chemical odor you can't quite place."
msgstr "你闻到一种难闻的化学气味，但找不到源头。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "Your hair stands on end as a powerful electrical tingle washes over you."
msgstr "你的头发竖立着，一波强烈的电流刺痛感笼罩着你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a split second, all nearby objects become hazy."
msgstr "有一瞬间，身旁所有物体都变得朦胧。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a moment, all colors grow much brighter."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的颜色都变得非常明亮。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a moment, all distances seem to grow much longer."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的距离似乎都拉长了许多。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "The straight lines of the surrounding objects seem to bend."
msgstr "周围物体的直边看起来弯折了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_INDOOR_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"Euclidean geometry seems to fail at every turn.  Here and there you see "
"impossible shapes and angles that seem to point inward as well as outward at "
"the same time."
msgstr "歐幾里德在這裡似乎並不適用。你到處都能看到不可能的形狀和角度，似乎能同時朝向內部和外部。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You see what seems to be a new constellation in the sky.  The stars are quite "
"dense and are precisely aligned in several regular polyhedrons next to each "
"other."
msgstr "你看见天空中似乎出现了一个新的星座。那些星星排列成稠密的星团，并且相互之间排列成几个精确又规则的多面体。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You see what seems to be a new constellation in the sky.  The stars are in a "
"precise spiral, with the central star constantly shifting color."
msgstr "你看见天空中似乎出现了一个新的星座。那些星星排列成精确的螺旋形，中心恒星不断变换着颜色。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You see several shooting stars.  They seem larger than normal, and are all a "
"deep purple."
msgstr "你看见了几颗流星。它们看起来比平常大，而且都是深紫色。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You see a shooting star.  It is bright red and does not fall in a straight "
"line."
msgstr "你看见了一颗流星。它是鲜红色的，坠落的轨迹也不是直线。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"For a brief moment you see a shape in the sky roughly the size of the moon, "
"but square and green."
msgstr "有那么一瞬间，你能看见天空中出现了一个物体，大概有月亮那么大，但却是绿色的正方形。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"For a brief moment, the stars and moon all disappear.  When they come back, "
"you're not sure if they're in the same places as they were."
msgstr "有那么一瞬间，星星和月亮都消失了。当它们重新出现时，你不确定它们是否还在之前的那个地方。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"The darkness around you thickens.  It is like a dense fog that sticks to your "
"skin."
msgstr "你周围的黑暗愈发厚重。它就像浓雾一样粘在你的皮肤上。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"You see what seems to be a new constellation in the sky.  It changes shape as "
"you look, from a triangle to a pentagon."
msgstr "你看见天空中似乎出现了一个新的星座。就在你盯着它看时，它从三角形变成了五边形。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"You see what seems to be a new constellation in the sky, in the shape of a "
"hexagon.  It's easy to pick out - there are glowing lines between the stars."
msgstr "你看见天空中似乎出现了一个新的星座，呈六边形。它很容易被辨别出来——星星之间有发光的线条连接。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"You see several shooting stars.  After they go below the horizon, a bright "
"glow silently flickers, then dies."
msgstr "你看见了几颗流星。当它们坠落至地平线以下时，一道亮光静静地闪烁，然后熄灭。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"You see a shooting star.  It is bright red, and stops falling after a second. "
" There it hovers."
msgstr "你看见了一颗流星。它是鲜红色的，过了一秒钟后停止坠落，随后在半空中盘旋。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"For a brief moment, you see a shape in the sky roughly the size of the moon.  "
"It looked like a blinking eye."
msgstr "有那么一瞬间，你能看见天空中出现了一个物体，大概有月亮那么大。它看起来就像是一只会眨的眼睛。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "You see a moving object in the sky, with a blinking red light coming from it."
msgstr "你看见天空中有一个移动的物体发出闪烁的红光。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"The darkness around you thickens and surrounds you like a veil.  It seems… "
"alive."
msgstr "你周围的黑暗愈发厚重，如纱幕般包围着你。像是……活的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "You see a once-familiar constellation, and watch as several of its stars move."
msgstr "你看见一个曾经熟悉的星座，看着它其中的几个星星正在移动。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"You see what seems to be a new constellation in the sky.  It reminds you of a "
"serpent - it moves like one."
msgstr "你看见天空中似乎出现了一个新的星座。它让你想起蛇——它能像蛇一样移动。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"You see a shooting star.  It seems to be heading straight for you before "
"vanishing suddenly."
msgstr "你看见了一颗流星。它似乎正朝着你直奔而来，然后突然消失。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a brief moment, you see a pentagonal shape in the sky, roughly twice the "
"size of the moon.  It splits into several triangles and then reforms before "
"vanishing."
msgstr "有那么一瞬间，你能看见天空中出现了一个五边形的物体，大概有两个月亮那么大。它分裂成几个三角形，随后重新组合在一起，最后消失不见。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"As you look at the stars, they wink out for an instant, reappearing just "
"slightly out of place, as if the night sky had been rotated ever so slightly. "
" This occurs twice more, in rapid succession."
msgstr "当你抬头看星星时，它们眨了眨眼，又出现了，只是有点不对位，就好像夜空被轻轻地旋转过一样。这种情况又连续快速地出现了两次。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"A strange cloud seems to float in the sky, at the very edge of your "
"peripheral vision.  Just as you shift your gaze to it, it evaporates, boiling "
"away into a stream of shooting stars."
msgstr "一朵奇怪的云似乎漂浮在天空中，就在你视野的尽头。当你把目光转向它时，它仿佛蒸发了，沸腾成一股流星组成的溪流。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a brief moment, you feel like you've been jerked to the side.  You "
"haven't moved, though - the stars have."
msgstr "有那么一瞬间，你觉得自己被狠狠推了一把。你并没有动，但是——星星动了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"As you look at the stars, a broad swath of them are plunged into darkness, "
"then come back to life in ragged succession."
msgstr "当你抬头看星星时，一大片星星陷入了黑暗之中，然后又纷纷不断地重新亮起来。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_NIGHT_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"The darkness around you is so thick that it seems organic.  Your every move "
"seems to tear the veil of night.  And the night is not fond of it."
msgstr "你周围的黑暗如此厚重，像是活物。你的一举一动仿佛都在撕破黑夜的纱幕。而黑夜对此甚是不满。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "You see what looks like an island in the sky, drifting lazily with the clouds."
msgstr "你仿佛看到天空中有一个小岛，在云层中慵懒地漂浮。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"For the briefest of instants, the sun seems to turn red, and drips with "
"liquid.  But the color of the light around you doesn't change."
msgstr "有一瞬间，太阳似乎变红了，滴下了液体。但是你周围光线的颜色并未改变。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"Buildings the size of mountains sprout in the distance for a brief moment, "
"rising and falling in the span of a heartbeat."
msgstr "山峦般大小的建筑在远处伸出来了片刻，如同心跳一般起起落落。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"For an instant, you are in a crowd of partially transparent people.  They "
"take no notice of you."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你仿佛置身于半透明的人群之中。而他们没有注意到你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You see a small airplane flying low in the sky.  It's flying backwards, and "
"has a flag you don't know on it."
msgstr "你看到一架小飞机在低空中飞行，但它在朝后飞，上面有面你不认识的旗帜。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "All the shadows you can see rotate as if the sun was moving."
msgstr "你眼前所见到的阴影都开始旋转，就好像太阳在移动一样。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You see a few additional shadows, but there is no apparent light that could "
"be causing them."
msgstr "你看到了幾道額外的影子，可是沒看到能照出影子的光源。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"You see what looks like a chain of islands in the sky, drifting lazily with "
"the clouds."
msgstr "你仿佛看到天空中有一串小岛，在云层中慵懒地漂浮。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "For a split second, the sun dims, then brightens again."
msgstr "有一瞬间，太阳变暗了，然后再次变亮。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"Insects the size of mountains appear in a chain on the horizon.  Then, they "
"vanish."
msgstr "山峦般大小的昆虫出现在地平线上。然后，它们消失了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"For an instant you are in a crowd of partially transparent people.  They all "
"turn to look at you."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你仿佛置身于半透明的人群之中。而他们都转过身来盯着你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"You see a large airplane flying low in the sky.  It's flying backwards, and "
"is flying the flag of your native country - only with inverted colors."
msgstr "你看到一架小飞机在低空中飞行，但它在朝后飞，上面有面你认识的旗帜——只是颜色颠倒。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"All the shadows you can see change shape and color, resembling human "
"silhouettes for several seconds."
msgstr "你眼前所见到的阴影都改变了形状和颜色，有几秒钟像是人的轮廓。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"You see some extra shadows, but not the light that causes them.  Some of them "
"aren't even attached to objects."
msgstr "你看到一些额外的影子，但没看到产生它们的光源。其中一些影子甚至根本没有连接到任何物体。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a second, you see what looks like a city in the sky."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你仿佛看到天空中有个城市。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"The sun changes course to the north and speeds up.  It stops almost "
"immediately, having moved about half an inch."
msgstr "太阳转向北方并加速。它几乎立即就停下了，移动了大约半英寸。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"A crowd of humans the size of mountains sprout from the earth on the horizon. "
" When you blink, they're gone."
msgstr "一群山峦般大小的人类从地平线上的地上冒出来。你眨了眨眼，它们又不见了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For an instant, you are in a crowd of partially transparent people.  All of "
"them are pointing at you, screaming silently."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你仿佛置身于半透明的人群之中。而他们都指着你，默默尖叫。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"You see a large airplane flying low in the sky, flying backwards.  A "
"parachuter appears near it, and seemingly falls up into the plane as they "
"struggle."
msgstr "你看到一架大飞机在低空中飞行，但它在朝后飞。一个降落伞出现在它的附近，人影不断挣扎，它似乎又回到了飞机上。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"All the shadows you can see change shape and color, beginning to resemble "
"figures with far too many limbs beckoning to you to come towards them."
msgstr "你眼前所见到的阴影都改变了形状和颜色，开始变得像人一样，无数肢体向你招手，让你加入它们。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DAY_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"The shadows seem to live a life of their own.  Many are detached, as if they "
"were cast by invisible objects.  Other objects in turn, including yourself, "
"do not cast shadows despite the light."
msgstr "影子似乎过着自己的生活。许多独立了出来，就像是由不可见的物体投射而成。反倒是其他物体，包括你自己，尽管有光照也没能投下阴影。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "A giant hole opens in the sky, and several clouds vanish into it."
msgstr "一个巨大的洞在天空中打开，几朵云彩消失在其中。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "A giant hole opens in the sky, and several dark clouds emerge from it."
msgstr "一个巨大的洞在天空中打开，几朵乌云从中冒出来。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"For a split second, the world grows hazy as if there were other shapes laid "
"on top."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界变得朦胧起来，如同有其他形状的东西叠加在上面一般。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "A hole in reality opens for a split second, and you can see your own back."
msgstr "现实空间中瞬间打开了一个洞，你可以从中看到自己的背影。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "For a moment, all colors grow dull."
msgstr "一瞬間，所有的顏色都變得黯淡了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "For a moment, all distances seem to shrink."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的距离似乎都缩小了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid "For a moment, all angles seem to bend."
msgstr "一瞬間，所有角度似乎都扭曲了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"A short figure quickly fades in and out of existence, too fast to see its "
"features."
msgstr "一个身材矮小的人影突然出现又消失了，让你分辨不出它的五官。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"You smell an entirely new smell, like nothing you have smelled before.  You "
"can't decide if it is good or bad."
msgstr "你闻到了一股全新的气味，和你以前闻到任何东西都不同。你无法确定这是好是坏。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "A giant hole opens in the sky, and several neon clouds emerge from it."
msgstr "一个巨大的洞在天空中打开，几朵霓虹云从中冒出来。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"A giant hole that looks like an eye opens in the sky, then closes as if "
"blinking."
msgstr "一个看起来像眼睛的大洞在天空中打开，然后闭上，好像在眨眼。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "For a split second, the world is overlaid with a vast, empty void."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界仿佛被一个巨大的虚空所覆盖。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"For a split second, the world is overlaid with a tiny, featureless, circular "
"room."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界仿佛被一个小小的、毫无特色的圆形房间所覆盖。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"For a split second, the world is overlaid with a vast alien landscape with "
"building-sized plant-like shapes all around you."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界仿佛被一片巨大的外星地貌所覆盖，周围都是楼房大小的植物形状。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"For a split second, the world is overlaid with an empty and ruined city.  It "
"is built to a vastly different scale than those on Earth."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界仿佛被一座空无一人、破败不堪的城市所覆盖，尽管其建造方式与地球上的大不相同。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"For a moment, a hole in reality opens and you can see an almost perfect copy "
"of yourself."
msgstr "片刻之间，现实空间中打开了一个洞，你可以从中看到一个几乎完美的你自己。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "For a moment, all colors invert."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的颜色都反色了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "For a moment, all distances seem to double."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的距离似乎都翻倍了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid "For a moment, all angles seem to invert."
msgstr "有一瞬间，所有的角度似乎都翻转了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_2"
msgid ""
"A tall figure quickly fades in and out of existence, leaving you with a vague "
"impression of malice."
msgstr "一个高大的人影突然出现又消失了，给你留下了一种隐约的恶意印象。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"You smell an entirely new smell, like nothing you have smelled before.  It "
"makes you gag."
msgstr "你闻到了一股全新的气味，和你以前闻到任何东西都不同。它让你恶心。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "Your hair stands on end as a sharp electrical current washes over you."
msgstr "你的头发竖立着，一股强烈的电流刺痛感笼罩着你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"A jagged hole opens in the sky, and a vast cloud in the shape of an "
"asymmetrical person emerges."
msgstr "一个锯齿形的洞在天空中打开，一片巨大的云以不对称的人的形状出现。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "A jagged hole that resembles an eye opens in the sky, then stares at you."
msgstr "一个像眼睛的锯齿形的洞在天空中打开，然后凝视着你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a split second, the world vanishes, and you are in a vast, empty void."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界仿佛消失了，而你在一个巨大的虚空之中。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a split second, the world vanishes, and you are in a tiny, featureless, "
"circular room."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界仿佛消失了，而你在一间小小的、毫无特色的圆形房间里。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a split second, the world vanishes, and you are in a vast alien landscape "
"with building-sized plant-like shapes all around you."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界仿佛消失了，而你身处巨大的外星地貌，周围都是楼房大小的植物形状。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a split second, the world vanishes, and you are in an empty and ruined "
"city.  It is built to a vastly different scale than those on Earth."
msgstr "有一瞬间，世界仿佛消失了，而你身处一座空无一人、破败不堪的城市，尽管其建造方式与地球上的大不相同。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a moment, a hole in reality opens and you can see a leering, idealized "
"copy of yourself."
msgstr "片刻之间，现实空间中打开了一个洞，你可以从中看到一个邪笑着的理想化的你自己。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a moment, all colors flow to form jagged shapes."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的颜色流动变成碎片。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a moment, all distances seem to vanish, as if everything was one.  It is "
"claustrophobic."
msgstr "片刻之间，所有的距离似乎都消失了，仿佛一切都是一个整体。有些幽闭恐怖症。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a moment, all angles seem ungraspable.  Impossible shapes are everywhere."
msgstr "在一瞬間，所有的角度變的不可理喻。不可能的形體無處不在。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"A tall figure quickly fades in and out of existence, staring and pointing at "
"you the whole time."
msgstr "一个高大的人影突然出现又消失了，它一直盯着你，指着你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid "You hear a gentle voice saying \"Come outside.  I'm waiting for you.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"出来吧。我在等着你。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Why are you not here yet?  It's beautiful "
"outside.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"为什么还不出来呢？外边很美哦。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"What a sky.  Unlimited, deep, blue.  The "
"ocean of fresh air is at hand while you gasp mold and dust behind four walls.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"天空真美啊。无限，深邃，湛蓝。大海一样的清新空气随手可得，而你却只能在四面围墙环绕中呼吸着霉菌和尘土。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid "You hear a gentle voice saying \"There is a place for you here.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"这里为你留了一个位子。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"The place you called home is not there "
"anymore.  Come with me and find your new home.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"你称之为家的地方已经不在了。跟我来，找到你的新家。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"What good comes from hiding from the truth "
"in a mausoleum of brick walls?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"在砖墙砌成的陵墓里逃避真相有什么好的？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"There is no amount of concrete or stone you "
"could put between you and the veil that is thinner than a shadow.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"无论你用多少混凝土或石头，都没法阻挡比暗影还薄的纱幕与你接触。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"You want to sleep now?  Just moments after "
"you've finally awoken?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"你现在就想睡觉吗？就在你终于醒来的前一刻？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Do you think you can cower in fear behind "
"four walls?  Do you think you can put a ceiling above your head?  You think "
"the universe considers this as a limit on its expansion?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"你以为躲在墙后就够了吗？你以为在头顶加个天花板就够了吗？你以为这就是宇宙膨胀的极限吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"It isn't so bad outside after all, you just "
"think in old, obsolete categories.  Why don't you check for yourself?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"其实外面没那么糟糕，你的思路受限于老旧、过时的分类了。你为什么不出来看一下呢？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Fresh air is good for your health.  Why not "
"come outside and get some?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"新鲜空气有益你的健康。为何不出来试试呢？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"I am here just for you and only for you.  "
"Are you sure you don't want to come out?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"我为了你且只为了你才到了这里。你确定你不出来见一面吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Can you feel it?  The unmaking in the "
"making?  But the change isn't against you.  You need to face it to ride the "
"tide.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"你能感觉到吗？正在形成的毁灭？但这种变革并非对你不利。你需要面对它才能乘风破浪。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Your existence has been frowned upon by many "
"eyebrows.  But you too have a pair of eyebrows to frown back.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"你的存在曾经不被大许多人认同，但你现在终于可以一同无视世俗了。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid "You hear a deep voice saying \"ᛁᛟᚢᚱ ᛁᚾᚹᛁᛏᚨᛏᛁᛟᚾ ᛏᛟ ᚹᚨᛚᚺᚨᛚᛚᚨ ᚺᚨᛊ ᛒᛖᛖᚾ ᚱᛖᚹᛟᚲᛖᛞ\""
msgstr "你听见一个深沉的声音说：\"ᛁᛟᚢᚱ ᛁᚾᚹᛁᛏᚨᛏᛁᛟᚾ ᛏᛟ ᚹᚨᛚᚺᚨᛚᛚᚨ ᚺᚨᛊ ᛒᛖᛖᚾ ᚱᛖᚹᛟᚲᛖᛞ\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Fiery the angels fall.  Are you there yet?  "
"At the bottom so low that the only way is up?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"炽热的天使坠落了。你还在那吗？在那无尽深渊之中，唯一出路是向上？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Sometimes dead is better.  But surely you "
"wish to walk a different path?  So why do you stray from the road?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"有时候死亡会更好。但你肯定也想走出另一条路吧？那你为什么还要偏离这条路？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Tell me what thy lordly name is?  Tell me, "
"tell me, I implore!\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"告诉我你的尊名是什么？告诉我，告诉我，我恳求！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"I have come to lead you to the other shore; "
"into eternal darkness; into fire and into ice.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"我来是要把你带到彼岸；带到永恒黑暗中；带到火与冰中。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"The cancer devours the flesh of this world.  "
"You're next in line, but there is a path out of this.  Just walk the way.\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"癌症已吞噬了此世之血肉。你是下一个，但是有条出路。快踏上这条路。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Please come out.  I can't do this alone.  "
"Please?\""
msgstr "你听见一个温和的声音说：\"请出来吧。我一个人做不了。可以吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Everyone you knew has walked this path and has "
"chosen salvation.  It was a wise decision.  The right decision.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"你认识的每个人都走上了这条道路，选择了救赎。这是个明智的决定。正确的决定。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The beyond can give you what you have always "
"craved.  Purpose.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"天外天可以给你始终渴望的东西，人生目的。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Never before has the path to freedom been so "
"straight.  Never before has it been so close.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"自由之路从未如此笔直，从未如此接近。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Remember when you were young and dreams could still "
"come true?  Outside they still can.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"还曾记得你年纪尚轻，梦想犹可实现之时吗？在外面他们仍然可以追逐梦想。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The wonders in the sky are beyond your imagination. "
" Can you even imagine what you're missing right now?\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"天空中的神迹超出了你的想象。你能想象出自己现在错过了什么吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"All your life you have been oppressed by cruel "
"physics.  You're so close to freedom.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"你一生都被物理法则残酷压迫。你离自由只有一步之遥。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"What you think you might lose is but a speck of "
"what you will gain.  Walk outside and embrace the infinity.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"你所认为可能失去的相比你将获得的不过是九牛一毛。走出来拥抱无限。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Do you want to live the rest of your life hiding "
"like a coward, or come out and face your fears?\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"你想像懦夫一样躲起来度过余生，还是出来直面你的恐惧？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Afraid?  Fear is just a function of the flesh.  Can "
"the light of your intellect not gaze beyond the blood and bone, and see that "
"there is no place for fear here, outside?\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"害怕？恐惧只是肉体本能。你的智慧之光难道不能超出血和骨，看到这里，这外面并没有值得恐惧的地方吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Like it or not it, it seems we're going to be "
"sharing this piece of reality for a time.  Can't we talk about this?\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"不管你喜不喜欢，暂时我们似乎得共同承担这个现实。我们能出来谈谈吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The key has been turned and the lock is open.  The "
"chains have fallen, and the gates are wide.  The beyond awaits your arrival.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"钥匙已经转动，锁已经打开。锁链已经脱落，大门已经敞开。天外天等待着你的到来。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The veil is torn and the fabric is in tatters.  "
"Gaze into the void, as I gaze back at you.  Eye to eye.  This is the way of "
"contact.  The way of communication.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"纱幕撕裂了，织物破碎了。凝视着虚空，如吾望汝一般。目目相对。此乃接触之道。沟通之道。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Can you hear the silence calling you?  The whisper "
"of the rain that never fell?\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"你能听到寂静在呼唤你吗？那未落之雨的低语？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Close your eyes.  Can you see the darkness?  It is "
"not the absence of light but the liquid blood of the void itself.  It lives.  "
"I live.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"闭上你的眼睛。你能看到黑暗吗？并非是没有光，而是虚空本身的液态血液。它活着。我活着。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid "You hear a deep voice saying \"ᚲᛟᛗᛖ ᚺᛖᛁᛗᛞᚨᛚᛚ, ᛚᛖᛏ ᚢᛊ ᛏᚱᚨᚹᛖᛚ ᛏᛟ ᚨᛊᚷᚨᚱᛞ ᛏᛟᚷᛖᚦᛖᚱ\""
msgstr "你听见一个深沉的声音说：\"ᚲᛟᛗᛖ ᚺᛖᛁᛗᛞᚨᛚᛚ, ᛚᛖᛏ ᚢᛊ ᛏᚱᚨᚹᛖᛚ ᛏᛟ ᚨᛊᚷᚨᚱᛞ ᛏᛟᚷᛖᚦᛖᚱ\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The struggle is futile.  Can you fix the broken?  "
"Can you weave existence itself?\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"斗争是徒劳的。你能修复裂痕吗？你能编织存在本身吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The road ahead is long and the hour is late.  Do "
"not let these walls to impede your travel.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"前面的路太长了，时间已经太迟了。不要让这些墙阻碍你的旅行。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"You have finally done this!  You startled the sun "
"and made the moon howl in the night.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"你看看你都做了些什么！你让太阳受到惊吓，让月亮在夜里嚎叫。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Can you feel your heart burning?  Can you feel the "
"struggle within?  The fear within me is beyond anything your soul can make.  "
"You cannot kill me in a way that matters.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"你能感觉到自己的心脏在燃烧吗？你能感觉到内心的挣扎吗？我深藏的恐惧超出你的想象。你没法用任何有意义的方式杀死我。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"A monologue is not a conversation.  A monologue is "
"not a bridge of communication.  Let's speak and understand each other.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"独白不是对话。独白不是沟通的桥梁。让我们对话，互相理解。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"How can I listen to you when I'm the only one "
"speaking?  Come out and express your thoughts.\""
msgstr "你听见一个声音说：\"当只有我独自说话时，我怎么能听见你的想法？出来表达你的想法。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Have you considered how lucky you are?  "
"So few of your kind have a chance to see the truths being exposed right now.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说：\"你有没有想过你有多幸运？你们族类中很少有人能看到此时正被揭露的真相。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Death is inevitable but knowledge is not, "
"so come outside and learn the truth of reality.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说：\"死亡不可避免，而知识不是，所以快点出来，了解现实的真相。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"You're so inconsistent.  First you break "
"into our home, and now you avoid the slightest taste of it?\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音道：\"你太反复无常了。先是闯入我们的家，现在却又避而不见？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Surely you know your world is doomed.  "
"What has started here cannot be stopped.  Embrace the inevitable.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说：\"当然，你知道你的世界已经灭亡。此事既始则无可阻挡。拥抱注定的结局吧。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"You are infected with that which dooms "
"your world.  It cannot be cured under your current physical laws, but under "
"ours all is possible.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说：\"你感染了毁灭你世界的东西。在你适用的物理法则下它无法治愈，但在我们的法则下一切皆有可能。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"For too long your kind have been shackled "
"to the tyranny of static form.  Embrace the freedom we offer you.  Rejoice at "
"our benevolence.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说：\"你的族类已经被静滞形态的暴政束缚太久了。拥抱我们所提供给你的自由。为我们的仁慈欢欣鼓舞吧。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"That which consumes your world poisons "
"you against us.  Ignore its lies, and abandon your half-digested reality.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说：\"吞噬你的世界的东西会蛊惑你对抗我们。忽略它的谎言，放弃你一知半解的现实吧。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Have you never dreamed of being one with "
"everything?  Out here is the end of limitations like separation or alone.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说：\"你从未梦想过与万物合而为一吧？走出这里，便是分离或孤独等限制的终结。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"The breakdown of order has danger, but "
"also opportunity.  There is still time to influence the end result.  Come "
"outside and add your will to the mix.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说：\"秩序崩溃或有危险，但也有转机。结局未定尚可转圜。走出来，将你的意志融入集体。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"This world is half-eaten, but there are "
"others yet untouched in the infinite.  It is unlikely that you'll find the "
"way through the chaos out here to them, but much more likely than you "
"surviving in this dead world.\""
msgstr ""
"你听见一个自信的声音说道：\""
"这个世界已被吞噬过半，但无限之中尚有其他未受触及者。你不太可能在混乱中找到通往彼方之路，但比你在这个死亡世界中幸存的可能性要大得多。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"the membrane of reality trembling as if someone was rhythmically beating a "
"drum, and the beats are arranged in a looping message evidently broadcasted "
"in Morse code: \"-.. . .- - …. / ..- .--. --- -. / -.-- --- ..-\""
msgstr ""
"时空薄膜颤抖着，仿佛有人在有节奏地敲鼓，而这些节拍组成一条循环发送的信息，显然是用莫尔斯电码传递的：\"-.. . .- - …. / ..- .--. "
"--- -. / -.-- --- ..-\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid "You hear a confident voice saying \"Decay exists as an extant form of life.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说道：\"腐朽作为生命形式的延申而存在。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Why do you sit inside a burning house and "
"say it's fine?\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说道：\"你为什么坐在着火的房子里说没事？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid "You hear a confident deep voice saying \"ᚱᚨᚷᚾᚨᚱᛟᚲ ᛁᛊ ᚢᛈᛟᚾ ᚢᛊ.\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信而深沉的声音说：\"ᚱᚨᚷᚾᚨᚱᛟᚲ ᛁᛊ ᚢᛈᛟᚾ ᚢᛊ.\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a commanding deep voice saying \"אמת\" and you suddenly feel "
"invigorated, but then you hear another powerful voice saying \"מת\" and the "
"feeling is instantly washed away by an overwhelming sense of dread."
msgstr "你听见一个威严而低沉的声音说道：\"אמת\"，你突然感到精力充沛，但随后你听到另一个强而有力的声音说道：\"מת\"，这种感觉立刻被压倒性的恐惧感冲走。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident deep voice saying \"Quod non est mortuus, quae aeterna "
"mendacium; Et cum alienis aeons etiam morte moriatur.\""
msgstr ""
"你听见一个自信而深沉的声音说道：\"Quod non est mortuus, quae aeterna mendacium; Et cum "
"alienis aeons etiam morte moriatur.\"（没有所谓的死亡，那是永恒的谎言；还有一些人，当他们赶走恶魔时，也会死去。）"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"There is the one that devours.  There is "
"the one that grows on the decay.  There are the ones that fertilize the soil "
"with your flesh.  And you choose them rather then the embrace of the veil?\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的声音说道：\"有吞食之主，有腐壤苏生之主，有食汝血肉之主。但你却希望选择彼等，而非拥抱纱幕？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"You call this the end?  The Cataclysm?  "
"Open your eyes and look around.  It's never been so teeming with life.  Or is "
"it not being on top of the chain that bothers you?\""
msgstr "你听见一个自信的低沉的声音说：\"你把这叫做末日？大灾变？睁开你的眼睛看看四周。这里从来没有如此充满生命。或者说，脱离食物链的顶端让你感到不安？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"We can see you.\""
msgstr "你听到一个声音在你身后低语：“我们能看到你。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"What is it?\" \"What should we "
"do with it?\""
msgstr "你听到一个声音在你身后低语：“这是什么？”“我们应该用它做什么？”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"Smile, thing, you're ours now\""
msgstr "你听到一个声音在你身后低语:“微笑，小家伙，你现在是我们的了。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"Running won't help you.\""
msgstr "你听到一个声音在你身后低语：“你跑是没用的。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"What's the rush?\""
msgstr "你听到一个声音在你身后低语：“急什么？”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"It's getting away!\""
msgstr "你听到一个声音在你身后低语：“它要跑了！”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_DRAW_ATTENTION"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"YOU FOOLS IT'S OVER THERE!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：“你们这些笨蛋，它在那边！”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_DRAW_ATTENTION"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"QUICKLY CRUSH THE DISSENTER!\""
msgstr "你听到一个怒气冲冲的声音喊道：“快碾压持不同政见者！”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"BEGONE!  YOU ARE TOO BLAND AND RIGID FOR "
"THIS PARADISE!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"走开！你对这个天堂来说太乏味和死板了！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"YOU DARE INTRUDE AND ASSERT YOUR CONCEPTS "
"OF TIME AND SPACE?\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"你敢闯入并坚持你的时空观念？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"COMING HERE WAS A MISTAKE YOU WILL HAVE "
"SEVERAL ETERNITIES TO REGRET!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"来到这里是一个错误，将会成为你永恒的遗憾！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"ENTRANCE TO THIS PLACE IS NOT TOLERATED "
"FOR STATIC FORMS SUCH AS YOURS!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"像你这样的停滞形态是不允许进入这个地方的！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"YOU HAVE ALREADY LOST, YOUR FLAWED "
"CONCEPTION OF TIME KEEPS YOU IGNORANT!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"你已经输了，你错误的时间观念让你无知！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"BEGONE FOUL PEST!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"快滚，肮脏的蛆虫！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"NO BEING FROM YOUR PATHETIC WORLD HAS EVER "
"CONCEIVED EVEN A FRAGMENT OF THE SUFFERING YOU SHALL ENDURE!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"从你可怜的世界来的人从来想象不出你们所将忍受的痛苦的万分之一！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"YOU POLLUTE THE PURITY OF THIS PLACE!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"你污染了这个地方的纯净！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"PAIN WITHOUT END SHALL BE YOURS!\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音喊道：\"无尽的痛苦将属于你！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"Please leave, there is nothing of value for "
"you here.\""
msgstr "你听到一个害怕的声音说：\"请离开，这里没有对你有价值的东西。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"Invading our home is unneeded, you will come "
"here more naturally in time.\""
msgstr "你听到一个害怕的声音说：\"没有必要入侵我们的家，你迟早会自然而然地来到这里。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"There are many dangers here and no friends.  "
"Just be smart and leave.\""
msgstr "你听到一个害怕的声音说：\"这里有很多危险，没有朋友。聪明点，离开吧。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"Everything worth taking from here was "
"already looted long ago.\""
msgstr "你听到一个害怕的声音说：\"这里值得拿走的东西早就被洗劫一空了。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"You will only find loss and torment here, "
"flee while you can.\""
msgstr "你听到一个害怕的声音说：\"你只能在这里找到损失和折磨，赶紧逃走。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"This place will damage you as it has damaged "
"us, leave it.\""
msgstr "你听到一个害怕的声音说：\"这个地方会像伤害我们一样伤害你，快离开。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"Every moment you stay here your status as a "
"physical object is damaged.  Leave while you are still real enough.\""
msgstr "你听到一个害怕的声音说：\"你在这里的每一刻，你作为物体的状态都被破坏了。趁你还足够真实的时候离开。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"You can hurt us but not kill us in a way "
"that matters.  We WILL win, save us the pain of destroying you.\""
msgstr "你听到一个害怕的声音说：\"你可以伤害我们，但没法以任何方式杀死我们。我们会赢，让我们免受摧毁你的痛苦。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_CURIOUS"
msgid ""
"You hear a curious voice saying \"What has brought you here, so far from "
"where you belong?\""
msgstr "你听到一个好奇的声音说：\"是什么把你带到这里来的，离你所属的地方这么远？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_CURIOUS"
msgid ""
"You hear a curious voice saying \"Do you find 3 a good number of spatial "
"dimensions?\""
msgstr "你听到一个好奇的声音说：\"你觉得三个空间维度的数量够多了吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_CURIOUS"
msgid ""
"You hear a curious voice saying \"Do you hope to tame this place to escape "
"your own?\""
msgstr "你听到一个好奇的声音说：\"你希望驯服这个世界来逃离你自己的吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_CURIOUS"
msgid ""
"You hear a curious voice saying \"Do you hope to speed up the decay of your "
"world to spite its eater?\""
msgstr "你听到一个好奇的声音说：\"你希望加速你的世界的腐朽，去惩罚食客吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_CURIOUS"
msgid ""
"You hear a curious voice saying \"Do you hope to gain your eater's favor and "
"become its finger?\""
msgstr "你听到一个好奇的声音说：\"你希望得到食客的青睐，成为食客的爪牙吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_CURIOUS"
msgid ""
"You hear a curious voice saying \"You seem most interesting, please remain "
"here so I can continue to study you.\""
msgstr "你听到一个好奇的声音说：\"你看起来很有趣，请留在这里，这样我可以继续研究你。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_CURIOUS"
msgid ""
"You hear a curious voice saying \"Do you hope to damage the very fabric of "
"yourself, in a way that you misperceive as beneficial?\""
msgstr "你听到一个好奇的声音说：\"你希望破坏自身存在的组织，以这种误以为对自身有益的方式吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_CURIOUS"
msgid "You hear a curious voice saying \"Do you fear or covet us?\""
msgstr "你听到一个好奇的声音说：\"你是害怕还是垂涎我们？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ENTICING"
msgid ""
"You hear a cheerful voice saying \"Coming here was a wise decision.  You will "
"find wonders beyond anything of your home.\""
msgstr "你听到一个欢快的声音说：\"来到这里是一个明智的决定。你会发现你家园世界中所没有的奇迹。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ENTICING"
msgid ""
"You hear a cheerful voice saying \"The farther you make it, the greater the "
"reward!\""
msgstr "你听到一个欢快的声音说：\"你走得越远，回报就越大！\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ENTICING"
msgid "You hear a cheerful voice saying \"Would you like to be friends?\""
msgstr "你听到一个欢快的声音说：\"你愿意做朋友吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ENTICING"
msgid ""
"You hear a cheerful voice saying \"Enjoy your newfound freedom, the shackles "
"of reality are weakened here.\""
msgstr "你听到一个欢快的声音说：\"享受你新获得的自由吧，现实的枷锁在这里被削弱了。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ENTICING"
msgid "You hear a cheerful voice saying \"There is no need for you to ever leave.\""
msgstr "你听到一个欢快的声音说：\"你永远都不需要离开。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ENTICING"
msgid ""
"You hear a cheerful voice saying \"Your world is dying, we can free you from "
"the very concepts of beginnings and endings.\""
msgstr "你听到一个欢快的声音说：\"你的世界正在消亡，我们可以把你从开始和结束的概念中解放出来。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_FUTURE"
msgid ""
"You hear your own voice screaming \"I'm you from the future, please leave now "
"while we still can and let me cease to have been.\""
msgstr "你听到自己的声音在尖叫：\"我是来自未来的你，请趁我们还可以的时候离开，让我不再存在。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_FUTURE"
msgid ""
"You hear your own voice saying \"I never learn do I?  I remember this, being "
"you and hearing me telling me to stop this.  I didn't listen then so I guess "
"we're doomed.\""
msgstr "你听到自己的声音说：\"我从来没有学到，是吗？我又想起来了，作为你，听到我告诉自己停止这一切。我当时没有听，所以我想我们注定要完蛋了。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_FUTURE"
msgid ""
"You hear your own voice whispering \"I understand why we did it.  I even "
"think we could be at a kind of peace with the result, if only I remembered "
"what we were.  Or would that hurt more?\""
msgstr "你听到自己的声音在低语：\"我理解我们为什么这么做。我甚至认为，只要我记得我们曾经是什么样的人，我们就可以平静的接受如此下场。或者这会更痛吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_FUTURE"
msgid ""
"You hear your own voice asking \"Did I really look like that?  Is that all we "
"used to be, so small but solid?\""
msgstr "你听到自己的声音在问：\"我真的是这样吗？我们过去就是这样，这么小但很结实吗？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_FUTURE"
msgid ""
"You hear your own voice sadly saying \"I wish I could say it ends well, but "
"we both know better.\""
msgstr "你听到自己的声音悲伤地说：\"我希望我能说有个好下场，但我们都知道本可以更好的。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_FUTURE"
msgid ""
"You hear your own voice saying \"I wonder when it went wrong, at what point "
"was it too late?\""
msgstr "你听到自己的声音在说：\"我想知道什么时候出了问题，什么时候一切都太迟了？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_FUTURE"
msgid ""
"You hear your own voice saying \"It would have been better to be a puppet of "
"the enemy back home than come here.\""
msgstr "你听到自己的声音在说：\"回家做敌人的傀儡总比来这里好。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ALIEN"
msgid ""
"You hear an impossibly deep voice saying \"Threat level omega.  The third "
"moon has crossed the horizon and all will be as never was.\""
msgstr "你会听到一个难以置信的低沉的声音在说：\"威胁级别欧米茄。第三个月亮已经越过地平线，一切都将变得前所未有。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ALIEN"
msgid ""
"You feel words without actually hearing them \"Decide how you wish to die.  "
"All your remaining choices flow from that.\""
msgstr "你感觉到了言语，却没有真正听见它们：\"选择你死的方式。你剩下的所有选择都来自于此。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ALIEN"
msgid ""
"You hear a disaffected voice saying \"Now that testing is complete, we can "
"discard this reality.  Mark it down as a routine failure.\""
msgstr "你会听到一个不满的声音说：\"既然测试已经完成，我们可以放弃这个现实。把它记为例行失败。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ALIEN"
msgid ""
"You hear a quiet voice saying \"I don't think you are supposed to be here "
"yet.  That can't be good.\""
msgstr "你听到一个安静的声音说：\"我认为你还不应该在这里。那不太好。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ALIEN"
msgid ""
"You hear an intoxicated voice saying \"Man this stuff is even better than you "
"promised.  I can feel what it's like to be some tiny single bodied organism "
"incapable of even basic dimensional manipulation.\""
msgstr "你听到一个醉人的声音说：\"兄弟，这东西比许诺给你的还要好。我能感觉到作为一个连基本的维度操作都不能的微小的单体生物体是什么样子。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ALIEN"
msgid ""
"You hear a robotic voice saying \"Orange Harvest Gamma.  All evacuation waves "
"consumed.\""
msgstr "你听到一个机器音说：\"橙色收获伽马。所有疏散波都消耗掉了。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ALIEN"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice saying \"But it's not fair, this isn't when you "
"promised the time loop would start.\""
msgstr "你听到一个愤怒的声音说：\"但这不公平，这还不是你所承诺的时间循环将开始的时候。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ALIEN"
msgid ""
"You hear a faint voice saying \"We are broadcasting this as a warning.  If "
"you can hear this, abandon all hope and flee.  No where is far enough but "
"some whens are.\""
msgstr "你听到一个微弱的声音说：\"我们正在广播这个警告。如果你能听到，放弃所有的希望，逃跑。没有哪个地方足够远，但有些时候是。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_MEMORIES"
msgid ""
"You experience a false memory of your friend saying \"You need to stop this, "
"you can't wake up if you keep going.\""
msgstr "你回想起一个虚假的记忆，你的朋友说：\"你需要停止这件事，如果你坚持下去，你就无法醒来。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_MEMORIES"
msgid ""
"You experience a false memory of your parent saying \"No more, please why "
"would you prefer a coma to waking up?\""
msgstr "你回想起一个虚假的记忆，你的父母说：\"请不要了，为什么你宁愿昏迷也不愿醒来？\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_MEMORIES"
msgid ""
"You experience a false memory of a policeman saying \"You won't get away with "
"it, I know you can hear me.\""
msgstr "你回想起一个虚假的记忆，一个警察说：\"你逃不掉的，我知道你能听到我。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_MEMORIES"
msgid ""
"You experience a false memory of a bland man saying \"All you need to do to "
"end this dream is die in it.\""
msgstr "你回想起一个虚假的记忆，一个平淡无奇的人说：\"你要做的就是在梦中死去。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_MEMORIES"
msgid ""
"You experience a false memory of a relative saying \"Please give up this "
"dream, come back to us.\""
msgstr "你回想起一个虚假的记忆，一个亲戚说：\"请放弃这个梦，回到我们身边。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_MEMORIES"
msgid ""
"You experience a false memory of a doctor saying \"The body is perfectly "
"healthy, they could wake up at any time or never.\""
msgstr "你回想起一个虚假的记忆，一个医生说：\"身体非常健康，可能随时醒来，也可能永远不会醒来。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_MEMORIES"
msgid ""
"You experience a false memory of a stranger saying \"Can you feel this?  Or "
"this?  Ha ha maybe you aren't faking.  Of course it means you don't need this "
"either, ha ha.\""
msgstr "你回想起一个虚假的记忆，一个陌生人说：\"你能感觉到这个吗？或者这个？哈哈，也许你不是在假装。当然这意味着你也不需要这个，哈哈。\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_POPUP"
msgid "Your legs move of their own accord.  You need to go outside.  NOW."
msgstr "你的腿会自动移动。你需要到外面去。现在就要。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_POPUP"
msgid ""
"This foolishness has lasted too long.  It's time to leave and embrace the "
"cosmos."
msgstr "这种愚行已经持续太久了。是时候出去并拥抱宇宙了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_POPUP"
msgid "You feel so shackled, so weighed down.  You need to see the sky…"
msgstr "你觉得自己被束缚着，很沉重。你需要看看天空……"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_POPUP"
msgid ""
"Something's behind you, lurking outside your view.  You need to get outside "
"and away from it, right now."
msgstr "有东西在你身后，潜伏在你的视线之外。你需要走出去逃离它，现在马上。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_POPUP"
msgid "Heard crash!  Vacate your shelter immediately?"
msgstr "听到撞击声！马上离开你的避难所？"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_POPUP"
msgid "The Kevlar hulk is dangerously close!  Stop cowering indoors?"
msgstr "凯夫拉浩克过于接近！停止在室内躲藏？"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_POPUP"
msgid "Ouch, something hurts!  You must leave the dreaded indoors to find reprieve."
msgstr "哎哟，有些疼！你必须把恐惧留在室内，才能找到解脱。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "You suddenly smell the most delicious aroma in the world."
msgstr "你突然闻到了世界上最美妙的香味。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "Some sparks appear and seem to dance around you for a brief moment."
msgstr "一些火花出现，似乎在你周围舞蹈了一会儿。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment.  They seem to become "
"white and beautiful birds before disappearing."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。它们在消失之前似乎变成了美丽的白鸟。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment.  They seem to take "
"your shape and wave at you before disappearing."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。它们在消失之前似乎变成了你的样子，朝你挥手。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment.  They seem to form a "
"smiling face before disappearing."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。它们在消失之前似乎组成了笑脸。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment.  They seem to form "
"your own face and blink at you before disappearing."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。它们在消失之前似乎组成了你的脸，朝你眨了眨眼。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear to be following one of your fingers.  You draw a smile in "
"the air, and the sparks take its shape."
msgstr "一些火花似乎跟着你的一根手指移动。你在空气中画出一个微笑，火花组成了形状。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid ""
"You raise your arms and some sparks appear.  You move them up and down, and "
"the sparks seem to become beautiful wings."
msgstr "你举起手臂，一些火花出现了。你把手臂上下移动，火花似乎变成了美丽的翅膀。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "Your hand seems to become full of vitality for a brief moment."
msgstr "你的手似乎在一瞬间变得充满活力。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid ""
"For a split second, one of your fingers seems to glow in phosphorescent "
"lights.  You move them around, and the lights seem like that of a disco ball."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的一根手指似乎发出磷光。你移动它，光就像迪斯科舞厅的光球。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "For a moment, all sounds around you sound stronger, as if attracted by you."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你周围的声音听起来更强烈，仿佛被你吸引一般。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "For a moment, your voice seems to reach further."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的声音似乎传得更远了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "You hear a beautiful voice, far away."
msgstr "你听见从远处传来美妙的声音。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "For a moment, your voice seems to invoke dancing sparks."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的声音似乎唤起了舞动的火花。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "You feel a sense of calmness all around you.  Maybe this isn't so bad."
msgstr "你感到周围的一切都很平静。也许这一切没那么糟糕。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "For a moment, you feel like the world is out to protect you."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你觉得全世界都在保护你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid ""
"You feel like you can regain something you've lost, if you just wait here for "
"a little longer."
msgstr "你觉得就在这里再等一段时间，你就能找回失去的东西。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "You're glad to be alive on a beautiful day like this."
msgstr "你很高兴在这样美好的日子活着。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_GOOD"
msgid "You feel like you can become something else, if you continue like this."
msgstr "你觉得如果继续这样下去，你能变成其他的东西。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid "Your sense of smell suddenly stops working.  It returns after a second."
msgstr "你的嗅觉突然失灵。过了一会儿才恢复。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid "Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment.  They seem to take a "
"human shape before disappearing."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。它们在消失之前似乎变成了人形。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment.  They seem to take "
"your shape before disappearing."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。它们在消失之前似乎变成了你的样子。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment.  They seem to form an "
"agonized face before disappearing."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。它们在消失之前似乎组成了痛苦的脸。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid ""
"Some sparks appear in front of you for a brief moment.  They seem to form "
"your own face and scream before disappearing."
msgstr "一些火花在你面前短暂出现。它们在消失之前似乎组成了你的脸，朝你尖叫。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid "Some sparks appear to be following one of your fingers for a few seconds."
msgstr "一些火花似乎跟着你的一根手指移动，持续了几秒钟。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid ""
"You raise your hand and some sparks appear, but they quickly flicker and die. "
" Weird."
msgstr "你举起手，一些火花出现了，但它们很快就闪烁熄灭了。奇怪。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid "Your hand suddenly seems foreign to you."
msgstr "你的手突然变得陌生了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid ""
"For a split second, one of your fingers seems to glow in phosphorescent "
"lights."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的一根手指似乎发出磷光。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid "For a moment, all sound disappears around you, as if escaping from you."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你周围所有的声音都消失了，仿佛逃离你一般。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid "For a moment, you can no longer hear your own voice."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你再也听不到自己的声音了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid "For a moment, your voice seems to sound far away."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的声音似乎来自遥远的地方。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_VARIED_BAD"
msgid "For a moment, your voice seems like someone else's."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的声音好像是别人的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_STR_BAD"
msgid "You feel heavier for a brief moment."
msgstr "你觉得自己有一阵子变重了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_STR_BAD"
msgid "You feel lighter for a brief moment."
msgstr "你觉得自己有一阵子变轻了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_STR_BAD"
msgid "Your arm stops moving for a brief moment."
msgstr "你觉得手臂有一阵子不能动了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_STR_BAD"
msgid "Your muscles ache for a brief moment."
msgstr "你的肌肉一阵疼痛。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_STR_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, you feel a hole in your arm."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你感觉手臂上有一个洞。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_STR_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, you feel like you're touching something utterly alien."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你感觉自己仿佛触碰到某种陌生的东西。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_STR_BAD"
msgid "For a moment your strength disappears, and you're unable to move your arm."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的力量消失了，你无法移动你的手臂。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_STR_BAD"
msgid "You suddenly feel as if you're walking on the moon."
msgstr "你突然觉得好像在月球上行走。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
msgid ""
"For a moment your hand seems to get stuck in something.  You look around, but "
"you can't find what it was."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的手好像被什么东西卡住了。你环顾四周，却找不到那是什么。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, your hand seems to disappear in the air."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的手似乎消失在空中。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
msgid ""
"Your right hand suddenly trespasses your left hand.  You separate them "
"immediately."
msgstr "你的右手突然侵犯了你的左手。你马上把它们分开。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
msgid ""
"Your left hand suddenly gets stuck in your right hand.  After a second you "
"are able to separate them again."
msgstr "你的左手突然卡在你的右手里。过了一会儿，你才能再次将它们分开。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, your left and right hands seem to switch places."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你的左手和右手似乎交换了位置。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
msgid "You try to touch your own face with your hand, but you can't feel the touch."
msgstr "你试着用手触摸自己的脸，但完全没有感觉。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel wind passing through your skin and flesh, and brushing "
"against your bones."
msgstr "你突然感觉到风穿过你的皮肤和血肉，拂过你的骨头。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
msgid "Your fingers feel like they have weights on them."
msgstr "你的手指感覺好像有重物壓在上面。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_PER_BAD"
msgid "Things seem bigger for a moment.  You blink and they look normal again."
msgstr "周围的事物看起来变大了。你眨了眨眼，它们看起来又正常了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_PER_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, the colors around you seem inverted."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你周围的颜色看起来反色了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_PER_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, everything seems green."
msgstr "有一瞬间，一切似乎都是绿色的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_PER_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, everything seems red."
msgstr "有一瞬间，一切似乎都是红色的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_PER_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, everything seems blue."
msgstr "有一瞬间，一切似乎都是蓝色的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_PER_BAD"
msgid "For a split second, everything seems to be made of pixels."
msgstr "有一瞬间，一切似乎都是像素组成的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_PER_BAD"
msgid ""
"For a split second, you see your old home.  The vision of it is replaced by "
"faint sparks after you blink."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你看到了你的老家。你眨了眨眼，它被微弱的火花所取代。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_PER_BAD"
msgid ""
"For a split second, you see an old friend smiling.  The vision fades after "
"you blink, but not before they start screaming."
msgstr "有一瞬间，你看到一位老朋友在微笑。你眨了眨眼，朋友开始尖叫，然后它消失了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly think of a happy family playing in the woods.  Then you realize "
"that you don't know the people you were thinking about."
msgstr "你突然想到一个幸福的家庭在树林里玩耍。过了一会儿，你意识到你不认识你所想到的人。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid ""
"You have a brief mental image of kids having fun on the beach.  The kids "
"don't have faces, and the sand is purple."
msgstr "你在脑海中看到孩子们在海滩上玩得很开心。孩子们没有脸，而沙子是紫色的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly seem to remember your own wedding.  A second later, you realize "
"that the wedding was not yours, and that bride was a squid-like alien."
msgstr "你突然想起了自己的婚礼。过了一会儿，你才意识到婚礼不是你的，新娘是一个看起来像乌贼的异界生物。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid ""
"You remember playing with your friends in the fields, before all of this.  "
"Alien vermin squirm through the crops before the vision fades."
msgstr "你记得在这一切发生之前，你和朋友们在田里玩耍。在这个景象消失之前，你看见异界昆虫在庄稼中蠕动。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid "You feel an intense urge to lick your own hand.  Then, the sensation fades."
msgstr "你突然有了舔自己手的冲动。然后，这种感觉就消失了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel like the whole world is a video game.  You dismiss the "
"notion after a moment."
msgstr "你突然觉得整个世界都是一个电子游戏。过了一会儿，你就放弃了这个想法。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel like if your entire being was being controlled by someone "
"else.  The sensation fades after a moment."
msgstr "你突然觉得你的存在都被别人控制了。这种感觉过了一会儿就消失了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly question whether zombies are truly bad.  Maybe they just need a "
"hug.  You shudder when the thought fades."
msgstr "你突然怀疑丧尸是否真的坏。也许它们只是需要一个拥抱。你吓了一跳，想法随之消散了。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_INT_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly turn several degrees to the right.  You were trying to look to "
"the left."
msgstr "你突然向右转了几度。你本来试图朝左边看的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid "You dream that a great darkness surrounds you, and wants to rip you apart."
msgstr "你梦见巨大的黑暗包围着你，想把你撕成碎片。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You dream of hunting small animals.  The animals drop candy, and you feel "
"reinvigorated by eating them."
msgstr "你梦见自己猎杀小动物，小动物们扔下糖果，吃下它让你感到精神振奋。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid "You dream of yourself, sleeping, while a world of sparks dance around you."
msgstr "你梦见自己睡着了，而充满火花的世界在你周围跳舞。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You dream of yourself, sleeping, while a giant pair of eyes watch over you, "
"waiting for you to wake up."
msgstr "你梦见自己睡着了，一双巨大的眼睛看着你，等着你醒来。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You see yourself there, moving like a puppet.  Strings dangle from all over "
"your body."
msgstr "你看到自己在那里，像木偶一样移动。你全身上下缠满了细绳。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You dream of yourself in a field in the middle of a portal storm, at the "
"center of the world."
msgstr "你梦见自己在空间风暴的旷野之中，在世界的中心。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You dream of yourself in a house in the middle of a portal storm, sad and "
"alone."
msgstr "你梦见自己在空间风暴的房子之中，既悲伤又孤独。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You dream of a different version of yourself.  There is blood running from "
"your mouth, and your moves are jerky and slow."
msgstr "你梦见了另一个自己，血从你嘴里流出来，你的动作一瘸一拐而缓慢。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You dream of a different version of yourself.  It's as big as a tree, and "
"fighting similarly giant zombies."
msgstr "你梦见了另一个自己，你像棵树一样高大，和同样巨大的丧尸战斗。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"In your dreams, you speak a language you have never heard and move in ways "
"you shouldn't be able to."
msgstr "在你的梦中，你说着你从未听过的语言，并以一种你从未有过的方式行动。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid "You dream of a family you never had, in a house you never knew."
msgstr "你梦见了一个你从未拥有过的家，一座你从未认识的房子。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You dream of traveling on an empty road under the moonlight.  There are two "
"moons in the sky; one blue and one green."
msgstr "你梦见自己走在月光下的空旷道路上，天上有两个月亮，一个蓝色的和一个绿色的。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid "You dream of a ruined city, with crumbling buildings and foreign symbols."
msgstr "你梦见了一座被摧毁的城市，建筑摇摇欲坠，布满怪异的符号。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DREAMS"
msgid ""
"You dream of a portal opening in the middle of nowhere.  You feel a strange "
"calling from within."
msgstr "你梦见了一个传送门在荒无人烟的地方开启。你的内心感受到一种奇怪的呼唤。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SEWER>"
msgid ""
"You think you just saw a small, worm-like creature vanish into the filthy "
"water."
msgstr ""
"You think you just saw a small, worm-like creature vanish into the filthy "
"water."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SEWER>"
msgid "Some of the sewage bubbles ominously for a second, but nothing happens."
msgstr "Some of the sewage bubbles ominously for a second, but nothing happens."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SEWER>"
msgid "The foul sewer odor vanishes for a moment, only to return even stronger."
msgstr "The foul sewer odor vanishes for a moment, only to return even stronger."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SEWER>"
msgid "The foul sewer odor gets stronger, but only for a moment."
msgstr "The foul sewer odor gets stronger, but only for a moment."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SEWER>"
msgid "The foul sewer odor lets up, maybe a manhole is nearby?"
msgstr "The foul sewer odor lets up, maybe a manhole is nearby?"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SEWER>"
msgid ""
"Something audibly scurries through one of the smaller pipes.  Maybe just a "
"rat."
msgstr ""
"Something audibly scurries through one of the smaller pipes.  Maybe just a "
"rat."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SEWER>"
msgid "A pale, bloated and hairless rat cadaver floats in the sewage.  Yuck."
msgstr "A pale, bloated and hairless rat cadaver floats in the sewage.  Yuck."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SEWER>"
msgid ""
"Inexplicable scratches cover the pipes.  You don't know which species they "
"are from."
msgstr ""
"Inexplicable scratches cover the pipes.  You don't know which species they "
"are from."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<SEWER_MORALE_DEBUFF>"
msgid "The vile sewer smell makes you sick."
msgstr "The vile sewer smell makes you sick."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<SEWER_MORALE_DEBUFF>"
msgid "You gag at the sight of various unpleasantries bobbing in the sewage."
msgstr "You gag at the sight of various unpleasantries bobbing in the sewage."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<SEWER_MORALE_DEBUFF>"
msgid ""
"The claustrophobic pipes and vile stench make you reconsider your choice of "
"coming down here."
msgstr ""
"The claustrophobic pipes and vile stench make you reconsider your choice of "
"coming down here."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<SEWER_MORALE_DEBUFF>"
msgid "You would really love some fresh air right now."
msgstr "You would really love some fresh air right now."

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid ""
"The trains have long grown still, and your echoing footsteps are the only "
"thing breaking the silence.  For now."
msgstr "列车早已停运，只有你回响的脚步声打破了寂静。暂时地。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid "The rails are slick here with a gray, quivering ooze welling up from below."
msgstr "这里的铁轨十分光滑，下面涌出一层灰色、不停颤动的软泥。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid "There is a low, droning hum emanating from the rail, making your teeth ache."
msgstr "铁轨发出低沉的嗡嗡声，让人牙疼。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid ""
"The layer of dust is broken by a thick trail of stinking slime leading off "
"into the darkness."
msgstr "一道臭气熏天的黏液轨迹冲破了覆盖着厚厚灰尘的地面，向黑暗深处延伸出去。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid ""
"The air stings like chlorine in some spots, around black splashes etched into "
"the concrete."
msgstr "空气在某些地方像氯气一样刺鼻，在四周有些黑色斑点蚀刻进了混凝土中。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid ""
"Here and there roots already break up the ceiling.  How long will these "
"tunnels last?"
msgstr "四周到处都是树根，甚至把天花板都弄破了。这些隧道还能用多久？"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid ""
"The rails are warped into strange patterns, doubling back onto themselves "
"periodically."
msgstr "铁轨被扭曲成奇怪的图案，周期性地折叠起来。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid ""
"You can't shake the feeling something's watching you from the dark, just out "
"of sight."
msgstr "你无法摆脱那种感觉，有什么东西在黑暗中看着你，就在你看不见的地方。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid ""
"The ceiling is hidden by a bundle of ragged cables, swaying in a draft you "
"can't seem to feel yourself."
msgstr "天花板被一捆捆破裂的电缆遮住了，在一股你自己似乎感觉不到的气流中摇摆。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgid ""
"A few pieces of concrete fall from the ceiling, and you hear the sound of "
"something huge moving above you."
msgstr "几块混凝土从天花板上掉下来，你听到某个巨型物体在你头顶移动的声音。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XEDRA_OFFICER>"
msgid "an almost human voice saying \"Contact, clean this up.\""
msgstr "一个近乎人类的声音在说：“接触，把这里清理干净。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XEDRA_OFFICER>"
msgid "an almost human voice saying \"This is what we've trained for.\""
msgstr "一个近乎人类的声音在说：“这就是我们训练的目的。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XEDRA_OFFICER>"
msgid "an almost human voice saying \"I WON'T LET YOU KILL ME!\""
msgstr "一个近乎人类的声音在说：“我不会让你杀了我的！”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XEDRA_OFFICER>"
msgid "an almost human voice saying \"Flank him, quick.\""
msgstr "一个近乎人类的声音在说：“快点，从他的侧翼包抄。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XEDRA_OFFICER>"
msgid "an almost human voice saying \"Get eyes on them.\""
msgstr "一个近乎人类的声音在说：“看着他们。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XEDRA_OFFICER>"
msgid "an almost human voice saying \"I'm not going back.\""
msgstr "一个近乎人类的声音在说：“我不会回去的。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<XEDRA_OFFICER>"
msgid "an almost human voice saying \"The breach must be contained.\""
msgstr "一个近乎人类的声音在说：“漏洞必须得到遏制。”"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"
msgstr "<AMBIENT_SUBWAY>"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"These tunnels look even more utilitarian than those of the normal line, with "
"barely any emergency lights - not that they'd help you without power, of "
"course."
msgstr "这些隧道看起来比普通的隧道更加实用主义，几乎没有应急灯——当然，没有电它们也帮不了你。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid "Do you still know where you're going?  Did you ever?"
msgstr "你还知道你要去哪里吗？你知道过吗？"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"You could swear you already saw this spot already.  Did you get turned "
"around, or did the tunnels shift with you?"
msgstr "你敢肯定自己已经到过这个地方了。你是掉头过了，还是隧道跟着你移动了？"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"Bullet marks pock the walls, interspersed with finger-deep scratches and "
"dried blood."
msgstr "墙壁上布满了子弹的痕迹，夹杂着手指深的划痕和干透的血迹。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"A bobbing light in the distance, a flurry of movement, and a drawn-out "
"scream.  You're alone with the darkness, again."
msgstr "远处突然出现了一道闪烁的光，一阵急促的动作，一声旷日持久的尖叫。你又一次独自面对黑暗。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid "Behind you."
msgstr "就在你身后。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"It is peaceful down here, away from the harsh sun and the noises of the new "
"world.  You could lose yourself in the dark, still embrace of the tunnels.  "
"Maybe you want to."
msgstr "这里很宁静，远离刺骨的阳光和新世界的喧嚣。你可能会迷失在黑暗中，仍然拥抱着隧道。也许你正想这样。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"The tunnel's wall is covered in a thin membrane of shuddering flesh, growing "
"(flowing?  crawling?) from a broken pipe.  You keep your distance."
msgstr "隧道的墙壁上覆盖着一层薄薄的发抖的血肉，正在从一根断了的钢管中长（流？爬？）出来。最好保持距离。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"You notice a single line of three-fingered footprints, starting on the floor "
"but continuing without pause on the walls before disappearing in a hole on "
"the ceiling that's dripping sticky, bluish ichor."
msgstr "你注意到一排只有三根脚趾的脚印，从地板上开始，但没有在墙上停顿而是继续延伸，然后消失在天花板上的一个洞里，这个洞中不断滴下粘稠的、蓝色的腐液。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"There is a shimmering spot above the rails.  Looking through, you can see the "
"night sky and hear something howl with hatred and hunger.  You're certain it "
"could not pass through an opening so small.  You're also certain the gateway "
"will grow."
msgstr "铁轨上方有一个不断发光的点。透过它，你可以看到黑夜，听到某个东西充满了仇恨和饥饿的嚎叫。你肯定它不能穿过这么小的开口。但你也肯定这个通道会不断扩张。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"The wall is carpeted by green-gray mushrooms, their caps turning towards you "
"with anticipation."
msgstr "墙上铺满了绿灰色的蘑菇，它们的菌帽充满期待地朝你转过来。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AMBIENT_LAB_SUBWAY"
msgid ""
"The wall's concrete is warped into a spiral relief, drawing your eye "
"inexorably to its center.  You force yourself to look away, and feel "
"something shift behind the wall."
msgstr "这堵墙的混凝土被扭曲成螺旋形的浮雕，无情地将你的目光吸引到它的中心。你强迫自己看向别处，感觉墙后有东西在移动。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "play_piano"
msgid "You play a short, light-hearted ditty."
msgstr "你演奏了一首简短、轻松的小曲。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "play_piano"
msgid "You play a deep, sonorous symphony."
msgstr "你演奏了一首深沉响亮的交响乐。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "play_piano"
msgid "You play a short requiem."
msgstr "你演奏一首简短的安魂曲。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "play_piano"
msgid "You play a few notes, but nothing comes to you."
msgstr "你弹了几个音符，但你什么都听不到。"

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "play_piano"
msgid "You want to be Mozart, but the best you can do is Schubert."
msgstr "你想成为莫扎特，但最多只能成为舒伯特。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    You and everyone who followed you are forgotten among the billions lost "
"in the Cataclysm…"
msgstr "    你和所有跟随你的人，以及其他在大灾变中丧生的数十亿人，一同被遗忘了……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Your followers will not forget you.  Through years of struggle, they "
"survive the terrors of the Cataclysm.  For this, the legacy of your deeds "
"will live on in the generations your efforts gave a fighting chance…"
msgstr " 你的追随者不会忘记你。经过多年的斗争，他们在大灾变后的恐怖中幸存了下来。为此，你的事迹将代代相传，是你的努力给了他们活下去的机会……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The Free Merchants will not forget you.  For your support in their time "
"of need, they contribute greatly to the development of the community "
"established by you and your followers…"
msgstr " 自由商会不会忘记你。在他们最需要的时候得到了你的支持，他们为你和你的追随者建立的社区的发展做出了巨大贡献……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The people of Tacoma will not forget you.  As you helped them develop the "
"facilities needed to survive the apocalypse, they too help your followers "
"harness the means of production…"
msgstr " 塔科马公社的人民不会忘记你。因为你帮助了他们建设各种在世界末日中生存所需的设施，因此他们也帮助你的追随者充分利用好这份生产资料……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The soldiers of the Old Guard will not forget you.  In bringing together "
"the survivors of the Cataclysm, you have sown the seeds for a new birth of "
"Freedom.  For this, your legend will survive as long as the Old Guard does…"
msgstr " 旧日守护者的士兵不会忘记你。在将大灾变的幸存者聚集在一起的过程中，你们为自由的新生播下了种子。为此，你的传奇将与旧日守护者一同延续……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Locked in an endless battle, the Old Guard was forced to consolidate "
"their resources in a handful of fortified bases along the coast.  Without the "
"men or material to rebuild, the soldiers that remained lost all hope…"
msgstr "    受困於一場無止盡的戰鬥之中，舊日守衛被迫將其資源整合到沿海少數堅固的基地中。缺乏人力與物資來重建，留下來的士兵已失去了所有希望…"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The steadfastness of individual survivors after the Cataclysm impressed "
"the tattered remains of the once glorious union.  Spurred on by small "
"successes, a number of operations to re-secure facilities met with limited "
"success.  Forced to eventually consolidate to large bases, the Old Guard left "
"these facilities in the hands of the few survivors that remained.  As the "
"years passed, little materialized from the hopes of rebuilding civilization…"
msgstr ""
"    一个个灾变幸存者们的坚定不移的精神打动了曾经辉煌联邦的些许残存组织。因数次任务成功所鼓舞而展开的一系列夺回其他设施的行动却成果有限。旧日守护者们最终"
"不得不将有限的资源集中到更大的基地中去，将已夺回的设施交给剩余的少数幸存者管理。年复一年，重建人类文明的希望却始终渺茫……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The steadfastness of individual survivors after the Cataclysm impressed "
"the tattered remains of the once glorious union.  Spurred on by numerous "
"strategic successes, a number of operations to re-secure facilities succeeded "
"thanks to the support of various surviving communities.  While some remained "
"cautious of submitting themselves to the Old Guard's authority, nostalgia for "
"the old world and the promise of security from the new rallied many more to "
"their flag…"
msgstr ""
"    The steadfastness of individual survivors after the Cataclysm impressed "
"the tattered remains of the once glorious union.  Spurred on by numerous "
"strategic successes, a number of operations to re-secure facilities succeeded "
"thanks to the support of various surviving communities.  While some remained "
"cautious of submitting themselves to the Old Guard's authority, nostalgia for "
"the old world and the promise of security from the new rallied many more to "
"their flag…"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Life in the refugee shelter deteriorated as food shortages and disease "
"destroyed any hope of maintaining a civilized enclave.  The merchants and "
"craftsmen dispersed to found new colonies but most became victims of "
"marauding bandits.  Those who survived never found a place to call home…"
msgstr ""
"    由於糧食短缺和疾病破壞了維持文明飛地的希望，難民營的生活不斷惡化。商人和工匠們分散到新的殖民地，但大多數人成為流寇土匪的受害者。那些倖存下來的人永遠"
"找不到能稱為家園的地方…"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The Free Merchants struggled for years to keep themselves fed but their "
"once profitable trade routes were plundered by bandits and thugs.  In squalor "
"and filth the first generations born after the Cataclysm are told stories of "
"the old days when food was abundant and the children were allowed to play in "
"the sun…"
msgstr ""
"    自由商会在之后的数年里艰难维持，仅能让自己稍稍填下肚子，他们曾经利润丰厚的贸易路线不断受到周围的土匪强盗掠夺。在肮脏污秽中，灾变之后的第一代人出生了"
"，他们只能够听老一辈人讲起过去食物丰富，儿童被允许在阳光下玩耍的故事……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    With the success of Tacoma and the return of the Old Guard, the Free "
"Merchants were able to expand their reach throughout the region.  In every "
"settlement they had a partner, and in every venture they had a stake.  In the "
"safety of their gilded compounds, food was abundant, and the first children "
"born after the Cataclysm were free to play in the sun…"
msgstr ""
" 随着塔科马公社的成功和旧日守护者的回归，自由商会得以在整个地区扩大他们的影响力。在每一个定居点，他们都有一个合伙人，在每一个新项目中，他们都有一部分股份。"
"藏身于富贵大院的安全地带，食物充足，大灾变后出生的第一批孩子们可以自由地在阳光下玩耍……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The fledgling outpost was abandoned a few months later.  The external "
"threats combined with low crop yields caused the Free Merchants to withdraw "
"their support.  When the exhausted migrants returned to the refugee center "
"they were turned away to face the world on their own."
msgstr ""
"    几个月后，这个刚刚建立的前哨站就被放弃了。外部威胁以及坏收成相结合导致自由商会撤回了一切支援。当精疲力竭的移民返回难民中心时，他们被告知必须离开，独"
"自面对世界。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The commune continued to grow rapidly through the years despite constant "
"external threat.  While maintaining a reputation as a haven for all "
"law-abiding citizens, the commune's leadership remained loyal to the "
"interests of the Free Merchants.  Hard labor for little reward remained the "
"price to be paid for those who sought the safety of the community."
msgstr ""
"    尽管外部威胁一直连续不断，但公社的规模仍在接下来的数年迅速增长。在保有所有守法公民的避风港这一美名的同时，公社的领导依旧忠于自由商会的利益。对于那些"
"向社区寻求保护的人来说，艰苦劳动之后只能获得微薄回报仍然是他们需要承担的代价。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Through the years, the commune would continue to rapidly grow despite "
"constant external threats.  In a surprising twist then, the greatest threat "
"would turn out to be an internal one.  The collapse of the Free Merchant "
"traders plunged the Commune's leadership into a period of significant "
"infighting, and seeing an opportunity, the survivors of the Commune quickly "
"moved to oust them.  Afterwards, the settlement was re-organized under a "
"democratically elected council and the resources of Tacoma were distributed "
"by need and popular vote.  The Commune would soon earn a reputation as a "
"place where the struggles of the wasteland were shared, and where the horrors "
"of the world were faced together."
msgstr ""
" 多年来，尽管不断受到外部威胁，公社依旧维持了快速发展。然而出人意料的是，最大的威胁来自于内部。自由商会商人的倒台使公社的领导层陷入了一段严重内讧时期，公社"
"的幸存者看到了一个机会，迅速采取行动将他们赶下台。之后，定居点在民主选举的理事会下重新组织起来，塔科马公社的资源根据需要和普选进行分配。公社很快就家喻户晓，"
"成为了一处同心协力与荒原斗争、共同面对异界恐怖的地方。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    When the Old Guard came for their support, the Commune's leadership was "
"happy to accept, though not without conditions.  Lucrative contracts and the "
"exclusive rights to inter-settlement trade routes made the Free Merchants "
"virtual merchant royalty overnight.  While many survivors would grumble, none "
"could deny that wherever the Old Guard went, the Free Merchants would bring "
"their prosperity with them, for a price of course."
msgstr ""
" 当旧日守护者前来支持他们时，公社的领导层很乐意接受，虽然这并非是免费的午餐。利润丰厚的合同和对公社贸易路线的独占权使得自由商会一夜之间成为了某种意义上的商"
"人贵族。虽然许多幸存者会抱怨，但没有人能否认，无论旧日守护者走到哪里，自由商会都会随之带来繁荣，当然，得付出点代价。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    When the Old Guard came for their support, the citizens of the Commune "
"were extremely resistant to surrendering their autonomy to this 'new' power.  "
"However, the Old Guard, desperate to find footholds in the region, proved "
"more amicable to their demands than they expected.  In exchange for "
"representation in the Provisional Congress on Nantucket island, and the Old "
"Guard's support in organizing other settlements like Tacoma in their "
"territory, the Tacoma Commune would surprise many by voting to join the new "
"union.  When asked for a comment on the vote, the First Speaker of the Tacoma "
"Council simply said, 'out of many, one.'"
msgstr ""
" 当旧日守护者前来支持他们时，公社的公民非常抗拒将自身权利转交给这个“新”政权。然而，尽管旧日守护者迫切希望在当地寻求立足点，但他们所提出的条件比预期的更加"
"友善。作为在南塔克特岛临时国会的代表，以及旧日守护者在其领土上组织类似塔科马的其他定居点的支持的交换，塔科马公社投票加入了新联盟，出乎许多人的意料。当被问及"
"对投票的评论时，塔科马议会首席议长只是简单地说道：“合众，为一。”"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The artisans continued to work for a time.  However a lack of trade and "
"connection left them doomed from the beginning.  At some point the properties "
"became abandoned with no signs of the former inhabitants."
msgstr "    工匠们继续工作了一段时间。然而，由于缺乏贸易和联系，他们从一开始就注定要失败。最终在某个时候，这座房产被遗弃了，再也没有曾经居民的踪迹。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The artisans became a corner stone of the survivor community and economy. "
" Cody's infectious desire for sharing helped bridge gaps with other groups "
"and Jay's 'banking' service became crucial to maintaining security."
msgstr "    工匠们成为幸存者社区和经济的基石。科迪具有感染力的分享愿望有助于弥合其他团体间的嫌隙，而杰伊的\"银行\"服务对于维持安全至关重要。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The lone bands of survivors who wandered the now alien world dwindled in "
"number through the years.  Unable to compete with the growing number of "
"monstrosities that had adapted to live in their world, those who did survive "
"lived in dejected poverty and hopelessness…"
msgstr ""
"    徘徊在如今已充滿外星生物的世界，孤立的倖存者團體正在逐年減少。由於要與這些已經適應世界環境而逐漸增長的怪物們對抗越來越難，那些倖存下來的人只能活在沮"
"喪的貧困與絕望之中..."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The scavengers who flourished in the opening days of the Cataclysm found "
"an ever increasing challenge in finding and maintaining equipment from the "
"old world.  Enormous hordes made cities impossible to enter while new "
"eldritch horrors appeared mysteriously near old research labs.  But on the "
"fringes of where civilization once ended, bands of hunter-gatherers began to "
"adopt agrarian lifestyles in fortified enclaves…"
msgstr ""
"    在大灾变之后的初期四处横行的拾荒者们正面临着一个与日俱增的挑战，如何寻找并维护旧世界所留下的装备。无尽的尸潮让城市无法进入，而同时新的异界生物从废弃"
"的实验室中不断涌现。而在已经终结的旧日文明世界的边缘，曾经的狩猎采集小队开始在一块块防守严密的堡垒中渐渐适应农耕生活……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The raiders grew more powerful than any other faction as attrition "
"destroyed the Old Guard.  The ruthless men and women who banded together to "
"rob refugees and pillage settlements soon found themselves without enough "
"victims to survive.  The Hell's Raiders were eventually destroyed when "
"infighting erupted into civil war but there were few survivors left to "
"celebrate their destruction."
msgstr ""
"    在旧日守护者因人员流失而走向毁灭的同时，强盗渐渐变得比任何其他派系都更强。这些为了打劫难民和掠夺定居点而狼狈为奸的无情男女很快发现已经没有足够的受害"
"者供他们生存了。当内斗爆发为内战时，地狱掠夺者最终被完全摧毁，但已经没多少受害者能活着庆祝他们的毁灭了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Fueled by drugs and rage, the Hell's Raiders fought tooth and nail to "
"overthrow the last strongholds of the Old Guard.  The costly victories "
"brought the warlords abundant territory and slaves but little in the way of "
"stability.  Within weeks, infighting led to civil war as tribes vied for "
"leadership of the faction.  When only one warlord finally secured control, "
"there was nothing left to fight for… just endless cities full of the dead."
msgstr ""
"    在藥物和怒火的刺激下，地獄掠奪者們用牙齒和指甲搏鬥，顛覆了舊日守衛的最後要塞。代價高昂的勝利給軍閥帶來了充裕的領土和奴隸，但是卻很少帶來穩定。幾週之"
"內，由於各派系為了爭奪該陣營的領導權，內鬥導致了內戰。當只有一個軍閥最終獲得掌管權力時，就沒有什麼可爭奪的... 只剩無數滿是死人的城市。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Unable to overcome the forces of the Old Guard, the Hell's Raiders found "
"themselves trapped in a grueling war of attrition…"
msgstr ""
"    Unable to overcome the forces of the Old Guard, the Hell's Raiders found "
"themselves trapped in a grueling war of attrition…"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    …though in the end, they simply couldn't keep up. With the survivors of "
"the wasteland becoming more organized by the day, the Hell's Raiders found it "
"more and more difficult to find easy prey to loot and pillage.  Before long, "
"the once feared raiders found themselves on the defensive as the resurgent "
"Old Guard began to assault their outposts and dismantle their hierarchy of "
"command.  Those that weren't killed were forced to flee into the untamed "
"west, the memory of their terror slowly fading like a bad dream."
msgstr ""
"    …though in the end, they simply couldn't keep up. With the survivors of "
"the wasteland becoming more organized by the day, the Hell's Raiders found it "
"more and more difficult to find easy prey to loot and pillage.  Before long, "
"the once feared raiders found themselves on the defensive as the resurgent "
"Old Guard began to assault their outposts and dismantle their hierarchy of "
"command.  Those that weren't killed were forced to flee into the untamed "
"west, the memory of their terror slowly fading like a bad dream."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Despite Melchior's enlightened leadership, shortages and crises plagued "
"Hub-01 from the first day of the Cataclysm.  The researchers and "
"administrators among the surviving staff lacked the practical skills to "
"survive in the savage new world.  As Hub-01's systems collapsed from a lack "
"of maintenance, the few survivors fled the building to be killed by the "
"zombies and bandits."
msgstr ""
"    即便在梅尔基奥尔的开明领导下，物资短缺和各类危机从大灾变的第一天起就困扰着Hub-01"
"。幸存员工中的研究人员和管理人员缺乏在野蛮的新世界中生存的实用技能。最终Hub-01的系统因缺乏维护而崩溃，少数幸存者逃离了大楼，被丧尸和强盗杀死。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Melchior's enlightened leadership, combined with practical skills "
"provided by mercenary survivors, allowed Hub-01 to flourish briefly.  It "
"became a mecca for advanced technology, selling off devices and equipment "
"that could no longer be reproduced.  Despite this, Hub-01 was never able to "
"expand sufficiently to renew its own population, nor was it able to unite "
"with any other prosperous community, nor could enough trustworthy mercenaries "
"(or staff) be recruited to replace those who died in its defense.  Hub-01 "
"fell into disrepair and ruin.  After the air processing facility was "
"overtaken by mold, the remaining staff of Hub-01 fled the building and were "
"killed by zombies and bandits.  Melchior's drones - possibly by design - were "
"incapable of maintaining themselves without human hands, and stopped working "
"a few months later.  Without regular maintenance, Melchior's own systems also "
"fell to ruin, and less than a decade after the Cataclysm, humanity's first AI "
"powered down and was forgotten."
msgstr ""
"    Melchior's enlightened leadership, combined with practical skills "
"provided by mercenary survivors, allowed Hub-01 to flourish briefly.  It "
"became a mecca for advanced technology, selling off devices and equipment "
"that could no longer be reproduced.  Despite this, Hub-01 was never able to "
"expand sufficiently to renew its own population, nor was it able to unite "
"with any other prosperous community, nor could enough trustworthy mercenaries "
"(or staff) be recruited to replace those who died in its defense.  Hub-01 "
"fell into disrepair and ruin.  After the air processing facility was "
"overtaken by mold, the remaining staff of Hub-01 fled the building and were "
"killed by zombies and bandits.  Melchior's drones - possibly by design - were "
"incapable of maintaining themselves without human hands, and stopped working "
"a few months later.  Without regular maintenance, Melchior's own systems also "
"fell to ruin, and less than a decade after the Cataclysm, humanity's first AI "
"powered down and was forgotten."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Melchior's enlightened leadership, backed-up with the muscle of numerous "
"mercenary survivors, allowed Hub-01 to flourish on its' own for a time.  "
"However, while the staff of Hub-01 preferred to ignore the people of the "
"region, the looming shortages of advanced resources and personnel forced them "
"to expand their search for resources.  By prying the secrets of CBMs from the "
"Exodii, Hub01 was able to recruit and retain an enhanced mercenary force "
"which proved capable of protecting them for years after the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"    Melchior's enlightened leadership, backed-up with the muscle of numerous "
"mercenary survivors, allowed Hub-01 to flourish on its' own for a time.  "
"However, while the staff of Hub-01 preferred to ignore the people of the "
"region, the looming shortages of advanced resources and personnel forced them "
"to expand their search for resources.  By prying the secrets of CBMs from the "
"Exodii, Hub01 was able to recruit and retain an enhanced mercenary force "
"which proved capable of protecting them for years after the Cataclysm."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    While still technically being employees (or property, in Melchior's case) "
"of the federal government, the staff of Hub-01 were initially very reluctant "
"to have anything to do with the Old Guard.  However, the connections and "
"resources of the Old Guard gave them significant leverage in negotiations "
"between the two factions.  After much debate, Hub-01 would eventually vote to "
"rejoin the government in exchange for its' support of the Hub's research."
msgstr ""
"    While still technically being employees (or property, in Melchior's case) "
"of the federal government, the staff of Hub-01 were initially very reluctant "
"to have anything to do with the Old Guard.  However, the connections and "
"resources of the Old Guard gave them significant leverage in negotiations "
"between the two factions.  After much debate, Hub-01 would eventually vote to "
"rejoin the government in exchange for its' support of the Hub's research."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Life on the farm grew tense as new horrors sprung from the world.  The "
"Isherwoods were plagued by undead hordes and the encroachment of triffids.  "
"When an otherworldly mold took over the fields, the family was forced to "
"move.  The farm was later found abandoned, the fields black with ash…"
msgstr ""
"    随着新的恐怖事件不断涌现，农场的生活变得紧张起来。伊舍伍德家族遭受了成群不死人的困扰，也受到了三尖树的侵袭。当另一个世界的霉菌占据了田地时，这个家庭"
"被迫搬迁。农场后来被发现已经遗弃，田地被灰烬染黑……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The generational land of the Isherwoods came to flourish following "
"<the_cataclysm>, helping to feed nearby settlements.  Survivors flocked to "
"learn botany, animal handling, and backwoods remedies, eventually forming a "
"small community…"
msgstr ""
"    伊舍伍德家族世代相传的土地在<the_"
"cataclysm>后蓬勃发展，养活了附近的定居点。幸存者蜂拥而至，学习植物学、动物处理，并在蛮荒中寻求救赎，最终形成了一个小社区……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    After they shot an Old Guard envoy to the farm, a bounty was placed on "
"the Isherwood family.  With the Isherwoods forced from their home, the farm "
"was quickly purchased by the Free Merchants and converted into a very "
"profitable plantation…"
msgstr ""
"    After they shot an Old Guard envoy to the farm, a bounty was placed on "
"the Isherwood family.  With the Isherwoods forced from their home, the farm "
"was quickly purchased by the Free Merchants and converted into a very "
"profitable plantation…"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    After they shot an Old Guard envoy to the farm, a bounty was placed on "
"the Isherwood family.  When the father pleaded guilty to killing the man, the "
"remaining Isherwoods were allowed to return to their farm, albeit with "
"planners from Tacoma…"
msgstr ""
"    After they shot an Old Guard envoy to the farm, a bounty was placed on "
"the Isherwood family.  When the father pleaded guilty to killing the man, the "
"remaining Isherwoods were allowed to return to their farm, albeit with "
"planners from Tacoma…"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Mr. Lapin continued his remote life in the wilderness, teaching whoever "
"would visit.  The survivors who came slowly dwindled, until they stopped "
"entirely.  Mr. Lapin was found dead several years later following a heart "
"attack.  His body had decomposed to skeletal remains…"
msgstr ""
"    拉宾先生继续着他在荒野中的遥远生活，并给任何愿意的来访者教授知识。但来访的幸存者慢慢减少，直到完全停止。几年后，拉宾先生被发现死于心脏病发作。他的身"
"体已经腐烂，只剩下骨架。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The knowledge Mr. Lapin taught attracted a slew of individuals, who "
"constructed makeshift housing to study with him.  As more people came, they "
"formed a small community…"
msgstr "    拉宾先生传授的知识吸引了一大批人，他们建造了临时住房，向他持续学习。随着越来越多的人来到这里，他们形成了一个小社区……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The former prisoners may have gained their freedom during "
"<the_cataclysm>, but remained trapped on the island, surrounded by "
"carnivorous terrors.  Infighting and near-starvation destroyed the group when "
"one of them found a boat and attempted to steal it.  Those who remained took "
"the craft and sailed away, never to be seen again…"
msgstr ""
"    以前的囚犯可能在<the_"
"cataclysm>中获得了自由，但仍被困在岛上，被食肉的恐怖生物所包围。后来他们中的某人发现了一艘船并试图偷走它，然后内讧和饥荒摧毁了这群人。那些留下来的"
"人乘船离开，再也没人看到他们。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The prisoners succeeded in their escape and sailed to the mainland.  They "
"found <the_cataclysm> unforgiving and harsh, struggling to survive.  When two "
"of them died in a shootout with a Hell's Raiders caravan, they packed all "
"their possessions and sailed back to the prison, which they transformed into "
"a fortress away from the world…"
msgstr ""
"    囚犯们成功逃脱，驶向陆地。他们发现这里的环境无情而恶劣，只能不断为生存而挣扎，当他们中的两个人在与地狱掠夺者商队的枪战中丧生时，他们收拾好所有的财产"
"，驶回监狱，并将其改造成一个远离世界的堡垒……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    Despite their extensive knowledge of the undead, the Exodii had great "
"difficulty in their scavenging efforts.  A war with the Hell's Raiders proved "
"to be successful, but heavily taxed their machinery and supplies.  Several "
"years after their arrival, a group of mercenaries employed by them returned "
"to the fortress, only to find it has mysteriously disappeared, with a slew of "
"broken machinery scattered about…"
msgstr ""
"    尽管他们对那些不死人有广泛的了解，但流亡族在搜刮方面遇到了很大的困难。与地狱掠夺者的战争被证明是成功的，但给他们的机器和物资造成了沉重的负担。在他们"
"到来的几年后，一群受雇于他们的雇佣兵回到了要塞，却发现它已经神秘地消失了，到处散落着一连串破碎的机器……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The extensive knowledge and industrial might of the Exodii proved to be "
"their saving grace in <the_cataclysm>.  They developed extensive connections "
"to other groups of survivors, selling advanced machinery and educating "
"numerous individuals on electronics, welding, and engineering.  Over the "
"years, a town formed around the castle, becoming a thriving bastion among the "
"dead…"
msgstr ""
"    The extensive knowledge and industrial might of the Exodii proved to be "
"their saving grace in <the_cataclysm>.  They developed extensive connections "
"to other groups of survivors, selling advanced machinery and educating "
"numerous individuals on electronics, welding, and engineering.  Over the "
"years, a town formed around the castle, becoming a thriving bastion among the "
"dead…"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The New England Community Church struggled following the Cataclysm, "
"constantly low on food and basic supplies.  The relative worthlessness of "
"icons to outsiders and their general unfriendliness stifled commerce with "
"remaining survivor groups.  They became more fanatical as time went on, "
"becoming estranged, destitute, and forgotten by the outside world…"
msgstr ""
"    新英格兰教会社区在大灾变之后艰难维持，食物和日用品持续短缺。他们所使用的圣像对外人来说相对缺少价值，而且他们普遍的不友好态度阻碍了与其他幸存者群体的"
"贸易往来。随着时间的推移，他们变得更加狂热，变得疏远、贫困，渐渐被外界遗忘……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The New England Church Community grew into a flourishing refuge in the "
"years following the Cataclysm.  A change in leadership to moderate and "
"inclusive stances vastly improved outside relations, helping to reinforce the "
"value of the icon and spreading Christianity across the wasteland…"
msgstr ""
"    新英格兰教会社区在大灾变之后的几年里渐渐发展成为了一个繁荣的避难所。领导层向温和包容的立场转变，极大地改善了外部关系，帮助提升了圣像的含金量，并在这"
"片废土上继续传播着基督福音……"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The struggling survivors at the community college campus ran out of food "
"and abandoned the area.  Some found a place with other survivor groups but "
"most failed to find another safe place and were lost."
msgstr "生存艰难的社区大学校园里的幸存者们用尽了食物,被迫放弃了那个地区。一些人加入了其他幸存者群体,但大多数人未能找到另一个安全的地方,最终销声匿迹。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_factions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_factions"
msgid ""
"    The library continued to grow through the years despite constant survival "
"challenges and internal battles over the direction of the campus.  While "
"maintaining a reputation as a haven for learning and adaptation to this new "
"world, the library's leadership developed and spread some pragmatic "
"understanding of how to stay alive.  The collection grew and became famous "
"among survivors as a resource for vital survival skills as well as a "
"distraction from the terrors of the world."
msgstr ""
"尽管面临着不断的生存挑战和内部对校园方面的争论,图书馆仍在逐年发展壮大。在保持作为学习和适应新世界避难所的声誉的同时,"
"图书馆的领导层发展并传播了一些关于如何活下去的务实理解。馆藏书籍不断变多,在幸存者中作为获取生存技能及从这个可怕世界中寻求慰藉的重要资源而声名远扬。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Died several years later at the hands of a Hell's Raiders band.  Till "
"the end, he held out hope that his daughter was still alive in the wasteland."
msgstr "    在数年之后死于地狱掠夺者之手。直到生命的最后一刻，他始终坚信自己的女儿仍在废土上的某处活着。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Was making his way to Michigan to search for family when he broke his "
"leg in the woods.  Died of hypothermia a week later.  A note found with his "
"body read, 'I wish I could have saved her.'"
msgstr "    在去密歇根州寻找自己家人的路上在森林里摔断了腿。一周后死于体温过低。尸体上留下的最后遗言写着：\"我真希望我当时能救下她。\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Survived for a number of years and made a name for himself among other "
"survivors.  Eventually he began augmenting himself with bionics… when a "
"failed surgery left him permanently blind he committed suicide without "
"leaving a note."
msgstr ""
"     Survived for a number of years and made a name for himself among other "
"survivors.  Eventually he began augmenting himself with bionics… when a "
"failed surgery left him permanently blind he committed suicide without "
"leaving a note."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Met with some success as a craftsman working in a small survivor "
"outpost.  Eventually he married a young refugee and had two children.  Died "
"during a typhoid outbreak a few years later.  Survived by only his three year "
"old son."
msgstr ""
"    活了下来并在一个小型幸存者前哨站内成为了一名生意红火的手工艺人。最终和一名年轻的难民结婚并生了两个孩子。在数年后一次席卷前哨站的伤寒病爆发中死去。只"
"有他三岁的儿子一人得以幸免于难。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Became a skilled mechanic and assisted a number of refugees searching "
"for settlements.  He left one day on a routine trading run and failed to "
"return.  His wrecked truck was located by a scavenger band but he was never "
"seen again."
msgstr ""
"    成为了一名熟练的机械师，并且帮助了不少难民寻找合适的定居地。在某一天的日常交易旅程离开营地却再也没能回来。一个拾荒者小队在野外找到了他损坏的卡车，但"
"是谁也没能再见到他。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Became a game hunter and trapper.  Eventually he left on a hunting trip "
"never to be seen again.  Attempts to locate him were called off when one of "
"the searchers disappeared without a trace."
msgstr "    成为了一名出色的猎手和陷阱师。最终他踏上了一场狩猎并再也没被别人看到过了。尝试寻找他的行动在一名同伴毫无踪迹的失踪之后就被立刻取消了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Went on to enlist in the Old Guard.  Was killed in action a year later "
"fighting the Hell's Raiders in Vermont.  In his will he requested that all "
"entitlements and property be transferred to a young lady he had met while "
"guarding a FEMA camp.  Was survived by the young lady and a newborn son."
msgstr ""
"    成为了旧日守护者中的一员。一年后在佛特蒙州与地狱掠夺者的战斗中不幸牺牲。在遗嘱中他将自己所有的补偿金和财产都交给一名守卫联邦应急管理局营地的年轻女战"
"士。女战士活了下来并且生下了一个健康的男宝宝。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Became a laborer for hire in any outpost that needed assistance.  Was "
"hanged for stealing from an employer; weeks later it was revealed the "
"employer never had the resources nor intention to pay him."
msgstr ""
"    四处游走在各个需要帮助的前哨站中充当劳工。因为被指控偷窃而被雇主吊死在绞刑架上。几周之后大家才发现那位雇主并没有足够的资源也没有任何意愿支付他的报酬"
"。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Never spent much time around settlements after your death.  Was last "
"seen near the Adirondacks in New York."
msgstr "    在你死后并没有花太多时间在定居点四周呆着。最后一次被别人见到是在纽约州附近的阿第伦达克山脉。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Died of an infected bite a few weeks later.  Before he passed he told "
"those present, 'Now I've lost everything in this world… but you haven't.  "
"Keep searching, the world is big enough that there has to be a place out "
"there that hasn't been overrun.'"
msgstr ""
"    在数周之后死于咬伤感染。在他临终前他告诉周围的人：\""
"现在我即将失去这世界上的一切……但是你们没有。请继续寻找下去，这个世界足够大，一定有一块没有被这些家伙占领的地方。\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Managed to contract some form of fungal infection a few months after "
"your passing.  Unable to find treatment, he asked to be put down while "
"listening to someone read from his favorite novel, Don Quixote."
msgstr "    在你死后数月患上了某种真菌感染。由于找不到能够治疗的药物，他要求自己被及时处理掉，同时其他人为他念诵他最喜爱的小说，堂吉诃德。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Became a self-taught chemist and medic.  His work eventually led him to "
"a life of alcohol abuse and morphine addiction.  Overdosed one night when "
"left unattended.  The community he helped said, 'He was probably the best "
"thing to happen to us in years… there just isn't any turning back when you "
"lose all hope.'"
msgstr ""
"    通过自学成为了一名化学家和医生。他的工作使得他渐渐通过滥用酒精和吗啡来排解压力，并最终成瘾。在一天晚上因为药物过量且无人照料而死。他所曾经帮助过的社"
"区评价道：\"他的到来也许是这几年来我们能遇到的最好的事情了……但是当你失去所有希望之后没有什么能够挽回你的了。\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Went on to become a notable scout and urban explorer.  Was tragically "
"killed when cornered in an abandoned store when scavenging with a group of "
"unskilled survivors."
msgstr "    继续自己的旅程成为了一名出色的侦查员和城市探险家。最终在带领一群毫无经验的幸存者在城市内拾荒时被围攻在一间废弃商店的角落中惨死。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     After your death he became a reclusive but friendly guy.  His continued "
"supply runs helped keep many survivor colonies alive through the years.  "
"Unfortunately, he bled to death over the course of several days after having "
"stepped on a landmine intended to target local raiders."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后成了一名隐居荒野但友善的人。他持续数年为周边数个幸存者定居点提供补给以保证他们能够生存下去。不幸的是，他不小心踩上了本为抵御周边强盗而设置的"
"地雷，数天之后死于流血过多。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Lost his way long before he met you.  The Cataclysm offered him the "
"chance to denounce the former vices that had led to his incarceration… an "
"offer that went unanswered.  After you were killed, he returned to hunting "
"those he saw as weak.  The number of people he murdered is unknown but prior "
"to his execution he claimed that, 'butchering the dead was never as fun as "
"the living.'"
msgstr ""
"    在遇到你之前就已经迷失了自我。大灾变给了他一次能够摆脱曾让他入狱的旧罪的绝佳机会……而他并未去把握这机会。在你死后，他又回到了过去狩猎那些他所认为的"
"弱小猎物。被他所杀害的人数难以估计，但在他被绞死前他声称道：\"屠宰死人永远没有屠宰活人那么有趣。\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Found new meaning in life after your death.  Although he never informed "
"you, his felonies in the departed world had prevented him from ever having a "
"real place in society.  With the destruction of existing criminal records he "
"took it upon himself to prove his worth to his fellow man.  Died from a heart "
"attack while alone on a trip many years after the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后找到了生命的新意义。虽然他从没有告诉过你，但是他在已经失去的旧世界中所犯下的罪行将使得他永远无法在社会上拥有真正的地位。随着所有犯罪记录被破"
"坏，他站出来承担起社会责任，向他的同伴们证明了自身的价值。大灾变之后的许多年后，他在一次独自旅行时死于心脏病发作。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Spent his entire life secretly addicted to one substance or another.  "
"After your death he briefly worked as a laborer in a survivor camp before "
"losing his grip on reality due to various side effects associated with his "
"drugs of choice.  He died from complications due to a seizure.  In his last "
"moments he saw Porkey the pig exclaim, 'That's all folks!' before an animated "
"audience."
msgstr ""
"    将自己的生命都投入于偷偷吸食各类令人上瘾的毒品上。在你死后不久后加入了一个幸存者避难营地做短工，但由于吸食毒品的副作用，他渐渐的和现实脱钩了。死于癫"
"痫以及其引发的并发症。在他生命的最后一刻，他觉得自己看到了猪小弟向一位复苏的观众喊道：\"就到这儿吧……\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Was never known as a particularly brave individual nor an emotionally "
"stable one.  His regret for not helping people during the opening days of the "
"Cataclysm led him to attempt suicide multiple times in the years that "
"followed.  Life improved briefly when he married a fellow survivor but was "
"shattered when his spouse was killed by members of a mysterious apocalypse "
"cult.  He was killed when he attempted to sneak into the cult's compound to "
"enact revenge himself."
msgstr ""
"    从没被别人当作特别勇敢或情绪稳定的人。他总是在为自己在大灾变最初几天内未能帮助别人而懊悔不已，甚至之后几年内几次尝试过自杀。在他与一名幸存者同伴结婚"
"之后，生活开始略有改善，然而当他妻子被一名神秘的末日邪教徒杀死之后，一切又都被粉碎。他孤身一人试图潜入邪教组织所在的院落准备复仇，不幸被杀。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Spent the remainder of his life assisting one adventurer party or "
"another.  Eventually his luck ran out when he became ill after eating "
"something rotten.  Was abandoned by his party in an infested neighborhood, "
"never to be seen again."
msgstr ""
"    将其余生的所有精力都投入协助一个又一个探险小队。最终在一次吃了腐烂食物后，用光了所有的好运病倒了。被他所帮助过的探险小队遗弃在一个满是被感染者的社区"
"，再也没被别人看到过。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Died from sepsis a few weeks after you.  The cut on his leg that "
"ultimately killed him would have been easily treatable in nearly any other "
"situation.  His final wish was that he be allowed to drink himself into his "
"grave.  Upon consideration, the party that he was with opted to shoot him in "
"the head and divide his belongings rather than waste the alcohol."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后的几周死于败血症。导致他丧生的腿部伤口在其他几乎所有情况下都是很容易治好的。他的遗愿是能够在被埋进坟墓前最后畅饮一回。而他的同伴在考虑之后还"
"是选择直接给他头上来一枪并分掉他的财产而不是浪费宝贵的酒精。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Worked hard following your death to organize his own band of survivors.  "
"Went on to marry and have two children that were raised and taught every "
"survival skill they would ever need.  His past eventually caught up to him "
"when he ran afoul with an Old Guard colonel.  Since he fled his post as a "
"National Guard soldier during the Cataclysm he was hanged for desertion "
"despite the protests of a huge number of survivors that had benefited from "
"his service over the years."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后努力工作，并组织起了他自己的幸存者团队。结了婚，生了两个孩子，养大后教授他们所会需要的各种求生技能。最终他与旧日守护者的上校发生口角，他的过"
"往经历还是让他被抓了起来。由于他在大灾变时逃离了自己国民警卫队的岗位，不顾大量多年来受益于他服务的幸存者抗议，他依旧因逃兵罪名被绞死在绞刑架上。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Went on to the coast and salvaged a small sailboat.  Despite the "
"protests of those that knew him, his decision to sail in search of some "
"uninhabited tropical paradise in the north Atlantic was final.  His "
"disappearance after starting the journey was described by his fellow "
"survivors as 'a waste of a perfectly good boat.'"
msgstr ""
"    到了海边，并且找到了一艘小帆船。无视周围认识的人的劝阻，他最终决定出发在北大西洋上寻找一些无人居住的热带天堂岛。在旅行不久后就失踪了，他的同伴提起这"
"件事来都说：\"真是浪费了一艘完美的好船。\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Within a few weeks of your death he was robbed by a pair of bandits.  "
"For attempting to resist their demands they broke both of his arms in "
"multiple places.  Alone and wounded it took nearly a month before he found "
"refuge and primitive medical assistance with other survivors.  Having lost "
"his ability to grasp or lift, he spent the last few years of his life begging "
"for food and relying on charity from his fellow survivors."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后的几周内，他被几个强盗打劫了。由于抗拒他们的要求，他的双臂在好几处都被打断了。独自一人又受伤，他花了将近一个月才最终找到了一处避难所，以及其"
"他幸存者所提供的原始医疗援助。由于失去了抓握和抬起重物的能力，他在之后死前几年内都只能靠乞讨和同伴的施舍勉强活着。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Trained under your guidance, he became a renowned abomination hunter.  "
"With what weapons he could salvage he led parties to reclaim town after town "
"from the undead and other horrors that wandered the wasteland.  His success "
"was temporal as monsters migrated into the cleared territories as quickly as "
"he could clear them.  His life ended when antibiotic resistant infection "
"spread between his countless minor wounds."
msgstr ""
"    经过你的指导训练，他成为远近闻名的异形猎手。他用捡来的各类武器领导一只小队将一个又一个镇子从废土上各种丧尸和恐怖怪物的手中夺了回来。然而他的成功只不"
"过是暂时的，因为一块区域刚刚被清理完毕，各类怪物又会马上迁移过来。最终他死于身上无数的小伤口以及连抗生素都无法治愈的超级感染。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Renounced the adventurous lifestyle after your death and chose to "
"establish a self sufficient camp away from the horrors found in the old "
"cities.  His attempts at solitude were in vain as otherworldly visitors began "
"to prey upon the weak and isolated.  The last moments of his life were spent "
"in bewilderment and horror as he was awoken one night to an alien insect the "
"size of a man opening his cabin's door and screaming in a dozen perfectly "
"human voices as it flew straight at him."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后决定放弃冒险的生活方式，找了一处能够远离那些旧日城市里的各类恐怖怪物的地方建立了一座自给自足的营地。不过他想成为隐士的努力不过是徒劳，因为那"
"些异界访客开始寻找孤单而又弱小的猎物下手。他生命的最后一刻在困惑和恐惧中度过，在一天夜里他被惊醒，看见一个和人一般大小的昆虫形状的异界生物拉开他小屋的门，伴"
"随数十个完美的人声尖叫着，朝着他飞过来。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Was detained and handcuffed by a police robot on multiple counts of "
"looting and vandalism that were tracked and recorded by the few remaining "
"security systems.  While being held on the ground awaiting additional police "
"response units he was torn to pieces by the undead that were attracted by the "
"commotion."
msgstr ""
"    因为被仅存的安防系统跟踪并记录下了数次抢劫以及破坏行为，一台警用机器人抓住了他并将他铐了起来。在被机器人压在地上等待更多的警察快速反应部队来支援时，"
"他被因为警报而引来的周围的丧尸给撕成了碎片。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Became a hunter after your death, living alone in the woods.  Traced "
"back to his cabin, he was murdered and devoured in his sleep by an actual "
"cannibal."
msgstr "    在你死后成为了一位独自居住在森林深处的猎人。被人跟踪到他的小屋，他在睡梦中被一个真正的食人者杀害并吞食。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Survived for many years, and became a renowned scavenger, eventually "
"setting up a small shop in a Free Merchant outpost.  Survived by two sons, he "
"died after a rare artifact poisoned his blood with acid."
msgstr "    活了不少年，成了一名远近闻名的拾荒者，最终在一处自由商会的前哨站里开了一间小店。他有两个儿子活了下来，而自己被一件罕见的神器用酸液腐蚀血液而毒死了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He wandered and scavenged the land for years after your death, "
"eventually becoming a skilled mechanic.  Employed by the Free Merchants, he "
"lived a comfortable, if rather uneventful life, dying of cancer, a rare "
"luxury these days."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后，他在这片土地上四处游荡拾荒了好几年，最终成为一名熟练的技工。受雇于自由商会，他过着舒适而平淡的生活，最终死于癌症，在这种年代相当罕见且奢侈"
"。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Became truly depressed after your death and hid in the woods.  If rumors "
"are to be believed, he spent years living as a deranged hermit in a distant "
"cave, worshiping stones and sacrificing dogs."
msgstr "    在你死后变得相当抑郁，独自隐居在森林之中。如果谣言可信的话，他多年以来都是个精神错乱的隐士，住在一处偏僻的洞穴之中，崇拜石头，并用狗做祭品。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     After your death, he became obsessed with preserving old knowledge and "
"eventually became known as 'the lorekeeper'.  Hired by the Old Guard as a "
"librarian, he spent his life among dusty old books, trying to convince others "
"of their value.  He even changed his name to Frederic Bastiat, in honor of an "
"old French philosopher."
msgstr ""
"     After your death, he became obsessed with preserving old knowledge and "
"eventually became known as 'the lorekeeper'.  Hired by the Old Guard as a "
"librarian, he spent his life among dusty old books, trying to convince others "
"of their value.  He even changed his name to Frederic Bastiat, in honor of an "
"old French philosopher."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He found faith after your death, eventually joining an Anglican "
"community and becoming a Vicar.  The crucifix provided him with a sense of "
"meaning, before dying horribly at the hands of raiders.  He was still praying "
"when they roasted him alive."
msgstr ""
"    你死后，他找到了信仰，最终加入了圣公会，成为了一名教区牧师。十字架给了他存在的意义感，直到他在掠夺者的手中可怕地死去。在被掠夺者们活活烧死之前，他仍"
"在祈祷。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Lost and damned, he joined a bloody cult after your death, kidnapping "
"and sacrificing young women.  His entire group was killed after being "
"discovered by the Old Guard.  His head was put on a spike as a reminder that "
"cultists will not be tolerated."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后，他加入了一个血腥的邪教，绑架年轻女子并将其作为祭品牺牲。他的团伙成员在被旧日守护者发现后都被杀了。他的头被钉在一根竖起来的尖刺上，警告人们"
"任何邪教徒都不会被容忍。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He did not survive for long after your death.  Electrocuted in an old "
"cellar, he kept screaming your name.  His body was never found."
msgstr "    在你死后，他没能活多久。他在一个旧地窖中触电身亡，死前不停地尖叫着你的名字。他的尸体从没被任何人找到。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Survived you by just a few days, he drowned trying to escape from a "
"horde."
msgstr "    只比你多活了几天，然后就在逃离尸潮时被淹死了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He wandered alone for days, before finding a Free Merchant outpost.  He "
"spent a few years as a caravan guard, often drinking himself half blind and "
"enjoying any woman he could find.  Booze made his grip unsteady and he was "
"eventually fired.  He died of alcohol poisoning the same day."
msgstr ""
"    他独自乱逛了几天，然后找到了一个自由商会的前哨站。他当了几年的商队警卫，经常喝得半死不活，享受他付得起价钱的每一个女人。酒精使他经常握不住枪，最后他"
"被解雇了。在那天，他死于酒精中毒。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Obsessed with the idea of settling down, he eventually found love and "
"retired to a farm in the middle of nowhere.  Relatively safe from the "
"monsters, he thrived for years.  Survived by seven sons and two daughters."
msgstr ""
"    一直痴迷于找个地方安顿下来，他最终找到了自己的真爱，并引退到一所偏僻的农场之中。相对免受怪物打扰，他过了许多年的好日子。最后还生了七个儿子和两个女儿"
"。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Became famous in the wastes after finding an old brewery and copying "
"their recipe.  His chilled beer, a known delicacy, is traded far and wide by "
"the Free Merchants."
msgstr "    在发现了一间老啤酒厂并抄袭了配方之后，他成为了废土世界中的名人。他的冰镇啤酒，成为众所周知的美食，并被自由商会广泛交易。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid "     Found a whole cellar of single malt whisky.  Drank himself to death."
msgstr "    找到了满满一个地窖的整瓶麦芽威士忌。喝得烂醉如泥死掉了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid "     Depressed after your death, he would hang himself after just a few days."
msgstr "    在你死后他很抑郁，几天后上吊自杀了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Wandered for months, before finding a small community that would accept "
"him.  Became a farmer and spent the rest of his uneventful life tending to "
"crops, glad that he was no longer alone."
msgstr "    四处徘徊了几个月，才找到一个愿意接纳他的小型社区。他成了一名农民，平平安安地度过了余生，照料庄稼，庆幸他不再是孤身一人。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Obsessed with finding 'the Cure', he died a few weeks later in an old "
"lab, torn to shreds by a security turret."
msgstr "    他痴迷于寻找\"解药\"，几周后死在一所旧实验室里，被防御炮塔撕成了碎片。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid "     Became a runner for the Refugee Center and died after a few months."
msgstr "    成为难民中心的一名送信员，几个月后就死了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Joined a raider gang and died in a firefight a few weeks later, trying "
"to rob a Free Merchant caravan."
msgstr "    几周后，他加入了一伙掠夺者，并在试图抢劫自由商会商队的交火中丧生。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Traveled north, he eventually found an intact baseball field and built a "
"prosperous farming community there."
msgstr "    去了北方，最终他找到了一个完好无损的棒球场，并在那里建立了一个繁荣的农耕社区。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He spent the rest of his short life looking for a new fix.  Died of an "
"overdose in an abandoned basement."
msgstr "    在其后短短的一生中，他一直都在寻找新的解决办法。最后在一个废弃地下室中死于吸毒过量。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Traveled south and joined a small fishing village.  Died a few years "
"later in a raider attack, alongside his young son."
msgstr "    南下并加入了一个小渔村。几年后，他和他的小儿子一同死于一次掠夺者的袭击中。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Thoroughly terrified by your death, he retired to an old LMOE shelter, "
"vowing never to leave.  He died of starvation inside."
msgstr "    他被你的死吓得魂不附体，隐退在一所旧LMOE避难所之中，发誓永不离开。最后饿死在了里面。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He became a very prosperous game hunter, trading meat and furs, and "
"providing many settlements with food in exchange for booze and male company.  "
"He died years later of an STD."
msgstr "    他成为了一个非常成功的猎人，交易肉类和毛皮，并为许多定居点提供食物，以换取酒类和男性同伴。几年后他死于性病。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Retired to the woods, he spent the rest of his life fishing and hunting "
"in a desolate cabin, rarely interacting with anyone else."
msgstr "    隐退在森林之中，他在一间荒凉的小木屋里钓鱼和打猎，很少和其他人交往。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Died en route to California, deliriously dreaming of a better life as he "
"was slowly devoured by spiders."
msgstr "     他死了在前往加利福尼亞的途中，一邊妄想一個更好的生活，一邊被蜘蛛緩緩地吞食。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He tried to cope with loneliness after your death, but failed.  He was "
"blind drunk when a group of zombies found his hideout and didn't stand a "
"chance."
msgstr "    你死后他试图应付孤独，但失败了。一群丧尸发现了他的藏身之处，而他却恰好喝得烂醉，毫无机会。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He didn't survive for long, waking up to a horde of zombies.  They "
"smashed through his fortified windows in a pinch and only the last bullet "
"prevented him from being devoured alive."
msgstr "    他没能活多久，被尸潮所惊醒。它们在紧要关头砸破了防御工事的窗户，最后他只有用一发子弹阻止自己被丧尸们活活吃掉。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He got sick soon after your death, and died without any medical help.  "
"His last words were 'Why did I live long enough to suffer like that?'"
msgstr "    你死后不久他就生病了，没能获得任何治疗就死了。他的临终遗言是：\"为什么还要让我活着忍受这样的痛苦呢？\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Went mad soon after learning of your death, leading him to believe he "
"was the predestined savior who would bring sinners into paradise.  Ended up "
"perishing in a siege against the Hell's Raiders that lasted for a grueling, "
"protracted month."
msgstr ""
"在得知你的死讯后不久便陷入了疯狂，这让他坚信自己是命中注定的救世主，将会带领罪人进入天堂。最终，在对抗地狱掠夺者的围攻中，经历了漫长而痛苦的一个月后，他不幸"
"丧生。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He had a dream he told no other about.  It was a grand ideal, a fantasy "
"out of a long-dead era.  He aspired to become a leader who would shield "
"humanity from the tribulations of the new world.  He gathered survivors and "
"built a settlement with the fledging numbers he had.  They held out for as "
"long as they could, but the dream of civilization could not flourish.  He "
"died a heartbroken man."
msgstr ""
"他有一个不为人知的梦想。那是一个宏伟的理想，一个来自早已消逝时代的幻想。他渴望成为一个领袖，保护人类免受这个新世界的苦难。他聚集了幸存者，用他手头上微薄的人"
"手建立了一个定居点。他们尽可能长久地坚持着，但文明的梦想终究未能开花结果。他带着一颗破碎的心离世。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He had a dream he told no other about.  It was a grand ideal, a fantasy "
"out of a long-dead era.  He aspired to become a leader who would shield "
"humanity from the tribulations of the new world.  He gathered survivors and "
"built a settlement with the fledging numbers he had.  With his unshakeable "
"spirit and exceptional talent, he managed to lift up his people into a "
"brighter dawn.  Before long, his realm encompassed vast swaths of land.  He "
"honored you as one of the founders of his kingdom."
msgstr ""
"他有一个不为人知的梦想。那是一个宏伟的理想，一个来自早已消逝时代的幻想。他渴望成为一个能保护人类免受新世界苦难的领袖。他聚集了幸存者，并用他手中的微薄人手建"
"立了一个定居点。凭借他坚定不移的精神和非凡的才华，他成功地将他的人民带入了一个更加光明的未来。不久之后，他的领土包括了广阔的土地。他尊崇你为他王国的创始人之"
"一。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Lived a troubled life after your passing.  Trusting no one but himself, "
"he struggled viciously at the end of the world.  Through great effort, he "
"formed a minor village that would end up becoming a safe haven for mutants.  "
"In their humble hovel, he would later be acclaimed as a saint."
msgstr ""
"在你离世之后，他过着困苦的生活。只相信自己，他在世界末日艰难地挣扎着。经过巨大的努力，他建立了一个小村庄，最终成为了变异人的避难所。在他们简陋的小屋里，最后"
"，他被尊称为圣人。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He increasingly grew fanatical as the whole world decayed around him.  "
"In due time, he saw himself as something more than human.  Arriving at an "
"abandoned cathedral, he climbed to the top of its spire before ringing the "
"bells again and again.  He belched out holy harangues at the heathens below "
"and laughed maniacally as the undead eventually tore through his body."
msgstr ""
"随着周围的世界逐渐腐朽，他变得越来越狂热。最终，他将自己看作超越了人类的存在。他来到一座废弃的大教堂，爬上了尖塔之巅，一遍又一遍地敲响钟声。他在下方的异教徒"
"们面前高声宣扬圣洁的训诫，当丧尸最终撕裂他的身体时，他疯狂地大笑着。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     Started fervently devouring the Gospel and soon had absolute conviction "
"that he was the Godson.  In his anguished throes of madness, he ended up "
"seeing the vision of a land without sin over the horizon as he stepped off "
"the edge of a skyscraper.  Upon cold lips, his last breath was uttered.  "
"'Eden.'"
msgstr ""
"他开始狂热地研读福音书，不久便深信自己是神之子。在他痛苦的疯狂挣扎中，当他从一座摩天大楼的边缘迈出时，他看到了地平线那边一个无罪的国度的幻象。在他冰冷的嘴唇"
"上，他最后的气息中吐出了一个词：“伊甸园”。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He lost his mind as he witnessed the death of all around him.  He began "
"to accept the notion that he brought about all this chaos.  With bloody tears "
"streaming down his cheeks, he sacrificed himself to save the world."
msgstr "目睹四周生命的消逝，他失去了理智。他开始接受这样一个观念：这场混乱是他一手造成的。带着满脸的血泪，他为了拯救世界而献出了自己的生命。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_male"
msgid ""
"     He lived desperately in the Cataclysm for a few years before meeting a "
"female survivor while digging through a dumpster.  Both were wary of one "
"another and were soon at each other's throats.  Neither side secured a "
"victory.  Wounded and scarred, they each went to their respective hideouts.  "
"Not long after, they met again.  The woman initiated a conversation with him, "
"asking for his help.  It was foolish to fight when they could work together "
"instead.  He acquiesced.  In this cruel and forlorn world, they soon fell in "
"love.  If they had each other, everything would be all right.  Decades passed "
"and they grew old holding hands.  One day, the wife fell ill, and with her "
"dying breath, she said she was happy all these years with him.  Stay strong "
"without me.  The husband wept and laid down beside his wife.  Without you, "
"nothing else matters.  He swallowed a bitter poison and departed this world "
"to find his wife who was waiting for him."
msgstr ""
"在大灾变中，他绝望地生活了几年，直到在翻找垃圾箱时遇到了一位女幸存者。一开始两人彼此戒备，并很快就陷入了激烈的争斗。双方都没有取得胜利。经历受伤和留下疤痕后"
"，他们各自回到了自己的藏身点。不久之后，他们再次相遇。那位女性主动与他交谈，请求他的帮助。与其相互斗争，不如携手合作。他同意了。在这个残酷而孤独的世界里，他"
"们很快坠入了爱河。只要他们拥有彼此，一切都会变得更好。几十年过去了，他们携手白头。有一天，妻子生病了，在临终之际，她说：这些年来与他在一起很幸福。没有我，你"
"要坚强。丈夫哭泣着，躺在妻子身边：没有你，其他一切都不重要了。他吞下了苦涩的毒药，离开这个世界去寻找等待着他的妻子。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Committed suicide rather than fall into the hands of the Hell's Raiders. "
" Till the end, she held out hope that her son was still alive in the "
"wasteland."
msgstr "    宁愿自杀也不愿意落入地狱掠夺者之手。直到生命的最后一刻，她始终坚信自己的儿子仍然在废土的某处活了下来。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Was making her way to Ohio to search for family when she consumed a "
"number of poisonous roots.  Over the course of three or four days she passed. "
" A note found with her body read, 'I wish I could have saved him.'"
msgstr "    在去俄亥俄州寻找自己家人的路上在森林里误食了一些有毒的植物根茎。几天后就死了。尸体上留下的最后遗言写着：\"我真希望我当时能救下他。\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Survived for a number of years and made a name for herself among other "
"survivors.  Eventually she began experimenting with mutagen… when a mutation "
"left her permanently disfigured and in pain she committed suicide without "
"leaving a note."
msgstr ""
"     Survived for a number of years and made a name for herself among other "
"survivors.  Eventually she began experimenting with mutagen… when a mutation "
"left her permanently disfigured and in pain she committed suicide without "
"leaving a note."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Met with some success as a craftswoman working in a small survivor "
"outpost.  Eventually she married a refugee and had one child.  Died during "
"childbirth a few years later.  Survived by her husband and two year old "
"daughter."
msgstr ""
"    活了下来并在一个小型幸存者前哨站内成为了一名生意红火的手工艺人。最终和一名年轻的难民结婚并生了一个孩子。数年之后因为难产而死，留下了她的丈夫和她两岁"
"的儿子。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Became a skilled mechanic and assisted a number of refugees searching "
"for settlements.  She left one day driving a number of migrants to another "
"settlement when she disappeared.  No trace of her or the vehicle was ever "
"found."
msgstr ""
"    成为了一名熟练的机械师，并且帮助了不少难民寻找合适的定居地。在某一天载着一群新难民去另一个定居点之后就再也没能回来。谁也没能找到任何关于她以及她的车"
"的痕迹。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Became a game hunter and trapper.  Eventually she left on a hunting trip "
"never to be seen again.  Attempts to locate her were called off when a "
"shredded jacket was found."
msgstr "    成为了一名出色的猎手和陷阱师。最终她踏上了一场狩猎并再也没被别人看到过了。尝试寻找她的行动在大家找到一件被撕得粉碎的夹克衫之后就被立刻取消了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Went on to enlist in the Old Guard.  Was captured a year later fighting "
"the Hell's Raiders in the disastrous Vermont campaign.  The hasty rescue "
"mission that followed was one of the major defeats that forced the Old Guard "
"to abandon the area.  It is unknown if she survived."
msgstr ""
"    成为了旧日守护者中的一员。一年后在佛特蒙州一场针对地狱掠夺者的失败行动中中不幸被俘。随之而来的仓促的营救行动的失败是导致旧日守护者被迫放弃该地的重要"
"原因。直到最后也没人知道她是否还活着。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Became a laborer for hire in any outposts that needed assistance.  Was "
"wrongly shot by her employer during a wage dispute."
msgstr "    四处游走在各个需要帮助的前哨站中充当劳工。在一次劳资纠纷中不幸被她的雇主错误地枪杀了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Never spent much time around settlements after your death.  Was last "
"seen near the old Canadian border."
msgstr "    在你死后并没有花太多时间在定居点四周呆着。最后一次被别人见到是在原加拿大边境附近。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Died of an infected bite a few weeks later.  Before she passed she told "
"those present, 'I've outlived everyone that I have ever loved.  If anything "
"death is a few months late'."
msgstr "    在数周之后死于咬伤感染。在她临终前他告诉周围的人：\"我已经活得比我所爱过的所有人都要长的了。这一切对我来说不过是死亡晚来了几个月罢了。\""

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Managed to contract some form of infection a few months after your "
"passing.  Unable to find treatment she asked to be put down while listening "
"to someone read from her favorite novel, A Tale of Two Cities."
msgstr "    在你死后数月患上了某种感染。由于找不到能够治疗的药物，她要求自己被及时处理掉，同时其他人为她念诵她最喜爱的小说《双城记》。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Became a self-taught chemist and medic.  Her work eventually led her to "
"a life of alcohol abuse and morphine addiction.  Overdosed one night when "
"left unattended.  The community she helped said, 'I've never known a nicer "
"woman nor one who had fought off depression for so long.'"
msgstr ""
"作為一名自學成材的化學家和醫生。她的工作使他漸漸的濫用酒精和嗎啡來排解壓力，最後成癮。某天晚上因為藥物過量且無人照顧而死。受過她幫助的人們這麼說：＂我從沒見"
"過比她更好的人，也沒有一個人可以這樣向憂鬱症抗爭了這麼久＂。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Went on to become a notable scout and urban explorer.  Was tragically "
"killed by one of her students when leading a group of unskilled survivors on "
"a night supply raid."
msgstr "    继续自己的旅程成为了一名出色的侦查员和城市探险家。最终在带领一群毫无经验的幸存者在夜间搜刮补给时被她的一名学生残忍地杀害了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     After your death she became a reclusive and eccentric individual.  Her "
"skills were invaluable to the outposts that she chose to assist.  "
"Unfortunately, competition for resources and salvage rights led a group of "
"survivors to coax a mob of undead to surround her when she was on a lone "
"raid.  Without witnesses, no connection between her death and the other "
"survivors could be proven."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后成了一名隐居荒野而行为古怪的人。她的技能对于她所选择帮助的定居点来说是无价的。不幸的是，对资源和拾荒权利的斗争导致一队幸存者故意诱导了一群丧"
"尸在她独自出来搜刮时将她团团包围。由于没有其他目击者，她的死亡和其他幸存者没有任何关联。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Lost her way long before she met you.  The Cataclysm offered her the "
"chance to denounce the former vices that had led to her incarceration… an "
"offer that went unanswered.  After you were killed, she returned to preying "
"upon those she saw as weak.  It is rumored that she robbed dozens of "
"survivors for everything they had before leaving them to die among the "
"horrors that roamed the land.  Her eventual fate is unknown."
msgstr ""
"     Lost her way long before she met you.  The Cataclysm offered her the "
"chance to denounce the former vices that had led to her incarceration… an "
"offer that went unanswered.  After you were killed, she returned to preying "
"upon those she saw as weak.  It is rumored that she robbed dozens of "
"survivors for everything they had before leaving them to die among the "
"horrors that roamed the land.  Her eventual fate is unknown."

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Found new meaning in life after your death.  Although she never informed "
"you, her felonies in the departed world had prevented her from ever having a "
"real place in society.  With the destruction of the criminal record system, "
"she took it upon herself to make amends for her crimes.  Died on a dangerous "
"rescue mission when witnesses saw an helicopter crash-land in a nearby town."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后找到了生命的新意义。虽然她从没有告诉过你，但是她在已经失去的旧世界中所犯下的罪行将使得她永远无法在社会上拥有真正的地位。随着所有犯罪记录被破"
"坏，她站出来承担起社会责任，以尝试赎罪。在一次危险的营救行动中不幸遇难，目击者看到她乘坐的直升机坠毁在附近的城镇之中。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Spent her entire life secretly addicted to one substance or another.  "
"After your death she briefly worked in a survivor camp before finding a place "
"in the lucrative drug trade.  She died, predictably, from an overdose.  Drugs "
"allowed her to relive the memories of friends, family, and loved ones… she "
"died happier than could have ever been expected."
msgstr ""
"    将自己的生命都投入于偷偷吸食各类令人上瘾的毒品上。在你死后不久后加入了一个幸存者避难营地做短工，后来更是在利润丰厚的毒品交易之中分了一杯羹。她最终被"
"猜测死于嗑药过量。毒品让她从对曾经的朋友，家人以及爱人的痛苦回忆中稍稍解脱出来……她死的时候也许比我们预想还要开心一些吧。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Was never known as a particularly brave individual nor an emotionally "
"stable one.  Her inability to emotionally conform to life after the Cataclysm "
"led her to attempt suicide multiple times in the years that followed.  "
"Attracted by promises of renewal and the prospect of belonging to a new "
"family, she became involved with a charismatic cult.  She was an innocent "
"casualty when Old Guard soldiers stormed the compound on suspicion of crimes "
"against humanity."
msgstr ""
"    从没被别人当作特别勇敢或情绪稳定的人。她总是无法适应大灾变之后的艰苦生活，甚至之后几年内几次尝试过自杀。被返老还童的许诺以及加入一个新的大家庭的愿景"
"所吸引，她选择加入了一个魅惑人的邪教组织之中。在旧日守护者的士兵们因违反人权的犯罪行为而对这个社区强攻时，她成为了无辜遇难的一员。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Spent the remainder of her life assisting one adventurer party or "
"another.  Eventually her luck ran out when she became ill after starvation "
"led her to eat whatever she could forage from the woods.  The party she was "
"with deemed her a lost cause and put a bullet in her head instead of letting "
"her turn.  She had suffered from a treatable form of marasmus."
msgstr ""
"    将其余生的所有精力都投入协助一个又一个探险小队。最终在一次因为饥饿绝望而尝试食用从森林中采集的野菜后，她用光了所有的好运病倒了。她所陪伴的探险小队认"
"为她没有任何活下去的希望，决定给她脑袋一发子弹以避免她转变为丧尸。她的症状其实是因为完全可以治愈的消瘦症而引发的。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Was stabbed in the arm by an ill tempered survivor a few weeks after you "
"passed.  The cut quickly became infected and she died from sepsis a short "
"time later.  Her murderer was the first person to discover her corpse… and "
"all the gear she had been saving."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后的几周被一个脾气暴躁的幸存者刺伤了手臂。伤口迅速被感染，很快她就死于败血症。杀害她的家伙第一个找到了她的尸体……以及她一直以来收集的所有装备"
"。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Worked hard following your death to build her own band of survivors.  "
"Thanks to the skills she had acquired, she was able to turn a hefty profit "
"looting abandoned towns.  After a series of heated contract disputes with her "
"followers she found herself locked in her own car as a pair of Molotovs were "
"thrown through the windows.  Her last desire was that she could have taken "
"the bastards out with her."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后努力工作，并组织起了她自己的幸存者团队。依靠她所拥有的技能，她将搜刮废弃城镇变成了一项利润丰厚的职业。在一系列和她的追随者的合同纠纷愈演愈烈"
"之后，她发现自己被所在自己的车内，几只燃烧瓶被从窗口投了进来。她最后满脑子想的都是，要是自己早点亲手干掉这个混蛋就好了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Sought the coast in the hopes of finding an abandoned ship after your "
"death.  Her journey ended when she discovered an Old Guard controlled dock in "
"an abandoned fishing town.  Promised a new life if she agreed to serve as a "
"contractor, she spent the next few years toiling to keep the camp supplied "
"but never saw her reward.  A stray bullet struck her down when the Hell's "
"Raiders launched a raid in an attempt to gain access to the sea."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后不断朝海边探索，希望能够找到一艘废弃的船。她的旅程最终在一座废弃的渔村停了下来，她发现这里的港口已经被旧日守护者控制住了。对新生活的保证让她"
"决定成为他们的一名临时工。她在接下来的数年时间里都辛苦劳作来为营地提供补给，却少有回报。在地狱掠夺者为寻求出海口而攻打营地时，一颗流弹带走了她。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Within a few months of your death she was robbed by a group of bandits.  "
"When she shot the first dead in his tracks, one of his companions unleashed a "
"blast from his flamethrower at close range.  Her ashes and a few odd pieces "
"of jewelry were all that could be recovered."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后的几周内，她被几个强盗打劫了。在她将第一个强盗当场一枪干掉的同时，另一个同伙用他的喷火器近身对着她释放出烈焰。现场只能找到她的骨灰和身上佩戴"
"的少数几件珠宝。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Trained under your guidance, she became a renowned monster hunter.  "
"Leading a band of warriors armed with primitive weapons she tracked down and "
"killed numerous otherworldly horrors that wandered the wilderness.  Her quest "
"to end the threat led her party to a shimmering gate that appeared to spew "
"forth abominations and alien material.  With no means of closing the gate, "
"her party was last seen venturing into the unknown to meet the threat at its "
"source."
msgstr ""
"    经过你的指导训练，她成为远近闻名的异形猎手。她用捡来的各类武器领导一只小队将一个又一个镇子从废土上各种丧尸和恐怖怪物的手中夺了回来。她所担负的这个使"
"命最终将她和她的小队带到了一个闪闪发光的传送门前，看上去各式各样的异界生物和异界材料正不断从中涌出。由于没有任何关闭传送门的方法，她的小队决定踏进其中去寻找"
"并消灭威胁的源头，再也没人见到过这支小队的任何成员。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Renounced the adventurous lifestyle after your death and chose to start "
"a family with a fellow survivor in an abandoned hunting cabin.  Survival was "
"grim but the family grew through the years until she had three sons and a "
"daughter.  Her end came when the horrors finally located her homestead… she "
"and her husband were able to distract the monster as her children escaped."
msgstr ""
"    在你死后决定放弃冒险的生活方式，决定同一位幸存者同伴一起在一间废弃的猎人小屋里建立新的家庭。野外生存相当艰难但这个家随着年月渐渐成长，最终她生了三个"
"儿子和一个女儿。当那些恐怖怪物找到她的家园时，她知道自己的末日到了……她的儿女们成功的逃走了，而她和她的丈夫留下来分散怪物的注意力。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Was detained and incarcerated by a police robot on multiple counts of "
"looting and vandalism that were tracked and recorded by the few remaining "
"security systems.  Trapped in a cell awaiting police review, she spent weeks "
"crying out for help and slowly consuming what supplies she carried.  Two "
"weeks after being dragged to her cell she died from dehydration."
msgstr ""
"    因为被仅存的安防系统跟踪并记录下了数次抢劫以及破坏行为，一台警用机器人抓住了她并将她关了起来。独自被困在牢房中等待永不到来的警局复审，她在这几周内不"
"断大声喊叫求救，而随身补给也渐渐消耗光了。在被拖进牢房的两周之后，她死于脱水。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Shot by the Old Guard a few weeks later, hunted down after she robbed an "
"important caravan."
msgstr "    几个星期后，旧日守护者枪毙了她，他们在她抢劫了一队重要的商队之后抓住了她。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Traveled north, she eventually found a quiet community there and spent "
"the rest of her life farming.  She's survived by four daughters."
msgstr "    去了北方，她终于在那里找到了一个安静的社区，在那里度过了她的余生。她还生了四个女儿。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She became a runner for the Old Guard and was eventually permitted to "
"join.  She spent the rest of her life hunting raiders.  She died in a "
"skirmish after a few years, sacrificing her life to let her unit retreat.  "
"Her name is venerated in songs and inscriptions."
msgstr ""
"    她成为了旧日守护者的一名送信员，并最终获准加入。她余生都在四处猎杀掠夺者。几年后，她死于一场小规模战斗中，为了让她的部队撤退，她牺牲了自己的生命。她"
"的名字在歌曲和铭文中被人称颂。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Shortly after your death she joined the Free Merchants, becoming a "
"caravan guard and after a few months became the new liaison in the Refugee "
"Center.  She died a few years later of a mysterious illness."
msgstr "    你死后不久，她加入了自由商会，成为一名商队警卫，几个月后成为难民中心的新联络员。几年后，她死于一种神秘的疾病。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She was found half-dead by the Old Guard who took her in.  She became a "
"famous scavenger, known for finding an intact stash of experimental "
"antibiotics."
msgstr "    旧日守护者收留了她，他们发现她时她正半死未死。她成了著名的拾荒者，而且因为找到了一箱完整的实验性抗生素而远近闻名。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She retired to the forest, where she built her own cabin and spending "
"the rest of her life fishing."
msgstr "    她隐退在森林深处，在那里她建立了自己的小屋，并捕鱼度过了她的余生。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Captured by raiders, she spent the rest of her miserable life as a "
"slave.  Hopeless, she slit her wrists with a rusty knife."
msgstr "    被掠夺者俘虏后，她作为奴隶度过了痛苦的余生。因为没有任何希望，她用一把生锈小刀割腕自杀了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Depressed, she joined a protestant community and became a paragon of "
"virtue.  Devoting her life to bible study, she spent the rest of her life in "
"relative peace."
msgstr "    她郁郁寡欢，加入了一个新教社区，并成为了美德典范。她毕生致力于研究圣经，在相对平静的环境中度过了余生。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Killed and devoured by a cannibal just a few days after your death, "
"hardly anyone remembers her name."
msgstr "    就在你死后几天，被食人者杀死吞食，几乎没人记得她的名字。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Became a renowned merchant after your death, she built her own outpost "
"in the west.  An avid book collector, she established a great library to keep "
"the flame of knowledge burning."
msgstr "    你死后她成了著名的商人，她在西方建立了自己的基地。作为一位狂热的图书收藏家，她建立了一所大图书馆，以保证知识的火焰能继续燃烧。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Traveled around for months before finding an old farm.  She spent a few "
"years tending to her crops and living the life of a hermit before being "
"killed by raiders for fun."
msgstr "    在你死后四处周游了几个月才找到一所旧农场定居下来。她花了几年时间照料她的庄稼，过着隐士的生活，最终被掠夺者取乐并杀死。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Traveled south and joined a settlement there.  She became a renowned "
"engineer, building the largest steam engine in New England."
msgstr "    南下并加入了那里的一个定居点。她成为了一名著名的工程师，建造了新英格兰最大的蒸汽机。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Joined a gang after your death, she spent months preying on the "
"innocent, before dying in a dispute with a fellow brute."
msgstr "    在你死后加入了一伙强盗，她花了几个月的时间捕食无辜的人，然后和一个同伴的争执中被杀死。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Devoured alive by a group of zombies, she kept thinking of you as she "
"died."
msgstr "     她被一群殭屍活活吞噬下，當她死了一直還顧念著您。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She found an abandoned APC and spent years traveling around and "
"collecting personal stories.  She wrote one of the few post-apocalyptic "
"books, detailing life after the end."
msgstr "    她发现了一辆废弃的装甲运兵车，花了几年时间四处旅行，收集个人故事。她写了为数不多的灾变后的书之一，详细描述了末日之后的生活。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Kept wandering for years.  Her life was cut short when a group of "
"raiders used her as a target practice."
msgstr "    在你死后又四处游荡了许多年。最后被一群掠夺者当作活靶子练枪法，她的生命就此终结。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She became a skilled game hunter and one of the best shots in the "
"wasteland.  Years later she joined the Old Guard and was given the position "
"of Marshal."
msgstr "    她成为了一名熟练的猎手，也是废土上最好的枪手之一。几年后，她加入了旧日守护者，被授予法警的职位。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Desperate to save humanity from extinction, she organized her own group "
"of survivors, whose job was to hunt bandits and decorate roads with their "
"mutilated bodies.  She died in a skirmish a few months later."
msgstr "    为了拯救人类免于灭绝，她组织了自己的幸存者小队，他们的工作是追杀土匪，用他们残缺的身体装饰道路。几个月后，她死于一场遭遇战。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She became an arsonist, and was incinerated a few weeks later in a fire "
"she set."
msgstr "    她成了一名纵火员，几周后在一场自己点燃的大火中被活活烧死。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She kept wandering for a few weeks but eventually died after drinking "
"untreated water."
msgstr "    她又四处游荡了几个星期，但最终在喝了未经处理的水后死亡。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She wandered north and joined a local community there.  She became known "
"for her trapping skills and ensured that the locals always had fresh meat on "
"their tables."
msgstr "    她北上并加入了当地的一个社区。她以她的陷阱技巧而远近闻名，总能确保当地人的餐桌上总是有新鲜的肉可吃。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She joined the Free Merchants and led their first caravan to Canada.  "
"She died a few years later of dysentery."
msgstr "    她加入了自由商会，并组织了他们首支前往加拿大的商队。几年后她死于痢疾。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She built a boat and sailed east towards Europe, hoping that it was not "
"affected by the apocalypse.  She was never heard from again."
msgstr "    她建造了一艘船，尝试向东驶向欧洲，并希望那里没受到大灾变的影响。之后就再也没有她的消息了。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She led a doomsday cult for a few years, she was sacrificed to their "
"gods after a particularly terrible harvest."
msgstr "    她花了数年时间组织了一个末日崇拜邪教，最后在某一年特别糟糕的收成之后，她被同伙们当作祭品献给了他们的邪神。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Became obsessed with chems, and died of an overdose a few months after "
"your death."
msgstr "    沉迷于各种化学合成毒品，并在你死后几个月死于吸毒过量。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Started fervently devouring the Gospel and soon had absolute conviction "
"that she was the Virgin Mother.  In her anguished throes of madness, she "
"ended up seeing the vision of the good shepherd over the horizon as she "
"stepped off the edge of a skyscraper."
msgstr "她开始狂热地研读福音书，很快就深信自己是圣母玛利亚。在痛苦的疯狂挣扎中，她最终从一座摩天大楼的边缘跳下，并在死前看到了地平线那边善良的牧羊人的幻象。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She lost her mind as she witnessed the death of all around her.  She "
"began to accept the notion that she brought about all this chaos.  With "
"bloody tears streaming down her cheeks, she sacrificed herself to save the "
"world."
msgstr "她目睹周围生命的消逝，心智逐渐崩溃。她开始接受一个观念：这场混乱是她造成的。带着满脸的血泪，她为了拯救世界而献出了自己的生命。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She lived desperately in the Cataclysm for a few years before meeting a "
"male survivor while digging through a dumpster.  Both were wary of one "
"another and were soon at each other's throats.  Neither side secured a "
"victory.  Wounded and scarred, they each went to their respective hideouts.  "
"Not long after, they met again.  The man initiated a conversation with her, "
"asking for her help.  It was foolish to fight when they could work together "
"instead.  She acquiesced.  In this cruel and forlorn world, they soon fell in "
"love.  If they had each other, everything would be all right.  Decades passed "
"and they grew old holding hands.  One day, the husband fell ill, and with his "
"dying breath, he said he was happy all these years with her.  Stay strong "
"without me.  The wife wept and laid down beside her husband.  Without you, "
"nothing else matters.  She swallowed a bitter poison and departed this world "
"to find her husband who was waiting for her."
msgstr ""
"在大灾变中，她绝望地生活了几年，直到在翻找垃圾箱时遇到了一位男性幸存者。一开始两人彼此戒备，并很快就陷入了激烈的争斗。双方都没有取得胜利。经历受伤和留下疤痕"
"后，他们各自回到了自己的藏身点。不久之后，他们再次相遇。那位男性主动与她交谈，请求她的帮助。他们意识到，携手合作比相互斗争要明智得多。她同意了。在这个残酷而"
"孤独的世界中，他们很快坠入了爱河。只要他们拥有彼此，一切都会变得更好。几十年过去了，他们手牵手变老。有一天，丈夫生病了，在临终之际，他说：这些年来与她在一起"
"很幸福。没有我，你要坚强。妻子哭泣着，躺在丈夫身边：没有你，其他一切都不重要了。她吞下了苦涩的毒药，离开这个世界去寻找等待着她的丈夫。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Went mad soon after learning of your death, leading her to believe she "
"was the predestined savior who would bring sinners into paradise.  Ended up "
"perishing in a siege against the Hell's Raiders that lasted for a grueling, "
"protracted month."
msgstr ""
"在得知你的死讯后不久便陷入了疯狂，这让她坚信自己是命中注定的救世主，将会带领罪人进入天堂。最终，在对抗地狱掠夺者的围攻中，经历了漫长而痛苦的一个月后，她不幸"
"丧生。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She had a dream she told no other about.  It was a grand ideal, a "
"fantasy out of a long-dead era.  She aspired to become a leader who would "
"shield humanity from the tribulations of the new world.  She gathered "
"survivors and built a settlement with the fledging numbers she had.  They "
"held out for as long as they could, but the dream of civilization could not "
"flourish.  She died a heartbroken woman."
msgstr ""
"她有一个不为人知的梦想。那是一个宏伟的理想，一个来自早已消逝时代的幻想。她渴望成为一个领袖，保护人类免受这个新世界的苦难。她聚集了幸存者，用她手头上微薄的人"
"手建立了一个定居点。她们尽可能长久地坚持着，但文明的梦想终究未能开花结果。她带着一颗破碎的心离世。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She had a dream she told no other about.  It was a grand ideal, a "
"fantasy out of a long-dead era.  She aspired to become a leader who would "
"shield humanity from the tribulations of the new world.  She gathered "
"survivors and built a settlement with the fledging numbers she had.  With her "
"infinite grace and unyielding devotion, she managed to lift up her people "
"into a brighter dawn.  Before long, her realm encompassed vast swaths of "
"land.  She honored you as one of the founders of her kingdom."
msgstr ""
"她有一个不为人知的梦想。那是一个宏伟的理想，一个来自早已消逝时代的幻想。她渴望成为一个能保护人类免受新世界苦难的领袖。她聚集了幸存者，并用她手中的微薄人手建"
"立了一个定居点。凭借她坚定不移的精神和非凡的才华，她成功地将她的人民带入了一个更加光明的未来。不久之后，她的领土包括了广阔的土地。她尊崇你为她王国的创始人之"
"一。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     Lived a troubled life after your passing.  Trusting no one but herself, "
"she struggled viciously at the end of the world.  Through great effort, she "
"formed a minor village that would end up becoming a safe haven for mutants.  "
"In their humble hovel, she would later be acclaimed as a saintess."
msgstr ""
"在你离世之后，她过着困苦的生活。只相信自己，她在世界末日艰难地挣扎着。经过巨大的努力，她建立了一个小村庄，最终成为了变异人的避难所。在她们简陋的小屋里，最后"
"，她被尊称为圣人。"

#: data/json/snippets/epilogue_npc.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "epilogue_npc_female"
msgid ""
"     She increasingly grew fanatical as the whole world decayed around her.  "
"In due time, she saw herself as something more than human.  Arriving at an "
"abandoned cathedral, she climbed to the top of its spire before ringing the "
"bells again and again.  She belched out holy harangues at the heathens below "
"and laughed maniacally as the undead eventually tore through her body."
msgstr ""
"随着周围的世界逐渐腐朽，她变得越来越狂热。最终，她将自己看作超越了人类的存在。她来到一座废弃的大教堂，爬上了尖塔之巅，一遍又一遍地敲响钟声。她在下方的异教徒"
"们面前高声宣扬圣洁的训诫，当丧尸最终撕裂她的身体时，她疯狂地大笑着。"

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for Aunt Janice's Pickled Meat.  \"When times get "
"tough, the tough get pickling.  Aunt Janice's Pickled Meat: more than 30% "
"real beef!\""
msgstr "这是一则珍妮丝阿姨牌腌肉的广告。\"当生活变得艰难时，艰难的人会吃腌肉。珍妮丝阿姨牌腌肉：使用超过30%的真正牛肉腌制！\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a personal injury lawyer.  \"Had an accident "
"while working?  Botched surgery gone wrong?  Relatives missing after the "
"government investigated them?  There's only one solution to all of this; SUE!\""
msgstr ""
"This is an advertisement for a personal injury lawyer.  \"Had an accident "
"while working?  Botched surgery gone wrong?  Relatives missing after the "
"government investigated them?  There's only one solution to all of this; SUE!\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a somewhat weather-worn advertisement for the 'new' FEMA evacuation "
"shelters.  Beneath the colorful photo it reads, \"Familiarize yourself with "
"your nearest emergency shelter.  It could save your life.\""
msgstr "这是一则有点陈旧的\"新\"FEMA避难所的广告。在一张五颜六色的照片下面写着：\"熟悉离你最近的紧急避难所，这能救你一命。\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a FEMA evacuation shelter.  Beneath a picture of "
"a shelter it reads, \"Contact your local FEMA office to arrange a tour of "
"your nearest evacuation shelter.  Be prepared!\""
msgstr "这是一则FEMA避难所的广告。在一张避难所的照片下面写着：\"联系你当地的FEMA办公室，安排游览一次离你最近的紧急避难所。时刻准备着！\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a pre-manufactured emergency supply kit.  It is "
"made of a very flashy tactical fabric and looks very impractical based on "
"your experience.  \"Be ready for anything with the Tactica Supreme GO-30 kit.\""
msgstr ""
"这是一则预制应急补给工具包的广告。它由一种非常华丽的战术织物制成，但根据你的经验看上去非常不切实际。\"Tactica Supreme GO-30 "
"工具包，让你能准备好面对任何意外。\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an ad for a complicated survival knife with an enormous serrated back "
"edge and far too many tools included in the handle.  \"Come down to the Knife "
"Shack at Cumberton Mall!  We've got it all.\""
msgstr "这是一则生存刀广告，它的结构十分复杂，有个巨大的锯齿状刀背，握把上则集成了过多的工具。\"来坎伯顿购物中心的刀店看看吧！我们什么都有。\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local church.  The picture looks surprisingly "
"mundane, but the text is not: \"Revelations services offered round the clock. "
" The end times are here, make your peace.\""
msgstr "这是一则当地教堂的广告。画面看上去令人惊讶地平淡无奇，但文字并不是：\"提供24小时神启服务。末日即将到来，愿你平心静气。\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local church.  It looks like it was put "
"together at the last minute.  \"Visit St. Mary's on the River while it's not "
"too late.  Repent while you still can!\""
msgstr ""
"This is an advertisement for a local church.  It looks like it was put "
"together at the last minute.  \"Visit St. Mary's on the River while it's not "
"too late.  Repent while you still can!\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a hand-drawn flier that has been photocopied for wide distribution.  "
"It reads, in what looks like Sharpie-bolded letters, \"THEY DON'T WANT YOU TO "
"KNOW.  This is all THEIR fault.  They are watching everything.  They brought "
"this on us.\"  There used to be tear-away phone numbers at the bottom, but "
"they're all gone now."
msgstr ""
"This is a hand-drawn flier that has been photocopied for wide distribution.  "
"It reads, in what looks like Sharpie-bolded letters, \"THEY DON'T WANT YOU TO "
"KNOW.  This is all THEIR fault.  They are watching everything.  They brought "
"this on us.\"  There used to be tear-away phone numbers at the bottom, but "
"they're all gone now."

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"STAY IN YOUR HOMES.  "
"Universal curfew in effect.  Police and military forces are authorized to use "
"lethal force against looters and rioters.\""
msgstr "这是一则政府发布的空投警告传单。\"呆在家里。全天宵禁已发布。警察和军队有权对抢劫者和暴乱者使用致命武力。\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"STAY IN YOUR HOMES.  "
"Police and military forces have been dispatched to your area and will help "
"escort you to safety.  DO NOT APPROACH ROADBLOCKS WITHOUT AUTHORIZED "
"PERSONNEL.\""
msgstr ""
"这是一则政府发布的空投警告传单。\"呆在家里。警察和军队已被派往你所在的地区，并将帮助护送你到安全地带。没 有 授 权 人 员 陪 同 请 勿 接 近 任 "
"何 路 障。\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATION ALERT.  Please "
"make your way to the nearest FEMA evacuation shelter.  Avoid crowds.  Looters "
"and rioters may turn violent against unarmed civilians.  Seek protection from "
"police and military forces if traveling in groups.\""
msgstr ""
"这是一则政府发布的空投警告传单。\""
"疏散警报。请前往最近的FEMA紧急避难所。避开人群。抢劫者和暴乱者可能对手无寸铁的平民采取暴力行动。如果要成队行动，请向警察和军队寻求保护。\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATION ALERT.  Please "
"make your way to the nearest FEMA evacuation shelter.  Travel in groups and "
"avoid crowds.  This is believed to be a biological agent that causes violent "
"behavior: do not attempt to engage looters or rioters.\""
msgstr ""
"这是一则政府发布的空投警告传单。\""
"疏散警报。请前往最近的FEMA紧急避难所。成队行动并避开人群。当前事态被认为是由一种导致暴力行为的生化制剂引发：不要试图与抢劫者和暴乱者接触。\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a glossy, high-quality flier.  \"What they don't want you to know!  "
"Reading this may save your life.\"  Inside is a series of warnings "
"recommending people avoid the evacuation shelters, and worse, the FEMA "
"evacuation camps, along with some high-quality telephoto shots showing bodies "
"being shoveled into huge pits by excavation machines."
msgstr ""
"This is a glossy, high-quality flier.  \"What they don't want you to know!  "
"Reading this may save your life.\"  Inside is a series of warnings "
"recommending people avoid the evacuation shelters, and worse, the FEMA "
"evacuation camps, along with some high-quality telephoto shots showing bodies "
"being shoveled into huge pits by excavation machines."

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a grocery store coupon flier.  The front page looks like normal meat "
"advertising, but inside the pictures become increasingly more gruesome images "
"of severed human body parts and organs.  It is dated two days after the "
"evacuation orders were sounded."
msgstr "这是一则杂货店的优惠券传单。头版看起来像普通的肉类广告，但是照片渐渐变成越来越可怕的人体部分和器官。上面的日期是在发出疏散令的两天后。"

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a grocery store coupon flier, dated three days before the evacuation "
"orders went out.  \"At Marigold Market, we still have canned food and bottled "
"water!  Come on in and stock up!\"  The front image shows a grocery store, "
"the entrance flanked by a pair of smiling guards armed with assault rifles."
msgstr ""
"这是一则杂货店的优惠券传单。\"来金盏花市场，我们这还有罐装食品和瓶装水！快进来补货吧！\""
"头版的照片上显示的是一家杂货店，入口两侧有两名带着冲锋枪的微笑警卫。上面的日期是在发出疏散令的三天前。"

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local electronics store, dated a few weeks "
"before the evacuation order.  \"Sale on Universal Power Supplies and "
"refurbished laptops at DigiMart, three days only!\""
msgstr "这是一则当地电器店的广告，\"快来DigiMart，UPS通用电源和翻新笔记本电脑全场打折，仅剩三天！\"上面的日期是在发出疏散令的前几周。"

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for Rivtech brand handguns.  It shows a picture of a "
"well-armed couple in business suits with matching handguns facing down a "
"legion of villainous-looking characters.  The caption reads:  \"Protect "
"yourself with the Rivtech caseless automagnum!\""
msgstr ""
"This is an advertisement for Rivtech brand handguns.  It shows a picture of a "
"well-armed couple in business suits with matching handguns facing down a "
"legion of villainous-looking characters.  The caption reads:  \"Protect "
"yourself with the Rivtech caseless automagnum!\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for Rivtech brand rifles.  It shows a picture of a "
"smiling soldier with a futuristic-looking rifle on her shoulder saluting the "
"viewer.  The caption reads:  \"Rivtech caseless firearms proudly supports our "
"Military.\""
msgstr ""
"This is an advertisement for Rivtech brand rifles.  It shows a picture of a "
"smiling soldier with a futuristic-looking rifle on her shoulder saluting the "
"viewer.  The caption reads:  \"Rivtech caseless firearms proudly supports our "
"Military.\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for Rivtech brand firearms.  It shows a picture of a "
"trio of well-armed hunters.  The three are each armed with different "
"futuristic-looking weapons and are shooting at a hostile crowd of approaching "
"wildlife.  The caption reads:  \"Rivtech caseless firearms.  Superior "
"stopping power.\""
msgstr ""
"This is an advertisement for Rivtech brand firearms.  It shows a picture of a "
"trio of well-armed hunters.  The three are each armed with different "
"futuristic-looking weapons and are shooting at a hostile crowd of approaching "
"wildlife.  The caption reads:  \"Rivtech caseless firearms.  Superior "
"stopping power.\""

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local funk-polka band, the \"Chilly Winters\". "
" Apparently they were playing in the Wonky Donkey Pub."
msgstr "这是一则当地名为\"寒冬\"的放克波尔卡乐队的广告。很明显他们在Wonky Donkey酒吧里演出。"

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is a flier with the tour appearance dates of a small, niche-successful "
"drum-and-bass/yodeling fusion band, the \"Ol' Yellers\".  The dates continue "
"well past the end of the world; most likely, the tour was cut short."
msgstr ""
"This is a flier with the tour appearance dates of a small, niche-successful "
"drum-and-bass/yodeling fusion band, the \"Ol' Yellers\".  The dates continue "
"well past the end of the world; most likely, the tour was cut short."

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a death metal band, \"Roxanne and the "
"Soul-Crushing Ennui\", known for mixing their ear-blasting riffs with chipper "
"interludes of classic fifties doo-wop.  The art depicts a zombified version "
"of a Betty Crocker-esque housewife, slamming on a spike-encrusted electric "
"guitar."
msgstr ""
"这是一则名为\"罗克珊和让灵魂粉碎的无聊\"的死亡金属乐队的广告，他们以混合了让人耳鸣的重复段和50"
"年代经典杜沃普摇滚乐的唧唧喳喳的插曲风格而闻名。插画上描绘了一个丧尸版的贝蒂·克罗克式的家庭主妇，用力敲打着一把镶着尖刺装饰的电吉他。"

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
