"一個上鏡且穿著皮衣的男人拿著左輪手槍和大砍刀走向觀眾。他的身旁有他最信任的機械狗夥伴。"

#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an illustrated poster for a brand of solar car.  The vehicle is "
"driving through a lush countryside as small animals look on.  The slogan "
