#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "sr1_mess"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Subj: Security Reminder\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  I want to remind everyone on staff: do not open or examine containers above "
"your security-clearance.  If you have some question about safety protocols or "
"shipping procedures, please contact your SRCF administrator or on-site "
"military officer.  When in doubt, assume all containers are Class-A "
"Biohazards and highly toxic.  Take full precautions!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"主题：安全须知\n"
"发往：SRCF全体员工\n"
"来自：康斯坦丁·德沃拉克，核安全部副部长\n"
"\n"
"    我想再次提醒各位员工：不要开启或检查超过你安全权限的容器。如果你对当前执行的安全制度或者运输流程方面有任何问题，可以联系你在SRCF内的上级主管或者"
"驻地现场军官。如果无法确定安全等级，假设所有容器均为A级生物危害并含高毒性。保持全面警惕！"

#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "sr2_mess"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Subj: Security Reminder\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  From today onward medical wastes are not to be stored anywhere near "
"radioactive materials.  All containers are to be re-arranged according to "
"these new regulations.  If your facility currently has these containers "
"stored in close proximity, you are to work with armed guards on duty at all "
"times.  Report any unusual activity to your SRCF administrator at once."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  主旨: 安全提醒\n"
"  給: 所有 SRCF 成員\n"
"  從: Constantine Dvorak， 核安副國務卿\n"
"  \n"
"  從今天起醫療廢棄物禁止存放在放射性物質的附近，  所有容器將依照新的規定重新安排。  若近期你的設施內儲存著這些容器，  "
"你將會被安排與武裝警衛全天候與你一起工作，  若有不尋常的狀況請立刻回報你的 SRCF 主管。  "

#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "sr3_mess"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Subj: Security Reminder\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  Worker health and safety is our number one concern!  As such, we are "
"instituting weekly health examinations for all SRCF employees.  Report any "
"unusual symptoms or physical changes to your SRCF administrator at once."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"主题：安全须知\n"
"发往：SRCF全体员工\n"
"来自：康斯坦丁·德沃拉克，核安全部副部长\n"
"\n"
"    工作人员的健康和安全是我们最关注的问题！因此，我们将对SRCF全体员工进行每周体检。发现自己有任何异常症状或身体变化一定要第一时间汇报给你所在SRC"
"F的上级主管。"

#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "sr4_mess"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Subj: Security Reminder\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  All compromised facilities will remain under lock down until further "
"notice.  Anyone who has seen or come in direct contact with the creatures is "
"to report to the home office for a full medical evaluation and security "
"debriefing."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"主题：安全须知\n"
"发往：SRCF全体员工\n"
"来自：康斯坦丁·德沃拉克，核安全部副部长\n"
"\n"
"    所有被污染的设施将永久处于封存状态，解封时间另行通知。任何目击或者直接接触过该生物的员工须立即向总部汇报，并接受健康评估及安全汇报。"

#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_1_mess"
msgid ""
"Subj: EPA: Report All Potential Containment Breaches 3873643\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Robert Shane, Director of the EPA\n"
"\n"
"  All hazardous waste dumps and sarcophagi must submit three samples from "
"each operational leache system to the following addresses:\n"
"\n"
"CDC Bioterrorism Lab\n"
"Building 10\n"
"Corporate Square Boulevard\n"
"Atlanta, GA 30329\n"
"\n"
"EPA Region 8 Laboratory\n"
"16194 W. 45th Drive\n"
"Golden, CO 80403\n"
"\n"
"  These samples must be accurate and any attempts to cover incompetencies "
"will result in charges of Federal Corruption and potentially Treason.\n"
"\n"
"Director of the EPA,\n"
"  Robert Shane"
msgstr ""
"主题：环保局：即刻上报所有潜在安全漏洞 3873643\n"
"发往：SRCF全体员工\n"
"来自：罗伯特·谢恩，环保局主任\n"
"\n"
"    所有有害物质排放点和填埋场即刻起必须从每个正在工作的过滤系统中采集并提交三份不同样本寄送至以下地址：\n"
"\n"
"疾控中心生化恐袭实验室\n"
"10 号楼\n"
"企业广场大道\n"
"亚特兰大，乔治亚州 30329\n"
"\n"
"环保局8号区域实验室\n"
"16194 西45号大街\n"
"戈尔登，科罗拉多州 80403\n"
"\n"
"    请务必提供准确样本，任何隐瞒事实的企图将会面临联邦雇员贪污及叛国罪的指控。\n"
"\n"
"环保局主任\n"
"罗伯特·谢恩"

#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_2_1_mess"
msgid ""
"Subj: SRCF: Internal Memo, EPA [2918024]\n"
"To: all SRCF admin staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  Director Grimes has released a new series of accusations that will soon be "
"investigated by a Congressional committee.  Below is the message that he sent "
"me.\n"
"--------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"Subj: Congressional Investigations\n"
"To: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Safety\n"
"From: Robert Shane, director of the EPA\n"
"\n"
"  The EPA has opposed the Security-Restricted Containment Facility (SRCF) "
"project from its inception.  We were horrified that these facilities would be "
"constructed so close to populated areas, and only agreed to sign-off on the "
"project if we were allowed to freely examine and monitor the sarcophagi.  But "
"that has not happened.  Since then, the DOE has employed any and all means to "
"keep EPA agents from visiting the SRCFs, using military secrecy, emergency "
"powers, and inter-departmental gag orders to surround the project with an "
"impenetrable thicket of red tape."
msgstr ""
"主题：SRCF：内部备忘录，关于环保局 [2918024]\n"
"收件人：SRCF全体管理人员\n"
"发件人：康斯坦丁·德沃拉克，核安全部副部长\n"
"\n"
"    格里姆斯主任又针对我们发起了一系列新指控，会有一个来自国会的调查委员会对这些指控进行调查。下面是他发给我的信息。\n"
"--------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"主题：国会调查\n"
"收件人：康斯坦丁·德沃拉克，核安全部副部长\n"
"发件人：罗伯特·谢恩，环保局主任\n"
"\n"
"    从成立之初，美国环保局一直反对安全限制隔离设施（SRCF）项目。我们震惊于该设施被允许建造在如此接近人口稠密的地区。只有在让我们自由检查并监督各处放"
"射地埋点的前提下，我们才会同意签署这个项目。但是自项目开始以来，能源部想尽了一切方法，采用诸如军事机密、应急权限、以及跨部门的封口命令的各种手段，阻止环保局"
"工作人员访问SRCF，整个项目充斥着各式名目繁复的红头文件。"

#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_2_2_mess"
msgid ""
"Although our agents have not been allowed inside, our atmospheric testers in "
"nearby communities have detected high levels of toxins and radiation, and "
"we've found dozens of potentially dangerous unidentified compounds in the "
"ground water.  We now have conclusive evidence that the SRCFs are a threat to "
"the public safety.  We are taking these data to state representatives and "
"petitioning for a full Congressional inquiry.  They should be able to force "
"open your secret vaults, and the world will see what you've been hiding.\n"
"\n"
"If you had any hand in this outbreak I hope you will rot in hell.\n"
"\n"
"Director of the EPA,\n"
"  Robert Shane"
msgstr ""
"    虽然我们的工作人员无法进入这些设施，但我们在附近社区的大气测试中检测到高浓度的毒素和辐射，我们已经在地下水里发现了数十种有潜在危险的未知化合物成分。"
"现在，我们有确凿的证据证明这些SRCF设施对公众安全造成了严重威胁。我们将会把这些数据提供给众议员并请求进行一次正式的国会调查。他们会强行打开你的秘密保险箱"
"，到时候全世界都会看到你一直以来所要隐藏的一切。\n"
"\n"
"    如果这次疫情爆发和你有任何关系，我诅咒你永远烂在地狱里。\n"
"\n"
"环保局主任\n"
"罗伯特·谢恩"

#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_3_mess"
msgid ""
"Subj: CDC: Internal Memo, Standby [2918115]\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Ellen Grimes, Director of the CDC\n"
"\n"
"  Your site along with many others has been found to be contaminated with "
"what we will now refer to as [redacted]. It is vital that you standby for "
"further orders.  We are currently awaiting the President to decide our course "
"of action in this national crisis.  You will proceed with fail-safe "
"procedures and rig the sarcophagus with C-4 as outlined in Publication 4423.  "
"We will send you orders to either detonate and seal the sarcophagus or remove "
"the charges.  It is of the utmost importance that the facility be sealed "
"immediately when the orders are given.  We have been alerted by Homeland "
"Security that there are potential terrorist suspects that are being detained "
"in connection with the recent national crisis.\n"
"\n"
"Director of the CDC,\n"
"  Ellen Grimes"
msgstr ""
"主题：疾控中心：内部备忘录，原地待命 [2918115]\n"
"发往：SCRF 全体员工\n"
"来自：艾伦·格里姆斯，疾控中心主任\n"
"\n"
"      你所在的设施，与其他许多设施一样，已经被称为 [已删除] "
"的污染物所污染。现在你需要立刻原地待命，等待后续指示。我们正在等待总统针对此次国家危机选择合适的行动方案。你需要按照故障防护操作流程操作并根据第 4423 "
"号文件的描述在放射性埋点各处安放好 C4 "
"炸药。我们将提供进一步封锁放射性埋点或移除炸药的指令。最重要的是，一旦指令下达，放射性埋点需要在第一时间内封锁完成。我们已经接到国土安全部的通告，最近已有不"
"少与近期发生的国家危机相关联的潜在恐怖分子嫌犯被逮捕。\n"
"\n"
"疾控中心主任，\n"
"    艾伦·格里姆斯"

#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_seal_order"
msgid ""
"Subj: USARMY: SEAL SRCF [987167]\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Major General Cornelius, U.S. Army\n"
"\n"
"  As a general warning to all civilian staff: the 10th Mountain Division has "
"been assigned to oversee the sealing of the SRCF facilities.  By direct "
"order, all non-essential staff must vacate at the earliest possible "
"opportunity to prevent potential contamination.  Low yield tactical nuclear "
"demolition charges will be deployed in the lower tunnels to ensure that "
"recovery of hazardous material is impossible.  The Army Corps of Engineers "
"will then dump concrete over the rubble so that we can redeploy the 10th "
"Mountain into the greater Boston area.\n"
"\n"
"Cornelius,\n"
"Major General, U.S. Army\n"
"Commander of the 10th Mountain Division"
msgstr ""
"主题：美国陆军：封锁SRCF设施 [987167]\n"
"发往：SRCF全体员工\n"
"来自：科尼利厄斯，美国陆军少将\n"
"\n"
"    给全体文职人员的通用警告：第 10 山地师已经收到了监督封锁 SRCF "
"设施的任务。依照命令原文，所有非必需员工必须尽早撤离以免受可能的感染。低当量战术核武器炸药将部署至设施底部通道内，以确保危险有害物质无法被回收。陆军工程兵部"
"队随后将在废墟之上浇灌混凝土，使得第 10 山地师可以被重新部署至大波士顿地区。\n"
"\n"
"科尼利厄斯\n"
"美国陆军少将\n"
"第 10 山地师指挥官"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid ""
"You feel great!  It doesn't seem like wounds could even slow you down for "
"more than a day."
msgstr "你覺得好極了! 無論多麼嚴重的傷口, 在一兩天內也能癒合。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid ""
"Within moments you're ready and up.  You don't feel like anything could stop "
"you today!"
msgstr "轉眼間你已起身準備好。今天的你無人可擋!"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid ""
"Your eyes open and your entire body feels like it is just bursting with "
"energy to burn!"
msgstr "你睜開眼睛而起, 整個身體充滿了能量!"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid "You feel like a rubber ball; whatever hits you, you'll just bounce back!"
msgstr "你覺得自己像顆皮球, 不論甚麼打了你, 只會反彈回去!"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid ""
"You're up and you feel fantastic.  No sickness is going to keep you down "
"today!"
msgstr "你起床, 你覺得太棒了! 今天沒有病痛拖累你!"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid ""
"You wake up feeling invincible, ready to take on any challenge that comes "
"your way."
msgstr "你醒来时感觉自己无敌了，已经准备好迎接任何向你而来的挑战。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid "Your body feels as light as a feather, every movement effortless and smooth."
msgstr "你感觉身轻如羽，每一个动作都轻松流畅。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid "You wake up with a smile, knowing today is going to be a great day."
msgstr "你微笑着醒来，知道今天将是美好的一天。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid "Strength and vitality surge through you, making you feel unstoppable."
msgstr "力量和活力在你体内涌动，让你感到势不可挡。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
msgid ""
"You feel a powerful sense of well-being, as if every cell in your body is "
"thriving."
msgstr "你会感觉到一种强烈的幸福感，仿佛身体里的每一个细胞都在舒展。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid ""
"You're up and going rather quickly, and all the little aches from yesterday "
"are gone."
msgstr "你很快地起床, 而且昨天所有的小痠痛都消失了。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid ""
"You get up feeling pretty good, as if all your little aches were fading "
"faster."
msgstr "起床後你感覺非常棒, 似乎你所有的小痠痛都快速地消失了。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid "Getting up comes easy to you, your muscles revitalized after your rest."
msgstr "你很輕鬆地起床, 休息後肌肉恢復活力。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid ""
"You're up and your little pains from before seem to have faded away rather "
"quickly."
msgstr "你起來而且之前的小傷痛很快地消失了。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid "Awareness comes fast, your body coming quickly to attention after your rest."
msgstr "很快醒來, 休息後你的身體意興高昂。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid "You feel refreshed and ready to start the day with enthusiasm."
msgstr "神清气爽的你准备以热情满满的心态开始新的一天。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid "Your body feels rejuvenated, as if you've been given a new lease on life."
msgstr "你的身体仿佛重获新生，每个细胞都焕发着活力。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid "You wake up feeling revitalized, your energy levels high and stable."
msgstr "你醒来时感觉身体焕然一新，精神元气满满。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid ""
"Any lingering fatigue from yesterday has vanished, leaving you feeling strong "
"and capable."
msgstr "昨日的你疲惫不堪，今天的你强而有力。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
msgid "You stretch and feel a wonderful sense of vitality coursing through your body."
msgstr "你伸了个懒腰，享受着体内的澎湃活力。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "You feel good.  Healthy living does seem to have some rewards."
msgstr "你感覺很不錯, 健康的生活似乎會有一些回饋。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "Getting out of bed doesn't seem too hard today.  You could get used to this!"
msgstr "今天很容易起床。你會習慣的!"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid ""
"Alertness comes somewhat fast, and your muscles stretch easier than before "
"you went to bed."
msgstr "你很快地醒來, 而且肌肉伸展比睡前還要輕鬆。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "You feel extra alert, and your body feels ready to go."
msgstr "你感覺非常的精神充沛, 全身蓄勢待發。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "Your body stretches with ease, and you feel ready to take on the world."
msgstr "你的身體伸展自如, 你準備好迎接這個世界。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "You wake up feeling clear-headed and ready to tackle the day ahead."
msgstr "你神清气爽地醒来，准备好从容应对新的一天。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "Your body feels responsive and agile, making movement a pleasure."
msgstr "你感觉身体灵活自如，每个动作都带来轻盈的愉悦感。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "You stretch and feel a pleasant sense of readiness in your muscles."
msgstr "你伸了个懒腰，享受着肌肉蓄势待发的泵感。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "You feel energized and alert, ready to face whatever the day throws at you."
msgstr "你那充沛的精力和清醒的头脑足以应对随性的命运。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
msgid "You wake up with a sense of purpose, feeling good about the day ahead."
msgstr "晨起心怀笃定，欣迎一日新程。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid "You feel cruddy.  Maybe you should consider eating a bit healthier."
msgstr "你感到難受。或許你應該吃得健康點。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid "You get up with a bit of a scratch in your throat."
msgstr "你起床後覺得喉嚨有點疼。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid "You stretch, but your muscles don't seem to be doing so good today."
msgstr "你伸展身體, 但是今天你的肌肉似乎狀況不佳。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid ""
"Your stomach gurgles.  It's probably nothing, but maybe you should look into "
"eating something healthy."
msgstr "你的肚子咯咯作響。這也許不算什麼, 但或者你該考慮吃些健康的食物。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid "You struggle to awareness.  Being awake seems somewhat harder to reach today."
msgstr "你掙扎著醒來, 今天似乎很難保持清醒。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid "You wake up feeling a bit off, as if something is not quite right."
msgstr "你醒来时感觉身体不太舒服，仿佛哪颗螺丝拧松了似的。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid "Your body feels sluggish, making every movement an effort."
msgstr "你感觉身心疲弱，抬个手都费劲。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid ""
"You get up feeling like you didn't get enough rest, even if you slept for "
"hours."
msgstr "明明休息了足够时长，起床时仍觉得睡眠不足。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid ""
"There's a nagging discomfort in your body, making it hard to focus on "
"anything else."
msgstr "挥之不去的不适感让你难以专注于其他事情。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
msgid "You feel a general sense of malaise, as if something is draining your energy."
msgstr "你浑身无力，感觉身体被掏空。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid ""
"Getting out of bed only comes with great difficulty, and your muscles resist "
"the movement."
msgstr "你非常不想起床, 而且你的身體不想動。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid ""
"Getting up seems like it should be easy, but all you want to do is go back to "
"bed."
msgstr "起床看似很容易, 但你只想繼續睡。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid ""
"Tired hands rub at your eyes, the little aches of yesterday protesting your "
"stretches."
msgstr "你疲憊的雙手揉了揉眼睛, 昨日殘留的疼痛在你伸展時發出陣陣抗議。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid "Alertness seems flighty today, and your body argues when you move towards it."
msgstr "今天你的精神似乎不在狀態, 當你前進時你的身體向你抗議著。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid "You're up, but your body seems like it would rather stay in bed."
msgstr "你醒了, 但是自己的身體寧願繼續賴在床上。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid "You wake up feeling drained, as if you haven't slept at all."
msgstr "醒来的你如同彻夜未眠般精疲力竭。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid "Every movement feels like a chore, your muscles aching with every step."
msgstr "每个动作都如同在服苦役，每走一步肌肉都在酸疼。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid ""
"You feel a pervasive sense of exhaustion, making it hard to even think "
"clearly."
msgstr "弥漫性疲惫侵蚀着每个细胞，连组织连贯思绪都成为奢望。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid "Your body feels heavy and uncooperative, resisting every effort to get up."
msgstr "身体如同灌满混凝土的皮囊，对抗着每一个试图起身的神经信号。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
msgid "You wake up with a sense of dread, knowing today will be a struggle."
msgstr "你在恐惧中醒来，知晓今日会有一场死斗，对手则是你的身体。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid "You get up feeling horrible, as if something was messing with your body."
msgstr "你起床的感覺糟透了, 像似有甚麼東西攪亂了你的身體。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid "You feel awful, and every ache from yesterday is still there."
msgstr "你覺得很糟糕, 而且昨天的所有疼痛都依然存在。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid ""
"Your eyes struggle to open, and your muscles ache like you didn't sleep at "
"all."
msgstr "你的眼睛勉強張開, 你的身體好像沒睡過一樣痠痛。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid "Bleary-eyed and half-asleep, you consider why you are doing this to yourself."
msgstr "睡眼惺忪半夢半醒間, 你思考著為何這樣對待自己。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid ""
"Awareness seems to only come with a battle… and your body seems to be on its "
"side."
msgstr "你正在与睡神进行一场战斗……而你的身体站在你的敌人那边。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid ""
"You wake up feeling like you've been hit by a truck, every part of your body "
"protesting."
msgstr "你睡着时多半是撞大运了——百吨王那种。你全身上下每个零件都在发出故障警报。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid ""
"A deep, bone-weary exhaustion fills you, making it hard to even lift your "
"head."
msgstr "骨髓深处渗出的倦意漫过脊椎，连抬头都像在对抗地心引力。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid ""
"You feel a persistent ache in your body, as if you were fighting off a severe "
"illness."
msgstr "你感到体内有一种挥之不去的疼痛，仿佛正在与一场重病抗争。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid "Every joint and muscle screams in protest as you try to get up."
msgstr "每次抬手关节都像在对抗锈蚀，每次迈步肌肉都像在无声恸哭。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
msgid "You wake up feeling completely depleted, with no energy to face the day."
msgstr "你带着被掏空般的虚弱醒来，今天的你已油尽灯枯。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
msgid ""
"You're too weak to be hungry anymore.  Is this what starving to death feels "
"like?"
msgstr "你已经虚弱到无法再产生饥饿感了。饿死就是这种感觉吗？"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
msgid "Your body feels like it's eating itself from the inside out."
msgstr "你的身体仿佛在由内而外蚕食自己，每一寸血肉都在被饥饿掏空。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
msgid ""
"Every movement feels like a monumental effort, your limbs trembling from "
"weakness."
msgstr "每一次移动都像在搬动千斤巨石，虚弱的四肢因无力而颤抖。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
msgid ""
"You can't remember the last time you had a proper meal, and it's starting to "
"take its toll."
msgstr "你上一次好好吃饭是在什么时候？报应来了。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
msgid "You feel a deep, gnawing emptiness in your stomach that never goes away."
msgstr "胃部持续传来噬咬般的空洞感，如同永远填不满的深渊。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
msgid ""
"Even though you've eaten not too long ago you still feel drained of energy.  "
"It will take more than that to get you back up."
msgstr "即便不久前已经进食，你依然感觉精虚力竭。要恢复还得耗更多时间。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
msgid ""
"You feel like a bottomless pit, no amount of food seems to satisfy your "
"hunger."
msgstr "你感觉自己像个无底洞，似乎再多的食物也无法满足你的饥饿感。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
msgid ""
"Your body is crying out for nourishment, every cell feeling the lack of "
"sustenance."
msgstr "身体在拼命渴求营养，每个细胞都在发出能量告急的哀鸣。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
msgid "You feel dizzy and lightheaded from the constant hunger."
msgstr "持续的饥饿让你头晕目眩。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
msgid "Your hands tremble as you try to find something, anything, to eat."
msgstr "手在抖。找点吃的。什么都行。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
msgid "Your empty stomach gnaws at you.  You really need something to eat."
msgstr "空荡荡的胃袋在折腾着你。你真的需要吃点东西了。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
msgid "You feel like a shadow of your former self, your body wasting away."
msgstr "你感觉自己已今非昔比，躯体日渐消瘦。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
msgid "Every rib is visible, your skin stretched thin over your bones."
msgstr "每一根肋骨都清晰可见，皮肤如裹尸布般紧覆骨骼。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
msgid "You feel a deep, bone-deep weariness, as if your body is giving up."
msgstr "你感到一种深入骨髓的疲惫，你的身体仿佛正在认输。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
msgid "Your muscles are wasting away, leaving you feeling weak and frail."
msgstr "你的肌肉正在萎缩，让你感到虚弱无力。"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "emaciated"
msgid "You are EMACIATED!"
msgstr "你極度瘦弱！"

#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "emaciated"
msgid "Your body is little more than skin and bones."
msgstr "你的身体已经皮包骨头。"

