#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This is a small and creased photo of a smirking young woman standing with "
"booted feet planted upon the asphalt of a driveway, a thick cowl of blond "
"hair flowing over her leather jacket-clad shoulders.  With the setting sun's "
"light reflecting off the surface of a helmet she holds under one arm, she's "
"casually leaning against a propped-up motorcycle, her head slightly inclined "
"as she shoots a black-glossed grin towards the camera.  In looping "
"handwriting, the back end of the picture is inscribed with the text, "
"\"Dallas, 1993.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Though cancer has parted us, I'll always carry you with me.\""
msgstr ""
"这张照片虽已皱褶斑驳，却记录了一位年轻女子站在沥青车道上的瞬间，她脚蹬皮靴，一头浓密的金色长发披散在皮夹克肩头。夕阳的余晖洒在她单臂下的头盔表面，映衬着她那"
"倚靠在支起的摩托车旁的悠闲姿态。她微微侧头，对着镜头露出一抹黑亮的狡黠笑容。照片背面以飘逸的手写体题写着一行字：“达拉斯，1993年。”\n"
"\n"
"“虽然癌症将我们分离，但你将永远活在我的心中。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Frost-dusted pastures and the fringes of a forest in winter sparseness liven "
"this picture, with two grinning men standing in the foreground dressed in "
"khaki pants and matching winter jackets, their arms about one another's "
"shoulders.  In the distance, a herd of deer can be seen clustered by a "
"semi-frozen lake.  The fact that some of the group's fawns seem to sport "
"unnaturally course streaks of black hair and that, you could swear, at least "
"one of them has a second set of eyes between their budding antlers seems to "
"have gone unnoticed by the photo's previous owner."
msgstr ""
"这张照片展现了一片霜冻点缀的牧场以及冬季稀疏的森林边缘，前景中两位面带微笑的男子身穿卡其裤和配套的冬季夹克，彼此手臂搭在对方肩上。远处，一群鹿聚集在半结冰的"
"湖边。有趣的是，这群鹿中的一些小鹿似乎有着异常粗糙的黑色条纹斑块，而且你发誓至少有一只鹿在其初生的鹿角之间长有一双额外的眼睛，但这些怪异之处似乎并未引起照片"
"前任主人的注意。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This is a rather aged Polaroid photo, creased from having spent years being "
"folded and unfolded in succession.  A smiling young man dressed in an "
"olive-drab flight suit stands in the foreground, framed by the open doorway "
"of an UH-1 Huey helicopter, a gloved hand gripping the door, a flight helmet "
"and pushed-up aviator's goggles perched upon his head, and a jaunty thumbs-up "
"directed towards the camera.  In shaky handwriting, the back of the picture "
"is marked with the caption, \"September 10th, 1967.\"\n"
"\n"
"In smaller script, someone's written, \"still missing in action.  May you fly "
"on in our hearts.\""
msgstr ""
"这是一张颇为陈旧的宝丽来照片，多年来经过反复折叠和展开，留下了深深的折痕。照片中，一名穿着橄榄绿飞行服的年轻男子站在前景，背景是打开门框的UH-1"
"休伊直升机，一只戴着手套的手紧紧抓住舱门，头上戴着飞行头盔和推至额上的飞行员护目镜，他朝着镜头俏皮地竖起了大拇指。照片背面以颤抖的手笔标注着日期：“1967"
"年9月10日”。\n"
"\n"
"旁边还用较小的字体附有一句留言：“至今仍处于失踪状态。愿你在我们心中继续翱翔。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This downwardly shot photo gazes into the watery abysses of an indoor baptism "
"tank, within which stands a muscular young man with a crucifix hanging about "
"his neck.  With the water gently lapping at his waist, the solemnity of his "
"expression is softened by a small smile and a twinkle within his gray gaze "
"as, in his arms, he lifts a sopping-wet child from the liquid."
msgstr ""
"这张从上往下拍摄的照片俯视着室内洗礼池幽深的水域，其中站立着一名脖子上挂着十字架的壮硕青年男子。水波轻轻拍打着他的腰，当他怀抱着刚从水中抱起的湿漉漉的孩子时"
"，严肃的表情因嘴角那一丝微笑和灰色眼神中闪烁的光芒而变得柔和起来。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"A white-draped and elegantly laid table takes up the foreground of this "
"photo, behind which, framed by the interior of a cruise ship's dining room, a "
"formally dressed man and woman are seated.  With the woman's head lightly "
"resting upon her husband's shoulder and the gentleman's suited arm lifting a "
"cocktail glass in a toast, the pair's free arms are cast contentedly about "
"one another's shoulders, while beaming grins adorn their faces."
msgstr ""
"这张照片的前景是一张铺着白色桌布、布置雅致的餐桌，背景则是游轮餐厅内部，一对穿着正式礼服的男女坐在餐桌后方。女士的头轻轻地靠在丈夫的肩膀上，男士则身着西装，"
"举起鸡尾酒杯向镜头祝酒，两人的空闲手臂愉快地搂在对方的肩头，脸上洋溢着灿烂的笑容。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Resplendent with the interior view of a nightclub, this photo's midground is "
"dominated by a gaggle of young men and women gathered before the camera.  "
"Judging by the way that they're clinging to one another, the spaced-out grins "
"all around, and the presence of more than a few licker bottles brandished "
"like the holy grail, the assembly's probably halfway to being drunkenly "
"sprawled on the floor.  The picture's edges have been blurred and messily "
"cropped out in post, likely in an effort to hide the mountain range of "
"\"sugar\" proudly rising from tables in the background.  It's just a shame "
"that it only resulted in a worse photo."
msgstr ""
"这张照片以夜总会内部景象为主题，画面中部聚拢着一群面向镜头的年轻人。从他们彼此依偎的姿态、恍惚四散的笑容，以及手中挥舞着如同圣杯般存在的多瓶舔舐酒瓶可以看出"
"，这群人恐怕已经半醉，即将瘫倒在地板上。照片的边缘经过模糊处理并杂乱地裁剪掉了，这显然是为了掩盖背景中桌上堆成山一般的“糖果”。遗憾的是，这样的处理反而让照"
"片变得更糟。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"The foreground of this crisply shot photo is filled with the kneeling profile "
"of a young girl, bundled in a cocoon of winter apparel and crouching behind a "
"low wall of sandbags.  The barrel of a big-game hunting rifle rests upon the "
"barrier's lip, the weapon gripped by an affectionately grinning man sitting "
"beside the child.  Helpfully holding the gun steady as the youth gazes "
"through the sights, one of the man's palms is lightly resting upon the girl's "
"hand as he shows her how to work the weapon's bolt.  You don't know their "
"names, but you're likely the only person who'll ever recall their faces."
msgstr ""
"在这张清晰度极高的照片前景部分，一个身裹冬季衣物的小女孩跪坐在一堆沙袋矮墙后侧，她的轮廓鲜明。一杆大型狩猎步枪的枪管搁置在壁垒边缘，旁边一位面带慈爱笑容的男"
"人握着武器。他正耐心地帮助这个年轻的孩子稳住枪支，当她通过瞄准镜凝视时，男人的一只手轻轻搭在女孩的手上，指导她如何操作枪栓上膛。尽管我们并不知道他们的名字，"
"但很可能只有你能记住他们的面容。这张照片捕捉到了这样一幕独特的瞬间，展示了父女之间或是师徒之间的传承与信任。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Photographed within a warmly lit living room, a young boy sits upon a large "
"beanbag armchair with a discarded pet carrier sitting on the floor beside him "
"and a goofy grin plastered across his face.  His arms are clasped around a "
"fluffy ball of brown fuzz, which, initially, you mistake for a plushie before "
"the bright eyes, lolling tongue, and madly wagging tail place it as a "
"majestically furry canine.  A breed you've never seen before: the dog's "
"pictured with its front paws awkwardly gripping the child's shoulders as it "
"happily laps at his face.  Its paws look like tiny, clawed hands."
msgstr ""
"在这张在温馨灯光下拍摄的照片中，一个小男孩坐在一张大号豆袋椅上，旁边地板上放着一个弃置的宠物笼子，他的脸上洋溢着傻乎乎的笑容。他怀抱一团棕色绒毛，乍一看你会"
"误以为那是个毛绒玩具，但明亮的眼神、伸出的舌头和疯狂摆动的尾巴揭示了它的真实身份——一只威武蓬松的狗狗。这是一种你从未见过的犬种：照片中，狗狗前爪笨拙地搭在"
"小男孩的肩头，欢快地舔舐着他的脸颊，它的爪子看起来就像是小小的、带爪的手掌。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Raven-haired, freckled, and quite pudgy, a young woman dressed in an "
"ill-fitting black robe and graduation cap peers shyly from this photo, "
"standing upon a low stage in a large auditorium.  Her face is a half-way "
"blend of anxiety and exhaustion, barely hidden behind a clearly forced grin "
"as her downcast eyes regard the microphone standing before her.  The torn-out "
"heading of a newspaper article is connected to the photo by a paperclip.\n"
"\n"
"\"Unidentified Young Woman Found Washed Up on Bar Harbor Beach, Maine.\""
msgstr ""
"在这张照片中，一位头发乌黑、满脸雀斑且身材略显丰满的年轻女子穿着一件不合身的黑色学士袍和毕业帽，羞涩地站在一个大型礼堂的低舞台上。她的脸上呈现出半是焦虑半是"
"疲惫的神情，勉强挂在脸上的笑容背后难以掩饰真实情绪，低垂的目光落在面前的话筒上。一张从报纸上撕下来的标题页通过回形针与照片相连。\n"
"\n"
"“缅因州巴尔港海滩发现不明身份年轻女子尸体。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Glistening in the light of an afternoon day, a large, multicolored fish hangs "
"neatly hooked upon a long fishing rod within this photo, the implement held "
"by a pair of grinning teens.  Dressed in bright yellow waders and standing "
"knee-deep in murky swamp water, with a sprawling marshland unfurling reeds, "
"low trees, and water vegetation for as far as the eye can see, the youths are "
"posed with the rod gripped between them.  You're not too sure what part of "
"the situation merits a grin from the photo's occupants, considering that the "
"fish's body bulges with tumor-like growths and spiny clusters of protruding "
"bones."
msgstr ""
"在这张照片中，一条色彩斑斓的大鱼在午后阳光下闪闪发光，整齐地挂在一根长长的钓竿上，这根钓竿被一对笑逐颜开的青少年举着。他们身穿鲜艳的黄色防水裤，站在浑浊的沼"
"泽水里，膝盖以下浸泡在水中，周围是一片广袤的湿地，芦苇丛生，低矮树木和水生植物蔓延至视线尽头。尽管这条鱼的身体肿胀，布满了肿瘤状的生长物和突出的骨刺集群，但"
"你不太确定这对年轻人面对这种情况有什么值得笑出来的。他们俩共同握住钓竿，摆好姿势拍照留念。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This appears to be a glossy photo of some manner of internet celebrity: a "
"young, redheaded woman reclining on a plush sofa, wearing a smirk, high "
"heels, and a sparing veil of pixelation over the more tasteless bits.  There "
"are many such bits on display.  The picture looks to have been the subject of "
"some extensive photoshopping.  At least, for the sake of the probably dead "
"young lady's back, you hope that it's just photoshopped."
msgstr ""
"这似乎是一张互联网红人的光鲜照片：一名年轻的红发女子斜倚在一张豪华沙发上，嘴角挂着一丝冷笑，脚踩高跟鞋，而在某些私密部位仅用一层淡淡的马赛克遮掩。照片展示了"
"许多这样的暴露部位。看上去这张照片经过了大量的Photoshop处理。至少，为了那位可能已故的年轻女士的背部健康，你希望这只是PS效果而已。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Coated in mountaineering gear and grayish-white alpine clothes, a bearded, "
"appropriately mountainous man takes up most of this photo, with boots firmly "
"planted upon a craggy ridge.  With the breath-taking view of a mountainside "
"clad in winter's last vestiges resolving into the budding green landscape of "
"what looks, suspiciously, like Switzerland blooming behind the climber, his "
"paw-like hands are securely closed about the legs of a young boy sitting upon "
"his shoulders.  Both child and hiker alike are flashing a pair of thumbs-ups "
"towards the camera."
msgstr ""
"在这张照片中，一名蓄着胡须、身材魁梧的男子占据了大部分画面，他身着登山装备和灰白色的阿尔卑斯服装，双脚稳稳地踏在崎岖的山脊上。在他背后，令人屏息的美景徐徐展"
"开，一面山坡仍残留着冬日的痕迹，而另一边却不可思议地展现出一幅瑞士春天般嫩绿的风景画卷。这位登山者如熊掌般的大手紧紧环抱着坐在他肩膀上的小男孩的双腿。孩子和"
"登山者都向着镜头竖起了大拇指，传递出胜利的信号。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This is the heart-achingly adorable snapshot of a large and incredibly fluffy "
"Labrador: the dog sprawled upon a low bed with its huge paws outstretched and "
"a light dusting of shed fur sprinkling the blankets.  Gripping a chew toy in "
"its jaws and with its head resting upon a drool-spattered pillow, the canine "
"is regarding the camera with a lopsided, doleful gaze."
msgstr ""
"这张照片捕捉到了一只无比庞大且毛茸茸的拉布拉多犬让人疼爱不已的瞬间：这只狗狗四肢摊开，懒洋洋地躺在一张低矮的床上，硕大的爪子伸展着，轻轻飘落的脱毛散落在被褥"
"上。它口中紧咬着一个磨牙玩具，头枕在一个沾满口水的枕头上，以一种歪斜而又略带忧郁的眼神凝视着镜头，那模样仿佛是在诉说着什么无声的故事。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Shot within an indoor shooting range, a lanky young lady with Slavic features "
"stands in the foreground of this photo, her flowing brunette hair all but "
"concealed beneath a modified pot-helmet with an attached camera and flip-down "
"infrared eyepiece.  Enveloped within a vest to which is attached a "
"contraption that looks like the end product of a machine gun and a motorcycle "
"being crashed together, the woman's posing with the weapon cradled at her "
"hip.  At the picture's left-most echelons, clearly intended to serve as a "
"target, a 7-foot-tall insectoid creature cast from black foam crouches, its "
"plastic fangs bared and its second jaw extended.\n"
"\n"
"On the photo's backside, the caption \"LA, 2019\" has been scrawled in "
"looping handwriting.  In more recent script, a large x has been scored "
"through the caption, while the term \"game over man\" has been jotted in its "
"place."
msgstr ""
"这张照片拍摄于一处室内射击场，前景是一位拥有斯拉夫容貌的瘦削年轻女性，她那瀑布般的棕发几乎被一顶改装过的锅盔头盔所遮盖，头盔上装有摄像头和可翻下的红外线目镜"
"。她身穿一件背心，背心上固定着一个看起来像是机枪和摩托车相结合后诞生的装置。女子摆出持枪姿势，将武器揽在髋部。在照片最左侧，明显作为目标的是一只7"
"英尺高的黑色泡沫材料制作而成的昆虫外形生物，龇牙咧嘴，颚部向前延伸。\n"
"\n"
"照片背面，以连贯的笔迹写着“洛杉矶，2019"
"”的字样。而在更近的时间添加上去的笔记中，有人划掉原来的注释，用粗大的X标记，并在其上方潦草地写下“游戏结束，伙计”。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Sat on a low stool and lightly strumming an electric guitar, a girl in her "
"late teens with tousled red hair draping to her trench coat-clad shoulders "
"grins slyly in the middle of this aged photo, flanked by a similarly aged "
"pair of nearly identical-looking young men: one playing on a mounted keyboard "
"while the other beats a silent tune on a large drum set.  Behind the trio "
"stands a taller woman with sharper features, her body clad in a crisp suit, "
"her lips parted in mid-verse, and primly gloved hands cupping a microphone.  "
"With the aid of a Sharpie, the photo's been captioned \"The Nightjars, Our NY "
"Tour, 2011,\" while on its back, a crossed-off list is present.\n"
"\n"
"\"Rob: dead of stomach cancer in 2016\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Andi: took a bone spike to the guts when <city> was overrun\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Audrey: died when the air force leveled Boston\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Melony: sitting with a broken leg while something's bringing down the "
"door\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I'm sorry we broke up, guys.  At least we would have died toget…\"\n"
"\n"
"The rest of the text is illegible through the dried stains that surround the "
"edge of a bullet hole that clipped the picture."
msgstr ""
"在这张颇具年代感的照片中央，一位红发蓬乱、披至风衣肩头的十七八岁少女坐在矮凳上，轻轻拨弄着电吉他，开心地笑着。她的两侧分别是一名年龄相仿、长相极为相似的年轻"
"男子，一人在键盘上演奏，另一人在庞大的鼓组前敲击节奏。在三人身后矗立着一位面容更为立体的高挑女子，她身着一套笔挺的套装，嘴唇微启，正在唱出歌词的中间部分，而"
"她那戴着精致手套的双手正捧着麦克风。借助马克笔，照片上标注着“夜鹰乐队，我们的纽约巡演，2011年”。在照片背面，有一张划掉部分成员信息的名单。\n"
"\n"
"“罗伯：2016年因胃癌去世”\n"
"\n"
"“安迪：在被感染者袭击时被骨刺刺入腹部”\n"
"\n"
"“奥德丽：当空军轰炸波士顿时遇难”\n"
"\n"
"“梅洛尼：腿部骨折，此刻正坐着，门外有某种东西在破坏门”\n"
"\n"
"“对不起，我们解散了，伙伴们。至少我们可以……”\n"
"\n"
"剩余的文字因围绕着照片边缘弹孔溅出的干涸污渍而变得难以辨认。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Judging by the black and orange motifs, mounted jack-o'-lanterns, and throngs "
"of costumed individuals that compose the backdrop of this photo, it's clear "
"that this particular picture was captured during some manner of Halloween "
"party.  In the foreground stands what you could charitably describe as an "
"unlikely pairing of franchises, with a grinning man dressed in ankle boots, "
"khaki short shorts, a safari jacket, and a wide-brimmed fedora cradling what "
"appears to be a plastic Spas-12, while standing next to him is a slighter "
"figure wearing a mask and a baseball glove with dulled blades attached.  "
"Behind the pair looms a muscular individual with white, fur-coated pants that "
"make their legs look like those of a goat, a full head mask with inwardly "
"curling horns, red body paint sprayed across their exposed chest, and clawed "
"hands placed upon the shoulders of their smaller compatriots.  The picture's "
"completed with the gloved partygoer using two of their blades to flash a "
"peace sign at the camera."
msgstr ""
"根据照片背景中的黑色和橙色装饰元素、悬挂的南瓜灯以及众多盛装打扮的人群判断，显然这张照片是在某个万圣节派对期间拍摄的。画面前景中站着一对颇令人意外的角色组合"
"：一位笑容满面的男子穿着短靴、卡其色短裤、一件狩猎夹克以及宽檐软呢帽，他手中握着一支看似塑料材质的Spas-12"
"霰弹枪；而他旁边则是一个体型较瘦小的人物，戴着面具，手持一只安装了钝化刀刃的棒球手套。在这对搭档身后，赫然屹立着一个肌肉发达的个体，下半身穿着毛皮覆盖的白色"
"裤子，使其腿部看起来犹如山羊腿一般，头顶戴着一副带有内弯犄角的全头面具，裸露的胸膛上涂满了红色涂料，他们用爪型手套搭在两位同伴的肩膀上。画面最后定格在那位戴"
"着手套的派对参与者用两只刀刃比划出和平手势，向镜头挥手致意。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Illuminated by the rays of the middle-eastern sun, the open bay of a large "
"transport plane takes up most of this photo, with its loading ramp lowered "
"and the aircraft seemingly idling upon a dust-swept runway.  At the foot of "
"the ramp stands a line of uniformed men and women clad in rather dated desert "
"camouflage service attire, with a medley of frozen waves, thumbs ups, and "
"cheerfully presented middle fingers all present and accounted for.  At the "
"picture's apex, somebody's scrawled, \"2nd Rangers, through hell, high water, "
"and mosquitoes.\"  You sincerely doubt that any of these soldiers are still "
"alive."
msgstr ""
"这张照片中，中东地区的阳光照亮了一个大型运输机的开放式货舱，占据了画面的大半部分，飞机的装载斜坡已经放下，似乎正停靠在一条尘土飞扬的跑道上。在斜坡底部，一排"
"身着颇具年代感沙漠迷彩军服的男女军人整齐列队，他们之中有人做出严肃的敬礼姿势，有人竖起大拇指，也有人诙谐地伸出中指，各式各样的手势记录下这一瞬间。照片顶部手"
"写着一行字：“第二突击队，穿越地狱、深水与蚊虫。”你真心怀疑这些士兵是否还有人生还。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Kneeling in the foreground of this photo, within the overhang of several "
"trees, a camouflaged soldier with a green beret and a rifle strapped across "
"his shoulders crouches, an affectionate grin creasing his unshaven face.  "
"With its broad paws placed within the man's lap, a large German shepherd "
"wearing a Kevlar harness nuzzles against the soldier's chest, the dog "
"cuddling within the military man's arms while its jaws are clamped about a "
"bundle of ragged cloth.  After some scrutiny, you deduce it to have once been "
"the bloodied crotch of a very unfortunate pair of trousers.  In recent "
"penmanship, someone's jotted on the photo's rear.\n"
"\n"
"\"I'm sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"在这张照片前景位置，在几棵大树的树荫下，一名身穿迷彩服、头戴绿色贝雷帽的士兵单膝跪地，他的脸庞未经刮胡子，却洋溢着亲切的笑容，肩上则挂着一把步枪。他宽大的手"
"掌托着一只身披凯夫拉护具的大德国牧羊犬，这只犬只把宽厚的爪子放在士兵的膝盖上，紧贴着士兵的胸膛依偎着，而它的嘴紧紧咬着一团破烂的布料。仔细审视后，你会推断出"
"那曾是一条沾满血迹、非常不幸的裤裆部位。在照片背面，最近有人草草地写下了一句话。\n"
"\n"
"“对不起。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This night-time photo is filled with the front profile of a parked 4x4, the "
"utility vehicle sitting upon the dust-caked surface of a roadway with a wide "
"stretch of sandy desert sprawling for as far as the eye can see.  Sitting "
"upon the vehicle's hood with booted feet kicked up on the bush grill, a "
"muscular woman reclines against the windshield with a bottle of beer in her "
"hand.  Gripping her own beverage and illuminated by the light cast from the "
"tapestry of stars that stretch overhead, a shorter, rather mousey woman leans "
"against her compatriot.  Both women have a soft smile on their lips as they "
"hold their beers in a frozen toast."
msgstr ""
"这张夜间照片充满了一辆停放的4x4"
"越野车的正面轮廓，这辆实用车辆停在一条尘土覆盖的路面上，而广阔的沙质沙漠在视线所及之处延伸开来。一名肌肉发达的女子把靴子搭在灌木丛的格栅上，背靠着挡风玻璃，"
"手中拿着一瓶啤酒，悠闲地坐在车辆的引擎盖上。一个身材较矮、相当害羞的女子握着自己的饮料，在头顶上方繁星闪烁的光芒照耀下，靠在她的同伴身上。两位女士唇边都带着"
"柔和的微笑，她们手持啤酒，定格在一个温馨的祝酒时刻。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Beaming up at the camera with a too-wide grin that all but screams \"my feet "
"are killing me, please, make this stop,\" a little girl stands against a "
"backdrop of dense jungle foliage, which, you hope, is only the work of a "
"green screen.  Dressed in all white, with a bow tie, an appropriately small "
"vest, and alabaster ballet shoes, the child is holding a bouquet of partly "
"wilted red and white roses and presenting it to the camera.  The photo has "
"clearly been clumsily edited in post to blot out any perceived imperfections "
"and add a radiant glow to the child's otherwise sallow skin."
msgstr ""
"一位年幼的女孩面对镜头，展露出一个灿烂的微笑，仿佛在无声地诉说着她的不适：“我的脚真的很痛，请让这一切结束吧。”她站在一片繁茂的丛林前，让人不禁希望这仅仅是"
"绿幕技术所营造的幻象。女孩身穿一袭纯白的衣裳，打着领结，身着贴身的小背心，脚踏一双白色的芭蕾舞鞋。她手中紧握着一束红白玫瑰，部分花瓣已经凋零，却依旧向镜头展"
"示着。这张相片在后期处理中显得有些粗糙，试图掩盖那些不完美的细节，同时在女孩本就缺乏血色的皮肤上增添了一抹不自然的光泽。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This is a small photograph of what, initially, appears to be a muddle of "
"black, gray, and faint white color scales blended together in what could be "
"mistaken as some manner of abstract print.  A predominant dark patch takes up "
"the picture's middle, blending at the edges into a grayish border, while a "
"white striation cuts across the image's apex from right to left.  A small, "
"grayish dot peacefully floats at the heart of the central mass while, on the "
"back of the photo, somebody's drawn a stack of nine boxes, with a little "
"check mark marking each of them save for the final two."
msgstr ""
"这是一张小照片，乍一看似乎是黑色、灰色和淡白色色块混合在一起的模糊图像，可能会被误认为是某种抽象印刷品。照片中间有一个主要的深色区域，边缘逐渐过渡成灰色边框"
"，而一道白色的条纹从右至左穿过图像的顶部。在中央区域的中心位置，有一个小的灰色点静静地漂浮着，而在照片的背面，有人画了一堆九个盒子，每个盒子上都有一个小勾号"
"，除了最后两个。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Snapped from ground level, this upwardly tilted picture is filled with the "
"pointed profile of a rather antiquated fighter jet, the aircraft sitting upon "
"a sun-lit taxiway and parked in a row with other planes visible behind it.  "
"The jet's canopy glass has been pulled back to expose the Tomcat's cockpit, "
"within which, barely visible, sits a radiantly grinning young boy, his head "
"just poking over the lip of the military aircraft's compartment.  Standing "
"upon the F14's wing and leaning down over the cockpit's wall stands a young "
"woman dressed in an Air Force flight suit, her head bowed in conversation, "
"clearly giving the youth a small tour of the jet's controls."
msgstr ""
"这张照片以低角度拍摄，捕捉到了一架具有经典线条的老旧战斗机的优雅姿态。飞机静候在被阳光洗礼的滑行道上，背景中还排列着一系列其他的飞机。战斗机的座舱罩已被推起"
"，揭示了内部的“汤姆猫”驾驶舱，其中一位面带微笑的小男孩探出头来，好奇地张望。在F14"
"的机翼上，一位身着空军飞行服的女飞行员正倾身于驾驶舱上方，专注地向下与小男孩交流。她似乎在向他详细解释战斗机的操控系统，而他则聚精会神地聆听着，眼中闪烁着对"
"飞行的向往和对知识的渴望。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This is an extremely old black and white photo, not even of Polaroid "
"heritage, within which, framed by the fenced-in pastures of some form of "
"farmstead, stands a potbellied man in farmer's overalls and a young woman in "
"what appears to be mid-twentieth-century garb.  An enormous and saddled "
"stallion rears its proud head in the picture's midground, upon whose stirrup "
"the lady's frozen in mid-climb, supported by the gentleman as he keeps the "
"horse steady.  Both individuals are clearly in the midst of some decades-old "
"private joke, with the man's lips parted in mid-laugh and the woman's face "
"set in an amused grin.  On the back of the picture, in much more modern "
"script, somebody's written, \"I'm glad the Japanese took you in Saipan.  You "
"don't have to see judgment day.\""
msgstr ""
"这是一张非常古老的黑白照片，甚至不是宝丽来风格的照片。在照片中，被某种农场的围栏包围的背景中，站着一个肚子凸出的男人，穿着农民的工装，旁边是一个穿着20"
"世纪中期服装的年轻女子。一匹巨大而装备马鞍的雄马在照片的中景抬起它骄傲的头，女士正被冻结在攀爬的瞬间，由男士扶着，他保持着马的稳定。两个人显然都在开一个几十"
"年前的老玩笑，男人的嘴唇在笑声中张开，女人的脸上带着愉快的微笑。在照片的背面，用更现代的字体，有人写道：“我很高兴日本人在塞班岛接纳了你。你不必经历审判日。"
"”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Framed by the towering spires, roller coaster arches, and medley of stores, "
"restaurants, and vendor kiosks of some form of theme park's main boulevard, a "
"smiling family stands arrayed in the foreground of this picture.  Standing "
"with their arms about one another's shoulders, an older man and woman, two "
"young children, and an adolescent grin up at you from out of this photo—or, "
"at least, most of them do.  One of the children has their face set in a "
"sullen glare and is, clearly unbeknownst to their parents, flipping the bird "
"towards the camera, the offending hand peeking out from behind their mother's "
"waist."
msgstr ""
"这张照片的背景是由主题公园主大道上的高耸尖塔、过山车轨道以及各种商店、餐馆和售货亭组成的，前景中站着一个笑容满面的家庭。他们互相搭着肩膀，包括一位年长的男士"
"和女士、两个小孩子以及一个青少年，都对着你笑——至少大部分人是如此。其中一个孩子面露愠色，显然没有被父母察觉，正对镜头比着不雅的手势，那只冒犯的手从母亲腰后"
"探出来。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Rather blurry and unfocused, as though taken in a rush, this monochrome "
"photograph depicts a bustling curbside, with a traffic-clogged street and the "
"looming towers of a city center forming its backdrop.  Parked beside the "
"sidewalk sits a little red hatchback, the car's driver's side door open, and "
"a formally dressed woman in high heels, a pencil skirt, and a form-fitting "
"blouse stepping within: a takeaway coffee cup in one well-manicured hand and "
"a neatly set waterfall of brown hair concealing part of her sideways turned "
"face.  On the back of the picture, somebody's inscribed a crude list.\n"
"\n"
"\"Name: Kelly Cline.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Phone: 772-297-2152\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Residence: Godfrey Hotel, 505 Washington St., room 109.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Departing at: March 18th, 15:42 for Logan International Airport.\""
msgstr ""
"这张单色照片略显模糊且焦点不集中，看起来像是匆忙中拍摄的。照片描绘了一个繁忙的路边景象，背景是拥挤的街道和高耸的城市中心塔楼。停在路边的是一部小红车，车门开"
"着，一位穿着正式的女士正迈入车内：她脚踩高跟鞋，身穿铅笔裙和贴身衬衫，手中拿着一杯外带咖啡，整齐的棕色瀑布般的长发遮住了她侧脸的一部分。照片背面粗糙地写着一"
"张清单。\n"
"\n"
"“姓名：凯利·克莱恩。”\n"
"\n"
"“电话：772-297-2152”\n"
"\n"
"“住址：戈弗雷酒店，华盛顿街505号，109房间。”\n"
"\n"
"“出发时间：3月18日，15:42前往洛根国际机场。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This small photograph shines with beams of reflected light glinting off of a "
"lake's surface, with the water body looming in the background and bordered by "
"thick clusters of evergreen trees.  In the picture's foreground, before a "
"wrought iron railing encircling the lake, runs a gravel footpath upon which "
"sits a slatted park bench that's playing host to the diorama's main "
"characters: an older lady and gentleman.  Dressed warmly, with knitted "
"beanies pulled low over their white-haired heads, a silver thermos between "
"them, and arms clasped about one another's shoulders, the elderly couple are "
"smiling warmly at the camera while a lanky Irish Springer lounges at their "
"feet."
msgstr ""
"这张小照片上反射的光芒在湖面上闪烁，湖水在背景中显得辽阔，四周环绕着茂密的常绿树木。在照片的前景，一条环绕湖泊的铸铁栏杆前，有一条碎石步行道，上面放着一张条"
"板公园长椅，长椅上坐着这个场景的主要人物：一对老夫妇。他们穿着保暖，头上戴着针织无边帽，中间放着一个银色保温瓶，双臂相互搂着对方的肩膀，这对老年夫妇对着镜头"
"温暖地微笑，而一只瘦长的爱尔兰跳猎犬正懒洋洋地躺在他们的脚边。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This appears to be a torn-out segment from a movie poster, creased and "
"crinkled from having been folded many times over.  The glossy image of an "
"older man dressed in an old army uniform and gas mask fills the snippet, "
"standing against a yellowish backdrop of swirling gas.  Part of the poster's "
"original caption has been preserved, floating over the soldier's head and "
"printed in a font that looks like sprayed bullet holes.\n"
"\n"
"\"Dillan Piper to Appear in No M…\"\n"
"\n"
"The actor's name has been crossed out in post with a pen and the term "
"\"dad?\" appended below it.  In the same recent handwriting, the back of the "
"poster is filled with a jumble of half-legible scribbles.\n"
"\n"
"\"I wish you were here.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I wish you were actually here.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I wish you didn't just appear when the sky turns red and I hear screaming "
"in my ears.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I wish you appeared with your skin.\""
msgstr ""
"这似乎是从一张电影海报上撕下来的一个片段，由于多次折叠而变得褶皱和磨损。片段上是一个穿着旧军装和防毒面具的老年男子的光滑形象，他站在背景中黄色的旋涡气体中。"
"海报原始标题的一部分得以保留，悬浮在士兵的头顶上，字体看起来像是喷射的弹孔。\n"
"\n"
"“迪兰·派珀将出演《无……》”\n"
"\n"
"演员的名字被用笔划掉，并在下面附加了“爸爸？”这个词。用同样的近期手写，海报的背面充满了一堆半可读的涂鸦。\n"
"\n"
"“我希望你在这里。”\n"
"\n"
"“我希望你真的在这里。”\n"
"\n"
"“我希望不只是当天空中出现红色，我耳边响起尖叫时，你才出现。”\n"
"\n"
"“我希望你带着你的皮囊出现。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Captured within the handsomely tiled foyer of what appears to be a museum, "
"the hulking bulk of a mounted tyrannosaur skeleton fills this picture, "
"standing poised upon a circular plinth with its massive head lowered and jaws "
"parted.  Facing the camera, its tail coiling into the dimly lit distance, and "
"the skeleton's pedestal bordered by faux greenery, the fossil serves as the "
"backdrop to a bald child who stands in the photograph's foreground.  Posed "
"with their arms shielding their face and mouth open in a mock screen, the "
"youth huddles close to the floor.  The diorama's dramatic effect is partially "
"spoiled by the grin that's lighting up the child's face.  With the aid of a "
"blue pen, somebody has inscribed the picture's rear.  \"Every night, I thank "
"God.  I thank him for sending cancer to take you away.  I thank him for "
"saving you from having to see the end.\""
msgstr ""
"这张照片拍摄于一个看似博物馆的华丽瓷砖大厅内，一个庞大的霸王龙骨架占据了整个画面，它站在圆形基座上，巨大的头部低垂，嘴巴张开。骨架面向镜头，尾巴蜿蜒进入昏暗"
"的远处，而化石的基座周围被人造绿植环绕，成为背景。一个秃顶的小孩站在照片的前景中，用手臂遮住脸，张大嘴巴做出模仿电影镜头的姿势，紧贴着地面。这个场景的戏剧效"
"果被孩子脸上的笑容部分破坏了。有人用蓝色笔在照片的背面题字：“每个夜晚，我都感谢上帝。我感谢他派癌症来带走你。我感谢他让你免于目睹这一切的终结。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Seeming to defy the natural laws of order, a leather-upholstered sofa spans "
"this photo, upon which recline an adorably tiny dog and a silvery white "
"feline.  Sitting quite imperiously upon a cushion, the cat is passively "
"regarding the camera, while beside it, laying upon its back, the dog rests, "
"its little paws trying, and failing, to reach a rope toy that's primly held "
"beneath the feline's legs.  You never thought a cat could look pleased with "
"itself, smug, and amused all at the same time."
msgstr ""
"这张照片中的景象似乎违背了自然秩序的法则，一张皮革沙发横跨画面，上面躺着一只非常小的狗和一只银白色的猫。猫威严地坐在垫子上，被动地看着相机，而在它旁边，狗仰"
"躺着，它的小爪子试图（但失败了）去够一只被猫腿下端庄地夹着的绳索玩具。你从未想过一只猫能同时看起来如此自得、沾沾自喜和娱乐。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Sunshine blazes down upon the bustling boulevard or market street that this "
"photo captures, with large buildings decked out in south American "
"architecture rising to a brilliantly blue sky and small kiosks dotted along "
"the roadway.  Standing by one such stall is a smiling pre-teen girl dressed "
"in warm weather apparel and the most absolutely massive Panama hat you've "
"ever seen, the piece sitting upon her crown like a small umbrella.  Entwined "
"about her lean body are a pair of snakes, their heads hovering by the girl's "
"collar bone and their fat bodies cocooning her down to the tops of her thighs."
msgstr ""
"阳光照耀在这张照片所捕捉的繁忙大道或市场街道上，大型建筑装饰着南美洲风格的建筑，耸立在明亮的蓝天下，小摊位沿着道路散布。在其中一个摊位旁站着一个微笑的少女，"
"她穿着适合温暖天气的服装，戴着你曾见过的最大的巴拿马草帽，这顶帽子像一把小伞一样坐在她的头顶上。两条蛇缠绕在她纤细的身体上，它们的头部悬在女孩的锁骨旁，肥胖"
"的身体一直包裹到她的大腿上方。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"A crowd of muddled bodies fills this picture, with the trampled turf of a "
"football field extending into the distance and rows of bleachers rising into "
"the night sky behind them.  Illuminated by white floodlight beams, the "
"individuals stand abreast of one another, all clad in football armor and "
"other sports wear, their arms poised in a jumble of fist bumps, victory "
"signs, and jubilant pumps.  A massive trophy gleams overhead, held by three "
"people at the group's heart.  You miss the days when people could be this "
"excited about winning a game."
msgstr ""
"这张照片中挤满了模糊不清的人群，他们站在被踩踏的足球场草坪上，远处延伸着一排排的露天看台，直插夜空。在白色泛光灯的照射下，这些人肩并肩站立，都穿着球衣和其他"
"运动服饰，手臂交错在一起，形成了一片拳头碰撞、胜利手势和欢庆的挥舞。一个巨大的奖杯在他们头顶上闪闪发光，由站在人群中心的三个人举着。你怀念那些日子，人们因为"
"赢得一场比赛而如此兴奋。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"A blue sky stretches overhead within this crisp photo, the gravel and dirt "
"landscape of a shooting range filling the background while a coffee-skinned "
"man stands poised in the foreground, his lips quirking in a soft smile and a "
"large medal gleaming upon his chest.  A futuristic-looking bullpup marksman's "
"rifle rests in the crook of his arm, with the Rivtech logo etched along the "
"recessed barrel's housing and the weapon's buttstock firmly planted in the "
"gravel by his feet.  In elegant penmanship, the picture's been captioned, "
"\"Camp Perry, 2021 NRA High-Power Rifle Championships.\""
msgstr ""
"在这张清晰的照片里，蓝天伸展在头顶，射击场的砾石和泥土景观填满了背景，而一位咖啡色肌肤的男子站在前景中，他的嘴唇微微上扬，露出柔和的微笑，胸前闪耀着一枚大奖"
"牌。一支未来感十足的无托狙击步枪安静地搁在他的臂弯里，枪身上刻有Rivtech的标志，沿着凹陷的枪管外壳，而武器的托肩板牢牢地插在他脚旁的砾石中。照片上用优"
"雅的书法题写着，“坎普佩里，2021年NRA高功率步枪锦标赛。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This particular photograph is filled with the sweeping expanse of a modern "
"auditorium, with lines of occupied chairs leading away from the camera and "
"terminating before a white-lit stage.  Arrayed in an orderly line, several "
"dozen newly minted police recruits stand at rigid attention upon the "
"platform, all clad in blue and black dress uniforms.  With a bundle of "
"diplomas tucked under an arm, an older man with a spider's web of gray "
"furrowing his beard stands poised before the assembly, his free hand frozen "
"as he hands a certificate to a dark-haired Latina woman in the line's middle. "
" You idly wonder how these cadets fared during the riots.  Not well seems "
"like a pretty safe bet."
msgstr ""
"这张照片充满了现代礼堂的广阔景象，一排排坐满人的椅子从镜头前延伸开去，最终在白色灯光照亮的舞台上结束。几十名新晋的警察学员在台上整齐地站成一行，他们都穿着蓝"
"色和黑色的礼服。画面中，一位满脸布满灰色皱纹如蜘蛛网般的老者，正拿着一捆文凭站在队伍前，他的另一只手在将证书递给队伍中间的一位黑发拉丁裔女性时被定格。你不禁"
"遐想这些学员们在暴乱期间的表现会是如何。很显然，认为他们的表现不会太好似乎是个相当稳妥的猜测。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"Ragged, unclear, and altogether hurriedly developed, this photograph appears "
"to depict the gloomy interior of what once was a living room, with window "
"blinds thickly drawn and boards nailing down any cracks through which "
"external observation could be possible.  The entire space looks alive: some "
"manner of spongy vegetation coats its surfaces and thick tendrils and "
"quivering mounds of mold subsume most of the furniture.  Reclined within the "
"misshapen gray lump that might have been a sofa, a pale-skinned woman "
"lounges, her spine arched, head thrown back, and a look of rapturous ecstasy "
"visible on the parts of her face not caked by the fungus that's extending in "
"wet stalks from her open mouth.  Smiling contentedly, with dainty tendrils "
"spreading across her face, entwining in her hair, and burrowing into the "
"ruptured sockets where eyes used to reside, the woman is embracing a bulging "
"cocoon of gray resting in her lap, small bits of fur peeking through cracks "
"in the fungal shell.  In bold and crude calligraphy, text has been scrawled "
"on the back of the image.\n"
"\n"
"\"Do not be afraid, for our beauty is all-encompassing and rests beyond your "
"sight.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do not be afraid, for we speak the word of blissful hegemony.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do not be afraid, for this is our mission, and you will be a part of it.\""
msgstr ""
"这张匆忙冲洗的照片显得破旧、不清晰，似乎描绘了一个曾经是客厅的阴暗内部，窗户上的百叶窗被厚厚地拉上，木板钉在任何可能被外部观察到的裂缝上。整个空间看起来充满"
"了生命力：某种海绵状的植被覆盖了其表面，厚实的菌丝和颤动的霉块几乎吞没了所有的家具。一个肤色苍白的女子斜倚在一个可能是沙发的畸形灰色块中，她的脊柱弯曲，头向"
"后仰，脸上露出狂喜的表情，除了那些从她张开的嘴里伸出的湿漉漉的菌丝覆盖的部分外。女子满足地微笑着，细腻的菌丝蔓延在她的脸上，缠绕在她的头发中，并钻入曾经是眼"
"睛的破裂眼窝，她拥抱着躺在她膝上的鼓起的灰色茧，真菌外壳的裂缝中露出小块的毛发。在图像的背面，照片背面以粗犷而原始的书法笔迹潦草地写着几行字：\n"
"\n"
"“不要害怕，因为我们的美丽无所不在，超越你的视线。”\n"
"\n"
"“不要害怕，因为我们传扬的是极乐至上的福音。”\n"
"\n"
"“不要害怕，因为这是我们的使命，而你将会成为其中的一部分。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This is a blurry photo taken in bright daylight.  A dog sits in the middle of "
"the frame with a ball in its mouth; its fur is completely caked in mud.  Two "
"kids are seen to the left playing in a nearby pond—most likely the cause of "
"the dog's soiled fur.  On the back, a message reads, \"You had a long run.  I "
"still miss you, always.\""
msgstr ""
"这是一张在明媚阳光下拍摄的模糊照片。画面中央，一只狗口衔球状物端坐，全身毛发沾满泥浆。左侧可见两个孩子正在附近的水塘中嬉戏，很可能是导致这只狗浑身脏污的“罪"
"魁祸首”。照片背面附有一句话：“你已奔腾万里，我仍深深怀念，始终如一。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"This photograph demonstrates what happens when you let too many puppies into "
"a room with one person.  The man in the middle of the dogpile is absolutely "
"overjoyed, as he's covered in canines of all shapes and sizes.  A note on the "
"back says, \"Winner of the company lottery.\""
msgstr ""
"这张照片生动展示了许多小狗同时涌入一个房间与一个人玩耍时的情景。被狗狗堆包围的男子正处于中心位置，尽管全身上下都被各种体型大小的狗狗包围，但他的脸上洋溢着无"
"比开心的表情。照片背面附有一行字：“公司彩票头奖得主。”"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"A simple photo of two children hugging.  The photo is awfully thick, though, "
"and a tap of the picture results in displacing multiple other photos that "
"were stuck together.  Each consecutive photo shows the two in later stages of "
"their lives.  The last photo shows the two wearing a pair of graduation caps "
"and robes, in a similar hugging position as the first."
msgstr ""
"这是一帧捕捉了两位孩童深情相拥瞬间的画面，然而，此照犹如一部厚重的影像册，轻轻一掀，便揭示出数层紧密相连的照片。这些照片逐一呈现了这对孩子在成长岁月中的蜕变"
"历程。直至末页，他们已然身披学士盛装，头戴学位帽，以一种与开篇场景相同的拥抱姿态，画面在此刻永恒定格。"

#: data/json/snippets/photos.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "wallet_photos"
#. ~ These are meant to be small pictures that people would have kept in their
#. wallets before the Cataclysm.  Nothing majorly anomalous should show up in
#. these pictures, unless they were taken shortly before the end of the world,
#. in which case anything abnormal should be subtle enough to have plausibly
#. gone unnoticed by the former owner.
msgid ""
"A strange gray fruit is placed on a pedestal, like a relic would be placed on "
"a stand for others to admire.  Clearly, it isn't anything originating from "
"this world, and the vein-like tendrils along its skin only convince you of "
"that even more.  A piece of plastic crudely paperclipped to the back has been "
"used to carve out the message \"I'm sorry I'm sorry Im sorr'm soryI'm sorrm "
"sorrsorr\" in increasingly illegible handwriting.  It gives off the faint "
"smell of mold."
msgstr ""
"A strange gray fruit is placed on a pedestal, like a relic would be placed on "
"a stand for others to admire.  Clearly, it isn't anything originating from "
"this world, and the vein-like tendrils along its skin only convince you of "
"that even more.  A piece of plastic crudely paperclipped to the back has been "
"used to carve out the message \"I'm sorry I'm sorry Im sorr'm soryI'm sorrm "
"sorrsorr\" in increasingly illegible handwriting.  It gives off the faint "
"smell of mold."

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest>"
msgid ""
"The bark of this plant/creature is tough and leathery and slightly "
"translucent, with blue veins running through it."
msgstr "这种植物/生物的树皮坚硬且呈皮革状，略带透明，蓝色脉络贯穿其中。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest>"
msgid ""
"When you cut this plant-creature open the smell of ozone gets stronger, but "
"it's mixed with a sweet smell from the creature itself."
msgstr "当你切开这株植物/生物时，臭味变得更加浓烈，但混合着一种来自生物本身的甜味。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest>"
msgid ""
"The sap of the beast is a slightly bluish color and seems to be less viscous "
"than animal blood."
msgstr "这个野兽的树液有种轻微的蓝色，并且似乎比动物血液的粘度要低。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest>"
msgid ""
"Despite the creature seemingly being a plant/creature hybrid, the muscles are "
"surprisingly similar to animal muscles, although the color is off."
msgstr "尽管这种生物看似是植物/动物的混合体，但肌肉出人意料地与动物肌肉相似，尽管颜色有所不同。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest>"
msgid ""
"You don't find anything resembling bones in the creature.  Instead, it seems "
"it's more similar to terrestrial invertebrates."
msgstr "你在这个生物体内没有发现任何类似骨头的结构。相反，它似乎更像是陆地上的无脊椎动物。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest>"
msgid ""
"A slight electric discharge gives you a minor shock as you pierce what you "
"assume is an electric organ."
msgstr "当你刺穿你认为是发电器官的部位时，一阵轻微的电刺激让你轻微地颤动。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest>"
msgid ""
"You find no external sensory organs in the plant/beast hybrid, but it's quite "
"possible the main means of perception is through electric fields."
msgstr "你没有在这个植物/野兽的混合生物里找到外部感知器官，但它很可能主要是通过电场感知外界的。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The blue veins of the vascular system of the creature is extensive, reaching "
"every part of its body."
msgstr "这个生物的血管系统中的蓝色脉络非常广泛，遍布它全身的各个部分。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The plant creature seems to have a heart of sorts, although its structure is "
"different from that on any animal you've heard of."
msgstr "这个植物生物似乎有一个勉强可以称为心脏的器官，尽管它的结构与你听说过的任何动物都不同。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"You take a closer look at the electric organs, and it seems to be built up of "
"layers of alternating dark and light tissue, which you guess might build up a "
"battery stack of sorts."
msgstr "你仔细查看这个放电器官，它看起来是一层层深色与浅色的组织交替排列而成。你猜这可能是一个电池堆。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"A closer examination of the rhizomes at the base of the creature indicates "
"they're adapted to movement and clinging to surfaces rather than burrowing "
"into the soil as you would expect from roots."
msgstr "仔细观察这生物底部的根茎，可以发现它们适合移动，或紧贴某种表面，而非像你想象的那样钻进土壤。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The power organs are surrounded by a complex tissue you suspect is "
"responsible for projection of electric fields the creature used for attack, "
"and, you suspect, sensory perception."
msgstr "电器官被复杂的组织包裹，你怀疑它用于投射这生物攻击用的电场。你还怀疑它是某种感官。"

#: data/json/snippets/power_leech_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<power_leech_harvest_deeper>"
msgid ""
"A small structure that vaguely resembles a brain is found near the center of "
"the creature."
msgstr "靠近生物的中心，有一个似乎是大脑的小结构。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"kssht.  Dark Horse, this is Blue Jay, what's your status, over.  kssht.  Blue "
"Jay, this is Dark Horse, still holding, but not for long.  kssht.  Dark "
"Horse, you've got to hold position for 3 hours.  We're almost black on ammo, "
"but resupply is on the way, over.  kssht.  Not possible Blue Jay, too many "
"dead.  30 minutes max, and if you don't order us to retreat we're gone, over. "
" kssht."
msgstr ""
"-*滋滋*-黑马，这里是蓝鸦，你的状态怎么样，完毕。-*滋滋*-蓝鸦，这里是黑马，我们还在坚持，不过坚持不了多久了。-*滋滋*-黑马，你得坚守3"
"个小时。我们的弹药快耗尽了，但补给正在路上，完毕。-*滋滋*-不可能蓝鸦，伤亡过多。最多30分钟，如果你不下命令，我们就自行撤退，完毕。-*滋滋*-"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"kssht.  Blue Jay, this is Black Rose, got your resupply, going in on vector "
"36, what's the status of the LZ?  kssht.  Black Rose, this is Blue Jay, what "
"took you so long?  LZ hot and unsecured, ammo black, bayonets in action, land "
"on your own discretion, over.  kssht.  Roger that, hold on, Black Rose out.  "
"kssht."
msgstr ""
"-*滋滋*-蓝鸦，这里是黑玫瑰，已带来补给，正在前往36方向。着陆点的状态如何？-*滋滋*-"
"黑玫瑰，这里是蓝鸦，你们怎么花了这么长时间？着陆点仍在交战，未确保安全，弹药耗尽，已装备刺刀，自行决定是否降落，完毕。-*滋滋*-"
"收到，坚持住，黑玫瑰完毕。-*滋滋*-"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"kssht.  Hammer1 to Command, on baring 216 from bulls, angels 3, target in "
"sight.  Command, target's still packed with civilians.  Holding weapons and "
"continuing dry, over.  kssht.  Negative hammer1, regard all ground forces "
"already KIA.  Weapons free.  I repeat, weapons free, over.  kssht.  Roger "
"that Command, moving in to engage.  3, 2, 1, rifle, rifle.  Command, target's "
"splash, over.  kssht.  Copy that Hammer1, hold fire and return to Homeplate, "
"over.  kssht.  Roger that Command, Hammer1 out.  kssht."
msgstr ""
"kssht.  Hammer1 to Command, on baring 216 from bulls, angels 3, target in "
"sight.  Command, target's still packed with civilians.  Holding weapons and "
"continuing dry, over.  kssht.  Negative hammer1, regard all ground forces "
"already KIA.  Weapons free.  I repeat, weapons free, over.  kssht.  Roger "
"that Command, moving in to engage.  3, 2, 1, rifle, rifle.  Command, target's "
"splash, over.  kssht.  Copy that Hammer1, hold fire and return to Homeplate, "
"over.  kssht.  Roger that Command, Hammer1 out.  kssht."

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"To whomever is listening, this may be our last broadcast.  Wish you luck.  "
"Can't stay in the studio any longer, station is being rewired to military "
"frequencies for automatic broadcast.  Stay safe, and bless you, people."
msgstr "无论谁正在收听，这可能是我们最后一次广播了。祝你好运。我们不能再呆在演播室里了，电台将切换至军用频率进行自动广播。注意安全，祝福你，所有人。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"You're listening to KDDA from Boston, I'm Jenny Sanders with a special "
"emergency news update.  Road closures by military and police forces have been "
"reported on interstates 90, 91, 93, and 95.  Alternative routes have not been "
"suggested.  Due to dangers on non-interstate roads, it is strongly "
"recommended that you avoid major thoroughfares and population centers when "
"traveling by car."
msgstr ""
"你正在收听的是波士顿KDDA频道，我是珍妮·桑德斯，插播一条特别紧急新闻。据报道，90、91、93和95"
"号州际公路被军队和警察封锁。没有其他的建议路线。由于非州际公路上存在危险，强烈建议你在开车旅行时避开主要干道和人口中心。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Those evacuating cities are advised to head to the nearest designated "
"evacuation shelter and await pickup by a FEMA transport.  Do not engage with "
"rioters.  Due to the danger of being mistaken for a rioter, do not approach "
"military or police blockades, even for assistance.  I repeat, do not approach "
"military or police blockades, even for assistance."
msgstr ""
"建议待疏散城市中的市民前往最近的指定紧急避难所，等待联邦应急管理局的交通工具到来。不要与暴徒接触。由于有被误认为是暴动者的危险，即使是为了寻求帮助，也不要接"
"近军方或警察封锁线。我重复一遍，即使是为了寻求帮助，也不要接近军方或警察封锁线。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"If you are not in an evacuation zone, officials highly recommend you pack "
"gear for evacuation.  Make sure to include clean clothes, a blanket, and "
"enough food and water to last a few days."
msgstr "如果你不在疏散区，政府强烈建议你带上疏散装备。确保带有干净的衣服，毯子，以及足够坚持几天的食物和水。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"In other news, the federal government has confirmed that Rhode Island's "
"declaration of secession is official, although the US government does not "
"acknowledge its validity.  Our sources haven't been able to determine the "
"extent of hostilities in the area, but there are rumors of border violence "
"initiated by the Rhode Island militia."
msgstr ""
"其他新闻，联邦政府已经确认罗得岛州的分裂声明是官方发出的，但美国政府不承认它的有效性。我们的消息来源还无法确定该地区敌对行动的程度，但有谣言称罗得岛民兵已经"
"制造了几场边境冲突。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Hey ladies and gentlemen of the apocalypse, you're listening to Dark Days "
"Radio, the last radio station on the Eastern Seaboard, I'm DJ Dustbowl here "
"with our mascot Sam."
msgstr "嗨末日后的女士们和先生们，你们正在听东海岸的最后一个广播电台Dark Days Radio，这里是DJ Dustbowl和我们的吉祥物Sam。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"DJ Dustbowl back, you're listening to Dark Days Radio.  Quick survivor tip: "
"remember, killing a zombie isn't enough.  You've gotta smash that thing to a "
"pulp or chop it into pieces if you don't want it getting back up.  Good news "
"though, you don't need to worry about headshots!  Any major damage will lay a "
"shambler out."
msgstr ""
"DJ Dustbowl回来了，你正在收听Dark Days "
"Radio。快速幸存提示：记住，杀死一个丧尸是不够的。如果你不想让它再次爬起来，你必须将那些东西粉捣成肉浆或将其切成碎片。不过好消息，你不需要考虑如何爆头！"
"任何重伤都会把那些瘸子撂倒。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"You're listening to Dark Days Radio, I'm DJ Dustbowl!  In with a quick tip "
"for any survivors listening: one zombie is bad news, two are worse.  Don't go "
"Rambo on me.  Tackle threats in small numbers or through bottlenecks.  You "
"aren't tougher than a zombie but you are smarter, use that to your advantage… "
"or just run away."
msgstr ""
"你正在收听Dark Days Radio，我是DJ "
"Dustbowl！快速提示给所有的幸存者：一个丧尸是坏消息，两个更糟糕。不要对我说兰博。不要一次面对大量丧尸。你也可以通过障碍物来减缓丧尸的行动。你并不比丧"
"尸更强硬，但你更聪明，好好利用它……或者赶紧逃跑。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"The world may be ending, but the music plays on.  This is DJ Dustbowl, coming "
"right back at you with Dark Days Radio, the soundtrack to the apocalypse.  "
"Tune in for a mix of classic hits, indie tracks, and post-apocalyptic jams.  "
"And remember people, while we may be living in hell, we at least still got "
"good tunes."
msgstr ""
"世↑界↓可能正走向终结，但——音乐仍将继续！我是DJ "
"Dustbowl，带着大灾变音乐专辑《黑暗之日电台》向你走来。跟我一起收听经典热门歌曲、独立音乐和后启示录时代的精彩混响。请记住，或许我们正生活在地狱，但仍"
"拥有美妙的音乐电台。"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Hey ladies and gentlemen, this is DJ Dustbowl, still kicking around and "
"coming in to deliver y'all's zombie survival tip of the day.  When facing "
"abominations, remember that knowledge is power.  If you end up with a corpse "
"and you have the means, don't just pulp the bejesus out of it, and, people, "
"don't eat it.  You've got all the time in the world, so why not take a knife "
"to poke, pry, and see how it ticks?  Some guy, somewhere, at some point said, "
"\"Know thy enemy.\"  I ain't the man to tell you if Napoleon or Eisenhower "
"said that, but I can guarantee that you'll be glad you got elbows deep in "
"some guts if it means you can figure which parts need bullets being sent "
"through."
msgstr ""
"Hey ladies and gentlemen, this is DJ Dustbowl, still kicking around and "
"coming in to deliver y'all's zombie survival tip of the day.  When facing "
"abominations, remember that knowledge is power.  If you end up with a corpse "
"and you have the means, don't just pulp the bejesus out of it, and, people, "
"don't eat it.  You've got all the time in the world, so why not take a knife "
"to poke, pry, and see how it ticks?  Some guy, somewhere, at some point said, "
"\"Know thy enemy.\"  I ain't the man to tell you if Napoleon or Eisenhower "
"said that, but I can guarantee that you'll be glad you got elbows deep in "
"some guts if it means you can figure which parts need bullets being sent "
"through."

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Uncle Sam's still kicking!  Yes, I was just as surprised as y'all listening "
"probably are.  That is, unless you happen to be an uncle named Sam, in which "
"case I'm DJ Dustbowl, this is my canine co-host, who's also Sam, and we want "
"to tell you good job for making it this far.  Jesus fuck, Sam, I think that "
"was our most brain-dead intro.  Anyways, moving swiftly along, members of the "
"federal government are still out there, folks.  Just this morning, a big old "
"heli flew past, pretty as can be.  I managed to hail them and found out that "
"they were ferrying some supplies over to what they're calling the \"Old "
"Guard's First Fleet.\"  Tap some wood, people, but it sounds like a bunch of "
"Navy and private ships are tootling along the coastline, cruising and looking "
"to clear some safe zones."
msgstr ""
"Uncle Sam's still kicking!  Yes, I was just as surprised as y'all listening "
"probably are.  That is, unless you happen to be an uncle named Sam, in which "
"case I'm DJ Dustbowl, this is my canine co-host, who's also Sam, and we want "
"to tell you good job for making it this far.  Jesus fuck, Sam, I think that "
"was our most brain-dead intro.  Anyways, moving swiftly along, members of the "
"federal government are still out there, folks.  Just this morning, a big old "
"heli flew past, pretty as can be.  I managed to hail them and found out that "
"they were ferrying some supplies over to what they're calling the \"Old "
"Guard's First Fleet.\"  Tap some wood, people, but it sounds like a bunch of "
"Navy and private ships are tootling along the coastline, cruising and looking "
"to clear some safe zones."

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Hey ladies and gentlemen, it's DJ Dustbowl back with Dark Days Radio, and "
"today is going to be less of a survival tip and more of a \"survivor's "
"lesson,\" cause we're going to be talking about guns.  Now, if you're hearing "
"this, you've probably already had to pull some triggers, but in case you've "
"been lucky, or you're just not that confident, I'm going to be walking "
"through field maintenance, cleaning, proper safety, and good stances.  "
"Knowing how to shoot a gun is worthless if you can't keep it running, and "
"even more useless if you can't ensure that you won't accidentally put a "
"bullet through yourself.  So, with Sam tucked safely away so she won't be "
"nosing around the guns (that's rule one, folks: don't let your dogs play with "
"your boom sticks), we can begin."
msgstr ""
"Hey ladies and gentlemen, it's DJ Dustbowl back with Dark Days Radio, and "
"today is going to be less of a survival tip and more of a \"survivor's "
"lesson,\" cause we're going to be talking about guns.  Now, if you're hearing "
"this, you've probably already had to pull some triggers, but in case you've "
"been lucky, or you're just not that confident, I'm going to be walking "
"through field maintenance, cleaning, proper safety, and good stances.  "
"Knowing how to shoot a gun is worthless if you can't keep it running, and "
"even more useless if you can't ensure that you won't accidentally put a "
"bullet through yourself.  So, with Sam tucked safely away so she won't be "
"nosing around the guns (that's rule one, folks: don't let your dogs play with "
"your boom sticks), we can begin."

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Hey, people of the wasteland, it's DJ Dustbowl on Dark Days Radio, and I've "
"got two words for y'all that are listening in: tear gas.  We've all heard of "
"these giant bugs that are crawling around, and if you haven't… I hate to "
"break it to you, my sweet summer child, but wake up and sniff the bug juice; "
"they're a thing.  Regardless, people, keep cool if you've got some tear gas "
"canisters on tap.  That crap lays a creepy crawler out like they got told "
"their free trial of life was up.  Sam's now got a whole bunch of fresh bug "
"meat to snack on after I had to try it out on some uninvited guests climbing "
"across my front door."
msgstr ""
"Hey, people of the wasteland, it's DJ Dustbowl on Dark Days Radio, and I've "
"got two words for y'all that are listening in: tear gas.  We've all heard of "
"these giant bugs that are crawling around, and if you haven't… I hate to "
"break it to you, my sweet summer child, but wake up and sniff the bug juice; "
"they're a thing.  Regardless, people, keep cool if you've got some tear gas "
"canisters on tap.  That crap lays a creepy crawler out like they got told "
"their free trial of life was up.  Sam's now got a whole bunch of fresh bug "
"meat to snack on after I had to try it out on some uninvited guests climbing "
"across my front door."

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"This is DJ Dustbowl on Dark Days Radio, saying hey to your eardrums with some "
"good tunes and a bunch of news.  Mutant meat makes for good eating, folks.  "
"Well, sort of.  While that stuff's packed with a whole bunch of trash, "
"forking a moderate serving onto y'all's plates ain't going to do much harm, "
"save for offending your taste buds.  It's a hell of a lot better than "
"starving, provided that you're mindful of how much you eat and don't go ham "
"on the mutants if you've got some other food on tap.  Like actual ham, for "
"example.  Daft jokes aside, I'd also like to give a shout out to the group of "
"Old Guard soldiers who served up a royal ass kicking to some raiders down by "
"<city>.  Go get them, guys."
msgstr ""
"This is DJ Dustbowl on Dark Days Radio, saying hey to your eardrums with some "
"good tunes and a bunch of news.  Mutant meat makes for good eating, folks.  "
"Well, sort of.  While that stuff's packed with a whole bunch of trash, "
"forking a moderate serving onto y'all's plates ain't going to do much harm, "
"save for offending your taste buds.  It's a hell of a lot better than "
"starving, provided that you're mindful of how much you eat and don't go ham "
"on the mutants if you've got some other food on tap.  Like actual ham, for "
"example.  Daft jokes aside, I'd also like to give a shout out to the group of "
"Old Guard soldiers who served up a royal ass kicking to some raiders down by "
"<city>.  Go get them, guys."

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"I'm DJ Dustbowl, this is my co-host, Sam, and my survival tip for today, "
"folks, is simply to be resourceful.  This sounds like a whole lot of vague "
"bullshit, I know, but I managed to find another survivor broadcasting on ham "
"radio.  We got to talking, and this crazy motherfucker has apparently made a "
"complete suit of armor from sheet metal padded with ripped-up body pillows, a "
"mace from plumbing pipes, and has retooled their old hatchback into a fucking "
"armored brick.  People, while we may be living in a wasteland, with some "
"creativity, we can still make it ours.  So, I'm going to queue up an "
"appropriate track, Sam, you sign us off, and to all of you listening… chin up "
"and say, \"Welcome to my wasteland!\""
msgstr ""
"I'm DJ Dustbowl, this is my co-host, Sam, and my survival tip for today, "
"folks, is simply to be resourceful.  This sounds like a whole lot of vague "
"bullshit, I know, but I managed to find another survivor broadcasting on ham "
"radio.  We got to talking, and this crazy motherfucker has apparently made a "
"complete suit of armor from sheet metal padded with ripped-up body pillows, a "
"mace from plumbing pipes, and has retooled their old hatchback into a fucking "
"armored brick.  People, while we may be living in a wasteland, with some "
"creativity, we can still make it ours.  So, I'm going to queue up an "
"appropriate track, Sam, you sign us off, and to all of you listening… chin up "
"and say, \"Welcome to my wasteland!\""

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"What's up, people of <the_cataclysm>?  I'm DJ Dustbowl, this is my canine "
"partner in crime, Sam, and you're listening to Dark Days Radio, but… let me "
"shut my mouth for a bit.\n"
"\n"
"\"Hey hey, this is Anarchy, former writer, now turned apocalypse survivor and "
"wearer of oven-derived sheet metal armor.\"\n"
"\n"
"Aren't you forgetting, \"Driver of a hatchback turned death brick?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Yes.  That's an important part of my zombie-trashing credentials.\"\n"
"\n"
"So yeah, ladies and gentlemen, if you didn't catch my last broadcast, I did "
"the impossible: I found, quite possibly, the only other living, breathing "
"nerd operating a radio on the eastern seaboard.\n"
"\n"
"\"Truly, we are an endangered species.\"\n"
"\n"
"That we are, but, Anarchy, please enlighten the people bunkering down on how "
"you got here.\n"
"\n"
"\"Let's just say… a lot of zombies got introduced to the front grill of the "
"death brick.\"\n"
"\n"
"Metal.  Now, folks, I'm going to step out for a smoke, and I'll leave y'all "
"in Anarchy's hands.  I'm not responsible for anything that gets said.\n"
"\n"
"\"OK, so I'm going to be bringing you whatever music I feel like playing, as "
"well as tips, tricks, and excerpts from whatever I've been writing in this "
"apocalyptic hellscape.  But before we launch, I'd like to give some dad "
"advice.  Don't forget to work on your personal projects, people.  I know "
"you've got plenty of time sitting in those shelters of yours.\""
msgstr ""
"\"各位幸存者还好吗？我是DJ沙尘暴，这是我的犯罪搭档——狗子山姆，您现在收听的是《暗夜电台》…不过嘛，我先闭嘴一会儿。\"\n"
"\n"
"\"咳咳，我是无政府，前文字工作者，现末日生存专家兼烤箱改造铠甲发明人。\"\n"
"\n"
"是不是忘了说\"两厢车改装死亡战车驾驶员\"？\n"
"\n"
"\"啊对，这可是我碾压丧尸的重要资历。\"\n"
"\n"
"没错女士们先生们，如果错过上期节目，我可是完成了奇迹——找到了东海岸可能仅存的、还在用电台喘气的另一个书呆子。\n"
"\n"
"\"说真的，咱们这类人比大熊猫还稀罕。\"\n"
"\n"
"可不是嘛！不过无政府啊，给地堡里的乡亲们讲讲你怎么活到现在的？\n"
"\n"
"\"这么说吧…很多丧尸和我的死亡战车前脸进行了深度交流。\"\n"
"\n"
"够硬核！好了各位，我出去抽根烟，把话筒交给无政府。待会儿无论听到什么离谱内容都别找我。\n"
"\n"
"\"OK，接下来我会随机播放音乐，分享生存技巧，顺便念点在这个地狱里写的文字。但开场前先来点老爹式忠告：别忘了经营你的个人项目啊朋友们，蹲防空洞的时候可有的"
"是时间。\""

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"It's time to line up some fresh tracks and for y'all to crank up the volume "
"(don't do that if you're in an infested area), because I'm DJ Dustbowl and "
"you're rocking along to Dark Days Radio.  It's just me and Sam in the studio "
"again, folks.  Anarchy's on the road back home, and we just wanna say that it "
"was a pleasure having him join us in manning Dark Days Radio for a while.  "
"So, Anarchy, if you're driving along and tuning in as well, have a safe trip "
"in your death brick, you sheet metal-wearing lunatic.  Hallelujah to have had "
"someone like you kick around the set, and hallelujah for all the new tracks "
"you brought in for us!"
msgstr ""
"It's time to line up some fresh tracks and for y'all to crank up the volume "
"(don't do that if you're in an infested area), because I'm DJ Dustbowl and "
"you're rocking along to Dark Days Radio.  It's just me and Sam in the studio "
"again, folks.  Anarchy's on the road back home, and we just wanna say that it "
"was a pleasure having him join us in manning Dark Days Radio for a while.  "
"So, Anarchy, if you're driving along and tuning in as well, have a safe trip "
"in your death brick, you sheet metal-wearing lunatic.  Hallelujah to have had "
"someone like you kick around the set, and hallelujah for all the new tracks "
"you brought in for us!"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Attention folks, this is DJ Dustbowl in with an emergency announcement for "
"anyone that happens to be listening.  I don't know if it's just localized to "
"here or is widespread, but crap's going down outside.  Reality's breaking, "
"people, just like when this shitshow started.  Stay indoors at all costs, "
"close any curtains and barricade the doors for good measure, and, for the "
"love of God, if you hear voices outside, ignore them!  They're not human.  "
"We're going to be going off air and heading below ground while this crapshoot "
"runs its course.  Have faith, people, we'll all get through this one as well. "
" Just don't go loony on me, and again, don't, listen, to the voices!"
msgstr ""
"Attention folks, this is DJ Dustbowl in with an emergency announcement for "
"anyone that happens to be listening.  I don't know if it's just localized to "
"here or is widespread, but crap's going down outside.  Reality's breaking, "
"people, just like when this shitshow started.  Stay indoors at all costs, "
"close any curtains and barricade the doors for good measure, and, for the "
"love of God, if you hear voices outside, ignore them!  They're not human.  "
"We're going to be going off air and heading below ground while this crapshoot "
"runs its course.  Have faith, people, we'll all get through this one as well. "
" Just don't go loony on me, and again, don't, listen, to the voices!"

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Ok, ladies and gentlemen, this is DJ Dustbowl, you're tuned into Dark Days "
"Radio, and if you're hearing this, then let's have an amen because it means "
"we all made it out of the storm.  That is, if the storm was a widespread "
"thing and not just neatly centered atop my head.  If that's the case and "
"y'all didn't catch my broadcast, the bottom line's that reality was breaking, "
"just like when this nonsense started.  Now, I don't know if it'll happen "
"again, but let's use today's survival tip slot to see what we can learn from "
"it.  Number one, folks, if reality's shitting the bed, don't try to fight "
"anything that appears.  If you're caught outside, my advice is to just run "
"for cover, and you'd be best served by snuggling underground.  Failing that, "
"closing all the curtains and barricading the doors will work in a pinch.  "
"Most importantly, people, if you hear something outside, regardless of what "
"it might be, stuff your ears and ignore it.  You'll hear things that will "
"make you want to open the front door.  I heard… I opened up.  You don't want "
"to see what'll be waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"Ok, ladies and gentlemen, this is DJ Dustbowl, you're tuned into Dark Days "
"Radio, and if you're hearing this, then let's have an amen because it means "
"we all made it out of the storm.  That is, if the storm was a widespread "
"thing and not just neatly centered atop my head.  If that's the case and "
"y'all didn't catch my broadcast, the bottom line's that reality was breaking, "
"just like when this nonsense started.  Now, I don't know if it'll happen "
"again, but let's use today's survival tip slot to see what we can learn from "
"it.  Number one, folks, if reality's shitting the bed, don't try to fight "
"anything that appears.  If you're caught outside, my advice is to just run "
"for cover, and you'd be best served by snuggling underground.  Failing that, "
"closing all the curtains and barricading the doors will work in a pinch.  "
"Most importantly, people, if you hear something outside, regardless of what "
"it might be, stuff your ears and ignore it.  You'll hear things that will "
"make you want to open the front door.  I heard… I opened up.  You don't want "
"to see what'll be waiting for you."

#: data/json/snippets/radio.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
msgid ""
"Hey people, it's DJ Dustbowl again, back gon… on Dark Days Radio.  I'm sorry "
"if I'm slurring my words today, but I've been hitting the boose real fucking "
"hard.  It's all okay, I guess.  It's not like anyone's listenizng to this "
"trash anyway.  Y'aulll are probably all dead.  God knnows, maybe ty'all are "
"dead because of me as well.\n"
"\n"
"In his calr.  He was sitdting in his car.  I'm so sorry.  Something had torn "
"it open: hallf of it was missssing when I found it.  It was in better "
"caondition than what used to be …kshssssssk.  He… it, had already reanimated, "
"and …kshhhsk… so many tentacles.  Dear god.  Why cahn't you just let corpses "
"rot in peace?  Why did you have to turn him into that?  It's all my fault.  I "
"should havne never asked him to make it over.  DI burned and buried it.  I'm "
"so focking sorry.  Stupid fucking make-believe DJ, pretending to run a radio "
"show and getting people killled becauuse he's lonely.  I shold stay alone.  I "
