"\n"
"I unterstand now.  I understand why I heard you icn the… portal storm and why "
"you told me to comme out.  Did you want revenge?  I'm so sorry.  I hate "
"myself.  I fucking haatte myself.  I'm sorry, Anarchy."
msgstr ""
"Hey people, it's DJ Dustbowl again, back gon… on Dark Days Radio.  I'm sorry "
