#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
msgid "It's a tape of '70s rock.  All original hits!  All original artists!"
msgstr "這是個裝著 70 年代搖滾樂的錄音帶。充滿原創的暢銷歌曲！都是原創的音樂家！"

#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
msgid "You've found the fabled America Online disk graveyard!"
msgstr "你已經找到了傳說中的 \"美國線上\" 的磁碟墳場!"

#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
msgid "Empty jewelboxes litter the landscape."
msgstr "空珠寶盒在這裡堆得亂七八糟。"

#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
msgid "It's the astounding meta-object."
msgstr "這是個驚人的中繼物件。"

#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
msgid "Ed McMahon stands here, lost in thought.  Seeing you, he bellows, \"YES SIR!\""
msgstr "艾德·麦克马洪在这里站着沉思，看到你后，他大喊到：\"是的，长官！\""

#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
msgid "…thingy???"
msgstr "……某种东西？？？"

#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
