msgstr "可更換超大型蓄電池"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "swappable very large storage battery"
msgid ""
"A battery for storing electrical power, and discharging it to power "
"electrical devices built into the vehicle.  This one is mounted on a quick "
"release framework to allow it to be easily swapped, though it still weighs so "
"much that a lifting tool of some kind is necessary for most people."
msgstr "一種用於儲存電力並為車輛內置的電氣設備供電的電池。這個安裝在一個能快速取出的框架上，以便輕鬆更換，它仍然很重，以致於大多數人都需要使用起重工具。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "swappable large storage battery"
msgstr "可更換大型蓄電池"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "swappable large storage battery"
msgid ""
"A battery for storing electrical power, and discharging it to power "
"electrical devices built into the vehicle.  This one is mounted on a quick "
"release framework to allow it to be easily swapped, though it still weighs so "
"much that a lifting tool of some kind is necessary for some people."
msgstr "一種用於儲存電力並為車輛內置的電氣設備供電的電池。這個安裝在一個能快速取出的框架上，以便輕鬆更換，它仍然很重，以致於一些人需要使用起重工具。"

