#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cloth flap door"
msgid "A cloth sheet that can be fastened into a closed position to act as a door."
msgstr "一块可以系紧关闭的布门帘。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "cloth curtain door"
msgstr "帆布滑門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cloth curtain door"
msgid "A cloth sheet that can be slid into a closed position to act as a door."
msgstr "一块可以拉起关闭的布门帘。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "opaque door"
msgstr "不透明門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "opaque door"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "opaque wooden door"
msgid "A door.  Solid construction means you can't see through it when closed."
msgstr "一扇門。實心的結構意味著你在它關閉時無法看到外面。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty door"
msgstr "重型門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty door"
msgid "A strong door.  Has a window so you can see out of it, even when closed."
msgstr "一扇堅固的門。上面有窗戶, 因此即使它關閉時你也可以看到外面。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty opaque door"
msgstr "重型不透明門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty opaque door"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "opaque hatch"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "shutter door"
msgid "A strong door.  Solid construction means you can't see through it when closed."
msgstr "一扇堅固的門。堅固的實心結構意味著你在它關閉時無法看到外面。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "internal door"
msgstr "內部門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "internal door"
msgid ""
"An interior door.  Solid construction means you can't see through it when "
"closed."
msgstr "一扇內部的門。堅固的實心結構意味著你在它關閉時無法看到外面。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "hatch"
msgstr "艙門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hatch"
msgid "A strong door.  A window lets you see through it when closed."
msgstr "一扇堅固的門。在關閉時你能從窗戶看到外面。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "opaque hatch"
msgstr "不透明艙門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty hatch"
msgstr "重型艙門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty hatch"
msgid "A very strong door.  A window lets you see through it when closed."
msgstr "一扇非常堅固的門。在關閉時你能從窗戶看到外面。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty opaque hatch"
msgstr "重型不透明艙門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty opaque hatch"
msgid ""
"A very strong door.  Solid construction means you can't see through it when "
"closed."
msgstr "一扇非常堅固的門。堅固的實心結構意味著你在它關閉時無法看到外面。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wooden door"
msgstr "木門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "opaque wooden door"
msgstr "不透明木門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "trunk door"
msgstr "行李箱門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "trunk door"
msgid "A short door.  You can always see over it, open or closed."
msgstr "一扇矮門。你可以看向外面, 無論是開著或關著。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty trunk door"
msgstr "重型行李箱門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty trunk door"
msgid "A strong, short door.  You can always see over it, open or closed."
msgstr "一扇堅固的矮門。你可以看向外面, 無論是開著或關著。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "shutter door"
msgstr "百葉門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "sliding door"
msgstr "滑門"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "sliding door"
msgid "A door.  A window lets you see through it when closed."
msgstr "一扇門。在關閉時你能從窗戶看到外面。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "suspending for butchering"
msgid_plural "suspending for butchering"
msgstr[0] "屠宰吊架"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "boom crane"
msgstr "吊桿起重機"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "boom crane"
msgid ""
"A rigid steel boom crane.  If it is in your line of sight and within two "
"tiles of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you want to jack "
"up the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy "
"component like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must "
"have line of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"一台坚固的钢制吊臂起重机。当它安装在你视野内的载具上且距离目标载具两格内时，能够当作千斤顶使用，将其他载具抬起来更换轮胎。当它安装在你视野内的载具上且距离目"
"标四格内时，能够当作起重机使用，更换沉重的载具部件，例如引擎。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "internal boom crane"
msgstr "內部吊臂起重機"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "telescopic crane"
msgstr "伸縮臂起重機"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "telescopic crane"
msgid ""
"An extendable cantilever crane.  If it is in your line of sight and within "
"two tiles of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you want to "
"jack up the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy "
"component like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must "
"have line of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"一台可伸缩吊臂起重机。当它安装在你视野内的载具上且距离目标载具两格内时，能够当作千斤顶使用，将其他载具抬起来更换轮胎。当它安装在你视野内的载具上且距离目标四"
"格内时，能够当作起重机使用，更换沉重的载具部件，例如引擎。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "pallet lifter"
msgid ""
"A small pallet lifter.  If it is in your line of sight and within two tiles "
"of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you want to jack up "
"the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy component "
"like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must have line "
"of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of it."
msgstr ""
"一台小型托盘升降机。当它安装在你视野内的载具上且距离目标载具两格内时，能够当作千斤顶使用，将其他载具抬起来更换轮胎。当它安装在你视野内的载具上且距离目标四格"
"内时，能够当作起重机使用，更换沉重的载具部件，例如引擎。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "forklift arms"
msgstr "叉车臂"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "forklift arms"
msgid ""
"A pair of forklift arms.  If it is in your line of sight and within two tiles "
"of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you want to jack up "
"the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy component "
"like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must have line "
"of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of it."
msgstr ""
"一对叉车升降臂。当它安装在你视野内的载具上且距离目标载具两格内时，能够当作千斤顶使用，将其他载具抬起来更换轮胎。当它安装在你视野内的载具上且距离目标四格内时"
"，能够当作起重机使用，更换沉重的载具部件，例如引擎。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "rockwheel"
msgid ""
"A large metal disc, powered by the vehicle's engines.  Use the vehicle "
"controls to turn it on or off.  When turned on, it will stop the vehicle "
"unless it has a strong engine.  When turned on, it will dig a shallow pit in "
"dirt.  Mount it on the edge of your vehicle."
msgstr "一個由車輛引擎發動的巨大金屬圓盤，在載具控制板中開關它。當開啟時，除非有足夠好的引擎不然載具會停住，並把經過的泥土地挖成淺坑。必須安裝在車輛的邊緣處。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "air jack system"
msgstr "氣壓千斤頂"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "motorcycle kickstand"
msgid ""
"A kickstand to keep the bike from falling over.  You could use this to lean "
"it forward or backward to change a tire."
msgstr "用來防止車子倒下的腳架。您可以利用它向前或向後傾斜以更換輪胎。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "frame"
msgstr "框架"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "frame"
msgid ""
"A metal framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and it can "
"be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size."
msgstr "一個金屬框架，其他的車輛零件可以鑲嵌上去，而且能連接其他框架去增加車輛的大小。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foldable light frame"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foldable orichalcum frame"
msgid ""
"A light metal framework, designed to fold.  Other vehicle components can be "
"mounted on it.  If all the frames and components of a vehicle are foldable, "
"the vehicle can be folding into a small package and picked up as a normal "
"item."
msgstr "一个可折叠的轻型金属车辆框架。其他载具部件能够安装在它上面。如果构成载具的所有框架和部件都可折叠，那么这辆载具能够被打包折叠并可像普通物品一样被拾取带走。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foldable wooden frame"
msgid ""
"A light wooden framework, designed to fold.  Other vehicle components can be "
"mounted on it.  If all the frames and components of a vehicle are foldable, "
"the vehicle can be folding into a small package and picked up as a normal "
"item."
msgstr "一个可折叠的轻型木制车辆框架。其他载具部件能够安装在它上面。如果构成载具的所有框架和部件都可折叠，那么这辆载具能够被打包折叠并可像普通物品一样被拾取带走。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wooden frame"
msgid ""
"A wooden framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and it "
"can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size.  Wood and "
"nail construction means it can be constructed and added to the vehicle "
"without welding tools."
msgstr "一個木製框架，其他的車輛零件可以鑲嵌上去，而且能連接其他框架去增加車輛的大小。木工建造代表它無需焊接工具就能被建造或安裝在車輛上。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "skateboard deck"
msgid ""
"A light wooden skateboard deck.  Other skateboard components can be mounted "
"on it."
msgstr "轻便结实的木制板材，可以让其他的滑板部件恰当地安装在上边。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "light wooden frame"
msgid ""
"A light wooden framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and "
"it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size.  Wood and "
"rope constructions means it can be constructed and added to the vehicle "
"without welding tools or nails."
msgstr "一個輕型的木製框架，其他的車輛零件可以鑲嵌上去，而且能連接其他框架去增加車輛的大小。框架使用木頭和繩索固定，因此無需焊接工具就能被建造或安裝在車輛上。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty frame"
msgid ""
"A heavy metal framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and "
"it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size.  Increased "
"mass makes it more resistant to damage in collisions."
msgstr "一個重型的金屬框架，其他的車輛零件可以鑲嵌上去，而且能連接其他框架去增加車輛的大小。強化了質量使它在碰撞時更能抵禦損傷。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "extra light frame"
msgstr "超輕型框架"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "extra light frame"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foldable extra light frame"
msgid ""
"A light metal framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and "
"it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size."
msgstr "一個輕型的金屬框架，其他的車輛零件可以鑲嵌上去，而且能連接其他框架去增加車輛的大小。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "foldable extra light frame"
msgstr "超轻车架（可折叠）"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "aisle lights"
msgstr "過道燈"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "atomic lamp"
msgid ""
"A bright light, self-powered by an atomic decay reaction that never stops.  "
"When turned on, it illuminates several squares inside the vehicle."
msgstr "一盏明亮的原子灯，采用内部核能供电，开启时照亮车内数格空间。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "atomic nightlight"
msgstr "原子夜燈"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "atomic nightlight"
msgid ""
"A very dim light, self-powered by an atomic decay reaction that never stops.  "
"When turned on, it illuminates a single square inside the vehicle that isn't "
"suitable for crafting."
msgstr "一盏十分昏暗的原子灯，采用内部核能供电，开启时照亮车内一格空间。你无法在这么昏暗的灯光下制造物品。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "floodlight"
msgid ""
"A very bright, circular light that illuminates the area outside the vehicle "
"when turned on."
msgstr "一盏十分明亮的泛光灯，开启时照亮车外大片圆形区域。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "directed floodlight"
msgid ""
"A very bright, directed light that illuminates a half-circular area outside "
"the vehicle when turned on.  During installation, you can choose what "
"direction to point the light."
msgstr "一盏十分明亮的定向泛光灯，开启时照亮车外大片半圆形区域。安装时可以选择车灯的方向。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "headlight"
msgstr "車頭燈"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "headlight"
msgid ""
"A bright light that illuminates a narrow cone outside the vehicle when turned "
"on.  During installation, you can choose what direction to point the light, "
"so multiple headlights can illuminate the sides or rear, as well as the front."
msgstr "一盏明亮的探照灯，开启时照亮车外一片锥形区域。安装时可以选择车灯方向，多盏方向不同的车灯能照亮载具四周。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "motorcycle headlight"
msgid ""
"A small, lightweight, bright light that illuminates a narrow cone outside the "
"vehicle when turned on.  During installation, you can choose what direction "
"to point the light, so multiple headlights can illuminate the sides or rear, "
"as well as the front."
msgstr "一盏小巧轻便明亮的探照灯，开启时照亮车外一片锥形区域。安装时可以选择车灯方向，多盏方向不同的车灯能照亮载具四周。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wide angle headlight"
msgstr "廣角車頭燈"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wide angle headlight"
msgid ""
"A bright light that illuminates a wide cone outside the vehicle when turned "
"on.  During installation, you can choose what direction to point the light, "
"so multiple headlights can illuminate the sides or rear, as well as the front."
msgstr "一盏明亮的探照灯，开启时照亮车外一片广角锥形区域。安装时可以选择车灯方向，多盏方向不同的车灯能照亮载具四周。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part ""
msgid ""
"Emergency lights, like a police car's or ambulance's, mounted on the "
"vehicle's roof.  Flashes between red and blue when turned on, attracting "
"attention without illuminating the area."
msgstr "一盏安装在车顶上的警灯，和警车和救护车顶上的一样。开启时发出红蓝相间的光，照亮不了很大范围但能够吸引附近人的注意。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "blue light"
msgstr "藍燈"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "red light"
msgstr "紅燈"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "foot pedals"
msgstr "腳踏板"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foot pedals"
msgid ""
"A set of bicycle-style foot pedals attached to a crank.  If mounted on the "
"same tile as a seat, they allow you to use your stamina to produce engine "
"power, using your legs.  Provides more power the stronger you are."
msgstr "一组连接到曲轴的自行车式脚踏板。 如果与座椅安装在同一块格上，它们可以让你利用你的腿部耐力来产生引擎动力。 你越强壮，提供的动力就越多。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "hand rims"
msgstr "輪椅手推輪"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hand rims"
msgid ""
"A set of wheelchair-style hoop hand rims, often attached directly to the "
"wheels.  If mounted on the same tile as seat, they allow you to use your "
"stamina to produce engine power, using your arms.  Provides more power the "
"stronger you are."
msgstr "一组轮椅式的环形手圈，通常直接连接到轮子上。 如果与座椅安装在同一块格上，它们可以让你用你的手臂，通过你的耐力来产生引擎动力。 你越强壮，提供的动力就越多。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "hand paddles"
msgstr "划水板"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "reins and tackle"
msgstr "韁繩和束具"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reins and tackle"
msgid ""
"A set of leather bindings to control a creature pulling a vehicle, such as a "
"cart."
msgstr "用来控制可骑乘生物的全套皮革缰绳和挽具，让它能拉动载具，就和马车一样。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wing mirror"
msgstr "後視鏡"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wing mirror"
msgid ""
"A small mirror, mounted outside the vehicle.  If you see the mirror, your "
"vision is expanded as though you were standing where the mirror is."
msgstr "一個安裝在車外的小鏡子。如果你看到鏡子, 你的視野就像你站在鏡子所在的地方一樣。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "inboard mirror"
msgstr "車內後視鏡"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "inboard mirror"
msgid ""
"A small mirror, mounted inside the vehicle.  If you see the mirror, your "
"vision is expanded as though you were standing where the mirror is."
msgstr "一個安裝在車內的小鏡子。如果你看到鏡子, 你的視野就像你站在鏡子所在的地方一樣。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/modular_tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vehicle tool station"
msgid_plural "vehicle tool stations"
msgstr[0] "载具工具站"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/modular_tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mounted kitchen"
msgid_plural "mounted kitchens"
msgstr[0] "車載廚房"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/modular_tools.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of "mounted kitchen"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "veh_tools_kitchen"
msgid ""
"A table rig with a faucet for water tank access, fume hood, drawers and "
"fixtures for storing tools, low power electric connectors and valves for fuel "
"tank connections."
msgstr ""
"A table rig with a faucet for water tank access, fume hood, drawers and "
"fixtures for storing tools, low power electric connectors and valves for fuel "
"tank connections."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/modular_tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mounted workshop"
msgid_plural "mounted workshops"
msgstr[0] "車載作坊"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/modular_tools.json
#. ~ Description of "mounted workshop"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "veh_tools_workshop"
msgid ""
"A table rig with drawers and fixtures for storing tools, wiring for high "
"power electric connectors and valves for fuel tank connections."
msgstr ""
"A table rig with drawers and fixtures for storing tools, wiring for high "
"power electric connectors and valves for fuel tank connections."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/motor.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "electric motor"
msgid "An electric motor."
msgstr "一個電動馬達。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/motor.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "tiny electric motor"
msgid ""
"A tiny electric motor just the right size for powering a bicycle or a hedge "
"trimmer."
msgstr "尺寸剛好適合為自行車或樹籬修剪機提供動力的微型電動馬達。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/motor.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small electric motor"
msgid ""
"A light-duty electrical motor, strong enough for an electric moped or golf "
"cart."
msgstr "一個輕型電動馬達。用來為電動助力車或高爾夫球車提供動力已經夠用了。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/motor.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_electric"
msgid ""
"A medium-duty electrical motor, suitable for powering ultra-light vehicles, "
"or as part of a hybrid gas-electric drivetrain."
msgstr "一個中型電動馬達，適用於為超輕型車輛提供動力，或作為混合油電傳動系統的一部分。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/motor.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "large electric motor"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty electrical motor, capable of propelling a full-size car or SUV "
"through electric power alone, provided you have the battery capacity."
msgstr "一個重型電動馬達，只要有足夠的電量，就能僅使用電力來驅動全尺寸汽車或休旅車（SUV）。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/motor.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "enhanced electric motor"
msgid ""
"A powerful high-performance electric motor, as found in those consumer "
"electric sports cars with ridiculous, ludicrous, or similarly hyperbolic "
"acceleration options.  It needs a lot of battery power."
msgstr "一個強力的高性能電動馬達，就像裝配在那些具有荒謬可笑或令人匪夷所思加速選項的消費性電動跑車一樣。它需要消耗大量的電力。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/motor.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "super electric motor"
msgid ""
"A massive and extremely powerful electric motor, delivering high torque at "
"the cost of significant power drain, this would be well suited to an electric "
"racing car."
msgstr "一個巨型且極其強力的電動馬達，以大量電力消耗為代價提供高扭矩，這非常適合電動賽車。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/motor.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "1,300 HP electric train engine"
msgid ""
"An enormous and heavy electric traction motor, powerful enough to pull a "
"train."
msgstr "巨大而沉重的電力牽引電機，強大到足以拉動火車。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/rams.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part ""
msgid ""
"A reinforced ram.  Place at the edge of vehicle to reduce damage taken in "
"collisions, and to increase damaged delivered in collisions, if the ram is "
"the first vehicle part to collide."
msgstr "一个强化撞锤。将它安装在载具的边沿能减少碰撞对载具的损伤。而且能够让被撞上的家伙伤得更惨。"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/rams.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "superalloy ram"
msgstr "超合金保險桿"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/rams.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy steel ram"
