#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "portable survival battery"
msgid_plural "portable survival batteries"
msgstr[0] "portable survival batteries"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bag of holding"
msgid_plural "bags of holding"
msgstr[0] "攜行袋"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bag of holding"
msgid ""
"A sleek, unfathomably-complicated machine covered in dozens of blinking "
"lights, worn on the back by sturdy faux-leather straps.  An electrode dangles "
"from the back, attaching to your forehead.  How it operates without "
"annihilating spacetime isn't quite clear, but a localized portal allows "
"things to be stored in an extradimensional space."
msgstr ""
"這個光滑，極端複雜的機器表面閃爍著數十盞小燈，背面採用堅固的人造皮革繫帶。電極從背面垂下並連接在你的前額上。你並不是很清楚這個裝置如何運作而不造成時空湮滅，"
"但是這個隨身傳送門允許你將事物存儲在超維空間中。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "titanium vest"
msgid_plural "titanium vests"
msgstr[0] "鈦製背心"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "titanium vest"
msgid ""
"A lightweight armor vest made of pieces of titanium sewn together, with cloth "
"padding for comfort.  Brittle against blunt force, but highly resistant to "
"cuts and corrosion."
msgstr "這款輕質盔甲背心由鈦合金縫製而成，布料襯墊舒適。雖然鈍擊防護力弱，但對切割和腐蝕具有很強的防護。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hologram cloak Mk. II"
msgid_plural "hologram cloaks Mk. II"
msgstr[0] "全息投影披风Mk.II型"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hologram cloak Mk. II"
msgid ""
"When activated, creates a holographic decoy of its wearer.  Powered by an "
"experimental n-space energy generator, it slowly recharges itself for free, "
"probably by siphoning excess energy from some unknown hyperdimensional space."
msgstr "激活后，将产生一个穿戴者的全息投影。它由一个实验型n维空间能量发生器供能，无消耗地缓慢为自身充能，很可能是吸收某个未知的高维空间中多余的能量来充能的。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sentinel-lx cloak"
msgid_plural "sentinel-lx cloaks"
msgstr[0] "哨兵-LX披风"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "sentinel-lx cloak"
msgid ""
"The vantablack cloak of sentinel-lx hangs around ones shoulders as a solid, "
"unnatural shadow.  Made from woven graphene, it's lightweight and resistant, "
"but cannot be repaired."
msgstr "哨兵-lx型机器人的超黑色长披风，披在肩上如同一个实体而不自然的阴影。由编织石墨烯制成，轻便且坚固，但无法被修复。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "IX-2110 computer"
msgid "IX-2110 computer"
msgid_plural "IX-2110 computers"
msgstr[0] "IX-2110 计算机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "IX-2110 computer"
msgid ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally designed "
"to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the most "
"successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were produced "
"and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the early "
"Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the "
"discontinuity has left slightly slower than its modern counterparts."
msgstr ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally designed "
"to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the most "
"successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were produced "
"and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the early "
"Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the "
"discontinuity has left slightly slower than its modern counterparts."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "IX-2110 computer" of item "IX-2110 computer"
msgid ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally designed "
"to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the most "
"successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were produced "
"and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the early "
"Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the "
"discontinuity means its only slightly less capable than its modern "
"counterparts."
msgstr ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally designed "
"to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the most "
"successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were produced "
"and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the early "
"Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the "
"discontinuity means its only slightly less capable than its modern "
"counterparts."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "IX-2110 computer"
msgid "IX-2330S computer"
msgid_plural "IX-2330S computers"
msgstr[0] "IX-2330S 计算机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "IX-2330S computer" of item "IX-2110 computer"
msgid ""
"A rugged and radiation shielded wirst computer specifically designed to "
"support salvage operations.  It can perform general computing tasks and might "
"be used to interface with most ancient computer systems."
msgstr ""
"A rugged and radiation shielded wirst computer specifically designed to "
"support salvage operations.  It can perform general computing tasks and might "
"be used to interface with most ancient computer systems."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quantum solar backpack (folded)"
msgid_plural "quantum solar backpacks (folded)"
msgstr[0] "量子太陽能板背包 (摺疊)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "quantum solar backpack (folded)"
msgid ""
"Personal portable charging system consisting of an array of quantum solar "
"panels neatly folded in the form of a large backpack.  It can be worn as one, "
"and has an integrated cable to plug it into a cable charger system.  Cutting "
"edge technology."
msgstr ""
"一套个人便携式充能系统，由一系列超能太阳能电池板组成，都被整齐地折叠并装入一个大背包。它可以一体式穿着在身上，并且集成了一条可插入电缆充电器的电缆。最新尖端"
"科技。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quantum solar backpack (unfolded)"
msgid_plural "quantum solar backpacks (unfolded)"
msgstr[0] "量子太陽能板背包 (展開)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "quantum solar backpack (unfolded)"
msgid ""
"Unfolded array of portable quantum solar panels ready to push some power into "
"an active cable charger system."
msgstr "展開的量子太陽能板， 將電力輸入已開啟的電纜充電系統。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of combat boots"
msgid "Modern oversized reinforced tactical combat boots.  Very durable."
msgstr ""
"一双具备良好的抓地力、增加脚踝稳定性以及可以保护足部的加大号现代战术靴，非常耐用。\n"
"\"外型很酷，结实耐用，功能性强，这样的一双鞋在末世来说尤为重要。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of tactical gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of oversized reinforced Kevlar tactical gloves.  Commonly used by "
"police and military units."
msgstr "一双加大号的凯夫拉强化战术手套，有防震，防滑等功能，于军方与警方之中广泛使用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Killophant gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Killophant gloves"
msgstr[0] "\"杀人象\"部队战术手套"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Killophant gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of reinforced Kevlar tactical gloves, specifically designed to "
"accommodate three-fingered Killophants.  Thinner than regular oversized "
"tactical gloves."
msgstr "一双凯夫拉强化战术手套，有防震、防滑等功能，是为\"杀人象\"部队特制的三指款，相比常规的加大号战术手套更加纤细。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leather belt"
msgid ""
"An XL leather belt.  Useful for making your pair of pants fit if you need "
"really big pants."
msgstr "一条特大号的皮革腰带。能让裤子穿起来更合身。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "police duty belt"
msgid ""
"An XL black leather belt used by extremely large uplifted police officers.  "
"It has several pouches and a holder for a baton."
msgstr "一条特大号的黑色皮带，适合那些体型巨大的基因擢升警察们佩戴。它上面有几个袋子和一个警棍的插销。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical full helmet"
msgid ""
"An all-encompassing massive black helmet that covers your entire face and "
"neck, providing excellent protection from all sorts of damage."
msgstr "一顶特大号的黑色极简头盔，覆盖面部和颈部，保护你免受各种伤害。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leg ammo pouch"
msgid ""
"An XL fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your leg; capable of holding "
"two magazines close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在腿上的特大号布包，能够装下两个弹匣，保证弹药随手取用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cecaelia wetsuit"
msgid_plural "Cecaelia wetsuits"
msgstr[0] "塞卡莉亚潜水服"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Cecaelia wetsuit"
msgid ""
"A wetsuit designed for the Octopus Uplifts known as Cecaelia.  This is the "
"explorer suit with no head or tentacle protection."
msgstr "一种为基因擢升的章鱼人而设计的潜水衣，被称为塞卡莉亚。这是没有头部或触角保护的探险者套装。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat wetsuit"
msgid_plural "combat wetsuits"
msgstr[0] "作戰潛水服"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "combat wetsuit"
msgid ""
"The combat version of the Cecaelia wetsuit; made of neoprene and Kevlar, it "
"will provide some level of protection for deep dwellers."
msgstr "塞卡莉亚潜水服的战斗版，由氯丁橡胶和凯夫拉制成，它将为深海居民提供一定程度的保护。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nanomesh vest"
msgid_plural "nanomesh vests"
msgstr[0] "纳米网背心"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "nanomesh vest"
msgid ""
"A lightweight nanomesh vest designed to face down many of the perils of space "
"travel.  These vests are mass produced and often stacked in starship lockers."
msgstr "一件轻便的纳米网背心，设计用于面对太空旅行时的诸多威胁。这些背心是工厂批量生产的，经常堆放在星际飞船的储物柜里。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "carbide cuirass"
msgid_plural "carbide cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "carbide cuirasses"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "carbide cuirass"
msgid ""
"This piece of armor hearkens back to renaissance designs.  It differs in that "
"it is cast as a single piece in deep space installations where conditions can "
"be controlled absolutely.  Not quite bulletproof, but it will stop most small "
"arms fire."
msgstr ""
"This piece of armor hearkens back to renaissance designs.  It differs in that "
"it is cast as a single piece in deep space installations where conditions can "
"be controlled absolutely.  Not quite bulletproof, but it will stop most small "
"arms fire."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vacuum cast cuirass"
msgid_plural "vacuum cast cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "真空铸造胸甲"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor_helmets.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raider's breaching helmet"
msgid_plural "raider's breaching helmets"
msgstr[0] "raider's breaching helmets"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor_helmets.json
#. ~ Description of "raider's breaching helmet"
msgid ""
"This helmet is designed for the individual that is worried about catching "
"heavy weapons fire to the face.  It is unwieldy and heavy, and lacks basic "
"environmental protection features, but it just might stop even the largest of "
"ballistic rounds."
msgstr "这种头盔是为那些担心被重型武器直击面部的人设计的。它既累赘又笨重，也缺乏基本的环境防护功能，但它甚至能挡住最大口径的弹药。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor_helmets.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "UICAS Tip of the Spear helmet"
msgid_plural "UICAS Tip of the Spear helmets"
msgstr[0] "UICAS \"矛尖\"头盔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor_helmets.json
#. ~ Description of "UICAS Tip of the Spear helmet"
msgid ""
"An all-environment combat helmet issued to UICA espatiers.  Commonly known as "
"'the jar' due to its unusual clear polymer canopy that leaves its wearer's "
"face visible."
msgstr "分发给UICA星际战士的全环境作战头盔。常被称为\"玻璃罐\"，因为它有着与众不同的透明聚合物面罩，可以看清佩戴者的脸。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor_helmets.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "UICAS Point of Impact helmet"
msgid_plural "UICAS Point of Impact helmets"
msgstr[0] "UICAS \"弹着点\"头盔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor_helmets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor_helmets.json
#. ~ Description of "UICAS Point of Impact helmet"
msgid ""
"A lightweight black helmet that provides excellent protection from all sorts "
"of damage, unless it's airborne.  UICAS makes the point of designing all "
"headgear whenever possible with clear faceplates, in order to provide a human "
"touch to all interactions."
msgstr "一顶轻便的黑色头盔，能够提供极好的伤害防护，除非是空气传播的病毒。UICAS 在设计头盔时极尽可能要求其具有清晰的前面罩，以便为所有互动提供人性化的感觉。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/battery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "suit battery"
msgid_plural "suit batteries"
msgstr[0] "太空服电池"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/battery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/battery.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "suit battery"
#. ~ Description of "suit battery"
msgid ""
"A heavy battery cell, compatible with most industrial equipment but "
"purposefully designed to power EVA suits  It's a bit too big to fit in most "
"portable tools."
msgstr "一个为给舱外活动套装供电而生的重型电池，与大多数工业设备兼容。它有点太大以至于不兼容大多数便携式工具。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Arms Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Arms Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 合金裝甲－手臂"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Legs Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Legs Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 合金裝甲－腿部"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Alarm System CBM installation data"
msgid_plural "Alarm System CBM installation data"
msgstr[0] "警報系統（CBM）安裝資料"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Description of "Alarm System CBM installation data"
msgid ""
"Precise step-by-step instructions and other required data for installation of "
"an Alarm System CBM, stored on a data card of proprietary form-factor, "
"designed to be used extensively by an Autodoc, and allowing bionic "
"installation with minimal failure chance.  An integrated security subroutine "
"renders it unusable after a single installation."
msgstr ""
"一套用于安装警报系统CBM的精确到每个步骤的指令和数据，存储于特殊规格的专有数据卡中，能够用于全自动医疗仪来将CBM安装失败率降到最低。其中包含的安全子程序"
"会使其在安装完CBM后立刻失效。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "LED Tattoo CBM installation data"
msgid_plural "LED Tattoo CBM installation data"
msgstr[0] "LED紋身（CBM）安裝資料"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Description of "LED Tattoo CBM installation data"
msgid ""
"Precise step-by-step instructions and other required data for installation of "
"an LED Tattoo CBM, stored on a data card of proprietary form-factor, designed "
"to be used extensively by an Autodoc, and allowing bionic installation with "
"minimal failure chance.  An integrated security subroutine renders it "
"unusable after a single installation."
msgstr ""
"一套用于安装LED纹身CBM的精确到每个步骤的指令和数据，存储于特殊规格的专有数据卡中，能够用于全自动医疗仪来将CBM安装失败率降到最低。其中包含的安全子程"
