msgid ""
"Precise step-by-step instructions and other required data for installation of "
"a Power Storage CBM Mk. II, stored on a data card of proprietary form-factor, "
"designed to be used extensively by an Autodoc, and allowing bionic "
"installation with minimal failure chance.  An integrated security subroutine "
"renders it unusable after a single installation."
