#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Throwing Assist CBM installation data"
msgid_plural "Throwing Assist CBM installation data"
msgstr[0] "投掷辅助CBM安装数据"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bionics_mainline_override.json
#. ~ Description of "Throwing Assist CBM installation data"
msgid ""
"Precise step-by-step instructions and other required data for installation of "
"a Throwing Assist CBM, stored on a data card of proprietary form-factor, "
"designed to be used extensively by an Autodoc, and allowing bionic "
"installation with minimal failure chance.  An integrated security subroutine "
"renders it unusable after a single installation."
msgstr ""
"一套用于安装投掷辅助CBM的精确到每个步骤的指令和数据，存储于特殊规格的专有数据卡中，能够用于全自动医疗仪来将CBM安装失败率降到最低。其中包含的安全子程序"
"会使其在安装完CBM后立刻失效。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "living brain in a jar"
msgid_plural "jars full of living brains"
msgstr[0] "一罐活生生的腦"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Description of "living brain in a jar"
msgid ""
"This jar contains a human brain kept alive by mi-go technology.  It has metal "
"veined tendrils that appear to allow it to connect to various devices."
msgstr "使用米戈技術保持活性的罐裝人腦。它有著金屬紋理的捲須，似乎可以將其連接到各種設備。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "humming heart"
msgid_plural "humming hearts"
msgstr[0] "蜂鳴之心"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Description of "humming heart"
msgid ""
"This heartlike organ has multiple valves and upon its proper removal from the "
"bioweapons corpse each valve sealed itself.  It hums gently in your hands, as "
"if waiting for an appropriate receptacle."
msgstr "这个类似心脏的器官上有多个瓣膜，当它被正确地从生物武器的尸体上移除之后，所有阀门都会自动封闭起来。它在你的手中轻声地嗡嗡作响，仿佛在等待一个合适的容器。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sensory cluster"
msgid_plural "sensory clusters"
msgstr[0] "感官集簇"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Description of "sensory cluster"
msgid ""
"This lump of flesh has various lobes protruding from it that at intervals "
"will emit toned sounds.  Perhaps it works via echolocation.  Like all mi-go "
"bioparts the openings on this piece closed up after it was cut free and it "
"seems to have gone into a form of hibernation with the pulses occurring "
"slower and slower as it conserves energy."
msgstr ""
"这个肉块上有各种突出的叶片，每隔一段时间就会发出不同音调的声音。也许它可以通过回声定位。就像其他的米·戈生物身体部件一样，这块躯体的开口在它被从尸体上切除后"
"就关闭了，它似乎进入了一种冬眠的形式，为了保存能量，脉动的速度越来越慢。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bioweapon chassis"
msgid_plural "bioweapon chassis"
msgstr[0] "生物武器底盘"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Description of "bioweapon chassis"
msgid ""
"This cross between a sea anemone and what you imagine a dragon's mouth would "
"look like is the core body of the bioweapon.  You cannot imagine what you "
"could make out of this but maybe someone somewhere does."
msgstr "这个看上去像海葵和你所想象的巨龙龙嘴杂交而成的怪物是某种生物武器的核心部件。你无法想象你还能把它用来做什么，但也许在某个地方有某个人能够将它派上用场。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken mi-go turret"
msgid_plural "broken mi-go turrets"
msgstr[0] "損毀的米戈砲塔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Description of "broken mi-go turret"
msgid ""
"A broken mi-go turret.  It's leaking fluids and smells you can't identify.  "
"Could be butchered for parts."
msgstr "一個損毀的的米戈砲塔，洩漏著一些你聞起來無法辨識的液體。可以屠宰以取得零件。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "vibrating bioblaster"
msgid_plural "vibrating bioblasters"
msgstr[0] "生化热熔炮（颤动）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/bioparts.json
#. ~ Description of gun "vibrating bioblaster"
#. ~ Description of "vibrating bioblaster"
msgid ""
"You ripped this from a mi-go abomination.  You think you should wear gloves "
"to reload it."
msgstr "这玩意是你从一台米·戈怪物上撕下来了的。你觉得自己在给它重新装填弹药时得戴上手套。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "original copy of Housefly"
msgid_plural "original copies of Housefly"
msgstr[0] "《家蠅》原本"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "original copy of Housefly"
msgid ""
"The only copy of Housefly in existence - a long book about three individuals "
"drawn together by fate in the early 1800s to save their English town of "
"Victoria from a mysterious threat.  You never got to publish it, but reading "
"it lets you forget the horrors of the Cataclysm, if only for a moment."
msgstr ""
"\"Housefly\"現存的唯一副本 - "
"一本關於三個人的長篇小說，在19世紀早期由命運匯集在一起，以拯救他們的英國小鎮維多利亞免受神秘的威脅。閱讀它可以讓你忘記大災變的恐怖，即使只是片刻也好。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 1"
msgid_plural "copies of Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 1"
msgstr[0] "《Salus IV 非官方歷史 Vol. 1》"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 1"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Frozen Hell, an unofficial history of Salus IV by Bette Lapin.  "
"Salus IV was founded in the early days of the Hyperspace Era as a joint "
"venture between Mercurial Genomics and a Soviet Design Bureau.  At its height "
"several hundred years ago Salus IV had just over 110 million citizens "
"(including both uplifts and humans). However, that population had begun to "
"decline even before the Discontinuity as people migrated to planets that, "
"while more hostile to life during the earliest colonization phases than Salus "
"IV, were much simpler to terraform into a place more enjoyable by human and "
"uplift citizens."
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到冰冻地狱，由贝特·拉宾编写的Salus IV星的非官方历史。Salus "
"IV星是在超空间时代早期，由水星基因公司和苏维埃设计局联合建立的。在几百年前的鼎盛时期，Salus "
"IV星上有约一亿一千万公民（包括擢升种族和人类），但即便是在大隔绝出现之前，星球人口就已经开始减少，因为人们迁移到了各个比Salus "
"IV星相对而言，处于在早期殖民阶段，生命更难生存的行星上，只因为对其他星球进行气候改造使其适应于人类及擢升动物生存要容易得多。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 2"
msgid_plural "copies of Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 2"
msgstr[0] "《Salus IV 非官方歷史 Vol. 2》"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 2"
msgid ""
"Even during the Discontinuity Salus IV's population continued to drop as "
"there were easier places to live even in the Salus system - from honeycombed "
"asteroid habitats to domed cities with gorgeous views.  Mercurial Genomics "
"was an early member of the nascent post-Discontinuity government efforts.  As "
"a result of this membership, they have successfully reclaimed Salus IV in the "
"court system set up by ESCA.  The Whately family, which runs Mercurial "
"Genomics, began leasing development and exploitation permits and allows the "
"establishment of minor UICA outposts within Salus IV.  There is an official "
"citizen count of less than twenty thousand sentient beings, albeit mostly in "
"orbit.  It is believed, however, that there are at least that many "
"non-citizen sentients spread amongst squatter, smuggler, pirate, and feral "
"uplift communities."
msgstr ""
"即使在大隔绝时期，Salus "
"IV星的人口依旧继续流失，因为在Salus星系中有更容易居住的地方，从蜂巢形小行星居住站，到有壮丽美景的圆顶城市。水星基因公司也是努力构建后隔绝时代新兴政府"
"的早期成员之一。由于这一成员资格，他们也成功地在ESCA建立的法院系统中收回了Salus "
"IV星系的主权。沃特利家族，作为水星基因公司的实际控制者，开始出售开发和利用许可证，并允许在Salus "
"IV星上建立小型UICA前哨站。据官方统计，Salus IV星目前仅存不到5万智能生命体，大部分居住在Salus "
"IV星轨道上。但据信，至少有许多非公民的智能生命散布在星球地表居住，包含非法定居者，走私者，海盗和野生基因擢升动物种群。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 3"
msgid_plural "copies of Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 3"
msgstr[0] "《Salus IV 非官方歷史 Vol. 3》"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Unofficial History of Salus IV Vol. 3"
msgid ""
"The Salus system is what is called a hinge system for the new FTL travels.  "
"This system contains a number of easy exit points to star systems that have "
"no other easy way to travel to each other than through a series of systems "
"with low to zero civilization in them.  Salus has several interstellar "
"refueling points.  These stations are often blind to each other as the "
"planets and other objects rotate around the sun.  Mercurial seems to have no "
"interest in managing or protecting the traffic that flows through the Salus "
"system or in neighboring systems beyond the bare minimum effort required by "
"UICA.  As a result of this neglect; victims of pirate attacks, engine failure "
"and other critical issues regularly limp to whatever safety they can find in "
"the Salus system.  Unfortunately for many of them they will crash land on "
"Salus IV where there are few regular shuttles between its scattered ports and "
"the outside universe.  As the locals are fond of saying 'Getting to Salus IV "
"is hard, getting off may be impossible'."
msgstr ""
"Salus星系被称为新一代超光速旅行枢纽星系。此星系中包含许多能很容易到达其他恒星系的出口，而这些星系之间除了经过一系列文明程度低到零的星球外，没有其他简单"
"方式彼此相联。Salus星系内有几个星际加油点。随着行星和其他天体围绕恒星旋转，这些空间站常常彼此无法通讯。水星公司除了满足UICA所要求的最小工作量外，似"
"乎对管理或保护途经Salus星系或邻近星系的交通不感兴趣。由于这种疏忽；海盗袭击、引擎故障和其他严重问题的受害者经常只能一瘸一拐地躲进他们能在Salus星系"
"内找到仅存的安全地带。不幸的是，他们中的许多人都坠毁在Salus "
"IV星上，那里只有散布在星球上的零星几个太空港有定期穿梭机与外部宇宙联系。正如当地人喜欢说的\"想去Salus IV很难，而要离开它更是不可能\"。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Nuclear Physics Made Easy"
msgid_plural "copies of Nuclear Physics Made Easy"
msgstr[0] "《核子物理創造便利》"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Nuclear Physics Made Easy"
msgid ""
"A book detailing the workings of state of the art atomic technology, and the "
"physics behind it."
msgstr "一本教科书，详细介绍了最尖端的核能技术的运作流程，以及背后的核物理学理论知识。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mealworm farm logbook"
msgid_plural "mealworm farm logbooks"
msgstr[0] "肉蟲農場紀錄"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "mealworm farm logbook"
msgid ""
"A binder containing detailed production logs from an industrial mealworm "
"farm.  You could use its recordings to start your own farming operations."
msgstr "这本活页夹中包含了详尽的工业化粉虫养殖场生产记录，凭借它你可以开始自己的粉虫养殖。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chicken walker schematics"
msgid_plural "chicken walker schematics"
msgstr[0] "雙足步行機器人原理圖"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "chicken walker schematics"
msgid ""
"Bearing the logo of Northrop, those are assembly plans, design specs, and "
"technical drawings for the chicken walker.  Most of this is useless to you, "
"but you could use the assembly plans to re-assemble the robot from salvaged "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"帶有 Northrop "
"的標誌，這些是雙足步行機器人的裝配藍圖、設計規格和技術圖紙。其中大部分對你沒用，但你可以利用裝配藍圖，把搜刮來的機器人部件重新組裝成機器人。"

