"A tiny plastic explosive meant to be installed in a Kabura-ya drone.  "
"Explodes 3 turns after activation."
msgstr "一个装在响箭型无人机上的微型塑胶炸药。激活后3回合爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/grenades.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Kabura-ya antipersonnel device"
msgid "You activate the device."
msgstr "你激活了自爆装置。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
