msgid_plural "titanium implants"
msgstr[0] "鈦植入物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/items.json
#. ~ Description of "titanium implant"
msgid ""
"An internal implant to correct a musculoskeletal problem such as a bad hip or "
"back.  It is made of titanium due to its biocompatibility."
msgstr "一個用來校正肌肉骨骼問題的體內植入物。為了生物相容性所以使用鈦製做。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/items.json
