#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/items.json
#. ~ Description of "glass device"
msgid ""
"This transparent slate of computation glass was once an incredibly versatile "
"hypercloud access point.  It continues to display \"No Connection\" in "
"ancient English script."
msgstr ""
"This transparent slate of computation glass was once an incredibly versatile "
"hypercloud access point.  It continues to display \"No Connection\" in "
"ancient English script."

