#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "atomic smartphone"
msgid ""
"Never charge your phone again with the Rivtech atomic smartphone.  Rated for "
"10 million years of use, this cutting-edge gadget had been on public markets "
"for less than a week when the Cataclysm hit, and their eye-watering price "
"made them a rarity.  It includes an alarm clock, a high-resolution camera, "
"and a bright flashlight."
msgstr ""
"有了Rivtech原子智慧型手機，你就再不需要幫你的手機充電了。它可以使用一千萬年，這個最尖端的小玩兒在大災變來臨的一星期之前推出市場，它的超高價格使它成為"
"一件珍品。它包含一個鬧鐘、一個高解像度相機、以及一個光亮的電筒。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "structural imager"
msgid_plural "structural imagers"
msgstr[0] "結構成像儀"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "structural imager"
msgid ""
"A compact imaging tool, capable of scanning and visualizing objects hiding "
"behind walls, maintenance panels and all other sort of visual barriers.  "
"While normally used to diagnostic potential faults within the internal "
"systems of spaceships, the ability to peer between obstacles grant it obvious "
"surveillance applications.  It can be activated to reveal a small conical "
"area around you."
msgstr ""
"一套袖珍成像仪，能够扫描隐藏在墙壁、面板或者其他障碍后面的物体，将其显示在屏幕上。通常用于诊断宇宙飞船内部系统中的潜在故障，但这种透视能力显然还能用于监控。"
"激活以透视周围一小片锥形区域。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "motion scanner"
msgid_plural "motion scanners"
msgstr[0] "运动扫描仪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "motion scanner"
msgid ""
"A handheld motion scanner normally used for pest control within spaceships.  "
"This model features an integrated screen to highlight the location of "
"detected motion.  It must be activated to function."
msgstr "手持式运动扫描仪通常用于飞船内的害虫控制。 该型号配有一个集成屏幕，可显示检测到的运动位置。 必须激活才能运作。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "motion scanner"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s screen flashes on."
msgstr "%s的屏幕亮了起来！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "motion scanner (on)"
msgid_plural "motion scanners (on)"
msgstr[0] "运动扫描仪（开）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "motion scanner (on)"
msgid ""
"This active motion scanner will survey your surroundings every ten seconds "
"and audibly alert you when movement is detected.  Wielding it will accurately "
"reveal the location of motion sources."
msgstr "启动的运动传感器每隔十秒扫描一次附近环境，并会在检测到运动时发出提示声。手持它就能发现运动源的精确位置。"

