#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "377-UASTA plasma torch"
msgid_plural "377-UASTA plasma torches"
msgstr[0] "377-UASTA 等离子喷枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "377-UASTA plasma torch"
msgid ""
"One of the many versions of UASTA certified plasma torches, essentially a "
"civilian plasma railgun used to deliver focused waves of plasma for precision "
"welding or metal cutting.  It is an indispensable tool for construction or "
"demolition work, and is sometimes transformed into a weapon by mining & "
"salvage outfits of questionable repute."
msgstr ""
"经过UASTA认证的众多等离子喷枪版本之一，本质上是一种民用等离子磁轨炮，发射出高度聚焦的等离子射线，用于精密焊接或金属切割。它是建筑或拆除工程中不可或缺的"
"工具，有时也会被名声不好的采矿和打捞团伙改装为武器。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "atomic smartphone - music"
msgid_plural "atomic smartphones - music"
msgstr[0] "原子智慧型手機 - 音樂模式"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "atomic smartphone - Flashlight"
msgid_plural "atomic smartphones - Flashlight"
msgstr[0] "原子智慧型手機 - 手電筒模式"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wraitheon executive's smartphone"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon executive's smartphones"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"公司高管智能手机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "Wraitheon executive's smartphone"
msgid ""
"Your custom crafted atomic smartphone.  Most notably a confidential "
"executive-level override program allows you to remotely control most robots."
msgstr "定制版原子智能手机。值得一提的是内部集成了一个保密的高管级重置程序能够让你远程控制大多数机器人。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wraitheon executive's smartphone - music"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon executive's smartphones - music"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"公司高管智能手机（音乐）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Executive's smartphone - Flashlight"
msgid_plural "Executive's smartphones - Flashlight"
msgstr[0] "高管智能手机（手电筒）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "atompot"
msgid_plural "atompots"
msgstr[0] "原子鍋"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "atompot"
msgid ""
"Rivtech's premiere self-heating kitchen appliance, complete with lid, "
"hand-crafted with the power of the atom to reach any temperature in thirty "
"seconds.  As bulky as it is, its plutonium power source means that it can be "
"used to cook an absurd amount of meals without ever worrying about running "
"low on power.  Unsurprisingly, sales weren't particularly good because of the "
"prospect of irradiating your food, but internal shielding ensures that only "
"trace amounts find their way into the center."
msgstr ""
"Rivtech首創的自我加熱廚房用具，附有鍋蓋，以原子的力量可以在三十秒內達到任何溫度。雖然它很笨重，但以鈽作為電源代表它可以烹調大量的食物而不用擔心不夠電"
"力。這產品被指會令食物被放射性物質污染，所以銷量理所當然不太好，但內部的放護層確保只會有很微量的放射性物質流出。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "atomic coffeemaker"
msgid ""
"A Curie-G coffeemaker, made by CuppaTech.  It famously uses a radioactive "
"generator to heat water for coffee.  Normally the water is heated using "
"energy stored in a capacitor, and makes ordinary coffee.  However, as a "
"special feature, water from the RTG containment area can be used, giving the "
"coffee a very special kick.  The Curie-G is illegal in most countries."
msgstr ""
"一台由CuppaTech公司生产的Curie-"
"G型原子咖啡机。因使用放射性元素产生的热量来加热咖啡而闻名。通常情况下，普通的咖啡机是通过电能来加热水冲泡咖啡的。然而，这台特殊的原子咖啡机可以使用内置的放"
"射性同位素热机来加热密封区域的水。Curie-G型原子咖啡机在大多数国家都被禁用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "power cutter (off)"
msgid_plural "power cutters (off)"
msgstr[0] "電動切割機（關閉）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "power cutter (off)"
msgid ""
"A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade.  If it has gasoline, it can be "
"turned on to turn it into a powerful metal cutting tool."
msgstr "一把巨大的汽油動力鑽石刀刃電鋸。如果有燃料，可以啟動以變成強力的金屬切割工具。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
