#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rocket pack"
msgid_plural "rocket packs"
msgstr[0] "火箭背包"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#. ~ Description of "rocket pack"
msgid ""
"A back mounted rocket pack, its well worn superalloy nozzles seem to suggest "
"great age.  Units like this one are rarely used by elite military forces and "
"by scavenger-explorers hoping to find high value salvage.  Not powerful "
"enough to enable true flight within a gravity well, but it may still be used "
"to perform short jumps and air-dashes."
msgstr ""
"一个背在身后的火箭背包，其早已磨损的高温超合金喷嘴似乎表明其年代久远。像这样的装备偶尔被精英军事部队和希望找到高价值战利品的拾荒者使用。推力不足以在重力井中"
"维持飞行，但仍然可用于短距离跳跃和空中冲刺。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "rocket pack"
msgid "The rocket pack fuel tank.  Holds up to 10 liters of pressurized fuel."
msgstr "火箭背包燃料箱。最多可容纳10升加压燃油。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic collar"
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon collar assemblies with armor inserts for neck "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr ""
"Front and back nylon collar assemblies with armor inserts for neck "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "IPAV armor"
msgid_plural "IPAV armors"
msgstr[0] "IPAV 护甲"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "IPAV armor"
msgid ""
"Multipurpose military armor for the torso and upper arms, intended to protect "
"against a wide variety of ballistic or direct energy attacks.  Made from a "
"single piece of ablative carbide that keeps it relatively lightweight and "
"completely disposable."
msgstr "用于躯干和上臂的多用途军事护甲。旨在保护使用者免受各种各样的实弹或直接能量攻击。使用一片烧蚀碳化物制成，以保证它相对轻便且完全一次性。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "IPAV armor"
msgid ""
"Multipurpose military armor for the torso and upper arms, intended to protect "
"against a wide variety of ballistic or direct energy attacks.  Made from a "
"single piece of ablative carbide that keeps it relatively lightweight and "
"completely disposable.  Made to fit the uplifted, the heavily augmented, or "
"similarly sized individuals."
msgstr ""
"用于躯干和上臂的多用途军事护甲。旨在保护使用者免受各种各样的实弹或直接能量攻击。使用单片烧蚀碳化物制成，以保证它相对轻便且完全一次性。适合身材高大、体格健壮"
"或体型相似的人。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Uplifted Enforcer armor"
msgid_plural "Uplifted Enforcer armors"
msgstr[0] "Uplifted Enforcer armors"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Uplifted Enforcer armor"
msgid ""
"An extra large suit of black bulletproof armor.  Specifically designed for "
"Uplifted officers such as Mastodons."
msgstr ""
"An extra large suit of black bulletproof armor.  Specifically designed for "
"Uplifted officers such as Mastodons."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ablative combat cloak"
msgid_plural "ablative combat cloaks"
msgstr[0] "烧蚀战斗斗篷"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ablative combat cloak"
msgid ""
"A military poncho made from heat dissipating ablative fibers.  It is designed "
"to be worn over armor and provide additional protection against direct energy "
"attacks.  Its ablative properties make it disposable and relatively fragile, "
"its not rated to survive more than a single combat engagement."
msgstr ""
"一种由散热烧蚀纤维制成的军用斗篷。 其设计目的是穿在盔甲外面，为直接能量攻击提供额外保护。 "
"它的烧蚀特性使其具有一次性和相对脆弱的特点，其额定寿命不超过一次交战。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military overalls"
msgid_plural "military overalls"
msgstr[0] "军用连身衣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#. ~ Description of "military overalls"
msgid ""
"A sturdy Nomex jumpsuit, normally worn by armed forces during transit or "
"beneath combat armor while in the field."
msgstr "一件结实的芳纶连体衣，通常在军人执行运送任务时穿着，或在战场上穿在战斗护甲底下。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "U3s ILBE"
msgid_plural "U3s ILBE"
msgstr[0] "U3s ILBE"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#. ~ Description of "U3s ILBE"
msgid ""
"Load bearing equipment that can be configured to attach PALS compatible "
"pouches, meant to be worn in conjunction with armor.  It has two magnetic "
"attachment points for a rifle and a sidearm.  Standard issue in UICA forces."
msgstr ""
"Load bearing equipment that can be configured to attach PALS compatible "
"pouches, meant to be worn in conjunction with armor.  It has two magnetic "
"attachment points for a rifle and a sidearm.  Standard issue in UICA forces."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "U3s ILBE"
msgid "Rifle attachment point."
msgstr "Rifle attachment point."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "U3s ILBE"
msgid "Sidearm attachment point."
msgstr "Sidearm attachment point."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "U38m munitions carrier"
msgid_plural "U38m munitions carriers"
msgstr[0] "U38m munitions carriers"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_clothing.json
#. ~ Description of "U38m munitions carrier"
msgid ""
"A large carrying frame designed to hold up to 10 rockets or similarly shaped "
"munitions on your back.  Most often used in conjunction with a lifting frame "
"to manage the weight."
msgstr ""
"A large carrying frame designed to hold up to 10 rockets or similarly shaped "
"munitions on your back.  Most often used in conjunction with a lifting frame "
"to manage the weight."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "U5s magazine carrier"
msgid_plural "U5s magazine carriers"
msgstr[0] "U5s magazine carriers"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#. ~ Description of "U5s magazine carrier"
msgid ""
"A collection of 6 pockets, designed to hold rifle magazines and keep them "
"accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to an ILBE or can be "
"strapped directly to your chest.  Standard issue in UICA forces."
msgstr ""
"A collection of 6 pockets, designed to hold rifle magazines and keep them "
"accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to an ILBE or can be "
"strapped directly to your chest.  Standard issue in UICA forces."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grenadier pouch"
msgid_plural "grenadier pouches"
msgstr[0] "grenadier pouches"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#. ~ Description of "grenadier pouch"
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold six military grenades, keeping them both accessible "
"and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""
"A pouch designed to hold six military grenades, keeping them both accessible "
"and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "U7s ammo satchel"
msgid_plural "U7s ammo satchels"
msgstr[0] "U7s ammo satchels"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/pals_accesories.json
#. ~ Description of "U7s ammo satchel"
msgid ""
"A large magnetic magazine carrier.  It is capable of holding two large "
"magazines close at hand."
msgstr ""
"A large magnetic magazine carrier.  It is capable of holding two large "
"magazines close at hand."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magellan helmet CA."
msgid_plural "Magellan helmets CA."
msgstr[0] "麥哲倫太空帽"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "Magellan helmet CA."
msgid ""
"The high quality helmet of a Magellan exosuit, adapted to handle the freezing "
"but breathable air of Salus IV.  In addition to its life support "
"functionality, it features a minor augmented reality UI overlay and a "
"retractable gold-plated visor to protect against glare and UV light.  "
"Although not armored as such, it's strong enough to handle minor blunt "
"impacts."
msgstr ""
"一顶麦哲伦外太空服的高质量头盔，能够让你适应 Salus IV "
"卫星冰冷但可呼吸的空气。除了它的生命支持功能外，它还有一个小型增强现实显示器以及一个可伸缩的镀金遮阳护镜，以防止眩光和紫外线。虽然并无多少装甲，但它的强度足"
"以应对轻微的钝击。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magellan helmet CA. (on)"
msgid_plural "Magellan helmets CA. (on)"
msgstr[0] "麥哲倫太空帽（開）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "Magellan helmet CA. (on)"
msgid ""
"The temperature control units and augmented reality overlays of this "
"high-tech garment are currently active, and continuously draining battery "
"power.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr "这件高科技服装的恒温机构及增强显示显示器目前正处于开启状态，并不断消耗电池电量。激活它来关闭。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frontier cryomask"
msgid_plural "frontier cryomasks"
msgstr[0] "冷凍邊境星球防護面罩"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "frontier cryomask"
msgid ""
"A common, industrially printed respirator cleverly retrofitted into a "
"wearable air heater.  While it adequately protects against the cold, most of "
"its original functions have been discarded and it offers no noticeable "
"protection against noxious fumes or other environmental hazards."
msgstr ""
"一个普通的，工业3"
"D打印制造的呼吸面罩，巧妙地被改装成一台可穿戴的空气加热器。虽然它能充分抵御寒冷，但它的大部分原有功能已被废弃，对有害气体或其他环境危害没有明显的保护作用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frontier cryomask (on)"
msgid_plural "frontier cryomasks (on)"
msgstr[0] "冷凍邊境星球防護面罩（開）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "frontier cryomask (on)"
msgid ""
"The heater of this high-tech garment is currently active, and continuously "
"draining battery power.  Use it to turn the heat off."
msgstr "这件高科技服装的加热器目前正处于开启状态，并不断消耗电池电量。激活它来关闭。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magellan exosuit"
msgid_plural "Magellan exosuits"
msgstr[0] "麥哲倫太空衣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "Magellan exosuit"
msgid ""
"A high-quality, civilian grade EVA suit often employed by well-established "
"frontier research and exploration associations.  Designed to support the "
"exploration of challenging terrain, it offers respectable protection against "
"common environmental hazards like extreme temperatures, inhospitable "
"atmospheres, and light radiation.  It leaves arms and hands relatively "
"unencumbered to aid the manipulation of scientific instruments.\n"
"\n"
"An integral battery allows the suit to operate for up to 34 hours, but "
"complicates field recharging."
msgstr ""
"一件高质量的民用外太空服，通常由久负盛誉的边境星球研究和勘探协会成员使用。它的设计为了在对具有挑战性的地形的探索时提供生命支持，能够防护常见环境危害，例如极"
"端温度、不适宜居住的大气和强光辐射。它的设计能使手臂和双手相对不太累赘地操纵科学仪器。\n"
"内置电池可以让太空服运行34小时，但让野外充电变得复杂。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magellan exosuit (on)"
msgid_plural "Magellan exosuits (on)"
msgstr[0] "麥哲倫太空衣（開）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "Magellan exosuit (on)"
#. ~ Description of "frontier cryo suit (on)"
#. ~ Description of "combat cryo suit (on)"
msgid ""
"The temperature control units of this high-tech garment are currently active, "
"and continuously draining battery power.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr "這件高科技服裝的溫度控制單元現在正處於啟動狀態，並且持續消耗電池。\"使用\" 以關閉它。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frontier cryo suit"
msgid_plural "frontier cryo suits"
msgstr[0] "冷凍邊境星球太空衣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "frontier cryo suit"
msgid ""
"A sturdy suit meant to protect against the freezing cold, made from a pair of "
"jumpsuits that have been woven around a heavy insulation layer and "
"crisscrossed with the thermal tubing of a heat regulation unit.  The thick "
"insulation allows the suit to function with unrivaled efficiency, but also "
"makes all types of movement difficult."
msgstr ""
"一套用来抵御严寒的坚固套装，由一对连身衣制成，连身衣被缝上了一层厚厚的隔热层，上面交叉纵横着许多与热调节装置连接的热管。厚厚的隔热层让太空服的效率无与伦比，"
"但也让做出任何动作都十分困难。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frontier cryo suit (on)"
msgid_plural "frontier cryo suits (on)"
msgstr[0] "冷凍邊境星球太空衣（開）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat cryo suit"
msgid_plural "combat cryo suits"
msgstr[0] "控温战斗服"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "combat cryo suit"
msgid ""
"A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation "
"unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the "
"suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally "
"protective and designed to be worn under a set of armor."
msgstr ""
"光滑的黑色内衣上纵横交错着热量调节装置的管道。 为了保证战斗中的机动性，隔热性能保持在最低水平，因此该防护服非常耗电。 "
"尽管名称如此，但它的防护性极低，设计用于在盔甲下穿戴。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat cryo suit (on)"
msgid_plural "combat cryo suits (on)"
msgstr[0] "控温战斗服（开）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "combat cryo suit"
msgid ""
"A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation "
"unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the "
"suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally "
"protective and designed to be worn under a set of armor.  Made to fit the "
"uplifted, the heavily augmented, or similarly sized individuals."
msgstr ""
"A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation "
"unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the "
"suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally "
"protective and designed to be worn under a set of armor.  Made to fit the "
"uplifted, the heavily augmented, or similarly sized individuals."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cryopod bodyglove"
msgid_plural "cryopod bodygloves"
msgstr[0] "冬眠舱连身衣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "cryopod bodyglove"
msgid ""
"A dark orange bodyglove, hundreds of tubes curl over its surface, tracing the "
"contours of human musculature.  Meant to control body temperature during "
"prolonged cryopreservation, it could easily keep you comfortable in any "
"earthly climate.  Use it to activate its climate control functionality."
msgstr ""
"一套暗橙色的连身衣，数百根管子缠绕在它的表面，描绘出如同人类肌肉一般的轮廓。它能够在长期低温休眠时控制体温，同时也能轻易地让你在任何地球气候下保持舒适。激活"
"它以启用恒温机构。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
