msgid "Exosuit Climb Assist"
msgstr "动力装甲辅助攀爬"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_mutations.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Exosuit Climb Assist"
msgid "Your exosuit is equipped with a variety of climbing assists."
