#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "exosuit_electrolaser ( Exosuit Electrolaser )"
msgid ""
"Creates a conductive channel from the exosuit to the target by ionizing air "
"molecules using a high-powered laser beam, then sends a powerful half million "
"volt charge down the channel."
msgstr "通过使用高功率激光束电离空气分子，创建出一条从动力装甲到目标的导电通道，然后沿着通道释放出50万伏的强大电荷。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_spells.json
