msgid "A small storage pouch, mountable on a hardpoint."
msgstr "一个小型储物袋，可安装在动力装甲的插槽上。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large ammo pouches (exosuit)"
msgid_plural "large ammo pouches (exosuit)"
msgstr[0] "大型弹药袋（动力装甲）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#. ~ Description of "large ammo pouches (exosuit)"
#. ~ Description of "small ammo pouches (exosuit)"
msgid "A set of pouches that attach to a hardpoint."
msgstr "一系列弹药袋，可安装在动力装甲的插槽上。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small ammo pouches (exosuit)"
msgid_plural "small ammo pouches (exosuit)"
msgstr[0] "小型弹药袋（动力装甲）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit quick draw holster"
msgid_plural "exosuit quick draw holsters"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲快取枪套"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit quick draw holster"
msgid ""
"This module holds a single sidearm and will recharge an energy weapon.  "
"Automatically opens when the exosuit's pilot reaches for it, just like in "
"that one movie."
msgstr "这个模块可以容纳一把手枪，还能为其中的能量武器充电。当动力装甲的操控者伸手靠近时，口袋会自动打开，就像在某部电影中的那样。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit blade sheath"
msgid_plural "exosuit blade sheaths"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲刀鞘"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_storage.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit blade sheath"
msgid ""
"This module holds a single knife or small blade.  Automatically opens when "
"the exosuit's pilot reaches for it."
msgstr "这个模块可以容纳一把小刀。当动力装甲的操控者伸手靠近时，口袋会自动打开。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_tool.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_tool.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit repair kit"
msgid_plural "exosuit repair kits"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲修理包"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_tool.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_tool.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit repair kit"
msgid ""
"This is a collection of tools including a high-powered torch for working the "
"titanium frame."
msgstr "这是一整套工具，包括一把用于加工钛框架的高功率焊炬。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit underlayer"
msgid_plural "exosuit underlayers"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲贴身服"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit underlayer"
msgid ""
"A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by an exosuit pilot.  Although not a "
"requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback "
"systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  The suit "
"is not designed for use outside of armor.  This standard model uses a scale "
"mail of overlapping plastic disks for incidental protection."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit combat underlayer"
msgid_plural "exosuit combat underlayers"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲作战贴身服"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit combat underlayer"
msgid ""
"A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by an exosuit pilot.  Although not a "
"requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback "
"systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  The suit "
"is not designed for use outside of armor.  This model includes tough Kevlar "
"to protect from spalling."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit EVA underlayer"
msgid_plural "exosuit EVA underlayers"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲太空贴身服"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit EVA underlayer"
msgid ""
"A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by an exosuit pilot.  Although not a "
"requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback "
"systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  This "
"model is designed for EVA operation, offering protection against breaches."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit utility underlayer"
msgid_plural "exosuit utility underlayers"
msgstr[0] "动力装甲通用贴身服"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_underlayers.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit utility underlayer"
msgid ""
"A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by an exosuit pilot.  Although not a "
"requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback "
"systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  This "
"model is designed for hazardous environments and sacrifices mobility for "
"extra protection."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clump of lichen"
msgid_plural "clumps of lichen"
msgstr[0] "地衣塊"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "clump of lichen"
msgid ""
"A clump of moist squishy lichen.  You get the impression that it might not be "
"the safest thing to eat considering how it makes your hand tingle."
msgstr "一团湿软的地衣。你的第一印象是，考虑到它在你手中让你的手发麻，这可能不是最安全的食品。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clump of processed lichen"
msgid_plural "clumps of processed lichen"
msgstr[0] "處理過的地衣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "clump of processed lichen"
msgid ""
"A clump of squishy lichen, while it isn't as wet as it used to be, your hands "
"no longer tingle holding it."
msgstr "一团软绵绵的地衣，虽然不像以前那么湿了，但你握着它的手不再刺痛了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of frostbitten human meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of frostbitten human meat"
msgstr[0] "凍傷人肉塊"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of frostbitten human meat"
msgid "Freshly butchered meat from a frozen human carcass, not the most appetizing."
msgstr "從冷凍的人類屍體中屠宰的新鮮肉塊，並不讓人開胃。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked freezerburned human meat"
msgid_plural "cooked freezerburned human meat"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的凍傷人肉"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked freezerburned human meat"
msgid "A freshly cooked slice of human meat, it has severe frostburn."
msgstr "經選人肉切片烹調，看起來有些嚴重的凍傷。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frostbitten human stomach"
msgid_plural "frostbitten human stomachs"
msgstr[0] "凍傷人胃"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "frostbitten human stomach"
msgid "A shriveled gray stomach, it hasn't seen use in a very long time."
msgstr "皱巴巴的灰色人胃，已经很久没被使用过了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frostbitten human bone"
msgid_plural "frostbitten human bones"
msgstr[0] "凍傷人骨"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "frostbitten human bone"
msgid "A stretched bumpy piece of bone, unpleasant to hold."
msgstr "一块坑坑洼洼的骨头，拿着它使你感到不适。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of frostbitten human fat"
msgid_plural "chunks of frostbitten human fat"
msgstr[0] "凍傷人脂肪塊"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of frostbitten human fat"
msgid ""
"Light green fat, smelling absolutely rancid.  You could eat it, but it "
"wouldn't be worth it."
msgstr "散发着腐败气味的绿色油脂。你可以吃了它，但是不会有什么好处。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "freezerburned human tallow"
msgid_plural "freezerburned human tallow"
msgstr[0] "凍傷人脂肪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "freezerburned human tallow"
msgid ""
"A smooth light green block of cleaned and rendered human fat.  While it'll "
"remain edible for a very long time, it won't be the most appetizing."
msgstr "一块清洗后熬制的光滑的浅绿色人类脂肪。虽然可以保存很久并食用，但它看上去就让你没胃口。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "freezerburned human lard"
msgid_plural "freezerburned human lard"
msgstr[0] "凍傷人豬油"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "freezerburned human lard"
msgid ""
"A smooth light green block of dry-rendered human fat.  It's very frostburnt, "
"and while it will remain edible for a very long time, it's not the most "
"appetizing."
msgstr "一块干法炼制的光滑的浅绿色人类脂肪。虽然可以保存很久并食用，但它看上去就让你没胃口。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw frostbitten human skin"
msgid_plural "raw frostbitten human skin"
msgstr[0] "冻坏的生人皮"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw frostbitten human skin"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a human corpse.  It is stained "
"blue from frostbite.  You can cure it for storage and tanning, or eat it if "
"you're desperate enough."
msgstr "一张小心翼翼从人类尸体上剥下并折叠起来的生皮，由于冻伤呈现着蓝色。你可以加工它以方便储存和鞣制，如果你饿疯了也可以就这样吃掉。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of alien flesh"
msgid ""
"Freshly butchered meat from an alien corpse.  You could eat it raw or cooked, "
"but this is a completely alien biosphere."
msgstr "屠宰异形尸体得到的肉。你也许可以直接食用或者烹饪它，但它可是来自完全不同的生物圈。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked alien flesh"
msgid_plural "cooked alien flesh"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的外星肉塊"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked alien flesh"
msgid ""
"This is a chunk of freshly cooked alien meat.  It could be either filling and "
"nutritious, or poisonous and lethal."
msgstr "一块经过简单烹饪的异形肉块。也许富含营养能够果腹，也可能含有剧毒。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap of alien flesh"
msgid_plural "scraps of alien flesh"
msgstr[0] "外星肉渣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap of alien flesh"
msgid ""
"This is a tiny scrap of dubiously edible alien meat.  It's not much, but it "
"might be better than starving."
msgstr "也许可以食用的一小块异形碎肉。虽然量不多，但是大概比饿死要好一点。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked scrap of alien flesh"
msgid_plural "cooked scraps of alien flesh"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的外星肉渣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien stomach"
msgid_plural "alien stomachs"
msgstr[0] "外星胃袋"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "alien stomach"
msgid ""
"A balloon-like organ you can only guess is a stomach.  It is surprisingly "
"durable."
msgstr "一个气球一样的器官，你只能猜测它是胃一类的东西。令人意外的耐磨。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large alien stomach"
msgid_plural "large alien stomachs"
msgstr[0] "大型外星胃袋"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "large alien stomach"
msgid ""
"A balloon-like organ of a large alien you can only guess is a stomach.  It is "
"surprisingly durable."
msgstr "一个气球一样的异形器官，你只能猜测它是胃一类的东西。令人意外的耐磨。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "piece of raw alien lung"
msgid_plural "pieces of raw alien lung"
msgstr[0] "外星肺片"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "piece of raw alien lung"
msgid ""
"A red sponge-like organ rests in your hands.  It leaks out a strange liquid, "
"and spoils very quickly.  You hazard a guess this is a lung."
msgstr "一个红色的海绵状器官，正在渗出一种奇怪的液体，很快就会变质。你大胆猜测这是一种肺。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked piece of alien lung"
msgid_plural "cooked pieces of alien lung"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的外星肺片"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked piece of alien lung"
msgid ""
"The organ no longer leaks out a strange liquid, and has faded to a light blue "
"color.  It looks chewy, and has an unpleasant smell."
msgstr "这个器官不再渗出奇怪的液体，并且颜色褪去变成了浅蓝色。看上去很难嚼，并且散发出不好闻的气味。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien liver"
msgid_plural "raw alien liver"
msgstr[0] "外星生肝"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien liver"
msgid ""
"A porous hard organ.  Hazarding a guess from all the large blood vessels "
"going in and out, this is the liver.  It smells rancid."
msgstr "一个多孔的硬质器官。从上面布满的大血管来大胆猜测的话，这是一种肝。它有一股腐败的气味。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked alien liver"
msgid_plural "cooked alien liver"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的外星肝臟"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked alien liver"
msgid ""
"After some time cooking, the pores of the organ have shrunk, and it's much, "
"much softer - almost yogurt-like in its consistency.  It still smells awful."
msgstr "经过一定烹调后，这个器官上的孔收缩了，并且变得柔软了很多，几乎有酸奶一样的质感。闻起来仍然相当糟糕。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien brains"
msgid_plural "raw alien brains"
msgstr[0] "外星腦"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien brains"
msgid ""
"A brain butchered from an alien organism.  It looks somewhat similar to its "
"earthly analogues, barring its light-blue coloration and gland riddled "
"frontal lobe."
msgstr "从某个异形身上取下的大脑。看起来和地球生物的脑有些许相似，除了它浅蓝的颜色和前额叶上布满的腺体以外。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked alien brains"
msgid_plural "cooked alien brains"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的外星腦"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked alien brains"
msgid ""
"Fried and scrambled, this doesn't look the most appetizing, but it's edible "
"(you hope)."
msgstr "经过翻炒的异形脑花。它看起来不是很美味，但是已经能够食用（希望如此）。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien kidney"
msgid_plural "raw alien kidney"
msgstr[0] "外星腎臟"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien kidney"
msgid ""
"You are guessing here, but this is likely the kidney of the animal.  The "
"ammonia smell was the biggest hint."
msgstr "这只是你的猜测，但是这应该是这个生物的肾脏，氨的味道是最明显的线索。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked alien kidney"
msgid_plural "cooked alien kidney"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的外星腎臟"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked alien kidney"
msgid ""
"Thoroughly cooked and prepared, this alien organ has acquired the filthy "
"ammonia smell of a poorly mopped spaceship deck.  Even if it were safe to "
"eat, you are not sure you'd want to."
msgstr "经过充分烹饪处理后，这个外星器官看起来就像是用厕所里面没洗的拖把拖过的散发尿味的飞船甲板。就算它能吃，你也不是很想这么做。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien sweetbread"
msgid_plural "raw alien sweetbread"
msgstr[0] "外星胸腺"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien sweetbread"
msgid "You got this chunk of meat from the throat of the animal; it looks different?"
msgstr "你从某个生物的喉咙里面抠出了这块肉。它看上去不太一样……"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked alien sweetbread"
msgid_plural "cooked alien sweetbread"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的外星胸腺"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked alien sweetbread"
msgid ""
"Well, it's definitely not muscle, you can tell now.  It oozes a purple liquid "
"out onto your hand as you hold it."
msgstr "现在你能看出这肯定不是肌肉。当你拿起它时，里面的某种紫色液体渗出到你的手上。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien bone"
msgid_plural "alien bones"
msgstr[0] "外星骨頭"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "alien bone"
msgid "Obviously bones.  Could be used to make some stuff, like needles."
msgstr "显然是骨头。可以用来制造一些东西，比如说骨针。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of alien fat"
msgid_plural "chunks of alien fat"
msgstr[0] "外星脂肪塊"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of alien fat"
msgid ""
"Freshly butchered fat from an alien.  You could eat it cooked or raw, but it "
"is more safely used for crafting non edible-products."
msgstr "屠宰异形得到的新鲜脂肪，可以烹饪之后食用或是生吃，但是用来制造非食用的物品会更安全。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien tallow"
msgid_plural "alien tallow"
msgstr[0] "外星動物脂"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "alien tallow"
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered alien animal fat.  It'll last "
"for a very long time, but you are unsure of its edibility.  Can be used as an "
"ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr "一块清洗后熬制的白色异形脂肪。可以保存很久，但是你不确定能不能食用。在很多食物和物品的制造配方中会用到。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien lard"
msgid_plural "alien lard"
msgstr[0] "外星豬油"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "alien lard"
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of dry-rendered animal fat.  It'll last for a very long "
"time, but you are unsure of its edibility.  Can be used as an ingredient in "
"many foods and projects."
msgstr "一块干法炼制的白色异形脂肪。可以保存很久，但是你不确定能不能食用。在很多食物和物品的制造配方中会用到。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "unidentifiable alien organs"
msgid_plural "unidentifiable alien organs"
msgstr[0] "無法識別的外星器官"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "unidentifiable alien organs"
msgid "An unidentifiable pile of organs; you have no idea how you'd prepare them."
msgstr "一堆未知的器官。你不知道该如何烹饪它们。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien cracklins"
msgid_plural "alien cracklins"
msgstr[0] "外星豬皮酥"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "alien cracklins"
msgid ""
"Bits of alien fat and skin that have been fried until they are crispy and "
"delicious (at least, you hope they are)."
msgstr "一份在油中炸到酥脆可口的异形脂肪和皮（至少你希望如此）。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "freezerburned human cracklins"
msgid_plural "freezerburned human cracklins"
msgstr[0] "凍傷人油渣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "freezerburned human cracklins"
msgid ""
"Green scraps of rancid fat and skin, and while they have been fried to a "
"crisp, they still don't smell any better."
msgstr "腐败的绿色脂肪和皮。尽管已经被炸到发脆，但是闻起来并没有任何改善。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien hide"
msgid_plural "raw alien hide"
msgstr[0] "生外星皮"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien hide"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from an alien animal.  You can cure it "
"for storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr "一张小心翼翼从异形身上剥下并折叠起来的生皮，你可以加工它以方便储存和鞣制，如果你饿疯了也可以就这样吃掉。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien pelt"
msgid_plural "raw alien pelt"
msgstr[0] "生外星毛皮"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien pelt"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing alien animal.  It "
"still has the fur attached.  You can cure it for storage and tanning, or eat "
"it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr "一块从有毛皮的异形上仔细地削下来的生皮。还连着毛。你可以加工它来存储并进一步的鞣制，或者直接吃掉它，如果你的肚子里真的是一根毛都没有了的话。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mealgrub growth medium"
msgid_plural "mealgrub growth medium"
msgstr[0] "肉蟲培養皿"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Description of "mealgrub growth medium"
msgid ""
"All sorts of organic substances rendered into a nutritious goop that can be "
"used as a growth medium in grub aquaculture.  Urban myth claims that its "
"original formula was just bottled industrial runoff.  Whatever the case, "
"mealgrubs thrive within it."
msgstr "用于粉虫幼虫养殖的胶状培养基，由各种有机营养物质制成。传闻它的原始配方只是瓶装工业废水而已。但不管怎么说，粉虫幼虫在里面茁壮成长。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mealgrub spores"
msgid_plural "mealgrub spores"
msgstr[0] "肉蟲幼苗"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Description of "mealgrub spores"
msgid ""
"Mealgrubs are a staple aquacultural product, treasured for their ability to "
"process nearly any organic substance into safe for consumption animal "
"protein.  As the result of very heavy-handed gene-modding these are "
"proprietary organisms, and strictly speaking, it's illegal to grow them "
"without a license."
msgstr ""
"粉虫是一种特殊的水产养殖主食，因其能将几乎任何有机物加工成可以安全食用的动物蛋白而备受珍视。由于非常特殊的深度基因改造，它们都是带有专利的生物，严格地说，未"
"经许可私自饲养它们是违法行为。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mealgrub broth"
msgid_plural "mealgrub broth"
msgstr[0] "肉蟲培養液"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Description of "mealgrub broth"
msgid ""
"Growth medium seeded with mealgrub eggs.  Once placed in a growing vat, they "
"should be ready for harvesting in around 76 hours.  The immature grub's "
"metabolism can produce toxic by-products so caution is advisable."
msgstr "一個密封著肉蟲卵的培養皿。將其放置於可生長的大桶中，牠們將在76小時後可進行收穫。不成熟的肉蟲會產生有毒的副產品，所以請謹慎使用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "live mealgrubs"
msgid_plural "live mealgrubs"
msgstr[0] "肉蟲（成熟的）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Description of "live mealgrubs"
msgid ""
"Thousands of mature mealworms, squirming in the viscous remains of their "
"growth medium.  They are ready for harvest, and in fact require speedy "
"cleaning and processing, as the harvest can quickly rot in this stage."
msgstr "好幾千隻成熟肉蟲，在黏稠的培養皿中蠕動著。牠們已經可以被收穫，而且最好快速的進行清理和加工，不然收穫後的肉蟲會快速的腐爛。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mealgrubs"
msgid_plural "mealgrubs"
msgstr[0] "肉蟲"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
#. ~ Description of "mealgrubs"
msgid ""
"A handful of edible and heavily genemoded grubs, each only slightly thinner "
"than your thumb.  Engineered in the wake of the XXII century to feed an "
"overpopulated Earth and its fledgling colonies these are a sturdy, easily "
"grown and scalable crop.\n"
"\n"
"Removed from their growth solution they'll quickly die and desiccate, as "
"these already have.  They could be safely eaten with no further processing, "
"for a nutritious if somewhat striking meal."
msgstr ""
"一把可食用的深度转基因粉虫，每一只都只比你的拇指稍细。在二十二世纪之初，为了养活人口过多的地球和其羽翼未丰的外星殖民地而设计出这种主食产品，它们生命力强、容"
"易生长、可大批量养殖。\n"
"从培养基中取出后，它们会很快死亡并脱水，就像你手中握着的一样。它们可以安全食用，无需进一步加工，是一种营养丰富，但有点吓人的食品。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nutriment"
msgid_plural "nutriments"
msgstr[0] "營養丸"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "nutriment"
msgid ""
"A crumbly white biscuit half the size of your thumb, packed with vitamins and "
"calories.  Provides a whole meal's nutrition in portable form, but it's a "
"little hard to keep down, thanks to the rancid taste and chalky texture."
msgstr "一颗只有拇指一半大小的易碎白色饼干，富含维生素和卡路里。其热量和营养能管一顿饭。但它散发着腐败的味道，口感像粉笔一样，有点难以下咽。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nutriment water"
msgid_plural "nutriment water"
msgstr[0] "加水營養丸"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "nutriment water"
msgid ""
"Nutriment that has been dissolved in water to dilute its taste.  Unnervingly "
"resembles spoiled milk."
msgstr "溶解在水中以稀釋其味道的營養丸。令人不安的酷似變質的牛奶。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Spite Soda"
msgid_plural "Spite Soda"
msgstr[0] "雪碧"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "Spite Soda"
msgid ""
"Spite Soda, the only soda native to the Salus system.  'Stay Frosty, Drink "
"Spite'.  Visitors to the Salus system who have drank Spite Soda have "
"described it as the taste of transhumanist dialectical materialism."
msgstr "斯派得可乐是Salus星系中唯一的天然苏打水。\"保持冷静，喝斯派得\"。曾喝过斯派得可乐的Salus星系游客将其描述为跨人文辩证唯物主义的味道。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "Spite Soda"
msgid "You take a swig, it tastes like it was distilled in a hyperspace engine."
msgstr "你喝了一大口，尝起来就像是在超空间引擎中蒸馏出来的。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "H₂O™"
msgid_plural "H₂O™"
msgstr[0] "H₂O™水"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "H₂O™"
msgid ""
"When Thistle Industries successfully trademarked the chemical formula of "
"water, you thought the world had gone irreparably insane, but things have "
"only gotten worse since."
msgstr "当希斯尔工业公司成功地注册了水的化学式配方专利时，你以为世界已经变得不可救药的疯狂，但从那以后一切只会变得越来越糟。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "food cubes"
msgid_plural "food cubes"
msgstr[0] "食立方™"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "food cubes"
msgid "Smoothly blended edibles, neatly shaped into cubes for maximum enjoyment."
msgstr "顺滑混合食品，整齐列成立方，提供终极享受。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
msgid_plural "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
msgstr[0] "美食中心健康美食™"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
msgid ""
"Foodplace™ easy-storage Food-to-go™ the choice Food™ for the contemporary "
"Foodman™."
msgstr "美食中心™出品易於儲藏的健康美食™，當代美食人的最佳食物。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "loop 'fruit'"
msgid_plural "loop 'fruit'"
msgstr[0] "圈圈果™"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "loop 'fruit'"
msgid "Rings of caramelized yellow colorant, tasting not exactly like apple."
msgstr "一堆富含焦糖和黄色色素的能量圈，尝起来并不太像苹果。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cee wafers"
msgid_plural "cee wafers"
msgstr[0] "cee 海藻餅乾"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "cee wafers"
msgid ""
"Smooth crackers colored grayish-green.  Used to be perfectly edible seaweed, "
"or so the wrapper claims."
msgstr "一些外表灰绿色的光滑薄脆饼干。用完全可以食用的海藻制成，至少包装上是这么说的。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "beefsim"
msgid_plural "beefsim"
msgstr[0] "毕夫兴™人造肉条"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "beefsim"
msgid ""
"Soy or pureed rat?  Better not to know.\n"
"(But its probably both.)"
msgstr ""
"感觉像是大豆或是老鼠肉糊糊？还是别知道的好。\n"
"（但很可能两者皆是。）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soup, flavor 27"
msgid_plural "soup, flavor 27"
msgstr[0] "汤™风味27#"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "soup, flavor 27"
msgid ""
"Yellow chunks float on creamy liquid, like flotsam on a filthy summer pond.  "
"Branding implies at least 26 other flavors, but you have neither seen or "
"heard about any of them."
msgstr "不少黄色的块状物漂浮在奶油状液体上，就像是夏季肮脏池塘中的漂浮物一样。商品的名称意味着它应该还有至少26种其他口味，但你从未见过或听说过其中任何一种。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "landfall survival rations"
msgid_plural "landfall survival rations"
msgstr[0] "著陸救生口糧"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "landfall survival rations"
msgid ""
"Sealed emergency rations invariably found within an escape pod's inventory.  "
"This particular pack should provide around a day's worth of nutrition.  "
"Required by regulation but rarely ever used, the design of these \"meals\" "
"prioritizes a long shelf life and a very low bulk-cost.  Which lends them "
"their disgusting taste of greased sawdust."
msgstr ""
"救生舱内常备的应急口粮，这个特殊的包装提供大约一天的营养价值。这些\"餐食\""
"按规定需要有，但很少被使用。其设计优先考虑的是保质期足够长和非常低的批量成本，这使得它们有一种令人作呕的涂了油的锯末味道。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "caffex"
msgid_plural "caffex"
msgstr[0] "咖啡X™"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "caffex"
msgid "A dark and soapy beverage, pre-brewed and loaded with synthetic caffeine."
msgstr "一种冒着白色肥皂状泡沫的深色饮料，工厂预先酿制罐装并加入了人工合成的咖啡因。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "organic sludge"
msgid_plural "organic sludge"
msgstr[0] "有机污泥"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "organic sludge"
msgid ""
"Time and the elements have reverted this heavily processed meal to its "
"original form.  Eating it isn't even worth thinking about."
msgstr "时光摧残之下，这份食物早已恢复自然本貌。吃掉它，想都不要想。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heat retention cream"
msgid_plural "heat retention cream"
msgstr[0] "保溫霜"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "heat retention cream"
msgid ""
"Rub this on your skin when you are expecting exposure to extreme cold "
"temperatures.  Cannot protect from instant frostbite.  Smells like the inside "
"of a sheep."
msgstr "如果你预计会暴露在极端寒冷环境下，你可以将这种乳霜涂抹在皮肤上。无法对瞬间的冻伤进行保护。闻起来像是羊的内脏。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heat retention cream xtreme"
msgid_plural "heat retention cream xtreme"
msgstr[0] "極致保溫霜"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "heat retention cream xtreme"
msgid ""
"This product was advertised before the Cataclysm for extreme cold environment "
"protection.  You remember a demonstration involving a woman coating her hand "
"in this and plunging it in liquid nitrogen for a second.  You're pretty sure "
"that was staged."
msgstr ""
"大灾变前有宣传说这种产品能够对极端寒冷环境进行防护。你想起来在一次展示中，一位女性在手上涂抹了这种乳霜后直接把手伸进了液氮里并停留了一秒。你怎么看那都像是演"
"的。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "atomic butter"
msgid_plural "atomic butter"
msgstr[0] "原子黄油"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "atomic butter"
msgid ""
"A yellow stick of milkfat and milk solids, made from cow's milk and the power "
"of the atom.  All radiation levels are confirmed to be in line with "
"background exposure and any cancers later in life have nothing to do with "
"this butter or any products made with this butter.  By consuming this butter "
"you indemnify and hold harmless the Rivtech Corporation, its parent company "
"and subsidiaries and any agents, directors or officers of the Rivtech "
"Corporation from any losses or damages that may occur as a result of "
"consuming this butter in any form or fashion."
msgstr ""
"一种黄色的乳脂和奶固体棒，由牛奶和原子能制成。所有的辐射水平都被证实与天然本底暴露值一致，此后生命中的任何癌症都与此黄油或使用此黄油制作的任何产品无关。食用"
"此黄油即代表你理解并同意完全免除Rivtech公司、其母公司和子公司以及Rivtech公司的任何代理人、董事会成员或高级管理人员因任何形式或方式食用此黄油而"
"造成的任何损失及损害的赔偿责任。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "synthetic meat"
msgid_plural "synthetic meat"
msgstr[0] "合成肉"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Description of "synthetic meat"
msgid ""
"A cut of vat grown lean meat, genetically similar to beef.  Conspicuously "
"uniform in both looks and texture."
msgstr "一块培养瘦肉，基因类似于牛肉。外观和质地相当均一。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "meat flakes"
msgid_plural "meat flakes"
msgstr[0] "肉片"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Description of "meat flakes"
msgid ""
"Transparent thin hexagonal cuts of dried meat.  Conspicuously uniform in both "
"looks and texture."
msgstr "透明的六角形薄肉片。外观和质地相当均一。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ramen"
msgid_plural "ramen"
msgstr[0] "ramen"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Description of "ramen"
msgid ""
"Ramen's adaptability to dried and preserved ingredients make it a staple in "
"the culinary landscapes of frontier outposts and shipping crews alike.  Any "
"spaceport worth visiting has a local ramen tradition of its own, and here the "
"dish is slightly acidic, with a sweet aftertaste produced by the break-down "
"of alien proteins."
msgstr ""
"Ramen's adaptability to dried and preserved ingredients make it a staple in "
"the culinary landscapes of frontier outposts and shipping crews alike.  Any "
"spaceport worth visiting has a local ramen tradition of its own, and here the "
"dish is slightly acidic, with a sweet aftertaste produced by the break-down "
"of alien proteins."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "ramen" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches mutant
msgid "frontier ramen"
msgid_plural "frontier ramen"
msgstr[0] "frontier ramen"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "synthetic blood"
msgid_plural "synthetic blood"
msgstr[0] "合成血液"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ Description of "synthetic blood"
msgid ""
"A chalk white blood analogue for emergency medical use.  Far more efficient "
"at oxygenation than natural blood, it can also be used as a general "
"performance enhancer.  Once injected, it will be metabolized or otherwise "
"expunged from the body in around 8 hours."
msgstr ""
"A chalk white blood analogue for emergency medical use.  Far more efficient "
"at oxygenation than natural blood, it can also be used as a general "
"performance enhancer.  Once injected, it will be metabolized or otherwise "
"expunged from the body in around 8 hours."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "serendipnol"
msgid_plural "serendipnols"
msgstr[0] "serendipnols麻醉剂"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ Description of "serendipnol"
msgid ""
"A very strong, synthetic narcotic built from alien biochemistry and used to "
"treat intense pain while in the field.  You'll need to inject it, and it's "
"very addictive, so be careful."
msgstr "这是一种非常强效的合成麻醉剂，由外星生物化学物质制成，用于在战场上缓解剧痛。需要注射使用，而且极易使人上瘾，所以要小心。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ Description of "MediGel"
msgid ""
"Mercurial brand medical gel; a thick, translucent substance that can be "
"applied to wounds to seal them and promote rapid healing.  Perhaps the most "
"useful medical invention ever devised, it's a staple of any first aid kit."
msgstr ""
"Mercurial 牌医用凝胶是一种粘稠的半透明物质，涂抹在伤口上可起到封闭伤口、促进伤口快速愈合的作用。 "
"它可能是有史以来最有用的医疗发明，是所有急救箱的主打产品。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat stim"
msgid_plural "combat stims"
msgstr[0] "战斗用兴奋剂"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ Description of "combat stim"
msgid ""
"A small, disposable injector filled with a cocktail of stimulants and "
"painkillers.  Will kick you from death's door into awareness, but it's not a "
"long-term solution."
msgstr "一个小巧的，充满了混合的兴奋剂和止痛剂的可降解注射器。它可以把你从死亡的大门踢回清醒之中，但这并不是一个长期的解决方法。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "combat stim"
msgid "You shove the stimpack against your chest."
msgstr "你将兴奋剂注射进你的胸膛。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kelp"
msgid_plural "kelp"
msgstr[0] "巨藻"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#. ~ Description of "kelp"
msgid ""
"Thin wafers of kelp, the essential greens of frontier cuisine.  These were "
"probably grown in some farm ship or another."
msgstr "薄如蝉翼的海带，边疆美食中不可或缺的绿色蔬菜。 这些海带可能是在某个农业飞船上种植的。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegan ramen"
msgid_plural "vegan ramen"
msgstr[0] "vegan ramen"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#. ~ Description of "vegan ramen"
msgid ""
"Most ramen served in the frontier is already vegan through the use of "
"synthetic meat and other meat substitutes.  This variant simply doesn't "
"pretend to include any meat at all.  Slightly spicy."
msgstr ""
"Most ramen served in the frontier is already vegan through the use of "
"synthetic meat and other meat substitutes.  This variant simply doesn't "
"pretend to include any meat at all.  Slightly spicy."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spiced chops"
msgid_plural "spiced chops"
msgstr[0] "五香排"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#. ~ Description of "spiced chops"
msgid ""
"Kibble made for humans.  A heavy dressing of spices makes it impossible to "
"discern the original flavors it might have had."
msgstr "为人类制作的食物粒（译注：狗粮）。由于添加了大量香料，无法辨别其原本的味道。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/abstract_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/abstract_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ur-scrap"
msgid_plural "ur-scraps"
msgstr[0] "高級廢料"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/abstract_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/abstract_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "ur-scrap"
msgid "A small techno doodad."
msgstr "一個小型有技術的便宜貨。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "monomeric slurry"
msgid_plural "monomeric slurry"
msgstr[0] "單質細胞液"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "monomeric slurry"
msgid ""
"A collection of the building blocks of polymers.  With this and a whole lot "
"of know-how, you can create proteins and other building blocks of life."
msgstr "一堆有机聚合物基本组分的混合体。如果你知道整套制取流程，你可以利用它创造蛋白质和其他一些组成生命的基本成分。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "micellular growth medium"
msgid_plural "micellular growth mediums"
msgstr[0] "微細胞培養皿"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "micellular growth medium"
msgid ""
"For the mixing of biomaterials that might otherwise be antithetical to one "
"another."
msgstr "用來避免一些可能衝突的生物材料混合的培養皿。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "artificial muscle fibers"
msgid_plural "artificial muscle fibers"
msgstr[0] "人造肌肉纖維"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "artificial muscle fibers"
msgid ""
"Lab-grown or bioprinted muscle fibers; much denser and with higher "
"performance ratios than baseline human muscles."
msgstr "一种在实验室培养或通过3D生物打印技术生产出的肌肉纤维材料，相比常规的的人类肌肉具有更高的肌肉密度与性价比。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "self healing polymers"
msgid_plural "self healing polymers"
msgstr[0] "自我修復聚合物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "self healing polymers"
msgid ""
"Materials capable of taking environmental chemicals and utilizing them for "
"self-repair; be careful you don't make gray goo."
msgstr ""
"一种能够获取环境中的化学材料并利用它们修复自身的材料。请小心对待它们，你也不想一不小心创造出可怕的\"灰色粘质\""
"吧。（指大量失控的纳米机器吞噬所有能接触到的物质来复制自身所引发的世界末日场景，又称灰蛊或灰雾）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "autologous totipotent tissue culture"
msgid_plural "autologous totipotent tissue cultures"
msgstr[0] "自體全能幹細胞培養體"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "autologous totipotent tissue culture"
msgid ""
"Uncontaminated pure cellular matter that, with the right instructions, can "
"become just about anything."
msgstr "未受污染的纯细胞物质，按照正确的步骤处理后能够成长为任何生物组织。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap photonics"
msgid_plural "scrap photonics"
msgstr[0] "廢棄光子電路"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap photonics"
msgid "Small circuits blue and gold, transmitting signals through light."
msgstr "蓝色和金色的小型电路元件，通过光传输信号。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "photonic circuitry"
msgid_plural "photonic circuitries"
msgstr[0] "光子電路版"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "photonic circuitry"
msgid "A resplendent golden grid inlaid on dark blue substrate."
msgstr "一块镶嵌在深蓝色基底上的金光闪闪的网格状电路。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "photonic computation core"
msgid_plural "photonic computation cores"
msgstr[0] "光子計算核心"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "photonic computation core"
msgid "A monolithic circuit shaped as a glowing cube of crystal."
msgstr "一大塊如同發光結晶立方體的電路板。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hypergeometric photonics"
msgid_plural "hypergeometric photonics"
msgstr[0] "超幾何光子體"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "hypergeometric photonics"
msgid ""
"In your hands lies a self-contained digital universe.  Its programs glowing "
"like stars fixed on computational shells infinitely layered."
msgstr "你手掌般大小的元件中有个完全独立的数字宇宙。附着在似乎有着无限层的计算\"壳\"上的程序像恒星一样闪闪发光。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acausal logic permutator"
msgid_plural "acausal logic permutators"
msgstr[0] "因果邏輯置換器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "acausal logic permutator"
msgid "It has given you an answer, but you are yet to ask anything."
msgstr "它給你答案，但你還沒問問題。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/cloth_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/cloth_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "woven metamaterial sheet"
msgid_plural "woven metamaterial sheets"
msgstr[0] "超級材料織物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/cloth_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/cloth_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "woven metamaterial sheet"
msgid "An intricately spun and carefully engineered sheet of iridescent fibers."
msgstr "一片经过精心设计用十分复杂工艺制成的彩虹色纤维织物。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nanowire battery"
msgid_plural "nanowire batteries"
msgstr[0] "奈米線圈電池"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "nanowire battery"
msgid "A small battery component with a very high energy density."
msgstr "具有非常高能量密度的小型電池組件。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ultracapacitor"
msgid_plural "ultracapacitors"
msgstr[0] "超級電容"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "ultracapacitor"
msgid ""
"A capacitor made from exotic compounds, capable of storing a high amount of "
"electric charge."
msgstr "一种由奇异原子化合物制成的超级电容，能储存大量的电荷。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ultracapacitor array"
msgid_plural "ultracapacitor arrays"
msgstr[0] "超級電容陣列"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "ultracapacitor array"
msgid "Ultracapacitors assembled into a finely tuned energy storage array."
msgstr "一個經過精密諧調的超級電容組裝而成的儲能陣列。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "superconductive coil"
msgid_plural "superconductive coils"
msgstr[0] "超導線圈"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "superconductive coil"
msgid ""
"Superconductive wire warped upon itself manipulates the electromagnetic "
"spectrum to store vast amounts of power."
msgstr "自缠绕而成的超导线圈能够控制电磁频谱以储存巨量的能量。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zero-point energy extractor"
msgid_plural "zero-point energy extractors"
msgstr[0] "真空零點能源抽取機"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/energy_storage_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "zero-point energy extractor"
msgid ""
"A complex grid pins space-time to the surface of the multiversal hyper-torus, "
"allowing the energies within to leak into our sliver of existence."
msgstr "一个复杂的时空网格把时空平面钉在多重超环面的表面，让其中所含能量泄漏到我们所生活的空间之中。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "conductive thermoplastic"
msgid_plural "conductive thermoplastics"
msgstr[0] "熱塑性導體"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "conductive thermoplastic"
msgid ""
"An excellent heat conductor and electrical insulator.  Conductive "
"thermoplastics were introduced to the civilian market nearly two centuries "
"ago, and have tightly integrated themselves into the modern society since "
"then."
msgstr "导热热塑塑料是极佳的热导体和电绝缘体，在近两世纪前就已投入民用，并从此深入到现代社会的每个方面。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "supercritical coolant"
msgid_plural "supercritical coolant"
msgstr[0] "超臨界冷卻液"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "supercritical coolant"
msgid ""
"Capable of withstanding extreme temperature gradients, fulleroclathrate "
"supercritical coolants are the lifeblood of high-energy systems, from "
"cutting-edge aerospace engines to experimental small arms tech.  Liquid at "
"room conditions, it has to be used in a pressurized closed-loop system at 450 "
"psi or greater."
msgstr ""
"富勒克莱瑞超临界冷却液能够承受极端温度梯度，是高能量系统不可或缺的成分，在大至尖端航空引擎，小至实验性轻武器中均有广泛应用。该物质在常温下为液体，因此需要在"
" 450 psi 以上的加压闭环系统中使用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "carbon-lattice heatsink"
msgid_plural "carbon-lattice heatsinks"
msgstr[0] "碳晶格散熱器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "carbon-lattice heatsink"
msgid ""
"Sections of dark, translucent, monocrystalline carbon fins, functionally "
"identical to diamond.  Microscopic etches on the inside allows the flow of "
"high-pressure coolant.  Crystalline carbon lattices exhibit far superior "
"thermal conductivity and deformation resistance than any other conventional "
"metals."
msgstr "半透明的深色单晶碳散热片，和钻石具有相同的散热性质。内部刻蚀的微型通道能够通过高压冷却液。碳晶格晶体具有远超常规材料的导热性和抗形变性能。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fermionic nanoribbon"
msgid_plural "fermionic nanoribbons"
msgstr[0] "鐵離子奈米帶"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "fermionic nanoribbon"
msgid ""
"This delicate bundle of silvery, iridescent cables is capable of transporting "
"heat energy between its connections instantly without ever heating up by "
"itself.  Even the slightest damage to the casing will annihilate the "
"ground-state quantum uniformity of the fermionic superfluid matrix - Handle "
"with care!"
msgstr ""
"这束闪闪发光的脆弱银色线缆能够在自身不升温的情况下在其连接的物体间瞬时传递热量。即使是对其外壳造成的最轻微的损伤也会使其中的费米超流体阵列中的基态量子一致性"
"消失——小心保管！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Maxwellian entropic chirality generator"
msgid_plural "Maxwellian entropic chirality generators"
msgstr[0] "麦克斯韦熵手性发生器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "Maxwellian entropic chirality generator"
msgid ""
"A nondescript square piece of metal about the size of a computer chip.  One "
"side is cold to the touch, while the other is uncomfortably hot.  "
"Hermetically sealed and devoid of any identifying feature, this peculiar "
"device gives off an unexplainable, sinister aura."
msgstr "一块电脑芯片大小的难以名状的方形金属块。一端手感冰凉，而另一端热得烫手。这个奇怪的密封装置没有任何显著的特征，并且散发出一种难以言喻的令人不安的光晕。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salvaged coolant system"
msgid_plural "salvaged coolant systems"
msgstr[0] "回收的冷卻系統"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/heat_transfer_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "salvaged coolant system"
msgid ""
"Rusty fluid reservoirs and decomposing high-pressure tubing containing still "
"usable supercritical coolant.  You could disassemble it to separate the "
"liquid coolant from the rest of the scrap."
msgstr "生鏽的儲液筒和快分解的高壓管路容器，仍有些還能使用的超臨界冷卻液。你可以拆解它以分離出冷卻液和金屬廢料。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "high quality electromagnet"
msgid_plural "high quality electromagnets"
msgstr[0] "高品質電磁元件"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "high quality electromagnet"
msgid "A sturdy, industrially crafted electromagnet."
msgstr "堅固耐用的工業製電磁元件。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cryo electromagnet"
msgid_plural "cryo electromagnets"
msgstr[0] "低溫電磁鐵"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "cryo electromagnet"
msgid ""
"A powerful super conductive electromagnet, that must be kept at very low "
"temperatures to operate."
msgstr "一个强大的低温超导电磁铁，必须保持在非常低的温度下才能工作。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "super conductive electromagnet"
msgid_plural "super conductive electromagnets"
msgstr[0] "超導電磁鐵"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "super conductive electromagnet"
msgid "A powerful electromagnet made from a room temperature superconductor."
msgstr "由常溫超導體製成的強大電磁鐵。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ferrofluid dynamo"
msgid_plural "ferrofluid dynamos"
msgstr[0] "磁流體發電機"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/magnet_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "ferrofluid dynamo"
msgid "Black metallic fluid, harmonically flowing from one fractal shape to the next."
msgstr "黑色的金屬液體，諧和地流動成一個又一個的分形形狀。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "composite alloy"
msgid_plural "composite alloys"
msgstr[0] "複合合金"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "composite alloy"
msgid "Miscellaneous scrap pieces made from a composite alloy."
msgstr "由複合合金製成的雜件。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vacuum cast carbide"
msgid_plural "vacuum cast carbides"
msgstr[0] "真空鑄造碳化物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "vacuum cast carbide"
msgid "Malleable carbide cast by forges on high earth orbit."
msgstr "在高地球軌道上鍛造可塑性碳鑄件。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nanoprinted alloy"
msgid_plural "nanoprinted alloys"
msgstr[0] "奈米印刷合金"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "nanoprinted alloy"
msgid ""
"A meta material fabricated by precisely layering different elements at an "
"atomic scale."
msgstr "一种通过在原子尺度上精确地分层放置不同的元素制造而成的超级材料。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crystal forged neutrite"
msgid_plural "crystal forged neutrites"
msgstr[0] "晶鍛中子材料"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "crystal forged neutrite"
msgid ""
"Great forges within the Earth's core wrought hydrogen into flaming metal and "
"poured it within lattices of super conductive lanthanum.  Locked in magnetic "
"equilibrium, it was left to cool into a dark unbreakable metal."
msgstr "位于地核深层的巨大锻炉将氢气转化为燃烧的金属态，并将金属氢注入超导镧的晶格中。将其被锁在磁平衡中，最终冷却成一种牢不可破的黑色金属。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "phase uneven matter"
msgid_plural "phase uneven matters"
msgstr[0] "不穩定相位物質"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/material_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "phase uneven matter"
msgid "Matter condensed from the liminal spaces between dimensions."
msgstr "由多维度之间阈限空间凝结而成的物质材料。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peripheral electrode"
msgid_plural "peripheral electrodes"
msgstr[0] "外圈電極"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "peripheral electrode"
msgid ""
"A thin strand of wire and a clamp, meant to be spliced into the smaller "
"nerves of the human body."
msgstr "一根带着夹子的细长电线，用来嵌入连接到人体四周细小的神经突触上。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "neural electrode"
msgid_plural "neural electrodes"
msgstr[0] "神經電極"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "neural electrode"
msgid ""
"A small array of metallic needles allows complex communication between "
"machine and human mind."
msgstr "一個小型的金屬針陣列，讓人機之間可以進行複雜的溝通。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "brain implant prod"
msgid_plural "brain implant prods"
msgstr[0] "腦植入物刺針"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "brain implant prod"
msgid ""
"A complexly etched rod of metal interfaces with the corpus callosum of the "
"patient, granting increased control of bionic functions."
msgstr "一根外表有着复杂的金属刻蚀图案的针，与受体的胼胝体相结合通信，提升对生化插件的控制。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "artificial neural tissue"
msgid_plural "artificial neural tissues"
msgstr[0] "人工神經組織"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "artificial neural tissue"
msgid ""
"Photonic axons process thought at speeds far surpassing primitive, "
"chemical-driven communication."
msgstr "光子轴突的思维处理速度远远超过了原始的、基于化学驱动的交流手段。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "neurosynaptic interface matrix"
msgid_plural "neurosynaptic interface matrices"
msgstr[0] "神經突觸介面矩陣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#. ~ Description of "neurosynaptic interface matrix"
msgid ""
"A membrane of artificial neurons envelops the cerebral cortex, melding "
"machine and human intellect into a gestalt much greater than its individual "
"parts."
msgstr "一層人造神經元構成的膜包覆著大腦皮層，將機械和人類智能完全結合成比人類和機械更強大的格式塔。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/optics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/optics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "laser optics"
msgid_plural "laser optics"
msgstr[0] "雷射光學元件"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/optics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/optics.json
#. ~ Description of "laser optics"
msgid ""
"Lenses, mirrors, emitters and other optical elements that once belonged to a "
"weapon, industrial cutter or laser research setup."
msgstr "透鏡，鏡子，雷射發射器和各種應該曾經屬於一種武器的光學元件，又或許是工業切割機或者雷射研究設備。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/optics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/optics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "metamaterial lens"
msgid_plural "metamaterial lenses"
msgstr[0] "超級材料鏡片"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/optics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/optics.json
#. ~ Description of "metamaterial lens"
msgid ""
"A diminute sphere of crystal and metal, magnetically affixed to the centroid "
"of its containing chamber."
msgstr "一个由晶体和金属组成的微型球体，被磁性固定在其容室的质心上。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "10mm Pistol"
msgid_plural "10mm Pistols"
msgstr[0] "10mm 手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "10mm Pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "10mm Pistol" of gun "Seyfert 84K"
#. ~ Description of "10mm Pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Seyfert 84K" of item "10mm Pistol"
msgid ""
"Commonly carried by shipping crews that can afford it, Seyfert Armistice's "
"84K pistol doesn't particularly shine or show anything special but it keeps "
"you safe on long journeys in the vast dark of Orion's Arm."
msgstr "通常由能负担得起价格的船员随身携带，塞弗特停战日公司出品的 84K 手枪并没有任何特别闪亮或突出的特点，但它可以保证你在猎户座旋臂广阔黑暗的长途旅行安全。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "10mm Pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "10mm Pistol"
msgid "vatforged pistol"
msgid_plural "vatforged pistols"
msgstr[0] "vatforged 手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Description of variant "10mm Pistol" of gun "vatforged pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "vatforged pistol" of item "10mm Pistol"
msgid ""
"Across the Orion Arm, there exist pistols that possess subtle elegance, "
"unmatched precision, or even just straightforward lethality.  This one simply "
"shoots bullets."
msgstr "在猎户臂上，有的手枪精巧优雅，有的精准无双，有的甚至直接致命。 而这把枪只会射出子弹。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "10mm Pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "10mm Pistol"
msgid "Seyfert 84K"
msgid_plural "Seyfert 84Ks"
msgstr[0] "塞弗特 84K 手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/7.50mm.json
