#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "MarSec. 4"
msgid_plural "MarSec. 4s"
msgstr[0] "MarSec. 4s 手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "MarSec. 4"
#. ~ Description of "MarSec. 4"
msgid ""
"Dependable, reliable, classic.  The MarSec. 4 is the combat pistol made for "
"those who can differentiate real quality from glued-on tech."
msgstr ""
"Dependable, reliable, classic.  The MarSec. 4 is the combat pistol made for "
"those who can differentiate real quality from glued-on tech."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "2rd burst"
msgstr "二连发"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#. ~ Variant name of gun "W1011 Silvergram"
#. ~ Variant name of item "W1011 Silvergram"
msgid "W1011 Silvergram"
msgid_plural "W1011 Silvergrams"
msgstr[0] "W1011 \"希瓦格兰\"手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "W1011 Silvergram"
#. ~ Description of variant "W1011 Silvergram" of gun "W1011 Silvergram"
#. ~ Description of "W1011 Silvergram"
#. ~ Description of variant "W1011 Silvergram" of item "W1011 Silvergram"
msgid ""
"A finely sculpted white and silver pistol entrusted to Wraitheon's corporate "
"elite.  It employs advanced targeting and precision guiding capabilities to "
"deliver devastating bursts of guided 10mm microjet darts.  Firing is as "
"expensive as it looks."
msgstr ""
"一把精工雕琢的银白色手枪，被被授予\"鬼神\"企业的精英。它采用了先进的瞄准和精确制导能力，能射出毁灭性的10"
"毫米镖头微型导弹。射一发子弹的费用和它的外观一样昂贵。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "W1011 Silvergram"
#. ~ Variant name of item "W1011 Silvergram"
msgid "W1011 Silverhawk"
msgid_plural "W1011 Silverhawks"
msgstr[0] "W1011 \"银鹰\"手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Description of variant "W1011 Silvergram" of gun "W1011 Silverhawk"
#. ~ Description of variant "W1011 Silverhawk" of item "W1011 Silvergram"
msgid ""
"A Silvergram smart pistol given a far less conspicuous \"military carbon\" "
"black finish.  Its performance and smart targeting capacities are otherwise "
"identical."
msgstr "一把希瓦格兰智能手枪的\"军用碳素\"黑色涂层低可见版。除此之外，性能和智能瞄准功能和原版相同。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/10mm.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "2rd.  burst"
msgstr "两连发"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Gibson S86"
msgid_plural "Gibson S86s"
msgstr[0] "吉布森 S86 榴弹发射器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Gibson S86"
#. ~ Description of "Gibson S86"
msgid ""
"Manufactured by Gibson Armory, the S86 is a light-weight grenade launcher "
"designed to take care of moderately armored opponents.  While the S86 "
"firepower is nothing to truly gawk at, it still packs quite a punch both for "
"the target and user and is usually mounted as it is impossible to fire with "
"average strength."
msgstr ""
"由吉布森军械公司制造，S86 是一款轻型榴弹发射器，旨在对付中等装甲的对手。虽然 S86 "
"的火力并未真正令人瞠目结舌，它仍然给人狠狠一击，无论是对目标和使用者，通常需要车载，因为普通人根本无法承受它射击时的后坐力。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "DOUBLE"
msgstr "双发"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "1025 Goa"
msgid_plural "1025 Goa"
msgstr[0] "1025\"果阿\"榴弹步枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "1025 Goa"
#. ~ Description of "1025 Goa"
msgid ""
"A powerful, single shot 25mm rifle, heavy under the weight of several recoil "
"dampening mechanisms.  Designed by the now defunct Goa Firearms, it was "
"originally conceived as a luxury rifle for sport hunting alien megafauna."
msgstr ""
"一种威力强大的单发25"
"mm榴弹步枪，由于多个反冲缓冲机构的重量而非常重。它是由现已不复存在的果阿枪械公司设计的，最初被认为是一种用于竞赛狩猎外星巨型动物的豪华步枪。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Armory 2519s"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"2519型步枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
#. ~ Description of "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
msgid ""
"The much feared 2519 smart sniper platform leverages advanced ballistic "
"targeting and guidance computers to deliver heavy munitions with unerring "
"precision.  Its undisputed lethality makes it a rare sight outside of the "
"company's max security divisions."
msgstr ""
"这把更令人胆寒的2519"
"型智能狙击平台使用先进的弹道瞄准和制导计算机，能精确无误地发射出重型弹药。其无可争议的致命威力使其在公司最高等级的安保部门之外极为罕见。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/40mm_grenade.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/40mm_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "vatforged grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "vatforged grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "vatforged grenade launchers"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/40mm_grenade.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/40mm_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of gun "vatforged grenade launcher"
#. ~ Description of "vatforged grenade launcher"
msgid ""
"A crude grenade launcher that's been either ripped from a broken robot or "
"built using a hacked template.  The remnants of a loading rack allow it to "
"hold three 40mm grenades at once."
msgstr ""
"A crude grenade launcher that's been either ripped from a broken robot or "
"built using a hacked template.  The remnants of a loading rack allow it to "
"hold three 40mm grenades at once."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/5x50.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "eidolon derringer"
msgid_plural "eidolon derringers"
msgstr[0] "伊多伦德林加手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/5x50.json
#. ~ Description of gun "eidolon derringer"
#. ~ Description of "eidolon derringer"
msgid ""
"A slick, miniature derringer designed as a backup weapon for covert "
"operations and close-range assassination.  It will fire up to four 5x50mm "
"penetrators simultaneously, to devastating effect."
msgstr "一把外表光滑的微型德林加手枪，设计用于秘密行动和近距离暗杀任务的备用武器。它能够同时发射四发5×50mm口径的穿甲弹，造成毁灭性的后果。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/5x50.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "RM216 SPIW"
msgid_plural "RM216 SPIWs"
msgstr[0] "RM216 SPIW"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/5x50.json
#. ~ Description of gun "RM216 SPIW"
#. ~ Description of "RM216 SPIW"
msgid ""
"This light carbine fires 5x50mm armor-piercing flechette cartridges.  "
"Classified as a special purpose individual weapon, this advanced firearm was "
"developed by Rivtech for the US military shortly before the end of the world. "
" Designed to be fired in bursts, it excels in close combat."
msgstr ""
"這把輕量的卡賓槍能發射 5x50mm 穿甲鋼鏢彈。這把在末日前由 Rivtech "
"設計給美國軍隊的先進槍械被列為特殊用途的武器。在近距離戰鬥中能連發並達到很好的效果。(註: SPIW 即特種用途單兵武器)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/5x50.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "RM232 IDW"
msgid_plural "RM232 IDWs"
msgstr[0] "RM232 IDW"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/5x50.json
#. ~ Description of gun "RM232 IDW"
#. ~ Description of "RM232 IDW"
msgid ""
"This lightweight machine pistol fires 5x50mm armor-piercing flechette "
"cartridges.  Classified as an individual defense weapon, this advanced "
"firearm was developed by Rivtech for the US military shortly before the end "
"of the world.  Designed to be fired in bursts, it excels in close combat."
msgstr ""
"這把輕巧的自動手槍發射 5x50mm 的箭型穿甲彈, 通常是作為個人防衛武器使用, 這把先進的武器是在世界毀滅不久前, 由 Rivtech "
"為美軍所設計。這把槍被設計為連發, 在近距離交火中佔盡優勢。(註: IDW 即單兵自衛武器)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/5x50.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/advanced.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/needle.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
