#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/foam.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/foam.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "foam gun"
msgid_plural "foam guns"
msgstr[0] "泡沫水泥喷射器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/foam.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/foam.json
#. ~ Description of gun "foam gun"
#. ~ Description of "foam gun"
msgid ""
"A stubby industrial tool used to shoot expanding foam.  Using it as a weapon "
"might require some creative thinking."
msgstr "一把粗短的产业工具，用来喷射能够迅速膨胀的泡沫水泥。把它当作武器可能需要有一些创意。"

