#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "wrist-stunner"
msgid_plural "wrist-stunners"
msgstr[0] "眩晕机械手"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "wrist-stunner"
#. ~ Description of "wrist-stunner"
msgid ""
"A severed robotic hand from a Wraitheon Sentinel.  The powerful electro-laser "
"stun gun embed on its wrist is still functional, and can be used when "
"connected to an UPS."
msgstr "从\"鬼神\"哨兵机器人上砍下来的一只机械手。腕上嵌入的强力电磁激光眩晕枪仍可使用，当使用UPS供电时可以继续使用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "wrist-trilaser"
msgid_plural "wrist-trilasers"
msgstr[0] "三管激光机械手"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "wrist-trilaser"
#. ~ Description of "wrist-trilaser"
msgid ""
"A powerful tri-barreled laser weapon, still mounted to the robotic hand of "
"the Wraitheon drone it originally belonged to.  Can still be fired when "
"connected to an UPS."
msgstr "一把仍安装在\"鬼神\"机器人的一只机械手上的三管激光枪。当使用UPS供电时可以继续使用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "trilaser"
msgstr "三管激光"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "handheld x-ray cannon"
msgid_plural "handheld x-ray cannons"
msgstr[0] "手持X射线激光加农炮"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "handheld x-ray cannon"
#. ~ Description of "handheld x-ray cannon"
msgid ""
"This is an x-ray laser stripped from a TX-5LR Cerberus laser turret that has "
"been modified to use UPS power for firing.  Single shot then requires "
"reloading.  Nicknamed the 'Tin Can Killer' for its ability to destroy power "
"armor."
msgstr ""
"一只从 TX-5LR "
"\"地狱犬\"型激光炮塔上拆下的X射线激光炮。被修改成使用UPS供电。每次射击后需要重新装填。绰号\"锡罐杀手\"，因为它具有摧毁动力装甲的巨大威力。\n"
"\"一炮一个罐头人。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "mounted x-ray cannon"
msgid_plural "mounted x-ray cannons"
msgstr[0] "车载X射线激光加农炮"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "shoddy laser rifle"
msgid_plural "shoddy laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "粗製雷射步槍"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "shoddy laser rifle"
#. ~ Description of "shoddy laser rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a cheap laser rifle made from common components.  Weak, but can be "
"powered with rechargeable batteries."
msgstr "這是一把由常見的零件製作的廉價雷射步槍。火力不高，但能夠以充電電池供電。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "av-22"
msgid_plural "av-22s"
msgstr[0] "Av-22 激光手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "av-22"
#. ~ Description of "av-22"
msgid ""
"A common pulse-laser pistol cleared for civilian use.  Recoilless, "
"energy-efficient, and easy to use, the av-22 is often carried as a defense "
"weapon by those who lack the practice required to effectively use ballistic "
"weaponry.  Due to its low power, it must be fired in sequence mode to stand a "
"chance against hardened foes."
msgstr ""
"一把可用于民用的激光脉冲手枪。无后坐力，效率高，而且很易用。Av-22"
"主要由缺少需要有效使用兵器的锻炼的人用作防御性武器。因为它的威力很低，所以必须连续发射，才有机会对付强大的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "pulse"
msgstr "脉冲"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "2s sequence"
msgstr "连射2秒"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "3s sequence"
msgstr "连射3秒"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "E-150b"
msgid_plural "E-150bs"
msgstr[0] "E-150b 激光手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "E-150b"
#. ~ Description of "E-150b"
msgid ""
"A silver, elegantly-wrought laser pistol that fires armor-piercing bolts of "
"golden light.  A now-irreplaceable historical artifact built by the "
"engineering AIs of the late Hyperspace Era, it is as precious as it is deadly."
msgstr "一个银色、工艺精良的激光手枪，可以射出穿透装甲的金光。一个超空间时代晚期的工程师们创造的、现在仍无可取代的历史性神器，如同它的致命程度一样珍贵。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Izhevsk PLC-75"
msgid_plural "Izhevsk PLC-75s"
msgstr[0] "伊热夫斯克PLC-75"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Izhevsk PLC-75"
#. ~ Description of "Izhevsk PLC-75"
msgid ""
"Straight from the bureaus of the old Soviet Union the PLC-75 is the crude and "
"brutal answer to the constraints posed by the design of heavy laser ordnance. "
" Its use of antiquated flashtube pumped laser technology makes it unwieldy "
"and wholly incompatible with modern equipment, whether this offers any "
"consolation to downrange targets remains a matter of contentious dispute."
msgstr "PLC-75直接来自古苏联的设计局，是对重型激光武器设计限制的暴力答案。它使用过时的闪光灯管泵浦激光技术，因此非常笨重，与现代设备完全不兼容。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Shikishma A-82 tactical laser"
msgid_plural "Shikishma A-82 tactical lasers"
msgstr[0] "敷岛A-82战术激光枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Shikishma A-82 tactical laser"
#. ~ Description of "Shikishma A-82 tactical laser"
msgid ""
"Crown jewel of Shikishma armories, and possible product of unsanctioned data "
"scavenging, the A-82 is the undisputed market leader when it comes to man "
"portable laser weaponry.  Sustained fire is likely to cause secondary "
"explosions as target layers are vaporized."
msgstr "A-82激光枪是敷岛军工的明珠，可能属于非法数据挖掘的成果。它在单兵激光武器市场的地位无可匹敌。连续射击可能会蒸发目标材料，制造二次爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "V14 laser pistol"
msgid_plural "V14 laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "V14 激光手枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "V14 laser pistol"
#. ~ Description of "V14 laser pistol"
msgid ""
"An incredibly ancient and outdated laser pistol design with origins traceable "
"to Earth's early Space Age.  One of the few 'open-hardware' guns, its leaked "
"and widely-circulated design specifications allow this weapon to retain some "
"popularity within backwater worlds."
msgstr ""
"一个不可思议的古老而过时的激光手枪设计，最早可以追溯到太空时代早期。是少数的\"开放硬件\""
"枪之一，它的泄露后广为流传的设计规格让这把武器在大灾变后的世界中保留了一些人气。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "mounted a7 laser rifle"
msgid_plural "mounted a7 laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "车载 A7 激光步枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Makeshift Scrambler Rifle"
msgid_plural "Makeshift Scrambler Rifles"
msgstr[0] "自制扰频步枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Makeshift Scrambler Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Makeshift Scrambler Rifle"
msgid ""
"This 'energy weapon' appears to be haphazardly jury-rigged from commercially "
"available electronics.  It has a radar dish placed where a barrel would be, "
"and the frame of a weapon is covered in a mesh of wiring.  Despite its "
"appearance, this weapon can temporarily stun robots if you manage to hit "
"their sensors."
msgstr ""
"这把\"能量武器\""
"似乎是由民用电子设备拼凑而成的。它枪管所在位置安装上了一个雷达天线，武器框架外覆盖满了金属导线。尽管外观如此，如果你能用它精确击中机器人的传感器的话，就能暂"
"时击晕机器人。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "xm34 EMP projector"
msgid_plural "xm34 EMP projectors"
msgstr[0] "XM34 EMP 发射器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/mining_rod.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/mining_rod.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "mining rod launcher"
msgid_plural "mining rod launchers"
msgstr[0] "采矿探棒发射器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/mining_rod.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/mining_rod.json
#. ~ Description of gun "mining rod launcher"
#. ~ Description of "mining rod launcher"
msgid ""
"Based on an old TsKBEM design, this is a rail launcher used in mining "
"exploration.  The rod is fired into a rock face and a seismic mapper on the "
"launcher displays ore veins.  Not being designed for combat, it is difficult "
"to use without the augmented strength of an exosuit and the reloading process "
"is quite slow.  The barrel is covered in warning labels indemnifying the "
"manufacturer of any injuries caused by misuse."
msgstr ""
"用于采矿勘探的磁轨枪，基于TsKBEM的旧设计。磁轨枪发射探测杆撞击岩壁，然后枪上的地震绘图器就会显示内部矿脉。由于不是为战斗而设计，因此它在没有外骨骼增强"
"力量的情况下很难使用，装弹过程也相当缓慢。枪管上贴有警告标签，如果使用不当造成任何伤害，制造商将不承担赔偿责任。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/needle.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/needle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "GG-860 Wasp Rifle"
msgid_plural "GG-860 Wasp Rifles"
msgstr[0] "GG-860 Wasp Rifles"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/needle.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/needle.json
#. ~ Description of gun "GG-860 Wasp Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "GG-860 Wasp Rifle"
msgid ""
"This light coilgun fires 3x35mm armor-piercing flechette.  Classified as a "
"support crew weapon that can be stashed in hidden lockers throughout the "
"floors of a ship.  Designed to be fired in short bursts, if the flechettes "
"pierce a ship's hull they leave tiny holes that are easily repaired."
msgstr ""
"This light coilgun fires 3x35mm armor-piercing flechette.  Classified as a "
"support crew weapon that can be stashed in hidden lockers throughout the "
"floors of a ship.  Designed to be fired in short bursts, if the flechettes "
"pierce a ship's hull they leave tiny holes that are easily repaired."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/needle.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/needle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "3x35mm automatic 'Wandering Priest' coilpistol"
msgid_plural "3x35mm automatic 'Wandering Priest' coilpistols"
msgstr[0] "3x35mm automatic 'Wandering Priest' coilpistols"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/needle.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/needle.json
#. ~ Description of gun "3x35mm automatic 'Wandering Priest' coilpistol"
#. ~ Description of "3x35mm automatic 'Wandering Priest' coilpistol"
msgid ""
"An automatic coilgun made entirely of lightweight ceramics, with no moving "
"pieces and if loaded with splinter rounds almost entirely invisible on most "
"security scanners.  No one is sure who manufactures this assassin's tool, but "
"they randomly come onto the back room markets frequented by the unsavory."
msgstr ""
"An automatic coilgun made entirely of lightweight ceramics, with no moving "
"pieces and if loaded with splinter rounds almost entirely invisible on most "
"security scanners.  No one is sure who manufactures this assassin's tool, but "
"they randomly come onto the back room markets frequented by the unsavory."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Magnadrive 230K"
msgid_plural "Magnadrive 230K"
msgstr[0] "磁驱 230K"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Magnadrive 230K"
#. ~ Description of "Magnadrive 230K"
msgid ""
"A heavy plasma railgun that easily defeats most forms of conventional armor "
"and flash-incinerates anything  behind it.  Its large size and liability to "
"overheat make it unsuitable for infantry use, but it is a common sight on "
"military vehicles and in the hands of power-armored troops, especially when "
"heavy armor is expected."
msgstr ""
"一门重型等离子磁轨炮可以轻松击败大多数形式的传统装甲，并在闪光下焚烧它背后的任何东西。它的体积大，容易过热，不适合步兵使用，但它在军用车辆上和动力装甲部队手"
"中很常见，特别是在需要重型装甲的情况下。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "PAM-41 2g"
msgid_plural "PAM-41 2gs"
msgstr[0] "PAM-41 2g 等离子步枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Description of gun "PAM-41 2g"
#. ~ Description of "PAM-41 2g"
msgid ""
"A short and stubby 2 gram plasma railgun occasionally used by espatiers as a "
"hull breaching tool.  Like larger plasma weapons, it propels toroids of "
"plasma that detonate on contact, but its reduced size heavily hampers its "
"range and damage output.  Fired within an atmosphere, its very low range "
"makes it dangerous to shooter and target alike."
msgstr ""
"一支短粗的两克等离子磁轨炮，偶尔会被星际战士用作破坏船体的工具。同其他更大的等离子武器一样，它会喷射出触碰引爆的等离子环，但它缩减的尺寸严重限制了它的射程和"
"伤害输出能力。在大气中开火时，它极低的射程使得它对射击者和目标都很危险。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "377-UASTA (weaponized)"
msgid_plural "377-UASTA (weaponized)"
msgstr[0] "377-UASTA 等离子喷枪（改）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Description of gun "377-UASTA (weaponized)"
#. ~ Description of "377-UASTA (weaponized)"
msgid ""
"A common modification for directed plasma torches that involves the "
"installation of oversize capacitor banks and judiciously bypassed safety "
"mechanisms, allowing them to function as a deadly if decidedly short-ranged "
"weapons.  In most cases, the resulting \"gun\" can still perform its original "
"metalworking functions, albeit at a much lower efficiency.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike purposefully made plasma weapons, the propelled plasma bottle won't "
"cause a considerable explosion upon contact, allowing for relatively safe "
"operation within enclosed spaces."
msgstr ""
"一款常见的定向等离子喷枪的改造型号，包括安装了超大电容器组和精心绕过防护机构，使其能够作为致命的短程武器使用。在大多数情况下，这把\"枪\""
"仍然可以用于其原始的金属加工功能，尽管效率要低得多。\n"
"与专门制造的等离子武器不同，喷气式等离子瓶在撞击时不会引发相当大的爆炸，从而能在封闭空间内进行相对安全的操作。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "direct fusion gun"
msgid_plural "direct fusion gun"
msgstr[0] "direct fusion gun"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Description of gun "direct fusion gun"
#. ~ Description of "direct fusion gun"
msgid ""
"Exhaust from a salvaged starship engine is channeled through a series of "
"magnetic coils and focused into a searing fan of plasma, creating a crude but "
"effective short range weapon that can easily melt through most forms of "
"armor.  Its makeshift nature and lack of proper cooling systems make it prone "
"to overheating and catastrophic failure."
msgstr ""
"Exhaust from a salvaged starship engine is channeled through a series of "
"magnetic coils and focused into a searing fan of plasma, creating a crude but "
"effective short range weapon that can easily melt through most forms of "
"armor.  Its makeshift nature and lack of proper cooling systems make it prone "
"to overheating and catastrophic failure."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "standard"
msgstr "standard"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/plasma.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "unsafe"
msgstr "unsafe"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/projectile.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/projectile.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "bionic skullgun"
msgid_plural "bionic skullguns"
msgstr[0] "生化顱骨槍"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/projectile.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/projectile.json
#. ~ Description of gun "bionic skullgun"
#. ~ Description of "bionic skullgun"
msgid "Bionic one-shot subdermal 10mm pistol integrated with your head."
msgstr "通过生化插件植入你头骨的单发10mm手枪。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/projectile.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/projectile.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "makeshift rail rifle"
msgid_plural "makeshift rail rifles"
msgstr[0] "粗製軌道步槍"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/projectile.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/projectile.json
#. ~ Description of gun "makeshift rail rifle"
#. ~ Description of "makeshift rail rifle"
msgid ""
"A single-shot, break-action, electrically propelled, steel rail launcher "
"handcrafted from scrap.  The hypervelocity metal stake that it fires is "
"accelerated to the point of spontaneous combustion by a Lorentz force "
"generated by electromagnetic induction, powered by a standard UPS."
msgstr ""
"一把电力驱动的单发开膛式钢制轨道发射器，采用废金属自制而成。它通过电磁感应所产生的洛仑兹力发射超高速金属棒，同时加热棒体至接近自燃的温度，该武器采用标准UP"
"S供电。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Benelli 315"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Benelli 315"
msgid "Benelli 315"
msgid_plural "Benelli 315s"
msgstr[0] "伯奈利 315 霰弹枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Benelli 315"
#. ~ Description of variant "Benelli 315" of gun "Benelli 315"
#. ~ Description of "Benelli 315"
#. ~ Description of variant "Benelli 315" of item "Benelli 315"
msgid ""
"A widely popular combat shotgun featuring minor iterative refinements to a "
"base design nearly three centuries old.  Whether the design is outdated or "
"unsurpassable remains a matter of personal opinion."
msgstr "广受欢迎的战斗霰弹枪，对近三个世纪前的基础设计小修小补的成果。至于这种设计是过时了还是不可超越，则见仁见智。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Benelli 315"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Benelli 315"
msgid "vatforged shotgun"
msgid_plural "vatforged shotguns"
msgstr[0] "盗版霰弹枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Benelli 315" of gun "vatforged shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "vatforged shotgun" of item "Benelli 315"
msgid ""
"A crude but otherwise serviceable pump-action shotgun built from a hacked or "
"scavenged template.  Frequently seen in the hands of frontier pirates, "
"settlers or salvors.  Not that such groups are much different from one "
"another."
msgstr "一种粗制滥造但可用的泵动式霰弹枪，来自骇入或挖掘的数据模板。经常出现在边境海盗、定居者或打捞者手中。这些群体本就没什么区别。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Benelli 315"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Benelli 315"
msgid "m2101-UASTA shotgun"
msgid_plural "m2101-UASTA shotguns"
msgstr[0] "M2101-UASTA霰弹枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Benelli 315" of gun "m2101-UASTA shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "m2101-UASTA shotgun" of item "Benelli 315"
msgid ""
"The standard issue combat shotgun of UICA marine and colonial forces.  Shot "
"shells have poor performance against modern combat armor, so the M2101 is "
"more often used during policing and peacekeeping operations."
msgstr "UICA陆战队和殖民地部队的标准战斗霰弹枪。霰弹对现代护甲的效果较差，因此M2101更常用于治安和维和行动。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Accipiter Magnastorm-12"
msgid_plural "Accipiter Magnastorm-12"
msgstr[0] "Accipiter Magnastorm-12"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Accipiter Magnastorm-12"
#. ~ Description of "Accipiter Magnastorm-12"
msgid ""
"An advanced shotgun that combines chemical and electromagnetic propulsion "
"systems to accelerate and focus a cloud of steel flechettes.  Resulting in a "
"longer effective range and greater penetration than whats conventionally "
"possible.  Most often deployed during low-intensity corporate conflicts."
msgstr ""
"一种先进的霰弹枪，融合了化学和电磁推进系统，用于加速并聚焦一团钢质箭弹。这使得其有效射程更长，穿透力更强，超越了传统霰弹枪的性能。这种枪械最常用于低强度的企"
"业冲突中。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Raketa"
msgid_plural "Raketas"
msgstr[0] "“火箭”式霰弹枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Raketa"
#. ~ Description of "Raketa"
msgid ""
"A massive TSKBEM-design shotgun intended for exosuit forces, the Raketa aka "
"'Rocket' is a magazine-fed bullpup shotgun featuring twin barrels.  This "
"design remains popular for extra-atmospheric operations as the 12ga rounds "
"are less likely to pierce a ship or station's delicate hull."
msgstr ""
"“火箭”式（Raketa，俄语“火箭”）是TsKBEM设计的大型霰弹枪，主要用于动力装甲部队。12"
"号口径霰弹更不容易击穿飞船或空间站的脆弱壳体，因此在大气外行动中仍然很受欢迎。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/shot.json
