msgstr "脉冲"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/voltaic.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "W3310 Archangel ENR"
msgid_plural "W3310 Archangel ENRs"
msgstr[0] "W3310 Archangel ENRs"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/voltaic.json
#. ~ Description of gun "W3310 Archangel ENR"
#. ~ Description of "W3310 Archangel ENR"
msgid ""
"A powerful anti-drone defense weapon, the W3310 Archangel is capable of "
"firing a chain of electrical discharges that can arc between multiple "
"targets.  Most effective against groups of lightly armored foes, use within "
"closed spaces is not recommended due to the risk of self-inflicted injury."
msgstr ""
"作为一种强大的反无人机防御武器，W3310 “大天使 ”能够在多个目标之间发射弧形连锁放电。 "
"该武器对轻型装甲的敌人群体最为有效，但由于有自伤的风险，不建议在封闭空间内使用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/voltaic.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "W3100 Volt"
msgid_plural "W3100 Volts"
msgstr[0] "W3100 电子激光枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/voltaic.json
#. ~ Description of gun "W3100 Volt"
#. ~ Description of "W3100 Volt"
msgid ""
"Wraitheon Armories' premier electrolaser personal defense weapon.  The W3100 "
"Volt adjustable power settings make it adaptable to most conflict situations, "
"lethal or otherwise, and make it a favorite among well-off security forces "
"and law enforcement corps."
msgstr "鬼神军械库出品的顶级电激光个人防卫武器。W3100伏的可调电源设置使其适应大多数冲突情况，无论是致命或是其他情况，因此深受富裕的安全部队和执法部队的青眯。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "ETC firmware (overpressure)"
msgid_plural "ETC firmware (overpressure)"
msgstr[0] "ETC firmware (overpressure)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "ETC firmware (overpressure)"
#. ~ Description of "ETC firmware (overpressure)"
msgid ""
"Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  "
"Tweaks the ignition timing to maximize pressure in the chamber, increasing "
"muzzle velocity and armor penetration at the cost of increased wear on the "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  "
"Tweaks the ignition timing to maximize pressure in the chamber, increasing "
"muzzle velocity and armor penetration at the cost of increased wear on the "
"weapon."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "ETC firmware (subsonic)"
msgid_plural "ETC firmware (subsonic)"
msgstr[0] "ETC firmware (subsonic)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "ETC firmware (subsonic)"
#. ~ Description of "ETC firmware (subsonic)"
msgid ""
"Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  "
"Tweaks the ignition timing to ensure that fired bullets remain subsonic, "
"reducing noise at the cost of range and armor penetration."
msgstr ""
"Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  "
"Tweaks the ignition timing to ensure that fired bullets remain subsonic, "
"reducing noise at the cost of range and armor penetration."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "ETC firmware (incendiary)"
msgid_plural "ETC firmware (incendiary)"
msgstr[0] "ETC firmware (incendiary)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/ETC_firmware.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "ETC firmware (incendiary)"
#. ~ Description of "ETC firmware (incendiary)"
msgid ""
"Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  "
"Increases the potency of the heat ignition system, causing bullets to melt "
"and be subsequently fired as globules of superheated metal.  The projectiles "
"will set targets on fire, at the cost of direct damage, range, and weapon "
"durability."
msgstr ""
"Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  "
"Increases the potency of the heat ignition system, causing bullets to melt "
"and be subsequently fired as globules of superheated metal.  The projectiles "
"will set targets on fire, at the cost of direct damage, range, and weapon "
"durability."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "electrolaser conversion"
#. ~ Description of "electrolaser conversion"
msgid ""
"A set of high-tech electronics and optics.  This converts a laser pistol into "
"a less-lethal electrolaser capable of stunning targets, at the cost of "
"decreased damage output and increased power consumption."
msgstr "一套高科技电路及光学器件。这个改装模组可将激光手枪改装成发射能够击晕目标的非致命电子束激光，但相应的会减少伤害输出，并增加射击时的能量消耗。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "high density capacitor"
#. ~ Description of "high density capacitor"
msgid ""
"A capacitor with a higher energy density increases range and damage, at the "
"cost of doubling power consumption."
msgstr "一个使用了高能量密度材质制成的电容器，能够增加激光武器的射程和伤害，但同时也极大的增加了射击时的能量消耗。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/shotguns.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/shotguns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "magnetic choke"
msgid_plural "magnetic chokes"
msgstr[0] "磁力喉缩"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/shotguns.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/shotguns.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "magnetic choke"
#. ~ Description of "magnetic choke"
msgid ""
"A choke that uses a powerful cross-shaped electromagnet to pull the shot "
"cloud together, greatly reducing the spread of shot.  Prevents the use of "
"slugs."
msgstr "这个喉缩以强力十字形电磁铁聚焦霰弹云，极大降低其散布。装备时无法使用独头弹。"

