#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/shotguns.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "shotgun gauss array"
#. ~ Description of "shotgun gauss array"
msgid ""
"A tuned set of electromagnets that accelerate projectiles to a much higher "
"velocity than normal, increasing range and damage.  The required "
"modifications are invasive and cannot be removed once installed."
msgstr "这是一组经过精心调整的电磁铁，能将弹丸加速到远超常规的速度，进而大幅提升射程和破坏力。所需的改装极具侵入性，一旦安装便无法拆除。"

