#. ~ Description of gun mod "holographic aim-assist system"
#. ~ Description of "holographic aim-assist system"
msgid ""
"An advanced ballistic computer calculates projectile trajectories, "
"hit-probabilities, and enemy movements, before outputting the information "
"into an AR holo display.  It greatly increases both accuracy and aiming speed."
msgstr "一种先进的弹道计算机，能计算出投射物的轨迹、命中概率以及敌人的运动状态后将信息输出到AR全息显示器上。它会极大地提高精度和瞄准速度。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/sights.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gunmods/sights.json
