#. ~ Description of magazine "RMGS5 8x40mm speedloader"
#. ~ Description of "RMGS5 8x40mm speedloader"
msgid ""
"This speedloader, made by Rivtech for use with the RM99 revolver, can hold 5 "
"rounds of 8x40mm caseless rounds and quickly reload a compatible revolver."
msgstr "该装弹器由Rivtech公司制造，用于RM99左轮手枪，可容纳5发 8x40mm 无壳弹，为兼容的左轮手枪快速装弹。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/alien.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/alien.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "alien cell"
msgid_plural "alien cells"
msgstr[0] "异星电池"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/alien.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/alien.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "alien cell"
#. ~ Description of "alien cell"
msgid ""
"A conical device salvaged from an alien artifact.  Grooves etched on its "
"circular face slowly pulse with purple light."
msgstr "从外星人造物中回收来的圆锥形装置。在它圆形表面上刻有数道凹槽，其中不断缓慢闪动着紫色的光。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "power cartridge"
msgid_plural "power cartridges"
msgstr[0] "能量電池"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "power cartridge"
#. ~ Description of "power cartridge"
msgid ""
"A standard-design power cell compatible with most common energy weapons.  Can "
"be recharged by connecting to a power source."
msgstr "一个标准的储能装置，能用于大部分常见的能量武器，可通过电源充能。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "compact power cartridge"
msgid_plural "compact power cartridges"
msgstr[0] "小型能量電池"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "compact power cartridge"
#. ~ Description of "compact power cartridge"
msgid ""
"A compact power cell compatible with most common energy weapons.  Can be "
"recharged by connecting to a power source."
msgstr "一个小型储能装置，能用于大部分常见能量武器，可通过电源充能。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "bootleg power cartridge"
msgid_plural "bootleg power cartridges"
msgstr[0] "自製能量電池"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "bootleg power cartridge"
#. ~ Description of "bootleg power cartridge"
msgid ""
"A functional but poorly-built power cell compatible with most common energy "
"weapons.  It cannot be recharged."
msgstr "一个勉强能用的自制储能装置，能用于大部分常见能量武器，但是不可再次充能。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "chromoelectric cartridge"
msgid_plural "chromoelectric cartridges"
msgstr[0] "量子色动力弹药"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/energy_cell.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "chromoelectric cartridge"
#. ~ Description of "chromoelectric cartridge"
msgid ""
"A thin strip of transuranic metal, glowing a somber blue from within its "
"shielded glass prison.  A rare and sought-after relic, it could be used to "
"momentarily power all sorts of technology from the late Hyperspace Era."
msgstr ""
"一条薄薄的超铀金属带，在其屏蔽玻璃的监牢之中散发出阴郁的蓝色光芒。这是一个罕见的、受人追捧的高科技遗物，它可以用来为超空间时代后期的各种科技武器短暂地提供动"
"力。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/foam.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/foam.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "pressurized foam tank"
msgid_plural "pressurized foam tanks"
msgstr[0] "加壓泡沫罐"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/foam.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/foam.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "pressurized foam tank"
#. ~ Description of "pressurized foam tank"
msgid "A pressurized 5L canister designed to feed an industrial foam gun."
msgstr "一个加压的 5L 罐，设计来给泡沫水泥喷射器供料。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/needle.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/needle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "3x35mm 150-round magazine"
msgid_plural "3x35mm 150-round magazines"
msgstr[0] "3x35mm 150-round magazines"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/needle.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/needle.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "3x35mm 150-round magazine"
#. ~ Description of "3x35mm 150-round magazine"
msgid ""
"A 150-round box magazine for use with 3x35mm flechette coilguns.  Marketed as "
"GGS150."
msgstr ""
"A 150-round box magazine for use with 3x35mm flechette coilguns.  Marketed as "
"GGS150."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/needle.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/magazine/needle.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
