msgstr "水星基因重组机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Mercurial Resequencer"
msgid ""
"A large bio-sarcophagus and accompanying control machinery.  Used in gene "
"editing and for general medical purposes, can impart or remove traits using a "
"variety of gene templates."
msgstr "一个大型生物维修棺和配套的控制机器。用于基因编辑和一些一般医疗目的，可利用各种基因模板来赋予或去除基因性状。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Deactivated Mercurial Resequencer"
msgstr "Deactivated Mercurial Resequencer"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Deactivated Mercurial Resequencer"
msgid ""
"A large bio-sarcophagus and accompanying control machinery.  Used in gene "
"editing and for general medical purposes, can impart or remove traits using a "
"variety of gene templates.  This one stands lifelessly, its screens black and "
"the hum of machinery replaced by an eerie silence."
msgstr ""
"A large bio-sarcophagus and accompanying control machinery.  Used in gene "
"editing and for general medical purposes, can impart or remove traits using a "
"variety of gene templates.  This one stands lifelessly, its screens black and "
"the hum of machinery replaced by an eerie silence."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Ravaged Mercurial Resequencer"
msgstr "Ravaged Mercurial Resequencer"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Ravaged Mercurial Resequencer"
msgid ""
"A large bio-sarcophagus and accompanying control machinery.  Panels dangle "
"loosely from their hinges revealing a rat's nest of wires and cabling ripped "
"from the machine.  Useless metal and electronics scraps are strewn about "
"haphazardly on the floor.  It's clear anything of value has long been taken "
"from this machine."
msgstr ""
"A large bio-sarcophagus and accompanying control machinery.  Panels dangle "
"loosely from their hinges revealing a rat's nest of wires and cabling ripped "
"from the machine.  Useless metal and electronics scraps are strewn about "
"haphazardly on the floor.  It's clear anything of value has long been taken "
"from this machine."

