#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Net Breacher recliner"
msgid ""
"A reclined metal chair adorned with soft fabric padding.  A number of cables "
"dangle from the headrest, waiting to be connected to a bionic interface.  In "
"the past, this state-of-the-art equipment would have served as a hypercloud "
"access point for cyber security specialists."
msgstr ""
"A reclined metal chair adorned with soft fabric padding.  A number of cables "
"dangle from the headrest, waiting to be connected to a bionic interface.  In "
"the past, this state-of-the-art equipment would have served as a hypercloud "
"access point for cyber security specialists."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "security override panel"
msgstr "security override panel"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "security override panel"
#. ~ Description of furniture "burnt out security override panel"
msgid ""
"A slim wall mounted metal panel covering an electronic interface to manually "
"override nearby security systems."
msgstr ""
"A slim wall mounted metal panel covering an electronic interface to manually "
"override nearby security systems."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "burnt out security override panel"
msgstr "burnt out security override panel"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "safe"
msgid ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with an electronic lock.  "
"This one isn't actually locked, just closed."
msgstr ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with an electronic lock.  "
"This one isn't actually locked, just closed."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "safe"
#. ~ Description of furniture "powered down safe"
msgid ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with an electronic lock.  "
"With a hacking tool and the right skills you might be able to crack it."
msgstr ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with an electronic lock.  "
"With a hacking tool and the right skills you might be able to crack it."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "powered down safe"
msgstr "powered down safe"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "open safe"
msgid ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with an electronic lock, "
"albeit significantly less secure with the door open."
msgstr ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with an electronic lock, "
"albeit significantly less secure with the door open."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Genetech display mannequin"
msgstr "Genetech display mannequin"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Genetech display mannequin"
msgid ""
"A life-size painted plastic figure of a person displaying prominent genetic "
"alterations.  Commonly used as part of Mercurial Ad campaigns intended to "
"sell the public on Genetech treatments."
msgstr ""
"A life-size painted plastic figure of a person displaying prominent genetic "
"alterations.  Commonly used as part of Mercurial Ad campaigns intended to "
"sell the public on Genetech treatments."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "ECU"
msgstr "环控单元"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "ECU"
msgid ""
"The central node of a life support system, tasked with regulating "
"atmospherics and water flow to the rest of an habitat or ship."
msgstr "生命维持系统的中心节点，任务是调节大气和流向居住地或船只其余部分的水流。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Cryo-fluid pump"
msgstr "低温流体泵"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Cryo-fluid pump"
msgid ""
"An insulated metal tank prepared for the storage of exotic cryo-coolants.  "
"Relatively advanced in construction, it can be salvaged for valuable scrap."
msgstr "一种用来储存外来冷冻剂的绝热金属罐。施工相对先进，可以回收成有价值的废品。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "atmospherics controller"
msgstr "大气控制器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "atmospherics controller"
msgid ""
"An imposing brick of circuitry inlaid tubing adorned with a single console.  "
"It might still half-work, even after all this time."
msgstr "一块令人印象深刻的嵌管电路板，上面装饰着一个控制台。即使经过了这么长时间，它仍可能只起到一半的作用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "automated charging station"
msgstr "automated charging station"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "automated charging station"
msgid "An automated charging console for electric vehicles."
msgstr "An automated charging console for electric vehicles."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "broken automated charging station"
msgstr "broken automated charging station"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat_machinery.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "broken automated charging station"
msgid ""
"An automated charging console for electric vehicles.  It's broken.  This is "
"not a good thing."
msgstr ""
"An automated charging console for electric vehicles.  It's broken.  This is "
"not a good thing."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Direct fusion drive"
msgstr "Direct fusion drive"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Direct fusion drive"
msgid ""
"A powerful fusion engine fueled by helium.  A miracle of hyperspace age "
"technology, painstakingly reproduced from original schematics without true "
"understanding.  Its core components are notably expensive."
msgstr ""
"A powerful fusion engine fueled by helium.  A miracle of hyperspace age "
"technology, painstakingly reproduced from original schematics without true "
"understanding.  Its core components are notably expensive."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Multi-axis maneuvering thruster"
msgstr "Multi-axis maneuvering thruster"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Multi-axis maneuvering thruster"
msgid ""
"A set of highly maneuverable chemical thrusters used is small to medium "
"spacecraft."
msgstr ""
"A set of highly maneuverable chemical thrusters used is small to medium "
"spacecraft."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_spaceship_machinery.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "radioactive slag"
msgid ""
"A pile of melted slag from a destroyed spaceship reactor.  Incandescently hot "
"and highly radioactive, you'd need a purposefully armored suit to even "
"approach it."
msgstr ""
"A pile of melted slag from a destroyed spaceship reactor.  Incandescently hot "
"and highly radioactive, you'd need a purposefully armored suit to even "
"approach it."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "foamcrete wall"
msgstr "泡沫水泥墙"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete wall"
msgid ""
"A lightweight wall made from unreinforced foamcrete.  Not nearly as resilient "
"as a real wall, but it will block sight and the elements nonetheless."
msgstr "用泡沫水泥建成的轻便墙壁。不如一般的墙壁结实，但是仍然能够遮挡视线和天气。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "foamcrete floor"
msgstr "泡沫水泥地板"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete floor"
msgid "A relatively flat slab of unreinforced foamcrete."
msgstr "一块较为平坦的未加固泡沫水泥。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "clearcrete wall"
msgstr "清凝土墙"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "clearcrete wall"
msgid ""
"A barrier made of clearcrete, perfect for greenhouses but looks extremely "
"fragile.  It is most definitely not fragile, and it's probably alarmed in the "
"event of a breach."
msgstr "清凝土制成的屏障，很适合温室，看起来很脆弱。但它肯定一点都不脆弱，而且很可能安装了报警装置，一旦破碎就会被触发。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "a cross between steel bending and stone shattering!"
msgstr "金属弯曲和石头破碎声！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete wall"
msgid ""
"Automatically deployed by the ship to block breaches and seal off damaged "
"sections, this foamcrete wall is a temporary solution at best."
msgstr "这种泡沫混凝土墙由船舶自动部署，用于堵塞破口和封闭受损部分，充其量只是一种临时解决方案。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete floor"
msgid ""
"Automatically deployed by the ship to block breaches and seal off damaged "
"sections, this foamcrete floor is a temporary solution at best."
msgstr "这种泡沫混凝土地板由船舶自动铺设，用于堵塞破损处和封闭受损部分，充其量只是一种临时解决方案。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "hard vacuum"
msgstr "hard vacuum"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "hard vacuum"
msgid ""
"The cold inhospitable vacuum of space.  Going this way without an EVA pack "
"will end in either a slow cold death as your life support fades or a slow hot "
"death as you drop into the planet's atmosphere."
msgstr ""
"The cold inhospitable vacuum of space.  Going this way without an EVA pack "
"will end in either a slow cold death as your life support fades or a slow hot "
"death as you drop into the planet's atmosphere."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "coral floor"
msgstr "珊瑚地板"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "coral floor"
msgid ""
"Thin shelves of coral latch together into a flat mosaic and portray the "
"geometries of life."
msgstr "薄薄的珊瑚架嵌在一起，形成扁平的马赛克拼花图案，描绘出生命的几何形状。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "coral floor"
msgid ""
"Filaments of white coral grow tall and weave themselves into a sinuous wall.  "
"The living surface is ornately grooved, and golden light slowly flows within "
"its gaps."
msgstr "细丝状的白珊瑚长得很高，编织成一道蜿蜒的墙。活体的表面有华丽的凹槽，金色光芒在缝隙中缓慢流动。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "Old TSKBEM Card Reader"
msgstr "老旧的TsKBEM读卡器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "Old TSKBEM Card Reader"
msgid ""
"A smartcard based lock system once fitted to TSKBEM prefab industrial "
"facilities.  While an original key would be impossible to find, the machine "
"is ancient and obsolete, and it can be hacked or masterkeys can be obtained "
"to bypass it."
msgstr "TsKBEM 预制工厂曾经安装过一种基于智能卡的锁系统。 虽然不可能找到原始钥匙，但这台机器型号老旧，可以通过黑客攻击或获取万能钥匙来绕过它。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "Old Enforcer Card Reader"
msgstr "Old Enforcer Card Reader"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "Old Enforcer Card Reader"
msgid ""
"A smartcard based lock system once fitted to corporate police prefab "
"facilities.  While an original key would be impossible to find, the machine "
"is ancient and obsolete, and it can be hacked or masterkeys can be obtained "
"to bypass it."
msgstr ""
"A smartcard based lock system once fitted to corporate police prefab "
"facilities.  While an original key would be impossible to find, the machine "
"is ancient and obsolete, and it can be hacked or masterkeys can be obtained "
"to bypass it."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "Old Mercurial Card Reader"
msgstr "Old Mercurial Card Reader"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_card_readers.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "Old Mercurial Card Reader"
msgid ""
"A smartcard based lock system once fitted to corporate Mercurial prefab "
"facilities.  While an original key would be impossible to find, the machine "
"is ancient and obsolete, and it can be hacked or masterkeys can be obtained "
"to bypass it."
msgstr ""
"A smartcard based lock system once fitted to corporate Mercurial prefab "
"facilities.  While an original key would be impossible to find, the machine "
"is ancient and obsolete, and it can be hacked or masterkeys can be obtained "
"to bypass it."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "leviathan annelids"
msgstr "巨型环节虫"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "leviathan annelids"
msgid ""
"Several massive protrusions emerge from the ground, coiled together into a "
"tower.  At the top, blue and purple tentacles sway in the wind."
msgstr "几个巨大的突出物从地上冒出来，盘绕成一座塔。在顶部，蓝色和紫色的触须在风中摇摆。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "lichen tree"
msgstr "地衣樹"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen tree"
msgid ""
"A massive corrugated body sprouts from the lichen here, branching out into "
"mushroom-like limbs, dust filling the air as the wind meets it."
msgstr "一个巨大的褶皱新芽从这里的苔藓中长出来，分叉成蘑菇状的肢体，当风吹来时，空气中充满了灰尘。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "fossilized conifer"
msgstr "石化针叶树"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "fossilized conifer"
msgid ""
"A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers "
"into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron."
msgstr "一棵早已枯死的高树，枝干十分细长，类似于柏树，向上逐渐变细成为一个点，然后顶部展开成一个中空的十二面体。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "infested fossilized conifer"
msgstr "感染石化针叶树"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "infested fossilized conifer"
msgid ""
"A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers "
"into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron.  The trunk seems "
"to be splitting as tendrils of mold dig into it, clinging onto the tree like "
"a frame."
msgstr ""
"一棵早已枯死的高树，枝干十分细长，类似于柏树，向上逐渐变细成为一个点，然后顶部展开成一个中空的十二面体。树干似乎被深深扎入其中的霉菌触须撑裂开来，这些触须像"
"框架一样紧贴在树上。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "lichen shrub"
msgstr "地衣叢"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen shrub"
msgid ""
"A small mound of lichen grows here, noticeably bigger than the lichen and "
"moss around it."
msgstr "这里生长着一小丛地衣，明显比周围的地衣和苔藓要大。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "squish."
msgstr "嘎吱。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen shrub"
msgid ""
"A small mound of lichen grows here, noticeably bigger than the lichen and "
"moss around it.  A few clumps have been removed."
msgstr "这里生长着一小丛地衣，明显比周围的地衣和苔藓还要大。一些地衣已被挖开。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "moss bush"
msgstr "苔藓丛"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "moss bush"
msgid "A mound of moss, with large colorful stems protruding out of it."
msgstr "一大堆苔藓，有大而多彩长茎从其中突出来。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "geothermal bladder"
msgstr "地热排气囊"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "geothermal bladder"
msgid ""
"Black veins support a large formation of bleached coral as it grows around "
"the rim of this geothermal vent.  Above it, red and purple tentacles caress a "
"balloon-shaped organ as it breathes."
msgstr "在这个地热排气孔的四周有着许多黑色藤网支撑着大量被漂白的珊瑚。在它的上方，红色和紫色的触手抚摸着一个气球形状的器官，它仿佛在呼吸。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "breather"
msgid ""
"On the ground here lay several colorless coral reefs, the black veins are "
"noticeably more engorged as they breathe."
msgstr "这里的地面铺着一些缺乏色泽的珊瑚礁，黑色藤网在它们呼吸时明显变得愈发饱满。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "overgrown vent"
msgstr "蔓生脉络"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "overgrown vent"
msgid ""
"The coral and veins on the ground here have fused into a sea anemone-like "
"structure; pufts of smoke and hot air emit from its mouth."
msgstr "这里的珊瑚和藤网融合成一个海葵状的结构。烟团与热气从其口中喷涌而出。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "lichen"
msgstr "地衣"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen"
msgid ""
"Many colorful species of ice-lichen, thriving above an uncharacteristically "
"fertile segment of ice.  Either endemic, or surviving genecraft from an "
"aborted terraforming project."
msgstr "许多五颜六色的冰原地衣，在异常肥沃的冰上旺盛生长。可能是本地原生物种，也可能是从某个地质改造工程中幸存下来的基因工程产物。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "splosh."
msgstr "啪叽。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "lichen bed"
msgstr "地衣床"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen bed"
msgid ""
"Familiar, yet unfamiliar.  Lichens and moss cling to rocks and lifeless dirt "
"here, providing a squishy but colorful grass."
msgstr "地衣和苔藓附着在岩石和死气沉沉的泥土上，提供了一处粘糊糊却色彩丰富的草床，熟悉又陌生。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "glacial ice"
msgstr "冰层"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "glacial ice"
msgid ""
"A small segment from the near planet-wide glacier of Salus IV.  Gets called "
"'ground' around these parts."
msgstr "覆盖了近乎整个Salus IV卫星的冰川的一小部分，被称为\"地面\"，环绕着其他部分。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "fweet!"
msgstr "哗啦！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt"
msgid ""
"A relatively flat area of black dirt with no observable growth on it, caked "
"with shards of rock.  The only real ground besides the glacial ice."
msgstr "一块相对平坦的黑色泥土区域，上面没有明显的植被，由岩石碎片凝结而成。除了冰层之外唯一的真正的地面。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "basalt floor"
msgstr "玄武岩地面"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "basalt floor"
msgid "A relatively flat area of gray stone, warm to the touch."
msgstr "一片相对平坦的灰色石头区域，触感温暖。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "geothermal vent"
msgstr "地热排气孔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "geothermal vent"
msgid ""
"A basalt column stands here, perpetually emitting foul-smelling gas, similar "
"to rotten eggs.  It is very warm to the touch, hot enough to burn you if you "
"aren't careful."
msgstr "一根玄武岩柱矗立在这里，不停地散发出类似于臭鸡蛋的恶臭气体。它摸起来很暖和，如果你不小心就会被烫到手。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "fumarolic ice tower"
msgstr "凝华冰塔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "fumarolic ice tower"
msgid ""
"A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust "
"and meets the freezing air.  It is still emitting some gases."
msgstr "一种固态的云状结构，从地壳中逸出的水蒸气遇到冷空气时形成。现在它仍然在冒着白气。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "fumarolic ice tower"
msgid ""
"A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust "
"and meets the freezing air."
msgstr "一种固态的云状结构，从地壳中逸出的水蒸气遇到冷空气时形成。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
