msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with a still-functioning inactive light "
"attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "一片光秃且冰冷的混凝土地板，天花板上有一盏已经关闭但还能工作的灯。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
