#. ~ Description of terrain "simple metal floor, overhead light"
msgid ""
"A crudely welded-together metal floor with steel trusses and supporting "
"girders.  Can support a roof.  A still-functioning light hangs from the "
"ceiling above."
msgstr "一片由钢桁架和支撑梁草草焊接而成的金属地板。 可支撑屋顶。天花板上有一盏还能工作的灯。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_floor.json
