"The control panel for the prisoner cell.  Might be able to open and close "
"cell grating."
msgstr ""
"The control panel for the prisoner cell.  Might be able to open and close "
"cell grating."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_spaceship.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_PRISON_CONSOLE_OPEN" in terrain
#. "Prisoner Cell Console"'s examine action
