msgid ""
"A rabbit from Earth, genetically modified to eat the lichen of Salus IV.  Its "
"fur is rust-colored and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth.  This one "
"seems well-acclimated to the presence of nearby humans."
msgstr ""
"一只源自地球的兔子，经过基因改造，具备了食用Salus "
"IV上的地衣的能力。该兔的毛色呈现铁锈红，其耳部结构缩短，以助于维持体温。这只似乎已经很好地适应了附近有人类存在的环境。 "

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Description of monster "labbit kit"
msgid ""
"A tiny rabbit kit, spawned from a rabbit genetically modified to eat the "
"lichen of Salus IV.  It's coat is a vibrant crimson that will turn a rust "
"orange when it reaches adulthood.  This one seems well-acclimated to the "
"presence of nearby humans."
msgstr ""
"一只兔幼崽，由一种经过基因改造、能够Salus "
"IV上的地衣的兔子繁育而来。其毛色呈鲜艳的深红色，成年后会转变为铁锈橙色。这只似乎已经很好地适应了附近有人类存在的环境。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "garlander"
msgid_plural "garlanders"
msgstr[0] "花環蟲"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Description of monster "garlander"
msgid ""
"A ribbon-like alien that glides along the ground on countless hair-thin legs, "
"wrapping around sources of body heat to absorb as much as it can before "
"gliding on."
msgstr "一条像缎带一样的外星生物，用无数条细如发丝的腿在地面上滑行，在滑行时，它尽可能地吸收环绕在它身体表面的热量。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "garlander"
msgid "The air around the garlander feels unnaturally cold!"
msgstr "花环虫周围的空气感觉异常寒冷！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "anchor-boatman"
msgid_plural "anchor-boatmen"
msgstr[0] "锚船手虫"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Description of monster "anchor-boatman"
msgid ""
"The anchor-boatman, borne on the frozen wind like a predatory dandelion seed, "
"subtly inclines its rigid parachutes as it drifts towards its prey, its "
"clawed tentacles undulating and flicking as they taste the air for signs of "
"life.  Soft things that get too close are hooked, bled out, and dragged "
"behind it for months as it extracts every bit of nutrition it can.  "
"Scavengers that try to take its prey often join them."
msgstr ""
"一直被人称为\"锚船手\""
"的外星生物，像一颗捕食者的蒲公英种子一样，随着寒风飘荡。它巧妙地倾斜着自身坚硬的降落伞，慢慢向猎物飘去，并用爪子般的触手在空气中不停起伏摆动，寻找生命的迹象"
"。那些靠得太近的软家伙会被它钩住，流干血，拖在身后好几个月，因为它会尽可能地吸收每一点营养。试图从它身上带走猎物的食腐动物经常加入其中的行列。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "runner"
msgid_plural "runners"
msgstr[0] "奔牦"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Description of monster "runner"
msgid ""
"A large fluffy three-legged herbivore, extremely fast and cowardly.  It "
"usually grazes alone, and relies on its keen senses to stay safe."
msgstr "蓬松多毛的三足草食动物，极其迅捷而胆怯。它通常单独吃草，并依靠敏锐的感官保持安全。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grazer"
msgid_plural "grazers"
msgstr[0] "牧毛兕"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grazer"
msgid ""
"A large furred herbivore, with its heavy head constantly against the ground.  "
"It uses its clawed hooves to shovel up the snow to reach any dead plant life "
"to eat."
msgstr "披覆毛皮的大型草食动物，以沉重的头部，不停抵蹭着地面。它用爪状的蹄铲起积雪，取食其下的枯枝败叶。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hevel"
msgid_plural "hevels"
msgstr[0] "雪猪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hevel"
msgid ""
"A small creature covered in blue down, scurrying across the ground fast as it "
"digs through the snow with claws buried in its down, looking for food.  It "
"works in large packs with its fellow kin."
msgstr "一只身披蓝色绒毛的小动物，在雪地上快速奔跑，用埋在绒毛里的一双爪子在雪地里寻找食物。它和它的同类一般成群结队行动。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "venandi"
msgid_plural "venatores"
msgstr[0] "维纳托猎手"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Description of monster "venandi"
msgid ""
"A six-legged animal, showing relative intelligence in not only its ability to "
"track and hunt down prey, but its strategy of covering itself with the skin "
"of its hunts to warm itself."
msgstr "一种六足动物，不只在追踪与捕获猎物方面显出相当的智力，还会刻意地以其猎物的毛皮覆盖自己取暖。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "terror bird"
msgid_plural "terror birds"
msgstr[0] "恐鳥"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/aliens.json
#. ~ Description of monster "terror bird"
msgid "A tall bird with two long, muscular legs, a long neck, and a long sharp beak."
msgstr "一只有两条肌肉发达的长腿、长脖子、和一个长的尖嘴的高大的鸟。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/mutants.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/mutants.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "frost maddened human"
msgid_plural "frost maddened humans"
msgstr[0] "冷凍瘋人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/mutants.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/mutants.json
#. ~ Description of monster "frost maddened human"
msgid ""
"Sky blue irises cover the entirety of the eye.  What happened to this person "
"during their deep freeze?"
msgstr "天蓝色的虹膜覆盖了它的整个眼睛。这个人在深度冷冻时经历了什么？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/mutants.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/mutants.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_cryokinetic"
msgid ""
"Sky blue irises with gray floating flecks cover the entirety of the eye.  "
"Flurries seem to emanate from around them."
msgstr "天蓝色的虹膜和灰色的浮动斑点覆盖了它的整个眼睛。它们周围似乎发散出阵阵雪花。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/mutants.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/mutants.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_cryokinetic"
msgid "A burst of frozen air explodes from their lungs!"
msgstr "一道冰冷的空气突然从它们的肺中呼出！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/reavers_and_bandits.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skittish scavenger"
msgid_plural "skittish scavengers"
msgstr[0] "易受惊的拾荒者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/reavers_and_bandits.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skittish scavenger"
msgid ""
"A scavenger willing to engage in violence to scavenge your remains.  Will run "
"after a reasonable show of force from their would be victims."
msgstr "一个愿意用暴力来清理你的遗体的拾荒者。他们会在受害者合理展示武力后逃跑。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/reavers_and_bandits.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "skittish scavenger"
msgid "\"Let's see what loot you are carrying!\""
msgstr "\"让我看看你带着什么好东西！\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/reavers_and_bandits.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "opportunistic bandit"
msgid_plural "opportunistic bandits"
msgstr[0] "投机取巧的强盗"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/reavers_and_bandits.json
#. ~ Description of monster "opportunistic bandit"
msgid ""
"Armed with a rifle, this bandit seems to feel quite sure of their impending "
"victory."
msgstr "这名强盗带着步枪，似乎对即将到来的胜利感到十分肯定。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/reavers_and_bandits.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "opportunistic bandit"
msgid "\"I bet you're worth a pretty penny!\""
msgstr "\"我打赌你值一大笔钱！\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "brain blaster"
msgid_plural "brain blasters"
msgstr[0] "脑熔炮塔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "brain blaster"
msgid ""
"The mi-go have set up some defenses here.  This horrifying techno-organic "
"amalgamation appears to use brains in jars as their operating system.  On the "
"plus side it looks like an easy headshot."
msgstr "米·戈已经在这里设置了一些防御系统。这个由机械和生物融合的怪胎看上去似乎是由缸中之脑控制的。往好处想，它可以被爆头。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Whately family brain blaster"
msgid_plural "Whately family brain blasters"
msgstr[0] "Whately家族腦袋爆破砲塔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Whately family brain blaster"
msgid ""
"The Whately family deploys mi-go style techno-organic defensive turrets.  "
"They claim that these turrets are made from family members near death, but "
"you have doubts."
msgstr "沃特利家族部署的采用了米·戈技术的科技有机型防御炮塔。他们声称这些炮塔是用濒死的家庭成员制造的，你也只能相信了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Pathfinder"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Pathfinders"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"开拓者型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Pathfinder"
msgid ""
"The Wraitheon Pathfinder is a massive, house-height armored robot.  It is "
"armed to the teeth with a 40mm anti-material grenade launcher, a 5.56 "
"anti-personnel gun, and an electroshock capability to defend against melee "
"strikes.  Manufactured by Wraitheon for the ESCA military, it was used along "
"with infantry thanks to the flexibility of its reverse-jointed legs."
msgstr ""
"\"鬼神\"开拓者型无人机是一台高达一层楼的巨型装甲机器人。它装备着一门40mm反器材榴弹发射器，一门5.56反步兵机枪和防近战打击的电击能力。它是由\""
"鬼神\"公司为ESCA防务公司制造的，由于其反向关节腿的灵活性，它能与步兵一同部署使用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Pathfinder"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Regulator"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "tripod"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Imaginifer"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Hashashiyyin"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Suppressor"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Fulgent"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Frequency"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "chicken walker"
msgid "\"Hostile Detected.\""
msgstr "＂偵測到敵人。＂"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Pathfinder"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Regulator"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "pest hunter"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Imaginifer"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Hashashiyyin"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Suppressor"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Scavbot Skorpion"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "chicken walker"
msgid "click!"
msgstr "喀哒！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Regulator"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Regulators"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"监管者型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Regulator"
msgid ""
"Designed by Wraitheon, the Regulator is effectively an automated battle tank "
"designed for high-risk urban fighting.  Armed with an anti-material missile "
"launcher, a 40mm grenade launcher, and several anti-personnel weapons, it's "
"designed to match the fervor of freedom fighters with the industrial might of "
"Earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tripod"
msgid_plural "tripods"
msgstr[0] "三足機器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tripod"
msgid ""
"The Honda Crop King.  Originally designed for agriculture, it has a trio of "
"spiked retractable cables and where it used to mount pesticide sprayer the "
"PrepNet Phyle have modified it to have a flamethrower for their war against "
"the Mycus."
msgstr ""
"一台本田Crop "
"King机器人。它最初是为农业而设计的，有三根可伸缩的带刺电缆，之前用来安装杀虫剂喷雾器的部位已被生化先驱者改造，安装了一台火焰喷射器，用于对抗马卡斯的入侵"
"。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "tripod"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Allosaurus Le Truck"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Tyruckusaurus Rex"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "renfield with a flamethrower"
msgid "hiss!"
msgstr "嘶嘶！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Sentinel-lx"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Sentinels-lx"
msgstr[0] "哨兵-LX型机器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Sentinel-lx"
msgid ""
"Its exterior plates are sable and gold, this luxurious variant of a Wraitheon "
"drone was once kept as a bodyguard by society's wealthiest.  Still with its "
"wrist sword extended, it resembles an ancient knight, standing an eternal "
"watch."
msgstr ""
"这台豪华型号的\"鬼神\""
"机器人有著黑貂色和金色的装甲，曾经被社会上最富有的人作为保镖使用。它静静地站立不动，腕上的剑已经伸出，如同古代骑士一般，永恒地守望。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Sentinel-lx"
msgid "\"Dispatching hostile with lethal force.\""
msgstr "\"正使用致命武力处置敌人。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bloodhound drone"
msgid_plural "bloodhound drones"
msgstr[0] "獵犬無人機"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloodhound drone"
msgid ""
"A small, spiked quadcopter robot equipped with a high-power spotlight.  This "
"automated seeker drone was originally designed to harry and harass fugitives "
"while maintaining visual contact for other pursuers."
msgstr "一个配备了大功率聚光灯的带尖刺的小型四翼无人机。这种自动寻的无人机最初是设计来阻止及干扰逃犯，同时为其它追击成员保持目视联系。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ENIAC Seneschal"
msgid_plural "ENIAC Seneschals"
msgstr[0] "\"埃尼阿克\"总管型机器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ENIAC Seneschal"
msgid ""
"One of the many cheaper models produced by ENIAC.  It is supposedly "
"multi-purpose, and equipped with several tools to facilitate this; however, "
"it is commonly used for janitorial work."
msgstr "\"埃尼阿克\"公司生产的众多廉价机器人型号之一。它是一台多用途机器人，也配备了多种工具来满足需求；然而，它通常只被用来当作清洁工。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "TsKBEM Likvidator"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Likvidators"
msgstr[0] "TsKBEM清理者型机器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "TsKBEM Likvidator"
msgid ""
"A now ancient industrial robot line first made by the Soviet TsKBEM, and "
"still in use thanks to its easily obtained fabrication schematics.  Built to "
"operate within nuclear reactors and waste repositories, the Likvidator is "
"assembled around an armored bipedal chassis that mounts several heavy "
"manipulator arms.  Legend claims it was originally designed after a nuclear "
"disaster during early space-age Earth."
msgstr ""
"沿袭自现已过时的工业机器人生产线，最初由苏联的TskBEM（实验机器制造中央设计局）制造，由于其制造原理图易于获得，至今仍被广泛生产使用。清理者型机器人是为"
"在核反应堆和废料储存库中运行而设计的，由一个装甲双足底盘和几个重型机械臂组成。传说中，它最初是在早期太空时代地球的一次核灾难后设计的。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ENIAC Famulus"
msgid_plural "ENIAC Famuli"
msgstr[0] "ENIAC Famuli 仿真機器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ENIAC Famulus"
msgid ""
"A top of the line luxury model, the Famulus is a humaniform robot, derived "
"from Wraitheon schematics with slight alterations to give it a more human "
"appearance.  Designed to be a robotic servant, its AI tailored for the needs "
"of each customer, it is arguably one of the few commercial robots to pass the "
"Turing test."
msgstr ""
"作为一款顶级豪华型号，仆从型机器人是一款人形机器人，源自\"鬼神\""
"公司设计图纸，稍作改动，使其更具人性化的外观。设计用来充当机器人助手，它所使用的人工智能需要为每个客户量身定做，可以说它是为数不多的通过图灵测试的商业机器人"
"之一。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "TsKBEM Udarnik"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Udarniks"
msgstr[0] "TskBEM劳模型机器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "TsKBEM Udarnik"
msgid ""
"A highly customizable light industrial and agricultural robot.  Its original "
"design dates back to the ancient Soviet Union; the aptly named Udarnik "
"\"shock worker\" was the trigger behind the automation revolution, and with "
"subsequent adaptations, became the workhorse of early human space "
"colonization.  Although outdated by modern standards, the Udarnik is still "
"commonly seen in frontier worlds - thanks to its easily obtainable "
"fabrication schematics.\n"
"\n"
"This particular version is equipped with a mix of construction and heavy "
"cargo-handling tools and was likely involved in the construction of colony "
"buildings."
msgstr ""
"一台能够高度定制的轻工业和农业机器人。它最初的设计可以追溯到古苏联时期；恰如其名，\"乌达尼克\""
"劳模突击手型机器人是引燃自动化革命的导火索，经过后续改造，成为早期人类太空殖民的主力军。尽管按照现代标准来看，它已经过时了，但由于其制造原理图易于获得，它仍"
"然在边境星球上很常见。\n"
"这台特殊型号上配备了各类建筑设备和重型货物装卸工具，很可能参与了殖民地建筑的建造。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rampant Udarnik"
msgid_plural "rampant Udarniks"
msgstr[0] "rampant Udarniks"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rampant Udarnik"
msgid ""
"An erratic and dangerous Udarnik that mistakenly attempts to hammer "
"everything on its sights.  Although this corrupted robot is not built for "
"combat, its sheer size and hydraulic strength make it extremely dangerous up "
"close."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Its in Russian.  Not a typo.
msgid "TsKBEM Zenit"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Zenit"
msgstr[0] "TsKBEM Zenit"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "TsKBEM Zenit"
msgid ""
"An ancient security drone intended to safeguard extractive outposts in "
"hostile environments.  Its construction vaguely recalls an alien crustacean, "
"with a single sensory oculus and four spade-like legs mounted underneath a "
"disk of space-ship grade armor.  Zenit units can mount a wide variety of "
"\"deterrent\" weapon modules, and its difficult to tell what this rogue unit "
"is capable of."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "TsKBEM Brandspojt"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Brandspojts"
msgstr[0] "TskBEM水炮型机器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "TsKBEM Brandspojt"
msgid ""
"An old and decidedly uncommon firefighter robot of Soviet design.  Crab-like "
"in form, its back mounts a squat water tank beneath a turreted water cannon.  "
"While effective for its original function, the design lacks the flexibility "
"of others from the TsKBEM, and most Brandspojt units still in existence are "
"museum pieces."
msgstr ""
"这是一种前苏联设计的消防机器人，年代久远，并不常见。 它的外形像螃蟹，背部在炮塔式水炮下面安装了一个矮壮的水箱。 "
"虽然它的原始功能很有效，但缺乏其他TsKBEM设计的灵活性，现存的大多数“水炮”式消防机器人都已成为博物馆藏品。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Croplord 2SPL"
msgid_plural "Croplord 2SPLs"
msgstr[0] "Croplord 2SPLs"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Croplord 2SPL"
msgid ""
"Twin linked rotors allow this ubiquitous EINAC drone to comfortably hover "
"above fields and deploy pesticides at prodigious rates.  They have no ability "
"to detect humans within their work areas and will readily disperse lethal "
"pesticides near them."
msgstr ""
"Twin linked rotors allow this ubiquitous EINAC drone to comfortably hover "
"above fields and deploy pesticides at prodigious rates.  They have no ability "
"to detect humans within their work areas and will readily disperse lethal "
"pesticides near them."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Croplord 2SPL"
msgid "The Croplord crashes into the ground."
msgstr "The Croplord crashes into the ground."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "faulty surgical droid"
msgid_plural "faulty surgical droids"
msgstr[0] "故障的外科手术型机器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "faulty surgical droid"
msgid ""
"A free roaming medical robot capable of administering powerful anesthetics "
"and performing complex surgical operations, usually in that order.  Faulty "
"bio-diagnostic programs resulted in numerous lawsuits before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"一台正在四处游荡的医疗机器人，它能够为患者注射强效麻醉剂并进行复杂的外科手术，通常会按这顺序进行操作。然而错误百出的医疗诊断程序让其在大灾变之前引发了无数诉"
"讼。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rat snatcher"
msgid_plural "rat snatchers"
msgstr[0] "捕鼠者機器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rat snatcher"
msgid ""
"A small and flimsy hexapod drone that relies on sheer speed to hunt rats and "
"other small pests.  It has either gone rampant or been maliciously "
"reprogrammed."
msgstr "一台小而脆弱的六足无人机，依靠极快的速度捕杀老鼠和其他小型害虫。它要么是已经出错失控，要么就是被人恶意地重新编程。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grab-bot"
msgid_plural "grab-bots"
msgstr[0] "抓鉤機器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grab-bot"
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilize enemies.  It's "
"meant to work in a pack."
msgstr "一個回收利用的小型機器人，改用來抓住並固定敵人。準備收拾工作。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pest hunter"
msgid_plural "pest hunters"
msgstr[0] "害蟲獵手"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pest hunter"
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot refitted with an 8mm integrated firearm.  The robot's "
"small size precludes rapid-fire, due to recoil, and requires the use of "
"lightweight caseless ammo."
msgstr "一台改装的掠行无人机，内置了一把8x40mm无壳弹枪械。该机器人体型过小，发射时的后坐力让其无法快速射击，而且需要使用重量更轻的无壳弹药。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "UICA Imaginifer MP"
msgid_plural "UICA Imaginifer MP"
msgstr[0] "UICA Imaginifer MP"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "UICA Imaginifer MP"
msgid ""
"A supposedly non-combat refit of Wraitheon's Imaginifer series, outfitted for "
"crowd control and riot suppression.  This unit is outfitted with a beanbag "
"shotgun and a taser and has been painted in the white and blue scheme of "
"UICA's military police."
msgstr ""
"A supposedly non-combat refit of Wraitheon's Imaginifer series, outfitted for "
"crowd control and riot suppression.  This unit is outfitted with a beanbag "
"shotgun and a taser and has been painted in the white and blue scheme of "
"UICA's military police."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "UICA Imaginifer MP"
msgid "click click!"
msgstr "喀哒喀哒！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Imaginifer"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Imaginifers"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"执像者型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Imaginifer"
msgid ""
"Imaginifers are Wraitheon Industries standard military humaniforms, company "
"parlance for an android designed to seamlessly integrate into standard "
"infantry units.  Although originally designed for UICA's expeditionary forces "
"they are now commonly employed by any faction that can afford them.  This "
"particular unit seems to belong to the Company itself.\n"
"\n"
"Wraitheon humaniforms are designed to take full advantage of a humanoid "
"shape, not to look human; programmed for game theory, not for sapience."
msgstr ""
"Imaginifers are Wraitheon Industries standard military humaniforms, company "
"parlance for an android designed to seamlessly integrate into standard "
"infantry units.  Although originally designed for UICA's expeditionary forces "
"they are now commonly employed by any faction that can afford them.  This "
"particular unit seems to belong to the Company itself.\n"
"\n"
"Wraitheon humaniforms are designed to take full advantage of a humanoid "
"shape, not to look human; programmed for game theory, not for sapience."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Hashashiyyin"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Hashashiyyins"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"阿萨辛型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Hashashiyyin"
msgid ""
"An imaginifer variant of unorthodox design, the Hashashiyyin dispenses with "
"most of its armor in favor of active-camo systems and a lightweight, more "
"agile frame.  Commonly employed in scouting and counter-sniping roles.  This "
"unit is equipped for close range ambush, and weilds a 35x50mm dart gun."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Suppressor"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Suppressors"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"压制者型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Suppressor"
msgid ""
"Looking more like a tank than a robot, the Suppressor is built to deal with "
"vehicles (including tanks) and personnel alike.  Equipped with a 40mm grenade "
"launcher, it can easily dispatch anything in its path."
msgstr "看起来更像坦克而不是机器人，压制者型机器人能够用来对付各类载具（包括坦克）和人员目标。配备了一门40mm榴弹发射器，它可以很容易地解决一切挡路者。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Fulgent"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Fulgent"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"耀光型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Fulgent"
msgid ""
"An autonomous anti-personnel weapons platform, mounting a laser on an "
"insectoid chassis.  The Fulgent designation excels at 'controlling' riots and "
"(sometimes simultaneously) putting down potential freedom fighters."
msgstr "一台全自主反步兵武器平台，一把激光枪被安装在一个昆虫外形的底盘上。耀光型机器人擅长于\"控制\"暴乱和（有时同时）镇压任何潜在的自由斗士。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Irradiant"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Irradiants"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"辉光型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Irradiant"
msgid ""
"An autonomous anti-armor weapons platform, mounting a 5kg plasma railgun over "
"an insectoid chassis.  The Irradiant designation excels at ambush and "
"midrange combat, where it can leverage its superior agility and reduced "
"sensor profile to successfully engage technologically advanced foes."
msgstr ""
"一台\"鬼神\""
"公司出品的全自主反装甲武器平台，一门五千克等离子磁轨炮被安装在一个昆虫外形底盘上。辉光型无人机擅长伏击和中程作战，它可以利用其卓越的敏捷性和低调的信号特征，"
"成功地击败技术更先进的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Irradiant"
msgid "The Irradiant emits a chilling robotic shrill as it fires its plasma railgun."
msgstr "随着一道令人不寒而栗的机械尖啸，辉光型无人机发射了等离子磁轨炮。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Irradiant"
msgid "the climbing pitch of a charging plasma railgun"
msgstr "声调逐渐升高的等离子磁轨炮充能声"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Isohypsa"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Isohypsas"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"等高图型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Isohypsa"
msgid ""
"A bulky aerial drone that mounts an advanced AI overwatch unit within it "
"bulbous carapace-like armor.  As an autonomous drone control platform, the "
"Isohypsa is principally meant to coordinate and enhance the combat "
"capabilities of simpler Wraitheon robots in lieu of human operators."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Isohypsa"
msgid "The Isohypsa emits a rapid sequence of sibilant tones!"
msgstr "等高图型无人机快速发出一连串咝咝声！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Kabura-ya"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Kabura-ya"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"响箭型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Kabura-ya"
msgid ""
"A microplane drone designed to seek enemy personnel before detonating at "
"close range."
msgstr "一台微型无人机，能自主寻找敌方人员并靠近，然后近距离引爆炸药。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wraitheon Frequency"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Frequencies"
msgstr[0] "\"鬼神\"脉冲型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Frequency"
msgid ""
"An autonomous weapons platform, made to disrupt or disable electronics - "
"especially other robots - with an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr "一台全自主武器平台，能发射电磁脉冲来破坏或瘫痪电子设备，特别是其他机器人。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shock-mine"
msgid_plural "shock-mines"
msgstr[0] "shock-mines"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shock-mine"
msgid ""
"A bulky device that will constantly discharge electricity in a small radius "
"around it."
msgstr ""
"A bulky device that will constantly discharge electricity in a small radius "
"around it."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "eyebot"
msgid_plural "eyebots"
msgstr[0] "眼球機器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "eyebot"
msgid ""
"A quadcopter drone largely comprised of a high-resolution camera lens and a "
"speaker, this robot hovers above the ground, documenting the carnage and "
"mayhem around it.  While it is no longer able to report to a central "
"authority, it's likely that some of its automated alert systems are still "
"functional, given that the thing seems to have an operational charging "
"station somewhere."
msgstr ""
"一架主要由一个高分辨率摄像头和一个扬声器组成的四轴无人机，这台无人机盘旋在地面上，记录着周围的屠杀和混乱。虽然它不能再向中央机关报告，但它的一些自动报警系统"
"很可能仍然正常工作，因为它似乎在某个地方有一个还在运作的充电站。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "police bot"
msgid_plural "police bots"
msgstr[0] "警用機器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "police bot"
msgid ""
"One of the many models of armored law enforcement robots employed shortly "
"before the collapse of civilization.  Solar powered like many other robots, "
"it maintains its programmed pursuit of law and order, propelled on a trio of "
"omni wheels."
msgstr "許多型號的其中一種裝甲執法機器人， 在文明崩潰前不久才採用的。就像其他許多的機器人一樣是使用太陽能驅動的， 它保持了執法的程序， 並且利用三輪移動。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "riot control bot"
msgid_plural "riot control bots"
msgstr[0] "鎮暴機器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "riot control bot"
msgid ""
"A nonviolent riot-control bot, designed to suppress riots and make mass "
"arrests of those participating.  Though its relaxation gas is by far its "
"best-known weapon, it carries a blinding spotlight and a low-powered stungun "
"for self-defense--in addition to a supply of electronic handcuffs."
msgstr ""
"一台不致命的防暴机器人。专门用于镇压暴乱，并对参与暴乱的人进行大规模逮捕行动。虽然它的麻醉气体是最著名的武器，但它除了配备无数电子手铐之外，还携带了致盲炫光"
"灯和用于自卫的低功率电击枪。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "STEED"
msgid_plural "STEEDs"
msgstr[0] "STEED 机器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "STEED"
msgid ""
"Found on nearly every frontier planet, the ubiquitous TSKBEM STEED (Surface "
"Traversing Equine Emulating Drone) is an incredibly rugged quadrupedal "
"machine based on old Earth horses and mules.  Capable of crossing the "
"roughest terrain, powered by a compact atomic reactor, generous storage "
"capacity, light armor, and a lifetime warranty, the STEED is a priceless tool "
"for prospectors and homesteaders.  This version has been ruggedized against "
"Salus IV's extreme cold, but does not keep you warm while riding."
msgstr ""
"TSKBEM STEED（地表穿越马匹仿真无人机）几乎遍布每一个边疆星球，它是一种以旧地球上的老马和骡子为原型的四足机器，坚固得令人难以置信。 STEED "
"可以穿越最崎岖的地形，由一个紧凑的原子反应堆提供动力，存储容量大，装甲轻便，终身保修，是勘探者和自耕农的无价之宝。 此版本经过加固，可抵御 Salus "
"IV 的极寒天气，但骑行时并不保暖。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "STEED"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s activates as you swipe the registry key.  A nearly inaudible hum is "
"the only indication the STEED is active."
msgstr ""
"The %s activates as you swipe the registry key.  A nearly inaudible hum is "
"the only indication the STEED is active."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken STEED"
msgid_plural "broken STEEDs"
msgstr[0] "STEED 机器人（损坏）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of "broken STEED"
msgid ""
"A broken STEED, it looks beyond repair.  At least the atomic core shielding "
"should be intact."
msgstr "坏掉的 STEED，看起来已经无法修复了。 至少原子核屏蔽应该完好无损。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "UICA Irradiant"
msgid_plural "UICA Irradiants"
msgstr[0] "UICA Irradiants"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "UICA Regulator"
msgid_plural "UICA Regulators"
msgstr[0] "UICA监管者型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "UICA Imaginifer"
msgid_plural "UICA Imaginifers"
msgstr[0] "UICA执像者型无人机"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "UICA Imaginifer"
msgid ""
"Imaginifers are Wraitheon Industries standard military humaniforms, company "
"parlance for an android designed to seamlessly integrate into standard "
"infantry units.  This particular unit is currently equipped with light blue "
"UICA livery and wields a SR-P77.  Its rugged design and technological "
"sophistication make it far more formidable than the human soldiers its "
"nominally meant to support.\n"
"\n"
"The Wraitheon humaniforms are designed to take full advantage of a humanoid "
"shape, not to look human; programmed for game theory, not for sapience."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bee bot"
msgid_plural "bee bots"
msgstr[0] "蜜蜂機器人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bee bot"
msgid ""
"A salvaged utility robot converted into an AI monitored bee hive that "
"periodically removes and delivers honey combs."
msgstr "一個回收利用的功能性機器人，被轉換成蜂窩監視AI，用於定期清除並運書蜂巢。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "floating lantern"
msgid_plural "floating lanterns"
msgstr[0] "懸浮燈"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "floating lantern"
msgid "A salvaged drone repurposed into a mobile light source."
msgstr "一台经过改装的无人机，用来当作移动光源使用。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Scavbot Skorpion"
msgid_plural "Scavbot Skorpions"
msgstr[0] "Scavbot Skorpions"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Scavbot Skorpion"
msgid ""
"The Scavbot Skorpion is a refurb of colonial perimeter defense bots found "
"across many systems.  Because they are designed to defend against pirates, "
"raiders, feral uplifts, hungry scavengers, rival mining clans, and any other "
"enemy that is unlikely to attack with heavily armored units, these "
"reprogrammed and refurbed versions are often found in the employ of the very "
"types of people it was originally purposed to fight.  Often found as the core "
"of a light patrol or attack squad."
msgstr ""
"The Scavbot Skorpion is a refurb of colonial perimeter defense bots found "
"across many systems.  Because they are designed to defend against pirates, "
"raiders, feral uplifts, hungry scavengers, rival mining clans, and any other "
"enemy that is unlikely to attack with heavily armored units, these "
"reprogrammed and refurbed versions are often found in the employ of the very "
"types of people it was originally purposed to fight.  Often found as the core "
"of a light patrol or attack squad."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Scavbot Skorpion"
msgid "\"Target Aquired.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "floating heater"
msgid_plural "floating heaters"
msgstr[0] "懸浮加熱器"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/scavbots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "floating heater"
msgid ""
"A salvaged eyebot repurposed into a floating space heater.  It emits a "
"constant jet of warm air to heat an enclosed space."
msgstr "一個回收利用的眼球機器人，改用來當作懸浮空間加熱器。他發出穩定的熱空氣來加熱密閉空間。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/species.json
#. ~ Description of species "UPLIFT"
msgid "an intelligent animal created by man before the Cataclysm"
msgstr "災變之前人為創造的智慧動物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/species.json
#. ~ Description of species "ALIEN_ARTHROPOD"
msgid "an alien arthropod"
msgstr "外星節肢動物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/species.json
#. ~ Foot steps of species "ALIEN_ARTHROPOD"
msgid "chittering."
msgstr "啾啾声。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/species.json
#. ~ Description of species "ALIEN_FLOATER"
msgid "a floating alien"
msgstr "浮空外星生物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/species.json
#. ~ Description of species "MOXIE"
msgid "a humanoid monster"
msgstr "人形的怪物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/species.json
#. ~ Description of species "BIOMACHINE"
msgid "an unusual creature"
msgstr "異常生物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/turrets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "x-ray laser turret"
msgid_plural "x-ray laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "X射線雷射砲塔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/turrets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "x-ray laser turret"
msgid ""
"The TX-5LR Cerberus is an upgrade to its predecessors.  It features a state "
"of the art x-ray laser cannon system with three barrels.  Each barrel will "
"fire once and be exhausted until the part can be replaced."
msgstr "TX-5LR \"地狱犬\"型激光炮塔是其前身的升级版。它的特点是有着最先进的三管转轮X射线激光炮系统。每根炮管发射后就会耗尽能量，需要更换炮管。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/turrets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "SOL XII laser turret"
msgid_plural "SOL XII laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "太阳系 XII 激光炮塔"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/turrets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Description of monster "SOL XII laser turret"
msgid ""
"The Sol Systems model 12 laser turret was once a popular choice for home and "
"business security.  It's integrated laser rifle boasts a cost-effective "
"deterrent to any would-be trespasser."
msgstr "太阳系 XII 型激光炮塔曾经是家庭和商业安防的热门选择。它的集成激光步枪对各类潜在的入侵者都是性价比很高的威慑。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/turrets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/turrets.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "SOL XII laser turret"
msgid "\"Trespasser Detected.\""
msgstr "\"检测到入侵者。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Schwarz Walder"
msgid_plural "Schwarz Walders"
msgstr[0] "黑森林熊人"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Schwarz Walder"
msgid ""
"Schwarz Walders are a bipedal uplifted animal originally developed by a "
"German company as forest rangers for the expanded Black Forest Conservation "
"Area.  Like all Uplifts they have a human level of intelligence and are "
"indentured laborers to the corporation that grew and raised them, until they "
"reach age of enfranchisement dictated by UICA regulations or they earn their "
"citizenship early.  Shortly afterward the creation of the first Schwarz "
"Walders it was determined that they also made excellent long range "
"reconnaissance units that could operate independently indefinitely.  This was "
"one of the most popular Uplift models before the Discontinuity, and many "
"frontier planets still retain significant feral and otherwise independent "
"populations.  They are skilled marksmen and this one appears to be armed with "
"an SMG."
msgstr ""
"黑森林熊人是一种基因擢升双足动物，最初是由一家德国公司研发的，作为扩大后的黑森林保护区的护林员。和其他基因擢升动物一样，他们有着媲美人类的智力水平，是归属于"
"制造及培养他们的巨型企业名下的契约奴工，直到他们达到UICA所规定的解放年龄或提前获得公民身份。在第一批黑森林熊人被培育出不久之后，公司发现他们也能够成为优"
"秀的远程侦察兵，可以在敌后无限期独自行动。在大隔绝之前，他们是最流行的基因擢升动物之一，许多边境星球上仍然保留着大量已野化和独立后的种群。他们是熟练的神枪手"
"，这一只似乎配备了一把冲锋枪。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Schwarz Walder"
msgid "\"You should walk away.\""
msgstr "\"你应该离开。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Schwarz Walder cub"
msgid_plural "Schwarz Walder cubs"
msgstr[0] "黑森林熊人幼兽"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Schwarz Walder cub"
msgid ""
"A young Schwarz Walder.  If one is out here, a very protective parent is "
"likely nearby."
msgstr "一只黑森林熊人幼兽。如果你发现了一只黑森林熊人幼兽，说明它那保护欲极强的父母也一定就在附近。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "infeme"
msgid_plural "infemes"
msgstr[0] "因非瑪異人類"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "infeme"
msgid ""
"The Infeme are uplifted from apes and other near-human ancestors.  The Zulu "
"word for monkey became the catch-all term for many species of uplifts whether "
"majority chimp, gorilla or baboon.  Several worlds experienced a series of "
"events similar to the old pre-spaceflight movie series 'Planet of the Apes' "
"during the Discontinuity."
msgstr ""
"因非玛人是从类人猿和其他接近人类的祖先基因擢升而成的新物种。这个祖鲁人对猴子的称谓成了多个相似的基因擢升物种的统称，其中大部分源自黑猩猩、大猩猩或是狒狒。有"
"几个星球在大隔绝期间经历了一系列类似于旧的前太空飞行时代系列电影《人猿星球》的事件。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Cecaelian survivor"
msgid_plural "Cecaelian survivors"
msgstr[0] "塞卡莉亚幸存者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Cecaelian survivor"
msgid ""
"The Cecaelia were the corporate answer to the frailty of unmodified humans "
"under the sea.  These individuals have spent a lifetime beneath the waves "
"seeing conflicts you can't even imagine."
msgstr "章魚人是企業為了解決脆弱的人類在海中生存的解決方案。這些人在海中渡過了他們的一生且見過你無法想像的衝突。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Cecaelian survivor"
msgid "\"Under the water, it's an endless war.\""
msgstr "\"在水底，唯有无尽的战火。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Cecaelian Spawn"
msgid_plural "Cecaelian Spawns"
msgstr[0] "章魚人幼體"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/water_mobs.json
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/water_mobs.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deep one"
msgid_plural "deep ones"
msgstr[0] "深潜者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/water_mobs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/water_mobs.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deep one"
msgid ""
"An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its "
"tubular gray body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed "
"protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its "
"shape, shifting in and out of the water."
msgstr "似乎是为了在深海生存而进化的外星人。它灰色的管状身体上长出了无数成对的附肢和一对粗壮的鳍。当它在水中来回移动时，你能勉强看到它时隐时现的外形。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/water_mobs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/water_mobs.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deep one slaver"
msgid_plural "deep one slavers"
msgstr[0] "深潜奴役者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/water_mobs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/water_mobs.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deep one slaver"
msgid ""
"An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its "
"tubular gray body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed "
"protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its "
"shape, shifting in and out of the water.  It is carrying a conical object "
"that hums with an odd keening sound."
msgstr ""
"似乎是为了在深海生存而进化的外星人。它灰色的管状身体上长出了无数成对的附肢和一对粗壮的鳍。当它在水中来回移动时，你能勉强看到它时隐时现的外形，它身上携带着一"
"个能发出奇怪哼鸣声的圆锥形物体。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Haunting Forest Walker"
msgid_plural "Haunting Forest Walkers"
msgstr[0] "森林游獵者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Haunting Forest Walker"
msgid ""
"This towering zombie is covered in wounds and shedding fur.  Once it may have "
"prevented forest fires in national parks, now it kills anything it catches."
msgstr "这只体积巨大的丧尸身上满是伤口和破碎的毛皮。也许曾经它负责阻止国家公园的森林火灾，而现在它可以杀死它所抓住的任何东西。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rotting grodd"
msgid_plural "rotting grodds"
msgstr[0] "腐爛大猩猩"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rotting grodd"
msgid ""
"Imagine a gorilla.  Now imagine it dead and rotting and somehow looking at "
"you with more hate than you had previously imagined possible."
msgstr "想像一隻大猩猩，現在想像他死了且腐爛了，然後用你所能想到的看起來憎恨的目光看著你。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Ghoulodon"
msgid_plural "Ghoulodons"
msgstr[0] "長毛象殭屍"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Ghoulodon"
msgid ""
"An undead Uplifted Elephant of ginormous size.  It still wears its assault "
"grade armor."
msgstr "一個巨大的大象殭屍。它仍然穿著它的突擊級裝甲。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Dead Sea Witch"
msgid_plural "Dead Sea Witches"
msgstr[0] "死海女巫"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Dead Sea Witch"
msgid ""
"There is driftwood coming out of oozing wounds.  It moves towards you on a "
"mass of writhing tentacles, black eyes like the deepest trench of the sea."
msgstr "它体表的伤口渗出来了类似漂浮木头的东西。它用一大团扭曲的触肢向你移动过来，黑色的眼睛就像大海中最深的海沟一般。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "MoxPhore Scavenger"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Scavengers"
msgstr[0] "霜凍人拾荒者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Scavenger"
msgid ""
"A human stands here, towering around 2 meters high.  Its flesh is frozen "
"solid, colored black and blue from frostbite.  It constantly scratches at its "
"flesh with its claw-like hands, surveying the land with frozen and foggy eyes."
msgstr "一个身高约两米的人型生物站立在这里。它的血肉早就冻成了固体，呈现被冻伤后的青紫色。它不停地用爪子似的手抓挠着自己的身体，用冰冷而朦胧的眼睛审视着大地。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "MoxPhore Spartan"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Spartans"
msgstr[0] "霜凍人戰士"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Spartan"
msgid ""
"A human stands here, its body bulging and ripped as the tissue is torn, "
"showing bluish muscle, and gray bones.  Ice crystals jut out of its visible "
"wounds as it wanders."
msgstr ""
"一个身高约两米的人型生物站立在这里。它的身体肿胀鼓起并且伤痕累累，组织撕裂处露出了蓝色的肌肉和灰色的骨头。许多冰晶随着它漫无目的的游荡从它体表可见的伤口中凸"
"出来。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "MoxPhore Regenerator"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Regenerators"
msgstr[0] "霜凍人再生者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Regenerator"
msgid ""
"A human stands here, comically thin and scratching its scar-ridden flesh, any "
"flesh it rips off grows back in seconds."
msgstr "一个身高约两米的人型生物站立在这里。它如同动画人物一般瘦削，不断抓挠着的身体上着布满疤痕的肉，它所撕裂开的任何血肉都会在几秒钟内长回来。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "MoxPhore Tangler"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Tanglers"
msgstr[0] "霜凍人糾纏者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Tangler"
msgid ""
"A human stands here, several rust-colored limbs jutting out of its back, the "
"limbs moving around and grabbing at the air while the person looks blankly "
"around…"
msgstr "一个身高约两米的人型生物站立在这里。从它的背上伸出来的几条锈迹斑斑的四肢在它茫然地环顾四周的时候，不停地四处移动，抓挠着周围的空气………"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Speaker"
msgid_plural "Speakers"
msgstr[0] "呓语海星"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Speaker"
msgid ""
"A starfish-like creature stands here, covered in black metallic fur as it "
"stands out, pointing in a specific direction."
msgstr "一个像海星一样的生物站在这里，身上覆盖着黑色金属色的毛皮，显得格外显眼，指向特定的方向。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "MoxPhore Elder"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Elders"
msgstr[0] "霜凍人長老"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Elder"
msgid ""
"Numerous claw-like limbs closely wrap around this alien arachnid's head and "
"thorax, forming a protective barrier.  Its antennae twitch and writhe, and it "
"seems to grope wildly toward threats."
msgstr "无数爪子形状的触手紧紧地缠绕在这只异星蜘蛛生物的头部和胸部，形成了一道保护性屏障。它的触角不停地抽动和扭动，似乎在疯狂地侦测着任何可能的威胁。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "MoxPhore Bloodhound"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Bloodhounds"
msgstr[0] "霜凍人獵犬"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Bloodhound"
msgid ""
"The remains of a long lost colonist, shaped and rebuilt into a twisted "
"reflection of the insectoid and canid forms.  It scuttles across the ground, "
"looking blankly with vestigial eyes as it sniffs the air."
msgstr "一具早已死去的殖民者的遗骸，被重塑成混合了昆虫和犬科动物特征的扭曲外形。它贴着地面飞跑，用残存的眼睛茫然地四处张望，不断嗅探着空气中任何异常的气息。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "MoxPhore Emetic"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Emetics"
msgstr[0] "莫斯佛呕吐者"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Emetic"
msgid ""
"Unidentifiable walking remains, hunched and wandering in apparent pain.  An "
"alien plant peeks meekly from its open mouth, leaking green liquid as its "
"host stumbles."
msgstr "一具无法辨认的复生残骸，驼着背，带着明显的痛苦蹒跚而行。一种外星植物温顺地在它张开的嘴中窥视着，在它的宿主行走不稳时，会泄漏出一种绿色的液体。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/monster_attacks/zenit.json
