#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Job description of "Mastodon Uplift" NPC class
msgid "Humans created me.  Let's see what I can be on my own."
msgstr "人类创造了我。让我看看我自己能做什么。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"When the government gave up on saving the depths of the city someone decided "
"to use tactical nukes and buy time for the retreat."
msgstr "当政府决定放弃拯救那些已经深陷尸群包围的城市时，高层中有人决定使用战术核武器，为撤退争取时间。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It blew an opening in the horde roaming the city and allowed me to escape."
msgstr "这在游荡在城里的尸群中炸出了一个缺口，让我得以逃脱。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Every choice has consequences though.  But every consequence is probably "
"worth it, if it's the only way to survive."
msgstr "不过，每个抉择都有其后果。但如果这是那时候我唯一能活下来的方法，那么所有后果都是值得的。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I was working in a reactor when something big started smashing everything."
msgstr "我那时候正在一个核反应堆里工作，有个巨大无比的怪物开始砸碎一切东西。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My coworkers and I spiked the reactor to prevent the deaths of hundreds of "
"thousands."
msgstr "我和我的同事通过让反应堆过载防止数十万人死亡。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I guess the other workers are probably all dead anyway now."
msgstr "我想其他工人现在可能也都死了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Things were good.  I had a good job working for a zaibatsu.  I was respected, "
"and had people working for me.  I mostly ignored the changes that were "
"happening in the city, they were beneath me."
msgstr "那会一切都很好。我在一家财阀公司有份很好的工作。我很受尊重，底下有不少人为我工作。我那时候基本上忽略了城市里正在发生的变化，它们一直都藏在我的脚下。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Slowly fewer and fewer of the cubicle drones came into the office.  Security "
"notices piled up about routes through the city to avoid.  Finally, one day I "
"came in and you could hear the riots coming closer and some kind of "
"animalistic roars, gigantic animals."
msgstr ""
"渐渐地，能来公司的隔间码农们越来越少了。关于城内应该避开的道路的安全警示越叠越多。最后，有天我一进公司就能听到暴乱越来越近，夹杂了一些动物的咆哮，巨大的动物"
"。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"That last day security and scientists came up from the underground lab and "
"rounded up all the remaining staff.  One of them said that this was the only "
"chance any of us had of surviving.  They started injecting people at gunpoint."
msgstr ""
"那是我呆在公司的最后一天了，安保队和科学家们从地下实验室赶过来，把公司里剩下的工作人员都召集起来。他们中的一个说这是我们唯一的生存机会。他们开始用枪指着强迫"
"给我们注射了奇怪的药剂。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I was a biohacker by trade before the Cataclysm.  I made a living out of "
"bootlegging medicines, drugs and other copywritten biological products."
msgstr "在大灾变之前我是个生化黑客。我靠走私药品、毒品和仿造生化插件谋生。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Imagine my surprise when I found myself infected with some kind of alien stem "
"cells."
msgstr "你可以想象一下，当我发现自己被某种外星干细胞感染时，我得有多惊讶。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's certainly helped me survive so far.  Was there even a choice not to take "
"advantage of that?"
msgstr "到目前为止，它确实帮助我活了下来。我难道还有得选吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I… can move again.  I have a real body!  Is this a body?"
msgstr "我……又可以动了。我有一个真的身体！这是身体吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So you must have seen some weird stuff?"
msgstr "你一定见过些更奇怪的东西？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I built this body and rescued you…"
msgstr "是我造了这具躯体并拯救了你……"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can put you back in the pieces I found you in."
msgstr "我可以把你放回我找到你的那些玩意里。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No one deserves the hell you've been through.  I hope you find peace."
msgstr "没有人应该经受你所经历的苦难。我希望你能找回内心的安宁。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*crackle* So why would you do this?"
msgstr "*噼里啪啦* 那你为什么要这样做？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "…This is just another torture isn't it!"
msgstr "……这又是一种折磨，不是吗！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I went to a lot of trouble to provide you with a body."
msgstr "为了给你提供一具新躯体，我可费了不少周折。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, *sizzle* I'm sorry!  Don't hurt me again!  Anything to stay away "
"from those fiends!"
msgstr "好吧，好吧，*滋滋*对不起！别再伤害我了！只要能远离那些恶魔要我做什么都行！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "…You're one of those mocking monsters!  I'm going to tear you apart!"
msgstr "……你和那些可笑的怪物是一伙的！我要把你撕成碎片！"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I don't know what's happening but I'm going back home."
msgstr "我不知道发生了什么事，但我要回家了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I was created to be a billionaire's companion."
msgstr "我是为了成为一名亿万富翁的同伴而被创造出来的。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Their wealth and connections didn't save them."
msgstr "他们的财富和人脉并没有拯救他们。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "But they built me with the ability to survive a world beyond imagining."
msgstr "但他们给了我在这个无法想象的世界里生存下去的能力。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "But here you are?"
msgstr "但你还是到这里来了？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "A resort created a whole line of Uplifts just like me."
msgstr "一个度假胜地创造了一系列像我一样的基因擢升人。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We should have created a whole village of just us away from all the humans "
"once the Cataclysm came."
msgstr "当大灾变来临，我们本应该创造一个只属于我们自己的村庄，远离所有的人类。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Maybe we did, haha."
msgstr "也许我们做到了，哈哈。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Why didn't you?"
msgstr "那你怎么没有呢？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I grew up on an island with a doctor."
msgstr "我在一个岛上和一个医生一起长大。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I had so many brothers and sisters."
msgstr "我有許多兄弟姊妹。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "We ate him."
msgstr "我们把他吃掉了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The zoo designed me to be a link between my original species and humans "
"studying us."
msgstr "一家动物园把我设计成一个连接我原始物种和人类的纽带，然后研究我们。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I was there when the Cataclysm happened.  Many animals were infected."
msgstr "大灾变发生时我就在那里。许多动物被感染了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Zombears are terrifying creatures of destruction."
msgstr "丧尸熊是可怕的毁灭性生物。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I was part of a black ops paramilitary unit.  I still don't know if I worked "
"for the government or a corporation."
msgstr "我曾经是黑色行动部队的一员。我至今仍然不知道我是为政府还是公司工作。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My team was sent in to a lab on a purge in fire mission.  The things I saw in "
"there haunt me."
msgstr "我的小队被派往一个实验室执行一项灭火任务。我在那里看到的东西不断给我梦魇。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Others may have survived but I doubt it.  I certainly hope they haven't come "
"back."
msgstr "其他人可能还活着，但我不是很确定。我当然希望他们不会被复活。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm a vatgrown, an almost man, a MacDuff.  I was a product in the Old World."
msgstr "我是一个克隆罐培人，近似人，麦克达夫。我是旧世界的产物。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Now there are too few people left to differentiate.  Other than those morons "
"afraid of mutants."
msgstr "现在活下来的人太少了，再也没法把我区分开了。除了那些害怕变种人的白痴。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Now I choose the cause I'll die for."
msgstr "现在我可以自己选择了能为之死去的信条了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Staying at the family compounds scattered across New England, we've managed "
"to maintain some organization post Cataclysm."
msgstr "住在分散在新英格兰各地的家族领地里，我们设法在大灾变后维持了某种程度上的组织。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The Whately family has been outcast in these parts for centuries.  But it "
"made us stronger as a family."
msgstr "几个世纪以来，沃特利家族在这一带一直都被人排斥。但这让我们变得更强大。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "We've been talking to those from other places from the beginning."
msgstr "我们从一开始就在和来自其他位面的生物交谈。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "All the earth was flame in a holocaust of ecstasy and freedom."
msgstr "整个地球都在狂喜和自由的屠杀中燃烧。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&<mypronoun> looks you up and down, sizing you up."
msgstr "&<mypronoun> looks you up and down, sizing you up."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "What do you want?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You lost or something?"
msgstr "You lost or something?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Like what you see?"
msgstr "Like what you see?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&<mypronoun> simply ignores you as they flick a spent cigarette into the snow."
msgstr "&<mypronoun> simply ignores you as they flick a spent cigarette into the snow."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Mind your own business."
msgstr "Mind your own business."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&<mypronoun> gives you a dismissive look."
msgstr "&<mypronoun> gives you a dismissive look."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Piss off."
msgstr "Piss off."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/salvor_camp_solo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm not here to chat.  What do you want?"
msgstr "I'm not here to chat.  What do you want?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Independents/GENERIC/nc_solo.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Independents/GENERIC/nc_solo.json
#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ Independent mercenaries with high quality combat gear and augments.
msgid "Just fighting for the almighty dollar."
msgstr "Just fighting for the almighty dollar."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
msgid "Mercurial augmentation tech."
msgstr "水星改造技术."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The Mercurial store is attended by a massive clerk, sleek scales adorn their "
"massive forearms and slightly pointed ears.  They greet you with a voice that "
"is both deep and melodious, \"Welcome to Mercurial Genetech, where we can "
"help you unlock your potential.\""
msgstr "&水星商店里站着身材魁梧、双臂和尖耳布满光滑鳞片的店员。 他们用低沉而悦耳的声音向你问好：\"欢迎来到水星基因科技，我们可以帮助您释放你的潜能。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm looking into augments"
msgstr "我想要基因改造。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How does this Genetech stuff works?"
msgstr "基因科技产品是如何工作的？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The clerk smiles, \"Our Genetech is a marvel of modern science, capable of "
"rewriting your very DNA.  We offer a wide range of treatments, from the "
"mundanely medical to the exotic.  You need only select one of our templates "
"and visit one of our editing machines in both ends of this store.  If you "
"ever have doubts, remember that all our treatments are reversible.\""
msgstr ""
"&店员微笑着说：\""
"我们的基因科技是现代科学中的奇迹，能够改写你的DNA。我们提供多种普通或是奇特的疗程，为此，您只需选择其中一个模板，然后使用商店两端的任意一台基因编辑机器。"
"如果你还有任何疑问，请务必记住：我们所有的疗程都是可逆的。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "salvage merchant"
msgstr "salvage merchant"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#. ~ Job description of "salvage merchant" NPC class
msgid "Salvor Fabricator"
msgstr "Salvor Fabricator"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
msgid "Veronica Donaldson"
msgstr "Veronica Donaldson"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
msgid "salvor fabricator"
msgstr "salvor fabricator"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&As you approach the counter, you can't help but notice the chaotic scene "
"before you: Juxtaposed to the makeshift structure, an awkward marriage of "
"ship hulls and foamcrete walls, stands neatly arranged shelving, and "
"near-pristine furniture.  The tools and parts lining the shelves have each "
"been meticulously arranged.  A Salvor sits behind the counter with her arm "
"perched on the surface, supporting her head in her hand.  In her other hand, "
"she idly waves a cigarette, making small circles in the air.  Gray hairs peek "
"out from the edges of her Cryo suit, and her wrinkle-creased face wears a "
"permanent scowl."
msgstr ""
"&As you approach the counter, you can't help but notice the chaotic scene "
"before you: Juxtaposed to the makeshift structure, an awkward marriage of "
"ship hulls and foamcrete walls, stands neatly arranged shelving, and "
"near-pristine furniture.  The tools and parts lining the shelves have each "
"been meticulously arranged.  A Salvor sits behind the counter with her arm "
"perched on the surface, supporting her head in her hand.  In her other hand, "
"she idly waves a cigarette, making small circles in the air.  Gray hairs peek "
"out from the edges of her Cryo suit, and her wrinkle-creased face wears a "
"permanent scowl."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Approach the counter]"
msgstr "[Approach the counter]"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Great, another Earther descends from the heavens.  Did you come all the way "
"here to grace us with your presence?  If you've any brains in that thick "
"skull: you take whatever money you have left and get your sorry ass off this "
"rock.  Salus ain't for you."
msgstr ""
"Great, another Earther descends from the heavens.  Did you come all the way "
"here to grace us with your presence?  If you've any brains in that thick "
"skull: you take whatever money you have left and get your sorry ass off this "
"rock.  Salus ain't for you."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can't do that."
msgstr "I can't do that."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You got some kind of problem with Earthers?"
msgstr "You got some kind of problem with Earthers?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Your kind are all the same.  Born on the ol' celestial throne Sol, silver "
"spoon in your mouth.  Everywhere you go, you're walk'n and talk'n like you "
"own the place.  Bumbling through the stars without a clue.  Spit'n out the "
"Corpo bullshit they been feeding you till you die for the glory of ol' Earth. "
" I've seen enough Earth kids come through here to know you type.  Here to "
"bite it just like they did?"
msgstr ""
"Your kind are all the same.  Born on the ol' celestial throne Sol, silver "
"spoon in your mouth.  Everywhere you go, you're walk'n and talk'n like you "
"own the place.  Bumbling through the stars without a clue.  Spit'n out the "
"Corpo bullshit they been feeding you till you die for the glory of ol' Earth. "
" I've seen enough Earth kids come through here to know you type.  Here to "
"bite it just like they did?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I didn't come here to die."
msgstr "I didn't come here to die."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Course you didn't.  But death's all you'll find here.  You step into those "
"icy wastes and you ain't wandering back.  A bot'll blow your brains out or a "
"Wraith splatter you into some many pieces that even the med bots can't put "
"your carcass back together.  And if you ain't lucky the moxies'll mob you.  "
"Now the way they tear a person apart, it ain't a sight that ever leaves you."
msgstr ""
"Course you didn't.  But death's all you'll find here.  You step into those "
"icy wastes and you ain't wandering back.  A bot'll blow your brains out or a "
"Wraith splatter you into some many pieces that even the med bots can't put "
"your carcass back together.  And if you ain't lucky the moxies'll mob you.  "
"Now the way they tear a person apart, it ain't a sight that ever leaves you."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Leaving isn't an option for me."
msgstr "Leaving isn't an option for me."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Another new face.  So what'll it be this time?  Corpo Business?  Treasure "
"Hunting?  Bounty Hunt?  Or maybe you heard about the lovely weather here and "
"just had to experience it yourself?  Save yourself the trouble, there ain't "
"nothing for you on Salus.  Want my advice?  Get off world 'fore some bot "
"plasters your brains all over the snow."
msgstr ""
"Another new face.  So what'll it be this time?  Corpo Business?  Treasure "
"Hunting?  Bounty Hunt?  Or maybe you heard about the lovely weather here and "
"just had to experience it yourself?  Save yourself the trouble, there ain't "
"nothing for you on Salus.  Want my advice?  Get off world 'fore some bot "
"plasters your brains all over the snow."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Whatever you think your reasons are they ain't worth it.  Salus'll chew you "
"up and spit you back out.  A quick death here is a mercy.  Get off world no "
"matter what it costs you: That's how you survive."
msgstr ""
"Whatever you think your reasons are they ain't worth it.  Salus'll chew you "
"up and spit you back out.  A quick death here is a mercy.  Get off world no "
"matter what it costs you: That's how you survive."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm not backing down."
msgstr "I'm not backing down."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you talk to all your customers like this?"
msgstr "Do you talk to all your customers like this?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Veronica looks you up and down discerningly and a small smile creases her "
"lips.\n"
"So you got some spine, good.  Some of the kids that come through here fold "
"the minute the pressure's on.  They don't have a damn clue what's waiting for "
"them out there.  You, well come back alive and you can call me impressed."
msgstr ""
"Veronica looks you up and down discerningly and a small smile creases her "
"lips.\n"
"So you got some spine, good.  Some of the kids that come through here fold "
"the minute the pressure's on.  They don't have a damn clue what's waiting for "
"them out there.  You, well come back alive and you can call me impressed."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, what do you actually do here?"
msgstr "So, what do you actually do here?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Veronica looks you up and down discerningly and scoffs.\n"
"You don't have what it takes kid.  But I won't beat a dead horse.  If you're "
"set on this: best you get geared up before you head out there.  Got some good "
"stuff here that might save your life."
msgstr ""
"Veronica looks you up and down discerningly and scoffs.\n"
"You don't have what it takes kid.  But I won't beat a dead horse.  If you're "
"set on this: best you get geared up before you head out there.  Got some good "
"stuff here that might save your life."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"A small smile tugs at the edge of Veronica's lips.\n"
"Tch.  No, just the ones I like.  If you ain't changing your mind then at "
"least take a look around.  Best not to go into those frigid wastes unprepared."
msgstr ""
"A small smile tugs at the edge of Veronica's lips.\n"
"Tch.  No, just the ones I like.  If you ain't changing your mind then at "
"least take a look around.  Best not to go into those frigid wastes unprepared."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Right then, this here's my shop, and round the back there's my workroom.  "
"I've enough tech here to whip up whatever you need, 'cept for that real fancy "
"glittertech shit.  I sell the sorts of tools folk like you need to do your "
"work.  Stuff that'll get you into places you ain't supposed to be and break "
"apart anything interesting you find.  I'll buy any scraps you get out there "
"and I'll shoot you straight on the prices.  So if you find anything "
"interesting you bring it here first ya hear?"
msgstr ""
"Right then, this here's my shop, and round the back there's my workroom.  "
"I've enough tech here to whip up whatever you need, 'cept for that real fancy "
"glittertech shit.  I sell the sorts of tools folk like you need to do your "
"work.  Stuff that'll get you into places you ain't supposed to be and break "
"apart anything interesting you find.  I'll buy any scraps you get out there "
"and I'll shoot you straight on the prices.  So if you find anything "
"interesting you bring it here first ya hear?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Good to know.  Can I take a look at your stock?"
msgstr "Good to know.  Can I take a look at your stock?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Good to know.  I don't need anything right now though."
msgstr "Good to know.  I don't need anything right now though."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome back.  Planning on buying something or did you just come here to gawk?"
msgstr "Welcome back.  Planning on buying something or did you just come here to gawk?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Show me what you have in stock."
msgstr "Show me what you have in stock."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What brought you to Salus?"
msgstr "What brought you to Salus?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Nevermind."
msgstr "沒事。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Came in with a crew trying to cozy up 'ere on the DL.  It was a shit plan "
"from the start, told 'em as much.  But those scrap-for brains couldn't see "
"the forest for the trees.  Figured they pull a fortune of ship parts from the "
"graveyards and skip planet fat and happy."
msgstr ""
"Came in with a crew trying to cozy up 'ere on the DL.  It was a shit plan "
"from the start, told 'em as much.  But those scrap-for brains couldn't see "
"the forest for the trees.  Figured they pull a fortune of ship parts from the "
"graveyards and skip planet fat and happy."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What happened to your crew?"
msgstr "What happened to your crew?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Did you ever find anything interesting?"
msgstr "Did you ever find anything interesting?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They're pushing daisies in the great beyond.  Not a single one of them made "
"it off this hell.  Not like I didn't warn them.  They just kept fooling "
"around in places one of us had any business being."
msgstr ""
"They're pushing daisies in the great beyond.  Not a single one of them made "
"it off this hell.  Not like I didn't warn them.  They just kept fooling "
"around in places one of us had any business being."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Tch, sure.  Plenty.  But we never got our hands on any of it.  Not a single "
"thing worth taking comes as easily as you like, and you'd do well to remember "
"that."
msgstr ""
"Tch, sure.  Plenty.  But we never got our hands on any of it.  Not a single "
"thing worth taking comes as easily as you like, and you'd do well to remember "
"that."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What was the coolest thing you ever found?"
msgstr "What was the coolest thing you ever found?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Noted."
msgstr "Noted."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Drive Core, Cruiser class, mostly intact.  We picked it up on scanners in the "
"stern section of a Titan II class.  It was partially buried at the bottom of "
"a ravine, old gal must a split in the atmo.  Only ever managed a glimpse of "
"the damn thing though."
msgstr ""
"Drive Core, Cruiser class, mostly intact.  We picked it up on scanners in the "
"stern section of a Titan II class.  It was partially buried at the bottom of "
"a ravine, old gal must a split in the atmo.  Only ever managed a glimpse of "
"the damn thing though."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Net Breacher woke up the Ship's AI.  The bastard fried her brain from the "
"inside out.  Rail from a Wraith turned another two to paste while everyone "
"was still losing their shit.  Rest is a haze of bloody screams and a hail of "
"bullets and plasma.  Few that got out died later of blood loss or froze from "
"suits full o' holes.\n"
"Veronica removes her glove revealing a metallic hand that glints brightly in "
"the dim light of the structure.\n"
"Woulda been dead myself but the plasma burst that took my arm cauterized the "
"wound.  Patched the suit up with foamcrete on my way out.  The Doc had a lot "
"of fun with that one."
msgstr ""
"Net Breacher woke up the Ship's AI.  The bastard fried her brain from the "
"inside out.  Rail from a Wraith turned another two to paste while everyone "
"was still losing their shit.  Rest is a haze of bloody screams and a hail of "
"bullets and plasma.  Few that got out died later of blood loss or froze from "
"suits full o' holes.\n"
"Veronica removes her glove revealing a metallic hand that glints brightly in "
"the dim light of the structure.\n"
"Woulda been dead myself but the plasma burst that took my arm cauterized the "
"wound.  Patched the suit up with foamcrete on my way out.  The Doc had a lot "
"of fun with that one."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Veronica slowly slides her glove back over her hand and meets your eyes with "
"a scornful gaze.\n"
"Those kids were hopeful idiots but they knew what they were doing.  This "
"place 'ill take everything from you no matter how prepared you think you are. "
" Leave as soon as you can.  And stay the hell away from the graveyards."
msgstr ""
"Veronica slowly slides her glove back over her hand and meets your eyes with "
"a scornful gaze.\n"
"Those kids were hopeful idiots but they knew what they were doing.  This "
"place 'ill take everything from you no matter how prepared you think you are. "
" Leave as soon as you can.  And stay the hell away from the graveyards."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What happened afterwards, how did you end up here?"
msgstr "What happened afterwards, how did you end up here?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I pulled myself together and set up this little abode.  Been selling tools "
"and gear to the folk that come through 'ere for a time now.  Buncha upstarts "
"followed suit and set up their own little places.  And now we got our own "
"neighborhood.  If it weren't for the nosey UICA pricks and especially that "
"little shit Atermis I'd almost call it livable."
msgstr ""
"I pulled myself together and set up this little abode.  Been selling tools "
"and gear to the folk that come through 'ere for a time now.  Buncha upstarts "
"followed suit and set up their own little places.  And now we got our own "
"neighborhood.  If it weren't for the nosey UICA pricks and especially that "
"little shit Atermis I'd almost call it livable."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Why stay?  You must have enough to leave the planet by now?"
msgstr "Why stay?  You must have enough to leave the planet by now?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, it ain't like I got someplace to be.  And, well, I can't rightly "
"explain it, but, I feel like I still got business here.  There's a score that "
"needs to be settled, and it just wouldn't sit right leaving things at that.  "
"Salus ain't through with me yet."
msgstr ""
"Well, it ain't like I got someplace to be.  And, well, I can't rightly "
"explain it, but, I feel like I still got business here.  There's a score that "
"needs to be settled, and it just wouldn't sit right leaving things at that.  "
"Salus ain't through with me yet."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I understand"
msgstr "I understand"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The workshop is a chaotic mess of spare parts, tools, and partially "
"assembled components littering every surface.  <npc_name> is muttering to "
"himself under his breath when you approach.\n"
"Oh hello, do you need something?"
msgstr ""
"&车间里到处都是杂乱的零件、工具和部分组装的部件。当你走近时，<npc_name>低声喃喃。\n"
"哦，你好，你需要什么吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The workshop is a chaotic mess of spare parts, tools, and partially "
"assembled components littering every surface.  <npc_name> is muttering to "
"himself under his breath when you approach.\n"
"Do you need something salvor?"
msgstr ""
"&车间里到处都是杂乱的零件、工具和部分组装的部件。当你走近时，<npc_name>低声喃喃。\n"
"你需要什么帮助吗，打捞者？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you have in stock?"
msgstr "你有什么存货？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You said something about a special offer?"
msgstr "你之前说有什么特别的要卖？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you sell any vehicles here?"
msgstr "你这里卖什么载具吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Is that Lynx still for sale?"
msgstr "那辆猞猁还在卖吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, why did you come to Salus IV?"
msgstr "所以，你为什么来Salus IV？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Wait.  Hold on a second, please don't take this the wrong way, but you "
"wouldn't happen to be from Earth by any chance?."
msgstr "&等等。等一下，请不要误会，你不会碰巧来自地球吧？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How can you tell?"
msgstr "你怎么知道？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sorry, you're mistaken."
msgstr "对不起，你搞错了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&I knew it!  I'm from Earth too so I could just tell.  The way you carry "
"yourself, it's not like the rest of the salvors around here.  But you get it "
"right?"
msgstr "&我就知道！我也来自地球，所以我可以分辨。你走路的样子不像这里其他的打捞者。你理解我的意思吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Right?  Right!  Of course you do.  You understand!  This place is about as "
"far a cry from civilization as you can get.  And the people, god, the people! "
" This post sees a never-ending deluge of criminals and brawn for brains.  And "
"it's like none of them have even heard of a shower!  Just the other day, a "
"man emerged from the icy waste covered in blood and viscera.  And everyone "
"just ignored him acting like that was a completely normal thing to do!  I am "
"going to get off this god-forsaken rock if it's the last thing I do, I swear "
"it."
msgstr ""
"&理解吗？当然了，你当然理解！这这地方离文明十万八千光年远。还有这些人，天哪，这些人！每天都有数不清的罪犯和头脑简单四肢发达的人来来往往。他们好像连澡都没洗"
"过！就在前几天，一个浑身是血和内脏的人从冰天雪地中走了出来。可大家却都视而不见，好像这再正常不过了！我发誓，就算这是我要做的最后一件事，我也要离开这个该死的"
"地方。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&No, don't give me that!  I can tell, just by looking at you, I know.  Don't "
"worry, I'm from Earth too!  I get it: some people around here get all weird "
"when they find out where you're from.  But you won't get that from me. Us "
"Earthers got to stick together, right?"
msgstr ""
"&不，别跟我来这套！光看你一眼我就知道了。别担心，我也是地球人！我懂，这里有些人一知道你来自哪里就会变得很奇怪。但你在我这儿可不会遇到这种情况。咱们地球人得"
"相互支持，对吧？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr "我不知道你在说什么。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&Sure, whatever you say, pal."
msgstr "&当然，随你怎么说，伙计。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Right!  Sorry, this is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Mostly I just "
"fix up the patrol vehicles.  But I am also in charge of maintaining our stock "
"of vehicle parts.  As such: I've been authorized to trade with salvors in "
"order to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or "
"chits in exchange.  I'll give you a nice price, just: Don't tell my boss.  "
"And one more thing, I've got something really special for sale, if you're "
"interested."
msgstr ""
"&好了！抱歉说多了，这是载具库房，归我管。我大多时候就是修修巡逻车。但车辆零件的库存也由我负责。就因为这样：我被允许和打捞者做交易来搞到我们需要的东西，也能"
"给你一些我们多余的库存或者欠条来交换。我会给你个好价钱，只是：你可别跟我老板讲。还有啊，我有个特别的东西要卖，要是你感兴趣的话。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you show me your stock?"
msgstr "你能给我看看你的存货吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What's this special offer?"
msgstr "你说的特别的东西是什么？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks, I don't need anything right now."
msgstr "谢谢，我现在什么都不需要。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Please don't touch anything "
"unless you're buying.  I fix up the patrol vehicles and maintain our stock of "
"spare parts.  As such: I've been authorized to trade with outsiders in order "
"to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or chits in "
"exchange."
msgstr ""
"这里是载具库房，由我负责管理。除非您要购买，否则请勿触碰任何东西。我负责修理巡逻车辆以及维护零件库存。因此，我被授权与外界进行交易以获取所需物资，并且可以为"
"您提供一些我们的剩余库存或借条作为交换。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Here's the thing: A while back one of our patrol vehicles got totalled when "
"some junior officers took it for a joy ride.  We are in queue to get a "
"replacement issued to us and High Command just wants the old one broken down "
"for parts.  Well the chief and I agree that's a little wasteful.  So I "
"patched the damn thing back together with the parts we had on hand.  And now "
"we're looking for a way to make it, disappear.  You follow?"
msgstr ""
"事情是这样的：之前我们一辆巡逻车被几个小年轻开出去兜风给撞报废了。我们等着领一辆新的，可上面却想把那辆旧的拆了当零件用。我和队长都觉得这有点浪费，所以我就用"
"手头有的零件把它修好了。现在我们正在想办法把它藏起来，你能明白我的意思吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How much do want for it?"
msgstr "这个你要价多少？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'll cut you a deal.  Let's say 30,000 USD and it's all yours."
msgstr "我给你个优惠价。3 万美元，这东西就归你了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll take it"
msgstr "我要了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&As I've SAID before: I'm only authorized to trade vehicle parts and scraps.  "
"Our patrol vehicles are not up for auction.  Now if you don't mind, I have "
"work to do."
msgstr "&正如我之前所说：我只被授权交易载具零件和废料。我们的巡逻车不在拍卖之列。现在如果您不介意的话，我还有工作要做。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Surely you can arrange for a patrol car to be 'lost'.  I can make it worth "
"your while."
msgstr "你肯定有办法让一辆巡逻车‘消失’吧。我保证会让你这笔买卖划得来。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/ground_quartermaster.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/ground_quartermaster.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Nevermind then."
msgstr "算了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'd report you if this sort of behavior wasn't already so laughably "
"perdictable.  Just go away."
msgstr "要不是觉得你这种行为不是那么可笑又那么易懂，我早就告你了。赶紧走开。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Alright, alright.  Just not so loud.  Here's the thing: A while back one of "
"our patrol vehicles got totalled when some junior officers took it for a joy "
"ride.  We are in queue to get a replacement issued to us and High Command "
"just wants the old one broken down for parts.  Well the chief and I agree "
"that's a little wasteful.  So I patched the damn thing back together with the "
"parts we had on hand.  And now we're looking for a way to make it, disappear."
msgstr ""
"行啦行啦，声音小点。事情是这样的：之前咱们一辆巡逻车被几个小年轻开出去兜风给撞报废了。我们等着领辆新的，可上面却要我们把那辆旧的拆了当零件用。我和队长都觉得"
"这有点浪费，所以我就用手头有的零件把它修好了。现在咱们得想办法让它，消失。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"<npc_name> sighs.\n"
"Yes it is, are you interested?"
msgstr ""
"<npc_name>叹息。\n"
"是，您感兴趣吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How much do want for it again?"
msgstr "你再说一遍，这个要多少钱？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "40,000 USD and it's all yours."
msgstr "四万美元，它就全归你了。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It wasn't my choice, obviously.  That fucking bastard back in Alpha Centauri "
"had me transferred to this frozen hell.  Pulled strings with the staff in "
"command.  I signed on to help put Earth back where it belongs: on top.  Not "
"freeze my arse off fixing barely held-together scrap in the middle of fucking "
"nowhere.  Mercurial doesn't even give a shit about this place.  I don't know "
"why the UICA even bothers to station us here.  If you ask me this planet "
"should have stayed abandoned."
msgstr ""
"这明显不是我的选择。那个混蛋在半人马座阿尔法星系里把我调到了这个冰天雪地的鬼地方。他跟指挥官那边的人打了招呼。我当初签约是为了帮地球重回巅峰，而不是在这荒郊"
"野外冻得屁滚尿流地修那些破烂玩意儿。水星公司根本不在乎这个地方。我真搞不懂UICA为什么还要在这儿驻军。依我看，这星球就该一直荒着。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Who's the bastard?"
msgstr "谁是那个混蛋？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What makes you think Mercurial doesn't care?"
msgstr "是什么让你觉得水星公司不在乎？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sorry I asked."
msgstr "抱歉。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My former superior officer, the prick.  Always hovering my shoulder like a "
"damn drone.  I won't miss that uptight control freak.  We fought a lot and "
"didn't see things eye to eye.  But this?  I never imagined the fucker would "
"stoop this low.  Hell of a disciplinary action, I'll tell you that much."
msgstr ""
"我以前的上司，那个混蛋。老是像烦人的苍蝇一样在我耳边转悠。我可不会想念那个神经兮兮的控制狂。我们经常吵架，观点也合不来。但这次？我真没想到这混蛋会这么卑鄙。"
"这纪律处分可真是够狠的，我跟你说。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that."
msgstr "很抱歉听到这件事。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The last thing they did was set up their little clinic on the station, and "
"they haven't done jack since.  No communications, no re-colonization efforts, "
"no survey teams.  They hardly even seem to care about going down planetside.  "
"Not like I blame them.  The colony didn't work out before so, why bother?  "
"This place is clearly not worth the effort."
msgstr ""
"他们最后做的事就是在空间站上开了个小诊所，之后就啥也没干了。没搞过通讯，没搞过重新殖民，也没派过考察队。他们似乎根本不在乎去星球表面。我也不怪他们，之前的殖"
"民地都没成功，干嘛还要费劲呢？这地方显然不值得花心思。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I guess there are some rocks even Corpos won't touch."
msgstr "我想这些石头连那些公司都不会碰。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_merchant.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_merchant.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
msgid "garage clerk"
msgstr "车库员工"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_merchant.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_merchant.json
#. ~ Job description of "garage clerk" NPC class
msgid "Vehicle Garage Clerk"
msgstr "载具车库员工"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_merchant.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_merchant.json
#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
msgid "Artemis Burton"
msgstr "阿尔忒弥斯·伯顿"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Please retrieve your belongings and move along.  We have a schedule to keep"
msgstr "请带好你的随身物品并继续前行。我们可需要遵守时刻表。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yes yes, welcome to Port Augustmoon.  Please collect your belongings and head "
"down the docking arm.  Port authority won't be liable for any missing items."
msgstr ""
"Yes yes, welcome to Port Augustmoon.  Please collect your belongings and head "
"down the docking arm.  Port authority won't be liable for any missing items."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Could you help me with directions?"
msgstr "你能给我指个路吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The main concourse is down the docking arm.  You can't miss it.  Links up to "
"the mess hall and the commercial wing is right beyond that.  You can arrange "
"planetary transport with the portmaster, found where the commercial wing "
"starts."
msgstr "主大厅就在对接舱段的下面。你不会错过的。再向前则通往餐厅和商业舱段。你可以在商业舱段起始点找到站长，安排往返行星的穿梭机。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_longshoreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thank you"
msgstr "谢谢。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/GENERIC/nc_naval_police.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_security.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/GENERIC/nc_naval_police.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_security.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A generic guard for port augustmoon.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Security within ships and ports
msgid "Augustmoon Security"
msgstr "秋月港保安"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_security.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/ground_engineer.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/ground_soldier.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_security.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/ground_engineer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/ground_soldier.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Keep it civil, salvor."
msgstr "举止文明点，打捞者。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/spaceport_portmaster.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/spaceport_portmaster.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Portmaster"
msgstr "站长"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#. ~ Job description of "Portmaster" NPC class
msgid "I manage incoming and outgoing ships and shuttlecraft."
msgstr "我负责管理星舰和穿梭机的进出。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Interested in booking passage planetside?"
msgstr "需要预定前往行星表面的穿梭机吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/spaceport_portmaster.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/spaceport_portmaster.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's why I'm here"
msgstr "这正是我找你的原因。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want to contract a drone shuttle."
msgstr "我需要预定一台无人穿梭机。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/spaceport_portmaster.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/spaceport_portmaster.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Not right now"
msgstr "再等等。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Excellent, the current price for a passage down is 1000 USD.  If there's any "
"cargo you wish to transfer planetside please place it in the nearby "
"container.  Additionally, I'm obliged to inform you that a return passage is "
"considerably more expensive, having a current price of 12500 USD.  Do you "
"wish to book passage?"
msgstr ""
"非常好，目前的价格是1000美元。如果你想朝穿梭机上搬运货物，请把它放在附近的集装箱里。此外，我不得不通知你，返程票要贵得多，目前价格为12500"
"美元。你需要现在订一架吗？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm ready, book me in the next ship down."
msgstr "我准备好了，给我订下一班穿梭机。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/spaceport_portmaster.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/augustmoon_shipping_agent.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/spaceport_portmaster.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I need to settle a few things first"
msgstr "我手头还有些事要处理。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/GENERIC/nc_ground_engineer.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/ground_engineer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/GENERIC/nc_ground_engineer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/ground_engineer.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A generic commanding officer for UICA ground installations.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Engineers for ground installations to maintain robots and military
#. equipment
msgid "UICA Engineer"
msgstr "UICA Engineer"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/ground_engineer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/ground_engineer.json
