msgstr "继续往前走。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/GENERIC/nc_port_worker.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/GENERIC/nc_port_worker.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ For crew and customs officers in port Augustmoon.  They have some level
#. of military training.
