#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/computers/escape_pod_control.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Ready escape pod."
msgstr "准备逃生舱。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/computers/escape_pod_control.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/computers/escape_pod_control.json
