msgstr "Charged Bionic Weapon"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of enchantment "Charged Bionic Weapon"
msgid "Your bionic weapon sparks under constant electrical charge."
msgstr "Your bionic weapon sparks under constant electrical charge."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/bionics.json
#. ~ Name of a bionic
msgid "Skullgun"
msgstr "头骨枪"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of bionic "Skullgun"
msgid ""
"Concealed in your head is a single shot 10mm pistol.  Activate the bionic to "
"fire and reload the skullgun."
msgstr "你的头部藏有一把 10mm 口径单发手枪。启动生化插件即可发射头骨枪并重新装弹。"

