msgstr "聚精会神 （入门）"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/proficiencies.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/proficiencies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/proficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Concentration (Beginner)"
msgid ""
"You are capable of holding the same thing in mind even when sitting in an "
"uncomfortable position or after skipping a meal."
msgstr "即使坐姿难受或者没有进食，你也能维持一样的思绪。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/proficiencies.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/proficiencies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/proficiencies.json
