#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"A mountainside in the distance is littered with erratic flashes of light that "
"suggest extended combat.  It's too far to tell any other details."
msgstr "远处的山腰上散布着不稳定的闪光，表明战斗仍在继续。距离太远了，看不到其他细节。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a sudden CRACK of ice breaking and then the low roar of what must be "
"an avalanche just outside your line of sight."
msgstr "你突然听到一声冰块破裂的声音，随后是在你的视线之外的低沉巨响，那一定是一场雪崩。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"Winged shadows cross the ground, but when you look into the sky you can't "
"seem to see any movement or shapes at all."
msgstr "带有翅膀的影子掠过地面，但当你仰望天空时，你似乎根本看不到任何运动或形状。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"Catch a falling star and put it in your pocket, watch it blaze on through the "
"night sky.  It's a peaceful sign despite all the chaos here below."
msgstr "抓住一颗流星，把它放进口袋，看着它在夜空中闪耀。这是和平的象征，尽管下面一片混乱。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"Some craft swiftly hovers across the night sky, searchlights flaring out from "
"its belly in figure-eight patterns.  It circles in an ever larger pattern "
"until it pauses and weapons fire lashes from it to the ground like lightning. "
" A full five seconds of broadsides to the ground, then only the searchlights "
"pointed where the shots seemed to land, then those lights cut off and it "
"might as well be invisible to you."
msgstr ""
"一些飞船迅速地在夜空中飞过，探照灯从它的腹部发出八字形的闪光。闪光轨迹越来越大，直到它停下来，武器冒出的火光像闪电一样从它身上向地面倾泄。整整5"
"秒钟的全速射击，然后只剩下探照灯指向射击地点，然后灯光被切断，它似乎就此消失无踪。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"From where you stand, you can see at the edge of the horizon something "
"rocketing from planetside into orbit."
msgstr "从你站的地方，你可以看到在地平线的边缘有什么东西从星球表面飞向轨道。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"There is a picture of a shuttle taking off with happy people waving from the "
"viewports.  \"Salus is cold.\n"
"\n"
" Our love is true\n"
"\n"
" I hope to see you\n"
"\n"
" On Croatan 2\n"
"\n"
" My dearest, please join me.  I don't believe there are many shuttles left "
"before people will be stuck here forever.\""
msgstr ""
"一张航天飞机起飞的照片，人们高兴地从观察窗中朝外面挥手致意。\n"
"\"Salus 很冷。\n"
"我们的爱很真\n"
"希望与你相遇\n"
"在 Croatan 2 星\n"
"亲爱的，请加入我。我觉得距离人们被永远困在这颗星球之前剩不下几艘航天飞机了。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"A person wrapped up in bandages in a hospital bed is pictured on the front of "
"this card.  \"Get well soon!!!\n"
"\n"
" Torrance, I'm sorry you feel ill but many new colonists forget to process "
"any foodstuffs from Salus IV to remove the macronutrient.\""
msgstr ""
"这张卡片的正面是一个裹着绷带躺在病床上的人。\"祝你早日康复！！！\n"
"托伦斯，我很抱歉让你生病了，但许多新殖民者忘记处理食物，Salus IV中的任何食物中都含有的神经毒素。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"A picture of a bloody steak.  This card appears particularly old.  \"Gauchos "
"Steaks.  Deliveries made monthly from Brazil to Salus IV.  Sign up today!\""
msgstr "一张血淋淋的牛排的照片。这张卡看起来特别旧。\"高乔牛排。每月从巴西直送Salus IV。今天就加入会员吧！\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"A glossy image of flowers and funeral statuary.  \"I'm sorry for your loss.  "
"Ebby was an excellent grandparent and we hate for you that he was infected "
"with the Moxphoria and wandered into the wastes.\""
msgstr "一张鲜花和葬礼雕像的浮华照片。\"我为你失去亲人感到遗憾。埃比是一位优秀的祖父，我们和你同样心痛，他感染了莫斯佛病毒，流落在荒野中。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"An orbital view of Salus IV.  \"Happy Colonization Day!\n"
"\n"
" Leonid,\n"
"\n"
" This place is cold as Hell but we've made a life out here in the last ten "
"years.\""
msgstr ""
"一张Salus IV卫星的轨道照片。\"殖民日快乐！\n"
"利奥尼德，\n"
"这地方冷得要命，但过去十年我们在这里过得很好。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"An old style movie theater.  \"Showing the vintage film Aelita!\n"
"\n"
" Tovarishch,\n"
"\n"
" Come with me to the movies.  My grandfather says that this movie is one of "
"the classics.\""
msgstr ""
"一家老式电影院海报。\"播放古董电影《艾莉塔》！\n"
"达瓦里希，\n"
"跟我去看电影吧。我爷爷说这部电影是经典之一。\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
msgid "A strange lumpy pink organ, it pulsates in your hand."
msgstr "一個奇怪長滿結節的粉色器官在你手中跳動。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
msgid "A trio of bean-shaped organs connected by webbing."
msgstr "三个被网状结构连接起来的豆子形状的器官。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
msgid "A spiral covered in spines, it unfolds in your hand."
msgstr "一個長滿尖刺的螺旋狀物體，在你的手中緩緩展開。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
msgid "A hollow organ filled with awful-smelling mucus."
msgstr "一個內部充滿了惡臭的黏液的空心器官。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
msgid "A worm-like object."
msgstr "一個蠕蟲般的物體。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/enchantments.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/enchantments.json
#. ~ Message in effect "afs_generic_free_turn"
msgid "You react with machine-like precision."
msgstr "你的动作有如机器一般精准。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/enchantments.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/enchantments.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect "afs_generic_free_turn"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's reacts with robotic precision."
msgstr "%1$s的动作有着机器人般的精准。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/hologram_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_holo_field"
msgid "Holographic Field"
msgstr "全像力場"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/hologram_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_holo_field ( Holographic Field )"
msgid "Creates several short-lived holograms around you."
msgstr "在你四周创造出几个持续时间很短的全息投影。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/hologram_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_holo_decoy"
msgid "Holographic Decoy"
msgstr "全像誘餌"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/hologram_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_holo_decoy ( Holographic Decoy )"
msgid "Creates a short-lived hologram."
msgstr "创造出一个持续时间很短的全息投影。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/hologram_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_holo_flare"
msgid "Holographic Flash"
msgstr "全像閃光"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/hologram_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_holo_flare ( Holographic Flash )"
msgid ""
"Causes an existing hologram to explode into burning light, harming and "
"stunning enemies close to it."
msgstr "让一个已有的全息影响爆炸成炫目的光芒，伤害并晕眩它附近的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/hologram_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_holo_transposition"
#. ~ Name of spell "holographic_transposition"
msgid "Holographic Transposition"
msgstr "全像換位"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/hologram_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_holo_transposition ( Holographic Transposition
#. )"
#. ~ Description of spell "holographic_transposition ( Holographic
#. Transposition )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Holographic Transposition"
msgid ""
"Allows you to swap places with a previously existing holographic image of "
"yourself.  If the universe itself can't tell you apart, who could?"
msgstr "允許你和已存在的自身全息投影交換位置。如果宇宙本身無法區分你和投影，那還有誰能呢？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/jetpack_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_rocket_jump"
msgid "Rocket Jump"
msgstr "火箭跳跃"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/jetpack_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_rocket_jump ( Rocket Jump )"
msgid ""
"Take to the skies with a rocket assisted jump or dash.  You might target a "
"hostile creature to perform a powerful rocket kick at the end of the dash.  "
"The rocket pack allows for a brief moment of air control or hovering after a "
"jump."
msgstr "进行火箭辅助的短距离跳跃或空中冲刺。你可以在冲刺结束时以一个敌对生物为目标，给它来一脚威力强大的火箭踢。火箭背包可以在跳跃后进行短暂的空中控制或悬停。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/teleport_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_translocation"
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_translocation_slow"
msgid "Translocation"
msgstr "傳送術"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/teleport_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_translocation ( Translocation )"
msgid "Translocates the user to an encoded buoy."
msgstr "將使用者傳送到一個已編碼的信標。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/teleport_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_translocation_slow ( Translocation )"
msgid "Slowly translocates the user to an encoded buoy."
msgstr "緩慢的將使用者傳送到一個已編碼的信標。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/classless.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_classless_toggleable_concentration_end"
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_toggleable_concentration_end"
msgid "[Ψ]Stop Concentrating"
msgstr "[Ψ]结束专注"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/classless.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/classless.json
