#. [Ψ]Stop Concentrating )"
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_toggleable_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating )"
msgid ""
"End your concentration on all of your maintained powers.\n"
"\n"
"Channeling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."
msgstr ""
"结束对所有维持的灵能的专注。\n"
"\n"
"引导这种灵能<color_green>总是成功</color>。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/classless.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/classless.json
#. ~ Message of spell "afs_classless_toggleable_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating )"
msgid "You stop concentrating."
msgstr "你不再集中精力。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_see_electric"
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_see_electric"
msgid "[Ψ]Spark Sight (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]电气感知(C)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_see_electric ( [Ψ]Spark Sight
#. (C) )"
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_see_electric ( [Ψ]Spark Sight (C) )"
msgid ""
"Open your senses to the flow of electricity, revealing nearby electrical "
"creatures or robots.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"开始尝试感受电流的流动，定位附近的带电生物或机器人。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_shock_touch"
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_shock_touch"
