#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_ZAP_ENEMIES_INITIATE"
msgid "Your skin tingles."
msgstr "你的皮肤刺痛。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_hacking_interface"
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_hacking_interface"
msgid "[Ψ]Hacking Interface (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]黑客接口(C)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_hacking_interface ( [Ψ]Hacking
#. Interface (C) )"
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_hacking_interface ( [Ψ]Hacking
#. Interface (C) )"
msgid ""
"Create an electrical interface with your powers, allowing you to hack nearby "
"devices as if you were using a computer.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"用灵能创建一个电子接口，让你可以像使用电脑一样破解附近的电子设备。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_personal_battery"
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_personal_battery"
msgid "[Ψ]Electron Overflow (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]电子溢流(C)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_personal_battery ( [Ψ]Electron
#. Overflow (C) )"
msgid ""
"Generate power for UPS compatible devices on your person.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"产生电流为你兼容UPS的设备充电。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle"
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle"
msgid "[Ψ]Re-energize"
msgstr "[Ψ]反向充电"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle ( [Ψ]Re-
#. energize )"
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle ( [Ψ]Re-energize )"
msgid ""
"Turn your own energy into power for a vehicle or appliance.  You need merely "
"touch the vehicle or any part of the power grid to recharge the batteries."
msgstr "将体内的灵能转化为车辆或设备的电力。触摸车辆或电网的任何部位即可进行充电。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
