#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "waycircle"
msgstr "寻路之环"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "waycircle"
msgid ""
"A ritualistic, circular glyph painted onto a sizable boulder and surrounded "
"with primitive decor, with the intent of channeling the natural of ley lines "
"into a functional landing spot for teleportation.  Theoretically, it could "
"receive any manner of targeted teleport, be it magical, ritualistic, or "
"technological.  Examine to link."
msgstr ""
"一个神秘的环形符号，画在一块巨大的巨石上，周围是一些原始的装饰，用于将自然的地脉线引导到一个特殊的焦点以进行传送。从理论上讲，它可以接收任何方式的定向传送，"
"无论是魔法、巫术还是科技。查看以进行链接。"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Waystone"
msgid_plural "Waystones"
msgstr[0] "寻路之石"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
#. ~ Description of "Waystone"
msgid ""
"This large chunk of stone, cut from a paired waycircle, has been enchanted "
"with primitive, ritual power to link it to a network of empowered ley lines.  "
"As a result, it is capable of sending the user to any linked waycircle, or to "
"any similar teleport location, be it magical or technological, after "
"performing a brief somatic ritual.  The stone is many, many times heavier "
"than it seems to have any right to be, as if pulled powerfully to the Earth "
"by unseen forces.  Further, though it is only somewhat bulky, it seems to "
"defy proper transport, its own dimensions defying any container or reasonable "
"transport.  Best to craft this where you intend to leave it.  Requires a "
"nearby waycircle to craft."
msgstr ""
"这块巨大的石头，是从一个寻路之环上切割下来的，被附上了远古的力量，连接着一个强大的地脉网络。因此，它能够在执行简短的躯体仪式后将使用者传送到任何链接的寻路之"
"环，或任何类似的传送位置，无论是魔法的还是科技的。这块石头比它看起来应该有的重量还要重好几倍，就好像被看不见的力量猛烈地拉到地面上一样。此外，虽然它只是有点"
"笨重，但它似乎无法正常携带，其自身的尺寸被任何容器合理地运输。所以最好在你打算离开它的地方制作它。需要一个附近的寻路之环来制作。"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
#. ~ Name of spell "prim_warp"
msgid "Red Room Recall"
msgstr "红色房间召回"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/teleport.json
#. ~ Description of spell "prim_warp ( Red Room Recall )"
msgid "Transports the user to a viable landing pad via strange forces."
msgstr "神秘力量将使用者传送到一个可用的着陆地点。"

