msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "確認"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ANTI_EVIL_EYE_GEAR"
msgid "Wearing this will protect you from the Evil Eye."
msgstr "戴上这个可以保护你不受邪眼的伤害。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "salt"
msgid "Throw some salt over your shoulder."
msgstr "在你肩上撒些盐。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/absit_invidia.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_ABSIT_INVIDIA_SALT"
msgid ""
"You toss the salt over your shoulder and mutter under your breath the words "
"that you remember from your childhood."
msgstr "你把盐洒在肩上，低声呢喃着儿时的记忆。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/bellringer.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_bellringer"
msgid "Bell-ringing"
msgstr "钟声"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/bellringer.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Bell-ringing"
msgid "This is really going to hurt.  Applied to targets of the Bellringer perk."
msgstr "这会很痛苦。适用于敲钟人能力的目标。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/belowthebelt.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing the "groin" weakpoint
msgid "the groin"
msgstr "the groin"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/closedfist.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/openpalm.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/pinchedfingers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "callused hands"
msgid_plural "callused hands"
msgstr[0] "手锤"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/closedfist.json
#. ~ Description of "callused hands"
msgid ""
"You've dealt so many blows your hands are rough with calluses.  The bottoms "
"of your hand can deal blows hard enough to hammer or finely crush objects."
msgstr "你徒手干掉了不少家伙，你的手已经长满了老茧。你的手掌底部足以施展猛烈的打击，用来攻击或精工锤打物品。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/dice_addition_damage.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_perk_dice_addition_damage"
msgid "Damage dice result: 1D<context_val:dice_side_nums> = <context_val:dice_result>"
msgstr "伤害骰结果：1D<context_val:dice_side_nums> = <context_val:dice_result>"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/duck_and_weave.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_duck_and_weave"
msgid "Running without Rhythm"
msgstr "无节律运动"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/duck_and_weave.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Running without Rhythm"
msgid "You definitely won't attract the worm.  +5 effective dodge, +1 dodge attempt."
msgstr "你绝对不招虫子。+5 有效闪避，+1 闪避次数。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/early_to_rise.json
#. ~ Morale text
msgid "Early Riser"
msgstr "早起的鸟儿"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_zombie"
msgid "Zombie Empathy"
msgstr "丧尸共鸣"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last zombie you killed.  That must have been "
"really hard for it to die again.  Though you aren't really feeling pain right "
"now."
msgstr "你与你击杀的上一只丧尸感同身受。再死一次肯定不好受吧。尽管你现在并没有真正感到疼痛。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
msgid "You feel a bit hungry for brains."
msgstr "你感受到对于新鲜脑子的渴望。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
msgid "Brains are overrated anyways."
msgstr "现在脑子对你来说好像没那么诱人了。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
msgid "Zombie?"
msgstr "丧尸？"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Animal Empathy"
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last animal you killed.  Reminds you of that "
"scene in the movie where they kill the pet, really sad stuff.  Though you are "
"feeling ready to learn to fight right now."
msgstr "你与你击杀的上一只动物感同身受。让你想起电影里杀死宠物的场景，令人悲伤。同时，你感觉自己准备好了像动物一样战斗。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Animal Empathy"
msgid "You are ready for a fight."
msgstr "你的狩猎本能让你准备好投入到战斗中了。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Animal Empathy"
msgid "Your animal instincts dissipate."
msgstr "动物般的狩猎本能渐渐消退..."

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Animal Empathy"
msgid "Animal?"
msgstr "动物？"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether"
msgid "Nether Empathy"
msgstr "异界生物共鸣"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Nether Empathy"
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last demon you killed.  Must be hard to die "
"when you don't truly exist.  Though you are feeling rejuvenated."
msgstr "你与你击杀的上一只异界生物感同身受。作为不被世人所熟知的种族，死亡也不好受吧。你感觉自己的身体充满复生的能量。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Nether Empathy"
msgid "You feel your wounds begin to seal."
msgstr "你感觉你的再生能力加强了。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Nether Empathy"
msgid "Your regeneration ceases."
msgstr "你的再生速度回到了正常水平。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Nether Empathy"
msgid "Nothing?"
msgstr "虚空？"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_fungus"
msgid "Fungal Empathy"
msgstr "真菌共鸣"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Fungal Empathy"
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last mushroom you killed.  You always hated "
"mushrooms on food, too earthy for your taste.  Though you feel like your "
"illness is gone."
msgstr "你与你击杀的上一只真菌体感同身受。你总是讨厌食物中的蘑菇，它们对你的口味来说太土了。同时，你感觉到自己体内的疾病正在消失。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Fungal Empathy"
msgid "You feel like something eats all the sickness inside you."
msgstr "你感觉体内的疾病似乎被吞噬了。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Fungal Empathy"
msgid "Mushroom?"
msgstr "真菌？"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_insect"
msgid "Bug Empathy"
msgstr "昆虫共鸣"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Bug Empathy"
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last bug you killed.  You always hated "
"squishing bugs, what did they ever do to you.  Though you feel like your skin "
"has hardened."
msgstr "你与你击杀的上一只昆虫感同身受。就像你总是讨厌压扁无辜的虫子。同时，你感觉你的皮肤开始硬化。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Bug Empathy"
msgid "Your skin hardens significantly."
msgstr "你的皮肤显著硬化了。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Bug Empathy"
msgid "Your skin softens again."
msgstr "你的皮肤重新软化了。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Bug Empathy"
msgid "Bug?"
msgstr "昆虫？"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/flawless_memory.json
#. ~ Description of "Flawless memory"
msgid ""
"You can remember with perfect detail everything you've ever lived, even "
"allowing you to read books and play games by remembering them."
msgstr "你可以回忆起有关你经历过的一切的完美的细节 ，使你甚至能通过回忆读书和玩游戏。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/forge_blood.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check_blood" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood"
msgid "You pour some of your blood on the object, imbuing it with durability."
msgstr "你对目标撒了一些自己的血，赋予其耐用性。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/forge_blood.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check_blood" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood"
msgid "You do not have enough blood to safely use this ability."
msgstr "你的血量不足以安全使用这个能力。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/forge_blood.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood_check" in nested
#. EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_forge_blood"
msgid "This object is durable enough, there's no need to use your blood on it."
msgstr "这个目标已经足够耐用，没有必要对它使用自己的血。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_frankenstein_insight"
msgid "You have already mastered the art of bringing back the undead!"
msgstr "你已经掌握了让死物复苏的艺术！"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_frankenstein_insight"
msgid "With a flash of insight you now understand how to bring the dead back to life!"
msgstr "随着眼前的一道白光，你懂得了如何让死物复苏！"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "homunculus"
msgid_plural "homunculi"
msgstr[0] "复苏缝合怪"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
#. ~ Description of "homunculus"
msgid ""
"A stitched together monstrosity of meat and bone, with limbs as wide as trash "
"cans.  This one is still sleeping.  It would require a master's touch to "
"bring it to life."
msgstr "一直由血肉和白骨缝合在一起的怪物，四肢像垃圾桶一样粗。它还在沉睡，等待谁来让它重获生命。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/frankenstein.json
#. ~ Description of monster "homunculus"
msgid ""
"A stitched together monstrosity of meat and bone, with limbs as wide as trash "
"cans."
msgstr "一只由血肉和白骨缝合在一起的怪物，四肢像垃圾桶一样粗。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/grit_your_teeth.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_GRIT_YOUR_TEETH"
msgid "You need more time to collect yourself before you can grit your teeth again."
msgstr "你需要更多的时间来振作起来，然后才能再次咬紧牙关。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/holdout_pocket.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "holdout pocket"
msgid_plural "holdout pocket"
msgstr[0] "隐秘口袋"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/holdout_pocket.json
#. ~ Description of "holdout pocket"
msgid "A secret pocket no one knows about that can easily store a weapon."
msgstr "一个无人知晓的秘密口袋，可以轻松存放一件武器。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_moonstruck_full"
msgid "Moonstruck: Full Moon"
msgstr "痴迷月色：满月"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Moonstruck: Full Moon"
msgid ""
"Under the clear light of the full moon, you have unlocked your greatest "
"potential."
msgstr "在满月的清辉下，你释放了自己最大的潜力。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_moonstruck_waxing"
msgid "Moonstruck: Waxing Moon"
msgstr "痴迷月色：盈月"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Moonstruck: Waxing Moon"
msgid "The silver light of the waxing moon enhances your prowess."
msgstr "上弦月的银光增强了你的能力。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_moonstruck_new"
msgid "Moonstruck: New Moon"
msgstr "痴迷月色：新月"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/moonstruck.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Moonstruck: New Moon"
msgid "In the dark of the moon, you feel your vital essence weaken."
msgstr "在黯淡的月光中，你感到你的生命本质变弱了。"

