#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/openpalm.json
#. ~ Description of "callused hands"
msgid ""
"You've dealt so many blows your hands are rough with calluses.  The edge of "
"your hand is sharp enough to cut paper."
msgstr "你徒手干掉了不少家伙，你的手已经长满了老茧。你的手掌边缘锋利得吹毛可断。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/pinchedfingers.json
#. ~ Description of "callused hands"
msgid ""
"You've dealt so many blows your hands are rough with calluses.  The tips of "
"your fingers can pinch firmly enough to pry nails or turn small bolts."
msgstr "你徒手干掉了不少家伙，你的手已经长满了老茧。你的手指尖足够可以掀开钉子或拧动螺栓。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/popeye.json
#. ~ Player spell casting message in effect in EoC "EOC_spinach_consumption"
msgid "You swallow the spinach raw and grow visibly stronger, for a short while."
msgstr "你生吃菠菜，在短时间内明显变得更强壮。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/popeye.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_spinach_consumption"
msgid "You don't have any spinach!"
msgstr "没有菠菜还想当大力水手？"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/popeye.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_strength_of_spinach"
msgid "Strength in Spinach"
msgstr "摄入菠菜之力"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/popeye.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_strength_of_spinach ( Strength in Spinach )"
msgid "You gain the strength of a sailor."
msgstr "你像大力水手那样从菠菜里获得力量。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/popeye.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "spinach_strength"
msgid "Strength of Spinach"
msgstr "菠菜之力"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/popeye.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Strength of Spinach"
msgid "You have the strength of a sailor!"
msgstr "你现在像大力水手一样强壮！"

