#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/radio_infusion.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_radio_infusion_true" in nested EOCs
#. on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_radio_infusion"
msgid "You focus on what you are holding, and suddenly it starts glowing green."
msgstr "你对手持的物品全神贯注，突然它开始发出绿色的光芒。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/rage_against_the_unnatural.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_rage_against_the_unnatural_penalty"
msgid "Red Rage"
msgstr "狂怒"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/rage_against_the_unnatural.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Red Rage"
msgid "You are filled with a furious rage that is sending your swings wide."
msgstr "你被极度的愤怒填满以至于攻击失准。"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/rage_against_the_unnatural.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Red Rage"
msgid ""
"Crimson clouds your vision as a rage fills you at the presence of these "
"hell-spawn.  You must slay them!  It is they who should feel the sting of "
"your blade, not the rabble!"
msgstr "当地狱造物现身时，猩红狂怒遮蔽你的视野 —— 你必须将其屠戮殆尽！让他们品尝刀刃的刺痛，而非无辜者！"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/recycler.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_can_hunting"
msgid "Someone left a perfectly good can of soda on the ground!"
msgstr "有人落下了一罐好饮料！"

#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/recycler.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_can_finder_on"
msgid "You start hunting for cans"
msgstr "你开始搜寻饮料"

