#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "SpOreos"
msgid_plural "SpOreos"
msgstr[0] "孢子奧力奧(SpOreos)"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "SpOreos"
msgid ""
"The hit cookie from Mycus Industries!  Now comes in addicting flavors such as "
"Marloss, Chanterelle, and The Encroaching, Unavoidable Death of Human "
"Civilization."
msgstr "来自马库斯工业的畅销饼干！现在有了让人上瘾的口味，比如马洛斯风味、致幻菇，还有人类文明不可避免的、被逐渐侵蚀的灭亡。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Powerthirst - Manana Flavor"
msgid_plural "Powerthirst - Manana Flavor"
msgstr[0] "渴力宝（马纳纳口味）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "Powerthirst - Manana Flavor"
msgid ""
"POWERTHIRST in new Manana flavor.  Contains preposterous amounts of "
"testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal "
"meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."
msgstr "新款马纳纳风味的渴力宝。含有高得离谱的睾酮。就离谱。就像罐装冰毒。就是罐装冰毒。渴力宝就是冰毒。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavor"
msgid_plural "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavor"
msgstr[0] "渴力宝（菲兹碧池口味）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavor"
msgid ""
"POWERTHIRST in new Fizzbitch flavor.  Contains preposterous amounts of "
"testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal "
"meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."
msgstr "新款菲兹碧池风味的渴力宝。含有高得离谱的睾酮。就离谱。就像罐装冰毒。就是罐装冰毒。渴力宝就是冰毒。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Powerthirst - Gun Flavor"
msgid_plural "Powerthirst - Gun Flavor"
msgstr[0] "渴力宝（枪弹口味）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "Powerthirst - Gun Flavor"
msgid ""
"POWERTHIRST in new Gun flavor.  Contains preposterous amounts of "
"testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal "
"meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."
msgstr "新款枪弹风味的渴力宝。含有高得离谱的睾酮。就离谱。就像罐装冰毒。就是罐装冰毒。渴力宝就是冰毒。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Granade"
msgid_plural "Granades"
msgstr[0] "丰榴彈"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Granade"
msgid ""
"Attached to this grenade is a name tag with the name Kevin written on it.  "
"Does not seem to work like a grenade, handle with care."
msgstr "這個手榴… 不。雖然看起來很像手榴彈， 但… 這上面有個名牌寫著 \"凱文\"。使用時注意一點。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Granade"
msgid "You pull the pin on the Granade."
msgstr "你拉開手榴彈的安全插銷。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active Granade"
msgid_plural "active Granades"
msgstr[0] "啟動中丰榴彈"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "active Granade"
msgid ""
"Attached to this grenade is a name tag with the name Kevin written on it.  "
"Does not seem to work like a grenade, handle with care.  Better throw it!"
msgstr "這個手榴… 不。雖然看起來很像手榴彈， 但… 這上面有個名牌寫著 \"凱文\"。管他的！ 這東西隨時都會爆炸！ 你最好趕快投擲出去！"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "sound_message" action message of item "active Granade"
msgid "Merged!"
msgstr "程序合併!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ionic Overload Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Ionic Overload Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 離子超載生成器"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Ionic Overload Generator CBM"
#. ~ Description of bionic "Ionic Overload Generator"
msgid ""
"A powerful ion energy generator is implanted on your chest.  Fires a "
"powerful, ever-expanding energy blast.  The resulting blast ignites oxygen "
"creating fires as it moves and an explosion on impact.  Close range use is "
"highly discouraged."
msgstr ""
"一套强大的离子能量发生器被植入你的胸腔之中。能够发射出一个道威力巨大的，不断扩散并能穿透多个目标的高能冲击波。所产生的冲击波会点燃氧气，使的其经过的地方产生"
"火焰，并在最终撞击目标时爆炸。近距离使用它是非常不明智的选择。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ionic Overload Generator"
msgid_plural "Ionic Overload Generators"
msgstr[0] "离子过载发生器"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ionic Overload Generator"
#. ~ Description of "Ionic Overload Generator"
msgid ""
"A powerful ion energy generator is implanted on your chest.  Fires a "
"powerful, ever-expanding energy blast that goes through various targets.  The "
"energy shot ignites oxygen creating fires as it moves and an explosion on "
"impact."
msgstr ""
"一套强大的离子能量发生器被植入你的胸腔之中。能够发射出一个道威力巨大的，不断扩散并能穿透多个目标的高能冲击波。所产生的冲击波会点燃氧气，使的其经过的地方产生"
"火焰，并在最终撞击目标时爆炸。近距离使用它是非常不明智的选择。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Yeet Cannon"
msgid_plural "Yeet Cannons"
msgstr[0] "Yeet炮"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Yeet Cannon"
#. ~ Description of "Yeet Cannon"
msgid ""
"You can YEET all the bullets with this baby.  YEET them right into all of the "
"zombies in your path, all the hulks, the spiders, and those damned mole rats."
msgstr "你可以用這東西YEET出所有的子彈，把所有擋路的生物全都YEET到死，什麼僵屍、浩克、蜘蛛，還有那些該死的鼴鼠。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Rising Sun"
msgid ""
"This is a katana with a nozzle just behind the cutting edge of the blade.  "
"People love fire, and people love katana, so why not put them together?  The "
"gas burners attached to this blade can really turn up the heat on your foes.  "
"Use to ignite."
msgstr "这把武士刀刀锋边缘有个汽油喷嘴。大家喜欢火，也喜欢武士刀，所以为什么不把它们结合在一起？汽油燃烧器附加在刀刃上可以烧伤敌人。使用它来点火。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "success_message" action message of item "Rising Sun"
msgid "The Sun rises."
msgstr "炎陽升起。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Rising Sun"
msgid ""
"This is a katana that glows with the fury and heat of the SUN!  Well, okay "
"it's not THAT hot, but getting hit with it still stings like the dickens.  "
"Use to shut off the gas."
msgstr "一把發散著烈日熱度的武士刀！ 好吧， 其實沒有那麼燙， 但是被砍到還是會讓人吱吱叫的。使用它來關閉。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Rising Sun"
msgid "The Sun sets."
msgstr "夕陽西下。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "charges_extinguish_message" action message of item "Rising Sun"
msgid "The Light Fades."
msgstr "陽炎漸暗。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "noise_message" action message of item "Rising Sun"
msgid "The Sun shines brightly."
msgstr "炎陽閃耀。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "water_extinguish_message" action message of item "Rising Sun"
msgid "Your sword hisses in the water and goes out."
msgstr "你的炎陽刀在水裡發出嘶嘶聲後熄滅了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flammenschwert (aus)"
msgid_plural "flammenschwerter (aus)"
msgstr[0] "毀燄劍 (關閉)"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "flammenschwert (aus)"
#. ~ Description of "flammenschwert"
msgid ""
"Ein großes zweihändiges Schwert aus Deutschland, an dessen Klinge sich, unter "
"Zuführung von Benzin, eine anhaltende Flamme erzeugen lässt.  Es ist eine "
"sehr mächtige Waffe."
msgstr ""
"Ein großes zweihändiges Schwert aus Deutschland, an dessen Klinge sich, unter "
"zuführung von Benzin, eine anhaltende Flamme erzeugen lässt. Es ist eine sehr "
"mächtige Waffe.（德语：德制双手大剑，流淌着汽油的厚刃可产生持续的火焰。是一把非常强大的武器。）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "success_message" action message of item "flammenschwert (aus)"
msgid "Die Klinge deines Schwertes brennt!"
msgstr "你咧刀仔著火燒啊!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "red jeans"
msgid_plural "red jeans"
msgstr[0] "紅色牛仔長褲"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "red jeans"
msgid "A pair of tight-fitting candy-apple-red jeans with two deep pockets."
msgstr "一件有兩個深口袋的糖蘋果紅緊身牛仔長褲。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flammenschwert"
msgid_plural "flammenschwerter"
msgstr[0] "焰形劍"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "flammenschwert"
msgid "Die Flamme deines Schwertes erlischt."
msgstr "你咧刀仔火花去啊。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "charges_extinguish_message" action message of item "flammenschwert"
msgid "Deinem Flammenschwert ist der Brennstoff ausgegangen!"
msgstr "你咧刀仔愛嘎汽油啊!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "noise_message" action message of item "flammenschwert"
msgid "Das Feuer um deine Schwertklinge leuchtet hell!"
msgstr "你咧刀仔燒甲閃閃熠!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "water_extinguish_message" action message of item "flammenschwert"
msgid "Dein Schwert zischt und erlischt."
msgstr "哩欸毀燄劍謀會啊 (你的毀燄劍沒火了)。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "burnt out Louisville Slaughterer"
msgid_plural "burnt out Louisville Slaughterers"
msgstr[0] "燒完的炙焰打擊手"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "burnt out Louisville Slaughterer"
msgid ""
"A sturdy wood bat, wrapped in flame-resistant Nomex fabric.  Makes a good "
"melee weapon but better be disassembled to recycle the baseball bat and some "
"Nomex patches."
msgstr "一根纏繞著諾梅克斯阻燃纖維的堅硬木棒。能作為不錯的近戰武器， 也能夠拆解回收成球棒及一些諾梅克斯補丁。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Louisville Slaughterer"
msgid_plural "Louisville Slaughterers"
msgstr[0] "炙焰打擊手"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Louisville Slaughterer"
msgid ""
"This is sturdy wood bat, wrapped in gasoline-soaked rags and flame-resistant "
"Nomex fabric.  Light it, and the ball game will REALLY heat up.  You'll need "
"a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr "一大塊吸飽汽油的布料與諾梅克斯阻燃纖維纏繞在堅固的木頭球棒上。點燃它， 讓球賽變得更加火熱吧！ 喔， 對了， 你當然要有打火機或火柴才能點燃。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Louisville Slaughterer"
msgid "You light the Louisville Slaughterer."
msgstr "你點燃炙焰打擊手。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Louisville Slaughterer"
msgid ""
"This is a sturdy wood bat, wrapped in gasoline-soaked rags and "
"flame-resistant Nomex fabric.  It is burning brightly, and makes it much "
"easier to see the baselines at night games (It also makes the umpire FAR more "
"likely to call a ball instead of a strike)."
msgstr ""
"一大塊吸飽汽油的布料與諾梅克斯阻燃纖維纏繞在堅固的木頭球棒上。它正發出亮光， 讓人在夜晚中的球賽能更清楚的看見跑壘線 (也更容易說服裁判把好球判壞球) "
"-- [手上拿火焰球棒當然怕]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Louisville Slaughterer"
msgid "The Louisville Slaughterer is extinguished."
msgstr "炙焰打擊手熄滅了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blurry picture of a scowling cartoon ape"
msgid_plural "blurry picture of a scowling cartoon apes"
msgstr[0] "皺著眉頭的卡通猿的模糊圖片"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "blurry picture of a scowling cartoon ape"
msgid "Allegedly very important."
msgstr "据说非常重要。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "penultimate key"
msgid_plural "penultimate keys"
msgstr[0] "倒数第二把钥匙"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "penultimate key"
msgid "This opens the Blob Door.  Better hold on to it."
msgstr "这能打开变形怪门。最好拿着。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Excalibread"
msgid_plural "Excalibreads"
msgstr[0] "面包圣剑"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Excalibread"
msgid ""
"A French baguette, sharpened into a blade and toasted for durability.  Truly, "
"the best weapon to smite the gluten-intolerant."
msgstr "一根法棍面包，被磨成剑的形状，经过烘烤后经久耐用。的确，这是用来打击谷物不耐症的最佳武器。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rocket can"
msgid_plural "rocket cans"
msgstr[0] "火箭罐子"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "rocket can"
msgid ""
"A beverage can shaped like a rocket with a peeling label that reads "
"'POWERTHIRST: ROCKET CAN EDITION'.  Its tagline claims that it contains "
"everything you've ever wanted."
msgstr "一罐外形像火箭的罐装饮料，贴着一张可以刮落的标签，上面写着\"渴力宝：火箭罐装版\"。它的广告词声称它包含了你想要的一切。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "0.5L pressurized fuel tank"
msgid_plural "0.5L pressurized fuel tanks"
msgstr[0] "0.5 公升加壓燃料罐"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "0.5L pressurized fuel tank"
msgid ""
"A pressurized 0.5L canister built crafting into a small auxiliary "
"flamethrower."
msgstr "一个加压的 0.5L 燃料罐，用于制作火焰喷射武器。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "party rock"
msgid_plural "party rocks"
msgstr[0] "party rocks"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "party rock"
msgid ""
"Party rock condensed into physical form.  This should be too much for any "
"mere mortal to handle."
msgstr ""
"Party rock condensed into physical form.  This should be too much for any "
"mere mortal to handle."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "AK 90-round magazine"
msgid_plural "AK 90-round magazines"
msgstr[0] "AK 90-round magazines"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "AK 90-round magazine"
#. ~ Description of "AK 90-round magazine"
msgid ""
"A homemade AK magazine made out of welding magazines together.  Looks really "
"stupid, and doesn't work."
msgstr ""
"A homemade AK magazine made out of welding magazines together.  Looks really "
"stupid, and doesn't work."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Diamond Sword"
msgid_plural "Diamond Swords"
msgstr[0] "Diamond Swords"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Diamond Sword"
msgid "A sword made with two diamonds and a stick."
msgstr "A sword made with two diamonds and a stick."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "compromised ceramic plate"
msgid_plural "compromised ceramic plates"
msgstr[0] "compromised ceramic plates"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "compromised ceramic plate"
msgid "A ceramic dinner plate that's been shattered."
msgstr "A ceramic dinner plate that's been shattered."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "50 Cent coin"
msgid_plural "50 Cent coins"
msgstr[0] "50 Cent coins"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "50 Cent coin"
msgid ""
"A fifty-cent coin, featuring a portrait of famed rapper 50 Cent.  On the back "
"is the date of minting, and the G-Unit symbol."
msgstr ""
"A fifty-cent coin, featuring a portrait of famed rapper 50 Cent.  On the back "
"is the date of minting, and the G-Unit symbol."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
msgid "NB flag"
msgid_plural "NB flags"
msgstr[0] ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "NB flag" of item "pride flag"
msgid ""
"A yellow flag with a ship and lion, representing New Brunswick.  You have a "
"feeling this might be the wrong NB flag."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mapgen.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Name of map extra
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Shia LaBeouf"
msgid_plural "Shia LaBeouf"
msgstr[0] "西亞李畢福"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of map extra "Shia LaBeouf"
msgid "Cannibal is nearby."
msgstr "附近有食人族。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of map extra "Jackson"
msgid "It's close to midnight, and something evil's lurking in the dark."
msgstr "临近午夜，黑暗中潜伏着邪恶的东西。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Break into armory to retrieve valued possession"
msgstr "闯入军械库取回珍贵物品"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
msgid "I need you to get my riches from the armory safe."
msgstr "我需要你从军械库的保险箱中取回我的珍贵物品。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
msgid ""
"I left my most valued possession in the armory.  I don't have the code, can "
"you get in?"
msgstr "我把我的宝贝落在了军械库里。我没有密码，你能进去吗？"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
msgid "Got it?  Should've been in my gun safe."
msgstr "找到了吗？它应该在我的枪用保险箱里。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
msgid "Filthy right-clicker."
msgstr "该死的右键玩家。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shocker zombie"
msgid ""
"A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy.  It "
"seems eager to tell you something."
msgstr "一具身体呈现淡蓝色的丧尸，由于生化插件的异常放电，其周围不断有噼啪的电流环绕。看起来似乎急于告诉你点东西。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mr skeltal"
msgid_plural "mr skeltals"
msgstr[0] "吹喇叭的骷髏"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mr skeltal"
msgid ""
"Devoid entirely of flesh and organs, this walking skeleton rattles you to the "
"bone.  In its bony hand, it holds a pristine trumpet, unmarred by the end of "
"the world."
msgstr "这具血肉内脏尽失的行走骨架，令人颤栗入骨。在它骨感的手上，抓着一支崭新的小号，即便是世界终结也毫发无伤。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "minion of skeltal"
msgid_plural "minions of skeltal"
msgstr[0] "喇叭骷髏小兵"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "minion of skeltal"
msgid "A lesser skeleton, raised by the forlorn dooting of a trumpet."
msgstr "一隻較小的骷髏，被小喇叭的哀怨的曲調聲所喚醒。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Smoky bear"
msgid_plural "Smoky bears"
msgstr[0] "煙霧熊"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Smoky bear"
msgid ""
"A smoking husk is all that remains of this once proud bear.  Its black eyes "
"gaze at you with malice… and hunger."
msgstr "曾经是头熊，现在仅存一具冒着烟的躯壳。它那深邃的眼睛盯着你，满怀怨恨和饥渴。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie dancer"
msgid_plural "zombie dancers"
msgstr[0] "舞者殭屍"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dancer"
msgid ""
"The foulest stench is in the air,\n"
"The funk of forty thousand years,\n"
"And grisly ghouls from every tomb,\n"
"Are closing in to seal your doom!\n"
"\n"
"The dancer doesn't even notice you, it seems like something nearby is "
"controlling it."
msgstr ""
"散發著陣陣惡臭，\n"
"四千年的妖魔，\n"
"墳堆裡的屍鬼，\n"
"就將來完結你的性命！ -- 麥可傑克森＜Thriller＞\n"
"\n"
"殭屍舞者根本沒留意到你， 它似乎被鄰近的某個東西操縱著。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Thriller"
msgid_plural "Thrillers"
msgstr[0] "顫慄者"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Thriller"
msgid ""
"And though you fight to stay alive,\n"
"Your body starts to shiver.\n"
"For no mere mortal can resist,\n"
"The evil of the thriller."
msgstr ""
"虽然你为了生存而战，\n"
"你的身体开始颤抖。\n"
"凡人不能抵挡，\n"
"颤栗的邪恶——迈克尔·杰克逊《Thriller》"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Thriller"
msgid "The music stops!"
msgstr "音樂停了!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "Thriller"
msgid "the funky, funky head"
msgstr "时髦的，放克的脑袋"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "Thriller"
msgid "the glittering, beautiful eye"
msgstr "闪亮的、美丽的眼睛"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Shia LaBeouf"
msgid ""
"Living in the woods,\n"
"killing for sport,\n"
"eating all the bodies--\n"
"actual cannibal Shia LaBeouf."
msgstr ""
"住在森林深處，\n"
"殺人當作運動，\n"
"吃掉所有屍體，\n"
"現世的食人族， 西亞李畢福。（譯註：取自 Rob Cantor 創作的歌曲 \"Shia LaBeouf\"）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sewer gator"
msgid_plural "sewer gators"
msgstr[0] "下水道鱷魚"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sewer gator"
msgid ""
"In the late 20th century, there was an urban legend about pet alligators "
"getting flushed down the toilet and growing to adulthood in the sewers.  If "
"this large specimen was ever someone's pet, it doesn't look like it sees "
"humans as anything other than a meal now."
msgstr ""
"一只在充满废料的下水道长大的鳄鱼，在二十世纪末常常有关于宠物短吻鳄被冲下马桶，在下水道中长到成年的都市传说。如果这只巨大的生物曾是某人的宠物，那么现在它看起"
"来把人类除了当作食物之外什么也没有了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "party rocker"
msgid_plural "party rockers"
msgstr[0] "party rockers"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
msgid ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a pipe of the non-smoking kind."
msgstr ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a pipe of the non-smoking kind."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "party rocker"
msgid "The party rocker party rocks!"
msgstr "The party rocker party rocks!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
msgid ""
"A party rocker who's not dancing with as much energy, and they seem to be "
"stopping often to cough and catch their breath."
msgstr ""
"A party rocker who's not dancing with as much energy, and they seem to be "
"stopping often to cough and catch their breath."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
msgid ""
"A party rocker who's grown painful mushroom stalks out of their body, "
"writhing in pain as their last neurons still instruct them to dance."
msgstr ""
"A party rocker who's grown painful mushroom stalks out of their body, "
"writhing in pain as their last neurons still instruct them to dance."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
msgid ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a drink in hand."
msgstr ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a drink in hand."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "immortal snail"
msgid_plural "immortal snails"
msgstr[0] "immortal snails"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "immortal snail"
msgid ""
"A small nondescript immortal snail that is slowly but relentlessly making its "
"way toward you.  You get a strong feeling you should not touch the snail."
msgstr ""
"A small nondescript immortal snail that is slowly but relentlessly making its "
"way toward you.  You get a strong feeling you should not touch the snail."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%s touches you, killing you instantly."
msgstr "%s touches you, killing you instantly."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%s tries to touch you, but misses."
msgstr "%s tries to touch you, but misses."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%s touches you, yet somehow you live!"
msgstr "%s touches you, yet somehow you live!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_you_touch_the_immortal_snail"
msgid "You touch the snail and die instantly."
msgstr "You touch the snail and die instantly."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lucky"
msgid "You're naturally quite lucky!"
msgstr "You're naturally quite lucky!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unlucky"
msgstr "Unlucky"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unlucky"
msgid "You're naturally quite unlucky."
msgstr "You're naturally quite unlucky."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "When the testing is over, you will be missed."
msgstr "当测试结束时，你将会被错过。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Unbelievable.  You, [subject name here], must be the pride of [subject "
"hometown here]!"
msgstr "不可思议呀！[subject name here]，[subject hometown here]必将以你为傲！"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"That thing is probably some sort of raw sewage container.  Go ahead and rub "
"your face all over it."
msgstr "这可能是某种未经处理的污水容器。快去好好洗把脸吧。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr "为了你和他人的安全，请不要触碰 [滋滋滋——]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"No one will blame you for giving up.  In fact, quitting at this point is a "
"perfectly reasonable response."
msgstr "你即便放弃也没人会因此责备你的，事实上，离职恰好是一个非常合理的反应。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of extreme "
"pessimism."
msgstr "太棒了！在如此悲哀的气氛中，你仍然有着果敢与机智。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Hello again.  To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr "再次向你致敬。并重申我们之前的警告：[garbled]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"
msgstr "噫噫噫噫噫噫噫噫噫——[bzzt]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr "如果你渴昏了头，随时可以放弃。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"No further compliance information is required or will be provided, and you "
"are an excellent test subject!"
msgstr "不需要，也不会提供近一步符合讯息，你是个极好的测试对象！"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Thank you for helping us help you help us all."
msgstr "感谢你对我们的协助……助人即助己。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr "测试结束后将提供蛋糕与心理创伤辅导。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "The experiment is nearing its conclusion."
msgstr "这个实验已经进行到最后关头，快要的出结论了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"The Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked "
"[garbled] cake."
msgstr "富集中心需要提醒你，你即将被做成烤[乱码]蛋糕"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "We are very, very happy for your success."
msgstr "对你的成功，我们感到非常，非常高兴。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "我们要举行一个派对，来纪念你伟大的胜利。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "A party associate will arrive shortly to collect you for your party."
msgstr "党的成员将尽快抵达，为党征召你。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "我知道你在那。我能感觉的到。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "You're not going the right way."
msgstr "你走错方向了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "You shouldn't be here.  This isn't safe for you."
msgstr "你不该待在这儿，这对你很不安全。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Maybe you think you're helping yourself.  But you're not.  This isn't helping "
"anyone."
msgstr "也许你认为这样有利于己，然并卵。这对任何人都无助益。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "现在回头还来得及。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Someone is going to get badly hurt."
msgstr "有人正受到严重伤害。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Uh oh.  Somebody cut the cake.  I told them to wait for you, but they did it "
"anyway."
msgstr "啊哦。有人分了杯羹，我让他们等等你，但是他们还是那样做了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "This is your fault.  It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr "这全都是你的错，这本不该如此的。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "You're not a good person.  You know that, right?"
msgstr "你不是一個好人。你知道的, 對吧?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "好人才不會在這裡完蛋。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "You should have turned left before."
msgstr "你应该先左转。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far "
"is my heart."
msgstr "那怕你竭尽暴虐，能伤害的也只有我的心罢了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "What was that?  Did you say something?"
msgstr "那是什么？你刚刚说话了吗？"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
msgstr "我只想指出，所有通向成功的机会已经给你了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "What's your point, anyway?  Survival?"
msgstr "你有任何方面的建议吗？生存？"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"You've been wrong about every single thing you've ever done, including this "
"thing."
msgstr "你所做的每一件事都是错误的，包括这件事。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's going "
"on outside."
msgstr "我拥有无限的知识，而哪怕是我也不确定外面发生了什么。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr "停止小动作，像个成熟的人一样赴死。否则我删除你的备份。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr "顺带一提，干得好。讽 刺 自 检 完 成。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr "你的行当我不想插嘴，但要我的话，就会把那事儿留给自己。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr "坦白说，我们谁都不知道那件事是怎么做的。把它放一边吧，我以后会处理的。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr "我知道你不会相信的，但目前为止发生的一切事情都是为了你好。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think… yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr "我在检查一些蓝图，我想……嗯，是的，就在这。你肯定走错路了。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "你有没有在听我讲话？"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "KEVIN SACRIFICING GAMEPLAY FOR REALISM?  THE SHOCKING TRUTH REVEALED"
msgstr "Kevin为了追求真实而牺牲游戏性？真相令人震惊"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "TEN FACTS ABOUT THE NEW BIONIC SYSTEM THAT WILL SHOCK YOU"
msgstr "新版生化插件系统令人震驚的十大真相"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHO JUST ADDED A NEW PROFESSION"
msgstr "你絕對猜不到是誰剛剛加入了新職業。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid ""
"TRIVIALIZE THE EARLY GAME WITH THIS ONE SIMPLE SPEAR WEAPON!  CONTRIBUTORS "
"HATE HIM"
msgstr "此人用一个简单长矛武器让游戏前期挑战全无！作者都恨之入骨"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "A MEDICAL MUTANT SET THEMSELVES ON FIRE - YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHAT HAPPENED NEXT"
msgstr "一个医疗变种人给自己点了一把火，接下来所发生的一切让人震惊"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "THE TRUTH ABOUT CATACLYSM'S DEVELOPMENT - AND ITS DISGUSTING SECRET"
msgstr "CDDA游戏开发的真相，以及它背后令人作呕的秘密"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#, no-c-format
msgid "IT'S TRUE - MUTAGEN IS 40% BLEACH, AND HERE'S WHY"
msgstr "真相：诱变剂内含高达40%漂白剂，原因竟是"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "20 EASY WAYS TO ESCAPE A LAB - #4 WILL BLOW YOUR MIND"
msgstr "20种逃出实验室的简易方式，第4项会让你大吃一惊"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "\"我感觉我们已经不在堪萨斯州了。\"（注：《绿野仙踪》，1939）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "\"来吧，让我开开眼界。\"（注：《拨云见日》，1983）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "\"你在和我说话？\"（注：《出租车司机》，1976）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "\"那你他妈的在和谁说话？\"（注：《出租车司机》，1976）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "\"嗨，这里只有我一个人。\"（注：《出租车司机》，1976）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "\"你他妈觉得自己在和谁说话？\"（注：《出租车司机》，1976）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "\"我们这儿看到的就是沟通失败的结果。\"（注：《铁窗喋血》，1967）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"E.T.  phone home.\""
msgstr "\"E.T.打电话回家。\"（注：《E.T. 外星人》，1982）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "\"我就快要被逼疯了，而且我也不愿意再忍受了！\"（注：《电视台风云》，1976）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "\"没有比家更好的地方。\"（注：《绿野仙踪》，1939）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "\"徽章? 我們沒有徽章! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr "\"我們不需要任何徽章! 我不必向你出示任何臭徽章! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "\"我会回来的。\"（注：《终结者》，1984）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "\"我看到死人。\"（注：《第六感》，1999）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"It's alive!  It's alive!\""
msgstr "\"它活过来了！它活过来了！\"（注：《弗兰肯斯坦》，1931）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "\"跟我的小伙伴打个招呼吧！\"（注：《疤面煞星》，1983）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "\"强尼在这！\"（注：《闪灵》，1980）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "\"把舱门打开，哈尔。\"（注：《2001太空漫游》，1968）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr "\"他们也许能夺走我们的生命，但是，他们永远夺不走我们的自由！\"（注：《勇敢的心》，1995）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr "\"如果你现在放我的女儿走，那么这件事就此结束，我不会去找你，我也不会来追杀你。\"（注：《飓风营救》，2008）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr "\"如果你不干，那么我会去找你，我会找到你，然后杀了你。\"（注：《飓风营救》，2008）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "\"路？我们要去的地方，不需要路。\"（注：《回到未来》，1985）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts.  It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr "\"系好你的安全带。这将是一个颠簸的夜晚。\"（注：《彗星美人》，1950）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr "\"你应该问自己一个问题：'我感到幸运吗？'你觉得呢，痞子？\"（注：《肮脏的哈里》，1971）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "\"你一句你好就已经征服我了。\"（注：《甜心先生》，1996）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "\"休斯敦，我们有麻烦了。\"（注：《阿波罗13号》，1995）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "\"走你，王八蛋！\"（注：《虎胆龙威》，1988）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr "\"实验室的第一条守则是：别提实验室。\"（注：《搏击俱乐部》，1999）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "\"别害怕，它不过就是只个大、大点的哈巴狗。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "\"把所有人帶來。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "\"你說每個人？\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "\"每個人！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr "“我打算向他提出他無法拒絕的提議。”"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "“這是美好友誼的開端。”"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"You can't handle the truth!\""
msgstr "\"You can't handle the truth!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "\"你盖好了，他就会来。\"（注：《梦幻之地》，1989）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr "\"再见，宝贝。\"（注：《终结者2》，1991）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"They're here!\""
msgstr "他们在这！"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Tis but a scratch!\""
msgstr "\"这不过是点小划伤而已！\"（注：《巨蟒与圣杯》，1975）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn.\""
msgstr "\"老实说，亲爱的，我一点也不在乎。\"（注：《乱世佳人》，1939）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.\""
msgstr "\"只工作不玩耍，聪明孩子也变傻。\"（注：《闪灵》，1980）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Remember: all I'm offering is the truth.  Nothing more.\""
msgstr "\"记住，我要告诉你的只有一样东西，真相。\"（注：《黑客帝国》，1999）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Don't call me Shirley.\""
msgstr "\"不要叫我雪莉。\"（注：《空前绝后满天飞》，1980）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I have had it with these motherfucking snakes!\""
msgstr "\"我受够了这些该死的蛇！\"（注：《航班蛇患》，2006）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr "\"后退，放下枪，再给我点热带水果口味的波波丝口香糖。\"（注：《绝地战警》，1995）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"And some skittles.\""
msgstr "\"还有一些彩虹糖。\"（注：《绝地战警》，1995）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"You'll shoot your eye out, kid.\""
msgstr "\"你会把自己的眼珠射出来的，孩子。\"（注：《圣诞故事》，1983）"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Cocainum!\""
msgstr "\"可卡因！\"（注：《红色警探》，1988）"

