#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Not getting better with age!\""
msgstr "\"随着岁数增加并没有好转！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"This is just getting embarrassing.\""
msgstr "\"这只会让人尴尬。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Alright, you can go.\""
msgstr "\"好吧，你可以走了。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"[sigh] Don't tell anyone about this.\""
msgstr "\"叹气，千万别告诉别人。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Well, I tried.  Best of luck!\""
msgstr "\"嗨，至少我试过。祝你好运！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Hey, safe travels, there.\""
msgstr "\"嘿，祝你一路平安。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Hey, thanks so much!\""
msgstr "\"嘿，太感谢了！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Don't be a stranger!\""
msgstr "\"别见外！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"It's been a pleasure!\""
msgstr "\"很高兴遇见你！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"That was fun, wasn't it?\""
msgstr "\"那很有趣，不是吗？\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"\"I can't see a thing.  What just happened?  Better open fire!  [click click "
"click click]  Dang!\""
msgstr "\"我啥都没看到。发生什么事了？最好快开火！咔咔咔咔当！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"*clicking noises*\""
msgstr "\"*咔嗒声*\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"No, wait, wait!\""
msgstr "\"不，等等，等等！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Hey, hold on now WHOA WHOA WHOA!\""
msgstr "\"嘿，等一下下喔喔喔喔\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Oh, this is ridiculous!\""
msgstr "\"噢，这太可笑了！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Give me another channnnce!\""
msgstr "\"再给我次机——会！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Hey!  Squeaky-voice!  Gimme some of your bullets!\""
msgstr "\"嘿！那个尖嗓门的家伙！给我点你的弹药！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Can I get some bullets here?  Anybody got bullets?\""
msgstr "\"能给我点子弹吗？谁有子弹？\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Uhhh, no bullets.  Sorry.\""
msgstr "\"呃，没弹药了。抱歉。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Shootin' blanks every time, ALL the time.\""
msgstr "\"每次都打空，每一次。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Standing down.\""
msgstr "\"警报解除。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Watch and learn, everybody.  Watch and learn.\""
msgstr "\"诸君啊，好好看，好好学。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"So what am I, uh, supposed to do here?\""
msgstr "\"那我，呃，该做些什么呢？\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Identify yourself or I will shoot.\""
msgstr "\"報上名來，否則我要開槍了。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Pleased to meetcha.\""
msgstr "\"很開心遇見你。\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I'm gonna make you proud!\""
msgstr "\"我會讓你以我為榮！\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "remove_controlled_jackson"
msgid "Uncontrol Dancers"
msgstr "失控舞者"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "remove_controlled_jackson ( Uncontrol Dancers )"
msgid "Removes control effect from polymorphed dancers."
msgstr "移除被施加变形术的舞者的控制效果。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "death_jackson"
msgid "Jackson Death"
msgstr "杰克逊丧尸死亡"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "death_jackson ( Jackson Death )"
msgid "Hee Hee!  WOO!"
msgstr "嘻嘻！惊喜！"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Crazy Cataclysm"
msgstr "瘋狂大災變"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Crazy Cataclysm"
msgid "Want a little crazy in your Cataclysm?  Try this one."
msgstr "想在大災變中加入一點瘋狂? 試試這個。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/mod_interactions/mindovermatter/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "woo woo"
msgstr "歪比巴卜"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/mod_interactions/mindovermatter/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "woo woo"
msgid ""
"Crystals, meditation, astral projection, remote viewing, channeling, ESP; "
"it's all real, man.  It all works if you believe."
msgstr ""
"Crystals, meditation, astral projection, remote viewing, channeling, ESP; "
"it's all real, man.  It all works if you believe."

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/game_win.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Through all your struggles, you have won the day against the unknown.  Do "
"you wish to struggle more, or rest in your triumph."
msgstr "&你通过所有的斗争，战胜了未知。你是想继续斗争，还是安于胜利。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/game_win.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I wish to rest in my triumph, and let the struggle end."
msgstr "我希望安于我的胜利，就让斗争终止。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/game_win.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I will continue on and face oblivion, even if it costs me my life and limb."
msgstr "我会继续面对湮灭，即使搭上我的生命和身体。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "service contract"
msgid_plural "service contracts"
msgstr[0] "服务合同"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/items.json
#. ~ Description of "service contract"
msgid ""
"A slip of paper signed by the issuer and the recipient, detailing the terms "
"of service of a hiring contract."
msgstr "由签发人和接收人签署的一张纸条，详细说明雇佣合同的服务条款。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Survive"
msgstr "活下去"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Survive"
msgid ""
"You don't know how you got here, or why.  All you know is that you need to "
"live."
msgstr "你不知道你怎么到这里的，也不知道为什么。你只知道你要活下去。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Defense Mode"
msgstr "防御模式"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Defense Mode"
msgid ""
"This transforms the game into a horde-based wave defense mode.  Pick a "
"starting location, create your character, and defend your bastion against the "
"relentless waves of zombies, insects, aliens, you name it!  Complex "
"customizations allow the game to be tinkered with to your hearts content, and "
"extensive mod compatibility allows for your favorite additions to work "
"perfectly in the new game.  It's kill or be killed!"
msgstr ""
"这个模组将游戏变成基于波次的丧尸抵御模式。选择出生点和你的角色，在你的堡垒中抵御一波又一波的丧尸、昆虫、外星生物吧！多样的自定义选项让你随心所欲地调整偏好的"
"内容，对其他mod良好的兼容性允许你添加中意的额外内容。来吧，看看谁在防御模式里能笑到最后！"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/monster_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gargantuan_raptor_spawn"
msgid "Summon Raptor Horde"
msgstr "召唤出一群血鸷。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/monster_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gargantuan_raptor_spawn ( Summon Raptor Horde )"
msgid "Summons a horde of zombiespawn raptors."
msgstr "召唤出一群丧尸血鸷。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadow of reality"
msgid_plural "shadow of reality"
msgstr[0] "真实的阴影"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadow of reality"
msgid ""
"Something is there!  Against all reason, this shadow lurks at the corners of "
"your vision.  You close your eyes, but still, it is there.  No matter how far "
"you run, it is there.  Behind heavy fortifications, it is there.  The maw of "
"the void, the all consumer, the most powerful.  Now you will know why you "
"fear the night, the day, and the unknown."
msgstr ""
"有东西在那里！无论如何，这个阴影潜伏在你视野的角落里。你闭上眼睛，但它仍然在那里。无论你跑多远，它都在那里。在坚固的防御工事后面，它就在那里。空虚的胃袋，一"
"切猎食者，最强大之物。现在你会知道为什么你害怕夜晚、白天和未知。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "shadow of reality"
msgid "Grasping at the air, the shadow melts away and vanishes!"
msgstr "Grasping at the air, the shadow melts away and vanishes!"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shadow of reality"
msgid "The shadow opens its mouth, and gore-smeared winged beasts fly out of it!"
msgstr "阴影张开一个大口子，一只覆满血肉的带翼野兽从中飞了出来！"

