#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Money Makin' Mercenary"
msgstr "赚钱的雇佣兵"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Money Makin' Mercenary"
msgid ""
"You've always had a knack for finding the value in life, whether it's $200 or "
"$50 for a life.  You get more money from completing hordes."
msgstr ""
"You've always had a knack for finding the value in life, whether it's $200 or "
"$50 for a life.  You get more money from completing hordes."

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Slice n' Dice"
msgstr "刀剑切切"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Slice n' Dice"
msgid ""
"You've become very skilled with cutting weapons of all sorts, and know how to "
"use them better."
msgstr "你能熟练使用各种斩击类武器，并且还能更进一步地使用它们。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Bash n' Mash"
msgstr "大棒梆梆"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Bash n' Mash"
msgid ""
"You've become very skilled with blunt instruments of all sorts, and know how "
"to use them better."
msgstr "你熟练掌握各种钝器，并且还能更进一步使用它们。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Knifey"
msgstr "刀客"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Knifey"
msgid "You're very in tune with the ways of stabbing somebody."
msgstr "你深谙捅人之道。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Melee Master"
msgstr "近战大师"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Melee Master"
msgid "You've become a master of melee, and are skilled with melee weapons."
msgstr "你已经成为了一个近战大师，并对近战武器的使用非常熟练。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gym Rat King"
msgstr "健身领域大神"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gym Rat King"
msgid ""
"Your time exercising has gotten you used to being winded, and has vastly "
"expanded your stamina.  You can go for longer and harder now."
msgstr "你锻炼得十分充分，习惯了气喘吁吁，你的耐力也得到了极大的提升。你现在可以跑更久更累的步了。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Living on a Prayer"
msgstr "幸运加持"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Living on a Prayer"
msgid ""
"You're like a cat, and it always seemed to you like you've had nine lives.  "
"When things get rough, by pure luck or divine intervention, you can get out "
"of it."
msgstr "你像只猫，看起来总像不止一条命的样子。遇到困难的时候，不知是因为纯属命大还是上天的眷顾，你总能化险为夷。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/mysterious_stranger.json
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Mysterious Stranger"
msgstr "神秘的陌生人"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mysterious Stranger"
msgid ""
"Someone must be watching over you!  Whenever you're in combat, you can call "
"for the help of a stranger for a short amount of time."
msgstr "肯定有谁在关注着你！处于战斗中时，你可以向陌生人求助，但仅限一小段时间。"

#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/mysterious_stranger.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "mysterious_stranger_activate"
msgid "Nobody hears you…"
msgstr "没人听见你的呼喊……"

