#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Yes.  I ask because I noticed there are dinosaurs around.  Do you know "
"anything about that?"
msgstr "是的。我這麼問是因為我注意到周遭有很多恐龍。你知道關於他們的事情嗎？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I know all kinds of weird useless stuff.  I've seen things at churches, I've "
"seen things on farms, I've seen whole exhibits way out, a whole zoo even.  "
"And there's someone pretending to be me, but it's not me, because I would "
"know.  Or you would know.  One of us would be us.  Those Swampers, they know "
"what's happening.  They're creatures of light come back to save us all.  Or "
"eat us, I forget.  Oh and that Old Guard Repo Man hates them and Red at the "
"train station."
msgstr ""
"我知道各种奇怪又无用的知识。我在教堂看到过东西，在农场看到过东西，我看过整场展览，甚至有一整个动物园。有个假装是我，但其实并不是我，因为我知道。或者你会知道"
"的。我们就是我们。那些沼泽人，他们知道发生了什么。他们是光之生物，回来拯救我们所有人。也许是吃掉我们，我记不清了。哦，还有那个住在火车站旧日守护者瑞德讨厌它"
"们。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes.  How do I find the someone pretending to be you?"
msgstr "对。我怎么才能找到那个伪装成你的人？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I think I have to get going…"
msgstr "我想我得走了..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Wait, what if I'm the probe?  What if you're the probe?  Let me mark that on "
"your map nice and big."
msgstr "等等，如果我是探员呢？如果你是探员呢？让我把它标在你的地图上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks for the information.  I'd better go."
msgstr "谢谢你的信息了。我最好走了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I was the probe the whole time."
msgstr "我一直都是探员。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgstr "找到伪装成迪诺·戴夫的人"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "It must be an alien probe…"
msgstr "一定是个外星人探子……"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid ""
"I think the shack was that way.  Might have cleared out but who knows.  Watch "
"out for space lasers."
msgstr "我想应该是在小屋那边。可能已经逃走了，但谁知道呢。小心太空激光。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "You'll see, it's just like I say."
msgstr "你会看到，就像我说的一样。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid ""
"There aren't a lot of things to have faith for in the world today, but if I "
"were you I would bring some cardboard."
msgstr "在如今的世界上，没有太多值得信任的东西，但如果我是你，我会带个硬纸板箱。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "Did you see the probe?"
msgstr "你找到那个探员了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "I knew it.  Good."
msgstr "我就知道。太好了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "Could have been another shack.  I don't know, lots going on."
msgstr "可能是另一间小屋。我也不知道，发生了很多事。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What can you tell me about the dinosaurs?"
msgstr "能告訴我有關恐龍的事嗎？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I am afraid that is drifting far out of my area of expertise, but I would be "
"willing to bet some of the little ones might be worth something to you if you "
"tamed them and raised them.  No fur to speak of, but feathers might be of "
"some use, and meat and eggs could help.  I'm not sure what they eat, but I "
"hope it isn't rabbits or people on the more rabbit adjacent end of things."
msgstr ""
"我担心这已经远远超出了我的专业范围，但我敢打赌，如果你驯服并抚养它们的话，这些小家伙中的应该有一部分会对你有些价值。虽然没有毛皮，但羽毛可能有一些用处，肉和"
"蛋可能会有所帮助。我不知道他们吃什么，但我希望不是兔子或是人，当然更偏向于兔子大小的东西。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe dinosaurs and rabbits aren't so different."
msgstr "也许恐龙和兔子没什么不同。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Swamper"
msgstr "沼泽教教众"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Job description of "Swamper" NPC class
msgid "The great eaters have returned and they must be fed."
msgstr "大食客们回来了，他们必须进食。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ A charismatic religious leader and CEO.
msgid "Bo Baronyx"
msgstr "Bo Baronyx"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ A charismatic religious leader and CEO.
msgid "CEO"
msgstr "總裁"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The eaters will be fed."
msgstr "大食客们必将进食。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome.  Are you hungry friend?"
msgstr "歡迎。你餓了嗎朋友？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You look hungry friend.  So much hunger in this world.  This is the time of "
"the eaters."
msgstr "你看起來很餓，朋友。世上如此多的飢餓。這是食者的時代。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hello.  Who are the eaters?"
msgstr "嗨。你說誰是食者？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So about the eaters…"
msgstr "所以關於食者..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You mentioned some pretenders before.  What does that mean?"
msgstr "你之前提到一些冒牌貨，這是指啥？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Is there a way I can help feed the eaters?"
msgstr "有什麼我能幫助偉大食者的嗎？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I have to get going.  Take care, CEO Baronyx."
msgstr "我該走了。保重。CEO Baronyx 。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The great eaters have returned, along with the false ones.  We must feed the "
"eaters and destroy the pretenders, child."
msgstr "大食客和假食客都回来了。我们必须喂饱大食客，消灭伪神，孩子。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Who are you talking about?"
msgstr "你到底在說誰？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No thank you, I'd like to leave now."
msgstr "不謝了，我該走了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This Cataclysm has woken the great eaters, lost in time, returned them to the "
"world to do their great work, to multiply and fill the land with their song.  "
"The time of man is over, but we few who remain can do our part to protect "
"this new world from the pretenders, who would steal the meat."
msgstr ""
"大災變喚醒了那些偉大的食者，他們迷失在時間裡，現在回到這世界來做他們偉大的工作。用他們的歌繁衍和充滿這塊土地。人類的時代已經過去，我們只有少數的倖存者來保護"
"自己對抗會來偷我們肉食的冒牌貨。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So what do you do with the meat?"
msgstr "所以你是怎麼處理這些肉？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Who are the great eaters and the pretenders?"
msgstr "偉大食者和冒牌貨？是在指誰？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are there any others left?"
msgstr "還有其他人嗎？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The great eaters are the ones that were lost, what we call dinosaurs, whose "
"meat we took and who are taking it back.  The pretenders are those others "
"that have come to steal the meat of this world.  It does not belong to them "
"and we will take it from their mouths."
msgstr ""
"大食客是那些已经消失的，我们称为恐龙的动物，它们的肉被我们拿走了，而它们正在把它取回。伪神是那些来偷这个世界的肉的外人。它不属于他们，而我们会从他们嘴里夺回"
"它。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Okay, so you worship dinosaurs.  Understood."
msgstr "好的，所以你崇拜恐龍，我懂了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The Swampers knew these times would return and we prepared for them.  When "
"others wasted their time and meat, we fed and grew strong, and we filled our "
"stores with meat for this day."
msgstr "沼澤人知道這些時代會回來，我們為此做好了準備。 當其他人浪費時間和肉時，我們進食並成長壯大，這一天我們在倉庫裡裝滿了肉。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes, very good."
msgstr "是的，非常好。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You keep talking about meat.  Why is meat so important?"
msgstr "你不斷的提到肉。為什麼這肉這麼重要？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The meat makes the great eaters strong.  We gather the meat and feed them, "
"and in the end we too will serve the eaters in death as we do in life.  This "
"was always our purpose and we lucky few have lived to see it."
msgstr "這些肉使偉大的食者更加強壯。我們採集這些肉並餵食給他們，在最後我們自身以死亡為食者服務。這是我們的目的，而且只有我們幾個少數的幸運兒能活道看到最後。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Our purpose?  How do you know?"
msgstr "我們的目的？你怎麼知道的？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The return of the great eaters was foretold by a prophet.  We faithful have "
"been waiting and preparing since the revelation."
msgstr "一位预言家预言了大食客们的回归。我们这些忠心的人，自从这神启开始，就一直在等候和准备。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I guess it must be nice to be proven right."
msgstr "我猜你們應該很高興證明他是真的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "This is crazy."
msgstr "真是太瘋狂了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You understand our purpose.  I welcome you to this work, all are needed to "
"feed the eaters."
msgstr "你現在理解我們的目的了。我也歡迎你一起來加入，我們需要做的只是餵食那些食者。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You deny what you see right in front of you.  This world is what was foretold."
msgstr "你否认眼前的一切。这个世界早就被神告知过了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yeah, alright."
msgstr "是的，好。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do it."
msgstr "幫 Bo Baronyx 收集點肉。8塊應該夠了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "The eaters are hungry.  They need meat."
msgstr "大食客们饿了，他们需要肉。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid ""
"If you wish to feed the eaters, your work will be rewarded.  Go out, butcher "
"a pure animal.  Not a false eater, the meat must be good to eat.  Then bring "
"me the meat and I will see to the eaters."
msgstr "如果你想给大食客们喂食，你的工作就会得到回报。去外面，屠宰一只纯种动物。不是假食者，肉必须是可以吃的。然后把肉给我，我去拿给大食客们。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "Excellent.  The eaters must feed."
msgstr "太棒了。大食客们必将进食。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "Understood.  The great eaters will feed either way."
msgstr "明白了。大食客们总会找到方法进食的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid ""
"Some of the animals have become touched by the pretenders in recent days, "
"larger and more dangerous, producing tainted mutant meat.  This will not work "
"for the great eaters, it must be the true meat."
msgstr "最近一阵子一些生物被伪神触碰过，变得又大又危险，产生了被污染的变异肉。这些肉不能给大食客，它必须是真正的肉。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "Have you brought meat?"
msgstr "你带肉来了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "The eaters will feed.  Oh, this one seems to like you."
msgstr "食者會獲得滿足。喔，這隻看上去喜歡你。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "The eaters will feed I am sure."
msgstr "大食客们必将进食，我确信。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid ""
"I see no meat.  There is meat in the forests and swamps waiting for the "
"eaters."
msgstr "我没看到肉。森林和沼泽里都有肉在等着大食客们。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_eoraptor' in an effect
msgid "Bamm-Bamm"
msgstr "班班"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The eaters have fed.  They will be hungry again in time."
msgstr "大食客们已经吃饱了。他们很快又会饿的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You know what to do."
msgstr "你知道該怎麼做。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The great eaters must be fed.  Are you ready?"
msgstr "偉大食者必須吃飽。你準備好了嗎？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "There is still more work to do.  Are you ready?"
msgstr "還有更多的工作要做。你準備好了嗎？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "There is meat ready for the feeding.  Are you ready to gather it?"
msgstr "可以喂肉了。你准备好了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The eaters are hungry."
msgstr "食者餓了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "There is more meat needed."
msgstr "不需要更多肉了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I know of eaters ready for meat."
msgstr "我知道食者準備好吃肉了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe another time CEO Baronyx."
msgstr "下次聊，CEO Baronyx。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If you are ready to be of service to the great eaters, go and find meat and "
"bring it back.  There is always need for more."
msgstr "如果你准备好为大食客效劳，就去找些肉带回来。这里总是需要更多肉。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Happy to be of service to the great eaters.  I'm in."
msgstr "很高兴能为大食客效劳。算我一个。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Excellent.  Make it happen."
msgstr "完美。讓這一切實現吧。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The great eaters are not picky, any pure meat will do, but mutant and tainted "
"meat are not good enough."
msgstr "大食客們並不挑食，任何純淨的肉都可以，但變異和汙染的肉是不行的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, meat from a creature that isn't a zombie, or a giant monster.  Got it."
msgstr "所以，任何不是殭屍或大怪物身上的肉都行。瞭解。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Of course, you should find everything you need here."
msgstr "當然，你應該能找到你所需要的一切。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That explains the knives then."
msgstr "这就解释了为什么这里会有刀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Oh, you know my friend Brigitte.  Well in that case, let's go!"
msgstr "哦，你认识我的朋友布丽吉特。好吧，那样的话，我们走吧！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "No, I must remain here to oversee the company."
msgstr "不，我必须留在这里管理公司。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Of course CEO Baronyx."
msgstr "當然，CEO Baronyx。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sweet!"
msgstr "讚啦！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Not just now.  You should remain here to oversee the company."
msgstr "现在还不行，你必须留在这里管理公司。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Of course, the company will be ready when you are and the great eaters will "
"feed either way."
msgstr "当然，当你准备好的时候，公司也会随时准备好的，而且大食客们总会找到方法进食的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It was foretold that as the great eaters returned, so too would the "
"pretenders, who would come to steal the meat.  Very little is asked of us, "
"except that we do all we can to ensure that the true great eaters received as "
"much meat as possible and the pretenders go hungry."
msgstr "据说，当大食客回来时，那些来偷肉的伪神也会回来。神示里对我们的要求不多，除了我们需要确保真正的大食客得到尽可能多的肉，并让假食客们去挨饿。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes CEO Baronyx, very good CEO Baronyx."
msgstr "是的 CEO Baronyx，非常好 CEO Baronyx。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "This makes no sense and I'm done talking about it."
msgstr "这都是胡说八道，我不想再谈这件事了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC faction name
msgid "Swampers Religious Community and Hotels and Casinos"
msgstr "沼泽教及下属酒店和赌场"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Description of NPC faction "Swampers Religious Community and Hotels and
#. Casinos"
msgid ""
"A prosperous but secretive group of churchgoers and entertainment moguls with "
"an affection for dinosaurs.  They welcome all untainted humans."
msgstr "一群富有但神秘的教会信徒和娱乐大亨，他们对恐龙有着某种浓厚的爱慕之情。他们欢迎所有未受污染的人类。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Red"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It's a good day to shoot some dinos."
msgstr "今天是个狩猎恐龙的好日子。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You're back.  I knew you were a killer.  Are you ready to take this country "
"back?"
msgstr "你回来了。我就知道你是个杀手。你准备好夺回这个国家了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You there, wanderer.  You have the look of someone who hates dinosaurs.  Are "
"you ready to take this country back?"
msgstr "你好，流浪者。你看起来像个讨厌恐龙的人。你准备好夺回这个国家了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Dinosaurs?  What are you talking about?"
msgstr "恐龙？你说什么呢？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How can I help?"
msgstr "我能帮什么忙吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Mission update for you, Red."
msgstr "任务更新，瑞德。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Anyway.  Take care, Red."
msgstr "总之保重，瑞德。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They just started showing up about the same time it all fell apart.  They "
"attack the caravans and the bandits both.  Hungry bastards.  All dinosaurs "
"are shoot on sight.  We don't eat them, they're probably poisoned with "
"whatever got the dead ones.  Just leave them for the crows.  Same with the "
"eggs."
msgstr ""
"它们几乎和这场大灾变同时出现，一切都分崩离析了。它们攻击商队和土匪。饥肠辘辘的混蛋。所有恐龙格杀勿论。我们不吃它们，它们很可能带着那些不死人身上的毒素。把尸"
"体留给乌鸦吧。它们的蛋也一样。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Kill all dinosaurs, interesting…"
msgstr "杀掉所有恐龙，有趣……"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Probably not important."
msgstr "可能这件事并不重要。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Secure Area"
msgstr "扫荡区域"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Secure Area"
msgid ""
"We lost another trade caravan.  Whatever did the damage is still out there.  "
"Investigate the trade route and eliminate the threat."
msgstr "我们又损失了一队商队。不管是谁，破坏商队的祸首依然在外逍遥。调查商队路线并解决掉这一威胁。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Secure Area"
msgid ""
"It sounds like you get it.  There is something out there scaring the "
"merchants.  They got away safe but lost a grain shipment, you're welcome to "
"it if you can haul it back.  Check out the area and report anything you find."
msgstr "听起来你已经了解原因了。外面有些怪物吓到了商会的人。他们安全逃走了，但丢了一批粮食，如果你能把它搬回来，我们万分感谢。搜索这个区域并报告你的发现。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Lost in the Woods"
msgstr "迷失丛林"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Lost in the Woods"
msgid ""
"We lost a scout searching the woods for a lost family.  Find the scout or "
"take out what got them."
msgstr "我们的一名侦察员在森林中搜索失联家庭时失踪了。找到那位侦察员或者干掉抓走他的怪物。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lost in the Woods"
msgid ""
"Seems like the only news we get here is bad.  A weirdo family was staying "
"outside the center, I don't know why.  They said something about germs.  "
"Anyway, they're gone, vanished in the night.  We sent a scout out to find "
"them but now they're gone too.  We have a pretty good idea of where in the "
"woods the scout was searching.  Bring back anyone you can alive and end "
"whatever is keeping them."
msgstr ""
"看来我们得到的唯一消息只有坏消息。一个怪人组成的家庭呆在中心外，我也不知道为什么。他们说了些关于细菌的事。总之，他们走了，在夜里消失了。我们派了个侦察员去找"
"他们，但现在他也不见了。我们很了解侦察员所去搜索的那片森林。尽可能把所有人活着带回来，干掉那些抓走他们的怪物。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lost in the Woods"
msgid ""
"Try not to make too much noise.  Visibility is bad in the woods so it's all "
"about sound."
msgstr "尽量不要制造太多的噪音。森林里的能见度很差，所以一切都取决于声音。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Protect the cattle"
msgstr "保护牛只"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Protect the cattle"
msgid "Someone or something in the swamps is stealing cattle.  Stop it."
msgstr "沼泽里有什么人或者什么东西在不停偷我们的牛。阻止他们。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Protect the cattle"
msgid ""
"This is probably a waste of time, but a nearby farmer has been complaining "
"that someone or something has been stealing a lot of their cattle.  We don't "
"normally bother with little things like this, but our food supplies are "
"getting low and the farmers are threatening to cut us off if we won't help.  "
"I've marked on your map where the farmers think the cattle are going."
msgstr ""
"这很可能会无功而返，但附近的一个农民总是抱怨说有什么人或什么东西偷走了很多牛。我们一般不会处理这些琐碎事情，但我们最近的食物补给不多，而且那些农民威胁我们如"
"果不处理就停止给我们补给。我已经在你的地图上标记了那些农民认为牛只失踪的地方。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Protect the cattle"
msgid ""
"Maybe bring a rope to bring the cattle back or something for them to eat.  "
"They can be ornery cusses if you don't know how to treat them."
msgstr "也许用绳子把牛牵回来或者给它们喂点东西。如果你不了解对付它们的方法，它们也会变成恼人的捣蛋鬼。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Protect the cattle"
msgid ""
"Oh.  Oh no.  We didn't think the dinosaurs could raise and we've killed so "
"many of them.  We might be in trouble here.  Here's one now, I'll rip it "
"apart!  Wait, I can see in its dead eyes that it loves us and wants to help "
"us.  I'll just end up killing it, I'm barely holding it together here.  You'd "
"better take it."
msgstr ""
"噢。哦，不。我们不认为恐龙能复活，我们已经杀了很多恐龙。我们可能有麻烦了。这里就有一只，我要把它撕碎了！等等，我能从它死掉的眼睛里看出它爱我们，想帮助我们。"
"而我最后却杀了它，我快受不了了。你最好带走它。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zachycephalosaurus_chain' in an effect
msgid "Betty"
msgstr "贝蒂"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid "Kill 50 dinos"
msgstr "杀死50只恐龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid ""
"While we were out on a hunting party a couple of those big ugly ones came "
"back and ate a whole mob of the dead I wanted to take out.  We lost a lot of "
"soldiers too while we were out too, good ones, and they died bad.  Slow.  I "
"made sure of it, the traitors.  These dinosaurs have gone too far.  They're "
"making us crazy.  We need to rack up some serious numbers to catch up.  We "
"need some serious risk taking, I'm talking explosives and fire and drugs and "
"rock and roll here.  I don't care if it's living dinos or dead, they all need "
"to be taken down."
msgstr ""
"当我们出去参加狩猎大会的时候，几只又大又丑的家伙复活吃了一大堆我想干掉的死人。我们在外面的时候也损失了很多士兵，好兵，他们死得很惨。很慢。我决定了，那些叛徒"
"。这些恐龙做的太过分了。它们把我们逼上了绝路。我们需要增加些数量来比上它们。我们需要冒点险，我说的是炸药、烈火、毒品和摇滚。我不管恐龙是活是死，它们都得被干"
"掉。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid "Kill all dinos."
msgstr "杀光恐龙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "I'm right on the edge soldier.  Whose side are you on here?"
msgstr "我是个忍不住的战士。而你又是站在那一边的？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid ""
"You can kill a lot of dinos without taking a lot of pills, but I don't see "
"how."
msgstr "你也许不用吃很多药就能杀死很多恐龙，但我不知道该怎么做。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid "You hit your numbers yet?"
msgstr "你杀够数了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear.  We got our numbers too, and we chained down a "
"couple too.  I had to take out a few more soldiers who didn't make their "
"numbers, so this is good.  We're doing good."
msgstr "这是我最爱听的。我们也杀够了自己的数目，我们还拴了几只。我不得不再干掉几名没有达标的战士，所以扯平了。我们做得很好。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zachycephalosaurus_chain' in an effect
msgid "Stromer"
msgstr "施特罗默"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "Kill me a T Rex"
msgstr "干掉一只霸王龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid ""
"I have a special mission I need to complete before these dinos finish killing "
"me off, and I need you to bring me something special.  Go kill me a T Rex.  "
"We're going to be gods.  It's all going to be worth it."
msgstr "在这些恐龙杀死我之前，我需要你帮我完成一个特殊的任务，我需要你给我带来一件特别的东西。去帮我杀死一只霸王龙。我们将成为神。这一切都是值得的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "MY LIFE FOR YOU."
msgstr "为你献上我的生命。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "You're a dino killing machine like me.  You know what to do."
msgstr "你就像我一樣是個恐龍殺手，你知道該怎麼做。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "You got my body yet?"
msgstr "你找到我想要的尸体了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid ""
"All right, we've got the body here.  Watch this, I'm going to climb into its "
"dead mouth and when you see me again I'll be a god.  *SWALLOW*"
msgstr "好了，屍體在這裡。看好了，我要爬進它的死亡巨口裡，當你再次看到我的時候，我已經成為神了。*吞下*"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zyrannosaurus_chain' in an effect
msgid "Wilma"
msgstr "威尔玛"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
msgid "Yoshimi"
msgstr "良美"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "DinoLab survivor"
msgstr "恐龙实验室幸存者"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Job description of "DinoLab survivor" NPC class
msgid "Need to learn what happened…"
msgstr "需要知道发生了什么……"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "How can I help you, survivor?"
msgstr "我能帮你什么忙吗，幸存者？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Seen any interesting specimens?  I mean dinosaurs."
msgstr "看到什么有趣的样本了吗？我是说恐龙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I was just imagining you transforming into a tyrannosaurus rex.  Of course "
"that's impossible.  Unless…"
msgstr "我只是在想像把你變成雷克斯暴龍的樣子。當然啦這其實是不可能的，除非..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Let's do some science."
msgstr "让我们做些科学研究。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Please leave me be, I am but a humble muck farmer in this humble muck."
msgstr "请别管我，我只是一个在这片黄土上脸朝黄土的农民。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"You are dressed like a scientist.  Are you a scientist?  You look like a "
"dinosaur.  Are you a dinosaur?  Are you a scientist dinosaur?"
msgstr "你穿得像个科学家。你是科学家吗？你看起来像只恐龙。你是恐龙吗？你是恐龙科学家吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Die demon mutant!"
msgstr "死吧恶魔变种人！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You look like you need help.  Can I do something for you?"
msgstr "你看起来需要帮助。我能为你做点什么吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You have seen through my ruse.  In retrospect I should have prepared a "
"costume of some kind.  Unimportant!  You haven't attacked me or tried to "
"seduce me so you aren't like the others.  Had any bad headaches recently, "
"strange mood swings, strong urges, desire for human flesh?"
msgstr ""
"你识破了我的伪装。回想起来，我本该准备一套服装的。这不重要！你没有攻击我或试图勾引我，所以你不像其他人。最近有没有严重的头痛，奇怪的情绪波动，强烈的欲望，对"
"人肉的渴望？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Only the usual.  What are you really?"
msgstr "和往常一样。你到底是什么？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You are aware of the Cataclysm then?"
msgstr "你知道大灾变的吧？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd rather not say at this point."
msgstr "我现在不想说。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I am a hard working professional in a challenging field adjusting to a recent "
"change in circumstances.  That is all you need to know."
msgstr "我是个在一个具有挑战性的领域努力工作的专业人士，以适应最近环境的变化。你只需要知道这些。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My manager Dr. Tingle made some important mistakes and I have had to make "
"some quick decisions I would rather not go into detail on.  In retrospect our "
"faculties may have been influenced by external factors.  Suffice to say Dr. "
"Tingle is no longer with us but died happy.  And I escaped alive."
msgstr ""
"我的主管丁格尔博士犯了一些重要的错误，我不得不迅速做出一些决定，我不想细说。回想起来，当时我们的职员们可能受到外部因素的影响。我只想说丁格尔博士已经不在我们"
"身边了，但他死得很开心。我活着逃走了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Look at me.  Yes, I am aware.  The question is what happens next."
msgstr "看看我。是的，我知道。问题是接下来会发生什么。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I just got here, actually; I've recently found it wise to move a lot.  There "
"may be some interesting specimens nearby.  I mean dinosaurs."
msgstr "实际上，我刚到这里；我最近发现经常搬家是个明智选择。附近可能有一些有趣的样本。我是说恐龙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "First we need some supplies"
msgstr "寻找化学用品包"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "I think I might know where a decent chemistry set is…"
msgstr "我想我可能知道一个能用的化学用品包在哪里……"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "I need a full chemistry set to do my work properly.  I could use some help."
msgstr "我需要一套完整的化学仪器来完成我的工作。我需要一些帮助。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Fine.  I've marked one I know about on your map but any set will work."
msgstr "好把。我已经在你的地图上标出了一个我知道的，但随便哪一个都行。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Fine, you'll probably be dead soon anyway."
msgstr "好吧，反正你也活不了多久的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid ""
"It might be too dangerous now, any working full chemistry set is fine.  There "
"is a good chance something got out."
msgstr "现在可能太危险了，但任何一套完整的化学用品包都可以。很有可能出了什么事。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Do you have the set yet?"
msgstr "弄到化学用品包了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Let's get started."
msgstr "我们开始吧。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Very convincing.  I do need an actual chemistry set to work though."
msgstr "很有说服力。不过，我确实需要一个真正的化学用品包。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "It's fine, I'll make something work."
msgstr "没事的，我可以做点别的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kiernan consult"
msgstr "Kiernan的建議"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "I need some expert advice…"
msgstr "我需要一些专家建议……"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid ""
"I don't have access to my old lab's procedural documents here.  Find Dr. "
"Kiernan and get some notes on the basics.  I can work from there."
msgstr "我这里没有我以前实验室的程序文件。找到基尔南博士，做一些简要的记录。我可以从那继续做下去。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Right.  I've marked his last location on your map."
msgstr "好吧。我在你的地图上标出了他的最后所在。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Ugh."
msgstr "呃。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid ""
"Kiernan is probably still at the old field office.  It should be fine as long "
"as the emergency power is still working.  You may have to do some kind of "
"stupid task before Kiernan talks.  Try not to get violent.  If Kiernan is "
"dead try and find some notes or books."
msgstr ""
"基尔南可能还在旧的外派办事处。只要应急电源还在工作就可以了。在基尔南愿意说话之前，你可能要做一些蠢事情。尽量不要使用暴力。如果基尔南死了，试着找些笔记或书籍"
"。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Do you have the information yet?"
msgstr "你弄到我需要的信息了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Let's get started.  Oh, I'll make you a copy just in case."
msgstr "我们开始吧。哦，我给你复印一份以防万一。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Very convincing.  I do need the information to work though."
msgstr "很有说服力。不过，我确实需要真正的信息才能工作。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_zombie_scientist" placed on map update on start
#. of mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Kiernan"
msgstr "Kiernan"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Nice relaxing break"
msgstr "很好的放松休息"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Time for a nice relaxing trip…"
msgstr "是时候好好放松一下了……"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid ""
"We have been working so hard.  We deserve a break.  Here is what I want you "
"to do.  There is a special zoo with very special animals in it. I need you to "
"go there and kill anything dangerous and smash the corpses bloody so they "
"don't rise and try to kill me.  For science.  Then I'm going to go there and "
"study what is there to get ready for the next step."
msgstr ""
"我们一直在努力工作。我们应该休息一下。下面是我想让你做的。有一个特别的动物园，里面有非常特别的动物。我需要你去那里杀掉任何危险的东西，砸碎血淋淋的尸体，这样"
"他们就不会重新站起来想杀我了。为了科学。然后我要去那里研究下一步的准备工作。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Clean up if you can, I don't like mess."
msgstr "如果可以的话，请顺便清理一下，我不喜欢乱糟糟的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid ""
"You're good at this kind of brutality I assume.  Bring a weapon of some kind. "
" I don't know how dangerous it will be but I would assume the worst.  I "
"always do."
msgstr "我猜你很擅长用暴力解决问题。带上武器。我不知道会有多危险，但我会防范未然。我总是这样。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Are you back from your relaxing trip?"
msgstr "你从你的放松旅行回来了吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid ""
"Wonderful.  I trust you weren't hurt by those animals.  I have some spare "
"chemicals you might enjoy."
msgstr "太棒了。我相信你没被那些动物伤到。我这里有些你可能喜欢的多余化学品。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Wonderful, now I'm off to inspect your work."
msgstr "太棒了，现在我可以出发看看你的工作成果了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It could be a mighty challenge, but Alonso knows there are some that are into "
"this, no?  I think they call themselves escalier, which is Italian for the "
"scaly banana.  Or staircase.  It is not important, I mean to say that people "
"love who they love, and the dinosaur, she does the same, and there is no "
"shame in what two people or dinosaurs do in the escalier.  Alonso does not "
"judge you.  You do you.  And maybe Alonso as well when you are done with the "
"you doing."
msgstr ""
"这可能是一个巨大的挑战，但阿隆索知道有一些人对此很感兴趣，不是吗？我想他们自称为埃斯卡利尔，意为长着鳞片的香蕉。或者是楼梯。这并不重要，我的意思是说，人们爱"
"他们所爱的人，而恐龙，亦如是，两个人或恐龙在埃斯卡利尔做的事没有羞耻感。阿隆索不会评判你。你做自己就好。也许阿隆索也能如此，当你们做完你们所做之事。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Their song is older than ours, but also different.  We have much to learn "
"from their old bones.  I knew a man once who sang not of bones but of meat.  "
"If you find him, you will know the face of Bo.  He has listened hardest to "
"them, but I do not know if he hears."
msgstr ""
"他们的歌比我们的老，但也不同。我们能从他们的老骨头中学到很多东西。我认识一个人，他的歌不是骨头而是血肉。如果你找到他，你就会知道博的面目。他听得很认真，但我"
"不知道他是否真的听到了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That explains everything, thank you."
msgstr "这就解释了一切，谢谢。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_RED_Soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Kill all dinosaurs."
msgstr "杀死所有的恐龙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_RED_Soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome to whatever this is."
msgstr "欢迎来到这个不知道算啥的地方。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_RED_Soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm supposed to direct all questions to my leadership, that's Red over there."
msgstr "我想你该去找我的头儿问这些问题，瑞德就在那里。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_RED_Soldier_1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sure sure…"
msgstr "当然，当然……"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They just started showing up about the same time it all fell apart.  They "
"attack the caravans and the bandits both.  Hungry bastards.  All dinosaurs "
"are shoot on sight.  We don't eat them, they're probably poisoned with "
"whatever got the dead ones.  Best to burn and bury them.  Same with the eggs. "
" We have a team out working on wiping them all out in the region.  Check the "
"mass graves.  Talk to Red there."
msgstr ""
"它们几乎和这场大灾变同时出现，一切都分崩离析了。它们攻击商队和土匪。饥肠辘辘的混蛋。所有恐龙格杀勿论。我们不吃它们，它们很可能带着那些不死人身上的毒素。最好"
"一把火烧光或者埋进土里。它们的蛋也一样。我们在这片区域有个小分队，正努力把它们全部消灭掉。去和那里的瑞德谈谈。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Probably for the best."
msgstr "可能这样也好吧。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Strange greeting, ignoring that.  What can you tell me about the dinosaurs?"
msgstr "奇怪的问候，别太上心。能和我说说关于恐龙的事吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Cute things, aren't they!  Like big birds with big appetites.  The plant "
"eaters are okay unless they get spooked - then it's time to hide on the roof "
"for a while until they calm down.  I gave one some cattle feed and it seemed "
"to like it fine, let me pet it and followed me around some.  I bet you could "
"tame them if they're young, maybe even some of the grown ones.  A man came "
"out here a while ago saying they were coming, that it was their time and we "
"needed to get with them or get out of the way.  The man said I should follow "
"him to the Swamper church, but I'm too busy here.  A whole lot of people went "
"with him though."
msgstr ""
"可爱的东西，不是吗！就像胃口超级大的大鸟。吃植物的那些还好，除非它们受到惊吓——最多是在屋顶上躲一段时间，直到它们冷静下来。我给了其中一只喂了些家畜饲料，它"
"似乎很喜欢，还让我抚摸它，跟着我去了一些地方。我敢打赌，如果它们还年幼，你应该可以驯服它们，甚至可以驯服一些成年的。前段时间有个家伙来过这里，说它们要降临了"
"，现在是它们的时代了，我们需要和它们一起共存或者是为它们让路。那人说我应该跟他去沼泽教堂，但我在这里太忙了。但是很多人都和他一起去了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm sure they're fine.  What was that question again?"
msgstr "我肯定它们没事。刚刚是什么问题来着？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"That's a lot of meat to break down.  You're going to want to get together a "
"real butcher setup, hooks and all, rig up a way to keep the meat cold or even "
"better frozen, and figure out some way to make it last longer.  Could do "
"jerky, maybe get a canning operation going.  The main thing is to work fast "
"before it goes bad.  Hey, I know a pretty good cook who could help with that. "
" No, she's dead.  I'm here though."
msgstr ""
"那有很多肉要分解。你需要一個正規的屠宰設備、釣和其他東西，然後找方法冷藏，或者更進一步，冷凍它，還要找方法令它保存得更久。可以做肉乾，或者製作成罐頭。最重要"
"的是要在肉開始腐爛之前做完。嘿，我認識一位很多的廚師可以幫到手。不，她已經死了。但這裡還有我。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm getting hungry."
msgstr "我開始覺得肚餓了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Yes, and what can I tell you about the grass being green and the sun
#. being yellow?  All of the large baby chickens do what they do and we get no
#. benefit from it regardless of what we say about them.  Why do you ask, you
#. person with a physical body?  Do you like the big turkeys?
msgid ""
"Aye, 'n what c'n I yark'n ye around the grassins what be a'green 'n that the "
"big brassy what be a'yeller?  All'n those great chickees do what they do 'n "
"we profit none 'n the immortalinity of the crabs consists just so. What of it "
"ye long and bobbly?  Ye takin' a shinin' to the jibble-necks?"
msgstr ""
"啊，要我告诉你草是绿和太阳是黄的？所有的大号鸡崽子都在做它们该做的事，无论我们怎么说它们我们都不会从中得到任何好处。你这个肉体人为什么要问这个问题？你喜欢这"
"些大火鸡吗？（注：特殊语言，不作翻译。）"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "This was unhelpful."
msgstr "这毫无帮助。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are you really this nonchalant about the dinosaurs?"
msgstr "你就对恐龙这么漠不关心？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Yes, and yes again.  If every world has zombies, 90% of the ones we reach
#. have dinos.
msgid ""
"Aye, n'aye again!  E'ry ball o mud has the Enemy.  Nine mudballs out o' ten  "
"are mudded up wit thunder chickees."
msgstr "没错，确实没错。如果每个世界都有丧尸，那么我们到达的 90%的世界都有恐龙。（注：特殊语言，不作翻译。）"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I wonder why most worlds have dinosaurs roaming?"
msgstr "我好奇为什么大多数世界都有恐龙在漫游？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Stego Mutant"
msgstr "剑龙变种人"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Job description of "Stego Mutant" NPC class
msgid "I'm looking for stego mutagen… I'm going to become a thunder lizard."
msgstr "我正在找剑龙诱变剂……我准备成为一条雷蜥。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Tyrant Mutant"
msgstr "暴龙变种人"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Job description of "Tyrant Mutant" NPC class
msgid "I'm looking for tyrant mutagen… I'm going to be a king."
msgstr "我正在找暴龙诱变剂……我准备成为一个王者。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "They should all be destroyed…"
msgstr "它们都应该被摧毁……"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Muldoon"
msgstr "马尔登"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Sharptooth"
msgstr "利齿"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "KILL ALL DINOS"
msgstr "杀光恐龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Giant Asteroid"
msgstr "巨型小行星"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Unending hunger"
msgstr "无尽饥饿"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Unending hunger"
msgid "crossed tyrant mutation threshold"
msgstr "跨過暴龍突變臨界"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
