#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled dinosaur egg"
msgid "A hard-boiled dinosaur egg, still in its shell.  Portable and nutritious!"
msgstr "一只白煮恐龙蛋，壳都没有剥掉。营养全面又便于携带。"

