#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/laser_items.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "2-DINO-A7 laser rifle"
msgid_plural "2-DINO-A7 laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "2-DINO-A7 激光步枪"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/laser_items.json
#. ~ Description of gun "2-DINO-A7 laser rifle"
#. ~ Description of "2-DINO-A7 laser rifle"
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art laser rifle developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\".  "
"Initial performance rivaled Rivtech's finest, with rumors flying about "
"corporate skulduggery.  Fitted with a large internal plutonium cell for "
"CyberDinos."
msgstr ""
"最先进的激光步枪，由研究机构\"Aerial "
"Labs\""
"制造。初始性能甚至可以和Rivtech的最佳产品一较上下，虽然集团诈骗的传言满天飞，当大灾变降临，这些都被扔进了历史的垃圾堆里。赛博恐龙为它安装了一个大型的"
"内部钚电池。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tyrant mutagenic primer"
msgid_plural "tyrant mutagenic primer"
msgstr[0] "暴龙诱变引物"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Description of "tyrant mutagenic primer"
msgid ""
"A super-concentrated mutagenic primer strongly resembling children's toy "
"slime."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，像是儿童玩具里的黏液。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tyrant mutagen"
msgid_plural "tyrant mutagen"
msgstr[0] "暴龍誘變劑"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Description of "tyrant mutagen"
msgid ""
"An extremely rare mutagen cocktail, it smells like blood and is a green goop "
"with blood-red streaks."
msgstr "一种极度罕见的混合诱变剂，闻上去和血一般，是一团带着血红色条纹的绿色黏液。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stego mutagenic primer"
msgid_plural "stego mutagenic primer"
msgstr[0] "劍龍誘變引子"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Description of "stego mutagenic primer"
msgid ""
"A super-concentrated mutagenic primer not for those frightened of this thing "
"they have become."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，不适合那些恐惧此类事物的人。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stego mutagen"
msgid_plural "stego mutagen"
msgstr[0] "劍龍誘變劑"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horns mutagenic primer"
msgid_plural "horns mutagenic primer"
msgstr[0] "角龙诱变引物"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Description of "horns mutagenic primer"
msgid ""
"A super-concentrated mutagenic primer containing refined and purified "
"biological samples, spiked with rum."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，含有经过提纯精炼的生化样本，并掺入朗姆酒。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horns mutagen"
msgid_plural "horns mutagen"
msgstr[0] "角龙诱变剂"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
#. ~ Description of "horns mutagen"
msgid ""
"An extremely rare mutagen cocktail containing a mix of biological samples, "
"spiked with rum."
msgstr "一种极度罕见的混合诱变剂，含有各类生化样本，并掺入朗姆酒。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen_ingredients.json
#. ~ Description of "raptor sample"
msgid ""
"A sample of tissues and liquids from a living dromaeosaurid, popularly called "
"a 'raptor', a flightless feathered predatory dinosaur popularized by an "
"American film."
msgstr "一份来自活体异爪类恐龙的组织和体液样本，俗称\"迅猛龙\"，这是一种不会飞的有羽毛的食肉恐龙，由于一部美国电影而广为人知。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen_ingredients.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tyrant sample"
msgid_plural "tyrant samples"
msgstr[0] "暴龍樣本"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen_ingredients.json
#. ~ Description of "tyrant sample"
msgid ""
"A sample of tissues and liquids from a living tyrannosauroid, one of many "
"carnivorous three-toed predator dinosaurs known for being very big."
msgstr "一份来自活体霸王龙的组织和体液样本，霸王龙是三趾食肉恐龙中的一种，以体型巨大而闻名。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen_ingredients.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stegosaurus sample"
msgid_plural "stegosaurus samples"
msgstr[0] "劍龍樣本"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen_ingredients.json
#. ~ Description of "stegosaurus sample"
msgid ""
"A sample of tissues and liquids from a living thyreophoran, one of many plant "
"eating dinosaurs with natural protective armor."
msgstr "一份来自活体剑龙的组织和体液样本，剑龙是长着天然护甲的食草恐龙中的一种。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen_ingredients.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ceratopsian sample"
msgid_plural "ceratopsian samples"
msgstr[0] "角龙样本"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen_ingredients.json
#. ~ Description of "ceratopsian sample"
msgid ""
"A sample of tissues and liquids from a living ceratopsian, one of many plant "
"eating dinosaurs with dramatic head adaptations useful for fighting and for "
"finding a mate."
msgstr "一份来自活体角龙的组织和体液样本，角龙是长着各类能用于战斗或寻找配偶的夸张头冠的食草恐龙中的一种。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutation_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stego skin"
msgid_plural "stego skin"
msgstr[0] "剑龙皮"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutation_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "stego skin"
msgid ""
"Thick, bulky and heavy.  This skin withstands punishment from even the "
"biggest beasts."
msgstr "厚实又笨重。这种皮肤能承受来最强大野兽的进攻。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large pet carrier"
msgid_plural "large pet carriers"
msgstr[0] "大型宠物笼"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets.json
#. ~ Description of "large pet carrier"
msgid ""
"A sturdy reinforced plastic container meant to hold dinosaurs for transport.  "
"Use it on a suitable animal to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr "一个坚固耐用的塑料笼子，可以用来运输大型恐龙。激活它后选择需要捕获的动物，或者选择空地放出笼中动物。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large wooden pet carrier"
msgid_plural "large wooden pet carriers"
msgstr[0] "大型木制宠物笼"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets.json
#. ~ Description of "large wooden pet carrier"
msgid ""
"A sturdy reinforced wooden container meant to hold dinosaurs for transport.  "
"Use it on a suitable animal to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr "一个坚固耐用的木制笼子，可以用来运输大型恐龙。激活它后选择需要捕获的动物，或者选择空地放出笼中动物。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bear armor"
msgid_plural "bear armors"
msgstr[0] "熊甲"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Kevlar-lined bear-sized peto"
msgid_plural "Kevlar-lined bear-sized petos"
msgstr[0] "克維拉內襯熊護甲"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Kevlar-lined bear-sized peto"
msgid ""
"A heavy mattress-like armor of cloth, leather, and thick linings of Kevlar, "
"originally used as horse protection for bullfighting, but adapted for the "
"noblest of beasts.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套由棉布、皮革和厚厚的凯夫拉内衬制成的沉重的床垫状盔甲，最初用于斗牛时的保护，但也适用于最高贵的野兽种群。你可以将这套熊铠穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "biosilicified chitin bear armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin bear armors"
msgstr[0] "硅化甲壳熊铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin bear armor"
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral, and croupiere made from "
"biosilicified chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly "
"bear."
msgstr "一套自制的动物铠甲，包含护颈的鸡颈、护胸的当胸和护臀的搭后，上面的生物硅化甲壳片和薄薄的网状织物贴合在一起。你可以将这套熊铠穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chitin bear armor"
msgid_plural "chitin bear armors"
msgstr[0] "甲壳熊铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "chitin bear armor"
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral, and croupiere made from chitin "
"fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套自制的动物铠甲，包含护颈的鸡颈、护胸的当胸和护臀的搭后，上面的甲壳片和薄薄的网状织物贴合在一起。你可以把这套熊铠套在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chainmail bear armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail bear armors"
msgstr[0] "锁环熊铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "chainmail bear armor"
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of chainmail, suitably made for bears as protection.  You "
"could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套厚厚的铁环链甲，专门为保护熊打造。你可以将这套熊铠穿在一匹友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled leather bear barding with caparison"
msgid_plural "boiled leather bear bardings with caparison"
msgstr[0] "华丽皮革熊铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled leather bear barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath. "
" This caparison depicts four men in heavy metal armor riddled with bullet "
"marks.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套全身熊铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。熊铠上的装饰描绘了四名身穿重金属盔甲的男子，盔甲上布满了弹痕。你可以将这套熊铠穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather bear barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath. "
" This caparison depicts a large brown bear being swarmed by bees as it "
"devours a honeycomb.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套全身熊铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。熊铠上的装饰描绘了一只大棕熊正在吞食蜂巢，周围蜂拥着蜜蜂。你可以将这套熊穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather bear barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath. "
" This caparison depicts a warrior-woman holding a baby in one arm and a "
"battleaxe in the other.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套全身熊铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马衣上描绘着一个女战士怀抱婴儿，手持战斧。你可以将其装备在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather bear barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath. "
" This caparison depicts a bear dancing with a golden-haired maiden.  You "
"could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套全身熊铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马衣上描绘着一头熊与金发少女共舞，手持战斧。你可以将其装备在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather bear barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath. "
" This caparison depicts a zombified bear with cold blue eyes fighting "
"alongside an undead army.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套全身熊铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马衣上描绘着一只有着冰冷蓝瞳的丧尸熊与不死军队并肩作战。你可以将其装备在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather bear barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath. "
" This caparison depicts a tall man transforming into a giant bear and leaping "
"into battle.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套全身熊铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马衣上描绘着一个高大的男人化身巨熊跃入战场。你可以将其装备在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "boiled leather bear barding with caparison"
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath. "
" This caparison depicts a fierce stegosaurus bursting out the side of a "
"1970s-era van.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套全身熊铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。马衣上描绘着一只凶猛的剑龙从 1970 年代的面包车侧面冲了出来。你可以将其装备在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled leather bear barding with bones"
msgid_plural "boiled leather bear bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "骨饰皮革熊铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled leather bear barding with bones"
msgid ""
"Leather bear barding with decorative bones affixed, meant to invoke fear in "
"bandits and raiders and traders all!  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "带有装饰性骨制附件的皮革熊铠，意在引发强盗、袭击者和商贩等人的恐惧！你可以将其装备在一只友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bear rain sheet"
msgid_plural "bear rain sheets"
msgstr[0] "熊用雨衣"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bear rain sheet"
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering, adapted to protect a bear from acid zombie splashes "
"and similar caustic substances.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一层薄薄的能覆盖熊全身的塑料布，能够防护酸雨和其他腐蚀性物质。你可以将这套熊铠穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bear-sized holiday sweater"
msgid_plural "bear-sized holiday sweaters"
msgstr[0] "熊大小的节日毛衣"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bear-sized holiday sweater"
msgid ""
"A very large warm wool sweater with a festive holiday pattern.  You could put "
"this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一件印着有节日图案的非常大的保暖羊毛衫。你可以将它穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "iron bear armor"
msgid_plural "iron bear armors"
msgstr[0] "铁熊铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "iron bear armor"
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically placed iron plates and leather, suitably "
"made for bears as protection.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的铁板，专门为保护熊而打造。你可以将这套熊铠穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steel bear armor"
msgid_plural "steel bear armors"
msgstr[0] "钢熊铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "steel bear armor"
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of steel plate and leather, suitably made for bears as "
"protection.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的钢板，专门为保护熊而打造。你可以将这套熊铠穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze bear armor"
msgid_plural "bronze bear armors"
msgstr[0] "青铜熊铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze bear armor"
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically placed bronze plates and leather, suitably "
"made for bears as protection.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的青铜板，专门为保护熊而打造。你可以将这套熊铠穿在一头友好的熊身上。"

