#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Kevlar-lined elephant-sized peto"
msgid ""
"A heavy mattress-like armor of cloth, leather, and thick linings of Kevlar, "
"originally used as horse protection for bullfighting.  You could put this on "
"a friendly elephant."
msgstr "一套由棉布、皮革和厚厚的凯夫拉内衬制成的沉重的床垫状盔甲，最初用于骑马斗牛时的保护。你可以将这套象铠穿在一头友好的象身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "biosilicified chitin elephant armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin elephant armors"
msgstr[0] "硅化甲壳象铠"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin elephant armor"
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral, and croupiere made from "
"biosilicified chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly "
"elephant."
msgstr "一套自制的象铠，包含保护象颈的鸡颈、保护象胸的当胸和保护象臀的搭后，上面的生物硅化甲壳片和薄薄的网状织物贴合在一起。你可以将这套象铠穿在一头友好的象身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_elephant_armor.json
