msgid ""
"A full barding for ostriches, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a crown floating above an armored tank in "
"profile above the word AUSTRALIA.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套全身鸵鸟铠，由鞣制皮革和布制内衬构成。鸵鸟铠上的装饰描绘了一顶漂浮在装甲坦克上方的皇冠，铭文上写着\"AUSTRALIA\""
"。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
