msgid "fungal chasmosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal chasmosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌丧尸开角龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal chasmosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"This was once a four-legged dinosaur with a tall bony crest from which three "
"short horns emerge above the eyes and beak.  Fungal tendrils now sprout from "
"its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together a shambling mass of "
"mold-covered flesh."
msgstr "一具蹒跚而行的四足恐龙尸体，头上长着高高的骨冠，上面有三个短角，真菌从它的口、眼、耳和其他孔洞处喷薄而出并互相连接起来，被霉菌覆盖的巨大躯体还在蹒跚而行。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal pentaceratops zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal pentaceratops zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌丧尸五角龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fungal kosmoceratops zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal kosmoceratops zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌科斯莫角龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/fungus.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal kosmoceratops zombie"
msgid ""
"This was once a massive, four-legged dinosaur herbivore, with a tall bony "
"crest from which fifteen horns and spikes emerged.  Fungal tendrils now "
"sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together a shambling "
"mass of mold-covered flesh."
msgstr ""
"曾经是一只体型巨大的犀牛一般的恐龙。头上长着高高的骨冠，上面有十五根短角和骨刺。真菌从它的口、眼、耳和其他孔洞处喷薄而出并互相连接起来，被霉菌覆盖的巨大躯体"
"还在蹒跚而行。"

