#. ~ Description of monster "edmontonia zombie"
msgid ""
"This heavily-armored dinosaur corpse is covered with small ridged bony plates "
"with long, bony spikes.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "这只身着厚重护甲的恐龙丧尸，覆盖着小型、带有长长骨刺的骨板。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zuul zombie"
msgid_plural "zuul zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸祖鲁龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zuul zombie"
msgid ""
"This four-legged armored dinosaur corpse has horns on the head and large "
"spikes in rows along the back and side.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "这只四足的披甲恐龙丧尸，额头上矗立着一对角，背部和侧面齐列着巨大的骨刺。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dyoplosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "dyoplosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "倍甲龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dyoplosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"This armored dinosaur corpse looks like a giant prehistoric armadillo.  Its "
"tail ends in a spiked club of bone.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "这只披甲恐龙的尸体看起来像一个巨大的史前犰狳。它的尾巴末端是一根长满骨刺的棍子。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ankylosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "ankylosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "甲龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ankylosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a four legged dinosaur with peeling armored plates, a "
"beak, and black, glistening eyes.  Its tail ends in a massive spiked club of "
"bone."
msgstr "这头四足丧尸恐龙包覆着些许剥落的表壳，嘴部呈喙状，黑色的眼睛微光闪烁。尾巴末端是一根巨型且长满锐刺的骨棍。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "euoplocephalus zombie"
msgid_plural "euoplocephalus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸包头龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "euoplocephalus zombie"
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur corpse has a horny beak, two bony "
"rings protecting the neck, and a long tail ending in a heavy club of bone.  "
"Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "这只四足恐龙丧尸身披厚重的装甲，其喙坚硬，脖颈则有两个骨环保护，长尾末端带有沉重的骨球。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scolosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "scolosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸厚甲龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scolosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur corpse has several long spikes "
"along the back and a long spiked tail ending in a club of bone.  Its eyes "
"ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "这只身披厚重装甲的四足恐龙丧尸，背部有几条长长的刺，尾部也是长刺，并以骨球收尾。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tenontosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "tenontosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸腱龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tenontosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a feathered dinosaur with a long broad tail and a "
"beak.  Its tattered feathers are stained with black, sticky liquid."
msgstr "这头长着宽长尾巴和喙的有羽毛丧尸恐龙蹒跚而行。它的羽毛破烂不堪，并沾满了黑色的粘稠液体。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dryosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "dryosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸橡树龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dryosaurus zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "camptosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a large, feathered, bipedal dinosaur with strong "
"legs, broad shoulders, and a pointed beak.  Its tattered feathers are stained "
"with black, sticky liquid."
msgstr "一具体表覆盖着破碎羽毛和黑色腐臭液体的蹒跚而行的大型两足恐龙尸体。它的两条腿很强壮，肩膀宽阔，长着尖喙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "camptosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "camptosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "彎龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "iguanodon zombie"
msgid_plural "iguanodon zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸禽龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "iguanodon zombie"
msgid ""
"A bulky, beaked dinosaur with spiky thumbs, dead but walking, eyes vacant and "
"swollen."
msgstr ""
"A bulky, beaked dinosaur with spiky thumbs, dead but walking, eyes vacant and "
"swollen."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "eolambia zombie"
msgid_plural "eolambia zombies"
msgstr[0] "eolambia zombies"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "eolambia zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "hadrosaurus zombie"
msgid "A bulky, beaked dinosaur, dead but walking, eyes vacant and swollen."
msgstr "一具巨大的、长喙的蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体。它正四处游荡，黑漆漆的眼中空洞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hadrosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "hadrosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "鴨嘴龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "maiasaura zombie"
msgid_plural "maiasaura zombies"
msgstr[0] "慈母龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "maiasaura zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, mottled dinosaur with hooves and a heavy tail, dead but walking, eyes "
"vacant and swollen.  Has a flat beak, thick nose, and a small but spiky head "
"crest."
msgstr ""
"一具巨大的、身体上有各色斑块的蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体，有蹄子一样的脚和沉重的尾巴。头上长着一个扁平的喙，厚厚的鼻子，和一个小尖状冠饰。它正四处游荡，黑漆漆的眼中"
"空洞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gryposaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "gryposaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸钩鼻龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gryposaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, mottled dinosaur with hooves and a heavy tail, dead but walking, eyes "
"vacant and swollen.  Has a flat beak and a nose with a prominent nasal arch."
msgstr "一头体躯庞大，外表斑驳的恐龙，有蹄足和沉重的尾巴，已经死亡但仍在行走，眼神呆滞而肿胀。它还有一个扁平的喙和一个突出的鼻弓。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "prosaurolophus zombie"
msgid_plural "prosaurolophus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸原栉龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "prosaurolophus zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, mottled dinosaur with hooves, a short beak and a tall head crest, "
"dead but walking, eyes vacant and swollen."
msgstr "一头体躯庞大，外表斑驳的恐龙，有蹄足、短喙和挺立的头冠，已经死亡但仍在行走，眼神呆滞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "saurulophus zombie"
msgid_plural "saurulophus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸栉龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "saurulophus zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, mottled dinosaur with hooves, a broad beak and a spiky head crest, "
"dead but walking, eyes vacant and swollen."
msgstr "一头体躯庞大，外表斑驳的恐龙，有蹄足、宽阔的喙和突起的头冠，已经死亡但仍在行走，眼神呆滞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "edmontosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "edmontosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "埃德蒙頓龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "edmontosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, scaly dinosaur with a broad, toothless beak, dead but walking, eyes "
"vacant and swollen."
msgstr "一具巨大的、长着鳞片的蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体，长着一只没有牙齿的大嘴。它正四处游荡，黑漆漆的眼中空洞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "parasaurolophus zombie"
msgid_plural "parasaurolophus zombies"
msgstr[0] "副櫛龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "parasaurolophus zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, mottled dinosaur with a blunt head crest, dead but walking, eyes "
"vacant and swollen."
msgstr "一具巨大的、身体上有各色斑块的蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体，长着钝的头脊。它正四处游荡，黑漆漆的眼中空洞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lambeosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "lambeosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸赖氏龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lambeosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, scaly dinosaur with a long stiff tail, hooves, a narrow beak and a "
"tall head crest, dead but walking, eyes vacant and swollen."
msgstr "一头体躯庞大且被鳞甲包覆的恐龙，一条长硬的尾巴附于其后，足带有蹄，喙形狭长，头冠挺立，已经死亡但仍在行走，眼神呆滞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "corythosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "corythosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "冠龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "corythosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, scaly dinosaur with a short beak and a tall head crest, dead but "
"walking, eyes vacant and swollen."
msgstr "一具巨大的、长着鳞片的蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体，头上长着一个短喙和一个高高的头冠。它正四处游荡，黑漆漆的眼中空洞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hypacrosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "hypacrosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸亚冠龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hypacrosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A huge, scaly dinosaur with a tall ridge down the back, a tail, hooves, a "
"short beak and a wide, rounded head crest, dead but walking, eyes vacant and "
"swollen."
msgstr "一头体躯庞大且被鳞甲包覆的恐龙，背部脊骨屹立，尾巴附于其后，足带有蹄，喙形短，头冠宽圆，已经死去但仍在行走，眼神呆滞而肿胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pachycephalosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "pachycephalosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "厚頭龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pachycephalosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with tattered "
"feathers and black, putrid liquid.  It resembles a reptilian ostrich with a "
"hard-looking domed head."
msgstr "一具体表覆盖着破碎羽毛和黑色腐臭液体的蹒跚而行的中型两足恐龙尸体。它看起来像一只长着坚硬圆头的蜥蜴鸵鸟。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "chained Pachycephalosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "chained Pachycephalosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "被栓住的厚頭龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chained Pachycephalosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A feathered dinosaur corpse with a domed head with heavy chains to allow some "
"control."
msgstr "一具长有羽毛的恐龙尸体，长着坚硬圆头，头上有沉重的锁链，以便于控制。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leptoceratops zombie"
msgid_plural "leptoceratops zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸纤角龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leptoceratops zombie"
msgid ""
"A shambling dinosaur corpse with a bony crest and sharp beak able to walk on "
"two legs and four.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "一头蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体，拥有骨质冠和锐利喙，可以以两腿或四腿行走。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zuniceratops zombie"
msgid_plural "zuniceratops zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸祖尼角龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zuniceratops zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, four-legged dinosaur with a tall thin bony head crest, "
"two long brow horns, and a beak.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "一头巨型的四足恐龙蹒跚而行，具有高耸的骨质头冠，两只长长的眉角和一张喙。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lokiceratops zombie"
msgid_plural "lokiceratops zombies"
msgstr[0] "lokiceratops zombies"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lokiceratops zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, four-legged dinosaur with a bony head crest with two "
"large horns that curve out and down, two long brow horns, and a beak.  Its "
"eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr ""
"A massive, shambling, four-legged dinosaur with a bony head crest with two "
"large horns that curve out and down, two long brow horns, and a beak.  Its "
"eyes ooze black, putrid tears."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "styracosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "styracosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸戟龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "styracosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a bony crest with "
"several long spikes and one large horn above the beak and a short tail.  Its "
"eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "一头巨型的四足恐龙丧尸蹒跚而行，头顶有一个骨质冠，上面有几根长长的尖刺和一个大角，嘴喙上方有一对短小的角质突起。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "centrosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "centrosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸尖角龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "centrosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a beak and long horn "
"above the nose.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "一头巨型的、酷似犀牛的恐龙丧尸蹒跚而行，喙和鼻子上方长着一只长角。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "einiosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "einiosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸野牛龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "einiosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a tall bony crest and "
"one large horn above the nose curving forward towards the beak.  Its eyes "
"ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "一头巨型的四足恐龙丧尸蹒跚而行，头部有一个高高的骨质冠，额头上方长着一只向前弯曲的大角。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "achelousaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "achelousaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸河神龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "achelousaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a tall bony crest with "
"two long curved spikes and three rough bosses above the eyes and nose as well "
"as a short tail and hooked beak.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr ""
"一头巨型的、酷似犀牛的恐龙丧尸蹒跚而行，头部有一个高高的骨质冠，上面有两个长弯曲的尖刺，额头和鼻子上方还有三个粗糙的隆起，尾巴较短，嘴喙弯曲。它的眼睛里渗出"
"黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pachyrhinosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "pachyrhinosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "厚鼻龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pachyrhinosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with two massive bony bosses "
"on its brow and nose.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "一具体型巨大的犀牛一般的蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体。头上长着骨冠，上面有两根弯曲的角和一根粗矮的骨质鼻角。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "chasmosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "chasmosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸开角龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chasmosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a tall bony crest from "
"which three short horns emerge above the eyes and beak.  Its eyes ooze black, "
"putrid tears."
msgstr "一头巨型的、酷似犀牛的恐龙丧尸蹒跚而行，额头高高隆起，从中长出三只短角，分别在眼睛和喙上方。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pentaceratops zombie"
msgid_plural "pentaceratops zombies"
msgstr[0] "五角龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pentaceratops zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a tall, bony crest from "
"which four long horns and a short nose horn emerge.  Its eyes ooze black, "
"putrid tears."
msgstr "一具体型巨大的犀牛一般的蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体。头上长着高高的骨冠，上面有四根长长的角和一根粗矮的骨质鼻角。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "kosmoceratops zombie"
msgid_plural "kosmoceratops zombies"
msgstr[0] "科斯莫角龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "kosmoceratops zombie"
msgid ""
"A massive, shambling, rhino-like dinosaur corpse with a bony crest and two "
"wavy side horns.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "一具体型巨大的犀牛一般的蹒跚而行的恐龙尸体。头上长着高高的骨冠，上面有两根波浪状的侧角。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐臭的眼泪。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "torosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "torosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "牛角龍殭屍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "torosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
