#. ~ Description of monster "scorched hypacrosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"A heavily-burned zombie dinosaur with a tall ridge down the back, a tail, "
"hooves, a short beak and a wide, rounded head crest; it still reeks of "
"charred meat.  Its flesh has mended into a leathery shell."
msgstr ""
"一头重度烧伤的丧尸恐龙，背躯脊骨屹立，尾巴附于其后，足带有蹄，喙形短，头冠宽圆，它仍然散发着烧焦肉的味道。它表皮已经焦化成皮革状的坚韧外壳。\n"
" "

