#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Crested Crusher"
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized dinosaur with sharp teeth and two "
"prominent bony crests on its head, with ragged strips of ripped flesh hanging "
"down like a frill.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and "
"swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "一具蹒跚而行的中型恐龙尸体，牙齿很锋利，头部有两个突出的骨冠，上面撕裂的血肉像褶边一样垂落下来。它的整个身体被肿胀的肌肉和溃烂的伤口撑得十分鼓胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
