"festering wounds."
msgstr "这具厚重装甲的四足恐龙丧尸有一个喙和大量尖刺的骨质尾巴。整个身体都被臃肿的肌肉撑得鼓鼓囊囊，并布满肿胀、溃烂的伤口。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Horned Horror"
msgid_plural "Horned Horrors"
msgstr[0] "戴角恐怖"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Horned Horror"
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur corpse has a horny beak, two bony "
"rings protecting the neck, a horn studded and bone plated back, and a long "
"tail ending in a heavy club of bone.  Its entire body bulges with distended "
"muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "这只四足恐龙丧尸身披厚重的装甲，其喙坚硬，脖颈则有两个骨环保护，镶角镀骨的后背，长尾末端长有沉重的骨槌。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Cutler Crusher"
msgid_plural "Cutler Crushers"
msgstr[0] "恐怖厚甲龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Cutler Crusher"
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur corpse has several long spikes "
"along the back and a long spiked tail ending in a club of bone.  Its entire "
"body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "这只身披厚重装甲的四足恐龙丧尸，背部长有尖刺，骨质的尾巴上缀满刺突，长尾巴在末端长有沉重的骨槌。整个身体被肿胀的肌肉和溃烂的伤口撑得十分鼓胀。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Sinewy Striker"
msgid_plural "Sinewy Strikers"
msgstr[0] "恐怖库纳姆龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Sinewy Striker"
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a feathered dinosaur with grossly-bulging legs, "
"massive hulking shoulders, a vicious pointed beak and long powerful tail.  "
"Its tattered feathers are stained with black, sticky liquid."
msgstr "一具体表覆盖着破碎羽毛和黑色腐臭液体的蹒跚而行的两足恐龙尸体。它的两条腿肌肉变得肿胀，肩膀宽阔，长着尖利的喙和有力的尾巴。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
