msgid_plural "Dry Destroyers"
msgstr[0] "恐怖犹他齿龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Dry Destroyer"
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a feathered, bipedal dinosaur with grossly-bulging "
"legs, long thick neck, and a vicious pointed beak.  Its tattered feathers are "
"stained with black, sticky liquid."
msgstr "一具体表覆盖着破碎羽毛和黑色腐臭液体的蹒跚而行的两足恐龙尸体。它的两条腿肌肉变得肿胀，有着长粗的脖子和尖利的喙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
