msgstr "一具体表覆盖着破碎羽毛和黑色腐臭液体的蹒跚而行的大型两足恐龙尸体。它的两条腿肌肉变得肿胀，肩膀宽阔，长着尖喙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Inevitable Iguanodon"
msgid_plural "Inevitable Iguanodons"
msgstr[0] "Inevitable Iguanodons"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Inevitable Iguanodon"
msgid ""
"A bulky, four-legged dinosaur with a beak and spiked thumbs, dead but "
"walking, eyes vacant and swollen.  Its entire body bulges with distended "
"muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "一种体型庞大的四足恐龙，长着喙和尖刺的拇指，已经死了，但还能行走，眼睛空洞且肿胀。 它的整个身体都鼓起来，肌肉膨胀，伤口肿胀，溃烂。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
