#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dilophosaurus nightstalker"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of a "
"bulky bipedal dinosaur with sharp teeth and bulges on the head."
msgstr "一团怪诞的阴影笼罩着这个生物。你可以辨认出一只双足恐龙的轮廓，长着锋利的牙齿，头部凸起。"

