"like a fully loaded long haul truck with mounted flamethrowers and robotic "
"arms."
msgstr "一大坨破烂发臭的血肉，托着巨大的牙齿。它浑身上下看起来像一辆满载的长途卡车，装有喷火器和机械臂。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Allosaurus Le Truck"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Tyruckusaurus Rex"
msgid "Giant flames erupt from the truck!"
msgstr "Giant flames erupt from the truck!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
