#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal beaked juggernaut"
msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around its "
"form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisting pointed "
"beak suggest some kind of beaked, two legged dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"这只丑陋的巨型怪兽浑身布满了骨板，畸形的血肉拖拽着其沉重而尖锐的四肢。本就强大且危险的躯体长出了许多保护的骨甲。而这骨甲还在增长、增长、不断增长。它的外形和"
"扭曲的尖喙表明它曾经是某种长喙双足恐龙。"

