"You are familiar with general dinosaur anatomy, and can exploit potential "
"weaknesses."
msgstr "你熟悉一般恐龍的解剖結構，可以利用潛在的弱點。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "Rejoice.  The great eaters have returned"
msgstr "欢呼吧。大食客们回来了"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid ""
"There is a detailed drawing of a predator dinosaur with an arrow pointing at "
"the mouth and the note 'INSERT HERE'."
msgstr "这里画着一只栩栩如生的食肉恐龙，图上有个箭头指向嘴，并注明'插入此处'。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "<given_name> is dinosaur lunch"
msgstr "<given_name>是個恐龍午餐。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "<given_name> + troodon"
msgstr "<given_name> ♥ 伤齿龙"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "Dinos, zombies, it doesn't matter"
msgstr "恐龍還是殭屍，都不重要了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "Learn to fly!  Mess with a big dino!"
msgstr "学会飞翔！干死大恐龙！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "T REX ET ME"
msgstr "霸王龙 吃 我"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "I give up, I'm joining the dinosaurs"
msgstr "我放弃了，去喂恐龙了"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "This is a cartoon rendition of a long necked four legged dinosaur."
msgstr "这是一只卡通化的长颈四足恐龙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid ""
"This is a cartoon rendition of a long necked reptile with four fins for "
"swimming."
msgstr "这是一只卡通化的长颈恐龙，有着四个用来游泳的脚蹼。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "This is a crudely spray painted tag adorned with dinosaur skulls."
msgstr "这上面有个粗糙喷绘而成的用恐龙头骨装饰的涂鸦标记。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "KILL ALL DINOSAURS"
msgstr "殺光恐龍"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/graffiti.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm but
#. post dino
msgid "Don't believe the government, the dinosaurs are real!"
msgstr "別相信政府說的，恐龍都是真的！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Good soldier.  Killed 40 dinos."
msgstr "好士兵。殺了四十隻恐龍。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Bad soldier.  Killed 3 dinos."
msgstr "爛士兵。殺了三隻恐龍。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Fed the great Eaters.  Will be honored for all time."
msgstr "偉大的食者們必將進食。你將受到人們永恆的尊敬。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Meh scientist but a good friend."
msgstr "馬馬虎虎的科學家，但是個好朋友。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Loved dinosaurs.  Should have run."
msgstr "太爱恐龙了。应该逃的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Died tragically rescuing his family from a burning tyrannosaurus."
msgstr "从着火的霸王龙嘴下救出亲友时不幸身亡。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Died wrestling a mosasaurus.  It was not just a big gator."
msgstr "死于同沧龙摔跤。那可不仅仅是一只大鳄鱼。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Built a beautiful farm and filled it with dangerous dinosaurs."
msgstr "造了一个美丽的农场，并往其中塞满危险的恐龙。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Life did not find a way."
msgstr "生命並沒有找到出路。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid ""
"The greatest dinosaur expert of our times.  Crushed to death by an "
"apatosaurus."
msgstr "我们这个时代最伟大的恐龙专家。被一只迷惑龙压死。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid ""
"Fool hid in a cardboard box from a deinonychus, shouting Dino Dave!  Didn't "
"work."
msgstr "这傻子躲在一只恐爪龙纸板箱里，喊着什么恐龙·戴夫！这没用。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid "Here lies a dinosaur, don't know what kind.  Hated shovels."
msgstr "这里躺着一只恐龙，不知道是什么种。讨厌铲子。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/grave_labels.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "grave_label"
msgid ""
"Alonso did not know her, but she was beautiful and majestic and she deserved "
"the proper burial.  Alonso will remember this dinosaur for some of the time."
msgstr "阿隆索不认识她，但她美丽而威严，她理应得到应有的安葬。阿隆索会偶尔缅怀这只恐龙的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"I've seen some big dinosaurs out there.  I know that should be scary, but all "
"I felt was hungry."
msgstr "我在附近看到一些大恐龍。我知道這應該聽起來很可怕，但我只覺得餓。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"I think those little dinosaurs are kind of cute, like a cat kind of.  Do you "
"think they eat cat food?"
msgstr "我觉得那些小恐龙有点可爱，就像一只猫。你觉得他们吃猫食吗？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid "Dinosaurs are a bow hunter's best friend.  Feathers forever!"
msgstr "恐龙是弓箭猎手最好的朋友。永远的羽毛！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"I saw one of those feathered dinosaurs up close and it had these beautiful "
"soft downy feathers under the big ones.  I bet if you could pluck one you "
"could make a nice dino feather mattress."
msgstr "我近距离地看到了那些有羽毛的恐龙，它在大的羽毛下有这些美丽的柔软的绒毛。我敢打赌，如果你能拔掉一根，你可以做一个漂亮的恐龙羽毛床垫。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"Those big dinosaurs make a big mess.  If only there was some way to harness "
"the power of those poops for the uplift of all mankind.  Maybe a renewable "
"energy source, or a construction material, or super dino fertilizer"
msgstr "这些大恐龙制造了大混乱。如果有某种方法可以利用这些大便的力量来提高全人类的地位就好了。也许是一种可再生能源，或者是一种建筑材料，或者是超级恐龙肥料。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"A buddy of mine wandered close to the swamps and was eaten by a T-Rex, a big "
"lizard.  I'd be careful unless you have a gun and plenty of ammo."
msgstr "我的一个朋友在沼泽地附近徘徊，被一只长得像蜥蜴一样的大霸王龙吃掉了。除非你有枪和很多弹药否则我会小心的。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"I hear the zombies have been in the swamps.  Bad news if they bite a dinosaur "
"before it bites them."
msgstr "我听说在沼泽里有丧尸。如果它们在被恐龙咬到之前咬了它，那可是个坏消息。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"I know there aren't alligators in the sewer, but I heard there was some kind "
"of big lizard down there.  Probably not a good idea to check."
msgstr "我知道下水道里没有鳄鱼，但我听说那里有一种大蜥蜴。最好还是别去弄清楚了。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"Some of those big dinosaurs seem halfway all right.  I bet if you fed them "
"something nice and gave them a pet you could ride them like a pony.  Or maybe "
"they'd eat you instead."
msgstr "有些大型恐龙看起来没那么可怕。我敢打赌，如果你给他们吃点好吃的东西，拍拍它们，你就能像匹小马一样骑上它们。或者它们会直接吃了你。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"I saw something with a large fin in the water.  It was the size of a whale "
"and gave me a menacing feeling.  I'm gonna think twice before going back "
"there."
msgstr "我看见水里有个长着大鳍的东西。它有鲸鱼那么大，给我一种恐怖感觉。看来我要三思而后行。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"One time I found a strange egg out in the woods.  It was probably a dinosaur, "
"but I cooked it and it was pretty good!"
msgstr "有一次我在树林里发现了一个奇怪的鸡蛋。可能是恐龙蛋，但我煮了它，味道那可是相当得好！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"One time I found a giant egg out in the woods.  I ate it raw all at once and "
"then got sick all over.  Maybe I should have cooked it and eaten it bit by "
"bit?"
msgstr "有一次我在森林里发现了一枚巨大的鸡蛋。我一口气把它生吃光了，结果浑身上下大病了一场。也许我应该把它煮熟，一点一点地吃？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"I got a bunch of these big lizards to follow me around and it was great and "
"then they smashed up the place I was staying and then a bunch of other places "
"I wanted to set up camp in.  Maybe I should have tied them down?"
msgstr "我身后有一大群大蜥蜴跟着我，这很好，然后它们毁了我住的地方，然后又毁了许多我想扎营的地方。也许我应该把它们拴起来？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/hints.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
msgid ""
"I heard some loud smashing outside a cabin I was in out in the swamp and "
"figured it was nothing.  Then a hungry dinosaur smashed right through the "
"wall and I ran!"
msgstr "我在沼泽地里的一间小木屋外听到了几声巨响，我以为没什么。 然后，一只饥饿的恐龙直接砸穿了墙，我赶紧跑了！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local wildlife exhibit, claiming to have new "
"and exciting animals on display.  Strangely, the only imagery on it is a "
"stylized silhouette of a T. Rex.  The flier reads \"Witness the rebirth of "
"the extinct, grand opening this week!\""
msgstr ""
"这是一个当地野生动物展览会的广告，上面正展示着新奇的动物。奇怪的是，上面唯一的生物影像是一只霸王龙。传单写着\""
"宏大的开幕，本周你将见证这早已灭绝生物的重生！\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"SWAMPS BAD TEETH HUGE OHGOD\""
msgstr "「沼澤壞壞 牙齒大大 喔天」"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"Why is that place just fucking crawling with lizards?\""
msgstr "\"为什么这地方他妈的全都是蜥蜴？\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I bet dinosaurs can read and play chess so don't eat us because we can "
"teach you important things like magnets and ramen\""
msgstr "\"我敢打赌恐龙会读书下棋，所以请不要吃我们，因为我们可以教你一些重要的东西，比如磁铁和拉面。\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"where's some .700 t-rex medicine when you need it?\""
msgstr "\"当你需要.700霸王龙药剂的时候它在哪里？\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"So is this what happens when you stray off the path and step on a "
"butterfly?\""
msgstr "\"那么这就是你迷路然后踩到一只蝴蝶后发生的事情？\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"But even a much older gent  Sees itself forced to wander  He goes by the "
"name Diplodocus  And belongs among the fossils  Mr. Carnegie packs him "
"joyfully  Into giant arks  And sends him as gift  To several monarchs\""
msgstr "\"昔有古圣贤，自隐江湖中，梁龙为其名，化石藏其身，卡耐基氏掘之，喜送方舟上，包装作重礼，传于王庭间\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"What the hell is a brown and magenta 4 legged juvenile?!  Fucker took a "
"dozen or more .308 rounds to put down.  Gives a ton of fucking meat\""
msgstr "\"这只个棕色和品红的四条腿的幼龙到底是什么？！他妈的用了十几发 .308 子弹才把它干掉。给了他妈的一吨肉\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid "\"I saw the most beautiful dinosaur today.  I must dress her.\""
msgstr "\"我今天看到了最漂亮的恐龙。我必须给她穿衣服。\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"I saw this one dinosaur and I was like gorge.  And then I saw this other "
"dinosaur and I was like gooorge!  And then I saw this other one and I was "
"like gorgosaurus!  Like for real.\""
msgstr "\"我看到了一只恐龙，我当时就哇了一声。然后我看到了另一只恐龙，我当时就哇~~了！然后我又看到了另一只恐龙，我当时就叫到戈尔冈龙~~！就像真的一样。\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"\"KILL ALL DINOSAURS.  DO NOT TAKE THEIR DRUGS.  DO NOT LISTEN TO THEIR LIES. "
" THEY ARE BEAUTIFUL AND WE WILL KILL THEM UNTIL WE DIE AND THEN WE WILL RISE "
"AGAIN AND KILL THEM SOME MORE.  ANYONE WHO SAYS DIFFERENT IS THE ENEMY.\""
msgstr "\"杀死所有恐龙。不要吃下它们的毒药。不要听从它们的谎言。它们很美丽，我们会杀死它们直到死亡，然后我们会复生再杀死它们一次。任何说法不同的人都是敌人。\""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
msgid ""
"MANY MISSING: A wave of missing persons reports have shaken an already "
"troubled nation, especially among members of the popular Swampers religion "
"and hotel and casino chain.  Asked to comment, their charismatic CEO Bo "
"Baronyx refused to explain their whereabouts, saying only 'The great eaters "
"have returned and they will be sated' and winked and smiled in the most "
"charming way.  The Swampers are doing their part in this crisis and are "
"accepting donations of meat and money to feed the hungry."
msgstr ""
"《许多失踪者》最近一波失踪人口报告再次动摇了这个已经陷入困境的国家，特别是关于广受欢迎的沼泽教成员的失踪报告，该宗教广泛开设了酒店及赌场连锁店。当被问及评论"
"时，该宗教集团魅力四射的首席执行官博·巴罗尼克拒绝解释成员的行踪，只说\"大食客们回来了，他们会满足的\""
"，并以最迷人的方式对着镜头眨眼和微笑。沼泽教成员们在这场危机中尽了自己的一份力量，他们接受捐赠的肉类和金钱来满足饥饿的人们。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
msgid ""
"CUTEST VISITORS: A mysterious portal of shimmering blue energy and flashing "
"lights opened above Cretaceous Kindergarten today, showering children with "
"the cutest tiny fuzzy dinosaurs and dinosaur babies.  Local paleontologist "
"and exotic dancer Othniel Marsh expressed skepticism that dinosaurs had not "
"died out millions of years ago but 'at this point why not, at least they're "
"cute'.  And cute they are!"
msgstr ""
"《最可爱的游客》今天在白垩纪幼儿园的上空，一个闪烁着蓝色能量和闪光灯的神秘传送门开启了，给孩子们带来了最可爱的毛茸茸的恐龙和恐龙宝宝。当地古生物学家和艳舞女"
"郎奥特尼尔·马什对此表示怀疑，称恐龙早在数百万年前就已经灭绝了，但\"在这一点上为什么不呢，至少它们很可爱\"。它们真的很可爱！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
msgid ""
"DENIES DINOSAURS: FEMA official Ernst Stromer said late last night that the "
"cities are not safe and reports of dinosaurs outside the cities are wrong and "
"'possibly drug-related' but cautioned refugees to 'get all the guns you can' "
"because 'it's bad out there'."
msgstr ""
"《否认恐龙存在》联邦应急管理局官员恩斯特·斯特罗默昨晚晚间表示，城市已经变得不安全了，而关于城市外面有恐龙的报道是错误的，而且\"可能与毒品有关\""
"，但他警告难民\"尽你所能带上枪\"，因为\"外面情况很糟糕\"。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
msgid ""
"NEVER HUMANS?: Swamper scientists report that in every historical simulation "
"they have run, humans never evolve, with dinosaurs remaining the dominant "
"life form to present day in every model unless an artificial disaster event "
"is introduced.  'Fear not, this world is healing, we will return to normal "
"soon' reports Swamper CEO Bo Baronyx confidently.  Sounds like good news "
"ahead!"
msgstr ""
"《人类不曾存在？》沼泽教科学家报导称在他们进行的所有历史模拟中，人类都从未出现过，而恐龙则继续作为主导性的物种存在至今，除非在模型中人为引入灾难性事件。\""
"不要害怕，世界正在痊愈，我们不久就会恢复正常\"，沼泽教CEO博·巴罗尼克斯信心满满地说道。听起来是好消息！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
msgid ""
"GOD IS A DINOSAUR?:  Colorful FEMA official and slug mutant Ernst Stromer "
"reported this morning that he has 'seen god and she is a hungry torvosaurus "
"too beautiful for this world'.  He says that she 'cannot be harmed by "
"bullets' and that she is 'made of beautiful golden light from above' and she "
"demands human flesh.  Stromer says that every fighting man and woman must go "
"to her to be destroyed by her 'atomic majesty'.  Good news America!"
msgstr ""
"《上帝是只恐龙？》经历丰富的联邦应急管理局官员及蛞蝓变种人恩斯特·斯特罗默今早宣布，他\"见到了上帝，她是只饥饿的蛮龙，对这个世界来说太美了\"。他说她\""
"不会被子弹伤害\"，她是\"来自上天的美丽金光\"，而且她需要人肉。斯特罗默说，每一个战斗的男人和女人都必须去她那里，被她的\"核子威严\""
"所摧毁。好消息，美国！"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "dino-reports"
msgid ""
"\n"
"IMMERSION LOG: 30D-A\n"
"\n"
"PRELIMINARY REPORT:\n"
"\n"
"SUMMARY:\n"
"Exploration into sub-scape 30-D revealed biosphere similar to prime, similar "
"to previous sub-scapes in same frequency.  Expedition team reported visual "
"contact with several reptoids ('dinosaurs') and warm, humid conditions.  "
"Though one reptoid made visual contact with the expedition team and "
"approached, all members were returned with no incident.  Refer to previous "
"sub-scape system 30 reports and meta-comparison report for further "
"information."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"沉浸日志：30D-A\n"
"\n"
"初步报告：\n"
"\n"
"概述：\n"
"对30-D亚位面的探索揭示出类似于主位面以及以前相同频率的亚位面的生物圈。探险队报告说，他们目击了几只爬行动物（\"恐龙\""
"）以及温暖潮湿的环境。尽管其中一只爬行动物发现了探险队并接近，但所有队员都顺利返回主位面。有关更多信息，请参阅先前的亚位面30系统报告和Meta分析报告。"

