#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "HEDP grenade cartridge"
msgid ""
"A grenade cartridge with a high explosive dual purpose load, capable of "
"producing good penetration and a high number of damaging fragments.  Good for "
"armored or soft targets."
msgstr "一颗破片榴弹，有个高爆两用弹头，能产生大量穿甲及伤害都很高的碎片。对装甲及软目标均能有效杀伤。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "beanbag grenade cartridge"
msgid_plural "beanbag grenade cartridges"
msgstr[0] "豆袋榴彈"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "beanbag grenade cartridge"
msgid ""
"A less-lethal beanbag grenade cartridge that delivers strong impact on "
"target, causing major pain and disorientation.  May still injure or kill."
msgstr "一款低初速低杀伤榴弹，弹头内装着泡沫和塑料弹丸，目的是使得受攻击目标疼痛并迷失方向。但仍可能造成伤害并导致死亡。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flare grenade cartridge"
msgid_plural "flare grenade cartridges"
msgstr[0] "照明榴彈"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "flare grenade cartridge"
msgid ""
"A signal flare grenade cartridge.  It will burn brightly for up to a minute, "
"and will also leave a streak of smoke cover in its wake."
msgstr "一颗照明榴弹。它会明亮地燃烧大约一分钟，并同时会在它的飞行轨迹上留下一道烟雾的痕迹。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "buckshot grenade cartridge"
msgid_plural "buckshot grenade cartridges"
msgstr[0] "獵鹿榴彈"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "buckshot grenade cartridge"
msgid ""
"A grenade cartridge with a powerful buckshot load, designed to provide some "
"defensive options when carrying a grenade launcher."
msgstr "一颗使用猎鹿弹弹头的榴弹。设计为榴弹发射器使用者提供一些防御弹药选择。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "smoke grenade cartridge"
msgid_plural "smoke grenade cartridges"
msgstr[0] "煙霧榴彈"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "smoke grenade cartridge"
msgid "A grenade cartridge grenade designed to provide smoke cover."
msgstr "一颗设计用来提供烟幕掩护的榴弹。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "teargas grenade cartridge"
msgid_plural "teargas grenade cartridges"
msgstr[0] "催淚瓦斯榴彈"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "teargas grenade cartridge"
msgid ""
"A grenade cartridge with a teargas load.  It will disburse a cloud of highly "
"incapacitating gas."
msgstr "一颗催泪瓦斯榴弹。它爆炸后会散发的气雾能使目标暂时丧失战斗力。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "slug grenade cartridge"
msgid_plural "slug grenade cartridges"
msgstr[0] "獨頭榴彈"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "slug grenade cartridge"
msgid ""
"A grenade cartridge loaded with a massive bullet.  Say goodbye to your "
"shoulder, I guess."
msgstr "一颗独头榴弹，里面装着一颗巨大的弹头。我想跟你的肩膀说再见吧。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pistol ammo, ball"
msgid_plural "pistol ammo, ball"
msgstr[0] "手槍球型彈"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol.json
#. ~ Description of "pistol ammo, ball"
msgid ""
"Modern ubiquitous medium pistol ammo, popularized by usage in two wars and "
"almost a century of post-war defensive and duty usage.  'Ball' is an old term "
"for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better "
"reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr ""
"近现代四处可见的中型手枪弹药，在两次世界大战和战后长达一个世纪的防御和执勤行动中得到广泛使用。全金属被甲弹在早期又被称为球形弹，与普通铅弹相比，它能减少残垢"
"，提高枪械可靠性，并略微提高穿透力。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pistol ammo, JHP"
msgid_plural "pistol ammo, JHP"
msgstr[0] "手枪空尖弹"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol.json
#. ~ Description of "pistol ammo, JHP"
msgid ""
"Modern ubiquitous medium pistol ammo, popularized by usage in two wars and "
"almost a century of post-war defensive and duty usage.  Jacketed Hollow "
"Points are defensive/duty projectiles that are more destructive to tissue "
"than plain ball ammunition, and slightly reduce overpenetration concerns."
msgstr ""
"近现代四处可见的中型手枪弹药，在两次世界大战和战后长达一个世纪的防御和执勤行动中得到广泛使用。空尖弹是一种防御/"
"执勤用弹，比普通被甲弹对软组织的破坏性更大，并且稍微降低了对弹药过穿的担忧。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pistol ammo, ball (reloaded)"
msgid_plural "pistol ammo, ball (reloaded)"
msgstr[0] "手枪被甲弹（复装）"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/pistol.json
