msgstr[0] "步枪被甲弹"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
#. ~ Description of "rifle ammo, ball"
msgid ""
"Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for "
"international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defense, and these "
"days, zombies.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which "
"offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration "
"compared to plain lead."
msgstr ""
"现代步枪弹药，十分常见，价格实惠。它被广泛用于各类国际冲突，狩猎大小猎物，家庭防卫，而现在，对付丧尸。全金属被甲弹在早期又被称为球形弹，与普通铅弹相比，它能"
"减少残垢，提高枪械可靠性，并略微提高穿透力。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rifle ammo, AP"
msgid_plural "rifle ammo, AP"
msgstr[0] "步枪穿甲弹"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
#. ~ Description of "rifle ammo, AP"
msgid ""
"Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for "
"international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defense, and these "
"days, zombies.  This 'armor piercing' variant features a mild steel "
"penetrator for environmental friendliness, improved barrier penetration, and "
"enhanced effect on armor."
msgstr ""
"现代步枪弹药，十分常见，价格实惠。它被广泛用于各类国际冲突，狩猎大小猎物，家庭防卫，而现在，对付丧尸。这个\"穿甲\""
"型号采用了软钢钢芯作为穿甲部件，十分环保，提高了穿透障碍物能力，以及增强了穿甲后效。"

