msgstr[0] "磁軌砲步槍彈藥"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
#. ~ Description of "railgun rifle ammo"
msgid ""
"Projectile used for a railgun.  It's made of a ferromagnetic metal, probably "
"cobalt."
msgstr "磁軌砲專用投射物。由磁性金屬製成，可能是鈷。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "foreign cannon rifle ammo, ball"
msgid_plural "foreign cannon rifle ammo, ball"
msgstr[0] "异国加农步枪被甲弹"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
#. ~ Description of "foreign cannon rifle ammo, ball"
msgid ""
"Foreign cannon rifle ammo brought by the Exodii, capable to destroy lightly "
"armored vehicles, as well as highly armored mutants."
msgstr ""
"Foreign cannon rifle ammo brought by the Exodii, capable to destroy lightly "
"armored vehicles, as well as highly armored mutants."

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "huge rifle ammo, ball"
msgid_plural "huge rifle ammo, ball"
msgstr[0] "大型步枪被甲弹"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
#. ~ Description of "huge rifle ammo, ball"
msgid ""
"Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and big "
"game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other materiel, "
"or hunting extremely large game.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal "
"jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and "
"slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr ""
"这种类型的大型步枪弹药填补了轻型火炮和狩猎步枪之间的空白。它能够用于对付轻型载具和其他装备器材，或狩猎特别大的猎物。全金属被甲弹在早期又被称为球形弹，与普通"
"铅弹相比，它能减少残垢，提高枪械可靠性，并略微提高穿透力。"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "huge rifle ammo, AP"
msgid_plural "huge rifle ammo, AP"
msgstr[0] "大型步枪穿甲弹"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
#. ~ Description of "huge rifle ammo, AP"
msgid ""
"Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and big "
"game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other materiel, "
"or hunting extremely large game.  These armor piercing munitions feature "
"tungsten steel penetrators for use against light-skinned vehicles."
msgstr ""
"像它这样的大型步枪弹药填补了轻型火炮和狩猎步枪之间的空白。它能够用于对付轻型载具和其他装备器材，或狩猎特别大的猎物。这些穿甲型号子弹采用了钨芯弹头，能够穿透"
"轻装甲载具。"

