msgstr "它是一个茶壶！"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "iso_robolove_charm_1 ( Its a teapot! )"
msgid "Makes a robot friendly for a very long time."
msgstr "使机器人在很长一段时间内保持友好。"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "iso_robolove_charm_2"
msgid "robot charm"
msgstr "魅惑机器人"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "iso_robolove_charm_2 ( robot charm )"
msgid "!"
msgstr "！"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Deliverator"
msgid ""
"Every night you brave the highway, life-bound to a single promise: \"Your pie "
"in thirty minutes or you can have it free.\"  People can respect that.  You "
"are a role model.  A hero to the hungry.\n"
"\n"
"You gain +1 quickness for each level of normality distortion."
msgstr ""
"每天晚上，你都勇敢地走在高速公路上，一生都恪守着一个承诺：“你的馅饼三十分钟内送达，否则你可以免费得到它。”人们可以尊重这一点。你是一个榜样。饥饿者的英雄。"
"\n"
"\n"
"每级正态变异你都会获得 +1 速度。"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hypocrite's Oath"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I swear by Apollo the Healer, by Asclepius, by Hygieia, by Panacea, and by "
"all the gods and goddesses, making them my witnesses, that I shall deliver, "
"according to my ability and judgment, death.\n"
"\n"
"You temporarily deal 50% more damage after being hurt.  The first time you "
"bandage or disinfect a limb, it instantly heals by 10hp in addition to normal "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"我向疗愈者阿波罗、阿斯克勒庇俄斯、海吉亚、帕纳西亚以及所有的神和女神发誓，让他们成为我的见证人，我将根据我的能力和判断，交付死亡。\n"
"\n"
"受伤后，你会暂时受到50%的伤害。当你第一次包扎或消毒肢体时，它会在正常效果的基础上立即恢复10hp。"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "备份"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Backup"
msgid ""
"We call this a tactical retreat.\n"
"\n"
"You gain +50 movement speed for few moments after successfully dealing "
"ballistic damage."
msgstr ""
"我们称之为战术撤退。\n"
"\n"
"在成功造成弹道伤害后，你会在几分钟内获得+50的移动速度。"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Machine Whisperer"
msgstr "机器语者"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Machine Whisperer"
msgid ""
"Error.  418 //I am a teapot.\n"
"\n"
"Every 20 seconds, there's a small chance for nearby robots to become "
"permanently friendly."
msgstr ""
"错误418//我是个茶壶。\n"
"\n"
"每隔20秒，附近的机器人就有极小几率变为永久同伴。"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ancient Vow"
msgstr "Ancient Vow"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ancient Vow"
msgid ""
"A lifetime ago you swore to protect your vanished homeland.  This oath binds "
"you still.\n"
"\n"
"You cannot flee from high danger enemies but gain increased damage and "
"stamina regeneration when fighting them."
msgstr ""
"上辈子，你发誓要保护你消失的家园。 你现在仍然遵守着这个誓言。\n"
"\n"
"你无法逃离高度危险的敌人，但在与他们战斗时会造成更高的伤害和获得体力恢复。"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Power Drain"
msgstr "Power Drain"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Power Drain"
msgid ""
"Your cybernetic implants are constantly losing power, but a quirk of their "
"design allows you regain power through murder.\n"
"\n"
"You lose bionic power every second, but melee kills restore power, scaling "
"with the danger level of your target."
msgstr ""
"Your cybernetic implants are constantly losing power, but a quirk of their "
"design allows you regain power through murder.\n"
"\n"
"You lose bionic power every second, but melee kills restore power, scaling "
"with the danger level of your target."

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Archmagister of the Gloaming Tower"
msgstr "Archmagister of the Gloaming Tower"

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Archmagister of the Gloaming Tower"
msgid ""
"You have spent long centuries poring over mouldering tomes and wresting "
"knowledge from spirits who dwell within the translunary spheres and have "
"forgotten more enchantments than some upstart conjurer will ever learn.\n"
"\n"
"When you pick up a ranged weapon, you will absorb its power into a new spell."
msgstr ""
"You have spent long centuries poring over mouldering tomes and wresting "
"knowledge from spirits who dwell within the translunary spheres and have "
"forgotten more enchantments than some upstart conjurer will ever learn.\n"
"\n"
"When you pick up a ranged weapon, you will absorb its power into a new spell."

