#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden prosthetic right arm"
msgid ""
"A prosthetic arm, used as a replacement limb for those missing one.  Dating "
"back to antiquity, this wooden arm was often used by many individuals as a "
"simple way to hide the loss of one of their limbs.  Outside of that, its "
"rigidity and lack of flexibility make it nearly useless for practical "
"purposes, though it can help with very basic tasks, like lifting objects.  "
"This one is for the right arm."
msgstr ""
"一条用于替代缺失肢体的义肢臂。  这种木制手臂可以追溯到古代，常被许多人用作简单的方法来隐藏他们失去肢体的事实。  "
"除此之外，它的刚性和缺乏灵活性使其在使用时几乎毫无用处，尽管它可以帮助完成一些非常基本的任务，例如举起物品。这条是用于右臂的。"

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/armor/arm_prosthetics.json
#. ~ Item name
