#. ~ Vitamin name
msgid "Black Dragon Mutagen"
msgstr "黑龍誘變劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/vitamin.json
#. ~ Vitamin name
msgid "Concentrated Mana Mutagen"
msgstr "濃縮法力誘變劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/alien_mages.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "migo_nethermancer_summon_nether ( Summon
#. Nether Being )"
msgid "a high-pitched whine"
msgstr "一声高亢的呜咽"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "smite"
msgid "Smite"
msgstr "聖擊術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "smite ( Smite )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Smite"
msgid ""
"Evil has become pervasive throughout the world.  Let your power be the light "
"that shines in the darkness!"
msgstr "邪惡已經遍佈世界。讓你的力量成為照亮黑暗的光明。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "recover_mana"
msgid "Life Conversion"
msgstr "生命轉化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_mana ( Life Conversion )"
msgid ""
"You channel lifeforce itself into your spiritual energy.  You consume a rune "
"to regain mana."
msgstr "将你的生命力量导入你的精神能量。消耗符文恢复魔力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "recover_pain"
msgid "Mind over Pain"
msgstr "痛苦鎮壓"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_pain ( Mind over Pain )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mind Over Pain"
msgid ""
"With an intense ritual that resembles crossfit, you manage to put some of "
"your pain at bay."
msgstr "透過一些類似運動的強烈儀式行為，你減輕了你受到的痛苦。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_undead"
msgid "Summon Undead"
msgstr "召唤不死人"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_undead ( Summon Undead )"
msgid ""
"An ethereal-looking undead rises from the depths of the earth to fight for "
"you.  The type of undead you summon get deadlier with increasing spell level."
msgstr "一只从地底深处冒出来的不死人会为你而战。你召唤的不死生物种类会随着法术等级的提高而变得更致命。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_undead_swarm"
msgid "Summon Undead Swarm"
msgstr "召唤不死兽群"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_undead_swarm ( Summon Undead Swarm )"
msgid ""
"A group of undead animals rises from the depths of the earth to fight for "
"you.  The type of undead you summon get deadlier with increasing spell level."
msgstr "一群从地底深处冒出来的不死动物会为你而战。你召唤的不死生物种类会随着法术等级的提高而变得更致命。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "necrotic_gaze"
msgid "Necrotic Gaze"
msgstr "腐壞凝視"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "necrotic_gaze ( Necrotic Gaze )"
msgid ""
"Using the power of blood contained within a rune, you imbue necrotic energy "
"into your gaze, damaging the target you look at."
msgstr "使用存于符文之中的血液力量，将死灵能量注入到你的凝视之中，对你的凝视目标照成伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_animist"
msgid "Animist Rune"
msgstr "泛靈論者符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_animist ( Animist Rune )"
msgid ""
"Performing a ritual, you turn some of your blood into an animist rune.  You "
"can use the rune to summon creatures, or as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr "进行一场仪式，将自身的部分血液转化为泛灵师符文。你可以使用符文来召唤生物，或者作为催化剂用于制造其它物品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dominate"
msgid "Domination"
msgstr "统御丧尸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dominate ( Domination )"
msgid ""
"Force the undead creature you pick to obey your command, making it your ally "
"for a short time."
msgstr "强迫你所选择的不死生物服从你的命令，使其暂时成为盟友。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "life_detonation"
msgid "Life Detonation"
msgstr "生命爆炸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "life_detonation ( Life Detonation )"
msgid ""
"Force life energy into an allied undead, making them explode with tremendous "
"force."
msgstr "将生命能量强行施加于不死生物盟友身上，使其以巨大的威力爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "convert"
msgid "Convert"
msgstr "符文转化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "convert ( Convert )"
msgid ""
"Kill an allied creature, converting its life energy into a compact rune that "
"you can use afterwards."
msgstr "杀死一个友方生物，将其生命能量转化为一个小巧的符文，之后就可以使用了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "soulrend"
msgid "Soulrend"
msgstr "裂魂術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "soulrend ( Soulrend )"
msgid ""
"Violently tears the spirit from the body and binds the resulting shade to "
"your will."
msgstr "猛烈地将灵魂从躯体中撕裂，并将由此产生的暗影束缚在你的意志之下。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "disruption_bolt"
msgid "Disruption Bolt"
msgstr "干擾之箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "disruption_bolt ( Disruption Bolt )"
msgid ""
"Release a resonant bolt of spiritual energy at a nearby target.  It will "
"disrupt the natural link between matter and animus, causing heavy, non-lethal "
"damage."
msgstr "向附近的目标施放出一道共振的精神能量波束。它会破坏物质和灵魂之间的自然联系，造成严重但绝不会致命的伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "wrathful_spirits"
msgid "Wrathful Spirits"
msgstr "愤怒灵魂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Description of spell "wrathful_spirits ( Wrathful Spirits )"
#. ~ Description of spell "feral_high_animist_wrathful_spirits_self ( Wrathful
#. Spirits Summon )"
msgid ""
"Grant brief corporality to orphaned spirits and allow them to fight under "
"your command."
msgstr "赋予孤魂野鬼短暂的肉体，让他们在你的指挥下战斗。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spirit_walk"
msgid "Spirit Walk"
msgstr "灵魂漫步"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spirit_walk ( Spirit Walk )"
msgid ""
"Momentarily plunge into the underworld and swap positions with any spirit you "
"command."
msgstr "短暂地进入冥界，与你所控制下的任何灵魂之一交换位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "banishment_lesser"
msgid "Lesser Banishment"
msgstr "次級放逐術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "banishment_lesser ( Lesser Banishment )"
msgid ""
"Banish a monster to a lesser-known nether dimension.  If a monster is more "
"powerful than you can handle, the spell drains your life force to make up the "
"difference."
msgstr "把怪物放逐到鲜为人知的异界维度之中。如果怪物比你更强大，这个法术会消耗你的生命来弥补其中的差异。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_wisps"
msgid "Ignus Fatuus"
msgstr "召喚鬼火"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_wisps ( Ignus Fatuus )"
msgid ""
"Summons ghostly foxfire worked from living marsh vapor to lead your enemies "
"astray.  With more experience, this spell can conjure multiple ghost lights."
msgstr "从富有生命力的沼泽水蒸气中召唤幽灵般的狐火，把你的敌人引向歧途。当你有更多的施法经验时，这个法术可以召唤出数只发光的鬼火。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bleed"
msgid "Bleed"
msgstr "致傷"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bleed ( Bleed )"
msgid "Agitate old wounds on a creature, causing blood to ooze out of them."
msgstr "撕裂生物身上的旧伤口，使其渗出鲜血。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_summon_decaying_boneclub"
msgid "Decaying Boneclub"
msgstr "腐朽骨棒"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_summon_decaying_boneclub ( Decaying
#. Boneclub )"
msgid ""
"You link your living blood to dead bones, creating a club hungry for the "
"flesh of the living."
msgstr "这个法术将你体内的活血和死者的骨头联系起来，制造出一根渴望收割活物的骨棍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_summon_decaying_boneclub_plus"
msgid "Improved Decaying Boneclub"
msgstr "升级版腐朽骨棍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_summon_decaying_boneclub_plus ( Improved
#. Decaying Boneclub )"
msgid ""
"You link your living blood to dead bones, creating a club hungry for the "
"flesh of the living.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and "
"have started to design your own version."
msgstr "这个法术将你体内的活血和死者的血和骨头联系起来，制造出一根渴望收割活物的骨棍。现在你对这个法术了如指掌，并设计出了你自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "rupture"
msgid "Rupture"
msgstr "魔爆术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "rupture ( Rupture )"
msgid ""
"You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular "
"break-down, internal hemorrhaging, muddling ley lines, and overcharging "
"electronics.  The more powerful the spell, the faster the damage happens.  "
"Immensely gruesome and crude, it was once illegal world-wide, not that it "
"matters now."
msgstr ""
"You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular "
"break-down, internal hemorrhaging, muddling ley lines, and overcharging "
"electronics.  The more powerful the spell, the faster the damage happens.  "
"Immensely gruesome and crude, it was once illegal world-wide, not that it "
"matters now."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "devour"
msgid "Devour"
msgstr "吞噬"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "devour ( Devour )"
msgid "Kill an allied creature, consuming its life energy to regain some health."
msgstr "杀死一只召唤物，吸收它的生命能量来恢复一些血量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_sense_outsiders"
msgid "Sense Outsiders"
msgstr "界外感知"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_sense_outsiders ( Sense Outsiders )"
msgid "You can sense the presence of nearby beings from the Nether."
msgstr "你可以感觉到来自异界的附近生物的存在。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_summon_watcher"
msgid "Summon Watcher Spirit"
msgstr "召唤守望者之魂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_summon_watcher ( Summon Watcher Spirit )"
msgid ""
"Summon a watcher spirit, whose senses overlap with your own and through whose "
"eyes you can see.  Although they are spirits, they are fragile and dissipate "
"easily in the face of any assault."
msgstr "召唤一个守望者之魂，它的感官与你的重叠，你可以通过它的眼睛看到你。 虽然它们是灵魂，但它们很脆弱，面对任何攻击都很容易消散。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_mass_hiding_aoe"
msgid "A Shadow in the Crowd"
msgstr "泯然众人"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_mass_hiding_aoe ( A Shadow in the Crowd )"
msgid ""
"Sever the connections between your spirit and the spirits of everyone around "
"you, rendering them incapable of perceiving you; the light might hit their "
"eyes and the sounds their ears, but they cannot recognize what those "
"impressions mean.  Anything outside the spell's area of effect will have no "
"trouble spotting you.\n"
"\n"
"This spell does not affect any target without a spirit, such as a robot."
msgstr ""
"Sever the connections between your spirit and the spirits of everyone around "
"you, rendering them incapable of perceiving you; the light might hit their "
"eyes and the sounds their ears, but they cannot recognize what those "
"impressions mean.  Anything outside the spell's area of effect will have no "
"trouble spotting you.\n"
"\n"
"This spell does not affect any target without a spirit, such as a robot."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_luck_bone"
msgid "Osseous Luck"
msgstr "骨之幸运"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_luck_bone ( Osseous Luck )"
msgid ""
"Attract spirits of good fortune to a bone, granting minor bonuses as long as "
"it is carried.  Though benevolent, the spirits are capricious, and exactly "
"what benefits they will provide cannot be determined ahead of time.  The bone "
"crumbles to dust when the spell duration expires and the spirits leave."
msgstr ""
"将好运灵吸引到骨头上，只要它被携带，就会给你提供少量加成。虽然本性善良，但灵是难以捉摸的，它所提供的加成完全无法事前确定。当法术持续时间结束，灵离开时，骨头"
"会碎成粉末。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_spirit_walking"
msgid "Spirit-Walking"
msgstr "灵魂漫步"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_spirit_walking ( Spirit-Walking )"
msgid ""
"Transform your body to pure spirit, making you invisible and intangible.  You "
"can move incredibly quickly while the spell is in effect and can pass by "
"enemies unseen, but you will be unable to affect the physical world or cast "
"spells."
msgstr "将你的身体转化为纯粹的灵体，使你隐身且无形。在法术生效期间，你可以快速移动，并且可以在隐身状态下穿过敌人，但你将无法与物理世界交互或者施法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects_monster.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_add_evasion_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_animist_add_evasion"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_feral_animist_guardian_spirit"
msgid "Guardian Spirit"
msgstr "守护之灵"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_add_evasion_spell ( Guardian Spirit )"
msgid ""
"Summon a benevolent spirit to keep watch over you and warn you of imminent "
"attacks, allowing you to dodge some of them."
msgstr "召唤一个友善的灵魂来为你警戒，并提醒你即将到来的攻击，让你能够闪避掉其中的部分攻击。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_slow_food_rotting_spell"
msgid "Abjure Spirits of Rot"
msgstr "驱逐腐败"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_slow_food_rotting_spell ( Abjure Spirits of
#. Rot )"
msgid ""
"Placing a warding on food or drink, preventing the spirits of decay from "
"nesting within it.  The mage may affect as much food or drink as they can "
"carry.  The principles by which this spell functions were not discovered "
"until the 20th century, but some animists maintain that radiation is "
"frightening to decay spirits."
msgstr ""
"Placing a warding on food or drink, preventing the spirits of decay from "
"nesting within it.  The mage may affect as much food or drink as they can "
"carry.  The principles by which this spell functions were not discovered "
"until the 20th century, but some animists maintain that radiation is "
"frightening to decay spirits."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_magic_fissile"
msgid "Magic Fissile"
msgstr "魔法裂变"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_magic_fissile ( Magic Fissile )"
msgid "I cast Magic… Fissile?  At the darkness?"
msgstr "我发射魔法……裂变？在黑暗中？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_cast_spells_when_silent"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_animist_vocalize"
msgid "The Inner Voice"
msgstr "心灵之声"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_cast_spells_when_silent ( The Inner Voice
#. )"
msgid ""
"Channel magic through your soul instead of your voice, allowing you to cast "
"spells that require speech even when mute."
msgstr ""
"Channel magic through your soul instead of your voice, allowing you to cast "
"spells that require speech even when mute."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_do_psionic_damage_to_head"
msgid "Mind Crush"
msgstr "意志击溃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_do_psionic_damage_to_head ( Mind Crush )"
msgid ""
"Directly assault the target's spirit, bypassing any physical protections they "
"have."
msgstr "绕过目标的所有物理防护，直击其心灵。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_detect_wizards"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_animist_detect_wizards"
msgid "Witchsight"
msgstr "巫术视觉"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_detect_wizards ( Witchsight )"
msgid ""
"Open your senses up to look for the bright corporeal ley lines of those who "
"spent their lives frequently expending their mana.  This also applies to "
"creatures or alien beings that frequently use spells."
msgstr ""
"Open your senses up to look for the bright corporeal ley lines of those who "
"spent their lives frequently expending their mana.  This also applies to "
"creatures or alien beings that frequently use spells."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "light_healing"
msgid "Knit the Rent Flesh"
msgstr "Knit the Rent Flesh"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "light_healing ( Knit the Rent Flesh )"
msgid ""
"Cause the target's wounds to writhe, the flesh to crawl back together, and "
"their injuries to heal.  Disturbing, and painful, but effective."
msgstr ""
"Cause the target's wounds to writhe, the flesh to crawl back together, and "
"their injuries to heal.  Disturbing, and painful, but effective."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pain_split"
msgid "Pain Split"
msgstr "痛苦均分"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pain_split ( Pain Split )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Pain Split"
msgid "Evens out damage among your limbs."
msgstr "將你的傷痛平均分配到肢體上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "vicious_tentacle"
msgid "Vicious Tentacle"
msgstr "邪惡之觸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "vicious_tentacle ( Vicious Tentacle )"
msgid ""
"This spell extrudes a long and nasty whiplike tentacle of sharp bones and "
"oozing acid from your body, which has a long reach attack and vicious damage."
msgstr ""
"This spell extrudes a long and nasty whiplike tentacle of sharp bones and "
"oozing acid from your body, which has a long reach attack and vicious damage."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "vicious_tentacle_plus"
msgid "Evolved Vicious Tentacle"
msgstr "进化版残暴之鞭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "vicious_tentacle_plus ( Evolved Vicious Tentacle )"
msgid ""
"This spell extrudes a long and nasty whiplike tentacle of sharp bones and "
"oozing acid from your body, which has a long reach attack and vicious damage. "
" Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and start to design your "
"own version."
msgstr ""
"This spell extrudes a long and nasty whiplike tentacle of sharp bones and "
"oozing acid from your body, which has a long reach attack and vicious damage. "
" Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and start to design your "
"own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_grotesque"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bio_boost"
msgid "Grotesque Enhancement"
msgstr "奇異強化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_grotesque ( Grotesque Enhancement )"
msgid ""
"A spell that warps your body in foreign, unnatural ways to increase your "
"physical abilities and strength."
msgstr ""
"A spell that warps your body in foreign, unnatural ways to increase your "
"physical abilities and strength."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_acidicspray"
msgid "Acidic Spray"
msgstr "酸性噴霧"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_acidicspray ( Acidic Spray )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Acidic Spray"
msgid ""
"When cast, the mage opens his mouth and sprays acid in a wide cone to "
"dissolve his foes into goo.  Just imagine what he'll do with the goo."
msgstr "當施展時，法師張開他的嘴並噴吐出腐蝕性酸液到圓錐狀區域，使目標溶解成黏液狀。你可以想像最後他該怎麼處理這些噁心的黏液。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_fleshpouch"
msgid "Flesh Pouch"
msgstr "血肉口袋"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_fleshpouch ( Flesh Pouch )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flesh Pouch"
msgid ""
"This spell grows a large pouch out of your skin on your back, allowing you to "
"store your gear in it."
msgstr "這個法術使你背後的皮膚長出一個大口袋，使你可以將裝備儲存在其中。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_bonespear"
msgid "Conjure Bonespear"
msgstr "咒法骨矛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_bonespear ( Conjure Bonespear )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Conjure Bonespear"
msgid ""
"This spell creates a long shaft of bone with a wicked point and blades along "
"its length."
msgstr "這個法術創造一把邪惡的骨矛，除手柄外整把都是尖銳的刀鋒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_bonespear_plus"
msgid "Evolved Conjure Bonespear"
msgstr "进化版白骨之矛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_bonespear_plus ( Evolved Conjure Bonespear )"
msgid ""
"This spell creates a long shaft of bone with a wicked point and blades along "
"its length.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"This spell creates a long shaft of bone with a wicked point and blades along "
"its length.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_biomancer"
msgid "Biomancer Rune"
msgstr "生機術士符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_biomancer ( Biomancer Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual grows a small nub of flesh on you, which quickly falls off and "
"turns into a rune attuned to Biomancers.  You can use the rune as a catalyst "
"for recipes."
msgstr ""
"This ritual grows a small nub of flesh on you, which quickly falls off and "
"turns into a rune attuned to Biomancers.  You can use the rune as a catalyst "
"for recipes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_paralytic_dart"
msgid "Paralytic Dart"
msgstr "麻痺飛鏢"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_paralytic_dart ( Paralytic Dart )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Paralytic Dart"
msgid ""
"Spits a warped needle of sinew and bone, carrying with it a sting that slows "
"your victim."
msgstr "喷射出一根由筋腱与骨头纠缠而成的扭曲细针，它造成的螫刺会迟缓受害者。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_visceral_projection"
msgid "Visceral Projection"
msgstr "髒污投射"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_visceral_projection ( Visceral Projection
#. )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Visceral Projection"
msgid ""
"Projects a spray of acrid blood and gore all around you, growing to ensnare "
"your prey in a field of twitching poisonous tendrils."
msgstr "在你四周喷射出辛辣刺鼻的血肉，不断生长并将你的猎物捕获进一片有毒的卷须之中。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_coagulant_weave"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bio_weave"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_coagulant_weave"
msgid "Coagulant Weave"
msgstr "凝血編織"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_coagulant_weave ( Coagulant Weave )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Coagulant Weave"
msgid ""
"Turns your biological mastery inwards, medically enhancing your flesh.  "
"Rather than strength of healing, it staves off blood loss and purges wounds "
"before they can turn septic, at the cost of increased hunger and thirst."
msgstr "將你對生物法術的控制轉移至體內，在醫學上強化你的肉體。它是防止失血，並在傷口化膿之前消除傷口的法術，而非有治療能力的法術，代價是加速飢餓與口渴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "corrosive_aura_spell ( Caustic Feedback )"
msgid "acidic sizzle!"
msgstr "酸液嘶嘶声！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_caustic_aura"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_aura_caustic"
msgid "Caustic Aura"
msgstr "腐蝕靈氣"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_caustic_aura ( Caustic Aura )"
msgid ""
"This spell suspends acid in a layer around you, corroding melee attackers "
"when struck and enhancing your melee damage."
msgstr "这个法术在你身体周围召唤出一个酸液光环，腐蚀攻击你的敌人，并增加你的近战伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_caustic_aura_plus"
msgid "Improved Caustic Aura"
msgstr "强化腐蚀光环"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_caustic_aura_plus ( Improved Caustic Aura
#. )"
msgid ""
"This spell suspends acid in a layer around you, corroding melee attackers "
"when struck and enhancing your melee damage.  Now you know this spell like "
"the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"This spell suspends acid in a layer around you, corroding melee attackers "
"when struck and enhancing your melee damage.  Now you know this spell like "
"the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_swim_frog"
msgid "Limbs of the Frog"
msgstr "蛙肢"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_swim_frog ( Limbs of the Frog )"
msgid "Grow webbing on your hands and feet, making quick swimming a breeze."
msgstr "手脚上长出蹼，让快速游泳变得轻而易举。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_giant_growth"
msgid "Giant Growth"
msgstr "巨型生长"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_giant_growth ( Giant Growth )"
msgid "Grow to enormous size.  Your clothing and equipment will not grow with you."
msgstr "成长为巨大的体型。 你的衣服和装备不会随你成长。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GIANT_GROWTH_MUTATION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEMON_POSSESSION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_GIANT_GROWTH"
msgid "Your body swells and warps as your size increases!"
msgstr "当你的体型增加时，你的身体会膨胀和扭曲！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GIANT_GROWTH_MUTATION"
msgid "You are already enormous--the spell cannot make you any larger!"
msgstr "你已经很巨大了--咒语不能让你变得更大！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GIANT_GROWTH_MUTATION_REMOVE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEMON_POSSESSION_REMOVE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_GIANT_GROWTH_REMOVE"
msgid "Your body shrinks and warps as your size decreases!"
msgstr "当你的体型变小时，你的身体会收缩和弯曲！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_remove_instability"
msgid "Preserve Genetic Stability"
msgstr "稳定基因"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_remove_instability ( Preserve Genetic
#. Stability )"
msgid ""
"The scroll said that this spell is for \"Reducing negative consequences from "
"XE037 exposure\", whatever that means.  According the scroll, the spell "
"should be allowed to run its course before reapplication."
msgstr ""
"The scroll said that this spell is for \"Reducing negative consequences from "
"XE037 exposure\", whatever that means.  According the scroll, the spell "
"should be allowed to run its course before reapplication."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_carrion_feast"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_carrion_feast"
msgid "Carrion Feast"
msgstr "腐肉盛宴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_carrion_feast ( Carrion Feast )"
msgid ""
"Alter your digestive system to consume rotten food with no ill effects.  This "
"is either a truly ancient spell or otherwise must have been the product of "
"some university thaumaturgical research department."
msgstr "改变你的消化系统，让你吃下腐烂的食物而无任何不良反应。 这要么是一个真正古老的咒语，要么一定是某所大学法医学研究部门的产物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_lashing_tentacles"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_lashing_tentacles"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lashing Tentacles"
msgstr "鞭笞触手"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_lashing_tentacles ( Lashing Tentacles )"
msgid ""
"Grow a pair of lashing tentacles from your shoulders.  While not as long as "
"the Vicious Tentacle, they will strike anyone in melee with you.  You cannot "
"wear rigid armor that covers the shoulders with them."
msgstr ""
"Grow a pair of lashing tentacles from your shoulders.  While not as long as "
"the Vicious Tentacle, they will strike anyone in melee with you.  You cannot "
"wear rigid armor that covers the shoulders with them."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_cure_disease_minor"
msgid "Purgation of Maladies"
msgstr "净化疫病"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_cure_disease_minor ( Purgation of
#. Maladies )"
msgid ""
"Vomit up any minor illnesses you might be suffering from, such as colds or "
"the flu.  This is one of the few biomantic cure spells that is castable on "
"other people."
msgstr ""
"Vomit up any minor illnesses you might be suffering from, such as colds or "
"the flu.  This is one of the few biomantic cure spells that is castable on "
"other people."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_hyper_regeneration"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_hyper_regeneration"
msgid "Corporeal Reconstitution"
msgstr "肉体调整"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_hyper_regeneration ( Corporeal
#. Reconstitution )"
msgid ""
"Possibly the most powerful of the biomantic healing spells, this causes your "
"flesh to literally knit itself together before your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Possibly the most powerful of the biomantic healing spells, this causes your "
"flesh to literally knit itself together before your eyes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_slow_bleeding"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_slow_bleeding_01"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_slow_bleeding_02"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_slow_bleeding_03"
msgid "Halt Bleeding"
msgstr "止血"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_slow_bleeding ( Halt Bleeding )"
msgid "As you can control your body, you can control your blood."
msgstr "随着你能控制自己的身体，你也能控制自己的血液。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_scalpel_fingers"
msgid "Flensing Fingers"
msgstr "尖刀手指"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_scalpel_fingers ( Flensing Fingers )"
msgid ""
"Change each of your fingers into a myriad of tiny bone knives, allowing you "
"to cut with surgical precision… or slice your enemies to ribbons."
msgstr ""
"Change each of your fingers into a myriad of tiny bone knives, allowing you "
"to cut with surgical precision… or slice your enemies to ribbons."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_caustic_blood"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_caustic_blood"
msgid "Caustic Blood"
msgstr "腐蚀血液"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_caustic_blood ( Caustic Blood )"
msgid ""
"Transmute your blood to magically-enhanced acid, making you immune to acid "
"and also splashing anyone who spills your blood."
msgstr "将你的血液转化为被魔法强化的酸液，使你免疫酸液，同时会向使你流血的生物喷溅酸液。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_eat_tons_of_food"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_eat_tons_of_food"
msgid "Gluttonous Consumption"
msgstr "暴饮暴食"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_eat_tons_of_food ( Gluttonous Consumption
#. )"
msgid ""
"Magically expand your stomach size, allowing it to consume more food without "
"taking up any more room in your body.  Once a rarely-learned spell, it's much "
"more useful now that you're not always sure where your next meal is coming "
"from."
msgstr "扩容你的胃，使它能够装下更多食物，不会挤占其他内脏的空间。 曾经是个无甚卵用的咒语，现在它终于有用了，因为你不知道下一顿饭什么时候才能吃。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_get_more_blood"
msgid "Carmine Infusion"
msgstr "Carmine Infusion"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_get_more_blood ( Carmine Infusion )"
msgid ""
"Using water as a catalyst, restore some of your lost blood.  This spell has "
"no effect if you're healthy and uninjured."
msgstr ""
"Using water as a catalyst, restore some of your lost blood.  This spell has "
"no effect if you're healthy and uninjured."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_control_mutations"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_control_mutations"
msgid "Morphogenic Mastery"
msgstr "Morphogenic Mastery"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_control_mutations ( Morphogenic Mastery
#. )"
msgid ""
"The scroll said that this spell is for \"Exerting deliberate control over "
"morphogenic alterations\", which sounds ominous."
msgstr ""
"The scroll said that this spell is for \"Exerting deliberate control over "
"morphogenic alterations\", which sounds ominous."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/bionic_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "bio_ley_energy_blaster_spell ( Levinbolt Projector
#. Targeting )"
msgid "You unleash a levinbolt."
msgstr "You unleash a levinbolt."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acid_claw"
msgid "Acid Claw"
msgstr "酸液之爪"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acid_claw ( Acid Claw )"
msgid ""
"Your claws glow with yellow acid energy, and as you swipe your claw a wave of "
"acid sweeps forth from it."
msgstr "你的爪子散发出黄色的酸液魔法光芒，当你挥动爪子时，一股酸液从中飞溅出来。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acid_bite"
msgid "Acid Bite"
msgstr "酸液噬咬"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acid_bite ( Acid Bite )"
msgid "Your maw drips with acid as you make a bite attack."
msgstr "当你咬人时，你的大嘴能够分泌出酸液。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_bite"
msgid "Dragon's Bite"
msgstr "巨龙噬咬"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_bite ( Dragon's Bite )"
msgid "The bite damage in Acid Bite."
msgstr "酸液噬咬造成的咬伤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_shell_black"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Black Dragon Shell"
msgid_plural "Black Dragon Shells"
msgstr[0] "黑龙外鳞"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_shell_black ( Black Dragon Shell )"
msgid ""
"You channel your inner draconic magic to protect yourself from damage and "
"reflect some back as acid damage."
msgstr "你引导体内的龙族魔力来保护你自己不受伤害，并将一些伤害以酸液伤害的形式反弹给敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/mutation_effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_terror"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dragon_terror_debuff"
msgid "Dragon Terror"
msgstr "巨龙恐惧"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_terror ( Dragon Terror )"
msgid ""
"With an ear piercing roar, you channel the inner power of dragons and strike "
"fear into those who stand before you, slowing their escape from your terror."
msgstr "伴随着一声刺耳的咆哮，你引导体内的龙族魔力，让那些站在你面前的敌人恐惧不已，降低他们逃离你恐怖力量的速度。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/mutation_effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_boost"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dragon_boost"
msgid "Dragon Boost"
msgstr "巨龙注能"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_boost ( Dragon Boost )"
msgid "You let out a mighty roar as you infuse yourself with the power of Dragons."
msgstr "伴随着一声刺耳的咆哮，你把龙族魔力灌注进自己体内。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_spit_acid"
msgid "Dragon Acid Spit"
msgstr "巨龙酸液喷射"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_spit_acid ( Dragon Acid Spit )"
msgid ""
"You conjure up acidic spittle that you can shoot long distances as you close "
"in on your terrified prey."
msgstr "在你步步紧逼被你吓坏的猎物时，你能够喷射出一股远距离攻击的酸液。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_breath_acid"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Black Dragon Breath"
msgstr "黑龍吐息"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_breath_acid ( Black Dragon Breath )"
msgid "Spews a line of acid from your mouth."
msgstr "從你嘴裡吐出一道酸線。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#. ~ Name of spell "crystallize_mana"
#. ~ Name of spell "manatouched_crystal"
msgid "Crystallize Mana"
msgstr "法力結晶化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "crystallize_mana ( Crystallize Mana )"
msgid "Crystallizes mana into solid form."
msgstr "将魔力凝聚成固体结晶型态。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dark_sight"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dark_sight"
msgid "Dark Sight"
msgstr "黑暗視覺"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dark_sight ( Dark Sight )"
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_eyegleam ( Eye gleam )"
#. ~ Description of spell "night_sight ( Night Sight )"
msgid "Gives you the power to see in the dark."
msgstr "给你在黑暗中视物的能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Message of spell "dark_sight ( Dark Sight )"
msgid ""
"Your eyes glow green for a moment.  Now your sight can pierce the darkest "
"shadows."
msgstr "你的眼睛發出綠光。現在你可以看透黑暗陰影。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "megablast"
msgid "Megablast"
msgstr "超級爆裂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "megablast ( Megablast )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Megablast"
msgid ""
"You always wanted to fire energy beams like in the animes you watched as a "
"kid.  Now you can!"
msgstr "你曾經想要像幼時看的動畫片那般可以發射能量光束。現在你真的可以這麼做！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_atomic_light"
msgid "Magical Light"
msgstr "魔法之光"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_atomic_light ( Magical Light )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Magical Light"
#. ~ Description of spell "create_light_sylph ( Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "create_light_salamander ( Light )"
msgid "Creates a magical light."
msgstr "產生一個魔法光源。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "blinding_flash"
msgid "Blinding Flash"
msgstr "致盲閃光"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "blinding_flash ( Blinding Flash )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Blinding Flash"
msgid ""
"Blind enemies for a short time with a sudden, dazzling light.  Higher levels "
"deal slightly higher damage."
msgstr "以一個突然且眩目的光令敵人暫時失明。高等級會稍為增加造成的傷害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ethereal_grasp"
msgid "Ethereal Grasp"
msgstr "空靈抓握"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ethereal_grasp ( Ethereal Grasp )"
msgid ""
"A mass of spectral hands emerge from the ground, grabbing and slowing "
"everything in range.  Higher levels allow a bigger AoE, and longer effect\n"
"\n"
"Larger targets will be <color_yellow>less affected</color> by the spell."
msgstr ""
"A mass of spectral hands emerge from the ground, grabbing and slowing "
"everything in range.  Higher levels allow a bigger AoE, and longer effect\n"
"\n"
"Larger targets will be <color_yellow>less affected</color> by the spell."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "obfuscated_body"
msgid "Obfuscated Body"
msgstr "朦朧驅體"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "obfuscated_body ( Obfuscated Body )"
#. ~ Description of spell "obfuscated_body_plus ( Improved Obfuscated Body )"
msgid ""
"A magical aura distorts light around your body, increasing the amount of "
"attacks you might dodge in a given turn."
msgstr "一个魔法光环扭曲了你身体周围的光线，增加了你在一个回合中所能闪避攻击的次数。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "obfuscated_body_plus"
msgid "Improved Obfuscated Body"
msgstr "高级朦胧术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "protection_aura"
msgid "Aura of Protection"
msgstr "防護靈氣"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "protection_aura ( Aura of Protection )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Aura of Protection"
msgid ""
"Encases your whole body in a magical aura that protects you from the "
"environment."
msgstr "將你整個身體包覆在魔法靈氣中，保護你免受環境影響。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "protection_aura_plus"
msgid "Improved Aura of Protection"
msgstr "强化保护光环"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "protection_aura_plus ( Improved Aura of Protection
#. )"
msgid ""
"Encases your whole body in a magical aura that protects you from the "
"environment.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"Encases your whole body in a magical aura that protects you from the "
"environment.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "translocate_self"
msgid "Translocate Self"
msgstr "轉移自我"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "translocate_self ( Translocate Self )"
msgid "Translocates the user to an attuned gate."
msgstr "將施法者移轉到預調的傳送門。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acid_resistance"
msgid "Acid Resistance"
msgstr "抗酸術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acid_resistance ( Acid Resistance )"
msgid "Protects the user from acid."
msgstr "保護使用者不受酸液影響。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acid_resistance_greater"
msgid "Greater Acid Resistance"
msgstr "高等抗酸術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acid_resistance_greater ( Greater Acid Resistance
#. )"
msgid ""
"Protects the user from acid.  Now you know this spell like the back of your "
"hand, and start to design your own version, no longer requiring you to hold "
"concentration."
msgstr ""
"Protects the user from acid.  Now you know this spell like the back of your "
"hand, and start to design your own version, no longer requiring you to hold "
"concentration."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "thought_shield"
msgid "Thought Shield"
msgstr "心灵防护"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "thought_shield ( Thought Shield )"
msgid ""
"Two small shimmering spots appear on your temples, protecting your mind from "
"outside influences."
msgstr "你的太阳穴上会出现两个闪闪发光的小点，保护你的心灵不受外界影响。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "thought_shield_plus"
msgid "Thought Suit"
msgstr "心灵套装"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "thought_shield_plus ( Thought Suit )"
msgid ""
"Why protect just your mind from outside influences?  More shields all over "
"your body should also prevent you from being teleported forcefully"
msgstr "为什么只保护你的心智不受外界影响？在身体各处设置更多防护也能防止被强行传送。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sound_bomb"
msgid "Sound Bomb"
msgstr "聲波炸彈"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sound_bomb ( Sound Bomb )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Sound Bomb"
msgid ""
"Behind the cool name hides a common joke spell to spook your friends and "
"restrain dogs.  It can be useful in some special cases."
msgstr "隱藏在這個酷炫名字背後的是一個常見的搞笑咒語，可以嚇唬你的朋友和讓狗愣住。在某些情況下很有用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "sound_bomb ( Sound Bomb )"
msgid "a loud, high pitched sound"
msgstr "响亮、尖锐的声音"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_watch_spell"
msgid "Knowing the Day and the Hour"
msgstr "知晓时间"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_watch_spell ( Knowing the Day and the
#. Hour )"
msgid ""
"Probably the single greatest example of technology rendering magic obsolete, "
"this spell allows you know exactly what time it is."
msgstr "这个法术可能是科技淘汰魔法的最伟大范例，它能让你准确知道现在的时间。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_clean_clothing_and_self"
msgid "Freshen Up"
msgstr "梳洗术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_clean_clothing_and_self ( Freshen Up )"
msgid ""
"Undoubtedly the single most common spell in the world before the Cataclysm, "
"Freshen Up cleans your teeth, sweetens your breath, removes stains and sweat "
"from your clothes, exfoliates you, and gives volume back to your hair."
msgstr ""
"Undoubtedly the single most common spell in the world before the Cataclysm, "
"Freshen Up cleans your teeth, sweetens your breath, removes stains and sweat "
"from your clothes, exfoliates you, and gives volume back to your hair."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_easy_sleep_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_classless_easy_sleep"
msgid "Peaceful Rest"
msgstr "安睡术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_easy_sleep_spell ( Peaceful Rest )"
msgid ""
"A favorite of overworked mages and dilettantes who, this spell makes it much "
"easier to fall asleep regardless of how tired you are."
msgstr ""
"A favorite of overworked mages and dilettantes who, this spell makes it much "
"easier to fall asleep regardless of how tired you are."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_dispel_magic"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dispel_magic"
msgid "Dispel Magic"
msgstr "驱散魔法"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_dispel_magic ( Dispel Magic )"
msgid ""
"Remove magical effects from your target.  It fails when faced with powerful "
"enchantments or the unique bonuses provided by attunements."
msgstr "移除目标身上的魔法效果。 当面对强大的魔法或调谐提供的独特加成时，它就会失效。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_disjunction"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_disjunction"
msgid "Disjunction"
msgstr "解离"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_disjunction ( Disjunction )"
msgid ""
"The ultimate anti-magic spell, Disjunction will strip even attunement-related "
"or powerful enchantments from the target."
msgstr "作为终极反魔法咒语，\"解离 \"甚至能从目标身上剥离与调谐相关的魔力或强大的魔法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_restore_crystal_mana"
msgid "Mana Extraction"
msgstr "魔力提取"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_restore_crystal_mana ( Mana Extraction )"
msgid ""
"Return crystallized mana into raw mana and absorb it, restoring some of your "
"mana.  The process is slow and not very efficient, but it's easier to "
"transport than mana potions."
msgstr "将魔力结晶还原为原始的魔力并将其吸收，恢复你的部分魔力。这个过程非常缓慢，并且效率不高，但相比起魔力药剂更为便携。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Message of spell "classless_restore_crystal_mana ( Mana Extraction )"
msgid ""
"You slowly crush the crystallized mana and as it flares into a burst of "
"light, absorb the now-free mana."
msgstr "你将这些结晶化的魔力粉碎，随着它发出一阵闪光，你吸收了这些释放出来的魔力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "flower_fern_spell ( Flower fern effect )"
msgid "You feel better!"
msgstr "You feel better!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "glowing_mushroom_spell ( Glowing mushroom effect )"
msgid "You feel lighter!"
msgstr "You feel lighter!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "whiskflower_spell ( Whiskflower effect )"
msgid "You wobble as you feel inebriated"
msgstr "You wobble as you feel inebriated"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "sojourners_palm_spell ( Sojourners palm effect )"
msgid "Your vision shifts in a flash of colors and you reappear elsewhere."
msgstr "Your vision shifts in a flash of colors and you reappear elsewhere."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "funnelcap_spell ( Funnelcap effect )"
msgid "You recover mana!"
msgstr "You recover mana!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_veggrasp"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "entangled"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "entangled_monster"
msgid "Vegetative Grasp"
msgstr "植物纏繞"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_veggrasp ( Vegetative Grasp )"
msgid ""
"This spell causes roots and vines to burst forth from the ground and grab "
"your foes, slowing them and doing a small amount of damage as they dig in.\n"
"\n"
"Larger targets will be <color_yellow>less affected</color> by the spell, and "
"it has <color_red>no effect</color> on targets not on natural ground."
msgstr ""
"This spell causes roots and vines to burst forth from the ground and grab "
"your foes, slowing them and doing a small amount of damage as they dig in.\n"
"\n"
"Larger targets will be <color_yellow>less affected</color> by the spell, and "
"it has <color_red>no effect</color> on targets not on natural ground."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_rootstrike"
msgid "Root Strike"
msgstr "樹根打擊"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_rootstrike ( Root Strike )"
msgid ""
"This spell causes roots to spear out of the ground in a cone and stab into "
"your foes, impaling them."
msgstr ""
"This spell causes roots to spear out of the ground in a cone and stab into "
"your foes, impaling them."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_woodshaft"
msgid "Wooden Shaft"
msgstr "木矛術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_woodshaft ( Wooden Shaft )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Wooden Shaft"
msgid ""
"This spell creates a projectile of hardwood that shoots forth from the "
"caster's hand at high speed to stab into an enemy."
msgstr "此法術會生成一枚硬木拋射物，從施法者的手上高速射出，刺入敵人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_naturebow1"
msgid "Nature's Bow"
msgstr "自然之弓"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_naturebow1 ( Nature's Bow )"
msgid ""
"This spell conjures a magical wooden recurve bow, as well as a quiver and a "
"set of arrows to go with it."
msgstr "这个法术可以变出一把神奇的木制反曲弓，以及与之相配的箭筒和箭簇。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_naturebow1_plus"
msgid "Improved Nature's Bow"
msgstr "升级版自然之弓"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_naturebow1_plus ( Improved Nature's Bow )"
msgid ""
"This spell conjures a magical wooden recurve bow, as well as a quiver and a "
"set of arrows to go with it.  Now you know this spell like the back of your "
"hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr "这个咒语可以变出一把神奇的木质反曲弓，以及与之相配的箭筒和箭簇。 现在你已经对这个咒语了如指掌，并开始设计自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "recover_sleepiness"
msgid "Nature's Trance"
msgstr "自然冥想"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_sleepiness ( Nature's Trance )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Nature's Trance"
msgid ""
"Your connection to living things allows you to go into a magical trance.  "
"This allows you to recover from fatigue quickly in exchange for mana."
msgstr ""
"Your connection to living things allows you to go into a magical trance.  "
"This allows you to recover from fatigue quickly in exchange for mana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_cats"
msgid "Bag of Cats"
msgstr "袋裝貓咪"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_cats ( Bag of Cats )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Bag of Cats"
msgid "Are you the crazy cat lady?"
msgstr "你是位瘋狂的貓女士？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_bear"
msgid "Cause Bear"
msgstr "產生恐龍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_bear ( Cause Bear )"
msgid ""
"This spell appears to be very smudged.  You're fairly sure the name should be "
"Cause Fear, but you're also fairly sure it won't have the desired effect "
"because the instructions are hardly legible.  No time like the Cataclysm to "
"find out, though!"
msgstr ""
"這個法術似乎非常之模糊。你堅信這個法術應該是叫「產生恐懼 (Fear) "
"」，但你同時也堅信它不會有預期的效果，因為使用說明實在很難看清楚。就跟大災變一樣，根本沒有時間去尋求真相。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "fungicide"
msgid "Kill Fungus"
msgstr "滅殺真菌"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "fungicide ( Kill Fungus )"
msgid "Kills fungus affected areas."
msgstr "消灭一片区域中的真菌感染。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_druid"
msgid "Druid Rune"
msgstr "德魯伊符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_druid ( Druid Rune )"
msgid ""
"A ritual in which you conjure forth roots and vines in order to make a "
"druidic rune.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""
"A ritual in which you conjure forth roots and vines in order to make a "
"druidic rune.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "purify_seed"
msgid "Purification Seed"
msgstr "淨化種子"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "purify_seed ( Purification Seed )"
msgid ""
"You summon a gift of the earth which will purify water.  Rapidly degrades if "
"not utilized."
msgstr "你召喚大地的贈禮，能夠淨化水質的種子。如果不使用的話會快速變質。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druidic_regrowth"
msgid "Sacrificial Regrowth"
msgstr "血腥復生"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druidic_regrowth ( Sacrificial Regrowth )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Sacrificial Regrowth"
msgid ""
"Through giving of one's own life force, you restore withered and barren plant "
"life nearby.  What remains will need time to regrow its full strength."
msgstr "通過獻祭自身的生命力，你可以讓附近枯萎貧瘠的植被獲得新生。剩下的就靠時間來等他完全恢復生機。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druidic_healing"
msgid "Sacrificial Healing"
msgstr "犧牲治療"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druidic_healing ( Sacrificial Healing )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Sacrificial Healing"
msgid ""
"Channels some of the user's own life force into healing energy, for the sake "
"of one's allies."
msgstr "将使用者自身部分生命力转化为医疗能量，为同伴治疗。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_tornskin"
msgid "Tornskin"
msgstr "棘皮術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_tornskin ( Tornskin )"
msgid ""
"This spell, which resembles Thornskin through the sap & needles covering the "
"page, seemed to involve thorns and bleeding wounds.  The marred words may "
"have altered the function."
msgstr "这个法术，从卷轴上覆盖的汁液和尖刺看来，似乎像是棘皮术，但现在那些荆棘效果变成撕裂皮肤造成流血。也许那些被污染的单词可能改变了法术的效果。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_feralform"
msgid "Feral Form"
msgstr "狂野型態"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_feralform ( Feral Form )"
msgid ""
"This spell unleashes your inner beast, growing claws & fangs to rend your "
"foes limb from limb."
msgstr "这个法术释放出你内心暗藏的兽性，让你长出尖牙利爪，将你的敌人撕成碎片。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_feralform_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Feral Form"
msgstr "高级狂野形态"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_feralform_plus ( Enhanced Feral Form )"
msgid ""
"This spell unleashes your inner beast, growing claws & fangs to rend your "
"foes limb from limb.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and "
"start to design your own version."
msgstr "这个法术释放出你内心暗藏的兽性，让你长出尖牙利爪，将你的敌人撕成碎片。现在你对这个法术了如指掌，并设计出了你自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_wolf_druid"
msgid "Summon Wolf"
msgstr "召喚狼"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_wolf_druid ( Summon Wolf )"
msgid "Call to the wilds for aid from some wolves."
msgstr "向荒野尋求狼群的幫助"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_natures_commune"
msgid "Communion with Nature"
msgstr "沟通自然"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_natures_commune ( Communion with Nature )"
msgid ""
"You focus on the bounty of nature around you and commune with it, improving "
"your health and mood and calming nearby wildlife.  This spell may only be "
"cast outdoors away from civilization."
msgstr "你专注于周围的大自然，与之交流，改善你的健康和情绪，并安抚附近的野生动物。此咒语只能在远离文明的户外施放。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_NATURE_COMMUNE"
msgid "You must be surrounded by nature to commune with nature"
msgstr "你必须被自然环绕才能与自然沟通"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_growth"
msgid "Seed of Growth"
msgstr "成長之種"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_growth ( Seed of Growth )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Seed of Growth"
msgid "Offer some of your life in a ritual to get tokens of growth in return."
msgstr "在仪式中献出你的部分生命来换取成长的象征。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cause_rot"
msgid "Cause Rot"
msgstr "腐化術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cause_rot ( Cause Rot )"
msgid ""
"A spell from a darker sect of druidry, created to forcibly begin the circle "
"of life anew.  For without rot, you cannot have growth.  Affects a huge area, "
"but is indiscriminate; even rusting machines into nothing but dust and slow "
"both in casting and effect.  Once lost entirely to the passage of time, this "
"spell was thought to be no more than a myth, the stuff of fairy tales, albeit "
"grim ones."
msgstr ""
"来自德鲁伊黑暗教派的法术，用来强行重启生命循环。因为没有腐化，就无法生长。影响范围很大，且不分敌我；即便是机器也会生锈化为尘土，施法及起效速度都很慢。曾经完"
"全失传在时间的流逝中，这个法术被认为只不过是神话传说，是童话故事的素材，虽然是黑暗童话。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_healing"
msgid "Restoration"
msgstr "恢复"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_healing ( Restoration )"
msgid ""
"Slowly heal your wounds by drawing on the power of nature.\n"
"\n"
"You must be <color_yellow>outdoors and in a natural area</color> away from "
"civilization to cast Restoration."
msgstr ""
"利用自然的力量慢慢治愈你的伤口。\n"
"\n"
"你必须在在<color_yellow>户外且远离文明的自然区</color>才能施展恢复。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RESTORATION"
msgid "You must be surrounded by nature to use its power to heal."
msgstr "你必须被自然环绕才能与使用它的力量治疗。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_healing_herb"
msgid "Floral Healing"
msgstr "鲜花疗法"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_healing_herb ( Floral Healing )"
msgid "Use some magic herbs to heal yourself."
msgstr "使用一些魔法草药来治疗自己。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_bandage_heal"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Vegetative Poultice"
msgid_plural "Vegetative Poultices"
msgstr[0] "植物药膏"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_bandage_heal ( Vegetative Poultice )"
msgid ""
"This spell turns a mixture of bark and leaves into a powerful salve capable "
"of stopping even grievous wounds from bleeding."
msgstr "这个法术将树皮和树叶的混合物变成一种强大的药膏，即使是严重的伤口也能止血。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_whisper_leaves"
msgid "Whisper of the Leaves"
msgstr "叶之低语"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_whisper_leaves ( Whisper of the Leaves )"
msgid ""
"This spell allows you to hear the trees' wisdom in the rustle of the leaves "
"and the creaking of their roots, discerning the layout of the forest."
msgstr "这个法术可以让你在树叶的沙沙声和树根的吱吱声中听到树木的智慧，洞察森林的布局。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GAIN_WHISPER_LEAVES"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GAIN_COMMUNE_OAKS"
msgid ""
"You are already in tune with the rhythms of the forest.  Further magic cannot "
"deepen your bond."
msgstr "你已经与森林的韵律融为一体。更多魔法已无法加深你们之间的联系。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_harvest_hunter"
msgid "Harvest of the Hunter"
msgstr "猎人收获"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_harvest_hunter ( Harvest of the Hunter )"
msgid ""
"This spell creates a grouping of odd-looking but functional arrows out of "
"forest detritus."
msgstr "这个法术从森林碎屑中制造出一组看起来奇怪但功能强大的箭。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_summon_tanglevine"
msgid "Summon Tanglevine"
msgstr "召唤藤蔓"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_summon_tanglevine ( Summon Tanglevine )"
msgid ""
"This spell causes an animated vine to burst from the ground and attempt to "
"seize a nearby target and hold it fast."
msgstr "该法术会使一根有生命的藤蔓从地面破土而出，试图抓住附近的目标并将其牢牢固定。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_beguile_savage_beast"
msgid "Beguiling the Savage Beast"
msgstr "蛊惑野兽"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_beguile_savage_beast ( Beguiling the Savage
#. Beast )"
msgid ""
"Using your connection to nature, you can sway an animal to your service.  "
"This spell even works on mutated animals."
msgstr "利用你与大自然的联系，你可以支配一只动物为你服务。这个法术甚至对变异的动物有效。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_bramble_spear"
msgid "Spear of Brambles"
msgstr "荆棘之矛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_bramble_spear ( Spear of Brambles )"
msgid "This spell turns a stick into a vicious spear that drips with sticky sap."
msgstr "这个法术会把一根棍子变成一把会滴下粘性汁液的凶猛的矛状物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_bramble_spear_enhanced"
msgid "Enhanced Spear of Brambles"
msgstr "强化荆棘之矛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_bramble_spear_enhanced ( Enhanced Spear of
#. Brambles )"
msgid ""
"This spell turns a bit of bark or a twig into a vicious spear that drips with "
"sticky sap.  You now know this spell like the back of your hand, and no "
"longer need such massive spell components as you did previously."
msgstr "这个法术能将树皮或树枝变成一根滴着粘稠汁液的凶恶长矛。 你现在对这个咒语了如指掌，再也不需要像以前那样需要大量的法术组件了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_summon_brambles"
msgid "Stranglethorns"
msgstr "绞杀荆棘"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_summon_brambles ( Stranglethorns )"
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_summon_brambles_arc ( Summon Brambles Arc )"
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_summon_brambles_line ( Summon Brambles Line
#. )"
msgid ""
"Call up thick, swiftly growing brambles, either in a line to form a wall or "
"an arc to trap an enemy."
msgstr ""
"Call up thick, swiftly growing brambles, either in a line to form a wall or "
"an arc to trap an enemy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_BRAMBLES_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Thorny Arc"
msgstr "Thorny Arc"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_BRAMBLES_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Wall of Brambles"
msgstr "Wall of Brambles"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_BRAMBLES_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Summon a spray of brambles to entrap an enemy."
msgstr "Summon a spray of brambles to entrap an enemy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_BRAMBLES_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Summon a wall of thorns to fortify a location."
msgstr "Summon a wall of thorns to fortify a location."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_summon_brambles_arc"
msgid "Summon Brambles Arc"
msgstr "召唤荆棘弧"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_summon_brambles_line"
msgid "Summon Brambles Line"
msgstr "召唤荆棘线"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_thorn_skin"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Thornskin"
msgid_plural "Thornskins"
msgstr[0] "棘皮术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_thorn_skin ( Thornskin )"
msgid ""
"This spell transforms the druid's skin into a bark-like material covered in "
"large thorns.  It provides excellent protection but slightly slows you and "
"makes you vulnerable to fire."
msgstr "这个咒语将德鲁伊的皮肤变成一种树皮状的物质，上面覆盖着巨大的刺。它提供了极好的保护，但会稍微减慢你的速度，使你容易受到火灾的伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_renew_forest_spell"
msgid "Renewing the Forest"
msgstr "森林新生"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_renew_forest_spell ( Renewing the Forest )"
msgid ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the druid can create a profusion of life "
"around themselves, causing grass to grow through pavement, bushes and flowers "
"to sprout, and trees to grow to full height in moments.\n"
"\n"
"In <color_yellow>addition to</color> mana, this spell also requires "
"<color_red>hit points</color> to cast and <color_yellow>will fail</color> if "
"you are too injured."
msgstr ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the druid can create a profusion of life "
"around themselves, causing grass to grow through pavement, bushes and flowers "
"to sprout, and trees to grow to full height in moments.\n"
"\n"
"In <color_yellow>addition to</color> mana, this spell also requires "
"<color_red>hit points</color> to cast and <color_yellow>will fail</color> if "
"you are too injured."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid "You do not have enough life force to donate it to renew the forest!"
msgstr "You do not have enough life force to donate it to renew the forest!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid ""
"You must be on the surface and not on a building's upper stories to cast "
"Renewing the Forest!"
msgstr "你必须位于地表，且不在建筑上才能施放森林新生！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid "You must be outside to cast Renewing the Forest!"
msgstr "你必须在户外才能施放森林新生！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_wood_living_tree_spell"
msgid "Shape Wood"
msgstr "塑木术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_wood_living_tree_spell ( Shape Wood )"
msgid ""
"Using druidic magic, shape living wood into a log that you can use for other "
"projects without harming the tree.  You must cast this spell on a living tree."
msgstr "用德鲁伊魔法，在不伤害树木的情况下用其塑造出可用的原木。你必须对一棵活着的树施放此法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_EOC_DRUID_SHAPE_WOOD"
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING"
msgid "Select nearby tree"
msgstr "Select nearby tree"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EOC_DRUID_SHAPE_WOOD"
msgid ""
"The wood of the tree grows and forms as you cast the spell and when it ends, "
"there is a log lying on the ground, entirely covered in bark but otherwise "
"straight and ready to be used in other projects."
msgstr ""
"The wood of the tree grows and forms as you cast the spell and when it ends, "
"there is a log lying on the ground, entirely covered in bark but otherwise "
"straight and ready to be used in other projects."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_anti_heat"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_druid_anti_heat"
msgid "Water's Cooling Touch"
msgstr "清凉之触"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_anti_heat ( Water's Cooling Touch )"
msgid ""
"Draw on some of the essence of water, providing protection against the "
"summer's heat."
msgstr ""
"Draw on some of the essence of water, providing protection against the "
"summer's heat."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_breathing_underwater"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Aquatic Mantle"
msgid_plural "Aquatic Mantles"
msgstr[0] "Aquatic Mantles"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_breathing_underwater ( Aquatic Mantle )"
msgid ""
"Cover yourself in a thin layer of magical seaweed, preventing you from "
"getting wet and allowing you to breathe underwater."
msgstr ""
"Cover yourself in a thin layer of magical seaweed, preventing you from "
"getting wet and allowing you to breathe underwater."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_disinfectant"
msgid "Wash the Wounds Clean"
msgstr "清洗伤口"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_disinfectant ( Wash the Wounds Clean )"
msgid ""
"Transform a bit of water into a magical disinfectant as you pour it over your "
"wounds."
msgstr ""
"Transform a bit of water into a magical disinfectant as you pour it over your "
"wounds."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_water_walking"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_druid_water_walking"
msgid "Water Strider's Walk"
msgstr "水上漂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_water_walking ( Water Strider's Walk )"
msgid ""
"Enchant yourself so that the water will buoy you up and prevent you from "
"sinking, allowing you to walk on its surface."
msgstr ""
"Enchant yourself so that the water will buoy you up and prevent you from "
"sinking, allowing you to walk on its surface."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_traverse_the_wilds"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_druid_traverse_the_wilds"
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_traverse_the_wilds"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Traverse the Wilds"
msgstr "穿行荒野"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_traverse_the_wilds ( Traverse the Wilds )"
msgid ""
"Blend in the wilds and urge them to speed your passage.  Trees bend out of "
"the way, bushes do not hinder you, and even grass subtly moves your feet "
"along.  The spell cannot be cast near civilization and similarly will fade if "
"your travels take you out of the wilds."
msgstr ""
"Blend in the wilds and urge them to speed your passage.  Trees bend out of "
"the way, bushes do not hinder you, and even grass subtly moves your feet "
"along.  The spell cannot be cast near civilization and similarly will fade if "
"your travels take you out of the wilds."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_TRAVERSE_THE_WILDS"
msgid "You must be surrounded by the wilds to traverse them."
msgstr "你需要身处荒野才能施放穿行荒野。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_TRAVERSE_THE_WILDS_REMOVER"
msgid "As you approach civilization, your spell fades."
msgstr "As you approach civilization, your spell fades."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_bearmantle"
msgid "Bearmantle"
msgstr "Bearmantle"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_bearmantle ( Bearmantle )"
msgid ""
"Adopt some of the aspect of the bear, protecting you from cold and preparing "
"you for winter."
msgstr ""
"Adopt some of the aspect of the bear, protecting you from cold and preparing "
"you for winter."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_goodberry"
msgid "Goodberry"
msgstr "神莓术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_goodberry ( Goodberry )"
msgid ""
"Enchant a set of berries, transforming them into magical fruit that will "
"provide a hearty meal's worth of nutrition and a small amount of healing when "
"eaten.  The goodberries will rot away within 24 hours if not eaten."
msgstr ""
"Enchant a set of berries, transforming them into magical fruit that will "
"provide a hearty meal's worth of nutrition and a small amount of healing when "
"eaten.  The goodberries will rot away within 24 hours if not eaten."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_create_temporary_spring"
msgid "Fountain of the Depths"
msgstr "Fountain of the Depths"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_create_temporary_spring ( Fountain of the
#. Depths )"
msgid ""
"Call to the waters beneath the earth and bring them to the surface, creating "
"a natural spring.  The waters will subside when the spell's duration ends."
msgstr ""
"Call to the waters beneath the earth and bring them to the surface, creating "
"a natural spring.  The waters will subside when the spell's duration ends."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_TEMPORARY_SPRING"
msgid "Select natural earth"
msgstr "Select natural earth"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_turn_tree_into_treant"
msgid "Awakening of the Forest Guardian"
msgstr "Awakening of the Forest Guardian"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_turn_tree_into_treant ( Awakening of the
#. Forest Guardian )"
msgid ""
"Grant a nearby tree awareness and mobility, letting it shake free from the "
"soil and rise up to crush your enemies.  It will root itself again when the "
"spell expires.\n"
"\n"
"You must be <color_yellow>standing next to a tree</color> for the spell to "
"take effect."
msgstr ""
"Grant a nearby tree awareness and mobility, letting it shake free from the "
"soil and rise up to crush your enemies.  It will root itself again when the "
"spell expires.\n"
"\n"
"You must be <color_yellow>standing next to a tree</color> for the spell to "
"take effect."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stonefist"
msgid "Stonefist"
msgstr "石拳術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stonefist ( Stonefist )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stonefist"
msgid ""
"Encases your arms and hands in a sheath of magical stone, you can punch and "
"defend yourself with it in melee combat."
msgstr "將你的手臂和拳頭包裹在劈啪作響的魔法閃電護套中，你可以在近戰格鬥中用它來打擊對手並保護自己。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stonefist_plus"
msgid "Improved Stonefist"
msgstr "升级版大地之拳"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stonefist_plus ( Improved Stonefist )"
msgid ""
"Encases your arms and hands in a sheath of magical stone, you can punch and "
"defend yourself with it in melee combat.  Now you know this spell like the "
"back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"Encases your arms and hands in a sheath of magical stone, you can punch and "
"defend yourself with it in melee combat.  Now you know this spell like the "
"back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "seismic_stomp"
msgid "Seismic Stomp"
msgstr "地震踐踏"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "seismic_stomp ( Seismic Stomp )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Seismic Stomp"
msgid ""
"Focusing mana into your leg, you stomp your foot and send out a shockwave, "
"knocking enemies around you onto the ground."
msgstr "將法力集中到你的雙腿，你踩動地面並發出震波，擊倒附近站在地面的敵人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "recover_stamina"
msgid "Stone's Endurance"
msgstr "巖石耐力"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_stamina ( Stone's Endurance )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stone's Endurance"
msgid ""
"You focus on the stones beneath you and draw from their agelessness.  Your "
"mana is converted to stamina."
msgstr "你專注於岩石的呼吸，你可以從中抽取它們永恆的力量。你的法力可轉換成體力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_shardspray"
msgid "Shardspray"
msgstr "碎片噴射"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_shardspray ( Shardspray )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shardspray"
msgid ""
"This spell projects a wide spray of sharp metal shards, cutting into your "
"foes and friends alike."
msgstr "這個法術扇形噴射出大量鋒利的金屬碎片，敵我不分的切向目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_piercing_bolt"
msgid "Piercing Bolt"
msgstr "穿刺之箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_piercing_bolt ( Piercing Bolt )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Piercing Bolt"
msgid ""
"This spell projects a piercing rod of conjured iron at those that dare oppose "
"you."
msgstr "這個法術投射出一根尖銳的咒術鐵棒，穿刺那些膽敢挑戰你的敵人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_shardstorm"
msgid "Shardstorm"
msgstr "碎片風暴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_shardstorm ( Shardstorm )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shardstorm"
msgid "Creates an omnidirectional spray of razor sharp metal shards all around you."
msgstr "向你周圍的所有方向噴射出剃刀般的金屬碎片。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_rockbolt"
msgid "Rockbolt"
msgstr "岩石之箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_rockbolt ( Rockbolt )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Rockbolt"
msgid "Fires a conjured stone projectile at high velocity."
msgstr "發射一枚高速的咒術石頭投射物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "move_earth"
msgid "Move Earth"
msgstr "移動大地"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "move_earth ( Move Earth )"
msgid "Your essence flows around you, and the earth follows."
msgstr "你的魔法精魂在周圍流動，而大地隨之變化。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_earthshaper"
msgid "Earthshaper Rune"
msgstr "塑地者符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_earthshaper ( Earthshaper Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual creates a small pebble attuned to Earthshapers.  You can use the "
"rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr "這個儀式創造了一個與大地塑形者契合的小石子。你能將此符文用於製作時的催化劑。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clairvoyance"
msgid "Clairvoyance"
msgstr "千里眼"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clairvoyance ( Clairvoyance )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Clairvoyance"
msgid "You close your eyes and the earth surrenders its secrets to you."
msgstr "你閉上眼睛，大地向你交出它的秘密。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_stoneskin"
msgid "Stoneskin"
msgstr "石膚術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_stoneskin ( Stoneskin )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stoneskin"
msgid ""
"Envelops your entire body in armor formed from living rock, encumbering yet "
"protective."
msgstr "将你全身包覆在活化岩石构成的装甲中，累赘但防护森严。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_stoneskin_plus"
msgid "Improved Stoneskin"
msgstr "高级石肤术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_stoneskin_plus ( Improved Stoneskin )"
msgid ""
"Envelops your entire body in armor formed from living rock, encumbering yet "
"protective.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"Envelops your entire body in armor formed from living rock, encumbering yet "
"protective.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_pillar"
msgid "Pillar of Stone"
msgstr "石柱"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_pillar ( Pillar of Stone )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Pillar of Stone"
msgid ""
"Drawing upon the surrounding earth, you form a pillar of solid rock.  "
"Experience will make the task easier, and less disruptive to the surrounding "
"area."
msgstr "你用魔法将四周的泥土堆起，形成一根硬石柱。经验的累积将使施法更容易，并减少对周围区域的破坏。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pertifying_touch"
msgid "Petrifying Touch"
msgstr "石化之触"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pertifying_touch ( Petrifying Touch )"
msgid ""
"With a simple touch, you transform the body of your enemy into pure stone.  "
"The effect is temporary, but the target will be totally immobile while the "
"spell lasts."
msgstr ""
"With a simple touch, you transform the body of your enemy into pure stone.  "
"The effect is temporary, but the target will be totally immobile while the "
"spell lasts."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "reactive_armor"
msgid "Reactive Armor"
msgstr "反应装甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "reactive_armor ( Reactive Armor )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Reactive Armor"
msgid "Explode your stone skin, to deal massive damage to all enemies around."
msgstr "引爆你的石肤，对附近的敌人造成巨量伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_impalement"
msgid "Impalement"
msgstr "穿刺"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_impalement ( Impalement )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Impalement"
msgid ""
"Summon a stone spikes underground, that penetrate your enemies, and nail them "
"for a while."
msgstr "从地下召唤出岩石尖刺，刺穿你的敌人，并使其暂时无法动弹。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_spawn_tools"
msgid "Utility Molding"
msgstr "工具塑造术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_spawn_tools ( Utility Molding )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Utility Molding"
msgid ""
"Shape the basic working tools, using your own magic abilities and earth "
"nearby.  Activate to change the shape of a tool."
msgstr "塑造出基本的工作用具，使用你自己的魔法能力和附近的土地。激活以更改工具的形状。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Hammer"
msgstr "召唤锤子"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Pickaxe"
msgstr "召唤鹤嘴锄"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Axe"
msgstr "召唤斧子"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Knife"
msgstr "召唤小刀"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Shovel"
msgstr "召唤铲子"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into a hammer."
msgstr "将生命土地变成锤子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into a pickaxe."
msgstr "将生命土地变成鹤嘴锄。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into an axe."
msgstr "将生命土地变成斧子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into a knife."
msgstr "将生命土地变成小刀。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into a shovel."
msgstr "将生命土地变成铲子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_melee_damage"
msgid "Weighting"
msgstr "沉重打击"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_melee_damage ( Weighting )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Weighting"
msgid ""
"Fill yourself with the power of Earth, and make each your attacks as "
"devastating as an earthquake."
msgstr "将大地的能量充满你的身体，让你的每次攻击都像地震一样有毁灭性。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_crystal_wrap"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "eshaper_crystal_wrap"
msgid "Crystal Wrapping"
msgstr "水晶裹覆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_crystal_wrap ( Crystal Wrapping )"
msgid ""
"You cover your body with a layer of small, razor-sharp crystals.  It makes "
"monsters that attack you take some damage in return, and gives you some "
"additional cut damage in melee."
msgstr "你用一层小而锋利的晶体覆盖住身体。它使攻击你的怪物受到一些伤害，并在近战中造成一些额外的切割伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shape_of_dust"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_shape_of_dust"
msgid "Shape of Dust"
msgstr "朦胧尘影"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shape_of_dust ( Shape of Dust )"
msgid ""
"Hide yourself within sand-filled winds.  It's harder to hit you, and monsters "
"can't spot you.  Attacking a target will break the spell."
msgstr ""
"Hide yourself within sand-filled winds.  It's harder to hit you, and monsters "
"can't spot you.  Attacking a target will break the spell."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_eshaper_golem"
msgid "Summon Earthshaper's Golem"
msgstr "召唤塑地者傀儡"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_eshaper_golem ( Summon Earthshaper's Golem
#. )"
msgid ""
"Shape a strong golem out of stone.  It may help for a while, but you haven't "
"enough energy to support it forever."
msgstr "塑造一个强大的石制傀儡。能帮上你很多，但你没有足够的能量永远维持它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_boulder"
msgid "Summon Boulder"
msgstr "召唤巨石"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_boulder ( Summon Boulder )"
msgid ""
"Pull forth a table of smooth rock from the underground bedrock, using your "
"forces of earthshaping.  You can use it as a table or as a primitive anvil."
msgstr ""
"Pull forth a table of smooth rock from the underground bedrock, using your "
"forces of earthshaping.  You can use it as a table or as a primitive anvil."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_reveal_world_map"
msgid "Reading the Earthbones"
msgstr "解读地骨"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_reveal_world_map ( Reading the
#. Earthbones )"
msgid ""
"You extend your senses into the ground, becoming aware of every hill and "
"valley within a large area.  It will only work when in contact with the earth."
msgstr "你可以将感官延伸到地面，感知到大片区域内的每一座山丘和山谷。 只有与大地接触时，它才会发挥作用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_MAP"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_DANGERSENSE"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_REVEAL_MAP"
msgid "Without a direct connection to the living earth, the spell fails."
msgstr "没有与生命土地的直接连接，法术失效了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_danger_sense"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_tremorsense"
msgid "Tremorsense"
msgstr "震颤感知"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_danger_sense ( Tremorsense )"
msgid ""
"By sensing their movements upon the earth, you can detect nearby sources of "
"danger.  You must maintain a connection to the earth for the spell to "
"function."
msgstr "通过感知它们在大地上的运动，你可以探测到附近的危险来源。你必须保持与大地的连接才能使法术发挥作用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_DANGERSENSE_CHECKER"
msgid ""
"As you break your connection to the living earth, your magical senses fade "
"away."
msgstr "当你切断与生命土地的联系时，你的魔法感官就会消失。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_fortitude_of_stone"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "earthshaper_fortitude_of_stone"
msgid "Stones' Fortitude"
msgstr "坚如磐石"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_fortitude_of_stone ( Stones' Fortitude
#. )"
msgid ""
"Draw on the eternal endurance of the stones, slowing your metabolism and "
"staving off hunger and thirst.  However, while the enchantment is in effect, "
"you will not heal."
msgstr "利用磐石永恒的耐力，减缓新陈代谢，缓解饥饿和干渴。 不过，当魔法生效时，你将无法痊愈。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_turning_of_earth"
msgid "The Turning of the Earth"
msgstr "翻土术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_turning_of_earth ( The Turning of the
#. Earth )"
msgid "Ask the earth spirits to prepare the earth for growth and planting."
msgstr "祈求大地之灵为生长和种植做好准备。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_granite_aegis"
msgid "Granite Aegis"
msgstr "花岗岩神盾"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_granite_aegis ( Granite Aegis )"
msgid ""
"In an extremity of danger, summon a hollow shell of rock around yourself.  It "
"lasts only a few moments, but sometimes that's all you need.  You must be "
"standing on the living earth to invoke it."
msgstr "在极端危险的情况下，在自己周围召唤一个空心的岩石外壳。 它只能持续片刻，但有时这就是你所需要的。 你必须站在生命土地上才能召唤它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_GRANITE_AEGIS"
msgid ""
"Without a connection to the living earth or a flat surface of solid rock, the "
"spell fails."
msgstr "如果没有与生命土地或坚硬岩石的平面相连接，法术就会失效。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_harden_earth"
msgid "Harden Earth"
msgstr "泥土硬化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_harden_earth ( Harden Earth )"
msgid ""
"Compress dirt together so it becomes as hard as rock.  A great way to turn "
"makeshift barricades into a fortress."
msgstr "将泥土压缩，使其变得像岩石一样坚硬。将简易路障变成堡垒的好方法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_sleep_in_earth"
msgid "Stone Slumber"
msgstr "Stone Slumber"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_sleep_in_earth ( Stone Slumber )"
msgid ""
"When standing on earth or stone, sink into the ground.  While submerged, you "
"will heal faster, sleep will be more restorative, and you will not need to "
"eat or drink.  Cast this spell again to return to the surface."
msgstr ""
"When standing on earth or stone, sink into the ground.  While submerged, you "
"will heal faster, sleep will be more restorative, and you will not need to "
"eat or drink.  Cast this spell again to return to the surface."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid ""
"As you complete the spell, the earth parts beneath you and you sink down into "
"the stone."
msgstr ""
"As you complete the spell, the earth parts beneath you and you sink down into "
"the stone."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid ""
"As you nearly complete the spell, you stop in your tracks.  There's something "
"odd about the ground below you, and sinking into it would be too dangerous."
msgstr ""
"As you nearly complete the spell, you stop in your tracks.  There's something "
"odd about the ground below you, and sinking into it would be too dangerous."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid "You must be standing on the living earth to sink into the stone!"
msgstr "你必须站在生命土地上才能沉入石头中！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid ""
"As you recite the words of release, you feel yourself rising until you stand "
"in the clear air once again."
msgstr ""
"As you recite the words of release, you feel yourself rising until you stand "
"in the clear air once again."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_repair_metal_stone"
msgid "Fault-Mending Chant"
msgstr "Fault-Mending Chant"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_repair_metal_stone ( Fault-Mending
#. Chant )"
msgid ""
"While holding an item made of natural metal or stone, mold it with your "
"hands, work to repairing any flaws and restoring its condition.  Note that "
"some items may still not be repaired."
msgstr ""
"While holding an item made of natural metal or stone, mold it with your "
"hands, work to repairing any flaws and restoring its condition.  Note that "
"some items may still not be repaired."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_REPAIR_METAL_STONE_ITEM" in nested EOCs on true condition
#. in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_REPAIR_METAL_STONE"
msgid ""
"The magic simply does not take hold.  The item cannot be repaired, even with "
"sorcery."
msgstr ""
"The magic simply does not take hold.  The item cannot be repaired, even with "
"sorcery."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_diggable_teleport"
msgid "Earth Gate"
msgstr "Earth Gate"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_diggable_teleport ( Earth Gate )"
msgid ""
"While standing on natural earth, sink into it and emerge from any other patch "
"of natural earth within the spell's range."
msgstr ""
"While standing on natural earth, sink into it and emerge from any other patch "
"of natural earth within the spell's range."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_EARTH_GATE_TELEPORT_CHECK"
msgid "Select nearby earth to gate to."
msgstr "Select nearby earth to gate to."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_EARTH_GATE_TELEPORT_CHECK"
msgid "You sink into the earth and re-emerge nearby."
msgstr "你沉入地面，然后在附近再次出现。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_EARTH_GATE_TELEPORT_CHECK"
msgid "You must select a patch of earth to transport to."
msgstr "You must select a patch of earth to transport to."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_EARTH_GATE_TELEPORT_CHECK"
msgid "You must be on the living earth to use Earth Gate."
msgstr "You must be on the living earth to use Earth Gate."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Name of spell "goblin_tame_warg_spell"
msgid "Warg-Friend"
msgstr "Warg-Friend"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of spell "goblin_tame_warg_spell ( Warg-Friend )"
msgid ""
"Goblins and wargs have had an innate bond from time immemorial, and even wild "
"wargs will easily heel when a goblin calls…as long as the goblin has some raw "
"meat to feed them with."
msgstr ""
"Goblins and wargs have had an innate bond from time immemorial, and even wild "
"wargs will easily heel when a goblin calls…as long as the goblin has some raw "
"meat to feed them with."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/fantasy_species.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Message of spell "goblin_tame_warg_spell ( Warg-Friend )"
#. ~ Message of spell "telepathic_animal_mind_control ( [Ψ]Beastmaster )"
msgid "You take control of the animal's mind!"
msgstr "你接管了动物的思维！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "feral_animist_summon_zombie ( Summon Zombie
#. )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "feral_animist_summon_tough_zombie ( Summon
#. Tough Zombie )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "feral_animist_summon_zombie_brute ( Summon
#. Zombie Brute )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "feral_animist_summon_zombie_hulk ( Radiation
#. Mage Summon Zombie )"
msgid "a roar"
msgstr "一声吼叫"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/infrastructure.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "soul_pressure ( Soul Pressure )"
msgid "a grunt and a sizzle"
msgstr "咕噜声和嘶嘶声"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "conj_throwing_blade3 ( Conjure Throwing Blade I )"
msgid "You activate your ring and three throwing knives appear, ready to throw!"
msgstr "你使用了戒指，出現三把飛刀，準備投擲！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "conj_mag_throw_blade_1 ( Conjure Magical Throwing Blade
#. I )"
msgid "You activate your bag and a throwing knife appears, ready to throw!"
msgstr "你激活了你的袋子，一把魔法飞刀随之产生，随时可以投掷！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "conj_mag_throw_blade_fire ( Conjure Magical Throwing
#. Blade Fire )"
msgid ""
"You activate your bag and a throwing knife wrapped in ethereal flames "
"appears, ready to throw!"
msgstr "你激活了你的袋子，一把包裹着永恒之焰的魔法飞刀随之产生，随时可以投掷！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "conj_mag_throw_blade_cold ( Conjure Magical Throwing
#. Blade Cold )"
msgid ""
"You activate your bag and a throwing knife emanating cold appears, ready to "
"throw!"
msgstr "你激活了你的袋子，一把散发着刺骨冰寒的魔法飞刀随之产生，随时可以投掷！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "conj_mag_throw_blade_cut ( Conjure Magical Throwing
#. Blade Cut )"
msgid ""
"You activate your bag and a throwing knife with unnaturally sharp edges "
"appears, ready to throw!"
msgstr "你激活了你的袋子，一把异常锋利的魔法飞刀随之产生，随时可以投掷！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "conj_mag_throw_blade_biological ( Conjure Magical
#. Throwing Blade Biological )"
msgid ""
"You activate your bag and a throwing knife covered in dark ooze appears, "
"ready to throw!"
msgstr "你激活了你的袋子，一把包裹着黑色软泥的魔法飞刀随之产生，随时可以投掷！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "magical_throwing_knife_pure_special ( Conjure Magical
#. Throwing Blade Pure )"
msgid ""
"You activate your bag and with a flash magical energies coalescence in your "
"hand into a shape of knife.  It seems vastly more powerful than other knives "
"that appear from the bag!"
msgstr "你激活了你的袋子，一瞬间纯净的魔法能量在你的手上汇聚成飞刀的形状。它看起来比袋子里的其他飞刀威力要大得多！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "potion_recover_mana ( Recover Mana )"
#. ~ Message of spell "potion_recover_mana_xe ( Recover Mana )"
msgid "You start regenerating mana!"
msgstr "你開始恢復法力！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "mana_doping ( Pain )"
msgid ""
"Your veins feel like they are on fire!\n"
"You start regenerating mana!"
msgstr ""
"你的血管感覺像是著火了！\n"
"你開始恢復法力！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Message of spell "flask_regeneration_effect ( Renovamen Healing Effect )"
msgid "You start regenerating!"
msgstr "You start regenerating!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Fire_Elemental.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "alchemist_mine_pull ( Mana explosion )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "flarewhip ( Flarewhip )"
msgid "whoosh"
msgstr "唰"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mag_open_beetle_ball_large"
msgid "Call Stag Beetles"
msgstr "Call Stag Beetles"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mag_open_beetle_ball_large ( Call Stag Beetles )"
msgid "Call upon stag beetles for various tasks."
msgstr "Call upon stag beetles for various tasks."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_STAG_BEETLE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Call stag beetle for riding"
msgstr "Call stag beetle for riding"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_STAG_BEETLE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Call beetles for foraging"
msgstr "Call beetles for foraging"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_STAG_BEETLE_SELECTOR"
msgid ""
"Call a stag beetle for riding.  Will respond if you haven't called for one in "
"awhile."
msgstr ""
"Call a stag beetle for riding.  Will respond if you haven't called for one in "
"awhile."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_STAG_BEETLE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Call local beetles to forage hidden areas around you."
msgstr "Call local beetles to forage hidden areas around you."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CALL_STAG_BEETLE"
msgid ""
"The wildwood beetle makes its call.  You feel something large coming, and it "
"is coming fast."
msgstr ""
"The wildwood beetle makes its call.  You feel something large coming, and it "
"is coming fast."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_CALL_STAG_BEETLE"
msgid ""
"The wildwood beetle makes its call, but only some small beetles respond.  "
"They'll bring you a small gift."
msgstr ""
"The wildwood beetle makes its call, but only some small beetles respond.  "
"They'll bring you a small gift."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SUMMON_STAG_BEETLE"
msgid ""
"The stag beetle arrives, it is massive and powerful.  It can be used to carry "
"you and your belongings so long as you have a wildwood rune and the skill to "
"ride it."
msgstr ""
"The stag beetle arrives, it is massive and powerful.  It can be used to carry "
"you and your belongings so long as you have a wildwood rune and the skill to "
"ride it."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CALL_FORAGING_BEETLES"
msgid "The beetles come swiftly, bearing some mushrooms."
msgstr "The beetles come swiftly, bearing some mushrooms."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LOSE_STAG_BEETLE_BOND"
msgid "Your bond with the stag beetle fades.  Another can answer the call now."
msgstr "Your bond with the stag beetle fades.  Another can answer the call now."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mag_call_stag_beetle_real"
msgid "Call Stag Beetle"
msgstr "Call Stag Beetle"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/item_only.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mag_call_stag_beetle_real ( Call Stag Beetle )"
msgid ""
"A stag beetle responds to the call, arriving in the location you are in.  It "
"can be used to carry you and your belongings so long as you have a wildwood "
"rune and the skill to ride it."
msgstr ""
"A stag beetle responds to the call, arriving in the location you are in.  It "
"can be used to carry you and your belongings so long as you have a wildwood "
"rune and the skill to ride it."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "point_flare"
msgid "Point Flare"
msgstr "定點驟燃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "point_flare ( Point Flare )"
msgid ""
"Generates strong heat at the targeted location, damaging anything susceptible "
"to high temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Generates strong heat at the targeted location, damaging anything susceptible "
"to high temperatures."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "nova_flare"
msgid "Nova Flare"
msgstr "火焰新星"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "nova_flare ( Nova Flare )"
msgid ""
"Generates an intense heat at the location, greatly damaging anything "
"susceptible to high temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Generates an intense heat at the location, greatly damaging anything "
"susceptible to high temperatures."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_lighter"
msgid "Finger Firelighter"
msgstr "指尖引火"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_lighter ( Finger Firelighter )"
msgid ""
"Summons a small flame that does not affect you, but can be used to light "
"things on fire.  It seems to need you to have some intent to light things on "
"fire, since you are able to put it in your pocket with no issue."
msgstr ""
"Summons a small flame that does not affect you, but can be used to light "
"things on fire.  It seems to need you to have some intent to light things on "
"fire, since you are able to put it in your pocket with no issue."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ice_spike"
msgid "Ice Spike"
msgstr "冰刺術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ice_spike ( Ice Spike )"
msgid ""
"Causes jagged icicles to form in the air above the target, falling and "
"damaging them."
msgstr ""
"Causes jagged icicles to form in the air above the target, falling and "
"damaging them."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "fireball"
msgid "Fireball"
msgstr "火球術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "fireball ( Fireball )"
msgid ""
"You hurl a pea-sized glowing orb that produces a pressure-less blast of "
"searing heat when it hits an obstacle or reaches the target."
msgstr ""
"You hurl a pea-sized glowing orb that produces a pressure-less blast of "
"searing heat when it hits an obstacle or reaches the target."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cone_cold"
msgid "Cone of Cold"
msgstr "冷錐術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cone_cold ( Cone of Cold )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Cone of Cold"
msgid "You blast a cone of frigid air toward the target."
msgstr "你向目標吹出一股錐狀的冰寒氣團。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "burning_hands"
msgid "Burning Hands"
msgstr "燃燒之手"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "burning_hands ( Burning Hands )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Burning Hands"
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure you saw this in a game somewhere.  You fire a short-range "
"cone of fire."
msgstr "你很確定在某個遊戲裡面看過它。你發射短距離的火焰錐體。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "frost_spray"
msgid "Frost Spray"
msgstr "寒霜噴霧"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "frost_spray ( Frost Spray )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Frost Spray"
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure you saw this in a game somewhere.  You fire a short-range "
"cone of ice and cold."
msgstr "你很確定在某個遊戲裡面看過它。你發射短距離的寒冰錐體。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "chilling_touch"
msgid "Chilling Touch"
msgstr "冰冷之觸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "chilling_touch ( Chilling Touch )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Chilling Touch"
msgid "Freezes the touched target with intense cold."
msgstr "以強烈的冰冷冷凍接觸到的目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "glide_ice"
msgid "Glide on Ice"
msgstr "冰面滑行"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "glide_ice ( Glide on Ice )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Glide on Ice"
msgid ""
"Encases your feet in a magical coating of ice, allowing you to glide along "
"smooth surfaces faster."
msgstr "將你的腳包覆在魔法的冰層中，使你可以在光滑的表面快速滑行。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "glide_ice_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Glide on Ice"
msgstr "强化冰上滑行<br>"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "glide_ice_plus ( Enhanced Glide on Ice )"
msgid ""
"Encases your feet in a magical coating of ice, allowing you to glide along "
"smooth surfaces faster.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, "
"and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"Encases your feet in a magical coating of ice, allowing you to glide along "
"smooth surfaces faster.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, "
"and have started to design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "hoary_blast"
msgid "Hoary Blast"
msgstr "蒼白爆破"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "hoary_blast ( Hoary Blast )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Hoary Blast"
msgid ""
"You project a glowing white crystal of ice and it explodes on impact into a "
"blossom of shattering cold."
msgstr "你投射出一顆發光的白色冰晶，撞擊後爆炸並綻放破碎冰花。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ice_shield"
msgid "Ice Shield"
msgstr "冰盾術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ice_shield ( Ice Shield )"
msgid ""
"Creates a magical shield of ice on your arm, with which you can defend "
"yourself in melee and use it to bash."
msgstr "在你的手臂上制造一个魔法冰盾，你可以用它在近战中保护自己，并使用它来攻击。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ice_shield_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Ice Shield"
msgstr "强化冰盾"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ice_shield_plus ( Enhanced Ice Shield )"
msgid ""
"Creates a magical shield of ice on your arm, with which you can defend "
"yourself and use it to bash.  Now you know this spell like the back of your "
"hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr "在你的手臂上制造一个魔法冰盾，你可以用它在近战中保护自己，并使用它来攻击。现在你对这个法术了如指掌，并设计出了你自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "frost_armor"
msgid "Frost Armor"
msgstr "寒霜護甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "frost_armor ( Frost Armor )"
msgid ""
"Covers you in a thin layer of reactive magical ice to attack those who harm "
"you."
msgstr "用一层薄薄的魔法冰来保护你，反击你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "frost_armor_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Frost Armor"
msgstr "强化霜甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "frost_armor_plus ( Enhanced Frost Armor )"
msgid ""
"Covers you in a thin layer of reactive magical ice to attack those who harm "
"you.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to "
"design your own version."
msgstr ""
"Covers you in a thin layer of reactive magical ice to attack those who harm "
"you.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to "
"design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_kelvinist"
msgid "Kelvinist Rune"
msgstr "熱力學者符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_kelvinist ( Kelvinist Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual freezes a small fire in order to create a rune attuned to "
"Kelvinists.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""
"This ritual freezes a small fire in order to create a rune attuned to "
"Kelvinists.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_summon_flamesword"
msgid "Flamesword"
msgstr "烈焰劍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_summon_flamesword ( Flamesword )"
msgid ""
"This spell ignites a wooden sword, creating a flaming blade able to burn, "
"bruise, and chop."
msgstr "这个法术点燃一柄木剑，将其变成一把燃烧的剑。可以对敌人造成烧伤、钝击、斩击伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_summon_flamesword_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Flamesword"
msgstr "强化火焰剑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_summon_flamesword_plus ( Enhanced
#. Flamesword )"
msgid ""
"This spell ignites a wooden sword, creating a flaming blade able to burn, "
"bruise, and chop.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and "
"have started to design your own version."
msgstr "这个法术点燃一柄木剑，将其变成一把燃烧的剑。可以对敌人造成烧伤、钝击、斩击伤害。现在你对这个法术了如指掌，并设计出了你自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_flamebreath"
msgid "Flamebreath"
msgstr "火焰吐息"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_flamebreath ( Flamebreath )"
msgid ""
"This spell ignites dust scattered in the air, creating a cone of flame.  The "
"hot ashes can cling to targets, causing additional burns over time."
msgstr "这个法术点燃散布在空气中的尘埃，释放出一个火焰锥。炽热的灰烬会附着在目标身上，并随着时间的推移造成更多灼伤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "freezing_touch"
msgid "Freezing Touch"
msgstr "急凍之觸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "freezing_touch ( Freezing Touch )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Freezing Touch"
msgid ""
"Your hands freeze anything they touch at temperatures so cold it slows down "
"your foes."
msgstr "你的手用低溫凍結任何觸碰的目標，緩慢你的目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_power_effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_anti_cold"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_kelvinist_anti_cold"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_END_PSI_POWERS_SPECIFIC"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_pyrokinetic_cloak"
msgid "Cloak of Warmth"
msgstr "熱熱斗篷"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_anti_cold ( Cloak of Warmth )"
msgid ""
"Heat the nearby air, keeping you warm and providing some protection against "
"ice and cold."
msgstr "加熱附近的空氣，提供保暖，並提供一些寒冷保護。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_anti_heat"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_kelvinist_anti_heat"
msgid "Cloak of Chill"
msgstr "涼涼斗篷"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_anti_heat ( Cloak of Chill )"
msgid ""
"Cool the nearby air, keeping you cool and providing some protection against "
"heat and flame."
msgstr "冷卻附近的空氣，使你保持涼爽，並提供高溫和火焰保護。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_persuasion_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_kelvinist_flames_of_passion"
msgid "Flames of Passion"
msgstr "热情之火"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_persuasion_spell ( Flames of Passion )"
msgid ""
"Like the bonfire gathers revelers around it, the kelvinist becomes the life "
"of the party, as their eyes shine with passion and their voice burns with the "
"heat of their conviction.  You will be more convincing while this spell is in "
"effect.  Before the Cataclysm, this was one of the most common spells that "
"apprentices were desperate to learn and master mages were reluctant to teach."
msgstr ""
"就像篝火聚集了狂欢者一样，炽霜法师成为了派对的灵魂，他们的眼睛闪耀着激情，声音中燃烧着坚定的热情。生效期间，你会更有说服力。在大灾变之前，这是学徒们渴望学习"
"的常见法术之一，而大师们却不愿意传授。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_extinguish_fire_spell ( Extinguish )"
msgid ""
"Just as the kelvinist can start a fire, they can extinguish it, by "
"transmuting the heat of the fire directly into cold and leaving nothing left "
"to continue the flames."
msgstr "就像炽霜法师可以生火一样，他们也可以通过将火焰的热量直接转化为冰冷，不留下任何让火焰持续的东西，来使其熄灭。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_summon_freezer_spell"
msgid "Freezer Field"
msgstr "Freezer Field"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_summon_freezer_spell ( Freezer Field )"
msgid ""
"Summon a sphere of ice that will preserve anything placed inside while the "
"container lasts."
msgstr ""
"Summon a sphere of ice that will preserve anything placed inside while the "
"container lasts."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_no_emotion_spell"
msgid "The Rime-Covered Heart"
msgstr "覆霜之心"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_no_emotion_spell ( The Rime-Covered Heart
#. )"
msgid ""
"Draw on the essence of ice to freeze out all emotion, rendering you "
"comfortably numb.  This spell used to get you on several lists if the "
"government learned that you knew it, back when there was a government to care "
"about that."
msgstr "凭借冰之精华，冻结所有感情，使你变得惬意地麻木。在那个还重视着这个法术的政府还没崩溃的时候，一旦政府知道你了解这个，你必然会上好几个名单。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_firebolt"
msgid "Firebolt"
msgstr "霹雳火花"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_firebolt ( Firebolt )"
msgid ""
"A simple spell that hurls a bolt of fire to the target location.  While not "
"as damaging as some more complex spells, it is quick to cast and will ignite "
"anything flammable at the target."
msgstr "一个简单的咒语，向目标位置掷出一道闪电。虽然不像一些更复杂的咒语那样具有破坏性，但它施放速度很快，会点燃目标上的任何易燃物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "kelvinist_firebolt ( Firebolt )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_eruption ( [Ψ]Fountain of Flames
#. )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_flamethrower ( [Ψ]Flamethrower )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_aoe_explosion ( Salamander AoE
#. Explosion )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_make_fire ( Enkindle )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_flame_punch_spell ( Blazing Blow
#. )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_fire_breath ( Breath of the
#. Firedragon )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_explosion_trap_spell_activated (
#. Salamander Trap Explosion )"
msgid "a crackle!"
msgstr "一阵噼啪声！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_heat_food"
msgid "Baking Hands"
msgstr "烹饪之手"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_heat_food ( Baking Hands )"
msgid ""
"With the tiniest amount of heat, unfreeze an item of food or drink and heat "
"it up to a comfortable temperature."
msgstr "用最少量的热量解冻食物或饮料，并将其加热到舒适的温度。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_set_everyone_on_fire"
msgid "Flames of the Apocalypse"
msgstr "天启之火"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_set_everyone_on_fire ( Flames of the
#. Apocalypse )"
msgid ""
"Force a large amount of burning mana into every hostile target affected by "
"the spell, causing them to explode in flames.  Knowledge of this spell "
"required licensing and registration before the Cataclysm, but you're pretty "
"sure the ATF isn't going to be hassling you any time soon."
msgstr "将大量燃烧的魔力强制注入每个受法术影响的敌对目标，使其在烈火中爆炸。在大灾变前，了解这个法术需要许可和登记，但现在你很确定 ATF 不会再来找你麻烦了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/lizardfolk_shaman.json
#. ~ Message of spell "spell_summon_crocodile ( Summon Crocodile )"
msgid "The shaman summons a crocodile!"
msgstr "蜥蜴人萨满召唤出一只鳄鱼！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shadow_field"
msgid "Shadow Field"
msgstr "陰影力場"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shadow_field ( Shadow Field )"
msgid "Shroud an area in intense shadows."
msgstr "Shroud an area in intense shadows."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magic_missile"
msgid "Magic Missile"
msgstr "魔法飛彈"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magic_missile ( Magic Missile )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Magic Missile"
msgid "I cast Magic Missile at the darkness!"
msgstr "我能在黑暗中施放魔法飛彈！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "phase_door"
msgid "Phase Door"
msgstr "相位之門"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "phase_door ( Phase Door )"
msgid "Teleports you a short distance in a random direction."
msgstr "把你往随机方向传送一小段距离。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dimension_door"
msgid "Dimension Door"
msgstr "次元門"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dimension_door ( Dimension Door )"
msgid "Teleports you randomly near a target location."
msgstr "将你随机传送至目标位置附近。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gravity_well"
msgid "Gravity Well"
msgstr "重力井"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gravity_well ( Gravity Well )"
msgid ""
"Summons a well of gravity centered on the targeted location.  Dealing bashing "
"damage to all creatures in the affected area."
msgstr "在指定地点的中央召唤一口重力井。对受影响地区的所有生物造成钝击伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_mana_blast"
msgid "Mana Blast"
msgstr "魔力爆破"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_mana_blast ( Mana Blast )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mana Blast"
msgid "A blast of concentrated magical power that obliterates a large area."
msgstr "集中的魔力爆破對一個大範圍區域造成抹滅。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_mana_bolt"
msgid "Mana Bolt"
msgstr "魔力之箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_mana_bolt ( Mana Bolt )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mana Bolt"
msgid "A bolt of magical power that only damages your foes."
msgstr "魔力箭矢可以精確打擊你的目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_haste"
msgid "Haste"
msgstr "加速術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_haste ( Haste )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Haste"
msgid ""
"This spell gives you an enormous boost of speed lasting a short period of "
"time."
msgstr "此法術可以在短時間內極大地提高速度。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_slow ( Slow )"
msgid ""
"This spell weakens your target, resulting in a decrease of speed lasting a "
"short period of time."
msgstr "这个法术削弱你的敌人，导致其速度暂时降低。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_baleful_polymorph"
msgid "Baleful Polymorph"
msgstr "惡意變形術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_baleful_polymorph ( Baleful Polymorph )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Baleful Polymorph"
msgid "Transform your enemies into frogs."
msgstr "把你的敵人們變成青蛙。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_mana_beam"
msgid "Mana Beam"
msgstr "魔力射線"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_mana_beam ( Mana Beam )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mana Beam"
msgid "A beam of focused magical power that damages any foes in its path."
msgstr "這專注的魔法力量射線會傷害路徑上的任何目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_escape"
msgid "Escape"
msgstr "逃脫術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_escape ( Escape )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Escape"
msgid ""
"Teleports you in a random direction a medium distance, to help escape your "
"foes in dangerous situations."
msgstr "把你傳送到中距離的隨機方向，幫助你逃離危險情況。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_magus"
msgid "Magus Rune"
msgstr "祆教徒符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_magus ( Magus Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual forces small amounts of mana to crystallize out into intricate "
"patterns, making a rune attuned to Magi.  You can use the rune as a catalyst "
"for recipes."
msgstr "这个仪式能将少量的魔力结晶压成复杂的图案，形成与魔法契合的符文。 你可以将符文作为催化剂用于制造其它物品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cats_grace"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "cats_grace"
msgid "Cat's Grace"
msgstr "貓之優雅"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cats_grace ( Cat's Grace )"
msgid ""
"You align your senses to be closer to those of a cat, becoming more graceful, "
"agile, and coordinated."
msgstr ""
"You align your senses to be closer to those of a cat, becoming more graceful, "
"agile, and coordinated."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eagles_sight"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "eagles_sight"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Eagle's Sight"
msgstr "鷹之視野"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eagles_sight ( Eagle's Sight )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Eagle's Sight"
msgid "You gain the perception of an eagle."
msgstr "你得到獵鷹般的感知力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ogres_strength"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "ogres_strength"
msgid "Ogre's Strength"
msgstr "食人魔之力"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ogres_strength ( Ogre's Strength )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ogre's Strength"
msgid "You gain the strength of an ogre."
msgstr "你得到食人魔的力量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "foxs_cunning"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "foxs_cunning"
msgid "Fox's Cunning"
msgstr "狐之狡滑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "foxs_cunning ( Fox's Cunning )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Fox's Cunning"
msgid "You become wily like a fox."
msgstr "你變得像狐狸一樣狡滑。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_force_jar"
msgid "Jar of Force"
msgstr "力場瓶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_force_jar ( Jar of Force )"
msgid "Summon a jar of force in which you can store liquids."
msgstr "招換一個可以用來儲存液體的力場瓶。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_summon_impact_sling"
msgid "Impact Sling"
msgstr "衝擊投索"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_summon_impact_sling ( Impact Sling )"
msgid ""
"This spell infuses a sling with tremendous force, delivering devastating "
"pebble shots until the energy tears it apart."
msgstr "这个法术将巨大的力量注入投石索，在能量撕碎自己之前，投掷出威力巨大的石子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_summon_impact_sling_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Impact Sling"
msgstr "强化冲击投索"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_summon_impact_sling_plus ( Enhanced Impact
#. Sling )"
msgid ""
"This spell infuses a sling with tremendous force, delivering devastating "
"pebble shots until the energy tears it apart.  Now you know this spell like "
"the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "focused_bolt"
msgid "Focused Bolt"
msgstr "聚能光束"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "focused_bolt ( Focused Bolt )"
msgid ""
"You focus your mana into a microscopically thin pulsed beam of pure energy, "
"capable of extreme range and precision; as well as unparalleled penetration, "
"provided proper skill.  Once the invention of a notorious assassin, this "
"spell has slain many a king and noble.  Passed on only through direct "
"descendants over the ages, though occasionally shared by them to others."
msgstr ""
"你将你的魔力聚集到一束极薄的纯能量脉冲光束中，具有极高的射程和精度；以及无与伦比的穿透力，只要技能等级足够。这个法术曾经是一名臭名昭著的刺客的发明，曾经杀死"
"了无数国王和贵族。它只通过世代相传的直系后裔传承，虽然偶尔也会被他们分享给其他人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_slowfall"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_slowfall"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_slowfall"
msgid "Slowfall"
msgstr "羽落術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_slowfall ( Slowfall )"
msgid ""
"Reduce the velocity of your falls by a great amount, or to zero if at high "
"mastery."
msgstr "將下落速度大幅降低，或是如果你超厲害的話能夠降成零。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_spiderclimb"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_spiderclimb"
msgid "Spider Climb"
msgstr "蛛行术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_spiderclimb ( Spider Climb )"
msgid "Ascend even the most sheer wall with ease as you cling to surfaces."
msgstr "Ascend even the most sheer wall with ease as you cling to surfaces."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_teleport_mark"
msgid "Magus's Mark"
msgstr "魔术标记"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_teleport_mark ( Magus's Mark )"
msgid "Mark a particular patch of ground to allow you to return to it later."
msgstr "在一块特定的土地上做上标记，这样你以后就可以回到那里。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MAGUS_MARK"
msgid ""
"As you make the gestures and recite the incantation, a brief glow fills your "
"surroundings."
msgstr "随着你做完手势、念完咒语，你的周围充斥过转瞬即逝的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_word_of_recall"
msgid "Word of Recall"
msgstr "世界召回"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_word_of_recall ( Word of Recall )"
msgid ""
"Immediately return to the place you marked with Magus's Mark, no matter how "
"far away it is."
msgstr "立即回到你标有魔术师标记的地方，无论它有多远。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MAGUS_RECALL"
msgid "You shout out the word of recall and suddenly you are somewhere else."
msgstr "你喊出召回词汇，突然你就到了别的地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_stop_attack_shield"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_mageshield"
msgid "Mageshield"
msgstr "魔法盾"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_stop_attack_shield ( Mageshield )"
msgid ""
"A simple but powerful spell, Mageshield will render the caster immune to any "
"single attack.  It is indiscriminate: whether hit by an anti-tank missile or "
"the caster stubbing their toe, it will absorb all energy of the attack and "
"then fade."
msgstr ""
"A simple but powerful spell, Mageshield will render the caster immune to any "
"single attack.  It is indiscriminate: whether hit by an anti-tank missile or "
"the caster stubbing their toe, it will absorb all energy of the attack and "
"then fade."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_far_hand_pull"
msgid "Sorcerer's Hand"
msgstr "法师之手"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_far_hand_pull ( Sorcerer's Hand )"
msgid "Pull a target or set of items to you."
msgstr "拉取一个目标或一组物品给你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_ranged_increase"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_ranged_increase"
msgid "Arrowflight"
msgstr "能量箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_ranged_increase ( Arrowflight )"
msgid ""
"A popular military spell since ancient times, Arrowflight increases the range "
"of bows and, as it later turned out, firearms."
msgstr ""
"A popular military spell since ancient times, Arrowflight increases the range "
"of bows and, as it later turned out, firearms."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_diamond_imbuement"
msgid "Diamond Imbuement"
msgstr "钻石附魔"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_diamond_imbuement ( Diamond Imbuement )"
msgid ""
"Magically infuse a melee weapon with the hardness and resilience of a diamond "
"as well as its industrial cutting capability, making it supremely sharp and "
"durable.  However, like a diamond, any damage the weapon suffers afterwards "
"cannot be repaired."
msgstr ""
"Magically infuse a melee weapon with the hardness and resilience of a diamond "
"as well as its industrial cutting capability, making it supremely sharp and "
"durable.  However, like a diamond, any damage the weapon suffers afterwards "
"cannot be repaired."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_silence"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_silence"
msgid "Silence"
msgstr "沉默术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_silence ( Silence )"
msgid ""
"Affect the air around the target and their vocal cords, preventing them from "
"making any noise whatsoever.  This makes them much more stealthy, but they "
"cannot cast any spells requiring speech."
msgstr ""
"Affect the air around the target and their vocal cords, preventing them from "
"making any noise whatsoever.  This makes them much more stealthy, but they "
"cannot cast any spells requiring speech."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_light_target"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_faerie_fire"
msgid "Faerie Fire"
msgstr "妖精之火"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_light_target ( Faerie Fire )"
msgid ""
"Cause the air around the target to glow slightly, revealing their location "
"and making it slightly harder for them to dodge attacks."
msgstr ""
"Cause the air around the target to glow slightly, revealing their location "
"and making it slightly harder for them to dodge attacks."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_permanent_light"
msgid "Imperishable Light"
msgstr "不灭之光"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_permanent_light ( Imperishable Light )"
msgid ""
"Enchant the air in a location to glow, producing a orb of soft light.  While "
"not particularly bright, the light will last years if you're not lucky and "
"millennia if you are."
msgstr ""
"Enchant the air in a location to glow, producing a orb of soft light.  While "
"not particularly bright, the light will last years if you're not lucky and "
"millennia if you are."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_cannot_move_attack_or_damage_target"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_cannot_move_attack_or_damage_target"
msgid "Adamantine Gaol"
msgstr "Adamantine Gaol"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_cannot_move_attack_or_damage_target (
#. Adamantine Gaol )"
msgid ""
"Create an impenetrable shell of force around the target, preventing them from "
"moving or acting for the spell's duration.  The shell works in two directions "
"and the target is also immune to all harm.\n"
"\n"
"Adamantine Gaol <color_yellow>cannot be dispelled</color>."
msgstr ""
"Create an impenetrable shell of force around the target, preventing them from "
"moving or acting for the spell's duration.  The shell works in two directions "
"and the target is also immune to all harm.\n"
"\n"
"Adamantine Gaol <color_yellow>cannot be dispelled</color>."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_push_nearby_enemies_back"
msgid "Repulsion Wave"
msgstr "Repulsion Wave"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_push_nearby_enemies_back ( Repulsion Wave )"
msgid ""
"Unleash a wave of force, hurling all nearby targets away from you.  Heavier "
"targets are harder to affect."
msgstr ""
"Unleash a wave of force, hurling all nearby targets away from you.  Heavier "
"targets are harder to affect."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_efficiency_01"
msgid "First Circle: Lesser Mana Efficiency."
msgstr "第一圈：略多魔力容纳"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_efficiency_01 ( First Circle: Lesser
#. Mana Efficiency. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the efficiency by which your body "
"processes mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Efficiency trait.  The ritual "
"must end when the sun is in the sky and you are at least one story above the "
"ground.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"进行一个魔法仪式以提高你身体处理魔力的效率，授予你略多魔力容纳特性。仪式必须在阳光照耀下结束，并且你至少在地面以上一层楼的高度。\n"
"\n"
"仪式成功的几率取决于你的法术等级和法术技巧。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD1_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD2_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN1_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN2_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT1_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT2_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT2"
msgid ""
"As you intone the final words of the spell, you wait for the change, but "
"nothing happens.  You must need more practice."
msgstr ""
"As you intone the final words of the spell, you wait for the change, but "
"nothing happens.  You must need more practice."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT2"
msgid ""
"You intone the final words of the spell, but without the proper conditions "
"being fulfilled it has no effect."
msgstr ""
"You intone the final words of the spell, but without the proper conditions "
"being fulfilled it has no effect."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_efficiency_02"
msgid "Second Circle: Mana Efficiency."
msgstr "第二圈：较多魔力容纳"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_efficiency_02 ( Second Circle: Mana
#. Efficiency. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the efficiency by which your body "
"processes mana, granting you the Mana Efficiency trait.  You must already "
"have the Lesser Mana Efficiency trait for the spell to take full effect.  The "
"ritual must end within one hour of noon and you are at least four stories "
"above the ground.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"进行一个魔法仪式以提高你身体处理魔力的效率，授予你魔力效率特性。为了使法术完全生效，你必须已经具备略多魔力容纳特性。仪式必须在中午前后一小时内结束，并且你至"
"少在地面以上四层楼的高度。\n"
"\n"
"仪式成功的几率取决于你的法术等级和法术技能。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_regeneration_01"
msgid "First Circle: Lesser Mana Regeneration."
msgstr "第一圈：稍快魔力再生"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_regeneration_01 ( First Circle: Lesser
#. Mana Regeneration. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the speed by which your body restores "
"its mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Regeneration trait.  The ritual must "
"be performed while standing in a river or a stream.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"进行一个魔法仪式以提高你身体恢复魔力的速度，授予你稍快魔力再生特性。仪式必须在河流或小溪中进行。\n"
"\n"
"仪式成功的几率取决于你的法术等级和法术技能。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_regeneration_02"
msgid "Second Circle: Mana Regeneration."
msgstr "第二圈：快速魔力再生"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_regeneration_02 ( Second Circle: Mana
#. Regeneration. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the speed by which your body restores "
"its mana, granting you the Mana Regeneration trait.  You must already have "
"the Lesser Mana Regeneration trait for the spell to take full effect.  The "
"ritual must be performed while standing in a river.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"进行一个魔法仪式以提高你身体恢复魔力的速度，授予你魔力恢复特性。为了使法术完全生效，你必须已经具备稍快魔力再生特性。仪式必须在河流中进行。\n"
"\n"
"仪式成功的几率取决于你的法术等级和法术技能。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_sensitivity_01"
msgid "First Circle: Lesser Mana Sensitivity."
msgstr "第一圈：稍强魔力敏感"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_sensitivity_01 ( First Circle: Lesser
#. Mana Sensitivity. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to "
"mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait.  The ritual must take "
"place in a natural location away (at least 4 OM tiles) from buildings, roads, "
"or other evidence of civilization.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to "
"mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait.  The ritual must take "
"place in a natural location away (at least 4 OM tiles) from buildings, roads, "
"or other evidence of civilization.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_sensitivity_02"
msgid "Second Circle: Mana Sensitivity."
msgstr "第二圈：高强魔力敏感"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_sensitivity_02 ( Second Circle: Mana
#. Sensitivity. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to "
"mana, granting you the Mana Sensitivity trait.  You must already have the "
"Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait for the spell to take full effect.  The ritual "
"must take place in a natural location far away (at least 15 OM tiles) from "
"buildings, roads, or other evidence of civilization.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"进行一个魔法仪式以提高你身体对魔力的敏感度，授予你魔力敏感特性。为了使法术完全生效，你必须已经具备稍强魔力敏感特性。仪式必须在远离建筑、道路或其他文明迹象的"
"自然环境中进行（至少15 OM格远）。\n"
"\n"
"仪式成功的几率取决于你的法术等级和法术技能。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of spell "manatouched_crystal ( Crystallize Mana )"
msgid ""
"Crystallizes mana into solid form.  Your physiological changes have made this "
"spell much more efficient and easier to cast."
msgstr "将魔力凝聚成固体结晶型态。你生理上的变化使这个法术效果更强大，且更容易施放。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Name of spell "manatouched_seeker_bolts"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Seeker Bolts"
msgstr "追蹤箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of spell "manatouched_seeker_bolts ( Seeker Bolts )"
msgid ""
"Fires bolts of mana from your fingertips that home in on randomly selected "
"targets in range."
msgstr "从你的指尖发射多只魔法火焰箭，随机命中在射程中的目标。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "manatouched_seeker_bolts ( Seeker Bolts )"
msgid "a zing"
msgstr "尖啸声"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/monsterspells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "bear_trap ( Bear Trap )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "forge_trap ( Forge Trap )"
msgid "\"It's a trap!\""
msgstr "\"这是个陷阱！\""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/monsterspells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ethereal_grasp_monster ( Ethereal Grasp )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ethereal Grasp"
msgid ""
"A mass of spectral hands emerge from the ground, slowing everything in range. "
" Higher levels allow a bigger AoE, and longer effect."
msgstr "許多鬼手從地板升出來，減慢在該範圍內的所有東西。越高等級的範圍越大，持續時間也越久。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/monsterspells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_veggrasp_monster ( Vegetative Grasp Monster
#. )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Vegetative Grasp"
msgid ""
"This spell causes roots and vines to burst forth from the ground and grab "
"your foes, slowing them and doing a small amount of damage as they dig in."
msgstr "這個法術使植物根系和藤蔓從地上鑽出並抓住目標，在範圍內使他們變緩慢且受到小量的傷害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_ravenfolk_leap"
msgid "Wing Leap"
msgstr "Wing Leap"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effect_on_conditions/mutation_eocs.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_ravenfolk_leap ( Wing Leap )"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_RAVENFOLK_LEAP"
msgid "You launch yourself into a powerful wing-assisted leap."
msgstr "You launch yourself into a powerful wing-assisted leap."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "jolt"
msgid "Jolt"
msgstr "猛擊術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "jolt ( Jolt )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Jolt"
msgid "A short-ranged fan of electricity shoots from your fingers."
msgstr "從你手指射出短距離的電擊波動。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shocking_lash"
msgid "Shocking Lash"
msgstr "閃電鞭笞"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shocking_lash ( Shocking Lash )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shocking Lash"
msgid "A quick burst of electricity strikes a target and possibly one other nearby."
msgstr "快速爆發的電擊打擊目標和其附近可能的目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "lightning_bolt"
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_call_lightning"
msgid "Lightning Bolt"
msgstr "閃電之箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lightning_bolt ( Lightning Bolt )"
msgid ""
"The go-to spell for many Stormshapers, this iconic spell does just what you "
"expect: shoot lightning from your fingertips.  However, this lightning is "
"more directed than most lightning, and travels in a line through most "
"non-solid targets."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "windstrike"
msgid "Windstrike"
msgstr "風擊術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "windstrike ( Windstrike )"
msgid "A powerful blast of wind slams into anything in front of your body."
msgstr "一阵强风爆出，吹向你身体前的一切。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "windrun"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "enchant_windrun"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "enchant_windrun_monster"
msgid "Windrunning"
msgstr "迅捷之風"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "windrun ( Windrunning )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Windrunning"
msgid ""
"A magical wind pushes you forward as you move, easing your movements and "
"increasing speed."
msgstr "當你移動時，一股魔法風將你推向前方，讓你行動更加容易並提高速度。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_hammer"
msgid "Call Stormhammer"
msgstr "召喚暴風之錘"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_hammer ( Call Stormhammer )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Call Stormhammer"
msgid ""
"Creates a crackling magical warhammer full of lightning to smite your foes "
"with, and of course, smash things to bits!"
msgstr "製造一把充滿閃電劈啪作響的魔法戰鎚，用來打擊你的敵人，當然也能砸碎東西！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_hammer_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Call Stormhammer"
msgstr "强化风暴之锤"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_hammer_plus ( Enhanced Call Stormhammer )"
msgid ""
"Creates a crackling magical warhammer full of lightning to smite your foes "
"with, and of course, smash things to bits!  Now you know this spell like the "
"back of your hand, and start to design your own version."
msgstr "一个充满闪电的魔幻战锤，用闪电击打你的敌人。当然，也可以把东西砸成碎片！现在你对这个法术了如指掌，并设计出了你自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_stormshaper"
msgid "Stormshaper Rune"
msgstr "塑風者符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_stormshaper ( Stormshaper Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual creates a rune attuned to Stormshapers, which looks similar to "
"what you'd expect lightning in a glass pebble to look like.  You can use the "
"rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""
"This ritual creates a rune attuned to Stormshapers, which looks similar to "
"what you'd expect lightning in a glass pebble to look like.  You can use the "
"rune as a catalyst for recipes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "lightning_blast"
msgid "Lightning Blast"
msgstr "閃電爆破"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lightning_blast ( Lightning Blast )"
msgid ""
"You fire a small concentrated ball of lightning at the target.  The "
"electricity diffuses rapidly, so it doesn't do much damage, but you're able "
"to fire off several ones quickly."
msgstr ""
"You fire a small concentrated ball of lightning at the target.  The "
"electricity diffuses rapidly, so it doesn't do much damage, but you're able "
"to fire off several ones quickly."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lightning_storm ( Lightning Storm )"
msgid ""
"You call the power of the sky to strike the earth.  Several lightning blasts "
"fire from your finger tips to strike the target."
msgstr "你召唤天空的力量来打击大地。几道闪电从你的指尖射出，击中目标。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_ionization"
msgid "Ionization"
msgstr "電離術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_ionization ( Ionization )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ionization"
msgid ""
"By manipulating the charge in the air, you can conjure a sharp snap of "
"lightning over a wide area.  While its destructive potential is a far cry "
"from natural lightning, the light and thunderclap produced will leave your "
"foes reeling."
msgstr "通过操控空气中的电荷，你可以在大片区域内召唤出一道闪电。虽然它的破坏力与自然产生的闪电相去甚远，但它所产生的强光和雷击会让你的敌人战战兢兢。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_wall_of_fog"
msgid "Wall of Fog"
msgstr "霧牆術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_wall_of_fog ( Wall of Fog )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Wall of Fog"
msgid ""
"Draws forth a broad wall of thick fog.  While the sudden force of air "
"pressure will floor any enemies caught in it, the conjuration is otherwise "
"harmless."
msgstr "召唤出一堵厚厚的雾墙。虽然突然出现的气压会击倒任何被困在里面的敌人，但这个魔法无法造成其它伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "thorns_zap ( Repelling Arc Aura )"
msgid "arcing electricity!"
msgstr "放电声！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_repelling_arc"
msgid "Repelling Arc"
msgstr "擊退電弧"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_repelling_arc ( Repelling Arc )"
msgid ""
"Manifests an aura of crackling electricity around you to strike attackers "
"with baleful lightning."
msgstr "你在你周围召唤出一道噼啪作响的电弧光环，能放出可怕的闪电电击近战攻击你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_repelling_arc_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Repelling Arc"
msgstr "强化电弧光环"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_repelling_arc_plus ( Enhanced Repelling
#. Arc )"
msgid ""
"Manifests an aura of crackling electricity around you to strike attackers "
"with baleful lightning.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, "
"and start to design your own version."
msgstr "你在你周围召唤出一道噼啪作响的电弧光环，能放出可怕的闪电电击近战攻击你的敌人。现在你对这个法术了如指掌，并设计出了你自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormfist"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Stormfist"
msgid_plural "Stormfists"
msgstr[0] "暴風拳套"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormfist ( Stormfist )"
#. ~ Description of "Stormfist"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stormfist"
msgid ""
"Encases your arm and hand in a sheath of crackling magical lightning, you can "
"punch and defend yourself with it in melee combat."
msgstr "將你的手臂和拳頭包裹在劈啪作響的魔法閃電護套中，你可以在近戰格鬥中用它來打擊對手並保護自己。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormfist_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Stormfist"
msgstr "强化风暴之拳"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormfist_plus ( Enhanced Stormfist )"
msgid ""
"Encases your arm and hand in a sheath of crackling magical lightning, you can "
"punch and defend yourself with it in melee combat.  Now you know this spell "
"like the back of your hand, and start to design your own version."
msgstr "召唤闪电包裹手臂和拳头，使你可以在近战战斗中用它来击打敌人和保护自己。现在你对这个法术了如指掌，并设计出了你自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_electric_lighter"
msgid "Fire Spark"
msgstr "电火花"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_electric_lighter ( Fire Spark )"
msgid ""
"Summons a small electric spark, that doesn't harm anything.  You can use it "
"to ignite something flammable."
msgstr "召唤一道小电火花，什么都伤不到。你可以用它点燃什么易燃物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_shipwrecker"
msgid "Shipwrecker"
msgstr "碎舰风暴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_shipwrecker ( Shipwrecker )"
msgid ""
"As the sound of the spell moves out of your mouth, it creates a crushing "
"shockwave that shatters everything in its path."
msgstr ""
"As the sound of the spell moves out of your mouth, it creates a crushing "
"shockwave that shatters everything in its path."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "explosive_decompression"
msgid "Explosive Decompression"
msgstr "爆裂失压"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "explosive_decompression ( Explosive Decompression
#. )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Explosive Decompression"
msgid ""
"Create a high-pressure zone originating from the selected point.  Shortly "
"after, a massive pressure wave will crush everything inside, inflicting "
"barotraumatic injuries on everyone affected."
msgstr "创建从选定点开始的高压区。随后，巨大的压力波将粉碎里面的一切，给每个受影响的单位造成伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "vacuum_decompression"
msgid "Vacuum Decompression"
msgstr "真空减压"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "vacuum_decompression ( Vacuum Decompression )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Vacuum Decompression"
msgid ""
"Create a high-pressure zone originating from the selected point.  Shortly "
"after, a massive pressure wave will crush everything inside, inflicting "
"barotraumatic injuries on everyone affected.  The pressure differential will "
"also pull unprepared creatures inside the zone before collapsing."
msgstr "创建一个从选定点开始的高压区域。随后，巨大的压力波会压碎里面的一切，对所有受影响的单位造成伤害。压力差也会在崩溃前把毫无准备的单位拉进这个区域。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "air_bubble"
msgid "Air Bubble"
msgstr "气泡术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "air_bubble ( Air Bubble )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Air Bubble"
msgid ""
"Cover your head with an air bubble, allowing you to breathe underwater or "
"prevent breathing of toxic gases."
msgstr "用气泡覆盖住头部，使你能在水下和有毒气体中呼吸。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_superconductor"
msgid "Superconductor"
msgstr "超导"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_superconductor ( Superconductor )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Superconductor"
msgid ""
"Create arcs of devastating electric charge in an area around you, roasting "
"everything within."
msgstr "在你周围的区域产生毁灭性电荷的弧线，烘烤里面的一切。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shocking_dash"
msgid "Shocking Dash"
msgstr "雷霆冲刺"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shocking_dash ( Shocking Dash )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shocking Dash"
msgid "Fill your legs with energy and quickly dash to a target destination."
msgstr "让你的双腿充满能量，快速冲向目标。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shocking_teleport"
msgid "Shocking Teleport"
msgstr "闪电传送"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shocking_teleport ( Shocking Teleport )"
msgid ""
"Briefly become lightning to teleport to a chosen spot, ignoring all obstacles "
"in-between."
msgstr "短暂地变成闪电传送到选定的地点，忽略路径上的所有障碍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "toxtricity"
msgid "Toxtricity"
msgstr "电毒"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "toxtricity ( Toxtricity )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Toxtricity"
msgid ""
"Inject a corrosive electric energy into targets within the affected area, "
"weakening them and dealing huge damage over time."
msgstr "向受影响区域内的目标注入腐蚀性电能，削弱它们，并随着时间的推移造成巨大伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_eye"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "electric_eye"
msgid "Electric Eye"
msgstr "电磁视觉"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_eye ( Electric Eye )"
msgid ""
"Enhance your sight with your powers which allows you to see creatures of the "
"same energy around you.  This enhanced perception speed enables you to see "
"more attacks incoming, allowing for an additional block or dodge attempt."
msgstr "运用你的能力增强你的视觉，使你能看见周围同源能量的生物。这种增强的感知速度使你能察觉到更多即将到来的攻击，从而有机会尝试做出额外的格挡或闪避。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_waves"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "electric_waves"
msgid "Electric Waves"
msgstr "电波"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_waves ( Electric Waves )"
msgid ""
"Your hands start to store a vast amount of energy, which you release with "
"each attack.  You feel the spell will get stronger with a higher mastery."
msgstr "你的双手开始蓄积庞大的能量，并在每次攻击时释放。你感觉到随着对该法术掌握程度的提高，其威力将会更强。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_arts"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "electric_arts"
msgid "Electric Arts"
msgstr "电荷艺术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_arts ( Electric Arts )"
msgid ""
"A spell designed for scholars who have recently started to learn "
"stormshaping, allowing them to reduce the damage their often capricious new "
"abilities may cause to themselves."
msgstr "一项专为初学风暴塑造者设计的法术，使他们能够减少自己新学到的经常不稳定能力可能对自己造成的伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_teravolt"
msgid "Summon Teravolt"
msgstr "召唤特拉伏特"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_teravolt ( Summon Teravolt )"
msgid ""
"Summon a Teravolt, a small, semi-intelligent spirit that homes in on hostile "
"creatures before exploding into a huge spark cloud."
msgstr "召唤一只特拉伏特，一只小型、半灵智的灵魂体，它会锁定敌对生物并在接近后爆炸成为一团巨大的电火花云。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_cloak_of_fog"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_cloak_of_fog"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_selkie_fog_cloak"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "selkie_fog_cloak_spell"
msgid "Cloak of Fog"
msgstr "迷雾斗篷"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_cloak_of_fog ( Cloak of Fog )"
msgid ""
"Call out to the sky spirits for aid and ask them to conceal you from your "
"enemies.  The fog will hide your passage, but you do not have any special "
"ability to see through it yourself."
msgstr "向天空中的神灵求助，请他们帮你躲避敌人。 大雾会遮住你的通路，但你自己没有任何特殊能力看穿大雾。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_heart_of_hurricane"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_heart_of_hurricane"
msgid "Heart of the Hurricane"
msgstr "飓风之心"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_heart_of_hurricane ( Heart of the
#. Hurricane )"
msgid ""
"Compress the fury of hurricane winds into a thin shell of raging air around "
"yourself.  This will make it harder for you to lose your footing or be "
"knocked down and occasionally throw attackers away from you, but the whirling "
"winds are loud."
msgstr "将狂暴飓风的狂风压缩成薄薄的狂暴气流壳，环绕在自己周围。这样你就不容易失去平衡或被击倒，有时还能将攻击者扔出去，但旋风的声音很大。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Message of spell "stormshaper_heart_of_hurricane_throw ( Heart of the
#. Hurricane Throw )"
msgid "The winds lash out and hurl <npcname> away!"
msgstr "狂风骤起，将<npcname>扔了出去！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_cloak_of_frog"
msgid "Cloak of Frog"
msgstr "青蛙斗篷"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_cloak_of_frog ( Cloak of Frog )"
msgid ""
"Someone's personal notes were added to this spell.  You're positive that they "
"changed both the name and the function."
msgstr "这个法术上添加了某人的个人笔记。你能确定不管是名字还是功效都已经变了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LOSE_CLOAK_OF_FROG_MUTATIONS"
msgid "It wasn't easy being green."
msgstr "顶着一身绿可不容易。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_loud_voice_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_stormshaper_loud_voice"
msgid "Thundering Voice"
msgstr "洪亮如雷"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_loud_voice_spell ( Thundering Voice )"
msgid ""
"Increase the volume of the caster's voice, allowing every word to resound "
"like a peal of thunder.  As a useful side effect, it makes the caster immune "
"to hearing damage caused by loud noises."
msgstr "增大施法者的声音音量，使其说出的每个字如同雷霆般回荡。作为一项实用的附加效果，此法术使施法者对因噪音过大导致的听力损伤免疫。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bless"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_feral_technomancer_bless"
msgid "Bless"
msgstr "祝福術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bless ( Bless )"
msgid "A blessing that gives you energy and boosts your abilities."
msgstr "这是一个能给你能量并提升你的能力的祝福。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "invisibility"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "invisibility"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_invisibility"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_invisibility_magic_square"
msgid "Invisibility"
msgstr "隱身術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "invisibility ( Invisibility )"
msgid ""
"Creates a magical field that hides your visual presence to others.  "
"Colloquially known as invisibility, but without all the science mumbo jumbo.  "
"Attacking a target will break the invisibility."
msgstr ""
"Creates a magical field that hides your visual presence to others.  "
"Colloquially known as invisibility, but without all the science mumbo jumbo.  "
"Attacking a target will break the invisibility."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Message of spell "invisibility ( Invisibility )"
msgid "To the outside world, your body fades away and you cease to exist!"
msgstr "對外部世界來說，你的身體逐漸消失，你不復存在！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "holy_blade"
msgid "Mage Blade"
msgstr "魔法剑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "holy_blade ( Mage Blade )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Holy Blade"
msgid "This blade of light will cut through any evil it makes contact with!"
msgstr "這把光明之劍將斬斷所有邪惡。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "holy_blade_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Mage Blade"
msgstr "强化魔法剑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "holy_blade_plus ( Enhanced Mage Blade )"
msgid ""
"This blade of light will cut through any evil it makes contact with!  Now you "
"know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to design your "
"own version."
msgstr "这把光明之刃将斩断它所接触到的任何邪恶！现在你已经像了解自己手背一样熟悉这个咒语，并且开始设计你自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spirit_armor"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_feral_technomancer_mage_armor"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_feral_high_technomancer_mage_armor"
msgid "Mage Armor"
msgstr "魔法铠甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spirit_armor ( Mage Armor )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Spiritual Armor"
msgid "Evil will not make it through your defenses if your faith is strong enough!"
msgstr "如果你的信念夠堅定，邪惡無法打破你的防禦！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spirit_armor_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Mage Armor"
msgstr "强化魔法铠甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spirit_armor_plus ( Enhanced Mage Armor )"
msgid ""
"Evil will not make it through your defenses if your faith is strong enough!  "
"Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to "
"design your own version."
msgstr ""
"Evil will not make it through your defenses if your faith is strong enough!  "
"Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to "
"design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_atomic_lamp"
msgid "Lamp"
msgstr "燈"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_atomic_lamp ( Lamp )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lamp"
msgid "Creates a magical lamp."
msgstr "創造一盞魔法燈。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "recover_bionic_power"
msgid "Manatricity"
msgstr "法力轉化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_bionic_power ( Manatricity )"
msgid ""
"You have found a way to convert your mana into power you can use for your "
"bionics."
msgstr ""
"You have found a way to convert your mana into power you can use for your "
"bionics."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_technomancer"
msgid "Technomancer Rune"
msgstr "科技巫師符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_technomancer ( Technomancer Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual inscribes circuit-like ley-lines into a rune, attuned to "
"Technomancers.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""
"This ritual inscribes circuit-like ley-lines into a rune, attuned to "
"Technomancers.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "taze"
msgid "Taze"
msgstr "電擊術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "taze ( Taze )"
msgid "This spell arcs two small bolts of electricity into a target, shocking them."
msgstr "该法术会向目标发射两道小电流，使其受到电击。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "quantum_tunnel_lesser"
msgid "Lesser Quantum Tunnel"
msgstr "次級量子隧道"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "quantum_tunnel_lesser ( Lesser Quantum Tunnel )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lesser Quantum Tunnel"
msgid ""
"This spell manipulates some quantum something or other to tunnel you through "
"a short distance of space, and even matter, unfortunately there's that whole "
"uncertainty thing as to where you come out.  It leaves you a little dazed on "
"the other side as you reorient yourself."
msgstr ""
"這個法術操縱一些量子領域的東西來引導你穿過空間中的一小段距離，甚至是物質中的，不幸的是，你出來的地方存在滿滿地不確定性。當你重新定位自己後，會讓你神智有點茫"
"然。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "synaptic_stimulation"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "synaptic_stim"
msgid "Synaptic Stimulation"
msgstr "突觸刺激"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "synaptic_stimulation ( Synaptic Stimulation )"
msgid ""
"This spell stimulates the synapses in your brain beyond normal processing "
"speeds, giving you a large boost in mental processing capability.  It "
"enhances your reflexes, speed, and raw intellectual power.  Use responsibly!"
msgstr ""
"This spell stimulates the synapses in your brain beyond normal processing "
"speeds, giving you a large boost in mental processing capability.  It "
"enhances your reflexes, speed, and raw intellectual power.  Use responsibly!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "laze"
msgid "Laze"
msgstr "雷光術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "laze ( Laze )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Laze"
msgid ""
"You concentrate and release a focused beam of photons at a target, also known "
"as a laser."
msgstr "你集中並釋放一道光子束到目標上，俗稱叫做雷射。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animated_blade"
msgid "Animated Blade"
msgstr "活化幻刃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animated_blade ( Animated Blade )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Animated Blade"
msgid ""
"This spell conjures flying animated blades that will cut your enemies down to "
"size.  Into small pieces that is."
msgstr "這法術會召喚出飛行的活化刀刃，它將把你的敵人大卸八塊。大卸成八百塊。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mirror_image"
msgid "Mirror Image"
msgstr "鏡像投影"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mirror_image ( Mirror Image )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mirror Image"
msgid ""
"This spell manipulates light into barely tangible duplicates of a living "
"being, a magical hologram in short."
msgstr "這個法術將操縱光線將施法者的影像完整地複製出來，簡而言之就是魔法的全像投影。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_floating_disk"
msgid "Summon Floating Disk"
msgstr "召唤飘浮碟"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_floating_disk ( Summon Floating Disk )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Floating Disk"
msgid "Summons a floating disk that is sworn to carry your burdens."
msgstr "召喚一個可以幫你減輕負擔的漂浮圓盤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_magic_motorcycle"
msgid "Summon Mojocycle"
msgstr "召唤魔托车"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_magic_motorcycle ( Summon Mojocycle )"
msgid "You're not a cowboy, but on a steel horse you ride regardless."
msgstr "你不是一个牛仔，但是你还是骑着铁骑。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_magic_comcycle"
msgid "Summon Co-op cycle"
msgstr "Summon Co-op cycle"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_magic_comcycle ( Summon Co-op cycle )"
msgid "A bigger ride for bigger loot.  Or a second cowboy."
msgstr "A bigger ride for bigger loot.  Or a second cowboy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "overcharge_eyes"
msgid "Optical Sneeze Beam"
msgstr "喷嚏激光术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "overcharge_eyes ( Optical Sneeze Beam )"
msgid ""
"You overcharge your internal batteries to send a semi-directed beam from your "
"face.  The inventor of this spell must have had some weird sense of humor."
msgstr "你将体内的生化电池过载，从你的脸上射出半定向的激光光束。这个法术的发明者一定有某种诡异的幽默感。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "overcharge_eyes ( Optical Sneeze Beam )"
msgid "bzzzzzzt!"
msgstr "噗滋滋滋滋！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Message of spell "overcharge_eyes ( Optical Sneeze Beam )"
msgid ""
"You overcharge your bionic energy through what ley lines you have left, and "
"channel it through the center of your face."
msgstr "你将体内的生化能量过载并导入你仅余的灵脉中，并将其导引至脸部射出。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "x-ray"
msgid "X-ray Vision"
msgstr "X射線眼"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "x-ray ( X-ray Vision )"
msgid ""
"You fire a cone of X-rays that magically allows you to see that area for a "
"short time."
msgstr "你发射出一道X光，并通过魔法来短暂地看清X光所及区域。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "knock"
msgid "Knock"
msgstr "敲鎖術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "knock ( Knock )"
msgid ""
"You channel magic into a force capable of opening doors.  This variant can "
"only open wooden doors."
msgstr "你引导魔力，将其变成能够打开门的力量。这种法术只能打开木门。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "improved_knock"
msgid "Improved Knock"
msgstr "強力敲鎖術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "improved_knock ( Improved Knock )"
msgid ""
"You channel magic into a force capable of opening doors.  This variant can "
"open any locked door."
msgstr ""
"你引导魔力，将其变成能够打开门的力量。这种法术能打开任何锁住的门。\n"
"\"阿拉霍洞开!\""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_knifeshot"
msgid "Knifeshot"
msgstr "射刀術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_knifeshot ( Knifeshot )"
msgid ""
"This spell generates a magnetic field around a knife, before launching it at "
"high speed."
msgstr "这个法术能在一把刀子周围产生磁场，并将其高速发射出去。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_knifeshot_superior"
msgid "Hypervelocity Knifeshot"
msgstr "超高速飞刀术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_knifeshot_superior ( Hypervelocity
#. Knifeshot )"
msgid ""
"This spell goes even further beyond, launching a knife so fast it can pierce "
"through targets."
msgstr "这个法术比之前更进一步，它所射出的飞刀速度快到能够直接穿透目标。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_robot_shutdown"
msgid "Shutdown"
msgstr "机械关闭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_robot_shutdown ( Shutdown )"
msgid ""
"Overload the target, stunning it briefly.  Originally developed during the "
"Roman Empire to target out-of-control golems, this spell became significantly "
"more popular in modern times when it was discovered it also worked on robots "
"and machinery."
msgstr "使目标超载，短暂眩晕。 该法术最初是在罗马帝国时期开发的，用于对付失控的傀儡，到了现代，人们发现该法术对机器人和机械也同样有效，因此变得更加流行。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_conjure_radio"
msgid "Speak through the Aether"
msgstr "以太交流"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_conjure_radio ( Speak through the
#. Aether )"
msgid ""
"One of the most widely-known pre-modern technomantic spells, this allows "
"technomancers to communicate at a distance.  Its use declined rapidly after "
"Guglielmo Marconi invented the radio and suddenly everyone could listen in to "
"their conversations."
msgstr ""
"这是最广为人知的前现代技术咒语之一，可以让技术人员进行远距离通信。 "
"在古列尔莫-马可尼发明了收音机之后，它的使用迅速减少，因为突然之间，每个人都可以监听他们的谈话。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_conjure_ups"
msgid "Power Supply"
msgstr "發電供應"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_conjure_ups ( Power Supply )"
msgid ""
"For the technomancer with no enhancements, this spell summons a power supply "
"composed of pure mana that can be used to charge any compatible device.  Just "
"keep it on your person and it will continually recharge your electronic "
"devices until the duration expires."
msgstr ""
"For the technomancer with no enhancements, this spell summons a power supply "
"composed of pure mana that can be used to charge any compatible device.  Just "
"keep it on your person and it will continually recharge your electronic "
"devices until the duration expires."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_welder"
msgid "Voltaic Touch"
msgstr "雷电之触"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_welder ( Voltaic Touch )"
msgid ""
"Using the principles of what were once called \"voltaic arcs\", you can "
"electrically heat metal hot enough to weld it together."
msgstr "利用曾经被称为“伏特电弧”的原理，你可以将金属电热到足以将其焊接在一起。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_recharge_vehicle"
msgid "Imbue with Lightning"
msgstr "Imbue with Lightning"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_recharge_vehicle ( Imbue with
#. Lightning )"
msgid ""
"This fancifully-named spell actually restores power to a battery or power "
"grid.  An esoteric curiosity until electrical power became widespread, even "
"then the power efficiency of fossil fuels rendered it a niche spell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_gain_electronics_computer_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_technomancer_gain_electronics_computer"
msgid "Machine Mind"
msgstr "机械知识"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_gain_electronics_computer_spell (
#. Machine Mind )"
msgid ""
"This spell grants the caster an intuitive understanding of electronics and "
"computers, making their use, repair, and construction much easier."
msgstr "该咒语能增加施法者对电子产品和计算机的知识，使其使用、维修和制造更加轻松。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_create_ups_connection"
msgid "Power Linkage"
msgstr "能量传输"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_create_ups_connection ( Power Linkage
#. )"
msgid ""
"Enchant an item so that it is capable of drawing power wirelessly through the "
"air from a compatible power source."
msgstr ""
"Enchant an item so that it is capable of drawing power wirelessly through the "
"air from a compatible power source."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_far_sight"
msgid "Zoom Lens"
msgstr "透镜变焦"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_far_sight ( Zoom Lens )"
msgid ""
"By etching tiny runes on a lens of great quality and infusing it with their "
"magic, the caster can use the lens to see further than even the finest "
"mundane binoculars.  Unfortunately, the arrangement is unstable and the lens "
"will disintegrate after a time."
msgstr ""
"By etching tiny runes on a lens of great quality and infusing it with their "
"magic, the caster can use the lens to see further than even the finest "
"mundane binoculars.  Unfortunately, the arrangement is unstable and the lens "
"will disintegrate after a time."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_far_sight_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Zoom Lens"
msgstr "Enhanced Zoom Lens"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_far_sight_plus ( Enhanced Zoom Lens )"
msgid ""
"This lens can see farther than ever!  Now you know this spell like the back "
"of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"This lens can see farther than ever!  Now you know this spell like the back "
"of your hand, and have started to design your own version."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_pain_ignore"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_technomancer_pain_ignore"
msgid "The Body Mechanical"
msgstr "The Body Mechanical"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_pain_ignore ( The Body Mechanical )"
msgid ""
"With a word of power, you spur your body to function as a machine would, "
"partially ignoring the effects of pain for a brief moment."
msgstr ""
"With a word of power, you spur your body to function as a machine would, "
"partially ignoring the effects of pain for a brief moment."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "alchemist_make_potion_starter"
msgid "Infuse water"
msgstr "注能水"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "alchemist_make_potion_starter ( Infuse water )"
msgid ""
"Infuse water with ethanol from the air and your own mana to create some "
"potion starter.  Sometimes it might overreact and overflow."
msgstr "将空气中的乙醇和你自己的魔力注入水中，制造一些基础药剂。有时可能会反应过饱和，导致魔力溢出。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "alchemist_make_potion_bomb"
msgid "Manafusion Bomb"
msgstr "魔能聚变炸弹"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "alchemist_make_potion_bomb ( Manafusion Bomb )"
msgid "Oversaturates potion starter with mana to create a deadly mana explosion."
msgstr "使基础药剂的魔力过饱和，造成致命的魔能爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "alchemist_make_potion_trap"
msgid "Manafusion Trap"
msgstr "魔能聚变陷阱"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "alchemist_make_potion_trap ( Manafusion Trap )"
msgid ""
"Make a manafusion trap, stabilizing manafusion bombs and giving you some of "
"the excess mana."
msgstr "制造一个魔能聚变陷阱，稳定魔能聚变炸弹并返还多余魔力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spy_wasp"
msgid "Spy Wasp"
msgstr "偵查蜂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spy_wasp ( Spy Wasp )"
msgid ""
"Sends out a partly magical, partly electronic spy drone shaped like a wasp "
"that reveals terrain in a line in front of you.  The wasp can travel through "
"walls."
msgstr "派出一只部分魔法、部分电子、外形像黄蜂的侦察无人机，揭示你正前方一条线上的地形。侦察蜂可以穿过墙壁。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "artificer's toolkit"
msgid_plural "artificer's toolkits"
msgstr[0] "機關師的工具箱"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Description of "artificer's toolkit"
msgid ""
"This is a magical device that can take the shape of many tools.  When not in "
"use it looks like a simple screwdriver."
msgstr "一个能够变形成各种工具的魔法装置。当它未被使用时，它看起来就像一把简单的螺丝刀。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "artificer_toolkit"
msgid "Artificer's Toolkit"
msgstr "機關師的工具箱"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "artificer_toolkit ( Artificer's Toolkit )"
msgid ""
"Artificers have a special pocket dimension with a magical tool that can cover "
"a wide variety of tasks.  It is only a matter of temporarily summoning the "
"item for use."
msgstr "机关术师们能通向一个特殊的口袋维度，其中有把魔法工具，可以完成各种各样的工作。你可以暂时召唤出这个工具供你使用一段时间。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#. ~ Name of spell "nitro_boost"
msgid "Nitro Boost"
msgstr "氮气加速"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#. ~ Description of spell "nitro_boost ( Nitro Boost )"
msgid ""
"You overclock your flesh and bionics, charging so fast the friction can "
"ignite the air, to wind up for a skull-cracking punch."
msgstr "你将自身肉体和生化插件超频，充能速度如此之快，以至于摩擦都能点燃四周的空气，给对方来一记碎骨拳。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biotek_healing"
msgid "Jury Rig"
msgstr "紧急损管"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biotek_healing ( Jury Rig )"
msgid "Heals a little bit of damage on the target."
msgstr "醫治目標的傷害，回復少量的生命值。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "banishment_greater"
msgid "Greater Banishment"
msgstr "高等放逐术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "banishment_greater ( Greater Banishment )"
msgid ""
"A more advanced version of Banishment, which is a ritual spell that attempts "
"to banish a monster.  Being closely related to blood magic, the Blood Mage is "
"much more specialized to use a spell like this."
msgstr "放逐术的更高级版本，它是一种试图驱逐怪物的仪式法术。由于与血魔法联系紧密，所以血法师更擅长使用这样的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ixythyug the Destroyer's soul"
msgid_plural "Ixythyug the Destroyer's souls"
msgstr[0] "伊克斯蒂赫\"毁灭者\"之魂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of "Ixythyug the Destroyer's soul"
msgid "RIP AND TEAR"
msgstr "撕碎万物！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "demonic_possession"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Demonic Possession"
msgstr "恶魔附身"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "demonic_possession ( Demonic Possession )"
msgid ""
"You allow a demon to possess your body for a short time, giving you great "
"combat abilities.  You still retain control, though lose your spellcasting "
"abilities temporarily."
msgstr "你让恶魔短时间占有你的身体，赋予你强大的战斗能力。你仍然保持控制，不过你会暂时失去施法能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DEMON_POSSESSION"
msgid "Your body fills with demonic power!"
msgstr "你体内充满了恶魔之力！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "demonic_possession_real"
msgid "Demonic Possession Real"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "demonic_possession_real ( Demonic Possession Real
#. )"
msgid "Grants the aura that gives the demon traits.  You're not supposed to see this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Boreal_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "auroral_wave"
msgid "Auroral Wave"
msgstr "极光浪潮"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Boreal_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "auroral_wave ( Auroral Wave )"
msgid ""
"A rippling wave of luminous energy spreads from your hands, a beautiful "
"torrent of magnetic force and chill wind."
msgstr "一道闪亮能量组成的涟漪自你手中荡漾开，化为磁力与寒风交织的壮丽洪流。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Boreal_Mage.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "auroral_wave ( Auroral Wave )"
msgid "a faint shimmering crackle"
msgstr "微微作响的爆裂声"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Boreal_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "borealmage_auroral_guard"
msgid "Auroral Guard"
msgstr "极光防护"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Boreal_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "borealmage_auroral_guard ( Auroral Guard )"
msgid "Create a sturdy shell that wraps around your body, bestowing a sturdy defense."
msgstr "Create a sturdy shell that wraps around your body, bestowing a sturdy defense."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "burning_trail"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_burning_trail"
msgid "Burning Trail"
msgstr "Burning Trail"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#. ~ Description of spell "burning_trail ( Burning Trail )"
msgid ""
"Speak a short phrase and transform your footsteps into burning pits of flame, "
"leaving a trail of fire behind you.  Each step will consume mana, but you "
"will be immune to fire while the spell is in effect."
msgstr ""
"Speak a short phrase and transform your footsteps into burning pits of flame, "
"leaving a trail of fire behind you.  Each step will consume mana, but you "
"will be immune to fire while the spell is in effect."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLEANSING_FLAME_FIRE_FOOSTEPS_3" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLEANSING_FLAME_FIRE_FOOSTEPS_2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_FIRE_FOOSTEPS"
msgid "You do not have enough mana to fuel your searing footsteps!"
msgstr "你的魔力不足，无法继续维持灼热步伐！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_dirt, t_grass_dead"
msgid "The earth is scorched clean!"
msgstr "大地被烈焰焚烧殆尽！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#. ~ Name of spell "immolate"
msgid "Immolate"
msgstr "焚祭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#. ~ Description of spell "immolate ( Immolate )"
msgid ""
"A purifying blast of raw elemental heat wipes the slate clean, searing the "
"Earth back to her most original state: a barren ball of burning rock."
msgstr "原初元素热能掀起的净化大爆炸将地表抹得干干净净，将地球炙烤回她最开始的模样：灼热岩石堆积成的不毛之球。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "immolate ( Immolate )"
msgid "a searing whoosh"
msgstr "灼热的呼啸声"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cleansingflame_hermes_heal"
msgid "Hermes Reborn"
msgstr "赫尔墨斯复生"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Cleansing_Flame.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cleansingflame_hermes_heal ( Hermes Reborn )"
msgid ""
"In the sea without lees\n"
"Standeth the bird of Hermes\n"
"Eating his wings variable\n"
"And maketh himself yet full stable"
msgstr ""
"在无背风处的海中\n"
"站立着赫耳墨斯之鸟\n"
"吃着自己多变的翅膀\n"
"使自己变得完全稳定（注：《黎普列卷轴》）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of spell "holy_shield"
msgid "Holy Shield"
msgid_plural "Holy Shields"
msgstr[0] "圣盾术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of "Holy Shield"
msgid ""
"A Crusader's magical shield, enhanced to protect the Crusader from all that "
"stands in their way."
msgstr "圣战法师召唤出的魔法盾，经过强化能够保护圣战法师不受任何阻挡。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of spell "holy_shield ( Holy Shield )"
msgid ""
"Crusaders have the ability to summon a magically enhanced shield to their arm "
"to protect them in armed combat."
msgstr "圣战法师能在他们的手臂上召唤出一个经过魔法强化的盾，在武装近战时保护他们。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Name of spell "judgement_sword"
msgid "Sword of Judgement"
msgstr "审判之剑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of spell "judgement_sword ( Sword of Judgement )"
msgid ""
"This blade of light will cut through any evil it makes contact with!  You can "
"change its shape into a dagger, great sword, spear or mace."
msgstr "这把光刃将切开它所接触到的任何邪恶! 你可以将变形为匕首、巨剑、长矛或锤矛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Radiant Strike"
msgstr "耀目打击"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of martial technique "Radiant Strike"
msgid "Attack adjacent enemies, crit only"
msgstr "攻击邻近敌人，仅暴击。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Radiant Strike"
msgid "Your sword bursts with radiant light, hitting everyone nearby"
msgstr "Your sword bursts with radiant light, hitting everyone nearby"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Radiant Strike"
msgid "<npcname>'s sword bursts with radiant light, hitting everyone nearby"
msgstr "<npcname>'s sword bursts with radiant light, hitting everyone nearby"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sword of judgement"
msgid_plural "swords of judgement"
msgstr[0] "审判之剑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of "sword of judgement"
msgid ""
"A large sword made of glowing, radiant fire.  It explodes with radiance when "
"striking enemies."
msgstr "一把由灼热照耀的火焰制成的大剑。在砍中敌人时会爆射出灿烂的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sword of judgement"
msgid "Transform to dagger."
msgstr "化为匕首"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sword of judgement"
msgid "Concentrating, you change your sword into a much smaller, quicker blade."
msgstr "集中精神，你将你的剑换成一个更小，更快的锋刃。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dagger of judgement"
msgid_plural "daggers of judgement"
msgstr[0] "审判之匕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of "dagger of judgement"
msgid ""
"A short blade made of glowing, radiant fire.  It explodes with radiance when "
"striking enemies."
msgstr "一把由灼热照耀的火焰制成的匕首。在刺中敌人时会爆射出灿烂的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "dagger of judgement"
msgid "Transform to great sword."
msgstr "化为巨剑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "dagger of judgement"
msgid ""
"Concentrating, you change your dagger into a much larger, more intimidating "
"form."
msgstr "集中精神，你将匕首转变成一把巨大，更具压迫感的形态。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "great sword of judgement"
msgid_plural "great swords of judgement"
msgstr[0] "审判巨剑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of "great sword of judgement"
msgid ""
"A very large sword glowing with radiant fire.  It explodes with radiance when "
"striking enemies."
msgstr "一把由灼热照耀的火焰制成的巨剑。在劈中敌人时会爆射出灿烂的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "great sword of judgement"
msgid "Transform into spear."
msgstr "化为长矛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "great sword of judgement"
msgid ""
"Concentrating, you change your dagger into a longer, much more precise "
"piercing form."
msgstr "集中精神，你将匕首转变成一种更长，更精准的穿刺形态。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spear of judgement"
msgid_plural "spears of judgement"
msgstr[0] "审判之矛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of "spear of judgement"
msgid ""
"A very thin, nimble spear glowing with radiant fire.  It explodes with "
"radiance when striking enemies."
msgstr "一根非常细长，灵活的长矛，闪耀着绚烂的火焰。 它在戳刺敌人时，会爆发出璀璨的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "spear of judgement"
msgid "Transform to mace."
msgstr "化为锤矛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "spear of judgement"
msgid "Concentrating, you change your spear into a shorter, more hefty form."
msgstr "集中精神，你将长矛转变成一种更短更沉重的形态。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mace of judgement"
msgid_plural "maces of judgement"
msgstr[0] "审判之杖"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ Description of "mace of judgement"
msgid ""
"A short and hefty mace glowing with radiant fire.  It explodes with radiance "
"when striking enemies."
msgstr "一把短而重的锤矛，闪耀着绚烂的火焰。在砸中敌人时会爆射出灿烂的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "mace of judgement"
msgid "Transform to longsword."
msgstr "化为长剑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Crusader.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "mace of judgement"
msgid "Concentrating, you change your spear into a shorter, more robust blade."
msgstr "集中精神，你将长矛转变为更短更坚固的剑刃。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Earth_Elemental.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
#. ~ Message after transforming to "f_rubble"
msgid "The earth is upheaved!"
msgstr "地面开始隆起！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Earth_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "quake"
msgid "Quake"
msgstr "地震术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Earth_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "quake ( Quake )"
msgid "Cause a localized earthquake, knocking down enemies and overturning the earth."
msgstr "造成局部地震并会击倒敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Earth_Elemental.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/XAEA.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "quake ( Quake )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "XAEA_quake ( Artifact Earthquake )"
msgid "a deep rumbling"
msgstr "低沉的隆隆声"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Earth_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "rock_blast"
msgid "Rock Blast"
msgstr "巨石冲击"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Earth_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "rock_blast ( Rock Blast )"
msgid "Fire three large rocks at an enemy, causing blunt damage and knocking it back."
msgstr "向敌人发射三块巨石，造成钝器伤害并击退敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Fire_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "flareup"
msgid "Flareup"
msgstr "骤燃术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Fire_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "flareup ( Flareup )"
msgid "You channel heat through your hands to severely burn a target you touch."
msgstr "你用双手引导魔法热能，严重烧伤你所接触的目标。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Fire_Elemental.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "flareup ( Flareup )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "burn_at_both_ends ( Burn at Both Ends )"
msgid "skin crackling"
msgstr "皮肤噼啪声！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Fire_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "flarewhip"
msgid "Flarewhip"
msgstr "火焰鞭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Fire_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "flarewhip ( Flarewhip )"
msgid "You conjure a whip made of solid flame."
msgstr "你召唤出一根由固态魔法火焰制成的鞭子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Force_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "force_blade"
msgid "Force Blade"
msgstr "原力刃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Force_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "force_blade ( Force Blade )"
msgid ""
"You shoot a blade of concentrated force in a straight line, cutting "
"everything in its path."
msgstr "你直线射出一把力场凝聚而成的利刃，切割途经路径上的所有物品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Force_Mage.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of spell "force_magical_armor"
msgid "Force Shield"
msgid_plural "Force Shield"
msgstr[0] "原力盾牌"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Force_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of "Force Shield"
msgid "A shield of pure force that protects you from most types of physical damage."
msgstr "纯粹力场形成的护盾，能够保护你不受大部分物理伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Force_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "force_magical_armor ( Force Shield )"
msgid ""
"Adds a shield of pure force that protects your body and your clothing from "
"attacks."
msgstr "你召唤出一个由纯粹力场凝聚而成的护盾，能够保护你自身和身上装备不受伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gaias_Chosen.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gaiaschosen_samsara"
msgid "Samsara"
msgstr "轮回术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gaias_Chosen.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gaiaschosen_samsara ( Samsara )"
msgid "You tie your ley lines to the world's, renewing your flesh as if reborn."
msgstr "你把你的灵脉与世界相连，让你的血肉再生，仿佛重生一般。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gaias_Chosen.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dust_reborn"
msgid "Dust Reborn"
msgstr "尘土重生"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gaias_Chosen.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dust_reborn ( Dust Reborn )"
msgid ""
"Create a cast of your own body and soul, hidden inside the earth's lines.  "
"When the times come and your body is close to destruction, you can abandon "
"it, transferring your consciousness into the cast.  But it brings with it a "
"great price, and for your immortality, you pay with temporary bodily weakness."
msgstr ""
"Create a cast of your own body and soul, hidden inside the earth's lines.  "
"When the times come and your body is close to destruction, you can abandon "
"it, transferring your consciousness into the cast.  But it brings with it a "
"great price, and for your immortality, you pay with temporary bodily weakness."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gaias_Chosen.json
#. ~ Name of spell "terra_armor"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_terra_armor"
msgid "Terra Armor"
msgstr "大地铠甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gaias_Chosen.json
#. ~ Description of spell "terra_armor ( Terra Armor )"
msgid ""
"Cover yourself in dense, invisible energy of Earth.  Higher level increase "
"your defense abilities."
msgstr "将你包裹在源于大地的致密而不可见的能量之中。等级越高，防御力越强。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gaias_Chosen.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Terra Armor"
msgid "Your body is covered in dense, ethereal shell, that protect you."
msgstr "致密的无形外壳覆盖你的身躯，保护着你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gaias_Chosen.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Terra Armor"
msgid "Your lost your terra shell."
msgstr "你失去了大地甲壳。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Glacier_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ice_clave"
msgid "Ice Clave"
msgstr "寒冰之钥"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Glacier_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ice_clave ( Ice Clave )"
msgid "Use the unstoppable force from a glacier to cause severe damage."
msgstr "驭使源于冰川的万夫莫当之力造成严重的破坏。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Glacier_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "frozen_winds"
msgid "Frozen Winds"
msgstr "凛冽狂风"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Glacier_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "frozen_winds ( Frozen Winds )"
msgid ""
"A gust of wind, colder than any Earthly mountaintop, spirals from your "
"fingers, damaging and pushing anything in its path."
msgstr "一阵比大地上任何山顶的都冷的风，从你指间盘旋而出，破坏、推动着途径的一切。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Golemancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_golem_clay"
msgid "Summon Clay Golem"
msgstr "召唤黏土傀儡"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Golemancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_golem_clay ( Summon Clay Golem )"
msgid ""
"Use a golem core as a focus to shape clay into a roughly humanoid shape and "
"animate it for some time."
msgstr "以一个傀儡核心作为核心，将黏土塑造成一个人形傀儡，并使其运作一段时间。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Golemancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "golem_push"
msgid "Golem Push"
msgstr "魔像推动"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Golemancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "golem_push ( Golem Push )"
msgid "You channel the strength of a golem to push an enemy backward."
msgstr "你通过魔像的力量将敌人推开。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gravitymage_graviton"
msgid "Graviton Polarization"
msgstr "引力子极化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gravitymage_graviton ( Graviton Polarization )"
msgid ""
"Changes and amplifies gravitational pull towards a point you choose, even "
"through walls.  Pulls in items and deals bashing damage in its center."
msgstr ""
"Changes and amplifies gravitational pull towards a point you choose, even "
"through walls.  Pulls in items and deals bashing damage in its center."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "gravitymage_graviton ( Graviton Polarization
#. )"
msgid "a crack"
msgstr "一道噼啪声"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gravity_mage_leap"
msgid "Gravity Leap"
msgstr "重力飞跃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gravity_mage_leap ( Gravity Leap )"
msgid ""
"Decrease your weight to a minimum, and use a mana flow to jump to your "
"enemies from a long distance."
msgstr ""
"Decrease your weight to a minimum, and use a mana flow to jump to your "
"enemies from a long distance."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gravity_mage_melee"
msgid "Tactile Telekinesis"
msgstr "触知传动"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gravity_mage_melee ( Tactile Telekinesis )"
msgid ""
"When you make contact with an object, it's way easier to manipulate its "
"gravity.  Control gravity around yourself to change your inertia in order to "
"make quick but heavy attacks."
msgstr ""
"When you make contact with an object, it's way easier to manipulate its "
"gravity.  Control gravity around yourself to change your inertia in order to "
"make quick but heavy attacks."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "gravity_mage_melee"
msgid "Gravity Control"
msgstr "重力控制"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Gravity Control"
msgid "Decreases mass of weapon on swing, increases the gravity on attack."
msgstr "减少你武器挥舞时的重量，在攻击时增强重力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Gravity Control"
msgid "You cease your control over gravity."
msgstr "你失去了对重力的控制。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/item_enchants.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_subzero_talons"
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
msgid "Subzero Talons"
msgstr "冰爪"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_subzero_talons ( Subzero Talons )"
msgid ""
"Your fingers stiffen as condensation freezes into claws, intensifying your "
"naturally cold touch and protecting your hands from damage."
msgstr "你的手指凝结出坚硬的冰爪，让你的徒手攻击造成寒冷伤害并保护你的双手。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cold_heart"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "cold_heart_effect"
msgid "Cold Heart"
msgstr "冰寒之心"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cold_heart ( Cold Heart )"
msgid ""
"Harshly drop the temperature inside of your enemies, slowing down their "
"bloodstreams or even shattering organs."
msgstr ""
"Harshly drop the temperature inside of your enemies, slowing down their "
"bloodstreams or even shattering organs."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "iceelemental_frostcrystal"
msgid "Form Everfrost"
msgstr "恒霜术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "iceelemental_frostcrystal ( Form Everfrost )"
msgid ""
"Drawing upon the cold in your own blood and the power of your magic you form "
"a large piece of never-thawing ice."
msgstr "凭借自己血液中的冰寒和魔法的力量，你召唤出一大块永不融化的魔法坚冰。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spear_of_light"
msgid "Spear of Light"
msgstr "光之矛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spear_of_light ( Spear of Light )"
msgid ""
"Shoot directed light from your fingertips that is so bright you can see "
"through the skin of the target for an instant."
msgstr "从你的指尖射出定向光，其亮度之高可以在一瞬间穿透目标的皮肤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "illusionist_hologram"
msgid "Battle Holograms"
msgstr "战场全息投影"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "illusionist_hologram ( Battle Holograms )"
msgid ""
"Created to disrupt your enemies, they look exactly like you, and act like a "
"real person."
msgstr "扰乱你的敌人，它们看起来和你一模一样，并且像一个真人一样行动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "illusionist_transposition"
msgid "Illusion Transposition"
msgstr "假影换位"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "illusionist_transposition ( Illusion Transposition
#. )"
msgid ""
"Fool reality, and swap your position with any other creature in your line of "
"sight"
msgstr "愚弄现实，和你视线内的任何其他生物交换你的位置"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "railgun"
msgid "Railgun"
msgstr "軌道槍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "railgun ( Railgun )"
msgid ""
"Magnetize a bullet, and fire it at supersonic speeds by applying an opposite "
"magnetic force to the bullet.  Leaves a trail of sparks"
msgstr "将子弹磁化后通过一个反向磁场将子弹以超声速发射，并留下一道闪光的尾迹。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magnetismmage_electrolaser"
msgid "Electrolaser"
msgstr "电子激光"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magnetismmage_electrolaser ( Electrolaser )"
msgid ""
"Creates a conductive channel from the caster's hand to the target by ionizing "
"air molecules using a high-powered laser beam, then sends a powerful half "
"million volt charge down the channel."
msgstr "通过使用高功率激光束电离空气分子，创建出一条从施法者手到目标的导电通道，然后沿着通道释放出50万伏的强大电荷。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "robot_disabler_explosion"
msgid "Surge"
msgstr "电涌术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "robot_disabler_explosion ( Surge )"
msgid ""
"Send a wave of high-frequency alternating pulses.  It can't hurt living "
"creatures, but is exceptional at stunning and destroying robots.  Even though "
"it isn't an EMP."
msgstr ""
"Send a wave of high-frequency alternating pulses.  It can't hurt living "
"creatures, but is exceptional at stunning and destroying robots.  Even though "
"it isn't an EMP."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Overclocker.json
#. ~ Name of spell "overaccelerate"
msgid "Overaccelerate"
msgstr "超限加速术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Overclocker.json
#. ~ Description of spell "overaccelerate ( Overaccelerate )"
msgid ""
"This drastically increases the target's metabolism to dangerous levels, "
"causing their body to tear itself apart."
msgstr ""
"This drastically increases the target's metabolism to dangerous levels, "
"causing their body to tear itself apart."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Overclocker.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "overclocker_drive"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "overclocker_drive_effect"
msgid "Overdrive"
msgstr "时间过载"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Overclocker.json
#. ~ Description of spell "overclocker_drive ( Overdrive )"
msgid ""
"The power of mana flows into you, heightening your speed to supernatural "
"levels in a self-destructive way.  You are a blur amongst your enemies, "
"felling them with blows too swift to see."
msgstr "魔法能量流入你体内，以自我毁灭的方式将你的速度提升到超自然的水平。你在敌人眼中是一个模糊不清的人影，用看不见的速度击倒他们。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cold_energy"
msgid "Ice Fog"
msgstr "冰雾术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cold_energy ( Ice Fog )"
msgid ""
"Using your mana, you began to accelerate ice particles inside a cold mist, "
"eroding everything inside."
msgstr "使用你的魔力，你开始加速冰雾中的冰粒子，侵蚀被它包裹的一切物体。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ice Orbit"
msgid_plural "Ice Orbits"
msgstr[0] "寒冰轨道"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of "Ice Orbit"
msgid ""
"Small particles of ice orbit around your body, as a beacon for a giant field "
"of frozen energy."
msgstr "寒冰的小颗粒围绕着你的身体旋转，就像一个巨大的冰冻能量场的灯塔。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "permafrost_mage_ice_age"
msgid "Ice Age"
msgstr "冰期"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "permafrost_mage_ice_age ( Ice Age )"
msgid ""
"Cool down every creature in range 'till their flesh cracks, bones shatter, "
"and armor fractures."
msgstr ""
"Cool down every creature in range 'till their flesh cracks, bones shatter, "
"and armor fractures."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Radiation_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shortwave"
msgid "Shortwave"
msgstr "短波术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Radiation_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shortwave ( Shortwave )"
msgid "Cook nearby monsters (and yourself to an extent)."
msgstr "烤熟附近的怪物（还包括你自己）。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Radiation_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gamma_burst"
msgid "Gamma Burst"
msgstr "伽马射线"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Radiation_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gamma_burst ( Gamma Burst )"
msgid ""
"Cause cell damage to everything in a wide area.  Fast to cast, but does "
"damage slowly."
msgstr "在大范围内造成细胞损伤，施放速度快，但见效慢。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shaman.json
#. ~ Name of spell "butterfly_swarm"
msgid "Butterfly Swarm"
msgstr "蝴蝶群"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shaman.json
#. ~ Description of spell "butterfly_swarm ( Butterfly Swarm )"
msgid ""
"Summon a pack of butterflies with razor-sharp wings, to cut every creature in "
"your way."
msgstr "召唤出一群长着锋利翅膀的蝴蝶，能把挡路的每个生物都切得粉碎。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shaman.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_keeper_of_the_glades"
msgid "The Guardian of the Forest"
msgstr "The Guardian of the Forest"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shaman.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_keeper_of_the_glades ( The Guardian of the
#. Forest )"
msgid ""
"Summons a keeper of the glades, a powerful ancient forest spirit, to defend "
"you.  The keeper may be ridden and will unleash its fury on unnatural "
"enemies, but is much less powerful in the cities than in the forest."
msgstr ""
"Summons a keeper of the glades, a powerful ancient forest spirit, to defend "
"you.  The keeper may be ridden and will unleash its fury on unnatural "
"enemies, but is much less powerful in the cities than in the forest."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shapeshifter.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shapeshifter_alkahest"
msgid "Alkahest"
msgstr "万能溶剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shapeshifter.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shapeshifter_alkahest ( Alkahest )"
msgid ""
"Release a spray of mana-saturated bioactive solvent.  Your ley lines give you "
"a resistance to this acid due to your mana signature, but others beware!"
msgstr "射出一束富含魔力的生物活性溶剂。由于你的魔力特征，你体内的灵脉可以让你抵抗这种酸液，但是其他人可要小心了！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shapeshifter.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomechanic"
msgid "Biomechanic"
msgstr "生物力学"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shapeshifter.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomechanic ( Biomechanic )"
msgid ""
"Who said the human body is weak?  You just need to compress enough mana into "
"your flesh and bones in order to show them who is the deadliest animal in the "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Who said the human body is weak?  You just need to compress enough mana into "
"your flesh and bones in order to show them who is the deadliest animal in the "
"world."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Name of spell "burn_at_both_ends"
msgid "Burn at Both Ends"
msgstr "两头烧"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Description of spell "burn_at_both_ends ( Burn at Both Ends )"
msgid "A candle burns the most brightly at both ends, and yet it burns twice as fast."
msgstr "一根蜡烛在两头烧时最明亮，但燃烧速度却是原来的两倍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Name of spell "soul_afterburner"
#. ~ Name of spell "soul_afterburner_real"
msgid "Soul Afterburner"
msgstr "灵魂助推"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Description of spell "soul_afterburner ( Soul Afterburner )"
msgid ""
"You burn a small portion of your soul to gain a large burst of speed.  You "
"will have to wait until your soul has healed before burning a part of it "
"again."
msgstr ""
"You burn a small portion of your soul to gain a large burst of speed.  You "
"will have to wait until your soul has healed before burning a part of it "
"again."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SOUL_AFTERBURNER"
msgid "You gain a sudden burst of speed!"
msgstr "You gain a sudden burst of speed!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SOUL_AFTERBURNER"
msgid "Burning your soul before it healed only resulted in some damage to your body."
msgstr "Burning your soul before it healed only resulted in some damage to your body."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Name of spell "soul_afterburner_cooldown_backlash"
msgid "Soul backlash"
msgstr "Soul backlash"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "soul_burn"
msgid "Soul Burn"
msgstr "灵魂燃烧"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Soul Burn"
msgid ""
"A little of your soul has been burned away, leaving you in a weakened state.  "
"The soul heals quickly, but your body regenerates more slowly while the soul "
"is weak."
msgstr "你的灵魂有一点被烧毁，让你处于虚弱的状态。灵魂愈合得很快，但当灵魂虚弱时，你的身体再生得更慢。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_chain_master"
msgid "Storm Chain"
msgstr "闪电风暴链"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_chain_master ( Storm Chain )"
msgid ""
"You touch an unwilling subject and lightning dances from you to multiple "
"nearby enemies."
msgstr "除了目标遭到重创外，闪电还会跳到附近的多个敌人身上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_elemental_electric_melee"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "eff_storm_elemental_electric_melee"
msgid "Galvanic"
msgstr "放电"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_elemental_electric_melee ( Galvanic )"
msgid ""
"Fill your hands with high-voltage electricity, and deal additional electric "
"damage in melee."
msgstr "让你的双手充满高压电，并在近战中造成额外的电击伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Galvanic"
msgid "You deal additional electric damage in melee."
msgstr "让你在近战中造成额外的电击伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Galvanic"
msgid "Electric energy is concentrated in your hands, and it's ready to go."
msgstr "电流聚集在你的手中，蓄势待发。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Galvanic"
msgid "Your hands turn back to normal condition."
msgstr "你的手回到了正常状态。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Stormcaller.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_demon"
msgid "Electric Demon"
msgstr "闪电恶魔"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Stormcaller.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_demon ( Electric Demon )"
msgid "Summon a small electric imp - fast as lightning, and just as deadly."
msgstr "召唤一个闪电小恶魔——快如闪电，也同样致命。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Stormcaller.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_turret"
msgid "Thunder Pillar"
msgstr "闪电柱"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Stormcaller.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_turret ( Thunder Pillar )"
msgid ""
"Summon immovable pillars, that will attack your enemies with devastating "
"lightning bolts."
msgstr "召唤出一道不可移动的柱子，用毁灭性的闪电攻击你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Sun_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "solar_beam"
msgid "Solar Beam"
msgstr "日光束"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Sun_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "solar_beam ( Solar Beam )"
msgid ""
"Fire a blast of sunlight in a wide beam, blinding everything in its path and "
"leaving it bright enough for you to see for a few seconds."
msgstr "发射一束阳光，使其路径上的所有生物都失明，并在几秒钟内保持明亮状态。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Sun_Mage.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sunmage_pocket_sun"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pocket Sun"
msgid_plural "Pocket Suns"
msgstr[0] "便攜太陽"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Sun_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sunmage_pocket_sun ( Pocket Sun )"
msgid ""
"You create a stable portal in the fabric of reality to the sun, through which "
"you can draw on its light and temperature."
msgstr "你在客观现实的构架上创造出一个通往太阳的稳定传送门，通过它你可以利用太阳的光照和温度。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cold_snap"
msgid "Cold Snap"
msgstr "寒潮"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cold_snap ( Cold Snap )"
msgid ""
"With a snap of your fingers, the target takes cold damage and freezes in "
"place."
msgstr "只需一个响指，目标就会被冻结在原地并受到寒冷伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_winter_wolf"
msgid "Winter Wolf's Call"
msgstr "召唤冬狼"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_winter_wolf ( Winter Wolf's Call )"
msgid "Summon your personal pack of winter wolves to freeze and maul your foes."
msgstr "召唤你直属的冬狼群来冻结并撕碎你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Void_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "voidmage_final_grasp"
msgid "Final Grasp"
msgstr "终结之握"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Void_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "voidmage_final_grasp ( Final Grasp )"
msgid ""
"In the end, everything succumbs to the grasp of nothingness and stasis.  This "
"spell gives the target a foretaste of that."
msgstr ""
"In the end, everything succumbs to the grasp of nothingness and stasis.  This "
"spell gives the target a foretaste of that."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Void_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "voidmage_horizon_vortex"
msgid "Horizon Vortex"
msgstr "视界漩涡"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Void_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "voidmage_horizon_vortex ( Horizon Vortex )"
msgid ""
"Creates a chaotic energy field that disrupts enemies inside it.  It is rather "
"random, and its effects can range from almost nothing to killing all hostiles "
"in the area."
msgstr "召唤一处充满混沌魔法的力场，扰乱其中的敌人。效果相当随机，法术影响可能从几乎没有到杀死该地区内的所有敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "lava_bomb_main"
msgid "Lava Bomb"
msgstr "熔岩炸彈"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lava_bomb_main ( Lava Bomb )"
msgid ""
"You tear up the ground beneath you to fire a lava bomb: a globe of lava "
"surrounded by hot, solid rock.  It shatters upon impact, spraying shards of "
"rock and lava everywhere."
msgstr "你撕裂脚下的地面，发射出一个熔岩炸弹：一个被炽热的固体岩石包围的熔岩球。它撞击物体时会粉碎，朝四周射出大量碎岩石和熔岩。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "vulcanist_pyroclastic_flow"
msgid "Pyroclastic Flow"
msgstr "火山碎屑流"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "vulcanist_pyroclastic_flow ( Pyroclastic Flow )"
msgid ""
"Pulls up the heat of the Earth, along with considerable smoke mixed with "
"ashes."
msgstr "引发地球内部蕴含的火焰，还有大量的烟雾和灰烬。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "assassin_strike"
msgid "Assassin Strike"
msgstr "刺杀术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "assassin_strike ( Assassin Strike )"
msgid "You strike a poisonous blow and disappear in a puff of toxic smoke."
msgstr "你猛烈一击，然后消失在一股有毒的烟雾中。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "life_drain"
msgid "Life Drain"
msgstr "生命汲取"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "life_drain ( Life Drain )"
msgid ""
"This spell takes some of a target's life; part of it comes to you in a "
"less-potent form."
msgstr "这个法术会夺去目标的一部分生命；其中一部分以一种不那么有效的形式输送给你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/mutations.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Dragons don't have nightmares, nightmares have dragons!"
msgstr "恶龙不会做噩梦，但噩梦里总有恶龙！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Dragons don't have nightmares,
#. nightmares have dragons!"
msgid "crossed black dragon mutation threshold"
msgstr "跨過黑龍突變臨界"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Would-be Wizard"
msgstr "將來的巫師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Wizard's Apprentice"
msgstr "魔法師的學徒"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Journeyman Wizard"
msgstr "熟练魔法师"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Description of achievement "Journeyman Wizard"
msgid ""
"You have learned enough spells that in more reasonable times you would have "
"graduated from your apprenticeship."
msgstr "你已经学会了足够多的法术，再过一段时间，你就能从魔法学徒期毕业。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Archmage"
msgstr "大法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Description of achievement "Archmage"
msgid ""
"You have learned a large number of spells, and would be qualified for the "
"Archmage title."
msgstr "你已经学会了大量的法术，并且有资格获得大法师的头衔。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Master Archmage"
msgstr "法术大师"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Description of achievement "Master Archmage"
msgid ""
"You have learned so many spells, that you would have been a major source of "
"knowledge for many wizards.  Also known as a Sage, Master Archmages enjoy a "
"wide variety of perks due to their lifelong commitment to learning and "
"helping others learn."
msgstr ""
"你已经学会了很多法术，你会成为很多魔法师的主要知识来源。达到法术大师级别的大法师也被称为贤者，由于他们毕生致力于学习和帮助他人学习，因此有各种各样技能专精P"
"erk。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Senile Wizard"
msgstr "高龄魔法师"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Cast a Spell"
msgstr "施展一個法術"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Description of achievement "Cast a Spell"
msgid ""
"The first great milestone to becoming a full-fledged wizard is to cast a "
"spell.  Some mages simply study the spell in the spellbook until they think "
"they understand it as well as they can, but you can't beat practice over "
"theory."
msgstr "成為成熟的巫師的第一個重要里程碑是施展法術。 一些法師只是簡單地研究法術書中的法術，直到他們認為自己盡可能地理解它為止，但是讀再多書都比不親手實踐。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Spell Level 5"
msgstr "5级法术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
