msgstr "It's harder for you to draw on your mana than it should be."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dust_reborn"
msgid "Divided"
msgstr "一分为二"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Divided"
msgid ""
"Your body was split before, which makes you really fragile, but allow you to "
"accept more mana than before."
msgstr "之前你的身体被分裂了，这让你确实很脆弱，但却让你比以前接受了更多的魔力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Divided"
msgid "Your body turns back to normal state."
msgstr "你的身体恢复正常状态。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "golemancer_block"
