#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/mutation_effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Dragon Boost"
msgid "You let out a mighty roar as you are filled with the power of Dragons!"
msgstr "伴随着一声刺耳的咆哮，你的体内充满了巨龙的力量！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/mutation_effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dragon Boost"
msgid "The Draconic energy fades from within you."
msgstr "巨龙的力量从你体内消失了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/enchantments/Fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
msgid "Goblin Eyes"
msgstr "哥布林之眼"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Translocator Gate"
msgstr "傳送門"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Translocator Gate"
msgid ""
"A gate for translocation.  Cast the translocation spell or use a translocator "
"to choose this gate as a destination."
msgstr "一座易位门。施放易位术或使用易位门可将其作为传送目的地。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Translocation Portal"
msgstr "Translocation Portal"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Translocation Portal"
msgid ""
"A portal that allows translocation.  You may use this portal to teleport to "
"attuned locations or teleport to it if it is attuned."
msgstr ""
"A portal that allows translocation.  You may use this portal to teleport to "
"attuned locations or teleport to it if it is attuned."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Magic Circle"
msgstr "魔法陣"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Magic Circle"
msgid ""
"This is a rough magic circle, carved into the ground and decorated with "
"blood, candles, and other small knick-knacks."
msgstr "这是一个刻在地上的魔法阵，上面装饰着血液、蜡烛以及其它小物件。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Magic Circle"
msgid ""
"This is a rough magic circle, carved into the ground and decorated with "
"blood, candles, and other small knick-knacks.  It has been enhanced with "
"silver to channel more mana."
msgstr "这是一个粗糙的魔法圆圈，雕刻在地上，上面装饰着鲜血、蜡烛和其他小玩意儿。它已经被银强化，以引导更多的魔力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "large glowing boulder"
msgstr "发光的巨石"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "large glowing boulder"
msgid "Something about this doesn't look right."
msgstr "它看上去不太对劲。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "enchanter's workbench"
msgstr "附魔師的工作台"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "enchanter's workbench"
msgid ""
"An ornate oak cabinet topped by a durable resin countertop resistant to most "
"alchemical spills and burns.  It has wired in electrical and gas fittings, "
"and has been decorated with several protection runes - mostly ornamental."
msgstr "一个装饰华丽的橡木储藏柜，上面有一个耐用的树脂台面，能抵抗大多数炼金物品的腐蚀，它同时配有电力与煤气设备，并点缀着许多保护用的符文，不过大部分都是装饰。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "standing alembic"
msgstr "立式蒸餾爐"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "standing alembic"
msgid ""
"A large glass and copper alembic for distilling alchemical concoctions.  It "
"consists of a copper pot with rising spires of twisted glass draining into "
"various removable bottles."
msgstr "一台由玻璃和铜制成的大型蒸馏釜，用于提纯炼金药剂。它的主体是一口铜锅，顶部有许多盘旋上升的螺旋形玻璃排水管，通向各种可被移除的瓶子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orrery"
msgid_plural "orreries"
msgstr[0] "太陽系天文儀"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "orrery"
msgid ""
"This is a beautiful, non-scale model of the solar system.  A complex series "
"of gears allows the relative motions of the planets to be studied at the turn "
"of a crank.  This more modern version also has bluetooth and could have been "
"controlled with an app, if there was any power anymore."
msgstr ""
"一套漂亮的非真实比例太阳系模型。一系列复杂的齿轮使你能在摇柄转动时进行行星相对运动的研究。这台更现代的版本带有蓝牙模块，可以通过APP来控制，如果还有电的话"
"。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "huge mana crystal"
msgstr "巨型法力水晶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "huge mana crystal"
msgid ""
"This is a mana crystal that juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up "
"like a weed.  It pulses with a delicate yellow energy, occasionally bursting "
"with flashes of pent-up light."
msgstr "一个像杂草一样在地面上突出而来的魔力水晶。它发出微弱的黄色能量脉冲，偶尔会迸发出被压抑的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "mana crackling!"
msgstr "魔力噼啪声！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "stone altar"
msgstr "石頭祭壇"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "stone altar"
msgid ""
"This is a big stone altar.  Most commonly used in morally questionable "
"rituals."
msgstr "一個巨大的石頭祭壇。常用於各種不合倫理的儀式。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/worldgen/overmap_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "attunement altar"
msgstr "協調祭壇"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "attunement altar"
msgid ""
"An ancient stone plinth covered in symbols that appear to be combinations and "
"variations of the eight magic classes.  Eight depressions are on the top with "
"the original symbols of the classes, each look as though they can hold an "
"item."
msgstr "一个古老的石头基座，上面遍布的符文似乎代表着八种魔法流派的组合及演变。顶部有八个凹槽，雕饰着代表各个流派的原始符文，每个凹槽都看上去似乎可以放进一件物品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demon forge"
msgid_plural "demon forges"
msgstr[0] "惡魔鍛造爐"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "demon forge"
msgid ""
"This is a forge made of the chitin of a huge, red spider that has a penchant "
"for flames.  Custom made to withstand the heat from alumentum, this forge can "
"resmelt the magical metals into their workable, ingot form."
msgstr "這是由一隻對火焰情有獨鍾的巨大紅蜘蛛的甲殼素製成的鍛造爐。 定制的鍛造爐可以承受來自於源動之炎的熱量，這個鍛造爐可以將魔法金屬重新熔化成可加工的鋼錠。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "candelabra of everlasting candles"
msgstr "永恆燭台"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "candelabra of everlasting candles"
msgid ""
"A candelabra, strangely the candles never seem to burn down.  Smashing it "
"doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr "一个烛台，奇怪的是里面的蜡烛似乎从来不会烧完。粉碎它似乎不会产生任何可回收的物品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "everburning street lamp"
msgstr "everburning street lamp"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "everburning street lamp"
msgid ""
"A street lamp, strangely the candle never seems to burn down.  Smashing it "
"doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr ""
"A street lamp, strangely the candle never seems to burn down.  Smashing it "
"doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "everburning brazier"
msgstr "everburning brazier"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "everburning brazier"
msgid ""
"A raised metal dish in which to safely burn things.  This one seems to "
"contain a flame that burns endlessly without fuel."
msgstr ""
"A raised metal dish in which to safely burn things.  This one seems to "
"contain a flame that burns endlessly without fuel."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "everfrost crystal"
msgstr "永霜水晶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "everfrost crystal"
msgid ""
"This massive mana crystal juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up like "
"a weed.  It pulses with an angry white light, occasionally flickering "
"brighter."
msgstr "一个像杂草一样在地面上突出而来的巨大魔法冰晶。它发出愤怒的白光，偶尔闪耀出更亮的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "flat boulder"
msgstr "平顶圆石"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "flat boulder"
msgid ""
"Smooth, flat boulder.  You can use it both as a table and an anvil.  It "
"responds to your force, and you can easily move it."
msgstr "光滑平坦的巨石，可以当作桌子和铁砧。它会响应你的力量，你可以轻松移动它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "The boulder recedes into the ground."
msgstr "巨石退入了地下。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "everburning torch candelabra"
msgid_plural "everburning torch candelabras"
msgstr[0] "不灭火炬台"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "everburning torch candelabra"
msgid ""
"A candelabra made of a half-dozen everburning torches attached to a wooden "
"support structure.  Plenty of light with no worries about power usage or "
"smoke.  Plus, how can you be a real wizard unless your tower is lit by the "
"flicking light of imperishable flames?"
msgstr "一种由六个不灭火炬连接到木制支撑结构上制成的烛台。充足的光线，不用担心用电或冒烟。另外，除非你的塔被不朽的火焰的闪光照亮，否则你怎么能称作一个真正的法师？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "statue of Valzain"
msgstr "statue of Valzain"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "statue of Valzain"
msgid "A massive solid gold statue of the Forge Lord himself."
msgstr "A massive solid gold statue of the Forge Lord himself."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "monolithic statue of Valzain"
msgstr "monolithic statue of Valzain"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "monolithic statue of Valzain"
msgid ""
"A truly monolithic statue of the Forge Lord siting lazily on a golden throne. "
" Meeting it's gaze sends chills down your spine."
msgstr ""
"A truly monolithic statue of the Forge Lord siting lazily on a golden throne. "
" Meeting it's gaze sends chills down your spine."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "owlbear taxidermy"
msgstr "owlbear taxidermy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "owlbear taxidermy"
msgid "An aggressive looking stuffed Owlbear stands here, menacingly."
msgstr "An aggressive looking stuffed Owlbear stands here, menacingly."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "stone altar"
msgid "An ancient stone altar, moss-grown and weather-worn."
msgstr "一座古老的石坛，长满了苔藓，饱经风霜。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "standing stone"
msgstr "立石"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "standing stone"
msgid ""
"A tall standing stone.  It is covered in carvings, but they are so worn by "
"wind and rain you can't make out what they might have been."
msgstr "一块高高的石碑。它上面覆盖着雕刻，但它们被风和雨磨损得太厉害了，你看不出它们是什么。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "brambles"
msgid ""
"A thick wall of tangled brambles grows here.  Vicious thorns protrude from "
"the stems."
msgstr "这里生长着一堵厚厚的荆棘丛生的墙。恶毒的刺从茎上伸出来。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Autodoc, Delta Class"
msgstr "Autodoc, Delta Class"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Autodoc, Delta Class"
msgid ""
"A machine used for the installation and removal of bionics.  The name "
"'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as safe operation is only guaranteed "
"with a ritual circle of technomancers.  The entire surface is carved with "
"runes so fine that they look like spiraling circuitry from a distance."
msgstr ""
"A machine used for the installation and removal of bionics.  The name "
"'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as safe operation is only guaranteed "
"with a ritual circle of technomancers.  The entire surface is carved with "
"runes so fine that they look like spiraling circuitry from a distance."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "glowing plant bulb"
msgstr "发光植物球"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing plant bulb"
msgid ""
"A small, round plant grows here, illuminating the surroundings, grown through "
"druidic magic."
msgstr "通过德鲁伊的魔法，一种小而圆的植物生长在这里，并照亮了周围的环境。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled bookcase"
msgstr "扭曲的书柜"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled bookcase"
msgid ""
"A set of shelves looking more like they were grown than built, all of a "
"single solid piece.  While designed for books, it does a decent job of "
"storing anything else that'll fit."
msgstr "一组架子看起来更像是自然生长而不是建造出来的，一切都是一个整体。虽然它是为书籍设计的，但它也能很好地存储其他适合的东西。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "druidic bed"
msgstr "德鲁伊床"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "druidic bed"
msgid ""
"A solid wooden frame in a single piece and covered in soft, spongy moss with "
"an ordinary sheet over it.  You probably wouldn't have wanted to sleep on it "
"before the Cataclysm, but nowadays any real bed is a luxury."
msgstr "一个实心的木架，上面覆盖着柔软的、海绵状的苔藓，上面盖着一块普通的床单。在大灾难之前，你可能不想睡在上面，但现在任何真正的床都是奢侈品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gnarled chair"
msgid_plural "gnarled chairs"
msgstr[0] "扭曲的椅子"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled chair"
#. ~ Description of "gnarled chair"
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair with four legs, a seat, and a back, all seemingly grown "
"out of a single solid piece of wood.  Despite the twisted lines, it still "
"looks extremely comfortable."
msgstr "这是一把简单的木椅，有四条腿、一个座位和一个靠背，看起来都是由一块实心木头生长出来的。尽管线条扭曲，但它坐起来仍然非常舒适。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled desk"
msgstr "扭曲的书桌"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled desk"
msgid ""
"A wooden desk, all formed of a single solid piece and covered in the whorls "
"of natural wood.  It even has a single leaf growing off a patch of bark on "
"the side."
msgstr "一张木制的桌子，全部由一块实心的木头长成，上面覆盖着天然木材的螺旋纹理，它甚至有一片叶子从旁边的树皮上长出来。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled wardrobe"
msgstr "扭曲的衣柜"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled wardrobe"
msgid ""
"A large wooden cabinet, all grown from a single piece of wood but somehow "
"still containing doors that open.  You could store plenty of things in here."
msgstr "一个大木柜，全部由一块木头长成，但不知何故仍然包含着可以打开的门，你可以在这里放很多东西。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled table"
msgstr "扭曲的木桌"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled table"
msgid ""
"A knotted wooden table, looking more like it was grown rather than assembled. "
" You could sit down at it to eat like a civilized person."
msgstr "一张扭曲的木桌，看起来更像是种植的，而不是组装的，你可以像个文明人一样坐下来吃饭了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled wooden rack"
msgstr "扭曲的木架"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled wooden rack"
msgid ""
"A wooden shelving unit with angled storage surfaces designed to show off "
"whatever is stored on it.  This one seems to be grown all from a single piece "
"of wood, gnarled and covered in bark.  There's even a bit of moss growing on "
"it."
msgstr "一个木制架子，有倾斜的存储表面，旨在展示上面存储的东西。这个架子似乎都是由一块多节的树皮覆盖的木头长成的，上面甚至长着一点苔藓。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled sink"
msgstr "扭曲的水槽"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled sink"
msgid ""
"A water basin with a water tap and drain, but all made of wood except for the "
"piping.  Even the taps, however that works."
msgstr "一个带水龙头和排水管的水池，但除了管道外都是木头做的。即使是水龙头。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled counter"
msgstr "扭曲的工作台"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled counter"
msgid ""
"A plain wooden countertop, all made of a single, solid piece of wood.  Makes "
"a decent surface for storage or crafting, even it's not completely level."
msgstr "一个普通的木制台面，全部由一整块实木长成。为存储或手工制作提供了一个体面的表面，即使它不是完全水平的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "awoken weaver shelter"
msgstr "awoken weaver shelter"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "awoken weaver shelter"
msgid ""
"A shelter woven from wildwood weaver's webs.  It can be used to rest, and the "
"weaver provides assistance in any tailoring task."
msgstr ""
"A shelter woven from wildwood weaver's webs.  It can be used to rest, and the "
"weaver provides assistance in any tailoring task."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "platonic flower"
msgstr "柏拉图花丛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "platonic flower"
msgid ""
"Small bush, that looks like a pair of dragon curves, with a flower in the "
"very center.  The branches of the plant can be used as a perfect ruler."
msgstr "小灌木丛，看起来像一对分形龙状曲线，最中间有一朵花。这株植物的枝条可以作为一把完美的尺子使用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "moonflower bush"
msgstr "月光花从"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "moonflower bush"
msgid ""
"A silver colored vine, whose luminescent flowers will only bloom during "
"night.\n"
"\n"
"Amazingly rare, it grows only in places where heroic deeds took place, or so "
"it's believed."
msgstr ""
"一种银色的藤蔓，其发光的花朵只在夜间绽放。\n"
"\n"
"令人惊讶地稀有，而且只生长在发生过英雄事迹的地方，或者说，人们相信它是如此。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/herbs_and_flowers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kampuch"
msgid_plural "kampuches"
msgstr[0] "生殁毒花"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "kampuch"
msgid ""
"The tiny and lethal rod flowers of the Kämpuch break the underbrush like "
"small ivory thorns."
msgstr "微小而致命的棒状生殁毒花，像小象牙刺一样折断了灌木丛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "olieribos"
msgstr "死灵之草"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "olieribos"
msgid ""
"Dark colored leaves and bitter roots, firmly entrenched in untrodden earth.  "
"They can be used to ward against evil, or to attract it."
msgstr "深色的叶子，苦涩的根，牢牢地扎根于未开垦的土地。既可抵御邪恶，也能吸引邪恶。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "glowing mushrooms"
msgstr "发光蘑菇"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing mushrooms"
msgid ""
"A bioluminescent mushroom shaped like a small nest.  Motes of light "
"occasionally detach from its surface and float upwards before fading."
msgstr "一种发光的蘑菇，形状像一个小巢穴。偶尔会有光点从其表面脱离，并在熄灭前向上漂浮。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "horn moss"
msgstr "牛角苔"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "horn moss"
msgid ""
"A cluster of red moss, so called for the white capsules that it will grow "
"during spring."
msgstr "一簇红色的苔藓，因其在春季会长出白色的\"胶囊\"而得名。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "golden reed"
msgstr "金蘆葦"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "golden reed"
msgid "Thin stalks colored deep yellow, crowned with blue feather-like leaves."
msgstr "细细的深黄色茎秆，冠部有蓝色的羽毛状叶子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "barnacle weed"
msgstr "藤壶草"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "barnacle weed"
msgid ""
"A wooden pod kept aloft by a spiral stalk and the short, dagger-shaped leaves "
"growing at its base."
msgstr "一个木制的豆荚，通过螺旋状的柄和生长在底部的短小匕首状叶子，悬挂在高处。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "dragonails"
msgstr "龙尾藤"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "dragonails"
msgid ""
"A small tangle of old and crooked wood, completely covered with black "
"menacing thorns."
msgstr "一根扭曲的老木，完全被黑色的汹涌荆棘所覆盖。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "moly"
msgstr "雪滴草"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "moly"
msgid ""
"A small herb with milk white flowers and pitch black roots.  Known since "
"Ancient Greece, it was brought to the New World by European druids long ago."
msgstr "一种小型草本植物，有乳白色的花朵和漆黑的根茎。自古以来就被人所知，很久以前被欧洲德鲁伊带到了新世界。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "flowering fern"
msgstr "花蕨"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "flowering fern"
msgid "A seemingly normal fern, which has somehow produced a single red flower."
msgstr "一种看似普通的蕨类植物，不知为何开出了一朵红花。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "funnelcap"
msgstr "漏斗菇"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "funnelcap"
msgid ""
"A man-sized mushroom, with most of its bulk defined by a tall funnel shaped "
"pileus, which collects rainfall."
msgstr "一个人形大小的蘑菇，其大部分体积由一个高大的漏斗形菌盖占据，可以收集降雨。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "sojourner's palm"
msgstr "行者棕榈"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "sojourner's palm"
msgid ""
"A large magical palm tree, normally you would find it in the tropics, but "
"this plant also has the well documented ability to teleport randomly."
msgstr "一株巨大的魔法棕榈树，通常你只能在热带地区找到它，但这种植物有大量记载说它会随机传送。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "whiskflower bush"
msgstr "威士忌花丛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "whiskflower bush"
msgid ""
"A small plant with curled leaves and pink whisk-shaped flowers.  It has a "
"very strong alcoholic smell."
msgstr "一种小植物，叶子卷曲，开粉红色的拂尘状花朵。它有一种非常强烈的酒精味。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_pure_magic.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "imperishable light"
msgstr "不朽之光"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_pure_magic.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "imperishable light"
msgid "A glowing orb of light floats here, emitting a soft radiance."
msgstr "一颗发光的光球悬浮于此，散发出柔和的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_pure_magic.json
#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
msgid "Dismiss the imperishable light?"
msgstr "驱散不朽之光？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_stone.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "rock troll statue"
msgstr "岩石巨魔雕像"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_stone.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "rock troll statue"
msgid ""
"A massive block of stone in the shape of a rock troll, because it used to be "
"a rock troll."
msgstr "一块形似岩石巨魔的巨大石块 —— 因为它曾经真的是一只岩石巨魔。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "burnt tree"
msgstr "燒焦的樹"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "burnt tree"
msgid ""
"This tree looks like it has been burnt badly, but it is somehow still "
"standing."
msgstr "這棵樹看起來已經燒焦了，但不知道為何它仍然屹立不倒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "dry cocoon"
msgstr "干茧"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "dry cocoon"
msgid ""
"This is a large cocoon-like object that looks to be the vague shape of some "
"creature.  You don't want to know how long it stayed alive while being sucked "
"dry by these spiders."
msgstr "这像是一个巨大的茧，看起来像某种生物的形状。你不想去想那个生物在被这些蜘蛛活活吸干之前活了多久。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "webbing wall"
msgstr "蛛網牆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "webbing wall"
msgid ""
"This wall seems to be made up of a combination of webbing, wood splinters, "
"detritus, and some kind of dark-colored resin."
msgstr "这面墙似乎是由蛛网、木头碎片、碎石和某种深色树脂组合而成。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "barren dirt"
msgstr "貧瘠地"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "barren dirt"
msgid ""
"It's dirt.  The ground here is infertile.  Could also be dug out for "
"construction projects."
msgstr "土地，這塊地十分貧脊。也能挖坑進行建造計畫。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "glassteel vault wall"
msgstr "鋼化玻璃保險牆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "glassteel vault wall"
msgid ""
"A barrier made of glassteel, it's nothing complicated, and looks extremely "
"fragile.  It is most definitely not fragile and it's probably alarmed in the "
"event that someone does break through it."
msgstr "玻璃钢制成的屏障，看起来简单而脆弱。但它肯定一点都不脆弱，而且很可能安装了报警装置，一旦破碎就会被触发。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "a cross between steel bending and glass shattering!"
msgstr "金属弯曲和玻璃破碎声！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "concrete floor, everburning chandelier"
msgstr "混凝土地板，不滅燭台"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor, everburning chandelier"
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with an elaborate chandelier above it filled "
"with everburning candles."
msgstr "一片冰冷而平凡的混凝土地板，其上的天花板有一盏永恒烛台。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "magically reinforced concrete wall"
msgstr "魔法強化混凝土牆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "magically reinforced concrete wall"
msgid ""
"An extremely resilient wall, filled with concrete and rebar and esoteric "
"ingredients.  Best suited for supporting multi-level buildings, only serious "
"explosives and high-speed impacts would be capable of damaging this wall."
msgstr "一堵填满钢筋水泥和魔法材料的坚韧墙壁。极适合支持多层建筑，只有烈性爆炸物和高速撞击才能破坏这堵墙。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "magically reinforced concrete floor"
msgstr "魔法強化混凝土地板"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "magically reinforced concrete floor"
msgid ""
"Extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured "
"alchemical concrete, capable of providing protection from the elements.  As "
"for the matching roof, it still requires supporting walls, otherwise it may "
"very well cave in."
msgstr "由精心架设的钢筋和魔法材料浇筑混凝土制成的强韧地板，能够提供对自然环境的防护。匹配的屋顶仍然需要支撑墙，否则它可能会崩塌。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "vault vent"
msgstr "金庫通風口"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "vault vent"
msgid "This concrete flooring has a vent pouring fresh, clean air into the vault."
msgstr "这块混凝土天花板上有个通风口，不断向避难所中注入新鲜干净的空气。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_druid.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "heartwood floor"
msgstr "心材地板"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_druid.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "heartwood floor"
msgid "The living heartwood of the tree."
msgstr "树木中仍 “存活” 的心材。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "owlbear gastrolith"
msgid_plural "owlbear gastroliths"
msgstr[0] "鴞熊胃結石"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "owlbear gastrolith"
msgid ""
"This strangely shaped rock was once a part of an owlbear's complex digestive "
"system, creating a link between owl throat and bear stomach.  It is possible "
"that it could serve a similar purpose in alchemy, helping to bind together "
"two disparate halves."
msgstr "這顆形狀奇特的石頭曾經是鴞熊複雜消化系統的一部分，在鴞熊喉嚨和熊胃之間建立了聯繫。它有可能在煉金術中起到類似的作用，有助於將兩個不同的一半結合在一起。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone shell"
msgid_plural "stone shells"
msgstr[0] "石之殼"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "stone shell"
msgid ""
"The broken fragment of an owlbear egg.  With luck it might still contain some "
"of its former power, though if nothing else it's still a bit sharp."
msgstr "鴞熊蛋的破片。幸運的是它仍保有原本的力量，除此之外還有點尖銳。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "copper infusion bracelet"
msgid_plural "copper infusion bracelets"
msgstr[0] "銅灌注手鐲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "copper infusion bracelet"
#. ~ Description of "silver infusion bracelet"
msgid ""
"This bracelet has runes engraved on it.  You sense a faint air of mysticism "
"when you look at it.  It would be useful for imbuing mana into material."
msgstr "这个手镯上刻着符文。当你看着它的时候，你会感觉到一种神秘的微弱气息。它将有助于将魔力灌注到物质中。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "silver infusion bracelet"
msgid_plural "silver infusion bracelets"
msgstr[0] "銀灌注手鐲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "copper circlet"
msgid_plural "copper circlets"
msgstr[0] "銅飾環"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "copper circlet"
msgid ""
"A wooden band with copper trimmings to be worn on the head.  Touching your "
"temples with it on makes you feel very calm."
msgstr "镶有铜边的木质头环。在戴上它时按摩太阳穴会使你感到非常平静。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "silver circlet"
msgid_plural "silver circlets"
msgstr[0] "银色圆环"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "silver circlet"
msgid ""
"A wooden band with silver trimmings to be worn on the head.  Touching your "
"temples with it on makes you feel very calm."
msgstr "戴在头上的银饰木带。戴着它触摸你的太阳穴会让你感到非常平静。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion starter"
msgid_plural "potion starter"
msgstr[0] "藥劑基底"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion starter"
msgid ""
"Strong alcohol, infused with mana and concentrated into a liquid that can "
"stabilize spells into liquid form.  You can still drink it, if you want."
msgstr "強烈的酒精，注入法力並濃縮成液體，可以使法術穩定成液態。如果你願意，仍然可以喝它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "superior potion starter"
msgid_plural "superior potion starter"
msgstr[0] "高級藥劑基底"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "superior potion starter"
msgid ""
"Pure ethanol saturated with magical energy.  The sheer power concentrated "
"within causes the surface of the potion to ripple continuously."
msgstr "充满魔法能量的纯净乙醇。聚集在其中的魔力使药剂表面不断地波动起伏。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large adrenal gland"
msgid_plural "large adrenal glands"
msgstr[0] "巨大腎上腺"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "large adrenal gland"
msgid ""
"An organ located above the kidneys responsible for secretion of adrenaline, "
"cortisol, and aldosterone.  This one is huge, whether by nature or mutation."
msgstr "位於腎臟上方的器官，負責分泌腎上腺素、皮質醇和醛固酮。無論是天生還是突變的，這個都是巨大的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glow dust"
msgid_plural "glow dusts"
msgstr[0] "發光粉"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "glow dust"
msgid ""
"The powdered remains of a will-o-wisps's physical form.  It seems to still "
"possess an otherworldly glow."
msgstr "鬼火物質型態的粉狀遺骸。它依然散發出異界的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magical reading light"
msgid_plural "magical reading lights"
msgstr[0] "魔法閱讀燈"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "magical reading light"
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of glow powder and lesser mana potions, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at least "
"a decade.  Use it to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr "這種極其昂貴的小光源用發光粉和次級法力藥水提供動力，提供閱讀時足夠的光源長達至少十年。使用它來蓋上蓋子並隱藏燈光。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magical reading light (covered)"
msgid_plural "magical reading lights (covered)"
msgstr[0] "魔法閱讀燈（蓋上）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "magical reading light (covered)"
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of glow powder and lesser mana potions, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at least "
"a decade.  The cover is closed.  Use it to open the cover and show the light."
msgstr "這種極其昂貴的小光源用發光粉和次級法力藥水提供動力，提供閱讀時足夠的光源長達至少十年。蓋子已經蓋上。使用它來打開蓋子並顯示燈光。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bulette plate"
msgid_plural "bulette plates"
msgstr[0] "鯊蜥獸甲片"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "bulette plate"
msgid ""
"The great plates from behind a bulette's head have always been prized for use "
"in shield and armor making."
msgstr "從鯊蜥獸頭部後面撬出來的大型甲片，可用來製作盾牌跟護甲。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bulette pearl"
msgid_plural "bulette pearls"
msgstr[0] "鯊蜥獸珍珠"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "bulette pearl"
msgid ""
"As a bulette burrows through the earth its gills collect minute amounts of "
"precious metals and gems which slowly aggregate into lustrous gemstones "
"prized for their beauty and power."
msgstr "當鯊蜥獸在地底挖洞時，它的鰓會收集微量的貴重金屬和寶石，這些慢慢地聚集成燦爛的珠寶，因其美麗與魔力而備受珍視。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dragon essence"
msgid_plural "dragon essence"
msgstr[0] "龍精"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "dragon essence"
msgid "This is the magical essence from a dragon, distilled into a concentrated form."
msgstr "這是龍的魔力精華，蒸餾成濃縮型態。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stirge proboscis"
msgid_plural "stirge proboscises"
msgstr[0] "蚊蝙喙"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "stirge proboscis"
msgid ""
"A long sucking apparatus harvested from stirge corpse.  Makes a poor melee "
"weapon."
msgstr "一根从蚊蝠尸体上收获所得的长喙，可以勉强当成武器使用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of demon chitin"
msgid_plural "chunks of demon chitin"
msgstr[0] "惡魔幾丁質塊"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of demon chitin"
msgid ""
"A piece of demon spider exoskeleton.  It is light and very durable, and "
"probably has some magical properties."
msgstr "一塊惡魔蜘蛛的外骨骼。質輕且非常耐用，並且可能具有一些魔法特性。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bundle of demon chitin chunks"
msgid_plural "bundles of demon chitin chunks"
msgstr[0] "惡魔幾丁質捆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "bundle of demon chitin chunks"
msgid ""
"Pieces of demon spider exoskeleton, bundled tightly together for storage.  "
"Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr "几片恶魔蜘蛛外壳，系紧打包以便存放。可拆解。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demon chitin plate"
msgid_plural "demon chitin plates"
msgstr[0] "惡魔幾丁質板"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "demon chitin plate"
msgid ""
"A large piece of demon spider exoskeleton, painstakingly cut from the corpse "
"of an adult demon spider.  A plate of this size can be used to create armor "
"plating."
msgstr "一大片惡魔蜘蛛的外骨骼，從成年惡魔蜘蛛的屍體細心地割下。這種尺寸的板可用於製造裝甲板。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demon spider fang"
msgid_plural "demon spider fangs"
msgstr[0] "惡魔蜘蛛毒牙"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "demon spider fang"
msgid ""
"A fang from a demon spider.  It seems to still drip with poison; you might be "
"able to use this in some alchemical recipe?"
msgstr "一支惡魔蜘蛛的獠牙。它仍然滴著毒藥；也許你在一些煉金術配方中能使用它？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
msgid "alumentum"
msgid_plural "alumentum"
msgstr[0] "源動之焰"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "alumentum"
msgid ""
"Alumentum is magically processed coal or charcoal.  It burns as hot as "
"magnesium, and for a significantly longer period of time.  One of the very "
"few magical materials that is still produced in any quantity today due to its "
"usefulness."
msgstr "源動之焰是經過魔法加工的煤或木炭。 它的燃燒溫度和鎂一樣高，而且燃燒的時間明顯更長。 由於它的實用性，是目前仍在大量生產的極少數魔法材料之一。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mana dust"
msgid_plural "mana dusts"
msgstr[0] "法力粉塵"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "mana dust"
msgid "Crystalized mana in powdered form.  It faintly pulses with arcane energy."
msgstr "一撮粉末状的魔力结晶。它所含的奥术能量不断脉动着发出微光。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mana pearl"
msgid_plural "mana pearls"
msgstr[0] "法力珍珠"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "mana pearl"
msgid "A gemstone created by alchemy.  You can feel it attract surrounding mana."
msgstr "炼金术创造的宝石。你可以感觉到它吸引着周围的魔力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "enchanted wood"
msgid_plural "enchanted wood"
msgstr[0] "附魔木"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "enchanted wood"
msgid "Wood that has been infused with mana."
msgstr "灌注過法力的木頭。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mana bomb"
msgid_plural "mana bombs"
msgstr[0] "魔能炸弹"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "mana bomb"
msgid ""
"Mana bombs are powerful explosive devices developed by a little-known "
"alchemist group for use against enemy spellcasters.  These bombs are fueled "
"by pure arcane energy and can kill instantly.  The exact workings are "
"unclear, but they appear to use some kind of massive mana burn."
msgstr ""
"魔能炸弹是由一个鲜为人知的炼金术士团体开发的强大爆炸装置，用于对付敌方法师。这些炸弹使用纯奥术能量作为燃料，可以瞬间杀伤。确切的工作原理尚不清楚，但似乎利用"
"了某种快速而剧烈的魔力燃烧。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "mana bomb"
msgid "Mix liquid"
msgstr "注能"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "mana bomb"
msgid "You mix the contents of the bottle, and it starts to sizzle."
msgstr "你把魔法药剂混合，它开始嘶嘶作响。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mana bomb (lit)"
msgid_plural "mana bombs (lit)"
msgstr[0] "魔能炸弹（点燃）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "mana bomb (lit)"
msgid ""
"The liquid in the bottle is sizzling.  Throwing it away from you, preferably "
"at an enemy, would be a very good idea."
msgstr "瓶子里的液体在嘶嘶作响。把它从你身边扔掉，最好是扔向敌人，这将是一个非常好的主意。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "mana bomb (lit)"
msgid "The reaction has already started - all you can do is get it away from you!"
msgstr "反应已经开始了——你所能做的就是把它从你身边弄走！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a trap
msgid "alchemical mine"
msgid_plural "alchemical mines"
msgstr[0] "煉金地雷"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "alchemical mine"
msgid ""
"A pair of stabilized alchemist bombs with concentrated mana linking them.  "
"Any movement in the mana linkage zone provokes an extremely powerful "
"explosion in a small area."
msgstr "一对稳定的炼金术士炸弹，被高度提纯的魔力连接起来。在魔力连接区内的任何移动都会引发威力极其强大的小范围爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "alchemical mine"
msgid "You set the alchemic mine."
msgstr "你設置了煉金地雷。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/fuel.json
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dragon blood"
msgid_plural "dragon blood"
msgstr[0] "龍血"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/fuel.json
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mana infused blood"
msgid_plural "mana infused blood"
msgstr[0] "注魔之血"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orichalcum arrow"
msgid_plural "orichalcum arrows"
msgstr[0] "奧利哈鋼箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/generic.json
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
msgid "parabolan yarn"
msgid_plural "parabolan yarn"
msgstr[0] "派瑞伯倫紗線"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
msgid "elastic potential energy"
msgid_plural "elastic potential energy"
msgstr[0] "弹性势能"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
msgid "biomancer booster sludge"
msgid_plural "biomancer booster sludge"
msgstr[0] "生化术士强化浆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ichaival"
msgid_plural "Ichaivals"
msgstr[0] "伊奇巴爾"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ichaival"
#. ~ Description of "Ichaival"
msgid ""
"Ichaival, the bow of Odin.  Rumored to fire 10 arrows with every pull of the "
"string.  It has gold and silver ornaments on it, as well as an ornate Raven."
msgstr "伊奇巴尔，传说中北欧众神之父奥丁使用的神弓。据说每次拉弦能够射出 10 只箭。这件上面覆盖满了金银饰品，以及一只装饰华丽的渡鸦。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "orichalcum arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow composed of a sliver of orichalcum.  The arrow has a mysterious "
"glow.  Has a very high chance of staying intact when fired, however can only "
"be fired from Ichaival."
msgstr "由山铜制成的箭，正发出神秘的光芒。射击后有很大概率可以保持完好，但是只能从神弓伊奇巴尔上射出。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tangler arrow"
msgid_plural "tangler arrows"
msgstr[0] "纠缠箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "tangler arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow with a fragment of a druid rune in the arrowhead.  It unleashes a "
"storm of entangling vegetation when it strikes."
msgstr ""
"An arrow with a fragment of a druid rune in the arrowhead.  It unleashes a "
"storm of entangling vegetation when it strikes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thunderclap arrow"
msgid_plural "thunderclap arrows"
msgstr[0] "雷霆箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "thunderclap arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow with a fragment of a stormshaper rune in the arrowhead.  It trails "
"lightning and explodes with a crash of thunder."
msgstr "一支箭，箭头嵌有风暴塑造者符文碎片。飞行时拖曳雷光尾迹，命中时在雷光震响中炸裂。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "avalanche arrow"
msgid_plural "avalanche arrows"
msgstr[0] "avalanche arrows"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "avalanche arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow with a fragment of a earthshaper rune in the arrowhead.  It hits the "
"target with the force of an avalanche."
msgstr ""
"An arrow with a fragment of a earthshaper rune in the arrowhead.  It hits the "
"target with the force of an avalanche."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fireball arrow"
msgid_plural "fireball arrows"
msgstr[0] "火球箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "fireball arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow with a fragment of a kelvinist rune in the arrowhead.  It explodes "
"into a firestorm."
msgstr "一支箭，其箭头上有炽霜法师的符文碎片。 在发射后爆炸并形成火焰风暴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "visceral arrow"
msgid_plural "visceral arrows"
msgstr[0] "酸蚀箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "visceral arrow"
msgid ""
"A disturbing bone arrow with a fragment of a biomancer rune in the arrowhead. "
" It showers its target in acid."
msgstr ""
"A disturbing bone arrow with a fragment of a biomancer rune in the arrowhead. "
" It showers its target in acid."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sparking arrow"
msgid_plural "sparking arrows"
msgstr[0] "闪耀箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "sparking arrow"
msgid ""
"A metallic arrow with a fragment of a technomancer rune in the arrowhead.  It "
"destroys electronic targets."
msgstr "一支金属箭，其箭头上有科技法师的符文碎片。 用来摧毁电子目标。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gravity arrow"
msgid_plural "gravity arrows"
msgstr[0] "引力箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "gravity arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow with a fragment of a magus rune in the arrowhead.  It reverses "
"flight briefly after striking its target and then hits another one."
msgstr "其箭头上有魔法符文的碎片。 击中目标后，这只箭矢会在短时间内向反方向飞行，从而击中另一个目标。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "enervating arrow"
msgid_plural "enervating arrows"
msgstr[0] "衰弱箭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "enervating arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow with a fragment of an animist rune in the arrowhead.  It unleashes a "
"cloud of enervating gas."
msgstr ""
"An arrow with a fragment of an animist rune in the arrowhead.  It unleashes a "
"cloud of enervating gas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quiver of holding +1"
msgid_plural "quivers of holding +1"
msgstr[0] "魔法箭袋+1"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "quiver of holding +1"
msgid ""
"A quiver enchanted to hold 40 arrows or bolts while not taking up any more "
"space than a normal quiver.  Rarely made after the invention of firearms."
msgstr ""
"A quiver enchanted to hold 40 arrows or bolts while not taking up any more "
"space than a normal quiver.  Rarely made after the invention of firearms."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quiver of holding +2"
msgid_plural "quivers of holding +2"
msgstr[0] "魔法箭袋+2"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "quiver of holding +2"
msgid ""
"A quiver enchanted to hold 80 arrows or bolts while not taking up any more "
"space than a normal quiver.  Rarely made after the invention of firearms."
msgstr ""
"A quiver enchanted to hold 80 arrows or bolts while not taking up any more "
"space than a normal quiver.  Rarely made after the invention of firearms."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of demon chitin arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of demon chitin arm guards"
msgstr[0] "惡魔甲殼護臂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of demon chitin arm guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red "
"exoskeletons of demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "由惡魔蜘蛛的生物矽化外骨骼，仔細清洗並剪裁製成的護臂。防火且非常耐用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demon chitin armor"
msgid_plural "demon chitin armors"
msgstr[0] "惡魔甲殼護甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "demon chitin armor"
msgid ""
"Leg and body armor crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red "
"exoskeletons of demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "由惡魔蜘蛛的生物矽化外骨骼，仔細清洗並剪裁製成的腿部與軀幹護甲。防火且非常耐用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demon chitin helmet"
msgid_plural "demon chitin helmets"
msgstr[0] "惡魔甲殼頭盔"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "demon chitin helmet"
msgid ""
"A helmet crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of "
"demon spiders.  Covers the entire head; fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "由惡魔蜘蛛的生物矽化外骨骼，仔細清洗並剪裁製成的頭盔。包覆整個頭部。防火且非常耐用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of demon chitin gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of demon chitin gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "惡魔甲殼手套"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of demon chitin gauntlets"
msgid ""
"Gauntlets crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of "
"demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "由惡魔蜘蛛的生物矽化外骨骼，仔細清洗並剪裁製成的護手。防火且非常耐用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of demon chitin boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of demon chitin boots"
msgstr[0] "惡魔甲殼靴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of demon chitin boots"
msgid ""
"Boots crafted from carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of demon "
"spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "由惡魔蜘蛛的生物矽化外骨骼，仔細清洗並剪裁製成的靴子。防火且非常耐用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demon chitin dog mesh harness"
msgid_plural "demon chitin dog mesh harnesses"
msgstr[0] "恶魔甲壳犬具"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "demon chitin dog mesh harness"
msgid ""
"A makeshift harness of demon chitin fitted to a thin mesh protecting the neck "
"to flank of canines.  You could put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr "一套自制的犬具，上面的恶魔甲壳片和薄薄的网状织物贴合在一起，保护狗的侧面和颈部。你可以将这套犬具穿在一匹友好的狗身上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demon chitin horse armor"
msgid_plural "demon chitin horse armors"
msgstr[0] "恶魔甲壳马铠"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "demon chitin horse armor"
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from demon "
"chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "一套自制的马铠，包含保护马颈的鸡颈、保护马胸的当胸和保护马臀的搭后，上面的恶魔甲壳片和薄薄的网状织物贴合在一起。你可以将这套马铠穿在一匹友好的马身上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Blood Power Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Power Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM：血液發電機"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Blood Power Generator CBM"
msgid ""
"Using the latest advancement in technomancy this bionic is able to convert "
"the innate energy stored in blood into bionic power.  The stronger the blood "
"the better.  It can hold up to 100 mL of blood."
msgstr "科技魔法的最新进展使这个生化插件能够将血液中的固有能量转化成生化能量。血液越强，效率越高。可以容纳 100 ml 血液。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement CBM"
msgid_plural "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement CBMs"
msgstr[0] "魔力结晶义鼻CBM"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement CBM"
#. ~ Description of bionic "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement"
msgid ""
"A large gem made with crystallized mana and some other stabilizing metals.  "
"Comes with a specially designed power pack (installed into the skull) that "
"does not interfere with your mana ley lines.  WARNING: for Technomancer use "
"only.  By using this spell you are waiving all liability of Frikken Laser "
"Beams Inc.  and its subsidiaries."
msgstr ""
"一个使用魔力结晶和其他稳定金属制作而成的大型宝石。配有一个经过特别设计不会干扰你魔力脉络的供能装置（被安装在头骨之中）。警告：仅供科技法师使用。施放此法术视"
"为你同意免除弗里肯激光公司及其子公司的所有责任。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Name of a bionic
msgid "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement"
msgstr "魔力结晶义鼻"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Witchfinder Eyes CBM"
msgid_plural "Witchfinder Eyes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "猎巫人之眼CBM"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Witchfinder Eyes CBM"
msgid ""
"A series of rune-inscribed implants around the eyes allow the user of this "
"bionic to see the ley lines in the bodies of those who frequently use magic, "
"effectively detecting nearby wizards even through obstructing terrain."
msgstr "一系列植入于眼球周围的，雕刻有符文的植入物，允许该生化插件的使用者看见频繁使用魔法之人的灵脉，即使有障碍地形也能高效地侦测附近的巫师。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Name of a bionic
msgid "Witchfinder Eyes"
msgstr "猎巫人之眼"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of bionic "Witchfinder Eyes"
msgid ""
"Rune-inscribed metal filaments have been implanted around your eyes, allowing "
"you to detect nearby mages.  Activate to turn it on."
msgstr "刻有符文的金属丝已经被植入你的双眼周围，使你拥有侦测附近法师的能力。激活以开启。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Corporeal Ley Tap CBM"
msgid_plural "Corporeal Ley Tap CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Corporeal Ley Tap CBMs"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Corporeal Ley Tap CBM"
msgid ""
"For those who have no use for their mana, this bionic allows the user to "
"convert mana directly into bionic power.  Though the conversion rate is "
"inefficient, mana is free."
msgstr ""
"For those who have no use for their mana, this bionic allows the user to "
"convert mana directly into bionic power.  Though the conversion rate is "
"inefficient, mana is free."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Name of a bionic
msgid "Corporeal Ley Tap"
msgstr "Corporeal Ley Tap"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of bionic "Corporeal Ley Tap"
msgid ""
"Tiny bits of orichalcum have been implanted at important intersections in "
"your ley lines, allowing you to turn your mana into bionic power.  Activate "
"to begin the conversion process."
msgstr ""
"Tiny bits of orichalcum have been implanted at important intersections in "
"your ley lines, allowing you to turn your mana into bionic power.  Activate "
"to begin the conversion process."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Levinbolt Projector CBM"
msgid_plural "Levinbolt Projector CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Levinbolt Projector CBMs"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Levinbolt Projector CBM"
msgid ""
"The ultimate in concealable personal defense, thin filaments are implanted "
"along the ley lines in both of your arms leading to embedded mana crystals in "
"your hands, allowing you to launch blasts of pure magical energy at nearby "
"targets.  The only disadvantage is that it draws on your own personal mana "
"supply rather than bionic power."
msgstr ""
"The ultimate in concealable personal defense, thin filaments are implanted "
"along the ley lines in both of your arms leading to embedded mana crystals in "
"your hands, allowing you to launch blasts of pure magical energy at nearby "
"targets.  The only disadvantage is that it draws on your own personal mana "
"supply rather than bionic power."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Name of a bionic
msgid "Levinbolt Projector"
msgstr "Levinbolt Projector"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of bionic "Levinbolt Projector"
msgid ""
"Implants in your arm's ley lines allow you to project bolts of magical energy "
"from your hands.  This draws on your personal mana stores, not your bionic "
"power."
msgstr ""
"Implants in your arm's ley lines allow you to project bolts of magical energy "
"from your hands.  This draws on your personal mana stores, not your bionic "
"power."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black dragon scale"
msgid_plural "black dragon scales"
msgstr[0] "黑龍鱗片"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragon scale"
msgid ""
"A scale from a black dragon.  It still has its magical properties and acid "
"resistance."
msgstr "黑龍的鱗片。它仍保留原有的魔法性質與耐酸性。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bundle of black dragon scales"
msgid_plural "bundles of black dragon scales"
msgstr[0] "黑龍鱗捆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "bundle of black dragon scales"
msgid ""
"Scales from a black dragon, bundled tightly together for storage.  "
"Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr "几片黑龙鳞片，系紧打包以便存放。可拆解。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw black dragon hide"
msgid_plural "raw black dragon hide"
msgstr[0] "生黑龍皮"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "raw black dragon hide"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw hide harvested from a black dragon.  It is a large "
"enough piece that it is workable to make armor, and with enough scales you "
"could make scale mail."
msgstr "細心地從黑龍身上剝下來的一疊龍皮，這是很大的一片，足夠你用來製作護甲，如果有夠多的鱗片，可以作成鱗甲。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tanning black dragon hide"
msgid_plural "tanning black dragon hides"
msgstr[0] "鞣製過的黑龍皮"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "tanning black dragon hide"
msgid ""
"A treated black dragon hide which is undergoing the chemical processes "
"required to become workable.  You will be able to activate it to unroll and "
"make use of it when it is done."
msgstr "一張經過處理的黑龍皮，它正透過化學反應以轉變成可做為製作材料的皮革，完成後你可以使用它來攤開它並得到一張可以利用的皮革。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tanning black dragon hide"
msgid "You carefully unfold the black dragon hide and shake it clean."
msgstr "你小心翼翼的的把鞣製過的黑龍皮攤開，並把它上面殘留的液體甩乾淨。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "tanning black dragon hide"
msgid "The black dragon hide isn't done yet."
msgstr "黑龍皮尚未鞣製完成。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black dragon hide"
msgid_plural "black dragon hides"
msgstr[0] "黑龍皮"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragon hide"
msgid ""
"Prepared hide from a black dragon.  Hard, acid-resistant, and with more "
"scales could make a suit of armor as hard as steel and half as heavy."
msgstr "已處理的黑龍皮。堅硬而耐酸，如果有足量的黑龍皮，你可以製作一套硬如鋼鐵的護甲，而且重量只有鋼鐵的一半。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bundle of black dragon hides"
msgid_plural "bundles of black dragon hides"
msgstr[0] "黑龍皮捆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "bundle of black dragon hides"
msgid ""
"Hides from a black dragon, bundled tightly together for storage.  Disassemble "
"to unpack."
msgstr "几张黑龙皮，系紧打包以便存放。可拆解。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of black dragonscale boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of black dragonscale boots"
msgstr[0] "黑龍鱗靴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of black dragonscale boots"
msgid ""
"Boots made of black incredibly durable dragonscale.  Very protective, and "
"surprisingly light."
msgstr "一双用黑龙鳞制成的靴子，在拥有极高的防御力的同时令人惊异的轻便。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of black dragonhide boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of black dragonhide boots"
msgstr[0] "黑龍皮靴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of black dragonhide boots"
msgid ""
"Boots made of very durable black dragonhide.  Very protective, and "
"surprisingly light."
msgstr "一双用黑龙皮制成的靴子，在拥有极高的防御力的同时令人惊异的轻便。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black dragonscale helmet"
msgid_plural "black dragonscale helmets"
msgstr[0] "黑龍鱗盔"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonscale helmet"
msgid ""
"A helmet made from black incredibly durable dragonscale, held together with "
"black dragonhide.  It comes equipped with a full face visor with only a thin "
"slit to see out of.  Activate to raise the visor."
msgstr "一顶用黑龙鳞与黑龙皮制成的头盔，全覆面设计，只能通过一条细细的开口看见外面。激活以升起面罩。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black dragonscale helmet (raised visor)"
msgid_plural "black dragonscale helmets (raised visor)"
msgstr[0] "黑龍鱗盔（拉高面罩）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonscale helmet (raised visor)"
msgid ""
"A helmet made from incredibly durable black dragonscale, held together with "
"black dragonhide.  The visor is raised."
msgstr "一顶用黑龙鳞与黑龙皮制成的头盔，全覆面设计，面罩已经被升起。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black dragonhide helmet"
msgid_plural "black dragonhide helmets"
msgstr[0] "黑龍皮帽"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonhide helmet"
msgid ""
"A helmet made from very durable black dragonhide.  It protects your head "
"well, but doesn't cover your face."
msgstr "一顶用黑龙皮制成的头盔，提供出色的头部防护，又不会遮挡面部。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black dragonscale armor"
msgid_plural "black dragonscale armors"
msgstr[0] "黑龍鱗甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonscale armor"
msgid ""
"A full suit of incredibly durable black dragon scale mail.  It comes with all "
"the accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms, with the benefit of "
"being very light and flexible."
msgstr "全套黑龙鳞甲，部件覆盖躯干、腿、手臂，轻便且灵活。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "black dragonhide armor"
msgid_plural "black dragonhide armors"
msgstr[0] "黑龍皮甲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonhide armor"
msgid ""
"A full suit of very durable black dragonhide armor.  It comes with all the "
"accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms, with the benefit of "
"being very light and flexible."
msgstr "全套黑龙皮甲，部件覆盖躯干、腿、手臂，轻便且灵活。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of black dragonscale gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of black dragonscale gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "黑龍鱗護手"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of black dragonscale gauntlets"
msgid ""
"A pair of heavy-duty gauntlets made of incredibly durable black dragonscale "
"that covers your hands."
msgstr "一对用黑龙鳞制成的护手，坚固耐用，完全覆盖了双手。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of black dragonhide gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of black dragonhide gloves"
msgstr[0] "黑龍皮手套"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of black dragonhide gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves made of very durable black dragonhide, modified to be easy "
"to wear while providing maximum protection under extreme conditions."
msgstr "一对用黑龙皮制成的手套，易于穿戴，在极端环境下也能提最大的防护。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of black dragonscale boots"
msgid ""
"Massive boots made of incredibly durable black dragonscale, modified to fit "
"even the strangest of bodies.  Very protective, and surprisingly light."
msgstr "一双用黑龙鳞制成的大码靴子，能容下各种变异肢体，在拥有极高的防御力的同时令人惊异的轻便。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of black dragonhide boots"
msgid ""
"Massive boots made of very durable black dragonhide, modified to fit even the "
"strangest of bodies.  Very protective, and surprisingly light."
msgstr "一双用黑龙皮制成的大码靴子，能容下各种变异肢体，在拥有极高的防御力的同时令人惊异的轻便。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of black dragonscale gauntlets"
msgid ""
"A pair of heavy-duty gauntlets made of incredibly durable black dragonscale "
"that covers your hands, or whatever you use as hands."
msgstr "一对用黑龙鳞制成的大码护手，坚固耐用，完全覆盖了双手或其他变异肢体。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of black dragonhide gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves made of very durable black dragonhide, modified to be easy "
"to wear while providing maximum protection under extreme conditions.  Sized "
"to fit even the strangest of anatomy."
msgstr "一对用黑龙皮制成的大码手套，易于穿戴，能容下各种变异肢体，在极端环境下也能提最大的防护。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonscale helmet"
msgid ""
"A massive helmet made from incredibly durable black dragonscale, held "
"together with black dragonhide.  It comes equipped with a full face visor you "
"can raise and is large enough to fit even the strangest of heads."
msgstr "一顶用黑龙鳞与黑龙皮制成的大码头盔，全覆面设计，能容下各种变异肢体，只能通过一条细细的开口看见外面。激活以升起面罩。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonscale helmet (raised visor)"
msgid ""
"A massive helmet made from incredibly durable black dragonscale, held "
"together with black dragonhide.  It is large enough to fit even the strangest "
"of heads.  The visor is raised"
msgstr "一顶用黑龙鳞与黑龙皮制成的大码头盔，全覆面设计，能容下各种变异肢体，面罩已经被升起。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonhide helmet"
msgid ""
"A massive helmet made from very durable black dragonhide.  It protects your "
"head well, and doesn't cover your face, but is large enough to fit even the "
"strangest of heads."
msgstr "一顶用黑龙皮制成的大码头盔，能容下各种变异肢体，提供出色的头部防护，又不会遮挡面部。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonscale armor"
msgid ""
"A massive full suit of incredibly durable black dragon scale mail.  It comes "
"with all the accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms; sized to "
"fit even the strangest of bodies."
msgstr "特大码的全套黑龙鳞甲，部件覆盖躯干、腿、手臂，能容下各种变异肢体。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "black dragonhide armor"
msgid ""
"A massive full suit of very durable black dragonhide armor.  It comes with "
"all the accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms; sized to fit "
"even the strangest of bodies."
msgstr "特大码的全套黑龙皮甲，部件覆盖躯干、腿、手臂，能容下各种变异肢体。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dragonhide backpack"
msgid_plural "dragonhide backpacks"
msgstr[0] "龍皮背包"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "dragonhide backpack"
msgid ""
"A custom-built backpack.  Made of very durable dragon leather and carefully "
"crafted to hold as much stuff as possible."
msgstr "一件自制的龙皮背包，经久耐用并且被经过精心制造，使得它能够装下尽可能多的物品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Spellcraft Theory"
msgid_plural "copies of Spellcraft Theory"
msgstr[0] "《法術辨識原理》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Spellcraft Theory"
msgid "A intermediate textbook on magical theories."
msgstr "一本魔法理論的中級教科書。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Basic Spellcraft Theory"
msgid_plural "copies of Basic Spellcraft Theory"
msgstr[0] "《基礎法術辨識原理》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Basic Spellcraft Theory"
msgid "A beginner textbook on magical theories."
msgstr "一本魔法理論的入門教科書。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Basics of Caster Levels"
msgid_plural "copies of The Basics of Caster Levels"
msgstr[0] "施法等级指南"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "The Basics of Caster Levels"
msgid ""
"This book goes into details about different ways to boost one's caster level "
"above what one would normally achieve.  Domination schools can be boosted by "
"various items detailed inside, while harmony schools can be boosted by "
"circumstances.  Regardless, the book cautions that this boost can not exceed "
"1 + ( your highest caster level in that school / 5 ).  For animist, they get "
"a boost if they stand in blood.  More blood means a higher maximum boost.  "
"Stormshapers gets a boost while being outside during precipitation.  More "
"precipitation means a higher maximum boost.  Earthshapers get a boost by "
"being underground, and by standing on dirt, sand, clay or the like.  "
"Apparently, standing in pits is also very effective.  Druids gets a boost by "
"standing on grass, fern, bushes, and the like.  Hugging a young tree gives "
"among the highest possible boosts for druids."
msgstr ""
"这本书描述让施法等级超出一般水平的不同方法。统御学派以各种物品强化施法等级，调谐学派则依靠环境进行强化。不论情况如何，施法等级都无法超出1+"
"（该学派的最高施法等级/5"
"）。泛灵师站在血里就能获得强化，血越多、最大强化就越高。风暴塑造者在正在降水的户外环境里获得强化。塑地者在地下空间、站在泥土，粘土，沙砾里都能获得强化。站在"
"坑里也行。德鲁伊站在草地、蕨类、树丛等植物里就能获得强化。站在年轻的树边上能给德鲁伊最高等级的强化。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ᚲᚨᚲ:ᚲᛟᚹᚨᛏ:ᛗᛁᚠᚱᛁᛚ"
msgid_plural "ᚲᚨᚲ:ᚲᛟᚹᚨᛏ:ᛗᛁᚠᚱᛁᛚ"
msgstr[0] "ᚲᚨᚲ:ᚲᛟᚹᚨᛏ:ᛗᛁᚠᚱᛁᛚ"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "ᚲᚨᚲ:ᚲᛟᚹᚨᛏ:ᛗᛁᚠᚱᛁᛚ"
msgid ""
"This book is written in a runic language unfamiliar to you.  Fortunately, "
"there are several very detailed pictures that demonstrate the process of "
"forging a sword from an ingot of silvery metal.  You get the impression that "
"this is some sort of textbook for blacksmiths."
msgstr "这本书是用你不熟悉的符文写成的。幸运的是，有几张非常详细的图片展示了用某种银色金属锭锻造刀剑的过程。你觉得这是本铁匠的教科书。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vacation brochure"
msgid_plural "vacation brochures"
msgstr[0] "假期旅遊宣傳冊"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "vacation brochure"
msgid ""
"This is a glossy brochure encouraging students to book vacations at a lake "
"retreat or remote cabin.  The brochure includes lush photographs of a tower "
"on an island and a remote looking cabin in the woods.  It includes a map of "
"the areas."
msgstr "这是一本精美的小册子，鼓励学生在湖畔度假地或偏远的小屋里度假。这本小册子有着岛屿上的一座塔和林中一座偏远小屋的华丽照片。里面附带着一张本地区的地图。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "vacation brochure"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "lair map"
#. ~ "message" action message of item "strategic points of interest tourist
#. map"
msgid "You add the locations to your map."
msgstr "你將地點標繪在地圖上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lair map"
msgid_plural "lair maps"
msgstr[0] "巢穴地圖"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "lair map"
msgid ""
"This is a well worn map.  It has pictures of fantastical beasts embellishing "
"the carefully drawn map markers."
msgstr "这是一张破旧的地图。它有一些奇形怪状的野兽的照片，装饰着精心绘制的地图标记。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "old photo"
msgid_plural "old photos"
msgstr[0] "古老的相片"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "old photo"
msgid ""
"A photo of a jovial, old wizard, he seems to be dancing with a coat rack in "
"this basement.  There is a stack of suitcases in the background."
msgstr "一张快乐的老魔法师的照片，他似乎正在地下室里和一个衣架跳舞。背景里有一堆手提箱。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "On the Origin of Species by Means of Natural and Supernatural Selection"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of On the Origin of Species by Means of Natural and Supernatural "
"Selection"
msgstr[0] "物种起源"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "On the Origin of Species by Means of Natural and
#. Supernatural Selection"
msgid ""
"This is a mass-market paperback copy of Charles Darwin's famous book where he "
"laid out his theory of evolution and the way that magic influences the course "
"of speciation.  The book was extremely controversial when it came out for "
"positing a recent common ancestor for humans and dwarves and for claiming "
"that elves as a distinct species only date back to 3 million years before "
"present."
msgstr ""
"This is a mass-market paperback copy of Charles Darwin's famous book where he "
"laid out his theory of evolution and the way that magic influences the course "
"of speciation.  The book was extremely controversial when it came out for "
"positing a recent common ancestor for humans and dwarves and for claiming "
"that elves as a distinct species only date back to 3 million years before "
"present."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Running on Empty: A Social History of those Born Without Magic"
msgid_plural "copies of Running on Empty: A Social History of those Born Without Magic"
msgstr[0] "copies of Running on Empty: A Social History of those Born Without Magic"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "Running on Empty: A Social History of those Born Without
#. Magic"
msgid ""
"A history of the treatment of the \"Empty\", people born with the inability "
"to master even the simplest of spells.  From persecution to favored positions "
"(since rulers could be sure the Empty had no magical means of plotting "
"against them), this book chronicles their treatment across the ages."
msgstr ""
"A history of the treatment of the \"Empty\", people born with the inability "
"to master even the simplest of spells.  From persecution to favored positions "
"(since rulers could be sure the Empty had no magical means of plotting "
"against them), this book chronicles their treatment across the ages."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Prisons and Magic: The History of Past and Present Antimagic Restraints"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Prisons and Magic: The History of Past and Present Antimagic "
"Restraints"
msgstr[0] ""
"copies of Prisons and Magic: The History of Past and Present Antimagic "
"Restraints"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "Prisons and Magic: The History of Past and Present
#. Antimagic Restraints"
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the means used by ancient societies to keep imprisoned "
"magic users inside prisons.  From the chains and gag to the mana-leech "
"shackle, this book covers the myriad of ways prisons dealt with "
"teleportation, invisibility, intangibility and every other magic that could "
"be used for an evasion."
msgstr ""
"A detailed overview of the means used by ancient societies to keep imprisoned "
"magic users inside prisons.  From the chains and gag to the mana-leech "
"shackle, this book covers the myriad of ways prisons dealt with "
"teleportation, invisibility, intangibility and every other magic that could "
"be used for an evasion."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Augmentative Technomancy Review"
msgid_plural "issues of Augmentative Technomancy Review"
msgstr[0] "issues of Augmentative Technomancy Review"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "Augmentative Technomancy Review"
msgid ""
"This annual publication covers the latest advances in bionic technomancy, the "
"implantation of metal into flesh.  There are some pretty promising new "
"developments in here that will now never see the light of day."
msgstr ""
"This annual publication covers the latest advances in bionic technomancy, the "
"implantation of metal into flesh.  There are some pretty promising new "
"developments in here that will now never see the light of day."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lesser mana potion"
msgid_plural "lesser mana potions"
msgstr[0] "次級法力藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "lesser mana potion"
msgid ""
"You can't buy these, so you need to save them until the last boss!  Actually, "
"don't even use them there!"
msgstr "你無法買到這東西，所以你需要留下來直到打最後首領！正確來說，你也不要在那裡使用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mana potion"
msgid_plural "mana potions"
msgstr[0] "法力藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "greater mana potion"
msgid_plural "greater mana potions"
msgstr[0] "高級法力藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of Cat's Grace"
msgid_plural "potions of Cat's Grace"
msgstr[0] "貓之優雅藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of Cat's Grace"
msgid ""
"This is a potion of Cat's Grace.  It will increase your dexterity for 50 "
"minutes."
msgstr "这是猫之优雅药剂，它会在50分钟内提高你的敏捷。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of Ogre's Strength"
msgid_plural "potions of Ogre's Strength"
msgstr[0] "食人魔之力藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of Ogre's Strength"
msgid ""
"This is a potion of Ogre's Strength.  It will increase your strength for 50 "
"minutes."
msgstr "这是巨魔之力药剂，它会在50分钟内提高你的力量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of Eagle's Sight"
msgid_plural "potions of Eagle's Sight"
msgstr[0] "鷹之視野藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of Eagle's Sight"
msgid ""
"This is a potion of Eagle's Sight.  It will increase your perception for 50 "
"minutes."
msgstr "这是鹰眼药水，它会在50分钟内提高你的感知。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of Fox's Cunning"
msgid_plural "potions of Fox's Cunning"
msgstr[0] "狐之狡黠藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of Fox's Cunning"
msgid ""
"This is a potion of Fox's Cunning.  It will increase your intelligence for 50 "
"minutes."
msgstr "这是狐之狡黠药剂，它会在50分钟内提高你的智力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of clairvoyance"
msgid_plural "potions of clairvoyance"
msgstr[0] "透视药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of clairvoyance"
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_clairvoyance ( Open Mind )"
msgid "Close your eyes and see."
msgstr "闭上眼睛来看清一切。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Spear in the flask\""
msgid_plural "\"Spear in the flask\""
msgstr[0] "\"瓶中之矛\""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of ""Spear in the flask""
msgid "Use it to penetrate everything in line of sight"
msgstr "用它来刺穿视野中的一切"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of instability"
msgid_plural "potions of instability"
msgstr[0] "不稳药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of instability"
msgid ""
"A potion that temporarily freezes the higher brain activity for a while.  It "
"was banned by the government due to popularity in the criminal sphere, but "
"some people still know the recipe."
msgstr "这种药水能暂时冻结所有复杂的大脑活动。由于在犯罪领域的流行，它被政府禁止了，但有些人仍然知道这个配方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of escape"
msgid_plural "potions of escape"
msgstr[0] "逃脱药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of escape"
msgid "Get out of jail free card for each who care about his life."
msgstr "对每个关心自己生活的人来说，都有免于被监禁的权利。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of teleportation"
msgid_plural "potions of teleportation"
msgstr[0] "传送药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of teleportation"
msgid ""
"Important part of every professional robber's kit.  It was banned by the "
"government due to the popularity in criminal sphere, but some people still "
"know the recipe."
msgstr "每个专业大盗的必备品。由于在犯罪领域的流行，它被政府禁止了，但有些人仍然知道这个配方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of shadows"
msgid_plural "potions of shadows"
msgstr[0] "暗影药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of shadows"
msgid ""
"No one really knows why it was created, but it can be useful in some "
"situations"
msgstr "没有人真正知道它为什么会被创造出来，但它在某些情况下确实有用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Fire in the flask\""
msgid_plural "\"Fire in the flask\""
msgstr[0] "\"瓶中之火\""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of ""Fire in the flask""
msgid ""
"They were really useful in middle ages, but the price was too high, and they "
"were supplanted with another incendiary weapon and, long after, with Molotov "
"cocktails."
msgstr "这种药水在中世纪确实很有用，但价格太高，它们很快被其他燃烧武器所取代，很久之后，又被燃烧瓶所取代。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of invisibility"
msgid_plural "potions of invisibility"
msgstr[0] "隐形药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of invisibility"
msgid ""
"Make you totally invisible, except in mana spectrum.  It was banned by the "
"government due to the popularity in crime sphere, but some people still know "
"the recipe."
msgstr "让你在视觉上完全隐形。由于在犯罪领域的流行，它被政府禁止了，但有些人仍然知道这个配方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of healthiness"
msgid_plural "potions of healthiness"
msgstr[0] "健康药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of healthiness"
msgid ""
"Classical medicine, used from ancient times, that came to us with almost no "
"changes.  Allows you to heal the common illness way faster than before."
msgstr "自古以来使用的经典药物，直到如今几乎没有任何变化。让你比以前更快地治愈常见疾病。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of lesser gravity control"
msgid_plural "potions of lesser gravity control"
msgstr[0] "弱引力控制药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of lesser gravity control"
msgid ""
"Allow user to survive the fall from any height.  Sadly, the required "
"preparation and effect's weakness do not allow to use it for climbing "
"protection."
msgstr "允许使用者在从任何高度坠落时幸存下来。遗憾的是，所需的准备工作和效果的弱点不允许将其用于攀登时的保护。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of night vision"
msgid_plural "potions of night vision"
msgstr[0] "夜视药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of night vision"
msgid ""
"Designed by Occult Coalition sorcerers, this potion was fairly popular inside "
"the special operation forces and in the hunting communities."
msgstr "这种药水由某个神秘联盟的巫师设计，在特别行动部队和狩猎界相当流行。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of domination"
msgid_plural "potions of domination"
msgstr[0] "统御丧尸药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of domination"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rearrange neural activity of the creature to be 100% loyal to a blood owner.  "
"It was banned by the government due to the popularity in crime sphere, but "
"some people still know the recipe."
msgstr "重新安排生物的神经活动，使其100%地忠诚于使用者。由于在犯罪领域的流行，它被政府禁止了，但有些人仍然知道这个配方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of slippery splash"
msgid_plural "potions of slippery splash"
msgstr[0] "粘滑喷溅药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of slippery splash"
msgid ""
"At first only an insignificant spell designed to trap and kill small bugs and "
"rodents, someone found it pretty useful in a real fight and improved it with "
"that goal in mind."
msgstr "起初它是一种小法术，旨在诱捕并杀死小虫子和啮齿动物，但有人发现它在真正的战斗中很有用，并对它进行了改进时纳入考量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of sprint"
msgid_plural "potions of sprint"
msgstr[0] "冲刺药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of sprint"
msgid "They count as doping in Olympic games.  Luckily you are not in a stadium."
msgstr "这种药剂在奥林匹克运动会中被视为兴奋剂。幸运的是你不在体育场里。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of iron lungs"
msgid_plural "potions of iron lungs"
msgstr[0] "铁肺药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of iron lungs"
msgid ""
"Old recipe, used to increase the user's endurance.  The diluted version was "
"used by different armies for fast and long forced marches."
msgstr "古老的配方，用于增加使用者的耐力。稀释后的版本被不同的军队用于快速和长时间的强制行军。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of water breathing"
msgid_plural "potions of water breathing"
msgstr[0] "水肺药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of water breathing"
msgid "An old marine recipe, that saved a lot of shipwreck victim lives."
msgstr "一个古老的海员用配方，拯救了许多船难受害者的生命。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of stimulus"
msgid_plural "potions of stimulus"
msgstr[0] "刺激药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of stimulus"
msgid ""
"One among a variety of potions designed to make a person stronger on the "
"battlefield.  Sharpens the user's senses and improves reaction time, "
"increasing their ability to fight in melee."
msgstr ""
"One among a variety of potions designed to make a person stronger on the "
"battlefield.  Sharpens the user's senses and improves reaction time, "
"increasing their ability to fight in melee."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of iron skin"
msgid_plural "potions of iron skin"
msgstr[0] "铁肤药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of iron skin"
msgid ""
"Harden the user's skin, and allow taking more damage with no harm.  Was "
"popular in ancient armies, but now mostly forgotten."
msgstr "硬化使用者的皮肤，免受更多的伤害。在古代军队中很流行，但现在大多被遗忘。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of illumination"
msgid_plural "potions of illumination"
msgstr[0] "光明药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of illumination"
msgid ""
"A potion designed during the 19th century and popular among miners wishing to "
"avoid the dangers of explosive gas leaks underground.  It is less popular "
"these days due to the abundance of electric lighters, but still sees "
"occasional use."
msgstr ""
"A potion designed during the 19th century and popular among miners wishing to "
"avoid the dangers of explosive gas leaks underground.  It is less popular "
"these days due to the abundance of electric lighters, but still sees "
"occasional use."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of mana regeneration"
msgid_plural "potions of mana regeneration"
msgstr[0] "魔力恢复药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of mana regeneration"
msgid "Attract the ley-lines to user, increasing the natural mana regeneration."
msgstr "能够让使用者吸引灵脉，增加魔力自然再生的速度。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of mana reserves"
msgid_plural "potions of mana reserves"
msgstr[0] "魔力扩容药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of mana reserves"
msgid ""
"Splay user's ley-lines, what allow them to use more mana than they usually "
"can."
msgstr "让使用者的灵脉向外伸展，允许使用比通常更多的魔力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of regeneration"
msgid_plural "potions of regeneration"
msgstr[0] "再生药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of regeneration"
msgid "Start a long-term spell sequence, that increase your regeneration abilities."
msgstr "开启一个长期的法术序列，以增加你的再生能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of happiness"
msgid_plural "potions of happiness"
msgstr[0] "欢乐药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of happiness"
msgid ""
"Closer to an alcoholic drink than a potion, this mixture makes your brain "
"feel constant happiness, ignoring the whole boredom of reality.  It causes no "
"addiction, but is still banned in some countries, including the USA (except "
"in Texas and New Hampshire, where it's just frowned upon)."
msgstr ""
"Closer to an alcoholic drink than a potion, this mixture makes your brain "
"feel constant happiness, ignoring the whole boredom of reality.  It causes no "
"addiction, but is still banned in some countries, including the USA (except "
"in Texas and New Hampshire, where it's just frowned upon)."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of toxin"
msgid_plural "potions of toxin"
msgstr[0] "毒素药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of toxin"
msgid ""
"Spread a low lethal toxin on your enemies.  It's surprisingly effective, if "
"you have enough time."
msgstr "在你的敌人身上传播一种低致命性的毒素。效果意外地好，前提是你有足够的时间。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of venom"
msgid_plural "potions of venom"
msgstr[0] "猛毒药剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of venom"
msgid ""
"Concentrated potion, teleported right in the enemy body - fast, painful, and "
"guarantee death."
msgstr "浓缩的药水，可以直接传送到敌人体内——快速、痛苦，并且保证死亡。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zombie voodoo doll"
msgid_plural "zombie voodoo dolls"
msgstr[0] "殭屍巫毒娃娃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "zombie voodoo doll"
msgid ""
"A remarkably accurate effigy of an undead human, including pieces of bone and "
"organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't last forever.  "
"Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve you."
msgstr "一個維妙維肖的不死人類模型，包括骨頭和器官。死靈魔法延遲了它的腐爛，但不會永遠持續下去。使用附帶的針刺穿它可以迫使它為你服務。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ossified voodoo doll"
msgid_plural "ossified voodoo dolls"
msgstr[0] "骨化巫毒娃娃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "ossified voodoo doll"
msgid ""
"A remarkably accurate effigy of an undead human covered with bone, including "
"pieces of organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't last "
"forever.  Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve you."
msgstr "一個維妙維肖被骨頭包覆的不死人類模型，包括器官。死靈魔法延遲了它的腐爛，但不會永遠持續下去。使用附帶的針刺穿它可以迫使它為你服務。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cougar voodoo doll"
msgid_plural "cougar voodoo dolls"
msgstr[0] "美洲獅巫毒娃娃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "cougar voodoo doll"
msgid ""
"A remarkably accurate effigy of an undead cougar, complete with fur, bones, "
"and organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't last "
"forever.  Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve you."
msgstr "一個維妙維肖的不死美洲獅模型，包括毛皮、骨骼和器官。死靈魔法延遲了它的腐爛，但不會永遠持續下去。使用附帶的針刺穿它可以迫使它為你服務。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of Twisted Restoration"
msgid_plural "potions of Twisted Restoration"
msgstr[0] "扭曲恢復藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of Twisted Restoration"
msgid ""
"This foul-smelling liquid simulates undead regeneration by accelerating your "
"heart to dangerous levels.  Drinking this in danger or at critical condition "
"may be lethal."
msgstr "這種惡臭的液體用加速你的心跳達到危險等級的方式來模擬不死生物的再生。在危險或危急情況下飲用可能會致命。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "potion of Improved Twisted Restoration"
msgid_plural "potions of Improved Twisted Restoration"
msgstr[0] "改良扭曲恢復藥劑"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "potion of Improved Twisted Restoration"
msgid ""
"This foul-smelling liquid simulates undead regeneration by accelerating your "
"heart to dangerous levels.  Drinking this in danger or at critical condition "
"may be lethal.  Improved infusion techniques lessen the strain of the process."
msgstr "這種惡臭的液體用加速你的心跳達到危險等級的方式來模擬不死生物的再生。在危險或危急情況下飲用可能會致命。改良的灌注技術讓這過程稍微減輕了壓力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Forge of Wonders warp scroll"
msgid_plural "Forge of Wonders warp scrolls"
msgstr[0] "奇迹熔炉传送卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Forge of Wonders warp scroll"
msgid ""
"This scroll is imbued with a magical spell that, when activated, will "
"transport you to the Forge of Wonders.  Good for one round-trip."
msgstr ""
"This scroll is imbued with a magical spell that, when activated, will "
"transport you to the Forge of Wonders.  Good for one round-trip."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "return warp scroll"
msgid_plural "return warp scrolls"
msgstr[0] "回程传送卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "return warp scroll"
msgid ""
"This scroll is imbued with a magical spell that, when activated, will return "
"you to where you were before you warped to the Forge."
msgstr ""
"This scroll is imbued with a magical spell that, when activated, will return "
"you to where you were before you warped to the Forge."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mana-leech shackle unlock scroll"
msgid_plural "mana-leech shackle unlock scrolls"
msgstr[0] "mana-leech shackle unlock scrolls"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
#. ~ Description of "mana-leech shackle unlock scroll"
msgid ""
"This scroll is imbued with the magical spell that can unlock any mana-leech "
"shackle when cast.  Utterly useless to anyone not struck wearing one."
msgstr ""
"This scroll is imbued with the magical spell that can unlock any mana-leech "
"shackle when cast.  Utterly useless to anyone not struck wearing one."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magus's elastic potential energy contraption (off)"
msgid_plural "magus's elastic potential energy contraptions (off)"
msgstr[0] "魔术师的弹性势能机关（关）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "magus's elastic potential energy contraption (off)"
msgid ""
"This elaborate contraption of wooden sticks under tension and tightly wound "
"strings has a pebble with a magus rune on in its center.  Once activated, "
"this device will transform the stored elastic potential energy into arcane "
"energy, boosting your caster level of magus spells by 1 for as long as the "
"stored energy lasts."
msgstr ""
"这个由受拉木棍和紧绷的线组成的精巧机关的中心有一颗刻着魔术师符文的卵石。启动以后，它就会把存储的弹性势能转化为魔力，在能量耗尽前让你的魔术师施法等级提高1"
"级。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "magus's elastic potential energy
#. contraption (off)"
msgid "You squeeze the machine and its interior starts spinning."
msgstr "你挤压机器，零件开始转动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magus's elastic potential energy contraption"
msgid_plural "magus's elastic potential energy contraptions"
msgstr[0] "魔术师的弹性势能机关"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "magus's elastic potential energy contraption"
msgid ""
"This elaborate contraption of wooden sticks and strings contains a rapidly "
"spinning pebble with magus rune on.  You feel slightly empowered, as your "
"caster level of magus spells is boosted by 1."
msgstr "这个由木棍和线组成的精巧装置内有一颗快速旋转的鹅卵石，石头上刻有魔术师符文。你感觉自己的施法等级提高了1级。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "magus's elastic potential energy
#. contraption"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "magus's clockwork contraption"
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "magus's elastic potential energy
#. contraption"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "magus's clockwork contraption"
msgid "The device slows down and stops."
msgstr "装置逐渐减速，直到完全停下。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magus's clockwork contraption (off)"
msgid_plural "magus's clockwork contraptions (off)"
msgstr[0] "魔术师的发条机关（关）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "magus's clockwork contraption (off)"
msgid ""
"This intricate contraption consists of fine gears, screw drivers, belts, "
"pulleys, springs and other clockwork.  The gearwork is contained in a casing "
"of magically treated glass.  An elegantly drawn magus rune is caged in the "
"center, and a wind-up key extends out of the casing, allowing the device to "
"be powered.  Once wound up, it will boost your magus caster level by 2 for as "
"long as the energy lasts."
msgstr ""
"这个复杂的装置由精细的齿轮、螺丝刀、皮带、滑轮、弹簧和其他钟表结构组成。齿轮装置中心有一个绘制精美的魔术师符文，整体装在经过魔法处理的玻璃外壳中。发条钥匙从"
"外壳中伸出。一旦发条上好，在能量耗尽前，它会把你的魔术师施法等级提升2级。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "magus's clockwork contraption (off)"
msgid "You wind up the device and it starts making a ticking noise."
msgstr "你上好发条，它开始嘀嗒作响。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magus's clockwork contraption"
msgid_plural "magus's clockwork contraptions"
msgstr[0] "魔术师的发条机关"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "magus's clockwork contraption"
msgid ""
"This intricate contraption consists of fine gears, screw drivers, belts, "
"pulleys, springs and other clockwork parts moving in a mesmerizing dance.  "
"The gearwork is contained in a casing of magically treated glass and gives "
"off a soft ticking noise.  An elegantly drawn magus rune in the center is "
"being spun and rotated in a neverending complex dance of arcane energy.  The "
"wind-up key extending from the casing slowly spins back into its original "
"position.  You feel empowered, as your caster level of magus spells is "
"boosted by 2."
msgstr ""
"这个复杂的装置由精细的齿轮、螺丝刀、皮带、滑轮、弹簧和其他钟表结构组成。齿轮装置装在经过魔法处理的玻璃外壳中。中间有一个绘制精美的魔法符文。发条钥匙正缓慢转"
"回原位。它正把你的魔术师施法等级提升2级。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kelvinist's candle (off)"
msgid_plural "kelvinist's candles (off)"
msgstr[0] "炽霜法师蜡烛（关）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "kelvinist's candle (off)"
msgid ""
"A thick candle of magically treated tallow with a kelvinist rune artfully "
"inscribed on the side.  It doesn't burn for quite as long as a regular "
"candle, but it will boost your caster level of kelvinist spells by 1 while "
"burning.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr ""
"一根由魔法处理油脂制成的粗蜡烛，侧面精巧地刻上了炽霜法师符文。它燃烧的时间不如普通蜡烛长，但燃烧时会将你的炽霜法师法术施法等级提高 "
"1。你需要打火机或火柴来点燃它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kelvinist's candle"
msgid_plural "kelvinist's candles"
msgstr[0] "炽霜法师蜡烛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "kelvinist's candle"
msgid ""
"A thick candle of magically treated tallow with a kelvinist rune artfully "
"inscribed on the side.  It doesn't burn for quite as long as a regular "
"candle, but it will boost your caster level of kelvinist spells by 1 while "
"burning.  The magic of the candle protects it from the wind and from setting "
"your backpack aflame.  This candle is lit."
msgstr ""
"一根由魔法处理油脂制成的粗蜡烛，侧面精巧地刻上了炽霜法师符文。它燃烧的时间不如普通蜡烛长，但燃烧时会将你的炽霜法师法术施法等级提高 "
"1。蜡烛的魔力使它免于风吹和点燃你的背包。这根蜡烛已点燃。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kelvinist's oil lamp (off)"
msgid_plural "kelvinist's oil lamps (off)"
msgstr[0] "炽霜法师油灯（关）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "kelvinist's oil lamp (off)"
msgid ""
"An masterfully crafted metal oil lamp with two elongated nozzles, each "
"containing a wick.  The surface is carved with intricate arcane symbols, "
"including a prominent kelvinist rune.  The magic of the lamp protects it from "
"the wind and from setting your backpack aflame.  It does not provide much "
"light, but will boost your kelvinist caster level by 2 while burning.  Use it "
"to light it."
msgstr ""
"一盏制作精良的金属油灯，带有两个细长的喷嘴，每个喷嘴都装有一根灯芯。表面雕刻着复杂的神秘符号，包括一个显眼的炽霜法师符文。油灯的魔力使它免于风吹和点燃你的背"
"包。它不会提供太多光线，但燃烧时会将你的炽霜法师法术施法等级提高 2。通过使用来点亮它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kelvinist's oil lamp"
msgid_plural "kelvinist's oil lamps"
msgstr[0] "炽霜法师油灯"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "kelvinist's oil lamp"
msgid ""
"An masterfully crafted metal oil lamp with two elongated nozzles, each "
"containing a burning wick.  The surface is carved with intricate arcane "
"symbols, including a prominent kelvinist rune.  The reflections from the "
"flames makes it look like the inscriptions are moving.  The magic of the lamp "
"protects it from the wind and from setting your backpack aflame.  It is lit, "
"consuming oil, boosting your kelvinist caster level by 2, and providing "
"light.  Use it to extinguish the flame."
msgstr ""
"一盏制作精良的金属油灯，带有两个细长的喷嘴，每个喷嘴都装有一根燃烧的灯芯。表面雕刻着复杂的神秘符号，包括一个显眼的炽霜法师符文。反射的火光让灯上的铭文看起来"
"像在移动一样。油灯的魔力使它免于风吹和点燃你的背包。它已经点燃，需要消耗油，将你的炽霜法师法术施法等级提高 2以及提供照明。通过使用来熄灭它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "technomancer's clay tablet"
msgid_plural "technomancer's clay tablets"
msgstr[0] "科技法师粘土板"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "technomancer's clay tablet"
msgid ""
"A fire-hardened clay tablet depicting a technomancer rune.  Breaking the "
"tablet will release the stored magical energy, boosting your technomancer "
"caster level by 1 for a while."
msgstr "一块经过火硬化的粘土板，描绘了科技法师符文。打破粘土板会释放储存的魔法能量，暂时将你的科技法师施法等级提高1级。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "technomancer's clay tablet"
msgid "You feel a surge of power as the clay tablet crumbles between your fingers."
msgstr "当泥板在你的指间破碎时，你会感到一股力量的涌动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "technomancer's doodad (off)"
msgid_plural "technomancer's doodads (off)"
msgstr[0] "科技法师机关（关）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "technomancer's doodad (off)"
msgid ""
"A jumble of cables, gears, electromagnets, and metal encased in a steel "
"casing inscribed with arcane runes.  A pebble with a technomancer rune is "
"found at the core.  The machine can adjust the electric charge, magnetic "
"field, and angular velocity of said rune.  When active and in your inventory, "
"the machine will automatically detect when you are trying to cast a "
"technomancer spell.  Once that happens, it will use a moderate amount of "
"battery charge to boost your caster level as far as it can.  A larger boost "
"will draw more energy."
msgstr ""
"一坨电缆、齿轮、电磁铁、金属，包裹在刻有神秘符文的钢壳中。核心部位有一块刻有科技法师符文的鹅卵石。机器可以调整符文的电荷、磁场和角速度。当机器处于激活状态并"
"在你的物品栏中时，它会自动检测你是否正在尝试施放科技法师法术。一旦如此，它就会使用中量的电池电量尽可能地提升你的施法等级。更大的提升将消耗更多的能量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "technomancer's doodad (off)"
msgid "You turn on the doodad and it starts to hum."
msgstr "你启动科技法师机关，它开始嗡鸣。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "technomancer's doodad"
msgid_plural "technomancer's doodads"
msgstr[0] "科技法师机关"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "technomancer's doodad"
msgid ""
"A jumble of cables, gears, electromagnets, and metal encased in a steel "
"casing inscribed with arcane runes.  A pebble with a technomancer rune is "
"found at the core.  The machine can adjust the electric charge, magnetic "
"field, and angular velocity of said rune.  While active and in your "
"inventory, the machine will automatically detect when you are trying to cast "
"a technomancer spell.  Once that happens, it will use a moderate amount of "
"battery charge to boost your caster level as far as it can.  A larger boost "
"will draw more energy.  A faint humming is heard from inside."
msgstr ""
"一坨电缆、齿轮、电磁铁、金属，包裹在刻有神秘符文的钢壳中。核心部位有一块刻有科技法师符文的鹅卵石。机器可以调整符文的电荷、磁场和角速度。当机器处于激活状态并"
"在你的物品栏中时，它会自动检测你是否正在尝试施放科技法师法术。一旦如此，它就会使用中量的电池电量尽可能地提升你的施法等级。更大的提升将消耗更多的能量。它里面"
"正发出微弱的嗡鸣声。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "technomancer's doodad"
msgid "The doodad shuts down."
msgstr "科技法师机关关机了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "biomancer's bone syringe"
msgid_plural "biomancer's bone syringes"
msgstr[0] "生化术士骨针筒"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "biomancer's bone syringe"
msgid ""
"A hollow bone, about 20 cm long, which has been broken at one end and "
"sharpened into a crude syringe.  A biomancer rune is carved on the surface.  "
"By jabbing it into yourself, you can release stored biomancer booster sludge "
"into yourself, thereby boosting your biomancer caster level by 1 for a while. "
" Doing so is about as painful as it sounds."
msgstr ""
"一根约 20 厘米长的空心骨头，一端折断，并被削成一个简陋的注射器。 "
"表面刻有一个生化术士符文。只要将它刺入自己体内，就能将储存的生化术士强化浆释放到自己体内，从而使自己的生化术士施法等级暂时提高1"
"级。这样做确实像听起来那样痛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "biomancer's bone syringe"
msgid ""
"You feel a surge of power as the bone syringe deposits the sludge inside your "
"body."
msgstr "随着骨针筒将强化浆注入你的体内你感觉到一股力量在涌动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "biomancer's syringe"
msgid_plural "biomancer's syringes"
msgstr[0] "生化术士针筒"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "biomancer's syringe"
msgid ""
"An elegant, sturdy metal syringe with a biomancer rune carved on the outside. "
" It can be used to administer stored biomancer booster sludge into yourself, "
"thereby boosting your biomancer caster level by 2 for a while."
msgstr "一根优雅、坚固的金属注射器，外部刻有生化术士符文。它可以用来将储存的生化术士强化浆注入自己体内，使生化术士施法等级暂时提升2级。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "biomancer's syringe"
msgid "You feel a surge of power as the syringe deposits the sludge inside your body."
msgstr "随着针筒将强化浆注入你的体内你感觉到一股力量在涌动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "biomancer booster sludge"
msgid ""
"A thick purple liquid that is filled to the brim with arcane energy.  With "
"the right tool, it can be used to boost your biomancer caster level."
msgstr "一种充盈着魔法能量的紫色粘稠液体。如果有正确的工具，它就可以用来强化你的生化术士施法等级。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Biomancer rune"
msgid_plural "Biomancer runes"
msgstr[0] "生機術士符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "Biomancer rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of rended flesh and bones on it.  It is "
"necessary for Biomancers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有血肉和骨骼的徽章。生機術士將魔法注入創作物過程中的必需品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Technomancer rune"
msgid_plural "Technomancer runes"
msgstr[0] "科技巫師符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "Technomancer rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of clockwork and gears on it.  It is "
"necessary for Technomancers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有發條和齒輪的徽章。科技巫師將魔法注入創作物過程中的必需品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magus rune"
msgid_plural "Magi runes"
msgstr[0] "祆教徒符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "Magus rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of crystal and mana orbs on it.  It is "
"necessary for Magi to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有水晶和魔力球的徽章。祆教徒將魔法注入創作物過程中的必需品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Earthshaper rune"
msgid_plural "Earthshaper runes"
msgstr[0] "塑地者符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "Earthshaper rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of steel and rocks on it.  It is "
"necessary for Earthshapers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有鋼鐵和岩石的徽章。大地塑形者將魔法注入創作物過程中的必需品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Kelvinist rune"
msgid_plural "Kelvinist runes"
msgstr[0] "熱力學者符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "Kelvinist rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of ice and flames on it.  It is necessary "
"for Kelvinists to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有冰和火焰的徽章。熱力學者將魔法注入創作物過程中的必需品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Stormshaper rune"
msgid_plural "Stormshaper runes"
msgstr[0] "塑風者符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "Stormshaper rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of lightning and storm clouds on it.  It "
"is necessary for Stormshapers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有閃電和暴風雲的徽章。風暴塑形者將魔法注入創作物過程中的必需品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Druid rune"
msgid_plural "Druid runes"
msgstr[0] "德魯伊符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "Druid rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of nature and trees on it.  It is "
"necessary for Druids to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有自然和樹木的徽章。德魯伊將魔法注入創作物過程中的必需品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Animist rune"
msgid_plural "Animist runes"
msgstr[0] "泛靈論者符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "Animist rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of summoners on it.  It is necessary for "
"Animists to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有召喚師的徽章。泛靈論者將魔法注入創作物過程中的必需品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alchemist rune"
msgid_plural "alchemist runes"
msgstr[0] "煉金術士符文"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
#. ~ Description of "alchemist rune"
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of alchemy and potions on it.  While "
"versatile in use, the lack of attunement to any school prevents creation of "
"more advanced recipes."
msgstr "這顆魔法的小石子上有煉金術與藥劑的徽章。儘管有各種用途，但是它無法適應各學派導致他無法運用在大多數的高階製作中。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "owlbear egg"
msgid_plural "owlbear eggs"
msgstr[0] "鴞熊蛋"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "owlbear egg"
msgid ""
"This egg laid by an owlbear seems almost indistinguishable from a large rock "
"until you touch it and can feel the warm glow of potential life energy from "
"within.  It's hard to believe that an owlbear could grow so quickly from "
"something so small.  Perhaps you could carefully crack it open to get at the "
"liquid golden goodness inside."
msgstr ""
"這顆鴞熊蛋幾乎與大石頭沒有區別，直到你觸摸它並能從內部感受到潛在生命能量的溫暖光芒。人們很難相信鴞熊可以從如此小的東西中快速增長。也許你可以小心地打開它以獲"
"得裡面金色高質地的液體。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aenorhi egg"
msgid_plural "aenorhi eggs"
msgstr[0] "aenorhi eggs"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "aenorhi egg"
msgid "A large egg laid by an aenor.  You could feed a lot of people with this."
msgstr "A large egg laid by an aenor.  You could feed a lot of people with this."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "owlbear egg yolk"
msgid_plural "owlbear egg yolks"
msgstr[0] "鴞熊蛋黃"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "owlbear egg yolk"
msgid "The liquid innards of an owlbear egg.  Good eating."
msgstr "鴞熊蛋內的液體。好吃。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hairball"
msgid_plural "hairballs"
msgstr[0] "毛球"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "hairball"
msgid "A big, ugly ball of animal spit and licked-off hairs.  Don't swallow it."
msgstr "動物舔吐出來的巨大醜陋毛球。不要吞它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dragon meat"
msgid_plural "dragon meat"
msgstr[0] "龍肉"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "dragon meat"
msgid ""
"The meat from a slain dragon.  It does not seem to respond to cooking the "
"same way as other meat, making it obvious that it still retains some magical "
"properties."
msgstr "來自被殺死的龍的肉。無法用平常的烹飪方式處理它，顯然它依舊保有一些魔法特性。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scream mushroom"
msgid_plural "scream mushrooms"
msgstr[0] "尖叫蘑菇"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "scream mushroom"
msgid "The mushrooms harvested from a dead shrieker.  Could be used in potions."
msgstr "從死掉的尖叫蘑菇收穫而來的蘑菇。可以用來製作藥劑。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "purified meat"
msgid_plural "purified meat"
msgstr[0] "淨化過的肉"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "purified meat"
msgid ""
"Indistinguishable from pre-Cataclysm lab grown beef.  It should be excellent "
"but somehow it's just edible."
msgstr "和大灾变前实验室培育的牛肉没有区别。本来它应该是非常美味的，但不知为何只是勉强可以食用而已。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "impure meat"
msgid_plural "impure meat"
msgstr[0] "不純淨的肉"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "impure meat"
msgid ""
"Not as tainted as previously and tastes like the real thing.  You do not want "
"to cook this for your friends, though if you do they won't know the "
"difference for a while."
msgstr "虽然不像之前那样被感染，尝起来也和真肉一样。但你可不想用它来做东西给你的同伴吃，尽管这样做了他们也一时半会发现不出有什么区别。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "golem core"
msgid_plural "golem cores"
msgstr[0] "魔像核心"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#. ~ Description of "golem core"
msgid ""
"The \"heart\" of a golem.  Makes a soft humming noise when you hold it close "
"to your ear."
msgstr "一颗傀儡的\"心\"。当你把它靠近耳朵时，会听见它所发出的柔和的嗡嗡声。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpse.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken clay golem"
msgid_plural "broken clay golems"
msgstr[0] "損毀的黏土魔像"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpse.json
#. ~ Description of "broken clay golem"
msgid ""
"A broken clay golem, looking like a piece of post-modern art.  Could be "
"smashed for clay."
msgstr "一个损坏的黏土傀儡，看起来像一件后现代艺术品。打碎可以获得黏土。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpse.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken plastic golem"
msgid_plural "broken plastic golems"
msgstr[0] "損毀的塑膠魔像"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpse.json
#. ~ Description of "broken plastic golem"
msgid ""
"A broken plastic golem, like a giant action figure chewed up by an equally "
"giant puppy.  You could smash it up into recycled plastic bits."
msgstr "一个损坏的塑料傀儡，就像一个巨大的人偶被一只同样巨大的小狗咬碎了。打碎可以获得塑料。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpse.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken stone golem"
msgid_plural "broken stone golems"
msgstr[0] "損毀的石魔像"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpse.json
#. ~ Description of "broken stone golem"
msgid ""
"A broken stone golem, not that much different from a big boulder.  Could be "
"smashed for stone."
msgstr "一个损坏的石傀儡，看起来像一件后现代艺术品。打碎可以获得石头。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpse.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken iron golem"
msgid_plural "broken iron golems"
msgstr[0] "損毀的鐵魔像"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpse.json
#. ~ Description of "broken iron golem"
msgid ""
"A broken iron golem, with all iron you would possibly ever need.  Could be "
"smashed for iron."
msgstr "一个损坏的铁傀儡，看起来像一件后现代艺术品。打碎可以获得铁。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken forge born"
msgid_plural "broken forge born"
msgstr[0] "損毀的熔爐傀儡"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#. ~ Description of "broken forge born"
msgid ""
"A broken forge born, with all orichalcum you would possibly ever need.  Could "
"be smashed for orichalcum."
msgstr "一个损坏的炉裔傀儡，看起来像一件后现代艺术品。打碎可以获得山铜。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
#. ~ Description of "broken stone golem"
msgid ""
"A broken earthshaper's golem, almost the same as it's natural stone "
"counterpart.  Could be smashed for stone."
msgstr "一个破损的塑地者傀儡，几乎和天然的石头一样。可以砸碎得到石头。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lesser dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "lesser dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "次級次元袋"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "lesser dimensional bag"
msgid ""
"This is a bag that can contain more than it should.  The bag magically "
"reduces the weight of its contents and expands less than the amount of stuff "
"you put into it.  It takes a few words and hand-waving to take an item out."
msgstr "一个可以装下更多东西的袋子。这个袋子用魔法减轻了内部物品的重量，并且体积也比你放进的物品体积要小得多。只需说句话再挥手就能取出其中的任何物品。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "次元袋"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "greater dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "greater dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "高級次元袋"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "greater dimensional bag"
msgid ""
"This dimensional bag has reached the limits of human innovation with a "
"combination of manufacturing and magical secrets."
msgstr "这个维度袋是人类将制造和魔法秘密结合所能达到的创新极限。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "supergravity preservation box"
msgid_plural "supergravity preservation boxes"
msgstr[0] "超重力保鮮盒"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "supergravity preservation box"
msgid ""
"A box that uses gravity magic to preserve food.  It makes the box much "
"heavier, but anything in it lasts far longer and you can store more."
msgstr "一個使用重力魔法來保存食物的盒子。這讓盒子變得更重，但能裝更多東西且保存時間更長。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/currency.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "denarius"
msgid_plural "denarii"
msgstr[0] "第納里秘銀幣"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/currency.json
#. ~ Description of "denarius"
msgid ""
"Each of these mithril coins has a profile of Valzain, and strangely each of "
"these coins is defaced in some way."
msgstr "這些秘銀幣中的每一枚都刻著Valzain的頭像，奇怪的是，每一枚的頭像上都有著不同程度的污損。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/currency.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "denarius"
msgid "Further deface the coin"
msgstr "Further deface the coin"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/currency.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_REVEAL_ROUTE_TO_FORGE_OF_WONDERS" in
#. use action of item "denarius"
msgid ""
"You scratch your nails against the coin like so many before you, and feel "
"Valzain's tears.  He longingly cries for somewhere that is not here, and now "
"you know where."
msgstr ""
"You scratch your nails against the coin like so many before you, and feel "
"Valzain's tears.  He longingly cries for somewhere that is not here, and now "
"you know where."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/currency.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_REVEAL_ROUTE_TO_FORGE_OF_WONDERS" in use action of item "denarius"
msgid ""
"You rub the scratches on the coin, but leave no mark.  Oh, would-be "
"traveller, how can you wear upon his visage like the wagon wheels upon the "
"roads?"
msgstr "你擦拭钱币上的划痕，却未留一丝痕迹。啊，未来的旅人，你该如何在他面容上留下印记，如同车辙深深刻入道路？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "abstract wildwood doodad"
msgid_plural "abstract wildwood doodads"
msgstr[0] "abstract wildwood doodads"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "abstract wildwood doodad"
msgid "A generic wildwood doodad used"
msgstr "A generic wildwood doodad used"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wildwood Weaver"
msgid_plural "Wildwood Weavers"
msgstr[0] "Wildwood Weavers"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Name of material
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
msgid "Awakened Water"
msgstr "Awakened Water"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glowing awakened water"
msgid_plural "glowing awakened water"
msgstr[0] "glowing awakened water"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "glowing awakened water"
msgid "A nutrient-rich elixir for wildwood entities.  No longer fit for consumption."
msgstr "A nutrient-rich elixir for wildwood entities.  No longer fit for consumption."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sealed glowing gourd"
msgid_plural "sealed glowing gourd"
msgstr[0] "sealed glowing gourd"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "sealed glowing gourd"
msgid ""
"A gourd sealed with a druid's rune.  You may harvest the liquid inside when "
"it is done brewing."
msgstr ""
"A gourd sealed with a druid's rune.  You may harvest the liquid inside when "
"it is done brewing."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sealed glowing gourd"
msgid "The rune cracks as you open the gourd and collect the liquid."
msgstr "The rune cracks as you open the gourd and collect the liquid."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "sealed glowing gourd"
msgid "The liquid isn't done brewing yet."
msgstr "The liquid isn't done brewing yet."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "immature wildwood weaver"
msgid_plural "immature wildwood weavers"
msgstr[0] "immature wildwood weavers"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "immature wildwood weaver"
msgid ""
"This weaver is immature, it needs to be fed with awakened water to grow.  It "
"attentively observes its surroundings."
msgstr ""
"This weaver is immature, it needs to be fed with awakened water to grow.  It "
"attentively observes its surroundings."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "immature wildwood weaver"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s matures.  Another pair of legs sharpen into blades for cutting fabric. "
" It still has some room to grow."
msgstr ""
"The %s matures.  Another pair of legs sharpen into blades for cutting fabric. "
" It still has some room to grow."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "immature wildwood weaver"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "adult wildwood weaver"
msgid "The weaver does not have enough liquid."
msgstr "The weaver does not have enough liquid."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "immature wildwood weaver"
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "adult wildwood weaver"
msgid "The weaver isn't done growing yet."
msgstr "The weaver isn't done growing yet."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "adult wildwood weaver"
msgid_plural "adult wildwood weavers"
msgstr[0] "adult wildwood weavers"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "adult wildwood weaver"
msgid "This weaver is fully grown.  There's no light behind its eyes, yet."
msgstr "This weaver is fully grown.  There's no light behind its eyes, yet."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "adult wildwood weaver"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s awakens.  It gazes at you with its many eyes, ready to serve you."
msgstr "The %s awakens.  It gazes at you with its many eyes, ready to serve you."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "awoken wildwood weaver"
msgid_plural "awoken wildwood weavers"
msgstr[0] "awoken wildwood weavers"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "awoken wildwood weaver"
msgid ""
"You never thought you'd see the day when a wildwood entity would be so "
"playful and docile.  This weaver is ready to serve you, and can be used to "
"repair clothing or create a shelter."
msgstr ""
"You never thought you'd see the day when a wildwood entity would be so "
"playful and docile.  This weaver is ready to serve you, and can be used to "
"repair clothing or create a shelter."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small damaged weaver"
msgid_plural "small damaged weavers"
msgstr[0] "small damaged weavers"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "small damaged weaver"
msgid ""
"A tiny broken weaver.  Its legs bent and broken, it can no longer be used to "
"repair clothing or create a shelter."
msgstr ""
"A tiny broken weaver.  Its legs bent and broken, it can no longer be used to "
"repair clothing or create a shelter."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small wildwood stag beetle ball"
msgid_plural "small wildwood stag beetle balls"
msgstr[0] "small wildwood stag beetle balls"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "small wildwood stag beetle ball"
msgid ""
"A small ball made of wildwood.  A narrative relief of a stag beetle dancing "
"wraps the ball.  A soft chittering noise can be heard from it."
msgstr ""
"A small ball made of wildwood.  A narrative relief of a stag beetle dancing "
"wraps the ball.  A soft chittering noise can be heard from it."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "small wildwood stag beetle ball"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s surges in size.  It shudders and rolls around as the relief begins to "
"move on its own."
msgstr ""
"The %s surges in size.  It shudders and rolls around as the relief begins to "
"move on its own."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "small wildwood stag beetle
#. ball"
msgid "The beetle does not have enough liquid to grow."
msgstr "The beetle does not have enough liquid to grow."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "small wildwood stag beetle ball"
msgid "The beetle isn't done growing yet."
msgstr "The beetle isn't done growing yet."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wildwood stag beetle ball"
msgid_plural "wildwood stag beetle balls"
msgstr[0] "wildwood stag beetle balls"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "wildwood stag beetle ball"
msgid ""
"A large ball made of wildwood.  A narrative relief of a dancing stag beetle "
"wraps the ball.  A soft chittering noise can be heard from it as the relief "
"flows across the surface."
msgstr ""
"A large ball made of wildwood.  A narrative relief of a dancing stag beetle "
"wraps the ball.  A soft chittering noise can be heard from it as the relief "
"flows across the surface."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wildwood rune"
msgid_plural "wildwood runes"
msgstr[0] "wildwood runes"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/druid_items.json
#. ~ Description of "wildwood rune"
msgid ""
"A small druid rune wrapped in a leaf.  It appears to be made of some kind of "
"resin, and is very sticky."
msgstr ""
"A small druid rune wrapped in a leaf.  It appears to be made of some kind of "
"resin, and is very sticky."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "belt of strength +2"
msgid_plural "belts of strength +2"
msgstr[0] "力量腰帶 +2"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "belt of haste"
msgid_plural "belts of haste"
msgstr[0] "加速腰帶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "minor staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "minor staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "初級法師長杖"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "minor staff of the magi"
msgid ""
"A simple carved staff, made of wood.  It faintly glows with magic when you "
"cast spells.  Wielding it slightly increases your mana regeneration"
msgstr "雕工简陋的长杖，由木头制成。当你施法时，它会散发出魔幻的光芒。手持时稍微增加魔力回复。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lesser staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "lesser staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "次級法師長杖"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "lesser staff of the magi"
msgid ""
"A beautifully carved staff, made of enchanted wood.  It faintly glows with "
"magic when you cast spells, but it is not a sturdy melee weapon.  Wielding it "
"increases your mana regeneration."
msgstr "雕工精美的长杖，由附魔木制成。当你施法时，它会散发出魔幻的光芒，但它不是坚固的近身武器。手持时增加魔力回复。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "greater staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "greater staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "高級法師長杖"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "greater staff of the magi"
msgid ""
"A beautifully carved staff, made of enchanted wood and mithril.  It faintly "
"glows with magic when you cast spells, but it is not a sturdy melee weapon.  "
"Wielding it greatly increases your mana regeneration."
msgstr "雕工精美的长杖，由附魔木和秘银制成。当你施法时，它会散发出魔幻的光芒，但它不是坚固的近身武器。手持时大大增加魔力回复。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sinister minor staff of bleeding"
msgid_plural "sinister minor staves of bleeding"
msgstr[0] "邪恶引血长杖"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "sinister minor staff of bleeding"
msgid ""
"A sinister looking staff, made of wood and with a red orb of crystallized "
"mana at the handle.  The orb and its rune faintly glow with magic when you "
"cast spells.  Wielding it slightly increases your mana regeneration and "
"allows you to cast the bleed spell."
msgstr ""
"一根看起来很邪恶的长杖，由木头制成，杖头上有个红色魔力结晶球。当你施放法术时，球体和它的符文会发出微弱的魔法光芒。手持它会略微增加你的魔力回复，并让你能够施"
"放引血术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "wizard hat"
msgid ""
"A blue pointed hat with stars stitched into it.  Wearing it increases your "
"maximum mana."
msgstr "一顶镶有许多星星的蓝色尖顶帽。戴着它可以增加你的最大魔力值。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fireball hammer"
msgid_plural "fireball hammers"
msgstr[0] "火球錘"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "fireball hammer"
msgid "Use with caution!  Flammable!  Explosive!"
msgstr "請謹慎使用！易燃！爆炸！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cloak of Morthylla the Lamia"
msgid_plural "Cloaks of Morthylla the Lamia"
msgstr[0] "茉希拉女妖之袍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "Cloak of Morthylla the Lamia"
msgid ""
"This cloak seems to absorb light except for the pinpricks of stars that move "
"across its surface."
msgstr "这件长袍似乎能吸收光线，它的表面有无数繁星般的光点在其中移动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Bag of Infinite Throwing Knives"
msgid_plural "Bags of Infinite Throwing Knives"
msgstr[0] "無盡飛刀袋"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "Bag of Infinite Throwing Knives"
msgid ""
"This bag conjures a magical throwing knife on activation.  Only refills when "
"worn.  It also boosts your throwing abilities."
msgstr "这个袋子激活后会变出一把魔法飞刀。仅在穿着能重新充填。它同时也会增强你的投掷技能。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of wolfshead cufflinks"
msgid_plural "pairs of wolfshead cufflinks"
msgstr[0] "狼頭袖扣"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of wolfshead cufflinks"
msgid ""
"A pair of silver cufflinks with a wolf's head engraved into them.  Each "
"cufflink has a bright ruby eye and pearl teeth.  They appear to be growling.  "
"There is an inscription, 'When the moon shines.  I become alive.'"
msgstr "一对纯银袖扣，上面雕刻着狼头。每个袖扣上的狼头都有着明亮的红宝石眼珠和珍珠制成的牙齿。它们看上去仿佛在嚎叫。上面有一行铭文：\"明月当空，我将复生。\""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Belt of Haste"
msgid_plural "Belts of Haste"
msgstr[0] "加速腰带"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Megingjörð"
msgid_plural "Megingjörð"
msgstr[0] "雷神索爾的腰帶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Description of "Megingjörð"
msgid ""
"The mythical belt of Thor, god of thunder.  Or at least so it appears.  It "
"doubles the wearer's base strength."
msgstr "传说中雷神索尔的神奇腰带，至少看起来是这样的。它能使佩戴者的基础力量加倍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lesser dimensional toolbelt"
msgid_plural "lesser dimensional toolbelts"
msgstr[0] "次級次元工具腰帶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Description of "lesser dimensional toolbelt"
msgid ""
"A sturdy workman's belt that fits around your waist, covered in easy to "
"access pouches.  Like all dimensional spaces, they hold more than they should "
"with a fair weight reduction."
msgstr "一条结实合身的工具腰带，上面套着许多方便取用的袋子。像所有的维度空间一样，放入的物品重量会减轻。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "greater dimensional toolbelt"
msgid_plural "greater dimensional toolbelts"
msgstr[0] "高級次元工具腰帶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Description of "greater dimensional toolbelt"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty workman's belt that fits around your waist, covered in easy to "
"access pouches.  Like all dimensional spaces, they hold far more than they "
"should with a substantial weight reduction."
msgstr "一条特别结实合身的工具腰带，上面套着许多方便取用的袋子。像所有的维度空间一样，放入的物品重量会大大减轻。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Belt of Weaponry"
msgid_plural "Belts of Weaponry"
msgstr[0] "武器庫腰帶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Description of "Belt of Weaponry"
msgid ""
"A wide girdle that fits around your waist, you can sheath or holster any "
"weapon into it in the blink of an eye, and it seemingly stores them somewhere "
"else."
msgstr "合身地環繞在你腰部的寬腰帶，你可以在眨眼間將任何武器放入其中，而它似乎將武器儲存在其他地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "technomancer's toolbelt"
msgid_plural "technomancer's toolbelts"
msgstr[0] "科技巫師的工具腰帶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Description of "technomancer's toolbelt"
msgid ""
"A custom-built leather utility belt that instantly creates any tool that you "
"reach for.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "一條自製工具皮帶，設計成可以讓你的手快速拿取上面的工具。使用它來收入/取出一把武器。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Belt of The Iron Whip"
msgid_plural "Belts of the Iron Whip"
msgstr[0] "鐵鞭腰帶"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Description of "Belt of The Iron Whip"
msgid ""
"A braided but flexible belt seemingly made of metal.  You can activate it to "
"transform it into a whip and flay your enemies."
msgstr "一根看上去似由金属编织而成但又十分灵活的皮带。你可以激活它，把它变成鞭子，然后切碎你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Belt of The Iron Whip"
msgid "You grab the belt and it uncoils to become a flexible metal whip in your hand!"
msgstr "你抓起腰带，它瞬间在你手中舒展开，变成一根灵活的铁鞭子！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Iron Whip"
msgid_plural "Iron Whips"
msgstr[0] "鐵鞭"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ Description of "The Iron Whip"
msgid ""
"A long braided flexible steel bullwhip that narrows into a sharp blade at the "
"end.  Easily capable of slicing and dicing anything that comes at you.  It "
"transforms back into a belt."
msgstr "一条编织而成、柔软灵活的钢铁长鞭，末端变成锋利的刀刃。能够轻易切割任何向你袭来的物品。使用它能够将其变回皮带。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "The Iron Whip"
msgid ""
"You loop the whip in your hand and it coils back into a belt form in an "
"instant."
msgstr "你把鞭子在手中缠绕，使其在瞬间卷曲回皮带形状。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "seven league boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of seven league boots"
msgstr[0] "七里靴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Description of "seven league boots"
#. ~ Description of "boots of haste"
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of worn leather and "
"steel, they look like they've seen a lot of use and will likely see a lot "
"more.  They make your movement a lot less work."
msgstr "一双十分坚固却又非常舒适合身的旧钢头皮靴，看上去已经用了很久，而且能继续用上更久。穿上它让你移动变得轻松了不少。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boots of haste"
msgid_plural "pairs of boots of haste"
msgstr[0] "加速靴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "escape boots"
msgid_plural "escape boots"
msgstr[0] "遁逃靴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Description of "escape boots"
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of worn leather and "
"steel, these boots can be activated once a day to escape from nasty "
"situations, teleporting you a good distance in a random direction."
msgstr "即使表面破舊，但是磨損的皮革跟鋼鐵卻非常舒適且合腳。這靴子每天能啟動一次來逃離惡劣的環境，能將你傳送到隨機方向的很長距離處。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "freerunner's boots"
msgid_plural "freerunner's boots"
msgstr[0] "自由跑者鞋"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Description of "freerunner's boots"
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of worn leather and "
"steel, seeming a bit more flexible and breathable than typical for their "
"materials.  The enchantment they bear helps guide their wearer in their "
"motions, to make movement around and over obstacles much more fluid and "
"efficient."
msgstr "一双十分坚固却又非常舒适合身的旧钢头皮靴，使用的材料看起来比一般皮靴更柔软透气。靴子所携带的魔法能引导穿戴者移动，使其在通过障碍物时更加迅捷流畅。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boots of grounding"
msgid_plural "pairs of boots of grounding"
msgstr[0] "接地鞋"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Description of "boots of grounding"
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of leather with small "
"engraved runes seemingly filled with rubber.  When worn, you are immune to "
"damage from electricity."
msgstr "一双十分坚固却又非常舒适合身的旧皮靴，上面雕刻着些似乎充满了橡胶的小型符文。穿上它能让你免疫电击。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of boots of elvenkind"
msgid_plural "pairs of boots of elvenkind"
msgstr[0] "pairs of boots of elvenkind"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of boots of elvenkind"
msgid ""
"One of the traditional items of the ancient elven warrior societies, these "
"soft leather boots are worked with silver inlays in the shape of vines and "
"leaves.  They allow the wearer to walk in complete silence and move faster "
"when in the wilderness."
msgstr ""
"One of the traditional items of the ancient elven warrior societies, these "
"soft leather boots are worked with silver inlays in the shape of vines and "
"leaves.  They allow the wearer to walk in complete silence and move faster "
"when in the wilderness."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "missile volley bracelet"
msgid_plural "missile volley bracelets"
msgstr[0] "魔法箭雨手镯"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Description of "missile volley bracelet"
msgid ""
"A bracelet, completely covered with a large amount of runes from both sides.  "
"Wizards love to name it \"Ultima Ratio\", describing its colossal might.  "
"Require almost a whole week to restore its charge."
msgstr "一个手镯，内外均完全覆盖着大量魔法符文。魔法师们喜欢称之为\"终极比率\"，用来形容其巨大的威力。恢复充能需要将近一周的时间。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "petrification bracelet"
msgid_plural "petrification bracelets"
msgstr[0] "石化術手鐲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Description of "petrification bracelet"
msgid ""
"A bracelet, completely covered with a large amount of runes from both sides.  "
"You don't really know how it works, but after use enemies literally freeze in "
"the middle of their movement.  Require almost 7 days to restore its charge."
msgstr "一个手镯，内外均完全覆盖着大量魔法符文。你真的不知道它是如何工作的，但使用后敌人还在移动过程中就已经被石化冻结。恢复充能需要将近一周的时间。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disorientation bracelet"
msgid_plural "disorientation bracelets"
msgstr[0] "迷惑術手鐲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Description of "disorientation bracelet"
msgid ""
"Known as \"a worse version of petrification bracelet\", this tool casts a "
"spell that temporarily breaks the whole movement system of a creature, "
"disabling its movement for a short time.  Require almost a week to restore "
"its charge."
msgstr "又被称为\"石化术手镯的更糟糕版本\"，这件法器所施放的法术会暂时打断生物的整个移动系统，使其在短时间内无法移动。恢复充能需要将近一周的时间。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "propulsion bracelet"
msgid_plural "propulsion bracelets"
msgstr[0] "推進術手鐲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Description of "propulsion bracelet"
msgid ""
"It feels like the world around you just stops.  That's not true, that's just "
"a combination of really fast speed and some mana tricks you can't understand. "
" Requires a whole week to restore its charge."
msgstr "感觉像是你周围的世界停下了。当然，不是真的停下了，它只是极快的速度和一些你理解不了的魔力技巧的结合。需要一个星期来充能。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inert mana-leech shackle"
msgid_plural "inert mana-leech shackles"
msgstr[0] "未激活的吸魔镣铐"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Description of "inert mana-leech shackle"
msgid ""
"A platinum bracelet covered in runes.  If it was active, it would keep its "
"wearer from casting spells.  Now it's just another useless trinket as you do "
"not know the spells it requires to be activated again."
msgstr ""
"A platinum bracelet covered in runes.  If it was active, it would keep its "
"wearer from casting spells.  Now it's just another useless trinket as you do "
"not know the spells it requires to be activated again."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mana-leech shackle"
msgid_plural "mana-leech shackles"
msgstr[0] "吸魔镣铐"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
#. ~ Description of "mana-leech shackle"
msgid ""
"A platinum bracelet covered in runes.  It cannot be removed without the "
"appropriate spell and it constantly drains the wearer's mana, preventing them "
"from casting any spell until they get rid of it."
msgstr ""
"A platinum bracelet covered in runes.  It cannot be removed without the "
"appropriate spell and it constantly drains the wearer's mana, preventing them "
"from casting any spell until they get rid of it."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of steel bracers"
msgid_plural "pairs of steel bracers"
msgstr[0] "一對鋼護腕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of steel bracers"
msgid "A full assembly of medieval arm protection."
msgstr "一副完整的中世紀手臂保護裝置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steel bracer"
msgid_plural "steel bracers"
msgstr[0] "鋼護腕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bracer of lesser defense"
msgid_plural "bracers of lesser defense"
msgstr[0] "次級防護護腕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Description of "bracer of lesser defense"
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate shield engraved on "
"the top, silver accentuates the intricate design.  It protects your body with "
"a light aura to reduce damage you take."
msgstr "輕巧但堅固的鋼製護腕，頂部刻有華麗的盾牌，銀色凸顯出精緻的設計。它具有輕微的靈氣保護你的身體，能減少受到的傷害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bracer of greater defense"
msgid_plural "bracers of greater defense"
msgstr[0] "高級防護護腕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Description of "bracer of greater defense"
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate shield engraved on "
"the top, gold accentuates the intricate design.  It protects your body with a "
"strong aura to reduce damage you take."
msgstr "輕巧但堅固的鋼製護腕，頂部刻有華麗的盾牌，金色凸顯出精緻的設計。它具有強大的靈氣保護你的身體，能減少受到的傷害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lesser bracer of lightning"
msgid_plural "lesser bracers of lightning"
msgstr[0] "次級閃電護腕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Description of "lesser bracer of lightning"
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate bundle of lightning "
"bolts engraved on the top, silver accentuates the intricate design.  It "
"protects your body with a light aura to reduce electrical damage you take, as "
"well as being able to release a Jolt spell 3 times a day."
msgstr "輕巧但堅固的鋼製護腕，頂部刻有華麗的閃電束，銀色凸顯出精緻的設計。它具有輕微的靈氣保護你的身體，能減少遭受的電擊傷害，並且每天可以施放 3 次猛擊術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "greater bracer of lightning"
msgid_plural "greater bracers of lightning"
msgstr[0] "高級閃電護腕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Description of "greater bracer of lightning"
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate bundle of lightning "
"bolts engraved on the top, gold accentuates the intricate design.  It "
"protects your body with a strong aura to reduce electrical damage you take, "
"as well as being able to release a Lightning Bolt spell 3 times a day."
msgstr "輕巧但堅固的鋼製護腕，頂部刻有華麗的閃電束，銀色凸顯出精緻的設計。它具有輕微的靈氣保護你的身體，能減少遭受的電擊傷害，並且每天可以施放 3 次閃電之箭。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of bracers of archery"
msgid_plural "pairs of bracers of archery"
msgstr[0] "弓箭护腕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of bracers of archery"
msgid ""
"A set of leather bracers worked with images of arrows in flight and scenes of "
"hunting parties.  Bows you wield will be more accurate and do more damage "
"while you wear these, and you can shoot your arrows farther as well."
msgstr ""
"A set of leather bracers worked with images of arrows in flight and scenes of "
"hunting parties.  Bows you wield will be more accurate and do more damage "
"while you wear these, and you can shoot your arrows farther as well."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bracers of the blinding strike"
msgid_plural "bracers of the blinding strike"
msgstr[0] "残影打击护腕"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
#. ~ Description of "bracers of the blinding strike"
msgid ""
"A pair of light leather bracers with inlays of mithril looking like vines "
"with tiny, leaf-shaped leaves branching off of the vines.  It slightly "
"increases your attack speed at all times, and you may activate it to greatly "
"increase your attack speed for a short time."
msgstr "一对轻皮护腕，表面镶嵌着秘银打造的藤蔓纹路，纤细的枝桠上延伸出无数叶形小叶片。它会小幅提升你的攻击速度；激活后，可在短时间内大幅提升攻击速度。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wildshape Cloak: Fish"
msgid_plural "Wildshape Cloaks: Fish"
msgstr[0] "變形披風（魚）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
#. ~ Description of "Wildshape Cloak: Fish"
msgid ""
"A magical cloak that shimmers like fresh water under a warm sun.  It can be "
"worn to morph your body to a form that is excellent for swimming, but "
"ill-suited for combat.  You should probably stand in water before you put it "
"on."
msgstr ""
"A magical cloak that shimmers like fresh water under a warm sun.  It can be "
"worn to morph your body to a form that is excellent for swimming, but "
"ill-suited for combat.  You should probably stand in water before you put it "
"on."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wildshape Cloak: Bear"
msgid_plural "Wildshape Cloak: Bears"
msgstr[0] "變形披風（熊）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
#. ~ Description of "Wildshape Cloak: Bear"
msgid ""
"A magical cloak that smells of the forest.  It can be worn to morph your body "
"to a form that is strong and resilient in melee combat.  However, you feel as "
"if you would lose a part of yourself."
msgstr "一件魔法披风，闻起来仿佛有股森林的气息。穿上它可以使你的身体变形成强壮且能快速回复的熊形态。然而，你的直觉告诉你肯定会失去自己的部分能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wildshape Cloak: Deer"
msgid_plural "Wildshape Cloak: Deers"
msgstr[0] "變形披風（鹿）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
#. ~ Description of "Wildshape Cloak: Deer"
msgid ""
"A magical cloak that feels soft to the touch.  It can be worn to morph your "
"body to a form well-suited to escaping difficult situations.  However, it is "
"not suited for combat."
msgstr "一件魔法披风，摸上去异常的柔软。穿上它可以使你的身体变形成能轻松逃离任何不利环境的鹿形态。然而，这并不适合用来战斗。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cloak of elvenkind"
msgid_plural "cloaks of elvenkind"
msgstr[0] "cloaks of elvenkind"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
#. ~ Description of "cloak of elvenkind"
msgid ""
"One of the traditional items of the ancient elven warrior societies, this "
"cloth cloak woven with still-living leaves makes its wearer much harder to "
"spot in forests or dense vegetation.  Infamous for their use during the "
"Vietnam War by elves on both sides of the conflict."
msgstr ""
"One of the traditional items of the ancient elven warrior societies, this "
"cloth cloak woven with still-living leaves makes its wearer much harder to "
"spot in forests or dense vegetation.  Infamous for their use during the "
"Vietnam War by elves on both sides of the conflict."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "enchanted parabolan wool blouse"
msgid_plural "enchanted parabolan wool blouse"
msgstr[0] "附魔派瑞伯倫羊毛上衣"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "enchanted parabolan wool blouse"
msgid ""
"A loose silvery iridescent blouse in a style most often associated with "
"pirates and renfaires.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of parabolan "
"wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not.  This "
"particular one has piratical flairs and glitters with enchantment."
msgstr ""
"一件银光闪闪色彩斑斓的宽松上衣，通常与海盗和文艺复兴节联系在一起。当你看着它时，它会闪闪发光。由群勃龙毛纱制成，它有时隐约地映射出在这里事物，有时则不是。这"
"件上有个特别的海盗的标志，闪烁着迷人的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "enchanted parabolan wool breeches"
msgid_plural "enchanted parabolan wool breeches"
msgstr[0] "附魔派瑞伯倫褲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "enchanted parabolan wool breeches"
msgid ""
"A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of silvery iridescent material. "
" Comfortable, but lacks pockets.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of "
"parabolan wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not.  "
"This particular one has piratical flairs and glitters with enchantment."
msgstr ""
"一条制作精良样式古典的宽松马裤，由银光闪闪色彩斑斓的毛纱制成。舒适，但没有口袋。当你看着它时，它会闪闪发光。由群勃龙毛纱制成，它有时隐约地映射出在这里事物，"
"有时则不是。这件上有个特别的海盗的标志，闪烁着迷人的光芒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "parabolan wool blouse"
msgid_plural "parabolan wool blouses"
msgstr[0] "派瑞伯倫羊毛上衣"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "parabolan wool blouse"
msgid ""
"A loose silvery iridescent blouse in a style most often associated with "
"pirates and renfaires.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of parabolan "
"wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not."
msgstr "一件色彩斑斓的宽松上衣，通常与海盗和文艺复兴节联系在一起。当你看着它时，它会闪闪发光。由群勃龙毛纱制成，它有时隐约地映射出在这里事物，有时则不是。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "parabolan wool breeches"
msgid_plural "parabolan wool breeches"
msgstr[0] "派瑞伯倫羊毛褲"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "parabolan wool breeches"
msgid ""
"A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of silvery iridescent material. "
" Comfortable, but lacks pockets.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of "
"parabolan wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not."
msgstr ""
"一条制作精良样式古典的宽松马裤，由色彩斑斓的毛纱制成。舒适，但没有口袋。当你看着它时，它会闪闪发光。由群勃龙毛纱制成，它有时隐约地映射出在这里事物，有时则不"
"是。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "parabolan wool gambeson"
msgid_plural "parabolan wool gambesons"
msgstr[0] "群勃龙绗缝软铠"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "parabolan wool gambeson"
msgid ""
"A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting rarely available iridescent wool "
"that was intended as standalone armor, this is half the thickness of a "
"historical gambeson due to the quality of its material.  Famed for its "
"resistance to arrows in olden times, one might wonder how effective it might "
"be against modern projectiles."
msgstr ""
"A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting rarely available iridescent wool "
"that was intended as standalone armor, this is half the thickness of a "
"historical gambeson due to the quality of its material.  Famed for its "
"resistance to arrows in olden times, one might wonder how effective it might "
"be against modern projectiles."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thin-sleeved parabolan wool gambeson"
msgid_plural "thin-sleeved parabolan wool gambesons"
msgstr[0] "薄袖群勃龙绗缝软铠"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "thin-sleeved parabolan wool gambeson"
msgid ""
"A thick iridescent wool greatcoat famed for its resistance to arrows in olden "
"times.  Compared to conventional wool, this is much lighter and less warm.  "
"The sleeves are a lot thinner for flexibility and it drapes below your legs, "
"providing additional protection there."
msgstr ""
"A thick iridescent wool greatcoat famed for its resistance to arrows in olden "
"times.  Compared to conventional wool, this is much lighter and less warm.  "
"The sleeves are a lot thinner for flexibility and it drapes below your legs, "
"providing additional protection there."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless parabolan wool gambeson"
msgid_plural "sleeveless parabolan wool gambesons"
msgstr[0] "无袖群勃龙绗缝软铠"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless parabolan wool gambeson"
msgid ""
"A thick iridescent wool surcoat famed for its resistance to arrows in the "
"olden times.  Compared to conventional wool, this is much lighter and less "
"warm.  It drapes below your legs, providing additional protection there, and "
"it lacks sleeves entirely."
msgstr ""
"A thick iridescent wool surcoat famed for its resistance to arrows in the "
"olden times.  Compared to conventional wool, this is much lighter and less "
"warm.  It drapes below your legs, providing additional protection there, and "
"it lacks sleeves entirely."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "parabolan wool heavy arming pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of parabolan wool heavy arming pants"
msgstr[0] "pairs of parabolan wool heavy arming pants"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "parabolan wool heavy arming pants"
msgid ""
"Tough, fairly thick iridescent wool pants worn on their own alongside a "
"gambeson.  These are made of layered wool quilting offering very solid "
"protection, specifically for the purposes of stopping arrows."
msgstr ""
"Tough, fairly thick iridescent wool pants worn on their own alongside a "
"gambeson.  These are made of layered wool quilting offering very solid "
"protection, specifically for the purposes of stopping arrows."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "parabolan wool arming mittens"
msgid_plural "pairs of parabolan wool arming mittens"
msgstr[0] "pairs of parabolan wool arming mittens"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "parabolan wool arming mittens"
msgid ""
"Thick iridescent wool gauntlets worn in lieu of metal or leather armor.  "
"These are much less encumbering and warm than conventional wool, but they "
"offer excellent protection against arrows."
msgstr ""
"Thick iridescent wool gauntlets worn in lieu of metal or leather armor.  "
"These are much less encumbering and warm than conventional wool, but they "
"offer excellent protection against arrows."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "enchanted lab coat"
msgid_plural "enchanted lab coat"
msgstr[0] "附魔实验室外套"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "enchanted lab coat"
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets, with a pentagram on the lapel "
"and a few orichalcum threads sewn into the seams.  Perfect for the "
"stylish-but-effective academic mage."
msgstr "一件白色长外套，有几个大口袋，翻领上有一个五角星，接缝处缝着几根山铜线。非常适合时尚但有效的学院派法师。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "enspelled lab coat"
msgid_plural "enspelled lab coat"
msgstr[0] "施术的实验室外套"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "enspelled lab coat"
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets, with a pentagram on the lapel "
"and orichalcum and mithril threads sewn into the seams.  A director of "
"thaumaturgical research would have worn this or something like this before "
"the Cataclysm."
msgstr "一件白色长外套，有几个大口袋，翻领上有五角星，接缝处缝有山铜和秘银线。在大灾难之前，一位风湿病研究主任会穿这个或类似的衣服。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "'Silent Winds' suppressor"
msgid_plural "'Silent Winds' suppressors"
msgstr[0] "\"Silent Winds\"滅音器"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "'Silent Winds' suppressor"
#. ~ Description of "'Silent Winds' suppressor"
msgid ""
"Rather than using purely wipe media, an additional localized silence spell in "
"this tube quiets gunshots going through to hearing-safe levels."
msgstr "除了消音材料之外，这个消音器还含有一个小范围静音法术，能够把枪声降低到对听力安全的水平。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "mana laser sight (rail)"
msgid_plural "mana laser sights (rail)"
msgstr[0] "魔法雷射瞄準器（槍管上）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "mana laser sight (rail)"
#. ~ Description of "mana laser sight (rail)"
msgid ""
"A small visible-light laser using light shown through a mana crystal that "
"mounts on a firearm's accessory rail to enhance ease and speed of target "
"acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, there are no drawbacks.  You can "
"rotate the attachment rail to fit under the barrel."
msgstr "小型可见激光发射器，使用魔力水晶发射激光，可安装在枪械上，增加命中率与瞄准速度。完全没有缺点——除了增加一点点重量。你可以旋转附挂导轨将其变成管下瞄具。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "mana laser sight (rail)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "mana laser sight (underbarrel)"
msgid "You rotate the laser sight."
msgstr "You rotate the laser sight."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "mana laser sight (underbarrel)"
msgid_plural "mana laser sights (underbarrel)"
msgstr[0] "魔法雷射瞄準器（槍管下）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "mana laser sight (underbarrel)"
#. ~ Description of "mana laser sight (underbarrel)"
msgid ""
"A small visible-light laser using light shown through a mana crystal that "
"mounts on a firearm's accessory rail to enhance ease and speed of target "
"acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, there are no drawbacks.  You can "
"rotate the attachment rail to fit on the rail."
msgstr "小型可见激光发射器，使用魔力水晶发射激光，可安装在枪械上，增加命中率与瞄准速度。完全没有缺点——除了增加一点点重量。你可以旋转导轨将其变成导轨瞄具。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "mana dot sight"
msgid_plural "mana dot sights"
msgstr[0] "魔法紅點瞄準鏡"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "mana dot sight"
#. ~ Description of "mana dot sight"
msgid ""
"Adds a blue dot optic made from crystallized mana to the top of your gun, "
"replacing the iron sights.  Increases accuracy and weight."
msgstr "在你的枪上安装一个使用魔力结晶发光的蓝点瞄具以取代机械瞄准具。提高命中率，增加重量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mask of disappearance"
msgid_plural "masks of disappearance"
msgstr[0] "消逝面具"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "mask of disappearance"
msgid ""
"A mask with no facial features at all, just eye and mouth holes, upon "
"activation it makes everything ignore your presence for a while."
msgstr "完全沒有面部特徵，只有眼孔和嘴孔的面具，當啟動時，它會使所有東西在一段時間內忽視你的存在。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mask of perfect vision"
msgid_plural "masks of perfect vision"
msgstr[0] "完美視覺面具"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "mask of perfect vision"
msgid ""
"A decidedly steampunk-looking half mask that covers the eye area of the face, "
"it has large lenses that correct and greatly enhance the vision of the wearer."
msgstr "這款看起來像蒸汽龐克的半面罩覆蓋了臉部的眼睛區域，它具有可矯正並大大增強佩戴者視力的大鏡片。"

