#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Journeyman Enchanter's Primer"
#. ~ Description of "The Paladin's Guide to Modern Spellcasting"
msgid ""
"Despite the title, this seems to be written in Middle English.  A little "
"obtuse, but you can make out most of the words well enough."
msgstr "雖說書名這麼寫，但是內容卻是用中古世紀的英文寫成的。雖然有點難讀懂，但你還是能搞懂大部分的字詞。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/recipe_books.json
