#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Summon Undead"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Summon Undead"
msgstr[0] "召唤不死人卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/migration_and_obsoletion/items.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Undead"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Zombie"
msgid ""
"An ethereal-looking zombie rises from the depths of the earth to fight for "
"you.  You may be able to summon more with a higher level in this spell."
msgstr "一個看起來不凡的殭屍從地底下復甦準備好為你而戰。提升法術等級可使你招喚更多殭屍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Rupture"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Rupture"
msgstr[0] "魔爆术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Rupture"
msgid ""
"You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular "
"break-down, internal hemorrhaging, leylines to become muddled, and "
"electronics to overcharge.  Immensely gruesome, crude, and was once illegal "
"world-wide, not that it matters now."
msgstr "你将魔力注入一个不情愿且毫无准备的目标体内，导致细胞破裂、内部出血、魔脉混乱以及电子设备过载。极其可怕粗暴，曾经被全球禁用，但现在已经不重要了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Devour"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Devour"
msgstr[0] "吞噬卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
