#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Undead Swarm"
msgid ""
"A few decrepit looking animals rises from the depths of the earth to fight "
"for you.  You may be able to summon better with a higher level in this spell."
msgstr "几只看起来很衰弱的动物从地底深处爬出来为你战斗。 如果这个咒语的等级更高，你也许能召唤出更好的动物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
