"Kill an ally creature, converting its life energy into compact rune, that you "
"can use afterwards."
msgstr "杀死一个友方生物，将它的生命能量转化为易于携带、方便使用的符文。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
