msgid "Scroll of Knit the Rent Flesh"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Knit the Rent Flesh"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Knit the Rent Flesh"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Knit the Rent Flesh"
msgid "Cause the target's wounds to pull themselves together."
msgstr "Cause the target's wounds to pull themselves together."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
