msgstr[0] "召喚狼群卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Wolf"
msgid "Call to the wild for aid from some wolves."
msgstr "向荒野尋求狼群的幫助。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Cause Rot"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Cause Rot"
msgstr[0] "腐化術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Cause Rot"
msgid ""
"A spell from a darker sect of druidry, created to forcibly begin the circle "
"of life anew.  For without rot, you cannot have growth.  Affects a huge area, "
"but is indiscriminate and slow both in casting and effect.  Once lost "
"entirely to the passage of time, this spell was thought to be no more than a "
"myth, the stuff of fairy tales, albeit grim ones."
msgstr ""
"来自德鲁伊黑暗教派的法术，用来强行重启生命循环。因为没有腐化，就无法生长。影响范围很大，且不分敌我；即便是机器也会生锈化为尘土，施法及起效速度都很慢。曾经完"
"全失传在时间的流逝中，这个法术被认为只不过是神话传说，是童话故事的素材，虽然是黑暗童话。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Restoration"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Restoration"
msgstr[0] "恢复卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Restoration"
msgid "Directed magical energy that slowly heals your body from wounds."
msgstr "被引导的魔法能量，可以慢慢治愈你的身体创伤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
