msgid "Uses magic energy from herbs to heal your wounds."
msgstr "使用来自草药的魔法能量治愈你的伤口。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Vegetative Poultice"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Vegetative Poultice"
msgstr[0] "植物药膏卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Vegetative Poultice"
msgid "Turns a bunch of leaves and bark into an effective bandage."
msgstr "将一些树叶和树皮做成强大的绷带。"

