#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Petrifying Touch"
msgid ""
"Your hands tries to transform the body of your enemy into a pure stone.  The "
"effect is temporary, but it can deal significant damage."
msgstr "你的双手会试图将敌人的身体变成一块纯粹的石头。效果是暂时的，但可以造成巨大伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Reactive Armor"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Reactive Armor"
msgstr[0] "反应装甲卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Impalement"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Impalement"
msgstr[0] "穿刺卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
