"You cover your body with a layer of razor sharp crystals.  Monster that "
"attack you will take some damage in return, and gives you some additional cut "
"damage in melee."
msgstr "给你的身体覆盖上一层如剃刀般锋利的水晶。怪物在攻击你时会反过来受到伤害，并在近战中造成一些额外的切割伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Shape of Dust"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Shape of Dust"
msgstr[0] "塑形尘土卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shape of Dust"
msgid ""
"Hide yourself between the sand gust.  It's harder to hit you, and monster's "
"can't spot you."
msgstr "将自己藏入沙尘暴中，你更难被打中，怪物也无法发现你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Earthshaper's Golem"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Earthshaper's Golem"
msgstr[0] "塑地者傀儡卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Earthshaper's Golem"
msgid ""
"Shape a strong golem out of the stone.  It may help for a lot, but you have "
"not enough energy to support it forever."
msgstr "塑造一个强大的石制傀儡。能帮上你很多，但你没有足够的能量永远维持它。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Summon Boulder"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Summon Boulder"
msgstr[0] "召唤巨石卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Boulder"
msgid ""
"Pull the smooth rock underground, using your forces of earth shaping.  You "
"can use it as a table, or as a primitive anvil."
msgstr "用你塑造大地的力量，拉出地下的光滑岩石。 你可以把它当作桌子，或者当作原始的铁砧。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Reading the Earthbones"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Reading the Earthbones"
msgstr[0] "解读地骨卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Reading the Earthbones"
msgid "Use magic to reveal nearby terrain."
msgstr "使用魔法显示附近的地形。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Point Flare"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Point Flare"
msgstr[0] "定點驟燃卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Point Flare"
msgid "Causes an intense heat at the location, damaging the target."
msgstr "在該位置產生強烈的熱量，並傷害目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Finger Firelighter"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Finger Firelighter"
msgstr[0] "指尖引火卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Finger Firelighter"
msgid ""
"Summons a small flame that does not burn you, but you can use it to light "
"things on fire.  It seems to need you to have some intent to light things on "
"fire, because you are able to put it in your pocket with no issue."
msgstr "召喚一個不會燒傷你的細小火焰，你可以用它去點燃物品。它看來需要你一點專注去點燃東西，因為你能毫無阻礙地把它放進去你的口袋之中。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Ice Spike"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Ice Spike"
msgstr[0] "冰刺術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ice Spike"
msgid ""
"Causes jagged icicles to form in the air above the target, falling and "
"damaging it."
msgstr "在目標上方從空氣中製造出鋸齒狀冰柱，掉落並傷害目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Fireball"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Fireball"
msgstr[0] "火球術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Fireball"
msgid ""
"You hurl a pea-sized glowing orb that when reaches its target or an obstacle "
"produces a pressure-less blast of searing heat."
msgstr "你丟出一個碗豆般大小的發光球體，當它碰觸到目標或者障礙物時會產生爆炸和高熱。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Cone of Cold"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Cone of Cold"
msgstr[0] "冷錐術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Burning Hands"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Burning Hands"
msgstr[0] "燃燒之手卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Frost Spray"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Frost Spray"
msgstr[0] "寒霜噴霧卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Chilling Touch"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Chilling Touch"
msgstr[0] "冰冷之觸卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Glide on Ice"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Glide on Ice"
msgstr[0] "冰面滑行卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Hoary Blast"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Hoary Blast"
msgstr[0] "蒼白爆破卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Ice Shield"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Ice Shield"
msgstr[0] "冰盾卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ice Shield"
msgid ""
"Creates a magical shield of ice on your arm, you can defend yourself with it "
"in melee combat and use it to bash."
msgstr "在你的手臂上創造一個魔法冰盾，能夠防禦近戰攻擊並能使用盾擊。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Frost Armor"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Frost Armor"
msgstr[0] "寒霜護甲卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Frost Armor"
msgid "Covers you in a thin layer of magical ice to protect you from harm."
msgstr "將你包覆在一層用魔力製造的薄冰，保護你免於受傷。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Shadow Field"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Shadow Field"
msgstr[0] "陰影力場卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shadow Field"
msgid "Cast a field of shadows."
msgstr "施展一個陰影力場。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Magic Missile"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Magic Missile"
msgstr[0] "魔法飛彈卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Phase Door"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Phase Door"
msgstr[0] "相位之門卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Phase Door"
msgid "Teleports you in a random direction a short distance."
msgstr "把你傳送到短距離內的隨機位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Gravity Well"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Gravity Well"
msgstr[0] "重力井卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Gravity Well"
msgid ""
"Summons a well of gravity with the epicenter at the location.  Deals bashing "
"damage to all creatures in the affected area."
msgstr "以該地點為震央召喚一口重力井。對受影響區域內的所有生物造成鈍擊傷害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Mana Blast"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Mana Blast"
msgstr[0] "魔力爆破卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Mana Bolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Mana Bolt"
msgstr[0] "魔力之箭卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Haste"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Haste"
msgstr[0] "加速術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Slow"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Slow"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Slow"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Slow"
msgid "This spell slows a single target greatly for its duration."
msgstr "This spell slows a single target greatly for its duration."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Mana Beam"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Mana Beam"
msgstr[0] "魔力射線卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Escape"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Escape"
msgstr[0] "脫離卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Cat's Grace"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Cat's Grace"
msgstr[0] "貓之優雅卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Cat's Grace"
msgid "You become more graceful, agile, and coordinated."
msgstr "你變得更優雅、敏捷與協調。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Eagle's Sight"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Eagle's Sight"
msgstr[0] "鷹之視野卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Ogre's Strength"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Ogre's Strength"
msgstr[0] "食人魔之力卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Fox's Cunning"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Fox's Cunning"
msgstr[0] "狐之狡黠卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Focused Bolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Focused Bolt"
msgstr[0] "聚能光束卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Focused Bolt"
msgid ""
"You focus your mana into a microscopically thin pulsed beam of pure energy, "
"capable of extreme range and precision; as well as unparalleled penetration, "
"provided proper skill.  Once the invention of a notorious assassin, this "
"spell has slayed many a king and noble.  Passed on only through direct "
"descendants over the ages, though occasionally shared by them to others."
msgstr ""
"你将你的魔力聚集到一束极薄的纯能量脉冲光束中，具有极高的射程和精度；以及无与伦比的穿透力，只要技能等级足够。这个法术曾经是一名臭名昭著的刺客的发明，曾经杀死"
"了无数国王和贵族。它只通过世代相传的直系后裔传承，虽然偶尔也会被他们分享给其他人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Shocking Lash"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Shocking Lash"
msgstr[0] "閃電鞭笞卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Jolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Jolt"
msgstr[0] "猛擊術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Lightning Bolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Lightning Bolt"
msgstr[0] "閃電箭卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lightning Bolt"
msgid ""
"The go-to spell for many Stormshapers, this iconic spell does just what you "
"expect: you shoot lightning from your fingertips.  However, this lightning is "
"more directed than most lightning, and travels in a line through most "
"non-solid targets."
msgstr "对于许多风暴塑造者来说，这个标志性法术正如你所期待的那样：你可以从指尖射出闪电。不过这种闪电比其他闪电更有方向性，并以直线穿过大多数非固体目标。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Windstrike"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Windstrike"
msgstr[0] "風擊術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Windstrike"
msgid ""
"A powerful blast of wind slams into anything in front of your outstretched "
"hand."
msgstr "在你伸出的雙手前，一股勁風將猛擊所有東西。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Shipwrecker"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Shipwrecker"
msgstr[0] "碎舰风暴卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shipwrecker"
msgid ""
"The spell moves out of your mouth, creating a giant shockwave that shatters "
"everything in its path."
msgstr "咒语从你的嘴里出来，产生一个巨大的冲击波，摧毁它路径上的一切。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Explosive Decompression"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Explosive Decompression"
msgstr[0] "爆裂失压卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Vacuum Decompression"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Vacuum Decompression"
msgstr[0] "真空减压卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Air Bubble"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Air Bubble"
msgstr[0] "气泡术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Superconductor"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Superconductor"
msgstr[0] "超导卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Shocking Dash"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Shocking Dash"
msgstr[0] "雷霆冲刺卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Toxtricity"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Toxtricity"
msgstr[0] "电毒卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Electric Eye"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Electric Eye"
msgstr[0] "电磁视力卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Electric Eye"
msgid ""
"Enhance your sight with your powers.  It allows you to see creatures of the "
"same energy around you, and block or dodge an additional attack your enhanced "
"perception speed could anticipate."
msgstr "用你的能量增强你的视力。它可以让你看到周围拥有同样能量的生物。增强的感知速度使你能够看到即将到来的攻击，增加额外的格挡或闪避次数。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Electric Waves"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Electric Waves"
msgstr[0] "电波卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Electric Waves"
msgid ""
"Your hands start to emit a huge amount of energy, that you release with each "
"attack."
msgstr "你的双手开始发出巨大的能量，每次攻击时都会释放。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Electric Arts"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Electric Arts"
msgstr[0] "电荷艺术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Electric Arts"
msgid ""
"Insulate the skin against electrical damage.  Particularly useful for the "
"apprentice Stormshaper, whose magical control is weak and whose efforts could "
"easily end in self-electrocution."
msgstr "使皮肤绝缘，防止电击伤害伤。特别适用于魔法控制能力很弱的风暴塑造初学者，防止他的努力因自我触电告终。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Teravolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Teravolt"
msgstr[0] "太拉伏特卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Teravolt"
msgid ""
"Summon a Teravolt, a small, semi-intelligent spirit that homes onto hostile "
"creatures and explodes into a huge spark cloud."
msgstr "召唤一只特拉伏特，一只小型半灵智的灵魂体，会在爆炸成为巨型电火花云前吸附到敌对生物身上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Windrunning"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Windrunning"
msgstr[0] "迅捷之風卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Call Stormhammer"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Call Stormhammer"
msgstr[0] "召喚暴風之錘卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Stormfist"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Stormfist"
msgstr[0] "风暴之拳卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Bless"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Bless"
msgstr[0] "祝福卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Bless"
msgid "A spell of blessing that gives you energy and boosts your abilities."
msgstr "一個給予你能量並強化你的能力的祝福法術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Holy Blade"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Holy Blade"
msgstr[0] "神聖之刃卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Spiritual Armor"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Spiritual Armor"
msgstr[0] "心靈護甲卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Lamp"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Lamp"
msgstr[0] "魔法燈卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Manatricity"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Manatricity"
msgstr[0] "法力轉化卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Manatricity"
msgid ""
"You have found a way to convert your spiritual energy into power you can use "
"for your bionics."
msgstr "你已經找到了一種方法，可以將你的精神能量轉化成你的生化能量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Taze"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Taze"
msgstr[0] "電擊術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Taze"
msgid "This spell creates a very short range bolt of electricity to shock your foes."
msgstr "該卷軸能從你手指射出極短距離的閃電箭來電擊你的敵人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Lesser Quantum Tunnel"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Lesser Quantum Tunnel"
msgstr[0] "次級量子隧道卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Synaptic Stimulation"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Synaptic Stimulation"
msgstr[0] "突觸刺激卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Synaptic Stimulation"
msgid ""
"This spell stimulates the synapses in your brain beyond normal processing "
"speeds, giving you a large boost in mental processing capability, including "
"enhancing your reflexes, speed, and raw intellectual power.  Use responsibly!"
msgstr "此法術刺激大腦突觸超出正常處理速度，使你在心智處理能力上有大幅的提升，包括提高你的反應能力、速度和基礎智力。負責任地使用！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Laze"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Laze"
msgstr[0] "雷光卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Animated Blade"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Animated Blade"
msgstr[0] "活化幻刃卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Mirror Image"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Mirror Image"
msgstr[0] "鏡像投影卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Lightning Blast"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Lightning Blast"
msgstr[0] "閃電爆破卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lightning Blast"
msgid ""
"You fire a small concentrated ball of lightning at the target.  The "
"electricity diffuses quickly, so it doesn't do much damage, but you're able "
"to fire off several quick ones in a row."
msgstr "你向目標發射一個小的閃電球。電流擴散很快，所以它不會造成太大的傷害，但你可以快速地連續發射好幾個。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Necrotic Gaze"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Necrotic Gaze"
msgstr[0] "腐壞凝視卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Necrotic Gaze"
msgid ""
"You use the power of your own blood to imbue necrotic energy into your gaze, "
"damaging the target you look at."
msgstr "你利用自己血液的力量將壞死的能量注入你的視線，傷害你所凝視的目標。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Purification Seed"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Purification Seed"
msgstr[0] "淨化種子卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Purification Seed"
msgid ""
"You summon a gift of the earth which will purify water.  Greater levels yield "
"greater numbers of seeds."
msgstr "你召喚大地的贈禮，它將淨化水質。越高的等級能產生越多的種子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of X-ray Vision"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of X-ray Vision"
msgstr[0] "X射線眼卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of X-ray Vision"
msgid ""
"You fire a cone of X-rays that magically allow you to see that area for a "
"short time."
msgstr "你射出一道魔法的X射線，讓你可以在短時間內看清周圍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Optical Sneeze Beam"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Optical Sneeze Beam"
msgstr[0] "喷嚏激光术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Optical Sneeze Beam"
msgid ""
"You overcharge your internal batteries to send a semi-directed beam from your "
"face."
msgstr "你将体内的生化电池过载，从你的脸上射出半定向的激光光束。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Bleed"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Bleed"
msgstr[0] "致傷卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Bleed"
msgid "With a shout and a gesture, the target starts bleeding from old wounds."
msgstr "擺出手勢並念出咒語，目標的傷口開始流血。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Lesser Banishment"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Lesser Banishment"
msgstr[0] "次級放逐術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lesser Banishment"
msgid ""
"Banish a monster to the lesser-known nether dimension.  If a monster is more "
"powerful than you can handle, the spell drains your life force to make up the "
"difference."
msgstr "把怪物放逐到鲜为人知的异界维度之中。如果怪物比你更强大，这个法术会消耗你的生命来弥补其中的差异。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Acid Resistance"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Acid Resistance"
msgstr[0] "抗酸術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Acid Resistance"
msgid "This spell creates an invisible aura to protect you from acid."
msgstr "这法术能产生一个肉眼无法看见的防酸光环保护你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Lightning Storm"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Lightning Storm"
msgstr[0] "閃電風暴卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lightning Storm"
msgid ""
"This scroll details how a spell called 'Lightning Blast' which is commonly "
"used among Stormshapers can be altered to become much more powerful, at a "
"much higher mana cost."
msgstr "這卷軸詳細描述了如何耗用更多的法力來改變塑風者常用的「閃電爆破」法術，讓它變成更強大破壞力的法術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Sacrificial Regrowth"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Sacrificial Regrowth"
msgstr[0] "血腥復生卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Sacrificial Healing"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Sacrificial Healing"
msgstr[0] "犧牲治療卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Move Earth"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Move Earth"
msgstr[0] "移土卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Move Earth"
msgid "Make the terrain answer to your call."
msgstr "让大地回应你的呼唤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Paralytic Dart"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Paralytic Dart"
msgstr[0] "麻痺飛鏢卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Visceral Projection"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Visceral Projection"
msgstr[0] "髒污投射卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Coagulant Weave"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Coagulant Weave"
msgstr[0] "凝血編織卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Ionization"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Ionization"
msgstr[0] "電離卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Ignus Fatuus"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Ignus Fatuus"
msgstr[0] "召喚鬼火卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ignus Fatuus"
msgid ""
"Summons ghostly foxfire worked from living marsh vapor, to lead your enemies "
"astray.  With more experience, this spell can conjure multiple ghost lights."
msgstr "从富有生命力的沼泽水蒸气中召唤幽灵般的狐火，把你的敌人引向歧途。当你有更多的施法经验时，这个法术可以召唤出数只发光的鬼火。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Wall of Fog"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Wall of Fog"
msgstr[0] "霧牆卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Knock"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Knock"
msgstr[0] "敲鎖卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Knock"
msgid ""
"You can channel magical energy to open locked wooden doors from a short range "
"away."
msgstr "你可以引導魔力來開啟短距離內的鎖住木門。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Improved Knock"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Improved Knock"
msgstr[0] "強力敲鎖卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Improved Knock"
msgid ""
"You can channel magical energy to open any locked door from a short range "
"away."
msgstr "你可以引導魔力來開啟短距離內的任何鎖住門。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Fire Spark"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Fire Spark"
msgstr[0] "电火花卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Fire Spark"
msgid ""
"Summons a small electric spark, that do not harm anything.  You can use it to "
"ignite something flammable."
msgstr "召唤一道小电火花，什么都伤不到。你可以用它点燃什么易燃物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Repelling Arc"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Repelling Arc"
msgstr[0] "擊退電弧卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Repelling Arc"
msgid ""
"You manifest an aura of crackling electricity around you to strike attackers "
"with baleful lightning."
msgstr "你在你周围召唤出一道噼啪作响的电弧光环，能放出可怕的闪电电击近战攻击你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sappy Scroll"
msgid_plural "Sappy Scrolls"
msgstr[0] "沾滿汁液的卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Sappy Scroll"
msgid ""
"This scroll is covered in sap and rose thorns.  You can still make out some "
"of the writings, but it probably won't work the same."
msgstr "这个卷轴上覆盖着汁液和玫瑰刺。你仍然可以辨认出卷轴中的一些文字，它应该能够施放出些法术，但不知道是否会有效。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Feral Form"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Feral Form"
msgstr[0] "狂野型態卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Feral Form"
msgid "Unleash your inner beast by snapping a fur-covered bone, becoming beastly."
msgstr "折断一根毛皮覆盖的骨头，释放出你内心暗藏的兽性，变得如同野兽一般。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Flamesword"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Flamesword"
msgstr[0] "烈焰劍卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flamesword"
msgid "Ignite a wooden sword to create a flaming saber."
msgstr "點燃木劍來創造一把烈焰劍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Flamebreath"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Flamebreath"
msgstr[0] "火焰吐息卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flamebreath"
msgid ""
"A pocketful of combustible powder is ignited, creating a cone of flame with "
"ashes that stick to those in its path."
msgstr "点燃一小袋可燃火药粉末，形成一个火炎锥，燃烧的灰烬覆盖在范围内的所有物品之上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Caustic Aura"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Caustic Aura"
msgstr[0] "腐蝕靈氣卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Caustic Aura"
msgid ""
"Animate a layer of acid around you, burning attackers and increasing your "
"melee damage."
msgstr "在你身体周围召唤出一个酸液光环，腐蚀攻击你的敌人，并增加你的近战伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Decaying Boneclub"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Decaying Boneclub"
msgstr[0] "腐朽骨棒卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Decaying Boneclub"
msgid ""
"Link your live blood to dead blood and bones, creating a club eager to "
"harvest the living."
msgstr "将你体内的活血和死者的血和骨头联系起来，制造出一根渴望收割活物的骨棍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Disruption Bolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Disruption Bolt"
msgstr[0] "干擾之箭卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Disruption Bolt"
msgid ""
"Release a resonant bolt of spiritual energy at a nearby target.  It will "
"disrupt the natural link between matter and animus, causing heavy but never "
"lethal damage."
msgstr "向附近的目标释放一道共振的精神能量波束。它会破坏物质和灵魂之间的自然联系，造成严重但绝不会致命的伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Impact Sling"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Impact Sling"
msgstr[0] "衝擊投索卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Impact Sling"
msgid ""
"Infuse a sling with excess energy, delivering devastating throws before it "
"tears itself apart."
msgstr "为投石索灌注入过量能量，在它撕碎自己之前，打出威力巨大的投掷打击。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Knifeshot"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Knifeshot"
msgstr[0] "射刀術卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Knifeshot"
msgid "Emulate a railgun, launching a knife at high speed."
msgstr "模仿一把磁軌槍，用高速發射一把小刀。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "MICE(R) blueprint"
msgid_plural "MICE(R) blueprints"
msgstr[0] "MICE（R）蓝图"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "MICE(R) blueprint"
msgid ""
"Manafied Infernal Combustion Engine (Rideable)\n"
"Detailed schematics for a motorcycle, that are somehow simultaneously "
"obviously impossible and yet intriguingly intuitive.\n"
"In one margin, the word 'Mojocycle' has been scrawled in a flowing hand."
msgstr ""
"魔法内燃机（可驾驶）\n"
"一辆摩托车的详细设计图，看起来明显无法实现的同时却又奇妙地符合直觉。\n"
"在设计图的空白处潦草地写着\"魔托车\"三个字。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Nova Flare"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Nova Flare"
msgstr[0] "火焰新星卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Nova Flare"
msgid "Causes an intense heat at the location, greatly damaging the target."
msgstr "在該位置產生強烈的熱量，並對目標造成大量傷害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Jar of Force"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Jar of Force"
msgstr[0] "力場瓶卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Jar of Force"
msgid "Summon a jar of force you can use to store liquids in."
msgstr "招換一個可以用來儲存液體的力場瓶。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Freezing Touch"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Freezing Touch"
msgstr[0] "极冻之触卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Nature's Commune"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Nature's Commune"
msgstr[0] "自然交流卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Nature's Commune"
msgid ""
"Your connection with nature allows you to become one with it; you revitalize "
"your body while in communion with the flora and fauna around you."
msgstr "你与大自然建立起的联结让你与它融为一体。当你同周围的动植物联结时，能迅速恢复生命活力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Seed of Growth"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Seed of Growth"
msgstr[0] "成长之种卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Whisper of the Leaves"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Whisper of the Leaves"
msgstr[0] "叶之低语卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Whisper of the Leaves"
msgid "Deepen your bond with the forest and understand the whispers of the trees."
msgstr "加深你与森林的联系，了解树木的低语。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Tremorsense"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Tremorsense"
msgstr[0] "震颤感知卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Tremorsense"
msgid ""
"Sink your senses into the earth and learn of the approach of anything walking "
"upon it."
msgstr "把你的感官沉入大地，学习任何在大地上行走的东西的方法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Stones' Fortitude"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Stones' Fortitude"
msgstr[0] "坚如磐石卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stones' Fortitude"
msgid "Like the unyielding stone, lessen your need for food or water."
msgstr "像坚硬的石头一样，减少你对食物和水的需求。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of the Turning of the Earth"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of the Turning of the Earth"
msgstr[0] "翻土术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of the Turning of the Earth"
msgid "Ask the earth spirits to prepare the earth for planting and sowing."
msgstr "请大地之灵为种植和播种准备。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Harvest of the Hunter"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Harvest of the Hunter"
msgstr[0] "猎人收获卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Harvest of the Hunter"
msgid "Create usable arrows out of forest detritus."
msgstr "用森林碎屑制作有用的箭头。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Sense Outsiders"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Sense Outsiders"
msgstr[0] "界外感知卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Sense Outsiders"
msgid "Open your mystic senses and locate the things that should not be."
msgstr "打开你神秘的感官，找出不应该出现的东西。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Cloak of Warmth"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Cloak of Warmth"
msgstr[0] "保暖斗篷卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Cloak of Warmth"
msgid "Winter-be-gone through the power of modern magic."
msgstr "Winter-be-gone through the power of modern magic."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Cloak of Chill"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Cloak of Chill"
msgstr[0] "寒冷斗篷卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Cloak of Chill"
msgid "Summer-be-gone through the power of modern magic."
msgstr "Summer-be-gone through the power of modern magic."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Slowfall"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Slowfall"
msgstr[0] "羽落术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Slowfall"
msgid "Who's afraid of heights?  Not you, after you read this scroll."
msgstr "Who's afraid of heights?  Not you, after you read this scroll."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Spider Climb"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Spider Climb"
msgstr[0] "蛛行卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Spider Climb"
msgid "Free climb better than the best."
msgstr "自由爬行胜过最好的攀登。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Limbs of the Frog"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Limbs of the Frog"
msgstr[0] "蛙肢卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Limbs of the Frog"
msgid "Swim with the fishes, with your froggy hands and legs."
msgstr "和鱼一起游，用你青蛙般的手和腿。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Giant Growth"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Giant Growth"
msgstr[0] "巨大增长卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Giant Growth"
msgid "Grow to enormous size and crush your enemies."
msgstr "成长到巨大的规模和粉碎你的敌人"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Formula of Preserve Genetic Stability"
msgid_plural "Formulae of Preserve Genetic Stability"
msgstr[0] "Formulae of Preserve Genetic Stability"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Formula of Preserve Genetic Stability"
msgid ""
"This research paper has an extremely complicated series of formulae with "
"various genetic code diagrams interspersed.  It claims that the spell will "
"reduce the negative effects of XE037 exposure."
msgstr ""
"This research paper has an extremely complicated series of formulae with "
"various genetic code diagrams interspersed.  It claims that the spell will "
"reduce the negative effects of XE037 exposure."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Carrion Feast"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Carrion Feast"
msgstr[0] "腐烂盛宴卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Carrion Feast"
msgid ""
"Eat rotten food with no ill effects.  It doesn't make it taste any better, "
"though."
msgstr "吃没有不良影响的腐坏食物。但这并没有让它的味道变好。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Knowing the Day and the Hour"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Knowing the Day and the Hour"
msgstr[0] "知晓时间卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Knowing the Day and the Hour"
msgid ""
"Cast this spell to know exactly what time it is.  You're amazed anyone is "
"still making these scrolls; this spell might as well be a museum piece."
msgstr "施放这个法术来知道确切的时间。你很惊讶有人还在制作这些卷轴;这个法术还不如进博物馆呢。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Magus's Mark"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Magus's Mark"
msgstr[0] "魔法印记卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Magus's Mark"
msgid ""
"Mark an area to be aetherically resonant so that you can easily find it "
"later; for example, by using the Word of Recall spell."
msgstr "将一个区域标记为以太共振，这样你以后就可以很容易地找到它；例如通过使用回忆之词咒语法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Word of Recall"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Word of Recall"
msgstr[0] "回返真言卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Word of Recall"
msgid ""
"The counterpart to Magus's Mark, reciting this simple spell will instantly "
"return you to wherever it was that you cast that spell."
msgstr "与魔法印记相对应的是，背诵这个简单的咒语会让你立即回到你施放那个咒语的地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Summon Watcher Spirit"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Summon Watcher Spirit"
msgstr[0] "召唤守望者灵魂卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Watcher Spirit"
msgid ""
"Summon a spirit through whose eyes you can see.  This spell was frowned upon "
"pre-Cataclysm due to the potential for misuse, but its many legitimate uses "
"kept it on the curriculum at major universities' thaumaturgical studies "
"departments."
msgstr "召唤一个灵魂，通过他的眼睛你可以看到。由于有可能被误用，这个咒语在大灾变前是不受欢迎的，但它的许多合法用途使它成为主要大学自然学系的课程。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Beguiling the Savage Beast"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Beguiling the Savage Beast"
msgstr[0] "蛊惑野兽卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Beguiling the Savage Beast"
msgid ""
"Charm an animal into your service for a time.  They don't even technically "
"have to be savage!"
msgstr "你可以魅惑一只动物，为你服务一段时间。它们甚至不一定非得是野兽！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Shutdown"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Shutdown"
msgstr[0] "关闭卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shutdown"
msgid ""
"Stop a robot, golem, or cyborg in their tracks.  Be perfectly prepared for a "
"different kind of apocalypse."
msgstr "让机器人、傀儡或半机械人停下脚步。为另一种世界末日做好充分准备。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Speak through the Aether"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Speak through the Aether"
msgstr[0] "以太交流卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Speak through the Aether"
msgid ""
"Summon up a magical device that allows you to communicate through radio "
"waves.  Well, maybe there's someone still out there."
msgstr "召唤一个可以让你通过无线电波交流的神奇设备。也许有人还在外面。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Power Supply"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Power Supply"
msgstr[0] "电力来源卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Power Supply"
msgid "Power all of your devices using mana instead of electricity."
msgstr "使用魔力而不是电力为所有设备供电。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Voltaic Touch"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Voltaic Touch"
msgstr[0] "雷电之触卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Voltaic Touch"
msgid "Weld metal using touch alone.  It'll do a number on a zombie too."
msgstr "仅用触摸就能熔接金属。它也会对丧尸产生一定的影响。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Granite Aegis"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Granite Aegis"
msgstr[0] "花岗岩宙斯盾卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Granite Aegis"
msgid ""
"When the going gets tough, the tough summon yards-thick walls of solid rock "
"around themselves."
msgstr "当事情变得艰难时，强者会召唤出几码厚的坚固岩石墙。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Spear of Brambles"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Spear of Brambles"
msgstr[0] "荆棘之矛卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Spear of Brambles"
msgid "Transform a long stick into a spear that drips with sticky sap."
msgstr "把一根长木棍变成一支能滴下粘稠树液的长矛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Summon Tanglevine"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Summon Tanglevine"
msgstr[0] "召唤藤蔓卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Tanglevine"
msgid ""
"Conjure a lashing bunch of animated vines that will grab and hold your "
"enemies."
msgstr "召唤一束活跃藤蔓，抓住并捆缚你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Thornskin"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Thornskin"
msgstr[0] "棘皮术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Thornskin"
msgid "Transform your skin into bark covered in sharp thorns."
msgstr "把你的皮肤变成布满尖刺的树皮。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Stranglethorns"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Stranglethorns"
msgstr[0] "荆棘卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stranglethorns"
msgid ""
"Conjure a bunch of thick brambles out of the ground to either form a wall or "
"slow your enemies."
msgstr "从地上召唤一束浓密的荆棘，形成一堵墙或减缓你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Cloak of Fog"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Cloak of Fog"
msgstr[0] "浓雾环绕卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Cloak of Fog"
msgid ""
"Summon up a large cloud of mist that will conceal your movements from your "
"enemies."
msgstr "召唤一大团雾来掩护你的行动，不让你的敌人看见。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Heart of the Hurricane"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Heart of the Hurricane"
msgstr[0] "飓风之心卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Heart of the Hurricane"
msgid "Compress raging storm winds into a shell around you to protect you."
msgstr "将肆虐的风暴风压缩成一个围绕你的外壳来保护你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scribbled Scroll"
msgid_plural "Scribbled Scrolls"
msgstr[0] "潦草卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scribbled Scroll"
msgid ""
"Someone has scribbled on this scroll in…colored pencil?  You're pretty sure "
"whatever it does now isn't the spell's original function."
msgstr "有人用彩色铅笔在这个卷轴上乱涂乱画了吗?你很确定它现在的作用不是法术最初的作用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Lashing Tentacles"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Lashing Tentacles"
msgstr[0] "鞭笞触手卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lashing Tentacles"
msgid ""
"Grow a pair of barbed tentacles from your shoulders that will attack enemies "
"in melee range."
msgstr "从你的肩膀上长出一对带刺的触手，可以攻击近战范围内的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Purgation of Maladies"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Purgation of Maladies"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Purgation of Maladies"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Purgation of Maladies"
msgid ""
"Snap your fingers and get rid of that nasty cold or flu, with the slight "
"disadvantage that you'll have to vomit it out."
msgstr ""
"Snap your fingers and get rid of that nasty cold or flu, with the slight "
"disadvantage that you'll have to vomit it out."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Dispel Magic"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Dispel Magic"
msgstr[0] "驱散魔法卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Dispel Magic"
msgid ""
"Enemy wizards got you down?  Just remove all their magic and punch them in "
"the face."
msgstr "敌人的魔法师把你打倒了?只要除掉他们的魔法，然后一拳打在他们脸上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Disjunction"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Disjunction"
msgstr[0] "禁魔卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Disjunction"
msgid ""
"Remove all magic from your target, even rare or powerful spells.  Who's the "
"archmage now?"
msgstr "移除目标的所有魔法，即使是稀有或强大的魔法。现在谁是大法师？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Corporeal Reconstitution"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Corporeal Reconstitution"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Corporeal Reconstitution"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Corporeal Reconstitution"
msgid "Cuts?  Lacerations?  Torn organs?  Fix all that with this handy spell."
msgstr "Cuts?  Lacerations?  Torn organs?  Fix all that with this handy spell."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Halt Bleeding"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Halt Bleeding"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Halt Bleeding"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Halt Bleeding"
msgid "Keep all that blood in your body."
msgstr "Keep all that blood in your body."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Flensing Fingers"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Flensing Fingers"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Flensing Fingers"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flensing Fingers"
msgid "Turn your fingers into myriad bone knives."
msgstr "Turn your fingers into myriad bone knives."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Caustic Blood"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Caustic Blood"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Caustic Blood"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Caustic Blood"
msgid ""
"Turn your blood into acid, just like that movie you used to watch all that "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Turn your blood into acid, just like that movie you used to watch all that "
"time."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Renew the Forest"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Renew the Forest"
msgstr[0] "森林新生卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Renew the Forest"
msgid ""
"Grow an entire forest from nothing, given enough time and mana.  There were "
"druids who made good money doing this for industrial logging, the ethics of "
"which were always good to start an argument at a party."
msgstr ""
"Grow an entire forest from nothing, given enough time and mana.  There were "
"druids who made good money doing this for industrial logging, the ethics of "
"which were always good to start an argument at a party."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Shape Wood"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Shape Wood"
msgstr[0] "塑木术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shape Wood"
msgid "Grow a log from a living tree and prune it without violence."
msgstr "Grow a log from a living tree and prune it without violence."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Water's Cooling Touch"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Water's Cooling Touch"
msgstr[0] "清凉之触卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Water's Cooling Touch"
msgid "Using a bit of water, transfer water's refreshing chill to yourself."
msgstr "Using a bit of water, transfer water's refreshing chill to yourself."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Aquatic Mantle"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Aquatic Mantle"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Aquatic Mantle"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Aquatic Mantle"
msgid ""
"Grow magical seaweed to form a protective coating, allowing you to travel the "
"depths."
msgstr ""
"Grow magical seaweed to form a protective coating, allowing you to travel the "
"depths."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Wash the Wounds Clean"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Wash the Wounds Clean"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Wash the Wounds Clean"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Wash the Wounds Clean"
msgid "Disinfect your wounds with just a bit of water and magic."
msgstr "Disinfect your wounds with just a bit of water and magic."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Water Strider's Walk"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Water Strider's Walk"
msgstr[0] "水上漂卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Water Strider's Walk"
msgid "Walk on water using the power of your magic."
msgstr "Walk on water using the power of your magic."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Imbue with Lightning"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Imbue with Lightning"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Imbue with Lightning"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Imbue with Lightning"
msgid "Charge a battery using only your mana!  Once of niche use, now a vital skill."
msgstr "Charge a battery using only your mana!  Once of niche use, now a vital skill."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Flames of Passion"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Flames of Passion"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Flames of Passion"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flames of Passion"
msgid "Fire yourself up to give a persuasive speech with this spell."
msgstr "Fire yourself up to give a persuasive speech with this spell."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Extinguish"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Extinguish"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Extinguish"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Extinguish"
msgid ""
"Turn a fire directly into cold, putting it out.  Once one of the most "
"commonly-known spells in the world, the lack of open flames in daily life has "
"lead to a steep decline in its use."
msgstr ""
"Turn a fire directly into cold, putting it out.  Once one of the most "
"commonly-known spells in the world, the lack of open flames in daily life has "
"lead to a steep decline in its use."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Freezer Field"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Freezer Field"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Freezer Field"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Freezer Field"
msgid ""
"Summon a sphere of ice to preserve your food inside.  Once a vital spell to "
"keep food from rotting, then a party trick to keep drinks cold at the beach, "
"and now back to vital once again."
msgstr ""
"Summon a sphere of ice to preserve your food inside.  Once a vital spell to "
"keep food from rotting, then a party trick to keep drinks cold at the beach, "
"and now back to vital once again."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Harden Earth"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Harden Earth"
msgstr[0] "泥土硬化卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Harden Earth"
msgid ""
"Turn dirt into solid rock.  Useful for making a fortress or a castle in a "
"fraction of the time."
msgstr ""
"Turn dirt into solid rock.  Useful for making a fortress or a castle in a "
"fraction of the time."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Stone Slumber"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Stone Slumber"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Stone Slumber"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stone Slumber"
msgid ""
"Sink into the depths of the earth to heal more quickly and make sleep more "
"restful.  You don't need to eat or drink either…  Say, how many earthshapers "
"are still asleep down there?"
msgstr ""
"Sink into the depths of the earth to heal more quickly and make sleep more "
"restful.  You don't need to eat or drink either…  Say, how many earthshapers "
"are still asleep down there?"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Freshen Up"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Freshen Up"
msgstr[0] "梳洗术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Freshen Up"
msgid ""
"The single most well-known spell in the entire world before the Cataclysm.  "
"Why take a shower and do your laundry if you can get magic to do it for you?"
msgstr ""
"The single most well-known spell in the entire world before the Cataclysm.  "
"Why take a shower and do your laundry if you can get magic to do it for you?"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Body of Spirit"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Body of Spirit"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Body of Spirit"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Body of Spirit"
msgid ""
"Highly restricted before the Cataclysm, this spell allows you to turn into "
"pure spirit and pass through the physical world unseen and insubstantial."
msgstr ""
"Highly restricted before the Cataclysm, this spell allows you to turn into "
"pure spirit and pass through the physical world unseen and insubstantial."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Mageshield"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Mageshield"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Mageshield"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mageshield"
msgid ""
"A common protective spell even before the Cataclysm, Mageshield will render "
"you completely invincible…against a single attack."
msgstr ""
"A common protective spell even before the Cataclysm, Mageshield will render "
"you completely invincible…against a single attack."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Traverse the Wilds"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Traverse the Wilds"
msgstr[0] "穿行荒野卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Traverse the Wilds"
msgid ""
"A favored spell of those hiking the Appalachian Trail, this spell increases "
"your speed in the wilderness."
msgstr ""
"A favored spell of those hiking the Appalachian Trail, this spell increases "
"your speed in the wilderness."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of The Rime-Covered Heart"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of The Rime-Covered Heart"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of The Rime-Covered Heart"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of The Rime-Covered Heart"
msgid ""
"Highly-restricted before the Cataclysm, this spell prevents you from feeling "
"any emotion for the duration."
msgstr ""
"Highly-restricted before the Cataclysm, this spell prevents you from feeling "
"any emotion for the duration."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Sorcerer's Hand"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Sorcerer's Hand"
msgstr[0] "法师之手卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Sorcerer's Hand"
msgid ""
"Pull a distant creature or item toward you.  The ultimate spell for the couch "
"potato mage."
msgstr ""
"Pull a distant creature or item toward you.  The ultimate spell for the couch "
"potato mage."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of A Shadow in the Crowd"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of A Shadow in the Crowd"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of A Shadow in the Crowd"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of A Shadow in the Crowd"
msgid "Cut yourself off from your fellows, and also make yourself invisible to them."
msgstr "Cut yourself off from your fellows, and also make yourself invisible to them."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Osseous Luck"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Osseous Luck"
msgstr[0] "骨之幸运卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Osseous Luck"
msgid "Summon benevolent spirits into a bone, granting minor benefits."
msgstr "Summon benevolent spirits into a bone, granting minor benefits."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Bearmantle"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Bearmantle"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Bearmantle"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Bearmantle"
msgid ""
"Take on some of the characteristics of the bear, making it much easier to "
"survive the winter."
msgstr ""
"Take on some of the characteristics of the bear, making it much easier to "
"survive the winter."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Gluttonous Consumption"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Gluttonous Consumption"
msgstr[0] "暴饮暴食卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Gluttonous Consumption"
msgid ""
"For when you don't know where your next meal is coming from and you want to "
"make sure absolutely nothing goes to waste."
msgstr ""
"For when you don't know where your next meal is coming from and you want to "
"make sure absolutely nothing goes to waste."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Peaceful Rest"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Peaceful Rest"
msgstr[0] "安睡术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Peaceful Rest"
msgid ""
"Never spend any time tossing and turning again with one of the most popular "
"pre-Cataclysm spells."
msgstr ""
"Never spend any time tossing and turning again with one of the most popular "
"pre-Cataclysm spells."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Firebolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Firebolt"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Firebolt"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Firebolt"
msgid "Hurls a bolt of fire at the target, just like the name implies."
msgstr "Hurls a bolt of fire at the target, just like the name implies."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Thundering Voice"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Thundering Voice"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Thundering Voice"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Thundering Voice"
msgid ""
"Greatly increases the volume of the caster's voice while also making them "
"immune to any hearing damage the resulting noise would cause.  Very popular "
"at pre-Cataclysm metal concerts, both on and off the stage."
msgstr ""
"Greatly increases the volume of the caster's voice while also making them "
"immune to any hearing damage the resulting noise would cause.  Very popular "
"at pre-Cataclysm metal concerts, both on and off the stage."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Arrowflight"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Arrowflight"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Arrowflight"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Arrowflight"
msgid ""
"Manipulate gravity, atmospheric drag, and friction to increase the effective "
"ranged of ranged weapons, both bows and firearms."
msgstr ""
"Manipulate gravity, atmospheric drag, and friction to increase the effective "
"ranged of ranged weapons, both bows and firearms."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Guardian Spirit"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Guardian Spirit"
msgstr[0] "守护之灵卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Guardian Spirit"
msgid ""
"Summon a benevolent spirit to watch over the caster and warn them of imminent "
"attack."
msgstr ""
"Summon a benevolent spirit to watch over the caster and warn them of imminent "
"attack."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Machine Mind"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Machine Mind"
msgstr[0] "机械知识卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Machine Mind"
msgid ""
"Gain an intuitive understanding of computers and electronics, allowing an "
"easier time repairing or using them."
msgstr "增强对计算机和电子产品的的理解，使其修理或使用更容易。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Baking Hands"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Baking Hands"
msgstr[0] "烹饪之手卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Baking Hands"
msgid "Warm up your food using pure mana."
msgstr "只用魔力加热你的食物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Diamond Imbuement"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Diamond Imbuement"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Diamond Imbuement"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Diamond Imbuement"
msgid ""
"Enchant a weapon with the metaphysical essence of diamonds, greatly "
"increasing its power."
msgstr ""
"Enchant a weapon with the metaphysical essence of diamonds, greatly "
"increasing its power."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Abjure Spirits of Rot"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Abjure Spirits of Rot"
msgstr[0] "驱逐腐败"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Abjure Spirits of Rot"
msgid ""
"Banish the decay spirits from the food you're carrying, making it last much "
"longer before going bad."
msgstr ""
"Banish the decay spirits from the food you're carrying, making it last much "
"longer before going bad."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Fault-Mending Chant"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Fault-Mending Chant"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Fault-Mending Chant"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Fault-Mending Chant"
msgid ""
"With some earth and stone and a song, repair and item made of natural stone "
"or metal."
msgstr ""
"With some earth and stone and a song, repair and item made of natural stone "
"or metal."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Power Linkage"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Power Linkage"
msgstr[0] "能量传输卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Power Linkage"
msgid "Enchant a tool to accept power wirelessly from a compatible source."
msgstr "Enchant a tool to accept power wirelessly from a compatible source."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Zoom Lens"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Zoom Lens"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Zoom Lens"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Zoom Lens"
msgid "Enchant a lens with the ability to see beyond the horizon."
msgstr "使一个镜头具有看到地平线以外的能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of The Body Mechanical"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of The Body Mechanical"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of The Body Mechanical"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of The Body Mechanical"
msgid "Grant yourself brief reprieves from the effects of pain."
msgstr "Grant yourself brief reprieves from the effects of pain."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Rewritten Scroll"
msgid_plural "Rewritten Scrolls"
msgstr[0] "覆写的卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Rewritten Scroll"
msgid ""
"This scroll has been scribbled over again and again in the handwriting of "
"more than one person.  The notes in the margins imply some sort of "
"departmental competition, but no matter the results you can still make out a "
"functional spell in the mess."
msgstr "这张卷轴上反复被不同人的笔迹涂写过。其边缘的注释暗示了某种部门间的竞赛，无论结果如何，你仍然可以在这些混乱的文字中中辨认出一个有效的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of The Inner Voice"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of The Inner Voice"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of The Inner Voice"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of The Inner Voice"
msgid ""
"Speak with your soul instead of your voice, allowing casting spells in "
"silence."
msgstr ""
"Speak with your soul instead of your voice, allowing casting spells in "
"silence."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Silence"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Silence"
msgstr[0] "沉默卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Silence"
msgid "Shut that pesky enemy wizard right up with this spell."
msgstr "Shut that pesky enemy wizard right up with this spell."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Faerie Fire"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Faerie Fire"
msgstr[0] "妖精之火卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Faerie Fire"
msgid "Limn the target in a soft green or blue light.  Great at parties."
msgstr "Limn the target in a soft green or blue light.  Great at parties."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Mana Extraction"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Mana Extraction"
msgstr[0] "魔力提取卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mana Extraction"
msgid ""
"Turn crystallized mana back into mana you can use.  Doing that repeatedly is "
"a great way to make huge quantities of mana vanish into the Aethereum."
msgstr ""
"Turn crystallized mana back into mana you can use.  Doing that repeatedly is "
"a great way to make huge quantities of mana vanish into the Aethereum."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Goodberry"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Goodberry"
msgstr[0] "神莓术卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Goodberry"
msgid ""
"Transform a set of berries into a set of even better berries that keep you "
"full and heal your wounds.  Delicious and nutritious."
msgstr ""
"Transform a set of berries into a set of even better berries that keep you "
"full and heal your wounds.  Delicious and nutritious."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Mind Crush"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Mind Crush"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Mind Crush"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mind Crush"
msgid "Use your own spirit to attack the target's spirit."
msgstr "Use your own spirit to attack the target's spirit."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Imperishable Light"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Imperishable Light"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Imperishable Light"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Imperishable Light"
msgid ""
"Create a permanent glowing orb of light in the air.  Well, it will take a few "
"years to see if it's really permanent; hopefully you'll live to know the "
"answer."
msgstr ""
"Create a permanent glowing orb of light in the air.  Well, it will take a few "
"years to see if it's really permanent; hopefully you'll live to know the "
"answer."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Carmine Infusion"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Carmine Infusion"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Carmine Infusion"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Carmine Infusion"
msgid ""
"Using water as a medium, restore some of your lost blood.  Be more careful "
"where you put that blood next time."
msgstr ""
"Using water as a medium, restore some of your lost blood.  Be more careful "
"where you put that blood next time."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Fountain of the Depths"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Fountain of the Depths"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Fountain of the Depths"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Fountain of the Depths"
msgid ""
"Call up the hidden waters from the depths of the earth to the surface.  Less "
"convenient than a faucet, but the plumbing has been off for a while."
msgstr ""
"Call up the hidden waters from the depths of the earth to the surface.  Less "
"convenient than a faucet, but the plumbing has been off for a while."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Adamantine Gaol"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Adamantine Gaol"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Adamantine Gaol"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Adamantine Gaol"
msgid "Imprison the target in an impenetrable shell of force."
msgstr "Imprison the target in an impenetrable shell of force."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Earth Gate"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Earth Gate"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Earth Gate"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Earth Gate"
msgid ""
"Sink into the ground and re-emerge somewhere nearby.  More likely to keep you "
"in shape than the ability to teleport to the kitchen from your bedroom."
msgstr ""
"Sink into the ground and re-emerge somewhere nearby.  More likely to keep you "
"in shape than the ability to teleport to the kitchen from your bedroom."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Awakening of the Forest Guardian"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Awakening of the Forest Guardian"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Awakening of the Forest Guardian"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Awakening of the Forest Guardian"
msgid ""
"Give motion and awareness to a tree, allowing it to shake free of the soil "
"and crush your enemies."
msgstr ""
"Give motion and awareness to a tree, allowing it to shake free of the soil "
"and crush your enemies."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Flames of the Apocalypse"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Flames of the Apocalypse"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Flames of the Apocalypse"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flames of the Apocalypse"
msgid ""
"Call forth an inner fire from every enemy in the spell's radius, causing "
"multiple explosions."
msgstr ""
"Call forth an inner fire from every enemy in the spell's radius, causing "
"multiple explosions."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Witchsight"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Witchsight"
msgstr[0] "巫术视觉卷轴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Witchsight"
msgid ""
"Open up your senses to detect the brighter ley lines of those who habitually "
"use their magic."
msgstr ""
"Open up your senses to detect the brighter ley lines of those who habitually "
"use their magic."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Formula of Morphogenic Mastery"
msgid_plural "Formulae of Morphogenic Mastery"
msgstr[0] "Formulae of Morphogenic Mastery"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Formula of Morphogenic Mastery"
msgid ""
"This research paper has an extremely complicated series of formulae with "
"various genetic code diagrams interspersed.  It claims that the spell will "
"allow conscious control over any \"morphogenic alterations\"."
msgstr ""
"This research paper has an extremely complicated series of formulae with "
"various genetic code diagrams interspersed.  It claims that the spell will "
"allow conscious control over any \"morphogenic alterations\"."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Repulsion Wave"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Repulsion Wave"
msgstr[0] "Scrolls of Repulsion Wave"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Repulsion Wave"
msgid ""
"Unless a wave of force to hurl anyone nearby backwards.  Great for the "
"commute."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Technomancer's Guide to Debugging C:DDA"
msgid_plural "copies of A Technomancer's Guide to Debugging C:DDA"
msgstr[0] "《科技巫師指南：為C:DDA除錯》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "A Technomancer's Guide to Debugging C:DDA"
msgid "static std::string description( spell sp ) const;"
msgstr "static std::string 描述（法術 sp）const;"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Beginner's Guide to Magic"
msgid_plural "copies of A Beginner's Guide to Magic"
msgstr[0] "《魔法初學指南》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "A Beginner's Guide to Magic"
msgid ""
"You would describe this as more like a pamphlet than a spellbook, but it "
"seems to have at least a few interesting spells you can use."
msgstr "比起一本魔法书，你更愿意把它描述为一本小册子，但似乎它至少有几个你可以使用的有趣法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "An Introduction to Applied Meteorology"
msgid_plural "copies of An Introduction to Applied Meteorology"
msgstr[0] "《氣象運用介紹》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "An Introduction to Applied Meteorology"
msgid ""
"A professional-looking book on stormshaping, structured after many college "
"textbooks.  It has less to apply than one might expect from its size."
msgstr "一本關於風暴形成的專業書籍，是根據許多大學教科書編排而成。比起這厚重的書本，它所能應用的東西比預期要少的多。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wizarding Guide to Backpacking"
msgid_plural "copies of Wizarding Guide to Backpacking"
msgstr[0] "《背包旅行的巫師指南》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Wizarding Guide to Backpacking"
msgid ""
"This appears to be the spell version of a guide for what things to take with "
"you when backpacking.  It's a little bulky, but will certainly prove useful."
msgstr "這似乎是背包旅行指南的法術版本，教導你該打包何物以進行背包旅行。它雖然笨重了點，但是卻提供很多有用的資訊。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pyromancy for Heretics"
msgid_plural "copies of Pyromancy for Heretics"
msgstr[0] "《異教徒的火焰占卜》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Pyromancy for Heretics"
msgid "This charred husk of a book still contains many ways to light things aflame."
msgstr "這本書雖然有著燒焦的書皮，卻仍然記述著許多點燃物品的方法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Treatise on Magical Elements"
msgid_plural "copies of A Treatise on Magical Elements"
msgstr[0] "《魔法元素專論》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "A Treatise on Magical Elements"
msgid ""
"This details complex diagrams, rituals, and choreography that describes "
"various spells."
msgstr "這本書以詳細而複雜圖表、儀式和動作順序來介紹各種法術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Limits of Magical Recovery"
msgid_plural "copies of The Limits of Magical Recovery"
msgstr[0] "魔法疗愈的局限性"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Limits of Magical Recovery"
msgid ""
"A study of the progress of using magic to cure ailments and heal wounds "
"throughout the ages, from the earliest simple rituals to set bones all the "
"way through modern thaumaturgical research into cancer treatments and curing "
"Orcus's disease.  Some of the descriptions are detailed enough to be used as "
"spell formulae."
msgstr ""
"A study of the progress of using magic to cure ailments and heal wounds "
"throughout the ages, from the earliest simple rituals to set bones all the "
"way through modern thaumaturgical research into cancer treatments and curing "
"Orcus's disease.  Some of the descriptions are detailed enough to be used as "
"spell formulae."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Paladin's Guide to Modern Spellcasting"
msgid_plural "copies of The Paladin's Guide to Modern Spellcasting"
msgstr[0] "《聖騎士的現代施法指南》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Winter's Eternal Grasp"
msgid_plural "copies of Winter's Eternal Grasp"
msgstr[0] "《冬日的永恆掌握》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Winter's Eternal Grasp"
msgid "This slim book almost seems to be made from ice, it's cold to the touch."
msgstr "這本小冊子似乎是冰製的，摸起來很冰冷。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Tome of The Oncoming Storm"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of The Oncoming Storm"
msgstr[0] "《迎向暴風魔典》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Tome of The Oncoming Storm"
msgid ""
"A large book embossed with crossed lightning bolts and storm clouds, it "
"tingles to the touch."
msgstr "封面浮飾著交叉閃電與暴雨雲圖樣的大部頭書。觸摸著它會讓你感到微微的刺痛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Bioelectricity, An Arcane Approach"
msgid_plural "copies of Bioelectricity, An Arcane Approach"
msgstr[0] "生化电学，以奥术方法分析"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Bioelectricity, An Arcane Approach"
msgid ""
"A small, but thick book, that covers the most recent developments in the "
"field, including real examples."
msgstr "一本小而厚的书，涵盖了该领域的最新发展，其中包含了一些真实的案例。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Blow You Away"
msgid_plural "copies of Blow You Away"
msgstr[0] "风卷残云"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Blow You Away"
msgid ""
"A large, illustrated book, that describes the unpopular side of stormshaping "
"- wind control.  Despite being less \"cool\", it has more control, and can be "
"as devastating as lightning."
msgstr "一本大型插图书，描述了风暴塑形中不太流行的一方面——风的控制。尽管不如其他元素那么“酷”，但它更易于掌控，并且可以像闪电一样具有毁灭性的力量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "How Electromancy Changed the Vietnam War"
msgid_plural "copies of How Electromancy Changed the Vietnam War"
msgstr[0] "电力学如何改变越南战争"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "How Electromancy Changed the Vietnam War"
msgid ""
"A scholarly work, that discusses the electromancy boom in the 60's and how "
"the mass military draft of fresh, inexperienced mages changed the war, with "
"examples of tactics and spells used by year.  Summary says \"it changed "
"nothing\"."
msgstr "一部学术著作，论述了60年代电法术的爆发式增长，以及征召大量的新手法师如何改变了战争，书中列举了各年使用的战术和法术实例。其摘要中写道：“它并未改变什么。”"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Nondescript Spellbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Nondescript Spellbook"
msgstr[0] "《不倫不類的法術書》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Nondescript Spellbook"
msgid "A small book, containing spells created by a novice magician."
msgstr "一本小書，記述著由新手魔法師創造的法術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Of Light and Falsehoods"
msgid_plural "copies of Of Light and Falsehoods"
msgstr[0] "《光與虛假》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Of Light and Falsehoods"
msgid "A small white book, it subtly amplifies the ambient light around it."
msgstr "一本很小的白皮書，它巧妙的放大了周圍的環境光。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Tome of Flesh"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of Flesh"
msgstr[0] "《血肉魔典》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Tome of Flesh"
msgid "A small tome, seemingly covered in tanned human skin."
msgstr "一本小專論，封面似乎是鞣製後的人皮。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Book of Trees"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of Trees"
msgstr[0] "《樹之書》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Book of Trees"
msgid "A bark covered book."
msgstr "有著樹皮封面的書。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Utility of Mana as an Energy Source"
msgid_plural "copies of The Utility of Mana as an Energy Source"
msgstr[0] "《法力作為能源的效用》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Utility of Mana as an Energy Source"
msgid ""
"This book details spells that use your mana to recover various physiological "
"effects."
msgstr "本書詳細介紹了使用你的法力來恢復各種生理效果的法術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Farm-Wizard's Almanac"
msgid_plural "copies of The Farm-Wizard's Almanac"
msgstr[0] "农场法师年鉴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Farm-Wizard's Almanac"
msgid ""
"While no longer popular in the age of nitrogen fertilizer and industrial farm "
"equipment, copies of this tome continued to be published for years for a "
"small audience of back-to-nature, do-it-yourself organic mage-farmers."
msgstr "虽然在氮肥和工业化农机时代，这本小册子已不再流行，但多年来，这本小册子仍在为少数回归自然、自己动手的有机农夫出版。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Tome of The Battle Mage"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of The Battle Mage"
msgstr[0] "《戰鬥法師魔典》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Tome of The Battle Mage"
msgid ""
"Your standard wizardy looking spellbook, filled with Magus combat spells.  "
"You sure lucked out!"
msgstr "以你的法師標準來看此書，內容滿是祆教徒的戰鬥法術。你真幸運！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Tome of the Hollow Earth"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of the Hollow Earth"
msgstr[0] "《空靈大地魔典》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Tome of the Hollow Earth"
msgid ""
"This large dusty spellbook seems perpetually, well, dusty.  It contains a "
"considerable amount of earthly power."
msgstr ""
"这本尘封的大型魔法书似乎总是被灰尘覆盖着。它蕴含着惊人的的大地之力。 \n"
" "

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Memoirs of the Champion of Earth"
msgid_plural "copies of Memoirs of the Champion of Earth"
msgstr[0] "地球卫士回忆录"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Memoirs of the Champion of Earth"
msgid ""
"A book written by someone obviously very self-absorbed who describes himself "
"as \"Chosen of Gaia, the Only Champion of Terra\".  Despite his arrogance, "
"his mastery in combining different earthshaper's abilities as described in "
"the book make him an accomplished sorcerer worth learning from."
msgstr ""
"由一位显然非常自恋的人所写的书，他自称为“盖亚神选，唯一的大地冠军”。尽管他非常傲慢，但他在书中描述的那些，将不同塑地者的能力结合起来的大师级技巧，使他成为"
"一个值得学习的杰出巫师。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "One Spell is All You Need!"
msgid_plural "copies of One Spell is All You Need!"
msgstr[0] "一个法术就够了！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "One Spell is All You Need!"
msgid ""
"This advertising booklet promotes one spell that allows you to create a "
"different tool for different purposes.  Surprisingly, it works as the book "
"says - you can change the shape of your tool, depending on your needs."
msgstr "一本广告小册子宣传的一个法术，能够让你为不同目的创造不同的工具。令人惊讶，就像书里说的，你可以依据你的需要改来你工具的形状。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Tome of Magical Movement"
msgid_plural "copies of The Tome of Magical Movement"
msgstr[0] "《魔法位移魔典》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Tome of Magical Movement"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This small lightweight book seems to almost not entirely exist, let's say it "
"97% does.  It contains Magus spells focused on movement."
msgstr "這本又小又輕的書感覺似乎不存在，可說97%是這樣。它包含了專門用於移動的祆教徒法術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Smudged Scroll"
msgid_plural "Smudged Scrolls"
msgstr[0] "污跡卷軸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Smudged Scroll"
msgid ""
"This looks like someone was designing a new spell, but spilled a mug of "
"coffee on it and crumpled it up in anger.  You can tell that it will "
"definitely cast something, but you can't be sure that it will work very well."
msgstr "這看起來像是有人正在設計一個新的法術，卻在上面灑了一大杯咖啡而且憤怒地揉皺它。你覺得它肯定能施展出什麼法術，但是你不確定是好是壞。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Necromantic Minions for Dummies"
msgid_plural "copies of Necromantic Minions for Dummies"
msgstr[0] "《死靈奴僕的傻瓜指南》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Necromantic Minions for Dummies"
msgid ""
"This book details various ways of summoning an undead minion to fight for "
"you.  They all appear to disappear after a short time, crumbling to dust."
msgstr "這本書詳細介紹了召喚不死小兵為你作戰的各種方法。它們似乎都會在很短的時間消失，散成塵埃。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Fundamentals of Technomancy"
msgid_plural "copies of Fundamentals of Technomancy"
msgstr[0] "《科技巫術的基本原理》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Fundamentals of Technomancy"
msgid ""
"This thick manual instructs the spellcaster on manipulating and empowering "
"various forms of matter and energy."
msgstr "這本厚厚的說明書指導施法者如何操縱和賦予各種形式的物質與能量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Complete Idiot's Guide to Technomancy"
msgid_plural "copies of Complete Idiot's Guide to Technomancy"
msgstr[0] "《科技巫術的完全傻瓜指南》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Complete Idiot's Guide to Technomancy"
msgid ""
"This colorful guide, full of diagrams and cartoons, teaches a couple of very "
"basic Technomancy spells for the not-so-bright pupils."
msgstr "這個色彩繽紛的指南，充滿了圖表和漫畫，教授給不那麼聰明的學生幾個非常基本的科技巫師法術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Technomancy and the Electromagnetic Spectrum"
msgid_plural "copies of Technomancy and the Electromagnetic Spectrum"
msgstr[0] "《科技巫術與電磁波譜》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Technomancy and the Electromagnetic Spectrum"
msgid ""
"This lab reference material book is thick and overflowing with information on "
"combining magic with EM radiation."
msgstr "這本實驗室參考資料書很厚，內含關於魔法與電磁輻射相結合的大量資訊。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Mage-Engineer's Practical Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of The Mage-Engineer's Practical Guide"
msgstr[0] "工程法师的实用指南书"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Mage-Engineer's Practical Guide"
msgid ""
"This is a heavy, university thaumaturgical-program-level guidebook.  It "
"discusses the various practical applications of magic in repairwork and "
"engineering, with a focus on immediately-usable techniques instead of airy "
"theoretical approaches."
msgstr "这是一本厚重的，大学级别的魔法学课程指南手册。它讨论了魔法在维修工作和实际工程中的各种应用，这本书专注于那些即用性的技术，而不是空洞的理论方法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Liminal Pathways"
msgid_plural "copies of Liminal Pathways"
msgstr[0] "《界域通道》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Liminal Pathways"
msgid ""
"A famous animist grimoire from early modernity.  Its cryptic passages "
"describe and map connections between the spiritual world and ours."
msgstr "一本著名的早期现代性泛灵师魔法书。它用晦涩难懂的段落叙述及描绘了灵界和我们所在世界之间的联系。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Runic Tablet shard"
msgid_plural "Runic Tablet shards"
msgstr[0] "符文板碎片"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Runic Tablet shard"
msgid ""
"A small tablet of blackened stone, apparently cut from a much larger slab.  "
"Golden runes glow over its surface, and slowly shift into intelligible "
"sentences when you stare at them."
msgstr "一小塊發黑的石頭，很明顯是從更大塊的石板上切下來的。金色的符文在它表面發出光輝，且當你注視時慢慢的轉變成你所能理解的語言。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Geospatial Systems: The Lie Of Linearity"
msgid_plural "copies of Geospatial Systems: The Lie Of Linearity"
msgstr[0] "《地理空間系統：線性的謊言》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Geospatial Systems: The Lie Of Linearity"
msgid ""
"This book outlines in great detail how time and space are wibbly-wobbly and "
"non-Euclidean.  It also appears to have a dozen different coordinate systems "
"that it uses nearly interchangeably, which makes it hard to follow.  There's "
"lots of jargon, but with intense study you can probably learn a thing or two "
"about portals."
msgstr ""
"這本書非常詳細地記述了時間和空間如何的搖擺不定而且不是歐幾里德距離。它也有十幾種不同的坐標系，幾乎可以互換使用，這使得它很難遵循。雖然書內有大量的術語，但經"
"過深入研究，你可能會學到一些關於傳送門的東西。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Forbidden Tome"
msgid_plural "Forbidden Tomes"
msgstr[0] "禁忌之書"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Forbidden Tome"
msgid ""
"A very, very old and heavy tome of various spells lost to the ages, either "
"for good reason, or simply through the passage of time.  There are very few "
"copies in existence, usually owned by those of great power, and yet all of "
"them seem to have the last dozen pages or so torn out, in haste."
msgstr ""
"一本非常、非常古老的沉重典籍，里面有各种各样的早已失传的法术，要么出于合理原因，要么只是因为时间流逝而失传。该书现存传世副本极少，通常仅为那些有权势之人所有"
"，但似乎所有副本都被十分匆忙地撕去了最后的十几页。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Transcendence of the Human Condition"
msgid_plural "copies of Transcendence of the Human Condition"
msgstr[0] "《超越人體的極限》"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Transcendence of the Human Condition"
msgid ""
"The Human is the only creature that seeks to improve himself.  This study "
"examines different spells that can heighten various senses temporarily, in "
"hopes to discover a more permanent solution."
msgstr "人類是唯一尋求改善自己的生物。本研究考察了可以暫時提升各種感官的不同法術，希望能找到更持久的解決方案。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Wherever You've Gone, There You Can Be"
msgid_plural "copies of Wherever You've Gone, There You Can Be"
msgstr[0] "无论你走到哪里，你都可以在那里"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Wherever You've Gone, There You Can Be"
msgid ""
"A very sarcastically-written guide to using magic to get into and out of "
"places you absolutely are not supposed to be."
msgstr "这是一本非常讽刺的指南，教你如何使用魔法进出你绝对不应该去的地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "It's the End of the World, But You'll Feel Fine"
msgid_plural "copies of It's the End of the World, But You'll Feel Fine"
msgstr[0] "这是世界末日，但你会感觉很好"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "It's the End of the World, But You'll Feel Fine"
msgid ""
"This thick paperback book is a collection of the proper magical preparations "
"to survive various disasters.  Unfortunately, the zombie apocalypse section "
"doesn't account for everything that's gone wrong in the Cataclysm, but "
"there's still a lot of useful knowledge here."
msgstr "这本厚厚的平装书收集了在各种灾难中生存的正确魔法准备。 遗憾的是，\"丧尸启示录 \"部分没有考虑到大灾变中出现的所有问题，但这里仍有很多有用的知识。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Elven Path"
msgid ""
"Written by the elven archdruid Tylindel Melithilarahd over 500 years ago, "
"this weighty tome was considered *the* most important book of the Harmonist "
"druidic movement up until just before the Cataclysm.  Archdruid "
"Melithilarahd's death in 2016 ended his overt patronage of his own works, "
"allowing other writers to attempt to make their mark, especially younger "
"elves who did not have such a strident anti-modern attitude.  In addition to "
"all the philosophical essays about the importance of living in harmony with "
"nature and allowing plants to grow where they will are several plant-based "
"druidic spells."
msgstr ""
"这本厚重的书是由精灵德鲁伊——泰林德尔·梅丽瑟拉拉德在500多年前撰写的，直到大灾变前都被认为是“和谐主义”德鲁伊运动中最重要的书籍。德鲁伊梅丽瑟拉拉德于2"
"016年去世，结束了他对自己作品的公开支持，使其他作家得以尝试留下自己的印记，尤其是那些没有如此强烈的反现代态度的年轻精灵。书中除了关于与自然和谐共生及允许"
"植物自由生长的重要性的哲学论文外，还包括了几种基于植物的德鲁伊法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Lazy Mage's How-to Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of The Lazy Mage's How-to Guide"
msgstr[0] "懒惰法师的操作指南"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Lazy Mage's How-to Guide"
msgid ""
"A thin book full of spells designed to help the practitioner short-cut having "
"to actually do any work.  Considering the effort involved in studying magic, "
"you're not sure any actual time is being saved."
msgstr "一本薄薄的书，充满了旨在帮助从业者缩短实际工作时间的法术。考虑到学习这些魔法所需的努力，你不确定是否真的能节省任何时间。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Arcano-hiking for Fun"
msgid_plural "copies of Arcano-hiking for Fun"
msgstr[0] "奥秘徒步旅行的乐趣"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Arcano-hiking for Fun"
msgid ""
"A thin book about the usefulness of magic in hiking, such as keeping clean, "
"keeping the weather good, staying dry, and otherwise avoiding all the "
"problems of the mundane outdoors."
msgstr "一本薄薄的书，有关魔法在徒步旅行中的用法，例如保持清洁、维持天气良好、保持干燥，以及避免其他世俗户外活动中的所有问题。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Effects of Technological Progress on Magic"
msgid_plural "copies of The Effects of Technological Progress on Magic"
msgstr[0] "技术进步对魔法的影响"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Effects of Technological Progress on Magic"
msgid ""
"A thick book about the history of magic's interactions with technology.  It "
"delves deeply into why technological solutions have mostly replaced magic in "
"daily life even though mages can have immense personal power: the "
"incompatibility of Control and Harmony schools, the technological ease-of-use "
"from the end-user perspective, and even the way some nations' legal systems "
"have worked to discourage magic use so as to prevent individuals from "
"attaining too much power."
msgstr ""
"一本关于魔法与技术相互作用的历史的厚书。 "
"它深入探讨了为什么技术解决方案在日常生活中大部分取代了魔法，尽管法师可以拥有巨大的个人力量：控制与和谐学派的不兼容，从最终使用者的角度来看技术的易用性，甚至"
"各国的法律体系一直致力于阻止魔法的使用，以防止个人获得过多的力量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Home Mage's Healthcare Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of The Home Mage's Healthcare Manual"
msgstr[0] "家庭法师的保健手册"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Home Mage's Healthcare Manual"
msgid ""
"A reference book for the practical use of magic in healing the sort of wounds "
"that are likely to occur at home: burns from cooking, scraped knees, cuts "
"from knives, bruises, colds and the flu, and so on."
msgstr "一本实用的，关于治疗在家中可能发生的受伤的魔法参考书：例如治疗烹饪烧伤、膝盖擦伤、刀伤、淤青、感冒和流感等。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ""
"Travels Among the Ljósálfar: Their Customs, Food, Lifestyle, Celebrations, "
"and Ceremonies"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Travels Among the Ljósálfar: Their Customs, Food, Lifestyle, "
"Celebrations, and Ceremonies"
msgstr[0] "与光精灵同行：他们的习俗，食物，生活方式，庆祝活动和仪式"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Travels Among the Ljósálfar: Their Customs, Food,
#. Lifestyle, Celebrations, and Ceremonies"
msgid ""
"An old 19th-century travelogue, detailing the author's travels among the "
"elven tribes of northern Greenland.  The section about the midwinter festival "
"and the northern lights is particularly detailed."
msgstr "一本19世纪的古老旅行记，详细记述了作者在格陵兰北部精灵部落中的旅行。书中关于隆冬节和极光的描述部分特别详细。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Storm Chasing In Complete Safety"
msgid_plural "copies of Storm Chasing In Complete Safety"
msgstr[0] "如何安全追逐风暴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Storm Chasing In Complete Safety"
msgid ""
"A description of weather patterns, geological formations in particularly "
"storm-prone areas, essays from well-known storm chasers, proper equipment and "
"safety, how to keep dry, and a way to use magic to completely avoid any "
"possible danger from the storm itself.  The book does explicitly warn that if "
"a tree falls on you, you're on your own, though, so the title seems to be "
"more than half marketing."
msgstr ""
"这本书描述了特别容易发生暴风雨的地质形态以及气象模式、也包含了著名追风者的文章、适当的装备介绍，一些安全知识、如何在暴风雨中如何保持干燥，以及如何使用魔法以"
"完全避免暴风雨本身的任何可能危险。然而书中明确警告，如果非常不幸树砸在了你的身上，你就只能自认倒霉，所以似乎书名大半都是营销的噱头。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Fashion Over Function: A Thaumaturgical Guide to Wearing Whatever, Whenever"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Fashion Over Function: A Thaumaturgical Guide to Wearing Whatever, "
"Whenever"
msgstr[0] "时尚胜过功能：何时何地穿何物的奇术指南"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Fashion Over Function: A Thaumaturgical Guide to Wearing
#. Whatever, Whenever"
msgid ""
"A thin guide to using magic to avoid extremes of both hot and cold, allowing "
"you to design your wardrobe around always looking good rather than having to "
"account for summer's heat or winter's chill."
msgstr "一本关于利用魔法来避免极端酷热或严寒的简易指南，让你能够设计自己的衣橱，不必考虑夏天的酷热或冬天的寒冷，始终保持良好的外观，"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Cat Cafe at Home!"
msgid_plural "copies of A Cat Cafe at Home!"
msgstr[0] "家有猫咖！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "A Cat Cafe at Home!"
msgid ""
"A very thin book, filled with glossy photos, about how to use druidic magic "
"to call up cats whenever you are feeling lonely, if you can't afford one, or "
"if you live in a place that doesn't normally allow pets.  The people in the "
"photos watching half-a-dozen cats play sure look happy."
msgstr ""
"一本插入了很多精妙照片的，非常薄的书，书中介绍了如果你买不起猫，或者生活在通常不允许养宠物的地方，如何在你感到孤独时使用德鲁伊魔法召唤猫。照片中欣赏很多嬉戏"
"中的猫的人们看起来非常开心。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Save Water and Time, with Magic!"
msgid_plural "copies of Save Water and Time, with Magic!"
msgstr[0] "节水省时的魔法"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Save Water and Time, with Magic!"
msgid ""
"This very thin booklet about the ecological benefits of using magic instead "
"of a mundane morning cleaning routine.  At the bottom of the back cover is an "
"abstract logo of two people holding both hands with a tree growing through "
"the resulting circle, and the words \"Gaia's Children\" beneath it."
msgstr ""
"这本非常薄的小册子讲述了使用魔法而不是世俗的常规清晨清洁所带来的生态益处。在封底的底部是一个抽象的标志，两个人手拉手，形成一个圆圈，一个树从圆圈中生长出来，"
"下面写着“盖亚的子女”。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mystic Survival in the End Times"
msgid_plural "copies of Mystic Survival in the End Times"
msgstr[0] "末世玄妙生存法"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Mystic Survival in the End Times"
msgid ""
"A somewhat alarmist book about the ways to survive after the collapse of "
"civilization, using simple magic to deal with common problems.  Sadly, there "
"are no anti-zombie combat spells within."
msgstr "一本有些危言耸听的书，讲述了在文明崩溃后生存的方法，以及使用简单的魔法来解决常见问题。不幸的是，书中没有关于反僵尸的战斗法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Landscaping with Earthshaping"
msgid_plural "copies of Landscaping with Earthshaping"
msgstr[0] "塑地法术景观设计"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Landscaping with Earthshaping"
msgid ""
"A guide to using earthshaping magic to shortcut the backbreaking work of "
"digging and hauling needed to redo one's yard."
msgstr "一本指南，介绍如何利用塑地魔法来减少重新布置庭院时费力的挖掘和搬运工作。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Limitations of the Mana Economy"
msgid_plural "copies of The Limitations of the Mana Economy"
msgstr[0] "魔力经济的局限性"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Limitations of the Mana Economy"
msgid ""
"A study of the inherent non-scalability of magical solutions to problems, "
"touching on the difficulty of producing crystallized mana in the quantities "
"needed for industrial use, the long time period necessary for magical "
"materials like orichalcum, mithril, or crimsonite to reach reliability, the "
"way that earthshaping and druidism specifically require wilderness for some "
"of their spells, and the way that an average mage exhausts their mana pool "
"within fifteen minutes of working on any major project without extensive "
"study and training."
msgstr ""
"A study of the inherent non-scalability of magical solutions to problems, "
"touching on the difficulty of producing crystallized mana in the quantities "
"needed for industrial use, the long time period necessary for magical "
"materials like orichalcum, mithril, or crimsonite to reach reliability, the "
"way that earthshaping and druidism specifically require wilderness for some "
"of their spells, and the way that an average mage exhausts their mana pool "
"within fifteen minutes of working on any major project without extensive "
"study and training."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Make Your Own Special Effects"
msgid_plural "copies of Make Your Own Special Effects"
msgstr[0] "创造属于你自己的特效"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Make Your Own Special Effects"
msgid ""
"A guide to using magic to create practical special effects, whether for a "
"birthday celebration, house party, or simply for your own amusement."
msgstr "使用魔法创造实用特效的指南，无论是用于生日庆祝、家庭聚会，还是仅用于娱乐自己。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Gardening the Druidic Way"
msgid_plural "copies of Gardening the Druidic Way"
msgstr[0] "像德鲁伊一样栽培"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Gardening the Druidic Way"
msgid ""
"A reference tome for using magic to garden in a \"organic, traditional, "
"earth-centered way\", as the back cover states."
msgstr ""
"A reference tome for using magic to garden in a \"organic, traditional, "
"earth-centered way\", as the back cover states."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Let No Wall Stand in Your Way!"
msgid_plural "copies of Let No Wall Stand in Your Way!"
msgstr[0] "copies of Let No Wall Stand in Your Way!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Let No Wall Stand in Your Way!"
msgid ""
"This book claims to be an aid to people who always forget their keys or need "
"to get into their car quickly, but the selection of spells seems pretty "
"suspicious to you."
msgstr ""
"This book claims to be an aid to people who always forget their keys or need "
"to get into their car quickly, but the selection of spells seems pretty "
"suspicious to you."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Study of Nethereum Incursions"
msgid_plural "copies of A Study of Nethereum Incursions"
msgstr[0] "copies of A Study of Nethereum Incursions"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "A Study of Nethereum Incursions"
msgid ""
"An academic book about the history of known Nethereum incursions, including "
"the 1908 Tunguska incident, the disappearance of the army of Cambyses, "
"various dancing plagues, the earthquake that destroyed the kingdom of "
"Mgarzhbag, the Week Without Sun in the 7th century, and more, along with a "
"variety of speculation about possible other historical and pre-historical "
"incursions."
msgstr ""
"An academic book about the history of known Nethereum incursions, including "
"the 1908 Tunguska incident, the disappearance of the army of Cambyses, "
"various dancing plagues, the earthquake that destroyed the kingdom of "
"Mgarzhbag, the Week Without Sun in the 7th century, and more, along with a "
"variety of speculation about possible other historical and pre-historical "
"incursions."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Born of a Gale: A Taxonomy of Air and Weather Spirits"
msgid_plural "copies of Born of a Gale: A Taxonomy of Air and Weather Spirits"
msgstr[0] "生于狂风：空气、天气精灵鬼怪的分类学"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Born of a Gale: A Taxonomy of Air and Weather Spirits"
msgid ""
"A formal study of the various sylphs, anemoi, shedim, hytersprites, hyades, "
"ame-onna, and other spirits associated with air, wind, or weather."
msgstr ""
"对各种风元素、阿涅弥伊（古希腊神话风神）、谢迪姆（希伯来神话伪神）、海特灵（英国神话妖精）、许阿得斯（古希腊神话雨仙女）、雨女（日本神话妖怪）以及其他各种空"
"气、风或天气相关的精灵鬼怪的正式研究。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Akyâluaban and Ghâzkhud are words from a fictional language and should
#. not be translated.
msgid "Akyâluaban: the Book of the Living Stone"
msgid_plural "copies of Akyâluaban: the Book of the Living Stone"
msgstr[0] "copies of Akyâluaban: the Book of the Living Stone"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Akyâluaban: the Book of the Living Stone"
msgid ""
"A copy of a religious text from the Ghâzkhud dwarven religion.  Amidst the "
"prayers and songs and meditations on the ancestors and the earth and the "
"stones are some spells, though pious traditional ghâzkhudians would react "
"with shock if you called them that."
msgstr ""
"A copy of a religious text from the Ghâzkhud dwarven religion.  Amidst the "
"prayers and songs and meditations on the ancestors and the earth and the "
"stones are some spells, though pious traditional ghâzkhudians would react "
"with shock if you called them that."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Magical Method of Tidying Up"
msgid_plural "copies of The Magical Method of Tidying Up"
msgstr[0] "魔法整理术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Magical Method of Tidying Up"
msgid ""
"This obvious cash-in book does have some actual practical spells amongst all "
"the philosophical-sounding essays about the importance of cleanliness."
msgstr ""
"This obvious cash-in book does have some actual practical spells amongst all "
"the philosophical-sounding essays about the importance of cleanliness."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Healing Power of Nature"
msgid_plural "copies of The Healing Power of Nature"
msgstr[0] "大自然的治愈力"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Healing Power of Nature"
msgid ""
"A description of the various ways to use natural herbs and plants to fuel "
"magical healing.  There is a lot of useful knowledge of here if you sift "
"through the book and filter out the various chapters about the dangers of "
"allopathic medicine and modern post-industrial lifestyles."
msgstr ""
"A description of the various ways to use natural herbs and plants to fuel "
"magical healing.  There is a lot of useful knowledge of here if you sift "
"through the book and filter out the various chapters about the dangers of "
"allopathic medicine and modern post-industrial lifestyles."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Now You See We: Technomantic Transit In Action"
msgid_plural "copies of Now You See We: Technomantic Transit In Action"
msgstr[0] "现在你看到我们了：科技魔法传输应用"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Now You See We: Technomantic Transit In Action"
msgid ""
"A book about how technomancy, usually thought of as being based around "
"electricity and human enhancement, somehow also encompasses quick moment but "
"only when holograms are involved.  At least half the book is descriptions of "
"experiments performed by research thaumaturges to find the exact boundaries "
"of technomancy when movement is involved."
msgstr ""
"一本关于科技魔法的书，通常被认为基于电力和人体强化内容，在某种程度上也包含了快速，但仅限于涉及全息图。这本书至少有一半是对研究人员进行的实验的描述，他们希望"
"在涉及运动的情况下找到科技魔法的确切边界。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magical Mishaps: When Spells Go Wrong"
msgid_plural "copies of Magical Mishaps: When Spells Go Wrong"
msgstr[0] "copies of Magical Mishaps: When Spells Go Wrong"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Magical Mishaps: When Spells Go Wrong"
msgid ""
"A series of stories of the various ways magic can go wrong if the wrong "
"ingredients, words, or gestures are used.  A lot of the stories are merely "
"funny, like the magus who in trying to alter the Sorcerer's Hand spell caused "
"music to follow her everywhere she went, but there's the occasional real "
"tragedy mixed in as a cautionary tale."
msgstr ""
"这是一个系列故事，讲述了如果使用了错误的材料、词语或手势，魔法可能出错的各种方式。 很多故事都很有趣，比如一个魔法师在试图改变 “巫师之手 "
"”的咒语时，导致她所到之处音乐如影随形，但偶尔也会有真正的悲剧发生，以儆效尤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Intermittent Fasting Using Biomancy"
msgid_plural "copies of Intermittent Fasting Using Biomancy"
msgstr[0] "copies of Intermittent Fasting Using Biomancy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Intermittent Fasting Using Biomancy"
msgid ""
"A guide to using biomancy to perform extreme intermittent fasting, eating an "
"enormous amount of food only once every 2-5 days, depending on the mage's "
"skill.  The book is filled with both glossy photos of extremely fit, "
"beautiful people and warnings to make sure that your stomach isn't full when "
"the spell wears off."
msgstr ""
"这是一本使用生化魔法进行极限间歇性禁食的指南，即每2-5"
"天只用吃一顿巨量的食物，具体取决于施法者的魔法水平。书中既有身材姣好、容貌出众的人物图片，也有提醒读者在法术效果消失时确保处于空腹状态的警告。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Year of Living Without Magic"
msgid_plural "copies of A Year of Living Without Magic"
msgstr[0] "告别魔法生活一年"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "A Year of Living Without Magic"
msgid ""
"A guide to living without any magic at all, including ways to perform tasks "
"that were traditionally performed with magic, such as starting fires, tending "
"minor wounds, cooking and preserving food, doing laundry, and so on.  "
"Somewhat hypocritically, it does include a dispelling spell in the back of "
"the book."
msgstr ""
"这本指南教你如何不用魔法完成各种日常任务，比如点火、处理小伤口、烹饪和保存食物、洗衣等等。\n"
"有些讽刺的是，文末附带了一个驱散魔法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Beyond Sleeping Easy with Sorcery"
msgid_plural "copies of Beyond Sleeping Easy with Sorcery"
msgstr[0] "copies of Beyond Sleeping Easy with Sorcery"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Beyond Sleeping Easy with Sorcery"
msgid ""
"This self-help book is themed around the Peaceful Rest spell, famed before "
"the Cataclysm as an easy way to avoid tossing and turning.  Laudably, the "
"book seems to be mostly about eventually weaning the reader off the need to "
"cast a spell to be able to fall asleep on time."
msgstr ""
"This self-help book is themed around the Peaceful Rest spell, famed before "
"the Cataclysm as an easy way to avoid tossing and turning.  Laudably, the "
"book seems to be mostly about eventually weaning the reader off the need to "
"cast a spell to be able to fall asleep on time."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Practical Pyromancy, Seventh Edition"
msgid_plural "copies of Practical Pyromancy, Seventh Edition"
msgstr[0] "实用火焰占卜法第七版"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Practical Pyromancy, Seventh Edition"
msgid ""
"The 2020 edition of the classic tome of fire magic, not containing any "
"restricted battle magic but popular all the same."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Rites of the First Circle"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rites of the First Circle"
msgstr[0] "第一环仪式"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Rites of the First Circle"
msgid ""
"A weighty tome containing all three of the Rites of the First Circle, the "
"rituals used by dedicated mages to increase their ability to channel and "
"recover mana."
msgstr ""
"A weighty tome containing all three of the Rites of the First Circle, the "
"rituals used by dedicated mages to increase their ability to channel and "
"recover mana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Pool"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Pool"
msgstr[0] "copies of The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Pool"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Pool"
msgid ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to slightly increase "
"the efficiency by which the mage's body processes mana."
msgstr ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to slightly increase "
"the efficiency by which the mage's body processes mana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Pool"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Pool"
msgstr[0] "copies of The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Pool"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Pool"
msgid ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to increase the "
"efficiency by which the mage's body processes mana."
msgstr ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to increase the "
"efficiency by which the mage's body processes mana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Flow"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Flow"
msgstr[0] "第一环仪式：魔力流动"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Flow"
msgid ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to slightly increase "
"the rate by which the mage's body regains mana."
msgstr ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to slightly increase "
"the rate by which the mage's body regains mana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Flow"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Flow"
msgstr[0] "第二环仪式：魔力流动"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Flow"
msgid ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to increase the rate "
"by which the mage's body regains mana."
msgstr ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to increase the rate "
"by which the mage's body regains mana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Sense"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Sense"
msgstr[0] "第一环仪式：魔力感知"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Rite of the First Circle: Mana Sense"
msgid ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to slightly increase "
"the sensitivity that the mage's body has to  mana."
msgstr ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to slightly increase "
"the sensitivity that the mage's body has to  mana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Sense"
msgid_plural "copies of The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Sense"
msgstr[0] "第二环仪式：魔力感知"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "The Rite of the Second Circle: Mana Sense"
msgid ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to increase the "
"sensitivity that the mage's body has to mana."
msgstr ""
"A lengthy list of the rituals and components necessary to increase the "
"sensitivity that the mage's body has to mana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sail the High Seas with Sorcery on Your Side"
msgid_plural "copies of Sail the High Seas with Sorcery on Your Side"
msgstr[0] "魔法傍身的远航"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
#. ~ Description of "Sail the High Seas with Sorcery on Your Side"
msgid ""
"This romanticized book of dubious historical accuracy details how pirates "
"used magic to their advantage while sailing.  From better telescopes to banks "
"of fog to hide their approach, it seems that according to this author at "
"least, piracy was a true terror to behold."
msgstr "这本历史准确性存疑的浪漫主义书籍详细描述了海盗如何在航行中利用魔法来为自己谋利。 从更好的望远镜到掩盖他们接近的浓雾，至少在这位作者看来，海盗是真正的恐怖。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cauldron of purification"
msgid_plural "cauldrons of purification"
msgstr[0] "淨化鍋釜"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "cauldron of purification"
msgid ""
"This cauldron made of demon spider chitin seems to absorb the light.  It will "
"hold 16 liters of material and will absorb poisons from it.  It may have "
"other properties that require discovery."
msgstr "这个由恶魔蜘蛛甲壳所制成的大锅似乎正在吸收四周的光线。它能够容纳16升原料，并吸收其中的毒素。它可能还有其他需要你发现的隐藏属性。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orichalcum cauldron"
msgid_plural "orichalcum cauldrons"
msgstr[0] "奧利哈鋼鍋釜"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "orichalcum cauldron"
msgid ""
"This is an alchemical cauldron made of orichalcum.  The metal is especially "
"resistant to the unique types of corrosion caused by alchemy."
msgstr "这是一个用山铜制成的炼金术大锅。这种金属特别耐炼金时产生的特殊腐蚀。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "demon forge"
msgid ""
"This is a portable version of the charcoal forge that is magically enhanced "
"and fortified with demon spider chitin in order to be able to resmelt magical "
"metals into their workable ingot form."
msgstr "一个便携式版本的火炭锻造台，它使用了恶魔蜘蛛甲壳进行附魔和强化，以便能够将魔法金属熔化成能够制造物品的锭。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fireproof mortar"
msgid_plural "fireproof mortar"
msgstr[0] "防火砂漿"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "fireproof mortar"
msgid ""
"Some alchemical mortar, ready to be used in building projects expecting "
"temperatures on par with dragonbreath."
msgstr "一堆炼金术制造的灰泥，已经准备好，随时可以用到需要抵抗龙炎般高温的工程建设项目中。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "parabolan wool staple"
msgid_plural "parabolan wool staples"
msgstr[0] "派瑞伯倫羊毛纖維"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "parabolan wool staple"
msgid ""
"The natural cluster of parabolan wool fibers.  Could be processed to felt "
"patches or yarns."
msgstr "一簇天然的派瑞伯倫羊毛纖維。可以加工成毛氈補丁或者紗線。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glassteel shard"
msgid_plural "glassteel shards"
msgstr[0] "玻璃鋼碎片"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "glassteel shard"
msgid ""
"A broken shard of glassteel covered in sharp edges.  You could use it as a "
"weapon, but you might want to wear gloves."
msgstr "一片碎玻璃钢，边缘锋利。可以拿来戳人，不过还是先戴上手套比较好。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magic Circle Rank 1"
msgid_plural "Magic Circles Rank 1"
msgstr[0] "魔法阵等级1"

