msgstr[0] "輕型奧利哈鋼框架"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/vehicle/frames.json
#. ~ Description of "light orichalcum frame"
msgid ""
"A frame made of orichalcum.  Partially torn down in order to reduce weight at "
