#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/skyisland/translocation_handling.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MAGICLYSM_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MOM_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
msgid ""
"You briefly see the familiar sights of the floating island before you feel a "
"wrenching sensation and you're suddenly back on the surface.  Whatever powers "
"have put you in this situation must not be happy with you trying to "
"circumvent the rules."
msgstr ""
"You briefly see the familiar sights of the floating island before you feel a "
"wrenching sensation and you're suddenly back on the surface.  Whatever powers "
"have put you in this situation must not be happy with you trying to "
"circumvent the rules."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/skyisland/translocation_handling.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MAGICLYSM_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MOM_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
msgid ""
"As you come out of the darkness and the cold and see the surface, you feel a "
"sudden wrenching sensation.  Pain washes over your entire body as your vision "
"goes red, and the air burns as you take in a ragged breath.  The powers "
"behind your situation are not happy at your attempt to circumvent their rules."
msgstr ""
"As you come out of the darkness and the cold and see the surface, you feel a "
"sudden wrenching sensation.  Pain washes over your entire body as your vision "
"goes red, and the air burns as you take in a ragged breath.  The powers "
"behind your situation are not happy at your attempt to circumvent their rules."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/skyisland/translocation_handling.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MAGICLYSM_SI_PRE_TELEPORT_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MOM_SI_PRE_TELEPORT_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_SI_PRE_TELEPORT_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
msgid "With an internal twist, you're suddenly back on the island."
msgstr "With an internal twist, you're suddenly back on the island."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "demon spiderling"
msgid_plural "demon spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "幼年惡魔蜘蛛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "demon spiderling"
msgid ""
"Despite it being the size of a small dog, you can tell this is a very young "
"spider.  Its red color is why you gave it this name; you have never seen this "
"creature before the Cataclysm.  It is quick, and its large fangs drip with "
"venom."
msgstr ""
"雖然牠已經有小狗大小的體型，但你仍然知道這只是非常幼小的惡魔蜘蛛。牠的血腥的紅色就是你稱牠惡魔的原因。在大災變之前你根本沒見過這種生物。牠行動快速，而且有正"
"滴著毒液的大毒牙。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "demon spider"
msgid_plural "demon spiders"
msgstr[0] "惡魔蜘蛛"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "demon spider"
msgid ""
"This spider is the size of a car.  Its huge compound eyes seem to be infinite "
"pools of blackness that seem to suck the light out of the air.  Its maroon "
"carapace is studded with wicked-looking spikes that drip with some kind of "
"viscous black liquid that sizzles when it touches the ground.  The air around "
"it wavers with heat."
msgstr ""
"这只蜘蛛有汽车那么大。它那巨大的复眼仿佛能吸收空中光亮的无尽黑暗。它的栗色甲壳上布满了看起来很邪恶的尖刺，滴着某种粘稠的黑色液体，接触地面时会发出咝咝声。它"
"周围的空气因热量而摇曳。"

