#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral elf"
msgid_plural "feral elves"
msgstr[0] "疯人精灵"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral elf"
msgid ""
"Fair folk no longer, this elf's pupils are dilated and what can be seen of "
"the iris and sclera are bloodshot.  They clutch a pipe in one delicate hand "
"as they gracefully walk unbothered amidst the zombies."
msgstr "这个精灵的瞳孔放大，虹膜和巩膜布满血丝，再也不复仙灵的美丽。他们用一只纤细的手抓着钢管，不受干扰地在丧尸中间优雅行走。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral elf"
msgid "The feral elf throws a rock!"
msgstr "疯人精灵扔了一块石头！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral dwarf"
msgid_plural "feral dwarves"
msgstr[0] "疯人矮人"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral dwarf"
msgid ""
"Lacking their normal eye protection, this dwarf's pupils are dilated and what "
"can be seen of the iris and sclera are bloodshot.  They clutch a pipe in one "
"hand and the walking dead leave them alone."
msgstr "由于缺乏正常的眼部保护，这个矮人的瞳孔扩大，虹膜和巩膜充血。他们一手抓着钢管，而行尸走肉也置他们不顾。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral dwarf"
msgid "The feral dwarf throws a rock!"
msgstr "疯人矮人扔了一块石头！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral elf"
msgid ""
"Fair folk no longer, this elf's pupils are dilated and what can be seen of "
"the iris and sclera are bloodshot.  They clutch a crowbar in one delicate "
"hand as they gracefully walk unbothered amidst the zombies."
msgstr "这个精灵的瞳孔放大，虹膜和巩膜布满血丝，再也不复仙灵的美丽。他们用一只纤细的手抓着撬棍，不受干扰地在丧尸中间优雅行走。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral dwarf"
msgid ""
"Lacking their normal eye protection, this dwarf's pupils are dilated and what "
"can be seen of the iris and sclera are bloodshot.  They clutch a crowbar in "
"one hand and the walking dead leave them alone."
msgstr "由于缺乏正常的眼部保护，这个矮人的瞳孔扩大，虹膜和巩膜充血。他们一手抓着撬棍，而行尸走肉也置他们不顾。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral axe-elf"
msgid_plural "feral axe-elves"
msgstr[0] "疯人精灵斧手"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral axe-elf"
msgid ""
"Dragging a large axe along the ground, this elf's expression is one of "
"twisted glee.  Their movements are more fluid than those of the feral humans, "
"but no less unsettling."
msgstr "这个精灵拖着一把大斧头在地上行走，脸上露出扭曲的喜悦表情。他们的动作比野性疯人更加流畅，但同样令人不安。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deranged axedwarf"
msgid_plural "deranged axedwarves"
msgstr[0] "狂乱矮人斧手"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deranged axedwarf"
msgid ""
"This dwarf holds the traditional dwarven weapon with none of the skill and "
"craft of the axedwarves of old.  The axehead is pitted but still looks sharp, "
"and the zombies around them ignore them as they hold it."
msgstr "这个矮人拿着传统的矮人武器，但没有古代矮人斧手的技巧和手艺。斧头虽然坑坑洼洼却仍然很锋利，他们拿着斧头而周围的丧尸无视了他们。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral goblin"
msgid_plural "feral goblins"
msgstr[0] "疯人哥布林"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral goblin"
msgid ""
"A goblin out of nightmares, with their already-reddish eyes now bloodshot and "
"staring.  Their clothes are tattered and they flex their clawed fingers "
"repeatedly as they walk among the zombies."
msgstr "从噩梦走出的哥布林，原本就红肿的眼睛现在又布满血丝，目光呆滞。他们衣衫褴褛，在丧尸中行走时不停地弯曲着手指。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral ravenfolk"
msgid_plural "feral ravenfolk"
msgstr[0] "疯人鸦族"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral ravenfolk"
msgid ""
"Wing-feathers tattered, eyes bloodshot, this ravenfolk walks among the dead "
"as though already one of them."
msgstr "羽翼残破，双眼布满血丝。这个鸦族走在死者之间，仿佛已是其中一员。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral lizardfolk"
msgid_plural "feral lizardfolk"
msgstr[0] "疯人蜥族"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral lizardfolk"
msgid ""
"This lizardfolk's eyes are bloodshot and they walk among the dead as though "
"one of them.  Their tongue repeatedly flickers in and out of their mouth like "
"a snake."
msgstr "这个蜥族的眼睛布满血丝，他们走在死者之间，仿佛已是其中一员。他们的舌头像蛇一样在嘴里不停地摆动。"

