msgid_plural "feral druids"
msgstr[0] "疯人德鲁伊"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral druid"
msgid ""
"A member of a druidic order with the bloodshot eyes you've come to recognize "
"and dread.  Patches of their skin are covered in bark and fur, leaves grow in "
"their hair, and long claws grow from the ends of their fingers.  Protecting "
"nature is obviously the last thing on their mind now."
msgstr ""
"A member of a druidic order with the bloodshot eyes you've come to recognize "
"and dread.  Patches of their skin are covered in bark and fur, leaves grow in "
"their hair, and long claws grow from the ends of their fingers.  Protecting "
"nature is obviously the last thing on their mind now."

