#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral high earthshaper"
msgid ""
"Once a master of earthshaping, this feral now wanders haphazardly through the "
"post-Cataclysmic world.  Their skin is stone covered in fine crystalline "
"spikes, and their bloodshot eyes glitter like polished gems, but their "
"movements are uncoordinated.  Occasionally, the earth shakes when they take a "
"step."
msgstr ""
"曾经身为塑地者的大师，这只疯人现在仅仅步履蹒跚在大灾变后的世界。它石化的皮肤被细小的结晶尖刺覆盖着，血红的双眼像光滑的宝石一样闪闪发亮，但它的步伐并不协调。"
"当它踏出步伐时，地面偶尔会震动。"

