msgstr "你的法力自然再生率比平常人快一些。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Greater Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "高級法力再生率"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Greater Mana Regeneration"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Manatouched Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is much faster than normal."
msgstr "你的法力自然再生率比平常人快很多。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "低法力再生率"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is slightly slower than normal."
msgstr "你的法力自然再生率比平常人稍為慢一點。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Very Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "微弱法力再生率"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is slower than normal."
msgstr "你的法力自然再生率比平常人慢一些。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Abysmal Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "低劣法力再生率"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Abysmal Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is much slower than normal."
msgstr "你的法力自然再生率比平常人慢很多。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lesser Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "次級法力靈敏度"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lesser Mana Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"You can sense the mana in your body slightly better than normal, allowing you "
"to tap into more of your reserves."
msgstr "你對體內的法力感應能力比一般人稍微好一點，這讓你能運用更多體內的法力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "法力靈敏度"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"You can sense the mana in your body better than normal, allowing you to tap "
"into more of your reserves."
msgstr "你對體內的法力感應能力比一般人好一些，這讓你能運用更多體內的法力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Greater Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "高級法力靈敏度"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Greater Mana Sensitivity"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Manatouched Mana Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"You can sense the mana in your body much better than normal, allowing you to "
"tap into more of your reserves."
msgstr "你對體內的法力感應能力比一般人好很多，這讓你能運用更多體內的法力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Poor Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "低法力靈敏度"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Poor Mana Sensitivity"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Poor Mana Sensitivity"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Abysmal Mana Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"You have a hard time sensing the mana in your body, making less of your "
"reserves available for use."
msgstr "你很難感知身體儲備的法力值，因此減少所能使用的數量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Very Poor Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "微弱法力靈敏度"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Abysmal Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "低劣法力靈敏度"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Slime Breath"
msgstr "黏液呼吸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime Breath"
msgid ""
"Your breath is sticky and slimy somehow.  This won't damage your interactions "
"with people but it's definitely noticeable."
msgstr "不知怎么的，你的呼吸变得又粘又滑。虽然这不会让你无法与他人互动，但影响绝对是显而易见的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Chimeric Breath"
msgstr "嵌合呼吸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Chimeric Breath"
msgid ""
"Your breath could metaphorically melt lead.  It's horrible.  It's so bad that "
"it can actually distract from your attempts to intimidate someone."
msgstr "你的呼吸可以如比喻一般融化铸铅。太可怕了。它糟糕到能够分散你恐吓别人时的注意力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Debug Spell Mutation"
msgstr "除錯法術突變"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Spell Mutation"
msgid "Gives all of the debug spells at max level."
msgstr "給予最高等級的所有除錯法術。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wildshape: Fish"
msgstr "變形術（魚）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Fish"
msgid "You are fish-like.  Just keep swimming!"
msgstr "你像鱼一样。继续游吧!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wildshape: Bear"
msgstr "變形術（熊）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Bear"
msgid ""
"You are bear-like, granting you raw bestial power in exchange for "
"intelligence."
msgstr "你像熊一样，以智力换取原始的兽性力量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wildshape: Deer"
msgstr "變形術（鹿）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Deer"
msgid ""
"You are deer-like, giving you the ability to move quickly and escape danger.  "
"It is hard to use your arms in combat, however."
msgstr "你像鹿一样，使你有能力快速移动并逃离危险。然而，在战斗中很难使用你的手臂。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mirror Displacement"
msgstr "镜像换位"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mirror Displacement"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Future Sight"
msgid "You aren't where you seem to be."
msgstr "你似乎不在你所在的地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Empty"
msgstr "无魔者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Empty"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Empty, the rare few unable to cast even the simplest "
"spells.  Your complete lack of mana prevents you from ever casting any magic, "
"no matter how well you know it.  At least it doesn't prevent the use of "
"magical items and potions."
msgstr ""
"你是一个无魔者，是那寥寥无几的、连最简单的魔法都无法触及之人。你体内没有丝毫魔力，这使得你无论多么精通魔法，都无法施展任何法术。值得庆幸的是，这不妨碍你使用"
"魔法物品和药水。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana-Shackled"
msgstr "吸魔镣铐"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana-Shackled"
msgid ""
"For a reason or another you are wearing a mana-leech shackle, leaving you "
"constantly empty of mana.  Should you get rid of it you will regain the "
"ability to use your mana, but this is much easier said than done.  You know "
"that these shackles are often used in prisons, so maybe you could find a way "
"to remove it in there?"
msgstr ""
"由于某种原因，你戴着一副能够吸取魔力的镣铐，这使你体内的魔力源源不断地流失。如果你能摆脱这副镣，你将重获使用魔法的能力，然而想做到这一点并非易事。你听说到这"
"种镣铐常用于囚禁犯人，或许能在监狱中找到解除之法？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana-Shackled effect"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Iron Intolerance"
msgstr "铁不耐受"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Iron Intolerance"
msgid ""
"You were born with an allergy to iron and, to a lesser extent, steel.  "
"Wearing or touching anything made of iron or steel will cause you pain and "
"discomfort."
msgstr "你天生对铁过敏，对钢的过敏程度会轻一点。穿戴或接触任何由铁或钢制成的东西都会让你感到疼痛和不适。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Channeling"
msgstr "学派缺陷：引导系"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Channeling"
msgid ""
"No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master channeling spells.  "
"You are unable to cast any spell of the channeling school."
msgstr "无论你多么努力，你都没法掌握引导系法术。你无法施展任何引导学派的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Evocation"
msgstr "学派缺陷：塑能系"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Evocation"
msgid ""
"No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master evocation spells.  "
"You are unable to cast any spell of the evocation school."
msgstr "无论你多么努力，你都没法掌握塑能系法术。你无法施展任何塑能学派的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Conjuration"
msgstr "学派缺陷：咒法系"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Conjuration"
msgid ""
"No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master conjuration spells.  "
"You are unable to cast any spell of the conjuration school."
msgstr "无论你多么努力，你都没法掌握咒法系法术。你无法施展任何咒法学派的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Enhancement"
msgstr "学派缺陷：强化系"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Enhancement"
msgid ""
"No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master enhancement spells.  "
"You are unable to cast any spell of the enhancement school."
msgstr "无论你多么努力，你都没法掌握强化系法术。你无法施展任何强化学派的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Enervation"
msgstr "学派缺陷：弱化系"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Enervation"
msgid ""
"No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master enervation spells.  "
"You are unable to cast any spell of the enervation school."
msgstr "无论你多么努力，你都没法掌握弱化系法术。你无法施展任何弱化学派的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Conveyance"
msgstr "学派缺陷：传送系"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Conveyance"
msgid ""
"No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master conveyance spells.  "
"You are unable to cast any spell of the conveyance school."
msgstr "无论你多么努力，你都没法掌握传送系法术。你无法施展任何传送学派的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Restoration"
msgstr "学派缺陷：恢复系"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Restoration"
msgid ""
"No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master restoration spells.  "
"You are unable to cast any spell of the restoration school."
msgstr "无论你多么努力，你都没法掌握恢复系法术。你无法施展任何恢复学派的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Transformation"
msgstr "学派缺陷：变化系"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Transformation"
msgid ""
"No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master transformation "
"spells.  You are unable to cast any spell of the transformation school."
msgstr "无论你多么努力，你都没法掌握变化系法术。你无法施展任何变化学派的法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of the Forest King"
msgstr "Form of the Forest King"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Forest King"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bear.  Roar."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a bear.  Roar."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of the Stalking Hunter"
msgstr "Form of the Stalking Hunter"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Stalking Hunter"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a cougar and stalk your enemies."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a cougar and stalk your enemies."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of the Swift Runner"
msgstr "Form of the Swift Runner"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Swift Runner"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Deer"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a deer."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a deer."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of the Soaring Wings"
msgstr "Form of the Soaring Wings"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Soaring Wings"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a raven and take wing."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a raven and take wing."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Demon Horns"
msgstr "惡魔之角"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Horns"
msgid ""
"Large ram horns curl around your ears on each side of your head.  Gives you a "
"headbutt attack and head protection."
msgstr "你的头部两侧长出了大公羊一样的角，蜷曲在你的耳旁。这使你能头槌攻击敌人并提供了头部防护。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Demon Horns" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You headbutt %s with your horns"
msgstr "你用角頭錘攻擊 %s"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Demon Horns" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their horns"
msgstr "%1$s 用角頭錘攻擊 %2$s"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Demon Hooves"
msgstr "惡魔之蹄"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Hooves"
msgid ""
"Your toes have merged into cloven hooves, like that of a goat.  You also have "
"coarse brown fur from the waist down."
msgstr "你的脚趾和山羊一样，已经变成了偶蹄。你从腰部以下也长出了粗糙的棕色毛皮。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Demonic Possession"
msgid ""
"You are possessed by a greater demon, giving you great strength and combat "
"abilities but reducing your fine motor control skills.  This gives you a "
"slower crafting speed and the inability to cast spells."
msgstr "你被一只大恶魔附身了，这赋予你强大的力量和战斗能力，但却减少了你对精细运动的控制。这使你制造速度变慢而且无法施放法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Demon Claws"
msgstr "惡魔之爪"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Demon Skin"
msgstr "惡魔皮膚"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Demon Skin"
msgid "Your skin is crimson."
msgstr "你的皮肤是深红色的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Goat Tail"
msgstr "山羊尾"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Goat Tail"
msgid "You have a short, stubby goat tail."
msgstr "你有一根又短又粗的山羊尾巴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Giant-sized"
msgstr "巨型"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Giant-sized"
msgid "Magic has made you grow to enormous size!"
msgstr "魔法让你长成巨大的身躯！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lashing Tentacles"
msgid "You have a pair of vicious barbed tentacles growing from your shoulders."
msgstr "你的肩膀上长出了一对恶毒的带刺的触手。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Lashing Tentacles" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You lash at %s with your tentacles!"
msgstr "你用触手猛击%s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Lashing Tentacles" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s lashes at %2$s with their tentacles!"
msgstr "%1$s用触手猛击%2$s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_skinchanged_animalistic_mind"
msgid "Animalistic Mind"
msgstr "兽化心智"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Animalistic Mind"
msgid "It's hard to think.  Let the instinct take over."
msgstr "思考很困难。让本能驾驭你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Predator's Mind"
msgstr "Predator's Mind"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator's Mind"
msgid "Hunt.  Kill.  Feed."
msgstr "Hunt.  Kill.  Feed."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Beetle Bond"
msgstr "Beetle Bond"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Beetle Bond"
msgid "You have gained a bond with a stag beetle."
msgstr "You have gained a bond with a stag beetle."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cold Aura"
msgstr "寒冷光环"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Aura"
msgid ""
"Your presence is so dangerous you can freeze everything around yourself.  You "
"are currently suppressing this power."
msgstr "你的存在是如此危险，你可以冻结自己周围的一切。但你压制着这毁灭之力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Cold Aura" to "COLD_AURA_ON"
msgid "Everything around you is covered in frost!"
msgstr "你身边万物皆挂满冰霜！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cold Aura (on)"
msgstr "寒冷光环（开）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Aura (on)"
msgid "Your presence is so dangerous you can freeze everything around yourself."
msgstr "你的存在是如此危险，你可以冻结自己周围的一切。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Cold Aura (on)" to
#. "COLD_AURA_OFF"
msgid "You suppress your frozen powers."
msgstr "你压制住了你的冰冻能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Split"
msgstr "剥离"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Split"
msgid ""
"Your body and soul were split in half, and part of it were left inside the "
"ley-line, connected with your main body with tiniest, ethereal thread.  In "
"danger situation, you will abandon your main body and turn back into copy, "
"with all knowledge and skills you have."
msgstr "你的身体和灵魂被分成了两半，一部分留在了地脉之中，与你的本体以最微小的飘渺丝线相连。在危险的情况下，你会放弃本体，带着你所有的知识和技能回到复制体。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Frozen Pressure"
msgstr "霜冻加压"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Frozen Pressure"
msgid ""
"Your presence is so dangerous living creatures nearby are smashed.  You are "
"currently suppressing this power."
msgstr "你的存在危险至极，以至周边寸草不生。但你正压制着这种毁灭之力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Frozen Pressure" to
#. "FROZEN_PRESSURE_ON"
msgid "Living creatures around you are crushed!"
msgstr "你周围的活物被压碎了！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Frozen Pressure (on)"
msgstr "霜冻加压（开）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Frozen Pressure (on)"
msgid "Your presence is so dangerous living creatures nearby are smashed."
msgstr "你的存在危险至极，以至周边寸草不生。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Frozen Pressure (on)" to
#. "FROZEN_PRESSURE_OFF"
msgid "You suppress your frozen pressure."
msgstr "你压制住了你的霜冻加压能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Rad Senses"
msgstr "辐射感官"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Rad Senses"
msgid ""
"You can perceive radiation being emitted in your surroundings with sufficient "
"precision to see while totally blind.  You suppress it now."
msgstr ""
"You can perceive radiation being emitted in your surroundings with sufficient "
"precision to see while totally blind.  You suppress it now."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Rad Senses" to
#. "CLAIRVOYANCE_ON"
msgid "You see everything!"
msgstr "你看到了一切！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Rad Senses (on)"
msgstr "辐射感官（开）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Rad Senses (on)"
msgid ""
"You can perceive radiation being emitted in your surroundings with sufficient "
"precision to see while totally blind."
msgstr ""
"You can perceive radiation being emitted in your surroundings with sufficient "
"precision to see while totally blind."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Rad Senses (on)" to
#. "CLAIRVOYANCE_OFF"
msgid "You suppress your rad senses."
msgstr "你压制住了你的辐射感官。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mind Reading"
msgstr "读心术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mind Reading"
msgid ""
"You can feel the living energy of creatures around you, which allows you to "
"predict their movements or words.  You suppress it now."
msgstr "你能够感受到周围生物的生命能量，这让你可以预测它们的动作或发言。你现在抑制着这项能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Mind Reading" to "MIND_READ_ON"
msgid "You reach out with your powers, seeking nearby living beings."
msgstr "你使用你的能力探索附近是否还有生命。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mind Reading (on)"
msgstr "读心术（开）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mind Reading (on)"
msgid ""
"You can feel the living energy of creatures around you, which allows you to "
"predict their movements or words."
msgstr "你能够感受到周围生物的生命能量，这让你可以预测它们的动作或发言。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Mind Reading (on)" to
#. "MIND_READ_OFF"
msgid "You suppress your mind abilities."
msgstr "你压制住了你的读心能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Soul Pressure"
msgstr "灵魂加压"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Soul Pressure"
msgid ""
"Your presence is so dangerous you can burn living creatures around you.  You "
"suppress it now."
msgstr "你的存在是如此危险，你可以燃烧周围的生物。但你现在把这股力量压制住了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Soul Pressure" to
#. "SOUL_PRESSURE_ON"
msgid "Living creatures around you start to burn!"
msgstr "你周围的活物开始燃烧！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Soul Pressure (on)"
msgstr "灵魂加压（开）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Soul Pressure (on)"
msgid "Your presence is so dangerous you can burn living creatures around you."
msgstr "你的存在是如此危险，你可以燃烧周围的生物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Soul Pressure (on)" to
#. "SOUL_PRESSURE_OFF"
msgid "You suppress your soul pressure."
msgstr "你压制住了你的灵魂加压能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Freezing Aura"
msgstr "冰冻光环"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Freezing Aura"
msgid ""
"Your body emits a large amount of cold energy, which freezes all enemies near "
"you.  You suppress this ability now."
msgstr "你的身体发出大量寒冷的能量，使你附近的所有敌人都被冻结。 你现在抑制着这项能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Freezing Aura" to
#. "FREEZING_AURA_ON"
msgid "Living creatures around you freezes!"
msgstr "你周围的活物开始冻结！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Freezing Aura (on)"
msgstr "冰冻光环（开）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Freezing Aura (on)"
msgid ""
"Your body emits a large amount of cold energy, which freezes all enemies near "
"you."
msgstr "你的身体发出大量寒冷的能量，使你附近的所有敌人都被冻结。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Freezing Aura (on)" to
#. "FREEZING_AURA_OFF"
msgid "You suppress your freezing aura."
msgstr "你压制住了你的冰冻光环。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Toxic Aura"
msgstr "毒性光环"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Toxic Aura"
msgid "Your body can emit an aura of deadly toxins.  You suppress this ability now."
msgstr "Your body can emit an aura of deadly toxins.  You suppress this ability now."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Toxic Aura" to "TOXIC_AURA_ON"
msgid "Living creatures around you are poisoned!"
msgstr "你周围的活物开始中毒！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Toxic Aura (on)"
msgstr "毒性光环（开）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Toxic Aura (on)"
msgid "Your body can emit an aura of deadly toxins."
msgstr "Your body can emit an aura of deadly toxins."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_triggering_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Toxic Aura (on)" to
#. "TOXIC_AURA_OFF"
msgid "You suppress your toxic aura."
msgstr "你压制住了你的毒性光环。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Skin tone: blue"
msgstr "肤色：蓝色"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: blue"
msgid "You have a sky- or sea-colored skin tone."
msgstr "天蓝或海蓝肤色。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Skin tone: green"
msgstr "肤色：绿色"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: green"
msgid "You have a green skin tone."
msgstr "绿色肤色。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Skin tone: gray"
msgstr "肤色：灰色"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: gray"
msgid "You have a gray skin tone."
msgstr "灰色肤色。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Skin tone: midnight"
msgstr "肤色：暗夜"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: midnight"
msgid "You have an almost pure black skin tone."
msgstr "几乎纯黑的肤色。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Skin tone: opal"
msgstr "肤色：蛋白石"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: opal"
msgid ""
"You have an opalescent skin tone, pale with a faint shimmering rainbow of "
"colors."
msgstr "类似蛋白石的肤色，白中带着轻微的七彩光泽。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Skin tone: red"
msgstr "肤色：红色"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/vanity.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin tone: red"
msgid "You have a reddish or very ruddy skin tone."
msgstr "偏红的肤色。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Artificer"
msgstr "機關師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Artificer"
msgid ""
"With the mechanically-minded Technomancer and the sheer power of lightning "
"from a Stormshaper, the Artificer has a unique confluence of skills and "
"spells to be perfect for invention.  While modern inventions and machines "
"have won out in a modern society, after a Cataclysm one has a chance to go "
"back to roots of things.  To make weird gadgets that are just as likely to "
"explode as explode the thing you're pointing at."
msgstr ""
"作为同时拥有了机械思维的科技法师和拥有闪电力量的风暴塑造者，机关术师所掌握的技艺和法术在发明方面完美而独特的汇合在一起。虽然现代发明和机器已经在现代社会中取"
"得了胜利，但在经历了一场大灾变之后，人们终于能有机会回归事物的本源。你制造出的各类奇怪小玩意自身就和被你所瞄准的东西一样容易爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Alchemist"
msgstr "煉金術士"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Alchemist"
msgid ""
"The alchemist comes from the technomancer's skills with unliving matter "
"combined with the animist's grasp on the ambient ley lines.  It requires "
"magical talent and lots of time, but is invaluable for creating powerful "
"magical effects in a storable, accessible form."
msgstr ""
"炼金术士来自于科技法师处理无机物的技能，加上泛灵师对周围魔法灵脉的掌握。掌握它需要魔法天赋和大量时间，但对于将魔法能量以可存储、便于使用的形式创造更强大的法"
"术效果来说是无价的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Biotek"
msgstr "生化技師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Biotek"
msgid ""
"The Biotek is quite simply the marriage of technology and flesh.  It was not "
"even discovered as an attunement until recent times due to the great "
"advancements in technology in the last 50 years.  The Biotek is unique as it "
"is the only known attunement that warps the Aethereum in such a way as to "
"allow cybernetics to coincide with magical abilities, to an extent."
msgstr ""
"生化技师是技术和肉体的简单结合。由于科技在过去50"
"年中的巨大进步，直到最近人们才发现了魔法调谐现象。生化技师是独一无二的，因为它是唯一已知能够在某种程度上扭曲以太的魔法调谐，从而让生化插件与魔法能力在某种程"
"度上融合一致。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blood Mage"
msgstr "血法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Mage"
msgid ""
"Animists are known for their blood magic, and being a Biomancer you are able "
"to take it another step further by strengthening your blood.  The dark arts "
"have opened to you, and while dangerous, are incredible to behold.\n"
"\n"
"Ichor: Your Blood Mage abilities grant you the ability to steal some health "
"from your enemies from time to time, and immunity to bleeding."
msgstr ""
"泛灵师以他们的血魔法而闻名，作为一名生化术士，你可以通过强化自身血液而更进一步。黑魔法的大门已经向你敞开了，虽然危险，却让人欲罢不能。\n"
"\n"
"神血：你的血法师能力赋予你偶尔吸取敌人血量的能力，同时你会免疫流血。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Boreal Mage"
msgstr "北寒法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Boreal Mage"
msgid ""
"Named for the auroras that grace the poles of the earth, the Boreal mage "
"specializes in auras that protect ethereally.  Boreal mages definitely know "
"their way around cold spells, but their real strength is protection.\n"
"\n"
"Boreal Wind: Your Boreal Mage abilities grant you good resistance to "
"temperature conditions.  Also, your hands emit a small amount of cold, "
"increasing your damage in melee."
msgstr ""
"以优雅地照亮了地球的两极的极光命名，北寒法师专门研究魔法保护的光环。北寒法师当然也很了解寒冷法术，但他们真正强大之处还是在于防护。\n"
"\n"
"北风：你的北寒法师能力赋予你的温度条件的良好抵抗力，初次之外，你的双手还能散发微量寒气，增加你的近战伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cleansing Flame"
msgstr "淨火法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cleansing Flame"
msgid ""
"The Cleansing Flame is the fire that burns away the chaff, in preparation for "
"the regrowth of new life.\n"
"\n"
"Cleansing Blaze: Your Cleansing Flame abilities grant you good resistance to "
"temperature conditions.  You are also immune to infection, as your body "
"cleanses every tainted part of you, constantly."
msgstr ""
"净火法师是燃尽糟粕，迎接世间万物新生的火焰。\n"
"\n"
"净化烈焰：你的净化火焰能力赋予你对温度条件的良好抵抗力。您还可以免受感染，因为您的身体会不断地净化您身体的每个受污染的部分。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Crusader"
msgstr "十字軍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Crusader"
msgid ""
"The Crusader attunement is a clashing dichotomy of Man and Nature.  Utilizing "
"man's propensity for tools and nature's resilience, the Crusader is a "
"juggernaut in armed combat."
msgstr "圣战法师魔法调谐中专注于人与自然的矛盾二分法。圣战法师同时利用人类使用工具的倾向和以及自然的复原能力，是武装近战中的佼佼者。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Earth Elemental"
msgstr "地元素師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Earth Elemental"
msgid ""
"Stone is superior to flesh.  You have allowed this axiom into your life, and "
"work to correct your own weakness with biomancy.  The strength of the Earth "
"rushed up to meet you with open arms.\n"
"\n"
"Earth Creep: Your Earth Elemental body grant you good resistance against cut "
"damage, total immunity to electricity, great strength, and colossal stamina."
msgstr ""
"Stone is superior to flesh.  You have allowed this axiom into your life, and "
"work to correct your own weakness with biomancy.  The strength of the Earth "
"rushed up to meet you with open arms.\n"
"\n"
"Earth Creep: Your Earth Elemental body grant you good resistance against cut "
"damage, total immunity to electricity, great strength, and colossal stamina."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fire Elemental"
msgstr "火元素師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fire Elemental"
msgid ""
"You have used your expertise in Biomancy to change your body more toward your "
"affinity for fire as a Kelvinist.  Fire doesn't bother you as much anymore, "
"and your blood is flammable when it touches the air, resulting in a gout of "
"flame when something hurts you.  You are also starting to study more spells "
"that focus on using your own body's affinity for fire.\n"
"\n"
"Salamander: Your Fire Elemental abilities grant you good resistance to "
"temperature conditions and heat damage.  Also, your body emits streams of "
"blistering heat towards anyone who attacks you."
msgstr ""
"通过你所掌握的生化术士的力量，你已经改变了你的身体，提升了自身炽霜法师对火的魔法亲和度。火焰不再那么让你烦恼了，而且你的血液一旦接触到空气就会燃烧，这使你受"
"到任何伤害时，就会喷出一道火焰。你也开始研究更多专注于你身体内在与火的魔法亲和度的魔法。\n"
"\n"
"火蜥蜴：你的火元素能力赋予你对温度条件和热伤害的良好抵抗力。 此外，你的身体还能向任何攻击你的人喷射灼热的热流。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Message in effect "FIRE_ELEMENTAL_BURNBACK"
msgid "Flame and heat flash out from where you've been hit."
msgstr "火焰和热量自你被击中的地方涌出。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect "FIRE_ELEMENTAL_BURNBACK"
#. ~ NPC message in effect "integrated_coal_skin_burnback"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's body jets fire and heat out from the wound."
msgstr "%1$s的伤口中涌出火焰和热量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Force Mage"
msgstr "原力法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Force Mage"
msgid ""
"Force = Mass x Acceleration.  This is the typical thing that people think of "
"nowadays when the word is used, but Force Mages have a different meaning, "
"coming from traditional roots: untyped magical damage appears to be a ghostly "
"\"force.\"  This might be the effect of the attunement, but the cause is even "
"more intriguing: they appear to turn Newton's Third Law on its head.  Magical "
"scholars of the 21st century have theorized that this isn't really the case; "
"instead of the opposite reaction happening on this plane of existence, a "
"Force Mage uses the Aetherium's alternate Laws to rebound the force back upon "
"itself, effectively doubling the force in the same direction instead.  "
"However this ability comes with limitations, as the Force Mage can only do "
"this for melee damage.\n"
"\n"
"Motion: Your Force Mage abilities grant you better speed, and increased "
"damage in melee."
msgstr ""
"Force = Mass x Acceleration.  This is the typical thing that people think of "
"nowadays when the word is used, but Force Mages have a different meaning, "
"coming from traditional roots: untyped magical damage appears to be a ghostly "
"\"force.\"  This might be the effect of the attunement, but the cause is even "
"more intriguing: they appear to turn Newton's Third Law on its head.  Magical "
"scholars of the 21st century have theorized that this isn't really the case; "
"instead of the opposite reaction happening on this plane of existence, a "
"Force Mage uses the Aetherium's alternate Laws to rebound the force back upon "
"itself, effectively doubling the force in the same direction instead.  "
"However this ability comes with limitations, as the Force Mage can only do "
"this for melee damage.\n"
"\n"
"Motion: Your Force Mage abilities grant you better speed, and increased "
"damage in melee."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gaia's Chosen"
msgstr "蓋亞神選"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gaia's Chosen"
msgid ""
"The Champion of the Earth, Gaia's Chosen is blessed on all things nature, "
"animate and inanimate.\n"
"\n"
"Gaia's Champion: Your Gaia's Chosen abilities grant you a larger HP pool, and "
"enemies have a chance to impale themselves upon your thorns when they attack "
"you.  However, the thorns growing from your skin means you feel pain more "
"acutely."
msgstr ""
"The Champion of the Earth, Gaia's Chosen is blessed on all things nature, "
"animate and inanimate.\n"
"\n"
"Gaia's Champion: Your Gaia's Chosen abilities grant you a larger HP pool, and "
"enemies have a chance to impale themselves upon your thorns when they attack "
"you.  However, the thorns growing from your skin means you feel pain more "
"acutely."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Message in effect "GAIAS_CHOSEN_THORNS"
msgid "Thorns tear at your opponent as they strike you."
msgstr "荆棘袭向攻击你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect "GAIAS_CHOSEN_THORNS"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's thorny brambles bite into their attacker."
msgstr "%1$s的带刺荆棘会伤害攻击者。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Glacier Mage"
msgstr "冰川法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Glacier Mage"
msgid ""
"The power of a Glacier Mage is backed by a thousand tons of ice and snow, "
"with a brutal might in their spells.  While they are skilled with cold "
"spells, their greatest strength is in offense.\n"
"\n"
"Stalactite: Your Glacier Mage abilities grant you good resistance to "
"temperature conditions, and enemies are often hurt when try to attack you in "
"melee."
msgstr ""
"The power of a Glacier Mage is backed by a thousand tons of ice and snow, "
"with a brutal might in their spells.  While they are skilled with cold "
"spells, their greatest strength is in offense.\n"
"\n"
"Stalactite: Your Glacier Mage abilities grant you good resistance to "
"temperature conditions, and enemies are often hurt when try to attack you in "
"melee."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Golemancer"
msgstr "魔像師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Golemancer"
msgid ""
"The Golemancer is the ancient myth of the clay golem, made reality from "
"constant use of Animist summons and Earthshaper self-strengthening spells.  "
"Takes some traits from the golems they create, such as immunity to slowing "
"effects.\n"
"\n"
"Clay: Your Golemancer abilities make you perfectly steady, as nothing can "
"slow you down.  Your body also deflects some of the damage you take."
msgstr ""
"The Golemancer is the ancient myth of the clay golem, made reality from "
"constant use of Animist summons and Earthshaper self-strengthening spells.  "
"Takes some traits from the golems they create, such as immunity to slowing "
"effects.\n"
"\n"
"Clay: Your Golemancer abilities make you perfectly steady, as nothing can "
"slow you down.  Your body also deflects some of the damage you take."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gravity Mage"
msgstr "重力法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gravity Mage"
msgid ""
"The fundamental Laws of the universe are thought of as the end-all-be-all in "
"magical circles, and the Gravity Mage is a result of mages mucking around "
"with those laws.  Unfortunately, this attunement does not give supreme "
"control over gravity as a fundamental force, though the affinity is prominent "
"and comes with some non-negligible benefits.\n"
"\n"
"Weight: Your Gravity Mage abilities increase your attack speed and melee "
"damage for a bit, double your ability to carry weight, and allow you to climb "
"without using ladders or support."
msgstr ""
"The fundamental Laws of the universe are thought of as the end-all-be-all in "
"magical circles, and the Gravity Mage is a result of mages mucking around "
"with those laws.  Unfortunately, this attunement does not give supreme "
"control over gravity as a fundamental force, though the affinity is prominent "
"and comes with some non-negligible benefits.\n"
"\n"
"Weight: Your Gravity Mage abilities increase your attack speed and melee "
"damage for a bit, double your ability to carry weight, and allow you to climb "
"without using ladders or support."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Overclocker"
msgstr "超頻法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Overclocker"
msgid ""
"The Technomancer specializes in augmenting humans without actually modifying "
"them; and the Overclocker takes the heat aptitude of a Kelvinist and puts "
"that to work.  You are able to think significantly faster, and are able to "
"align your ley lines for spellcasting faster as a result."
msgstr ""
"科技法师擅长于在不完全抛弃肉体的情况下增强自身；而超频法师利用了炽霜法师对高热的适应，并将其付诸实践。这让你能够更快地思考，并且能够更迅速地调节你的灵脉提升"
"施法速度。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ice Elemental"
msgstr "冰元素師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ice Elemental"
msgid ""
"Through your power in Biomancy, you have changed your body towards your "
"Kelvinist affinity for ice.  Extreme cold has less effect on you, and your "
"superchilled skin causes frostbite when touching others.  You're also "
"starting to research more magic that focuses on your body's inherent ice "
"affinity.\n"
"\n"
"Iceberg: Your Ice Elemental abilities grant you good resistance to "
"temperature conditions and cold damage, your hands can emit small amount of "
"cold, increasing your damage in melee, and enemies impale themselves on ice "
"spikes when they attack you."
msgstr ""
"通过你所掌握的生化术士的力量，你已经改变了你的身体，提升了自身炽霜法师对冰的魔法亲和度。极端寒冷对你的影响更小，而当你接触他人时，你的超冷皮肤会瞬间造成冻伤"
"。你也开始研究更多专注于你身体内在与冰的魔法亲和度的魔法。\n"
"\n"
"冰山：你的冰元素能力赋予你对温度条件和寒冷伤害的良好抵抗力，你的双手能造成少量的寒冷伤害，提升你的近战伤害，同时任何攻击你的人会被寒冰尖刺刺伤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Illusionist"
msgstr "幻術師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Illusionist"
msgid ""
"Through the fine manipulation of light, an Illusionist might craft "
"deceptively convincing and dangerous illusions.  An Illusionist excels at "
"avoiding direct confrontation, instead relying on decoys and traps to slip by "
"undetected."
msgstr "通过对光的精细操控，幻术师可能会制造出具有欺骗性的、令人信服的、而且十分危险的幻象。幻术师擅长于避免直接对抗，而是依靠投影和陷阱在未被察觉的情况下溜走。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Magnetism Mage"
msgstr "磁力法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Magnetism Mage"
msgid ""
"This attunement grants you a magical control over the forces of magnetism.\n"
"\n"
"Power: Your Magnetism Mage abilities grant you a good defense against "
"firearms, perfect electric immunity, and the ability to see electric "
"creatures from any distance."
msgstr ""
"This attunement grants you a magical control over the forces of magnetism.\n"
"\n"
"Power: Your Magnetism Mage abilities grant you a good defense against "
"firearms, perfect electric immunity, and the ability to see electric "
"creatures from any distance."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Permafrost Mage"
msgstr "永霜法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Permafrost Mage"
msgid ""
"This attunement focuses on continuously freezing foes to death.\n"
"\n"
"Blizzard: Your Permafrost Mage abilities grant you good resistance to "
"temperature conditions.  Also, enemies who attack you may find themselves "
"frozen solid."
msgstr ""
"这一调谐专注于持续冻结你的敌人，将其拖入死亡。\n"
"\n"
"暴风雪：你的永霜法师能力赋予你对温度条件的良好抵抗力，除此之外，攻击你的敌人会被冻结。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Radiation Mage"
msgstr "輻射法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Radiation Mage"
msgid ""
"The Radiation mage was discovered as an attunement in the 20th century, "
"closely guarded as a military secret in close relation to the Manhattan "
"Project.  It was declassified in 1989 as a part of the attunement awareness "
"movement, but it is still poorly understood even by the very few researchers "
"that wrote books on attunements."
msgstr ""
"辐射法师在 20 世纪作为一种魔法调谐被发现，由于其发现过程与曼哈顿计划密切相关，因此一直被作为军事机密严密保管。但在 1989 "
"年，它作为魔法调谐全民科普运动的一部分而被解密，但是至今仍未有研究者彻底理解其原理，即使对于极少数写过魔法调谐专著的研究者也是如此。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shaman"
msgstr "薩滿"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shaman"
msgid ""
"Deeply attuned to the spiritual fabric that shapes and nurtures the natural "
"world, shamans call upon the primeval spirits of nature for aid and advice.  "
"Be careful however, for ancient spirits are fickle and unknowable things.\n"
"\n"
"Spirits: Your Shaman abilities double your natural mana regeneration."
msgstr ""
"体内魔法深深地调谐适应了塑造和培育了这个自然世界的精神体系。萨满巫师向大自然的原始精魂寻求帮助和建议。不过要小心，因为古灵是变幻莫测难以预测的生物。\n"
"\n"
"幻灵：你的萨满巫师能力使你的自然魔力再生翻倍。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shapeshifter"
msgstr "變形者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shapeshifter"
msgid ""
"The shapeshifter is the Biomancer refined - able to use a flicker of mana to "
"change shape at the drop of a hat to make yourself more inviting or shape "
"others into desired shapes."
msgstr "变形者是一位精益求精的生化术士，摘帽瞬间就能仅用少许的魔力改变自身形状，将你自己变的更迷人或其他想要的体型。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Soulfire"
msgstr "魂火法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Soulfire"
msgid ""
"The Soulfire is a phenomena of the caster's spirit binding to a fragment of a "
"spirit of flame.  This makes it possible for the Soulfire to use its namesake "
"as an element - much like fire, it does burn, but it burns away at the soul "
"instead of the flesh.\n"
"\n"
"Spirit Flames: Your Soulfire abilities grant you good resistance to "
"temperature conditions.  Your hands also emit the purest of blazes, which "
"increases your damage in melee."
msgstr ""
"灵魂之火是施法者将自身部分灵魂与火焰碎片结合而成的现象。这使得魂火法师可以像使用火焰一样使用这种命名了自身魔法调谐的元素，它确实能够燃烧，但它燃烧的是你的灵"
"魂而非肉体。\n"
"\n"
"灵魂之火：你的魂火法师能力赋予你对温度条件的良好抗性。除此之外，你的双手可以散发最纯净的火焰，提高你的近战伤害。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Storm Elemental"
msgstr "風暴元素師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Storm Elemental"
msgid ""
"You've used your knowledge of Biomancy to change your body into a form "
"befitting a Stormshaper.  You can better withstand the power of electricity, "
"and sparks leap from your skin when something hits you.  You're beginning to "
"study spells that utilize your body's affinity for the electric.\n"
"\n"
"Cyclone: Your Storm Elemental abilities grant you total electric immunity, "
"and reflective zippers to anyone who tries to attack you."
msgstr ""
"通过你所掌握的生化术士的力量，你已经改变了你的身体，提升了自身风暴塑造者对电的魔法亲和度。你能更好地承受电的力量，被物体击中后皮肤还会迸发出电火花。你也开始"
"研究更多专注于你身体内在与电的魔法亲和度的魔法。\n"
"\n"
"旋风：你的暴风术师能力赋予你完全免疫电击伤害的能力，除此之外，反射性的电流会射向任何试图攻击你的人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Message in effect "STORM_ELEMENTAL_ZAPBACK"
msgid "Electricity arcs out from where you've been hit."
msgstr "雷电自你被击中的地方涌出。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect "STORM_ELEMENTAL_ZAPBACK"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's body arcs electricity from the wound."
msgstr "%1$s的伤口中涌出电流。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stormcaller"
msgstr "風暴招換者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormcaller"
msgid ""
"A stormcaller is a stormshaper with an additional affinity toward the weather "
"in a localized area.  Historians agree that the druid requirement has "
"something to do with the Druid's affinity for nature, just like their ability "
"to summon animals.  You will know a stormcaller is in the room if your ears "
"pop and your hair stands straight on end.  Stormcallers are not known for "
"their subtlety."
msgstr ""
"唤风者是对本地区的天气有额外魔法亲和度的风暴塑造者。历史学家一致认为德鲁伊的前置需求与德鲁伊对自然的魔法亲和相关，就像他们召唤动物的能力一样。当你开始耳鸣，"
"毛发竖立之时，你就知道房间里来了位唤风者。唤风者从来不当隐姓埋名之辈。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sun Mage"
msgstr "太陽法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sun Mage"
msgid ""
"The Sun Mage has been studying the Laws governing heat, and has attained a "
"special relationship with that life-giving yellow orb in the sky.  Glimpses "
"of the Sun meet its foes, and its own burning light pierces the darkness.\n"
"\n"
"Solar Warrior: Your Sun Mage abilities blind everyone who are mean to you."
msgstr ""
"日炎法师通过长期研究热量传导规律，与天空中那个造就生命的黄色火球产生了特殊的联系。太阳的光辉将击穿黑暗，使任何瞥见这光芒的敌人畏惧。\n"
"\n"
"太阳战士：你的日炎法师能力会使任何对你图谋不轨的人失明。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Message in effect "solar_blinding"
msgid "A brilliant light radiates from where you've been hit."
msgstr "一道刺眼的闪光自你被击中的地方四散开来。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect "solar_blinding"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's body is enveloped in a bright glare."
msgstr "%1$s的身体笼罩在耀眼的强光中。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Tundra Mage"
msgstr "苔原法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Tundra Mage"
msgid ""
"The barren cold of the world's far reaches flows through the Tundra Mage.  "
"They find power in the all-pervasive frost of the North and in the creatures "
"that defy its deathly chill.\n"
"\n"
"Arctic: Your Tundra Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"The barren cold of the world's far reaches flows through the Tundra Mage.  "
"They find power in the all-pervasive frost of the North and in the creatures "
"that defy its deathly chill.\n"
"\n"
"Arctic: Your Tundra Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature "
"conditions."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Void Mage"
msgstr "虛空法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Void Mage"
msgid ""
"Where there is nothing, there is still power, and the Void Mages embody that "
"power.  The ability to wield emptiness itself is at their fingertips, and no "
"living creature can withstand the call of the void.\n"
"\n"
"Drainer: Your Void Mage abilities grant you perfect night vision, and envenom "
"everyone you attack."
msgstr ""
"在一无所有之中，仍有魔力，而虚空法师的体内饱含着这一力量。掌控虚空本身的能力就在他们指尖，没有任何活物能够抵挡虚空的召唤。\n"
"\n"
"吞噬者：你的虚空法师能力赋予你完美夜视的能力，同时会在攻击时使敌人中毒。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vulcanist"
msgstr "火山法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vulcanist"
msgid ""
"One of the most destructive forces on earth, a Volcano Mage takes some aspect "
"of its namesake.  Their spells tend to be a little slow, but their resilience "
"in proximity to a volcano is legendary.\n"
"\n"
"Lava: Your Vulcanist abilities grant you good resistance to temperature "
"conditions, total heat immunity, and immunity to smoke."
msgstr ""
"One of the most destructive forces on earth, a Volcano Mage takes some aspect "
"of its namesake.  Their spells tend to be a little slow, but their resilience "
"in proximity to a volcano is legendary.\n"
"\n"
"Lava: Your Vulcanist abilities grant you good resistance to temperature "
"conditions, total heat immunity, and immunity to smoke."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wither Mage"
msgstr "凋零法師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/attunements.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wither Mage"
msgid ""
"While biomancers focus on both life and death; Wither Mages set their sights "
"on the transitional period between these two stages.  They wield entropy and "
"decay hand and hand, using it to enhance their combat prowess to surgical "
"precision.  This confluence of abilities are what lead to assassin mages "
"gaining this attunement.\n"
"\n"
"Fading: Your Wither Mage abilities grant you the ability to consume the "
"enemies powers for a short time."
msgstr ""
"While biomancers focus on both life and death; Wither Mages set their sights "
"on the transitional period between these two stages.  They wield entropy and "
"decay hand and hand, using it to enhance their combat prowess to surgical "
"precision.  This confluence of abilities are what lead to assassin mages "
"gaining this attunement.\n"
"\n"
"Fading: Your Wither Mage abilities grant you the ability to consume the "
"enemies powers for a short time."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Magus"
msgstr "祆教徒"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Magus"
msgid ""
"A tradition as old as magic, the Magus focuses on binding and shaping the "
"energy of the universe to their will."
msgstr "祆教是種跟魔法一樣古老的教派，專注於根據自己的意願約束和形塑宇宙的能量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Animist"
msgstr "泛靈論者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Animist"
msgid ""
"The animist tradition is a relatively new school of magical thought, formed "
"through combination of many older ways that focus on harmony and connection "
"to the natural world.  This does not mean that animists are passive: the "
"natural world is a savage place."
msgstr "萬物有靈論的教派是一個相對較新的魔法思想學派，它透過結合許多注重與自然世界和諧及聯繫的傳統方式而形成。這並不意味著泛靈論者是被動的：自然界是一個殘酷的地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Kelvinist"
msgstr "熱力學者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Kelvinist"
msgid ""
"Disciples of the great Archwizard Lord Kelvin.  Kelvinists focus their magic "
"on manipulation and control of the temperature of their environment, leading "
"to spectacularly powerful explosions or bone-chilling cold.  Your powers "
"grant you some immunity from fire that increases with your skills."
msgstr "伟大的大魔法师开尔文勋爵的信徒。炽霜法师们凝聚魔力，操控温度，引发炽烈爆炸，制造刺骨严寒。你的力量赋予你一定的火焰防护，这会随着你的技能而提高。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stormshaper"
msgstr "塑風者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormshaper"
msgid ""
"Stormshapers follow ancient arcane disciplines of meditation and harmony with "
"the winds and tides that shape the planet.  Through their deep connection to "
"these forces, they can request powerful changes.  Your powers grant you some "
"immunity from electricity that increases with your skills."
msgstr ""
"风暴塑造者遵循古老的奥术信条，依靠冥想与风暴和潮汐融为一体来改造这个世界。通过他们与这些力量的深入联系，他们可以请求强大力量的改变。你的能力赋予你一些对电的"
"免疫力，这随着你的技能而提高。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Technomancer"
msgstr "科技巫師"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Technomancer"
msgid ""
"Technomancers are the new breed of modern magician, blending their arcane "
"might with their advanced knowledge of the fundamental nature of the "
"universe.  They use technology to enhance their magic and vice versa."
msgstr "科技巫師是現代魔法師的新學派，他們把神秘的力量與他們所掌握的宇宙本質的先進知識進行混合。他們使用科技來增強他們的魔力，反之亦然。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Earthshaper"
msgstr "塑地者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthshaper"
msgid ""
"Earthshapers have allowed their minds to sink deep within the stones and "
"metals of the planet, and become one with its secrets.  To a master "
"Earthshaper, spells can be as permanent as the stones they are created from, "
"and time is measured in geological eras."
msgstr ""
"大地塑形者將他們的心神沉入星球深處的岩石與金屬之中，因而成為掌握其秘密的人。對一個塑形者大師而言，法術能夠像創造出他們的石頭一樣持久，而時間的計量是以地質年"
"代來計算的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Biomancer"
msgstr "生機術士"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Biomancer"
msgid ""
"The Biomancer focuses on manipulating and even absorbing flesh; their own, "
"and that of other living or dead things.  Most other wizards find their "
"powers gross and disturbing, but no one can question the potency of their "
"abilities, and certainly not their adaptability to any situation."
msgstr ""
"生機術士專注於操縱甚至吸收肉體：包含他們自己，以及其他活著或死亡的血肉。大多數其他派別的法師發現生機術士的魔力是粗暴而令人不安的，但沒有人能夠質疑他們的魔法"
"的效力，特別是他們對任何情況的適應性。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Druid"
msgstr "德魯伊"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/magic_classes/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Druid"
msgid ""
"Druids follow a wild tradition of allegiance and rebirth within the world of "
"nature, especially the cycle of death and rebirth that is the plant world.  A "
"powerful Druid is as much a part of that world as the human one."
msgstr "德魯伊遵循自然世界中忠誠和重生的野性傳統，尤其是植物世界中死亡與重生的循環。強大的德魯伊與人類一樣，都是這個世界的一部分。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Black Dragon"
msgstr "黑龍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Black Dragon"
msgid "Acid boils through your veins.  You feel ancient power swell within you."
msgstr "酸液在你的血管里沸腾。你感觉到古老的力量在你体内膨胀。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon"
msgid ""
"You sometimes think back about the world you left behind.  You're glad you "
"burned it in your wake."
msgstr "你有时会回想起你所离开的世界。你很高兴自己在觉醒时把它烧成灰烬。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Black Dragon Scales"
msgstr "黑龍鱗片"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Scales"
msgid ""
"Your skin has grown thick and a set of draconic black scales has grown to "
"cover most of your body, acting as natural armor.  Greatly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Your skin has grown thick and a set of draconic black scales has grown to "
"cover most of your body, acting as natural armor.  Greatly reduces wet "
"effects."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Reptilian Legs"
msgstr "爬行之足"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Reptilian Legs"
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet have become reptile-like and your toenails have grown into "
"short claws.  Fortunately they don't impede your movement."
msgstr "你的腿和脚已经变得像爬行动物，你的脚趾甲已经长成了短爪。幸运的是，它们并不妨碍你的行动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dragon Legs"
msgstr "龙腿"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dragon Legs"
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet have become dragon-like and the claws on your toes have "
"developed into incredibly tough talons.  These are fearsome and powerful, but "
"prevent you from wearing shoes and slightly impede your movement."
msgstr "你的腿和脚已经变得像龙一样，脚趾上的爪子已经坚硬得难以置信。这些爪子可怕而有力，但使你无法穿鞋，还会略微妨碍你的行动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Dragon Legs" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You slash %s with your clawed feet!"
msgstr "你用爪足猛地割向 %s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Dragon Legs" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes %2$s with their clawed feet!"
msgstr "%1$s 用爪足猛地割向 %2$s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Inconvenient Draconic Growth"
msgstr "傻长巨龙"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Inconvenient Draconic Growth"
msgid ""
"You have grown noticeably taller, broader, and menacing.  Much of it is "
"useful muscle mass (Strength +2), but you find it throws off your balance and "
"you get in your own way (+10 torso and arm encumbrance), and you notice "
"people are starting to treat you differently."
msgstr ""
"你明显地长高长壮长可怕了。你变得更强壮（力量+2），但是你发现你的平衡感被破坏了，甚至会自己绊到自己（+10"
"躯干和手臂累赘），而且人们对待你的态度也有所改变。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Growth"
msgstr "生长巨龙"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Growth"
msgid ""
"You carry your rugged body with the dignity you deserve, but are all the more "
"menacing for it.  Strength +2."
msgstr "虽然你的身材高大威猛，但是你也拥有与之相匹配的力量和敏捷。力量+2。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Freakish Draconic Maturity"
msgstr "畸熟巨龙"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wyrmling Strength"
msgstr "雛龍之力"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wyrmling Strength"
msgid ""
"Your muscles are enhanced by some growing innate magic.  You are slightly "
"stronger.  Strength + 1"
msgstr "你的肌肉被体内的魔法强化。你比以前强壮了少许。力量+1"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Young Dragon Strength"
msgstr "幼龍之力"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Young Dragon Strength"
msgid ""
"The connection to your inner magic is growing and your muscles are stronger, "
"but you're a little more clumsy.  Strength + 3, Dexterity - 1"
msgstr "你与体内魔力的联系正在增强，你的肌肉也变得更加强壮，但你的动作却有点笨拙。力量+3，敏捷-1"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Strength"
msgstr "龍之力"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Strength"
msgid ""
"The magic within you courses through your muscles, greatly empowering them.  "
"This costs you valuable flexibility and coordination, however.  Strength + 5, "
"Dexterity - 2"
msgstr "你体内的魔法不断锻炼着你的肌肉，极大地增强了它们的力量。然而，这会使你失去宝贵的灵活性和协调性。力量+5，敏捷-2"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ancient Draconic Strength"
msgstr "古龍之力"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ancient Draconic Strength"
msgid ""
"Your internal magic has filled you with unimaginable strength, but you can't "
"move as freely as your form once could.  This is no problem.  Strength + 8, "
"Dexterity - 3"
msgstr "你体内的魔法已经让你充满了难以想象的力量，但是你的形体再也不能像以前一样自由地移动。这算不上问题。力量+8，敏捷-3"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Maturity"
msgstr "成熟巨龍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dragon Horns"
msgstr "龙角"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dragon Horns"
msgid ""
"You have a pair of long, curved back, dragon-like horns.  They allow you to "
"make a strong bashing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear that is "
"not made of fabric."
msgstr "你头上有一对又长又向后弯曲的龙角。你可以用你的头撞击对方造成钝击伤害，但也让你没法戴上不是织物做的帽子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Dragon Horns" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You headbutt %s with your draconic horns!"
msgstr "你用龙角头锤攻击%s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Dragon Horns" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their draconic horns!"
msgstr "%1$s用龙角头锤攻击%2$s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Black Dragon Wings"
msgstr "黑龍翅膀"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Wings"
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, black scaled dragon wings.  While you have control "
"of them and can make attacks with them, they are not large enough nor strong "
"enough to allow you to fly and they throw you off balance, greatly reducing "
"your ability to dodge.  They can be used to cast a protective spell on "
"yourself however."
msgstr ""
"你的背后有双巨大的黑色龙翼，虽然你控制了它们，可以用它们攻击敌人，但它们不够大，不够强壮以至于不但让你飞不起来还使你的身体失去了平衡，降低了你的闪避能力。不"
"过，你可以用来它们对自己施放保护法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Black Dragon Wings" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You bash %s with your powerful wings!"
msgstr "你用强力双翼猛击 %s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Black Dragon Wings" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s bashes %2$s with their powerful wings!"
msgstr "%1$s 用强力双翼猛击 %2$s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Overly Acidic Digestion"
msgstr "過酸消化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Overly Acidic Digestion"
msgid ""
"Your digestive issues have developed to become overly acidic which greatly "
"impacts your ability to normally digest food, resulting in getting far less "
"nutrition from the food you eat and making your need to eat more often."
msgstr "你消化系统的问题已经发展变得过酸，这极大地影响了你消化正常食物的能力，导致你从食物中获得的营养要变得少得多，而且你需要更经常地进食。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Breath"
msgid ""
"Your digestive issues may not have settled entirely, but you can somewhat "
"control them and now you have the ability to spit acid!"
msgstr "你消化系统的问题可能还没有完全解决，但你可以控制它，现在你能吐出酸液吐息！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Heat Dependence"
msgstr "巨龍熱能依賴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Heat Dependence"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose 1% of "
"your speed for every 5 (2.8) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  Unfortunately, "
"this doesn't seem to help you conserve any energy."
msgstr "你的肌肉反应速度受环境温度影响。在18.3℃（65F）以下，温度每降低2.8℃（5F），你的速度将下降1%。不幸的是，这似乎无法帮助你减少任何食物消耗。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "High Draconic Heat Dependence"
msgstr "重度巨龍熱能依賴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "High Draconic Heat Dependence"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is highly dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose "
"1% of your speed for every 3 (1.7) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  "
"Unfortunately, it seems you have to exert more energy to keep moving."
msgstr ""
"你的肌肉反应速度严重受环境温度影响。在18.3℃（65F）以下，温度每降低1.7℃（3F），你的速度将下降1%"
"。不幸的是，似乎你必须消耗更多能量才能持续移动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Ectothermia"
msgstr "冷血巨龍"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Ectothermia"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ectothermia"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body has become permanently cold-blooded.  Your speed lowers or raises "
"1% for every 2 (1.1) degrees below or above 65 F (18.3 C).  All this and you "
"need even more food to maintain your energy."
msgstr ""
"你已经完全变异为冷血动物。在温度低于/高于18.3℃（65F）时，每 1.1℃（2F）的变化会使你的速度降低/提高 "
"1%。这使得你需要更多的食物来维持你的能量。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Magic"
msgstr "龍裔魔法"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Magic"
msgid ""
"You are imbued with the ancient magic powers of dragons, improving your mana "
"reserves and opening your mind to amazing feats of magic."
msgstr "你的体内灌注了黑龙一族的古老魔法能量，它提高了你的魔力储备上限，并让你领悟到了绝妙的魔法专长。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Spellcasting"
msgstr "龍裔施法者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Spellcasting"
msgid ""
"Your mind has fully opened to the power and ancient heritage of dragons.  You "
"can access even greater quantities of mana and you have access to more dragon "
"spells."
msgstr "你的头脑已经与龙族古老力量和遗存完全融合。它进一步提高了你的魔力储备上限，并让你领悟到了更多的龙族法术。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Scaled Mouth"
msgstr "鱗嘴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Scaled Mouth"
msgid ""
"Your scales have grown up and around your mouth, digging into your gums and "
"retracting your lips.  On the down side, it makes speaking difficult.  On the "
"positive side, it makes it very easy to bite things, though what's driving "
"you to do that?"
msgstr "你的鳞片开始在你的嘴周围生长，它们扎在你的牙床上，让你的嘴唇回缩。往坏了说，这让你说话困难。往好了说，这让你咬东西变得很容易，但你为什么要这么做呢？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Black Dragon Maw"
msgstr "黑龍嘴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Dragon Maw"
msgid ""
"Your face and jaws have extended to a long, toothy dragon maw.  It's fearsome "
"and causes grievous wounds, but prevents wearing mouth gear."
msgstr "你的脸和下巴都变得很长，变成了长着利齿的龙嘴。它看上去非常可怕，而且能造成严重的伤口，但你嘴部无法穿戴任何装备了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stubby Dragon Tail"
msgstr "粗短龙尾"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stubby Dragon Tail"
msgid ""
"You have a short, stubby tail that has strange bumps and ridges.  You can "
"wiggle it, but it serves no purpose."
msgstr "你有一个粗短的尾巴，长着奇怪的凸起和脊。你可以扭动它，但它并无作用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Short Dragon Tail"
msgstr "短龙尾"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Short Dragon Tail"
msgid ""
"You have a short, dragonlike tail.  You can use it decently as a club of "
"sorts, but it's not doing anything to help you balance.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr "你有一条又短又粗的龙尾巴。你可以像挥舞棍棒一样轻松使用它，但它并不能帮助你保持平衡，还会让你没法穿上不是织物的裤子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dragon Tail"
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, dragonlike tail.  It doesn't help you balance or "
"dodge any better, but it is a powerful bashing weapon.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr "你有一条又长又厚的龙尾。它并不能使你保持平衡或是提升闪避能力，但能当作威力强大的钝击武器。让你没法穿上不是织物的裤子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Scaled Hands"
msgstr "鳞手"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Scaled Hands"
msgid ""
"Your scales have grown to cover your hands and elongate the tips in to jagged "
"claws that can be serviceable as cutting and piercing weapons in unarmed "
"combat.  You can still use them normally, but you can't wear gloves."
msgstr "你的鳞片开始在你的手上生长，并且指尖部分伸长成了锯齿状的爪，在徒手格斗时可以当作斩击和刺击武器使用。你仍旧可以正常控制双手，但你穿不了手套了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Black Dragon Talons"
msgstr "黑龙之爪"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Predator"
msgstr "龙形掠食者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Predator"
msgid ""
"You have become something more than human.  Something better - and far, far "
"worse.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, and unlike lesser "
"predators, your mental faculties don't suffer at all."
msgstr "你已经变得超越人类了。一些更好的东西——但也有更糟糕的东西。战斗技能很容易学习和维持，而且与较小的掠食者不同，你的智力根本不会受到影响。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Apex Predator"
msgstr "龙形顶级掠食者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Apex Predator"
msgid ""
"Your mind and brain have fully adapted to your new place at the top of the "
"magical food chain.  You can effortlessly master and maintain combat skills, "
"and your malevolent intellect only grows."
msgstr "你的思想和大脑已经完全适应了你在神奇食物链顶端的新位置。你可以毫不费力地掌握和维持战斗技能，而你的恶意智力只会不断增长。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Draconic Acid Immunity"
msgstr "龙葵酸免疫"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Draconic Acid Immunity"
msgid ""
"Like your scale and hide, your remaining flesh has been transmuted by black "
"dragon's essence.  You are invulnerable to acid now."
msgstr ""
"Like your scale and hide, your remaining flesh has been transmuted by black "
"dragon's essence.  You are invulnerable to acid now."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Dwarf"
msgstr "矮星"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Dwarf"
msgid "Your heart beats in time with the rhythm of the Earth."
msgstr "你的心脏与地球的节奏同步跳动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Child of the Stone"
msgstr "石之子"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Child of the Stone"
msgid ""
"Trust the humans to make a mess of the world.  Trust a dwarf to rebuild it "
"better than they found it."
msgstr "相信人类会把世界搞得一团糟。相信一个矮人能把它重建得比他们发现的更好。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Vitamin name
msgid "Dwarven Purifier"
msgstr "矮人净化剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Elf"
msgstr "小精灵"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Elf"
msgid "You hear the songs of nature."
msgstr "你听到了大自然的歌声。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Firstborn"
msgstr "初生者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Firstborn"
msgid ""
"The first elves sprang forth from magic and moonlight before the ancestors of "
"humanity stopped scurrying through the underbrush to avoid the dinosaurs.  "
"You won't let that legacy die with you."
msgstr "在人类的祖先不再为了躲避恐龙而匆忙穿梭于灌木丛之前，第一批精灵从魔法和月光中诞生了。你不会让这份遗产随你而去的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Vitamin name
msgid "Elven Purifier"
msgstr "精灵净化剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Goblin"
msgstr "哥布林"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Goblin"
msgid "You feel the urge to steal a baby or two."
msgstr "你有一种想偷一两个孩子的冲动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Night Stalker"
msgstr "夜行者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Stalker"
msgid ""
"Long ago, the others feared your people as hunters in the night.  In this new "
"world, it's time to revive that legacy."
msgstr "很久以前，其他人就像夜间的猎人一样害怕你的人民。在这个新的世界里，是时候重振这一传说了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Vitamin name
msgid "Goblin Purifier"
msgstr "哥布林净化剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Lizardfolk"
msgstr "蜥族"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Lizardfolk"
msgid "You remember the warmth of your home swamps."
msgstr "你记得你家沼泽的温暖。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Scaled One"
msgstr "有鳞者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Scaled One"
msgid ""
"The old world was nothing like your home swamps, but this new world is "
"something you understand."
msgstr "旧世界一点也不像你们家乡的沼泽，但这个新世界是你们所了解的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Vitamin name
msgid "Lizardfolk Purifier"
msgstr "蜥族净化剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Ravenfolk"
msgstr "鸦族"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Ravenfolk"
msgid "You feel the call of the sky.  There are treasures out there to collect."
msgstr "你感受到了天空的召唤。那里有宝藏等着你去收集。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Thought and Memory"
msgstr "思想与记忆"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Thought and Memory"
msgid ""
"In the ruins of the old world, you're sure there are plenty of new places to "
"go and new things to find."
msgstr "在旧世界的废墟中，你肯定有很多新的地方可以去，也有很多新东西可以找到。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Vitamin name
msgid "Ravenfolk Purifier"
msgstr "鸦族净化剂剂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dwarven Build"
msgstr "矮人体形"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dwarven Build"
msgid ""
"Dwarves are smaller than humans, the better to deal with confined spaces "
"underground, but as solid as the mountains (+2 STR, -1 DEX)."
msgstr "矮人比人类矮小，能够更好地适应地下狭窄的空间环境，但他们拥有如山脉般坚实的体魄（+2 力量，-1 敏捷）。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Earthborn Artisan"
msgstr "尘世工匠"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthborn Artisan"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Born from the living earth, your people are naturally adept at the "
"manipulation of the physical world.  Your crafting speed is 10% faster, and "
"you can even craft in darkness."
msgstr "诞于在生命土地之上，你族人民天生擅长操控物质世界。你的制作速度提高 10%，甚至可以在黑暗中进行制作。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Darksight"
msgstr "夜视"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Darksight"
msgid ""
"Long ages underground or under the night boughs have made your people capable "
"of seeing into the infrared spectrum."
msgstr "长期生活在地下或夜间的树枝下使你们的人能够看到红外光谱。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Elven Build"
msgstr "精灵体型"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Elven Build"
msgid ""
"Elves are more lithe and frail than humans, but possess an almost "
"otherworldly grace (-1 STR, +2 DEX)."
msgstr "精灵比人类更柔弱，但拥有近乎超凡脱俗的优雅。力量 -1，敏捷 +2。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Passing Fair"
msgstr "极其美貌"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Passing Fair"
msgid ""
"The elves are often called the \"Fair Folk\" due to their preternatural "
"beauty, and you are no exception to this custom."
msgstr "精灵常因其超凡之美被称作“仙灵”，在这一惯例上，你亦不例外。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Elvensight"
msgstr "精灵视觉"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Elvensight"
msgid ""
"Like a cat, elven eyes are well-attuned to low levels of light, able to pick "
"up even the slightest glimmer.  You have greatly-enhanced night vision."
msgstr "精灵的眼睛，如同猫眼般敏锐，即使在幽暗中也能捕捉到最细微的闪光。你拥有极其强大的夜视能力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Elven Hearing"
msgstr "精灵听觉"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Elven Hearing"
msgid "Your delicate pointed ears allow you to hear all the sounds of the world."
msgstr "你精致尖尖的耳朵可以让你听到世界上所有的声音。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Reverie"
msgstr "幻梦"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Reverie"
msgid ""
"Rather than sleep insensate like humans do, you blend living night and dreams "
"into a harmonious whole.  You are not bothered by light levels, and need much "
"less sleep per night."
msgstr "你不像人类那样睡得毫无知觉，而是把活生生的黑夜和梦境融合成一个和谐的整体。你不会受到光线水平的影响，每晚需要的睡眠也会少得多。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Natural Stride"
msgstr "自然步伐"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Natural Stride"
msgid ""
"The elves were born of nature and the elements, and long ages under the trees "
"allow them to quickly pass through their forest homes."
msgstr "精灵是大自然和自然元素的产物，在树下生活了很长时间，使他们能够快速穿越森林家园。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Goblin Build"
msgstr "哥布林体型"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Goblin Build"
msgid ""
"Goblins are much smaller than humans, often no more than half the height.  "
"You have a harder time carrying things and can't eat as much, but you're "
"better at dodging and make very little noise when you move."
msgstr "哥布林比人类小得多，通常不超过一半的高度。你很难拿东西，也不能吃那么多，但你更善于躲避，移动时很少发出噪音。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Nocturnal"
msgid ""
"Your people have always had an easier time operating at night, away from the "
"hated light of the sun."
msgstr "你的人在晚上行动总是比较容易，远离讨厌的阳光。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Goblin Teeth"
msgstr "哥布林牙齿"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Goblin Teeth"
msgid ""
"Your teeth are longer and more pointed than not.  Before the Cataclysm it was "
"considered extremely gauche to bite anything in a fight; it was a mark of the "
"goblins' uncivilized past.  But, needs must."
msgstr "你的牙齿又长又尖。在大灾变之前，战斗时咬人曾被认为是无礼之举，是未开化者的残留。但是，有需就有用。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Nocturnal Vision"
msgstr "夜视"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Nocturnal Vision"
msgid ""
"While your reddish eyes have been known to give other people a start, they "
"help you see in the dark.  You have much better night vision than a human, "
"even being able to craft in the dark."
msgstr ""
"While your reddish eyes have been known to give other people a start, they "
"help you see in the dark.  You have much better night vision than a human, "
"even being able to craft in the dark."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lizardfolk Build"
msgstr "蜥族体型"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lizardfolk Build"
msgid ""
"Lizardfolk are taller and stronger than humans but not much thicker and are "
"surprisingly fast for their size (+1 STR, +1 DEX)."
msgstr "蜥族比人类更高、更强壮，但挨揍程度并没有强太多，相对其体型而言动作十分迅捷。力量 +1，敏捷 +1。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lizardfolk Feet"
msgstr "蜥族之足"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lizardfolk Feet"
msgid ""
"Your feet are heavily webbed, with three large scaled toes and a dewclaw in "
"the back, allowing you to swim faster.  However, your feet are not designed "
"for human footwear."
msgstr "你的脚上是三个巨大的鳞状脚趾，脚趾间长有厚蹼，脚后跟有一个露爪，让你游得更快。然而，你的脚穿不进人类的鞋子。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ectothermia"
msgstr "冷血动物"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Scalefolk Mindset"
msgstr "上族思维"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Scalefolk Mindset"
msgid ""
"While not completely predatory, the lizardfolk are generally not particularly "
"invested in the welfare of warmbloods.  Their death does not affect you "
"greatly, and your ability to maintain combat skills is enhanced."
msgstr "虽然不是完全的掠食性动物，但蜥蜴族通常不会特别关注温血动物的福利。他们的死亡不会对你造成太大的影响，而且你维持战斗技能的能力得到了增强。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lizardfolk Muzzle"
msgstr "Lizardfolk Muzzle"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lizardfolk Muzzle"
msgid ""
"Your face and jaws are those of a predatory lizard, with a set of sharp teeth "
"to go with them.  They look NASTY--as do the bite wounds they can "
"inflict--but prevent wearing mouthgear."
msgstr ""
"Your face and jaws are those of a predatory lizard, with a set of sharp teeth "
"to go with them.  They look NASTY--as do the bite wounds they can "
"inflict--but prevent wearing mouthgear."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ravenfolk Build"
msgstr "鸦族体型"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ravenfolk Build"
msgid ""
"Ravenfolk are about the same size as humans, though their feathers and wings "
"obviously set them apart."
msgstr "鸦族的体型和人类差不多，不过它们的羽毛和翅膀显然使它们与众不同。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ravenfolk Legs"
msgstr "鸦族下肢"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ravenfolk Legs"
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet are those of a raven, with three long talons at the front "
"and one at the back, ending in wicked claws and preventing you from wearing "
"shoes.  Fortunately they don't impede your movement, and you could use them "
"as part of a leaping attack."
msgstr ""
"Your legs and feet are those of a raven, with three long talons at the front "
"and one at the back, ending in wicked claws and preventing you from wearing "
"shoes.  Fortunately they don't impede your movement, and you could use them "
"as part of a leaping attack."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ravenfolk Wings"
msgstr "鸦族翅膀"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ravenfolk Wings"
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large raven wings projecting from your shoulderblades.  "
"Your body is too heavy to be able to fly, but if you're not too weighed down, "
"you might be able to glide from a ledge or lessen the impact of a fall."
msgstr ""
"You have a pair of large raven wings projecting from your shoulderblades.  "
"Your body is too heavy to be able to fly, but if you're not too weighed down, "
"you might be able to glide from a ledge or lessen the impact of a fall."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Raven Beak"
msgstr "渡鸦喙"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Raven Beak"
msgid ""
"Your large beak allows you to imitate nearly every sound humans can make, as "
"well as let out very loud screeches.  And also rip into flesh, if it comes to "
"that."
msgstr ""
"Your large beak allows you to imitate nearly every sound humans can make, as "
"well as let out very loud screeches.  And also rip into flesh, if it comes to "
"that."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Raven Beak" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You stab into %s with your beak!"
msgstr "你用喙刺击了 %s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Raven Beak" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stabs into %2$s with their beak!"
msgstr "%1$s 用喙猛戳了 %2$s！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation ""
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your bones are nearly hollow, a remnant of your people's past as creatures of "
"the air.  Your body is very light as a result, enabling you to move and "
"attack 20% faster, but also frail; you can carry 40% less, and bashing "
"attacks injure you more."
msgstr ""
"你的骨头几乎是空心的，，这是你们族群过去作为空中生物的遗留特征。由于你的身体很轻，你的行动速度增加20%，但你的体质也弱，你的最大载重量减少40%"
"，而且你受到的钝击伤害有所提升。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Chrysophilia"
msgstr "Chrysophilia"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Chrysophilia"
msgid ""
"You need to have shiny objects on your person or you just can't concentrate "
"very well.  You suffer a morale penalty unless you're wearing at least six "
"items made of gold or silver."
msgstr ""
"You need to have shiny objects on your person or you just can't concentrate "
"very well.  You suffer a morale penalty unless you're wearing at least six "
"items made of gold or silver."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Manatouched"
msgstr "魔触之魂"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Manatouched"
msgid "Your ley lines surge with mana and power."
msgstr "你的灵脉和魔能力量一同搏动。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Manatouched"
msgid "Magic is in you.  Magic is you."
msgstr "魔法在你体内。你就是魔法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Solidification"
msgstr "魔力固化"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Solidification"
msgid ""
"Your internal ley lines have become much easier for you to control, resulting "
"in you being able to naturally create crystallized mana."
msgstr "你体内的灵脉变得更容易受你控制了，这让你能够很自然地制造出魔力结晶。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Seeker Bolts"
msgid ""
"Your hands glow with mana energy.  You can fire seeker bolts from your "
"fingertips."
msgstr "你的双手闪耀着魔法能量。你可以用指尖发射能够追踪敌人的火焰箭。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Subtle Spell"
msgstr "精妙法术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Subtle Spell"
msgid ""
"You no longer need to move your arms to cast spells, due to your ley lines "
"becoming untethered from your arms.  Hand and arm encumbrance no longer "
"applies to spells, and you can cast regardless of wielded objects."
msgstr "由于你的灵脉已经从你的手臂上脱离，你在施法时无需挥舞你的手臂。双手和手臂的累赘不再影响施法，而且你可以在手持物品的情况下施法。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Silent Spell"
msgstr "默发法术"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Silent Spell"
msgid ""
"You no longer need to use your voice to enforce your will upon the world.  "
"Verbal spells do not require an incantation, and mouth encumbrance no longer "
"applies to spell failure chance."
msgstr "你不再需要发出声音便可将自身意志强加于这个世界之上。需言语的法术无需吟唱咒语，嘴部累赘不再增加法术失败几率。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weak"
msgstr "虛弱"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak"
msgid "Your body is unnaturally weak.  -2 Strength."
msgstr "你的身体异常虚弱。力量 -2。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Luminance"
msgstr "魔力发光"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Luminance"
msgid ""
"The constant thrum of mana makes your ley lines visibly glow beneath the skin "
"of your torso and limbs, shedding a small amount of light.  However, it also "
"makes you slightly warmer."
msgstr ""
"The constant thrum of mana makes your ley lines visibly glow beneath the skin "
"of your torso and limbs, shedding a small amount of light.  However, it also "
"makes you slightly warmer."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Flares"
msgstr "Mana Flares"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Flares"
msgid ""
"Casting a spell sometimes causes your mana to grow overexcited, making the "
"normally-dim glow of your ley lines much brighter.  This extends the glow to "
"your entire body."
msgstr ""
"Casting a spell sometimes causes your mana to grow overexcited, making the "
"normally-dim glow of your ley lines much brighter.  This extends the glow to "
"your entire body."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eldritch Glow"
msgid ""
"Your mana sometimes swirls off your leylines and excites the air, creating a "
"eldritch glow around you, occasionally happening when you cast or a spell or "
"when your mana is high enough.  All you can do when it happens is wait for it "
"to subside."
msgstr ""
"Your mana sometimes swirls off your leylines and excites the air, creating a "
"eldritch glow around you, occasionally happening when you cast or a spell or "
"when your mana is high enough.  All you can do when it happens is wait for it "
"to subside."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Siphon"
msgstr "魔力虹吸"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Siphon"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Drain"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Vortex"
msgid ""
"Violence excites your ley lines.  Whenever you hit an enemy in melee, you "
"have a chance of regaining some mana."
msgstr "暴力能够唤醒你体内的灵脉。当你在近战中攻击命中敌人时，你就有几率获得一些魔力。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Drain"
msgstr "魔力汲取"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Vortex"
msgstr "魔力漩涡"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Manatouched Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "強烈法力效率"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Manatouched Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "強烈法力再生率"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Manatouched Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "強烈法力靈敏度"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ The Librarian of the Forge of Wonders.
msgid "Librarian, A"
msgstr "圖書管理員，A"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ The Librarian of the Forge of Wonders.
#. ~ The Pirate of the Forge of Wonders.
#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ The Lord of the Forge of Wonders.
msgid "Forge Lord"
msgstr "熔爐之主"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
msgid "Forge Librarian"
msgstr "熔爐圖書管理員"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#. ~ Job description of "Forge Librarian" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
msgid "I take care of the books and scrolls."
msgstr "我负责管理书籍和卷轴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I keep Valzain's books.  There are many floors of bookshelves among his "
"pocket dimensions, with more magic than a mortal mind like yours could "
"comprehend.  These happen to be the ones I think it most likely he'll read "
"soon.  I can sell some that we have extra copies of."
msgstr ""
"I keep Valzain's books.  There are many floors of bookshelves among his "
"pocket dimensions, with more magic than a mortal mind like yours could "
"comprehend.  These happen to be the ones I think it most likely he'll read "
"soon.  I can sell some that we have extra copies of."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you have any more books in the back?"
msgstr "Do you have any more books in the back?"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I organize the books, I sell extra books, back when we still lent books I "
"would hunt down those with late books to return.  I have done this for aeons "
"past and I will continue to do this for aeons to come."
msgstr ""
"I organize the books, I sell extra books, back when we still lent books I "
"would hunt down those with late books to return.  I have done this for aeons "
"past and I will continue to do this for aeons to come."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Let's talk business then."
msgstr "好吧，那就谈交易吧。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It shouldn't take Valzain too long to read what he desires from what I have "
"out.  Check back in <interval> and I should have some new books set out."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_ARDELIA.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Safe readings."
msgstr "Safe readings."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ The Diviner of the Forge of Wonders.
msgid "Mary Machen"
msgstr "玛丽·马琴"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ The Diviner of the Forge of Wonders.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
msgid "Diviner"
msgstr "预言家"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Job description of "Diviner" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
msgid "I see the past, the present, and the future."
msgstr "我看见过去、现在、未来。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Are you looking for something?  I can help with anything but your own stuff.  "
"You'll have to ask your mother for help with that."
msgstr "你在找什么？除了你自己的东西，我什么都能帮忙。那些东西去找你自己的妈妈求助吧。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you help me find something?"
msgstr "你能帮我寻找东西吗？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"What are any of us really doing here in this dead and dying world?  I "
"specialize in scrying, and while I wish I could say I'm in it to help lost "
"souls find their way, the collective pockets of a thousand realities is a "
"very good incentive.  I can help you find any number of things, but I take no "
"responsibility for what happens when you find what you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"What are any of us really doing here in this dead and dying world?  I "
"specialize in scrying, and while I wish I could say I'm in it to help lost "
"souls find their way, the collective pockets of a thousand realities is a "
"very good incentive.  I can help you find any number of things, but I take no "
"responsibility for what happens when you find what you're looking for."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Perhaps.  What do you seek?"
msgstr "也许吧。你能找到什么？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A dangerous location."
msgstr "危险地点。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A man made structure."
msgstr "人造建筑。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A geological formation."
msgstr "地质构造。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A plant."
msgstr "一棵植物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An animal."
msgstr "一只动物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A god."
msgstr "一位神灵。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "About something else…"
msgstr "关于其他事情..."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "A thrill seeker, are you?  So what will it be?"
msgstr "你又要寻找刺激了？这次是什么？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An ant nest."
msgstr "蚁穴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An acid ant nest."
msgstr "酸蚁穴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Spiders."
msgstr "蜘蛛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A fungal growth."
msgstr "真菌巢穴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A mi-go building."
msgstr "米戈建筑。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A triffid grove."
msgstr "一个三尖树。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A kraken cave."
msgstr "一座海怪巢穴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A slime pit."
msgstr "一座变形怪坑。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A goblin camp."
msgstr "A goblin camp."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A swamp dragon cave!"
msgstr "一座沼泽龙巢穴！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A balrog mine"
msgstr "炎魔矿场。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Seeking to pick around your civilization's corpse?  You're not the first and "
"you won't be the last."
msgstr ""
"Seeking to pick around your civilization's corpse?  You're not the first and "
"you won't be the last."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A lab."
msgstr "一座实验室。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An Exodii location."
msgstr "流亡族据点。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A strange temple."
msgstr "一座神秘庙宇。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An attunement altar."
msgstr "一座调谐祭坛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A magic academy."
msgstr "一所魔法学院。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A wizard tower."
msgstr "一座法师塔。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A druid tower."
msgstr "A druid tower."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A goblin city."
msgstr "A goblin city."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This reality does not seem to have a history of being inhabited by humans.  "
"Perhaps humanity never evolved?  Or perhaps they never discovered this "
"continent?  Either way, due to the portal storms, humans are here now.  And "
"so are orcs and goblins.  I should be able to help you find some artificial "
"structures.  What are you looking for?"
msgstr ""
"这个世界过去似乎没有人类居住过。也许人类从未演化出来？或者他们从来没发现过这个大陆？不论如何，传送门风暴带来了人类。还有兽人和哥布林。我应该可以帮你找到一些"
"人造建筑。你想要什么？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Sure.  Looking for a nice spot to watch the world end, perhaps?"
msgstr "Sure.  Looking for a nice spot to watch the world end, perhaps?"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A river."
msgstr "一条河。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A clay deposit."
msgstr "一座粘土矿床。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A sand deposit."
msgstr "沙坑。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A hot spring."
msgstr "一座温泉。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A cave."
msgstr "一座洞穴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "A plant you say?  Which one?"
msgstr "植物？什么植物？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A magical plant."
msgstr "魔法植物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm afraid I can't do that right now.  Sorry."
msgstr "恐怕我现在做不到。抱歉。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Fair enough.  About something else…"
msgstr "好吧。关于其他事情..."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I see.  You could get some from trading with the merchants around here.  The "
"librarian is crazy for beech nuts, for example.  I saw her trade away all her "
"money and books for a literal truckload of the things in another reality "
"earlier.  Not sure what she does with them.  You see, she's lined her private "
"rooms with lead which just so happens to block my scrying.  Almost like she "
"doesn't trust me.  Not sure why."
msgstr ""
"I see.  You could get some from trading with the merchants around here.  The "
"librarian is crazy for beech nuts, for example.  I saw her trade away all her "
"money and books for a literal truckload of the things in another reality "
"earlier.  Not sure what she does with them.  You see, she's lined her private "
"rooms with lead which just so happens to block my scrying.  Almost like she "
"doesn't trust me.  Not sure why."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I see a giant ant cutting down a tree with her mandibles.  Did you know that "
"worker ants are all female?  I see her friends around her as well.  I'll mark "
"the location on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "我看到了一只巨大的蚂蚁用她的下颚砍倒一棵树。你知道工蚁都是雌性吗？她身边还有许多同伴朋友。给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你在地图上标出那个地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It's a deal."
msgstr "一言为定。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can't afford that right now."
msgstr "我现在可给不出那么多钱。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I see a giant ant lobbing globs of acids at a group of unfortunate dogs.  It "
"seems to be quite effective.  I'll mark the location on your map for one "
"denarius."
msgstr "我看到一只巨大的蚂蚁向一群可怜的狗吐酸球。这似乎很有效。给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你在地图上标出那个地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Why would you ever want to get close to those creatures?  Don't you know they "
"lay eggs inside of other creatures!?  Including humans!  Well, if you're sure "
"you want to go there, I'll mark the location on your map for one denarius.  "
"But don't come crying to me if you get poked full of dermatik larvae.  "
"Seriously, don't.  I would like to keep my lunch.  If they do give you "
"problems though, you might find that drinking mugwort oil helps.  It's made "
"with, uh, mugwort.  And oil.  I think."
msgstr ""
"你为什么想要接近那些生物？难道你不知道它们在其他生物体内产卵吗？包括人类！好吧，如果你确定要去，我就在地图上标出那个地方，只要给我一个第纳尔。但假如你被灌满"
"了寄生虫幼虫可别哭着找我。说真的，别来。我还想留着我的午餐。如果它们确实给你带来了麻烦，你会发现喝点艾草油会有所帮助。是用，嗯，艾草，和油做的吧，我想是的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sure, why not."
msgstr "当然，为什么不呢？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "On second <freaking> thought…"
msgstr "On second <freaking> thought…"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Nope!  Fuck this.  I'm out."
msgstr "Nope!  Fuck this.  I'm out."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Spiders it is then.  But of course, there are several different kinds of "
"spiders out there.  Which type are you interested in?"
msgstr ""
"Spiders it is then.  But of course, there are several different kinds of "
"spiders out there.  Which type are you interested in?"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Web spinners in a forest."
msgstr "森林里的织网蜘蛛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A pit full of spiders."
msgstr "一座充满蜘蛛的巢穴。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Demonic spiders."
msgstr "恶魔蜘蛛。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I see a grove covered in webs.  And legs.  So many legs.  I'll mark the "
"location on your map for one denarius.  Just don't bring any of them back "
"here."
msgstr "我看到一片被蛛网覆盖的小树林。还有腿，好多腿。给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你在地图上标出位置。别把它们带回来就行了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There is a burrow not too far away that is absolutely crawling with spiders.  "
"Probably.  I didn't get a close look.  And I don't intend to.  I'll mark the "
"location on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "不远的地方有一个洞，里面爬满了蜘蛛。大概是吧，我没有仔细看。我也不打算这么做。给我一个第纳尔，我就在地图上帮你标出位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Fascinating creatures, really.  They have evolved a way to channel their "
"innate mana into potent fire spells.  Some demonic spider queens collect "
"magical items as well.  Perhaps they have a way of absorbing the mana in them "
"and use it for themselves?  I'll mark the lair of such a queen on your map "
"for one denarius.  You might want to bring fire resistant clothing."
msgstr ""
"真是迷人的生物。它们已经进化出可以将天生魔力转化为强大的火焰法术的能力。一些恶魔蜘蛛女王也会收集魔法物品。也许他们有办法吸收其中的魔力并为自己所用？给我一个"
"第纳尔，我就帮你在地图上标出巢穴位置。你最好带上防火服。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No thanks.  Giant fire-breathing spiders are no joke."
msgstr "不，谢谢。巨型喷火蜘蛛可不是闹着玩的。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Ah yes, the extradimensional fungal dispersed intelligence known as the "
"Mycus.  Quite a menace to interdimensional travelers, I tell you.  Some see "
"them as a god.  Some see them as an existential threat.  And yet others see "
"them as a good source of plant fibers.  Their cellular structure makes them "
"highly adaptive to a wide variety of levels of reality, much like other "
"fungal lifeforms.  Should you find yourself infected and without antifungal "
"medicine, you can try rubbing sulphur on your skin.  It might not work, and "
"it might irritate your skin, but anything is preferable to letting it run its "
"course.  Should medication fail, don't bother with a bullet through your "
"head.  It won't save you from your impending fate.  Instead, use fire, that's "
"my advice.  Now then, the Mycus have a few different manifestations.  Which "
"one are you interested in?"
msgstr ""
"啊，是的，被称为马卡斯的超维度真菌分散智能体。我告诉你，它们对跨维度旅行者来说是一个相当大的威胁。有些人把他们视为神。有些人将其视为生死存亡的威胁。还有一些"
"人认为它们是植物纤维的良好来源。它们的细胞结构使它们高度适应各种各样的现实世界，就像其他真菌生命形式一样。如果你发现自己被感染了，而且没有抗真菌药物，你可以"
"试着在皮肤上擦硫磺。它可能不起作用，也可能刺激你的皮肤，但任何事情都比让它顺其自然要好。如果药物治疗失败了，别费心让子弹穿过你的脑袋。这并不能把你从迫在眉睫"
"的命运中拯救出来。取而代之的是用火，这是我的建议。现在，马卡斯有几种不同的表现形式。你对哪一个感兴趣？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A bloom."
msgstr "一朵盛开的花。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A tower."
msgstr "一座塔。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Some flowers."
msgstr "一些花。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "On second thought, maybe I'll go for something else…"
msgstr "转念一想，我们还是谈点别的吧。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You know what?  Nevermind."
msgstr "你说怎么着？算了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I can almost smell them through the crystal ball.  Disturbing.  I'll mark the "
"location on your map for one denarius.  Good luck.  You might need it."
msgstr "我甚至能透过水晶球闻到它们的味道，真是令人不安。给我一个第纳尔，我就在地图上标出这个地方。祝你好运。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Scrying on these things makes me uneasy, but I'll mark the location on your "
"map for one denarius."
msgstr "探知这些东西让我浑身不舒服，但只要给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你标出位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I can't even number the times I've scraped this mess off of the forge.  It's "
"like walking into a spider web at an hundred miles an hour, and the web also "
"smells terribly and tries to eat you.  At least the magical torches the "
"forgemaster has installed help a bit.  See, the Mycus fears fire, and for "
"good reasons.  Anyways, I'll mark the location on your map for one denarius.  "
"Don't eat the fruit."
msgstr ""
"我都记不清有多少次从熔炉上刮掉这些东西了。这就像以每秒50"
"米的速度走进一张蜘蛛网，而且这蜘蛛网很难闻，想要吃掉你。至少锻造大师安装的魔法火炬有点帮助。马卡斯害怕火，这就说得清了。总之，只要给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你标"
"出位置。记住了：别吃那里的任何东西，无论它们有多诱人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Right.  Fungal crustaceans from space.  Mighty unpleasant fellas, if you ask "
"me.  But, uh, don't tell them I said so.  The forge lord says they mean no "
"offense, that cutting people up is just their way of saying 'hi'.  Personally "
"I find it rude, but perhaps that's anthropocentric of me.  But I digress.  "
"Are you interested in an encampment or a scout tower?"
msgstr ""
"对，来自太空的真菌甲壳类动物。要我说，这真是讨厌的家伙——啊哦，别告诉他们。铸造大师说他们没有冒犯的意思......"
"把人砍成碎片只是他们打招呼的方式。就我个人而言，这很粗鲁，但也许这是我的人类中心主义。\n"
"我离题了。你对营地还是侦察塔感兴趣?？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An encampment."
msgstr "一座营地。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A scout tower."
msgstr "一座侦察塔。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "On second thought…"
msgstr "又想了想..."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Have you seen mi-go architecture?  They make these living, organic structures "
"out of resin.  Kind of cool.  And disturbing, I guess.  Of course, they'll "
"cut you to pieces if you gawk at it too long.  I'll mark the location of one "
"of these places on your map for one denarius.  I heard a story, not sure if "
"it was true, but allegedly one guy tried to use the mi-go building resin as "
"armor.  Apparently, it bore into the poor guy's flesh!  Like lichen!  His "
"friends tried to tear it off, but it wouldn't bulge.  He was in so much pain "
"they decided to put him out of his misery.  But they couldn't do it, because "
"the armor was too good!  So I guess that in a sense it worked.  Heh.  The "
"mental image still keeps me awake at night, occasionally.  And now you have "
"it too.  You're welcome."
msgstr ""
"你看过那些米·戈建筑吗？它们用树脂建造出那些活生生的有机结构。挺酷的，而且令人不安，我想。当然，如果你盯着它看太久，它们会把你切成碎片的。只要给我一个第纳尔"
"，我就帮你标出位置。我听过一个故事，不知道是真是假，但据说一个人试图用那种树脂制造盔甲。不出意料，它扎进了那个可怜的家伙的肉里！就像地衣一样！他的朋友们试图"
"把它扯下来，但它毫发无损。他非常痛苦，他们决定结束他的痛苦。但他们做不到，因为盔甲太好了！所以我想，从某种意义上说，它起效了。呵呵。偶尔，脑海中的画面仍然会"
"让我晚上睡不着觉。现在你也有画面了吧，不用谢。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Uh sure.  Thanks?  It's a deal."
msgstr "我谢谢你，我真的谢谢你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The mi-go seem to abduct humans and animals for some alien purpose, and then "
"build these towers for their spaceships to dock with to move the prisoners "
"of-world.  Did I mention they have space ships?  Well, I've never actually "
"seen one dock with a tower, but still.  I'll mark such a tower on your map "
"for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"米·戈们似乎为了某种怪异目的而绑架人类和动物，建造了这些塔，让它们的宇宙飞船停靠，把这些囚犯送出地球。我好像提到了他们有宇宙飞船？不过，我没能亲眼见过这种塔"
"。即便如此，只要给我一个第纳尔，我就能帮你标出塔的位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Right.  Extradimensional intelligent plants with a mean streak.  They seem to "
"have a method of traveling from reality to reality without traversing the "
"hazards between.  Interesting, no?  I'd ask them how they do it but I don't "
"think I could get a word in edgewise before they cut me to pieces.  I'll mark "
"one of their groves on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"Right.  Extradimensional intelligent plants with a mean streak.  They seem to "
"have a method of traveling from reality to reality without traversing the "
"hazards between.  Interesting, no?  I'd ask them how they do it but I don't "
"think I could get a word in edgewise before they cut me to pieces.  I'll mark "
"one of their groves on your map for one denarius."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It seems that a group of mutated cephalopods have set up camp in a cave near "
"the water.  I don't know what they're up to, but if you want to go and "
"investigate I'll mark the cave on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "看起来一群变异章鱼在水边的洞穴里扎营了。我不知道它们在干什么，但如果你想去调查一下，只要一个第纳尔，我就在地图上给你标上位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Do you like slime?  Do you like living slime that tries to eat you?  Do you "
"wish you were surrounded by lots and lots and lots of it?  Then perhaps this "
"place is the place for you.  I'll mark the place on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"你喜欢变形怪吗？你喜欢想要吃你的活生生的变形怪吗？你希望自己被很多很多很多的变形怪包围吗？那也许那里就是你的归宿。只要给我一个第纳尔，我就能在地图上标出位置"
"。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Good choice.  It seems that shortly before the world started to end, a few of "
"them got it in their heads to just leave civilization alone for a bit and go "
"live in the woods with other goblins.  And wargs.  Not a terrible idea if you "
"ask me.  Anyways, there's a few different types of places they gather, are "
"you looking for an encampment or an outpost?"
msgstr ""
"Good choice.  It seems that shortly before the world started to end, a few of "
"them got it in their heads to just leave civilization alone for a bit and go "
"live in the woods with other goblins.  And wargs.  Not a terrible idea if you "
"ask me.  Anyways, there's a few different types of places they gather, are "
"you looking for an encampment or an outpost?"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An outpost."
msgstr "An outpost."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You've got a long walk deep into the forest ahead of you.  Oh, and did I "
"mention the wargs?  They've got these wargs that are absolutely adorable.  Of "
"course they'll maul you if you try to pet them, but the temptation is always "
"there.  I'll mark one of their camps on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"You've got a long walk deep into the forest ahead of you.  Oh, and did I "
"mention the wargs?  They've got these wargs that are absolutely adorable.  Of "
"course they'll maul you if you try to pet them, but the temptation is always "
"there.  I'll mark one of their camps on your map for one denarius."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Contrary to popular belief, goblins are not actually orcs.  Its the other way "
"around.  Orcs are goblins who have taken one too many unlabeled potions and "
"lived to tell the tale.  Sometimes this awakens powers much like my own.  "
"Well, not exactly, if it did I'd be out of a job faster than a Magus could "
"cast Phase Door.  Luckily for you, you shouldn't have to delve too deep into "
"a forest to see for yourself.  I'll mark one of their outposts on your map "
"for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"Contrary to popular belief, goblins are not actually orcs.  Its the other way "
"around.  Orcs are goblins who have taken one too many unlabeled potions and "
"lived to tell the tale.  Sometimes this awakens powers much like my own.  "
"Well, not exactly, if it did I'd be out of a job faster than a Magus could "
"cast Phase Door.  Luckily for you, you shouldn't have to delve too deep into "
"a forest to see for yourself.  I'll mark one of their outposts on your map "
"for one denarius."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh, fancy yourself a dragon slayer, eh?  It's my understanding they use a lot "
"of acid, so be ready for that.  And remember that the body parts of dragons "
"are quite valuable.  Even the blood, so you might wanna bring something to "
"keep said blood in, and bleed the corpses before you butcher.  I'll mark it "
"on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"哦，想当屠龙者，嗯？据我了解，它们会喷酸，所以要为此做好准备。而且记住，龙的浑身都是宝，甚至血液也不例外，所以你可能想带点东西装血，并记得在你完全屠宰之前给"
"尸体放血。只要给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你标出它巢穴的位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Now there is not a lot I can tell you about this one.  There is some kind of "
"demonic beast living in this cave.  But it only surfaces occasionally, and "
"the heavy metals in the cave walls interfere with my scrying.  There might be "
"treasure down there, or there might not be.  But there is certain to be "
"danger.  I'll mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"现在关于这个，我能告诉你的不多。这个山洞里住着某种恶魔兽。但它只是偶尔浮出水面，洞穴墙壁上的重金属干扰了我的占卜结果。那里可能有宝藏，也可能没有。但肯定充满"
"了危险。只要给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你标出位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Deeply buried secret installations where shady government organizations "
"conducted unethical experiments, free from moral constrains.  Did such places "
"really exist before the Cataclysm, or did humanity's collective mistrust, "
"superstition and conspiracy theories cause the portal storms to dream these "
"places into existence?  I honestly can't tell, but I suppose it doesn't "
"matter now.  These places do exist, and are ripe with mysteries, dangers, and "
"loot.  You'll have to specify which kind you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"Deeply buried secret installations where shady government organizations "
"conducted unethical experiments, free from moral constrains.  Did such places "
"really exist before the Cataclysm, or did humanity's collective mistrust, "
"superstition and conspiracy theories cause the portal storms to dream these "
"places into existence?  I honestly can't tell, but I suppose it doesn't "
"matter now.  These places do exist, and are ripe with mysteries, dangers, and "
"loot.  You'll have to specify which kind you're looking for."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Just a normal one."
msgstr "普通的就行了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A central lab."
msgstr "一座中央实验室。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An ice lab."
msgstr "一座冷冻实验室。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A nether lab."
msgstr "一座异界实验室。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Right.  Probably a good call.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "对。也许是个好主意。只要给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你在地图上标出位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"A larger lab with more dangers and more treasures.  I'll mark it on your map "
"for one denarius."
msgstr "一间更大的实验室，里面有更多的危险和更多的宝藏。只要给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你在地图上标出位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's an incredibly cold place, that lab.  The deeper parts might even be "
"below absolute zero.  Now this was of course not possible during the old laws "
"of physics, but times change.  Times change.  I'll mark one on your map for "
"one denarius."
msgstr "那个实验室可冷了。更深的部分甚至可能低于绝对零度。依照以前的物理定律，这显然是不可能的，但是时代变了。时代变了。给我一个第纳尔，我就在地图上给你标出位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Cool.  It's a deal."
msgstr "酷，一言为定。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Actually, I got cold feet."
msgstr "好吧，这让我临阵退缩了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Here it seems like the scientists managed to break through the walls of "
"reality to the nether.  Of course, they didn't bother to do it correctly, so "
"the whole place is a mess.  Be ready for flaming eyes if you go there.  I'll "
"mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"科学家们似乎成功地打通了现世与异界。当然，他们就没想过安全流程，所以这整个地方变得一团糟。如果你去那里，要当心面对燃烧之眼。只要给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你标出"
"位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Fellow travelers between realities, those ones.  At first I thought they "
"would be competition, but they seem to have little interest in the things we "
"at the forge value.  Nowadays we barely interact with them, except in the "
"rare occasions when we find a group of them marooned in between the worlds.  "
"Poor things are almost always driven completely insane by the time we can "
"mount a rescue.  Nevertheless, it's the law of the sea out there, as far as "
"Valzain is concerned.  They seem to have set up shop not too far from here.  "
"I'll mark it on your map for one denarius.  You might wanna check the magic "
"item store for an Amulet of Comprehend Languages before you go.  Then again, "
"we might be out of that right now."
msgstr ""
"在不同现实世界之间穿行的同伴旅行者，那群人。起初我以为他们会是竞争对手，但他们似乎对我们熔炉所重视的东西兴趣不大。如今，我们很少与他们互动，除了在极少数情况"
"下，当我们发现他们被困在两个世界之间会伸手帮一把。几乎每次在我们可以救援时，这群可怜人快被完全逼疯了。尽管如此，对瓦尔赞而言，这就是海洋的法则。他们似乎在离"
"这里不远的地方开了家店。只要给我一个第纳尔，我就会在你的地图上标出位置。在你出发之前，你也许会想去魔法物品商店看看有没有通晓语言护符买。但话说回来，我们现在"
"可能已经卖光了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yes, a strange location indeed, buried mostly underground.  Was it really "
"built by humans?  I find that rather unlikely.  I can't see very deep into "
"the structure, but there is a strange power somewhere below the entrance.  "
"I'll mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"是的，确实是一个奇怪的地方，大部分埋在地下。它真的是人类建造的吗？我觉得这不太可能。我看不清建筑的深处，但在入口下方的某个地方有股奇怪的力量。只要给我一个第"
"纳尔，我就在地图上给你标上位置。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You know, if you've got the aptitude, you should go visit an attunement "
"altar.  They help you combine your skills with different classes of magic to "
"incredible effect.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"You know, if you've got the aptitude, you should go visit an attunement "
"altar.  They help you combine your skills with different classes of magic to "
"incredible effect.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This place used to teach magic before the whole Malignance business.  There "
"are probably still spell scrolls and magical items to find there.  And "
"golems.  Can't forget about the golems.  I'll mark one on your map for one "
"denarius."
msgstr ""
"This place used to teach magic before the whole Malignance business.  There "
"are probably still spell scrolls and magical items to find there.  And "
"golems.  Can't forget about the golems.  I'll mark one on your map for one "
"denarius."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Seems like an eccentric wizard once lived here.  Not that there are any other "
"kind of wizards, am I right?  But, uh, don't tell Valzain I said so.  Or any "
"other wizards for that matter.  But you know it's true.  Anyways, I'll mark "
"the building on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"Seems like an eccentric wizard once lived here.  Not that there are any other "
"kind of wizards, am I right?  But, uh, don't tell Valzain I said so.  Or any "
"other wizards for that matter.  But you know it's true.  Anyways, I'll mark "
"the building on your map for one denarius."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Poor druids, they were hit hardest by the rise of technology.  Magi, "
"technomancers, animists, they can just close the windows and keep their "
"chanting low so to not bother the neighbors.  Even earthshapers can just go "
"into the backyard, but druids had to move out to the middle of nowhere.  "
"That's where their tower will be, mind.  There won't be a road there, so "
"you're in for quite the trip.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr ""
"Poor druids, they were hit hardest by the rise of technology.  Magi, "
"technomancers, animists, they can just close the windows and keep their "
"chanting low so to not bother the neighbors.  Even earthshapers can just go "
"into the backyard, but druids had to move out to the middle of nowhere.  "
"That's where their tower will be, mind.  There won't be a road there, so "
"you're in for quite the trip.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I could use a nice walk."
msgstr "I could use a nice walk."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Rivers.  Water, sand, clay, fish, giant mutant bugs.  Generally pretty big.  "
"If you're still having trouble finding one, I'll mark one on your map for one "
"denarius."
msgstr ""
"Rivers.  Water, sand, clay, fish, giant mutant bugs.  Generally pretty big.  "
"If you're still having trouble finding one, I'll mark one on your map for one "
"denarius."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Digging clay is quintessential of the Earthshaper.  Forming it into useful "
"tools is quintessential of the Technomancer.  Showing you where you can find "
"it is quintessential of me. For one denarius of course."
msgstr ""
"Digging clay is quintessential of the Earthshaper.  Forming it into useful "
"tools is quintessential of the Technomancer.  Showing you where you can find "
"it is quintessential of me. For one denarius of course."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If you're looking for something rough and coarse that gets everywhere, I'll "
"mark a large sand patch on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "如果你要找的东西既粗又糙还到处都是，我可以在你的地图上标记一处沙地，只要给我一个第纳尔。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The water there is scolding hot.  Perhaps it could help you survive the cold "
"winter months?  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "那里的水热得要命。也许它能帮你度过寒冬？只要给我一个第纳尔，我就帮你标出来。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If you're interested in the neolithic housing market, I'll mark a cave on "
"your map for one denarius.  Just be warned that the place might already be "
"occupied."
msgstr "如果你对新石器时代的房地产感兴趣，我可以在地图上标出一个洞穴，只要给我一个第纳尔。只是要注意，可能已经有住客了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Looking for potion ingredients?  I know a place where the leylines converge "
"and such plants grows plentiful.  I'll mark it on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "在寻找药剂成分吗？我知道一个地方，魔脉在此交汇，这种植物长得很多。给我一个第纳尔，我在地图上给你标上。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Valzain is over at the entrance of the forge, selling overpriced magical "
"knick-knacks.  Or perhaps there was something else you had in mind?"
msgstr "瓦尔赞就在熔炉门口，卖着高价的魔法小玩意。或者你还有别的想法？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Another forge?"
msgstr "另一个熔炉？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "A Lovecraftian horror."
msgstr "一只克系怪物。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "The Malignance."
msgstr "魔瘤。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There is only one Forge of Wonders, it's not like this is a multidimensional "
"franchise opportunity."
msgstr ""
"There is only one Forge of Wonders, it's not like this is a multidimensional "
"franchise opportunity."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There are these city-sized creatures called Void Leviathans that lives in the "
"vast nether regions between realities.  Sometimes they used to wash up onto "
"Earths that had recently had a Cataclysm.  Caused all kinds of trouble, they "
"did, so Valzain made it so they would spawn underground instead.  But I "
"haven't seen any of them in quite a while.  Perhaps they retreated deeper "
"into the empty parts of the nether?  Sorry, I haven't seen any in this "
"reality yet.  I can't help you."
msgstr ""
"There are these city-sized creatures called Void Leviathans that lives in the "
"vast nether regions between realities.  Sometimes they used to wash up onto "
"Earths that had recently had a Cataclysm.  Caused all kinds of trouble, they "
"did, so Valzain made it so they would spawn underground instead.  But I "
"haven't seen any of them in quite a while.  Perhaps they retreated deeper "
"into the empty parts of the nether?  Sorry, I haven't seen any in this "
"reality yet.  I can't help you."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The Malignance is the cause for much of our woes.  It is the force animating "
"the zombies.  It is responsible for the portal storms, and it seems to be "
"absolutely bursting with hate.  Valzain theorizes that it used to be a "
"fundamental force of nature or perhaps a school of magic that somehow grew "
"conscious, or perhaps had a consciousness imposed on it. Allegedly, the Mi-Go "
"speak of a time before it existed, or perhaps a time in which it wasn't so "
"dangerous.  By now, it is everywhere on Earth.  As far as I can tell, it "
"builds no structures and has no bases of operation, so there is no place I "
"can point you towards.  Sorry."
msgstr ""
"魔瘤是我们大部分苦难的原因。它是驱动丧尸的力量。它是空间风暴的原因，它似乎充满仇恨。瓦尔赞的理论是，它曾经是自然的基本力量，或者是某种魔法力量，以某种方式获"
"得了意识，或者可能是强加于它的意识。据称，米·戈曾经谈起它存在之前的一个时代，或者可能是一个它还不那么危险的时代。而现在，它在地球上无处不在。据我所知，它没"
"有结构，也没有行动基地，所以我没有地方可以帮你标出来。对不起。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#. ~ The Pirate of the Forge of Wonders.
msgid "Helen Tavrel, Former Pirate"
msgstr "Helen Tavrel，前海盜"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
msgid "Pirate Queen"
msgstr "海盜女王"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ Job description of "Pirate Queen" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#. ~ Job description of "Pirate" NPC class
msgid "My adventures would curdle your blood."
msgstr "我的冒险经历会让你的血液凝固。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Would you try to capture me?"
msgstr "你也想要抓我吗？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I've killed many a government-sanctioned hunter in my life."
msgstr "我这辈子杀过很多政府认证过的赏金猎人。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Aren't we all lucky that you are probably the last lawman alive in miles?"
msgstr "你可能是方圆几里内最后一个活着的执法人员，我们难道不都应该感到幸运吗？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome to the Forge of Wonders."
msgstr "歡迎來到奇蹟熔爐。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Reagents and blackpowders!"
msgstr "各类试剂和火药！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Ahoy and other nautical terms!"
msgstr "啊呵，还有其他的航海术语！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "When are you getting new stuff?"
msgstr "你什么时候进货？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I hope you're willing to overlook my past because otherwise you're not buying "
"anything from me."
msgstr "我希望你能忽视掉我的过去，否则你没法从我这里买到任何东西。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"A lifetime of plunder has brought me many a strange item - that you can have "
"for unbeatable prices!"
msgstr "一辈子到处掠夺给我带来了很多奇怪的东西——而你可以用无与伦比的价格买到！"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well, shiver me timbers then."
msgstr "好吧，吓老子一跳。（注：shiver me timbers）"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Do you think me a fool, to tell an officer of the law my current plans?"
msgstr "Do you think me a fool, to tell an officer of the law my current plans?"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Not even trying to ask me that undercover?  By the seventeen seas, officers "
"of the law really ARE made worse these days."
msgstr ""
"Not even trying to ask me that undercover?  By the seventeen seas, officers "
"of the law really ARE made worse these days."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The end of times is here and that's what you're worried about?  You should "
"get your priorities straight."
msgstr ""
"The end of times is here and that's what you're worried about?  You should "
"get your priorities straight."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well you obviously aren't an officer so here's the deal.  There's a mighty "
"fine galleon making land in <interval>, I'm certain to have something good by "
"then."
msgstr "好吧，你显然不是什么官员，所以事情是这样的。<interval>后将会有一艘非常漂亮的大帆船到来，到那时我肯定会有一些好东西。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_HELEN_TAVREL.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "May the seas be ever in your favor."
msgstr "May the seas be ever in your favor."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ The Lord of the Forge of Wonders.
msgid "Valzain of Psiom"
msgstr "Valzain of Psiom"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
msgid "Wondrous Dreamer"
msgstr "玄奇梦者"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Job description of "Wondrous Dreamer" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
msgid "I created this place from dreams and magic."
msgstr "我用梦和魔法创造了这个地方。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The government doesn't subsidize your purchases here anymore."
msgstr "你的政府可没法再为你在这里的购买行为提供补贴了。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Do you have any tales of adventure I could write down?"
msgstr "你有什么冒险故事可以让我写下来吗？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "In case you were wondering, we no longer respect any pre-existing weapon laws."
msgstr "如果你想知道的话，我们这里可不尊重任何原有的武器法案。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Bring me tales and we can trade."
msgstr "讲些故事给我听，我们还可以交易。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I have some stories for you."
msgstr "我有一些故事要告诉你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Anything interesting being worked on?"
msgstr "有什么有趣的事情吗？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Excellent.  What new stories have you brought me?"
msgstr "太棒了。你给我带来了什么新故事？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well, let's see."
msgstr "Well, let's see."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Once I was lost in the throes of love, now I've built an empire of material "
"goods.  I've found these two things are equally as powerful, and dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Once I was lost in the throes of love, now I've built an empire of material "
"goods.  I've found these two things are equally as powerful, and dangerous."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well here and now I am the law, and the law here is that people purchase my "
"goods, they take them out into the world and they die; or they return to buy "
"more of my goods.  Either way, I write poetry about them."
msgstr "好吧，现在我就是法律，这里的法律是人们购买我的商品，他们把它们带去到世界上，然后要么在外面死去；要么回来购买更多商品。不管怎样，我都会为他们写些诗。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Good day, sir."
msgstr "祝你过得愉快，先生。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My minions are busy putting the final touches on a few exciting projects, "
"check back in <interval> and see what's new."
msgstr "我的团队正忙着为几个激动人心的项目做最后的收尾工作，<interval>后再来看看有哪些新内容吧。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "May your hammers be accurate."
msgstr "祝你计划顺利。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
msgid "Former Pirate"
msgstr "前海盜"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
msgid "Pirate"
msgstr "海盜"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Walk away afore I kill ya where you stand."
msgstr "赶紧在我杀了你之前从我面前滚开。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You've got a lot of nerve wearing that badge these days."
msgstr "现在这种情况你还敢戴着那枚徽章，真是胆大包天。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Boys, I think we should drown this fool."
msgstr "兄弟们，我想我们应该淹死这个蠢货。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Talk to Captain Tavrel."
msgstr "和塔夫雷尔船长谈。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Obviously I should speak to someone else."
msgstr "显然我应该和别人谈谈。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Pirates should be hung until dead."
msgstr "海盜應該被絞死。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/missiondef.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 150 Zombies"
msgid "Blessed be."
msgstr "祝福你。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I must purge this land of its curse.  Will you help or hinder our mission?"
msgstr "我将清除这片土地的诅咒。你会帮助我们还是阻碍我们？"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hello <name_g>."
msgstr "你好，<name_g>。"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "About the mission…"
msgstr "關於任務..."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
