#. ~ Description of effect type "Hardened Skin"
msgid "Your skin is more resilient thanks to psionic energy."
msgstr "你的皮肤因为灵能而变得更坚韧。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hardened Skin"
msgid "The slight itching and waxiness in your skin fades away."
msgstr "The slight itching and waxiness in your skin fades away."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_climate_control"
msgid "Climate Controlled"
msgstr "体温控制"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Climate Controlled"
msgid "You are better at dealing with extremes of heat and cold."
msgstr "你更擅长应对极端的炎热和寒冷。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Climate Controlled"
msgid "The temperature feels uncomfortable again."
msgstr "温度又开始让人不爽了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Climate Controlled"
msgid "The temperature is really starting to get to you."
msgstr "温度真的让你快受不了了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Climate Controlled"
msgid "Your adaptation to extreme temperatures is fading."
msgstr "你对极端温度的适应力正在减弱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_enhance_mobility"
msgid "Enhanced Mobility"
msgstr "轻装上阵"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Enhanced Mobility"
msgid "You find it much easier to move in encumbering gear."
msgstr "穿着累赘的装备运动变得更容易了一些。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Enhanced Mobility"
msgid "Your gear suddenly seems to weigh you down."
msgstr "你的装备突然感觉变得很沉重。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hammerhand"
msgid "Your bare hands substitute for several common tools."
msgstr "你的双手可以替代一些常见的工具。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hammerhand"
msgid "You're no longer capable of hammering in a nail with your thumb."
msgstr "你再也不能用你的拇指敲钉子了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_sealed"
msgid "Sealed System"
msgstr "封闭躯体"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Sealed System"
msgid "You are protected from the dangers of the world."
msgstr "你受到保护，免受世界的危险。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sealed System"
msgid "You let out your breath in a rush."
msgstr "你大大地呼出一口气。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sealed System"
msgid "You need to take a new breath, and soon!"
msgstr "你需要换口气，快！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sealed System"
msgid "Your lungs are straining with the effort of holding your breath."
msgstr "你的肺正在努力对抗屏住呼吸的压力。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_metabolism_enhance"
msgid "Hyperenhanced Metabolism"
msgstr "高效代谢"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hyperenhanced Metabolism"
msgid "Your metabolism is far more efficient than before."
msgstr "你的新陈代谢比以前更有效率。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hyperenhanced Metabolism"
msgid "Your stomach rumbles."
msgstr "你的胃咕噜作响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Combat Dance"
msgid "You are a dynamo of death."
msgstr "你是不知疲倦的杀戮化身。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Combat Dance"
msgid "Your movements return to normal."
msgstr "你的动作回到了正常"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_guided_evolution_backfire"
msgid "Evolving Backfire"
msgstr "Evolving Backfire"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Evolving Backfire"
msgid ""
"Your biology is running out of control.  Perhaps extensively drawing on the "
"netherium was a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"Your biology is running out of control.  Perhaps extensively drawing on the "
"netherium was a bad idea."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Evolving Backfire"
msgid ""
"Netherium energy surges through your cells, changing them in an unknowable "
"way.  Something is about to change."
msgstr ""
"Netherium energy surges through your cells, changing them in an unknowable "
"way.  Something is about to change."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Guided Evolution"
msgid ""
"Whenever you mutate, you may pick the resulting mutation from a selection of "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Whenever you mutate, you may pick the resulting mutation from a selection of "
"options."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Guided Evolution"
msgid "You are no longer controlling your evolution."
msgstr "You are no longer controlling your evolution."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Perfected Motion"
msgid "You feel like you can outrun a locomotive."
msgstr "你感觉自己能跑过火车。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Perfected Motion"
msgid "The world returns to normal speed."
msgstr "世界回到了正常的速度。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Perfected Motion"
msgid "Your movements are slower and slower now."
msgstr "你的速度开始逐渐减慢。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Perfected Motion"
msgid "The world begins speeding up around you."
msgstr "周围的世界逐渐加速恢复。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_hurricane_blows"
msgid "Hurricane Blows"
msgstr "暴风连击"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hurricane Blows"
msgid "You can attack faster than thought."
msgstr "你的攻击速度快过了思维。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_vitaminosis"
msgid "Vitaminosis"
msgstr "Vitaminosis"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Vitaminosis"
msgid "You are steadily converting calories into vitamins."
msgstr "You are steadily converting calories into vitamins."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Heightened Senses"
msgid "You are enhancing your mundane senses."
msgstr "You are enhancing your mundane senses."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Heightened Senses"
msgid "Your enhance senses fade away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_better_senses_pain"
msgid "Sensory Pain"
msgstr "Sensory Pain"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Sensory Pain"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sensory Pain"
msgid "Your senses are overwhelmed!"
msgstr "Your senses are overwhelmed!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Night Eyes"
msgid "You can sense your surroundings in the dark."
msgstr "你可以在黑暗中感知周围的环境。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Night Eyes"
msgid "The darkness hides your surroundings again."
msgstr "黑暗再次遮蔽了周围的环境。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Speed Reader"
msgid "You are absorbing knowledge from books like a sponge absorbs water."
msgstr "你正在像海绵吸水一样吸收书本中的知识。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_premonition"
msgid "Sensing Danger"
msgstr "危险感知"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Sensing Danger"
msgid "You know there's something out there."
msgstr "你知道哪里会有危险。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sensing Danger"
msgid "The sense of danger fades away, but you know the danger remains."
msgstr "危险仍然存在，但你对它的感知正逐渐消失。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "moving_creature"
msgid "You sense a danger here."
msgstr "You sense a danger here."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Aura Sight"
msgid "Swirling colors are visible around others, revealing their emotions."
msgstr "人们周围环绕着彩色灵气，揭示着他们的情绪。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Aura Sight"
msgid "The colors fade away."
msgstr "彩色灵气慢慢淡去。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_weak_point"
msgid "Weaknesses Discerned"
msgstr "弱点观察"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Weaknesses Discerned"
msgid "Your vulnerabilities have been laid open."
msgstr "弱点被一一暴露出来。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weaknesses Discerned"
msgid "You suddenly feel terribly vulnerable."
msgstr "你突然感到非常脆弱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weaknesses Discerned"
msgid "You no longer feel so exposed."
msgstr "你不再感到脆弱了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_ranged_enhance"
msgid "Dead Aim"
msgstr "致命精度"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dead Aim"
msgid "Your powers make aiming much easier for you."
msgstr "你的灵能让你更容易瞄准。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dead Aim"
msgid "The world lurches as apparent distances snap back into place."
msgstr "世界颤动，明了的距离重新变得不确定。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_sense_rads_self"
msgid "Sensing Radiation"
msgstr "辐射感知"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Sensing Radiation"
msgid "You can detect environmental radiation."
msgstr "你可以感知环境的辐射。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sensing Radiation"
msgid "Your radiation sense is gone."
msgstr "你的辐射感知消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sensing Radiation"
msgid "The ambient glow of radiation is almost invisible now."
msgstr "辐射的辉光淡得让人难以察觉。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sensing Radiation"
msgid "Your ability to sense radiation is fading."
msgstr "你感知辐射的能力正在减弱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_dodge"
msgid "Anticipating Attack"
msgstr "攻击预知"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Anticipating Attack"
msgid "You can see your enemies' attacks in advance."
msgstr "你可以提前看到敌人的攻击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Anticipating Attack"
msgid "The fore-images of your enemies fade away."
msgstr "指示敌人攻击的虚像消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_craft_bonus"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Intuitive Artistry"
msgstr "工匠直觉"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Intuitive Artistry"
msgid ""
"You just know what you need to do next.  It's harder for you to pay attention "
"to anything else due to the shifting futures, however, and you will lose "
"awareness of the outside world entirely when making something."
msgstr ""
"You just know what you need to do next.  It's harder for you to pay attention "
"to anything else due to the shifting futures, however, and you will lose "
"awareness of the outside world entirely when making something."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_perfect_shot"
msgid "One Perfect Shot"
msgstr "完美射击"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "One Perfect Shot"
msgid "Do it.  Take the shot."
msgstr "动手，开枪。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_clear_sight"
msgid "Truesight"
msgstr "真实视野"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Truesight"
msgid "Your powers allow you to see the true shape of reality."
msgstr "你的灵能让你能够看到现实的真实面貌。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Truesight"
msgid "The world seems wrapped in gauze compared to before."
msgstr "世界重新被笼罩上了一层纱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_astral_projection"
msgid "Astrally Projecting"
msgstr "星界映射"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Astrally Projecting"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Etheric Form"
msgid "Your spirit wanders the world."
msgstr "你的灵行走在此世界之上。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_group_tactics_other"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_group_tactics_self"
msgid "Prescient Tactics"
msgstr "先知指挥"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Prescient Tactics"
msgid "You're being informed of the best way to fight."
msgstr "你掌握着充足的信息便于指挥战斗。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Prescient Tactics"
msgid ""
"You're calling out tactics to your followers.  It's much harder to "
"concentrate on your own defense."
msgstr "你专注于指导你的同伴战斗。这使分出注意力保护自己变得困难。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Prescient Tactics"
msgid "As the visions fade, you stop calling out orders."
msgstr "随着预知视野的消失，你停止了对战斗的指挥。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_omniscence"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_super_clairvoyance"
msgid "Omniscience"
msgstr "全知"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Omniscience"
#. ~ Message of spell "clair_omniscience ( [Ψ]Omniscence )"
msgid "You can see forever."
msgstr "你无所不知。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Omniscience"
msgid "Your senses snap back to your physical body."
msgstr "你的知觉回到了你的肉身里。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Voltaic Strikes"
msgid "Your melee attacks unleash electrical blasts."
msgstr "电流附加到你武器的每一次挥动中。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Voltaic Strikes"
msgid "Your hands no longer spark with electricity."
msgstr "你的手上不再闪烁电光。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hacking Interface"
msgid "You have constructed an electrical interface to hack nearby devices."
msgstr "你创造出了一个能黑掉附近的电子设备的接口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokin_paralysis"
msgid "Neural Spasms"
msgstr "神经痉挛"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Neural Spasms"
msgid "Your muscles are twitching and won't obey you!"
msgstr "Your muscles are twitching and won't obey you!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Neural Spasms"
msgid "Your spasms stop."
msgstr "Your spasms stop."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Pain Suppression"
msgid "When it hurts, it won't hurt as much."
msgstr "疼痛来袭时似乎有所减弱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Pain Suppression"
msgid "Your nerves burn for a moment as a surge of pain hits them."
msgstr "一阵疼痛袭来，你的神经感觉火辣辣的。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokinetic_pain_immune"
msgid "Analgesic Block"
msgstr "疼痛阻断"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Analgesic Block"
msgid ""
"You can't feel anything.  That means everything is fine, right?  Everything "
"is fine."
msgstr "你什么都感觉不到。这意味着一切都好，对吧？一切都好。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Analgesic Block"
msgid "All of your pain rushes back in!"
msgstr "你之前的疼痛卷土重来了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Analgesic Block"
msgid "Your wounds are starting to ache."
msgstr "你的伤口又开始隐隐作痛。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Analgesic Block"
msgid "Your wounds sting a bit."
msgstr "你的伤口有点痒。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Neuro-Accelerated"
msgid "You are enhancing your nervous system."
msgstr "你强化你的神经系统。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Galvanic Aura"
msgid "Anyone nearby risks being blasted by lightning."
msgstr "电流场附近的任何人都可能会遭受电击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Galvanic Aura"
msgid "The thrum in the air around you dissipates."
msgstr "你附近空气中的嗡嗡声消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Galvanic Aura"
msgid "The crackling aura around you is fading quickly."
msgstr "你周围的带电场正在加速减弱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Galvanic Aura"
msgid "The lightning blasts are growing less powerful."
msgstr "闪电的噼啪声减弱了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokinetic_lightning_aura_aftershock"
msgid "Galvanic Aftershock"
msgstr "电流场余波"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Galvanic Aftershock"
msgid "You still remain immune to the effects of electricity, if only briefly."
msgstr "你仍然可以免受电击，哪怕只是暂时的。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_light_local"
msgid "Candle's Light"
msgstr "长明烛光"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Candle's Light"
msgid "The air above your hand glows faintly."
msgstr "你手上亮着一团微弱的光芒。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Candle's Light"
msgid "A faint light springs up over your hand."
msgstr "一团微弱的光芒在你的手中出现。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Candle's Light"
msgid "The glow above your hand fades."
msgstr "你手中的光芒渐渐消逝了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Illuminated"
msgid "The air around you is glowing."
msgstr "The air around you is glowing."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Illuminated"
msgid "You are outlined in light."
msgstr "You are outlined in light."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Trick of the Light"
msgid ""
"You are surrounded by shifting illusions, and your enemies struggle to see "
"where your true form is."
msgstr "你被不断变化的幻象所包裹，使敌人难以看清你的正体。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Trick of the Light"
msgid "The illusions around you suddenly vanish!"
msgstr "你周围的幻象彻底消失了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Chameleoflage"
msgid "You bending nearby light to make yourself more difficult to spot."
msgstr "你扭曲周围的光线，隐蔽自己的身形。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Chameleoflage"
msgid "You stop bending light around your location."
msgstr "你停止扭曲附近的光线。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Lucent Barrier"
msgid "You are protected from extremes of light and radiation."
msgstr "你被极强的光线于辐射所保护着。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Lucent Barrier"
msgid "The surrounding air shimmers once more as your light barrier fades."
msgstr "随着灵光屏障的减弱，周围的空气再次开始闪烁。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Mirror-Mask"
msgid ""
"You're just another survivor.  There's definitely nothing odd about you at "
"all."
msgstr "你只是又一个幸存者罢了。嗯，你身上没什么古怪。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Mirror-Mask"
msgid "The illusions around you fall away."
msgstr "你周围的幻象消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Radio Transception"
msgid "You can interpret and transmit radio waves."
msgstr "你可以转译和收发无线电波。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Radio Transception"
msgid "You stop paying attention to the radio waves around you."
msgstr "你不再留意周围的电磁波。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Invisibility"
msgid "The obscuring veil of light fades, revealing your presence."
msgstr "朦胧的光之帷幕缓缓消失，展露出你的存在。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_arms"
msgid "refraction of arms"
msgstr "三头六臂"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "refraction of arms"
msgid ""
"Your arms refract light to create the illusion of having multiple arms and "
"their wielded items."
msgstr "你的手臂折射光线，像有三头六臂一般，一齐挥动着武器。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "refraction of arms"
msgid "The light around your arms returns to normal."
msgstr "你手臂周围的光线折射恢复了正常。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "refraction of arms"
msgid "Your illusionary arms are obviously translucent."
msgstr "你的幻象手臂明显变得暗淡了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "refraction of arms"
msgid "Your illusionary arms are losing some of their solid appearance."
msgstr "你的幻象手臂失去了一些真实性。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Blind"
msgid "You are blinded!"
msgstr "你失明了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Blinding Radiance"
msgid "You are glowing like the sun."
msgstr "你如太阳一般刺眼。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blinding Radiance"
msgid "The last light finally dies."
msgstr "最后一丝光芒也消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_psi_post_cauterize"
msgid "Cauterized"
msgstr "烧灼止血"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Cauterized"
msgid ""
"You used your powers to cauterize a wound here.  Whether it worked or not, it "
"still stings terribly."
msgstr "你使用灵能进行了伤口烧灼。无论是否起作用，这都非常疼。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Banked Flames"
msgid "A flame is burning over one of your palms."
msgstr "A flame is burning over one of your palms."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Cloak of Warmth"
msgid "The air around you has its temperature controlled."
msgstr "你四周的空气变得更加舒适。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Incandescent Lance"
msgid "A thin beam of searing plasma extends from one finger."
msgstr "A thin beam of searing plasma extends from one finger."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Blazing Aura"
msgid "You are surrounded by flames."
msgstr "你被火焰包围。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blazing Aura"
msgid "The flames surrounding you gutter out."
msgstr "你周围的火焰闪烁着熄灭了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_pyrokinetic_aura_damage"
msgid "Burning Air"
msgstr "Burning Air"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Burning Air"
msgid "The air is intolerably hot."
msgstr "The air is intolerably hot."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Burning Air"
msgid "The air cools down."
msgstr "The air cools down."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Flame Immunity"
msgid "You are completely immune to fire."
msgstr "你完全免疫火焰的影响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Flame Immunity"
msgid "You are once again vulnerable to fire."
msgstr "你再次易与遭受火焰伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_water_walking"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_hedge_walk_on_water_magic_square"
msgid "Water-Walking"
msgstr "水上行走"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Water-Walking"
msgid "You can walk over liquids without sinking into them."
msgstr "你可以在液体表面上行走，而不至于沉入其中。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Water-Walking"
msgid "Your feet are firm on the ground."
msgstr "Your feet are firm on the ground."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Slowfall"
msgid "The ground isn't as eager to receive you."
msgstr "你感受到了一些地面的斥力。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Slowfall"
msgid "You suddenly feel much heavier."
msgstr "你突然感觉身体变得沉重了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Lifting Field"
msgid "You can hover a single item nearby, at the ready."
msgstr "你现在可以将一个物体悬停在你的旁边。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Lifting Field"
msgid "Your lifting field dissipates."
msgstr "你的悬浮场消散了"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_strength"
msgid "Telekinetic Strength"
msgstr "念动力量"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Telekinetic Strength"
msgid "You are greatly enhancing your ability to lift and break things."
msgstr "你极大地增强了你举起和破坏物品的力量。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Telekinetic Strength"
msgid "The force supporting your muscles suddenly vanishes."
msgstr "强化你肌肉的力量突然消失。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Inertial Barrier"
msgid "The barrier of force around you falls apart."
msgstr "你周围的念力屏障消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Levitation"
msgid "You are floating in defiance of gravity."
msgstr "你正在无视重力地漂浮。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Levitation"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Smoke-Walking"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Wind-Walking"
msgid "Your feet touch the ground once again."
msgstr "你的双脚再次落回地面。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Levitation"
msgid "You are sinking despite your best efforts."
msgstr "你的力量支撑不住，开始下降。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Levitation"
msgid "You wobble briefly downward before recovering."
msgstr "你在稍微下降后迅速恢复。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_aegis"
msgid "Aegis"
msgstr "神盾"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Aegis"
msgid "You are nearly invincible."
msgstr "你几乎是无敌的。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Aegis"
msgid "The air loses its structure and you are vulnerable once again."
msgstr "空气失去了组成神盾的结构，你再次变得脆弱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepathic_learning_bonus"
msgid "Trance State"
msgstr "专注状态"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Trance State"
msgid "You are in a focused mental state, increasing the ease of learning."
msgstr "你处于专注的精神状态，使学习更容易。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Trance State"
msgid "You shake your head as you become aware of the outside world again."
msgstr "你摇摇头，再次讲意识放回周围的世界。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Trance State"
msgid "Your enhanced concentration is fading like a dream."
msgstr "你增强的专注开始恍惚，像踏入梦境一般。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Trance State"
msgid "The outside world is impinging itself on your awareness."
msgstr "外部世界也逐渐开始回到你的意识。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepath_mesmerize_tracker"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_hypnotism"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_mesmerize_tracker"
msgid "Mesmerized"
msgstr "Mesmerized"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Mesmerized"
msgid "You are in a daze."
msgstr "You are in a daze."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Mesmerized"
msgid "You snap out of your trance."
msgstr "You snap out of your trance."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepathic_morale"
msgid "Stabilized Mood"
msgstr "心静如水"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Stabilized Mood"
msgid ""
"You are editing out your most negative thoughts.  When you think about it, is "
"the Cataclysm really the worst thing that could have happened?"
msgstr "你正在抹除那些最消极的想法。你仔细思考，大灾变真的是可能发生的最糟糕的事情吗？"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Stabilized Mood"
msgid "You let your thoughts return to their normal flow."
msgstr "You let your thoughts return to their normal flow."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "telepathic_ignorance"
msgid "Ignorance"
msgstr "无视"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Ignorance"
msgid "You're positive that no one is there."
msgstr "你很确定，此地空无一人。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Ignorance"
msgid "Wait a minute, there *is* someone there!"
msgstr "等等，“有”人早就在这！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepathic_primal_terror"
msgid "Terrorized"
msgstr "远古恐惧"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Terrorized"
msgid "You are overcome with overwhelming dread."
msgstr "你被压倒性的恐惧震慑。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Terrorized"
msgid "Your heart races as a sudden feeling of dread grips you."
msgstr "你的心跳加速，一种突然的恐惧感包围了你。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Terrorized"
msgid "The heart-freezing terror fades as suddenly as it began."
msgstr "令人心惊胆战的恐惧突然消失，就像来时一样。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepath_network_effect"
msgid "Telepathic Network"
msgstr "心灵网络"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Telepathic Network"
msgid ""
"You are in constant communication with your allies, looking out for each "
"other in combat."
msgstr "你与你的盟友不断沟通，在战斗中互相照顾。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Telepathic Network"
msgid "Silence fills your mind."
msgstr "你脑中一刻不停的交流突然沉寂。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Telepathic Network"
msgid "The inner voices of your allies are only a whisper now."
msgstr "脑海中同伴的声音变成了耳语。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Telepathic Network"
msgid "The inner voices of your allies begin to fade."
msgstr "脑海中的同伴交流声减弱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Ephemeral Walk"
msgid ""
"You exist slightly outside of baseline reality, allowing you to effortlessly "
"walk through solid matter."
msgstr ""
"You exist slightly outside of baseline reality, allowing you to effortlessly "
"walk through solid matter."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Ephemeral Walk"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Reactive Displacement"
msgid "The surrounding matter feels real again."
msgstr "The surrounding matter feels real again."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Loci Establishment"
msgid ""
"You are concentrating on your locus.  You can teleport there at will with the "
"[Ψ]Loci Technique."
msgstr ""
"You are concentrating on your locus.  You can teleport there at will with the "
"[Ψ]Loci Technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Loci Establishment"
msgid "You've forgotten your locus!"
msgstr "You've forgotten your locus!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_teleport_slow"
msgid "Stutterstepping"
msgstr "卡顿步伐"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Stutterstepping"
msgid "Your steps aren't taking you as far as your eyes tell you they should."
msgstr "你的每一步走得并没有像眼睛预计的那般远。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Stutterstepping"
msgid "The air ripples and you stumble."
msgstr "周围空间撕裂，你走得跌跌撞撞。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Stutterstepping"
msgid "Your eyes and your legs agree with each other again."
msgstr "你的观察与步伐再次协调。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Extended Stride"
msgid "Every step takes you further than your eyes tell you it should."
msgstr "你的每一步都走得比眼睛预计得更远。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Extended Stride"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Muffled"
msgid "Your steps are normal once again."
msgstr "你的步伐回到了正常水平。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warped Strikes"
msgid "Your melee attacks extend much further than would normally be possible."
msgstr "Your melee attacks extend much further than would normally be possible."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warped Strikes"
msgid "Your reach goes back to normal."
msgstr "Your reach goes back to normal."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Flickerflash Stance"
msgid ""
"Through constant teleports and warping of space, your combat prowess is "
"increased."
msgstr ""
"Through constant teleports and warping of space, your combat prowess is "
"increased."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Flickerflash Stance"
msgid "Your constant teleporting slows to a stop."
msgstr "Your constant teleporting slows to a stop."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Coagulation"
msgid "For just a moment, you feel your blood rushing through your veins."
msgstr "一瞬间，你开始感觉到血液重新在血管中奔流。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Coagulation"
msgid "You bleed much less than normal and sometimes not at all."
msgstr "你的出血量比正常情况少得多，有时甚至根本不出血。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Healthy Glow"
msgid "You feel amazing."
msgstr "你感觉棒极了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Healthy Glow"
msgid "The surge of vitality leaves you in a rush."
msgstr "生命力的冲刷一齐消退了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Leukocyte Accumulation"
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is receiving the bulk of your body's healing resources."
msgstr "Your %s is receiving the bulk of your body's healing resources."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Leukocyte Accumulation"
msgid "You stop concentrating your healing."
msgstr "You stop concentrating your healing."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vita_cure_disease"
msgid "Immunostimulated"
msgstr "Immunostimulated"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Immunostimulated"
msgid ""
"You are not going to get sick.  You absolutely refuse.  And if you do, you're "
"going to get better."
msgstr "你的免疫受到强化，不会生病。就算生病也会很快会康复。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_healing_trance"
msgid "Revitalizing Meditation"
msgstr "再生冥想"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Revitalizing Meditation"
msgid "Thanks to your meditations you are healing much more quickly"
msgstr "因为你的冥想，你身体恢复得更快了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_hurt"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Enervating Touch"
msgstr "衰弱触碰"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Enervating Touch"
msgid "This reduces monsters' regeneration.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "这将削弱怪物的再生能力。拥有这个效果的话是bug。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_purge_rads"
msgid "Radiation Purge"
msgstr "辐射净化"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Radiation Purge"
msgid "You are using your powers to cleanse yourself of radiation."
msgstr "你正在用你的灵能清除自己的辐射。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_purge_rads_sideeffects"
msgid "Radiation Purge Side Effects"
msgstr "辐射净化副作用"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Radiation Purge Side Effects"
msgid ""
"You are using your powers to cleanse yourself of radiation, but there are "
"some side effects."
msgstr "你正在用你的灵能清除自己的辐射，但会有一些副作用。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Anabolic Rejuvenation"
#. ~ Description of effect type "effect_vita_super_heal_return_from_death"
msgid "You are healing extraordinarily quickly."
msgstr "你康复得非常快。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Anabolic Rejuvenation"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "effect_vita_super_heal_return_from_death"
msgid "Your body aches as your preternatural healing slows to a stop."
msgstr "你的身体疼痛，同时你超自然的愈合能力逐渐停止。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vita_degenerating_touch"
msgid "Degenerating"
msgstr "Degenerating"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Degenerating"
msgid "You flesh is withering and decaying!"
msgstr "You flesh is withering and decaying!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vita_super_heal_pain_allayed"
msgid "Overflowing Vitality"
msgstr "Overflowing Vitality"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Overflowing Vitality"
msgid ""
"The energy of your accelerated resuscitation is preventing you from feeling "
"the pain you obviously should be, for the moment."
msgstr ""
"The energy of your accelerated resuscitation is preventing you from feeling "
"the pain you obviously should be, for the moment."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Accelerated Resuscitation"
msgid "If you suffer potentially-fatal damage, your powers will attempt to save you."
msgstr "如果你受到可能至死的伤害，这个灵能会试图为你续命。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/scenario.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id
#. "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_awake_attunement_gain"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Heart of Fire"
msgstr "Heart of Fire"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Heart of Fire"
msgid ""
"The flames in your heart have kindled, fueling a connection to the Nether.  "
"Your Nether Attunement will not reduce with time."
msgstr ""
"The flames in your heart have kindled, fueling a connection to the Nether.  "
"Your Nether Attunement will not reduce with time."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id
#. "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_asleep_attunement_gain"
msgid "Heart of Cinders"
msgstr "Heart of Cinders"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Heart of Cinders"
msgid ""
"The flames in your heart smolder, maintaining your connection to the Nether.  "
"Your Nether Attunement will reduce with time, but more slowly."
msgstr ""
"The flames in your heart smolder, maintaining your connection to the Nether.  "
"Your Nether Attunement will reduce with time, but more slowly."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_need_to_channel"
msgid "Let the Fire Burn"
msgstr "Let the Fire Burn"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Let the Fire Burn"
msgid "The power twists inside you.  Let it out.  Let the flames rise."
msgstr "The power twists inside you.  Let it out.  Let the flames rise."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Let the Fire Burn"
msgid "A fire burns within you."
msgstr "A fire burns within you."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_damage"
msgid "Inner Blaze"
msgstr "Inner Blaze"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_damage"
msgid "Inner Inferno"
msgstr "Inner Inferno"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Inner Blaze, Inner Inferno"
msgid "You feel far too warm."
msgstr "You feel far too warm."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Inner Blaze, Inner Inferno"
msgid "You feel far, far too warm."
msgstr "You feel far, far too warm."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Inner Blaze, Inner Inferno"
msgid "You are burning up!"
msgstr "You are burning up!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/enchantments/enchantment_bionic.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "moving_creature"
msgid "You sense a hostile target here."
msgstr "You sense a hostile target here."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/enchantments/enchantment_item.json
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
msgid "Targeting assistance"
msgstr "Targeting assistance"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/enchantments/enchantment_item.json
#. ~ Description of enchantment "Targeting assistance"
#, c-format
msgid "Your gear relays targeting data to your weapons, reducing dispersion by 25%."
msgstr "Your gear relays targeting data to your weapons, reducing dispersion by 25%."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/appliance_lighting.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "standing matrix lamp"
msgstr "矩阵立灯"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/appliance_lighting.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "standing matrix lamp"
msgid "An lamp enhanced with matrix technology."
msgstr "采用矩阵晶体技术增强的灯。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/appliance_misc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "noetic resonance detector"
msgid_plural "noetic resonance detectors"
msgstr[0] "noetic resonance detectors"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/appliance_misc.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "noetic resonance detector"
msgid ""
"A strange device, a bit like one of those eyesight testing machines you look "
"into in an optometrist's office.  The main housing has a place to rest your "
"chin and a pair of binocular-like tubes, but there is also a headband "
"attached to a set of wires hanging from a hook on the side and an armband "
"hanging from the other side.  It's supposed to be used for measuring your "
"\"noetic potential\"."
msgstr ""
"A strange device, a bit like one of those eyesight testing machines you look "
"into in an optometrist's office.  The main housing has a place to rest your "
"chin and a pair of binocular-like tubes, but there is also a headband "
"attached to a set of wires hanging from a hook on the side and an armband "
"hanging from the other side.  It's supposed to be used for measuring your "
"\"noetic potential\"."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Transporter Beacon"
msgstr "传送信标"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Transporter Beacon"
msgid ""
"A transporter beacon, placed on the ground with a stable set of coordinates.  "
"(e)xamine to finish the setup."
msgstr "一个传送信标，放置在地面上提供稳定传送坐标。按\"e\"查看来完成坐标设置。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "telepathic amplifier"
msgstr "心灵控制器"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "telepathic amplifier"
msgid ""
"A bulky machine with a chair and a hat-like mechanism designed to fit over "
"the wearer's head, like something you would find in a hair salon.  You have "
"no idea how to operate it, but you could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "这是一台笨重的机器，有一把椅子和一个类似帽子的装置，可以套在佩戴者的头上，就像发廊里的东西一样。 你不知道如何操作它，但你可以从它身上找到零件。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "noetic resonance detector"
msgid ""
"A table and chair topped with what looks like something you'd seen in an "
"optometrist's office for testing vision, except this also has a headband and "
"an armband hanging off the side connected to the main apparatus by cables.  "
"There is a full-sized keyboard and several dials on the opposite side from "
"the chair where the subject is supposed to sit; without a set of "
"instructions, you'd have no idea how to operate this."
msgstr ""
"A table and chair topped with what looks like something you'd seen in an "
"optometrist's office for testing vision, except this also has a headband and "
"an armband hanging off the side connected to the main apparatus by cables.  "
"There is a full-sized keyboard and several dials on the opposite side from "
"the chair where the subject is supposed to sit; without a set of "
"instructions, you'd have no idea how to operate this."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "portal stabilizer"
msgstr "传送门稳定器"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "portal stabilizer"
msgid ""
"A strange machine that looks a little like a large gyroscope.  Multiple "
"concentric rings are built around a central matrix crystal, all connected to "
"an antenna.  How it was used is unclear, since there doesn't seem to be a "
"keyboard or any input device."
msgstr ""
"一台看起来有点像大型陀螺仪的奇怪机器。围绕着中央矩阵晶体搭建起许多个同心的圆环，所有圆环都连接到一个天线上。它是如何使用的尚不清楚，因为似乎没有键盘或其他输"
"入设备。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "glowing crystal"
msgstr "发光晶体"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing crystal"
#. ~ Description of terrain "glowing crystal"
msgid ""
"An irregular chunk of glowing crystal.  The fitful glow sheds no illumination "
"on the nearby terrain."
msgstr "一块不规则的发光水晶。 不规则的光芒无法照亮附近的地形。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/terrain.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "crystal shattering!"
msgstr "晶体破碎声！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "alien plant"
msgstr "异界植物"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "alien plant"
msgid ""
"An alien plant, a knee-high tightly-coiled bundle of reddish-yellow stalks "
"with jagged leaves extending every which way.  It looks very difficult to "
"walk through."
msgstr ""
"An alien plant, a knee-high tightly-coiled bundle of reddish-yellow stalks "
"with jagged leaves extending every which way.  It looks very difficult to "
"walk through."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "alien plant"
msgid ""
"An alien plant, a collection of delicate bluish-white strands with small "
"white globes along their length.  They seem to float almost like seaweed, "
"despite being a terrestrial plant."
msgstr ""
"An alien plant, a collection of delicate bluish-white strands with small "
"white globes along their length.  They seem to float almost like seaweed, "
"despite being a terrestrial plant."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "alien plant"
msgid ""
"An alien plant, a single, cylindrical dark-red trunk with a small cluster of "
"leaves on top.  It makes a hollow sound when struck."
msgstr ""
"An alien plant, a single, cylindrical dark-red trunk with a small cluster of "
"leaves on top.  It makes a hollow sound when struck."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "black stone"
msgstr "黑色石块"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "black stone"
msgid "A perfectly smooth patch of black stone, like carved and polished obsidian."
msgstr "一块完美光滑的黑色石头，就像雕刻打磨过的黑曜石。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "black water"
msgstr "黑水"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "black water"
msgid ""
"An expanse of some sort of black liquid.  The air nearby is chill, and its "
"surface is perfectly smooth and undisturbed by ripples or wind.  You have no "
"idea how deep it is."
msgstr "一大片某种黑色液体。附近的空气很冷，表面非常光滑，不受涟漪或风的干扰。你不知道它有多深。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like grass.  The blades are rolled up "
"into curls, similar to ferns, but they seem to all unroll at once and then "
"roll up again in a steady pattern.  They're a color you can only describe as "
"\"purplish-yellow\"."
msgstr "一片几乎像草一样的地方。 叶片卷成卷曲状，与蕨类植物相似，但它们似乎一次全部展开，然后又以稳定的模式卷起来。 它们的颜色只能用 \"紫黄色 \"来形容。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like grass.  The blades are less than "
"an inch high and a blue so dark it's almost black.  When you look closer, "
"many blades seemed to be fused together at the top, forming small clusters."
msgstr "一片几乎像草的地方。 草叶不到3厘米高，蓝色深得近乎黑色。 走近一看，许多叶片似乎在顶端融合在一起，形成一个个小簇。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like grass.  It's the familiar green "
"of terrestrial grass, but each blade has a large pink bulb at the top that "
"bobs and moves in the breeze."
msgstr "一片几乎像草的地方。 它是我们熟悉的陆生草绿色，但每片草叶顶端都有一个粉红色的大球茎，在微风中摇摆。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "alien vines"
msgstr "异界藤蔓"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien vines"
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like vines, or perhaps tree roots.  A "
"thick ropy cluster of white tendrils streaked with red, twining around each "
"other and branching off in all directions before meeting up in new clusters.  "
"Sometimes, one of the vines twitches."
msgstr "一片几乎像藤蔓或树根的地方。 一簇簇粗壮的白色卷须带着红色条纹，相互缠绕，向四面八方分支，然后又汇聚成新的一簇。 有时，其中一根藤蔓会抽动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "alien moss"
msgstr "异界苔藓"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien moss"
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like moss.  It's a pale bluish color "
"and clumps of it seem to be very slowly moving across the ground."
msgstr "一片几乎像苔藓的地方。 它呈淡蓝色，一团团似乎在地面上缓慢移动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien moss"
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like moss.  It's close to an inch "
"thick, a dark yellowish-red, and glistens wetly."
msgstr "一片几乎像苔藓一样的东西。 它接近3厘米厚，呈暗黄红色，湿漉漉地闪闪发光。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "alien tree"
msgstr "异界树"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"A short tree, or something that's vaguely shaped like one.  It has long, "
"needle-like leaves that twitch rhythmically and its dark reddish-purple "
"bark(?) has a scale-like pattern, with glowing nodules irregularly spaced "
"along its trunk.  Bluish-green globules hang from the end of some of the "
"branches."
msgstr ""
"一棵矮树，或者一些形状隐约像树的东西。它有长长的针状叶子，有节奏地抽动，深红紫色的树皮（？）有鳞片状图案，发光的结节沿着树干不规则地分布。一些树枝的末端悬挂"
"着蓝绿色的小球。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"A tall alien plant.  It has long, needle-like leaves that twitch rhythmically "
"and its dark reddish-purple bark(?) has a scale-like pattern, with glowing "
"nodules irregularly spaced along its trunk."
msgstr "一种高大的外来植物。 它长着针状的长叶，有节奏地抽动着，深红紫色的树皮（？）上有鳞片状的花纹，树干上不规则地分布着发光的结节。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"A tall, thin alien plant.  From a distance it seems more like a column than a "
"tree, but when you get closer you can see that it's made up of a series of "
"broad, serrated leaves all folded so closely together that they form a single "
"stalk."
msgstr ""
"A tall, thin alien plant.  From a distance it seems more like a column than a "
"tree, but when you get closer you can see that it's made up of a series of "
"broad, serrated leaves all folded so closely together that they form a single "
"stalk."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"A large alien plant.  It looks like a series of bulbous mushrooms that have "
"all grown together at the base, rising into a flaring series of branches that "
"curve up before hanging down and ending in reddish-brown spheres."
msgstr "一种大型外来植物。 它看起来像一串球茎蘑菇，在基部长在一起，形成一串向上弯曲的枝条，然后垂下来，最后形成一个红褐色的球体。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
msgid ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass, except it's a light "
"reddish color and the stalks are much broader.  Some kind of waxy residue "
"seems to rub off onto your clothes when you walk through it."
msgstr ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass, except it's a light "
"reddish color and the stalks are much broader.  Some kind of waxy residue "
"seems to rub off onto your clothes when you walk through it."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "long alien grass"
msgstr "长异界草从"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "long alien grass"
#. ~ Description of terrain "tall alien grass"
msgid ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass.  Dark red in color and "
"almost waist-high, each stalk splits into two to four other stalks which "
"similarly split on various places along their length, ending in fine "
"fern-like fronds."
msgstr ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass.  Dark red in color and "
"almost waist-high, each stalk splits into two to four other stalks which "
"similarly split on various places along their length, ending in fine "
"fern-like fronds."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "tall alien grass"
msgstr "tall alien grass"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "tall alien grass"
msgid ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass.  Head high and such a dark "
"red as to be nearly black, the ends of the long stalks are a burst of fine "
"fronds all tangled into and around each other, forming a canopy."
msgstr ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass.  Head high and such a dark "
"red as to be nearly black, the ends of the long stalks are a burst of fine "
"fronds all tangled into and around each other, forming a canopy."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "alien bush"
msgstr "alien bush"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien bush"
msgid ""
"An alien plant, dark blue-green in color.  The leaves are all interwoven, "
"forming a sphere except for spots where the leaves have been eaten away by "
"some predator or pathogen.  It glows faintly in the dark."
msgstr ""
"An alien plant, dark blue-green in color.  The leaves are all interwoven, "
"forming a sphere except for spots where the leaves have been eaten away by "
"some predator or pathogen.  It glows faintly in the dark."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien bush"
msgid ""
"An alien bush, but one that looks very similar to a terrestrial bush despite "
"the dark purple leaves.  There are even clusters of white berries growing "
"from it."
msgstr ""
"An alien bush, but one that looks very similar to a terrestrial bush despite "
"the dark purple leaves.  There are even clusters of white berries growing "
"from it."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien bush"
msgid ""
"An alien bush, but one that looks very similar to a terrestrial bush despite "
"the dark purple leaves."
msgstr ""
"An alien bush, but one that looks very similar to a terrestrial bush despite "
"the dark purple leaves."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "alien shrub"
msgstr "alien shrub"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien shrub"
msgid ""
"An alien plant.  The branches split and split again into very fine tendrils "
"with bulbs on the end that float upward, holding its yellow leaves(?) up to "
"the sun.  Every gust of wind makes the entire plant sway."
msgstr ""
"An alien plant.  The branches split and split again into very fine tendrils "
"with bulbs on the end that float upward, holding its yellow leaves(?) up to "
"the sun.  Every gust of wind makes the entire plant sway."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"An alien tree, a group of individual dark-colored trunks that intertwine to "
"the point whether you can't tell whether it's a single plant or a group of "
"them.  The branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their "
"lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."
msgstr ""
"An alien tree, a group of individual dark-colored trunks that intertwine to "
"the point whether you can't tell whether it's a single plant or a group of "
"them.  The branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their "
"lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"An alien tree, looking vaguely like a willow with yellow leaves.  As you look "
"more closely, you see that the branches that touch the ground have put down "
"roots and are forming secondary trunks."
msgstr ""
"An alien tree, looking vaguely like a willow with yellow leaves.  As you look "
"more closely, you see that the branches that touch the ground have put down "
"roots and are forming secondary trunks."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"An alien tree, with the trunk lifted off the ground on a cluster of roots.  "
"Giant dark-red globes the size of watermelons hang from its branches amidst "
"clusters of dark-red leaves."
msgstr ""
"An alien tree, with the trunk lifted off the ground on a cluster of roots.  "
"Giant dark-red globes the size of watermelons hang from its branches amidst "
"clusters of dark-red leaves."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"An alien tree, with the trunk lifted off the ground on a cluster of roots.  "
"The branches have clusters of long, dark-red leaves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
msgid ""
"An alien tree, a group of thick dark-colored trunks half-fused together.  The "
"drooping branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their "
"lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."
msgstr ""
"An alien tree, a group of thick dark-colored trunks half-fused together.  The "
"drooping branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their "
"lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien roots"
msgid ""
"A cluster of dark roots from an alien tree are visible here.  Did one of them "
"just move?"
msgstr ""
"A cluster of dark roots from an alien tree are visible here.  Did one of them "
"just move?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "strange pool"
msgstr "strange pool"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "strange pool"
msgid ""
"A pool of some very thick, nearly-opaque liquid.  The surface is almost "
"perfectly smooth."
msgstr ""
"A pool of some very thick, nearly-opaque liquid.  The surface is almost "
"perfectly smooth."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "oak tree"
msgid ""
"A massive deciduous tree belonging to the 'Quercus' genus, commonly found "
"throughout the New England region.  If you look closely, you can see some "
"acorns the squirrels haven't gotten yet.  If you look near the top, you can "
"see a gigantic birds nest.  There are large bones sticking out of the edges "
"of the nest."
msgstr ""
"一棵体型巨大的落叶树，分类学上属于栎属，在新英格兰地区四处可见。如果你仔细观察，你会发现一些还没有被松鼠摘取的橡实。如果你朝树顶看，你可以看见一个巨大的鸟巢"
"。许多粗大的骨头从巢穴的边缘伸出来。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_tanks.json
