#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_tanks.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "Osiris chamber"
msgid ""
"A vat full of faintly-glowing solution, large enough to hold an adult human "
"with room to spare.  It was obviously used for some kind of scientific "
"experiments, and, based on the glowing lights on the base and the "
"still-active computer terminal next to it, could be used for such again."
msgstr ""
"一个装满微弱发光溶液的大桶，大到足以容纳一个成年人，还有多余的空间。显然它是用来做某种科学实验的，而且从底座上的发光灯和旁边仍在运行的电脑终端来看，还可以再"
