#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Meditation and You"
msgid_plural "copies of Meditation and You"
msgstr[0] "冥想和你"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Meditation and You"
msgid ""
"A description of simple meditation and breathing techniques, intended for a "
"beginner."
msgstr "针对初学者的简单冥想和呼吸技巧的描述。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
msgid "Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind"
msgid_plural "copies of Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind"
msgstr[0] "禅心，初心"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind" of item "Meditation
#. and You"
msgid ""
"This is a transcription of lectures given by Suzuki Shunryū, a Buddhist monk "
"who founded the first Zen Buddhist monastery in the United States, containing "
"discussion about Zen meditation and practice."
msgstr "这是铃木俊隆讲课的抄本，铃木俊隆是一位佛教僧侣，他在美国创立了第一座禅宗寺院，其中包含关于禅宗冥想和修行的讨论。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
msgid "How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making Friends with Your Mind"
msgid_plural "copies of How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making Friends with Your Mind"
msgstr[0] "如何冥想：用心灵交朋友的实用指南"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making
#. Friends with Your Mind" of item "Meditation and You"
msgid ""
"A book on meditation written for a general audience, containing simple "
"techniques on breathing and mindfulness."
msgstr "一本为普通读者写的关于冥想的书，包含有关呼吸和正念的简单技巧。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
msgid "The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us about Distraction"
msgid_plural "copies of The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us about Distraction"
msgstr[0] "流浪的心灵：中世纪僧侣告诉我们的分心"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us
#. about Distraction" of item "Meditation and You"
msgid ""
"A history of monastic attempts at finding calm and peace in the midst of a "
"profane world.  There are far fewer daily distractions now than pre-Cataclysm "
"but there's still some useful techniques you could gain here."
msgstr "一部僧侣试图在亵渎的世界中寻找平静与和平的历史。与大灾变前相比，现在的日常干扰要少得多，但仍然有一些有用的技巧可以在这里学到。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
msgid "The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to the Practice of Meditation"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to the Practice of "
"Meditation"
msgstr[0] "正念的奇迹：冥想练习入门"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to
#. the Practice of Meditation" of item "Meditation and You"
msgid ""
"A translation of a letter written by Thich Nhat Hanh to colleagues in Viet "
"Nam, this book focuses on mindfulness and breathwork."
msgstr "这本书是一行禅师写给越南同事的一封信的翻译，这本书专注于正念和呼吸。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid_plural "copies of Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgstr[0] "禅宗大师的秘密"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid ""
"This book purports to contain hidden tips that will make you serene and calm "
"in the face of the most grievous calamities.  Cataclysms, one might say."
msgstr "这本书声称包含许多密不外传的技巧，可以让你在面对最严重的灾难时保持平静。有人可能会说，那就是大灾变。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid ""
"The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide Integrating Buddhist Wisdom "
"and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide Integrating "
"Buddhist Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness"
msgstr[0] "点亮心灵：一本完整的冥想指南，融合佛教智慧和脑科学，提升正念"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide
#. Integrating Buddhist Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness" of
#. item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid ""
"Written by a neuroscientist and meditator practitioner, this book offers a "
"ten-step meditation program that combines science with traditional meditation "
"techniques."
msgstr "这本书由一位神经学家和冥想练习者撰写，提供了一个将科学与传统冥想技术相结合的十步冥想计划。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid "Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An Unusually Hardcore Dharma Book"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An Unusually Hardcore "
"Dharma Book"
msgstr[0] "掌握佛学奥义：一本不同寻常的硬核佛法书"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An
#. Unusually Hardcore Dharma Book" of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid ""
"This book argues that meditation is not an eternal progression but can be "
"mastered just like any other skill, and it will tell you how to do it."
msgstr "这本书认为冥想不是一个永恒的过程，但可以像任何其他技能一样掌握，它会告诉你如何做到这一点。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid "Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
msgid_plural "copies of Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
msgstr[0] "并非总是如此：实践禅宗的真正精神"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
#. of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid ""
"A continuation of the lessons expounded on in \"Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind\", "
"this book contains a myriad of parables and koans to help the student grasp "
"the nature of meditation."
msgstr "这本书是《禅心，初心》一书中阐述的课程的继续，本书包含了无数的寓言和常识，帮助学生掌握冥想的本质。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Lab Journal-Otomo"
msgid_plural "copies of Lab Journal-Otomo"
msgstr[0] "研究日志（大友博士）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Lab Journal-Otomo"
msgid ""
"This notebook is mostly a series of fanciful speculations about something the "
"author alternately calls \"Matrix Mechanics,\", \"Dimensional Metaphysics,\" "
"or \"Netherium Mathematics,\" sometimes using more than one in the same "
"sentence.  Most of it is incoherent, but there is some experimental data "
"about \"Conscious redirection of nether energy\" that catches your eye."
msgstr ""
"这本笔记主要是一系列关于作者交替称为“矩阵力学”、“维度玄学”或“幽冥数学”的奇思妙想，有时在同一个句子中使用不止一个。其中大部分是不连贯的，但是有一些关于"
"“主动引导异界能量”的数据记录吸引了你的眼球。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgid_plural "copies of Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgstr[0] "实验报告（引导流程 PGS38）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgid ""
"A formal report on a process to reduce the unpredictable effects of long-term "
"psionic use.  It describes a special meditation technique, performed with the "
"aid of a matrix crystal, though it does warn that the process: \"puts extreme "
"stress on the focus object.  Further refinement is required.\""
msgstr ""
"一份正式的报告，关于如何降低长期使用灵能所导致的不可预测影响。其中详细描述了一种特殊的冥想技巧，需要在矩阵晶体的帮助下进行，不过其中实实在在地警告说本过程："
"“对聚焦对象施加极大的压力。需要进一步完善。”"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional Metaphysics"
msgid_plural "copies of Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional Metaphysics"
msgstr[0] "训练手册：轨迹记忆法和维度玄学"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional
#. Metaphysics"
msgid ""
"A formal report on a series of training procedures to allow the practitioner "
"to hold images and ideas in their head for long periods of time without being "
"distracted or losing their train of thought.  The report concludes, \"While "
"the human mind is not adept at holding static images or scenes in place, some "
"minor variation can be allowed for without suffering any adverse effects from "
"the flow of Netherum energy.  Method of Loci allows the mathematician to "
"maintain their thoughts within this area of variation while still exerting "
"effective control over the mathematics.\""
msgstr ""
"一系列正式报告，通过特定训练程序使练习者能够在头脑中长时间记忆图像和想法，而不会分心或中断思维链路。报告中的结论处写道：“虽然人类思维不擅长长时间记忆静态图"
"像或场景，但可以允许略微细小的变化，而不会受到异界能量流动所产生的不利影响。轨迹记忆法可以使数学家们将自身的思维链路维持在这个变化范围内，同时仍然有效掌控数"
"学。”"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgid_plural "copies of Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgstr[0] "训练手册：青翠之手战斗规程"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgid ""
"A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"VERDANT HAND - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  Contrary to your initial assumption, it is not a martial arts "
"training manual.  Instead, it describes a series of meditations and "
"visualization exercises designed to \"increase the subject's unarmed combat "
"prowess fivefold\".  There are several charts showing the results of a "
"VERDANT HAND combatant against training opponents armed with weapons or "
"firearms at various engagement distances.  It's clearly still not as good as "
"just having a rifle, but the data look pretty promising if you can get these "
"exercises down."
msgstr ""
"一份正式的报告，封面大部分是空白的，盖着 PHAVIAN "
"项目的图章，纸张正中印着红色的“青翠之手：最高机密”。与你最初的假设相反，这不是一本武术训练手册。相反，它描述了一系列冥想和可视化练习，旨在“将徒手作战能力"
"提高五倍”。有几张图表显示了使用青翠之手的作战人员在不同交战距离上对抗训练携带武器或枪械的对手的结果。显然，它仍然不如使用步枪那么好，但是如果你能完成这些训"
"练，那么数据看起来还有点希望。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Proposal: TURQUOISE KEYSTONE"
msgid_plural "copies of Proposal: TURQUOISE KEYSTONE"
msgstr[0] "copies of Proposal: TURQUOISE KEYSTONE"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Proposal: TURQUOISE KEYSTONE"
msgid ""
"A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"TURQUOISE KEYSTONE - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  Skimming through it, you see a lot of very worrying phrases in "
"light of recent events, like \"…the sudden but so-far unexplained increase in "
"our mathematicians' prowess…\" or \"…E71 is now capable of passing through "
"two meters of solid matter.\"  The main topic of the document seems to be "
"using teleportation (\"LOST RAIN\", as the report calls it) in combat.  By "
"lengthening the space between the teleporter and their target to build up "
"momentum on their strikes, warping space to make near-misses turn into hits, "
"or teleporting fractions of a meter to avoid incoming attacks or put "
"themselves in a better position to make strikes, the TURQUOISE KEYSTONE "
"practitioner can vastly increase their prowess in close-quarters combat.  "
"Written at the bottom of the last page is, \"We had better test this soon--I "
"think we're going to need it.\""
msgstr ""
"A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"TURQUOISE KEYSTONE - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  Skimming through it, you see a lot of very worrying phrases in "
"light of recent events, like \"…the sudden but so-far unexplained increase in "
"our mathematicians' prowess…\" or \"…E71 is now capable of passing through "
"two meters of solid matter.\"  The main topic of the document seems to be "
"using teleportation (\"LOST RAIN\", as the report calls it) in combat.  By "
"lengthening the space between the teleporter and their target to build up "
"momentum on their strikes, warping space to make near-misses turn into hits, "
"or teleporting fractions of a meter to avoid incoming attacks or put "
"themselves in a better position to make strikes, the TURQUOISE KEYSTONE "
"practitioner can vastly increase their prowess in close-quarters combat.  "
"Written at the bottom of the last page is, \"We had better test this soon--I "
"think we're going to need it.\""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Lab Report: PATIENT MOSAIC process"
msgid_plural "copies of Lab Report: PATIENT MOSAIC process"
msgstr[0] "copies of Lab Report: PATIENT MOSAIC process"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Lab Report: PATIENT MOSAIC process"
msgid ""
"A thick lab report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"PATIENT MOSAIC - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  According to the summary, the report details how a powerful GRAY "
"DAWN participant may use a specifically attuned focusing tool to allow "
"themselves to induce permanent changes in their personality and other "
"segments of their brain.  The report details little success in GRAY DAWN "
"participant applying this process to others."
msgstr ""
"A thick lab report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"PATIENT MOSAIC - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  According to the summary, the report details how a powerful GRAY "
"DAWN participant may use a specifically attuned focusing tool to allow "
"themselves to induce permanent changes in their personality and other "
"segments of their brain.  The report details little success in GRAY DAWN "
"participant applying this process to others."

