msgid "black liquid"
msgid_plural "black liquid"
msgstr[0] "黑液"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "black liquid"
msgid ""
"You don't know what this is but now that you've gotten a closer look it's "
"definitely not water.  It's completely opaque and freezing cold to the touch, "
"but when you pull your fingertip out of it, your skin is dry as a bone."
msgstr ""
"You don't know what this is but now that you've gotten a closer look it's "
"definitely not water.  It's completely opaque and freezing cold to the touch, "
"but when you pull your fingertip out of it, your skin is dry as a bone."

