"reports, with a large \"Project OBSIDIAN RING\" on the front.  Most of it is "
"rather trivial, but certain passages catch your eye…"
msgstr "一个满是实验结果或是记录报告的文件夹，标题为“黑曜石环”。大部分内容都很琐碎，但某些段落还是能吸引你的眼球……"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/files_and_post_it.json
#. ~ Description of "visitor's pass"
msgid ""
"A visitor's pass to some sort of facility.  The reverse side describes the "
"protocol for using it; this could grant one-time access at a card reader, if "
"you can find one.  It also lists the addresses of nearby facilities; activate "
"it to add their locations to your map.  There is a prominent symbol stamped "
"on it with the word \"PHAVIAN\" underneath."
msgstr ""
"某种设施的访客通行证。背面描述了使用它的协议；如果你能找到读卡器，这可以授予一次访问权限。它还列出了附近设施的地址；使用它以将设施位置添加到地图中。这张通行"
"证上面印着一个显眼的符号，下面有\"PHAVIAN\"一词。"

