#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/matrix_crystals.json
#. ~ Description of "refined matrix crystal powder, black"
msgid ""
"Concentrated matrix crystal dust.  It seems to completely absorb any light "
"that falls on it."
msgstr "一小撮浓缩矩阵晶体粉尘。它似乎完全吸收了落在其上的光线。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/matrix_crystals.json
