"A strange-looking, surprisingly-heavy crystal.  In total darkness, "
"multicolored lights churn and swirl within its depths."
msgstr "一个外形奇特，重得出奇的水晶。在完全的黑暗中，深处透出不断翻腾旋转的五彩光芒。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/matrix_crystals.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "strange crystal, coruscating"
