#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/matrix_crystals.json
#. ~ Description of "strange crystal shard"
msgid ""
"A very heavy chunk of a strange crystalline outcropping.  You could use it as "
"a weapon, but you might want to wear gloves."
msgstr "一块外形奇特，重得出奇的水晶碎片。可以拿来戳人，不过还是先戴上手套比较好。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "morphic reinforcement serum"
msgid_plural "morphic reinforcement serum"
msgstr[0] "morphic reinforcement serum"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ Description of "morphic reinforcement serum"
msgid ""
"An extremely thick-looking liquid that will \"enhance your resilience against "
"detrimental mutagenic alterations caused by XE037 overexposure\" if injected."
msgstr ""
"An extremely thick-looking liquid that will \"enhance your resilience against "
"detrimental mutagenic alterations caused by XE037 overexposure\" if injected."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "morphic reinforcement serum"
msgid "You inject the morphic reinforcement serum."
msgstr "You inject the morphic reinforcement serum."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "morphic reversion serum"
msgid_plural "morphic reversion serum"
msgstr[0] "突变逆转血清"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ Description of "morphic reversion serum"
msgid ""
"A faintly-glowing green liquid, the document you found told you that this "
"would \"restore your morphology to baseline\", whatever that means."
msgstr "一种微弱发光的绿色液体，你所找到的文件中说这玩意能够“将你的形态恢复到基线”，不管那是什么意思。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "noetic resilience treatment"
msgid_plural "noetic resilience treatment"
msgstr[0] "心智恢复治疗剂"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ Description of "noetic resilience treatment"
msgid ""
"A clear liquid, designed to alleviate some of the unpredictable effects of "
"excessive psionic channeling."
msgstr "一种透明液体，旨在减轻过度引导灵能所带来的某些不可预测的影响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
#. ~ Description of "noetic resonance detector"
msgid ""
"A strange device, a bit like one of those eyesight testing machines you look "
"into in an optometrist's office.  The main housing has a place to rest your "
"chin and a pair of binocular-like tubes, but there is also a headband "
"attached to a set of wires hanging from a hook on the side and an armband "
"hanging from the other side."
msgstr ""
"A strange device, a bit like one of those eyesight testing machines you look "
"into in an optometrist's office.  The main housing has a place to rest your "
"chin and a pair of binocular-like tubes, but there is also a headband "
"attached to a set of wires hanging from a hook on the side and an armband "
"hanging from the other side."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deck of Zener cards"
msgid_plural "decks of Zener cards"
msgstr[0] "齐纳牌"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "deck of Zener cards"
msgid "A deck of Zener cards, used pre-Cataclysm to test for psychic ability."
msgstr "一副齐纳卡片，在大灾变前被用作测试灵能的工具。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "deck of Zener cards"
msgid "Pick a card.  Any card."
msgstr "选张牌。随意一张。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "device labeled OS647-P"
msgid_plural "devices labeled OS647-P"
msgstr[0] "标签为OS647-P的设备"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "device labeled OS647-P"
msgid ""
"A small plastic device about the size of two smartphones stacked on top of "
"each other, with a toggle on one end and \"OS647-P\" written prominently on "
"one side above the XEDRA logo.  There is an indentation on the other side the "
"right size to contain a matrix crystal."
msgstr ""
"一个大约两部智能手机大小的小型塑料设备，堆叠在一起，一端有一个开关，XEDRA标志上方的一侧醒目地写着“OS647-"
"P”。另一侧有一个适当大小的压痕，可以容纳矩阵晶体。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "device labeled OS647-P"
msgid "Insert a black matrix crystal and flip the toggle."
msgstr "插入黑色矩阵晶体并翻转开关。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "device labeled OS647-P"
msgid ""
"A small plastic device about the size of two smartphones stacked on top of "
"each other, with a toggle on one end and \"OS647-P\" written prominently on "
"one side above the XEDRA logo.  Parts of the device seem melted and the "
"toggle no longer moves."
msgstr ""
"这是一款小型塑料设备，大小相当于两台智能手机堆叠在一起，一端有一个开关，在XEDRA标识上方醒目地写着“OS647-"
"P”。设备的部分部件似乎融化了，手柄也不再转动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "your body"
msgid_plural "your body"
msgstr[0] "你的身体"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "your body"
msgid ""
"Your body, lying on the ground while your spirit walks free.  Hopefully "
"nothing happens to it while you're gone."
msgstr "你的身体，躺在地上，而你的灵魂自由行走。希望你离开的这段时间里没发生什么事。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of alien leaves"
msgid_plural "handfuls of alien leaves"
msgstr[0] "handfuls of alien leaves"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of alien leaves"
msgid ""
"A handful of dry leaves(?) from an alien plant.  Despite their otherworldly "
"origin, they have very few uses and are thus (almost) only good for burning."
msgstr "一把外星植物的干叶子（？ 尽管它们来自异世界，但用途却很少，因此（几乎）只能用来燃烧。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]oxygen absorption"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]oxygen absorption"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]体表呼吸"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]oxygen absorption"
msgid "You are breathing through your skin."
msgstr "你通过皮肤呼吸。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]hammerhand"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]hammerhand"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]工具手"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]hammerhand"
msgid "You can perform many common handy tasks with your bare hands."
msgstr "你可以赤手空拳完成许多常见的简单制造任务。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]radiation sense"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]radiation senses"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]辐射感知"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]radiation sense"
msgid "You can see ambient radiation as a faint, sinister glow."
msgstr "你可以看到周围的辐射是一种微弱的、邪恶的光芒。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]silver cord"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]silver cord"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]系魂银带"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]silver cord"
msgid ""
"A thin silver cord, stretching off into the distance, connecting you to your "
"body.  You could follow it back to return."
msgstr "一根银色细绳，延伸到远处，将你与身体连接起来。你可以跟着它回去。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_robot_interface"
msgid "[Ψ]Robotic Interface"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]Robotic Interfaces"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]机器人接口"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]Robotic Interface"
msgid "Interface with robots remotely"
msgstr "远程控制机器人的接口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]radio sense (speaking)"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]radio sense (speaking)"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]电波交流（通信）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]radio sense (speaking)"
msgid ""
"Your powers allow you to communicate by radio waves.  With a moment's "
"concentration, you may instead scan for radio signals."
msgstr "你的灵能使你能够通过无线电波进行通信。稍加专注，你就可以改变频率或切换到侦听模式。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "[Ψ]radio sense (speaking)"
msgid "Switch to scanning mode"
msgstr "开启侦听模式"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]radio sense (scanning)"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]radio sense (scanning)"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]电波交流（侦听）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]radio sense (scanning)"
msgid ""
"Your powers allow you to listen for radio signals from the surrounding area.  "
"With a moment's concentration, you may change frequency or switch to "
"communicating by radio."
msgstr "你的灵能使你能够收听周围地区的无线电信号。稍加专注，你就可以改变频率或切换到通信模式。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "[Ψ]radio sense (scanning)"
msgid "Switch to speaking mode"
msgstr "开启通信模式"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "photon regulation"
msgid_plural "photon regulation"
msgstr[0] "光子管控"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "photon regulation"
msgid ""
"With a little concentration, you can control the light your eyes accept.  "
"Protects you from glare and welding arcs."
msgstr "只要稍稍集中专注，你就可以控制眼睛接受的光线。保护你的眼睛免受闪光和焊接时的强光伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]banked flames"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]banked flames"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]banked flames"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]banked flames"
msgid ""
"Dancing flames hovering over your hand.  You can use this to provide heat and "
"light when necessary."
msgstr "舞动的火焰在你的手上盘旋。你可以在必要的时候用它来提供热量和光线。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]incandescent lance"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]incandescent lances"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]炽耀喷流"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]incandescent lance"
msgid ""
"A thin, searing beam, almost too bright to look at.  You can use this to weld "
"or cut through things."
msgstr "一束细细的灼热的光束，几乎亮得无法直视。你可以用它来焊接或切割东西。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]lifting field"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]lifting fields"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]悬浮场"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]lifting field"
msgid ""
"You can lift one thing with your powers, removing its effect on your "
"encumbrance."
msgstr "你可以用你的灵能悬浮一件东西，消除它对你的负担的影响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]telekinetic jack"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]telekinetic jacks"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]念力千斤顶"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]telekinetic jack"
msgid ""
"Using your powers, you can lift up a vehicle just enough to allow you to "
"change the wheels."
msgstr "使用你的灵能，你可以举起一辆车，刚好可以让你更换车轮。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]Vitakinetic Wound Staunching"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]Vitakinetic Wound Staunchings"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]止血灵能"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]Vitakinetic Wound Staunching"
msgid "The power to stop bleeding"
msgstr "疗愈者的灵能，用以止血。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "[Ψ]Vitakinetic Disinfectant"
msgid_plural "[Ψ]Vitakinetic Disinfectants"
msgstr[0] "[Ψ]消毒灵能"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/psions_summon_items.json
#. ~ Description of "[Ψ]Vitakinetic Disinfectant"
msgid "The power to stop infections"
msgstr "疗愈者的灵能，用以消毒防止感染。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "matrix channeling array schematics"
msgid_plural "matrix channeling array schematics"
msgstr[0] "矩阵引导阵列原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "matrix channeling array schematics"
msgid ""
"This is a series of technical design documents for a \"matrix channeling "
"array\" designed to \"allow an attuned mathematician to direct a stronger "
"level of Netherum energy\".  It sounds like nonsense, but the document does "
"have the XEDRA seal stamped on it."
msgstr "一系列技术设计文档，描述了一种“矩阵引导阵列”，设计用来“让已同调的数学家引导更强的异界能量”。听起来狗屁不通，但文件上确实盖着XEDRA的印章。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crystalline focusing assembly schematics"
msgid_plural "crystalline focusing assembly schematics"
msgstr[0] "晶体聚焦组件原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "crystalline focusing assembly schematics"
#. ~ Description of "telepathic focusing tool schematics"
msgid ""
"This is a series of technical design documents for a focusing assembly "
"designed to \"enhance the precision of Netherum mathematics\"."
msgstr "一系列技术设计文档，描述了某种聚焦设备，用以“增强异界数学的精准度”。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "telepathic focusing tool schematics"
msgid_plural "telepathic focusing tool schematics"
msgstr[0] "telepathic focusing tool schematics"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "refined matrix crystal schematics"
msgid_plural "refined matrix crystal schematics"
msgstr[0] "精制矩阵晶体原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "refined matrix crystal schematics"
msgid ""
"A series of technical documents for further refining ground matrix crystal, "
"separating out the inert parts from the \"Netherically active\" parts."
msgstr "一系列的技术文件，以进一步精制矩阵晶体，将惰性部分从具有“异界活性”的部分分离出来。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "anchoring crown schematics"
msgid_plural "anchoring crown schematics"
msgstr[0] "相位锚冠原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "anchoring crown schematics"
msgid ""
"This is a series of technical design documents for using matrix crystals to "
"shield the wearer from excess Netherum energies with the drawback of also "
"shutting down any psionic ability they have while worn."
msgstr "一系列技术设计文档，描述了如何使用矩阵水晶来保护佩戴者免受过量异界能量的影响，然而同时提到缺点是也会阻碍佩戴者使用灵能能力。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "telepathic dampener schematics"
msgid_plural "telepathic dampener schematics"
msgstr[0] "心灵减震器原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "telepathic dampener schematics"
msgid ""
"This is a series of technical design documents for using matrix crystals to "
"shield the wearer's mind from telepathic assault and from unfriendly "
"attention from Netherum entities.  The design also mentions that it reduces "
"the wearer's own psionic power, however."
msgstr "一系列技术设计文档，描述了如何使用矩阵水晶来保护佩戴者的思想免受心灵感应攻击，以及来自异界生物的敌意关注。然而同时提到缺点是会降低佩戴者自身的灵能能力。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inferno grenade schematics"
msgid_plural "inferno grenade schematics"
msgstr[0] "炼狱手雷原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "inferno grenade schematics"
msgid ""
"This is a design document to create a grenade using matrix crystal dust that "
"explodes in a sea of pure flame.  In pen below is the note \"EXTREMELY "
"DANGEROUS\".  You're not sure you could replicate the exact process with the "
"tools available to you, but you could definitely come up with your own "
"version."
msgstr ""
"这是一份使用矩阵晶体粉末制造手雷的设计文档，该手雷会在一片纯净的火焰中爆炸。下面用钢笔写着“极度危险”的字样。你不确定自己能否用手头现有的工具精确复制这个过"
"程，但你肯定能想出自己的版本。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Netherum transporter schematics"
msgid_plural "Netherum transporter schematics"
msgstr[0] "异界传送器原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "Netherum transporter schematics"
msgid ""
"This is a series of design documents for building a transporter beacon and "
"connected transporter remote, which you can use to teleport yourself through "
"the Nether to the beacon.  It's labeled \"for immersion use only\", but that "
"part has a line through it and \"IT WORKS!\" written next to it in pen.  "
"There's another note in red that states that on very rare occasions, "
"\"entities\" can also use the beacon to exit the Nether, and also that as of "
"two weeks before the Cataclysm, the designers have not solved the energy "
"surge problems that make each remote burn out after use."
msgstr ""
"一系列技术设计文档，描述了如何制造传送器信标并将其与远端传送器相连，你可以使用异界传送到这些信标所在地。上面写着“仅供沉浸使用”，但那句话被划掉了，旁边用圆"
"珠笔写着“这能行！”。还有另一条用红字标明的备注指出，在极少数情况下，“其他生物”也可以使用信标进出异界，而且截至大灾变前两周，设计者还没有解决能量激增的问"
"题，这使得每个信标在使用一次远程传送后就会被烧毁。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "everglow matrix lamp schematics"
msgid_plural "everglow matrix lamp schematics"
msgstr[0] "永光矩阵灯原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "everglow matrix lamp schematics"
msgid ""
"This is a series of design documents to use ground matrix crystals to greatly "
"enhance the power efficiency of a lamp."
msgstr "这是一系列的设计文件，使用矩阵晶体以大大提高灯的功率。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "psychoreactive catalyst specifications"
msgid_plural "psychoreactive catalyst specifications"
msgstr[0] "精神反应催化剂说明书"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "psychoreactive catalyst specifications"
msgid ""
"A chemical formula for mixing ground matrix crystals with other metals and "
"dissolving them in liquid.  There's a long list of possible applications for "
"the resulting compound, almost all of which would have seemed like pure "
"fantasy if you hadn't lived through the end of the world."
msgstr "一种将磨碎的矩阵晶体与其他金属混合并将其溶解在液体中的化学配方。得到的化合物有一长串可能的应用，如果不是在大灾变，几乎所有的应用都会看起来像是天方夜谭。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "morphic reinforcement serum schematics"
msgid_plural "morphic reinforcement serum schematics"
msgstr[0] "morphic reinforcement serum schematics"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "morphic reinforcement serum schematics"
msgid ""
"This document details a series of steps for making an injectable serum which "
"will \"enhance the subject's resilience against detrimental mutagenic "
"alterations caused by XE037 overexposure, reducing negative outcomes during "
"testing\".  It's stamped with a XEDRA symbol in the corner with \"Project "
"PHAVIAN\" written at the top."
msgstr ""
"This document details a series of steps for making an injectable serum which "
"will \"enhance the subject's resilience against detrimental mutagenic "
"alterations caused by XE037 overexposure, reducing negative outcomes during "
"testing\".  It's stamped with a XEDRA symbol in the corner with \"Project "
"PHAVIAN\" written at the top."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "morphic reversion serum schematics"
msgid_plural "morphic reversion serum schematics"
msgstr[0] "突变逆转血清原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "morphic reversion serum schematics"
msgid ""
"A series of steps to create a serum that will \"Eliminate the undesirable "
"effects of XE037 overexposure\".  It is designed to be injected in the "
"recipient."
msgstr "指导如何制造“消除XE037过度暴露的不良效果”的血清，必须注射。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "compound XV471 schematics"
msgid_plural "compound XV471 schematics"
msgstr[0] "compound XV471 schematics"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "compound XV471 schematics"
msgid ""
"This document details the chemical process necessary to create what it calls "
"Compound XV471, which it claims is a pharmaceutical treatment for a wide "
"variety of ills.  According to this, it acts as a near-universal antivenin, "
"an antifungal, an antiparasitic, an antibiotic, cures several common diseases "
"such as influenza or the common cold, improves the immune system generally, "
"and even increases strength, agility, and overall bodily function.  You would "
"think it was too good to be true if you hadn't seen so many other bizarre "
"things since the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"This document details the chemical process necessary to create what it calls "
"Compound XV471, which it claims is a pharmaceutical treatment for a wide "
"variety of ills.  According to this, it acts as a near-universal antivenin, "
"an antifungal, an antiparasitic, an antibiotic, cures several common diseases "
"such as influenza or the common cold, improves the immune system generally, "
"and even increases strength, agility, and overall bodily function.  You would "
"think it was too good to be true if you hadn't seen so many other bizarre "
"things since the Cataclysm."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "noetic resilience treatment schematics"
msgid_plural "noetic resilience treatment schematics"
msgstr[0] "灵能韧性疗程原理图"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "noetic resilience treatment schematics"
msgid ""
"A technical document outlining a treatment for \"noetic overuse\".  After the "
"outline of the treatment is a note, dated two weeks before the end of the "
"world, that while it showed great promise in initial trials the side effects "
"require further study before it can be recommended for widespread usage."
msgstr "这份文档详细描述了如何治疗“灵能过劳”的症状。在文档背后贴着一张大灾变前两周的笔记，指出虽然先期试验表明疗程潜力巨大，但副作用仍未明确。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "USB drive (Phavian)"
msgid_plural "USB drives (Phavian)"
msgstr[0] "USB驱动器（Phavian）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "USB drive (Phavian)"
msgid ""
"A USB thumb drive with the XEDRA logo over a large Ψ symbol printed on it.  "
"You'd bet there's something important on here."
msgstr "一个USB拇指驱动器，上面印有XEDRA标志和一个大的Ψ符号。你可以打赌这里有一些重要的东西。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "USB drive (Phavian)"
msgid "Use a laptop to access the data."
msgstr "使用笔记本电脑访问数据。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "noetic resonance detector operator instructions"
msgid_plural "noetic resonance detector operator instructions"
msgstr[0] "noetic resonance detector operator instructions"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/schematics.json
#. ~ Description of "noetic resonance detector operator instructions"
msgid ""
"An extensive series of instructions on the proper calibrations and parameters "
"for using the \"noetic resonance detector\" to determine a target's noetic "
"potential.  There is no way you could have ever figured this out without "
"these directions to follow."
msgstr ""
"An extensive series of instructions on the proper calibrations and parameters "
"for using the \"noetic resonance detector\" to determine a target's noetic "
"potential.  There is no way you could have ever figured this out without "
"these directions to follow."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/survivor_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled matrix crystal notes"
msgid_plural "scribbled matrix crystal notes"
msgstr[0] "scribbled matrix crystal notes"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/survivor_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "scribbled matrix crystal notes"
msgid ""
"A series of notes, musings, and marginalia about grinding up matrix crystals, "
"refining the dust and then…mixing it with water and drinking the results?  "
"Hopefully it won't make you go blind."
msgstr ""
"A series of notes, musings, and marginalia about grinding up matrix crystals, "
"refining the dust and then…mixing it with water and drinking the results?  "
"Hopefully it won't make you go blind."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ch47 Fusion Pistol"
msgid_plural "Ch47 Fusion Pistols"
msgstr[0] "Ch47聚变手枪"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ch47 Fusion Pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Ch47 Fusion Pistol"
msgid ""
"The standard-issue officer's sidearm for the Imperial Navy, guaranteed "
"manufactured on Tlalticpactli itself by scions of the Huey Calpulli, the Ch47 "
"replaced the earlier Ch41 and is widely renowned for its accuracy and ease of "
"maintenance.  This particular Ch47 even bears an eagle and snake on the grip, "
"indicating it was produced in a factory in Anáhuac.  Hopefully it'll make a "
"good melee weapon as well."
msgstr ""
"Ch47 是帝国海军的制式军官佩枪，由休伊·卡尔普利的子嗣在“特拉尔蒂克帕克特里”自行制造，它取代了早期的 Ch41，并因其准确性和易于维护而广为人知。 "
"这款特殊的 Ch47 甚至在握把上刻有一只鹰和一条蛇，表明它是在“阿纳瓦克”的一家工厂生产的。希望它也能成为一把优秀的近战武器。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "Ch47 power pack"
msgid_plural "Ch47 power packs"
msgstr[0] "Ch47聚变手枪电源组"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "Ch47 power pack"
#. ~ Description of "Ch47 power pack"
#. ~ Description of magazine "M12 power pack"
#. ~ Description of "M12 power pack"
msgid "A power pack for the Ch47."
msgstr "CH47聚变手枪所使用的能量来源。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ch47 power cartridge"
msgid_plural "Ch47 power cartridges"
msgstr[0] "Ch47 聚变手枪能量弹"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Ch47 power cartridge"
msgid ""
"Power cartridges for the Ch47.  You had better make every shot count, because "
"there's no way you're finding any more of these."
msgstr "Ch47的能量弹药。你最好让每一枪都有价值，因为你不可能再找到这样的子弹了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
msgid "Ch47 fusion shot"
msgstr "Ch47聚变弹"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "M12 \"Cochmamauhtia\" Pistol"
msgid_plural "M12 \"Cochmamauhtia\" Pistols"
msgstr[0] "M12 \"Cochmamauhtia\" Pistols"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M12 "Cochmamauhtia" Pistol"
#. ~ Description of "M12 "Cochmamauhtia" Pistol"
msgid ""
"The M12 was designed as a less-than-lethal alternative to more dangerous "
"forms of crowd pacification, able to disable a target for up to a minute with "
"a single shot and few to no permanent effects.  While it cannot be said to be "
"nonlethal because it is not safe to use on targets with heart conditions or "
"epilepsy, it is a great improvement over the previous X04 \"Tecuacuilli\" "
"which, on unfortunately not-rare-enough occasions, could cause permanent "
"paralysis.  On this world, though, you don't think the M12's lethality or "
"lack thereof is going to be much of a concern."
msgstr ""
"The M12 was designed as a less-than-lethal alternative to more dangerous "
"forms of crowd pacification, able to disable a target for up to a minute with "
"a single shot and few to no permanent effects.  While it cannot be said to be "
"nonlethal because it is not safe to use on targets with heart conditions or "
"epilepsy, it is a great improvement over the previous X04 \"Tecuacuilli\" "
"which, on unfortunately not-rare-enough occasions, could cause permanent "
"paralysis.  On this world, though, you don't think the M12's lethality or "
"lack thereof is going to be much of a concern."

