#. ~ Description of "pāncahcallō torso armor"
msgid ""
"A set of torso and upper-arm armor made with mixed leather overlaid with "
"sheets of ichcayolli, pāncahcallō armor derives its effectiveness from the "
"integral generator capable of projecting an ehēcatepantli barrier that "
"provides most of the armor's protection."
msgstr ""
"A set of torso and upper-arm armor made with mixed leather overlaid with "
"sheets of ichcayolli, pāncahcallō armor derives its effectiveness from the "
"integral generator capable of projecting an ehēcatepantli barrier that "
"provides most of the armor's protection."

