#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Itzcuāuhtli Corps tilmàtli"
msgid_plural "Itzcuāuhtli Corps tilmàtli"
msgstr[0] "Itzcuāuhtli Corps tilmàtli"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Itzcuāuhtli Corps tilmàtli"
msgid ""
"A formal dress cape for the Itzcuāuhtli Corps in crimson and gold, with the "
"eagle's head over a field of stars insignia on the left shoulder, worn by "
"generations of those who sought out new worlds in service to the Huey "
"Tlatoani and the Ēxcān Tlahtōlōyān.  You're pretty sure this is the furthest "
"anyone wearing one has ever been from Anáhuac."
msgstr ""
"A formal dress cape for the Itzcuāuhtli Corps in crimson and gold, with the "
"eagle's head over a field of stars insignia on the left shoulder, worn by "
"generations of those who sought out new worlds in service to the Huey "
"Tlatoani and the Ēxcān Tlahtōlōyān.  You're pretty sure this is the furthest "
"anyone wearing one has ever been from Anáhuac."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Imperial navy cap"
msgid_plural "Imperial navy caps"
msgstr[0] "帝国海军帽"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Imperial navy cap"
msgid ""
"A flat crimson hat worn by members of the Imperial navy at formal events.  "
"This one has the black circle of the Yohualli Ehēcatl on it."
msgstr ""
"A flat crimson hat worn by members of the Imperial navy at formal events.  "
"This one has the black circle of the Yohualli Ehēcatl on it."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ch47 holster"
msgid_plural "Ch47 holsters"
msgstr[0] "Ch47手枪枪套"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Ch47 holster"
msgid ""
"A holster for the Ch47.  You could put one of the primitive local ranged "
"weapons in here too, if you had to."
msgstr "Ch47 手枪的枪套。如果需要的话，你也可以将其他本地原始的远程武器收进其中。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
