msgid_plural "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform pants"
msgstr[0] "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform pants"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform pants"
msgid ""
"The standard combat uniform of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps, in shades of dark green "
"and grey.  These are pants, with several pockets."
msgstr ""
"The standard combat uniform of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps, in shades of dark green "
"and grey.  These are pants, with several pockets."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform shirt"
msgid_plural "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform shirt"
msgstr[0] "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform shirt"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform shirt"
msgid ""
"The standard combat uniform of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps, in shades of dark green "
"and grey.  This is a shirt."
msgstr ""
"The standard combat uniform of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps, in shades of dark green "
"and grey.  This is a shirt."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform jacket"
msgid_plural "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform jacket"
msgstr[0] "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform jacket"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform jacket"
msgid ""
"The standard combat uniform of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps, in shades of dark green "
"and grey.  This is a jacket.  It has the eagle over a field of stars symbol "
"of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps on both shoulders."
msgstr ""
"The standard combat uniform of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps, in shades of dark green "
"and grey.  This is a jacket.  It has the eagle over a field of stars symbol "
"of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps on both shoulders."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Imperial Church holy symbol"
msgid_plural "Imperial Church holy symbols"
msgstr[0] "Imperial Church holy symbols"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/teleporter_start_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Imperial Church holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of fine gold chain, bearing an image of Jesucristo as the "
"Ultimate Sacrifice as a pendant, his heart clearly visible through his chest. "
" Under his left hand is a raindrop, representing the Aeon Tláloc, and under "
"his right hand is a sun disc, representing the Aeon Huītzilōpōchtli."
msgstr ""
"A necklace made of fine gold chain, bearing an image of Jesucristo as the "
"Ultimate Sacrifice as a pendant, his heart clearly visible through his chest. "
" Under his left hand is a raindrop, representing the Aeon Tláloc, and under "
"his right hand is a sun disc, representing the Aeon Huītzilōpōchtli."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inferno grenade"
msgid_plural "inferno grenades"
msgstr[0] "炼狱手雷"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "inferno grenade"
msgid ""
"This is an inferno grenade, designed to channel Netherum energy to increase "
"its incendiary power.  Once you throw it, you will have five seconds to get "
"away before it explodes into a raging firestorm."
msgstr "炼狱手雷，以异界能量引导出更强的燃烧效果。启动后五秒就会炸成暴烈的火风暴。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active inferno grenade"
msgid_plural "active inferno grenades"
msgstr[0] "激活的炼狱手雷"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "active inferno grenade"
msgid "This is an active inferno grenade.  Better throw it!"
msgstr "激活的炼狱手雷，快扔出去！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift inferno grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift inferno grenades"
msgstr[0] "自制炼狱手雷"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift inferno grenade"
msgid ""
"This is a post-apocalyptic recreation of an inferno grenade, less powerful "
"than a lab-made one but still very dangerous.  Once you throw it, you will "
"have five seconds to get away before it explodes into a raging firestorm."
msgstr ""
"这是一款末日后的炼狱手雷仿制品，威力虽不及实验室制造的那般强大，但依然十分危险。一旦投掷出去，你将有五秒钟的时间逃离，随后它便会爆炸，引发一场熊熊燃烧的火风"
"暴。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active makeshift inferno grenade"
msgid_plural "active makeshift inferno grenades"
msgstr[0] "自制炼狱手雷（激活）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "active makeshift inferno grenade"
msgid "This is an active makeshift inferno grenade.  Better throw it!"
msgstr "激活的自制炼狱手雷，快扔出去！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "null grenade"
msgid_plural "null grenades"
msgstr[0] "null grenades"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "null grenade"
msgid ""
"A strange grenade, designed like nothing you've seen before.  It's round, "
"with flat black crystalline panels like television screens on four sides, and "
"two buttons on either end.  On both of the buttons is a large Ψ, surrounded "
"by a circle with a line through it."
msgstr ""
"A strange grenade, designed like nothing you've seen before.  It's round, "
"with flat black crystalline panels like television screens on four sides, and "
"two buttons on either end.  On both of the buttons is a large Ψ, surrounded "
"by a circle with a line through it."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "null grenade"
msgid "Push buttons"
msgstr "Push buttons"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "null grenade"
msgid "You press the buttons on the sides of the null grenade."
msgstr "You press the buttons on the sides of the null grenade."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active null grenade"
msgid_plural "active null grenades"
msgstr[0] "active null grenades"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "active null grenade"
msgid ""
"This null grenade is activate and ready to unleash its pulse.  You'd better "
"throw it!"
msgstr ""
"This null grenade is activate and ready to unleash its pulse.  You'd better "
"throw it!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "active null grenade"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is already active, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "The %s is already active, try throwing it instead."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "expended null grenade"
msgid_plural "expended null grenades"
msgstr[0] "expended null grenades"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "expended null grenade"
msgid ""
"A strange grenade, designed like nothing you've seen before.  It's round, "
"with flat black crystalline panels like television screens on four sides, and "
"two buttons on either end.  On both of the buttons is a large Ψ, surrounded "
"by a circle with a line through it.  The buttons on either end are depressed."
msgstr ""
"A strange grenade, designed like nothing you've seen before.  It's round, "
"with flat black crystalline panels like television screens on four sides, and "
"two buttons on either end.  On both of the buttons is a large Ψ, surrounded "
"by a circle with a line through it.  The buttons on either end are depressed."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pyrokinetic matrix crystal bomb"
msgid_plural "pyrokinetic matrix crystal bombs"
msgstr[0] "焰动矩阵晶体炸弹"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "pyrokinetic matrix crystal bomb"
msgid ""
"A matrix crystal attuned to pyrokinesis.  This one has a (currently) stable "
"loop of energy set up within it.  It would take only a thought to destabilize "
"the energy loop and set up a reaction that would lead to a massive explosion."
msgstr "一块与焰动灵能相协调的矩阵晶体。这块晶体内部目前有一个稳定的能量循环。只需一个念头就能破坏这个能量循环，引发一场巨大的爆炸。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pyrokinetic matrix crystal bomb"
msgid "Overcharge the crystal"
msgstr "过充能"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pyrokinetic matrix crystal bomb"
msgid "With a thought, you destabilize the matrix crystal."
msgstr "随着一个念头，你使矩阵晶体失去稳定。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "destabilized pyrokinetic matrix crystal bomb"
msgid_plural "destabilized pyrokinetic matrix crystal bombs"
msgstr[0] "焰动矩阵晶体炸弹（失稳）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "destabilized pyrokinetic matrix crystal bomb"
msgid ""
"A matrix crystal attuned to pyrokinesis.  The faint light in its depths is "
"growing brighter and brighter, and the crystal itself is heating up as you "
"hold it."
msgstr "一块与焰动灵能相协调的矩阵晶体。其内部微弱的光芒正变得越来越亮，而当你握住它时，晶体本身也在逐渐升温。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "destabilized pyrokinetic matrix crystal
#. bomb"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is already destabilized, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "%s已经失去了稳定，你应该把它丢出去。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "LV429 Pulse Rifle"
msgid_plural "LV429 Pulse Rifles"
msgstr[0] "LV429脉冲步枪"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of gun "LV429 Pulse Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "LV429 Pulse Rifle"
msgid ""
"The LV429 fires a series of extremely short high-energy laser pulses, more "
"like bullets than a traditional laser beam, greatly reducing dwell time and "
"increasing weapon effectiveness.  Matrix crystal technology has made the "
"weapon compact enough to be man-portable and provided it with enough power "
"for essentially unlimited combat operations, but heat dissipation is still a "
"problem, preventing it from being fired more than once every few seconds."
msgstr ""
"LV429 "
"发射一系列极短的高能激光脉冲，相对传统的连续波激光，极大减少滞留时间、提高武器效能。矩阵晶体技术使该武器紧凑得可以随身携带，且基本，但散热仍然是一个问题，让"
"它必须冷却几秒才能再次射击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "LV429-P Pulse Rifle"
msgid_plural "LV429-P Pulse Rifles"
msgstr[0] "LV429-P 脉冲步枪"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of gun "LV429-P Pulse Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "LV429-P Pulse Rifle"
msgid ""
"The LV429 fires a series of extremely short high-energy laser pulses, more "
"like bullets than a traditional laser beam, greatly reducing dwell time and "
"increasing weapon effectiveness.  Matrix crystal technology has made the "
"weapon compact enough to be man-portable and provided it with enough power "
"for essentially unlimited operation.  This is a prototype, obvious from the "
"bright red coloration of the barrel and grip, as well as the word "
"\"prototype\" written in large letters on the stock and the flammable symbol "
"next to it."
msgstr ""
"LV429"
"发射一系列极短的高能激光脉冲，比传统的激光束更像子弹，极大地缩短了停留时间，提高了武器效率。矩阵水晶技术使武器足够紧凑，便于携带，并为其提供了足够的电力，基"
"本上可以进行无限的操作。这是一个原型，从枪管和把手的鲜红色，以及用大字写在股票上的原型和旁边的易燃符号上可以明显看出。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shield belt"
msgid_plural "shield belts"
msgstr[0] "护盾腰带"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ Description of "shield belt"
msgid ""
"A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The "
"box has a toggleable switch and a stylized shield with Ψ and the XEDRA logo "
"inside it."
msgstr "简单的化纤腰带，右边挂着一个盒。盒上有个开关，还有一个盾牌徽记，内有Ψ字样和XEDRA标志。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "shield belt"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "suppression belt"
msgid "You flip the switch on the box and a red LED lights up."
msgstr "你拨动盒子上的开关，红色LED亮起。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shield belt (active)"
msgid_plural "shield belts (active)"
msgstr[0] "护盾腰带（激活）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "shield belt (active)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "suppression belt (active)"
msgid "You flip the switch on the box and the red LED turns off."
msgstr "你拨动盒子上的开关，红色LED熄灭。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ Description of "shield belt"
msgid ""
"A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The "
"box has a toggleable switch and a stylized shield with Ψ and the XEDRA logo "
"inside it.  It also has a large crack across it and rattles when moved."
msgstr "简单的化纤腰带，右边挂着一个盒。盒上有个开关，还有一个盾牌徽记，内有Ψ字样和XEDRA标志。盒上有一条大裂缝，移动时会发出响声。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "shield belt"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "suppression belt"
msgid "You flip the switch on the box, but nothing happens."
msgstr "你拨动盒子上的开关，但什么也没发生。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "suppression belt"
msgid_plural "suppression belts"
msgstr[0] "抑制腰带"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ Description of "suppression belt"
msgid ""
"A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The "
"box has a toggleable switch and a stylized flame with a large circle and line "
"superimposed over it and a Ψ behind the XEDRA logo inside it."
msgstr "简单的化纤腰带，右边挂着一个盒。盒上有个开关，还有一个上有圆圈和斜线的火焰徽记，徽记里是背后有Ψ字样的XEDRA标志。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "suppression belt (active)"
msgid_plural "suppression belts (active)"
msgstr[0] "抑制腰带（激活）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/belt.json
#. ~ Description of "suppression belt"
msgid ""
"A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The "
"box has a toggleable switch and a stylized flame with a large circle and line "
"superimposed over it and a Ψ behind the XEDRA logo inside it.  It also has a "
"large crack across it and rattles when moved."
msgstr "简单的化纤腰带，右边挂着一个盒。盒上有个开关，还有一个上有圆圈和斜线的火焰徽记，徽记里是背后有Ψ字样的XEDRA标志。盒上有一条大裂缝，移动时会发出响声。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ONYX LIGHTNING combat blouse"
msgid_plural "ONYX LIGHTNING combat blouses"
msgstr[0] "ONYX LIGHTNING combat blouses"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "ONYX LIGHTNING combat blouse"
msgid ""
"A sleek blouse in a camouflage pattern with angled breast pockets and lots of "
"loop velcro for affixing patches.  You might call it a jacket but it's really "
"a blouse.  It bears an onyx patch reading \"ONYX LIGHTNING\"."
msgstr ""
"A sleek blouse in a camouflage pattern with angled breast pockets and lots of "
"loop velcro for affixing patches.  You might call it a jacket but it's really "
"a blouse.  It bears an onyx patch reading \"ONYX LIGHTNING\"."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/head.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "anchoring crown"
msgid_plural "anchoring crowns"
msgstr[0] "相位锚冠"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/head.json
#. ~ Description of "anchoring crown"
msgid ""
"A thin steel circlet studded with chunks of matrix crystal.  Your skin "
"prickles slightly where the crown touches it."
msgstr "一个镶嵌着矩阵晶体块的细细的钢制头环。在相位锚冠接触处的皮肤会轻微刺痛。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/head.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "telepathic dampener"
msgid_plural "telepathic dampeners"
msgstr[0] "心灵减震器"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/head.json
#. ~ Description of "telepathic dampener"
msgid ""
"A steel skullcap with a matrix crystal at its crown.  It looks ridiculous, "
"but the documents you read said it would protect you from telepathic attack."
msgstr "一顶钢制无边便帽，顶部镶嵌了一颗矩阵水晶。虽然听起来很荒诞，但你读到的文件说它可以保护你免受心灵攻击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/head.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses"
msgid_plural "sets of QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses"
msgstr[0] "sets of QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/head.json
#. ~ Description of "QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses"
msgid ""
"A set of AR-looking glasses.  The code \"QD944-P\" is printed in small "
"letters on the temples."
msgstr "一套 AR 眼镜。 镜腿上用小字印着代码 “QD944-P”。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/head.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses (on)"
msgid_plural "sets of QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses (on)"
msgstr[0] "sets of QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses (on)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/armor/head.json
#. ~ Description of "QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses (on)"
msgid ""
"A set of AR-looking glasses.  The code \"QD944-P\" is printed in small "
"letters on the temples.  They are currently active."
msgstr ""
"A set of AR-looking glasses.  The code \"QD944-P\" is printed in small "
"letters on the temples.  They are currently active."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/crafting_tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "matrix channeling array"
msgid_plural "matrix channeling arrays"
msgstr[0] "矩阵引导阵列"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/crafting_tools.json
#. ~ Description of "matrix channeling array"
msgid ""
"A set of matrix crystals arranged together to direct Netherium energy.  "
"You're not entirely sure all the crystals are actually touching the metal "
"assembly soldered around them."
msgstr "一组排列在一起的矩阵晶体，用来引导异界能量。你不确定这些晶体与焊接在它周围的金属组件的接触是否良好。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/crafting_tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crystalline focusing assembly"
msgid_plural "crystalline focusing assemblies"
msgstr[0] "晶体聚焦组件"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/crafting_tools.json
#. ~ Description of "crystalline focusing assembly"
msgid ""
"A precise arrangement of cut crystal pieces from the crystal outgrowths left "
"by the portal storms.  The air in the center shimmers like a summer heat gaze "
"when you look through the focal point of the apparatus."
msgstr "一片从空间风暴留下的水晶产物上精心切割下来的晶片。当你透过晶片焦点看过去时，那中间的空气就像夏日灼热的阳光一样闪闪发光。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/crafting_tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "telepathic focusing tool"
msgid_plural "telepathic focusing assemblies"
msgstr[0] "telepathic focusing assemblies"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/crafting_tools.json
#. ~ Description of "telepathic focusing tool"
msgid ""
"A glowing white netherium crystal surrounded by floating dust and shards of "
"crystal.  The closer you look at the assembly the louder your thoughts sound."
msgstr ""
"A glowing white netherium crystal surrounded by floating dust and shards of "
"crystal.  The closer you look at the assembly the louder your thoughts sound."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "everglow matrix flashlight (off)"
msgid_plural "everglow matrix flashlights (off)"
msgstr[0] "永光矩阵手电筒（关）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "everglow matrix flashlight (off)"
msgid ""
"A household flashlight enhanced with matrix technology.  It is slightly "
"dimmer but will last significantly longer."
msgstr "采用矩阵技术增强的家用手电筒。它稍微暗一些，但使用时间要长得多。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "everglow matrix flashlight (on)"
msgid_plural "everglow matrix flashlights (on)"
msgstr[0] "永光矩阵手电筒（开）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "everglow matrix lamp (covered)"
msgid_plural "everglow matrix lamps (covered)"
msgstr[0] "永光矩阵灯（盖上）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "everglow matrix lamp (covered)"
msgid ""
"Powered by matrix technology, this lamp will shed a bluish light for far "
"longer than a standard battery-powered lamp.  Activate to open the lid."
msgstr ""
"Powered by matrix technology, this lamp will shed a bluish light for far "
"longer than a standard battery-powered lamp.  Activate to open the lid."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "everglow matrix lamp
#. (covered)"
msgid "The lamp's batteries are dead."
msgstr "灯的电池没电了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "everglow matrix lamp (uncovered)"
msgid_plural "everglow matrix lamps (uncovered)"
msgstr[0] "永光矩阵灯（展开）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "everglow matrix lamp (uncovered)"
msgid ""
"Powered by matrix technology, this lamp will shed a reddish light for far "
"longer than a standard battery-powered lamp.  Activate to close the lid."
msgstr "这个灯采用矩阵技术供电，散发出偏红的光芒，寿命比普通电池供电的灯要长得多。激活它以关闭灯罩。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected standing matrix lamp"
msgid_plural "disconnected standing matrix lamps"
msgstr[0] "矩阵立灯（未连接）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected standing matrix lamp"
msgid ""
"A tall floor lamp that provides illumination when plugged into a power "
"outlet.  This lamp is enhanced with matrix technology, making it far more "
"power efficient."
msgstr ""
"A tall floor lamp that provides illumination when plugged into a power "
"outlet.  This lamp is enhanced with matrix technology, making it far more "
"power efficient."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/nether_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "compressed chaos"
msgid_plural "compressed chaos"
msgstr[0] "压缩浑沌"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/nether_items.json
#. ~ Description of "compressed chaos"
msgid ""
"This defies easy description, it feels solid but the surface is yielding.  "
"Looking at it you are reminded of the electric tingle in the air before a "
"portal storm."
msgstr "这很难用简单的语言来描述，它摸上去感觉很结实，但表面却很柔软。看着它，你会想起空间风暴发生前空气中的电刺感。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/nether_items.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "compressed chaos"
msgid "Seems like chaos in solid form."
msgstr "看起来像是固体形式的浑沌。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/pseudo.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nether crystal outcropping"
msgid_plural "nether crystal outcroppings"
msgstr[0] "外露的异界晶体"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/pseudo.json
#. ~ Description of "nether crystal outcropping"
msgid ""
"This is the pseudo-tool provided by having a nearby cluster of black nether "
"crystal.  You shouldn't see this as an individual item."
msgstr "这是由附近的黑色异界晶体提供的伪工具。如果你以物品形式看到这个，说明游戏出bug了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/pseudo.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active noetic resonance detector"
msgid_plural "active noetic resonance detectors"
msgstr[0] "active noetic resonance detectors"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/pseudo.json
#. ~ Description of "active noetic resonance detector"
msgid ""
"This is the pseudo-tool provided by having a nearby active noetic resonance "
"detector.  You shouldn't see this as an individual item."
msgstr ""
"This is the pseudo-tool provided by having a nearby active noetic resonance "
"detector.  You shouldn't see this as an individual item."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "transporter beacon"
msgid_plural "transporter beacons"
msgstr[0] "传送信标"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ Description of "transporter beacon"
msgid ""
"A pyramidal object with a matrix crystal on top, surrounded by several chunks "
"of the otherworldly boulders you've found dotting the landscape.  You could "
"place it somewhere and after you've configured it, use a transporter remote "
"to teleport yourself to its location."
msgstr ""
"一个金字塔形的物体，顶部有一个矩阵晶体，周围环绕着几块你找来的散落在野外的异界石块。你可以把它放在某处，在你配置完成后，使用传送终端把自己传送到它所在的位置"
"。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "transporter remote"
msgid_plural "transporter remotes"
msgstr[0] "传送终端"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ Description of "transporter remote"
msgid ""
"A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix "
"channeling array is stick out of the side like an antenna.  There is a small "
"screen on the front, currently off."
msgstr "一台四四方方的设备，就像是老式功能手机和收音机的混合体。一个矩阵引导阵列像天线一样从侧面伸出。正面有块小屏幕，目前处于关闭状态。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "transporter remote"
msgid ""
"You turn the transporter remote on and the screen begins displaying "
"coordinates."
msgstr "你打开传送终端，屏幕上开始出现一排坐标。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "transporter remote"
msgid "The transporter remote's batteries need more charge."
msgstr "传送终端没电了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "transporter remote (searching)"
msgid_plural "transporter remote (searching)"
msgstr[0] "传送终端（扫描中）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ Description of "transporter remote (searching)"
msgid ""
"A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix "
"channeling array is sticking out of the side like an antenna.  There is a "
"small screen on the front, currently running what looks like a series of "
"mathematical calculations."
msgstr "一台四四方方的设备，就像是老式功能手机和收音机的混合体。一个矩阵引导阵列像天线一样从侧面伸出。正面有块小屏幕，目前正在进行一系列数学计算。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "transporter remote (searching)"
msgid "You turn the transporter remote off."
msgstr "你关闭了传送终端。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "transporter remote (searching)"
msgid ""
"Begin the transportation process.  It will take several minutes for the "
"remote to zero in on the beacon location."
msgstr "启动传送进程。终端需要几分钟才能锁定信标的位置。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "transporter remote (searching)"
msgid "Activate the remote"
msgstr "启动终端"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "transporter remote (burned out)"
msgid_plural "transporter remote (burned out)"
msgstr[0] "传送终端（烧毁）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/tools/travel.json
#. ~ Description of "transporter remote (burned out)"
msgid ""
"A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix "
"channeling array was sticking out of the side like an antenna, but it's now "
"cracked and probably useless.  There is a small screen on the front, "
"obviously burned out.  Parts of the plastic casing are warped as though the "
"plastic had frozen and cracked."
msgstr ""
"一台四四方方的设备，就像是老式功能手机和收音机的混合体。一个矩阵引导阵列像天线一样从侧面伸出。正面有块小屏幕，很明显烧焦了。一部分塑料外壳扭曲变形了，就好像"
"塑料被冻裂了一样。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mapgen/microlab_rooms.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mapgen/nested/skyscraper_lab_modular.json
#. ~ Computer name placed on map
msgid "Project OBSIDIAN RING access"
msgstr "“黑曜石环”计划权限"

