#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Clear-Minded Channeling"
msgstr "清明引导"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Clear-Minded Channeling"
msgid ""
"This \"psychic powers\" stuff is easy, as long as nothing distracts you.  "
"When you are concentrating on 0 powers, or have 0 pain, you have an easier "
"time invoking your powers."
msgstr ""
"This \"psychic powers\" stuff is easy, as long as nothing distracts you.  "
"When you are concentrating on 0 powers, or have 0 pain, you have an easier "
"time invoking your powers."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Concussive Blasts"
msgstr "震荡爆发"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Concussive Blasts"
msgid ""
"Your telekinetic attacks really hammer into your target.  Damaging "
"telekinetic powers have a much higher chance to stagger or knock down your "
"targets."
msgstr "你的念动攻击像真实的锤子一样重击在你的目标上。伤害性念动灵能有更高的几率使目标踉跄或倒地。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Efficient Slumber"
msgstr "高效睡眠"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Efficient Slumber"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some part of your Metabolic Hyperefficiency is running even when you sleep, "
"or perhaps your wakeful meditations have made the process of sleeping more "
"efficient.  You can stay awake for 20% longer, and sleep is 20% more "
"restorative."
msgstr "即使当你睡着了，灵能“高效代谢”的某些部分也还在运转，或者你清醒时的冥想使睡眠过程更加高效。你保持清醒的时间延长20%，睡眠的恢复能力也提高了20%。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grace Under Pain"
msgstr "痛中优雅"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grace Under Pain"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Happy.  In Your Lane.  Focused.  Flourishing.  Your Intelligence is only "
"penalized 66% of the normal amount from pain, and 33% of normal if you're "
"using the Biokinetic power Overcome Pain, the Electrokinetic power Pain "
"Suppression, or the Telepathic power Mood Stabilization."
msgstr ""
"想点高兴的。坚持下去。集中注意。保持心盛。疼痛只会对智力造成正常情况下 66% "
"的惩罚，而当你使用炼体者灵能“消除疼痛”，驱电者灵能“疼痛抑制”，或传心者灵能“稳定情绪”后，则只会对智力造成正常情况下 33% 的惩罚。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/in_the_zone.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_in_the_zone"
msgid "In the Zone"
msgstr "进入心流状态"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "In the Zone"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you get going you just keep rolling.  Your next use of a psionic power "
"within five seconds of channeling one has its stamina cost reduced by 25%."
msgstr "只要你踏出一步，就可以顺势前进。在你引导灵能后五秒内，你下次使用灵能时所消耗的耐力降低 25%。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mastery of Form"
msgstr "掌握躯体"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mastery of Form"
msgid ""
"Your control of your own body has given you control of your own genetics, "
"albeit a subconscious one.  You will be less likely to suffer from negative "
"mutations when taking mutagen."
msgstr "你对自己身体的控制使你能够控制自己的基因，尽管是潜意识的控制。 在服用诱变剂时，你将更少出现负面变异。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wary Sleeper"
msgstr "Wary Sleeper"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wary Sleeper"
msgid ""
"Your Premonition ability has developed to such a level that you can sense "
"movement around you even when you sleep."
msgstr ""
"Your Premonition ability has developed to such a level that you can sense "
"movement around you even when you sleep."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Bright"
msgstr "Burning Bright"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Bright"
msgid ""
"Nether energy easily flows through you, causing your power to rise and fall "
"far faster than normal.  You gain far more Nether Attunement from channeling "
"or maintaining your powers, but you lose your Nether Attunement much faster "
"as well.  You do not lose Nether Attunement at this accelerated rate while "
"maintaining any powers."
msgstr ""
"Nether energy easily flows through you, causing your power to rise and fall "
"far faster than normal.  You gain far more Nether Attunement from channeling "
"or maintaining your powers, but you lose your Nether Attunement much faster "
"as well.  You do not lose Nether Attunement at this accelerated rate while "
"maintaining any powers."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Phoenix Rising"
msgstr "Phoenix Rising"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Phoenix Rising"
msgid ""
"Only the phoenix rises and does not descend, but you're going try your "
"hardest.  The stamina cost of your powers is reduced beginning at Nether "
"Attunement level 8, reaching 1/3rd of normal by Nether Attunement level 12."
msgstr ""
"Only the phoenix rises and does not descend, but you're going try your "
"hardest.  The stamina cost of your powers is reduced beginning at Nether "
"Attunement level 8, reaching 1/3rd of normal by Nether Attunement level 12."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/in_the_zone.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "In the Zone"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You are one with the Nether and the Nether is with you.  The stamina cost of "
"channeling your next power is reduced by 25%."
msgstr ""
"You are one with the Nether and the Nether is with you.  The stamina cost of "
"channeling your next power is reduced by 25%."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monsters.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_feral_human_telekin_dm"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral PKer"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral mindhand"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstoppable force"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at %3$s and %3$s is lifted up and pulled towards them!"
msgstr "%1$s 紧盯着 %3$s ，随后 %3$s 被凭空举起，拉了过去！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monsters.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mon_feral_human_telekin_dm"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral PKer"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s makes a throwing motion and one of the rocks around them suddenly "
"launches like a bullet!"
msgstr "%1$s 做出一个投掷动作，环绕周围的一块石头突然像子弹般射出！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/defense_mode/premonition_instances.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_WAVE_CONTROL_PREMENITION"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_WAVE_CONTROL"
msgid ""
"You feel a multitude of foes coming for you, bleary-eyed and full of "
"bloodlust.  Steel yourself, for the horde is coming."
msgstr "你感到一大群敌人向你走来，它们步履蹒跚，充满了杀戮的欲望。打起精神来，因为尸潮要来了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/defense_mode/premonition_instances.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEFENSE_MODE_RANDOM_NPC_ROBBER"
msgid ""
"You feel greedy, insidious eyes watching you and rapidly getting closer.  "
"Someone has it out for your stuff."
msgstr "你感到贪婪狡诈的目光注视着你，并迅速靠近。有人想抢你的东西。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/defense_mode/premonition_instances.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEFENSE_MODE_BANDIT_ATTACK"
msgid ""
"You feel a multitude of hostile eyes watching you and rapidly getting closer. "
" The masses have it in for you."
msgstr "你感到许多贪婪狡诈的目光注视着你，并迅速靠近。有人想抢你的东西。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/defense_mode/scenarios.json
#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_phavian_office"
msgid "Office?"
msgstr "办公室？"

