"its features seem to be becoming more reptilian, it doesn't appear dangerous. "
" However, it looks at you like it understands you in some way."
msgstr "这只长相奇特的怪鸟的名字源于它奇怪的外观。虽然它的外表似乎变得更接近于爬行动物，但看起来并不是那么危险。然而它正盯着你，好像在某种程度上知道你的想法。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "cockatrice"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares and lets out a silent cry!"
msgstr "%1$s紧紧凝视着，发出沉默的叫声！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strange chick"
msgid_plural "strange chicks"
msgstr[0] "奇異雛鳥"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strange chick"
msgid ""
"A strange tiny chick, it could be from a number of different species if it "
"weren't for the patches of scales between its feathers."
msgstr ""
"A strange tiny chick, it could be from a number of different species if it "
"weren't for the patches of scales between its feathers."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pigeon passenger"
msgid_plural "pigeon passengers"
msgstr[0] "旅鸽"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pigeon passenger"
msgid ""
"A gentle, plump, small-billed bird with a third eye, between its bill and "
"forehead.  On the ground, it struts about with a characteristic bobbing of "
"the head.  It is a strong, swift flier thanks to its long wings and powerful "
"flight muscles.  Is it following you?"
msgstr ""
"一只圆润优雅的小喙鸟类，在喙和额之间长着第三只眼。在地上时，它昂首阔步地走着，头不停地前后摇晃。由于具有较长的翼和强大的飞行肌群，它们能够长时间灵活飞行，它"
"在跟着你吗？"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pigeon passenger"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$'s third eye opens and it coos!"
msgstr "旅鸽的第三只眼睛睁开了，发出咕咕声！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_pigeon_passenger_chick"
msgid ""
"A tiny darkly-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species "
"if it weren't for the third eye below the center of its forehead."
msgstr ""
"A tiny darkly-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species "
"if it weren't for the third eye below the center of its forehead."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gremlin"
msgid_plural "gremlins"
msgstr[0] "狐精"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gremlin"
msgid ""
"The red fox, an omnivorous canine and largest of the true foxes, it is a wily "
"hunter with a combative, suspicious temperament.  Sparks occasionally crackle "
"over its fur and its body distorts oddly as it moves, covering more ground "
"with each stride than the length of its legs would indicate."
msgstr "一只赤狐，狐狸中体型最大的一种，性格狡猾多疑且十分凶猛。它的皮毛上偶尔会迸发出火花，移动时身形会发生奇怪的扭曲，每一步在地上跨出的距离都比它的腿还要长。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "gremlin"
#, c-format
msgid "Sparks flicker over %1$s's fur."
msgstr "Sparks flicker over %1$s's fur."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "direhound"
msgid_plural "direhounds"
msgstr[0] "骇人恶犬"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "direhound"
msgid ""
"This large canid has grown to terrifying proportions, roughly three times the "
"size of some of its brethren.  Its teeth give steak knives a run for their "
"money, and it looks to be the social center of any surrounding dogs."
msgstr ""
"This large canid has grown to terrifying proportions, roughly three times the "
"size of some of its brethren.  Its teeth give steak knives a run for their "
"money, and it looks to be the social center of any surrounding dogs."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "direhound"
msgid "The direhound gazes upon its allies, and lets out a howl!"
msgstr "冰原猎犬注视着它的盟友，发出一声嚎叫！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hellhound"
msgid_plural "hellhounds"
msgstr[0] "地狱犬"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hellhound"
msgid ""
"This once-average Labrador mixed-breed dog has clearly gone feral.  Though it "
"likely still instinctively trusts humans, it's probably far from domestic by "
"now.  The air around it wavers like the haze over summer asphalt."
msgstr "这只普通的混血拉布拉多犬已经明显发狂了。尽管它的本能让它依旧信任人类，但比起原先驯服的宠物要差得远了。它周围的空气像夏日柏油路上的热气一样微微摇曳。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hellhound"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s barks out a stream of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s barks out a stream of flame!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hellpup"
msgid_plural "hellpups"
msgstr[0] "hellpups"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hellpup"
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog.  Its breath is very hot."
msgstr ""
"An adorable, defenseless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog.  Its breath is very hot."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_devourer_lab_sec"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral slider"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s glances at %3$s and the world lurches."
msgstr "%1$s看向%3$s，四周的世界突然颠倒！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_devourer_lab_sec"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral slider"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid riftcaller"
#, c-format
msgid "The space around %1$s distorts."
msgstr "The space around %1$s distorts."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_devourer_lab_sec"
#, c-format
msgid "The air around %3$s wavers and shapes appear!"
msgstr "The air around %3$s wavers and shapes appear!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mathematician A57"
msgid_plural "mathematician A57s"
msgstr[0] "mathematician A57s"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mathematician A57"
msgid ""
"No one could mistake this person for a human; they move with astonishing "
"speed and grace, but every motion is precisely controlled.  As they catch "
"sight of you, a momentary grimace mars the perfection of their unnaturally "
"beautiful face, and as they move quickly toward you, they make a quick "
"gesture and some debris on the floor moves out of their way."
msgstr ""
"No one could mistake this person for a human; they move with astonishing "
"speed and grace, but every motion is precisely controlled.  As they catch "
"sight of you, a momentary grimace mars the perfection of their unnaturally "
"beautiful face, and as they move quickly toward you, they make a quick "
"gesture and some debris on the floor moves out of their way."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s with a pipe in a blur of motion!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s with a pipe in a blur of motion!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits <npcname>'s %2$s with a pipe in a blur of motion!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 hits <npcname>'s %2$s with a pipe in a blur of motion!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 tries to hit you, but you barely dodge!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 tries to hit you, but you barely dodge!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 tries to hit <npcname>, but they barely dodge!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 tries to hit <npcname>, but they barely dodge!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s without penetrating your armor."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s without penetrating your armor."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armor."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 hits <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armor."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
msgid "Mathematician A57's skin takes on a slightly waxen appearance."
msgstr "Mathematician A57's skin takes on a slightly waxen appearance."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
msgid "Mathematician A57 begins moving much more quickly."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 begins moving much more quickly."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 blurs as they explode into motion!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 blurs as they explode into motion!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Mathematician A57 stares at %3$s and %3$s is lifted up and pulled towards "
"them!"
msgstr ""
"Mathematician A57 stares at %3$s and %3$s is lifted up and pulled towards "
"them!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
msgid "The air around Mathematician A57Mathematician A57 wavers."
msgstr "The air around Mathematician A57Mathematician A57 wavers."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
msgid "The air around Mathematician A57 distorts."
msgstr "The air around Mathematician A57 distorts."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches you and wounds open on your flesh!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 touches you and wounds open on your flesh!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> and wounds open on their flesh!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> and wounds open on their flesh!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 tries to touch you, but you dodge!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 tries to touch you, but you dodge!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 tries to touch <npcname>, but they dodge!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 tries to touch <npcname>, but they dodge!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches you but only hits your armor."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 touches you but only hits your armor."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> but only hits their armor."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> but only hits their armor."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches you and you feel weaker!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 touches you and you feel weaker!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> and they flinch!"
msgstr "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> and they flinch!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
msgid ""
"Mathematician A57 closes their eyes and their wounds begin healing at a rapid "
"pace!"
msgstr ""
"Mathematician A57 closes their eyes and their wounds begin healing at a rapid "
"pace!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bellicose brawler"
msgid_plural "bellicose brawlers"
msgstr[0] "好战搏斗者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bellicose brawler"
msgid ""
"This bloodshot-eyed berserker hurls themselves at the zombie horde.  Despite "
"their crude technique, they are moving faster than you've ever seen a human "
"move, and some of their attacks send the zombies flying."
msgstr "这个眼睛充血的狂战士冲向尸群，虽然毫无技巧，但行动速度比你见过的任何人都要快，而且攻击偶尔还能击飞丧尸。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "agitated augur"
msgid_plural "agitated augurs"
msgstr[0] "癫狂预言者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "agitated augur"
msgid ""
"This individual looks wildly all around them, constantly muttering to "
"themselves the entire time."
msgstr "这个人疯狂地环顾四周，一直在自言自语。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "voltaic vigilante"
msgid_plural "voltaic vigilantes"
msgstr[0] "放电义勇军"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "voltaic vigilante"
msgid ""
"This person's skin occasionally crackles with lightning.  Their eyes have an "
"eerie blue glow and sparks drip from their hands as they hurl themselves at "
"the zombie hordes."
msgstr "这个人的皮肤偶尔会有闪电噼啪作响。眼睛中有种怪异的蓝色光芒，当他冲向尸群，手上会不断冒出电火花。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "voltaic vigilante"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s unleashes a burst of sparks!"
msgstr "%1$s释放出一道火花！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "miserable magician"
msgid_plural "miserable magicians"
msgstr[0] "可怜魔术师"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "miserable magician"
msgid ""
"This person seems to be afraid of his own illusionary tricks, not being used "
"to his 'magic' actually working.  He doesn't seem to be able to control it "
"very well, or willfully."
msgstr "这个人似乎害怕他自己的幻术戏法，不习惯自己的“魔术”真的起效。他似乎无法控制住自己，至少不是存心如此。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "miserable magician"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiant"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s fires a photon beam!"
msgstr "%1$s射出一道光束！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "furious firestarter"
msgid_plural "furious firestarters"
msgstr[0] "狂怒点火者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "furious firestarter"
msgid ""
"The air around this person wavers slightly like summer heat, and flames "
"occasionally flicker around their upraised hand.  There is a focused look in "
"their eyes, and they seem to think they can kill every zombie in sight with "
"their powers."
msgstr "这个人周围的空气像炎炎夏日一样微微波动，火焰偶尔在高举的双手上闪烁。他的眼神很专注，似乎认为可以用自己新获得的力量杀死看到的每只丧尸。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "furious firestarter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s summons a blast of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s召唤出一道火焰！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "panic-stricken psychokinetic"
msgid_plural "panic-stricken psychokinetics"
msgstr[0] "恐慌念动者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "panic-stricken psychokinetic"
msgid ""
"They stare around at the monsters nearby, occasionally making throwing "
"motions with their hands.  Sometimes, when they make a throwing motion, one "
"of the zombies is hurled through the air."
msgstr "他紧紧盯着附近的怪物，时不时的用手比划出投掷的动作。有些时候，当他做出动作时，某一只丧尸就会被扔到空中。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "manic mutterer"
msgid_plural "manic mutterers"
msgstr[0] "躁狂呢喃者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "manic mutterer"
msgid ""
"Holding their head in their hands, they barely seem aware of the world around "
"them, but they still try to escape the zombies.  Looking at them, you feel an "
"eerie sensation like fingers scratching at your mind."
msgstr "他双手抱着头，似乎几乎没有意识到周围的一切，但他们仍然试图逃离丧尸。当你看见他时，你会有种被人用手指抓挠大脑的奇怪感觉。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jittery jumper"
msgid_plural "jittery jumpers"
msgstr[0] "抖动跃迁者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jittery jumper"
msgid ""
"This person looks vacantly around them with a blank expression on their face. "
" Then, in an instant, they are gone."
msgstr "这个人茫然地环顾四周，脸上不带任何表情。然后一转眼，他就消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "jittery jumper"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s suddenly vanishes!"
msgstr "%1$s突然消失了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "confused curer"
msgid_plural "confused curers"
msgstr[0] "困惑疗愈者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "confused curer"
msgid ""
"This person mutters to themselves, glancing to and fro with bloodshot eyes.  "
"They seem remarkably unscathed for someone in the midst of the apocalypse."
msgstr "这个人喃喃自语，用布满血丝的眼睛来回扫视。 对于身处世界末日的人来说，他们似乎毫发无损。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/death_effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Message of spell "teleport_summon_monster ( [Ψ]Breach Monster )"
#. ~ Message of spell "teleport_summon ( [Ψ]Breach )"
msgid "The air nearby fractures and something comes through!"
msgstr "附近的空气破裂了，有东西进来了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Dr. Brain"
msgid_plural "Dr. Brains"
msgstr[0] "脑博士"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Dr. Brain"
msgid ""
"An ordinary-looking scientist lost amid the carnage, were it not for the "
"bloodshot eyes, the enlarged cranium, and the fact that the zombies ignore "
"them.  Bits of paper and chemistry equipment lazily float in the air near "
"them."
msgstr "迷失在尸山血海中的科学家，看起来很正常，只是两眼通红、头颅膨大，还不被丧尸攻击。纸屑和化学用具慵懒地漂浮在它身旁。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Dr. Brain"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral esper"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral brainburner"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go mindrender"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#, c-format
msgid "A roar fills %3$s's mind and the world is blotted out!"
msgstr "一声怒吼充斥着%3$s的头脑，世界也变得模糊起来！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Dr. Brain"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral esper"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral brainburner"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at %3$s!"
msgstr "%1$s注视着%3$s！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and your %2$s is hammered with psionic force!"
msgstr "%1$s紧盯着你，你的%2$s被灵能重击！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at <npcname> and their %2$s is hammered with psionic force!"
msgstr "%1$s紧盯着<npcname>，%2$s被灵能重击！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and you narrowly avoid an unseen attack!"
msgstr "%1$s紧盯着你，你侥幸躲过了一次无形的攻击！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares and <npcname> narrowly avoids an unseen attack!"
msgstr "%1$s紧盯着，<npcname>侥幸躲过了一次无形的攻击！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you, but the telekinetic attack rebounds off your armor."
msgstr "%1$s紧盯着你，但心灵攻击被护甲弹开了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at <npcname>, but the telekinetic attack rebounds off their armor."
msgstr "%1$s紧盯着<npcname>，但心灵攻击被护甲弹开了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Dr. Brain"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral PKer"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral mindhand"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstoppable force"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#, c-format
msgid "The air around %1$s wavers."
msgstr "%1$s四周的空气微微波动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral security guard, Ψ Division"
msgid_plural "feral security guard, Ψ Divisions"
msgstr[0] "疯人警卫（Ψ部门）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral security guard, Ψ Division"
msgid ""
"A security guard gone feral, or so you thought.  As you look closer, you "
"notice the relatively-normal appearance, the clear eyes, and the patch on "
"their uniform with a Ψ shape in front of the logo of XEDRA.  The zombies "
"around them ignore them as they move smoothly and purposefully through the "
"ruins."
msgstr ""
"一个发疯的警卫，至少你是这么想的。仔细观察时，你注意到他相对正常的外表，清澈的眼睛，以及制服上的背后有Ψ字样的XEDRA标志图案。当他在废墟中平稳而有目的地"
"移动时，四周的丧尸似乎毫无反应。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral security captain, Ψ Division"
msgid_plural "feral security captain, Ψ Divisions"
msgstr[0] "疯人警长（Ψ部门）"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral security captain, Ψ Division"
msgid ""
"A feral security guard with a military-style uniform, bearing the XEDRA logo "
"and some kind of rank insignia.  Their movements are precise, controlled, and "
"inhumanly smooth, and while their eyes are still bloodshot, they have a spark "
"lacking in most ferals you've seen."
msgstr ""
"穿着军装式制服的发疯警卫，上面有XEDRA的标识和某种军衔肩章。他行动时动作精确、有控制，而且非常平稳，虽然眼睛仍然充满血丝，但有种你在其他疯人中从未见过的"
"智慧火花。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral adept"
msgid_plural "feral adepts"
msgstr[0] "疯人修士"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral adept"
msgid ""
"This feral human moves with a disturbing fluid grace.  Despite that, they "
"bear the same crazed expression as all the others."
msgstr "这个疯人以一种令人不安的流畅优雅行动。尽管如此，它的表情和其他疯人一样疯狂。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral dervish"
msgid_plural "feral dervishes"
msgstr[0] "疯人行僧"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral dervish"
msgid ""
"Despite their appearance, this creature moves too quickly and smoothly to be "
"truly human.  Bloodshot eyes are the only indicator that they are not some "
"kind of perfectly precise android."
msgstr "尽管外表相似，但这只生物移动得太快太平稳了，不可能是真正的人类。浑身上下只有充血的眼睛还能算是表明它不是某种精密完美的机器人的标志。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "human whirlwind"
msgid_plural "human whirlwinds"
msgstr[0] "疯人旋风"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "human whirlwind"
msgid ""
"With inhumanly precise movements, this feral moves toward you.  They are "
"clearly still alive, but their mouth is closed and their chest does not rise "
"or fall.  As you watch, they suddenly blur into rapid motion."
msgstr "这个疯人以非人的精确动作向你走来。它显然还活着，但嘴巴紧闭着，胸部也看不出呼吸起伏。它在你眼前动作飞快，模糊成一团幻影。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "human whirlwind"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go juggernaut"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s begins moving much more quickly."
msgstr "%1$s begins moving much more quickly."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s blurs as they explode into motion!"
msgstr "%1$s blurs as they explode into motion!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral seer"
msgid_plural "feral seers"
msgstr[0] "疯人先知"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral seer"
msgid ""
"This feral human completely lacks the crazed look most of their compatriots "
"have.  Instead, they fix their bloodshot eyes straight at you, seeming to "
"gaze right into your soul, and raise their weapon."
msgstr "这个疯人完全没有其他同类一般的疯狂表情。相反，它只是用布满血丝的眼睛直直地盯着你，似乎在凝视你的灵魂，并举起手中的武器。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral visionary"
msgid_plural "feral visionaries"
msgstr[0] "疯人透视者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral visionary"
msgid ""
"By the time you see this feral, they have already noticed you.  They stare "
"straight at you, regardless of obstruction or any obstacle in between, "
"clutching a weapon in one hand."
msgstr "当你看到这个疯人的时候，它早已经注意到你了。它直直地盯着你，不论中间是否有障碍，一只手中紧紧抓着武器。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral visionary"
msgid "The feral visionary throws a rock!"
msgstr "疯人透视者扔了一块石头！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pattern screamer"
msgid_plural "pattern screamers"
msgstr[0] "相啸魔"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pattern screamer"
msgid ""
"This feral's eyes are closed, but they move with no hesitation, effortlessly "
"avoiding all obstacles in their path, and clutching a large rock in one hand "
"and a long bit of debris in the other.  When you look at them, you hear a "
"static crackling, just on the threshold of inaudibility."
msgstr ""
"这个疯人双眼紧闭着，但它移动起来并不迟疑，毫不费力地避开了路上的所有障碍，一只手抓着一块大石头，另一只手抓着一长条建筑残骸。当你看着它时，你能听到一种静电的"
"噼啪声，若隐若现。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "pattern screamer"
msgid "With inhuman accuracy, the pattern screamer throws a rock!"
msgstr "相啸魔以超乎常人的精准扔了一块石头！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pattern screamer"
msgid "Static fills your hearing for a moment, blotting out all other sounds!"
msgstr "静电声充斥了你的双耳，掩盖了其他声音！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral sparker"
msgid_plural "feral sparkers"
msgstr[0] "疯人放电者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral sparker"
msgid ""
"This feral has the standard bloodshot eyes and erratic movements, but in "
"addition, some of their gestures unleash a shower of sparks.  They seem "
"totally unphased by the light or the crackling sounds."
msgstr "这个疯人除了常见的充血双眼和古怪动作之外，某些手势还会释放出一阵电火花。它似乎完全不受电火花强光和噼啪声的影响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral sparker"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dynamo"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's touches %3$s with a jolt!"
msgstr "%1$s 朝着 %3$s 射出一道电弧！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral dynamo"
msgid_plural "feral dynamos"
msgstr[0] "疯人发电者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral dynamo"
msgid ""
"Lightning crackles across this feral's skin, occasionally discharging into "
"the surrounding environment.  Their bloodshot eyes have an eerie blue glow."
msgstr "这个疯人的皮肤表面不断有闪电噼啪作响，偶尔会射向周围的环境。它布满血丝的眼睛发出诡异的蓝色光芒。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dynamo"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's unleashes a bolt of lightning!"
msgstr "%1$s射出一道闪电！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dynamo"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's waves a hand at %3$s and sparks crackle over their skin!"
msgstr "%1$s朝着%3$s摆摆手，火花在皮肤表面噼啪作响！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "avatar of the storm"
msgid_plural "avatar of the storms"
msgstr[0] "风暴化身"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "avatar of the storm"
msgid ""
"This feral is barely visible, their body constantly wreathed in bolts of "
"lightning.  A harsh actinic glow casts their surroundings into sharp relief "
"while leaving their own features concealed.  Crackling lightning "
"nearly-constantly explodes from their body and grounds itself nearby."
msgstr ""
"这个疯人几乎看不见，它的身体四周被闪电包围。强光使它们周围的环境变得清晰，而它自己的五官却被掩盖了。噼啪作响的闪电几乎不断地从它体内爆炸，并扎进附近的土地之"
"中。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's gestures and lighting crackles around them!"
msgstr "%1$s摆摆手，闪电在四周噼啪作响！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral radiant"
msgid_plural "feral radiants"
msgstr[0] "疯人辐光者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral radiant"
msgid ""
"This feral's skin has some sort of radiance.  Their eyes are bright with "
"light and there's a slight shimmer around their form."
msgstr "这个疯人的皮肤散发出某种光泽。它的眼睛闪烁着光芒，身体周围有一圈微光环绕。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiant"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's form is shifting with illusions!"
msgstr "%1$s的形体变幻出无数幻象！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiant"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's looks at you for a moment."
msgstr "%1$s's looks at you for a moment."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral beacon"
msgid_plural "feral beacons"
msgstr[0] "疯人灯塔"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral beacon"
msgid ""
"Almost blinding light radiates from this feral's skin.  They seem to have "
"greater control over their powers than most ferals, but they are still "
"clearly insane."
msgstr "足以致盲的强光从这个疯人的皮肤上放射出来。它似乎比大多数疯人更能控制自己的灵能力量，但显然还是疯了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s concentrates and unleashes a super-luminous flash!"
msgstr "%1$s聚精会神，射出一道无比明亮的闪光！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at %3$s and %3$s is enveloped in an eerie glow!"
msgstr "%1$s 紧盯着 %3$s ，随后 %3$s 被一团怪异的光芒所笼罩！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "atom splitter"
msgid_plural "atom splitters"
msgstr[0] "原子分裂者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "atom splitter"
msgid ""
"This feral glows brighter than streetlamp, casting their surroundings into "
"sharp relief amid the glow.  They are clearly still lucid but their "
"expression is blank and their eyes are unfocused."
msgstr "这个疯人的光芒比街灯还亮，让四周的环境在强光中照的一清二楚。它也许还保留着部分意识，但面无表情，双眼无神。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "atom splitter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s shrieks and unleashes a powerful blinding flash!"
msgstr "%1$s 尖叫并释放出强大的致盲闪光！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and you are enveloped in an eerie glow!"
msgstr "%1$s 紧盯着你，随后你被一团怪异的光芒所笼罩！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral burner"
msgid_plural "feral burners"
msgstr[0] "疯人燃烧者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral burner"
msgid ""
"This feral human looks a little more composed than most, but only a little.  "
"Their clothes are singed and the air around them shimmers like a summer heat "
"haze."
msgstr "这个疯人看起来比大多数疯人都更镇定，但也就多一点而已。它的衣服烧焦了，周围的空气像夏天的热雾一样微微颤动着。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and your %2$s is engulfed in flames!"
msgstr "%1$s 摆摆手，你的%2$s被一团火焰包裹！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and <npcname>'s %2$s is engulfed in flames!"
msgstr "%1$s 摆摆手，<npcname>的%2$s被一团火焰包裹！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and you narrowly avoid a burst of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s摆摆手，你侥幸躲过了火焰的攻击！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and <npcname> narrowly avoids a burst of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s摆摆手，<npcname>侥幸躲过了火焰的攻击！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and your %2$s is engulfed in flames, but they do not burn you."
msgstr "%1$s 摆摆手，你的%2$s被一团火焰包裹，但没能造成伤害！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s gestures and <npcname>'s %2$s is engulfed in flames, but it does not "
"burn them."
msgstr "%1$s 摆摆手，<npcname>的%2$s被一团火焰包裹，但没能造成伤害！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral burner"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral inferno"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unending conflagration"
#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_flash ( [Ψ]Brilliant Flash )"
msgid "The air erupts into an eye-searing flash!"
msgstr "空中爆发出一道灼眼的光芒！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral inferno"
msgid_plural "feral infernos"
msgstr[0] "疯人炼狱使"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral inferno"
msgid ""
"Through a cloud of smoke and fire, you can see a human form.  Their body is "
"barely visible through the flames."
msgstr "透过烟雾和火焰，你可以看到一个人形。它的身体在火焰中几乎看不见。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral inferno"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unending conflagration"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and summons a conflagration!"
msgstr "%1$s摆摆手，召唤出一场大火！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unending conflagration"
msgid_plural "unending conflagrations"
msgstr[0] "无尽燃火"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unending conflagration"
msgid ""
"Occasionally through the fire and smoke, you can see a human form.  Their "
"flesh blackens and withers in the heat, then the burns retreat and healthy "
"skin replaces it, over and over again."
msgstr "偶尔透过火和烟，你可以看到一个人形。它的皮肤在高温下变黑、枯萎，然后烧伤消退，健康的皮肤取而代之，周而复始。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "unending conflagration"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s screams and the flames around them burst outward!"
msgstr "%1$s尖叫，身体周围的火焰向外爆发！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral PKer"
msgid_plural "feral PKers"
msgstr[0] "疯人念动者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral PKer"
msgid ""
"Though they still have a maniacal expression, this feral human is "
"distinguished by the rocks floating in the around around them."
msgstr "虽然脸上也带着疯狂的表情，但这个疯人能以漂浮在周围的岩石和其他疯人区分。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "feral PKer"
#. ~ Death message of monster "feral mindhand"
#. ~ Death message of monster "unstoppable force"
#, c-format
msgid "As the %1$s dies, a wave of force explodes outward!"
msgstr "随着%1$s死亡，一道冲击波向外爆炸开！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral mindhand"
msgid_plural "feral mindhands"
msgstr[0] "疯人念动使"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral mindhand"
msgid ""
"This feral human moves quickly across uneven terrain and, when you look more "
"closely, you see that they are floating just above the ground.  The air "
"around them is distorted strangely, like looking through the surface of water."
msgstr ""
"This feral human moves quickly across uneven terrain and, when you look more "
"closely, you see that they are floating just above the ground.  The air "
"around them is distorted strangely, like looking through the surface of water."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unstoppable force"
msgid_plural "unstoppable forces"
msgstr[0] "unstoppable forces"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unstoppable force"
msgid ""
"Hovering half a meter off the ground, this feral human is surrounded by a "
"whirling cloud of rock, dust, splintered wood, and various household objects. "
" As they move, the ground occasionally shakes."
msgstr ""
"Hovering half a meter off the ground, this feral human is surrounded by a "
"whirling cloud of rock, dust, splintered wood, and various household objects. "
" As they move, the ground occasionally shakes."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstoppable force"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and the ground bursts apart!"
msgstr "%1$s gestures and the ground bursts apart!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstoppable force"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s closes their eyes and the ground shakes!"
msgstr "%1$s closes their eyes and the ground shakes!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral esper"
msgid_plural "feral espers"
msgstr[0] "疯人超感者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral esper"
msgid ""
"This feral human lacks the crazed look most of their kind have.  Instead, "
"their gaze is unfocused, as though listening to voices only they can hear."
msgstr "这个疯人缺少其他大多数同类所拥有的疯狂表情。相反，它的目光涣散，好像在聆听只有它才能听到的声音。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "feral esper"
#. ~ Death message of monster "feral brainburner"
#. ~ Death message of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#, c-format
msgid "As the %1$s dies, a scream fills your mind!"
msgstr "随着%1$s死亡，尖叫声充斥着你的脑海！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral brainburner"
msgid_plural "feral brainburners"
msgstr[0] "疯人灼脑者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral brainburner"
msgid ""
"Before you see them, you can feel it--a sensation like spiders crawling along "
"your brain.  As you shudder, this feral human looks at you and smiles "
"slightly."
msgstr "在你看到它之前，你可以感觉到它——是有无数蜘蛛沿着你的大脑爬行的感觉。当你颤抖时，这个疯人看向你，微微一笑。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "instiller of nightmares"
msgid_plural "instillers of nightmares"
msgstr[0] "梦魇诛心者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "instiller of nightmares"
msgid ""
"Just another feral, with the typical bloodshot eyes and intense expression.  "
"You have only a moment to think that before your heart starts racing in your "
"chest and the hair stands up on the back of your neck as every instinct "
"screams at you to run."
msgstr "又一个疯人，眼睛充血，表情紧绷。你只有片刻的时间来思考，然后你的心脏开始在胸膛里加速跳动，你的脖子汗毛竖立，因为每一项种本能都在尖叫着让你逃跑。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s eyes suddenly go wide!"
msgstr "%1$s眼睛突然睁大了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at %3$s and they freeze like a frightened rabbit!"
msgstr "%1$s紧盯着%3$s，让他像只受惊的兔子一样僵住了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral jumper"
msgid_plural "feral jumpers"
msgstr[0] "疯人跳跃者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral jumper"
msgid ""
"What was once empty air suddenly contains this feral human.  They have the "
"same crazed expression as their fellows, but their gaze is focused on more "
"distant locations.  A sturdy piece of debris from some ruin dangles from one "
"of their hands."
msgstr ""
"What was once empty air suddenly contains this feral human.  They have the "
"same crazed expression as their fellows, but their gaze is focused on more "
"distant locations.  A sturdy piece of debris from some ruin dangles from one "
"of their hands."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral jumper"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s looks at %3$s and the world lurches."
msgstr "%1$s看向%3$s，四周的世界突然颠倒！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "feral slider"
msgid_plural "feral sliders"
msgstr[0] "疯人滑跃者"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "feral slider"
msgid ""
"Every time you blink, this debris-wielding feral is in a different place.  "
"They are always in motion without actually crossing the intervening space."
msgstr ""
"Every time you blink, this debris-wielding feral is in a different place.  "
"They are always in motion without actually crossing the intervening space."

