msgstr "别动。*除去<npc_name>的季节性情绪失调*"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Actually, maybe now's not the best time."
msgstr "其实，也许现在不太合适。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Telepathy Check] What are you talking about?  This is mine."
msgstr "[心灵感应]你在说什么？这是我的。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Oh, I…I don't know what I was thinking.  I…sorry."
msgstr "哦，我……我不知道我在想什么。我……抱歉。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It is?  Oh, it…it is.  Right.  Right."
msgstr "是吗？哦，是……是的。对的。对的。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I…I thought that…never mind."
msgstr "我……我以为……算了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "But you…no, I thought…I just…"
msgstr "但是你……不，我以为……我只是……"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What?  But that's…we've had…how did you…"
msgstr "什么？可是……我们已经……你是怎么……"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*'s weapon flies out of his hands.\n"
"\n"
"\"<freaking> <name_b>!  You some kind of witch?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
