#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Mood Stablization Check] You don't want to hurt me."
msgstr "[稳定情绪]你不会想要伤害我的。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
