#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_physical_enhance"
msgid "[Ψ]Physical Enhancement (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]躯体强化(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_physical_enhance ( [Ψ]Physical Enhancement
#. (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can improve your strength and agility with your powers.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用灵能强化你的力量和敏捷。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_overcome_pain"
msgid "[Ψ]Overcome Pain (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]消除疼痛(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_overcome_pain ( [Ψ]Overcome Pain (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can lessen the impact of pain on your performance, though this has no "
"effect on the underlying injuries.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以抑制疼痛，但对应的损伤仍会存在。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_breathe_skin"
msgid "[Ψ]Oxygen Absorption (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]体表呼吸(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_breathe_skin ( [Ψ]Oxygen Absorption (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can make the entire surface of your skin selectively permeable, allowing "
"you to 'breathe' through it.  You can breathe in low-oxygen environments or "
"underwater, but are more vulnerable to toxic gas.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  Oxygen Absorption <color_red>cannot be active</color> "
"with Sealed System."
msgstr ""
"你可以使皮肤具有选择透过性，让其拥有“呼吸”的灵能。这让你能在水下或氧气含量低的地方呼吸，但也会因为毒气受到更多伤害。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。体表呼吸 与 封闭躯体灵能<color_red>不能共存</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_flexibility"
msgid "[Ψ]Flexibility"
msgstr "[Ψ]柔韧动作"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_flexibility ( [Ψ]Flexibility )"
msgid ""
"You can make your limbs move far beyond the normal human range of motion, "
"allowing you to twist out of others' grasp and reduce fall damage."
msgstr "你可以让你的四肢远远超出正常人类的运动范围，让你扭动身体，脱离别人的控制，减少摔倒造成的伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_flexibility ( [Ψ]Flexibility )"
msgid "You body begins twisting in unbelievable ways."
msgstr "你的肢体现在能以难以置信的方式运动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_dash"
msgid "[Ψ]Burst of Speed"
msgstr "[Ψ]速度爆发"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_dash ( [Ψ]Burst of Speed )"
msgid "Like a cheetah, you can run with incredible speed for a short distance."
msgstr "你可以在短时间内爆发出极快的速度，就像猎豹一样。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_change_appearance"
msgid "[Ψ]Flesh of Clay"
msgstr "[Ψ]易容"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_change_appearance ( [Ψ]Flesh of Clay )"
msgid ""
"You can reshape your physical appearance, changing hair, skin, or eye color.  "
"Your own mother wouldn't recognize you when you're done."
msgstr "你可以自由改变你的外观，改变头发、皮肤、眼睛颜色。没人能识破你的本来面目。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_change_appearance ( [Ψ]Flesh of Clay )"
msgid "You physical appearance shifts!"
msgstr "你的外貌开始改变！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_armor_skin"
msgid "[Ψ]Hardened Skin (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]硬化皮肤(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_armor_skin ( [Ψ]Hardened Skin (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can increase the strength of your skin, making it almost like armor while "
"still allowing you to move freely.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"You can increase the strength of your skin, making it almost like armor while "
"still allowing you to move freely.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_adrenaline"
msgid "[Ψ]Adrenaline Trigger"
msgstr "[Ψ]肾上腺素"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_adrenaline ( [Ψ]Adrenaline Trigger )"
msgid ""
"With a moment of concentration, you can trigger a surge of adrenaline.  This "
"provides a speed boost, albeit at a draining cost when the boost expires."
msgstr "只要专注片刻，你就能触发肾上腺素激增。这让你速度提升，尽管在激增期结束后需要承受精疲力竭的后果。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_adrenaline ( [Ψ]Adrenaline Trigger )"
msgid "Your heartbeat surges as your body floods with adrenaline."
msgstr "你心跳加速，肾上腺素充满你的身体。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_climate_control"
msgid "[Ψ]Temperature Adaptability (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]温度适应(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_climate_control ( [Ψ]Temperature
#. Adaptability (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can increase the heat dissipation and retention of your body, allowing "
"you to function in a much wider range of temperatures.  Temperature "
"Adaptability and Sealed System <color_red>will cancel each other</color>.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以控制身体热量的去留，使你能够适应更宽的温度范围。温度适性和封闭躯体<color_red>会相互抵消</color>。\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_enhance_mobility"
msgid "[Ψ]Enhance Mobility (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]轻装上阵(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_enhance_mobility ( [Ψ]Enhance Mobility (C)
#. )"
msgid ""
"Increase your range of motion and flexibility such that you can move more "
"easily even in encumbering gear.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"增加你的灵活性和动作幅度，即使穿有很累赘的装备，也能轻松行动。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，  "
"可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_hammerhand"
msgid "[Ψ]Hammerhand (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]工具手(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_hammerhand ( [Ψ]Hammerhand (C) )"
msgid ""
"Who needs tools?  You can apply enough raw force or torque with your bare "
"hands to substitute for many simple tools.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"谁还要工具？如果你徒手就能施加足够的力或者扭矩，许多简单的工具就显得异常多余。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_reflex_enhance"
msgid "[Ψ]Heightened Reflexes (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]反应提升(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_reflex_enhance ( [Ψ]Heightened Reflexes (C)
#. )"
msgid ""
"You can improve your sensory acuity and the speed at which your brain "
"processes sensory inputs.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以提高你的感知能力并通过增强大脑处理感官输入信息的速度来提高动作速度。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_sealed_system"
msgid "[Ψ]Sealed System"
msgstr "[Ψ]封闭躯体"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_sealed_system ( [Ψ]Sealed System )"
msgid ""
"With a deep breath, you lock your body off from the outside world.  Gas, "
"poison, blood, bile, electricity--nothing gets in, nothing gets out.\n"
"\n"
"Sealed System <color_red>cannot be active</color> with either Temperature "
"Adaptability or Oxygen Absorption."
msgstr ""
"你深深呼吸，将身体与外部世界隔绝开。气体、毒素、血液、胆汁、电流——内外的物质交换被隔断了。\n"
"\n"
"封闭躯体 与 温度适性 或 体表呼吸 <color_red>不能共存</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_sealed_system ( [Ψ]Sealed System )"
msgid "You take a deep breath and seal your lips."
msgstr "你深吸一口气，然后封闭了身体与外界。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_metabolism_enhance"
msgid "[Ψ]Metabolic Hyperefficiency (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]高效代谢(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_metabolism_enhance ( [Ψ]Metabolic
#. Hyperefficiency (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can supercharge your metabolism, allowing you to eat, drink, and sleep "
"much less than normal.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以提高新陈代谢的利用率，比起正常人需要更少的吃喝和睡眠。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_vitaminosis"
msgid "[Ψ]Vitaminosis"
msgstr "[Ψ]维生素再生"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_vitaminosis ( [Ψ]Vitaminosis )"
msgid ""
"Enter a trance and hyper focus on a narrow segment of your metabolism, "
"supercharging your body's ability to create vitamins and expanding it beyond "
"its normal range.  These vitamins will be created directly from your stored "
"calories."
msgstr ""
"Enter a trance and hyper focus on a narrow segment of your metabolism, "
"supercharging your body's ability to create vitamins and expanding it beyond "
"its normal range.  These vitamins will be created directly from your stored "
"calories."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_vitaminosis ( [Ψ]Vitaminosis )"
#. ~ Message of spell "vita_healing_trance ( [Ψ]Revitalizing Meditation )"
msgid "You enter a trance and submerge your awareness into your body."
msgstr "You enter a trance and submerge your awareness into your body."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_guided_evolution"
msgid "[Ψ]Guided Evolution (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]引导进化(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_guided_evolution ( [Ψ]Guided Evolution (C)
#. )"
msgid ""
"With a large amount of focus, you can maintain a targeted control over any "
"alterations to your body.  Whenever you mutate, you will have additional "
"options to select from.  This power does not cause you to mutate on its own.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in "
"combat</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> "
"than usual."
msgstr ""
"With a large amount of focus, you can maintain a targeted control over any "
"alterations to your body.  Whenever you mutate, you will have additional "
"options to select from.  This power does not cause you to mutate on its own.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in "
"combat</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> "
"than usual."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_combat_dance"
msgid "[Ψ]Combat Dance (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]战斗之舞(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_combat_dance ( [Ψ]Combat Dance (C) )"
msgid "You can flood your body with psionic power to enhance your combat prowess."
msgstr "你可以用灵能充盈你的身体，以提高你的战斗灵能。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_perfected_motion"
msgid "[Ψ]Perfected Motion (C)"
msgstr "极速移动"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_perfected_motion ( [Ψ]Perfected Motion (C)
#. )"
msgid ""
"Your control over your body allows you to move incredibly quickly.  While "
"this does not allow you to attack more quickly, you can cross distances in "
"the blink of an eye and outrun a cheetah.  You could even run on water, "
"though not walk on it.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual.\n"
"\n"
"Perfected Motion <color_red>cannot be active</color> with Hurricane Blows."
msgstr ""
"Your control over your body allows you to move incredibly quickly.  While "
"this does not allow you to attack more quickly, you can cross distances in "
"the blink of an eye and outrun a cheetah.  You could even run on water, "
"though not walk on it.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual.\n"
"\n"
"Perfected Motion <color_red>cannot be active</color> with Hurricane Blows."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_hurricane_blows"
msgid "[Ψ]Hurricane Blows"
msgstr "[Ψ]暴风连击"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_hurricane_blows ( [Ψ]Hurricane Blows )"
msgid ""
"You can now strike so quickly that you don't even seem to move at all.  "
"Before an opponent can even finish blinking, you can strike them multiple "
"times, executing your final blow before they feel the pain of the first.  "
"Moving while using Hurricane Blows will disrupt your concentration, ending "
"the effect.\n"
"\n"
"Hurricane Blows <color_red>cannot be active</color> with Perfected Motion."
msgstr ""
"你攻击快如幻影，似乎根本看不到你抬手。在对手一个眨眼之间你就能发动数次攻击，在其刚开始察觉就打出了最后一击。移动会打断暴风连击的专注并终止效果。\n"
"\n"
"暴风连击 与  极速行动 <color_red>不能共存</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_hurricane_blows ( [Ψ]Hurricane Blows )"
msgid "The world around you slows down to a stop."
msgstr "你周围的世界慢得像几乎停滞。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_PAIN_INITIATE"
msgid "You breathe deeply and your pain lessens."
msgstr "你深呼吸，感受到身上的疼痛正在减弱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_PHYSICAL_ENHANCE_INITIATE"
msgid "You enhance your physical prowess."
msgstr "你增强了自己的身体能力。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_BREATHE_SKIN_INITIATE"
msgid "As you seal your lips, your chest still rises and falls."
msgstr "你闭上了嘴，胸膛还在随着起伏。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_HARDENED_SKIN_INITIATE"
msgid "Your skin itches slightly and takes on a waxy appearance."
msgstr "你的皮肤有些痒，呈现出蜡质的外观。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_CLIMATE_CONTROL_INITIATE"
msgid "You feel much more comfortable."
msgstr "你现在感觉舒服多了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_ENHANCE_MOBILITY_INITIATE"
msgid "Your gear doesn't seem to encumber you as much."
msgstr "你感觉身上装备的累赘减轻了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_HAMMERHAND_INITIATE"
msgid "You flex your fingers."
msgstr "你舒展你的手指。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_REFLEX_ENHANCE_INITIATE"
msgid "You enhance your speed and sensory prowess."
msgstr "你增强了自己的速度和感知能力。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_METABOLISM_ENHANCE_INITIATE"
msgid "You supercharge your metabolism."
msgstr "你强化了身体的新陈代谢。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_GUIDED_EVOLUTION_INITIATE"
msgid "You begin targeting your future mutations."
msgstr "你开始有意识地规划自身未来的变异方向。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_COMBAT_DANCE_INITIATE"
msgid "A surge of power fills your body and you begin moving with terrible purpose!"
msgstr "一股灵能汇聚到你的体内，你的每个动作都充满了力量！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_PERFECTED_MOTION_INITIATE"
msgid "The world around you slows down to a crawl"
msgstr "The world around you slows down to a crawl"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_DASH_CHECKER"
msgid "You move almost faster than the eye can see."
msgstr "你几乎比目光能及的速度还快。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_DASH_CHECKER"
msgid "Your circumstances prevent you from moving freely right now."
msgstr "你当前所处的情况不允许你自由移动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_ADRENALINE_TRIGGER"
msgid "You already have a surge of adrenaline in your system!"
msgstr "你体内已经有一剂肾上腺素了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PERFECTED_MOTION_WATER_RUN_CONTINUANCE" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_PERFECTED_MOTION_WATER_RUN"
msgid "You are moving too slowly and fall into the water."
msgstr "You are moving too slowly and fall into the water."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_VITAMINOSIS_REMOVE"
msgid "You exit your trance and feel somehow fuller"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_better_senses"
msgid "[Ψ]Heightened Senses (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]感知强化(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_better_senses ( [Ψ]Heightened Senses (C) )"
msgid ""
"All of your senses are heightened, allowing you to see further and hear "
"better, and at higher levels even see in murky water or use minor vibrations "
"and small sounds to determine moving creatures nearby.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"All of your senses are heightened, allowing you to see further and hear "
"better, and at higher levels even see in murky water or use minor vibrations "
"and small sounds to determine moving creatures nearby.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_speed_reading"
msgid "[Ψ]Speed Reader (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]高速阅读(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_speed_reading ( [Ψ]Speed Reader (C) )"
msgid ""
"Your powers make words fairly leap off the page directly into your mind, "
"allowing you to read much faster and better absorb what you read.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"你的灵能让你能够高速阅读。书上的文字似乎在不停飞出，直接映入你的脑海，你得以读的更快并且记得更牢。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_danger_sense"
msgid "[Ψ]Premonition (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]危险感知(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_danger_sense ( [Ψ]Premonition (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can sense the presence of the things that wish to do you harm.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以感觉到危险敌人的存在。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_night_vision"
msgid "[Ψ]Night Eyes (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]夜视(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_night_vision ( [Ψ]Night Eyes (C) )"
msgid ""
"You are able to sense your surroundings in areas of low light, and you can "
"even \"see\" in pitch darkness.  Strictly speaking, this is not vision, and "
"you cannot discern fine details or read.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"You are able to sense your surroundings in areas of low light, and you can "
"even \"see\" in pitch darkness.  Strictly speaking, this is not vision, and "
"you cannot discern fine details or read.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_spot_weakness"
msgid "[Ψ]Discern Weakness"
msgstr "[Ψ]弱点观察"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_spot_weakness ( [Ψ]Discern Weakness )"
msgid "Your powers let you pinpoint exactly where your enemies are weak."
msgstr "你的灵能可以让你准确地定位你的敌人的弱点。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Message of spell "clair_spot_weakness ( [Ψ]Discern Weakness )"
msgid "The vulnerabilities of your enemy are revealed."
msgstr "敌人身上的弱点变得显而易见。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_see_auras"
msgid "[Ψ]Aura Sight (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]气场感知(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_see_auras ( [Ψ]Aura Sight (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can see people's emotions and physical state as a hazy swirl of color "
"around their body.  This makes it much easier to get them to do what you "
"want.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"你隐隐约约看到彩色漩涡环绕人们周围，暗示他们的情绪和精神状态。这使你在交流谈判中处于上风。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_sense_rads"
msgid "[Ψ]Radiation Sense"
msgstr "[Ψ]辐射感知"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_sense_rads ( [Ψ]Radiation Sense )"
msgid "You can open your tenses to the tell-tale glow of radiation."
msgstr "你可以打开你的神经来感受辐射的光芒。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_ranged_enhance"
msgid "[Ψ]Marksman's Eye (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]射手之眼(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_ranged_enhance ( [Ψ]Marksman's Eye (C) )"
msgid ""
"With your enhanced senses, you can increase the effective range and accuracy "
"of your ranged attacks.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"运用你被灵能增强了的感官，你可以增加远程攻击的射程与精度。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_voyance"
msgid "[Ψ]Clairvoyance"
msgstr "[Ψ]透视"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_voyance ( [Ψ]Clairvoyance )"
msgid ""
"The classic example of a clairsentient's powers, you can see through walls "
"and reveal everything nearby."
msgstr "这是超感者的经典灵能，你可以透过墙壁看到周围的一切。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Message of spell "clair_voyance ( [Ψ]Clairvoyance )"
msgid "You open your inner eye."
msgstr "你张开心眼。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_dodge_power"
msgid "[Ψ]Combat Sense (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]战斗直感(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_dodge_power ( [Ψ]Combat Sense (C) )"
msgid ""
"By gazing just a few moments into the future, you can be wherever your "
"enemies are not attacking.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以稍稍预感短暂的未来，从而更好地躲避敌人的攻击。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_craft_bonus"
msgid "[Ψ]Intuitive Artisan (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]工匠直觉(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_craft_bonus ( [Ψ]Intuitive Artisan (C) )"
msgid ""
"Opening yourself up to the immediate future, you can see the best option to "
"take when crafting or working on a task.  However, due to the intensity of "
"the visions you will be <color_red>blind</color> to the outside world while "
"crafting anything.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"你彻底投入未来，你能察觉到到制造或工作时应该采取的最佳对策。然而，由于专注于对未来的观察，你在制作时会<color_red>忽视</"
"color>周围的环境。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_perfect_shot"
msgid "[Ψ]One Perfect Shot"
msgstr "[Ψ]完美射击"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_perfect_shot ( [Ψ]One Perfect Shot )"
msgid ""
"Gaze into the future and, taking your enemy's future movements into account, "
"fire at the perfect moment.  This power will only last for a single attack."
msgstr "看向未来，将敌人的行动纳入考量，并于最佳时机开火，发射一颗前无古人的精准子弹吧！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Message of spell "clair_perfect_shot ( [Ψ]One Perfect Shot )"
msgid "It's time to take the shot."
msgstr "是时候准备射击了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_see_map"
msgid "[Ψ]Satellite View"
msgstr "[Ψ]卫星视野"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_see_map ( [Ψ]Satellite View )"
msgid ""
"You can extend your senses over the landscape, becoming aware of every hill, "
"building, and valley within a large area."
msgstr "你可以将你的感官延伸到风景中，意识到大范围内的每一座山、每一栋建筑和每一座山谷。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Message of spell "clair_see_map ( [Ψ]Satellite View )"
msgid ""
"You close your eyes and concentrate, and you can see the landscape spread out "
"as though you were a bird on the wing."
msgstr "随着你闭目凝神，周围世界的鸟瞰视野在你眼前平铺开来。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_clear_sight"
msgid "[Ψ]Clarity (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]清明感官(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_clear_sight ( [Ψ]Clarity (C) )"
msgid ""
"Thanks to your powers, nothing can stop you from seeing the world as it is.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"拜灵能所赐，再也没有什么能够阻挡你看清世界的本来面貌了。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_astral_projection"
msgid "[Ψ]Astral Projection"
msgstr "[Ψ]星界投射"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_astral_projection ( [Ψ]Astral Projection )"
msgid ""
"After a short period of concentration and meditation, cast your spirit forth "
"from your body, wandering the world disembodied.  You will move at the speed "
"of thought but cannot use further powers or interact with the world while "
"your spirit is wandering.  Follow your silver cord to return back to your "
"body."
msgstr ""
"在短暂的专注和冥想之后，将你的灵魂从你的身体中释放出来，以无实体的方式在世界上游荡。你将以思想的速度移动，但当你的灵魂游荡时，你无法使用其他灵能或与世界互动"
"。跟随你的系魂银带回到你的身体。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_astral_projection_return"
msgid "[Ψ]Follow the Silver Cord"
msgstr "[Ψ]跟随银带"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_astral_projection_return ( [Ψ]Follow the
#. Silver Cord )"
#. ~ Description of spell "hedge_astral_projection_return ( Follow the Silver
#. Cord )"
msgid "Follow the silver cord back to your body."
msgstr "跟随系魂银带返回你的身体。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_group_tactics"
msgid "[Ψ]Prescient Tactician (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]先觉战术家(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_group_tactics ( [Ψ]Prescient Tactician (C) )"
msgid ""
"Gazing into the near future, you can call out warnings to your followers so "
"they can avoid attacks before they occur.  This will greatly increase their "
"defensive capability, though it will be harder for you to defend yourself.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual."
msgstr ""
"你可以看到未来，从而在危险到来前指挥你的跟随者。极大的增强他们的防守灵能，但也因为分心让你自己的防御更困难。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。比其寻常灵能需要<color_yellow>更多专注</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clair_omniscience"
msgid "[Ψ]Omniscence"
msgstr "[Ψ]全知"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clair_omniscience ( [Ψ]Omniscence )"
msgid ""
"Extend your senses to a supernal degree, perceiving everything within the "
"nearby area.  Every creature, every object, every blade of grass, everything. "
" <color_red>EVERYTHING</color>."
msgstr "将你的感官延伸到一个超凡的程度，感知附近区域内的一切。每一个生物，每一个物体，每一片草叶，每一样东西。<color_red>一切</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_BETTER_SENSES_INITIATE"
msgid "All of your senses are enhanced."
msgstr "All of your senses are enhanced."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_REMOVE_BETTER_SENSES"
msgid "The world now seems separated from you by a thin veil."
msgstr "The world now seems separated from you by a thin veil."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_NIGHT_EYES_INITIATE"
msgid "You open your senses to the world."
msgstr "你睁开眼，感受这个世界。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_SPEED_READING_INITIATE"
msgid "You feel like sitting down with a good book."
msgstr "你现在想坐下来好好地享受阅读。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_REMOVE_SPEED_READ"
msgid "Your eyes ache a bit.  Maybe it's time to put the book down."
msgstr "你眼睛干涩，有点看累了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_SEE_AURAS_INITIATE"
msgid "Swirling colors coalesce around others' bodies"
msgstr "你可以看见人们周围环绕的灵气色彩。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_DANGER_SENSE_INITIATE"
msgid "You open your senses to the dangers of the world."
msgstr "你尝试感知周围世界的危险。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RANGED_ENHANCE_INITIATE"
msgid ""
"Distances seem to narrow and your enemies' movements seem to slow as their "
"vulnerabilities are laid bare."
msgstr ""
"Distances seem to narrow and your enemies' movements seem to slow as their "
"vulnerabilities are laid bare."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_DODGE_POWER_INITIATE"
msgid "You can see a premonition of your enemies' attacks like a ghostly image."
msgstr "你能够以虚像的形式预知看到敌人的攻击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_CRAFT_BONUS_INITIATE"
msgid "You can see how it all fits together, and how it *should* fit together."
msgstr "你可以看到物体是如何完美地结合在一起的，以及它们*应该*如何结合。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_CLEAR_SIGHT_INITIATE"
msgid "Your senses sharpen and all distractions vanish."
msgstr "你的感知增强，外界的纷扰消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_GROUP_TACTICS_INITIATE"
msgid ""
"As the visions overtake you, you start involuntarily calling out warnings to "
"your allies."
msgstr "你情不自禁将预知内容警报给同伴。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE"
msgid "Check yourself"
msgstr "查看自己"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE"
msgid "Check your surroundings"
msgstr "查看周围"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE"
msgid ""
"Cast your subtle senses over yourself, seeing if you are contaminated with "
"radiation."
msgstr "用你敏锐的感官观察你自己，看看你是否被辐射污染了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE"
msgid "Open your inner eye, searching your environment for dangerous radiation."
msgstr "打开你的心眼，环顾周围的环境中寻找是否存在危险辐射。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see none of the insidious glow typical "
"of radiation.  You are in the clear, for now."
msgstr "你仔细感受身体，没有发现典型的辐射射线。你现在还是干净的。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a few dull glimmers, hidden deep in "
"your flesh.  The damage is minimal for now, but you had best not let it "
"fester."
msgstr ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a few dull glimmers, hidden deep in "
"your flesh.  The damage is minimal for now, but you had best not let it "
"fester."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_3" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a dull glow along your core.  Your "
"radiation is climbing, though it's still not in the danger zone."
msgstr "你把你的感官转你自身，你看到核心处有股暗淡的光芒。你的辐射水平正在上升，但还没到危险的等级。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_4" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_3" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a faint glow spreading outward from "
"your core to your limbs.  You're getting closer to dangerous levels--you "
"should deal with it before it gets worse."
msgstr "你把你的感官转向自身，你看到微光从你的核心处向外扩散到你的四肢。你正在接近危险的辐射水平——你应该在情况变得更糟之前治疗一下。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_5" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_4" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_3" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a glow along your bones.  You had "
"best seek treatment, and soon."
msgstr "你把你的感官转你自身，你看到骨头上散发出光。你最好尽快寻求治疗，越快越好。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_6" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_5" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_4" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_3" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a steady glow all along your muscles "
"and bones.  You are in real trouble if you don't deal with your radiation "
"immediately."
msgstr "你仔细感受身体，发现肌肉和骨骼都在不断放出射线。如果不设法解决，问题可能会变得很严重。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_CRAFTING_ADD_BLINDNESS_WHEN_CRAFTING"
msgid "You close your eyes as the visions overtake you."
msgstr "You close your eyes as the visions overtake you."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_CRAFTING_REMOVE_BLINDNESS_WHEN_DONE_CRAFTING"
msgid "You open your eyes as the visions fade."
msgstr "You open your eyes as the visions fade."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_ASTRAL_PROJECTION_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_ASTRAL_PROJECTION"
msgid "As you meditate, you feel your spirit slipping free from your body."
msgstr "你开始冥想，感到自己的灵魂离开你的身体。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_ASTRAL_PROJECTION_DEACTIVATE"
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_ASTRAL_PROJECTION_DEACTIVATE"
msgid "You snap back into your body once again."
msgstr "你又一次回到自己的身体中。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
#. ~ Message of spell "classless_toggleable_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating )"
msgid "You stop concentrating on your powers."
msgstr "You stop concentrating on your powers."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_specific_concentration_end"
msgid "[Ψ]Stop Concentrating (Individual)"
msgstr "[Ψ]结束专注(自选)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_specific_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating (Individual) )"
msgid ""
"End your concentration on a specific power.\n"
"\n"
"Channeling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."
msgstr ""
"结束对某个正在维持的灵能的专注。\n"
"\n"
"引导这种灵能<color_green>总是成功</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
#. ~ Message of spell "classless_specific_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating (Individual) )"
msgid "You stop concentrating on one of your powers."
msgstr "你不再专注于维持一个正在生效的灵能。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_zap_enemies"
msgid "[Ψ]Electrical Discharge (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]电荷释放(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_zap_enemies ( [Ψ]Electrical
#. Discharge (C) )"
msgid ""
"Build up a charge in your body, zapping anyone who attempts to attack you.  "
"It will also protect you from EMP attacks.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"在你的体内积聚电荷，电击任何试图攻击你的人。这还能保护你免受电磁脉冲的攻击。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_melee_attacks"
msgid "[Ψ]Voltaic Strikes (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]电流附加(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_melee_attacks ( [Ψ]Voltaic Strikes
#. (C) )"
msgid ""
"Unleash electrical blasts on those you strike in melee.  It also provides "
"protection against electrical damage.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"在使用武器攻击时附加电击伤害。同时还提供对电击伤害的防护。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_melee_attacks ( [Ψ]Voltaic Strikes (C)
#. )"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_MELEE_ATTACKS_INITIATE"
msgid "Lightning crackles between your fingers!"
msgstr "闪电在你的手指间闪烁！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_personal_battery ( [Ψ]Electron
#. Overflow (C) )"
msgid ""
"Generate power for battery-powered devices on your person.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"Generate power for battery-powered devices on your person.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_paralysis"
msgid "[Ψ]Neural Spasms"
msgstr "[Ψ]神经电击"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_paralysis ( [Ψ]Neural Spasms )"
msgid ""
"Cause an electrical burst in the target's nervous system (or the remains of "
"it), incapacitating them briefly.  It will only work on targets that have, or "
"had, a nervous system."
msgstr ""
"Cause an electrical burst in the target's nervous system (or the remains of "
"it), incapacitating them briefly.  It will only work on targets that have, or "
"had, a nervous system."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_reduce_pain"
msgid "[Ψ]Pain Suppression (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]疼痛抑制(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_reduce_pain ( [Ψ]Pain Suppression
#. (C) )"
msgid ""
"With your control over electricity, reduce the strength of the pain signals "
"in your own body.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"运用你掌控电流的灵能，减弱体内的疼痛信号。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_bolt"
msgid "[Ψ]Electrocutioner"
msgstr "[Ψ]电击处刑"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_bolt ( [Ψ]Electrocutioner
#. )"
msgid "Launch a bolt of lightning at a nearby target."
msgstr "向附近的目标发射一道闪电。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_bolt (
#. [Ψ]Electrocutioner )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrokinetic_kill_robot_sparks ( [Ψ]Short
#. Circuit Lightning Burst )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_blast ( [Ψ]Ion Blast
#. )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "sylph_massive_lightning_bolt_spell ( Fist of
#. Heaven's Fury )"
msgid "zzzzaaaaaapp!"
msgstr "滋啪！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_bolt ( [Ψ]Electrocutioner )"
msgid "You unleash a bolt of lightning."
msgstr "你放出一道闪电。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_pain_immune"
msgid "[Ψ]Analgesic Block"
msgstr "[Ψ]疼痛阻断"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_pain_immune ( [Ψ]Analgesic Block )"
msgid ""
"By clamping down on all pain signals you can completely eliminate your "
"ability to feel pain briefly.  This does not eliminate the source of pain, "
"and when the power ends all of the original pain and more will return.\n"
"\n"
"Analgesic Block is <color_red>incompatible</color> with Neuro-Acceleration."
msgstr ""
"通过压制疼痛信号，你可以短暂地消除疼痛感，但疼痛的源头依然存在。当压制结束，更多的疼痛会卷土重来。\n"
"\n"
"疼痛阻断与神经加速<color_red>不兼容</color_red>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_pain_immune ( [Ψ]Analgesic Block )"
msgid "The pain just… disappears."
msgstr "疼痛...消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_speed_boost"
msgid "[Ψ]Neuro-acceleration"
msgstr "[Ψ]神经加速(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_speed_boost ( [Ψ]Neuro-acceleration
#. )"
msgid ""
"You can improve the efficiency of your or an ally's nervous system, allowing "
"for much faster response times.  This also increases the target's ability to "
"retain information.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  Neuro-acceleration is <color_red>incompatible</color> "
"with Analgesic Block.  When used on <color_green>allies</color>, the power "
"has <color_yellow>one-half the normal duration</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以提高自己或盟友的神经系统效率，从而大大加快反应。这也能增强记忆能力。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能 "
"<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。疼痛阻断 与 "
"神经加速<color_red>不兼容</color>。对<color_green>盟友</color>使用时，该能力的持续时间是<color_"
"yellow>正常时间的一半</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_kill_robot"
msgid "[Ψ]Short Circuit"
msgstr "[Ψ]短路"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_kill_robot ( [Ψ]Short Circuit )"
msgid "Cause a massive power surge within a robot or cyborg, disabling it."
msgstr "对机器人或改造人释放强劲电流脉冲，使其瘫痪。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_kill_robot ( [Ψ]Short Circuit )"
msgid "You channel a surge of power into your target!"
msgstr "你引导一道电流对目标进行冲击！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_robot_interface ( [Ψ]Robotic
#. Interface )"
msgid ""
"Use your powers to remotely interface with a robot's internal circuitry, "
"allowing you to hack it if you have the skill."
msgstr "使用你的灵能远程连接机器人的内部电路，如果你有足够的计算机技能的话，就可以黑进它。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_aura"
msgid "[Ψ]Galvanic Aura (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]电流光环(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_aura ( [Ψ]Galvanic Aura
#. (C) )"
msgid ""
"Charge the air around you with power, unleashing blasts at anyone nearby.  "
"This power does not discriminate between friend and foe.  It will also "
"protect you from electricity while active.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>"
msgstr ""
"用能力为你周遭充能，电击任何靠近的生物。这种能力不分敌我。能力激活时，还会保护你免受电击伤害。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能 "
"<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_aura ( [Ψ]Galvanic Aura (C) )"
msgid "The air around you hums with power."
msgstr "你周围的空气充盈着电能，微微颤动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_blast"
msgid "[Ψ]Ion Blast"
msgstr "[Ψ]离子轰击"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_blast ( [Ψ]Ion Blast )"
msgid ""
"Launch a blast of lightning at a nearby target, causing a secondary explosion "
"at the location."
msgstr "在附近引发一道离子闪电，并造成小型的爆炸。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_blast ( [Ψ]Ion Blast )"
msgid "You unleash an explosive blast of lightning."
msgstr "你释放了一道爆炸闪电。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_revive"
msgid "[Ψ]Revivification"
msgstr "[Ψ]复苏电击"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_revive ( [Ψ]Revivification )"
msgid ""
"Manipulate the nervous system of a corpse, causing it to rise and protect "
"you.  This protection will only last a short time."
msgstr "操作尸体的神经系统，让它为你而战。仅能持续一小段时间。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_revive ( [Ψ]Revivification )"
msgid "You charge a nearby corpse with lightning."
msgstr "你用电流充能了附近的一具尸体。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PERSONAL_BATTERY_INITIATE"
msgid "The power you channel vanishes into nothingness."
msgstr "The power you channel vanishes into nothingness."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_REDUCE_PAIN_INITIATE"
msgid "The aches and pains of post-Cataclysmic life fade, just a little."
msgstr "大灾变后的疼痛与创伤消退了一些。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_SPEED_BOOST_INITIATE"
msgid "You enhance the functioning of your neurons."
msgstr "你强化了自己的神经系统。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LIGHTNING_AURA_INITIATE"
msgid "The air around you begins crackling with electricity!"
msgstr "你周围的空气开始充满噼啪作响的电流！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PARALYSIS"
msgid "You overload the target's neurons!"
msgstr "你引动电荷，冲击目标的神经！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PARALYSIS"
msgid "You attempt to overload the target's neurons but nothing happens!"
msgstr "You attempt to overload the target's neurons but nothing happens!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PAIN_IMMUNE_ON"
msgid "You are already under the effects of Analgesic Block!"
msgstr "你已经处于疼痛阻断状态了！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_local"
msgid "[Ψ]Candle's Glow (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]长明烛光(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_local ( [Ψ]Candle's Glow (C) )"
msgid ""
"Create a simple patch of light nearby, sufficient to read or perform simple "
"tasks with.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"创造一小片光芒，它不是很明亮，但足够阅读或进行其他简单任务。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_create_light"
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_create_light_01"
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_create_light_02"
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_create_light_03"
msgid "[Ψ]Field of Light"
msgstr "[Ψ]驱暗灵光"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_create_light ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_create_light_01 ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_create_light_02 ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_create_light_03 ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_up_enemy ( [Ψ]Illuminate )"
msgid "Create photons to illuminate an entire area."
msgstr "创造光子，并操控其照亮整片区域。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_create_light ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
msgid "Sudden light bursts forth!"
msgstr "光芒突然向前方爆发！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_up_enemy"
msgid "[Ψ]Illuminate"
msgstr "[Ψ]Illuminate"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_up_enemy ( [Ψ]Illuminate )"
msgid "Your target is outlined in light."
msgstr "Your target is outlined in light."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_snuff_light"
msgid "[Ψ]Blackout"
msgstr "[Ψ]黑暗降临"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_snuff_light ( [Ψ]Blackout )"
msgid "Interrupt the flow of photons to create an area of darkness."
msgstr "截断光线的流动以创造一个黑暗区域。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_snuff_light ( [Ψ]Blackout )"
msgid "As you concentrate, an area nearby is plunged into darkness!"
msgstr "随着你专注地控制，附近的一个区域陷入黑暗！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_dodge"
msgid "[Ψ]Trick of the Light (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]光线戏法(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_dodge ( [Ψ]Trick of the Light
#. (C) )"
msgid ""
"Manipulate the light around your body, creating shifting illusions, blurring "
"your outline and position, and becoming harder to hit.  An enemy successfully "
"hitting you will pinpoint your location and <color_red>disrupt the "
"power</color>.\n"
"\n"
"his power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"Manipulate the light around your body, creating shifting illusions, blurring "
"your outline and position, and becoming harder to hit.  An enemy successfully "
"hitting you will pinpoint your location and <color_red>disrupt the "
"power</color>.\n"
"\n"
"his power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_beam"
msgid "[Ψ]Photon Beam"
msgstr "[Ψ]光子集束"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_beam ( [Ψ]Photon Beam )"
msgid "Concentrate photons into a high-energy beam."
msgstr "汇集一道高能光子束。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_beam ( [Ψ]Photon Beam )"
msgid "You fire a searing beam of light!"
msgstr "你发射出一道灼热的光束！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_camouflage"
#. ~ Combination of chameleon and camouflage
msgid "[Ψ]Chameleoflage (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]拟态伪装(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_camouflage ( [Ψ]Chameleoflage (C) )"
msgid ""
"By blending the light reflecting from you with the light reflecting from "
"nearby surfaces, you can make yourself much harder to spot from a distance.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"通过将自身反射光与附近表面反射光混合，你可以使自己在远处更难被发现。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_rad_immunity"
msgid "[Ψ]Lucent Barrier (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]灵光屏障(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_rad_immunity ( [Ψ]Lucent Barrier (C)
#. )"
msgid ""
"Create a barrier of light around yourself to protect against radiation and "
"light damage.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"在你周围创建一道光的屏障，以保护免受辐射和光能伤害。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_arms"
msgid "[Ψ]Refracted Arms"
msgstr "[Ψ]幻象武器"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_arms ( [Ψ]Refracted Arms )"
msgid ""
"Create the illusion of extra arms and wielded items to trick your enemies, "
"forcing them off balance and rendering them open to attack."
msgstr "用光线创造出额外的手臂，握持物品与武器，以真真假假的攻击诱使敌人失去平衡，做出错误的防御。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_arms ( [Ψ]Refracted Arms )"
msgid ""
"Light around your arms shimmers and refracts, creating the illusion of "
"multiple arms."
msgstr "周围的光线闪烁和折射，塑造出多只手臂的幻象。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_hide_ugly"
msgid "[Ψ]Mirror-Mask (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]易容幻象(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_hide_ugly ( [Ψ]Mirror-Mask (C) )"
msgid ""
"Hide your true form behind unassuming illusions, preventing baseline humans "
"from reacting poorly to your presence if you are mutated or a cyborg.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"用不起眼的幻象隐藏你真实的形态，防止没见识的普通人类对你的变异肢体或改造部位大惊小怪\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_image"
msgid "[Ψ]Lucid Shadows"
msgstr "[Ψ]幻影替身"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_image ( [Ψ]Lucid Shadows )"
msgid "Form images of yourself to confuse and distract enemies."
msgstr "操控幻影汇集成你自己的形象，从而混淆和分散敌人的注意力。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_image ( [Ψ]Lucid Shadows )"
msgid "Identical copies of you suddenly appear!"
msgstr "一个与你一模一样的幻象突然显现！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_radio"
msgid "[Ψ]Radio Transception (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]电波交流(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_radio ( [Ψ]Radio Transception (C) )"
msgid ""
"Attune your senses to radio waves, allowing you to listen to transmissions "
"and send them yourself.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"调整你的感官以接收无线电波，使你能够侦听或发送信息。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_sterilize_food"
msgid "[Ψ]Gamma Sterilization"
msgstr "[Ψ]伽马灭菌"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_sterilize_food ( [Ψ]Gamma
#. Sterilization )"
msgid ""
"Use a focused emission of high-power radiation to eliminating microorganisms "
"in food and allowing it to last much longer before rotting.  This power is "
"<color_red>extremely taxing</color>."
msgstr ""
"Use a focused emission of high-power radiation to eliminating microorganisms "
"in food and allowing it to last much longer before rotting.  This power is "
"<color_red>extremely taxing</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_stun_robots"
msgid "[Ψ]Sensor Jamming"
msgstr "[Ψ]传感器干扰"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_stun_robots ( [Ψ]Sensor Jamming )"
msgid ""
"Unleash a localized burst of electromagnetic radiation, overloading any "
"electronic sensory equipment in the area."
msgstr ""
"Unleash a localized burst of electromagnetic radiation, overloading any "
"electronic sensory equipment in the area."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_stun_robots ( [Ψ]Sensor Jamming )"
msgid "You unleash an electromagnetic wave!"
msgstr "You unleash an electromagnetic wave!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_invisibility"
msgid "[Ψ]Veil of Light (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]光之帷幕(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_invisibility ( [Ψ]Veil of Light (C) )"
msgid ""
"Refract light around yourself to become invisible.  Moving too quickly has a "
"chance to disrupt the effect, and attacking in melee will invariably do so.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"折射你周围的光线来使你隐身。如果能力不够熟练，移动时有概率使隐身失效；近战攻击也会导致隐身失效。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_flash"
msgid "[Ψ]Star Flash"
msgstr "[Ψ]恒星耀光"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_flash ( [Ψ]Star Flash )"
msgid ""
"Create a destructive flash of light in a line, damaging all targets caught in "
"the beam."
msgstr ""
"Create a destructive flash of light in a line, damaging all targets caught in "
"the beam."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_flash ( [Ψ]Star Flash )"
msgid "You fire a searing wave of light!"
msgstr "你释放出一道灼热的光波！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_blinding_glare"
msgid "[Ψ]Blinding Radiance (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]Blinding Radiance (C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_blinding_glare ( [Ψ]Blinding Radiance
#. (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can emit so much light that anyone trying to attack you risks being "
"blinded.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"You can emit so much light that anyone trying to attack you risks being "
"blinded.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_disintegrate"
msgid "[Ψ]Luminous Disintegration"
msgstr "[Ψ]瓦解光束"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_disintegrate ( [Ψ]Luminous
#. Disintegration )"
msgid ""
"Concentrate a massive amount of light into a single target, causing it to "
"disintegrate."
msgstr "将大量光线集中到一个单一目标上，将其瓦解。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_disintegrate ( [Ψ]Luminous
#. Disintegration )"
msgid "You focus a pointpoint burst of light on your target!"
msgstr "你将瓦解光束聚焦在你的目标上！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_army"
msgid "[Ψ]Phantom Legion (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]Phantom Legion (C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_army ( [Ψ]Phantom Legion (C) )"
msgid ""
"Create a myriad of illusions around yourself to mislead and confuse your "
"enemies.  The illusions will explode into blinding flashes if damaged.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual.  Concentration will "
"<color_green>automatically end</color> if all illusions are destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Create a myriad of illusions around yourself to mislead and confuse your "
"enemies.  The illusions will explode into blinding flashes if damaged.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual.  Concentration will "
"<color_green>automatically end</color> if all illusions are destroyed."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LIGHT_LOCAL_INITIATE"
msgid "A soft glow springs up around you."
msgstr "A soft glow springs up around you."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LIGHT_DODGE_INITIATE"
msgid "You are surrounded by shifting illusions."
msgstr "你被不断变化的幻象所包围。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_RAD_IMMUNITY_INITIATE"
msgid "The air around you shimmers as an invisible barrier of light forms around you."
msgstr "你周围的空气闪烁跃动，形成了一个无形的光之屏障。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_CAMOUFLAGE_INITIATE"
msgid "You twist nearby light to help conceal you from distant observers."
msgstr "你扭曲附近的光线，距离稍远就几乎不能察觉你的行踪。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_HIDE_UGLY_INITIATE"
msgid "You shroud your true form behind unassuming illusions."
msgstr "你用难以察觉的幻象隐藏了你的真实形态。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_RADIO_INITIATE"
msgid "You attune your senses to passing radio waves."
msgstr "你调整你的感官来收发无线电波。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_INVISIBILITY_INITIATE"
msgid ""
"Suddenly, the world around you seems like it's on the other side of the "
"surface of water."
msgstr "你周围的世界突然变得像水面的另一边，不再能发现你。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_BLINDING_GLARE_INITIATE"
msgid "You begin glowing as brightly as the sun!"
msgstr "你发出如太阳般明亮的光芒！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LIGHT_ARMY_INITIATE"
msgid "A myriad of duplicates of yourself appear nearby!"
msgstr "A myriad of duplicates of yourself appear nearby!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player spell casting message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PHOTOKIN_REMOVE_LIGHT_ARMY"
msgid "The remaining light duplicates disappear."
msgstr "The remaining light duplicates disappear."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_eocs.json
#. ~ Player inventory menu title in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PHOTOKINETIC_STERILIZE_FOODS"
msgid "What food or drink do you want to sterilize?"
msgstr "What food or drink do you want to sterilize?"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_eruption"
msgid "[Ψ]Fountain of Flames"
msgstr "[Ψ]火焰喷泉"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_eruption ( [Ψ]Fountain of Flames )"
msgid "Cause a burst of flames at the target location."
msgstr "在目标位置引发一场大火。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_eruption ( [Ψ]Fountain of Flames )"
msgid "You summon flames!"
msgstr "你召唤出火焰！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_flash"
msgid "[Ψ]Brilliant Flash"
msgstr "[Ψ]眩目闪光"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_flash ( [Ψ]Brilliant Flash )"
msgid ""
"By strongly exciting the air at a particular point, you produce a burst of "
"light."
msgstr "通过在某一特定点强烈激发空气，你就会产生一束光。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_cauterize"
msgid "[Ψ]Cauterize"
msgstr "[Ψ]烧灼止血"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_cauterize ( [Ψ]Cauterize )"
msgid ""
"Using an extremely focused application of pyrokinesis, sear a wound shut to "
"stop the bleeding.  This is liable to be painful and is almost certainly "
"likely to just cause more damage if you don't have any medical knowledge.  If "
"the bleeding is too strong, cauterization will be ineffective, and there is a "
"<color_red>chance of infection</color> whether you are successful or not."
msgstr ""
"一项功能细分的焰动者能力，将伤口烧焦以止血。这可能会很痛苦，如果你没有医学知识，几乎肯定会造成更多的伤害。如果出血过多，烧灼将无效，并且无论你是否成功，都有"
"<color_red>感染几率</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_call_flames"
msgid "[Ψ]Banked Flames (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]可控火焰(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_call_flames ( [Ψ]Banked Flames (C) )"
msgid ""
"Call up flames over your outstretched hand.  You can use them to heat up "
"food, boil water, start fires, or anything else fire can accomplish.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"伸出手并召唤火焰。你可以用它们来加热食物、煮水、点火，或者完成任何火焰能够做到的事情。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_quell_flames"
msgid "[Ψ]Quell Fire"
msgstr "[Ψ]熄灭火焰"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_quell_flames ( [Ψ]Quell Fire )"
msgid "As you can create fire, you can also extinguish it."
msgstr "既然你可以生火，你也可以扑灭它。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_quell_flames ( [Ψ]Quell Fire )"
msgid "You disperse the flames harmlessly."
msgstr "你手一挥，熄灭掉了火焰。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_cloak"
msgid "[Ψ]Cloak of Warmth (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]控温斗篷(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_cloak ( [Ψ]Cloak of Warmth (C) )"
msgid ""
"Control the temperature of the nearby air, warming you and protecting you "
"against flames.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"控制附近空气的温度，保持温暖并使你免受火焰伤害。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_flamethrower"
msgid "[Ψ]Flamethrower"
msgstr "[Ψ]喷射火焰"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_flamethrower ( [Ψ]Flamethrower )"
msgid "Spray fire in a cone in front of you."
msgstr "在你面前的一个锥形区里喷火。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_flamethrower ( [Ψ]Flamethrower )"
msgid "You hurl a spray of flames."
msgstr "你喷射出一团火焰。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_lance"
msgid "[Ψ]Incandescent Lance (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]炽耀喷流(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_lance ( [Ψ]Incandescent Lance (C) )"
msgid ""
"Concentrate heat into a thin, searing beam capable of cutting through solid "
"metal or welding it together.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"将火焰汇聚成一道灼热的光束，其温度足以切割金属或将其重新焊接在一起。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_thermogenesis"
msgid "[Ψ]Thermogenesis"
msgstr "[Ψ]热力操控"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_thermogenesis ( [Ψ]Thermogenesis )"
msgid ""
"Heat the air nearby and maintain it, taking off the chill or turning winter "
"to warm summer."
msgstr "加热附近的空气并保持它，消除寒冷或把冬天变成温暖的夏天。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_aura"
msgid "[Ψ]Blazing Aura (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]炽焰光环(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_aura ( [Ψ]Blazing Aura (C) )"
msgid ""
"Surround yourself with a cloud of flames, damaging anyone in melee combat "
"with you.  The flames also produce light.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"将你包裹在一团火焰中，反击任何试图近战攻击你的人。同时火焰还能提供照明。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_flame_immunity"
msgid "[Ψ]Flameshield (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]火焰护盾(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_flame_immunity ( [Ψ]Flameshield (C) )"
msgid ""
"Your power over fire is such that you can now step directly into raging "
"flames and walk through them unharmed, feeling no more than a pleasant "
"warmth.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"你对火的掌控力已经到了可以直接踏入熊熊烈焰中并毫发无伤地穿行其中，只感到愉悦的温暖。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_blast"
msgid "[Ψ]Conflagration"
msgstr "[Ψ]爆燃术"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_blast ( [Ψ]Conflagration )"
msgid "Create an expanding fireball that catches multiple targets in its wake."
msgstr "创造一个不断膨胀的火球，在其尾流中捕捉到多个目标。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_blast ( [Ψ]Conflagration )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_aoe_blast ( [Ψ]Hellfire )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_incineration ( [Ψ]Crucible )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_explosion_and_heal_spell ( The
#. Phoenix's Last Cry )"
msgid "the roar of flames!"
msgstr "火焰呼呼燃烧！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_blast ( [Ψ]Conflagration )"
msgid "You call forth a raging inferno!"
msgstr "你召唤狂怒的炼狱之焰！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_aoe_blast"
msgid "[Ψ]Hellfire"
msgstr "[Ψ]火焰地狱"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_aoe_blast ( [Ψ]Hellfire )"
msgid ""
"Send forth raging flames and turn the ground around you into an inferno.  You "
"will be <color_yellow>briefly</color> immune to the aftereffects of your own "
"power as well."
msgstr "引发狂暴的烈焰，将周围彻底转为火海。你会<color_yellow>暂时</color>免疫烈焰引起的一系列副作用。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_aoe_blast ( [Ψ]Hellfire )"
msgid "The ground around you explodes in flames!"
msgstr "你周围的地面充斥着暴烈的火焰！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_incineration"
msgid "[Ψ]Crucible"
msgstr "[Ψ]熔金炽焰"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_incineration ( [Ψ]Crucible )"
msgid ""
"Concentrate the entirety of your power into a single white-hot point, searing "
"your target with the heat of a volcano."
msgstr "将所有的烈焰集中同一点呈现出炽白的颜色，用这火山般的热量烧灼你的目标。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_incineration ( [Ψ]Crucible )"
msgid "You focus all of your power onto a single point!"
msgstr "你将所有的烈焰灵能集中在一个点上！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CALL_FLAME_INITIATE"
msgid "Flames begin dancing in the air above your hand."
msgstr "火焰在你的手上舞动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYRO_REMOVE_FIRE_TOOL"
msgid "The flames over your hand gutter and die out."
msgstr "你手中的火焰听话地熄灭掉了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_WARMTH_CLOAK_INITIATE"
msgid "You heat the nearby air to a comfortable temperature."
msgstr "你将附近的空气加热到一个舒适的温度。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_TORCH_WELD_INITIATE"
msgid "A searing line of flame springs forth from your finger."
msgstr "一道灼热的火焰从你的手指中喷薄而出。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYRO_REMOVE_TORCH_WELD"
msgid "The line of fire vanishes in an instant."
msgstr "火线一瞬间消失了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_BLAZING_AURA_INITIATE"
msgid "You set the air around yourself ablaze."
msgstr "熊熊火焰在你周围的空气中腾起。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_FLAME_IMMUNITY_INITIATE"
msgid "The nearby air loses any heat."
msgstr "附近的空气失去了任何热量。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_CONCENTRATED_HEALING_SELECTOR"
msgid "Left Arm"
msgstr "左臂"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_CONCENTRATED_HEALING_SELECTOR"
msgid "Right Arm"
msgstr "右臂"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_CONCENTRATED_HEALING_SELECTOR"
msgid "Left Leg"
msgstr "左腿"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_CONCENTRATED_HEALING_SELECTOR"
msgid "Right Leg"
msgstr "右腿"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the left arm."
msgstr "烧灼左臂伤口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the right arm."
msgstr "烧灼右臂伤口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the head."
msgstr "烧灼头部伤口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the left leg."
msgstr "烧灼左腿伤口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the right leg."
msgstr "烧灼右腿伤口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the torso."
msgstr "烧灼躯干伤口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_LEFT_ARM_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_LEFT_ARM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_RIGHT_ARM_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_RIGHT_ARM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_HEAD_2" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_HEAD"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_LEFT_LEG_2" in
