#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_noise"
msgid "[Ψ]Noisemaker"
msgstr "[Ψ]噪音发生器"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_noise ( [Ψ]Noisemaker )"
msgid ""
"Using a focused burst of telekinesis, slam two objects together, or an object "
"into the ground, or simply hit the ground with your powers, causing a loud "
"noise."
msgstr "使用集中的念动爆破力，将两个物体撞击在一起，或者将一个物体撞向地面，或者只是将自身的灵能撞击地面，引发巨大的噪音。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "telekinetic_noise ( [Ψ]Noisemaker )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "trow_make_noise_spell ( The One Who Knocks )"
msgid "a loud thump"
msgstr "砰的一声巨响"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telekinetic_noise ( [Ψ]Noisemaker )"
msgid "You lash out at the ground with your powers."
msgstr "你使用灵能猛烈敲打大地。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_slam_down"
msgid "[Ψ]Knockdown"
msgstr "[Ψ]念力击倒"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_slam_down ( [Ψ]Knockdown )"
msgid ""
"Slam something to the ground with a burst of telekinetic force, doing a small "
"amount of damage and downing them."
msgstr "操控念动力使某物猛烈地摔到地上，造成少量伤害和击倒。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telekinetic_slam_down ( [Ψ]Knockdown )"
msgid "Your target is knocked to the ground."
msgstr "你的目标被击倒在地。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_slowfall"
msgid "[Ψ]Slowfall"
msgstr "[Ψ]羽落术"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_slowfall ( [Ψ]Slowfall )"
msgid ""
"Counteract the pull of gravity with telekinetic force, greatly reducing or "
"even eliminating damage from falling and becoming much more buoyant."
msgstr "用心灵能力抵消重力的拉扯，极大地减少甚至消除坠落造成的损害，并变得更加轻快。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telekinetic_slowfall ( [Ψ]Slowfall )"
msgid "You feel lighter."
msgstr "你感觉身体轻飘飘的。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_water_walk"
msgid "[Ψ]Water Walking (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]水上行走(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_water_walk ( [Ψ]Water Walking (C) )"
msgid ""
"Lift yourself enough to counteract your mass, allowing the surface tension of "
"liquids to support you, enabling you to walk on water.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual."
msgstr ""
"Lift yourself enough to counteract your mass, allowing the surface tension of "
"liquids to support you, enabling you to walk on water.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_lifting_field"
msgid "[Ψ]Lifting Field (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]悬浮场(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_lifting_field ( [Ψ]Lifting Field (C) )"
msgid ""
"Hover a single object next to you, freeing your hands for other tasks and "
"making it easy to access.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"将一个物体悬停在你旁边，供你轻松取用或腾出双手执行其他任务。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_strength"
msgid "[Ψ]Enhance Strength (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]强化力量(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_strength ( [Ψ]Enhance Strength (C) )"
msgid ""
"Focus your powers to allow you to move much heavier objects and smash through "
"walls.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"集中提高你的灵能，让你能够移动更重的物体或砸破墙壁。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_vehicle_lift"
msgid "[Ψ]Lift Vehicle (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]念力起重(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_vehicle_lift ( [Ψ]Lift Vehicle (C) )"
msgid ""
"Focus your powers to raise a vehicle just enough to change a tire or perform "
"repairs.  As your powers increase, you will be able to lift heavier vehicles.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"集中你的灵能，将车辆抬起一些高度，足以更换轮胎或进行修理了。随着你的灵能增加，你将能够举起更重的车辆。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_shield"
msgid "[Ψ]Inertial Barrier (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]念力屏障(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_shield ( [Ψ]Inertial Barrier (C) )"
msgid ""
"Create a telekinetic barrier around yourself to protect you from damage.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"创建一个念动屏障，保护自己免受伤害。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_explosion"
msgid "[Ψ]Wrecking Ball"
msgstr "[Ψ]念力破拆"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_explosion ( [Ψ]Wrecking Ball )"
msgid ""
"A burst of telekinetic force shatters the terrain at the target location, as "
"well as anything caught inside."
msgstr "一股瞬动力量的爆发粉碎了目标位置的地形，以及任何目标位置的物品。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telekinetic_explosion ( [Ψ]Wrecking Ball )"
msgid "You indiscriminately blast your targets!"
msgstr "你使用灵能无差别地轰击目标位置！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_levitation"
msgid "[Ψ]Levitation (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]念力浮空(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_levitation ( [Ψ]Levitation (C) )"
msgid ""
"Use your telekinesis and lift yourself up, defying gravity.  While not true "
"flight, you can cross open air and descend safely.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in "
"combat</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> "
"than usual."
msgstr ""
"Use your telekinesis and lift yourself up, defying gravity.  While not true "
"flight, you can cross open air and descend safely.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in "
"combat</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> "
"than usual."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_move_large_weight"
msgid "[Ψ]Megakinesis"
msgstr "[Ψ]超念动"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_move_large_weight ( [Ψ]Megakinesis )"
msgid ""
"Telekinesis on a grand scale, this power allows you to move truly enormous "
"amounts of weight, hurling a human-sized target at lethal speeds or picking "
"up and throwing something monstrously large.  The amount of weight you can "
"move is dependent on the power level."
msgstr ""
"范围及强度更大的念动，这种灵能可以让你移动非常重的物品，并以足以致命的速度投掷出接近人类体型的目标，或者捡起并投掷巨大的物品。你可以移动的重量取决于灵能水平"
"。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_aegis"
msgid "[Ψ]Aegis"
msgstr "[Ψ]灵能神盾"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_aegis ( [Ψ]Aegis )"
msgid ""
"Create a shield impenetrable to physical damage around yourself.  It will "
"<color_yellow>only last a few moments</color>.  You will be <color_red>unable "
"to move</color> while the power is in effect."
msgstr ""
"在周围生成一个物理伤害无法穿透的盾牌。只能维持<color_yellow>极短时间</color>并且你在持续期间<color_red>无法移动</"
"color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telekinetic_aegis ( [Ψ]Aegis )"
msgid "The air around you becomes as hard as adamant."
msgstr "周围的空气在灵能引导下变得坚不可摧。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telekinetic_earthshaker"
msgid "[Ψ]Earthshaker"
msgstr "[Ψ]撼地灵能"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telekinetic_earthshaker ( [Ψ]Earthshaker )"
msgid ""
"Seize the nearby earth with your powers and *wrench* it, toppling buildings "
"and knocking everyone nearby off their feet."
msgstr "用灵能操纵附近的大地，将其*扭曲*，推倒建筑物，击倒附近的所有人。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telekinetic_earthshaker ( [Ψ]Earthshaker )"
msgid "The earth shakes!"
msgstr "地表在晃動!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_WATER_WALKING"
msgid "Your steps feel very light on the ground."
msgstr "Your steps feel very light on the ground."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LIFTING_FIELD_INITIATE"
msgid "You prepare to hover an item close to hand."
msgstr "You prepare to hover an item close to hand."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_STRENGTH_INITIATE"
msgid "You concentrate and prepare to lift something heavy."
msgstr "你集中注意力，准备举起一些重物。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_SHIELD_INITIATE"
msgid "The air around you shimmers slightly."
msgstr "附近的空气微微颤动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEKIN_SUMMON_JACKING_TOOL_INITIATE"
msgid "You ready yourself to lift a car just enough to work on it."
msgstr "你准备好用灵能将车抬高，以便进行修理。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_REMOVE_JACKING_TOOL"
msgid "You let the vehicle settle gently to the ground."
msgstr "你将车辆轻轻地降落到地面上。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEVITATION_INITIATE"
msgid "You begin floating a hand's breadth above the ground."
msgstr "你用灵能对抗重力，于离地一寸处开始漂浮。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKINETIC_THROW_WEIGHT_HANDLER"
msgid "The weight ratio is <u_val:weight_ratio>."
msgstr "The weight ratio is <u_val:weight_ratio>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKINETIC_THROW_WEIGHT_HANDLER"
msgid "The effective spell level is <u_val:telekinesis_shove_spell_level>."
msgstr "The effective spell level is <u_val:telekinesis_shove_spell_level>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKINETIC_THROW_WEIGHT_HANDLER"
msgid ""
"The effective spell level for pulling is "
"<u_val:telekinesis_shove_spell_level>."
msgstr ""
"The effective spell level for pulling is "
"<u_val:telekinesis_shove_spell_level>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEKINETIC_FORCE_SHOVE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Shove a target in a particular direction."
msgstr "Shove a target in a particular direction."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEKINETIC_MOVE_LARGE_WEIGHT_SELECTOR"
msgid "Shove a target in particular direction."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEKINETIC_MOVE_LARGE_WEIGHT_SELECTOR"
msgid "Pull something toward you."
msgstr "将物品或生物拉近你。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_concentration"
msgid "[Ψ]Concentration Trance (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]专注催眠(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_concentration ( [Ψ]Concentration Trance
#. (C) )"
msgid ""
"Focus your own mind into a trance state, increasing learning speed.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"将自己的思维调整到一种近似于催眠的状态中，提高学习速度。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_shield ( [Ψ]Telepathic Shield (C) )"
msgid ""
"You can protect your mind from the dangers of the post-Cataclysmic world.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"你可以保护自己的思维免受后灾变世界的危险。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_mesmerize"
msgid "[Ψ]Mesmerize"
msgstr "[Ψ]Mesmerize"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_mesmerize ( [Ψ]Mesmerize )"
msgid ""
"Hypnotize a target, causing them to stand in a trance or wander around in a "
"small area.  Any damage taken will snap the target out of their trance.  Some "
"targets are more resistant to mesmerism than others."
msgstr ""
"Hypnotize a target, causing them to stand in a trance or wander around in a "
"small area.  Any damage taken will snap the target out of their trance.  Some "
"targets are more resistant to mesmerism than others."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_morale"
msgid "[Ψ]Mood Stabilization (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]稳定情绪(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_morale ( [Ψ]Mood Stabilization (C) )"
msgid ""
"With the ability to edit others' thoughts comes the ability to edit your own, "
"removing negative moods to a degree.  You have also learned to do this more "
"subtly on others, calming their anger or assuaging their fears.\n"
"\n"
"When used on yourself, this power <color_yellow>is maintained by "
"concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if "
"<color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"能修改他人的思想自然也能修改自己的思想，这使你得以在一定程度上消除负面情绪。同时，你也学会了在别人身上更巧妙地做到这一点，平息他们的愤怒或缓解他们的恐惧。\n"
"\n"
"将此项灵能施加到自身时，<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_"
"yellow>打断专注</color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_blast ( [Ψ]Synaptic Overload )"
msgid "Short-circuit and overwhelm a target's brain, causing extreme damage or death."
msgstr "短路并超载目标的大脑，造成极大的伤害甚至死亡。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_animal_mind_control"
msgid "[Ψ]Beastmaster"
msgstr "[Ψ]野兽操控"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_animal_mind_control ( [Ψ]Beastmaster )"
msgid ""
"Take control of an animal's mind, forcing it to obey you.  This power will "
"not work on insects, spiders, or similar beings."
msgstr "控制动物的思维，强迫它服从你。这种灵能对昆虫、蜘蛛等生物无效。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_fear"
msgid "[Ψ]Primal Terror"
msgstr "[Ψ]原始恐惧"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telepathic_fear ( [Ψ]Primal Terror )"
msgid "You unleash your target's fears."
msgstr "你引发目标最原始的恐惧。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_invisibility"
msgid "[Ψ]Obscurity"
msgstr "[Ψ]心理隐身"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_invisibility ( [Ψ]Obscurity )"
msgid ""
"Use a light touch on others' minds to hide your presence.  You will be "
"invisible to the target(s) while the power is in effect.\n"
"\n"
"This power is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color> with your "
"target."
msgstr ""
"以难以察觉的方式影响他人的思维，从心理上隐藏自己的存在。当灵能生效时，目标将不能看见你。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_red>进入战斗失效</color>。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telepathic_invisibility ( [Ψ]Obscurity )"
msgid "You hide your presence from your enemies."
msgstr "你隐藏你的存在，不让敌人发现。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_blast_radius"
msgid "[Ψ]Psychic Scream"
msgstr "[Ψ]心灵尖啸"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_blast_radius ( [Ψ]Psychic Scream )"
msgid ""
"Emit an uncontrolled psychic scream, attacking the mind of anyone nearby.  "
"This power does not distinguish between friend and foe."
msgstr "发出一种不受控制的心灵尖叫，攻击附近任何人的思想。这种灵能不区分朋友和敌人。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telepathic_blast_radius ( [Ψ]Psychic Scream )"
msgid "You unleash a mind-piercing psionic shriek!"
msgstr "你释放出一声直达心理的刺耳灵能尖叫！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_beast_taming"
msgid "[Ψ]Beast Tamer"
msgstr "[Ψ]野兽驯服"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_beast_taming ( [Ψ]Beast Tamer )"
msgid ""
"Perform mental surgery on an animal, making it friendly to you for a much "
"longer duration.  The animal must already be friendly, either naturally or "
"through powers such as Beastmastery, in order to be tamed."
msgstr "对动物进行意识改造，使其长时间将你视为朋友。动物必须已经成为同伴。可以是正常驯服，也可以通过其他灵能控制得来。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telepathic_beast_taming ( [Ψ]Beast Tamer )"
msgid "The animal sniffs at your palm."
msgstr "动物凑过来闻了闻你的手掌。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_mind_control"
msgid "[Ψ]Mind Control"
msgstr "[Ψ]心灵控制"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_mind_control ( [Ψ]Mind Control )"
msgid "Seize control of the target's mind, forcing them to do your bidding."
msgstr "控制目标的思想，迫使他们听从你的命令。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Message of spell "telepathic_mind_control ( [Ψ]Mind Control )"
msgid "You take control of your target's mind!"
msgstr "你掌控了目标的思维！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Name of spell "telepathic_network"
msgid "[Ψ]Network Effect"
msgstr "[Ψ]网络效应"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy.json
#. ~ Description of spell "telepathic_network ( [Ψ]Network Effect )"
msgid ""
"Forge an unconscious telepathic network between you and nearby allies, "
"allowing you all to send and receive information about nearby dangers and "
"react more quickly in combat.  The network requires at least one ally nearby "
"to be effective."
msgstr "在你和附近的盟友之间形成一个无意识的心灵感应网络，让你们都能发送和接收附近危险的信息，并在战斗中做出更快的反应。 该网络需要附近至少有一名盟友才能生效。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_CONCENTRATION_INITIATE"
msgid "Your vision narrows to what is directly in front of you as you concentrate."
msgstr "你的视野缩小到你专注的正前方。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_INITIATE_SELF"
msgid "You begin to edit out your discouraging thoughts."
msgstr "你开始修改抹除自己的负面情绪。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE"
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE"
msgid "You mesmerize your target and they stand in a daze."
msgstr "You mesmerize your target and they stand in a daze."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE"
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE"
msgid "Your target resists the mesmerism!"
msgstr "Your target resists the mesmerism!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE"
msgid "You mesmerize the alien creature and it stands in a daze."
msgstr "You mesmerize the alien creature and it stands in a daze."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MESMERIZE"
msgid "You mesmerize the feral human and they stand in a daze."
msgstr "You mesmerize the feral human and they stand in a daze."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_NPC_VALUES_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_NPC_VALUES"
#. ~ NPC message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_MONSTER_VALUES_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_MONSTER_VALUES"
msgid "You reach in and, with a deft touch, sooth your target's negative emotions."
msgstr "You reach in and, with a deft touch, sooth your target's negative emotions."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_NPC_VALUES_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_NPC_VALUES"
#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_MONSTER_VALUES_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_MONSTER_VALUES"
msgid ""
"You attempt to edit the target's mood, but your powers slam into a smooth, "
"unyielding barrier and slide off."
msgstr ""
"You attempt to edit the target's mood, but your powers slam into a smooth, "
"unyielding barrier and slide off."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MORALE_MODIFY_NPC_VALUES"
msgid "You don't want to risk affecting the target's mind too quickly, and withdraw."
msgstr "You don't want to risk affecting the target's mind too quickly, and withdraw."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ Player spell casting message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_NETWORK_ALLY_CHECK"
msgid "You now have an instinctive awareness of your allies, and they of you."
msgstr "你现在对你的同伴有种本能感知，他们对你也是如此。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telepathy_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_NETWORK_ALLY_CHECK"
msgid "With no nearby allies, there is no one to network with."
msgstr "没有同伴在附近，你找不到人来组建网络。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_blink"
msgid "[Ψ]Blink"
msgstr "[Ψ]闪现"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_blink ( [Ψ]Blink )"
msgid ""
"Step briefly into the void between dimensions and emerge at a random nearby "
"location.\n"
"\n"
"The power <color_red>will fail</color> if the volume of your carried gear is "
"too great."
msgstr ""
"Step briefly into the void between dimensions and emerge at a random nearby "
"location.\n"
"\n"
"The power <color_red>will fail</color> if the volume of your carried gear is "
"too great."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_slow"
msgid "[Ψ]Stutterstep"
msgstr "[Ψ]卡顿步伐"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_slow ( [Ψ]Stutterstep )"
msgid ""
"Manipulate space to increase relative distance around the target, reducing "
"their speed."
msgstr "操纵空间来增加目标周围的相对距离，降低他们的速度。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Message of spell "teleport_slow ( [Ψ]Stutterstep )"
msgid "You warp the space around your enemies!"
msgstr "你扭曲了敌人周围的空间！"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_phase"
msgid "[Ψ]Phase"
msgstr "[Ψ]相位"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_phase ( [Ψ]Phase )"
msgid ""
"By stepping for a moment into the void between dimensions, you can bypass a "
"wall or walk from the ground to the roof of a house."
msgstr "通过短暂穿行于维度之间的空隙，你可以穿透墙壁或从地面穿行至屋顶。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_item_apport"
msgid "[Ψ]Apportation"
msgstr "[Ψ]隔空投送"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_item_apport ( [Ψ]Apportation )"
msgid ""
"Rather than teleporting yourself, you could teleport an item you're holding "
"somewhere nearby without having to follow it to its destination.\n"
"\n"
"Items that are <color_yellow>too large</color> cannot be apported."
msgstr ""
"你可以将你持有的物品传送到附近的某个地方，而无需亲自搬运。\n"
"\n"
"<color_yellow>太大</color>的物品无法被传送"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_stride"
msgid "[Ψ]Extended Stride (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]扩展步幅(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_stride ( [Ψ]Extended Stride (C) )"
msgid ""
"By warping space to shorten distances, you can make each of your movements "
"carry you much further.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"通过折叠空间来缩短距离，你的每一步都能你走得更远。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Message of spell "teleport_stride ( [Ψ]Extended Stride (C) )"
msgid "Your steps devour the distance."
msgstr "你踏出的每一步似乎都在让距离凭空消失。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_transpose"
msgid "[Ψ]Transposition"
msgstr "[Ψ]换位"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_transpose ( [Ψ]Transposition )"
msgid ""
"Entangle yourself with your target's position and, with a twist, swap places "
"with them."
msgstr "把你自己和你目标的位置纠缠在一起，扭转一下，和他们交换位置。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Message of spell "teleport_transpose ( [Ψ]Transposition )"
msgid ""
"There is a moment of darkness and terrible cold, and you are somewhere else, "
"and so is your target."
msgstr "随着短暂的黑暗和令人毛骨悚然的寒冷，你和目标的位置都交换了。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_displacement"
msgid "[Ψ]Displacement"
msgstr "[Ψ]强制传送"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_displacement ( [Ψ]Displacement )"
msgid ""
"With a touch, you can send your target through the void to re-emerge "
"somewhere nearby, further away from you.  Targets that are <color_yellow>too "
"large</color> cannot be displaced."
msgstr ""
"With a touch, you can send your target through the void to re-emerge "
"somewhere nearby, further away from you.  Targets that are <color_yellow>too "
"large</color> cannot be displaced."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_reactive_displacement"
msgid "[Ψ]Reactive Displacement (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]反应式强制传送(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_reactive_displacement ( [Ψ]Reactive
#. Displacement (C) )"
msgid ""
"Maintain a field of unstable space around you, allowing you to effortlessly "
"teleport enemies that strike you further away.  Unfortunately, their attacks "
"will still hurt you as normal.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"在你的周围维持一个不稳定的空间场，让你能毫不费力地将攻击你的敌人传送到远处。不幸的是，他们的攻击仍然会像往常一样伤害你。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_reactive_displacement_teleport"
msgid "[Ψ]Reactive Displacement (C) - Teleport"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_reactive_displacement_teleport (
#. [Ψ]Reactive Displacement (C) - Teleport )"
msgid ""
"The actual teleport effect of reactive displacement.  Having this spell is a "
"bug."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_collapse"
msgid "[Ψ]Spacial Vortex"
msgstr "[Ψ]空间漩涡"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_collapse ( [Ψ]Spacial Vortex )"
msgid ""
"Affect the fabric of space, changing relative distance around a point so that "
"everything moving within finds themselves moving towards it."
msgstr "影响空间结构，改变范围内的所有东西相对某点的距离，无论怎么移动，最终都在向中心点靠近。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Message of spell "teleport_collapse ( [Ψ]Spacial Vortex )"
msgid ""
"The air around your enemies shimmers as their forward motion carries them "
"rapidly towards each other."
msgstr "敌人周围的空气随着他们移动不断闪烁，任何挣扎都只是让他们随漩涡移动得更快。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_relocation"
msgid "[Ψ]Relocation"
msgstr "[Ψ]Relocation"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_relocation ( [Ψ]Relocation )"
msgid "Transport items in your hands through the Nether to an attuned location."
msgstr "Transport items in your hands through the Nether to an attuned location."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_warped_strikes"
msgid "[Ψ]Warped Strikes (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]Warped Strikes (C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_warped_strikes ( [Ψ]Warped Strikes (C) )"
msgid ""
"By warping space as you attack, you can allow your melee attacks to reach "
"much further than normal.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"By warping space as you attack, you can allow your melee attacks to reach "
"much further than normal.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_ephemeral_walk"
msgid "[Ψ]Ephemeral Walk (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]虚化穿行(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_ephemeral_walk ( [Ψ]Ephemeral Walk (C) )"
msgid ""
"By moving slightly into the void between dimensions, you can exist in a state "
"that allows effortless travel through obstacles."
msgstr "只要稍微涉足维度之间的空隙，你就能处于一种可以毫不费力地穿越障碍的状态。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_farstep"
msgid "[Ψ]Farstep"
msgstr "[Ψ]远端移动"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_farstep ( [Ψ]Farstep )"
msgid ""
"Skating along the void between dimensions, move to a specific place nearby.\n"
"\n"
"The power <color_red>will fail</color> if the volume of your carried gear is "
"too great."
msgstr ""
"Skating along the void between dimensions, move to a specific place nearby.\n"
"\n"
"The power <color_red>will fail</color> if the volume of your carried gear is "
"too great."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_farstep_real"
msgid "[Ψ]Farstep Real"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_banish"
msgid "[Ψ]Oubliette"
msgstr "[Ψ]异界监牢"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_banish ( [Ψ]Oubliette )"
msgid ""
"Teleport the target through the nether to some other dimension.  They are "
"technically not dead, but they are no longer your concern.  Oubliette will "
"occasionally fail when used against very powerful enemies, or succeed but "
"cause damage to the teleporter."
msgstr "通过异界将目标传送到其他维度。他们并不会直接因此死亡，但也不能再威胁到你了。传送非常强大敌人时，异界监牢可能会失效，就算成功也会对施法者造成伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_loci_establishment"
msgid "[Ψ]Loci Establishment (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]锚点设立(C)"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_loci_establishment ( [Ψ]Loci Establishment
#. (C) )"
msgid ""
"Start concentrating on your current location, allowing you to return here at "
"will with the [Ψ]Loci Technique power.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"开始专注于记录能当前的位置，以便于通过施展“[Ψ]锚点回归”来回到锚点。\n"
"\n"
"此项灵能<color_yellow>需要专注维持</color>，可能<color_red>失效</color>于<color_yellow>打断专注</"
"color>后。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_loci_technique"
msgid "[Ψ]Loci Technique"
msgstr "[Ψ]锚点回归"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_loci_technique ( [Ψ]Loci Technique )"
msgid ""
"Transport yourself through the nether to your established loci location.  You "
"must currently be concentrating on your [Ψ]Loci Establishment (C) for this to "
"function."
msgstr "通过异界将自己传送到设立好的锚点。传送前必须先使用[Ψ]锚点设立 (C)与目的地同调。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_gateway"
msgid "[Ψ]Gateway"
msgstr "[Ψ]空间传送"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_gateway ( [Ψ]Gateway )"
msgid ""
"Transport yourself through the Nether to an attuned location.  You must "
"attune yourself to the place you wish to travel to.\n"
"\n"
"The power <color_red>will fail</color> if the volume of your carried gear is "
"too great."
msgstr ""
"Transport yourself through the Nether to an attuned location.  You must "
"attune yourself to the place you wish to travel to.\n"
"\n"
"The power <color_red>will fail</color> if the volume of your carried gear is "
"too great."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_dilated_gateway"
msgid "[Ψ]Dilated Gateway"
msgstr "[Ψ]Dilated Gateway"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_dilated_gateway ( [Ψ]Dilated Gateway )"
msgid ""
"Transport yourself and every adjacent creature to a chosen location.  You "
"must have already attuned an area with [Ψ]Gateway."
msgstr ""
"Transport yourself and every adjacent creature to a chosen location.  You "
"must have already attuned an area with [Ψ]Gateway."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_dilated_gateway_teleport_others"
msgid "[Ψ]Dilated Gateway - Teleport Others"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_dilated_gateway_teleport_others (
#. [Ψ]Dilated Gateway - Teleport Others )"
msgid ""
"The spell that actually teleports the adjacent targets.  Should only be "
"casted via teleport_gateway_other's EOC."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_dilated_gateway_teleport_self"
msgid "[Ψ]Dilated Gateway - Teleport Self"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_dilated_gateway_teleport_self ( [Ψ]Dilated
#. Gateway - Teleport Self )"
msgid ""
"The spell that actually teleports the player.  Should only be casted via "
"teleport_gateway_other's EOC."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_summon"
msgid "[Ψ]Breach"
msgstr "[Ψ]异界裂口"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_summon ( [Ψ]Breach )"
msgid ""
"Open a brief passage to the Nether using yourself or an enemy as an anchor "
"and allow one (or more) of its inhabitants to come through.  You have no "
"control over what finds the doorway and no ability to command it when it "
"arrives.\n"
"\n"
"Remember that some denizens of the Nether die instantly in sunlight."
msgstr ""
"利用你自己或敌人作为相位锚，短暂开启一条通往异界的通道，并使一个（或多个）异界生物通过。你无法控制找到传送门的生物，也无法在它抵达主位面后指挥它。\n"
"\n"
"记住，有些异界生物在阳光下会立即死亡。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_warper_combat"
msgid "[Ψ]Flickerflash Stance"
msgstr "[Ψ]Flickerflash Stance"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_warper_combat ( [Ψ]Flickerflash Stance )"
msgid ""
"Through constant contraction and expansion of nearby space, as well as "
"near-constant micro-teleports less than decimeter in distance, you can "
"increase the effective momentum behind your strikes, make your exact position "
"nearly impossible to determine, and your blows nearly impossible to stop.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual."
msgstr ""
"Through constant contraction and expansion of nearby space, as well as "
"near-constant micro-teleports less than decimeter in distance, you can "
"increase the effective momentum behind your strikes, make your exact position "
"nearly impossible to determine, and your blows nearly impossible to stop.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and "
"<color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is "
"interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more "
"concentration</color> than usual."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Name of spell "teleport_reality_tear"
msgid "[Ψ]Reality Tear"
msgstr "[Ψ]时空裂隙"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
#. ~ Description of spell "teleport_reality_tear ( [Ψ]Reality Tear )"
msgid ""
"Make your own contribution to the Cataclysm by opening a rift in reality, "
"allowing all manners of netherium creatures access to Earth.  The rift is "
"temporary…hopefully."
msgstr ""
"Make your own contribution to the Cataclysm by opening a rift in reality, "
"allowing all manners of netherium creatures access to Earth.  The rift is "
"temporary…hopefully."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_STRIDE_INITIATE"
msgid "Your steps are taking you further than your eyes tell you they should."
msgstr "你的每一步都走得比眼睛预计得更远。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_WARPED_STRIKES_INITIATE"
msgid "You are ready to momentarily warp space to coincide with your attacks."
msgstr "You are ready to momentarily warp space to coincide with your attacks."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_EPHEMERAL_WALK_INITIATE"
msgid "You feel a strange coolness as matter around you feels somehow less solid."
msgstr "You feel a strange coolness as matter around you feels somehow less solid."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_REACTIVE_DISPLACEMENT_INITIATE"
msgid "You are prepared to displace your attackers."
msgstr "You are prepared to displace your attackers."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_LOCI_ESTABLISHMENT_INITIATE"
msgid "You've established a locus to return to later."
msgstr "你已经设定了一个稍后能回来的地方。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_concentration_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_WARPER_COMBAT_INITIATE"
msgid "The world jerks as you start continually blinking from place to place."
msgstr "The world jerks as you start continually blinking from place to place."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_SELF_CARRIED_VOLUME_CHECKER"
msgid "Your carried volume is <u_val:teleport_total_carried_volume>."
msgstr "Your carried volume is <u_val:teleport_total_carried_volume>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_BLINK_INITIATE"
msgid "Your Blink volume limit is <context_val:teleport_blink_limit>."
msgstr "Your Blink volume limit is <context_val:teleport_blink_limit>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_BLINK_INITIATE"
msgid "You vanish and reappear nearby."
msgstr "你突然消失，然后出现在附近。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_BLINK_INITIATE"
msgid ""
"You attempt to teleport to somewhere nearby, but your skin merely tingles and "
"nothing happens.  You're carrying too much."
msgstr ""
"You attempt to teleport to somewhere nearby, but your skin merely tingles and "
"nothing happens.  You're carrying too much."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_PHASE_INITIATE"
msgid "Your Phase volume limit is <context_val:teleport_blink_limit>."
msgstr "Your Phase volume limit is <context_val:teleport_blink_limit>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_PHASE_INITIATE"
msgid ""
"There is a brief moment of darkness and terrible cold, and you are somewhere "
"else."
msgstr "随着极短的黑暗和令人毛骨悚然的寒冷，你出现在了其他地方。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_PHASE_INITIATE"
msgid ""
"You attempt to phase through the barrier, but your skin merely tingles and "
"nothing happens.  You're carrying too much."
msgstr ""
"You attempt to phase through the barrier, but your skin merely tingles and "
"nothing happens.  You're carrying too much."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_ITEM_QUALIFIES" in
#. nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_NEXT" in nested EOCs on true condition in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT"
msgid "Select apport location."
msgstr "Select apport location."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_ITEM_QUALIFIES"
#. in nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_NEXT" in nested EOCs on true condition in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT"
msgid "You cannot apport an item inside a solid object."
msgstr "You cannot apport an item inside a solid object."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_ITEM_QUALIFIES"
#. in nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_NEXT" in nested EOCs on true condition in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT"
msgid "The item in your hands grows freezing cold for a moment before vanishing."
msgstr "The item in your hands grows freezing cold for a moment before vanishing."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_ITEM_DOES_NOT_QUALIFY" in nested EOCs on false
#. condition in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_NEXT" in nested EOCs
#. on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT"
msgid "The air around the item wavers, but nothing happens.  The item is too large."
msgstr "The air around the item wavers, but nothing happens.  The item is too large."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT_FAIL" in nested
#. EOCs on false condition in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_ITEM_APPORT"
msgid "You must be holding something to apport it."
msgstr "You must be holding something to apport it."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in then
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_DISPLACEMENT_CHECK"
msgid "As <u_name> strikes you, they are suddenly somewhere else"
msgstr "As <u_name> strikes you, they are suddenly somewhere else"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in then
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_DISPLACEMENT_CHECK"
msgid "You touch <u_name> and they are suddenly somewhere else"
msgstr "You touch <u_name> and they are suddenly somewhere else"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_DISPLACEMENT_CHECK"
msgid "You touch <u_name> but nothing happens.  They are too big to teleport."
msgstr "You touch <u_name> but nothing happens.  They are too big to teleport."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_FARSTEP_INITIATE"
msgid "Your Blink volume limit is <context_val:teleport_farstep_limit>."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_FARSTEP_INITIATE"
msgid "There is a moment of darkness and terrible cold, and you are somewhere else."
msgstr "随着短暂的黑暗和令人毛骨悚然的寒冷，你出现在了其他地方。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORTER_OUBLIETTE_HANDLING"
msgid "Your target wavers for a moment, but nothing happens."
msgstr "你的目标摇晃了几下，但什么都没有发生。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORTER_OUBLIETTE_HANDLING_2"
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORTER_OUBLIETTE_HANDLING_2"
msgid "With a tremendous mental exertion, you hurl your target…elsewhere."
msgstr "With a tremendous mental exertion, you hurl your target…elsewhere."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORTER_GATEWAY_MESSAGE_CARRYING_TOO_MUCH"
msgid ""
"You attempt to teleport to your destination, but your skin merely tingles and "
"nothing happens.  You're carrying too much."
msgstr ""
"You attempt to teleport to your destination, but your skin merely tingles and "
"nothing happens.  You're carrying too much."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORTER_ATTUNING_MESSAGE"
msgid ""
"You concentrate and begin memorizing every detail of the current area you are "
"in."
msgstr "你集中精神，开始记忆你所在区域的每一个细节。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORTER_ATTUNED_MESSAGE"
msgid ""
"You have successfully memorized the local area, and may now return to it with "
"your powers."
msgstr "你成功记住了这片区域，现在你可以使用你的能力返回这里。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_GATEWAY_SELECTOR"
msgid "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_1>"
msgstr "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_1>"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_GATEWAY_SELECTOR"
msgid "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_2>"
msgstr "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_2>"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_GATEWAY_SELECTOR"
msgid "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_3>"
msgstr "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_3>"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_GATEWAY_SELECTOR"
msgid "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_4>"
msgstr "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_4>"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_GATEWAY_SELECTOR"
msgid "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_5>"
msgstr "Gateway: <u_val:gateway_destination_name_5>"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_GATEWAY_SELECTOR"
