msgstr "Your target has no biology to affect!"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKINESIS_RETURN_FROM_DEATH"
msgid "As the wounds overtake you, you feel your powers go into overdrive."
msgstr "当伤口出现时，你感到自己的灵能开始加速。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_OXYGEN_ABSORPTION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could use your powers to make "
"your skin selectively permeable to oxygen, allowing you to breathe "
"underwater, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以利用灵能使得氧气选择性地透过皮肤，从而让你在水下呼吸。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_FLEXIBILITY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could twist your joints and "
"relax your muscles far beyond the capability of a baseline human, allowing "
"you to escape shackles and adeptly dodge blows for a brief period, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可用以远超普通人的程度扭转关节，收缩肌肉，从而在一段时间内摆脱束缚并灵巧地躲避攻击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_DASH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could supercharge your muscles "
"to move incredibly quickly for brief periods, if you can figure out the "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以强化肌肉，在短时间内移动得非常快。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_ARMOR_SKIN"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could harden your skin to "
"protect yourself from damage, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以硬化皮肤来保护自己免受伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_CLIMATE_CONTROL"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could adapt your physiology to "
"be comfortable in hotter or colder temperatures, if you can figure out the "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以调节生理机能，以适应更热或更冷的温度。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_ADRENALINE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could control your adrenaline, "
"unleashing a surge of it on command when you need it, if you can figure out "
"the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以控制你的肾上腺素，在需要的时候命令性地释放一股肾上腺素激增。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_ENHANCE_MOBILITY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enhance your skin "
"tension and joint flexibility to make your gear much less encumbering, if you "
"can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以增强皮肤张力和关节灵活性，使穿着的装备更加轻便。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_HAMMERHAND"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could replicate simple tools "
"with your body, applying enough torque to turn bolts with your fingers or "
"enough force to hammer a nail with your thumb, if you can figure out the "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以用你的身体代替简单的工具，用手指施加足够的扭矩来拧紧螺栓，或者用拇指施加足够的力量来钉击钉子。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_REFLEX_ENHANCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enhance your sensory "
"acuity and reaction time, spotting threats from further away and moving more "
"quickly to counter them, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以增强你的感官敏锐度和反应时间，从更远的地方发现威胁并更快地采取对策。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_SEALED_SYSTEM"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  With an enormously deep breath and "
"an alteration to your skin, you could protect yourself from harmful gases, "
"electricity, radiation, and other deleterious conditions, if you can figure "
"out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以通过深呼吸操控你的皮肤，保护自己免受有害气体、电力、辐射和其他有害条件的影响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_METABOLISM_ENHANCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enhance your metabolism "
"to a preternatural degree, eating only once a day and sleeping every two to "
"three days, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，可以增强新陈代谢效率到超自然的程度，每天只需进食一次，每两到三天睡一次觉。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_VITAMINOSIS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can refine specific elements "
"of your metabolism with an incredible amount of focus, allowing you to "
"directly convert your stored calories into vitamins."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can refine specific elements "
"of your metabolism with an incredible amount of focus, allowing you to "
"directly convert your stored calories into vitamins."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_GUIDED_EVOLUTION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can enforce some control over "
"any changes to your body, allowing you to alter the trajectory of any "
"mutations you experience."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_COMBAT_DANCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Combining enhancements to speed, "
"strength, reaction time, agility, and coordination, you could enter a battle "
"trance like the legendary berserkergang, but with full control over your "
"mind, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr ""
"对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以同时增强速度、力量、反应、敏捷和协调性，以进入一种战斗催眠状态，却不失去对思维的控制，就像传说中的"
"狂战士一样。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_PERFECTED_MOTION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_LEARNING_HURRICANE_BLOWS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could maintain a speed boost "
"for an extended period of time, traveling a dozen meters in the blink of an "
"eye, and avoiding any difficult terrain while doing so, if you can figure out "
"the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以保持速度爆发，在眨眼之间走过十几米的距离，并且在此过程中避开地形的影响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_PREMONITION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could expand your senses for "
"what is out of place, looking for anything that means harm to you, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以扩展你的感知，察觉任何对你有害的事物。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_SPOT_WEAKNESS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  The same way your eyes can pick "
"out details in pure dark and you can sense hidden dangers, you could find the "
"weaknesses of your enemies, knowing exactly where to strike them, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。就像你的眼睛可以在完全黑暗中辨别细节，感知隐藏的危险那样，如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以找出敌人的弱点，并进行精确地打击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_NIGHT_VISION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enhance your senses to "
"such a degree that you could even \"see\" in the dark, even pitch blackness, "
"if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enhance your senses to "
"such a degree that you could even \"see\" in the dark, even pitch blackness, "
"if you can figure out the proper technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_AURA_SIGHT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could turn your insight on "
"people, looking beyond the surface toward their essential elements, if you "
"can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将自身的洞察力施加在他人身上，透过表象看到本质。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_RANGED_ENHANCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could greatly enhance your "
"vision, making ranged combat much easier as you're able to pinpoint exactly "
"where to shoot, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以大大增强你的视力，使远程作战变得更容易，因为你能够准确地找到射击的位置。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_VOYANCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You perform the classic feat of "
"clairvoyance, throwing your senses to a spot nearby, if you can figure out "
"the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可控制经典的透视术，将感官投射到附近的一个地方。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_DODGE_POWER"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could predict your enemies' "
"movements and attacks, smoothly avoiding danger by not being where they are "
"about to strike, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以预测你的敌人的行动和攻击，通过提前行动丝滑地避开危险。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_CRAFT_BONUS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could use your insight into "
"the near future to speed any manual tasks you do, working smoothly and "
"efficiently to construct or assemble something, if you can figure out the "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以利用对近期未来的洞察力来加快你手头上的任何任务，以流畅高效地构建或组装某物。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_PERFECT_SHOT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could predict the exact "
"trajectory of a bullet, aiming for the perfect spot to do the most damage, if "
"you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以预测子弹的精确轨迹，瞄准最佳位置造成最大的伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_SEE_MAP"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You expand your vision to the "
"surrounding terrain, revealing nearby points of interest and where you should "
"go, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以扩展你的视野到周围的地形，揭示附近的重要地点和你应该去的地方，"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_CLEAR_SIGHT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enhance your senses so "
"much that nothing could cloud them for as long as you maintain your "
"concentration, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以增强你的感官，以至于没有任何东西能够在你保持专注的时间内干扰它们。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_ASTRAL_PROJECTION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could cast your spirit free "
"from your body, wandering as a ghost and spying out your surroundings, if you "
"can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以把灵魂从躯体之中解放出来，像幽灵一样游荡，窥探你的周围环境。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_GROUP_TACTICS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could use your prescience to "
"help direct the flow of battle, calling out orders so your allies can react "
"to dangers before they happen, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以利用你的预知灵能来帮助指挥战斗，提前预警危险，让你的盟友能够做出反应。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/clairsentience.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_LEARNING_OMNISCIENCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could expand your senses to a "
"huge area, seeing every most of dust, every blade of grass, every speck or "
"spot, all simultaneously, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以扩展你的感知范围到一个巨大的区域，同时看到每一粒灰尘，每一根草，每一点或斑点。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_ZAP_ENEMIES"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could use your powers to "
"charge your skin with electricity, shocking and damaging anyone who strikes "
"you, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以利用你的灵能让你的皮肤充满电力，当有人攻击你时会给他们造成电击和伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_MELEE_ATTACKS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could channel electricity "
"through your arms while you attack, adding a shock to the blow, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以在攻击时通过你的手臂传导电力，为攻击施加电击伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_PERSONAL_BATTERY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could extend a galvanic charge "
"outward from your skin, charging any compatible devices you're carrying with "
"you, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以从皮肤向外释放电流，为随身携带的电器设备充电。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_PARALYSIS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could overload an organic "
"target's nervous system, causing seizures and incapacitating them for a brief "
"period, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以过载有机目标的神经系统，使其昏厥，在短时间内失去行动灵能。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_REDUCE_PAIN"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could use your control over "
"nervous systems to reduce the pain you feel and recover from it faster, if "
"you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以利用对神经系统的控制来减轻你感受到的痛苦并更快地恢复。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_HACKING_INTERFACE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could create an electrical "
"interface to hack nearby devices, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以创造出一个能黑掉附近的电子设备的接口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_LIGHTNING_BOLT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could extend your electrical "
"discharges, unleashing blasts of lightning at your enemies, if you can figure "
"out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以延伸你的放电灵能，向敌人释放闪电冲击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_RECHARGE_VEHICLE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could charge vehicle or "
"residential batteries instead of just the small ones in portable devices, if "
"you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以为载具或电网充电，而不仅限于便携设备。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_PAIN_IMMUNE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could block the pain signals "
"in your body entirely for a short time, letting you fight on through hideous "
"wounds, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could block the pain signals "
"in your body entirely for a short time, letting you fight on through hideous "
"wounds, if you can figure out the technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_SPEED_BOOST"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enhance your reflexes "
"and synaptic reaction time, both moving and thinking faster, if you can "
"figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以提高你的反应灵能和神经元反应时间，无论是在移动还是思考上都更快。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_ROBOT_INTERFACE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could directly manipulate a "
"nearby robot's circuitry, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以创造出一个能操纵附近的机器人的接口。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_KILL_ROBOT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  With a single overwhelming power "
"surge, you could overload and destroy a robotic or cybernetic enemy, if you "
"can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，通过一次巨大的灵能冲击，你可以过载并摧毁机器人或生化人。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_LIGHTNING_AURA"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could charge the air around "
"you with so much electricity that lightning would lash out at anyone around "
"you, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以让你周围的空气充斥过盈电流，让闪电攻击任何靠近你的人。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_LIGHTNING_BLAST"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Not only could you hurl a bolt of "
"lightning, but an actual thunderbolt that causes an explosion at the point of "
"impact, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你不仅可以放出一束电流，甚至是释放一道真正的雷电，在接触引发爆炸。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/electrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LEARNING_REVIVE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could charge a corpse's "
"nervous system, manipulating the signals and forcing dead flesh to move and "
"fight for you, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以给尸体的神经系统充电，操纵信号，迫使尸体移动并为你战斗。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/overall.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PSI_STUDYING_POWER_INITIAL_SETUP"
msgid "You attempt to unlock new capabilities within your mind."
msgstr "你尝试掌握脑中的新灵能。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/overall.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PSI_STUDYING_POWER_BEGIN"
msgid "You spend some time meditating and contemplating your powers."
msgstr "你花了一些时间冥想和思考你的灵能。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/overall.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_PSI_STUDYING_POWER_BEGIN"
msgid "You are too exhausted to contemplate anything."
msgstr "You are too exhausted to contemplate anything."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/overall.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PRACTICE_PSIONICS_FINAL_LEARNING_CHECK"
msgid ""
"You are studying <spell_name:<u_val:latest_studied_power_name>> whose ID is "
"<u_val:latest_studied_power_name> with Difficulty "
"<u_val:latest_studied_power_difficulty> and requires the "
"<u_val:latest_studied_power_proficiency> proficiency"
msgstr ""
"You are studying <spell_name:<u_val:latest_studied_power_name>> whose ID is "
"<u_val:latest_studied_power_name> with Difficulty "
"<u_val:latest_studied_power_difficulty> and requires the "
"<u_val:latest_studied_power_proficiency> proficiency"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/overall.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PRACTICE_PSIONICS_FINAL_LEARNING_CHECK"
msgid ""
"As you meditate, all the pieces suddenly come together.  You've unlocked: "
"<spell_name:<u_val:latest_studied_power_name>>."
msgstr ""
"As you meditate, all the pieces suddenly come together.  You've unlocked: "
"<spell_name:<u_val:latest_studied_power_name>>."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/overall.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PRACTICE_PSIONICS_FINAL_LEARNING_CHECK"
msgid "You just couldn't manage to grasp the technique.  You'll have to try again."
msgstr "你仍没有掌握到技术要领。或许你得再试试。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_LIGHT_UP_ENEMY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Creating light in a single place "
"is easy, but you could outline another being in light, marking their location "
"and making it harder for them to avoid attack, if you can figure out the "
"proper technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Creating light in a single place "
"is easy, but you could outline another being in light, marking their location "
"and making it harder for them to avoid attack, if you can figure out the "
"proper technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_SNUFF_LIGHT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Just like you can create light, "
"you could extinguish it, plunging an area into darkness, if you can figure "
"out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，就像你可以创造光一样，你也可以熄灭它，使整片区域陷入黑暗。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTO_LEARNING_LIGHT_DODGE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Instead of simply creating light "
"you could bend it, warping it around yourself and making it hard for enemies "
"to determine your exact position, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你不只是创造光线，还可以弯曲光线，使光线在自身周围扭曲，让敌人难以确定确切位置。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTO_LEARNING_LIGHT_BEAM"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could focus the light you "
"create, making it a searing beam capable of burning your enemies, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将创造出的光聚焦，使其成为能够燃烧敌人的灼热光束。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTO_LEARNING_CAMOUFLAGE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could bend the light not only "
"around yourself, but around your nearby surroundings, blending them together "
"and making yourself very difficult to spot from a distance, if you can figure "
"out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你不仅可以弯曲自身周围的光线，还可以弯曲周围区域的光线，使其混合在一起，让你很难被发现。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTO_LEARNING_RAD_IMMUNITY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Bending light leads to deflecting "
"it, and you could deflect harmful light and radiation away from yourself, if "
"you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，弯曲光线会导致光线偏转，你可以将有害的光线和辐射偏转远离自己。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_LIGHT_ARMS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could create illusions of your "
"arms and weapons, making it much harder for your enemies to know where you "
"are going to strike, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以创造手臂和武器的幻象，让你的敌人更难判断你所攻击的位置。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_HIDE_UGLY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  With a full-body wreathe of "
"illusion, you could conceal your form, preventing anyone from reacting poorly "
"to part of your appearance that isn't normal, if you can figure out the "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你能制造出笼罩全身的幻象，隐藏自己的身形，防止他人对你的异常容貌产生负面印象。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_LIGHT_IMAGE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could create an illusion of "
"yourself, or even multiple illusions, confusion your enemies as to where you "
"even are, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你能制造出自身的一个甚至多个幻象，让敌人无法判断出你的位置。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_RADIO"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could read and broadcast radio "
"waves, communicating with anyone else who is left out there, if you can "
"figure out the technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could read and broadcast radio "
"waves, communicating with anyone else who is left out there, if you can "
"figure out the technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_STERILIZE_FOOD"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  With a focused burst of radiation, "
"you could sterilize food, making it last much longer without going rotten, if "
"you can figure out the technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  With a focused burst of radiation, "
"you could sterilize food, making it last much longer without going rotten, if "
"you can figure out the technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_STUN_ROBOTS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Electronics are vulnerable to "
"electromagnetic waves, and light is an electromagnetic wave.  While you "
"couldn't destroy electronics, you can overload them and cause them to fail "
"for a brief time."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Electronics are vulnerable to "
"electromagnetic waves, and light is an electromagnetic wave.  While you "
"couldn't destroy electronics, you can overload them and cause them to fail "
"for a brief time."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_INVISIBILITY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could bend light completely "
"around yourself, concealing your existence entirely, if you can figure out "
"the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将身体周围的光线弯折，完全隐藏自身的存在。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_LIGHT_FLASH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could expand the usage of "
"focused light, creating a wide beam capable of searing entire groups of "
"enemies, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以扩大聚焦光线的使用范围，创造出一道能够灼烧整群敌人的灼热光束。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_LIGHT_BLINDING_GLARE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Enhancing your generation of light "
"to an extreme level, you could glow brighter than a floodlight and blind "
"anyone who attempts to attack you, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你创造出的光线强度极度提高，可以发出比车头灯更亮的光芒，并使任何试图攻击你的人失明。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_LIGHT_DISINTEGRATE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could pour so much energy into "
"a target that their body begins to disintegrate, doing immense damage, if you "
"can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以向目标注入大量灵能，导致身体开始崩溃，造成巨大的伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/photokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LEARNING_LIGHT_ARMY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could summon multiple "
"duplicates, dozens, even more, a veritable legion of holographic clones to "
"allow you confuse and dazzle your enemies, if you can figure out the "
"technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could summon multiple "
"duplicates, dozens, even more, a veritable legion of holographic clones to "
"allow you confuse and dazzle your enemies, if you can figure out the "
"technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_CAUTERIZE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could focus your heat and sear "
"bleeding wounds shut, stopping bleeding instantly at the cost of a small "
"amount of further damage, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以控制火焰，烧灼流血的伤口使其停止出血，但会造成一点额外的损伤。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_CALL_FLAMES"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  With a bit of concentration you "
"could keep a fire going through your powers alone, burning on air and "
"providing a source of heat and light without needing fuel, if you can figure "
"out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你就可以通过自己的灵能维持一团火焰，只靠空气燃烧并提供热量和光线，而不需要燃料。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_QUELL_FLAMES"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Just as you can start fires, you "
"could also stop them, harmlessly dispersing the heat and dissipating existing "
"flames, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，就像你可以起火一样，你也可以灭掉它，将热量无害地驱散从而熄灭火焰。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_CLOAK"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could heat the air around "
"yourself to an even greater degree, maintaining comfort and a pleasant "
"temperature in the depths of winter, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以加热自身周围的空气，在寒冬中保持舒适宜人的温度。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_FLAMETHROWER"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than focusing on a point, "
"you could spew a swath of flames, damaging a whole group of enemies, if you "
"can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以喷射一片火焰，对一整群敌人造成伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_LANCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could focus your heat into a "
"searing line, capable of welding or cutting through metal, if you can figure "
"out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将你的热量集中到一条灼热的线上，能够焊接或切割金属。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_THERMOGENESIS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could heat the air itself, "
"making an entire room warm, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以加热空气本身，使整个房间变暖。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_AURA"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could heat the air around "
"yourself burning hot, injuring anyone engaged in melee combat with you, if "
"you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以加热你周围的空气，使与你进行近战战斗的任何人受伤。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_FLAME_IMMUNITY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Your control over temperature is "
"strong enough that you could keep yourself completely shielded from it, "
"becoming totally immune to flame and heat, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你对温度的控制足够强大，可以完全将自己保护起来，对火焰和热量完全免疫。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_BLAST"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  With enough focused heat you could "
"unleash an explosion, catching multiple enemies in its wake, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，通过足够集中的热量，你可以引发一次爆炸，卷入多个敌人。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_AOE_BLAST"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could build the heat up around "
"yourself quickly enough to cause an expanding explosion and protect yourself "
"from its effects, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以迅速地在自己周围积聚热量，引发一次爆炸，并保护自己免受其影响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/pyrokinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_LEARNING_INCINERATION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  By focusing all of your power on a "
"single point, you could raise the temperature there thousands of degrees, "
"incinerating whatever you're focused on, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，通过引导灵能集中于一处，你可以将那里的温度提高数千度，将任何目标焚烧殆尽。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_NOISEMAKER"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could use a quick burst of "
"telekinetic force to create noise, luring enemies away from you or toward a "
"trapped location, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以使用快速爆发的念动力来制造噪音，引诱敌人远离你或走进陷阱。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_SLAM_DOWN"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Instead of just shoving someone "
"away from your location, you could direct the force orthogonally to knock "
"someone to the ground, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以引导灵能将目标击倒在地，而不只是从身边将其推离开。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_MOMENTUM"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Instead of just applying all of "
"your force at once, you could apply it gradually to all movement around you, "
"making yourself slightly faster and anything dangerous slightly slower, if "
"you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，与其一次性施加所有力量，不如逐步操控周围的所有运动，你可以加快自己的速度，同时相对的减慢四周危险的速度。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_SLOWFALL"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could lift yourself just a "
"little, slowing you any time you take a fall and making swimming much easier, "
"if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以克服部分重力，减低摔落的速度，并使游泳变得更容易。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_WAVE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could release force in all "
"directions, knocking back everyone surrounding you all at once, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以释放力量击退四面八方的敌人。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_WATER_WALKING"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could counteract gravity, not "
"enough to fly, but enough to allow surface tension to hold you up so you "
"could walk on water, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could counteract gravity, not "
"enough to fly, but enough to allow surface tension to hold you up so you "
"could walk on water, if you can figure out the proper technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_LIFTING_FIELD"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could hold a single object in "
"place, carrying it next to you without using your hands, if you can figure "
"out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以不用手控制附近的单个物体，将其移动到你的身旁。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_STRENGTH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enhance your own "
"strength, allowing you to pull much heavier objects or smash through study "
"doors and walls, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以增强自己的力量，让你能够拉动更重的物体，或者破坏坚固的门和墙壁。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_HAMMER"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could concentrate your "
"application of force into a blunt instrument, shattering bones and "
"splintering furniture, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将灵能注入到钝器中，击碎骨头或砸烂家具。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_VEHICLE_LIFT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than smashing objects with "
"your telekinetic strength, you could apply it to lifting a car, allowing you "
"to work on the undercarriage without a jack, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，与其使用念动力量砸碎物体，你也可以用它举起车辆，在没有千斤顶的情况下对底盘进行维修。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_SHIELD"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could create a barrier of "
"force around yourself, shielding you from harm, if you can figure out the "
"proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以在自己周围创建一个力场屏障，保护自己免受伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_EXPLOSION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than striking a single "
"point, you could create an explosion of telekinetic force, damaging an entire "
"area, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，与其攻击一点，你可以创造一个念动力的爆炸，破坏整片区域。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_LEVITATION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than simply slowing your "
"fall, you could stop it, completely defying gravity and walking on air, if "
"you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟，如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以彻底克服重力，行走在空中。而不是仅仅减缓下落。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_MEGAKINESIS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could lift truly enormous "
"amounts of weight, hurling huge creatures with a moment of effort, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以举起非常人所能及的重量，毫不费力地投掷体型巨大的生物。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_AEGIS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could take all the energy of a "
"telekinetic shield and pour it into a single instant, forming a barrier "
"strong enough to repel a ballistic missile, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将集中到一个瞬间，形成一个强大的屏障，甚至足以防御弹道导弹。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telekinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEKIN_LEARNING_EARTHSHAKER"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could grab the very earth with "
"your powers, shaking it and causing a minor local earthquake, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以用你的力量控制大地，引发一个小规模的地震。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_SHIELD"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could invert the extreme focus "
"of the concentration trance to make an impenetrable shell around your mind, "
"protecting you from telepathic attack, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将类似专注催眠状态下的焦点反转，在头脑周围形成一个坚不可摧的外壳，保护你免受心灵攻击。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_MESMERIZE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could nudge someone's mind "
"into a self-focused spiral, keeping them in a daze and unaware of the outside "
"world, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could nudge someone's mind "
"into a self-focused spiral, keeping them in a daze and unaware of the outside "
"world, if you can figure out the proper technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_MORALE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  In the same way you prepare your "
"mind for learning, you could buffer it against the stresses of "
"post-Cataclysmic life, editing out unwarranted negative thoughts, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，采用将自己催眠成学习状态相同的手法，你可以缓解大灾变后生活带来的压力，编辑掉不必要的消极想法。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_BLAST"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than any kind of subtle "
"detection or adjustment, you could lash out with your powers, damaging the "
"minds you contact, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，与其进行精细微妙的检测或调整，你可以将灵能猛烈释放出去，破坏所接触的心灵思绪。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_BEASTMASTER"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  The minds of animals are less "
"complex than those of humans.  You should be able to overshadow them, to "
"direct their actions and make them friendly toward you, if you can figure out "
"the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，动物的思想没有人类那么复杂。你应该能够操控它们，指导它们行动，将它们变为同伴。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_CONFUSION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than a clumsy hammer, you "
"could use a telepathic scalpel to cut off the target's connection between "
"their senses and their brain, leaving them stumbling and blind, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，与其像锤子一样笨拙，你可以用灵能手术刀式地切断目标的感官和大脑之间的联系，让目标磕磕绊绊和失明。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_FEAR"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could evoke your target's "
"darkest fears, leaving them frozen in panic or trembling in terror, if you "
"can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以引发目标最深层次的恐惧，让其在惊慌下迟滞或在恐惧中颤抖。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_INVISIBILITY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_AOE_BLAST"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could erase yourself from a "
"target's perceptions, making them completely unable to even know that you're "
"there, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以抹除目标对你的感知，让其完全意识不到你的存在。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_BEAST_TAMING"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can overshadow animal minds "
"for a short time, but it shouldn't be difficult to make further adjustments, "
"to make the animal friendly for weeks or months, if you can figure out the "
"proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以暂时蒙蔽动物的心智，虽然不能直接操控，但也能让其在几周到几个月的时间里将你识别为同伴。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_MIND_CONTROL"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Just as you can control the minds "
"of animals, you could control the minds of humans, or maybe even aliens, if "
"you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你也可以蒙蔽人类、甚至是异界生物的思维，就像你之前操控动物那样。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/telepathy.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_LEARNING_NETWORK"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Thought is far faster than speech, "
"and with your allies nearby you could warn each other of any dangers or enemy "
"weaknesses as fast as thinking, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。思维要远远快过言语。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以直接与同伴进行思维交流，警示敌人的攻击或指出敌人的弱点。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_PHASE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could control your "
"teleporting, traveling short distances without crossing the intervening "
"space, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以控制你的瞬间移动，只在短距离内移动而不穿越中间的空间。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_WARPED_STRIKES"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can maintain an easily "
"modifiable section of warped space around you, which you can warp to allow "
"your attacks to reach much further than they should."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can maintain an easily "
"modifiable section of warped space around you, which you can warp to allow "
"your attacks to reach much further than they should."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_EPHEMERAL_WALK"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can maintain a slight offset "
"from normal space, allowing yourself to effortlessly phase through obstacles "
"while still being able to interact with reality, if you can figure out the "
"proper technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can maintain a slight offset "
"from normal space, allowing yourself to effortlessly phase through obstacles "
"while still being able to interact with reality, if you can figure out the "
"proper technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_ITEM_APPORT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than traveling to a new "
"location yourself, you could send an item you were holding there, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than traveling to a new "
"location yourself, you could send an item you were holding there, if you can "
"figure out the proper technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_STRIDE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than expanding space, you "
"could collapse it, making each of your steps cover a larger area of ground "
"despite not moving any more quickly, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧。你可以将空间折叠，移动没有变快但每一步都能跨越更大的距离，而不是扩展空间。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_TRANSPOSE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could combine moving yourself "
"and moving a target to swap places, moving them to your previous location "
"while you take their place, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将自己的移动和目标的移动结合起来，实现位置的相互交换。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_DISPLACEMENT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could teleport only your "
"target, sending them somewhere nearby away from you, if you can figure out "
"the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将你的目标传送到附近的某个地方，远离你。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_REACTIVE_DISPLACEMENT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could automatically teleport "
"away attacking enemies, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could automatically teleport "
"away attacking enemies, if you can figure out the technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_COLLAPSE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could warp space to such a "
"degree that you could redirect your targets' movement, forcing them to travel "
"toward a central point regardless of their intent, if you can figure out the "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以扭曲空间到一定程度，使你的目标的移动改变方向，使其无法抵抗地朝向中心点移动。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_FARSTEP"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could travel much further "
"distances, crossing dozens of meters in moments, if you can figure out the "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以在瞬间穿越数十米的距离，移动更远的地方。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_BANISH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could send your target "
"somewhere *else*, some other place far from you in the endless parade of "
"realities, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将你的目标传送到*远方*，无尽的现实队列中一个远离你的地方。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_LOCI_ESTABLISHMENT"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could concentrate on a "
"specific location and teleport there at will."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could concentrate on a "
"specific location and teleport there at will."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_GATEWAY"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Once you properly study a location "
"so you're familiar enough with it, you could return there in moments even if "
"you're fifty miles away, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，并且对某个地点进行了足够的研究和熟悉，即使你离它五十英里远，你也可以在瞬间返回那里。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_dilated_gateway"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Just as you can teleport yourself "
"to memorized locations, you can also teleport other beings to those same "
"locations alongside you."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Just as you can teleport yourself "
"to memorized locations, you can also teleport other beings to those same "
"locations alongside you."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_RELOCATION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Just as you can teleport yourself "
"to memorized locations, you can also teleport held items to those same "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Just as you can teleport yourself "
"to memorized locations, you can also teleport held items to those same "
"locations."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_BREACH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Just as you can send a target away "
"from you, you could open up a portal to the Nether and allow some of its "
"denizens to come through to Earth, if you can figure out the technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你也可以打开地狱之门，让异界原住民门踏上地球。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/teleportation.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPORT_LEARNING_REALITY_TEAR"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You are able to open a permanent "
"tear in reality to the Nether, allowing all manners of creatures to pass "
"through to Earth."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You are able to open a permanent "
"tear in reality to the Nether, allowing all manners of creatures to pass "
"through to Earth."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_CONCENTRATED_HEALING"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could reroute stem cells and "
"blood flow to injured parts, speeding their healing at the expense of your "
"uninjured areas, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以引导干细胞和血液前往受伤的地方，以健康部位的部分损伤，换取快速的伤口恢复。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_STOP_BLEEDING"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than merely slowing your "
"bleeding, you could stop it, and clean the wound to encourage healing too, if "
"you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟，如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以彻底进行止血，清理伤口并促进恢复，而仅仅是减缓流血。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_HEALING_TOUCH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  The same way you encourage your "
"own healing and good health, you could use physical contact to provide that "
"same bonus to an ally, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。就像你能加速你自身的恢复，如果找到恰当的技巧，你也可以通过身体接触为同伴提供痊愈效果。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_HURT_TOUCH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than speeding healing, you "
"could slow it, causing damage and especially reducing the preternatural "
"healing of some of the post-Cataclysm creatures out there, if you can figure "
"out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。就像你能促进恢复一样，如果找到恰当的技巧，你也能对目标造成伤害，并显著减慢大灾变后的超自然恢复能力。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_REMOVE_POISON"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could remove poison from your "
"body, carrying it your skin and sweating it out, if you can figure out the "
"proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以将体内的毒素排斥到体表，再随汗液排出，最终彻底消除体内的毒素。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_CURE_DISEASE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Instead of carrying poison to your "
"skin, you could carry antibodies and white blood cells to diseased parts of "
"your body, speeding your recovery time, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。就像你能主动排出体内毒素，如果找到恰当的技巧，你也可以控制抗体和白细胞向指定的目标行动，加快自身的恢复。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_SLEEPING_TRANCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could enter a trance, allowing "
"your mind and body to restore themselves more efficiently than natural sleep, "
"if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以进入一种恍惚的状态，比起睡眠效率更高地恢复身体和精神上的疲劳。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_STOP_INFECTION"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could clean your wounds with "
"an act of will, preventing infection or curing one before it leads to "
"life-threatening problems, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以在一念之间清理好你的伤口，防止感染危及生命。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_HEALING_TRANCE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could sink into a trance, "
"focusing all of your energy on healing and speed your recovery hundreds of "
"times, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以进入一种恍惚的状态，将灵能专注于治疗，百倍增加你的恢复速度。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_ATTACK_TOUCH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  Rather than merely slowing your "
"enemies' healing, you could directly damage their cells, if you can figure "
"out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。就像你可以减缓敌人的恢复，如果找到恰当的技巧，你也可以直接破坏敌人的细胞，对其造成伤害。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_BLOOD_PURGE"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could perform a full sweep of "
"your bloodstream, purging all foreign contaminants, if you can figure out the "
"proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以对全身的血液进行过滤，扫除所有外来的污染物质。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_BANISH_ILLNESS"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could cure diseases directly, "
"even long-term or chronic conditions, if you can figure out the proper "
"technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以直接治愈疾病，甚至连长期的慢性病也能解决。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_SUPER_HEAL"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could speed your healing rate "
"thousands of times, closing wounds in minutes, albeit at a great physical "
"cost to your body, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以上千倍地增加你的恢复速度，分分钟使伤口痊愈，同时这也会对你的身体带来巨大的负担。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_DEGENERATING_TOUCH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could reverse your enemies' "
"natural healing processes, causing cellular breakdown and necrosis to occur "
"at an accelerated pace, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could reverse your enemies' "
"natural healing processes, causing cellular breakdown and necrosis to occur "
"at an accelerated pace, if you can figure out the proper technique."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/vitakinesis.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_LEARNING_RETURN_FROM_DEATH"
msgid ""
"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You could prepare for grievous or "
"potentially-fatal injury, kicking your healing into overdrive and preventing "
"yourself from dying, if you can figure out the proper technique."
msgstr "对灵能的使用给你带来了新的明悟。如果找到恰当的技巧，你可以以一些代价，在受到极其严重甚至致命的伤害时，全力驱使恢复灵能，将你从死亡线上拉回来。"

