#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_PSIONIC_COMBAT"
msgid ""
"Study and attempt to internalize the practices in the VERDANT HAND Combat "
"Protocol training manual.  There's a lot in there; it may take you more than "
"one attempt to understand it."
msgstr "学习并内化记载有 青翠之手 的研习文档。其中真的记载了很多内容，你可能需要多次研读才能理解。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/rituals.json
