#. crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_PSIONIC_COMBAT"
msgid ""
"You've done it.  After long effort, you've mastered the VERDANT HAND "
"protocols.  Bring on the zombies; you'll smash them to pieces with your fists."
msgstr "你成功了。在不懈努力后你终于掌握了 青翠之手。丧尸？你现在想试试用最新的战斗技术手撕它们。"

