msgstr "不小心碰到了一个样本，现在我的脑袋还蒙蒙的"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_fifth_sun.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_QUEST_STARTER_NOTE_FIFTH_SUN_CUACHIC"
msgid ""
"You take a closer look at the note and, with mounting excitement, realize its "
"written in the Imperial Speech!  The blocky Imperial-military-standard "
"characters read, \"I do not know if there are any who will read this, but I "
"am still alive.  I survived the disaster of the Texopapalotl and awakened in "
"a scientific facility filled with demons.  I fought my way out and found a "
"place of some safety.  If you can read this, find me.\n"
"Xiuhcozcatl, Squad Leader, Eighth Band\"  Below it is a map of a small "
"building by a lake, though you don't recognize the nearby terrain."
msgstr ""
"你仔细看了看这张纸条，越来越兴奋地意识到它是用帝国语写成的！上面块状的帝国军用标准字符写道：“我不知道是否有人会读到它，但我还活着。我在特西奥帕帕洛提的灾难"
"中幸存下来，并在一个充满恶魔的科学设施中醒来。我奋力逃了出去，找到了一个安全的地方。如果你能读到这张纸条，马上来找我。\n"
"修克寇兹卡提，第八班班长” 下面画着一张湖边一栋小楼的地图，不过你认不出附近的地形。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_fifth_sun.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_QUEST_STARTER_NOTE_FIFTH_SUN_CUACHIC"
msgid ""
"The note is written in another language with some kind of pictographic "
"characters.  They look vaguely…Mayan?  Regardless, you can't read them.  "
"There is a crude map drawn below the characters, however, showing a house or "
"similar structure by a lake."
msgstr ""
"这张纸条是用另一种语言写的，上面有一些象形文字。他们看起来有点像是……玛雅文字？无论如何，你都读不懂。然而，在文字下方绘制了一张粗略的地图，像是湖边的一所房"
"子或类似的建筑。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "post-it"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Pink for the body, grey for the eyes, green for…hmm"
msgstr "粉红色代表身体，灰色代表眼睛，绿色代表……呃"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Don't look into the dull ones"
msgstr "不要看向那些暗淡的"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "If the mathematician asks for me, I was never here"
msgstr "如果数学家问起我，那我从来没有来过这里"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid ""
"Our clears keep waking up from screaming nightmares.  Higher-ups say it's "
"nothing"
msgstr "我们的清理工不断从尖叫的噩梦中醒来。上级说这没什么"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Subject can lift 14.82g.  15g or higher causes migraine"
msgstr "受试者可举起14.82克。15克或更高会引起偏头痛"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Note: order some Zener cards"
msgstr "备忘：再买几套齐纳牌"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "ONYX LIGHTNING?  GRAY DAWN?  COLD BELOW?  VERDANT HAND?  Oh come on"
msgstr "玛瑙闪电？灰色黎明？冰冷地下？青翠之手？哦，拜托"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "I can't believe she wants to call them psi-cops"
msgstr "我简直不敢相信她居然想叫他们心灵警探"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Two more subjects overloaded.  Need to request more"
msgstr "又有两个受试者过载了。需要请求更多"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Maybe a teep can communicate with them"
msgstr "也许得安排一场TEEP来和他们交流"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Reminder: Tell the immersion teams we need more samples"
msgstr "备忘录：告诉沉浸小组我们需要更多样品"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "It won't kill you but you'll wish it had"
msgstr "它不会杀死你，但你会希望它能杀死你"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Brains show no physical differences"
msgstr "脑组织没有表现出物理性质上的差异"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Animal testing approved.  Try the TK on the mice"
msgstr "动物试验已批准。先在老鼠身上试试TK"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Can't wait for cross-testing"
msgstr "等不及要来次交叉测试了"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "She tried to scan Y65-08.  Now in a coma"
msgstr "她试图扫描Y65-08。现在处于昏迷状态"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Scanning them doesn't work.  It's just static"
msgstr "扫描它们不起作用。全都是白噪声"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Stay away from those GRAY DAWN guys.  Creepy"
msgstr "远离那些“灰色黎明”的家伙。令人毛骨悚然"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "Need to up monitoring of GRAY DAWN candidates.  Who watches the watchers?"
msgstr "需要加强对“灰色黎明”受试者的监控。谁来监视观察者？"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "<given_name> is up for awakening.  Ban her from the poker game"
msgstr "<given_name>准备好觉醒了。禁止和她一起玩扑克"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "A better lightbulb.  What's next, a matrix mousetrap?"
msgstr "稍好的灯泡。接下来是什么，矩阵捕鼠器？"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "So does my PB still count post-awakening?"
msgstr "那么我的PB纪录在觉醒后还算数吗？"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "What's my dog thinking?  I should ask"
msgstr "我的狗在想什么？或许该这样问"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
msgid "COLD BELOW is a bit too on-the-nose"
msgstr "冰冷地下这名字有点太形象了"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_psi"
