#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid "AAR ID# V78-08"
msgstr "AAR ID# V78-08"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid ""
"At 1756 (dive time), Sergeant Eric Collins's team came under attack by an "
"XE157 entity near the end of scheduled in-phase time.  Despite the "
"expenditure of most of their ordinance, XE157 suffered no significant damage "
"and continued its attack.  Despite the known combat capabilities of XE157 and "
"with no regard for his own safety, Sergeant Collins ordered his team to "
"retreat to the dive breachhead and engaged it in hand-to-hand combat, holding "
"it off for several minutes while his team exited the dive.  The aperture was "
"held open for an additional minute afterward, allowing just enough time for a "
"severely-injured Sergeant Collins to exit the dive and preventing the exit of "
"XE157.  Sergeant Collins suffered severe lacerations, the loss of two "
"fingers, and burns across fifty percent of his arms and upper body; he has "
"since volunteered to be a test subject for SMOKE USHER.  In lieu of a medal, "
"we have authorized a meritorious service bonus to be applied retroactive to "
"the beginning of the year."
msgstr ""
"于 "
"1756（沉浸时），埃里克·柯林斯中士的小队在预定的同相时间接近结束时遭到XE157实体的袭击。尽管他们消耗掉了大部分弹药，XE157"
"没有受到重大破坏，并继续进行攻击。尽管XE157"
"具有已知的作战能力，且不顾自身安危，柯林斯中士还是命令他的小队撤退到沉浸点入口，并与它展开肉搏战，将其拖延了几分钟以让他的小队能够退出沉浸。之后，开口又持续"
"了一分钟，刚好足够让严重受伤的柯林斯中士退出沉浸，并阻止了XE157入侵。柯林斯中士被严重撕裂，失去两根手指，50%"
"的手臂和上半身烧伤；从那以后，他自愿成为“烟雾引导”项目的实验对象。我们已授权将功勋服务奖金发放追溯到年初，以代替勋章。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid "Notes written on the back of an unimportant memo"
msgstr "Notes written on the back of an unimportant memo"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid ""
"Treadmills?  Blood ox tests?  Have them try to punch through walls or "
"something\n"
"Any cellular difference?  Should check\n"
"Brains show no difference but what about organs?  Lactic acid production, "
"inflammation, blood flow, etc.\n"
"\n"
"Outrun a horse?\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, yeah, faster than a speeding bullet.  VERDANT HAND vs ONYX LIGHTNING?\n"
"Oh come on.\n"
"What about jumping distance?  Height?\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"*a doodle of two stick figures engaged in a martial arts battle*\n"
"Actually do the shoryuken.  Too bad gun still beats fist\n"
"Hadoken?  Wouldn't surprise me at this point\n"
"Grip strength tests?  Charts?  zzzzz  *a surprisingly-detailed picture of a "
"curled-up sleeping cat*\n"
"Summary: Ban them from the Olympics"
msgstr ""
"跑步机？血牛测试？让他们尝试打穿墙壁之类的\n"
"细胞结构有差异吗？应该检查\n"
"大脑没有什么区别，但是器官呢？乳酸产生、炎症、血流等。\n"
"\n"
"跑得过马吗？\n"
"\n"
"是啊，是啊，比高速子弹还快。青翠之手 vs 玛瑙闪电？\n"
"哦，来吧。\n"
"跳跃距离呢？ 高度？\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"*两个简笔画小人进行武术战斗的涂鸦*\n"
"真正的升龙拳。可惜火枪还是胜过拳头\n"
"波动拳？ 现在也不会让我惊讶\n"
"握力测试？ 图表？ zzzzz *画着一张异常精细的蜷缩熟睡的猫*\n"
"总结：应该禁止他们参加奥运会"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
