#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid "incident report: 385924"
msgstr "incident report: 385924"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid ""
"Upon leaving for the evening, Dr. Erickson neglected to seal cage #3, "
"allowing one of the experimental mice (#748562) to gain access to the matrix "
"crystal supplies.  One crystal discharged, affecting 748562 and apparently "
"causing an awakening.  748562 escaped the room, squeezing under the door, and "
"is currently loose within the facility.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Erickson has been placed on administrative leave pending a full "
"investigation and new procedures for storing matrix crystals are currently "
"being implemented.  A search for 748562 is still underway."
msgstr ""
"晚上离开后，埃里克森博士忘记封闭3号笼子，使得其中一只实验小鼠（#748562）获得了矩阵晶体供应。其中一颗水晶施放出能量，影响了#748562"
"，并显然使其觉醒。#748562逃离了房间，钻出了门外，目前在该设施内自由行动。\n"
"\n"
"埃里克森博士已被停职，等待全面调查，关于存取矩阵晶体的新流程正在制定中。对#748562的搜捕仍在进行中。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid "torn notebook page"
msgstr "torn notebook page"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid ""
"They wanted me to keep a logbook of my daily exercise but I don't understand "
"the point.  I run, I lift, I sleep, that's about all these have me do here.  "
"What, they want \"5:40 a.m.: 30 reps 250 lbs, run 20 minutes, 100 burpees (10 "
"sets)\" blah blah who cares?  That shit doesn't matter.  We're all trapped "
"here and things are going to hell and we got some kind of poison in our "
"bodies that's going to bring us back when we die so we can eat brains.\n"
"\n"
"Well, fine, here's my log: 6:05 a.m.: 50 reps 400 lbs, sprint 10 minutes, 200 "
"pull-ups, triple somersault from a standing start.  Put me in the Olympics "
"right now."
msgstr ""
"他们想让我把每天的运动记录下来，但我不明白有什么意义。我跑步，我举重，我睡觉，这就是我在这里所做的一切。什么，他们想要我记下“早上5:40：30次重复250"
"磅，跑20分钟，100个立卧撑（10"
"组）”等等，谁在乎呢？这玩意啥用没有。我们都被困在这里，一切都在走向地狱，而我们体内有某种毒药，当我们死后会把我们复活，这样我们就可以吃掉大脑。\n"
"\n"
"好吧，好吧，这是我今天的日志：早上6:05：50次重复400磅，快跑10分钟，200个引体向上，三个立定后空翻。现在就让我参加奥运会。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid "The VERDANT HAND combat protocols"
msgstr "The VERDANT HAND combat protocols"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid ""
"They demanded that I include that title on this report even though it's "
"pretentious as hell.  This isn't some superweapon that will change the face "
"of modern warfare, it's just a better form of hand-to-hand combat.  They "
"can't dodge bullets.  They can't punch through brick walls.  They can't do "
"that movie thing where the hero hits a bad guy and the bad guy goes flying "
"twenty feet.  They're just faster and stronger and hit harder, all good "
"things, but they aren't going to beat someone with a gun.  There's a reason "
"we invented guns and why functional martial arts training is about defending "
"yourself and getting away, not about going on the offense.\n"
"\n"
"So is it worth training people?  That's the wrong question.  This isn't a "
"codified martial art, it's just using dimensional metaphysics to enhance "
"existing methods of combat.  A VERDANT HAND candidate will be better at Muay "
"Thai than anyone who hasn't gone through BURNT NOVEMBER but they still need "
"the actual martial arts training.  This is just another tool.  I'm not sure "
"why there's so much focus on this, to be honest.  With the cost of retrieving "
"materials, surely we could spend that money better elsewhere.  Modern warfare "
"does not rely on single superheroes winning battles."
msgstr ""
"他们要求我在这份报告中加入这个标题，不过这也太刻意了。这不是什么能够改变现代战争面貌的超级武器，它不过是种更好的肉搏手段。它无法躲避子弹。也没法打穿砖墙。做"
"不到那种一个英雄一拳将坏蛋击飞二十英尺的电影特效。它只是更快、更强、砸得更狠，这都是好事，但可打不赢另一个拿枪的家伙。我们发明枪械是有原因的，这也是为什么实"
"战中武术更多用于自卫和逃跑，而非进攻。\n"
"\n"
"那么，为它培训新人值得吗？这是个错误的问题。这不是一门成文的武术，它只是利用维度玄学来增强现有的战斗方法。“青翠之手”候选者会比任何没有经历过“燃情雾月”训"
"练的其他人更擅长泰拳，但仍需要接受实际的武术训练。这只是另一个工具。老实说，我不知道为什么对它有这么多关注。考虑到回收材料的成本，我们肯定可以更好地将这笔资"
"源花在其他的地方。现代战争并不依赖于某个超级英雄赢得战斗。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_clairsentience"
#. ~ Phavian designation for clairsentience study is NOBLE HORIZON.  Phavian
#. designation for use of clairsentience to find appropriate portal targets
#. for immersion dives is COLD BELOW
msgid "Notes scribbled on notebook paper"
msgstr "Notes scribbled on notebook paper"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_clairsentience"
#. ~ Phavian designation for clairsentience study is NOBLE HORIZON.  Phavian
#. designation for use of clairsentience to find appropriate portal targets
#. for immersion dives is COLD BELOW
msgid ""
"I'm looking up at the sky.  I can see the same constellations on Earth, but "
"they're shimmering somehow, like there's a haze or a fog or something between "
"us.  Then, the stars start to slowly go out.  Not in a wave, but "
"randomly--one here, one there, faster and faster until the entire sky was "
"dark.  Then the moon disappeared as well and everything went black.\n"
"\n"
"I'm standing on the edge of a cliff.  Below me is the churning sea, the "
"waters black under the stormclouds.  The sea rises slowly as rain falls in "
"sheets, lightning striking the waters.  They break over the edge of the "
"cliff, then over my head.  I drown.\n"
"\n"
"I am standing in a forest.  The trees rustle all around me and the birds "
"sing, and then clouds pass over the sun.  The sun dims and then starts to go "
"black.  It's an eclipse.  The light fades and all the birdsong dies.  I stand "
"in pitch blackness with the rustle of leaves around me."
msgstr ""
"我抬头看向天空。我可以看到和地球上同样的星座，但它们不知怎么地闪闪发光，就像和我们之间隔了一层薄雾或是什么的。然后，星星开始慢慢熄灭。不像一阵波浪，而是随机"
"的——这里一个，那里一个，越来越快，直到整个天空都变黑了。然后月亮也消失了，最后一切陷入黑暗。\n"
"\n"
"我站在悬崖边上。在我的下面是翻腾的大海，乌云笼罩下的海水是黑色的。海水缓慢上升，雨点成片落下，闪电击打海水。它们越过悬崖，然后淹没了我的头。我淹死了。\n"
"\n"
"我站在森林之中。我周围的树沙沙作响，鸟儿歌唱，然后乌云遮蔽了太阳。太阳变暗了，然后开始变黑。如同日食一般。光线渐渐暗淡，所有的鸟鸣声都消失了。我站在一片漆黑"
"中，周围只剩下树叶沙沙作响。"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_clairsentience"
#. ~ Phavian designation for clairsentience study is NOBLE HORIZON.  Phavian
#. designation for use of clairsentience to find appropriate portal targets
#. for immersion dives is COLD BELOW
msgid "testing report N2-8129"
msgstr "testing report N2-8129"

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_clairsentience"
#. ~ Phavian designation for clairsentience study is NOBLE HORIZON.  Phavian
#. designation for use of clairsentience to find appropriate portal targets
#. for immersion dives is COLD BELOW
msgid ""
"Subject O21 was placed blindfolded in a completely dark room with a deck of "
"shuffled playing cards, instructed to remove the blindfold, and asked to sort "
"them in standard order: clubs, diamonds, hearts, spades, each in numerical "
"order.  Task was completed in 6:03 with 18/52 cards in the proper order and "
"minor to major ordering errors in all other cards.  Subject was then asked to "
"drink from the coffee cup in the room.  Cup was placed on a shelf above the "
"door to prevent movement around the room from discovering it, but task was "
"completed in 1:14, with the only difficulty being subject's height (158 cm) "
"making it harder to reach the shelf.  Subject was then asked to cross the "
"room to the table, pick up the paper, and read the sequence of numbers "
"written on it.  Subject was unable to do so, only correctly reciting the "
"first two digits.\n"
"\n"
"Experiment does uphold the thesis that successful NOBLE HORIZON "
"mathematicians perceive their surroundings through means other than light.  "
"As O21 was unable to read the document, their sense is not \"sight\" as such. "
" Further experimentation to determine its limits is necessary."
msgstr ""
