"that high among RUBY LOOP mathematicians.  And no, before you ask, hooking up "
"a lightning rod and having her just blast it repeatedly wouldn't generate "
"enough power either.  I thought of it and we did try it, but no dice.\n"
"\n"
"We're going to have to hope that COBALT THORN comes through if we're stuck in "
"here for too long."

