msgid_plural "chocolate ichor"
msgstr[0] "chocolate ichor"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_flesh.json
#. ~ Description of "chocolate ichor"
msgid ""
"Ichor harvested from the corpse of a chocolate cow.  Quite bitter and… oddly "
"warm?"
msgstr ""
"Ichor harvested from the corpse of a chocolate cow.  Quite bitter and… oddly "
"warm?"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "pile of rock candy rubble"
msgstr "岩糖碎砾"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "pile of rock candy rubble"
msgid "Pile of rock candy shards.  Useless?"
msgstr "一堆岩糖的碎片。没什么用？"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "small rock candy boulder"
msgstr "小型岩糖"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "small rock candy boulder"
msgid ""
"Blocking your path.  Should be easy to move.  It can be used as a primitive "
"anvil."
msgstr "擋住你的去路。應該很容易搬動。它可以當作原始的鐵砧。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "medium rock candy boulder"
msgstr "中型岩糖"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "medium rock candy boulder"
msgid ""
"Blocking your path.  It'll be a struggle to move.  It can be used as a "
"primitive anvil."
msgstr "擋住你的去路。不容易搬動。它可以當作原始的鐵砧。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "large rock candy boulder"
msgstr "大型岩糖"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "large rock candy boulder"
msgid "Now how are you going to move this?"
msgstr "現在你怎麼搬這個？"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_harvest.json
#. ~ Harvest message
msgid ""
"As you butcher the chocolate corpse, you break the large pieces of flesh down "
"into more manageable chunks."
msgstr "当你屠宰巧克力尸体时，你将大块的肉切割成更易处理的小块。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_harvest.json
#. ~ Harvest message
msgid "You carefully open the snake to extract the sweet fillets."
msgstr "你小心地剖开蛇身，取出甜美的蛇柳。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "SugarKin flyer"
msgid_plural "SugarKin flyers"
msgstr[0] "SugarKin 傳單"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Description of "SugarKin flyer"
msgid ""
"A flyer for some kind of candy.  It shows a picture of a gleaming human made "
"of smooth candy looking at you in terror.  \"SugarKin the first life-size "
"human candy!  Are you a real monster?  Will you be able to devour it?\"\n"
" On the back of the flyer you can see some hastily scribbled words:\n"
" \"Hello, my child, welcome to this world.  A world where you'll be able to "
"thrive if you follow a few rules:\n"
"1) Never ever get into contact with water, it would melt you!\n"
"2) Avoid humans with clear eyes they are very dangerous!  (You can ignore the "
"ones with black eyes they are harmless to you.)\n"
"3) Learn how to make caramel ointment, it's the only way to fix your body if "
"you get hurt.\n"
" There are many more things I'd like to tell you but I must leave before it's "
"too late.  I've made you a friend to keep you company, be kind to it.\n"
" I love you,\n"
" - F.  \"."
msgstr ""
"某種宣傳糖果的傳單。上面有張閃閃發光的光滑人形糖果恐懼地看向你的照片。「世上首見 SugarKin "
"真人大小人形糖果！你是個真正的怪物嗎？或是你能夠吃掉它嗎？」\n"
"　你能看到在傳單背面有著草草寫下的文字：\n"
"　「哈囉，我的孩子，歡迎來到這世界。一個你遵守以下守則就能飛黃騰達的世界：\n"
"１）　永遠別碰到水，你會融掉！\n"
"２）　避開有著清澈眼神的人類，他們非常危險！（你可以忽視眼睛全黑的因為他們對你無害。）\n"
"３）　學會如何製作焦糖軟膏，這是唯一能修復你身體的方式。\n"
"　我還有許多事想告訴你但我要趕快離開。我給你做了個朋友來陪伴你，好好照顧牠。\n"
"　愛你，\n"
"－Ｆ.」"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pieces of candy wrapper"
msgid_plural "pieces of candy wrapper"
msgstr[0] "糖果包裝紙"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Description of "pieces of candy wrapper"
msgid ""
"Bits and pieces of plastic entangled in sticky candy goop.  They spot some "
"bright colors and might have been part of a candy wrapper at some point.  "
"Maybe you could suck the sugar from them, if you're really desperate."
msgstr "沾滿融化糖果的糖果紙。曾是糖果包裝紙的他們有著鮮豔的顏色。也許你可以舔起黏在上面的糖果，如果你真的別無選擇的話。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sticky sludge"
msgid_plural "sticky sludge"
msgstr[0] "粘性污泥"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Description of "sticky sludge"
msgid ""
"A pile of weird sticky sludge.  It looks absolutely disgusting but smells "
"kind of sweet."
msgstr "一堆奇怪的粘糊糊的污泥。它看起来非常恶心，但闻起来有点甜。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rock candy chunk"
msgid_plural "rock candy chunks"
msgstr[0] "岩糖塊"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Description of "rock candy chunk"
msgid "This is a chunk of hard rock candy.  It can be broken down into sugar."
msgstr "这是一块坚硬的岩糖，可以分解成白糖。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sugar bone"
msgid_plural "sugar bone"
msgstr[0] "sugar bone"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_items.json
#. ~ Description of "sugar bone"
msgid ""
"A large bone, made entirely of super-compressed sugar.  Way too hard to be "
"eaten directly, but it can be broken down into sugar."
msgstr ""
"A large bone, made entirely of super-compressed sugar.  Way too hard to be "
"eaten directly, but it can be broken down into sugar."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_materials.json
#. ~ Name of material
msgid "rock candy"
msgstr "岩糖"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "caramel ointment"
msgid_plural "caramel ointment"
msgstr[0] "焦糖軟膏"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_med.json
#. ~ Description of "caramel ointment"
msgid ""
"An ointment made of caramel.  You could use it to heal your wounds, if you "
"were made of sugar."
msgstr "用焦糖製成的軟膏。你能用它來治療你的傷口，如果你是糖做成的。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "necco"
msgid_plural "neccos"
msgstr[0] "糖果猫"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "necco"
msgid "A giant necco wafer happily hopping around."
msgstr "一块巨大的彩虹糖，快乐的跳来跳去。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "marshmallow kid"
msgid_plural "marshmallow kids"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖小孩"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow kid"
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  It bumbles about on its stubby "
"cushiony legs.  How cute!"
msgstr "一只完全由棉花糖组成的小型类人生物。它用粗短软垫状的腿蹒跚乱步。多么可爱呀！"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "marshmallow guy"
msgid_plural "marshmallow guys"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖人"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow guy"
msgid ""
"A marshmallow humanoid with a smile drawn on its face.  It bumbles around as "
"if looking for something.  It's oddly adorable."
msgstr "一只由棉花糖组成的类人生物，脸上勾勒着微笑。它蹒跚乱步，似乎在寻找着什么。看起来异常可爱。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "marshmallow buff"
msgid_plural "marshmallow buffs"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖壯漢"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow buff"
msgid ""
"A muscular body made of marshmallow, proudly striding towards an unknown "
"goal.  Yummy!"
msgstr "一只体型健壮的由棉花糖组成的类人生物，自豪地迈向未知的目标。美味唷！"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "marshmallow goliath"
msgid_plural "marshmallow goliaths"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖巨人"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow goliath"
msgid ""
"A gigantic marshmallow humanoid softly stomping around.  Its frozen smile and "
"big empty eyes are carefully scanning its surroundings."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的棉花糖类人生物，正轻柔地踏步漫行，脸上带着冻结的微笑，巨大空洞的眼睛正仔细地扫视四周。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "marshmallow squire"
msgid_plural "marshmallow squires"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖護衛"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow squire"
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  Its chocolate-coated cracker armor "
"shines dully as it bumbles around on its stubby marshmallow legs.  How cute!"
msgstr "一只完全由棉花糖组成的小型类人生物。它所穿着的巧克力薄脆饼干板甲随着它粗短的棉花糖腿的移动不断上下颠簸着，散发出暗淡的光芒。多么可爱啊！"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "marshmallow knight"
msgid_plural "marshmallow knights"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖騎士"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow knight"
msgid ""
"A marshmallow humanoid clad in knightly armor made of chocolate-coated "
"crackers.  It bumbles around as if looking around for something.  It's oddly "
"adorable in a majestic sort of way."
msgstr "一只由棉花糖组成的类人生物，穿着由巧克力薄脆饼干制成的骑士盔甲。它笨手笨脚地走来走去，好像在四处寻找什么东西。有点威严同时又令人喜爱。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "marshmallow champion"
msgid_plural "marshmallow champions"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖冠軍"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow champion"
msgid ""
"Standing tall in its shining armor of chocolate-coated crackers, this "
"marshmallow proudly strides towards an unknown goal."
msgstr "一只体型健壮的由棉花糖组成的类人生物，穿着一套闪耀的由带巧克力涂层的薄脆饼干制成的盔甲，正自豪地迈向未知的目标。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "marshmallow war lord"
msgid_plural "marshmallow war lords"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖戰爭領主"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow war lord"
msgid ""
"A gigantic humanoid armored with thick plates of chocolate-coated crackers.  "
"Its frozen smile is barely visible from under its heavy helmet as it scans "
"its surroundings."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的棉花糖类人生物，穿着厚重的由带巧克力涂层的薄脆饼干制成的盔甲，从它沉重的头盔中透出若隐若现的脸上带着冻结的微笑，巨大空洞的眼睛正扫视四周。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gummy cub"
msgid_plural "gummy cubs"
msgstr[0] "軟糖幼熊"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gummy cub"
msgid "An achingly adorable bear cub made of sugary gummy goodness."
msgstr "一只可爱得令人心疼的熊宝宝，全身完全由甜蜜的软糖构成。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gummy bear"
msgid_plural "gummy bears"
msgstr[0] "軟糖熊"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gummy bear"
msgid ""
"A large bear made of flavored sugary gelatin.  Its smooth, round shape and "
"fruity smell make it somehow less scary than its fleshy counterpart."
msgstr "一只由水果味软糖组成的大熊，其圆滑的体形和散发出的水果风味让它看上去比由血肉构成的熊更无害些。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gummy gator"
msgid_plural "gummy gators"
msgstr[0] "軟糖鱷"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gummy gator"
msgid ""
"Slowly moving through the chocolate like a gummy log along the surface.  You "
"notice it's eye's following your movement as you approach."
msgstr "它在巧克力液表面慢慢移动，就像一根粘糊糊的圆木。你注意到当你靠近它时，它的眼睛正盯着你的一举一动。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cracker kid"
msgid_plural "cracker kids"
msgstr[0] "薄脆饼小子"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cracker kid"
msgid "A small cracker kid running around on its cracker legs."
msgstr "一个薄脆饼小子，正用薄脆饼干腿跑来跑去。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cracker"
msgid "A full grown cracker running around on its cracker legs."
msgstr "一个成年的薄脆饼人，正用薄脆饼干腿跑来跑去。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "animal cracker largemouth bass"
msgid_plural "animal cracker largemouth bass"
msgstr[0] "动物薄脆大嘴鲈"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "animal cracker largemouth bass"
msgid ""
"An animal cracker largemouth bass.  It leaps from the water in pursuit of "
"food."
msgstr "一只由动物薄脆饼干构成的大嘴鲈。它从水里跳出来寻找食物。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cookie"
msgid "A small cookie, scurrying around in search for crumbs to eat."
msgstr "一块小曲奇饼，正在四处匆匆寻觅面包屑果腹。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cookie hydra"
msgid_plural "cookie hydras"
msgstr[0] "曲奇九头蛇"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cookie hydra"
#. ~ Description of monster "cookie hydra spawn"
msgid "A giant cookie dragon with multiple heads.  It prowls looking for food."
msgstr "一只长着许多头的巨型曲奇饼干九头蛇。它正在四处觅食。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cookie hydra spawn"
msgid_plural "cookie hydra spawns"
msgstr[0] "曲奇九头蛇幼仔"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gum spider"
msgid_plural "gum spiders"
msgstr[0] "口香糖蜘蛛"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gum spider"
msgid ""
"A giant piece of gum stretched in the shape of a spider.  You'd best not get "
"gummed up in its web, literally."
msgstr "一块体型巨大的被扯成蜘蛛形状的口香糖。正如字面一般，你最好别被它的口香糖网中。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "caffeinated gum spider"
msgid_plural "caffeinated gum spiders"
msgstr[0] "咖啡因口香糖蜘蛛"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "caffeinated gum spider"
msgid ""
"A giant piece of gum stretched in the shape of a spider.  It jitters and "
"darts about rapidly as if it had too much energy to stand still."
msgstr "一块体型巨大的被扯成蜘蛛形状的口香糖。它不停颤抖，飞快地跑来跑去，好像体内能量太强了，停不下来一样。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "gum spiderling"
msgid_plural "gum spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "gum spiderlings"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "gum spiderling"
msgid "A large wad of living gum morphed into a spider."
msgstr "A large wad of living gum morphed into a spider."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "caffeinated gum spiderling"
msgid_plural "caffeinated gum spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "caffeinated gum spiderlings"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "caffeinated gum spiderling"
msgid ""
"A large wad of living gum morphed into a spider.  This one shakes and fidgets "
"as it struggles to steady its feet."
msgstr ""
"A large wad of living gum morphed into a spider.  This one shakes and fidgets "
"as it struggles to steady its feet."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "chocolate calf"
msgid_plural "chocolate calves"
msgstr[0] "巧克力小牛"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chocolate calf"
#. ~ Description of monster "chocolate cow"
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  It is quite muscular, "
"and the males can have a violent streak to accompany their nasty-looking "
"horns.  This one looks to be made entirely of chocolate."
msgstr "一头被圈养的牛，一种反刍类农场动物，肌肉相当发达，雄性个体长着凶恶的角并且具有威胁性。这只牛看起来完全由巧克力构成。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "chocolate cow"
msgid_plural "chocolate cows"
msgstr[0] "巧克力牛"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "licorice snake"
msgid_plural "licorice snakes"
msgstr[0] "甘草蛇"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "licorice snake"
msgid "A snake whose body is made out of licorice, at least it's the red type."
msgstr "一条浑身上下都由甘草糖组成的蛇，至少是红色款。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "licorice snake hatchling"
msgid_plural "licorice snake hatchlings"
msgstr[0] "甘草幼蛇"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "licorice snake hatchling"
msgid ""
"A baby snake made entirely out of licorice, possibly the children of the "
"larger licorice snakes."
msgstr "一条浑身上下都由甘草糖组成的小蛇，可能是大甘草蛇的后代。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mutation_category.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Sugar Kin"
msgstr "糖質"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mutation_category.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Sugar Kin"
msgid "How sweet!"
msgstr "多麼甜啊！"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Made Of Sugar"
msgstr "糖果人"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Made Of Sugar"
msgid "You are literally made of sugar."
msgstr "如字面意思你全身由糖果組成。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
msgid ""
"A flyer for some kind of candy.  It shows a picture of a gleaming human made "
"of smooth candy looking at you in terror.  \"SugarKin the first life-size "
"human candy!  Are you a real monster?  Will you be able to devour it all?\""
msgstr "一张介绍某种糖果的传单。上面画着一个用光滑的糖果做成的闪闪发光的人，正害怕地看着你。\"糖人，世上首个真人大小的糖果！你真是个怪物吗？你能把它吞下吗？\""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/mod_interactions/defense_mode/species.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_species.json
#. ~ Foot steps of species "MARSHMALLOW"
#. ~ Foot steps of species "DM_SWEETS"
msgid "shlop."
msgstr "唰啦。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_species.json
#. ~ Foot steps of species "GUMMY"
msgid "pop."
msgstr "啵。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_species.json
#. ~ Foot steps of species "CRACKER"
msgid "tac."
msgstr "嗒。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_species.json
#. ~ Foot steps of species "COOKIE"
msgid "pat."
msgstr "啪。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_species.json
#. ~ Foot steps of species "CHEWGUM"
msgid "shlip."
msgstr "咝溜。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_species.json
#. ~ Foot steps of species "LICORICE"
msgid "Shlop."
msgstr "唰啦。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_species.json
#. ~ Foot steps of species "CHOCOLATE"
msgid "Clop."
msgstr "咔噗。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_overmap_terrain.json
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "chocolate bog"
msgstr "巧克力沼澤"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "shallow chocolate"
msgstr "浅巧克力池"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "shallow chocolate"
msgid ""
"The chocolate isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather what looks to be pure melted cacao.  This will not be tasty."
msgstr "这里的巧克力不太深。有水密容器的话，可以从这里收集纯的液态可可。这不会很好吃。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "deep chocolate"
msgstr "深巧克力池"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "deep chocolate"
msgid ""
"The chocolate here is deep enough to drown in.  With a watertight container, "
"you could gather what looks to be pure melted cacao.  This will not be tasty."
msgstr "这里的巧克力深度足以使人溺水。有水密容器的话，可以从这里收集纯的液态可可。这不会很好吃。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "caramel"
msgid ""
"An extremely hot, glowing liquid, composed of molten caramel.  In some "
"places, caramel coated fruit is a delicacy."
msgstr "炽热、灼亮的液体，由熔融的焦糖组成。在某些地方，焦糖涂层的水果可是美味佳肴。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/harvest.json
#. ~ Harvest message
msgid ""
"You crack open the hard chitin of the outer barrel to get at the alien flesh "
"beneath."
msgstr "你切开它的桶形外壳的甲壳，好获取下方的怪肉。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Mythos Mod - Mythos Creatures Only"
msgstr "僅有克蘇魯生物"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Mythos Mod - Mythos Creatures Only"
msgid ""
"Removes all the zombies (including fungus zombies), cyborgs and robots from "
"the game and replaces them with a variety of Lovecraftian monsters - intended "
"to be part of a total conversion mod but can be used as a standalone if "
"wanted."
msgstr ""
"將所有的殭屍（包括真菌殭屍）、機械人和機器人從遊戲中移除，並將它們替換為各種洛夫克拉夫特式的怪物——這是一個完全轉換的模組的一部分，但如果希望，也可以作為獨"
"立模組使用。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/mod_interactions/defense_mode/species.json
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/species.json
#. ~ Description of species "MYTHOS"
#. ~ Description of species "MYTHOS_DM"
msgid "a mythos creature"
msgstr "克苏鲁生物"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deep one corpse"
msgid_plural "deep one corpses"
msgstr[0] "深潜者尸体"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
msgid "The dead body of a deep one."
msgstr "一具深潜者的尸体。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
msgid "A dead body of a male deep one."
msgstr "一具男性深潜者的尸体。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
msgid "A dead body of a female deep one."
msgstr "一具女性深潜者的尸体。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
msgid "The dead body of a deep one, coated in congealed blood."
msgstr "一具沾满了凝固的血液的深潜者尸体。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
msgid "A dead body of a deep one with a gaping stab wound in its back."
msgstr "一具后颈被刺了个大洞的深潜者尸体。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"The dead body of a deep one.  Its forehead bears a large bullet entrance "
"wound.  An even larger exit wound is present on the back of its head."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，额头上有一个巨大的子弹入射伤口，后脑勺则有另一个更大的伤口。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"The upper half of a dead deep one body, as if torn apart with enormous force. "
" Some organs are hanging out."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体的上半截，像是被蛮力撕开的一样。一些器官从里面漏了出来。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one shot several times in the back with a low-caliber "
"weapon."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，它被一把小口径枪械从背后多次射击。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"A deep one corpse gored by arms fire chest to thighs, leaving the face eerily "
"and fishily pristine."
msgstr "一具无法分辨性别的深潜者尸体，被手臂从胸部到大腿的火焰刺伤，但却留下了一副诡异的干净鱼类面孔。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one.  It appears to have been shot in the forehead at a "
"very close range leaving you a good view of its brain matter."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，似乎是在很近的地方被击中了前额，你可以清晰地看见它的脑子。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one, its legs and arms covered in blood.  It appears to "
"have been shot in the thigh."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，它的腿和手臂都沾满了鲜血。它似乎大腿中枪。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one who appears to have been shot to death.  Its right "
"arm is only barely still attached to his shoulder."
msgstr "一具似乎被枪杀的深潜者尸体。它的右臂只是勉强依附在肩膀上。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one unblemished but for the bloody hole atop its head, "
"its bald scalp intermixed now with brain, viscera and shotgun pellets."
msgstr "一具深潜者尸体，完好无损，但由于她头顶上有一个血迹斑斑的窟窿，光秃秃的鳞片夹杂着大脑、内脏和猎枪子弹。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deep one"
msgid ""
"A large, greenish-gray amphibious humanoid with webbed hands and feet.  It's "
"wide, flabby head is distinctly fish like with wide staring eyes and its "
"gangling limbs end in wickedly sharp claws.  It moves with an odd hopping "
"gait, occasionally dropping down to walk on four limbs."
msgstr ""
"一只大型灰绿色两栖人型生物，手和脚有蹼。它宽大、松弛的头部像鱼一样，眼睛瞪得大大的，瘦长的四肢末端有可怕的利爪。它用一种奇怪的跳跃步伐移动，偶尔会俯身用四肢"
"行走。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rat-thing"
msgid_plural "rat-things"
msgstr[0] "人面鼠"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rat-thing"
msgid ""
"A small brown rodent with long whiskers and beady eyes.  Its face is "
"strangely human-like, as are its tiny hands."
msgstr "一只棕色的小型啮齿动物，长着长胡须和圆圆的眼睛。它的脸和它的小手都很像人类。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shantak"
msgid_plural "shantak"
msgstr[0] "夏塔克鸟"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shantak"
msgid ""
"An enormous, scaly avian monster larger than an elephant.  It has slimy, "
"reptilian skin, a pair of membranous, bat-like wings and a horse-like head at "
"the end of a long neck."
msgstr "一只体型比大象更大的巨大有着鳞的鸟类怪物。它体表长着黏糊糊的爬行动物皮肤，一对蝙蝠般的膜状翅膀，长长的脖子顶上长着马一样的头。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dark young"
msgid_plural "dark young"
msgstr[0] "黑山羊幼仔"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dark young"
msgid ""
"A horrifying, pitch-black monstrosity, seemingly made of ropy tentacles.  It "
"stands as tall as a tree on stumpy, hoofed legs, and its flanks covered in "
"puckered maws, dripping green goo."
msgstr "一只可怕的漆黑色怪物，似乎是由粘稠的触手构成的。它像一棵树一样高，腿短而有蹄，两侧布满皱巴巴的大洞，滴着绿色的黏液。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ghoul"
msgid_plural "ghouls"
msgstr[0] "食屍鬼"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ghoul"
msgid ""
"This humanoid creature has a semi-canine head, hooved feet, and claws.  Its "
"rubbery skin is pale and covered with grave-mold."
msgstr "这只人型生物长着犬类般的脸、有蹄的脚和利爪。它橡胶般的皮肤十分苍白，覆盖着严重的真菌。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ghast"
msgid_plural "ghasts"
msgstr[0] "妖鬼"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ghast"
msgid ""
"This vaguely humanoid creature is almost as big as a pony.  It has long "
"hooved legs on which it hops, clawed hands, and a hideous noseless head with "
"oversized teeth."
msgstr "这只半人型生物的体型几乎和一匹小马一样大。它长着可以跳跃的蹄足，有利爪的手，还有一个丑陋的没有鼻子的脑袋和超大的尖牙。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "elder thing"
msgid_plural "elder things"
msgstr[0] "古老者"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "elder thing"
msgid ""
"A strange alien creature with a star-shaped head and numerous writhing "
"appendages arranged radially around its barrel-shaped body."
msgstr "这是一种奇怪的外星生物，头部呈星形，无数蠕动的附肢呈放射状排列在桶状的身体周围。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "nightgaunt"
msgid_plural "nightgaunts"
msgstr[0] "夜魇"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "nightgaunt"
msgid ""
"This lanky ebon humanoid has batlike wings and a long prehensile tail, yet "
"its most unsettling feature is its lack of a face."
msgstr "这只瘦长而乌黑的人型动物长着蝙蝠般的翅膀和一条可缠绕的长尾巴，但它最令人不安的特征是没有脸。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "nightgaunt"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s melts into wisps of darkness."
msgstr "%s融化成一缕黑暗。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "servitor of the outer gods"
msgid_plural "servitors of the outer gods"
msgstr[0] "外神之仆役"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "servitor of the outer gods"
msgid ""
"A constantly-flickering mass of eyes, mouths, and tentacles hanging in the "
"air, emitting a piping noise from flutes of bone."
msgstr "一团不断闪烁的眼睛、嘴巴和触手悬在空中，骨笛中不断发出刺耳的声音。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "servitor of the outer gods"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s folds into itself and disappears."
msgstr "%s折叠并消失。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flying polyp"
msgid ""
"A half polypous, utterly alien creature.  It's only partly material and has "
"the ability to fly, despite the absence of wings.  It produces strange "
"whistling noises which send cold shivers of primal terror down your spine."
msgstr ""
"一只源自克苏鲁神话的盲目者亚种，完完全全的异界生物。它的身体仅有一半是由物质构成，虽然没有翅膀却能够在空中飞行。它在移动时发出奇怪的呼啸声，一阵阵远古的恐惧"
"感让你的从头到脚的脊柱都不寒而栗。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shoggoth"
msgid ""
"A gargantuan protoplasmic blob, constantly reshaping, forming new pseudopods "
"seemingly at will.  All over its body are eyes that form and disappear.  It "
"looks at you with malice."
msgstr "一團龐大無定形的原生質生物， 看上去就像柏油構成的巨大變形蟲， 膿液似的眼睛不斷在它的表面形成又分解， 它似乎對你充滿著惡意。"

#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/monsters/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hunting horror"
msgid ""
"This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously "
"distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself "
"with the aid of black rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions.  Its form "
"writhes and changes before your eyes, filling you with unnameable horror."
msgstr "這是一隻巨大的蛇形生物，有著扭曲的頭部和尖銳的巨型附肢，利用龐大的黑色肉翼支撐自己。它扭動的形體使你充滿無法形容的恐懼。"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/difficulty_options.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_NH_set_difficulty"
msgid "Creeping Despair"
msgstr "Creeping Despair"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/difficulty_options.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_NH_set_difficulty"
msgid "Fervent Despair"
msgstr "Fervent Despair"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/difficulty_options.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_NH_set_difficulty"
msgid "Overwhelming Despair"
msgstr "Overwhelming Despair"

#: data/mods/No_Hope/difficulty_options.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_NH_set_difficulty"
msgid "Creeping Despair makes items rarer than vanilla."
msgstr "Creeping Despair makes items rarer than vanilla."

