#: data/mods/Perk_melee/menu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"XP is gained by killing enemies, either by melee or ranged combat, with "
"tougher enemies giving more XP.  You'll gain a perk point every time you "
"level up, which can be used to unlock a perk through this menu.  Most perks "
"are completely passive, and apply their effects automatically on movement, "
"combat or waiting.\n"
"\n"
"Perks cannot be refunded or disabled once learned, consider your choices "
"carefully."
msgstr ""
"通过杀死敌人获得经验，近战、远程皆可，敌人越强大，获得的经验就越多。每次升级时你都会获得一个能力点，可在此菜单用于解锁能力。大多数能力都是完全的被动能力，并"
"在移动、战斗或等待时自动生效。\n"
"\n"
"能力一旦学会就无法退还或禁用，请慎重考虑你的选择。"

