#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Feint drills"
msgstr "佯攻演练"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Feint drills"
msgid "Perform a feint whenever an attack would miss."
msgstr "当攻击落空时施展一次佯攻。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Staggering Strikes"
msgstr "震慑打击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Staggering Strikes"
msgid ""
"Attacks with bashing weapons are likely to stun their target if the full "
"combat tempo bonus is active."
msgstr "当满层 战斗节奏 加成生效时，使用钝击武器攻击将有概率击晕目标。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fore!"
msgstr "小心！"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fore!"
msgid ""
"Hah, just watch this.\n"
"Critical strikes with bashing weapons can knock your targets backwards.  You "
"are guaranteed to knock back stunned targets."
msgstr ""
"哈，让你见识一下。\n"
"使用钝击武器打出暴击时，可以把目标击退。对眩晕中的敌人必定能将其击飞。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Make Way"
msgstr "让路"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Make Way"
msgid ""
"Perform an overhead attack with a polearm or staff.  The attack will knock "
"back all targets hit."
msgstr "使用长柄武器或棍子，对敌人当头一击。这次攻击会击退所有命中的目标。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Fulcrum Kick"
msgstr "支點踢"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fulcrum Kick"
msgid ""
"Deliver a powerful flying kick using a polearm as a springboard.  The kick "
"will knock back humanoid targets of similar or smaller size."
msgstr "以长柄武器作为助力，踢出强劲飞踢，能将体型相同或更小的人形敌人击退。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Coiling Strikes"
msgstr "盘卷旋击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Coiling Strikes"
msgid ""
"Perform a quick reach attack with a polearm or staff if you have at least 1 "
"momentum stack.  The attack will heavily scale with perception."
msgstr "若你拥有至少 1 层 动量，可使用长柄武器或长棍发动一次快速的 远距攻击 。此攻击将大幅受感知属性加成。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Snap slash"
msgstr "迅斬"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Snap slash"
msgid ""
"If you dodge an attack with a knife or dagger, you'll counterattack with a "
"quick slash."
msgstr "持刀或匕首闪避攻击时，会以迅捷斩击立即反击。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Slaying strike"
msgstr "刃锁戮击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Slaying strike"
msgid ""
"Perform a finishing attack with a knife or dagger when reaching 3 tempo "
"stacks.  The attack will prioritize enemy weak points."
msgstr "当 战斗节奏 层数达到 3 层时，可使用匕首或短剑发动终结攻击。该攻击将优先锁定敌人的弱点。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Vulgar Opening"
msgstr "蛮横开局"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vulgar Opening"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have no combat buffs active, perform an opening attack with armor "
"penetration increased by 225% of your strength.  Just hit them with the damn "
"thing."
msgstr "没有任何战斗Buff时，开场攻击获得等同于力量225%的护甲穿透。直接用力砸下去！"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Estocada"
msgstr "迅捷刺击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Estocada"
msgid ""
"Perform a quick lunging thrust with a long sword, thrusting sword or "
"quarterstaff.  You must have exactly 1 momentum stack to perform this attack."
msgstr "使用长剑、刺剑或长棍快速刺击。发动此攻击需精确保持 1 层 动量。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Compound finisher"
msgstr "连诛终式"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Compound finisher"
msgid ""
"If your third attack against the same target coincides with the full combat "
"tempo bonus, you will perform a fast and powerful finishing attack."
msgstr "当对同一目标的第三次攻击触发满层 战斗节奏 加成时，你将发动一次迅如雷霆的终结打击。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Timed lunge"
msgstr "进退游刃"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Timed lunge"
msgid ""
"Perform a ranged lunge attack with fencing and thrusting swords.  The attack "
"will move you adjacent to the target or move you away from the target if you "
"are already adjacent to them.  You must have exactly 1 momentum stack to "
"perform this attack."
msgstr "使用击剑或长刺剑发动远距攻击。此次攻击将根据站位进行战术位移，若与目标间隔则突进至其身旁，若已贴身则反向撤离。发动此攻击需精确保持 1 层 动量。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Charging Tackle"
msgstr "冲锋陷阵"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Charging Tackle"
msgid ""
"Your first attack after acquiring at least 3 momentum stacks will be replaced "
"by a shoulder tackle.  The tackle will ground humanoid targets of similar or "
"smaller size and consume all momentum stacks."
msgstr "当你累积至少3层动能时，接下来的第一次攻击将会被冲撞（冲肩撞击）取代。此次冲撞会击倒体型相同或更小的人形目标，并消耗所有动能层数。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Execution"
msgstr "处决"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Execution"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whenever you attack a human-sized target with a great axe, great sword or "
"great hammer if the target has less health than the base attack rating of "
"your weapon, you will execute them instead.  Execution attacks ignore armor "
"and will restore 10% of your max stamina."
msgstr "用巨斧、巨剑或巨锤攻击人型敌人时，若对方血量低于你武器的基础攻击力，会直接进行处决。处决攻击无视护甲，并回复10%最大耐力。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Brutal Execution"
msgstr "残暴处决"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Brutal Execution"
msgid ""
"You perform executions with such brutality that all minded enemies that "
"witness them will become stunned for 2 turns."
msgstr "你施展的处决相当残暴使得看到这一场面的所有能够思考的敌人眩晕 2 回合。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/leveling.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_perk_ma_level_up"
msgid "Your experience with martial arts has increased!"
msgstr "你的武术经验增加了！"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/leveling.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_perk_ma_initialize"
msgid ""
"Martial Mastery mod is active.  Interact with the \"Practice Martial Arts\" "
"trait from the mutation menu to learn new techniques and perks."
msgstr "武道绝学模组已激活。在变异菜单中选择“练习武术”特性以学习新的招式和能力。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/shrug_off.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shrug it off"
msgstr "耸肩无视"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/shrug_off.json
#. ~ Description of enchantment "Shrug it off"
msgid "You will completely negate the next attack that hits you."
msgstr "你将完全抵消下一次命中你的攻击。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/shrug_off.json
#. ~ Message in effect "sp_shrug_off_hit"
msgid "You shrug off the attack."
msgstr "你对攻击不屑一顾。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/shrug_off.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect "sp_shrug_off_hit"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's no sells the incoming attack."
msgstr "%1$s完全无视了袭来的攻击。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/shrug_off.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sp_shrug_off_hit"
msgid "Shrug Off Trigger"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Insight I"
msgstr "洞察 I"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Insight I"
msgid ""
"You passively accumulate up to 20 insight stacks while near enemies.  Each "
"insight stack increases all damage dealt by 1 until your next attack.  "
"Insight greatly favors perceptive warriors."
msgstr "当你靠近敌人时被动叠加至多 20 层 洞察。每层 洞察 在你下一次攻击前提升所有类型伤害 1 点。洞察 对感知强大的战士很有利。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like Water"
msgstr "如同流水"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like Water"
msgid "You gain a +25 dodge chance if you have at least 10 insight stacks."
msgstr "若你有至少10层洞察效果，将获得+25闪避概率。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sixth Sense"
msgstr "第六感"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sixth Sense"
msgid ""
"You accumulate up to 20 insight stacks even from enemies you can't see.  You "
"can perceive unseen enemies within 10 tiles if you have at least 10 insight "
"stacks."
msgstr "你甚至可以从你看不到的敌人处累积至多 20 层 洞察。当你有至少 10 层 洞察时 你可以感知到 10 格范围内的看不到的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Psychic Sea"
msgstr "灵能之海"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Psychic Sea"
msgid "You can accumulate an infinite number of insight stacks."
msgstr "你可以累积无限层数的洞察效果。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Twilight Form"
msgstr "暮光形态"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Twilight Form"
#, no-c-format
msgid "Whenever you kill an enemy in melee, you retain 50% of your insight stacks."
msgstr "每当你以近战击杀敌人时，将保留你50%的洞察层数。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blind Calculus"
msgstr "本能推算"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blind Calculus"
msgid ""
"If you have been blind for at least 15 turns, every time you would gain an "
"insight stack you instead gain 5."
msgstr "若你已经失明至少15回合，每当你本来会获得一层洞察时，改为获得5层。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mystic Shot I"
msgstr "秘术射击 I"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mystic Shot I"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Insight stacks also increase the accuracy of ranged bow and crossbow attacks "
"by 2% per stack.  Ranged attacks will consume insight stacks."
msgstr "每层洞察效果还会使弓与弩的远程攻击精度提升2%。远程攻击会消耗洞察层数。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mystic Shot II"
msgstr "秘术射击 II"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/insight.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mystic Shot II"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Insight stacks also increase the damage of ranged bow and crossbow attacks by "
"1% per stack."
msgstr "每层洞察效果还会使你的弓与弩的远程攻击伤害提高1%。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/momentum.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Momentum I"
msgstr "动量 I"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/momentum.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Momentum I"
msgid ""
"Rapid movement generates momentum stacks.  Momentum greatly favors dextrous "
"warriors."
msgstr "快速移动产生 动量 层数。动量对敏捷的战士很有利。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/momentum.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Momentum II"
msgstr "动量 II"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/momentum.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Momentum II"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rapid movement generates momentum stacks.  As long as momentum is active your "
"attacks gain extra physical damage equal to 10% of your dexterity.  You gain "
"a point of dexterity for every 2 momentum stacks."
msgstr "快速移动产生 动量 层数。只要动量处于生效状态，你的攻击会获得相当于你敏捷属性 10% 的额外物理伤害。每 2 层动量获得 1 点敏捷。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/momentum.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ballistic Evasion"
msgstr "子弹时间"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/momentum.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ballistic Evasion"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have at least 4 momentum stacks, gain a 5% chance to dodge any ranged "
"attack for every point of dexterity you have.  If you have less than 4 "
"momentum stacks, gain a 1% chance to dodge any ranged attack for every point "
"of dexterity you have."
msgstr "若你拥有至少 4 层 动量 ，每点敏捷可让你获得 5% 远程攻击闪避；若 动量 不足 4 层，则每点敏捷可让你获得 1% 远程攻击闪避。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/momentum.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Duelist Form"
msgstr "决斗架势"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/momentum.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Duelist Form"
msgid ""
"If you have more than 1 momentum stack, your momentum will be set to 1 "
"whenever you wait a turn."
msgstr "若你拥有 动量 层数超过 1 层，当你进行回合等待时， 动量 层数将被重置为 1 层。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Practice Martial Arts"
msgstr "练习武术"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Practice Martial Arts"
msgid "Learn new martial arts techniques and perks."
msgstr "学习新的武术招式和能力。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Carefree Stance"
msgstr "从容姿态"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Carefree Stance"
msgid ""
"You aren't even trying.\n"
"You clear all combat buffs whenever you wait."
msgstr ""
"你根本没使出全力。\n"
"每当你选择等待时，会自动清除所有战斗增益效果。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pressure Points"
msgstr "要害打击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pressure Points"
msgid "Your unarmed melee attacks will redeal damage to their targets after 4 turns."
msgstr "你的徒手近战攻击会在4回合后再次对敌人造成相同伤害。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Flowing Retreat"
msgstr "流水后撤"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Flowing Retreat"
msgid ""
"You'll attempt to move away from your attackers when you successfully dodge "
"an attack.  You'll gain a momentum stack if you can normally gain them."
msgstr "成功闪避攻击时，你会试图远离攻击者，并（若能正常获得）获得一层动能。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Counter Strikes"
msgstr "反击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Counter Strikes"
msgid "You gain +1 accuracy for two turns after a successful block."
msgstr "成功格挡后，你获得 +1 精度 2 回合。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stalwart"
msgstr "钢铁意志"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stalwart"
msgid "You have an extra block attempt per turn."
msgstr "你每回合可额外进行一次格挡。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shrug it off"
msgid "Automatically block the first attack that hits you every 15 turns."
msgstr "每隔15回合会自动格挡首次受到的攻击。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spry footwork"
msgstr "灵动步法"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spry footwork"
msgid "You have an extra dodge attempt per turn."
msgstr "你每回合能获取 1 次额外的闪避次数。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Combat Tempo I"
msgstr "战斗节奏 I"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Combat Tempo I"
msgid ""
"Perfect.  Now do it again.\n"
"Attacks generate stacks of combat tempo.  Tempo greatly favors the strong."
msgstr "完美，再来一击。你的攻击能够积累 战斗节奏 层数。节奏是强者的利器。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Perfect Tempo"
msgid ""
"You gain +15 quickness as long as you have the maximum number of combat tempo "
"stacks."
msgstr "只要你的 战斗节奏 层数达到上限，就能获得 +15 速度。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Tempo Shift"
msgstr "节奏转换"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Tempo Shift"
msgid "Gain a stack of combat tempo whenever you successfully block an attack."
msgstr "每当你成功格挡一次攻击，你获得 1 层 战斗节奏。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unrelenting Assault"
msgstr "无休攻势"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unrelenting Assault"
msgid ""
"Whenever you kill an enemy in melee, you'll advance into their position and "
"automatically attack an adjacent enemy.  You'll gain a momentum stack if you "
"can normally gain them."
msgstr "每当你以近战方式击杀一名敌人时，你将前进至其位置并自动攻击毗邻的一名敌人。若满足获得条件，你将获得 1 层 动量。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Zoning"
msgstr "战域腾挪"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Zoning"
msgid ""
"If you have the maximum number of combat tempo stacks, killing an enemy will "
"move you away from any other adjacent enemies.  This movement action will "
"consume all of your combat tempo stacks, and grant you a momentum stack if "
"can normally gain them."
msgstr "当你的 战斗节奏 层数达到上限时，击杀敌人将使你远离其他相邻敌人。该次移动动作将消耗全部 战斗节奏 层数，并在满足获得条件时获得 1 层 动量。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Measured Throws"
msgstr "精准投掷"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/tempo.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Measured Throws"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your throwing attacks deal 100% more damage for every combat tempo stack you "
"have."
msgstr "你的投掷攻击伤害将根据当前 战斗节奏 层数获得每层 100% 的额外加成。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Execution (Great Sword)"
msgstr "处决（巨剑）"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Execution (Great Sword)"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You deliver a rapid strike to the %s before cleaving them in two with a "
"powerful blow"
msgstr "你先对%s发动一记迅猛突刺，继而以强力一击将其劈为两半。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Execution (Great Sword)"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> cleaves %s in two with a powerful blow"
msgstr "<npcname>以一记强力猛击将 %s 劈作两段。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Execution (Great Hammer)"
msgstr "處決（大錘）"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Execution (Great Hammer)"
#, c-format
msgid "You knock the %s to the ground before delivering a crushing blow"
msgstr "你将%s击退至地面，紧接着施以粉碎性的致命一击。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Execution (Great Hammer)"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> knocks down and crushes %s with a powerful blow"
msgstr "<npcname> knocks down and crushes %s with a powerful blow"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Execution (Great Axe)"
msgstr "處決（大斧）"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Execution (Great Axe)"
#, c-format
msgid "You cleave the %s asunder with a furious slash"
msgstr "You cleave the %s asunder with a furious slash"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/executions.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Execution (Great Axe)"
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Vulgar Opening"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> cleaves into %s with a powerful blow"
msgstr "<npcname> cleaves into %s with a powerful blow"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Staggering Strike"
msgstr "震慑打击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Description of martial technique "Staggering Strike"
msgid "Stun for 1 turn"
msgstr "击晕 1 回合"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Staggering Strike"
msgid ""
"* Only works on a <info>non-stunned</info> target of <info>similar or "
"smaller</info> size."
msgstr "* 仅对<info>未被击倒</info>且体型<info>相近或更小</info>的目标生效。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Brutal Swing"
msgstr "残暴挥击​​"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Description of martial technique "Brutal Swing"
#. ~ Description of martial technique "Brutal Swing (Stunned target)"
msgid "Three tile knockback"
msgstr "三格击退"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Brutal Swing"
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Brutal Swing (Stunned target)"
#, c-format
msgid "You send %s reeling with a brutal strike"
msgstr "你一记猛击，将%s打得踉跄后退"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Brutal Swing (Stunned target)"
msgstr "残暴挥击（眩晕目标）"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Shoulder tackle"
msgstr "肩撞"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Shoulder tackle"
#, c-format
msgid "You ground %s with a shoulder bash"
msgstr "你用一记肩撞将%s撞倒在地"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Shoulder tackle"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> drops %s with a shoulder bash"
msgstr "<npcname> drops %s with a shoulder bash"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Shoulder tackle"
msgid ""
"* Only works on a <info>non-downed humanoid</info> target of <info>similar or "
"smaller</info> size incapable of flight. Requires <info>momentum(3)</info> or "
"higher to trigger."
msgstr "* 仅对<info>未被击倒</info>且体型<info>相近或更小</info>的类人目标生效，需要<info>动量 [3]</info>或更高来触发。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Vulgar Opening"
#, c-format
msgid "You cleave into %s with a mighty strike"
msgstr "You cleave into %s with a mighty strike"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Coiling strike"
msgstr "盘卷旋击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Description of martial technique "Coiling strike"
#. ~ Description of martial technique "Lunge"
msgid "A quick reach attack that scales heavily with perception."
msgstr "A quick reach attack that scales heavily with perception."

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Coiling strike"
#, c-format
msgid "You quickly stab %s with a sideways thrust"
msgstr "你侧向戳击快速击中%s"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Coiling strike"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> stabs %s with a quick thrust"
msgstr "<npcname>侧向戳击快速击中%s"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Make Way"
#, c-format
msgid "You swing through %s and everything nearby with an overhead attack"
msgstr "You swing through %s and everything nearby with an overhead attack"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Make Way"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> swings at %s and everything nearby with an overhead attack"
msgstr "<npcname> swings at %s and everything nearby with an overhead attack"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Fulcrum Kick"
#, c-format
msgid "You use your polearm as a springboard to kick %s"
msgstr "You use your polearm as a springboard to kick %s"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Fulcrum Kick"
msgid ""
"* Only works on a <info>non-downed humanoid</info> target of <info>similar or "
"smaller</info> size incapable of flight."
msgstr "* 仅对体型<info>相近或更小</info>，不能飞行且<info>未被击倒的类人型</info>目标生效。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Estocada"
#, c-format
msgid "You thrust your weapon into %s"
msgstr "你将你的武器刺入%s"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Estocada"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> thrusts their weapon into %s"
msgstr "<npcname>将TA的武器刺入%s"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Estocada"
msgid "* Requires <info>momentum(1)</info> to trigger."
msgstr "* 需 <info>动量 [1]</info> 方可触发。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Lunge"
msgstr "Lunge"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Lunge"
#, c-format
msgid "You step and stab the %s with an elegant motion"
msgstr "You step and stab the %s with an elegant motion"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Lunge"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> steps closer to %s and stabs them with a quick motion"
msgstr "<npcname> steps closer to %s and stabs them with a quick motion"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Knife Counter"
msgstr "Knife Counter"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Knife Counter"
#, c-format
msgid "You slash at the %s as you dodge"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Knife Counter"
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> slashes at %s as they dodge"
msgstr "<npcname> slashes at %s as they dodge"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Slaying Strike"
msgstr "刃锁戮击"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Slaying Strike"
msgid "* Requires <info>tempo(3)</info> to trigger."
msgstr "* 需 <info>战斗节奏 [ 3 ]</info> 方可触发。"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Martial technique name
msgid "Compound strike"
msgstr "连诛终式"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Compound strike"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You cleanly transition from your last attack into a powerful finishing strike "
"against %s"
msgstr "你在前次攻击后行云流水般衔接上一记强而有力的终结技，对%s"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Message of martial technique "Compound strike"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<npcname> cleanly transitions their last attack into a powerful finishing "
"strike against %s"
msgstr "<npcname>在前次攻击后行云流水般衔接上一记强而有力的终结技，对%s"

#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
#. ~ Condition description of martial technique "Compound strike"
msgid ""
"* Can only trigger on the attack that achieves <info>tempo(3)</info>.  The "
"attacked target must be the same as the previous two attacks."
msgstr "* 仅在达成 <info>战斗节奏 [ 3 ]</info> 时的那次攻击生效。本次攻击目标必须与前两次攻击目标相同。"

#: data/mods/Personal_Portal_Storms/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Portal Storms Ignore NPCs"
msgstr "NPC不受空間風暴影響"

#: data/mods/Personal_Portal_Storms/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Portal Storms Ignore NPCs"
msgid ""
"Makes Portal Storm enemies only attack the player.  Without this critical "
"NPCs can die to Portal Storm enemies in very unfair ways.  More work needs to "
"be done on AI and faction base security before it will be safe to disable "
"this."
msgstr "使空間風暴生成敵人只會攻擊玩家。沒有這個的話NPC很容易以不公平的方式死於空間風暴。建議在AI和陣營的保安措施更好之前別關閉此項。"

#: data/mods/Rummaging/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Rummaging"
msgstr "翻箱倒櫃"

#: data/mods/Rummaging/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Rummaging"
msgid ""
"Some furniture containers need to open the door to scavenge, to enhance the "
"thrill of scavenging."
msgstr "部分家具容器必須先開啟才能搜刮，以增加搜刮物品時的新奇感。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultysafeguard"
msgid ""
"You haven't selected a difficulty.  This could be because you're playing an "
"old save.\n"
"\n"
"Your current difficulty has been set to Normal.  In this setting, you will "
"have 4 hours in every expedition to reach the exit and leave safely.  After "
"this, warp sickness sets in and applies heavy debuffs until you exit.  After "
"6 hours, warp disintegration begins, and you will rapidly lose health until "
"you exit or die."
msgstr ""
"你尚未選擇難度。這可能是因為你正在玩舊的存檔。\n"
"\n"
"你目前的難度被設為普通。在這個設定中，每次探險你會有4個小時的時間抵達出口並安全逃離。在此之後，你將受到傳送失調的影響，並在逃離之前受到嚴重的 "
"debuff。6個小時後，傳送瓦解將開始，你將迅速流失生命，直到你逃離或死亡為止。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_initiate_randomport"
msgid "It seems the portal couldn't find a valid location."
msgstr "无法找到一个有效的位置。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_award_material_tokens"
msgid ""
"You've returned home safely using a designated exit point.  You have earned "
"<global_val:owed_material_tokens> material tokens for your success."
msgstr "你已经通过指定撤离点安全回家了。你因此获得了<global_val:owed_material_tokens>材料代币作为成功的奖励。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_progressgate1"
msgid ""
"You've proved you can survive a few excursions to the world below.  Something "
"in the warp pulls at you, quickening your pulse and turning your vision red.  "
"The sensation is indescribable.  You feel… powerful.\n"
"The Heart of the Island may have further use for you.\n"
"\n"
"Healing at the Heart of the Island is no longer free.  Be cautious in your "
"future endeavors."
msgstr ""
"你已经证明你能够在地面存活好几次。翘曲之力正在牵引着你,加快你的脉搏,使你的视线变为红色。这种感觉难以形容。你感到......强大。\n"
"空岛之心也许对你还有进一步的用途。\n"
"\n"
"在空岛之心处恢复不再免费。在未来的行动中要谨慎行事。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_progressgate2"
msgid ""
"You've drank deep of the warpstream and survived to tell the tale, though "
"your unique isolation makes finding ears to listen difficult.  The fragments "
"of this reality have risen against you, and you have weathered the storm… for "
"now.\n"
"You feel confident, powerful.  Your mouth tastes of blood.  As the familiar "
"world takes shape around you once more, you understand the Heart of the "
"Island will surely be interested in your continued growth."
msgstr ""
"你已深深地品尝了翘曲洪流的滋味,并且幸存下来讲述这段经历,尽管你独特的孤立使得很难找到听故事的人。这个现实的碎片已经反过来攻击你了,你暂时挺过了这场风暴.."
"....暂时\n"
"你更加自信、强大。你已经尝到了血的味道。当熟悉的世界再次在你周围现形时,你明白空岛之心必定对你持续的成长感兴趣。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
msgid ""
"This will teleport you back to your sky island.  Any items inside the room "
"will be teleported home alongside you.  Are you ready to leave?"
msgstr "这将把你传送回你的浮空岛。房间里所有物品都将与你一起被传送回安全区。你准备好离开了吗?"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
msgid ""
"This will teleport you back to your sky island.  You will spend your vortex "
"token to return any items in the room home alongside you.  Are you ready to "
"leave?"
msgstr "这将把你传送回你的浮空岛。你将消耗你的漩涡代币,以将房间里所有物品与你一起传送回安全区。你准备好离开了吗?"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
msgid ""
"This will teleport you back to your sky island.  Any items not on your person "
"WILL BE LOST.  Are you ready to leave?"
msgstr "这将把你传送回你的浮空岛。任何不在你身上的物品都将遗失。你准备好离开了吗?"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_return_OM_teleport_item"
msgid "Now teleporting back home.  Please wait…"
msgstr "正在传送回安全区，请稍等......"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_youdied"
msgid ""
"Moments before your last breath leaves your body, the mote of warp essence on "
"you jolts with a brilliant energy.  Its thin filament immediately snaps "
"tight, reeling you home faster than you can process what it was that just "
"saved your life.  The mote is spent, but you arrive home alive and well."
msgstr ""
"就在最後一口氣離開你的身體之際，你身上的傳送精華微粒突然閃爍出耀眼的能量。它的薄絲立刻緊縮，你已經被帶回了家中，而你還來不及理解剛才是什麼拯救了你的生命。那"
"個微粒已經耗盡，但你平安無事地回到了家。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_deathconfirmed"
msgid ""
"You died at home?  What's the matter with you?  Stop this.  You are restored. "
" The powers that be have made you temporarily incorporeal, in case you were "
"stuck in a deadly loop."
msgstr "你死在家裡了？你是怎麼回事？停下來。你已經回復了。權力所有者使你暫時無形，以免你困在死亡迴圈。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_deathconfirmed"
msgid ""
"You feel the icy grip of death begin to take you, and the world whirls and "
"rushes past.  Reality bends and at the peak of your last mortal moment, "
"something snags you and hauls you through space and time.  Your mind has been "
"preserved, at cost, and your body is not far behind."
msgstr ""
"你感受到死亡的冰冷之握開始吞噬你，整個世界迴旋、掠過。現實彎曲，在你最後的臨死時刻，某種力量抓住了你，拉你穿越時空。你的思想已被救下了，但代價不小，你的身體"
"也一樣。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEAL_NEWBIE"
msgid ""
"The island's grace heals you at no charge.\n"
"This effect will only be free until you have survived 10 expeditions."
msgstr ""
"空岛恩赐免费治愈了你。\n"
"这种效果在你活着完成10次探险之前都是免费的。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEAL_NEWBIE"
msgid ""
"The warp shards you were holding dissipate into a mist and swirl in tiny "
"vortices around your body.  The price is paid, and you are healed."
msgstr "你手中的翘曲碎片化为一团雾气，在你身体周围形成小型漩涡。代价已付出,你的伤势得到了治愈。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEAL_NEWBIE"
msgid "You must have the required payment on your person to be healed."
msgstr "要被治愈，你必须在身上携带足够的代币。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_healall"
msgid ""
"Your body mends itself in the blink of an eye.  Underlying health issues may "
"persist, but your structural integrity is restored."
msgstr "你的身體在眨眼間修復自己。潛在的健康問題可能還存在，但你的結構完整性已經恢復。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_healall"
msgid ""
"The effect is wasted and you don't feel any better.  You have to be in your "
"sanctuary to be healed by this!"
msgstr "效果被浪費了，你感覺一點好轉都沒有。你必須在你的空島才能被治愈！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "scenario_warp_begins"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Sky Islands.\n"
"\n"
"Speak to the Heart of the Island to get your bearings, accept missions, "
"manage upgrades, change your difficulty settings, and more."
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到浮空岛。\n"
"\n"
"与空岛之心交谈，你可以获得方位信息、接受任务、管理升级、调整难度设置等等。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
msgid "Casual"
msgstr "休闲"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
msgid ""
"In Casual difficulty, time limits are more relaxed.\n"
"Warp pulses occur every 30 minutes.  This means warp sickness sets in after 4 "
"hours of being earthside, and disintegration at 6 hours.  You will have more "
"time for activities and reaching the extract should generally not be a "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"在休闲难度下，时间限制更加宽松。\n"
"每 30 分钟将产生一道翘曲脉冲，这意味着在你每次探险开始 4 小时后会出现翘曲失调，再过 2 "
"小时则将发生翘曲解体。你将会有更多的时间探险，找到撤离点一般也不会是难事。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
msgid ""
"In Normal Difficulty, pulses occur every 15 minutes.  This means on every "
"expedition, you will have 2 hours to explore, fight, loot, and find the exit "
"before warp sickness sets in, and 3 hours total before disintegration begins.\n"
"This is the intended way to play.  Getting to the exit is not a cakewalk, but "
"you should have time to explore while earthside."
msgstr ""
"在普通难度下，每 15 分钟将产生一道翘曲脉冲，这意味着在你每次探险中将有 2 小时时间用于探险、战斗、搜刮、撤离，而此后就会出现翘曲失调，而再过 1 "
"小时后将发生翘曲解体。\n"
"这是推荐的难度设置。要撤离并非特别简单，但你一般有足够的时间进行探险。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
msgid ""
"In Hard difficulty, time limits are strict.\n"
"Warp pulses occur every 10 minutes.  This means warp sickness sets in after "
"only 1 hour 20 minutes of being earthside, and disintegration at 2 hours.  "
"You will have much less time to spare and must make getting to the exit your "
"immediate priority."
msgstr ""
"在困难难度下，时间限制更加严格。\n"
"每 10 分钟将产生一道翘曲脉冲，这意味着在你每次探险开始 1 小时 20 分钟后会出现翘曲失调，再过 40 "
"分钟后则将发生翘曲解体。你将不会有太多的探险时间，建议将抵达撤离点放在首位。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
msgid ""
"In Impossible difficulty, time limits are extremely tight.\n"
"Warp pulses occur every 5 minutes.  This means warp sickness sets in after "
"only 40 minutes of being earthside, and disintegration at 1 hour.  Reaching "
"the extract alive will take all the time you can spare, and warp sickness "
"will be common.  You will not be given mercy!"
msgstr ""
"在地狱难度下，时间限制将会十分严格。\n"
"每 5 分钟将产生一道翘曲脉冲，这意味着在你每次探险开始 40 分钟后会出现翘曲失调，再过 20 "
"分钟则将发生翘曲解体。仅仅是抵达撤离点几乎就会花掉你的所有时间，你将会与传送病为伴，世界不会对你有一点仁慈！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
msgid "Select a Difficulty"
msgstr "选择难度"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty_DEFAULTS"
msgid ""
"All difficulty settings set to default.  You can speak to the Heart of the "
"Island to change these at any time."
msgstr "所有难度设置均为默认。你可以随时和空岛之心交谈以改变难度设置。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty0"
msgid ""
"Difficulty set to Casual.  You can speak to the Heart of the Island to change "
"this at any time."
msgstr "当前难度为休闲。你可以随时和空岛之心交谈以改变难度设置。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty1"
msgid ""
"Difficulty set to Normal.  You can speak to the Heart of the Island to change "
"this at any time."
msgstr "当前难度为普通。你可以随时和空岛之心交谈以改变难度设置。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty2"
msgid ""
"Difficulty set to Hard.  You can speak to the Heart of the Island to change "
"this at any time."
msgstr "当前难度为困难。你可以随时和空岛之心交谈以改变难度设置。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty3"
msgid ""
"Difficulty set to Impossible.  You can speak to the Heart of the Island to "
"change this at any time."
msgstr "当前难度为地狱。你可以随时和空岛之心交谈以改变难度设置。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
msgid "Whole Room"
msgstr "带回整个房间内"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
msgid "Whole Room for a Cost"
msgstr "使用旋涡代币带回整个房间内"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
msgid "Self Only"
msgstr "仅物品栏"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, everything in the room with you will return to your sky "
"island.  Getting resources will generally not be a problem as long as you "
"make it to the extraction point."
msgstr ""
"设置归源尖碑。\n"
"选择这个选项,返回房间里的一切都会回到你的浮空岛上。只要你能到达撤离点,资源通常不会是个问题。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, if you have a warp vortex token with you, everything in the "
"room with you will return to your sky island.  Otherwise, only what you are "
"carrying on your person will return with you.  You may have to make difficult "
"choices about what to bring back."
msgstr ""
"设置归源尖碑。\n"
"选择这个选项时，如果你手上有一枚漩涡代币,那么撤离点房间里的一切都会随你一起返回浮空岛。否则,只有你个人携带的物品会被带回去,"
"其他的东西都将遗失。在这种情况下,你可能不得不做出艰难的选择,决定要带回哪些物品。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, only what you are carrying on your person will return with "
"you.  You will always have to make difficult choices about what to bring back."
msgstr ""
"设置归源尖碑。\n"
"选择这个选项时,只有随身携带的东西会与你一起返回。在这种情况下,你可能不得不做出艰难的选择,决定要带回哪些物品。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
msgid "Adjust Return Obelisk Behavior"
msgstr "设置归源尖碑"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_warphome_adjuster_1"
msgid ""
"Warp home behavior set to whole room.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if "
"you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "折跃回程的生效范围为整个房间。 你可以使用难度石板随时进行调整。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_warphome_adjuster_2"
msgid ""
"Warp home behavior set to whole room at a cost.  You can use the Difficulty "
"Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "付出代价后折跃回程的生效范围为整个房间。 你可以使用难度石板随时进行调整。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_warphome_adjuster_3"
msgid ""
"Warp home behavior set to self only.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if "
"you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "折跃回程的生效范围仅为你自己携带的东西。 你可以使用难度石板随时进行调整。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid "Get the Warp Home spell"
msgstr "获得折跃回程法术"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid "Get the Warped Return spell"
msgstr "获得翘曲回程法术"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid "Get the Warped Skyward Beacon recipe"
msgstr "获得回程锚点配方"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid "Get nothing"
msgstr "什么都不选择"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, you will receive a spell that will return you home at any "
"time for no cost.  It takes one minute to cast.  Using this will remove most "
"of the challenge of the mod."
msgstr ""
"设置在没有撤离点的情况下返回安全区的可能性。\n"
"选择这个选项,你将获得一个随时可以无成本返回安全区的法术。施放这个法术需要一分钟时间。使用这个选项将会大大降低模组的挑战性。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, you will receive a spell that will return you home at any "
"time by paying 1 warp shard.  It takes one minute to cast.  You may not be "
"near any enemies when the spell is successfully cast or it will have no "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"设置在没有撤离点的情况下返回安全区的可能性。\n"
"选择这个选项,你将获得一个可以通过支付1个翘曲碎片以来返回安全区的法术。施放这个法术需要一分钟时间。在法术施放时,你附近不能有任何敌人,否则法术将无效。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, you will receive a recipe to craft a Warped Skyward Beacon. "
" This costs 5 warp shards and when used, casts the Warped Return spell."
msgstr ""
"设置在没有撤离点的情况下返回安全区的可能性。\n"
"选择这个选项,你将获得一个回程锚点的制造配方。这需要消耗5个翘曲碎片,使用后会施放翘曲回程法术。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, your only choice is to find the extraction point.  Good "
"luck!"
msgstr ""
"设置在没有撤离点的情况下返回安全区的可能性。\n"
"选择这个选项,你唯一的选择就是找到撤离点。祝你好运!"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
msgid "Select Emergency Return Options"
msgstr "紧急返回选项"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_warpspell_adjuster_1"
msgid ""
"Warp Home spell granted.  You may find it in your spellcasting menu.  You can "
"use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "已获得折跃回程法术。你可以在法术施放菜单中找到它。如果你希望更改设置,可以调整难度选项。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_warpspell_adjuster_2"
msgid ""
"Warped Return spell granted.  You may find it in your spellcasting menu.  You "
"can use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any "
"time."
msgstr "已获得翘曲回程法术。你可以在法术施放菜单中找到它。如果你希望更改设置,可以调整难度选项。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_warpspell_adjuster_3"
msgid ""
"Warped Skyward Beacon recipe granted.  You may find it in the Warp crafting "
"menu.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting "
"at any time."
msgstr "已获得回程锚点配方。你可以在制造菜单中找到它。如果你希望更改设置,可以调整难度选项。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_warpspell_adjuster_4"
msgid ""
"All additional returning options removed.  You can use the Difficulty "
"Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "所有额外返回选项都已禁止。如果你希望更改设置,可以调整难度选项。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
msgid "View Expedition Stats"
msgstr "查看探险统计信息"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
msgid "View Upgrades"
msgstr "视野升级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
msgid "View Construction"
msgstr "视野构造"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
msgid ""
"Displays statistics on how your expeditions have gone so far and how your "
"warp sickness works."
msgstr "显示你的探险任务到目前为止的统计数据以及你的翘曲失调是如何运作的。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
msgid "Displays your current progress on permanent upgrades."
msgstr "显示当前永久升级进度。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
msgid "Displays your current progress on constructions."
msgstr "显示当前建设进度。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
msgid "What do you wish to learn?"
msgstr "你希望学些什么?"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_progresscheck"
msgid ""
"Island Rank: <global_val:islandrank_readable> of 2\n"
"Expedition Lengths: <global_val:longerraids> of 2\n"
"Expedition Starts: <global_val:totalstarts> of 4\n"
"Bonus Pulses: <global_val:bonuspulses> of 4\n"
"Target reveal distance: <global_val:scoutingdistancetargets> of 10\n"
"Landing reveal distance: <global_val:scoutingdistancelanding> of 24\n"
"Warpcloak duration in seconds: <global_val:invistime> of 120\n"
"Slaughter missions unlocked: <global_val:slaughterunlocked> of 1\n"
"Exits per expedition: <global_val:totalexits> of 3\n"
