#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Earthside"
msgstr "落地"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthside"
msgid ""
"You are away from your sanctuary island.  Over time, you will begin to "
"succumb to the intangible miasma of the world below, and your stats will "
"suffer.  You have several hours after warp before this becomes a problem, "
"after which it will rapidly get worse until you warp home or die."
msgstr ""
"你離開了你的庇護島嶼。隨著時間的推移，你將開始受到下界無形的瘴氣影響，你的屬性會受到影響。在傳送之後的數小時內，這不會成為問題，之後情況將迅速惡化，直到你傳"
"送回家或死亡。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
msgid "Warp Disintegration!"
msgstr "傳送瓦解！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
msgid "Warp Necrosis"
msgstr "傳送壞死"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
msgid "Warp Debilitation"
msgstr "傳送虛弱"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
msgid "Warp Sickness"
msgstr "傳送失調"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
msgid "Warp Nausea"
msgstr "傳送噁心"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpsickness"
msgid "Warp Stability"
msgstr "傳送穩定性"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Disintegration!"
msgid ""
"You're going to die.  And if you weren't busy leaking blood out of every "
"pore, you'd find a better way to emphasize just how badly you're dying.  Your "
"only hope is to return home immediately."
msgstr "你快要死了。要不是你正忙著從每個毛孔滲出血來，你會找到更好的方式來強調你離死亡有多麼接近。你唯一的希望就是立刻返回家中。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Necrosis"
msgid ""
"The very fabric of your being is unraveling!  You're in dire straits.  You "
"need to get back to your sanctuary island NOW!"
msgstr "你的存在本質正在解體！你處於生死關頭中。你現在必須立刻返回你的空島！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Debilitation"
msgid ""
"You've stayed earthside WAY too long!  Your body barely responds and your "
"senses are slush.  The world itself feels barbed and frayed, and the very air "
"is like breathing fiberglass.  If you want to survive, you need to warp home "
"as soon as possible."
msgstr "你在地面停留的時間太長了！你的身體幾乎沒有反應，感官也變得麻木。世界感覺像是被鋸齒割裂，空氣就像是呼吸玻璃纖維一樣。如果你想生存下去，你需要儘快回到家中。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Sickness"
msgid ""
"You've stayed earthside too long.  Your body aches and your senses are "
"dulling.  Every step feels like you're walking through thick mud and "
"breathing hot tar.  You should warp home as soon as you can, or this is only "
"going to get worse."
msgstr "你在地面停留的時間太長了。你的身體疼痛，感官也變得遲鈍。每一步感覺就像在走在厚重的泥巴上，吸入的空氣像熱焦油一樣。你應該儘快回家，否則情況只會變得更糟。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Nausea"
msgid ""
"You've overstayed your time earthside.  It's getting hard to concentrate, "
"there's a painful ringing in your ears, and your muscles sting and jolt.  "
"Every action feels delayed.  You need to warp home to refresh yourself, or "
"this is going to get worse.  Probably within just a few hours."
msgstr ""
"你在地面的待太久了。集中注意力變得困難，耳裡響著痛苦的鈴聲，肌肉感到刺痛和抽動。每一個動作都感覺緩慢。你需要立刻回到家中讓自己恢復，否則情況可能只需要幾個小"
"時就會變得更糟。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warp Stability"
msgid ""
"You're fresh from your stay at your sanctuary island.  The intangible miasma "
"of terra firma currently has no effect on you, and you feel fine.  This "
"should last for several hours.  Stay too long, however, and you'll gradually "
"begin to suffer ever-worsening debilitating effects."
msgstr "你剛從空島到來，現在陸地的無形瘴氣還沒有任何影響，你感覺很好。這種狀態應該會持續幾個小時。然而，如果停留的時間太長，你將逐漸開始遭受越來越嚴重的虛弱效果。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
msgid ""
"There are no words to describe how much trouble you're in.  Your body is "
"crumbling to wet paste and your blood is twisting into a viny tangle.  All "
"you know is pain.  You're not just dying, you're dying horribly.  Your only "
"hope is escape to your sanctuary, but oblivion is only moments away."
msgstr ""
"你已經無法形容自己陷入了多大的麻煩。你的身體正在破碎成泥，你的血液扭曲成藤蔓纏繞。你只感受到痛苦。你不僅僅是在死亡，而是在可怕地死去。唯一的希望是逃離到你的"
"空島，但湮滅只消片刻。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
msgid ""
"You taste blood and your eyes sink back into their sockets.  You've stayed "
"out too long.  Your warp sickness is about to consume you entirely and you're "
"falling apart at the seams.  Get home NOW!"
msgstr "你嘗到了血腥味，眼睛陷入了眼窩。你在外面逗留的時間太長了。你的傳送失調即將完全吞噬你，你正從接縫處散開。現在就回家！快！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
msgid ""
"The ravages of the world intensify.  Everything hurts and existence is a "
"surreal wash of pain.  Your warp sickness is unbearable.  You need to get "
"home as soon as possible."
msgstr "世界的摧殘逐漸加劇。一切都痛苦不堪，存在是一場超現實的痛苦洗禮。你的傳送失調讓你難以忍受。你需要盡快回家。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
msgid ""
"The bile suddenly rises in your throat and your fingers feel like they're "
"peeling themselves open.  Your warp sickness is getting worse.  You should "
"get home soon."
msgstr "胃酸突然湧上喉頭，你的手指感覺就像他們在把自己撕開。你的傳送失調正在加劇。你應該盡快回家。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warp Disintegration!, Warp Necrosis, Warp
#. Debilitation, Warp Sickness, Warp Nausea, Warp Stability"
msgid ""
"The whole world shimmers in front of your eyes.  Everything feels slow and "
"sticky.  Warp sickness is setting in.  You should focus on getting home."
msgstr "整個世界在你眼前閃爍。一切感覺都變得緩慢而黏膩。傳送失調開始發作了。你應該想想回家的事了。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpdisintegration"
msgid "Disintegrating!"
msgstr "瓦解中！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Disintegrating!"
msgid "Prolonged warp is destroying you.  You're coming apart."
msgstr "過長的傳送正在摧毀你。你正在分崩離析。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disintegrating!"
msgid "You're being unmade!"
msgstr "你正在解體！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disintegrating!"
msgid "The rending of the warp has finally abated.  You feel like you exist again."
msgstr "撕裂的傳送力量終於消散了。你感覺自己再次存在。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "warpcloak"
msgid "Warpcloaked"
msgstr "傳送匿蹤"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warpcloaked"
msgid ""
"You are invisible for a very brief time.  Now's your chance to get to cover.  "
"You're also incorporeal enough to not take fall damage, but hopefully that "
"won't be relevant."
msgstr "你在極短的時間內隱形。現在是你找掩蔽的機會。你的身體也變得無形能避免摔傷，希望你用不到這項能力。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warpcloaked"
msgid "You fully materialize.  You're not invisible anymore!"
msgstr "你完全實體化了。你不再隱形了！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Warpcloaked"
msgid "Your warpcloak is about to fade away."
msgstr "Your warpcloak is about to fade away."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_warped_waterwalking"
msgid "Warped Waterwalking"
msgstr "翘曲水行"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_warped_super_clairvoyance"
msgid "Warped Omniscience"
msgstr "Warped Omniscience"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Warped Omniscience"
msgid "Nothing escapes your sight."
msgstr "Nothing escapes your sight."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Warped Omniscience"
msgid "Your vision expands until you see everything."
msgstr "Your vision expands until you see everything."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warped Omniscience"
msgid "Your sight returns to normal."
msgstr "Your sight returns to normal."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Warp Obelisk"
msgstr "傳送方尖碑"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Warp Obelisk"
msgid ""
"This strange, towering monolith is the only lifeline you have to the outside "
"world.  Despite its massive size, it's surprisingly easy to move around the "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"It seems you can interact with it."
msgstr ""
"这座奇怪的高耸巨石是你与外界唯一的联系。尽管它体积庞大，但在这个岛屿上移动它却出乎意料地容易。\n"
"\n"
"似乎你可以与它互动。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Island's Heart"
msgstr "空岛之心"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Island's Heart"
msgid ""
"A swirling, surreal statue of organic shapes carved from dark stone.  In your "
"head, a voice speaks faintly.  Despite its massive size, it's surprisingly "
"easy to move around the island.\n"
"\n"
"It seems you can interact with it."
msgstr ""
"一座由黑色石头雕刻而成的，由有机形状组成的漩涡状超现实雕像。 在你的脑海中，有一个声音在微弱地说话。 "
"尽管它体积庞大，但在这个岛屿上移动它却出乎意料地容易。\n"
"\n"
"似乎你可以与它互动。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Return Obelisk"
msgstr "回歸方尖碑"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Return Obelisk"
msgid "A strange statue that will take you back home."
msgstr "能帶你回家的奇怪雕像。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "open air"
msgid ""
"This is the edge of the island.  A metaphysical border stops you from going "
"over the edge yourself, but anything you drop here will be gone forever."
msgstr "這是島嶼的邊緣。一個超自然的邊界阻止你自己走過邊緣，但你丟在這裡的東西將永遠消失。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "warpglass wall"
msgstr "傳送玻璃牆"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "warpglass wall"
msgid ""
"A shimmering translucent barrier that almost yields to the touch, but "
"adamantly refuses entry."
msgstr "閃爍著的半透明屏障，幾乎可以觸碰到，但堅決拒絕事物進入。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nearby warp obelisk"
msgid_plural "nearby warp obelisks"
msgstr[0] "附近的傳送方尖碑"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of "nearby warp obelisk"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity tree"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity stone"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity ore"
msgid "This is a crafting_pseudo_item if you have it something is wrong."
msgstr "這是測試用的製造仿冒物品，如果你有這物品那一定是BUG。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nearby infinity tree"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity trees"
msgstr[0] "靠近无限树"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "infinity tree"
msgstr "无限树"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity tree"
msgid ""
"Purple-blue shimmers sparkle around the leaves of this small sapling.  New "
"growth seems to spring up in seconds, as if in a timelapse, and yet there "
"never seem to be too many branches.  It's always in equilibrium.  Its strange "
"nature allows you to push it around like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this tree allows you to produce raw wooden items from material "
"tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"这棵小树苗的树叶周围闪烁着紫蓝色的光芒。 新的树枝仿佛把世界时停中后一瞬间就长出来了，但树枝的数量似乎永远不会有很多。 它总是处于平衡状态。 "
"它奇怪的特性允许你像家具一样推着它走。\n"
"\n"
"这棵树的力量允许你通过制作菜单使用材料代币来制作原始的木制品。 \n"
"只需一个这样的东西就可以永远维持下去。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nearby infinity stone"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity stones"
msgstr[0] "靠近无限石"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "infinity stone"
msgstr "无限石"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity stone"
msgid ""
"Wisps of iridescent energy spark around this immense stone like miniature "
"fireworks, leaving behind a satisfying showers of pebbles.  Clay and soil "
"shift around its base, erupting in slow motion yet never overflowing.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this stone allows you to produce rocks and natural earthen items "
"from material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"虹彩能量围绕着这块巨大的石头闪烁，就像小型烟花一样，留下许多鹅卵石。粘土和土壤在其底部蠕动，缓慢喷出，但永远不会溢出。\n"
"\n"
"这块石头的力量允许你通过制作菜单使用材料代币来制作岩石和泥土制品。\n"
"只需要一个这样的东西就可以永远维持下去。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nearby infinity ore"
msgid_plural "nearby infinity ores"
msgstr[0] "靠近无限矿"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "infinity ore"
msgstr "无限矿"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity ore"
msgid ""
"A roiling, rattling mass of ever-churning metal.  Flares of purple energy arc "
"around the formless pile like electricity, and in their wake, thin metal rods "
"and struts jut out, before disappearing into the half-molten heap which never "
"seems to grow or diminish.  Its strange nature allows you to shift it around "
"like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this ore allows you to produce raw and basic metal items from "
"material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"这是一团永不停歇的金属块。紫色的能量在这团无定形的堆积物周围像电流一样跳跃,在它们的余波中,细长的金属杆和支架会突出出来,然后又消失在半融化的堆积物中,"
"这种堆积物似乎永远也不会增加或减少。它奇特的性质让你可以像移动家具一样移动它。\n"
"\n"
"这种矿石的力量可以让你通过制作菜单使用材料代币生产出基本的金属制品。\n"
"\n"
"只需一个这样的东西就可以永远维持下去。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "warped rock"
msgstr "扭曲岩石"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "warped rock"
msgid ""
"A sparkly-black stone that's glassy smooth to the touch.  Seems "
"indestructible by normal means."
msgstr "一块闪亮的黑色石头，摸起来像玻璃一样光滑。看起来无法用常规手段摧毁它。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "glzt!"
msgstr "咯吱！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Warped Autodoc Mk. XXII"
msgstr "全自动医疗仪 XXII 型"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Warped Autodoc Mk. XXII"
msgid ""
"A surgical apparatus used for the installation and removal of bionics.  The "
"term name 'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as it can only operate if "
"programmed beforehand, something that a plethora of labels warn against doing "
"without expertise.  Bluish-purple sparks occasionally emit from some of the "
"mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"一个用于安装和移除生化插件的外科器械。\"全自动医疗仪\""
"其实是一个错误的名字，因为它只能在预先编程的情况下才能操作，上面用一系列警告标志提醒用户不要在没有专业知识的情况下进行操作。一些装置偶尔会发出蓝紫色的火花。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Warped Autodoc Mk. XXXIII"
msgstr "全自动医疗仪 XXXIII 型"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Warped Autodoc Mk. XXXIII"
msgid ""
"A surgical apparatus used for the installation and removal of bionics.  The "
"term name 'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as it can only operate if "
"programmed beforehand, something that a plethora of labels warn against doing "
"without expertise.  Bluish-purple sparks frequently emit from some of the "
"mechanisms, and the entire machine has a faint violet glow."
msgstr ""
"一个用于安装和移除生化插件的外科器械。\"全自动医疗仪\""
"其实是一个错误的名字，因为它只能在预先编程的情况下才能操作，上面用一系列警告标志提醒用户不要在没有专业知识的情况下进行操作。一些装置经常发出蓝紫色的火花，整"
"个机器发出微弱的紫色光芒。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/island_mapgen.json
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "sky island"
msgstr "空島"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/island_upgrades.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_memorize_island"
msgid "Mapping island for future construction…"
msgstr "為未來的建設繪製島嶼地圖…"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quickheal pill"
msgid_plural "quickheal pills"
msgstr[0] "快速治療藥丸"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "quickheal pill"
msgid ""
"This pseudomagical pill will heal all your damaged parts, but only if "
"swallowed while on your sanctuary island.  No reason to bring this into the "
"field."
msgstr "這種類魔法藥丸能夠治愈你所有受損的部位，但只有在空島上吞下時才有效。沒有理由帶到戰場上。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warped lumberjack's bag"
msgid_plural "warped lumberjack's bags"
msgstr[0] "翘曲伐木背包"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "warped lumberjack's bag"
#. ~ Description of "warped excavator's bag"
#. ~ Description of "warped scrapper's bag"
msgid ""
"THIS ITEM HAS BEEN OBSOLETED.  If you have one from an old save, you may "
"continue to use it, but no more may be crafted.  You can deconstruct this for "
"a full refund on warp shards."
msgstr "此物品已过时。如果你从旧存档中得到一个，你可以继续使用它，但不能再制作。你可以分解它以获得翘曲碎片。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warped excavator's bag"
msgid_plural "warped excavator's bags"
msgstr[0] "翘曲掘土背包"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warped scrapper's bag"
msgid_plural "warped scrapper's bags"
msgstr[0] "翘曲废铁背包"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warped hauler's harness"
msgid_plural "warped hauler's harnesses"
msgstr[0] "翘曲搬运轭带"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "warped hauler's harness"
msgid ""
"A looped pair of shimmering blue-black straps that can be worn over the "
"shoulders like a harness.  They can snugly fit a single item of nearly any "
"size in comfort, and any burdens carried here feel twice as light.  Ideal for "
"squeezing one more bulky item home through the exit when your hands are "
"already full, or even some container packed full of other items!  Just beware "
"you don't break your back doing it."
msgstr ""
"一对闪耀着蓝黑色光泽的环形带子，可以像背带一样戴在肩上。它们能紧密地适应几乎任何尺寸的单件物品，并且在这里携带的任何负担感觉轻了一半。当你的双手已经满满当当"
"时，它是理想的选择，可以让你挤出一条路，带着一个笨重的物品回家，甚至是装满其他物品的容器！只是要小心不要因此伤到你的背。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "earthbound pill"
msgid_plural "earthbound pills"
msgstr[0] "迟返药丸"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "earthbound pill"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This pseudomagical pill extends the amount of time you can stay earthside by "
"4 pulses, or about 50% of a normal trip.  They're precious, but should help "
"buy time for a difficult extract."
msgstr "这种如魔法般的药丸可以将你在地表上停留的时间延长4次脉冲，即普通难度的一半时间左右。它们很珍贵，但能为你脱离险境赢得宝贵时间。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homeward mote"
msgid_plural "homeward motes"
msgstr[0] "溯返之尘"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "homeward mote"
msgid ""
"Though visibly little more than a glowing dustbunny, this strange ethereal "
"mote of warp essence reveals, on closer inspection, something more.  A tiny, "
"twisting, half-visible thread of shimmering bluish-purple trails away into "
"the sky and far out of sight, unimpeded by any obstacles.\n"
"\n"
"Taking this rare and valuable artifact with you on an expedition is "
"essentially buying life insurance.  If you die with this mote in your "
"inventory, you will instead be restored to full health and brought home, WITH "
"all items and equipment carried.  But this effect will only last for a single "
"expedition.  Even if you extract safely, any and all motes carried on your "
"person when you return home will be DESTROYED."
msgstr ""
"看上去只是一小团发光的尘兔，但仔细观察后，这团奇异飘渺的翘曲微粒蕴含着更多的东西。一条纤细扭曲的半透明丝线闪烁着蓝紫色光芒，一直延伸到天空之中，远离视线，不"
"受任何障碍物的阻碍。\n"
"\n"
"带着这件稀有而珍贵的神器去探险，本质上是给自己买了份保险。只要你携带着这件物品，如果在探险中死亡，你会完好无损的回到岛上，你身上的所有东西也都会保留。但这种"
"效果只能生效一次。即使你从安全撤离，这件物品也会失效并消失。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "homeward mote"
msgid "A hasty escape."
msgstr "仓促逃跑。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warped animal carrier"
msgid_plural "warped animal carriers"
msgstr[0] "翘曲动物携具"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "warped animal carrier"
msgid ""
"A hand-sized cage with a shimmering portal at its aperture.  Despite being "
"shaped more like a cat carrier, the power of warp enables it to capture "
"creatures far bigger than you.  This may be your best bet for bringing "
"animals home to your island sanctuary.  Activate to capture an adjacent "
"animal, or to release a carried animal."
msgstr ""
"一个手掌大小的笼子，开口处闪闪发光。尽管形状更像猫笼，但翘曲力量使其能够捕获比你大得多的生物。这可能是你将动物带回岛上的最佳选择。激活以捕获邻近的动物，或释"
"放携带的动物。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Autodoc copyplate (inert)"
msgid_plural "Autodoc copyplates (inert)"
msgstr[0] "全自动医疗仪复制板（空白）"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "Autodoc copyplate (inert)"
msgid ""
"This strange obsidian-colored plate is capable of mimicking the advanced tech "
"found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy at "
"your sanctuary.  However, it is inert in its current state and must first be "
"imprinted on a working Autodoc.  To do so, find an Autodoc during an "
"expedition and use the construction menu to imprint this plate."
msgstr ""
"这块奇异的黑曜石颜色板子可以拟态现代全自动医疗仪中的先进技术，在你的避难岛上创建一个可以运转的复制品。不过，目前它还处于休眠状态，必须先找到一个处于工作状态"
"的全自动医疗仪进行拓印。如果要这么做，请在探险中找到一个自动医疗仪，然后使用建造菜单在板子上拓印。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Autodoc copyplate (activated)"
msgid_plural "Autodoc copyplates (activated)"
msgstr[0] "全自动医疗仪复制板（就绪）"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "Autodoc copyplate (activated)"
msgid ""
"This strange obsidian-colored plate is capable of mimicking the advanced tech "
"found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy at "
"your sanctuary.  It has been successfully activated and can be used as the "
"catalyst to create a new Autodoc at a location of your choosing using the "
"construction menu.  Be aware this cannot be safely moved once placed, and "
"will also require you to add an adjacent couch, then convert it to an Autodoc "
"couch."
msgstr ""
"这块奇异的黑曜石颜色板子可以拟态现代全自动医疗仪中的先进技术，在你的避难岛上创建一个可以运转的复制品。它已被成功激活为建造用的引物，通过建造菜单在你选择的位"
"置创建一个新的全自动医疗仪。请注意，全自动医疗仪一旦放置就不能再安全地移动了，旁边还需要放一个沙发，然后将其转换为全自动医疗仪用沙发。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warped autodoc enhancer"
msgid_plural "warped autodoc enhancers"
msgstr[0] "翘曲全自动医疗仪增强剂"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "warped autodoc enhancer"
msgid ""
"A small device, so complex you can't entirely tell what it does.  You can see "
"a miniature chair, a bed, some kind of machine, a computer console, a tangle "
"of mechanical arms, all changing from moment to moment.  When used on an "
"existing autodoc mark XI, you can upgrade it to a more advanced XXII model."
msgstr ""
"一个小设备，如此复杂，你无法完全分辨它的功能。你可以看到一张微型椅子，一张床，某种机器，一个电脑控制台，一堆机械臂，所有这些都在不断变化。在现有的全自动医疗"
"仪 XI 型上使用，您可以将其升级到更先进的 XXII 型。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warped autodoc augmenter"
msgid_plural "warped autodoc augmenters"
msgstr[0] "翘曲全自动医疗仪增压器"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "warped autodoc augmenter"
msgid ""
"A small device, so complex you can't entirely tell what it does.  You can see "
"a miniature chair, a bed, some kind of machine, a computer console, a tangle "
"of mechanical arms, all changing from moment to moment.  When used on an "
"advanced autodoc mark XXII, you can upgrade it to its most advanced XXXIII "
"form."
msgstr ""
"一个小设备，如此复杂，你无法完全分辨它的功能。你可以看到一张微型椅子，一张床，某种机器，一个电脑控制台，一堆机械臂，所有这些都在不断变化。在现有的全自动医疗"
"仪 XXII 型上使用，您可以将其升级到更先进的 XXXIII 型。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warped grass seeds"
msgid_plural "warped grass seeds"
msgstr[0] "翘曲草种子"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "warped grass seeds"
msgid ""
"While these are certainly imbued with warp, they don't seem to have any "
"supernatural powers beyond just growing quickly.  A nice option if you want "
"to re-plant grass on your island, for decoration's sake."
msgstr "虽然它们确实充满了翘曲能量，但除了快速生长之外并没有其他能力。如果你想在岛上种草以进行装饰，这是一个不错的选择。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wood-floor tokens"
msgid_plural "wood-floor tokens"
msgstr[0] "木地板代币"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "wood-floor tokens"
msgid ""
"A group of small squares of wood, smooth and polished.  You can use them to "
"transform a section of flooring into interlocking wooden planks."
msgstr "一组光滑抛光的小方块。你可以用它们把一段地板变成相互锁紧的木板。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flagstone tokens"
msgid_plural "flagstone tokens"
msgstr[0] "石板代币"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "flagstone tokens"
msgid ""
"A group of small stone stones, rough to the touch.  You can use them to "
"transform a section of flooring into mortared flagstones."
msgstr "一组小石块，摸起来粗糙。你可以用它们把一段地板改造成灰泥石板。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sand tokens"
msgid_plural "sand tokens"
msgstr[0] "沙代币"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "sand tokens"
msgid ""
"A group of small yellow stones, gritty to the touch yet seemingly nothing "
"ever rubs off.  You can use them to transform a section of flooring into fine "
"sand."
msgstr "一堆黄色的沙子，摸起来很坚韧，但似乎什么也擦不掉。你可以用它们把一段地板变成细沙。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vortex token"
msgid_plural "vortex token"
msgstr[0] "漩涡代币"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "vortex token"
msgid ""
"This irregular purplish lump seems to slowly pull in air even while you hold "
"it in your hand.  If you have one with you when you activate the return "
"obelisk and the obelisk is correctly configured, it will drag the entire "
"contents of the room with you back up to your island."
msgstr "这个不规则的紫红块状物看起来正在缓慢地吸气，即使你拿在手上也在继续吸。 如果你在启动归源尖碑时带着它，并且设置正确，它会把房间里的所有东西一起带回你的岛上。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "skyward beacon"
msgid_plural "skyward beacon"
msgstr[0] "空岛信标"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "skyward beacon"
msgid ""
"This smooth purplish sphere seems like it wants to rise right out of your "
"hand.  If you activate it, you will return directly to the island with "
"everything you are carrying."
msgstr "这个光滑的紫色球体似乎将要从你的手中升上天空。如果你激活它，你将带着你所携带的一切直接返回到岛上。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "skyward beacon"
msgid "Return to the sky."
msgstr "返回安全区。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "healing salve"
msgid_plural "healing salves"
msgstr[0] "治疗药膏"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "healing salve"
msgid ""
"A lump of purplish goo, smooth but yielding, sculptable like clay.  If you "
"rub it on a wound, it will immediately heal some of the damage you have "
"taken, but the air of the lower world destabilizes its structure and it will "
"only last a single trip to the surface."
msgstr "一块紫色凝胶状物质，表面光滑柔软，可塑形如黏土。若将其涂抹于伤口，能即刻愈合部分损伤。但下层世界的空气会破坏其结构，因此仅能维持单次地表之旅的时效。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flotation stone"
msgid_plural "flotation stone"
msgstr[0] "漂浮石"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "flotation stone"
msgid ""
"This smooth, whorled stone seems cool and wet to the touch, but when you take "
"your hand off it your skin is perfectly dry.  If you activate it, you will be "
"able to walk on the surface of water for three minutes."
msgstr "这块光滑的螺旋状石头摸起来又凉又湿，但当你把手从上面拿开时，你的皮肤就会变得非常干燥。如果你激活它，你就可以在水上行走三分钟。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "flotation stone"
msgid "Cross the waters."
msgstr "穿过水域。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warp shards"
msgid_plural "warp shards"
msgstr[0] "傳送碎片"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "warp shards"
msgid ""
"A small quantity of airy-thin material that resembles flaked obsidian.  It "
"glints with a purplish shimmer that seems to stretch off the bounds of itself "
"and into the air itself.  Offered to the powers that be, one could exchange "
"it for valuable artifacts."
msgstr "一小份轻薄的材料，类似片状的黑曜石。它闪烁着紫色的微光，似乎延伸到了自身的边界，进入到空气之中。将其献给某种强大的存在，可以用来交换有价值的造物。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "material token"
msgid_plural "material token"
msgstr[0] "材料代币"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "material token"
msgid ""
"A very tiny disc-shaped blue wafer.  It seems to shift in your grasp, feeling "
"one moment like a grain of sand, then a sharp metal fragment, then a wooden "
"splinter.  These miniature tokens are rewarded for surviving a raid, and can "
"be crafted on your island for a large supply of common resources by using "
"infinity nodes as a catalyst."
msgstr ""
"一个非常小的圆盘形蓝色晶片。在你掌握它的时候，它似乎会发生变化，一会儿像一粒沙子，一会儿像一个锋利的金属碎片，一会儿又像一个木头碎片。这些代币是活着完成突袭"
"的奖励，可以在你的岛上使用无限源来制作大量普通资源。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Labs Catalyst"
msgid_plural "Labs Catalysts"
msgstr[0] "实验室门卡"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "Labs Catalyst"
msgid ""
"A bit of warp power, a magnetic stripe keycard from a dangerous place, and a "
"little hope, blended well.  This item is required to begin a Labs expedition, "
"and is consumed when leaving."
msgstr "一些翘曲之力，来自危险地带密钥，还有一点希望，融合得很好。此物品是开始实验室探险所必需的，在离开时消耗掉。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Heartseed"
msgid_plural "Heartseeds"
msgstr[0] "空岛之心种子"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "Heartseed"
msgid ""
"A whorl of black stone that feels impossibly heavy for its size.  Activate "
"this on your island to place the Heart of the Island, the catalyst of future "
"upgrades."
msgstr "一块黑色的石头漩涡，感觉其重量与其大小极不相符。在你的岛屿上激活它，以放置空岛之心，可用于升级。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "infinity tree sapling"
msgid_plural "infinity tree saplings"
msgstr[0] "无限树之苗"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "infinity tree sapling"
msgid ""
"A fragile little wisp of a sapling.  Its leaves shake and quiver, shimmering "
"with strange energies.  Activate this on your island to place an infinity "
"tree, which can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens into wooden "
"resources."
msgstr "一株脆弱的小树苗。它的树叶颤抖，闪烁着奇怪的能量。在你的岛屿上激活它，以放置一棵无限树，它可以当作无限源，将材料代币变成木制品。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "infinity stone source"
msgid_plural "infinity stone sources"
msgstr[0] "无限石之种"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "infinity stone source"
msgid ""
"A crackling little cluster of pebbles that spark as they knock together, "
"tumbling about from forces unseen.  Activate this on your island to place an "
"infinity stone, which can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens into "
"stony and earthen resources."
msgstr ""
"一簇噼啪作响的小卵石，当它们碰撞在一起时会迸发出火花，在看不见的力量的作用下翻滚着。在你的岛屿上激活它，以放置一块无限石，它可以当作无限源，将材料代币转化为"
"岩石和泥土制品。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "infinity ore crucible"
msgid_plural "infinity ore crucibles"
msgstr[0] "无限矿之炉"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "infinity ore crucible"
msgid ""
"A miniature tangle of metal that resembles a dust bunny made of barbed wire.  "
"It twists in upon itself endlessly, folding and unfolding in ways that don't "
"seem possible.  Activate this on your island to place an infinity ore, which "
"can be used as a catalyst to turn material tokens into metal resources."
msgstr ""
"一团纠缠的金属小物件,似乎是由带刺的金属丝编织而成的,形状犹如t铁丝球。它无止无尽地扭曲着,以一种违反牛顿的方式展开又折叠。在你的岛屿上激活它,"
"以放置一块无限矿,它可以当作无限源，将材料代币转化为金属制品。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Personal Sunblock"
msgid_plural "Personal Sunblocks"
msgstr[0] "个人防晒强化"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "Personal Sunblock"
msgid "The island is protecting you against the sun as long as you are on it."
msgstr "只要身处岛上，岛屿的庇护效应将使你免受阳光伤害。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Personal Windblock"
msgid_plural "Personal Windblocks"
msgstr[0] "Personal Windblocks"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/items.json
#. ~ Description of "Personal Windblock"
msgid "The island is protecting you against the winds as long as you are on it."
msgstr "The island is protecting you against the winds as long as you are on it."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
msgid ""
"You're still materializing and not fully visible yet.  In about "
"<global_val:invistime> seconds, the world will be able to see you, so if you "
"were warped into danger, now's your chance to get to cover."
msgstr "你还在显现，还没完全显现出来。再过几秒钟，全世界就能看到你了，所以如果你陷入了危险，现在是你躲起来的机会。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
msgid ""
"You've arrived!\n"
"Press a key when ready and random missions will be generated for this "
"expedition.  This may take another minute."
msgstr ""
"你已經抵達了！\n"
"按下按鍵，將生成隨機任務用於此次探險。此流程可能需要再等一分鐘。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_safely_landed"
msgid ""
"Something went wrong.  The game could not find a suitable teleport location.  "
"Please try using the obelisk again."
msgstr "出错了。游戏无法找到合适的传送位置。请再试一次尖碑。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Reach one of the exit points!"
msgstr "抵達其中一個逃離點！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Reach one of the exit points!"
msgid ""
"If you want to get home with your stuff, you'll need to reach one of these "
"nearby exit points.  They're only things that can bring you back to your "
"sanctuary island in one piece."
msgstr "如果你想带着你的东西回安全区，你需要到达最近的撤离点。它们是唯一能将你完整地带回你的安全区的东西。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find the warp shards!"
msgstr "找到傳送碎片！"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find the warp shards!"
msgid ""
"A very small cluster of warp energy has left shards behind at this location.  "
"All you need to do is find and retrieve them.  There may be threats nearby, "
"but unlike most tasks, no special guards are on-site.  A minimal reward, but "
"little risk."
msgstr "一小團傳送能量在這個位置留下了碎片。你只需要找到並取回它們。附近可能會有威脅，但不像大多數任務那樣有特別的存在守護這裡。獎勵很少，但風險也不大。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill the warp-draining zombies!"
msgstr "消滅吸收傳送能量的殭屍！"

