#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill the guarded interlopers!"
msgid ""
"The warp has marked human beings for death.  They may be accompanied.  Their "
"sins are not your concern.  All you need to know is that it must be done."
msgstr "翘曲之力已经决定处死一群人类。他们人多势众。他们的罪孽与你无关。你只要知道，这件事必须完成。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill 10 Zombies this expedition"
msgstr "本次消灭10只丧尸"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 10 Zombies this expedition"
msgid ""
"Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream "
"of warp once more.  Kill at least 10 zombified humans or creatures before "
"returning to your sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr "这些丧尸吸收了潜在的能量，这些能量必须重新释放到翘曲之中。杀死至少10只丧尸化人类或生物，回到空岛后可获得额外的翘曲碎片。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kill 50 Zombies this expedition"
msgstr "本次消灭50只丧尸"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/missions_and_mapgen.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 50 Zombies this expedition"
msgid ""
"Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream "
"of warp once more.  Kill at least 50 zombified humans or creatures before "
