#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
msgid "Extended Expedition"
msgstr "超长探险"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
msgid ""
"A simple, brief expedition at the normal time limit.  Missions and exits will "
"be close together.  A good chance to quickly gather supplies and experience."
msgstr "这是一次简单、短时间的普通探险。任务和撤离点将集中在一起。是一个快速获取物资和积累经验的好机会。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
msgid ""
"A longer expedition that offers twice the time.  Missions and exits will be "
"scattered over a wider area.  You will have more opportunity to dig deeper "
"into surrounding points of interest, but also need more time to travel.  "
"Missions offer extra warp shards as rewards."
msgstr "一次较长的探险，提供两倍的时间。任务点和撤离点将更分散。你将有更多机会进行探险，但也需要更多时间来赶路。任务提供额外的翘曲碎片作为奖励。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
msgid ""
"A very long expedition that triples the time limit.  Missions and exits will "
"be very far away.  You will have time for extended activities, but a good "
"deal of your time will be spent trying to reach objectives over potentially "
"dangerous terrain.  Missions offer even more warp shards as rewards."
msgstr "一次非常长的探险，将时间限制延长三倍。任务点和撤离点将非常遥远。你将有时间进行活动，但你将花费大量时间在穿越危险地形上。任务提供更多的翘曲碎片作为奖励。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid "Stay on the island for now."
msgstr "我怂了，还是待会再说。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_statue"
msgid "Select Expedition Length"
msgstr "选择探险时间"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_raidcancel"
msgid "You decide not to go out just yet."
msgstr "你决定暂时不外出。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid "Target: Field"
msgstr "目标：荒野"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid "Target: Basement"
msgstr "目标：地下室"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid "Target: Rooftop"
msgstr "目标：屋顶"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid "Target: Science Lab"
msgstr "目标：科学实验室"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid ""
"Arrive in a barren field.  This usually means landing in the open wilderness, "
"but there's always the chance you'll find yourself at an empty lot in town."
msgstr "到达一片贫瘠的田野。这通常意味着降落在空旷的旷野中，但总有机发现自己身处在城镇的一块空地上。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid ""
"Arrive inside an underground basement.  This will tend to put you somewhere "
"in suburbia, but there are always exceptions."
msgstr "到达一个地下室。这往往会让你出现在郊区的某个地方，但也有其他可能。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid ""
"Arrive on a building roof someplace.  Usually this means houses, but you "
"never know for sure.  This will always be one story off the ground."
msgstr "到达某个地方的屋顶。通常情况下，这意味着有房子，但你永远无法确定。始终比地面高一层。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid ""
"Arrive somewhere in a subterranean science lab.  This is a highly dangerous "
"method.  Due to the dimensional shielding these labs project, this expedition "
"will cost 1 Labs Catalyst to begin.\n"
"BE WARNED!  You will begin inside a sealed lab, so make sure you have the "
"means to get out!  A second card, to unlock the surface exit, is one option.  "
"You may also consider a homeward mote or a warp skyward beacon."
msgstr ""
"到达某个地下科学实验室。这非常危险。由于这些实验室投射的维度护盾，因此这次探险将花费 1 个实验室门卡才能开始。\n"
"警告！你将从一个密封的实验室内部开始，所以先确保你有办法出去！带上第二张门卡以解锁地表出口也是一种选择。你还可以考虑溯返之尘或回程锚点。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/obelisk_selector.json
#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_warp_choose_locale"
msgid "Select a Starting Location"
msgstr "选择一个起始位置"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
#. ~ Crafting recipes category name
msgid "WARP"
msgstr "傳送"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
#. ~ Crafting recipes subcategory of "WARP" cat.
msgid "GEAR"
msgstr "装备"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
#. ~ Crafting recipes subcategory of "WARP" cat.
msgid "ITEMS"
msgstr "物品"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
#. ~ Crafting recipes subcategory of "WARP" cat.
msgid "UPGRADES"
msgstr "升级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_spawn_random_artifact_fromrecipe"
msgid ""
"Utilizing the unstable, reality-changing nature of the warp shards, you could "
"combine several to create a powerful semi-magical item.  This is a skill you "
"have no way of practicing and a field of science no one's ever really "
"touched, so exactly what you'd get from it is anyone's guess."
msgstr ""
"利用不穩定、改變現實的特性，你可以將幾個傳送碎片結合在一起，創造出一個強大的半魔法物品。這是一種你無法練習的技能，也是一個沒有人真正觸及過的科學領域，所以從"
"中得到什麼效果還真是誰也說不準。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_spawn_random_artifact_fromrecipe"
msgid "materialize random artifact"
msgstr "随机神器"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_WARPED_POND_CREATION"
msgid ""
"Create a pond on your island.  You must be standing next to a water source to "
"successfully create the pond."
msgstr "在岛上创建一个池塘。 您必须站在水源旁边才能成功创建池塘。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/recipes.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_WARPED_POND_CREATION"
msgid "Warped Pond"
msgstr "翘曲池塘"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Alpha Secure Container"
msgid_plural "Alpha Secure Containers"
msgstr[0] "Alpha 安全容器"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
#. ~ Description of "Alpha Secure Container"
msgid ""
"The most secure storage possible, even if it is tiny.  This metaphysical "
"container is unique in that it is the only storage that will keep its "
"contents on death.  Everything else will still be lost."
msgstr "最安全的存储方式，即使它很小。这个神奇容器的独特之处在于，它是唯一在死亡时仍能保留容器内物品的存储方式。容器之外的物品都将遗失。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Security Alpha"
msgid ""
"You have come into possession of a tiny, ethereal storage container that "
"cannot be removed or destroyed.  It can hold 500 mL and will bring items back "
"to the island with you, even when you die."
msgstr "你获得了小型安全箱，无法移除或摧毁。它可以容纳 500 ml，即使你死亡，它也可以将箱内物品带回岛屿。"

