#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Scouting 1"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Scouting Lens from high quality lenses and miscellaneous parts.  The "
"Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reveals slightly more of the map around exit points and mission "
"targets."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用高品质的镜片和一些零件制作一个侦察透镜。空岛之心已经将配方植入你的脑海。\n"
"\n"
"效果:在出口点和任务目标周围显示略多的地图信息。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Somehow, you understand the statue is calling out for something that can "
"strengthen its power.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reveals slightly more of the map around exit points and mission "
"targets."
msgstr ""
"不知何故,你明白这尊雕像在呼唤某种可以增强它力量的东西。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果:在撤离点和任务目标周围显示略多的地图信息。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Your vision expands.  Future missions and exits will be scouted just a little "
"better."
msgstr "你的视野扩大了。以后的任务和撤离点将被侦察得更好一些。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scouting Lens"
msgid_plural "Scouting Lenses"
msgstr[0] "侦察透镜"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Scouting Lens"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Scouting 1"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将为岛屿赋予力量,并为所有未来的冒险解锁一个永久升级。制作完成后将自动使用,并且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级:侦察 1级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Scouting 2"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Scouting Scope from a pair of binoculars and miscellaneous parts.  "
"The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reveals a bit more of the map around exit points and mission targets."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"以一副双筒望远镜和其他零件中制作一个侦察望远镜。空岛之心已经将配方植入了你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果：在出口点和任务目标周围揭示更多的地图信息。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Somehow, you understand the statue is calling out for something that can "
"strengthen its power.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reveals a bit more of the map around exit points and mission targets."
msgstr ""
"不知何故,你明白这座雕像在呼唤某种可以增强其力量的东西。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果:在撤离点和任务目标周围揭示更多的地图信息。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Your vision expands.  Future missions and exits will provide better map "
"scouting."
msgstr "你的视野扩大了。未来的任务和撤离点将提供更好的地图信息。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scouting Scope"
msgid_plural "Scouting Scopes"
msgstr[0] "侦查透镜"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Scouting Scope"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Scouting 2"
msgstr ""
"这个物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为所有未来的运行解锁一个永久升级。制作后会自动使用,只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级:侦察 2级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Scouting 3"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Vision Amplifier from high quality optics and miscellaneous parts.  "
