msgstr[0] "翘曲之翼"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Warped Parachute"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Landing 3"
msgstr ""
"这件奇异的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制作完成后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级：着陆 3级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Landing 4"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft an Ethereal Cushion from complex materials and miscellaneous parts.  "
"The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reveal a lot of the map around your landing point, and increase the "
"warpcloak invisibility grace period at the start of each expedition to 100 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用复杂的材料和杂物制造虚灵软垫。空岛之心已经将制作配方植入了你的大脑。\n"
"\n"
"效果：在着陆点周围揭示大量地图信息,并将每次探险开始时的隐身效果时间延长至100秒。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Somehow, you understand the statue is calling out for something that can "
"strengthen its power.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reveal a lot of the map around your landing point, and increase the "
"warpcloak invisibility grace period at the start of each expedition to 100 "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"不知怎的,你理解到这座雕像在呼唤一些可以增强它力量的东西。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果：在着陆点周围揭示大量地图信息,并将每次探险开始时的隐身斗篷时间延长至100秒。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Your focus tightens.  Landing points will reveal more of the map, and your "
"warpcloak will last 100 seconds at the beginning of every expedition."
msgstr "你的注意力更加集中。着陆点将揭示更多地图信息,你的隐形效果在每次探险开始时将持续100秒。"

