"miscellaneous parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe "
"inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: One special slaughter mission will be assigned during each "
"expedition, rewarding warp shards if you kill a certain number of "
"specifically targeted enemies before returning home."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用实验性材料和杂物制造空岛之罚。空岛之心已经将制作配方植入了你的大脑。\n"
"\n"
"效果：在每次探险中将会分配一个特殊的杀戮任务,如果你在返回安全区前杀死了指定数量的特定敌人,将会获得翘曲碎片奖励。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
