#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock: Two Exits per Expedition"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft an Escape Charm from experimental materials and miscellaneous parts.  "
"The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Every expedition will now have two different locations you can exit "
"from."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"从实验性材料和各种零件制造一枚逃脱护符。空岛之心已将配方植入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果：从现在开始,每次探险都会有两个撤离点可以用来撤离。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Somehow, you understand the statue is calling out for something that can "
"strengthen its power.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Every expedition will now have two different locations you can exit "
"from."
msgstr ""
"不知怎的,你理解到这座雕像在呼唤一些可以增强它力量的东西。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果：从现在开始,每次探险都会有两个撤离点可以用来撤离。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You close your eyes and through the flow of turbulent warpstream, an "
"invisible maze manifests.  A thousand potential passages brush smooth stone "
"across your consciousness, and the meaning of this reality glimmers faintly, "
"a dancing splinter of light in the distance.  You've been here before, you "
"are here now, and you will be here again.\n"
"When you open your eyes, you're back where you began.  You haven't moved, but "
"it feels as though the world has.\n"
"\n"
"In every future expedition, you will now be able to find two different "
"locations you can exit from."
msgstr ""
"你闭上双眼,穿越湍急的翘曲洪流,一个无形的迷宫出现在眼前。千百条潜在的通道在你的意识中掠过,这个现实隐隐闪烁,仿佛远处一片闪动的微光。你曾经来过这里,"
"现在也在这里,未来也将再次来到这里。\n"
"\n"
"当你睁开眼睛,你回到了原处。你没有移动分毫,但却感觉世界已经改变了。\n"
"\n"
"从现在开始,在每次未来的探险中,你都将能够找到两个不同的位置来撤退。"

