#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock: Three Exits per Expedition"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Blindfold of Egress from experimental materials and miscellaneous "
"parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your "
"mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Every expedition will now have three different locations you can exit "
"from."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"从实验性材料和各种零件制造一副撤离眼罩。空岛之心已将配方植入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果：从现在开始,每次探险都会有三个不同的撤离点可以用来撤离。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Somehow, you understand the statue is calling out for something that can "
"strengthen its power.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Every expedition will now have three different locations you can exit "
"from."
msgstr ""
"不知怎的,你理解到这座雕像在呼唤一些可以增强它力量的东西。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果：从现在开始,每次探险都会有三个不同的撤离点可以用来撤离。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Again you see in blindness, and before you stretches a vast invisible "
"labyrinth beneath an empty sky.  You race forward, tracing paths spoken to "
"you in dreams, and an origami spiderweb crumples and breathes out underfoot.  "
"At last, at the seashell's center, lies the cornucopia's smallest door.\n"
"When at last you open your eyes, you find yourself where you began, unmoved, "
"yet changed.\n"
"\n"
"In every future expedition, you will now be able to find three different "
"locations you can exit from."
msgstr ""
"再次在黑暗中看见,在你面前展开的是一片广阔无垠的无形迷宫,天空空荡荡的。你向前飞奔,追随着梦中告诉你的道路,脚下的折纸蜘蛛网在喘息和碎裂。最后,"
"在贝壳的中心,是丰饶之门最小的那道门。\n"
"\n"
"当你最终睁开双眼,发现自己回到了原点,位置未变,却已不同。\n"
"\n"
"在今后的每次探险中,你都将能找到三个不同的撤离点。"

