#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock: Expedition Missions"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Warped Decree from experimental materials and miscellaneous parts.  "
"The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Every expedition now offers a randomly assigned mission, which will "
"reward you with valuable warp shards.  Completing a mission also extends the "
"time left on current expedition by 1 warp pulse."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用实验性材料和各种零件制造一枚翘曲法令。空岛之心已将配方植入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果：每次探险现在都会提供一个随机分配的任务,完成任务将获得宝贵的翘曲碎片作为奖励。完成任务还会延长当前探险1个脉冲的时间。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
