#. ~ Item name
msgid "Oath of the Island's Enforcer"
msgid_plural "Oath of the Island's Enforcers"
msgstr[0] "Oath of the Island's Enforcers"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Oath of the Island's Enforcer"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Five Missions per Expedition"
msgstr ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Five Missions per Expedition"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock: Harder Missions"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft an Ordinator's Sigil from experimental materials and miscellaneous "
"parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your "
"mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: New and more challenging types of missions are available to be "
"randomly assigned in every expedition.  Harder missions will reward many more "
"warp shards."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用实验性材料和杂物制造秩序之印。空岛之心已经将制作配方植入了你的大脑。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 每次探险都会随机分配更加具有挑战性的任务。艰难的任务会带来更多的翘曲碎片奖励。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Somehow, you understand the statue is calling out for something that can "
"strengthen its power.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: New and more challenging types of missions are available to be "
"randomly assigned in every expedition.  Harder missions will reward many more "
"warp shards."
msgstr ""
"你似乎感受到这座雕像在呼唤着什么能增强它力量的东西。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 每次探险都会随机分配更加具有挑战性的任务。艰难的任务会带来更多的翘曲碎片奖励。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Greater trespasses against the flow of the warpstream reveal themselves to "
"you.  This interference cannot go unpunished.\n"
"The missions you are randomly assigned in each expedition are more varied, "
"and can now pull from harder and more rewarding challenges."
msgstr ""
"你发现了对翘曲洪流更大的侵犯。这种行为必须受到惩罚。\n"
"在每次探险中随机分配的任务更加多样化,现在可以选择更艰难但回报更丰厚的挑战。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ordinator's Sigil"
msgid_plural "Ordinator's Sigils"
msgstr[0] "秩序之印"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Ordinator's Sigil"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Harder Missions"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 更艰难的任务"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock: Hardest Missions"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Will of the Island from experimental materials and miscellaneous "
"parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your "
"mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: New and even more challenging types of missions are available to be "
"randomly assigned in every expedition.  Harder missions will reward many more "
"warp shards."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用实验性材料和杂物制造空岛意志。空岛之心已经将制作配方植入了你的大脑。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 每次探险都会随机分配更加具有挑战性的任务。艰难的任务会带来更多的翘曲碎片奖励。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Somehow, you understand the statue is calling out for something that can "
"strengthen its power.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: New and even more challenging types of missions are available to be "
"randomly assigned in every expedition.  Harder missions will reward many more "
"warp shards."
msgstr ""
"你似乎感受到这座雕像在呼唤着什么能增强它力量的东西。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 每次探险都会随机分配更加具有挑战性的任务。艰难的任务会带来更多的翘曲碎片奖励。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The greatest trespasses against the island now glimmer in the dark, guiding "
"your hand as a tool of order.  Return these chaotic energies to the "
"tranquility of the warpstream.\n"
"The missions you are randomly assigned in each expedition are even more "
"varied, and can now pull from the hardest and most rewarding challenges."
msgstr ""
"对这个岛屿最严重的侵犯现在在黑暗中闪烁,引导你的双手成为秩序的工具。将这些混乱的能量归还于翘曲洪流的宁静之中。\n"
"在每次探险中随机分配给你的任务更加多样化,现在可以包含最艰难但回报最丰厚的挑战。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Will of the Island"
msgid_plural "Will of the Islands"
msgstr[0] "空岛意志"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Will of the Island"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Hardest Missions"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 最艰难的任务"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Island Rank Up 1"
msgstr "岛屿等级提升 1级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Island Rank Up 1"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission ascends you to a new rank.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Proof of Determination from experimental materials and "
"miscellaneous parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe "
"inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reach Rank 1.  Some upgrades and unlocks will not be available until "
"you have ranked up.  You will also instantly learn several new warp-related "
"crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务会让你晋升到一个新的等级。\n"
"\n"
"用实验材料和杂项部件制造决心之证。空岛之心已经将配方植入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果:达到1级。在你晋级之前,某些升级和解锁将无法使用。你还将立即获得几个相关的制作配方。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You are ready to ascend to a higher tier of strength and ability.  Complete "
"this trial and prove yourself, and you will discover new powers for yourself "
"and the island.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reach Rank 1.  Some upgrades and unlocks will not be available until "
"you have ranked up.  You will also instantly learn several new warp-related "
"crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"你已经准备好晋升到更高的力量和能力层次。完成这个试炼,证明自己,你将为自己和岛屿挖掘新的力量。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果:达到1级。在你晋级之前,某些升级和解锁将无法使用。你还将立即获得几个相关的制作配方。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You have proved your ability to survive to the island, to the warpstream, and "
"to yourself.\n"
"More unlockable upgrades will be available as you progress, and you may "
"experience exits and targets in new locations."
msgstr ""
"你已经向岛屿、翘曲洪流和自己证明了你的生存能力。\n"
"随着你的进步,将有更多可解锁的升级可供使用,将会有更多的撤离点和任务。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Your mind expands.  You have learned to craft:\n"
"Materialize random artifact\n"
"Vortex token\n"
"Warped hauler's harness\n"
"Warped animal carrier"
msgstr ""
"你的思想扩展了。你已经学会制造：\n"
"随机物品\n"
"漩涡代币\n"
"翘曲搬运轭带\n"
"翘曲动物携具"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Proof of Determination"
msgid_plural "Proofs of Determination"
msgstr[0] "决心之证"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Proof of Determination"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Island Rank Up 1"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 岛屿等级提升 1级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Island Rank Up 2"
msgstr "岛屿等级提升 2级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Island Rank Up 2"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission ascends you to a new rank.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Proof of Determination from experimental materials and "
"miscellaneous parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe "
"inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reach Rank 2.  Some upgrades and unlocks will not be available until "
"you have ranked up.  You will also instantly learn several new warp-related "
"crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务会让你晋升到一个新的等级。\n"
"\n"
"用实验材料和杂项部件制造决心之证。空岛之心已经将配方植入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果:达到2级。在你晋级之前,某些升级和解锁将无法使用。你还将立即获得几个相关的制作配方。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You are ready to ascend to a higher tier of strength and ability.  Complete "
"this trial and prove yourself, and you will discover new powers for yourself "
"and the island.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reach Rank 2.  Some upgrades and unlocks will not be available until "
"you have ranked up.  You will also instantly learn several new warp-related "
"crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"你已经准备好晋升到更高的力量和能力层次。完成这个试炼,证明自己,你将为自己和岛屿挖掘新的力量。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果:达到2级。在你晋级之前,某些升级和解锁将无法使用。你还将立即获得几个相关的制作配方。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"That you are still here, fighting on, makes your determination clear.  This "
"new existence is strange and unpredictable, but you can adapt.  It's how you "
"made it this far, and you're not about to stop now.\n"
"More unlockable upgrades will be available as you progress, and you may "
"experience exits and targets in new locations."
msgstr ""
"你仍然在这里,继续战斗,这表明了你坚定的决心。这种新的生存方式虽然陌生且变幻莫测,但你有能力适应。正是凭借这种适应力,你才走到了现在这一步,"
"而你不会就此止步。\n"
"随着你的进步,将有更多可解锁的升级可供使用,将会有更多的撤离点和任务。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Your mind expands.  You have learned to craft:\n"
"Homeward mote\n"
"Autodoc copyplate\n"
msgstr ""
"你的思维得到扩展。你已学会制作：\n"
"溯返之尘\n"
"全自动医疗仪\n"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Proof of Mastery"
msgid_plural "Proofs of Mastery"
msgstr[0] "精通之证"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Proof of Mastery"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Island Rank Up 2"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 岛屿等级提升 2级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock: Large Expeditions"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Warped Hourglass from experimental materials and miscellaneous parts. "
" The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select Large Expeditions when leaving via the "
"warp obelisk.  Large Expeditions last 2x as long, but mission targets and "
"exit points are significantly farther away."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用实验性材料和杂件零件制造逆流沙漏。空岛之心已将配方植入你的大脑。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 你将能够在通过翘曲尖碑离开时选择大型探险。大型探险持续时间是正常的2倍,但任务和撤离点会大幅远离。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"With some success under your belt, you feel ready to tackle more ambitious "
"expeditions, and the island seems to know it.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select Large Expeditions when leaving via the "
"warp obelisk.  Large Expeditions last 2x as long, but mission targets and "
"exit points are significantly farther away."
msgstr ""
"随着你取得一定成功，你感觉自己准备好了面对更具挑战性的探险，岛屿似乎也意识到了这一点。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 你将能够在通过翘曲尖碑离开时选择大型探险。大型探险持续时间是正常的2倍,但任务和撤离点会大幅远离。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You are ready for a longer haul.\n"
"Large Expeditions are now available at the warp obelisk.  Exits and missions "
"will be farther away, but you will have twice as long to spend earthside.  "
"Use this time wisely, and set your sights on bigger targets.  What will you "
"do with your newfound time?"
msgstr ""
"你已经准备好进行更长时间的探险了。\n"
"现在在翘曲尖碑处可以选择进行大型探险。撤离点和任务会更加遥远,但你将拥有两倍的停留时间。请谨慎利用这段时间,"
"并将目光投向更大的目标。你打算如何利用获得的额外时间呢?"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Warped Hourglass"
msgid_plural "Warped Hourglasses"
msgstr[0] "逆流沙漏"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Warped Hourglass"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Large Expeditions"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 大型探险"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock: Extended Expeditions"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Watch of Flowing Time from experimental materials and miscellaneous "
"parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your "
"mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select Extended Expeditions when leaving via the "
"warp obelisk.  Extended Expeditions last 3x as long, but mission targets and "
"exit points are significantly farther away."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用实验性材料和杂件零件制造时流之表。空岛之心已将配方植入你的大脑。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 你将能够在通过翘曲尖碑离开时选择超长探险。超长探险持续时间是正常的3倍,但任务和撤离点会大幅远离。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You've seen enough safe returns to know your way around an expedition.  Now "
"if you could spend even more time earthside, you'd be able to tackle even "
"bigger and more ambitious goals.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select Extended Expeditions when leaving via the "
"warp obelisk.  Extended Expeditions last 3x as long, but mission targets and "
"exit points are much farther away."
msgstr ""
"你已经经历过多次安全的探险，对探险的流程已经非常熟悉。如果能再在地表上待更长的时间，你将能够应对更大胆、更野心勃勃的计划。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 你将能够在通过翘曲尖碑离开时选择超长探险。超长探险持续时间是正常的3倍,但任务和撤离点会大幅远离。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You're in it to win it, and are prepared to take a long time exploring the "
"world below.\n"
"Extended Expeditions are now available at the warp obelisk.  Exits and "
"missions will be much farther away, but you will have three times as long to "
"spend earthside.  Pack supplies for a day trip and be sure to bring plenty of "
"storage space.  Where will you go with your newfound time?"
msgstr ""
"你已经做好了全力以赴和长时间探险地表的准备。\n"
"现在在翘曲尖碑处可以选择进行超长探险。撤离点和任务会更加遥远,但你将拥有三倍的停留时间。准备好补给，并确保带足够的存储空间。你会在额外的时间里去哪里？"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Watch of Flowing Time"
msgid_plural "Watch of Flowing Times"
msgstr[0] "时流之表"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Watch of Flowing Time"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Extended Expeditions"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 超长探险"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock Start Location: Basements"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a new possible location to begin future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Basement Locator from experimental materials and miscellaneous "
"parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your "
"mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select random Basement starts when leaving via "
"the warp obelisk."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将解锁一个新的起始位置。\n"
"\n"
"用实验材料和各种零部件制造定位器—地下室。空岛之心已经将配方放入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果:当通过翘曲尖碑离开时,你将能够选择随机的实验室作为起始点。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Being guaranteed to start in a town or city would cut down on your hikes "
"through the wilderness.  But popping down in the middle of the street with no "
"warning could really attract hordes.  Basements aren't always safe, but "
"they're probably safer than walking down Main in broad daylight, and might be "
"a good location to begin future expeditions.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select random Basement starts when leaving via "
"the warp obelisk."
msgstr ""
"从一个城镇或城市开始探险,可以减少你在荒野中的徒步时间。但突然出现在大街上也可能引来大批丧尸的注意。地下室并不总是安全的,但它们也比大白天在街上乱逛更安全,"
"也许是未来开始探险的不错的起点。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果:当通过翘曲尖碑离开时,你将能够选择随机地下室作为起始点。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"When leaving from the warp obelisk, you can now guarantee you will begin your "
"expedition in a basement.  Not glamorous, but at least it ensures you won't "
"be stranded out in some desolate field."
msgstr "现在从翘曲尖碑离开时，可以在随机地下室开始探险。虽然不太光彩，但至少可以确保你不会被困在荒凉的田野里。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Basement Locator"
msgid_plural "Basement Locators"
msgstr[0] "定位器—地下室"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Basement Locator"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Unlock Start Location: Basements"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 解锁起始位置:地下室"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Unlock Start Location: Roofs"
msgstr "解锁开始位置:屋顶"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock Start Location: Roofs"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a new possible location to begin future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Rooftop Locator from experimental materials and miscellaneous "
"parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your "
"mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select random Rooftop starts when leaving via the "
"warp obelisk."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将解锁一个新的起始位置。\n"
"\n"
"用实验材料和各种零部件制造定位器—屋顶。空岛之心已经将配方放入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果:当通过翘曲尖碑离开时,你将能够选择随机的屋顶作为起始点。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"If basements aren't cutting it, there's always rooftops.  Starting one floor "
"up will give you a good vantage and relative safety from the busy streets "
"while still ensuring you begin your expedition in a town or city.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select random Rooftop starts when leaving via the "
"warp obelisk.  In case you need to make a quick descent, bear in mind that "
"the warpcloak effect you have briefly at the start of each expedition "
"prevents fall damage."
msgstr ""
"如果地下室不合适，那么屋顶总是个不错的选择。从高层开始将为你提供一个良好视野，远离繁忙的街道，同时确保你在城镇或城市开始探险。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果: 当通过翘曲尖碑离开时,你将能够选择随机的屋顶作为起始点。如果需要快速下落,请记住，在每次探险开始时你会短暂获得缓解效果,可以防止坠落伤害。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"When leaving from the warp obelisk, you can now guarantee you will begin your "
"expedition on some rooftop.  Dangerous, perhaps, but it ensures proximity to "
"points of interest, and besides, there are all kinds of buildings this might "
"land you on."
msgstr "现在从翘曲尖碑离开时，可以在随机屋顶开始探险。这可能会很危险,但它确保了你靠近感兴趣的地点,而且,这会让你落在各种建筑物上。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Rooftop Locator"
msgid_plural "Rooftop Locators"
msgstr[0] "定位器—屋顶"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Rooftop Locator"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Unlock Start Location: Roofs"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 解锁起始位置:屋顶"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Unlock Start Location: Labs"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a new possible location to begin future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Laboratory Locator from experimental materials and miscellaneous "
"parts.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your "
"mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select random Labs starts when leaving via the "
"warp obelisk."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将解锁一个新的起始位置。\n"
"\n"
"用实验材料和各种零部件制造定位器—实验室。空岛之心已经将配方放入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"效果:当通过翘曲尖碑离开时,你将能够选择随机的实验室作为起始点。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Labs are rare and valuable finds, and clearing them out will take the better "
"part of a long expedition.  It would be much so easier if you could start "
"right outside one!\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select random Lab starts when leaving via the "
"warp obelisk.  This expedition type is unique in that it will require a Labs "
"Catalyst in your inventory when you select the expedition, which will then be "
"consumed on leaving."
msgstr ""
"实验室是罕见且珍贵的发现，清理它们将占用长大部分时间。如果能直接在一个实验室外开始，那会简单得多！\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"效果:当通过翘曲尖碑离开时,你将能够选择随机的实验室作为起始点。这种探险类型是特殊的,在选择探险时,你需要拥有实验室门卡,它将在离开时被消耗掉。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"With this upgrade, you're guaranteed to begin your expedition at an "
"underground lab.  Be aware that you will need to have a Labs Catalyst on you "
"when activating the warp obelisk, and these will be consumed on leaving."
msgstr "有了这个升级,你就可以确保在地下实验室开始探险。请注意,你在激活传送翘曲尖碑时，需要携带实验室门卡,它们将在离开时被消耗掉。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Laboratory Locator"
msgid_plural "Laboratory Locators"
msgstr[0] "定位器—实验室"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Laboratory Locator"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will empower the island and unlock a "
"permanent upgrade for all future runs.  Will be used automatically upon "
"crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: Unlock Start Location: Labs"
msgstr ""
"这个奇怪的物品将增强岛屿的力量,并为未来所有探险解锁一个永久升级。它会在制造后自动使用,且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关升级: 解锁起始位置:实验室"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Construct: Bunker Entrance"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will instantly build a new structure on your home "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"Craft the Mouth of the Island from simple tools and common building "
"materials.  The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your "
"mind.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Bunker Entrance.  A simple concrete entrance leading down into "
"the lower levels of the island, including a small subterranean chamber."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将立即在你的岛上立即建造一个新的建筑。\n"
"\n"
"用简单的工具和常见的建筑材料制造岛内之门。空岛之心已经将配方植入你的脑海。\n"
"新建筑:地堡入口。一个简单的混凝土入口,通向岛屿的地下层,拥有一个小型地下室。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The island seems to be a suitable safe haven for staging future expeditions, "
"but while there's no threat of monsters, it's still harshly exposed to the "
"elements.  Having even minimal covered shelter would go a long way towards "
"helping you rest and recuperate between expeditions.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Bunker Entrance.  A simple concrete entrance leading down into "
"the lower levels of the island, including a small subterranean chamber."
msgstr ""
"这个岛屿是一个很合适的安全避难所,可以用作将来探险的前哨基地。虽然这里没有怪物的威胁,但依然暴露于恶劣的环境之中。即使有最简陋的遮蔽庇护所,"
"也能在探险之前让你得到很好的休息和恢复。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:地下室入口。一个简单的混凝土入口,通向岛屿的地下,有一个小型地下室。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"It is done.  A small bunker has been carved into the foundations of this "
"island.  You will find the stairs nearby.\n"
"This is only the beginning."
msgstr ""
"已经完成了,一个小型地下室已经被在岛屿内生成。你会在附近找到通向它的楼梯。\n"
"这只是个开始。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mouth of the Island"
msgid_plural "Mouth of the Islands"
msgstr[0] "岛内之门"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Mouth of the Island"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact is used to build a structure on the "
"island.  Will be used automatically upon crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED BUILD: Bunker Entrance"
msgstr ""
"这种奇特的形而上学工艺品用于在岛屿上建造一个建筑物。它会在制造后自动使用,而且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关建筑:地堡入口"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Construct: Main Room 1"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will instantly build a new structure on your home "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Miner's Cameo from simple tools and common building materials.  The "
"Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 1.  A hollow chamber beneath the island's center to "
"serve as a multipurpose space, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将立即在你的岛上建造一个新的建筑。\n"
"\n"
"用简单的工具和常见的建筑材料制造矿工之章。空岛之心已经将配方植入你的脑海。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:主室 1级。一个位于岛屿中心下方的空房间,可以有很多种用途,有足够的空间进行扩建。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Now that work on the island bunker has begun, a large central room would be "
"ideal.  With all the loot you'll be scavenging on expeditions, it could make "
"a useful storeroom and crafting center.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 1.  A hollow chamber beneath the island's center to "
"serve as a multipurpose space, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"现在岛屿地堡的工作已经开始,一个大型的中央房间会是理想的选择。考虑到你在探险中收获的所有战利品,它可以作为一个有用的储藏室或制造点。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:主室 1级。一个位于岛屿中心下方的空房间,可以有很多种用途,有足够的空间进行扩建。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Construction complete.  A central room has been dug out in the bunker beneath "
"the island."
msgstr "建造完成。在空岛地下室中扩建了一个新区域。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Miner's Cameo"
msgid_plural "Miner's Cameos"
msgstr[0] "矿工之章"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Miner's Cameo"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact is used to build a structure on the "
"island.  Will be used automatically upon crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED BUILD: Main Room 1"
msgstr ""
"这种奇特的物品用于在岛屿上建造一个建筑物。它会在制造后自动使用,而且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关建筑:主室 1级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Construct: Main Room 2"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will instantly build a new structure on your home "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Hollow Carver from simple tools and common building materials.  The "
"Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 2.  Expand the central room to fit more loot, "
"furniture, or anything else you may need."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将立即在你的岛上建造一个新的建筑。\n"
"\n"
"用简单的工具和常见的建筑材料制造洞窟刻石。空岛之心已经将配方植入你的脑海。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:主室 2级。扩展中央房间以容纳更多的战利品、家具或其他你可能需要的东西。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The central room would be a lot more useful if it were larger.  Time to get "
"to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 2.  Expand the central room to fit more loot, "
"furniture, or anything else you may need."
msgstr ""
"如果中央房间更大一些,它会更加有用。是时候开始工作了。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:主室 2级。扩展中央房间以容纳更多的战利品、家具或其他你可能需要的东西。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "Construction complete.  The central room has grown."
msgstr "建设完成。中央房间已经扩大了。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hollow Carver"
msgid_plural "Hollow Carvers"
msgstr[0] "洞窟刻石"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Hollow Carver"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact is used to build a structure on the "
"island.  Will be used automatically upon crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED BUILD: Main Room 2"
msgstr ""
"这种奇特的物品用于在岛屿上建造一个建筑物。它会在制造后自动使用,而且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关建筑:主室 2级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Construct: Main Room 3"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will instantly build a new structure on your home "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Warped Reinforcement from simple tools and common building materials. "
" The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 3.  Expand the central room to very generous "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将立即在你的岛上建造一个新的建筑。\n"
"\n"
"用简单的工具和常见的建筑材料制造拓展令。空岛之心已经将配方放入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:主室 3级。将中央房间扩建到非常宽敞的尺寸。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The central room is a good start, but it could be much bigger.  Time to get "
"to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 3.  Expand the central room to very generous "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"中央房间是一个不错的开始,但它可以更大。是时候开始工作了。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:主室 3级。将中央房间扩建到非常宽敞的尺寸。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "Construction complete.  The central room has grown even further."
msgstr "建设完成。中央房间已经进一步扩大了。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Warped Reinforcement"
msgid_plural "Warped Reinforcements"
msgstr[0] "拓展令"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Warped Reinforcement"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact is used to build a structure on the "
"island.  Will be used automatically upon crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED BUILD: Main Room 3"
msgstr ""
"这种奇特的物品用于在岛屿上建造一个建筑物。它会在制造后自动使用,而且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关建筑:主室 3级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Construct: Main Room 4"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will instantly build a new structure on your home "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Cavernous Soul from simple tools and common building materials.  The "
"Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 4.  Expand the central room to its maximum size."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将立即在你的岛上建造一个新的建筑。\n"
"\n"
"用简单的工具和常见的建筑材料制造洞穴之魂。空岛之心已经将配方放入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:主室 4级。将中央房间扩建到最大尺寸。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The central room is big.  But not yet big enough.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 4.  Expand the central room to its maximum size."
msgstr ""
"中央房间很大了。但还不够大。是时候开始工作了。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:主室 4级。将中央房间扩建到最大尺寸。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "Construction complete.  The central room is now at its maximum size."
msgstr "建设完成。中央房间现已达到最大尺寸。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cavernous Soul"
msgid_plural "Cavernous Souls"
msgstr[0] "洞穴之魂"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Cavernous Soul"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact is used to build a structure on the "
"island.  Will be used automatically upon crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED BUILD: Main Room 4"
msgstr ""
"这种奇特的物品用于在岛屿上建造一个建筑物。它会在制造后自动使用,而且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关建筑:主室 4级"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Construct: Central Skylight 2"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will instantly build a new structure on your home "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Glass Figurine from simple tools and common building materials.  The "
"Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Central Skylight 2.  A larger skylight above your main room, "
"allowing more light to enter in."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将立即在你的岛上建造一个新的建筑。\n"
"\n"
"用简单的工具和常见的建筑材料制造玻璃雕像。空岛之心已经将配方放入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:中央天窗 2级。主房间上方有一个更大的天窗，让更多的光线进入。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Now that you have a bunker under the island, you have a place to live.  But "
"the small glass roof doesn't let in a lot of light; a larger skylight would "
"be ideal.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Central Skylight 2.  A larger skylight over the main room."
msgstr ""
"既然你在岛下有了地堡，你就有地方住了。但是小的玻璃屋顶不能让很多光线进来，大一点的天窗比较理想。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
