"用简单的工具和常见的建筑材料制造倒立方。空岛之心已经将配方放入你的脑海中。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑:北房间侧室。在北房间走廊两侧增加两个房间。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The northern room is a nice size, but it's just one room.  You could use a "
"bit of separation between activities, and maybe a place to store some "
"materials that you won't use as often.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: North Side Rooms.  Add two side rooms in the north for "
"additional storage."
msgstr ""
"北边的房间大小不错，但只有一个房间。你可以把不同的活动分开，或者找个地方存放一些你不经常使用的材料。是时候开始工作了。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"\n"
"新建筑：北房间侧室。在北面增加两个侧室以增加存储空间。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Construction complete.  The north now has two side rooms for additional "
"storage."
msgstr "建造完成。北边现在有两个侧室用于额外的存储。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Inverted Cube (North)"
msgid_plural "Inverted Cube (North)"
msgstr[0] "倒立方（北）"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Inverted Cube (North)"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact is used to build a structure on the "
"island.  Will be used automatically upon crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED BUILD: North Side Rooms"
msgstr ""
"这种奇特的物品用于在岛屿上建造一个建筑物。它会在制造后自动使用,而且只能使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"相关建筑:北房间侧室"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Upgrade: Security Alpha"
msgstr "升级:Alpha安全箱"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Alpha"
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"You have been granted the recipe to craft an Alpha Secure Container.  This "
"little miracle defies the very laws of physics and insists upon its own "
"permanence.  In short, it will give you an integrated pocket you can always "
"access.  The contents of this pocket are completely secure and will not be "
"lost, even if you die and are returned to the island.\n"
"\n"
"You can only ever equip one secure container."
msgstr ""
"你获得了制造Alpha安全箱的配方。这个小小箱子违背了物理定律,它是永恒的。简而言之,它会给你一个可以随时查看的口袋。这个口袋里的东西是完全安全的,"
"即使你死亡并被送回到岛上,也不会遗失。\n"
"\n"
"你一次只能装备一个安全箱。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The strange metaphysical container suddenly snaps inward, clinging to the "
"very core of your being.  Anything stored here will not be lost on death."
msgstr "这个奇怪的容器突然向内收缩,紧紧依附在你的存在核心上。存放在这里的任何东西在死亡时都不会丢失。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Upgrade: Security Beta"
msgstr "升级:Beta安全箱"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Beta"
#. ~ Player message in an effect
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Gamma"
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Epsilon"
msgid ""
"With the supplied recipe, you will be able to expand the capacity of your "
"secure container."
msgstr "使用提供的配方，您将能够扩展安全箱的容量。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The strange metaphysical container churns inward with violent force, grinding "
"loudly before suddenly expanding.  Your secure container can now carry more."
msgstr "这个奇怪的容器剧烈地向内收缩,然后发出巨大的噪音,最后突然膨胀。你的安全箱现在可以携带更多东西了。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Upgrade: Security Gamma"
msgstr "升级:Gamma安全箱"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Upgrade: Security Epsilon"
msgstr "升级:Epsilon安全箱"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Upgrade: Security Kappa"
msgstr "升级:Kappa安全箱"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Security Kappa"
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"With the supplied recipe, you will be able to expand the capacity of your "
"secure container to its maximum size."
msgstr "使用提供的配方，您将能够扩展安全箱的容量到最大。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Upgrade: Personal sunblock"
msgstr "升级：个人防晒强化"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Upgrade: Personal sunblock"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will unlock a permanent upgrade for all future "
"expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Solar Refractor from sunglasses, glass and miscellaneous parts.  The "
"Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: The sun's rays cannot affect you while on the island."
msgstr ""
"完成这个任务将为所有未来的探险解锁一个永久升级。\n"
"\n"
"用太阳镜、玻璃和杂项零件制作一个日光折射器。空岛之心已经将配方放入你的脑海中\n"
"\n"
"效果：身处岛屿期间，阳光无法对你造成任何负面影响。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Somehow, you understand the statue is calling out for something that can "
"strengthen its power.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: The sun's rays cannot affect you while on the island."
msgstr ""
"不知何故,你感觉到这座雕像在呼唤着一些能增强其力量的东西。\n"
"学会一个新配方。制作此神器以永久升级岛屿。\n"
"效果：身处岛屿期间免疫阳光伤害。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The sun's rays shift a little.  As long as you are on the island, any harm "
"they could do to you will be negated."
msgstr "阳光的照射角度有些变化。只要身处岛屿范围内，阳光可能带来的伤害都会自动失效。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Solar Refractor"
msgid_plural "Solar Refractors"
msgstr[0] "日光折射器"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Solar Refractor"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will make the island protect your skin "
"from the sun while you are not earthside.  If your skin doesn't burn as the "
"sun shines on it, this artifact will not do much to help but still won't "
"hinder.  Will be used automatically upon crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED UPGRADE: personal sunblock."
msgstr ""
"“这件玄乎的装置能让你在地面时免受阳光灼伤。但如果你本身不怕晒，它虽然派不上大用场，倒也不会添乱。制作完成后自动生效，且仅限使用一次。\n"
"\n"
"关联升级项：个人防晒强化。"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Upgrade: Personal windblock"
msgstr "Upgrade: Personal windblock"

