msgstr "Empower your vampirism."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Superior Vampiric Amplificator"
msgid_plural "Superior Vampiric Amplificators"
msgstr[0] "Superior Vampiric Amplificators"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "Superior Vampiric Amplificator"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will push your vampirism to its absolute "
"limit.\n"
"\n"
"As per the previous vampiric amplificator, you have to decide to use the "
"crafted item for its effect to apply."
msgstr ""
