#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sweet goop"
msgid_plural "sweet goop"
msgstr[0] "甜胶"

#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/items/comestibles/other.json
#. ~ Description of "sweet goop"
msgid ""
"A bunch of sweet stuff with a wet, goopy consistency.  Normal bugs would die "
"for this, just hope the mutants will like it as well."
msgstr "一堆湿润黏稠的甜食，普通的昆虫一定会为此而死，只希望变异昆虫也会喜欢。"

