msgstr "关于驯养各种虫卵的配方"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxic_glue"
msgid "Termite Glue"
msgstr "白蚁胶"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Termite Glue"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Termite Glue"
msgid "You're covered in thick noxious glue!"
msgstr "厚厚的毒胶覆盖住了你！"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Termite Glue"
msgid "The glue has washed up but it surely left a mark."
msgstr "毒胶洗干净了，但肯定留下了痕迹。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Termite Glue"
msgid "The glue restricts your movement."
msgstr "毒胶限制了你的行动。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Termite Glue"
msgid "Chemical Allergen"
msgstr "Chemical Allergen"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "TropiCataclysm"
msgstr "熱帶大災變"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "TropiCataclysm"
msgid ""
"Changes the setting from New England to an undisclosed region in Brazil.  "
"Initially based out of Desert Region mod."
msgstr "将地区设置从新英格兰变更为一个位于巴西的不明地区，最初基于沙漠地区模组。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spread_glue"
msgid "Spread Glue"
msgstr "散布毒胶"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spread_glue ( Spread Glue )"
msgid "Splatters a glue-like substance along the ground in a cone."
msgstr "在一片锥形区域的地面上喷射出有毒粘胶。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pollen_breath"
msgid "Pollen Breath"
msgstr "花粉呼吸"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pollen_breath ( Pollen Breath )"
msgid "Spews pollen in a cone."
msgstr "在一片锥形区域喷出花粉。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "malboro_breath"
msgid "Bad Breath"
msgstr "有毒呼吸"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "malboro_breath ( Bad Breath )"
msgid "Spews toxic gas in a cone."
msgstr "在一片锥形区域喷出毒气。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_overmap_terrain.json
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "desert"
msgstr "沙漠"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "singing sand"
msgstr "鸣沙"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "singing sand"
msgid ""
"A formation of sand containing special minerals to produce whistling noises "
"when stepped on and from the wind."
msgstr "一种含有特殊矿物的沙子的形成，当踩在风上或从风中发出口哨声。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "outcrop"
msgid ""
"An assortment of various large, sharp rocks that jut out from the surrounding "
"terrain.  Could be used as a surface for a number of things or climbed on if "
"worn with proper footwear."
msgstr "从周围地形中突出来的各种大而尖的岩石。可以作为很多东西的表面，如果穿着合适的鞋子，也可以爬上去。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "dune"
msgstr "沙丘"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "dune"
msgid ""
"A huge sand dune that is continually reshaped by the wind.  Climbing it will "
"be troublesome."
msgstr "一个巨大的沙丘，被风不断地重塑。很难爬上去。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/overmap/desert_overmap_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "desert pavement"
msgstr "岩漠"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "desert pavement"
msgid ""
"Not that kind of pavement!  Naturally occurring pockets of densely packed "
"rock fragments that is easier to traverse than sand, with the right footwear."
msgstr "那不是人工路面，而是由密集的天然空腔碎岩石组成，比沙漠更容易穿行，只要穿着合适的鞋子。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "scorched earth"
msgstr "焦土"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "scorched earth"
msgid ""
"Cracked and dry soil that doesn't look like it will be capable of supporting "
"anything in your lifetime."
msgstr "龟裂的土地，看起来不像是可以支撑什么东西。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "fungal mat"
msgstr "菌毯"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal mat"
msgid ""
"A dense layer of mutated underground fungus grown by the termites.  "
"Completely unrelated to the alien fungus found in the surface."
msgstr "白蚁生长出一层密集的变异地下真菌。与在地表发现的异界真菌完全无关。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "underground fungus"
msgstr "地下真菌"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "underground fungus"
msgid ""
"This is a large clump of mutated fungi grown by the termites deep "
"underground.  It looks slightly toxic but edible and it should be ripe for "
"harvest on winter."
msgstr "这是地下深处白蚁生长出一大块变异真菌。它看起来带有微毒，但仍可以食用，应该在冬天能成熟收割。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "underground fungus"
msgid ""
"This is a large clump of mutated fungi grown by the termites deep "
"underground.  It doesn't seem to be ready for harvest yet."
msgstr "这是地下深处白蚁生长出一大块变异真菌。它看起来还不能被收割。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "pachira tree"
msgstr "瓜栗树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "pachira tree"
msgid ""
"A massive wetland tree belonging to the 'Pachira' genus, also known as the "
"Guiana Chestnut Tree.  If you look closely, you can see some unharvested "
"chestnuts."
msgstr "这是一棵巨大的湿地乔木，属于瓜栗属，也被称为发财树。如果仔细观察，还能看到一些未采摘的栗子。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "chestnut tree"
msgid ""
"A massive wetland tree belonging to the 'Pachira' genus, also known as the "
"Guiana Chestnut tree."
msgstr "这是一棵巨大的湿地乔木，属于瓜栗属，也被称为发财树。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "gevuina tree"
msgstr "智利榛树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "gevuina tree"
msgid ""
"A stubby tree belonging to the 'Gevuina' genus, also known as the Chilean "
"Hazelnut Tree.  If you look closely, you can see some unharvested hazelnuts."
msgstr "一棵粗矮的树木，名为智利榛树（拉丁学名\"Gevuina\"）。靠近看时可以发现一些还没被摘掉的榛子。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "gevuina tree"
msgid ""
"A stubby tree belonging to the 'Gevuina' genus, also known as the Chilean "
"Hazelnut Tree."
msgstr "一棵粗矮的树木，名为智利榛树（拉丁学名\"Gevuina\"）。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "avellanita bush"
msgstr "罂粟花从"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "avellanita bush"
msgid ""
"A species of bush belonging to the 'Avellanita' genus.  This plant is native "
"to Chile and has potential due to their edible nuts."
msgstr "一种属于 \"珠花桐 \"属的灌木。 这种植物原产于智利，因其坚果可食用而颇具潜力。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "avellanita bush"
msgid ""
"A species of bush belonging to the 'Avellanita' genus.  Currently devoid of "
"nuts."
msgstr "一种属于 \"珠花桐 \"属的灌木。 目前没有坚果。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "ceiba"
msgstr "木棉树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "ceiba"
msgid ""
"A massive tropical tree belonging to the 'Ceiba' genus.  These gigantic trees "
"can be found from Mexico to Southern Chile."
msgstr "木棉属的巨大的热带树木，从墨西哥到智利南部都有分布。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "acacia"
msgstr "相思树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "acacia"
msgid ""
"A slender subtropical tree belonging to the 'Acacia' genus.  Members of this "
"genus are mostly constrained to Australia but have been brought abroad for "
"multiple purposes with some being considered invasive species."
msgstr "细长的亚热带乔木，属于\"相思树\"属。 该属的成员大多只生长于澳大利亚，但因种种原因被带到国外，其中一部分被认为是入侵物种。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "huizache"
msgstr "金合欢"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "huizache"
msgid ""
"A slender tropical tree belonging to the 'Vachellia' genus.  This genus of "
"plants is related to acacias but are native to the Americas with a wide "
"distribution from Mexico to Brazil and worldwide."
msgstr "细长的热带树木，属于\"金合欢\"属。金合欢属与相思树属是近亲，但其原产于美洲，从墨西哥到巴西和世界各地广泛分布。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "parajubea"
msgstr "脊果椰子树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "parajubea"
msgid ""
"A medium sized palm tree belonging to the 'Parajubea' genus.  There are only "
"three confirmed members of this genus, two of them endangered in Bolivia."
msgstr "中等大小的棕榈树，属于\"脊果椰子\"属。这个属只有三个已确认的成员，其中两个在玻利维亚濒临灭绝。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "guayacan"
msgstr "中美洲蚁木"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "guayacan"
msgid ""
"A medium sized tropical tree belonging to one of four different genera native "
"to the Americas.  All well known for their incredibly sturdy wood."
msgstr "中等大小的热带树木，原产于美洲的四个不同属之一。它们都以木质特别坚固而闻名。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "ficus"
msgstr "无花果树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "ficus"
msgid ""
"A large tropical tree belonging to the 'Ficus' genus.  This genus has a "
"worldwide distribution, specially known for their fruit known as 'figs' or "
"the latex they produce when cut."
msgstr "无花果属的大型热带树木。这个属在世界各地都有分布，特别是以其果实\"无花果\"或其切割时产生的乳胶而闻名。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "mango tree"
msgstr "芒果树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "mango tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Mangifera' genus, producing fruit commonly "
"known as mangoes.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could "
"probably find a few mature ones in summer."
msgstr "一棵在夏天能够结出芒果果实的树，分类学上属于芒果属。如果你顺着枝干仔细观察的话，就可以找到几个成熟的芒果。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "mango tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Mangifera' genus, producing fruit commonly "
"known as mangoes.  There do not appear to be any ripe mangoes now."
msgstr "一棵在夏天能够结出芒果果实的树，分类学上属于芒果属。看起来上面成熟的芒果都被摘光了。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "papaya tree"
msgstr "木瓜树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "papaya tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Carica' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as papayas.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably "
"find a few mature ones in summer."
msgstr "一棵在夏天能够结出木瓜果实的树，分类学上属于番木瓜属。如果你顺着枝干仔细观察的话，就可以找到几个成熟的木瓜。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "papaya tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Carica' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as papayas.  There do not appear to be any ripe papayas now."
msgstr "一棵在夏天能够结出木瓜果实的树，分类学上属于番木瓜属。看起来上面成熟的木瓜都被摘光了。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "pomegranate tree"
msgstr "石榴树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "pomegranate tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Punica' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as pomegranates.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could "
"probably find a few mature ones in autumn."
msgstr "一棵在秋天能够结出石榴果实的树，分类学上属于石榴属。如果你顺着枝干仔细观察的话，就可以找到几个成熟的石榴。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "pomegranate tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Punica' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
