msgstr "一棵在秋天能够结出石榴果实的树，分类学上属于石榴属。看起来上面成熟的石榴都被摘光了。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "coconut palm tree"
msgstr "椰子树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "coconut palm tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Cocos' genus, producing fruit commonly known as "
"coconuts.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably find "
