msgstr "一棵在夏天能够结出椰子果实的树，分类学上属于椰子属。如果你顺着枝干仔细观察的话，就可以找到几个成熟的椰子。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "coconut palm tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Cocos' genus, producing fruit commonly known as "
"coconuts.  There do not appear to be any ripe coconuts now."
msgstr "一棵在夏天能够结出椰子果实的树，分类学上属于椰子属。看起来上面成熟的椰子都被摘光了。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "orange tree"
msgstr "橘子樹"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "orange tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as oranges.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably "
"find a few mature ones in spring."
msgstr "一棵在春天能够结出橘子果实的树，分类学上属于柑橘属。如果你顺着枝干仔细观察的话，就可以找到几个成熟的橘子。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "orange tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as oranges.  There do not appear to be any ripe oranges now."
msgstr "一棵在春天能够结出橘子果实的树，分类学上属于柑橘属。看起来上面成熟的橘子都被摘光了。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "lemon tree"
msgstr "柠檬树木"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "lemon tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as lemons.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably "
"find a few mature ones in winter."
msgstr "一棵在春天能够结出柠檬果实的树，分类学上属于柑橘属。如果你顺着枝干仔细观察的话，就可以找到几个成熟的柠檬。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "lemon tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as lemons.  There do not appear to be any ripe lemons now."
msgstr "一棵在冬天能够结出柠檬果实的树，分类学上属于柑橘属。看起来上面成熟的柠檬都被摘光了。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "grapefruit tree"
msgstr "西柚树"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "grapefruit tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as grapefruits or pomelos.  If you examined the branches more closely, you "
"could probably find a few mature ones in autumn."
msgstr "一棵在秋天能够结出西柚果实的树，分类学上属于柑橘属。如果你顺着枝干仔细观察的话，就可以找到几个成熟的西柚。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "grapefruit tree"
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as grapefruits or pomelos.  There do not appear to be any ripe grapefruits "
"now."
msgstr "一棵在秋天能够结出西柚果实的树，分类学上属于柑橘属。看起来上面成熟的西柚都被摘光了。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "cholla cactus"
msgstr "乔拉仙人掌"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "cholla cactus"
msgid ""
"This cactus is a member of the 'Cylindropuntia' genus, producing fruit known "
"commonly as cholla buds.  The buds grow and ripen around spring."
msgstr "这株仙人掌属于\"圆柱掌\"属，其果实通常被称为仙人掌花蕾。花蕾在春季左右生长成熟。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "cholla cactus"
msgid ""
"This cactus is a member of the 'Cylindropuntia' genus, producing fruit known "
"commonly as cholla buds.  There doesn't seem to be any cholla buds right now."
msgstr "这株仙人掌属于\"圆柱掌\"属，其果实通常被称为仙人掌花蕾。现在似乎没有任何花蕾。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "nopal cactus"
msgstr "梨果仙人掌"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "nopal cactus"
msgid ""
"This cactus is a member of the 'Opuntia' genus, producing fruit known "
"commonly as tuno buds or figs.  The buds grow and ripen around autumn."
msgstr "这株仙人掌属于\"仙人掌\"属，其果实通常被称为梨果仙人掌。梨果在秋季左右生长成熟。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "nopal cactus"
msgid ""
"This cactus is a member of the 'Opuntia' genus, producing fruit known "
"commonly as tuno buds or figs.  There doesn't seem to be any tuno buds right "
"now."
msgstr "这株仙人掌属于\"仙人掌\"属，其果实通常被称为梨果仙人掌。现在似乎没有任何梨果。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "alien coral"
msgstr "外星珊瑚"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "alien coral"
msgid ""
"A colony of alien organisms forming what appears to be some kind of rocky "
"structure.  It looks sturdy as stone."
msgstr "形成某种岩石结构的异界生物种群。它看起来像石头一样坚固。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "alien sponge"
msgstr "外星海綿"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "alien sponge"
msgid ""
"This looks like some kind of alien sponge.  It has a bluish color and seems "
"sturdy as a rock."
msgstr "这看起来像某种异界海绵。它呈蓝色，看起来像岩石一样坚固。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "alien polyp"
msgstr "外星水蟲息"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien polyp"
msgid ""
"This is an alien creature resembling some kind of cnidarian like a hydra or "
"anemone.  Probably not a good idea to touch or step on it."
msgstr "某种异界生物，类似于水螅或海葵等腔肠动物。触摸或是踩上去可能不是个好主意。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "alien lily"
msgstr "外星海百合"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "alien lily"
msgid ""
"This is an alien creature resembling some kind of sea lily.  Its feathery "
"arms spread open like palm tree to catch the aero plankton in the area."
msgstr "某种异界生物，类似于某种海百合。它羽毛般的手臂像棕榈树一样张开，捕捉该地区的浮游生物。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of echinoderm flesh"
msgid_plural "chunks of echinoderm flesh"
msgstr[0] "棘皮肉塊"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of echinoderm flesh"
msgid ""
"The flesh of an echinoderm.  Considered a delicacy in several parts of the "
"world but otherwise poor in nutritional value."
msgstr "棘皮动物的肉块。在世界上许多地方被认为是美味佳肴，但其他方面的营养价值很低。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked echinoderm"
msgid_plural "cooked echinoderm"
msgstr[0] "熟棘皮肉"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked echinoderm"
msgid "Freshly cooked echinoderm.  Not so glamorous without the rest of ingredients."
msgstr "新鲜烹制的棘皮动物的肉块。没有其他佐料就不那么美味了。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of cnidarian meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of cnidarian meat"
msgstr[0] "刺胞肉塊"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of cnidarian meat"
msgid ""
"The flesh of a cnidarian.  Cultivated in some parts of the planet as an "
"exotic ingredient but otherwise a low nutrient edible."
msgstr "腔肠动物的肉块。在地球的某些地方被认为是一种猎奇食材，但其他方面的营养价值很低。"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked cnidarian"
msgid_plural "cooked cnidarian"
msgstr[0] "熟刺胞肉"

#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked cnidarian"
msgid ""
"Freshly cooked cnidarian.  Looks translucent and tasteless, you may want to "
"add something to flavor it."
msgstr "新鲜烹制的腔肠动物的肉块。看起来透明无味，你可能想给它添加一些佐料。"

