#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help menu
msgid "Xedra Evolved: Basics"
msgstr "Xedra Evolved: Basics"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Basics"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Xedra Evolved, the urban fantasy mod for Cataclysm.  This mod adds "
"folklore based enemies, experiences and magicks to the Cataclysm.  Humans who "
"experience particularly vivid dreams might learn how to wield them into "
"strange magicks.  Former Xedra employees include cyborgs with stolen bionics, "
"magick wielders and even a Gracken or two."
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Xedra Evolved, the urban fantasy mod for Cataclysm.  This mod adds "
"folklore based enemies, experiences and magicks to the Cataclysm.  Humans who "
"experience particularly vivid dreams might learn how to wield them into "
"strange magicks.  Former Xedra employees include cyborgs with stolen bionics, "
"magick wielders and even a Gracken or two."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Basics"
msgid ""
"The world of Xedra Evolved had decades of dimensional seepage and places "
"where our world connected to other realities.  During these years before the "
"Cataclysm the world became weirder.  Supernatural creatures from myth and "
"legend returned, visited for the first time or left the shadows.  Some games "
"you'll fight against them.  Some days you may very well be one of them."
msgstr ""
"The world of Xedra Evolved had decades of dimensional seepage and places "
"where our world connected to other realities.  During these years before the "
"Cataclysm the world became weirder.  Supernatural creatures from myth and "
"legend returned, visited for the first time or left the shadows.  Some games "
"you'll fight against them.  Some days you may very well be one of them."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Basics"
msgid ""
"There are multiple types of supernatural beings that the player can start as "
"or sometimes become.  It is intended that their abilities cannot be mixed and "
"matched except in very specific circumstances."
msgstr ""
"There are multiple types of supernatural beings that the player can start as "
"or sometimes become.  It is intended that their abilities cannot be mixed and "
"matched except in very specific circumstances."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Basics"
msgid ""
"Some times you may want to play a normal game with extra enemies and no dream "
"magick, take the Dreamless trait."
msgstr ""
"Some times you may want to play a normal game with extra enemies and no dream "
"magick, take the Dreamless trait."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help menu
msgid "Xedra Evolved: Possible Starts"
msgstr "Xedra Evolved: Possible Starts"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Possible Starts"
msgid ""
"Cyborg starts exist in XE.  However, those cbms inside of you were pulled out "
"of dead Exodii offworld.  Now that the Exodii are here on planet don't expect "
"them to help you."
msgstr ""
"Cyborg starts exist in XE.  However, those cbms inside of you were pulled out "
"of dead Exodii offworld.  Now that the Exodii are here on planet don't expect "
"them to help you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Possible Starts"
msgid ""
"If you are interested in starting with significant dream magick, look at the "
"four melded task force professions."
msgstr ""
"If you are interested in starting with significant dream magick, look at the "
"four melded task force professions."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Possible Starts"
msgid ""
"To start as a werewolf, newly bitten vampire, Lilit, elemental fae, or "
"Chronomancer look at the mod specific scenarios."
msgstr ""
"To start as a werewolf, newly bitten vampire, Lilit, elemental fae, or "
"Chronomancer look at the mod specific scenarios."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Possible Starts"
msgid ""
"There are a number of more mundane/less high powered starts available such as "
"a foreign spy, cryptid hunter all the way to hedge magician and changeling."
msgstr ""
"There are a number of more mundane/less high powered starts available such as "
"a foreign spy, cryptid hunter all the way to hedge magician and changeling."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help menu
msgid "Xedra Evolved: Learning New Powers"
msgstr "Xedra超进化：学习新的力量"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Learning New Powers"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Both the Dreamsmith and Mad Inventor classes have research actions that you "
"can perform.  They will often fail, but each failure moves the percentage "
"chance for your next attempt to succeed up until it hits 100%."
msgstr ""
"Both the Dreamsmith and Mad Inventor classes have research actions that you "
"can perform.  They will often fail, but each failure moves the percentage "
"chance for your next attempt to succeed up until it hits 100%."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Learning New Powers"
msgid ""
"Alchemy can be discovered in game.  It requires some luck to find it in the "
"game world, but if you selected Bombastic Perks mod as an additional mod, you "
"can learn Alchemy easily via the perk system."
msgstr ""
"Alchemy can be discovered in game.  It requires some luck to find it in the "
"game world, but if you selected Bombastic Perks mod as an additional mod, you "
"can learn Alchemy easily via the perk system."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Learning New Powers"
msgid ""
"Vampires will get a random assortment of powers as they age up and grow.  "
"Every run as a vampire should have a slightly different mix of powers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Learning New Powers"
msgid ""
"Elemental Fae, Paraclesians need to gather samples from the other elements "
"and make potions that grant them new powers."
msgstr ""
"Elemental Fae, Paraclesians need to gather samples from the other elements "
"and make potions that grant them new powers."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Learning New Powers"
msgid ""
"Gracken are a work in progress but the idea is that they are monster hunters "
"who take parts of their kills and use those parts to transform themselves in "
"new and different ways.  Look in their Gracken recipe tab."
msgstr ""
"Gracken are a work in progress but the idea is that they are monster hunters "
"who take parts of their kills and use those parts to transform themselves in "
"new and different ways.  Look in their Gracken recipe tab."

