#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/dialogue/chronomancer_insight_menu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"As a chronomancer, you have a nigh-unique ability to alter the flow of time "
"to your benefit.  However, in order to improve your abilities you must have "
"insight into time.\n"
"\n"
"You may gain chronal insight in several ways:\n"
" #1: Using any chronomancy spell will temporarily allow you to gain insight "
"on killing any enemy for a short time based on the difficulty of the spell.\n"
" #2: Killing time altered creatures, such as monochrome zombies, will give "
"you immediate insight based on the difficulty of that enemy.\n"
" #3: You will gain a small amount of insight every day, proportionally "
"increased by the amount of negative temporal traits you have.\n"
"\n"
" Current Insight: <u_val:xedra_chronomancer_insight_count>"
msgstr ""
"As a chronomancer, you have a nigh-unique ability to alter the flow of time "
"to your benefit.  However, in order to improve your abilities you must have "
"insight into time.\n"
"\n"
"You may gain chronal insight in several ways:\n"
" #1: Using any chronomancy spell will temporarily allow you to gain insight "
"on killing any enemy for a short time based on the difficulty of the spell.\n"
" #2: Killing time altered creatures, such as monochrome zombies, will give "
"you immediate insight based on the difficulty of that enemy.\n"
" #3: You will gain a small amount of insight every day, proportionally "
"increased by the amount of negative temporal traits you have.\n"
"\n"
" Current Insight: <u_val:xedra_chronomancer_insight_count>"

