#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Blood Spiders"
msgid "Your veins itch…"
msgstr "你的血管很痒……"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Blood Spiders"
msgid "Unknown Hemolytic Parasite"
msgstr "Unknown Hemolytic Parasite"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "faewild"
msgid "glamoured"
msgstr "被迷住"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "glamoured"
msgid "The world is beautiful and breathtaking but maybe also terrifying."
msgstr "这个世界既美丽的，令人惊叹，但也可能是可怕的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "glamoured"
msgid "The colors brighten and your vision sharpens."
msgstr "The colors brighten and your vision sharpens."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "glamoured"
msgid "The world becomes a duller place."
msgstr "这个世界又变得如之前一般沉闷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "glamoured"
msgid "Cross-dimensional Narcotic, unexpected physics encountered"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "relative_physics"
msgid "Angled"
msgstr "夹角"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "relative_physics"
msgid "Canted"
msgstr "倾斜"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "relative_physics"
msgid "Mirrored"
msgstr "镜像"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Angled"
msgid "Your vision suddenly feels as if it shifted down and to the left."
msgstr "你的视野突然感觉好像向左下方移动了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Canted"
msgid "You are viewing the world as if from an orchestra pit."
msgstr "你觉得自己看着世界就像是一个管弦乐队一样。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Mirrored"
msgid "You feel your body moves mirrored to the thoughts in your head."
msgstr "你觉得自己的身体运动好像和你头脑中的想法正好相反。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
msgid "You feel the universe vibrating."
msgstr "你感觉到宇宙在震动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
msgid "The hum in your bones subsides."
msgstr "你骨头里的嗡嗡声消失了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
msgid "Your body accepts your presence once more."
msgstr "你的身体重新接受了你的存在。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
msgid "A mirror cracks in the distance."
msgstr "远处仿佛有面镜子裂开了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Angled, Canted, Mirrored"
msgid "Anomalous Readings"
msgstr "Anomalous Readings"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "foxfire_imbibed"
msgid "Foxfire"
msgstr "狐火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "foxfire_imbibed"
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Balefire"
msgstr "烽火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "foxfire_imbibed"
msgid "St. Elmo's Fire"
msgstr "圣艾尔摩之火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Foxfire"
msgid "Your body is dimly covered in ephemeral flames."
msgstr "你的身体被短暂的火焰模糊地覆盖着。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Balefire"
msgid "The flames sometimes obstruct your vision, yet you feel no pain from them."
msgstr "火焰有时会挡住你的视线，但你却感觉不到任何疼痛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "St. Elmo's Fire"
msgid "You body shines like a lit beacon."
msgstr "你的身体像灯塔一样耀眼。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Foxfire, Balefire, St. Elmo's Fire"
msgid "The flames distract you."
msgstr "火焰让你无法集中精力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_monster_shadow_damage_reduction"
msgid "Shadow Damage Reduction"
msgstr "Shadow Damage Reduction"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Shadow Damage Reduction"
msgid ""
"You are flatter and less real in ways that makes you less susceptible to "
"damage."
msgstr ""
"You are flatter and less real in ways that makes you less susceptible to "
"damage."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "creativity"
msgid "One Amazing Idea"
msgstr "一个奇思妙想"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "creativity"
msgid "Several Inspired Tangents"
msgstr "几个灵感切入点"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "creativity"
msgid "Brimming with Creativity"
msgstr "创造力满盈"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "One Amazing Idea"
msgid ""
"You have an incredibly amazing idea.  You think you should "
"<color_yellow>research</color> it."
msgstr "你有了个超棒的点子。你觉得你应该<color_yellow>研究</color>它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Several Inspired Tangents"
msgid ""
"You've got a few theories you'd like to explore.  Grab a laptop, a cup of "
"coffee, and <color_yellow>research</color> it like a proper scientist."
msgstr "你有了几个想研究的理论。找个笔记本电脑，加上一杯咖啡，像个正经科学家一样<color_yellow>研究</color>它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Brimming with Creativity"
msgid ""
"Your brain can't hold any more brilliance.  To the "
"<color_yellow>research</color> table!"
msgstr "你的大脑无法承受更多的智慧，快去<color_yellow>研究</color>！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "One Amazing Idea, Several Inspired
#. Tangents, Brimming with Creativity"
msgid ""
"A great idea has illuminated your mind, it's probably a good time to pick up "
"your laptop and do some calculations."
msgstr "一个好点子点亮了你的头脑，现在也许是拿起笔记本电脑计算一下的好时机。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "mental_exhaustion"
msgid "Mental Exhaustion"
msgstr "心力交瘁"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Mental Exhaustion"
msgid ""
"You have recently realized a new alchemical recipe and your thoughts are "
"scattered."
msgstr "你刚发明了一个炼金配方，如今思绪混乱。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Mental Exhaustion"
msgid ""
"Your mind feels normal enough that you could focus on new alchemy ideas once "
"again."
msgstr "你感觉现在思想足够正常，可以再次专注于新的炼金术研究。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dreamer_eff"
msgid "Matter Twist"
msgstr "物质扭曲"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dreamer_eff"
msgid "Matter Deformation"
msgstr "物质变形"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dreamer_eff"
msgid "Dimensional Shift"
msgstr "维度转移"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dreamer_eff"
msgid "Dimensional Chasm"
msgstr "维度裂隙"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dreamer_eff"
msgid "Reality Gateway"
msgstr "现实门径"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Matter Twist"
msgid "Sometimes the world nearby twists.  Was it you?"
msgstr "有时附近的世界扭曲了。是你吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Matter Deformation"
msgid "Sometimes you hear an odd noise, like a whisper."
msgstr "Sometimes you hear an odd noise, like a whisper."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Shift"
msgid "You feel someone's presences.  They are wondering."
msgstr "你感觉到某个存在。它们正在好奇。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Chasm"
msgid ""
"Random voices jump into your head from time to time.  Most of them are "
"friendly."
msgstr ""
"Random voices jump into your head from time to time.  Most of them are "
"friendly."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Reality Gateway"
msgid "You clearly feel the otherworldly presence.  They are ready to help you."
msgstr "你清晰地感觉到异界存在。它们准备好帮助你了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "night_sight"
#. ~ Name of spell "night_sight"
msgid "Night Sight"
msgstr "夜視術"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Night Sight"
msgid "The darkness loses its shape and your eyes return to their usual hue."
msgstr "黑暗失去了它的形状，你所见之处恢复成往常的色彩。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dread_weight"
msgid "Existential Dread"
msgstr "生存恐惧"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Existential Dread"
msgid "Is there any point to forward movement?"
msgstr "还有任何前进的意义吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Existential Dread"
msgid "The air around you chills as existence loses its appeal!"
msgstr "你周围的空气变冷了，生存对你也失去了吸引力！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Existential Dread"
msgid "The weight is lifted from your mind and the air warms."
msgstr "重负从你的脑海中消失，空气重新变得温暖。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "blood_treatment"
msgid "Heightened levels of organosulfur compounds, mercury, and silver."
msgstr "Heightened levels of organosulfur compounds, mercury, and silver."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Flush, Engorged, Tick-like"
msgid ""
"Patient has had extensive battlefield blood transfusions.  Serious risk of "
"bloodborne infections."
msgstr ""
"Patient has had extensive battlefield blood transfusions.  Serious risk of "
"bloodborne infections."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "cheval_overdose"
msgid "Energized"
msgstr "活力四射"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "cheval_overdose"
msgid "Enflamed"
msgstr "激动似火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "cheval_overdose"
msgid "Arrhythmic"
msgstr "心率失常"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "cheval_overdose"
msgid "Tachycardiac"
msgstr "心跳加速"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
msgid "These magickal trucker pills have kicked in and you feel great!"
msgstr "These magickal trucker pills have kicked in and you feel great!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
msgid ""
"You shouldn't have taken this many pills.  Your skin flushes and your nerves "
"feel like they are on fire."
msgstr ""
"You shouldn't have taken this many pills.  Your skin flushes and your nerves "
"feel like they are on fire."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
msgid ""
"Your heartbeat doesn't feel normal.  Why on earth did you take more of these "
"pills?"
msgstr ""
"Your heartbeat doesn't feel normal.  Why on earth did you take more of these "
"pills?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
msgid ""
"This might just be it, the big one.  With no hospital available you're just "
"going to have to ride it straight through Hell."
msgstr ""
"This might just be it, the big one.  With no hospital available you're just "
"going to have to ride it straight through Hell."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
msgid ""
"These magickal trucker pills have worn off and you feel rough.  It might be "
"best to go ahead and sleep through the hangover as best you can."
msgstr "这些神奇的小贩药片已经失效，你感觉很难受。 最好的办法可能是先睡一觉，尽可能地度过宿醉期。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
msgid ""
"Aside from any leftover pain and damage that was done to your body by "
"overdosing your feeling pretty good now."
msgstr "除了残留的疼痛和药物过量对身体造成的伤害，你现在感觉很好。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
msgid ""
"Your heartbeat slows into a somewhat normal rhythm but your skin is still on "
"fire."
msgstr "你的心跳逐渐减慢，节奏稍稍正常，但皮肤仍然火辣辣的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
msgid ""
"The pain in your chest subsides but your heart is still beating in a "
"concerning fashion."
msgstr "胸口的疼痛感减弱了，但心脏仍在令人担忧地跳动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Energized, Enflamed,
#. Arrhythmic, Tachycardiac"
msgid ""
"Patient has dangerous levels of multiple chemicals in their blood.  Sedation "
"and restraint suggested."
msgstr ""
"Patient has dangerous levels of multiple chemicals in their blood.  Sedation "
"and restraint suggested."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "cheval_withdrawal"
msgid ""
"Patient has multiple byproducts in blood stream suggesting extended drug "
"binge."
msgstr ""
"Patient has multiple byproducts in blood stream suggesting extended drug "
"binge."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "drank_fae_blood_hallucination"
msgid "Altered vision"
msgstr "Altered vision"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "drank_fae_blood_hallucination"
msgid "Distorted vision"
msgstr "Distorted vision"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "drank_fae_blood_hallucination"
msgid "Hallucination"
msgstr "幻覺"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "drank_fae_blood_hallucination"
msgid "Severe hallucination"
msgstr "Severe hallucination"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted vision,
#. Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid "Your vision twists a little after drinking that Fae blood."
msgstr "Your vision twists a little after drinking that Fae blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted vision,
#. Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid "Your vision starts distorting a little more as you drink the Fae blood."
msgstr "Your vision starts distorting a little more as you drink the Fae blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted vision,
#. Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid "Your vision starts seeing things that aren't there as you drink the Fae blood."
msgstr "Your vision starts seeing things that aren't there as you drink the Fae blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted vision,
#. Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid ""
"Drinking that much Fae blood has left your vision almost unable to "
"differentiate between reality and illusion."
msgstr ""
"Drinking that much Fae blood has left your vision almost unable to "
"differentiate between reality and illusion."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted vision,
#. Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid "Your vision is normal again."
msgstr "Your vision is normal again."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted vision,
#. Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid "Your vision is almost back to normal."
msgstr "Your vision is almost back to normal."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted vision,
#. Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid ""
"You stopped seeing things, but your vision still twists and deforms what you "
"see."
msgstr ""
"You stopped seeing things, but your vision still twists and deforms what you "
"see."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted vision,
#. Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid ""
"Your ability to differentiate what is real and what isn't is a little better "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Your ability to differentiate what is real and what isn't is a little better "
"now."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Altered vision, Distorted
#. vision, Hallucination, Severe hallucination"
msgid "Unknown Hallucinogens."
msgstr "Unknown Hallucinogens."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "poisoned_blood"
msgid "Poisoned blood"
msgstr "血液中毒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Poisoned blood"
msgid "You have poisoned your own blood!"
msgstr "你的血中毒了！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Death message of effect type "poisoned_blood2"
msgid "Your blood turns to acid and melts through your body."
msgstr "你的血液转变为酸，流遍身体将你溶解。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
msgid "Wan"
msgstr "病态苍白"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
msgid "Reddened Eyes"
msgstr "血红双眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
msgid "Bloodthirst"
msgstr "血渴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Wan"
msgid "Your complexion is wan and spent."
msgstr "你的面色苍白又憔悴。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Reddened Eyes"
msgid "Your skin is pale and your eyes are thoroughly bloodshot."
msgstr "你的皮肤苍白，双眼极度充血。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Bloodthirst"
msgid ""
"Your skin is pale and your eyes have turned dark red.  You feel a constant "
"hunger, like the food you eat is no longer nourishing you."
msgstr "你的皮肤变得苍白眼睛转为深红色。你感到持续的饥饿感，就像你所吃的食物不再为你提供营养一样。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes, Bloodthirst"
msgid ""
"You feel the blood rushing from the wound and then a pressure that reminds "
"you of backwash."
msgstr "你感到血从伤口中涌出，然后有一种像回流的压力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes, Bloodthirst"
msgid "Your iris slowly turns red from the outside in."
msgstr "你的虹膜从内而外地缓慢变红。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes, Bloodthirst"
msgid ""
"There is an emptiness in your stomach and soul that can no longer be filled "
"with mortal joys."
msgstr ""
"There is an emptiness in your stomach and soul that can no longer be filled "
"with mortal joys."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes, Bloodthirst"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Pallor, Itchy pale skin, Necrotic skin"
msgid "You succumb to your deadly necrotic condition."
msgstr "你死于致命的坏死症状。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes,
#. Bloodthirst"
msgid "Unknown RNA virus is rewriting sampled blood cells."
msgstr "Unknown RNA virus is rewriting sampled blood cells."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus_ascendant"
msgid "Terminal Porphyria"
msgstr "卟啉症晚期"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
msgid "Your skin is deathly white and will redden and burn when exposed to the sun."
msgstr "你的皮肤如尸体般苍白，当暴露在太阳下时会发红并烧伤。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
msgid "You've chosen to embrace this illness and enhance your curse."
msgstr "你选择拥抱这疾病，增强你的诅咒。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgid ""
"Blood sample contains numerous unidentified mutations and numerous blood "
"sources.  Original host blood unidentifiable in the mix."
msgstr ""
"Blood sample contains numerous unidentified mutations and numerous blood "
"sources.  Original host blood unidentifiable in the mix."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus_post_mortal"
msgid "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgstr "吸血鬼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgid ""
"Your skin is deathly white, your eyes are solid red except for a huge pupil, "
"the only food you can consume is human blood, and if sunlight hits you that "
"part of your body instantly burns."
msgstr "你的皮肤同死人般泛白，眼中除了巨大的眼瞳外尽溢血红，你今后仅以人血为生，若是行于阳光之下，被太阳照射的部位便会化为灰烬。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgid ""
"Becoming a monster is a matter of degrees until one day it isn't and you can "
"no longer remember why morality seemed important."
msgstr "成为怪物是个循序渐进的过程，直到有一天，当你记不起道德为何物时，也就完全沦为了怪物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Sallow"
msgid ""
"The absence of raw blood from your diet has left you wan, pale and "
"uncomfortable."
msgstr "你的饮食中缺乏生肉，让你变得苍白、无精打采、不舒服。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hypomia"
msgid "Your body is weakened and your need to feed is a constant pain in your chest."
msgstr "你的身体虚弱，需要进食的欲望在你的胸口带来持续的痛苦。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Corpse-like"
msgid ""
"Severe blood deficiency has left you looking emaciated no matter what your "
"weight is."
msgstr "严重的血液不足让你看起来瘦弱不堪，无论你的体重是多少。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Eternal Slumber"
msgid ""
"One day blood may spill on your lips and wake you from your slumber, but "
"until then you are a corpse."
msgstr "有一天，鲜血可能会溅到你的嘴唇上，将你从沉睡中唤醒，但在那之前，你只是一具尸体。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like, Eternal
#. Slumber"
msgid ""
"Most of your thoughts now revolve around blood, how good it tastes and where "
"you might find it."
msgstr "现在你大部分的思绪都围绕着血液，它的美味以及你可能会在哪里找到它"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like, Eternal
#. Slumber"
msgid "Your blood lust is slaked."
msgstr "你的嗜血欲望已经得到满足。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like, Eternal
#. Slumber"
msgid "You've almost consumed enough blood to feel normal again."
msgstr "你已经几乎喝够血液以恢复正常了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like, Eternal
#. Slumber"
msgid "More blood and you'll start to feel even better."
msgstr "多点血液，你会感觉更好。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like,
#. Eternal Slumber"
msgid "Severe Progressive Anemic Autophagy"
msgstr "Severe Progressive Anemic Autophagy"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_blood_drinking_target"
msgid "Vampire's Kiss"
msgstr "Vampire's Kiss"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Vampire's Kiss"
msgid "You are having your blood drunk by a vampire and are still in a swoon."
msgstr "You are having your blood drunk by a vampire and are still in a swoon."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dhampir_empowered_blood_indicator"
msgid "Empowered Blood"
msgstr "Empowered Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Empowered Blood"
msgid ""
"Your blood hums with power, allowing you to access more of your vampiric "
"abilities."
msgstr ""
"Your blood hums with power, allowing you to access more of your vampiric "
"abilities."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dhampir_enervated_blood"
msgid "Enervated Blood"
msgstr "Enervated Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Enervated Blood"
msgid ""
"You have used up much of the power in your blood, and are slightly listless "
"as a result.  In addition, some of your vampiric powers will not function as "
"well, or at all, until the power returns to your blood."
msgstr ""
"You have used up much of the power in your blood, and are slightly listless "
"as a result.  In addition, some of your vampiric powers will not function as "
"well, or at all, until the power returns to your blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dhampir_water_weakness_pain"
msgid "Pain in Water"
msgstr "Pain in Water"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Pain in Water"
msgid "The running water burns you!"
msgstr "The running water burns you!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dhampir_bloodlust_cravings"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "blood_craving"
msgid "Blood Craving"
msgstr "Blood Craving"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Blood Craving"
msgid "Your thoughts keep going back to the taste of warm, fresh blood."
msgstr "Your thoughts keep going back to the taste of warm, fresh blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "eyegleam"
msgid "Eye Gleam"
msgstr "Eye Gleam"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_monster_only.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampiric_strength"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_monster_strength"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vigor Mortis"
msgstr "Vigor Mortis"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Vigor Mortis"
msgid "You have the strength of the damned."
msgstr "You have the strength of the damned."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_monster_only.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampiric_resilience"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_monster_resilience"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sanguine Resilience"
msgstr "Sanguine Resilience"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Sanguine Resilience"
msgid "You have the fortitude of the grave."
msgstr "You have the fortitude of the grave."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "blood_weave"
msgid "Blood Weave"
msgstr "血之守护"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_drank_blood_power_boost"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Carmine Vitality"
msgstr "Carmine Vitality"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Carmine Vitality"
msgid "You can still taste the warm blood on your lips.  You feel amazing."
msgstr "You can still taste the warm blood on your lips.  You feel amazing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_monster_only.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampiric_dodge"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_monster_agility"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Flow Like Blood"
msgstr "Flow Like Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Flow Like Blood"
msgid "You can move so quickly you might even be able to dodge bullets."
msgstr "You can move so quickly you might even be able to dodge bullets."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampiric_stealth_bonus"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cloak of Shadows"
msgstr "Cloak of Shadows"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Cloak of Shadows"
msgid "You are clouding nearby minds and are harder to spot in dim light or darkness."
msgstr "You are clouding nearby minds and are harder to spot in dim light or darkness."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_feign_death"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Corpse's Countenance"
msgstr "Corpse's Countenance"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Corpse's Countenance"
msgid "Nothing here but a corpse."
msgstr "Nothing here but a corpse."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Corpse's Countenance"
msgid "You end your imitation of death."
msgstr "You end your imitation of death."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_feign_death_ended"
msgid "Feigned Death"
msgstr "Feigned Death"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Feigned Death"
msgid "You've been caught, and they know you aren't dead"
msgstr "You've been caught, and they know you aren't dead"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Mesmerized"
msgid "You just can't seem to move or think."
msgstr "You just can't seem to move or think."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Mesmerized"
msgid "You snap out of your fugue."
msgstr "You snap out of your fugue."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_recently_learned_blood_gifts"
msgid "Learned blood gift"
msgstr "Learned blood gift"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Learned blood gift"
msgid ""
"You recently discovered a gift of the blood.  Until you've experimented with "
"it and tested your new powers, further research will be fruitless."
msgstr ""
"You recently discovered a gift of the blood.  Until you've experimented with "
"it and tested your new powers, further research will be fruitless."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Learned blood gift"
msgid "You're sure you could try to learn a new blood gift now."
msgstr "You're sure you could try to learn a new blood gift now."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "eater_lump_pool"
msgid "Dream Gorging"
msgstr "黄粱美梦"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dream Gorging"
msgid ""
"You ate a whole dreamdross ingot.  It is too much for your body, but for a "
"while you are much <color_green>stronger</color>, and <color_green>recover "
"from traumas</color> faster."
msgstr ""
"你吃下了一整块浮梦锭。超过了你能吸收的量，但在接下来的一段时间内，你<color_green>更强壮</color>，<color_green>伤口愈合</"
"color>更快。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Dream Gorging"
msgid "A huge warm wave moves from your stomach through your body."
msgstr "一股巨大的暖流从腹部涌向全身。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dream Gorging"
msgid "The warm feeling fades away."
msgstr "温暖的感觉渐渐消失。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "blind_rage"
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_rage"
msgid "Blind Rage"
msgstr "盲目盛怒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Blind Rage"
msgid "Perfect hatred"
msgstr "完美的憎恨"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Blind Rage"
msgid "AAAAARGH!!"
msgstr "啊啊啊！！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "spell_stamina_eff"
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_stamina_wonder"
msgid "Circulatory"
msgstr "循环"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Circulatory"
msgid "You can't run out of <color_green>breath</color>."
msgstr "你用不完<color_green>呼吸</color>。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Circulatory"
msgid "You feel a deep energy in your muscles, exuberant and coiled."
msgstr "你感受到肌肉中的深层能量，充满活力且紧绷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dodge"
msgid "<color_green>Shun</color> their attacks."
msgstr "<color_green>躲开</color>攻击。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Dodge"
msgid "Your reaction speed is increased."
msgstr "你的反应速度增快了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dodge"
msgid "Your reaction speed turns back to normal."
msgstr "你的反应速度回落至常态。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_endurance"
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_endurance"
msgid "Endurance"
msgstr "忍耐"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Endurance"
msgid ""
"Take the blows.  <color_red>Don't let the world kill you</color>.  Your skin "
"can stop a few attacks."
msgstr "承受打击。<color_red>别让世界杀死你</color>。你的皮肤可以阻止一些攻击。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Endurance"
msgid "Your sense of touch is blunted for a bit, but your skin feels more dense."
msgstr "你的触觉迟钝少许，但你感觉皮肤更加紧实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "spell_melee_damage"
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_melee_damage"
msgid "Physical Instrument"
msgstr "物理工具"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Physical Instrument"
msgid ""
"Your body is a tool of destruction.  <color_red>Use it effectively</color>.  "
"Your attacks are faster and deadlier, and your dodging ability is better."
msgstr "你的身体是毁灭的工具。<color_red>有效地使用它</color>。你的攻击更快更致命，你的躲避能力也更好。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Physical Instrument"
msgid "You can feel a bubbling energy in your muscles."
msgstr "你可以感受到肌肉中涌动的能量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Physical Instrument"
msgid "The feelings in your muscles subside."
msgstr "你肌肉中的感觉消退了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "spell_speed_eff"
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_speed_wonder"
msgid "Rush"
msgstr "狂奔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Rush"
msgid "A burst of <color_green>speed</color>."
msgstr " <color_green>速度</color>爆发。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Rush"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Accelerated"
msgid "You feel your legs are much longer now."
msgstr "现在你感觉你的腿更长了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Rush"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Accelerated"
msgid "Your body shrinks back into its normal space."
msgstr "你的身体回缩到了正常占比。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakness"
msgid "Your body is weakened."
msgstr "Your body is weakened."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "spell_unbreakable_eff"
msgid "You are the only who can control your body now."
msgstr "现在你是唯一能控制自己身体的人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "spell_unbreakable_eff"
msgid "External forces apply to your body again."
msgstr "外力再次作用于你的身体。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "mutagen_earthkin"
msgid "Ierde Mutation"
msgstr "山石裔突变"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "mutagen_earthkin"
msgid "Ierde Transformation"
msgstr "山石裔变形"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "mutagen_earthkin"
msgid "Ierde Metamorphosis"
msgstr "山石裔变身"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Ierde Mutation"
msgid "You consumed Ierde destiny draught."
msgstr "你喝了山石裔命运药水。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Ierde Transformation"
msgid "You consumed a large amount of Ierde destiny draught."
msgstr "你消耗了大量的山石裔命运药水。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Ierde Metamorphosis"
msgid "You consumed a life-changing amount of Ierde destiny draught."
msgstr "你饮用了足以改变一生的山石裔命运药水"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Ierde Mutation, Ierde
#. Transformation, Ierde Metamorphosis"
msgid "Anomalous silicon content in blood sample"
msgstr "Anomalous silicon content in blood sample"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unbreakable"
msgid ""
"<color_green>Nothing can slow you down</color>, and your "
"<color_red>pain</color> sensations are dull."
msgstr "<color_green>没有什么可以让你慢下来</color>， 你的<color_red>疼痛感</color>也会变得迟钝。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "wicked_quick_hands"
msgid "Wicked Quick Hands"
msgstr "邪恶快手"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Wicked Quick Hands"
msgid "Your hands move wicked quick!"
msgstr "你的手动得真快！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "terrible_strength"
msgid "Terrible Strength"
msgstr "凶恶邪力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Terrible Strength"
msgid "You have a terrible strength!"
msgstr "你的力量太可怕了！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_evil_eye"
msgid "Evil Eye"
msgstr "邪恶之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Evil Eye"
msgid "Something is definitely wrong."
msgstr "Something is definitely wrong."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sylph_underground_timer"
msgid "Underground in Dead Air"
msgstr "死气沉沉的地下"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Underground in Dead Air"
msgid ""
"You were not born to crawl beneath the dirt like a mole.  You need to get out "
"to the open sky."
msgstr ""
"You were not born to crawl beneath the dirt like a mole.  You need to get out "
"to the open sky."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_broke_fae_ban"
msgid "Broken Ban"
msgstr "破碎的禁令"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Broken Ban"
msgid ""
"You've broken one of the ancient laws that bind the fae and are suffering "
"thereby."
msgstr "你违反了一条束缚精灵的古老法则并因此而受苦。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Touching Iron"
msgid ""
"You are in contact with iron, the ancient bane of the fae.  It will cause you "
"pain and discomfort until removed."
msgstr "你接触了铁，妖精的古老禁忌。这会导致你疼痛且不适直到你将它取下。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Touching Steel"
msgid ""
"You are in contact with steel, the closest material to iron, the ancient bane "
"of the fae.  It will cause you pain and discomfort until removed."
msgstr ""
"You are in contact with steel, the closest material to iron, the ancient bane "
"of the fae.  It will cause you pain and discomfort until removed."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Touching Steel"
msgid "As the steel touches you, your skin begins to burn."
msgstr "As the steel touches you, your skin begins to burn."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Touching Steel"
msgid "The burning from the steel finally fades."
msgstr "The burning from the steel finally fades."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Touching Iron"
msgid "As the iron touches you, your skin begins to itch fiercely."
msgstr "As the iron touches you, your skin begins to itch fiercely."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Touching Iron"
msgid "The itch from the iron finally fades."
msgstr "The itch from the iron finally fades."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "natures_commune"
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_commune_with_nature"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Commune with Nature"
msgstr "与自然交流"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Commune with Nature"
msgid ""
"You are in tune with the natural world, drawing strength from it and calming "
"natural animals."
msgstr "你与自然世界融为一体，从中汲取力量并安抚自然动物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Commune with Nature"
msgid "You can feel the lifeblood of nature all around, welcoming you as kin."
msgstr "你可以感受到周围大自然的生命，像亲人一样欢迎你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Commune with Nature"
msgid "Your communion with nature fades."
msgstr "你与自然的交流逐渐消失。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_hungry_roots"
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_roots_spell"
#. ~ The name is a reference to the poem "Goblin Market" by Christina
#. Rossetti.
msgid "Hungry Thirsty Roots"
msgstr "饥渴的根"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hungry Thirsty Roots"
msgid "Roots and vines clutch at you."
msgstr "树根和藤蔓紧紧抓住你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Hungry Thirsty Roots"
msgid "Roots and vines entangle you!"
msgstr "根和藤纠缠着你!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "arvore_verdant_infusion"
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_verdant_infusion"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Verdant Infusion"
msgstr "绿意盎然"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Verdant Infusion"
msgid "You are filled with the vitality of nature."
msgstr "你充满了大自然的活力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Verdant Infusion"
msgid "You can feel the power of nature flowing through you."
msgstr "你可以感受到自然的力量在你身上流动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Verdant Infusion"
msgid "The power of nature fades from you."
msgstr "自然的力量从你身上消失。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_arvore_seedbearer_available"
msgid "Seed-Bearer"
msgstr "Seed-Bearer"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Seed-Bearer"
msgid "You can bring forth a fine bunch of seeds, ready for planting."
msgstr "You can bring forth a fine bunch of seeds, ready for planting."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "arvore_perennial_rebirth_cooldown"
msgid "Reborn"
msgstr "重生"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Reborn"
msgid "You were reborn and your soul and new body are still finding their balance."
msgstr "你重生了，你的灵魂和新身体仍在寻找平衡。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_arvore_poison_pollen"
msgid "Night-Blooming Flower"
msgstr "夜半绽放之花"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Night-Blooming Flower"
msgid "You are emitting a pollen that will weaken and disorient your enemies."
msgstr "你播撒着花粉，它会削弱并迷惑你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_pollen_arvore_weaken"
msgid "Weakening Pollen"
msgstr "削弱的花粉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_arvore_attacked_a_triffid"
msgid "Broken Green Pact "
msgstr "破碎的绿之约"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Broken Green Pact "
msgid ""
"You broke the pact of the green and have no more protection from the "
"triffids' wrath."
msgstr "你违背了绿之约，从此再无庇护，要直面三尖树的愤怒了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_ierde_slow_enemies"
msgid "Lithic Rigidity "
msgstr "岩之僵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Lithic Rigidity "
msgid "It's very hard for you to move."
msgstr "你很难移动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Lithic Rigidity "
msgid "It's easier for you to move again."
msgstr "现在你再动起来就容易多了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_ierde_rooted_in_place"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Root of the Mountain"
msgstr "The Root of the Mountain"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "The Root of the Mountain"
msgid ""
"Drawing on the immobility of the mountain, you are resilient but rooted in "
"place."
msgstr ""
"Drawing on the immobility of the mountain, you are resilient but rooted in "
"place."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_ierde_buff_armor_allies"
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_buff_armor_allies_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Skin of the Mountains"
msgstr "山之肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Skin of the Mountains"
msgid "Your skin is much harder than it appears."
msgstr "你的皮肤比看起来坚硬得多。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Skin of the Mountains"
msgid "The magicks reinforcing your skin vanish."
msgstr "重塑你皮肤的魔力消失了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_ierde_earthen_shield"
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_earthen_shield_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Impenetrable Earthen Shield"
msgstr "Impenetrable Earthen Shield"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Impenetrable Earthen Shield"
msgid "You are protected by the living earth."
msgstr "You are protected by the living earth."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Impenetrable Earthen Shield"
msgid "Your earthen shield finally crumbles."
msgstr "Your earthen shield finally crumbles."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_ierde_sense_nearby_monsters"
msgid "Earth-Sensing"
msgstr "大地感知"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Earth-Sensing"
msgid "You are sensing the movements of nearby creatures upon the living earth."
msgstr "你正在感知附近生物在地面上的活动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Earth-Sensing"
msgid "Nearby creatures' movements are revealed to you."
msgstr "Nearby creatures' movements are revealed to you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Earth-Sensing"
msgid "Your earth-sense fades away."
msgstr "Your earth-sense fades away."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_homullus_reduced_visibility_ally"
msgid "Average Joe"
msgstr "普通人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Average Joe"
msgid "You're just this guy, you know?"
msgstr "你知道的吧？你就是那个人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Average Joe"
msgid "Nearby enemies twitch and start turning towards you."
msgstr "你身边的敌人吃了一惊，转向了你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_homullus_add_learning_focus"
msgid "Scholar's Regard"
msgstr "学者之见"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Scholar's Regard"
msgid "It's time for a study session"
msgstr "研讨会时间"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Scholar's Regard"
msgid "You were just on the cusp of something as your enhanced focus fades."
msgstr "你正刚登上思考的顶峰，你超人的专注力便恢复如初。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_homullus_prevented_death"
msgid "Transferred Essence"
msgstr "Transferred Essence"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Transferred Essence"
msgid ""
"You have transferred your essence into a human, saving yourself at the "
"expense of their being.  It will take some time until you can do this again."
msgstr ""
"You have transferred your essence into a human, saving yourself at the "
"expense of their being.  It will take some time until you can do this again."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_salamander_levitation"
msgid "Smoke-Walking"
msgstr "烟雾行者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Smoke-Walking"
msgid "You are walking through the air."
msgstr "你行走于空中。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_salamander_fire_dot"
msgid "Fire in the Marrow"
msgstr "骨髓之火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Fire in the Marrow"
msgid "Your burning internal organs are making it more difficult to aim."
msgstr "你燃烧的内脏使得它变得更加难以被瞄准。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Burning"
msgid "Your impurities are being seared away!"
msgstr "你身上不纯之物正被灼烧！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_salamander_berserk_stance"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wildfire Soul"
msgstr "野火之魂"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Wildfire Soul"
msgid "You are filled with transcendent flame."
msgstr "超凡的火焰充满了你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Wildfire Soul"
msgid "All of your weakness boils away in the heat of the flames!"
msgstr "你所有的虚弱随着火焰的热量升腾而去！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Wildfire Soul"
msgid "As the heat leaves you, pain rushes in to take its place."
msgstr "随着热量消散，疼痛再一次袭来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_salamander_increase_speed"
msgid "Inner Spark"
msgstr "内在活力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Inner Spark"
msgid "Your speed is magically increased."
msgstr "你的速度神奇的增加了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Inner Spark"
msgid "You are filled with burning vigor."
msgstr "燃烧的活力充满了你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Inner Spark"
msgid "Your movements gradually slow."
msgstr "你的动作逐渐变慢。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_salamander_emit_heat"
msgid "Burning Furnace"
msgstr "燃炉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Burning Furnace"
msgid "You are throwing off a large amount of heat."
msgstr "你散发着大量的热。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Burning Furnace"
msgid "The air around you heats up."
msgstr "你身边的空气被烧热了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Burning Furnace"
msgid "The air around you cools down."
msgstr "你身边的空气不再那么灼热。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_salamander_prevented_death"
msgid "Arisen"
msgstr "复苏"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Arisen"
msgid "Like the phoenix, you have been reborn."
msgstr "就像不死鸟那样，你浴火重生。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_salamander_phoenix_healing"
msgid "Phoenix's Rejuvenation"
msgstr "不死鸟再生"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Phoenix's Rejuvenation"
msgid "Like the phoenix, the flames are renewing your flesh."
msgstr "火焰重塑你的肉身，你如一只不死鸟。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Phoenix's Rejuvenation"
msgid "The aftereffects of the phoenix fire finally fade."
msgstr "不死鸟咒的副作用终于消散了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lucid_dream"
msgid "Lucid Dreaming"
msgstr "清醒梦"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Lucid Dreaming"
msgid "While you may just be dreaming, you are still capable of affecting the world."
msgstr "你可能身在梦中，但仍可影响现实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_salamander_smoke_form"
msgid "Smoke Form"
msgstr "烟雾形态"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Smoke Form"
msgid "You have transformed yourself into a cloud of smoke."
msgstr "你变换身姿，化为一团烟雾。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Smoke Form"
msgid "Your body falls apart into billowing smoke!"
msgstr "你的身体四散，化为滚滚浓烟！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Smoke Form"
msgid "You reconstruct yourself from the smoke."
msgstr "你由烟雾转回正常形态。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sylph_levitation"
msgid "Wind-Walking"
msgstr "御风者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Wind-Walking"
msgid "You are walking on the winds."
msgstr "你御风而行。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sylph_bonus_melee_range"
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_bonus_melee_range_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breeze-Cutting Blows"
msgstr "Breeze-Cutting Blows"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Breeze-Cutting Blows"
msgid "Your strikes cut the air and carry on to your foes."
msgstr "Your strikes cut the air and carry on to your foes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Breeze-Cutting Blows"
msgid "Your blows no longer split the air itself."
msgstr "Your blows no longer split the air itself."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sylph_hindering_wind"
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_hindering_wind_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Hindering Winds"
msgstr "阻挡之风"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hindering Winds"
msgid "The winds are swirling around you and slowing you down!"
msgstr "风在你的四周盘旋，使你减速！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Hindering Winds"
msgid "A wind swirls up around you, slowing you."
msgstr "风在你的四周盘旋，使你减速。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sylph_increase_ally_speed"
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_increase_ally_speed_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Favonian Murmuration"
msgstr "西风聚"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Favonian Murmuration"
msgid "You steps are buoyed up by the winds."
msgstr "You steps are buoyed up by the winds."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Favonian Murmuration"
msgid "The winds around you die down."
msgstr "你身边的风停息了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sylph_cloud_body"
msgid "Body of Clouds"
msgstr "云雾之身"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Body of Clouds"
msgid "You are mist and cloud and wind."
msgstr "你是云，是雾，是风。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Body of Clouds"
msgid "Your body regains its solidity."
msgstr "你的身体又一次回归固态。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_undine_escape_grabs"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Flow Like Water"
msgstr "像水一样流动"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Flow Like Water"
msgid "Your movements are inhumanly fluid."
msgstr "你的动作超乎人类，犹如流体。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_undine_acid_resist_ally"
#. ~ Name of spell "undine_acid_resist_ally_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Caustic Cloak"
msgstr "Caustic Cloak"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Caustic Cloak"
msgid "You are surrounded by a thin shell of acidic mist."
msgstr "You are surrounded by a thin shell of acidic mist."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Caustic Cloak"
msgid "The acidic mist around you dissipates."
msgstr "The acidic mist around you dissipates."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_undine_spell_slow"
msgid "Slowed by the Current"
msgstr "Slowed by the Current"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Slowed by the Current"
msgid "Currents of aetherial water are hindering your movements."
msgstr "Currents of aetherial water are hindering your movements."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Slowed by the Current"
msgid "You feel like you're wading through a rushing river!"
msgstr "You feel like you're wading through a rushing river!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Slowed by the Current"
msgid "The drag on your movements is gone."
msgstr "The drag on your movements is gone."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_paraclesian_dodge_bonus_1"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_paraclesian_dodge_bonus_2"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_paraclesian_dodge_bonus_3"
msgid "Enhanced Dodging"
msgstr "强化躲避"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Enhanced Dodging"
msgid ""
"Like the whistling wind or the supple willow, you can easily move when danger "
"beckons.  The spell has greatly reduced effect if not outside (if Sylph) or "
"not on natural terrain (if Arvore)."
msgstr ""
"Like the whistling wind or the supple willow, you can easily move when danger "
"beckons.  The spell has greatly reduced effect if not outside (if Sylph) or "
"not on natural terrain (if Arvore)."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Enhanced Dodging"
msgid "Your enhanced dodging ability fades away."
msgstr "你的强化躲避效果褪去。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_paraclesian_see_fae"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wyrd Sight"
msgstr "Wyrd Sight"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Wyrd Sight"
msgid "You can sense nearby creatures that come from under the hill."
msgstr "You can sense nearby creatures that come from under the hill."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "fae_sense"
msgid "You sense fae here."
msgstr "You sense fae here."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sense_vampire"
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_sense_vampires"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sense the Night Hunters"
msgstr "Sense the Night Hunters"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Sense the Night Hunters"
msgid "You can sense nearby vampires."
msgstr "You can sense nearby vampires."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "vamnpire_sense"
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "vampire_sense"
msgid "You detect a vampire here."
msgstr "You detect a vampire here."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_hedge_nether_eye_paste"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Blood-and-Ash Paste"
msgid_plural "Blood-and-Ash Paste"
msgstr[0] "Blood-and-Ash Paste"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Blood-and-Ash Paste"
msgid ""
"You rubbed the paste of blood and herbs and ashes on your eyes.  It stings.  "
"A lot."
msgstr ""
