"With a popping sound several of your teeth fall out but when you put a finger "
"into your mouth to feel the hole, there are new sharp fangs where you "
"expected nothing."
msgstr ""
"With a popping sound several of your teeth fall out but when you put a finger "
"into your mouth to feel the hole, there are new sharp fangs where you "
"expected nothing."

