"Your hunger for blood submerges you for a moment, as the blood of the "
"Anathema combines with your own.  Vampires, mortals, what's the difference?  "
"You'll drink them all dry anyway."
msgstr ""
"Your hunger for blood submerges you for a moment, as the blood of the "
"Anathema combines with your own.  Vampires, mortals, what's the difference?  "
"You'll drink them all dry anyway."

