#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONSUMED_BLOOD_ANATHEMA"
msgid ""
"The blood's power tries to take hold, but another sinister power prevents it "
"from doing so!"
msgstr ""
"The blood's power tries to take hold, but another sinister power prevents it "
"from doing so!"

