#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eoc_strange_events.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SLEEPING_SEIZED_BY_LILIT_WARNING"
msgid ""
"The night was a little rough.  You tossed and turned, aware of every single "
"noise and creak of wood in a way you never were before all of this happened, "
"before you finally fell asleep.  You weren't attacked and woke up without "
"trouble, but you have to wonder if it's really safe, sleeping alone like this "
"in an abandoned building?"
msgstr ""
"昨晚有些难熬。每一丝声响都在折磨着你，令你辗转反侧，而在这一切发生前，你从未有过这种感觉——最终你还是睡着了。虽然你没遭到袭击，醒来时也安然无恙，但你不禁怀"
"疑：独自睡在废弃建筑里，真的安全吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_EATER_DREAMER_COUNTER"
msgid ""
"In your dream, you stand at the edge of two worlds, a bad feeling overcoming "
"you."
msgstr "梦中，你站在两个世界的交界，心中充满不妙的感觉。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_EATER_DREAMER_COUNTER"
