"neverending gales and scorching heat."
msgstr "一个密度无限的世界，缩成一个奇异的点，伴随着永无休止的飓风和热浪。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_EATER_DREAMER_COUNTER"
