msgid_plural "Imbuement of Parchment"
msgstr[0] "附魔：羊皮卷"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Description of "Imbuement of Parchment"
msgid ""
"While looking in a mirror, Faewild and Dreamdross are ground to dust.  That "
"dust is mixed with parts taken from the Fair Folk and united with a dollop of "
"fae, and human blood.  The resulting mixture will eventually dissolve into "
"what almost looks like liquid porcelain."
msgstr ""
"在看着镜子的时候，狂妖尘和浮梦残渣被研磨成粉末。那些粉末与从精灵族身上取下的部分混合在一起，再加入一团精灵和人类的血液。最终，混合后的物质会逐渐溶解成几乎类"
"似液态瓷器的东西。"

