msgid ""
"You reference your map with your location, determining the path to take to "
"find the cryptid."
msgstr ""
"You reference your map with your location, determining the path to take to "
"find the cryptid."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "notes about the cryptid"
msgid_plural "notes about the cryptids"
msgstr[0] "notes about the cryptids"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "notes about the cryptid"
msgid ""
"The notes you have taken about the cryptid you're hunting.\n"
"Also known as the mongolian death worm, the Olgoi-khorkhoi is a massive "
"acid-spewing burrowing worm.  Finding acid-resistant gear will prove useful "
"to survive the encounter.  According to most of the credible stories you've "
"read, the lethal poison covering its skin is nothing but exaggerations."
msgstr ""
"The notes you have taken about the cryptid you're hunting.\n"
"Also known as the mongolian death worm, the Olgoi-khorkhoi is a massive "
"acid-spewing burrowing worm.  Finding acid-resistant gear will prove useful "
"to survive the encounter.  According to most of the credible stories you've "
"read, the lethal poison covering its skin is nothing but exaggerations."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "notes about the cryptid"
msgid ""
"The notes you have taken about the cryptid you're hunting.\n"
"The man of the Nineteenth Hour is peaceful for most of the day but becomes "
"incredibly violent against those who are still awake when he enters his "
"active phase.  Some stories tell that his presence shields those who are "
"sleeping against everything that could disturb their sleep."
msgstr ""
"The notes you have taken about the cryptid you're hunting.\n"
"The man of the Nineteenth Hour is peaceful for most of the day but becomes "
"incredibly violent against those who are still awake when he enters his "
"active phase.  Some stories tell that his presence shields those who are "
"sleeping against everything that could disturb their sleep."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "old leather-bound journal"
msgid_plural "old leather-bound journal"
msgstr[0] "吸血鬼皮面笔记本"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "old leather-bound journal"
msgid ""
"This handwritten book contains the detailed yet disorganized notes of a "
"vampire who found how to consume other vampires for power.  Reading it might "
"tell you how to do it, if it is what you want."
msgstr ""
"This handwritten book contains the detailed yet disorganized notes of a "
"vampire who found how to consume other vampires for power.  Reading it might "
"tell you how to do it, if it is what you want."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Report: LAUGHING DANCER metallurgy"
msgid_plural "copies of Report: LAUGHING DANCER metallurgy"
msgstr[0] "copies of Report: LAUGHING DANCER metallurgy"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/book_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "Report: LAUGHING DANCER metallurgy"
msgid ""
"A series of documents discussing the properties of the armor and weapons used "
"by a group or organization only referred to as \"LAUGHING DANCER\".  Some of "
"these described specifications don't seem physically possible."
msgstr ""
"A series of documents discussing the properties of the armor and weapons used "
"by a group or organization only referred to as \"LAUGHING DANCER\".  Some of "
"these described specifications don't seem physically possible."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Esoteric Investigations Weekly"
msgid_plural "issues of Esoteric Investigations Weekly"
msgstr[0] "《奧秘調查周刊》"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Description of "Esoteric Investigations Weekly"
msgid ""
"A magazine for occult investigators.  These types of magazines proliferated "
"in the decade prior to the Cataclysm."
msgstr "以神秘學研究者為讀者群的雜誌。這類型的雜誌在大災變之前的十年間激增。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Noon"
msgid_plural "issues of The Noon"
msgstr[0] "issues of The Noon"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Description of "The Noon"
msgid ""
"A tabloid paper with a rather unusually out-of-this-world articles even for "
"tabloids' standard, ranging from something like an article about morticians "
"selling the deceased's 'dreams' to the government to a sensational headline "
"about a half-bat half-human boy causing 40-car pileup in the highway while "
"driving away from police pursuit.  While most thought of The Noon as an "
"amusing but otherwise mostly fake news paper in the past, the Cataclysm might "
"bring the articles' presumably fake facts to light."
msgstr ""
"A tabloid paper with a rather unusually out-of-this-world articles even for "
"tabloids' standard, ranging from something like an article about morticians "
"selling the deceased's 'dreams' to the government to a sensational headline "
"about a half-bat half-human boy causing 40-car pileup in the highway while "
"driving away from police pursuit.  While most thought of The Noon as an "
"amusing but otherwise mostly fake news paper in the past, the Cataclysm might "
"bring the articles' presumably fake facts to light."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Holmesian Guide to Magickal Practice"
msgid_plural "copies of The Holmesian Guide to Magickal Practice"
msgstr[0] "福尔摩斯魔法实践指南"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Description of "The Holmesian Guide to Magickal Practice"
msgid ""
"It's big and heavy, but full of great information about esoteric "
"investigations."
msgstr "一本又大又重的书，但是记载着大量深奥的调查知识。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scraggy-Boo and the Mystery Crew"
msgid_plural "copies of Scraggy-Boo and the Mystery Crew"
msgstr[0] "斯拉格布和神秘成员"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Description of "Scraggy-Boo and the Mystery Crew"
msgid ""
"A guide for teens interested in pursuing occult knowledge.  Readers often "
"speak of encountering a guide in their dreams of a Russian Sheepdog, who "
"introduces himself as Scraggy-Boo."
msgstr "一本面向对神秘学知识感兴趣的青少年的指南。读者们经常说他们会在梦中受到一位俄罗斯牧羊犬的引导，他自称斯格拉布。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Escaping the Black Iron Prison"
msgid_plural "copies of Escaping the Black Iron Prison"
msgstr[0] "逃离黑铁监狱"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Description of "Escaping the Black Iron Prison"
msgid ""
"A hardbound book detailing numerous rituals and thought modifications in "
"order to teach its readers how to break the shackles of mundanity."
msgstr "一本精装书，详细介绍了许多仪式和控制思维的方法，以教导读者如何打破世俗的束缚。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Out-of-place manuscript"
msgid_plural "Out-of-place manuscript"
msgstr[0] "Out-of-place manuscript"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Description of "Out-of-place manuscript"
msgid ""
"This book always feels like it shouldn't be where it is.  Its texts are "
"incoherent and illogical, but they promise to help you understand something.  "
"Reading a few words from its pages is enough to give you a headache."
msgstr ""
"This book always feels like it shouldn't be where it is.  Its texts are "
"incoherent and illogical, but they promise to help you understand something.  "
"Reading a few words from its pages is enough to give you a headache."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Lies"
msgid_plural "copies of Lies"
msgstr[0] "copies of Lies"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Description of "Lies"
msgid ""
"A haphazardly-written book filled with ramblings about something it calls "
"\"the Lies\".  You feel threatened by this book, uneasy at the thought of "
"having it on your person, but parsing its texts could give you insight on how "
"things truly are.\n"
"Only the first third of the pages are filled with text, and the last written "
"page is splattered in red."
msgstr ""
"A haphazardly-written book filled with ramblings about something it calls "
"\"the Lies\".  You feel threatened by this book, uneasy at the thought of "
"having it on your person, but parsing its texts could give you insight on how "
"things truly are.\n"
"Only the first third of the pages are filled with text, and the last written "
"page is splattered in red."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_READ_BOOK_LIES"
msgid "Fortunately, you lack the deductive abilities to understand this book."
msgstr "Fortunately, you lack the deductive abilities to understand this book."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_READ_BOOK_LIES_REAL"
msgid "You begin your read, for better or worse."
msgstr "You begin your read, for better or worse."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_READ_BOOK_LIES_REAL"
msgid "Rejoice, for you have no reason to read this book anymore."
msgstr "Rejoice, for you have no reason to read this book anymore."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DEDUCTION_FROM_BOOK_LIES"
msgid ""
"You gained almost no knowledge from this session.  Maybe if you read more, "
"you will gain more."
msgstr ""
"You gained almost no knowledge from this session.  Maybe if you read more, "
"you will gain more."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DEDUCTION_FROM_BOOK_LIES"
msgid "You gained a decent amount of knowledge from this read."
msgstr "You gained a decent amount of knowledge from this read."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/books_deduction.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DEDUCTION_FROM_BOOK_LIES"
msgid ""
"You bear the marks inflicted by beings that do not want you to know this "
"much.  Not moderating your use of this book will have consequences, but what "
"you are gaining from it might be worth the cost."
msgstr ""
"You bear the marks inflicted by beings that do not want you to know this "
"much.  Not moderating your use of this book will have consequences, but what "
"you are gaining from it might be worth the cost."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nether organs"
msgid_plural "nether organs"
msgstr[0] "地獄器官"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "nether organs"
msgid "These organs came from a beast from the nether."
msgstr "從地獄野獸中切下來的奇怪器官。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw shimmer pelt"
msgid_plural "raw shimmer pelt"
msgstr[0] "生闪光毛皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw shimmer pelt"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing animal from a "
"specific region of the Nether.  It still has the fur attached.  You can cure "
"it for storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr "一块从有毛皮的异界怪物身上仔细地削下来的生皮。还连着毛。你可以加工它来存储并进一步的鞣制，或者直接吃掉它，如果你的肚子里真的是一根毛都没有了的话。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of fae meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of fae meat"
msgstr[0] "妖精肉塊"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of fae meat"
msgid ""
"Freshly butchered meat from a fae beast.  You could eat it raw, but cooking "
"it is better."
msgstr "屠宰妖精怪物得到的肉，可以直接食用，但烹饪加工后更美味并且更加安全。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap of fae meat"
msgid_plural "scraps of fae meat"
msgstr[0] "妖精肉渣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap of fae meat"
msgid ""
"This is a tiny scrap of edible meat from a fae beast.  It's not much, but "
"it'll do in a pinch."
msgstr "一小块尚可食用的妖精碎肉。虽然量不多，但是应急用也足够了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "fae blood"
msgid "Blood, from a specific part of the Nether.  Disgusting!"
msgstr "從地獄生物上取來的血。真噁心！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked meat"
msgid ""
"This is a chunk of freshly cooked fae meat.  It's filling and nutritious, but "
"unseasoned and a bit bland."
msgstr "一块经过简单烹饪的妖精肉。能够填饱肚子，营养也还丰富，但没有调过味，吃上去有点枯燥乏味。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked scrap of fae meat"
msgid_plural "cooked scraps of fae meat"
msgstr[0] "煮熟的妖精肉渣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "smoked meat" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. fae
msgid "smoked fae"
msgid_plural "smoked fae"
msgstr[0] "熏妖精肉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "omnivore stomach"
msgid_plural "omnivore stomachs"
msgstr[0] "omnivore stomachs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "omnivore stomach"
msgid "The stomach of an omnivorous creature.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "The stomach of an omnivorous creature.  It is surprisingly durable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ruminant stomach"
msgid_plural "ruminant stomachs"
msgstr[0] "ruminant stomachs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "ruminant stomach"
msgid "The four stomachs of a grazing creature.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "The four stomachs of a grazing creature.  It is surprisingly durable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "herbivore stomach"
msgid_plural "herbivore stomachs"
msgstr[0] "herbivore stomachs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "herbivore stomach"
msgid "The stomach of a herbivore.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "The stomach of a herbivore.  It is surprisingly durable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "carnivore stomach"
msgid_plural "carnivore stomachs"
msgstr[0] "carnivore stomachs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "carnivore stomach"
msgid "The stomach of an carnivorous creature.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "The stomach of an carnivorous creature.  It is surprisingly durable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small carnivore stomach"
msgid_plural "small carnivore stomachs"
msgstr[0] "small carnivore stomachs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "small carnivore stomach"
msgid "The stomach of a small carnivorous creature.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "The stomach of a small carnivorous creature.  It is surprisingly durable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small omnivore stomach"
msgid_plural "small omnivore stomachs"
msgstr[0] "small omnivore stomachs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "small omnivore stomach"
msgid "The stomach of a small omnivorous creature.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "The stomach of a small omnivorous creature.  It is surprisingly durable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small herbivore stomach"
msgid_plural "small herbivore stomachs"
msgstr[0] "small herbivore stomachs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "small herbivore stomach"
msgid "The stomach of a small herbivore.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "The stomach of a small herbivore.  It is surprisingly durable."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ant stomach"
msgid_plural "ant stomachs"
msgstr[0] "ant stomachs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "ant stomach"
msgid ""
"The two stomachs of a giant ant.  One stomach is for digestion and one "
"stomach is for storing food for the colony."
msgstr ""
"The two stomachs of a giant ant.  One stomach is for digestion and one "
"stomach is for storing food for the colony."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vampire blood"
msgid_plural "vampire blood"
msgstr[0] "吸血鬼血液"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "vampire blood"
msgid ""
"Blood extracted from a vampire.  Drinking it feels like a bad idea but there "
"might be other ways to use it."
msgstr "从吸血鬼身上提取的血液。喝下它似乎不是个好主意，但可能也有其他方式能够利用它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/casing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "9x21mm casing"
msgid_plural "9x21mm casings"
msgstr[0] "9x21mm 弹壳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/casing.json
#. ~ Description of "9x21mm casing"
msgid "An empty casing from a 9x21mm round."
msgstr "9x21mm 子弹的空弹壳。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Flesh roots seed"
msgid_plural "Flesh roots seeds"
msgstr[0] "鲜肉种"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Flesh roots seed"
msgid ""
"This seed might be more accurately compared to a bulb, because like a bulb "
"you dug it out of the home it had made and chopped off its extremities and "
"are now preparing to plant it in a new location; only, in this instance the "
"hole was dug into the chest of a dead vampire minion and the new location is "
"nestled against the still-beating heart of a patient."
msgstr ""
"这颗种子更像是一个鳞茎，因为就像鳞茎一样，你挖出它原本存在的位置，并切去了末端的部分，现在正准备把它种在一个新的地方；只不过，在这种情况下，你是在一个死亡的"
"吸血鬼手下的胸部挖了个洞，并将它种在了一个仍在跳动的病人心脏旁。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Vampire Blood Fuel Cell Generator"
msgid_plural "Vampire Blood Fuel Cell Generators"
msgstr[0] "吸血鬼血液燃料电池CBM"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Vampire Blood Fuel Cell Generator"
msgid ""
"What reason could anyone have making a bionic power generator that runs off "
"the blood of vampires?  After some thought, one option that occurs to you "
"would be the possibility that by limiting the fuel options, a vampire is also "
"limiting the opportunities for a rogue minion to use its bionics against its "
"master."
msgstr "为什么会有人用吸血鬼的血来驱动燃料电池呢?经过一番思考，你想到了一种可能，即吸血鬼通过限制燃料来源，以此防止它们的仆从依靠CBM来反抗主人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Chiropteran Signal CBM"
msgid_plural "Chiropteran Signal CBMs"
msgstr[0] "翼手目訊號 CBM"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Chiropteran Signal CBM"
msgid ""
"A jar-like container that includes a set of vocal cords with a large hood at "
"the top of them and rootlike tendrils at the base connecting to a microchip."
msgstr "一个类似罐子的容器，内含一组带有大罩子的声带，顶部有根状的藤蔓与连接到微芯片的基部。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a bionic
msgid "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizer"
msgid_plural "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizers"
msgstr[0] "巨型嗜血蝙蝠音频装置"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizer"
msgid ""
"A jar-like container that includes a set of oversized and reinforced vocal "
"cords with a large hood at the top of them and rootlike tendrils at the base "
"connecting to a microchip."
msgstr "一个类似罐子的容器，内部装有一组超大号和加固的声带，顶部有一个大罩子，底部连接着类似根状的触须，与一个微芯片相连。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Crypt Spore Vaporizer"
msgid_plural "Crypt Spore Vaporizers"
msgstr[0] "地穴孢子气化物"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Crypt Spore Vaporizer"
msgid ""
"A syringe that extends out into two tubes that snake up through the nostrils "
"and down to the lungs in order to get the spores deep into their new home, "
"where they can best spread through the body."
msgstr "一种注射器，伸出两根管子，蜿蜒穿过鼻孔，延伸至肺部，以便将孢子深入它们的新家，从而最好地在体内传播。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid_plural "slightly off t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "稍微不对劲T恤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton tee featuring a uniquely odd design that sets it apart "
"from any you've seen before."
msgstr ""
"A short-sleeved cotton tee featuring a uniquely odd design that sets it apart "
"from any you've seen before."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid "Seven Faceless Voids for Seven Brothers t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Seven Faceless Voids for Seven Brothers t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "七侠三雄T恤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Seven Faceless Voids for Seven Brothers t-shirt"
#. of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid ""
"A pink t-shirt with seven ominous figures in bridal wear facing towards seven "
"identical men.  There are tears running down from the eyes of the men."
msgstr "一件粉色T恤，上面有七个身穿婚纱的不祥人物，面向七个一模一样的男人。男人们的眼睛里流下了泪水。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid "Sawzall the Musical t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Sawzall the Musical t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "音乐剧《索扎尔》T恤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Sawzall the Musical t-shirt" of item "slightly
#. off t-shirt"
msgid ""
"A shirt that says Sawzall the Musical in bold letters, over a giant Sawzall "
"tool."
msgstr "一件衬衫，上面用粗体字母写着Sawzall the Musical，上面有一个巨大的往复锯图标。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid "go t-shirt"
msgid_plural "go t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（围棋）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of variant "go t-shirt" of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid ""
"This t-shirt displays a picture of a man standing behind a go table, the text "
"is using an unfamiliar alphabet.  His features seem subtly off."
msgstr "这件T恤展示了一张照片，照片上一名男子站在一张围棋桌后面，里面的文字来自一个陌生的字母表。他的五官似乎有点不对劲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid "Tachli t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Tachli t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "Tachli T恤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Tachli t-shirt" of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the logo of a Tachli team printed on its "
"front and back.  It looks like it might be a violent sport."
msgstr "棉一件正面和背面印有Tachli团队标志的短袖棉质衬衫。看起来这可能是一项激烈的运动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid "rollerball t-shirt"
msgid_plural "rollerball t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "滚球T恤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of variant "rollerball t-shirt" of item "slightly off
#. t-shirt"
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the logo of a rollerball team, whatever "
"that is, printed on its front and back."
msgstr "一件印有滚球队标志的短袖棉质衬衫，无论是什么，正面和背面都印着。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid "sunnyvale t-shirt"
msgid_plural "sunnyvale t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "桑尼维尔T恤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of variant "sunnyvale t-shirt" of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid ""
"This t-shirt displays a purple sun rising over a town that looks like it came "
"out of a Doctor Seuss book."
msgstr "这件T恤展示了一个小镇上升起的紫色太阳，看起来就像是出自苏斯博士的书中。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid "CSA t-shirt"
msgid_plural "CSA t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（CSA）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of variant "CSA t-shirt" of item "slightly off t-shirt"
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a globe at the bottom with a C above the "
"globe with an S to the left and A to the right.  The background is like a "
"flag with the top left being the corner of a black triangle and the bottom "
"right is a red triangle.  They meet in the middle with the globe."
msgstr ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a globe at the bottom with a C above the "
"globe with an S to the left and A to the right.  The background is like a "
"flag with the top left being the corner of a black triangle and the bottom "
"right is a red triangle.  They meet in the middle with the globe."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer tunic"
msgid_plural "gossamer tunics"
msgstr[0] "月之纱束腰外衣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer tunic"
msgid ""
"A simple garment made of gossamer.  It's very light, and the fabric shimmers "
"in a rainbow of colors in the sunlight."
msgstr "一件由月之纱制成的简易衣物。它极其轻盈，在阳光下织物闪耀着彩虹般的绚丽色彩。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless gossamer tunic"
msgid_plural "sleeveless gossamer tunics"
msgstr[0] "月之纱无袖束腰外衣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless gossamer tunic"
msgid ""
"A simple, sleeveless garment made of gossamer.  It's very light, and the "
"fabric shimmers in a rainbow of colors in the sunlight."
msgstr "一件由月之纱制成的无袖设计的简易衣物。它极其轻盈，在阳光下织物闪耀着彩虹般的绚丽色彩。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer doublet"
msgid_plural "gossamer doublets"
msgstr[0] "月之纱短上衣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer doublet"
msgid ""
"A thick overshirt of gossamer, shimmering in a rainbow of colors.  This would "
"have made you the king of the Renn Faire."
msgstr "一件厚厚的月之纱套衫，闪烁着彩虹般的色彩。 这件衣服会让你成为雷恩狂欢节之王。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer dress"
msgid_plural "gossamer dresses"
msgstr[0] "月之纱连衣裙"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer dress"
msgid "A gossamer dress, shimmering in a mix of rainbow colors."
msgstr "一件月之纱的连衣裙，闪烁着混合彩虹色的微光。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer evening gown"
msgid_plural "gossamer evening gowns"
msgstr[0] "月之纱晚礼服"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer evening gown"
msgid "A full-length gossamer gown, like a waterfall of coruscating light."
msgstr "一袭月之纱长裙，宛如瀑布般璀璨夺目。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer cloak"
msgid_plural "gossamer cloaks"
msgstr[0] "月之纱披风"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer cloak"
msgid ""
"A gossamer cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  It looks like ripples of "
"multicolored light when worn."
msgstr "一件可以披在身上的月之纱斗篷。 披上后，就像荡漾着五颜六色的涟漪。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer jacket"
msgid_plural "gossamer jackets"
msgstr[0] "月之纱夹克"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer jacket"
msgid "A thin gossamer jacket.  Despite its lack of heft, its surprisingly warm."
msgstr "一件薄薄的月之纱夹克。 尽管没有厚重感，却出奇地保暖。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer robe"
msgid_plural "gossamer robes"
msgstr[0] "月之纱长袍"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer robe"
msgid ""
"A flowing gossamer robe, like a waterfall of light.  There are a surprising "
"amount of pockets cunningly hidden in the iridescent folds."
msgstr "一件流动的月之纱长袍，像一道瀑布般的光。彩虹色的褶皱中隐藏着数量惊人的口袋。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of gossamer gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of gossamer gloves"
msgstr[0] "月之纱手套"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of gossamer gloves"
msgid "A pair of gossamer gloves."
msgstr "月之纱手套"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer breechcloth"
msgid_plural "gossamer breechcloths"
msgstr[0] "月之纱短裤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer breechcloth"
msgid ""
"A gossamer covering for your loins, for when you want to feel like you're "
"wearing moonbeams."
msgstr "为你的腰部披上一层月之纱，让你感觉像披上了月光。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer trousers"
msgid_plural "gossamer trousers"
msgstr[0] "月之纱长裤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer trousers"
msgid "A pair of gossamer pants with two pockets.  They shimmer opalescently."
msgstr "一条有两个口袋的月之纱裤子。 闪烁着乳白色的光泽。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer hose"
msgid ""
"A pair of tight-fitting gossamer pants with no pockets.  They would have been "
"the absolute height of fashion five hundred years ago."
msgstr "一条没有口袋的月之纱紧身裤子。 五百年前，这绝对是时尚的顶峰。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer skirt"
msgid_plural "gossamer skirt"
msgstr[0] "月之纱短裙"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer skirt"
msgid "A loose gossamer skirt, like a waterfall of light."
msgstr "一条宽松的月之纱短裙，宛如瀑布般闪烁。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "long gossamer skirt"
msgid_plural "long gossamer skirts"
msgstr[0] "月之纱长裙"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "long gossamer skirt"
msgid ""
"A long gossamer skirt that shimmers like a woven rainbow.  It's warmer and "
"more fashionable than a shorter gossamer skirt."
msgstr "一条月之纱长裙，如锦似虹，闪闪发光。它比一条月之纱短裙更暖和、更时尚。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of gossamer socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of gossamer socks"
msgstr[0] "月之纱袜"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of gossamer socks"
msgid ""
"Gossamer socks.  Whether your shoes are made of leather or canvas or "
"moonlight or nightmares, they'll keep your feet from rubbing in them."
msgstr "月之纱的袜子。无论你的鞋子是皮革、帆布甚至是月光、噩梦啥的材质，它都能防止你的脚与鞋的摩擦。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of gossamer stockings"
msgid_plural "pairs of gossamer stockings"
msgstr[0] "月之纱长筒袜"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of gossamer stockings"
msgid "A pair of gossamer stockings that shimmer in a rainbow of muted colors."
msgstr "一双闪烁着彩虹般柔和色彩的丝袜。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of gossamer slippers"
msgid_plural "pairs of gossamer slippers"
msgstr[0] "月之纱拖鞋"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of gossamer slippers"
msgid ""
"Soft indoor shoes, suitable for wearing whie drinking liquid light from "
"goblets of unmelting ice and dancing the night away."
msgstr "柔质室内鞋，适合穿着它们时，自永不消融之冰所制高脚杯中啜饮流光，彻夜翩然起舞。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_VERDANT_CLOAK_MANA_CHECK"
msgid "verdant cloak"
msgid_plural "verdant cloaks"
msgstr[0] "verdant cloaks"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/clothes.json
#. ~ Description of "verdant cloak"
msgid ""
"A heavy cloak made of living leaves with long twigs and branches connecting "
"them, meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "由活树叶和长树枝连接而成的厚重斗篷，可以披在身上。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cold iron ingot"
msgid_plural "cold iron ingots"
msgstr[0] "寒铁锭"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Description of "cold iron ingot"
msgid "A five-liter ingot of solid cold iron."
msgstr "一块5升的寒铁锭。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cold iron arming sword"
msgid_plural "cold iron arming swords"
msgstr[0] "寒铁武装剑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Description of "cold iron arming sword"
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed.\n"
"\n"
"Made with cold iron and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks "
"you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一把经典的中世纪剑，大小正好可以单手使用。\n"
"\n"
"这把剑由寒铁制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cold iron battle axe"
msgid_plural "cold iron battle axes"
msgstr[0] "寒铁战斧"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Description of "cold iron battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge cold iron axe designed for early warfare.  Though intended for use as "
"a weapon, it can also be pressed into service as a rather clumsy woodcutting "
"tool."
msgstr "一把专为早期战争设计的寒铁巨斧。虽然只建议作为武器使用，但也可以勉强当作一把相当笨拙的伐木工具。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cold iron baselard"
msgid_plural "cold iron baselards"
msgstr[0] "寒铁短剑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/cold_iron.json
#. ~ Description of "cold iron baselard"
msgid ""
"A medieval dagger forged from cold iron.  It is not the sharpest tool in the "
"shed, but it is certainly one of the largest."
msgstr "寒铁锻造的中世纪短剑，不是最锋利的匕首，但肯定是最大的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/components.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged nail"
msgid_plural "dreamforged nails"
msgstr[0] "梦铸钉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/components.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged nail"
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of steel.  It can be used to construct various things with "
"a hammer.  Forged from dreamdross, which makes it much lighter.  They do "
"curse and scream at you in an eldritch tongue while you hammer them in and "
"sometimes refuse to be used in specific purposes."
msgstr ""
"A pin-shaped piece of steel.  It can be used to construct various things with "
"a hammer.  Forged from dreamdross, which makes it much lighter.  They do "
"curse and scream at you in an eldritch tongue while you hammer them in and "
"sometimes refuse to be used in specific purposes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "candy wrapper"
msgid_plural "candy wrappers"
msgstr[0] "糖果包裝紙"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "candy wrapper"
msgid ""
"\"Wyld Candy, our flavors span the possible\" is emblazoned proudly upon this "
"shiny colorful wrapper."
msgstr "\"怀尔德糖果，我们的口味跨越无穷可能。\"被自豪地印在这张闪亮多彩的包装纸上。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blood bank"
msgid_plural "blood banks"
msgstr[0] "血库"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "blood bank"
msgid ""
"A large moon tear canteen.  It radiates the cold of the grave and smells "
"strongly of blood.  Any blood stored inside is protected from spoilage by "
"some kind of fae enchantment."
msgstr "一个大号的月之泪水壶。它散发着阴森的气息和浓浓的血腥味。任何储存在里面的血液都受到某种奇异魔法的保护而免于变质。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blood camel"
msgid_plural "blood camels"
msgstr[0] "血骆驼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/containers.json
#. ~ Description of "blood camel"
msgid ""
"A slim and lightweight insulated moon tear bladder worn on the back or within "
"a hydration pouch in a backpack.  Perfect for the renfield on the go.  It has "
"a large pocket and a capped mouth for filling with blood, with a hose that "
"allows the wearer to drink hands-free.  Any blood stored inside is protected "
"from spoilage by some kind of fae enchantment."
msgstr ""
"一个纤薄轻巧的月之泪制成的水袋，可背在背上或背包的水袋位内。它有一个大口袋和一个用于填充血液的带盖嘴，带有一根软管，可以让佩戴者时解放双手。 "
"任何储存在里面的血液都受到某种魔法的保护而不会变质。\"很适合吸血鬼同学郊游时携带\""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken sniper bot"
msgid_plural "broken sniper bots"
msgstr[0] "狙击机器人（损坏）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "broken sniper bot"
msgid "A broken sniper bot.  Total scrap, but some stuff is still useful."
msgstr "一台坏掉的狙击机器人。完全是废品，但有些东西仍然有用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken shotgun bot"
msgid_plural "broken shotgun bots"
msgstr[0] "霰弹枪机器人（损坏）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "broken shotgun bot"
msgid "A broken shotgun bot.  Total scrap, but some stuff is still useful."
msgstr "一个坏掉的霰弹枪机器人。完全是废品，但有些东西仍然有用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken cutthroater"
msgid_plural "broken cutthroaters"
msgstr[0] "割喉者机械蜘蛛（损坏）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "broken cutthroater"
msgid "A broken cutthroater.  Total scrap, but some stuff is still useful."
msgstr "一台坏掉的割喉者机械蜘蛛。完全是废品，但有些东西仍然有用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "broken Exodii quadruped"
msgid ""
"A broken Exodii Jotunn walker.  Still looks incredibly intimidating despite "
"being permanently inoperative, due to the sheer size, mass, and protruding "
"weapons.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "一台损坏的流亡族巨人机器人。可能因为巨大的体积、质量和怪异武器的缘故，就算已经永久无法继续运作，依旧看起来可怕无比。可以拆解得到部件。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken dreamforged automaton"
msgid_plural "broken dreamforged automatons"
msgstr[0] "broken dreamforged automatons"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "broken dreamforged automaton"
msgid ""
"The automaton is now much more broken than it was before.  It resembles a "
"pile of random parts and its internals are fried beyond salvage but could be "
"gutted for materials."
msgstr ""
"The automaton is now much more broken than it was before.  It resembles a "
"pile of random parts and its internals are fried beyond salvage but could be "
"gutted for materials."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fae corpse"
msgid_plural "fae corpses"
msgstr[0] "妖精尸体"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "fae corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "fae corpse"
msgid ""
"The dead body of a changeling.  There are multiple bites across the body and "
"numerous scratches.  It looks like blood loss might have brought them down."
msgstr "一具换生灵的尸体。尸体上有多处遍布全身的咬伤和巨大的爪痕。看起来似乎是失血过多将它带进鬼门关的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "fae corpse"
msgid ""
"Extreme burns cover the body of this changeling.  In multiple locations the "
"charring goes all the way to the bone."
msgstr "剧烈的烧伤遍布了这具换生灵的尸体。在许多部位，炭化的伤口深入尸骨。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "fae corpse"
msgid ""
"Several ballistic wounds seem to have brought down this changeling.  It "
"probably happened elsewhere and they escaped to here."
msgstr "看起来几处枪伤将这只换生灵杀死了。这种事可能在别处发生过，而它们逃到了这里。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "fae corpse"
msgid ""
"This lifeless body is covered in a rime of frost, that seems resistant to the "
"prevailing weather."
msgstr "这具没有生命体征的尸体上布满了白霜，看起来这些白霜能耐受当下天气。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "fae corpse"
msgid ""
"This changeling seems to have gotten themselves impaled upon an unhealthy "
"number of large thorns.  What kind of plant could do this?"
msgstr "这个换生灵似乎被异常多的大型荆棘刺穿了。哪种植物能做到这种事？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "fae corpse"
msgid ""
"This changeling corpse has a belly wound that appears to be caused by a sword "
"and is also missing its hand."
msgstr "这具换生灵尸体的腹部上有一道刀剑造成的伤口，手也被砍了下来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/dreamsmith.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged bed of restful repose, folded for travel"
msgid_plural "dreamforged beds of restful repose, folded for travel"
msgstr[0] "dreamforged beds of restful repose, folded for travel"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/dreamsmith.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged bed of restful repose, folded for travel"
msgid "A large object folded up into a box for itself, the size of a keyboard."
msgstr "A large object folded up into a box for itself, the size of a keyboard."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "faewild dust"
msgid_plural "faewild dust"
msgstr[0] "狂妖尘"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "faewild dust"
msgid ""
"A shimmering silvery dust.  Narcotic with the street name of Faewild.  Causes "
"the user to see colors not normally visible to the naked human eye."
msgstr "一小撮闪闪发光的银色微尘。在街头被成为“狂妖”的毒品。让使用者能看到肉眼通常不可见的颜色。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "faewild dust"
msgid "You rub the glittering dust into your gums."
msgstr "你把闪闪发光的微尘擦到牙龈上。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lotus blossom"
msgid_plural "lotus blossoms"
msgstr[0] "莲花"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "lotus blossom"
msgid ""
"A drug that became popular over the last few years before the Cataclysm.  It "
"appears to be exactly as its street name, a dark purple lotus blossom.  It's "
"known to be a strong painkiller while also causing vivid hallucinations."
msgstr "一种在大灾变前几年里流行起来的药。它看起来和它的绰号一模一样，是一朵深紫色的莲花。已知是一种强效止痛药，同时也会引起强烈幻觉。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "lotus blossom"
msgid "You eat the purple lotus blossom."
msgstr "你吃下了这朵紫色的莲花。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wyld candy"
msgid_plural "wyld candies"
msgstr[0] "怀尔德糖果"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "wyld candy"
msgid ""
"Mixed candies purporting to come from 'Fair Folk Industries' these candies "
"appear in areas of the country thought to have significant crossover events.  "
"It remains unknown whether these candies are produced by a company from here "
"taking advantage of a thin place or if they came from somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"一些据称来自\"美人工业\""
"的混合糖果。这些糖果出现在被国家认为存在重大跨世界活动的地区。目前尚不清楚这些糖果是由此公司在这些地点利用稀薄结界生产的，或是来自其他世界。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "questionable blood treatment"
msgid_plural "questionable blood treatment"
msgstr[0] "可疑的血疗"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "questionable blood treatment"
msgid ""
"This homemade blood treatment purports to reduce the cravings brought on by "
"vampirism and if applied often and early to even reverse some stages of the "
"disease.  But vampires surely can't be real, can they?"
msgstr "这种自制的血液疗法声称可以减少吸血鬼症带来的渴求，如果经常和及早使用，甚至可以逆转疾病的某些阶段。 但吸血鬼肯定不是真的，不是吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cthonic poultice"
msgid_plural "cthonic poultices"
msgstr[0] "大地药膏"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "cthonic poultice"
msgid ""
"A poultice made from the elements of the earth.  You could use it to heal "
"your wounds, if you were made of stone."
msgstr "由大地元素制成的膏药。 如果你是石头做的，你可以用它来治愈伤口。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "verdant poultice"
msgid_plural "verdant poultices"
msgstr[0] "苍郁药膏"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "verdant poultice"
msgid ""
"A poultice made from plant life.  You could use it to heal your wounds, if "
"you were grown from plants."
msgstr "用植物制成的膏药。 如果你是从植物中生长出来的，你可以用它来治愈伤口。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cerulean poultice"
msgid_plural "cerulean poultices"
msgstr[0] "海蓝药膏"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "cerulean poultice"
msgid ""
"A poultice made from the elements of the sea.  You could use it to heal your "
"wounds, if you were liquid as well."
msgstr "由海洋元素制成的膏药。 如果你也是液体，你可以用它来愈合伤口。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "charred sacrifice"
msgid_plural "charred sacrifice"
msgstr[0] "焦炭祭品"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "charred sacrifice"
msgid ""
"A devotion to the powers of fire.  You could use it to heal your wounds, if "
"you were born of the flames."
msgstr "皈依火之力。若你身为火焰，此法可治愈伤口。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "doll repair paste"
msgid_plural "doll repair paste"
msgstr[0] "娃娃修补膏"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "doll repair paste"
msgid ""
"A paste made from paint and glue.  You could use it to heal your wounds, if "
"you were made in man's image."
msgstr "由油漆和胶水制成的糊状物。如果你是按人的形象制造的，你可以用它来治愈伤口。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ethereal draught"
msgid_plural "ethereal draughts"
msgstr[0] "空灵药剂"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "ethereal draught"
msgid ""
"A concoction made from honey and bread.  You could use it to heal your "
"wounds, if you were born of air and darkness."
msgstr "由蜂蜜和面包调制而成 如果你是由空气和黑暗所生，你可以用它来治愈伤口。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "elemental mana draught"
msgid_plural "elemental mana draughts"
msgstr[0] "元素魔力药水"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "churning vampire blood mixture"
msgid_plural "churning vampire blood mixture"
msgstr[0] "churning vampire blood mixture"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "churning vampire blood mixture"
msgid ""
"Vampire blood mixed with blood none would consume and different toxic "
"substances.  The hostile environment is already driving the vampire blood to "
"devour itself.  It will be ready to consume in a few days."
msgstr ""
"Vampire blood mixed with blood none would consume and different toxic "
"substances.  The hostile environment is already driving the vampire blood to "
"devour itself.  It will be ready to consume in a few days."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "churning vampire blood mixture"
msgid ""
"The vampire blood has completely devoured itself, leaving a small dose of "
"very potent vampire blood behind."
msgstr ""
"The vampire blood has completely devoured itself, leaving a small dose of "
"very potent vampire blood behind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "churning vampire blood mixture"
msgid "The vampire blood is still devouring itself."
msgstr "The vampire blood is still devouring itself."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blood of the Anathema"
msgid_plural "blood of the Anathema"
msgstr[0] "blood of the Anathema"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#. ~ Description of "blood of the Anathema"
msgid ""
"Vampire blood that been forced to gain the ability to devour vampire blood to "
"survive.  Consuming it will allow you to devour vampire blood to gain power, "
"like that vampire did before you caused their end."
msgstr ""
"Vampire blood that been forced to gain the ability to devour vampire blood to "
"survive.  Consuming it will allow you to devour vampire blood to gain power, "
"like that vampire did before you caused their end."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "XEDRA laptop"
msgid_plural "XEDRA laptops"
msgstr[0] "XEDRA笔记本电脑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "XEDRA laptop"
msgid ""
"A heavy, dark laptop with a swappable battery slot.  The back panel is "
"labeled \"PROPERTY OF XEDRA\".  It uses a non-standard OS, so there's not "
"much you can use it for without reinstalling it."
msgstr ""
"A heavy, dark laptop with a swappable battery slot.  The back panel is "
"labeled \"PROPERTY OF XEDRA\".  It uses a non-standard OS, so there's not "
"much you can use it for without reinstalling it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "XEDRA laptop"
#. ~ "description" action message of item "XEDRA laptop - lit screen"
msgid "You can guess a password and check some classified information, if it has any."
msgstr "你可以猜测一个密码，并检查一些机密信息，如果有的话。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "XEDRA laptop"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "XEDRA laptop - lit screen"
msgid "Try to open locked folders"
msgstr "尝试打开锁定的文件夹"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "XEDRA laptop"
msgid "You can reinstall the OS to use it as a common laptop."
msgstr "你可以重新安装操作系统，将其作为普通笔记本电脑使用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "XEDRA laptop"
msgid "Reinstall the OS."
msgstr "重新安装操作系统"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "XEDRA laptop - lit screen"
msgid_plural "XEDRA laptops - lit screen"
msgstr[0] "XEDRA 笔记本电脑（点亮）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blurred aura"
msgid_plural "blurred auras"
msgstr[0] "模糊光环"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "blurred aura"
msgid ""
"Your edges blur and expand and contract in ways that don't reflect reality.  "
"Allows you to dodge two extra attacks in a given turn."
msgstr "你身体的边缘模糊、膨胀、收缩，似乎并不反映现实。让你在每回合中可以额外闪避两次攻击。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "precognitive aura"
msgid_plural "precognitive aura"
msgstr[0] "预知光环"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "precognitive aura"
msgid "A precognitive aura that allows you to dodge things you didn't see coming."
msgstr "预知光环可以让你躲避尚未看到的袭来事物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamdross rapier"
msgid_plural "dreamdross rapiers"
msgstr[0] "浮梦迅捷剑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamdross rapier"
msgid ""
"This is a thin ephemeral sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the "
"preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes "
"any battle a stylish one."
msgstr "这是一把短暂存在的带有华丽护手的细剑，看起来像是绅士和剑客的首选武器。 它轻便快捷，让每场战斗都充满时尚气息。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamer dagger"
msgid_plural "dreamer daggers"
msgstr[0] "梦之匕"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamer dagger"
msgid ""
"This ephemeral dagger is 15 inches long from the hilt to the tip, the "
"double-edged blade itself is a pearly white color and extremely sharp."
msgstr "这把短暂存在的匕首全长15英寸，两面开刃的刀身呈珍珠白色，十分锋利。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dream armor"
msgid_plural "dream armor"
msgstr[0] "梦渣盔甲"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "dream armor"
msgid ""
"A summoned medieval armor made from dreamdross.  It shimmers in the light and "
"provides some protection."
msgstr "一套召唤出的中世纪盔甲，由浮梦残渣构成。它在光线下闪闪发光，提供了一些保护。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Drunken Master aura"
msgid_plural "Drunken Master auras"
msgstr[0] "醉拳光环"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Drunken Master aura"
msgid "Hey I thought this was America…"
msgstr "哈我想这里可是美利坚……"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Oneiric Hammer"
msgid_plural "Oneiric Hammers"
msgstr[0] "梦之锤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Oneiric Hammer"
msgid ""
"The platonic embodiment of a blacksmiths hammer.  This hammer is necessary to "
"forge or repair items made of forged dreamstuff."
msgstr "一把铁匠锤的柏拉图式化身。这把锤子是锻造或修理铸梦材料制品的必备工具。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "constructed hammer"
msgid_plural "constructed hammers"
msgstr[0] "构造锤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "constructed hammer"
msgid ""
"A long handle ending in a two-sided head, one of which is hollow, and the "
"other… does not exist.  Weirdly, both heads are equally useful, and the "
"balance of hammer is pretty good to be useful as a weapon.  By activating and "
"attacking with the hollow part, the hammer creates a tremendous force, able "
"to break a thick tree (or someone's spine) in half, but will be destroyed "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"长柄的末端是一个两面的锤头，其中一面是空心的，而另一面......并不存在。 奇怪的是，这两个头都同样有用，而且锤子的平衡性相当好，可以作为武器使用。 "
"启动锤子并用空心部分进行攻击，锤子就会产生巨大的力量，可以将粗大的树木（或人的脊柱）砸成两半，但之后就会被摧毁。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "constructed winch"
msgid_plural "constructed winches"
msgstr[0] "传送令牌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "constructed winch"
msgid ""
"A small token that floats near your right hand.  It pulls you to determined "
"coordinates when you command it."
msgstr "一个漂浮在你右手附近的小令牌。 只要你发出指令，它就会把你拉到确定的坐标处。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "constructed winch"
msgid "Jump."
msgstr "跳。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "water pocket"
msgid_plural "water pockets"
msgstr[0] "水袋"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "water pocket"
msgid ""
"A large pouch of churning water on your back, containing a sealed air bubble. "
" It shifts and adjusts itself to minimize encumbrance."
msgstr "翻涌搅动的水在你的背上形成了一个可以储物的袋子，包裹着内部空间形成了一个密封的空气泡。它不断改变和调整，以减小累赘。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Tongues of Flame"
msgid_plural "Tongues of Flames"
msgstr[0] "烈焰火鞭"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Tongues of Flame"
msgid ""
"A long whip made of red-hot fire.  It crackles menacingly and casts a "
"flickering red glow."
msgstr "由炽热殷红的火制成的长鞭。它发出危险的噼啪声和闪烁的红光。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "undine waters map"
msgid "The waters reveal themselves to you."
msgstr "水向你占展露自身。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetal sphere"
msgid_plural "vegetal spheres"
msgstr[0] "蔬果球"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetal sphere"
msgid ""
"A large, hollow sphere of plant matter, bark, and wood.  Food placed inside "
"will rot one-fifth as fast as it would if left out in the open air."
msgstr "由植物物质、树皮和木头组成的空心大球。放在里面的食物的腐烂速度是暴露在外时的五分之一。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "invulnerable iron skin"
msgid_plural "invulnerable iron skin"
msgstr[0] "invulnerable iron skin"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "invulnerable iron skin"
msgid "Fae iron essence."
msgstr "Fae iron essence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Under the Noonday Sun"
msgid_plural "Under the Noonday Suns"
msgstr[0] "Under the Noonday Suns"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Under the Noonday Sun"
msgid "You are protected from extremely bright lights."
msgstr "You are protected from extremely bright lights."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blood-storing sphere"
msgid_plural "blood-storing spheres"
msgstr[0] "储血球"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "blood-storing sphere"
msgid ""
"A magical transparent sphere.  You can use it to store any type of blood, at "
"least until the sphere vanishes."
msgstr "一个透明的魔法球。你可以用它存储任何类型的血液，至少直到它消失前。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/furniture_items.json
#. ~ Description of "treesung wardrobe"
msgid ""
"A very large wooden cabinet for storing clothes, effectively an upright "
"closet.  It's all made of a single, solid piece of wood, with twists and "
"curves like it grew in place rather than being made."
msgstr ""
"A very large wooden cabinet for storing clothes, effectively an upright "
"closet.  It's all made of a single, solid piece of wood, with twists and "
"curves like it grew in place rather than being made."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/furniture_items.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_TABLE_MANA_CHECK"
msgid "treesung wooden table"
msgid_plural "treesung wooden tables"
msgstr[0] "treesung wooden tables"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gracken_trait_improvements.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Gracken Shade Arms"
msgid_plural "Gracken Shade Arms"
msgstr[0] "Gracken Shade Arms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gracken_trait_improvements.json
#. ~ Description of "Gracken Shade Arms"
msgid ""
"An organ that allows a mature Gracken to convert their arms back to a base "
"state."
msgstr ""
"An organ that allows a mature Gracken to convert their arms back to a base "
"state."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gracken_trait_improvements.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "shade_arms"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "strong_arms"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "long_arms"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "gracken_shade_hands"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "shade_legs"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "long_legs"
msgid "You exchanged your previous arms for this."
msgstr "You exchanged your previous arms for this."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gracken_trait_improvements.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "shade_arms"
msgid "You are already have Gracken arms."
msgstr "You are already have Gracken arms."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gracken_trait_improvements.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Gracken Strong Arms"
msgid_plural "Gracken Strong Arms"
msgstr[0] "Gracken Strong Arms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gracken_trait_improvements.json
#. ~ Description of "Gracken Strong Arms"
msgid ""
"An organ that allows a mature Gracken to convert their arms to a stronger "
"form."
msgstr ""
"An organ that allows a mature Gracken to convert their arms to a stronger "
"form."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gracken_trait_improvements.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "strong_arms"
msgid "You are already have strong arms."
msgstr "You are already have strong arms."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/gracken_trait_improvements.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Gracken Long Arms"
msgid_plural "Gracken Long Arms"
