#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glasknife"
msgid_plural "glasknives"
msgstr[0] "玻璃刀"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "glasknife"
msgid ""
"This is a knife that seems to be made of glass, but significantly more "
"durable, like some sort of crystal with the strength of metal."
msgstr "这是一把似乎是玻璃制成的刀，但要耐用得多，就像某种具有金属强度的水晶。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mirrored estoc"
msgid_plural "mirrored estocs"
msgstr[0] "镜像穿甲剑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "mirrored estoc"
msgid ""
"A thin piercing sword no wider than two fingers side by side, it's mirrored "
"surface reflects the world back at it's wielders opponents and is difficult "
"to see to parry.  You've never felt a sword like this before."
msgstr "一把宽度不超过两根并排手指的细刺剑，它的镜面将整个世界反射到持剑者对手的眼中，这让它很难招架。你以前从未摸过这样的剑。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frostrimed estoc"
msgid_plural "frostrimed estocs"
msgstr[0] "霜结穿甲剑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "frostrimed estoc"
msgid ""
"This sword is covered in shifting frost and seems to move of its own volition "
"in your hands."
msgstr "这把刺剑上覆盖着流动的白霜，在你手中似乎按照自己的意志移动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "witchwood sword"
msgid_plural "witchwood swords"
msgstr[0] "巫木剑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "witchwood sword"
msgid ""
"This sword is made all of a single piece of wood and so black any details are "
"lost.  Some kind of shimmering leather is wrapped around the grip."
msgstr "这把剑完全由一整块木头制成，颜色漆黑，所有细节都消失不见。剑柄上缠绕着某种闪闪发光的皮革。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "redcap club"
msgid_plural "redcap clubs"
msgstr[0] "红顶木棒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "redcap club"
msgid ""
"A giant bloodstained club, barely human wieldable with two hands.  You see "
"shadowy tendrils of blood whenever it connects with an enemy, sticking to "
"whatever it hits and burning like acid."
msgstr "一根沾满鲜血的巨棍，两只手几乎无法挥舞。 每当它与敌人连接时，你都会看到朦胧的血卷须，粘在它击中的任何东西上，像酸一样燃烧。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Name of spell "blood_tendrils"
msgid "Blood Tendrils"
msgstr "鲜血触手"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Description of spell "blood_tendrils ( Blood Tendrils )"
msgid "Brownish reddish tendrils connect from the club to your enemies."
msgstr "棕红色的触手从木棒上接触到你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
