msgid_plural "pooka gladii"
msgstr[0] "普卡短剑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "pooka gladius"
msgid ""
"A gladius covered in the whorls of Celtic knots.  Sparks seems to pop off the "
"edge of the blade."
msgstr "一条盖满了凯尔特结的短剑。火花似乎从剑刃上迸发出来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
