msgid_plural "salamagman battle axes"
msgstr[0] "salamagman battle axes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "salamagman battle axe"
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Made of forged dreamdross, and enchanted to "
"channel heat into those it wounds."
msgstr ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Made of forged dreamdross, and enchanted to "
"channel heat into those it wounds."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
