msgstr "一张亮绿色的便利贴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
#. ~ Description of "post-it note"
msgid "A bright gray post-it note."
msgstr "一张浅灰色的便利贴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
#. ~ Description of "post-it note"
msgid "A bright pink post-it note."
msgstr "一张亮粉色的便利贴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "museum plaque"
msgid_plural "museum plaques"
msgstr[0] "展览馆铭牌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/notes_and_news.json
#. ~ Description of "museum plaque"
msgid "A paper plaque.  It has words printed on it."
msgstr "一块纸质铭牌。上面印有文字。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "purity crackers"
msgid_plural "purity crackers"
msgstr[0] "纯洁饼干"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
#. ~ Description of "purity crackers"
msgid ""
"An incredibly hard cracker.  Squeezing it in your hand it feels as though "
"your teeth might break before the cracker does.  The packaging on the side "
"shows a tall being feeding these crackers to a horned and four legged "
"creature."
msgstr "一个非常硬的饼干。把它捏在手里，感觉就像你的牙齿可能会比饼干先碎。侧面的包装展示了一个高个子正在给一个有角的四条腿的生物喂食这些饼干。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "golden bridle"
msgid_plural "golden bridles"
msgstr[0] "金色韁繩"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/pets.json
#. ~ Description of "golden bridle"
msgid ""
"A golden bridle made of spun moon tears, gold, and incredibly strong hair "
"including associated tack that can be placed on a tamed mythical animal that "
"is capable of being ridden."
msgstr "一根金色的缰绳，由月之泪、和某种金色难以置信的坚韧的毛发编织而成的绳索制成，包含配套的各类马钉，能够装在已驯服的神话动物身上，让它供你骑乘。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "dreamforged bow"
msgid_plural "dreamforged bows"
msgstr[0] "梦铸弓"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
#. ~ Description of gun "dreamforged bow"
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged bow"
msgid ""
"A six-foot bow, forged entirely from dreamdross, including its strings.  "
"Primitive look, devastating power."
msgstr "一个六英尺（约1.8米）长的弓，完全由浮梦残渣锻造而成，包括它的弦。原始的外表，毁灭性的力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged arrow"
msgid_plural "dreamforged arrows"
msgstr[0] "梦铸箭"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged arrow"
msgid "A dreamforged arrow with a razor-sharp tip."
msgstr "梦铸尖头箭。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "dreamforged crossbow"
msgid_plural "dreamforged crossbows"
msgstr[0] "梦铸弩"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
#. ~ Description of gun "dreamforged crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged crossbow"
msgid ""
"A medieval crossbow, forged entirely from dreamdross, including its strings.  "
"Probably not the optimal weapon in our modern world, but still capable of "
"doing devastating damage while being completely silent."
msgstr ""
"A medieval crossbow, forged entirely from dreamdross, including its strings.  "
"Probably not the optimal weapon in our modern world, but still capable of "
"doing devastating damage while being completely silent."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged bolt"
msgid_plural "dreamforged bolts"
msgstr[0] "梦铸弩矢"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged bolt"
msgid "A dreamforged crossbow bolt with broadhead tip."
msgstr "梦铸宽刃弩矢"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range_treesung.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "treesung bow"
msgid_plural "treesung bows"
msgstr[0] "treesung bows"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range_treesung.json
#. ~ Description of gun "treesung bow"
#. ~ Description of "treesung bow"
msgid ""
"A wooden shortbow with a thin vine for a string, all formed from a single "
"piece of wood, with twists and curves like it grew in place rather than being "
"made."
msgstr ""
"A wooden shortbow with a thin vine for a string, all formed from a single "
"piece of wood, with twists and curves like it grew in place rather than being "
"made."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range_treesung.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_GREATBOW_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK"
msgid "treesung greatbow"
msgid_plural "treesung greatbows"
msgstr[0] "treesung greatbows"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range_treesung.json
#. ~ Description of gun "treesung greatbow"
#. ~ Description of "treesung greatbow"
msgid ""
"A truly enormous wooden bow with a thin vine for a string, all formed from a "
"single piece of wood, with twists and curves like it grew in place rather "
"than being made."
msgstr ""
"A truly enormous wooden bow with a thin vine for a string, all formed from a "
"single piece of wood, with twists and curves like it grew in place rather "
"than being made."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range_treesung.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "treesung arrow"
msgid_plural "treesung arrows"
msgstr[0] "treesung arrows"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/range_treesung.json
#. ~ Description of "treesung arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow all formed from a single piece of wood, with twists and curves like "
"it grew in place rather than being made.  It even has leaves for fletching."
msgstr ""
"An arrow all formed from a single piece of wood, with twists and curves like "
"it grew in place rather than being made.  It even has leaves for fletching."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "moon tears ingot"
msgid_plural "moon tears ingots"
msgstr[0] "月之泪锭"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tears ingot"
msgid ""
"An ingot of moon tears.  About 3cm by 7cm by 12cm in size, ready to be used "
"for various blacksmithing tasks."
msgstr "一块月之泪锭。约有3x7x12厘米大小，能被用于各种锻造任务。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "moon tear wire"
msgid_plural "moon tear wires"
msgstr[0] "月之泪丝"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tear wire"
msgid "A length of thin, relatively stiff moon tear wire."
msgstr "一截细的，坚韧的月之泪丝线"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap moon tears"
msgid_plural "scraps of moon tears"
msgstr[0] "月之泪余料"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap moon tears"
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap moon tears, useful for forging into "
"ingots and wire."
msgstr "各式各样的月之泪废料，可用于锻造成锭和丝。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap shadowstuff"
msgid_plural "scraps of shadowstuff"
msgstr[0] "scraps of shadowstuff"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap shadowstuff"
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap shadowstuff, possibly useful in "
"ephemeral crafting."
msgstr ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap shadowstuff, possibly useful in "
"ephemeral crafting."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk shadowstuff"
msgid_plural "scraps of shadowstuff"
msgstr[0] "scraps of shadowstuff"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk shadowstuff"
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of larger bits of scrap shadowstuff, possibly useful in "
"ephemeral crafting."
msgstr ""
"A bulky assortment of larger bits of scrap shadowstuff, possibly useful in "
"ephemeral crafting."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrap dreamdross"
msgid_plural "scraps of dreamdross"
msgstr[0] "浮梦碎渣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "scrap dreamdross"
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap dreamdross, useful in all kinds of "
"ephemeral crafting."
msgstr "一堆各式各样的小块浮梦碎片，在所有的梦境系列制造中都很有用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lump of dreamdross"
msgid_plural "lumps of dreamdross"
msgstr[0] "浮梦块"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "lump of dreamdross"
msgid "A heavy formed piece of dreamdross.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "一大块沉重的经过成型的浮梦残渣，可以用来制造物品。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamdross ingot"
msgid_plural "dreamdross ingots"
msgstr[0] "浮梦锭"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamdross ingot"
msgid ""
"A forged ingot of dreamdross.  About 3cm by 7cm by 12cm in size, ready to be "
"used for various reality forging tasks."
msgstr "一块浮梦锭。约有3x7x12厘米大小，能被用于各种梦境制品锻造。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamspark"
msgid_plural "dreamsparks"
msgstr[0] "dreamsparks"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamspark"
msgid "The extracted essence of human dreams, used to fuel fae magicks."
msgstr "The extracted essence of human dreams, used to fuel fae magicks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tanned glimmer fur pelt"
msgid_plural "tanned glimmer fur pelts"
msgstr[0] "晒黑的微光毛皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "tanned glimmer fur pelt"
msgid ""
"A folded sheet of glimmer fur made from carefully tanned fae animal pelt.  "
"Can be cut up or used as is."
msgstr "一块折叠的微光毛皮，由精心鞣制的妖精毛皮制成。可以按原样切割或使用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tanning glimmer fur pelt"
msgid_plural "tanning glimmer fur pelts"
msgstr[0] "鞣制微光毛皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "tanning glimmer fur pelt"
msgid ""
"A treated fae animal pelt that is undergoing the chemical processes required "
"to become fur.  You will be able to activate it to unroll and make use of it "
"when it is done."
msgstr "一种经过处理的毛皮，正在经历成为毛皮所需的化学过程。你将能够激活它来展开，并在完成后使用它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tanning glimmer fur pelt"
msgid "You carefully unfold the tanning fae fur pelt and shake it clean."
msgstr "你小心地展开晒黑的毛皮，把它抖干净。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ "not_ready_msg" action message of item "tanning glimmer fur pelt"
msgid "The tanning fae fur pelt isn't done yet."
msgstr "鞣制毛皮的工作还没有完成。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cured glimmer pelt"
msgid_plural "cured glimmer pelts"
msgstr[0] "风干闪光毛皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "cured glimmer pelt"
msgid ""
"A rolled-up fae animal hide which has been scraped of extraneous hair and "
"flesh and treated to prevent decay.  It still requires tanning to become "
"usable fur."
msgstr "一种卷起来的妖怪兽皮，刮去多余的毛和肉，并处理以防止腐烂。它仍然需要鞣制才能成为可用的皮毛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer sheet"
msgid_plural "gossamer sheets"
msgstr[0] "月之纱面料"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer sheet"
msgid ""
"A 12-inch by 24-inch sheet of gossamer fabric, like a swatch plucked from a "
"rainbow."
msgstr "一块 12 英寸乘 24 英寸的月之纱布料，就像从彩虹上摘下的色块。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "patchwork gossamer sheet"
msgid_plural "patchwork gossamer sheets"
msgstr[0] "月之纱拼布面料"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "patchwork gossamer sheet"
msgid ""
"A 12-inch by 24-inch sheet of gossamer sewn together from patches of various "
"clothing parts.  Suitable for making clothing if you lack proper material "
"sheets."
msgstr "一张12英寸×24英寸（约30厘米×61厘米）的月之纱面料，由各种衣服部件的补丁缝制而成。 如果你缺乏适当的其它材料片，可以用它来制作服装。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer patch"
msgid_plural "gossamer patches"
msgstr[0] "月之纱布片"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer patch"
msgid "A 6-inch square gossamer patch, suitable for repairing and tailoring clothing."
msgstr "一块约6英寸（约15厘米）见方的月之纱布片，可以用来修补或缝制衣物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer scraps"
msgid_plural "gossamer scraps"
msgstr[0] "月之纱碎片"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer scraps"
msgid "Filmy bits of gossamer, barely there.  Not useful for much."
msgstr "丝丝缕缕的月之纱，存在感若有若无。用处不大。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "elemental gossamer sheet"
msgid_plural "elemental gossamer sheets"
msgstr[0] "elemental gossamer sheets"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "elemental gossamer sheet"
msgid ""
"A 12-inch by 24-inch sheet of elemental gossamer fabric, like a swatch "
"plucked from a rainbow."
msgstr ""
"A 12-inch by 24-inch sheet of elemental gossamer fabric, like a swatch "
"plucked from a rainbow."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "patchwork elemental gossamer sheet"
msgid_plural "patchwork elemental gossamer sheets"
msgstr[0] "patchwork elemental gossamer sheets"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "patchwork elemental gossamer sheet"
msgid ""
"A 12-inch by 24-inch sheet of elemental gossamer sewn together from patches "
"of various clothing parts.  Suitable for making clothing if you lack proper "
"material sheets."
msgstr ""
"A 12-inch by 24-inch sheet of elemental gossamer sewn together from patches "
"of various clothing parts.  Suitable for making clothing if you lack proper "
"material sheets."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "elemental gossamer patch"
msgid_plural "elemental gossamer patches"
msgstr[0] "elemental gossamer patches"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "elemental gossamer patch"
msgid ""
"A 6-inch square elemental gossamer patch, suitable for repairing and "
"tailoring clothing."
msgstr ""
"A 6-inch square elemental gossamer patch, suitable for repairing and "
"tailoring clothing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "elemental gossamer scraps"
msgid_plural "elemental gossamer scraps"
msgstr[0] "elemental gossamer scraps"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "elemental gossamer scraps"
msgid "Filmy bits of elemental gossamer, barely there.  Not useful for much."
msgstr "Filmy bits of elemental gossamer, barely there.  Not useful for much."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer gambeson batting"
msgid_plural "clumps of gossamer gambeson batting"
msgstr[0] "月之纱软铠衬料"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer gambeson batting"
msgid ""
"A pile of shredded gossamer, like wisps of solid moonlight, which could be "
"used to stuff the fabric layers of a gambeson."
msgstr "一块由零碎月之纱组成的布料，像一束束纯净的月光，可以用来填充软铠的织物层。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "treesung log"
msgid_plural "treesung logs"
msgstr[0] "treesung logs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "treesung log"
msgid "A large log of living wood, sung from a tree by elemental magick."
msgstr "A large log of living wood, sung from a tree by elemental magick."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of obsidian"
msgid_plural "chunks of obsidian"
msgstr[0] "黑曜石块"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of obsidian"
msgid ""
"A chunk of obsidian, smashed from a larger rock vein.  It has several "
"wickedly sharp edges and could probably be formed into a weapon with some "
"work."
msgstr "一大块的黑曜石，是从更大的黑耀石岩脉上砸下来的。它有几个非常锋利的边缘，经过稍稍加工可以当作武器。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "piece of the darkest shadow"
msgid_plural "pieces of the darkest shadow"
msgstr[0] "pieces of the darkest shadow"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "piece of the darkest shadow"
msgid ""
"A chunk of darkness, torn from a powerful shadow.  It is so dark that no "
"light reflect from it."
msgstr ""
"A chunk of darkness, torn from a powerful shadow.  It is so dark that no "
"light reflect from it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "march lord skull"
msgid_plural "march lord skulls"
msgstr[0] "征战领主头骨"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "march lord skull"
msgid "The skull of a march lord.  You can feel its lingering power as you touch it."
msgstr "征战领主的头骨。当你触摸它时，你能感受到其中残存的力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inert stormwrought blood"
msgid_plural "doses of inert stormwrought blood"
msgstr[0] "doses of inert stormwrought blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "inert stormwrought blood"
msgid ""
"A ball of almost-solid blood, needing to bath in the energies of a portal "
"storm before being useful."
msgstr ""
"A ball of almost-solid blood, needing to bath in the energies of a portal "
"storm before being useful."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "simmering stormwrought blood"
msgid_plural "doses of simmering stormwrought blood"
msgstr[0] "doses of simmering stormwrought blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "simmering stormwrought blood"
msgid ""
"A ball of almost-solid blood with ripples across its surface.  It has been "
"exposed to the energies of the portal storms enough to be used in the ritual."
msgstr ""
"A ball of almost-solid blood with ripples across its surface.  It has been "
"exposed to the energies of the portal storms enough to be used in the ritual."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "concentrated underhill essence"
msgid_plural "concentrated underhill essence"
msgstr[0] "concentrated underhill essence"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "concentrated underhill essence"
msgid "The distilled essence of the Fae.  Can be used as part of rituals."
msgstr "The distilled essence of the Fae.  Can be used as part of rituals."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "concentrated underhill
#. essence"
msgid "You drink some concentrated underhill essence."
msgstr "You drink some concentrated underhill essence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dream-drainer mosquito's heart"
msgid_plural "dream-drainer mosquito's hearts"
msgstr[0] "dream-drainer mosquito's hearts"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "dream-drainer mosquito's heart"
msgid ""
"A heartlike object made from dreamdross.  It feels as if it were still "
"beating despite its lack of movement."
msgstr "由梦幻渣滓制成的心脏状物体。 虽然没有运动，但感觉它仍在跳动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "moonstruck pearl"
msgid_plural "moonstruck pearls"
msgstr[0] "moonstruck pearls"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "moonstruck pearl"
msgid "A small pearl brightly shining with moonlight."
msgstr "A small pearl brightly shining with moonlight."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Abyssal Hunger's shard"
msgid_plural "Abyssal Hunger's shards"
msgstr[0] "Abyssal Hunger's shards"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/resources.json
#. ~ Description of "Abyssal Hunger's shard"
msgid "A strange object you brought back from the insides of the Abyssal Hunger."
msgstr "A strange object you brought back from the insides of the Abyssal Hunger."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_tailoring.json
#. ~ Description of "tailor's kit"
msgid ""
"This is a high quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some wooden "
"spools for thread, some small scissors, and an awl.  Use a tailor's kit to "
"customize your clothing and armor.  This uses your tailoring skill."
msgstr "一組高品質的套件，裝有各種針、一些木線軸、一些小剪刀和縫錐。使用裁縫工具來修改你的衣服和護甲。結果取決於你的裁縫技能。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged hacksaw"
msgid_plural "dreamforged hacksaws"
msgstr[0] "梦铸钢锯"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged hacksaw"
msgid ""
"A sturdy saw, useful for cutting through metal objects.  Forged from "
"dreamdross, which makes it much lighter."
msgstr "一把结实的锯子，适合用来切割金属物品。 由浮梦残渣锻造而成，重量更轻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged hammer"
msgid_plural "dreamforged hammers"
msgstr[0] "梦铸锤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged hammer"
msgid ""
"A classic carpenter hammer with claw.  Forged from dreamdross, which makes it "
"much lighter."
msgstr "经典的羊角木工锤。 由浮梦残渣锻造而成，重量更轻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged Halligan bar"
msgid_plural "dreamforged Halligan bars"
msgstr[0] "梦铸消防破拆棍"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged Halligan bar"
msgid ""
"A small tool for breaking into closed locations.  Forged from dreamdross, "
"which makes it really light."
msgstr "用于破门进入封闭场所的小型工具。由浮梦残渣锻造而成，非常轻巧。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged locking pliers"
msgid_plural "dreamforged locking pliers"
msgstr[0] "梦铸锁定钳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged locking pliers"
msgid ""
"A pair of strong pliers with an adjustable mechanism.  Forged entirely from "
"dreamdross, which makes it much lighter."
msgstr "一把坚固的可调节钳子。完全由浮梦残渣锻造而成，重量更轻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged pickaxe"
msgid_plural "dreamforged pickaxes"
msgstr[0] "梦铸鹤嘴锄"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged pickaxe"
msgid ""
"A classic pickaxe, used for digging.  Forged from dreamdross, which makes it "
"really light, albeit a bit weaker."
msgstr ""
"A classic pickaxe, used for digging.  Forged from dreamdross, which makes it "
"really light, albeit a bit weaker."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged locksmith kit"
msgid_plural "dreamforged locksmith kits"
msgstr[0] "梦铸撬锁工具"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged locksmith kit"
msgid "A set of light and sturdy dreamforged lockpicks and wrenches."
msgstr "一套轻巧坚固的梦铸开锁工具和扳手。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged scalpel"
msgid_plural "dreamforged scalpels"
msgstr[0] "梦铸手术刀"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged scalpel"
msgid "A very sharp medical knife for surgical operations.  Almost weightless."
msgstr "A very sharp medical knife for surgical operations.  Almost weightless."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged entrenching tool"
msgid_plural "dreamforged entrenching tools"
msgstr[0] "梦铸工兵铲"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged entrenching tool"
msgid ""
"A collapsible spade for digging small pits.  Forged from dreamdross to make "
"it even lighter than before."
msgstr "用于挖掘小坑的可折叠铲子。 用梦幻渣锻造而成，比以前更轻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged time trap"
msgid_plural "dreamforged time traps"
msgstr[0] "梦铸时间陷阱"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged time trap"
msgid ""
"A dreamdross mesh that condenses within the center.  Use it to set it on the "
"ground, creating a trap that will freeze anything that steps on it for "
"several hours."
msgstr "一张压缩在中心的浮梦之网。如果有东西踩过它的话，会将其冻结数个小时。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "dreamforged time trap"
msgid "You set the time trap on the ground."
msgstr "You set the time trap on the ground."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "time shattering pocket watch"
msgid_plural "time shattering pocket watches"
msgstr[0] "time shattering pocket watches"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "time shattering pocket watch"
msgid ""
"A pocket watch made entirely of dreamdross.  It somehow still accurately "
"tells the time.  Once per day, press the button on the right to briefly stop "
"time for everything but you."
msgstr ""
"A pocket watch made entirely of dreamdross.  It somehow still accurately "
"tells the time.  Once per day, press the button on the right to briefly stop "
"time for everything but you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged axe"
msgid_plural "dreamforged axes"
msgstr[0] "梦铸斧"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged axe"
msgid "A large, two-handed axe for chopping wood.  Light, but still useful."
msgstr "A large, two-handed axe for chopping wood.  Light, but still useful."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sacrifice table"
msgid_plural "sacrifice tables"
msgstr[0] "祭祀桌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "sacrifice table"
msgid "A magickal space where offerings are sacrificed and transformed."
msgstr "一个供奉祭品并进行转化的魔法空间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dream-drainer catalyst"
msgid_plural "dream-drainer catalyst"
msgstr[0] "dream-drainer catalyst"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "dream-drainer catalyst"
msgid ""
"A small ball of dreams, Fae blood and illicit substances from Under the Hill. "
" Your book claims it will transform any mosquito ingesting it in a "
"dream-eating nightmare."
msgstr ""
"A small ball of dreams, Fae blood and illicit substances from Under the Hill. "
" Your book claims it will transform any mosquito ingesting it in a "
"dream-eating nightmare."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "revenant's effigy"
msgid_plural "revenant's effigy"
msgstr[0] "revenant's effigy"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "revenant's effigy"
msgid ""
"A macabre effigy made of meat and bone, with a heart filled with glass and "
"faewild dust.  When the full moon will shine upon it, you will be able to use "
"it to summon the Luna-attuned revenant."
msgstr ""
"A macabre effigy made of meat and bone, with a heart filled with glass and "
"faewild dust.  When the full moon will shine upon it, you will be able to use "
"it to summon the Luna-attuned revenant."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/tools.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "revenant's effigy"
msgid "Complete the ritual."
msgstr "Complete the ritual."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vegetables.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "triffid heart chunk"
msgid_plural "triffid heart chunks"
msgstr[0] "triffid heart chunks"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vegetables.json
#. ~ Description of "triffid heart chunk"
msgid ""
"A thick, hulking mass of plant matter and wood that's easily the size of your "
"head, torn from a triffid heart."
msgstr ""
"A thick, hulking mass of plant matter and wood that's easily the size of your "
"head, torn from a triffid heart."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "elemental wave rider engine"
msgid_plural "elemental wave rider engines"
msgstr[0] "元素乘波发动机"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of "elemental wave rider engine"
msgid ""
"An elementally manifested combustion engine.  Despite operating entirely off "
"of mana rather than normal fuel, it otherwise functions exactly as a "
"conventional internal combustion engine."
msgstr "一台元素形式的内燃机。尽管完全使用魔力作为燃料而非普通燃料，在其它方面它却和普通的内燃机没有什么不同。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "floral vessel"
msgid_plural "floral vessels"
msgstr[0] "floral vessels"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/xedra_gear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "zebra badge"
msgid_plural "zebra badges"
msgstr[0] "斑马钥匙卡"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/xedra_gear.json
#. ~ Description of "zebra badge"
msgid ""
"A white piece of plastic with a picture of an agent and a barcode underneath. "
" The lack of other details on badges like it led to them being called 'Zebra "
"Badges'.  It might grant basic access to some Xedra areas."
msgstr ""
"A white piece of plastic with a picture of an agent and a barcode underneath. "
" The lack of other details on badges like it led to them being called 'Zebra "
"Badges'.  It might grant basic access to some Xedra areas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of glimmer fur boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of glimmer fur boots"
msgstr[0] "闪光毛皮靴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of glimmer fur boots"
msgid "Boots lined with glimmer fur for warmth."
msgstr "一双闪光毛皮内衬的靴子，十分暖和。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of glimmer fur pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of glimmer fur pants"
msgstr[0] "pairs of glimmer fur pants"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of glimmer fur pants"
msgid "A hefty pair of fae fur-lined pants."
msgstr "一条带有妖精毛皮内衬的厚实裤子。非常保暖。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glimmer fur cloak"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur cloaks"
msgstr[0] "闪光毛皮披风"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur cloak"
msgid ""
"A heavy glimmer fur cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  The shimmering "
"nature of the fur made these garments coveted before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "一件套在衣服外面、覆盖全身的闪光毛皮披风。毛皮闪闪发光的特性使这件披风在大灾变前备受垂涎。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glimmer fur coat"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur coats"
msgstr[0] "闪光毛皮大衣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur coat"
msgid ""
"A glimmer fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm and very rare "
"before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "一件闪光毛皮大衣，有些口袋，保暖效果非常棒，在大灾变前非常罕见。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glimmer fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "闪光毛皮风衣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur trenchcoat"
msgid "A thick glimmer fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr "一件厚厚的闪光毛皮风衣，缝着不少口袋，提供非常大的存储空间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless glimmer fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless glimmer fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "闪光毛皮风衣（无袖）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless glimmer fur trenchcoat"
msgid ""
"A thick glimmer fur trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件无袖的厚实闪光毛皮风衣，让你的手臂不受束缚。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的存储空间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "閃光毛皮防塵大衣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "glimmer fur duster"
msgid ""
"A thick glimmer fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage.  "
"Shimmers in direct sunlight and would have been fancy clothing prior to the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "一件结实的全身长闪光毛皮防尘风衣，提供比较可观的存储空间。在阳光照射下闪闪发光，在大灾变之前是一件十分时髦的衣服。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sleeveless glimmer fur duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless glimmer fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "闪光毛皮防尘风衣（无袖）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "sleeveless glimmer fur duster"
msgid ""
"A thick glimmer fur full-length duster without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "一件厚实的闪光毛皮全身长无袖防尘风衣，让你的手臂有足够的伸展自由。它有很多口袋，提供了相当充足的存储空间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer gambeson"
msgid_plural "gossamer gambesons"
msgstr[0] "月之纱软铠"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer gambeson"
msgid ""
"A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting gossamer and stuffing the layers "
"with more scraps of gossamer.  It shimmers in a soft rainbow of colors."
msgstr "这是一件软垫大衣，通过填充绗缝的月之纱并且在层间填充更多的月之纱碎片而制成。 它闪烁着柔和的彩虹色。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer arming pants"
msgid_plural "gossamer arming pants"
msgstr[0] "月之纱绗缝衬裤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer arming pants"
msgid ""
"Thick pants made of gossamer, meant to be worn alongside a gambeson under or "
"without armor.  Stylish and as comfortable as armor can be."
msgstr "一件由月之纱制成的绗缝厚裤子，用来穿在链甲或其他护甲底下。既时尚，又像盔甲一样舒服。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gossamer gambeson coif"
msgid_plural "gossamer gambeson coifs"
msgstr[0] "月之纱罩盔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "gossamer gambeson coif"
msgid ""
"A gossamer coif with neck and forehead protection.  Resting on your "
"shoulders, it serves as padding for a helmet.  The sort of thing a fae knight "
"guarding a crossroads would wear when challenging travelers to duels."
msgstr "带有颈部和前额保护装置的月之纱头巾。 戴在肩上，可以作为头盔的衬垫。 这是守卫十字路口的异种骑士在与旅行者决斗时会戴的东西。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgid_plural "pairs of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgstr[0] "锁环护臂（月之泪）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of moon tears chainmail sleeves"
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail arms, found in places where changeling bannermen are "
"numerous.  Each sleeve has straps to connect them with each other.  The lack "
"of fingers makes them less cumbersome and allows them to be used with gloves."
msgstr "一对月之泪链甲护臂，在换生灵领主频繁出现的地方找到。套筒间有带子连接，无指的设计使它们不那么笨重，并留下了戴手套的空间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "锁环镫靴（月之泪）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail chausses that cover the feet, like booties made of "
"chainmail.  Found in places where changeling bannermen are numerous."
msgstr "月之泪制成的锁环镫靴，覆盖了整个腿部，如同锁环制成的长筒女靴一样。在换生灵领主频繁出现的地方找到。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail chausses that cover the feet, like booties made of "
"chainmail.  Found in places where redcap aspirants are numerous."
msgstr "月之泪制成的锁环镫靴，覆盖了整个腿部，如同锁环制成的长筒女靴一样。在红顶妖精频繁出现的地方找到。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of moon tears chainmail chausses"
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail chausses that cover the feet, like booties made of "
"chainmail.  Found in places where pooka aspirants are numerous."
msgstr "月之泪制成的锁环镫靴，覆盖了整个腿部，如同锁环制成的长筒女靴一样。在普卡妖精频繁出现的地方找到。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of moon tears chainmail gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of moon tears chainmail gloves"
msgstr[0] "锁环手套（月之泪）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of moon tears chainmail gloves"
msgid "Moon tears chainmail gloves that fully enclose the hand."
msgstr "一副月之泪制成的完全覆盖了双手的锁环手套。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "moon tears chainmail coif"
msgid_plural "moon tears chainmail coifs"
msgstr[0] "锁环罩盔（月之泪）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tears chainmail coif"
msgid "A fine moon tears chainmail hood.  Can be worn comfortably under helmets."
msgstr "一条能舒适地戴在头盔之下的月之泪链甲头巾。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "moon tears chainmail leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of moon tears chainmail leggings"
msgstr[0] "锁环护胫（月之泪）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tears chainmail leggings"
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail leggings.  Their straps keep everything in place, and "
"the lack of toes and heels allows them to work perfectly well with footwear."
msgstr "一套月之泪制成的锁链腿甲，各个部件之间采用带子连接固定在一起，脚趾和脚跟处的空缺使它们能够与鞋类很好地兼容。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tears chainmail leggings"
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail leggings for the largest of redcaps.  Their straps keep "
"everything in place, and the lack of toes and heels allows them to work "
"perfectly well with footwear."
msgstr "一套月之泪制成的锁链腿甲，专为大个子红顶妖精设计。各个部件之间采用带子连接固定在一起，脚趾和脚跟处的空缺使它们能够与鞋类很好地兼容。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tears chainmail leggings"
msgid ""
"Moon tears chainmail leggings for the smallest of pooka.  Their straps keep "
"everything in place, and the lack of toes and heels allows them to work "
"perfectly well with footwear."
msgstr "一套月之泪制成的锁链腿甲，专为小个子普卡妖精设计。各个部件之间采用带子连接固定在一起，脚趾和脚跟处的空缺使它们能够与鞋类很好地兼容。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "moon tears chainmail hauberk"
msgid_plural "moon tears chainmail hauberks"
msgstr[0] "锁环长衣（月之泪）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tears chainmail hauberk"
msgid ""
"A fully customized high steel chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  "
"Combine with a gambeson or other padded layer for optimal protection."
msgstr "一件自制的高碳钢锁环服，没有覆盖头部。与软铠或其他内衬一同穿着时能提供更好的保护效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "moon tears chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "moon tears chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "锁环甲（月之泪）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tears chainmail armor"
msgid ""
"A fully customized moon tears chainmail suit.  Combine with a gambeson or "
"other padded layer for optimal protection."
msgstr "一套自制的完整月之泪链甲套装。与软铠或其他内衬一同穿着，能够提供最佳保护。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "moon tears chainmail vest"
msgid_plural "moon tears chainmail vests"
msgstr[0] "锁环胸甲（月之泪）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "moon tears chainmail vest"
msgid ""
"A customized moon tears chainmail vest.  It's a sleeveless piece of chainmail "
"with small straps designed to better distribute the weight."
msgstr "一件自制的月之泪锁环胸甲，这件无袖胸甲由多条带子连结，均匀地分散装甲的重量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dreamforged ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "dreamforged ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "梦铸防弹板"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged ballistic plate"
msgid ""
"Manually forged ballistic plate, made to fit the common ballistic plate.  "
"Probably not as good as steel one, but lightweight, and additionally hardened "
"with magic."
msgstr "手工锻造的防弹板，用于安装普通的防弹板设备。可能没有钢制的好，但重量很轻，而且还用魔法加固了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small dreamforged ballistic plate"
msgid_plural "small dreamforged ballistic plates"
msgstr[0] "小型梦铸防弹板"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "small dreamforged ballistic plate"
msgid ""
"Manually forged ballistic plate, made to fit the common ballistic plate.  "
"Probably not as good as steel one, but lightweight, and additionally hardened "
"with magic.  Smaller in size, and can fit a side pocket of plate carrier."
msgstr "手工锻造的防弹板，用于安装普通的防弹板设备。可能没有钢制的好，但重量很轻，而且还用魔法加固了。体积较小，可装在携板背心的侧袋中。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/dreamforged_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_fullhelmet_ench"
msgid "dreamforged full helmet"
msgid_plural "dreamforged full helmets"
msgstr[0] "梦铸全覆头盔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged full helmet"
msgid ""
"Manually forged helmet, that resemble the shape of modern army helmets.  This "
"one protect both face and eyes, using a special forged mask, but has no "
"visor, and not so comfortable.  The dreamdross grant it some small magical "
"properties, but you can't control their effects."
msgstr "手工打造的头盔，形状像现代军队头盔。这个头盔保护你的眼睛和脸部，有一个面罩但没有面甲，不是很舒服。浮梦残渣赋予了它一些魔法特性，但你不能控制魔法的效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/dreamforged_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_helmet_ench"
msgid "dreamforged helmet"
msgid_plural "dreamforged helmets"
msgstr[0] "梦铸头盔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged helmet"
msgid "Manually forged helmet in the that resemble the shape of modern army helmets."
msgstr "手工锻造的头盔，形状类似于现代军用头盔。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/dreamforged_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_plate_armor_ench"
msgid "dreamforged plate armor"
msgid_plural "dreamforged plate armors"
msgstr[0] "梦铸板甲"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "dreamforged plate armor"
msgid ""
"Lightweight armor, forged using dreamdross.  The only reason it feels soft "
"enough is the magic.  It also has few MOLLE-compatible strips that you can "
"utilize.  The dreamdross grant it some minor magical properties, but you "
"can't control their effects."
msgstr "轻质盔甲，由浮梦残渣制成。穿起来柔软的唯一原因是魔法。上面还有几个兼容的MOLLE绑带供你使用。浮梦残渣赋予了它一些魔法特性，但你不能控制魔法的效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of dreamforged arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of dreamforged arm guards"
msgstr[0] "梦铸护臂"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of dreamforged arm guards"
msgid ""
"Pair of arm protectors, forged entirely from dreamdross.  Instead of straps "
"this one uses a pretty smart locking mechanism, which allows you to adjust it "
"to your hands.  The dreamdross grants it some minor magical properties, but "
"you can't control their effects."
msgstr ""
"完全由浮梦残渣打造而成的一对护臂。没有采用传统的绑带固定，而是使用了一套巧妙的锁扣结构，供你将其调整到适合自己的尺寸。浮梦残渣赋予了它一些魔法特性，但你不能"
"控制产生的效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of dreamforged boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of dreamforged boots"
msgstr[0] "梦铸长靴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of dreamforged boots"
msgid ""
"Light set of boots, forged from dreamdross.  Surprisingly comfortable for "
"clothing that has no physical padding.  The dreamdross grants it some minor "
"magical properties, but you can't control their effects."
msgstr "由浮梦残渣打造的一双靴子。令人意外的是，没有物理内衬却也十分舒适。浮梦残渣赋予了它一些魔法特性，但你不能控制魔法的效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "berserk helmet"
msgid_plural "berserk helmets"
msgstr[0] "狂战士头盔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "berserk helmet"
msgid ""
"Thin, smooth helmet, that cover your head, with a wide, sharp two-teeth blade "
"from the forehead.  Fueled by damage of berserk knuckles, your feel the "
"helmet pump the tension right into your veins."
msgstr "薄而光滑的头盔，覆盖着你的头，额头上有一个宽而锋利的两颗牙齿的刀片。在狂战指虎伤害的推动下，你会感觉到头盔将紧张直接注入你的血管。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of dreamforged berserk guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of dreamforged berserk guards"
msgstr[0] "梦铸狂战士护臂"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of dreamforged berserk guards"
msgid ""
"Pair of fiery red armguards, they glow red the more damage you deal, using "
"berserk knuckles, and your physical strength grows respectively."
msgstr "一对火红色的护臂，受到的伤害越多，护臂的红光就越是光芒四射，通过使用狂战士指虎，你的力量会随之增长。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of berserker boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of berserker boots"
msgstr[0] "狂战士长靴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of berserker boots"
msgid ""
"Pair of fiery red boots, they are fueled by damage you deal with berserk "
"knuckles, and increase your speed respectively."
msgstr "一双火红色的靴子，它们从狂战士指虎造成的伤害中获得能量，并随之提高你的速度。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "arcane helmet"
msgid_plural "arcane helmets"
msgstr[0] "奥术头盔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "arcane helmet"
msgid ""
"Dreamforged helmet with side protection, and carved runes outside.  It grant "
"you an ability to understand more, and with better world investigation your "
"mana regeneration grows.  Runes are just decorations actually."
msgstr "梦铸奥术头盔，可以防护侧面，外边刻有符文。它能使你更好地理解魔法和更好的研究世界，提高你的魔力再生速度。其实那些符文仅仅是装饰。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Gunslinger\""
msgid_plural "\"Gunslinger\""
msgstr[0] "“枪手”"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of ""Gunslinger""
msgid ""
"Pair of flat armguards, fully carved with numbers and crosses.  Inside the "
"left guard there is a text, cut with something sharp, that starts from \"Sent "
"onto those that escaped limbo's clutches, and unleash the rage of all hell…\"."
msgstr "这是一对雕满了数字和十字架的扁平护臂；左护臂内部刻有一段文本，用尖锐的工具刻划而成，开头是\"被送到逃脱了炼狱魔爪的人们手中，释放所有地狱之怒……\"。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "verdant helmet"
msgid_plural "verdant helmets"
msgstr[0] "verdant helmets"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "verdant helmet"
msgid ""
"A helmet made from the of living plant matter, with bark covering the outer "
"surface.  This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"A helmet made from the of living plant matter, with bark covering the outer "
"surface.  This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the "
"Cataclysm."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "verdant cuirass"
msgid_plural "verdant cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "verdant cuirasses"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "verdant cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of living plant matter, with bark covering the outer surface.  "
"This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"A cuirass made of living plant matter, with bark covering the outer surface.  "
"This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the Cataclysm."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of verdant gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of verdant gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "pairs of verdant gauntlets"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of verdant gauntlets"
msgid ""
"A pair of fingerless gauntlets made from living plant matter, with bark "
"covering the outer surface.  This is definitely not anything that could have "
"existed before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"A pair of fingerless gauntlets made from living plant matter, with bark "
"covering the outer surface.  This is definitely not anything that could have "
"existed before the Cataclysm."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of verdant leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of verdant leg guards"
msgstr[0] "pairs of verdant leg guards"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of verdant leg guards"
msgid ""
"A pair of leg guards made from living plant matter, with bark covering the "
"outer surface.  This is definitely not anything that could have existed "
"before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"A pair of leg guards made from living plant matter, with bark covering the "
"outer surface.  This is definitely not anything that could have existed "
"before the Cataclysm."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of verdant boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of verdant boots"
msgstr[0] "pairs of verdant boots"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of verdant boots"
msgid ""
"Boots made from living plant matter, with bark covering the outer surface.  "
"This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Boots made from living plant matter, with bark covering the outer surface.  "
"This is definitely not anything that could have existed before the Cataclysm."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "coat of the timely sleeper"
msgid_plural "coat of the timely sleepers"
msgstr[0] "coat of the timely sleepers"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "coat of the timely sleeper"
msgid ""
"A old-fashioned padded coat with deep pockets.  As you touch it, you feel "
"that this coat could allow you to fall asleep whenever and wherever you want."
msgstr ""
"A old-fashioned padded coat with deep pockets.  As you touch it, you feel "
"that this coat could allow you to fall asleep whenever and wherever you want."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "banner of the dark forest"
msgid_plural "banners of the dark forest"
msgstr[0] "黑暗森林旗帜"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of "banner of the dark forest"
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of a dark and gloomy forest with red eyes staring out from "
"between the trees."
msgstr "一面可识别部队忠诚度的背旗。 旗帜上的纹章是一片阴暗的森林，树丛间有一双红色的眼睛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "banner of the butterfly knight"
msgid_plural "banners of the butterfly knight"
msgstr[0] "banners of the butterfly knight"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of "banner of the butterfly knight"
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of a brilliantly colored butterfly in flight, ridden by a "
"knight in armor.  The knight is striking down a foe with a scythe while the "
"butterfly appears to have bitten the head off a different opponent."
msgstr ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of a brilliantly colored butterfly in flight, ridden by a "
"knight in armor.  The knight is striking down a foe with a scythe while the "
"butterfly appears to have bitten the head off a different opponent."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "banner of the angry darkness"
msgid_plural "banners of the angry darkness"
msgstr[0] "banners of the angry darkness"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of "banner of the angry darkness"
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of, well you aren't quite sure.  It's a dark cloud, or "
"blackness.  You feel hate radiating from this banner."
msgstr ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of, well you aren't quite sure.  It's a dark cloud, or "
"blackness.  You feel hate radiating from this banner."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "banner of starry wisdom"
msgid_plural "banners of starry wisdom"
msgstr[0] "banners of starry wisdom"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of "banner of starry wisdom"
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of the night sky shining with ancient wisdom, full of stars."
msgstr ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of the night sky shining with ancient wisdom, full of stars."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "banner of thunderous rush"
msgid_plural "banners of thunderous rush"
msgstr[0] "banners of thunderous rush"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of "banner of thunderous rush"
msgid ""
"A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on "
"this banner is of lightning striking a tower that is falling."
msgstr "一面背装旗帜，用于识别部队的忠诚度。 旗帜上的纹章是闪电击中一座正在倒塌的高塔。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/changeling.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aegis gown"
msgid_plural "aegis gowns"
msgstr[0] "庇护长袍"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "phrygian cap"
msgid_plural "phrygian caps"
msgstr[0] "弗里几亚帽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
#. ~ Description of "phrygian cap"
msgid ""
"A soft conical hat with the apex bent over.  Commonly worn in antiquity by "
"various cultures in Eastern Europe and Anatolia.  It later signified freedom "
"in both the American and French Revolutions."
msgstr "顶端弯曲的柔软圆锥形帽子。 在古代，东欧和安纳托利亚的各种文化普遍佩戴。 它后来在美国和法国大革命中都象征着自由。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blood red cap"
msgid_plural "blood red caps"
msgstr[0] "染血红帽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
#. ~ Description of "blood red cap"
msgid ""
"A soft conical hat with the apex bent over.  Commonly worn in antiquity by "
"various cultures in Eastern Europe and Anatolia.  It later signified freedom "
"in both the American and French Revolutions.  Along the brim the cap appears "
"to be the rusty red of old blood."
msgstr "顶端弯曲的柔软圆锥形帽子。 在古代，东欧和安纳托利亚的各种文化普遍佩戴。 它后来在美国和法国大革命中都象征着自由。 沿着帽檐，帽子似乎是旧血的锈红色。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bleeding_cap"
msgid "Bleeding Cap"
msgstr "流血红帽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bleeding_cap ( Bleeding Cap )"
msgid "Blood starts seeping out of the cap, down your face."
msgstr "血开始从帽子里渗出来，流到你的脸上。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bloody redcap"
msgid_plural "bloody redcap"
msgstr[0] "渗血红帽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/headgear.json
#. ~ Description of "bloody redcap"
msgid "The cap develops a fearsome aura as the blood pours back out of the fibers."
msgstr "帽子散发出某种恐怖光环，鲜血随之从纤维中渗出。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flesh roots"
msgid_plural "flesh roots"
msgstr[0] "肉根"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "flesh roots"
msgid ""
"A layer of bulging rootlike structures distending the upper layers of skin.  "
"Helps protect your body from damage."
msgstr "一层凸起的根状结构，使皮肤的上层膨胀。 有助于保护你的身体免受伤害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pebbled skin"
msgid_plural "pebbled skin"
msgstr[0] "鹅卵石皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "pebbled skin"
msgid "Your skin has begun to harden and pebbles have begun to surface."
msgstr "你的皮肤开始变硬，鹅卵石开始浮出表面。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "granite skin"
msgid_plural "granite skin"
msgstr[0] "花岗岩皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "granite skin"
msgid "Your skin has hardened into a granite like covering."
msgstr "你的皮肤硬得像花岗岩一样。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ierde eyes"
msgid_plural "ierde eyes"
msgstr[0] "山石裔之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "ierde eyes"
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colors of stone.  You are also immune "
"to the glare of the sun."
msgstr ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colors of stone.  You are also immune "
"to the glare of the sun."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone fists"
msgid_plural "stone fists"
msgstr[0] "石拳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "stone fists"
msgid ""
"Your stone-like skin means your hands hit like hammers, and can be used like "
"hammers as well."
msgstr "你像石头一样的皮肤意味着你的拳头能像锤子一样痛击敌人，同时也可以像真正的锤子一样使用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vegetal cuticle"
msgid_plural "vegetal cuticles"
msgstr[0] "植物表皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "vegetal cuticle"
msgid ""
"A pliable but hefty layer of living plant matter impregnated with various "
"waxy polymers."
msgstr "一层柔韧但厚重的活植物物质，浸有各种蜡状聚合物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "barkskin"
msgid_plural "barkskin"
msgstr[0] "树皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "barkskin"
msgid "A thin layer of bark covers your body."
msgstr "一层薄薄的树皮覆盖着你的身体。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "arvore eyes"
msgid_plural "arvore eyes"
msgstr[0] "奇木灵眼睛"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "arvore eyes"
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect the seasons: green, yellow, red, orange, or brown.  You "
"are also immune to the glare of the sun."
msgstr "你的眼睛现在能反映季节:绿色、黄色、红色、橙色或棕色。你也对刺眼的阳光免疫。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "woody thorns"
msgid_plural "woody thorns"
msgstr[0] "木质荆棘"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "woody thorns"
msgid "Your skin is covered in thick, woody thorns."
msgstr "你的皮肤上覆盖着厚厚的、木质的刺。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jagged wooden claws"
msgid_plural "jagged wooden claws"
msgstr[0] "锯齿木爪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "jagged wooden claws"
msgid "Your hands and fingers have transformed into jagged wooden claws."
msgstr "你的手和手指已经变成了锯齿状的木爪。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "burning coals skin"
msgid_plural "burning coals skin"
msgstr[0] "烧炭皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "burning coals skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has magical flames flaring out of it on occasion.  You can operate "
"in warmer climates than normal humans but begin to take damage from getting "
"wet."
msgstr "你的皮肤会适时迸发出魔法火焰。相比普通人你可以在比更温暖的气候下活动，但一旦被淋湿就会受到伤害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flaming skin"
msgid_plural "flaming skin"
msgstr[0] "燃烧皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of "flaming skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Flame Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin exudes magickal flames constantly, you can operate in almost any "
"heat now without danger but rain may be a lethal threat."
msgstr "你的皮肤不断散发着神奇的火焰，你现在几乎可以在任何高温下活动而没有危险，但雨水会是致命威胁。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "salamander eyes"
msgid_plural "salamander eyes"
msgstr[0] "火蜥蜴之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "salamander eyes"
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood, the warm red of a campfire or the searing "
"heat of an incendiary weapon.  Glare no longer affects you."
msgstr "你的眼睛现在会反映你的心情，无论是营火的暖红还是燃烧武器的灼热。眩目不再影响你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stove's caress"
msgid_plural "stove's caress"
msgstr[0] "炉之爱抚"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "stove's caress"
msgid "Heat from your hands.  You may cook with it at will."
msgstr "热量从你的手上散发。如果你愿意，你可以用它来烹饪。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "liquid skin"
msgid_plural "liquid skin"
msgstr[0] "液体皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of "liquid skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Liquid Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has become vaguely gelatinous.  Provides some extra bash defense "
"and immunity to wet effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤变得有点像凝胶。提供一些额外的重击防御和对潮湿效果的免疫力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wave skin"
msgid_plural "wave skin"
msgstr[0] "波浪表皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of "wave skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wave Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin is completely replaced by magickal water.  You have become immune "
"to acid effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤完全被神奇的水所取代。你已经对酸的作用免疫了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "undine eyes"
msgid_plural "undine eyes"
msgstr[0] "水仙子之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "undine eyes"
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colors of the deep waters.  From an "
"aquamarine blue when you are pleased to the pitch black of the depths when "
"you are angry or sad.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun and can "
"see under water."
msgstr "你的眼睛现在会用深水的颜色反映你的心情。从你高兴时的海蓝宝石，到你生气或悲伤时的漆黑深渊。你也不因阳光眩目，还可以看到水下的东西。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "water pocket"
msgid "Your skin is capable of ."
msgstr "Your skin is capable of ."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shadowstuff organ"
msgid_plural "shadowstuff organs"
msgstr[0] "shadowstuff organs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "shadowstuff organ"
msgid ""
"You have an organ inside of your body that grows a material you can create "
"improved versions of your body parts with.  You must combine it with "
"components taken from monsters with abilities you wish to gain and magickal "
"essence."
msgstr ""
"You have an organ inside of your body that grows a material you can create "
"improved versions of your body parts with.  You must combine it with "
"components taken from monsters with abilities you wish to gain and magickal "
"essence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
msgid "cloud skin"
msgid_plural "cloud skin"
msgstr[0] "云皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of "cloud skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloud Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin is clearly separate from the air around you but has become its own "
"weather system.  If someone reaches out and touches you, they will clearly "
"feel you but you look like someone might reach right through you."
msgstr "你的皮肤显然与周围的空气分离，但它已经成为自己的天气系统。如果有人伸出手来触摸你，他们会清楚地感觉到你，但你看起来像是有人直接通过你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/integrated_armor_spells.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
msgid "storm skin"
msgid_plural "storm skin"
msgstr[0] "风暴皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of "storm skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Storm Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin is a roiling storm.  Your flexibility is greatly increased, your "
"ability to ignore temperatures hot and cold have greatly increased but your "
"ability to carry objects has been reduced."
msgstr "你的皮肤就像一场翻腾的风暴。你的灵活性大大提高，你忽视冷热温度的能力大大提高，但你携带物体的能力却降低了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sylph eyes"
msgid_plural "sylph eyes"
msgstr[0] "风妖精之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "sylph eyes"
msgid ""
"Your eyes now reflect your mood in different weather patterns.  Clear blue "
"skies when you are pleased and storms when you are mad.  You are also immune "
"to the glare of the sun."
msgstr "你的眼睛现在会用不同的天气反映你的心情。 高兴时晴空万里，生气时狂风暴雨。 你还可以免受阳光的眩目。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sylph breathe without air"
msgid_plural "sylph breathe without air"
msgstr[0] "风妖精无气吐纳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "sylph breathe without air"
msgid ""
"You can now exist as your own source of oxygen.  Anywhere that you would be "
"impacted by a lack of oxygen should no longer trouble you."
msgstr "现在，你可以作为自己的氧气源。​​任何会受到缺氧影响的地方都不再会困扰你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "porcelain skin"
msgid_plural "porcelain skin"
msgstr[0] "瓷器皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of "porcelain skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Porcelain Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has smoothed and all your prior blemishes have faded away.  This "
"somewhat reduces wet effects and leads to a more durable yet harder to heal "
"body."
msgstr ""
"Your skin has smoothed and all your prior blemishes have faded away.  This "
"somewhat reduces wet effects and leads to a more durable yet harder to heal "
"body."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "latex skin"
msgid_plural "latex skin"
msgstr[0] "乳胶皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of "latex skin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Latex Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has become latex like.  While it provides additional protection and "
"attractiveness it also heals at a much slower rate."
msgstr ""
"Your skin has become latex like.  While it provides additional protection and "
"attractiveness it also heals at a much slower rate."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "homullus eyes"
msgid_plural "homullus eyes"
msgstr[0] "金灵偶之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "homullus eyes"
msgid ""
"Your eyes now stare out at the world, impassive and blank like the eyes of a "
"doll.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun."
msgstr ""
"Your eyes now stare out at the world, impassive and blank like the eyes of a "
"doll.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "essence of the makers"
msgid_plural "essence of the makers"
msgstr[0] "essence of the makers"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "essence of the makers"
msgid "The spirits of past artisans guide your hands."
msgstr "The spirits of past artisans guide your hands."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "net spider's touch"
msgid_plural "net spider's touch"
msgstr[0] "net spider's touch"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "net spider's touch"
msgid ""
"With but a touch, you can override the circuits of electronics and grant "
"yourself access."
msgstr ""
"With but a touch, you can override the circuits of electronics and grant "
"yourself access."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "organic bloodbank"
msgid_plural "organic bloodbank"
msgstr[0] "绿色血库"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "organic bloodbank"
msgid "You can vaguely sense this organ… somewhere in your body."
msgstr "你隐隐感受到这个器官……在你身体的某个部位。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vestigial lungs"
msgid_plural "vestigial lungs"
msgstr[0] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "vestigial lungs"
msgid ""
"Breathing is now something you decide to do, rather than a biological "
"necessity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "werewolf claws"
msgid_plural "werewolf claws"
msgstr[0] "werewolf claws"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "werewolf claws"
msgid "You have massive claws on your end of your furry fingers."
msgstr "You have massive claws on your end of your furry fingers."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "werewolf teeth"
msgid_plural "werewolf teeth"
msgstr[0] "werewolf teeth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "werewolf teeth"
msgid "A mouth full of vicious sharp teeth, almost twice as large as a wolf's."
msgstr "A mouth full of vicious sharp teeth, almost twice as large as a wolf's."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "brownie fur"
msgid_plural "brownie fur"
msgstr[0] "brownie fur"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "brownie fur"
msgid "Thick fur-like hair covering your entire body."
msgstr "Thick fur-like hair covering your entire body."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "stone fists"
msgid ""
"Your thick skin and nails means your hands can be used as simple tools.  You "
"also do slightly more damage when punching."
msgstr ""
"Your thick skin and nails means your hands can be used as simple tools.  You "
"also do slightly more damage when punching."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The fruit's song"
msgid_plural "The fruit's songs"
msgstr[0] "果实之歌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "The fruit's song"
msgid ""
"The song contained in the fruit is now struck in your head until it goes "
"away.  Fortunately this song is enjoyable, increasing your mood while it "
"lasts."
msgstr "果实中的歌声现在会驻足于你的脑海中，直到它离去。幸好这种歌声很悦耳，当它持续时你的心情会变好。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "The fruit's song"
msgid "Hear the song"
msgstr "Hear the song"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "The fruit's song"
msgid "The fruit's melody fills your mind."
msgstr "The fruit's melody fills your mind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "The fruit's song"
msgid "Something is preventing this fruit from working.  Please report it on github."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Well of Dreamsparks"
msgid_plural "Well of Dreamsparks"
msgstr[0] "Well of Dreamsparks"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/armor/integrated.json
#. ~ Description of "Well of Dreamsparks"
msgid "The power of mortal dreams."
msgstr "The power of mortal dreams."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mysterious fruit"
msgid_plural "mysterious fruits"
msgstr[0] "神秘的水果"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "mysterious fruit"
msgid ""
"Some sort of fruit sealed in a thick shell.  The shell is rigid but seems "
"surprisingly brittle; you could easily peel it open to see what's inside with "
"your bare hands."
msgstr ""
"Some sort of fruit sealed in a thick shell.  The shell is rigid but seems "
"surprisingly brittle; you could easily peel it open to see what's inside with "
"your bare hands."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_GACHA"
msgid "You peel open the mysterious fruit and find another whole fruit inside."
msgstr "你剥开神秘的水果，发现水果里是另一个完好的水果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sweet goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "sweet goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "甜蜜精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "sweet goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This round goblin fruit is reddish-orange with a waxy texture.  It smells "
"sweet with a hint of petrichor."
msgstr "這種圓形哥布林果實呈紅橙色，具有蠟質質地。聞起來很甜，帶有一絲初雨味。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "iridescent goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "iridescent goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "彩虹精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "iridescent goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This oblong goblin fruit shimmers slightly in a rainbow of colors.  It smells "
"like a mix of peach and freshly-baked bread."
msgstr "这个柱状的精怪果实微微带着一点彩虹色的反光，闻起来像桃子和刚出炉的面包混合起来的味道。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "silvery goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "silvery goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "银色精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "silvery goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This round goblin fruit looks like a metal sculpture but has the yielding "
"texture of a peach.  It smells like the tang in the air before a storm."
msgstr "这种精怪果实是圆的，看起来像金属制品，但手感像桃子。它闻起来像暴风雨前的水气。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spicy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "spicy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "辛辣精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "spicy goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This long, thin goblin fruit is a subdued green color but has a smell that "
"burns your nostrils."
msgstr "这种精怪果实是长条形的，颜色是柔和的绿，但闻起来能辣掉你的鼻子。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "savory goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "savory goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "可口精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "savory goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This round goblin fruit is a bluish color changing to red at the ends.  It "
"smells like a freshly-roasted hunk of meat."
msgstr "这种圆形的精怪果实是蓝色的，末端逐渐变红。它闻起来像刚烤好的肉排。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rinded goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "rinded goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "厚皮精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "rinded goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This round goblin fruit has a thick red rind with a leaf still attached to "
"the stem.  The leaf seems to move occasionally even when there is no wind."
msgstr "这种精怪果实呈圆形，有一层厚厚的红色外皮。果子上还连着叶子，即使没有风，叶子似乎也会不时飘动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "minty goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "minty goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "薄荷香精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "minty goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This dark purple goblin fruit has an overpowering minty smell.  The smell "
"even escapes sealed containers."
msgstr "这种精怪果实是深紫色的，其浓烈的薄荷味甚至连密封容器都无法完全阻挡。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cubic goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "cubic goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "方型精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "cubic goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This pale blue goblin fruit is a cube, and the edges are fine enough to leave "
"a line in your thumb when you press on them.  It smells incredibly sour."
msgstr "这种淡蓝色的精怪果实是一个立方体，边缘笔直，用拇指按在边上能留下一道直直的印子。闻起来特别酸。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "smoky goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "smoky goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "灰白精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "smoky goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This sharply-curved goblin fruit is an off-white color turning red toward the "
"ends.  It smells like the alley outside a club."
msgstr "这种具棱角的精怪果实总体是灰白色的，其末端慢慢趋近红色，闻起来就像酒吧门口那条小巷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inky goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "inky goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "漆黑精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "inky goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This large goblin fruit is such a deep black color you can't actually tell "
"exactly what shape it is.  It's roundish, but when you hold it, it seems more "
"like you're holding a hole in the fabric of the world.  It smells like an "
"apple."
msgstr "这种精怪果实很大，黑得估摸不清形状。大体上它是圆的，但当你拿着它的时候，你觉得自己拿着的比起说是水果，不如说是世界之幕的一个洞。它闻起来像苹果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toroid goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "toroid goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "环形精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "toroid goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This yellow-green goblin fruit is shaped like a donut, with six reddish stems "
"spaced equidistantly around its circumference.  You can't imagine what the "
"plant that grew this one looks like."
msgstr "这个黄绿色的精怪果实看着像一只甜甜圈，外层圆周等距排列六个红色的果柄。你实在想不出怎样的植物会结出这种果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Dolm is a fictional color from the 1920 book "A Voyage to Arcturus"
#. that's a mix of infrared and blue.
msgid "dolm goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "dolm goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "Dolm色精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "dolm goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This teardrop-shaped goblin fruit hurts to look at.  Sometimes it's a dark "
"blue, sometimes it's a feverish red, and sometimes it's a mix of the two that "
"you would previously have sworn could not exist.  It smells faintly peppery "
"with a hint of lemon."
msgstr ""
"这种精怪果实是泪滴状的，看着就令人难过。它的颜色有时是深蓝色，有时是疯狂的红。有时它是二者混合的颜色，你曾发誓这不可能。它闻起来有淡淡的胡椒味和一点柠檬香气"
"。\n"
"注：Dolm是1920年出版的《大角星之旅》一书中虚构的一种颜色，它是红外线和蓝色的混合色。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spikey goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "spikey goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "尖刺精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "spikey goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This dark-colored goblin fruit is covered in spikes like a pineapple.  Unlike "
"a pineapple, the spikes are yielding and seem part of the fruit, not a rind.  "
"It smells of freshly-cut grass."
msgstr "这种深色的精怪果实上长满了像菠萝一样的尖刺。与菠萝不同的是，这些刺是软的，看着像是果实的一部分，而非果皮。它闻起来像新割的草地。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sanguine goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "sanguine goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "血红精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "sanguine goblin fruit"
msgid "A dark red goblin fruit with a heavy iron smell.  It feels warm to the touch."
msgstr "这种精怪果实是暗红色的，有很重的铁锈味。它摸着很温暖。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "translucent goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "translucent goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "透明精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "translucent goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This goblin fruit looks like a globe of water with seeds and a stem suspended "
"within it.  Despite that, it feels like kiwi, with a slight fuzz and no "
"moisture left on your fingers when you touch it.  It smells like roses."
msgstr ""
"这种精怪果实看起来像一个装满水的透明地球仪，你能看到其中的种子和横穿的果柄。尽管如此，它摸起来像猕猴桃，有轻微的的粗糙质感，指尖也不会因此留下水痕。它闻起来"
"像玫瑰。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inconspicuous goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "inconspicuous goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "普通精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "inconspicuous goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This goblin fruit looks like a pear and feels like a pear and smells exactly "
"like a pear.  You have no idea how it tastes because the instant you put your "
"tongue to it, your entire mouth goes numb."
msgstr "这种精怪果实看着像梨，摸着像梨，闻起来分明就是梨。但你并不清楚它味道如何，因为舌头一碰它就麻了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crumbly goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "crumbly goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "脆弱精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "crumbly goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This large, curved goblin fruit is a dark blue color and feels like it's "
"already on the verge of rotting.  It takes very little pressure for your "
"fingers to bruise the skin and the flesh inside flakes off when you touch it. "
" It smells like sun-ripened strawberries."
msgstr "这种大而弯曲的精怪果实呈深蓝色，看着感觉马上要腐烂了。只需轻轻一碰便能压伤它的果皮，剥落它的果肉。它闻起来像自然成熟的草莓。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "star-shaped goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "star-shaped goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "星型精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "star-shaped goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This greenish-white goblin fruit is shaped like a star in a much more literal "
"way than a starfruit.  It's almost like if a starfish was an apple.  It "
"smells like freshly-laundered clothing."
msgstr "这种绿调白色的精怪果实比杨桃更像一颗星星，就字面意思而言，它看起来就好像是由海星变来的水果。它闻起来像刚洗好的衣服。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shadowy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "shadowy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "阴影精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "shadowy goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This greyish goblin fruit is shaped like a pear, if pears had scales like a "
"pinecone.  There is a pulpy meat underneath the scales."
msgstr ""
"This greyish goblin fruit is shaped like a pear, if pears had scales like a "
"pinecone.  There is a pulpy meat underneath the scales."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shiny goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "shiny goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "发光精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "shiny goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This round blue goblin fruit glows bright enough to read by.  The light "
"flickers like firelight, even when the fruit is simply placed on the table.  "
"It smells like pine needles soaked in strong alcohol."
msgstr "这种圆形的蓝色精怪果实发着光，亮度足以阅读。只是把它简单地放在桌子上，光芒便跃动如炉火。闻起来像烈酒浸过的松针。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_GIANT_GROWTH"
msgid "You eat the goblin fruit but nothing happens.  Oh well."
msgstr "你吃下了精怪果实，但什么都没发生。哎，可惜。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fizzy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "fizzy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "起泡精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "fizzy goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This small brown goblin fruit constantly forms bubbles that erupt from its "
"skin.  Despite that, its surface remains smooth at all times.  It has a "
"subtle, sugary smell."
msgstr ""
"This small brown goblin fruit constantly forms bubbles that erupt from its "
"skin.  Despite that, its surface remains smooth at all times.  It has a "
"subtle, sugary smell."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "unnoticeable goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "unnoticeable goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "隐秘精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "unnoticeable goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This goblin fruit is hard to perceive.  You think it's black, you believe "
"it's small and you're certain it's near you, but all its other details slip "
"from your memory the instant you stop looking at this fruit."
msgstr ""
"This goblin fruit is hard to perceive.  You think it's black, you believe "
"it's small and you're certain it's near you, but all its other details slip "
"from your memory the instant you stop looking at this fruit."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "heavy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "沉重精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This green goblin fruit is much heavier than it should be.  Its scent is "
"heavy, pressing down your nose and throat as you smell it."
msgstr ""
"This green goblin fruit is much heavier than it should be.  Its scent is "
"heavy, pressing down your nose and throat as you smell it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soothing goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "soothing goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "抚慰精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "soothing goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This sky blue fruit slows the thoughts racing in your mind a little as you "
"stare at it, making you feel sightly more calm until you put it away."
msgstr ""
"This sky blue fruit slows the thoughts racing in your mind a little as you "
"stare at it, making you feel sightly more calm until you put it away."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "melodious goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "melodious goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "旋律精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "melodious goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This sinewy, beak-shaped fruit produces a faint melody.  This melody grows a "
"little louder when you bring the fruit next to your mouth."
msgstr ""
"This sinewy, beak-shaped fruit produces a faint melody.  This melody grows a "
"little louder when you bring the fruit next to your mouth."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MUSIC"
msgid "The fruit's melody fills your head."
msgstr "果实的旋律充斥在你的脑海中。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MUSIC"
msgid ""
"Another song is already struck in your head and won't share its space with "
"another."
msgstr "有一首歌已经盘踞于你的脑海，不愿为另一首让出空间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MUSIC_REMOVE"
msgid "The song in your head fades."
msgstr "The song in your head fades."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mirror goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "mirror goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "镜面精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "mirror goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"You can see your reflection in the mirror-like surface of this fruit.  This "
"reflection of you seems angrier, closer to a feral human than to your own "
"image."
msgstr ""
"You can see your reflection in the mirror-like surface of this fruit.  This "
"reflection of you seems angrier, closer to a feral human than to your own "
"image."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "camouflaged goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "camouflaged goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "伪装精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "camouflaged goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"The many colors of this oblong fruit shift to mimic what's behind it, trying "
"to imitate other things with the best of its ability."
msgstr ""
"The many colors of this oblong fruit shift to mimic what's behind it, trying "
"to imitate other things with the best of its ability."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bitter goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "bitter goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "苦涩精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "bitter goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit wrapped in barbed vines fills you with bitterness as you hold it.  "
"It slightly resists inertia as you move it, as if it moved through molasses."
msgstr ""
"This fruit wrapped in barbed vines fills you with bitterness as you hold it.  "
"It slightly resists inertia as you move it, as if it moved through molasses."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "evasive goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "evasive goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "逃避精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "evasive goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This yellow half-liquid fruit is hard to hold, as it actively tries to escape "
"your grasp.  You hope it won't try to escape your innards after you eat it."
msgstr ""
"This yellow half-liquid fruit is hard to hold, as it actively tries to escape "
"your grasp.  You hope it won't try to escape your innards after you eat it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vein-filled goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "vein-filled goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "叶脉精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "vein-filled goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This translucent fruit is filled with a network of tubes not unlike veins and "
"arteries.  Judging by the way its brown surface turns blue when bruised, it "
"probably contains a fluid similar to blood."
msgstr ""
"This translucent fruit is filled with a network of tubes not unlike veins and "
"arteries.  Judging by the way its brown surface turns blue when bruised, it "
"probably contains a fluid similar to blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_BLOOD_GAIN"
msgid "This isn't the blood you need."
msgstr "This isn't the blood you need."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_BLOOD_GAIN"
msgid "You feel a pressure in your veins, then it passes."
msgstr "You feel a pressure in your veins, then it passes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "dazzling goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "dazzling goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "眩目精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "dazzling goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit shines a light bright enough to be painful to look at.  From the "
"little you can see, it appears to be a purple ovoid fruit."
msgstr ""
"This fruit shines a light bright enough to be painful to look at.  From the "
"little you can see, it appears to be a purple ovoid fruit."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rotating goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "rotating goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "旋转精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "rotating goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This spiraled fruit ceaselessly spins on itself.  No matter how tight your "
"grasp, you cannot stop its spinning."
msgstr ""
"This spiraled fruit ceaselessly spins on itself.  No matter how tight your "
"grasp, you cannot stop its spinning."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pulsating goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "pulsating goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "脉动精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "pulsating goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit pulses at regular intervals like a beating heart.  As you hold it "
"its rhythm changes, mimicking your own heart."
msgstr ""
"This fruit pulses at regular intervals like a beating heart.  As you hold it "
"its rhythm changes, mimicking your own heart."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "understandable goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "understandable goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "理解精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "understandable goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"You understand everything about this pale green fruit.  You know that it will "
"taste like an apple and you know that it will have the inner structure of a "
"kiwi, the texture of a durian, the smell of a dragon fruit and the colors of "
"an orange.  you also know that eating it will help you understand anything "
"you could try to learn for a few hours."
msgstr ""
"You understand everything about this pale green fruit.  You know that it will "
"taste like an apple and you know that it will have the inner structure of a "
"kiwi, the texture of a durian, the smell of a dragon fruit and the colors of "
"an orange.  you also know that eating it will help you understand anything "
"you could try to learn for a few hours."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pupating goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "pupating goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "蛹状精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "pupating goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This dark red half-liquid fruit fills you with dread and sadness as it "
"endlessly tries to split but fails to do so.  You sense that it wants you to "
"eat it, but you're not sure if it would be worth it."
msgstr ""
"This dark red half-liquid fruit fills you with dread and sadness as it "
"endlessly tries to split but fails to do so.  You sense that it wants you to "
"eat it, but you're not sure if it would be worth it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_SPAWN_MORE_FRUITS"
msgid ""
"Some hard chunks of that horrible fruit jump from your mouth and turn into "
"fresh goblin fruits."
msgstr ""
"Some hard chunks of that horrible fruit jump from your mouth and turn into "
"fresh goblin fruits."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "patchwork goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "patchwork goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "拼凑精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "patchwork goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is closer to an art project than to a fruit.  Numerous stitches "
"hold together red-tinted parts of many different fruits so tightly it acts as "
"a single, consistent whole."
msgstr ""
"This fruit is closer to an art project than to a fruit.  Numerous stitches "
"hold together red-tinted parts of many different fruits so tightly it acts as "
"a single, consistent whole."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pristine goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "pristine goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "崭新精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "pristine goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit has a perfectly unblemished surface that cannot be tarnished or "
"dirtied, no matter what happens to it."
msgstr ""
"This fruit has a perfectly unblemished surface that cannot be tarnished or "
"dirtied, no matter what happens to it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "numbing goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "numbing goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "麻木精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "numbing goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This gray dented fruit numbs your fingers as you hold it and its smell numbs "
"your nose the same way."
msgstr ""
"This gray dented fruit numbs your fingers as you hold it and its smell numbs "
"your nose the same way."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_NUMB"
msgid "Everything goes numb."
msgstr "Everything goes numb."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_NUMB"
msgid "You don't feel more numb than you currently are."
msgstr "You don't feel more numb than you currently are."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_NUMB_REMOVE"
msgid "The numbness goes away."
msgstr "The numbness goes away."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "whispering goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "whispering goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "低语精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "whispering goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is similar to a sphere of smoke.  Faint sounds come from this "
"fruit.  They almost sound like whispers."
msgstr ""
"This fruit is similar to a sphere of smoke.  Faint sounds come from this "
"fruit.  They almost sound like whispers."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_SPAWN_SHADOWS"
msgid "A few shadows emerge from the ground near you."
msgstr "A few shadows emerge from the ground near you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "recoloring goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "recoloring goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "渐变精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "recoloring goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This rectangle fruit smells of lavender and has a mushy texture.  Its colors "
"grow more vibrant for a second when you blink."
msgstr ""
"This rectangle fruit smells of lavender and has a mushy texture.  Its colors "
"grow more vibrant for a second when you blink."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_HEAL_AFTER_SLEEP_HEALING"
msgid "Some of the aches of yesterday are gone."
msgstr "Some of the aches of yesterday are gone."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fractal goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "fractal goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "分型精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "fractal goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This spherical fruit is made of smaller versions of itself, which are also "
"made of smaller versions of themselves.  Should you have a microscope, you "
"could look at the fractal as it becomes smaller and smaller."
msgstr ""
"This spherical fruit is made of smaller versions of itself, which are also "
"made of smaller versions of themselves.  Should you have a microscope, you "
"could look at the fractal as it becomes smaller and smaller."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sticky goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "sticky goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "黏性精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "sticky goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"Reeking of glass cleaner, this disk-shaped fruit sticks to anything it "
"touches.  Despite this, you have no issue removing any dust sticking to it."
msgstr ""
"Reeking of glass cleaner, this disk-shaped fruit sticks to anything it "
"touches.  Despite this, you have no issue removing any dust sticking to it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pressurized goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "pressurized goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "高压精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "pressurized goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This capsule-shaped goblin fruit behaves as a pressurized tank when you press "
"its surface with your finger.  Fortunately, it doesn't appear to be able to "
"explode if pierced or bitten."
msgstr ""
"This capsule-shaped goblin fruit behaves as a pressurized tank when you press "
"its surface with your finger.  Fortunately, it doesn't appear to be able to "
"explode if pierced or bitten."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "balloon goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "balloon goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "气球精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "balloon goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is nothing more than a thin layer of fruit filled with air.  It "
"has a heady aroma that makes you a little lightheaded."
msgstr ""
"This fruit is nothing more than a thin layer of fruit filled with air.  It "
"has a heady aroma that makes you a little lightheaded."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boring goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "boring goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "无趣精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "boring goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is the most boring thing you've ever seen.  Everything about it is "
"boring: its drab dark brown color, its smell, its lack of feature, even its "
"taste is boring.  It's not a good fruit.  It's not a bad fruit.  It's just "
"boring."
msgstr ""
"This fruit is the most boring thing you've ever seen.  Everything about it is "
"boring: its drab dark brown color, its smell, its lack of feature, even its "
"taste is boring.  It's not a good fruit.  It's not a bad fruit.  It's just "
"boring."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mud-covered goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "mud-covered goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "覆泥精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "mud-covered goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is always covered in fresh mud.  You try to wipe it away, but it "
"always come back."
msgstr ""
"This fruit is always covered in fresh mud.  You try to wipe it away, but it "
"always come back."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cavernous goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "cavernous goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "空洞精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "cavernous goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit has the shape of a hollow cylinder.  It has a notable smell of "
"freshly-upturned earth."
msgstr ""
"This fruit has the shape of a hollow cylinder.  It has a notable smell of "
"freshly-upturned earth."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "arguing goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "arguing goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "争论精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "arguing goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit reminds you of a small bowling ball.  You can hear it as it tries "
"to convince you to not eat it.  It won't succeed, right?"
msgstr ""
"This fruit reminds you of a small bowling ball.  You can hear it as it tries "
"to convince you to not eat it.  It won't succeed, right?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "urchin goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "urchin goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "海胆精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "urchin goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This spherical fruit bears many spines, yet all of of them are dulled.  It "
"smells faintly of cinnamon and aftershave."
msgstr ""
"This spherical fruit bears many spines, yet all of of them are dulled.  It "
"smells faintly of cinnamon and aftershave."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rushing goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "rushing goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "环线精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "rushing goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This pale fruit is surrounded by small lines of wind revolving around it.  "
"The lines grow thicker the further the fruit is from the ground."
msgstr ""
"This pale fruit is surrounded by small lines of wind revolving around it.  "
"The lines grow thicker the further the fruit is from the ground."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sapphire goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "sapphire goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "宝石精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "sapphire goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit is easily mistakable for a fist-sized sapphire.  Its color, "
"rigidity and facets bring to mind a gemstone, unlike its green stem."
msgstr ""
"This fruit is easily mistakable for a fist-sized sapphire.  Its color, "
"rigidity and facets bring to mind a gemstone, unlike its green stem."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "shy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "含羞精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "shy goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit shaped akin to a chunk torn from a beehive is warm, but becomes "
"cold as long as anyone is looking at it.  It has a strong odor, between maple "
"and oak, but only when unobserved."
msgstr ""
"This fruit shaped akin to a chunk torn from a beehive is warm, but becomes "
"cold as long as anyone is looking at it.  It has a strong odor, between maple "
"and oak, but only when unobserved."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "weeping goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "weeping goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "哭泣精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "weeping goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This blue tear-shaped fruit drips with water.  You try to collect it, but it "
"fades away before touching the container."
msgstr ""
"This blue tear-shaped fruit drips with water.  You try to collect it, but it "
"fades away before touching the container."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CALL_RAIN"
msgid "A few droplets fall from the sky, but nothing more happen."
msgstr "A few droplets fall from the sky, but nothing more happen."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CALL_RAIN_TRUE"
msgid "A light drizzle starts falling from the sky."
msgstr "A light drizzle starts falling from the sky."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_STOP_RAIN"
msgid "The drizzle the fruit caused ends."
msgstr "The drizzle the fruit caused ends."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "furry goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "furry goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "绒毛精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "furry goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit what a kiwi would be if kiwi had decimeter-long beige fur.  It "
"smells of steel and lilies."
msgstr ""
"This fruit what a kiwi would be if kiwi had decimeter-long beige fur.  It "
"smells of steel and lilies."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE"
msgid "Nearby animals tolerate your presence a little more."
msgstr "Nearby animals tolerate your presence a little more."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE"
msgid "Animals can't tolerate your presence more than they are currently doing."
msgstr "Animals can't tolerate your presence more than they are currently doing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE_REMOVE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE_ATTACK_RANGED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "GOBLIN_FRUIT_ANIMAL_IGNORE_ATTACK_MELEE"
msgid "Nearby animals stop ignoring your presence."
msgstr "Nearby animals stop ignoring your presence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "remolding goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "remolding goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "重塑精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "remolding goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This gray fruit is hard to pierce, as it reshapes itself to close any hole "
"you make in it.  Ironically, the fruit keeps tearing its surface apart, "
"making its reshaping a sisyphean task."
msgstr ""
"This gray fruit is hard to pierce, as it reshapes itself to close any hole "
"you make in it.  Ironically, the fruit keeps tearing its surface apart, "
"making its reshaping a sisyphean task."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "The bones of your left arm mend together in an instant!"
msgstr "The bones of your left arm mend together in an instant!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "The bones of your right arm mend together in an instant!"
msgstr "The bones of your right arm mend together in an instant!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "The bones of your left leg mend together in an instant!"
msgstr "The bones of your left leg mend together in an instant!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "The bones of your right leg mend together in an instant!"
msgstr "The bones of your right leg mend together in an instant!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_MEND_BONE"
msgid "You feel your bones itch for a moment, but nothing happens."
msgstr "You feel your bones itch for a moment, but nothing happens."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cloudy goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "cloudy goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "云彩精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Description of "cloudy goblin fruit"
msgid ""
"This fruit looks like a crystal ball filled with clouds.  When you look into "
"it, you see fragments of your most intense dreams."
msgstr "这种水果看起来像一个装满云的水晶球。当你审视它时，你会看到你最激烈的梦的碎片。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "Not even the power of this fruit could grant you access to dream magic."
msgstr "即使是这种水果的力量也无法让你获得来自梦的魔力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid ""
"Your dreams are still digesting another cloudy fruit, preventing this one "
"from having any effect."
msgstr ""
"Your dreams are still digesting another cloudy fruit, preventing this one "
"from having any effect."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "Your mind fills with dreams of an intensity you have never seen before!"
msgstr "Your mind fills with dreams of an intensity you have never seen before!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "Your mind fills with oddly real dreams!"
msgstr "Your mind fills with oddly real dreams!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in false effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "Your mind fills with dreams you could make real!"
msgstr "Your mind fills with dreams you could make real!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "You feel your Eater potential grow!"
msgstr "You feel your Eater potential grow!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_CURE_DREAMLESS"
msgid "You feel your Dreamer potential grow!"
msgstr "You feel your Dreamer potential grow!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "eXtra strength aspirin"
msgid_plural "eXtra strength aspirins"
msgstr[0] "强效阿司匹林"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "eXtra strength aspirin"
msgid "Alchemically altered aspirin.  Take to relieve pain and injury."
msgstr "用炼金术改进的阿司匹林，服用以减轻疼痛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horny rhino pill"
msgid_plural "horny rhino pills"
msgstr[0] "犀角丸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "horny rhino pill"
msgid ""
"DOES YOUR PARTNER FIND YOUR LACK OF SEXUAL POTENCY PATHETIC?!??!  SMASH YOUR "
"BEDROOM LIKE A WILD ANIMAL ALL NIGHT LONG!!!  -ingredients not confirmed with "
"the FDA."
msgstr "你的伴侣是否觉得你性能力匮乏到可悲？！？？！如野兽般彻底不眠地砸烂你的卧室！！！- 成分未经 FDA 确认。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "horny rhino pill"
#, c-format
msgid "You take the %s.  Your skin feels like it is vibrating."
msgstr "你服用了%s。你的皮肤感觉在振动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blood of the saints"
msgid_plural "blood of the saints"
msgstr[0] "圣血"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "learn_blood_of_saints"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "learn_blood_of_saints_2"
#. ~ Message of spell "learn_blood_of_saints ( Blood of Saints )"
msgid "You imbibed the concoction and you feel your veins flex in a warm glow."
msgstr "你吸收了混合物，你感觉到你的静脉在温暖的光芒中弯曲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hawthorn petals"
msgid_plural "hawthorn petals"
msgstr[0] "山楂花瓣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "hawthorn petals"
msgid "A small salads worth of hawthorn petals."
msgstr "一小份山楂花瓣沙拉。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hawthorn berries"
msgid_plural "hawthorn berries"
msgstr[0] "山楂浆果"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "hawthorn berries"
msgid ""
"Dense clusters of edible red berries grow enormously during autumn, but try "
"not to eat the seeds as they contain cyanide.  Too tart to be very enjoyable "
"they are often used in jams and jellies."
msgstr "在秋季，密集的可食用红色浆果簇大量生长，但尽量不要吃种子，因为它们含有氰化物。 太酸了，不能非常愉快，它们经常用于果酱和果冻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fig"
msgid_plural "figs"
msgstr[0] "无花果"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "fig"
msgid ""
"Figs are a unique fruit resembling a teardrop.  They're about the size of "
"your thumb, filled with hundreds of tiny seeds, and have an edible purple or "
"green peel.  The flesh of the fruit is pink and has a mild, sweet taste.  The "
"scientific name for the fig is Ficus carica."
msgstr ""
"Figs are a unique fruit resembling a teardrop.  They're about the size of "
"your thumb, filled with hundreds of tiny seeds, and have an edible purple or "
"green peel.  The flesh of the fruit is pink and has a mild, sweet taste.  The "
"scientific name for the fig is Ficus carica."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "elder ginseng"
msgid_plural "several elder ginseng"
msgstr[0] "上古人参"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "elder ginseng"
msgid ""
"A clump of off white roots in the shape of a humanoid body.  It feels strange "
"to the touch, almost alive."
msgstr "一团灰白色的人形根茎。摸起来感觉很奇特，像活的一样。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "helmet of creative juices"
msgid_plural "helmets of creative juices"
msgstr[0] "创造力提取头盔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "helmet of creative juices"
msgid ""
"The helmet of creative juices may look like a child's homemade toy, but its "
"effects when turned on are real enough.  While wearing it, your thoughts are "
"buffered from the outside world by a soft white noise that varies from person "
"to person as to what they actually hear.  Some hear the ocean, a fan blowing "
"or paper crumpling.  Whatever the sound, it helps you to think faster and "
"more creatively than before."
msgstr ""
"这个创造力提取头盔或许看上去像小孩的自制玩具，但它开启后的效果却足够真实。当戴上它时，你的思想被一种柔和的白噪声所缓冲，而这种白噪声因人而异，因为他们实际上"
"听到了什么。 有些人听到的是大海，风扇的声音或纸张的破碎声。 不管是什么声音，它都能帮助你比以前更快、更有创造性地思考。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "helmet of creative juices"
msgid "The helmet turns on."
msgstr "头盔启动了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "helmet of creative juices (on)"
msgid_plural "helmets of creative juices (on)"
msgstr[0] "创造力提取头盔（开）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "helmet of creative juices (on)"
msgid "The helmet turns off."
msgstr "头盔关闭了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vacuum backpack"
msgid_plural "vacuum backpacks"
msgstr[0] "真空背包"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "vacuum backpack"
msgid ""
"A backpack with lot of light aluminum bars inside that hold a perfect vacuum, "
"making the backpack much lighter than it should be."
msgstr "这个背包内有大量空心铝棒，铝棒内的完美真空让背包比正常情况下更轻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leg weight suspension system"
msgid_plural "leg weight suspension systems"
msgstr[0] "腿部悬挂系统"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leg weight suspension system"
msgid ""
"Compact leg attachments that distribute your weight onto the ground nearby "
"using some kind of force.  It makes you leave giant spherical footprints, but "
"makes carrying heavy weight much easier."
msgstr ""
"Compact leg attachments that distribute your weight onto the ground nearby "
"using some kind of force.  It makes you leave giant spherical footprints, but "
"makes carrying heavy weight much easier."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "leg weight suspension system"
msgid "You turn on the weight suspension system."
msgstr "你启动了悬挂系统。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "leg weight suspension system"
msgid "You turn off the weight suspension system."
msgstr "你关闭了悬挂系统。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "jump driver"
msgid_plural "jump drivers"
msgstr[0] "跳跃驱动靴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "jump driver"
msgid ""
"Heavily mechanized boots with small integrated battery slot inside.  Upon "
"activation make you jump higher and farther."
msgstr "高度机械化的靴子，内有小型内置电池接口。激活时让你跳得更高更远。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "force shield"
msgid_plural "force shields"
msgstr[0] "力场护盾"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "force shield"
msgid ""
"A small, thin torus with a huge battery case, and a belt.  You can activate "
"it to emit a field that covers your whole body which will decelerate all "
"objects it touches."
msgstr "小而薄的环形装置，配有腰带和巨大的电池盒。 你可以启动它，使其发出一个覆盖全身的场，并使其接触到的所有物体减速。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "force shield"
msgid "The torus start to emit an invisible waves."
msgstr "环带开始发出无形的波动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "force shield (on)"
msgid_plural "force shields (on)"
msgstr[0] "力场护盾（开）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "force shield (on)"
msgid "Torus stops working."
msgstr "环带停止工作。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electronic halo"
msgid_plural "electronic halos"
msgstr[0] "电子光环"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "electronic halo"
msgid ""
"A compact crown boasting a built-in processor and several tiny projectors "
"that beam information directly onto your eye.  It's equipped with enough "
"internal storage and RAM to support a basic AI.  Along with multiple cameras "
"providing 360-degree coverage, this setup enables you to tackle tasks far "
"more efficiently than before.  Plus, there's a battle mode that activates an "
"energy-intensive radiation detector."
msgstr ""
"A compact crown boasting a built-in processor and several tiny projectors "
"that beam information directly onto your eye.  It's equipped with enough "
"internal storage and RAM to support a basic AI.  Along with multiple cameras "
"providing 360-degree coverage, this setup enables you to tackle tasks far "
"more efficiently than before.  Plus, there's a battle mode that activates an "
"energy-intensive radiation detector."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "electronic halo"
msgid "Turn on a battle mode"
msgstr "启动战斗模式"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "electronic halo"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item ""Overture""
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wolf's mask"
msgid "Turn on."
msgstr "启动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "electronic halo"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item ""Overture""
msgid "The halo's charge is too low."
msgstr "光环的电量太低了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electronic halo (on)"
msgid_plural "electronic halos (on)"
msgstr[0] "电子光环（开）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "electronic halo (on)"
msgid "Turn off battle mode"
msgstr "关闭战斗模式"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "electronic halo (on)"
msgid "Turn off."
msgstr "关闭。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy CQC system"
msgid_plural "heavy CQC systems"
msgstr[0] "重型近战系统"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy CQC system"
msgid ""
"This robust system begins at your hands, where it features a squarish steel "
"frame enhanced with strategic protrusions to amplify impact damage by "
"focusing the point of contact.  It extends along your forearms with thick, "
"hardened steel shields protecting both your limbs and the underlying "
"hydraulic mechanisms.  Aluminum tubes channel these hydraulics up into your "
"upper arms, culminating at your back where the central hub for the hydraulic "
"servos is located.  While the system recovers some energy with each movement, "
"its substantial weight and bulk significantly limit the use of your hands for "
"anything else."
msgstr ""
"This robust system begins at your hands, where it features a squarish steel "
"frame enhanced with strategic protrusions to amplify impact damage by "
"focusing the point of contact.  It extends along your forearms with thick, "
"hardened steel shields protecting both your limbs and the underlying "
"hydraulic mechanisms.  Aluminum tubes channel these hydraulics up into your "
"upper arms, culminating at your back where the central hub for the hydraulic "
"servos is located.  While the system recovers some energy with each movement, "
"its substantial weight and bulk significantly limit the use of your hands for "
"anything else."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "advanced heavy CQC system"
msgid_plural "advanced heavy CQC systems"
msgstr[0] "高级重型近战系统"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "advanced heavy CQC system"
msgid ""
"An advanced version of the heavy CQC system.  It contain a self-recharging "
"pneumatic tank that slowly builds pressure that you can use in a fight."
msgstr "重型近战系统的高级版本。它包含一个可自我充能的气缸，可以缓慢地构建起压力，并在战斗中使用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "advanced heavy CQC system"
msgid "Activate to read the file"
msgstr "啟動以讀取檔案"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Overture\""
msgid_plural "\"Overtures\""
msgstr[0] "“序曲”"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of ""Overture""
msgid ""
"A bulky mess of coils and wires that goes from your fists to your shoulder, "
"and a slot for a small battery behind the elbow.  Upon activation it will "
"start to emit huge electrical charges, frying your enemies when attacked in "
"melee."
msgstr ""
"A bulky mess of coils and wires that goes from your fists to your shoulder, "
"and a slot for a small battery behind the elbow.  Upon activation it will "
"start to emit huge electrical charges, frying your enemies when attacked in "
"melee."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item ""Overture""
msgid "Turn on the overture"
msgstr "启动序曲"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Overture\" (on)"
msgid_plural "\"Overtures\" (on)"
msgstr[0] "“序曲”（开）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item ""Overture" (on)"
msgid "The fist turns off."
msgstr "拳套关闭了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wolf's mask"
msgid_plural "wolf's masks"
msgstr[0] "狼面具"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "wolf's mask"
msgid ""
"A huge, respirator-like mask covering the whole head except for the right "
"eye.  Upon activation it protects you lungs from toxic gases as well as "
"improving your breathing and stamina."
msgstr ""
"A huge, respirator-like mask covering the whole head except for the right "
"eye.  Upon activation it protects you lungs from toxic gases as well as "
"improving your breathing and stamina."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "wolf's mask"
msgid "Turn on the mask"
msgstr "启动面具"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "wolf's mask"
msgid "The mask's charge is too low."
msgstr "面具的电量太低了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wolf's mask (on)"
msgid_plural "wolf's masks (on)"
msgstr[0] "狼面具（开）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wolf's mask (on)"
msgid "The mask stops working."
msgstr "面具关闭了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magnetic holster"
msgid_plural "magnetic holsters"
msgstr[0] "磁力枪套"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "magnetic holster"
msgid ""
"A long strap with small, powerful gravity field emitters on the surface.  "
"Allows one to strap and carry almost anything."
msgstr "长长的背带表面装有小而有力的重力场发射器。几乎可以捆绑和携带任何物品。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Injury Reset Device"
msgid_plural "Injury Reset Devices"
msgstr[0] "伤痛重置装置"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Injury Reset Device"
msgid ""
"A bulky wristwatch that attaches to your arm.  Using it will revert the last "
"injury that you have suffered.  Also tells the time."
msgstr "一只绑在你手臂上的笨重腕表。使用它可以回溯你最后受到的伤，同时也可以显示当前时间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/armor.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "Injury Reset Device"
msgid "Reverse your last injury."
msgstr "回溯你最后的伤痛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive sniper bot"
msgid_plural "inactive sniper bots"
msgstr[0] "狙击机器人（关）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive sniper bot"
msgid ""
"A compressed sniper sentry.  Ludicrous, physical law violating compression "
"allows you to fit them into a small metal cylinder, but the weight "
"compression is not as effective."
msgstr "压缩的狙击机器人。可笑的是，违反物理定律的压缩允许将它们放入小的金属圆筒中，但重量压缩却没有那么有效。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive shotgun bot"
msgid_plural "inactive shotgun bots"
msgstr[0] "霰弹机器人（关）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive shotgun bot"
msgid ""
"A compressed shotgun sentry.  Ludicrous, physical law violating compression "
"allows you to fit them into a small metal cylinder, but the weight "
"compression is not as effective."
msgstr "压缩的霰弹枪机器人。可笑的是，违反物理定律的压缩允许将它们放入小的金属圆筒中，但重量压缩却没有那么有效。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive melee bot"
msgid_plural "inactive melee bots"
msgstr[0] "近战机器人（关）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive melee bot"
msgid ""
"A compressed melee sentry.  Ludicrous, physical law violating compression "
"allows you to fit them into a small metal cylinder, but the weight "
"compression is not as effective."
msgstr "压缩的近战机器人。可笑的是，违反物理定律的压缩允许将它们放入小的金属圆筒中，但重量压缩却没有那么有效。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vancian bill"
msgid_plural "vancian bills"
msgstr[0] "万斯纸币"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Description of "vancian bill"
msgid ""
"A small bill covered in odd symbols.  Tearing it will in turn cause a small "
"dimensional tear located within a nearby entity.  Despite only lasting a few "
"milliseconds, an internal tear in reality should be enough to kill anything.  "
"Hopefully."
msgstr ""
"A small bill covered in odd symbols.  Tearing it will in turn cause a small "
"dimensional tear located within a nearby entity.  Despite only lasting a few "
"milliseconds, an internal tear in reality should be enough to kill anything.  "
"Hopefully."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cosmic dagwood"
msgid_plural "cosmic dagwoods"
msgstr[0] "cosmic dagwoods"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Description of "cosmic dagwood"
msgid ""
"The greatest sandwich that will ever be made, in this universe and the next.  "
"A quadruple stacker with beer-batter fried poultry, caramel chocolate chili, "
"and topped with a specially made sauce of egg, blue cheese, honey mustard, "
"BBQ and extremely concentrated vinegar that oozes down the other layers, "
"before the entire thing is pressed and grilled in a waffle iron and finished "
"with a garnish of gold and silver flakes and a fresh fruit skewered on top.  "
"All the gourmet chefs in existence could not even conceive such a combination "
"which, by all means, should not taste this good - But you did it.  And you "
"don't plan on sharing."
msgstr ""
"The greatest sandwich that will ever be made, in this universe and the next.  "
"A quadruple stacker with beer-batter fried poultry, caramel chocolate chili, "
"and topped with a specially made sauce of egg, blue cheese, honey mustard, "
"BBQ and extremely concentrated vinegar that oozes down the other layers, "
"before the entire thing is pressed and grilled in a waffle iron and finished "
"with a garnish of gold and silver flakes and a fresh fruit skewered on top.  "
"All the gourmet chefs in existence could not even conceive such a combination "
"which, by all means, should not taste this good - But you did it.  And you "
"don't plan on sharing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "netherium warp grenade"
msgid_plural "netherium warp grenades"
msgstr[0] "netherium warp grenades"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Description of "netherium warp grenade"
msgid ""
"A homemade general purpose reality implosion device.  Use this item to pull "
"the pin and start the fuse.  After 5 seconds, everything nearby will be "
"violently sliced, warped, aged, and partially teleported straight into many "
"different sections of the nether.  After a short moment of instant death, the "
"dimensional gap will probably heal.  Probably."
msgstr ""
"A homemade general purpose reality implosion device.  Use this item to pull "
"the pin and start the fuse.  After 5 seconds, everything nearby will be "
"violently sliced, warped, aged, and partially teleported straight into many "
"different sections of the nether.  After a short moment of instant death, the "
"dimensional gap will probably heal.  Probably."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active netherium warp grenade"
msgid_plural "active netherium warp grenades"
msgstr[0] "active netherium warp grenades"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Description of "active netherium warp grenade"
msgid ""
"This netherium warp grenade is active, and will explode any second now.  "
"Continue holding it to die in the messiest and most violent of ways imaginable"
msgstr ""
"This netherium warp grenade is active, and will explode any second now.  "
"Continue holding it to die in the messiest and most violent of ways imaginable"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/explosive.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "portable dark age"
msgid_plural "portable dark ages"
msgstr[0] "便携黑暗纪元"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/explosive.json
#. ~ Description of "portable dark age"
msgid ""
"In this device the Mad Genius creates an extremely strong magnetic field.  "
"Then in the next step of its creation they split that field in two in such a "
"way it is perpetually trying to reconnect.  When activated the timer counts "
"down til the moment the two fields reconnect.  Upon reconnection, energy is "
"released in the form of EMP."
msgstr ""
"在这个装置中，疯狂天才创造了一个极强的磁场。然后在下一步中，它被分裂成两个永远在尝试重连的磁场。当激活时，计时器会开始倒计时，直到两个磁场重新连接。在重连时"
"，能量会以EMP的形式释放出来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/explosive.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "portable dark age"
msgid "You activate the portable dark age."
msgstr "你激活了便携黑暗纪元。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/explosive.json
#. ~ Description of "active EMP bomb"
msgid ""
"The Portable Dark Age™ is now active and will soon end all electronic devices "
"in range.  Prepare yourself for a life without mp3s and cell phones, at least "
"in the closest 60 meters."
msgstr "便携黑暗纪元™现在处于激活状态，不久后它就会终结范围内的所有电子设备。准备好度过一个没有MP3和电话的余生，至少在60米以内。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "battery-powered laser pistol"
msgid_plural "battery-powered laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "电池供能型激光手枪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "battery-powered laser pistol"
#. ~ Description of "battery-powered laser pistol"
msgid ""
"This handgun looks like it came from some sci-fi journal.  It has a recharge "
"slot that is somehow capable of using almost any type of battery."
msgstr "这把手枪看起来像是从科幻杂志上拿来的。它有一个充电槽，不知何故能够使用几乎任何类型的电池。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Location of gun mod
msgid "heat sink"
msgstr "热沉器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Location of gun mod
msgid "radiator"
msgstr "散热器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "ray gun"
msgid_plural "ray guns"
msgstr[0] "射线枪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "ray gun"
#. ~ Description of "ray gun"
msgid ""
"A ray gun with lots of cylinders and whorling cables that light up. It has a "
"recharge slot that is somehow capable of using almost any type of battery."
msgstr "一个有很多圆柱体和螺纹电缆的射线枪，可以发光。它有一个几乎可以使用任何类型的电池充电槽。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "the hyperboloid"
msgid_plural "the hyperboloids"
msgstr[0] "“双曲面”"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "the hyperboloid"
#. ~ Description of "the hyperboloid"
msgid ""
"Pretty bulky, this laser rifle has double the amount of lenses and emitters, "
"which makes it really devastating after some modding."
msgstr "这把笨重的激光步枪有双倍的透镜和发射器，改造后能够发挥极大威力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "death ray"
msgid_plural "death rays"
msgstr[0] "死亡射线"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "death ray"
#. ~ Description of "death ray"
msgid ""
"The Aetheric Death Ray, glowing a menacing green.  It hums with a barely "
"controlled hatred of organic life.  It must recharge on its own, as there are "
"no ports or battery slots on it.  It's sleek and smooth and evil."
msgstr "以太死亡射线，闪烁着慑人的绿色光芒。它低鸣着对有机生命的憎恨。它上面没有接口或电池槽，必须自行充能。光滑流畅，邪恶无比。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bio detonator"
msgid_plural "bio detonators"
msgstr[0] "生化飞雷筒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "bio detonator"
msgid ""
"A long, huge barrel drum mortar with a small device in the very end.  It is "
"collapsible, and you can comfortably wear it using a strap."
msgstr "一个长而巨大的桶状迫击炮，末端装有一个小装置。它可以折叠，用一根带子就可以舒适地穿着。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
msgid "bio-warhead"
msgid_plural "bio-warheads"
msgstr[0] "生化飞雷"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "bio-warhead"
msgid ""
"So you decided to become an inventor and instead of inventing something good "
"for mankind, you invented this?  You should be ashamed."
msgstr "你决定成为发明家，不去造福人类，而是发明这东西？可耻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ion rifle"
msgid_plural "ion rifles"
msgstr[0] "离子步枪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "ion rifle"
msgid "Something something ion, something something wide area.  Don't even ask."
msgstr "一些些离子，再来片空旷的区域，剩下的无需再问了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "\"Repeater\""
msgid_plural "\"Repeater\""
msgstr[0] "“连珠枪”"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun ""Repeater""
#. ~ Description of ""Repeater""
msgid ""
"A hand-made lever action sniper rifle with an extremely long barrel.  "
"Logically such a barrel shouldn't function properly, but somehow it not only "
"works well enough, it also accelerates the bullet much more than anyone could "
"expect.  Two internal magazine tubes under the barrel accept 15 7.62x51 "
"rounds each."
msgstr ""
"手工自制的杠杆式狙击步枪，枪管极长。常理而言，这么长的枪管是无法正常工作的，但不知何故，它不仅能正常工作，还能加快子弹的速度，远远超出预期。枪管下的两个内置"
"弹匣可各装入15发7.62x51mm子弹。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "shredder shotgun"
msgid_plural "shredder shotguns"
msgstr[0] "撕裂霰弹枪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "shredder shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "shredder shotgun"
msgid ""
"An abominably huge, two barrel Gast system shotgun.  Recoil from the first "
"shot powers the piston that loads a shell into the second barrel, and vice "
"versa, making it shoot approximately 1000rpm at max.  The biggest part of "
"this weapon is a giant, multi tube magazine, which can store 240 shells at "
"once.  It makes the weapon extremely bulky, so the only way you can utilize "
"it is by handling it like a chainsaw or installing it on a turret base."
msgstr ""
"巨大无比的双管加斯特自动机霰弹枪。第一发子弹的后坐力为活塞提供动力，将炮弹装入第二发枪管，反之亦然，使其最大射速约为 1000 "
"RPM。武器最大的部分是一个巨大的多筒弹匣，一次可储存 240 枚霰弹。它使武器非常笨重，因此唯一的使用方法就是像电锯一样操作它，或者将它安装在炮塔底座上。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "acceleratron"
msgid_plural "acceleratrons"
msgstr[0] "粒子加速枪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "acceleratron"
#. ~ Description of "acceleratron"
msgid ""
"A carbine-sized particle cannon.  It shoots microscopic particles, and due "
"the size of projectile you don't need to reload it for decades.  Instead, you "
"need a ton of energy to generate enough magnetic force.  The damage of the "
"weapon is not great, but it has perfect armor penetration, and no physical "
"armor can stop its bullets."
msgstr ""
"A carbine-sized particle cannon.  It shoots microscopic particles, and due "
"the size of projectile you don't need to reload it for decades.  Instead, you "
"need a ton of energy to generate enough magnetic force.  The damage of the "
"weapon is not great, but it has perfect armor penetration, and no physical "
"armor can stop its bullets."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "inventor's grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "inventor's grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "发明家榴弹发射器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "inventor's grenade launcher"
#. ~ Description of "inventor's grenade launcher"
msgid ""
"Transformed from a tool, this weapon can emit giant clouds of energy, "
"destroying everything on their path."
msgstr ""
"Transformed from a tool, this weapon can emit giant clouds of energy, "
"destroying everything on their path."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Valid mod location of gun
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
#. ~ Location of gun mod
msgid "energy transformer"
msgid_plural "energy transformers"
msgstr[0] "能量变换器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "energy transformer"
#. ~ Description of "energy transformer"
msgid "A default energy transformer that converts the power into raw energy."
msgstr "A default energy transformer that converts the power into raw energy."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "incendiary energy transformer"
msgid_plural "incendiary energy transformers"
msgstr[0] "火焰能量变换器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "incendiary energy transformer"
#. ~ Description of "incendiary energy transformer"
msgid ""
"A modified energy transformer.  It converts the power flow into a slow heat "
"cloud that ignites everything around it."
msgstr "一个改装的能量变换器。将能量流转化为缓慢的热云，点燃周围的一切。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "voltaic energy transformer"
msgid_plural "voltaic energy transformers"
msgstr[0] "伏特能量变换器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "voltaic energy transformer"
#. ~ Description of "voltaic energy transformer"
msgid ""
"Instead of converting energy this transformer emits it as it is, generating a "
"giant high-voltage cloud."
msgstr ""
"Instead of converting energy this transformer emits it as it is, generating a "
"giant high-voltage cloud."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "focused energy transformer"
msgid_plural "focused energy transformers"
msgstr[0] "聚焦能量变换器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "focused energy transformer"
#. ~ Description of "focused energy transformer"
msgid ""
"A bunch of powerful lenses and reflectors that transform the energy output "
"into a powerful directed laser beam."
msgstr ""
"A bunch of powerful lenses and reflectors that transform the energy output "
"into a powerful directed laser beam."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inventor's noise grenade"
msgid_plural "inventor's noise grenades"
msgstr[0] "发明家噪音手雷"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "inventor's noise grenade"
msgid ""
"A small energy grenade with an additional timer slapped onto it.  When "
"triggered, the timer will start to count to 70 seconds.  As it ends a massive "
"explosion will rip your enemies apart."
msgstr "一个加装了计时器的小型能量手雷。触发后，计时器将开始倒数70 秒。倒计时结束时巨大的爆炸将撕碎你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "inventor's noise grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "inventor's noise EMP grenade"
msgid "You trigger the mechanism, and it starts to whistle!"
msgstr "你触发了装置，它开始发出哨声！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inventor's noise EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "inventor's noise EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "发明家噪音电磁脉冲手雷"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "inventor's noise EMP grenade"
msgid ""
"A small energy grenade with an additional timer and a whistle slapped onto "
"it.   When triggered, the timer will start to count to 70 seconds.  As it "
"ends a huge EMP explosion will cover the zone."
msgstr ""
"A small energy grenade with an additional timer and a whistle slapped onto "
"it.   When triggered, the timer will start to count to 70 seconds.  As it "
"ends a huge EMP explosion will cover the zone."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inventor's noise fire grenade"
msgid_plural "inventor's noise fire grenades"
msgstr[0] "发明家噪音火焰手雷"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of "inventor's noise fire grenade"
msgid ""
"A small energy grenade with an additional timer slapped onto it.  When "
"triggered, the timer will start to count to 70 seconds.  As it ends a massive "
"fire explosion will rip your enemies apart."
msgstr "一个加装了计时器的小型能量手雷。触发后，计时器将开始倒数70 秒。倒计时结束时巨大的火焰爆炸将撕碎你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "inventor's noise fire grenade"
msgid "You trigger the mechanism, and it start to whistle!"
msgstr "你触发了装置，它开始发出哨声！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "sonic gun"
msgid_plural "sonic guns"
msgstr[0] "声波枪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "sonic gun"
#. ~ Description of "sonic gun"
msgid ""
"A small, square tube with a pistol grip that can emit a sonic waves, creating "
"cavitation and tissue damage inside living creatures.  It's pretty weak as a "
"weapon, but using extremely high frequency sounds makes it silent for most "
"creatures you can met.  It would be fun to listen some music using it, but "
"alas."
msgstr ""
"A small, square tube with a pistol grip that can emit a sonic waves, creating "
"cavitation and tissue damage inside living creatures.  It's pretty weak as a "
"weapon, but using extremely high frequency sounds makes it silent for most "
"creatures you can met.  It would be fun to listen some music using it, but "
"alas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Boiler\""
msgid_plural "\"Boilers\""
msgstr[0] "“沸腾枪”"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of ""Boiler""
msgid ""
"A rifle-sized tool that can concentrate heat in a huge range.  It lost its "
"ability to work as a tool as you don't want to accidentally evaporate your "
"materials, but the damage output pays for this with interest."
msgstr ""
"A rifle-sized tool that can concentrate heat in a huge range.  It lost its "
"ability to work as a tool as you don't want to accidentally evaporate your "
"materials, but the damage output pays for this with interest."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "blocky pistol"
msgid_plural "blocky pistols"
msgstr[0] "方块手枪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
#. ~ Description of gun "blocky pistol"
#. ~ Description of "blocky pistol"
msgid ""
"A square abomination resembling a pistol, but with a collapsible outer "
"magazine under the barrel.  This overengineered piece of metal is able to "
"vary the size of chamber, which makes it able to shoot any round up to "
"shotgun shells.  You spent a really long time to make it fit into a common "
"holster."
msgstr ""
"外形酷似手枪的方形武器，但枪管下有一个可折叠的外弹匣。这块过度设计的金属可以改变枪膛的大小，因此可以发射任何子弹，甚至霰弹。你花了很长时间才把它装进一个普通"
"枪套。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "projectile accelerator"
msgid_plural "projectile accelerators"
msgstr[0] "射弹加速器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "projectile accelerator"
#. ~ Description of "projectile accelerator"
msgid ""
"A small cylinder, reminiscent of a muzzle booster.  It can be mounted onto "
"the end of your barrel, which somehow increases the speed of the projectile.  "
"It also makes the gun much louder and difficult to hold after each shot."
msgstr "一个小圆筒，能让人联想到枪口助推器。 它可以安装在枪管末端，以某种方式提高弹丸的速度。 每次射击后，它还会使枪声更大，而且难以握住。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "rocket bullets"
msgid_plural "rocket bullets"
msgstr[0] "火箭子弹"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "rocket bullets"
#. ~ Description of "rocket bullets"
msgid ""
"You can't properly explain how this thing works, but the end result should be "
"clear - faster bullet with better damage, but awful dispersion."
msgstr "你无法解释这东西的原理，但结果很明显——子弹更快、伤害更高，但散布很烂。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "force silencer"
msgid_plural "force silencers"
msgstr[0] "原力消音器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "force silencer"
#. ~ Description of "force silencer"
msgid ""
"This barrel attachment drastically decreases any sound that your gun emits.  "
"Sadly, the damage and range of the weapon decrease respectively."
msgstr "这种枪管附件可以大幅降低枪支发出的声音。遗憾的是，武器的伤害和射程也会降低。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "wide-shot shotgun choke"
msgid_plural "wide-shot shotgun chokes"
msgstr[0] "广角霰弹枪喉缩"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "wide-shot shotgun choke"
#. ~ Description of "wide-shot shotgun choke"
msgid ""
"A choke that makes the pellets spread out wide to hit multiple enemies.  The "
"pellets will have shorter range but somehow deals higher damage."
msgstr "喉缩能让弹丸散开，击中多个敌人。 弹丸的射程较短，但伤害较高。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "pistol booster"
msgid_plural "pistol boosters"
msgstr[0] "手枪增强组件"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol booster"
#. ~ Description of "pistol booster"
msgid ""
"A set of mechanisms, that alter the action of the blocky pistol enough to "
"make it something in-between a machine pistol and a submachine gun."
msgstr "一套槍機可以改變結實短手槍的發射模式，使其成為介於衝鋒手槍和衝鋒槍之間的東西。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "beam array"
msgid_plural "beam arrays"
msgstr[0] "光束阵列"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "beam array"
#. ~ Description of "beam array"
msgid ""
"A set of modified weapon lens that increase the output energy of the laser at "
"expense of its range."
msgstr "一套改良型武器透镜，可增加激光的输出能量，但会牺牲其射程。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "focusing lens"
#. ~ Description of "focusing lens"
msgid ""
"A set of modified weapon lens that increases the range of the weapon at the "
"price of its damage."
msgstr "一套改良型武器透镜，可增加武器的射程，但会牺牲其伤害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "improved capacitors"
msgid_plural "improved capacitors"
msgstr[0] "改良电容器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "improved capacitors"
#. ~ Description of "improved capacitors"
msgid ""
"A set of powerful capacitors that increase the damage of a beam at the price "
"of doubling power consumption."
msgstr "一组功能强大的电容器，可以增加光束的伤害，但代价是功耗增加一倍。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "high-powered capacitors"
msgid_plural "high-powered capacitors"
msgstr[0] "高能电容器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "high-powered capacitors"
#. ~ Description of "high-powered capacitors"
msgid ""
"A set of extremely powerful capacitors which can turn a common laser beam "
"into powerful anti-materiel penetrator.  It spends five times more energy "
"than the default capacitor, so you need a lot of batteries to use it."
msgstr "一组超级强力电容，能把普通激光变成强力反器材武器。它消耗的能量是默认电容器的五倍，因此需要大量电池。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "energy-effective pump sources"
msgid_plural "energy-effective pump sources"
msgstr[0] "高效泵浦源"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "energy-effective pump sources"
#. ~ Description of "energy-effective pump sources"
msgid ""
"A set of improved electric discharges, that uses energy more efficiently then "
"standard.  It makes you spend much less energy per shot, but the overall "
"output of a system is a bit smaller."
msgstr "改良型放电设备，比标准版更为高效。它让射击消耗更少能量，但输出稍有降低。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "advanced heat exchanger"
msgid_plural "advanced heat exchangers"
msgstr[0] "高级换热器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "advanced heat exchanger"
#. ~ Description of "advanced heat exchanger"
msgid ""
"A set of fins in mathematically precise order, that make heat transferring "
"much more efficient than your original implementation."
msgstr "一组按数学上的精确顺序排列的散热片，其热传导效率比你最初的设计更有效。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "freezing heat sink"
msgid_plural "freezing heat sinks"
msgstr[0] "冷冻热沉器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "freezing heat sink"
#. ~ Description of "freezing heat sink"
msgid ""
"A small piece of completely frozen metal.  It grants a massive cooling "
"improvement, but the weapon circuits don't work properly with this mod, "
"making you spend more energy per shot."
msgstr "一小块完全冻结的金属。 它能显著改善冷却效果，但武器电路在使用这种模组时无法正常地工作，导致每次射击消耗更多能量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "heat recuperator"
msgid_plural "heat recuperators"
msgstr[0] "对流换热器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "heat recuperator"
#. ~ Description of "heat recuperator"
msgid ""
"Put some amount of the heat exchange from the gun back into platform loop.  "
"Decrease amount of energy used, and increase the heat output of the weapon, "
"but also its heat generation within the loop."
msgstr "将枪中的一些热交换放回平台回路中。减少使用的能量，增加武器的热量输出，同时也增加其回路内的热量产生。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "glass cannon energy conversion"
msgid_plural "glass cannon energy conversions"
msgstr[0] "玻璃大炮能量转换器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "glass cannon energy conversion"
#. ~ Description of "glass cannon energy conversion"
msgid ""
"Alter the energy loop in the platform - instead of doing multiple shots, it "
"store all the power, and use most of it in a single shot.  Effectively "
"transform the weapon into one or two shot recoilless rifle."
msgstr "改变平台的能量循环--不再进行多次射击，而是储存所有能量，并在一次射击中使用大部分能量。 有效地将武器转化为单发或双发无后坐力步枪。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "secondary radiator"
msgid_plural "secondary radiators"
msgstr[0] "第二散热器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "secondary radiator"
#. ~ Description of "secondary radiator"
msgid ""
"Additional radiator for your energy weapon.  Someone may say it's because you "
"don't know how to use your gun properly."
msgstr "能量武器的额外散热器。 也许有人会说这玩意的存在是因为你不知道如何正确地使用你的枪。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "huge radiator"
msgid_plural "huge radiators"
msgstr[0] "巨型散热器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "huge radiator"
#. ~ Description of "huge radiator"
msgid ""
"Replace the entire radiator in the platform into this hefty and bulky piece "
"of metal, trading a portability of a gun for a massive overheat buffer."
msgstr "将平台上的整个散热器换成这块又沉又笨重的金属，用枪支的便携性换取巨大的过热缓冲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "skeletonized heat sink"
msgid_plural "skeletonized heat sinks"
msgstr[0] "简化热沉器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "skeletonized heat sink"
#. ~ Description of "skeletonized heat sink"
msgid ""
"Replace a large part of the weapon's radiator with an additional cooling "
"unit.  The gun overheats faster, but recovers from it at a faster rate."
msgstr "把武器散热器的大部分更换额外的冷却装置。枪过热更快，但恢复速度更快。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "additional capacitors"
msgid_plural "additional capacitors"
msgstr[0] "附加电容"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gunmods.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "additional capacitors"
#. ~ Description of "additional capacitors"
msgid ""
"Replace a large portion of the radiator with additional capacitors.  The gun "
"will barely cool off, but the damage output may be worth it."
msgstr "用额外的电容器替换大部分的散热器。枪几乎不会冷却，但伤害输出可能是值得的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wolf sledge"
msgid_plural "wolf sledges"
msgstr[0] "恶狼战锤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "wolf sledge"
msgid ""
"A long, solid, crafted steel haft, and a bulky, comma-like head.  It feels "
"really massive, but it is surprisingly easy to swing, and you will do more "
"damage as your level increases.  You can throw it like a boomerang, and the "
"damage of throw depend on your throwing skill level."
msgstr ""
"长而坚固的精钢枪柄，带有笨重的逗号状枪头。它给人的感觉非常巨大，但挥动起来却出乎意料地轻松，而且伤害会随等级提高。你可以像投掷回旋镖一样投掷它，投掷伤害取决"
"于投掷技能等级。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chainsaw spear (off)"
msgid_plural "chainsaw spears (off)"
msgstr[0] "链锯矛（关）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "chainsaw spear (off)"
msgid ""
"A hand-made lightened engine, with chain blades on a long stick.  The only "
"reason it works without falling apart is because your calculations can't be "
"wrong."
msgstr "手工制造、装有刃链的轻型引擎，安装在长木棍上。它还能运转不散架的唯一原因是你肯定没计算错。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "chainsaw spear (off)"
msgid "You turn on the chainsaw spear."
msgstr "你启动链锯矛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "chainsaw spear (off)"
msgid "The chainsaw spear battery is dead."
msgstr "链锯矛的电池耗尽了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chainsaw spear (on)"
msgid_plural "chainsaw spears (on)"
msgstr[0] "链锯矛（开）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "chainsaw spear (on)"
msgid "You turn off the chainsaw spear."
msgstr "你关闭链锯矛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "megachette (folded)"
msgid_plural "megachettes (folded)"
msgstr[0] "开山刀（折叠）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "megachette (folded)"
msgid "Probably a great weapon, it is folded now."
msgstr "也许是把好武器，不过现在折叠起来了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "megachette (folded)"
msgid "With a quiet click, the megachette is unfolded."
msgstr "咔嗒一声，开山刀展开了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "megachette (extended)"
msgid_plural "megachettes (extended)"
msgstr[0] "开山刀（展开）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "megachette (extended)"
msgid ""
"A completely flat, single-edged blade.  While very visually appealing, it is "
"no less deadly.  It can be folded more times than makes sense."
msgstr "一把扁平的单刃刀。不仅视觉上很吸引人，还极具杀伤力。它可以折叠的次数超过了常理范围。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "megachette (extended)"
msgid "With a few moves, the megachette is folded."
msgstr "只需几步，开山刀就被折叠起来了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "binary sword"
msgid_plural "binary swords"
msgstr[0] "二进制剑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Description of "binary sword"
msgid ""
"A relatively heavy two-handed sword with \"100111100\" inscribed on the "
"blade, perhaps to appear fancier than it truly is.  Still, it is a "
"surprisingly good weapon."
msgstr "这是一把相对较重的双手剑，剑刃上刻有 \"100111100 \"字样，也许是为了显得比实际重量更重。 不过，这仍然是一把出人意料的好武器。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Neon Angle\" (off)"
msgid_plural "\"Neon Angles\" (off)"
msgstr[0] "氖头斧（关）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Description of ""Neon Angle" (off)"
#. ~ Description of ""Neon Angle" (on)"
msgid ""
"A light, hollow aluminum bar with an installed plasma torch on the end in the "
"form of a circle, emitting 28000 centrigrades of heat on demand.  This "
"probably violates dozens of OSHA regulations."
msgstr ""
"A light, hollow aluminum bar with an installed plasma torch on the end in the "
"form of a circle, emitting 28000 centrigrades of heat on demand.  This "
"probably violates dozens of OSHA regulations."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item ""Neon Angle" (off)"
msgid "You turn on your \"Neon Angle\"."
msgstr "你打开了氖头斧。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item ""Neon Angle" (off)"
msgid "The \"Neon Angle\" battery is dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Neon Angle\" (on)"
msgid_plural "\"Neon Angles\" (on)"
msgstr[0] "氖头斧（开）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/melee.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item ""Neon Angle" (on)"
msgid "You turn off your \"Neon Angle\"."
msgstr "你关掉了氖头斧。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "ultra-light modified battery"
msgid_plural "ultra-light modified batteries"
msgstr[0] "超輕改裝電池"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "ultra-light modified battery"
#. ~ Description of "ultra-light modified battery"
#. ~ Description of magazine "light modified battery"
#. ~ Description of "light modified battery"
msgid ""
"A light battery cell that was modified and replaced with much more effective "
"cells inside."
msgstr "一個經過修改的輕型電池，更換了更有效率的內部電池單元。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "light modified battery"
msgid_plural "light modified batteries"
msgstr[0] "輕型改裝電池"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "medium modified battery"
msgid_plural "medium modified batteries"
msgstr[0] "中型改裝電池"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "medium modified battery"
#. ~ Description of "medium modified battery"
msgid ""
"A medium battery cell that was modified and replaced with much more effective "
"cells inside."
msgstr "一個經過修改的中型電池，更換了更有效率的內部電池單元。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
msgid "modified tool battery"
msgid_plural "modified tool batteries"
msgstr[0] "modified tool batteries"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "modified tool battery"
#. ~ Description of "modified tool battery"
msgid ""
"A tool battery cell that was modified and replaced with much more effective "
"cells inside."
msgstr ""
"A tool battery cell that was modified and replaced with much more effective "
"cells inside."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inventor's welder"
msgid_plural "inventor's welders"
msgstr[0] "发明家焊枪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "inventor's welder"
msgid ""
"A lightweight, battery-powered tool to weld metal pieces together using a "
"plasma-inducted electric arc.  A decent tool, but you think you can do more "
"with some modifications."
msgstr "一個電池供電的輕量化工具，可以使用等離子感應電弧將金屬零件焊接在一起。是個不錯的工具，但你認為透過一些修改可以有更多功能。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "\"Heater\""
msgid_plural "\"Heaters\""
msgstr[0] "“加热器”"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of ""Heater""
msgid ""
"An extremely small and light tool that creates and transfers the heat in an "
"extremely effective way.  You think it would be interesting to develop it "
"further."
msgstr ""
"An extremely small and light tool that creates and transfers the heat in an "
"extremely effective way.  You think it would be interesting to develop it "
"further."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "IA software"
msgid_plural "IA software"
msgstr[0] "人工智能软件"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "IA software"
msgid ""
"A simple intelligent agent to provide support in parsing big layers of "
"information."
msgstr "一个简单的智能代理软件，为大量信息的解析提供支持。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Netherium-Reality Smoothing Device"
msgid_plural "Netherium-Reality Smoothing Devices"
msgstr[0] "Netherium-Reality Smoothing Devices"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Netherium-Reality Smoothing Device"
msgid ""
"An enormous industrial press shaped device, covered in sensors, circuits, and "
"other doodads.  Two inverted teleporters are located on each side of the "
"hammers, poised to perfectly align at the end of a strike.  Doing so will "
"smoothen the overall local barrier between Earth and other realities, filling "
"in any holes at the expense of weakening it in a much wider area.  This is an "
"overall positive effect, allowing you to heal tears that would never "
"naturally close, but expect large temporary side-effects."
msgstr ""
"An enormous industrial press shaped device, covered in sensors, circuits, and "
"other doodads.  Two inverted teleporters are located on each side of the "
"hammers, poised to perfectly align at the end of a strike.  Doing so will "
"smoothen the overall local barrier between Earth and other realities, filling "
"in any holes at the expense of weakening it in a much wider area.  This is an "
"overall positive effect, allowing you to heal tears that would never "
"naturally close, but expect large temporary side-effects."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Time Piercing Device"
msgid_plural "Time Piercing Devices"
msgstr[0] "时间穿刺装置"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Time Piercing Device"
msgid ""
"A small remote with a sharp spike at the end.  You can activate this device "
"while poking it into a zone of frozen time in order to unfreeze the area "
"you're touching."
msgstr "一个小遥控器，末端有尖锐的刺。你可以激活这个小装置，将其刺向一片时间冻结的区域，使其解冻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "intricate and opulent clock"
msgid_plural "intricate and opulent clocks"
msgstr[0] "复杂华丽的钟表"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "intricate and opulent clock"
msgid ""
"An incredibly intricate clock where every visible surface appears to be "
"gilded or chrome.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"极其复杂的时钟，每个可见表面似乎都镀了金或铬。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crystalline rod"
msgid_plural "crystalline rods"
msgstr[0] "晶体棒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "crystalline rod"
msgid ""
"This crystal rod changes hue at random.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"随机改变颜色的晶体棒。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "baroque monitor"
msgid_plural "baroque monitors"
msgstr[0] "复杂监视器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "baroque monitor"
msgid ""
"A strange monitor with a variety of knobs and dials.  When you turn it on, it "
"crackles and then begins tracking things that either aren't there or aren't "
"visible to the naked eye.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"奇怪的监视器，带有一堆旋钮和仪表盘。启动时，它会开始跟踪不存在于此或肉眼不可见的存在。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "a mess of tubes and wires"
msgid_plural "several messes of tubes and wires"
msgstr[0] "管道电线团"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "a mess of tubes and wires"
msgid ""
"What is it for?  What could it do?\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"这是什么？它能干什么？\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "abstract sculpture"
msgid_plural "abstract sculptures"
msgstr[0] "抽象雕塑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "abstract sculpture"
msgid ""
"It's a sculpture, but you can't identify what it depicts.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"It's a sculpture, but you can't identify what it depicts.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "humming disc"
msgid_plural "humming discs"
msgstr[0] "嗡鸣圆盘"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "humming disc"
msgid ""
"It hums louder when you touch it.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"你触摸时它的嗡鸣声变大了。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "an instrument"
msgid_plural "instruments"
msgstr[0] "乐器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "an instrument"
msgid ""
"This looks like a musical instrument.  But how would you play it?\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"这看起来像一件乐器。但是你会怎么玩呢\n"
"它可能拥有未知的力量；试着激活它们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "very thin sheet"
msgid ""
"A sheet so light and thin that viewing it horizontally makes it almost "
"invisible.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"轻薄得侧面几乎看不到的薄膜。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "spiked sphere"
msgid ""
"A prickly ball that, no matter the force you apply, somehow never feels as if "
"it could cut.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"带刺的小球，无论你用多大的力气，都感觉不到它能割伤你。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "malleable blob"
msgid ""
"Despite its looseness, this mass of goo keeps its shape as you fold it in "
"your hands.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"尽管松松垮垮，但这团黏糊糊的东西在你手中折叠时却能保持形状。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "spiraling rod"
msgid ""
"A rod with a bulbous, spiralling knob on the end that seems to spin as you "
"look.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一根杆子的末端有一个螺旋状的球形旋钮，似乎会随着你的视线旋转。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "small pin"
msgid ""
"One of those pins you wear on your shirt, but this one has indecipherable "
"symbols in place of a witty slogan.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"可以别在衬衫上的别针，但这个别针用难以辨认的符号代替了诙谐的标语。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "hollow tube"
msgid ""
"A tube of unknown material.  A strange noise from nowhere can be heard when "
"you place it next to your ear, as if something's inside.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"未知材料的空管。当你放在耳边时会听见不知哪来的奇怪声音，像是里面有什么。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "regular tetrahedron"
msgid ""
"A triangular pyramid, inconspicuous in every way.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一个三角形锥体，在各方面都不显眼。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "translucent crystal"
msgid ""
"A beautiful crystal, which seems to suck in detail rather than merely "
"obscuring it as light passes through.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"美丽的晶体，它似乎能吸住细节，而不仅仅是在光线通过时将其遮住。\n"
"它可能有未知的力量，试试激活它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "twisted, knotted cord"
msgid ""
"A bit of spiralling rope, disorienting you as your eyes vainly try to "
"complete following the loop.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"一段螺旋状绳索，你的眼睛徒劳地跟随环路后最终迷失方向。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "crescent-shaped stone"
msgid ""
"The sound of the tide can be heard from this stone, as if it were a miniature "
"moon moving the oceans.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"能听见来自这块石头的潮汐声，仿佛一个引动海洋的微型月亮。\n"
"它可能具有未知的力量;尝试激活它们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stunning QR trap"
msgid_plural "stunning QR traps"
msgstr[0] "stunning QR traps"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
#. ~ Description of "stunning QR trap"
msgid ""
"A jagged and eldritch looking QR code ready to be placed wherever you are "
"concerned about mechanical eyes.  Will trap robots if they wander into it."
msgstr ""
"A jagged and eldritch looking QR code ready to be placed wherever you are "
"concerned about mechanical eyes.  Will trap robots if they wander into it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "stunning QR trap"
#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "stunning arg trap"
msgid "You set the QR code."
msgstr "You set the QR code."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stunning arg trap"
msgid_plural "stunning arg traps"
msgstr[0] "stunning arg traps"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/traps.json
#. ~ Description of "stunning arg trap"
msgid ""
"A jagged and eldritch looking QR code ready to be placed wherever you are "
"concerned about mechanical eyes.  Will trap cyborgs if they wander into it."
msgstr ""
"A jagged and eldritch looking QR code ready to be placed wherever you are "
"concerned about mechanical eyes.  Will trap cyborgs if they wander into it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magician's hat"
msgid_plural "magician's hats"
msgstr[0] "魔术师帽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
#. ~ Description of "magician's hat"
msgid ""
"An old-school cylinder hat, used by illusionists around the world.  Maybe it "
"still remembers some cool tricks?"
msgstr "一顶老派的圆筒礼帽，为世界各地的幻术师所使用。或许它还记得一些炫酷的戏法吧？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "warm ball"
msgid_plural "warm balls"
msgstr[0] "暖球"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_classless.json
#. ~ Description of "warm ball"
msgid ""
"A small and light ball of glass with flickering flames inside.  The surface "
"feels scalding hot, yet the temperature does not change."
msgstr "一个小而轻的玻璃球，里面有闪烁的火焰。表面感觉很烫，但室温并未因此改变。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "magick 8-Ball"
msgid_plural "magick 8-Balls"
msgstr[0] "真·魔法8号球"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "magick 8-Ball"
msgid ""
"A fortune-telling device from the 1950s.  If you shake it and look at the "
"bottom it will give you detailed step by step instructions on how to do… "
"something."
msgstr "一个源自20世纪50年代的占卜工具。如果你摇晃它，并盯着底部，它会给你提供详细逐步指示去……做些什么。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "glass dagger paperweight"
msgid_plural "glass dagger paperweights"
msgstr[0] "玻璃匕首镇纸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "glass dagger paperweight"
msgid ""
"This paperweight in the shape of a small glass dagger emits a wet wheeze like "
"a punctured lung when held."
msgstr "这个玻璃匕首形状的小型镇纸握住时会发出湿漉漉的呼气声，就像刺破的肺一样。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Caravaggio on his deathbed"
msgid_plural "copies of Caravaggio on his deathbed"
msgstr[0] "卡拉瓦乔临终之时"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "Caravaggio on his deathbed"
msgid ""
"A previously unknown painting in Caravaggio's style of the artist himself "
"lying prone on his deathbed as black ichor seeps from a sword wound in his "
"side.  His own sword rests near his hand and his ever dying breath asks you "
"to take up his blade."
msgstr ""
"一幅卡拉瓦乔风格的尚不为人所知的画，画中的艺术家自己躺在临终的病床上，黑色血液从他身体侧面的刀伤中渗出。他自己的匕首放在手边，他那垂死的气息仿佛正叫你拿起那"
"把匕首。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "ɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ"
msgid "·ɓuoɹʍ ɓuᴉɥʇǝɯoS  ·ɹoɹɹᴉɯ puɐɥ ʅʅɐɯs Ɐ"
msgstr "劲对太不些有。镜持手小个一"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of glasses"
msgstr[0] "一副眼镜"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of glasses"
msgid ""
"A pair of a common glasses.  They have no lens or glass inside, only casing.  "
"There is a strange engraving of vines, snakes, and foxes covering every "
"surface of the frames.  You think that maybe the engravings are moving when "
"you aren't looking at them."
msgstr "一副普通的眼镜。它们的内部没有镜头或玻璃，只有外壳。框架的每一个表面都刻着奇怪的藤条、蛇和狐狸的图案。你认为当你不看雕刻品的时候，它们可能在移动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "family photo"
msgid ""
"A photo of a smiling family on a camping trip.  The background is always the "
"same, but people are not.  Do you recall them?"
msgstr "一张露营旅行中微笑的一家人的照片。背景依旧，但人却不再。你是否又回想起他们了？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sphere"
msgid_plural "spheres"
msgstr[0] "球體"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "sphere"
msgid ""
"A small, black sphere.  It constantly changes its position.  It even tries to "
"roll out of corners you wedge it into."
msgstr "一个黑色的小球体。它不断地改变自己的位置。它甚至试图从你楔入的角落里滚出来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flashlight"
msgid_plural "flashlights"
msgstr[0] "手电筒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "flashlight"
msgid ""
"This looks like a typical household flashlight.  It has no battery holder and "
"it hums when you touch it."
msgstr "這看起來就像一個典型的家用手電筒。它沒有電池座，當你觸摸它時它會發出嗡嗡聲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "nail"
msgid "A pin-shaped piece of iron.  You feel the need to hammer it."
msgstr "一块针状的铁片。你觉得有必要敲打它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bubble"
msgid_plural "bubbles"
msgstr[0] "气泡"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "bubble"
msgid ""
"A small, transparent bubble.  It divides itself into two, then four, eight, "
"sixteen, endlessly, before turning back to single bubble and repeating the "
"process."
msgstr "透明的小气泡它把自己分成两个，然后四个，八个，十六个，没完没了，然后又变成一个气泡，重复这个过程。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shard of amber"
msgid_plural "shards of amber"
msgstr[0] "shards of amber"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "shard of amber"
msgid ""
"A small shard of amber.  Looking carefully, you think you see some manner of "
"creature trapped within."
msgstr ""
"A small shard of amber.  Looking carefully, you think you see some manner of "
"creature trapped within."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "wallet"
msgid ""
"A small, flat case used to carry currency.  Each time you open it, it reveals "
"new pockets, but all of them hold the same one coin, which you can't remove."
msgstr "一个用来装货币的扁平小盒子。 每次打开它，都会出现新的口袋，但所有口袋都装着同一枚硬币，而且无法取出。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "angel figurine"
msgid_plural "angel figurines"
msgstr[0] "天使雕像"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "angel figurine"
msgid "A delicate figurine of a renaissance angel.  It looks oddly human."
msgstr "文艺复兴时期天使的精美雕像。它看起来像是奇怪的人类。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "action figurine"
msgid_plural "action figurines"
msgstr[0] "行动的雕像"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "action figurine"
msgid ""
"A small action figurine of a man with an old computer.  It appears he is "
"attempting to hack it."
msgstr "一个拿着一台旧电脑的人的小动作小雕像。看起来他是在试图黑掉它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone feather"
msgid_plural "stone feathers"
msgstr[0] "石制羽毛"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "stone feather"
msgid "You see an incredibly detailed stone feather, almost lifelike in appearance."
msgstr "你看到一根极其精细、栩栩如生的石制羽毛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "monochrome arrow"
msgid_plural "monochrome arrows"
msgstr[0] "褪色箭头"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "monochrome arrow"
msgid ""
"You see a blocky arrow, unerringly pointed in some far off direction.  It is "
"completely colorless."
msgstr "你看到一个块状箭头，准确无误地指向某个遥远的方向。 它没有丝毫颜色。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "odd circle"
msgid_plural "odd circles"
msgstr[0] "奇异圆环"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "odd circle"
msgid ""
"A circular unit of energy, surrounded by a few other circles that almost "
"connect around the center."
msgstr "一个环形的能量单元，周围环绕着几圈几乎围拢于中心的圆环。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "presence"
msgid_plural "presences"
msgstr[0] "存在"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "presence"
msgid ""
"You feel like something took a glance at this place, and it was so menacing "
"that the world itself curled up."
msgstr ""
"You feel like something took a glance at this place, and it was so menacing "
"that the world itself curled up."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lizard tail"
msgid_plural "lizard tails"
msgstr[0] "蜥蜴尾巴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Description of "lizard tail"
msgid "A small lizard tail that was ripped off.  Looks like someone's joke."
msgstr "一条被扯掉的小蜥蜴尾巴。 看起来像是某人的玩笑。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamsmith.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "set of brass cylinders"
msgid_plural "sets of brass cylinders"
msgstr[0] "成套黄铜圆柱"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamsmith.json
#. ~ Description of "set of brass cylinders"
msgid ""
"These brass cylinders are engraved with cuneiform and could be rolled across "
"wet clay to create a page of writing per cylinder.  When you touch one of the "
"cylinders you hear a faint voice whisper 'Enki'."
msgstr "这些黄铜圆柱上雕刻着楔形文字，可以在湿黏土上滚动，每个铜柱能印出一页。当你触摸其中一个圆柱时，你能听到一个微弱的声音在低语\"Enki\"。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "deck of tarot cards"
msgid ""
"A deck of intricately designed tarot cards.  When you lay out your future "
"they seem to be trying to tell you to take a leap of faith."
msgstr "一副设计复杂的塔罗牌。当你用它占卜未来时，它似乎在告诉你要向前一步信仰之跃。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "occult seal"
msgid_plural "occult seals"
msgstr[0] "神秘印章"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "occult seal"
msgid ""
"An intricate occult seal.  When you glance at the bottom left corner you hear "
"the sound of the ocean and smell the salty air of the sea, and sense a river "
"flowing through each point of the seal."
msgstr "一个错综复杂的神秘印章。当你瞥一眼左下角的时候，你会听到海洋的声音，闻到大海里咸咸的空气，感觉到一条河流过印章的每一个点。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hurricane lamp with thorns"
msgid_plural "hurricane lamps with thorns"
msgstr[0] "荆棘防风灯"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "hurricane lamp with thorns"
msgid ""
"An old style hurricane lamp.  The handle appears to made of vines covered in "
"sharp thorns."
msgstr "一顶老式防风灯。手柄似乎是由覆盖着尖刺的荆棘制成的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "box of glass berries"
msgid_plural "boxes of glass berries"
msgstr[0] "玻璃浆果盒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "box of glass berries"
msgid ""
"A box full of glass berries, when you get distracted you find yourself "
"crunching them in your mouth.  Each one tastes like a mouthful of blood that "
"slowly changes to espresso."
msgstr "一个装满玻璃浆果的盒子，当你分心时，你会发现自己在嘴里嚼着它们。每一杯都尝起来像一口慢慢变成浓缩咖啡的血液。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "polaroid of a missing person"
msgid_plural "polaroids of a missing person"
msgstr[0] "失踪人员的拍立得照片"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "polaroid of a missing person"
msgid ""
"A polaroid of someone you remember going missing before the Cataclysm.  It "
"caught a ton of media attention due to them being seen near what was shortly "
"after identified as a thin place between dimensions.  The more you stare at "
"the picture, the more you begin to see wounds appear and disappear on the "
"person.  Sometimes they match your old scars."
msgstr ""
"一张你记得在大灾变前失踪的人的宝丽来。它吸引了大量媒体的注意，因为它们被发现在不久之后被确认为维度之间的薄薄之处附近。你越盯着这张照片，你就越能看到这个人身"
"上的伤口出现和消失。有时它们会和你以前的伤疤相配。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "strange cup of coffee"
msgid_plural "strange cups of coffee"
msgstr[0] "怪咖啡"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "strange cup of coffee"
msgid ""
"A small jar with coffee, moving in weird patterns with no apparent cause.  "
"After watching the swirls for some time, you are sure that it loops back on "
"its movements, like some sort of message."
msgstr "一个小罐子里的咖啡，以奇怪的模式移动，没有明显的原因。观察这些漩涡一段时间后，你确定它们循环着移动，就像某种信息一样。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "red devil blindfold"
msgid_plural "red devil blindfolds"
msgstr[0] "红恶魔眼罩"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "red devil blindfold"
msgid ""
"A red fabric blindfold with a cartoonish devil over the eyes.  You feel some "
"anger when you put it on.  Did that devil just wink at you?"
msgstr "一个红色布料的眼罩，眼部上有一个卡通恶鬼。 当你戴上它时，你感到有些愤怒。 那个恶魔刚才是在向你眨眼吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mother of pearl heart"
msgid_plural "mother of pearl hearts"
msgstr[0] "珍珠母之心"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "mother of pearl heart"
msgid ""
"A human heart grown in mother of pearl.  It beats loudly when you raise it to "
"your ear."
msgstr "在珍珠母中生长着一颗人心。将它举到耳边时，心跳声会增大。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "right eye"
msgid ""
"A tiny human eye.  You can clearly see the green iris and red capillaries.  "
"While holding it in the dark you feel it watching you."
msgstr "一只小小的人眼。你可以清楚地看到绿色的虹膜和红色的毛细血管。当你在黑暗中拿着它时，你会感觉到它在看着你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cerebellum"
msgid_plural "cerebellums"
msgstr[0] "小脑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "cerebellum"
msgid "A small, smooth part of the human brain.  Looks slippery.  Feels like rubber."
msgstr "人脑的一个小而光滑的部分。看起来很滑。摸起来像橡胶。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "skull"
msgid_plural "skulls"
msgstr[0] "颅骨"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "skull"
msgid "A tiny human skull.  His empty orbits are watching you."
msgstr "一个小小的人类头骨。他的空洞在注视着你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ring of Gyges"
msgid_plural "rings of Gyges"
msgstr[0] "盖吉斯之戒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "ring of Gyges"
msgid ""
"A small ring.  There is nothing special about it, except the word "
"\"Republic\" embossed on it."
msgstr "一枚小戒指。它没有什么特别之处，只是上面浮雕了一个“共和国”的字样。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "left eye"
msgid ""
"A tiny human eye.  You can clearly see it has a blue iris and red "
"capillaries.  You feel it can see you no matter how you hide."
msgstr "一只小小的人眼。你可以清楚地看到它有蓝色的虹膜和红色的毛细血管。无论你如何隐藏，你都能感觉到它能看到你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Enemy of the World"
msgid_plural "copies of Enemy of the World"
msgstr[0] "世界公敌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "Enemy of the World"
msgid ""
"A small Korean novel that describes the journey of an incredibly strong "
"protagonist attempting to save the world."
msgstr ""
"A small Korean novel that describes the journey of an incredibly strong "
"protagonist attempting to save the world."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "horn"
msgid_plural "horns"
msgstr[0] "角"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "horn"
msgid ""
"A large, straight horn of some unknown creature.  It could easily injure a "
"careless person."
msgstr "某种未知生物的大而直的角。它很容易伤到粗心大意的人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "muscles"
msgid_plural "muscles"
msgstr[0] "肌肉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "muscles"
msgid ""
"A long fleshy tendon with joints on both sides.  They contract from time to "
"time."
msgstr "一条两侧都有关节的又长又多肉的肌腱。他们时不时地会收缩。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pile of pain"
msgid_plural "pile of pains"
msgstr[0] "痛苦之堆"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "pile of pain"
msgid "There is nothing here.  It's uncomfortable to hold it."
msgstr "这里什么都没有。拿着它很不舒服。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of spheres"
msgid_plural "pairs of spheres"
msgstr[0] "双球"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of spheres"
msgid ""
"Two perfect spheres.  The first does not move at all, and the second "
"constantly rotates around.  You feel a connection to both of them."
msgstr ""
"Two perfect spheres.  The first does not move at all, and the second "
"constantly rotates around.  You feel a connection to both of them."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fist"
msgid_plural "fists"
msgstr[0] "拳头"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "fist"
msgid ""
"A solid, full size cast of a human fist, made out of some gray metal.  Looks "
"menacing."
msgstr "一个实心的、全尺寸的拳头模型，由灰色的金属制成。它想要和你打一架。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "anchor"
msgid_plural "anchors"
msgstr[0] "anchors"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "anchor"
msgid "A miniature anchor with an earthly sheen.  You feel more stable looking at it."
msgstr "A miniature anchor with an earthly sheen.  You feel more stable looking at it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "clumped sand"
msgid_plural "clumped sands"
msgstr[0] "clumped sands"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_eater.json
#. ~ Description of "clumped sand"
msgid ""
"A pile of gray sand that is clumped together.  When you separate the pieces "
"they seem to flow back together."
msgstr ""
"A pile of gray sand that is clumped together.  When you separate the pieces "
"they seem to flow back together."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_inventor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "String Theory For Dummies"
msgid_plural "copies of String Theory For Dummies"
msgstr[0] "傻瓜弦理论入门"

