#. ~ Description of "Parchment of sight beyond sight"
msgid "A short parchment that will supposedly teach you how to see through walls."
msgstr "A short parchment that will supposedly teach you how to see through walls."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid ""
"The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic and Divination in "
"Russia"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic and "
"Divination in Russia"
msgstr[0] ""
"copies of The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic and "
"Divination in Russia"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "The Bathhouse at Midnight: An Historical Survey of Magic
#. and Divination in Russia"
msgid ""
"This encyclopediac tome by W. F. Ryan concerns a wide variety of folk magic "
"practices in pre-modern Russia, including their social context, the way that "
"the Church had to work against folk practices like leaving items on the altar "
"for six weeks so they would gain protective powers, the dangers of being "
"alone in the bathhouse, ways to find and keep a husband or wife, when to "
"throw an axe handle over your shoulder when walking into the forest, and how "
"the government mostly suppressed magic because magical power (real or "
"imagined) would have been a threat to secular power.  The description of some "
"of these rituals are extremely detailed."
msgstr ""
"This encyclopediac tome by W. F. Ryan concerns a wide variety of folk magic "
"practices in pre-modern Russia, including their social context, the way that "
"the Church had to work against folk practices like leaving items on the altar "
"for six weeks so they would gain protective powers, the dangers of being "
"alone in the bathhouse, ways to find and keep a husband or wife, when to "
"throw an axe handle over your shoulder when walking into the forest, and how "
"the government mostly suppressed magic because magical power (real or "
"imagined) would have been a threat to secular power.  The description of some "
"of these rituals are extremely detailed."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "The Book of the Sacred Magic of Abramelin the Mage"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of the Sacred Magic of Abramelin the Mage"
msgstr[0] "copies of The Book of the Sacred Magic of Abramelin the Mage"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "The Book of the Sacred Magic of Abramelin the Mage"
msgid ""
"Translated from the French edition by Samuel L MacGregor Mathers, this tome "
"compiles the journeys of a man named Abraham of Worms to Egypt, where he "
"learned occult secrets from the wizard Abramelin who lived in a small town "
"near the Nile.  The magic contained within focuses mostly on the creation of "
"magic squares which, when used in ceremonies by an initiate, provide magical "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Translated from the French edition by Samuel L MacGregor Mathers, this tome "
"compiles the journeys of a man named Abraham of Worms to Egypt, where he "
"learned occult secrets from the wizard Abramelin who lived in a small town "
"near the Nile.  The magic contained within focuses mostly on the creation of "
"magic squares which, when used in ceremonies by an initiate, provide magical "
"effects."

