#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric Anathema"
msgid_plural "Vampiric Anathema"
msgstr[0] "Vampiric Anathema"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Vampiric Anathema"
msgid ""
"Your instincts are telling you three things about this armored, axe-wielding "
"humanoid foe: they are a vampire far more powerful than you, they thirst for "
"your blood, and they are a vampire hunter wanting all vampires dead.  You "
"know for certain that you will be quickly killed if you attack them without a "
"proper plan."
msgstr ""
"Your instincts are telling you three things about this armored, axe-wielding "
"humanoid foe: they are a vampire far more powerful than you, they thirst for "
"your blood, and they are a vampire hunter wanting all vampires dead.  You "
"know for certain that you will be quickly killed if you attack them without a "
"proper plan."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Vampiric Anathema"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's wounds are closing at a rapid pace!"
msgstr "%1$s's wounds are closing at a rapid pace!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Vampiric Anathema"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's movements are much quicker now!"
msgstr "%1$s's movements are much quicker now!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Vampiric Anathema"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s accelerates to the point your eyes struggle to follow and heal their "
"wounds as shadows surround their body!"
msgstr ""
"%1$s accelerates to the point your eyes struggle to follow and heal their "
"wounds as shadows surround their body!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_CHECK_FOR_START" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_BUFF_ON_HIT"
msgid "The vampiric anathema's movements are much quicker now!"
msgstr "The vampiric anathema's movements are much quicker now!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_CHECK_FOR_LATER" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_BUFF_ON_HIT"
msgid ""
"The vampiric anathema accelerates to the point your eyes struggle to follow "
"and heal their wounds as shadows surround their body!"
msgstr ""
"The vampiric anathema accelerates to the point your eyes struggle to follow "
"and heal their wounds as shadows surround their body!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_SPAWN_MESSAGE"
msgid ""
"You feel a threat closing in, more dangerous than anything you've ever faced. "
" Your vampiric instincts urge you to flee, as fighting them is certain to "
"cause your death.\n"
"RUN."
msgstr ""
"You feel a threat closing in, more dangerous than anything you've ever faced. "
" Your vampiric instincts urge you to flee, as fighting them is certain to "
"cause your death.\n"
"RUN."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_WITHDRAWS_FOR_NOW"
msgid "The Anathema vanishes in a fine mist"
msgstr "The Anathema vanishes in a fine mist"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ANATHEMA_WITHDRAWS_FOR_NOW"
msgid "…but they will come back."
msgstr "…but they will come back."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"You shudder at the thought of vampire hunters.  Knowing your luck, one is "
"probably tracking you as this very moment."
msgstr ""
"You shudder at the thought of vampire hunters.  Knowing your luck, one is "
"probably tracking you as this very moment."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"You long for the safety of a warm uncontrolled blaze, burning away the thing "
"stalking you from the shadows."
msgstr ""
"You long for the safety of a warm uncontrolled blaze, burning away the thing "
"stalking you from the shadows."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"Your instincts warn you about something far more dangerous than you are, "
"wandering the shadows to find you."
msgstr ""
"Your instincts warn you about something far more dangerous than you are, "
"wandering the shadows to find you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"You long for proximity to vast waters and holy ground, no matter how uneasy "
"you might be about them."
msgstr ""
"You long for proximity to vast waters and holy ground, no matter how uneasy "
"you might be about them."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"You feel a threatening presence.  Someone who desires nothing but killing "
"vampires has their sights on you."
msgstr ""
"You feel a threatening presence.  Someone who desires nothing but killing "
"vampires has their sights on you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"You have a passing thought about standing in unblocked sunlight, and how you "
"would be safer in it than you currently are here."
msgstr ""
"You have a passing thought about standing in unblocked sunlight, and how you "
"would be safer in it than you currently are here."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"Someone is coming to kill you.  You can feel them knowing where you are, "
"waiting for the right moment to strike."
msgstr ""
"Someone is coming to kill you.  You can feel them knowing where you are, "
"waiting for the right moment to strike."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"You are filled with the fear that a vampire will soon drink you dry.  You "
"know that vampire blood is inedible to vampires, but you're still unsettled."
msgstr ""
"You are filled with the fear that a vampire will soon drink you dry.  You "
"know that vampire blood is inedible to vampires, but you're still unsettled."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/anathema.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "Anathema_Warnings_Snippets"
msgid ""
"For a moment, the darkness doesn't feel like home.  It feels like a "
"slaughterhouse, and you're next in line to be killed."
msgstr ""
"For a moment, the darkness doesn't feel like home.  It feels like a "
"slaughterhouse, and you're next in line to be killed."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wight"
msgid_plural "wight"
msgstr[0] "wight"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wight"
msgid ""
"This creature scarcely looks like the human you know they must once have "
"been.  Red eyes lit by a faint inner glow, a pair of protruding fangs, "
"fingers twisted into claws, clothes in tatters, and skin so covered in dirt "
"and blood you have no idea what color it originally was.  They move like a "
"wild animal, occasionally dropping on all fours and raising their head to "
"sniff the air."
msgstr ""
"This creature scarcely looks like the human you know they must once have "
"been.  Red eyes lit by a faint inner glow, a pair of protruding fangs, "
"fingers twisted into claws, clothes in tatters, and skin so covered in dirt "
"and blood you have no idea what color it originally was.  They move like a "
"wild animal, occasionally dropping on all fours and raising their head to "
"sniff the air."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "moroi"
msgid_plural "moroi"
msgstr[0] "魔洛伊"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "moroi"
msgid ""
"This creature looks more aware than most of the ferals you have seen and in "
"fact you might even suspect them of being normal if it weren't for the dried "
"blood caked around their mouth and down the front of their clothes.  The "
"light glints against what look to be sharp fangs in their mouth."
msgstr "这个生物比你所见的大多数疯人更意识清醒，事实上如果他们的嘴角和衣物没有凝结的干血，你甚至怀疑他们是正常的。嘴里的尖牙闪烁着光线。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strigoi"
msgid_plural "strigoi"
msgstr[0] "斯特里戈伊"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strigoi"
msgid ""
"An incredibly skinny corpse like creature moving with unnatural flexibility.  "
"It sniffs the air and opens a mouthful of jagged teeth while the jaws keep "
"distending.  This could easily be the origin creature of Nosferatu."
msgstr "一个饿殍般的生物，以不自然的灵活性移动着。它嗅着空气，嘴中露出锯齿状的牙齿同时下巴不断张大。这很可能是诺斯费拉图的起源生物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "renfield"
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their "
"vampire masters."
msgstr "狂乱的头发和充血的眼睛，这个人不断地对自己喃喃自语，谈论食物和生命。除了保护他们的吸血鬼主人之外，雷恩菲尔德什么都不在乎。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "renfield with a pistol"
msgid_plural "renfields with pistols"
msgstr[0] "带手枪的雷恩菲尔德"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a pistol"
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  They carry a 9mm pistol with no respect for trigger "
"discipline.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire "
"masters."
msgstr ""
"狂乱的头发和充血的眼睛，这个人不断地对自己喃喃自语，谈论食物和生命。他握着一把9"
"mm手枪，早就把金手指之类的规矩丢在了脑后。除了保护的吸血鬼主人之外，雷恩菲尔德什么都不关心。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a pistol"
msgid "The renfield fires their Glock!"
msgstr "雷恩菲尔德用手枪射击了！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "renfield with a Remington"
msgid_plural "renfields with shotguns"
msgstr[0] "带雷明顿霰弹枪的雷恩菲尔德"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a Remington"
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  They carry a shotgun loosely one handed until they take "
"aim.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire masters."
msgstr "狂乱的头发和充血的眼睛，这个人不断地对自己喃喃自语，谈论食物和生命。他没在瞄准，单手轻握着一把霰弹枪。除了保护的吸血鬼主人之外，雷恩菲尔德什么都不关心。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a Remington"
msgid "The renfield fires their shotgun!"
msgstr "雷恩菲尔德击发了它的霰弹枪！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "renfield with a flamethrower"
msgid_plural "renfields with flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "带喷火器的雷恩菲尔德"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "renfield with a flamethrower"
msgid ""
"Wild hair and bloodshot eyes, this person constantly mumbles to themselves "
"about food and life.  A pilot light runs at the business end of their "
"flamethrower.  Renfields care for nothing except protecting their vampire "
"masters."
msgstr "狂乱的头发和充血的眼睛，这个人不断地对自己喃喃自语，念叨着食物和生命。在他们的喷火器的前端有一个引导灯亮着。除了保护吸血鬼主人之外，雷恩菲尔德什么都不关心。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "renfield with a flamethrower"
msgid "The renfield shoots their flamethrower!"
msgstr "雷恩菲尔德用喷火器射出火焰！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cyber-renfield"
msgid_plural "cyber-renfields"
msgstr[0] "雷恩菲尔德改造人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cyber-renfield"
msgid ""
"A renfield enhanced with cybernetic modules.  These bloodhunting "
"monstrosities will crash through brick walls in search of their masters' "
"foes.  Someone with enough surgical skills might be able to pull some useful "
"bionics from their corpse.  Bionic claws snikt in and out until it finds a "
"target for its hate."
msgstr ""
"经过赛博强化的雷恩菲尔德。这种嗜血的怪物为了追随吸血鬼主人的脚步走到哪拆到哪儿。或许谁的外科手术技术够好，能从他们身上挖出些能用的生化插件。发现憎恶的猎物时"
"，他们的金属爪伸出发出骇人的响声。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "abominable renfield"
msgid_plural "abominable renfields"
msgstr[0] "雷恩菲尔德缝合人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "abominable renfield"
msgid ""
"A brobdingnagian Renfield, twisted through unnatural alchemies.  Their stump "
"sized legs and feet pound the earth as they move, while their claw like hands "
"to tear you apart."
msgstr "巨大的雷恩菲尔德，因为非自然力量而呈现扭曲的外形。每当他们行走，树桩一样大的腿和脚掌重重地踏在地上。他们爪子一般的手掌能将你撕成两半。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "vampire bat"
msgid_plural "vampire bats"
msgstr[0] "vampire bats"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "vampire bat"
msgid ""
"The Northern European Vampire bat, was discovered 8 years previous to the "
"Cataclysm in Lithuania.  Within those years it had spread across the entire "
"northern hemisphere.  It is larger than a regular bat and furrier allowing it "
"to remain active in the colder winters.  They do drink human and animal blood "
"as part of their sustenance.  It roosts in caves and other hollows, and uses "
"a form of echolocation to aerially navigate through tricky terrain at rapid "
"speeds."
msgstr ""
"一种北欧吸血蝙蝠，它在大灾变开始的8"
"年前发现于立陶宛。在那几年间，它已经蔓延到了整个北半球。它的体型比普通的蝙蝠大，而且体表带毛，这让它在寒冷的冬天仍然能够活跃。它们将人和动物的血作为食物来源"
"的一部分。平时栖息在洞穴和其他坑洞中，并使用声波反射定位在复杂的地形中躲避和快速飞行。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant vampire bat"
msgid_plural "giant vampire bats"
msgstr[0] "giant vampire bats"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant vampire bat"
msgid ""
"The Mega-Chiropteran Vampire (Giant Vampire Bat), began appearing 4 years ago "
"in locations with Northern European Vampire bats.  There were videos of them "
"bringing down large animals like goats and cattle before the Cataclysm as "
"well as pervasive rumors of them coming after humans."
msgstr ""
"巨型翼手目吸血鬼（巨型吸血蝙蝠）於 4 "
"年前開始出現在北歐吸血蝙蝠所在的地區。有影片顯示它們在大災變之前放倒了山羊和牛等大型動物，也有關於它們追捕人類的傳言。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "changeling wanderer"
msgid_plural "changeling wanderers"
msgstr[0] "换生灵行尸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "changeling wanderer"
msgid ""
"The outline looks human but the movements of the limbs are too willowy and "
"sinuous, a small knife flickers between its fingers in and out of sight.  Its "
"clothing appears to be skintight silvery chain or scale mail, it shifts in "
"the light."
msgstr "虽然轮廓看起来像人，但四肢的动作太过柔弱和弯曲，一把小刀在手指之间忽隐忽现。它穿着的衣服似乎是某种贴身的银色锁甲或鳞甲，在光照下不停变幻。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "changeling wanderer"
msgid "The changeling lithely throws a knife!"
msgstr "换生灵轻巧地投出一把飞刀！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "changeling bannerman"
msgid_plural "changeling bannermen"
msgstr[0] "换生灵旗手"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "changeling bannerman"
msgid ""
"A tall lithe humanoid of indeterminate gender, clad in silvery scale mail and "
"wielding archaic weapons.  Their sea-green eyes promise violence."
msgstr "一个身材高大轻盈且性别不明的人形生物，身披银色鳞甲，挥舞着古老的武器。他们海绿色的眼睛中闪烁着残暴。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "redcap aspirant"
msgid_plural "redcap aspirants"
msgstr[0] "红顶斗士"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "redcap aspirant"
msgid ""
"With a red feathered plume rising out of their helmet, this large combatant "
"is clearly a cut above many of the foes you've faced.  Ogrish features stare "
"out from under the blood drenched helmet."
msgstr "它的头盔底下冒出一缕红色羽毛，这只体型巨大的战士显然比你面对的许多敌人都高明。从血淋淋的头盔下可以看到恐怖的身形。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pooka aspirant"
msgid_plural "pooka aspirants"
msgstr[0] "普卡斗士"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pooka aspirant"
msgid ""
"This diminutive warrior possesses both animalistic features and custom made "
"arms and armor.  The twinkle in its eye seems to giggle as it readies its "
"weapons."
msgstr "这个矮小的战士既有动物特征，又有特制的武器和盔甲。当它拔出武器时，眼中的闪光似乎在咯咯地笑。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "March Lord"
msgid_plural "March Lords"
msgstr[0] "征战领主"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "March Lord"
msgid ""
"Nearly seven feet tall and whip thin, this warlord of the border realm of the "
"Nether is clothed in silks and silvery tightly woven chainmail.  It glares at "
"you and an ethereal sword manifests in its hand."
msgstr "这位来自异界边境王国的领主身高近七英尺（约2.1米），身披丝绸和银光闪闪的密织链甲。它怒视着你，手中挥舞着一把空灵的剑。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Wild Huntsman"
msgid_plural "Wild Huntsmen"
msgstr[0] "荒野猎手"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Wild Huntsman"
msgid ""
"Shrouded in an obscuring cloak, this fae warrior is crowned with an "
"impressive rack of antlers spreading through rents in its gossamer hood.  Two "
"burning blue eyes are all that is visible of its features.  In one mailed "
"hand, it holds a sword made of wood as black as ebony."
msgstr ""
"这位精灵战士身披一件遮蔽身形的月之纱斗篷，斗篷上裂开的口子中伸出一对令人奇异的鹿角。除了两道燃烧着的蓝色眼眸，其面容全然隐匿。一只披甲的手握着一把乌黑如檀木"
"般的木剑。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes your %2$s with its sword!"
msgstr "%1$s用剑猛劈你的%2$s！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes <npcname>'s %2$s with its sword!"
msgstr "%1$s用剑猛劈<npcname>的%2$s！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes your %2$s without penetrating your armor."
msgstr "%1$s斩击了你的%2$s，但未穿透你的护甲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armor."
msgstr "%1$s斩击了<npcname>'s%2$s，但未能穿透其护甲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Wild Huntsman"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s makes a gestures with one hand and a glow springs up around you!"
msgstr "%1$s makes a gestures with one hand and a glow springs up around you!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hound of the wild hunt"
msgid_plural "hound of the wild hunts"
msgstr[0] "荒野猎犬"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hound of the wild hunt"
msgid ""
"An enormous dog, a meter and a half high at the shoulder, with silvery fur "
"and multicolored eyes.  It sniffs the air and looks around alertly."
msgstr "一头身形庞大的犬兽，肩部足有一米半之高，皮毛如银，双目色彩驳杂。它翕动鼻翼嗅着空气，警觉地环视四周。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hound of the wild hunt"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s lets out a deep baying!"
msgstr "%1$s发出一声深沉的吠叫！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "draugr"
msgid_plural "draugrs"
msgstr[0] "尸鬼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "draugr"
msgid ""
"One of the changelings risen as the undead.  Shudders and jerks interrupt its "
"previously smooth movements.  The silvery mail that covered much of its body "
"is now tarnished and where it is damaged it looks more like broken skin than "
"broken armor."
msgstr ""
"由换生灵复生而成的不死生物。颤抖和抽搐打断了它之前平稳的动作。覆盖其身体大部分的银色锁甲现在已经失去光泽，而那些破损的地方看起来更像是破损的皮肤，而不是破损"
"的盔甲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "overgrown and cracked mirror"
msgid_plural "overgrown and cracked mirrors"
msgstr[0] "蔓生碎镜"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "overgrown and cracked mirror"
msgid ""
"What once would have been easily confused for a regular human, now tendrils "
"of fuzz hang loose from every wound this body received before and after death."
msgstr "也许以前会被误认为一个普通人，但现在，无数毛茸茸的触手从这具尸体在死前和死后的每处伤口上长了出来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "childlike fetch"
msgid_plural "childlike fetches"
msgstr[0] "童稚活魂"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "childlike fetch"
msgid ""
"It looks like either a child or a child sized doll.  However, the sharp "
"objects in its hands and the reflective nature of its eyes are the real tells "
"this isn't just a living child or doll.  You'd be hard-pressed to not feel "
"like you were killing an actual child by putting it down."
msgstr ""
"它看起来要么像个孩子，要么像个孩子大小的娃娃。然而，它手中的锋利物体和眼中反射出的光芒不停地告诉我们这不仅仅是一个活着的孩子或玩偶。然而你在杀死它时却很难摆"
"脱自己正在杀死一个真正的孩子的感觉。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "daffodil warrior"
msgid_plural "daffodil warriors"
msgstr[0] "水仙战士"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "daffodil warrior"
msgid ""
"Wispy and willowy these fetches are the cannon fodder of the Fae.  Said to "
"grow in vast fields under the hill and harvested right before a battle "
"legends say they live but a day.  Its features are quite plant-like and one "
"arm ends in an ornate club."
msgstr "这些纤细而柔弱的灵魂是妖精军队的炮灰。据说它们生长在山下的大片土地上，并在战斗前收割。传说它们只活一天。它的特征很像植物，一只手臂末端长成了一根华丽的大棒。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "daffodil warrior"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts into a rain of pollen!"
msgstr "%s 爆开成一团花粉！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shimmer wolf"
msgid_plural "shimmer wolves"
msgstr[0] "闪光狼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shimmer wolf"
msgid ""
"This is some form of otherworldly wolf.  Its luxurious fur shimmers in the "
"light.  If an Irish Wolfhound had an ancestor that couldn't be bothered to "
"mingle with mere mortal men it would be this wolf."
msgstr "这是某种来自异界的狼。它奢华的毛皮在光照下闪闪发光。如果爱尔兰猎狼犬的祖先不愿意与凡人混在一起，那它应该就会变成这只狼。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "goblin spider"
msgid_plural "goblin spiders"
msgstr[0] "妖精蜘蛛"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "goblin spider"
msgid ""
"A giant, dark gray goblin spider, the size of a pony.  Above the mandibles, "
"where you would expect to see the eyes, instead there is a child's face.  It "
"seems to vanish into the shadows if you take your eyes off it."
msgstr "一只巨大的、深灰色的妖精蜘蛛，有一匹小马那么大。在下颚上方你本以为能看到眼睛的地方，长着一张孩子的脸。如果你把目光从它身上移开，它似乎会消失在阴影中。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unicorn"
msgid_plural "unicorns"
msgstr[0] "独角兽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unicorn"
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing creature with a thick, shaggy, shimmering mane of hair, a "
"sweeping tail, and powerful-looking muscles.  Impossible to confuse with a "
"regular horse even if you don't spot the spiraled horn coming from its head.  "
"Rumor has it that some of the Fair Lords have ways to tame and ride this "
"magnificent creature."
msgstr ""
"一种草食性有蹄动物，长着浓密蓬松的闪亮鬃毛，不停扫动的尾巴和看上去十分强健的肌肉。即便你未注意到那头部突出的螺旋角，也不可能与寻常马匹混淆。有传言说，一些贤"
"明之主有驯服和驾驭这类雄骏生物的方法。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unicorn foal"
msgid_plural "unicorn foals"
msgstr[0] "独角兽幼驹"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unicorn foal"
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing creature with a thick, shaggy, shimmering mane of hair, a "
"sweeping tail, and powerful-looking muscles.  It has a stubby nub of a horn "
"growth starting.  This one is still a juvenile; it'll take a while before it "
"can be ridden."
msgstr "一种草食性有蹄动物，长着浓密蓬松的闪亮鬃毛，不停扫动的尾巴和看上去十分强健的肌肉。它初生的角还只不过是个粗短的小突起。它还未成年；需要过一段时间才能骑乘。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mavka"
msgid_plural "mavkas"
msgstr[0] "玛弗卡"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mavka"
msgid ""
"A beautiful woman clad in diaphanous robes that drifts in the water along "
"with her lengthy hair.  As she steps up and across the water you never manage "
"to see her reflection.  Suddenly, her hair moves and grabs some small animal "
"and pulls it towards herself."
msgstr "一个穿着透明长袍的美丽女子，随着她的长发在水中飘荡。当她起身跨过水面时，你始终看不到她的倒影。突然，她的头发移动并抓住一只小动物朝她拉去。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Melian mantis stallion"
msgid_plural "Melian mantis stallions"
msgstr[0] "迈雅螳螂马兽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Melian mantis stallion"
msgid ""
"An enormous green insect grown to about half the size of a giraffe.  It moves "
"in a weird, dance-like pattern but goes incredibly still as it positions "
"itself to be mounted.  These gargantuan mantis-like monsters are one of the "
"mounts that Seelie aligned knights will ride into combat.  It won't use its "
"attacks while it is ridden but if its rider dismounts or is knocked off, it "
"will stay nearby and protect them."
msgstr ""
"一种巨大的绿色昆虫，长到长颈鹿一半大小。它以一种奇怪的、像舞蹈一样的方式移动，但当它定位自己被安装时却难以置信地静止不动。这些巨大的像螳螂一样的怪物是西利联"
"盟骑士将骑上战斗的坐骑之一。当它被骑着的时候，它不会使用它的攻击，但如果它的骑手下马或被撞倒，它会留在附近保护他们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "will-o'-the-wisp"
msgid_plural "will-o'-the-wisps"
msgstr[0] "will-o'-the-wisps"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/changeling.json
#. ~ Description of monster "will-o'-the-wisp"
msgid ""
"Drifting lights in the distance, moving slowly, seeming to light the way.  "
"But to what?"
msgstr ""
"Drifting lights in the distance, moving slowly, seeming to light the way.  "
"But to what?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/cryptids.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Man of the Nineteenth Hour"
msgid_plural "Man of the Nineteenth Hour"
msgstr[0] "Man of the Nineteenth Hour"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/cryptids.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Man of the Nineteenth Hour"
msgid ""
"A tall and lanky old man wearing an old-fashioned winter coat carrying a cane "
"in his hand and a bag over his shoulder.  He absently look at the horizon, as "
"if waiting for something."
msgstr ""
"A tall and lanky old man wearing an old-fashioned winter coat carrying a cane "
"in his hand and a bag over his shoulder.  He absently look at the horizon, as "
"if waiting for something."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/cryptids.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Man of the Nineteenth Hour"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s is blotted by shadows for an instant then reemerges, visibly angrier "
"than before."
msgstr ""
"%1$s is blotted by shadows for an instant then reemerges, visibly angrier "
"than before."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/cryptids.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Man of the Nineteenth Hour"
msgid ""
"A tall and lanky old man wearing an old-fashioned winter coat carrying a cane "
"in his hand and a bag over his shoulder.  As he notices that you are awake he "
"prepares his bag and brandishes his cane, his visage warped by a twisted "
"combination of anger, hunger and disapproval."
msgstr ""
"A tall and lanky old man wearing an old-fashioned winter coat carrying a cane "
"in his hand and a bag over his shoulder.  As he notices that you are awake he "
"prepares his bag and brandishes his cane, his visage warped by a twisted "
"combination of anger, hunger and disapproval."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/cryptids.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Man of the Nineteenth Hour"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s is blotted by shadows for an instant then reemerges, visibly calmer than "
"before."
msgstr ""
"%1$s is blotted by shadows for an instant then reemerges, visibly calmer than "
"before."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/cryptids.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Olgoi-khorkhoi"
msgid_plural "Olgoi-khorkhoi"
msgstr[0] "Olgoi-khorkhoi"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/cryptids.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Olgoi-khorkhoi"
msgid ""
"Also known as the mongolian death worm, the olgoi-khorkhoi is a massive "
"acid-spewing blood-red worm.  As you see it, you start hoping for the stories "
"you've heard about the deadly poison coating its skin to be nothing but "
"exaggerations."
msgstr ""
"Also known as the mongolian death worm, the olgoi-khorkhoi is a massive "
"acid-spewing blood-red worm.  As you see it, you start hoping for the stories "
"you've heard about the deadly poison coating its skin to be nothing but "
"exaggerations."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/cryptids.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Olgoi-khorkhoi"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr "%1$s吐出了一团酸液！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shadow"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shadow beast"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "quickling shadow"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's appears to become two dimensional."
msgstr "%1$s's appears to become two dimensional."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadow beast"
msgid_plural "shadow beasts"
msgstr[0] "shadow beasts"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadow beast"
msgid "A large beastly looking shadow"
msgstr "A large beastly looking shadow"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "quickling shadow"
msgid_plural "quickling shadows"
msgstr[0] "quickling shadows"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "quickling shadow"
msgid ""
"A slight and spry shadow about the size of a tall boy, with a shadowy dagger "
"in hand.  It flits through the air from spot to spot, while it flies you can "
"see ragged and frayed threads hanging from the bottom of its feet."
msgstr ""
"A slight and spry shadow about the size of a tall boy, with a shadowy dagger "
"in hand.  It flits through the air from spot to spot, while it flies you can "
"see ragged and frayed threads hanging from the bottom of its feet."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "quickling shadow"
#, c-format
msgid "Threads stitch the %s back into whatever realm it comes from!"
msgstr "Threads stitch the %s back into whatever realm it comes from!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/dream_wound_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "quickling shadow"
msgid ""
"The quickling shadow flits across the space almost faster than the eye can "
"see, striking without warning!"
msgstr ""
"The quickling shadow flits across the space almost faster than the eye can "
"see, striking without warning!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "stoneling"
msgid_plural "stonelings"
msgstr[0] "石精灵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "stoneling"
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of rock, it doesn't seem to be fully intelligent but "
"more a mimicry of higher intelligence."
msgstr "它是一个由岩石制成的小型人形机器人，看起来并不完全智能，但更多的是对更高智能的模仿。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "monstrous badger"
msgid_plural "monstrous badgers"
msgstr[0] "巨獾"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "monstrous badger"
msgid ""
"A fairly large badger burrowed up through the ground near you.  It is both "
"larger than garden variety badgers and strangely seems to have more "
"intelligence in it."
msgstr "一只相当大的獾在你附近的地上挖洞。它不仅比普通獾大，而且奇怪的是，它似乎更聪明。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Biblical Hebrew term
msgid "shamir"
msgid_plural "shamir"
msgstr[0] "沙米尔虫"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shamir"
msgid ""
"Poking out of the ground, you see a what looks like a worm, barely bigger "
"than your pinky finger.  Its skin has a craggy, rocky texture, however, and "
"it very clearly has three black eyes on one end.  As you watch, it stares at "
"the ground and in a greenish flash, some dirt and stones vanish."
msgstr ""
"从地下探出来，你会看到一个看起来像蠕虫的东西，比你的小指大不了多少。 然而，它的皮肤有着崎岖的岩石纹理，而且很明显，一端有三只黑色的眼睛。 "
"当你观看时，它盯着地面，在绿光的闪光中，一些泥土和石头消失了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shamir"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at the rock!"
msgstr "%1$s stares at the rock!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spitting lizard"
msgid_plural "spitting lizards"
msgstr[0] "口水蜥"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spitting lizard"
msgid ""
"A small dog-sized furry lizard colored in ocean blues.  It hisses and then "
"spits gouts of water at whatever attracts its ire."
msgstr "一种小狗大小的毛茸茸的蜥蜴，颜色为海洋蓝色。它发出嘶嘶声，然后向任何引起它愤怒的东西吐出一大口水。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "water sprite"
msgid_plural "water sprites"
msgstr[0] "水仙子"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "water sprite"
msgid ""
"A mischievous creature made entirely of water, with a vaguely humanoid shape. "
" Its movements are graceful and fluid, and its voice is a musical tinkling."
msgstr "一种完全由水制成的顽皮生物，有着模糊的人形。它的动作优美流畅，声音悦耳动听。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "undertow"
msgid_plural "undertows"
msgstr[0] "暗流"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "undertow"
msgid ""
"A pair of frog eyes break the water, with a humanoid shadow below.  The water "
"around it churns against the current."
msgstr ""
"A pair of frog eyes break the water, with a humanoid shadow below.  The water "
"around it churns against the current."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Biblical Hebrew term
msgid "shabriri"
msgid_plural "shabriri"
msgstr[0] "夏波利利"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shabriri"
msgid ""
"You see nothing more than a mist in the air, with the vague impression of "
"darker spots that feel like they're watching you.  When you look at it, your "
"eyes itch and the edges of your vision dim."
msgstr ""
"You see nothing more than a mist in the air, with the vague impression of "
"darker spots that feel like they're watching you.  When you look at it, your "
"eyes itch and the edges of your vision dim."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "nuckalavee"
msgid_plural "nuckalavees"
msgstr[0] "海人马"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "nuckalavee"
msgid ""
"A giant grotesque centaur-like beast, with a skinless human torso grafted to "
"an equally skinless horse.  Thick toxic smoke leeches from its two mouths as "
"it affixes you with a gaze of pure malevolence."
msgstr "一只巨大而怪异的半人马般的怪兽，将无皮的人类躯干嫁接在同样无皮的马身上。滚滚毒烟从它的两张嘴里喷出，它用充满恶意的目光紧紧盯着你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "nuckalavee"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s breathes out a stream of toxic gas!"
msgstr "%1$s breathes out a stream of toxic gas!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Ratatosk's child"
msgid_plural "Ratatosk's children"
msgstr[0] "拉塔托斯克之子"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Ratatosk's child"
msgid ""
"A large granivorous rodent with a long bushy tail, often seen darting amid "
"the branches of trees.  A skittish varmint with an expression of unwavering "
"austerity, it is the mortal enemy of cat and dog alike."
msgstr "一只有着长长像毛刷尾巴的大型啮齿类动物，常常会见到它们在树林间穿梭。一个冰雪聪明的可爱坏蛋，跟猫狗是死对头。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "vineling"
msgid_plural "vinelings"
msgstr[0] "蔓藤兽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "vineling"
msgid ""
"A small animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with "
"alarming speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the center from which they "
"grow is concealed."
msgstr "地面充满了移动的藤蔓和根部，这些植物以惊人的速度像四周蔓延，他们成长的源头被这些混乱景象隐藏了起来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "thorn-bear"
msgid_plural "thorn-bears"
msgstr[0] "荆棘熊"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "thorn-bear"
msgid ""
"A bear, or something that looks like one.  Its eyes are a brilliant green, "
"moss grows throughout its thick fur, and foot-long woody thorns sprout from "
"its body."
msgstr ""
"A bear, or something that looks like one.  Its eyes are a brilliant green, "
"moss grows throughout its thick fur, and foot-long woody thorns sprout from "
"its body."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "defender of the wood"
msgid_plural "defenders of the wood"
msgstr[0] "森林守护者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "defender of the wood"
msgid ""
"An enormous man-like form with the head of a stag, over ten feet tall, "
"covered in short fur and wearing a loincloth of leaves and vines and topped "
"with a rack of majestic antlers.  It carries a long, sharpened stake of wood "
"as thick as a man's arm in one hand."
msgstr ""
"An enormous man-like form with the head of a stag, over ten feet tall, "
"covered in short fur and wearing a loincloth of leaves and vines and topped "
"with a rack of majestic antlers.  It carries a long, sharpened stake of wood "
"as thick as a man's arm in one hand."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "defender of the wood"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and you hear the creak of growing wood!"
msgstr "%1$s gestures and you hear the creak of growing wood!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiny elemental salamander"
msgid_plural "tiny elemental salamanders"
msgstr[0] "小型元素火蜥蜴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiny elemental salamander"
msgid ""
"A small dog-sized furry lizard colored in fiery reds.  It hisses and then "
"spits napalm-like fluid at whatever attracts its ire."
msgstr "一种小狗大小的毛茸茸的蜥蜴，颜色呈火红。它发出嘶嘶声，然后向任何引起它怒火的东西吐出凝固汽油弹般的液体。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "tiny elemental salamander"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s spits!"
msgstr "%1$s吐了一口！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "smoke mephit"
msgid_plural "smoke mephits"
msgstr[0] "烟雾人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "smoke mephit"
msgid ""
"A mischievous creature surrounded by smoke and particulates, with a vaguely "
"humanoid shape.  Its movements are sharp and jittery, and its voice is the "
"sound of fire crackling."
msgstr "一个被烟雾和微粒包围的淘气的生物，有着模糊的人形。它的动作尖锐而紧张，它的声音是火的噼啪声。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "firebird"
msgid_plural "firebirds"
msgstr[0] "火焰鸟"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "firebird"
msgid ""
"A bird flitting through the air, glowing brightly.  Its outline is obscured "
"by the flames that ripple along its wings and body."
msgstr ""
"A bird flitting through the air, glowing brightly.  Its outline is obscured "
"by the flames that ripple along its wings and body."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "firebird"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts into flames!"
msgstr "The %s bursts into flames!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "firebird"
msgid "The firebird lets out a cry and explodes in a burst of flames!"
msgstr "The firebird lets out a cry and explodes in a burst of flames!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Here referencing the serpents in Numbers 21:6, but the same root as the
#. modern word for the type of angel.
msgid "saraph"
msgid_plural "seraphim"
msgstr[0] "撒拉弗"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "saraph"
msgid ""
"This four-winged serpent constantly twirls and spins as it flies through the "
"air, its wings always in motion.  Or at least, you think so.  It's glowing so "
"brightly it's painful to look at, and the air around it wavers like the heat "
"haze over pavement at midsummer."
msgstr ""
"This four-winged serpent constantly twirls and spins as it flies through the "
"air, its wings always in motion.  Or at least, you think so.  It's glowing so "
"brightly it's painful to look at, and the air around it wavers like the heat "
"haze over pavement at midsummer."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "salamagman"
msgid_plural "salamagmans"
msgstr[0] "salamagmans"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "salamagman"
msgid ""
"A sluglike lower body made of barely cooled magma transforms into a glowing "
"red, squat, barrel-like torso and cooling magma forms a beard and hair around "
"its face.  Smoking obsidian hand axes and armor adorn it as it seeks out "
"enemies to destroy."
msgstr ""
"A sluglike lower body made of barely cooled magma transforms into a glowing "
"red, squat, barrel-like torso and cooling magma forms a beard and hair around "
"its face.  Smoking obsidian hand axes and armor adorn it as it seeks out "
"enemies to destroy."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "salamagman champion"
msgid_plural "salamagman champions"
msgstr[0] "salamagman champions"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "salamagman champion"
msgid ""
"A sluglike lower body made of barely cooled magma transforms into a glowing "
"red, squat, barrel-like torso and cooling magma forms a beard and hair around "
"its face.  A black mirror battleaxe reflects your image darkly back at you."
msgstr ""
"A sluglike lower body made of barely cooled magma transforms into a glowing "
"red, squat, barrel-like torso and cooling magma forms a beard and hair around "
"its face.  A black mirror battleaxe reflects your image darkly back at you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "salamagman warlord"
msgid_plural "salamagman warlords"
msgstr[0] "salamagman warlords"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "salamagman warlord"
msgid ""
"A sluglike lower body made of barely cooled magma transforms into the embers "
"of a slender torso, with wings of fire and smoke extending out from its back. "
" A club studded with obsidian shards graces their belt."
msgstr ""
"A sluglike lower body made of barely cooled magma transforms into the embers "
"of a slender torso, with wings of fire and smoke extending out from its back. "
" A club studded with obsidian shards graces their belt."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Venus figurine"
msgid_plural "Venus figurines"
msgstr[0] "维纳斯雕像"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Venus figurine"
msgid ""
"Resembling most of all the ancient art form of the Venus figurines, this "
"rounded female body sinously moves side to side as it steps.  It's eyes flash "
"yellow and green as they scan the area surrounding them."
msgstr "与大多数古代艺术形式的维纳斯雕像相似，这种圆形的女性身体在行走时会优雅地左右移动。它的眼睛在扫描周围区域时会闪烁黄色和绿色。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zoomorphic figurine"
msgid_plural "zoomorphic figurines"
msgstr[0] "兽人雕像"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zoomorphic figurine"
msgid ""
"A human shaped figure with the head of an animal.  Their skin shifts between "
"skin and fur across the body, and their fingers end in long talons."
msgstr "有动物头的人形人物。它们的皮肤在全身的皮肤和皮毛之间变换，手指末端长着爪子。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Nimue's dragonfly"
msgid_plural "Nimue's dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "尼米埃蜻蜓"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Nimue's dragonfly"
msgid ""
"A ferocious, iridescent multi-hued dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite "
"growing to the size of a football.  Its head is little more than a palm-sized "
"pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""
"一只凶猛的、彩虹色的多色蜻蜓，尽管长到了足球大小，但仍闪电般快速。它的头只不过是一双手掌大小的彩虹复眼，它的经过进化专门用来抓住猎物的腿上长满了弯曲的锋利尖"
"刺。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skyglass butterfly"
msgid_plural "skyglass butterflies"
msgstr[0] "琉璃晴空蝴蝶"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sheyd"
msgid_plural "shedim"
msgstr[0] "shedim"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sheyd"
msgid ""
"An ordinary person, until you look at second time and notice that their "
"shadow has wings and their feet are the clawed feet of a chicken.  When you "
"look away from them for more than a moment, they seem to disappear."
msgstr "他们初看时与常人无异，但当你仔细观察第二眼时，就会发现他们的影子竟长着翅膀，而双脚则是鸡的利爪。只要你的目光离开他们片刻，他们似乎就会从现实中消失。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "sheyd"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s glares at you!"
msgstr "%1$s glares at you!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/exodii.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Exodii Jotunn"
msgid_plural "Exodii Jotunns"
msgstr[0] "流亡族巨人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Exodii Jotunn"
msgid ""
"A truly massive heavy combat cyborg with six independent legs, two arms that "
"look like a cross between shovels and shields that can be rooted into the "
"ground to provide stabilized cover, two close combat arms that can swing over "
"top of the shields, and a weapon pod mounted on a swiveling turret."
msgstr ""
"一个真正巨大的重型战斗机器人，有六个独立的腿，两个看起来像铲子和盾牌交叉的手臂，可以扎根在地上提供稳定的掩护，两个可以在盾牌顶部摆动的近战手臂，以及一个安装"
"在旋转炮塔上的武器舱。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/exodii.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Exodii Jotunn"
msgid "The Exodii Jotunn fires its weapon pod!"
msgstr "流亡族巨人发射了它的武器舱！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/ferals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deranged zebra agent"
msgid_plural "deranged zebra agents"
msgstr[0] "疯狂的斑马探员"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/ferals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deranged zebra agent"
msgid ""
"This formerly buttoned up professional government agent has become deranged "
"and dangerous.  They move among the undead, handgun at the ready and saucer "
"pupils scanning for threats in a mockery of their former lives."
msgstr "这位以前沉默寡言的职业政府特工现在变得疯狂而危险。他们在不死者中移动，手枪随时待命，碟形的瞳孔扫描着威胁，这是对他们以前生活的嘲弄。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/ferals.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "deranged zebra agent"
msgid "The deranged agent fires their Five-seveN!"
msgstr "精神错乱的特工用五七式手枪开枪了！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/ferals.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "heavily armed zebra agent"
msgid_plural "heavily armed zebra agents"
msgstr[0] "全副武装的斑马探员"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/ferals.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "heavily armed zebra agent"
msgid "The deranged agent fires their P90!"
msgstr "精神错乱的特工用 P90 开枪了！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sniper bot"
msgid_plural "sniper bots"
msgstr[0] "狙击机器人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sniper bot"
msgid ""
"A doglike robot with a rifle barrel mounted on its back.  The quadrupedal "
"platform appears to grant a high level of stability in order to strike "
"targets at long range."
msgstr "像狗一样的机器人，背上装着一个步枪枪管。四足平台似乎提供了高水平的稳定性，以便在远距离打击目标。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "sniper bot"
msgid "\"Steady, steady.\""
msgstr "“稳住，稳住。”"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "sniper bot"
msgid "chk-chk pop!"
msgstr "咔-咔 嘭！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shotgun bot"
msgid_plural "shotgun bots"
msgstr[0] "霰弹枪机器人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shotgun bot"
msgid ""
"A heavy, but quick two-legged drone that holds a massive shotgun system above "
"himself.  Effectively a machinegun with legs."
msgstr ""
"A heavy, but quick two-legged drone that holds a massive shotgun system above "
"himself.  Effectively a machinegun with legs."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "shotgun bot"
msgid "chk-chk!"
msgstr "咔嚓！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cutthroater"
msgid_plural "cutthroaters"
msgstr[0] "割喉者机械蜘蛛"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/inventor.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cutthroater"
msgid ""
"A tiny arachnid-like bot with three manipulators with telescopic razor-sharp "
"blades."
msgstr ""
"A tiny arachnid-like bot with three manipulators with telescopic razor-sharp "
"blades."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/migo.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "stalking warper"
msgid_plural "stalking warpers"
msgstr[0] "stalking warpers"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/migo.json
#. ~ Description of monster "stalking warper"
msgid ""
"Once the mi-go revealed themselves in the last days before the Cataclysm they "
"released a number of animals to 'gather specimens'.  This four legged beast "
"resembles a cross between a cat and a monitor lizard, tongue flicking out and "
"splitting into multiple appendages.  Before the tvs stopped working people "
"witnessed these creatures biting and injecting some kind of warping venom "
"into their victims.  The changes that its victims would undergo were quite "
"shocking in those days."
msgstr ""
"Once the mi-go revealed themselves in the last days before the Cataclysm they "
"released a number of animals to 'gather specimens'.  This four legged beast "
"resembles a cross between a cat and a monitor lizard, tongue flicking out and "
"splitting into multiple appendages.  Before the tvs stopped working people "
"witnessed these creatures biting and injecting some kind of warping venom "
"into their victims.  The changes that its victims would undergo were quite "
"shocking in those days."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shimmering spider"
msgid_plural "shimmering spiders"
msgstr[0] "微光蜘蛛"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shimmering spider"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized spider, the air around it has a faint shimmer of light, possibly "
"reflected from tiny strands of webbing."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的蜘蛛，它周围的空气散发出微弱亮光，可能是由细小的蛛丝反射出来的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shifter"
msgid_plural "shifters"
msgstr[0] "移相怪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shifter"
msgid ""
"A tall body on four legs, surrounded by a \"glitched\" aura - it constantly "
"changes its own position."
msgstr ""
"A tall body on four legs, surrounded by a \"glitched\" aura - it constantly "
"changes its own position."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "duplicator"
msgid_plural "duplicators"
msgstr[0] "复制者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "duplicator"
msgid ""
"A humanoid on two legs, this creature spies on everything around with its "
"eight eyes, arranged in a circle.  From time to time it splits in two, where "
"the one on the left is in a defensive position, and the other attacks the "
"enemy with its long fists."
msgstr "这是一种长着两条腿的人形生物，它的八只眼睛排成一个圆圈，监视着周围的一切。它不时地分成两半，左边的一只处于防御位置，另一只则用它的长拳头攻击敌人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "duplicator"
msgid "The body of the duplicator splits in half!"
msgstr "复制者的身体一分为二！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ophanim"
msgid_plural "ophanims"
msgstr[0] "奥法尼姆"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ophanim"
msgid ""
"Their entire bodies\n"
"including their backs, their hands and their wings\n"
"were completely full of eyes\n"
"as were their four wheels."
msgstr ""
"他们的整个身体\n"
"包括它们的背部、双手和翅膀\n"
"完全充满了眼睛\n"
"他们的四个轮子也是如此。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "ophanim"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s shatter into pieces in silent explosion."
msgstr "%s在无声的爆炸声中碎成碎片。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "light"
msgid ""
"Flying piece of light in a shape of… a cube?  It constantly changes its form, "
"and each of its attacks tears the piece of space from the reality, causing a "
"ridiculously loud explosion.  Even if it's friendly, some of its action are "
"impossible to explain."
msgstr "一个立方体形状的飞行光？它不断地改变自己的形态，每一次攻击都会将这片空间从现实中撕裂，引发一场荒谬的爆炸。即使它很友好，它的一些行为也无法解释。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rat king"
msgid_plural "rat kings"
msgstr[0] "鼠王"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rat king"
msgid ""
"A towering swarm of mutated rats, their tails knotted together in a filthy "
"mass.  A fetid stench flows from its filthy presence."
msgstr "一群變異老鼠， 尾巴揉結在一起形成一個骯髒的肉團。散發出強烈的惡臭。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "rat king"
msgid "Rats suddenly swarm into view."
msgstr "鼠群從四周竄出於視線之中。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "flaming eye"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and you feel a sense of doom!"
msgstr "%1$s stares at you and you feel a sense of doom!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "remains of a dreamforged automaton"
msgid_plural "remains of a dreamforged automatons"
msgstr[0] "remains of a dreamforged automatons"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "remains of a dreamforged automaton"
msgid ""
"A broken robot, still standing and saturated with electricity.  Between the "
"shattered dreamdross plates, the ruined armor and the electrical discharges, "
"you can barely see the remains of the machinery that once animated it, and "
"yet it moves on its two feet, albeit like some sort of puppet."
msgstr ""
"A broken robot, still standing and saturated with electricity.  Between the "
"shattered dreamdross plates, the ruined armor and the electrical discharges, "
"you can barely see the remains of the machinery that once animated it, and "
"yet it moves on its two feet, albeit like some sort of puppet."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dream-drainer mosquito"
msgid_plural "dream-drainer mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "食梦蚊"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
msgid ""
"Forged from the wildest dreams and the worst nightmares, this gigantic "
"mosquito bloats as its proboscis syphons the air, as if it was feeding on "
"some invisible thing.  Looking at it, your mind blurs a little, making you "
"feel that what this monster is sucking are your dreams."
msgstr ""
"这只巨蚊从最野蛮的梦境和最恐怖的噩梦中诞生，当它的口器虹吸着空气时，身体也随之膨胀，就像它以某种不可视之物为食。看着它，你感觉意识有些模糊，让你感觉这只怪物"
"正在吮吸的是你的梦。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s shivers as its wounds close."
msgstr "%1$s shivers as its wounds close."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s buzzes loudly as its speed increases."
msgstr "%1$s buzzes loudly as its speed increases."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's shell hardens as you prepare to attack it."
msgstr "%1$s's shell hardens as you prepare to attack it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s points its proboscis at you, and a projectile bursts from it!"
msgstr "%1$s points its proboscis at you, and a projectile bursts from it!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "dream-drainer mosquito"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits you with one of its legs with tremendous force."
msgstr "%1$s hits you with one of its legs with tremendous force."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
msgid_plural "Luna-Attuned Revenants"
msgstr[0] "Luna-Attuned Revenants"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
msgid ""
"Nearly seven feet tall and whip thin, this grotesque mockery of a March Lord "
"is wrapped in fiery moonlight.  Moonlight courses its veins as the heart you "
"granted it pulses with power.  Its face is struck in a grimace of pain and "
"its eyes shine with endless hatred directed at you, the one responsible for "
"its current state of agony."
msgstr ""
"Nearly seven feet tall and whip thin, this grotesque mockery of a March Lord "
"is wrapped in fiery moonlight.  Moonlight courses its veins as the heart you "
"granted it pulses with power.  Its face is struck in a grimace of pain and "
"its eyes shine with endless hatred directed at you, the one responsible for "
"its current state of agony."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s decoheres and is consumed by the moonlight!"
msgstr "The %s decoheres and is consumed by the moonlight!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s points a finger at you, and a projectile suddenly appears from it!"
msgstr "%1$s points a finger at you, and a projectile suddenly appears from it!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#, c-format
msgid "A ray of moonlight bursts from %1$s!"
msgstr "A ray of moonlight bursts from %1$s!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#, c-format
msgid "Without the moonlight shining on it, %1$s is weakened!"
msgstr "Without the moonlight shining on it, %1$s is weakened!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Luna-Attuned Revenant"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s lashes out as it attempts to be exposed to the moonlight again!"
msgstr "%1$s lashes out as it attempts to be exposed to the moonlight again!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grasping globule"
msgid_plural "grasping globules"
msgstr[0] "grasping globules"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grasping globule"
msgid ""
"A large, irregular mass of greenish slime.  It forms tendrils as it perceives "
"you, likely to try and bring you closer of its stronger allies."
msgstr ""
"A large, irregular mass of greenish slime.  It forms tendrils as it perceives "
"you, likely to try and bring you closer of its stronger allies."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bashing globule"
msgid_plural "bashing globules"
msgstr[0] "bashing globules"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bashing globule"
msgid ""
"A large, irregular mass of reddish slime, forming appendages to bash its "
"targets.  It wanders blindly, waiting for something to come close enoug for "
"it to notice and crush with its mass."
msgstr ""
"A large, irregular mass of reddish slime, forming appendages to bash its "
"targets.  It wanders blindly, waiting for something to come close enoug for "
"it to notice and crush with its mass."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
