"Clad in leather armor and with a sword in hand, this warrior was summoned by "
"magic to defend you."
msgstr ""
"Clad in leather armor and with a sword in hand, this warrior was summoned by "
"magic to defend you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/summoned_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadowy warrior"
msgid_plural "shadowy warriors"
msgstr[0] "shadowy warriors"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/summoned_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadowy warrior"
msgid ""
"A shadowy figure, only barely visible as more than a mist, but the silhouette "
"of armor and weapons are obvious."
msgstr ""
"A shadowy figure, only barely visible as more than a mist, but the silhouette "
"of armor and weapons are obvious."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "monochrome zombie"
msgid_plural "monochrome zombies"
msgstr[0] "灰度丧尸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "monochrome zombie"
msgid ""
"What stands in front of you is one of the healthiest zombies you've ever "
"seen.  If not for the black muck oozing from its orifices and shambling gait, "
"you might even think it human.  Every part of this zombie, even its clothes, "
"is colored some shade of gray, and every couple of seconds it flickers."
msgstr ""
"站在你面前的是你见过的最健康的丧尸之一。 如果不是因为它步履蹒跚，口中渗出黑色的软泥，你甚至会认为它是人类。 "
"这具丧尸的每个部分，甚至它的衣服，都染上了某种灰色，每隔几秒钟就会闪烁一下。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "monochrome zombie"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "distorted zombie"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "zombie timewound"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s flickers and all of its injuries disappear!"
msgstr "%1$s flickers and all of its injuries disappear!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "distorted zombie"
msgid_plural "distorted zombies"
msgstr[0] "扭曲丧尸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "distorted zombie"
msgid ""
"This zombie is partially obscured by the gray, distorted air around it.  From "
"what you can see it doesn't have a single wound on its body, and it moves "
"much quicker than a zombie should.  Every few seconds the distortions surge."
msgstr "这只丧尸遮掩在周围扭曲的灰色空气内。 据你所见，它身上没有一处伤口，以比其它丧尸快得多的速度行动。 每隔几秒钟，扭曲的空气就会涌动一次。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie timewound"
msgid_plural "zombie timewounds"
msgstr[0] "时痕丧尸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie timewound"
msgid ""
"Every bit of color around this zombie has been sapped a distorted gray.  In "
"contrast with its healthy appearance, the surrounding environment seems to "
"slowly erode, even after it swiftly moves away.  It sharply flickers every "
"few seconds."
msgstr ""
"这具丧尸周围的每一点色彩都被抽走，变成了扭曲的灰色。 与它健康、完整的外表不同的是，周围的环境似乎在慢慢被它侵蚀，甚至在它飞快地移动走后也是如此。 "
"它每隔几秒钟就会剧烈地闪烁一下。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "zombie timewound"
#, c-format
msgid "The ground around %1$s starts eroding into nothingness."
msgstr "The ground around %1$s starts eroding into nothingness."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "monochrome boomer"
msgid_plural "monochrome boomers"
msgstr[0] "monochrome boomers"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "monochrome boomer"
msgid ""
"A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief.  Its entire body is tainted gray, "
"and it seems to emit a pulsating distortion that saps color from the world "
"around it.  Every few seconds the world around it seems to freeze, and its "
"likely that any damage will easily detonate the distorted time the zombie "
"barely holds within itself."
msgstr ""
"A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief.  Its entire body is tainted gray, "
"and it seems to emit a pulsating distortion that saps color from the world "
"around it.  Every few seconds the world around it seems to freeze, and its "
"likely that any damage will easily detonate the distorted time the zombie "
"barely holds within itself."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "monochrome boomer"
#, c-format
msgid "Everything around the %s suddenly stops!"
msgstr "Everything around the %s suddenly stops!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Living Paradox"
msgstr "悖论实体"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Living Paradox"
msgid ""
"You have an intimate sense for the flow of time, and you can use your power "
"to manipulate it.  Activate this trait to spend learned insight."
msgstr "你对时间的流逝有着敏锐的感知，并能运用自己的力量操控时间。 激活这一特性，就能消耗得到的洞悉。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Time Looped Knife Wound"
msgstr "时间循环刀伤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Time Looped Knife Wound"
msgid ""
"You have suffered a time looped wound, forcing you to repeatedly endure the "
"harm of an earlier wound.  Every 24 hours you are impaled by a non-existent "
"knife."
msgstr "你有一个时间循环的伤口，导致你不得不反复忍受之前的伤害。 每隔 24 小时，你就会被一把不存在的匕首刺中。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Slowed Timestream"
msgstr "缓慢时间流动"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Slowed Timestream"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your timestream remains slightly slower than baseline reality.  You act 10% "
"slower."
msgstr "你的时间流比基准现实稍慢。 你的行动速度慢 10%。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unstable Chronomancy"
msgstr "司辰法术失稳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/chronomancer_traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unstable Chronomancy"
msgid ""
"Your chronomantic powers have inherent instability.  While attempting to "
"maintain them over long periods of time, your powers may randomly fail."
msgstr "你的司辰能力有固有的不稳定性。当你试图长时间保持它们时，你的能力可能会在某一刻突然失效。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dreamer"
msgstr "梦行者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamer"
msgid ""
"Dreamers are people who are able to tap into the power of dreams and nearby "
"dimensions and create fantastical effects as a result.  They can even pull "
"some of this dream material into our world to build other things with it.  "
"Sometimes they hear outside voices that offer help and presents, and with "
"enough power, dreamers can pull them right from beyond.  Their power scales "
"with their natural perception and intellect."
msgstr ""
"梦行者是那些能够利用梦想和附近维度的力量并创造奇妙效果的人。他们甚至可以将一些梦想材料引入我们的世界，用它来建造其他东西。有时，他们会听到外界提供帮助和礼物"
"的声音，只要有足够的力量，梦行者就可以将它们从远处拉出来。他们的力量随着他们的自然感知和智力而变化。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Eater of Dreams"
msgstr "食梦者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater of Dreams"
msgid ""
"These people are aware of this cross-dimensional contamination and while they "
"can't pull anything over and make new things, they can eat anything they find "
"in our world that doesn't belong and gain abilities and powers from that "
"consumption.  They have larger than normal mana pools but regen that mana "
"much slower as a result, they can cast a spell to convert dreamdross scraps "
"directly into mana.  Their power scales with their natural strength and "
"dexterity."
msgstr ""
"这些人意识到这种跨维度的污染，虽然他们不能把任何东西拉过来制造新事物，但他们可以吃掉他们在我们的世界中发现的任何不属于他们的东西，并从中获得能力和力量。 "
"它们魔力总量更多，但魔力再生速度更慢。他们能施法将浮梦残渣直接转化为魔力值。 他们的能力与力量和敏捷值成比例。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dreamsmith"
msgstr "铸梦师"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamsmith"
msgid ""
"Dreamsmiths can forge dreamdross into a more durable form and create "
"permanent items that can be repaired."
msgstr "铸梦师可以将浮梦残渣锻造成可以存在更久的形态，并制造出可以修复的永久物品。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mad Genius"
msgstr "疯狂天才"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mad Genius"
msgid ""
"The Mad Genius uses their connection to other dimensions in order to "
"manipulate or even replace the physics of this realm with that of another.  "
"They turn toys and nonsense inventions into machines of incredible "
"sophistication and power, temporarily."
msgstr ""
"疯狂天才利用他们与其他维度的联系来操纵甚至用另一个维度的物理法则来取代这个维度中的法则。他们把玩具和无意义的发明变成了难以置信的复杂和强大的机器，但只是暂时"
"的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Hedgecraft"
msgstr "树篱巫者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/classes.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hedgecraft"
msgid ""
"The craft of the wise, provenance of cunning men, wise women, soothsayers, "
"knowers, herb-witches, and curse-lifters throughout history.  With the proper "
"components, and at the proper times and places, they can perform miracles."
msgstr "属于智者的技艺，历史上那些狡猾的男人、智慧的女人、预言家、通晓者、草药女巫和解咒者皆源于此。只要有适当的材料，身处适当的时间和地点，他们就能展现奇迹。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/cybernetic_traits.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "XEDRA Neurobionic Interface"
msgstr "XEDRA神经生化接口"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/cybernetic_traits.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "XEDRA Neurobionic Interface"
msgid ""
"The compact bionic command and control interface interwoven with your nervous "
"system had a previous life inside of a cybernetic tribesperson.  Best case "
"scenario, none of them are on this Earth."
msgstr "紧凑型生化插件的控制指令界面与你的神经系统交织在一起，曾经属于某个改造部落民体内。最好的情况，他们不在这个位面的地球上。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/dhampir_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DHAMPIR_UPDATE_BLOOD_SPENT_AMOUNTS"
msgid "This round's blood spent was <context_val:temp_value>"
msgstr "This round's blood spent was <context_val:temp_value>"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/dhampir_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DHAMPIR_CHECK_FOR_POWER_UPGRADES"
msgid ""
"Odds of gaining a new power are "
"<u_val:dhampir_blood_spent_compare_value_for_powers> in "
"<context_val:target_value>."
msgstr ""
"Odds of gaining a new power are "
"<u_val:dhampir_blood_spent_compare_value_for_powers> in "
"<context_val:target_value>."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/dhampir_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DHAMPIR_GAIN_NEW_POWER_MESSAGE"
msgid "You have unlocked a new ability from your use of your tainted blood."
msgstr "You have unlocked a new ability from your use of your tainted blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/dhampir_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DHAMPIR_GAIN_NEW_WEAKNESS_MESSAGE"
msgid "You use of your vampiric powers has caused you to gain a new frailty."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/dhampir_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DHAMPIR_WEAKNESS_BLOODLUST_CHECKS"
msgid "Crimson clouds your vision as you are overcome with an urge to drink blood."
msgstr "Crimson clouds your vision as you are overcome with an urge to drink blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/dhampir_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DHAMPIR_AVOID_EAT_SLEEP_DRINK_activated"
msgid "You have not enough power in your blood to sustain yourself."
msgstr "You have not enough power in your blood to sustain yourself."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/dhampir_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DHAMPIR_AVOID_EAT_SLEEP_DRINK_deactivated"
msgid ""
"You feel a wave of tiredness as you allow mortal needs to assert their will "
"once again."
msgstr ""
"You feel a wave of tiredness as you allow mortal needs to assert their will "
"once again."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/gracken_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "gracken_arm_push_spell ( Gracken Long Arms Spell )"
#, c-format
msgid "You extend your arms and push the %s away from you!"
msgstr "You extend your arms and push the %s away from you!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/gracken_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_GRACKEN_ARM_PUSH1_activated"
msgid "You lash out and push your target away!"
msgstr "You lash out and push your target away!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Ierde"
msgid "Soil and stone."
msgstr "土壤和石头。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Sylph"
msgid "Wind and weather."
msgstr "风和天气。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Undine"
msgid "Rain and wave."
msgstr "雨水和波浪。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Arvore"
msgid "Growth in adversity."
msgstr "在逆境中成长。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Arvorian Canker"
msgstr "Arvorian Canker"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Arvorian Canker"
msgid "Gorged with verdant power."
msgstr "Gorged with verdant power."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Salamander"
msgid "Touched by fire."
msgstr "触之以火。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Homullus"
msgid "Wish upon a star."
msgstr "向着星星许愿。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Fair Folk Noble"
msgstr "Fair Folk Noble"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Fair Folk Commoner, Brownie"
msgstr "Fair Folk Commoner, Brownie"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Fair Folk Commoner, Pooka"
msgstr "Fair Folk Commoner, Pooka"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Fair Folk Commoner, Selkie"
msgstr "Fair Folk Commoner, Selkie"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Fair Folk Commoner, Trow"
msgstr "Fair Folk Commoner, Trow"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
#. ~ Mutation class name
msgid "Lilin"
msgstr "莉莉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_eggsac_survivable_or_fatal" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "eggsac_mantain"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "eoc_eggsac_survivable_or_fatal" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "eggsac_mantain"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_eggsac_remove_survivable_or_fatal"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "eggsac_remove"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "eoc_eggsac_remove_survivable_or_fatal" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "eggsac_remove"
msgid "Spiders erupt from your body!"
msgstr "Spiders erupt from your body!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_thresh.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ierde"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Arvore"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Homullus"
msgid "You have ascended into your fae nature."
msgstr "你已经觉醒到你的妖精本性。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dreamless"
msgstr "无梦"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamless"
msgid ""
"You live firmly in reality and never experience extremely vivid dreams about "
"choices that have real world consequences.  ( You will be unable to gain "
"Dream magicks from sleeping after strange events)"
msgstr "你安稳地生活在现实中，从未体验过在其中做出选择能影响现实的极其逼真的梦境。（你无法经历奇异事件从睡眠获得梦境魔法。）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Transformed into Goblin"
msgstr "變成哥布林"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transformed into Goblin"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Transformed into Spider"
msgid "You feel like you've left behind your old life and form."
msgstr "你感觉自己舍弃了自己的旧生命和旧形体。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Transformed into Spider"
msgstr "变成蜘蛛"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ki Strike"
msgid ""
"Who needs weapons?  You deal more melee damage while fighting barehanded and "
"without gloves.  This damage improves as your unarmed skill increases."
msgstr "谁说要用武器呢？你在赤手空拳不戴手套时能够造成更多的近战伤害。伤害随着你的徒手格斗技能等级提升而提升。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Extended Life"
msgstr "延长寿命"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Extended Life"
msgid ""
"You swallow the potion and feel younger already.  Though the taste lingers "
"long past when you'd hope it would pass."
msgstr "你吞下药水，感觉自己更年轻了。尽管当你希望它会过去时，味道却久久挥之不去。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dhampir"
msgstr "Dhampir"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dhampir"
msgid ""
"You are a dhampir, the child of a vampire.  You have inherited a portion of "
"their vampiric power, as well as the ability to drink blood.  Hopefully you "
"can keep your urges under control.\n"
"\n"
"As a dhampir, your blood naturally slowly fills with power over time, which "
"you can use to fuel your abilities."
msgstr ""
"You are a dhampir, the child of a vampire.  You have inherited a portion of "
"their vampiric power, as well as the ability to drink blood.  Hopefully you "
"can keep your urges under control.\n"
"\n"
"As a dhampir, your blood naturally slowly fills with power over time, which "
"you can use to fuel your abilities."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blood Calls to Blood"
msgstr "Blood Calls to Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Calls to Blood"
msgid ""
"You can use the connection of your heritage to sense nearby vampires and "
"their minions."
msgstr ""
"You can use the connection of your heritage to sense nearby vampires and "
"their minions."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "vampire_sense"
msgid "You sense one of the vampires' servants here."
msgstr "You sense one of the vampires' servants here."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "vampire_sense"
msgid "You sense a vampire here."
msgstr "You sense a vampire here."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dhampir Fangs"
msgstr "Dhampir Fangs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dhampir Fangs"
msgid ""
"You have a set of small fangs, not as long as a true vampire's, but on the "
"other hand, you can retract them to more easily conceal them.  Activate to "
"extend your fangs."
msgstr ""
"You have a set of small fangs, not as long as a true vampire's, but on the "
"other hand, you can retract them to more easily conceal them.  Activate to "
"extend your fangs."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cold as the Grave"
msgstr "Cold as the Grave"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold as the Grave"
msgid ""
"Your half-dead flesh is inured to winter's chill.  As long as you have "
"empowered blood in your body, you suffer much less from colder temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Your half-dead flesh is inured to winter's chill.  As long as you have "
"empowered blood in your body, you suffer much less from colder temperatures."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "One Foot in the Grave"
msgstr "One Foot in the Grave"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "One Foot in the Grave"
msgid ""
"The deathly energies that course through your veins are inimical to mundane "
"poisons and diseases.  As long as you have empowered blood in your body, you "
"are more resistant to disease, poison, and infection."
msgstr ""
"The deathly energies that course through your veins are inimical to mundane "
"poisons and diseases.  As long as you have empowered blood in your body, you "
"are more resistant to disease, poison, and infection."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Light as the Last Breath"
msgstr "Light as the Last Breath"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Light as the Last Breath"
msgid ""
"While unable to ignore gravity like a true vampire, it has less of a hold on "
"you.  You can fall one story without ill effect and take greatly-reduced fall "
"damage as long as you have empowered blood in your body."
msgstr ""
"While unable to ignore gravity like a true vampire, it has less of a hold on "
"you.  You can fall one story without ill effect and take greatly-reduced fall "
"damage as long as you have empowered blood in your body."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Half-Dead Flesh"
msgstr "Half-Dead Flesh"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Half-Dead Flesh"
msgid ""
"Being born closer to death, you feel the sensations of the living less "
"strongly.  You suffer much less pain from your injuries than a human would, "
"and the pain affects your capabilities less."
msgstr ""
"Being born closer to death, you feel the sensations of the living less "
"strongly.  You suffer much less pain from your injuries than a human would, "
"and the pain affects your capabilities less."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "A Thousand Years of Night"
msgstr "A Thousand Years of Night"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "A Thousand Years of Night"
msgid ""
"You are only half-alive now, sustained as much by the energy in your blood as "
"by biological processes.  You age far slower than a mortal, and when your "
"limbs break, they heal more quickly in proportion to how much empowered blood "
"you have."
msgstr ""
"You are only half-alive now, sustained as much by the energy in your blood as "
"by biological processes.  You age far slower than a mortal, and when your "
"limbs break, they heal more quickly in proportion to how much empowered blood "
"you have."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Blood is the Life"
msgid ""
"While you must normally eat, sleep, and drink as a mortal must, in times of "
"need you can put that off.  Activate this trait to reduce your need for food, "
"water, and sleep to zero.  While active, the Blood is the Life will "
"continually expend the power in your blood, and when it wears off, you will "
"become exhausted in proportion to how long the trait was active.  You spend "
"<color_yellow>much more blood</color> if outdoors in the sunlight.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 1 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 1 ml per minute"
msgstr ""
"While you must normally eat, sleep, and drink as a mortal must, in times of "
"need you can put that off.  Activate this trait to reduce your need for food, "
"water, and sleep to zero.  While active, the Blood is the Life will "
"continually expend the power in your blood, and when it wears off, you will "
"become exhausted in proportion to how long the trait was active.  You spend "
"<color_yellow>much more blood</color> if outdoors in the sunlight.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 1 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 1 ml per minute"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Sun Sensitivity"
msgstr "Weakness: Sun Sensitivity"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Sun Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"While you won't burn in the sunlight like a true vampire, it's not "
"comfortable.  You suffer a -1 penalty to all stats when outdoors during the "
"daytime, and an additional -2 if it's sunny or clear."
msgstr ""
"While you won't burn in the sunlight like a true vampire, it's not "
"comfortable.  You suffer a -1 penalty to all stats when outdoors during the "
"daytime, and an additional -2 if it's sunny or clear."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Nocturnal"
msgstr "Weakness: Nocturnal"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Nocturnal"
msgid ""
"You aren't forced to slumber the day away, but you sure want to.  Your "
"sleepiness accumulates much faster while the sun is in the sky, but you have "
"an easier time sleeping during the day."
msgstr ""
"You aren't forced to slumber the day away, but you sure want to.  Your "
"sleepiness accumulates much faster while the sun is in the sky, but you have "
"an easier time sleeping during the day."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Slow Healing"
msgstr "Weakness: Slow Healing"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Slow Healing"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Being so close to death has slowed down the processes of your living cells "
"considerably.  You heal at 50% of the normal rate."
msgstr ""
"Being so close to death has slowed down the processes of your living cells "
"considerably.  You heal at 50% of the normal rate."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Animal Hatred"
msgstr "Weakness: Animal Hatred"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Animal Hatred"
msgid ""
"Animals can sense your dead blood and they hate it.  They may run or be "
"aggressive to you."
msgstr ""
"Animals can sense your dead blood and they hate it.  They may run or be "
"aggressive to you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Burned by Water"
msgstr "Weakness: Burned by Water"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Burned by Water"
msgid ""
"While running water is not deadly to you, it is uncomfortable.  Moving "
"through running water without a boat will cause pain."
msgstr ""
"While running water is not deadly to you, it is uncomfortable.  Moving "
"through running water without a boat will cause pain."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Corpselike Pallor"
msgstr "Weakness: Corpselike Pallor"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Corpselike Pallor"
msgid ""
"Your skin has the obviously-unnatural grayish-white tinge of a corpse, and "
"mortals will react appropriately to seeing it."
msgstr ""
"Your skin has the obviously-unnatural grayish-white tinge of a corpse, and "
"mortals will react appropriately to seeing it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Overwhelming Arrogance"
msgstr "Weakness: Overwhelming Arrogance"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Overwhelming Arrogance"
msgid ""
"The vampires are right about one thing; they are better than humans, and your "
"vampire blood makes you better as well."
msgstr ""
"The vampires are right about one thing; they are better than humans, and your "
"vampire blood makes you better as well."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Bloodlust"
msgstr "Weakness: Bloodlust"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Bloodlust"
msgid ""
"You have tasted blood and that taste forever lingers in the back of your "
"mind.  You will get cravings for blood that only time or drinking more blood "
"can sate."
msgstr ""
"You have tasted blood and that taste forever lingers in the back of your "
"mind.  You will get cravings for blood that only time or drinking more blood "
"can sate."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Thirst of the Damned"
msgstr "弱点：被诅咒的饥渴"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Thirst of the Damned"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Fresh blood has an energy that mortal food simply cannot compare to.  You "
"gain 33% reduced kcal from the food you eat, but additional calories from "
"drinking blood."
msgstr "新鲜的血液有着一种普通食物无法比拟的能量。你从食物中获得的卡路里减少33%，但可以在饮用血液时获得额外的能量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Weakness: Decreased Blood Empowerment"
msgstr "Weakness: Decreased Blood Empowerment"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Weakness: Decreased Blood Empowerment"
msgid ""
"The power of fresh stolen blood lingers in your veins.  The natural rate that "
"your blood empowers itself is cut in half."
msgstr ""
"The power of fresh stolen blood lingers in your veins.  The natural rate that "
"your blood empowers itself is cut in half."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Infected with the vampire disease"
msgstr "感染吸血鬼病"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Infected with the vampire disease"
msgid "You have developed a thirst for the blood of your fellow humans."
msgstr "你对你人类同伴的鲜血产生了渴求。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blood Arts"
msgstr "Blood Arts"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Arts"
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for vampire blood powers.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"This provides the school trait for vampire blood powers.  It should not be "
"visible."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gleaming Eyes"
msgstr "红莹之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gleaming Eyes"
msgid ""
"Your eyes gleam lightly red as the light catches in them and with a few drops "
"of the stolen blood in your veins you are able to see in the dark.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 100 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 50 ml"
msgstr ""
"Your eyes gleam lightly red as the light catches in them and with a few drops "
"of the stolen blood in your veins you are able to see in the dark.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 100 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 50 ml"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sanguine Ecstasy"
msgstr "猩红狂喜"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Ecstasy"
msgid ""
"Your palate adapted to your new condition.  Drinking human blood will make "
"you feel great."
msgstr "你的味觉已经适应了新的体质。饮用人血会让你感到由衷愉悦。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor Mortis"
msgid ""
"Your stolen blood reinforces your muscles, making your grip crack bone and "
"your punches dent steel.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 150 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 75 ml"
msgstr ""
"Your stolen blood reinforces your muscles, making your grip crack bone and "
"your punches dent steel.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 150 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 75 ml"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Resilience"
msgid ""
"Your cold flesh is not as vulnerable as it once was.  Activate to render it "
"even more resistant to physical damage.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 150 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 75 ml"
msgstr ""
"Your cold flesh is not as vulnerable as it once was.  Activate to render it "
"even more resistant to physical damage.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 150 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 75 ml"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Predator's Senses"
msgstr "Predator's Senses"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator's Senses"
msgid ""
"Your senses are heightened, allowing you to see more clearly, hear even tiny "
"sounds, and smell nearby fresh human blood."
msgstr ""
"Your senses are heightened, allowing you to see more clearly, hear even tiny "
"sounds, and smell nearby fresh human blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blush of Health"
msgstr "Blush of Health"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blush of Health"
msgid ""
"The power of stolen blood keeps you feel amazing.  As long as you are not "
"suffering from the Withering, you gain a bonus to your health."
msgstr ""
"The power of stolen blood keeps you feel amazing.  As long as you are not "
"suffering from the Withering, you gain a bonus to your health."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Silent as Death"
msgstr "沉寂如死"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Silent as Death"
msgid "Your movements don't make nearby as much noise as they used to."
msgstr "Your movements don't make nearby as much noise as they used to."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blood Lungs"
msgstr "血肺"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Lungs"
msgid ""
"Your fingers have developed bloodsucking properties, you can now suck up "
"blood through them.  You're not sure where the blood goes but with a thought "
"you can use these deposits."
msgstr "你的手指获得了吸血能力，现在你可以通过手指吸血。你不确定这些血流到了哪里，但只要一个念头，你就能将这些存货投入使用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_stamina_for_blood_spell"
msgid "Unholy Endurance"
msgstr "Unholy Endurance"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unholy Endurance"
msgid ""
"Your exhaust some of the blood in your veins to boost and recover some of "
"your spent stamina."
msgstr "你消耗血管中的一些血液，以增强和恢复一些消耗掉的体力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_commune_with_night_spell"
msgid "Learn from the Children of the Night"
msgstr "向夜之子学习"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Learn from the Children of the Night"
msgid ""
"You call out to the creatures that inhabit the night.  Wolves, bats, rats and "
"more.  They tell you about what terrain surrounds you."
msgstr "你呼唤夜行生物。狼、蝙蝠、老鼠等等。它们会告诉你你周围的地形。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sense the Children of the Night"
msgstr "Sense the Children of the Night"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sense the Children of the Night"
msgid "You can sense the presence of nearby predatory night creatures."
msgstr "You can sense the presence of nearby predatory night creatures."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "night_creature_sense"
msgid "You sense one of the creatures of the night."
msgstr "You sense one of the creatures of the night."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Walking the shadowed path of blood"
msgstr "Walking the shadowed path of blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Walking the shadowed path of blood"
msgid "You have new fangs to go along with your thirst for blood."
msgstr "你有了新的尖牙和对鲜血的渴望。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Coagulant Weave"
msgid ""
"Your body prepares to prevent the loss of any blood to combat damage.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 500 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 250 ml"
msgstr ""
"Your body prepares to prevent the loss of any blood to combat damage.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 500 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 250 ml"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_blood_heal"
msgid "Sanguine Restoration"
msgstr "Sanguine Restoration"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Restoration"
msgid "Your flesh heals visibly while blood disintegrates hidden inside your veins."
msgstr "你的皮肉显著愈合，而隐藏在血管中的血液则会分解。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Flow Like Blood"
msgid ""
"You can move faster than the eye can see, avoiding the claws and teeth and "
"weapons of your enemies.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 250 "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 125 ml"
msgstr ""
"You can move faster than the eye can see, avoiding the claws and teeth and "
"weapons of your enemies.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 250 "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 125 ml"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloak of Shadows"
msgid ""
"When indoors or at night, you can cloud the minds of nearby enemies, making "
"it harder for them to spot you.  This does not make you invisible.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 100 "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 50 ml"
msgstr ""
"When indoors or at night, you can cloud the minds of nearby enemies, making "
"it harder for them to spot you.  This does not make you invisible.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 100 "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 50 ml"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_fear_gaze_spell"
msgid "Predator's Mien"
msgstr "Predator's Mien"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Predator's Mien"
msgid ""
"With a bit of stolen blood and a savage expression, you can send your enemies "
"fleeing."
msgstr ""
"With a bit of stolen blood and a savage expression, you can send your enemies "
"fleeing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Corpse's Countenance"
msgid ""
"You are close enough to death now that you can easily imitate it; your "
"heartbeat slows to a near-stop, your breathing ceases, your flesh grows pale, "
"and you show no signs of life.  You will be unable to move or act while "
"feigning death, but enemies will generally ignore you.  You will be unable to "
"feign death twice in a short time if you are seen ending your masquerade."
msgstr ""
"You are close enough to death now that you can easily imitate it; your "
"heartbeat slows to a near-stop, your breathing ceases, your flesh grows pale, "
"and you show no signs of life.  You will be unable to move or act while "
"feigning death, but enemies will generally ignore you.  You will be unable to "
"feign death twice in a short time if you are seen ending your masquerade."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spider's Walk"
msgstr "Spider's Walk"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spider's Walk"
msgid ""
"Gravity seems to have less of an effect than it used it.  With barely an "
"effort you can ascend or descend even sheer walls, and you can fall any "
"distance and land on your feet uninjured."
msgstr ""
"Gravity seems to have less of an effect than it used it.  With barely an "
"effort you can ascend or descend even sheer walls, and you can fall any "
"distance and land on your feet uninjured."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Claws of the Beast"
msgstr "Claws of the Beast"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Claws of the Beast"
msgid ""
"You can twist your fingernails into sharp claws, allowing you to inflict "
"extra damage in unarmed combat.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 125 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 62 ml"
msgstr ""
"You can twist your fingernails into sharp claws, allowing you to inflict "
"extra damage in unarmed combat.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 125 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 62 ml"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Crimson Vision"
msgstr "Crimson Vision"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Crimson Vision"
msgid ""
"Your vision has improved and now you can see flowing blood in the vein, like "
"bright trails in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Your vision has improved and now you can see flowing blood in the vein, like "
"bright trails in the dark."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Carmine Vitality"
msgid ""
"Blood fills you with a surge of power.  You gain a bonus to your strength and "
"dexterity for one hour after drinking blood."
msgstr ""
"Blood fills you with a surge of power.  You gain a bonus to your strength and "
"dexterity for one hour after drinking blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal hungers"
msgstr "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal hungers"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mortal hungers are replaced with immortal
#. hungers"
msgid ""
"You replace some of your regular caloric intake with blood and begin to see "
"some of the more esoteric abilities inherent to vampirism."
msgstr "你用血液代替了一些常规的热量摄入，并开始获知吸血鬼固有的一些更深奥的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_hypnotic_gaze"
msgid "Hypnotic Gaze"
msgstr "Hypnotic Gaze"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hypnotic Gaze"
msgid ""
"You can mesmerize your prey, gazing into their eyes and freezing them in "
"their tracks."
msgstr ""
"You can mesmerize your prey, gazing into their eyes and freezing them in "
"their tracks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood-Driven Speed"
msgid ""
"Your body exceeds normal human reaction limits as blood turns to ash in your "
"veins.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 750 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 375 ml"
msgstr ""
"Your body exceeds normal human reaction limits as blood turns to ash in your "
"veins.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 750 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)\n"
"<color_light_red>Periodic Blood Cost:</color> 375 ml"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_magic_for_blood_spell"
msgid "Blood-Fueled Magic"
msgstr "燃血补魔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood-Fueled Magic"
msgid ""
"Your exhaust some of the blood in your veins to recover some of your spent "
"mana."
msgstr "你消耗血管中的一些血液，以恢复一些消耗掉的魔力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_command_beast_spell"
msgid "Cowing the Beast"
msgstr "威震野兽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cowing the Beast"
msgid "You are a supreme predator, and other predators bow at your feet."
msgstr "你是超凡的捕猎者，而其他捕猎者对你鞠躬屈膝。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_earth_slumber_spell"
msgid "Earthen Slumber"
msgstr "入土安眠"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthen Slumber"
msgid "You can sleep within the earth itself, avoiding the hateful light of the sun."
msgstr "你可以睡在大地之中，避免惹人生厌的阳光。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Incarnadine Energy"
msgstr "Incarnadine Energy"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Incarnadine Energy"
msgid ""
"The stolen blood within your body provides you with a fountain of energy.  "
"You gain a bonus to your Cardio rating."
msgstr ""
"The stolen blood within your body provides you with a fountain of energy.  "
"You gain a bonus to your Cardio rating."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wakeful Slumber"
msgstr "Wakeful Slumber"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wakeful Slumber"
msgid ""
"Your senses are so fine they can alert you to danger even while you slumber.  "
"Activate to cause yourself to wake up if danger approaches while you sleep."
msgstr ""
"Your senses are so fine they can alert you to danger even while you slumber.  "
"Activate to cause yourself to wake up if danger approaches while you sleep."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fortitude of the Damned"
msgstr "Fortitude of the Damned"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fortitude of the Damned"
msgid ""
"Your flesh is more resilient and you can suffer much more damage than a "
"mortal before expiring.  Your hit points are increased."
msgstr ""
"Your flesh is more resilient and you can suffer much more damage than a "
"mortal before expiring.  Your hit points are increased."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Discarded their mortality"
msgstr "Discarded their mortality"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Discarded their mortality"
msgid ""
"You have become a true vampire and are beginning to see some of the most "
"potent abilities vampirism has to offer."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "True Vampire's Potence"
msgstr "True Vampire's Potence"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "True Vampire's Potence"
msgid "Your new status as a true vampire has empowered your other abilities."
msgstr "Your new status as a true vampire has empowered your other abilities."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_torpor"
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_torpor"
msgid "Torpor"
msgstr "蛰眠"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Torpor"
msgid ""
"You can enter a deathlike stake known as torpor, in which your wounds will "
"close faster, your fatigue will fully recover and your blood thirst will be "
"less intense.  Be careful, though, as nothing will be able to wake you up "
"until eight hours have passed."
msgstr "你可以进入蛰眠一样的假死状态，此时伤口加速愈合、疲劳完全恢复、嗜血渴望大幅减轻。但请注意，在八个小时内没有东西能把你唤醒。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_dominate"
msgid "Dominating Gaze"
msgstr "统御凝视"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dominating Gaze"
msgid ""
"You can focus your gaze and take control of your target.  Only works against "
"targets that have a mind."
msgstr "你可以集中你的目光，取得对目标的控制。只对有意识的目标生效。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Facultative Breathing"
msgstr "兼性呼吸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Facultative Breathing"
msgid ""
"You do not need to breathe air to live anymore.  It prevents you from being "
"drowned or suffocated and allows you to ignore inhaled gases."
msgstr "你不必再呼吸空气以维持生命了。你不会溺水和窒息，同时可以无视吸入的毒气。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Corpse-like Flesh"
msgstr "Corpse-like Flesh"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Corpse-like Flesh"
msgid ""
"Your undead body is now much more dead than alive.  It prevents mundane "
"illnesses and parasites from affecting you, while granting you a total "
"immunity against radiation.  In addition, your scent is now something most "
"mundane creatures cannot understand."
msgstr ""
"Your undead body is now much more dead than alive.  It prevents mundane "
"illnesses and parasites from affecting you, while granting you a total "
"immunity against radiation.  In addition, your scent is now something most "
"mundane creatures cannot understand."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shape of the Night Flier"
msgstr "夜翼之形"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Night Flier"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bat and take wing on the night air."
msgstr "你可以化为蝙蝠来飞行，在深夜的高空中张开你的双翼。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shape of the Pack Hunter"
msgstr "Shape of the Pack Hunter"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Pack Hunter"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a wolf and stalk your enemies."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a wolf and stalk your enemies."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shape of the Billowing Mists"
msgstr "Shape of the Billowing Mists"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Billowing Mists"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a cloud of mist and flee any dangers."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a cloud of mist and flee any dangers."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fully fueled by the Blood"
msgstr "Fully fueled by the Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fully fueled by the Blood"
msgid ""
"By reaching the final stage of vampirism, you have freed yourself from your "
"mundane needs.  The only sustenance you need now is blood."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Master the Mortal Mind"
msgstr "Master the Mortal Mind"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Master the Mortal Mind"
msgid ""
"Your ability to influence others has amplified.  You can now spend blood "
"while talking with someone else to make them like you more, with the "
"costliest application of this power being able to turn them into your "
"obsessed servants.  Not all can be influenced by this power, for anger, panic "
"and strong ties to a group that isn't yours will disrupt the process.  Other "
"vampires and the rare saint-blooded are also immune to it."
msgstr ""
"Your ability to influence others has amplified.  You can now spend blood "
"while talking with someone else to make them like you more, with the "
"costliest application of this power being able to turn them into your "
"obsessed servants.  Not all can be influenced by this power, for anger, panic "
"and strong ties to a group that isn't yours will disrupt the process.  Other "
"vampires and the rare saint-blooded are also immune to it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Distillate the Inner Blood"
msgstr "Distillate the Inner Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Distillate the Inner Blood"
msgid ""
"Unlike lesser vampires who bloat as they gorge on blood, you concentrate the "
"blood you consume, making it fit nicely in your veins.  This removes the "
"penalties for containing too much blood, but doesn't expand your maximal "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"Unlike lesser vampires who bloat as they gorge on blood, you concentrate the "
"blood you consume, making it fit nicely in your veins.  This removes the "
"penalties for containing too much blood, but doesn't expand your maximal "
"capacity."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shape of the Shadowed Path"
msgstr "Shape of the Shadowed Path"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shape of the Shadowed Path"
msgid ""
"You can shroud your body and what you are carrying with shadows, amplifying "
"your combat ability but preventing communication and using other powers until "
"you return to your normal form.  It also costs blood for every second you "
"spend in that state."
msgstr ""
"You can shroud your body and what you are carrying with shadows, amplifying "
"your combat ability but preventing communication and using other powers until "
"you return to your normal form.  It also costs blood for every second you "
"spend in that state."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Last Breath's Mist"
msgstr "Last Breath's Mist"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Last Breath's Mist"
msgid ""
"Your mastery over your mist form has increased to the point that you can now "
"instinctively activate it should you be about to die.  It requires you to "
"have a lot of stolen blood in your body and can't trigger more than once a "
"week but might save your life."
msgstr ""
"Your mastery over your mist form has increased to the point that you can now "
"instinctively activate it should you be about to die.  It requires you to "
"have a lot of stolen blood in your body and can't trigger more than once a "
"week but might save your life."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Immortal Iron Mind"
msgstr "超凡钢铁意志"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Immortal Iron Mind"
msgid ""
"Your vampiric potency has reinforced your mind beyond anything a mortal could "
"ever hope.  You are immune to anything that could negatively impact your mind."
msgstr "你的血族之力已经将你的意志强化到了凡人所不能及的境界。你对任何能对你的意志造成负面影响的事物免疫。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blind the Sun"
msgstr "蔽日"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blind the Sun"
msgid ""
"You mastery over the shadowed path of blood has become much more potent, "
"allowing you to use your vampiric powers and a massive expense of blood to "
"blot out the sun for a few dozen minutes.\n"
"\n"
"<color_light_red>Initial Blood Cost:</color> 3000 ml "
"(<u_val:blood_amount_for_graph> ml current)"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Renfield"
msgstr "雷恩菲尔德"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Renfield"
msgid ""
"This person is now a renfield, a human obsessed with serving their vampire "
"masters.  This obsession impedes their cognition as they struggle to think "
"about anything but serving said vampire masters."
msgstr "此人现在是雷恩菲尔德，一个痴迷于服侍吸血鬼君主的人类。因为只知伺服所谓的吸血鬼君主，心中空无一物，所以这种痴迷妨碍了他们的认知。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Message in effect "mentor_vanish"
msgid ""
"You're not supposed to see this.  Open a bug report on Github about having "
"the Mentor's Peace trait."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect "mentor_vanish"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s vanishes in a fine mist."
msgstr "%1$s vanishes in a fine mist."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: blood drain"
msgstr "血族弱点：榨血"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: blood drain"
msgid ""
"You thirst for blood is more intense than usual.  You now need much more "
"blood to prevent blood starvation."
msgstr "你对血液的渴求比平常更加强烈。你需要更多的血液才能遏制血渴。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: revolting appearance"
msgstr "血族弱点：丑恶外表"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: revolting appearance"
msgid ""
"Your body brings to mind a rotting corpse.  Social interactions will be much "
"harder for you."
msgstr "你的身体让人想到腐烂的尸体。对于你而言社交会更加困难。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: earth-sleeper"
msgstr "血族弱点：大地沉眠者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: earth-sleeper"
msgid ""
"You now depend on the proximity to the earth to sleep well.  Should you sleep "
"or torpor aboveground or not surrounded by earth, you will suffer penalties "
"for the next day."
msgstr "你现在需要依靠大地才能睡得安稳。如果你睡眠或者蛰眠时在地上或者没有被大地环绕，你第二天会受到惩罚。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: rebuked by holy ground"
msgstr "血族弱点：受拒于圣地"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: rebuked by holy ground"
msgid ""
"Your flesh will burn should you ever enter a sanctified area.  Only places "
"that are holy will burn you, so holy places filled with vampires or unholy "
"humans are safe for you to enter."
msgstr "当你进入一个圣洁的地方时，你的血肉会燃烧。只有神圣的地方会灼烧你，所以充满了吸血鬼和不洁人类的神圣之地对你而言是安全的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: melted by vast water"
msgstr "血族弱点：溶于浩瀚"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: melted by vast water"
msgid ""
"Your flesh will melt should you ever try to cross a large body of water or "
"get too close to them.  Only rivers, lakes and oceans have enough water to "
"trigger this weakness, but it will take effect even if floating or "
"water-walking."
msgstr "如果你尝试穿越巨大的水体或者太靠近它们，你的血肉会溶解。虽然只有河流、湖泊和海洋会有充足的水触发这个弱点，但即使是漂浮或水上行走都会生效。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: hated by animals"
msgstr "血族弱点：动物仇恨"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: hated by animals"
msgid ""
"Animals cannot tolerate your wicked presence.  Expect any animal you "
"encounter to either flee or attack you on sight."
msgstr "动物无法容忍你的邪恶存在。你视野里的所有动物都会逃离你或攻击你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: vulnerable to fire"
msgstr "血族弱点：脆火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: vulnerable to fire"
msgid ""
"Fire damages you far more than it should.  You take massive damage from fire "
"and flames, mundane and magical."
msgstr "火焰对你造成的伤害远比它本应该的要大。你受到巨大的伤害，无论来自火苗还是烈焰，普通的还是魔法的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: cold as a corpse"
msgstr "血族弱点：冷似尸体"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: cold as a corpse"
msgid ""
"You now lack amy body heat.  You feel colder at all times, and being cold "
"will slow you down."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: living-drinker"
msgstr "血族弱点：活血饮者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: living-drinker"
msgid ""
"You now need to drink some fresh, warm blood from a living being once in a "
"while or suffer growing penalties.  You better find someone willing to share "
"their blood, as blood from fresh corpses won't satisfy this need."
msgstr "你现在需要饮用来自不时复活或正遭受活罪者的新鲜、温暖的血液。因为来自新鲜尸体的血液无法满足欲望，你最好找到愿意分享血液的人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: picky feeding"
msgstr "血族弱点：挑食"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: picky feeding"
msgid ""
"Your ability to process varied types of blood is now hampered.  Blood that "
"isn't regular human blood will only sate your thirst half as much."
msgstr "你消化血液的能力受到了阻碍。非普通人类的血液只会满足你一半的饥渴。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: blood cravings"
msgstr "血族弱点：鲜血成瘾"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: blood cravings"
msgid ""
"Your thirst for blood will occasionally magnify, causing painful cravings.  "
"You can calm these cravings as or before they happen by consuming blood."
msgstr "你对血液的饥渴偶尔会扩大，导致痛苦的成瘾症状。你可以通过在症状发作时或更早饮用鲜血以安抚这种欲望。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampiric weakness: barred from mortal joys"
msgstr "血族弱点：超脱凡俗"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric weakness: barred from mortal joys"
msgid ""
"Blood is the only thing that can bring a smile to your lips.  Nothing else "
"gives you any lasting joy or pleasure.  It is impossible for you to be truly "
"happy unless you recently consumed blood."
msgstr "鲜血是唯一能让你嘴角上扬的东西了。别的东西再也给不了你快乐和喜悦。除非你最近饮用鲜血了，否则你不可能感受到真正的快乐。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampiric Anathema"
msgid ""
"Through the consumption of self-cannibalizing vampire blood, you gained the "
"ability to consume vampire blood to gain vampiric abilities undreamt of by "
"other vampires."
msgstr ""
"Through the consumption of self-cannibalizing vampire blood, you gained the "
"ability to consume vampire blood to gain vampiric abilities undreamt of by "
"other vampires."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Inner Vault of Blood"
msgstr "Inner Vault of Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Inner Vault of Blood"
msgid ""
"Your vestigial circulatory system is now better at holding stolen blood.  You "
"can hold five more liters inside you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Eternally-Gleaming Eyes"
msgstr "Eternally-Gleaming Eyes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eternally-Gleaming Eyes"
msgid ""
"Your ability to see in the dark has expanded.  You no longer need to spend "
"blood to maintain your gleaming eyes."
msgstr ""
"Your ability to see in the dark has expanded.  You no longer need to spend "
"blood to maintain your gleaming eyes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Claim the Crimson Wine"
msgstr "Claim the Crimson Wine"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Claim the Crimson Wine"
msgid ""
"You can now attract the blood within a corpse's veins, extracting it all in a "
"second through a small cut.  In addition, you can create temporary blood "
"containers by spending mana."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Apex Vampire's Sight"
msgstr "顶级血族视野"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Apex Vampire's Sight"
msgid ""
"In comparison to you, regular vampires are the same as mortals.  You can now "
"detect nearby vampires, your new prey, even through walls."
msgstr "在你面前，一般的吸血鬼都相形见绌，仿似凡人。即使隔着墙壁，你现在也可以探测附近的吸血鬼，你的新猎物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unlimited Drinking"
msgstr "无限畅饮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unlimited Drinking"
msgid ""
"Your digestive system has warped to repurpose some vestigial parts, making "
"you much better at drinking blood.  Drinking reasonable amounts of blood "
"won't ever stretch your stomach, and you drink blood much faster now."
msgstr "你的消化系统发生了变形，以再利用那些残余部位，旨在让你更好地饮血。饮用适量的血液不再会占用你的胃，同时你饮用血液的速度更快了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "See Through Night's Eyes"
msgstr "See Through Night's Eyes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "See Through Night's Eyes"
msgid ""
"Your supernatural senses have expanded.  You can now see anything close to "
"some nocturnal creatures, even if they lack sight."
msgstr ""
"Your supernatural senses have expanded.  You can now see anything close to "
"some nocturnal creatures, even if they lack sight."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sanguine Paradise"
msgstr "猩红欢愉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sanguine Paradise"
msgid ""
"Becoming more vampire than vampires are has affected your new palate, making "
"the consumption of blood feel even better than before.  You now enjoy "
"drinking blood so much that enough of it will bolster your resolve for a "
"while."
msgstr "超越吸血鬼使得你的品味也发生了改变，吸血变得比以往更令人愉悦。现在你非常享受饮血，以至于足量的血液会在一段时间内坚定你的决心。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dead Silent Strikes"
msgstr "死寂打击"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dead Silent Strikes"
msgid ""
"Your lack of movement noise is now encompassing any noise you could do in "
"combat.  All such noises you would've made by attacking in melee are "
"nullified."
msgstr "你行动上的无声现在囊括了你在战斗中发出的所有噪音。你在近战中发出的这些噪音都会被消除。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ascended Anathema"
msgstr "Ascended Anathema"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ascended Anathema"
msgid ""
"You drank enough vampire blood to gain access to power the mentors never "
"thought possible.  There is no more limit to how powerful of a vampire you "
"can be."
msgstr ""
"You drank enough vampire blood to gain access to power the mentors never "
"thought possible.  There is no more limit to how powerful of a vampire you "
"can be."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Inner Sea of Blood"
msgstr "血之内海"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Inner Sea of Blood"
msgid ""
"Your new power allows you to store even more stolen blood inside your body.  "
"You can hold another ten liters inside you."
msgstr "你的新能力允许你在体内储存更多窃取的血液。你可以在体内储存额外的十升血液。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shrouded by the Shadowed Path"
msgid ""
"Darkness is your home, and you can call it to shroud you from others.  When "
"away from the sun, you can become invisible with a constant expense of blood."
msgstr ""
"Darkness is your home, and you can call it to shroud you from others.  When "
"away from the sun, you can become invisible with a constant expense of blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stitched by the Shadowed Path"
msgstr "Stitched by the Shadowed Path"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stitched by the Shadowed Path"
msgid ""
"Darkness is your new friend, and like a good friend it helps you through hard "
"times.  Passively heal your wounds and reduce your pain while away from the "
"sun."
msgstr ""
"Darkness is your new friend, and like a good friend it helps you through hard "
"times.  Passively heal your wounds and reduce your pain while away from the "
"sun."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Boiling Crimson Cauldron"
msgstr "Boiling Crimson Cauldron"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Boiling Crimson Cauldron"
msgid ""
"The powers of vampires come through their sustenance of blood, and you now "
"know how to use this at your advantage.  You can increase your need for blood "
"to boost your vampiric potency until you decide to stop the effect.  If you "
"do not have enough blood, it will have no effect until you drink more blood."
msgstr ""
"The powers of vampires come through their sustenance of blood, and you now "
"know how to use this at your advantage.  You can increase your need for blood "
"to boost your vampiric potency until you decide to stop the effect.  If you "
"do not have enough blood, it will have no effect until you drink more blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Boiling Crimson Cauldron Real"
msgid ""
"Increases blood potency and drain while the player-visible version is active "
"and has enough blood.  You should never see this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Immortal's Health"
msgstr "Immortal's Health"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Immortal's Health"
msgid ""
"Being protected against mundane afflictions only is something your flesh has "
"stopped tolerating.  Your condition now protects you from any illness, "
"parasite and poison, no matter how dangerous they are."
msgstr ""
"Being protected against mundane afflictions only is something your flesh has "
"stopped tolerating.  Your condition now protects you from any illness, "
"parasite and poison, no matter how dangerous they are."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mastery of Forms"
msgstr "Mastery of Forms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mastery of Forms"
msgid ""
"You are much more attuned to your other forms, and they are now easier to "
"activate than ever.  The cost to activate them is halved."
msgstr ""
"You are much more attuned to your other forms, and they are now easier to "
"activate than ever.  The cost to activate them is halved."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Second Final Breath"
msgstr "Second Final Breath"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Second Final Breath"
msgid ""
"Your instinctive mastery of your mist form has expanded.  You now recover "
"from triggering Last Breath's Mist twice as quickly."
msgstr ""
"Your instinctive mastery of your mist form has expanded.  You now recover "
"from triggering Last Breath's Mist twice as quickly."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fueled by the Blood-Drinkers' Blood"
msgstr "Fueled by the Blood-Drinkers' Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fueled by the Blood-Drinkers' Blood"
msgid ""
"Vampires, mortals, they are all the same for you now.  Drinking vampire blood "
"now gives all the benefits of drinking regular blood, in addition to growing "
"your power."
msgstr ""
"Vampires, mortals, they are all the same for you now.  Drinking vampire blood "
"now gives all the benefits of drinking regular blood, in addition to growing "
"your power."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Knowledge of the Blood"
msgstr "Knowledge of the Blood"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Knowledge of the Blood"
msgid ""
"Your own blood now reveals its secrets to you.  Every week, you will gain a "
"new gift of the blood.  It will only give you what researching your blood "
"gifts could give you."
msgstr ""
"Your own blood now reveals its secrets to you.  Every week, you will gain a "
"new gift of the blood.  It will only give you what researching your blood "
"gifts could give you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Maximal Mastery of the Mortal Mind"
msgstr "Maximal Mastery of the Mortal Mind"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Maximal Mastery of the Mortal Mind"
msgid "Your mind-control abilities are much simpler to use now, halving their cost."
msgstr "Your mind-control abilities are much simpler to use now, halving their cost."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Anathema's Weakness: Slain by the Sun"
msgstr "Anathema's Weakness: Slain by the Sun"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Anathema's Weakness: Slain by the Sun"
msgid ""
"Vampires burn under the sun, and becoming more of a vampire made you burn far "
"more than any other vampire would.  While under the sun, you will take "
"constant damage no matter how covered you are."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Anathema's Weakness: Blood-Muddled Mind"
msgstr "Anathema's Weakness: Blood-Muddled Mind"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Anathema's Weakness: Blood-Muddled Mind"
msgid ""
"Your constant consumption of vampire blood has permanently destabilized your "
"mind, and it will only grow worse with each new vampire drained.  Each time "
"you drink vampire blood, you have a growing chance to gain a new mental "
"affliction."
msgstr ""
"Your constant consumption of vampire blood has permanently destabilized your "
"mind, and it will only grow worse with each new vampire drained.  Each time "
"you drink vampire blood, you have a growing chance to gain a new mental "
"affliction."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Anathema's Weakness: Apex's Thirst"
msgstr "Anathema's Weakness: Apex's Thirst"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Anathema's Weakness: Apex's Thirst"
msgid ""
"Drinking all this vampire blood has left your body yearning for more.  Going "
"too long without drinking vampire blood will progressively increase your "
"thirst for blood with each passing day until you starve or drink vampire "
"blood."
msgstr ""
"Drinking all this vampire blood has left your body yearning for more.  Going "
"too long without drinking vampire blood will progressively increase your "
"thirst for blood with each passing day until you starve or drink vampire "
"blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Saint's blood"
msgstr "圣血"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Saint's blood"
msgid ""
"Through a complicated ritual utilizing a saint's relic, you have "
"transubstantiated your own blood with the holy blood of the saints.  It'll "
"prevent you from becoming infected with vampirism while you live, effects "
"postmortem unknown."
msgstr "通过使用圣人遗物的复杂仪式，你已经用圣人的圣血转化了你自己的血液。它会防止你在活着的时候感染吸血鬼，死后效果未知。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Future Sight"
msgstr "未来视界"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Eater's Sixth Sense"
msgstr "食梦者第六感"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eater's Sixth Sense"
msgid ""
"You are no longer limited to the five senses common to most humans in your "
"hunt for the unnatural."
msgstr "在追捕非自然生物的过程中，你不再局限于大多数人类常见的五种感官。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Authority"
msgstr "Fae Authority"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Authority"
msgid ""
"Boann bestowed upon you the right to summon a few daffodil warriors once a "
"day."
msgstr ""
"Boann bestowed upon you the right to summon a few daffodil warriors once a "
"day."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Enmity"
msgstr "精灵仇隙"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Enmity"
msgid ""
"The Fair Folk can sense the stolen power within you and their vengeance will "
"be terrible."
msgstr "仙灵们能够察觉到你体内窃取而来的魔力，他们的报复将超乎想象的恐怖。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "False Arvore"
msgstr "False Arvore"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "False Arvore"
msgid ""
"The arvore can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react well "
"to it."
msgstr ""
"The arvore can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react well "
"to it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "False Homullus"
msgstr "False Homullus"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "False Homullus"
msgid ""
"The homullus can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react "
"well to it."
msgstr ""
"The homullus can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react "
"well to it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "False Salamander"
msgstr "False Salamander"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "False Salamander"
msgid ""
"The salamanders can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react "
"well to it."
msgstr ""
"The salamanders can sense the stolen power within you and they will not react "
"well to it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Noble"
msgstr "貴族"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Noble"
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as one of the nobility of the "
"Fair Folk."
msgstr ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as one of the nobility of the "
"Fair Folk."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Commoner Changeling"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Commoner Changeling"
msgid "This tracks your heritage, used to pick a subcategory.  You shouldn't see it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Summer Court"
msgstr "Summer Court"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Summer Court"
msgid ""
"You are a member of the Summer Court, sometimes called the Seelie Court, the "
"faeries recognized as benevolent by mortals.  Or, at least, the faeries who "
"are slightly less likely to levy a generational curses on those who wrong "
"them."
msgstr ""
"You are a member of the Summer Court, sometimes called the Seelie Court, the "
"faeries recognized as benevolent by mortals.  Or, at least, the faeries who "
"are slightly less likely to levy a generational curses on those who wrong "
"them."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Winter Court"
msgstr "Winter Court"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Winter Court"
msgid ""
"You are a member of the Winter Court, sometimes called the Unseelie Court, "
"the faeries most feared by mortals.  Too bad there's so few of them around "
"nowadays."
msgstr ""
"You are a member of the Winter Court, sometimes called the Unseelie Court, "
"the faeries most feared by mortals.  Too bad there's so few of them around "
"nowadays."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Glamour"
msgstr "Glamour"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Glamour"
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Changeling magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spring"
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Spring seasonal magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Summer"
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Summer seasonal magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Autumn"
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Autumn seasonal magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Winter"
msgid ""
"This provides the school trait for Winter seasonal magic.  It should not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Changeling"
msgstr "Changeling"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Changeling"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  While you find it uncomfortable ever since your heritage asserted "
"itself, your time in the mortal realm has inured you to the presence of iron. "
" However, it has not done so enough to allow you to install any CBMs."
msgstr ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  While you find it uncomfortable ever since your heritage asserted "
"itself, your time in the mortal realm has inured you to the presence of iron. "
" However, it has not done so enough to allow you to install any CBMs."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Brownie"
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a brownie, hard-working "
"and mostly unseen."
msgstr ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a brownie, hard-working "
"and mostly unseen."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pooka"
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a pooka, a shapeshifter "
"close to nature."
msgstr ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a pooka, a shapeshifter "
"close to nature."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Selkie"
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a selkie, with one foot on "
"the land and one in the sea."
msgstr ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a selkie, with one foot on "
"the land and one in the sea."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Trow"
msgid ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a trow, strong and "
"enduring as the mountains."
msgstr ""
"You have awakened your long-slumbering heritage as a trow, strong and "
"enduring as the mountains."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_noble_cure_bad_conditions_spell"
msgid "Lights of Imbolc"
msgstr "Lights of Imbolc"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lights of Imbolc"
msgid ""
"The end of winter brings hope for the coming of spring, and in the light of "
"the candles lit at Imbolc the dust and gloom of the long nights end."
msgstr ""
"The end of winter brings hope for the coming of spring, and in the light of "
"the candles lit at Imbolc the dust and gloom of the long nights end."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fires of Bealtaine"
msgid "The bonfires of Bealtaine drive away evil and purify both man and beast."
msgstr "The bonfires of Bealtaine drive away evil and purify both man and beast."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Deeds of Lughnasadh"
msgid ""
"Lughnasadh is a time for bringing in the harvest and for contests of skill "
"and stamina."
msgstr ""
"Lughnasadh is a time for bringing in the harvest and for contests of skill "
"and stamina."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_noble_summon_ghosts_spell"
msgid "Hosts of Samhain"
msgstr "Hosts of Samhain"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hosts of Samhain"
msgid ""
"As the year dies and winter's winds begin to blow, the dead return for a "
"short time to visit the living."
msgstr ""
"As the year dies and winter's winds begin to blow, the dead return for a "
"short time to visit the living."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Right of Passage"
msgstr "Right of Passage"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Right of Passage"
msgid ""
"The Fair Folk have dealt with many mortal civilizations over the aeons, and "
"have come to mutually beneficial arrangements with some of them.  Activate "
"this trait to make your fae nature obvious, invoking those ancient "
"agreements.  This <color_yellow>may anger</color> some who have especially "
"bad relationships with the fae."
msgstr ""
"The Fair Folk have dealt with many mortal civilizations over the aeons, and "
"have come to mutually beneficial arrangements with some of them.  Activate "
"this trait to make your fae nature obvious, invoking those ancient "
"agreements.  This <color_yellow>may anger</color> some who have especially "
"bad relationships with the fae."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the A.E. poem 'A Call of the Sidhe'
msgid "Murmurs the Mighty One"
msgstr "Murmurs the Mighty One"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Murmurs the Mighty One"
msgid ""
"You are strong enough to defend a crossroads at twilight against all comers.  "
"+3 Strength."
msgstr ""
"You are strong enough to defend a crossroads at twilight against all comers.  "
"+3 Strength."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Rose Fyleman poem 'Alms in Autumn'
msgid "All Dancing with Delight"
msgstr "All Dancing with Delight"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "All Dancing with Delight"
msgid ""
"You are graceful enough to dance the night away beneath a crystal dome on a "
"floor of mirror-bright silver.  +3 Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"You are graceful enough to dance the night away beneath a crystal dome on a "
"floor of mirror-bright silver.  +3 Dexterity."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Lord Dunsany poem 'The Fairy Child'
msgid "At Speed Unthought Of"
msgstr "At Speed Unthought Of"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "At Speed Unthought Of"
msgid "Your reactions are inhumanly quick.  +15 Speed."
msgstr "Your reactions are inhumanly quick.  +15 Speed."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wisdom from the Well"
msgstr "Wisdom from the Well"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wisdom from the Well"
msgid ""
"Like the legendary salmon who ate the nine acorns, you have gained a plethora "
"of wisdom.  +3 Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Like the legendary salmon who ate the nine acorns, you have gained a plethora "
"of wisdom.  +3 Intelligence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Charlotte Mew poem 'The Changeling'
msgid "Hear the Whole World Whispering"
msgstr "Hear the Whole World Whispering"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hear the Whole World Whispering"
msgid ""
"You senses are far more attuned to your surroundings than previously.  +3 "
"Perception."
msgstr ""
"You senses are far more attuned to your surroundings than previously.  +3 "
"Perception."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dreamwalker"
msgstr "梦行者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dreamwalker"
msgid ""
"From the dreams of mortals, you can spin remnants of fantasy into material "
"substance.  When you sleep near mortals, you have a chance to awaken with "
"some dreamdross nearby."
msgstr ""
"From the dreams of mortals, you can spin remnants of fantasy into material "
"substance.  When you sleep near mortals, you have a chance to awaken with "
"some dreamdross nearby."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_noble_command_commoners_spell"
msgid "Sovereign's Command"
msgstr "Sovereign's Command"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sovereign's Command"
msgid ""
"Invoke your rights as one of noble birth and exert your authority over the "
"commoner fae, forcing them to obey your commands.  The glamour will only last "
"a short time, and the target is under no obligation to look on your favorably "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Invoke your rights as one of noble birth and exert your authority over the "
"commoner fae, forcing them to obey your commands.  The glamour will only last "
"a short time, and the target is under no obligation to look on your favorably "
"afterwards."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Yeats poem 'The Stolen Child'
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_noble_charm_humans_spell"
msgid "Come Away, O Human Child"
msgstr "Come Away, O Human Child"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Come Away, O Human Child"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Beguilement"
msgid ""
"Glamour a human into defending you for a short period of time.  When the "
"glamour ends, all effects end and the human will not be well-disposed toward "
"you afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Glamour a human into defending you for a short period of time.  When the "
"glamour ends, all effects end and the human will not be well-disposed toward "
"you afterwards."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ A reference to the Yeats poem 'The Hosting of the Sidhe'
msgid "Empty Your Heart of its Mortal Dream"
msgstr "Empty Your Heart of its Mortal Dream"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Empty Your Heart of its Mortal Dream"
msgid ""
"Your mindset is shifting to the alien morality of those from Under the Hill.  "
"You can control this to some extent, though it may also overtake you in times "
"of pain or stress."
msgstr ""
"Your mindset is shifting to the alien morality of those from Under the Hill.  "
"You can control this to some extent, though it may also overtake you in times "
"of pain or stress."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Household Artistry"
msgstr "Household Artistry"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Household Artistry"
msgid ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's easy for "
"you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to watch you do "
"it."
msgstr ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's easy for "
"you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to watch you do "
"it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Adept Household Artistry"
msgstr "Adept Household Artistry"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Adept Household Artistry"
msgid ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's very easy "
"for you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to watch you "
"do it."
msgstr ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's very easy "
"for you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to watch you "
"do it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Incomparable Household Artistry"
msgstr "Incomparable Household Artistry"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Incomparable Household Artistry"
msgid ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's almost "
"effortless for you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to "
"watch you do it."
msgstr ""
"The brownies are the unassuming crafters of the Fair Folk, and it's almost "
"effortless for you to build and repair things, as long as no one is nearby to "
"watch you do it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unobtrusive"
msgstr "Unobtrusive"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unobtrusive"
msgid ""
"Your appearance hasn't changed, but people don't seem to notice you as much "
"as they used to.  As long as you don't engage in combat, you're easy to "
"overlook."
msgstr ""
"Your appearance hasn't changed, but people don't seem to notice you as much "
"as they used to.  As long as you don't engage in combat, you're easy to "
"overlook."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Inconspicuous"
msgstr "邊緣人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Inconspicuous"
msgid ""
"Your appearance hasn't changed, but people really don't seem to notice you as "
"much as they used to.  As long as you don't engage in combat, you're very "
"easy to overlook."
msgstr ""
"Your appearance hasn't changed, but people really don't seem to notice you as "
"much as they used to.  As long as you don't engage in combat, you're very "
"easy to overlook."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Tolerance"
msgid "The cold doesn't seem to bother you quite as much anymore."
msgstr "The cold doesn't seem to bother you quite as much anymore."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cold Endurance"
msgstr "耐寒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Endurance"
msgid "Even on a winter day, you need only a light jacket now."
msgstr "即使在冬天，你也可以只穿着一件轻薄的夹克。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Inured to Cold"
msgstr "Inured to Cold"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Inured to Cold"
msgid ""
"Legends say that brownies went about naked clad only in their almost-furry "
"coat, and while you wouldn't go that far, you could wear a swimsuit in a "
"blizzard without much trouble."
msgstr ""
"Legends say that brownies went about naked clad only in their almost-furry "
"coat, and while you wouldn't go that far, you could wear a swimsuit in a "
"blizzard without much trouble."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Churning As Quick as a Wink"
msgstr "Churning As Quick as a Wink"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Churning As Quick as a Wink"
msgid ""
"Brownies are famous for their ability to do household chores, and you now "
"have an instinctive understanding of making milk and cheese."
msgstr ""
"Brownies are famous for their ability to do household chores, and you now "
"have an instinctive understanding of making milk and cheese."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Coat of Fur"
msgstr "Coat of Fur"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Coat of Fur"
msgid ""
"Your hair has thickened to almost the level of fur covering your entire body. "
" It's very warm and provides some level of protection against attacks."
msgstr ""
"Your hair has thickened to almost the level of fur covering your entire body. "
" It's very warm and provides some level of protection against attacks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Seneschal's Gaze"
msgstr "Seneschal's Gaze"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Seneschal's Gaze"
msgid ""
"With a few quick glances you can take in the contents of an entire room.  +3 "
"Perception."
msgstr ""
"With a few quick glances you can take in the contents of an entire room.  +3 "
"Perception."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Chatelain's Mind"
msgstr "Chatelain's Mind"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Chatelain's Mind"
msgid "It takes a keen mind to keep a household running smoothly.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "It takes a keen mind to keep a household running smoothly.  +2 Intelligence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Homebody"
msgstr "Homebody"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Homebody"
msgid ""
"Brownies know every corner of their homes, all the well-worn grooves in the "
"floor and the quick paths from place to place.  Your speed is increased the "
"longer you spend in the same area."
msgstr ""
"Brownies know every corner of their homes, all the well-worn grooves in the "
"floor and the quick paths from place to place.  Your speed is increased the "
"longer you spend in the same area."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sense Intruders"
msgstr "Sense Intruders"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sense Intruders"
msgid ""
"With the knowledge of one's home comes the knowledge that something is off "
"about it.  You can sense any intruders nearby, as long as you are indoors and "
"have been in the same location for some time."
msgstr ""
"With the knowledge of one's home comes the knowledge that something is off "
"about it.  You can sense any intruders nearby, as long as you are indoors and "
"have been in the same location for some time."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "moving_creature"
msgid "Intruder!"
msgstr "Intruder!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_brownie_blink_indoors_spell"
msgid "Slip Through the Cracks"
msgstr "Slip Through the Cracks"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Slip Through the Cracks"
msgid ""
"You can tell every nook and cranny of indoor spaces, and know how to quickly "
"get from one place to another."
msgstr ""
"You can tell every nook and cranny of indoor spaces, and know how to quickly "
"get from one place to another."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_teleport_home_spell"
msgid "Hurry Home"
msgstr "Hurry Home"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hurry Home"
msgid "You can return home from anywhere, as quick as a wink."
msgstr "You can return home from anywhere, as quick as a wink."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_pooka_charm_animals_spell"
msgid "Friend to Birds and Beasts"
msgstr "Friend to Birds and Beasts"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Friend to Birds and Beasts"
msgid ""
"You are close enough to the birds and beasts that you can speak their "
"language and ask them for aid."
msgstr ""
"You are close enough to the birds and beasts that you can speak their "
"language and ask them for aid."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Antlers (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Antlers (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Antlers (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow an impressive rack of antlers, allowing you to make a headbutt attack "
"but preventing you from wearing a helmet."
msgstr ""
"Grow an impressive rack of antlers, allowing you to make a headbutt attack "
"but preventing you from wearing a helmet."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Curled Horns (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Curled Horns (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Curled Horns (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow a set of spiraling curled horns, allowing you to make a headbutt attack "
"but preventing you from wearing a helmet."
msgstr ""
"Grow a set of spiraling curled horns, allowing you to make a headbutt attack "
"but preventing you from wearing a helmet."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fangs (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Fangs (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fangs (Shapeshift)"
msgid "Grow a set of sharp fangs, allowing you to make a bite attack."
msgstr "Grow a set of sharp fangs, allowing you to make a bite attack."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vicious Fangs (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Vicious Fangs (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vicious Fangs (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow a set of long, saber-like fangs, preventing you from wearing mouth gear "
"but allowing you to make rending bite attacks."
msgstr ""
"Grow a set of long, saber-like fangs, preventing you from wearing mouth gear "
"but allowing you to make rending bite attacks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wolf Ears (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Wolf Ears (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wolf Ears (Shapeshift)"
msgid "Change your ears into the ears of a wolf, granting you increased hearing."
msgstr "Change your ears into the ears of a wolf, granting you increased hearing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Feline Ears (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Feline Ears (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Feline Ears (Shapeshift)"
msgid "Change your ears into the ears of a great cat, granting you increased hearing."
msgstr "把你的耳朵变成大猫的耳朵，让你的听力得到增强。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Claws (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Claws (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Claws (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow a set of claws, improving your unarmed damage if you aren't wearing "
"gloves."
msgstr ""
"Grow a set of claws, improving your unarmed damage if you aren't wearing "
"gloves."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vicious Claws (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Vicious Claws (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vicious Claws (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow a powerful set of claws, nearly as hard as steel, greatly improving your "
"unarmed damage if you aren't wearing gloves."
msgstr ""
"Grow a powerful set of claws, nearly as hard as steel, greatly improving your "
"unarmed damage if you aren't wearing gloves."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Bird Wings (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Bird Wings (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Bird Wings (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Transform your arms into bird wings, allow you to slow your fall when jumping "
"from a high place and glide short distances."
msgstr ""
"Transform your arms into bird wings, allow you to slow your fall when jumping "
"from a high place and glide short distances."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Thick Fur (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Thick Fur (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Fur (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow a coat of thick fur, keeping you warm in the winter and protecting you "
"from attacks."
msgstr ""
"Grow a coat of thick fur, keeping you warm in the winter and protecting you "
"from attacks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Chitin Carapace (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Chitin Carapace (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Chitin Carapace (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow an armored suit of chitin, protecting you and making your punches hit "
"harder."
msgstr ""
"Grow an armored suit of chitin, protecting you and making your punches hit "
"harder."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Quadruped (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Quadruped (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Quadruped (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow paws and animal-like legs, allowing you to run much faster on all fours, "
"but preventing you from wearing shoes or gloves."
msgstr ""
"Grow paws and animal-like legs, allowing you to run much faster on all fours, "
"but preventing you from wearing shoes or gloves."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Quadruped"
msgstr "Quadruped"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Quadruped"
msgid ""
"Your arms, hands, and legs are animal-like, allowing you to move quickly when "
"running on all fours, but preventing you from wearing shoes or gloves."
msgstr ""
"Your arms, hands, and legs are animal-like, allowing you to move quickly when "
"running on all fours, but preventing you from wearing shoes or gloves."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Leaping Legs (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Leaping Legs (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaping Legs (Shapeshift)"
msgid "Grow strong frog- or cat-like legs, allowing you to leap great distances."
msgstr "Grow strong frog- or cat-like legs, allowing you to leap great distances."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wolf Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Wolf Tail (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wolf Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow the tail of a wolf, making it harder to wear pants but improving your "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Grow the tail of a wolf, making it harder to wear pants but improving your "
"balance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cat Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Cat Tail (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cat Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow the tail of a cat, making it harder to wear pants but improving your "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Grow the tail of a cat, making it harder to wear pants but improving your "
"balance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spiked Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgstr "Spiked Tail (Shapeshift)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spiked Tail (Shapeshift)"
msgid ""
"Grow the tail of a scorpion, making it harder to wear pants but allowing you "
"to attack with the stinger."
msgstr ""
"Grow the tail of a scorpion, making it harder to wear pants but allowing you "
"to attack with the stinger."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Bestial Strength"
msgstr "Bestial Strength"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Bestial Strength"
msgid ""
"Even when not shapeshifted you can bring part of a wild animal's strength to "
"bear.  +2 Strength."
msgstr ""
"Even when not shapeshifted you can bring part of a wild animal's strength to "
"bear.  +2 Strength."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Untamed Agility"
msgstr "Untamed Agility"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Untamed Agility"
msgid "You have the quick reactions of a wild animal.  +3 Dexterity."
msgstr "You have the quick reactions of a wild animal.  +3 Dexterity."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Initiate of Forms"
msgstr "Initiate of Forms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Initiate of Forms"
msgid ""
"You are getting better at shapeshifting and are able to maintain one more "
"simultaneous shapeshift without drawing on your mana."
msgstr ""
"You are getting better at shapeshifting and are able to maintain one more "
"simultaneous shapeshift without drawing on your mana."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Adept of Forms"
msgstr "Adept of Forms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Adept of Forms"
msgid ""
"You are getting much better at shapeshifting and are able to maintain two "
"more simultaneous shapeshifts without drawing on your mana."
msgstr ""
"You are getting much better at shapeshifting and are able to maintain two "
"more simultaneous shapeshifts without drawing on your mana."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Master of Forms"
msgstr "Master of Forms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Master of Forms"
msgid ""
"You are a master of shapeshifting and are able to maintain four more "
"simultaneous shapeshifts without drawing on your mana."
msgstr ""
"You are a master of shapeshifting and are able to maintain four more "
"simultaneous shapeshifts without drawing on your mana."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spirit of the Bat"
msgstr "Spirit of the Bat"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Bat"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bat."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a bat."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spirit of the Raven"
msgstr "Spirit of the Raven"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Raven"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a raven."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a raven."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spirit of the Bear"
msgstr "Spirit of the Bear"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Bear"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a bear."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a bear."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spirit of the Deer"
msgstr "Spirit of the Deer"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spirit of the Wolf"
msgstr "Spirit of the Wolf"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Wolf"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a wolf."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a wolf."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spirit of the Cougar"
msgstr "Spirit of the Cougar"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spirit of the Cougar"
msgid "You can transform yourself into a cougar."
msgstr "You can transform yourself into a cougar."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Instinctive Attacks"
msgstr "Instinctive Attacks"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Instinctive Attacks"
msgid ""
"You're getting used to moving and reacting like an animal.  When without "
"weapons or armor and using your gifts of shapeshifting, your natural attacks "
"do more damage."
msgstr ""
"You're getting used to moving and reacting like an animal.  When without "
"weapons or armor and using your gifts of shapeshifting, your natural attacks "
"do more damage."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Animalistic Defense"
msgstr "兽化防御"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Animalistic Defense"
msgid ""
"The best defense is not getting hit, especially if you're a wild animal.  "
"When using your shapeshifting and not wearing armor or using a weapon, you "
"gain a bonus to your dodging."
msgstr "最好的防御不是挨打，尤其对于野生动物。当使用变身能力，同时不穿戴盔甲、不使用武器时，你的闪避能力获得提升。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Primal Alacrity"
msgstr "Primal Alacrity"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Primal Alacrity"
msgid ""
"Like the animals you mimic, you're quicker than you seem.  You gain a speed "
"bonus while shapeshifted as long as you're unarmed and unarmored."
msgstr ""
"Like the animals you mimic, you're quicker than you seem.  You gain a speed "
"bonus while shapeshifted as long as you're unarmed and unarmored."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Bending Like the River"
msgstr "Bending Like the River"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Bending Like the River"
msgid "Your movements are graceful whether on land or in the water.  +3 Dexterity."
msgstr "Your movements are graceful whether on land or in the water.  +3 Dexterity."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Eyes On the Waterline"
msgstr "Eyes On the Waterline"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eyes On the Waterline"
msgid "Your sight is keen whether in or out of the water.  +2 Perception."
msgstr "Your sight is keen whether in or out of the water.  +2 Perception."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Thoughts like Clear Water"
msgstr "Thoughts like Clear Water"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Thoughts like Clear Water"
msgid ""
"Your mind flows easily from topic to topic while remembering the important "
"details.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Your mind flows easily from topic to topic while remembering the important "
"details.  +2 Intelligence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "selkie_beguilement_spell"
msgid "Beguilement"
msgstr "Beguilement"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloak of Fog"
msgid "Surround yourself with a thick fog, obscuring your position."
msgstr "将你包裹在浓雾中，隐藏你的位置。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Chant of Concealing Mists"
msgstr "隐雾吟唱"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Chant of Concealing Mists"
msgid "Call up a thick mist, shrouding the nearby landscape."
msgstr "呼唤一片浓雾，遮蔽附近的环境。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "selkie_change_weather_rains_spell"
msgid "Aria of the Droplets"
msgstr "微滴咏叹"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Aria of the Droplets"
msgid "Call a rain shower, letting the rains water the earth."
msgstr "呼唤一场阵雨，让雨水滋润大地。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "selkie_change_weather_rainstorm_spell"
msgid "Canticle of Rainstorms"
msgstr "暴雨颂歌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Canticle of Rainstorms"
msgid "Call a heavy rainstorm, soaking everything."
msgstr "呼唤一场大雨，淹没万物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "selkie_change_weather_lightningstorm_spell"
msgid "Symphony of Levin"
msgstr "雷光交响"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Symphony of Levin"
msgid "Call a lightning storm, ."
msgstr "呼唤一场闪电风暴。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breathing Water"
msgstr "水中呼吸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathing Water"
msgid ""
"You can breathe water just as easily as you can breathe air, and have no "
"trouble switching between them."
msgstr "你在水中呼吸就像在空气中呼吸一样容易，并且切换呼吸方式对你来说毫无困难。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "At Home in the Water"
msgstr "以水为乡"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "At Home in the Water"
msgid ""
"You can breathe water just as easily as you can breathe air, and have no "
"trouble switching between them.  In addition, being wet is pleasant in a way "
"it never was before."
msgstr "你在水中呼吸就像在空气中呼吸一样容易，并且切换呼吸方式对你来说毫无困难。除此以外，身体湿透的感觉变得前所未有地令人愉悦。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Waves my Bed"
msgstr "以浪为床"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Waves my Bed"
msgid ""
"Falling asleep underwater is easy for you, and you spend less time asleep "
"when you rest there."
msgstr "在水下入睡对你来说很容易，当你在水下睡眠时，你花费的时间会更少。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cutting Through the Waves"
msgstr "劈波斩浪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cutting Through the Waves"
msgid ""
"Your hands and feet haven't changed at all, but they seem to be much better "
"at swimming than before.  You gain a speed bonus when in water, increased "
"when not wearing shoes."
msgstr "你的手脚没有任何改变，但它们在游泳的时候似乎比以前更灵活了。在水中时你获得速度加成，不穿鞋子时提升更大。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Conductor of Storms"
msgstr "Conductor of Storms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Conductor of Storms"
msgid ""
"You are a master of meteorological enchantments, and your weather "
"manipulations will last much longer."
msgstr ""
"You are a master of meteorological enchantments, and your weather "
"manipulations will last much longer."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "trow_make_noise_spell"
msgid "The One Who Knocks"
msgstr "The One Who Knocks"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The One Who Knocks"
msgid ""
"Create a loud knocking sound within the glamour's range, to distract or lure "
"your enemies away."
msgstr ""
"Create a loud knocking sound within the glamour's range, to distract or lure "
"your enemies away."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fists of Stone"
msgstr "石拳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fists of Stone"
msgid ""
"Your tough skin and thick nails allow you to use yours hands to replace some "
"simple tools.  Your punches hit harder as well."
msgstr ""
"Your tough skin and thick nails allow you to use yours hands to replace some "
"simple tools.  Your punches hit harder as well."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stone-Eater"
msgstr "Stone-Eater"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone-Eater"
msgid ""
"The trow don't literally eat stones, but merely being underground fills you "
"with strength and vigor.  You need half as much food and water while you're "
"underground, and cold underground does not affect you."
msgstr ""
"The trow don't literally eat stones, but merely being underground fills you "
"with strength and vigor.  You need half as much food and water while you're "
"underground, and cold underground does not affect you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Deep-Delver"
msgstr "Deep-Delver"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Deep-Delver"
msgid ""
"Once you begin mining, you can do it for hours without rest or sleep.  You "
"need neither food nor drink nor rest for as long as you continue mining."
msgstr ""
"Once you begin mining, you can do it for hours without rest or sleep.  You "
"need neither food nor drink nor rest for as long as you continue mining."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Amongst the Stones"
msgstr "Amongst the Stones"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Amongst the Stones"
msgid ""
"While on rock or underground, you seem to subtly blend into your "
"surroundings.  You are harder to spot on rocks or underground."
msgstr ""
"While on rock or underground, you seem to subtly blend into your "
"surroundings.  You are harder to spot on rocks or underground."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Resilience of the Stones"
msgstr "石之韧性"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Resilience of the Stones"
msgid "You are as hardy as the rock.  When underground, you suffer much less pain."
msgstr "你像岩石一样坚韧。当你在地下时，你受到的疼痛更少。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shaping the Tears"
msgstr "塑造月之泪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shaping the Tears"
msgid ""
"You have learned the secrets of forging moon's tears.  Sometimes in your "
"dreams, a new recipe might be revealed to you."
msgstr "你已经知晓了塑造月之泪的秘密。有时当你在梦中时，一项新的配方会向你揭示。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unwavering Resilience of the Stones"
msgstr "石之坚定韧性"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unwavering Resilience of the Stones"
msgid ""
"You are as hardy as the rock.  When underground you suffer much less pain, "
"and your strength is not reduced by the pain you suffer."
msgstr "你像岩石一样坚韧。当你在地下时，你受到的疼痛更少，同时你的力量不会因为疼痛而降低。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unveiling the Night"
msgstr "揭开夜幕"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unveiling the Night"
msgid "Your sharp eyes can pierce the darkness."
msgstr "你锐利的眼现在可以看破黑暗。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pierce the Shadows"
msgstr "Pierce the Shadows"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pierce the Shadows"
msgid "Whether woods under trees or the cavern depths, you can see through the murk."
msgstr "Whether woods under trees or the cavern depths, you can see through the murk."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "None Here but the Stones"
msgstr "None Here but the Stones"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "None Here but the Stones"
msgid ""
"The Fair Folk can remain hidden among rocks or trees or whispers of wind, and "
"now you can too."
msgstr ""
"The Fair Folk can remain hidden among rocks or trees or whispers of wind, and "
"now you can too."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hidden from Mortal Eyes"
msgid "Like the Fair Folk of legend, you can remain unseen when you wish."
msgstr "Like the Fair Folk of legend, you can remain unseen when you wish."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Call Will o' the Wisp"
msgstr "Call Will o' the Wisp"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Call Will o' the Wisp"
msgid ""
"You can conjure up bobbing lights in the distance that will lead your enemies "
"astray."
msgstr ""
"You can conjure up bobbing lights in the distance that will lead your enemies "
"astray."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Faerie Eternity"
msgstr "妖精永生"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Faerie Eternity"
msgid ""
"You seem to have stopped aging.  That would have been an amazing gift before "
"the Cataclysm, but now at least you might live long enough to find some way "
"back to your birthplace Under the Hill."
msgstr "你的年龄看起来似乎停止了增长。在大灾变以前这本应是一种惊人的馈赠，但现在至少你可以活到找到山下的出生地的时候。"

