msgstr "War Form"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "War Form"
msgid ""
"You can transform yourself into a wolf-human hybrid and rip your enemies to "
"shreds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_WAR_FORM_BANNED_ACTIVITY_PHYSICAL"
msgid "Your war form lacks the fine dexterity for that."
msgstr "Your war form lacks the fine dexterity for that."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/shapeshifters.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_WAR_FORM_BANNED_ACTIVITY_MENTAL"
msgid ""
"Your mind is filled with the urge to sink your fangs into your enemies' "
"throats, leaving no room for these passive activities."
msgstr ""
"Your mind is filled with the urge to sink your fangs into your enemies' "
"throats, leaving no room for these passive activities."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Giant-sized"
msgid "Eating that goblin fruit has made you grow to enormous size!"
msgstr "吃了那个精怪果实，你变得巨大无比！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_ethereal_wings"
msgid "Ethereal Wings"
msgstr "空灵之翼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ethereal Wings"
msgid ""
"A wide set of ethereal wings sprouts from your back.  Despite them phasing "
"through every form of matter you've encountered, they still somehow lift you "
"off the ground.  Their mere appearance makes you feel lighter"
msgstr ""
"A wide set of ethereal wings sprouts from your back.  Despite them phasing "
"through every form of matter you've encountered, they still somehow lift you "
"off the ground.  Their mere appearance makes you feel lighter"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Karma"
msgstr "业力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Karma"
msgid "Ethereal hands appear behind your back, making you looks like an ancient god."
msgstr "空灵的双手出现在你的背后，让你看起来就像一个古老的神。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_devil_tail"
msgid "Devil's Tail"
msgstr "恶魔之尾"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Devil's Tail"
msgid ""
"While not actually a devil's, this long, triangular pointed tail can stretch "
"very far, allowing it to easily kill someone nearby."
msgstr "其实并不是魔鬼，这条尾部有三角尖的长尾巴可以伸展很多，可以轻易杀死附近的人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stalker's Vision"
msgstr "追猎者视域"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stalker's Vision"
msgid ""
"Your eyes transform into the orbits of an unknown creature.  You now see much "
"better in the light and dark."
msgstr ""
"Your eyes transform into the orbits of an unknown creature.  You now see much "
"better in the light and dark."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sleeper"
msgstr "沉眠者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleeper"
msgid ""
"You still sleep, yet your dreams still can impact the world.  Activate to "
"wake up."
msgstr "你仍在沉睡，但你的梦境仍能影响世界。 激活以唤醒。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "hedge_hide_in_forest"
msgid "To Vanish Amidst the Leaves"
msgstr "匿于丛叶"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/temporary.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "To Vanish Amidst the Leaves"
msgid "You are a bush and no one can see you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_GAIN_BLOOD_VITAMIN"
msgid ""
"The blood hits your tongue with a wash of warmth and for a moment the world "
"goes white.  The taste is indescribable.  It's better than nectar, better "
"than ambrosia, better than anything you've ever tasted in your life.  You "
"know at this moment that you have crossed a river and there will never be any "
"going back."
msgstr ""
"The blood hits your tongue with a wash of warmth and for a moment the world "
"goes white.  The taste is indescribable.  It's better than nectar, better "
"than ambrosia, better than anything you've ever tasted in your life.  You "
"know at this moment that you have crossed a river and there will never be any "
"going back."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_GAIN_BLOOD_VITAMIN"
msgid "As the blood hits your tongue, something inside you shifts."
msgstr "As the blood hits your tongue, something inside you shifts."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DHAMPIR_GAIN_CALORIES_FROM_NON_BAGGED_BLOOD"
msgid "You are gaining <context_val:temp_val> calories from the blood you drank."
msgstr "You are gaining <context_val:temp_val> calories from the blood you drank."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BLOOD_DRINKING_INEDIBLE"
msgid "You still feel as hungry as before.  This blood cannot sustain you."
msgstr "You still feel as hungry as before.  This blood cannot sustain you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUME_VAMPIRE_BLOOD"
msgid "This blood is the best you could drink.  You want more."
msgstr "This blood is the best you could drink.  You want more."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUME_VAMPIRE_BLOOD"
msgid "Though it cannot sustain you, this blood can empower you."
msgstr "Though it cannot sustain you, this blood can empower you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONSUME_VAMPIRE_BLOOD"
msgid "You need the blood of the living, not the blood of the dead."
msgstr "你需要活人的血，而非死者的血。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUME_VAMPIRE_BLOOD_NON_VAMPIRE"
msgid "As you drink, some of the vampire blood enters your gums."
msgstr "As you drink, some of the vampire blood enters your gums."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_DRINK_BLOOD_WITH_FANGS_activated"
msgid "You are drinking from an NPC."
msgstr "You are drinking from an NPC."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_DRINK_BLOOD_WITH_FANGS_activated"
msgid "You are drinking from a human-type monster."
msgstr "You are drinking from a human-type monster."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in then
#. statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_DRINK_BLOOD_WITH_FANGS_activated"
msgid ""
"The vampire's blood refuses to leave its veins, no matter how hard you try to "
"drain it."
msgstr ""
"The vampire's blood refuses to leave its veins, no matter how hard you try to "
"drain it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in then
#. statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_DRINK_BLOOD_WITH_FANGS_activated"
msgid ""
"You get a taste of blood but stop drinking when you realize it cannot sustain "
"you."
msgstr ""
"You get a taste of blood but stop drinking when you realize it cannot sustain "
"you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_DRINK_BLOOD_WITH_FANGS_activated"
msgid "You are drinking from an inhuman monster."
msgstr "You are drinking from an inhuman monster."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in then
#. statement in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in else
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_DRINK_BLOOD_WITH_FANGS_activated"
msgid "…and it tastes absolutely disgusting!"
msgstr "…and it tastes absolutely disgusting!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_DRINK_BLOOD_WITH_FANGS_activated"
msgid "You can only drink blood from an incapacitated or sleeping target."
msgstr "You can only drink blood from an incapacitated or sleeping target."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_DRINK_BLOOD_INTERRUPTED_CHECK"
msgid "You cancelled drinking blood and thus get no blood."
msgstr "You cancelled drinking blood and thus get no blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_ADD_ONE_WEAKNESS_SUCCESS"
msgid "You gain a new vampiric weakness."
msgstr "你获得了一种新的血族弱点。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_ADD_ONE_WEAKNESS_FAIL"
msgid "The EOC failed to give you a weakness.  Please report this on Github."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_MORE_BLOOD_MESSAGE"
msgid "Your thirst for blood intensifies."
msgstr "你的嗜血欲望变得更强了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_EARTH_SLEEP_MESSAGE"
msgid "You long for a good day of sleep surrounded by the earth."
msgstr "你渴望被大地围绕着美美地睡上一天。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_HOLY_BURN_MESSAGE"
msgid "You feel unholy, as if your presence wouldn't be tolerated by holy ground."
msgstr "You feel unholy, as if your presence wouldn't be tolerated by holy ground."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_VAST_WATER_BURN_MESSAGE"
msgid ""
"You think about crossing a river, but visions of your flesh melting disturb "
"you."
msgstr ""
"You think about crossing a river, but visions of your flesh melting disturb "
"you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_ANIMAL_HATE_MESSAGE"
msgid "Nearby animals start looking at you with eyes filled with hate."
msgstr "Nearby animals start looking at you with eyes filled with hate."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_FIRE_VULNERABLE_MESSAGE"
msgid "Your body feels much more vulnerable to fire."
msgstr "你感到身体对火焰更加脆弱。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_COLD_BLOODED_MESSAGE"
msgid "Your body grows cold."
msgstr "你的身体变得冰冷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_NEED_LIVING_BLOOD_MESSAGE"
msgid ""
"You daydream of drinking blood directly from the veins of the living for a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"You daydream of drinking blood directly from the veins of the living for a "
"moment."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_NEED_HUMAN_BLOOD_MESSAGE"
msgid ""
"All bloods, except the blood of regular humans, suddenly feel far less "
"appealing."
msgstr ""
"All bloods, except the blood of regular humans, suddenly feel far less "
"appealing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_BLOOD_CRAVING_MESSAGE"
msgid "You feel a painful craving for blood for a second, then it passes."
msgstr "You feel a painful craving for blood for a second, then it passes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VW_NO_FUN_MESSAGE"
msgid ""
"Everything grows dull and boring.  Your only memories still making you happy "
"are those about drinking blood."
msgstr ""
"Everything grows dull and boring.  Your only memories still making you happy "
"are those about drinking blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AW_SUN_BURN_MESSAGE"
msgid "You know with certainty that standing under the sun is now a lethal threat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AW_MIND_CHAOS_MESSAGE"
msgid "Your mind reels at the thought of drinking more vampire blood."
msgstr "Your mind reels at the thought of drinking more vampire blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AW_NEED_VAMPIRE_BLOOD_MESSAGE"
msgid "You feel a growing thirst for the blood of vampires."
msgstr "You feel a growing thirst for the blood of vampires."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated_2" in nested EOCs
#. in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated"
msgid "Your eyes gleam red momentarily as they drink in all available light."
msgstr "Your eyes gleam red momentarily as they drink in all available light."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to activate your gleaming eyes."
msgstr "你没有足够的血液激活你的 红莹之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_deactivated" in nested EOCs
#. in false effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_activated"
msgid "Your eyes lose their reddish glint as the darkness rolls back in."
msgstr "Your eyes lose their reddish glint as the darkness rolls back in."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_maintenance_2" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_maintenance"
msgid "You feel a momentary warmth as you channel stolen blood into your eyes."
msgstr "You feel a momentary warmth as you channel stolen blood into your eyes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_maintenance_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_EYEGLEAM_maintenance"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to maintain your gleaming eyes."
msgstr "你没有足够的血液维持你的红莹之眼。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_STRENGTH_activated_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_STRENGTH_activated"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to activate vigor mortis."
msgstr "You don't have enough blood to activate vigor mortis."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_STRENGTH_deactivated" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_STRENGTH_activated"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_deactivated" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_activated"
msgid "Your muscles weaken as the stolen blood leaves them."
msgstr "Your muscles weaken as the stolen blood leaves them."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_STRENGTH_maintenance_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_STRENGTH_maintenance"
msgid "You feel a momentary warmth as you channel stolen blood into your muscles."
msgstr "You feel a momentary warmth as you channel stolen blood into your muscles."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRIC_STRENGTH_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRIC_STRENGTH_maintenance"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to maintain your vigor mortis."
msgstr "You don't have enough blood to maintain your vigor mortis."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_activated"
msgid "You feel a surge of power as blood fortifies your flesh."
msgstr "You feel a surge of power as blood fortifies your flesh."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_activated"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to activate sanguine resilience."
msgstr "You don't have enough blood to activate sanguine resilience."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_maintenance_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_maintenance"
msgid "You feel a momentary warmth as you channel stolen blood into your flesh."
msgstr "You feel a momentary warmth as you channel stolen blood into your flesh."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRIC_RESILIENCE_maintenance"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to maintain your sanguine resilience."
msgstr "You don't have enough blood to maintain your sanguine resilience."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_SCENT_BLOOD_activated"
msgid "The scent of fresh blood fills your nostrils.  There is a human nearby."
msgstr "The scent of fresh blood fills your nostrils.  There is a human nearby."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_SCENT_BLOOD_activated"
msgid "You do not smell any nearby human blood."
msgstr "You do not smell any nearby human blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_STAMINAFORBLOOD_activated"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MAGICFORBLOOD_activated"
msgid ""
"Your veins pulse as your body pushes some of your blood reserves to "
"exhaustion and early dissolution."
msgstr ""
"Your veins pulse as your body pushes some of your blood reserves to "
"exhaustion and early dissolution."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_STAMINAFORBLOOD_activated"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to recover any stamina."
msgstr "你没有足够的血液回复任何耐力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_COMMUNE_NIGHT_MAP"
msgid "The children of the night tell you what features of the map are nearby."
msgstr "夜之子告诉你地图上附近的地形特征。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_COMMUNE_NIGHT_MAP"
msgid "Without the ability to howl into the wilds of the night, there is no response."
msgstr "不在夜晚的荒野中嚎叫，不会有回应。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_COMMUNE_NIGHT_MAP"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to summon the creatures of the night."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_COAGULANTWEAVE_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_COAGULANTWEAVE_activated"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to activate coagulant weave."
msgstr "You don't have enough blood to activate coagulant weave."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_COAGULANTWEAVE_deactivated" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_COAGULANTWEAVE_activated"
msgid "Your blood flows more freely as your grip on it relaxes."
msgstr "Your blood flows more freely as your grip on it relaxes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_COAGULANTWEAVE_maintenance_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_COAGULANTWEAVE_maintenance"
msgid "You feel a momentary warmth as you maintain your grip on your stolen blood."
msgstr "You feel a momentary warmth as you maintain your grip on your stolen blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_COAGULANTWEAVE_maintenance_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_COAGULANTWEAVE_maintenance"
msgid "You don't have enough blood to maintain your coagulant weave."
msgstr "You don't have enough blood to maintain your coagulant weave."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BLOODHEAL_activated"
msgid "Blood suffuses your flesh, repairing any damage it comes across."
msgstr "Blood suffuses your flesh, repairing any damage it comes across."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_BLOODHEAL_activated"
msgid "But your left arm is too damaged.  Only time can heal it."
msgstr "But your left arm is too damaged.  Only time can heal it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_BLOODHEAL_activated"
