msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_MENTOR_VANISH"
msgid ""
"You're not a mentor, so you're not supposed to see this.  Please open a "
"Github bug report."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "One with the Night"
msgstr "栖夜生灵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "One with the Night"
msgid ""
"You have ascended in power and can rival the mighty night-creatures of old.  "
"The night is your home, now, out of the light of the sun."
msgstr "你的能力在不断的擢升后，已足以与那些古且强大的黑夜生命相媲美。 现在，黑夜成为了你的领域，你已栖于日光之外。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lilit"
msgstr "莉莉丝"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lilit"
msgid ""
"You are one of the lilin, a hunter in the night, driven to feed on the "
"spiritual essence (some might say the soul) of your prey.  Probably you were "
"born that way, but maybe it happened to due to a malediction, or some "
"artifact you found in a place best forgotten.  Regardless, it is your gift "
"and your curse now, and you must use your powers to survive.\n"
"\n"
"You may activate this trait to spend some ruach toward increasing your power. "
" You must be outside under the moonlight to have a chance of gaining new "
"lilin powers."
msgstr ""
"你是莉莉丝中的一员，是黑夜中的猎手，以猎物的精神精萃（也有人说是灵魂）为食。 "
"也许生来如此，也许是因为诅咒，亦或许是因为在一个最好已被遗忘的地方发现的神器。 无论如何，这既是你的天赋，也是你的诅咒，你必须利用你的能力活下去。\n"
"\n"
"你可以激活这个特性，花费一些“灵”来提升你的能力。仅当在月光的照耀下时，你才能被赐予新的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Enervating Touch"
msgid ""
"With but a touch, you can drain the vitality and spiritual essence from your "
"targets."
msgstr "只需轻轻一触，你就能榨干目标的生命力和精神精萃。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breath Stealer"
msgstr "窃息者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breath Stealer"
msgid ""
"You no longer need to touch your targets to drain their ruach; you can do it "
"at a short distance through their breath."
msgstr "不需要接触目标，你现在凭借它们的呼吸就可以从近处榨干它们的灵。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Ruach is the Hebrew word for 'breath,' but it can also mean 'spirit'
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_drain_ruach_short_ranged_spell"
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_drain_ruach_long_ranged_spell"
msgid "Ruach Drinker"
msgstr "饮灵者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ruach Drinker"
msgid ""
"You no longer need to touch your targets to drain their ruach; you can do it "
"at a great distance through their breath."
msgstr "不需要接触目标，你现在凭借它们的呼吸就可以从远处榨干它们的灵。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Psalm 132:4
msgid "Given Sleep to Their Eyes"
msgstr "予其眼以安眠"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Given Sleep to Their Eyes"
msgid ""
"In sleep, a person's defenses are down and it is easier for the things in the "
"night to prey upon them.  You gain additional ruach from sleeping targets."
msgstr ""
"睡眠中的人对你的抵抗力会下降——黑夜中的猎物总是更容易捕猎。 你能从那些熟睡的目标身上榨取额外的灵。\n"
"『我不容我的眼睛睡觉，也不容我的眼目打盹 。』——《圣咏集》132:4"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Job 22:14
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_change_weather_fog_spell"
msgid "Thick Clouds A Covering"
msgstr "密云遮天"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Thick Clouds A Covering"
msgid ""
"Call up thick clouds of fog, allowing you to hide from your enemies.  This "
"power <color_green>lasts longer</color> when closer to the new moon."
msgstr ""
"召来浓密的云雾，以让你在其中躲避敌人。 当接近新月时，这种能力会<color_green>持续更长时间</color>。\n"
"『当祂在穹苍巡弋时，\n"
"密云挡住祂的视线。』\n"
"——《约伯记》22:14"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_evil_eye_spell"
msgid "The Evil Eye"
msgstr "憎恶邪眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Evil Eye"
msgid ""
"With a baleful gaze and a heart full of malice, curse a single target with "
"misfortune."
msgstr "以怨毒的目光和满腔的恶意，诅咒一个目标遭遇不幸。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cry of the Night-Bird"
msgstr "夜枭啼鸣"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cry of the Night-Bird"
msgid "Let out a piercing cry, disorienting both enemies and allies nearby."
msgstr "发出极具穿透力的啼鸣，以同时迷惑附近的敌人和盟友。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "On Silent Wings"
msgstr "以乘静谧之翼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "On Silent Wings"
msgid ""
"You can transform yourself into an owl and take wing on the night air.  You "
"won't be able to drain ruach while you are in this form."
msgstr "你可以化为夜枭来飞行，在深夜的高空中张开你的双翼。 化身为夜枭时，你将无法榨取灵。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Silent in Darkness"
msgid ""
"When shrouded in shadows, you make as little noise as one.  Your movement is "
"fully silent at night unless you're out of ruach."
msgstr ""
"当被阴影所笼罩时，你几乎不会发出任何声音。 除非你的“灵”已经耗尽，否则夜晚将以静谧遮掩你的行动。\n"
"『他必保护圣民的脚步；使恶人在黑暗中寂然不动。人都不能靠力量得胜。』——《撒母耳记上》2:9"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Genesis 1:5
msgid "And There Was Evening"
msgstr "夜幕已然降临"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "And There Was Evening"
msgid ""
"You were born to walk the night, and have a much easier time sleeping during "
"the day."
msgstr ""
"你生来就应行于夜，眠于日。白日中更易入眠。\n"
"『神称光为昼，称暗为夜。有晚上，有早晨，这是头一日。』——《创世记》1:5"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Psalms 121:4
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_avoid_sleep_spell"
msgid "Neither Sleep Nor Slumber"
msgstr "不眠不休"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Neither Sleep Nor Slumber"
msgid ""
"While sleep is restful, the ruach you gain fills you with more energy than "
"even a good night's rest.  You may spend ruach to alleviate your sleepiness."
msgstr ""
"固然睡眠能补充你的精力，但你获得的“灵”同样能让你精力充沛，甚至更胜一夜好眠。 你可以花费“灵”来缓解困倦。\n"
"『保护以色列的，也不打盹，也不睡觉。』——《圣咏集》121:4"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Proverbs 5:3
msgid "Smoother than Oil"
msgstr "油光蜜滑"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Smoother than Oil"
msgid ""
"Your presence is intoxicating, and humans have a hard time resisting your "
"charms.  You gain a bonus to your persuasion chance as long as you aren't "
"empty of ruach."
msgstr ""
"你的存在是如此醉人，人类难以不沉醉于你的魅力。 只要你体内的“灵”还没有耗尽，你就能获得说服成功几率的加成。\n"
"『因为淫妇的嘴滴下蜂蜜，她的口比油更滑。』——《箴言》5:3"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Exodus 20:16
msgid "The False Witness"
msgstr "虚构见证"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The False Witness"
msgid ""
"You have a much easier time spinning lies and making people believe them.  "
"You gain a bonus to your lying chance as long as you aren't empty of ruach."
msgstr ""
"你善于编织花言巧语，使人们听信你的谎言。 只要你体内的 “灵”没有耗尽，你就能获得说谎成功几率的加成。\n"
"『不可作假见证指证你的邻人。』——《出埃及记》20:16"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Jeremiah 10:14
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_mesmerize_target_spell"
msgid "Senseless and Without Knowledge"
msgstr "无知无觉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Senseless and Without Knowledge"
msgid ""
"You can temporarily beguile a single human, fey, or avian target, causing "
"them to stand senseless or wander in a daze.  Any damage will bring the "
"target out of their trance."
msgstr ""
"你可以暂时迷惑一个人类、精灵或鸟类目标，使他们失去知觉或在茫然中徘徊。 任何伤害都会让目标从恍惚中醒来。\n"
"『各人都成了畜类，毫无知识；各银匠都因他雕刻的偶像羞愧。』——《耶利米书》10:14"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Romans 6:23
msgid "The Gift of Eternal Life"
msgstr "永生之赐"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Gift of Eternal Life"
msgid ""
"Your body has now stopped aging, massively extending your longevity.  You can "
"still be killed but as long as your body can heal, all your wounds will "
"eventually fully heal no matter how severe they are."
msgstr ""
"你的身躯不再衰老，寿命得以极大的延长。你仍然可能被杀死，但只要你的身体还能够愈合，那么无论你受到有多么严重的创伤，最终都会完全治愈。\n"
"『因为罪的工价乃是死；惟有神的恩赐，在我们的主基督耶稣里，乃是永生。』——《罗马书》6:23"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Enduring Through All Generations"
msgid ""
"With eternal youth comes the strength to endure past anything one could face. "
" Your speed won't be lower than its default as long as you have some ruach in "
"you."
msgstr ""
"永恒定格的青春，为你带来足以承担一切磨损的生命力。只要你体内还有灵，你的速度就不会低于默认值。\n"
"『太阳还存，月亮还在，人要敬畏你，直到万代！』——《圣咏录》72:5"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_aoe_line_disease_spell"
msgid "Unleash the Night-Wind"
msgstr "掀起黑夜之风"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unleash the Night-Wind"
msgid "You may unleash a foul miasma on your enemies, sickening them."
msgstr "你可以向敌人释放污秽的瘴气，带去瘟疫和疾病。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_disease_enhancement_damage_spell"
msgid "Devoured by Pestilence"
msgstr "其为瘟疫所噬"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Devoured by Pestilence"
msgid ""
"You may greatly enhance the power of the miasma from Unleash the Night-Wind, "
"doing serious damage and crippling your target."
msgstr "你可以大大增强 “掀起黑夜之风 ”释放出的瘴气的威力，瘫痪目标并造成大额伤害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_blinding_target_spell"
msgid "Dwelling in Deep Darkness"
msgstr "深栖夜色之中"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dwelling in Deep Darkness"
msgid ""
"You may cut a single target off from light, completely blinding them.  You "
"may only do this at night, and only indoors or out in the wilderness."
msgstr "你以将一个目标与所有光线割离，使其完全失明。 您只能在夜间的室内或野外使用这个能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name comes from Genesis 29:17
msgid "Of Beautiful Form"
msgstr "曼妙姿态"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Of Beautiful Form"
msgid ""
"You can use your powers to spin a web of illusion around yourself, increasing "
"your attractiveness to a supernatural degree.  While the harsh light of the "
"sun destroys the illusion, you need merely to move back into the shadows to "
"restore it."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用你的能力编织起一张美轮美奂的幻象之网，以将自己的魅力提升到超自然的程度。 虽然刺眼的阳光会破坏幻象，但你只需回到阴影中就能将其恢复。\n"
"『利亚的眼睛没有神气，拉结却生得美貌俊秀。』——《创世纪》29:17"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name comes from II Samuel 14:25
msgid "Without Blemish"
msgstr "无瑕姿态"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Without Blemish"
msgid ""
"You can use your powers to spin a web of illusion around yourself, increasing "
"your attractiveness to a supernatural degree.  While the harsh light of the "
"sun destroys the illusion, you need merely to move back into the shadows to "
"restore it.  You have grown so powerful that this illusion requires almost no "
"effort and can be <color_green>maintained for weeks</color> at a time."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用你的能力编织起一张美轮美奂的幻象之网，以将自己的魅力提升到超自然的程度。 虽然刺眼的阳光会破坏幻象，但你只需回到阴影中就能将其恢复。 "
"你已经如此强大，以至于这种幻觉可以毫不费力地<color_green>维持数周之久</color>。\n"
"『无人像押沙龙那样俊美，得人的称赞，从脚底到头顶毫无瑕疵。』——《撒母耳记下II》14:25"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Might of the Nephilim"
msgid ""
"Like the monstrous children of angels and humans, your prowess surpasses "
"mortal limits.  Activate this trait to empower yourself."
msgstr "你宛如天使与人类所诞下的怪胎，拥有超越凡人极限的力量。 激活这一特性以增强你的力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Proverbs 30:15
msgid "Alukah's Daughter"
msgstr "阿鲁卡之女"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Alukah's Daughter"
msgid ""
"You can drain essence from your targets with your unarmed attacks.  Not well "
"enough to absorb their ruach, should they have any, but enough to cause "
"additional damage at night.  This damage is strongest during the half to full "
"moon and weakest during the new moon.  It functions only slightly during the "
"day."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过徒手的攻击榨出目标的精萃，虽然这不足以吸收他们的灵（如果他们有的话），但足以在夜间造成额外伤害。 这种伤害在半月到满月期间最强，在新月期间最弱。 "
"这在白天只发挥微乎其微的作用。\n"
"『阿鲁卡有两个女儿』——《箴言》30:15"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Reaping the Whirlwind"
msgid ""
"With an expenditure of ruach you can drastically enhance your speed for a "
"short period of time."
msgstr ""
"通过消耗灵，你可以在短时间内大幅提高速度。\n"
"『他们种的是风，收的是暴风。』——《何西阿书》8：7"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "From Shadow to Shadow"
msgstr "如影随形"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "From Shadow to Shadow"
msgid ""
"You can leap away from attacks like shadows dancing in candlelight.  You gain "
"Uncanny Dodge while under the effects of Reaping the Whirlwind."
msgstr "你在对手的攻击之间腾挪，一如在烛光中舞动的阴影。 在“收获昔日之风”的影响下，你会获得不可思议的闪避能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Strigine Gaze"
msgstr "如鸱鸮般凝视"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Strigine Gaze"
msgid ""
"Your eyes have adapted to the darkness of the night, allowing you to see "
"further through the shadows.  This is most effective out under the moon but "
"still has an effect indoors."
msgstr "你的眼睛已经适应了黑夜，可以透过阴影看得更远。 这在月下最显著，但在室内仍有一定效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Owl's Wisdom"
msgstr "夜枭的智慧"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Owl's Wisdom"
msgid ""
"The owl is a symbol of wisdom in culture after culture, and you are the heir "
"to that wisdom.  You find it easier to learn things, and even easier the more "
"ruach you're holding on to."
msgstr "在各种文化中，夜枭都是智慧的象征，而你是那智慧的继承者。 你掌握的灵越多，学东西就越容易。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shattering the Broken Vessels"
msgstr "击碎有隙之器"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shattering the Broken Vessels"
msgid ""
"Attuned to darkness and disease, you can easily spot the cracks in your "
"enemies' defenses.  You have an easier chance to hit enemy weakpoints, "
"increasing as your ruach rises."
msgstr "与黑夜和疾病相随，你能轻易找到对手防御之中的那些“裂缝”。 击中敌人的几率增大，并随着你的灵上升而增加。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Psalms 91:6
msgid "The Pestilence that Stalks in Darkness"
msgstr "夜中潜伏的瘟疫"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Pestilence that Stalks in Darkness"
msgid ""
"You are at home in the darkness and it clings to you to cover your movements. "
" In a half- or smaller moon, and when out of the daylight, it is harder for "
"your enemies to spots you."
msgstr ""
"黑夜是你的家，依附在你身上，遮掩你的行动。 在半月或更小的月亮下，于日光所及之外，你的敌人更难发现你。\n"
"『也不怕黑夜流行的瘟疫，\n"
"或是午间灭人的灾害。』\n"
"——《圣咏录》91:6"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Psalm 147:17
msgid "Stand Before the Cold"
msgstr "抵御冰寒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stand Before the Cold"
msgid ""
"As a hunter in the night, you are well-conditioned to the cold after the sun "
"goes down.  You are resistant to chill temperatures, and more so the more "
"ruach you have."
msgstr ""
"作为黑夜中的猎人，你对落日后袭来的的寒冷有很好的适应力。 你能抵御寒冷的气温，拥有的灵越多，抵御寒冷的能力就越强。\n"
"『他掷下冰雹如碎渣，他发出寒冷，谁能当得起呢？』——《圣咏录》147:17"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Proverbs 25:16
msgid "Eating Drops of Honey"
msgstr "饮下甘蜜"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eating Drops of Honey"
msgid ""
"When filled with ruach, no other food or drink compares.  The more ruach you "
"have, the less mundane hunger or thirst troubles you."
msgstr ""
"当体内充满灵时，其他食物或饮品都无法与这些灵相比。 你拥有的灵越多，世俗的饥饿或干渴就越难以干扰你。\n"
"『你得了蜜吗？只可吃够而已，恐怕你过饱就呕吐出来。』——《箴言》25:16"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Warm Breath"
msgstr "温暖呼吸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Warm Breath"
msgid ""
"Your stolen ruach speeds your healing in proportion to how much of it you "
"have."
msgstr "你所榨取的灵会按比例加速你的恢复。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Night's Caress"
msgstr "黑夜的爱抚"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Night's Caress"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, you cannot passively wait for your ruach to heal your wounds, you "
"need it to happen immediately.  You may activate this trait to greatly speed "
"your healing at a continual cost of ruach."
msgstr "有些时候，你不满足于等待你的灵治愈你的伤口，而需要一些更快的治疗。这时，你可以激活这个特性，以持续消耗灵为代价，大大加快伤口愈合的速度。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ruach Spring"
msgstr "灵泉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ruach Spring"
msgid "Your powers have expanded and you are now capable of holding more ruach."
msgstr "你的能力得到了增强，现在你能够容纳更多的灵。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ruach Well"
msgstr "灵井"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ruach Well"
msgid "Your powers have expanded and you are now capable of holding even more ruach."
msgstr "你的能力得到了增强，现在你能够容纳甚至更多的灵。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ruach Sea"
msgstr "灵海"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ruach Sea"
msgid ""
"Your powers have expanded and you are now capable of holding an enormous "
"amount of ruach."
msgstr "你的能力得到了增强，现在你能够容纳海量的灵。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Proverbs 23:5
msgid "Glancing at Riches"
msgstr "注视钱财"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Glancing at Riches"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You've learned how to more efficiently use your ruach, greedily keeping some "
"behind for yourself when you activate your powers.  Powers that cost ruach "
"have their initial and periodic costs reduced by 15%.  This does not reduce "
"the continual ruach cost of staying alive."
msgstr ""
"You've learned how to more efficiently use your ruach, greedily keeping some "
"behind for yourself when you activate your powers.  Powers that cost ruach "
"have their initial and periodic costs reduced by 15%.  This does not reduce "
"the continual ruach cost of staying alive."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Jeremiah 5:27
msgid "Like a Cage Full of Birds"
msgstr "Like a Cage Full of Birds"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like a Cage Full of Birds"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You jealously parcel out your ruach, only spending exactly as much as you "
"need and no more.  Powers that cost ruach have their initial and periodic "
"costs reduced by 15%, with an additional reduction that grows based on your "
"total amount of ruach, to a maximum reduction of 33%.  This does not reduce "
"the continual ruach cost of staying alive."
msgstr ""
"You jealously parcel out your ruach, only spending exactly as much as you "
"need and no more.  Powers that cost ruach have their initial and periodic "
"costs reduced by 15%, with an additional reduction that grows based on your "
"total amount of ruach, to a maximum reduction of 33%.  This does not reduce "
"the continual ruach cost of staying alive."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Psalms 139:12
msgid "The Night Shines Like the Day"
msgstr "The Night Shines Like the Day"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Night Shines Like the Day"
msgid ""
"You have adapted so well to the night that it doesn't hinder your actions at "
"all.  You can read and craft in any light levels."
msgstr ""
"You have adapted so well to the night that it doesn't hinder your actions at "
"all.  You can read and craft in any light levels."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Psalms 139:12
msgid "The Darkness is not Dark to You"
msgstr "The Darkness is not Dark to You"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Darkness is not Dark to You"
msgid ""
"Your eyes have fully adapted to the darkness, allowing you to see as well in "
"the dark as humans see in the light."
msgstr ""
"Your eyes have fully adapted to the darkness, allowing you to see as well in "
"the dark as humans see in the light."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Jeremiah 31:35
msgid "The Moon Shall Shine at Night"
msgstr "The Moon Shall Shine at Night"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Moon Shall Shine at Night"
msgid ""
"You are closely attuned to the moon, and some of your powers grow stronger "
"with it.  Any ability you have that is amplified the fuller the moon is will "
"not be weakened as much by an incomplete but non-new moon."
msgstr ""
"You are closely attuned to the moon, and some of your powers grow stronger "
"with it.  Any ability you have that is amplified the fuller the moon is will "
"not be weakened as much by an incomplete but non-new moon."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like an Unclean Spirit"
msgstr "Like an Unclean Spirit"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like an Unclean Spirit"
msgid ""
"Your owl form is half spirit and half flesh.  You have a high chance to dodge "
"any attacks against you, and may pass straight through walls as long as it is "
"night."
msgstr ""
"Your owl form is half spirit and half flesh.  You have a high chance to dodge "
"any attacks against you, and may pass straight through walls as long as it is "
"night."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Night-Hunter"
msgstr "The Night-Hunter"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Night-Hunter"
msgid ""
"You are at home in the night, and your prowess is heightened while the moon "
"is up as long as you have any ruach within you."
msgstr ""
"You are at home in the night, and your prowess is heightened while the moon "
"is up as long as you have any ruach within you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Strix's Wrath"
msgstr "The Strix's Wrath"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Strix's Wrath"
msgid ""
"You can combine your forms, transforming into a large owl-human hybrid with "
"wings, rending talons, and a deadly beak.  You won't be able to drain ruach "
"while you are in this form."
msgstr ""
"You can combine your forms, transforming into a large owl-human hybrid with "
"wings, rending talons, and a deadly beak.  You won't be able to drain ruach "
"while you are in this form."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Strix's Leap"
msgstr "Strix's Leap"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Strix's Leap"
msgid ""
"While you cannot fly, with your bird-like legs and your wings, you can leap "
"quite a distance."
msgstr ""
"While you cannot fly, with your bird-like legs and your wings, you can leap "
"quite a distance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Exodus 16:12
msgid "Eating Meat at Twilight"
msgstr "Eating Meat at Twilight"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eating Meat at Twilight"
msgid ""
"When filled with ruach, no other food or drink compares.  The more ruach you "
"have, the less mundane hunger or thirst troubles you.  In addition, drinking "
"ruach from your victims assuages your hunger and thirst."
msgstr ""
"When filled with ruach, no other food or drink compares.  The more ruach you "
"have, the less mundane hunger or thirst troubles you.  In addition, drinking "
"ruach from your victims assuages your hunger and thirst."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Touch of Contagion"
msgstr "Touch of Contagion"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Touch of Contagion"
msgid ""
"When you wish it, your very touch bears the contamination of plague.  Your "
"unarmed attacks have a chance to infect your targets, scaling with the amount "
"of ruach you have."
msgstr ""
"When you wish it, your very touch bears the contamination of plague.  Your "
"unarmed attacks have a chance to infect your targets, scaling with the amount "
"of ruach you have."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Treasures of Darkness"
msgid ""
"You are a being of darkness, closer to it than almost anything else is.  It "
"quickens your essence, and with it your actions, the longer you stay in it.  "
"Each night, you receive an increase to your speed that is higher for each "
"consecutive day spent without being exposed to the sun, up to ten.  The light "
"of the sun breaks this quickening, forcing you to wait once more for the "
"shadows to empower you in this way."
msgstr ""
"You are a being of darkness, closer to it than almost anything else is.  It "
"quickens your essence, and with it your actions, the longer you stay in it.  "
"Each night, you receive an increase to your speed that is higher for each "
"consecutive day spent without being exposed to the sun, up to ten.  The light "
"of the sun breaks this quickening, forcing you to wait once more for the "
"shadows to empower you in this way."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_instant_heal_spell"
msgid "The Moon to Rule the Night"
msgstr "The Moon to Rule the Night"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Moon to Rule the Night"
msgid ""
"At night, under the moonlight, you can knit grievous wounds together in "
"seconds with a great expenditure of ruach."
msgstr ""
"At night, under the moonlight, you can knit grievous wounds together in "
"seconds with a great expenditure of ruach."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Isaiah 66:24
msgid "Their Worm Shall Not Die"
msgstr "Their Worm Shall Not Die"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Their Worm Shall Not Die"
msgid ""
"When taking fatal damage, instead of dying you assume the form of an owl, "
"allowing you to fly away from danger and recover.  This does not function "
"during the day, if you are out of ruach, or if you are killed by fire."
msgstr ""
"When taking fatal damage, instead of dying you assume the form of an owl, "
"allowing you to fly away from danger and recover.  This does not function "
"during the day, if you are out of ruach, or if you are killed by fire."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_GAIN_POWERS_AT_NIGHT_ACTIVE"
msgid ""
"Under the light of the moon, you realize a new way to use your stolen ruach "
"to empower yourself."
msgstr ""
"Under the light of the moon, you realize a new way to use your stolen ruach "
"to empower yourself."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_GAINS_STRENGTH_TO_STRENGTH_CHOOSE_INITIAL"
msgid "Empower your Strength"
msgstr "Empower your Strength"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_GAINS_STRENGTH_TO_STRENGTH_CHOOSE_INITIAL"
msgid "Empower your Dexterity"
msgstr "Empower your Dexterity"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_GAINS_STRENGTH_TO_STRENGTH_CHOOSE_INITIAL"
msgid "Empower your Perception"
msgstr "Empower your Perception"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_GAINS_STRENGTH_TO_STRENGTH_CHOOSE_INITIAL"
msgid "Gain strength bonuses when using From Strength to Strength."
msgstr "Gain strength bonuses when using From Strength to Strength."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_GAINS_STRENGTH_TO_STRENGTH_CHOOSE_INITIAL"
msgid "Gain dexterity and dodge bonuses when using From Strength to Strength."
msgstr "Gain dexterity and dodge bonuses when using From Strength to Strength."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_GAINS_STRENGTH_TO_STRENGTH_CHOOSE_INITIAL"
msgid "Gain perception bonuses when using From Strength to Strength."
msgstr "Gain perception bonuses when using From Strength to Strength."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_GAINS_STRENGTH_TO_STRENGTH_CHOOSE_INITIAL"
msgid "Pick a choice"
msgstr "Pick a choice"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_activated_2" in nested EOCs in nested effect
#. in then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_activated"
msgid "You spin a beguiling web of illusion around yourself."
msgstr "You spin a beguiling web of illusion around yourself."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_activated_2" in nested EOCs in nested effect
#. in then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_activated"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_maintenance"
msgid "You don't have enough ruach to enhance your appearance."
msgstr "You don't have enough ruach to enhance your appearance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_activated"
msgid "You are already so beautiful no illusion could enhance your appearance"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_deactivated" in nested EOCs in false effect
#. in EoC "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_activated"
msgid "You rend the illusions around yourself to tatters."
msgstr "You rend the illusions around yourself to tatters."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_LILIN_TEMPORARY_GLORIOUS_maintenance"
msgid "You feel a chill on your skin as you maintain your web of pleasing illusions."
msgstr "You feel a chill on your skin as you maintain your web of pleasing illusions."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_activated_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_activated"
msgid "You draw on your ruach to enhance your physical abilities."
msgstr "You draw on your ruach to enhance your physical abilities."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_activated"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_maintenance"
msgid "You don't have enough ruach to enhance your physical abilities."
msgstr "You don't have enough ruach to enhance your physical abilities."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_deactivated"
#. in nested EOCs in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_activated"
msgid "Your physical abilities return to normal."
msgstr "Your physical abilities return to normal."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_ATTRIBUTE_BONUSES_maintenance"
msgid ""
"You feel a chill on your skin as you maintain your enhanced physical "
"abilities."
msgstr ""
"You feel a chill on your skin as you maintain your enhanced physical "
"abilities."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_TURN_INTO_OWL_activated_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_TURN_INTO_OWL_activated"
msgid ""
"Your eyes grow wide as feathers sprout from your arms and you take to the air "
"on silent wings."
msgstr ""
"Your eyes grow wide as feathers sprout from your arms and you take to the air "
"on silent wings."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TURN_INTO_OWL_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TURN_INTO_OWL_activated"
msgid "You don't have enough ruach to transform into an owl."
msgstr "You don't have enough ruach to transform into an owl."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_activated"
msgid "You pour ruach into your wounds and your body begins healing."
msgstr "You pour ruach into your wounds and your body begins healing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_activated"
msgid "You don't have enough ruach to heal your wounds."
msgstr "You don't have enough ruach to heal your wounds."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_deactivated" in nested EOCs in false effect
#. in EoC "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_activated"
msgid "Your accelerated healing slows to a stop."
msgstr "Your accelerated healing slows to a stop."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_maintenance"
msgid "You feel icy pinpricks on your skin as your wounds heal."
msgstr "You feel icy pinpricks on your skin as your wounds heal."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_maintenance"
msgid "With your body restored, you no longer need to dedicate ruach to healing it."
msgstr "With your body restored, you no longer need to dedicate ruach to healing it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_maintenance_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_LILIN_BONUS_HEALING_ACTIVE_maintenance"
msgid "You don't have enough ruach accelerate your healing."
msgstr "You don't have enough ruach accelerate your healing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TRANSFORM_INTO_WAR_OWL_FORM_activated_2" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_TRANSFORM_INTO_WAR_OWL_FORM_activated"
msgid ""
"Wings erupt from your shoulders and talons grow from your fingers as you "
"assume the strix form."
msgstr ""
"Wings erupt from your shoulders and talons grow from your fingers as you "
"assume the strix form."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TRANSFORM_INTO_WAR_OWL_FORM_activated_2" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_TRANSFORM_INTO_WAR_OWL_FORM_activated"
msgid "You don't have enough ruach to transform into a strix."
msgstr "You don't have enough ruach to transform into a strix."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_TRANSFORM_INTO_WAR_OWL_FORM_deactivated" in nested EOCs in false
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_TRANSFORM_INTO_WAR_OWL_FORM_activated"
msgid "Your wings, feathers, and talons all vanish as you return to your human form."
msgstr "Your wings, feathers, and talons all vanish as you return to your human form."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LILIN_STRIX_LEAP"
#. ~ Description of spell "lilin_strix_leap_spell ( Strix Leap )"
msgid ""
"You squat down, build up tension in your legs, then with a mighty beat of "
"your wings, you leap."
msgstr ""
"You squat down, build up tension in your legs, then with a mighty beat of "
"your wings, you leap."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_PREVENT_DEATH_INITIATE"
msgid ""
"As yours wounds overtake you, you cast forth your spirit in the form of an "
"owl."
msgstr ""
"As yours wounds overtake you, you cast forth your spirit in the form of an "
"owl."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gracken"
msgstr "Gracken"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gracken"
msgid ""
"A traveler from another dimension.  A dimension of shadows with few bright "
"lights.  Once your species matures, they gain the ability to create new "
"alterations to their body from ingredients harvested from their kills, "
"shadowstuff and magickal essence."
msgstr ""
"A traveler from another dimension.  A dimension of shadows with few bright "
"lights.  Once your species matures, they gain the ability to create new "
"alterations to their body from ingredients harvested from their kills, "
"shadowstuff and magickal essence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gracken, Mature"
msgstr "Gracken, Mature"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gracken, Mature"
msgid ""
"You have become a fully mature Gracken and have gained the ability to reform "
"your body in ways previously blocked to you in your immature state."
msgstr ""
"You have become a fully mature Gracken and have gained the ability to reform "
"your body in ways previously blocked to you in your immature state."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Eyes"
msgstr "Shade Eyes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Eyes"
msgid "Bright yellow eyes shine out from the shadowy crevices of your face."
msgstr "Bright yellow eyes shine out from the shadowy crevices of your face."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gracken Build"
msgstr "Gracken Build"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gracken Build"
msgid ""
"Gracken are about the same size as humans, though they look like shadow "
"demons."
msgstr ""
"Gracken are about the same size as humans, though they look like shadow "
"demons."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Legs"
msgstr "Shade Legs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Legs"
msgid "Your legs are human sized but appear to be made of swirling shadows."
msgstr "Your legs are human sized but appear to be made of swirling shadows."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Short Legs"
msgstr "Short Legs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Short Legs"
msgid ""
"Your legs have decreased in length providing you with a lower center of "
"gravity and a slight improvement to agility."
msgstr ""
"Your legs have decreased in length providing you with a lower center of "
"gravity and a slight improvement to agility."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Long Legs"
msgstr "Long Legs"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Long Legs"
msgid "Your legs have lengthened.  You can cross flat terrain more easily."
msgstr "Your legs have lengthened.  You can cross flat terrain more easily."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Feet"
msgstr "Shade Feet"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Feet"
msgid "Your feet are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows."
msgstr "Your feet are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Arms"
msgstr "Shade Arms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Arms"
msgid "Your arms are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows."
msgstr "Your arms are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Strong Arms"
msgstr "Strong Arms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Arms"
msgid "Your arms have begun bulking up and become stronger.  +1 Strength"
msgstr "Your arms have begun bulking up and become stronger.  +1 Strength"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Long Arms"
msgstr "Long Arms"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Long Arms"
msgid "Your arms have lengthened.  You can push a target away from you."
msgstr "Your arms have lengthened.  You can push a target away from you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Hands"
msgstr "Shade Hands"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Hands"
msgid "Your hands are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows."
msgstr "Your hands are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Sharp Nails"
msgstr "Shade Sharp Nails"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Sharp Nails"
msgid ""
"Your hands are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows.  At the "
"end of each finger you sport a razor sharp nail.  It increases your damage "
"when unarmed."
msgstr ""
"Your hands are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows.  At the "
"end of each finger you sport a razor sharp nail.  It increases your damage "
"when unarmed."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Dextrous Hands"
msgstr "Shade Dextrous Hands"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Dextrous Hands"
msgid ""
"Your hands are humanoid but appear to be made of swirling shadows.  You sport "
"an extra digit on every finger that improves your ability to get into tight "
"situations.."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Skin"
msgstr "Shade Skin"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Skin"
msgid "Your skin is the color of shadows moving in the twilight."
msgstr "Your skin is the color of shadows moving in the twilight."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shade Stomach"
msgstr "Shade Stomach"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shade Stomach"
msgid ""
"Your dietary needs are so minimized that you could travel months or years "
"without eating.  There are consequences to this.  One is an inability to "
"process normal food.  Another is a pretty constant state of weariness, but "
"this is the best way to handle interdimensional travel until you are able to "
"develop an organ to consume local foods.  The ambient energies here are much "
"weaker than what you normally encounter out in the Nether between universes, "
"you need exposure to nuclear radiation to gain calories on this planet, for "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Your dietary needs are so minimized that you could travel months or years "
"without eating.  There are consequences to this.  One is an inability to "
"process normal food.  Another is a pretty constant state of weariness, but "
"this is the best way to handle interdimensional travel until you are able to "
"develop an organ to consume local foods.  The ambient energies here are much "
"weaker than what you normally encounter out in the Nether between universes, "
"you need exposure to nuclear radiation to gain calories on this planet, for "
"now."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Omnivorous Stomach"
msgstr "Omnivorous Stomach"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Omnivorous Stomach"
msgid ""
"You eat a wide variety of foods native to this world that would be "
"appropriate for the dominant species."
msgstr ""
"You eat a wide variety of foods native to this world that would be "
"appropriate for the dominant species."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Carnivorous Stomach"
msgstr "Carnivorous Stomach"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Carnivorous Stomach"
msgid ""
"You eat an exclusively meat-based diet as befits an apex predator of this "
"planet."
msgstr ""
"You eat an exclusively meat-based diet as befits an apex predator of this "
"planet."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Herbivore Stomach"
msgstr "Herbivore Stomach"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Herbivore Stomach"
msgid ""
"You eat a herbivorous diet.  The benefit of this is you never have to kill "
"for your food.  Unless the plants were trying to kill you first."
msgstr ""
"You eat a herbivorous diet.  The benefit of this is you never have to kill "
"for your food.  Unless the plants were trying to kill you first."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Evolution Gland"
msgstr "Evolution Gland"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Evolution Gland"
msgid ""
"You have a gland that grows a small amount of the material needed to make "
"biological improvements to yourself.  You must gather dreamdross and "
"components from monsters you wish to gain the abilities of and combine them "
"with this shadowstuff into new organs and abilities."
msgstr ""
"You have a gland that grows a small amount of the material needed to make "
"biological improvements to yourself.  You must gather dreamdross and "
"components from monsters you wish to gain the abilities of and combine them "
"with this shadowstuff into new organs and abilities."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Radiotrophic"
msgstr "Radiotrophic"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Radiotrophic"
msgid ""
"Your system has adapted to radiation.  While irradiated, you will convert the "
"radiation into calories."
msgstr ""
"Your system has adapted to radiation.  While irradiated, you will convert the "
"radiation into calories."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "不做任何事"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Do nothing."
msgstr "什么都不做。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_COMMUNE_WITH_NATURE"
msgid "You must be surrounded by nature to commune with nature."
msgstr "你必须被自然环绕才能与自然沟通。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_JAGGED_CLAWS_ON"
msgid "The jagged wood covering your hands recedes, leaving no trace behind."
msgstr "覆盖在你手上的锯齿状木头逐渐退去，没有留下任何痕迹。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_THORNSKIN_ON"
msgid "Woody thorns push through your skin."
msgstr "Woody thorns push through your skin."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_THORNSKIN_ON"
msgid "Your thorns retract, leaving smooth unbroken skin behind."
msgstr "你的刺缩回去，留下光滑的皮肤。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_SEED_BEARER_activated"
msgid "You bring forth seeds."
msgstr "You bring forth seeds."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_SEED_BEARER_activated"
msgid "Your seeds slumber and dream of spring."
msgstr "Your seeds slumber and dream of spring."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_SEED_BEARER_activated"
msgid "You need more time before you can summon seeds again."
msgstr "You need more time before you can summon seeds again."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_SEED_BEARER_activated"
msgid "You must be surrounded by the wild to call forth regional seeds."
msgstr "You must be surrounded by the wild to call forth regional seeds."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid "You must be surrounded by the wild to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "你必须身处荒野才能培育出精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Grow Wooden Wall"
msgstr "Grow Wooden Wall"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Grow Wooden Floor"
msgstr "Grow Wooden Floor"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Grow Wooden Door"
msgstr "Grow Wooden Door"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Grow Leafy Branch"
msgstr "Grow Leafy Branch"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
msgid ""
"Grow a wall of solid wood from the earth, grow or remove bark from a wall, or "
"turn one of your wooden floors into a bark wall."
msgstr "从墙上种树皮或去掉树皮，或者把你的树皮地板变成树皮墙。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
msgid ""
"Grow a floor of bark from the earth, roof over a bark floor, or turn one of "
"your wooden walls into a bark floor."
msgstr "在地上种一个树皮地板，在树皮地板上盖一个屋顶，或者把你的一堵木墙变成树皮地板。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Grow a bramble door from a wooden wall or return the wall to solid wood."
msgstr "在木墙上种植一扇荆棘门，或者把墙改回实木。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_GROWING_WOOD_WALLS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Grow a leafy branch.  It won't provide shelter but it helps it feel like home."
msgstr "长一根枝繁叶茂的树枝。它不会提供庇护，但会让你有家的感觉。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_VINE_DRAG_activated"
msgid "Vines lash out and drag your target in!"
msgstr "Vines lash out and drag your target in!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_VINE_DRAG_activated"
msgid "You are too parched to lash out with any vines."
msgstr "You are too parched to lash out with any vines."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_SUMMON_PRESERVATION_CONTAINER_CHECK"
msgid "You must be surrounded by nature to cast To Oppose Decay."
msgstr "You must be surrounded by nature to cast To Oppose Decay."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH_INITIAL_CHECK_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH_INITIAL_CHECK"
msgid ""
"You need to be in the heart of the forest or at an attuned elemental altar to "
"successfully bind your soul."
msgstr "你需要身处森林深处或同调的元素祭坛处才能成功绑定您的灵魂。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH_INITIAL_CHECK"
msgid ""
"Your soul is still attaching itself to your new body.  You need to give it "
"time before attempting to bind it to the forest again."
msgstr "你的灵魂仍依附于你的新身体。你需要给它一些时间，然后再尝试将它与森林绑定。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH_INITIAL"
msgid "You bind your soul to the abundance of nature around you."
msgstr "你将灵魂与周围丰富的自然联系在一起。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERENNIAL_REBIRTH"
msgid ""
"As your body dies, your fae spirit flies free and, drawn to the pull of the "
"heart of the forest, rebirths itself from the bounty of nature."
msgstr "当你的身体死亡时，你的妖精灵魂将自由飞翔，并被森林深处吸引，在大自然的恩赐下重生。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_OVERGROWTH_2" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_OVERGROWTH"
msgid ""
"You must be on the surface and not on a building's upper stories to cast "
"Overgrowth!"
msgstr ""
"You must be on the surface and not on a building's upper stories to cast "
"Overgrowth!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_OVERGROWTH"
msgid "You must be outside to cast Overgrowth!"
msgstr "You must be outside to cast Overgrowth!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ NPC message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_DAMAGE_ZOMBIES_HEAL_LIVING"
msgid "Nature's power roars forth in an explosion of vital energy!"
msgstr "Nature's power roars forth in an explosion of vital energy!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
#. ~ Verb in activity "ACT_ARVORE_TREESINGING"
#. ~ name of the nested group
msgid "treesinging"
msgstr "treesinging"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING_COMPLETE"
msgid ""
"As your song fades, you open your eyes to find a large growth of wood lying "
"on the ground in front of you, separated from the tree without violence."
msgstr ""
"As your song fades, you open your eyes to find a large growth of wood lying "
"on the ground in front of you, separated from the tree without violence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING_LEARN_RECIPES"
msgid "The trees whisper their knowledge of a recipe to you"
msgstr "The trees whisper their knowledge of a recipe to you"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_FORM_ON"
msgid "You must be outside on diggable ground to become one with the forest."
msgstr "你必须在户外的可挖掘土地上才能与自然融为一体。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_VERDANT_IMPRISONMENT"
msgid "Your target must be outdoors to transform them into a tree."
msgstr "Your target must be outdoors to transform them into a tree."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_ROOT_TO_ROOT_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_ROOT_TO_ROOT_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
msgid "You must be outdoors and within the depths of the forest to cast this spell."
msgstr "你必须在户外，在森林深处才能施展这个咒语。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "human_sense"
msgid "The forest nervously whispers to you about the presence of humans."
msgstr "The forest nervously whispers to you about the presence of humans."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision
#. "infrared_creature_medium"
msgid "The forest gently whispers to you about the creatures of nature."
msgstr "The forest gently whispers to you about the creatures of nature."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "alien_being_sense"
msgid "The forest whispers warnings of unnatural creatures nearby."
msgstr "The forest whispers warnings of unnatural creatures nearby."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_commune_with_nature ( Commune with Nature )"
msgid ""
"You concentrate on nature around you and commune with it, improving your "
"health and calming the nearby wildlife.  This spell may only be cast outdoors "
"in natural surroundings."
msgstr "你专注于你周围的自然，与它交流，改善你的健康，安抚附近的野生动物。这个法术只能在户外自然环境中施展。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Cultivate Goblin
#. Fruit )"
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into a plant, bringing forth a goblin fruit.  "
"Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always at least "
"somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast outdoors in natural "
"surroundings."
msgstr "你可以向植物中注入一点妖精魔法，结出精怪果实。 果实的效果多种多样，虽然无法预测，但至少总能带来一些益处。 此咒语只能在户外自然环境中施放。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_tree_singing_spell"
msgid "Treesinging"
msgstr "Treesinging"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_tree_singing_spell ( Treesinging )"
msgid ""
"Using your voice and your magic, bring forth living wood from a tree to "
"provide resources without harming the forest."
msgstr ""
"Using your voice and your magic, bring forth living wood from a tree to "
"provide resources without harming the forest."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "arvore_tree_singing_spell ( Treesinging )"
msgid "You close your eyes and sing to the trees."
msgstr "You close your eyes and sing to the trees."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_verdant_infusion ( Verdant Infusion )"
msgid ""
"You draw on your own connection to nature and infuse some of its power into "
"one of your allies, healing them for a small amount and increasing their "
"overall health."
msgstr "你利用自己与自然的联系，将自然的一些力量注入到你的一个盟友身上，用少量的药物治愈他们，并增加他们的整体健康。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_roots_crack_the_foundation"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Roots Crack the Foundation"
msgstr "根系撕裂地基"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_roots_crack_the_foundation ( Roots Crack the
#. Foundation )"
msgid ""
"Roots can grow through even concrete given time.  With this spell, you can "
"compress that time into a single instant to shatter walls or rip doors off "
"their hinges."
msgstr "只要有时间，即使是混凝土也能长出根来。 有了这个咒语，你就可以瞬间击碎墙壁或把门从铰链上扯下来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_summon_wood_spirit"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Call the Children of the Roots"
msgstr "Call the Children of the Roots"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_summon_wood_spirit ( Call the Children of
#. the Roots )"
msgid "A lesser wood spirit is summoned to support you."
msgstr "一个较小的森林精灵被召唤来支持你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_summon_preservation_container"
msgid "To Withstand Decay"
msgstr "To Withstand Decay"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_summon_preservation_container ( To Withstand
#. Decay )"
msgid ""
"While in the wild, weave together some leaves and grasses and magick to form "
"a container that will keep its contents from rotting for a length of time.  "
"The container will only last a few weeks at most."
msgstr "在野外，把一些树叶和草编织在一起，用魔法做成一个容器，让里面的东西在一段时间内不会腐烂。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_summon_floral_boat"
msgid "Viridescent Vessel"
msgstr "Viridescent Vessel"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_summon_floral_boat ( Viridescent Vessel )"
msgid ""
"Trees require water but will still drown if submerged.  This spell allows the "
"Arvore to create a floral boat with the help of a nearby tree, letting them "
"travel safely across water.\n"
"\n"
"You must be standing <color_yellow>next to a tree</color> and "
"<color_yellow>near the water</color> for the spell to be effective."
msgstr ""
"Trees require water but will still drown if submerged.  This spell allows the "
"Arvore to create a floral boat with the help of a nearby tree, letting them "
"travel safely across water.\n"
"\n"
"You must be standing <color_yellow>next to a tree</color> and "
"<color_yellow>near the water</color> for the spell to be effective."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_summon_briars"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Briarwall"
msgstr "蒺藜之墙"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_summon_briars ( Briarwall )"
msgid ""
"Call up thick briars and thorns, either in a line to form a wall or an arc to "
"trap an enemy.  They will grow to full size in moments."
msgstr "召唤厚厚的蒺藜和荆棘，要么排成一条线，形成一堵墙，要么形成一个弧形，用来诱捕敌人。它们很快就会长到完整的尺寸。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_anti_plant_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Tending the Garden"
msgstr "照料花园"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_anti_plant_spell ( Tending the Garden )"
msgid ""
"Invasive weeds must be rooted out, lest they choke the life from the garden.  "
"This spell inflicts a rapid withering on plants and fungus within its area of "
"effect."
msgstr "必须铲除入侵的杂草，以免它们扼杀花园的生命。这个法术对其作用区域内的植物和真菌造成快速枯萎。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_seasonal_magic_spring.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_nurture_the_green"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_spring_growing_plants_spell"
msgid "Nurturing the Green"
msgstr "培育绿色"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_nurture_the_green ( Nurturing the Green )"
msgid ""
"You can greatly speed plant growth.  Grass can grow from seed in moments, "
"crops can be brought to ripeness, and even young trees will reach their full "
"bloom."
msgstr "你可以大大加速植物的生长。草可以瞬间从种子长出来，庄稼可以成熟，即使是幼小的树木也会盛开。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_nurture_the_green_aoe"
msgid "Spreading the Viridian Mantle"
msgstr "Spreading the Viridian Mantle"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_nurture_the_green_aoe ( Spreading the
#. Viridian Mantle )"
msgid ""
"Rather than fostering the growth of a single plant, you can cause a wave of "
"growth all around you, affecting an entire field and bringing it towards "
"ripeness."
msgstr ""
"Rather than fostering the growth of a single plant, you can cause a wave of "
"growth all around you, affecting an entire field and bringing it towards "
"ripeness."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_growing_wood_walls"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Forest Offers Shelter"
msgstr "森林提供庇护"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_growing_wood_walls ( The Forest Offers
#. Shelter )"
msgid ""
"In natural surroundings, you can create structures out of living wood--walls, "
"floors, doors, and roofs all together."
msgstr "在自然环境中，你可以用活的木头建造结构--墙、地板、门和屋顶都在一起。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_climbing_vine_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Creeper Ascends the Wall"
msgstr "Creeper Ascends the Wall"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_climbing_vine_spell ( Creeper Ascends the
#. Wall )"
msgid ""
"Cause a cluster of vines to burst out of diggable ground and rise up into the "
"sky in moments.  It will be easy to climb once its growth is finished."
msgstr ""
"Cause a cluster of vines to burst out of diggable ground and rise up into the "
"sky in moments.  It will be easy to climb once its growth is finished."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "arvore_climbing_vine_spell ( Creeper Ascends the Wall
#. )"
msgid "The soil churns as thick vines burst forth and shoots toward the sky."
msgstr "The soil churns as thick vines burst forth and shoots toward the sky."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_create_living_tent_spell"
msgid "Den of Brambles"
msgstr "Den of Brambles"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_create_living_tent_spell ( Den of Brambles
#. )"
msgid ""
"When outside on diggable ground, create a small structure of wood near the "
"Arvore, offering shelter against the elements."
msgstr ""
"When outside on diggable ground, create a small structure of wood near the "
"Arvore, offering shelter against the elements."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_seasonal_magic_spring.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_summon_grass_field_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_spring_summon_grass_field_spell"
msgid "Commanding the Grasses"
msgstr "Commanding the Grasses"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_summon_grass_field_spell ( Commanding the
#. Grasses )"
msgid ""
"Your command over plants allows you to cause grass to grow in profusion from "
"the soil, making the terrain very difficult for enemies to traverse."
msgstr ""
"Your command over plants allows you to cause grass to grow in profusion from "
"the soil, making the terrain very difficult for enemies to traverse."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_roots_spell ( Hungry Thirsty Roots )"
msgid ""
"Your command over plants allows you to call forth roots from the earth to "
"clutch and grasp at your enemies."
msgstr "你对植物的指挥使你能够从大地上拔出根来抓住你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_perennial_rebirth_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Perennial Rebirth"
msgstr "持续复活"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_perennial_rebirth_spell ( Perennial Rebirth
#. )"
msgid ""
"Bind your soul to the heart of the forest, rebirthing yourself if you should "
"die.  You may only perform this in thick forests or at an arvore altar, you "
"may be reborn no more than once in a lunar month."
msgstr "将自己的灵魂与森林之心绑定，死后可重生。 你只能在茂密的森林中或在奇木灵祭坛上进行这项仪式，一个月内你只能重生一次。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_overgrowth_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Overgrowth"
msgstr "过度生长"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_overgrowth_spell ( Overgrowth )"
msgid ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the Arvore can create a profusion of life "
"around themselves, causing grass to grow through pavement, bushes and flowers "
"to sprout, and trees to grow to full height in moments."
msgstr ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the Arvore can create a profusion of life "
"around themselves, causing grass to grow through pavement, bushes and flowers "
"to sprout, and trees to grow to full height in moments."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_cause_decay"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fallen Trees Decay to Soil"
msgstr "倒下的树木腐烂成土"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_cause_decay ( Fallen Trees Decay to Soil )"
msgid ""
"Even the mightiest tree returns to soil in the end.  The Arvore may channel "
"this natural process into an area around themselves, infecting everyone "
"within with the energies of rot.\n"
"\n"
"<color_yellow>This spell is indiscriminate</color> and <color_red>should not "
"be used near allies</color>."
msgstr ""
"即使是最高大的树，最终也会归于泥土。奇木灵可能会将这一自然过程引导到他们周围的一个区域，用腐烂的能量感染里面的每个人。\n"
"\n"
"<color_yellow>这个法术是不分青红皂白的</color>和<color_red>不应该在盟友附近使用</color>。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_traverse_the_wilds ( Traverse the Wilds )"
msgid ""
"Roots grow together and so forests are connected.  The Arvore may use this "
"connection to quickly transport themselves tree to tree, stepping into an "
"adjacent tree and then stepping out of another one within the spell's range."
msgstr ""
"Roots grow together and so forests are connected.  The Arvore may use this "
"connection to quickly transport themselves tree to tree, stepping into an "
"adjacent tree and then stepping out of another one within the spell's range."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_forest_translocate"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "From Root to Root the Forest Is Joined"
msgstr "根系联结"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_forest_translocate ( From Root to Root the
#. Forest Is Joined )"
msgid ""
"All forests are connected at their hearts.  You can use this connection to "
"travel from the depths of a forest to the depths of another forest, if you "
"properly attune to your destination."
msgstr ""
"All forests are connected at their hearts.  You can use this connection to "
"travel from the depths of a forest to the depths of another forest, if you "
"properly attune to your destination."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_forest_translocate_attune"
msgid "Root to Root Attunement"
msgstr "Root to Root Attunement"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_forest_translocate_attune ( Root to Root
#. Attunement )"
msgid ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune within the depths "
"of a forest."
msgstr ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune within the depths "
"of a forest."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_turn_into_tree"
msgid "Verdant Imprisonment"
msgstr "Verdant Imprisonment"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_turn_into_tree ( Verdant Imprisonment )"
msgid ""
"The ultimate expression of nature's power, you can turn your target into a "
"tree that might have stood for a century or more.  It works best on an "
"already-weakened target, and does not work at all on non-organic targets."
msgstr ""
"The ultimate expression of nature's power, you can turn your target into a "
"tree that might have stood for a century or more.  It works best on an "
"already-weakened target, and does not work at all on non-organic targets."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_damage_zombies_heal_living"
msgid "Embrace of the Verdant Mother"
msgstr "Embrace of the Verdant Mother"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "arvore_damage_zombies_heal_living ( Embrace of the
#. Verdant Mother )"
msgid ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the Arvore can unleash the power of "
"nature against their enemies.  The walking dead and most creatures not native "
"to the world suffer the Earthmother's wrath, while animals and humans are "
"healed.  Triffids, being plants, are healed as well.\n"
"\n"
"Note that this power is <color_yellow>indiscriminate</color>: if the Arvore "
"has somehow bound a Nether creature to their service, it will be damaged, and "
"hostile humans will be healed."
msgstr ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the Arvore can unleash the power of "
"nature against their enemies.  The walking dead and most creatures not native "
"to the world suffer the Earthmother's wrath, while animals and humans are "
"healed.  Triffids, being plants, are healed as well.\n"
"\n"
"Note that this power is <color_yellow>indiscriminate</color>: if the Arvore "
"has somehow bound a Nether creature to their service, it will be damaged, and "
"hostile humans will be healed."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Viridian Skin"
msgstr "铬绿皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Viridian Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of spring growth.  Your skin is now a viridian "
"green.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤已经变成了春天生长的颜色。你的皮肤现在是翠绿的。这没有游戏效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vegetal Cuticle"
msgstr "植物表皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vegetal Cuticle"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned into a type of plant matter, which in addition to any "
"armoring slows your loss of fluids."
msgstr "你的皮肤已经变成了一种植物物质，除了任何铠甲之外，它还能减缓你的液体流失。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Bark Skin"
msgstr "树皮"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Bark Skin"
msgid ""
"The skin on your body has grown into a barklike state.  This provides "
"significantly more armor but reduces flexibility."
msgstr "你身上的皮肤已经长成了树皮状。这提供了更多的装甲，但降低了灵活性。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Patches of Moss"
msgstr "Patches of Moss"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Patches of Moss"
msgid ""
"A viridian moss has grown on your skin, forming whorls and eldritch patterns, "
"providing some protection from the cold and the wet.  It also provides a "
"small amount of armor against acid or fire."
msgstr "你的身上长出了一层青苔，形成了螺旋状的奇异图案，为你抵挡寒冷和潮湿提供了一些保护。它还能提供少量的抗酸或抗火护甲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pact of the Green"
msgstr "绿之约"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pact of the Green"
msgid ""
"You are in tune with the forest and the triffids will allow you safe passage "
"in their lands, so long as you do not harm them."
msgstr "你与森林相融无间，只要你不伤害三尖树，它们便会容你在其领地安然穿行。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Greenstride"
msgstr "绿色步伐"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Greenstride"
msgid ""
"The trees recognize you as one of their own and allow you to pass easily "
"beneath their boughs.  The grass moves under your feet to speed your passage, "
"and shrubs bend out of the way.  When walking on grass, trees, or other "
"natural foliage, your movement speed is increased."
msgstr ""
"树木将你视为它们的一员，并允许你轻松地从它们的树枝下通过。草在你脚下移动，以加快你的通行速度，灌木丛也会弯腰让开。当在草地、树木或其他自然树叶上行走时，你的"
"移动速度会增加。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Forestwalker"
msgstr "森林行者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Forestwalker"
msgid ""
"The trees recognize you as one of their own and allow you to pass easily "
"beneath their boughs.  The grass moves under your feet to speed your passage, "
"and shrubs bend out of the way.  When walking on grass, trees, or other "
"natural foliage, your movement speed is increased.  In addition, when in a "
"forest, the trees bend out of your way, allowing you to pass"
msgstr ""
"The trees recognize you as one of their own and allow you to pass easily "
"beneath their boughs.  The grass moves under your feet to speed your passage, "
"and shrubs bend out of the way.  When walking on grass, trees, or other "
"natural foliage, your movement speed is increased.  In addition, when in a "
"forest, the trees bend out of your way, allowing you to pass"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Nurturing the Green"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore may greatly speed plant growth.  With "
"enough practice, you will even be able to bring forth mighty trees from the "
"dry earth."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，奇木灵可以极大地加速植物的生长。通过足够的练习，你甚至可以从干燥的土地上长出参天大树。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Seed Bearer"
msgstr "种子孕育者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Seed Bearer"
msgid ""
"Arvore with this ability have a seed pocket on their body that over time "
"fills with a set of from this region of the world.  Each time new seeds "
"appear they will all be of the same type, but the types will vary at random."
msgstr ""
"Arvore with this ability have a seed pocket on their body that over time "
"fills with a set of from this region of the world.  Each time new seeds "
"appear they will all be of the same type, but the types will vary at random."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Forest Offers Shelter"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore may create structures of living wood on "
"natural terrain."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，奇木灵可以在自然地形上建造活木结构。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Commune with Nature"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to draw on the peace "
"and strength of nature while standing in a wild area."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，奇木灵就能够在野外站立时汲取自然的和平与力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Briarwall"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to summon thick "
"tangles of briars to form walls or entrap their enemies."
msgstr "在获得这个技能后，奇木灵就可以召唤厚厚的蒺藜组成城墙或诱捕他们的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Traverse the Wilds"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to transport "
"themselves from tree to nearby tree while within a forest."
msgstr "获得此能力后，奇木灵就能够在森林中将自己从一棵树传送到附近的一棵树。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fallen Trees Decay to Soil"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to induce decay and "
"dissolution in the surrounding area."
msgstr "获得此能力后，奇木灵获得了在周围区域引起腐烂和溶解的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Call the Children of the Roots"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to summon a wood "
"spirit."
msgstr "获得此能力后，奇木灵获得了召唤木精的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Roots Crack the Foundation"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, the Arvore gains the ability to summon "
"semitangible roots that will shatter walls and furniture."
msgstr "获得此能力后，奇木灵获得了召唤半实体根的能力，可以粉碎墙壁和家具。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "From Root to Root the Forest Is Joined"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, the Arvore gains the ability to travel great "
"distances, even dozens of miles, in moments, as long as they start and end "
"their journey within the depths of a forest."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability, the Arvore gains the ability to travel great "
"distances, even dozens of miles, in moments, as long as they start and end "
"their journey within the depths of a forest."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Overgrowth"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, the Arvore gains the ability to cause rapid plant "
"growth in a radius around themselves."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability, the Arvore gains the ability to cause rapid plant "
"growth in a radius around themselves."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Perennial Rebirth"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to bind their soul to "
"the heart of the forest, rebirthing themselves when on the verge of death."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，奇木灵就能将自己的灵魂束缚在森林的中心，在死亡边缘重生。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Perennial Rebirth (bound)"
msgstr "持续复活（绑定）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Perennial Rebirth (bound)"
msgid ""
"You have bound your soul to the forest, and death will merely be a momentary "
"inconvenience."
msgstr "你已将灵魂与森林紧紧相连，死亡只是一时的不便。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Verdant Infusion"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to infuse their "
"companions with the vitality of the forest."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，奇木灵就能够为同伴注入森林的活力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Commanding the Grasses"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to cause grass to "
"rapidly grow on fertile terrain, slowing their enemies."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to cause grass to "
"rapidly grow on fertile terrain, slowing their enemies."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Creeper Ascends the Wall"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to summon a thick "
"climbing vine from diggable ground."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to summon a thick "
"climbing vine from diggable ground."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Tending the Garden"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to damage plant and "
"fungal entities, including others of their own kind."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，奇木灵就获得了伤害植物和真菌实体（包括其他同类）的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit "
"when in natural areas away from civilization."
msgstr "获得这项能力后，奇木灵在远离文明的自然区域就能培育精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_forest_mapping_spell"
msgid "Commune with the Ancient Oaks"
msgstr "与古橡树交流"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Commune with the Ancient Oaks"
msgid ""
"The Arvore are closely tied with the forests and may commune with the trees "
"to learn the layout of the land.  Activate this ability to enter the "
"communion."
msgstr "奇木灵与森林紧密相连，可以与树木交流以了解大地的布局。激活此能力即可进入交流。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Bramble's Bite"
msgstr "荆棘噬咬"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Bramble's Bite"
msgid ""
"Drawing out the power inherent in growing wood makes weapons composed of it "
"more deadly in your hands.  You do increased damage when wielding a weapon "
"primarily made of wood."
msgstr ""
"Drawing out the power inherent in growing wood makes weapons composed of it "
"more deadly in your hands.  You do increased damage when wielding a weapon "
"primarily made of wood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Essence of Hemlock"
msgstr "铁杉精华"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Essence of Hemlock"
msgid ""
"With a brief effort of will, the Arvore may infuse their blood with a poison "
"that harms any who bite them."
msgstr "只要有短暂的意志努力，奇木灵就可以在他们的血液中注入一种毒药，伤害任何咬他们的人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Scent of Night-Blooming Flowers"
msgstr "Scent of Night-Blooming Flowers"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Scent of Night-Blooming Flowers"
msgid ""
"The Arvore may release clouds of pollen that ruin the coordination of their "
"enemies when breathed in."
msgstr ""
"The Arvore may release clouds of pollen that ruin the coordination of their "
"enemies when breathed in."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Solar Rejuvenation"
msgstr "日光复苏"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Rejuvenation"
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you "
"will absorb its energy as nutrients and heal slightly faster."
msgstr "就像一棵树，你的能量来自阳光。 当站在阳光下时，你会吸收阳光的能量作为养分，愈合的速度也会稍快一些。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Solar Revitalization"
msgstr "日光再生"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Revitalization"
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you "
"will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, and your mana "
"regenerates much quicker."
msgstr "就像一棵树，你的能量来源于阳光。 当站在阳光下时，你会吸收阳光的能量作为养分，愈合速度会稍快，魔力再生也会更快。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Eternal Cycle"
msgstr "The Eternal Cycle"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Eternal Cycle"
msgid ""
"Your energy changes with the seasons: in spring and summer, you're more awake "
"and need less sleep, and the reverse is true in autumn and winter."
msgstr ""
"Your energy changes with the seasons: in spring and summer, you're more awake "
"and need less sleep, and the reverse is true in autumn and winter."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Solar Repast"
msgstr "日光餐"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Repast"
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you draw nourishment from the sun and the soil.  When standing "
"in the sunlight and on natural terrain, you absorb its energy as food.  You "
"still need to drink water and you will still get hungry."
msgstr "就像一棵树，你从阳光和土壤中汲取养分。 当你站在阳光下，站在自然的土地上，你会吸收阳光的能量作为食物。 你仍然需要喝水，仍然会感到饥饿。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Fallen Branch Suffers Not"
msgstr "落叶无痛"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Fallen Branch Suffers Not"
msgid "Filled with the energy of life, pain does not affect you as strongly."
msgstr "充满生命的能量，疼痛对你的影响就不会那么强烈。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Entangling Vines"
msgstr "纠缠藤蔓"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Entangling Vines"
msgid ""
"At will, you can extend a cluster of grasping vines to grab one target and "
"drag them in.  They have a range equal to 1/2 your Dexterity."
msgstr "只要愿意，你可以伸出一团贪婪的藤蔓，抓住一个目标并将它拖近身边。范围等于你敏捷的1/2。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Jagged Wooden Claws"
msgstr "锯齿木爪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Jagged Wooden Claws"
msgid ""
"At will, you can transform your hands into jagged wooden claws.  They are "
"potent weapons but make anything other than combat more difficult."
msgstr "你可以随意将双手变成锯齿状的木爪。 它们是有力的武器，但会使战斗以外的任何事情变得更加困难。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Jagged Wooden Claws Extended"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Jagged Wooden Claws Extended"
msgid ""
"Your hands are transformed into jagged wooden claws.  You can use them to "
"attack, but performing mundane tasks will be harder."
msgstr "你的双手会变成锯齿状的木爪。 你可以用它们进行攻击，但执行日常任务会更加困难。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Resist Winter's Chill"
msgstr "抵御寒冬"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Winter's Chill"
msgid ""
"Plants lose their leaves in winter, but that does not kill them, they simply "
"sleep until the spring comes.  The cold bothers you less now."
msgstr "植物在冬天落叶，但这并不会杀死它们，它们只是睡到春天来。现在感冒不那么让你烦恼了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ignore Winter's Chill"
msgstr "无视冬日的寒冷"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ignore Winter's Chill"
msgid ""
"Pine trees keep their leaves even in the coldest winter.  The cold bothers "
"you now not at all."
msgstr "即使在最寒冷的冬天，松树也能保持叶子的生长。 现在，寒冷已经完全不再困扰你了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sensing the Sun"
msgstr "感知太阳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sensing the Sun"
msgid ""
"By the places of the sun and the moon, you can always tell exactly what time "
"it is, as long as you're not underground."
msgstr "通过观测日月的位置，只要你不在地下，你永远能知道现在的时间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Among the Wilds"
msgstr "荒野的恩惠"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Among the Wilds"
msgid ""
"The wilderness welcomes you as one of its own, and you have an easier time "
"surviving there and making things from its bounty.  +1.5 Survival skill."
msgstr "荒野欢迎你成为它的一员，你会更容易在那里生存，并从它的恩惠中获得东西。+1.5生存技能。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Supple As a Reed"
msgstr "柔韧如芦苇"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Supple As a Reed"
msgid ""
"Like green wood, you can bend your limbs easily.  You gain a +4 bonus to "
"Dexterity."
msgstr "就像绿枝一样，你的四肢很容易弯曲。 你会获得 +4 的敏捷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Might of the Seedling"
msgstr "新芽的力量"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Might of the Seedling"
msgid ""
"Like the seedling poking through the soil, you have great strength hidden "
"within you.  +1 Strength."
msgstr "就像探出土壤的幼苗一样，你的体内蕴藏着强大的力量。 +1 力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Might of the Sapling"
msgstr "树苗的力量"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Might of the Sapling"
msgid ""
"Like the young tree reaching for the sun, your limbs are filled with power.  "
"+3 Strength."
msgstr "就像那棵朝向太阳的小树，你的四肢充满了力量。+3力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Might of the Ancient Tree"
msgstr "古树的力量"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Might of the Ancient Tree"
msgid ""
"Like forest giants that have stood for a hundred years, you are unshakeable.  "
"+5 Strength."
msgstr "你就像屹立百年的森林巨人，不可动摇。 力量 +5"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Insight of the Grove"
msgstr "森林的启示"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Insight of the Grove"
msgid ""
"When one tree in a grove is attacked by insects, soon all trees will produce "
"the deterrent.  +3 Perception."
msgstr "当小树林中的一棵树受到昆虫攻击时，很快所有的树都会感知。 +3 感知"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Shadow of the Trees"
msgstr "树之影"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Shadow of the Trees"
msgid ""
"The forest recognizes your kinship and will hide you beneath its boughs.  "
"When in a forest or in thick foliage, enemies will have a harder time "
"spotting you."
msgstr ""
"The forest recognizes your kinship and will hide you beneath its boughs.  "
"When in a forest or in thick foliage, enemies will have a harder time "
"spotting you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Arvore Eyes"
msgstr "奇木灵之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Arvore Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Arvore's eyes begin reflecting the seasons: a "
"bright yellow-green in spring; verdant green in summer; red, yellow, or "
"orange in autumn, and dark brown in winter.  Glare no longer impacts them."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，奇木灵的眼睛就会开始反映四季的变化：春天是明亮的黄绿色；夏天是青翠的绿色；秋天是红色、黄色或橙色；冬天是深褐色。 眩光不再影响它们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Arvore Ears"
msgstr "奇木灵之耳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Arvore Ears"
msgid ""
"The Arvore's ears are longer and pointed, more \"leaf-shaped.\"  While they "
"cannot hear any better, like the trees in the deep forest, they are unphased "
"by loud sounds."
msgstr "奇木灵的耳朵更长更尖，更像 \"树叶\"。 虽然它们听力不好，但就像森林深处的树木一样，它们不会被巨大的声音吓到。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vegetal Blood"
msgstr "植物血液"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vegetal Blood"
msgid ""
"The Arvore's blood is now composed of sap and vegetable matter.  This does "
"not benefit or harm them in any ways, but humans will be discomfited by it."
msgstr "奇木灵的血液现在由树液和植物物质组成。 这对它们没有任何好处或坏处，但人类会因此感到不适。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sap Seals the Wound"
msgstr "树液封伤口"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sap Seals the Wound"
msgid ""
"The Arvore's blood is a sticky sap that oozes rather than gushes from their "
"wounds.  They will bleed more slowly than normal."
msgstr "奇木灵的血液是一种粘稠的汁液，从伤口中渗出而不是涌出。他们的出血速度比正常人慢。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sap Defends the Trunk"
msgstr "树液卫树干"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sap Defends the Trunk"
msgid ""
"The Arvore's blood is a sticky sap that oozes rather than gushes from their "
"wounds and has potent defensive properties.  They will bleed more slowly than "
"normal and are immune to parasites and infection."
msgstr "奇木灵的血液是一种粘稠的汁液，从伤口渗出而不是涌出，具有强大的防御特性。它们出血更慢，并且对寄生虫和感染免疫。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sap Maintains the Heartwood"
msgstr "树液护心材"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sap Maintains the Heartwood"
msgid ""
"The Arvore's blood is a sticky sap that oozes rather than gushes from their "
"wounds and aggressively fights back against invading organisms.  They will "
"bleed much more slowly than normal, are immune to parasites and infection, "
"and cannot be transformed by the Mycus."
msgstr ""
"The Arvore's blood is a sticky sap that oozes rather than gushes from their "
"wounds and aggressively fights back against invading organisms.  They will "
"bleed much more slowly than normal, are immune to parasites and infection, "
"and cannot be transformed by the Mycus."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Writhing Vines"
msgstr "Writhing Vines"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Writhing Vines"
msgid ""
"At will, the Arvore can grow long vines from their shoulders and back.  They "
"can be used to climb or to lash at enemies, and can also be detached to serve "
"as a rope if necessary.  Activate to toggle vines on and off."
msgstr "你可以随意从肩膀和背部长出长长的藤蔓。它们可以用来攀爬或鞭打敌人，必要时也可以分离成绳子。激活以打开和关闭藤蔓。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Forests' Warning"
msgstr "森林的警告"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Forests' Warning"
msgid ""
"In the whispers of the leaves and the movement of the grasses, the forest "
"warns you of nearby creatures.  While the forest can distinguish between a "
"bird and a zombie, some fine distinctions are still lost to it."
msgstr ""
"In the whispers of the leaves and the movement of the grasses, the forest "
"warns you of nearby creatures.  While the forest can distinguish between a "
"bird and a zombie, some fine distinctions are still lost to it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Whispers of the Leaves"
msgstr "草木的细语"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Whispers of the Leaves"
msgid ""
"In the whispers of the leaves and the movement of the grasses, the forest "
"warns you of nearby creatures.  While the forest can distinguish between a "
"bird and a zombie, some fine distinctions are still lost to it.  Also, you "
"can see further when you're standing in a forest."
msgstr ""
"In the whispers of the leaves and the movement of the grasses, the forest "
"warns you of nearby creatures.  While the forest can distinguish between a "
"bird and a zombie, some fine distinctions are still lost to it.  Also, you "
"can see further when you're standing in a forest."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Verdant Hair"
msgstr "葱郁的头发"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Verdant Hair"
msgid ""
"Your hair now has flowers and small vines and leaves growing in it.  It's "
"pleasant to look at but has no further game effect."
msgstr "你的头发上现在长出了花朵、小藤蔓和叶子。 这很好看，但对游戏没有进一步的影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Floral Scent"
msgstr "花香四溢"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Floral Scent"
msgid ""
"The flowers in your hair produce a pleasant smell, obvious without being "
"overpowering.  You no longer smell anything like a human and other beings "
"will react to you appropriately."
msgstr "你头发上的花朵会散发出令人愉悦的香味，明显而不刺鼻。 你闻起来不再像人类，其他人也会对你做出适当的反应。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Hidden Thorns"
msgstr "隐秘荆棘"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hidden Thorns"
msgid ""
"Every rose has its thorn and so do you.  With a moment's concentration, you "
"can exude thorns through your skin that have a chance of damaging attackers "
"while increasing the damage of your unarmed attacks.  However, you cannot "
"wear rigid armor over your thorns."
msgstr ""
"每朵玫瑰都有它的刺，你也一样。 只要集中片刻的注意力，你就能通过皮肤散发出荆棘，有几率对攻击者造成伤害，同时增加你徒手攻击的伤害。 "
"不过，你不能在刺上穿戴坚硬的盔甲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unveiled Thorns Extended"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unveiled Thorns Extended"
msgid ""
"You are exuding thorns through your skin that have a chance of damaging "
"attackers while increasing the damage of your unarmed attacks.  However, you "
"cannot wear rigid armor over your thorns."
msgstr "你的皮肤会刺出荆棘，有几率对攻击者造成伤害，同时增加你徒手攻击的伤害。 不过，你不能在荆棘上穿戴坚硬的护甲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Enchanting Aroma"
msgstr "迷人香气"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Enchanting Aroma"
msgid ""
"The flowers in your hair produce an intoxicating smell.  You no longer smell "
"anything like a human and other beings will react to you appropriately.  You "
"can enhance this scent to an overpowering level, beguiling humans and making "
"them more suggestible at the cost of greatly increasing the range at which "
"others can smell you."
msgstr ""
"The flowers in your hair produce an intoxicating smell.  You no longer smell "
"anything like a human and other beings will react to you appropriately.  You "
"can enhance this scent to an overpowering level, beguiling humans and making "
"them more suggestible at the cost of greatly increasing the range at which "
"others can smell you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Leaves Return When Winter Ends"
msgstr "冬去春来，叶落归根"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Leaves Return When Winter Ends"
msgid ""
"When in wild areas, you can draw on the revitalizing power of the land to "
"heal yourself.  When in natural areas, your limbs will heal much faster."
msgstr "在野外，你可以借助土地的活力来治愈自己。 在自然环境中，你的肢体会愈合得更快。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "One with the Forest"
msgstr "与森林融为一体"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "One with the Forest"
msgid ""
"You may transform into a tree, extending roots and spreading leaves out to "
"the sun.  You will heal faster, gain more benefit from sleep, and almost all "
"monsters will ignore you, but you will only be dimly aware of the outside "
"world and will be nearly unable to move."
msgstr "你可以变成一棵树，伸展树根和向太阳展开树叶。 你会更快地痊愈，从睡眠中获得更多益处，几乎所有的怪物都会无视你，但你只能模糊地感知外界，几乎无法移动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ancient Tree"
msgstr "古树"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ancient Tree"
msgid ""
"You are a tree.  You will heal much more quickly and resting is more "
"beneficial.  You are unable to see, hear, or move, but have a dim awareness "
"of nearby movement."
msgstr "你是一棵树。 你的伤口会愈合得更快，休息也更有益。 你看不到、听不到或动不了，但能模糊地感知到附近的动静。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Solar Empowerment"
msgstr "日光赋能"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Empowerment"
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you "
"will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, your mana "
"regenerates much quicker, and you gain a bonus to your maximum mana."
msgstr "就像一棵树，你的能量来源于阳光。 当你站在阳光下时，你会吸收阳光的能量作为养分，愈合速度会稍快，魔力值的再生速度也会更快，而且你还会获得最大魔力值的加成。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Solar Ascendancy"
msgstr "日光统治"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Solar Ascendancy"
msgid ""
"Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you "
"will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, your mana "
"regenerates much quicker, you gain a bonus to your maximum mana, and you gain "
"a +2 bonus to all stats."
msgstr ""
"就像一棵树，你的能量来源于阳光。 "
"当你站在阳光下时，你会吸收阳光的能量作为养分，治疗速度会稍快一些，魔力值的再生速度会更快，你的最大魔力值会获得加成，所有属性都会获得 +2 加成。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_NURTURING_THE_GREEN"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_NURTURING_THE_GREEN_AOE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_WOOD_WALL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_COMMUNE_WITH_NATURE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_BRIARS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_FOREST_TELEPORT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_CAUSE_DECAY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_PRESERVATION_CONTAINER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_FLORAL_BOAT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_WOOD_SPIRIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_TERRAIN_BASH_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_FOREST_TRANSLOCATION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_TURN_INTO_TREE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_VERDANT_INFUSION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_SUMMON_GRASS_FIELD_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_ROOTS_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_CLIMBING_VINE_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_LIVING_TENT_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_ANTI_PLANT_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_DAMAGE_ZOMBIES_HEAL_LIVING"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_TREE_TRANSFORM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_WIND_BLOWS_WILLOW_BENDS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_ARVORE_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent under the shadows of the trees has increased your facility "
"with your fae magicks."
msgstr ""
"Your time spent under the shadows of the trees has increased your facility "
"with your fae magicks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_NO_TRACE_ON"
msgid "Your body stops producing scent."
msgstr "你的身体不再散发气味。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_NO_TRACE_ON"
msgid "Your body begins producing scent."
msgstr "你的身体开始散发气味。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_BACKSTAGE_ON"
msgid "You seem to fade into the background."
msgstr "你毫不起眼。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_BACKSTAGE_ON"
msgid "You become more noticeable."
msgstr "你变得更引人注目。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_DREAMWALKER_GAIN_DREAMDROSS"
msgid ""
"As you awaken from the remnants of another's dreams, you find scraps of "
"dreamdross next to you."
msgstr ""
"As you awaken from the remnants of another's dreams, you find scraps of "
"dreamdross next to you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid "You must be in the remnants of civilization to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "你必须身处文明遗迹才能获取精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_DOLL_FORM_ON"
msgid "Your limbs stiffen and your skin takes on an even more waxen appearance."
msgstr "Your limbs stiffen and your skin takes on an even more waxen appearance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_DOLL_FORM_ON"
msgid "A small semblance of life returns to you."
msgstr "A small semblance of life returns to you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_DOLL_FORM_MOVEMENT_BREAK_CHECKER"
msgid ""
"As you take another step, you notice hostile eyes turn toward you.  They "
"don't see you as just a doll now."
msgstr "在你更进一步之后，敌意的目光转向你。他们不再把你看做单纯的玩偶了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_ALL_ROADS_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
msgid "You must be standing on a road to cast this spell."
msgstr "You must be standing on a road to cast this spell."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_ALL_ROADS_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
msgid ""
"You must be within one of the remaining bastions of civilization to cast this "
"spell."
msgstr ""
"You must be within one of the remaining bastions of civilization to cast this "
"spell."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_charm_feral_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "One of Us"
msgstr "One of Us"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_charm_feral_spell ( One of Us )"
msgid ""
"Insinuate yourself into a feral human's mind, tricking them into thinking you "
"are an ally."
msgstr ""
"Insinuate yourself into a feral human's mind, tricking them into thinking you "
"are an ally."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_summon_feral_spell"
msgid "Calling the Lost and the Damned"
msgstr "Calling the Lost and the Damned"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_summon_feral_spell ( Calling the Lost and
#. the Damned )"
msgid "Feral humans come to your aid."
msgstr "Feral humans come to your aid."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_self_deception_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Everything Will Be Fine"
msgstr "都会好的"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_self_deception_spell ( Everything Will Be
#. Fine )"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, it is best to focus on the positive.  This spell increases the "
"Homullus's mood when cast."
msgstr "有时人最好往积极的那面想。 施放该法术能提升金灵偶心情。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_invisible_to_humans_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "A Face in the Crowd"
msgstr "泯然众人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_invisible_to_humans_spell ( A Face in the
#. Crowd )"
msgid ""
"Though the teeming masses of humanity are gone, the Homullus can evoke their "
"anonymizing essence with magick, rendering them invisible to any humans "
"affected by the spell."
msgstr ""
"Though the teeming masses of humanity are gone, the Homullus can evoke their "
"anonymizing essence with magick, rendering them invisible to any humans "
"affected by the spell."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_sense_vampires ( Sense the Night Hunters
#. )"
msgid "Weaving this glamour will allow you to sense the presence of nearby vampires."
msgstr "Weaving this glamour will allow you to sense the presence of nearby vampires."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "homullus_sense_vampires ( Sense the Night Hunters )"
msgid ""
"You mutter a charm under your breath and feel for those who subsist on stolen "
"blood."
msgstr ""
"You mutter a charm under your breath and feel for those who subsist on stolen "
"blood."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_reduced_visibility_ally_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Average Joe"
msgstr "凡夫俗子"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_reduced_visibility_ally_spell ( The
#. Average Joe )"
msgid ""
"Weave a cloak of glamour around a target, making it more difficult for "
"enemies to spot them.  This is not invisibility, and getting to close to a "
"hostile target will allow them to see through the magick."
msgstr "将一件魔法披风缠绕在目标上，使自己更难被发现。这不是隐形，敌对的目标能在被接近时看穿魔法。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_restore_power_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dynamo"
msgstr "Dynamo"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_restore_power_spell ( Dynamo )"
msgid ""
"Fueled by the power charging your leylines, touch a target to restore some of "
"the power in a vehicle or power grid."
msgstr ""
"Fueled by the power charging your leylines, touch a target to restore some of "
"the power in a vehicle or power grid."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_add_learning_focus_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Scholar's Regard"
msgstr "学者之见"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_add_learning_focus_spell ( The Scholar's
#. Regard )"
msgid ""
"Unlike plants or animals, humans study subjects unrelated to survival.  This "
"spell focuses the Homullus's mind, allowing easier learning."
msgstr ""
"Unlike plants or animals, humans study subjects unrelated to survival.  This "
"spell focuses the Homullus's mind, allowing easier learning."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_cultivate_goblin_fruit"
msgid "Discover Goblin Fruit"
msgstr "发掘精怪果实"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Discover Goblin
#. Fruit )"
msgid ""
"With the aid of a bit of fae magick, you may find a goblin fruit abandoned "
"among the ruins.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable "
"but always at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast in the "
"remnants of civilization."
msgstr "在精灵魔法的帮助下，你可能在废墟中找到无主的精怪果实。 果实的效果多种多样，虽然无法预测，但至少能带来一些益处。 此咒语只能在文明的遗迹中施放。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_road_translocate_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "All Roads Lead to Rome"
msgstr "All Roads Lead to Rome"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_road_translocate_spell ( All Roads Lead to
#. Rome )"
msgid ""
"Humanity crisscrossed the Earth with roads, first small tracks, then earthen "
"projects, and finally mighty asphalt webs upon which billions of people "
"traveled every day.  The Homullus can stand on the remnants of that web and "
"return to any remaining locus of civilization that they have attuned to."
msgstr ""
"Humanity crisscrossed the Earth with roads, first small tracks, then earthen "
"projects, and finally mighty asphalt webs upon which billions of people "
"traveled every day.  The Homullus can stand on the remnants of that web and "
"return to any remaining locus of civilization that they have attuned to."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_road_translocate_attune"
msgid "All Roads Lead to Rome Attunement"
msgstr "All Roads Lead to Rome Attunement"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_road_translocate_attune ( All Roads Lead
#. to Rome Attunement )"
msgid ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune at one of the "
"remaining bastions of civilization or concentrations of humanity."
msgstr ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune at one of the "
"remaining bastions of civilization or concentrations of humanity."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mannequin Skin"
msgstr "人偶皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mannequin Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned pearlescent white, similar to antique dolls.  This has "
"no gameplay effects."
msgstr "你皮肤的颜色变成珠光般的白，就像古董娃娃那样。这一变异对游戏方面没有影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Porcelain Skin"
msgstr "瓷器皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Latex Skin"
msgstr "乳胶皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Homullus Eyes"
msgstr "金灵偶之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Homullus Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus's eyes begin change to look like "
"doll's eyes, always staring at the world.  Glare no longer impacts them."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，金灵偶的眼睛开始变得像洋娃娃的眼睛，永远注视着世界。眩光不再对他们产生影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Trust Me"
msgstr "请相信我"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Trust Me"
msgid ""
" 'Men were deceivers ever,' as the quotation runs.  To be human is to be a "
"liar.  You are much more successful at lying to people now."
msgstr "\"人天性是骗子\"，莎翁如是说。人生来就要骗人。你现在更会骗人了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "One of Us"
msgid ""
"With this ability, the Homullus can reach out to a feral's fractured mind and "
"twist it, convincing them to function as an ally."
msgstr ""
"With this ability, the Homullus can reach out to a feral's fractured mind and "
"twist it, convincing them to function as an ally."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Free Will"
msgstr "Free Will"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Free Will"
msgid "The Dollkin has resistance to attacks on its ability to act on it's choices."
msgstr "The Dollkin has resistance to attacks on its ability to act on it's choices."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sense the Toolmakers"
msgstr "Sense the Toolmakers"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sense the Toolmakers"
msgid "Your powers enhance your mundane senses and allow you to detect human beings."
msgstr "Your powers enhance your mundane senses and allow you to detect human beings."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "human_sense"
msgid "You sense a human here."
msgstr "You sense a human here."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sense the Night Hunters"
msgid ""
"This and other abilities native to Dollkin suggest that if vampires did "
"create cities to concentrate their prey, something evolved afterwards to "
"complicate the hunting grounds."
msgstr ""
"This and other abilities native to Dollkin suggest that if vampires did "
"create cities to concentrate their prey, something evolved afterwards to "
"complicate the hunting grounds."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Lost and the Damned"
msgstr "迷失的人，可恶的人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Lost and the Damned"
msgid ""
"The world crawls with the hungry dead and those who may as well be dead while "
"they still live.  This allows the Homullus to call one of the latter to their "
"side."
msgstr ""
"The world crawls with the hungry dead and those who may as well be dead while "
"they still live.  This allows the Homullus to call one of the latter to their "
"side."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Everything Will Be Fine"
msgid ""
"A habit of lying is hard to break, even when, or especially when, talking to "
"oneself.  This trait grants the Homullus a spell that allows them to smooth "
"out any negative moods they experience."
msgstr "人一旦习惯说谎便难以改口，即使是在自言自语的时候。不如说，尤其是在自言自语的时候。这一特性赋予金灵偶一种法术，让他们能够消除任何负面情绪。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "A Face in the Crowd"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to render themselves "
"invisible to humans."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to render themselves "
"invisible to humans."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Average Joe"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to render one of "
"their allies inconspicuous."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to render one of "
"their allies inconspicuous."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dynamo"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to recharge vehicles "
"or power grids."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to recharge vehicles "
"or power grids."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Scholar's Regard"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to focus their mind "
"to increase their learning ability."
msgstr "获得此能力后，金灵偶就能集中注意力以提高学习能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "All Roads Lead to Rome"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to travel along a "
"road to any bastion of civilization they have attuned to."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to travel along a "
"road to any bastion of civilization they have attuned to."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to find a goblin "
"fruit when in the remnants of civilization."
msgstr "获得此能力后，金灵偶就能在文明的遗迹中找到精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "No Trace Yet I Wish"
msgstr "来去无踪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "No Trace Yet I Wish"
msgid ""
"The Homullus gains the ability to stop emitting scent at will.  They can use "
"this to control when scent-tracking creatures will be able to find them."
msgstr "金灵偶获得了随意消除自身气味的能力，他们可以利用这个能力来躲避能追踪气味的生物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "No Trace Yet I Wish (on)"
msgstr "来去无踪（激活）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "No Trace Yet I Wish (on)"
msgid "You don't currently produce scent."
msgstr "你现在没有任何气味。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Backstage"
msgstr "幕后"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Backstage"
msgid ""
"At will, you can recede from the foreground of people's perceptions.  They "
"will still notice you if you make yourself known.  Conversation with actual "
"humans will be harder while this trait is active."
msgstr "从人们的视野中随意消失并不是难事。当然，假如说你做些引人注目的事，他们还是会发现你的。当这一特性被激活时，与真人对话会变得更加困难。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Backstage (on)"
msgstr "幕后（激活）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Backstage (on)"
msgid "You have faded into the background."
msgstr "你已隐于幕后。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cybernetic Integration"
msgstr "义体集成"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cybernetic Integration"
msgid ""
"Your flesh and bones can instinctively shift to allow manually installing "
"cybernetics.  You no longer need external aid to install CBMs."
msgstr "你的血肉和骨骼可以本能地移动，以便手动安装义体。你不再需要外部协助来安装 CBM。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cybernetic Adaptation"
msgstr "义体适应"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cybernetic Adaptation"
msgid ""
"Your leylines have begun adapting to electronic interference.  Halves the "
"mana penalty caused by stored bionic power."
msgstr "你的魔脉已开始适应了电子干扰。储存生化能量引发的魔力上限惩罚减半。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Complete Cybernetic Adaptation"
msgstr "完全控制论适应"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Complete Cybernetic Adaptation"
msgid ""
"Your leylines have fully adapted to electronic interference.  You no longer "
"suffer any mana penalty for stored bionic power."
msgstr "你的魔脉已经适完全应了电子干扰。你的魔力上限再也不会因储存生化能量受到损害了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Internalized Charge"
msgstr "Internalized Charge"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Internalized Charge"
msgid ""
"You are capable of storing power directly in your flesh.  You gain 50 kJ of "
"bionic power storage per Homullus trait you have."
msgstr ""
"You are capable of storing power directly in your flesh.  You gain 50 kJ of "
"bionic power storage per Homullus trait you have."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Reinforced Armor"
msgstr "护甲强化"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Reinforced Armor"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Humans are flimsy creatures compared to even natural animals, yet by crafting "
"armor they obtain durability that unthinking creatures will never reach.  You "
"draw on this legacy, increasing the strength of armor you wear by 20%"
msgstr ""
"Humans are flimsy creatures compared to even natural animals, yet by crafting "
"armor they obtain durability that unthinking creatures will never reach.  You "
"draw on this legacy, increasing the strength of armor you wear by 20%"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fortified Armor"
msgstr "护甲超强化"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fortified Armor"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You embody the tales of ancient knights, increasing the strength of armor you "
"wear by 40%."
msgstr ""
"You embody the tales of ancient knights, increasing the strength of armor you "
"wear by 40%."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Equipment Hardening"
msgstr "装备硬化"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Equipment Hardening"
msgid ""
"You conceptually harden your tools and armor, reducing the chance that they "
"are damaged."
msgstr "你可以从概念上硬化你的工具和盔甲，降低它们受损的概率。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Extreme Equipment Hardening"
msgstr "极致装备硬化"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Extreme Equipment Hardening"
msgid ""
"You conceptually harden your tools and armor, immensely reducing the chance "
"that they are damaged."
msgstr "你可以从概念上硬化你的工具和盔甲，大幅降低它们受损的概率。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Echoes of the Streets"
msgstr "街道的回声"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Echoes of the Streets"
msgid ""
"Though much of humanity has died, their echoes remain in the places they once "
"called home.  The Homullus can draw on those echoes to restore their bionic "
"power."
msgstr "尽管大部分人已经死亡，他们的回声仍然停留在他们称为家的地方。金灵偶可以利用他们的回声以恢复生化能量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Pulse of the Invisible"
msgstr "无形之脉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Pulse of the Invisible"
msgid ""
"Though much of humanity has died, their echoes remain in the places they once "
"called home.  The Homullus can draw on those echoes to restore their bionic "
"power and mana."
msgstr "尽管大部分人已经死亡，他们的回声仍然停留在他们称为家的地方。金灵偶可以利用他们的回声以恢复生化能量和魔力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "City Strider"
msgstr "城市漫步者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "City Strider"
msgid ""
"You are at home in the artificial environments constructed by humanity.  You "
"move slightly faster within."
msgstr "你自在地生活在人类创造的人工环境中。在其中你的移动稍微变快了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Endurance Hunter"
msgstr "Endurance Hunter"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Endurance Hunter"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Early humans chased prey for miles before it dropped dead from exhaustion, "
"and the Homullus is heir to that legacy.  You have 33% more stamina."
msgstr ""
"Early humans chased prey for miles before it dropped dead from exhaustion, "
"and the Homullus is heir to that legacy.  You have 33% more stamina."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Take the Line"
msgstr "统一战线"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Take the Line"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By standing together, humanity was able to overcome all threats, and it was "
"only when they turned on each other that the Cataclysm grew out of control.  "
"The Homullus regains Stamina 5% faster per ally within 30 meters (10% faster "
"per ally if they have the Homullus trait)."
msgstr ""
"通过团结一致，人类得以战胜所有威胁，而一旦自相残杀，大灾变才会蔓延失控。在30米范围内，每存在一名盟友，金灵偶便会获得5%"
"的耐力恢复速度提升（如果盟友同样拥有金灵偶特性的话则提升10%）。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Top of the Food Chain"
msgstr "The Top of the Food Chain"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Top of the Food Chain"
msgid ""
"Humanity are omnivores in the most literal sense.  You can eat anything not "
"human without any moral qualms.  However, the food that pre-Cataclysm "
"humanity would slowly poison themselves with is anathema to you, and you will "
"eat only good-tasting food unless you are starving."
msgstr ""
"Humanity are omnivores in the most literal sense.  You can eat anything not "
"human without any moral qualms.  However, the food that pre-Cataclysm "
"humanity would slowly poison themselves with is anathema to you, and you will "
"eat only good-tasting food unless you are starving."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "At Home in any Clime"
msgstr "At Home in any Clime"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "At Home in any Clime"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm there were cities all across the world.  From above the "
"Arctic Circle to directly on the equator, humanity built their dwellings.  "
"You are more comfortable with temperature extremes."
msgstr ""
"Before the Cataclysm there were cities all across the world.  From above the "
"Arctic Circle to directly on the equator, humanity built their dwellings.  "
"You are more comfortable with temperature extremes."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Tool-Maker"
msgstr "工具制造者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Tool-Maker"
msgid ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed is "
"increased."
msgstr ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed is "
"increased."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Innovator"
msgstr "创新者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Innovator"
msgid ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed and "
"ability are increased."
msgstr ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed and "
"ability are increased."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Builder of Cities"
msgstr "城市建造者"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Builder of Cities"
msgid ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed and "
"ability are greatly increased."
msgstr ""
"Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the "
"world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed and "
"ability are greatly increased."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Essence of the Makers"
msgstr "制造者的精萃"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Essence of the Makers"
msgid ""
"With their tools, humanity built weapons, grew food, made homes, and tamed "
"the wilderness.  The Homullus has internalized that essence into themselves, "
"allowing them to use their bare hands to accomplish many tasks that would "
"otherwise require tools."
msgstr "通过工具，人类制造了武器，培育食物，建造房屋，并征服了荒野。金灵偶将这种精萃内化进自身，允许它们空手完成许多本来其他人使用工具才能完成的任务。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Net Spider's Touch"
msgstr "网蛛之触"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Net Spider's Touch"
msgid ""
"While some other animals use simple tools, complex machinery is humanity's "
"legacy alone.  The Homullus can log into a computer or hack electronics with "
"but a touch."
msgstr "当某些动物仅能使用简单的工具时，人类早已留下了独属于自己的复杂机械。金灵偶可以一触之间登入电脑或者骇入电子设备。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mimicry of Biology"
msgstr "生物擬態"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mimicry of Biology"
msgid ""
"As a spirit of humanity, you lack the natural biology required for mutagens "
"to function.  However, your powers have grown far enough to allow you to use "
"even the most abstract of human tools, allowing you to consume mutagens to "
"change your body.  Unlike humans, however, there are thresholds you will "
"never be able to reach, and should you choose this route, further development "
"of your native spirit powers will be closed off to you."
msgstr ""
"As a spirit of humanity, you lack the natural biology required for mutagens "
"to function.  However, your powers have grown far enough to allow you to use "
"even the most abstract of human tools, allowing you to consume mutagens to "
"change your body.  Unlike humans, however, there are thresholds you will "
"never be able to reach, and should you choose this route, further development "
"of your native spirit powers will be closed off to you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Homullus Biology"
msgstr "金灵偶生物学"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Homullus No Doll Mutations"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Homullus No Doll Mutations"
msgid ""
"You have chosen the path of human mutation and further Homullus mutation is "
"closed off to you.  You should not see this in-game."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Running to Marathon"
msgstr "Running to Marathon"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Running to Marathon"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Early humans chased prey for miles before it dropped dead from exhaustion, "
"and the Homullus is heir to that legacy.  You have 33% more stamina and you "
"can run for much longer before tiring."
msgstr ""
"Early humans chased prey for miles before it dropped dead from exhaustion, "
"and the Homullus is heir to that legacy.  You have 33% more stamina and you "
"can run for much longer before tiring."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Death Is But A Door"
msgstr "死亡不过是一扇门"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Death Is But A Door"
msgid ""
"One person may die, but their compatriots will carry their torch.  You too "
"will have your legacy maintained if you die, but in a way far less "
"metaphorical.  When you die, you will reincarnate within any nearby human, "
"immediately shifting their form to match your own.  You will not be able to "
"do this more than once per month."
msgstr ""
"人可能会死，但他们的同胞会保留他们的火种。你也不例外，会在死后保留你的遗产，但以一种远没有如此隐晦的方式。当你死后，你会转生在附近的任何人身上，不久就会将他"
"们的身体变成符合你自己的形态。每个月你只能使用这个能力不超过一次。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mien of the Mannequin"
msgstr "Mien of the Mannequin"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mien of the Mannequin"
msgid ""
"You may transform yourself into a doll in truth, ignoring the needs of the "
"flesh and making most monsters less likely to attack you.  However, your "
"stiff limbs will inhibit your movement."
msgstr ""
"You may transform yourself into a doll in truth, ignoring the needs of the "
"flesh and making most monsters less likely to attack you.  However, your "
"stiff limbs will inhibit your movement."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mannequin Form"
msgstr "Mannequin Form"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mannequin Form"
msgid ""
"You are a doll in truth.  You do not need to eat or drink, and monsters will "
"mostly ignore you, but you do not heal at all and crafting, as well as "
"movement over any ground not almost-perfectly flat, is very difficult due to "
"your stiff limbs."
msgstr ""
"You are a doll in truth.  You do not need to eat or drink, and monsters will "
"mostly ignore you, but you do not heal at all and crafting, as well as "
"movement over any ground not almost-perfectly flat, is very difficult due to "
"your stiff limbs."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mannequin Form Anger Relations"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mannequin Form Anger Relations"
msgid ""
"Anger relations are here in a separate mutation so that they're removed on "
"attacking a target or moving too quickly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mannequin Form Anger Relations Attacker"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mannequin Form Anger Relations Attacker"
msgid ""
"This blocks you from gaining the anger relations mutation so you can't just "
"turn Mien of the Mannequin on and off between attacks."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/homullus_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_CHARM_FERALS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_SUMMON_FERALS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_SELF_DECEPTION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_INVISIBLE_TO_HUMANS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_REDUCED_VISIBILITY_ALLY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_RESTORE_POWER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_ADD_LEARNING_FOCUS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_ROAD_TRANSLOCATION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_HOMULLUS_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent surrounded by the remnants of civilization has increased your "
"facility with your fae magicks."
msgstr ""
"Your time spent surrounded by the remnants of civilization has increased your "
"facility with your fae magicks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_DETECT_NEARBY_MONSTERS_EARTH_ON"
msgid ""
"You must be in contact with the living earth or underground to activate The "
"Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It"
msgstr ""
"You must be in contact with the living earth or underground to activate The "
"Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid "You must be on living earth or stone to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "你必须处于大地或石头上才能培育精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_IRON_ARMOR_SPELL"
msgid "You must be on living earth or stone to infuse yourself with iron."
msgstr "You must be on living earth or stone to infuse yourself with iron."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_ROOTED_IN_PLACE_activated"
msgid "You must be standing on the living earth to root yourself in place."
msgstr "You must be standing on the living earth to root yourself in place."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_SMASHING_PUNCH_activated"
msgid "You gather yourself for a moment and strike."
msgstr "You gather yourself for a moment and strike."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE_activate"
msgid "You settle down, feeling the ground beneath you, and begin your vigil"
msgstr "You settle down, feeling the ground beneath you, and begin your vigil"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE_activate"
msgid "You must be underground to begin your vigil!"
msgstr "You must be underground to begin your vigil!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE"
msgid "You're feeling refreshed and have no need to begin a vigil."
msgstr "You're feeling refreshed and have no need to begin a vigil."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Verb in activity "ACT_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE"
msgid "watching"
msgstr "watching"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_NO_SLEEP_MEDITATE_TURN"
msgid "You are fully refreshed and end your vigil."
msgstr "You are fully refreshed and end your vigil."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_EARTHEN_SHIELD_SPELL"
msgid "You must be on living earth or stone to create the earthen shield."
msgstr "You must be on living earth or stone to create the earthen shield."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_SINK_INTO_EARTH_activate"
msgid "You must be on living earth or stone to sink into it."
msgstr "You must be on living earth or stone to sink into it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid "The earth parts beneath you and you sink down into the stone."
msgstr "The earth parts beneath you and you sink down into the stone."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Create or Destroy Wall"
msgstr "Create or Destroy Wall"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Create Pit"
msgstr "Create Pit"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Earthen Stairs Up"
msgstr "上行楼梯"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Earthen Stairs Down"
msgstr "下行楼梯"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Smooth Stone"
msgstr "打磨岩石"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Churn Earth for Planting"
msgstr "松土种植"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Turn Earth to Stone"
msgstr "泥土转化岩石"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Turn Stone to Earth"
msgstr "岩石转化泥土"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Turn a dirt or stone floor into a wall or vice versa."
msgstr "把泥土或石头地板变成墙，反之亦然。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Create a pit."
msgstr "Create a pit."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Reshape the dirt or stone into a set of stairs going up."
msgstr "把泥土或石头重塑成上行楼梯。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Reshape the dirt or stone into a set of stairs going down."
msgstr "把泥土或石头重塑成下行楼梯。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Polish and smooth a stone wall into a mirror-like finish."
msgstr "把石墙打磨得光洁如镜。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Create furrows in the earth suitable for planting crops"
msgstr "Create furrows in the earth suitable for planting crops"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Turn dirt and earth into solid rock."
msgstr "把泥土变成坚硬的岩石。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH_SELECTOR"
msgid "Turn solid rock into loose soil or dirt."
msgstr "把坚硬的岩石变成泥土。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_TUNNEL_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
msgid "You must be standing deep underground and on the living earth to translocate."
msgstr "You must be standing deep underground and on the living earth to translocate."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_TUNNEL_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
msgid "You must be deep underground on and on the living earth  to cast this spell."
msgstr "You must be deep underground on and on the living earth  to cast this spell."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_STONE_FORM_ON"
msgid "Your body stiffens as your flesh turns to stone and your joints to earth."
msgstr "Your body stiffens as your flesh turns to stone and your joints to earth."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_stomp_ground_smash_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Earthquake Stomp"
msgstr "震地践踏"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_stomp_ground_smash_spell ( Earthquake Stomp
#. )"
msgid ""
"Stomp on the ground and cause a minor local earthquake, damaging buildings "
"and knocking anyone nearby off their feet."
msgstr "践踏地面，造成小型的局部地震，破坏建筑并击退附近的每一个人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "ierde_stomp_ground_smash_spell ( Earthquake
#. Stomp )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "ierde_create_pits_spell ( Earthen Grasp )"
msgid "the ground shakes!"
msgstr "大地震动了!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "ierde_stomp_ground_smash_spell ( Earthquake Stomp )"
msgid "You stomp the ground and it quakes!"
msgstr "You stomp the ground and it quakes!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_iron_armor_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Invulnerable Iron Skin"
msgstr "Invulnerable Iron Skin"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_iron_armor_spell ( Invulnerable Iron Skin )"
msgid ""
"While on living earth or stone, the Ierde may infuse their body with fae "
"iron, slowing their movement and attacks but rendering them much safer from "
"harm."
msgstr ""
"While on living earth or stone, the Ierde may infuse their body with fae "
"iron, slowing their movement and attacks but rendering them much safer from "
"harm."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "ierde_iron_armor_spell ( Invulnerable Iron Skin )"
msgid "You infuse yourself with the resilience of the earth."
msgstr "You infuse yourself with the resilience of the earth."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_knockback_punch_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mountain-Toppling Punch"
msgstr "崩山之拳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_knockback_punch_spell ( Mountain-Toppling
#. Punch )"
msgid ""
"With the force of a landslide behind it, punch a single target and knock them "
"backwards."
msgstr "崩山之力寄宿其后，拳击一个目标并将其击退。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "ierde_knockback_punch_spell ( Mountain-Toppling Punch
#. )"
msgid "You wide up and deliver a punch with the strength of a rockslide."
msgstr "你抡圆了拳头并打出了具有山崩地裂之力的一拳。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_reveal_earth_map_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Knowing Every Furrow"
msgstr "Knowing Every Furrow"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_reveal_earth_map_spell ( Knowing Every Furrow
#. )"
msgid ""
"Commune with the earth, whispering to it to reveal its secrets to you.  This "
"spell will reveal natural features within a large radius around the Ierde.  "
"The spell must be cast while standing on the living earth."
msgstr ""
"Commune with the earth, whispering to it to reveal its secrets to you.  This "
"spell will reveal natural features within a large radius around the Ierde.  "
"The spell must be cast while standing on the living earth."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_reshape_the_earth_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Reshape the Living Earth"
msgstr "重塑大地"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_reshape_the_earth_spell ( Reshape the Living
#. Earth )"
msgid ""
"You can mold earth like clay, turning it to stone and back, or raising it and "
"lowering it into pits or ramps or walls."
msgstr ""
"You can mold earth like clay, turning it to stone and back, or raising it and "
"lowering it into pits or ramps or walls."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "ierde_reshape_the_earth_spell ( Reshape the Living
#. Earth )"
msgid "The earth moves at your command"
msgstr "The earth moves at your command"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_slow_enemies_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Rigidity of Stone"
msgstr "Rigidity of Stone"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_slow_enemies_spell ( Rigidity of Stone )"
msgid "Infuse your enemies with the rigidity of stone, slowing their movements."
msgstr "Infuse your enemies with the rigidity of stone, slowing their movements."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_buff_armor_allies_spell ( Skin of the
#. Mountains )"
msgid ""
"Infuse the resilience of the earth into one of your allies.  Their skin will "
"repel some of the physical damage they take, and they will be more resistant "
"to losing blood, but they will be slightly slower due to the magicks."
msgstr ""
"Infuse the resilience of the earth into one of your allies.  Their skin will "
"repel some of the physical damage they take, and they will be more resistant "
"to losing blood, but they will be slightly slower due to the magicks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_earthen_shield_spell ( Impenetrable Earthen
#. Shield )"
msgid ""
"While standing on the living earth or stone, infuse your skin with the "
"hardness of bedrock.  You will take no damage at all while the spell is in "
"effect, though repeated blows can wear through the shield until it breaks."
msgstr ""
"While standing on the living earth or stone, infuse your skin with the "
"hardness of bedrock.  You will take no damage at all while the spell is in "
"effect, though repeated blows can wear through the shield until it breaks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_entrap_target_in_stone"
msgid "Lithic Gaol"
msgstr "Lithic Gaol"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_entrap_target_in_stone ( Lithic Gaol )"
msgid ""
"Summon up a series of spikes around a single target, imprisoning them in a "
"cage of stone.  The target must be on earth or stone for the spell to take "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"Summon up a series of spikes around a single target, imprisoning them in a "
"cage of stone.  The target must be on earth or stone for the spell to take "
"effect."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_summon_earth_spirit"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Calling the Children of the Stones"
msgstr "召唤石之子"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_summon_earth_spirit ( Calling the Children of
#. the Stones )"
msgid "A lesser earth elemental is summoned to support you."
msgstr "一个低级的土元素被召唤来支持你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_create_pits_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Earthen Grasp"
msgstr "大地攫抓"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_create_pits_spell ( Earthen Grasp )"
msgid "Open the ground beneath your enemies' feet, dumping them into pits."
msgstr "Open the ground beneath your enemies' feet, dumping them into pits."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ierde_tunnel_translocation_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Traveling the Veins of the Earth"
msgstr "Traveling the Veins of the Earth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_tunnel_translocation_spell ( Traveling the
#. Veins of the Earth )"
msgid ""
"The earth is crisscrossed with fissures, with layers of rock and veins of "
"metal, and deeper, with flows of molten rock.  The Ierde can flow along those "
"paths, traveling deep within the earth to any point they have previously been "
"to."
msgstr ""
"The earth is crisscrossed with fissures, with layers of rock and veins of "
"metal, and deeper, with flows of molten rock.  The Ierde can flow along those "
"paths, traveling deep within the earth to any point they have previously been "
"to."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ierde_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Cultivate Goblin
#. Fruit )"
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the earth, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always "
"at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast on earth or stone."
msgstr "你可以向大地中注入一点精灵魔法，结出精怪果实。 果实的效果多种多样，虽然无法预测，但至少能带来一些益处。 此咒语只能在大地或岩石上施放。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Clay of the Earth"
msgstr "Clay of the Earth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Clay of the Earth"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of manganese stained soil.  Your skin is now a "
"purplish black.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤变成了锰污染土壤的颜色。 你的皮肤现在呈紫黑色。 这对游戏没有影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pebbled Skin"
msgstr "Pebbled Skin"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pebbled Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has toughened and formed pebble-like growths in some places, acting "
"as natural armor.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤已经变硬，并且在某些地方形成了卵石状的生长物，充当天然的盔甲。一定程度上减少了潮湿的影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stone Skin"
msgstr "Stone Skin"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has developed into strong granite-like covering that retains some "
"flexibility and has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural "
"armor.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  "
"Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤已经发展成坚固的花岗岩状覆盖物，保留了一定的灵活性，并且已经覆盖了你身体的大部分，虽然难以被穿透，但它也限制了你的灵活性。极大减少湿身惩罚。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ierde Eyes"
msgstr "山石裔之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ierde Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde's eyes begin reflecting their mood: a "
"pale white streaked with rose when happy; pale green or grey when calm, and "
"pure obsidian black when angry.  Glare no longer impacts them and they are "
"not bothered by light levels when sleeping."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde's eyes begin reflecting their mood: a "
"pale white streaked with rose when happy; pale green or grey when calm, and "
"pure obsidian black when angry.  Glare no longer impacts them and they are "
"not bothered by light levels when sleeping."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ierde Ears"
msgstr "山石裔之耳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ierde Ears"
msgid ""
"The Ierde's ears are longer and pointed, like the peak of a high mountain.  "
"They can hear slightly better and are unphased by loud sounds."
msgstr "山石裔的耳朵又长又尖，像高山的峰顶。他们的听力稍微好一些，对大声的声音不敏感"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fists of Stone"
msgid ""
"The Ierde's stony skin makes their fists hit like hammers.  Though their "
"attacks are slower, the Ierde does more bashing damage with punches and can "
"use their hands to replace some simple tools."
msgstr ""
"The Ierde's stony skin makes their fists hit like hammers.  Though their "
"attacks are slower, the Ierde does more bashing damage with punches and can "
"use their hands to replace some simple tools."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stone-Hardened Panoply"
msgstr "Stone-Hardened Panoply"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone-Hardened Panoply"
msgid ""
"Just as their body is now one with the stone, the Ierde can infuse the "
"strength of the earth into their equipment, rendering it more resilient.  "
"While on natural earth or stone or underground, the Ierde's equipment is "
"twice as difficult to damage."
msgstr ""
"Just as their body is now one with the stone, the Ierde can infuse the "
"strength of the earth into their equipment, rendering it more resilient.  "
"While on natural earth or stone or underground, the Ierde's equipment is "
"twice as difficult to damage."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unsleeping Earth Vigil"
msgstr "Unsleeping Earth Vigil"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unsleeping Earth Vigil"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to, while underground, "
"rest and recover energy as though sleeping.  Activate to begin the vigil."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to, while underground, "
"rest and recover energy as though sleeping.  Activate to begin the vigil."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It"
msgstr "The Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to sense the movements "
"of nearby creatures, as long as they maintains contact with natural earth or "
"stone, or are underground."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to sense the movements "
"of nearby creatures, as long as they maintains contact with natural earth or "
"stone, or are underground."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sense the Smallest Tremor"
msgstr "Sense the Smallest Tremor"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sense the Smallest Tremor"
msgid ""
"The Ierde's ability to sense small movements is heightened to such a degree "
"that with small movements of their fingers, they can sense the exact shape "
"and position of objects nearby.  They can craft in darkness, as long as \"The "
"Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It\" is active."
msgstr ""
"The Ierde's ability to sense small movements is heightened to such a degree "
"that with small movements of their fingers, they can sense the exact shape "
"and position of objects nearby.  They can craft in darkness, as long as \"The "
"Soil Knows Those Who Tread Upon It\" is active."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Avalanche Blow"
msgstr "Avalanche Blow"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Avalanche Blow"
msgid ""
"With a brief moment to stabilize themselves, the Ierde strikes a wall, door, "
"or other terrain feature with the force of a falling boulder, doing many "
"times their normal damage."
msgstr ""
"With a brief moment to stabilize themselves, the Ierde strikes a wall, door, "
"or other terrain feature with the force of a falling boulder, doing many "
"times their normal damage."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthquake Stomp"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to stomp on the ground "
"and cause a minor local earthquake."
msgstr "获得此能力后，山石裔就能践踏地面，造成小型局部地震。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mountain-Toppling Punch"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to strike an enemy with "
"a blow that does extra damage and knocks them backwards."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to strike an enemy with "
"a blow that does extra damage and knocks them backwards."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Knowing Every Furrow"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to learn the terrain "
"layout in a large area around themselves."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to learn the terrain "
"layout in a large area around themselves."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthen Grasp"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to create large pits on "
"diggable ground, dumping their enemies into them."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to create large pits on "
"diggable ground, dumping their enemies into them."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Rigidity of Stone"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde may infuse the rigidity of stone into "
"their enemies, slowing their movements."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde may infuse the rigidity of stone into "
"their enemies, slowing their movements."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Reshape the Living Earth"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde may reshape the earth, raising or "
"lowering earth or stone or turning the one into the other."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde may reshape the earth, raising or "
"lowering earth or stone or turning the one into the other."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Calling the Children of the Stones"
msgid ""
"Allows the Ierde to summon a minor earth elemental to support them in the "
"world for a short time."
msgstr "允许山石裔召唤一只小型土元素，以支持他们现身一小段时间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Invulnerable Iron Skin"
msgid ""
"Stone endures but armor is made of metal.  While standing on natural earth or "
"stone, the Ierde can infuse their skin with metal, slowing their movement and "
"encumbering them but rendering them much harder to damage."
msgstr ""
"Stone endures but armor is made of metal.  While standing on natural earth or "
"stone, the Ierde can infuse their skin with metal, slowing their movement and "
"encumbering them but rendering them much harder to damage."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Impenetrable Earthen Shield"
msgid ""
"While standing on natural earth or stone, the Ierde can summon up an earthen "
"shield to protect themselves.  They will be invulnerable until the shield "
"breaks."
msgstr ""
"While standing on natural earth or stone, the Ierde can summon up an earthen "
"shield to protect themselves.  They will be invulnerable until the shield "
"breaks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Skin of the Mountains"
msgid ""
"When gaining this ability, the Ierde gains the ability to infuse the "
"resilience of the earth into one of their allies."
msgstr ""
"When gaining this ability, the Ierde gains the ability to infuse the "
"resilience of the earth into one of their allies."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ The name is a reference to Chapter 63 of Bleak House by Charles Dickens
msgid "An Iron Taste and an Iron Smell"
msgstr "An Iron Taste and an Iron Smell"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "An Iron Taste and an Iron Smell"
msgid ""
"The Ierde has taken the essence of iron into themselves.  They no longer "
"smell anything like a human, smelling only like a faint whiff of iron if they "
"have any scent at all, and can produce all their iron their body needs "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"The Ierde has taken the essence of iron into themselves.  They no longer "
"smell anything like a human, smelling only like a faint whiff of iron if they "
"have any scent at all, and can produce all their iron their body needs "
"themselves."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Tireless Strength of the Earth"
msgstr "Tireless Strength of the Earth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Tireless Strength of the Earth"
msgid ""
"The Ierde can draw on the boundless strength of the earth, increasing their "
"stamina."
msgstr "山石裔可以利用大地的力量，增加耐力上限。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unceasing Strength of the Earth"
msgstr "Unceasing Strength of the Earth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unceasing Strength of the Earth"
msgid ""
"The Ierde can draw even deeper on the boundless strength of the earth, "
"greatly increasing their stamina."
msgstr "山石裔可以更深入地汲取大地的力量，大幅增加耐力上限。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Inexhaustible Strength of the Earth"
msgstr "Inexhaustible Strength of the Earth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Inexhaustible Strength of the Earth"
msgid ""
"The Ierde can draw from boundless strength of the very depths of the earth, "
"enormously increasing their stamina."
msgstr "山石裔可以从大地的最深处汲取无限的力量，极大地增加耐力上限。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stone Does Not Grow Weary"
msgstr "Stone Does Not Grow Weary"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone Does Not Grow Weary"
#, no-c-format
msgid "When underground or on natural earth, the Ierde recovers Stamina 50% faster."
msgstr "When underground or on natural earth, the Ierde recovers Stamina 50% faster."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Stone Endures"
msgstr "The Stone Endures"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Stone Endures"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When underground or on natural earth, the Ierde recovers Stamina 50% faster "
"and heals 33% faster."
msgstr ""
"When underground or on natural earth, the Ierde recovers Stamina 50% faster "
"and heals 33% faster."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stone Does Not Cry Out"
msgstr "Stone Does Not Cry Out"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone Does Not Cry Out"
msgid "Like the stone, the Ierde suffers little from blows.  All pain is halved."
msgstr "Like the stone, the Ierde suffers little from blows.  All pain is halved."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "In the Earthmother's Embrace"
msgstr "大地母亲的怀抱"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "In the Earthmother's Embrace"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to sink into the living "
"earth, where they will heal faster, they will not need to eat or drink, and "
"sleep will be more restful for them."
msgstr "在获得这种能力后，山石裔获得了沉入大地的能力，在那里他们将更快地康复，他们将不需要进食，睡眠将更加宁静。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sleeping in the Earth"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sleeping in the Earth"
msgid ""
"You are resting in the depths of the earth.  You should never actually see "
"this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blood of the Earth"
msgstr "Blood of the Earth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood of the Earth"
msgid ""
"The Ierde's blood has turned black and grown thick and tar-like.  They will "
"bleed much more slowly."
msgstr "山石裔的血液是浓稠的黑色液体。他们的出血速度会慢得多。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Black Blood of the Earth"
msgstr "Black Blood of the Earth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Black Blood of the Earth"
msgid ""
"The Ierde's blood has turned into a black sludge that barely flows.  They no "
"longer bleed at all."
msgstr "山石裔的血像沥青一样几乎不能流动。他们不会流血。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Mountain Does Not Move"
msgstr "不动如山"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Mountain Does Not Move"
msgid ""
"Though the earth shivers and shakes, the mountain stands tall.  The Ierde is "
"immune to knockback."
msgstr "大地虽然颤抖，山却巍然屹立。山石裔对击退免疫。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Root of the Mountain"
msgid ""
"When standing on the living earth or underground, the Ierde can root "
"themselves in place.  While doing so, they cannot move, but they are immune "
"to being stunned, dazed, or downed, and gain additional armor."
msgstr ""
"When standing on the living earth or underground, the Ierde can root "
"themselves in place.  While doing so, they cannot move, but they are immune "
"to being stunned, dazed, or downed, and gain additional armor."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Durability of the Earth"
msgstr "Durability of the Earth"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Durability of the Earth"
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ierde has some of the toughness of the earth.  +15% hit points."
msgstr "The Ierde has some of the toughness of the earth.  +15% hit points."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Durability of the Stone"
msgstr "Durability of the Stone"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Durability of the Stone"
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ierde has some of the toughness of the stone.  +30% hit points."
msgstr "The Ierde has some of the toughness of the stone.  +30% hit points."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Durability of the Mountain"
msgstr "Durability of the Mountain"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Durability of the Mountain"
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ierde has the toughness of the enduring mountains.  +45% hit points."
msgstr "The Ierde has the toughness of the enduring mountains.  +45% hit points."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit "
"from a earth or stone."
msgstr "获得此能力后，山石裔就能从泥土或石头中种出精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vigor of the Soil"
msgstr "泥土活力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor of the Soil"
msgid "Like the bountiful soil, the Ierde is filled with power.  +3 Strength."
msgstr "就像肥沃的土壤，山石裔充满了力量。+3 力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vigor of the Stone"
msgstr "岩石活力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor of the Stone"
msgid "Like the stone, the Ierde can withstand any punishment.  +5 Strength."
msgstr "就像岩石一般，山石裔可以承受任何刑罚。+5 力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vigor of the Mountain"
msgstr "山之活力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor of the Mountain"
msgid "Like the mountain, the Ierde is unmoved by calamity.  +7 Strength."
msgstr "就像高山一般，山石裔面对灾厄也岿然不动。+7 力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vigor of the Bedrock"
msgstr "基岩活力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vigor of the Bedrock"
msgid ""
"Like the bedrock, the Ierde's might can support the entire world.  +9 "
"Strength."
msgstr "就像基岩一般，山石裔的力量足以支撑整个世界。+9 力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Hills Overlook the Valleys"
msgstr "The Hills Overlook the Valleys"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Hills Overlook the Valleys"
msgid ""
"Like an observer on a mountaintop, the Ierde sees more than most.  +3 "
"Perception."
msgstr ""
"Like an observer on a mountaintop, the Ierde sees more than most.  +3 "
"Perception."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Mountain Is Unflinching"
msgstr "岿然不动"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Mountain Is Unflinching"
msgid ""
"While on living earth or stone or underground, the Ierde is as impassive as "
"the mountains and feels no pain at all."
msgstr ""
"While on living earth or stone or underground, the Ierde is as impassive as "
"the mountains and feels no pain at all."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Stone Does Not Rot"
msgstr "岩石不会腐败"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Stone Does Not Rot"
msgid ""
"The stones do not rot as the trees or humans do, and neither is the Ierde "
"affected by the frailties of the flesh.  They are immune to disease and "
"cannot suffer from parasites."
msgstr "石头不会像树木或人类那样腐败，它们对疾病有免疫力，也不会受到寄生虫的侵害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mind of Iron"
msgstr "铁之心"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mind of Iron"
msgid ""
"The Ierde's mind has the resilience of iron, and they cannot be affected by "
"delusions, hallucinations, or other mental problems."
msgstr "山石裔的意志如铁一般坚韧，他们不会被妄想、幻觉或其他心理问题影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stone Meditations"
msgstr "石之冥想"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stone Meditations"
msgid ""
"The Ierde meditates on the nature of stone and removes themselves from the "
"highs and lows of mortal emotions."
msgstr ""
"The Ierde meditates on the nature of stone and removes themselves from the "
"highs and lows of mortal emotions."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Traveling the Veins of the Earth"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to travel through stone "
"to another underground location they have previously been to."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Ierde gains the ability to travel through stone "
"to another underground location they have previously been to."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of the Solid Earth"
msgstr "坚石形态"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Solid Earth"
msgid ""
"The Ierde may transform into rock and earth.  They become incredibly "
"resilient and nearly immune to some forms of damage, but will be much, much "
"slower."
msgstr "山石裔可以转化为岩石和泥土。他们变得难以置信的坚硬，而且近乎免疫某些形式的伤害，但会变得非常，非常慢。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Earthen Form"
msgstr "Earthen Form"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthen Form"
msgid ""
"You are a mass of stone and earth.  You are incredibly resilient, but you are "
"extremely slow."
msgstr ""
"You are a mass of stone and earth.  You are incredibly resilient, but you are "
"extremely slow."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Body of Adamant"
msgstr "Body of Adamant"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Body of Adamant"
msgid ""
"The Ierde is so infused with the power of stone they are approaching "
"invincibility.  There is a small chance that attacks against them simply "
"rebound off their rocky skin, and their limbs are so resilient that they will "
"never break."
msgstr ""
"The Ierde is so infused with the power of stone they are approaching "
"invincibility.  There is a small chance that attacks against them simply "
"rebound off their rocky skin, and their limbs are so resilient that they will "
"never break."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_STOMP_GROUND_SMASH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_CREATE_PITS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_KNOCKBACK_PUNCH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_IRON_ARMOR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_REVEAL_EARTH_MAP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_RESHAPE_THE_EARTH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_SLOW_ENEMIES"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_ENTRAP_TARGET_IN_STONE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_EARTHEN_SHIELD"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_BUFF_ARMOR_ALLIES"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_SUMMON_EARTH_SPIRIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_TUNNEL_TRANSLOCATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_IERDE_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent surrounded by the living earth has increased your facility "
"with your fae magicks."
msgstr ""
"Your time spent surrounded by the living earth has increased your facility "
"with your fae magicks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PARACLESIAN_FAE_SIGHT_PROCESSING"
msgid "You do not have enough mana to fuel your fae sight!"
msgstr "You do not have enough mana to fuel your fae sight!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SUCCESSFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER_GOSSAMER_RECIPE"
msgid "Your dreams have revealed to you a recipe for gossamer raiment."
msgstr "你的梦向你揭示了一项月之纱服饰的配方。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PARACLESIAN_TURN_COTTON_TO_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"The moonlight permeates the cotton and it begins to shimmer like an opal in "
"the sunlight."
msgstr "月光在棉布中弥漫，然后它开始发出微光，就像日光下的蛋白石一样。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PARACLESIAN_TURN_COTTON_TO_GOSSAMER"
msgid "You must be outdoors under the moonlight to turn cotton into gossamer."
msgstr "你必须在户外的月光下制作月之纱"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_eocs.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_WANTS_TO_TALK"
msgid "You cannot lead this person to talk to you anymore."
msgstr "You cannot lead this person to talk to you anymore."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_FAE_BAN_CUT_TREE"
msgid ""
"You feel a stabbing pain as the tree falls.  One of your own, murdered by "
"your hand."
msgstr "当树倒下时，你感到一阵刺痛。你的族人，被你亲手杀害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_FAE_BAN_LIGHT_FIRE"
msgid ""
"Your heart races as you spark the fire.  A fire, outdoors, in the view of the "
"trees and the grasses.  Visions of charred wood, of blackened trunks and "
"broken branches, fill your mind."
msgstr ""
"Your heart races as you spark the fire.  A fire, outdoors, in the view of the "
"trees and the grasses.  Visions of charred wood, of blackened trunks and "
"broken branches, fill your mind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_FAE_BAN_SLEPT_IN_CITY"
msgid ""
"You awaken with a groggy head, blinking bleary eyes.  Sleeping near the "
"remnants of civilization away from the bounty of nature, your sleep was not "
"as restful as it should have been."
msgstr "你醒来时，头昏昏沉沉的，眼睛模糊地眨着。睡在文明遗迹附近，远离大自然的恩赐，你的睡眠并不像它应该的那样安宁。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_FAE_BAN_DIDNT_SLEEP_UNDERGROUND"
msgid ""
"You awaken in pain, your muscles stiff, your body groaning in protest.  Away "
"from the depths of the living earth, your sleep was not as restful as it "
"should have been."
msgstr "你在痛苦中醒来，你的肌肉僵硬，你的身体呻吟着抗议。离开了生命的大地深处，你的睡眠并没有像它应该的那样安宁。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_IERDE_FAE_BAN_USED_TOOLS_ON_THE_EARTH"
msgid ""
"You feel a stabbing pain as your tools dig into the living earth.  Tools made "
"of material torn from the earth by humans.  You should not be using them."
msgstr "当你的工具钻入有生命的土壤时，你感到一阵刺痛。由人类从地球上挖来的材料制成的工具。你不应该使用它们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_FAE_BAN_KILL_HUMAN"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HOMULLUS_FAE_BAN_KILL_HUMAN_MONSTER"
msgid ""
"You feel a stab of pain as the human collapses in a puddle of their own "
"blood.  A human, slain by your hand, in defiance of your nature."
msgstr "当人类倒在血泊中时，你感到一阵刺痛。一个人类，被你亲手杀害，这违背了你的本性。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HOMULLUS_FAE_BAN_DIDNT_SLEEP_NEAR_HUMANS"
msgid ""
"You awaken with a start as a terrible feeling of crushing loneliness grips "
"you.  You were meant to live in close contact with humans, not wake up to an "
"empty home."
msgstr ""
"You awaken with a start as a terrible feeling of crushing loneliness grips "
"you.  You were meant to live in close contact with humans, not wake up to an "
"empty home."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_FAE_BAN_GET_WET"
msgid ""
"Accursed water!  The touch of it burns you like acid, reminding you of your "
"nature.  Your flames must not be dowsed."
msgstr "该死的水!它的触感像酸一样提醒着你的本性。你的火焰不能熄灭。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_FAE_BAN_DIDNT_SLEEP_OUTSIDE"
msgid ""
"You gasp as you awaken, the still air barely moving into your lungs.  You "
"long for the blowing winds."
msgstr "当你醒来时，你喘着气，静止的空气几乎没有进入你的肺部。你渴望风的吹拂。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SYLPH_FAE_BAN_TOO_LONG_UNDERGROUND_APPLY_PENALTY"
msgid ""
"The walls seem like they're closing in on you.  You were born to fly free, to "
"dance on the winds, not to cower underground like a worm.  You have to get "
"out to the open sky."
msgstr "你生来就是为了自由飞翔，在风中起舞，而不是像条蠕虫一样蜷缩在地下。你必须到开阔的天空去。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_fae_bans.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_FAE_BAN_SLEEP_ON_LAND"
msgid ""
"You gasp as you awaken, thin air barely filling your lungs as you struggle to "
"breath.  You long for the soothing embrace of the waters."
msgstr "当你醒来时，你喘不过气来，稀薄的空气勉强填满你的肺，你挣扎着呼吸。你渴望水抚慰的怀抱。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cloud_of_steam_sylph"
#. ~ Name of spell "cloud_of_steam_undine"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cloud of Steam"
msgstr "蒸汽之云"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cloud_of_steam_sylph ( Cloud of Steam )"
#. ~ Description of spell "cloud_of_steam_undine ( Cloud of Steam )"
msgid "You bring forth a cloud of boiling water."
msgstr "你带来一团沸腾的水汽。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "paraclesian_spell_dodge_bonus_arvore"
#. ~ Name of spell "paraclesian_spell_dodge_bonus_sylph"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "paraclesian_spell_dodge_bonus"
msgid "The Wind Blows, the Willow Bends"
msgstr "风在吹拂,柳条弯弯"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "paraclesian_spell_dodge_bonus_arvore ( The Wind
#. Blows, the Willow Bends )"
msgid ""
"Like the flitting wind or the flexible willow, the spell allows you to avoid "
"attacks much more easily.  It has <color_yellow>reduced effects</color> when "
"on artificial terrain."
msgstr ""
"Like the flitting wind or the flexible willow, the spell allows you to avoid "
"attacks much more easily.  It has <color_yellow>reduced effects</color> when "
"on artificial terrain."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "paraclesian_spell_dodge_bonus_sylph ( The Wind
#. Blows, the Willow Bends )"
msgid ""
"Like the flitting wind or the flexible willow, the spell allows you to avoid "
"attacks much more easily.  It has <color_yellow>reduced effects</color> "
"indoors."
msgstr ""
"Like the flitting wind or the flexible willow, the spell allows you to avoid "
"attacks much more easily.  It has <color_yellow>reduced effects</color> "
"indoors."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "paraclesian_spell_make_gossamer"
#. ~ Name of spell "paraclesian_spell_make_gossamer_real"
msgid "Weave Gossamer"
msgstr "编织月之纱"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "paraclesian_spell_make_gossamer ( Weave Gossamer )"
#. ~ Description of spell "paraclesian_spell_make_gossamer_real ( Weave
#. Gossamer )"
msgid "Under the light of the moon, you can weave cotton into gossamer."
msgstr "在月光下，你可以把棉花织成薄纱。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "homullus_spell_wish_to_converse"
msgid "Wish to Converse"
msgstr "Wish to Converse"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "homullus_spell_wish_to_converse ( Wish to Converse
#. )"
msgid ""
"When this spell is cast, the target will somehow begin to care about you very "
"much and can't not help but talk to."
msgstr ""
"When this spell is cast, the target will somehow begin to care about you very "
"much and can't not help but talk to."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_wants_to_talk"
msgid "Seeming to want to talk to you"
msgstr "Seeming to want to talk to you"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Seeming to want to talk to you"
msgid "This person wants to talk with you."
msgstr "This person wants to talk with you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Born of the Earth"
msgstr "生于大地"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of the Earth"
msgid "A spirit of earth and stone."
msgstr "土石之灵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Root and Branch"
msgstr "根与枝"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Root and Branch"
msgid "A spirit of leaf and bark."
msgstr "森之灵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Touched by Fire"
msgstr "触之以火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Touched by Fire"
msgid "A spirit of fire."
msgstr "火之灵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Rain and Wave"
msgstr "雨和浪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Rain and Wave"
msgid "You are born of the deep waters."
msgstr "你诞生于深海。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Child of Dolls"
msgstr "玩偶之子"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Child of Dolls"
msgid "A spirit of the image of humans given life."
msgstr "人型之灵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Born of the Air"
msgstr "生于天空"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of the Air"
msgid "A spirit of air and wind."
msgstr "气与风之灵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Prowess"
msgstr "Fae Prowess"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Prowess"
msgid ""
"You have gained a portion of the might of your fae ancestors.  +1 Strength "
"and Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"You have gained a portion of the might of your fae ancestors.  +1 Strength "
"and Dexterity."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Puissance"
msgstr "Fae Puissance"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Puissance"
msgid "You have gained the might of your fae ancestors.  +2 Strength and Dexterity."
msgstr "You have gained the might of your fae ancestors.  +2 Strength and Dexterity."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Discernment"
msgstr "妖精洞察力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Discernment"
msgid ""
"You have gained a portion of the wits of your fae ancestors.  +1 Intelligence "
"and Perception."
msgstr "你获得了妖精先祖的一部分智慧。+1智力与感知。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Acumen"
msgstr "Fae Acumen"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Acumen"
msgid ""
"You have gained the wits of your fae ancestors.  +2 Intelligence and "
"Perception."
msgstr ""
"You have gained the wits of your fae ancestors.  +2 Intelligence and "
"Perception."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fae Sight"
msgstr "妖精视觉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fae Sight"
msgid ""
"You can sense other nearby creatures from the Bright Lands.  Activate to "
"enable your fae senses.  It has a small chance to cost some of your mana each "
"turn it is in use."
msgstr "你可以感知到附近来自光明之地的其他生物。激活以开启你的妖精感官。每回合都会有小概率消耗你的部分魔力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wyrd Sight"
msgid ""
"You can sense other nearby creatures from the Bright Lands.  Activate to "
"enable your fae senses."
msgstr ""
"You can sense other nearby creatures from the Bright Lands.  Activate to "
"enable your fae senses."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloud of Steam"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create a cloud of "
"damaging steam."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够制造一团具有破坏力的蒸汽。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cloud of Steam"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to create a cloud of "
"damaging steam."
msgstr "获得此技能后，水仙子可以制造破坏性蒸汽云。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Create Light"
msgstr "创造光芒"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Create Light"
msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create light."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够创造光线。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Create Light"
msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to create light."
msgstr "获得这种能力后火蜥蜴能够创造光。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Born of the Elements"
msgstr "生于元素"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of the Elements"
msgid "Your connection to this world is deep and rewards you with additional mana."
msgstr "你与这个世界的联系很深，并能获得额外的魔力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Change with the Seasons"
msgstr "随着季节而变化"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Walking Ley Line"
msgstr "行走的灵脉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Wind Blows, the Willow Bends"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability, you gain the ability to enhance your dodge "
"capabilities."
msgstr "获得此能力后，你将获得增强闪避的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gossamer Artisan"
msgstr "月之纱技艺"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gossamer Artisan"
msgid ""
"Like your fae ancestors, you can turn gossamer into clothing and armor.  "
"Activate this trait to learn a gossamer recipe (once per week)."
msgstr "和你的异种祖先一样，你可以将月之纱变成衣服和盔甲。 激活此特性可学习一个月之纱配方（每周一次）。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gossamerwright"
msgstr "月之纱制作"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gossamerwright"
msgid ""
"Your manipulation of gossamer has advanced to the point where you can make it "
"yourself out of mundane cotton and moonlight."
msgstr "你对薄纱的操控已经发展到可以用普通的棉和月光自己制作的地步。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Desire for Conversation"
msgstr "Desire for Conversation"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Desire for Conversation"
msgid ""
"The Dollkin casts this spell to force a conversation with anyone, once.  If "
"they've heard the Dollkin out and decided they wish not to speak again it "
"will not work."
msgstr ""
"The Dollkin casts this spell to force a conversation with anyone, once.  If "
"they've heard the Dollkin out and decided they wish not to speak again it "
"will not work."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "FINAL DISCUSSION"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "FINAL DISCUSSION"
msgid "This person won't speak with them again if this goes poorly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid "You pull a goblin fruit from the flames."
msgstr "You pull a goblin fruit from the flames."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid "You must have a nearby source of flames or heat to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "You must have a nearby source of flames or heat to call forth a goblin fruit."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_FIRE_FLY"
msgid "You must be standing in flames to cast Burning Ascension."
msgstr "你必须站在火焰里才能施法燃烧升华。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_WATER_TO_BOOZE"
msgid ""
"From the fiery depths of your spirit, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"water into strong alcohol fills your mind."
msgstr ""
"From the fiery depths of your spirit, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"water into strong alcohol fills your mind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_WATER_TO_FUEL"
msgid ""
"From the fiery depths of your spirit, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"water into lamp oil fills your mind."
msgstr ""
"From the fiery depths of your spirit, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"water into lamp oil fills your mind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES_COOLDOWN" in nested EOCs in false effect
#. in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_REBORN_IN_FLAMES"
msgid ""
"As your body takes its final wound, your fae spirit drinks in the heat of the "
"flames and your flesh is renewed."
msgstr "当你的身体受到最后的创伤时，你的异种灵魂会吸收火焰的热量，你的肉体也会焕然一新。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GRANT_COOKING_HEAT"
msgid "Your hands grow warm."
msgstr "你的手变得温暖起来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_GRANT_COOKING_HEAT"
msgid "The heat from your hands fades away."
msgstr "你手中的热量消散了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_HEALTH_FOR_MANA"
msgid "You have no need to restore your mana now!"
msgstr "你现在没有必要恢复你的魔力！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND"
msgid "You must be in warm air to ascend!"
msgstr "你必须在温暖的空气中才能上升！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND_OUTSIDE_CHECK"
msgid "You soar upward on the rising smoke."
msgstr "You soar upward on the rising smoke."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_FORM_ASCEND_OUTSIDE_CHECK"
msgid "The ceiling above blocks your attempt to rise!"
msgstr "上方的天花板阻挡了你上升的企图！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SALAMANDER_BERSERK_STANCE_ON"
msgid "You are already under the effects of Wildfire Soul!"
msgstr "你已经处于野火灵魂的状态了！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_make_fire"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Enkindle"
msgstr "点燃"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_make_fire ( Enkindle )"
msgid ""
"Born from fire, it is easy for a Salamander to bring forth that fire and set "
"something alight."
msgstr "生于火焰，火蜥蜴能轻易操纵火焰点燃某物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_flame_punch_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blazing Blow"
msgstr "烈焰打击"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_flame_punch_spell ( Blazing Blow )"
msgid ""
"Wreathe your fist in flames and punch a single target, causing fire damage "
"and knocking them backward."
msgstr "用火焰包裹你的拳头击打单个目标，造成火焰伤害并将其击退。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_flaming_whip_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "A Hundred Tongues of Flame"
msgstr "火焰百舌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_flaming_whip_spell ( A Hundred Tongues
#. of Flame )"
msgid "Summon a flaming whip to scourge your enemies."
msgstr "召唤一条熊熊燃烧的鞭子来鞭笞你的敌人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_smoke_teleport_spell"
msgid "In a Cloud of Smoke"
msgstr "烟云缭绕"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_smoke_teleport_spell ( In a Cloud of
#. Smoke )"
msgid ""
"Like fire leaping over a firebreak, you can vanish and reappear somewhere "
"nearby, leaving a thick cloud of smoke in your former location."
msgstr "就像火焰能跳过防火带一样，你可以消失然后重新出现在附近的某个地方，在原来的位置留下一团浓烟。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_cure_conditions"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Away Your Impurities"
msgstr "烧尽杂秽"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_cure_conditions ( Burning Away Your
#. Impurities )"
msgid ""
"As fire burns dead wood, you can burn away poison or sickness in your target. "
" However, just as fire is dangerous to touch, it damages the target as well."
msgstr "如火一样烧过枯木，你可以烧掉目标身上的毒药或疾病。然而，如接触火一样危险，它也会伤害目标。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_fire_dot_spell"
msgid "The Fire in the Marrow"
msgstr "骨髓之火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_fire_dot_spell ( The Fire in the Marrow
#. )"
msgid ""
"Kindle a flame within the target, slowly burning them from the inside.  This "
"spell does damage only slowly, but there is little defense against being "
"burned from the inside out."
msgstr "点燃目标内部的火焰，从内部慢慢燃烧。这个法术只会缓慢造成伤害，但由内到外的烧伤几乎无法被防御。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_increase_speed_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fanning the Spark"
msgstr "煽动火花"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_increase_speed_spell ( Fanning the Spark
#. )"
msgid "You can infuse yourself or an ally with the blazing speed of fire."
msgstr "你可以为自己或一名同伴注入炽热火焰般的速度。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_emit_heat"
msgid "Stoking the Inner Furnace"
msgstr "内炉添火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_emit_heat ( Stoking the Inner Furnace )"
msgid "Like a bonfire, you can throw off large quantities of heat."
msgstr "就像篝火一样，你可以散发出巨多热量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_summon_fire_spirit"
msgid "Calling the Children of the Inferno"
msgstr "召唤地狱之子"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_summon_fire_spirit ( Calling the
#. Children of the Inferno )"
msgid "A lesser fire spirit is summoned to support you."
msgstr "召唤一个小火灵来支持你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_summon_firebird_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Flame of the Firebird"
msgstr "Flame of the Firebird"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_summon_firebird_spell ( Flame of the
#. Firebird )"
msgid ""
"Summon a delicate bird made of pure flame.  The bird will last only a few "
"moments, but if it sees an enemy it will eagerly dive upon them and erupt "
"into a fireball."
msgstr "召唤一只由纯净火焰构成精致魔法鸟。这只鸟只能持续几分钟，但只要它发现敌人，就会急切地扑过去，爆炸为一团火球。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_ash_breath_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Exhalation of Ashes"
msgstr "Exhalation of Ashes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_ash_breath_spell ( Exhalation of Ashes
#. )"
msgid ""
"You can breathe out a cloud of thick smoke, concealing your presence or "
"causing humans to choke."
msgstr ""
"You can breathe out a cloud of thick smoke, concealing your presence or "
"causing humans to choke."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_fire_breath"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breath of the Firedragon"
msgstr "火龙吐息"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_fire_breath ( Breath of the Firedragon
#. )"
msgid "Like the legendary dragon, you can spray fire in a cone in front of you."
msgstr "就像传说中的龙一样，你可以往面前的锥形区域喷射火焰。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_dash_boom_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fiery Charge"
msgstr "炽热冲锋"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_dash_boom_spell ( Fiery Charge )"
msgid ""
"Hurl yourself forward in a burst of speed, causing an explosion at your "
"arrive point."
msgstr "把你自己以极快的速度向掷出，在目标点引发爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_explosion_trap_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sigil of Detonation"
msgstr "爆炸印记"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_explosion_trap_spell ( Sigil of
#. Detonation )"
msgid "Place a magical rune on a the ground that will explode when stepped on."
msgstr "在地上放置一个魔法符文，当被踩踏时会引发爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Cultivate
#. Goblin Fruit )"
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magick into the flames, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always "
"at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast outdoors in "
"natural surroundings."
msgstr "你可以向火焰中注入一点精灵魔法，结出精怪果实。 果实的效果多种多样，虽然无法预测，但至少能带来一些益处。 此咒语只能在户外自然环境中施放。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_fire_fly"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Ascension"
msgstr "燃烧升华"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_fire_fly ( Burning Ascension )"
msgid ""
"Like the rising heat of fire, you can ascend into the air and walk with the "
"smoke for a short time before falling safely back to the earth."
msgstr "就像火焰升腾的热量一样，你可以升到空中，与烟雾同行一小会儿，然后安全地落回地面。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_ally_flame_immune_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Anointed with Incandescence"
msgstr "炽热创伤的敷愈"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_ally_flame_immune_spell ( Anointed with
#. Incandescence )"
msgid ""
"You draw on your own fiery nature and infuse a portion of it into an ally, "
"rendering them immune to warm temperatures and fire."
msgstr "你利用自己炽热如火的天性，将其中的一部分注入盟友，使他们对高温和火焰免疫。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "salamander_explosion_and_heal_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Phoenix's Last Cry"
msgstr "The Phoenix's Last Cry"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "salamander_explosion_and_heal_spell ( The Phoenix's
#. Last Cry )"
msgid ""
"Like the rebirth of the legendary phoenix, you explode into flames, causing "
"fire to engulf the entire nearby area.  You will heal faster for six hours "
"after casting this spell."
msgstr ""
"Like the rebirth of the legendary phoenix, you explode into flames, causing "
"fire to engulf the entire nearby area.  You will heal faster for six hours "
"after casting this spell."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Salamander Skin"
msgstr "火蜥蜴皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of an autumnal bonfire.  Your skin is now an "
"orange red with dark freckles.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤变成了秋天篝火的颜色。 你的皮肤现在是橙红色，并带有深色雀斑。这对游戏没有影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Coals Skin"
msgstr "烧炭皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Coals Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has magickal flames flaring out of it on occasion.  You can operate "
"in warmer climates than normal humans but begin to take damage from getting "
"wet, and you always smell of smoke and ashes."
msgstr "你的皮肤会适时迸发出魔法火焰。相比普通人你可以在比更温暖的气候下活动，但一旦被淋湿就会受到伤害，而且你身上总是有烟味和灰味。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Flame Skin"
msgstr "火焰皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Enkindle"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to set something "
"nearby on fire."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够能点燃附近物体。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fiery Charge"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to rush forward "
"and cause an explosion at the place they land."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够向前冲刺并在他们着陆的地方引发爆炸。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sigil of Detonation"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to lay a fiery "
"trap which will burst into searing flames when stepped on."
msgstr "火蜥蜴在获取此能力后能够在地上设置火焰陷阱，当被踩踏时，陷阱会引爆成一团烈焰。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "In a Puff of Smoke"
msgstr "烟风缭绕"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "In a Puff of Smoke"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to vanish in a "
"burst of smoke and reappear somewhere nearby."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够在一阵烟雾中消失然后重新出现在附近的某个地方。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blazing Blow"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to punch a target "
"with a fiery fist, causing damage and hurling them back."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够用燃烧的拳头击打目标，造成伤害并将其击退。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Summon Fire Spirit"
msgstr "召唤火之灵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Summon Fire Spirit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a fire "
"spirit."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够召唤一只火之灵。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Exhalation of Ashes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to breathe out a "
"cloud of thick smoke."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to breathe out a "
"cloud of thick smoke."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breath of the Firedragon"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to breathe a cone "
"of flames."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够喷出锥形火焰。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Flame of the Firebird"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a bird "
"made of roaring flames to their aid."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a bird "
"made of roaring flames to their aid."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fanning the Spark"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to increase their "
"own or an ally's speed."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够提高他们自己或一名同伴的速度。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "A Hundred Tongues of Flame"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to summon a "
"flaming whip to aid them in battle."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够召唤燃烧的鞭子来协助他们战斗。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stoking the Inner Fire"
msgstr "内在添火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stoking the Inner Fire"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to emit large "
"quantities of heat."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够散发巨多热量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Away Your Impurities"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to cure "
"deleterious conditions at the cost of damage."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴能够以伤害为代价治愈有害状态。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to pluck a goblin "
"fruit from the flames."
msgstr "在获得这个技能后，火蜥蜴就会获得从火焰中采摘精怪果实的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning Water"
msgstr "燃烧之水"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Water"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander learns how to convert water into "
"very strong alcohol."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴学会了如何将水转化为烈酒。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fire From Water"
msgstr "水中之火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fire From Water"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander learn how to convert water directly "
"into fuel.  This is an intensely draining activity."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴学会了如何将水直接转化为燃料。这是一项消耗大量体力的活动。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Salamander Eyes"
msgstr "火蜥蜴之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander's eyes begin reflecting their mood, "
"with warm yellows and deep reds when happy and blazing oranges, blues, and "
"whites when angry.  Glare no longer impacts them and they can always see "
"exactly what temperature it is."
msgstr ""
"获得此能力后火蜥蜴的眼睛开始反映他们的情绪，高兴时会呈现温暖的黄色和深红色，生气时会呈现耀眼的橙色、蓝色和白色。眩目不再能影响他们，他们还总能准确地看出温度"
"。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Heat Sight"
msgstr "热能视觉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Sight"
msgid ""
"With their new eyes, the Salamander can see heat and pick out others in "
"darkness."
msgstr "通过它们崭新的眼睛，火蜥蜴可以看见热量，并在黑暗中辨别出别人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Reading the Heartfires"
msgstr "解读心火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Reading the Heartfires"
msgid ""
"The Salamander's ability to see heat has sharpened greatly, and they can pick "
"out subtle change in a person's skin caused by blood flow.  This makes "
"persuasion and lying easier."
msgstr "火蜥蜴看见热量的能力大幅增强，因此他们可以发现人体皮肤因血液流动发生的微小变化，使得说服和撒谎更加容易。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Salamander Ears"
msgstr "火蜥蜴之耳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Salamander Ears"
msgid ""
"The Salamander's ears narrow to a point, like tongues of leaping flame.  "
"While distinctive, this has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "火蜥蜴的耳朵逐渐变窄缩小到一个点，就像跳跃的火舌。 虽然说这与众不同，但对游戏没有什么影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Heat Quickens the Blood"
msgstr "活血之热"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Quickens the Blood"
msgid ""
"The Salamander gains strength from heat and becomes faster in hot weather.  "
"However, cold weather produces a corresponding slowing effect."
msgstr "火蜥蜴从热量中获得力量，在炎热天气里会变得更快。然而，相应地，寒冷会使其减速。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Heat Fuels the Flames"
msgstr "燃火之热"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Heat Fuels the Flames"
msgid ""
"The Salamander gains strength from heat and becomes faster and heals much "
"quicker in hot weather.  However, cold weather produces a corresponding "
"slowing effect."
msgstr "火蜥蜴从热量中获得力量，在炎热天气里会变得更快，也会大幅提升恢复速度。然而，相应地，寒冷会使其减速。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Incandescent Artisan's Alacrity"
msgstr "白热工匠的敏捷"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Incandescent Artisan's Alacrity"
msgid ""
"As fae spirits of fire, Salamanders also partake of the heat of the forge and "
"the glow of white-hot iron.  Your crafting speed will increase while standing "
"in fire or hot air."
msgstr "作为火之精灵，火蜥蜴也会分享锻炉的热量和白热铁的光芒。站在火或热空气中时，你的制作速度会提高。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Searing Footsteps"
msgstr "灼热步伐"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Searing Footsteps"
msgid ""
"The Salamander can enhance their inner fire to the point where they leave "
"fiery footprints everywhere they travel.  Activate this trait to leave a "
"trail of fire in your wake at the cost of mana for every footstep."
msgstr "火蜥蜴可以增强它们的内驱之火，以至于它们在旅行的任何地方都会留下炽热的足迹。激活此特性，以每一步消耗法力值为代价，在你身后留下一道火焰痕迹。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Within the Firelight"
msgstr "无处不在的火光"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Within the Firelight"
msgid ""
"As a distant fire reveals that which is nearby, the Salamander can see what "
"surrounds their kin.  The Salamander may see through the eyes of any "
"creatures they summon."
msgstr "就像远处的火光会照亮其附近的环境一样，火蜥蜴也能看到自己同类周围的事物。 火蜥蜴可以通过它们召唤的任何生物的眼睛来观察。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Adding Wood to the Campfire"
msgstr "施木于火的放纵"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Adding Wood to the Campfire"
msgid ""
"Fires require fuel, and so does the Salamander.  This trait allows them to "
"eat twice as much at once."
msgstr "火需要燃料，火蜥蜴也是如此。 这一特性让它们一次能吃两倍的食物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fueling the Hungry Oven"
msgstr "添油在炉的饥饿"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fueling the Hungry Oven"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like a coal furnace, the Salamander devours food to keep functioning.  They "
"may eat three times as much at once and eat food 50% faster."
msgstr "火蜥蜴就像一个煤炉，靠吞食食物来维持运转。 它们一次可以吃三倍的食物，吃东西的速度也快 50%。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Burning New Wood"
msgstr "熊熊燃烧的新木"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning New Wood"
msgid ""
"In times of extreme need, the Salamander can fuel their powers with their own "
"body.  Activate this to restore mana at the cost of health."
msgstr ""
"In times of extreme need, the Salamander can fuel their powers with their own "
"body.  Activate this to restore mana at the cost of health."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Campfire Stands Watch"
msgstr "伫立篝火的守望"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Campfire Stands Watch"
msgid ""
"The Salamander needs less sleep than a human.  However, they will also need "
"to eat slightly more."
msgstr "火蜥蜴需要的睡眠比人类少。 不过，它们也需要稍微多吃一点。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Bonfire Blazes Until the Revelers Have Gone"
msgstr "篝火熊熊，直到狂欢者离去"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Bonfire Blazes Until the Revelers Have Gone"
msgid ""
"The Salamander needs much less sleep than a human.  However, they will also "
"need to eat significantly more."
msgstr "火蜥蜴需要的睡眠比人类少得多。 不过，它们也需要吃得更多。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Watchfire Burns Throughout the Night"
msgstr "守望彻夜的燃烧"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Watchfire Burns Throughout the Night"
msgid ""
"Like a blazing signal fire, a Salamander never stops shining.  They never "
"need to sleep if they do not want to, and when they do, they need much less "
"sleep than normal.  However, they require twice as much food as a human."
msgstr ""
"火蜥蜴就像熊熊燃烧的烽火，永不停息地发光发热。 如果它们不想睡觉，就永远不需要睡觉，即使要睡觉，它们需要的睡眠时间也比常人少得多。 "
"然而，它们需要的食物却是人类的两倍。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Inner Fire Cannot Be Quenched"
msgstr "不灭内火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Inner Fire Cannot Be Quenched"
msgid ""
"Accursed water.  Its touch dampens your flames, and you will no longer have "
"anything to do with it.  You do not need to drink."
msgstr "该死的水。和它的接触会熄灭你的火焰。你将不会再与它有任何关系。你不再需要饮水。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breathing in Cinders"
msgstr "Breathing in Cinders"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathing in Cinders"
msgid ""
"Smoke is the breath of fire and a Salamander is born of flames.  You suffer "
"no negative effects from smoke inhalation."
msgstr ""
"Smoke is the breath of fire and a Salamander is born of flames.  You suffer "
"no negative effects from smoke inhalation."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Strength of the Crackling Fire"
msgstr "爆燃火焰的力量"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Strength of the Crackling Fire"
msgid "Like a fire fueled with fresh wood, you have increased strength.  +1 Strength."
msgstr "就像用新鲜木柴点燃的火，你的力量得到了增强。+1力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Strength of the Blazing Bonfire"
msgstr "熊燃篝火的力量"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Strength of the Blazing Bonfire"
msgid ""
"Like the bonfire that will burn through the night, you have greatly increased "
"strength.  +3 Strength."
msgstr "就像篝火将在黑夜中燃烧，你的力量也将大大增强。+3力量。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fiery Speed"
msgstr "如火始燃的速度"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fiery Speed"
msgid "Like a fire sparks kindling in flame, you have increased speed.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "就像火种点燃火焰一样，你的速度也会增加。+2敏捷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Blazing Speed"
msgstr "大火蔓延的速度"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Blazing Speed"
msgid ""
"Like a forest fire moving faster than a running horse, you have greatly "
"increased speed.  +5 Dexterity."
msgstr "就像比奔马跑得还快的森林大火一样，你的速度也会大大提高。+2敏捷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Outracing the Prairie Fire"
msgstr "超越燎原之火"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Outracing the Prairie Fire"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Salamander can move even faster than a racing prairie fire.  -10% move "
"and attack speed."
msgstr "火蜥蜴甚至可以比奔驰的燎原大火还要快。-10%移动和攻击耗时。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sparking Thoughts"
msgstr "电光石火的思考"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sparking Thoughts"
msgid "Your thoughts are as fast as a forest fire.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "你的思考如同森林大火一样迅速。+2智力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Effortlessly-Rising Smoke"
msgstr "轻松升起的烟雾"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Effortlessly-Rising Smoke"
msgid ""
"Like smoke rising to the sky, the Salamander cannot be kept down.  This trait "
"may be activated to immediately clear the Stunned, Dazed, or Downed effects."
msgstr "火蜥蜴就像升上天空的烟雾，无法被压制。 激活该特质可立即清除眩晕、震晕或击倒效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stove's Caress"
msgstr "Stove's Caress"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stove's Caress"
msgid ""
"Instead of simply causing a burst of heat, the Salamander can emit heat from "
"their hands at will, allowing them to use it to cook."
msgstr ""
"Instead of simply causing a burst of heat, the Salamander can emit heat from "
"their hands at will, allowing them to use it to cook."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Inured to Flame"
msgstr "火海之中的生命"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Inured to Flame"
msgid ""
"A creature born and bred of fire, the Salamander is utterly immune to heat "
"and flame of any kind.  However, they will take additional damage from cold."
msgstr "火蜥蜴是一种生于火、长于火的生物，对任何热量和火焰都完全免疫。 不过，它们会受到额外的寒冷伤害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Burning Ascension"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to hurl themselves "
"skyward while standing in a fire."
msgstr "获得此能力后火蜥蜴获得了站在火中向天空投掷自己的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Bonfire"
msgstr "篝火法力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Bonfire"
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Salamander is a font of mana, like a well-fueled bonfire.  25% extra mana."
msgstr "火蜥蜴是一种魔力形式，就像一堆燃料充足的篝火。25%额外法力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Crackling Mana Bonfire"
msgstr "爆燃篝火法力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Crackling Mana Bonfire"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Salamander's mana surges within them, ready to burst out at the slightly "
"opportunity.  25% extra mana and -15% spell casting speed."
msgstr "火蜥蜴的法力在体内涌动，一有机会就会爆发出来。 额外 25% 的法力值和-15%的施法速度。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "On Wings of Flame"
msgstr "火焰之翼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "On Wings of Flame"
msgid ""
"With an act of will, you can extend wings of flame from your back.  These "
"aetherial wings are not hindered by clothing or armor, but also do not have "
"enough substance to allow you to fly.  However, they can break a fall or be "
"used in combat."
msgstr "只要你想，你就可以从背后展开火焰之翼。这些空气一般的翅膀不受衣服或盔甲的阻碍，但也没有足够的物质让你飞翔。然而，它们可以防止你摔落或用于战斗。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "On Wings of Flame" to
#. "SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WINGS_ON"
msgid "Flaming wings extend from your back!"
msgstr "燃烧的翅膀从你的背上展开!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "On Wings of Flame (active)"
msgstr "火焰之翼（激活）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)"
msgid ""
"You are extending wings of aetherial flame from your back.  You can attack "
"enemies with them and will not take damage from falls."
msgstr "你的背上展开火焰的翅膀。你可以用它们攻击敌人，并且不会受到坠落的伤害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when player with mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "You buffet %s with your fiery wings!"
msgstr "你用火焰之翼拍打 %s！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "On Wings of Flame (active)" attacks
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s buffets %2$s with their fiery wings!"
msgstr "%1$s 用火焰之翼拍打 %2$s！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "On Wings of Flame (active)" to
#. "SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WINGS"
msgid "The wings on your back gutter and die."
msgstr "你背后的火焰之翼听话地熄灭掉了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "In Flames, Reborn Like the Phoenix"
msgstr "火中涅槃的凤凰"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "In Flames, Reborn Like the Phoenix"
msgid ""
"Like the bird of legend, the Salamander can recreate themselves from the heat "
"and smoke of a fire.  If their body takes fatal damage while standing in a "
"fire, their fae spirit will use those flames to renew themselves.  This can "
"generally occur no more often than once every 14 days, though there is a "
"small chance it can occur more often."
msgstr ""
"Like the bird of legend, the Salamander can recreate themselves from the heat "
"and smoke of a fire.  If their body takes fatal damage while standing in a "
"fire, their fae spirit will use those flames to renew themselves.  This can "
"generally occur no more often than once every 14 days, though there is a "
"small chance it can occur more often."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Anointed with Incandescence"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability to make an ally "
"immune to heat and flame."
msgstr "获得这种能力后，火蜥蜴获得了使盟友对热和火焰免疫的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Phoenix's Last Cry"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability create a massive "
"explosion of flames around themselves and draw on its energy to increase "
"their healing rate."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Salamander gains the ability create a massive "
"explosion of flames around themselves and draw on its energy to increase "
"their healing rate."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of Billowing Smoke"
msgstr "喷涌的烟雾之形"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of Billowing Smoke"
msgid ""
"The Salamander may transform into smoke.  They will have only a dim awareness "
"of their surroundings, but can freely move including through the air and will "
"be nearly immune to attack.  They will be unable to attack anyone else "
"themselves, however."
msgstr "火蜥蜴可以变成烟雾。 它们只能模糊地感知周围的环境，但可以在空气中自由移动，而且几乎不受攻击。 不过，它们自己无法攻击其他人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of Billowing Smoke Appearance"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of Billowing Smoke Appearance"
msgid ""
"This mutation carries the sprite override info for Form of Billowing Smoke.  "
"You shouldn't be able to see it in game."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Smoke Form Ascension"
msgstr "烟雾形态上升"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Smoke Form Ascension"
msgid "While in hot air or a fire, you may ascend upwards"
msgstr "在热空气或火中，你可以向上上升"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "In No Other Fire Shall I Burn"
msgstr "辐照无伤的身躯"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "In No Other Fire Shall I Burn"
msgid "The Salamander is completely immune to radiation."
msgstr "火蜥蜴对辐射完全免疫。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildfire Soul"
msgid ""
"As a banked fire can suddenly spring up with a gust of wind, the Salamander "
"can surge into raging activity.  Activating this trait will make the "
"Salamander immune to pain and add +3 Strength and Dexterity for as long as it "
"is active.  However, when it ends, all the previously put-off pain and more "
"returns."
msgstr ""
"就像蓄势待发的火苗会在一阵风中突然窜起一样，火蜥蜴会突然爆发出狂暴的活动。激活这一特性将使火蜥蜴对疼痛免疫，只要它处于活动状态，就会获得+3"
"的力量和敏捷性。然而，当它结束时，所有先前被推迟的痛苦就会更强烈地卷土重来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_MAKE_FIRE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_DASH_BOOM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EXPLOSION_TRAP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SMOKE_TELEPORT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_PUNCH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_FIRE_SPIRIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_ASH_BREATH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_BREATH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_FIREBIRD"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_INCREASE_SPEED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_SUMMON_WHIP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EMIT_HEAT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CURE_CONDITIONS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FIRE_DOT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CREATE_LIGHT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLY_IN_FIRE_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_FLAME_IMMUNITY_ALLY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_EXPOSION_AND_HEAL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SALAMANDER_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent among the heat and flames has increased your facility with "
"your fae magicks."
msgstr ""
"Your time spent among the heat and flames has increased your facility with "
"your fae magicks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_LIGHTNING_MELEE_ATTACKS_ON"
msgid "Lightning sparks from you hands."
msgstr "Lightning sparks from you hands."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SYLPH_LIGHTNING_MELEE_ATTACKS_PER_TURN"
msgid "You do not have enough mana to maintain your fulgurating strikes!"
msgstr "You do not have enough mana to maintain your fulgurating strikes!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_REVEAL_OVERMAP"
msgid "You must be outdoors to cast Like a Bird on the Wing."
msgstr "你必须到室外才能释放身轻如燕！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap two stories up"
msgstr "Leap two stories up"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap four stories up"
msgstr "Leap four stories up"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap six stories up"
msgstr "Leap six stories up"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap straight up two stories."
msgstr "Leap straight up two stories."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap straight up four stories."
msgstr "Leap straight up four stories."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_ON"
msgid "Leap straight up six stories."
msgstr "Leap straight up six stories."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_TWO"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_FOUR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_SIX"
msgid "With a burst of wind, you leap into the air."
msgstr "With a burst of wind, you leap into the air."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_TWO"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_FOUR"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_JUMP_HIGH_SELECTOR_SIX"
msgid "You cannot jump with a ceiling above you!"
msgstr "You cannot jump with a ceiling above you!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_FLY_AT_WILL"
msgid "You do not have enough mana to fly!"
msgstr "你没有足够的魔力飞起来!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_CLOUD_FORM_ON"
msgid "Your body falls apart into billowing clouds."
msgstr "Your body falls apart into billowing clouds."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_CLOUD_FORM_PER_TURN"
msgid "You do not have enough mana to maintain your cloud body!"
msgstr "You do not have enough mana to maintain your cloud body!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_MASSIVE_LIGHTNING_BOLT"
msgid "You must be outdoors to cast Fist of Heaven's Fury."
msgstr "You must be outdoors to cast Fist of Heaven's Fury."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_WIND_TRANSLOCATE_CHECK"
msgid ""
"You must be outdoors and in a strong wind or high above the earth to "
"translocate."
msgstr ""
"You must be outdoors and in a strong wind or high above the earth to "
"translocate."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_WIND_ATTUNEMENT_CHECK"
msgid "You must be outdoors and high above the earth to cast this spell."
msgstr "You must be outdoors and high above the earth to cast this spell."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SYLPH_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid ""
"You must have a strong enough wind or be above ground level to call forth a "
"goblin fruit."
msgstr "你必须在有足够强的风力的情况下或处于高处才能召唤精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "zap_electrical_emission"
msgid "Zap"
msgstr "电击"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "zap_electrical_emission ( Zap )"
msgid "Electricity emits from your extremities."
msgstr "电流从你的四肢发出。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "zap_electrical_emission ( Zap )"
#. ~ Message of spell "electrical_field ( Electrical Field )"
#. ~ Message of spell "lightning_field ( Lightning Field )"
msgid "tsszappp!"
msgstr "滋滋电流！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_call_lightning ( Lightning Bolt )"
msgid ""
"The goto ability for many Sylphs, this does just what you expect: you shoot "
"lightning from your fingertips.  However, this lightning is more directed "
"than most lightning, and travels in a line through most non-solid targets."
msgstr "这是许多风妖精的必杀技，它的作用正如你所期望的那样：从你的指尖射出闪电。不过，这种闪电比大多数闪电更有方向性，会以一条直线穿过大多数非固体目标。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_crash_of_lightning"
msgid "Crash of lightning"
msgstr "闪电轰击"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_crash_of_lightning ( Crash of lightning )"
msgid ""
"The crash of lightning strikes your foes with a blast of electricity and a "
"physical force that knocks them prone."
msgstr "闪电的轰击会产生强烈的电流和物理力量，将敌人击倒在地。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clap_of_thunder"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Clap of Thunder"
msgstr "雷鸣掌声"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clap_of_thunder ( Clap of Thunder )"
msgid "A thunder clap at a distance."
msgstr "远处传来一声雷鸣。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electrical_field"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Electrical Field"
msgstr "电场"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electrical_field ( Electrical Field )"
msgid "Summons a field of electricity."
msgstr "召唤电场。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrical_field ( Electrical Field )"
msgid "zzzpptttt!"
msgstr "兹兹普特特特！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "lightning_field"
msgid "Lightning Field"
msgstr "雷电领域"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lightning_field ( Lightning Field )"
msgid "Summons a field of lightning."
msgstr "召唤雷电领域。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "lightning_field ( Lightning Field )"
msgid "cracklezzbit!"
msgstr "噼里啪啦！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_reveal_overmap_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like a Bird on the Wing"
msgstr "身轻如燕"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_reveal_overmap_spell ( Like a Bird on the
#. Wing )"
msgid ""
"Concentrating for a moment, you can hurl your senses into the air, seeing the "
"landscape spread out before you.  This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr ""
"Concentrating for a moment, you can hurl your senses into the air, seeing the "
"landscape spread out before you.  This spell only works outdoors."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_charge_dash_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Stormwind Stride"
msgstr "暴风步法"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_charge_dash_spell ( Stormwind Stride )"
msgid "Charge forward like a sudden gust of wind."
msgstr "Charge forward like a sudden gust of wind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_increase_ally_speed_spell ( Favonian
#. Murmuration )"
msgid ""
"With a burst of fae magick, you infuse the speed of the west wind into one of "
"your allies, allowing them to move much more quickly for a time."
msgstr ""
"With a burst of fae magick, you infuse the speed of the west wind into one of "
"your allies, allowing them to move much more quickly for a time."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_bonus_melee_range_spell ( Breeze-Cutting
#. Blows )"
msgid ""
"The Sylph strikes through the air so precisely that the air itself is cut and "
"carries their force outward.  While the spell is in effect, the Sylph can "
"make melee strikes and affect distant targets."
msgstr ""
"The Sylph strikes through the air so precisely that the air itself is cut and "
"carries their force outward.  While the spell is in effect, the Sylph can "
"make melee strikes and affect distant targets."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Cultivate Goblin
#. Fruit )"
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the winds, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always "
"at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast outdoors in "
"natural surroundings."
msgstr "你可以在风中施展一点精灵魔法，结出精怪果实。 果实的效果多种多样，虽然无法预测，但至少总能带来一些益处。 此咒语只能在户外自然环境中施放。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_air_sprite"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Call the Children of the Winds"
msgstr "Call the Children of the Winds"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_air_sprite ( Call the Children of the Winds
#. )"
msgid "A lesser air elemental is summoned to support you."
msgstr "召唤一个低等空气元素来支援你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ominous_wind"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ominous Wind"
msgstr "不祥之风"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ominous_wind ( Ominous Wind )"
msgid ""
"A whistling wind gusts past your shoulder in the direction you've pointed.  "
"It creates a fearful effect in your foes."
msgstr "一阵呼啸的风从你的肩膀吹过，吹向你所指的方向。 这让你的敌人感到恐惧。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pushing_wind"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pushing Wind"
msgstr "排云之风"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pushing_wind ( Pushing Wind )"
msgid "Shove something away with a burst of elemental air."
msgstr "用一阵元素之气推开某样东西。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "pushing_wind ( Pushing Wind )"
msgid "You hurl your target away."
msgstr "你用念力推开你的目标。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_clear_the_air"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Purifying the Air"
msgstr "Purifying the Air"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_clear_the_air ( Purifying the Air )"
msgid ""
"Reassert the purity of the air around yourself, removing contaminants such as "
"smoke or pollen."
msgstr ""
"Reassert the purity of the air around yourself, removing contaminants such as "
"smoke or pollen."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "sylph_clear_the_air ( Purifying the Air )"
msgid "The air begins to smell sweet."
msgstr "The air begins to smell sweet."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_hindering_wind_spell ( Hindering Winds )"
msgid ""
"Surround a target with a blanket of buffeting winds, slowing them and "
"hindering their freedom of movement."
msgstr "用猛烈的旋风包围目标，使其减速，阻碍其行动自由。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_massive_lightning_bolt_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fist of Heaven's Fury"
msgstr "Fist of Heaven's Fury"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_massive_lightning_bolt_spell ( Fist of
#. Heaven's Fury )"
msgid ""
"Call down a thundering lightning bolt to blast your enemies with the fury of "
"the heavens."
msgstr ""
"Call down a thundering lightning bolt to blast your enemies with the fury of "
"the heavens."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "sylph_massive_lightning_bolt_spell ( Fist of Heaven's
#. Fury )"
msgid "Lightning crashes down from the heavens!"
msgstr "Lightning crashes down from the heavens!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_wind_translocation_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Going Wither the Wind May Lead"
msgstr "Going Wither the Wind May Lead"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_wind_translocation_spell ( Going Wither the
#. Wind May Lead )"
msgid ""
"The wind blows where it will, through fences and open windows, across fields "
"and over rivers  The Sylph can blow with it, traveling high above the earth "
"and alighting on a location they have previously been."
msgstr "风会随意吹拂，穿过栅栏和敞开的窗，越过田野和奔流的河。风妖精也能随风飘荡，飞至高空，降落在他们曾经到过的地方。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_wind_translocation_attune"
msgid "Going Wither the Wind May Lead Attunement"
msgstr "Going Wither the Wind May Lead Attunement"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sylph_wind_translocation_attune ( Going Wither the
#. Wind May Lead Attunement )"
msgid ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune high above the "
"earth and outdoors."
msgstr ""
"Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune high above the "
"earth and outdoors."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sylph Skin"
msgstr "风妖精皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the rolling grey of the clouds.  Your skin is now an "
"ever-shifting color of clouds shifting from stormy to rainy to barely there.  "
"This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤已经变成了白云翻滚的灰色。你的皮肤现在是一种不断变化的云的颜色，从暴风雨到下雨，再到勉强存在。这没有游戏效果。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cloud Skin"
msgstr "云朵之肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Storm Skin"
msgstr "暴风之肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breathe Without Air"
msgstr "无氧呼吸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathe Without Air"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to breathe without "
"oxygen.  This will prevent damage from a lack of oxygen."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够无氧呼吸。这将阻止缺氧伤害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sylph Eyes"
msgstr "风妖精之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph's eyes begin reflecting their mood with "
"lightning and storms when angry and clear skies when happy.  Glare no longer "
"impacts them."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精的眼睛开始反映他们的情绪，愤怒时会出现闪电暴风，高兴时会出现晴空万里。眩目不再能影响他们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Sylph Ears"
msgstr "风妖精之耳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sylph Ears"
msgid ""
"The Sylph's ears are longer and pointed, like a wisp of cloud trailing across "
"the sky.  They can hear better and no matter how loud the thunder, their ears "
"will not ring from it."
msgstr "风妖精的耳朵长又尖，就像天空中飘过的一缕云彩。他们的听觉更灵敏，无论雷声多么响亮，他们的耳朵都不会因此而嗡嗡作响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Voice of Thunder"
msgstr "雷鸣怒吼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Voice of Thunder"
msgid ""
"The Sylph can make their voice boom like a peal of thunder, shouting so "
"loudly that they can be heard from hundreds of yards away."
msgstr "风妖精可以发出雷鸣般的怒吼，吼声在数百码外都能清晰听见。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Clap of Thunder"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to create a loud clap "
"of thunder noise at a distance."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够在远处发出巨大的霹雳声。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ominous Wind"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon and ominous "
"wind that damages sapient creatures morale."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够召唤不祥之风，不祥之风会损害有生命的生物的心情。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormwind Stride"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to rush forward in a "
"burst of wind."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够乘风向前冲刺。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Favonian Murmuration"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability increase the speed of "
"one of their allies."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够增加他们一名同伴的速度。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like a Bird on the Wing"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to see surrounding "
"terrain as though standing on high."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够像站在高处一样看见周围的地形。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breeze-Cutting Blows"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to strike so precisely "
"that the air will carry their melee attacks a short distance."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to strike so precisely "
"that the air will carry their melee attacks a short distance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Slow Fall"
msgstr "羽落术"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow Fall"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph ceases to fall at speeds that would "
"damage themselves, no matter how high the fall is."
msgstr "无论从多高的地方坠落，风妖精都不会再以伤害自己的速度坠落。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Carried on the Breeze"
msgstr "随风飘荡"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Carried on the Breeze"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph can direct their falls, moving "
"horizontally in a gust of wind if they step off a ledge and landing safely on "
"the ground."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够控制自己的坠落方向，如果它们从边缘走下就会在一阵风托着水平移动，然后安全地降落到地面上。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Updraft Leap"
msgstr "升气腾跃"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Updraft Leap"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph can leap straight into the air, riding "
"the wind currents for a few seconds before descending to the earth."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够直接跳到空中，，在降落到地面前乘风飞行几秒。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Resist Cold"
msgstr "抵御寒冷"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Cold"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Born of a Gale"
msgid "The Sylph gains a resistance to cold and cold based damage."
msgstr "风妖精获得对寒冷和基于寒冷的伤害的抗性。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Born of a Gale"
msgstr "生于狂风"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Dancing On Winter Winds"
msgstr "冬风起舞"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Dancing On Winter Winds"
msgid ""
"The sylph is nearly immune to mundane cold and heavily resistant to "
"cold-based damage."
msgstr "风妖精几乎对世俗的寒冷免疫，并对基于寒冷的伤害有很强的抵抗力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wind-Carried Weapons"
msgstr "Wind-Carried Weapons"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wind-Carried Weapons"
msgid ""
"The winds surge around the Sylph as they attack, guiding their projectiles to "
"the target.  The range of the Sylph's weapons is increased."
msgstr ""
"The winds surge around the Sylph as they attack, guiding their projectiles to "
"the target.  The range of the Sylph's weapons is increased."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Winds Guide Me"
msgstr "Winds Guide Me"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Winds Guide Me"
#, no-c-format
msgid "When outdoors, the Sylph moves 10% faster."
msgstr "在户外时，风妖精的移动速度提高10%。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Outrunning the Gale"
msgstr "Outrunning the Gale"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Outrunning the Gale"
#, no-c-format
msgid "When outdoors, the Sylph moves 10% faster and has +10% increased speed."
msgstr "室外时，风妖精移动速度提高10%，速度增加10%。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Gusting Evasion"
msgstr "Gusting Evasion"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Gusting Evasion"
msgid ""
"The Sylph slips away from attacks as easily as the wind finds its way through "
"cracks in a wall.  They gain +1 bonus dodge attempt per turn (+2 if they have "
"the Sylph trait)."
msgstr ""
"The Sylph slips away from attacks as easily as the wind finds its way through "
"cracks in a wall.  They gain +1 bonus dodge attempt per turn (+2 if they have "
"the Sylph trait)."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit "
"when outdoors and the wind is blowing strongly."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够在风力强劲的户外召唤精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pushing Wind"
msgid "The Sylph learns how to use the wind to push their opponents."
msgstr "风妖精学会了如何利用风力推动对手。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Hindering Winds"
msgid ""
"The Sylph learns how to surround a single target with buffeting winds, "
"slowing their movements and knocking them off-balance."
msgstr ""
"The Sylph learns how to surround a single target with buffeting winds, "
"slowing their movements and knocking them off-balance."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Purifying the Air"
msgid ""
"The Sylph can remove contaminants from the air such as smoke or pollen and "
"leave only pure air behind."
msgstr ""
"The Sylph can remove contaminants from the air such as smoke or pollen and "
"leave only pure air behind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Electrical Emissions"
msgstr "电力释放"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Electrical Emissions"
msgid ""
"Sylphs often develop electrical emissions that can culminate in lightning "
"bolts."
msgstr "风妖精经常会发出电光，最终形成闪电。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Electrical Field"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon electrical "
"fields."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够召唤电场。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fist of Heaven's Fury"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to call down the "
"thunderstorm's judgement on a location while outdoors."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to call down the "
"thunderstorm's judgement on a location while outdoors."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Call the Children of the Winds"
msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to summon an air sprite."
msgstr "获得此能力后风妖精能够召唤一只气之灵。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fulgurating Strikes"
msgstr "Fulgurating Strikes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fulgurating Strikes"
msgid ""
"At will, the Sylph may cause their attacks to carry a charge, whose power "
"grows with their mastery of lightning.  Each attack costs mana while this "
"trait is active."
msgstr ""
"At will, the Sylph may cause their attacks to carry a charge, whose power "
"grows with their mastery of lightning.  Each attack costs mana while this "
"trait is active."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Spring Breeze Stride"
msgstr "春风阔步"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Spring Breeze Stride"
msgid "The Sylph's moves like the wind.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "风妖精的行动迅捷如风。+2敏捷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Storm-Runner's Speed"
msgstr "Storm-Runner's Speed"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Storm-Runner's Speed"
msgid "The Sylph's moves like a sudden burst of wind.  +5 Dexterity."
msgstr "The Sylph's moves like a sudden burst of wind.  +5 Dexterity."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ice-Clear Thoughts"
msgstr "Ice-Clear Thoughts"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ice-Clear Thoughts"
msgid "The Sylph's mind has the clarity of pure frozen water.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "The Sylph's mind has the clarity of pure frozen water.  +2 Intelligence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lightning Mind"
msgstr "Lightning Mind"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lightning Mind"
msgid "The Sylph's thoughts move as quickly as a bolt of lightning.  +4 Intelligence."
msgstr "The Sylph's thoughts move as quickly as a bolt of lightning.  +4 Intelligence."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Eagle's Sight"
msgid ""
"Like a bird soaring on the wind, the Sylph's keen eyes take in their "
"surroundings.  +3 Perception."
msgstr ""
"Like a bird soaring on the wind, the Sylph's keen eyes take in their "
"surroundings.  +3 Perception."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Zephyr Chant"
msgstr "西风圣歌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Zephyr Chant"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the blowing winds, the Sylph's mana races from of their body at their "
"command.  -20% spell casting speed when outdoors."
msgstr ""
"Like the blowing winds, the Sylph's mana races from of their body at their "
"command.  -20% spell casting speed when outdoors."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Whistling Zephyr Chant"
msgstr "呼啸的西风圣歌"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Whistling Zephyr Chant"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The wind finds it way through any crack, and so does the Sylph's mana come to "
"their call regardless of what movements they make.  -20% spell casting speed "
"when outdoors and the Sylph no longer needs to gesture to use their magick."
msgstr ""
"The wind finds it way through any crack, and so does the Sylph's mana come to "
"their call regardless of what movements they make.  -20% spell casting speed "
"when outdoors and the Sylph no longer needs to gesture to use their magick."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Surmounting the Clouds"
msgstr "超越云层"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Surmounting the Clouds"
msgid ""
"Born of the winds, the Sylph can walk on them as easily as the ground.  While "
"this trait is active, the Sylph will not fall and may walk on the air as they "
"like.  It requires 3 mana per turn to fuel their steps."
msgstr ""
"Born of the winds, the Sylph can walk on them as easily as the ground.  While "
"this trait is active, the Sylph will not fall and may walk on the air as they "
"like.  It requires 3 mana per turn to fuel their steps."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Going Wither the Wind May Lead"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to travel along the "
"blowing winds to another location they have previously been to."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Sylph gains the ability to travel along the "
"blowing winds to another location they have previously been to."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Body of Cloud"
msgstr "Body of Cloud"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Body of Cloud"
msgid ""
"The Sylph may transform into misty cloud.  They will be insubstantial and "
"unable to interact with the environment, but also able to move incredibly "
"quickly and attacks will simply pass through them.  Each second in the cloud "
"form will cost 10 mana."
msgstr ""
"The Sylph may transform into misty cloud.  They will be insubstantial and "
"unable to interact with the environment, but also able to move incredibly "
"quickly and attacks will simply pass through them.  Each second in the cloud "
"form will cost 10 mana."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Body of Cloud Appearance"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Body of Cloud Appearance"
msgid ""
"This mutation carries the sprite override info for Body of Cloud.  You "
"shouldn't be able to see it in game."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "As Free as the Wind"
msgstr "像风一样自由"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "As Free as the Wind"
msgid ""
"Like the wind, the Sylph goes where they will with no one to stop them.  They "
"are immune to anything that would restrict their movement, such as grabs, "
"terrain costs, or slippery terrain."
msgstr ""
"Like the wind, the Sylph goes where they will with no one to stop them.  They "
"are immune to anything that would restrict their movement, such as grabs, "
"terrain costs, or slippery terrain."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Winds Always At My Back"
msgstr "Winds Always At My Back"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Winds Always At My Back"
msgid ""
"The winds surround the Sylph and carry them along regardless of their "
"physical condition.  They suffer no penalties to dexterity or speed due to "
"pain."
msgstr ""
"The winds surround the Sylph and carry them along regardless of their "
"physical condition.  They suffer no penalties to dexterity or speed due to "
"pain."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLAP_OF_THUNDER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_OMINOUS_WIND"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_PUSHING_WIND"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLEAR_THE_AIR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_ELECTRICAL_EMISSIONS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CHARGE_DASH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_INCREASE_ALLY_SPEED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_BONUS_MELEE_RANGE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_REVEAL_OVERMAP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_SUMMON_AIR_SPRITE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CLOUD_OF_STEAM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CREATE_LIGHT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CALL_LIGHTNING"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CRASH_OF_LIGHTNING"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_MASSIVE_LIGHTNING_BLAST"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_WIND_TRANSLOCATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SLYPH_WIND_BLOWS_WILLOW_BENDS"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_SYLPH_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent among the blowing winds has increased your facility with your "
"fae magicks."
msgstr ""
"Your time spent among the blowing winds has increased your facility with your "
"fae magicks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_COMPLETED_ROLL_REMAINDER_ELEMENTAL_RECIPE"
msgid "These are all the ways you can alter these elements now."
msgstr "以上就是你现在可以改变这些元素的所有方法。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SUCCESFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER_ELEMENTAL_RECIPE"
msgid "You learn how to alter an element."
msgstr "你将学会如何改变一个元素。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_SALTWATER_TO_FRESHWATER"
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn fresh water into "
"salt water, and vice versa, fills your mind."
msgstr ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn fresh water into "
"salt water, and vice versa, fills your mind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_FOUL_WATER"
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn foul water into "
"clean, pure water, and vice versa, fills your mind."
msgstr ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn foul water into "
"clean, pure water, and vice versa, fills your mind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_LIQUID_TO_WATER"
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"liquids directly into water fills your mind."
msgstr ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"liquids directly into water fills your mind."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid ""
"You must be standing in water or near a large body of water to call forth a "
"goblin fruit."
msgstr "你必须在水中或大型水域附近才能培育出精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WATER_FORM_ON"
msgid "Your body falls apart in a rush of water."
msgstr "你的身体四散，化为涛涛水流。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WATER_FORM_OFF"
msgid "Your body reconstitutes itself from the waters."
msgstr "你的身体从水中重组。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_fog"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Create Fog"
msgstr "制造雾气"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_fog ( Create Fog )"
msgid "Summons a field of fog."
msgstr "召唤一片雾气。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "create_fog ( Create Fog )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "acidic_mist ( Acidic Mist )"
msgid "sussurus!"
msgstr "嘶嘶作响！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "create_fog ( Create Fog )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "fog_bank ( Fog Bank )"
#. ~ Message of spell "fog_bank ( Fog Bank )"
#. ~ Message of spell "acidic_mist ( Acidic Mist )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "deadly_mist ( Deadly Mist )"
#. ~ Message of spell "deadly_mist ( Deadly Mist )"
msgid "whoosh!"
msgstr "嗚咻！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "fog_bank"
msgid "Fog Bank"
msgstr "雾障"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "fog_bank ( Fog Bank )"
msgid "Summons a bank of fog."
msgstr "召唤一片浓雾。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "grant_buoyancy"
msgid "Grant buoyancy"
msgstr "赋予浮力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "grant_buoyancy ( Grant buoyancy )"
msgid "You become more buoyant."
msgstr "你变得更有浮力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acidic_mist"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Acidic Mist"
msgstr "酸雾"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acidic_mist ( Acidic Mist )"
msgid "Summons an acidic mist."
msgstr "召唤酸雾。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "deadly_mist"
msgid "Deadly Mist"
msgstr "死亡迷雾"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "deadly_mist ( Deadly Mist )"
msgid "Summons a deadly mist."
msgstr "召唤致命的迷雾。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "water_pocket"
msgid "Water Pocket"
msgstr "水袋"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "water_pocket ( Water Pocket )"
msgid ""
"This spell summons a pocket made of churning water that contains an air "
"bubble inside and prevents any items in it from being damaged by water."
msgstr "这个咒语会召唤一个由搅动的水组成的口袋，里面有一个气泡，可以防止任何物品被水损坏。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_acid_resist_ally_spell ( Caustic Cloak )"
msgid ""
"Weave a cloak of fae magicks around a target, surrounding them with a thin "
"shell of acidic mist.  This protects them somewhat from acid damage and will "
"sometimes damage an attacker as well."
msgstr ""
"Weave a cloak of fae magicks around a target, surrounding them with a thin "
"shell of acidic mist.  This protects them somewhat from acid damage and will "
"sometimes damage an attacker as well."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_cultivate_goblin_fruit ( Cultivate Goblin
#. Fruit )"
msgid ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the waters, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always "
"at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast when standing or "
"water or a near a large body of water."
msgstr ""
"You may spin a bit of fae magic into the waters, bringing forth a goblin "
"fruit.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always "
"at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast when standing or "
"water or a near a large body of water."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "undine_bash_and_slow_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Crushing Pressure"
msgstr "粉碎水压"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_bash_and_slow_spell ( Crushing Pressure )"
msgid ""
"You may bring the force of the ocean's depths onto your enemy, crushing them "
"and slowing them briefly."
msgstr "你可以将深海的力量施加给你的敌人，将其粉碎并短暂地降低其速度。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "undine_drag_inward_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal"
msgstr "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_drag_inward_spell ( Whirlpool Catches the
#. Shoal )"
msgid ""
"Create a whirling field of magickal waters, dragging everything within it "
"toward a central point and slowing them with the force of the current."
msgstr ""
"Create a whirling field of magickal waters, dragging everything within it "
"toward a central point and slowing them with the force of the current."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "wave_rider"
msgid "Summon Wave Rider"
msgstr "召唤波浪骑手"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "wave_rider ( Summon Wave Rider )"
msgid "You summon a water based vehicle to propel you across the waves."
msgstr "您可以召唤一辆水上交通工具，带您穿越波涛汹涌的大海。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_fish"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Summon Fish"
msgstr "召唤鱼儿"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_fish ( Summon Fish )"
msgid "A fish arrives from somewhere.  It may not be that useful on land."
msgstr "一条鱼从某处驶来。 它在陆地上可能没那么有用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "charm_fish"
msgid "Charm Fish"
msgstr "魅惑鱼儿"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "charm_fish ( Charm Fish )"
msgid "A friendly fish arrives from somewhere.  It may not be that useful on land."
msgstr "一条友好的鱼不知从哪里来了。 它在陆地上可能没那么有用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_kraken"
msgid "Summon Kraken"
msgstr "召唤海怪"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_kraken ( Summon Kraken )"
msgid "A friendly kraken arrives from somewhere.  It may not be that useful on land."
msgstr "一只友好的海怪不知从哪里来了。 它在陆地上可能用处不大。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_water_sprite"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Calling the Children of the Waves"
msgstr "Calling the Children of the Waves"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_water_sprite ( Calling the Children of the
#. Waves )"
msgid "A lesser water elemental is summoned to support you."
msgstr "召唤一个较低级的水元素来支援你。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "undine_tidal_wave_spell"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Tidal Wave"
msgstr "Tidal Wave"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "undine_tidal_wave_spell ( Tidal Wave )"
msgid ""
"Create a magickal wall of water and bring it crashing down on your enemies, "
"buffeting and carrying them away."
msgstr ""
"Create a magickal wall of water and bring it crashing down on your enemies, "
"buffeting and carrying them away."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Undine Skin"
msgstr "水仙子皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine Skin"
msgid ""
"Your skin has turned the color of the Mediterranean Sea.  Your skin is now a "
"brilliant turquoise color.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "你的皮肤变成了地中海的颜色。 你的皮肤现在是亮丽的绿松石色。 这对游戏没有任何影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Liquid Skin"
msgstr "液态皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wave Skin"
msgstr "波浪皮肤"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Create Fog"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to create a cloud of "
"fog."
msgstr "获得此能力后水仙子能够制造云雾。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grant Buoyancy"
msgstr "赋予浮力"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grant Buoyancy"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to grant one person "
"the ability to float and swim."
msgstr "获得此能力后水仙子能够赋予一个人漂浮和游泳的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Acidic Mist"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to create an acidic "
"mist that damages any creatures inside it."
msgstr "获得此能力后水仙子能够制造酸雾，酸雾会伤害其中的任何生物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Caustic Cloak"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to weave an "
"enchantment on an ally which will protect them from acid and causes anything "
"who attacks that ally to be splashed with acid themselves."
msgstr "在获得此技能后，水仙子获得了在盟友身上使用魔法的能力，可以保护他们免受酸液伤害，并使任何攻击该盟友的人受到酸液上海。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit "
"from a natural water source."
msgstr "获得此能力后水仙子能够从水源中培育精怪果实。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "One Foot in the River and One in the Sea"
msgstr "One Foot in the River and One in the Sea"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "One Foot in the River and One in the Sea"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine learns how to convert salt water into "
"freshwater and vice versa."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Breathe Underwater"
msgstr "水下呼吸"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Breathe Underwater"
msgid "The Undine has gained the ability to breathe underwater."
msgstr "水精灵获得了在水下呼吸的能力。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cleansing the Poison Well"
msgstr "Cleansing the Poison Well"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cleansing the Poison Well"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine learns how to foul water, making it "
"murky and possibly infested.  Conversely, the Undine can also cleanse water "
"that is not already clean."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine learns how to foul water, making it "
"murky and possibly infested.  Conversely, the Undine can also cleanse water "
"that is not already clean."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Return to Primordial Waters"
msgstr "Return to Primordial Waters"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Return to Primordial Waters"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine learns how to convert various liquids "
"into freshwater."
msgstr ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine learns how to convert various liquids "
"into freshwater."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Resist Fire"
msgstr "抵御火焰"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Fire"
msgid "You've gained a resistance to fire."
msgstr "你获得了对火的抗性。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Resist Acid"
msgstr "酸性抵抗"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Resist Acid"
msgid "You've gained a resistance to acid."
msgstr "你获得了对酸的抗性。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Sea Bears Me Up"
msgstr "The Sea Bears Me Up"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Sea Bears Me Up"
msgid ""
"The waves themselves answer your call and support you, allowing you to walk "
"on the surface of the water.  Activate to walk on water."
msgstr ""
"The waves themselves answer your call and support you, allowing you to walk "
"on the surface of the water.  Activate to walk on water."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Let the Waves Wash Over Me"
msgstr "Let the Waves Wash Over Me"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Let the Waves Wash Over Me"
msgid ""
"As the Undine is one with the waters, so too is anything they carry.  Their "
"gear is immune to being dissolved or broken by water."
msgstr ""
"As the Undine is one with the waters, so too is anything they carry.  Their "
"gear is immune to being dissolved or broken by water."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Summon Rain"
msgstr "召唤雨天"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Summon Rain"
msgid "Allows the Undine to change the weather to rain.  (Currently not working)"
msgstr "允许 水仙子 将天气变为雨天。 （目前无法使用）"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Summon Fish"
msgid ""
"Allows the Undine to summon fish and eventually charm them.  Practice this "
"enough and you will be able to befriend sea monsters."
msgstr "可以让水仙子召唤鱼类，并最终迷住它们。 只要多加练习，你就能与海怪成为朋友。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Crushing Pressure"
msgid ""
"Allows the Undine to slow and damage a single target, as though they were "
"caught in the depths of the ocean."
msgstr "可以让水仙子使单个目标减速并受到伤害，如同目标被困在海洋深处。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Whirlpool Catches the Shoal"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Tidal Wave"
msgid ""
"Allows the Undine to force an entire group inward toward a central point, as "
"though caught in a whirlpool."
msgstr "可以使水仙子迫使整个群体陷入一个中心点，如同陷入漩涡。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Undine Eyes"
msgstr "水仙子之眼"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine Eyes"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Undine's eyes begin reflecting their mood with "
"colors of the deep waters, pitch black when angry or sad and green-blue when "
"pleased.  Glare no longer impacts them, and neither do light levels when "
"trying to sleep.  They can also see without problem underwater."
msgstr ""
"获得此能力后水仙子的眼睛开始用深水的颜色反映他们的情绪，愤怒或悲伤时是漆黑，高兴时是绿蓝。眩目不再能影响他们，光照也不能影响他们入睡。在水下，水仙子也能清晰"
"视物。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Undine Ears"
msgstr "水仙子之耳"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Undine Ears"
msgid ""
"The Undine's ears are longer and pointed, like a stream of water poured into "
"a glass from on high.  This is purely cosmetic."
msgstr "水仙子的耳朵又长又尖，就像从高处倒进玻璃杯里的水流。当然这纯粹是为了好看。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Calling the Children of the Waves"
msgid ""
"Allows the Undine to summon a minor water elemental to support them in the "
"world for a short time."
msgstr "允许水仙子召唤一只小型水元素，以支持他们现身一小段时间。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Embrace of the Waters"
msgstr "水之拥"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Embrace of the Waters"
msgid ""
"Surrounded by the waters, Undines find it easy to rest.  Falling asleep "
"underwater is easy for you, and you spend less time asleep when you rest "
"there.  You can also eat underwater, though you can't drink."
msgstr "被水包围时，水仙子更容易休息。在水下睡觉对你来说很容易，当你在水下休息时，你需要花在睡觉上的时间减少。你也可以在水下吃东西，但不能喝水。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Sea Sustains Me"
msgstr "海之滋养"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Sea Sustains Me"
msgid ""
"Undines are born of the flowing waters and the waters provide for their "
"children.  While submerged in fresh water, any thirst you have will be slaked."
msgstr "水仙子由流水所生，为流水所养。在淡水中潜水时，你的口渴会得到缓解。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Flow Like Water"
msgid ""
"With the Undine's more fluid skin has come more fluid motion.  Activate this "
"trait to immediately escape a grab and suffer less damage from falls for a "
"few seconds."
msgstr "水仙子更柔软的皮肤使运动更加灵活。获得此特性，水仙子可以立即逃离敌方的擒拿，并在几秒钟内减少跌落造成的伤害。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like a Fish in the River"
msgstr "如鱼得水"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like a Fish in the River"
msgid ""
"The Undines are born of the waters and water is their home.  This trait "
"allows them to move much faster when in water."
msgstr "水仙子为水所生，以水为家。这一特性增加水仙子在水中移动的速度。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Crashing Waves"
msgstr "Crashing Waves"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Crashing Waves"
msgid ""
"The waters come to the Undine's defense.  When attacked, there is a chance "
"that a burst of water will surge out and push their attackers back."
msgstr "水仙子被水护佑。当受到攻击时，水中有概率涌出一股水柱，击退攻击者。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Pounding Surf Strikes"
msgstr "Pounding Surf Strikes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Pounding Surf Strikes"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the relentless pounding of the waves against the shore, the Undine's "
"strikes hammer into their enemies.  While this trait is active, the Undine "
"does 25% more melee damage."
msgstr "水仙子伍仟锤击其敌，如同海浪无情地拍打着海岸。获得此特性后，水仙子的近战伤害增加25%。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "All Rivers Flow to the Sea"
msgstr "海纳百川"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "All Rivers Flow to the Sea"
msgid ""
"Water falls as rain, flows into streams, and then into rivers to the sea, and "
"rises as clouds to fall as rain once again.  While submerged in a river, "
"lake, or the ocean, the Undine can exploit this connection to locate other "
"sources of water."
msgstr "水化雨落，落入小溪，流入江河，汇入大海，复变为水又化雨。潜入河流、湖泊和海洋时，水仙子可以利用这种方式寻找其他水域。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Waves Erode the Stones"
msgstr "Waves Erode the Stones"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Waves Erode the Stones"
msgid ""
"Even the weakest waves will erode the strongest rock, given enough time.  +1 "
"Strength."
msgstr ""
"Even the weakest waves will erode the strongest rock, given enough time.  +1 "
"Strength."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Waves Erode the Shore"
msgstr "Waves Erode the Shore"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Waves Erode the Shore"
msgid ""
"Year by year, meter by meter, the waves gradually erode the beaches.  +3 "
"Strength."
msgstr ""
"Year by year, meter by meter, the waves gradually erode the beaches.  +3 "
"Strength."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grace of the Creek"
msgstr "Grace of the Creek"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grace of the Creek"
msgid ""
"The Undine's flexibility has increased, allowing them to move in increasingly "
"more fluid ways.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "水仙子的柔软度得以增加，它们的运动越发灵活。+2点敏捷。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grace of the Stream"
msgstr "Grace of the Stream"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grace of the Stream"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the babbling brook, the Undine flows over everything in their way.  +4 "
"Dexterity.  However, they must also drink 15% more water."
msgstr "如同小溪潺潺，水仙子流过他们所经之途。加4点敏捷。然而，他们必须多摄入15%的水。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Grace of the River"
msgstr "Grace of the River"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Grace of the River"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the flowing river, the Undine can twist back on themselves and pass "
"through any obstacle.  +6 Dexterity.  However, they must also drink 25% more "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Like the flowing river, the Undine can twist back on themselves and pass "
"through any obstacle.  +6 Dexterity.  However, they must also drink 25% more "
"water."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Seeing the Depths"
msgstr "Seeing the Depths"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Seeing the Depths"
msgid ""
"The Undine's senses take in their environment like a fisher gazing to the "
"bottom of a clear pond.  +2 Perception."
msgstr "水仙子的感官就像渔夫凝视清澈的池底一样，将周围环境尽收眼底。+2 感知。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Pond's Depths Do Not Freeze"
msgstr "深潭不冻"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Pond's Depths Do Not Freeze"
msgid ""
"Though the ice over the top grows thick, the water below remains liquid.  The "
"Undine is completely immune to cold temperatures when underwater."
msgstr "虽然上层的冰越来越厚，但下面的水仍然保持液态。在水下时，水仙子完全不受低温的影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Fluid Body"
msgstr "流体形态"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Fluid Body"
msgid ""
"Even the Undine's internal organs are becoming more liquid.  Bashing and "
"cutting damage is reduced even further, and ballistic damage is halved.  "
"However, the Undine needs to drink more water."
msgstr "水仙子的内部器官也变得更加像液体。钝击和斩击伤害进一步降低，子弹伤害减半。然而，水仙子需要摄入更多水。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like the Flowing Fountain"
msgstr "犹如流动之泉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like the Flowing Fountain"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the fountain continuously flowing with water, the Undine's mana "
"regenerates 50% faster while standing in or under water."
msgstr "如同喷泉流水，当水仙子站在水中或水下时，其魔力恢复速度增强50%。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like the Rushing Fountain"
msgstr "犹如奔涌之泉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like the Rushing Fountain"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the fountain continuously flowing to the brim with water, the Undine's "
"mana regenerates 50% faster and they have 50% more mana while standing in or "
"under water."
msgstr "如同喷泉流至水边，水仙子的魔力恢复速度增强50%，当他们站在水中或水下时，其魔力量增加50%。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Like the Overflowing Fountain"
msgstr "犹如满溢之泉"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Like the Overflowing Fountain"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like the fountain overflowing with water, the Undine's mana regenerates 50% "
"faster, they have 50% more mana, and their stamina regenerates 100% faster "
"while standing in or under water."
msgstr "如同喷泉满溢，水仙子的魔力恢复速度增强50%，魔力量增加50%，当他们站在水中或水下时，其耐力恢复速度增加100%。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Form of the Flowing Waters"
msgstr "流水形态"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Form of the Flowing Waters"
msgid ""
"You may transform your body into pure water, becoming much more difficult to "
"hurt (except by fire), able to flow easily over all terrain, and capable of "
"moving much faster and more stealthily when in water.  However, you will be "
"unable to attack, cold will do triple damage to you, and cold weather will "
"affect you more."
msgstr ""
"你可以把你的身体变成纯水，变得难以受伤（除了火），能够轻松地在所有地形上流动，并且能够在水中更快更隐蔽地移动。然而，你将无法攻击，寒冷会对你造成三倍的伤害，"
"寒冷的天气也会对你产生更大的影响。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Water Form"
msgstr "纯水形态"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Water Form"
msgid ""
"You are a mass of pure water.  It is much harder to damage you, and you can "
"move over any terrain without penalty, but you cannot attack."
msgstr ""
"You are a mass of pure water.  It is much harder to damage you, and you can "
"move over any terrain without penalty, but you cannot attack."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Watery Camouflage"
msgstr "纯水伪装"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Watery Camouflage"
msgid ""
"Being made entirely of water, it is easy for you to disguise yourself when "
"underwater."
msgstr "由于完全由水构成，你在水中很容易伪装自己。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "The Sea Is Always With Me"
msgstr "大海随我同在"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "The Sea Is Always With Me"
msgid ""
"The Undine can draw a bit of extra water into their watery skin, fortifying "
"them for journeys away from a water source."
msgstr "水仙子可以在起水般的皮肤中吸纳额外的水，增加其在远离水源时探索的距离。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_spell_learning_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_CREATE_FOG"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_GRANT_BUOYANCY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_ACIDIC_MIST"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_DEADLY_MIST"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_WAVE_RIDER"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_WATER_SEALED"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_SUMMON_FISH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_CHARM_FISH"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_SUMMON_KRAKEN"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_ACID_RESIST_ALLY"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_BASH_AND_SLOW_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_DRAG_INWARD_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_TIDAL_WAVE_SPELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_SUMMON_WATER_SPRITE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_CLOUD_OF_STEAM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_CULTIVATE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LEVELER_UNDINE_MAKE_GOSSAMER"
msgid ""
"Your time spent among the flowing waters has increased your facility with "
"your fae magicks."
msgstr ""
"Your time spent among the flowing waters has increased your facility with "
"your fae magicks."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
msgid "Lady Boann"
msgstr "波恩夫人"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "fae noblewoman"
msgstr "妖精贵妇"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Job description of "fae noblewoman" NPC class
msgid "I'm in charge of the faeries of my court."
msgstr "我统领着此处王廷下的妖精。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Begone, slayer.  I will have no dealings with you."
msgstr "滚开，杀手。我不会与你有任何瓜葛。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, kinsman."
msgstr "你好，亲戚。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, kinswoman."
msgstr "你好，亲戚。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, elder cousin."
msgstr "你好，表亲。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, nightwalker."
msgstr "你好，夜行者。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, child of the moon."
msgstr "你好，月之子。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings, mortal."
msgstr "你好，凡人。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "你好。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I-"
msgstr "我——"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Boann dismissively waves a hand before you can say anything, and you are "
"enveloped by a swirl of multicolored lights."
msgstr "博安不屑地朝你挥了挥手，你还没来得及开口，就被一团五彩斑斓的光晕所包裹。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I came here with my court when the Hedge between our worlds thinned and the "
"border marches expanded.  They came for conquest and I came here for "
"coexistence."
msgstr "当我们世界之间的树篱变薄，边境不断扩大时，我带着我的王廷来到此处。他们是为了征服而来，而我是为了共存而来。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So you're a good faerie?"
msgstr "所以你是好妖精吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How can I join your court?"
msgstr "我该怎么加入你的王廷呢？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am ready to leave this world for yours."
msgstr "I am ready to leave this world for yours."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the Jabberwock."
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the Jabberwock."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the march lords."
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the march lords."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about that dog."
msgstr "I'd like some advice about that dog."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the Mi-Go guards."
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the Mi-Go guards."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the armored centipede."
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the armored centipede."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the automaton."
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the automaton."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the triffid heart"
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the triffid heart"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the titan stag beetle"
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the titan stag beetle"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the shadow and its piece"
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the shadow and its piece"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like some advice about the star-crowned hound"
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the star-crowned hound"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Jabberwock.  [Give her the heart]"
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the Jabberwock.  [Give her the heart]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_melian_mantis_mount' in an effect
msgid "Bladepetal"
msgstr "布拉德塔尔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the March Lords."
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the March Lords."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed that dog-like thing."
msgstr "I'm back and I killed that dog-like thing."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Mi-Go guards."
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the Mi-Go guards."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the armored centipede"
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the armored centipede"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the automaton."
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the automaton."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the triffid heart.  [Give her the heart chunk]"
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the triffid heart.  [Give her the heart chunk]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the titan stag beetle"
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the titan stag beetle"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Shadow.  [Give her the piece of shadow]"
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the Shadow.  [Give her the piece of shadow]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm back and I killed the star-crowned hound"
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the star-crowned hound"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Some of my kind might find that word pejorative, but it's what you've called "
"us for so very long.  It had been quite a while since we were last able to "
"come in numbers to this world, until the last few years."
msgstr "对我们这类人来说，可能会觉得这个词是贬义的，但这正是你长时间以来对我们的称呼。我们已经有很长一段时间没有来到这个世界了，直到最近几年。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Why were you able to return?"
msgstr "你为什么能回来？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well those of us who aren't faeries have other places to be now."
msgstr "好吧，我们这些不是妖精的人现在得去其他地方了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The same thing that is causing the portal storms made travel between our "
"worlds easier again.  We have to engage in fairly strenuous decontamination "
"procedures on our way back but we've had those in place for aeons."
msgstr "引发空间风暴的力量，使我们世界之间的旅行重新变得可行。在离开此地前，我们必须进行相当艰苦的净化仪式，但我们对此早已熟悉于心。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Decontamination?  You can leave here and not worry about the risen dead?"
msgstr "净化？你可以离开这里，不用担心复活的死者？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How can I join your court?  I want to leave here when you do!"
msgstr "我该怎么加入你的王廷呢？你离开时带我一起走吧！"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm going to head on now."
msgstr "我现在要出发了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If we die here, we will rise just like you, we are within the belly of the "
"beast, so to speak here.  But yes when we go elsewhere we don't bring this "
"with us, that would be rude."
msgstr "如果我们在此地死去，我们也会像你们一样尸变，可以这么说，我们正身处野兽之腹。但我们离开到其他地方时不会把这些东西带回去，那样太鲁莽了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Please take me away with you."
msgstr "请让我跟你一起走。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I haven't decided if I believe you or not but I'll see you around."
msgstr "我还没决定好是否该相信你，但我们会再见面的。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well you can't just join by asking, you need to accomplish a series of "
"progressively more difficult quests, bringing me trophies and relics proving "
"your worth to join our ranks."
msgstr "你可不能随便问问就加入，你需要完成一系列难度递增的任务，带给沃战利品和遗物，证明你的价值以加入我们的行列。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you have a quest for me now?"
msgstr "你现在有任务给我吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I have no other quests for you.  Once you'll have completed them all, you'll "
"become part of my court and allowed to move offworld when you will wish so."
msgstr ""
"I have no other quests for you.  Once you'll have completed them all, you'll "
"become part of my court and allowed to move offworld when you will wish so."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"(Boann hands you a list) Here is a list of the quests to complete to become "
"part of my court.  They are very difficult, but their rewards will be worth "
"it."
msgstr ""
"(Boann hands you a list) Here is a list of the quests to complete to become "
"part of my court.  They are very difficult, but their rewards will be worth "
"it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I have no new quests for now.  Once you'll have completed them, you'll become "
"one of my knights and able to accomplish the quests that will make you a "
"member of my court."
msgstr ""
"I have no new quests for now.  Once you'll have completed them, you'll become "
"one of my knights and able to accomplish the quests that will make you a "
"member of my court."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"(Boann hands you a list) Here is a list of the quests to complete to become "
"one of my knights.  Take your time, they can be accomplished when you want."
msgstr "（波恩递给你一份清单）这是成为我的骑士所需完成的任务清单。慢慢来，等你想做的时候再去做。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "And when I'll be a knight you'll bring me out of here?"
msgstr "我成为你的骑士后，你能带我离开这里吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock]"
msgstr "[ 给我一颗伽卜沃克的心 ]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Find and kill two March Lords]"
msgstr "[ 寻找并杀死两个征战领主 ]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill the suspicious dog]"
msgstr "[ 杀掉可疑的狗 ]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill five Mi-Go guards]"
msgstr "[Kill five Mi-Go guards]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill an armored centipede]"
msgstr "[Kill an armored centipede]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton]"
msgstr "[Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Bring me back a chunk of a triffid heart]"
msgstr "[Bring me back a chunk of a triffid heart]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill a titan stag beetle]"
msgstr "[Kill a titan stag beetle]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Bring me back a piece of the darkest shadow]"
msgstr "[给我带回一片最黑暗的阴影]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Kill a star-crowned hound]"
msgstr "[Kill a star-crowned hound]"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You won't be a member of my court yet.  After another few quests, you will, "
"and you along with all those that follow you will be brought out of this "
"world whenever you wish so."
msgstr "你还不是我的国度的一员。再完成几次任务后，你会的，只要你愿意，你和所有跟随你的人都会被带出这个世界。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I see the quest list again?"
msgstr "我可以再看看任务清单吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
msgid ""
"Prove to me that you have the heart of a knight.  Bring me the putrid heart "
"of a Jabberwock."
msgstr "向我证明你拥有骑士之心，给我一颗伽卜沃克的腐化之心。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the Jabberwock?"
msgstr "I'll do it.  Where's the Jabberwock?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you have any advice?"
msgstr "Do you have any advice?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm not sure if I want to do it.  See you."
msgstr "I'm not sure if I want to do it.  See you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You will need incredible melee skills to handle this or an impressive gun.  "
"Otherwise it do not have hidden tricks or notable intelligence so it'll be a "
"straightforward fight."
msgstr ""
"You will need incredible melee skills to handle this or an impressive gun.  "
"Otherwise it do not have hidden tricks or notable intelligence so it'll be a "
"straightforward fight."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I see the other quests first?"
msgstr "Can I see the other quests first?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid "I had no doubts in you."
msgstr "我对你毫无怀疑。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I see the other quests?"
msgstr "Can I see the other quests?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you a Melian mount of your own."
msgstr "我很高兴能赐予你一匹属于你的迈雅螳螂马兽坐骑。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I talk about something else?"
msgstr "Can I talk about something else?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
msgid ""
"Prove your allegiance to me.  Kill two March Lords so all will know which "
"side you fight."
msgstr ""
"Prove your allegiance to me.  Kill two March Lords so all will know which "
"side you fight."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it."
msgstr "I'll do it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They are fearsome opponents but lack long-range attacks.  You can find them "
"in the border patrol offices with their soldiers."
msgstr ""
"They are fearsome opponents but lack long-range attacks.  You can find them "
"in the border patrol offices with their soldiers."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you the right to call upon the daffodil warriors."
msgstr "I'm pleased to grant you the right to call upon the daffodil warriors."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
msgid ""
"A dog-like being has been found nearby.  Whatever it is, it's not a dog.  "
"Kill it, and I will teach you how to see beyond barriers."
msgstr "我在附近发现了一只像狗的生物。但不管它是什么，它都不是狗。杀死它，我会教你如何跨越障碍。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the dog?"
msgstr "I'll do it.  Where's the dog?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
msgid ""
"Do not be deceived by its looks.  It is not a regular dog.  Be very careful "
"as we do not know what it can do."
msgstr ""
"Do not be deceived by its looks.  It is not a regular dog.  Be very careful "
"as we do not know what it can do."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I will now grant you the knowledge to see beyond all walls, written on this "
"parchment."
msgstr ""
"I will now grant you the knowledge to see beyond all walls, written on this "
"parchment."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
msgid ""
"A knight must be able to face harsh conditions.  Kill five Mi-Go guards and "
"you'll receive an object able to refuel your magical energy."
msgstr ""
"A knight must be able to face harsh conditions.  Kill five Mi-Go guards and "
"you'll receive an object able to refuel your magical energy."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the guards?"
msgstr "I'll do it.  Where's the guards?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
msgid ""
"Something to protect yourself from the fumes and heat is a must.  They are "
"smart enough to feel fear, so if they're injured enough they'll stop "
"attacking and try to flee."
msgstr ""
"Something to protect yourself from the fumes and heat is a must.  They are "
"smart enough to feel fear, so if they're injured enough they'll stop "
"attacking and try to flee."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it. Where's the guards?"
msgstr "I'll do it. Where's the guards?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
msgid "Here is the object.  As promised, using it will recharge your mana."
msgstr "Here is the object.  As promised, using it will recharge your mana."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
msgid ""
"A knight must know how to triumph despite their foe's armor.  Kill an armored "
"centipede and I'll grant you an insignia, so you might be recognized as one "
"of my knights."
msgstr ""
"A knight must know how to triumph despite their foe's armor.  Kill an armored "
"centipede and I'll grant you an insignia, so you might be recognized as one "
"of my knights."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the centipede?"
msgstr "I'll do it.  Where's the centipede?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
msgid ""
"Study the weak spots of weaker centipedes, it'll give you an advantage.  Its "
"armor isn't as effective against blunt and piercing weapon than it is against "
"slashing weapons and bullets."
msgstr ""
"Study the weak spots of weaker centipedes, it'll give you an advantage.  Its "
"armor isn't as effective against blunt and piercing weapon than it is against "
"slashing weapons and bullets."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
msgid "I'm honored to grant you this insignia."
msgstr "I'm honored to grant you this insignia."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
msgid ""
"A rampaging automaton has been spotted.  Destroy it, and you'll be granted a "
"great weapon."
msgstr ""
"A rampaging automaton has been spotted.  Destroy it, and you'll be granted a "
"great weapon."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the automaton?"
msgstr "I'll do it.  Where's the automaton?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My scouts mentioned that it relies on electricity to attack.  Find a way to "
"shield yourself against that, and it'll be much easier to kill.  They also "
"mentioned how damaged the automaton's exposed insides are, so I wouldn't "
"attempt to use weapons that only damage the insides if I were you."
msgstr ""
"My scouts mentioned that it relies on electricity to attack.  Find a way to "
"shield yourself against that, and it'll be much easier to kill.  They also "
"mentioned how damaged the automaton's exposed insides are, so I wouldn't "
"attempt to use weapons that only damage the insides if I were you."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you this frostrimed estoc."
msgstr "I'm pleased to grant you this frostrimed estoc."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
msgid ""
"I want you to brave the harshest environments.  Bring me a chunk of a triffid "
"heart and I'll grant you a powerful set of armor."
msgstr ""
"I want you to brave the harshest environments.  Bring me a chunk of a triffid "
"heart and I'll grant you a powerful set of armor."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the triffids?"
msgstr "I'll do it.  Where's the triffids?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
msgid ""
"Tear gas is deadly to them.  In addition, they don't go along with anything "
"that isn't a triffid."
msgstr ""
"Tear gas is deadly to them.  In addition, they don't go along with anything "
"that isn't a triffid."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you a set of armor appropriate for a knight."
msgstr "I'm pleased to grant you a set of armor appropriate for a knight."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
msgid ""
"A knight must be able to triumph of all beasts.  Kill a titan stag beetle and "
"you'll receive a magical musical instrument."
msgstr ""
"A knight must be able to triumph of all beasts.  Kill a titan stag beetle and "
"you'll receive a magical musical instrument."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the beetle?"
msgstr "I'll do it.  Where's the beetle?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
msgid ""
"Mundane weapons won't do much so try to find something that bypasses its "
"armor.  It's also very slow so keeping your distance is easy.  Learning the "
"weak points of smaller beetles and using high-power ammunitions can work too "
"but expect its shell to block most shots."
msgstr ""
"Mundane weapons won't do much so try to find something that bypasses its "
"armor.  It's also very slow so keeping your distance is easy.  Learning the "
"weak points of smaller beetles and using high-power ammunitions can work too "
"but expect its shell to block most shots."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I give you Väinämöinen's Kantele.  Take care of it, it's very precious."
msgstr "I give you Väinämöinen's Kantele.  Take care of it, it's very precious."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There is a shadow that haunts the night.  Bring me proof that you killed it "
"and I'll grant you the right to bear my banner."
msgstr ""
"There is a shadow that haunts the night.  Bring me proof that you killed it "
"and I'll grant you the right to bear my banner."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
msgid ""
"To encounter it, stand alone or accompanied by at most two allies in a field "
"or a forest at night.  It might take multiple nights for it to show itself so "
"prepare something to do while you wait.  Light massively weaken it so ensure "
"the battlefield is well lit.  Separate it from its minions, as it can create "
"more than you'll manage to kill and heal its wounds over time.  It is also "
"particularly resilient against bullets so engage in melee if you manage to "
"get close enough."
msgstr ""
"To encounter it, stand alone or accompanied by at most two allies in a field "
"or a forest at night.  It might take multiple nights for it to show itself so "
"prepare something to do while you wait.  Light massively weaken it so ensure "
"the battlefield is well lit.  Separate it from its minions, as it can create "
"more than you'll manage to kill and heal its wounds over time.  It is also "
"particularly resilient against bullets so engage in melee if you manage to "
"get close enough."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
msgid ""
"I am honored to give you this banner.  Wear it with pride, as you more than "
"earned that right."
msgstr ""
"I am honored to give you this banner.  Wear it with pride, as you more than "
"earned that right."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid ""
"Knight, I ask you to kill a star-crowned hound.  This will be a difficult "
"challenge but I trust that you will prevail against this mighty foe.  Kill it "
"and a necklace that will amplify your magical abilities will be yours."
msgstr ""
"Knight, I ask you to kill a star-crowned hound.  This will be a difficult "
"challenge but I trust that you will prevail against this mighty foe.  Kill it "
"and a necklace that will amplify your magical abilities will be yours."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the hound?"
msgstr "I'll do it.  Where's the hound?"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
msgid ""
"It is strong but slow, so disengaging is possible.  It will summon hounds, "
"but they quickly fade away so they aren't that much of an issue compared to "
"it.  Stand away from corners in walls as it can teleport to them.  It has no "
"armor against fire, electricity and blunt weapons but it quickly heal all its "
"wounds so continuous heavy damage is the key to kill it.  If you cannot "
"manage to injure it, do not hesitate to withdraw and try another way to kill "
"it."
msgstr ""
"It is strong but slow, so disengaging is possible.  It will summon hounds, "
"but they quickly fade away so they aren't that much of an issue compared to "
"it.  Stand away from corners in walls as it can teleport to them.  It has no "
"armor against fire, electricity and blunt weapons but it quickly heal all its "
"wounds so continuous heavy damage is the key to kill it.  If you cannot "
"manage to injure it, do not hesitate to withdraw and try another way to kill "
"it."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
