#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Have you seen anything that could help me?"
msgstr "你有看到任何能帮助我的东西吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The last fifteen years or so before the Cataclysm were weirder than the years "
"before that don't you remember?  Well anyway before the end of things, I used "
"to travel across New England as a wandering musician earning my keep as I "
"could.  There were good times and there were hard times; and once when things "
"were at their hardest I was starving and cold and playing my guitar on the "
"shore of the lake.  A swan boat glides up to the shore quiet as a mouse, a "
"tall elegantly dressed man stepped out of the boat and asked me to come play "
"for them at the 'bonum collis'.  Being more hungry than I was scared, I went "
"with him."
msgstr ""
"大灾变发生之前的十五年左右的日子比更早以前的日子要邪门许多，你不记得了吗？不管怎么说，在末日来临之前，我曾以流浪音乐家的身份游走于新英格兰各地，尽我所能赚钱"
"糊口。有好日子，也有苦日子；有一次，在最困难的时候，我饥寒交迫，在湖边弹吉他。一艘天鹅船如老鼠般安静地滑到岸边，一个衣着优雅的高个子男人从船上走下来，邀请我"
"去 “Bonum Collis”为他们演奏。我饿的程度超过了怕，就跟他走了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"So I get the boat and it moves smooth as silk across the lake, no sound or "
"vibration but the waves against the hull.  I never see anyone or anything "
"guiding the boat or making it move.  Anyway we arrived at an island in the "
"lake and as we approached I can hear laughter and music.  Once we landed, "
"they had me sign a contract which I'd figured would just be an NDA not to "
"talk about the rich peoples party island.  Turns out I signed a contract to "
"play music every night for three months for the price of room and board."
msgstr ""
"于是我上了船，它如丝般顺滑地在湖面上移动，没有声音或震动，只能看到拍打着船体的波浪。我没有看到任何人或任何东西在牵引或驱动船。无论如何，我们到达了湖中的一个"
"岛屿，当我们靠近时，我可以听到笑声和乐声。我们一上岸，他们就让我签了一份合同，我以为这只是一份保密协议让我不要对外谈论这些阔佬的派对岛。结果我是签了一份让我"
"在三个月里每晚奏乐以支付食宿费用的合同。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can't believe this story.  Goodbye."
msgstr "我无法相信这个故事，再见。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Long story short, I played for them every night like the contract said, it "
"was a good bit better than starving to death.  I saw and heard some of the "
"craziest things while I was there and other humans came and made deals and "
"went.  They told me that this particular 'sith' had strict rules about how to "
"treat people and that I was quite lucky to be here.  It didn't feel like they "
"considered themselves 'people'.  Anyway when my contract was up they said "
"they'd quite enjoyed my time with them and gave me some gifts to help me get "
"along once I'd left their island.  When society broke down I thought about "
"heading there to see if they were still there.  I chickened out when I "
"realized how far it was compared to my evacuation point.  Course, here I am "
"among the unwanted masses, maybe you'll find them there if you decide to go "
"look."
msgstr ""
"长话短说，我每天晚上都像合同上说的那样为他们打球，这比饿死要好得多。当我在那里的时候，我看到和听到了一些最疯狂的事情，其他人来了，做了交易，又走了。他们告诉"
"我，这个特殊的‘西斯’对如何对待人有严格的规定，我很幸运能在这里。这让人感觉他们并不认为自己是“人”。无论如何，当我的合同到期时，他们说他们很享受我和他们在"
"一起的时光，并给了我一些礼物，帮助我在离开他们的岛屿后相处得更好。当社会崩溃时，我想去那里看看他们是否还在那里。当我意识到这与我的疏散地点相比有多远时，我害"
"怕了。当然，我在这里，如果你决定去看看，也许你会在那里找到他们。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe I'll check it out."
msgstr "也许我会去查下。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/draco_dune.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Go check out this island"
msgstr "去看看这座岛吧"

