#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/mr_lapin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What can you tell me about Xedra?"
msgstr "能和我说说关于XEDRA的事吗？"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/mr_lapin.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Are you talking about the Zebra agencies?  I probably don't know any more "
"than you do.  When things started getting weird about a decade ago, all these "
"new departments starting springing up out of Homeland Security.  Their badges "
"were just barcodes that if you scanned with your phone would put you in "
"contact with your local law enforcement, who'd vouch for them."
msgstr ""
"你是说那些斑马探员吗？我可能不比你知道得更多。大约十年前，当怪事情越来越多时，各种各样的新部门开始从国土安全部涌现出来。他们的钥匙卡上只有条形码，如果你用手"
"机扫描，就能与当地执法部门取得联系，为他们提供担保。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/mr_lapin.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
