msgstr "你知道如何打造一把真正可怕的战锤。双手握住捶打，但也可以像回旋镖一样使用。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ [DEPRECATED] Don't translate this line.
#. ~ This string is from an obsolete source and will no longer be used in the
#. game.
msgid "Make The Bio Detonator"
msgstr "制作生物爆炸装置"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ [DEPRECATED] Don't translate this line.
#. ~ This string is from an obsolete source and will no longer be used in the
#. game.
msgid ""
"You know how to make a tool to explode the biosignature of nearly all living "
"creatures.  It's really powerful, but can't separate enemies from allies, or "
"enemies from the user, so it's better to not use it in point-blank range."
msgstr "你知道如何制造一种能够爆破几乎所有生物的生物特征的工具。它非常强大，但无法区分敌人和盟友，或者敌人和使用者，所以最好不要在近距离使用它。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ [DEPRECATED] Don't translate this line.
#. ~ This string is from an obsolete source and will no longer be used in the
#. game.
msgid "Make The Bio Warhead"
msgstr "制作生物炸弹"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ [DEPRECATED] Don't translate this line.
#. ~ This string is from an obsolete source and will no longer be used in the
#. game.
msgid "You know how to make a warhead for your humming mortar to fire."
msgstr "你知道如何制造一个战斗头，用于发射你的鸣蜂迫击炮。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ [DEPRECATED] Don't translate this line.
#. ~ This string is from an obsolete source and will no longer be used in the
#. game.
msgid "Make The Vancian Bill"
msgstr "制定万西安账单"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ [DEPRECATED] Don't translate this line.
#. ~ This string is from an obsolete source and will no longer be used in the
#. game.
msgid ""
"Somehow if you write some symbols on paper and cover it with mana, you can "
"make a tool that allows you to tear a small part of reality.  You found paper "
"dollar bills perfectly fit the required shape.  You find it hilarious that "
"reality accepts US currency."
msgstr ""
"如果你在纸上写下一些符号并用魔力覆盖，你就能制作出一种工具，让你撕裂现实的一小部分。 你发现一元纸币完全符合所需的形状。 "
"你发现现实竟然接受美钞，这太搞笑了。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ [DEPRECATED] Don't translate this line.
#. ~ This string is from an obsolete source and will no longer be used in the
#. game.
msgid "Helmet of Creative Juices"
msgstr "创造力提取头盔"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ [DEPRECATED] Don't translate this line.
#. ~ This string is from an obsolete source and will no longer be used in the
#. game.
msgid ""
