#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid "morticians apprenticeship"
msgstr "殡葬学徒培训"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid ""
"need_to_discuss.mp4\n"
"*It seems to be a part of some video for a newcomer mortician.*\n"
"Host: … Oh, and also, do you remember those small pieces of metal we found "
"covering the skin?  I recommend not throwing it away, but cleaning it up and "
"storing it in some bag - apparently zebra departments really like to buy some "
"of them for a whopping price.\n"
"Cameraman: Do you know why?\n"
"Host: I don't give a shit actually, but 50 bucks per month is 50 bucks per "
"month."
msgstr ""
"还需确定.mp4\n"
"(这似乎是给新人殡葬师的教学视频)\n"
"\n"
"主持人：...对了，还记得我们发现的那些覆盖在皮肤上的金属碎片吗？建议别扔掉，清理干净装袋收好——斑马部门那帮人居然愿意出高价收购。\n"
"\n"
"摄像师：知道他们买来干嘛用吗？\n"
"\n"
"主持人：关我屁事，但每月能多拿50美才是重点。"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid "the immovable bullet"
msgstr "浮空子弹"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_xedra"
#. ~ Messages, logs and videos, that xedra agent may have on it's laptop
msgid ""
"record_17.06.mp3\n"
"[Voice 1]: I'm here.\n"
"[Voice 2]: And?\n"
"[Voice 1]: As the report said.\n"
"[Voice 2]: Fuck.\n"
"*few seconds of complete silence*\n"
"[Voice 2]: So it's completely impossible to move it?\n"
"[Voice 1]: Correct, completely glued.\n"
"*another few seconds of complete silence*\n"
"[Voice 1]: So, in summary, we have a bullet, stuck in the air and completely "
"immovable, in the middle of fucking nowhere.  I think I've seen something "
"similar before…"
msgstr ""
"录音_17.06.mp3\n"
"[声音1]：我到了。\n"
"[声音2]：咋样？\n"
"[声音1]：和报告说的一样。\n"
"[声音2]：妈的。\n"
"数秒的沉默\n"
"[声音2]：所以完全挪不动？\n"
"[声音1]：对，像焊死了一样。\n"
"又是数秒的沉默\n"
"[声音1]：总而言之，我们有颗子弹，悬在半空纹丝不动，在这鸟不拉屎的地方。好像有点似曾相识..."

