#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_notes"
msgid ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Via our aquisition teams we have brought numerous practitioners back to "
"Cradle-Earth with an incredible variety of results as to whether or not their "
"powers function in our dimension.  Most strangely the broad form which their "
"powers manifest as tends to have little bearing on whether their abilities "
"function here.  We have yet to determine causation of this phenomena nor "
"achieved any control of it."
