#. ~ Description of spell "lilin_speed_dodge_boost_spell ( Reaping the
#. Whirlwind )"
msgid "Spend some ruach to greatly enhance your speed for a short period of time."
msgstr "Spend some ruach to greatly enhance your speed for a short period of time."

