#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Dark Days of the Dead"
msgstr "烏日到站"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Dark Days of the Dead"
msgid ""
"Turns the game into a classic Romero zombie game.  You must destroy the "
"brain.  Getting bitten is fatal.  However, zombies don't evolve, and when "
"they're down, they're down.  Removes the sci-fi and interdimensional aspects "
"of CDDA."
msgstr ""
"這個模組將遊戲轉變成一個經典的羅梅羅殭屍遊戲。你必須摧毀腦部才能殺死殭屍。被咬到會立即致命。然而，喪屍不會進化，而且一旦倒下，就永遠不會再起來。它移除了CD"
"DA的科幻和跨維度元素。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus"
msgid "Zombie bite"
msgstr "殭屍咬傷"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus_scratch"
msgid "Zombie contagion"
msgstr "殭屍感染"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie bite"
msgid "You've got a painful bite from a zombie.  You know how this ends."
msgstr "你被丧尸严重咬伤感染了。你知道这一切会怎么结束。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion"
msgid ""
"The area around your zombie bite is festering and red, and you're feeling hot "
"and cold at once."
msgstr "你被丧尸咬伤的区域四周正在溃烂红肿，你感到又热又冷。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion"
msgid "Everything's so dark.  You can feel it, you don't have much time left."
msgstr "一切看起來如此灰暗。你可以感覺到，你時日無多了。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
msgid "You've been bitten.  It's bad."
msgstr "你被咬伤了。这很糟糕。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Zombie bite, Zombie contagion"
msgid "You succumb to your zombie bite."
msgstr "你死于丧尸咬伤。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "zombie_virus_scratch"
msgid "Zombie wound"
msgstr "殭屍抓傷"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie wound"
msgid "The area around your zombie scratch is looking a little red."
msgstr "你被丧尸抓伤的伤口周围看起来有点红肿。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie wound"
msgid "Redness is creeping up from your wound.  You feel weak, and look pale."
msgstr "你的傷口開始紅腫。你感到虛弱，臉色蒼白。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie contagion"
msgid "Why is it so cold in here?  And so hot, at the same time?"
msgstr "为什么这里这么冷？同时又这么热？"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zombie wound, Zombie contagion"
msgid "You've been cut by a zombie.  Did it get infected?"
msgstr "你被丧尸抓伤了。伤口被感染了吗？"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/contagion/effect.json
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Zombie wound, Zombie contagion"
msgid "You succumb to your zombie contagion."
msgstr "你死于丧尸感染。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
