"The C7A1 is the standard issue rifle for the Canadian military manufactured "
"by Diemaco.  It is a gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle known for its accuracy "
"and controllable recoil."
msgstr "C7A1 步枪是迪玛科公司为加拿大军方所制造的制式步枪。这是一种转拴式气动步枪，以其高命中率和易于掌控的后坐力而出名。"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "C7 assault rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "C7 assault rifle"
msgid "C7"
msgid_plural "C7s"
msgstr[0] "C7 步枪"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
#. ~ Description of variant "C7 assault rifle" of gun "C7"
#. ~ Description of variant "C7" of item "C7 assault rifle"
