#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "bashing (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Practice the use of batons and similar weapons against a training dummy.  You "
"will need something to mark the striking points while you train."
msgstr "对着训练假人练习警棍和类似钝击武器的使用。你需要在训练时用些东西来标记打击点。"

#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "stabbing (beginner)"
msgstr "刺擊（入門）"

#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "stabbing (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Practice the use of spears and similar stabbing weapons against a training "
"dummy.  You will need something to mark the striking points while you train."
msgstr "对着训练假人练习长矛和类似刺击武器的使用。你需要在训练时用些东西来标记打击点。"

#: data/mods/innawood/vehicleparts/battery.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "clay car battery"
msgid ""
"A battery for storing electrical power, and discharging it to power "
"electrical devices built into the vehicle.  Contained in a clay shell."
msgstr "一块能够储存电能的电池，并能够为车上的各类电子设备提供电力，装在陶制外壳之中。"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Free yourself from your bionic failures"
msgstr "從故障的生化插件中解救自己"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Free yourself from your bionic failures"
msgid ""
"You currently have some bionics malfunctioning.  Remove them and avoid any "
"more faulty bionics in your body."
msgstr "你的體內有些故障的生化插件。想辦法移除並避免體內在出現更多故障的生化插件。"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Bionic Professions"
msgstr "生化職業"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Bionic Professions"
