msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You asked me recently; ask again later."
msgstr "你沒多久前才問過我, 晚點再說吧。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You just asked me for stuff; ask later."
msgstr "你沒多久前才跟我要東西, 晚點再說吧。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr "你是认真的吗？这里看上去可不是可以安全闲聊的地方……"

#: data/json/npcs/exodii/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Forgot sommat?"
msgstr "忘了什么的？"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Yeah, just that I sometimes see things.  I wanna be sure you're real."
msgstr "我还好，只是有时会看到一些东西。我想确定你是真实存在的。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I see things sometimes, and there's no way anyone could look like you!  I "
"know you're not real, and if you are, stay away you ugly <name_b>!"
msgstr "有时我会看到一些东西，但没有人可能看起来像你！我知道你不是真的，如果你是真的，走开，你这个丑八怪！"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a "
"kid.  Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet "
"paper and everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive "
"and they're looking for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"你真是个怪人。我很抱歉你没有朋友，但我真的是个孩子。地球上的每个人都变成了丧尸，我们的厕纸和所有东西都快用完了，我的父母也不见了。我知道他们还活着，他们在找"
"我。我想念他们。这对你来说够私人了吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "What the hell are you, sinner?  Get away from me."
msgstr "你这是怎么了啊，罪人？离我远点。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Nice to see you again, survivor."
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你，幸存者。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Well I'll be damned, a fellow survivor!  I'm Darryl, nice to meet you."
msgstr "喔，好家伙，一个幸存者老乡！我是达里尔，很高兴认识你。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well, you got me there.  I sure ain't one to block a fellow farmer's right to "
"reclaim this God-given earth."
msgstr "好吧，你问倒我了。我肯定不会阻挠农民朋友收回上帝赐予的这片土地的权利。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "The Lord isn't with you, and that's obvious.  Get out of my sight, sinner."
msgstr "主并不和你同在，显而易见。滚出我的视线，罪人。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the New "
"England Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr "我也很高兴认识你，幸存者。新英格兰教会社区已成悲剧，然而终有一天它将再次兴旺。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Get away from here, sinner, we don't want your kind here."
msgstr "离开这里，罪人，我们这里不欢迎你这样的人。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr "很高兴你能来这里。愿主怜悯你。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "能见到个外乡人总是那么美好。我能帮你什么忙吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  "
"Alright, it's your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr "你确定吗？我是说，你已经旅行了很长时间了，不是吗？好吧，这是你的决定。当你改变主意时告诉我。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh well, yet another sinner.  Don't talk to me."
msgstr "哦，好吧，又一个罪人。别跟我说话。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "哦，好吧，又是一个幸存者。欢迎来到我们这个小团体，我叫凯瑟琳。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local "
"herbalist."
msgstr "你一定是新来的，很高兴认识你。他们叫我科斯塔斯，我是本地的草药师。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "好吧，你说服了我。我会教耶利米的，指点他一下。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Well now, good to see you again, friend."
msgstr "好了，很高兴再次见到你，朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "啊，又一个幸存者！我希望你能平安归来。我是汤姆，很高兴认识你。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I got my rights to be here, chum.  Squatter's rights!"
msgstr "我有权在这里，朋友。擅自占有权！"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, "
"but they took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a "
"<freaking> nuisance."
msgstr "这不是重点，哥们。你不明白吗？这是我的地盘，但他们把它夺走了。现在他们认为我们只是个<freaking>讨厌鬼。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha!  Think before you speak, chum.  Eight icons for an honest day's "
"work, I say the system's broken!"
msgstr "哈哈哈！说话前先想一想，老兄。八个圣像能换一整天诚实的工作，想想可不可能吧！"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night "
"for a while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see "
"what that thing is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr "你没听到吗？夜里总有东西在森林里发出尖叫，有时让我睡不着。我太害怕了，不敢出去看看那是什么东西。如果你杀了它，我会永远记住你的恩情。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"After what you did for me, I'll follow you to the ends of the Earth!  No one "
"around here's stood up for me like that, I owe ya one."
msgstr "在你为我做了这一切之后，我会跟随你到天涯海角！这里没有人这样支持我，我欠你一个人情。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's "
"Simon."
msgstr "你好，陌生人，我想我们以前没见过面。很高兴见到你，我叫西蒙。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "啊，我看到一个有钱人。我猜你想要做笔交易。"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Barry!  Oh my god, you found him!"
msgstr "巴里！哦我的天，你找到他了！"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*eyes you up and down with a nervous smile.  \"I almost didn't expect you to "
"show up.\"  He hesitates, letting out a soft laugh.  \"That sounds bad.  I "
"just mean, I can't really believe we're doing this.  Thank you… for doing "
"this.  You ready to get Uncle Barry?\""
msgstr ""
"*他带着紧张的微笑上下打量着你。“我差点没想到你会出现。”他犹豫了一下，轻轻笑了一声。“听起来有点不对劲。我只是说，我简直不敢相信我们要这么做。谢谢你……为"
"了这个这么做。你准备好去救巴里叔叔了吗？”"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr "，马上又看到你的法警徽章：“你说过你要把那块该死的锡片放在我看不见的地方。”"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr "我看到你摘掉那个徽章了。好吧，但你最好不要让这里的任何人知道你和法警有任何联系。”"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
