#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "So you're back… explain yourself!"
msgstr "所以...你又回來了...請解釋清楚！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're not ready for this."
msgstr "你還沒有準備好。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "怎麼樣：證明了你自己的價值，並加入我作為我的助手？"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I barely understand what's going on *now*.  Why do you think I'd know how the "
"world ended?"
msgstr "我甚至搞不懂*现在*发生了什么。你怎么觉得我会知道世界是如何结束的呢？"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You ever see the Matrix?  This is it.  In real life.  To keep us locked in "
"here, the creators of the simulation have to make sure we're just the right "
"level of miserable.  I think their algorithms got messed up though, and went "
"into overdrive, because all this is a little implausible.  Still, I guess "
"we're still jacked in, so maybe it's working."
msgstr ""
"你看过黑客帝国吗？就和那一样。电影成真了。为了让我们被锁在这里，这个模拟世界的创造者必须确保我们能恰到好处地遭遇不幸。我认为他们用的算法可能出了点问题，进入"
"了超速档，因为现在发生的这些事情有点让人难以置信。不过，我想我们还是被困在里面了，所以也许它还是起到了一定的作用。"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Woof, you ready for a real hot take?  The <freaking> government did this to "
"us.  Intentionally, or at least sort-of intentionally."
msgstr "哇，你想听听我的第一感觉吗？<freaking>政府对我们做了这件事。他们肯定是故意的，或者至少是半故意的。"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's true.  Still not a very nice way to break the news to "
"someone you accidentally robbed…"
msgstr "我想这是真的。但对你不小心抢劫了的人来说，这并不是一个很好的消息……"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want this, "
"but if you're a brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr "我试着努力不去想它，但你可能是对的。我看到的越多，我能解释的就越少。我不知道为什么人类会想要这个，但如果你是一个吸食大脑的外星人，这就是你要去的地方。"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You're right, but I still think there's something bigger out there.  "
"Something evil.  It doesn't matter whether science can explain it because we "
"damn sure don't seem capable of defeating it."
msgstr "你是对的，但我依然觉得有某种更大的东西在那里。某种邪物。科学能否解释并不重要，因为我们似乎确实没有能力打败它。"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't "
"like it, I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find "
"contracts."
msgstr "没门。是你叫我跟着你的，最多也就是这样。如果你不喜欢的话，我就拿着我该得的钱回难民中心去。现在找到一份合同可不难。"

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You are limited.  Here outside there are no limits.  I could free you from "
"your bonds.  Or bring you halfway here to get a taste."
msgstr "你是被限制的。在外面没有限制。我可以把你从束缚中解放出来。或者把你带到中途先体验一下。"

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Language is too weak to describe it.  You are too limited to understand "
"freedom yet.  What is mortality when time is a choice?  What is weakness when "
"limits are an illusion?  What is up when there is no down, wrong when there "
"is no right?"
msgstr ""
"这是语言所无法描述的，你被束缚在限制中，还无法理解什么是自由。当时间变成一种选择时，死亡是什么？当极限只是一种幻觉时，弱点又是什么？没有下，那上是什么，没有"
"对，那错又是什么？"

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"There is no me.  I don't exist yet, but time is a lie.  The barriers are weak "
"and your presence is potent enough to reflect.  I am the you that said yes."
msgstr "没有所谓的我。我还不存在，但时间只是一个谎言。我们之间的阻碍很弱，而你的存在足以让人反思。我就是那个说“是”的你。"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Traveler."
msgstr "旅行者。"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're back.  Have you come to listen to the song?"
msgstr "你又回来了。你是来听这歌声的吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Your mind is open.  More than most.  Perhaps one day, you too will feel the "
"power of the song and become Kindred.  For now, traveler, listen, listen and "
"feel the song."
msgstr "你的思想很开放。比大多数人都开放。也许有一天，你也会感受到歌的力量，并成为血族一员。现在，旅行者，倾听，倾听，感受这歌声。"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "I see.  And you live still.  Does that mean you managed to stop him?"
msgstr "我懂了。但你还活着。那就是说你成功阻止了他？"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"It saddens me to see a talented Kindred lose his way so greatly, but I take "
"solace in the fact that you are unscathed."
msgstr "看到一个才华横溢的血族如此迷失自我，这让我很难过，但你毫发无损，这让我感到一丝安慰。"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"How do you do.  Name's Cooper.  What's your- wait… that's the Mark of the "
"Seer on your hand.  You're Kindred.  So I guess you know who I am, then."
msgstr "你好。我叫库珀。你叫——等等……你手上那是先知之印。你是血族成员。那我猜你已经知道我是谁了。"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"And how many people have you killed?  Maybe it was in self defense, maybe "
"because you wanted their gear.  It's all the same.  I give their death "
"meaning.  I hate that I have to do it, I truly do, but you really must "
"understand, there is no other way.  The sooner I finish my mission, the "
"sooner all this madness can end."
msgstr ""
"那你又杀了多少人？也许是出于自卫，也许只是因为你想要扒他们的装备。都一样。但我让他们死得有意义。我讨厌我不得不这样做，我真心讨厌，但你真的需要理解，没有其他"
"的办法了。我越早完成我的使命，这疯狂的一切就能越早结束。"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realizes "
"what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what "
"I do now, I must do alone."
msgstr "那你跟我一样，血族。我很高兴我不是唯一一个意识到什么才有必要的人。也许有一天，我们能携手同行，但我现在所做的事，我必须独自完成。"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You're Kindred, and yet you question the power the bones hold, the Song "
"itself?  This hypocrisy is why I set off on my own.  Stop wasting my time and "
"get out of my way."
msgstr "你是血族，但你却质疑骨头中蕴涵的力量，歌本身？这种虚伪也是让我出走的原因。别浪费我的时间，滚远点。"

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "你找到她们了吗，<name_g>？"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "你确定？"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You asked me recently; ask again later."
msgstr "你沒多久前才問過我, 晚點再說吧。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You just asked me for stuff; ask later."
msgstr "你沒多久前才跟我要東西, 晚點再說吧。"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr "你是认真的吗？这里看上去可不是可以安全闲聊的地方……"

#: data/json/npcs/exodii/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Forgot sommat?"
msgstr "忘了什么的？"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Yeah, just that I sometimes see things.  I wanna be sure you're real."
msgstr "我还好，只是有时会看到一些东西。我想确定你是真实存在的。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I see things sometimes, and there's no way anyone could look like you!  I "
"know you're not real, and if you are, stay away you ugly <name_b>!"
msgstr "有时我会看到一些东西，但没有人可能看起来像你！我知道你不是真的，如果你是真的，走开，你这个丑八怪！"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a "
"kid.  Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet "
"paper and everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive "
"and they're looking for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"你真是个怪人。我很抱歉你没有朋友，但我真的是个孩子。地球上的每个人都变成了丧尸，我们的厕纸和所有东西都快用完了，我的父母也不见了。我知道他们还活着，他们在找"
"我。我想念他们。这对你来说够私人了吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "What the hell are you, sinner?  Get away from me."
msgstr "你这是怎么了啊，罪人？离我远点。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Nice to see you again, survivor."
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你，幸存者。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Well I'll be damned, a fellow survivor!  I'm Darryl, nice to meet you."
msgstr "喔，好家伙，一个幸存者老乡！我是达里尔，很高兴认识你。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well, you got me there.  I sure ain't one to block a fellow farmer's right to "
"reclaim this God-given earth."
msgstr "好吧，你问倒我了。我肯定不会阻挠农民朋友收回上帝赐予的这片土地的权利。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "The Lord isn't with you, and that's obvious.  Get out of my sight, sinner."
msgstr "主并不和你同在，显而易见。滚出我的视线，罪人。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the New "
"England Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr "我也很高兴认识你，幸存者。新英格兰教会社区已成悲剧，然而终有一天它将再次兴旺。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Get away from here, sinner, we don't want your kind here."
msgstr "离开这里，罪人，我们这里不欢迎你这样的人。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr "很高兴你能来这里。愿主怜悯你。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "能见到个外乡人总是那么美好。我能帮你什么忙吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  "
"Alright, it's your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr "你确定吗？我是说，你已经旅行了很长时间了，不是吗？好吧，这是你的决定。当你改变主意时告诉我。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
