msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh well, yet another sinner.  Don't talk to me."
msgstr "哦，好吧，又一个罪人。别跟我说话。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "哦，好吧，又是一个幸存者。欢迎来到我们这个小团体，我叫凯瑟琳。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local "
"herbalist."
msgstr "你一定是新来的，很高兴认识你。他们叫我科斯塔斯，我是本地的草药师。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "好吧，你说服了我。我会教耶利米的，指点他一下。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Well now, good to see you again, friend."
msgstr "好了，很高兴再次见到你，朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "啊，又一个幸存者！我希望你能平安归来。我是汤姆，很高兴认识你。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "I got my rights to be here, chum.  Squatter's rights!"
msgstr "我有权在这里，朋友。擅自占有权！"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, "
"but they took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a "
"<freaking> nuisance."
msgstr "这不是重点，哥们。你不明白吗？这是我的地盘，但他们把它夺走了。现在他们认为我们只是个<freaking>讨厌鬼。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha!  Think before you speak, chum.  Eight icons for an honest day's "
"work, I say the system's broken!"
msgstr "哈哈哈！说话前先想一想，老兄。八个圣像能换一整天诚实的工作，想想可不可能吧！"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night "
"for a while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see "
"what that thing is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr "你没听到吗？夜里总有东西在森林里发出尖叫，有时让我睡不着。我太害怕了，不敢出去看看那是什么东西。如果你杀了它，我会永远记住你的恩情。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"After what you did for me, I'll follow you to the ends of the Earth!  No one "
"around here's stood up for me like that, I owe ya one."
msgstr "在你为我做了这一切之后，我会跟随你到天涯海角！这里没有人这样支持我，我欠你一个人情。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's "
"Simon."
msgstr "你好，陌生人，我想我们以前没见过面。很高兴见到你，我叫西蒙。"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "啊，我看到一个有钱人。我猜你想要做笔交易。"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Barry!  Oh my god, you found him!"
msgstr "巴里！哦我的天，你找到他了！"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*eyes you up and down with a nervous smile.  \"I almost didn't expect you to "
"show up.\"  He hesitates, letting out a soft laugh.  \"That sounds bad.  I "
"just mean, I can't really believe we're doing this.  Thank you… for doing "
"this.  You ready to get Uncle Barry?\""
msgstr ""
"*他带着紧张的微笑上下打量着你。“我差点没想到你会出现。”他犹豫了一下，轻轻笑了一声。“听起来有点不对劲。我只是说，我简直不敢相信我们要这么做。谢谢你……为"
"了这个这么做。你准备好去救巴里叔叔了吗？”"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr "，马上又看到你的法警徽章：“你说过你要把那块该死的锡片放在我看不见的地方。”"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr "我看到你摘掉那个徽章了。好吧，但你最好不要让这里的任何人知道你和法警有任何联系。”"

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "旅行者你好，什麼風把你吹來這呢？"

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it "
"doesn't matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING "
"ENTRY DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules "
"are: don't fuck with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a "
"reason with someone from us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"哎，你他妈的是谁啊？我没见过你。嗨，去他妈的，我也没兴趣知道。\n"
"告诉你这儿的规矩。最重要的第一条：进门后一定关好他妈的门！没问题的话，剩下的规矩是：不要惹我们，不要偷我们东西，不要没事找架打。懂了吗，瘪三？滚吧！"

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Are you deaf or stupid?  I said I don't give a fuck for you and your "
"<freaking> problems.  Bother me one more time, and you'll regret that.  Get "
"outta my sight."
msgstr "你是聋还是傻？我说了你和你的<freaking>麻烦不关我屁事。再烦我一次，你就知道什么是后悔了。从我眼前滚开。"

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You think you're immortal, huh, <name_b>?"
msgstr "你觉得你无敌了是吧，<name_b>？"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You look like you haven't eaten in days."
msgstr "你看起來好多天沒吃東西了。"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you did for me, I'd equip an army for you.  I'll need some "
"money to negotiate with the caravans and scavengers that come by.  What level "
"of protection are you thinking?  I can do 2mm, 4mm, and 6mm suits depending "
"on how much you want to resemble a tank, or I can make you a suit of "
"chainmail instead if you want a little more flexibility.  Materials costs are "
"300 merch to pay for the food I need to do the labor plus 100 merch per 2mm "
"or 50 merch for the chainmail.  Whatever I save in non-scaling bits like the "
"chain and leather, I get gouged in looking for so much bulk metal."
msgstr ""
"没问题。在你为我所做了这一切之后，我能替你武装出一支军队。我需要一些钱来和前来的商队和拾荒者谈判。你需要什么级别的防护？我可以做2mm、4mm和6"
"mm的全身板甲，这取决于你想要多像一台坦克，如果你想要灵活点，我可以给你做一个锁子甲。材料成本每2mm要100商会币，锁环需要50"
"商会币。虽然我之前存下了不少材料，比如链条和皮革，但要这么多钢材会让我吐血。"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah; the designs you showed me call for 'em.  Not sure what they are myself, "
"but the pictures are real descriptive about how to use them.  To make "
"anything, I'll need one of each of those wire kits.  Got any?"
msgstr "是啊，你给我看的设计很吸引人。虽然我不知道它们到底是什么，但这些设计图对如何使用它们进行了非常详细的描述。要制作任何东西，我需要这些模块每个各一个。有吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Thanks, sugar!  If you ever have me make some armor, just let me know if you "
"want me to use these in it."
msgstr "谢谢你，甜心！如果你下次再想让我做些盔甲，记得告诉我你是否想要用上这些宝贝。"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you've done for me, I'll forge you the finest work of art.  "
"The price and waiting time depend on the size of the weapon in question, but "
"it will take me a fair amount of money to buy the quality steel I need from "
"the scavengers, and even forging a short blade will take a few days.\n"
"\n"
"I can also temper your weapon, but that will cost an additional 50 merch and "
"take an additional 2 days, but I assure you, it's worth it."
msgstr ""
"没问题。为了回报你为我所做的一切，我会为你打造最精美的艺术品。价格和工期取决于武器的尺寸，但我得花不少钱从拾荒者那儿买优质钢材，就算打一把短刀也得花几天。\n"
"\n"
"我还能给你的武器回火，不过得额外收50个商会币，外加多等2天，但我保证，这绝对值得。"

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey stranger.  How's life treatin' ya these days?"
msgstr "嘿，陌生人。最近过得怎么样？"

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any "
"trouble."
msgstr "噢，你和<zombies>不一样。进来吧，别找麻烦就行。"

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of them.  Those <zombies>, I mean.  Come on in, just don't "
"cause any trouble."
msgstr "噢，你和他们不一样。我是说，那些<zombies>。进来吧，别找麻烦就行。"

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the "
"fan, but I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr "我猜你在灾难发生之前可能从未注意到这个地方，但我已经在这里呆了很长时间了。"

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr "你怎麼在這裡？無論如何，你是它們其中一員嗎？發生了什麼事？"

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything, you're outnumbered here and "
"we're well armed."
msgstr "瞧瞧，又一个旅行者。不要尝试做傻事，你在这里寡不敌众，我们都全副武装。"

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"No offense, but my clients definitely would not like me giving strangers "
"directions to their hideouts.  You'll have to find them on their own terms."
msgstr "无意冒犯，但我的客户肯定不希望我告诉陌生人他们的藏身之处。你必须用自己的方式找到他们。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say it after all you've done for me, but… I don't suppose you've "
"got anything to eat?"
msgstr "在你幫了我這麼多忙之後我很抱歉這麼說...我不應該...你有什麼能給我吃的嗎？"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well… you have shown that you can survive out there, and you've been able to "
"provide food, so I know you're thriving more than we are here.  All right, "
"I'll tell you what.  I'm not going anywhere without my friends here, we've "
"been through way too much together.  If you can convince Luo, Brandon, and "
"Yusuke to come along, then I'll go."
msgstr ""
"很好..."
"你證明了你可以離開這裡生存下去，而且能夠提供食物，我知道在你那可以獲得更好的生存條件。好吧讓我告訴你。我不會拋棄我的朋友們離開這裡，我們一起經歷過許多事情。"
"如果你可以說服 Luo，Brandon和Yusuke一起走，那麼我也會加入。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm real hungry and they put drugs in most of the food.  I can see "
"you're not like that."
msgstr "是的，我真的很餓，他們把藥物放在大部分食物中。我可以看出你不是那樣的。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Fuck off, dickwaddle."
msgstr "滾開，蠢貨。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit "
"cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr "嘿，我很抱歉先前有點嚇壞了。你可能是一個混蛋，但我相信你並不是那個意思。我的血糖很低，我有點暴躁。我們沒問題吧？"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey there, not-asshole.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "嘿，不混蛋的。很高興再次見到你。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to "
"die, hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* "
"after the apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy "
"lifting needed now… no, you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr ""
"幹！你他媽就是在講幹話。讓那些胖子去死吧，是嗎？你想知道在災變後取得該死的甲狀腺藥物有多容易嗎？賤人。除此之外，還有更多技能比單純的舉重能力有用多了..."
"不，你什麼都不知道？算了。你只是在浪費我的時間。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Thanks again for the grub, my friend."
msgstr "再次感謝你的食物，我的朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh, wow!  You're a real gem, you know that?  Thanks for even thinking of it."
msgstr "哇！你真是個好人，你知道嗎？非常感謝你願意為我考慮。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well… I'll be honest, I didn't even think Dave could be sorted out, and "
"you've gone and called my bluff!  It's a darn fine thing you've done for that "
"poor soul.  Listen, I wasn't… entirely serious about wanting to come with "
"you, but if you can convince the others to go, then I guess I'll come along."
msgstr ""
"喔..."
"我必須誠實的說，我以為Dave的事情根本不可能有個處理方式，你很快要離開只是隨口唬弄我的！你為那個可憐的靈魂所做的事情真是太了不起了。聽著，我不是那麼認真的"
"想要跟你走，但如果你能說服其他人，那麼這次我會跟你一起走。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey there, friend."
msgstr "你好，朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my "
"full-body pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible "
"for this little gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing "
"for them, I don't think I can leave."
msgstr ""
"阿，這真是個不錯的提議，而且我很感激你可以看到我這人而不是我那陰毛覆蓋的身體。不過很抱歉。我覺得我需要為大廳中這些可憐人負責，特別是只有我能找到食物，我不覺"
"得我能離開。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*seems impossibly young at first glance, her dark face nervous when she sees "
"you looking her way.  On closer inspection as you approach, you see that she "
"is likely in her early teens, but the contrast to the weary faces around "
"makes her age stand out.  \"Oh, uh… hi.  You look new.  I'm Aleesha.\""
msgstr ""
"*乍一看，她似乎年轻得不可思议，当她发觉你正盯着她时，她那张黝黑的脸表现得很紧张。当你走近仔细观察时，你发现她可能不过十几岁，但与周围疲惫的面孔所形成强烈对"
"比让她的年龄显得格外突出。\"哦，呃……嗨。你看上去是新来的。我叫阿莱莎。\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're back, and still alive!  Whoa."
msgstr "你回來了，而且還活著！哇喔。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, "
"gorgeous\""
msgstr "*看似随意地靠在避难所的砖墙上。\"又见面了，美人\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Yo, you're crazy hot!  I'm not stupid!"
msgstr "唷，你超辣！我可不笨！"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Well, well.  You are back."
msgstr "好吧，好吧。你回来了。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "So, you have survived."
msgstr "这么说，你活下来了。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Well, well.  I'm glad you are back."
msgstr "很好，很好。我很高興你回來了。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "It is good to see you again, my friend."
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你，朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hello, my friend."
msgstr "你好，我的朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yes, my friend.  You have done so much for me, I would be glad to teach you "
"what I can.  I must ask a small amount in trade, for materials.  I hope you "
"understand."
msgstr "是的，我的朋友。你为我做了这么多，我很乐意尽我所能教会你。但是作为交换条件，我需要一点材料。我希望你能理解。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Have you had a problem with memory, friend?  I was the one who asked you "
"this, I thought I explained why I could not."
msgstr "你的记忆力有问题吗，朋友？我是问你这个的人，我想我解释了为什么我做不了。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hmm, well it is not ideal but I appreciate you trying and being willing to "
"help.  I will have to do my best despite the bad memories.  Thank you, my "
"friend."
msgstr "嗯，虽然不太理想，但我很感激你的努力和热心。尽管有不好的回忆，我还是要尽力活下去。谢谢你，我的朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will "
"do my best to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr "谢谢你的尝试，我的朋友。有了你和我，那就五个人了，我会尽我所能坚强起来，协助清理。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"That is quite alright, four should be enough though I appreciate your offer.  "
"Four people will make the job much easier and I will do my best even if it is "
"painful.  My thanks, friend."
msgstr "那很好，四个人也该够了，但我很感激你的帮助。四个人会让工作变得更容易，即使过程会很痛苦，我也会尽我所能。谢谢你，朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Have you heard anything back from the ranch about jobs yet?"
msgstr "你去农场问过关于工作的事了吗？"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "朋友，总是很高兴见到你。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "My savior!  My patron of the arts!  You're always welcome here, friend."
msgstr "我的救星！我的艺术赞助人！这里随时欢迎你，朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm "
"talking about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr "你是哪来的来着？你并不像看上去那么俗气。我说的是叶子。大麻。不知道你是否碰巧有一些。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Sold!  Thanks for helping me out, friend."
msgstr "成交！谢谢你帮我，朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Sure thing, friend!  Let's see how you can move to this one."
msgstr "当然了，朋友！让我们看看你的舞步怎么样。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh my, am I dealing with a professional dancer here?  Sweet moves, friend."
msgstr "哦，天哪，我在这里和一个专业舞者打交道吗？漂亮的舞步，朋友。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr "天啊。你可能是我有幸遇到的最好的舞者。跳得不错。真的不错。"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Sure, I could teach you the basics, it'll cost you merch though.  Since you "
"helped me out, I can shave a bit off the price, let's say 4 merch, plus a bit "
"in trade depending on how in-depth you're looking for?"
msgstr "当然，我可以教你些基础知识，但这得花点商会币。不过你帮过我，我可以稍微降低价格，比如说4商会币，再加上一些，这取决于你想要学多深？"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"&\"Holy shit, what are the odds?  OK, stand back and hold on.\"  Jenny begins "
"peppering you with questions, which you answer to the best of your ability.  "
"She seems quite satisfied.  \"Well, I can't thank you enough,\" she smiles "
"after a few minutes.  \"You probably just saved me weeks of reinventing the "
"wheel.  Here, it's not much but it's all I've got.\"  She hands you a bundle "
"of the local currency."
msgstr ""
"&\"Holy shit, what are the odds?  OK, stand back and hold on.\"  Jenny begins "
"peppering you with questions, which you answer to the best of your ability.  "
"She seems quite satisfied.  \"Well, I can't thank you enough,\" she smiles "
"after a few minutes.  \"You probably just saved me weeks of reinventing the "
"wheel.  Here, it's not much but it's all I've got.\"  She hands you a bundle "
"of the local currency."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Things are coming along.  I have a lot of studying to do before I know how to "
"fix my design issues, but the book you brought definitely has everything I "
"need.  Now that I've got some progress to show, administration is much more "
"willing to help me get the parts I need.  You've been a great gofer, but I "
"can probably handle the rest on my own.  Check back in a week or two!"
msgstr ""
"事情进展顺利。在我知道如何解决我的设计问题之前，我还有很多研究要做，但是你带来的书里肯定有我需要的一切。现在我已经取得了一些进展，管理层更愿意帮助我得到我需"
"要的零件。你真是个了不起的家伙，但剩下的事情我应该能自己搞定。过一两周后再来看看！"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He "
"appears to be in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a "
"handlebar mustache.  Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  "
"\"Howdy, pardner.  They call me Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand.\""
msgstr ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He "
"appears to be in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a "
"handlebar mustache.  Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  "
"\"Howdy, pardner.  They call me Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand.\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, "
"pardner.\""
msgstr "*歪了歪他的牛仔帽，双脚分开，转过来正对着你。\"你好，伙计。\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*is a well-kept middle aged woman with dark hair tied back in a long braid.  "
"She looks surprised as you approach.  \"Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm "
"Mangalpreet.\""
msgstr "*是一个留着长长辫子的中年女人。你走近时，她看起来很惊讶。\"啊！你是新来的。对不起，我是曼加普雷特。\""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
